Interaktions-API von Gemini","Genaue Ergebnisse","Integration mit dem google-genai-SDK","Kompatibilität mit der Vorschauversion von AI Studio"],"pt":["Tarefas de pesquisa autônoma","Planejamento e síntese de informações","Utilização do Gemini Deep Research Agent","Acesso via Interactions API","Requisitos de SDK google-genai v0.3.0+"],"ru":["Автономные исследовательские задачи","Планирование и синтез информации","Использование агента Gemini Deep Research","Доступ через Interactions API","Требования к SDK google-genai v0.3.0+"],"ar":["مهام بحث ذاتي","التخطيط ودمج المعلومات","استخدام وكيل البحث العميق جيمي","الوصول عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للتفاعلات","متطلبات SDK google-genai v0.3.0+"]},"keywords":{"zh":["深度研究","自主研究任务","Gemini Deep Research Agent","Interactions API","google-genai SDK","自动研究","研究任务","信息综合"],"ja":["ディープリサーチ","自動研究タスク","Gemini Deep Research Agent","Interactions API","google-genai SDK","自動研究","研究タスク","情報の統合"],"ko":["딥 리서치","자율 연구 태스크","Gemini Deep Research Agent","Interactions API","google-genai SDK","자동 연구","연구 태스크","정보 통합"],"es":["investigación en profundidad","inteligencia artificial","API de interacción","Gemini","google-genai","AI Studio","recherche autónoma","análisis de información","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["recherche approfondie","intelligence artificielle","API d''interaction","Gemini","google-genai","AI Studio","recherche autonome","analyse d''information","développement de logiciels"],"de":["tiefere Recherche","künstliche Intelligenz","Interaktions-API","Gemini","google-genai","AI Studio","autonome Recherche","Informationsanalyse","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["pesquisa profunda","tarefas de pesquisa autônoma","desenvolvedores","Gemini Deep Research Agent","Interactions API","SDK google-genai"],"ru":["глубокое исследование","автономные исследовательские задачи","разработчики","агент Gemini Deep Research","Interactions API","SDK google-genai"],"ar":["البحث العميق","مهام بحث ذاتي","المطورين","وكيل البحث العميق جيمي","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للتفاعلات","SDK google-genai"]}},"owner":"cnemri","repo":"google-genai-skills","repoPath":"cnemri/google-genai-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deep-research","description":"Perform autonomous, multi-step research using the Gemini Deep Research Agent (Interactions API). Supports web search, file/directory context, and resilient streaming.","bodyPreview":"# Deep Research\n\nUse this skill to conduct deep, autonomous research tasks that require planning, searching, reading, and synthesizing information.\n\nThis skill uses the **Gemini Deep Research Agent** (`deep-research-pro-preview-12-2025`) via the Interactions API.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n*   `GOOGLE_API_KEY`: Required for accessing the Interactions API (currently in Preview via AI Studio).\n*   `google-genai` SDK v0.3.0+\n\n## Usage\n\n### Basic Research\nStart a research task and stream the results to the","body":"# Deep Research\n\nUse this skill to conduct deep, autonomous research tasks that require planning, searching, reading, and synthesizing information.\n\nThis skill uses the **Gemini Deep Research Agent** (`deep-research-pro-preview-12-2025`) via the Interactions API.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n*   `GOOGLE_API_KEY`: Required for accessing the Interactions API (currently in Preview via AI Studio).\n*   `google-genai` SDK v0.3.0+\n\n## Usage\n\n### Basic Research\nStart a research task and stream the results to the console.\n\n```bash\nuv run skills/deep-research/scripts/research.py \"Research the history of RISC-V architecture.\"\n```\n\n### Research with Context (Files or Directories)\nProvide local files (PDFs, text) or entire directories for the agent to read and incorporate into its research.\n\n**Direct Upload (Best for specific docs):**\n```bash\n# Single file\nuv run skills/deep-research/scripts/research.py \"Analyze this report\" --file report.pdf\n\n# Entire directory\nuv run skills/deep-research/scripts/research.py \"Summarize these meeting notes\" --file ./notes/\n```\n\n**File Search Store (Best for large corpora):**\nUse `--use-file-store` to index files into a searchable store (RAG) instead of uploading them into the context window.\n\n```bash\nuv run skills/deep-research/scripts/research.py \"Find trends in these 1000 PDFs\" --file ./large_corpus/ --use-file-store\n```\n\n### Saving the Report\nSave the final Markdown report to a file.\n\n```bash\nuv run skills/deep-research/scripts/research.py \"Competitive landscape of EV batteries\" --output report.md\n```\n\n### Continuing Research (Follow-up)\nAsk follow-up questions to an existing research session using the `Interaction ID` (displayed at the start of the previous run).\n\n```bash\nuv run skills/deep-research/scripts/research.py \"Elaborate on the second point about lithium supply.\" --follow-up \"INTERACTION_ID_HERE\"\n```\n\n## References\n*   [Online Documentation](references/online_docs.md)\n\n## How it Works\n1.  **Planning**: The agent breaks down your prompt into steps.\n2.  **Execution**: It autonomously searches the web and reads your provided files.\n3.  **Resilience**: The script automatically reconnects if the long-running stream drops.\n4.  **Synthesis**: It produces a comprehensive, cited report.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:19:17.512Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Research Agents needing autonomous information synthesis and planning capabilities via the Gemini Deep Research Agent.","zh":"适用于需要通过Gemini深度研究代理实现自主信息综合和规划能力的高级研究代理。","ja":"Gemini Deep Research Agentを通じて自律的な情報の統合と計画能力を必要とする高度な研究エージェントに適しています。","ko":"게미니 딥 리서치 에이전트를 통해 자율적인 정보 종합 및 계획 기능을 필요로 하는 고급 연구 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación avanzada que necesitan síntesis y capacidades de planificación de información autónoma a través del agente de investigación profunda Gemini.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche avancée ayant besoin de synthèse et de capacités de planification d''information autonomes via l''agent de recherche profonde Gemini.","de":"Perfekt für Advanced Research Agents, die autonome InformationsSynthese- und Planungsfähigkeiten über den Gemini Deep Research Agent benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa Avançada que necessitam de síntese e planejamento de informações autônomos via o Agente de Pesquisa Profunda Gemini.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых исследовательских агентов, которым необходимы автономные возможности синтеза и планирования информации через агент глубокого исследования Gemini.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات البحث المتقدمة التي تحتاج إلى تنسيق وخطط معلومات مستقلة من خلال وكيل البحث العميق جيمي니."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct deep, autonomous research tasks that require planning, searching, reading, and synthesizing information, leveraging the Interactions API and google-genai SDK v0.3.0+ for advanced data analysis.","zh":"赋予代理进行深入、自主的研究任务的能力，这些任务需要规划、搜索、阅读和综合信息，利用交互API和google-genai SDK v0.3.0+进行高级数据分析。","ja":"エージェントに、計画、検索、読み取り、情報の統合が必要な深い自律的な研究タスクを実行する能力を付与します。Interactions APIとgoogle-genai SDK v0.3.0+を使用して高度なデータ分析を実行します。","ko":"에이전트에게 계획, 검색, 읽기 및 정보 종합이 필요한 깊은 자율적인 연구 작업을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 상호작용 API 및 google-genai SDK v0.3.0+를 사용하여 고급 데이터 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar tareas de investigación profundas y autónomas que requieren planificación, búsqueda, lectura y síntesis de información, aprovechando la Interactions API y el SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ para análisis de datos avanzados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des tâches de recherche approfondies et autonomes qui nécessitent une planification, une recherche, une lecture et une synthèse d''informations, en exploitant l''API Interactions et le SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ pour une analyse de données avancée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, tiefe, autonome Forschungsaufgaben durchzuführen, die Planung, Suche, Lesen und Synthese von Informationen erfordern, indem sie die Interactions-API und das google-genai-SDK v0.3.0+ für erweiterte Datenanalyse nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizarem tarefas de pesquisa profundas e autônomas que exigem planejamento, busca, leitura e síntese de informações, utilizando a Interactions API e o SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ para análise de dados avançada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить глубокие, автономные исследования, требующие планирования, поиска, чтения и синтеза информации, используя Interactions API и SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ для продвинутого анализа данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إجراء مهام بحثية متقدمة وذاتية ت đòi تخطيط و بحث و قراءة و توحيد المعلومات، باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Interactions و SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ لتحليل البيانات المتقدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating in-depth literature reviews","Generating research summaries from large datasets","Synthesizing information across multiple sources"],"zh":["自动化深度文献综述","从大型数据集生成研究摘要","跨多个来源综合信息"],"ja":["深い文献レビューの自動化","大規模データセットから研究の要約を生成すること","複数の情報源間で情報を統合すること"],"ko":["깊은 문헌 리뷰 자동화","대규모 데이터셋에서 연구 요약 생성","여러 정보源 간 정보 종합"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones bibliográficas en profundidad","Generación de resúmenes de investigación a partir de grandes conjuntos de datos","Síntesis de información a partir de múltiples fuentes"],"fr":["Automatisation d''examen de la littérature en profondeur","Génération de résumés de recherche à partir de grands ensembles de données","Synthèse d''informations à partir de plusieurs sources"],"de":["Automatisierung von Literaturreviews in der Tiefe","Generierung von Forschungszusammenfassungen aus großen Datensätzen","Synthese von Informationen aus mehreren Quellen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de literatura aprofundadas","Gerar resumos de pesquisa a partir de grandes conjuntos de dados","Sintetizar informações de várias fontes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать углубленные обзоры литературы","Генерировать резюме исследований из больших наборов данных","Синтезировать информацию из нескольких источников"],"ar":["تأتمة المراجعات الأدبية المتعمقة","إنتاج ملخصات البحث من مجموعات بيانات كبيرة","توحيد المعلومات من مصادر متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GOOGLE_API_KEY for accessing the Interactions API","google-genai SDK v0.3.0+ or higher","Currently in Preview via AI Studio"],"zh":["需要GOOGLE_API_KEY访问交互API","google-genai SDK v0.3.0+或更高版本","目前通过AI Studio预览"],"ja":["Interactions APIにアクセスするためにGOOGLE_API_KEYが必要","google-genai SDK v0.3.0+または更高のバージョン","現在、AI Studioを介してプレビュー中"],"ko":["상호작용 API에 접근하기 위해 GOOGLE_API_KEY 필요","google-genai SDK v0.3.0+ 이상 버전","현재 AI Studio를 통해 미리 보기"],"es":["Requiere GOOGLE_API_KEY para acceder a la Interactions API","SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ o superior","Actualmente en vista previa a través de AI Studio"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé GOOGLE_API_KEY pour accéder à l''API Interactions","SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ ou supérieur","Actuellement en préversion via AI Studio"],"de":["Benötigt GOOGLE_API_KEY für den Zugriff auf die Interactions-API","google-genai-SDK v0.3.0+ oder höher","Derzeit in der Vorschau über AI Studio"],"pt":["Requer GOOGLE_API_KEY para acessar a Interactions API","SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ ou superior","Atualmente em Visualização via AI Studio"],"ru":["Требуется GOOGLE_API_KEY для доступа к Interactions API","SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ или выше","В настоящее время доступно в режиме предварительного просмотра через AI Studio"],"ar":["يتطلب GOOGLE_API_KEY للوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Interactions","SDK google-genai v0.3.0+ أو أعلى","الحالي في معاينة عبر استوديو الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sanjay3290/ai-skills/google-drive', 'community', 'sanjay3290', 'ai-skills', 'sanjay3290/ai-skills', 'google-drive', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z', '2026-02-18T07:19:24.419Z', NULL, '{"id":"sanjay3290/ai-skills/google-drive","name":"google-drive","description":{"zh":"Google Drive AI 集成提供轻量级的 Google Drive 集成，支持独立 OAuth 身份验证和全读写访问","ja":"Google Drive AI 統合は軽量の Google Drive 統合を提供し、スタンドアロン OAuth 認証とフル読み取り/書き込みアクセスをサポート","ko":"Google Drive AI 통합은 가벼운 Google Drive 통합을 제공하며 독립 OAuth 인증 및 전체 읽기/쓰기 액세스를 지원","es":"La integración de Google Drive ofrece una autenticación OAuth ligera y acceso de lectura/escritura completo, ideal para desarrolladores","fr":"L''intégration de Google Drive propose une authentification OAuth légère et un accès complet en lecture/écriture, idéal pour les développeurs","de":"Die Google Drive-Integration bietet eine leichte OAuth-Authentifizierung und einen vollständigen Lese-/Schreibzugriff, ideal für Entwickler","pt":"A integração do Google Drive permite acesso de leitura e gravação completo com autenticação OAuth leve","ru":"Интеграция Google Drive позволяет получить полный доступ на чтение и запись с легкой аутентификацией OAuth","ar":"تتيح لك مصادقة جوجل درايف الوصول الكامل للقراءة والكتابة مع مصادقة OAuth خفيفة","en":"Collection of agent skills for AI coding assistants"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Google Drive AI 集成","ja":"Google Drive AI 統合","ko":"Google Drive AI 통합","es":"Integración de Google Drive para desarrolladores","fr":"Intégration Google Drive pour les développeurs","de":"Google Drive Integration für Entwickler","pt":"Integração Google Drive para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Интеграция Google Drive для разработчиков","ar":"تكامل جوجل درايف للمطورين","en":"google-drive"},"description":{"zh":"Google Drive AI 集成提供轻量级的 Google Drive 集成，支持独立 OAuth 身份验证和全读写访问","ja":"Google Drive AI 統合は軽量の Google Drive 統合を提供し、スタンドアロン OAuth 認証とフル読み取り/書き込みアクセスをサポート","ko":"Google Drive AI 통합은 가벼운 Google Drive 통합을 제공하며 독립 OAuth 인증 및 전체 읽기/쓰기 액세스를 지원","es":"La integración de Google Drive ofrece una autenticación OAuth ligera y acceso de lectura/escritura completo, ideal para desarrolladores","fr":"L''intégration de Google Drive propose une authentification OAuth légère et un accès complet en lecture/écriture, idéal pour les développeurs","de":"Die Google Drive-Integration bietet eine leichte OAuth-Authentifizierung und einen vollständigen Lese-/Schreibzugriff, ideal für Entwickler","pt":"A integração do Google Drive permite acesso de leitura e gravação completo com autenticação OAuth leve","ru":"Интеграция Google Drive позволяет получить полный доступ на чтение и запись с легкой аутентификацией OAuth","ar":"تتيح لك مصادقة جوجل درايف الوصول الكامل للقراءة والكتابة مع مصادقة OAuth خفيفة","en":"Collection of agent skills for AI coding assistants"},"definition":{"en":"Collection of agent skills for AI coding assistants"},"features":{"zh":["轻量级 Google Drive 集成","独立 OAuth 身份验证","全读写访问","Google Workspace 账户支持"],"ja":["軽量の Google Drive 統合","スタンドアロン OAuth 認証","フル読み取り/書き込みアクセス","Google Workspace アカウントサポート"],"ko":["가벼운 Google Drive 통합","독립 OAuth 인증","전체 읽기/쓰기 액세스","Google Workspace 계정 지원"],"es":["Autenticación OAuth ligera","Acceso de lectura/escritura completo","No requiere servidor MCP","Requiere cuenta de Google Workspace","Compatibilidad con comandos de lectura"],"fr":["Authentification OAuth légère","Accès complet en lecture/écriture","Nécessite pas de serveur MCP","Requiert un compte Google Workspace","Compatibilité avec les commandes de lecture"],"de":["Leichte OAuth-Authentifizierung","Vollständiger Lese-/Schreibzugriff","Benötigt keinen MCP-Server","Benötigt ein Google Workspace-Konto","Kompatibilität mit Lesebefehlen"],"pt":["Autenticação OAuth leve","Acesso de leitura e gravação completo","Sem servidor MCP necessário","Requer conta Google Workspace","Suporte a comandos de leitura"],"ru":["Легкая аутентификация OAuth","Полный доступ на чтение и запись","Не требуется сервер MCP","Требуется учетная запись Google Workspace","Поддержка команд чтения"],"ar":["مصادقة OAuth خفيفة","وصول كامل للقراءة والكتابة","لا يتطلب خادم MCP","يتطلب حساب جوجل وركسبيس","دعم أوامر القراءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Google Drive AI","轻量级集成","OAuth 身份验证","AI 编码助手","Google Workspace","读写访问"],"ja":["Google Drive AI","軽量の統合","OAuth 認証","AI コーディング アシスタント","Google Workspace","読み取り/書き込みアクセス"],"ko":["Google Drive AI","가벼운 통합","OAuth 인증","AI 코딩 도우미","Google Workspace","읽기/쓰기 액세스"],"es":["integración de Google Drive","autenticación OAuth","acceso de lectura/escritura","desarrollo de software","asistentes de codificación de IA","Google Workspace","MCP","comandos de lectura"],"fr":["intégration de Google Drive","authentification OAuth","accès en lecture/écriture","développement de logiciels","assistants de codage de l''IA","Google Workspace","MCP","commandes de lecture"],"de":["Google Drive-Integration","OAuth-Authentifizierung","Lese-/Schreibzugriff","Softwareentwicklung","IA-Coding-Assistenten","Google Workspace","MCP","Lesebefehle"],"pt":["integração google drive","autenticação oauth","desenvolvedores","google workspace","acesso de leitura e gravação","servidor mcp"],"ru":["интеграция google drive","аутентификация oauth","разработчики","google workspace","доступ на чтение и запись","сервер mcp"],"ar":["مصادقة جوجل درايف","مصادقة oauth","المطورين","جوجل وركسبيس","وصول القراءة والكتابة","خادم ميكروسيفت"]}},"owner":"sanjay3290","repo":"ai-skills","repoPath":"sanjay3290/ai-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-drive","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Google Drive\n\nLightweight Google Drive integration with standalone OAuth authentication. No MCP server required. Full read/write access.\n\n> **Requires Google Workspace account.** Personal Gmail accounts are not supported.\n\n## First-Time Setup\n\nAuthenticate with Google (opens browser):\n```bash\npython scripts/auth.py login\n```\n\nCheck authentication status:\n```bash\npython scripts/auth.py status\n```\n\nLogout when needed:\n```bash\npython scripts/auth.py logout\n```\n\n## Read Commands\n\nAll operations vi","body":"# Google Drive\n\nLightweight Google Drive integration with standalone OAuth authentication. No MCP server required. Full read/write access.\n\n> **Requires Google Workspace account.** Personal Gmail accounts are not supported.\n\n## First-Time Setup\n\nAuthenticate with Google (opens browser):\n```bash\npython scripts/auth.py login\n```\n\nCheck authentication status:\n```bash\npython scripts/auth.py status\n```\n\nLogout when needed:\n```bash\npython scripts/auth.py logout\n```\n\n## Read Commands\n\nAll operations via `scripts/drive.py`. Auto-authenticates on first use if not logged in.\n\n```bash\n# Search for files (full-text search)\npython scripts/drive.py search \"quarterly report\"\n\n# Search by title only\npython scripts/drive.py search \"title:budget\"\n\n# Search using Google Drive URL (extracts ID automatically)\npython scripts/drive.py search \"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ABC123...\"\n\n# Search files shared with you\npython scripts/drive.py search --shared-with-me\n\n# Search with pagination\npython scripts/drive.py search \"report\" --limit 5 --page-token \"...\"\n\n# Find a folder by exact name\npython scripts/drive.py find-folder \"Project Documents\"\n\n# List files in root Drive\npython scripts/drive.py list\n\n# List files in a specific folder\npython scripts/drive.py list 1ABC123xyz --limit 20\n\n# Download a file\npython scripts/drive.py download 1ABC123xyz ./downloads/report.pdf\n```\n\n## Write Commands\n\n```bash\n# Upload a file to Drive root\npython scripts/drive.py upload ~/Documents/report.pdf\n\n# Upload to a specific folder\npython scripts/drive.py upload ~/Documents/report.pdf --folder 1ABC123xyz\n\n# Upload with a custom name\npython scripts/drive.py upload ~/Documents/report.pdf --name \"Q4 Report.pdf\"\n\n# Create a new folder\npython scripts/drive.py create-folder \"Project Documents\"\n\n# Create a folder inside another folder\npython scripts/drive.py create-folder \"Attachments\" --parent 1ABC123xyz\n\n# Move a file to a different folder\npython scripts/drive.py move FILE_ID DESTINATION_FOLDER_ID\n\n# Copy a file\npython scripts/drive.py copy FILE_ID\npython scripts/drive.py copy FILE_ID --name \"Report Copy\" --folder 1ABC123xyz\n\n# Rename a file or folder\npython scripts/drive.py rename FILE_ID \"New Name.pdf\"\n\n# Move a file to trash\npython scripts/drive.py trash FILE_ID\n```\n\n## Search Query Formats\n\nThe search command supports multiple query formats:\n\n| Format | Example | Description |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| Full-text | `\"quarterly report\"` | Searches file contents and names |\n| Title | `\"title:budget\"` | Searches file names only |\n| URL | `https://drive.google.com/...` | Extracts and uses file/folder ID |\n| Folder ID | `1ABC123...` | Lists folder contents (25+ char IDs) |\n| Native query | `mimeType=''application/pdf''` | Pass-through Drive query syntax |\n\n## File ID Format\n\nGoogle Drive uses long IDs like `1ABC123xyz_-abc123`. Get IDs from:\n- `search` results\n- `find-folder` results\n- `list` results\n- Google Drive URLs\n\n## Download Limitations\n\n- Regular files (PDFs, images, etc.) download directly\n- Google Docs/Sheets/Slides cannot be downloaded via this tool\n- For Google Workspace files, use export or dedicated tools\n\n## Token Management\n\nTokens stored securely using the system keyring:\n- **macOS**: Keychain\n- **Windows**: Windows Credential Locker\n- **Linux**: Secret Service API (GNOME Keyring, KDE Wallet, etc.)\n\nService name: `google-drive-skill-oauth`\n\nAutomatically refreshes expired tokens using Google''s cloud function.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:19:24.419Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Storage Agents requiring seamless Google Drive integration with OAuth authentication.","zh":"适用于需要与Google Drive无缝集成并使用OAuth身份验证的云存储代理。","ja":"Google Driveとの無縫な統合とOAuth認証を必要とするクラウドストレージエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구글 드라이브와 무중단 통합 및 OAuth 인증이 필요한 클라우드 저장소 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Almacenamiento en la Nube que requieren una integración sin problemas con Google Drive y autenticación OAuth.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Stockage Cloud nécessitant une intégration transparente avec Google Drive et une authentification OAuth.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Speicher-Agents, die eine nahtlose Google Drive-Integration mit OAuth-Authentifizierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Armazenamento em Nuvem que exigem integração perfeita com o Google Drive com autenticação OAuth.","ru":"Идеально для агентов облачного хранилища, требующих бесшовной интеграции с Google Drive с помощью аутентификации OAuth.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تخزين السحابي الذي يتطلب تكاملًا سلسًا مع Google Drive مع مصادقة OAuth."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read and write files to Google Drive using standalone OAuth authentication, providing full read/write access with Google Workspace accounts, supporting protocols like OAuth and file formats through Google Drive''s API.","zh":"赋予代理读取和写入Google Drive文件的能力，使用独立的OAuth身份验证，提供对Google Workspace账户的完全读写访问权限，并支持通过Google Drive API的协议和文件格式。","ja":"スタンドアロンのOAuth認証を使用して、エージェントがGoogle Driveのファイルを読み書きできるようにし、Google Workspaceアカウントに対する完全な読み書きアクセスを提供し、Google Drive APIを介したプロトコルとファイル形式をサポートします。","ko":"독립적인 OAuth 인증을 사용하여 에이전트가 구글 드라이브 파일을 읽고 쓸 수 있도록 하며, 구글 워크스페이스 계정에 대한 완전한 읽기/쓰기 액세스를 제공하고, 구글 드라이브 API를 통해 프로토콜 및 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer y escribir archivos en Google Drive utilizando la autenticación OAuth autónoma, proporcionando acceso de lectura y escritura completo con cuentas de Google Workspace, y admitiendo protocolos como OAuth y formatos de archivo a través de la API de Google Drive.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire et d''écrire des fichiers sur Google Drive en utilisant l''authentification OAuth autonome, offrant un accès complet en lecture/écriture avec des comptes Google Workspace, et prenant en charge des protocoles comme OAuth et des formats de fichiers via l''API de Google Drive.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Dateien in Google Drive zu lesen und zu schreiben, indem sie die eigenständige OAuth-Authentifizierung verwenden, und bietet somit vollen Lese- und Schreibzugriff auf Google Workspace-Konten, sowie Unterstützung für Protokolle wie OAuth und Dateiformate über die Google Drive-API.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ler e gravar arquivos no Google Drive usando autenticação OAuth autônoma, fornecendo acesso de leitura/gravação completo com contas do Google Workspace, suportando protocolos como OAuth e formatos de arquivo por meio da API do Google Drive.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью читать и записывать файлы в Google Drive, используя автономную аутентификацию OAuth, обеспечивая полный доступ на чтение/запись для учетных записей Google Workspace, поддерживая протоколы, такие как OAuth, и форматы файлов через API Google Drive.","ar":"يمكن للعميل قراءة وكتابة الملفات على جوجل درايف باستخدام مصادقة أوث معزولة، وتقديم وصول كامل للقراءة والكتابة مع حسابات جوجل ووركسبايس، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل أوث وتنسيقات الملفات من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جوجل درايف."},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating with Google Workspace accounts for secure file access","Reading and writing files to Google Drive for automated data storage","Managing authentication status for multiple agent sessions"],"zh":["使用Google Workspace账户进行安全文件访问的身份验证","读取和写入文件到Google Drive以实现自动化数据存储","管理多个代理会话的身份验证状态"],"ja":["セキュアなファイルアクセスをためのGoogle Workspaceアカウントの認証","自動化されたデータストレージをためのGoogle Driveへのファイルの読み書き","複数のエージェントセッションの認証ステータスの管理"],"ko":["보안 파일 액세스를 위한 구글 워크스페이스 계정의 인증","자동화된 데이터 저장을 위한 구글 드라이브의 파일 읽기/쓰기","여러 에이전트 세션의 인증 상태 관리"],"es":["Autenticar con cuentas de Google Workspace para acceder a archivos de forma segura","Leer y escribir archivos en Google Drive para el almacenamiento de datos automatizado","Administrar el estado de autenticación para múltiples sesiones de agentes"],"fr":["S''authentifier avec des comptes Google Workspace pour un accès sécurisé aux fichiers","Lire et écrire des fichiers sur Google Drive pour un stockage de données automatisé","Gérer le statut d''authentification pour plusieurs sessions d''agents"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit Google Workspace-Konten für sicheren Dateizugriff","Lesen und Schreiben von Dateien in Google Drive für automatisierten Datenspeicher","Verwalten des Authentifizierungsstatus für mehrere Agentensitzungen"],"pt":["Autenticar com contas do Google Workspace para acesso seguro a arquivos","Ler e gravar arquivos no Google Drive para armazenamento de dados automatizado","Gerenciar status de autenticação para várias sessões de agente"],"ru":["Аутентификация с помощью учетных записей Google Workspace для безопасного доступа к файлам","Чтение и запись файлов в Google Drive для автоматизированного хранения данных","Управление статусом аутентификации для нескольких сессий агента"],"ar":["التحقق من حسابات جوجل ووركسبايس للوصول الآمن إلى الملفات","قراءة وكتابة الملفات على جوجل درايف لتخزين البيانات التلقائي","إدارة حالة المصادقة لمножة جلسات العميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Workspace account, personal Gmail accounts are not supported"],"zh":["需要Google Workspace账户，个人Gmail账户不受支持"],"ja":["Google Workspaceアカウントが必要、個人用Gmailアカウントはサポートされていません"],"ko":["구글 워크스페이스 계정이 필요합니다. 개인용 지메일 계정은 지원되지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Google Workspace, no se admiten cuentas personales de Gmail"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Google Workspace, les comptes Gmail personnels ne sont pas pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt ein Google Workspace-Konto, persönliche Gmail-Konten werden nicht unterstützt"],"pt":["Exige conta do Google Workspace, contas de Gmail pessoais não são suportadas"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись Google Workspace, личные учетные записи Gmail не поддерживаются"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب جوجل ووركسبايس، حسابات جيميل الشخصية غير مدعومة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
