ode"],"fr":["Envoi de messages texte aux canaux ou threads","Envoi d''embeds et de fichiers","Création de boutons interactifs","Connexion à Discord via des commandes CLI","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["Senden von Textnachrichten an Kanäle oder Threads","Senden von Embeds und Dateien","Erstellen von interaktiven Schaltflächen","Verbindung zu Discord über CLI-Befehle","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Envio de mensagens de texto para canais ou threads","Envio de embeds e arquivos","Uso de botões interativos","Integração com o Discord através de comandos CLI","Verificação de conexão com o Discord","Uso de comandos CLI para interagir com o Discord"],"ru":["Отправка текстовых сообщений в каналы или потоки","Отправка встраиваний и файлов","Использование интерактивных кнопок","Интеграция с Discord через команды CLI","Проверка соединения с Discord","Использование команд CLI для взаимодействия с Discord"],"ar":["إرسال رسائل نصية إلى قنوات أو threads","إرسال ملحقات وملفات","استخدام أزرار تفاعلية","دمج ديسكورد باستخدام أوامر CLI","التحقق من الاتصال بديسكورد","استخدام أوامر CLI للتفاعل مع ديسكورد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cord","Discord","Claude Code","桥接","开源","CLI 命令","消息发送","嵌入","文件传输"],"ja":["Cord","Discord","Claude Code","ブリッジ","オープンソース","CLI コマンド","メッセージ送信","埋め込み","ファイル転送"],"ko":["Cord","디스코드","클라우드 코드","橋接","오픈 소스","CLI 명령어","메시지 전송","임베드","파일 전송"],"es":["discord","claude code","cord","comandos cli","desarrollo de software","integración de discord","botones interactivos","envío de mensajes"],"fr":["discord","claude code","cord","commandes cli","développement de logiciels","intégration de discord","boutons interactifs","envoi de messages"],"de":["discord","claude code","cord","cli-befehle","software-entwicklung","discord-integration","interaktive schaltflächen","nachrichten senden"],"pt":["discord","claude code","cord","skill","comandos cli","envio de mensagens","envio de arquivos","botões interativos","integração com discord"],"ru":["discord","claude code","cord","навык","команды cli","отправка сообщений","отправка файлов","интерактивные кнопки","интеграция с discord"],"ar":["ديسكورد","كلود كود","كورد","مهارة","أوامر cli","إرسال رسائل","إرسال ملفات","أزرار تفاعلية","دمج ديسكورد"]}},"owner":"alexknowshtml","repo":"cord","repoPath":"alexknowshtml/cord","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cord","description":"Send messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons to Discord via the Cord CLI. Use for notifications, reports, interactive choices, and dynamic Discord interactions.","bodyPreview":"# Cord - Discord Bridge Skill\n\nInteract with Discord through Cord''s CLI commands. This skill teaches Claude Code how to send messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons.\n\n**GitHub:** https://github.com/alexknowshtml/cord\n\n## Setup\n\nEnsure Cord is running:\n```bash\ncord start\n```\n\nVerify it''s connected:\n```bash\ncurl -s http://localhost:2643/health\n# {\"status\":\"ok\",\"connected\":true,\"user\":\"MyBot#1234\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n### send\n\nSend a text message to a channel or thread.\n\n```bash\nco","body":"# Cord - Discord Bridge Skill\n\nInteract with Discord through Cord''s CLI commands. This skill teaches Claude Code how to send messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons.\n\n**GitHub:** https://github.com/alexknowshtml/cord\n\n## Setup\n\nEnsure Cord is running:\n```bash\ncord start\n```\n\nVerify it''s connected:\n```bash\ncurl -s http://localhost:2643/health\n# {\"status\":\"ok\",\"connected\":true,\"user\":\"MyBot#1234\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n### send\n\nSend a text message to a channel or thread.\n\n```bash\ncord send <channel> \"message\"\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncord send 123456789 \"Hello world!\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### embed\n\nSend a formatted embed card with optional styling.\n\n```bash\ncord embed <channel> \"description\" [options]\n```\n\n**Options:**\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `--title \"...\"` | Embed title |\n| `--url \"...\"` | Title link URL |\n| `--color <name\\|hex>` | red, green, blue, yellow, purple, orange, or 0xHEX |\n| `--author \"...\"` | Author name |\n| `--author-url \"...\"` | Author link |\n| `--author-icon \"...\"` | Author icon URL |\n| `--thumbnail \"...\"` | Small image (top right) |\n| `--image \"...\"` | Large image (bottom) |\n| `--footer \"...\"` | Footer text |\n| `--footer-icon \"...\"` | Footer icon URL |\n| `--timestamp` | Add current timestamp |\n| `--field \"Name:Value\"` | Add field (append `:inline` for inline) |\n\n**Examples:**\n\nSimple embed:\n```bash\ncord embed 123456789 \"Daily status update\" --title \"Status Report\" --color green\n```\n\nEmbed with fields:\n```bash\ncord embed 123456789 \"Build completed successfully\" \\\n  --title \"CI/CD Pipeline\" \\\n  --color green \\\n  --field \"Branch:main:inline\" \\\n  --field \"Duration:2m 34s:inline\" \\\n  --field \"Tests:142 passed\" \\\n  --footer \"Deployed by Cord\" \\\n  --timestamp\n```\n\n---\n\n### file\n\nSend a file attachment.\n\n```bash\ncord file <channel> <filepath> [\"message\"]\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n```bash\ncord file 123456789 ./report.md \"Here''s the weekly report\"\ncord file 123456789 ./logs.txt\n```\n\n---\n\n### buttons\n\nSend interactive buttons with optional handlers.\n\n```bash\ncord buttons <channel> \"prompt\" --button label=\"...\" id=\"...\" [options]\n```\n\n**Button options:**\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `label=\"...\"` | Button text (required) |\n| `id=\"...\"` | Custom ID for tracking (required) |\n| `style=\"...\"` | primary, secondary, success, danger |\n| `reply=\"...\"` | Ephemeral reply when clicked |\n| `webhook=\"...\"` | URL to POST click data to |\n\n**Examples:**\n\nSimple confirmation:\n```bash\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Deploy to production?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Deploy\" id=\"deploy-prod\" style=\"success\" \\\n  --button label=\"Cancel\" id=\"cancel-deploy\" style=\"secondary\"\n```\n\nWith inline responses:\n```bash\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Approve this PR?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Approve\" id=\"approve\" style=\"success\" reply=\"Approved! Merging now.\" \\\n  --button label=\"Reject\" id=\"reject\" style=\"danger\" reply=\"Rejected. Please revise.\"\n```\n\nWith webhook callback:\n```bash\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Start backup?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Start Backup\" id=\"backup-start\" style=\"primary\" webhook=\"http://localhost:8080/backup\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### typing\n\nShow typing indicator (useful before slow operations).\n\n```bash\ncord typing <channel>\n```\n\n---\n\n### edit\n\nEdit an existing message.\n\n```bash\ncord edit <channel> <messageId> \"new content\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### delete\n\nDelete a message.\n\n```bash\ncord delete <channel> <messageId>\n```\n\n---\n\n### rename\n\nRename a thread.\n\n```bash\ncord rename <threadId> \"new name\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### reply\n\nReply to a specific message (shows reply preview).\n\n```bash\ncord reply <channel> <messageId> \"message\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### thread\n\nCreate a thread from a message.\n\n```bash\ncord thread <channel> <messageId> \"thread name\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### react\n\nAdd a reaction to a message.\n\n```bash\ncord react <channel> <messageId> \"emoji\"\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncord react 123456789 987654321 \"👍\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### state\n\nUpdate a message with a status indicator. Use this to show work progress on a thread starter or status message.\n\n```bash\ncord state <channel> <messageId> <state>\n```\n\n**Preset states:**\n| State | Display |\n|-------|---------|\n| `processing` | 🤖 Processing... |\n| `thinking` | 🧠 Thinking... |\n| `searching` | 🔍 Searching... |\n| `writing` | ✍️ Writing... |\n| `done` | ✅ Done |\n| `error` | ❌ Something went wrong |\n| `waiting` | ⏳ Waiting for input... |\n\n**Examples:**\n\nUsing presets:\n```bash\ncord state 123456789 987654321 processing\ncord state 123456789 987654321 done\n```\n\nCustom status:\n```bash\ncord state 123456789 987654321 \"🔄 Syncing database...\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Choosing the Right Command\n\n| Use Case | Command |\n|----------|---------|\n| Simple notification | `cord send` |\n| Formatted status update | `cord embed` |\n| Long content (logs, reports) | `cord file` |\n| User needs to make a choice | `cord buttons` |\n| Indicate processing (typing bubble) | `cord typing` |\n| Update thread/message status | `cord state` |\n| Update previous message | `cord edit` |\n| Start a focused discussion | `cord thread` |\n| Quick acknowledgment | `cord react` |\n\n---\n\n## Assembly Patterns\n\n### Notification with follow-up options\n\n```bash\n# Send the notification\ncord embed 123456789 \"Build failed on main branch\" \\\n  --title \"CI Alert\" \\\n  --color red \\\n  --field \"Error:Test suite timeout\" \\\n  --field \"Commit:abc1234:inline\"\n\n# Offer actions\ncord buttons 123456789 \"What would you like to do?\" \\\n  --button label=\"View Logs\" id=\"view-logs\" style=\"primary\" reply=\"Fetching logs...\" \\\n  --button label=\"Retry Build\" id=\"retry\" style=\"success\" webhook=\"http://ci/retry\" \\\n  --button label=\"Ignore\" id=\"ignore\" style=\"secondary\" reply=\"Acknowledged\"\n```\n\n### Progress updates\n\n```bash\n# Start with typing indicator\ncord typing 123456789\n\n# Send initial status message\nMSGID=$(cord send 123456789 \"🤖 Processing...\" | grep -o ''[0-9]*$'')\n\n# Update state as work progresses\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID searching\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID writing\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID done\n```\n\nOr with custom progress:\n```bash\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID \"🔄 Step 1/3: Fetching data...\"\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID \"🔄 Step 2/3: Processing...\"\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID \"🔄 Step 3/3: Generating report...\"\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID done\n```\n\n### Report delivery\n\n```bash\n# Send summary embed\ncord embed 123456789 \"Weekly metrics compiled\" \\\n  --title \"Weekly Report Ready\" \\\n  --color blue \\\n  --field \"Period:Jan 15-21:inline\" \\\n  --field \"Pages:12:inline\"\n\n# Attach the full report\ncord file 123456789 ./weekly-report.pdf \"Full report attached\"\n```\n\n### Confirmation flow\n\n```bash\n# Ask for confirmation\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Delete all archived items older than 30 days?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Yes, Delete\" id=\"confirm-delete\" style=\"danger\" reply=\"Deleting...\" \\\n  --button label=\"Cancel\" id=\"cancel-delete\" style=\"secondary\" reply=\"Cancelled\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Complete Behavior\n\nWhen a user adds a ✅ reaction to the **last message** in a thread, Cord automatically:\n1. Detects the reaction\n2. Updates the thread starter message to \"✅ Done\"\n\nThis provides a quick way for users to signal \"conversation complete\" without explicit commands.\n\n---\n\n## HTTP API\n\nFor advanced use cases (webhooks, external scripts), see [HTTP-API.md](./HTTP-API.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:20:44.338Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Chatbot Agents needing Discord integration for interactive messaging and file sharing.","zh":"非常适合需要 Discord 集成的交互式消息和文件共享的 Chatbot 代理。","ja":"Discord を介したインタラクティブ メッセージングとファイル共有が必要な Chatbot エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Discord 통합을 통해 대화형 메시징 및 파일 공유가 필요한 챗봇 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Chatbot que necesitan integración con Discord para mensajería interactiva y compartición de archivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de chatbot ayant besoin d''une intégration Discord pour la messagerie interactive et le partage de fichiers.","de":"Perfekt für Chatbot-Agents, die eine Discord-Integration für interaktive Messaging und Dateifreigabe benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Chatbot que necessitam de integração com o Discord para mensagens interativas e compartilhamento de arquivos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-чатботов, которым необходима интеграция с Discord для интерактивного обмена сообщениями и файлами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الدردشة الذي يحتاج إلى دمج الدردش مع التفاعل الرسالي وتحميل الملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to send messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons through Discord using Cord''s CLI commands, leveraging HTTP protocols for seamless communication.","zh":"赋予代理发送消息、嵌入、文件和交互按钮的能力，通过 Cord 的 CLI 命令使用 HTTP 协议实现无缝通信。","ja":"Cord の CLI コマンドを使用して、HTTP プロトコルを利用した無邪気なコミュニケーションにより、エージェントがメッセージ、埋め込み、ファイル、インタラクティブ ボタンを送信できるようにします。","ko":"Cord의 CLI 명령을 사용하여 HTTP 프로토콜을 활용한 무중단 통신으로 에이전트가 메시지, 임베드, 파일 및 대화형 버튼을 전송할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enviar mensajes, incrustaciones, archivos y botones interactivos a través de Discord utilizando comandos de CLI de Cord, aprovechando protocolos HTTP para una comunicación sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des messages, des intégrations, des fichiers et des boutons interactifs via Discord en utilisant les commandes CLI de Cord, en exploitant les protocoles HTTP pour une communication sans accroc.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Nachrichten, Einbettungen, Dateien und interaktive Schaltflächen über Discord mithilfe von Cord-CLI-Befehlen zu senden, indem HTTP-Protokolle für eine nahtlose Kommunikation genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes enviem mensagens, incorporações, arquivos e botões interativos pelo Discord usando comandos CLI do Cord, aproveitando protocolos HTTP para comunicação sem interrupções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отправлять сообщения, встраивания, файлы и интерактивные кнопки через Discord, используя команды CLI Cord,利用ая протоколы HTTP для бесперебойной связи.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بإرسال الرسائل و الإضافات و الملفات و أزرار تفاعلية من خلال تطبيق الدردش باستخدام أوامر واجهة سطر الأوامر من كورد، مستفيدا من بروتوكولات HTTP لضمان التواصل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Sending automated notifications to Discord channels","Sharing files with team members through interactive buttons","Debugging Discord bot connections using health checks"],"zh":["通过 Discord 通道发送自动通知","通过交互按钮与团队成员共享文件","使用健康检查调试 Discord 机器人连接"],"ja":["Discord チャンネルへの自動通知の送信","インタラクティブ ボタンを使用したファイルのチームメンバーとの共有","ヘルスチェックを使用した Discord ボット接続のデバッグ"],"ko":["Discord 채널로 자동 알림 전송","대화형 버튼을 통해 파일을 팀원과 공유","헬스 체크를 사용한 Discord 봇 연결 디버깅"],"es":["Envío de notificaciones automatizadas a canales de Discord","Compartir archivos con miembros del equipo a través de botones interactivos","Depuración de conexiones de bots de Discord mediante comprobaciones de estado"],"fr":["Envoi de notifications automatiques aux canaux Discord","Partage de fichiers avec les membres de l''équipe via des boutons interactifs","Débogage des connexions de bots Discord à l''aide de vérifications d''état"],"de":["Senden von automatisierten Benachrichtigungen an Discord-Kanäle","Teilen von Dateien mit Teammitgliedern über interaktive Schaltflächen","Fehlerbehebung von Discord-Bot-Verbindungen mithilfe von Statusüberprüfungen"],"pt":["Envio de notificações automatizadas para canais do Discord","Compartilhamento de arquivos com membros da equipe por meio de botões interativos","Depuração de conexões de bot do Discord usando verificações de integridade"],"ru":["Отправка автоматических уведомлений в каналы Discord","Обмен файлами с членами команды через интерактивные кнопки","Отладка подключений ботов Discord с помощью проверок работоспособности"],"ar":["إرسال الإشعارات الآلية إلى قنوات الدردش","مشاركة الملفات مع أعضاء الفريق من خلال أزرار تفاعلية","تصحيح أتصال봇 الدردش باستخدام فحص الصحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cord to be running on localhost:2643","Needs a Discord bot account for authentication"],"zh":["需要 Cord 在 localhost:2643 上运行","需要 Discord 机器人帐户进行身份验证"],"ja":["localhost:2643 上で Cord を実行する必要がある","認証のために Discord ボット アカウントが必要"],"ko":["Cord가 localhost:2643에서 실행되어야 함","인증을 위해 Discord 봇 계정 필요"],"es":["Requiere que Cord se esté ejecutando en localhost:2643","Necesita una cuenta de bot de Discord para la autenticación"],"fr":["Nécessite que Cord soit en cours d''exécution sur localhost:2643","Nécessite un compte de bot Discord pour l''authentification"],"de":["Erfordert, dass Cord auf localhost:2643 ausgeführt wird","Benötigt ein Discord-Bot-Konto für die Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Requer que o Cord esteja em execução no localhost:2643","Necessita de uma conta de bot do Discord para autenticação"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы Cord работал на localhost:2643","Требует учетной записи бота Discord для аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل كورد على المحلي: 2643","يحتاج إلى حساب بوت الدردش للمصادقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
