を減らし、チームの生産性を向上","ko":"스킬을 생성하여 워크플로우를 단순화하고 오류를 줄이고 팀의 생산성을 향상","es":"Las habilidades de código verificado para Claude y Codex permiten la automatización y documentación de flujos de trabajo complejos","fr":"Les compétences de code vérifié pour Claude et Codex permettent l''automatisation et la documentation de flux de travail complexes","de":"Die überprüften Code-Fähigkeiten für Claude und Codex ermöglichen die Automatisierung und Dokumentation komplexer Workflows","pt":"Crie habilidades de segurança para Claude, Codex e Claude Code com facilidade. Aprenda quando criar uma habilidade e como estruturar o diretório de habilidades.","ru":"Создайте навыки безопасности для Claude, Codex и Claude Code легко. Узнайте, когда создавать навык и как структурировать каталог навыков.","ar":"انشئ مهارات أمان لكلود وكودكس وكلود كود بسهولة. تعلم متى tạo مهارة وكيفية هيكلة دليل المهارات.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["一键安装","质量验证","安全审计","标准化工作流程","减少错误","提高团队效率"],"ja":["ワンクリックインストール","品質検証","セキュリティ監査","標準化されたワークフロー","エラーの減少","チームの生産性の向上"],"ko":["한 번의 클릭으로 설치","품질 검증","보안 감사","표준화된 워크플로우","오류 감소","팀의 생산성 향상"],"es":["Instalación de un solo clic","Código verificado y de alta calidad","Estructura de directorio de habilidades organizada","Compatibilidad con Claude, Codex y Claude Code","Documentación y automatización de flujos de trabajo complejos","Reducción de errores mediante procedimientos documentados"],"fr":["Installation en un seul clic","Code vérifié et de haute qualité","Structure de répertoire de compétences organisée","Compatibilité avec Claude, Codex et Claude Code","Documentation et automatisation de flux de travail complexes","Réduction des erreurs grâce à des procédures documentées"],"de":["Ein-Klick-Installation","Überprüfter und hochwertiger Code","Organisierte Fähigkeitsverzeichnisstruktur","Kompatibilität mit Claude, Codex und Claude Code","Dokumentation und Automatisierung komplexer Workflows","Fehlerreduzierung durch dokumentierte Verfahren"],"pt":["Instalação em um clique","Verificação de qualidade","Estrutura de diretório de habilidades","Suporte a documentos de referência","Suporte a scripts de automação","Segurança auditada"],"ru":["Установка в один клик","Проверка качества","Структура каталога навыков","Поддержка справочных документов","Поддержка скриптов автоматизации","Проверенная безопасность"],"ar":["تثبيت في خطوة واحدة","فرز الجودة","هيكلة دليل المهارات","دعم وثائق المرجع","دعم سكريبتات الأتمتة","أمان تم فحصه"]},"keywords":{"zh":["创建技能","工作流程优化","安全审计","质量验证","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","开发者工具"],"ja":["スキルの作成","ワークフローの最適化","セキュリティ監査","品質検証","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","開発者ツール"],"ko":["스킬 생성","작업 흐름 최적화","보안 감사","품질 검증","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","개발자 도구"],"es":["creación de habilidades","código verificado","automatización de flujos de trabajo","documentación de procesos","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","desarrollo de software","productividad"],"fr":["création de compétences","code vérifié","automatisation de flux de travail","documentation de processus","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","développement de logiciels","productivité"],"de":["Erstellung von Fähigkeiten","überprüfter Code","Automatisierung von Workflows","Dokumentation von Prozessen","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität"],"pt":["habilidades de segurança","claude","codex","claude code","segurança auditada","instalação em um clique","verificação de qualidade","desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["навыки безопасности","claude","codex","claude code","проверенная безопасность","установка в один клик","проверка качества","разработка навыков"],"ar":["مهارات أمان","كلود","كودكس","كلود كود","أمان تم فحصه","تثبيت في خطوة واحدة","فرز الجودة","تطوير المهارات"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-skills","description":"Use when creating new skills, documenting workflows, or standardizing processes into reusable skill definitions.","bodyPreview":"# Creating Skills\n\n## When to Create a Skill\n\nCreate a skill when:\n- A workflow is repeated across multiple sessions\n- Complex multi-step processes need documentation\n- Team needs standardized approach to a task\n- Errors occur that a documented procedure would prevent\n\n## Skill Directory Structure\n\n```\n.claude/skills/{skill-name}/\n├── SKILL.md          # Required: Main skill document\n├── reference/        # Optional: Supporting documents\n└── scripts/          # Optional: Automation scripts\n```","body":"# Creating Skills\n\n## When to Create a Skill\n\nCreate a skill when:\n- A workflow is repeated across multiple sessions\n- Complex multi-step processes need documentation\n- Team needs standardized approach to a task\n- Errors occur that a documented procedure would prevent\n\n## Skill Directory Structure\n\n```\n.claude/skills/{skill-name}/\n├── SKILL.md          # Required: Main skill document\n├── reference/        # Optional: Supporting documents\n└── scripts/          # Optional: Automation scripts\n```\n\n## SKILL.md Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: skill-name\ndescription: Third-person description of what the skill does. Under 1024 chars.\n---\n\n# Skill Title\n\n## When to Use\n\nDescribe trigger conditions.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. First step\n2. Second step\n3. Third step\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\ncommand1\ncommand2\n```\n\n## Examples\n\nShow usage examples.\n```\n\n## Frontmatter Rules\n\n**Required fields (only these two allowed):**\n\n| Field | Rules |\n|-------|-------|\n| `name` | Lowercase, hyphenated, gerund form (e.g., `creating-skills`) |\n| `description` | Under 1024 chars, 3rd-person voice, no \"you\" |\n\n**Not allowed:** Any other fields (version, author, tags, etc.)\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n| Rule | Good | Bad |\n|------|------|-----|\n| Lowercase | `reviewing-code` | `Reviewing-Code` |\n| Hyphens, not underscores | `creating-skills` | `creating_skills` |\n| Gerund form (-ing) | `implementing-with-tdd` | `implement-tdd` |\n| Match directory name | `name: foo` in `foo/` | `name: bar` in `foo/` |\n\n### Gerund Suggestions\n\n| Instead of | Use |\n|------------|-----|\n| `code-review` | `reviewing-code` |\n| `plan` | `planning` |\n| `implement` | `implementing` |\n| `design` | `designing` |\n| `finish` | `finishing` |\n\n## Description Guidelines\n\n**Good (3rd person):**\n> Manages task lifecycle transitions and coordinates Trello sync.\n\n**Bad (2nd person):**\n> Use when you need to manage task lifecycle.\n\n## File Size Limits\n\n- SKILL.md: **Under 500 lines**\n- Description: **Under 1024 characters**\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore finalizing a skill:\n\n- [ ] Frontmatter has only `name` and `description`\n- [ ] Name is lowercase-hyphenated gerund\n- [ ] Name matches directory name\n- [ ] Description under 1024 characters\n- [ ] Description uses 3rd-person voice\n- [ ] SKILL.md under 500 lines\n- [ ] No \"Claude already knows this\" content\n- [ ] Includes actionable steps or commands\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n```bash\n# List all skills\nbpsai-pair skill list\n\n# Validate all skills\nbpsai-pair skill validate\n\n# Validate specific skill\nbpsai-pair skill validate creating-skills\n\n# Auto-fix simple issues\nbpsai-pair skill validate --fix\n```\n\n## Common Validation Errors\n\n| Error | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Extra frontmatter fields | Remove all fields except name/description |\n| Name mismatch | Make frontmatter name match directory name |\n| Description too long | Shorten to under 1024 characters |\n| File too long | Split into SKILL.md + reference docs |\n\n## Creating a New Skill\n\n1. **Create directory**: `mkdir -p .claude/skills/{skill-name}`\n2. **Create SKILL.md** with template above\n3. **Add content**: Steps, commands, examples\n4. **Validate**: `bpsai-pair skill validate {skill-name}`\n5. **Fix issues**: Address any errors or warnings\n6. **Test**: Verify skill works in practice\n\n## Anti-patterns to Avoid\n\n- **Generic knowledge**: Don''t document things Claude already knows\n- **Excessive length**: Keep focused, link to reference docs\n- **2nd person voice**: Use \"Performs X\" not \"Use when you need X\"\n- **Extra metadata**: No version, author, tags in frontmatter\n- **Underscores**: Use hyphens for multi-word names\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:21:26.626Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, Codex, and Claude Code needing standardized, security-audited, and reusable workflows","zh":"非常适合像 Claude、Codex 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agent，需要标准化、安全审计和可重用工作流","ja":"Claude、Codex、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しています。標準化された、セキュリティ監査済み、再利用可能なワークフローが必要です","ko":"Claude, Codex, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 표준화된, 보안 감사된, 재사용 가능한 워크플ロー가 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude, Codex y Claude Code que necesitan flujos de trabajo estandarizados, auditados de seguridad y reutilizables","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude, Codex et Claude Code ayant besoin de flux de travail standardisés, auditées de sécurité et réutilisables","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, Codex und Claude Code, die standardisierte, sicherheitsgeprüfte und wiederverwendbare Workflows benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Claude, Codex e Claude Code que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho padronizados, auditados de segurança e reutilizáveis","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, таких как Claude, Codex и Claude Code, требующих стандартизированных, проверенных на безопасность и повторно используемых рабочих процессов","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude و Codex و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى سير عمل معيارية و خاضعة لتدقيق أمني و قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, document, and automate complex multi-step processes using a standardized directory structure, supporting Markdown documents, and optional automation scripts, ensuring quality verification and one-click installation","zh":"赋予代理创建、记录和自动化复杂的多步骤过程的能力，使用标准化的目录结构，支持 Markdown 文档和可选的自动化脚本，确保质量验证和一键安装","ja":"エージェントが複雑なマルチステップのプロセスを作成、文書化、自動化する能力を提供します。標準化されたディレクトリ構造を使用し、Markdown ドキュメントとオプションの自動化スクリプトをサポートし、品質の検証とワンクリックインストールを確実に行います","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 멀티ステップ 프로세스를 생성, 문서화, 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. 표준화된 디렉토리 구조를 사용하며, 마크다운 문서와 선택적 자동화 스크립트를 지원하며, 품질 검증과 단일 클릭 설치를 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, documentar y automatizar procesos complejos de múltiples pasos utilizando una estructura de directorio estandarizada, que admite documentos Markdown y scripts de automatización opcionales, garantizando la verificación de calidad y la instalación de un solo clic","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de documenter et d''automatiser des processus complexes à plusieurs étapes en utilisant une structure de répertoire standardisée, prenant en charge les documents Markdown et les scripts d''automatisation optionnels, garantissant la vérification de la qualité et l''installation en un seul clic","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Mehrschrittprozesse zu erstellen, zu dokumentieren und zu automatisieren, indem sie eine standardisierte Verzeichnisstruktur verwenden, die Markdown-Dokumente und optionale Automatisierungsskripte unterstützt, und so die Qualitätsverifizierung und die Ein-Klick-Installation sicherstellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, documentar e automatizar processos complexos multi-etapa usando uma estrutura de diretório padronizada, suportando documentos Markdown e scripts de automação opcionais, garantindo verificação de qualidade e instalação em um clique","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, документировать и автоматизировать сложные многоступенчатые процессы, используя стандартизированную структуру каталогов, поддерживающую документы Markdown и необязательные скрипты автоматизации, обеспечивающую проверку качества и установку в один клик","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء وتوثيق وآليّة عمليات متعددة المراحل المعقدة باستخدام هيكل دلالي معياري ، ودعم مستندات Markdown ونسخ آليّة اختياريّة ، ضمان التحقق من الجودة والتركيب في نقرة واحدة"},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing team workflows","Documenting repeated tasks across sessions","Automating error-prone processes","Creating reusable skill directories with SKILL.md and reference materials"],"zh":["标准化团队工作流","跨会话记录重复任务","自动化易出错的过程","使用 SKILL.md 和参考资料创建可重用技能目录"],"ja":["チームのワークフローを標準化する","セッション間で繰り返されるタスクを文書化する","エラーが発生しやすいプロセスを自動化する","SKILL.md とリファレンス資料を使用して再利用可能なスキルディレクトリを作成する"],"ko":["팀의 워크플ロー 표준화","세션 간 반복되는 작업 문서화","오류가 발생하기 쉬운 프로세스 자동화","SKILL.md와 참조 자료를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 스킬 디렉토리 생성"],"es":["Estandarizar flujos de trabajo de equipo","Documentar tareas repetidas en varias sesiones","Automatizar procesos propensos a errores","Crear directorios de habilidades reutilizables con SKILL.md y materiales de referencia"],"fr":["Standardiser les flux de travail d''équipe","Documenter les tâches répétées à travers les sessions","Automatiser les processus sujets à des erreurs","Créer des répertoires de compétences réutilisables avec SKILL.md et des matériaux de référence"],"de":["Team-Workflows standardisieren","Wiederholte Aufgaben über mehrere Sitzungen hinweg dokumentieren","Fehleranfällige Prozesse automatisieren","Wiederverwendbare Fähigkeitsverzeichnisse mit SKILL.md und Referenzmaterialien erstellen"],"pt":["Padronização de fluxos de trabalho da equipe","Documentação de tarefas repetidas em sessões","Automação de processos propensos a erros","Criação de diretórios de habilidades reutilizáveis com SKILL.md e materiais de referência"],"ru":["Стандартизация рабочих процессов команды","Документирование повторяющихся задач в сессиях","Автоматизация ошибочно-опасных процессов","Создание повторно используемых каталогов навыков с SKILL.md и справочными материалами"],"ar":["تقييس سير العمل الفريق","توثيق المهام المتكررة عبر الجلسات","آليّة العمليات المعرضة للأخطاء","إنشاء دلاليات مهارات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع SKILL.md والمواد المرجعيّة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with Claude, Codex, or Claude Code","Standard directory structure must be followed","Quality verification and security auditing required"],"zh":["需要与 Claude、Codex 或 Claude Code 兼容","必须遵循标准目录结构","需要质量验证和安全审计"],"ja":["Claude、Codex、または Claude Code との互換性が必要","標準ディレクトリ構造に従う必要がある","品質の検証とセキュリティ監査が必要"],"ko":["Claude, Codex, Claude Code와의 호환성 필요","표준 디렉토리 구조를 따라야 함","품질 검증과 보안 감사가 필요"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Claude, Codex o Claude Code","Se debe seguir la estructura de directorio estandarizada","Se requiere verificación de calidad y auditoría de seguridad"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Claude, Codex ou Claude Code","La structure de répertoire standardisée doit être suivie","La vérification de la qualité et l''audit de sécurité sont requis"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Claude, Codex oder Claude Code","Die standardisierte Verzeichnisstruktur muss befolgt werden","Qualitätsverifizierung und Sicherheitsprüfung sind erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Claude, Codex ou Claude Code","Estrutura de diretório padronizada deve ser seguida","Verificação de qualidade e auditoria de segurança são necessárias"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Claude, Codex или Claude Code","Стандартизированная структура каталогов должна быть соблюдена","Проверка качества и аудит безопасности необходимы"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع Claude أو Codex أو Claude Code","يجب اتباع هيكل دلالي معياري","التحقق من الجودة ومراجعة الأمن ضروريان"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
