para varios idiomas"],"fr":["Synthèse vocale de haute qualité","Compatibilité avec plusieurs modèles de langage","Installation du SDK dans un environnement virtuel","Configuration de l''API via une clé d''accès","Prise en charge de plusieurs langues"],"de":["Sprachsynthese hoher Qualität","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Sprachmodellen","Installation des SDK in einer virtuellen Umgebung","Konfiguration der API über einen Zugriffsschlüssel","Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen"],"pt":["Uso de modelos de TTS recomendados","Instalação do SDK em um ambiente virtual","Configuração de credenciais para uso do serviço","Suporte a várias linguagens","Integração com a plataforma Alicloud"],"ru":["Использование рекомендуемых моделей TTS","Установка SDK в виртуальной среде","Настройка учетных данных для использования сервиса","Поддержка нескольких языков","Интеграция с платформой Alicloud"],"ar":["استخدام نماذج تي تي إس الموصى بها","تثبيت إس كي دي في بيئة افتراضية","تكوين بيانات الاعتماد لاستخدام الخدمة","دعم لغات متعددة","التكامل مع منصة أليكلود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["阿里云 AI","音频 TTS","语音合成","开发者工具","云计算","人工智能","自然语言处理"],"ja":["Alibaba Cloud AI","オーディオ TTS","音声合成","開発者ツール","クラウドコンピューティング","人工知能","自然言語処理"],"ko":["알리바바 클라우드 AI","오디오 TTS","음성 합성","개발자 도구","클라우드 컴퓨팅","인공 지능","자연어 처리"],"es":["Alibaba Cloud TTS","Qwen","Síntesis de voz","Inteligencia artificial","Desarrollo de software","SDK","API","Texto a voz"],"fr":["Alibaba Cloud TTS","Qwen","Synthèse vocale","Intelligence artificielle","Développement de logiciels","SDK","API","Texte à voix"],"de":["Alibaba Cloud TTS","Qwen","Sprachsynthese","Künstliche Intelligenz","Softwareentwicklung","SDK","API","Text zu Sprache"],"pt":["síntese de voz","Alicloud AI Audio TTS","modelos de TTS","SDK","credenciais","serviço de áudio","plataforma Alicloud","desenvolvimento de áudio"],"ru":["синтез речи","Alicloud AI Audio TTS","модели TTS","SDK","учетные данные","сервис аудио","платформа Alicloud","разработка аудио"],"ar":["تحويل النص إلى كلام","أليكلود أيه آي أوديو تي تي إس","نماذج تي تي إس","إس كي دي","بيانات الاعتماد","خدمة صوت","منصة أليكلود","تطوير الصوت"]}},"owner":"cinience","repo":"alicloud-skills","repoPath":"cinience/alicloud-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"alicloud-ai-audio-tts","description":"Generate human-like speech audio with Model Studio DashScope Qwen TTS models (qwen3-tts-flash, qwen3-tts-instruct-flash). Use when converting text to speech, producing voice lines for short drama/news videos, or documenting TTS request/response fields for DashScope.","bodyPreview":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Critical model names\n\nUse one of the recommended models:\n- `qwen3-tts-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Install SDK (recommended in a venv to avoid PEP 668 limits):\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv .venv\n. .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install dashscope\n```\n- Set `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` in your environment, or add `dashscope_api_key` to `~/.alibabacloud/credentials` (env takes precedence).\n\n## N","body":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Critical model names\n\nUse one of the recommended models:\n- `qwen3-tts-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Install SDK (recommended in a venv to avoid PEP 668 limits):\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv .venv\n. .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install dashscope\n```\n- Set `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` in your environment, or add `dashscope_api_key` to `~/.alibabacloud/credentials` (env takes precedence).\n\n## Normalized interface (tts.generate)\n\n### Request\n- `text` (string, required)\n- `voice` (string, required)\n- `language_type` (string, optional; default `Auto`)\n- `instruction` (string, optional; recommended for instruct models)\n- `stream` (bool, optional; default false)\n\n### Response\n- `audio_url` (string, when stream=false)\n- `audio_base64_pcm` (string, when stream=true)\n- `sample_rate` (int, 24000)\n- `format` (string, wav or pcm depending on mode)\n\n## Quick start (Python + DashScope SDK)\n\n```python\nimport os\nimport dashscope\n\n# Prefer env var for auth: export DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=...\n# Or use ~/.alibabacloud/credentials with dashscope_api_key under [default].\n# Beijing region; for Singapore use: https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\ndashscope.base_http_api_url = \"https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\"\n\ntext = \"Hello, this is a short voice line.\"\nresponse = dashscope.MultiModalConversation.call(\n    model=\"qwen3-tts-instruct-flash\",\n    api_key=os.getenv(\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"),\n    text=text,\n    voice=\"Cherry\",\n    language_type=\"English\",\n    instruction=\"Warm and calm tone, slightly slower pace.\",\n    stream=False,\n)\n\naudio_url = response.output.audio.url\nprint(audio_url)\n```\n\n## Streaming notes\n\n- `stream=True` returns Base64-encoded PCM chunks at 24kHz.\n- Decode chunks and play or concatenate to a pcm buffer.\n- The response contains `finish_reason == \"stop\"` when the stream ends.\n\n## Operational guidance\n\n- Keep requests concise; split long text into multiple calls if you hit size or timeout errors.\n- Use `language_type` consistent with the text to improve pronunciation.\n- Use `instruction` only when you need explicit style/tone control.\n- Cache by `(text, voice, language_type)` to avoid repeat costs.\n\n## Output location\n\n- Default output: `output/ai-audio-tts/audio/`\n- Override base dir with `OUTPUT_DIR`.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/api_reference.md` for parameter mapping and streaming example.\n- Realtime mode is provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-realtime/`.\n- Voice cloning/design are provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-clone/` and `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-design/`.\n\n- Source list: `references/sources.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:22:13.257Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents requiring advanced text-to-speech capabilities with Alibaba Cloud''s AI services","zh":"适用于需要高级文本转语音功能的 AI 代理，并且可以使用阿里云的 AI 服务","ja":"Alibaba CloudのAIサービスを使用して高度なテキストツースピーチ機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 텍스트 음성 합성 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 아리바바 클라우드의 AI 서비스를 사용할 수 있음","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que requieren capacidades avanzadas de texto a voz con los servicios de IA de Alibaba Cloud","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de texte à parole avancées avec les services d''IA d''Alibaba Cloud","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Text-to-Speech-Fähigkeiten mit den KI-Diensten von Alibaba Cloud benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que exigem capacidades avançadas de texto-para-fala com os serviços de IA da Alibaba Cloud","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих передовых возможностей текст-в-речь с помощью сервисов ИИ Alibaba Cloud","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب قدرات متقدمة لتحويل النص إلى كلام مع خدمات الذكاء الاصطناعي من Alibaba Cloud"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize Alibaba Cloud''s TTS services with recommended models like qwen3-tts-flash, enabling high-quality audio synthesis using the dashscope SDK and managing API keys through environment variables or credentials files","zh":"赋予代理使用阿里云的 TTS 服务的能力，推荐的模型如 qwen3-tts-flash，使用 dashscope SDK 实现高质量音频合成，并通过环境变量或凭证文件管理 API 密钥","ja":"dashscope SDKを使用して、高品質のオーディオ合成を行い、環境変数または資格情報ファイルを介してAPIキーを管理するように、qwen3-tts-flashのようなモデルを使用してAlibaba CloudのTTSサービスを利用するエージェントの能力を付与することをお勧めします","ko":"dashscope SDK를 사용하여 고품질 오디오 합성을 수행하고, 환경 변수 또는 자격 증명 파일을 통해 API 키를 관리하도록 qwen3-tts-flash와 같은 모델을 사용해 아리바바 클라우드의 TTS 서비스를 사용할 수 있는 에이전트의 기능을 부여함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar los servicios de TTS de Alibaba Cloud con modelos recomendados como qwen3-tts-flash, lo que permite la síntesis de audio de alta calidad mediante el SDK de dashscope y la gestión de claves de API a través de variables de entorno o archivos de credenciales","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les services TTS d''Alibaba Cloud avec des modèles recommandés comme qwen3-tts-flash, permettant ainsi la synthèse audio de haute qualité à l''aide du SDK dashscope et la gestion des clés d''API via des variables d''environnement ou des fichiers de credenciales","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die TTS-Dienste von Alibaba Cloud mit empfohlenen Modellen wie qwen3-tts-flash zu nutzen, wodurch eine hochwertige Audio-Synthese mit dem dashscope-SDK und die Verwaltung von API-Schlüsseln über Umgebungsvariablen oder Credentials-Dateien ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem os serviços TTS da Alibaba Cloud com modelos recomendados como qwen3-tts-flash, permitindo a síntese de áudio de alta qualidade usando o SDK dashscope e gerenciando chaves de API por meio de variáveis de ambiente ou arquivos de credenciais","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать сервисы TTS Alibaba Cloud с рекомендуемыми моделями, такими как qwen3-tts-flash, что позволяет осуществлять синтез аудио высокого качества с помощью SDK dashscope и управлять ключами API через переменные среды или файлы учетных данных","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من استخدام خدمات TTS من Alibaba Cloud مع نماذج موصى بها مثل qwen3-tts-flash، مما يسمح بتحليل الصوت عالي الجودة باستخدام SDK dashscope وإدارة مفاتيح API من خلال متغيرات البيئة أو ملفات الاعتماد"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating audio content with Qwen TTS models","Integrating text-to-speech functionality into applications","Utilizing dashscope for streamlined API interactions"],"zh":["使用Qwen TTS模型生成音频内容","将文本转语音功能集成到应用程序中","利用dashscope进行流线化的API交互"],"ja":["Qwen TTSモデルを使用してオーディオコンテンツを生成する","テキストツースピーチ機能をアプリケーションに統合する","dashscopeを使用してAPIのやり取りを最適化する"],"ko":["Qwen TTS 모델을 사용하여 오디오 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것","텍스트 음성 합성 기능을 애플리케이션에 통합하는 것","dashscope를 사용하여 API 상호 작용을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Generación de contenido de audio con modelos Qwen TTS","Integración de la funcionalidad de texto a voz en aplicaciones","Utilización de dashscope para interacciones de API optimizadas"],"fr":["Génération de contenu audio avec des modèles Qwen TTS","Intégration de la fonctionnalité de texte à parole dans les applications","Utilisation de dashscope pour des interactions d''API optimisées"],"de":["Generierung von Audioinhalten mit Qwen-TTS-Modellen","Integration der Text-to-Speech-Funktionalität in Anwendungen","Verwendung von dashscope für optimierte API-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Gerar conteúdo de áudio com modelos Qwen TTS","Integrar funcionalidade de texto-para-fala em aplicações","Utilizar dashscope para interações de API otimizadas"],"ru":["Генерация аудиоконтента с помощью моделей Qwen TTS","Интеграция функциональности текст-в-речь в приложениях","Использование dashscope для оптимизированных взаимодействий API"],"ar":["генерация محتوى الصوت باستخدام نماذج Qwen TTS","دمج وظيفة النص-النطق في التطبيقات","استخدام dashscope للتفاعلات المثلى ل API"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires dashscope SDK installation","Needs DASHSCOPE_API_KEY environment variable or ~/.alibabacloud/credentials setup","Specific model versions like qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26 may have usage constraints"],"zh":["需要安装dashscope SDK","需要设置DASHSCOPE_API_KEY环境变量或~/.alibabacloud/credentials","特定的模型版本，如qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26，可能有使用限制"],"ja":["dashscope SDKのインストールが必要","DASHSCOPE_API_KEY環境変数または~/.alibabacloud/credentialsの設定が必要","特定のモデルバージョン、たとえばqwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26には、使用制限があるかもしれない"],"ko":["dashscope SDK 설치가 필요함","DASHSCOPE_API_KEY 환경 변수 또는 ~/.alibabacloud/credentials 설정이 필요함","특정 모델 버전, 예를 들어 qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26는 사용 제한이 있을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del SDK de dashscope","Necesita la variable de entorno DASHSCOPE_API_KEY o la configuración de ~/.alibabacloud/credentials","Versiones de modelos específicas como qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26 pueden tener restricciones de uso"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du SDK de dashscope","Besoin de la variable d''environnement DASHSCOPE_API_KEY ou de la configuration de ~/.alibabacloud/credentials","Des versions de modèles spécifiques comme qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26 peuvent avoir des contraintes d''utilisation"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des dashscope-SDK","Benötigt die Umgebungsvariable DASHSCOPE_API_KEY oder die Einrichtung von ~/.alibabacloud/credentials","Bestimmte Modellversionen wie qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26 können Nutzungsbeschränkungen aufweisen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do SDK dashscope","Necessita de variável de ambiente DASHSCOPE_API_KEY ou configuração do arquivo ~/.alibabacloud/credentials","Versões específicas de modelos, como qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26, podem ter restrições de uso"],"ru":["Требует установки SDK dashscope","Требует переменной среды DASHSCOPE_API_KEY или настройки файла ~/.alibabacloud/credentials","Конкретные версии моделей, такие как qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26, могут иметь ограничения на использование"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت SDK dashscope","يحتاج إلى متغير بيئة DASHSCOPE_API_KEY أو إعداد ملف ~/.alibabacloud/credentials","الإصدارات المحددة من النماذج، مثل qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26، قد يكون لديها قيود الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
