'erreur cohérents","Journalisation des erreurs"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Fehlerstrukturen","Try-catch-Blöcke für FastAPI und React/Next.js","Globale Fehlerbehandlungs-Controller","Konsistente Fehlermeldungen","Fehlerprotokollierung"],"pt":["Estruturação de erros para backends FastAPI","Estruturação de erros para frontends React/Next.js","Mensagens de erro consistentes","Registro de erros","Tratamento de exceções personalizadas","Tratamento de erros globais"],"ru":["Структуризация ошибок для бэкендов FastAPI","Структуризация ошибок для фронтендов React/Next.js","Последовательные сообщения об ошибках","Журналирование ошибок","Обработка пользовательских исключений","Глобальная обработка ошибок"],"ar":["هيكلة الأخطاء لخلفيات FastAPI","هيكلة الأخطاء لأمامي React/Next.js","رسائل خطأ متسقة","تسجيل الأخطاء","معالجة الاستثناءات المخصصة","معالجة الأخطاء العالمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["错误处理","FastAPI","React/Next.js","结构化错误处理","一致的错误信息","日志记录","自定义异常处理"],"ja":["エラーハンドリング","FastAPI","React/Next.js","構造化されたエラーハンドリング","一貫性のあるエラーメッセージ","ログレコード","カスタム例外処理"],"ko":["에러 처리","FastAPI","React/Next.js","구조화된 에러 처리","일관된 에러 메시지","로그 기록","사용자 정의 예외 처리"],"es":["manejo de errores","FastAPI","React","Next.js","estructuras de error","try-catch","controladores de errores","mensajes de error","registro de errores"],"fr":["gestion des erreurs","FastAPI","React","Next.js","structures d''erreur","try-catch","gestionnaires d''erreurs","messages d''erreur","journalisation des erreurs"],"de":["Fehlerbehandlung","FastAPI","React","Next.js","Fehlerstrukturen","try-catch","Fehlerbehandlungs-Controller","Fehlermeldungen","Fehlerprotokollierung"],"pt":["tratamento de erros","FastAPI","React","Next.js","exceções","erros","registro de erros","mensagens de erro","tratamento de erros globais"],"ru":["обработка ошибок","FastAPI","React","Next.js","исключения","ошибки","журналирование ошибок","сообщения об ошибках","глобальная обработка ошибок"],"ar":["معالجة الأخطاء","FastAPI","React","Next.js","الاستثناءات","الأخطاء","تسجيل الأخطاء","رسائل خطأ","معالجة الأخطاء العالمية"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"error-handling","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Error Handling Skill\n\nExpert structured error handling for FastAPI backends and React/Next.js frontends with consistent error messages and logging.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Backend | Frontend |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Custom exception | `class FeeNotPaidError(AppException)` | N/A |\n| Try-catch | `try: ... except SpecificError:` | `try { } catch (e) { }` |\n| Global handler | `@app.exception_handler` | `ErrorBoundary` component |\n| User message | `detail` field in response | T","body":"# Error Handling Skill\n\nExpert structured error handling for FastAPI backends and React/Next.js frontends with consistent error messages and logging.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Backend | Frontend |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Custom exception | `class FeeNotPaidError(AppException)` | N/A |\n| Try-catch | `try: ... except SpecificError:` | `try { } catch (e) { }` |\n| Global handler | `@app.exception_handler` | `ErrorBoundary` component |\n| User message | `detail` field in response | Toast/Snackbar |\n| Error logging | `logger.error(...)` | Console/Sentry |\n\n## Custom Exceptions (Backend)\n\n### Base Exception Hierarchy\n\n```python\n# backend/app/errors/exceptions.py\nfrom fastapi import HTTPException\nfrom typing import Any\n\n\nclass AppException(HTTPException):\n    \"\"\"Base application exception with user-friendly messages.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        status_code: int,\n        detail: str,\n        user_message: str,\n        headers: dict[str, Any] | None = None,\n    ):\n        self.user_message = user_message\n        super().__init__(status_code=status_code, detail=detail, headers=headers)\n\n\nclass NotFoundError(AppException):\n    \"\"\"Resource not found (404).\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, resource: str, identifier: str):\n        super().__init__(\n            status_code=404,\n            detail=f\"{resource} with id ''{identifier}'' not found\",\n            user_message=f\"{resource} not found. Please check and try again.\",\n        )\n\n\nclass ValidationError(AppException):\n    \"\"\"Validation failed (400).\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, field: str, reason: str):\n        super().__init__(\n            status_code=400,\n            detail=f\"Validation error for field ''{field}'': {reason}\",\n            user_message=f\"Invalid value for {field}. {reason}\",\n        )\n\n\nclass UnauthorizedError(AppException):\n    \"\"\"Authentication required (401).\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, reason: str = \"Authentication required\"):\n        super().__init__(\n            status_code=401,\n            detail=reason,\n            user_message=\"Please log in to continue.\",\n            headers={\"WWW-Authenticate\": \"Bearer\"},\n        )\n\n\nclass ForbiddenError(AppException):\n    \"\"\"Permission denied (403).\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, action: str):\n        super().__init__(\n            status_code=403,\n            detail=f\"Permission denied for action: {action}\",\n            user_message=f\"You don''t have permission to {action}.\",\n        )\n\n\nclass ConflictError(AppException):\n    \"\"\"Resource conflict (409).\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, resource: str, reason: str):\n        super().__init__(\n            status_code=409,\n            detail=f\"Conflict for {resource}: {reason}\",\n            user_message=f\"{resource} conflict. {reason}\",\n        )\n\n\nclass RateLimitError(AppException):\n    \"\"\"Too many requests (429).\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, retry_after: int = 60):\n        super().__init__(\n            status_code=429,\n            detail=f\"Rate limit exceeded. Retry after {retry_after} seconds.\",\n            user_message=\"Too many requests. Please wait a moment and try again.\",\n            headers={\"Retry-After\": str(retry_after)},\n        )\n```\n\n### Domain-Specific Exceptions\n\n```python\n# backend/app/errors/domains.py\nfrom .exceptions import NotFoundError, ValidationError, ConflictError\n\n\nclass StudentNotFoundError(NotFoundError):\n    def __init__(self, student_id: int):\n        super().__init__(resource=\"Student\", identifier=str(student_id))\n\n\nclass FeeNotPaidError(ConflictError):\n    def __init__(self, student_id: int, amount_due: float):\n        super().__init__(\n            resource=\"Fee\",\n            reason=f\"Student {student_id} has unpaid fee of ${amount_due:.2f}\",\n        )\n\n\nclass AttendanceAlreadyMarkedError(ConflictError):\n    def __init__(self, student_id: int, date: str):\n        super().__init__(\n            resource=\"Attendance\",\n            reason=f\"Attendance already marked for student {student_id} on {date}\",\n        )\n\n\nclass InvalidGradeError(ValidationError):\n    def __init__(self, grade: str, valid_grades: list[str]):\n        super().__init__(\n            field=\"grade\",\n            reason=f\"''{grade}'' is not valid. Must be one of: {'', ''.join(valid_grades)}\",\n        )\n\n\nclass InsufficientBalanceError(ValidationError):\n    def __init__(self, required: float, available: float):\n        super().__init__(\n            field=\"amount\",\n            reason=f\"Insufficient balance. Required: ${required:.2f}, Available: ${available:.2f}\",\n        )\n```\n\n## Try-Catch Patterns\n\n### Narrow Try Blocks\n\n```python\n# GOOD: Specific exception, narrow scope\ntry:\n    student = await get_student_by_id(student_id)\nexcept StudentNotFoundError:\n    raise StudentNotFoundError(student_id)\n\n# BAD: Too broad, catches everything\ntry:\n    student = await get_student_by_id(student_id)\n    calculate_fees(student)\n    send_notification(student)\n    update_records(student)\nexcept Exception:\n    pass  # Swallowed!\n```\n\n### Cleanup with Finally\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom contextlib import asynccontextmanager\n\n\n@asynccontextmanager\nasync def database_connection():\n    conn = await get_db_connection()\n    try:\n        yield conn\n    except Exception as e:\n        await conn.rollback()\n        raise\n    finally:\n        await conn.close()\n\n\nasync def transfer_funds(from_account: int, to_account: int, amount: float):\n    async with database_connection() as conn:\n        try:\n            await conn.execute(\"UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - ? WHERE id = ?\", amount, from_account)\n            await conn.execute(\"UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance + ? WHERE id = ?\", amount, to_account)\n            await conn.commit()\n        except InsufficientBalanceError:\n            await conn.rollback()\n            raise\n```\n\n## Error Logging (Backend)\n\n### Structured JSON Logging\n\n```python\n# backend/app/core/logger.py\nimport logging\nimport json\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom typing import Any\nfrom contextvars import ContextVar\nimport traceback\n\n# Correlation ID for request tracing\ncorrelation_id_var: ContextVar[str] = ContextVar(\"correlation_id\", default=\"\")\n\n\nclass StructuredLogger:\n    \"\"\"Structured JSON logger with correlation IDs.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, name: str):\n        self.logger = logging.getLogger(name)\n        self.logger.setLevel(logging.INFO)\n\n    def _log_record(self, level: str, message: str, extra: dict[str, Any] = None):\n        record = {\n            \"timestamp\": datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),\n            \"level\": level,\n            \"message\": message,\n            \"correlation_id\": correlation_id_var.get(),\n            **(extra or {}),\n        }\n        return json.dumps(record)\n\n    def info(self, message: str, **extra):\n        self.logger.info(self._log_record(\"INFO\", message, extra))\n\n    def warning(self, message: str, **extra):\n        self.logger.warning(self._log_record(\"WARNING\", message, extra))\n\n    def error(self, message: str, error: Exception = None, **extra):\n        log_extra = {**extra}\n        if error:\n            log_extra[\"error_type\"] = type(error).__name__\n            log_extra[\"error_message\"] = str(error)\n            log_extra[\"stack_trace\"] = traceback.format_exc()\n        self.logger.error(self._log_record(\"ERROR\", message, log_extra))\n\n\nlogger = StructuredLogger(__name__)\n```\n\n### Using the Logger\n\n```python\nfrom app.core.logger import logger, correlation_id_var\n\n\nasync def get_student(student_id: int) -> Student:\n    logger.info(\"Fetching student\", student_id=student_id)\n\n    try:\n        student = await db.get_student(student_id)\n        logger.info(\"Student fetched successfully\", student_id=student_id, has_fees=bool(student.fees))\n        return student\n    except StudentNotFoundError:\n        logger.warning(\"Student not found\", student_id=student_id)\n        raise\n    except Exception as e:\n        logger.error(\"Unexpected error fetching student\", error=e, student_id=student_id)\n        raise  # Re-raise for handler\n```\n\n## Global Error Handler (Backend)\n\n```python\n# backend/app/middleware/error_handler.py\nfrom fastapi import Request, FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.responses import JSONResponse\nfrom app.errors.exceptions import AppException\nfrom app.core.logger import logger\n\n\ndef setup_error_handlers(app: FastAPI):\n    @app.exception_handler(AppException)\n    async def app_exception_handler(request: Request, exc: AppException):\n        logger.error(\n            \"App exception occurred\",\n            error=exc,\n            status_code=exc.status_code,\n            path=request.url.path,\n        )\n        return JSONResponse(\n            status_code=exc.status_code,\n            content={\n                \"error\": {\n                    \"code\": exc.__class__.__name__,\n                    \"message\": exc.user_message,\n                    \"internal\": exc.detail,  # Only in debug mode\n                }\n            },\n            headers=exc.headers,\n        )\n\n    @app.exception_handler(Exception)\n    async def general_exception_handler(request: Request, exc: Exception):\n        logger.error(\n            \"Unhandled exception\",\n            error=exc,\n            path=request.url.path,\n            method=request.method,\n        )\n        return JSONResponse(\n            status_code=500,\n            content={\n                \"error\": {\n                    \"code\": \"INTERNAL_ERROR\",\n                    \"message\": \"Something went wrong. Please try again later.\",\n                }\n            },\n        )\n```\n\n## Frontend Error Handling\n\n### Error Types\n\n```typescript\n// frontend/lib/errors.ts\nexport interface ApiError {\n  error: {\n    code: string;\n    message: string;\n    internal?: string;\n  };\n}\n\nexport class ApiResponseError extends Error {\n  code: string;\n  userMessage: string;\n  internalMessage?: string;\n  statusCode: number;\n\n  constructor(error: ApiError[\"error\"], statusCode: number) {\n    super(error.message);\n    this.name = \"ApiResponseError\";\n    this.code = error.code;\n    this.userMessage = error.message;\n    this.internalMessage = error.internal;\n    this.statusCode = statusCode;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Error Mapper\n\n```typescript\n// frontend/lib/errorMapper.ts\nimport { ApiResponseError } from \"./errors\";\n\nexport function getUserMessage(error: unknown): string {\n  if (error instanceof ApiResponseError) {\n    return error.userMessage;\n  }\n\n  if (error instanceof Error) {\n    // Network errors\n    if (error.name === \"TypeError\" && error.message.includes(\"fetch\")) {\n      return \"Unable to connect to server. Please check your internet connection.\";\n    }\n\n    // Unexpected errors\n    return \"An unexpected error occurred. Please try again.\";\n  }\n\n  return \"An unknown error occurred.\";\n}\n\nexport function getErrorTitle(error: unknown): string {\n  if (error instanceof ApiResponseError) {\n    switch (error.statusCode) {\n      case 401:\n        return \"Authentication Required\";\n      case 403:\n        return \"Access Denied\";\n      case 404:\n        return \"Not Found\";\n      case 409:\n        return \"Conflict\";\n      case 422:\n        return \"Validation Error\";\n      case 429:\n        return \"Rate Limited\";\n      case 500:\n        return \"Server Error\";\n      default:\n        return \"Error\";\n    }\n  }\n\n  return \"Error\";\n}\n```\n\n### API Client with Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n// frontend/lib/api.ts\nimport { ApiResponseError } from \"./errors\";\nimport { getUserMessage } from \"./errorMapper\";\n\ninterface RequestOptions extends RequestInit {\n  params?: Record<string, string>;\n}\n\nclass ApiClient {\n  private baseUrl: string;\n\n  constructor(baseUrl: string = \"/api/v1\") {\n    this.baseUrl = baseUrl;\n  }\n\n  async request<T>(endpoint: string, options: RequestOptions = {}): Promise<T> {\n    const url = new URL(`${this.baseUrl}${endpoint}`, window.location.origin);\n\n    if (options.params) {\n      Object.entries(options.params).forEach(([key, value]) => {\n        url.searchParams.append(key, value);\n      });\n    }\n\n    const response = await fetch(url.toString(), {\n      ...options,\n      headers: {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        ...options.headers,\n      },\n    });\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      const errorData = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));\n\n      throw new ApiResponseError(\n        {\n          code: errorData.error?.code || \"HTTP_ERROR\",\n          message: errorData.error?.message || response.statusText,\n          internal: errorData.error?.internal,\n        },\n        response.status\n      );\n    }\n\n    if (response.status === 204) {\n      return undefined as T;\n    }\n\n    return response.json() as Promise<T>;\n  }\n\n  get<T>(endpoint: string, params?: Record<string, string>): Promise<T> {\n    return this.request<T>(endpoint, { method: \"GET\", params });\n  }\n\n  post<T>(endpoint: string, body: unknown): Promise<T> {\n    return this.request<T>(endpoint, { method: \"POST\", body: JSON.stringify(body) });\n  }\n\n  put<T>(endpoint: string, body: unknown): Promise<T> {\n    return this.request<T>(endpoint, { method: \"PUT\", body: JSON.stringify(body) });\n  }\n\n  delete<T>(endpoint: string): Promise<T> {\n    return this.request<T>(endpoint, { method: \"DELETE\" });\n  }\n}\n\nexport const api = new ApiClient();\n```\n\n### React Query with Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n// frontend/hooks/useApi.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation, UseQueryOptions } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { api } from \"../lib/api\";\nimport { ApiResponseError } from \"../lib/errors\";\nimport { toast } from \"sonner\";\n\nexport function useFetch<T>(\n  key: string[],\n  endpoint: string,\n  options?: Partial<UseQueryOptions<T>>\n) {\n  return useQuery({\n    queryKey: key,\n    queryFn: () => api.get<T>(endpoint),\n    ...options,\n    onError: (error: unknown) => {\n      if (error instanceof ApiResponseError) {\n        toast.error(error.userMessage);\n      } else {\n        toast.error(\"Failed to fetch data\");\n      }\n    },\n  });\n}\n\nexport function useMutationWithError<T, V>(\n  mutationFn: (variables: V) => Promise<T>,\n  successMessage: string,\n  onSuccess?: (data: T) => void\n) {\n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn,\n    onSuccess: (data) => {\n      toast.success(successMessage);\n      onSuccess?.(data);\n    },\n    onError: (error: unknown) => {\n      if (error instanceof ApiResponseError) {\n        toast.error(error.userMessage);\n      } else {\n        toast.error(\"An error occurred. Please try again.\");\n      }\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- [ ] **No swallowed errors**: Every exception is either logged or surfaced to user\n- [ ] **Internal vs user message separation**: Technical details in `detail`, user-friendly in `user_message`\n- [ ] **4xx vs 5xx correctly mapped**: Client errors (4xx) vs server errors (5xx)\n- [ ] **No PII in logs**: Never log passwords, tokens, personal data\n- [ ] **Correlation IDs**: Track errors across services with request IDs\n- [ ] **Consistent error format**: Same structure for all API errors\n\n## Error Response Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"STUDENT_NOT_FOUND\",\n    \"message\": \"Student not found. Please check and try again.\",\n    \"internal\": \"Student with id ''12345'' not found\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Points\n\n| Skill | Integration |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `@fastapi-app` | Global exception handlers in main.py |\n| `@api-route-design` | Proper status codes in responses |\n| `@jwt-auth` | UnauthorizedError for auth failures |\n| `@db-migration` | Handle migration errors gracefully |\n| `@env-config` | Configuration validation errors |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:21:58.727Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing robust error handling for FastAPI backends and React/Next.js frontends","zh":"非常适合需要为 FastAPI 后端和 React/Next.js 前端提供强大的错误处理的全栈代理","ja":"FastAPI バックエンドと React/Next.js フロントエンドで強力なエラーハンドリングが必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"FastAPI 백엔드와 React/Next.js 프론트엔드에서 강력한 오류 처리가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan un control de errores robusto para backends de FastAPI y frontends de React/Next.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack nécessitant une gestion d''erreurs robuste pour les backends FastAPI et les frontends React/Next.js","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine robuste Fehlerbehandlung für FastAPI-Backends und React/Next.js-Frontends benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de tratamento de erros robusto para backends FastAPI e frontends React/Next.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, требующих надежной обработки ошибок для бэкендов FastAPI и фронтендов React/Next.js","ar":"مثالي لعمال الويب الكاملة الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة أخطاء قوية لخلفيات FastAPI وواجهات المستخدم React/Next.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement expert structured error handling with consistent error messages and logging, leveraging custom exceptions, try-catch blocks, and global handlers for seamless error management across FastAPI and React/Next.js applications","zh":"赋予代理实现专家结构化错误处理的能力，具有一致的错误消息和日志记录，利用自定义异常、try-catch 块和全局处理程序实现 FastAPI 和 React/Next.js 应用程序的无缝错误管理","ja":"エージェントが、カスタム例外、try-catch ブロック、グローバルハンドラーを利用して一貫したエラーメッセージとログ記録で専門的な構造化エラーハンドリングを実装する能力を与え、FastAPI と React/Next.js アプリケーション全体でエラー管理を無邪気に行う","ko":"에이전트가 전문가의 구조화된 오류 처리를 구현할 수 있도록 하는 것으로, 일관된 오류 메시지와 로그 기록을 사용하여 사용자 정의 예외, try-catch 블록 및 글로벌 핸들러를 활용하여 FastAPI 및 React/Next.js 애플리케이션에서 무결점 오류 관리를 제공한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una gestión de errores estructurada y experta con mensajes de error consistentes y registro, aprovechando excepciones personalizadas, bloques try-catch y controladores globales para una gestión de errores sin problemas en aplicaciones FastAPI y React/Next.js","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une gestion d''erreurs structurée et experte avec des messages d''erreur cohérents et un journalisation, en exploitant les exceptions personnalisées, les blocs try-catch et les gestionnaires globaux pour une gestion d''erreurs sans problème dans les applications FastAPI et React/Next.js","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine strukturierte und experte Fehlerbehandlung mit konsistenten Fehlermeldungen und Protokollierung zu implementieren, indem es benutzerdefinierte Ausnahmen, Try-Catch-Blöcke und globale Handler für eine nahtlose Fehlerverwaltung in FastAPI- und React/Next.js-Anwendungen nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar tratamento de erros estruturado por especialistas com mensagens de erro consistentes e registro, aproveitando exceções personalizadas, blocos try-catch e manipuladores globais para gerenciamento de erros sem interrupções em aplicativos FastAPI e React/Next.js","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать экспертное структурированное обработку ошибок с последовательными сообщениями об ошибках и ведением журнала, используя пользовательские исключения, блоки try-catch и глобальные обработчики для бесперебойного управления ошибками в приложениях FastAPI и React/Next.js","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ معالجة أخطاء منسقة من قبل الخبراء مع رسائل خطأ متسقة وتسجيل، مستفيدة من استثناءات مخصصة وكتل حاول-امسك ومعالجين عالميين لإدارة الأخطاء دون انقطاع في تطبيقات FastAPI و React/Next.js"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing global error handlers with @app.exception_handler","Creating custom exceptions for specific error types","Logging errors with consistent messages for better debugging"],"zh":["使用 @app.exception_handler 实现全局错误处理器","为特定错误类型创建自定义异常","使用一致的消息记录错误以提高调试"],"ja":["@app.exception_handler を使用してグローバルエラーハンドラーを実装する","特定のエラータイプのカスタム例外を作成する","一貫したメッセージを使用してエラーをログすることでデバッグを改善する"],"ko":["@app.exception_handler 를 사용하여 전역 오류 처리기를 구현한다","특정 오류 유형에 대한 사용자 정의 예외를 생성한다","일관된 메시지를 사용하여 오류를 로깅하여 디버깅을 개선한다"],"es":["Implementar controladores de errores globales con @app.exception_handler","Crear excepciones personalizadas para tipos de errores específicos","Registrar errores con mensajes consistentes para una mejor depuración"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des gestionnaires d''erreurs globaux avec @app.exception_handler","Créer des exceptions personnalisées pour des types d''erreurs spécifiques","Journaliser les erreurs avec des messages cohérents pour un meilleur débogage"],"de":["Implementieren globaler Fehlerhandler mit @app.exception_handler","Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Ausnahmen für bestimmte Fehlerarten","Protokollieren von Fehlern mit konsistenten Meldungen für bessere Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Implementar manipuladores de erros globais com @app.exception_handler","Criar exceções personalizadas para tipos de erros específicos","Registrar erros com mensagens consistentes para depuração melhor"],"ru":["Реализовать глобальные обработчики ошибок с помощью @app.exception_handler","Создать пользовательские исключения для конкретных типов ошибок","Ведение журнала ошибок с последовательными сообщениями для лучшей отладки"],"ar":["تنفيذ معالجين أخطاء عالميين مع @app.exception_handler","إنشاء استثناءات مخصصة لأنواع أخطاء محددة","تسجيل الأخطاء برسائل متسقة لتحسين التصحيح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires FastAPI backend and React/Next.js frontend","Limited to Python and JavaScript environments"],"zh":["需要 FastAPI 后端和 React/Next.js 前端","仅限 Python 和 JavaScript 环境"],"ja":["FastAPI バックエンドと React/Next.js フロントエンドが必要","Python と JavaScript 環境に限定"],"ko":["FastAPI 백엔드와 React/Next.js 프론트엔드가 필요","파이썬 및 자바스크립트 환경에만 국한"],"es":["Requiere backend de FastAPI y frontend de React/Next.js","Limitado a entornos de Python y JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite un backend FastAPI et un frontend React/Next.js","Limité aux environnements Python et JavaScript"],"de":["Erfordert FastAPI-Backend und React/Next.js-Frontend","Begrenzt auf Python- und JavaScript-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Exige backend FastAPI e frontend React/Next.js","Limitado a ambientes Python e JavaScript"],"ru":["Требует бэкенда FastAPI и фронтенда React/Next.js","Ограничен средами Python и JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب خلفية FastAPI وواجهة مستخدم React/Next.js","محدود بالبيئات بايثون و جافاسكريبت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
