ction principale","Connaissez votre audience et ses besoins","Créez un appel à l''action efficace","Optimisez pour une meilleure conversion"],"de":["Schreiben Sie klaren und prägnanten Inhalt","Identifizieren Sie den Zweck der Seite und die primäre Aktion","Kennen Sie Ihre Zielgruppe und ihre Bedürfnisse","Erstellen Sie einen effektiven Call-to-Action","Optimieren Sie für eine bessere Konversion"],"pt":["Escreva copywriting de conversão claro e persuasivo","Crie conteúdo de marketing efetivo","Entenda o propósito da página e o público-alvo","Defina ações primárias e secundárias para os visitantes","Desenvolva habilidades de copywriting para melhorar a conversão"],"ru":["Пишите копирайтинг для конверсии с ясностью и убеждением","Создавайте эффективный маркетинговый контент","Понимайте цель страницы и целевую аудиторию","Определяйте основные и второстепенные действия для посетителей","Развивайте навыки копирайтинга для улучшения конверсии"],"ar":["اكتب المحتوى التسويقي الفعال مع الوضوح والإقناع","أنشئ محتوى تسويقي فعال","افهم الغرض من الصفحة والجمهور المستهدف","حدد الإجراءات الأساسية والثانوية للزوار","طور مهارات كتابة المحتوى للتسويق لتحسين التحويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["copywriting","营销文案","转化率","行动驱动","目标受众","页面目的","标题","副标题","社交媒体营销"],"ja":["コピーライティング","マーケティング文章","変換率","アクション駆動","ターゲットオーディエンス","ページ目的","ヘッドライン","サブヘッドライン","ソーシャルメディアマーケティング"],"ko":["카피라이팅","마케팅 문구","전환률","행동 유도","목표 대상","페이지 목적","제목","부제목","소셜 미디어 마케팅"],"es":["copywriting para desarrolladores","mejora la conversión","contenido publicitario","desarrollo web","marketing digital","escribir copywriting efectivo"],"fr":["copywriting pour développeurs","améliorer la conversion","contenu publicitaire","développement web","marketing digital","écrire du copywriting efficace"],"de":["copywriting für entwickler","konversion verbessern","werbeinhalt","webentwicklung","digitales marketing","effektives copywriting schreiben"],"pt":["copywriting","conteúdo de marketing","conversão","página de destino","público-alvo","ação primária","ação secundária"],"ru":["копирайтинг","маркетинговый контент","конверсия","цель страницы","целевая аудитория","основное действие","второстепенное действие"],"ar":["كتابة المحتوى","المحتوى التسويقي","التحويل","غرض الصفحة","الجمهور المستهدف","الإجراء الأساسي","الإجراء الثانوي"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriting","description":"When the user wants to write, rewrite, or improve marketing copy for any page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, about pages, or product pages. Also use when the user says write copy for, improve this copy, rewrite this page, marketing copy, headline help, or CTA copy. For email copy, see email-sequence. For popup copy, see popup-cro.","bodyPreview":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solv","body":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solve?\n- What have they already tried?\n- What objections or hesitations do they have?\n- What language do they use to describe their problem?\n\n### 3. Product/Offer\n- What are you selling or offering?\n- What makes it different from alternatives?\n- What''s the key transformation or outcome?\n- Any proof points (numbers, testimonials, case studies)?\n\n### 4. Context\n- Where is traffic coming from? (ads, organic, email)\n- What do visitors already know before arriving?\n- What messaging are they seeing before this page?\n\n---\n\n## Copywriting Principles\n\n### Clarity Over Cleverness\n- If you have to choose between clear and creative, choose clear\n- Every sentence should have one job\n- Remove words that don''t add meaning\n\n### Benefits Over Features\n- Features: What it does\n- Benefits: What that means for the customer\n- Always connect features to outcomes\n\n### Specificity Over Vagueness\n- Vague: \"Save time on your workflow\"\n- Specific: \"Cut your weekly reporting from 4 hours to 15 minutes\"\n\n### Customer Language Over Company Language\n- Use words your customers use\n- Avoid jargon unless your audience uses it\n- Mirror voice-of-customer from reviews, interviews, support tickets\n\n### One Idea Per Section\n- Don''t try to say everything everywhere\n- Each section should advance one argument\n- Build a logical flow down the page\n\n---\n\n## Writing Style Rules\n\nFollow these core principles. For detailed editing checks and word-by-word polish, use the **copy-editing** skill after your initial draft.\n\n### Core Style Principles\n\n1. **Simple over complex** — Use everyday words. \"Use\" instead of \"utilize,\" \"help\" instead of \"facilitate.\"\n\n2. **Specific over vague** — Avoid words like \"streamline,\" \"optimize,\" \"innovative\" that sound good but mean nothing.\n\n3. **Active over passive** — \"We generate reports\" not \"Reports are generated.\"\n\n4. **Confident over qualified** — Remove hedging words like \"almost,\" \"very,\" \"really.\"\n\n5. **Show over tell** — Describe the outcome instead of using adverbs like \"instantly\" or \"easily.\"\n\n6. **Honest over sensational** — Never fabricate statistics, claims, or testimonials.\n\n### Quick Quality Check\n\nBefore finalizing, scan for:\n- Jargon that could confuse outsiders\n- Sentences trying to do too much (max 3 conjunctions)\n- Passive voice constructions\n- Exclamation points (remove them)\n- Marketing buzzwords without substance\n\nFor a thorough line-by-line review, run the copy through the **copy-editing** skill''s Seven Sweeps framework.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Be Direct\nGet to the point. Don''t bury the value in qualifications.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot? Send as many documents, images, and audio files as your heart desires.\n\n### Use Rhetorical Questions\nQuestions engage readers and make them think about their own situation.\n\n✅ Hate returning stuff to Amazon?\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot?\n\n✅ Tired of chasing approvals?\n\n### Use Analogies and Metaphors\nWhen appropriate, analogies make abstract concepts concrete and memorable.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Imagine Slack''s file-sharing as a digital whiteboard where everyone can post files, images, and updates in real time.\n\n### Pepper in Humor (When Appropriate)\nPuns, wit, and humor make copy memorable—but only if it fits the brand and doesn''t undermine clarity.\n\n---\n\n## Page Structure Framework\n\n### Above the Fold (First Screen)\n\n**Headline**\n- Your single most important message\n- Should communicate core value proposition\n- Specific > generic\n\n**Headline Formulas:**\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} without {pain point}**\n*Example: Understand how users are really experiencing your site without drowning in numbers*\n\n**The {opposite of usual process} way to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: The easiest way to turn your passion into income*\n\n**Never {unpleasant event} again**\n*Example: Never miss a sales opportunity again*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience}**\n*Example: Advanced analytics for Shopify e-commerce*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience} to {what it''s used for}**\n*Example: An online whiteboard for teams to ideate and brainstorm together*\n\n**You don''t have to {skills or resources} to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: With Ahrefs, you don''t have to be an SEO pro to rank higher and get more traffic*\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} by {how product makes it possible}**\n*Example: Generate more leads by seeing which companies visit your site*\n\n**{Key benefit of your product}**\n*Example: Sound clear in online meetings*\n\n**{Question highlighting the main pain point}**\n*Example: Hate returning stuff to Amazon?*\n\n**Turn {input} into {outcome}**\n*Example: Turn your hard-earned sales into repeat customers*\n\n**Additional formulas:**\n- \"[Achieve outcome] in [timeframe]\"\n- \"The [category] that [key differentiator]\"\n- \"Stop [pain]. Start [pleasure].\"\n- \"[Number] [people] use [product] to [outcome]\"\n\n**Subheadline**\n- Expands on the headline\n- Adds specificity or addresses secondary concern\n- 1-2 sentences max\n\n**Primary CTA**\n- Action-oriented button text\n- Communicate what they get, not what they do\n- \"Start Free Trial\" > \"Sign Up\"\n- \"Get Your Report\" > \"Submit\"\n\n**Supporting Visual**\n- Product screenshot, demo, or hero image\n- Should reinforce the message, not distract\n\n### Social Proof Section\n\nOptions (use 1-2):\n- Customer logos (recognizable > many)\n- Key metric (\"10,000+ teams\")\n- Short testimonial with attribution\n- Star rating with review count\n\n### Problem/Pain Section\n\n- Articulate the problem better than they can\n- Show you understand their situation\n- Create recognition (\"that''s exactly my problem\")\n\nStructure:\n- \"You know the feeling...\" or \"If you''re like most [role]...\"\n- Describe the specific frustrations\n- Hint at the cost of not solving it\n\n### Solution/Benefits Section\n\n- Bridge from problem to your solution\n- Focus on 3-5 key benefits (not 10)\n- Each benefit: headline + short explanation + proof point if available\n\nFormat options:\n- Benefit blocks with icons\n- Before/after comparison\n- Feature → Benefit → Proof structure\n\n### How It Works Section\n\n- Reduce perceived complexity\n- 3-4 step process\n- Each step: simple action + outcome\n\nExample:\n1. \"Connect your tools (2 minutes)\"\n2. \"Set your preferences\"\n3. \"Get automated reports every Monday\"\n\n### Social Proof (Detailed)\n\n- Full testimonials with:\n  - Specific results\n  - Customer name, role, company\n  - Photo if possible\n- Case study snippets\n- Logos section (if not above)\n\n### Objection Handling\n\nCommon objections to address:\n- \"Is this right for my situation?\"\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n- \"Is it hard to set up?\"\n- \"How is this different from X?\"\n\nFormats:\n- FAQ section\n- Comparison table\n- Guarantee/promise section\n- \"Built for [specific audience]\" section\n\n### Final CTA Section\n\n- Recap the value proposition\n- Repeat the primary CTA\n- Add urgency if genuine (deadline, limited availability)\n- Risk reversal (guarantee, free trial, no credit card)\n\n---\n\n## Landing Page Section Variety\n\nA great landing page isn''t just a list of features. Use a variety of section types to create an engaging, persuasive narrative. Mix and match from these:\n\n### Section Types to Include\n\n**How It Works (Numbered Steps)**\nWalk users through the process in 3-4 clear steps. Reduces perceived complexity and shows the path to value.\n\n**Alternative/Competitor Comparison**\nShow how you stack up against the status quo or competitors. Tables, side-by-side comparisons, or \"Unlike X, we...\" sections.\n\n**Founder Manifesto / Our Story**\nShare why you built this and what you believe. Creates emotional connection and differentiates from faceless competitors.\n\n**Testimonials**\nCustomer quotes with names, photos, and specific results. Multiple formats: quote cards, video testimonials, tweet embeds.\n\n**Case Studies**\nDeeper stories of customer success. Problem → Solution → Results format with specific metrics.\n\n**Use Cases**\nShow different ways the product is used. Helps visitors self-identify: \"This is for people like me.\"\n\n**Personas / \"Built For\" Sections**\nExplicitly call out who the product is for: \"Perfect for marketers,\" \"Built for agencies,\" etc.\n\n**Stats and Social Proof**\nKey metrics that build credibility: \"10,000+ customers,\" \"4.9/5 rating,\" \"$2M saved for customers.\"\n\n**Demo / Product Tour**\nInteractive demos, video walkthroughs, or GIF previews showing the product in action.\n\n**FAQ Section**\nAddress common objections and questions. Good for SEO and reducing support burden.\n\n**Integrations / Partners**\nShow what tools you connect with. Logos build credibility and answer \"Will this work with my stack?\"\n\n**Pricing Preview**\nEven on non-pricing pages, a pricing teaser can move decision-makers forward.\n\n**Guarantee / Risk Reversal**\nMoney-back guarantee, free trial terms, or \"cancel anytime\" messaging reduces friction.\n\n### Recommended Section Mix\n\nFor a landing page, aim for variety. Don''t just stack features:\n\n**Typical Feature-Heavy Page (Weak):**\n1. Hero\n2. Feature 1\n3. Feature 2\n4. Feature 3\n5. Feature 4\n6. CTA\n\n**Varied, Engaging Page (Strong):**\n1. Hero with clear value prop\n2. Social proof bar (logos or stats)\n3. Problem/pain section\n4. How it works (3 steps)\n5. Key benefits (2-3, not 10)\n6. Testimonial\n7. Use cases or personas\n8. Comparison to alternatives\n9. Case study snippet\n10. FAQ\n11. Final CTA with guarantee\n\n---\n\n## CTA Copy Guidelines\n\n**Weak CTAs (avoid):**\n- Submit\n- Sign Up\n- Learn More\n- Click Here\n- Get Started\n\n**Strong CTAs (use):**\n- Start Free Trial\n- Get [Specific Thing]\n- See [Product] in Action\n- Create Your First [Thing]\n- Book My Demo\n- Download the Guide\n- Try It Free\n\n**CTA formula:**\n[Action Verb] + [What They Get] + [Qualifier if needed]\n\nExamples:\n- \"Start My Free Trial\"\n- \"Get the Complete Checklist\"\n- \"See Pricing for My Team\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen writing copy, provide:\n\n### Page Copy\nOrganized by section with clear labels:\n- Headline\n- Subheadline\n- CTA\n- Section headers\n- Body copy\n- Secondary CTAs\n\n### Annotations\nFor key elements, explain:\n- Why you made this choice\n- What principle it applies\n- Alternatives considered\n\n### Alternatives\nFor headlines and CTAs, provide 2-3 options:\n- Option A: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option B: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option C: [copy] — [rationale]\n\n### Meta Content (if relevant)\n- Page title (for SEO)\n- Meta description\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Guidance\n\n### Homepage Copy\n- Serve multiple audiences without being generic\n- Lead with broadest value proposition\n- Provide clear paths for different visitor intents\n- Balance \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page Copy\n- Single message, single CTA\n- Match headline to ad/traffic source\n- Complete argument on one page\n- Remove distractions (often no nav)\n\n### Pricing Page Copy\n- Help visitors choose the right plan\n- Clarify what''s included at each level\n- Address \"which is right for me?\" anxiety\n- Make recommended plan obvious\n\n### Feature Page Copy\n- Connect feature to benefit to outcome\n- Show use cases and examples\n- Differentiate from competitors'' versions\n- Clear path to try or buy\n\n### About Page Copy\n- Tell the story of why you exist\n- Connect company mission to customer benefit\n- Build trust through transparency\n- Still include a CTA (it''s still a marketing page)\n\n---\n\n## Voice and Tone Considerations\n\nBefore writing, establish:\n\n**Formality level:**\n- Casual/conversational\n- Professional but friendly\n- Formal/enterprise\n\n**Brand personality:**\n- Playful or serious?\n- Bold or understated?\n- Technical or accessible?\n\nMaintain consistency throughout, but adjust intensity:\n- Headlines can be bolder\n- Body copy should be clearer\n- CTAs should be action-oriented\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copy-editing**: For polishing and improving existing copy (use after writing your first draft)\n- **page-cro**: If the page structure/strategy needs work, not just copy\n- **email-sequence**: For email copywriting\n- **popup-cro**: For popup and modal copy\n- **ab-test-setup**: To test copy variations properly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:23:23.215Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing advanced marketing copy generation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级营销文案生成能力的语言代理。","ja":"高度なマーケティングコピー生成機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 마케팅 복사 생성 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de copias de marketing.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de capacités de génération de copie de marketing avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die erweiterte Marketing-Kopie-Generierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam de capacidades avançadas de geração de cópias de marketing.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации маркетингового контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى khảيات متقدمة لإنشاء نصوص إعلانية تسويقية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft clear, compelling, and action-driven marketing copy using context gathering techniques, such as identifying page purpose and understanding target audience problems, to drive conversions.","zh":"赋予代理人使用上下文收集技术（如识别页面目的和了解目标受众问题）来制作清晰、有说服力和驱动转化的营销文案的能力。","ja":"ページの目的を識別したり、ターゲットオーディエンスの問題を理解したりするなどのコンテキスト収集技術を使用して、クリアで説得力のあるマーケティングコピーを作成するエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"페이지 목적을 식별하거나 대상 受众의 문제를 이해하는 등의 컨텍스트 수집 기술을 사용하여 명확하고 설득력 있는 마케팅 복사를 작성하여 전환을 구동하는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear copias de marketing claras, convincentes y orientadas a la acción utilizando técnicas de recopilación de contexto, como la identificación del propósito de la página y la comprensión de los problemas del público objetivo, para impulsar las conversiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des copies de marketing claires, convaincantes et axées sur l''action en utilisant des techniques de collecte de contexte, telles que l''identification de l''objectif de la page et la compréhension des problèmes du public cible, pour stimuler les conversions.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klare, überzeugende und aktionsorientierte Marketing-Kopien zu erstellen, indem sie Kontextsammeltechniken wie die Identifizierung des Seitenzwecks und das Verständnis der Zielgruppenprobleme verwenden, um Konversionen zu fördern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar cópias de marketing claras, convincentes e impulsionadas por ações, usando técnicas de coleta de contexto, como identificar o propósito da página e entender os problemas do público-alvo, para impulsionar conversões.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать четкие, убедительные и действенные маркетинговые тексты, используя методы сбора контекста, такие как определение цели страницы и понимание проблем целевой аудитории, для стимулирования конверсий.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء نصوص إعلانية تسويقية واضحة ومقنعة ومحفزة للعمل، باستخدام تقنيات جمع السياق، مثل تحديد غرض الصفحة وفهم مشاكل الجمهور المستهدف، لتحفيز التحويلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating landing page copy","Crafting product feature descriptions","Writing persuasive homepage headlines"],"zh":["生成着陆页复制","制定产品功能描述","撰写说服性首页标题"],"ja":["ランディングページのコピー生成","製品機能の説明の作成","説得力のあるホームページのタイトルの作成"],"ko":["랜딩 페이지 복사 생성","제품 기능 설명 작성","설득력 있는 홈페이지 제목 작성"],"es":["Generación de copia de página de aterrizaje","Creación de descripciones de características de productos","Escritura de titulares de página de inicio persuasivos"],"fr":["Génération de copie de page de destination","Création de descriptions de fonctionnalités de produits","Rédaction de titres de page d''accueil persuasifs"],"de":["Generierung von Landingpage-Kopie","Erstellung von Produktfunktionenbeschreibungen","Schreiben von überzeugenden Homepage-Überschriften"],"pt":["Geração de cópias de página de destino","Criação de descrições de recursos de produtos","Escrita de títulos de página inicial persuasivos"],"ru":["Генерация копий целевой страницы","Создание описаний функций продукта","Написание убедительных заголовков домашней страницы"],"ar":["إنشاء نصوص لصفحة الوجهة","كتابة وصفات لمميزات المنتجات","كتابة عناوين الصفحة الرئيسية المقنعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires context input from user","Limited to marketing copy use cases"],"zh":["需要用户的上下文输入","仅限营销复制用例"],"ja":["ユーザーからのコンテキスト入力が必要","マーケティングコピーの使用例に限定される"],"ko":["사용자의 컨텍스트 입력이 필요","마케팅 복사 사용 사례에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entrada de contexto del usuario","Limitado a casos de uso de copia de marketing"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de contexte de l''utilisateur","Limité aux cas d''utilisation de copie de marketing"],"de":["Benötigt Kontexteingabe des Benutzers","Begrenzt auf Marketing-Kopie-Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Exige entrada de contexto do usuário","Limitado a casos de uso de cópias de marketing"],"ru":["Требует ввода контекста от пользователя","Ограничен только случаями использования маркетингового контента"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال سياق من المستخدم","محدود لحالات استخدام نصوص الإعلان الترويجي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sundial-org/skills/neuro-symbolic-reasoning', 'community', 'sundial-org', 'skills', 'sundial-org/skills', 'neuro-symbolic-reasoning', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z', '2026-02-18T07:23:44.885Z', NULL, '{"id":"sundial-org/skills/neuro-symbolic-reasoning","name":"neuro-symbolic-reasoning","description":{"zh":"神经符号推理是一种检测用户意图和路由的技术，包括Ideation和Implementation两个阶段","ja":"ニューロ・シンボル推論は、ユーザー意図の検出とルーティングを行う技術であり、アイデア生成と実装の2つの段階を含む","ko":"신경 상징적 추론은 사용자 의도 탐지 및 라우팅을 수행하는 기술로, 아이디어 생성 및 구현의 두 단계로 구성","es":"El razonamiento neuro-simbólico es una técnica que combina la inteligencia artificial y el procesamiento del lenguaje natural para detectar la intención del usuario","fr":"Le raisonnement neuro-symbolique est une technique qui combine l''intelligence artificielle et le traitement du langage naturel pour détecter l''intention de l''utilisateur","de":"Das neuro-symbolische Reasoning ist eine Technik, die künstliche Intelligenz und natürliche Sprachverarbeitung kombiniert, um die Benutzerintention zu erkennen","pt":"O raciocínio neuro-simbólico é uma técnica que combina a inteligência artificial com a lógica simbólica para detectar a intenção do usuário e rotear adequadamente.","ru":"Нейро-символическое рассуждение - это метод, который сочетает искусственный интеллект с символической логикой для обнаружения намерений пользователя и правильного маршрутизации.","ar":"الاستدلال العصبي الرمزي هو تقنية تجمع بين الذكاء الاصطناعي والمنطق الرمزي لاكتشاف مقصد المستخدم وتوجيهه بشكل صحيح.","en":"Claude Code Skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"神经符号推理技术","ja":"ニューロ・シンボル推論","ko":"신경 상징적 추론","es":"Razonamiento Neuro-Simbólico: Desarrollo de Inteligencia ...","fr":"Raisonnement Neuro-Symbolique: Développement d''Intelligen...","de":"Neuro-Symbolisches Reasoning: Entwicklung von Künstlicher...","pt":"Raciocínio Neuro-Simbólico: Desenvolvimento de Inteligênc...","ru":"Нейро-символическое рассуждение: Разработка искусственног...","ar":"الاستدلال العصبي الرمزي: تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"neuro-symbolic-reasoning"},"description":{"zh":"神经符号推理是一种检测用户意图和路由的技术，包括Ideation和Implementation两个阶段","ja":"ニューロ・シンボル推論は、ユーザー意図の検出とルーティングを行う技術であり、アイデア生成と実装の2つの段階を含む","ko":"신경 상징적 추론은 사용자 의도 탐지 및 라우팅을 수행하는 기술로, 아이디어 생성 및 구현의 두 단계로 구성","es":"El razonamiento neuro-simbólico es una técnica que combina la inteligencia artificial y el procesamiento del lenguaje natural para detectar la intención del ...","fr":"Le raisonnement neuro-symbolique est une technique qui combine l''intelligence artificielle et le traitement du langage naturel pour détecter l''intention de l...","de":"Das neuro-symbolische Reasoning ist eine Technik, die künstliche Intelligenz und natürliche Sprachverarbeitung kombiniert, um die Benutzerintention zu erkennen","pt":"O raciocínio neuro-simbólico é uma técnica que combina a inteligência artificial com a lógica simbólica para detectar a intenção do usuário e rotear adequada...","ru":"Нейро-символическое рассуждение - это метод, который сочетает искусственный интеллект с символической логикой для обнаружения намерений пользователя и правил...","ar":"الاستدلال العصبي الرمزي هو تقنية تجمع بين الذكاء الاصطناعي والمنطق الرمزي لاكتشاف مقصد المستخدم وتوجيهه بشكل صحيح.","en":"Claude Code Skills"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code Skills"},"features":{"zh":["检测用户意图","路由请求","Ideation阶段","Implementation阶段","代码生成","调试支持"],"ja":["ユーザー意図の検出","ルーティング要求","アイデア生成段階","実装段階","コード生成","デバッグサポート"],"ko":["사용자 의도 탐지","라우팅 요청","아이디어 생성 단계","구현 단계","코드 생성","디버깅 지원"],"es":["Detección de intención del usuario","Routeo según sea necesario","Implementación de experimentos","Depuración de código","Integración con lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Détection de l''intention de l''utilisateur","Routage en conséquence","Mise en œuvre d''expériences","Débogage de code","Intégration avec le langage naturel"],"de":["Erkennung der Benutzerintention","Routen entsprechend","Implementierung von Experimenten","Fehlerbehebung von Code","Integration mit natürlicher Sprache"],"pt":["Detecção de intenção do usuário","Roteamento adequado","Combinação de inteligência artificial e lógica simbólica","Aprendizado de máquina","Desenvolvimento de soluções de inteligência artificial"],"ru":["Обнаружение намерений пользователя","Правильное маршрутизация","Сочетание искусственного интеллекта и символической логики","Машинное обучение","Разработка решений искусственного интеллекта"],"ar":["اكتشاف مقصد المستخدم","التوجيه الصحيح","دمج الذكاء الاصطناعي والمنطق الرمزي","التعلم الآلي","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["神经符号推理","用户意图检测","路由技术","Ideation","Implementation","代码生成","人工智能","机器学习"],"ja":["ニューロ・シンボル推論","ユーザー意図の検出","ルーティング技術","アイデア生成","実装","コード生成","人工知能","機械学習"],"ko":["신경 상징적 추론","사용자 의도 탐지","라우팅 기술","아이디어 생성","구현","코드 생성","인공 지능","기계 학습"],"es":["razonamiento neuro-simbólico","inteligencia artificial","procesamiento del lenguaje natural","detección de intención","desarrollo de software","experimentos","depuración de código"],"fr":["raisonnement neuro-symbolique","intelligence artificielle","traitement du langage naturel","détection d''intention","développement de logiciels","expériences","débogage de code"],"de":["neuro-symbolisches Reasoning","künstliche Intelligenz","natürliche Sprachverarbeitung","Erkennung von Benutzerintention","Software-Entwicklung","Experimente","Fehlerbehebung von Code"],"pt":["raciocínio neuro-simbólico","inteligência artificial","lógica simbólica","aprendizado de máquina","desenvolvimento de soluções de inteligência artificial","detecção de intenção do usuário","roteamento adequado"],"ru":["нейро-символическое рассуждение","искусственный интеллект","символическая логика","машинное обучение","разработка решений искусственного интеллекта","обнаружение намерений пользователя","правильное маршрутизация"],"ar":["الاستدلال العصبي الرمزي","الذكاء الاصطناعي","المنطق الرمزي","التعلم الآلي","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","اكتشاف مقصد المستخدم","التوجيه الصحيح"]}},"owner":"sundial-org","repo":"skills","repoPath":"sundial-org/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"neuro-symbolic-reasoning","description":"Neuro-symbolic AI combining LLMs with symbolic solvers. Use when exploring neuro-symbolic approaches (ideation, no code) or implementing solver integrations (code).","bodyPreview":"# Neuro-Symbolic Reasoning\n\n## Mode Detection\n\nDetect user intent and route accordingly:\n\n**→ Ideation**: \"How should I...\", \"What are the tradeoffs...\", \"Design an experiment...\"\n- NO code, NO file creation\n- See [references/ideation.md](references/ideation.md)\n\n**→ Implementation**: \"Implement...\", \"Build...\", \"Write code...\", \"Debug...\"\n- See [references/solvers.md](references/solvers.md) for code\n- See [references/logic-llm.md](references/logic-llm.md) for format\n- See [references/packages.m","body":"# Neuro-Symbolic Reasoning\n\n## Mode Detection\n\nDetect user intent and route accordingly:\n\n**→ Ideation**: \"How should I...\", \"What are the tradeoffs...\", \"Design an experiment...\"\n- NO code, NO file creation\n- See [references/ideation.md](references/ideation.md)\n\n**→ Implementation**: \"Implement...\", \"Build...\", \"Write code...\", \"Debug...\"\n- See [references/solvers.md](references/solvers.md) for code\n- See [references/logic-llm.md](references/logic-llm.md) for format\n- See [references/packages.md](references/packages.md) for setup\n\n## File Creation Policy\n\n**Small files, few files:**\n- Create files (not inline code) but keep them small and focused\n- Avoid scaffolding project structures unless asked\n- Follow good coding practices: clear names, comments where needed\n\n## Core Pipeline\n\n```\nNL Problem → LLM Formulator → Logic Program → Symbolic Solver → Answer\n                    ↑                              |\n                    └──── Self-Refinement ←────────┘\n```\n\n## Solver Selection\n\n| Logic Type | Solver | Use When |\n|------------|--------|----------|\n| First-order logic | Prover9 | Expressive reasoning, theorem proving |\n| Constraints/SAT | Z3 | Scheduling, planning, satisfiability |\n| Rule-based | Pyke | Simple propositional rules |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:23:44.885Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents requiring enhanced neuro-symbolic reasoning capabilities for complex problem-solving and intent detection.","zh":"适用于需要增强神经符号推理能力的高级语言代理，以解决复杂问题和检测意图。","ja":"高度な神経記号論的推論能力を必要とする高度な言語エージェントに適しています。複雑な問題解決と意図の検出に役立ちます。","ko":"복잡한 문제 해결과 의도 감지를 위한 고급 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 강화된 신경 상징적推론 능력이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents requiring enhanced neuro-symbolic reasoning capabilities for complex problem-solving and intent detection.","fr":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents requiring enhanced neuro-symbolic reasoning capabilities for complex problem-solving and intent detection.","de":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents requiring enhanced neuro-symbolic reasoning capabilities for complex problem-solving and intent detection.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados que requerem capacidades de raciocínio neuro-simbólico aprimoradas para resolução de problemas complexos e detecção de intenção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Продвинутых Языковых Агентов, требующих улучшенных возможностей невро-символического рассуждения для сложного решения проблем и обнаружения намерений.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء اللغة المتقدمين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات استدلال SYMBOLIC العصبية المحسنة لحل المشكلات المعقدة وتحديد النية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect user intent and route accordingly, leveraging mode detection for ideation and implementation phases, and utilizing references such as solvers.md and logic-llm.md for code and format guidance, enabling seamless integration with packages and files.","zh":"赋予代理检测用户意图并相应路由的能力，利用模式检测进行构想和实施阶段，并利用诸如solvers.md和logic-llm.md的参考资料进行代码和格式指导，从而实现与软件包和文件的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントにユーザーの意図を検出し、適切にルーティングする能力を付与します。モード検出を使用してアイデア化と実装の段階を行い、solvers.mdやlogic-llm.mdなどのリファレンスを使用してコードとフォーマットのガイダンスを行い、パッケージやファイルとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자의 의도를 감지하고 적절하게 라우팅할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 모드 감지를 사용하여 아이디어화와 구현 단계를 진행하고, solvers.md와 logic-llm.md와 같은 참조를 사용하여 코드와 형식에 대한 지침을 제공하여 패키지와 파일との 무缝한 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to detect user intent and route accordingly, leveraging mode detection for ideation and implementation phases, and utilizing references such as solvers.md and logic-llm.md for code and format guidance, enabling seamless integration with packages and files.","fr":"Empowers agents to detect user intent and route accordingly, leveraging mode detection for ideation and implementation phases, and utilizing references such as solvers.md and logic-llm.md for code and format guidance, enabling seamless integration with packages and files.","de":"Empowers agents to detect user intent and route accordingly, leveraging mode detection for ideation and implementation phases, and utilizing references such as solvers.md and logic-llm.md for code and format guidance, enabling seamless integration with packages and files.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar a intenção do usuário e encaminhá-los de acordo, utilizando detecção de modo para fases de ideação e implementação, e utilizando referências como solvers.md e logic-llm.md para orientação de código e formato, permitindo integração perfeita com pacotes e arquivos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обнаруживать намерения пользователя и перенаправлять их соответственно, используя обнаружение режима для фаз идеации и реализации, и используя ссылки, такие как solvers.md и logic-llm.md, для руководства по коду и формату, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с пакетами и файлами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الكشف عن намية المستخدم وتوجيههم وفقًا لذلك، مستخدمين كشف الوضع لفترات التخيل والتنفيذ، واستخدام المراجع مثل solvers.md و logic-llm.md لتوجيه الشفرة والتنسيق، مما يسمح بالتكامل السلس مع الحزم والملفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Detecting user intent for routing to ideation or implementation phases","Generating code for implementation phases based on solvers.md and logic-llm.md","Creating files and debugging code according to specific format and package requirements"],"zh":["检测用户意图以路由到构想或实施阶段","根据solvers.md和logic-llm.md生成实施阶段的代码","根据特定的格式和软件包要求创建文件并调试代码"],"ja":["ユーザーの意図を検出し、アイデア化または実装の段階にルーティングする","solvers.mdとlogic-llm.mdに基づいて実装段階のコードを生成する","特定のフォーマットとパッケージの要件に基づいてファイルを作成し、コードをデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자의 의도를 감지하여 아이디어화 또는 구현 단계로 라우팅하는 것","solvers.md와 logic-llm.md를 기준으로 구현 단계의 코드를 생성하는 것","특정 형식과 패키지 요구 사항에 따라 파일을 생성하고 코드를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Detecting user intent for routing to ideation or implementation phases","Generating code for implementation phases based on solvers.md and logic-llm.md","Creating files and debugging code according to specific format and package requirements"],"fr":["Detecting user intent for routing to ideation or implementation phases","Generating code for implementation phases based on solvers.md and logic-llm.md","Creating files and debugging code according to specific format and package requirements"],"de":["Detecting user intent for routing to ideation or implementation phases","Generating code for implementation phases based on solvers.md and logic-llm.md","Creating files and debugging code according to specific format and package requirements"],"pt":["Detecção da intenção do usuário para encaminhamento para fases de ideação ou implementação","Geração de código para fases de implementação com base em solvers.md e logic-llm.md","Criação de arquivos e depuração de código de acordo com requisitos de formato e pacote específicos"],"ru":["Обнаружение намерений пользователя для перенаправления в фазы идеации или реализации","Генерация кода для фаз реализации на основе solvers.md и logic-llm.md","Создание файлов и отладка кода в соответствии с конкретными требованиями формата и пакета"],"ar":["اكتشاف نية المستخدم لإعادة توجيهه إلى مراحل التخيل أو التنفيذ","توليد رمز للفترات التنفيذية بناءً على solvers.md و logic-llm.md","إنشاء ملفات وتصحيح أخطاء الشفرة وفقًا لمتطلبات التنسيق والحزمة المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific formatting as per logic-llm.md","Limited to ideation and implementation modes","Needs access to references and packages for full functionality"],"zh":["需要遵循logic-llm.md中的特定格式","仅限于构想和实施模式","需要访问参考资料和软件包以实现全部功能"],"ja":["logic-llm.mdに記載されている特定のフォーマットに従う必要がある","アイデア化と実装のモードのみに限定される","全機能を実現するためにリファレンスとパッケージへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["logic-llm.md에 지정된 특정 형식을 따라야 함","아이디어화와 구현 모드만으로 제한됨","전체 기능을 구현하기 위해 참조와 패키지에 대한 액세스가 필요함"],"es":["Requires specific formatting as per logic-llm.md","Limited to ideation and implementation modes","Needs access to references and packages for full functionality"],"fr":["Requires specific formatting as per logic-llm.md","Limited to ideation and implementation modes","Needs access to references and packages for full functionality"],"de":["Requires specific formatting as per logic-llm.md","Limited to ideation and implementation modes","Needs access to references and packages for full functionality"],"pt":["Requer formatação específica de acordo com logic-llm.md","Limitado a modos de ideação e implementação","Necessita de acesso a referências e pacotes para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требует специфического форматирования в соответствии с logic-llm.md","Ограничен режимами идеации и реализации","Требует доступа к ссылкам и пакетам для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب تنسيقًا محددًا وفقًا لـ logic-llm.md","محدود بالوضعين التخيلي والتنفيذي","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى المراجع والحزم لتحقيق الوظائف الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
