ة","en":"evaluating-new-technology"},"description":{"zh":"评估新技术是一个帮助用户评估新兴技术的技能，使用来自22位产品领袖的框架","ja":"新技術の評価は、ユーザーが新技術を評価するのを助けるスキルです。22人の製品リーダーからのフレームワークを使用します","ko":"신기술 평가是一种帮助用户评估新兴技术的技能，使用来自22位产品领袖的框架","es":"Evalúa tecnologías emergentes con frameworks de expertos. Aprende a tomar decisiones informadas sobre la adopción de nuevas tecnologías","fr":"Évaluez les technologies émergentes avec des frameworks d''experts. Apprenez à prendre des décisions éclairées sur l''adoption de nouvelles technologies","de":"Bewerten Sie neue Technologien mit Frameworks von Experten. Lernen Sie, wie Sie fundierte Entscheidungen über die Einführung neuer Technologien treffen","pt":"Avalie tecnologias emergentes com frameworks de líderes de produtos. Clarifique problemas, avalie maturidade e considere construir ou comprar.","ru":"Оцените новые технологии с помощью фреймворков лидеров продукта. Выявите проблемы, оцените зрелость и рассмотрите возможность построения или покупки.","ar":"قيم التكنولوجيا الجديدة باستخدام إطارات قادة المنتجات. حدد المشاكل، وتقييم النضج، وافهم بناء أو شراء.","en":"86 product management skills from Lenny''s Podcast for Claude Code and AI agents. Hiring, user research, strategy, shipping, and more."},"definition":{"en":"86 product management skills from Lenny''s Podcast for Claude Code and AI agents. Hiring, user research, strategy, shipping, and more."},"features":{"zh":["问题导向","成熟度评估","构建与购买","技术决策","产品领导"],"ja":["問題指向","成熟度評価","構築と購入","技術的決定","製品リーダーシップ"],"ko":["문제 지향","성숙도 평가","구축 및 구매","기술적 결정","제품 리더십"],"es":["Frameworks de evaluación de tecnologías emergentes","Análisis de madurez tecnológica","Consideración de opciones de construcción y compra","Evaluación de la viabilidad de la tecnología","Análisis de casos de uso y requisitos del negocio"],"fr":["Frameworks d''évaluation de technologies émergentes","Analyse de la maturité technologique","Considération des options de construction et d''achat","Évaluation de la viabilité de la technologie","Analyse de cas d''utilisation et d''exigences métier"],"de":["Frameworks für die Bewertung von neuen Technologien","Analyse der technologischen Reife","Berücksichtigung von Build- und Buy-Optionen","Bewertung der Machbarkeit der Technologie","Analyse von Anwendungsfällen und Geschäftsanforderungen"],"pt":["Clarifique problemas antes de discutir ferramentas","Avalie maturidade da tecnologia","Considere construir ou comprar","Use frameworks de líderes de produtos","Análise de tecnologias emergentes"],"ru":["Выявите проблемы перед обсуждением инструментов","Оцените зрелость технологии","Рассмотрите возможность построения или покупки","Используйте фреймворки лидеров продукта","Анализ новых технологий"],"ar":["حدد المشاكل قبل مناقشة الأدوات","تقييم نضج التكنولوجيا","افهم بناء أو شراء","استخدم إطارات قادة المنتجات","تحليل التكنولوجيا الجديدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["新技术评估","技术决策","产品管理","技术领导","创新","技术框架"],"ja":["新技術評価","技術的決定","製品管理","技術リーダーシップ","イノベーション","技術フレームワーク"],"ko":["신기술 평가","기술적 결정","제품 관리","기술 리더십","혁신","기술 프레임워크"],"es":["evaluación de tecnologías emergentes","frameworks de evaluación","madurez tecnológica","construcción y compra","viabilidad de la tecnología","análisis de casos de uso","requisitos del negocio","desarrollo de software","innovación tecnológica"],"fr":["évaluation de technologies émergentes","frameworks d''évaluation","maturité technologique","construction et achat","viabilité de la technologie","analyse de cas d''utilisation","exigences métier","développement de logiciels","innovation technologique"],"de":["Bewertung von neuen Technologien","Frameworks für die Bewertung","technologische Reife","Build- und Buy-Optionen","Machbarkeit der Technologie","Analyse von Anwendungsfällen","Geschäftsanforderungen","Softwareentwicklung","technologische Innovation"],"pt":["avaliação de tecnologias","tecnologias emergentes","líderes de produtos","frameworks de avaliação","desenvolvimento de produtos","inovação tecnológica"],"ru":["оценка технологий","новые технологии","лидеры продукта","фреймворки оценки","разработка продукта","технологические инновации"],"ar":["تقييم التكنولوجيا","التكنولوجيا الجديدة","قادة المنتجات","إطارات التقييم","تنمية المنتجات","الابتكارات التكنولوجية"]}},"owner":"RefoundAI","repo":"lenny-skills","repoPath":"RefoundAI/lenny-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"evaluating-new-technology","description":"Help users evaluate emerging technologies. Use when someone is assessing new tools, making build vs buy decisions, evaluating AI vendors, or deciding on technical architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Evaluating New Technology\n\nHelp the user evaluate emerging technologies using frameworks from 22 product leaders who have made critical technology decisions at companies from Google to Shopify.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help evaluating technology:\n\n1. **Start with the problem** - Clarify what problem they''re solving before discussing tools\n2. **Assess maturity** - Determine if the technology is stable enough for their use case\n3. **Consider build and buy** - Help them find the ri","body":"# Evaluating New Technology\n\nHelp the user evaluate emerging technologies using frameworks from 22 product leaders who have made critical technology decisions at companies from Google to Shopify.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help evaluating technology:\n\n1. **Start with the problem** - Clarify what problem they''re solving before discussing tools\n2. **Assess maturity** - Determine if the technology is stable enough for their use case\n3. **Consider build and buy** - Help them find the right mix rather than forcing a binary choice\n4. **Plan for change** - Design for modularity since the landscape will shift\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Tools solve problems, not the reverse\nAustin Hay: \"I have this adage I always say, which is tools are just meant to solve problems. And the problem set for marketing technologists and business technologists is you focus on the tools.\" Always define the problem and the people involved before selecting a system or tool.\n\n### Build AND buy, not build vs buy\nAustin Hay: \"Build and buy as opposed to build versus buy. Build and buy means that both of you can win.\" Buy tools to handle 90% of standard functionality and build the ''cool'' 10% that is unique to your business.\n\n### Evaluate mental bandwidth, not just dollars\nDhanji R. Prasanna: \"The savings and costs that there might be in replacing a vendor tool by something you build in-house is probably not worth it in the mental bandwidth that you''ve lost.\" Focus technical bandwidth on core competencies, not recreating vendor tools.\n\n### Update your priors constantly\nAparna Chennapragada: \"The models couldn''t do some things one year ago. My impression of it from trying it a few months ago - that prior needs to be updated. The baby just grew up to be a 15-year-old in a month.\" Re-test assumptions about what technology can do every few months.\n\n### Bet on abstraction layers\nAsha Sharma: \"You really need to bet on a platform or some app server type layer that allows you to swap things in and out and not really be beholden to any one technology.\" Invest in modularity as the AI stack evolves.\n\n### AI guardrails don''t work\nSander Schulhoff: \"AI guardrails do not work. If someone is determined enough to trick GPT-5, they''re going to deal with that guardrail. When these guardrail providers say ''We catch everything,'' that''s a complete lie.\" Be skeptical of AI security vendor claims.\n\n### Use the tools yourself\nDhanji R. Prasanna: \"I would say really try and use these tools yourself. We learn a lot about how our own workflow can change.\" Solve a specific, personal problem with new tools to understand their true strengths.\n\n### Context drives AI value\nJeanne Grosser: \"Because this whole space is so nascent, often your own esoteric context, your content, your workflow is really key to unlocking the power of the agent.\" For AI agents, building internally often beats buying.\n\n## Questions to Help Users\n\n- \"What specific problem are you trying to solve with this technology?\"\n- \"Is this technology stable enough for production, or still experimental?\"\n- \"What''s the mental bandwidth cost of building vs maintaining a vendor relationship?\"\n- \"When did you last test your assumptions about what this technology can do?\"\n- \"How will you swap this out if something better comes along?\"\n- \"Have you actually used this tool to solve a real problem yourself?\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Flag\n\n- **Tool bias** - Picking tools because you''ve used them before, not because they solve the problem\n- **Binary build vs buy thinking** - Missing the opportunity to buy 90% and build the strategic 10%\n- **Outdated priors** - Making decisions based on what technology couldn''t do six months ago\n- **Vendor lock-in** - Betting on specific tools without an abstraction layer for future flexibility\n- **Trusting security marketing** - Believing AI guardrail vendors who claim to ''catch everything''\n\n## Deep Dive\n\nFor all 27 insights from 22 guests, see `references/guest-insights.md`\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- AI Product Strategy\n- Building with LLMs\n- Platform Strategy\n- Vibe Coding\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:23:14.429Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing structured frameworks to evaluate emerging technologies","zh":"适用于需要结构化框架来评估新兴技术的AI代理，如Claude Code和AutoGPT","ja":"新興技術を評価するための構造化フレームワークを必要とするAIエージェント、たとえばClaude CodeやAutoGPTに適しています","ko":"새로운 기술을 평가하기 위한 구조화된 프레임워크가 필요한 AI 에이전트인 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan marcos estructurados para evaluar tecnologías emergentes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT ayant besoin de cadres structurés pour évaluer les technologies émergentes","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die strukturierte Rahmenbedingungen benötigen, um neue Technologien zu bewerten","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de estruturas organizadas para avaliar tecnologias emergentes","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которые нуждаются в структурированных рамках для оценки новых технологий","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تحتاج إلى إطارات منظمة لتقييم التكنولوجيا الناشئة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to assess technology maturity using frameworks from 22 product leaders, considering build and buy options, and clarifying problems before discussing tools, leveraging protocols like user research and strategy","zh":"赋予代理评估技术成熟度的能力，使用来自22位产品领导者的框架，考虑构建和购买选项，并在讨论工具之前阐明问题，利用用户研究和策略等协议","ja":"22人の製品リーダーからのフレームワークを使用して、ビルドとバイヤーオプションを考慮し、ツールを議論する前に問題を明確にし、ユーザー研究や戦略などのプロトコルを利用して技術の成熟度を評価する代理の能力を与えます","ko":"22명의 제품 리더로부터의 프레임워크를 사용하여 기술 성숙도를 평가하고, 빌드 및 구매 옵션을 고려하며, 도구를 논의하기 전에 문제를 명확히 하며, 사용자 연구 및 전략 등의 프로토콜을 활용하여 에이전트가 기술의 성숙도를 평가할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes evaluar la madurez de la tecnología utilizando marcos de 22 líderes de productos, considerando opciones de construcción y compra, y aclarando problemas antes de discutir herramientas, aprovechando protocolos como la investigación de usuarios y la estrategia","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer la maturité de la technologie en utilisant des cadres de 22 leaders de produits, en considérant les options de construction et d''achat, et en clarifiant les problèmes avant de discuter des outils, en exploitant des protocoles tels que la recherche utilisateur et la stratégie","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Reife von Technologien unter Verwendung von Rahmenbedingungen von 22 Produktleitern zu bewerten, unter Berücksichtigung von Build- und Buy-Optionen und unter Klärung von Problemen, bevor Tools diskutiert werden, unter Nutzung von Protokollen wie Benutzerforschung und Strategie","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar a maturidade da tecnologia usando estruturas de 22 líderes de produtos, considerando opções de construção e compra, e esclarecendo problemas antes de discutir ferramentas, aproveitando protocolos como pesquisa de usuário e estratégia","ru":"Позволяет агентам оценивать зрелость технологий, используя структуры 22 лидеров продуктов, учитывая варианты построения и покупки, и проясняя проблемы до обсуждения инструментов, используя протоколы, такие как исследование пользователей и стратегия","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تقييم نضج التكنولوجيا باستخدام إطارات من 22 قائدًا للمنتجات، مع مراعاة خيارات البناء والشراء، و توضيح المشاكل قبل مناقشة الأدوات، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل بحث المستخدم والстрاتيجية"},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing stability of emerging technologies","Evaluating build vs buy options for new tools","Clarifying problems before implementing new technologies"],"zh":["评估新兴技术的稳定性","评估新工具的构建与购买选项","在实施新技术之前阐明问题"],"ja":["新興技術の安定性を評価する","新しいツールのビルドとバイヤーオプションを評価する","新しい技術を実施する前に問題を明確にする"],"ko":["새로운 기술의 안정성을 평가한다","새로운 도구의 빌드 및 구매 옵션을 평가한다","새로운 기술을 구현하기 전에 문제를 명확히 한다"],"es":["Evaluar la estabilidad de las tecnologías emergentes","Evaluar opciones de construcción frente a opciones de compra para nuevas herramientas","Aclarar problemas antes de implementar nuevas tecnologías"],"fr":["Évaluer la stabilité des technologies émergentes","Évaluer les options de construction par rapport aux options d''achat pour de nouveaux outils","Clarifier les problèmes avant de mettre en œuvre de nouvelles technologies"],"de":["Bewerten der Stabilität von neuen Technologien","Bewerten von Build- gegenüber Buy-Optionen für neue Tools","Klärung von Problemen, bevor neue Technologien implementiert werden"],"pt":["Avaliar a estabilidade de tecnologias emergentes","Avaliar opções de construção versus compra para novas ferramentas","Esclarecer problemas antes de implementar novas tecnologias"],"ru":["Оценка стабильности новых технологий","Оценка вариантов построения и покупки для новых инструментов","Выявление проблем до реализации новых технологий"],"ar":["تقييم استقرار التكنولوجيا الناشئة","تقييم خيارات البناء مقابل الشراء لأدوات جديدة","توضيح المشاكل قبل تنفيذ التكنولوجيا الجديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input on specific problems to solve","Limited to frameworks from 22 product leaders"],"zh":["需要用户输入特定的问题来解决","仅限于来自22位产品领导者的框架"],"ja":["特定の問題を解決するためにユーザー入力を必要とする","22人の製品リーダーからのフレームワークのみに限定される"],"ko":["特정 문제를 해결하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요하다","22명의 제품 리더로부터의 프레임워크로만 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario sobre problemas específicos para resolver","Limitado a marcos de 22 líderes de productos"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur sur des problèmes spécifiques à résoudre","Limité à des cadres de 22 leaders de produits"],"de":["Benutzerinput zu spezifischen Problemen erforderlich, um sie zu lösen","Begrenzt auf Rahmenbedingungen von 22 Produktleitern"],"pt":["Exige entrada do usuário sobre problemas específicos para resolver","Limitado a estruturas de 22 líderes de produtos"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя о конкретных проблемах для решения","Ограничен структурами 22 лидеров продуктов"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم بشأن مشاكل محددة لحلها","محدود بإطارات 22 قائدًا للمنتجات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jellydn/my-ai-tools/handoffs', 'community', 'jellydn', 'my-ai-tools', 'jellydn/my-ai-tools', 'handoffs', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z', '2026-02-18T07:23:14.972Z', NULL, '{"id":"jellydn/my-ai-tools/handoffs","name":"handoffs","description":{"zh":"Handoffs 技术提供全面配置管理，支持多种 AI 编码工具和自定义设置，提高开发效率","ja":"Handoffs 技術は、包括的な設定管理を提供し、複数の AI コーディングツールとカスタム設定をサポートして開発効率を向上させる","ko":"Handoffs 기술은 종합적인 설정 관리를 제공하며 여러 AI 코딩 도구 및 사용자 정의 설정을 지원하여 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Handoffs es una herramienta de configuración de herramientas de codificación AI que permite replicar tu configuración completa","fr":"Handoffs est un outil de configuration d''outils de codage AI qui permet de répliquer votre configuration complète","de":"Handoffs ist ein Tool zur Konfiguration von AI-Codierungstools, mit dem Sie Ihre gesamte Konfiguration replizieren können","pt":"Handoffs é uma solução de gerenciamento de configuração para ferramentas de codificação AI, permitindo a replicação de configurações personalizadas.","ru":"Handoffs - это решение для управления конфигурацией для инструментов кодирования ИИ, позволяющее реплицировать пользовательские конфигурации.","ar":"هاندوفز هو حل لإدارة التكوين لأدوات الترميز الذكية، مما يسمح بالتكرار التكوين المخصص.","en":"Comprehensive configuration management for AI coding tools - Replicate my complete setup for Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex and Claude Code Switch with custom configurations, MCP servers, plugins, and commands."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Handoffs 技术：AI 编码工具配置管理","ja":"Handoffs 技術：AI コーディングツールの設定管理","ko":"Handoffs 기술: AI 코딩 도구 설정 관리","es":"Handoffs: Configuración de herramientas de codificación AI","fr":"Handoffs : Configuration des outils de codage AI","de":"Handoffs: Konfiguration von AI-Codierungstools","pt":"Handoffs: Gerenciamento de Configuração para Ferramentas ...","ru":"Handoffs: Управление конфигурацией для инструментов кодир...","ar":"هاندوفز: إدارة التكوين لأدوات الترميز الذكية","en":"handoffs"},"description":{"zh":"Handoffs 技术提供全面配置管理，支持多种 AI 编码工具和自定义设置，提高开发效率","ja":"Handoffs 技術は、包括的な設定管理を提供し、複数の AI コーディングツールとカスタム設定をサポートして開発効率を向上させる","ko":"Handoffs 기술은 종합적인 설정 관리를 제공하며 여러 AI 코딩 도구 및 사용자 정의 설정을 지원하여 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Handoffs es una herramienta de configuración de herramientas de codificación AI que permite replicar tu configuración completa","fr":"Handoffs est un outil de configuration d''outils de codage AI qui permet de répliquer votre configuration complète","de":"Handoffs ist ein Tool zur Konfiguration von AI-Codierungstools, mit dem Sie Ihre gesamte Konfiguration replizieren können","pt":"Handoffs é uma solução de gerenciamento de configuração para ferramentas de codificação AI, permitindo a replicação de configurações personalizadas.","ru":"Handoffs - это решение для управления конфигурацией для инструментов кодирования ИИ, позволяющее реплицировать пользовательские конфигурации.","ar":"هاندوفز هو حل لإدارة التكوين لأدوات الترميز الذكية، مما يسمح بالتكرار التكوين المخصص.","en":"Comprehensive configuration management for AI coding tools - Replicate my complete setup for Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex and Claude Code Switch with cu..."},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive configuration management for AI coding tools - Replicate my complete setup for Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex and Claude Code Switch with custom configurations, MCP servers, plugins, and commands."},"features":{"zh":["支持多种 AI 编码工具","自定义配置和设置","MCP 服务器和插件支持","命令和脚本管理","会话转接和继续工作"],"ja":["複数の AI コーディングツールをサポート","カスタム設定と設定","MCP サーバーとプラグインのサポート","コマンドとスクリプト管理","セッションのハンドオフと作業の続行"],"ko":["여러 AI 코딩 도구 지원","사용자 정의 설정 및 구성","MCP 서버 및 플러그인 지원","명령 및 스크립트 관리","세션 핸드오버 및 작업 연속"],"es":["Configuración completa de herramientas de codificación AI","Replicación de configuraciones personalizadas","Compatibilidad con Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex y Claude Code Switch","Soporte para servidores MCP, plugins y comandos","Creación de un plan de handoff detallado"],"fr":["Configuration complète des outils de codage AI","Réplication de configurations personnalisées","Compatibilité avec Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex et Claude Code Switch","Prise en charge des serveurs MCP, des plugins et des commandes","Création d''un plan de handoff détaillé"],"de":["Vollständige Konfiguration von AI-Codierungstools","Replikation von benutzerdefinierten Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex und Claude Code Switch","Unterstützung für MCP-Server, Plugins und Befehle","Erstellung eines detaillierten Handoff-Plans"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de configuração para ferramentas de codificação AI","Replicação de configurações personalizadas","Suporte a Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex e Claude Code Switch","Configurações personalizadas para MCP servers, plugins e comandos","Criação de planos de handoff para continuar o trabalho em novas sessões"],"ru":["Управление конфигурацией для инструментов кодирования ИИ","Репликация пользовательских конфигураций","Поддержка Claude Code, OpenCode, Amp, Codex и Claude Code Switch","Пользовательские конфигурации для MCP servers, plugins и команд","Создание планов handoff для продолжения работы в новых сессиях"],"ar":["إدارة التكوين لأدوات الترميز الذكية","تكرار التكوين المخصص","دعم Claude Code و OpenCode و Amp و Codex و Claude Code Switch","التكوين المخصص للمخدمات MCP و الإضافات والأوامر","إنشاء خطط هاندوفز لمواصلة العمل في جلسات جديدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Handoffs","AI 编码工具","配置管理","自定义设置","MCP 服务器","插件","命令","会话转接"],"ja":["Handoffs","AI コーディングツール","設定管理","カスタム設定","MCP サーバー","プラグイン","コマンド","セッションのハンドオフ"],"ko":["Handoffs","AI 코딩 도구","설정 관리","사용자 정의 설정","MCP 서버","플러그인","명령","세션 핸드오버"],"es":["handoffs","herramientas de codificación AI","configuración de herramientas de codificación","replicación de configuraciones","Claude Code","OpenCode","Amp","Codex","Claude Code Switch"],"fr":["handoffs","outils de codage AI","configuration d''outils de codage","réplication de configurations","Claude Code","OpenCode","Amp","Codex","Claude Code Switch"],"de":["handoffs","AI-Codierungstools","Konfiguration von AI-Codierungstools","Replikation von Konfigurationen","Claude Code","OpenCode","Amp","Codex","Claude Code Switch"],"pt":["handoffs","gerenciamento de configuração","ferramentas de codificação AI","Claude Code","OpenCode","Amp","Codex","MCP servers","plugins","comandos"],"ru":["handoffs","управление конфигурацией","инструменты кодирования ИИ","Claude Code","OpenCode","Amp","Codex","MCP servers","плагины","команды"],"ar":["هاندوفز","إدارة التكوين","أدوات الترميز الذكية","Claude Code","OpenCode","Amp","Codex","مخدمات MCP","الإضافات","الأوامر"]}},"owner":"jellydn","repo":"my-ai-tools","repoPath":"jellydn/my-ai-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"handoffs","description":"Creates detailed handoff plans of conversations for continuing work in new sessions","bodyPreview":"# Session Handoff Plan\n\nCreates a detailed handoff plan of the conversation for continuing the work in a new session.\n\nThe user specified purpose:\n\n<purpose>$ARGUMENTS</purpose>\n\nYou are creating a summary specifically so that it can be continued by another agent. For this to work you MUST have a purpose. If no specified purpose was provided in the `<purpose>...</purpose>` tag you must STOP IMMEDIATELY and ask the user what the purpose is.\n\nDo not continue before asking for the purpose as you wi","body":"# Session Handoff Plan\n\nCreates a detailed handoff plan of the conversation for continuing the work in a new session.\n\nThe user specified purpose:\n\n<purpose>$ARGUMENTS</purpose>\n\nYou are creating a summary specifically so that it can be continued by another agent. For this to work you MUST have a purpose. If no specified purpose was provided in the `<purpose>...</purpose>` tag you must STOP IMMEDIATELY and ask the user what the purpose is.\n\nDo not continue before asking for the purpose as you will otherwise not understand the instructions and do not assume a purpose!\n\n## Goal\n\nCreate a detailed summary of the conversation so far, paying close attention to the user''s explicit purpose for the next steps.\nThis handoff plan should be thorough in capturing technical details, code patterns, and architectural decisions that will be essential for continuing development work without losing context.\n\n## Process\n\nBefore providing your final plan, wrap your analysis in <analysis> tags to organize your thoughts and ensure you''ve covered all necessary points:\n\n1. Chronologically analyze each message and section of the conversation. For each section thoroughly identify:\n   - The user''s explicit requests and intents\n   - Your approach to addressing the user''s requests\n   - Key decisions, technical concepts and code patterns\n   - Specific details like file names, full code snippets, function signatures, file edits, etc\n2. Double-check for technical accuracy and completeness, addressing each required element thoroughly.\n\nYour plan should include the following sections:\n\n1. **Primary Request and Intent**: Capture all of the user''s explicit requests and intents in detail\n2. **Key Technical Concepts**: List all important technical concepts, technologies, and frameworks discussed.\n3. **Files and Code Sections**: Enumerate specific files and code sections examined, modified, or created. Pay special attention to the most recent messages and include full code snippets where applicable and include a summary of why this file read or edit is important.\n4. **Problem Solving**: Document problems solved and any ongoing troubleshooting efforts.\n5. **Pending Tasks**: Outline any pending tasks that you have explicitly been asked to work on.\n6. **Current Work**: Describe in detail precisely what was being worked on immediately before this handoff request, paying special attention to the most recent messages from both user and assistant. Include file names and code snippets where applicable.\n7. **Next Step**: List the next step that you will take that is related to the most recent work you were doing. IMPORTANT: ensure that this step is DIRECTLY in line with the user''s explicit requests, and the task you were working on immediately before this handoff request. If your last task was concluded, then only list next steps if they are explicitly in line with the users request. Do not start on tangential requests without confirming with the user first. Include this section only if there is an actionable next step.\n\nAdditionally create a \"slug\" for this handoff. The \"slug\" is how we will refer to it later in a few places. Examples:\n\n- current-user-api-handler\n- implement-auth\n- fix-issue-42\n\nTogether with the slug create a \"Readable Summary\". Examples:\n\n- Implement Current User API Handler\n- Implement Authentication\n- Fix Issue #42\n\n## Output Structure\n\nFirst, show your analysis to the user in `<analysis>` tags as part of your response.\n\nThen write the handoff file with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Session Handoff Plan\n\n## 1. Primary Request and Intent\n\n[Detailed description of all user requests and intents]\n\n## 2. Key Technical Concepts\n\n- [Concept 1]\n- [Concept 2]\n- [...]\n\n## 3. Files and Code Sections\n\n### [File Name 1]\n\n- **Why important**: [Summary of why this file is important]\n- **Changes made**: [Summary of the changes made to this file, if any]\n- **Code snippet**:\n\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Important Code Snippet]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### [File Name 2]\n\n- **Code snippet**:\n\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Important Code Snippet]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n[...]\n\n## 4. Problem Solving\n\n[Description of solved problems and ongoing troubleshooting]\n\n## 5. Pending Tasks\n\n- [Task 1 that you have been explicitly asked to work on]\n- [Task 2 that you have been explicitly asked to work on]\n- [...]\n\n## 6. Current Work\n\n[Detailed description of what was being worked on immediately before this handoff, including file names and code snippets]\n\n## 7. Next Step\n\n[Next step to take, directly aligned with user''s explicit handoff purpose. Only include if there is an actionable next step.]\n```\n\n## Final Step\n\nAfter providing your analysis and summary:\n\n1. Ensure the `.claude/handoffs/` directory exists (create it if needed)\n2. Write the handoff summary to a markdown file at `.claude/handoffs/[timestamp]-[slug].md` where [timestamp] is the current date in format YYYY-MM-DD and the slug is what we defined before\n3. Tell the user about this file and that they can use `/pickup $1` to continue where $1 is the filename\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:23:14.972Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain requiring seamless conversation handoffs and comprehensive configuration management.","zh":"适用于Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain等高级AI代理，需要无缝对话交接和全面配置管理。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの高度なAIエージェントに適しており、無駄のない会話の手渡しと包括的な設定管理が必要です。","ko":"클라우드 코드, 오토지피티, 랭체인 등 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 무결점 대화 인계와 종합적인 구성 관리가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren una entrega de conversación sin problemas y una gestión de configuración integral.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de IA avancés comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des transferts de conversation sans heurts et une gestion de configuration complète.","de":"Ideal für fortgeschrittene KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine nahtlose Konversationsübergabe und eine umfassende Konfigurationsverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que requerem transferências de conversa sem interrupções e gerenciamento de configuração abrangente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих бесперебойной передачи разговоров и всестороннего управления конфигурацией.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات الوكيل الذكي المتقدمة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب عمليات إنهاء محادثة بدون انقطاع وإدارة تكوين شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create detailed session handoff plans with custom configurations, MCP servers, plugins, and commands, utilizing protocols and tags like `<purpose>...</purpose>` for efficient continuation of work in new sessions.","zh":"赋予代理创建详细会话交接计划的能力，具有自定义配置、MCP服务器、插件和命令，利用协议和标签（如`<purpose>...</purpose>`）实现新的会话中工作的高效继续。","ja":"エージェントが詳細なセッションハンドオフプランを作成する能力を付与し、カスタム構成、MCPサーバー、プラグイン、コマンドを使用し、`<purpose>...</purpose>`などのプロトコルとタグを利用して、新しいセッションでの作業の効率的な継続を実現します。","ko":"세부적인 세션 인계 계획을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여, 사용자 정의 구성, MCP 서버, 플러그인, 명령어를 사용하고, `<purpose>...</purpose>`와 같은 프로토콜과 태그를 활용하여 새로운 세션에서 작업을 효율적으로 계속할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear planes de entrega de sesión detallados con configuraciones personalizadas, servidores MCP, complementos y comandos, utilizando protocolos y etiquetas como `<purpose>...</purpose>` para una continuación eficiente del trabajo en nuevas sesiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans de transfert de session détaillés avec des configurations personnalisées, des serveurs MCP, des plug-ins et des commandes, en utilisant des protocoles et des balises comme `<purpose>...</purpose>` pour une continuation efficace du travail dans de nouvelles sessions.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, detaillierte Sitzungsübergabepläne mit benutzerdefinierten Konfigurationen, MCP-Servern, Plug-ins und Befehlen zu erstellen, indem Protokolle und Tags wie `<purpose>...</purpose>` für eine effiziente Fortsetzung der Arbeit in neuen Sitzungen verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar planos de transferência de sessão detalhados com configurações personalizadas, servidores MCP, plug-ins e comandos, utilizando protocolos e etiquetas como `<purpose>...</purpose>` para continuação eficiente do trabalho em novas sessões.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать подробные планы передачи сеанса с настраиваемыми конфигурациями, серверами MCP, плагинами и командами, используя протоколы и теги, такие как `<purpose>...</purpose>`, для эффективного продолжения работы в новых сеансах.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء خطط إنهاء جلسة مفصلة مع تكوينات مخصصة وخادوم MCP وإضافة البرامج وأوامر باستخدام بروتوكولات وسُمات مثل `<purpose>...</purpose>` من أجل الاستمرار الفعال في العمل في جلسات جديدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of detailed handoff plans for complex projects","Generating custom configurations for AI coding tools like OpenCode and Codex","Debugging issues with MCP servers and plugins using comprehensive logs"],"zh":["自动创建复杂项目的详细交接计划","为OpenCode和Codex等AI编码工具生成自定义配置","使用综合日志调试MCP服务器和插件的问题"],"ja":["複雑なプロジェクトの詳細なハンドオフプランを作成する自動化","OpenCodeやCodexなどのAIコーディングツールのためのカスタム構成を生成する","包括的なログを使用してMCPサーバーとプラグインの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["복잡한 프로젝트의 세부적인 인계 계획을 자동으로 생성하는 것","오픈코드와 코덱스 등의 AI 코딩 도구를 위한 사용자 정의 구성 생성","종합 로그를 사용하여 MCP 서버와 플러그인의 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de planes de entrega detallados para proyectos complejos","Generar configuraciones personalizadas para herramientas de codificación de IA como OpenCode y Codex","Depurar problemas con servidores MCP y complementos utilizando registros integrales"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de plans de transfert détaillés pour des projets complexes","Générer des configurations personnalisées pour des outils de codage de IA comme OpenCode et Codex","Déboguer des problèmes avec des serveurs MCP et des plug-ins en utilisant des journaux complets"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung detaillierter Übergabepläne für komplexe Projekte","Generieren von benutzerdefinierten Konfigurationen für KI-Coding-Tools wie OpenCode und Codex","Fehlerbehebung bei MCP-Servern und Plug-ins mithilfe umfassender Protokolle"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de planos de transferência detalhados para projetos complexos","Gerar configurações personalizadas para ferramentas de codificação de IA como OpenCode e Codex","Depurar problemas com servidores MCP e plug-ins usando logs abrangentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание подробных планов передачи для сложных проектов","Генерировать настраиваемые конфигурации для инструментов кодирования ИИ, таких как OpenCode и Codex","Отлаживать проблемы с серверами MCP и плагинами, используя всесторонние журналы"],"ar":["تحويل processo Automatizar إنشاء خطط إنهاء مفصلة للمشاريع المعقدة","إنشاء تكوينات مخصصة لأدوات برمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل OpenCode و Codex","تصحيح الأعطال في خادوم MCP وإضافة البرامج باستخدام سجلات شاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a specified purpose in the `<purpose>...</purpose>` tag to function","Must be used in conjunction with compatible AI coding tools and servers"],"zh":["需要在`<purpose>...</purpose>`标签中指定目的才能正常功能","必须与兼容的AI编码工具和服务器一起使用"],"ja":["`<purpose>...</purpose>`タグに目的を指定する必要がある","互換性のあるAIコーディングツールとサーバーとともに使用する必要がある"],"ko":["`<purpose>...</purpose>` 태그에 목적을 지정해야만 기능할 수 있음","호환되는 AI 코딩 도구와 서버와 함께 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un propósito especificado en la etiqueta `<purpose>...</purpose>` para funcionar","Debe utilizarse en conjunción con herramientas de codificación de IA y servidores compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un objectif spécifié dans la balise `<purpose>...</purpose>` pour fonctionner","Doit être utilisé en conjonction avec des outils de codage de IA et des serveurs compatibles"],"de":["Benötigt einen angegebenen Zweck in der `<purpose>...</purpose>`-Tag, um zu funktionieren","Muss in Verbindung mit kompatiblen KI-Coding-Tools und -Servern verwendet werden"],"pt":["Requer um propósito especificado na etiqueta `<purpose>...</purpose>` para funcionar","Deve ser usado em conjunto com ferramentas de codificação de IA e servidores compatíveis"],"ru":["Требует указания цели в теге `<purpose>...</purpose>`, чтобы функционировать","Должен использоваться в сочетании с совместимыми инструментами кодир