ón de sandbox"],"fr":["Gestion des environnements de commerce électronique","Création et suppression de sandbox","Utilisation du plugin de CLI","Compatibilité avec Salesforce Commerce Cloud","Sécurité et contrôle dans la gestion des sandbox"],"de":["Verwaltung von E-Commerce-Umgebungen","Erstellung und Löschung von Sandbox","Verwendung des CLI-Plugins","Kompatibilität mit Salesforce Commerce Cloud","Sicherheit und Kontrolle bei der Verwaltung von Sandbox"],"pt":["Crie e exclua sandboxes da Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","Use o plugin CLI do B2C para gerenciar sandboxes","Confirme ações destrutivas antes de executá-las","Use o prefixo ''ods'' para comandos de sandbox","Instale o plugin CLI do B2C globalmente ou use ''npx'' para executá-lo"],"ru":["Создавайте и удаляйте песочницы Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","Используйте плагин CLI B2C для управления песочницами","Подтверждайте разрушительные действия перед их выполнением","Используйте префикс ''ods'' для команд песочницы","Установите плагин CLI B2C глобально или используйте ''npx'' для его выполнения"],"ar":["أنشئ وحذف بيئات الاختبار الخاصة بSalesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","استخدم ملحق CLI B2C لإدارة بيئات الاختبار","أكد الإجراءات التدميرية قبل تنفيذها","استخدم بادئة ''ods'' للأوامر الخاصة ببيئة الاختبار","ثبت ملحق CLI B2C على مستوى العالم أو استخدم ''npx'' لتشغيله"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce B2C Commerce","On-demand沙盒","b2c-sandbox","CLI插件","沙盒管理","npx @salesforce/b2c-cli"],"ja":["Salesforce B2Cコマース","オンデマンドサンドボックス","b2c-sandbox","CLIプラグイン","サンドボックス管理","npx @salesforce/b2c-cli"],"ko":["Salesforce B2C 커머스","온디맨드 샌드박스","b2c-sandbox","CLI 플러그인","샌드박스 관리","npx @salesforce/b2c-cli"],"es":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce Commerce Cloud","gestión de entornos de comercio electrónico","creación de sandbox","eliminación de sandbox","plugin de CLI","seguridad en la gestión de sandbox"],"fr":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce Commerce Cloud","gestion des environnements de commerce électronique","création de sandbox","suppression de sandbox","plugin de CLI","sécurité dans la gestion des sandbox"],"de":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce Commerce Cloud","Verwaltung von E-Commerce-Umgebungen","Erstellung von Sandbox","Löschung von Sandbox","CLI-Plugin","Sicherheit bei der Verwaltung von Sandbox"],"pt":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","Desenvolvimento de software","Gerenciamento de ambientes de teste","CLI B2C","Plugin CLI","npx","Salesforce Development"],"ru":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","Разработка программного обеспечения","Управление тестовыми средами","CLI B2C","Плагин CLI","npx","Salesforce разработка"],"ar":["B2C Sandbox","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة بيئات الاختبار","CLI B2C","ملحق CLI","npx","تطوير Salesforce"]}},"owner":"SalesforceCommerceCloud","repo":"b2c-developer-tooling","repoPath":"SalesforceCommerceCloud/b2c-developer-tooling","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"b2c-sandbox","description":"Create and manage (B2C/SFCC/Demandware) on-demand sandboxes (ODS) with the b2c cli. Always reference when using the CLI to create, start, stop, restart, delete, or list on-demand sandboxes (ODS) and development instances.","bodyPreview":"# B2C Sandbox Skill\n\nOnly create or delete sandboxes when explicitly requested. Always confirm destructive actions.\n\nUse the `b2c` CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS). Only create or delete a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable or destructible action.\n\n> **Tip:** If `b2c` is not installed globally, use `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` instead (e.g., `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli sandbox list`).\n\n> **Alias:** The `ods` prefix is still supported as a backwa","body":"# B2C Sandbox Skill\n\nOnly create or delete sandboxes when explicitly requested. Always confirm destructive actions.\n\nUse the `b2c` CLI plugin to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS). Only create or delete a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable or destructible action.\n\n> **Tip:** If `b2c` is not installed globally, use `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` instead (e.g., `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli sandbox list`).\n\n> **Alias:** The `ods` prefix is still supported as a backward-compatible alias (e.g., `b2c ods list` works the same as `b2c sandbox list`).\n\n## Sandbox ID Formats\n\nCommands that operate on a specific sandbox accept two ID formats:\n\n- **UUID**: The full sandbox UUID (e.g., `abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789`)\n- **Realm-instance**: The realm-instance format (e.g., `zzzv-123` or `zzzv_123`)\n\nThe realm-instance format uses the 4-character realm code followed by a dash or underscore and the instance number. When using a realm-instance format, the CLI will automatically look up the corresponding UUID.\n\n## Examples\n\n### List Sandboxes\n\n```bash\nb2c sandbox list\n\n# for realm zzpq with JSON output\nb2c sandbox list --realm zzpq --json\n\n# filter by status and those created by a specific user, only print the columns id,state,hostname\nb2c sandbox list --filter-params ''state=started,creating&createdBy=clavery@salesforce.com'' --realm zzpq --columns id,state,hostname\n```\n\n### Create Sandbox\n\nOnly create a sandbox if explicitly asked as this may be a billable action.\n\n```bash\n# create in realm zzpq with 4 hour TTL (0 = infinite); json output and wait for completion (this may take 5-10 minutes; timeout is 10 minutes)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --ttl 4 --json --wait\n\n# create in realm zzpq with large profile (medium is default)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --profile large\n\n# create without automatic OCAPI/WebDAV permissions\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --no-set-permissions\n\n# use a different client ID for default permissions\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --permissions-client-id my-other-client\n\n# custom OCAPI settings (replaces defaults)\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --ocapi-settings ''[{\"client_id\":\"my-client\",\"resources\":[{\"resource_id\":\"/code_versions\",\"methods\":[\"get\"]}]}]''\n\n# with start/stop scheduler\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --start-scheduler ''{\"weekdays\":[\"MONDAY\",\"TUESDAY\"],\"time\":\"08:00:00Z\"}'' --stop-scheduler ''{\"weekdays\":[\"MONDAY\",\"TUESDAY\"],\"time\":\"19:00:00Z\"}''\n\n# get full log trace output to debug\nb2c sandbox create --realm zzpq --log-level trace\n```\n\n### Get/Start/Stop/Restart/Delete Sandbox\n\nCommands that operate on a specific sandbox support both UUID and realm-instance formats:\n\n```bash\n# Using UUID\nb2c sandbox get abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\nb2c sandbox start abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\nb2c sandbox stop abc12345-1234-1234-1234-abc123456789\n\n# Using realm-instance format\nb2c sandbox get zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox start zzzv_123\nb2c sandbox stop zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox restart zzzv-123\nb2c sandbox delete zzzv-123 --force\n```\n\n### More Commands\n\nSee `b2c sandbox --help` for a full list of available commands and options in the `sandbox` topic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:23:44.762Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Salesforce-focused Agents needing streamlined B2C Commerce On-demand sandbox management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化B2C Commerce On-demand沙箱管理的Salesforce专注代理。","ja":"Salesforceに焦点を当てたエージェントがB2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックスの管理を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"B2C 커머스 온디맨드 샌드박스 관리를 간소화해야 하는 Salesforce 중심 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en Salesforce que necesitan una gestión de sandbox de comercio B2C On-demand optimizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur Salesforce ayant besoin d''une gestion de sandbox de commerce B2C On-demand rationalisée.","de":"Perfekt für Salesforce-fokussierte Agenten, die eine optimierte Verwaltung von B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados no Salesforce que precisam de gerenciamento de sandbox de comércio B2C sob demanda simplificado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на Salesforce, которым требуется упрощенное управление sandbox для коммерции B2C по требованию.","ar":"مثالي لعمال الإعلام الذين يركزون على Salesforce و الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة صندوق رمل التجارة إلكترونية B2C عند الطلب المبسّط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS) using the `b2c` CLI plugin, confirming destructive actions and supporting billable operations through `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` for sandbox creation, deletion, and listing.","zh":"启用代理使用`b2c` CLI插件管理Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand沙箱（ODS），确认破坏性操作，并通过`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`支持可计费操作，用于沙箱创建、删除和列出。","ja":"エージェントが`b2c` CLIプラグインを使用してSalesforce B2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックス（ODS）を管理できるようにし、破壊的なアクションを確認し、`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`を介して請求可能な操作をサポートし、サンドボックスの作成、削除、リスト作成を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 `b2c` CLI 플러그인을 사용하여 Salesforce B2C 커머스 온디맨드 샌드박스(ODS)를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 파괴적인 작업을 확인하고 `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`를 통해 청구 가능한 작업을 지원하여 샌드박스 생성, 삭제 및 목록을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar sandbox de comercio B2C On-demand de Salesforce (ODS) utilizando el plugin de CLI `b2c`, confirmar acciones destructivas y admitir operaciones facturables a través de `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` para la creación, eliminación y enumeración de sandbox.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les sandbox de commerce B2C On-demand de Salesforce (ODS) en utilisant le plugin de CLI `b2c`, confirmant les actions destructrices et prenant en charge les opérations facturables via `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` pour la création, la suppression et la liste des sandbox.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxen (ODS) mithilfe des `b2c`-CLI-Plugins zu verwalten, zerstörerische Aktionen zu bestätigen und abrechnungsfähige Operationen über `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` für die Erstellung, Löschung und Auflistung von Sandboxen zu unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar sandboxes de comércio B2C do Salesforce sob demanda (ODS) usando o plug-in da CLI `b2c`, confirmando ações destrutivas e suportando operações cobráveis por meio de `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` para criação, exclusão e listagem de sandboxes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять sandbox для коммерции B2C Salesforce по требованию (ODS) с помощью плагина CLI `b2c`, подтверждая разрушительные действия и поддерживая платные операции через `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` для создания, удаления и перечисления песочниц.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة صندوق رمل للتجارة إلكترونية B2C على Salesforce عند الطلب (ODS) باستخدام مكون إضافي CLI `b2c` ، CONFIRMACTIONS-destructive الإجراءات ودعم العمليات القابلة للتسوية من خلال `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli` لإنشاء وحذف وlisting من الرمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS) for testing and development","Deleting unused sandboxes to manage resources and costs","Listing available sandboxes for organization and tracking"],"zh":["为测试和开发创建新的B2C Commerce On-demand沙箱（ODS）","删除未使用的沙箱以管理资源和成本","列出可用的沙箱以进行组织和跟踪"],"ja":["テストと開発のために新しいB2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックス（ODS）を作成する","使用されていないサンドボックスを削除してリソースとコストを管理する","利用可能なサンドボックスをリストして組織と追跡を行う"],"ko":["테스트 및 개발을 위해 새로운 B2C 커머스 온디맨드 샌드박스(ODS) 생성","리소스 및 비용 관리를 위해 사용되지 않는 샌드박스 삭제","조직 및 추적을 위해 사용 가능한 샌드박스 목록"],"es":["Crear nuevos sandbox de comercio B2C On-demand (ODS) para pruebas y desarrollo","Eliminar sandbox no utilizados para gestionar recursos y costos","Enumerar sandbox disponibles para organización y seguimiento"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux sandbox de commerce B2C On-demand (ODS) pour les tests et le développement","Supprimer les sandbox inutilisés pour gérer les ressources et les coûts","Lister les sandbox disponibles pour l''organisation et le suivi"],"de":["Erstellen neuer B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxen (ODS) für Tests und Entwicklung","Löschen nicht genutzter Sandboxen, um Ressourcen und Kosten zu verwalten","Auflisten verfügbarer Sandboxen für Organisation und Nachverfolgung"],"pt":["Criar novos sandboxes de comércio B2C sob demanda (ODS) para testes e desenvolvimento","Excluir sandboxes não utilizados para gerenciar recursos e custos","Listar sandboxes disponíveis para organização e acompanhamento"],"ru":["Создание новых sandbox для коммерции B2C по требованию (ODS) для тестирования и разработки","Удаление неиспользуемых песочниц для управления ресурсами и затратами","Перечисление доступных песочниц для организации и отслеживания"],"ar":["إنشاء沙ات جديدة للتجارة إلكترونية B2C عند الطلب (ODS) للاختبار والتنمية","حذف الرمل غير المستخدمة لإدارة الموارد والتكاليف","قائمة الرمل المتاحة للتنظيم والتتبع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit user request for sandbox creation or deletion","Supports Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand sandboxes (ODS) only","Needs `b2c` CLI plugin installed or accessible via `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`"],"zh":["需要明确的用户请求用于沙箱创建或删除","仅支持Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand沙箱（ODS）","需要安装`b2c` CLI插件或通过`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`访问"],"ja":["サンドボックスの作成または削除に明示的なユーザー要求が必要","Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demandサンドボックス（ODS）のみをサポート","`b2c` CLIプラグインをインストールするか、`npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`経由でアクセスする必要がある"],"ko":["샌드박스 생성 또는 삭제를 위해 명시적인 사용자 요청이 필요","Salesforce B2C 커머스 온디맨드 샌드박스(ODS)만 지원","`b2c` CLI 플러그인이 설치되거나 `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`를 통해 액세스 가능해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una solicitud explícita del usuario para la creación o eliminación de sandbox","Admite solo sandbox de comercio B2C On-demand de Salesforce (ODS)","Necesita el plugin de CLI `b2c` instalado o accesible a través de `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`"],"fr":["Nécessite une demande explicite de l''utilisateur pour la création ou la suppression de sandbox","Prend en charge uniquement les sandbox de commerce B2C On-demand de Salesforce (ODS)","Nécessite le plugin de CLI `b2c` installé ou accessible via `npx @salesforce/b2c-cli`"],"de":["Benötigt eine explizite Benutzeranfrage für die Erstellung oder Löschung von Sandboxen","Unterstützt nur Salesforce B2C Commerce On-demand-Sandboxen (ODS)","Benötigt das `b2c`-CLI-Plugin installier