 von unnötigen Neurendern","Verbesserung der Recheneffizienz","Reduzierung der Renderkomplexität"],"pt":["Evite re-renderizações desnecessárias","Otimização de listas e cálculos","Uso de memoização para melhorar o desempenho","Técnicas de otimização de renderização","Melhoria da eficiência do aplicativo"],"ru":["Избегайте ненужных перерисовок","Оптимизация списков и вычислений","Использование мемоизации для улучшения производительности","Техники оптимизации рендеринга","Улучшение эффективности приложения"],"ar":["تجنب إعادة التصيير غير الضرورية","تحسين القوائم والحسابات","استخدام التخزين المؤقت لتحسين الأداء","تقنيات تحسين التصيير","تحسين الفعالية للتطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React性能优化","渲染行为","重新渲染","列表优化","昂贵的计算","memoization","React应用性能"],"ja":["Reactパフォーマンス最適化","描画動作","再描画","リスト最適化","コストのかかる計算","メモ化","Reactアプリケーションパフォーマンス"],"ko":["리액트 성능 최적화","렌더링 행동","재렌더링","목록 최적화","비싼 계산","메모이제이션","리액트 애플리케이션 성능"],"es":["rendimiento de React","memoización","optimización de listas","react performance","mejora de rendimiento","desempeño de aplicaciones"],"fr":["performances de React","mémoïsation","optimisation des listes","react performance","amélioration des performances","rendement des applications"],"de":["React-Leistung","Memoisierung","Listoptimierung","react performance","Leistungsverbesserung","Anwendungsleistung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho do react","react performance","desempenho do react","otimização de renderização","memoização","técnicas de otimização"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности react","react производительность","производительность react","оптимизация рендеринга","мемоизация","техники оптимизации"],"ar":["تحسين أداء رياكت","رياكت أداء","أداء رياكت","تحسين التصيير","التخزين المؤقت","تقنيات تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-performance","description":"Performance optimization for React web applications. Use when optimizing renders, implementing virtualization, memoizing components, or debugging performance issues.","bodyPreview":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a,","body":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)\n    .slice(0, 100);\n}, [items]);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Recalculates every render\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = items\n  .filter(item => item.active)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Memoizing simple access (overhead > benefit)\nconst userName = useMemo(() => user.name, [user.name]);\n```\n\n**When to use useMemo:**\n- Array transformations (filter, sort, map chains)\n- Object creation passed to memoized children\n- Computations with O(n) or higher complexity\n\n### useCallback - Stable Function References\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable callback for child props\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  setSelectedId(id);\n}, []);\n\n// Pass to memoized child\n<MemoizedItem onClick={handleClick} />\n\n// ❌ WRONG: useCallback with unstable deps\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  doSomething(unstableObject); // unstableObject changes every render\n}, [unstableObject]); // Defeats the purpose\n```\n\n**When to use useCallback:**\n- Callbacks passed to memoized children\n- Callbacks in dependency arrays\n- Event handlers that would cause child re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: React.memo\n\n```typescript\n// Wrap components that receive stable props\nconst ItemCard = memo(function ItemCard({\n  item,\n  onSelect\n}: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div onClick={() => onSelect(item.id)}>\n      <h3>{item.name}</h3>\n      <p>{item.price}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\n// Custom comparison for complex props\nconst ItemCard = memo(\n  function ItemCard({ item, onSelect }: Props) {\n    // ...\n  },\n  (prevProps, nextProps) => {\n    // Return true if props are equal (skip re-render)\n    return (\n      prevProps.item.id === nextProps.item.id &&\n      prevProps.item.price === nextProps.item.price\n    );\n  }\n);\n```\n\n**When to use React.memo:**\n- List item components\n- Components receiving stable primitive props\n- Components that render frequently but rarely change\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Components that always receive new props\n- Simple components (overhead > benefit)\n- Root-level pages\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: List Virtualization\n\nFor long lists, render only visible items using react-window or react-virtualized.\n\n```typescript\nimport { FixedSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VirtualizedList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const Row = ({ index, style }: { index: number; style: React.CSSProperties }) => (\n    <div style={style}>\n      <ItemCard item={items[index]} />\n    </div>\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <FixedSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={80}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </FixedSizeList>\n  );\n}\n\n// Variable height items\nimport { VariableSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VariableList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const getItemSize = (index: number) => {\n    return items[index].expanded ? 200 : 80;\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <VariableSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={getItemSize}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </VariableSizeList>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**When to virtualize:**\n- Lists with 100+ items\n- Complex item components\n- Scrollable containers with many children\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Zustand Selector Optimization\n\n**Problem:** Selecting entire store causes re-render on any state change.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useAppStore();\n// or\nconst { items, loading, filters, ... } = useAppStore();\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Only re-renders when selected values change\nconst items = useAppStore((s) => s.items);\nconst loading = useAppStore((s) => s.loading);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Multiple values with shallow comparison\nimport { useShallow } from ''zustand/react/shallow'';\n\nconst { items, loading } = useAppStore(\n  useShallow((s) => ({\n    items: s.items,\n    loading: s.loading\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Avoiding Re-Renders\n\n### Object/Array Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: New object every render\n<ChildComponent style={{ padding: 10 }} />\n<ChildComponent config={{ enabled: true }} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable reference\nconst style = useMemo(() => ({ padding: 10 }), []);\nconst config = useMemo(() => ({ enabled: true }), []);\n\n<ChildComponent style={style} />\n<ChildComponent config={config} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Or define outside component\nconst style = { padding: 10 };\n\nfunction Parent() {\n  return <ChildComponent style={style} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Children Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Inline function creates new element each render\n<Parent>\n  {() => <Child />}\n</Parent>\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable element\nconst child = useMemo(() => <Child />, [deps]);\n<Parent>{child}</Parent>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Code Splitting\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react'';\n\n// Lazy load components\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Dashboard''));\nconst Settings = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Settings''));\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>\n      <Routes>\n        <Route path=\"/dashboard\" element={<Dashboard />} />\n        <Route path=\"/settings\" element={<Settings />} />\n      </Routes>\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}\n\n// Named exports\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() =>\n  import(''./pages/Dashboard'').then(module => ({\n    default: module.Dashboard\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Debouncing and Throttling\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMemo } from ''react'';\nimport { debounce, throttle } from ''lodash-es'';\n\n// Debounce - wait until user stops typing\nfunction SearchInput({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (query: string) => void }) {\n  const debouncedSearch = useMemo(\n    () => debounce(onSearch, 300),\n    [onSearch]\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <input\n      type=\"text\"\n      onChange={(e) => debouncedSearch(e.target.value)}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Throttle - limit how often function runs\nfunction InfiniteScroll({ onLoadMore }: { onLoadMore: () => void }) {\n  const throttledLoad = useMemo(\n    () => throttle(onLoadMore, 1000),\n    [onLoadMore]\n  );\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleScroll = () => {\n      if (nearBottom()) {\n        throttledLoad();\n      }\n    };\n\n    window.addEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n  }, [throttledLoad]);\n\n  return <div>...</div>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Image Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// Lazy load images\n<img\n  src={imageUrl}\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n  alt=\"Description\"\n/>\n\n// With intersection observer for more control\nfunction LazyImage({ src, alt }: { src: string; alt: string }) {\n  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n  const imgRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      ([entry]) => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          setIsVisible(true);\n          observer.disconnect();\n        }\n      },\n      { rootMargin: ''100px'' }\n    );\n\n    if (imgRef.current) {\n      observer.observe(imgRef.current);\n    }\n\n    return () => observer.disconnect();\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={imgRef}>\n      {isVisible ? (\n        <img src={src} alt={alt} />\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"placeholder\" />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Next.js Image component (if using Next.js)\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n\n<Image\n  src={imageUrl}\n  alt=\"Description\"\n  width={400}\n  height={300}\n  placeholder=\"blur\"\n  blurDataURL={blurHash}\n/>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Web Workers for Heavy Computation\n\n```typescript\n// worker.ts\nself.onmessage = (e: MessageEvent<{ data: number[] }>) => {\n  const result = heavyComputation(e.data.data);\n  self.postMessage(result);\n};\n\n// Component\nfunction DataProcessor({ data }: { data: number[] }) {\n  const [result, setResult] = useState(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const worker = new Worker(new URL(''./worker.ts'', import.meta.url));\n\n    worker.onmessage = (e) => {\n      setResult(e.data);\n    };\n\n    worker.postMessage({ data });\n\n    return () => worker.terminate();\n  }, [data]);\n\n  return result ? <Results data={result} /> : <Loading />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Detecting Re-Renders\n\n### React DevTools Profiler\n\n1. Open React DevTools\n2. Go to Profiler tab\n3. Click record, interact, stop\n4. Review \"Flamegraph\" for render times\n5. Look for components rendering unnecessarily\n\n### why-did-you-render\n\n```typescript\n// Setup in development\nimport React from ''react'';\n\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n  const whyDidYouRender = require(''@welldone-software/why-did-you-render'');\n  whyDidYouRender(React, {\n    trackAllPureComponents: true,\n  });\n}\n\n// Mark specific component for tracking\nItemCard.whyDidYouRender = true;\n```\n\n### Console Logging\n\n```typescript\n// Quick check for re-renders\nfunction ItemCard({ item }: Props) {\n  console.log(''ItemCard render:'', item.id);\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\nBefore shipping:\n\n- [ ] Large lists are virtualized\n- [ ] List items are memoized with `React.memo`\n- [ ] Callbacks passed to items use `useCallback`\n- [ ] Zustand selectors are specific (not whole store)\n- [ ] Images use lazy loading\n- [ ] Heavy routes are code-split\n- [ ] No inline object/function props to memoized children\n- [ ] Profiler shows no unnecessary re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| List scroll lag | Virtualize list, memoize items |\n| Component re-renders too often | Check selector specificity, memoize props |\n| Slow initial render | Code split, reduce bundle size |\n| Memory growing | Check for event listener cleanup, state accumulation |\n| UI freezes on interaction | Move computation to web worker or defer |\n\n---\n\n## Relationship to Other Skills\n\n- **react-zustand-patterns**: Selector optimization patterns\n- **react-async-patterns**: Proper async handling prevents re-render loops\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:24:03.031Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focused on optimizing React applications for better performance and user experience.","zh":"适用于专注于优化React应用程序以获得更好性能和用户体验的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがReactアプリケーションのパフォーマンスとユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化することに重点を置く場合に最適です。","ko":"프런트엔드 에이전트가 리액트 애플리케이션의 성능과 사용자 경험을 최적화하는 데 중점을 둔 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend centrados en optimizar aplicaciones React para un mejor rendimiento y experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend axés sur l''optimisation des applications React pour de meilleures performances et expérience utilisateur.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Optimierung von React-Anwendungen für bessere Leistung und Benutzererfahrung konzentrieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend focados na otimização de aplicações React para melhor desempenho e experiência do usuário.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, ориентированных на оптимизацию приложений React для лучшей производительности и пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يركزون على تحسين أداء وتجربة مستخدم تطبيقات React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify and resolve React performance issues by leveraging memoization techniques, such as useMemo, to minimize unnecessary re-renders and optimize computations on the main thread, ensuring seamless user interactions and efficient application behavior.","zh":"通过利用memoization技术（例如useMemo）来最小化不必要的重渲染并在主线程上优化计算，从而使代理能够识别和解决React性能问题，确保无缝的用户交互和高效的应用程序行为。","ja":"useMemoなどのメモ化技術を利用して、不要な再描画を最小限に抑え、メインスレッドでの計算を最適化することで、Reactのパフォーマンスの問題を特定して解決するエージェントを可能にし、シームレスなユーザーインタラクションと効率的なアプリケーションの動作を保証します。","ko":"useMemo와 같은 메모화 기술을 활용하여 불필요한 재 렌더링을 최소화하고 메인 스레드에서 계산을 최적화하여 리액트 성능 문제를 식별하고 해결할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 무제한의 사용자 상호 작용과 효율적인 애플리케이션 동작을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar y resolver problemas de rendimiento de React mediante la utilización de técnicas de memorización, como useMemo, para minimizar las repinturas innecesarias y optimizar los cálculos en el hilo principal, garantizando interacciones del usuario sin problemas y un comportamiento de aplicación eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier et de résoudre les problèmes de performances de React en exploitant des techniques de mémorisation, telles que useMemo, pour minimiser les réaffichages inutiles et optimiser les calculs sur le thread principal, garantissant des interactions utilisateur sans problème et un comportement d''application efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React-Leistungsprobleme zu identifizieren und zu lösen, indem sie Memoisierungstechniken wie useMemo nutzen, um unnötige Neurenderings zu minimieren und Berechnungen im Hauptthread zu optimieren, um eine nahtlose Benutzerinteraktion und ein effizientes Verhalten der Anwendung zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar e resolver problemas de desempenho do React, utilizando técnicas de memoização, como useMemo, para minimizar re-renderizações desnecessárias e otimizar cálculos na thread principal, garantindo interações de usuário sem interrupções e comportamento de aplicativo eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять и решать проблемы производительности React, используя техники мемоизации, такие как useMemo, для минимизации ненужных повторных рендерингов и оптимизации вычислений в основной нити, обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие пользователя и эффективное поведение приложения.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحديد ومعالجة مشاكل أداء React عن طريق استخدام تقنيات التخزين المؤقت، مثل useMemo، لتقليل إعادة التصيير غير الضرورية وتحسين الحسابات على Thread الرئيسي، مما يضمن تفاعلات المستخدم دون انقطاع وسلوك تطبيق فعال"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React component re-renders for improved application responsiveness","Implementing memoization to reduce expensive computations on the main thread","Debugging performance bottlenecks in React applications using optimized rendering techniques"],"zh":["优化React组件的重渲染以提高应用程序的响应速度","使用memoization技术来减少主线程上的昂贵计算","使用优化的渲染技术来调试React应用程序的性能瓶颈"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントの再描画を最適化してアプリケーションのレスポンス性を向上させる","メモ化技術を使用してメインスレッドでの高コストな計算を削減する","最適化されたレンダリング技術を使用してReactアプリケーションのパフォーマンスのボトルネックをデバッグする"],"ko":["리액트 컴포넌트의 재 렌더링을 최적화하여 애플리케이션의 응답성을 향상시키는 것","메모화 기술을 사용하여 메인 스레드에서 비싼 계산을 줄이는 것","최적화된 렌더링 기술을 사용하여 리액트 애플리케이션의 성능 병목 현상을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar las repinturas de componentes React para mejorar la respuesta de la aplicación","Implementar la memorización para reducir cálculos costosos en el hilo principal","Depurar cuellos de botella de rendimiento en aplicaciones React utilizando técnicas de renderizado optimizadas"],"fr":["Optimiser les réaffichages de composants React pour améliorer la réactivité de l''application","Mettre en œuvre la mémorisation pour réduire les calculs coûteux sur le thread principal","Déboguer les goulots d''étranglement des performances dans les applications React en utilisant des techniques de rendu optimisées"],"de":["Optimieren des Neurenderns von React-Komponenten für eine verbesserte Anwendungsreaktion","Implementierung der Memoisierung, um teure Berechnungen im Hauptthread zu reduzieren","Fehlersuche bei Leistungsengpässen in React-Anwendungen unter Verwendung optimierter Render-Techniken"],"pt":["Otimização de re-renderização de componentes React para melhorar a responsividade da aplicação","Implementação de memoização para reduzir cálculos caros na thread principal","Depuração de gargalos de desempenho em aplicações React usando técnicas de renderização otimizadas"],"ru":["Оптимизация повторного рендеринга компонентов React для улучшения отзывчивости приложения","Реализация мемоизации для уменьшения дорогих вычислений в основной нити","Отладка узких мест производительности в приложениях React с помощью оптимизированных техник рендеринга"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة التصيير لمكونات React لتحسين استجابة التطبيق","تنفيذ التخزين المؤقت لتقليل الحسابات المكلفة على Thread الرئيسي","تصحيح أخطاء الثغرات في أداء تطبيقات React باستخدام تقنيات التصيير المُحسنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of React rendering behavior and optimization techniques","Limited to React-based applications","May require additional setup for complex or large-scale applications"],"zh":["需要了解React的渲染行为和优化技术","仅限于基于React的应用程序","可能需要为复杂或大规模应用程序进行额外的设置"],"ja":["Reactのレンダリングの動作と最適化テクニックを理解する必要がある","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定される","複雑または大規模なアプリケーションの場合、追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["리액트의 렌더링 동작과 최적화 기술을 이해해야 함","리액트 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","복잡하거나 대규모 애플리케이션의 경우 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión del comportamiento de renderizado de React y las técnicas de optimización","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para aplicaciones complejas o de gran escala"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du comportement de rendu de React et des techniques d''optimisation","Limité aux applications basées sur React","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les applications complexes ou à grande échelle"],"de":["Erfordert ein Verständnis des Render-Verhaltens von React und der Optimierungstechniken","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen","Kann für komplexe oder groß angelegte Anwendungen eine zusätzliche Einrichtung erfordern"],"pt":["Requer entendimento do comportamento de renderização do React e técnicas de otimização","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React","Pode requerer configuração adicional para aplicações complexas ou de grande escala"],"ru":["Требует понимания поведения рендеринга React и техник оптимизации","Ограничен для приложений на основе React","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для сложных или крупномасштабных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لسلوك التصيير في React وطُرق التحسين","محدود للتطبيقات المبنية على React","يمكن أن يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا للتطبيقات المعقدة أو ذات النطاق الواسع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
