entação RAG: Construa Aplicativos LLM Precisos","ru":"Реализация RAG: Создание точных приложений LLM","ar":"تنفيذ RAG: بناء تطبيقات LLM دقيقة","en":"rag-implementation"},"description":{"zh":"RAG 实现是一种构建大型语言模型应用的方法，提供准确的、基于外部知识源的响应。它适用于构建 Q&A 系统、聊天机器人和语义搜索等应用","ja":"RAG 実装は、大規模な言語モデルアプリケーションを構築し、外部の知識源に基づいた正確な応答を提供する方法です。Q&A システム、チャットボット、セマンティック検索などのアプリケーションに適しています","ko":"RAG 구현은 대규모 언어 모델 애플리케이션을 구축하고 외부 지식源을 기반으로 정확한 응답을 제공하는 방법입니다. Q&A 시스템, 챗봇, 의미 검색 등의 애플리케이션에 적합합니다","es":"La implementación RAG te permite crear aplicaciones LLM que proporcionan respuestas precisas y basadas en conocimientos externos","fr":"La mise en œuvre RAG vous permet de créer des applications LLM qui fournissent des réponses précises et basées sur des connaissances externes","de":"Die RAG-Implementierung ermöglicht es Ihnen, LLM-Anwendungen zu erstellen, die genaue und auf externen Wissensquellen basierende Antworten liefern","pt":"A Implementação RAG permite criar aplicações LLM com respostas precisas e baseadas em conhecimento externo. Aprenda a dominar essa habilidade para melhorar s...","ru":"Реализация RAG позволяет создавать приложения LLM с точными и обоснованными ответами. Освойте эту技能, чтобы улучшить свои проекты","ar":"تنفيذ RAG يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات LLM ذات استجابات دقيقة ومستندة إلى مصادر معرفة خارجية. تعلمDOM الماستر لهذه المهارة لتحسين مشاريعك","en":"Comprehensive collection of 100+ custom Droids & 300+ Skills for FactoryAI Droid system"},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive collection of 100+ custom Droids & 300+ Skills for FactoryAI Droid system"},"features":{"zh":["构建 Q&A 系统","创建聊天机器人","实现语义搜索","减少幻觉","启用大型语言模型访问领域特定知识","构建文档助手"],"ja":["Q&A システムの構築","チャットボットの作成","セマンティック検索の実装","幻覚の削減","大規模な言語モデルがドメイン固有の知識にアクセスできるようにする","ドキュメント アシスタントの構築"],"ko":["Q&A 시스템 구축","챗봇 생성","의미 검색 구현","환각 감소","대규모 언어 모델이 도메인 특정 지식에 액세스할 수 있도록启用","문서 보조기 구축"],"es":["Creación de sistemas de preguntas y respuestas sobre documentos propietarios","Desarrollo de chatbots con información actual y factual","Implementación de búsqueda semántica con consultas de lenguaje natural","Reducción de alucinaciones con respuestas basadas en conocimientos","Habilitación de LLM para acceder a conocimientos específicos de dominio","Creación de asistentes de documentación"],"fr":["Création de systèmes de questions et réponses sur des documents propriétaires","Développement de chatbots avec des informations actuelles et factuelles","Mise en œuvre de la recherche sémantique avec des requêtes de langage naturel","Réduction des hallucinations avec des réponses basées sur des connaissances","Activation de LLM pour accéder à des connaissances spécifiques de domaine","Création d''assistants de documentation"],"de":["Erstellung von Frage- und Antwortsystemen über eigene Dokumente","Entwicklung von Chatbots mit aktuellen und faktischen Informationen","Implementierung von semantischer Suche mit natürlichen Sprachabfragen","Reduzierung von Halluzinationen mit wissensbasierten Antworten","Aktivierung von LLM zur Zugriff auf domänen-spezifisches Wissen","Erstellung von Dokumentationsassistenten"],"pt":["Criação de sistemas de Q&A sobre documentos proprietários","Desenvolvimento de chatbots com informações atuais e factuais","Implementação de busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","Redução de alucinações com respostas baseadas em fatos","Acesso a conhecimento específico de domínio para LLMs","Criação de assistentes de documentação"],"ru":["Создание систем вопросов и ответов над проприетарными документами","Разработка чат-ботов с актуальной и фактуальной информацией","Реализация семантического поиска с запросами естественного языка","Снижение галлюцинаций с помощью ответов, основанных на фактах","Предоставление доступа к знаниям конкретной области для LLM","Создание помощников документации"],"ar":["إنشاء أنظمة أسئلة وأجوبة على مستندات ملكية","تطوير محادثات دعم مع معلومات حديثة وحقيقية","تنفيذ بحث семантиكي باستخدام استفسارات لغة طبيعية","تقليل الهلوسة مع استجابات مستندة إلى الحقائق","تمكين وصول LLMs إلى معرفة محددة للنطاق","إنشاء مساعدين وثائق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RAG 实现","大型语言模型","外部知识源","Q&A 系统","聊天机器人","语义搜索","幻觉减少","领域特定知识"],"ja":["RAG 実装","大規模な言語モデル","外部の知識源","Q&A システム","チャットボット","セマンティック検索","幻覚削減","ドメイン固有の知識"],"ko":["RAG 구현","대규모 언어 모델","외부 지식源","Q&A 시스템","챗봇","의미 검색","환각 감소","도메인 특정 지식"],"es":["RAG","LLM","generación de respuestas","conocimientos externos","aplicaciones de lenguaje natural","desarrollo de chatbots","búsqueda semántica","asistentes de documentación"],"fr":["RAG","LLM","génération de réponses","connaissances externes","applications de langage naturel","développement de chatbots","recherche sémantique","assistants de documentation"],"de":["RAG","LLM","Antwortgenerierung","externe Wissensquellen","Anwendungen der natürlichen Sprache","Entwicklung von Chatbots","semantische Suche","Dokumentationsassistenten"],"pt":["Implementação RAG","LLM","Respostas precisas","Conhecimento externo","Sistemas de Q&A","Chatbots","Busca semântica","Redução de alucinações"],"ru":["Реализация RAG","LLM","Точные ответы","Внешние источники знаний","Системы вопросов и ответов","Чат-боты","Семантический поиск","Снижение галлюцинаций"],"ar":["تنفيذ RAG","LLM","استجابات دقيقة","معرفة خارجية","أنظمة أسئلة وأجوبة","محادثات دعم","بحث семантиكي","تقليل الهلوسة"]}},"owner":"ovachiever","repo":"droid-tings","repoPath":"ovachiever/droid-tings","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rag-implementation","description":"Build Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems for LLM applications with vector databases and semantic search. Use when implementing knowledge-grounded AI, building document Q&A systems, or integrating LLMs with external knowledge bases.","bodyPreview":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n-","body":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n- Creating research tools with source citation\n\n## Core Components\n\n### 1. Vector Databases\n**Purpose**: Store and retrieve document embeddings efficiently\n\n**Options:**\n- **Pinecone**: Managed, scalable, fast queries\n- **Weaviate**: Open-source, hybrid search\n- **Milvus**: High performance, on-premise\n- **Chroma**: Lightweight, easy to use\n- **Qdrant**: Fast, filtered search\n- **FAISS**: Meta''s library, local deployment\n\n### 2. Embeddings\n**Purpose**: Convert text to numerical vectors for similarity search\n\n**Models:**\n- **text-embedding-ada-002** (OpenAI): General purpose, 1536 dims\n- **all-MiniLM-L6-v2** (Sentence Transformers): Fast, lightweight\n- **e5-large-v2**: High quality, multilingual\n- **Instructor**: Task-specific instructions\n- **bge-large-en-v1.5**: SOTA performance\n\n### 3. Retrieval Strategies\n**Approaches:**\n- **Dense Retrieval**: Semantic similarity via embeddings\n- **Sparse Retrieval**: Keyword matching (BM25, TF-IDF)\n- **Hybrid Search**: Combine dense + sparse\n- **Multi-Query**: Generate multiple query variations\n- **HyDE**: Generate hypothetical documents\n\n### 4. Reranking\n**Purpose**: Improve retrieval quality by reordering results\n\n**Methods:**\n- **Cross-Encoders**: BERT-based reranking\n- **Cohere Rerank**: API-based reranking\n- **Maximal Marginal Relevance (MMR)**: Diversity + relevance\n- **LLM-based**: Use LLM to score relevance\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\n\n# 1. Load documents\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'', glob=\"**/*.txt\")\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\n# 2. Split into chunks\ntext_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len\n)\nchunks = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# 3. Create embeddings and vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(chunks, embeddings)\n\n# 4. Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=OpenAI(),\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 4}),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# 5. Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What are the main features?\"})\nprint(result[''result''])\nprint(result[''source_documents''])\n```\n\n## Advanced RAG Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hybrid Search\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import BM25Retriever, EnsembleRetriever\n\n# Sparse retriever (BM25)\nbm25_retriever = BM25Retriever.from_documents(chunks)\nbm25_retriever.k = 5\n\n# Dense retriever (embeddings)\nembedding_retriever = vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 5})\n\n# Combine with weights\nensemble_retriever = EnsembleRetriever(\n    retrievers=[bm25_retriever, embedding_retriever],\n    weights=[0.3, 0.7]\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Query Retrieval\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers.multi_query import MultiQueryRetriever\n\n# Generate multiple query perspectives\nretriever = MultiQueryRetriever.from_llm(\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    llm=OpenAI()\n)\n\n# Single query → multiple variations → combined results\nresults = retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"What is the main topic?\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Contextual Compression\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ContextualCompressionRetriever\nfrom langchain.retrievers.document_compressors import LLMChainExtractor\n\ncompressor = LLMChainExtractor.from_llm(llm)\n\ncompression_retriever = ContextualCompressionRetriever(\n    base_compressor=compressor,\n    base_retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever()\n)\n\n# Returns only relevant parts of documents\ncompressed_docs = compression_retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"query\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Parent Document Retriever\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ParentDocumentRetriever\nfrom langchain.storage import InMemoryStore\n\n# Store for parent documents\nstore = InMemoryStore()\n\n# Small chunks for retrieval, large chunks for context\nchild_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=400)\nparent_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=2000)\n\nretriever = ParentDocumentRetriever(\n    vectorstore=vectorstore,\n    docstore=store,\n    child_splitter=child_splitter,\n    parent_splitter=parent_splitter\n)\n```\n\n## Document Chunking Strategies\n\n### Recursive Character Text Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len,\n    separators=[\"\\n\\n\", \"\\n\", \" \", \"\"]  # Try these in order\n)\n```\n\n### Token-Based Splitting\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import TokenTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = TokenTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=512,\n    chunk_overlap=50\n)\n```\n\n### Semantic Chunking\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import SemanticChunker\n\nsplitter = SemanticChunker(\n    embeddings=OpenAIEmbeddings(),\n    breakpoint_threshold_type=\"percentile\"\n)\n```\n\n### Markdown Header Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter\n\nheaders_to_split_on = [\n    (\"#\", \"Header 1\"),\n    (\"##\", \"Header 2\"),\n    (\"###\", \"Header 3\"),\n]\n\nsplitter = MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter(headers_to_split_on=headers_to_split_on)\n```\n\n## Vector Store Configurations\n\n### Pinecone\n```python\nimport pinecone\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Pinecone\n\npinecone.init(api_key=\"your-api-key\", environment=\"us-west1-gcp\")\n\nindex = pinecone.Index(\"your-index-name\")\n\nvectorstore = Pinecone(index, embeddings.embed_query, \"text\")\n```\n\n### Weaviate\n```python\nimport weaviate\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Weaviate\n\nclient = weaviate.Client(\"http://localhost:8080\")\n\nvectorstore = Weaviate(client, \"Document\", \"content\", embeddings)\n```\n\n### Chroma (Local)\n```python\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n\nvectorstore = Chroma(\n    collection_name=\"my_collection\",\n    embedding_function=embeddings,\n    persist_directory=\"./chroma_db\"\n)\n```\n\n## Retrieval Optimization\n\n### 1. Metadata Filtering\n```python\n# Add metadata during indexing\nchunks_with_metadata = []\nfor i, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\n    chunk.metadata = {\n        \"source\": chunk.metadata.get(\"source\"),\n        \"page\": i,\n        \"category\": determine_category(chunk.page_content)\n    }\n    chunks_with_metadata.append(chunk)\n\n# Filter during retrieval\nresults = vectorstore.similarity_search(\n    \"query\",\n    filter={\"category\": \"technical\"},\n    k=5\n)\n```\n\n### 2. Maximal Marginal Relevance\n```python\n# Balance relevance with diversity\nresults = vectorstore.max_marginal_relevance_search(\n    \"query\",\n    k=5,\n    fetch_k=20,  # Fetch 20, return top 5 diverse\n    lambda_mult=0.5  # 0=max diversity, 1=max relevance\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Reranking with Cross-Encoder\n```python\nfrom sentence_transformers import CrossEncoder\n\nreranker = CrossEncoder(''cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2'')\n\n# Get initial results\ncandidates = vectorstore.similarity_search(\"query\", k=20)\n\n# Rerank\npairs = [[query, doc.page_content] for doc in candidates]\nscores = reranker.predict(pairs)\n\n# Sort by score and take top k\nreranked = sorted(zip(candidates, scores), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)[:5]\n```\n\n## Prompt Engineering for RAG\n\n### Contextual Prompt\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Use the following context to answer the question. If you cannot answer based on the context, say \"I don''t have enough information.\"\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Citations\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question based on the context below. Include citations using [1], [2], etc.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer (with citations):\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Confidence\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question using the context. Provide a confidence score (0-100%) for your answer.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\nConfidence:\"\"\"\n```\n\n## Evaluation Metrics\n\n```python\ndef evaluate_rag_system(qa_chain, test_cases):\n    metrics = {\n        ''accuracy'': [],\n        ''retrieval_quality'': [],\n        ''groundedness'': []\n    }\n\n    for test in test_cases:\n        result = qa_chain({\"query\": test[''question'']})\n\n        # Check if answer matches expected\n        accuracy = calculate_accuracy(result[''result''], test[''expected''])\n        metrics[''accuracy''].append(accuracy)\n\n        # Check if relevant docs were retrieved\n        retrieval_quality = evaluate_retrieved_docs(\n            result[''source_documents''],\n            test[''relevant_docs'']\n        )\n        metrics[''retrieval_quality''].append(retrieval_quality)\n\n        # Check if answer is grounded in context\n        groundedness = check_groundedness(\n            result[''result''],\n            result[''source_documents'']\n        )\n        metrics[''groundedness''].append(groundedness)\n\n    return {k: sum(v)/len(v) for k, v in metrics.items()}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/vector-databases.md**: Detailed comparison of vector DBs\n- **references/embeddings.md**: Embedding model selection guide\n- **references/retrieval-strategies.md**: Advanced retrieval techniques\n- **references/reranking.md**: Reranking methods and when to use them\n- **references/context-window.md**: Managing context limits\n- **assets/vector-store-config.yaml**: Configuration templates\n- **assets/retriever-pipeline.py**: Complete RAG pipeline\n- **assets/embedding-models.md**: Model comparison and benchmarks\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Chunk Size**: Balance between context and specificity (500-1000 tokens)\n2. **Overlap**: Use 10-20% overlap to preserve context at boundaries\n3. **Metadata**: Include source, page, timestamp for filtering and debugging\n4. **Hybrid Search**: Combine semantic and keyword search for best results\n5. **Reranking**: Improve top results with cross-encoder\n6. **Citations**: Always return source documents for transparency\n7. **Evaluation**: Continuously test retrieval quality and answer accuracy\n8. **Monitoring**: Track retrieval metrics in production\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Poor Retrieval**: Check embedding quality, chunk size, query formulation\n- **Irrelevant Results**: Add metadata filtering, use hybrid search, rerank\n- **Missing Information**: Ensure documents are properly indexed\n- **Slow Queries**: Optimize vector store, use caching, reduce k\n- **Hallucinations**: Improve grounding prompt, add verification step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:24:20.630Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Model Agents needing Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) for accurate and grounded responses","zh":"非常适合需要检索增强生成（RAG）以提供准确和有根据的响应的语言模型代理","ja":"言語モデルエージェントが正確で根拠のある応答を生成するために必要な検索増強生成（RAG）に適したもの","ko":"정확하고 근거 있는 응답을 제공하기 위해检索 증강 생성(RAG)이 필요한 언어 모델 에이전트에 적합함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje que necesitan Generación con Recuperación (RAG) para respuestas precisas y fundamentadas","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Modèle de Langage ayant besoin de Génération avec Recherche (RAG) pour des réponses précises et ancrées","de":"Perfekt für Language-Model-Agents, die Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) für genaue und fundierte Antworten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem que precisam de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação (RAG) para respostas precisas e fundamentadas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, которым необходима генерация,增强енная поиском (RAG), для точных и обоснованных ответов","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء نموذج اللغة الذين يحتاجون إلى генерація مدعومة بالاسترجاع (RAG) لأجوبة دقيقة وموثقة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build LLM applications with external knowledge sources, reducing hallucinations and enabling access to domain-specific knowledge through semantic search and natural language queries","zh":"使代理能够使用外部知识源构建大型语言模型（LLM）应用，减少幻觉并通过语义搜索和自然语言查询实现对特定领域知识的访问","ja":"エージェントが外部の知識源を使用して大規模言語モデル（LLM）アプリケーションを構築できるようにし、幻覚を減らし、セマンティック検索と自然言語クエリを介してドメイン固有の知識にアクセスできるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 外部 지식源을 사용하여 대규모 언어 모델(LLM) 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하여, 환각을 줄이고, 의미 검색 및 자연어 쿼리를 통해 특정 도메인 지식에 액세스할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones de LLM con fuentes de conocimiento externas, reduciendo alucinaciones y permitiendo el acceso a conocimiento específico del dominio a través de búsqueda semántica y consultas de lenguaje natural","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications LLM avec des sources de connaissances externes, réduisant les hallucinations et permettant l''accès à des connaissances spécifiques au domaine via la recherche sémantique et les requêtes en langage naturel","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, LLM-Anwendungen mit externen Wissensquellen zu erstellen, Halluzinationen zu reduzieren und den Zugriff auf domänen-spezifisches Wissen durch semantische Suche und natürliche Sprachabfragen zu ermöglichen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de LLM com fontes de conhecimento externas, reduzindo alucinações e permitindo o acesso a conhecimentos específicos de domínio por meio de busca semântica e consultas de linguagem natural","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать приложения LLM с внешними источниками знаний, уменьшая галлюцинации и обеспечивая доступ к доменно-специфичным знаниям посредством семантического поиска и запросов естественного языка","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات LLM مع مصادر معرفة خارجية، مما يقلل من هلوسات وتمكين الوصول إلى معرفة محددة للنطاق من خلال البحث الدلالي واستفسارات اللغة الطبيعية"},"useCases":{"en":["Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents","Implementing semantic search with natural language queries","Reducing hallucinations in chatbots with grounded responses"],"zh":["构建专有文档上的问答系统","使用自然语言查询实现语义搜索","在聊天机器人中使用有根据的响应减少幻觉"],"ja":["独自のドキュメント上のQAシステムの構築","自然言語クエリを使用したセマンティック検索の実装","チャットボットでの幻覚の削減に基づいたレスポンスの使用"],"ko":["자체 문서上的 Q&A 시스템 구축","자연어 쿼리를 사용한 의미 검색 구현","챗봇에서 근거 있는 응답을 사용하여 환각 줄이기"],"es":["Construir sistemas de preguntas y respuestas sobre documentos propietarios","Implementar búsqueda semántica con consultas de lenguaje natural","Reducir alucinaciones en chatbots con respuestas fundamentadas"],"fr":["Construire des systèmes de questions et réponses sur des documents propriétaires","Mettre en œuvre une recherche sémantique avec des requêtes en langage naturel","Réduire les hallucinations dans les chatbots avec des réponses ancrées"],"de":["Erstellung von Q&A-Systemen über proprietäre Dokumente","Implementierung von semantischer Suche mit natürlichen Sprachabfragen","Reduzierung von Halluzinationen in Chatbots mit fundierten Antworten"],"pt":["Construir sistemas de Perguntas e Respostas sobre documentos proprietários","Implementar busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","Reduzir alucinações em chatbots com respostas fundamentadas"],"ru":["Построение систем вопросов и ответов над проприетарными документами","Реализация семантического поиска с запросами естественного языка","Снижение галлюцинаций в чат-ботах с обоснованными ответами"],"ar":["بناء أنظمة الأسئلة والإجابات على وثائق ملكية","تنفيذ البحث الدلالي مع استفسارات اللغة الطبيعية","تقليل هلوسات في Chatbots مع إجابات موثقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with external knowledge sources","Dependent on quality and relevance of external knowledge"],"zh":["需要与外部知识源集成","依赖于外部知识的质量和相关性"],"ja":["外部の知識源との統合が必要","外部の知識の品質と関連性への依存"],"ko":["외부 지식源과의 통합이 필요","외부 지식의 품질 및 관련성에 대한 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con fuentes de conocimiento externas","Depende de la calidad y relevancia de las fuentes de conocimiento externas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec des sources de connaissances externes","Dépend de la qualité et de la pertinence des sources de connaissances externes"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit externen Wissensquellen","Hängt von der Qualität und Relevanz der externen Wissensquellen ab"],"pt":["Exige integração com fontes de conhecimento externas","Dependente da qualidade e relevância das fontes de conhecimento externas"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с внешними источниками знаний","Зависит от качества и релевантности внешних источников знаний"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع مصادر معرفة خارجية","يعتمد على جودة وأهمية مصادر المعرفة الخارجية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
