PI","Autenticación con token de integración"],"fr":["Intégration avec l''API Notion","Accès aux pages et bases de données","Opérations sécurisées et recommandées","Utilisation de la CLI Notion pour les appels d''API","Authentification avec un jeton d''intégration"],"de":["Integration mit der Notion-API","Zugriff auf Seiten und Datenbanken","Sichere und empfohlene Operationen","Verwendung der Notion-CLI für API-Aufrufe","Authentifizierung mit Integrations-Token"],"pt":["Trabalho com páginas do Notion","Trabalho com bancos de dados do Notion","Uso da API oficial do Notion","Operações seguras e recomendadas","Autenticação com token de integração"],"ru":["Работа со страницами Notion","Работа с базами данных Notion","Использование официального API Notion","Безопасные и рекомендуемые операции","Аутентификация с помощью токена интеграции"],"ar":["العمل مع صفحات نوتيون","العمل مع قواعد بيانات نوتيون","استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الرسمية لنوتيون","عمليات آمنة وموصى بها","التحقق باستخدام رمز التكامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Notion API","Notion页面","Notion数据库","集成技能","安全推荐操作","本地CLI"],"ja":["Notion API","Notionページ","Notionデータベース","統合スキル","安全な推奨操作","ローカルCLI"],"ko":["노션 API","노션 페이지","노션 데이터베이스","통합 스킬","安全한 추천 작동","로컬 CLI"],"es":["Notion API","Integración con Notion","Páginas de Notion","Bases de datos de Notion","Desarrollo con Notion","API de Notion para desarrolladores"],"fr":["API Notion","Intégration avec Notion","Pages Notion","Bases de données Notion","Développement avec Notion","API Notion pour développeurs"],"de":["Notion-API","Integration mit Notion","Notion-Seiten","Notion-Datenbanken","Entwicklung mit Notion","Notion-API für Entwickler"],"pt":["Notion API","Integração Notion","Desenvolvimento Notion","Notion para desenvolvedores","API Notion oficial","Habilidades Notion"],"ru":["Notion API","Интеграция Notion","Разработка Notion","Notion для разработчиков","Официальное API Notion","Навыки Notion"],"ar":["نوتيون API","دمج نوتيون","تطوير نوتيون","نوتيون للمطورين","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الرسمية لنوتيون","مهارات نوتيون"]}},"owner":"sundial-org","repo":"awesome-openclaw-skills","repoPath":"sundial-org/awesome-openclaw-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notion-2","description":"Work with Notion pages and databases via the official Notion API.","bodyPreview":"# Notion\n\nThis skill lets the agent work with **Notion pages and databases** using the official Notion API.\n\nThe skill is declarative: it documents **safe, recommended operations** and assumes a local CLI\n(`notion-cli`) that actually performs API calls.\n\n## Authentication\n\n- Create a Notion Integration at https://www.notion.so/my-integrations\n- Copy the Internal Integration Token.\n- Export it as:\n\n```bash\nexport NOTION_API_KEY=secret_xxx\n```\n\nShare the integration with the pages or databases you","body":"# Notion\n\nThis skill lets the agent work with **Notion pages and databases** using the official Notion API.\n\nThe skill is declarative: it documents **safe, recommended operations** and assumes a local CLI\n(`notion-cli`) that actually performs API calls.\n\n## Authentication\n\n- Create a Notion Integration at https://www.notion.so/my-integrations\n- Copy the Internal Integration Token.\n- Export it as:\n\n```bash\nexport NOTION_API_KEY=secret_xxx\n```\n\nShare the integration with the pages or databases you want to access.\nUnshared content is invisible to the API.\n\n## Profiles (personal / work)\n\nYou may define multiple profiles (e.g. personal, work) via env or config.\n\nDefault profile: personal\n\nOverride via:\n\n```bash\nexport NOTION_PROFILE=work\n```\n\n## Pages\n\n**Read page:**\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli page get <page_id>\n```\n\n**Append blocks:**\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli block append <page_id> --markdown \"...\"\n```\n\nPrefer appending over rewriting content.\n\n**Create page:**\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli page create --parent <page_id> --title \"...\"\n```\n\n## Databases\n\n**Inspect schema:**\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli db get <database_id>\n```\n\n**Query database:**\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli db query <database_id> --filter <json> --sort <json>\n```\n\n**Create row:**\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli page create --database <database_id> --props <json>\n```\n\n**Update row:**\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli page update <page_id> --props <json>\n```\n\n## Schema changes (advanced)\n\nAlways inspect diffs before applying schema changes.\n\nNever modify database schema without explicit confirmation.\n\nRecommended flow:\n\n```bash\nnotion-cli db schema diff <database_id> --desired <json>\nnotion-cli db schema apply <database_id> --desired <json>\n```\n\n## Safety notes\n\n- Notion API is rate-limited; batch carefully.\n- Prefer append and updates over destructive operations.\n- IDs are opaque; store them explicitly, do not infer from URLs.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:26:08.132Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing seamless Notion page and database integration.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝Notion页面和数据库集成的生产力代理。","ja":"ノーションページやデータベースのシームレスな統合が必要な生産性エージェントに最適。","ko":"노션 페이지 및 데이터베이스와의 무결점 통합이 필요한 생산성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad que necesitan una integración sin problemas de páginas y bases de datos de Notion.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de productivité ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente des pages et des bases de données Notion.","de":"Perfekt für Produktivitätsagenten, die eine nahtlose Integration von Notion-Seiten und -Datenbanken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade que necessitam de integração perfeita de páginas e banco de dados do Notion.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов производительности, требующих бесшовной интеграции страниц и базы данных Notion.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إنتاجية بحاجة إلى تكامل سلس للصفحات وقاعدة بيانات Notion."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform safe, recommended operations on Notion pages and databases using the official Notion API, enabling efficient data management and retrieval via the notion-cli.","zh":"赋予代理商使用官方Notion API对Notion页面和数据库执行安全的推荐操作的能力，从而通过notion-cli实现高效的数据管理和检索。","ja":"ノーションAPIを使用してノーションページやデータベースに対して安全で推奨される操作を実行できるようにエージェントに権限を付与し、notion-cliを介した効率的なデータ管理や取得を可能にします。","ko":"공식 Notion API를 사용하여 노션 페이지 및 데이터베이스에 안전하고 권장되는 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 에이전트에 권한을 부여하여 notion-cli를 통해 효율적인 데이터 관리 및 검색을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar operaciones seguras y recomendadas en páginas y bases de datos de Notion mediante la API oficial de Notion, lo que permite una gestión y recuperación de datos eficientes a través de notion-cli.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations sûres et recommandées sur les pages et les bases de données Notion à l''aide de l''API officielle Notion, ce qui permet une gestion et une récupération de données efficaces via notion-cli.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und empfohlene Operationen auf Notion-Seiten und -Datenbanken mithilfe der offiziellen Notion-API auszuführen, wodurch eine effiziente Datenerfassung und -rückgewinnung über notion-cli ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar operações seguras e recomendadas em páginas e bancos de dados do Notion usando a API oficial do Notion, permitindo gerenciamento e recuperação eficientes de dados via o notion-cli.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять безопасные и рекомендуемые операции со страницами и базами данных Notion, используя официальный API Notion, обеспечивая эффективное управление и получение данных через notion-cli.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من أداء عمليات آمنة وموصى بها على صفحات وقواعد بيانات Notion باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Notion الرسمية، مما يُمكّن الإدارة والاسترجاع الفعالين للبيانات عبر notion-cli."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Notion page updates","Generating reports from Notion databases","Debugging Notion integration issues"],"zh":["自动更新Notion页面","从Notion数据库生成报告","调试Notion集成问题"],"ja":["ノーションページの自動更新","ノーションデータベースからのレポート生成","ノーション統合の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["노션 페이지 자동 업데이트","노션 데이터베이스에서 보고서 생성","노션 통합 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de páginas de Notion","Generación de informes a partir de bases de datos de Notion","Depuración de problemas de integración de Notion"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour des pages Notion","Génération de rapports à partir de bases de données Notion","Débogage des problèmes d''intégration de Notion"],"de":["Automatisierung von Notion-Seitenaktualisierungen","Erstellung von Berichten aus Notion-Datenbanken","Fehlerbehebung bei Notion-Integration"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de páginas do Notion","Gerar relatórios a partir de bancos de dados do Notion","Depurar problemas de integração do Notion"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления страниц Notion","Генерировать отчеты из баз данных Notion","Отладить проблемы интеграции Notion"],"ar":["تأتميم تحديثات صفحات Notion","توليد تقارير من قواعد بيانات Notion","تصحيح مشاكل دمج Notion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Notion Integration Token","Needs notion-cli installed","Limited to Notion API capabilities"],"zh":["需要Notion集成令牌","需要安装notion-cli","仅限Notion API功能"],"ja":["ノーション統合トークンが必要","notion-cliのインストールが必要","ノーションAPIの機能に限定"],"ko":["노션 통합 토큰 필요","notion-cli 설치 필요","노션 API 기능에 한정"],"es":["Requiere Token de Integración de Notion","Necesita notion-cli instalado","Limitado a las capacidades de la API de Notion"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''intégration Notion","Nécessite l''installation de notion-cli","Limité aux capacités de l''API Notion"],"de":["Benötigt Notion-Integrationstoken","Benötigt die Installation von notion-cli","Begrenzt auf die Fähigkeiten der Notion-API"],"pt":["Exige Token de Integração do Notion","Necessita do notion-cli instalado","Limitado às capacidades da API do Notion"],"ru":["Требует токена интеграции Notion","Требует установленного notion-cli","Ограничен возможностями API Notion"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز دمج Notion","يحتاج إلى تثبيت notion-cli","محدود بسمات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Notion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('black-forest-labs/skills/bfl-api', 'community', 'black-forest-labs', 'skills', 'black-forest-labs/skills', 'bfl-api', 0, 0, 90, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:26:00.553Z', NULL, '{"id":"black-forest-labs/skills/bfl-api","name":"bfl-api","description":{"zh":"BFL API","ja":"BFL API","ko":"BFL API","es":"La integración BFL API permite a los desarrolladores generar, editar y procesar imágenes con FLUX. Sigue nuestra guía para configurar tu API Key y empezar a utilizar la API.","fr":"L''intégration BFL API permet aux développeurs de générer, d''éditer et de traiter des images avec FLUX. Suivez notre guide pour configurer votre clé API et commencer à utiliser l''API.","de":"Die BFL-API-Integration ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Bilder mit FLUX zu generieren, zu bearbeiten und zu verarbeiten. Folgen Sie unserer Anleitung, um Ihren API-Schlüssel zu konfigurieren und die API zu verwenden.","pt":"A API BFL é uma ferramenta oficial para geração de imagens, edição e processamento. Ela fornece diretrizes de prompt e padrões de integração de API.","ru":"API BFL — официальный инструмент для генерации, редактирования и обработки изображений. Он предоставляет руководства по промпту и шаблоны интеграции API.","ar":"واجهة برمجة التطبيقات BFL هي أداة رسمية لجénération الصور، تحريرها ومعالجتها. توفر إرشادات حول الحفーズ ونمط التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","en":"Official skills from Black Forest Labs for FLUX image generation models. These skills provide prompting guidelines and API integration patterns following the https://agentskills.io specification."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"BFL API","ja":"BFL API","ko":"BFL API","es":"Integración BFL API para generación de imágenes","fr":"Intégration BFL API pour la génération d''images","de":"BFL API-Integration für Bildgenerierung","pt":"Integração BFL API para Geração de Imagens","ru":"Интеграция BFL API для генерации изображений","ar":"تكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات BFL لجénération الصور","en":"bfl-api"},"description":{"zh":"BFL API","ja":"BFL API","ko":"BFL API","es":"La integración BFL API permite a los desarrolladores generar, editar y procesar imágenes con FLUX. Sigue nuestra guía para configurar tu API Key y empezar a ...","fr":"L''intégration BFL API permet aux développeurs de générer, d''éditer et de traiter des images avec FLUX. Suivez notre guide pour configurer votre clé API et co...","de":"Die BFL-API-Integration ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Bilder mit FLUX zu generieren, zu bearbeiten und zu verarbeiten. Folgen Sie unserer Anleitung, um Ihren AP...","pt":"A API BFL é uma ferramenta oficial para geração de imagens, edição e processamento. Ela fornece diretrizes de prompt e padrões de integração de API.","ru":"API BFL — официальный инструмент для генерации, редактирования и обработки изображений. Он предоставляет руководства по промпту и шаблоны интеграции API.","ar":"واجهة برمجة التطبيقات BFL هي أداة رسمية لجénération الصور، تحريرها ومعالجتها. توفر إرشادات حول الحفーズ ونمط التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","en":"Official skills from Black Forest Labs for FLUX image generation models. These skills provide prompting guidelines and API integration patterns following the..."},"definition":{"en":"Official skills from Black Forest Labs for FLUX image generation models. These skills provide prompting guidelines and API integration patterns following the https://agentskills.io specification."},"features":{"zh":["BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API"],"ja":["BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API"],"ko":["BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API"],"es":["Generación de imágenes con FLUX","Edición y procesamiento de imágenes","Configuración de API Key","Integración con aplicaciones","URLs de imágenes temporales","Descarga de imágenes después de la generación"],"fr":["Génération d''images avec FLUX","Édition et traitement d''images","Configuration de la clé API","Intégration avec des applications","URLs d''images temporaires","Téléchargement d''images après la génération"],"de":["Bildgenerierung mit FLUX","Bildbearbeitung und -verarbeitung","API-Schlüssel-Konfiguration","Integration mit Anwendungen","Temporäre Bild-URLs","Bild-Download nach der Generierung"],"pt":["Geração de imagens personalizadas","Edição e processamento de imagens","Integração de API segura","Documentação completa","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de imagem"],"ru":["Генерация пользовательских изображений","Редактирование и обработка изображений","Безопасная интеграция API","Полная документация","Поддержка нескольких форматов изображений"],"ar":["جénération الصور المخصصة","تحرير ومعالجة الصور","تكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الآمن","توثيق كامل","دعم صيغ الصور المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API"],"ja":["BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API"],"ko":["BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API","BFL API"],"es":["BFL API","generación de imágenes","FLUX","edición de imágenes","procesamiento de imágenes","integración de API","desarrollo de aplicaciones","API Key"],"fr":["BFL API","génération d''images","FLUX","édition d''images","traitement d''images","intégration d''API","développement d''applications","clé API"],"de":["BFL-API","Bildgenerierung","FLUX","Bildbearbeitung","Bildverarbeitung","API-Integration","Anwendungsentwicklung","API-Schlüssel"],"pt":["API BFL","Geração de imagens","Edição de imagens","Processamento de imagens","Integração de API","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Imagens personalizadas","Formatos de imagem"],"ru":["API BFL","Генерация изображений","Редактирование изображений","Обработка изображений","Интеграция API","Разработка приложений","Пользовательские изображения","Форматы изображений"],"ar":["واجهة برمجة التطبيقات BFL","جénération الصور","تحرير الصور","معالجة الصور","تكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تطوير التطبيقات","الصور المخصصة","صيغ الصور"]}},"owner":"black-forest-labs","repo":"skills","repoPath":"black-forest-labs/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bfl-api","description":"BFL FLUX API integration guide covering endpoints, async polling patterns, rate limiting, error handling, webhooks, and regional endpoints with Python and TypeScript code examples.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"flux, bfl, api, integration, webhooks, rate-limiting","bodyPreview":"# BFL API Integration Guide\n\nUse this skill when integrating BFL FLUX APIs into applications for image generation, editing, and processing.\n\n## First: Check API Key\n\n**Before generating images, verify your API key is set:**\n\n```bash\necho $BFL_API_KEY\n```\n\nIf empty or you see \"Not authenticated\" errors, see [API Key Setup](#api-key-setup) below.\n\n## Important: Image URLs Expire in 10 Minutes\n\nResult URLs from the API are temporary. Download images immediately after generation completes - do not s","body":"# BFL API Integration Guide\n\nUse this skill when integrating BFL FLUX APIs into applications for image generation, editing, and processing.\n\n## First: Check API Key\n\n**Before generating images, verify your API key is set:**\n\n```bash\necho $BFL_API_KEY\n```\n\nIf empty or you see \"Not authenticated\" errors, see [API Key Setup](#api-key-setup) below.\n\n## Important: Image URLs Expire in 10 Minutes\n\nResult URLs from the API are temporary. Download images immediately after generation completes - do not store or cache the URLs themselves.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up BFL API client\n- Implementing async polling patterns\n- Handling rate limits and errors\n- Configuring webhooks for production\n- Selecting regional endpoints\n- Building production-ready integrations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Base Endpoints\n\n| Region | Endpoint                | Use Case                    |\n| ------ | ----------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| Global | `https://api.bfl.ai`    | Default, automatic failover |\n| EU     | `https://api.eu.bfl.ai` | GDPR compliance             |\n| US     | `https://api.us.bfl.ai` | US data residency           |\n\n### Model Endpoints & Pricing\n\n> **Credit pricing:** 1 credit = $0.01 USD. FLUX.2 uses megapixel-based pricing (cost scales with resolution).\n\n#### FLUX.2 Models\n\n| Model             | Path                  | 1st MP | +MP  | 1MP T2I | 1MP I2I | Best For                           |\n| ----------------- | --------------------- | ------ | ---- | ------- | ------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| FLUX.2 [klein] 4B | `/v1/flux-2-klein-4b` | 1.4c   | 0.1c | $0.014  | $0.015  | Real-time, high volume             |\n| FLUX.2 [klein] 9B | `/v1/flux-2-klein-9b` | 1.5c   | 0.2c | $0.015  | $0.017  | Balanced quality/speed             |\n| FLUX.2 [pro]      | `/v1/flux-2-pro`      | 3c     | 1.5c | $0.03   | $0.045  | Production, fast turnaround        |\n| FLUX.2 [max]      | `/v1/flux-2-max`      | 7c     | 3c   | $0.07   | $0.10   | Maximum quality                    |\n| FLUX.2 [flex]     | `/v1/flux-2-flex`     | 5c     | 5c   | $0.05   | $0.10   | Typography, adjustable controls    |\n| FLUX.2 [dev]      | -                     | -      | -    | Free    | Free    | Local development (non-commercial) |\n\n> **Pricing formula:** `(firstMP + (outputMP-1) * mpPrice) + (inputMP * mpPrice)` in cents\n\n#### FLUX.1 Models\n\n| Model                | Path                     | Price/Image | Best For                      |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------ | ----------- | ----------------------------- |\n| FLUX.1 Kontext [pro] | `/v1/flux-kontext`       | $0.04       | Image editing with context    |\n| FLUX.1 Kontext [max] | `/v1/flux-kontext-max`   | $0.08       | Max quality editing           |\n| FLUX1.1 [pro]        | `/v1/flux-pro-1.1`       | $0.04       | Standard T2I, fast & reliable |\n| FLUX1.1 [pro] Ultra  | `/v1/flux-pro-1.1-ultra` | $0.06       | Ultra high-resolution         |\n| FLUX1.1 [pro] Raw    | `/v1/flux-pro-1.1-raw`   | $0.06       | Candid photography feel       |\n| FLUX.1 Fill [pro]    | `/v1/flux-pro-1.0-fill`  | $0.05       | Inpainting                    |\n\n> **Tip:** All FLUX.2 models support image editing via the `input_image` parameter - no separate editing endpoint needed. Use [bfl.ai/pricing](https://bfl.ai/pricing) calculator for exact costs at different resolutions.\n\n### Image Input for Editing\n\n**Preferred: Use URLs directly** - simpler and more convenient than base64.\n\n**Single image editing:**\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://api.bfl.ai/v1/flux-2-pro\" \\\n  -H \"x-key: $BFL_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"prompt\": \"Change the background to a sunset\",\n    \"input_image\": \"https://example.com/photo.jpg\"\n  }''\n```\n\n**Multi-reference editing:**\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://api.bfl.ai/v1/flux-2-pro\" \\\n  -H \"x-key: $BFL_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"prompt\": \"The person from image 1 in the environment from image 2\",\n    \"input_image\": \"https://example.com/person.jpg\",\n    \"input_image_2\": \"https://example.com/background.jpg\"\n  }''\n```\n\nThe API fetches URLs automatically. Both URL and base64 work, but URLs are recommended when available.\n\n### Multi-Reference I2I\n\nFLUX.2 models support multiple input images for combining elements, style transfer, and character consistency:\n\n| Model                 | Max References |\n| --------------------- | -------------- |\n| FLUX.2 [klein]        | 4 images       |\n| FLUX.2 [pro/max/flex] | 8 images       |\n\n**Parameters:** `input_image`, `input_image_2`, `input_image_3`, ... `input_image_8`\n\n**Prompt pattern:** Reference images by number in your prompt:\n\n- \"The subject from image 1 in the environment from image 2\"\n- \"Apply the style of image 2 to the scene in image 1\"\n- \"The person from image 1 wearing the outfit from image 2, in the pose from image 3\"\n\n> For detailed multi-reference patterns (character consistency, style transfer, pose guidance), see `flux-best-practices/rules/multi-reference-editing.md`\n\n### Rate Limits\n\n| Tier                      | Concurrent Requests |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| Standard (most endpoints) | 24                  |\n\n### Polling vs Webhooks\n\n| Approach     | Use When                                                                             |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Polling**  | Scripts, CLI tools, local development, single requests, simple integrations          |\n| **Webhooks** | Production apps, high volume, server-to-server, when you need immediate notification |\n\n**Start with polling** - it''s simpler and works everywhere. Switch to webhooks when you need to scale or want event-driven architecture.\n\n### Key Behaviors\n\n- **Polling**: Response includes `polling_url` for async results\n- **URL Expiration**: Result URLs expire after 10 minutes\n- **Webhook Support**: Configure `webhook_url` for production workloads\n\n## API Key Setup\n\n**Required**: The `BFL_API_KEY` environment variable must be set before using the API.\n\n### Quick Check\n\n```bash\necho $BFL_API_KEY\n```\n\n### If Not Set\n\n1. **Get a key**: Go to https://dashboard.bfl.ai/get-started → Click **\"Create Key\"** → Select organization\n2. **Save to `.env`** (recommended for persistence):\n   ```bash\n   echo ''BFL_API_KEY=bfl_your_key_here'' >> .env\n   echo ''.env'' >> .gitignore  # Don''t commit secrets\n   ```\n\nSee [references/api-key-setup.md](references/api-key-setup.md) for detailed setup instructions.\n\n## Authentication\n\n```bash\nx-key: YOUR_API_KEY\n```\n\n## Basic Request Flow\n\n```\n1. POST request to model endpoint\n   └─> Response: { \"polling_url\": \"...\" }\n\n2. GET polling_url (repeat until complete)\n   └─> Response: { \"status\": \"Pending\" | \"Ready\" | \"Error\", ... }\n\n3. When Ready, download result URL\n   └─> URL expires in 10 minutes - download immediately\n```\n\n## Related\n\n- **Prompting best practices** (T2I, I2I, typography, colors): see the **flux-best-practices** skill\n- **Multi-reference patterns** (character consistency, style transfer, pose guidance): see `flux-best-practices/rules/multi-reference-editing.md`\n\n## References\n\n- [references/api-key-setup.md](references/api-key-setup.md) - **API key creation and configuration**\n- [references/endpoints.md](references/endpoints.md) - Complete endpoint documentation\n- [references/polling-patterns.md](references/polling-patterns.md) - Async polling implementation\n- [references/rate-limiting.md](references/rate-limiting.md) - Rate limit handling strategies\n- [references/error-handling.md](references/error-handling.md) - Error codes and recovery\n- [references/webhook-integration.md](references/webhook-integration.md) - Webhook setup and security\n\n### Code Examples\n\n> **Note:** cURL examples are preferred by default as they work universally without requiring Python or Node.js. Use language-specific clients when building production applications.\n\n- [references/code-examples/curl-examples.sh](references/code-examples/curl-examples.sh) - **cURL examples (recommended)**\n- [references/code-examples/python-client.py](references/code-examples/python-client.py) - Python client\n- [references/code-examples/typescript-client.ts](references/code-examples/typescript-client.ts) - TypeScript client\n\n## Quick Start Example\n\n### 1. Submit Generation Request\n\n```bash\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://api.bfl.ai/v1/flux-2-pro\" \\\n  -H \"x-key: $BFL_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"prompt\": \"A serene mountain landscape at sunset\", \"width\": 1024, \"height\": 1024}''\n```\n\nResponse:\n\n```json\n{ \"id\": \"abc123\", \"polling_url\": \"https://api.bfl.ai/v1/get_result?id=abc123\" }\n```\n\n### 2. Poll for Result\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"POLLING_URL\" -H \"x-key: $BFL_API_KEY\"\n```\n\nResponse when ready:\n\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"Ready\", \"result\": { \"sample\": \"https://...\", \"seed\": 1234 } }\n```\n\n### 3. Download Image\n\n```bash\ncurl -s -o output.png \"IMAGE_URL\"\n```\n\n> **Tip:** Result URLs expire in 10 minutes. Download immediately after status becomes `Ready`.\n\n### 4. Multi-Reference Example\n\nCombine elements from multiple images:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://api.bfl.ai/v1/flux-2-pro\" \\\n  -H \"x-key: $BFL_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"prompt\": \"The cat from image 1 sitting in the cozy room from image 2\",\n    \"input_image\": \"https://example.com/cat.jpg\",\n    \"input_image_2\": \"https://example.com/room.jpg\",\n    \"width\": 1024,\n    \"height\": 1024\n  }''\n```\n\nReference images by number in your prompt. See [Multi-Reference I2I](#multi-reference-i2i) for limits and patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:26:00.553Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Agents integrating high-fidelity FLUX image generation and editing workflows.","zh":"适用于集成高保真FLUX图像生成和编辑工作流的AI代理的必备条件。","ja":"高精度のFLUXイメージ生成および編集ワークフローを統合するAIエージェントに不可欠。","ko":"고화질 FLUX 이미지 생성 및 편집 워크플로를 통합하는 AI 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de IA que integran flujos de trabajo de generación y edición de imágenes de alta fidelidad FLUX.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents IA qui intègrent des flux de travail de génération et d''édition d''images FLUX de haute fidélité.","de":"Wesentlich für KI-Agents, die Arbeitsabläufe für die Generierung und Bearbeitung von FLUX-Bildern mit hoher Auflösung integrieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA que integram fluxos de trabalho de geração e edição de imagens FLUX de alta fidelidade.","ru":"Необходим для агентов ИИ, интегрирующих рабочие процессы генерации и редактирования изображений FLUX высокого разрешения.","ar":"أساسي لموکل ای ای التي تدمج تدفقات العمل لتوليد و تحرير الصور FLUX عالية الدقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct integration with Black Forest Labs'' FLUX models for programmatic image generation and processing, following the agentskills.io specification. Provides structured prompting guidelines and API patterns for reliable image operations.","zh":"实现直接与Black Forest Labs的FLUX模型集成，用于程序化图像生成和处理，遵循agentskills.io规范。提供结构化提示指南和API模式，用于可靠的图像操作。","ja":"Black Forest LabsのFLUXモデルとの直接統合を可能にし、agentskills.ioの仕様に従ったプログラムによる画像生成および処理を実現します。信頼性の高い画像操作のための構造化されたプロンプトガイドラインとAPIパターンを提供します。","ko":"Black Forest Labs의 FLUX 모델과 직접 통합하여 agentskills.io 사양에 따라 프로그래밍 방식으로 이미지 생성 및 처리를 가능하게 합니다. 안정적인 이미지 작업을 위한 구조화된 프롬프트 지침과 API 패턴을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la integración directa con los modelos FLUX de Black Forest Labs para la generación y procesamiento de imágenes programáticas, siguiendo la especificación de agentskills.io. Proporciona directrices de solicitud estructuradas y patrones de API para operaciones de imagen confiables.","fr":"Permet une intégration directe avec les modèles FLUX de Black Forest Labs pour la génération et le traitement d''images programmiques, suivant la spécification agentskills.io. Fournit des directives de sollicitation structurées et des modèles d''API pour des opérations d''image fiables.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Integration mit den FLUX-Modellen von Black Forest Labs für die programmatische Bildgenerierung und -verarbeitung, gemäß der Spezifikation von agentskills.io. Bietet strukturierte Prompt-Richtlinien und API-Muster für zuverlässige Bildoperationen.","pt":"Permite a integração direta com os modelos FLUX dos Laboratórios Black Forest para geração e processamento de imagens programáticos, seguindo a especificação agentskills.io. Fornece diretrizes de prompting estruturadas e padrões de API para operações de imagem confiáveis.","ru":"Позволяет直接 интегрироваться с моделями FLUX от Black Forest Labs для программной генерации и обработки изображений, следуя спецификации agentskills.io. Предоставляет структурированные рекомендации по запросам и шаблоны API для надежных операций с изображениями.","ar":"یمکن التكامل المباشر مع نماذج FLUX من معاملات.Black Forest للتحكم البرمجي في توليد و معالجة الصور ، و متابعة مواصفات agentskills.io. تقدم إرشادات محددة لتحفيز و أنماط واجهة البرمجة التطبيقات من أجل عمليات الصور الموثوقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating images from text prompts via FLUX API","Processing batch image edits through API endpoints","Automating immediate download of generated images before URL expiration"],"zh":["通过FLUX API从文本提示生成图像","通过API端点批量处理图像编辑","自动下载生成的图像，以免URL过期"],"ja":["FLUX APIを使用してテキストプロンプトからイメージを生成する","APIエンドポイントを使用してバッチイメージ編集を処理する","生成されたイメージのURLが期限切れになる前に自動ダウンロードする"],"ko":["FLUX API를 사용하여 텍스트 프롬프트에서 이미지 생성","API 엔드포인트를 통해 일괄 이미지 편집 처리","생성된 이미지의 URL이 만료되기 전에 자동 다운로드"],"es":["Generar imágenes a partir de solicitudes de texto mediante la API de FLUX","Procesar ediciones de imágenes por lotes a través de puntos de conexión de API","Automatizar la descarga inmediata de imágenes generadas antes de la expiración de la URL"],"fr":["Générer des images à partir de sollicitations de texte via l''API FLUX","Traiter des éditions d''images par lots via des points de terminaison d''API","Automatiser le téléchargement immédiat d''images générées avant l''expiration de l''URL"],"de":["Bilder aus Textanfragen über die FLUX-API generieren","Batch-Bildbearbeitungen über API-Endpunkte verarbeiten","Sofortigen Download generierter Bilder vor Ablauf der URL automatisieren"],"pt":["Gerar imagens a partir de prompts de texto via API FLUX","Processar edições de imagem em lote por meio de endpoints de API","Automatizar o download imediato de imagens geradas antes do vencimento da URL"],"ru":["Генерировать изображения из текстовых запросов через API FLUX","Обрабатывать пакетные редактирования изображений через конечные точки API","Автоматизировать немедленную загрузку сгенерированных изображений до истечения срока действия URL"],"ar":["توليد الصور من التحفيزات النصية من خلال واجهة برمجة التطبيقات FLUX","معالجة تحريرات الصور بشكل دوري من خلال نقاط النهاية لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات","التحكم الآلي في تحميل الصور المتولدة على الفور قبل انتهاء صلاحية الرابط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires BFL_API_KEY environment variable","Generated image URLs expire within 10 minutes","Needs immediate download capability post-generation"],"zh":["需要BFL_API_KEY环境变量","生成的图像URL在10分钟内过期","需要生成后立即下载的功能"],"ja":["BFL_API_KEY環境変数が必要","生成されたイメージURLは10分以内に期限切れになる","生成後すぐにダウンロードする機能が必要"],"ko":["BFL_API_KEY 환경 변수가 필요","생성된 이미지 URL은 10분 이내에 만료","생성 후 즉시 다운로드 기능이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la variable de entorno BFL_API_KEY","Las URL de las imágenes generadas caducan en 10 minutos","Necesita capacidad de descarga inmediata después de la generación"],"fr":["Nécessite la variable d''environnement BFL_API_KEY","Les URL des images générées expirent dans 10 minutes","Nécessite une fonctionnalité de téléchargement immédiat après la génération"],"de":["Benötigt die Umgebungsvariable BFL_API_KEY","Die URLs der generierten Bilder verfallen nach 10 Minuten","Benötigt die Fähigkeit zum sofortigen Download nach der Generierung"],"pt":["Exige a variável de ambiente BFL_API_KEY","As URLs de imagens geradas expiram dentro de 10 minutos","Necessita de capacidade de download imediato após a geração"],"ru":["Требует переменной среды BFL_API_KEY","Сгенерированные URL-адреса изображений истекают через 10 минут","Требует возможности немедленной загрузки после генерации"],"ar":["يتطلب متغير بيئة BFL_API_KEY","تنتهي صلاحية روابط الصور المتولدة في غضون 10 دقائق","يحتاج إلى القدرة على التحميل الفوري بعد التوليد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":90}');
