성 및 발행 지원","특정 콘텐츠 형식 규칙 지원"],"es":["Crear artículos largos en X","Formato específico con Draft.js editor","Patrones virales comprobados","Publicación directa en X","Reglas de formato críticas para el éxito"],"fr":["Créer des articles longs sur X","Format spécifique avec l''éditeur Draft.js","Modèles viraux éprouvés","Publication directe sur X","Règles de formatage critiques pour le succès"],"de":["Erstellen von langen Artikeln auf X","Spezifisches Format mit Draft.js-Editor","Bewährte virale Muster","Direkte Veröffentlichung auf X","Kritische Formatierungsregeln für den Erfolg"],"pt":["Criação de artigos longos com padrões comprovados de viralidade","Utilização do editor Draft.js com regras específicas de formatação de conteúdo","Line breaks equivalentes a quebras de parágrafo","Sentenças devem ser unidas em uma única linha","Uso de texto puro, não markdown"],"ru":["Создание длинных статей с проверенными вирусными шаблонами","Использование редактора Draft.js с особыми правилами форматирования контента","Переходы строк эквивалентны разрывам абзаца","Предложения должны быть объединены в одну строку","Использование простого текста, не markdown"],"ar":["إنشاء مقالات طويلة بأشكال مُثبتة من الفيروسية","استخدام محرر Draft.js مع قواعد محددة لتنسيق المحتوى","الأسطر المنفصلة تعادل فاصل الفقرات","الجمل يجب أن تكون متصلة في سطر واحد","استخدام النص العادي، وليس markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["X Articles","推文长文","内容格式化规则","Draft.js 编辑器","富文本格式","创建和发布推文长文","开发者工具","技术文档"],"ja":["X Articles","ツイート長文","コンテンツフォーマットルール","Draft.js エディター","リッチテキスト形式","ツイート長文の作成と公開","開発者ツール","技術文書"],"ko":["X Articles","트위터 장문","콘텐츠 형식 규칙","Draft.js 편집기","리치 텍스트 형식","트위터 장문 작성 및 발행","개발자 도구","기술 문서"],"es":["artículos virales","X Articles","creación de contenido","formato de artículo","patrones virales","Draft.js editor","publicación en X"],"fr":["articles viraux","X Articles","création de contenu","format d''article","modèles viraux","éditeur Draft.js","publication sur X"],"de":["virale Artikel","X Articles","Erstellung von Inhalten","Artikelformat","virale Muster","Draft.js-Editor","Veröffentlichung auf X"],"pt":["x-articles","artigos virais","criação de conteúdo","editor Draft.js","formatação de conteúdo","padrões de viralidade","desenvolvimento de conteúdo","estratégias de marketing"],"ru":["x-articles","вирусные статьи","создание контента","редактор Draft.js","форматирование контента","вирусные шаблоны","разработка контента","стратегии маркетинга"],"ar":["x-articles","مقالات فيروسية","إنشاء محتوى","محرر Draft.js","تنسيق المحتوى","أشكال فيروسية","تطوير المحتوى","استراتيجيات التسويق"]}},"owner":"sundial-org","repo":"awesome-openclaw-skills","repoPath":"sundial-org/awesome-openclaw-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"x-articles","description":"Create and publish X (Twitter) Articles with viral formatting, hook patterns, and browser automation. Handles Draft.js quirks, embed limitations, and image uploads.","version":"1.0.1","bodyPreview":"# X Articles Skill\n\nCreate, format, and publish long-form articles on X (Twitter) with proven viral patterns.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Content Formatting Rules (CRITICAL)\n\nX Articles uses Draft.js editor with specific quirks:\n\n1. **Line breaks = paragraph breaks** - Each newline creates a new paragraph block with spacing\n2. **Join sentences on ONE LINE** - All sentences in the same paragraph must be on a single line\n3. **Use plain text, not markdown** - X Articles uses rich text, not markdown\n4.","body":"# X Articles Skill\n\nCreate, format, and publish long-form articles on X (Twitter) with proven viral patterns.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Content Formatting Rules (CRITICAL)\n\nX Articles uses Draft.js editor with specific quirks:\n\n1. **Line breaks = paragraph breaks** - Each newline creates a new paragraph block with spacing\n2. **Join sentences on ONE LINE** - All sentences in the same paragraph must be on a single line\n3. **Use plain text, not markdown** - X Articles uses rich text, not markdown\n4. **No em dashes (—)** - Replace with colons or rewrite sentences\n\n**Wrong:**\n```\nSentence one.\nSentence two.\nSentence three.\n```\n\n**Right:**\n```\nSentence one. Sentence two. Sentence three.\n```\n\n### Embed Limitation (IMPORTANT)\n\n**Embedded posts ALWAYS render at the END of the content block, not inline.**\n\nWorkarounds:\n- Structure article to reference \"see posts below\"\n- Accept visual flow: text → text → embeds at bottom\n- Use `Insert > Posts` menu (don''t paste URLs)\n\n### Image Specs\n\n| Type | Aspect Ratio | Recommended Size |\n|------|--------------|------------------|\n| Cover/Header | 5:2 | 1792x716 or similar |\n| Inline images | 16:9 or 4:3 | 1792x1024 (DALL-E HD) |\n\n## Viral Article Structure\n\n### The Template\n\n```\nHOOK (hit insecurity or opportunity)\n\nWHAT IT IS (1-2 paragraphs with social proof)\n\nWHY MOST PEOPLE WON''T DO IT (address objections)\n\nTHE [X]-MINUTE GUIDE\n- Step 1 (time estimate)\n- Step 2 (time estimate)\n- ...\n\nYOUR FIRST [N] WINS (immediate value)\n- Win 1: copy-paste example\n- Win 2: copy-paste example\n\nTHE COST (value comparison)\n\nWHAT TO DO AFTER (next steps)\n\nTHE WINDOW (urgency)\n\nCTA (soft or hard)\n```\n\n### Hook Patterns That Work\n\n**Insecurity/FOMO:**\n```\neveryone''s talking about X... and you''re sitting there wondering if you missed the window\n```\n\n**Big Opportunity:**\n```\nthis is the biggest opportunity of our lifetime\n```\n\n**News Hook:**\n```\nX just open sourced the algo. Here''s what it means for you:\n```\n\n**RIP Pattern:**\n```\nRIP [profession]. This AI tool will [action] in seconds.\n```\n\n**WTF Pattern:**\n```\nWTF!! This AI Agent [does amazing thing]. Here''s how:\n```\n\n**Personal Story:**\n```\nWhen I was young, I was always drawn to people who...\n```\n\n### CTA Patterns\n\n**Hard CTA (engagement bait):**\n```\nRT + follow + reply ''KEYWORD'' and I''ll send the cheat sheet\n```\n\n**Soft CTA:**\n```\nIf you take this advice and build something, let me know!\n```\n\n**Simple:**\n```\nFeel free to leave a like and RT if this helped.\n```\n\n## Style Guide\n\n### Damian Player Style (Tactical)\n- All lowercase (deliberate)\n- Urgent, tactical tone\n- 1500+ words\n- Heavy step-by-step detail\n- Hard CTA with lead magnet\n\n### Alex Finn Style (Motivational)\n- Normal capitalization\n- Warm, motivational tone\n- 800-1200 words\n- Mix of WHY and HOW\n- Soft CTA + product links\n\n### Dan Koe Style (Philosophical)\n- Long-form essay (2000+ words)\n- Personal storytelling opener\n- Named frameworks (\"The Pyramid Principle\")\n- Deep teaching, not just tactics\n- Newsletter CTA\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n- Short articles under 500 words\n- Facts without story/emotion\n- No clear sections or headers\n- No objection handling\n- No immediate wins section\n- No CTA\n- Generic AI-sounding language\n- Em dashes (—) everywhere\n- Excessive emojis\n- Pasting tweet URLs instead of using Insert menu\n\n## Browser Automation (agent-browser)\n\n### Prerequisites\n- clawd browser running on CDP port 18800\n- Logged into X on the browser\n\n### Navigate to Article Editor\n```bash\n# Open new article\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 navigate \"https://x.com/compose/article\"\n\n# Take snapshot to see current state\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 snapshot\n```\n\n### Paste Content\n```bash\n# Put content in clipboard\ncat article.txt | pbcopy\n\n# Click content area, select all, paste\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 click ''[contenteditable=\"true\"]''\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 press \"Meta+a\"\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 press \"Meta+v\"\n```\n\n### Upload Cover Image\n```bash\n# Upload to file input\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 upload ''input[type=\"file\"]'' /path/to/cover.png\n\n# Wait for Edit media dialog, click Apply\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 snapshot | grep -i apply\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 click @e5  # Apply button ref\n```\n\n### Publish\n```bash\n# Find and click Publish button\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 snapshot | grep -i publish\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 click @e35  # Publish button ref\n\n# Confirm in dialog\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 click @e5   # Confirm\n```\n\n### Cleanup (Important!)\n```bash\n# Close tab after publishing\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 tab list\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 tab close 1\n```\n\n### Troubleshooting: Stale Element Refs\n\nIf clicks fail due to stale refs, use JS evaluate:\n```bash\nagent-browser --cdp 18800 evaluate \"(function() { \n  const btns = document.querySelectorAll(''button''); \n  for (let btn of btns) { \n    if (btn.innerText.includes(''Publish'')) { \n      btn.click(); \n      return ''clicked''; \n    } \n  } \n  return ''not found''; \n})()\"\n```\n\n## Content Preparation Script\n\n### Convert Markdown to X-Friendly Format\n\n```bash\n# scripts/format-for-x.sh\n#!/bin/bash\n# Converts markdown to X Articles format\n\nINPUT=\"$1\"\nOUTPUT=\"${2:-${INPUT%.md}-x-ready.txt}\"\n\ncat \"$INPUT\" | \\\n  # Remove markdown headers, keep text\n  sed ''s/^## /\\n/g'' | \\\n  sed ''s/^### /\\n/g'' | \\\n  sed ''s/^# /\\n/g'' | \\\n  # Remove markdown bold/italic\n  sed ''s/\\*\\*//g'' | \\\n  sed ''s/\\*//g'' | \\\n  # Remove em dashes\n  sed ''s/ — /: /g'' | \\\n  sed ''s/—/:/g'' | \\\n  # Join lines within paragraphs (keeps blank lines as separators)\n  awk ''BEGIN{RS=\"\"; FS=\"\\n\"; ORS=\"\\n\\n\"} {gsub(/\\n/, \" \"); print}'' \\\n  > \"$OUTPUT\"\n\necho \"Created: $OUTPUT\"\n```\n\n## Pre-Publish Checklist\n\n- [ ] Hook grabs attention in first line\n- [ ] Objections addressed early\n- [ ] Step-by-step with time estimates\n- [ ] Immediate wins section included\n- [ ] CTA at the end\n- [ ] No em dashes (—)\n- [ ] Sentences joined on single lines\n- [ ] Cover image 5:2 aspect ratio\n- [ ] Embeds referenced as \"see below\"\n- [ ] Proofread for AI-sounding language\n\n## Tweetable Quote Patterns\n\nFor promoting your article:\n\n**Result + Cost:**\n```\nI gave an AI agent full access to my MacBook. It checks email, manages calendar, pushes code. Costs $20/month. A VA costs $2000.\n```\n\n**You Don''t Need X:**\n```\nYou don''t need a Mac Mini. You don''t need a server. I''m running my AI agent on an old MacBook Air from a drawer.\n```\n\n**Gap Warning:**\n```\nThe gap between ''has AI agent'' and ''doesn''t'' is about to get massive. I set mine up in 15 minutes.\n```\n\n**Urgency:**\n```\nMost people will bookmark this and never set it up. Don''t be most people. The window is closing.\n```\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n1. **Write article** in markdown with clear sections\n2. **Run format script** to convert to X-friendly plain text\n3. **Generate cover image** with DALL-E (1792x716 or 5:2 ratio)\n4. **Open X article editor** via browser automation\n5. **Paste content** and add section headers manually in editor\n6. **Upload cover image** via file input\n7. **Add inline images** at section breaks\n8. **Insert embeds** (they''ll appear at bottom)\n9. **Preview and proofread**\n10. **Publish**\n11. **Post promotional tweet** with hook + article link\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `bird` - X/Twitter CLI for posting tweets\n- `de-ai-ify` - Remove AI jargon from text\n- `ai-pdf-builder` - Generate PDFs (for lead magnets)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:26:51.045Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing to create and publish viral long-form articles on Twitter","zh":"非常适合需要在Twitter上创建和发布长篇病毒式文章的社交媒体代理","ja":"Twitter上で長文のウイルス性記事を作成して公開する必要があるソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適","ko":"트위터에서 길고 바이러스성 기사를 작성 및 게시해야 하는 소셜 미디어 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de medios sociales que necesitan crear y publicar artículos largos virales en Twitter","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de médias sociaux ayant besoin de créer et de publier des articles longs viraux sur Twitter","de":"Perfekt für Social-Media-Agenten, die virale lange Artikel auf Twitter erstellen und veröffentlichen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de mídia social que precisam criar e publicar artigos longos virais no Twitter","ru":"Идеально для социальных медиа-агентов, которым необходимо создавать и публиковать вирусные длинные статьи в Twitter","ar":"مثالي لعميل وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء ونشر مقالات طويلة فيريوس على تويتر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and format engaging content using Draft.js editor with rich text capabilities, plain text formatting, and proven viral patterns, while adhering to critical content formatting rules such as line breaks for paragraph breaks and joining sentences on a single line","zh":"赋予代理生成和格式化引人入胜的内容，使用具有丰富文本功能、纯文本格式和成熟的病毒模式的Draft.js编辑器，同时遵守关键的内容格式规则，例如行间隔符和单行连接句子","ja":"エージェントが、Draft.jsエディターを使用して豊富なテキスト機能、プレーンテキストのフォーマット、そして確立されたウイルスパターンで魅力的コンテンツを生成、フォーマットできるようにし、同時に重要なコンテンツフォーマット規則、例えば段落の改行や単行の文の結合に従う","ko":"에이전트가 Draft.js 편집기를 사용하여 풍부한 텍스트 기능, 평면 텍스트 형식 및 확립된 바이러스 패턴을 사용하여 매력적인 콘텐츠를 생성하고 형식을 지정할 수 있도록 하며, 동시에 중요한 콘텐츠 형식 규칙, 즉 단락의 줄 바꿈 및 단일 행의 문장 결합을 준수","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y dar formato a contenido atractivo utilizando el editor Draft.js con capacidades de texto rico, formato de texto plano y patrones virales probados, mientras se adhieren a reglas críticas de formato de contenido como saltos de línea para saltos de párrafo y unir oraciones en una sola línea","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de formater du contenu engageant en utilisant l''éditeur Draft.js avec des capacités de texte riche, un formatage de texte plat et des modèles viraux éprouvés, tout en respectant des règles de formatage de contenu critiques telles que les sauts de ligne pour les sauts de paragraphe et le regroupement de phrases sur une seule ligne","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, engagierenden Inhalt zu generieren und zu formatieren, indem sie den Draft.js-Editor mit Rich-Text-Funktionen, Plain-Text-Formatierung und bewährten viralen Mustern verwenden, während sie kritischen Inhaltformatierungsregeln wie Zeilenumbrüchen für Absatzumbrüche und dem Zusammenfügen von Sätzen in einer einzigen Zeile entsprechen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e formatar conteúdo atraente usando o editor Draft.js com recursos de texto rico, formatação de texto puro e padrões virais comprovados, enquanto adere às regras críticas de formatação de conteúdo, como quebras de linha para quebras de parágrafo e juntar frases em uma linha única","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и форматировать увлекательный контент с помощью редактора Draft.js с функциями богатого текста, форматирования обычного текста и проверенных вирусных шаблонов, при этом соблюдая критические правила форматирования контента, такие как разрывы строк для разрывов абзацев и соединение предложений в одну строку","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من توليد وتشكيل محتوى جذاب باستخدام محرر Draft.js مع إمكانيات نص غني وتنسيق نص عادي وأنماط فيريوس مثبتة ، في حين الالتزام بقواعد تنسيق المحتوى الحرجة مثل كسر السطر لفواصل الفقرة وربط الجمل في سطر واحد"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and publishing long-form Twitter articles","Formatting content with Draft.js editor for optimal engagement","Applying proven viral patterns to increase article reach"],"zh":["创建并发布Twitter长篇文章","使用Draft.js编辑器格式化内容以获得最佳参与度","应用成熟的病毒模式以增加文章的传播范围"],"ja":["Twitter長文記事の作成と公開","Draft.jsエディターを使用したコンテンツのフォーマットによるエンゲージメントの最適化","確立されたウイルスパターンの適用による記事のリーチの増加"],"ko":["트위터ยาว문서의 생성 및 게시","Draft.js 편집기를 사용한 콘텐츠 형식 지정에 의한 참여의 최적화","확립된 바이러스 패턴의 적용에 의한 기사의 도달 범위의 증가"],"es":["Creación y publicación de artículos largos de Twitter","Formato de contenido con el editor Draft.js para un compromiso óptimo","Aplicación de patrones virales probados para aumentar el alcance del artículo"],"fr":["Création et publication d''articles longs Twitter","Formatage de contenu avec l''éditeur Draft.js pour un engagement optimal","Application de modèles viraux éprouvés pour augmenter la portée de l''article"],"de":["Erstellung und Veröffentlichung von langen Twitter-Artikeln","Formatierung von Inhalt mit dem Draft.js-Editor für optimale Bindung","Anwendung bewährter viraler Muster, um die Reichweite des Artikels zu erhöhen"],"pt":["Criar e publicar artigos longos do Twitter","Formatar conteúdo com o editor Draft.js para engajamento ótimo","Aplicar padrões virais comprovados para aumentar o alcance do artigo"],"ru":["Создание и публикация длинных статей Twitter","Форматирование контента с помощью редактора Draft.js для оптимального взаимодействия","Применение проверенных вирусных шаблонов для увеличения охвата статьи"],"ar":["إنشاء ونشر مقالات طويلة على تويتر","تنسيق المحتوى مع محرر Draft.js لتحقيق أقصى قدر من التفاعل","تطبيق أنماط فيريوس مثبتة لزيادة انتشار المقال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific content formatting rules","Limited to Twitter platform","Does not support markdown formatting"],"zh":["需要遵守特定的内容格式规则","仅限Twitter平台","不支持markdown格式"],"ja":["特定のコンテンツフォーマット規則に従う必要","Twitterプラットフォームのみ","マークダウンフォーマットのサポートなし"],"ko":["특정 콘텐츠 형식 규칙을 따라야 함","트위터 플랫폼만","마크다운 형식 지원 안 함"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a reglas específicas de formato de contenido","Limitado a la plataforma de Twitter","No admite formato de markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à des règles spécifiques de formatage de contenu","Limité à la plate-forme Twitter","N''a pas de prise en charge du formatage markdown"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung spezifischer Inhaltformatierungsregeln","Begrenzt auf die Twitter-Plattform","Unterstützt keine Markdown-Formatierung"],"pt":["Exige adesão a regras específicas de formatação de conteúdo","Limitado à plataforma Twitter","Não suporta formatação markdown"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конкретных правил форматирования контента","Ограничен платформой Twitter","Не поддерживает форматирование markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بقواعد محددة لتنسيق المحتوى","محدود منصة تويتر","لا يدعم تنسيق markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HSn0918/kubernetes-mcp/kubernetes-mcp-usage', 'community', 'HSn0918', 'kubernetes-mcp', 'HSn0918/kubernetes-mcp', 'kubernetes-mcp-usage', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:26:57.718Z', NULL, '{"id":"HSn0918/kubernetes-mcp/kubernetes-mcp-usage","name":"kubernetes-mcp-usage","description":{"zh":"Kubernetes MCP Skill 提供了一种简单的方式来连接和操作 Kubernetes 集群","ja":"Kubernetes MCP Skill は、Kubernetes クラスターに接続して操作するための簡単な方法を提供します","ko":"쿠버네티스 MCP Skill은 쿠버네티스 클러스터에 연결하여操作하는 간단한 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Esta guía de uso de Kubernetes MCP te permite operar Kubernetes a través de kubernetes-mcp, conectar clientes MCP y solucionar problemas.","fr":"Ce guide d''utilisation de Kubernetes MCP vous permet d''exploiter Kubernetes via kubernetes-mcp, de connecter des clients MCP et de résoudre des problèmes.","de":"Diese Anleitung für Kubernetes MCP ermöglicht es Ihnen, Kubernetes über kubernetes-mcp zu betreiben, MCP-Clients zu verbinden und Probleme zu lösen.","pt":"O kubernetes-mcp é uma ferramenta para operar o Kubernetes, permitindo conectar, descobrir recursos e solucionar problemas","ru":"Kubernetes-mcp — это инструмент для работы с Kubernetes, позволяющий подключаться, обнаруживать ресурсы и устранять неполадки","ar":"كوبيرنيتس ميكروبروسيسور هو أداة لتشغيل كوبيرنيتس، مما يسمح بالاتصال واكتشاف الموارد ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Kubernetes MCP 使用指南","ja":"Kubernetes MCP の使用方法","ko":"쿠버네티스 MCP 사용 가이드","es":"Guía de Uso de Kubernetes MCP","fr":"Guide d''Utilisation de Kubernetes MCP","de":"Kubernetes MCP-Anleitung","pt":"Guia de Uso do Kubernetes MCP","ru":"Руководство по использованию Kubernetes MCP","ar":"دليل استخدام كوبيرنيتس MCP","en":"kubernetes-mcp-usage"},"description":{"zh":"Kubernetes MCP Skill 提供了一种简单的方式来连接和操作 Kubernetes 集群","ja":"Kubernetes MCP Skill は、Kubernetes クラスターに接続して操作するための簡単な方法を提供します","ko":"쿠버네티스 MCP Skill은 쿠버네티스 클러스터에 연결하여操作하는 간단한 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Esta guía de uso de Kubernetes MCP te permite operar Kubernetes a través de kubernetes-mcp, conectar clientes MCP y solucionar problemas.","fr":"Ce guide d''utilisation de Kubernetes MCP vous permet d''exploiter Kubernetes via kubernetes-mcp, de connecter des clients MCP et de résoudre des problèmes.","de":"Diese Anleitung für Kubernetes MCP ermöglicht es Ihnen, Kubernetes über kubernetes-mcp zu betreiben, MCP-Clients zu verbinden und Probleme zu lösen.","pt":"O kubernetes-mcp é uma ferramenta para operar o Kubernetes, permitindo conectar, descobrir recursos e solucionar problemas","ru":"Kubernetes-mcp — это инструмент для работы с Kubernetes, позволяющий подключаться, обнаруживать ресурсы и устранять неполадки","ar":"كوبيرنيتس ميكروبروسيسور هو أداة لتشغيل كوبيرنيتس، مما يسمح بالاتصال واكتشاف الموارد ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["连接 MCP 客户端到服务器","发现资源和检查集群状态","检查日志、事件和指标","故障排除和参数匹配"],"ja":["MCP クライアントをサーバーに接続する","リソースの検出とクラスター状態の確認","ログ、イベント、メトリックの確認","トラブルシューティングとパラメーターの整合"],"ko":["MCP 클라이언트를 서버에 연결","리소스 검색 및 클러스터 상태 확인","로그, 이벤트, 메트릭 확인","문제 해결 및 매개 변수 일치"],"es":["Conexión segura a través de stdio, sse o streamable","Descubrimiento de recursos y estado del clúster","Inspección de registros y eventos","Solución de problemas de herramientas y parámetros","Compatibilidad con kubeconfig local"],"fr":["Connexion sécurisée via stdio, sse ou streamable","Découverte de ressources et état du cluster","Inspection des journaux et des événements","Résolution de problèmes d''outils et de paramètres","Compatibilité avec kubeconfig local"],"de":["Sichere Verbindung über stdio, sse oder streamable","Erkennung von Ressourcen und Clusterzustand","Überprüfung von Protokollen und Ereignissen","Lösung von Werkzeug- und Parameterproblemen","Kompatibilität mit lokalem kubeconfig"],"pt":["Conexão ao servidor do Kubernetes","Descoberta de recursos do cluster","Verificação de logs, eventos e métricas","Solução de problemas de ferramentas e parâmetros","Suporte a stdio, sse e streamable"],"ru":["Подключение к серверу Kubernetes","Обнаружение ресурсов кластера","Проверка журналов, событий и метрик","Устранение неполадок инструментов и параметров","Поддержка stdio, sse и streamable"],"ar":["الارتباط بخادم كوبيرنيتس","اكتشاف موارد المجموعة","التحقق من السجلات والأحداث والأرقام","معالجة أخطاء الأدوات والمعلمات","دعم stdio و sse و streamable"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes MCP","Kubernetes 连接","Kubernetes 资源发现","Kubernetes 故障排除","Kubernetes 日志","Kubernetes 事件","Kubernetes 指标"],"ja":["Kubernetes MCP","Kubernetes 接続","Kubernetes リソース検出","Kubernetes トラブルシューティング","Kubernetes ログ","Kubernetes イベント","Kubernetes メトリック"],"ko":["쿠버네티스 MCP","쿠버네티스 연결","쿠버네티스 리소스 검색","쿠버네티스 문제 해결","쿠버네티스 로그","쿠버네티스 이벤트","쿠버네티스 메트릭"],"es":["kubernetes mcp","operar kubernetes","conexión segura","descubrimiento de recursos","solución de problemas","kubeconfig local","stdio","sse","streamable"],"fr":["kubernetes mcp","exploiter kubernetes","connexion sécurisée","découverte de ressources","résolution de problèmes","kubeconfig local","stdio","sse","streamable"],"de":["kubernetes mcp","kubernetes betreiben","sichere verbindung","erkennung von ressourcen","lösung von probleme","lokales kubeconfig","stdio","sse","streamable"],"pt":["kubernetes-mcp","operar kubernetes","conectar kubernetes","descobrir recursos kubernetes","solucionar problemas kubernetes","stdio","sse","streamable"],"ru":["kubernetes-mcp","работа с kubernetes","подключение к kubernetes","обнаружение ресурсов kubernetes","устранение неполадок kubernetes","stdio","sse","streamable"],"ar":["كوبيرنيتس ميكروبروسيسور","تشغيل كوبيرنيتس","الارتباط بكوبيرنيتس","اكتشاف موارد كوبيرنيتس","معالجة أخطاء كوبيرنيتس","stdio","sse","streamable"]}},"owner":"HSn0918","repo":"kubernetes-mcp","repoPath":"HSn0918/kubernetes-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kubernetes-mcp-usage","description":"Usage guide skill for kubernetes-mcp MCP server. Use when connecting the MCP server to clients, troubleshooting tool calls, and selecting the right Kubernetes tools for diagnosis and operations.","bodyPreview":"# Kubernetes MCP Usage Guide\n\n## When to Use\nUse this skill when the user wants to operate Kubernetes through `kubernetes-mcp`:\n- connect MCP client to this server (`stdio`, `sse`, `streamable`);\n- discover resources, inspect cluster state, check logs/events/metrics;\n- troubleshoot failed tool calls and parameter mismatch.\n\n## Connection Checklist\n1. Confirm server is reachable:\n   - `stdio`: binary command works with local kubeconfig.\n   - `streamable`: endpoint is `POST /mcp`.\n2. Confirm Kuber","body":"# Kubernetes MCP Usage Guide\n\n## When to Use\nUse this skill when the user wants to operate Kubernetes through `kubernetes-mcp`:\n- connect MCP client to this server (`stdio`, `sse`, `streamable`);\n- discover resources, inspect cluster state, check logs/events/metrics;\n- troubleshoot failed tool calls and parameter mismatch.\n\n## Connection Checklist\n1. Confirm server is reachable:\n   - `stdio`: binary command works with local kubeconfig.\n   - `streamable`: endpoint is `POST /mcp`.\n2. Confirm Kubernetes auth is valid:\n   - explicit `--kubeconfig` or in-cluster service account.\n3. Prefer smallest-scope query first:\n   - namespace + kind filters before wide cluster scans.\n\n## Recommended Tool Flow\n1. Health and inventory:\n   - `GET_CLUSTER_INFO`\n   - `LIST_NAMESPACES`\n2. Resource location:\n   - `SEARCH_RESOURCES` (supports `name=...`, `label=...`, `annotation=...`, wildcard `*`)\n   - `LIST_K8S_RESOURCES`\n3. Deep inspection:\n   - `GET_K8S_RESOURCE` / `DESCRIBE_K8S_RESOURCE`\n   - `GET_EVENTS`\n4. Runtime diagnosis:\n   - `GET_POD_LOGS`\n   - `GET_POD_METRICS`, `GET_NODE_METRICS`, `GET_TOP_CONSUMERS`\n\n## Practical Query Patterns\n- Find all pods in namespace:\n  - `SEARCH_RESOURCES {\"kinds\":\"Pod\",\"namespaces\":\"mcp-system\",\"query\":\"name=*\"}`\n- Find by label wildcard:\n  - `SEARCH_RESOURCES {\"query\":\"label=app:nginx-*\",\"namespaces\":\"default\"}`\n- Find by annotation:\n  - `SEARCH_RESOURCES {\"query\":\"annotation=team:platform\",\"namespaces\":\"default\"}`\n- List known kind explicitly:\n  - `LIST_K8S_RESOURCES {\"kind\":\"Pod\",\"apiVersion\":\"v1\",\"namespace\":\"default\"}`\n- List namespace resources by discovery:\n  - `LIST_K8S_RESOURCES {\"namespace\":\"default\"}`\n\n## Error Handling Guidance\n- If listing fails with missing `apiVersion`:\n  - provide both `kind` and `apiVersion`, or omit `kind` for discovery listing.\n- If search returns empty unexpectedly:\n  - check `kinds` value (`Pod`/`pods` both accepted),\n  - verify namespace scope,\n  - test with `query:\"name=*\"` first.\n- If metrics tools fail:\n  - confirm metrics-server is installed and accessible.\n\n## Safety\n- Avoid destructive actions (`DELETE`, large apply) unless user explicitly requests.\n- For changes, prefer `VALIDATE_MANIFEST` and `DIFF_MANIFEST` before `APPLY_MANIFEST`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:26:57.718Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing advanced Kubernetes operation capabilities through kubernetes-mcp","zh":"非常适合需要通过kubernetes-mcp实现高级Kubernetes操作能力的云管理代理","ja":"kubernetes-mcpを通じて高度なKubernetes操作機能を必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに最適","ko":"kubernetes-mcp를 통해 고급 Kubernetes操作 기능을 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de Cloud que necesitan capacidades de operación avanzadas de Kubernetes a través de kubernetes-mcp","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion Cloud nécessitant des capacités de fonctionnement avancées de Kubernetes via kubernetes-mcp","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Kubernetes-Betriebsfunktionen über kubernetes-mcp benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que necessitam de recursos avançados de operação do Kubernetes por meio do kubernetes-mcp","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления облачными системами, которым необходимы расширенные возможности операции с Kubernetes через kubernetes-mcp","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل إدارة السحابة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تشغيل كوبيرنيتس المتقدمة من خلال kubernetes-mcp"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to connect MCP clients to servers via stdio, sse, or streamable protocols, enabling resource discovery, cluster state inspection, and log/event/metric checking for efficient troubleshooting of failed tool calls and parameter mismatches","zh":"使代理能够通过stdio、sse或可流化协议将MCP客户端连接到服务器，实现资源发现、集群状态检查和日志/事件/指标检查，以高效地排除故障和工具调用失败及参数不匹配","ja":"エージェントがstdio、sse、またはストリーミング可能なプロトコルを介してMCPクライアントをサーバーに接続できるようにし、リソースの検出、クラスター状態の検査、ログ/イベント/メトリックの確認を可能にし、ツール呼び出し失敗やパラメータの不一致のトラブルシューティングを効率化する","ko":"에이전트가 stdio, sse 또는 스트리밍 가능한 프로토콜을 통해 MCP 클라이언트를 서버에 연결할 수 있도록 하여 리소스 검색, 클러스터 상태 검사 및 로그/이벤트/메트릭 확인을 가능하게 하여 도구 호출 실패 및 매개변수 불일치의 문제 해결을 효율적으로 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes para conectar clientes MCP a servidores a través de protocolos stdio, sse o transmisibles, lo que permite el descubrimiento de recursos, la inspección del estado del clúster y la verificación de registros/eventos/métricas para una resolución de problemas eficiente de llamadas de herramientas fallidas y errores de coincidencia de parámetros","fr":"Permet aux agents de connecter les clients MCP aux serveurs via des protocoles stdio, sse ou transmissibles, ce qui permet la découverte de ressources, l''inspection de l''état du cluster et la vérification des journaux/événements/métriques pour un dépannage efficace des appels d''outils défaillants et des erreurs de correspondance de paramètres","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, MCP-Clients mit Servern über stdio-, sse- oder streambare Protokolle zu verbinden, wodurch die Ressourcenerkennung, die Überprüfung des Clusterzustands und die Überprüfung von Protokollen/Ereignissen/Metriken für eine effiziente Fehlerbehebung von fehlgeschlagenen Toolaufrufen und Parameterübereinstimmungen ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se conectarem a clientes MCP a servidores via stdio, sse ou protocolos transmitíveis, permitindo a descoberta de recursos, inspeção de estado de cluster e verificação de log/evento/métrica para solução de problemas eficaz de chamadas de ferramenta com falha e disparidades de parâmetro","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность подключаться к клиентам MCP к серверам через stdio, sse или потоковые протоколы, что позволяет обнаруживать ресурсы, проверять состояние кластера и контролировать журналы/события/метрики для эффективной отладки неудачных вызовов инструментов и несоответствий параметров","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من الاتصال بالعملاء MCP بالخادم عبر stdio أو sse أو بروتوكولات قابلة للبث، مما يسمح باكتشاف الموارد وتفتيش حالة المجموعة وفحص سجل/حدث/مقياس لتصحيح أخطاء فشل呼وات الأداة واختلافات المعلمات"},"useCases":{"en":["Connecting MCP clients to Kubernetes servers for streamlined cluster management","Discovering resources and inspecting cluster states for proactive issue detection","Troubleshooting failed tool calls and parameter mismatches for enhanced reliability"],"zh":["将MCP客户端连接到Kubernetes服务器以实现集群管理的简化","发现资源并检查集群状态以进行主动问题检测","排除故障和工具调用失败及参数不匹配以提高可靠性"],"ja":["MCPクライアントをKubernetesサーバーに接続してクラスター管理を簡素化する","リソースを検出してクラスター状態を検査して事前に問題を発見する","ツール呼び出し失敗やパラメータの不一致のトラブルシューティングをして信頼性を高める"],"ko":["MCP 클라이언트를 Kubernetes 서버에 연결하여 클러스터 관리를 간소화","리소스를 검색하여 클러스터 상태를 검사하여 사전 문제를 발견","도구 호출 실패 및 매개변수 불일치의 문제 해결을 통해 신뢰성을 향상"],"es":["Conectar clientes MCP a servidores Kubernetes para una administración de clústeres optimizada","Descubrir recursos e inspeccionar estados de clúster para la detección proactiva de problemas","Solucionar errores de llamadas de herramientas y errores de coincidencia de parámetros para una mayor confiabilidad"],"fr":["Connecter les clients MCP aux serveurs Kubernetes pour une gestion de cluster optimisée","Découvrir des ressources et inspecter les états de cluster pour la détection proactive de problèmes","Dépanner les appels d''outils défaillants et les erreurs de correspondance de paramètres pour une fiabilité accrue"],"de":["MCP-Clients mit Kubernetes-Servern für eine optimierte Cluster-Verwaltung verbinden","Ressourcen erkennen und Clusterzustände überprüfen, um proaktive Problemerkennung zu ermöglichen","Fehlschläge von Toolaufrufen und Parameterübereinstimmungen für eine erhöhte Zuverlässigkeit beheben"],"pt":["Conectar clientes MCP a servidores Kubernetes para gerenciamento de cluster otimizado","Descobrir recursos e inspecionar estados de cluster para detecção proativa de problemas","Solucionar problemas de chamadas de ferramenta com falha e disparidades de parâmetro para confiabilidade aprimorada"],"ru":["Подключение клиентов MCP к серверам Kubernetes для оптимизированного управления кластером","Обнаружение ресурсов и проверка состояния кластера для проактивного обнаружения проблем","Отладка неудачных вызовов инструментов и несоответствий параметров для повышения надежности"],"ar":["الاتصال بالعملاء MCP بالخادم كوبيرنيتس لجعل إدارة المجموعة أكثر كفاءة","اكتشاف الموارد وتفتيش حالة المجموعة للكشف المبكر عن المشاكل","حل مشاكل فشل 呼وات الأداة واختلافات المعلمات لتعزيز الموثوقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires reachable Kubernetes server","Limited to kubernetes-mcp protocol","Needs compatible kubeconfig for stdio connections"],"zh":["需要可达的Kubernetes服务器","仅限kubernetes-mcp协议","需要兼容的kubeconfig用于stdio连接"],"ja":["到達可能なKubernetesサーバーが必要","kubernetes-mcpプロトコルに限定","stdio接続用の互換性のあるkubeconfigが必要"],"ko":["도달 가능한 Kubernetes 서버가 필요","kubernetes-mcp 프로토콜로 제한","stdio 연결을 위한 호환 가능한 kubeconfig가 필요"],"es":["Requiere un servidor Kubernetes accesible","Limitado al protocolo kubernetes-mcp","Necesita una kubeconfig compatible para conexiones stdio"],"fr":["Nécessite un serveur Kubernetes accessible","Limité au protocole kubernetes-mcp","Nécessite une kubeconfig compatible pour les connexions stdio"],"de":["Benötigt einen erreichbaren Kubernetes-Server","Begrenzt auf das kubernetes-mcp-Protokoll","Benötigt eine kompatible kubeconfig für stdio-Verbindungen"],"pt":["Exige servidor Kubernetes acessível","Limitado ao protocolo kubernetes-mcp","Necessita de kubeconfig compatível para conexões stdio"],"ru":["Требует доступного сервера Kubernetes","Ограничен протоколом kubernetes-mcp","Требует совместимого kubeconfig для подключений stdio"],"ar":["يتطلب خادم كوبيرنيتس يمكن الوصول إليه","محدود ببروتوكول kubernetes-mcp","يحتاج إلى kubeconfig متوافق لاتصالات stdio"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Lubu-Labs/langchain-agent-skills/langgraph-agent-patterns', 'community', 'Lubu-Labs', 'langchain-agent-skills', 'Lubu-Labs/langchain-agent-skills', 'langgraph-agent-patterns', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:26:28.873Z', NULL, '{"id":"Lubu-Labs/langchain-agent-skills/langgraph-agent-patterns","name":"langgraph-agent-patterns","description":{"zh":"LangGraph LangChain LangSmith","ja":"LangGraph LangChain LangSmith","ko":"LangGraph LangChain LangSmith","es":"LangGraph Agent Patterns es una colección de habilidades optimizadas para asistentes de codificación de IA. Implementa y configura patrones de coordinación de agentes para aplicaciones LangGraph.","fr":"LangGraph Agent Patterns est une collection de compétences optimisées pour les assistants de codage de l''IA. Implémenter et configurer des modèles de coordination d''agents pour les applications LangGraph.","de":"LangGraph Agent Patterns ist eine Sammlung von optimierten Fähigkeiten für KI-Coding-Assistenten. Implementieren und konfigurieren Sie Koordinierungsmuster für LangGraph-Anwendungen.","pt":"Implemente padrões de coordenação de agentes para aplicações LangGraph e melhore a colaboração entre agentes. Escolha o padrão certo com base nas necessidades de coordenação","ru":"Реализуйте шаблоны координации агентов для приложений LangGraph и улучшите сотрудничество между агентами. Выберите правильный шаблон на основе потребностей координации","ar":"نفذ أنماط تنسيق الوكلاء لأプリكات LangGraph وتحسين التعاون بين الوكلاء. اختر النمط الصحيح بناءً على احتياجات التنسيق","en":"A collection of agent-optimized LangChain, LangGraph and LangSmith skills for AI coding assistants."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"LangGraph ","ja":"LangGraph","ko":"LangGraph ","es":"Patrones de agente LangGraph para desarrolladores","fr":"Modèles d''agent LangGraph pour les développeurs","de":"LangGraph-Agenten-Muster für Entwickler","pt":"Padrões de Agentes LangGraph para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Шаблоны агентов LangGraph для разработчиков","ar":"نماط وكلاء LangGraph لل مطورين","en":"langgraph-agent-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"LangGraph LangChain LangSmith","ja":"LangGraph LangChain LangSmith","ko":"LangGraph LangChain LangSmith","es":"LangGraph Agent Patterns es una colección de habilidades optimizadas para asistentes de codificación de IA. Implementa y configura patrones de coordinación d...","fr":"LangGraph Agent Patterns est une collection de compétences optimisées pour les assistants de codage de l''IA. Implémenter et configurer des modèles de coordin...","de":"LangGraph Agent Patterns ist eine Sammlung von optimierten Fähigkeiten für KI-Coding-Assistenten. Implementieren und konfigurieren Sie Koordinierungsmuster f...","pt":"Implemente padrões de coordenação de agentes para aplicações LangGraph e melhore a colaboração entre agentes. Escolha o padrão certo com base nas necessidade...","ru":"Реализуйте шаблоны координации агентов для приложений LangGraph и улучшите сотрудничество между агентами. Выберите правильный шаблон на основе потребностей к...","ar":"نفذ أنماط تنسيق الوكلاء لأプリكات LangGraph وتحسين التعاون بين الوكلاء. اختر النمط الصحيح بناءً على احتياجات التنسيق","en":"A collection of agent-optimized LangChain, LangGraph and LangSmith skills for AI coding assistants."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of agent-optimized LangChain, LangGraph and LangSmith skills for AI coding assistants."},"features":{"zh":["LangGraph","LangChain","LangSmith","Supervisor","Router","Orchestr"],"ja":["LangGraph","LangChain","LangSmith","Supervisor","Router","Orchestr"],"ko":["LangGraph","LangChain","LangSmith","Supervisor","Router","Orchestr"],"es":["Implementación de patrones de coordinación de agentes","Configuración de flujos de trabajo complejos","Colaboración entre agentes","Rutas de enrutamiento dinámico","Tareas independientes y categorización simple"],"fr":["Implémentation de modèles de coordination d''agents","Configuration de flux de travail complexes","Collaboration entre les agents","Routes de routage dynamique","Tâches indépendantes et catégorisation simple"],"de":["Implementierung von Koordinierungsmustern für Agenten","Konfiguration von komplexen Workflows","Zusammenarbeit zwischen den Agenten","Dynamische Routing-Routen","Unabhängige Aufgaben und einfache Kategorisierung"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões de coordenação de agentes","Escolha do padrão certo com base nas necessidades de coordenação","Melhoria da colaboração entre agentes","Suporte a fluxos de trabalho complexos e rotas dinâmicas","Integração com LangChain, LangGraph e LangSmith"],"ru":["Реализация шаблонов координации агентов","Выбор правильного шаблона на основе потребностей координации","Улучшение сотрудничества между агентами","Поддержка сложных рабочих процессов и динамических маршрутов","Интеграция с LangChain, LangGraph и LangSmith"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط تنسيق الوكلاء","اختيار النمط الصحيح بناءً على احتياجات التنسيق","تحسين التعاون بين الوكلاء","دعم سلاسل عمل معقدة وطرق ديناميكية","التكامل مع LangChain و LangGraph و LangSmith"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangGraph","LangChain","LangSmith","AI","","Supervisor","Router","Orchestr"],"ja":["LangGraph","LangChain","LangSmith","AI","","Supervisor","Router","Orchestr"],"ko":["LangGraph","LangChain","LangSmith","AI","","Supervisor","Router","Orchestr"],"es":["patrones de agente LangGraph","desarrollo de aplicaciones LangGraph","coordinación de agentes","asistentes de codificación de IA","LangChain","LangSmith","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["modèles d''agent LangGraph","développement d''applications LangGraph","coordination d''agents","assistants de codage de l''IA","LangChain","LangSmith","développement de logiciels"],"de":["LangGraph-Agenten-Muster","Entwicklung von LangGraph-Anwendungen","Koordinierung von Agenten","KI-Coding-Assistenten","LangChain","LangSmith","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["padrões de agentes LangGraph","coordenação de agentes","aplicações LangGraph","assistente de codificação de IA","LangChain","LangGraph","LangSmith"],"ru":["шаблоны агентов LangGraph","координация агентов","приложения LangGraph","помощник кодирования ИИ","LangChain","LangGraph","LangSmith"],"ar":["نماط وكلاء LangGraph","تنسيق الوكلاء","أプリكات LangGraph","مساعد كتابة الشفرة الذكية","LangChain","LangGraph","LangSmith"]}},"owner":"Lubu-Labs","repo":"langchain-agent-skills","repoPath":"Lubu-Labs/langchain-agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langgraph-agent-patterns","description":"Implement multi-agent coordination patterns (supervisor-subagent, router, orchestrator-worker, handoffs) for LangGraph applications. Use when users want to (1) implement multi-agent systems, (2) coordinate multiple specialized agents, (3) choose between coordination patterns, (4) set up supervisor-subagent workflows, (5) implement router-based agent selection, (6) create parallel orchestrator-worker patterns, (7) implement agent handoffs, (8) design state schemas for multi-agent systems, or (9) debug multi-agent coordination issues.","bodyPreview":"# LangGraph Agent Patterns\n\nImplement and configure multi-agent coordination patterns for LangGraph applications.\n\n## Pattern Selection\n\nChoose the right pattern based on your coordination needs:\n\n| Pattern | Best For | When to Use |\n|---------|----------|-------------|\n| **Supervisor** | Complex workflows, dynamic routing | Agents need to collaborate, routing is context-dependent |\n| **Router** | Simple categorization, independent tasks | One-time routing, deterministic decisions |\n| **Orchestr","body":"# LangGraph Agent Patterns\n\nImplement and configure multi-agent coordination patterns for LangGraph applications.\n\n## Pattern Selection\n\nChoose the right pattern based on your coordination needs:\n\n| Pattern | Best For | When to Use |\n|---------|----------|-------------|\n| **Supervisor** | Complex workflows, dynamic routing | Agents need to collaborate, routing is context-dependent |\n| **Router** | Simple categorization, independent tasks | One-time routing, deterministic decisions |\n| **Orchestrator-Worker** | Parallel execution, high throughput | Independent subtasks, results need aggregation |\n| **Handoffs** | Sequential workflows, context preservation | Clear sequence, each agent builds on previous |\n\n**Quick Decision:**\n- **Dynamic routing needed?** → Supervisor\n- **Tasks can run in parallel?** → Orchestrator-Worker\n- **Simple categorization?** → Router\n- **Linear sequence?** → Handoffs\n\nFor detailed comparison: See references/pattern-comparison.md\n\n## Pattern Implementation Guides\n\n### Supervisor-Subagent Pattern\n\n**Overview:** Central coordinator delegates to specialized subagents based on context.\n\n**Quick Start:**\n\n```bash\n# Generate supervisor graph boilerplate\nuv run scripts/generate_supervisor_graph.py my-team \\\n  --subagents \"researcher,writer,reviewer\"\n\n# TypeScript\nuv run scripts/generate_supervisor_graph.py my-team \\\n  --subagents \"researcher,writer,reviewer\" \\\n  --typescript\n```\n\n**Key Components:**\n1. **State with routing**: `next` field for routing decisions\n2. **Supervisor node**: Makes routing decisions based on context\n3. **Subagent nodes**: Specialized agents with distinct capabilities\n4. **Conditional edges**: Route from supervisor to subagents\n\n**Example Flow:**\n```\nUser Request → Supervisor → Researcher → Supervisor → Writer → Supervisor → FINISH\n```\n\n**For complete implementation:** See references/supervisor-subagent.md\n\n### Router Pattern\n\n**Overview:** One-time routing to specialized agents based on initial request.\n\n**Key Components:**\n1. **State with route**: Single routing decision field\n2. **Router node**: Categorizes request (keyword, LLM, or semantic)\n3. **Specialized agents**: Independent agents for each category\n4. **Conditional routing**: Route to agent, then END\n\n**Example Flow:**\n```\nUser Request → Router → Sales Agent → END\n                   ├→ Support Agent → END\n                   └→ Billing Agent → END\n```\n\n**Routing Strategies:**\n- **Keyword-based**: Fast, simple string matching\n- **LLM-based**: Semantic understanding, flexible\n- **Embedding-based**: Similarity matching\n- **Model-based**: Fine-tuned classifier\n\n**For complete implementation:** See references/router-pattern.md\n\n### Orchestrator-Worker Pattern\n\n**Overview:** Decompose task into parallel subtasks, aggregate results.\n\n**Key Components:**\n1. **State with subtasks**: Task decomposition and results accumulation\n2. **Orchestrator node**: Splits task into independent subtasks\n3. **Worker nodes**: Process subtasks in parallel\n4. **Aggregator node**: Synthesizes results\n5. **Send fan-out**: Return `Send(...)` objects from conditional edges and use a list reducer (for example `Annotated[list[dict], operator.add]`) so worker outputs accumulate\n\n**Example Flow:**\n```\nTask → Orchestrator → Worker 1 ┐\n                  → Worker 2  ├→ Aggregator → Result\n                  → Worker 3 ┘\n```\n\n**Best Practices:**\n- Ensure subtasks are independent\n- Handle worker failures gracefully\n- Limit concurrent workers for resource management\n- Use LLM for result synthesis\n\n**For complete implementation:** See references/orchestrator-worker.md\n\n### Handoffs Pattern\n\n**Overview:** Sequential agent handoffs with context preservation.\n\n**Key Components:**\n1. **State with context**: Shared context across handoffs\n2. **Agent nodes**: Each agent hands off to next\n3. **Handoff logic**: Explicit or conditional handoffs\n4. **Context management**: Preserve and pass information\n\n**Example Flow:**\n```\nRequest → Researcher → Writer → Editor → FINISH\n         (with context preservation)\n```\n\n**Handoff Strategies:**\n- **Explicit**: Agent declares next agent\n- **Conditional**: Based on completion criteria\n- **Circular**: Agents can hand back for revisions\n\n**For complete implementation:** See references/handoffs.md\n\n## Examples\n\nRunnable mini-projects (Python + JavaScript):\n\n- `assets/examples/supervisor-example/`\n- `assets/examples/router-example/`\n- `assets/examples/orchestrator-example/`\n- `assets/examples/handoff-example/`\n\n## State Design for Multi-Agent Patterns\n\nEach pattern requires specific state schema design:\n\n**Supervisor Pattern:**\n```python\nclass SupervisorState(TypedDict):\n    messages: Annotated[list[BaseMessage], add_messages]\n    next: Literal[\"agent1\", \"agent2\", \"FINISH\"]\n    current_agent: str\n```\n\n**Router Pattern:**\n```python\nclass RouterState(TypedDict):\n    messages: list[BaseMessage]\n    route: Literal[\"category1\", \"category2\"]\n```\n\n**Orchestrator-Worker:**\n```python\nimport operator\nclass OrchestratorState(TypedDict):\n    task: str\n    subtasks: list[dict]\n    results: Annotated[list[dict], operator.add]\n```\n\n**Handoffs:**\n```python\nclass HandoffState(TypedDict):\n    messages: Annotated[list[BaseMessage], add_messages]\n    next_agent: str\n    context: dict\n```\n\n**For detailed state patterns:** See references/state-management-patterns.md\n\n## Validation and Visualization\n\n### Validate Graph Structure\n\n```bash\n# Validate agent graph for issues\nuv run scripts/validate_agent_graph.py path/to/graph.py:graph\n\n# Checks for:\n# - Unreachable nodes\n# - Cycles without termination\n# - Dead ends\n# - Invalid routing\n```\n\n### Visualize Graph\n\n```bash\n# Generate Mermaid diagram\nuv run scripts/visualize_graph.py path/to/graph.py:graph --output diagram.md\n\n# View in browser or IDE with Mermaid support\n```\n\n## Common Patterns and Anti-Patterns\n\n### Best Practices\n\n**1. Clear Agent Responsibilities**\n- Define non-overlapping capabilities\n- Document each agent''s purpose\n- Avoid agent duplication\n\n**2. Loop Prevention**\n- Track iteration count in state\n- Set maximum iterations\n- Implement loop detection\n\n**3. Context Management**\n- Summarize context when it grows large\n- Only pass necessary information\n- Use structured context where possible\n\n**4. Error Handling**\n- Validate routing decisions\n- Handle invalid routes gracefully\n- Default to safe fallbacks\n\n### Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n**1. Over-Supervision**\n```python\n# ❌ Bad: Supervisor for simple linear flow\nUser → Supervisor → Agent1 → Supervisor → Agent2 → Supervisor\n\n# ✅ Good: Use handoffs instead\nUser → Agent1 → Agent2 → FINISH\n```\n\n**2. Complex Router Logic**\n```python\n# ❌ Bad: Complex routing rules in router\nif complex_condition_A and (condition_B or condition_C):\n    route = determine_complex_route()\n\n# ✅ Good: Use supervisor with LLM\nroute = llm.invoke(\"Analyze and route: {query}\")\n```\n\n**3. Unmanaged State Growth**\n```python\n# ❌ Bad: Accumulating all messages forever\nmessages: list[BaseMessage]  # Grows unbounded\n\n# ✅ Good: Summarize or limit\nif len(messages) > 20:\n    messages = summarize_context(messages)\n```\n\n## Debugging Multi-Agent Systems\n\n### 1. Trace Agent Flow\n\nUse LangSmith to visualize agent interactions:\n\n```python\nimport os\nos.environ[\"LANGSMITH_TRACING\"] = \"true\"\nos.environ[\"LANGSMITH_API_KEY\"] = \"<your-api-key>\"\nos.environ[\"LANGSMITH_PROJECT\"] = \"multi-agent-debug\"\n\nresult = graph.invoke(input_state)\n```\n\n### 2. Log Routing Decisions\n\nAdd logging to routing nodes:\n\n```python\ndef supervisor_node(state: SupervisorState) -> dict:\n    decision = make_routing_decision(state)\n\n    print(f\"Supervisor routing to: {decision}\")\n    print(f\"Current state: {len(state[''messages''])} messages\")\n    print(f\"Iteration: {state.get(''iteration'', 0)}\")\n\n    return {\"next\": decision}\n```\n\n### 3. Validate Graph Structure\n\n```bash\n# Detect common issues\nuv run scripts/validate_agent_graph.py my_agent/graph.py:graph\n\n# Check for:\n# - Unreachable nodes\n# - Infinite loops\n# - Dead ends\n```\n\n### 4. Visualize Flow\n\n```bash\n# Generate diagram\nuv run scripts/visualize_graph.py my_agent/graph.py:graph -o flow.md\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Latency Optimization\n\n**Supervisor Pattern:**\n- Use faster models for routing (gpt-4o-mini)\n- Cache routing decisions\n- Implement early termination\n\n**Router Pattern:**\n- Use keyword matching for simple cases\n- Cache routing for similar queries\n- Avoid LLM calls when possible\n\n**Orchestrator-Worker:**\n- True parallelization already optimal\n- Limit worker count to avoid rate limits\n- Stream results to aggregator\n\n**Handoffs:**\n- Minimize context size\n- Skip unnecessary handoffs\n- Use cheaper models where appropriate\n\n### Cost Optimization\n\n**Token Usage:**\n- Summarize context regularly\n- Use structured output for reliability\n- Employ cheaper models for simple tasks\n\n**LLM Calls:**\n- Cache routing decisions\n- Use deterministic logic when possible\n- Batch similar requests\n\n**Pattern Selection:**\n- Router < Handoffs < Orchestrator < Supervisor (cost)\n\n## Testing Multi-Agent Patterns\n\n### Unit Test Routing Logic\n\n```python\ndef test_supervisor_routing():\n    \"\"\"Test supervisor routes correctly.\"\"\"\n    state = {\n        \"messages\": [HumanMessage(content=\"Need research\")],\n        \"next\": \"\",\n        \"current_agent\": \"\"\n    }\n\n    result = supervisor_node(state)\n    assert result[\"next\"] == \"researcher\"\n```\n\n### Integration Testing\n\n```python\ndef test_full_workflow():\n    \"\"\"Test complete multi-agent workflow.\"\"\"\n    graph = create_supervisor_graph()\n\n    result = graph.invoke({\n        \"messages\": [HumanMessage(content=\"Write article about AI\")]\n    })\n\n    # Verify agents were called in correct order\n    assert \"researcher\" in result[\"agent_history\"]\n    assert \"writer\" in result[\"agent_history\"]\n```\n\n### Test Graph Structure\n\n```bash\n# Validate before deployment\npython3 scripts/validate_agent_graph.py graph.py:graph\n```\n\n## Migration Between Patterns\n\n### Router to Supervisor\n\nWhen routing logic becomes complex:\n\n```python\n# Before: Complex router\ndef route(query):\n    if complex_rules(query):\n        return category\n\n# After: Supervisor with LLM\ndef supervisor(state):\n    return llm_routing_decision(state)\n```\n\n### Handoffs to Supervisor\n\nWhen need dynamic routing:\n\n```python\n# Before: Fixed sequence\nAgent1 → Agent2 → Agent3\n\n# After: Dynamic routing\nSupervisor ⇄ Agent1/Agent2/Agent3\n```\n\n### Sequential to Parallel\n\nWhen tasks become independent:\n\n```python\n# Before: Sequential\nAgent1 → Agent2 → Agent3\n\n# After: Parallel\nOrchestrator → [Agent1, Agent2, Agent3] → Aggregator\n```\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### Customer Support System\n\n**Pattern:** Router + Supervisor\n```\nRouter → Sales Supervisor → Sales Agents\n     ↓\n     Support Supervisor → Support Agents\n```\n\n### Research & Writing Pipeline\n\n**Pattern:** Supervisor or Handoffs\n```\nSupervisor ⇄ Researcher\n         ⇄ Writer\n         ⇄ Editor\n```\n\n### Data Analysis Pipeline\n\n**Pattern:** Orchestrator-Worker\n```\nOrchestrator → Data Collectors → Aggregator\n```\n\n### Document Processing\n\n**Pattern:** Orchestrator-Worker + Supervisor\n```\nRouter → PDF Orchestrator → Workers → Aggregator\n     ↓\n     DOCX Orchestrator → Workers → Aggregator\n```\n\n## Scripts Reference\n\n### generate_supervisor_graph.py\n\nGenerate supervisor-subagent boilerplate:\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/generate_supervisor_graph.py <name> [options]\n\nOptions:\n  --subagents AGENTS    Comma-separated list (default: researcher,writer,reviewer)\n  --output DIR          Output directory (default: current directory)\n  --typescript          Generate TypeScript instead of Python\n```\n\n### validate_agent_graph.py\n\nValidate graph structure:\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/validate_agent_graph.py <module_path>\n\nFormat: path/to/module.py:graph_name\n\nChecks:\n  - Unreachable nodes\n  - Cycles\n  - Dead ends\n  - Invalid routing\n```\n\n### visualize_graph.py\n\nGenerate Mermaid diagrams:\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/visualize_graph.py <module_path> [options]\n\nOptions:\n  --output FILE         Output file (default: stdout)\n  --diagram-only        Skip documentation, output diagram only\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Agents not coordinating correctly\"\n\n**Check:**\n1. State schema supports your pattern (see state-management-patterns.md)\n2. Routing logic validates correctly\n3. Context is preserved across agents\n\n### \"Infinite loops detected\"\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Add iteration counter to state\n2. Implement max iteration limit\n3. Add loop detection logic\n4. Validate with validate_agent_graph.py\n\n### \"Poor routing decisions\"\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Improve supervisor prompt with clear agent descriptions\n2. Use structured output for reliability\n3. Add examples to routing prompt\n4. Use better model for routing decisions\n\n### \"High latency\"\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Consider router pattern for simple cases\n2. Use faster models for routing\n3. Implement parallel execution where possible\n4. Cache routing decisions\n\n### \"High token usage\"\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Summarize context regularly\n2. Use cheaper models for simple tasks\n3. Implement context windowing\n4. Choose more efficient pattern\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- **Pattern Details:**\n  - Supervisor: references/supervisor-subagent.md\n  - Router: references/router-pattern.md\n  - Orchestrator-Worker: references/orchestrator-worker.md\n  - Handoffs: references/handoffs.md\n\n- **State Management:** references/state-management-patterns.md\n- **Pattern Comparison:** references/pattern-comparison.md\n- **Working Examples:** assets/examples/\n\n- **LangGraph Documentation:**\n  - Multi-Agent Patterns: https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/multi-agent/subagents-personal-assistant; https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/multi-agent/handoffs-customer-support; https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/multi-agent/router-knowledge-base\n  - Conditional Edges: https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langgraph/graph-api\n  - Map-Reduce: https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langgraph/graph-api#map-reduce-and-the-send-api\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:26:28.873Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Assistants seeking to implement multi-agent coordination patterns for LangGraph applications with advanced workflow management capabilities.","zh":"适用于寻求为 LangGraph 应用程序实现多代理协调模式的 AI 编码助手，具有高级工作流管理能力。","ja":"LangGraph アプリケーションにマルチエージェントの調整パターンを実装しようとしている AI コーディング アシスタントに最適です。高度なワークフロー管理機能を備えています。","ko":"LangGraph 응용 프로그램에 다중 에이전트 조정 패턴을 구현하려는 AI 코딩 어시스턴트에게 적합합니다. 고급 워크플로우 관리 기능을 갖추고 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación de IA que buscan implementar patrones de coordinación multiagente para aplicaciones de LangGraph con capacidades de gestión de flujo de trabajo avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage IA cherchant à mettre en œuvre des modèles de coordination multi-agents pour les applications LangGraph avec des capacités de gestion de workflow avancées.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Assistenten, die Multiagentenkoordinationsmuster für LangGraph-Anwendungen mit erweiterten Workflow-Managementfunktionen implementieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação de IA que buscam implementar padrões de coordenação de multiagentes para aplicações LangGraph com capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально для помощников кодирования ИИ, стремящихся реализовать шаблоны координации мультиагентов для приложений LangGraph с продвинутыми возможностями управления рабочим процессом.","ar":"مثالي لمساعدات البرمجة الإصطناعية التي تسعى إلى تنفيذ أنماط التنسيق المتعددة للوكلاء لتطبيقات LangGraph مع إمكانيات إدارة تدفق العمل المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and 