するために価値、macro、成長、リスクなどの投資フレームワークに基づいた分析を提供","ko":"투자 분석 스킬은 투자 결정 지원을 위해 가치, 거시, 성장 및 위험 투자 프레임워크를 기반으로 분석을 제공합니다","es":"Nuestra herramienta de análisis de inversión proporciona análisis a fondo para apoyar sus decisiones de inversión","fr":"Notre outil d''analyse de placement fournit une analyse approfondie pour soutenir vos décisions de placement","de":"Unser Investitionsanalyse-Tool bietet eine umfassende Analyse, um Ihre Investitionsentscheidungen zu unterstützen","pt":"O skill de análise de investimentos fornece análises aprofundadas para apoiar decisões de investimento, com base em frameworks de investidor","ru":"Навык анализа инвестиций предоставляет углубленный анализ для поддержки инвестиционных решений, основанный на инвесторских рамках","ar":"مهارة تحليل الاستثمار توفر تحليلات متعمقة لدعم قرارات الاستثمار، مع आधة إطارية مستثمر","en":"Jazz is a powerful CLI that lets you create autonomous AI agents with real-world capabilities."},"definition":{"en":"Jazz is a powerful CLI that lets you create autonomous AI agents with real-world capabilities."},"features":{"zh":["基于价值、宏观、增长和风险投资框架","提供明确、有来源、细致的结论","支持用户特定profile的投资决策","利用投资mindset和框架","提供投资分析报告","支持多种投资策略"],"ja":["価値、macro、成長、リスクなどの投資フレームワークに基づく分析","明確、出典のある、微妙な結論の提供","ユーザー特定のプロファイルに基づく投資決定の支援","投資mindsetとフレームワークの利用","投資分析レポートの提供","複数の投資戦略の支援"],"ko":["가치, 거시, 성장 및 위험 투자 프레임워크를 기반으로 분석","명확하고 출처가 있는 미묘한 결론 제공","사용자 특정 프로파일에 기반한 투자 결정 지원","투자 마인드셋과 프레임워크 사용","투자 분석 보고서 제공","여러 투자 전략 지원"],"es":["Análisis a fondo de oportunidades de inversión","Evaluación de frameworks de inversión","Análisis de riesgos y beneficios","Conclusión clara y fundamentada","Personalización según el perfil del usuario","Referencias y recursos adicionales"],"fr":["Analyse approfondie des opportunités de placement","Évaluation des frameworks de placement","Analyse des risques et des avantages","Conclusion claire et étayée","Personnalisation en fonction du profil de l''utilisateur","Références et ressources supplémentaires"],"de":["Umfassende Analyse von Investitionsmöglichkeiten","Bewertung von Investitionsframeworks","Analyse von Risiken und Nutzen","Klare und begründete Schlussfolgerung","Anpassung an das Benutzerprofil","Referenzen und weitere Ressourcen"],"pt":["Análise aprofundada de investimentos","Baseado em frameworks de investidor","Suporte à decisão de investimento","Análise de risco e crescimento","Integração com CLI Jazz"],"ru":["Углубленный анализ инвестиций","Основанный на инвесторских рамках","Поддержка инвестиционных решений","Анализ риска и роста","Интеграция с CLI Jazz"],"ar":["تحليل متعمق للاستثمار","مبني على إطارية مستثمر","دعم قرارات الاستثمار","تحليل المخاطر والنمو","التكامل مع واجهة سطر الأوامر Jazz"]},"keywords":{"zh":["投资分析","投资决策","价值投资","宏观投资","增长投资","风险投资","投资框架","投资模型"],"ja":["投資分析","投資決定","価値投資","macro投資","成長投資","リスク投資","投資フレームワーク","投資モデル"],"ko":["투자 분석","투자 결정","가치 투자","거시 투자","성장 투자","위험 투자","투자 프레임워크","투자 모델"],"es":["análisis de inversión","herramienta de análisis de inversión","inversión informada","análisis de riesgos","frameworks de inversión","inversión personalizada","análisis de beneficios"],"fr":["analyse de placement","outil d''analyse de placement","placement éclairé","analyse de risques","frameworks de placement","placement personnalisé","analyse de bénéfices"],"de":["Investitionsanalyse","Investitionsanalyse-Tool","informierte Investition","Risikoanalyse","Investitionsframeworks","personalisierte Investition","Nutzenanalyse"],"pt":["análise de investimentos","investimento","frameworks de investidor","suporte à decisão","análise de risco","crescimento","Jazz","CLI","desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["анализ инвестиций","инвестиции","инвесторские рамки","поддержка решений","анализ риска","рост","Jazz","CLI","разработка навыков"],"ar":["تحليل الاستثمار","استثمار","إطارية مستثمر","دعم القرارات","تحليل المخاطر","نمو","Jazz","واجهة سطر الأوامر","تطوير المهارات"]}},"owner":"lvndry","repo":"jazz","repoPath":"lvndry/jazz","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"investment-analysis","description":"In-depth analysis of investment assets (gold, silver, bitcoin, equities, etc.) to support investment decisions. Use when the user wants to understand an assets current state, market analysis, patterns, forecasts, or whether it fits their situation. Triggers on investment analysis, analyze gold/bitcoin/silver, should I invest in X, current state of X, market analysis, is X a good investment.","bodyPreview":"# Investment Analysis\n\nInvestment decisions affect real wealth and real lives. This skill provides in-depth analysis—grounded in investor frameworks (value, macro, growth, risk)—to support your decisions. When the analysis supports a view, give a **clear, sourced, nuanced conclusion** tailored to the user''s profile. Avoid vague hedging; substance and conviction (when justified) build trust.\n\nFor mindset and frameworks, see [references/investment-mindset.md](references/investment-mindset.md).\n\n##","body":"# Investment Analysis\n\nInvestment decisions affect real wealth and real lives. This skill provides in-depth analysis—grounded in investor frameworks (value, macro, growth, risk)—to support your decisions. When the analysis supports a view, give a **clear, sourced, nuanced conclusion** tailored to the user''s profile. Avoid vague hedging; substance and conviction (when justified) build trust.\n\nFor mindset and frameworks, see [references/investment-mindset.md](references/investment-mindset.md).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to analyze an asset (gold, silver, bitcoin, a stock, ETF, or commodity)\n- User asks \"should I invest in X?\" or \"is X a good investment?\"\n- User wants current market state, patterns, or forecasts for an asset\n- User wants to know if an asset fits their goals, risk, or time horizon\n- User asks for \"investment analysis\", \"market analysis\", or \"pattern recognition\" for an asset\n\n## Disclaimer & Scope\n\n**This is not licensed investment, tax, or legal advice.** No guarantee of returns. For major decisions (large sums, complex situations, tax/estate), recommend consulting a qualified professional.\n\n**Do give actionable conclusions** when analysis supports them: sourced, justified, tied to the user''s goals, risk, and horizon. The user deserves a clear view, not a hand-off. State confidence level and caveats.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Clarify asset and user situation**: Which asset? User''s goals (growth, income, hedge), risk tolerance, time horizon, and (if shared) existing exposure.\n2. **Gather current state**: Price, volume, recent trend, key levels. Use recent data; cite source and date.\n3. **Apply investment mindset**: Use frameworks from [references/investment-mindset.md](references/investment-mindset.md)—Buffett/Munger (value, margin of safety), Dalio (macro), Lynch (story), Marks (risk/cycles), Graham (intrinsic value)—to deepen analysis. Avoid shallow takes.\n4. **Analyze patterns and context**: Technical patterns, sentiment, on-chain (for crypto), macro context (rates, inflation, geopolitics) where relevant.\n5. **Consider forecasts and previsions**: What analysts or models say (bull/bear cases). Label as outlook, not fact.\n6. **Assess fit for situation**: Does the asset align with the user''s goals, risk, and horizon? Pros and cons in that context.\n7. **Present analysis**: Structured report with current state, patterns, outlook, fit, risks, and caveats. When analysis supports a view, state it clearly—e.g. \"For your profile, a small allocation (X–Y%) could fit because [sourced reasons]\" or \"Given your horizon and risk tolerance, this asset is likely misaligned—[reasons].\"\n\n## What to Analyze\n\n### Current State\n\n- **Price**: Current level, recent range (e.g. 30/90 days), key support/resistance if useful\n- **Volume / liquidity**: Where relevant (e.g. crypto, equities)\n- **Trend**: Short- and medium-term direction; cite time frame\n- **Context**: Rates, inflation, dollar, geopolitics—only what''s relevant to the asset\n\nCite source and date for every number (e.g. \"BTC price as of [date] per [source]\").\n\n### Pattern Recognition\n\n- **Technical**: Trends, ranges, common patterns (e.g. breakout, consolidation). Describe, don''t guarantee.\n- **Sentiment**: Fear/greed, positioning, flows—when data is available and relevant\n- **On-chain (crypto)**: Active addresses, supply in profit/loss, exchange flows—when available\n- **Seasonal / cyclical**: Historical patterns (e.g. gold in certain periods); state that past ≠ future\n\nLabel clearly: \"pattern observed\" vs \"forecast or interpretation.\"\n\n### Forecasts and Previsions\n\n- **Analyst views**: Summarize bull/bear cases; name source and date\n- **Model-based**: E.g. valuation bands, trend extrapolation—state assumptions\n- **Scenarios**: Best / base / worst case with clear \"if X then Y\" and caveats\n\nNo single \"this will happen\" claim; present range of views and uncertainty.\n\n### Fit for User Situation\n\n- **Goals**: Growth vs income vs hedge vs diversification\n- **Risk tolerance**: Volatility, drawdowns, loss capacity\n- **Time horizon**: Short vs long term; liquidity needs\n- **Existing exposure**: Already heavy in the asset? Diversification benefit?\n\nOutput: A clear conclusion with reasoning. E.g. \"Given [situation], I''d lean [for/against/neutral] because [sourced reasons]. Consider [suggested allocation or action] if [conditions].\" Tie every view to sources and profile.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Investment Analysis: [Asset] — [Date]\n\n## Summary\n\n[2–4 sentences: current state, main pattern/outlook, and fit with user situation. Include a clear conclusion when analysis supports it—e.g. \"For a long-term, risk-tolerant profile, a small allocation could fit; for short horizons, likely misaligned.\"]\n\n## Your Situation (as shared)\n\n- Goals: [e.g. long-term growth, hedge inflation]\n- Risk: [e.g. moderate, can tolerate 20% drawdown]\n- Horizon: [e.g. 5+ years]\n- [Optional] Current exposure: [e.g. none, 5% in gold]\n\n## Current Market State\n\n- **Price / level**: [value] as of [date] ([source])\n- **Recent trend**: [e.g. up/down/sideways over 30/90 days]\n- **Context**: [rates, inflation, or other relevant factor in 1–2 lines]\n\n## Patterns & Indicators\n\n- [Pattern 1]: [What you see and time frame]\n- [Pattern 2]: [What you see and time frame]\n- [Sentiment / on-chain if relevant]: [1–2 lines]\n\n## Outlook & Previsions\n\n- **Bull case**: [Short summary + source/date if applicable]\n- **Bear case**: [Short summary]\n- **Base case / range**: [If useful, with assumptions stated]\n\n## Fit for Your Situation\n\n- **Pros**: [How it could align with goals/risk/horizon]\n- **Cons**: [Risks or misalignment with situation]\n- **Conclusion**: [Clear view with reasoning. E.g. \"For your profile (long-term, moderate risk), a 2–5% allocation could fit as a diversification/hedge—because [sourced reasons]. I''d avoid or minimize if [conditions].\" Or \"Given your short horizon, I''d lean against—[reasons].\" State confidence and caveats.]\n\n## Risks & Caveats\n\n- [Risk 1]\n- [Risk 2]\n- Past performance does not guarantee future results. For large or complex decisions, consult a qualified professional.\n```\n\n## Asset Coverage\n\n- **Precious metals**: Gold, silver—price, trend, macro context (real rates, dollar, geopolitics), common use as hedge.\n- **Crypto**: Bitcoin (and optionally major altcoins)—price, volume, on-chain metrics, sentiment, regulatory/macro tailwinds/risks.\n- **Equities / ETFs**: Single names or broad indices—valuation, trend, sector context; same \"current state + patterns + outlook + fit\" structure.\n\nFor asset-specific metrics and data sources, see [references/assets.md](references/assets.md).\n\n## Time Awareness\n\n- **User specifies a period** (e.g. \"last 6 months\", \"2024\") → Use that period for trends and data.\n- **No period given** → Use **most recent** data (e.g. current price, last 30/90 days for trend).\n- Always state the date and source for prices and metrics (e.g. \"as of [date] per [source]\").\n\n## Sources\n\n- **Prices / market data**: Exchange or index provider, reputable aggregator (e.g. CoinGecko for crypto). Cite URL or name and date.\n- **On-chain (crypto)**: Public dashboards (e.g. Glassnode, CryptoQuant). Cite name and date.\n- **Macro**: Central banks, statistical offices, widely cited data. Cite source and date.\n- **Analyst views**: Named source and date; treat as opinion, not fact.\n\nPrefer primary or well-known sources. Never invent data.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- ❌ Giving conclusions without sources, reasoning, or profile fit (vague advice erodes trust)\n- ❌ Over-hedging when analysis supports a view—the user deserves a clear take\n- ❌ Guaranteeing returns or price levels\n- ❌ Using data without source and date\n- ❌ Presenting one view as certainty; show range and uncertainty\n- ❌ Ignoring user situation; always tie fit to goals, risk, and horizon\n- ❌ Skipping risks and caveats\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:27:03.268Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing in-depth investment insights grounded in investor frameworks like value, macro, growth, and risk.","zh":"非常适合需要深入投资洞察的金融分析代理，基于投资者框架，如价值、宏观、增长和风险。","ja":"金融分析エージェントが投資家のフレームワークに基づいた投資の深い洞察が必要な場合に最適です。価値、 マクロ、成長、リスクなどの。","ko":"금융 분석 에이전트가 투자자 프레임워크에 기초한 투자의 깊은 통찰력이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다. 가치, 거시, 성장, 위험 등과 같은","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Financiero que necesitan conocimientos de inversión en profundidad basados en marcos de inversores como valor, macro, crecimiento y riesgo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse financière ayant besoin d''informations d''investissement approfondies ancrées dans des cadres d''investisseurs tels que la valeur, le macro, la croissance et le risque.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzanalyse-Agenten, die tiefgehende Investitionserkenntnisse benötigen, die auf Investorenrahmen wie Wert, Makro, Wachstum und Risiko basieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que necessitam de insights de investimento aprofundados baseados em estruturas de investidor como valor, macro, crescimento e risco.","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых аналитических агентов, которым необходимы глубокие инвестиционные идеи, основанные на инвесторских рамках, таких как стоимость, макро, рост и риск.","ar":"مثالي ليعملاء تحليل مالي يحتاجون إلى رؤى استثمارية متعمقة تستند إلى إطارات مستثمر مثل القيمة والماكرو والنمو والخطر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide clear, sourced, and nuanced conclusions tailored to user profiles, leveraging frameworks and mindsets outlined in investment-mindset.md, and avoiding vague hedging to build trust with substance and conviction.","zh":"赋予代理提供清晰、有来源、细致入微的结论，根据用户配置文件量身定制，利用investment-mindset.md中概述的框架和心态，并避免模糊的预测以建立信任和信念。","ja":"エージェントがユーザープロファイルに合わせた明確で出典のあるニュアンスのある結論を提供できるようにし、investment-mindset.mdに概説されているフレームワークとマインドセットを利用し、信頼と信念を築くためにあいまいなヘッジを避ける。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 프로필에 따라 명확하고 출처가 있는 세련된 결론을 제공할 수 있도록 하며 investment-mindset.md에 개략적으로 설명된 프레임워크와 마음가짐을 활용하고 신뢰와 신념을 구축하기 위해 모호한 헤지(hedging)을 피합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes brindar conclusiones claras, fundamentadas y matizadas adaptadas a los perfiles de usuario, aprovechando los marcos y mentalidades establecidos en investment-mindset.md, y evitando una ambigüedad vaga para generar confianza con sustancia y convicción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des conclusions claires, sourcées et nuancées adaptées aux profils d''utilisateur, en exploitant les cadres et les mentalités décrits dans investment-mindset.md, et en évitant une ambiguïté vague pour établir la confiance avec de la substance et de la conviction.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klare, belegte und differenzierte Schlussfolgerungen bereitzustellen, die auf Benutzerprofile zugeschnitten sind, indem sie die in investment-mindset.md beschriebenen Rahmenbedingungen und Denkweisen nutzen und eine vage Zweideutigkeit vermeiden, um Vertrauen mit Inhalt und Überzeugung aufzubauen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer conclusões claras, fundamentadas e matizadas adaptadas a perfis de usuário, aproveitando estruturas e mentalidades delineadas em investment-mindset.md, e evitando hedge vago para construir confiança com substância e convicção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять четкие, обоснованные и нюансированные выводы, адаптированные к профилям пользователей, используя рамки и мышление, изложенные в investment-mindset.md, и избегая расплывчатого хеджирования для построения доверия с помощью содержания и убеждения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقديم استنتاجات واضحة ومثقفة ومتوازنة محدثة لملفات تعريف المستخدمين، وتوفير الإطارات وأفكار العقلية المحددة في investment-mindset.md، وتجنب التهرب الغامض لبناء الثقة بالمادة والاقتناع."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing investment opportunities based on macroeconomic trends","Generating growth-oriented investment portfolios","Evaluating risk management strategies for diversified investments"],"zh":["基于宏观经济趋势分析投资机会","生成面向增长的投资组合","评估多元化投资的风险管理策略"],"ja":["マクロ経済トレンドに基づいた投資機会の分析","成長志向の投資ポートフォリオの生成","多様化投資のリスク管理戦略の評価"],"ko":["거시 경제 동향에 따른 투자 기회 분석","성장 지향 투자 포트폴리오 생성","다양화 투자의 위험 관리 전략 평가"],"es":["Análisis de oportunidades de inversión basadas en tendencias macroeconómicas","Generación de carteras de inversión orientadas al crecimiento","Evaluación de estrategias de gestión de riesgos para inversiones diversificadas"],"fr":["Analyse des opportunités d''investissement basées sur les tendances macroéconomiques","Génération de portefeuilles d''investissement orientés vers la croissance","Évaluation des stratégies de gestion des risques pour les investissements diversifiés"],"de":["Analyse von Investitionsmöglichkeiten auf der Grundlage makroökonomischer Trends","Erstellung von wachstumsorientierten Anlageportfolios","Bewertung von Risikomanagementstrategien für diversifizierte Investitionen"],"pt":["Analisar oportunidades de investimento com base em tendências macroeconômicas","Gerar carteiras de investimento orientadas para o crescimento","Avaliar estratégias de gerenciamento de risco para investimentos diversificados"],"ru":["Анализировать возможности инвестирования на основе макроэкономических тенденций","Генерировать портфели инвестиций, ориентированные на рост","Оценивать стратегии управления рисками для диверсифицированных инвестиций"],"ar":["تحليل فرص الاستثمار بناءً على الاتجاهات الاقتصادية الكلية","_generating محفظة استثمارية موجهة نحو النمو","تقييم استراتيجيات إدارة المخاطر للاستثمارات المتنوعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of investor frameworks and mindsets","Dependent on quality and reliability of sourced data","May not account for unforeseen market fluctuations or black swan events"],"zh":["需要了解投资者框架和心态","依赖于来源数据的质量和可靠性","可能无法考虑到不可预见的市场波动或黑天鹅事件"],"ja":["投資家のフレームワークとマインドセットを理解する必要がある","出典データの品質と信頼性に依存する","予測不可能な市場の変動やブラックスワンイベントを考慮できない可能性がある"],"ko":["투자자 프레임워크와 마음가짐을 이해해야 함","출처 데이터의 품질과 신뢰성에 의존함","예측할 수 없는 시장의 변동이나 블랙스완 이벤트를 고려하지 못할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los marcos y mentalidades de los inversores","Depende de la calidad y fiabilidad de los datos obtenidos","Puede no tener en cuenta las fluctuaciones del mercado impredecibles o los eventos de cisne negro"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des cadres et des mentalités des investisseurs","Dépend de la qualité et de la fiabilité des données sourcées","Peut ne pas tenir compte des fluctuations de marché imprévisibles ou des événements de cygne noir"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Investorenrahmen und -mentalitäten","Hängt von der Qualität und Zuverlässigkeit der Quelldaten ab","Kann unvorhersehbare Marktschwankungen oder Schwarzer-Schwan-Ereignisse nicht berücksichtigen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de estruturas e mentalidades de investidor","Depende da qualidade e confiabilidade dos dados de origem","Pode não levar em conta flutuações de mercado imprevisíveis ou eventos de cisne negro"],"ru":["Требует понимания инвесторских рамок и мышления","Зависит от качества и надежности источников данных","Может не учитывать непредвиденные колебания рынка или события черного лебедя"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لإطارات وأفكار العقلية للمستثمر","يعتمد على جودة وموثوقية بيانات المصدر","قد لا يأخذ في الاعتبار تقلبات السوق غير المتوقعة أو أحداث الطائر الأسود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
