"Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Diseños ASCII copiables y personalizables","Soporte para horizontal y vertical layouts","Integración con proyectos de desarrollo full-stack"],"fr":["Génération de logos et de bannières ASCII personnalisés","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Conceptions ASCII copiables et personnalisables","Prise en charge des dispositions horizontales et verticales","Intégration avec des projets de développement full-stack"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten ASCII-Logos und -Bannern","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Kopierbare und anpassbare ASCII-Designs","Unterstützung für horizontale und vertikale Layouts","Integration mit Full-Stack-Entwicklungsprojekten"],"pt":["Geração de logotipos ASCII personalizados","Compatibilidade com múltiplas plataformas","Suporte a layout horizontal e vertical","Código de saída copiável","Regras de layout personalizáveis"],"ru":["Генерация индивидуальных логотипов ASCII","Совместимость с несколькими платформами","Поддержка горизонтальной и вертикальной раскладки","Код вывода для копирования","Правила раскладки настраиваются"],"ar":["إنشاء شعارات ASCII مخصصة","توافق مع منصات متعددة","دعم التخطيط الأفقي والرأسي","كود الإخراج للنسخ","قواعد التخطيط القابلة для التخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ASCII CLI Logo Banner","Figlet.js","文本logo生成","banner生成","布局样式","自定义logo"],"ja":["ASCII CLI ロゴバナー","Figlet.js","テキストロゴ生成","バナーエンジン","レイアウトスタイル","カスタマイズロゴ"],"ko":["ASCII CLI 로고 배너","Figlet.js","텍스트 로고 생성","배너 생성","레이아웃 스타일","커스텀 로고"],"es":["ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs","generador de logotipos ascii","figlet.js","desarrollo full-stack","diseños ascii","logotipos ascii personalizados"],"fr":["ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs","générateur de logos ascii","figlet.js","développement full-stack","conceptions ascii","logos ascii personnalisés"],"de":["ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs","ascii-logo-generator","figlet.js","full-stack-entwicklung","ascii-designs","benutzerdefinierte ascii-logos"],"pt":["figletjs","logotipos ascii","desenvolvimento full-stack","geração de logotipos","layout personalizado","código copiável"],"ru":["figletjs","логотипы ascii","полноценная стэк-разработка","генерация логотипов","настраиваемая раскладка","код для копирования"],"ar":["figletjs","شعارات ascii","تطوير كامل","إنشاء شعارات","تخطيط مخصص","كود للنسخ"]}},"owner":"partme-ai","repo":"full-stack-skills","repoPath":"partme-ai/full-stack-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs","description":"Generate TAAG/FIGlet-style ASCII art banners using figlet.js (FIGfont spec), with layout controls (horizontal/vertical layout, width, whitespaceBreak) and optional ANSI 256 coloring.","bodyPreview":"## When to use this skill\n**CRITICAL TRIGGER RULE**\n- Use this skill ONLY when the user explicitly mentions the exact skill name: `ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs`.\n\n**Trigger phrases include:**\n- \"ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs\"\n- \"use ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs\"\n- \"用 ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs 生成 TAAG/FIGlet 大字\"\n- \"使用 ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs 调 horizontalLayout / verticalLayout\"\n\n## Boundary\n- Output copy-pastable text and layout rules only. Do not modify project code.\n- FIGlet/TA","body":"## When to use this skill\n**CRITICAL TRIGGER RULE**\n- Use this skill ONLY when the user explicitly mentions the exact skill name: `ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs`.\n\n**Trigger phrases include:**\n- \"ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs\"\n- \"use ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs\"\n- \"用 ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs 生成 TAAG/FIGlet 大字\"\n- \"使用 ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs 调 horizontalLayout / verticalLayout\"\n\n## Boundary\n- Output copy-pastable text and layout rules only. Do not modify project code.\n- FIGlet/TAAG style is driven by FIGfont (.flf) rendering and layout “smushing/kerning” options.\n- ANSI coloring is optional and MUST not break alignment (spaces are not colorized).\n- Dependency note: `figlet` npm package is commonly used as the Node interface and is powered by `figlet.js`.\n\n## How to use this skill\n### Inputs (recommended)\n- brand (required)\n- width (default 80; if `< 60` use compact mode)\n- font (default Standard)\n- horizontalLayout (default | full | fitted | controlled smushing | universal smushing)\n- verticalLayout (default | full | fitted | controlled smushing | universal smushing)\n- whitespaceBreak (true|false, default true)\n- slogan/hint (optional; centered lines under the logo)\n- center (default true)\n- rule (default true; set false for hero output)\n- version/repo/docs/author (optional; only used when `rule=true`)\n- colorMode (none | ansi256, default none; logo only)\n- colorStart/colorEnd (0-255, defaults 33/129; only when `colorMode=ansi256`)\n\n### Outputs (required)\n- bannerPlain: banner text (no-color)\n- coloredText: when `colorMode=ansi256`, provide colored logo output\n- plainTextFallback: when colored, also provide a no-color fallback (same layout)\n\n## Script\n- `scripts/figlet_banner.mjs`\n\n## Examples\n- `examples/taag-figlet.md`\n- `examples/color-ansi256.md`\n\n## Quality checklist\n1. Layout options are honored (horizontal/vertical layout)\n2. 80-column output does not wrap; no trailing spaces\n3. Color mode does not break alignment (spaces are not colorized)\n4. Never prints secrets (tokens, internal URLs, personal data)\n\n## Keywords\n**English:** ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs, figlet, figlet.js, FIGfont, taag, ascii, banner, smushing, kerning, ansi256\n**中文:** ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs, FIGlet 大字, TAAG, FIGfont 字体, 横向布局, 纵向布局, ANSI256 上色\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:27:05.082Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Text-Based Agents needing advanced ASCII art generation capabilities with FIGlet and TAAG support.","zh":"非常适合需要高级ASCII艺术生成功能的文本基于代理，支持FIGlet和TAAG。","ja":"テキストベースのエージェントが高度なASCIIアート生成機能を必要とする場合に最適で、FIGletとTAAGをサポートしています。","ko":"고급 ASCII 아트 생성 기능과 FIGlet 및 TAAG 지원이 필요한 텍스트 기반 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en texto que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de arte ASCII con soporte para FIGlet y TAAG.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur du texte nécessitant des capacités avancées de génération d''art ASCII avec prise en charge de FIGlet et TAAG.","de":"Perfekt für textbasierte Agenten, die erweiterte ASCII-Kunstgenerierungsfähigkeiten mit FIGlet- und TAAG-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Baseados em Texto que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de arte ASCII com suporte a FIGlet e TAAG.","ru":"Идеально для текстовых агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности генерации ASCII-искусства с поддержкой FIGlet и TAAG.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء القائمين على النص الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء فن ASCII مع دعم FIGlet و TAAG."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate copy-pastable ASCII art banners using FIGlet and TAAG, with customizable horizontal and vertical layouts, supporting multiple platforms.","zh":"赋予代理生成可复制的ASCII艺术横幅的能力，使用FIGlet和TAAG，并支持可自定义的水平和垂直布局，适用于多个平台。","ja":"FIGletとTAAGを使用して、水平方向と垂直方向のレイアウトをカスタマイズ可能な、コピー＆ペースト可能なASCIIアートバナーの生成をエージェントに可能にします。複数のプラットフォームをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 FIGlet 및 TAAG를 사용하여 복사 및貼付 가능한 ASCII 아트 배너를 생성할 수 있도록 하는 기능으로, 가로 및 세로 레이아웃을 사용자 지정할 수 있으며, 여러 플랫폼을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar banners de arte ASCII copiables y pegables utilizando FIGlet y TAAG, con diseños personalizables horizontales y verticales, y compatible con varias plataformas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des bannières d''art ASCII copiables et collables à l''aide de FIGlet et TAAG, avec des dispositions horizontales et verticales personnalisables, et prend en charge plusieurs plateformes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kopier- und einfügbare ASCII-Kunst-Banner mit FIGlet und TAAG zu generieren, mit anpassbaren horizontalen und vertikalen Layouts und Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar banners de arte ASCII copiáveis e coláveis usando FIGlet e TAAG, com layouts horizontais e verticais personalizáveis, suportando várias plataformas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать копируемые и вставляемые баннеры ASCII-искусства с использованием FIGlet и TAAG, с настраиваемыми горизонтальными и вертикальными макетами, поддерживающими несколько платформ.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء بنرات فن ASCII قابلة للنسخ واللصق باستخدام FIGlet و TAAG، مع تخطيطات أفقية وعمودية قابلة للتخصيص،تدعم منصات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating branded ASCII logos for command-line interfaces","Creating custom FIGlet banners for text-based user interfaces","Customizing TAAG layouts for horizontal and vertical display"],"zh":["为命令行接口生成品牌的ASCII徽标","为基于文本的用户界面创建自定义的FIGlet横幅","为水平和垂直显示自定义TAAG布局"],"ja":["コマンドラインインターフェイスのブランドASCIIロゴを生成する","テキストベースのユーザーインターフェイスのカスタムFIGletバナーを作成する","水平方向と垂直方向の表示用にカスタムTAAGレイアウトを作成する"],"ko":["명령줄 인터페이스용 브랜드 ASCII 로고 생성","텍스트 기반 사용자 인터페이스용 사용자 지정 FIGlet 배너 생성","수평 및 수직 표시용 사용자 지정 TAAG 레이아웃"],"es":["Generación de logotipos de marca ASCII para interfaces de línea de comandos","Creación de banners personalizados de FIGlet para interfaces de usuario basadas en texto","Personalización de diseños de TAAG para visualización horizontal y vertical"],"fr":["Génération de logos de marque ASCII pour les interfaces en ligne de commande","Création de bannières de FIGlet personnalisées pour les interfaces utilisateur basées sur du texte","Personnalisation des dispositions de TAAG pour l''affichage horizontal et vertical"],"de":["Generierung von ASCII-Logos für Befehlszeilen-Oberflächen","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten FIGlet-Bannern für textbasierte Benutzeroberflächen","Anpassung von TAAG-Layouts für horizontale und vertikale Anzeige"],"pt":["Gerar logotipos ASCII de marca para interfaces de linha de comando","Criar banners personalizados FIGlet para interfaces de usuário baseadas em texto","Personalizar layouts TAAG para exibição horizontal e vertical"],"ru":["Генерировать брендированные логотипы ASCII для командной строки","Создавать пользовательские баннеры FIGlet для текстовых пользовательских интерфейсов","Настраивать макеты TAAG для горизонтального и вертикального отображения"],"ar":["إنشاء شعارات ASCII ذات علامة تجارية لتواجه واجهات سطر الأوامر","إنشاء بنرات مخصصة من FIGlet لواجهات المستخدم القائمة على النص","تخصيص تخطيطات TAAG لعرض أفقي وعمودي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Output limited to copy-pastable text and layout rules","Does not modify project code","Requires explicit mention of ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs'' to trigger"],"zh":["输出仅限于可复制的文本和布局规则","不修改项目代码","需要明确提及''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs''来触发"],"ja":["出力はコピー＆ペースト可能なテキストとレイアウトルールに限定されます","プロジェクトコードを変更しません","トリガーするには''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs''を明示的に指定する必要があります"],"ko":["출력은 복사 및貼付 가능한 텍스트 및 레이아웃 규칙으로 제한됨","프로젝트 코드를 수정하지 않음","트리거하려면 ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs''를 명시적으로 언급해야 함"],"es":["Salida limitada a texto copiable y pegable y reglas de diseño","No modifica el código del proyecto","Requiere mención explícita de ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs'' para activar"],"fr":["Sortie limitée au texte copiable et collable et aux règles de disposition","Ne modifie pas le code du projet","Requiert une mention explicite de ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs'' pour déclencher"],"de":["Ausgabe beschränkt auf kopier- und einfügbaren Text und Layoutregeln","Ändert den Projektcode nicht","Benötigt explizite Erwähnung von ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs'', um zu aktivieren"],"pt":["Saída limitada a texto copiável e regras de layout","Não modifica o código do projeto","Requer menção explícita de ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs'' para disparar"],"ru":["Выход ограничен копируемым текстом и правилами макета","Не изменяет код проекта","Требует явного упоминания ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs'', чтобы сработать"],"ar":["الخرج مقيد بنص قابل للنسخ وقواعد التخطيط","لا يغير رمز المشروع","يتطلب ذكرًا صريحًا لـ ''ascii-cli-logo-banner-figletjs'' لتفعيله"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lisbeth718/pseo-skills/pseo-discovery', 'community', 'lisbeth718', 'pseo-skills', 'lisbeth718/pseo-skills', 'pseo-discovery', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:27:20.038Z', NULL, '{"id":"lisbeth718/pseo-skills/pseo-discovery","name":"pseo-discovery","description":{"zh":"pSEO Discovery ","ja":"pSEO","ko":"pSEO - ","es":"pSEO Discovery es una habilidad que analiza el código y los datos para determinar qué páginas de SEO programáticas se pueden generar","fr":"pSEO Discovery est une compétence qui analyse le code et les données pour déterminer quelles pages de SEO programmatiques peuvent être générées","de":"pSEO Discovery ist eine Fähigkeit, die Code und Daten analysiert, um zu bestimmen, welche SEO-Programmseiten generiert werden können","pt":"A habilidade pSEO Discovery analisa o código, contexto de negócios e mercado para determinar quais páginas de SEO programáticas podem e devem ser construídas.","ru":"Навык pSEO Discovery анализирует код, бизнес-контекст и рынок, чтобы определить, какие программные страницы SEO можно и должны создавать.","ar":"المهارة pSEO Discovery تحلل الشفرة والسياق التجاري والسوق لتحديد الصفحات التي يمكن وينبغي بناؤها من أجل تحسين محركات البحث بشكل برمجي.","en":"pSEO Skills for AI Coding Assistants"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"pSEO Discovery - ","ja":"pSEO","ko":"pSEO - ","es":"pSEO Discovery: Análisis de código y datos para SEO","fr":"pSEO Discovery : Analyse de code et de données pour le SEO","de":"pSEO Discovery: Code- und Datenanalyse für SEO","pt":"pSEO Discovery: Otimização de SEO para Desenvolvedores","ru":"pSEO Discovery: Оптимизация SEO для разработчиков","ar":"pSEO Discovery: تحسين محركات البحث للمطورين","en":"pseo-discovery"},"description":{"zh":"pSEO Discovery ","ja":"pSEO","ko":"pSEO - ","es":"pSEO Discovery es una habilidad que analiza el código y los datos para determinar qué páginas de SEO programáticas se pueden generar","fr":"pSEO Discovery est une compétence qui analyse le code et les données pour déterminer quelles pages de SEO programmatiques peuvent être générées","de":"pSEO Discovery ist eine Fähigkeit, die Code und Daten analysiert, um zu bestimmen, welche SEO-Programmseiten generiert werden können","pt":"A habilidade pSEO Discovery analisa o código, contexto de negócios e mercado para determinar quais páginas de SEO programáticas podem e devem ser construídas.","ru":"Навык pSEO Discovery анализирует код, бизнес-контекст и рынок, чтобы определить, какие программные страницы SEO можно и должны создавать.","ar":"المهارة pSEO Discovery تحلل الشفرة والسياق التجاري والسوق لتحديد الصفحات التي يمكن وينبغي بناؤها من أجل تحسين محركات البحث بشكل برمجي.","en":"pSEO Skills for AI Coding Assistants"},"definition":{"en":"pSEO Skills for AI Coding Assistants"},"features":{"zh":["Data-first","Intent-matched","pseo-audit","pSEO","API"],"ja":["Data-first","Intent-matched","pseo-audit","pSEO","API"],"ko":["Data-first","Intent-matched","pseo-audit","pSEO","API"],"es":["Análisis de código y datos","Determinación de páginas de SEO programáticas","Enfoque en datos estructurados","Coincidencia de intención","Propuesta de tipos de páginas"],"fr":["Analyse de code et de données","Détermination de pages de SEO programmatiques","Focus sur les données structurées","Correspondance d''intention","Proposition de types de pages"],"de":["Code- und Datenanalyse","Bestimmung von SEO-Programmseiten","Fokus auf strukturierte Daten","Intent-Übereinstimmung","Vorschlag von Seitentypen"],"pt":["Análise de código e contexto de negócios","Determinação de páginas de SEO programáticas","Utilização de dados estruturados","Compatibilidade com pseo-audit"],"ru":["Анализ кода и бизнес-контекста","Определение программных страниц SEO","Использование структурированных данных","Совместимость с pseo-audit"],"ar":["تحليل الشفرة والسياق التجاري","تحديد الصفحات البرمجية لتحسين محركات البحث","استخدام البيانات المهيكلة","التوافق مع pseo-audit"]},"keywords":{"zh":["pSEO","SEO","pseo-discovery","pseo-audit","Data-first","Intent-matched","API"],"ja":["pSEO","SEO","pseo-discovery","pseo-audit","Data-first","Intent-matched","API"],"ko":["pSEO","SEO","pseo-discovery","pseo-audit","Data-first","Intent-matched","API"],"es":["pSEO Discovery","SEO programático","análisis de código","análisis de datos","desarrollo web","optimización de motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["pSEO Discovery","SEO programmatique","analyse de code","analyse de données","développement web","optimisation des moteurs de recherche"],"de":["pSEO Discovery","SEO-Programmierung","Code-Analyse","Datenanalyse","Webentwicklung","Suchmaschinenoptimierung"],"pt":["pSEO Discovery","Otimização de SEO","Desenvolvimento de software","Análise de código","Contexto de negócios","Páginas de SEO programáticas"],"ru":["pSEO Discovery","Оптимизация SEO","Разработка программного обеспечения","Анализ кода","Бизнес-контекст","Программные страницы SEO"],"ar":["pSEO Discovery","تحسين محركات البحث","تطوير البرمجيات","تحليل الشفرة","السياق التجاري","الصفحات البرمجية لتحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"lisbeth718","repo":"pseo-skills","repoPath":"lisbeth718/pseo-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pseo-discovery","description":"Analyze a codebase and business context to discover programmatic SEO opportunities, identifying what page types to generate, what data assets exist, and what search intent can be matched at scale. Use when starting a new pSEO project, when the user isnt sure what to build programmatically, or when exploring what structured data exists in the codebase or business that could power scalable pages.","bodyPreview":"# pSEO Discovery\n\nAnalyze the codebase, business context, and market to determine what programmatic SEO pages can and should be built. This skill answers the question: **\"What should we generate, and do we have the data to do it?\"**\n\nThis skill runs BEFORE pseo-audit. The audit checks if the codebase is ready; this skill figures out what to build.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Data-first**: Only propose page types backed by structured data that exists or can be sourced\n2. **Intent-matched**: Every p","body":"# pSEO Discovery\n\nAnalyze the codebase, business context, and market to determine what programmatic SEO pages can and should be built. This skill answers the question: **\"What should we generate, and do we have the data to do it?\"**\n\nThis skill runs BEFORE pseo-audit. The audit checks if the codebase is ready; this skill figures out what to build.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Data-first**: Only propose page types backed by structured data that exists or can be sourced\n2. **Intent-matched**: Every proposed page type must target a real search intent with volume\n3. **Differentiated**: Each page must be able to produce genuinely unique content — not just variable swaps\n4. **Feasible**: Proposals must be realistic given the current data, codebase, and team capacity\n5. **Business-aligned**: pSEO pages should serve the business''s actual audience and goals\n\n## Discovery Procedure\n\n### 1. Explore the Codebase for Data Assets\n\nSearch the codebase for existing structured data that could power pages:\n\n**Database/ORM models:**\n- Search for schema definitions (Prisma, Drizzle, TypeORM, Mongoose, SQL migrations)\n- Identify entities with many records (products, locations, services, users, listings, articles)\n- Note which entities have rich attributes (descriptions, categories, images, metadata)\n\n**CMS content types:**\n- Check for headless CMS configs (Contentful, Sanity, Strapi, etc.)\n- Identify content types and their field schemas\n- Count records per content type\n\n**API endpoints:**\n- Map all API routes and their response shapes\n- Identify list endpoints that return collections of entities\n- Check for paginated endpoints (signals large datasets)\n\n**Static data files:**\n- Search for JSON, CSV, YAML, MDX files in `data/`, `content/`, `src/data/` directories\n- Count records and inspect field richness\n- Check for categorization or taxonomy structures\n\n**What to extract per data source:**\n- Entity name and count (e.g., \"2,500 products\", \"150 cities\", \"80 services\")\n- Available fields (especially: name, description, category, attributes, images)\n- Relationships between entities (product → category, service → location)\n- Data freshness (how often updated, is there a lastModified field)\n\n### 2. Map Business Entities to Page Types\n\nFor each data asset found, evaluate whether it can power a pSEO page type:\n\n| Question | Must answer \"yes\" |\n|----------|-------------------|\n| Are there 50+ unique records? | Minimum for pSEO to make sense |\n| Does each record have enough data for a full page? | Title, description, 3+ unique attributes |\n| Would someone search for this? | Real search intent exists |\n| Can each page be meaningfully different? | Not just variable swaps |\n| Does this serve the business? | Drives traffic the business can convert |\n\n**Common pSEO page patterns by business type:**\n\n- **E-commerce**: Product pages, category pages, brand pages, `[product] vs [product]` comparisons, `best [category] for [use-case]`\n- **SaaS**: Feature pages, integration pages, `[tool] alternative`, `[tool] vs [competitor]`, use-case pages\n- **Marketplace**: Listing pages, location pages, `[service] in [city]`, category + location combinations\n- **Content/Media**: Topic pages, tag pages, author pages, `[topic] guide`, glossary/definition pages\n- **Local business**: Service + location pages, `[service] in [neighborhood]`, FAQ pages per service\n- **Directory**: Profile pages, category pages, comparison pages, `top [category] in [location]`\n\n### 3. Identify Keyword Patterns and Search Intent\n\nFor each proposed page type, validate that search demand exists:\n\n**Keyword pattern analysis:**\n- Identify the base keyword pattern (e.g., `[service] in [city]`, `best [product] for [use-case]`)\n- Estimate volume per pattern using keyword research tools or inferred demand\n- Check for long-tail variations that indicate intent depth\n- Verify that existing top results are not exclusively high-authority domains\n\n**Intent classification per page type:**\n- **Informational**: User wants to learn (guides, definitions, how-tos)\n- **Commercial investigation**: User is comparing options (comparisons, reviews, \"best X\")\n- **Transactional**: User wants to buy/sign up (product pages, pricing, service pages)\n- **Navigational**: User wants a specific entity (brand pages, location pages)\n\nEach pSEO page type should clearly map to one intent category.\n\n### 4. Evaluate Data Sufficiency for Content Uniqueness\n\nFor each proposed page type, assess whether the data produces genuinely unique pages:\n\n**The Content Differentiation Test:**\nTake 5 random records. For each, write out what the page would contain:\n- Title\n- H1\n- Intro paragraph\n- Main content sections\n- FAQ questions\n\nIf 3+ of these elements are essentially the same text with different proper nouns, the data is insufficient. Either:\n- Enrich the data (add more attributes, descriptions, FAQs per record)\n- Combine data sources (e.g., product data + user reviews + competitor data)\n- Narrow the page type to records with richer data\n- Abandon the page type as a pSEO candidate\n\n**Minimum data requirements per page:**\n- 2+ unique text fields beyond title and description (for body content)\n- 3+ structured attributes (for data tables, stat highlights)\n- Category or taxonomy data (for hub-spoke linking)\n- Ideally: 3-5 FAQ pairs per record (for FAQ schema and content depth)\n\n### 5. Assess URL Structure and Taxonomy\n\nPropose a URL hierarchy for the pSEO pages:\n\n```\n/{category}/{slug}                     # standard\n/{location}/{service}                  # location-based\n/{product-type}/{product-slug}         # e-commerce\n/{topic}/{subtopic}                    # content-based\n```\n\nCheck:\n- Will all slugs be unique within their URL namespace?\n- Does the hierarchy create natural hub-spoke relationships?\n- Is the URL structure human-readable and keyword-inclusive?\n- How deep is the hierarchy? (Maximum 3 levels recommended)\n\n### 6. Competitive Landscape Check\n\nIdentify whether competitors are already doing pSEO for the same patterns:\n\n- Search for the target keyword patterns and see what ranks\n- Check if competitors have programmatic pages (signs: similar URL patterns, templated content, large indexed page counts)\n- Assess competitor content quality — can you do meaningfully better?\n- Look for gaps they haven''t covered (long-tail variations, underserved locations, new categories)\n\n### 7. Propose a pSEO Strategy\n\nCompile findings into a ranked list of pSEO opportunities.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\n## pSEO Discovery Report\n\n### Data Assets Found\n| Entity | Record Count | Key Fields | Source |\n|--------|-------------|------------|--------|\n| [entity] | [count] | [fields] | [DB/CMS/API/files] |\n\n### Proposed Page Types (ranked by opportunity)\n\n#### 1. [Page Type Name]\n- **Pattern**: [URL pattern, e.g., /services/[service]-in-[city]]\n- **Record count**: [number of pages this would generate]\n- **Search intent**: [informational / commercial / transactional]\n- **Keyword pattern**: [e.g., \"[service] in [city]\"]\n- **Data source**: [where the data comes from]\n- **Content uniqueness**: [High / Medium / Low — with justification]\n- **Data gaps**: [what fields are missing or need enrichment]\n- **Feasibility**: [Ready / Needs data enrichment / Needs new data source]\n\n#### 2. [Next page type...]\n\n### Rejected Candidates\n| Entity | Reason Rejected |\n|--------|----------------|\n| [entity] | [too few records / insufficient data / no search intent / ...] |\n\n### Recommended URL Structure\n[Proposed hierarchy with examples]\n\n### Data Enrichment Needed\n[List of data fields that need to be added to unlock page types]\n\n### Next Steps\n1. [Confirm page types with stakeholder]\n2. [Enrich data where needed]\n3. [Run pseo-audit on the codebase]\n4. [Begin implementation with pseo-data]\n```\n\n## Scope Parameter\n\nIf `$ARGUMENTS` specifies a focus:\n- `all` (default): Full discovery\n- `codebase`: Only analyze existing data assets in the code (steps 1-2)\n- `business`: Focus on business entity mapping and page type proposals (steps 2-4)\n- `keywords`: Focus on keyword patterns and competitive landscape (steps 3, 6)\n\n## YMYL Risk Assessment\n\nGoogle''s September 2025 Quality Rater Guidelines expanded YMYL (Your Money or Your Life) to include civic information alongside health, finance, and legal content. pSEO in YMYL verticals carries elevated risk.\n\n**YMYL categories (as of September 2025):**\n- Health and medical information\n- Financial information (investing, taxes, loans, insurance)\n- Legal information\n- Civic information (voting, government, public trust)\n- Safety information (product safety, emergency procedures)\n- News about major events\n\n**If the proposed page types fall into ANY YMYL category:**\n\n1. **Flag the risk explicitly** in the discovery report\n2. **Elevate content quality requirements**: Every page needs cited authoritative sources, expert attribution, and review processes\n3. **Evaluate if pSEO is appropriate at all**: YMYL content often requires human expert review per page, which conflicts with the \"programmatic\" approach. Be honest about this tension.\n4. **Recommend stricter quality guard thresholds**: Higher minimum word counts, stricter uniqueness requirements, mandatory E-E-A-T fields\n5. **Consider hybrid approach**: Programmatic data structure + human-reviewed content per page\n\n**Discovery output should include a YMYL assessment:**\n```\n### YMYL Assessment\n- YMYL category: [None | Health | Finance | Legal | Civic | Safety]\n- Risk level: [Low | Medium | High]\n- Recommendation: [Standard pSEO OK | Needs elevated quality standards | Human review per page required | pSEO not recommended for this vertical]\n```\n\n## Output Artifact\n\nSave the discovery report to `.pseo/discovery-report.md` in the project root. This file is consumed by pseo-audit and pseo-orchestrate to inform subsequent phases. The file must include at minimum:\n\n- Confirmed page types with their URL patterns\n- Data source locations (file paths, API endpoints, CMS content types)\n- YMYL assessment (if applicable)\n- Data gaps that need enrichment before implementation\n\nIf running within a single Claude Code session, the report can also be kept in conversation context. The file serves as a persistent artifact for multi-session workflows.\n\n## Important Constraints\n\n- This is a research-only skill. Do NOT modify code or create files.\n- Be honest about data gaps. Don''t propose page types the data can''t support.\n- Quantity of pages is not the goal. 200 genuinely unique pages beats 5,000 thin pages.\n- If the codebase has no usable structured data, say so. The answer may be \"build the data layer first\" or \"this business isn''t a good fit for pSEO.\"\n- If a page type would produce thin or near-identical pages, flag it as rejected with a clear reason.\n\n## Relationship to Other Skills\n\n- **Runs before**: All other pseo-* skills\n- **Feeds into**: pseo-audit (what to look for), pseo-data (what models to build)\n- **Independent of**: All implementation skills — this is pure research\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:27:20.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Coding Assistants needing advanced programmatic page analysis and data-driven content generation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级编程页面分析和数据驱动内容生成的SEO编码助手。","ja":"高度なプログラムによるページ分析とデータ駆動型コンテンツ生成を必要とするSEOコーディングアシスタントに最適です。","ko":"고급 프로그래밍 페이지 분석 및 데이터 주도 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 SEO 코딩 어시스턴트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para asistentes de codificación SEO que necesitan un análisis de página programático avanzado y una generación de contenido basada en datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les assistants de codage SEO ayant besoin d''une analyse de page programmatique avancée et d''une génération de contenu basée sur les données.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Coding-Assistenten, die eine fortschrittliche programmmatische Seitenanalyse und eine datengetriebene Inhaltsgenerierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Assistente de Codificação SEO que necessita de análise avançada de páginas programáticas e geração de conteúdo baseado em dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для помощников SEO по кодированию, которым требуется продвинутый программный анализ страниц и генерация контента на основе данных.","ar":"مثالي للمساعدين في 编程 تحسين محركات البحث الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم للصفحات البرمجية وإنشاء محتوى مدعوم بالبيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze codebases, business contexts, and markets to determine viable programmatic SEO pages, leveraging data-first and intent-matched principles, and identifying available structured data for generation.","zh":"赋予代理分析代码库、业务背景和市场以确定可行的程序化SEO页面，利用数据优先和意图匹配原则，并找出可用的结构化数据用于生成。","ja":"エージェントにコードベース、ビジネス・コンテキスト、市場を分析して、実行可能なプログラムによるSEOページを決定する権限を与え、データ優先と意図に合った原則を利用し、生成のための利用可能な構造化データを特定する。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스, 비즈니스 contexto 및 시장을 분석하여 실행 가능한 프로그래밍 SEO 페이지를 결정하고, 데이터 우선 및 의도에 맞는 원칙을 활용하며, 생성을 위한 사용 가능한 구조화된 데이터를 식별할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar bases de código, contextos comerciales y mercados para determinar páginas de SEO programáticas viables, aprovechando principios de datos en primer lugar y coincidencia de intenciones, e identificando datos estructurados disponibles para la generación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les bases de code, les contextes commerciaux et les marchés pour déterminer des pages SEO programmatiques viables, en exploitant des principes de données en premier lieu et d''appariement d''intention, et en identifiant des données structurées disponibles pour la génération.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Codebasen, Geschäftskontexte und Märkte zu analysieren, um lebensfähige programmmatische SEO-Seiten zu bestimmen, wobei datengetriebene und intentionsübereinstimmende Grundsätze genutzt werden und verfügbare strukturierte Daten für die Generierung identifiziert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar repositórios de código, contextos empresariais e mercados para determinar páginas SEO programáticas viáveis, aproveitando princípios de dados em primeiro lugar e correspondência de intenção, e identificando dados estruturados disponíveis para geração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать кодовые базы, бизнес-контексты и рынки для определения жизнеспособных программных страниц SEO, используя принципы «данные прежде всего» и соответствие намерений, а также выявление доступных структурированных данных для генерации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحليل قواعد البيانات وسياقات العمل وأسواق لتحديد صفحات تحسين محركات البحث البرمجية الممكنة، مستفيداً من مبادئ البيانات أولاً وتماثل النية، وتحديد البيانات المهيكلة المتاحة للإنشاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pSEO page type proposals","Generating data-backed content recommendations","Determining required data sources for SEO page generation"],"zh":["自动化程序化SEO页面类型提案","生成数据支持的内容推荐","确定SEO页面生成所需的数据源"],"ja":["プログラムによるSEOページタイプの提案の自動化","データに裏付けられたコンテンツの推薦の生成","SEOページ生成に必要なデータソースの特定"],"ko":["프로그램 SEO 페이지 유형 제안의 자동화","데이터 지원 콘텐츠 추천 생성","SEO 페이지 생성에 필요한 데이터 소스 결정"],"es":["Automatización de propuestas de tipo de página de pSEO","Generación de recomendaciones de contenido respaldadas por datos","Determinación de fuentes de datos necesarias para la generación de páginas de SEO"],"fr":["Automatisation des propositions de type de page pSEO","Génération de recommandations de contenu étayées par des données","Détermination des sources de données nécessaires pour la génération de pages SEO"],"de":["Automatisierung von pSEO-Seitenvorschlägen","Generierung von datengetriebenen Inhaltsempfehlungen","Bestimmung der erforderlichen Datenquellen für die SEO-Seitengenerierung"],"pt":["Automatizar propostas de tipo de página pSEO","Gerar recomendações de conteúdo baseadas em dados","Determinar fontes de dados necessárias para geração de página SEO"],"ru":["Автоматизация предложений типа страницы pSEO","Генерация рекомендаций контента на основе данных","Определение необходимых источников данных для генерации страницы SEO"],"ar":["أتمتة مقترحات نوع صفحة تحسين محركات البحث البرمجية","توليد توصيات المحتوى المدعومة بالبيانات","تحديد مصادر البيانات المطلوبة لإنشاء صفحة تحسين محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase and business context data","Dependent on availability of structured data for page generation"],"zh":["需要访问代码库和业务背景数据","取决于页面生成的结构化数据的可用性"],"ja":["コードベースとビジネス・コンテキスト・データへのアクセスが必要","ページ生成のための構造化データの可用性に依存する"],"ko":["코드베이스 및 비즈니스 contexto 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요함","페이지 생성을 위한 구조화된 데이터의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de código y contexto empresarial","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de datos estructurados para la generación de páginas"],"fr":["Requiert un accès aux données de code et de contexte commercial","Dépend de la disponibilité de données structurées pour la génération de pages"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Codebasis- und Geschäftskontextdaten","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von strukturierten Daten für die SeitenGenerierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos dados do repositório de código e contexto empresarial","Depende da disponibilidade de dados estruturados para geração de páginas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным кодовой базы и бизнес-контекста","Зависит от наличия структурированных данных для генерации страниц"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات قاعدة البيانات وسياق العمل","يعتمد على توافر البيانات المهيكلة لإنشاء الصفحات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ahmed3elshaer/everything-claude-code-mobile/ktor-patterns', 'community', 'ahmed3elshaer', 'everything-claude-code-mobile', 'ahmed3elshaer/everything-claude-code-mobile', 'ktor-patterns', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:27:11.518Z', NULL, '{"id":"ahmed3elshaer/everything-claude-code-mobile/ktor-patterns","name":"ktor-patterns","description":{"zh":"Ktor 客户端模式是一种现代的 HTTP 客户端，用于 Kotlin 移动优先开发，提供 JSON 序列化、超时设置和日志记录等功能","ja":"Ktor クライアントパターンは、Kotlin モバイルファースト開発向けのモダンな HTTP クライアントであり、JSON シリアル化、タイムアウト設定、ログ記録などを提供します","ko":"Ktor 클라이언트 패턴은 Kotlin 모바일 우선 개발을 위한 현대적인 HTTP 클라이언트로서 JSON 직렬화, 시간 초과 설정, 로그 기록 등을 제공합니다","es":"Ktor es un cliente HTTP moderno para Kotlin que permite configurar timeouts y serialización JSON para aplicaciones móviles","fr":"Ktor est un client HTTP moderne pour Kotlin qui permet de configurer les timeouts et la sérialisation JSON pour les applications mobiles","de":"Ktor ist ein moderner HTTP-Client für Kotlin, der die Konfiguration von Timeouts und JSON-Serialisierung für Mobile-Anwendungen ermöglicht","pt":"O Ktor fornece um cliente HTTP moderno para Kotlin, permitindo a configuração de serialização JSON e timeouts.","ru":"Ktor предоставляет современный HTTP-клиент для Kotlin, позволяя настраивать сериализацию JSON и таймауты.","ar":"يوفّر Ktor عميل أتش تي تي بي حديث ل Kotlin، مما يسمح بالتكوين تسلسل JSON وタイأوتات.","en":"Makes Claude code mobile first"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Ktor 客户端模式 - Kotlin 移动优先开发","ja":"Ktor クライアントパターン - Kotlin モバイルファースト開発","ko":"Ktor 클라이언트 패턴 - Kotlin 모바일 우선 개발","es":"Patrones de Ktor para Desarrolladores","fr":"Modèles Ktor pour les Développeurs","de":"Ktor-Muster für Entwickler","pt":"Padrões Ktor: Desenvolvimento de Clientes HTTP para Kotlin","ru":"Шаблоны Ktor: Создание клиентов HTTP для Kotlin","ar":"نماذج Ktor: تطوير العميل أتش تي تي بي ل Kotlin","en":"ktor-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Ktor 客户端模式是一种现代的 HTTP 客户端，用于 Kotlin 移动优先开发，提供 JSON 序列化、超时设置和日志记录等功能","ja":"Ktor クライアントパターンは、Kotlin モバイルファースト開発向けのモダンな HTTP クライアントであり、JSON シリアル化、タイムアウト設定、ログ記録などを提供します","ko":"Ktor 클라이언트 패턴은 Kotlin 모바일 우선 개발을 위한 현대적인 HTTP 클라이언트로서 JSON 직렬화, 시간 초과 설정, 로그 기록 등을 제공합니다","es":"Ktor es un cliente HTTP moderno para Kotlin que permite configurar timeouts y serialización JSON para aplicaciones móviles","fr":"Ktor est un client HTTP moderne pour Kotlin qui permet de configurer les timeouts et la sérialisation JSON pour les applications mobiles","de":"Ktor ist ein moderner HTTP-Client für Kotlin, der die Konfiguration von Timeouts und JSON-Serialisierung für Mobile-Anwendungen ermöglicht","pt":"O Ktor fornece um cliente HTTP moderno para Kotlin, permitindo a configuração de serialização JSON e timeouts.","ru":"Ktor предоставляет современный HTTP-клиент для Kotlin, позволяя настраивать сериализацию JSON и таймауты.","ar":"يوفّر Ktor عميل أتش تي تي بي حديث ل Kotlin، مما يسمح بالتكوين تسلسل JSON وタイأوتات.","en":"Makes Claude code mobile first"},"definition":{"en":"Makes Claude code mobile first"},"features":{"zh":["JSON 序列化","超时设置","日志记录","移动优先开发","Kotlin 支持"],"ja":["JSON シリアル化","タイムアウト設定","ログ記録","モバイルファースト開発","Kotlin 対応"],"ko":["JSON 직렬화","시간 초과 설정","로그 기록","모바일 우선 개발","Kotlin 지원"],"es":["Configuración de timeouts para solicitudes HTTP","Serialización JSON para datos de respuesta","Compatibilidad con OkHttp","Configuración de conectividad y socket","Soporte para aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Configuration des délais d''attente pour les requêtes HTTP","Sérialisation JSON pour les données de réponse","Compatibilité avec OkHttp","Configuration de la connectivité et du socket","Prise en charge des applications mobiles"],"de":["Konfiguration von Timeouts für HTTP-Anfragen","JSON-Serialisierung für Antwortdaten","Kompatibilität mit OkHttp","Konfiguration von Konnektivität und Socket","Unterstützung für Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Configuração de serialização JSON","Definição de timeouts para requisições","Instalação de módulos de negociação de conteúdo","Otimização do desempenho do cliente","Suporte a diferentes bibliotecas de HTTP"],"ru":["Настройка сериализации JSON","Определение таймаутов для запросов","Установка модулей согласования содержимого","Оптимизация производительности клиента","Поддержка различных библиотек HTTP"],"ar":["تكوين تسلسل JSON","تحديد التايم أوت للطلبات","تثبيت وحدات التوفيق المحتوى","تحسين أداء العميل","دعم مكتبات HTTP المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ktor 客户端模式","Kotlin 移动优先开发","现代 HTTP 客户端","JSON 序列化","超时设置","日志记录"],"ja":["Ktor クライアントパターン","Kotlin モバイルファースト開発","モダンな HTTP クライアント","JSON シリアル化","タイムアウト設定","ログ記録"],"ko":["Ktor 클라이언트 패턴","Kotlin 모바일 우선 개발","현대적인 HTTP 클라이언트","JSON 직렬화","시간 초과 설정","로그 기록"],"es":["Ktor","cliente HTTP","Kotlin","aplicaciones móviles","serialización JSON","timeouts","OkHttp","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Ktor","client HTTP","Kotlin","applications mobiles","sérialisation JSON","délais d''attente","OkHttp","développement d''applications"],"de":["Ktor","HTTP-Client","Kotlin","Mobile-Anwendungen","JSON-Serialisierung","Timeouts","OkHttp","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Ktor","Cliente HTTP","Kotlin","Desenvolvimento de software","Padrões de design","Serialização JSON","Timeouts","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Ktor","HTTP-клиент","Kotlin","Разработка программного обеспечения","Шаблоны проектирования","Сериализация JSON","Таймауты","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["Ktor","عميل أتش تي تي بي","Kotlin","تطوير البرمجيات","نماذج التصميم","تسلسل JSON","تايم أوت","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"ahmed3elshaer","repo":"everything-claude-code-mobile","repoPath":"ahmed3elshaer/everything-claude-code-mobile","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ktor-patterns","description":"Ktor client patterns for Android networking with content negotiation, error handling, and interceptors.","bodyPreview":"# Ktor Client Patterns\n\nModern HTTP client for Kotlin.\n\n## Client Setup\n\n```kotlin\nval httpClient = HttpClient(OkHttp) {\n    // JSON serialization\n    install(ContentNegotiation) {\n        json(Json {\n            ignoreUnknownKeys = true\n            isLenient = true\n            prettyPrint = false\n        })\n    }\n    \n    // Timeouts\n    install(HttpTimeout) {\n        requestTimeoutMillis = 30_000\n        connectTimeoutMillis = 10_000\n        socketTimeoutMillis = 30_000\n    }\n    \n    // Loggi","body":"# Ktor Client Patterns\n\nModern HTTP client for Kotlin.\n\n## Client Setup\n\n```kotlin\nval httpClient = HttpClient(OkHttp) {\n    // JSON serialization\n    install(ContentNegotiation) {\n        json(Json {\n            ignoreUnknownKeys = true\n            isLenient = true\n            prettyPrint = false\n        })\n    }\n    \n    // Timeouts\n    install(HttpTimeout) {\n        requestTimeoutMillis = 30_000\n        connectTimeoutMillis = 10_000\n        socketTimeoutMillis = 30_000\n    }\n    \n    // Logging (debug only)\n    install(Logging) {\n        logger = Logger.ANDROID\n        level = if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) LogLevel.BODY else LogLevel.NONE\n    }\n    \n    // Default request config\n    defaultRequest {\n        url(\"https://api.example.com\")\n        contentType(ContentType.Application.Json)\n    }\n    \n    // Auth\n    install(Auth) {\n        bearer {\n            loadTokens {\n                BearerTokens(tokenStorage.accessToken, tokenStorage.refreshToken)\n            }\n            refreshTokens {\n                val response = client.post(\"auth/refresh\") {\n                    setBody(RefreshRequest(tokenStorage.refreshToken))\n                }\n                tokenStorage.save(response.body())\n                BearerTokens(response.body<TokenResponse>().accessToken, response.body<TokenResponse>().refreshToken)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## API Definition\n\n```kotlin\nclass UserApi(private val client: HttpClient) {\n    \n    suspend fun getUsers(): List<UserDto> {\n        return client.get(\"users\").body()\n    }\n    \n    suspend fun getUser(id: String): UserDto {\n        return client.get(\"users/$id\").body()\n    }\n    \n    suspend fun createUser(request: CreateUserRequest): UserDto {\n        return client.post(\"users\") {\n            setBody(request)\n        }.body()\n    }\n    \n    suspend fun updateUser(id: String, request: UpdateUserRequest): UserDto {\n        return client.put(\"users/$id\") {\n            setBody(request)\n        }.body()\n    }\n    \n    suspend fun deleteUser(id: String) {\n        client.delete(\"users/$id\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```kotlin\nclass ApiException(\n    val statusCode: Int,\n    override val message: String\n) : Exception(message)\n\nsuspend inline fun <reified T> HttpClient.safeRequest(\n    block: HttpRequestBuilder.() -> Unit\n): Result<T> = runCatching {\n    val response = request(block)\n    \n    if (response.status.isSuccess()) {\n        response.body<T>()\n    } else {\n        throw ApiException(\n            statusCode = response.status.value,\n            message = response.bodyAsText()\n        )\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage\nclass UserRepository(private val api: UserApi, private val client: HttpClient) {\n    suspend fun getUser(id: String): Result<User> {\n        return client.safeRequest<UserDto> {\n            url(\"users/$id\")\n            method = HttpMethod.Get\n        }.map { it.toDomain() }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## DTOs and Mapping\n\n```kotlin\n@Serializable\ndata class UserDto(\n    val id: String,\n    val email: String,\n    @SerialName(\"first_name\")\n    val firstName: String,\n    @SerialName(\"created_at\")\n    val createdAt: String\n)\n\nfun UserDto.toDomain(): User = User(\n    id = id,\n    email = email,\n    name = firstName,\n    createdAt = Instant.parse(createdAt)\n)\n```\n\n## Interceptors\n\n```kotlin\nval client = HttpClient(OkHttp) {\n    // Request interceptor\n    install(HttpSend) {\n        intercept { request ->\n            request.headers.append(\"X-Client-Version\", BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME)\n            execute(request)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Certificate Pinning\n\n```kotlin\nval client = HttpClient(OkHttp) {\n    engine {\n        config {\n            certificatePinner(\n                CertificatePinner.Builder()\n                    .add(\"api.example.com\", \"sha256/AAAA...\")\n                    .add(\"api.example.com\", \"sha256/BBBB...\")  // Backup pin\n                    .build()\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**Remember**: Ktor is coroutine-first. Embrace suspend functions, handle errors properly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:27:11.518Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Kotlin-based AI Agents needing modern HTTP client capabilities with JSON serialization and timeout configurations.","zh":"非常适合需要现代HTTP客户端功能、JSON序列化和超时配置的Kotlin-based AI代理","ja":"KotlinベースのAIエージェントが最新のHTTPクライアント機能、JSONシリアル化、タイムアウト設定を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"최신 HTTP 클라이언트 기능, JSON 직렬화 및 타임아웃 구성이 필요한 Kotlin 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Kotlin que necesitan capacidades de cliente HTTP modernas con serialización JSON y configuraciones de tiempo de espera.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Kotlin nécessitant des fonctionnalités de client HTTP modernes avec sérialisation JSON et configurations de délai d''attente.","de":"Perfekt für auf Kotlin basierende KI-Agents, die moderne HTTP-Client-Funktionen mit JSON-Serialisierung und Timeout-Konfigurationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Kotlin que necessitam de capacidades de cliente HTTP modernas com serialização JSON e configurações de tempo limite.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Kotlin, которым необходимы современные возможности HTTP-клиента с сериализацией JSON и настройками таймаута.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي القائم على Kotlin الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات العميل HTTP الحديثة مع تسلسل JSON وتفاصيل إعدادات الوقت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create mobile-first experiences using Ktor Client Patterns, leveraging OkHttp for robust HTTP requests, ContentNegotiation for JSON serialization, and HttpTimeout for configurable timeouts, ensuring reliable and efficient data exchange over HTTP and HTTPS protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建移动优先体验的能力，使用Ktor Client模式，利用OkHttp进行强大的HTTP请求，ContentNegotiation进行JSON序列化，并使用HttpTimeout进行可配置的超时设置，确保通过HTTP和HTTPS协议可靠高效的数据交换","ja":"エージェントがモバイルファースト体験を作成する能力を付与することで、Ktor Clientパターンを使用し、OkHttpを使用して強力なHTTPリクエストを実行し、ContentNegotiationを使用してJSONシリアル化を行い、HttpTimeoutを使用して可構成のタイムアウト設定を行い、HTTPおよびHTTPSプロトコルを介した信頼性の高い効率的なデータ交換を保証する","ko":"에이전트가 모바일 우선 경험을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Ktor Client 패턴을 사용하고 OkHttp를 사용하여 강력한 HTTP 요청을 수행하며 ContentNegotiation을 사용하여 JSON 직렬화를 수행하며 HttpTimeout을 사용하여 구성 가능한 타임아웃 설정을 수행하여 HTTP 및 HTTPS 프로토콜을 통해 신뢰할 수 있고 효율적인 데이터 교환을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias de primera generación móvil utilizando patrones de cliente Ktor, aprovechando OkHttp para solicitudes HTTP robustas, ContentNegotiation para serialización JSON y HttpTimeout para tiempos de espera configurables, garantizando un intercambio de datos confiable y eficiente a través de los protocolos HTTP y HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences mobiles de première génération en utilisant des modèles de client Ktor, en exploitant OkHttp pour des requêtes HTTP robustes, ContentNegotiation pour la sérialisation JSON et HttpTimeout pour des délais d''attente configurables, assurant un échange de données fiable et efficace via les protocoles HTTP et HTTPS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, mobile Erlebnisse der ersten Generation zu erstellen, indem sie Muster des Ktor-Clients verwenden, OkHttp für robuste HTTP-Anfragen nutzen, ContentNegotiation für JSON-Serialisierung und HttpTimeout für konfigurierbare Timeouts, um einen zuverlässigen und effizienten Datenaustausch über HTTP- und HTTPS-Protokolle zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar experiências mobile-first usando padrões de cliente Ktor, aproveitando OkHttp para solicitações HTTP robustas, ContentNegotiation para serialização JSON e HttpTimeout para temporizações configuráveis, garantindo troca de dados confiável e eficiente sobre os protocolos HTTP e HTTPS.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать мобильные trải nghiệm используя шаблоны клиента Ktor, используя OkHttp для робастных HTTP-запросов, ContentNegotiation для сериализации JSON и HttpTimeout для настраиваемых таймаутов, обеспечивая надёжный и эффективный обмен данными по протоколам HTTP и HTTPS.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تجارب محمولة أولاً باستخدام أنماط عميل Ktor ، وتحقيق OkHttp لطلبات HTTP قوية ، و ContentNegotiation لتسلسل JSON و HttpTimeout لضبط الوقت ، مما يضمن تبادل البيانات الموثوق والفعال عبر بروتوكولات HTTP و HTTPS"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring HTTP clients for mobile-first applications","Implementing JSON serialization with ignoreUnknownKeys and isLenient settings","Setting up request, connect, and socket timeouts for reliable data transfer"],"zh":["为移动优先应用程序配置HTTP客户端","使用ignoreUnknownKeys和isLenient设置实现JSON序列化","设置请求、连接和套接字超时以实现可靠的数据传输"],"ja":["モバイルファーストアプリケーションのためのHTTPクライアントの構成","ignoreUnknownKeysとisLenient設定を使用したJSONシリアル化の実装","信頼性の高いデータ転送のためのリクエスト、接続、ソケットのタイムアウトの設定"],"ko":["모바일 우선 애플리케이션을 위한 HTTP 클라이언트 구성","ignoreUnknownKeys 및 isLenient 설정을 사용한 JSON 직렬화 구현","신뢰할 수 있는 데이터 전송을 위한 요청, 연결, 소켓 타임아웃 설정"],"es":["Configuración de clientes HTTP para aplicaciones de primera generación móvil","Implementación de serialización JSON con configuraciones ignoreUnknownKeys y isLenient","Configuración de tiempos de espera de solicitud, conexión y socket para un transferencia de datos confiable"],"fr":["Configuration des clients HTTP pour les applications mobiles de première génération","Mise en œuvre de la sérialisation JSON avec les paramètres ignoreUnknownKeys et isLenient","Configuration des délais d''attente de requête, de connexion et de socket pour un transfert de données fiable"],"de":["Konfiguration von HTTP-Clients für mobile Erlebnisse der ersten Generation","Implementierung von JSON-Serialisierung mit ignoreUnknownKeys- und isLenient-Einstellungen","Einrichtung von Anfrage-, Verbindungs- und Socket-Timeouts für einen zuverlässigen Datentransfer"],"pt":["Configurando clientes HTTP para aplicações mobile-first","Implementando serialização JSON com configurações ignoreUnknownKeys e isLenient","Configurando tempos limite de solicitação, conexão e soquete para transferência de dados confiável"],"ru":["Настройка HTTP-клиентов для мобильных приложений первого поколения","Реализация сериализации JSON с настройками ignoreUnknownKeys и isLenient","Настройка таймаутов запроса, соединения и сокета для надёжной передачи данных"],"ar":["تهيئة العملاء HTTP للتطبيقات المحمولة الأولى","تنفيذ تسلسل JSON مع إعدادات ignoreUnknownKeys و isLenient","ضبط أوقات الطلب والاتصال والمنفذ لتحويل البيانات الموثوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kotlin programming language","Dependent on OkHttp and Ktor Client libraries","Specific to HTTP and HTTPS protocols"],"zh":["需要Kotlin编程语言","依赖于OkHttp和Ktor Client库","仅限HTTP和HTTPS协议"],"ja":["Kotlinプログラミング言語が必要","OkHttpおよびKtor Clientライブラリに依存","HTTPおよびHTTPSプロトコルのみ"],"ko":["Kotlin 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","OkHttp 및 Ktor Client 라이브러리에 의존","HTTP 및 HTTPS 프로토콜만"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Kotlin","Dependiente de las bibliotecas OkHttp y Ktor Client","Específico para los protocolos HTTP y HTTPS"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Kotlin","Dépendant des bibliothèques OkHttp et Ktor Client","Spécifique aux protocoles HTTP et HTTPS"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Kotlin","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken OkHttp und Ktor Client","Spezifisch für die Protokolle HTTP und HTTPS"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Kotlin","Dependente das bibliotecas OkHttp e Ktor Client","Específico para protocolos HTTP e HTTPS"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Kotlin","Зависит от библиотек OkHttp и Ktor Client","Специфичен для протоколов HTTP и HTTPS"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة Kotlin","يعتمد على مكتبات OkHttp و Ktor Client","محدد لبروتوكولات HTTP و HTTPS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
