ill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-to-backend-requirements","description":"Document frontend data needs for backend developers. Use when frontend needs to communicate API requirements to backend, or user says backend requirements, what data do I need, API requirements, or is describing data needs for a UI.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to re","body":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to render this screen?\n- What actions should the user be able to perform?\n- What business rules affect the UI?\n- What states and errors should I handle?\n\n**You''re requesting, not demanding.** Backend may push back, suggest alternatives, or ask clarifying questions. That''s healthy collaboration.\n\n---\n\n## What You Own vs. What Backend Owns\n\n| Frontend Owns | Backend Owns |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| What data is needed | How data is structured |\n| What actions exist | Endpoint design |\n| UI states to handle | Field names, types |\n| User-facing validation | API conventions |\n| Display requirements | Performance/caching |\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Describe the Feature\n\nBefore listing requirements:\n\n1. **What is this?** — Screen, flow, component\n2. **Who uses it?** — User type, permissions\n3. **What''s the goal?** — What does success look like?\n\n### Step 2: List Data Needs\n\nFor each screen/component, describe:\n\n**Data I need to display:**\n- What information appears on screen?\n- What''s the relationship between pieces?\n- What determines visibility/state?\n\n**Actions user can perform:**\n- What can the user do?\n- What''s the expected outcome?\n- What feedback should they see?\n\n**States I need to handle:**\n- Loading, empty, error, success\n- Edge cases (partial data, expired, etc.)\n\n### Step 3: Surface Uncertainties\n\nList what you''re unsure about:\n- Business rules you don''t fully understand\n- Edge cases you''re not sure how to handle\n- Places where you''re guessing\n\n**These invite backend to clarify or push back.**\n\n### Step 4: Leave Room for Discussion\n\nEnd with open questions:\n- \"Would it make sense to...?\"\n- \"Should I expect...?\"\n- \"Is there a simpler way to...?\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nCreate `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Backend Requirements: <Feature Name>\n\n## Context\n[What we''re building, who it''s for, what problem it solves]\n\n## Screens/Components\n\n### <Screen/Component Name>\n**Purpose**: What this screen does\n\n**Data I need to display**:\n- [Description of data piece, not field name]\n- [Another piece]\n- [Relationships between pieces]\n\n**Actions**:\n- [Action description] → [Expected outcome]\n- [Another action] → [Expected outcome]\n\n**States to handle**:\n- **Empty**: [When/why this happens]\n- **Loading**: [What''s being fetched]\n- **Error**: [What can go wrong, what user sees]\n- **Special**: [Any edge cases]\n\n**Business rules affecting UI**:\n- [Rule that changes what''s visible/enabled]\n- [Permissions that affect actions]\n\n### <Next Screen/Component>\n...\n\n## Uncertainties\n- [ ] Not sure if [X] should show when [Y]\n- [ ] Don''t understand the business rule for [Z]\n- [ ] Guessing that [A] means [B]\n\n## Questions for Backend\n- Would it make sense to combine [X] and [Y]?\n- Should I expect [Z] to always be present?\n- Is there existing data I can reuse for [W]?\n\n## Discussion Log\n[Backend responses, decisions made, changes to requirements]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Good vs. Bad Requests\n\n### Bad (Dictating Implementation)\n> \"I need a GET /api/contracts endpoint that returns an array with fields: id, title, status, created_at\"\n\n### Good (Describing Needs)\n> \"I need to show a list of contracts. Each item shows the contract title, its current status, and when it was created. User should be able to filter by status.\"\n\n### Bad (Assuming Structure)\n> \"The provider object should be nested inside the contract response\"\n\n### Good (Describing Relationship)\n> \"For each contract, I need to show who the provider is (their name and maybe logo)\"\n\n### Bad (No Context)\n> \"I need contract data\"\n\n### Good (With Context)\n> \"On the dashboard, there''s a ''Recent Contracts'' widget showing the 5 most recent contracts. User clicks one to go to detail page.\"\n\n---\n\n## Encouraging Pushback\n\nInclude these prompts in your requirements:\n\n- \"Let me know if this doesn''t make sense for how the data is structured\"\n- \"Open to suggestions on a better approach\"\n- \"Not sure if this is the right way to think about it\"\n- \"Push back if this complicates things unnecessarily\"\n\n**Good collaboration = frontend describes the problem, backend proposes the solution.**\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **NO IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS**—don''t specify endpoints, methods, field names\n- **DESCRIBE, DON''T PRESCRIBE**—say what you need, not how to provide it\n- **INCLUDE CONTEXT**—why you need it helps backend make better choices\n- **SURFACE UNKNOWNS**—don''t hide confusion, invite clarification\n- **INVITE PUSHBACK**—explicitly ask for backend''s input\n- **UPDATE THE DOC**—add backend responses to Discussion Log\n- **STAY HUMBLE**—you''re asking, not demanding\n\n---\n\n## After Backend Responds\n\nUpdate the requirements doc:\n1. Add responses to Discussion Log\n2. Adjust requirements based on feedback\n3. Mark resolved uncertainties\n4. Note any decisions made\n\nThe doc becomes the source of truth for what was agreed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:28:03.070Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing to streamline frontend-to-backend communication and requirement documentation.","zh":"非常适合需要简化前端到后端通信和需求文档的全栈代理","ja":"フルスタックエージェントがフロントエンドからバックエンドへのコミュニケーションと要件文書をストリームライン化する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"전체 스택 에이전트가 프론트엔드에서 백엔드로의 통신 및 요구 사항 문서를 간소화하는 데 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan optimizar la comunicación de frontend a backend y la documentación de requisitos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de rationaliser la communication de frontend à backend et la documentation des exigences.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agenten, die die Kommunikation von Frontend zu Backend und die Dokumentation der Anforderungen optimieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam simplificar a comunicação de frontend para backend e documentação de requisitos.","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, которым необходимо оптимизировать связь между frontend и backend, а также документацию требований.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرامج الكاملة الذين يحتاجون إلى تبسيط التواصل من واجهة المستخدم إلى الخادم والتوثيق المتعلق بالمتطلبات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to effectively document and communicate data needs from frontend to backend using Markdown files, specifically generating `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files, and focusing on ''what'' data is needed without delving into implementation details such as endpoints, field names, or API structure.","zh":"使代理能够有效地记录和传达从前端到后端的数据需求，使用Markdown文件，特别是生成`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`文件，并专注于需要的数据的''什么''而不涉及诸如端点、字段名称或API结构等实现细节","ja":"エージェントがフロントエンドからバックエンドへのデータ要件を効果的に文書化および伝達できるようにする。Markdownファイルを使用し、特に`.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`ファイルを生成し、実装の詳細 such as エンドポイント、フィールド名、またはAPI構造ではなく、必要なデータの''何''に焦点を当てる","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드로의 데이터 요구 사항을 효과적으로 문서화하고 전달할 수 있도록 에이전트를 능력화합니다. Markdown 파일을 사용하여 특히 `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` 파일을 생성하고 구현 세부 정보 such as 엔드 포인트, 필드 이름 또는 API 구조를 다루지 않고 필요한 데이터의 ''무엇''에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a documentar y comunicar eficazmente las necesidades de datos de frontend a backend utilizando archivos Markdown, generando específicamente archivos `.claude/docs/ai/<nombre-de-característica>/backend-requirements.md` y centrándose en ''qué'' datos son necesarios sin profundizar en detalles de implementación como puntos de conexión, nombres de campo o estructura de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de documenter et de communiquer efficacement les besoins de données de frontend à backend en utilisant des fichiers Markdown, en générant spécifiquement des fichiers `.claude/docs/ai/<nom-de-fonctionnalité>/backend-requirements.md` et en se concentrant sur ''ce que'' les données sont nécessaires sans s''attarder sur les détails d''implémentation tels que les points de terminaison, les noms de champ ou la structure de l''API.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Datenanforderungen von Frontend zu Backend effektiv zu dokumentieren und zu kommunizieren, indem sie Markdown-Dateien verwenden, insbesondere `.claude/docs/ai/<funktion-name>/backend-requirements.md`-Dateien generieren, und sich auf ''welche'' Daten benötigt werden konzentrieren, ohne sich mit Implementierungsdetails wie Endpunkten, Feldnamen oder API-Struktur auseinanderzusetzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a documentar e comunicar de forma eficaz as necessidades de dados do frontend para o backend utilizando arquivos Markdown, gerando especificamente arquivos `.claude/docs/ai/<nome-do-recurso>/requisitos-do-backend.md`, e se concentrando no ''o que'' os dados são necessários sem mergulhar em detalhes de implementação como endpoints, nomes de campos ou estrutura de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно документировать и передавать необходимые данные от frontend к backend с помощью файлов Markdown, в частности, генерируя файлы `.claude/docs/ai/<имя-функции>/требования-бэкенда.md`, сосредотачиваясь на ''что'' необходимо, не вдаваясь в подробности реализации, такие как конечные точки, имена полей или структура API.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توثيق وتبادل متطلبات البيانات من واجهة المستخدم إلى الخادم بفعالية باستخدام ملفات Markdown، و特别 بالملفات `.claude/docs/ai/<اسم-الميزة>/متطلبات-الخادم.md`، ويركز على ''ما'' البيانات المطلوبة بدون الخوض في تفاصيل التنفيذ مثل النقاط النهائية أو أسماء الحقول أو هيكل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting data requirements for new feature development","Communicating frontend needs to backend teams efficiently","Generating backend requirement documents in Markdown format"],"zh":["记录新功能开发的数据需求","高效地将前端需求传达给后端团队","以Markdown格式生成后端需求文档"],"ja":["新しい機能開発のためのデータ要件を文書化する","フロントエンドのニーズをバックエンドチームに効率的に伝達する","バックエンド要件文書をMarkdown形式で生成する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 개발을 위한 데이터 요구 사항을 문서화","프론트엔드의 요구 사항을 백엔드 팀에 효율적으로 전달","백엔드 요구 사항 문서를 Markdown 형식으로 생성"],"es":["Documentar requisitos de datos para el desarrollo de nuevas características","Comunicar eficientemente las necesidades de frontend a los equipos de backend","Generar documentos de requisitos de backend en formato Markdown"],"fr":["Documenter les exigences de données pour le développement de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Communiquer efficacement les besoins de frontend aux équipes de backend","Générer des documents d''exigences de backend au format Markdown"],"de":["Dokumentieren von Datenanforderungen für die Entwicklung neuer Funktionen","Effiziente Kommunikation der Frontend-Bedürfnisse an die Backend-Teams","Generieren von Backend-Anforderungsdokumenten im Markdown-Format"],"pt":["Documentação de requisitos de dados para desenvolvimento de novos recursos","Comunicação eficiente das necessidades do frontend para as equipes de backend","Geração de documentos de requisitos do backend no formato Markdown"],"ru":["Документирование требований к данным для разработки новых функций","Эффективная передача потребностей frontend командам backend","Генерация документов требований backend в формате Markdown"],"ar":["توثيق متطلبات البيانات لتطوير الميزات الجديدة","التواصل بكفاءة لاحتياجات واجهة المستخدم مع فرق الخادم","توليد وثائق متطلبات الخادم بتنسيق Markdown"]},"limitations":{"en":["No implementation details should be included","Responses must be directed to specific Markdown files","Backend implementation specifics are out of scope"],"zh":["不应包含实现细节","响应必须指向特定的Markdown文件","后端实现的具体细节超出范围"],"ja":["実装の詳細を含めるべきではない","レスポンスは特定のMarkdownファイルを指向する必要がある","バックエンドの実装の具体的な詳細は範囲外"],"ko":["구현 세부 정보를 포함해서는 안됩니다","응답은 특정 Markdown 파일을 향한 것이어야 합니다","백엔드 구현의 구체적인 세부 정보는 범위 밖입니다"],"es":["No se deben incluir detalles de implementación","Las respuestas deben dirigirse a archivos Markdown específicos","Los detalles de implementación de backend están fuera del alcance"],"fr":["Aucun détail d''implémentation ne doit être inclus","Les réponses doivent être dirigées vers des fichiers Markdown spécifiques","Les détails d''implémentation de backend sont hors de portée"],"de":["Keine Implementierungsdetails sollten enthalten sein","Antworten müssen an bestimmte Markdown-Dateien gerichtet sein","Backend-Implementierungsdetails sind außerhalb des Umfangs"],"pt":["Não devem ser incluídos detalhes de implementação","Respostas devem ser direcionadas a arquivos Markdown específicos","Detalhes específicos da implementação do backend estão fora do escopo"],"ru":["Не должны включаться детали реализации","Ответы должны быть направлены в конкретные файлы Markdown","Конкретные детали реализации backend находятся вне области действия"],"ar":["لا ينبغي تضمين تفاصيل التنفيذ","الردود يجب أن تكون موجهة إلى ملفات Markdown محددة","تفاصيل تنفيذ الخادم المحددة تقع خارج النطاق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
