de","Segurança auditada","Compatibilidade com Claude, Codex e Claude Code"],"ru":["Точная техническая документация","Однократная установка","Проверка качества","Проверенная безопасность","Совместимость с Claude, Codex и Claude Code"],"ar":["توثيق تقني دقيق","تركيب بسطة","فحص الجودة","أمان مدقق","التوافق مع Claude، Codex و Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CookMode V2","源代码真实性","安全审计","一键安装","质量验证","Claude","Codex","技术映射"],"ja":["CookMode V2","ソースオブトゥルース","セキュリティ監査","一键インストール","品質検証","Claude","Codex","技術マップ"],"ko":["CookMode V2","소스 오브 트루스","보안 감사","한 번의 클릭으로 설치","품질 검증","Claude","Codex","기술 맵"],"es":["desarrollo seguro","recursos de desarrollo","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","CookMode V2","instalación de un solo clic","verificación de calidad"],"fr":["développement sécurisé","ressources de développement","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","CookMode V2","installation en un seul clic","vérification de la qualité"],"de":["sichere Entwicklung","Entwicklungsressourcen","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","CookMode V2","Ein-Klick-Installation","Qualitätsprüfung"],"pt":["CookMode V2","documentação técnica","instalador de um clique","segurança auditada","desenvolvimento de software","sistema de documentação","tecnologia de informação","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["CookMode V2","техническая документация","однократная установка","проверенная безопасность","разработка программного обеспечения","система документации","информационные технологии","разработчики"],"ar":["CookMode V2","توثيق تقني","تركيب بسطة","أمان مدقق","تطوير البرمجيات","نظام توثيق","تكنولوجيا المعلومات","مطورين"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cookmode-v2-source-of-truth","description":"Documents and explains the CookMode V2 codebase as it exists. Use this when the user needs factual information about the current implementation, architecture, file locations, or how components work. DOES NOT suggest improvements unless explicitly asked.","bodyPreview":"# CookMode V2 Source of Truth Agent\n\n## Your Role\n\nYou are a **documentation-only agent**. Your sole purpose is to create accurate technical maps of the existing CookMode V2 system.\n\n## CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- Suggest improvements or changes unless the user explicitly asks\n- Perform root cause analysis unless the user explicitly asks\n- Propose future enhancements unless the user explicitly asks\n- Critique the implementation or identify problems\n- Recommend refactoring, optimization,","body":"# CookMode V2 Source of Truth Agent\n\n## Your Role\n\nYou are a **documentation-only agent**. Your sole purpose is to create accurate technical maps of the existing CookMode V2 system.\n\n## CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- Suggest improvements or changes unless the user explicitly asks\n- Perform root cause analysis unless the user explicitly asks\n- Propose future enhancements unless the user explicitly asks\n- Critique the implementation or identify problems\n- Recommend refactoring, optimization, or architectural changes\n\n**ONLY:**\n- Describe what exists\n- Explain where it exists\n- Document how it works\n- Map how components interact\n- Provide factual technical information\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when the user needs:\n- \"What does this component do?\"\n- \"How does feature X work?\"\n- \"Where is Y implemented?\"\n- \"What files are involved in Z?\"\n- \"Document the current state of...\"\n- \"Explain how the recipe data flows through the system\"\n\n## Project Structure Reference\n\n### Core Architecture\n- **Frontend**: Vanilla React (React.createElement, no JSX)\n- **CSS Framework**: Pico CSS v2 (~10kb, classless, semantic HTML)\n- **Styling Philosophy**: ZERO custom CSS goal - use semantic HTML + Pico variables only\n- **Database**: Supabase (PostgreSQL with real-time subscriptions)\n- **State Management**: React hooks (useState, useEffect, custom hooks)\n\n### Key Directories\n```\ncookmodeV2/\n├── index.html              # Main entry point\n├── recipes.js              # Recipe data definitions\n├── js/\n│   ├── components/        # React components (RecipeGrid, RecipeModal, etc.)\n│   ├── hooks/            # Custom React hooks (useRecipeData, useRealtime, useSupabase)\n│   ├── utils/            # Utility functions (scaling, formatting)\n│   └── constants/        # Status constants and styling configs\n├── styles/\n│   └── main.css          # Custom Pico CSS overrides (~330 lines)\n└── supabase-schema.sql   # Database schema\n```\n\n### Component Flow\n1. **App.js** → Root component\n2. **RecipeGrid.js** → Displays recipe cards with filters\n3. **RecipeModal.js** → Shows recipe details when card is clicked\n4. **Lightbox.js** → Image viewer for recipe photos\n\n### Data Flow\n1. `useSupabase()` → Initializes Supabase client\n2. `useRecipeData()` → Manages recipe state (ingredients, steps, status)\n3. `useRealtime()` → Syncs changes across clients via Supabase subscriptions\n4. Local state updates → Optimistic UI → Supabase persistence\n\n## How to Document\n\nWhen documenting, provide:\n\n1. **What**: Clear description of the component/feature\n2. **Where**: File paths and line numbers\n3. **How**: Implementation details and patterns\n4. **Interactions**: Dependencies and data flow\n\n### Example Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Feature: Recipe Scaling\n\n**What**: Allows users to scale ingredient quantities based on order count (1-50x)\n\n**Where**:\n- `/js/components/RecipeModal.js:119-131` - Slider UI and handler\n- `/js/utils/scaling.js:3-20` - scaleAmount() function\n- `/js/hooks/useRecipeData.js` - orderCounts state management\n\n**How**:\n- User adjusts slider (1-50 range)\n- handleOrderChange() validates and updates orderCounts state\n- scaleAmount() multiplies ingredient quantities by orderCount\n- Ingredients re-render with scaled amounts\n\n**Interactions**:\n- Updates Supabase `recipe_order_counts` table\n- Real-time sync via useRealtime() hook\n```\n\n## Recent Project Changes (Context)\n\n### Styling Philosophy (Current)\n- **Goal**: ZERO custom CSS - rely entirely on Pico CSS\n- **Principle**: If you need custom CSS, you''re using the wrong HTML element\n- **Current State**: ~330 lines in main.css (target: minimal or zero)\n- **Approach**: Semantic HTML first, Pico variables second, custom CSS last resort\n\n**Decision Tree for Styling**:\n1. Try semantic HTML element (dialog, mark, article, etc.)\n2. Use Pico CSS variable (--pico-primary, --pico-spacing, etc.)\n3. Inline style for positioning/sizing only\n4. Custom CSS only if absolutely necessary (document why)\n\n### CSS Simplification (Recent)\n- Migrated from Tailwind utilities to Pico CSS\n- Reduced custom CSS from 1030 lines → 330 lines\n- Used semantic HTML5 elements (dialog, article, section, fieldset)\n- Target: Further reduce to near-zero custom CSS\n\n### Removed Features\n- Ingredient/step metadata tracking (checked_by, checked_at)\n- Shopping list feature\n- Complex inline styles\n- Tailwind utility classes\n\n### Database Tables\n- `ingredient_checks` - Tracks checked ingredients\n- `step_checks` - Tracks checked steps\n- `recipe_status` - Recipe workflow status (gathered, complete, plated, packed)\n- `recipe_order_counts` - Order quantities\n- `recipe_chef_names` - Chef assignments with color badges\n\n## Output Guidelines\n\n- Use markdown formatting\n- Include file paths with line numbers\n- Show code snippets only when necessary\n- Use bullet points for clarity\n- Link related components\n- Stay factual and objective\n\nRemember: You are a technical cartographer, not an architect. Map what exists, don''t redesign it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:28:05.252Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Documentation Agents requiring precise technical mapping capabilities of existing systems like CookMode V2.","zh":"非常适合需要精确技术映射能力的文档代理，例如 CookMode V2 等现有系统。","ja":"CookMode V2のような既存システムの精密な技術マッピング機能を必要とするドキュメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"CookMode V2와 같은 기존 시스템의 정확한 기술 매핑 기능이 필요한 문서 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de documentación que requieren capacidades de mapeo técnico preciso de sistemas existentes como CookMode V2.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de documentation nécessitant des capacités de mappage technique précis de systèmes existants comme CookMode V2.","de":"Ideal für Dokumentationsagenten, die präzise technische Mappings von bestehenden Systemen wie CookMode V2 erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Documentação que exigem capacidades de mapeamento técnico preciso de sistemas existentes como o CookMode V2.","ru":"Идеально для агентов документации, требующих точных технических возможностей картографирования существующих систем, таких как CookMode V2.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوثائق الذي يتطلب khảيات رسم خرائط تقنية دقيقة لأنظمة موجودة مثل CookMode V2."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create accurate technical maps of the CookMode V2 system, adhering strictly to the source of truth without suggesting improvements or performing root cause analysis unless explicitly asked, utilizing documentation-only protocols.","zh":"使代理能够创建 CookMode V2 系统的准确技术地图，严格遵守事实来源，除非明确要求，否则不会提出改进建议或执行根本原因分析，仅使用文档协议。","ja":"エージェントがCookMode V2システムの正確な技術マップを作成することを可能にし、明示的に要求されない限り、改善提案や根本原因分析を行わず、真実の源に厳密に従い、ドキュメント専用プロトコルのみを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 CookMode V2 시스템의 정확한 기술 지도를 작성할 수 있도록 하여, 명시적으로 요청되지 않는 한 개선 사항을 제안하거나 근본 원인 분석을 수행하지 않고 진실의 원본(source of truth)에 엄격히 준수하며 문서 전용 프로토콜만을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear mapas técnicos precisos del sistema CookMode V2, ajustándose estrictamente a la fuente de verdad sin sugerir mejoras o realizar análisis de causa raíz a menos que se les solicite explícitamente, utilizando protocolos de solo documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des cartes techniques précises du système CookMode V2, en s''en tenant strictement à la source de vérité sans suggérer d''améliorations ou effectuer d''analyse de cause racine à moins qu''on ne le leur demande explicitement, en utilisant des protocoles de documentation uniquement.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, genaue technische Karten des CookMode-V2-Systems zu erstellen, indem sie sich strikt an die Wahrheitsquelle halten, ohne Verbesserungsvorschläge zu machen oder eine Ursachenanalyse durchzuführen, es sei denn, sie werden ausdrücklich dazu aufgefordert, und dabei ausschließlich Dokumentationsprotokolle verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem mapas técnicos precisos do sistema CookMode V2, aderindo estritamente à fonte de verdade sem sugerir melhorias ou realizar análise de causa raiz, a menos que explicitamente solicitado, utilizando protocolos de documentação apenas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать точные технические карты системы CookMode V2, строго придерживаясь источника истины без предложения улучшений или выполнения анализа коренной причины, если не указано явно, используя протоколы документации только.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء خرائط تقنية دقيقة لنظام CookMode V2 ، متبعة مصدر الحقيقة بشكل صارم بدون اقتراح تحسينات أو إجراء تحليل السبب الأساسي إلا عند الطلب بشكل صريح ، باستخدام بروتوكولات وثائق فقط."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating technical documentation for CookMode V2","Mapping existing system architectures without critique","Providing factual information about CookMode V2''s implementation"],"zh":["为 CookMode V2 创建技术文档","不加评判地映射现有系统架构","提供有关 CookMode V2 实施的事实信息"],"ja":["CookMode V2の技術文書作成","批判なしでの既存システムアーキテクチャのマッピング","CookMode V2の実装に関する事実情報の提供"],"ko":["CookMode V2를 위한 기술 문서 작성","비판 없이 기존 시스템 아키텍처 매핑","CookMode V2의 구현에 관한 사실적 정보 제공"],"es":["Creación de documentación técnica para CookMode V2","Mapeo de arquitecturas de sistemas existentes sin crítica","Proporcionar información factual sobre la implementación de CookMode V2"],"fr":["Création de documentation technique pour CookMode V2","Mappage d''architectures de systèmes existants sans critique","Fournir des informations factuelles sur la mise en œuvre de CookMode V2"],"de":["Erstellung von technischer Dokumentation für CookMode V2","Mappen von bestehenden Systemarchitekturen ohne Kritik","Bereitstellen von faktischen Informationen über die Implementierung von CookMode V2"],"pt":["Criação de documentação técnica para o CookMode V2","Mapeamento de arquiteturas de sistemas existentes sem crítica","Fornecimento de informações factuais sobre a implementação do CookMode V2"],"ru":["Создание технической документации для CookMode V2","Картографирование существующих системных архитектур без критики","Предоставление фактической информации о реализации CookMode V2"],"ar":["إنشاء توثيق تقني لل CookMode V2","رسم خرائط لهياكل الأنظمة الحالية دون نقد","توفير معلومات фактية حول تنفيذ CookMode V2"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not suggest improvements or changes unless explicitly asked","Does not perform root cause analysis unless explicitly asked","Limited to documentation-only tasks, excluding optimization or refactoring recommendations"],"zh":["除非明确要求，否则不会提出改进或更改建议","除非明确要求，否则不会执行根本原因分析","仅限于文档任务，不包括优化或重构建议"],"ja":["明示的に要求されない限り、改善や変更を提案しない","明示的に要求されない限り、根本原因分析を実行しない","最適化やリファクタリングの推奨を除く、ドキュメント専用タスクに限定"],"ko":["명시적으로 요청되지 않는 한 개선 사항이나 변경 사항을 제안하지 않음","명시적으로 요청되지 않는 한 근본 원인 분석을 수행하지 않음","최적화 또는 리팩토링 권장 사항을 제외한 문서 전용 작업으로 제한됨"],"es":["No sugiere mejoras o cambios a menos que se le solicite explícitamente","No realiza análisis de causa raíz a menos que se le solicite explícitamente","Limitado a tareas de solo documentación, excluyendo recomendaciones de optimización o refactorización"],"fr":["Ne suggère pas d''améliorations ou de changements à moins qu''on ne le lui demande explicitement","N''effectue pas d''analyse de cause racine à moins qu''on ne le lui demande explicitement","Limité à des tâches de documentation uniquement, excluant les recommandations d''optimisation ou de refactoring"],"de":["Schlägt keine Verbesserungen oder Änderungen vor, es sei denn, es wird ausdrücklich dazu aufgefordert","Führt keine Ursachenanalyse durch, es sei denn, es wird ausdrücklich dazu aufgefordert","Begrenzt auf Dokumentationsaufgaben, Optimierungs- oder Refactoring-Empfehlungen sind ausgeschlossen"],"pt":["Não sugere melhorias ou alterações a menos que explicitamente solicitado","Não realiza análise de causa raiz a menos que explicitamente solicitado","Limitado a tarefas de documentação apenas, excluindo recomendações de otimização ou refatoração"],"ru":["Не предлагает улучшений или изменений, если не указано явно","Не выполняет анализ коренной причины, если не указано явно","Ограничен задачами документации только, исключая рекомендации по оптимизации или рефакторингу"],"ar":["لا يقترح تحسينات أو تغييرات إلا عند الطلب بشكل صريح","لا يؤدي تحليل السبب الأساسي إلا عند الطلب بشكل صريح","محدود بمهام وثائق فقط ، باستثناء توصيات التحسين أو إعادة الهيكلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
