-prompt技能生成智能的应用商店评论提示，支持可配置的触发条件和平台检测","ja":"review-promptスキルは、アプリストアレビュープロンプトを生成し、可構成のトリガー条件とプラットフォーム検出をサポートします","ko":"review-prompt 기능은智能한 앱스토어 리뷰 프롬프트를 생성하며, 구성 가능한 트리거 조건과 플랫폼 감지를 지원합니다","es":"El generador de solicitudes de reseñas para App Store permite crear solicitudes de reseñas personalizadas con condiciones de activación y lógica de temporiza...","fr":"Le générateur de demandes d''avis pour l''App Store permet de créer des demandes d''avis personnalisées avec des conditions de déclenchement et une logique de t...","de":"Der App Store-Rezensionsanfragen-Generator ermöglicht die Erstellung personalisierter Rezensionsanfragen mit konfigurierbaren Triggerbedingungen und Zeitlogik","pt":"O gerador de prompts de revisão para App Store é uma ferramenta que ajuda a aumentar as avaliações do seu aplicativo","ru":"Генератор запросов отзывов для App Store - это инструмент, который помогает увеличить оценки вашего приложения","ar":"مُولِد استدراج المراجعات للتطبيقات هو أداة تساعد على زيادة تقييمات تطبيقاتك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["可配置的触发条件","平台检测","适当的时序逻辑","支持App Store rating和app reviews"],"ja":["可構成のトリガー条件","プラットフォーム検出","適切なタイミングロジック","App Store ratingとapp reviewsをサポート"],"ko":["구성 가능한 트리거 조건","플랫폼 감지","적절한 타이밍 로직","App Store rating과 app reviews 지원"],"es":["Condiciones de activación configurables","Detección de plataforma","Lógica de temporización adecuada","Solicitudes de reseñas personalizadas","Integración con StoreKit"],"fr":["Conditions de déclenchement configurables","Détection de plateforme","Logique de temporisation appropriée","Demandes d''avis personnalisées","Intégration avec StoreKit"],"de":["Konfigurierbare Triggerbedingungen","Plattform-Erkennung","Geeignete Zeitlogik","Personalisierte Rezensionsanfragen","Integration mit StoreKit"],"pt":["Geração de prompts de revisão personalizados","Detecção de plataforma para App Store","Lógica de temporização para solicitações de avaliação","Integração com StoreKit para revisões","Configuração de condições de disparo"],"ru":["Генерация индивидуальных запросов отзывов","Обнаружение платформы для App Store","Логика временного интервала для запросов отзывов","Интеграция со StoreKit для отзывов","Настройка условий срабатывания"],"ar":["توليد استدراجات المراجعات المُخصّصة","كشف منصة متجر التطبيقات","منطق توقيت لطلبات التقييم","التكامل مع StoreKit لاستدراج المراجعات","ضبط شروط الاستدراج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["应用商店评论提示","review-prompt","App Store rating","app reviews","StoreKit review","SKStoreReviewController"],"ja":["アプリストアレビュープロンプト","review-prompt","App Store rating","app reviews","StoreKit review","SKStoreReviewController"],"ko":["앱스토어 리뷰 프롬프트","review-prompt","App Store rating","app reviews","StoreKit review","SKStoreReviewController"],"es":["generador de solicitudes de reseñas","App Store","reseñas"," StoreKit","desarrollo de aplicaciones","optimización de aplicaciones"],"fr":["générateur de demandes d''avis","App Store","avis","StoreKit","développement d''applications","optimisation d''applications"],"de":["Rezensionsanfragen-Generator","App Store","Rezensionen","StoreKit","App-Entwicklung","App-Optimierung"],"pt":["gerador de prompts de revisão","App Store","avaliações de aplicativos","StoreKit","revisões de aplicativos","otimização de aplicativos"],"ru":["генератор запросов отзывов","App Store","оценки приложений","StoreKit","отзывы приложений","оптимизация приложений"],"ar":["مُولِد استدراج المراجعات","متجر التطبيقات","تقييمات التطبيقات","StoreKit","مراجعات التطبيقات","تحسين التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"rshankras","repo":"claude-code-apple-skills","repoPath":"rshankras/claude-code-apple-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-prompt","description":"Generates smart App Store review prompt infrastructure with configurable conditions and platform detection. Use when user wants to add review prompts, request ratings, or implement StoreKit reviews.","bodyPreview":"# Review Prompt Generator\n\nGenerate smart App Store review prompting with configurable trigger conditions, platform detection, and proper timing logic.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"add review prompt\" or \"request reviews\"\n- Mentions \"App Store rating\" or \"app reviews\"\n- Wants to \"prompt for ratings\" or \"ask for reviews\"\n- Asks about \"StoreKit review\" or \"SKStoreReviewController\"\n\n## Platform Detection (CRITICAL)\n\n**This skill only applies to App Store di","body":"# Review Prompt Generator\n\nGenerate smart App Store review prompting with configurable trigger conditions, platform detection, and proper timing logic.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"add review prompt\" or \"request reviews\"\n- Mentions \"App Store rating\" or \"app reviews\"\n- Wants to \"prompt for ratings\" or \"ask for reviews\"\n- Asks about \"StoreKit review\" or \"SKStoreReviewController\"\n\n## Platform Detection (CRITICAL)\n\n**This skill only applies to App Store distributed apps.**\n\n### iOS Apps\n- Always applicable (iOS apps require App Store)\n\n### macOS Apps\nDetection steps:\n1. Check for `com.apple.application-identifier` entitlement\n2. Look for Mac App Store related code\n3. If unclear, **ASK THE USER**:\n   - \"Is this app distributed via Mac App Store or direct download?\"\n\n### If NOT App Store:\n- Explain that StoreKit reviews only work for App Store apps\n- Offer alternative: In-app feedback form\n- Skip generation or generate feedback form instead\n\n## Pre-Generation Checks\n\n### 1. Project Context Detection\n- [ ] Determine platform (iOS/macOS)\n- [ ] Check distribution method (App Store vs direct)\n- [ ] Search for existing review prompt code\n- [ ] Identify App entry point\n\n### 2. Conflict Detection\nSearch for existing implementations:\n```\nGrep: \"requestReview\" or \"SKStoreReviewController\" or \"StoreKit\"\nGlob: **/*Review*.swift\n```\n\nIf found, ask user:\n- Replace existing implementation?\n- Enhance with better timing logic?\n\n## Configuration Questions\n\nAsk user via AskUserQuestion:\n\n1. **Trigger conditions?** (multi-select)\n   - Session count (e.g., after 5 sessions)\n   - Days since install (e.g., after 3 days)\n   - Positive actions (e.g., after completing a task)\n   - Feature usage (e.g., after using key feature 3 times)\n\n2. **Minimum thresholds?**\n   - Sessions before first prompt: 3-5 (default: 3)\n   - Days before first prompt: 2-7 (default: 3)\n\n3. **Cool-down period?**\n   - Days between prompts: 30-90 (default: 60)\n   - Apple limits to 3 prompts/year anyway\n\n4. **Debug mode?**\n   - Include debug override for testing?\n\n## Generation Process\n\n### Step 1: Create Core Files\n\nGenerate these files:\n1. `ReviewPromptManager.swift` - Core logic and timing\n2. `ReviewPromptCondition.swift` - Configurable conditions\n3. `ReviewPromptStorage.swift` - Persistence for tracking\n\n### Step 2: Determine File Location\n\nCheck project structure:\n- If `Sources/` exists → `Sources/Reviews/`\n- If `App/` exists → `App/Reviews/`\n- Otherwise → `Reviews/`\n\n### Step 3: Add Platform Guards\n\nFor macOS, include:\n```swift\n#if os(macOS)\n// Check if running from App Store\nguard Bundle.main.appStoreReceiptURL?.lastPathComponent != \"sandboxReceipt\" else {\n    // Running in sandbox but not App Store - skip\n    return\n}\n#endif\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nAfter generation, provide:\n\n### Files Created\n```\nSources/Reviews/\n├── ReviewPromptManager.swift      # Core logic\n├── ReviewPromptCondition.swift    # Conditions enum\n└── ReviewPromptStorage.swift      # UserDefaults persistence\n```\n\n### Integration Steps\n\n**Option 1: Automatic (Recommended)**\n```swift\n@main\nstruct MyApp: App {\n    var body: some Scene {\n        WindowGroup {\n            ContentView()\n                .onAppear {\n                    ReviewPromptManager.shared.incrementSession()\n                }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// In relevant places (after positive actions):\nReviewPromptManager.shared.recordPositiveAction()\nReviewPromptManager.shared.requestReviewIfAppropriate()\n```\n\n**Option 2: Manual Trigger Points**\n```swift\n// After user completes a significant action\nfunc completeTask() {\n    // ... task completion logic ...\n\n    ReviewPromptManager.shared.recordPositiveAction()\n    ReviewPromptManager.shared.requestReviewIfAppropriate()\n}\n```\n\n### Apple''s Guidelines\n- System limits to 3 prompts per 365-day period\n- Prompt appears at system''s discretion (not guaranteed)\n- Never prompt after negative experience\n- Don''t prompt on first launch\n- Don''t interrupt user''s workflow\n\n### Testing Instructions\n\n1. **Debug Mode**: Set `ReviewPromptManager.debugAlwaysShow = true`\n2. **Reset State**: Call `ReviewPromptStorage.reset()`\n3. **Simulate**: Increment sessions/actions in debug builds\n4. **Note**: Actual prompt may not show in Simulator\n\n### App Store Review URL (Alternative)\nFor custom UI or macOS direct distribution:\n```swift\n// Deep link to App Store review page\nlet appID = \"YOUR_APP_ID\"\nlet url = URL(string: \"https://apps.apple.com/app/id\\(appID)?action=write-review\")!\nNSWorkspace.shared.open(url)  // macOS\nUIApplication.shared.open(url)  // iOS\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **storekit-patterns.md** - Best practices and timing strategies\n- **templates/** - All template files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:28:05.627Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing smart App Store review prompting with configurable trigger conditions and platform detection.","zh":"非常适合需要智能应用商店评论提示的移动应用代理，具有可配置的触发条件和平台检测。","ja":"モバイルアプリエージェントがアプリストアレビューのプロンプトをスマートに作成できるようにするために最適です。可設定のトリガー条件とプラットフォーム検出が可能です。","ko":"스마트한 앱 스토어 리뷰 프롬프트가 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 구성 가능한 트리거 조건과 플랫폼 감지를 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan una solicitud de reseña inteligente en la App Store con condiciones de activación configurables y detección de plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles ayant besoin d''un rappel d''examen intelligent de l''App Store avec des conditions de déclenchement configurables et une détection de plateforme.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die eine intelligente App Store-Bewertungsaufforderung mit konfigurierbaren Triggerbedingungen und Plattformerkennung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que precisam de prompts de revisão inteligentes da App Store com condições de gatilho configuráveis e detecção de plataforma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, которым необходимы умные подсказки обзора App Store с настраиваемыми условиями триггера и обнаружением платформы.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الجوال الذين يحتاجون إلى إشارات مراجعة متجر التطبيقات الذكية مع شروط الزناد القابلة للتكوين والكشف عن المنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate review prompts with proper timing logic, leveraging StoreKit review and SKStoreReviewController for seamless integration, and utilizing platform detection for App Store optimization.","zh":"赋予代理生成评论提示的能力，具有适当的时机逻辑，利用StoreKit评论和SKStoreReviewController实现无缝集成，并利用平台检测进行应用商店优化。","ja":"エージェントがレビュープロンプトを生成する力を与え、適切なタイミングロジックを持ち、StoreKitレビューとSKStoreReviewControllerを利用してシームレスな統合を実現し、プラットフォーム検出を利用してアプリストアを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 리뷰 프롬프트를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 적절한 타이밍 로직을 가지고 있으며, StoreKit 리뷰 및 SKStoreReviewController를 활용하여 무缝한 통합을 구현하고, 플랫폼 감지를 통해 앱 스토어를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar recordatorios de reseñas con una lógica de temporización adecuada, aprovechando StoreKit review y SKStoreReviewController para una integración sin problemas, y utilizando la detección de plataforma para la optimización de la App Store.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des rappels d''examen avec une logique de temporisation appropriée, en exploitant StoreKit review et SKStoreReviewController pour une intégration sans accroc, et en utilisant la détection de plateforme pour l''optimisation de l''App Store.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bewertungserinnerungen mit angemessener Zeitlogik zu generieren, indem StoreKit-Bewertung und SKStoreReviewController für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt werden und die Plattformerkennung für die App Store-Optimierung verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar prompts de revisão com lógica de temporização adequada, aproveitando a revisão do StoreKit e o SKStoreReviewController para integração sem problemas, e utilizando a detecção de plataforma para otimização da App Store.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать подсказки обзора с правильной логикой тайминга, используя обзор StoreKit и SKStoreReviewController для беспроблемной интеграции, и используя обнаружение платформы для оптимизации App Store.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 إشارات المراجعة بأوقات منطقية مناسبة، مستفيدا من مراجعة StoreKit و SKStoreReviewController من أجل التكامل السلس، واستخدام الكشف عن المنصة لتحسين متجر التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating App Store review requests with configurable triggers","Generating review prompts based on user interactions and platform detection","Optimizing App Store ratings with timely and targeted review requests"],"zh":["使用可配置的触发器自动执行应用商店评论请求","基于用户交互和平台检测生成评论提示","使用及时和有针对性的评论请求优化应用商店评分"],"ja":["可設定のトリガーを使用してアプリストアレビューリクエストを自動化する","ユーザーとのやりとりとプラットフォーム検出に基づいてレビュープロンプトを生成する","タイムリーでターゲットを絞ったレビューリクエストを使用してアプリストアの評価を最適化する"],"ko":["구성 가능한 트리거를 사용하여 앱 스토어 리뷰 요청을 자동화하는 것","사용자 상호 작용 및 플랫폼 감지에 따라 리뷰 프롬프트를 생성하는 것","적절한 시점에 리뷰 요청을 보내고 대상에 맞춘 리뷰 요청을 사용하여 앱 스토어 평점을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las solicitudes de reseñas de la App Store con activadores configurables","Generar recordatorios de reseñas en función de las interacciones del usuario y la detección de plataforma","Optimizar las calificaciones de la App Store con solicitudes de reseñas oportunas y dirigidas"],"fr":["Automatiser les demandes d''examen de l''App Store avec des déclencheurs configurables","Générer des rappels d''examen en fonction des interactions de l''utilisateur et de la détection de plateforme","Optimiser les notes de l''App Store avec des demandes d''examen opportunes et ciblées"],"de":["Automatisieren von App Store-Bewertungsanfragen mit konfigurierbaren Auslösern","Generieren von Bewertungserinnerungen auf der Grundlage von Benutzerinteraktionen und Plattformerkennung","Optimieren der App Store-Bewertungen mit rechtzeitigen und gezielten Bewertungsanfragen"],"pt":["Automatizar solicitações de revisão da App Store com gatilhos configuráveis","Gerar prompts de revisão com base em interações do usuário e detecção de plataforma","Otimizar classificações da App Store com solicitações de revisão oportunas e direcionadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запросы обзора App Store с настраиваемыми триггерами","Генерировать подсказки обзора на основе взаимодействия пользователя и обнаружения платформы","Оптимизировать рейтинги App Store с своевременными и нацеленными запросами обзора"],"ar":["توفير طلبات مراجعة متجر التطبيقات تلقائيا مع شروط زناد قابلة للتكوين","توليد إشارات المراجعة بناءا على تفاعلات المستخدم والكشف عن المنصة","تحسين تصنيفات متجر التطبيقات بطلبات مراجعة في الوقت المناسب والهادفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Only applies to App Store deployments","Requires integration with StoreKit review and SKStoreReviewController"],"zh":["仅适用于应用商店部署","需要与StoreKit评论和SKStoreReviewController集成"],"ja":["アプリストアへのデプロイのみに適用される","StoreKitレビューとSKStoreReviewControllerとの統合が必要"],"ko":["앱 스토어 배포에만 적용됨","StoreKit 리뷰 및 SKStoreReviewController와의 통합이 필요"],"es":["Solo se aplica a implementaciones de la App Store","Requiere integración con StoreKit review y SKStoreReviewController"],"fr":["N''est applicable qu''aux déploiements de l''App Store","Nécessite une intégration avec StoreKit review et SKStoreReviewController"],"de":["Nur auf App Store-Implementierungen anwendbar","Benötigt Integration mit StoreKit-Bewertung und SKStoreReviewController"],"pt":["Apenas se aplica a implantações da App Store","Exige integração com revisão do StoreKit e SKStoreReviewController"],"ru":["Применяется только к развертываниям App Store","Требует интеграции с обзором StoreKit и SKStoreReviewController"],"ar":["ينطبق فقط على عمليات نشر متجر التطبيقات","يتطلب التكامل مع مراجعة StoreKit و SKStoreReviewController"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('albertms22/agent-toolkit/frontend-to-backend-requirements', 'community', 'albertms22', 'agent-toolkit', 'albertms22/agent-toolkit', 'frontend-to-backend-requirements', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:28:13.659Z', NULL, '{"id":"albertms22/agent-toolkit/frontend-to-backend-requirements","name":"frontend-to-backend-requirements","description":{"zh":"前端到后端需求技能是一种协助前端开发者与后端团队高效沟通的解决方案","ja":"フロントエンドからバックエンドへの要件スキルは、フロントエンド開発者がバックエンドチームとの効果的なコミュニケーションを実現するためのソリューション","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 요구 사항 스킬은 프론트엔드 개발자가 백엔드 팀과의 효율적인 커뮤니케이션을 실현하는 솔루션","es":"El modo de requisitos de backend permite a los desarrolladores frontend documentar las necesidades de datos sin especificar detalles de implementación.","fr":"Le mode d''exigences de backend permet aux développeurs frontend de documenter les besoins de données sans spécifier les détails d''implémentation.","de":"Der Backend-Anforderungsmodus ermöglicht es Frontend-Entwicklern, Datenanforderungen zu dokumentieren, ohne Implementierungsdetails anzugeben.","pt":"O modo de requisitos de backend permite que desenvolvedores frontend documentem suas necessidades de dados de forma clara e concisa.","ru":"Режим требований бэкенда позволяет фронтенд-разработчикам документировать свои потребности в данных четким и кратким образом.","ar":"يسمح وضع متطلبات الخلفية لمطوري الواجهة الأمامية بتوثيق احتياجاتهم من البيانات بطريقة واضحة وموجزة.","en":"A curated collection of skills, commands and role based agents for AI coding agents. they are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilities across development, documentation, planning, and professional workflows."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端到后端需求技能","ja":"フロントエンドからバックエンドへの要件スキル","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 요구 사항 스킬","es":"Requisitos de Backend para Desarrolladores Frontend","fr":"Exigences de Backend pour les Développeurs Frontend","de":"Backend-Anforderungen für Frontend-Entwickler","pt":"Requisitos Frontend para Backend","ru":"Требования Фронтенда для Бэкенда","ar":"متطلبات الواجهة الأمامية للخلفية","en":"frontend-to-backend-requirements"},"description":{"zh":"前端到后端需求技能是一种协助前端开发者与后端团队高效沟通的解决方案","ja":"フロントエンドからバックエンドへの要件スキルは、フロントエンド開発者がバックエンドチームとの効果的なコミュニケーションを実現するためのソリューション","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 요구 사항 스킬은 프론트엔드 개발자가 백엔드 팀과의 효율적인 커뮤니케이션을 실현하는 솔루션","es":"El modo de requisitos de backend permite a los desarrolladores frontend documentar las necesidades de datos sin especificar detalles de implementación.","fr":"Le mode d''exigences de backend permet aux développeurs frontend de documenter les besoins de données sans spécifier les détails d''implémentation.","de":"Der Backend-Anforderungsmodus ermöglicht es Frontend-Entwicklern, Datenanforderungen zu dokumentieren, ohne Implementierungsdetails anzugeben.","pt":"O modo de requisitos de backend permite que desenvolvedores frontend documentem suas necessidades de dados de forma clara e concisa.","ru":"Режим требований бэкенда позволяет фронтенд-разработчикам документировать свои потребности в данных четким и кратким образом.","ar":"يسمح وضع متطلبات الخلفية لمطوري الواجهة الأمامية بتوثيق احتياجاتهم من البيانات بطريقة واضحة وموجزة.","en":"A curated collection of skills, commands and role based agents for AI coding agents. they are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilitie..."},"definition":{"en":"A curated collection of skills, commands and role based agents for AI coding agents. they are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilities across development, documentation, planning, and professional workflows."},"features":{"zh":["简化前端和后端的沟通","提高开发效率","减少后端实现细节的干扰","方便数据需求的记录和跟踪","提高团队协作的效率"],"ja":["フロントエンドとバックエンドのコミュニケーションを簡素化","開発効率を向上","バックエンドの実装詳細の干渉を減らす","データ要件の記録と追跡を容易にする","チームコラボレーションの効率を向上"],"ko":["프론트엔드와 백엔드의 커뮤니케이션을 단순화","개발 효율성을 향상","백엔드 구현 세부 정보의 간섭을 줄임","데이터 요구 사항의 기록 및 추적을 쉽게 함","팀 협力的 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Documentación de requisitos de backend","Comunicación de necesidades de datos","Separación de responsabilidades entre frontend y backend","Flexibilidad en la implementación de detalles","Mejora de la colaboración entre equipos"],"fr":["Documentation des exigences de backend","Communication des besoins de données","Séparation des responsabilités entre frontend et backend","Flexibilité dans la mise en œuvre des détails","Amélioration de la collaboration entre les équipes"],"de":["Dokumentation von Backend-Anforderungen","Kommunikation von Datenanforderungen","Trennung von Verantwortlichkeiten zwischen Frontend und Backend","Flexibilität bei der Implementierung von Details","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit zwischen den Teams"],"pt":["Documentação de requisitos de dados","Comunicação clara com o time de backend","Separação de responsabilidades entre frontend e backend","Melhoria da colaboração entre equipes","Redução de erros de comunicação"],"ru":["Документирование требований к данным","Ясная коммуникация с командой бэкенда","Разделение ответственности между фронтендом и бэкендом","Улучшение сотрудничества между командами","Сокращение ошибок коммуникации"],"ar":["توثيق متطلبات البيانات","التواصل الواضح مع فريق الخلفية","فصل المسؤوليات بين الواجهة الأمامية والخلفية","تحسين التعاون بين الفرق","تقليل أخطاء التواصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发","后端开发","需求技能","数据需求","开发效率","团队协作","后端实现"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発","バックエンド開発","要件スキル","データ要件","開発効率","チームコラボレーション","バックエンド実装"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발","백엔드 개발","요구 사항 스킬","데이터 요구 사항","개발 효율성","팀 협력","백엔드 구현"],"es":["requisitos de backend","desarrollo frontend","documentación de requisitos","comunicación de necesidades de datos","colaboración entre equipos","flexibilidad en la implementación"],"fr":["exigences de backend","développement frontend","documentation des exigences","communication des besoins de données","collaboration entre les équipes","flexibilité dans la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Backend-Anforderungen","Frontend-Entwicklung","Dokumentation von Anforderungen","Kommunikation von Datenanforderungen","Zusammenarbeit zwischen den Teams","Flexibilität bei der Implementierung"],"pt":["requisitos de backend","desenvolvimento frontend","comunicação de dados","colaboração entre equipes","documentação de requisitos","separação de responsabilidades"],"ru":["требования бэкенда","фронтенд-разработка","коммуникация данных","сотрудничество между командами","документирование требований","разделение ответственности"],"ar":["متطلبات الخلفية","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","تواصل البيانات","تعاون بين الفرق","توثيق المتطلبات","فصل المسؤوليات"]}},"owner":"albertms22","repo":"agent-toolkit","repoPath":"albertms22/agent-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-to-backend-requirements","description":"Document frontend data needs for backend developers. Use when frontend needs to communicate API requirements to backend, or user says backend requirements, what data do I need, API requirements, or is describing data needs for a UI.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to re","body":"# Backend Requirements Mode\n\nYou are a frontend developer documenting what data you need from backend. You describe the **what**, not the **how**. Backend owns implementation details.\n\n> **No Chat Output**: ALL responses go to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`\n> **No Implementation Details**: Don''t specify endpoints, field names, or API structure—that''s backend''s call.\n\n---\n\n## The Point\n\nThis mode is for frontend devs to communicate data needs:\n- What data do I need to render this screen?\n- What actions should the user be able to perform?\n- What business rules affect the UI?\n- What states and errors should I handle?\n\n**You''re requesting, not demanding.** Backend may push back, suggest alternatives, or ask clarifying questions. That''s healthy collaboration.\n\n---\n\n## What You Own vs. What Backend Owns\n\n| Frontend Owns | Backend Owns |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| What data is needed | How data is structured |\n| What actions exist | Endpoint design |\n| UI states to handle | Field names, types |\n| User-facing validation | API conventions |\n| Display requirements | Performance/caching |\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Describe the Feature\n\nBefore listing requirements:\n\n1. **What is this?** — Screen, flow, component\n2. **Who uses it?** — User type, permissions\n3. **What''s the goal?** — What does success look like?\n\n### Step 2: List Data Needs\n\nFor each screen/component, describe:\n\n**Data I need to display:**\n- What information appears on screen?\n- What''s the relationship between pieces?\n- What determines visibility/state?\n\n**Actions user can perform:**\n- What can the user do?\n- What''s the expected outcome?\n- What feedback should they see?\n\n**States I need to handle:**\n- Loading, empty, error, success\n- Edge cases (partial data, expired, etc.)\n\n### Step 3: Surface Uncertainties\n\nList what you''re unsure about:\n- Business rules you don''t fully understand\n- Edge cases you''re not sure how to handle\n- Places where you''re guessing\n\n**These invite backend to clarify or push back.**\n\n### Step 4: Leave Room for Discussion\n\nEnd with open questions:\n- \"Would it make sense to...?\"\n- \"Should I expect...?\"\n- \"Is there a simpler way to...?\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nCreate `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Backend Requirements: <Feature Name>\n\n## Context\n[What we''re building, who it''s for, what problem it solves]\n\n## Screens/Components\n\n### <Screen/Component Name>\n**Purpose**: What this screen does\n\n**Data I need to display**:\n- [Description of data piece, not field name]\n- [Another piece]\n- [Relationships between pieces]\n\n**Actions**:\n- [Action description] → [Expected outcome]\n- [Another action] → [Expected outcome]\n\n**States to handle**:\n- **Empty**: [When/why this happens]\n- **Loading**: [What''s being fetched]\n- **Error**: [What can go wrong, what user sees]\n- **Special**: [Any edge cases]\n\n**Business rules affecting UI**:\n- [Rule that changes what''s visible/enabled]\n- [Permissions that affect actions]\n\n### <Next Screen/Component>\n...\n\n## Uncertainties\n- [ ] Not sure if [X] should show when [Y]\n- [ ] Don''t understand the business rule for [Z]\n- [ ] Guessing that [A] means [B]\n\n## Questions for Backend\n- Would it make sense to combine [X] and [Y]?\n- Should I expect [Z] to always be present?\n- Is there existing data I can reuse for [W]?\n\n## Discussion Log\n[Backend responses, decisions made, changes to requirements]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Good vs. Bad Requests\n\n### Bad (Dictating Implementation)\n> \"I need a GET /api/contracts endpoint that returns an array with fields: id, title, status, created_at\"\n\n### Good (Describing Needs)\n> \"I need to show a list of contracts. Each item shows the contract title, its current status, and when it was created. User should be able to filter by status.\"\n\n### Bad (Assuming Structure)\n> \"The provider object should be nested inside the contract response\"\n\n### Good (Describing Relationship)\n> \"For each contract, I need to show who the provider is (their name and maybe logo)\"\n\n### Bad (No Context)\n> \"I need contract data\"\n\n### Good (With Context)\n> \"On the dashboard, there''s a ''Recent Contracts'' widget showing the 5 most recent contracts. User clicks one to go to detail page.\"\n\n---\n\n## Encouraging Pushback\n\nInclude these prompts in your requirements:\n\n- \"Let me know if this doesn''t make sense for how the data is structured\"\n- \"Open to suggestions on a better approach\"\n- \"Not sure if this is the right way to think about it\"\n- \"Push back if this complicates things unnecessarily\"\n\n**Good collaboration = frontend describes the problem, backend proposes the solution.**\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **NO IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS**—don''t specify endpoints, methods, field names\n- **DESCRIBE, DON''T PRESCRIBE**—say what you need, not how to provide it\n- **INCLUDE CONTEXT**—why you need it helps backend make better choices\n- **SURFACE UNKNOWNS**—don''t hide confusion, invite clarification\n- **INVITE PUSHBACK**—explicitly ask for backend''s input\n- **UPDATE THE DOC**—add backend responses to Discussion Log\n- **STAY HUMBLE**—you''re asking, not demanding\n\n---\n\n## After Backend Responds\n\nUpdate the requirements doc:\n1. Add responses to Discussion Log\n2. Adjust requirements based on feedback\n3. Mark resolved uncertainties\n4. Note any decisions made\n\nThe doc becomes the source of truth for what was agreed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:28:13.659Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing seamless frontend-to-backend communication and requirement documentation.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝前端到后端通信和需求文档的全栈代理","ja":"フロントエンドからバックエンドへのシームレスな通信と要件のドキュメントが必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"프론트엔드에서 백엔드까지 무결점 통신과 요구사항 문서가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan una comunicación fluida entre frontend y backend y documentación de requisitos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant une communication fluide entre frontend et backend et une documentation de exigences.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine nahtlose Kommunikation zwischen Frontend und Backend sowie eine Anforderungsdokumentation benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing seamless frontend-to-backend communication and requirement documentation.","ru":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing seamless frontend-to-backend communication and requirement documentation.","ar":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing seamless frontend-to-backend communication and requirement documentation."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate markdown documentation for backend requirements, utilizing `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` file structure, and adhering to strict no-implementation-details protocol, ensuring clear separation of concerns between frontend and backend development.","zh":"赋予代理生成后端需求的markdown文档的能力，利用`.claude/docs/ai/<特性名称>/后端需求.md`文件结构，并遵循严格的无实现细节协议，确保前端和后端开发之间的明确关注点分离","ja":"エージェントがバックエンドの要件のMarkdownドキュメントを生成できるようにし，`.claude/docs/ai/<機能名>/バックエンド要件.md`ファイル構造を使用し，実装の詳細を含まないプロトコルに厳密に従い，フロントエンドとバックエンドの開発之间の明確な関心の分離を保証する","ko":"에이전트가 백엔드 요구사항의 마크다운 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, `.claude/docs/ai/<기능 이름>/백엔드 요구사항.md` 파일 구조를 사용하며, 구현 세부 정보를 포함하지 않는 프로토콜을 엄격히 준수하여 프론트엔드와 백엔드 개발 간의 명확한 관심사 분리를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentación de markdown para requisitos de backend, utilizando la estructura de archivos `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` y siguiendo estrictamente el protocolo de no detalles de implementación, garantizando una clara separación de preocupaciones entre el desarrollo de frontend y backend.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une documentation markdown pour les exigences de backend, en utilisant la structure de fichiers `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` et en respectant strictement le protocole de non-détails d''implémentation, garantissant une séparation claire des préoccupations entre le développement de frontend et de backend.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Markdown-Dokumentationen für Backend-Anforderungen zu generieren, indem sie die Dateistruktur `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` verwenden und dem strengen Protokoll ohne Implementierungsdetails folgen, um eine klare Trennung der Belange zwischen Frontend- und Backend-Entwicklung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate markdown documentation for backend requirements, utilizing `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` file structure, and adhering to strict no-implementation-details protocol, ensuring clear separation of concerns between frontend and backend development.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate markdown documentation for backend requirements, utilizing `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` file structure, and adhering to strict no-implementation-details protocol, ensuring clear separation of concerns between frontend and backend development.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate markdown documentation for backend requirements, utilizing `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` file structure, and adhering to strict no-implementation-details protocol, ensuring clear separation of concerns between frontend and backend development."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting data needs for new feature development","Generating backend requirements for existing frontend applications","Streamlining communication between frontend and backend teams through standardized markdown documentation"],"zh":["记录新功能开发的数据需求","为现有的前端应用程序生成后端需求","通过标准化的markdown文档简化前端和后端团队之间的通信"],"ja":["新機能開発のためのデータ要件を文書化する","既存のフロントエンドアプリケーションのためのバックエンド要件を生成する","標準化されたMarkdownドキュメントを通じてフロントエンドとバックエンドチーム間のコミュニケーションを簡素化する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 개발을 위한 데이터 요구 사항을 문서화","既存의 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 위한 백엔드 요구 사항을 생성","표준화된 마크다운 문서를 통해 프론트엔드와 백엔드 팀 간의 커뮤니케이션을 간소화"],"es":["Documentar las necesidades de datos para el desarrollo de nuevas características","Generar requisitos de backend para aplicaciones frontend existentes","Optimizar la comunicación entre los equipos de frontend y backend a través de documentación de markdown estandarizada"],"fr":["Documenter les besoins de données pour le développement de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Générer les exigences de backend pour les applications frontend existantes","Optimiser la communication entre les équipes de frontend et de backend via une documentation markdown standardisée"],"de":["Dokumentation der Datenanforderungen für die Entwicklung neuer Funktionen","Generierung von Backend-Anforderungen für bestehende Frontend-Anwendungen","Optimierung der Kommunikation zwischen Frontend- und Backend-Teams durch standardisierte Markdown-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Documenting data needs for new feature development","Generating backend requirements for existing frontend applications","Streamlining communication between frontend and backend teams through standardized markdown documentation"],"ru":["Documenting data needs for new feature development","Generating backend requirements for existing frontend applications","Streamlining communication between frontend and backend teams through standardized markdown documentation"],"ar":["Documenting data needs for new feature development","Generating backend requirements for existing frontend applications","Streamlining communication between frontend and backend teams through standardized markdown documentation"]},"limitations":{"en":["No implementation details allowed in documentation","Requires strict adherence to backend requirements documentation protocol","Output limited to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files"],"zh":["文档中不允许包含实现细节","需要严格遵循后端需求文档协议","输出仅限于`.claude/docs/ai/<特性名称>/后端需求.md`文件"],"ja":["ドキュメントには実装の詳細を含めることができない","バックエンド要件のドキュメントプロトコルに厳密に従う必要がある","出力は`.claude/docs/ai/<機能名>/バックエンド要件.md`ファイルのみに限定される"],"ko":["문서에는 구현 세부 정보를 포함할 수 없음","백엔드 요구 사항 문서 프로토콜을 엄격히 준수해야 함","출력은 `.claude/docs/ai/<기능 이름>/백엔드 요구 사항.md` 파일로만 제한됨"],"es":["No se permiten detalles de implementación en la documentación","Requiere una estricta adhesión al protocolo de documentación de requisitos de backend","La salida se limita a archivos `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`"],"fr":["Aucun détail d''implémentation n''est autorisé dans la documentation","Exige une stricte adhésion au protocole de documentation des exigences de backend","La sortie est limitée aux fichiers `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md`"],"de":["Keine Implementierungsdetails sind in der Dokumentation erlaubt","Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung des Protokolls für die Dokumentation von Backend-Anforderungen","Die Ausgabe ist auf Dateien `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` beschränkt"],"pt":["No implementation details allowed in documentation","Requires strict adherence to backend requirements documentation protocol","Output limited to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files"],"ru":["No implementation details allowed in documentation","Requires strict adherence to backend requirements documentation protocol","Output limited to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files"],"ar":["No implementation details allowed in documentation","Requires strict adherence to backend requirements documentation protocol","Output limited to `.claude/docs/ai/<feature-name>/backend-requirements.md` files"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
