了一种安全且便捷的方式来与 GitHub 仓库和服务进行交互","ja":"GitHub CLI スキルは、GitHub リポジトリやサービスと安全かつ簡単にやり取りする方法を提供します","ko":"GitHub CLI Skill은 GitHub 저장소와 서비스와 안전하고 편리하게 상호 작용할 수 있는 방법을 제공합니다","es":"La CLI de GitHub permite a los desarrolladores interactuar con los repositorios y servicios de GitHub de manera eficiente.","fr":"La CLI GitHub permet aux développeurs d''interagir avec les référentiels et les services GitHub de manière efficace.","de":"Die GitHub-CLI ermöglicht es Entwicklern, mit den Repositorys und Diensten von GitHub effizient zu interagieren.","pt":"O GitHub CLI permite interagir com repositórios e serviços de forma eficiente. Aprenda a usar comandos como autenticação e clonagem de repositórios.","ru":"GitHub CLI позволяет взаимодействовать с репозиториями и сервисами эффективно. Узнайте, как использовать команды, такие как аутентификация и клонирование реп...","ar":"جيت هاب سي إل آي يسمح بالتفاعل مع المستودعات والخدمات بفعالية. تعلم كيفية استخدام أوامر مثل المصادقة والاستنساخ للمستودعات.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["认证管理","仓库克隆","新建仓库","仓库分叉","浏览器中查看仓库"],"ja":["認証管理","リポジトリのクローン","新しいリポジトリの作成","リポジトリのフォーク","ブラウザでリポジトリを表示"],"ko":["인증 관리","저장소 클론","새 저장소 생성","저장소 포크","브라우저에서 저장소 보기"],"es":["Autenticación y autorización","Clonación de repositorios","Creación de nuevos repositorios","Fork de repositorios","Visualización de repositorios en el navegador"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation","Clonage de référentiels","Création de nouveaux référentiels","Fork de référentiels","Visualisation de référentiels dans le navigateur"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Klonen von Repositorys","Erstellen neuer Repositorys","Forken von Repositorys","Anzeigen von Repositorys im Browser"],"pt":["Autenticação com o GitHub","Clonagem de repositórios","Criação de novos repositórios","Fork de repositórios","Visualização de repositórios no navegador"],"ru":["Аутентификация с GitHub","Клонирование репозиториев","Создание новых репозиториев","Форк репозиториев","Просмотр репозиториев в браузере"],"ar":["المصادقة مع جيت هاب","استنساخ المستودعات","إنشاء مستودعات جديدة","فورك المستودعات","عرض المستودعات في المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","gh CLI","认证管理","仓库管理","GitHub Skill","开发者工具"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","gh CLI","認証管理","リポジトリ管理","GitHub スキル","開発者ツール"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","gh CLI","인증 관리","저장소 관리","GitHub Skill","개발자 도구"],"es":["GitHub CLI","desarrollo de software","integración continua","automatización de tareas","repositorios de código","gestión de versiones"],"fr":["GitHub CLI","développement de logiciels","intégration continue","automatisation de tâches","référentiels de code","gestion de versions"],"de":["GitHub-CLI","Software-Entwicklung","kontinuierliche Integration","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Code-Repositorys","Versionsverwaltung"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","linha de comando","repositórios","autenticação","clonagem","criação de repositórios","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","командная строка","репозитории","аутентификация","клонирование","создание репозиториев","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["جيت هاب سي إل آي","سطر الأوامر","المستودعات","المصادقة","الاستنساخ","إنشاء المستودعات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"GitHub CLI - manage repositories, issues, pull requests, actions, releases, and more from the command line.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub repositories and services.\n\n## Authentication\n\nCheck auth status:\n```bash\ngh auth status\n```\n\nLogin:\n```bash\ngh auth login\n```\n\nRefresh token:\n```bash\ngh auth refresh\n```\n\n## Repositories\n\nClone repository:\n```bash\ngh repo clone owner/repo\n```\n\nCreate new repo:\n```bash\ngh repo create my-repo --public --source=. --push\n```\n\nFork repository:\n```bash\ngh repo fork owner/repo --clone\n```\n\nView repo in browser:\n```bash\ngh repo view --web\n```","body":"# GitHub CLI Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub repositories and services.\n\n## Authentication\n\nCheck auth status:\n```bash\ngh auth status\n```\n\nLogin:\n```bash\ngh auth login\n```\n\nRefresh token:\n```bash\ngh auth refresh\n```\n\n## Repositories\n\nClone repository:\n```bash\ngh repo clone owner/repo\n```\n\nCreate new repo:\n```bash\ngh repo create my-repo --public --source=. --push\n```\n\nFork repository:\n```bash\ngh repo fork owner/repo --clone\n```\n\nView repo in browser:\n```bash\ngh repo view --web\n```\n\nList your repos:\n```bash\ngh repo list\n```\n\n## Issues\n\nList issues:\n```bash\ngh issue list\n```\n\nCreate issue:\n```bash\ngh issue create --title \"Bug: Login fails\" --body \"Description here\"\n```\n\nCreate issue interactively:\n```bash\ngh issue create\n```\n\nView issue:\n```bash\ngh issue view 123\n```\n\nClose issue:\n```bash\ngh issue close 123\n```\n\nReopen issue:\n```bash\ngh issue reopen 123\n```\n\nComment on issue:\n```bash\ngh issue comment 123 --body \"Working on this\"\n```\n\nAssign issue:\n```bash\ngh issue edit 123 --add-assignee @me\n```\n\nAdd labels:\n```bash\ngh issue edit 123 --add-label \"bug,priority:high\"\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nList PRs:\n```bash\ngh pr list\n```\n\nCreate PR:\n```bash\ngh pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n```\n\nCreate PR from current branch:\n```bash\ngh pr create --fill\n```\n\nView PR:\n```bash\ngh pr view 45\n```\n\nView PR in browser:\n```bash\ngh pr view 45 --web\n```\n\nCheckout PR locally:\n```bash\ngh pr checkout 45\n```\n\nReview PR:\n```bash\ngh pr review 45 --approve\ngh pr review 45 --request-changes --body \"Please fix X\"\ngh pr review 45 --comment --body \"Looks good but...\"\n```\n\nMerge PR:\n```bash\ngh pr merge 45 --squash\ngh pr merge 45 --merge\ngh pr merge 45 --rebase\n```\n\nClose PR:\n```bash\ngh pr close 45\n```\n\nList PR checks:\n```bash\ngh pr checks 45\n```\n\nView PR diff:\n```bash\ngh pr diff 45\n```\n\n## Actions (CI/CD)\n\nList workflow runs:\n```bash\ngh run list\n```\n\nView run details:\n```bash\ngh run view 12345\n```\n\nWatch run in progress:\n```bash\ngh run watch 12345\n```\n\nView run logs:\n```bash\ngh run view 12345 --log\n```\n\nRerun failed jobs:\n```bash\ngh run rerun 12345 --failed\n```\n\nList workflows:\n```bash\ngh workflow list\n```\n\nRun workflow manually:\n```bash\ngh workflow run deploy.yml\n```\n\nRun with inputs:\n```bash\ngh workflow run deploy.yml -f environment=production\n```\n\nDisable/enable workflow:\n```bash\ngh workflow disable deploy.yml\ngh workflow enable deploy.yml\n```\n\n## Releases\n\nList releases:\n```bash\ngh release list\n```\n\nCreate release:\n```bash\ngh release create v1.0.0 --title \"Version 1.0\" --notes \"Release notes\"\n```\n\nCreate from tag:\n```bash\ngh release create v1.0.0 --generate-notes\n```\n\nUpload assets:\n```bash\ngh release upload v1.0.0 ./dist/app.zip\n```\n\nDownload assets:\n```bash\ngh release download v1.0.0\n```\n\nDelete release:\n```bash\ngh release delete v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Gists\n\nCreate gist:\n```bash\ngh gist create file.txt --public\n```\n\nCreate from stdin:\n```bash\necho \"Hello\" | gh gist create -\n```\n\nList gists:\n```bash\ngh gist list\n```\n\nView gist:\n```bash\ngh gist view GIST_ID\n```\n\nEdit gist:\n```bash\ngh gist edit GIST_ID\n```\n\n## Search\n\nSearch repos:\n```bash\ngh search repos \"react hooks\" --limit 10\n```\n\nSearch issues:\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug authentication\" --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nSearch PRs:\n```bash\ngh search prs \"fix memory leak\" --state open\n```\n\nSearch code:\n```bash\ngh search code \"function handleAuth\" --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n## API\n\nMake API request:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo\n```\n\nPOST request:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo/issues -f title=\"New issue\" -f body=\"Description\"\n```\n\nGraphQL query:\n```bash\ngh api graphql -f query=''{ viewer { login } }''\n```\n\nPaginate results:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo/issues --paginate\n```\n\n## Labels\n\nList labels:\n```bash\ngh label list\n```\n\nCreate label:\n```bash\ngh label create \"priority:high\" --color FF0000 --description \"High priority\"\n```\n\n## Projects\n\nList projects:\n```bash\ngh project list\n```\n\nView project:\n```bash\ngh project view 1\n```\n\n## SSH Keys\n\nList SSH keys:\n```bash\ngh ssh-key list\n```\n\nAdd SSH key:\n```bash\ngh ssh-key add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub --title \"My laptop\"\n```\n\n## GPG Keys\n\nList GPG keys:\n```bash\ngh gpg-key list\n```\n\nAdd GPG key:\n```bash\ngh gpg-key add key.gpg\n```\n\n## Secrets (for Actions)\n\nList secrets:\n```bash\ngh secret list\n```\n\nSet secret:\n```bash\ngh secret set MY_SECRET\n```\n\nSet from file:\n```bash\ngh secret set MY_SECRET < secret.txt\n```\n\nDelete secret:\n```bash\ngh secret delete MY_SECRET\n```\n\n## Variables (for Actions)\n\nList variables:\n```bash\ngh variable list\n```\n\nSet variable:\n```bash\ngh variable set MY_VAR --body \"value\"\n```\n\n## Extensions\n\nList installed extensions:\n```bash\ngh extension list\n```\n\nInstall extension:\n```bash\ngh extension install owner/gh-extension\n```\n\nBrowse extensions:\n```bash\ngh extension browse\n```\n\n## Aliases\n\nCreate alias:\n```bash\ngh alias set pv ''pr view''\n```\n\nList aliases:\n```bash\ngh alias list\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nView config:\n```bash\ngh config list\n```\n\nSet default editor:\n```bash\ngh config set editor vim\n```\n\nSet default browser:\n```bash\ngh config set browser \"open\"\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Quick PR workflow:\n```bash\n# Create branch, commit, push, create PR\ngit checkout -b feature/my-feature\n# ... make changes ...\ngit add . && git commit -m \"Add feature\"\ngit push -u origin feature/my-feature\ngh pr create --fill\n```\n\n### Review and merge:\n```bash\ngh pr checkout 45\n# ... review code ...\ngh pr review --approve\ngh pr merge --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n### Check CI status:\n```bash\ngh pr checks\ngh run watch\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:29:44.328Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined GitHub repository management and automation.","zh":"适合需要简化 GitHub 仓库管理和自动化的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理と自動化を簡素化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 리포지토리 관리 및 자동화를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión y automatización de repositorios de GitHub optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion et une automation de référentiels GitHub rationalisées.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine optimierte Verwaltung und Automatisierung von GitHub-Repositorys benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de repositórios GitHub simplificado e automação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих упрощенного управления репозиториями GitHub и автоматизации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إدارة مستودع GitHub مبسطًا وتأتمتًا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub repositories and services using the `gh` CLI, enabling seamless authentication, repository cloning, creation, and forking, as well as refreshing tokens and viewing repositories in a web browser.","zh":"使代理能够使用 `gh` CLI 与 GitHub 仓库和服务交互，实现无缝身份验证、仓库克隆、创建和分叉，以及刷新令牌和在 Web 浏览器中查看仓库。","ja":"エージェントが `gh` CLI を使用して GitHub リポジトリおよびサービスとやり取りできるようにし、シームレスな認証、リポジトリのクローン作成、作成、フォーク、およびトークンの更新と Web ブラウザでのリポジトリの表示を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh` CLI를 사용하여 GitHub 리포지토리 및 서비스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여 보안 인증, 리포지토리 클론 생성, 생성, 포크 및 토큰 갱신과 웹 브라우저에서 리포지토리를 보는 것을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes interactuar con los repositorios y servicios de GitHub utilizando la CLI `gh`, lo que permite una autenticación sin problemas, clonación de repositorios, creación y bifurcación, así como la actualización de tokens y la visualización de repositorios en un navegador web.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec les référentiels et les services GitHub en utilisant la CLI `gh`, ce qui permet une authentification sans problème, le clonage de référentiels, la création et la bifurcation, ainsi que la mise à jour des jetons et la visualisation des référentiels dans un navigateur web.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mit GitHub-Repositorys und -Diensten über die `gh`-CLI zu interagieren, was eine nahtlose Authentifizierung, Repository-Klonen, -Erstellung und -Forking sowie die Aktualisierung von Token und die Anzeige von Repositorys in einem Webbrowser ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com repositórios e serviços GitHub usando a CLI `gh`, permitindo autenticação sem problemas, clonagem de repositórios, criação e bifurcação, bem como atualização de tokens e visualização de repositórios em um navegador da web.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность взаимодействия с репозиториями и сервисами GitHub с помощью CLI `gh`, обеспечивая бесшовную аутентификацию, клонирование репозиториев, создание и вилку, а также обновление токенов и просмотр репозиториев в веб-браузере.","ar":"يعزز العملاء للتفاعل مع مستودعات وخدمات GitHub باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `gh` ، مما يتيح مصادقة متصلة ، و استنساخ المستودعات ، وإنشاء وفروق ، بالإضافة إلى تحديث الرموز ومشاهدة المستودعات في متصفح ويب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating repository cloning and forking","Creating new public repositories with a single command","Refreshing authentication tokens for secure access"],"zh":["自动化仓库克隆和分叉","使用单个命令创建新的公共仓库","刷新用于安全访问的身份验证令牌"],"ja":["リポジトリのクローン作成とフォークの自動化","1 つのコマンドで新しい公開リポジトリを作成","セキュアなアクセスのために認証トークンを更新"],"ko":["리포지토리 클론 생성 및 포크 자동화","단일 명령으로 새로운 공개 리포지토리 생성","보안 액세스를 위한 인증 토큰 갱신"],"es":["Automatización del clonado y la bifurcación de repositorios","Creación de nuevos repositorios públicos con un solo comando","Actualización de tokens de autenticación para un acceso seguro"],"fr":["Automatisation du clonage et de la bifurcation de référentiels","Création de nouveaux référentiels publics avec une seule commande","Mise à jour des jetons d''authentification pour un accès sécurisé"],"de":["Automatisierung des Klonens und Forkings von Repositorys","Erstellung neuer öffentlicher Repositorys mit einem einzigen Befehl","Aktualisierung von Authentifizierungstoken für einen sicheren Zugriff"],"pt":["Automatizar a clonagem e bifurcação de repositórios","Criar novos repositórios públicos com um único comando","Atualizar tokens de autenticação para acesso seguro"],"ru":["Автоматизация клонирования и вилки репозиториев","Создание новых публичных репозиториев с помощью одной команды","Обновление токенов аутентификации для безопасного доступа"],"ar":["تأتمت استنساخ وفروق المستودعات","إنشاء مستودعات عامة جديدة بأمر واحد","تحديث رموز المصادقة للوصول الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Needs authentication credentials for GitHub access"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI","需要身份验证凭证以访问 GitHub"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","GitHub へのアクセスには認証資格情報が必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치 필요","GitHub 액세스에 인증 자격 증명 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de GitHub","Necesita credenciales de autenticación para el acceso a GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI GitHub","A besoin de credenciales d''authentification pour l''accès à GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der GitHub-CLI","Benötigt Authentifizierungsanmeldeinformationen für den Zugriff auf GitHub"],"pt":["Requer instalação da CLI do GitHub","Necessita de credenciais de autenticação para acesso ao GitHub"],"ru":["Требует установки GitHub CLI","Требует учетных данных аутентификации для доступа к GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub","يحتاج إلى بيانات اعتماد المصادقة للوصول إلى GitHub"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
