enticação com o GitHub","Clonar repositórios","Criar novos repositórios","Fork de repositórios","Visualizar repositórios no navegador"],"ru":["Аутентификация с GitHub","Клонирование репозиториев","Создание новых репозиториев","Форк репозиториев","Просмотр репозиториев в браузере"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية مع GitHub","استنساخ المستودعات","إنشاء مستودعات جديدة","فرع المستودعات","عرض المستودعات في المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","命令行工具","仓库管理","身份验证","开发者工具","GitHub 技术"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","コマンドラインツール","リポジトリ管理","認証","開発者ツール","GitHub 技術"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","명령줄 도구","저장소 관리","인증","개발자 도구","GitHub 기술"],"es":["github cli","comando gh","autenticación github","clonar repositorio github","crear repositorio github","fork repositorio github","visualizar repositorio github"],"fr":["github cli","commande gh","authentification github","cloner référentiel github","créer référentiel github","fork référentiel github","visualiser référentiel github"],"de":["github cli","befehl gh","authentifizierung github","repository klonen","repository erstellen","repository fork","repository anzeigen"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","Repositórios GitHub","Autenticação GitHub","Clonar repositório","Criar repositório","Fork repositório","Desenvolvedores GitHub"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","Репозитории GitHub","Аутентификация GitHub","Клонирование репозитория","Создание репозитория","Форк репозитория","Разработчики GitHub"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub","مستودعات GitHub","التحقق من الهوية مع GitHub","استنساخ المستودع","إنشاء مستودع","فرع المستودع","مطورو GitHub"]}},"owner":"carmandale","repo":"agent-config","repoPath":"carmandale/agent-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"GitHub CLI - manage repositories, issues, pull requests, actions, releases, and more from the command line.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub repositories and services.\n\n## Authentication\n\nCheck auth status:\n```bash\ngh auth status\n```\n\nLogin:\n```bash\ngh auth login\n```\n\nRefresh token:\n```bash\ngh auth refresh\n```\n\n## Repositories\n\nClone repository:\n```bash\ngh repo clone owner/repo\n```\n\nCreate new repo:\n```bash\ngh repo create my-repo --public --source=. --push\n```\n\nFork repository:\n```bash\ngh repo fork owner/repo --clone\n```\n\nView repo in browser:\n```bash\ngh repo view --web\n```","body":"# GitHub CLI Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub repositories and services.\n\n## Authentication\n\nCheck auth status:\n```bash\ngh auth status\n```\n\nLogin:\n```bash\ngh auth login\n```\n\nRefresh token:\n```bash\ngh auth refresh\n```\n\n## Repositories\n\nClone repository:\n```bash\ngh repo clone owner/repo\n```\n\nCreate new repo:\n```bash\ngh repo create my-repo --public --source=. --push\n```\n\nFork repository:\n```bash\ngh repo fork owner/repo --clone\n```\n\nView repo in browser:\n```bash\ngh repo view --web\n```\n\nList your repos:\n```bash\ngh repo list\n```\n\n## Issues\n\nList issues:\n```bash\ngh issue list\n```\n\nCreate issue:\n```bash\ngh issue create --title \"Bug: Login fails\" --body \"Description here\"\n```\n\nCreate issue interactively:\n```bash\ngh issue create\n```\n\nView issue:\n```bash\ngh issue view 123\n```\n\nClose issue:\n```bash\ngh issue close 123\n```\n\nReopen issue:\n```bash\ngh issue reopen 123\n```\n\nComment on issue:\n```bash\ngh issue comment 123 --body \"Working on this\"\n```\n\nAssign issue:\n```bash\ngh issue edit 123 --add-assignee @me\n```\n\nAdd labels:\n```bash\ngh issue edit 123 --add-label \"bug,priority:high\"\n```\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nList PRs:\n```bash\ngh pr list\n```\n\nCreate PR:\n```bash\ngh pr create --title \"Add feature\" --body \"Description\"\n```\n\nCreate PR from current branch:\n```bash\ngh pr create --fill\n```\n\nView PR:\n```bash\ngh pr view 45\n```\n\nView PR in browser:\n```bash\ngh pr view 45 --web\n```\n\nCheckout PR locally:\n```bash\ngh pr checkout 45\n```\n\nReview PR:\n```bash\ngh pr review 45 --approve\ngh pr review 45 --request-changes --body \"Please fix X\"\ngh pr review 45 --comment --body \"Looks good but...\"\n```\n\nMerge PR:\n```bash\ngh pr merge 45 --squash\ngh pr merge 45 --merge\ngh pr merge 45 --rebase\n```\n\nClose PR:\n```bash\ngh pr close 45\n```\n\nList PR checks:\n```bash\ngh pr checks 45\n```\n\nView PR diff:\n```bash\ngh pr diff 45\n```\n\n## Actions (CI/CD)\n\nList workflow runs:\n```bash\ngh run list\n```\n\nView run details:\n```bash\ngh run view 12345\n```\n\nWatch run in progress:\n```bash\ngh run watch 12345\n```\n\nView run logs:\n```bash\ngh run view 12345 --log\n```\n\nRerun failed jobs:\n```bash\ngh run rerun 12345 --failed\n```\n\nList workflows:\n```bash\ngh workflow list\n```\n\nRun workflow manually:\n```bash\ngh workflow run deploy.yml\n```\n\nRun with inputs:\n```bash\ngh workflow run deploy.yml -f environment=production\n```\n\nDisable/enable workflow:\n```bash\ngh workflow disable deploy.yml\ngh workflow enable deploy.yml\n```\n\n## Releases\n\nList releases:\n```bash\ngh release list\n```\n\nCreate release:\n```bash\ngh release create v1.0.0 --title \"Version 1.0\" --notes \"Release notes\"\n```\n\nCreate from tag:\n```bash\ngh release create v1.0.0 --generate-notes\n```\n\nUpload assets:\n```bash\ngh release upload v1.0.0 ./dist/app.zip\n```\n\nDownload assets:\n```bash\ngh release download v1.0.0\n```\n\nDelete release:\n```bash\ngh release delete v1.0.0\n```\n\n## Gists\n\nCreate gist:\n```bash\ngh gist create file.txt --public\n```\n\nCreate from stdin:\n```bash\necho \"Hello\" | gh gist create -\n```\n\nList gists:\n```bash\ngh gist list\n```\n\nView gist:\n```bash\ngh gist view GIST_ID\n```\n\nEdit gist:\n```bash\ngh gist edit GIST_ID\n```\n\n## Search\n\nSearch repos:\n```bash\ngh search repos \"react hooks\" --limit 10\n```\n\nSearch issues:\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug authentication\" --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nSearch PRs:\n```bash\ngh search prs \"fix memory leak\" --state open\n```\n\nSearch code:\n```bash\ngh search code \"function handleAuth\" --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n## API\n\nMake API request:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo\n```\n\nPOST request:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo/issues -f title=\"New issue\" -f body=\"Description\"\n```\n\nGraphQL query:\n```bash\ngh api graphql -f query=''{ viewer { login } }''\n```\n\nPaginate results:\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo/issues --paginate\n```\n\n## Labels\n\nList labels:\n```bash\ngh label list\n```\n\nCreate label:\n```bash\ngh label create \"priority:high\" --color FF0000 --description \"High priority\"\n```\n\n## Projects\n\nList projects:\n```bash\ngh project list\n```\n\nView project:\n```bash\ngh project view 1\n```\n\n## SSH Keys\n\nList SSH keys:\n```bash\ngh ssh-key list\n```\n\nAdd SSH key:\n```bash\ngh ssh-key add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub --title \"My laptop\"\n```\n\n## GPG Keys\n\nList GPG keys:\n```bash\ngh gpg-key list\n```\n\nAdd GPG key:\n```bash\ngh gpg-key add key.gpg\n```\n\n## Secrets (for Actions)\n\nList secrets:\n```bash\ngh secret list\n```\n\nSet secret:\n```bash\ngh secret set MY_SECRET\n```\n\nSet from file:\n```bash\ngh secret set MY_SECRET < secret.txt\n```\n\nDelete secret:\n```bash\ngh secret delete MY_SECRET\n```\n\n## Variables (for Actions)\n\nList variables:\n```bash\ngh variable list\n```\n\nSet variable:\n```bash\ngh variable set MY_VAR --body \"value\"\n```\n\n## Extensions\n\nList installed extensions:\n```bash\ngh extension list\n```\n\nInstall extension:\n```bash\ngh extension install owner/gh-extension\n```\n\nBrowse extensions:\n```bash\ngh extension browse\n```\n\n## Aliases\n\nCreate alias:\n```bash\ngh alias set pv ''pr view''\n```\n\nList aliases:\n```bash\ngh alias list\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nView config:\n```bash\ngh config list\n```\n\nSet default editor:\n```bash\ngh config set editor vim\n```\n\nSet default browser:\n```bash\ngh config set browser \"open\"\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Quick PR workflow:\n```bash\n# Create branch, commit, push, create PR\ngit checkout -b feature/my-feature\n# ... make changes ...\ngit add . && git commit -m \"Add feature\"\ngit push -u origin feature/my-feature\ngh pr create --fill\n```\n\n### Review and merge:\n```bash\ngh pr checkout 45\n# ... review code ...\ngh pr review --approve\ngh pr merge --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n### Check CI status:\n```bash\ngh pr checks\ngh run watch\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:29:50.630Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents needing unified GitHub repository management and automation.","zh":"适用于需要统一 GitHub 仓库管理和自动化的 AI 编码代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの統一管理と自動化が必要な AI コーディング エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 저장소의 통합 관리 및 자동화가 필요한 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación de IA que necesitan una gestión y automatización de repositorios de GitHub unificada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage IA ayant besoin d''une gestion et d''une automatisation de référentiels GitHub unifiée.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Coding-Agents, die eine einheitliche Verwaltung und Automatisierung von GitHub-Repositorys benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação de IA que necessitam de gerenciamento e automação de repositórios GitHub unificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования ИИ, которым требуется унифицированное управление и автоматизация репозиториев GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز الذكي الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة وت 자동ة لمستودعات GitHub موحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub repositories and services using the `gh` CLI, enabling seamless authentication, repository cloning, creation, forking, and viewing, all while leveraging GitHub''s APIs and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `gh` CLI 与 GitHub 仓库和服务交互的能力，实现无缝的身份验证、仓库克隆、创建、分叉和查看，同时利用 GitHub 的 API 和协议。","ja":"エージェントが `gh` CLI を使用して GitHub リポジトリとサービスとやり取りできるようにし、認証、リポジトリの複製、作成、フォーク、表示をシームレスに行い、同時に GitHub の API とプロトコルを利用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh` CLI를 사용하여 GitHub 저장소 및 서비스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여 인증, 저장소 복제, 생성, 분기 및 보기와 같은 기능을 무결점으로 수행하며,同時に GitHub의 API 및 프로토콜을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con los repositorios y servicios de GitHub utilizando la CLI `gh`, lo que permite una autenticación sin problemas, clonación de repositorios, creación, bifurcación y visualización, todo mientras aprovecha las API y protocolos de GitHub.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec les référentiels et les services GitHub en utilisant la CLI `gh`, ce qui permet une authentification transparente, le clonage de référentiels, la création, la bifurcation et la visualisation, le tout en exploitant les API et les protocoles GitHub.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, mit GitHub-Repositorys und -Diensten über die `gh`-CLI zu interagieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Authentifizierung, Repository-Klonen, Erstellung, Forking und Anzeige ermöglicht wird, während die GitHub-APIs und -Protokolle genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com repositórios e serviços GitHub usando a CLI `gh`, permitindo autenticação sem problemas, clonagem de repositórios, criação, bifurcação e visualização, tudo isso aproveitando as APIs e protocolos do GitHub.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с репозиториями и сервисами GitHub с помощью CLI `gh`, обеспечивая бесшовную аутентификацию, клонирование репозиториев, создание, вилки и просмотр, все это при использовании API и протоколов GitHub.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التفاعل مع مستودعات وخدمات GitHub باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `gh` ، مما يتيح عملية مصادقة بدون مشاكل، ونسخ المستودعات، وإنشاء، وتفرع، وعرض، كل ذلك مع استخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وبروتوكولات GitHub."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating repository cloning for AI coding projects","Generating new repositories for version-controlled collaborations","Debugging authentication issues with `gh auth status` and `gh auth refresh`"],"zh":["用于 AI 编码项目的自动仓库克隆","用于版本控制协作的新仓库生成","使用 `gh auth status` 和 `gh auth refresh` 调试身份验证问题"],"ja":["AI コーディング プロジェクトの自動リポジトリ複製","バージョン管理コラボレーションのための新しいリポジトリの生成","`gh auth status` および `gh auth refresh` を使用した認証問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["AI 코딩 프로젝트를 위한 자동 저장소 복제","버전 관리 협업을 위한 새로운 저장소 생성","`gh auth status` 및 `gh auth refresh`를 사용한 인증 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del clonado de repositorios para proyectos de codificación de IA","Generación de nuevos repositorios para colaboraciones con control de versiones","Depuración de problemas de autenticación con `gh auth status` y `gh auth refresh`"],"fr":["Automatisation du clonage de référentiels pour les projets de codage IA","Génération de nouveaux référentiels pour des collaborations avec contrôle de version","Débogage des problèmes d''authentification avec `gh auth status` et `gh auth refresh`"],"de":["Automatisierung des Klonens von Repositorys für AI-Coding-Projekte","Erzeugung neuer Repositorys für versionierte Zusammenarbeit","Fehlerbehebung bei Authentifizierungsproblemen mit `gh auth status` und `gh auth refresh`"],"pt":["Automatizar a clonagem de repositórios para projetos de codificação de IA","Gerar novos repositórios para colaborações controladas por versão","Depurar problemas de autenticação com `gh auth status` e `gh auth refresh`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать клонирование репозиториев для проектов кодирования ИИ","Генерировать новые репозитории для контрольных версий сотрудничества","Отладить проблемы аутентификации с помощью `gh auth status` и `gh auth refresh`"],"ar":["تأتمة نسخ المستودعات للمشاريع الترميز الذكي","إنشاء مستودعات جديدة للتعاونات المدارة بإصدار","تصحيح مشاكل المصادقة باستخدام `gh auth status` و `gh auth refresh`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Needs authentication token refresh for prolonged usage"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI","需要身份验证令牌刷新以进行长时间使用"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","長時間の使用には認証トークンの更新が必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치가 필요합니다.","장기간 사용을 위해서는 인증 토큰 새로고침이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de GitHub","Necesita una actualización del token de autenticación para un uso prolongado"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI GitHub","Nécessite une mise à jour du jeton d''authentification pour une utilisation prolongée"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der GitHub-CLI","Benötigt eine Aktualisierung des Authentifizierungstokens für einen langfristigen Einsatz"],"pt":["Requer instalação do GitHub CLI","Necessita de atualização do token de autenticação para uso prolongado"],"ru":["Требует установки GitHub CLI","Требует обновления токена аутентификации для длительного использования"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub","يتطلب تحديث رمز المصادقة للاستخدام الممتد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
