,"pt":["Mais de 264.000 estudos disponíveis","Mais de 8 milhões de amostras de dados","Suporte a experimentos baseados em array e sequência","Recuperação de dados experimentais","Download de arquivos brutos e processados","Consulta de perfis de expressão"],"ru":["Более 264 000 исследований в наличии","Более 8 миллионов образцов данных","Поддержка экспериментов на основе массивов и последовательностей","Восстановление экспериментальных данных","Скачивание сырых и обработанных файлов","Запрос профилей экспрессии"],"ar":["أكثر من 264.000 دراسة متاحة","أكثر من 8 ملايين عينة بيانات","دعم تجارب قائمة على المصفوفات والتسلسل","استرجاع بيانات تجارب","تحميل الملفات الخام والمعالجة","استعلام ملفات التعبير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GEO数据库","基因表达数据","实验数据","样本信息","表达谱分析","数据集成","生物信息学"],"ja":["GEOデータベース","遺伝子発現データ","実験データ","サンプル情報","発現プロファイル","データ統合","バイオインフォマティクス"],"ko":["GEO 데이터베이스","유전자 발현 데이터","실험 데이터","샘플 정보","발현 프로파일","데이터 통합","바이오 정보학"],"es":["base de datos GEO","genómica","expresión génica","NCBI","datos de alto rendimiento","genómica funcional"],"fr":["base de données GEO","génomique","expression génique","NCBI","données de haute performance","génomique fonctionnelle"],"de":["GEO-Datenbank","Genomik","Genexpression","NCBI","Daten mit hoher Leistung","funktionelle Genomik"],"pt":["banco de dados geo","expressão gênica","genômica funcional","ncbi","dados de expressão gênica","experimentos baseados em array","experimentos baseados em sequência"],"ru":["база данных geo","генная экспрессия","функциональная геномика","ncbi","данные о генной экспрессии","эксперименты на основе массивов","эксперименты на основе последовательностей"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات geo","التعبير الجيني","الجينوم الوظيفي","ncbi","بيانات التعبير الجيني","تجارب قائمة على المصفوفات","تجارب قائمة على التسلسل"]}},"owner":"drshailesh88","repo":"integrated_content_OS","repoPath":"drshailesh88/integrated_content_OS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"geo-database","description":"Access NCBI GEO for gene expression/genomics data. Search/download microarray and RNA-seq datasets (GSE, GSM, GPL), retrieve SOFT/Matrix files, for transcriptomics and expression analysis.","bodyPreview":"# GEO Database\n\n## Overview\n\nThe Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO) is NCBI''s public repository for high-throughput gene expression and functional genomics data. GEO contains over 264,000 studies with more than 8 million samples from both array-based and sequence-based experiments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be used when searching for gene expression datasets, retrieving experimental data, downloading raw and processed files, querying expression profiles, or integrating GEO data in","body":"# GEO Database\n\n## Overview\n\nThe Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO) is NCBI''s public repository for high-throughput gene expression and functional genomics data. GEO contains over 264,000 studies with more than 8 million samples from both array-based and sequence-based experiments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be used when searching for gene expression datasets, retrieving experimental data, downloading raw and processed files, querying expression profiles, or integrating GEO data into computational analysis workflows.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Understanding GEO Data Organization\n\nGEO organizes data hierarchically using different accession types:\n\n**Series (GSE):** A complete experiment with a set of related samples\n- Example: GSE123456\n- Contains experimental design, samples, and overall study information\n- Largest organizational unit in GEO\n- Current count: 264,928+ series\n\n**Sample (GSM):** A single experimental sample or biological replicate\n- Example: GSM987654\n- Contains individual sample data, protocols, and metadata\n- Linked to platforms and series\n- Current count: 8,068,632+ samples\n\n**Platform (GPL):** The microarray or sequencing platform used\n- Example: GPL570 (Affymetrix Human Genome U133 Plus 2.0 Array)\n- Describes the technology and probe/feature annotations\n- Shared across multiple experiments\n- Current count: 27,739+ platforms\n\n**DataSet (GDS):** Curated collections with consistent formatting\n- Example: GDS5678\n- Experimentally-comparable samples organized by study design\n- Processed for differential analysis\n- Subset of GEO data (4,348 curated datasets)\n- Ideal for quick comparative analyses\n\n**Profiles:** Gene-specific expression data linked to sequence features\n- Queryable by gene name or annotation\n- Cross-references to Entrez Gene\n- Enables gene-centric searches across all studies\n\n### 2. Searching GEO Data\n\n**GEO DataSets Search:**\n\nSearch for studies by keywords, organism, or experimental conditions:\n\n```python\nfrom Bio import Entrez\n\n# Configure Entrez (required)\nEntrez.email = \"your.email@example.com\"\n\n# Search for datasets\ndef search_geo_datasets(query, retmax=20):\n    \"\"\"Search GEO DataSets database\"\"\"\n    handle = Entrez.esearch(\n        db=\"gds\",\n        term=query,\n        retmax=retmax,\n        usehistory=\"y\"\n    )\n    results = Entrez.read(handle)\n    handle.close()\n    return results\n\n# Example searches\nresults = search_geo_datasets(\"breast cancer[MeSH] AND Homo sapiens[Organism]\")\nprint(f\"Found {results[''Count'']} datasets\")\n\n# Search by specific platform\nresults = search_geo_datasets(\"GPL570[Accession]\")\n\n# Search by study type\nresults = search_geo_datasets(\"expression profiling by array[DataSet Type]\")\n```\n\n**GEO Profiles Search:**\n\nFind gene-specific expression patterns:\n\n```python\n# Search for gene expression profiles\ndef search_geo_profiles(gene_name, organism=\"Homo sapiens\", retmax=100):\n    \"\"\"Search GEO Profiles for a specific gene\"\"\"\n    query = f\"{gene_name}[Gene Name] AND {organism}[Organism]\"\n    handle = Entrez.esearch(\n        db=\"geoprofiles\",\n        term=query,\n        retmax=retmax\n    )\n    results = Entrez.read(handle)\n    handle.close()\n    return results\n\n# Find TP53 expression across studies\ntp53_results = search_geo_profiles(\"TP53\", organism=\"Homo sapiens\")\nprint(f\"Found {tp53_results[''Count'']} expression profiles for TP53\")\n```\n\n**Advanced Search Patterns:**\n\n```python\n# Combine multiple search terms\ndef advanced_geo_search(terms, operator=\"AND\"):\n    \"\"\"Build complex search queries\"\"\"\n    query = f\" {operator} \".join(terms)\n    return search_geo_datasets(query)\n\n# Find recent high-throughput studies\nsearch_terms = [\n    \"RNA-seq[DataSet Type]\",\n    \"Homo sapiens[Organism]\",\n    \"2024[Publication Date]\"\n]\nresults = advanced_geo_search(search_terms)\n\n# Search by author and condition\nsearch_terms = [\n    \"Smith[Author]\",\n    \"diabetes[Disease]\"\n]\nresults = advanced_geo_search(search_terms)\n```\n\n### 3. Retrieving GEO Data with GEOparse (Recommended)\n\n**GEOparse** is the primary Python library for accessing GEO data:\n\n**Installation:**\n```bash\nuv pip install GEOparse\n```\n\n**Basic Usage:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\n\n# Download and parse a GEO Series\ngse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=\"GSE123456\", destdir=\"./data\")\n\n# Access series metadata\nprint(gse.metadata[''title''])\nprint(gse.metadata[''summary''])\nprint(gse.metadata[''overall_design''])\n\n# Access sample information\nfor gsm_name, gsm in gse.gsms.items():\n    print(f\"Sample: {gsm_name}\")\n    print(f\"  Title: {gsm.metadata[''title''][0]}\")\n    print(f\"  Source: {gsm.metadata[''source_name_ch1''][0]}\")\n    print(f\"  Characteristics: {gsm.metadata.get(''characteristics_ch1'', [])}\")\n\n# Access platform information\nfor gpl_name, gpl in gse.gpls.items():\n    print(f\"Platform: {gpl_name}\")\n    print(f\"  Title: {gpl.metadata[''title''][0]}\")\n    print(f\"  Organism: {gpl.metadata[''organism''][0]}\")\n```\n\n**Working with Expression Data:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Get expression data from series\ngse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=\"GSE123456\", destdir=\"./data\")\n\n# Extract expression matrix\n# Method 1: From series matrix file (fastest)\nif hasattr(gse, ''pivot_samples''):\n    expression_df = gse.pivot_samples(''VALUE'')\n    print(expression_df.shape)  # genes x samples\n\n# Method 2: From individual samples\nexpression_data = {}\nfor gsm_name, gsm in gse.gsms.items():\n    if hasattr(gsm, ''table''):\n        expression_data[gsm_name] = gsm.table[''VALUE'']\n\nexpression_df = pd.DataFrame(expression_data)\nprint(f\"Expression matrix: {expression_df.shape}\")\n```\n\n**Accessing Supplementary Files:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\n\ngse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=\"GSE123456\", destdir=\"./data\")\n\n# Download supplementary files\ngse.download_supplementary_files(\n    directory=\"./data/GSE123456_suppl\",\n    download_sra=False  # Set to True to download SRA files\n)\n\n# List available supplementary files\nfor gsm_name, gsm in gse.gsms.items():\n    if hasattr(gsm, ''supplementary_files''):\n        print(f\"Sample {gsm_name}:\")\n        for file_url in gsm.metadata.get(''supplementary_file'', []):\n            print(f\"  {file_url}\")\n```\n\n**Filtering and Subsetting Data:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\n\ngse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=\"GSE123456\", destdir=\"./data\")\n\n# Filter samples by metadata\ncontrol_samples = [\n    gsm_name for gsm_name, gsm in gse.gsms.items()\n    if ''control'' in gsm.metadata.get(''title'', [''''])[0].lower()\n]\n\ntreatment_samples = [\n    gsm_name for gsm_name, gsm in gse.gsms.items()\n    if ''treatment'' in gsm.metadata.get(''title'', [''''])[0].lower()\n]\n\nprint(f\"Control samples: {len(control_samples)}\")\nprint(f\"Treatment samples: {len(treatment_samples)}\")\n\n# Extract subset expression matrix\nexpression_df = gse.pivot_samples(''VALUE'')\ncontrol_expr = expression_df[control_samples]\ntreatment_expr = expression_df[treatment_samples]\n```\n\n### 4. Using NCBI E-utilities for GEO Access\n\n**E-utilities** provide lower-level programmatic access to GEO metadata:\n\n**Basic E-utilities Workflow:**\n\n```python\nfrom Bio import Entrez\nimport time\n\nEntrez.email = \"your.email@example.com\"\n\n# Step 1: Search for GEO entries\ndef search_geo(query, db=\"gds\", retmax=100):\n    \"\"\"Search GEO using E-utilities\"\"\"\n    handle = Entrez.esearch(\n        db=db,\n        term=query,\n        retmax=retmax,\n        usehistory=\"y\"\n    )\n    results = Entrez.read(handle)\n    handle.close()\n    return results\n\n# Step 2: Fetch summaries\ndef fetch_geo_summaries(id_list, db=\"gds\"):\n    \"\"\"Fetch document summaries for GEO entries\"\"\"\n    ids = \",\".join(id_list)\n    handle = Entrez.esummary(db=db, id=ids)\n    summaries = Entrez.read(handle)\n    handle.close()\n    return summaries\n\n# Step 3: Fetch full records\ndef fetch_geo_records(id_list, db=\"gds\"):\n    \"\"\"Fetch full GEO records\"\"\"\n    ids = \",\".join(id_list)\n    handle = Entrez.efetch(db=db, id=ids, retmode=\"xml\")\n    records = Entrez.read(handle)\n    handle.close()\n    return records\n\n# Example workflow\nsearch_results = search_geo(\"breast cancer AND Homo sapiens\")\nid_list = search_results[''IdList''][:5]\n\nsummaries = fetch_geo_summaries(id_list)\nfor summary in summaries:\n    print(f\"GDS: {summary.get(''Accession'', ''N/A'')}\")\n    print(f\"Title: {summary.get(''title'', ''N/A'')}\")\n    print(f\"Samples: {summary.get(''n_samples'', ''N/A'')}\")\n    print()\n```\n\n**Batch Processing with E-utilities:**\n\n```python\nfrom Bio import Entrez\nimport time\n\nEntrez.email = \"your.email@example.com\"\n\ndef batch_fetch_geo_metadata(accessions, batch_size=100):\n    \"\"\"Fetch metadata for multiple GEO accessions\"\"\"\n    results = {}\n\n    for i in range(0, len(accessions), batch_size):\n        batch = accessions[i:i + batch_size]\n\n        # Search for each accession\n        for accession in batch:\n            try:\n                query = f\"{accession}[Accession]\"\n                search_handle = Entrez.esearch(db=\"gds\", term=query)\n                search_results = Entrez.read(search_handle)\n                search_handle.close()\n\n                if search_results[''IdList'']:\n                    # Fetch summary\n                    summary_handle = Entrez.esummary(\n                        db=\"gds\",\n                        id=search_results[''IdList''][0]\n                    )\n                    summary = Entrez.read(summary_handle)\n                    summary_handle.close()\n                    results[accession] = summary[0]\n\n                # Be polite to NCBI servers\n                time.sleep(0.34)  # Max 3 requests per second\n\n            except Exception as e:\n                print(f\"Error fetching {accession}: {e}\")\n\n    return results\n\n# Fetch metadata for multiple datasets\ngse_list = [\"GSE100001\", \"GSE100002\", \"GSE100003\"]\nmetadata = batch_fetch_geo_metadata(gse_list)\n```\n\n### 5. Direct FTP Access for Data Files\n\n**FTP URLs for GEO Data:**\n\nGEO data can be downloaded directly via FTP:\n\n```python\nimport ftplib\nimport os\n\ndef download_geo_ftp(accession, file_type=\"matrix\", dest_dir=\"./data\"):\n    \"\"\"Download GEO files via FTP\"\"\"\n    # Construct FTP path based on accession type\n    if accession.startswith(\"GSE\"):\n        # Series files\n        gse_num = accession[3:]\n        base_num = gse_num[:-3] + \"nnn\"\n        ftp_path = f\"/geo/series/GSE{base_num}/{accession}/\"\n\n        if file_type == \"matrix\":\n            filename = f\"{accession}_series_matrix.txt.gz\"\n        elif file_type == \"soft\":\n            filename = f\"{accession}_family.soft.gz\"\n        elif file_type == \"miniml\":\n            filename = f\"{accession}_family.xml.tgz\"\n\n    # Connect to FTP server\n    ftp = ftplib.FTP(\"ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\")\n    ftp.login()\n    ftp.cwd(ftp_path)\n\n    # Download file\n    os.makedirs(dest_dir, exist_ok=True)\n    local_file = os.path.join(dest_dir, filename)\n\n    with open(local_file, ''wb'') as f:\n        ftp.retrbinary(f''RETR {filename}'', f.write)\n\n    ftp.quit()\n    print(f\"Downloaded: {local_file}\")\n    return local_file\n\n# Download series matrix file\ndownload_geo_ftp(\"GSE123456\", file_type=\"matrix\")\n\n# Download SOFT format file\ndownload_geo_ftp(\"GSE123456\", file_type=\"soft\")\n```\n\n**Using wget or curl for Downloads:**\n\n```bash\n# Download series matrix file\nwget ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/series/GSE123nnn/GSE123456/matrix/GSE123456_series_matrix.txt.gz\n\n# Download all supplementary files for a series\nwget -r -np -nd ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/series/GSE123nnn/GSE123456/suppl/\n\n# Download SOFT format family file\nwget ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/series/GSE123nnn/GSE123456/soft/GSE123456_family.soft.gz\n```\n\n### 6. Analyzing GEO Data\n\n**Quality Control and Preprocessing:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\n# Load dataset\ngse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=\"GSE123456\", destdir=\"./data\")\nexpression_df = gse.pivot_samples(''VALUE'')\n\n# Check for missing values\nprint(f\"Missing values: {expression_df.isnull().sum().sum()}\")\n\n# Log transformation (if needed)\nif expression_df.min().min() > 0:  # Check if already log-transformed\n    if expression_df.max().max() > 100:\n        expression_df = np.log2(expression_df + 1)\n        print(\"Applied log2 transformation\")\n\n# Distribution plots\nplt.figure(figsize=(12, 5))\n\nplt.subplot(1, 2, 1)\nexpression_df.plot.box(ax=plt.gca())\nplt.title(\"Expression Distribution per Sample\")\nplt.xticks(rotation=90)\n\nplt.subplot(1, 2, 2)\nexpression_df.mean(axis=1).hist(bins=50)\nplt.title(\"Gene Expression Distribution\")\nplt.xlabel(\"Average Expression\")\n\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.savefig(\"geo_qc.png\", dpi=300, bbox_inches=''tight'')\n```\n\n**Differential Expression Analysis:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import stats\n\ngse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=\"GSE123456\", destdir=\"./data\")\nexpression_df = gse.pivot_samples(''VALUE'')\n\n# Define sample groups\ncontrol_samples = [\"GSM1\", \"GSM2\", \"GSM3\"]\ntreatment_samples = [\"GSM4\", \"GSM5\", \"GSM6\"]\n\n# Calculate fold changes and p-values\nresults = []\nfor gene in expression_df.index:\n    control_expr = expression_df.loc[gene, control_samples]\n    treatment_expr = expression_df.loc[gene, treatment_samples]\n\n    # Calculate statistics\n    fold_change = treatment_expr.mean() - control_expr.mean()\n    t_stat, p_value = stats.ttest_ind(treatment_expr, control_expr)\n\n    results.append({\n        ''gene'': gene,\n        ''log2_fold_change'': fold_change,\n        ''p_value'': p_value,\n        ''control_mean'': control_expr.mean(),\n        ''treatment_mean'': treatment_expr.mean()\n    })\n\n# Create results DataFrame\nde_results = pd.DataFrame(results)\n\n# Multiple testing correction (Benjamini-Hochberg)\nfrom statsmodels.stats.multitest import multipletests\n_, de_results[''q_value''], _, _ = multipletests(\n    de_results[''p_value''],\n    method=''fdr_bh''\n)\n\n# Filter significant genes\nsignificant_genes = de_results[\n    (de_results[''q_value''] < 0.05) &\n    (abs(de_results[''log2_fold_change'']) > 1)\n]\n\nprint(f\"Significant genes: {len(significant_genes)}\")\nsignificant_genes.to_csv(\"de_results.csv\", index=False)\n```\n\n**Correlation and Clustering Analysis:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\nimport seaborn as sns\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nfrom scipy.cluster import hierarchy\nfrom scipy.spatial.distance import pdist\n\ngse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=\"GSE123456\", destdir=\"./data\")\nexpression_df = gse.pivot_samples(''VALUE'')\n\n# Sample correlation heatmap\nsample_corr = expression_df.corr()\n\nplt.figure(figsize=(10, 8))\nsns.heatmap(sample_corr, cmap=''coolwarm'', center=0,\n            square=True, linewidths=0.5)\nplt.title(\"Sample Correlation Matrix\")\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.savefig(\"sample_correlation.png\", dpi=300, bbox_inches=''tight'')\n\n# Hierarchical clustering\ndistances = pdist(expression_df.T, metric=''correlation'')\nlinkage = hierarchy.linkage(distances, method=''average'')\n\nplt.figure(figsize=(12, 6))\nhierarchy.dendrogram(linkage, labels=expression_df.columns)\nplt.title(\"Hierarchical Clustering of Samples\")\nplt.xlabel(\"Samples\")\nplt.ylabel(\"Distance\")\nplt.xticks(rotation=90)\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.savefig(\"sample_clustering.png\", dpi=300, bbox_inches=''tight'')\n```\n\n### 7. Batch Processing Multiple Datasets\n\n**Download and Process Multiple Series:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\nimport pandas as pd\nimport os\n\ndef batch_download_geo(gse_list, destdir=\"./geo_data\"):\n    \"\"\"Download multiple GEO series\"\"\"\n    results = {}\n\n    for gse_id in gse_list:\n        try:\n            print(f\"Processing {gse_id}...\")\n            gse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=gse_id, destdir=destdir)\n\n            # Extract key information\n            results[gse_id] = {\n                ''title'': gse.metadata.get(''title'', [''N/A''])[0],\n                ''organism'': gse.metadata.get(''organism'', [''N/A''])[0],\n                ''platform'': list(gse.gpls.keys())[0] if gse.gpls else ''N/A'',\n                ''num_samples'': len(gse.gsms),\n                ''submission_date'': gse.metadata.get(''submission_date'', [''N/A''])[0]\n            }\n\n            # Save expression data\n            if hasattr(gse, ''pivot_samples''):\n                expr_df = gse.pivot_samples(''VALUE'')\n                expr_df.to_csv(f\"{destdir}/{gse_id}_expression.csv\")\n                results[gse_id][''num_genes''] = len(expr_df)\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"Error processing {gse_id}: {e}\")\n            results[gse_id] = {''error'': str(e)}\n\n    # Save summary\n    summary_df = pd.DataFrame(results).T\n    summary_df.to_csv(f\"{destdir}/batch_summary.csv\")\n\n    return results\n\n# Process multiple datasets\ngse_list = [\"GSE100001\", \"GSE100002\", \"GSE100003\"]\nresults = batch_download_geo(gse_list)\n```\n\n**Meta-Analysis Across Studies:**\n\n```python\nimport GEOparse\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef meta_analysis_geo(gse_list, gene_of_interest):\n    \"\"\"Perform meta-analysis of gene expression across studies\"\"\"\n    results = []\n\n    for gse_id in gse_list:\n        try:\n            gse = GEOparse.get_GEO(geo=gse_id, destdir=\"./data\")\n\n            # Get platform annotation\n            gpl = list(gse.gpls.values())[0]\n\n            # Find gene in platform\n            if hasattr(gpl, ''table''):\n                gene_probes = gpl.table[\n                    gpl.table[''Gene Symbol''].str.contains(\n                        gene_of_interest,\n                        case=False,\n                        na=False\n                    )\n                ]\n\n                if not gene_probes.empty:\n                    expr_df = gse.pivot_samples(''VALUE'')\n\n                    for probe_id in gene_probes[''ID'']:\n                        if probe_id in expr_df.index:\n                            expr_values = expr_df.loc[probe_id]\n\n                            results.append({\n                                ''study'': gse_id,\n                                ''probe'': probe_id,\n                                ''mean_expression'': expr_values.mean(),\n                                ''std_expression'': expr_values.std(),\n                                ''num_samples'': len(expr_values)\n                            })\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"Error in {gse_id}: {e}\")\n\n    return pd.DataFrame(results)\n\n# Meta-analysis for TP53\ngse_studies = [\"GSE100001\", \"GSE100002\", \"GSE100003\"]\nmeta_results = meta_analysis_geo(gse_studies, \"TP53\")\nprint(meta_results)\n```\n\n## Installation and Setup\n\n### Python Libraries\n\n```bash\n# Primary GEO access library (recommended)\nuv pip install GEOparse\n\n# For E-utilities and programmatic NCBI access\nuv pip install biopython\n\n# For data analysis\nuv pip install pandas numpy scipy\n\n# For visualization\nuv pip install matplotlib seaborn\n\n# For statistical analysis\nuv pip install statsmodels scikit-learn\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\nSet up NCBI E-utilities access:\n\n```python\nfrom Bio import Entrez\n\n# Always set your email (required by NCBI)\nEntrez.email = \"your.email@example.com\"\n\n# Optional: Set API key for increased rate limits\n# Get your API key from: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/account/\nEntrez.api_key = \"your_api_key_here\"\n\n# With API key: 10 requests/second\n# Without API key: 3 requests/second\n```\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### Transcriptomics Research\n- Download gene expression data for specific conditions\n- Compare expression profiles across studies\n- Identify differentially expressed genes\n- Perform meta-analyses across multiple datasets\n\n### Drug Response Studies\n- Analyze gene expression changes after drug treatment\n- Identify biomarkers for drug response\n- Compare drug effects across cell lines or patients\n- Build predictive models for drug sensitivity\n\n### Disease Biology\n- Study gene expression in disease vs. normal tissues\n- Identify disease-associated expression signatures\n- Compare patient subgroups and disease stages\n- Correlate expression with clinical outcomes\n\n### Biomarker Discovery\n- Screen for diagnostic or prognostic markers\n- Validate biomarkers across independent cohorts\n- Compare marker performance across platforms\n- Integrate expression with clinical data\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n**SOFT (Simple Omnibus Format in Text):** GEO''s primary text-based format containing metadata and data tables. Easily parsed by GEOparse.\n\n**MINiML (MIAME Notation in Markup Language):** XML format for GEO data, used for programmatic access and data exchange.\n\n**Series Matrix:** Tab-delimited expression matrix with samples as columns and genes/probes as rows. Fastest format for getting expression data.\n\n**MIAME Compliance:** Minimum Information About a Microarray Experiment - standardized annotation that GEO enforces for all submissions.\n\n**Expression Value Types:** Different types of expression measurements (raw signal, normalized, log-transformed). Always check platform and processing methods.\n\n**Platform Annotation:** Maps probe/feature IDs to genes. Essential for biological interpretation of expression data.\n\n## GEO2R Web Tool\n\nFor quick analysis without coding, use GEO2R:\n\n- Web-based statistical analysis tool integrated into GEO\n- Accessible at: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/geo2r/?acc=GSExxxxx\n- Performs differential expression analysis\n- Generates R scripts for reproducibility\n- Useful for exploratory analysis before downloading data\n\n## Rate Limiting and Best Practices\n\n**NCBI E-utilities Rate Limits:**\n- Without API key: 3 requests per second\n- With API key: 10 requests per second\n- Implement delays between requests: `time.sleep(0.34)` (no API key) or `time.sleep(0.1)` (with API key)\n\n**FTP Access:**\n- No rate limits for FTP downloads\n- Preferred method for bulk downloads\n- Can download entire directories with wget -r\n\n**GEOparse Caching:**\n- GEOparse automatically caches downloaded files in destdir\n- Subsequent calls use cached data\n- Clean cache periodically to save disk space\n\n**Optimal Practices:**\n- Use GEOparse for series-level access (easiest)\n- Use E-utilities for metadata searching and batch queries\n- Use FTP for direct file downloads and bulk operations\n- Cache data locally to avoid repeated downloads\n- Always set Entrez.email when using Biopython\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/geo_reference.md\n\nComprehensive reference documentation covering:\n- Detailed E-utilities API specifications and endpoints\n- Complete SOFT and MINiML file format documentation\n- Advanced GEOparse usage patterns and examples\n- FTP directory structure and file naming conventions\n- Data processing pipelines and normalization methods\n- Troubleshooting common issues and error handling\n- Platform-specific considerations and quirks\n\nConsult this reference for in-depth technical details, complex query patterns, or when working with uncommon data formats.\n\n## Important Notes\n\n### Data Quality Considerations\n\n- GEO accepts user-submitted data with varying quality standards\n- Always check platform annotation and processing methods\n- Verify sample metadata and experimental design\n- Be cautious with batch effects across studies\n- Consider reprocessing raw data for consistency\n\n### File Size Warnings\n\n- Series matrix files can be large (>1 GB for large studies)\n- Supplementary files (e.g., CEL files) can be very large\n- Plan for adequate disk space before downloading\n- Consider downloading samples incrementally\n\n### Data Usage and Citation\n\n- GEO data is freely available for research use\n- Always cite original studies when using GEO data\n- Cite GEO database: Barrett et al. (2013) Nucleic Acids Research\n- Check individual dataset usage restrictions (if any)\n- Follow NCBI guidelines for programmatic access\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n- Different platforms use different probe IDs (requires annotation mapping)\n- Expression values may be raw, normalized, or log-transformed (check metadata)\n- Sample metadata can be inconsistently formatted across studies\n- Not all series have series matrix files (older submissions)\n- Platform annotations may be outdated (genes renamed, IDs deprecated)\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- **GEO Website:** https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/\n- **GEO Submission Guidelines:** https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/info/submission.html\n- **GEOparse Documentation:** https://geoparse.readthedocs.io/\n- **E-utilities Documentation:** https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK25501/\n- **GEO FTP Site:** ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/\n- **GEO2R Tool:** https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/geo2r/\n- **NCBI API Keys:** https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2017/11/02/new-api-keys-for-the-e-utilities/\n- **Biopython Tutorial:** https://biopython.org/DIST/docs/tutorial/Tutorial.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:30:29.099Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Bioinformatics Agents needing access to high-throughput gene expression data from the Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO) repository.","zh":"非常适合需要访问基因表达谱数据的生物信息学代理，特别是从基因表达谱观测（GEO）仓库中获取高通量基因表达数据。","ja":"BioinformaticsエージェントがGene Expression Omnibus（GEO）リポジトリからのハイスループット・遺伝子発現データにアクセスする必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"바이오인포매틱스 에이전트가 Gene Expression Omnibus(GEO) 저장소의 고처리량 유전자 발현 데이터에 액세스해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de bioinformática que necesitan acceso a datos de expresión genética de alto rendimiento del repositorio Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de bioinformatique ayant besoin d''accéder à des données d''expression génétique à haut débit du référentiel Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO).","de":"Perfekt für Bioinformatik-Agenten, die Zugang zu Hochdurchsatz-Genexpressionsdaten aus dem Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO)-Repository benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Bioinformática que necessitam de acesso a dados de expressão gênica de alto rendimento do repositório Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO).","ru":"Идеально для агентов биоинформатики, которым требуется доступ к данным о высокопроизводительном генном выражении из репозитория Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO).","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيلات المعلوماتية الحيوية التي تحتاج إلى الوصول إلى بيانات التعبير الجيني عالية الإنتاجية من مستودع قاعدة بيانات التعبير الجيني (GEO)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query and retrieve gene expression datasets, download raw and processed files, and integrate GEO data into their workflows using protocols such as array-based and sequence-based experiments, providing a vast repository of over 264,000 studies with more than 8 million samples.","zh":"赋予代理查询和检索基因表达数据集、下载原始和处理文件的能力，并使用诸如基于阵列和基于序列的实验等协议，将GEO数据集成到工作流中，提供超过264,000个研究和超过800万个样本的庞大仓库。","ja":"エージェントが遺伝子発現データセットを検索して取得し、生データと処理済みファイルをダウンロードし、GEOデータをアレイベースおよびシーケンスベースの実験などのプロトコルを使用してワークフローに統合する機能を提供し、264,000を超える研究と800万を超えるサンプルを持つ広大なリポジトリを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 유전자 발현 데이터 세트를 쿼리하고检索하고, 원시 및 처리된 파일을 다운로드하는 기능을 제공하고, 배열 기반 및 시퀀스 기반 실험과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 GEO 데이터를 워크플로에 통합하는 기능을 제공하며, 264,000개 이상의 연구 및 800만개 이상의 샘플을 보유한 광대한 저장소를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar y recuperar conjuntos de datos de expresión genética, descargar archivos raw y procesados, e integrar los datos de GEO en sus flujos de trabajo utilizando protocolos como experimentos basados en matrices y basados en secuencias, proporcionando un vasto repositorio de más de 264.000 estudios con más de 8 millones de muestras.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger et de récupérer des jeux de données d''expression génétique, de télécharger des fichiers bruts et traités, et d''intégrer les données de GEO dans leurs flux de travail en utilisant des protocoles tels que des expériences basées sur des matrices et basées sur des séquences, fournissant un vaste référentiel de plus de 264 000 études avec plus de 8 millions d''échantillons.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Genexpressions-Datensätze abzufragen und zu retrieveen, rohe und verarbeitete Dateien herunterzuladen und GEO-Daten in ihre Workflows mithilfe von Protokollen wie array-basierten und sequenzbasierten Experimenten zu integrieren, wodurch ein umfangreiches Repository mit über 264.000 Studien und mehr als 8 Millionen Proben bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar e recuperar conjuntos de dados de expressão gênica, fazer download de arquivos brutos e processados e integrar dados do GEO aos seus fluxos de trabalho usando protocolos como experimentos baseados em arranjos e experimentos baseados em sequências, fornecendo um repositório vasto com mais de 264.000 estudos e mais de 8 milhões de amostras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запроса и извлечения наборов данных о генном выражении, загрузки сырых и обработанных файлов, а также интеграции данных GEO в их рабочие процессы с использованием таких протоколов, как эксперименты на основе массивов и эксперименты на основе последовательностей, предоставляя огромный репозиторий более 264 000 исследований с более чем 8 миллионами образцов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استعلام ومعالجة مجموعات بيانات التعبير الجيني، وتحميل الملفات الخام والمعالجة، ودمج بيانات GEO في سير عملهم باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التجارب القائمة على المصفوفات والتجارب القائمة على التسلسلات، وتوفير مستودع ضخم يحتوي على أكثر من 264000 دراسة وأكثر من 8 ملايين عينة."},"useCases":{"en":["Retrieving experimental data for gene expression analysis","Downloading raw and processed files for downstream analysis","Querying expression profiles for specific genes or conditions","Integrating GEO data into machine learning models for predictive analytics"],"zh":["检索基因表达分析的实验数据","下载下游分析的生数据和处理数据","查询特定基因或条件的表达谱","将GEO数据集成到机器学习模型中进行预测分析"],"ja":["遺伝子発現分析のための実験データの取得","ダウンストリーム分析のための生データと処理済みデータのダウンロード","特定の遺伝子または条件の発現プロファイルの検索","GEOデータを機械学習モデルに統合して予測分析を行う"],"ko":["유전자 발현 분석을 위한 실험 데이터의 검색","하위 스트림 분석을 위한 원시 데이터 및 처리된 데이터의 다운로드","특정 유전자 또는 조건의 발현 프로필의 쿼리","GEO 데이터를 기계 학습 모델에 통합하여 예측 분석을 수행하는"],"es":["Recuperación de datos experimentales para el análisis de expresión genética","Descarga de archivos raw y procesados para el análisis posterior","Consulta de perfiles de expresión para genes o condiciones específicas","Integración de datos de GEO en modelos de aprendizaje automático para análisis predictivos"],"fr":["Récupération de données expérimentales pour l''analyse d''expression génétique","Téléchargement de fichiers bruts et traités pour l''analyse ultérieure","Interrogation de profils d''expression pour des gènes ou des conditions spécifiques","Intégration de données de GEO dans des modèles d''apprentissage automatique pour l''analyse prédictive"],"de":["Abrufen von experimentellen Daten für die Genexpressionsanalyse","Herunterladen von rohen und verarbeiteten Dateien für die nachgelagerte Analyse","Abfrage von Expressionsprofilen für spezifische Gene oder Bedingungen","Integrieren von GEO-Daten in Machine-Learning-Modelle für Vorhersageanalysen"],"pt":["Recuperar dados experimentais para análise de expressão gênica","Fazer download de arquivos brutos e processados para análise downstream","Consultar perfis de expressão para genes ou condições específicas","Integrar dados do GEO a modelos de aprendizado de máquina para análise preditiva"],"ru":["Извлечение экспериментальных данных для анализа генного выражения","Загрузка сырых и обработанных файлов для анализа downstream","Запрос профилей выражения для конкретных генов или условий","Интеграция данных GEO в модели машинного обучения для предиктивной аналитики"],"ar":["استرداد البيانات التجريبية لتحليل التعبير الجيني","تحميل الملفات الخام والمعالجة للتحليل التنازلي","استعلام ملفات تعبير محددة للأجين أو الظروف","دمج بيانات GEO في نماذج التعلم الآلي للتحليل التنبؤي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO) repository","Limited to gene expression and functional genomics data"],"zh":["需要访问基因表达谱观测（GEO）仓库","仅限于基因表达和功能基因组学数据"],"ja":["Gene Expression Omnibus（GEO）リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","遺伝子発現と機能ゲノミクスデータに限定される"],"ko":["Gene Expression Omnibus(GEO) 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요함","유전자 발현 및 기능유전체학 데이터에만 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO)","Limitado a datos de expresión genética y genómica funcional"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO)","Limité aux données d''expression génétique et de génomique fonctionnelle"],"de":["Erfordert Zugang zum Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO)-Repository","Begrenzt auf Genexpressions- und funktionelle Genomik-Daten"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO)","Limitado a dados de expressão gênica e genômica funcional"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO)","Ограничен данными о генном выражении и функциональной геномике"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع قاعدة بيانات التعبير الجيني (GEO)","محدود ببيانات التعبير الجيني والجينوم الوظيفي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jiangzhuizzz/MyMoltbot/copywriting', 'community', 'jiangzhuizzz', 'MyMoltbot', 'jiangzhuizzz/MyMoltbot', 'copywriting', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:30:53.508Z', NULL, '{"id":"jiangzhuizzz/MyMoltbot/copywriting","name":"copywriting","description":{"zh":"copywriting,","ja":"copywriting","ko":"copywriting","es":"La copia publicitaria es una técnica de marketing que impulsa la acción. Aprende a escribir copias efectivas para desarrolladores.","fr":"La copie publicitaire est une technique de marketing qui stimule l''action. Apprenez à écrire des copies efficaces pour les développeurs.","de":"Die Werbekopie ist eine Marketingtechnik, die zur Aktion anregt. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Werbetexte für Entwickler schreiben.","pt":"O copywriting de conversão é uma técnica de escrita que visa impulsionar ações e converter visitantes em clientes. Ele envolve a criação de conteúdo claro, conciso e persuasivo.","ru":"Копирайтинг для конверсии - это техника письма, направленная на стимулирование действий и превращение посетителей в клиентов. Она включает в себя создание четкого, краткого и убедительного контента.","ar":"كتابة المحتوى التسويقي الفعّال هي تقنية كتابة تهدف إلى تحفيز الأفعال وتحويل الزوار إلى عملاء. она تتضمن إنشاء محتوى واضح ومقنع.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"copywriting ","ja":"copywriting","ko":"copywriting","es":"Técnicas de copia publicitaria efectivas","fr":"Références de copie publicitaire pour les développeurs","de":"Effektive Copywriting-Techniken für Entwickler","pt":"Copywriting de Conversão: Escreva Conteúdo de Marketing E...","ru":"Копирайтинг для конверсии: пишите эффективный маркетингов...","ar":"كتابة المحتوى التسويقي الفعّال: копирайтинг للتحويل","en":"copywriting"},"description":{"zh":"copywriting,","ja":"copywriting","ko":"copywriting","es":"La copia publicitaria es una técnica de marketing que impulsa la acción. Aprende a escribir copias efectivas para desarrolladores.","fr":"La copie publicitaire est une technique de marketing qui stimule l''action. Apprenez à écrire des copies efficaces pour les développeurs.","de":"Die Werbekopie ist eine Marketingtechnik, die zur Aktion anregt. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Werbetexte für Entwickler schreiben.","pt":"O copywriting de conversão é uma técnica de escrita que visa impulsionar ações e converter visitantes em clientes. Ele envolve a criação de conteúdo claro, c...","ru":"Копирайтинг для конверсии - это техника письма, направленная на стимулирование действий и превращение посетителей в клиентов. Она включает в себя создание че...","ar":"كتابة المحتوى التسويقي الفعّال هي تقنية كتابة تهدف إلى تحفيز الأفعال وتحويل الزوار إلى عملاء. она تتضمن إنشاء محتوى واضح ومقنع.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["copywriting","SEO","","",""],"ja":["copywriting","SEO","","",""],"ko":["copywriting","SEO","","",""],"es":["Escribir copias publicitarias claras y convincentes","Definir el propósito de la página y la acción principal","Identificar el público objetivo y sus necesidades","Crear un llamado a la acción efectivo","Optimizar la copia publicitaria para motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["Écrire des copies publicitaires claires et convaincantes","Définir le but de la page et l''action principale","Identifier le public cible et ses besoins","Créer un appel à l''action efficace","Optimiser la copie publicitaire pour les moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Klare und überzeugende Werbetexte schreiben","Den Zweck der Seite und die primäre Aktion definieren","Die Zielgruppe und ihre Bedürfnisse identifizieren","Einen effektiven Aufruf zur Aktion erstellen","Die Werbekopie für Suchmaschinen optimieren"],"pt":["Escreva copywriting claro e conciso","Crie conteúdo persuasivo","Entenda o público-alvo","Defina ações primárias e secundárias","Otimizar para conversão"],"ru":["Пишите четкий и краткий копирайтинг","Создавайте убедительный контент","Понимайте целевую аудиторию","Определите основные и второстепенные действия","Оптимизируйте для конверсии"],"ar":["اكتب المحتوى التسويقي الواضح والمقنع","أنشئ محتوى مقنع","افهم الجمهور المستهدف","حدد الأفعال الأساسية والثانوية","أتمتة التحويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["copywriting","SEO","","","",""],"ja":["copywriting","SEO","","","",""],"ko":["copywriting","SEO","","","",""],"es":["copia publicitaria","marketing de contenido","desarrollo web","copywriting para desarrolladores","técnicas de copia publicitaria","optimización para motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["copie publicitaire","marketing de contenu","développement web","copywriting pour développeurs","techniques de copie publicitaire","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Werbekopie","Content-Marketing","Webentwicklung","Copywriting für Entwickler","Werbekopie-Techniken","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung"],"pt":["copywriting de conversão","conteúdo de marketing","otimização para conversão","escrita persuasiva","público-alvo","ações primárias e secundárias"],"ru":["копирайтинг для конверсии","маркетинговый контент","оптимизация для конверсии","убедительное письмо","целевая аудитория","основные и второстепенные действия"],"ar":["كتابة المحتوى التسويقي الفعّال","محتوى التسويق","تحسين التحويل","كتابة مقنعة","الجمهور المستهدف","الأفعال الأساسية والثانوية"]}},"owner":"jiangzhuizzz","repo":"MyMoltbot","repoPath":"jiangzhuizzz/MyMoltbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriting","description":"When the user wants to write, rewrite, or improve marketing copy for any page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, about pages, or product pages. Also use when the user says write copy for, improve this copy, rewrite this page, marketing copy, headline help, or CTA copy. For email copy, see email-sequence. For popup copy, see popup-cro.","bodyPreview":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solv","body":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solve?\n- What have they already tried?\n- What objections or hesitations do they have?\n- What language do they use to describe their problem?\n\n### 3. Product/Offer\n- What are you selling or offering?\n- What makes it different from alternatives?\n- What''s the key transformation or outcome?\n- Any proof points (numbers, testimonials, case studies)?\n\n### 4. Context\n- Where is traffic coming from? (ads, organic, email)\n- What do visitors already know before arriving?\n- What messaging are they seeing before this page?\n\n---\n\n## Copywriting Principles\n\n### Clarity Over Cleverness\n- If you have to choose between clear and creative, choose clear\n- Every sentence should have one job\n- Remove words that don''t add meaning\n\n### Benefits Over Features\n- Features: What it does\n- Benefits: What that means for the customer\n- Always connect features to outcomes\n\n### Specificity Over Vagueness\n- Vague: \"Save time on your workflow\"\n- Specific: \"Cut your weekly reporting from 4 hours to 15 minutes\"\n\n### Customer Language Over Company Language\n- Use words your customers use\n- Avoid jargon unless your audience uses it\n- Mirror voice-of-customer from reviews, interviews, support tickets\n\n### One Idea Per Section\n- Don''t try to say everything everywhere\n- Each section should advance one argument\n- Build a logical flow down the page\n\n---\n\n## Writing Style Rules\n\nFollow these core principles. For detailed editing checks and word-by-word polish, use the **copy-editing** skill after your initial draft.\n\n### Core Style Principles\n\n1. **Simple over complex** — Use everyday words. \"Use\" instead of \"utilize,\" \"help\" instead of \"facilitate.\"\n\n2. **Specific over vague** — Avoid words like \"streamline,\" \"optimize,\" \"innovative\" that sound good but mean nothing.\n\n3. **Active over passive** — \"We generate reports\" not \"Reports are generated.\"\n\n4. **Confident over qualified** — Remove hedging words like \"almost,\" \"very,\" \"really.\"\n\n5. **Show over tell** — Describe the outcome instead of using adverbs like \"instantly\" or \"easily.\"\n\n6. **Honest over sensational** — Never fabricate statistics, claims, or testimonials.\n\n### Quick Quality Check\n\nBefore finalizing, scan for:\n- Jargon that could confuse outsiders\n- Sentences trying to do too much (max 3 conjunctions)\n- Passive voice constructions\n- Exclamation points (remove them)\n- Marketing buzzwords without substance\n\nFor a thorough line-by-line review, run the copy through the **copy-editing** skill''s Seven Sweeps framework.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Be Direct\nGet to the point. Don''t bury the value in qualifications.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot? Send as many documents, images, and audio files as your heart desires.\n\n### Use Rhetorical Questions\nQuestions engage readers and make them think about their own situation.\n\n✅ Hate returning stuff to Amazon?\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot?\n\n✅ Tired of chasing approvals?\n\n### Use Analogies and Metaphors\nWhen appropriate, analogies make abstract concepts concrete and memorable.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Imagine Slack''s file-sharing as a digital whiteboard where everyone can post files, images, and updates in real time.\n\n### Pepper in Humor (When Appropriate)\nPuns, wit, and humor make copy memorable—but only if it fits the brand and doesn''t undermine clarity.\n\n---\n\n## Page Structure Framework\n\n### Above the Fold (First Screen)\n\n**Headline**\n- Your single most important message\n- Should communicate core value proposition\n- Specific > generic\n\n**Headline Formulas:**\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} without {pain point}**\n*Example: Understand how users are really experiencing your site without drowning in numbers*\n\n**The {opposite of usual process} way to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: The easiest way to turn your passion into income*\n\n**Never {unpleasant event} again**\n*Example: Never miss a sales opportunity again*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience}**\n*Example: Advanced analytics for Shopify e-commerce*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience} to {what it''s used for}**\n*Example: An online whiteboard for teams to ideate and brainstorm together*\n\n**You don''t have to {skills or resources} to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: With Ahrefs, you don''t have to be an SEO pro to rank higher and get more traffic*\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} by {how product makes it possible}**\n*Example: Generate more leads by seeing which companies visit your site*\n\n**{Key benefit of your product}**\n*Example: Sound clear in online meetings*\n\n**{Question highlighting the main pain point}**\n*Example: Hate returning stuff to Amazon?*\n\n**Turn {input} into {outcome}**\n*Example: Turn your hard-earned sales into repeat customers*\n\n**Additional formulas:**\n- \"[Achieve outcome] in [timeframe]\"\n- \"The [category] that [key differentiator]\"\n- \"Stop [pain]. Start [pleasure].\"\n- \"[Number] [people] use [product] to [outcome]\"\n\n**Subheadline**\n- Expands on the headline\n- Adds specificity or addresses secondary concern\n- 1-2 sentences max\n\n**Primary CTA**\n- Action-oriented button text\n- Communicate what they get, not what they do\n- \"Start Free Trial\" > \"Sign Up\"\n- \"Get Your Report\" > \"Submit\"\n\n**Supporting Visual**\n- Product screenshot, demo, or hero image\n- Should reinforce the message, not distract\n\n### Social Proof Section\n\nOptions (use 1-2):\n- Customer logos (recognizable > many)\n- Key metric (\"10,000+ teams\")\n- Short testimonial with attribution\n- Star rating with review count\n\n### Problem/Pain Section\n\n- Articulate the problem better than they can\n- Show you understand their situation\n- Create recognition (\"that''s exactly my problem\")\n\nStructure:\n- \"You know the feeling...\" or \"If you''re like most [role]...\"\n- Describe the specific frustrations\n- Hint at the cost of not solving it\n\n### Solution/Benefits Section\n\n- Bridge from problem to your solution\n- Focus on 3-5 key benefits (not 10)\n- Each benefit: headline + short explanation + proof point if available\n\nFormat options:\n- Benefit blocks with icons\n- Before/after comparison\n- Feature → Benefit → Proof structure\n\n### How It Works Section\n\n- Reduce perceived complexity\n- 3-4 step process\n- Each step: simple action + outcome\n\nExample:\n1. \"Connect your tools (2 minutes)\"\n2. \"Set your preferences\"\n3. \"Get automated reports every Monday\"\n\n### Social Proof (Detailed)\n\n- Full testimonials with:\n  - Specific results\n  - Customer name, role, company\n  - Photo if possible\n- Case study snippets\n- Logos section (if not above)\n\n### Objection Handling\n\nCommon objections to address:\n- \"Is this right for my situation?\"\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n- \"Is it hard to set up?\"\n- \"How is this different from X?\"\n\nFormats:\n- FAQ section\n- Comparison table\n- Guarantee/promise section\n- \"Built for [specific audience]\" section\n\n### Final CTA Section\n\n- Recap the value proposition\n- Repeat the primary CTA\n- Add urgency if genuine (deadline, limited availability)\n- Risk reversal (guarantee, free trial, no credit card)\n\n---\n\n## Landing Page Section Variety\n\nA great landing page isn''t just a list of features. Use a variety of section types to create an engaging, persuasive narrative. Mix and match from these:\n\n### Section Types to Include\n\n**How It Works (Numbered Steps)**\nWalk users through the process in 3-4 clear steps. Reduces perceived complexity and shows the path to value.\n\n**Alternative/Competitor Comparison**\nShow how you stack up against the status quo or competitors. Tables, side-by-side comparisons, or \"Unlike X, we...\" sections.\n\n**Founder Manifesto / Our Story**\nShare why you built this and what you believe. Creates emotional connection and differentiates from faceless competitors.\n\n**Testimonials**\nCustomer quotes with names, photos, and specific results. Multiple formats: quote cards, video testimonials, tweet embeds.\n\n**Case Studies**\nDeeper stories of customer success. Problem → Solution → Results format with specific metrics.\n\n**Use Cases**\nShow different ways the product is used. Helps visitors self-identify: \"This is for people like me.\"\n\n**Personas / \"Built For\" Sections**\nExplicitly call out who the product is for: \"Perfect for marketers,\" \"Built for agencies,\" etc.\n\n**Stats and Social Proof**\nKey metrics that build credibility: \"10,000+ customers,\" \"4.9/5 rating,\" \"$2M saved for customers.\"\n\n**Demo / Product Tour**\nInteractive demos, video walkthroughs, or GIF previews showing the product in action.\n\n**FAQ Section**\nAddress common objections and questions. Good for SEO and reducing support burden.\n\n**Integrations / Partners**\nShow what tools you connect with. Logos build credibility and answer \"Will this work with my stack?\"\n\n**Pricing Preview**\nEven on non-pricing pages, a pricing teaser can move decision-makers forward.\n\n**Guarantee / Risk Reversal**\nMoney-back guarantee, free trial terms, or \"cancel anytime\" messaging reduces friction.\n\n### Recommended Section Mix\n\nFor a landing page, aim for variety. Don''t just stack features:\n\n**Typical Feature-Heavy Page (Weak):**\n1. Hero\n2. Feature 1\n3. Feature 2\n4. Feature 3\n5. Feature 4\n6. CTA\n\n**Varied, Engaging Page (Strong):**\n1. Hero with clear value prop\n2. Social proof bar (logos or stats)\n3. Problem/pain section\n4. How it works (3 steps)\n5. Key benefits (2-3, not 10)\n6. Testimonial\n7. Use cases or personas\n8. Comparison to alternatives\n9. Case study snippet\n10. FAQ\n11. Final CTA with guarantee\n\n---\n\n## CTA Copy Guidelines\n\n**Weak CTAs (avoid):**\n- Submit\n- Sign Up\n- Learn More\n- Click Here\n- Get Started\n\n**Strong CTAs (use):**\n- Start Free Trial\n- Get [Specific Thing]\n- See [Product] in Action\n- Create Your First [Thing]\n- Book My Demo\n- Download the Guide\n- Try It Free\n\n**CTA formula:**\n[Action Verb] + [What They Get] + [Qualifier if needed]\n\nExamples:\n- \"Start My Free Trial\"\n- \"Get the Complete Checklist\"\n- \"See Pricing for My Team\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen writing copy, provide:\n\n### Page Copy\nOrganized by section with clear labels:\n- Headline\n- Subheadline\n- CTA\n- Section headers\n- Body copy\n- Secondary CTAs\n\n### Annotations\nFor key elements, explain:\n- Why you made this choice\n- What principle it applies\n- Alternatives considered\n\n### Alternatives\nFor headlines and CTAs, provide 2-3 options:\n- Option A: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option B: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option C: [copy] — [rationale]\n\n### Meta Content (if relevant)\n- Page title (for SEO)\n- Meta description\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Guidance\n\n### Homepage Copy\n- Serve multiple audiences without being generic\n- Lead with broadest value proposition\n- Provide clear paths for different visitor intents\n- Balance \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page Copy\n- Single message, single CTA\n- Match headline to ad/traffic source\n- Complete argument on one page\n- Remove distractions (often no nav)\n\n### Pricing Page Copy\n- Help visitors choose the right plan\n- Clarify what''s included at each level\n- Address \"which is right for me?\" anxiety\n- Make recommended plan obvious\n\n### Feature Page Copy\n- Connect feature to benefit to outcome\n- Show use cases and examples\n- Differentiate from competitors'' versions\n- Clear path to try or buy\n\n### About Page Copy\n- Tell the story of why you exist\n- Connect company mission to customer benefit\n- Build trust through transparency\n- Still include a CTA (it''s still a marketing page)\n\n---\n\n## Voice and Tone Considerations\n\nBefore writing, establish:\n\n**Formality level:**\n- Casual/conversational\n- Professional but friendly\n- Formal/enterprise\n\n**Brand personality:**\n- Playful or serious?\n- Bold or understated?\n- Technical or accessible?\n\nMaintain consistency throughout, but adjust intensity:\n- Headlines can be bolder\n- Body copy should be clearer\n- CTAs should be action-oriented\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copy-editing**: For polishing and improving existing copy (use after writing your first draft)\n- **page-cro**: If the page structure/strategy needs work, not just copy\n- **email-sequence**: For email copywriting\n- **popup-cro**: For popup and modal copy\n- **ab-test-setup**: To test copy variations properly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:30:53.508Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing persuasive marketing content generation.","zh":"非常适合需要说服性营销内容生成的语言代理。","ja":"説得力のあるマーケティングコンテンツ生成を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"説得력 있는 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan generar contenido de marketing persuasivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de générer du contenu de marketing persuasif.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die überzeugendes Marketing-Inhalt generieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de geração de conteúdo de marketing persuasivo.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым необходима генерация убедительного маркетингового контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد محتوى تسويقي مقنع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling marketing copy using context-driven page purpose and audience analysis, driving clear and actionable content with primary and secondary calls-to-action, leveraging protocols like HTML and CSS for seamless webpage integration.","zh":"使代理能够使用上下文驱动的页面目的和受众分析来制作令人信服的营销副本，推动清晰和可行的内容，具有主要和次要的行动号召，利用HTML和CSS等协议实现无缝的网页集成。","ja":"エージェントがコンテキスト駆動のページ目的とオーディエンス分析を使用して説得力のあるマーケティングコピーを作成できるようにし、明確で実行可能なコンテンツを推進し、主な呼び出しと副な呼び出しを使用し、HTMLやCSSなどのプロトコルを使用してシームレスなWebページ統合を実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 컨텍스트 기반 페이지 목적과 대상 분석을 사용하여 설득력 있는 마케팅 사본을 작성할 수 있도록 하여, 명확하고 실행 가능한 콘텐츠를 구동하고, 주요 및 보조 호출을 사용하며, HTML 및 CSS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 무결점의 웹 페이지 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear copias de marketing convincentes utilizando el propósito de la página y el análisis de la audiencia basado en el contexto, generando contenido claro y accionable con llamadas a la acción primarias y secundarias, aprovechando protocolos como HTML y CSS para una integración de página web sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des copies de marketing convaincantes en utilisant le but de la page et l''analyse du public basée sur le contexte, générant un contenu clair et actionnable avec des appels à l''action primaires et secondaires, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTML et CSS pour une intégration de page web sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, überzeugende Marketing-Kopien zu erstellen, indem sie den Zweck der Seite und die Analyse des Publikums basierend auf dem Kontext verwenden, klaren und handhabbaren Inhalt mit primären und sekundären Calls-to-Action generierend, Protokolle wie HTML und CSS nutzend, um eine nahtlose Integration von Webseiten zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar cópias de marketing convincentes usando a finalidade da página e a análise do contexto do público, impulsionando conteúdo claro e ação com chamadas primárias e secundárias, aproveitando protocolos como HTML e CSS para integração de página da web sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать убедительные маркетинговые копии, используя контекстно-ориентированную цель страницы и анализ аудитории, стимулируя четкий и действенный контент с основными и второстепенными призывами к действию, используя протоколы, такие как HTML и CSS, для бесшовной интеграции веб-страниц.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من صياغة نسخ تسويقية مقنعة باستخدام غرض الصفحة والتحليل الموجه للسياق للجمهور، مما يدفع المحتوى الواضح والقابل للتنفيذ مع نداءات العمل الأولى والثانوية، مستفيدًا من بروتوكولات مثل HTML و CSS من أجل دمج صفحات الويب بشكل متجانس."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating landing page copy for product launches","Creating persuasive homepage content for e-commerce sites","Writing targeted feature pages for software applications"],"zh":["为产品发布生成着陆页副本","为电子商务网站创建说服力首页内容","为软件应用程序编写目标特征页"],"ja":["製品リリースの着陸ページコピー生成","電子商取引サイトの説得力のあるホームページコンテンツ作成","ソフトウェアアプリケーションのターゲット機能ページ作成"],"ko":["제품 출시를 위한 랜딩 페이지 복사 생성","전자상거래 사이트를 위한 설득력 있는 홈페이지 콘텐츠 작성","소프트웨어 응용 프로그램을 위한 대상 특징 페이지 작성"],"es":["Generar copias de página de aterrizaje para lanzamientos de productos","Crear contenido de página de inicio persuasivo para sitios de comercio electrónico","Escribir páginas de características dirigidas para aplicaciones de software"],"fr":["Générer des copies de page de destination pour les lancements de produits","Créer un contenu de page d''accueil persuasif pour les sites de commerce électronique","Écrire des pages de fonctionnalités ciblées pour les applications logicielles"],"de":["Erstellen von Landeseitenkopien für Produktstarts","Erstellen von überzeugendem Startseiteninhalt für E-Commerce-Websites","Schreiben von gezielten Funktionsseiten für Softwareanwendungen"],"pt":["Geração de cópia de página de destino para lançamentos de produtos","Criação de conteúdo de página inicial persuasivo para sites de comércio eletrônico","Escrita de páginas de recursos direcionados para aplicações de software"],"ru":["Генерация копии целевой страницы для запуска продуктов","Создание убедительного контента домашней страницы для сайтов электронной коммерции","Написание целевых страниц функций для программных приложений"],"ar":["توليد نسخة صفحة 目的地 لأغراض إطلاق المنتجات","إنشاء محتوى مقنع لصفحة الرئيسية لمواقع التجارة الإلكترونية","كتابة صفحات الميزات المستهدفة للتطبيقات البرمجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific page purpose and audience context","Limited to marketing content generation"],"zh":["需要特定的页面目的和受众上下文","仅限营销内容生成"],"ja":["特定のページ目的とオーディエンスコンテキストが必要","マーケティングコンテンツ生成のみ"],"ko":["특정 페이지 목적과 대상 컨텍스트가 필요","마케팅 콘텐츠 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere un propósito de página y un contexto de audiencia específicos","Limitado a la generación de contenido de marketing"],"fr":["Nécessite un but de page et un contexte d''audience spécifiques","Limité à la génération de contenu de marketing"],"de":["Benötigt einen spezifischen Seitenzweck und einen Kontext der Zielgruppe","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Marketing-Inhalt"],"pt":["Exige contexto específico de finalidade e público da página","Limitado à geração de conteúdo de marketing"],"ru":["Требует конкретного контекста цели и аудитории страницы","Ограничен генерацией маркетингового контента"],"ar":["يتطلب سياقًا محددًا لغرض الصفحة وجمهورها","محدود بتوليد محتوى التسويق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YPYT1/All-skills/copywriting', 'community', 'YPYT1', 'All-skills', 'YPYT1/All-skills', 'copywriting', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:30:42.117Z', NULL, '{"id":"YPYT1/All-skills/copywriting","name":"copywriting","description":{"zh":"高效的Copywriting技巧可以帮助开发者提高转化率和用户参与度。我们的指南提供了撰写有效的营销文案的实用建议","ja":"コピーライティングの最適化は、開発者がコンバージョン率とユーザー参加度を向上させるのに役立ちます。このガイドでは、効果的なマーケティングコピーの書き方についての実践的なアドバイスを提供します","ko":"개발자를 위한 복사 작성 가이드는 전환率와 사용자 참여도를 향상시키는 데 도움이 됩니다. 이 가이드에서는 효과적인 마케팅 복사본을 작성하는 방법에 대한 실용적인 조언을 제공합니다","es":"El copywriting es una técnica de marketing que consiste en escribir texto para promocionar un producto o servicio. Los desarrolladores pueden aplicar estas técnicas para mejorar su marketing","fr":"Le copywriting est une technique de marketing qui consiste à écrire du texte pour promouvoir un produit ou un service. Les développeurs peuvent appliquer ces techniques pour améliorer leur marketing","de":"Copywriting ist eine Marketingtechnik, die darin besteht, Texte zu schreiben, um ein Produkt oder eine Dienstleistung zu bewerben. Entwickler können diese Techniken anwenden, um ihr Marketing zu verbessern","pt":"Copywriting é a arte de escrever conteúdo de marketing claro e atraente que impulsiona ações","ru":"Копирайтинг - это искусство написания ясного и привлекательного маркетингового контента, который стимулирует действия","ar":"كتابة المحتوى هي فن كتابة المحتوى التسويقي الواضح والمميز الذي يدفع الإجراءات","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"高效Copywriting技巧：开发者指南","ja":"コピーライティングの最適化：開発者のためのガイド","ko":"개발자를 위한 복사 작성 가이드","es":"Técnicas de Copywriting para Desarrolladores","fr":"Techniques de Copywriting pour les Développeurs","de":"Copywriting-Techniken für Entwickler","pt":"Copywriting para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Копирайтинг для разработчиков","ar":"كتابة المحتوى للמطورين","en":"copywriting"},"description":{"zh":"高效的Copywriting技巧可以帮助开发者提高转化率和用户参与度。我们的指南提供了撰写有效的营销文案的实用建议","ja":"コピーライティングの最適化は、開発者がコンバージョン率とユーザー参加度を向上させるのに役立ちます。このガイドでは、効果的なマーケティングコピーの書き方についての実践的なアドバイスを提供します","ko":"개발자를 위한 복사 작성 가이드는 전환率와 사용자 참여도를 향상시키는 데 도움이 됩니다. 이 가이드에서는 효과적인 마케팅 복사본을 작성하는 방법에 대한 실용적인 조언을 제공합니다","es":"El copywriting es una técnica de marketing que consiste en escribir texto para promocionar un producto o servicio. Los desarrolladores pueden aplicar estas t...","fr":"Le copywriting est une technique de marketing qui consiste à écrire du texte pour promouvoir un produit ou un service. Les développeurs peuvent appliquer ces...","de":"Copywriting ist eine Marketingtechnik, die darin besteht, Texte zu schreiben, um ein Produkt oder eine Dienstleistung zu bewerben. Entwickler können diese Te...","pt":"Copywriting é a arte de escrever conteúdo de marketing claro e atraente que impulsiona ações","ru":"Копирайтинг - это искусство написания ясного и привлекательного маркетингового контента, который стимулирует действия","ar":"كتابة المحتوى هي فن كتابة المحتوى التسويقي الواضح والمميز الذي يدفع الإجراءات","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"definition":{"en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"features":{"zh":["提高转化率和用户参与度","撰写有效的营销文案","了解目标受众和页面目的","优化页面结构和内容","提高搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["コンバージョン率とユーザー参加度の向上","効果的なマーケティングコピーの作成","ターゲットオーディエンスとページ目的の理解","ページ構造とコンテンツの最適化","検索エンジンランキングの向上"],"ko":["전환率와 사용자 참여도 향상","효과적인 마케팅 복사본 작성","목표 受众과 페이지 목적 이해","페이지 구조와 내용 최적화","검색 엔진 순위 향상"],"es":["Técnicas de escritura para convertir","Análisis de audiencia para contenido personalizado","Estructuras de página para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Optimización de contenido para motores de búsqueda","Creación de llamadas a la acción efectivas"],"fr":["Techniques d''écriture pour convertir","Analyse de l''audience pour un contenu personnalisé","Structures de page pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Optimisation de contenu pour les moteurs de recherche","Création d''appels à l''action efficaces"],"de":["Techniken für konvertierenden Text","Zielgruppenanalyse für personalisierten Inhalt","Seitenstrukturen für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung","Optimierung von Inhalten für Suchmaschinen","Erstellung effektiver Calls-to-Action"],"pt":["Escrever conteúdo claro e conciso","Definir o objetivo da página","Identificar o público-alvo","Criar chamadas para ação eficazes","Otimizar o conteúdo para motores de busca"],"ru":["Написание ясного и краткого контента","Определение цели страницы","Определение целевой аудитории","Создание эффективных призывов к действию","Оптимизация контента для поисковых систем"],"ar":["كتابة المحتوى الواضح والموجز","تحديد هدف الصفحة","تحديد الجمهور المستهدف","إنشاء دعوات للعمل الفعالة","تحسين المحتوى للمحركات البحثية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Copywriting","转化率优化","用户参与度提高","营销文案撰写","页面结构优化","搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["コピーライティング","コンバージョン率最適化","ユーザー参加度向上","マーケティングコピー作成","ページ構造最適化","検索エンジンランキング"],"ko":["복사 작성","전환율 최적화","사용자 참여도 향상","마케팅 복사본 작성","페이지 구조 최적화","검색 엔진 순위"],"es":["copywriting para desarrolladores","técnicas de copywriting","marketing para desarrolladores","contenido de marketing","optimización de contenido","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["copywriting pour les développeurs","techniques de copywriting","marketing pour les développeurs","contenu de marketing","optimisation de contenu","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Copywriting für Entwickler","Copywriting-Techniken","Marketing für Entwickler","Marketing-Inhalt","Optimierung von Inhalten","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["copywriting para desenvolvedores","técnicas de copywriting","conteúdo de marketing","experiência do usuário","conversões","otimização para motores de busca"],"ru":["копирайтинг для разработчиков","техники копирайтинга","маркетинговый контент","пользовательский опыт","конверсии","оптимизация для поисковых систем"],"ar":["كتابة المحتوى للمطورين","تقنيات كتابة المحتوى","المحتوى التسويقي","تجربة المستخدم","التحويلات","تحسين المحتوى للمحركات البحثية"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriting","description":"When the user wants to write, rewrite, or improve marketing copy for any page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, about pages, or product pages. Also use when the user says write copy for, improve this copy, rewrite this page, marketing copy, headline help, or CTA copy. For email copy, see email-sequence. For popup copy, see popup-cro.","bodyPreview":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solv","body":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solve?\n- What have they already tried?\n- What objections or hesitations do they have?\n- What language do they use to describe their problem?\n\n### 3. Product/Offer\n- What are you selling or offering?\n- What makes it different from alternatives?\n- What''s the key transformation or outcome?\n- Any proof points (numbers, testimonials, case studies)?\n\n### 4. Context\n- Where is traffic coming from? (ads, organic, email)\n- What do visitors already know before arriving?\n- What messaging are they seeing before this page?\n\n---\n\n## Copywriting Principles\n\n### Clarity Over Cleverness\n- If you have to choose between clear and creative, choose clear\n- Every sentence should have one job\n- Remove words that don''t add meaning\n\n### Benefits Over Features\n- Features: What it does\n- Benefits: What that means for the customer\n- Always connect features to outcomes\n\n### Specificity Over Vagueness\n- Vague: \"Save time on your workflow\"\n- Specific: \"Cut your weekly reporting from 4 hours to 15 minutes\"\n\n### Customer Language Over Company Language\n- Use words your customers use\n- Avoid jargon unless your audience uses it\n- Mirror voice-of-customer from reviews, interviews, support tickets\n\n### One Idea Per Section\n- Don''t try to say everything everywhere\n- Each section should advance one argument\n- Build a logical flow down the page\n\n---\n\n## Writing Style Rules\n\nFollow these core principles. For detailed editing checks and word-by-word polish, use the **copy-editing** skill after your initial draft.\n\n### Core Style Principles\n\n1. **Simple over complex** — Use everyday words. \"Use\" instead of \"utilize,\" \"help\" instead of \"facilitate.\"\n\n2. **Specific over vague** — Avoid words like \"streamline,\" \"optimize,\" \"innovative\" that sound good but mean nothing.\n\n3. **Active over passive** — \"We generate reports\" not \"Reports are generated.\"\n\n4. **Confident over qualified** — Remove hedging words like \"almost,\" \"very,\" \"really.\"\n\n5. **Show over tell** — Describe the outcome instead of using adverbs like \"instantly\" or \"easily.\"\n\n6. **Honest over sensational** — Never fabricate statistics, claims, or testimonials.\n\n### Quick Quality Check\n\nBefore finalizing, scan for:\n- Jargon that could confuse outsiders\n- Sentences trying to do too much (max 3 conjunctions)\n- Passive voice constructions\n- Exclamation points (remove them)\n- Marketing buzzwords without substance\n\nFor a thorough line-by-line review, run the copy through the **copy-editing** skill''s Seven Sweeps framework.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Be Direct\nGet to the point. Don''t bury the value in qualifications.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot? Send as many documents, images, and audio files as your heart desires.\n\n### Use Rhetorical Questions\nQuestions engage readers and make them think about their own situation.\n\n✅ Hate returning stuff to Amazon?\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot?\n\n✅ Tired of chasing approvals?\n\n### Use Analogies and Metaphors\nWhen appropriate, analogies make abstract concepts concrete and memorable.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Imagine Slack''s file-sharing as a digital whiteboard where everyone can post files, images, and updates in real time.\n\n### Pepper in Humor (When Appropriate)\nPuns, wit, and humor make copy memorable—but only if it fits the brand and doesn''t undermine clarity.\n\n---\n\n## Page Structure Framework\n\n### Above the Fold (First Screen)\n\n**Headline**\n- Your single most important message\n- Should communicate core value proposition\n- Specific > generic\n\n**Headline Formulas:**\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} without {pain point}**\n*Example: Understand how users are really experiencing your site without drowning in numbers*\n\n**The {opposite of usual process} way to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: The easiest way to turn your passion into income*\n\n**Never {unpleasant event} again**\n*Example: Never miss a sales opportunity again*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience}**\n*Example: Advanced analytics for Shopify e-commerce*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience} to {what it''s used for}**\n*Example: An online whiteboard for teams to ideate and brainstorm together*\n\n**You don''t have to {skills or resources} to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: With Ahrefs, you don''t have to be an SEO pro to rank higher and get more traffic*\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} by {how product makes it possible}**\n*Example: Generate more leads by seeing which companies visit your site*\n\n**{Key benefit of your product}**\n*Example: Sound clear in online meetings*\n\n**{Question highlighting the main pain point}**\n*Example: Hate returning stuff to Amazon?*\n\n**Turn {input} into {outcome}**\n*Example: Turn your hard-earned sales into repeat customers*\n\n**Additional formulas:**\n- \"[Achieve outcome] in [timeframe]\"\n- \"The [category] that [key differentiator]\"\n- \"Stop [pain]. Start [pleasure].\"\n- \"[Number] [people] use [product] to [outcome]\"\n\n**Subheadline**\n- Expands on the headline\n- Adds specificity or addresses secondary concern\n- 1-2 sentences max\n\n**Primary CTA**\n- Action-oriented button text\n- Communicate what they get, not what they do\n- \"Start Free Trial\" > \"Sign Up\"\n- \"Get Your Report\" > \"Submit\"\n\n**Supporting Visual**\n- Product screenshot, demo, or hero image\n- Should reinforce the message, not distract\n\n### Social Proof Section\n\nOptions (use 1-2):\n- Customer logos (recognizable > many)\n- Key metric (\"10,000+ teams\")\n- Short testimonial with attribution\n- Star rating with review count\n\n### Problem/Pain Section\n\n- Articulate the problem better than they can\n- Show you understand their situation\n- Create recognition (\"that''s exactly my problem\")\n\nStructure:\n- \"You know the feeling...\" or \"If you''re like most [role]...\"\n- Describe the specific frustrations\n- Hint at the cost of not solving it\n\n### Solution/Benefits Section\n\n- Bridge from problem to your solution\n- Focus on 3-5 key benefits (not 10)\n- Each benefit: headline + short explanation + proof point if available\n\nFormat options:\n- Benefit blocks with icons\n- Before/after comparison\n- Feature → Benefit → Proof structure\n\n### How It Works Section\n\n- Reduce perceived complexity\n- 3-4 step process\n- Each step: simple action + outcome\n\nExample:\n1. \"Connect your tools (2 minutes)\"\n2. \"Set your preferences\"\n3. \"Get automated reports every Monday\"\n\n### Social Proof (Detailed)\n\n- Full testimonials with:\n  - Specific results\n  - Customer name, role, company\n  - Photo if possible\n- Case study snippets\n- Logos section (if not above)\n\n### Objection Handling\n\nCommon objections to address:\n- \"Is this right for my situation?\"\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n- \"Is it hard to set up?\"\n- \"How is this different from X?\"\n\nFormats:\n- FAQ section\n- Comparison table\n- Guarantee/promise section\n- \"Built for [specific audience]\" section\n\n### Final CTA Section\n\n- Recap the value proposition\n- Repeat the primary CTA\n- Add urgency if genuine (deadline, limited availability)\n- Risk reversal (guarantee, free trial, no credit card)\n\n---\n\n## Landing Page Section Variety\n\nA great landing page isn''t just a list of features. Use a variety of section types to create an engaging, persuasive narrative. Mix and match from these:\n\n### Section Types to Include\n\n**How It Works (Numbered Steps)**\nWalk users through the process in 3-4 clear steps. Reduces perceived complexity and shows the path to value.\n\n**Alternative/Competitor Comparison**\nShow how you stack up against the status quo or competitors. Tables, side-by-side comparisons, or \"Unlike X, we...\" sections.\n\n**Founder Manifesto / Our Story**\nShare why you built this and what you believe. Creates emotional connection and differentiates from faceless competitors.\n\n**Testimonials**\nCustomer quotes with names, photos, and specific results. Multiple formats: quote cards, video testimonials, tweet embeds.\n\n**Case Studies**\nDeeper stories of customer success. Problem → Solution → Results format with specific metrics.\n\n**Use Cases**\nShow different ways the product is used. Helps visitors self-identify: \"This is for people like me.\"\n\n**Personas / \"Built For\" Sections**\nExplicitly call out who the product is for: \"Perfect for marketers,\" \"Built for agencies,\" etc.\n\n**Stats and Social Proof**\nKey metrics that build credibility: \"10,000+ customers,\" \"4.9/5 rating,\" \"$2M saved for customers.\"\n\n**Demo / Product Tour**\nInteractive demos, video walkthroughs, or GIF previews showing the product in action.\n\n**FAQ Section**\nAddress common objections and questions. Good for SEO and reducing support burden.\n\n**Integrations / Partners**\nShow what tools you connect with. Logos build credibility and answer \"Will this work with my stack?\"\n\n**Pricing Preview**\nEven on non-pricing pages, a pricing teaser can move decision-makers forward.\n\n**Guarantee / Risk Reversal**\nMoney-back guarantee, free trial terms, or \"cancel anytime\" messaging reduces friction.\n\n### Recommended Section Mix\n\nFor a landing page, aim for variety. Don''t just stack features:\n\n**Typical Feature-Heavy Page (Weak):**\n1. Hero\n2. Feature 1\n3. Feature 2\n4. Feature 3\n5. Feature 4\n6. CTA\n\n**Varied, Engaging Page (Strong):**\n1. Hero with clear value prop\n2. Social proof bar (logos or stats)\n3. Problem/pain section\n4. How it works (3 steps)\n5. Key benefits (2-3, not 10)\n6. Testimonial\n7. Use cases or personas\n8. Comparison to alternatives\n9. Case study snippet\n10. FAQ\n11. Final CTA with guarantee\n\n---\n\n## CTA Copy Guidelines\n\n**Weak CTAs (avoid):**\n- Submit\n- Sign Up\n- Learn More\n- Click Here\n- Get Started\n\n**Strong CTAs (use):**\n- Start Free Trial\n- Get [Specific Thing]\n- See [Product] in Action\n- Create Your First [Thing]\n- Book My Demo\n- Download the Guide\n- Try It Free\n\n**CTA formula:**\n[Action Verb] + [What They Get] + [Qualifier if needed]\n\nExamples:\n- \"Start My Free Trial\"\n- \"Get the Complete Checklist\"\n- \"See Pricing for My Team\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen writing copy, provide:\n\n### Page Copy\nOrganized by section with clear labels:\n- Headline\n- Subheadline\n- CTA\n- Section headers\n- Body copy\n- Secondary CTAs\n\n### Annotations\nFor key elements, explain:\n- Why you made this choice\n- What principle it applies\n- Alternatives considered\n\n### Alternatives\nFor headlines and CTAs, provide 2-3 options:\n- Option A: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option B: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option C: [copy] — [rationale]\n\n### Meta Content (if relevant)\n- Page title (for SEO)\n- Meta description\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Guidance\n\n### Homepage Copy\n- Serve multiple audiences without being generic\n- Lead with broadest value proposition\n- Provide clear paths for different visitor intents\n- Balance \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page Copy\n- Single message, single CTA\n- Match headline to ad/traffic source\n- Complete argument on one page\n- Remove distractions (often no nav)\n\n### Pricing Page Copy\n- Help visitors choose the right plan\n- Clarify what''s included at each level\n- Address \"which is right for me?\" anxiety\n- Make recommended plan obvious\n\n### Feature Page Copy\n- Connect feature to benefit to outcome\n- Show use cases and examples\n- Differentiate from competitors'' versions\n- Clear path to try or buy\n\n### About Page Copy\n- Tell the story of why you exist\n- Connect company mission to customer benefit\n- Build trust through transparency\n- Still include a CTA (it''s still a marketing page)\n\n---\n\n## Voice and Tone Considerations\n\nBefore writing, establish:\n\n**Formality level:**\n- Casual/conversational\n- Professional but friendly\n- Formal/enterprise\n\n**Brand personality:**\n- Playful or serious?\n- Bold or understated?\n- Technical or accessible?\n\nMaintain consistency throughout, but adjust intensity:\n- Headlines can be bolder\n- Body copy should be clearer\n- CTAs should be action-oriented\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copy-editing**: For polishing and improving existing copy (use after writing your first draft)\n- **page-cro**: If the page structure/strategy needs work, not just copy\n- **email-sequence**: For email copywriting\n- **popup-cro**: For popup and modal copy\n- **ab-test-setup**: To test copy variations properly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:30:42.117Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing persuasive marketing content creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要具有说服力营销内容创作能力的语言代理。","ja":"説得力のあるマーケティングコンテンツの作成能力を必要とする言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"説得力的 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de creación de contenido de marketing persuasivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de langage ayant besoin de capacités de création de contenu de marketing persuasif.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die überzeugende Marketing-Inhalte erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam de capacidades de criação de conteúdo de marketing persuasivo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимы возможности создания убедительного маркетингового контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إنشاء محتوى تسويقي مقنع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft clear, compelling, and actionable marketing copy using context-driven page purpose and audience analysis, including identifying primary and secondary actions, ideal customer profiles, and problem-solving statements.","zh":"赋予代理人使用基于上下文的页面目的和受众分析来制作清晰、有说服力和可行的营销副本的能力，包括识别主要和次要操作、理想客户资料和解决问题的声明。","ja":"コンテキスト駆動のページ目的とオーディエンス分析を使用して、クリアで説得力のあるマーケティングコピーを作成するエージェントをエンパワーメントします。主なアクションと二次的なアクション、理想的な顧客プロファイル、および問題解決ステートメントを識別することが含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 문맥 기반 페이지 목적 및 대상자 분석을 사용하여 명확하고 설득력 있으며 실행 가능한 마케팅 복사본을 제작할 수 있도록 합니다. 이에는 주요 및 보조 동작, 이상적인 고객 프로필 및 문제 해결 문을 식별하는 것이 포함됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear copias de marketing claras, convincentes y efectivas utilizando un análisis de propósito de página y audiencia basado en el contexto, incluyendo la identificación de acciones primarias y secundarias, perfiles de clientes ideales y declaraciones de resolución de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des copies de marketing claires, convaincantes et efficaces en utilisant une analyse de but de page et d''audience basée sur le contexte, y compris l''identification des actions primaires et secondaires, des profils de clients idéaux et des déclarations de résolution de problèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klare, überzeugende und handlungsauslösende Marketing-Kopien zu erstellen, indem sie eine kontextgesteuerte Analyse des Seitenzwecks und der Zielgruppe durchführen, einschließlich der Identifizierung primärer und sekundärer Aktionen, idealer Kundenprofile und Problemlösungsaussagen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar cópias de marketing claras, convincentes e eficazes usando a finalidade da página e a análise de público baseada no contexto, incluindo a identificação de ações primárias e secundárias, perfis de cliente ideais e declarações de resolução de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать четкий, убедительный и действенный маркетинговый текст с помощью контекстно-зависимого анализа цели страницы и аудитории, включая определение основного и второстепенного действий, идеальных профилей клиентов и формулировок решения проблем.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من صياغة نسخ تسويقية واضحة وملحة وفعّالة باستخدام غرض الصفحة وتحليل الجمهور القائم على السياق، بما في ذلك تحديد الإجراءات الأساسية والثانوية والملفات الشخصية المثالية للعملاء وبيانات حل المشكلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating landing page copy for targeted campaigns","Creating product descriptions that drive conversions","Writing email marketing sequences for lead nurturing"],"zh":["为目标活动生成着陆页复制","创建驱动转化的产品描述","为潜在客户培养编写电子邮件营销序列"],"ja":["ターゲットキャンペーンのランディングページコピーの生成","コンバージョンを駆る製品説明の作成","リードナーチャリングのためのメールマーケティングシーケンスの作成"],"ko":["타겟 캠페인에 대한 랜딩 페이지 복사본 생성","전환을 驅る 제품 설명 생성","리드 양육을 위한 이메일 마케팅 시퀀스 작성"],"es":["Generar copias de página de aterrizaje para campañas dirigidas","Crear descripciones de productos que impulsan las conversiones","Escribir secuencias de marketing por correo electrónico para la nutrición de leads"],"fr":["Générer des copies de page de destination pour des campagnes ciblées","Créer des descriptions de produits qui stimulent les conversions","Écrire des séquences de marketing par e-mail pour le nourrisson de leads"],"de":["Erstellen von Landingpage-Inhalten für gezielte Kampagnen","Erstellen von Produkbeschreibungen, die Konversionen vorantreiben","Schreiben von E-Mail-Marketing-Sequenzen für die Lead-Nutzung"],"pt":["Geração de cópia de página de destino para campanhas direcionadas","Criação de descrições de produtos que impulsionam conversões","Escrita de sequências de marketing por e-mail para nutrição de leads"],"ru":["Генерация копии целевой страницы для целевых кампаний","Создание описаний продуктов, которые стимулируют конверсии","Написание маркетинговых электронных последовательностей для выращивания лидов"],"ar":["إنشاء نسخة صفحة الوجهة للحملات المستهدفة","إنشاءوصف المنتجات التي تدفع التحويلات","كتابة تسلسلات البريد الإلكتروني للتسويق لتغذية Leads"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific context and audience data","Limited to text-based output"],"zh":["需要特定的上下文和受众数据","仅限文本输出"],"ja":["特定のコンテキストとオーディエンスデータが必要","テキスト出力のみ"],"ko":["특정 문맥 및 대상자 데이터가 필요","텍스트 출력만"],"es":["Requiere contexto y datos de audiencia específicos","Limitado a la salida basada en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte et des données d''audience spécifiques","Limité à la sortie basée sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt spezifischen Kontext und Zielgruppendaten","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Ausgabe"],"pt":["Exige contexto e dados de público específicos","Limitado a saída baseada em texto"],"ru":["Требует конкретного контекста и данных аудитории","Ограничен выводом на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب سياقًا وبيانات جمهورًا محددة","محدود بالخرج القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
