eMemo pour mémoriser les calculs","Optimisation de composants pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Memoisierungstechniken zur Vermeidung teurer Berechnungen","Liste-Optimierungen zur Leistungsverbesserung","Vermeidung unnötiger Neurenderings","Verwendung von useMemo zur Memoisierung von Berechnungen","Optimierung von Komponenten zur Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["Evite re-renderizações desnecessárias","Otimização de listas","Memoização de cálculos caros","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Redução do tempo de carregamento","Aumento da eficiência do aplicativo"],"ru":["Избегайте ненужных повторных рендерингов","Оптимизация списков","Мемоизация дорогих вычислений","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Сокращение времени загрузки","Повышение эффективности приложения"],"ar":["تجنب إعادة العرض غير الضرورية","تحسين القوائم","التخزين المؤقت للحسابات المكلفة","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تقليل وقت التحميل","زيادة كفاءة التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React性能优化","React渲染行为","memoization","计算优化","列表渲染优化","React应用性能"],"ja":["Reactパフォーマンス最適化","Reactレンダリング動作","メモ化","計算最適化","リストレンダリング最適化","Reactアプリケーションパフォーマンス"],"ko":["리액트 성능 최적화","리액트 렌더링 동작","메모화","계산 최적화","목록 렌더링 최적화","리액트 애플리케이션 성능"],"es":["react performance","optimización de react","memoización","optimización de listas","evitación de re-renders","useMemo","react optimization"],"fr":["react performances","optimisation de react","mémorisation","optimisation de listes","évitement des re-rendus","useMemo","react optimisation"],"de":["reaktionsleistung","optimierung von react","memoisierung","liste-optimierung","vermeidung von neurenderings","useMemo","react optimierung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho do react","react performance","melhoria de desempenho","aplicações rápidas","eficiência do aplicativo","experiência do usuário","re-renderização","memoização","otimização de listas"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности react","react performance","улучшение производительности","быстрые приложения","эффективность приложения","пользовательский опыт","повторная рендеризация","мемоизация","оптимизация списков"],"ar":["تحسين أداء رياكت","react performance","تحسين الأداء","تطبيقات سريعة","كفاءة التطبيق","تجربة المستخدم","إعادة العرض","التخزين المؤقت","تحسين القوائم"]}},"owner":"CJHarmath","repo":"claude-agents-skills","repoPath":"CJHarmath/claude-agents-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-performance","description":"Performance optimization for React web applications. Use when optimizing renders, implementing virtualization, memoizing components, or debugging performance issues.","bodyPreview":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a,","body":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)\n    .slice(0, 100);\n}, [items]);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Recalculates every render\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = items\n  .filter(item => item.active)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Memoizing simple access (overhead > benefit)\nconst userName = useMemo(() => user.name, [user.name]);\n```\n\n**When to use useMemo:**\n- Array transformations (filter, sort, map chains)\n- Object creation passed to memoized children\n- Computations with O(n) or higher complexity\n\n### useCallback - Stable Function References\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable callback for child props\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  setSelectedId(id);\n}, []);\n\n// Pass to memoized child\n<MemoizedItem onClick={handleClick} />\n\n// ❌ WRONG: useCallback with unstable deps\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  doSomething(unstableObject); // unstableObject changes every render\n}, [unstableObject]); // Defeats the purpose\n```\n\n**When to use useCallback:**\n- Callbacks passed to memoized children\n- Callbacks in dependency arrays\n- Event handlers that would cause child re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: React.memo\n\n```typescript\n// Wrap components that receive stable props\nconst ItemCard = memo(function ItemCard({\n  item,\n  onSelect\n}: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div onClick={() => onSelect(item.id)}>\n      <h3>{item.name}</h3>\n      <p>{item.price}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\n// Custom comparison for complex props\nconst ItemCard = memo(\n  function ItemCard({ item, onSelect }: Props) {\n    // ...\n  },\n  (prevProps, nextProps) => {\n    // Return true if props are equal (skip re-render)\n    return (\n      prevProps.item.id === nextProps.item.id &&\n      prevProps.item.price === nextProps.item.price\n    );\n  }\n);\n```\n\n**When to use React.memo:**\n- List item components\n- Components receiving stable primitive props\n- Components that render frequently but rarely change\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Components that always receive new props\n- Simple components (overhead > benefit)\n- Root-level pages\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: List Virtualization\n\nFor long lists, render only visible items using react-window or react-virtualized.\n\n```typescript\nimport { FixedSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VirtualizedList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const Row = ({ index, style }: { index: number; style: React.CSSProperties }) => (\n    <div style={style}>\n      <ItemCard item={items[index]} />\n    </div>\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <FixedSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={80}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </FixedSizeList>\n  );\n}\n\n// Variable height items\nimport { VariableSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VariableList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const getItemSize = (index: number) => {\n    return items[index].expanded ? 200 : 80;\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <VariableSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={getItemSize}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </VariableSizeList>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**When to virtualize:**\n- Lists with 100+ items\n- Complex item components\n- Scrollable containers with many children\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Zustand Selector Optimization\n\n**Problem:** Selecting entire store causes re-render on any state change.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useAppStore();\n// or\nconst { items, loading, filters, ... } = useAppStore();\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Only re-renders when selected values change\nconst items = useAppStore((s) => s.items);\nconst loading = useAppStore((s) => s.loading);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Multiple values with shallow comparison\nimport { useShallow } from ''zustand/react/shallow'';\n\nconst { items, loading } = useAppStore(\n  useShallow((s) => ({\n    items: s.items,\n    loading: s.loading\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Avoiding Re-Renders\n\n### Object/Array Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: New object every render\n<ChildComponent style={{ padding: 10 }} />\n<ChildComponent config={{ enabled: true }} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable reference\nconst style = useMemo(() => ({ padding: 10 }), []);\nconst config = useMemo(() => ({ enabled: true }), []);\n\n<ChildComponent style={style} />\n<ChildComponent config={config} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Or define outside component\nconst style = { padding: 10 };\n\nfunction Parent() {\n  return <ChildComponent style={style} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Children Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Inline function creates new element each render\n<Parent>\n  {() => <Child />}\n</Parent>\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable element\nconst child = useMemo(() => <Child />, [deps]);\n<Parent>{child}</Parent>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Code Splitting\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react'';\n\n// Lazy load components\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Dashboard''));\nconst Settings = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Settings''));\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>\n      <Routes>\n        <Route path=\"/dashboard\" element={<Dashboard />} />\n        <Route path=\"/settings\" element={<Settings />} />\n      </Routes>\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}\n\n// Named exports\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() =>\n  import(''./pages/Dashboard'').then(module => ({\n    default: module.Dashboard\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Debouncing and Throttling\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMemo } from ''react'';\nimport { debounce, throttle } from ''lodash-es'';\n\n// Debounce - wait until user stops typing\nfunction SearchInput({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (query: string) => void }) {\n  const debouncedSearch = useMemo(\n    () => debounce(onSearch, 300),\n    [onSearch]\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <input\n      type=\"text\"\n      onChange={(e) => debouncedSearch(e.target.value)}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Throttle - limit how often function runs\nfunction InfiniteScroll({ onLoadMore }: { onLoadMore: () => void }) {\n  const throttledLoad = useMemo(\n    () => throttle(onLoadMore, 1000),\n    [onLoadMore]\n  );\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleScroll = () => {\n      if (nearBottom()) {\n        throttledLoad();\n      }\n    };\n\n    window.addEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n  }, [throttledLoad]);\n\n  return <div>...</div>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Image Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// Lazy load images\n<img\n  src={imageUrl}\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n  alt=\"Description\"\n/>\n\n// With intersection observer for more control\nfunction LazyImage({ src, alt }: { src: string; alt: string }) {\n  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n  const imgRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      ([entry]) => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          setIsVisible(true);\n          observer.disconnect();\n        }\n      },\n      { rootMargin: ''100px'' }\n    );\n\n    if (imgRef.current) {\n      observer.observe(imgRef.current);\n    }\n\n    return () => observer.disconnect();\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={imgRef}>\n      {isVisible ? (\n        <img src={src} alt={alt} />\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"placeholder\" />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Next.js Image component (if using Next.js)\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n\n<Image\n  src={imageUrl}\n  alt=\"Description\"\n  width={400}\n  height={300}\n  placeholder=\"blur\"\n  blurDataURL={blurHash}\n/>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Web Workers for Heavy Computation\n\n```typescript\n// worker.ts\nself.onmessage = (e: MessageEvent<{ data: number[] }>) => {\n  const result = heavyComputation(e.data.data);\n  self.postMessage(result);\n};\n\n// Component\nfunction DataProcessor({ data }: { data: number[] }) {\n  const [result, setResult] = useState(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const worker = new Worker(new URL(''./worker.ts'', import.meta.url));\n\n    worker.onmessage = (e) => {\n      setResult(e.data);\n    };\n\n    worker.postMessage({ data });\n\n    return () => worker.terminate();\n  }, [data]);\n\n  return result ? <Results data={result} /> : <Loading />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Detecting Re-Renders\n\n### React DevTools Profiler\n\n1. Open React DevTools\n2. Go to Profiler tab\n3. Click record, interact, stop\n4. Review \"Flamegraph\" for render times\n5. Look for components rendering unnecessarily\n\n### why-did-you-render\n\n```typescript\n// Setup in development\nimport React from ''react'';\n\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n  const whyDidYouRender = require(''@welldone-software/why-did-you-render'');\n  whyDidYouRender(React, {\n    trackAllPureComponents: true,\n  });\n}\n\n// Mark specific component for tracking\nItemCard.whyDidYouRender = true;\n```\n\n### Console Logging\n\n```typescript\n// Quick check for re-renders\nfunction ItemCard({ item }: Props) {\n  console.log(''ItemCard render:'', item.id);\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\nBefore shipping:\n\n- [ ] Large lists are virtualized\n- [ ] List items are memoized with `React.memo`\n- [ ] Callbacks passed to items use `useCallback`\n- [ ] Zustand selectors are specific (not whole store)\n- [ ] Images use lazy loading\n- [ ] Heavy routes are code-split\n- [ ] No inline object/function props to memoized children\n- [ ] Profiler shows no unnecessary re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| List scroll lag | Virtualize list, memoize items |\n| Component re-renders too often | Check selector specificity, memoize props |\n| Slow initial render | Code split, reduce bundle size |\n| Memory growing | Check for event listener cleanup, state accumulation |\n| UI freezes on interaction | Move computation to web worker or defer |\n\n---\n\n## Relationship to Other Skills\n\n- **react-zustand-patterns**: Selector optimization patterns\n- **react-async-patterns**: Proper async handling prevents re-render loops\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:31:27.416Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in React applications needing optimization techniques for improved rendering performance.","zh":"适合专门从事React应用程序并需要优化技术以提高渲染性能的前端代理。","ja":"Reactアプリケーションの最適化テクニックが必要なReactアプリケーションを専門とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"렌더링 성능을 개선하기 위한 최적화 기술이 필요한 리액트 애플리케이션을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend especializados en aplicaciones de React que necesitan técnicas de optimización para mejorar el rendimiento de renderizado.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend spécialisés dans les applications React nécessitant des techniques d''optimisation pour améliorer les performances de rendu.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die auf React-Anwendungen spezialisiert sind und Optimierungstechniken für eine verbesserte Renderleistung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em aplicações React que necessitam de técnicas de otimização para melhorar o desempenho de renderização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на приложениях React, требующих методов оптимизации для улучшения производительности рендеринга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتخصص في تطبيقات React التي تحتاج إلى تقنيات تحسين الأداء لتحسين أداء العرض."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React applications by minimizing unnecessary re-renders, leveraging memoization with useMemo, and handling expensive computations on the main thread, ensuring seamless user experiences through optimized lists and efficient rendering behaviors.","zh":"通过最小化不必要的重新渲染，利用useMemo的记忆化技术，并在主线程上处理昂贵的计算来优化React应用程序，从而确保通过优化列表和高效的渲染行为实现无缝的用户体验。","ja":"不必要な再描画を最小限に抑え、useMemoのメモ化技術を利用し、メインスレッドで高価な計算を処理することで、Reactアプリケーションの最適化を行い、最適化されたリストと効率的な描画動作を通じてシームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現します。","ko":"불필요한 다시 그리기를 최소화하고, useMemo의 메모화 기술을 활용하고, 메인 스레드에서 비용이 많이 드는 계산을 처리함으로써 리액트 애플리케이션을 최적화하여, 최적화된 목록과 효율적인 렌더링 동작을 통해無斷な 사용자 경험을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React minimizando las re-rendersizaciones innecesarias, aprovechando la memoización con useMemo y manejando cálculos costosos en el hilo principal, garantizando experiencias de usuario sin problemas a través de listas optimizadas y comportamientos de renderizado eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React en minimisant les re-rendus inutiles, en exploitant la mémorisation avec useMemo et en gérant les calculs coûteux sur le thread principal, garantissant des expériences utilisateur sans problème grâce à des listes optimisées et à des comportements de rendu efficaces.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React-Anwendungen zu optimieren, indem sie unnötige Neurenderungen minimieren, Memoisierung mit useMemo nutzen und teure Berechnungen im Hauptthread verarbeiten, um so nahtlose Benutzererfahrungen durch optimierte Listen und effizientes Renderverhalten zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicações React minimizando re-renderizações desnecessárias, utilizando a memoização com useMemo e tratando cálculos caros na thread principal, garantindo experiências de usuário sem interrupções por meio de listas otimizadas e comportamentos de renderização eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React, минимизируя ненужные повторные рендеринги, используя мемоизацию с useMemo и обрабатывая дорогие вычисления в основной потоке, обеспечивая бесперебойные пользовательские trải nghiệm за счет оптимизированных списков и эффективных поведений рендеринга.","ar":"تمكين العميل من تحسين تطبيقات React عن طريق تقليص إعادة العرض غير الضرورية، وتسريع Memoization باستخدام useMemo ومعالجة الحسابات المكلفة على الخيط الرئيسي، مما يضمن تجارب مستخدم بدون انقطاع من خلال قوائم محسنة وسلوكيات عرض فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React component re-renders for better performance","Implementing memoization techniques for expensive computations","Debugging and resolving issues related to unoptimized lists in React applications"],"zh":["优化React组件的重新渲染以提高性能","实现昂贵计算的记忆化技术","调试和解决React应用程序中未优化列表相关的问题"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントの再描画を最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる","高価な計算のメモ化技術を実装する","Reactアプリケーションにおける最適化されていないリストに関連する問題をデバッグして解決する"],"ko":["리액트 컴포넌트의 다시 그리기를 최적화하여 성능을 개선하는 것","비용이 많이 드는 계산을 위한 메모화 기술을 구현하는 것","리액트 애플리케이션에서 최적화되지 않은 목록 관련 문제를 디버깅하고 해결하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar las re-rendersizaciones de componentes de React para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar técnicas de memoización para cálculos costosos","Depurar y resolver problemas relacionados con listas no optimizadas en aplicaciones de React"],"fr":["Optimiser les re-rendus de composants React pour de meilleures performances","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de mémorisation pour les calculs coûteux","Déboguer et résoudre les problèmes liés aux listes non optimisées dans les applications React"],"de":["Optimieren der Neurenderungen von React-Komponenten für bessere Leistung","Implementierung von Memoisierungstechniken für teure Berechnungen","Fehlerbehebung und Lösung von Problemen im Zusammenhang mit nicht optimierten Listen in React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Otimizando re-renderizações de componentes React para melhor desempenho","Implementando técnicas de memoização para cálculos caros","Depurando e resolvendo problemas relacionados a listas não otimizadas em aplicações React"],"ru":["Оптимизация повторных рендерингов компонентов React для лучшей производительности","Реализация методов мемоизации для дорогих вычислений","Отладка и решение проблем, связанных с неоптимизированными списками в приложениях React"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة عرض مكونات React لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ تقنيات التخزين المؤقت للمحاسبات المكلفة","تصحيح الأخطاء وحل المشكلات المتعلقة بالقوائم غير المُحسنة في تطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of React''s rendering behavior","Limited to React-based applications","May require additional optimization techniques for complex applications"],"zh":["需要了解React的渲染行为","仅限于基于React的应用程序","可能需要复杂应用程序的额外优化技术"],"ja":["Reactの描画動作を理解する必要がある","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定される","複雑なアプリケーションの場合、追加の最適化テクニックが必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["리액트의 렌더링 동작을 이해해야 함","리액트 기반 애플리케이션에만 국한됨","복잡한 애플리케이션의 경우 추가적