とで実現され、不要な再描画、最適化されていないリスト、コストのかかる計算が含まれる","ko":"React 성능 최적화는 React의 렌더링 동작을 이해함으로써 달성되며, 불필요한 재 렌더링, 최적화되지 않은 목록 및 비용이 많이 드는 계산을 포함합니다.","es":"Mejora el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones React con técnicas de optimización","fr":"Améliorez les performances de vos applications React avec des techniques d''optimisation","de":"Verbessern Sie die Leistung Ihrer React-Anwendungen mit Optimierungstechniken","pt":"Otimizar o desempenho do React é crucial para construir aplicações web rápidas e eficientes. Aprenda técnicas para melhorar o desempenho do React.","ru":"Оптимизация производительности React имеет решающее значение для создания быстрых и эффективных веб-приложений. Узнайте техники для улучшения производительно...","ar":"تحسين أداء ري액ت أمر بالغ الأهمية لبناء تطبيقات ويب سريعة وفعالة. تعلم تقنيات لتحسين أداء ري액ت.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["优化渲染行为","避免不必要的重新渲染","优化列表和表格","减少昂贵的计算"],"ja":["描画動作の最適化","不要な再描画の回避","リストとテーブルの最適化","コストのかかる計算の削減"],"ko":["렌더링 동작 최적화","불필요한 재 렌더링 방지","목록 및 표 최적화","비용이 많이 드는 계산 최적화"],"es":["Técnicas de memoización para cálculos costosos","Optimización de listas para mejorar el rendimiento","Uso de useMemo para evitar re-renders innecesarios","Identificación de cuellos de botella de rendimiento","Mejora de la velocidad de renderizado de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Techniques de mémorisation pour les calculs coûteux","Optimisation des listes pour améliorer les performances","Utilisation de useMemo pour éviter les re-renders inutiles","Identification des goulots d''étranglement des performances","Amélioration de la vitesse de rendu des applications"],"de":["Memoisierungstechniken für teure Berechnungen","Optimierung von Listen für bessere Leistung","Verwendung von useMemo, um unnötige Neuerstellungen zu vermeiden","Identifizierung von Leistungsengpässen","Verbesserung der Rendergeschwindigkeit von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Técnicas de memoização para evitar cálculos caros","Otimização de listas para melhorar o desempenho","Entendimento do comportamento de renderização do React","Uso de useMemo para memoizar cálculos caros","Otimização de componentes para melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Техники мемоизации для避免 дорогих вычислений","Оптимизация списков для улучшения производительности","Понимание поведения рендеринга React","Использование useMemo для мемоизации дорогих вычислений","Оптимизация компонентов для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["تقنيات التخزين المؤقت لتجنب الحسابات المكلفة","تحسين القوائم لتحسين الأداء","فهم سلوك عرض ري액ت","استخدام useMemo لتخزين حسابات مكلفة","تحسين المكونات لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 性能优化","渲染行为","重新渲染","列表优化","计算优化","React 优化"],"ja":["React パフォーマンス最適化","描画動作","再描画","リスト最適化","計算最適化","React 最適化"],"ko":["React 성능 최적화","렌더링 동작","재 렌더링","목록 최적화","계산 최적화","React 최적화"],"es":["rendimiento de React","optimización de React","memoización en React","mejora de rendimiento de aplicaciones","técnicas de optimización de React","React performance optimization"],"fr":["performances de React","optimisation de React","mémorisation dans React","amélioration des performances des applications","techniques d''optimisation de React","React performance optimisation"],"de":["React-Leistung","React-Optimierung","Memoisierung in React","Leistungsverbesserung von Anwendungen","Optimierungstechniken für React","React-Performance-Optimierung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho do react","memoização","otimização de listas","comportamento de renderização do react","usememo","otimização de componentes","desempenho do react","aplicações web rápidas","eficiência do react"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности react","мемоизация","оптимизация списков","поведение рендеринга react","usememo","оптимизация компонентов","производительность react","быстрые веб-приложения","эффективность react"],"ar":["تحسين أداء ري액ت","التخزين المؤقت","تحسين القوائم","سلوك عرض ري액ت","استخدام useMemo","تحسين المكونات","أداء ري액ت","تطبيقات ويب سريعة","كفاءة ري액ت"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-performance","description":"Performance optimization for React web applications. Use when optimizing renders, implementing virtualization, memoizing components, or debugging performance issues.","bodyPreview":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a,","body":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)\n    .slice(0, 100);\n}, [items]);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Recalculates every render\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = items\n  .filter(item => item.active)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Memoizing simple access (overhead > benefit)\nconst userName = useMemo(() => user.name, [user.name]);\n```\n\n**When to use useMemo:**\n- Array transformations (filter, sort, map chains)\n- Object creation passed to memoized children\n- Computations with O(n) or higher complexity\n\n### useCallback - Stable Function References\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable callback for child props\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  setSelectedId(id);\n}, []);\n\n// Pass to memoized child\n<MemoizedItem onClick={handleClick} />\n\n// ❌ WRONG: useCallback with unstable deps\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  doSomething(unstableObject); // unstableObject changes every render\n}, [unstableObject]); // Defeats the purpose\n```\n\n**When to use useCallback:**\n- Callbacks passed to memoized children\n- Callbacks in dependency arrays\n- Event handlers that would cause child re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: React.memo\n\n```typescript\n// Wrap components that receive stable props\nconst ItemCard = memo(function ItemCard({\n  item,\n  onSelect\n}: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div onClick={() => onSelect(item.id)}>\n      <h3>{item.name}</h3>\n      <p>{item.price}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\n// Custom comparison for complex props\nconst ItemCard = memo(\n  function ItemCard({ item, onSelect }: Props) {\n    // ...\n  },\n  (prevProps, nextProps) => {\n    // Return true if props are equal (skip re-render)\n    return (\n      prevProps.item.id === nextProps.item.id &&\n      prevProps.item.price === nextProps.item.price\n    );\n  }\n);\n```\n\n**When to use React.memo:**\n- List item components\n- Components receiving stable primitive props\n- Components that render frequently but rarely change\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Components that always receive new props\n- Simple components (overhead > benefit)\n- Root-level pages\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: List Virtualization\n\nFor long lists, render only visible items using react-window or react-virtualized.\n\n```typescript\nimport { FixedSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VirtualizedList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const Row = ({ index, style }: { index: number; style: React.CSSProperties }) => (\n    <div style={style}>\n      <ItemCard item={items[index]} />\n    </div>\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <FixedSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={80}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </FixedSizeList>\n  );\n}\n\n// Variable height items\nimport { VariableSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VariableList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const getItemSize = (index: number) => {\n    return items[index].expanded ? 200 : 80;\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <VariableSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={getItemSize}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </VariableSizeList>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**When to virtualize:**\n- Lists with 100+ items\n- Complex item components\n- Scrollable containers with many children\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Zustand Selector Optimization\n\n**Problem:** Selecting entire store causes re-render on any state change.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useAppStore();\n// or\nconst { items, loading, filters, ... } = useAppStore();\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Only re-renders when selected values change\nconst items = useAppStore((s) => s.items);\nconst loading = useAppStore((s) => s.loading);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Multiple values with shallow comparison\nimport { useShallow } from ''zustand/react/shallow'';\n\nconst { items, loading } = useAppStore(\n  useShallow((s) => ({\n    items: s.items,\n    loading: s.loading\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Avoiding Re-Renders\n\n### Object/Array Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: New object every render\n<ChildComponent style={{ padding: 10 }} />\n<ChildComponent config={{ enabled: true }} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable reference\nconst style = useMemo(() => ({ padding: 10 }), []);\nconst config = useMemo(() => ({ enabled: true }), []);\n\n<ChildComponent style={style} />\n<ChildComponent config={config} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Or define outside component\nconst style = { padding: 10 };\n\nfunction Parent() {\n  return <ChildComponent style={style} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Children Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Inline function creates new element each render\n<Parent>\n  {() => <Child />}\n</Parent>\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable element\nconst child = useMemo(() => <Child />, [deps]);\n<Parent>{child}</Parent>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Code Splitting\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react'';\n\n// Lazy load components\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Dashboard''));\nconst Settings = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Settings''));\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>\n      <Routes>\n        <Route path=\"/dashboard\" element={<Dashboard />} />\n        <Route path=\"/settings\" element={<Settings />} />\n      </Routes>\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}\n\n// Named exports\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() =>\n  import(''./pages/Dashboard'').then(module => ({\n    default: module.Dashboard\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Debouncing and Throttling\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMemo } from ''react'';\nimport { debounce, throttle } from ''lodash-es'';\n\n// Debounce - wait until user stops typing\nfunction SearchInput({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (query: string) => void }) {\n  const debouncedSearch = useMemo(\n    () => debounce(onSearch, 300),\n    [onSearch]\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <input\n      type=\"text\"\n      onChange={(e) => debouncedSearch(e.target.value)}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Throttle - limit how often function runs\nfunction InfiniteScroll({ onLoadMore }: { onLoadMore: () => void }) {\n  const throttledLoad = useMemo(\n    () => throttle(onLoadMore, 1000),\n    [onLoadMore]\n  );\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleScroll = () => {\n      if (nearBottom()) {\n        throttledLoad();\n      }\n    };\n\n    window.addEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n  }, [throttledLoad]);\n\n  return <div>...</div>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Image Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// Lazy load images\n<img\n  src={imageUrl}\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n  alt=\"Description\"\n/>\n\n// With intersection observer for more control\nfunction LazyImage({ src, alt }: { src: string; alt: string }) {\n  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n  const imgRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      ([entry]) => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          setIsVisible(true);\n          observer.disconnect();\n        }\n      },\n      { rootMargin: ''100px'' }\n    );\n\n    if (imgRef.current) {\n      observer.observe(imgRef.current);\n    }\n\n    return () => observer.disconnect();\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={imgRef}>\n      {isVisible ? (\n        <img src={src} alt={alt} />\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"placeholder\" />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Next.js Image component (if using Next.js)\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n\n<Image\n  src={imageUrl}\n  alt=\"Description\"\n  width={400}\n  height={300}\n  placeholder=\"blur\"\n  blurDataURL={blurHash}\n/>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Web Workers for Heavy Computation\n\n```typescript\n// worker.ts\nself.onmessage = (e: MessageEvent<{ data: number[] }>) => {\n  const result = heavyComputation(e.data.data);\n  self.postMessage(result);\n};\n\n// Component\nfunction DataProcessor({ data }: { data: number[] }) {\n  const [result, setResult] = useState(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const worker = new Worker(new URL(''./worker.ts'', import.meta.url));\n\n    worker.onmessage = (e) => {\n      setResult(e.data);\n    };\n\n    worker.postMessage({ data });\n\n    return () => worker.terminate();\n  }, [data]);\n\n  return result ? <Results data={result} /> : <Loading />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Detecting Re-Renders\n\n### React DevTools Profiler\n\n1. Open React DevTools\n2. Go to Profiler tab\n3. Click record, interact, stop\n4. Review \"Flamegraph\" for render times\n5. Look for components rendering unnecessarily\n\n### why-did-you-render\n\n```typescript\n// Setup in development\nimport React from ''react'';\n\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n  const whyDidYouRender = require(''@welldone-software/why-did-you-render'');\n  whyDidYouRender(React, {\n    trackAllPureComponents: true,\n  });\n}\n\n// Mark specific component for tracking\nItemCard.whyDidYouRender = true;\n```\n\n### Console Logging\n\n```typescript\n// Quick check for re-renders\nfunction ItemCard({ item }: Props) {\n  console.log(''ItemCard render:'', item.id);\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\nBefore shipping:\n\n- [ ] Large lists are virtualized\n- [ ] List items are memoized with `React.memo`\n- [ ] Callbacks passed to items use `useCallback`\n- [ ] Zustand selectors are specific (not whole store)\n- [ ] Images use lazy loading\n- [ ] Heavy routes are code-split\n- [ ] No inline object/function props to memoized children\n- [ ] Profiler shows no unnecessary re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| List scroll lag | Virtualize list, memoize items |\n| Component re-renders too often | Check selector specificity, memoize props |\n| Slow initial render | Code split, reduce bundle size |\n| Memory growing | Check for event listener cleanup, state accumulation |\n| UI freezes on interaction | Move computation to web worker or defer |\n\n---\n\n## Relationship to Other Skills\n\n- **react-zustand-patterns**: Selector optimization patterns\n- **react-async-patterns**: Proper async handling prevents re-render loops\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:31:19.974Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React optimization techniques to improve application performance.","zh":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React optimization techniques to improve application performance.","ja":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React optimization techniques to improve application performance.","ko":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React optimization techniques to improve application performance.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan técnicas avanzadas de optimización de React para mejorar el rendimiento de la aplicación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de techniques d''optimisation avancées de React pour améliorer les performances de l''application.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte React-Optimierungstechniken benötigen, um die Anwendungsleistung zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que necessitam de técnicas avançadas de otimização do React para melhorar o desempenho da aplicação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Фронтенд-Агентов, которым требуются продвинутые методы оптимизации React для повышения производительности приложений.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين React لتعزيز أداء التطبيق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React applications by minimizing unnecessary re-renders, leveraging memoization with useMemo, and optimizing lists and computations on the main thread using React''s rendering behavior and TypeScript.","zh":"Empowers agents to optimize React applications by minimizing unnecessary re-renders, leveraging memoization with useMemo, and optimizing lists and computations on the main thread using React''s rendering behavior and TypeScript.","ja":"Empowers agents to optimize React applications by minimizing unnecessary re-renders, leveraging memoization with useMemo, and optimizing lists and computations on the main thread using React''s rendering behavior and TypeScript.","ko":"Empowers agents to optimize React applications by minimizing unnecessary re-renders, leveraging memoization with useMemo, and optimizing lists and computations on the main thread using React''s rendering behavior and TypeScript.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React minimizando las re-renderezas innecesarias, aprovechando la memorización con useMemo y optimizando listas y cálculos en el hilo principal mediante el comportamiento de renderizado de React y TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React en minimisant les ré-rendus inutiles, en exploitant la mémorisation avec useMemo et en optimisant les listes et les calculs sur le thread principal à l''aide du comportement de rendu de React et de TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, React-Anwendungen zu optimieren, indem sie unnötige Neurender minimieren, Memoisierung mit useMemo nutzen und Listen und Berechnungen im Hauptthread mithilfe des Renderverhaltens von React und TypeScript optimieren.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a otimizar aplicações React, minimizando re-renderizações desnecessárias, aproveitando a memoização com useMemo e otimizando listas e computações na thread principal usando o comportamento de renderização do React e TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать приложения React за счет минимизации ненужных повторных рендеров, использования мемоизации с useMemo и оптимизации списков и вычислений в основном потоке с использованием поведения рендеринга React и TypeScript.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تحسين تطبيقات React عن طريق تقليل إعادة التصيير غير الضرورية، والاستفادة من الذاكرة (memoization) مع useMemo، وتحسين القوائم والحسابات في الخيط الرئيسي باستخدام سلوك تصيير React و TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React component re-renders","Implementing memoization for expensive computations","Debugging performance issues in React applications"],"zh":["Optimizing React component re-renders","Implementing memoization for expensive computations","Debugging performance issues in React applications"],"ja":["Optimizing React component re-renders","Implementing memoization for expensive computations","Debugging performance issues in React applications"],"ko":["Optimizing React component re-renders","Implementing memoization for expensive computations","Debugging performance issues in React applications"],"es":["Optimizar las re-renderezas de los componentes de React","Implementar la memorización para cálculos costosos","Depurar problemas de rendimiento en aplicaciones de React"],"fr":["Optimiser les ré-rendus des composants React","Mettre en œuvre la mémorisation pour les calculs coûteux","Déboguer les problèmes de performances dans les applications React"],"de":["Optimieren des Neurenderns von React-Komponenten","Implementierung der Memoisierung für teure Berechnungen","Debuggen von Leistungsproblemen in React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Otimização de re-renderizações de componentes React","Implementação de memoização para computações complexas","Depuração de problemas de desempenho em aplicações React"],"ru":["Оптимизация повторных рендеров компонентов React","Реализация мемоизации для ресурсоемких вычислений","Отладка проблем производительности в приложениях React"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة تصيير مكونات React","تنفيذ الذاكرة (memoization) للحسابات المكلفة","تصحيح مشكلات الأداء في تطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of React''s rendering behavior","Limited to React applications","Needs TypeScript for optimal usage"],"zh":["Requires understanding of React''s rendering behavior","Limited to React applications","Needs TypeScript for optimal usage"],"ja":["Requires understanding of React''s rendering behavior","Limited to React applications","Needs TypeScript for optimal usage"],"ko":["Requires understanding of React''s rendering behavior","Limited to React applications","Needs TypeScript for optimal usage"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del comportamiento de renderizado de React","Limitado a aplicaciones de React","Necesita TypeScript para un uso óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du comportement de rendu de React","Limité aux applications React","Nécessite TypeScript pour une utilisation optimale"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für das Renderverhalten von React","Begrenzt auf React-Anwendungen","Benötigt TypeScript für optimale Nutzung"],"pt":["Requer compreensão do comportamento de renderização do React","Limitado a aplicações React","Requer TypeScript para uso ideal"],"ru":["Требует понимания поведения рендеринга React","Ограничено приложениями React","Требует TypeScript для оптимального использования"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لسلوك تصيير React","يقتصر على تطبيقات React","يتطلب TypeScript للاستخدام الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
