ndungsfällen und Vorteilen","Identifizierung von Risiken und Herausforderungen"],"pt":["Frameworks de avaliação de tecnologias","Análise de maturidade da tecnologia","Consideração de opções de compra e construção","Tomada de decisões informadas","Avaliação de tecnologias emergentes","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de tecnologia"],"ru":["Фреймворки оценки технологий","Анализ зрелости технологии","Учет вариантов покупки и строительства","Принятие обоснованных решений","Оценка новых технологий","Разработка стратегий технологий"],"ar":["إطارات تقييم التكنولوجيا","تحليل نضج التكنولوجيا","النظر في خيارات الشراء والبناء","اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة","تقييم التكنولوجيا الناشئة","تطوير استراتيجيات التكنولوجيا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["新技术评估","技术决策","开发者工具","框架化评估","技术创新"],"ja":["新技術の評価","技術的決定","開発者ツール","フレームワーク化された評価","技術イノベーション"],"ko":["신기술 평가","기술적 결정","개발자 도구","프레임워크화된 평가","기술 혁신"],"es":["evaluación de tecnologías emergentes","desarrollo de software","frameworks de evaluación","análisis de madurez","construcción y compra","evaluación de herramientas","casos de uso","beneficios y riesgos"],"fr":["évaluation des nouvelles technologies","développement de logiciels","frameworks d''évaluation","analyse de maturité","construction et achat","évaluation des outils","cas d''utilisation","avantages et risques"],"de":["Bewertung von neuen Technologien","Software-Entwicklung","Frameworks für die Bewertung","Analyse der Reife","Build- und Buy-Optionen","Bewertung von Tools","Anwendungsfälle","Vorteile und Risiken"],"pt":["avaliação de tecnologias","tecnologias emergentes","frameworks de avaliação","maturidade da tecnologia","desenvolvimento de tecnologia","estratégias de tecnologia","inovação tecnológica","gestão de tecnologia"],"ru":["оценка технологий","новые технологии","фреймворки оценки","зрелость технологии","разработка технологий","стратегии технологий","технологические инновации","управление технологиями"],"ar":["تقييم التكنولوجيا","التكنولوجيا الناشئة","إطارات التقييم","نضج التكنولوجيا","تطوير التكنولوجيا","استراتيجيات التكنولوجيا","الابتكارات التكنولوجية","إدارة التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"evaluating-new-technology","description":"Help users evaluate emerging technologies. Use when someone is assessing new tools, making build vs buy decisions, evaluating AI vendors, or deciding on technical architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Evaluating New Technology\n\nHelp the user evaluate emerging technologies using frameworks from 22 product leaders who have made critical technology decisions at companies from Google to Shopify.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help evaluating technology:\n\n1. **Start with the problem** - Clarify what problem they''re solving before discussing tools\n2. **Assess maturity** - Determine if the technology is stable enough for their use case\n3. **Consider build and buy** - Help them find the ri","body":"# Evaluating New Technology\n\nHelp the user evaluate emerging technologies using frameworks from 22 product leaders who have made critical technology decisions at companies from Google to Shopify.\n\n## How to Help\n\nWhen the user asks for help evaluating technology:\n\n1. **Start with the problem** - Clarify what problem they''re solving before discussing tools\n2. **Assess maturity** - Determine if the technology is stable enough for their use case\n3. **Consider build and buy** - Help them find the right mix rather than forcing a binary choice\n4. **Plan for change** - Design for modularity since the landscape will shift\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Tools solve problems, not the reverse\nAustin Hay: \"I have this adage I always say, which is tools are just meant to solve problems. And the problem set for marketing technologists and business technologists is you focus on the tools.\" Always define the problem and the people involved before selecting a system or tool.\n\n### Build AND buy, not build vs buy\nAustin Hay: \"Build and buy as opposed to build versus buy. Build and buy means that both of you can win.\" Buy tools to handle 90% of standard functionality and build the ''cool'' 10% that is unique to your business.\n\n### Evaluate mental bandwidth, not just dollars\nDhanji R. Prasanna: \"The savings and costs that there might be in replacing a vendor tool by something you build in-house is probably not worth it in the mental bandwidth that you''ve lost.\" Focus technical bandwidth on core competencies, not recreating vendor tools.\n\n### Update your priors constantly\nAparna Chennapragada: \"The models couldn''t do some things one year ago. My impression of it from trying it a few months ago - that prior needs to be updated. The baby just grew up to be a 15-year-old in a month.\" Re-test assumptions about what technology can do every few months.\n\n### Bet on abstraction layers\nAsha Sharma: \"You really need to bet on a platform or some app server type layer that allows you to swap things in and out and not really be beholden to any one technology.\" Invest in modularity as the AI stack evolves.\n\n### AI guardrails don''t work\nSander Schulhoff: \"AI guardrails do not work. If someone is determined enough to trick GPT-5, they''re going to deal with that guardrail. When these guardrail providers say ''We catch everything,'' that''s a complete lie.\" Be skeptical of AI security vendor claims.\n\n### Use the tools yourself\nDhanji R. Prasanna: \"I would say really try and use these tools yourself. We learn a lot about how our own workflow can change.\" Solve a specific, personal problem with new tools to understand their true strengths.\n\n### Context drives AI value\nJeanne Grosser: \"Because this whole space is so nascent, often your own esoteric context, your content, your workflow is really key to unlocking the power of the agent.\" For AI agents, building internally often beats buying.\n\n## Questions to Help Users\n\n- \"What specific problem are you trying to solve with this technology?\"\n- \"Is this technology stable enough for production, or still experimental?\"\n- \"What''s the mental bandwidth cost of building vs maintaining a vendor relationship?\"\n- \"When did you last test your assumptions about what this technology can do?\"\n- \"How will you swap this out if something better comes along?\"\n- \"Have you actually used this tool to solve a real problem yourself?\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Flag\n\n- **Tool bias** - Picking tools because you''ve used them before, not because they solve the problem\n- **Binary build vs buy thinking** - Missing the opportunity to buy 90% and build the strategic 10%\n- **Outdated priors** - Making decisions based on what technology couldn''t do six months ago\n- **Vendor lock-in** - Betting on specific tools without an abstraction layer for future flexibility\n- **Trusting security marketing** - Believing AI guardrail vendors who claim to ''catch everything''\n\n## Deep Dive\n\nFor all 27 insights from 22 guests, see `references/guest-insights.md`\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- AI Product Strategy\n- Building with LLMs\n- Platform Strategy\n- Vibe Coding\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:31:11.111Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Decision Support Agents needing frameworks to assess technology maturity and stability","zh":"适用于需要评估技术成熟度和稳定性的决策支持代理的框架","ja":"技術の成熟度と安定性を評価するフレームワークを必要とする意思決定サポートエージェントに最適","ko":"기술 성숙도와 안정성을 평가하기 위한 프레임워크가 필요한 의사 결정 지원 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Soporte de Decisiones que necesitan marcos para evaluar la madurez y estabilidad tecnológica","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Support de Décision ayant besoin de cadres pour évaluer la maturité et la stabilité technologique","de":"Ideal für Entscheidungsunterstützungsagenten, die Frameworks zur Bewertung der Technologiereife und -stabilität benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Suporte a Decisões que necessitam de estruturas para avaliar a maturidade e estabilidade da tecnologia","ru":"Идеально для агентов поддержки принятия решений, которым требуются框ки для оценки зрелости и стабильности технологий","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء دعم القرار الذين يحتاجون إلى إطارات لتقييم نضج التكنولوجيا وثباتها"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate emerging technologies using frameworks from product leaders, considering factors like build and buy decisions, and assessing technology stability for specific use cases using protocols and methodologies from companies like Google and Shopify","zh":"赋予代理评估新兴技术的能力，使用来自产品领导者的框架，考虑诸如构建和购买决策等因素，并使用Google和Shopify等公司的协议和方法论评估特定用例的技术稳定性","ja":"新興技術を評価するためのエージェントをEmpowerし、製品リーダーからのフレームワークを使用し、ビルドと買い決断などの要因を考慮し、GoogleやShopifyなどの企業からのプロトコルと方法論を使用して、特定のユースケースの技術の安定性を評価する","ko":"새로운 기술을 평가하기 위한 에이전트를 강화하고, 제품 리더로부터의 프레임워크를 사용하며, 빌드와 구매 결정 등과 같은 요인을 고려하고, 구글이나 쇼피파이와 같은 회사의 프로토콜과 방법론을 사용하여 특정 유스케이스의 기술 안정성을 평가","es":"Permite a los agentes evaluar tecnologías emergentes utilizando marcos de líderes de productos, considerando factores como decisiones de construcción y compra, y evaluando la estabilidad tecnológica para casos de uso específicos utilizando protocolos y metodologías de empresas como Google y Shopify","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer les technologies émergentes en utilisant des cadres de leaders de produits, en considérant des facteurs tels que les décisions de construction et d''achat, et en évaluant la stabilité technologique pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques en utilisant des protocoles et des méthodologies d''entreprises comme Google et Shopify","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, neue Technologien unter Verwendung von Frameworks von Produktführern zu bewerten, unter Berücksichtigung von Faktoren wie Build- oder Buy-Entscheidungen und unter Bewertung der Technologiestabilität für spezifische Anwendungsfälle unter Verwendung von Protokollen und Methoden von Unternehmen wie Google und Shopify","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliarem tecnologias emergentes usando estruturas de líderes de produtos, considerando fatores como decisões de construir e comprar, e avaliando a estabilidade da tecnologia para casos de uso específicos usando protocolos e metodologias de empresas como Google e Shopify","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценивать появляющиеся технологии с использованием рамок от лидеров отрасли, учитывая такие факторы, как решения о построении и покупке, и оценивая стабильность технологий для конкретных случаев использования с использованием протоколов и методологий компаний như Google и Shopify","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم التكنولوجيا الناشئة باستخدام إطارات من قادة المنتجات، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار عوامل مثل القرارات بناء وشراء، وتقييم استقرار التكنولوجيا لحالات الاستخدام المحددة باستخدام بروتوكولات ومنهجيات من شركات مثل جوجل وشوبيفاي"},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing technology maturity for startup investments","Evaluating build vs buy decisions for enterprise software","Determining stability of emerging technologies for production environments"],"zh":["评估初创企业投资的技术成熟度","评估企业软件的构建与购买决策","确定生产环境中新兴技术的稳定性"],"ja":["スタートアップ投資の技術成熟度の評価","エンタープライズソフトウェアのビルドと買い決断の評価","生産環境における新興技術の安定性の決定"],"ko":["스타트업 투자의 기술 성숙도 평가","엔터프라이즈 소프트웨어의 빌드와 구매 결정 평가","생산 환경에서의 새로운 기술의 안정성 결정"],"es":["Evaluación de la madurez tecnológica para inversiones en startups","Evaluación de decisiones de construcción frente a compras para software empresarial","Determinación de la estabilidad de tecnologías emergentes para entornos de producción"],"fr":["Évaluation de la maturité technologique pour les investissements dans les startups","Évaluation des décisions de construction par rapport aux achats pour les logiciels d''entreprise","Détermination de la stabilité des technologies émergentes pour les environnements de production"],"de":["Bewertung der Technologiereife für Start-up-Investitionen","Bewertung von Build- oder Buy-Entscheidungen für Unternehmenssoftware","Bestimmung der Stabilität neuer Technologien für Produktionsumgebungen"],"pt":["Avaliando a maturidade da tecnologia para investimentos de startups","Avaliando decisões de construir versus comprar para software de empresa","Determinando a estabilidade de tecnologias emergentes para ambientes de produção"],"ru":["Оценка зрелости технологий для инвестиций в стартапы","Оценка решений о построении или покупке программного обеспечения для предприятий","Определение стабильности появляющихся технологий для производственных сред"],"ar":["تقييم نضج التكنولوجيا لاستثمارات الشركات الناشئة","تقييم قرارات بناء مقابل شراء لبرامج الشركات","تحديد استقرار التكنولوجيا الناشئة للبيئات الإنتاجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of technology decision-making frameworks","Limited to evaluating technologies with available maturity data"],"zh":["需要了解技术决策框架","仅限于评估具有可用成熟度数据的技术"],"ja":["技術的意思決定フレームワークの理解が必要","利用可能な成熟度データを持つ技術のみを評価すること"],"ko":["기술적 의사 결정 프레임워크에 대한 이해가 필요","사용 가능한 성숙도 데이터를 갖는 기술만을 평가"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de marcos de toma de decisiones tecnológicas","Limitado a la evaluación de tecnologías con datos de madurez disponibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des cadres de prise de décision technologique","Limité à l''évaluation des technologies avec des données de maturité disponibles"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von Technologie-Entscheidungsfindungsframeworks","Begrenzt auf die Bewertung von Technologien mit verfügbaren Reifegrad-Daten"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de estruturas de tomada de decisões tecnológicas","Limitado à avaliação de tecnologias com dados de maturidade disponíveis"],"ru":["Требует понимания рамок принятия технологических решений","Ограничен оценкой технологий с доступными данными о зрелости"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم إطارات اتخاذ القرارات التكنولوجية","محدود بتقييم التكنولوجيا المتاحة بيانات نضجها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
