ones con respuestas basadas en conocimientos","Habilitación de LLM para acceder a conocimientos específicos de dominio","Creación de asistentes de documentación"],"fr":["Création de systèmes de questions et réponses sur des documents propriétaires","Développement de chatbots avec des informations actuelles et factuelles","Mise en œuvre de recherches sémantiques avec des requêtes de langage naturel","Réduction des hallucinations avec des réponses basées sur des connaissances","Activation de LLM pour accéder à des connaissances spécifiques de domaine","Création d''assistants de documentation"],"de":["Erstellung von Fragen- und Antworten-Systemen über proprietäre Dokumente","Entwicklung von Chatbots mit aktuellen und faktischen Informationen","Implementierung von semantischen Suchen mit natürlichen Sprachabfragen","Reduzierung von Halluzinationen mit wissensbasierten Antworten","Aktivierung von LLM zur Zugriff auf domänen-spezifisches Wissen","Erstellung von Dokumentations-Assistenten"],"pt":["Geração de respostas baseadas em conhecimento externo","Redução de respostas não precisas","Acesso a conhecimento específico de domínio","Criação de sistemas de Q&A e chatbots","Melhoria da precisão das respostas","Integração com fontes de conhecimento externas"],"ru":["Генерация ответов на основе внешних источников знаний","Сокращение количества неточных ответов","Доступ к специфичным знаниям домена","Создание систем вопросов и ответов и чат-ботов","Улучшение точности ответов","Интеграция с внешними источниками знаний"],"ar":["إنشاء استجابات مستندة إلى مصادر معرفة خارجية","تقليل الاستجابات غير الدقيقة","الوصول إلى معرفة خاصة بالمجال","إنشاء أنظمة الأسئلة والأجوبة وچات بوتس","تحسين دقة الاستجابات","التكامل مع مصادر معرفة خارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RAG实现","LLM应用程序","外部知识源","准确响应","可靠响应","幻觉减少","事实信息","领域特定知识"],"ja":["RAG実装","LLMアプリケーション","外部知識源","正確な応答","信頼性の高い応答","幻覚減少","事実情報","ドメイン特有の知識"],"ko":["RAG 구현","LLM 애플리케이션","외부 지식 소스","정확한 응답","신뢰할 수 있는 응답","환상 감소","사실 정보","도메인 특정 지식"],"es":["RAG","LLM","aplicaciones LLM","respuestas precisas","conocimientos externos","desarrollo de chatbots","búsqueda semántica","reducción de alucinaciones","acceso a conocimientos específicos de dominio"],"fr":["RAG","LLM","applications LLM","réponses précises","connaissances externes","développement de chatbots","recherche sémantique","réduction des hallucinations","accès à des connaissances spécifiques de domaine"],"de":["RAG","LLM","LLM-Anwendungen","genaue Antworten","externes Wissen","Entwicklung von Chatbots","semantische Suche","Reduzierung von Halluzinationen","Zugriff auf domänen-spezifisches Wissen"],"pt":["RAG","Implementação RAG","Geração de respostas","Conhecimento externo","Aplicações LLM","Sistemas de Q&A","Chatbots","Redução de respostas não precisas","Acesso a conhecimento específico de domínio"],"ru":["RAG","Реализация RAG","Генерация ответов","Внешние источники знаний","Приложения LLM","Системы вопросов и ответов","Чат-боты","Сокращение количества неточных ответов","Доступ к специфичным знаниям домена"],"ar":["RAG","تنفيذ RAG","إنشاء استجابات","مصادر معرفة خارجية","تطبيقات LLM","أنظمة الأسئلة والأجوبة","چات بوتس","تقليل الاستجابات غير الدقيقة","الوصول إلى معرفة خاصة بالمجال"]}},"owner":"ljchg12-hue","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"ljchg12-hue/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rag-implementation","description":"Build Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems for LLM applications with vector databases and semantic search. Use when implementing knowledge-grounded AI, building document Q&A systems, or integrating LLMs with external knowledge bases.","bodyPreview":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n-","body":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n- Creating research tools with source citation\n\n## Core Components\n\n### 1. Vector Databases\n**Purpose**: Store and retrieve document embeddings efficiently\n\n**Options:**\n- **Pinecone**: Managed, scalable, fast queries\n- **Weaviate**: Open-source, hybrid search\n- **Milvus**: High performance, on-premise\n- **Chroma**: Lightweight, easy to use\n- **Qdrant**: Fast, filtered search\n- **FAISS**: Meta''s library, local deployment\n\n### 2. Embeddings\n**Purpose**: Convert text to numerical vectors for similarity search\n\n**Models:**\n- **text-embedding-ada-002** (OpenAI): General purpose, 1536 dims\n- **all-MiniLM-L6-v2** (Sentence Transformers): Fast, lightweight\n- **e5-large-v2**: High quality, multilingual\n- **Instructor**: Task-specific instructions\n- **bge-large-en-v1.5**: SOTA performance\n\n### 3. Retrieval Strategies\n**Approaches:**\n- **Dense Retrieval**: Semantic similarity via embeddings\n- **Sparse Retrieval**: Keyword matching (BM25, TF-IDF)\n- **Hybrid Search**: Combine dense + sparse\n- **Multi-Query**: Generate multiple query variations\n- **HyDE**: Generate hypothetical documents\n\n### 4. Reranking\n**Purpose**: Improve retrieval quality by reordering results\n\n**Methods:**\n- **Cross-Encoders**: BERT-based reranking\n- **Cohere Rerank**: API-based reranking\n- **Maximal Marginal Relevance (MMR)**: Diversity + relevance\n- **LLM-based**: Use LLM to score relevance\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\n\n# 1. Load documents\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'', glob=\"**/*.txt\")\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\n# 2. Split into chunks\ntext_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len\n)\nchunks = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# 3. Create embeddings and vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(chunks, embeddings)\n\n# 4. Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=OpenAI(),\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 4}),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# 5. Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What are the main features?\"})\nprint(result[''result''])\nprint(result[''source_documents''])\n```\n\n## Advanced RAG Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hybrid Search\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import BM25Retriever, EnsembleRetriever\n\n# Sparse retriever (BM25)\nbm25_retriever = BM25Retriever.from_documents(chunks)\nbm25_retriever.k = 5\n\n# Dense retriever (embeddings)\nembedding_retriever = vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 5})\n\n# Combine with weights\nensemble_retriever = EnsembleRetriever(\n    retrievers=[bm25_retriever, embedding_retriever],\n    weights=[0.3, 0.7]\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Query Retrieval\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers.multi_query import MultiQueryRetriever\n\n# Generate multiple query perspectives\nretriever = MultiQueryRetriever.from_llm(\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    llm=OpenAI()\n)\n\n# Single query → multiple variations → combined results\nresults = retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"What is the main topic?\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Contextual Compression\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ContextualCompressionRetriever\nfrom langchain.retrievers.document_compressors import LLMChainExtractor\n\ncompressor = LLMChainExtractor.from_llm(llm)\n\ncompression_retriever = ContextualCompressionRetriever(\n    base_compressor=compressor,\n    base_retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever()\n)\n\n# Returns only relevant parts of documents\ncompressed_docs = compression_retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"query\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Parent Document Retriever\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ParentDocumentRetriever\nfrom langchain.storage import InMemoryStore\n\n# Store for parent documents\nstore = InMemoryStore()\n\n# Small chunks for retrieval, large chunks for context\nchild_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=400)\nparent_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=2000)\n\nretriever = ParentDocumentRetriever(\n    vectorstore=vectorstore,\n    docstore=store,\n    child_splitter=child_splitter,\n    parent_splitter=parent_splitter\n)\n```\n\n## Document Chunking Strategies\n\n### Recursive Character Text Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len,\n    separators=[\"\\n\\n\", \"\\n\", \" \", \"\"]  # Try these in order\n)\n```\n\n### Token-Based Splitting\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import TokenTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = TokenTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=512,\n    chunk_overlap=50\n)\n```\n\n### Semantic Chunking\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import SemanticChunker\n\nsplitter = SemanticChunker(\n    embeddings=OpenAIEmbeddings(),\n    breakpoint_threshold_type=\"percentile\"\n)\n```\n\n### Markdown Header Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter\n\nheaders_to_split_on = [\n    (\"#\", \"Header 1\"),\n    (\"##\", \"Header 2\"),\n    (\"###\", \"Header 3\"),\n]\n\nsplitter = MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter(headers_to_split_on=headers_to_split_on)\n```\n\n## Vector Store Configurations\n\n### Pinecone\n```python\nimport pinecone\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Pinecone\n\npinecone.init(api_key=\"your-api-key\", environment=\"us-west1-gcp\")\n\nindex = pinecone.Index(\"your-index-name\")\n\nvectorstore = Pinecone(index, embeddings.embed_query, \"text\")\n```\n\n### Weaviate\n```python\nimport weaviate\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Weaviate\n\nclient = weaviate.Client(\"http://localhost:8080\")\n\nvectorstore = Weaviate(client, \"Document\", \"content\", embeddings)\n```\n\n### Chroma (Local)\n```python\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n\nvectorstore = Chroma(\n    collection_name=\"my_collection\",\n    embedding_function=embeddings,\n    persist_directory=\"./chroma_db\"\n)\n```\n\n## Retrieval Optimization\n\n### 1. Metadata Filtering\n```python\n# Add metadata during indexing\nchunks_with_metadata = []\nfor i, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\n    chunk.metadata = {\n        \"source\": chunk.metadata.get(\"source\"),\n        \"page\": i,\n        \"category\": determine_category(chunk.page_content)\n    }\n    chunks_with_metadata.append(chunk)\n\n# Filter during retrieval\nresults = vectorstore.similarity_search(\n    \"query\",\n    filter={\"category\": \"technical\"},\n    k=5\n)\n```\n\n### 2. Maximal Marginal Relevance\n```python\n# Balance relevance with diversity\nresults = vectorstore.max_marginal_relevance_search(\n    \"query\",\n    k=5,\n    fetch_k=20,  # Fetch 20, return top 5 diverse\n    lambda_mult=0.5  # 0=max diversity, 1=max relevance\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Reranking with Cross-Encoder\n```python\nfrom sentence_transformers import CrossEncoder\n\nreranker = CrossEncoder(''cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2'')\n\n# Get initial results\ncandidates = vectorstore.similarity_search(\"query\", k=20)\n\n# Rerank\npairs = [[query, doc.page_content] for doc in candidates]\nscores = reranker.predict(pairs)\n\n# Sort by score and take top k\nreranked = sorted(zip(candidates, scores), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)[:5]\n```\n\n## Prompt Engineering for RAG\n\n### Contextual Prompt\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Use the following context to answer the question. If you cannot answer based on the context, say \"I don''t have enough information.\"\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Citations\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question based on the context below. Include citations using [1], [2], etc.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer (with citations):\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Confidence\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question using the context. Provide a confidence score (0-100%) for your answer.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\nConfidence:\"\"\"\n```\n\n## Evaluation Metrics\n\n```python\ndef evaluate_rag_system(qa_chain, test_cases):\n    metrics = {\n        ''accuracy'': [],\n        ''retrieval_quality'': [],\n        ''groundedness'': []\n    }\n\n    for test in test_cases:\n        result = qa_chain({\"query\": test[''question'']})\n\n        # Check if answer matches expected\n        accuracy = calculate_accuracy(result[''result''], test[''expected''])\n        metrics[''accuracy''].append(accuracy)\n\n        # Check if relevant docs were retrieved\n        retrieval_quality = evaluate_retrieved_docs(\n            result[''source_documents''],\n            test[''relevant_docs'']\n        )\n        metrics[''retrieval_quality''].append(retrieval_quality)\n\n        # Check if answer is grounded in context\n        groundedness = check_groundedness(\n            result[''result''],\n            result[''source_documents'']\n        )\n        metrics[''groundedness''].append(groundedness)\n\n    return {k: sum(v)/len(v) for k, v in metrics.items()}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/vector-databases.md**: Detailed comparison of vector DBs\n- **references/embeddings.md**: Embedding model selection guide\n- **references/retrieval-strategies.md**: Advanced retrieval techniques\n- **references/reranking.md**: Reranking methods and when to use them\n- **references/context-window.md**: Managing context limits\n- **assets/vector-store-config.yaml**: Configuration templates\n- **assets/retriever-pipeline.py**: Complete RAG pipeline\n- **assets/embedding-models.md**: Model comparison and benchmarks\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Chunk Size**: Balance between context and specificity (500-1000 tokens)\n2. **Overlap**: Use 10-20% overlap to preserve context at boundaries\n3. **Metadata**: Include source, page, timestamp for filtering and debugging\n4. **Hybrid Search**: Combine semantic and keyword search for best results\n5. **Reranking**: Improve top results with cross-encoder\n6. **Citations**: Always return source documents for transparency\n7. **Evaluation**: Continuously test retrieval quality and answer accuracy\n8. **Monitoring**: Track retrieval metrics in production\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Poor Retrieval**: Check embedding quality, chunk size, query formulation\n- **Irrelevant Results**: Add metadata filtering, use hybrid search, rerank\n- **Missing Information**: Ensure documents are properly indexed\n- **Slow Queries**: Optimize vector store, use caching, reduce k\n- **Hallucinations**: Improve grounding prompt, add verification step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:31:40.968Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) for accurate and grounded responses","zh":"非常适合需要检索增强生成（RAG）技术的高级AI智能体（如Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain），以获得准确且基于事实的响应","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの高度なAIエージェントに最適です。正確で事実に基づいた応答を得るために検索拡張生成（RAG）を必要とします","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain과 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 이상적입니다. 정확하고 근거 있는 응답을 위해 검색 증강 생성(RAG)이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan Generación Mejorada con Recuperación (RAG) para respuestas precisas y fundamentadas","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''IA Avancés comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une Génération Améliorée avec Recherche (RAG) pour des réponses précises et ancrées","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine Retrieval-erweiterte Generierung (RAG) für genaue und fundierte Antworten benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação (RAG) para respostas precisas e fundamentadas","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуется Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) для точных и обоснованных ответов","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد معزز بالاسترجاع (RAG) للاستجابات الدقيقة والمؤسسة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master RAG implementation using external knowledge sources, enforcing ABSOLUTE RULES for multi-AI orchestration and providing accurate responses with reduced hallucinations, leveraging Claude Code CLI configuration for seamless integration with proprietary documents and domain-specific knowledge","zh":"使智能体能够掌握利用外部知识源实施RAG的技术，强制执行多AI编排的绝对规则，并通过利用Claude Code CLI配置与专有文档和领域特定知识无缝集成，提供准确响应并减少幻觉","ja":"外部知識ソースを使用したRAGの実装をマスターし、マルチAIオーケストレーションのための絶対規則を施行し、Claude Code CLI設定を活用して専有文書とドメイン固有知識とのシームレスな統合を実現し、幻覚を減らした正確な応答を提供するようにエージェントを強化します","ko":"외부 지식 소스를 사용한 RAG 구현을 숙달하고, 다중 AI 오케스트레이션을 위한 절대 규칙을 적용하며, Claude Code CLI 구성을 활용하여 독점 문서 및 도메인 특정 지식과의 원활한 통합을 통해 환각을 줄인 정확한 응답을 제공하도록 에이전트를 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar la implementación de RAG utilizando fuentes de conocimiento externas, aplicando REGLAS ABSOLUTAS para la orquestación multi-AI y proporcionando respuestas precisas con alucinaciones reducidas, aprovechando la configuración de la interfaz de línea de comandos de Claude Code para una integración sin problemas con documentos propiedad y conocimiento específico de dominio","fr":"Habilite les agents à maîtriser la mise en œuvre de la RAG en utilisant des sources de connaissances externes, en appliquant des RÈGLES ABSOLUES pour l''orchestration multi-AI et en fournissant des réponses précises avec des hallucinations réduites, en exploitant la configuration de l''interface de ligne de commande de Claude Code pour une intégration transparente avec des documents propriétaires et des connaissances spécifiques à un domaine","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Implementierung von RAG mithilfe externer Wissensquellen zu meistern, absolute Regeln für die Multi-KI-Orchestrierung durchzusetzen und genaue Antworten mit reduzierten Halluzinationen bereitzustellen, indem die Konfiguration der Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle von Claude Code für eine nahtlose Integration mit eigentumsbezogenen Dokumenten und domänen-spezifischem Wissen genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar a implementação de RAG usando fontes de conhecimento externas, aplicando REGRAS ABSOLUTAS para orquestração multi-AI e fornecendo respostas precisas com alucinações reduzidas, utilizando a configuração da CLI do Claude Code para integração transparente com documentos proprietários e conhecimento específico de domínio","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить реализацию RAG с использованием внешних источников знаний, обеспечивая ПРАВИЛА ABSOLUT для многоАИ-оркестровки и предоставляя точные ответы с уменьшенным количеством галлюцинаций, используя конфигурацию CLI Claude Code для бесшовной интеграции с собственными документами и домен-специфическими знаниями","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إتقان تنفيذ RAG باستخدام مصادر معرفة خارجية، وتنفيذ القواعد المطلقة لتنسيق متعدد للذكاء الاصطناعي، وتقديم استجابات دقيقة مع تقليل الوهم، باستخدام تكوين واجهة سطر الأوامر Claude Code لتكامل متماسك مع الوثائق المملوكة ومعرفة محددة المجال"},"useCases":{"en":["Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents","Implementing semantic search with natural language queries","Reducing hallucinations in chatbots with grounded responses"],"zh":["基于专有文档构建问答系统","通过自然语言查询实现语义搜索","通过基于事实的响应减少聊天机器人的幻觉"],"ja":["専有文書を対象としたQ&Aシステムの構築","自然言語クエリを用いた意味論的検索の実装","事実に基づいた応答によるチャットボットの幻覚の低減"],"ko":["독점 문서를 기반으로 한 질문-답변 시스템 구축","자연어 쿼리를 사용한 의미론적 검색 구현","근거 있는 응답을 통해 챗봇의 환각 현상 감소"],"es":["Construir sistemas de preguntas y respuestas sobre documentos propiedad","Implementar búsquedas semánticas con consultas de lenguaje natural","Reducir las alucinaciones en los chatbots con respuestas fundamentadas"],"fr":["Construire des systèmes de questions et réponses sur des documents propriétaires","Mettre en œuvre des recherches sémantiques avec des requêtes en langage naturel","Réduire les hallucinations dans les chatbots avec des réponses ancrées"],"de":["Q&A-Systeme über eigentumsbezogene Dokumente aufbauen","Semantische Suche mit natürlichen Sprachabfragen implementieren","Halluzinationen in Chatbots mit fundierten Antworten reduzieren"],"pt":["Construir sistemas de Perguntas e Respostas sobre documentos proprietários","Implementar busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","Reduzir alucinações em chatbots com respostas fundamentadas"],"ru":["Построение систем вопросов и ответов на основе собственных документов","Реализация семантического поиска с запросами естественного языка","Сокращение галлюцинаций в чат-ботах с обоснованными ответами"],"ar":["بناء أنظمة أسئلة وأجوبة على وثائق مملوكة","تنفيذ بحث семантиكي باستخدام استفسارات لغة طبيعية","تقليل الوهم في chatbots مع استجابات مؤسسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code CLI configuration","Dependent on external knowledge sources","May require significant computational resources for large-scale RAG implementation"],"zh":["需要配置Claude Code CLI","依赖外部知识源","大规模RAG实施可能需要大量计算资源"],"ja":["Claude Code CLIの設定が必要","外部知識ソースに依存","大規模なRAGの実装には相当な計算リソースが必要な場合がある"],"ko":["Claude Code CLI 구성 필요","외부 지식 소스에 의존","대규모 RAG 구현에는 상당한 컴퓨팅 리소스가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la interfaz de línea de comandos de Claude Code","Depende de fuentes de conocimiento externas","Puede requerir recursos computacionales significativos para la implementación a gran escala de RAG"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''interface de ligne de commande de Claude Code","Dépend de sources de connaissances externes","Peut nécessiter des ressources informatiques significatives pour la mise en œuvre à grande échelle de la RAG"],"de":["Benötigt die Konfiguration der Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle von Claude Code","Ist abhängig von externen Wissensquellen","Kann erhebliche Rechenressourcen für die großflächige Implementierung von RAG erfordern"],"pt":["Requer configuração da CLI do Claude Code","Depende de fontes de conhecimento externas","Pode requerer recursos computacionais significativos para implementação em larga escala de RAG"],"ru":["Требует конфигурации CLI Claude Code","Зависит от внешних источников знаний","Может требовать значительных вычислительных ресурсов для масштабной реализации RAG"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين واجهة سطر الأوامر Claude Code","يعتمد على مصادر معرفة خارجية","يمكن أن يتطلب موارد حسابية كبيرة لتنفيذ RAG على نطاق واسع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('camoneart/claude-code/rag-implementation', 'community', 'camoneart', 'claude-code', 'camoneart/claude-code', 'rag-implementation', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z', '2026-02-18T07:31:29.179Z', NULL, '{"id":"camoneart/claude-code/rag-implementation","name":"rag-implementation","description":{"zh":"RAG实现是一种利用外部知识源构建准确的LLM应用程序的方法，提供准确的回答","ja":"RAG実装は、外部の知識源を利用して正確なLLMアプリケーションを構築する方法であり、正確な回答を提供する","ko":"RAG 구현은 외부 지식 소스를 활용하여 정확한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 방법으로, 정확한 답변을 제공합니다","es":"El RAG es una técnica para mejorar la precisión de los modelos de lenguaje mediante el acceso a conocimientos externos.","fr":"Le RAG est une technique pour améliorer la précision des modèles de langage en accédant à des connaissances externes.","de":"RAG ist eine Technik, um die Genauigkeit von Sprachmodellen durch den Zugriff auf externe Wissensquellen zu verbessern.","pt":"A RAG Implementation permite construir aplicações LLM com respostas precisas e baseadas em conhecimento externo. Aprenda a dominar a geração de respostas baseadas em conhecimento","ru":"RAG Реализация позволяет строить приложения LLM с точными и основанными на внешних знаниях ответами. Изучите мастерство генерации ответов на основе знаний","ar":"تتيح لك تنفيذ RAG بناء تطبيقات LLM مع استجابات دقيقة ومبنية على المعرفة الخارجية. تعلم كيفية بمساعدة المعرفة الخارجية","en":"Subagents, Skills(Custom slash commands) collection for Claude Code."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"RAG实现 - 精确的LLM应用程序","ja":"RAG実装 - 正確なLLMアプリケーション","ko":"RAG 구현 - 정확한 LLM 애플리케이션","es":"Implementación RAG para Desarrolladores","fr":"Mise en œuvre RAG pour les développeurs","de":"RAG-Implementierung für Entwickler","pt":"RAG Implementation: Geração de Respostas Baseadas em Conh...","ru":"RAG Реализация: Генерация Ответов на Основе Внешних Знаний","ar":"تنفيذ RAG: генерація استجابات مبنية على المعرفة الخارجية","en":"rag-implementation"},"description":{"zh":"RAG实现是一种利用外部知识源构建准确的LLM应用程序的方法，提供准确的回答","ja":"RAG実装は、外部の知識源を利用して正確なLLMアプリケーションを構築する方法であり、正確な回答を提供する","ko":"RAG 구현은 외부 지식 소스를 활용하여 정확한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 방법으로, 정확한 답변을 제공합니다","es":"El RAG es una técnica para mejorar la precisión de los modelos de lenguaje mediante el acceso a conocimientos externos.","fr":"Le RAG est une technique pour améliorer la précision des modèles de langage en accédant à des connaissances externes.","de":"RAG ist eine Technik, um die Genauigkeit von Sprachmodellen durch den Zugriff auf externe Wissensquellen zu verbessern.","pt":"A RAG Implementation permite construir aplicações LLM com respostas precisas e baseadas em conhecimento externo. Aprenda a dominar a geração de respostas bas...","ru":"RAG Реализация позволяет строить приложения LLM с точными и основанными на внешних знаниях ответами. Изучите мастерство генерации ответов на основе знаний","ar":"تتيح لك تنفيذ RAG بناء تطبيقات LLM مع استجابات دقيقة ومبنية على المعرفة الخارجية. تعلم كيفية بمساعدة المعرفة الخارجية","en":"Subagents, Skills(Custom slash commands) collection for Claude Code."},"definition":{"en":"Subagents, Skills(Custom slash commands) collection for Claude Code."},"features":{"zh":["构建准确的问答系统","创建具有当前、事实信息的聊天机器人","实现语义搜索与自然语言查询","减少幻觉，提供有根据的回答","使LLM能够访问领域特定知识","构建文档助手"],"ja":["正確なQ&Aシステムを構築する","現在、事実情報を持つチャットボットを作成する","セマンティック検索と自然言語クエリを実装する","妄想を減らし、根拠のある回答を提供する","LLMがドメイン特有の知識にアクセスできるようにする","ドキュメントアシスタントを構築する"],"ko":["정확한 Q&A 시스템 구축","현재, 사실 정보를 가진 챗봇 생성","语义 검색 및 자연어 쿼리 구현","환각 감소, 근거 있는 답변 제공","LLM이 도메인 특정 지식에 액세스할 수 있도록 함","문서 보조기 구축"],"es":["Mejora de la precisión de los modelos de lenguaje","Acceso a conocimientos externos","Respuestas más precisas y basadas en hechos","Reducción de alucinaciones","Acceso a conocimientos específicos del dominio"],"fr":["Amélioration de la précision des modèles de langage","Accès à des connaissances externes","Réponses plus précises et basées sur des faits","Réduction des hallucinations","Accès à des connaissances spécifiques du domaine"],"de":["Verbesserung der Genauigkeit von Sprachmodellen","Zugriff auf externe Wissensquellen","Genauere und faktengestützte Antworten","Reduzierung von Halluzinationen","Zugriff auf domänspezifisches Wissen"],"pt":["Construção de sistemas de Q&A sobre documentos proprietários","Criação de chatbots com informações atuais e factuais","Implementação de busca semântica com consultas de linguagem natural","Redução de alucinações com respostas baseadas em conhecimento","Habilitação de LLMs para acessar conhecimento específico de domínio","Construção de assistentes de documentação"],"ru":["Построение систем вопросов и ответов над проприетарными документами","Создание чат-ботов с актуальной и фактической информацией","Реализация семантического поиска с естественно-языковыми запросами","Снижение галлюцинаций с ответами, основанными на знаниях","Включение LLM для доступа к домен-специфичным знаниям","Построение помощников документации"],"ar":["بناء أنظمة الأسئلة والأجوبة على وثائق مملوكة","إنشاء محادثات مع معلومات حقيقية ومفيدة","تنفيذ البحث الدلالي بالاستفسارات اللغوية الطبيعية","تقليل الوهم بالاستجابات المبنية على المعرفة","تمكين LLMs من الوصول إلى المعرفة الخاصة بالنطاق","بناء مساعدي الوثائق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RAG实现","LLM应用程序","外部知识源","问答系统","聊天机器人","语义搜索","自然语言查询","领域特定知识"],"ja":["RAG実装","LLMアプリケーション","外部の知識源","Q&Aシステム","チャットボット","セマンティック検索","自然言語クエリ","ドメイン特有の知識"],"ko":["RAG 구현","LLM 애플리케이션","외부 지식 소스","Q&A 시스템","챗봇","语义 검색","자연어 쿼리","도메인 특정 지식"],"es":["RAG","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","modelos de lenguaje","conocimientos externos","respuestas precisas","alucinaciones","conocimientos específicos del dominio"],"fr":["RAG","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","modèles de langage","connaissances externes","réponses précises","hallucinations","connaissances spécifiques du domaine"],"de":["RAG","Retrieval-Augmented Generation","Sprachmodelle","externe Wissensquellen","genaue Antworten","Halluzinationen","domänspezifisches Wissen"],"pt":["RAG Implementation","Geração de Respostas Baseadas em Conhecimento","LLM","Conhecimento Externo","Respostas Precisas","Sistemas de Q&A","Chatbots","Busca Semântica","Redução de Alucinações"],"ru":["RAG Реализация","Генерация Ответов на Основе Внешних Знаний","LLM","Внешние Знания","Точные Ответы","Системы Вопросов и Ответов","Чат-боты","Семантический Поиск","Снижение Галлюцинаций"],"ar":["تنفيذ RAG","توليد الاستجابات المبنية على المعرفة الخارجية","LLM","المعرفة الخارجية","الاستجابات الدقيقة","أنظمة الأسئلة والأجوبة","محادثات","البحث الدلالي","تقليل الوهم"]}},"owner":"camoneart","repo":"claude-code","repoPath":"camoneart/claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rag-implementation","description":"Build Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems for LLM applications with vector databases and semantic search. Use when implementing knowledge-grounded AI, building document Q&A systems, or integrating LLMs with external knowledge bases.","bodyPreview":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n-","body":"# RAG Implementation\n\nMaster Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to build LLM applications that provide accurate, grounded responses using external knowledge sources.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Q&A systems over proprietary documents\n- Creating chatbots with current, factual information\n- Implementing semantic search with natural language queries\n- Reducing hallucinations with grounded responses\n- Enabling LLMs to access domain-specific knowledge\n- Building documentation assistants\n- Creating research tools with source citation\n\n## Core Components\n\n### 1. Vector Databases\n**Purpose**: Store and retrieve document embeddings efficiently\n\n**Options:**\n- **Pinecone**: Managed, scalable, fast queries\n- **Weaviate**: Open-source, hybrid search\n- **Milvus**: High performance, on-premise\n- **Chroma**: Lightweight, easy to use\n- **Qdrant**: Fast, filtered search\n- **FAISS**: Meta''s library, local deployment\n\n### 2. Embeddings\n**Purpose**: Convert text to numerical vectors for similarity search\n\n**Models:**\n- **text-embedding-ada-002** (OpenAI): General purpose, 1536 dims\n- **all-MiniLM-L6-v2** (Sentence Transformers): Fast, lightweight\n- **e5-large-v2**: High quality, multilingual\n- **Instructor**: Task-specific instructions\n- **bge-large-en-v1.5**: SOTA performance\n\n### 3. Retrieval Strategies\n**Approaches:**\n- **Dense Retrieval**: Semantic similarity via embeddings\n- **Sparse Retrieval**: Keyword matching (BM25, TF-IDF)\n- **Hybrid Search**: Combine dense + sparse\n- **Multi-Query**: Generate multiple query variations\n- **HyDE**: Generate hypothetical documents\n\n### 4. Reranking\n**Purpose**: Improve retrieval quality by reordering results\n\n**Methods:**\n- **Cross-Encoders**: BERT-based reranking\n- **Cohere Rerank**: API-based reranking\n- **Maximal Marginal Relevance (MMR)**: Diversity + relevance\n- **LLM-based**: Use LLM to score relevance\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\n\n# 1. Load documents\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'', glob=\"**/*.txt\")\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\n# 2. Split into chunks\ntext_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len\n)\nchunks = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# 3. Create embeddings and vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(chunks, embeddings)\n\n# 4. Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=OpenAI(),\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 4}),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# 5. Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What are the main features?\"})\nprint(result[''result''])\nprint(result[''source_documents''])\n```\n\n## Advanced RAG Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Hybrid Search\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import BM25Retriever, EnsembleRetriever\n\n# Sparse retriever (BM25)\nbm25_retriever = BM25Retriever.from_documents(chunks)\nbm25_retriever.k = 5\n\n# Dense retriever (embeddings)\nembedding_retriever = vectorstore.as_retriever(search_kwargs={\"k\": 5})\n\n# Combine with weights\nensemble_retriever = EnsembleRetriever(\n    retrievers=[bm25_retriever, embedding_retriever],\n    weights=[0.3, 0.7]\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Query Retrieval\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers.multi_query import MultiQueryRetriever\n\n# Generate multiple query perspectives\nretriever = MultiQueryRetriever.from_llm(\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    llm=OpenAI()\n)\n\n# Single query → multiple variations → combined results\nresults = retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"What is the main topic?\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Contextual Compression\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ContextualCompressionRetriever\nfrom langchain.retrievers.document_compressors import LLMChainExtractor\n\ncompressor = LLMChainExtractor.from_llm(llm)\n\ncompression_retriever = ContextualCompressionRetriever(\n    base_compressor=compressor,\n    base_retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever()\n)\n\n# Returns only relevant parts of documents\ncompressed_docs = compression_retriever.get_relevant_documents(\"query\")\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Parent Document Retriever\n```python\nfrom langchain.retrievers import ParentDocumentRetriever\nfrom langchain.storage import InMemoryStore\n\n# Store for parent documents\nstore = InMemoryStore()\n\n# Small chunks for retrieval, large chunks for context\nchild_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=400)\nparent_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=2000)\n\nretriever = ParentDocumentRetriever(\n    vectorstore=vectorstore,\n    docstore=store,\n    child_splitter=child_splitter,\n    parent_splitter=parent_splitter\n)\n```\n\n## Document Chunking Strategies\n\n### Recursive Character Text Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,\n    chunk_overlap=200,\n    length_function=len,\n    separators=[\"\\n\\n\", \"\\n\", \" \", \"\"]  # Try these in order\n)\n```\n\n### Token-Based Splitting\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import TokenTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = TokenTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=512,\n    chunk_overlap=50\n)\n```\n\n### Semantic Chunking\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import SemanticChunker\n\nsplitter = SemanticChunker(\n    embeddings=OpenAIEmbeddings(),\n    breakpoint_threshold_type=\"percentile\"\n)\n```\n\n### Markdown Header Splitter\n```python\nfrom langchain.text_splitters import MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter\n\nheaders_to_split_on = [\n    (\"#\", \"Header 1\"),\n    (\"##\", \"Header 2\"),\n    (\"###\", \"Header 3\"),\n]\n\nsplitter = MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter(headers_to_split_on=headers_to_split_on)\n```\n\n## Vector Store Configurations\n\n### Pinecone\n```python\nimport pinecone\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Pinecone\n\npinecone.init(api_key=\"your-api-key\", environment=\"us-west1-gcp\")\n\nindex = pinecone.Index(\"your-index-name\")\n\nvectorstore = Pinecone(index, embeddings.embed_query, \"text\")\n```\n\n### Weaviate\n```python\nimport weaviate\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Weaviate\n\nclient = weaviate.Client(\"http://localhost:8080\")\n\nvectorstore = Weaviate(client, \"Document\", \"content\", embeddings)\n```\n\n### Chroma (Local)\n```python\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\n\nvectorstore = Chroma(\n    collection_name=\"my_collection\",\n    embedding_function=embeddings,\n    persist_directory=\"./chroma_db\"\n)\n```\n\n## Retrieval Optimization\n\n### 1. Metadata Filtering\n```python\n# Add metadata during indexing\nchunks_with_metadata = []\nfor i, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\n    chunk.metadata = {\n        \"source\": chunk.metadata.get(\"source\"),\n        \"page\": i,\n        \"category\": determine_category(chunk.page_content)\n    }\n    chunks_with_metadata.append(chunk)\n\n# Filter during retrieval\nresults = vectorstore.similarity_search(\n    \"query\",\n    filter={\"category\": \"technical\"},\n    k=5\n)\n```\n\n### 2. Maximal Marginal Relevance\n```python\n# Balance relevance with diversity\nresults = vectorstore.max_marginal_relevance_search(\n    \"query\",\n    k=5,\n    fetch_k=20,  # Fetch 20, return top 5 diverse\n    lambda_mult=0.5  # 0=max diversity, 1=max relevance\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Reranking with Cross-Encoder\n```python\nfrom sentence_transformers import CrossEncoder\n\nreranker = CrossEncoder(''cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2'')\n\n# Get initial results\ncandidates = vectorstore.similarity_search(\"query\", k=20)\n\n# Rerank\npairs = [[query, doc.page_content] for doc in candidates]\nscores = reranker.predict(pairs)\n\n# Sort by score and take top k\nreranked = sorted(zip(candidates, scores), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)[:5]\n```\n\n## Prompt Engineering for RAG\n\n### Contextual Prompt\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Use the following context to answer the question. If you cannot answer based on the context, say \"I don''t have enough information.\"\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Citations\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question based on the context below. Include citations using [1], [2], etc.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer (with citations):\"\"\"\n```\n\n### With Confidence\n```python\nprompt_template = \"\"\"Answer the question using the context. Provide a confidence score (0-100%) for your answer.\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nAnswer:\nConfidence:\"\"\"\n```\n\n## Evaluation Metrics\n\n```python\ndef evaluate_rag_system(qa_chain, test_cases):\n    metrics = {\n        ''accuracy'': [],\n        ''retrieval_quality'': [],\n        ''groundedness'': []\n    }\n\n    for test in test_cases:\n        result = qa_chain({\"query\": test[''question'']})\n\n        # Check if answer matches expected\n        accuracy = calculate_accuracy(result[''result''], test[''expected''])\n        metrics[''accuracy''].append(accuracy)\n\n        # Check if relevant docs were retrieved\n        retrieval_quality = evaluate_retrieved_docs(\n            result[''source_documents''],\n            test[''relevant_docs'']\n        )\n        metrics[''retrieval_quality''].append(retrieval_quality)\n\n        # Check if answer is grounded in context\n        groundedness = check_groundedness(\n            result[''result''],\n            result[''source_documents'']\n        )\n        metrics[''groundedness''].append(groundedness)\n\n    return {k: sum(v)/len(v) for k, v in metrics.items()}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/vector-databases.md**: Detailed comparison of vector DBs\n- **references/embeddings.md**: Embedding model selection guide\n- **references/retrieval-strategies.md**: Advanced retrieval techniques\n- **references/reranking.md**: Reranking methods and when to use them\n- **references/context-window.md**: Managing context limits\n- **assets/vector-store-config.yaml**: Configuration templates\n- **assets/retriever-pipeline.py**: Complete RAG pipeline\n- **assets/embedding-models.md**: Model comparison and benchmarks\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Chunk Size**: Balance between context and specificity (500-1000 tokens)\n2. **Overlap**: Use 10-20% overlap to preserve context at boundaries\n3. **Metadata**: Include source, page, timestamp for filtering and debugging\n4. **Hybrid Search**: Combine semantic and keyword search for best results\n5. **Reranking**: Improve top results with cross-encoder\n6. **Citations**: Always return source documents for transparency\n7. **Evaluation**: Continuously test retrieval quality and answer accuracy\n8. **Monitoring**: Track retrieval metrics in production\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Poor Retrieval**: Check embedding quality, chunk size, query formulation\n- **Irrelevant Results**: Add metadata filtering, use hybrid search, rerank\n- **Missing Information**: Ensure documents are properly indexed\n- **Slow Queries**: Optimize vector store, use caching, reduce k\n- **Hallucinations**: Improve grounding prompt, add verification step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:31:29.179Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for LLM Agents needing Retrieval-Augmented Generation capabilities for accurate and grounded responses.","zh":"非常适合需要检索增强生成（RAG）能力以提供准确且基于事实的回答的大型语言模型（LLM）智能体。","ja":"正確で事実に基づいた応答を提供するために、検索拡張生成（RAG）機能を必要とするLLMエージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확하고 근거 있는 응답을 위해 검색 증대 생성(Retrieval-Augmented Generation) 기능이 필요한 LLM 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes LLM que necesitan capacidades de Generación aumentada con recuperación para respuestas precisas y fundamentadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents LLM ayant besoin de capacités de génération augmentée de récupération pour des réponses précises et fondées.","de":"Perfekt für LLM-Agents, die Retrieval-Augmented-Generation-Fähigkeiten für genaue und fundierte Antworten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes LLM que necessitam de capacidades de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação para respostas precisas e baseadas em fatos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов LLM, которым необходимы возможности генерации,增强енные поиском, для точных и обоснованных ответов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل LLM الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات توليد مدعومة بالاسترجاع للاستجابات الدقيقة والمبنية على الحقائق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) using external knowledge sources, enabling them to provide factual information and reduce hallucinations through semantic search and natural language queries with protocols like Claude Code.","zh":"使智能体能够利用外部知识源掌握检索增强生成（RAG），通过语义搜索和使用Claude Code等协议的自然语言查询，提供事实信息并减少幻觉。","ja":"外部知識ソースを使用した検索拡張生成（RAG）をマスターするようにエージェントを強化し、意味論的検索やClaude Codeなどのプロトコルによる自然言語クエリを通じて、事実情報を提供し、虚構を減らすことを可能にします。","ko":"외부 지식 소스를 사용하여 검색 증대 생성(RAG)을 숙달하도록 에이전트를 지원하며, 의미론적 검색 및 Claude Code와 같은 프로토콜을 통한 자연어 쿼리를 통해 사실 정보를 제공하고 환각을 줄일 수 있게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar la Generación aumentada con recuperación (RAG) utilizando fuentes de conocimiento externas, lo que les permite proporcionar información factual y reducir alucinaciones a través de la búsqueda semántica y las consultas de lenguaje natural con protocolos como Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser la génération augmentée de récupération (RAG) en utilisant des sources de connaissances externes, leur permettant de fournir des informations factuelles et de réduire les hallucinations grâce à la recherche sémantique et aux requêtes de langage naturel avec des protocoles comme Claude Code.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Retrieval-Augmented-Generation (RAG) mithilfe externer Wissensquellen zu beherrschen, sodass sie faktuelle Informationen bereitstellen und Halluzinationen durch semantische Suche und natürliche Sprachabfragen mit Protokollen wie Claude Code reduzieren können.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar a Geração Aumentada por Recuperação (RAG) usando fontes de conhecimento externas, permitindo que forneçam informações factuais e reduzam alucinações por meio de busca semântica e 