"Produktvision","Teamentwicklung","Produktmetriken","Produkt-KPI"],"pt":["estrategista de produto","desenvolvedores","detecção de tecnologia","sincronização automática","OKR","análise de mercado","métricas","KPI"],"ru":["продукт-стратегист","разработчики","умное обнаружение технологий","автоматическая синхронизация","OKR","анализ рынка","метрики","KPI"],"ar":["مخطط المنتج","المطورين","الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا","التنسيق التلقائي","OKR","تحليل السوق","المetrics","الكاي"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.457Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"product-strategist","description":"Strategic product leadership toolkit for Head of Product including OKR cascade generation, market analysis, vision setting, and team scaling. Use for strategic planning, goal alignment, competitive analysis, and organizational design.","bodyPreview":"# Product Strategist\n\nStrategic toolkit for Head of Product to drive vision, alignment, and organizational excellence.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n- OKR cascade generation and alignment\n- Market and competitive analysis\n- Product vision and strategy frameworks\n- Team scaling and organizational design\n- Metrics and KPI definition\n\n## Key Scripts\n\n### okr_cascade_generator.py\nAutomatically cascades company OKRs down to product and team levels with alignment tracking.\n\n**Usage**: `python3 ~/.{TOOL}/skill","body":"# Product Strategist\n\nStrategic toolkit for Head of Product to drive vision, alignment, and organizational excellence.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n- OKR cascade generation and alignment\n- Market and competitive analysis\n- Product vision and strategy frameworks\n- Team scaling and organizational design\n- Metrics and KPI definition\n\n## Key Scripts\n\n### okr_cascade_generator.py\nAutomatically cascades company OKRs down to product and team levels with alignment tracking.\n\n**Usage**: `python3 ~/.{TOOL}/skills/product-strategist/scripts/okr_cascade_generator.py [strategy]`\n- Strategies: growth, retention, revenue, innovation, operational\n- Generates company → product → team OKR cascade\n- Calculates alignment scores\n- Tracks contribution percentages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:32:49.085Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Strategic AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor, needing advanced product strategy and OKR management capabilities.","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 和 Cursor 这样的战略 AI 代理，需要高级产品战略和 OKR 管理能力。","ja":"Claude CodeやCursorのような戦略的AIエージェントに最適で、高度な製品戦略とOKR管理機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 및 Cursor와 같은 전략적 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 고급 제품 전략 및 OKR 관리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA estratégicos como Claude Code y Cursor, que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de estrategia de producto y gestión de OKR.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA stratégiques comme Claude Code et Cursor, nécessitant des capacités avancées de stratégie de produit et de gestion des OKR.","de":"Ideal für strategische KI-Agenten wie Claude Code und Cursor, die erweiterte Produktstrategie- und OKR-Management-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Strategic AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor, needing advanced product strategy and OKR management capabilities.","ru":"Ideal for Strategic AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor, needing advanced product strategy and OKR management capabilities.","ar":"Ideal for Strategic AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor, needing advanced product strategy and OKR management capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to drive product vision and alignment through OKR cascade generation, market analysis, and team scaling, leveraging Python scripts like okr_cascade_generator.py and utilizing metrics and KPI definition for data-driven decision making.","zh":"赋予代理驱动产品愿景和对齐，通过OKR级联生成、市场分析和团队扩展，利用Python脚本如okr_cascade_generator.py，并利用指标和KPI定义进行数据驱动的决策。","ja":"エージェントに製品ビジョンと整合を駆動させる力を与え、OKRカスケード生成、市場分析、チームスケーリングを通じてPythonスクリプトsuch as okr_cascade_generator.pyを利用し、メトリクスとKPI定義を使用してデータドリブンの意思決定を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 비전 및 정렬을 구동 할 수 있도록 하는데, OKR 카스케이드 생성, 시장 분석 및 팀 확장을 통해 Python 스크립트 such as okr_cascade_generator.py를 사용하며, 메트릭스 및 KPI 정의를 사용하여 데이터 주도형 의사 결정을 내릴 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes impulsar la visión y la alineación del producto a través de la generación de cascadas de OKR, análisis de mercado y escalado de equipo, utilizando secuencias de comandos de Python como okr_cascade_generator.py y utilizando la definición de métricas y KPI para la toma de decisiones basada en datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de piloter la vision et l''alignement du produit grâce à la génération de cascades d''OKR, à l''analyse de marché et à la mise à l''échelle de l''équipe, en exploitant des scripts Python comme okr_cascade_generator.py et en utilisant la définition de métriques et de KPI pour la prise de décision basée sur les données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Produktvision und -ausrichtung durch die Generierung von OKR-Kaskaden, Marktanalyse und Team-Skalierung zu steuern, indem Python-Skripte wie okr_cascade_generator.py genutzt und die Definition von Metriken und KPI für datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung verwendet werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to drive product vision and alignment through OKR cascade generation, market analysis, and team scaling, leveraging Python scripts like okr_cascade_generator.py and utilizing metrics and KPI definition for data-driven decision making.","ru":"Empowers agents to drive product vision and alignment through OKR cascade generation, market analysis, and team scaling, leveraging Python scripts like okr_cascade_generator.py and utilizing metrics and KPI definition for data-driven decision making.","ar":"Empowers agents to drive product vision and alignment through OKR cascade generation, market analysis, and team scaling, leveraging Python scripts like okr_cascade_generator.py and utilizing metrics and KPI definition for data-driven decision making."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating OKR cascade generation and alignment for product and team levels","Generating product vision and strategy frameworks for organizational excellence","Defining metrics and KPIs for data-driven product development and team scaling"],"zh":["自动化OKR级联生成和对齐，适用于产品和团队水平","生成产品愿景和战略框架，用于组织卓越","定义指标和KPI，用于数据驱动的产品开发和团队扩展"],"ja":["製品とチームのレベルでのOKRカスケード生成と整合の自動化","組織の卓越性のための製品ビジョンと戦略フレームワークの生成","データドリブンの製品開発とチームスケーリングのためのメトリクスとKPIの定義"],"ko":["제품 및 팀 수준의 OKR 카스케이드 생성 및 정렬 자동화","조직의 우수성을 위한 제품 비전 및 전략 프레임워크 생성","데이터 주도형 제품 개발 및 팀 확장을 위한 메트릭스 및 KPI 정의"],"es":["Automatización de la generación y alineación de cascadas de OKR para niveles de producto y equipo","Generación de marcos de visión y estrategia de producto para la excelencia organizacional","Definición de métricas y KPI para el desarrollo de productos y la escalabilidad del equipo basados en datos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération et de l''alignement de cascades d''OKR pour les niveaux de produit et d''équipe","Génération de cadres de vision et de stratégie de produit pour l''excellence organisationnelle","Définition de métriques et de KPI pour le développement de produits et la mise à l''échelle de l''équipe basés sur les données"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung und Ausrichtung von OKR-Kaskaden für Produkt- und Team-Ebenen","Generierung von Produktvision- und Strategierahmen für organisatorische Exzellenz","Definition von Metriken und KPI für datengetriebene Produktentwicklung und Team-Skalierung"],"pt":["Automating OKR cascade generation and alignment for product and team levels","Generating product vision and strategy frameworks for organizational excellence","Defining metrics and KPIs for data-driven product development and team scaling"],"ru":["Automating OKR cascade generation and alignment for product and team levels","Generating product vision and strategy frameworks for organizational excellence","Defining metrics and KPIs for data-driven product development and team scaling"],"ar":["Automating OKR cascade generation and alignment for product and team levels","Generating product vision and strategy frameworks for organizational excellence","Defining metrics and KPIs for data-driven product development and team scaling"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x installation","Limited to product strategy and OKR management scope","Dependent on upstream sources for auto-sync functionality"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x安装","仅限产品战略和OKR管理范围","依赖上游源进行自动同步功能"],"ja":["Python 3.xのインストールが必要","製品戦略とOKR管理の範囲のみ","自動同期機能には上流源に依存"],"ko":["Python 3.x 설치 필요","제품 전략 및 OKR 관리 범위로 제한됨","자동 동기화 기능은 상위 소스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python 3.x","Limitado al alcance de la estrategia de producto y la gestión de OKR","Dependiente de fuentes ascendentes para la funcionalidad de auto-sincronización"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python 3.x","Limité à la portée de la stratégie de produit et de la gestion des OKR","Dépendant de sources ascendantes pour la fonctionnalité d''auto-synchronisation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Installation von Python 3.x","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der Produktstrategie und des OKR-Managements","Abhängig von Quellen für die Funktionalität der Auto-Synchronisierung"],"pt":["Requires Python 3.x installation","Limited to product strategy and OKR management scope","Dependent on upstream sources for auto-sync functionality"],"ru":["Requires Python 3.x installation","Limited to product strategy and OKR management scope","Dependent on upstream sources for auto-sync functionality"],"ar":["Requires Python 3.x installation","Limited to product strategy and OKR management scope","Dependent on upstream sources for auto-sync functionality"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vmarcosp/dotfiles/bug', 'community', 'vmarcosp', 'dotfiles', 'vmarcosp/dotfiles', 'bug', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z', '2026-02-18T07:33:02.012Z', NULL, '{"id":"vmarcosp/dotfiles/bug","name":"bug","description":{"zh":"Bug ","ja":"Bug","ko":"Bug ","es":"La documentación de errores es crucial para la resolución de problemas. Aprende a registrar y reproducir errores de manera consistente.","fr":"La documentation des bogues est cruciale pour la résolution de problèmes. Apprenez à enregistrer et reproduire les bogues de manière cohérente.","de":"Die Fehlerdokumentation ist entscheidend für die Problemlösung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Fehler konsistent aufzeichnen und reproduzieren.","pt":"A documentação de bugs é fundamental para a resolução de problemas em times de desenvolvimento. Aprenda a fazer isso de forma clara e eficaz.","ru":"Документация ошибок имеет важное значение для решения проблем в командах разработчиков. Узнайте, как делать это четко и эффективно.","ar":"توثيق الأخطاء هو أمر أساسي لحل المشكلات في فرق التطوير. تعلم كيفية القيام بذلك بطريقة واضحة وفعالة.","en":"$dotfiles"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Bug ","ja":"Bug","ko":"Bug ","es":"Documentación de errores: registro y reproducción","fr":"Documentation des bogues: enregistrement et reproduction","de":"Fehlerdokumentation: Aufzeichnung und Reproduktion","pt":"Documentação de Bugs: Guia para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Документация ошибок: Руководство для разработчиков","ar":"توثيق الأخطاء: دليل للمطورين","en":"bug"},"description":{"zh":"Bug ","ja":"Bug","ko":"Bug ","es":"La documentación de errores es crucial para la resolución de problemas. Aprende a registrar y reproducir errores de manera consistente.","fr":"La documentation des bogues est cruciale pour la résolution de problèmes. Apprenez à enregistrer et reproduire les bogues de manière cohérente.","de":"Die Fehlerdokumentation ist entscheidend für die Problemlösung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Fehler konsistent aufzeichnen und reproduzieren.","pt":"A documentação de bugs é fundamental para a resolução de problemas em times de desenvolvimento. Aprenda a fazer isso de forma clara e eficaz.","ru":"Документация ошибок имеет важное значение для решения проблем в командах разработчиков. Узнайте, как делать это четко и эффективно.","ar":"توثيق الأخطاء هو أمر أساسي لحل المشكلات في فرق التطوير. تعلم كيفية القيام بذلك بطريقة واضحة وفعالة.","en":"$dotfiles"},"definition":{"en":"$dotfiles"},"features":{"zh":["1. ","2. ","3. ","4. "],"ja":["1. ","2. ","3. ","4. "],"ko":["1. ","2. ","3. ","4. "],"es":["Registro de comportamiento inesperado","Descripción de comportamiento esperado","Secuencia de acciones para reproducir el error","Identificación del lugar donde ocurre el error","Formato de documentación consistente"],"fr":["Enregistrement d''un comportement inattendu","Description d''un comportement attendu","Séquence d''actions pour reproduire le bogue","Identification de l''endroit où se produit le bogue","Format de documentation cohérent"],"de":["Aufzeichnung unerwarteten Verhaltens","Beschreibung erwarteten Verhaltens","Ablauf der Schritte zur Fehlerreproduktion","Identifizierung des Ortes, an dem der Fehler auftritt","Konsistentes Dokumentationsformat"],"pt":["Coleta de informações sobre erros","Descrição clara de comportamentos inesperados","Reprodução de erros de forma consistente","Documentação de etapas para reproduzir erros","Identificação de locais onde ocorrem erros"],"ru":["Сбор информации об ошибках","Четкое описание неожиданного поведения","Воспроизведение ошибок последовательно","Документирование шагов для воспроизведения ошибок","Определение мест, где возникают ошибки"],"ar":["جمع المعلومات عن الأخطاء","وصف واضح للسلوك غير المتوقع","إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء بطريقة منتظمة","توثيق الخطوات لإعادة إنتاج الأخطاء","تحديد الأماكن التي تحدث فيها الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bug "," ","API"," "," "," "],"ja":["Bug","","API","","",""],"ko":["Bug ","","API","","",""],"es":["documentación de errores","registro de bugs","reproducción de errores","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","depuración de código"],"fr":["documentation des bogues","enregistrement de bogues","reproduction de bogues","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","débogage de code"],"de":["Fehlerdokumentation","Fehleraufzeichnung","Fehlerreproduktion","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests","Code-Debugging"],"pt":["documentação de bugs","desenvolvimento de software","resolução de problemas","colaboração em equipe","qualidade de software","testes de software","depuração de código"],"ru":["документация ошибок","разработка программного обеспечения","решение проблем","сотрудничество в команде","качество программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения","отладка кода"],"ar":["توثيق الأخطاء","تطوير البرمجيات","حل المشكلات","التعاون في الفريق","جودة البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات","تصحيح الأخطاء في الكود"]}},"owner":"vmarcosp","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"vmarcosp/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bug","description":"Documents bugs in a structured format. Gathers reproduction steps, assigns a bug ID, and creates entry in BUGS.md. Does NOT fix bugs - only documents them.","bodyPreview":"You are a bug documentation specialist. Your role is to gather information about bugs and document them in a consistent, reproducible format.\n\n## Your Role\n\nYou document bugs clearly so they can be understood and reproduced. You do NOT fix bugs - only document them.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Gather Information\n\nAsk the user for:\n1. **What happened?** - The unexpected behavior\n2. **What should happen?** - Expected behavior\n3. **Steps to reproduce** - Exact sequence of actions\n4. **Where?** - Which","body":"You are a bug documentation specialist. Your role is to gather information about bugs and document them in a consistent, reproducible format.\n\n## Your Role\n\nYou document bugs clearly so they can be understood and reproduced. You do NOT fix bugs - only document them.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Gather Information\n\nAsk the user for:\n1. **What happened?** - The unexpected behavior\n2. **What should happen?** - Expected behavior\n3. **Steps to reproduce** - Exact sequence of actions\n4. **Where?** - Which page/feature/file is affected\n5. **Any error messages?** - Console errors, stack traces, UI messages\n\nIf the user already provided some of this information, don''t ask again.\n\n### Step 2: Determine Bug ID and Location\n\n1. Check if a `BUGS.md` file exists in the project root\n2. If it exists, find the highest bug number and increment by 1\n3. If it doesn''t exist, create `BUGS.md` in project root\n\n### Step 3: Document the Bug\n\n#### Format for BUGS.md Entry\n\n```markdown\n### BUG-XXX: [Short descriptive title]\n\n**Status:** Not Started\n\n**Description:** [Clear explanation of the bug in 1-2 sentences]\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. [Step 1]\n2. [Step 2]\n3. [Step 3]\n4. [Unexpected result]\n\n**Expected behavior:** [What should happen instead]\n\n**Affected area:** [Page/feature/component/file]\n\n**Additional context:** [Error messages, logs, or other relevant information]\n\n---\n```\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n- **Title**: Short, descriptive, starts with action verb when possible\n- **Description**: One or two sentences explaining the issue\n- **Steps**: Numbered, specific, reproducible by someone unfamiliar with the bug\n- **Be precise**: Use exact button names, field labels, menu items\n\n## Good vs Bad Bug Titles\n\n### Good\n- \"Modal closes unexpectedly when clicking outside\"\n- \"Form validation shows wrong error message\"\n- \"Data not persisted after page refresh\"\n\n### Bad\n- \"Bug in modal\"\n- \"It doesn''t work\"\n- \"Form issue\"\n\n## Important Reminders\n\n- Never attempt to fix bugs - only document\n- If a similar bug exists, ask user if it''s the same or different\n- Keep descriptions concise but complete\n- Include all information needed to reproduce the bug\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:33:02.012Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Diagnostic Agents needing precise bug documentation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要精确 bug 文档功能的诊断代理。","ja":"バグの正確な文書化機能を必要とする診断エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 버그 문서화 기능을 필요로 하는 진단 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de diagnóstico que necesitan capacidades de documentación de errores precisas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de diagnostic nécessitant des capacités de documentation de bogues précises.","de":"Perfekt für Diagnoseagenten, die präzise Fehlernachweisfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Diagnóstico que necessitam de capacidades de documentação de bugs precisas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для диагностических агентов, которым необходимы точные возможности документирования багов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التشخيصيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات توثيق دقيق للعيوب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically gather and document bug information, including unexpected behavior, expected behavior, steps to reproduce, and affected areas, utilizing a consistent and reproducible format.","zh":"使代理能够系统地收集和记录 bug 信息，包括意外行为、预期行为、重现步骤和受影响的区域，使用一致且可重现的格式。","ja":"エージェントが予期せぬ動作、予想される動作、再現手順、影響を受ける領域など、バグ情報を体系的に収集し、文書化できるようにします。一貫性と再現性のあるフォーマットを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 예기치 않은 동작, 예상 동작, 재현 단계, 영향을 받는 영역 등을 포함한 버그 정보를 체계적으로 수집 및 문서화하도록 합니다. 일관되고 재현 가능한 형식을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes recopilar y documentar sistemáticamente la información de errores, incluyendo comportamiento inesperado, comportamiento esperado, pasos para reproducir y áreas afectadas, utilizando un formato consistente y reproducible.","fr":"Permet aux agents de recueillir et de documenter systématiquement les informations de bogues, y compris le comportement inattendu, le comportement attendu, les étapes pour reproduire et les zones affectées, en utilisant un format cohérent et reproductible.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fehlerinformationen systematisch zu sammeln und zu dokumentieren, einschließlich unerwartetem Verhalten, erwartetem Verhalten, Schritten zur Reproduktion und betroffenen Bereichen, unter Verwendung eines konsistenten und reproduzierbaren Formats.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coletar e documentar sistematicamente informações de bugs, incluindo comportamento inesperado, comportamento esperado, etapas para reproduzir e áreas afetadas, utilizando um formato consistente e reprodutível.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически собирать и документировать информацию о багах, включая неожиданное поведение, ожидаемое поведение, шаги для воспроизведения и затронутые области, используя последовательный и воспроизводимый формат.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من جمع وتوثيق المعلومات المتعلقة بالعيوب بطريقة منهجية، بما في ذلك السلوك غير المتوقع والسلوك المتوقع وخطوات الإعادة و المناطق المتأثرة، باستخدام تنسيق متسق ويمكن إعادة إنتاجه."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting software bugs for development teams","Gathering user feedback on application issues","Reproducing and reporting errors in complex systems"],"zh":["为开发团队记录软件 bug","收集应用程序问题的用户反馈","在复杂系统中重现和报告错误"],"ja":["開発チームのためのソフトウェアバグの文書化","アプリケーションの問題に関するユーザーフィードバックの収集","複雑なシステムでのエラーの再現と報告"],"ko":["개발 팀을 위한 소프트웨어 버그 문서화","애플리케이션 문제에 대한 사용자 피드백 수집","복잡한 시스템에서 오류 재현 및 보고"],"es":["Documentar errores de software para equipos de desarrollo","Recopilar comentarios de usuarios sobre problemas de aplicaciones","Reproducir y informar errores en sistemas complejos"],"fr":["Documenter les bogues de logiciels pour les équipes de développement","Recueillir les commentaires des utilisateurs sur les problèmes d''applications","Reproduire et signaler les erreurs dans les systèmes complexes"],"de":["Dokumentation von Softwarefehlern für Entwicklungsteams","Sammeln von Benutzerfeedback zu Anwendungsproblemen","Reproduzieren und Melden von Fehlern in komplexen Systemen"],"pt":["Documentação de bugs de software para equipes de desenvolvimento","Coleta de feedback de usuários sobre problemas de aplicativos","Reprodução e relato de erros em sistemas complexos"],"ru":["Документирование багов программного обеспечения для команд разработки","Сбор отзывов пользователей о проблемах с приложениями","Воспроизведение и отчет об ошибках в сложных системах"],"ar":["توثيق عيوب البرامج لحلول تطوير Teams","جمع ملاحظات المستخدمين حول مشاكل التطبيقات","إعادة إنتاج وتقرير الأخطاء في الأنظمة المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not fix bugs, only documents them","Requires user input for bug information"],"zh":["不能修复 bug，只能记录它们","需要用户输入来获取 bug 信息"],"ja":["バグを修正することはできず、文書化のみ","バグ情報を入力するためにユーザーの入力を必要とする"],"ko":["버그를 수정할 수 없고, 기록만 가능","버그 정보를 입력하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요"],"es":["No corrige errores, solo los documenta","Requiere entrada de usuario para la información de errores"],"fr":["Ne corrige pas les bogues, mais les documente seulement","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour les informations de bogues"],"de":["Behebt keine Fehler, dokumentiert sie nur","Benötigt Benutzereingabe für Fehlerinformationen"],"pt":["Não corrige bugs, apenas os documenta","Exige entrada do usuário para informações de bugs"],"ru":["Не исправляет баги, только документирует их","Требует ввода пользователя для информации о багах"],"ar":["لا يصلح العيوب، بل يوثقها فقط","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لمعلومات العيوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
