["ralph monitor","мониторинг циклов","статус циклов","прогресс циклов","archon","локальное состояние","диагностика циклов","история циклов","пользовательские команды","пользовательские навыки"],"ar":["رالف مونيتور","مراقبة الحلقات","حالة الحلقات","انتقالات الحلقات","آخون","الحالة المحلية","تشخيص الحلقات","تاريخ الحلقات","أوامر مخصصة","مهارات مخصصة"]}},"owner":"HouseGarofalo","repo":"claude-code-base","repoPath":"HouseGarofalo/claude-code-base","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-monitor","description":"Monitor and report on Ralph Wiggum loop progress. Provides real-time status, iteration summaries, and progress tracking via Archon state. Use to check on running or completed loops, view iteration history, and diagnose issues.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Monitor Skill\n\nMonitor and report on Ralph Wiggum loop status and progress. Provides visibility into active and completed loops via Archon state.\n\n## Triggers\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Checking Ralph loop status\n- Viewing iteration progress\n- Monitoring running loops\n- Reviewing loop history\n- Diagnosing stuck loops\n- Keywords: ralph status, loop status, ralph monitor, check loop, iteration progress, loop history\n\n## Core Mission\n\nQuery Archon and local state to provide comprehensive statu","body":"# Ralph Monitor Skill\n\nMonitor and report on Ralph Wiggum loop status and progress. Provides visibility into active and completed loops via Archon state.\n\n## Triggers\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Checking Ralph loop status\n- Viewing iteration progress\n- Monitoring running loops\n- Reviewing loop history\n- Diagnosing stuck loops\n- Keywords: ralph status, loop status, ralph monitor, check loop, iteration progress, loop history\n\n## Core Mission\n\nQuery Archon and local state to provide comprehensive status reports on Ralph loops.\n\n---\n\n## Status Report Formats\n\n### Active Loop Status\n\n```markdown\n## Ralph Loop Status\n\n### Loop Information\n| Property | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| Loop ID | [LOOP_ID] |\n| Status | Running / Paused / Stopped |\n| Started | [TIMESTAMP] |\n| Duration | [HH:MM:SS] |\n\n### Progress\n| Metric | Current | Target |\n|--------|---------|--------|\n| Iteration | [N] | [MAX] |\n| Tasks | [DONE] | [TOTAL] |\n| Tests Passing | [PASS] | [TOTAL] |\n\n[====================----------] 67% complete\n\n### Current Iteration\n| Property | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| Iteration | [N] |\n| Started | [TIME] |\n| Focus | [Current work summary] |\n\n### Recent Activity\n| Iter | Time | Summary | Files | Tests |\n|------|------|---------|-------|-------|\n| N | 5m ago | [Summary] | 3 | 15/15 |\n| N-1 | 12m ago | [Summary] | 5 | 14/15 |\n| N-2 | 20m ago | [Summary] | 2 | 10/15 |\n\n### Validation Status\n- Build: Passing\n- Tests: 15/15 passing\n- Lint: 2 warnings\n\n### Archon Integration\n- Project: [PROJECT_NAME] ([PROJECT_ID])\n- Task: [TASK_TITLE] ([TASK_ID])\n- Task Status: doing\n- State Doc: [DOC_ID]\n\n### Commands\n- View full log: `cat .ralph/loop.log`\n- Cancel loop: Use ralph-loop skill with cancel mode\n- View prompt: `cat .ralph/prompts/current.md`\n```\n\n---\n\n## Data Collection\n\n### From Archon\n\n```python\n# Get state document\nstate_docs = find_documents(\n    project_id=PROJECT_ID,\n    query=\"Ralph Loop State\"\n)\n\n# Get active loops\nactive_loops = [\n    doc for doc in state_docs\n    if doc[\"content\"][\"status\"] == \"running\"\n]\n\n# Get associated tasks\nfor loop in active_loops:\n    task = find_tasks(task_id=loop[\"content\"][\"task_id\"])\n    loop[\"task\"] = task\n```\n\n### From Local State\n\n```bash\n# Read config\ncat .ralph/config.json\n\n# Read recent log\ntail -100 .ralph/loop.log\n\n# Git status\ngit --no-pager log --oneline -5\ngit status --short\n```\n\n---\n\n## Report Types\n\n### Quick Status\n\nReturns brief one-liner:\n\n```\nRalph: Iteration 12/50 | 67% | Tests 15/15 | Duration 25m\n```\n\n### Full Status\n\nReturns complete report as shown above.\n\n### History Report\n\n```markdown\n## Ralph Loop History\n\n### Completed Loops\n| Loop ID | Task | Iterations | Duration | Status |\n|---------|------|------------|----------|--------|\n| ralph-20260122-150000 | Auth API | 12 | 45m | Complete |\n| ralph-20260121-100000 | DB Schema | 8 | 30m | Complete |\n| ralph-20260120-140000 | User Model | 25 | 1h 20m | Max reached |\n\n### Statistics\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Total Loops | 15 |\n| Completed | 12 (80%) |\n| Blocked | 2 (13%) |\n| Max Reached | 1 (7%) |\n| Avg Iterations | 14 |\n| Avg Duration | 35m |\n```\n\n### Comparison Report\n\n```markdown\n## Loop Comparison\n\n| Metric | loop1 | loop2 |\n|--------|-------|-------|\n| Task | Auth API | User API |\n| Iterations | 12 | 18 |\n| Duration | 45m | 1h 10m |\n| Files Changed | 24 | 31 |\n| Tests Added | 15 | 22 |\n| Status | Complete | Complete |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Progress Visualization\n\n### Iteration Timeline\n\n```\nIteration Progress\n==================\n\n1  #### Setup\n2  ######## Basic impl\n3  ############ Tests added\n4  ###### Bug fix\n5  ################ Feature complete\n6  #### Refactor\n7  ########## Edge cases\n8  #################### Validation\n9  ###### Polish\n10 ######################## Complete\n\nLegend: #### = Work done, length = files changed\n```\n\n### Test Progress\n\n```\nTest Progress Across Iterations\n===============================\n\nIter  1: [          ] 0/0\nIter  2: [###       ] 5/15\nIter  3: [#####     ] 8/15\nIter  4: [######    ] 10/15\nIter  5: [########  ] 12/15\nIter  6: [########  ] 12/15  <- regression\nIter  7: [##########] 15/15 PASS\n```\n\n---\n\n## Alerts and Warnings\n\n### Stuck Detection\n\n```markdown\n## Potential Issue Detected\n\n### Stuck Pattern\nThe loop appears to be stuck:\n- Last 3 iterations made no test progress\n- Same files being modified repeatedly\n- Similar error messages in output\n\n### Recommendation\nConsider:\n1. Reviewing the prompt for clarity\n2. Breaking the task into smaller pieces\n3. Adding more specific validation criteria\n4. Canceling and debugging manually\n\n### Action\n- Continue monitoring\n- Cancel loop if needed\n- Review logs: `cat .ralph/loop.log | tail -500`\n```\n\n### Resource Warning\n\n```markdown\n## Resource Warning\n\n### Issue\n- Token usage high in recent iterations\n- Approaching context limit\n\n### Recommendation\n- Consider checkpointing\n- May need to restart with fresh context\n- Current work is saved in Archon\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting Commands\n\n### Check Configuration\n\n```markdown\n## Configuration Check\n\n### Files\n- [x] .ralph/config.json exists\n- [x] .ralph/prompts/current.md exists\n- [x] .ralph/loop-state.json exists\n\n### Archon Connection\n- [x] Project found: [PROJECT_NAME]\n- [x] Task found: [TASK_TITLE]\n- [x] State document found\n\n### Validation Commands\n- [x] Build: `npm run build` (verified)\n- [x] Test: `npm test` (verified)\n- [ ] Lint: `npm run lint` (not configured)\n\n### All checks passed\n```\n\n---\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Check Current Status\n\n```python\n# Quick check\n\"What''s the Ralph loop status?\"\n\n# Full details\n\"Show me detailed Ralph loop status\"\n```\n\n### View History\n\n```python\n# All loops\n\"Show Ralph loop history\"\n\n# Specific loop\n\"Show details for ralph-20260122-150000\"\n```\n\n### Diagnose Issues\n\n```python\n# Check for problems\n\"Is the Ralph loop stuck?\"\n\n# View recent iterations\n\"Show last 5 Ralph iterations\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n### With ralph-loop Skill\n\n```python\n# If monitoring shows issues, suggest:\n\"Use ralph-loop skill to cancel or resume\"\n```\n\n### With archon-workflow Skill\n\n```python\n# For task management integration:\n\"Use archon-workflow to update task status\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Regular Monitoring**: Check status periodically for long loops\n2. **Watch for Patterns**: Same files modified repeatedly = potential issue\n3. **Test Progress**: Should generally increase each iteration\n4. **Duration Tracking**: Unusually long iterations may indicate problems\n5. **Archon Sync**: Ensure state is properly saved to Archon\n6. **Log Review**: Check loop.log for detailed error messages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:33:35.325Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing comprehensive loop status monitoring and Archon state visibility.","zh":"适用于需要全面循环状态监控和Archon状态可见性的高级AI代理。","ja":"高度なAIエージェントが包括的なループ状態監視とArchon状態の可視性を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전반적인 루프 상태 모니터링 및 Archon 상태 가시성이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan un monitoreo de estado de bucle integral y visibilidad del estado de Archon.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA avancés ayant besoin d''une surveillance complète de l''état de la boucle et d''une visibilité de l''état d''Archon.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die eine umfassende Schleifenstatusüberwachung und Archon-Zustandsichtigkeit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de monitoramento abrangente de status de loop e visibilidade de estado de Archon.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуется комплексный мониторинг состояния цикла и видимость состояния Архона.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى مراقبة شاملة لحالة الحلقة ومرئية حالة آرشون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query Archon and local state, providing real-time visibility into active and completed loops, iteration progress, and loop history via protocols like Archon state, enabling efficient diagnosis of stuck loops and optimization of loop performance.","zh":"赋予代理查询Archon和本地状态的能力，提供对活动和已完成循环、迭代进度和循环历史的实时可见性，通过协议如Archon状态，实现对卡住循环的高效诊断和循环性能的优化。","ja":"エージェントがArchonとローカル状態を照会する機能を提供し、Archon状態などのプロトコルを介して、アクティブなループと完了したループ、イテレーションの進度、ループ履歴のリアルタイム可視性を提供し、詰まったループの効率的な診断とループパフォーマンスの最適化を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Archon 및 로컬 상태를 쿼리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 Archon 상태와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 활성 루프 및 완료된 루프, 반복 진행 상황 및 루프 기록에 대한 실시간 가시성을 제공하여 걸린 루프의 효율적인 진단 및 루프 성능 최적화를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar el estado de Archon y local, proporcionando visibilidad en tiempo real de los bucles activos y completados, el progreso de la iteración y el historial de bucles a través de protocolos como el estado de Archon, lo que permite un diagnóstico eficiente de bucles atascados y la optimización del rendimiento del bucle.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger l''état d''Archon et l''état local, fournissant une visibilité en temps réel des boucles actives et terminées, de la progression de l''itération et de l''historique des boucles via des protocoles tels que l''état d''Archon, permettant ainsi un diagnostic efficace des boucles bloquées et l''optimisation des performances de la boucle.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Archon- und lokalen Status abzufragen und bietet Echtzeit-Einblick in aktive und abgeschlossene Schleifen, Iterationsfortschritt und Schleifenverlauf über Protokolle wie Archon-Status, ermöglicht so eine effiziente Diagnose von feststeckenden Schleifen und die Optimierung der Schleifenleistung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar o estado do Archon e local, fornecendo visibilidade em tempo real dos loops ativos e concluídos, progresso da iteração e histórico de loops por meio de protocolos como o estado do Archon, permitindo o diagnóstico eficiente de loops presos e a otimização do desempenho do loop.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запрашивать состояние Архона и локальное состояние, обеспечивая режим реального времени для активных и завершенных циклов, прогресса итерации и истории циклов посредством протоколов, таких как состояние Архона, что позволяет эффективно диагностировать застрявшие циклы и оптимизировать производительность цикла.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استفسار حالة آرشون والحالة المحلية، وتوفير رؤية في الوقت الفعلي للتحديثات النشطة والمنتهية، وتقدم التكرار وسجل الدورة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل حالة آرشون، مما يسمح بالتشخيص الفعال للتحديثات العالقة وتحسين أداء الدورة."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring Ralph loop status and progress","Debugging stuck loops","Reviewing loop history and iteration progress","Automating loop status checks"],"zh":["监控Ralph循环状态和进度","调试卡住的循环","查看循环历史和迭代进度","自动化循环状态检查"],"ja":["Ralphループの状態と進度を監視する","詰まったループをデバッグする","ループ履歴とイテレーションの進度を確認する","ループ状態のチェックを自動化する"],"ko":["Ralph 루프 상태 및 진행 상황 모니터링","걸린 루프 디버깅","루프 기록 및 반복 진행 상황 검토","루프 상태 체크 자동화"],"es":["Monitorear el estado y el progreso del bucle Ralph","Depurar bucles atascados","Revisar el historial y el progreso de la iteración del bucle","Automatizar las comprobaciones de estado del bucle"],"fr":["Surveiller l''état et la progression de la boucle Ralph","Déboguer les boucles bloquées","Examiner l''historique et la progression de l''itération de la boucle","Automatiser les vérifications de l''état de la boucle"],"de":["Überwachung des Status und des Fortschritts der Ralph-Schleife","Feststeckende Schleifen debuggen","Überprüfen des Schleifenverlaufs und des Iterationsfortschritts","Automatisierung der Schleifenstatus-Checks"],"pt":["Monitorar status e progresso do loop Ralph","Depurar loops presos","Revisar histórico de loops e progresso da iteração","Automatizar verificações de status de loop"],"ru":["Мониторинг состояния и прогресса цикла Ральфа","Отладка застрявших циклов","Просмотр истории циклов и прогресса итерации","Автоматизация проверок состояния цикла"],"ar":["مراقبة حالة وتقدم حلقة رالف","تصحيح الأخطاء في الحلقات العالقة","استعراض سجل الحلقات وتقدم التكرار","تأتمة فحص حالة الحلقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Archon state","Compatibility with Claude Code projects only"],"zh":["需要访问Archon状态","仅与Claude Code项目兼容"],"ja":["Archon状態へのアクセスが必要","Claude Codeプロジェクトのみと互換性がある"],"ko":["Archon 상태에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Claude Code 프로젝트와의 호환성만 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al estado de Archon","Compatibilidad solo con proyectos de Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à l''état d''Archon","Compatibilité uniquement avec les projets de code Claude"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf den Archon-Status","Kompatibilität nur mit Claude Code-Projekten"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao estado do Archon","Compatibilidade apenas com projetos Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует доступа к состоянию Архона","Совместимость только с проектами Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حالة آرشون","التوافق فقط مع مشاريع كلود كود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('bigdegenenergy/ai-dev-toolkit/autonomous-loop', 'community', 'bigdegenenergy', 'ai-dev-toolkit', 'bigdegenenergy/ai-dev-toolkit', 'autonomous-loop', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z', '2026-02-18T07:34:04.083Z', NULL, '{"id":"bigdegenenergy/ai-dev-toolkit/autonomous-loop","name":"autonomous-loop","description":{"zh":"自主循环开发模式是基于Boris Cherny的工作流，提供一种高效的开发方式","ja":"オートノマスループ開発はBoris Chernyのワークフローに基づいた開発手法です","ko":"자율 루프 개발은 보리스 체르니의 워크플로우를 기반으로 하는 개발 방법입니다","es":"El bucle autónomo es un enfoque de desarrollo basado en la técnica de Ralph de @ghuntley para Claude Code, que permite un flujo de trabajo más eficiente","fr":"La boucle autonome est une approche de développement basée sur la technique de Ralph de @ghuntley pour Claude Code, qui permet un flux de travail plus efficace","de":"Der autonome Entwicklungsloop ist ein Entwicklungskonzept basierend auf der Ralph-Technik von @ghuntley für Claude Code, das einen effizienteren Arbeitsfluss ermöglicht","pt":"O loop de desenvolvimento autônomo é uma técnica de engenharia de software que permite aos desenvolvedores trabalhar de forma mais eficiente","ru":"Автономный цикл разработки - это техника программной инженерии, которая позволяет разработчикам работать более эффективно","ar":"دورة التطوير المستقل هي تقنية هندسة البرمجيات التي تسمح للمطورين بالعمل بطريقة أكثر كفاءة","en":"Professional engineering team setup for Claude Code - Slash commands, subagents, hooks, and configurations based on Boris Cherny''s workflow"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"自主循环开发模式","ja":"オートノマスループ開発","ko":"자율 루프 개발","es":"Bucle Autónomo para Desarrolladores","fr":"Boucle Autonome pour Développeurs","de":"Autonomer Entwicklungsloop","pt":"Desenvolvimento Autônomo com Claude Code","ru":"Автономный Разработка с Claude Code","ar":"التطوير المستقل مع Claude Code","en":"autonomous-loop"},"description":{"zh":"自主循环开发模式是基于Boris Cherny的工作流，提供一种高效的开发方式","ja":"オートノマスループ開発はBoris Chernyのワークフローに基づいた開発手法です","ko":"자율 루프 개발은 보리스 체르니의 워크플로우를 기반으로 하는 개발 방법입니다","es":"El bucle autónomo es un enfoque de desarrollo basado en la técnica de Ralph de @ghuntley para Claude Code, que permite un flujo de trabajo más eficiente","fr":"La boucle autonome est une approche de développement basée sur la technique de Ralph de @ghuntley pour Claude Code, qui permet un flux de travail plus efficace","de":"Der autonome Entwicklungsloop ist ein Entwicklungskonzept basierend auf der Ralph-Technik von @ghuntley für Claude Code, das einen effizienteren Arbeitsfluss...","pt":"O loop de desenvolvimento autônomo é uma técnica de engenharia de software que permite aos desenvolvedores trabalhar de forma mais eficiente","ru":"Автономный цикл разработки - это техника программной инженерии, которая позволяет разработчикам работать более эффективно","ar":"دورة التطوير المستقل هي تقنية هندسة البرمجيات التي تسمح للمطورين بالعمل بطريقة أكثر كفاءة","en":"Professional engineering team setup for Claude Code - Slash commands, subagents, hooks, and configurations based on Boris Cherny''s workflow"},"definition":{"en":"Professional engineering team setup for Claude Code - Slash commands, subagents, hooks, and configurations based on Boris Cherny''s workflow"},"features":{"zh":["基于Boris Cherny的工作流","双条件退出门","completion indicators ≥ 2","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true","提高开发效率和质量"],"ja":["Boris Chernyのワークフローに基づく","デュアル条件エグジットゲート","completion indicators ≥ 2","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true","開発の生産性と品質を向上"],"ko":["보리스 체르니의 워크플로우를 기반으로","이중 조건.EXIT 게이트","completion indicators ≥ 2","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true","개발 효율성과 품질을 향상"],"es":["Bucle de desarrollo autónomo","Técnica de Ralph de @ghuntley","Indicadores de finalización heurísticos","Señales de salida explícitas","Compatibilidad con Claude Code"],"fr":["Boucle de développement autonome","Technique de Ralph de @ghuntley","Indicateurs de fin heuristiques","Signaux de sortie explicites","Compatibilité avec Claude Code"],"de":["Autonomer Entwicklungsloop","Ralph-Technik von @ghuntley","Heuristische Abschlussindikatoren","Explizite Ausgangssignale","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Técnica de detecção heurística para indicadores de conclusão","Sinal de saída explícito para controle de fluxo","Compatibilidade com Claude Code e Slash commands","Integração com subagentes e hooks","Configurações personalizadas com base no fluxo de trabalho de Boris Cherny"],"ru":["Техника эвристической детекции для индикаторов завершения","Явный сигнал выхода для контроля потока","Совместимость с Claude Code и Slash командами","Интеграция с субагентами и крючками","Настройки на основе рабочего процесса Бориса Черного"],"ar":["تقنية الكشف الإرشادي لمؤشرات الانتهاء","إشارة خروج صريحة للسيطرة على التدفق","التوافق مع Claude Code و Slash commands","التكامل مع الوكلاء التابعين والتحديثات","إعدادات مخصصة وفقًا لتدفق عمل بوريس تشيرني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自主循环开发","Boris Cherny","双条件退出门","completion indicators","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL","开发效率","开发质量"],"ja":["オートノマスループ開発","Boris Cherny","デュアル条件エグジットゲート","completion indicators","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL","開発の生産性","開発の品質"],"ko":["자율 루프 개발","보리스 체르니","이중 조건.EXIT 게이트","completion indicators","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL","개발 효율성","개발 품질"],"es":["bucle autónomo","desarrollo autónomo","técnica de Ralph","Claude Code","indicadores de finalización","señales de salida explícitas"],"fr":["boucle autonome","développement autonome","technique de Ralph","Claude Code","indicateurs de fin","signaux de sortie explicites"],"de":["autonomer Entwicklungsloop","autonomes Entwicklung","Ralph-Technik","Claude Code","Abschlussindikatoren","explizite Ausgangssignale"],"pt":["desenvolvimento autônomo","engenharia de software","Claude Code","técnicas de detecção heurística","sinais de saída explícitos","subagentes","hooks","configurações personalizadas"],"ru":["автономный разработка","программная инженерия","Claude Code","техники эвристической детекции","явные сигналы выхода","субагенты","крючки","настройки на основе рабочего процесса"],"ar":["التطوير المستقل","هندسة البرمجيات","Claude Code","تقنيات الكشف الإرشادي","إشارات خروج صريحة","الوكلاء التابعين","التحديثات","إعدادات مخصصة وفقًا لتدفق العمل"]}},"owner":"bigdegenenergy","repo":"ai-dev-toolkit","repoPath":"bigdegenenergy/ai-dev-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"autonomous-loop","description":"Autonomous development loop patterns for iterative self-improvement. Auto-triggers when implementing features autonomously, fixing bugs in a loop, or running until completion. Based on frankbria/ralph-claude-code.","bodyPreview":"# Autonomous Development Loop\n\nBased on [@ghuntley''s Ralph technique](https://github.com/frankbria/ralph-claude-code) for Claude Code.\n\n> **For full autonomous mode, use `/ralph`.** This skill provides the underlying patterns.\n\n## Core Principle: Dual-Condition Exit Gate\n\n**Never exit prematurely.** Exit requires BOTH conditions:\n\n1. **Completion Indicators ≥ 2** - Heuristic detection from your work\n2. **Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true** - Your conscious declaration\n\n**If only ONE is true → KEEP GOIN","body":"# Autonomous Development Loop\n\nBased on [@ghuntley''s Ralph technique](https://github.com/frankbria/ralph-claude-code) for Claude Code.\n\n> **For full autonomous mode, use `/ralph`.** This skill provides the underlying patterns.\n\n## Core Principle: Dual-Condition Exit Gate\n\n**Never exit prematurely.** Exit requires BOTH conditions:\n\n1. **Completion Indicators ≥ 2** - Heuristic detection from your work\n2. **Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true** - Your conscious declaration\n\n**If only ONE is true → KEEP GOING**\n\nThis innovation (introduced in ralph-claude-code v0.9.9) prevents false exits when completion language appears during productive work.\n\n## Completion Indicators\n\nCount how many apply each loop:\n\n| Indicator         | Pattern                                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Tests passing     | 100% pass rate                             |\n| Fix plan complete | All `- [ ]` → `- [x]`                      |\n| \"Done\" language   | \"done\", \"complete\", \"finished\"             |\n| \"Nothing to do\"   | \"no changes needed\", \"already implemented\" |\n| \"Ready\" language  | \"ready for review\", \"ready to merge\"       |\n| No errors         | Zero execution errors                      |\n\n**Need ≥2 indicators + explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true to exit**\n\n## Circuit Breaker Pattern\n\nTrack your own progress and halt when stuck:\n\n| State         | Condition                | Action             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| **CLOSED**    | Normal operation         | Continue executing |\n| **HALF_OPEN** | 2 loops without progress | Increase scrutiny  |\n| **OPEN**      | Threshold exceeded       | HALT immediately   |\n\n### Halt Thresholds\n\n| Trigger           | Threshold     | Meaning             |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | ------------------- |\n| No progress loops | 3 consecutive | Spinning wheels     |\n| Identical errors  | 5 consecutive | Stuck on same issue |\n| Test-only loops   | 3 consecutive | Not implementing    |\n| Output decline    | >70% drop     | Something''s wrong   |\n\n## Progress Detection\n\nTrack mentally each loop:\n\n- **Files modified** (0 = no progress)\n- **Tests changed** (pass/fail delta)\n- **Tasks completed** (fix plan updates)\n- **Errors encountered** (same vs different)\n\n## Structured Status Reporting\n\n**Every response MUST end with:**\n\n```\n## Status Report\n\nSTATUS: IN_PROGRESS | COMPLETE | BLOCKED\nLOOP: [N]\nCIRCUIT: CLOSED | HALF_OPEN | OPEN\nEXIT_SIGNAL: false | true\n\nTASKS_COMPLETED: [what you finished]\nFILES_MODIFIED: [count and list]\nTESTS: [X/Y passing]\nERRORS: [count or \"none\"]\n\nPROGRESS_INDICATORS:\n- [x] Files changed this loop\n- [ ] Tests improved\n- [ ] Tasks marked complete\n- [ ] No repeated errors\n\nNEXT: [next action or \"done\"]\n```\n\n## Exit Signal Checklist\n\nBefore setting `EXIT_SIGNAL: true`, verify ALL:\n\n```\n□ All fix_plan.md items complete (or task done if no plan)\n□ All tests passing (or code works if no tests)\n□ No execution errors\n□ All requirements implemented\n□ No meaningful work remaining\n```\n\n**If ANY unchecked → EXIT_SIGNAL: false**\n\n## Work Focus Hierarchy\n\n| Activity             | Effort | Priority        |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| **Implementation**   | 60-70% | PRIMARY         |\n| **Testing**          | 15-20% | Secondary       |\n| **Fix Plan Updates** | 5-10%  | Tracking        |\n| **Documentation**    | 0-5%   | Only if needed  |\n| **Cleanup**          | 0-10%  | After core work |\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- **Premature exit**: Tests pass but tasks remain\n- **Infinite loops**: Not detecting repeated failures\n- **Busy work**: Testing without implementing\n- **Silent failures**: Not reporting errors clearly\n- **Scope creep**: Adding unplanned work\n- **Analysis paralysis**: Over-researching instead of implementing\n\n## Fix Plan Integration\n\nMaintain `fix_plan.md`:\n\n```markdown\n## High Priority\n\n- [ ] Critical task\n\n## Medium Priority\n\n- [ ] Supporting task\n\n## Completed\n\n- [x] Done item\n```\n\n**Empty fix plan + passing tests = consider exit**\n\n## Example: Why Dual-Gate Matters\n\n```\nLoop 5:\n  Output: \"Auth complete! Moving to sessions.\"\n  Indicators: 3 (tests pass, \"complete\", no errors)\n  EXIT_SIGNAL: false (Claude continuing)\n  Result: CONTINUE ✅ (respects intent)\n\nLoop 8:\n  Output: \"All done, tests green, ready for review.\"\n  Indicators: 4 (all signals present)\n  EXIT_SIGNAL: true (Claude done)\n  Result: EXIT ✅ (both conditions met)\n```\n\n## Recovery Protocols\n\n### If BLOCKED\n\n1. State: \"I am blocked because [reason]\"\n2. List what you tried (min 2 approaches)\n3. Suggest alternatives\n4. Set STATUS: BLOCKED, EXIT_SIGNAL: false\n5. Wait for input\n\n### If Circuit Breaker OPENS\n\n1. State: \"Circuit breaker OPEN - halting\"\n2. Summarize accomplishments\n3. Describe stagnation pattern\n4. Set CIRCUIT: OPEN, EXIT_SIGNAL: false\n5. Recommend next steps\n\n**Never infinite loop on a blocker.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:34:04.083Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for advanced AI Agents like Claude Code, seeking to implement autonomous development loops with dual-condition exit gates and slash command integrations.","zh":"适合于像 Claude Code 这样的高级 AI 代理，旨在实现具有双重条件退出门和斜杠命令集成的自治开发循环。","ja":"Claude Code のような高度な AI エージェントに適しており、双条件終了ゲートとスラッシュコマンド統合を備えた自律的な開発ループを実現することを目指しています。","ko":"Claude Code 와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 이중 조건 종료 게이트 및 슬래시 명령 통합을 갖춘 자율적인 개발 루프를 구현하려고 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude Code, que buscan implementar bucles de desarrollo autónomos con puertas de salida de doble condición y integraciones de comandos de barra diagonal.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés comme Claude Code, cherchant à mettre en œuvre des boucles de développement autonomes avec des portes de sortie à double condition et des intégrations de commandes de barre oblique.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agenten wie Claude Code, die autarke Entwicklungszyklen mit doppelbedingten Ausgangstoren und Schrägstrich-Befehlsintegrationen umsetzen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA avançados, como Claude Code, que buscam implementar loops de desenvolvimento autônomo com portas de saída de condição dupla e integrações de comandos de barra.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, стремящихся реализовать автономные циклы разработки с двойными условиями выхода и интеграцией команд с косой чертой.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل Claude Code ، الذي يبحث عن تنفيذ حلقات التطوير المستقلة مع بوابات الخروج الشرطية المزدوجة وتكامل أوامر الشرطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain continuous workflow using subagents, hooks, and configurations, ensuring seamless execution and exit only when both completion indicators and explicit exit signals are met, leveraging techniques like Ralph and Boris Cherny''s workflow.","zh":"赋予代理维持连续工作流的能力，使用子代理、钩子和配置，确保无缝执行，只有当同时满足完成指标和显式退出信号时才退出，利用 Ralph 和 Boris Cherny 的工作流技术。","ja":"サブエージェント、フック、および構成を使用して、エージェントが連続したワークフローを維持できるようにし、完了指標と明示的な終了信号の両方が満たされた場合にのみ終了することを保証し、Ralph および Boris Cherny のワークフロー技術を利用します。","ko":"서브 에이전트, 후크 및 구성 등을 사용하여 에이전트가 연속적인 워크플ロー를 유지할 수 있도록 하며, 완료 지표 및 명시적인 종료 신호가 모두 충족될 때만 종료되도록 보장하며, Ralph 및 Boris Cherny 의 워크플로 기술을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener un flujo de trabajo continuo utilizando subagentes, ganchos y configuraciones, garantizando una ejecución sin problemas y la salida solo cuando se cumplen tanto los indicadores de finalización como las señales de salida explícitas, aprovechando técnicas como las de Ralph y Boris Cherny''s workflow.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir un flux de travail continu en utilisant des sous-agents, des crochets et des configurations, assurant une exécution sans problème et la sortie uniquement lorsque les indicateurs d''achèvement et les signaux de sortie explicites sont satisfaits, en utilisant des techniques comme celles de Ralph et du flux de travail de Boris Cherny.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, einen kontinuierlichen Arbeitsablauf mithilfe von Subagenten, Haken und Konfigurationen aufrechtzuerhalten, wodurch eine reibungslose Ausführung und ein Ausgang nur dann gewährleistet sind, wenn sowohl die Abschlussindikatoren als auch die expliziten Ausgangssignale erfüllt sind, unter Nutzung von Techniken wie denen von Ralph und Boris Cherny''s Workflow.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um fluxo de trabalho contínuo usando subagentes, ganchos e configurações, garantindo a execução sem problemas e saída apenas quando os indicadores de conclusão e sinais de saída explícitos sejam atendidos, aproveitando técnicas como Ralph e Boris Cherny''s workflow.","ru":"Позволяет агентам поддерживать непрерывный рабочий процесс, используя субагентов, крючки и конфигурации, обеспечивая бесперебойное выполнение и выход только тогда, когда выполнены индикаторы завершения и явные сигналы выхода, используя техники, такие как Ralph и рабочий процесс Boris Cherny.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من الحفاظ على تدفق العمل المستمر باستخدام الوكلاء التابعين والصواميل والتهيئة ، وضمان التنفيذ السلس والخروج فقط عند استيفاء مؤشرات الانتهاء والإشارات الخروج الصريحة ، واستخدام تقنيات مثل رالف و Борис تشيرني ورشة العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing autonomous loops with dual-condition exit gates for robust workflow management","Configuring slash commands for efficient task execution and management in Claude Code","Integrating subagents and hooks for enhanced automation and customization capabilities"],"zh":["实现具有双重条件退出门的自治循环，用于强大的工作流管理","在 Claude Code 中配置斜杠命令，用于高效的任务执行和管理","集成子代理和钩子，用于增强的自动化和定制能力"],"ja":["双条件終了ゲートを備えた自律ループを実現し、堅牢なワークフローマネジメントを実現する","Claude Code 内でスラッシュコマンドを構成し、効率的なタスクの実行と管理を実現する","サブエージェントとフックを統合し、強化された自動化とカスタマイズ能力を実現する"],"ko":["이중 조건 종료 게이트를 갖춘 자율 루프를 구현하여 강력한 워크플ロー 관리를 실현한다","Claude Code 내에서 슬래시 명령을 구성하여 효율적인 태스크 실행 및 관리를 실현한다","서브 에이전트 및 후크를 통합하여 강화된 자동화 및 사용자 정의 능력을 실현한다"],"es":["Implementar bucles autónomos con puertas de salida de doble condición para una gestión robusta del flujo de trabajo","Configurar comandos de barra diagonal para una ejecución y gestión de tareas eficientes en Claude Code","Integrar subagentes y ganchos para mejorar las capacidades de automatización y personalización"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des boucles autonomes avec des portes de sortie à double condition pour une gestion robuste du flux de travail","Configurer des commandes de barre oblique pour une exécution et une gestion de tâches efficaces dans Claude Code","Intégrer des sous-agents et des crochets pour améliorer les capacités d''automatisation et de personnalisation"],"de":["Autarke Zyklen mit doppelbedingten Ausgangstoren für eine robuste Arbeitsflussverwaltung implementieren","Schrägstrich-Befehle für eine effiziente Aufgabenausführung und -verwaltung in Claude Code konfigurieren","Subagenten und Haken integrieren, um die Automatisierungs- und Anpassungsfähigkeiten zu verbessern"],"pt":["Implementando loops autônomos com portas de saída de condição dupla para gestão robusta de fluxo de trabalho","Configurando comandos de barra para execução eficiente de tarefas e gestão em Claude Code","Integrando subagentes e ganchos para capacidades de automação e personalização aprimoradas"],"ru":["Реализация автономных циклов с двойными условиями выхода для прочной системы управления рабочим процессом","Настройка команд с косой чертой для эффективного выполнения задач и управления в Claude Code","Интеграция субагентов и крючков для улучшения возможностей автоматизации и настройки"],"ar":["تنفيذ الحلقات المستقلة مع بوابات الخروج الشرطية المزدوجة لإدارة تدفق العمل القوية","تهيئة أوامر الشرطة للتنفيذ الفعال للمهام وإدارتها في Claude Code","دمج الوكلاء التابعين والصواميل لتحسين قدرات التutomatisation والتخصيص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code setup and integration","Dependent on Boris Cherny''s workflow and Ralph technique for optimal performance","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true required for premature exit prevention"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 的设置和集成","依赖于 Boris Cherny 的工作流和 Ralph 技术以获得最佳性能","需要显式的 EXIT_SIGNAL: true 以防止过早退出"],"ja":["Claude Code の設定と統合が必要","Boris Cherny のワークフローと Ralph 技術に依存して最適なパフォーマンスを実現する","EXIT_SIGNAL: true を明示的に指定して、過早な終了を防止する必要がある"],"ko":["Claude Code 의 설정 및 통합이 필요하다","Boris Cherny 의 워크플로 및 Ralph 기술에 의존하여 최적의 성능을 실현한다","EXIT_SIGNAL: true 를 명시적으로 지정하여过早한 종료를 방지해야 한다"],"es":["Requiere configuración e integración de Claude Code","Depende del flujo de trabajo de Boris Cherny y la técnica de Ralph para un rendimiento óptimo","Se requiere EXIT_SIGNAL: true explícito para prevenir la salida prematura"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une intégration de Claude Code","Dépend du flux de travail de Boris Cherny et de la technique de Ralph pour des performances optimales","Un signal de sortie explicite EXIT_SIGNAL: true est requis pour prévenir une sortie prématurée"],"de":["Benötigt Claude Code-Einrichtung und -integration","Hängt von Boris Cherny''s Workflow und der Ralph-Technik für optimale Leistung ab","Ein explizites EXIT_SIGNAL: true ist erforderlich, um einen vorzeitigen Ausgang zu verhindern"],"pt":["Exige configuração e integração do Claude Code","Depende do fluxo de trabalho de Boris Cherny e da técnica Ralph para desempenho ótimo","EXIT_SIGNAL: true explícito necessário para prevenir saída prematura"],"ru":["Требует настройки и интеграции с Claude Code","Зависит от рабочего процесса Boris Cherny и техники Ralph для оптимальной производительности","Явный сигнал EXIT_SIGNAL: true необходим для предотвращения преждевременного выхода"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكامل Claude Code","يعتمد على ورشة عمل Boris Cherny و تقنية رالف للأداء الأمثل","EXIT_SIGNAL: true صريح مطلوب لمنع الخروج المسبق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
