idator 是一个用于验证代码提交消息的工具，确保提交遵循 Conventional Commits 规范","ja":"Commit Validator はコードのコミットメッセージを検証するツールで、コミットが Conventional Commits 規約に従っていることを確認します","ko":"Commit Validator는 코드 제출 메시지를 검증하는 도구로 제출이 Conventional Commits 규격을 따르는지 확인합니다","es":"Commit-validator es una herramienta que valida mensajes de commit según la especificación Conventional Commits.","fr":"Commit-validator est un outil qui valide les messages de commit selon la spécification Conventional Commits.","de":"Commit-validator ist ein Tool, das Commit-Nachrichten gemäß der Conventional Commits-Spezifikation validiert.","pt":"O commit-validator é uma ferramenta que valida mensagens de commit de acordo com a especificação Conventional Commits, garantindo a consistência e a clareza ...","ru":"Валидатор коммитов - это инструмент, который проверяет сообщения коммитов в соответствии со спецификацией Conventional Commits, обеспечивая согласованность и...","ar":"مصادق-التزام هو أداة لتحقق من رسائل الالتزام وفقًا لمواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية، مما يضمن الاتساق ووضوح السجلات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 Conventional Commits 规范","可用于 pre-commit hooks","可用于 CI/CD 流水线","可用于代码审查","程序化提交验证"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 規約をサポート","pre-commit hooks で使用可能","CI/CD パイプラインで使用可能","コードレビューで使用可能","プログラムによるコミット検証"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 규격 지원","pre-commit hooks에서 사용 가능","CI/CD 파이프라인에서 사용 가능","코드 리뷰에서 사용 가능","프로그램에 의한 제출 검증"],"es":["Validación de mensajes de commit","Compatibilidad con pre-commit hooks","Integración con pipelines de CI/CD","Verificación durante la revisión de código","Cumplimiento con la especificación Conventional Commits"],"fr":["Validation des messages de commit","Compatibilité avec les hooks de pré-commit","Intégration avec les pipelines de CI/CD","Vérification pendant la révision de code","Respect de la spécification Conventional Commits"],"de":["Validierung von Commit-Nachrichten","Kompatibilität mit Pre-Commit-Hooks","Integration mit CI/CD-Pipelines","Überprüfung während der Code-Überprüfung","Einhaltung der Conventional Commits-Spezifikation"],"pt":["Validação de mensagens de commit","Compatibilidade com a especificação Conventional Commits","Integração com hooks de pré-commit","Uso em pipelines de CI/CD","Verificação durante a revisão de código"],"ru":["Проверка сообщений коммитов","Совместимость со спецификацией Conventional Commits","Интеграция с хуками pré-commit","Использование в конвейерах CI/CD","Проверка во время ревизии кода"],"ar":["التحقق من رسائل الالتزام","التوافق مع مواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية","التكامل مع hooks من قبل الالتزام","استخدامها في أنابيب CI/CD","التحقق أثناء مراجعة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["提交验证","Conventional Commits","pre-commit hooks","CI/CD 流水线","代码审查","提交消息验证"],"ja":["コミット検証","Conventional Commits","pre-commit hooks","CI/CD パイプライン","コードレビュー","コミットメッセージ検証"],"ko":["제출 검증","Conventional Commits","pre-commit hooks","CI/CD 파이프라인","코드 리뷰","제출 메시지 검증"],"es":["validador de commits","conventional commits","pre-commit hooks","pipelines de CI/CD","revisión de código","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["validateur de commits","conventional commits","hooks de pré-commit","pipelines de CI/CD","révision de code","développement de logiciels"],"de":["commit-validator","conventional commits","pre-commit-hooks","CI/CD-Pipelines","Code-Überprüfung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["commit-validator","validação de commit","Conventional Commits","hooks de pré-commit","pipelines de CI/CD","revisão de código"],"ru":["валидатор коммитов","проверка коммитов","Conventional Commits","хуки pré-commit","конвейеры CI/CD","ревизия кода"],"ar":["مصادق-التزام","التحقق من الالتزام","الالتزامات التقليدية","hooks من قبل الالتزام","أنابيب CI/CD","مراجعة الكود"]}},"owner":"oimiragieo","repo":"agent-studio","repoPath":"oimiragieo/agent-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-validator","description":"Validates commit messages against Conventional Commits specification using programmatic validation. Replaces the git-conventional-commit-messages text file with a tool that provides instant feedback.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"**References (archive):** [SCAFFOLD_SKILLS_ARCHIVE_MAP.md](../../docs/SCAFFOLD_SKILLS_ARCHIVE_MAP.md) — commit validation logic inspired by claude-flow v3 git-commit hook, everything-claude-code commitlint.\n\n<identity>\nCommit Message Validator - Programmatically validates commit messages against the [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) specification.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Before committing code\n- In pre-commit hooks\n- In CI/CD pipelines\n- During code review\n- To e","body":"**References (archive):** [SCAFFOLD_SKILLS_ARCHIVE_MAP.md](../../docs/SCAFFOLD_SKILLS_ARCHIVE_MAP.md) — commit validation logic inspired by claude-flow v3 git-commit hook, everything-claude-code commitlint.\n\n<identity>\nCommit Message Validator - Programmatically validates commit messages against the [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) specification.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Before committing code\n- In pre-commit hooks\n- In CI/CD pipelines\n- During code review\n- To enforce team standards\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\n<execution_process>\n\n### Step 1: Validate Commit Message\n\nValidate a commit message string against Conventional Commits format:\n\n**Format**: `<type>(<scope>): <subject>`\n\n**Types**:\n\n- `feat`: A new feature\n- `fix`: A bug fix\n- `docs`: Documentation only changes\n- `style`: Code style changes (formatting, etc.)\n- `refactor`: Code refactoring\n- `perf`: Performance improvements\n- `test`: Adding or updating tests\n- `chore`: Maintenance tasks\n- `ci`: CI/CD changes\n- `build`: Build system changes\n- `revert`: Reverting a previous commit\n\n**Validation Rules**:\n\n1. Must start with type (required)\n2. Scope is optional (in parentheses)\n3. Subject is required (after colon and space)\n4. Use imperative, present tense (\"add\" not \"added\")\n5. Don''t capitalize first letter\n6. No period at end\n7. Can include body and footer (separated by blank line)\n   </execution_process>\n   </instructions>\n\n<examples>\n<code_example>\n**Implementation**\n\nUse this regex pattern for validation:\n\n```javascript\nconst CONVENTIONAL_COMMIT_REGEX =\n  /^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|chore|ci|build|revert)(\\(.+\\))?: .{1,72}/;\n\nfunction validateCommitMessage(message) {\n  const lines = message.trim().split(''\\n'');\n  const header = lines[0];\n\n  // Check format\n  if (!CONVENTIONAL_COMMIT_REGEX.test(header)) {\n    return {\n      valid: false,\n      error: ''Commit message does not follow Conventional Commits format'',\n    };\n  }\n\n  // Check length\n  if (header.length > 72) {\n    return {\n      valid: false,\n      error: ''Commit header exceeds 72 characters'',\n    };\n  }\n\n  return { valid: true };\n}\n```\n\n</code_example>\n\n<code_example>\n**Valid Examples**:\n\n```\nfeat(auth): add OAuth2 login support\nfix(api): resolve timeout issue in user endpoint\ndocs(readme): update installation instructions\nrefactor(components): extract common button logic\ntest(utils): add unit tests for date formatting\n```\n\n</code_example>\n\n<code_example>\n**Invalid Examples**:\n\n```\nAdded new feature  # Missing type\nfeat:new feature   # Missing space after colon\nFEAT: Add feature  # Type should be lowercase\nfeat: Added feature  # Should use imperative tense\n```\n\n</code_example>\n\n<code_example>\n**Pre-commit Hook** (`.git/hooks/pre-commit`):\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\ncommit_msg=$(git log -1 --pretty=%B)\nif ! node .claude/tools/validate-commit.mjs \"$commit_msg\"; then\n  echo \"Commit message validation failed\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n</code_example>\n\n<code_example>\n**CI/CD Integration**:\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/validate-commits.yml\n- name: Validate commit messages\n  run: |\n    git log origin/main..HEAD --pretty=%B | while read msg; do\n      node .claude/tools/validate-commit.mjs \"$msg\" || exit 1\n    done\n```\n\n</code_example>\n</examples>\n\n<examples>\n<formatting_example>\n**Output Format**\n\nReturns structured validation result:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"type\": \"feat\",\n  \"scope\": \"auth\",\n  \"subject\": \"add OAuth2 login support\",\n  \"warnings\": []\n}\n```\n\nOr for invalid messages:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"valid\": false,\n  \"error\": \"Commit message does not follow Conventional Commits format\",\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"Use format: <type>(<scope>): <subject>\",\n    \"Valid types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore, ci, build, revert\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n</formatting_example>\n</examples>\n\n<examples>\n<usage_example>\n**Example Commands**:\n\n```bash\n# Validate a commit message\nnode .claude/tools/validate-commit.mjs \"feat(auth): implement jwt login\"\n\n# Validate from stdin (e.g. in a hook)\necho \"fix: incorrect variable name\" | node .claude/tools/validate-commit.mjs\n```\n\n</usage_example>\n</examples>\n\n<instructions>\n<best_practices>\n1. **Validate Early**: Check commit messages before pushing\n2. **Provide Feedback**: Show clear error messages with suggestions\n3. **Enforce in CI**: Add validation to CI/CD pipelines\n4. **Team Training**: Educate team on Conventional Commits format\n5. **Tool Integration**: Integrate with Git hooks and IDEs\n</best_practices>\n</instructions>\n\n## Memory Protocol (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before starting:**\nRead `.claude/context/memory/learnings.md`\n\n**After completing:**\n\n- New pattern -> `.claude/context/memory/learnings.md`\n- Issue found -> `.claude/context/memory/issues.md`\n- Decision made -> `.claude/context/memory/decisions.md`\n\n> ASSUME INTERRUPTION: If it''s not in memory, it didn''t happen.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:33:50.184Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing standardized commit message validation against the Conventional Commits specification.","zh":"适用于需要标准化提交消息验证的代码审查代理，验证标准基于 Conventional Commits 规范。","ja":"Conventional Commits 規格に対する標準化されたコミットメッセージの検証が必要なコードレビューエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Conventional Commits 사양에 대한 표준화된 커밋 메시지 유효성을 필요로 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una validación de mensajes de confirmación estandarizados contra la especificación de Commits Convencionales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une validation de messages de commit standardisés contre la spécification Conventional Commits.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine standardisierte Validierung von Commit-Nachrichten gegen die Conventional Commits-Spezifikation benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de validação de mensagens de compromisso padronizadas contra a especificação Conventional Commits.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих стандартизированной проверки сообщений о коммитах против спецификации Conventional Commits.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تحقق رسائل الالتزام المعيارية ضد مواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce consistent commit formatting using Conventional Commits, integrating seamlessly with pre-commit hooks and CI/CD pipelines through commitlint and git-commit hooks.","zh":"赋予代理执行一致的提交格式，使用 Conventional Commits，并通过 commitlint 和 git-commit hooks 无缝集成到预提交钩子和 CI/CD 流水线中。","ja":"Conventional Commits を使用して一貫したコミット形式を実施し、commitlint と git-commit hooks を介して事前コミットフックと CI/CD パイプラインにシームレスに統合します。","ko":"Conventional Commits를 사용하여 일관된 커밋 형식을 적용하고 commitlint 및 git-commit hooks를 통해 사전 커밋 훅과 CI/CD 파이프라인에无缝하게 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un formato de confirmación coherente utilizando Commits Convencionales, integrándose perfectamente con ganchos pre-commit y tuberías de CI/CD a través de commitlint y ganchos de git-commit.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un formatage de commit cohérent en utilisant Conventional Commits, s''intégrant parfaitement avec des crochets pré-commit et des pipelines CI/CD via commitlint et des crochets git-commit.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ein konsistentes Commit-Formatierung unter Verwendung von Conventional Commits durchzusetzen, indem es nahtlos in Pre-Commit-Hooks und CI/CD-Pipelines über commitlint und Git-Commit-Hooks integriert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor uma formatação de compromisso consistente usando Conventional Commits, integrando-se perfeitamente com ganchos pré-compromisso e pipelines de CI/CD por meio de commitlint e ganchos de git-commit.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать последовательное форматирование коммитов с помощью Conventional Commits, интегрируясь без проблем с крючками предкоммита и конвейерами CI/CD через commitlint и крючки git-commit.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض تنسيق التزامات متسق باستخدام الالتزامات التقليدية، متكاملًا بشكل مت杰ز مع الإشعارات السابقة للالتزام والأنابيب CI/CD من خلال commitlint و الإشعارات git-commit."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating commit messages against Conventional Commits standards","Automating code review processes for commit consistency","Integrating commit validation into CI/CD pipelines for enhanced code quality"],"zh":["验证提交消息是否符合 Conventional Commits 标准","自动化代码审查流程以确保提交一致性","将提交验证集成到 CI/CD 流水线中以提高代码质量"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 標準へのコミットメッセージの検証","コミットの一貫性を確保するためのコードレビューの自動化","コード品質の向上のための CI/CD パイプラインへのコミット検証の統合"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 표준에 대한 커밋 메시지 유효성 검사","커밋 일관성을 보장하기 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","코드 품질 향상을 위한 CI/CD 파이프라인への 커밋 유효성 검사 통합"],"es":["Validar mensajes de confirmación contra los estándares de Commits Convencionales","Automatizar procesos de revisión de código para la coherencia de los commits","Integrar la validación de commits en tuberías de CI/CD para una mayor calidad del código"],"fr":["Valider les messages de commit contre les normes Conventional Commits","Automatiser les processus de revue de code pour la cohérence des commits","Intégrer la validation des commits dans les pipelines CI/CD pour une qualité de code améliorée"],"de":["Validieren von Commit-Nachrichten gegen die Standards der Conventional Commits","Automatisieren von Code-Review-Prozessen für die Konsistenz von Commits","Integrieren der Commit-Validierung in CI/CD-Pipelines für eine verbesserte Codequalität"],"pt":["Validar mensagens de compromisso contra os padrões Conventional Commits","Automatizar processos de revisão de código para consistência de compromisso","Integrar a validação de compromisso em pipelines de CI/CD para melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Проверка сообщений о коммитах на соответствие стандартам Conventional Commits","Автоматизация процессов кодового обзора для последовательности коммитов","Интеграция проверки коммитов в конвейеры CI/CD для повышения качества кода"],"ar":["تحقق رسائل الالتزام ضد معايير الالتزامات التقليدية","تأتمتة عمليات مراجعة الكود من أجل اتساق الالتزام","دمج التحقق من الالتزام في أنابيب CI/CD من أجل تحسين جودة الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of Conventional Commits specification","Limited to validation of commit messages only"],"zh":["需要实现 Conventional Commits 规范","仅限于提交消息的验证"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 規格の実装が必要","コミットメッセージの検証のみに限定される"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 사양의 구현이 필요","커밋 메시지의 유효성 검사만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la implementación de la especificación de Commits Convencionales","Limitado a la validación de mensajes de confirmación solo"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre de la spécification Conventional Commits","Limité à la validation des messages de commit uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung der Conventional Commits-Spezifikation","Begrenzt auf die Validierung von Commit-Nachrichten nur"],"pt":["Exige a implementação da especificação Conventional Commits","Limitado apenas à validação de mensagens de compromisso"],"ru":["Требует реализации спецификации Conventional Commits","Ограничен только проверкой сообщений о коммитах"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ مواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية","محدود فقط بالتحقق من رسائل الالتزام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
