ーで定義された markdown ファイルであり、開発環境を設定するために使用されます","ko":"Hookify 규칙은 YAML 프론트매터를 통해 정의된 마크다운 파일로서 개발 환경 설정을 위해 사용됩니다","es":"Las reglas de Hookify permiten una configuración rápida y personalizada de tu entorno de desarrollo","fr":"Les règles Hookify permettent une configuration rapide et personnalisée de votre environnement de développement","de":"Die Hookify-Regeln ermöglichen eine schnelle und benutzerdefinierte Konfiguration Ihrer Entwicklungsumgebung","pt":"As regras Hookify são arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML que definem padrões para assistir e mensagens para exibir quando esses padrões coincidem","ru":"Правила Hookify - это файлы markdown с YAML-фронтом, определяющие шаблоны для наблюдения и сообщения для отображения, когда эти шаблоны совпадают","ar":"قواعد Hookify هي ملفات markdown مع YAML frontmatter التي تعرف الأنماط للمراقبة والرسائل لإظهارها عند مطابقة هذه الأنماط","en":"Fast way of configuring my dev setup"},"definition":{"en":"Fast way of configuring my dev setup"},"features":{"zh":["支持 YAML 前置格式","定义模式和消息","存储在 `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` 文件中","支持 bash、file、stop、prompt 和 all 事件","支持正则表达式模式"],"ja":["YAML フロントマターをサポート","パターンとメッセージを定義","`.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` ファイルに保存","bash、file、stop、prompt、all イベントをサポート","正規表現パターンをサポート"],"ko":["YAML 프론트매터를 지원","패턴과 메시지를 정의","`.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` 파일에 저장","bash, file, stop, prompt, all 이벤트를 지원","정규식 패턴을 지원"],"es":["Archivos markdown con frontmatter YAML","Definición de patrones y mensajes personalizados","Almacenamiento en archivos `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Compatibilidad con eventos como bash, file, stop, prompt y all","Soporte para formato de mensaje con markdown y advertencias"],"fr":["Fichiers markdown avec frontmatter YAML","Définition de modèles et de messages personnalisés","Stockage dans des fichiers `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Compatibilité avec des événements tels que bash, file, stop, prompt et all","Prise en charge du format de message avec markdown et avertissements"],"de":["Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter","Definition von Mustern und benutzerdefinierten Nachrichten","Speicherung in Dateien `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Kompatibilität mit Ereignissen wie bash, file, stop, prompt und all","Unterstützung für Nachrichtenformat mit markdown und Warnungen"],"pt":["Definição de padrões com expressões regulares","Exibição de mensagens personalizadas","Suporte a vários eventos","Arquivos de configuração em formato markdown","Frontmatter YAML para definição de metadados"],"ru":["Определение шаблонов с помощью регулярных выражений","Отображение пользовательских сообщений","Поддержка нескольких событий","Файлы конфигурации в формате markdown","Frontmatter YAML для определения метаданных"],"ar":["تعريف الأنماط باستخدام التعبيرات العادية","إظهار رسائل مخصصة","دعم عدة أحداث","ملفات التهيئة بفورمت markdown","Frontmatter YAML لتعريف البيانات الوصفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Hookify 规则","开发环境配置","YAML 前置格式","markdown 文件","模式和消息","bash 事件","file 事件","stop 事件","prompt 事件","all 事件"],"ja":["Hookify ルール","開発環境設定","YAML フロントマター","markdown ファイル","パターンとメッセージ","bash イベント","file イベント","stop イベント","prompt イベント","all イベント"],"ko":["Hookify 규칙","개발 환경 설정","YAML 프론트매터","마크다운 파일","패턴과 메시지","bash 이벤트","file 이벤트","stop 이벤트","prompt 이벤트","all 이벤트"],"es":["reglas de Hookify","configuración de desarrollo","markdown","YAML","patrones y mensajes","desarrollo de software","productividad de desarrollo"],"fr":["règles Hookify","configuration de développement","markdown","YAML","modèles et messages","développement de logiciels","productivité de développement"],"de":["Hookify-Regeln","Entwicklungskonfiguration","markdown","YAML","Muster und Nachrichten","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungsproduktivität"],"pt":["regras hookify","configuração de desenvolvimento","ambientes de desenvolvimento","expressões regulares","markdown","yaml","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["правила hookify","настройка разработки","среды разработки","регулярные выражения","markdown","yaml","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность разработки"],"ar":["قواعد hookify","تهيئة التطوير","بيئات التطوير","التعبيرات العادية","markdown","yaml","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية التطوير"]}},"owner":"BartekFo","repo":"my-dev-setup","repoPath":"BartekFo/my-dev-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Writing Hookify Rules","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a hookify rule, write a hook rule, configure hookify, add a hookify rule, or needs guidance on hookify rule syntax and patterns.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggest","body":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggestions, etc.\n```\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\n**name** (required): Unique identifier for the rule\n- Use kebab-case: `warn-dangerous-rm`, `block-console-log`\n- Be descriptive and action-oriented\n- Start with verb: warn, prevent, block, require, check\n\n**enabled** (required): Boolean to activate/deactivate\n- `true`: Rule is active\n- `false`: Rule is disabled (won''t trigger)\n- Can toggle without deleting rule\n\n**event** (required): Which hook event to trigger on\n- `bash`: Bash tool commands\n- `file`: Edit, Write, MultiEdit tools\n- `stop`: When agent wants to stop\n- `prompt`: When user submits a prompt\n- `all`: All events\n\n**action** (optional): What to do when rule matches\n- `warn`: Show message but allow operation (default)\n- `block`: Prevent operation (PreToolUse) or stop session (Stop events)\n- If omitted, defaults to `warn`\n\n**pattern** (simple format): Regex pattern to match\n- Used for simple single-condition rules\n- Matches against command (bash) or new_text (file)\n- Python regex syntax\n\n**Example:**\n```yaml\nevent: bash\npattern: rm\\s+-rf\n```\n\n### Advanced Format (Multiple Conditions)\n\nFor complex rules with multiple conditions:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: warn-env-file-edits\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.env$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: API_KEY\n---\n\nYou''re adding an API key to a .env file. Ensure this file is in .gitignore!\n```\n\n**Condition fields:**\n- `field`: Which field to check\n  - For bash: `command`\n  - For file: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- `operator`: How to match\n  - `regex_match`: Regex pattern matching\n  - `contains`: Substring check\n  - `equals`: Exact match\n  - `not_contains`: Substring must NOT be present\n  - `starts_with`: Prefix check\n  - `ends_with`: Suffix check\n- `pattern`: Pattern or string to match\n\n**All conditions must match for rule to trigger.**\n\n## Message Body\n\nThe markdown content after frontmatter is shown to Claude when the rule triggers.\n\n**Good messages:**\n- Explain what was detected\n- Explain why it''s problematic\n- Suggest alternatives or best practices\n- Use formatting for clarity (bold, lists, etc.)\n\n**Example:**\n```markdown\n⚠️ **Console.log detected!**\n\nYou''re adding console.log to production code.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Debug logs shouldn''t ship to production\n- Console.log can expose sensitive data\n- Impacts browser performance\n\n**Alternatives:**\n- Use a proper logging library\n- Remove before committing\n- Use conditional debug builds\n```\n\n## Event Type Guide\n\n### bash Events\n\nMatch Bash command patterns:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: bash\npattern: sudo\\s+|rm\\s+-rf|chmod\\s+777\n---\n\nDangerous command detected!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Dangerous commands: `rm\\s+-rf`, `dd\\s+if=`, `mkfs`\n- Privilege escalation: `sudo\\s+`, `su\\s+`\n- Permission issues: `chmod\\s+777`, `chown\\s+root`\n\n### file Events\n\nMatch Edit/Write/MultiEdit operations:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\npattern: console\\.log\\(|eval\\(|innerHTML\\s*=\n---\n\nPotentially problematic code pattern detected!\n```\n\n**Match on different fields:**\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.tsx?$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: console\\.log\\(\n---\n\nConsole.log in TypeScript file!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Debug code: `console\\.log\\(`, `debugger`, `print\\(`\n- Security risks: `eval\\(`, `innerHTML\\s*=`, `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`\n- Sensitive files: `\\.env$`, `credentials`, `\\.pem$`\n- Generated files: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`\n\n### stop Events\n\nMatch when agent wants to stop (completion checks):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: stop\npattern: .*\n---\n\nBefore stopping, verify:\n- [ ] Tests were run\n- [ ] Build succeeded\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n**Use for:**\n- Reminders about required steps\n- Completion checklists\n- Process enforcement\n\n### prompt Events\n\nMatch user prompt content (advanced):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: prompt\nconditions:\n  - field: user_prompt\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: deploy to production\n---\n\nProduction deployment checklist:\n- [ ] Tests passing?\n- [ ] Reviewed by team?\n- [ ] Monitoring ready?\n```\n\n## Pattern Writing Tips\n\n### Regex Basics\n\n**Literal characters:** Most characters match themselves\n- `rm` matches \"rm\"\n- `console.log` matches \"console.log\"\n\n**Special characters need escaping:**\n- `.` (any char) → `\\.` (literal dot)\n- `(` `)` → `\\(` `\\)` (literal parens)\n- `[` `]` → `\\[` `\\]` (literal brackets)\n\n**Common metacharacters:**\n- `\\s` - whitespace (space, tab, newline)\n- `\\d` - digit (0-9)\n- `\\w` - word character (a-z, A-Z, 0-9, _)\n- `.` - any character\n- `+` - one or more\n- `*` - zero or more\n- `?` - zero or one\n- `|` - OR\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nrm\\s+-rf         Matches: rm -rf, rm  -rf\nconsole\\.log\\(   Matches: console.log(\n(eval|exec)\\(    Matches: eval( or exec(\nchmod\\s+777      Matches: chmod 777, chmod  777\nAPI_KEY\\s*=      Matches: API_KEY=, API_KEY =\n```\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\nTest regex patterns before using:\n\n```bash\npython3 -c \"import re; print(re.search(r''your_pattern'', ''test text''))\"\n```\n\nOr use online regex testers (regex101.com with Python flavor).\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n**Too broad:**\n```yaml\npattern: log    # Matches \"log\", \"login\", \"dialog\", \"catalog\"\n```\nBetter: `console\\.log\\(|logger\\.`\n\n**Too specific:**\n```yaml\npattern: rm -rf /tmp  # Only matches exact path\n```\nBetter: `rm\\s+-rf`\n\n**Escaping issues:**\n- YAML quoted strings: `\"pattern\"` requires double backslashes `\\\\s`\n- YAML unquoted: `pattern: \\s` works as-is\n- **Recommendation**: Use unquoted patterns in YAML\n\n## File Organization\n\n**Location:** All rules in `.claude/` directory\n**Naming:** `.claude/hookify.{descriptive-name}.local.md`\n**Gitignore:** Add `.claude/*.local.md` to `.gitignore`\n\n**Good names:**\n- `hookify.dangerous-rm.local.md`\n- `hookify.console-log.local.md`\n- `hookify.require-tests.local.md`\n- `hookify.sensitive-files.local.md`\n\n**Bad names:**\n- `hookify.rule1.local.md` (not descriptive)\n- `hookify.md` (missing .local)\n- `danger.local.md` (missing hookify prefix)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Creating a Rule\n\n1. Identify unwanted behavior\n2. Determine which tool is involved (Bash, Edit, etc.)\n3. Choose event type (bash, file, stop, etc.)\n4. Write regex pattern\n5. Create `.claude/hookify.{name}.local.md` file in project root\n6. Test immediately - rules are read dynamically on next tool use\n\n### Refining a Rule\n\n1. Edit the `.local.md` file\n2. Adjust pattern or message\n3. Test immediately - changes take effect on next tool use\n\n### Disabling a Rule\n\n**Temporary:** Set `enabled: false` in frontmatter\n**Permanent:** Delete the `.local.md` file\n\n## Examples\n\nSee `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/examples/` for complete examples:\n- `dangerous-rm.local.md` - Block dangerous rm commands\n- `console-log-warning.local.md` - Warn about console.log\n- `sensitive-files-warning.local.md` - Warn about editing .env files\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Minimum viable rule:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: bash\npattern: dangerous_command\n---\n\nWarning message here\n```\n\n**Rule with conditions:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.ts$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: any\n---\n\nWarning message\n```\n\n**Event types:**\n- `bash` - Bash commands\n- `file` - File edits\n- `stop` - Completion checks\n- `prompt` - User input\n- `all` - All events\n\n**Field options:**\n- Bash: `command`\n- File: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- Prompt: `user_prompt`\n\n**Operators:**\n- `regex_match`, `contains`, `equals`, `not_contains`, `starts_with`, `ends_with`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:34:28.430Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing customized automation and notification setups through markdown-based Hookify rules","zh":"非常适合需要自定义自动化和通知设置的AI代理，如Claude、AutoGPT和LangChain，通过基于markdown的Hookify规则实现","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChainなどのカスタマイズされた自動化と通知設定が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。マークダウンベースのHookifyルールを使用して実現します","ko":"커스텀 자동화 및 알림 설정이 필요한 AI 에이전트인 Claude, AutoGPT, LangChain에 적합합니다. 마크다운 기반의 Hookify 규칙을 통해 구현됩니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan configuraciones de automatización y notificación personalizadas a través de reglas de Hookify basadas en markdown","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des paramétrages d''automatisation et de notification personnalisés via des règles Hookify basées sur markdown","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die benutzerdefinierte Automatisierungs- und Benachrichtigungseinstellungen über markdown-basierte Hookify-Regeln benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de configurações de automação e notificação personalizadas por meio de regras baseadas em markdown do Hookify","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуются настраиваемые автоматизация и настройки уведомлений через правила Hookify на основе markdown","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى إعدادات أتمتة وتفاصيل إشعار مخصصة من خلال قواعد Hookify المبنية على markdown"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and trigger custom messages based on specific patterns in files, bash commands, or prompts, utilizing YAML frontmatter and regex patterns in markdown files stored in the `.claude` directory","zh":"赋予代理定义和触发基于文件、bash命令或提示中特定模式的自定义消息的能力，利用YAML前置内容和markdown文件中的正则表达式模式，文件存储在`.claude`目录中","ja":"エージェントがファイル、bashコマンド、またはプロンプト内の特定のパターンに基づいてカスタムメッセージを定義およびトリガーする機能を提供します。YAMLフロントマターとマークダウンファイル内の正則表現パターンを使用して、`.claude`ディレクトリにファイルを保存します","ko":"파일, bash 명령 또는 프롬프트 내에서 특정 패턴을 기반으로 커스텀 메시지를 정의하고 트리거하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. YAML 프론트매터와 마크다운 파일 내의 정규 표현식 패턴을 사용하여 `.claude` 디렉토리에 파일을 저장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir y activar mensajes personalizados en función de patrones específicos en archivos, comandos de bash o solicitudes, utilizando frontmatter de YAML y patrones de regex en archivos de markdown almacenados en el directorio `.claude`","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et de déclencher des messages personnalisés en fonction de modèles spécifiques dans des fichiers, des commandes bash ou des invites, en utilisant le frontmatter YAML et les modèles de regex dans les fichiers markdown stockés dans le répertoire `.claude`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten basierend auf spezifischen Mustern in Dateien, Bash-Befehlen oder Prompts zu definieren und auszulösen, unter Verwendung von YAML-Frontmatter und Regex-Mustern in Markdown-Dateien, die im `.claude`-Verzeichnis gespeichert sind","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir e acionar mensagens personalizadas com base em padrões específicos em arquivos, comandos bash ou prompts, utilizando frontmatter YAML e padrões de regex em arquivos markdown armazenados no diretório `.claude`","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность определять и запускать пользовательские сообщения на основе конкретных шаблонов в файлах, командах bash или запросах, используя YAML-заголовки и шаблоны regex в файлах markdown, хранящихся в каталоге `.claude`","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تعريف وإرسال رسائل مخصصة بناءً على أنماط محددة في الملفات أو أوامر bash أو استجابات ، باستخدام YAML و أنماط regex في ملفات markdown المخزنة في الدليل `.claude`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating developer setup configurations","Generating custom notifications for specific file changes","Debugging regex patterns for precise event triggering"],"zh":["自动化开发者设置配置","为特定文件更改生成自定义通知","调试正则表达式以实现精确事件触发"],"ja":["開発者設定の自動化","特定のファイル変更に対するカスタム通知の生成","正確なイベントトリガーの実現のための正則表現のデバッグ"],"ko":["개발자 설정 구성 자동화","특정 파일 변경에 대한 커스텀 알림 생성","정확한 이벤트 트리거를 위한 정규 표현식 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de configuraciones de instalación de desarrolladores","Generación de notificaciones personalizadas para cambios de archivos específicos","Depuración de patrones de regex para un desencadenamiento de eventos preciso"],"fr":["Automatisation des paramétrages de configuration des développeurs","Génération de notifications personnalisées pour des modifications de fichiers spécifiques","Débogage des modèles de regex pour un déclenchement d''événements précis"],"de":["Automatisierung von Entwickler-Setup-Konfigurationen","Erzeugung von benutzerdefinierten Benachrichtigungen für bestimmte Dateiänderungen","Fehlerbehebung von Regex-Mustern für eine präzise Ereignisauslösung"],"pt":["Automatizar configurações de instalação do desenvolvedor","Gerar notificações personalizadas para alterações de arquivos específicas","Depurar padrões de regex para disparo de eventos precisos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройки установки разработчика","Генерировать пользовательские уведомления для конкретных изменений файлов","Отлаживать шаблоны regex для точного срабатывания событий"],"ar":["أتمتة إعدادات تثبيت المطور","إنشاء إشعارات مخصصة لتغييرات ملفات محددة","تصحيح أخطاء في أنماط regex لتنشيط أحداث دقيقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires storage of rules in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files","Dependent on YAML frontmatter and markdown formatting","Regex pattern knowledge necessary for effective rule creation"],"zh":["需要将规则存储在`.claude/hookify.{规则名称}.local.md`文件中","依赖于YAML前置内容和markdown格式","需要正则表达式知识来有效地创建规则"],"ja":["`.claude/hookify.{ルール名}.local.md`ファイルにルールを保存する必要がある","YAMLフロントマターとマークダウン形式に依存する","ルールの作成には正則表現の知識が必要"],"ko":["`.claude/hookify.{규칙 이름}.local.md` 파일에 규칙을 저장해야 함","YAML 프론트매터와 마크다운 형식에 의존","규칙을 효과적으로 생성하려면 정규 표현식 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere el almacenamiento de reglas en archivos `.claude/hookify.{nombre-de-regla}.local.md`","Dependiente del frontmatter de YAML y del formato de markdown","Conocimiento de patrones de regex necesario para la creación efectiva de reglas"],"fr":["Nécessite le stockage de règles dans des fichiers `.claude/hookify.{nom-de-règle}.local.md`","Dépendant du frontmatter YAML et du formatage markdown","Connaissance des modèles de regex nécessaire pour la création efficace de règles"],"de":["Erfordert die Speicherung von Regeln in Dateien `.claude/hookify.{regelname}.local.md`","Abhängig von YAML-Frontmatter und Markdown-Formatierung","Kenntnisse von Regex-Mustern erforderlich für die effektive Erstellung von Regeln"],"pt":["Requer armazenamento de regras em arquivos `.claude/hookify.{nome-da-regra}.local.md`","Dependente de frontmatter YAML e formatação markdown","Conhecimento de padrões de regex necessário para criação eficaz de regras"],"ru":["Требует хранения правил в файлах `.claude/hookify.{имя-правила}.local.md`","Зависит от YAML-заголовков и форматирования markdown","Знание шаблонов regex необходимо для эффективного создания правил"],"ar":["يتطلب تخزين القواعد في ملفات `.claude/hookify.{اسم-القاعدة}.local.md`","يعتمد على YAML وتنسيق markdown","معرفة أنماط regex ضرورية لإنشاء قواعد فعالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
