me: Suivi des Coûts et Résilience Cybersécurité","de":"Autonomer Kreislauf: Kostenoptimierung und Cybersicherhei...","pt":"Laço Autônomo de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Автономный Цикл Разработки","ar":"حلقلة التطوير الذاتي","en":"autonomous-loop"},"description":{"zh":"自主循环开发是一个开源的AI FinOps平台，提供LLM成本跟踪、云成本优化和网络安全能力","ja":"オートノマスループ開発は、オープンソースのAI FinOpsプラットフォームであり、LLMコスト追跡、クラウドコスト最適化、サイバーセキュリティ機能を提供","ko":"자율 루프 개발은 오픈소스의 AI FinOps 플랫폼으로, LLM 비용 추적, 클라우드 비용 최적화, 사이버 보안 기능을 제공","es":"El bucle autónomo es una plataforma de FinOps de código abierto que ofrece seguimiento de costos de LLM, optimización de costos en la nube y resiliencia cibe...","fr":"La boucle autonome est une plateforme FinOps open source qui propose un suivi des coûts de LLM, une optimisation des coûts dans le cloud et une résilience cy...","de":"Der autonome Kreislauf ist eine Open-Source-FinOps-Plattform, die LLM-Kostenverfolgung, Cloud-Kostenoptimierung und Cybersicherheitsresilienz bietet","pt":"O Laço Autônomo de Desenvolvimento é uma plataforma de FinOps de IA de código aberto que fornece rastreamento de custos de LLM, otimização de custos de nuvem...","ru":"Автономный Цикл Разработки - это открытая платформа FinOps ИИ, обеспечивающая отслеживание затрат LLM, оптимизацию облачных затрат и киберустойчивость","ar":"حلقلة التطوير الذاتي هي منصة FinOps الاصطناعية مفتوحة المصدر توفر تتبع تكاليف LLM وتحسين تكاليف السحابة والقدرة على الصمود الإلكتروني","en":"Open-source AI FinOps platform: LLM cost tracking, cloud cost optimization, and cyber resilience."},"definition":{"en":"Open-source AI FinOps platform: LLM cost tracking, cloud cost optimization, and cyber resilience."},"features":{"zh":["LLM成本跟踪","云成本优化","网络安全能力","自主循环开发模式","开源平台"],"ja":["LLMコスト追跡","クラウドコスト最適化","サイバーセキュリティ機能","オートノマスループ開発モード","オープンソースプラットフォーム"],"ko":["LLM 비용 추적","클라우드 비용 최적화","사이버 보안 기능","자율 루프 개발 모드","오픈소스 플랫폼"],"es":["Seguimiento de costos de LLM","Optimización de costos en la nube","Resiliencia cibernética","Desarrollo autónomo","Patrón de salida dual"],"fr":["Suivi des coûts de LLM","Optimisation des coûts dans le cloud","Résilience cybersécurité","Développement autonome","Modèle de sortie double"],"de":["LLM-Kostenverfolgung","Cloud-Kostenoptimierung","Cybersicherheitsresilienz","Autonomes Entwicklung","Duales Ausgangsmuster"],"pt":["Rastreamento de custos de LLM","Otimização de custos de nuvem","Resiliência cibernética","Desenvolvimento autônomo","Técnica de Ralph","Suporte à código aberto"],"ru":["Отслеживание затрат LLM","Оптимизация облачных затрат","Киберустойчивость","Автономное развитие","Техника Ральфа","Поддержка открытого кода"],"ar":["تتبع تكاليف LLM","تحسين تكاليف السحابة","القدرة على الصمود الإلكتروني","التطوير الذاتي","تقنية رالف","دعم الكود المفتوح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI FinOps","自主循环开发","LLM成本跟踪","云成本优化","网络安全","开源平台"],"ja":["AI FinOps","オートノマスループ開発","LLMコスト追跡","クラウドコスト最適化","サイバーセキュリティ","オープンソースプラットフォーム"],"ko":["AI FinOps","자율 루프 개발","LLM 비용 추적","클라우드 비용 최적화","사이버 보안","오픈소스 플랫폼"],"es":["bucle autónomo","FinOps","optimización de costos","resiliencia cibernética","desarrollo autónomo","LLM","cloud","seguridad cibernética"],"fr":["boucle autonome","FinOps","optimisation des coûts","résilience cybersécurité","développement autonome","LLM","cloud","sécurité cybersécurité"],"de":["autonome Kreislauf","FinOps","Kostenoptimierung","Cybersicherheitsresilienz","autonomes Entwicklung","LLM","Cloud","Cybersicherheit"],"pt":["Laço Autônomo de Desenvolvimento","FinOps de IA","Rastreamento de custos de LLM","Otimização de custos de nuvem","Resiliência cibernética","Desenvolvimento de software","Inteligência artificial","Técnica de Ralph","Código aberto"],"ru":["Автономный Цикл Разработки","FinOps ИИ","Отслеживание затрат LLM","Оптимизация облачных затрат","Киберустойчивость","Разработка программного обеспечения","Искусственный интеллект","Техника Ральфа","Открытый код"],"ar":["حلقلة التطوير الذاتي","FinOps الاصطناعية","تتبع تكاليف LLM","تحسين تكاليف السحابة","القدرة على الصمود الإلكتروني","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقنية رالف","الكود المفتوح"]}},"owner":"bigdegenenergy","repo":"open-cloud-ops","repoPath":"bigdegenenergy/open-cloud-ops","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"autonomous-loop","description":"Autonomous development loop patterns for iterative self-improvement. Auto-triggers when implementing features autonomously, fixing bugs in a loop, or running until completion. Based on frankbria/ralph-claude-code.","bodyPreview":"# Autonomous Development Loop\n\nBased on [@ghuntley''s Ralph technique](https://github.com/frankbria/ralph-claude-code) for Claude Code.\n\n> **For full autonomous mode, use `/ralph`.** This skill provides the underlying patterns.\n\n## Core Principle: Dual-Condition Exit Gate\n\n**Never exit prematurely.** Exit requires BOTH conditions:\n\n1. **Completion Indicators ≥ 2** - Heuristic detection from your work\n2. **Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true** - Your conscious declaration\n\n**If only ONE is true → KEEP GOIN","body":"# Autonomous Development Loop\n\nBased on [@ghuntley''s Ralph technique](https://github.com/frankbria/ralph-claude-code) for Claude Code.\n\n> **For full autonomous mode, use `/ralph`.** This skill provides the underlying patterns.\n\n## Core Principle: Dual-Condition Exit Gate\n\n**Never exit prematurely.** Exit requires BOTH conditions:\n\n1. **Completion Indicators ≥ 2** - Heuristic detection from your work\n2. **Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true** - Your conscious declaration\n\n**If only ONE is true → KEEP GOING**\n\nThis innovation (introduced in ralph-claude-code v0.9.9) prevents false exits when completion language appears during productive work.\n\n## Completion Indicators\n\nCount how many apply each loop:\n\n| Indicator         | Pattern                                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Tests passing     | 100% pass rate                             |\n| Fix plan complete | All `- [ ]` → `- [x]`                      |\n| \"Done\" language   | \"done\", \"complete\", \"finished\"             |\n| \"Nothing to do\"   | \"no changes needed\", \"already implemented\" |\n| \"Ready\" language  | \"ready for review\", \"ready to merge\"       |\n| No errors         | Zero execution errors                      |\n\n**Need ≥2 indicators + explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true to exit**\n\n## Circuit Breaker Pattern\n\nTrack your own progress and halt when stuck:\n\n| State         | Condition                | Action             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| **CLOSED**    | Normal operation         | Continue executing |\n| **HALF_OPEN** | 2 loops without progress | Increase scrutiny  |\n| **OPEN**      | Threshold exceeded       | HALT immediately   |\n\n### Halt Thresholds\n\n| Trigger           | Threshold     | Meaning             |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | ------------------- |\n| No progress loops | 3 consecutive | Spinning wheels     |\n| Identical errors  | 5 consecutive | Stuck on same issue |\n| Test-only loops   | 3 consecutive | Not implementing    |\n| Output decline    | >70% drop     | Something''s wrong   |\n\n## Progress Detection\n\nTrack mentally each loop:\n\n- **Files modified** (0 = no progress)\n- **Tests changed** (pass/fail delta)\n- **Tasks completed** (fix plan updates)\n- **Errors encountered** (same vs different)\n\n## Structured Status Reporting\n\n**Every response MUST end with:**\n\n```\n## Status Report\n\nSTATUS: IN_PROGRESS | COMPLETE | BLOCKED\nLOOP: [N]\nCIRCUIT: CLOSED | HALF_OPEN | OPEN\nEXIT_SIGNAL: false | true\n\nTASKS_COMPLETED: [what you finished]\nFILES_MODIFIED: [count and list]\nTESTS: [X/Y passing]\nERRORS: [count or \"none\"]\n\nPROGRESS_INDICATORS:\n- [x] Files changed this loop\n- [ ] Tests improved\n- [ ] Tasks marked complete\n- [ ] No repeated errors\n\nNEXT: [next action or \"done\"]\n```\n\n## Exit Signal Checklist\n\nBefore setting `EXIT_SIGNAL: true`, verify ALL:\n\n```\n□ All fix_plan.md items complete (or task done if no plan)\n□ All tests passing (or code works if no tests)\n□ No execution errors\n□ All requirements implemented\n□ No meaningful work remaining\n```\n\n**If ANY unchecked → EXIT_SIGNAL: false**\n\n## Work Focus Hierarchy\n\n| Activity             | Effort | Priority        |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| **Implementation**   | 60-70% | PRIMARY         |\n| **Testing**          | 15-20% | Secondary       |\n| **Fix Plan Updates** | 5-10%  | Tracking        |\n| **Documentation**    | 0-5%   | Only if needed  |\n| **Cleanup**          | 0-10%  | After core work |\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- **Premature exit**: Tests pass but tasks remain\n- **Infinite loops**: Not detecting repeated failures\n- **Busy work**: Testing without implementing\n- **Silent failures**: Not reporting errors clearly\n- **Scope creep**: Adding unplanned work\n- **Analysis paralysis**: Over-researching instead of implementing\n\n## Fix Plan Integration\n\nMaintain `fix_plan.md`:\n\n```markdown\n## High Priority\n\n- [ ] Critical task\n\n## Medium Priority\n\n- [ ] Supporting task\n\n## Completed\n\n- [x] Done item\n```\n\n**Empty fix plan + passing tests = consider exit**\n\n## Example: Why Dual-Gate Matters\n\n```\nLoop 5:\n  Output: \"Auth complete! Moving to sessions.\"\n  Indicators: 3 (tests pass, \"complete\", no errors)\n  EXIT_SIGNAL: false (Claude continuing)\n  Result: CONTINUE ✅ (respects intent)\n\nLoop 8:\n  Output: \"All done, tests green, ready for review.\"\n  Indicators: 4 (all signals present)\n  EXIT_SIGNAL: true (Claude done)\n  Result: EXIT ✅ (both conditions met)\n```\n\n## Recovery Protocols\n\n### If BLOCKED\n\n1. State: \"I am blocked because [reason]\"\n2. List what you tried (min 2 approaches)\n3. Suggest alternatives\n4. Set STATUS: BLOCKED, EXIT_SIGNAL: false\n5. Wait for input\n\n### If Circuit Breaker OPENS\n\n1. State: \"Circuit breaker OPEN - halting\"\n2. Summarize accomplishments\n3. Describe stagnation pattern\n4. Set CIRCUIT: OPEN, EXIT_SIGNAL: false\n5. Recommend next steps\n\n**Never infinite loop on a blocker.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:34:24.533Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing autonomous development and cost optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI Agent，需要具有自主开发和成本优化能力。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しています。自己開発とコスト最適化機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code와 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 자율적 개발과 비용 최적화 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo autónomo y optimización de costos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de développement autonome et d''optimisation des coûts.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die autarke Entwicklung und Kostenoptimierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento autônomo e otimização de custos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходимы возможности автономного развития и оптимизации затрат.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التطوير المستقل وتحسين التكلفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track LLM costs, optimize cloud expenses, and ensure cyber resilience using Dual-Condition Exit Gate and Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL protocols, leveraging techniques like Ralph for autonomous mode.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪大语言模型成本、优化云费用和确保网络安全的能力，使用双条件退出门和显式退出信号协议，利用像 Ralph 这样的技术实现自主模式。","ja":"エージェントに、大規模言語モデルコストの追跡、クラウド費用の最適化、サイバーリスクの回避を可能にします。デュアルコンディションエグジットゲートとエクスプリシットエグジットシグナルプロトコルを使用し、Ralph などのテクニックを利用して自律モードを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 대규모 언어 모델 비용 추적, 클라우드 비용 최적화 및 사이버 보안을 보장할 수 있도록 합니다. Dual-Condition Exit Gate와 Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL 프로토콜을 사용하여 Ralph와 같은 기술을 활용하여 자율 모드를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a rastrear los costos de LLM, optimizar los gastos en la nube y garantizar la resiliencia cibernética utilizando la puerta de salida de condición dual y los protocolos de señal de salida explícita, aprovechando técnicas como Ralph para el modo autónomo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les coûts de LLM, d''optimiser les dépenses cloud et d''assurer la résilience cybersécurité en utilisant la porte de sortie à condition double et les protocoles de signal de sortie explicite, en exploitant des techniques comme Ralph pour le mode autonome.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, LLM-Kosten zu verfolgen, Cloud-Ausgaben zu optimieren und Cybersicherheitsresilienz zu gewährleisten, indem sie das Dual-Condition-Exit-Gate und explizite EXIT_SIGNAL-Protokolle verwenden, wobei Techniken wie Ralph für den autonomen Modus genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear os custos dos LLM, otimizar as despesas de nuvem e garantir a resiliência cibernética usando o Dual-Condition Exit Gate e os protocolos Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL, aproveitando técnicas como Ralph para o modo autônomo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать затраты на LLM, оптимизировать расходы на облачные вычисления и обеспечивать киберустойчивость с использованием Dual-Condition Exit Gate и протоколов Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL, используя такие методы, как Ralph для автономного режима.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تتبع تكاليف LLM وتحسين نفقات السحابة وضمان المرونة الإلكترونية باستخدام Dual-Condition Exit Gate وبروتوكولات Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL، مستفيداً من تقنيات مثل Ralph للوضع المستقل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating cost tracking for large language models","Optimizing cloud costs for AI workloads","Implementing cyber resilience measures for AI systems"],"zh":["为大型语言模型自动化成本跟踪","为 AI 工作负载优化云成本","为 AI 系统实施网络安全措施"],"ja":["大規模言語モデルのコスト追跡の自動化","AI ワークロードのクラウドコスト最適化","AI システムのサイバーリスク対策の実施"],"ko":["대규모 언어 모델 비용 추적 자동화","AI 작업량 클라우드 비용 최적화","AI 시스템 사이버 보안 조치 구현"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de costos para grandes modelos de lenguaje","Optimización de costos en la nube para cargas de trabajo de IA","Implementación de medidas de resiliencia cibernética para sistemas de IA"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des coûts pour les grands modèles de langage","Optimisation des coûts cloud pour les charges de travail IA","Mise en œuvre de mesures de résilience cybersécurité pour les systèmes IA"],"de":["Automatisierung der Kostenverfolgung für große Sprachmodelle","Optimierung der Cloud-Kosten für KI-Workloads","Implementierung von Maßnahmen zur Cybersicherheitsresilienz für KI-Systeme"],"pt":["Automatizar o rastreamento de custos para grandes modelos de linguagem","Otimizar os custos de nuvem para cargas de trabalho de IA","Implementar medidas de resiliência cibernética para sistemas de IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание затрат для больших языковых моделей","Оптимизировать облачные расходы для рабочих нагрузок ИИ","Реализовать меры киберустойчивости для систем ИИ"],"ar":["أتمتة تتبع التكاليف لنماذج اللغة الكبيرة","تحسين تكاليف السحابة لأحمال العمل للذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ إجراءات المرونة الإلكترونية لأنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of Dual-Condition Exit Gate","Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true declaration needed for exit","Compatibility with specific AI agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT"],"zh":["需要实现双条件退出门","需要显式退出信号：true 声明来退出","兼容性仅限于特定的 AI 代理，如 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT"],"ja":["デュアルコンディションエグジットゲートの実装が必要","エクスプリシットエグジットシグナル：true 宣言が必要","Claude Code や AutoGPT などの特定の AI エージェントとのみ互換性がある"],"ko":["Dual-Condition Exit Gate 구현이 필요합니다","EXIT_SIGNAL: true 선언이 필요합니다","Claude Code와 AutoGPT와 같은 특정 AI 에이전트와의 호환성만 제공"],"es":["Requiere la implementación de la puerta de salida de condición dual","Declaración explícita de EXIT_SIGNAL: true necesaria para la salida","Compatibilidad con agentes de IA específicos como Claude Code y AutoGPT"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre de la porte de sortie à condition double","Déclaration explicite de EXIT_SIGNAL: true nécessaire pour la sortie","Compatibilité avec des agents IA spécifiques comme Claude Code et AutoGPT"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung des Dual-Condition-Exit-Gates","Explizite EXIT_SIGNAL: true-Deklaration erforderlich für den Ausgang","Kompatibilität mit spezifischen KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT"],"pt":["Requer implementação do Dual-Condition Exit Gate","Declaração Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true necessária para saída","Compatibilidade com agentes de IA específicos como Claude Code e AutoGPT"],"ru":["Требует реализации Dual-Condition Exit Gate","Явное объявление EXIT_SIGNAL: true необходимо для выхода","Совместимость с определенными агентами ИИ, такими как Claude Code и AutoGPT"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذاً ل Dual-Condition Exit Gate","إعلان Explicit EXIT_SIGNAL: true ضروري للخروج","التوافق مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المعينين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
