système de conception d''interface utilisateur assure la cohérence dans toutes les interfaces d''application. Il utilise des jetons de thème et des composan...","de":"Das Benutzeroberflächendesign-System gewährleistet die Konsistenz in allen Anwendungsinterfaces. Es verwendet Themetoken und vorgefertigte Komponenten für ei...","pt":"O sistema de design de UI é uma abordagem para criar interfaces de usuário consistentes. Ele define regras rígidas para garantir uma experiência de usuário u...","ru":"Система дизайна UI - это подход к созданию последовательных интерфейсов пользователя. Она определяет жесткие правила для обеспечения единообразного пользоват...","ar":"نظام تصميم واجهة المستخدم هو نهج لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم متسقة. يحدد قواعد صارمة لضمان تجربة مستخدم موحدة.","en":"Repo for my dotfiles"},"definition":{"en":"Repo for my dotfiles"},"features":{"es":["Reglas estrictas para la creación de componentes","Uso de tokens de tema para la coherencia visual","Componentes predefinidos para una implementación rápida","Compatibilidad con shadcn-svelte","Uso de variables CSS para la personalización"],"fr":["Règles strictes pour la création de composants","Utilisation de jetons de thème pour la cohérence visuelle","Composants prédéfinis pour une mise en œuvre rapide","Compatibilité avec shadcn-svelte","Utilisation de variables CSS pour la personnalisation"],"de":["Strenge Regeln für die Erstellung von Komponenten","Verwendung von Themetoken für die visuelle Konsistenz","Vorgefertigte Komponenten für eine schnelle Implementierung","Kompatibilität mit shadcn-svelte","Verwendung von CSS-Variablen für die Anpassung"],"pt":["Consistência em todos os aplicativos","Regras rígidas para garantir a qualidade","Uso de tokens de tema para personalização","Componentes pré-concebidos para reduzir o tempo de desenvolvimento","Integração com shadcn-svelte","Padronização de layouts e componentes"],"ru":["Последовательность во всех приложениях","Жесткие правила для обеспечения качества","Использование токенов темы для настройки","Предварительно разработанные компоненты для сокращения времени разработки","Интеграция с shadcn-svelte","Стандартизация макетов и компонентов"],"ar":["التوافق في جميع التطبيقات","قواعد صارمة لضمان الجودة","استخدام رموز الموضوع للتخصيص","المكونات المسبقة للتصميم لتقليل وقت التطوير","التكامل مع shadcn-svelte","معايير التصميم والتخطيط"]},"keywords":{"es":["diseño de ui","sistema de diseño de ui","tokens de tema","componentes predefinidos","shadcn-svelte","variables css","coherencia visual","experiencia de usuario"],"fr":["conception d''interface utilisateur","système de conception d''interface utilisateur","jetons de thème","composants prédéfinis","shadcn-svelte","variables css","cohérence visuelle","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["benutzeroberflächendesign","benutzeroberflächendesign-system","themetoken","vorgefertigte komponenten","shadcn-svelte","css-variablen","visuelle konsistenz","benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ui","design de ui","sistema de design de ui","interface de usuário","experiência de usuário","regras de design","tokens de tema","componentes pré-concebidos","shadcn-svelte","padronização de layouts"],"ru":["разработка ui","дизайн ui","система дизайна ui","интерфейс пользователя","пользовательский опыт","правила дизайна","токены темы","предварительно разработанные компоненты","shadcn-svelte","стандартизация макетов"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","نظام تصميم واجهة المستخدم","واجهة المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","قواعد التصميم","رموز الموضوع","المكونات المسبقة للتصميم","shadcn-svelte","معايير التصميم والتخطيط"]}},"owner":"Bliz243","repo":".dotfiles","repoPath":"Bliz243/.dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-design","description":"Enforces consistent UI within shadcn-svelte + TailwindCSS 4 design system. Use when building ANY app UI — pages, components, forms, dashboards, settings, data display. Prevents style drift and ensures design system compliance.","bodyPreview":"# UI Design System Enforcement\n\nThis skill enforces consistency across all application UI. It is the default for all app interface work — dashboards, forms, settings, CRUD, data display. For creative/marketing work, use ultra-frontend instead.\n\n## Hard Rules\n\n1. **shadcn-svelte first.** Never build custom components when shadcn-svelte has one. Before creating anything, check `src/lib/components/ui/` for existing components.\n2. **Theme tokens only.** Use CSS variables (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-f","body":"# UI Design System Enforcement\n\nThis skill enforces consistency across all application UI. It is the default for all app interface work — dashboards, forms, settings, CRUD, data display. For creative/marketing work, use ultra-frontend instead.\n\n## Hard Rules\n\n1. **shadcn-svelte first.** Never build custom components when shadcn-svelte has one. Before creating anything, check `src/lib/components/ui/` for existing components.\n2. **Theme tokens only.** Use CSS variables (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`) — never raw Tailwind colors (`bg-blue-500`, `text-gray-500`). See the Color section below.\n3. **Scan before building.** Before creating any new page or component, find and read an existing similar one in the project. Match its structure, spacing, and patterns. State what you''re matching.\n4. **One way to do things.** If the project already does X a certain way, do it that way. Don''t introduce a second pattern.\n5. **Svelte 5 only.** Use `$state`, `$derived`, `$bindable`, `$props`, snippets. No legacy Svelte 4 patterns (stores, `export let`, slots).\n\n## Pre-Build Checklist\n\nBefore writing any UI code:\n\n1. **Glob** for similar existing pages/components in the project\n2. **Read** at least one to understand established patterns\n3. **State** which patterns you''re following and why\n4. **Check** `src/lib/components/ui/` for relevant shadcn components\n5. If no similar code exists, state the conventions you''ll establish and why\n\n## Colors & Theme Tokens\n\n### Always Use Semantic Tokens\n\n```\nbg-background, bg-foreground\nbg-primary, text-primary, bg-primary-foreground\nbg-secondary, text-secondary\nbg-muted, text-muted-foreground\nbg-accent, text-accent-foreground\nbg-destructive, text-destructive\nbg-success, text-success\nborder-border, border-input\nring-ring\n```\n\n### Status Colors — Use Semantic Tokens with Opacity\n\n```svelte\n<!-- CORRECT -->\n<span class=\"bg-success/10 text-success\">Active</span>\n<span class=\"bg-destructive/10 text-destructive\">Failed</span>\n<span class=\"bg-warning/10 text-warning\">Pending</span>\n<span class=\"bg-muted text-muted-foreground\">Draft</span>\n\n<!-- WRONG — raw Tailwind colors -->\n<span class=\"bg-green-100 text-green-700\">Active</span>\n<span class=\"bg-red-100 text-red-700\">Failed</span>\n<span class=\"bg-amber-100 text-amber-700\">Pending</span>\n```\n\n### Exceptions\n\n- **Email/brand preview components** that render non-themed UI may use hardcoded colors\n- **Charts** may use `--chart-1` through `--chart-5` tokens or raw colors for data series differentiation\n- **Dynamic brand colors** from database/API (e.g., customer portal branding) use inline `style:` bindings\n\n## Layout Conventions\n\n### Dashboard Content Wrapper\n\nThe dashboard layout provides `p-4` padding. Pages within it follow this structure:\n\n```svelte\n<div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col overflow-auto\">\n  <div class=\"w-full px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 space-y-6\">\n    <!-- Page content -->\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Max-Width by Page Type\n\n| Page Type | Max-Width | Example |\n|-----------|-----------|---------|\n| Forms / Settings | `max-w-3xl mx-auto` | Profile settings, edit forms |\n| Detail pages | `max-w-6xl mx-auto` | Organization page, subscription detail |\n| Data tables / Dashboards | No max-width | Subscriptions list, dashboard overview |\n| Catalog / Grid views | `max-w-7xl mx-auto` or `max-w-screen-xl mx-auto` | Product catalog, feature grid |\n\n### Section Spacing\n\n- **Between major page sections**: `space-y-6`\n- **Grid gaps between cards/items**: `gap-6`\n- **Tight item groups** (form fields, button groups, related items): `gap-4` or `space-y-4`\n- **Within a component** (label to input, icon to text): `gap-2` or `space-y-2`\n\n### Responsive Breakpoints\n\n- `md:` (768px) — two-column layouts\n- `lg:` (1024px) — three-column layouts, sidebar shows\n- Use `@container` queries when component responsiveness is independent of viewport\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Button Variants\n\n| Variant | Use Case |\n|---------|----------|\n| `default` | Primary action (one per visible area) |\n| `outline` | Secondary actions (most common) |\n| `ghost` | Tertiary/icon-only actions |\n| `destructive` | Danger/delete actions |\n| `secondary` | Alternative secondary styling |\n| `link` | Text-only navigation-style actions |\n\n### Button Sizes\n\n| Size | Use Case |\n|------|----------|\n| `default` (h-9) | Standard buttons |\n| `sm` (h-8) | Toolbars, table rows, compact areas |\n| `lg` (h-10) | Hero/primary call-to-action |\n| `icon` (h-9 w-9) | Icon-only buttons |\n| `icon-sm` (h-8 w-8) | Compact icon buttons |\n\n### Icons\n\n- **In menus/dropdowns**: `h-4 w-4` with `mr-2` spacing\n- **Standalone/page-level**: `h-5 w-5`\n- **Feature/empty-state illustrations**: `h-6 w-6` or larger\n- **Source**: `@tabler/icons-svelte` (project standard)\n\n### Feedback Patterns\n\n| Feedback Type | Component | When |\n|---------------|-----------|------|\n| Async operation result | `toast.success()` / `toast.error()` | After API calls, saves, sends |\n| Reversible confirmation | `ConfirmationModal` (variant=\"default\") | Pause, resume, send |\n| Destructive confirmation | `ConfirmationModal` (variant=\"destructive\") | Delete, cancel, disable |\n| Complex confirmation | Custom Dialog with options | Actions requiring reason selection |\n| Creation flow | `Sheet` with step tabs | Creating new entities |\n| Inline editing | Direct in-page form | Quick field edits |\n\n### Data Display\n\n| Pattern | Component | When |\n|---------|-----------|------|\n| Tabular data | TanStack Table + shadcn Table primitives | Lists with sorting/selection/pagination |\n| Metric cards | Card with header + content | Dashboard KPIs |\n| Detail view | DetailPageLayout with sidebar | Entity detail pages |\n| Empty state | Empty.Root + Empty.Title + Empty.Description | No data / first-time use |\n| Loading | Skeleton components with staggered animation | Initial data load |\n| Loading overlay | InlineLoadingOverlay | Refreshing existing data |\n| Status indicators | Badge with semantic token colors | Row status, entity state |\n\n### Dropdown Menus\n\n```svelte\n<DropdownMenu.Root bind:open={dropdownOpen}>\n  <DropdownMenu.Trigger>\n    {#snippet child({ props })}\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\" size=\"icon\" {...props}>\n        <DotsVerticalIcon />\n        <span class=\"sr-only\">Open menu</span>\n      </Button>\n    {/snippet}\n  </DropdownMenu.Trigger>\n  <DropdownMenu.Content align=\"end\" class=\"w-48\">\n    <DropdownMenu.Group>\n      <!-- Standard actions first -->\n      <DropdownMenu.Item>\n        <EyeIcon class=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4\" />View Details\n      </DropdownMenu.Item>\n      <DropdownMenu.Separator />\n      <!-- Destructive actions last -->\n      <DropdownMenu.Item variant=\"destructive\">\n        <TrashIcon class=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4\" />Delete\n      </DropdownMenu.Item>\n    </DropdownMenu.Group>\n  </DropdownMenu.Content>\n</DropdownMenu.Root>\n```\n\n## Form Patterns\n\n### When to Use Which\n\n| Context | Pattern | Validation |\n|---------|---------|------------|\n| Simple inline (login, quick edit) | Native `$state` + manual | Inline checks |\n| Creation in Sheet/Dialog | State object + `errorsByPath` | Zod schema, submit-first |\n| Settings pages | Store-based + `updateField()` | Store-level validation |\n| Server-validated | Formsnap + SvelteKit form actions | Server-side + `fail()` |\n\n### Form Field Spacing\n\n```svelte\n<!-- Standard form layout -->\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n    <Form.Field>\n      <Form.Control>\n        {#snippet children({ props })}\n          <Form.Label>Field Name</Form.Label>\n          <Input {...props} />\n        {/snippet}\n      </Form.Control>\n      <Form.Description>Helper text</Form.Description>\n      <Form.FieldErrors />\n    </Form.Field>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n- **Label to input**: `space-y-2` (via Form.Field)\n- **Between form fields**: `gap-6` (in grid) or `space-y-4` (in stack)\n- **Form sections**: `space-y-6`\n- **Submit buttons**: Full-width `w-full` in modals/sheets, right-aligned in page forms\n\n## Page Headers\n\n```svelte\n<!-- Standard page header -->\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n  <div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">{title}</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">{description}</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n    <!-- Action buttons -->\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## What This Skill Does NOT Cover\n\n- **Creative/marketing UI** — use ultra-frontend instead\n- **Architectural decisions** (folder structure, service patterns, data layer)\n- **Business logic** in components\n- **Accessibility beyond what shadcn provides** (shadcn handles ARIA by default)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:35:03.468Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing standardized UI component implementation with shadcn-svelte and CSS variables.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 shadcn-svelte 和 CSS 变量实现标准化 UI 组件的前端代理。","ja":"shadcn-svelte と CSS 変数を使用して標準化された UI コンポーネントを実装する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"shadcn-svelte와 CSS 변수를 사용하여 표준화된 UI 컴포넌트를 구현해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una implementación de componentes de interfaz de usuario estandarizados con shadcn-svelte y variables CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre de composants d''interface utilisateur standardisés avec shadcn-svelte et des variables CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine standardisierte Implementierung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit shadcn-svelte und CSS-Variablen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de implementação de componentes de interface do usuário padronizados com shadcn-svelte e variáveis CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется стандартизированная реализация компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью shadcn-svelte и переменных CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ مكونات واجهة المستخدم الموحدة باستخدام shadcn-svelte ومتغيرات CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce consistency across application UI using theme tokens and predefined components from shadcn-svelte, ensuring uniformity in dashboards, forms, and data display through CSS variables like bg-primary and text-muted.","zh":"赋予代理人使用主题令牌和 shadcn-svelte 的预定义组件来强制应用程序 UI 一致性，确保通过 CSS 变量（如 bg-primary 和 text-muted）在仪表板、表单和数据显示中保持统一。","ja":"テーマ トークンと shadcn-svelte の事前定義されたコンポーネントを使用して、アプリケーション UI の一貫性を強制することで、エージェントが権限を与え、CSS 変数（bg-primary や text-muted など）を使用してダッシュボード、フォーム、データ表示で統一性を保ちます。","ko":"테마 토큰 및 shadcn-svelte의 사전 정의된 컴포넌트를 사용하여 애플리케이션 UI의 일관성을 강제함으로써 에이전트가 권한을 부여하고, CSS 변수(bg-primary 및 text-muted 등)를 사용하여 대시보드, 양식 및 데이터 표시에서 일관성을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir la coherencia en toda la interfaz de usuario de la aplicación utilizando tokens de tema y componentes predefinidos de shadcn-svelte, garantizando la uniformidad en paneles, formularios y visualización de datos a través de variables CSS como bg-primary y text-muted.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter la cohérence à travers l''interface utilisateur de l''application en utilisant des jetons de thème et des composants prédéfinis de shadcn-svelte, garantissant l''uniformité des tableaux de bord, des formulaires et de l''affichage des données via des variables CSS comme bg-primary et text-muted.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Konsistenz über die gesamte Benutzeroberfläche der Anwendung hinweg durchzusetzen, indem sie Thementoken und vordefinierte Komponenten von shadcn-svelte verwenden, um die Einheitlichkeit in Dashboards, Formularen und Datenanzeige durch CSS-Variablen wie bg-primary und text-muted sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor consistência em toda a interface do aplicativo usando tokens de tema e componentes pré-definidos do shadcn-svelte, garantindo uniformidade em painéis, formulários e exibição de dados por meio de variáveis CSS como bg-primary e text-muted.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать согласованность во всей пользовательской интерфейсе приложения, используя токены темы и предопределенные компоненты shadcn-svelte, обеспечивая единообразие в панелях, формах и отображении данных посредством переменных CSS, таких как bg-primary и text-muted.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض الاتساق عبر واجهة التطبيق بأكملها باستخدام رموز الموضوع والمكونات المحددة مسبقًا من shadcn-svelte، وضمان التماثل في لوحات التحكم والاستمارات وعرض البيانات من خلال متغيرات CSS مثل bg-primary و text-muted."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing UI components across applications","Enforcing theme consistency with CSS variables","Streamlining dashboard and form design with shadcn-svelte components"],"zh":["跨应用程序标准化 UI 组件","使用 CSS 变量强制主题一致性","使用 shadcn-svelte 组件简化仪表板和表单设计"],"ja":["アプリケーション全体での UI コンポーネントの標準化","CSS 変数を使用したテーマの一貫性の強制","shadcn-svelte コンポーネントを使用したダッシュボードとフォームの設計の簡素化"],"ko":["애플리케이션 전체에서 UI 컴포넌트 표준화","CSS 변수를 사용한 테마 일관성 강제","shadcn-svelte 컴포넌트를 사용한 대시보드 및 양식 디자인 간소화"],"es":["Estandarizar componentes de interfaz de usuario en aplicaciones","Hacer cumplir la coherencia del tema con variables CSS","Optimizar el diseño del panel y del formulario con componentes de shadcn-svelte"],"fr":["Standardiser les composants d''interface utilisateur dans les applications","Faire respecter la cohérence du thème avec des variables CSS","Optimiser la conception du tableau de bord et du formulaire avec des composants shadcn-svelte"],"de":["Standardisieren von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten in Anwendungen","Durchsetzen der Themakonsistenz mit CSS-Variablen","Optimieren des Dashboard- und Formulardesigns mit shadcn-svelte-Komponenten"],"pt":["Padronizar componentes de interface do usuário em aplicativos","Impor consistência de tema com variáveis CSS","Otimizar design de painéis e formulários com componentes shadcn-svelte"],"ru":["Стандартизировать компоненты пользовательского интерфейса в приложениях","Обеспечить согласованность темы с помощью переменных CSS","Упростить проектирование панелей и форм с помощью компонентов shadcn-svelte"],"ar":["توحيد مكونات واجهة المستخدم عبر التطبيقات","فرض اتساق الموضوع باستخدام متغيرات CSS","تبسيط تصميم لوحات التحكم والاستمارات باستخدام مكونات shadcn-svelte"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn-svelte integration","Limited to applications using CSS variables for theming"],"zh":["需要 shadcn-svelte 集成","仅限使用 CSS 变量进行主题化的应用程序"],"ja":["shadcn-svelte の統合が必要","CSS 変数を使用したテーマ化のみに対応したアプリケーション"],"ko":["shadcn-svelte 통합이 필요","CSS 변수를 사용한 테마화만 지원하는 애플리케이션"],"es":["Requiere integración con shadcn-svelte","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan variables CSS para la personalización"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec shadcn-svelte","Limité aux applications utilisant des variables CSS pour le thème"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit shadcn-svelte","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die CSS-Variablen für die Gestaltung verwenden"],"pt":["Requer integração com shadcn-svelte","Limitado a aplicativos que usam variáveis CSS para temas"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с shadcn-svelte","Ограничен для приложений, использующих переменные CSS для тем"],"ar":["يتطلب دمجًا مع shadcn-svelte","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم متغيرات CSS للمواضيع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
