とNeoForgeのサポート"],"ko":["문서 업데이트 자동화","버전 업데이트 지원","새로운 컨텐츠 추가 지원","릴리즈 준비 지원","Fabric와 NeoForge 지원"],"es":["Actualiza la documentación automáticamente","Soporta cambios de versión y agregado de contenido","Incluye lista de verificación para tareas comunes"," Compatible con Fabric y NeoForge","Mejora la eficiencia del desarrollo"],"fr":["Mettre à jour la documentation automatiquement","Prend en charge les changements de version et l''ajout de contenu","Inclut une liste de vérification pour les tâches courantes","Compatible avec Fabric et NeoForge","Améliore l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Aktualisiert die Dokumentation automatisch","Unterstützt Versionsänderungen und Hinzufügen von Inhalt","Enthält Prüfliste für häufige Aufgaben","Kompatibel mit Fabric und NeoForge","Verbessert die Effizienz der Entwicklung"],"pt":["Atualização de versões do Minecraft","Adição de novos chefes, estruturas ou itens","Preparação para lançamento","Adição de novas dependências de mods","Checklist personalizada para tarefas"],"ru":["Обновление версий Minecraft","Добавление новых боссов, структур или предметов","Подготовка к релизу","Добавление новых зависимостей модов","Персонализированный чек-лист для задач"],"ar":["تحديث إصدارات Minecraft","إضافة رؤساء أو هياكل أو عناصر جديدة","التحضير لإطلاق الإصدار","إضافة зависимости mods جديدة","قائمة مرجعية مخصصة للمهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft","文档维护","模组开发","自动化更新","版本更新","Fabric","NeoForge"],"ja":["Minecraft","ドキュメントメンテナンス","モッド開発","自動更新","バージョン更新","Fabric","NeoForge"],"ko":["마인크래프트","문서 유지 보수","모드 개발","자동 업데이트","버전 업데이트","Fabric","NeoForge"],"es":["doc-maintenance","Minecraft","desarrollo de mods","actualización de documentación","eficiencia del desarrollo","Fabric","NeoForge"],"fr":["doc-maintenance","Minecraft","développement de mods","mise à jour de documentation","efficacité du développement","Fabric","NeoForge"],"de":["doc-maintenance","Minecraft","Mod-Entwicklung","Dokumentenupdate","Entwicklungs-Effizienz","Fabric","NeoForge"],"pt":["manutenção de documentação","desenvolvedores de Minecraft","mods de Minecraft","atualização de versões","documentação de software","lançamento de software"],"ru":["техническое обслуживание документации","разработчики Minecraft","моды Minecraft","обновление версий","документация программного обеспечения","релиз программного обеспечения"],"ar":["صيانة الوثائق","مطورو Minecraft","mods Minecraft","تحديث الإصدارات","توثيق البرمجيات","إطلاق البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ksoichiro","repo":"ChronoDawn","repoPath":"ksoichiro/ChronoDawn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-maintenance","description":"Guide documentation updates when changing versions, adding content, or preparing releases","bodyPreview":"# Documentation Maintenance\n\n**Purpose**: Guide documentation updates when changing versions, adding content, or preparing releases.\n\n**How it works**: This skill is automatically activated when you mention tasks related to:\n- Updating Minecraft or dependency versions\n- Adding new bosses, structures, or items\n- Preparing for a release\n- Adding new mod dependencies\n\nSimply describe what you want to do, and Claude will reference the appropriate checklist from this skill.\n\n---\n\n## Version Update Ch","body":"# Documentation Maintenance\n\n**Purpose**: Guide documentation updates when changing versions, adding content, or preparing releases.\n\n**How it works**: This skill is automatically activated when you mention tasks related to:\n- Updating Minecraft or dependency versions\n- Adding new bosses, structures, or items\n- Preparing for a release\n- Adding new mod dependencies\n\nSimply describe what you want to do, and Claude will reference the appropriate checklist from this skill.\n\n---\n\n## Version Update Checklist\n\n**When to use**: Updating Minecraft version, mod loader versions, or dependency versions\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **gradle.properties**\n   - Update version properties\n   - Example: `minecraft_version=1.21.1`\n\n2. **README.md** (lines ~47-50)\n   - Section: \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Update all version numbers\n\n3. **docs/player_guide.md** (lines ~25-56)\n   - Sections: \"Prerequisites\" and \"Required Dependencies\"\n   - Update version numbers and download links\n\n4. **docs/developer_guide.md** (lines ~32-45)\n   - Section: \"Key Technologies\"\n   - Update version specifications\n\n5. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~125-128)\n   - Section: \"Technical Details\" → \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Update version numbers\n\n6. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~30-39)\n   - Sections: \"Requirements\" (both Fabric and NeoForge)\n   - Update version numbers\n\n7. **fabric/src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json**\n   - Update `depends` section version ranges\n   - Update `recommends` section if applicable\n\n8. **neoforge/src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml**\n   - Update `[[dependencies.chronodawn]]` entries\n   - Update `versionRange` fields\n\n9. **THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md**\n   - Update version numbers in \"Runtime Dependencies\" section\n   - Update: Minecraft, Fabric Loader, Fabric API, NeoForge, Architectury API\n   - Update \"Last updated\" date at the bottom\n\n### Current Versions (Reference)\n\n```\nMinecraft: 1.21.1\nFabric Loader: 0.17.3+\nFabric API: 0.116.7+\nNeoForge: 21.1.209+\nArchitectury API: 13.0.8+\n```\n\n**After updating**, update this reference list in this skill file.\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Boss\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new boss enemy to the mod\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **README.md** (lines ~25-31)\n   - Section: \"Boss Enemies\" list\n   - Add: `- Boss Name (description, drops Item Name)`\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Section: \"Boss Battles\"\n   - Add full entry with:\n     - Stats (Health, Attack, Defense)\n     - Abilities (list special attacks)\n     - Strategy (combat tips)\n     - Drops (items dropped)\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~28-35)\n   - Section: \"Powerful Boss Battles\"\n   - Add boss to appropriate category (mini-boss, mid-boss, final boss)\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~105-140)\n   - Section: \"Boss Battles\"\n   - Add boss entry with stats and abilities\n\n5. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/spec.md**\n   - Add to User Stories if boss is critical to progression\n   - Add to Requirements section\n\n6. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md**\n   - Add boss entity definition with complete specifications\n\n7. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/tasks.md**\n   - Add implementation tasks for the boss\n\n### Template\n\n```markdown\n### Boss Name (Category)\n\n**Location**: Structure Name\n\n**Stats**:\n- Health: XXX HP\n- Attack: XX damage\n- Defense: XX armor points\n\n**Abilities**:\n- Ability 1: Description\n- Ability 2: Description\n\n**Strategy**:\n- Tip 1\n- Tip 2\n\n**Drops**:\n- **Item Name**: Description\n- Experience points\n```\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Structure\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new structure to the mod\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **README.md** (lines ~17-24)\n   - Section: \"Major Structures\" list\n   - Add: `- Structure Name (location, description)`\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Section: \"Exploring the Chrono Dawn\" or appropriate section\n   - Add structure description and how to find it\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~22-29)\n   - Section: \"Epic Structures\"\n   - Add structure to the list\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~89-97)\n   - Section: \"Structures\"\n   - Add structure entry\n\n5. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/spec.md**\n   - Add to User Stories if structure is critical\n   - Add to Requirements if needed\n\n6. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md**\n   - Add structure definition (generation rules, loot, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Ultimate Artifact\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new ultimate artifact item\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **README.md** (line ~32)\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\" list\n   - Add: `Item Name (type), Description`\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\"\n   - Add full entry with:\n     - Stats (damage, armor, durability)\n     - Special Ability (detailed description)\n     - Recipe (crafting requirements)\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~41-46)\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\"\n   - Add brief description\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~143-167)\n   - Section: \"Ultimate Artifacts\"\n   - Add item entry with ability description\n\n5. **specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md**\n   - Add item definition with complete specifications\n\n### Template\n\n```markdown\n### Item Name (Type)\n\n**Stats**:\n- Stat 1: Value\n- Stat 2: Value\n\n**Special Ability**: **Ability Name**\n- Effect description\n- Usage notes\n\n**Recipe**:\n\\`\\`\\`\n- Ingredient 1\n- Ingredient 2\n- Ingredient 3\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n---\n\n## Updating Content Counts and Lists\n\n**When to use**: Adding or removing biomes, bosses, structures, wood types, or other countable content\n\n**Purpose**: Ensure numeric descriptions (e.g., \"8 unique biomes\", \"4 mid-bosses\", \"three wood types\") remain accurate across all documentation\n\n### Files to Check\n\n1. **README.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count, structure count, wood type count\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\", \"Boss Enemies\" list length, \"Major Structures\" list length\n\n2. **docs/player_guide.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count (categorized: mini-boss, mid-bosses, final boss), structure count, wood type count\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\", \"three wood types\", mid-boss descriptions (\"4 mid-bosses\")\n\n3. **docs/curseforge_description.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count, structure count, artifact count\n   - Look for: \"8 Unique Biomes\", boss list lengths, structure list\n\n4. **docs/modrinth_description.md**\n   - Check: Biome count, boss count, structure count, wood type count\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\", boss list, structure list\n\n5. **CLAUDE.md**\n   - Check: Current versions list if content affects version compatibility\n   - Look for: \"8 unique biomes\" in Recent Changes or Active Technologies\n\n### Verification Method\n\nWhen adding/removing content:\n1. Search for numeric descriptions (e.g., \"8\", \"four\", \"4 mid-bosses\")\n2. Verify counts match actual implementation\n3. Update Table of Contents if section counts change\n4. Check for phrases like \"all X\", \"both\", \"each of the Y\"\n\n**Tip**: Use `grep -r \"8 unique biomes\" docs/` to find all occurrences quickly\n\n---\n\n## Adding a New Dependency\n\n**When to use**: Adding a new mod dependency (required or optional)\n\n### Files to Update\n\n1. **gradle.properties**\n   - Add version property if needed\n   - Example: `new_mod_version=1.0.0`\n\n2. **fabric/build.gradle**\n   - Add to `dependencies` section\n   - Use `modImplementation`, `modApi`, or `modCompileOnly` as appropriate\n\n3. **neoforge/build.gradle**\n   - Add to `dependencies` section\n   - Use `modImplementation`, `modApi`, or `modCompileOnly` as appropriate\n\n4. **fabric/src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json**\n   - Add to `depends` (required) or `recommends` (optional)\n   - Specify version range\n\n5. **neoforge/src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml**\n   - Add `[[dependencies.chronodawn]]` entry\n   - Set `type` to \"required\" or \"optional\"\n   - Specify `versionRange`\n\n6. **README.md** (lines ~47-50)\n   - Section: \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Add dependency with version and description\n\n7. **docs/player_guide.md** (lines ~41-56)\n   - Section: \"Required Dependencies\"\n   - Add numbered entry with links to CurseForge and Modrinth\n\n8. **docs/curseforge_description.md** (lines ~125-128)\n   - Section: \"Requirements\" → \"Dependencies\"\n   - Add dependency to the list\n\n9. **docs/modrinth_description.md** (lines ~30-39)\n   - Sections: \"Requirements\" (both Fabric and NeoForge)\n   - Add dependency to both loader sections\n\n10. **THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md**\n    - Add new dependency entry to \"Runtime Dependencies\" or \"Development Dependencies\" section\n    - Include: Project name, version, developer/organization, license, URL, license URL\n    - Add license summary if it''s a new license type\n    - Update \"Last updated\" date at the bottom\n    - Research license information from project''s GitHub repository or official page\n\n### Dependency Type Guidelines\n\n- **Required (`depends` / `required`)**: Mod cannot function without it\n- **Optional (`recommends` / `optional`)**: Adds features but not essential\n- **Include in JAR**: Use `include` in Fabric for bundling\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Release Verification\n\n**When to use**: Before creating a release or publishing to CurseForge/Modrinth\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [ ] **Version Consistency**\n  - All documentation files show consistent version numbers\n  - gradle.properties matches documentation\n  - fabric.mod.json and neoforge.mods.toml dependencies match gradle files\n\n- [ ] **Documentation Accuracy**\n  - README.md is accurate and up-to-date\n  - player_guide.md is complete with all features\n  - developer_guide.md reflects current architecture\n  - curseforge_description.md ready for publication\n  - modrinth_description.md ready for publication\n\n- [ ] **Configuration Files**\n  - fabric.mod.json has correct dependencies\n  - neoforge.mods.toml has correct dependencies\n  - All dependency versions are tested and working\n\n- [ ] **Build Verification**\n  - `./gradlew clean build` succeeds for both loaders\n  - JAR files are generated correctly\n  - No build warnings or errors\n\n- [ ] **Testing**\n  - All unit tests pass (`./gradlew test`)\n  - Manual testing completed (see quickstart.md checklist)\n  - Both Fabric and NeoForge builds tested in-game\n\n- [ ] **CHANGELOG** (if using)\n  - CHANGELOG.md exists and is current\n  - All user-facing changes documented\n\n- [ ] **GitHub Repository**\n  - All changes committed and pushed\n  - Branch is up-to-date with main/develop\n  - Tags are ready for release version\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Documentation Files by Purpose\n\n**User-Facing**:\n- `README.md` - Project overview, installation, build instructions\n- `docs/player_guide.md` - Complete gameplay guide\n- `docs/curseforge_description.md` - CurseForge mod page content\n- `docs/modrinth_description.md` - Modrinth mod page content\n\n**Legal**:\n- `LICENSE` - Project license (MIT)\n- `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md` - Dependency licenses and version information\n\n**Developer**:\n- `docs/developer_guide.md` - Development setup and architecture\n- `specs/chrono-dawn-mod/spec.md` - Feature specification\n- `specs/chrono-dawn-mod/data-model.md` - Data models\n- `specs/chrono-dawn-mod/tasks.md` - Implementation tasks\n\n**Configuration**:\n- `gradle.properties` - Version definitions\n- `fabric/src/main/resources/fabric.mod.json` - Fabric metadata\n- `neoforge/src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml` - NeoForge metadata\n\n### Common Line Number References\n\n- README.md Dependencies: ~47-50\n- player_guide.md Prerequisites: ~25-56\n- developer_guide.md Technologies: ~32-45\n- curseforge_description.md Requirements: ~125-128\n- modrinth_description.md Requirements: ~30-39\n- README.md Boss List: ~25-31\n- README.md Structure List: ~17-24\n\n---\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Always update in pairs**: When updating Fabric configs, update NeoForge configs too\n2. **Test both loaders**: Changes to dependencies affect both Fabric and NeoForge differently\n3. **Use search**: Use `grep` or IDE search to find all occurrences of version numbers\n4. **Keep CLAUDE.md current**: Update the current versions list after major updates\n5. **Commit frequently**: Commit documentation changes separately from code changes\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-08 (Added THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md to maintenance checklists)\n**Maintained by**: Chrono Dawn Development Team\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:35:02.546Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Minecraft Modding Agents requiring automated documentation updates for custom mods like Chrono Dawn.","zh":"适用于Minecraft Modding Agents，需要自动更新自定义模组如Chrono Dawn的文档。","ja":"Minecraft Modding AgentsがカスタムモッドのChrono Dawnのような自動ドキュメント更新を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"Minecraft Modding Agents에서 Chrono Dawn와 같은 사용자 지정 모드에 대한 자동 문서 업데이트가 필요한 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de modificación de Minecraft que requieren actualizaciones automatizadas de documentación para mods personalizados como Chrono Dawn.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modification de Minecraft nécessitant des mises à jour automatiques de documentation pour des mods personnalisés comme Chrono Dawn.","de":"Ideal für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die automatisierte Dokumentationsaktualisierungen für benutzerdefinierte Mods wie Chrono Dawn erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de modding do Minecraft que exigem atualizações automatizadas de documentação para mods personalizados como Chrono Dawn.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов моддинга Minecraft, требующих автоматических обновлений документации для пользовательских модов, таких как Chrono Dawn.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تعديل ماين كرافت التي تتطلب تحديثات وثائقية آلية للتعديلات المخصصة مثل Chrono Dawn."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain accurate documentation by referencing checklists for tasks such as updating Minecraft versions, adding new mod dependencies, and preparing releases, utilizing Fabric and NeoForge.","zh":"使代理能够通过引用任务的清单（如更新Minecraft版本、添加新模组依赖项和准备发布，利用Fabric和NeoForge）来维护准确的文档。","ja":"FabricとNeoForgeを利用して、Minecraftのバージョンを更新したり、新しいモッドの依存関係を追加したり、リリースを準備したりするタスクのチェックリストを参照することで、エージェントが正確なドキュメントを維持できるようにします。","ko":"Fabric와 NeoForge를 사용하여 Minecraft 버전 업데이트나 새로운 모드 종속성 추가, 릴리스 준비 등의 작업 체크리스트를 참조하여 에이전트가 정확한 문서를 유지하도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener una documentación precisa haciendo referencia a listas de verificación para tareas como la actualización de versiones de Minecraft, la adición de nuevas dependencias de mods y la preparación de lanzamientos, utilizando Fabric y NeoForge.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une documentation précise en référençant des listes de vérification pour des tâches telles que la mise à jour des versions de Minecraft, l''ajout de nouvelles dépendances de mods et la préparation de versions, en utilisant Fabric et NeoForge.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine genaue Dokumentation durch Bezugnahme auf Prüflisten für Aufgaben wie die Aktualisierung von Minecraft-Versionen, das Hinzufügen neuer Mod-Abhängigkeiten und die Vorbereitung von Veröffentlichungen zu erhalten, unter Verwendung von Fabric und NeoForge.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a documentação precisa, referenciando listas de verificação para tarefas, como atualizar versões do Minecraft, adicionar novas dependências de mods e preparar lançamentos, utilizando Fabric e NeoForge.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать точную документацию, обращаясь к контрольным спискам для задач, таких как обновление версий Minecraft, добавление новых зависимостей модов и подготовка релизов, используя Fabric и NeoForge.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على توثيق دقيق من خلال الإشارة إلى قوائم التحقق من المهام مثل تحديث إصدارات ماين كرافت وإضافة зависимости مود جديدة والاستعداد للصدور، باستخدام Fabric و NeoForge."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates for Minecraft mod version changes","Generating checklists for adding new bosses or items to Chrono Dawn","Streamlining release preparations with automated documentation tasks"],"zh":["自动更新Minecraft模组版本更改的文档","为Chrono Dawn添加新boss或物品生成清单","使用自动化文档任务简化发布准备"],"ja":["Minecraftモッドのバージョン変更のドキュメントを自動更新する","Chrono Dawnに新しいボスやアイテムを追加するためのチェックリストを生成する","自動ドキュメントタスクを使用してリリースの準備を簡素化する"],"ko":["Minecraft 모드 버전 변경의 문서를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","Chrono Dawn에 새로운 보스나 아이템을 추가하는 체크리스트 생성","자동 문서 작업을 사용하여 릴리스 준비를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de documentación para cambios de versión de mods de Minecraft","Generación de listas de verificación para agregar nuevos jefes o artículos a Chrono Dawn","Optimización de la preparación de lanzamientos con tareas de documentación automatizadas"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de documentation pour les modifications de version de mods de Minecraft","Génération de listes de vérification pour ajouter de nouveaux boss ou articles à Chrono Dawn","Optimisation de la préparation de versions avec des tâches de documentation automatisées"],"de":["Automatisierung von Dokumentationsaktualisierungen für Änderungen an der Mod-Version von Minecraft","Erstellung von Prüflisten zum Hinzufügen neuer Bosse oder Artikel zu Chrono Dawn","Optimierung der Veröffentlichungsvorbereitung durch automatisierte Dokumentationsaufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação para alterações de versão de mod do Minecraft","Gerar listas de verificação para adicionar novos chefes ou itens ao Chrono Dawn","Otizar preparações de lançamento com tarefas de documentação automatizadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации для изменений версий модов Minecraft","Генерировать контрольные списки для добавления новых боссов или предметов в Chrono Dawn","Оптимизировать подготовку релизов с автоматическими задачами документации"],"ar":["تحديث التوثيق آليًا لتحديثات إصدارات ماين كرافت","توليد قوائم التحقق لإضافة رؤساء أو عناصر جديدة إلى Chrono Dawn","تبسيط إعدادات الإصدار مع مهام توثيق آلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires mention of specific tasks to activate the skill","Limited to documentation maintenance for Minecraft mods"],"zh":["需要指定任务以激活该技能","仅限于Minecraft模组的文档维护"],"ja":["スキルをアクティブにするために特定のタスクを指定する必要がある","Minecraftモッドのドキュメントのメンテナンスのみに限定される"],"ko":["스킬을 활성화하기 위해 특정 작업을 지정해야 함","Minecraft 모드의 문서 유지 보수에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la mención de tareas específicas para activar la habilidad","Limitado al mantenimiento de documentación para mods de Minecraft"],"fr":["Nécessite la mention de tâches spécifiques pour activer la compétence","Limité au maintien de la documentation pour les mods de Minecraft"],"de":["Erfordert die Erwähnung spezifischer Aufgaben, um die Fähigkeit zu aktivieren","Begrenzt auf die Dokumentationswartung für Minecraft-Mods"],"pt":["Exige menção de tarefas específicas para ativar a habilidade","Limitado à manutenção de documentação para mods do Minecraft"],"ru":["Требует упоминания конкретных задач для активации навыка","Ограничен поддержкой документации только для модов Minecraft"],"ar":["يتطلب ذكر مهام محددة لتنشيط المهارة","محدود بالدعم الفني للتعديلات فقط في ماين كرافت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jscriptcoder/jshack.me/expectations', 'community', 'jscriptcoder', 'jshack.me', 'jscriptcoder/jshack.me', 'expectations', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z', '2026-02-18T07:35:13.608Z', NULL, '{"id":"jscriptcoder/jshack.me/expectations","name":"expectations","description":{"zh":"代码期望值是指在编写代码时应有的最佳实践和原则，确保代码的可维护性和可扩展性","ja":"コードの期待値は、コードを書く際に持つべきベストプラクティスと原則で、コードの保守性と拡張性を確保する","ko":"코드 기대값은 코드를 작성할 때 지켜야 할 최적화된 관행과 원칙을 말하며, 코드의 유지보수성과 확장성을 보장합니다","es":"Nuestras expectativas para desarrolladores incluyen pensar profundamente, entender el contexto y refactorizar con valor","fr":"Nos attentes pour les développeurs incluent une réflexion approfondie, une compréhension du contexte et une refacturation avec valeur","de":"Unsere Erwartungen für Entwickler umfassen tiefes Nachdenken, Kontextverständnis und wertvolle Refaktorisierung","pt":"A habilidade Expectativas fornece diretrizes para desenvolvedores, incluindo pensamento profundo e refatoração eficaz. Aprenda a trabalhar com código de forma eficaz","ru":"Навык Ожидания предоставляет руководство для разработчиков, включая глубокое мышление и эффективную рефакторинг. Узнайте, как работать с кодом эффективно","ar":"مهارة التوقعات توفر إرشادات للمطورين، بما في ذلك التفكير العميق وإعادة الهيكلة الفعالة. تعلم كيف تعمل مع الكود بفعالية","en":"Capture the Flag game"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码期望值：开发最佳实践","ja":"コードの期待値：開発のベストプラクティス","ko":"코드 기대값: 개발 최적화","es":"Expectativas en el desarrollo de software","fr":"Attentes en développement de logiciel","de":"Erwartungen in der Software-Entwicklung","pt":"Expectativas: Melhores Práticas para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Ожидания: Лучшие Практики для Разработчиков","ar":"التوقعات: أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","en":"expectations"},"description":{"zh":"代码期望值是指在编写代码时应有的最佳实践和原则，确保代码的可维护性和可扩展性","ja":"コードの期待値は、コードを書く際に持つべきベストプラクティスと原則で、コードの保守性と拡張性を確保する","ko":"코드 기대값은 코드를 작성할 때 지켜야 할 최적화된 관행과 원칙을 말하며, 코드의 유지보수성과 확장성을 보장합니다","es":"Nuestras expectativas para desarrolladores incluyen pensar profundamente, entender el contexto y refactorizar con valor","fr":"Nos attentes pour les développeurs incluent une réflexion approfondie, une compréhension du contexte et une refacturation avec valeur","de":"Unsere Erwartungen für Entwickler umfassen tiefes Nachdenken, Kontextverständnis und wertvolle Refaktorisierung","pt":"A habilidade Expectativas fornece diretrizes para desenvolvedores, incluindo pensamento profundo e refatoração eficaz. Aprenda a trabalhar com código de form...","ru":"Навык Ожидания предоставляет руководство для разработчиков, включая глубокое мышление и эффективную рефакторинг. Узнайте, как работать с кодом эффективно","ar":"مهارة التوقعات توفر إرشادات للمطورين، بما في ذلك التفكير العميق وإعادة الهيكلة الفعالة. تعلم كيف تعمل مع الكود بفعالية","en":"Capture the Flag game"},"definition":{"en":"Capture the Flag game"},"features":{"zh":["深入思考代码","理解代码的全局背景","提出澄清问题","从第一原则思考","评估重构的价值","保持项目文档的更新"],"ja":["コードを深く考える","コードの全体的な背景を理解する","明確な質問を提起する","第一原則から考える","リファクタリングの価値を評価する","プロジェクトドキュメントを最新に保つ"],"ko":["코드를 깊게 생각한다","코드의 전체적인 배경을 이해한다","명확한 질문을 제기한다","첫 번째 원칙으로부터 생각한다","리팩토링의 가치를 평가한다","프로젝트 문서를 최신 상태로 유지한다"],"es":["Pensar profundamente antes de editar","Entender el contexto completo del código","Hacer preguntas clarificadoras","Pensar desde principios básicos","Evaluar la refactorización después de cada éxito","Mantener la documentación del proyecto actualizada"],"fr":["Réfléchir profondément avant de modifier","Comprendre le contexte complet du code","Poser des questions clarificatrices","Réfléchir à partir de principes de base","Évaluer la refacturation après chaque succès","Maintenir la documentation du projet à jour"],"de":["Tiefes Nachdenken vor der Bearbeitung","Vollständiges Verständnis des Code-Kontexts","Klärungsfragen stellen","Von Grundprinzipien ausgehen","Refaktorisierung nach jedem Erfolg bewerten","Projektdokumentation auf dem neuesten Stand halten"],"pt":["Pensamento profundo antes de fazer edições","Entendimento do contexto completo do código e requisitos","Perguntas esclarecedoras quando os requisitos são ambíguos","Avaliação da refatoração após cada confirmação","Manutenção de documentos de projeto atualizados"],"ru":["Глубокое мышление перед внесением изменений","Понимание полного контекста кода и требований","Задавание разъясняющих вопросов при неясных требованиях","Оценка рефакторинга после каждого подтверждения","Поддержание актуальности документации проекта"],"ar":["التفكير العميق قبل إجراء التعديلات","فهم السياق الكامل للكود والمتطلبات","الأسئلة الإيضاحية عند وجود متطلبات غامضة","تقييم إعادة الهيكلة بعد كل تأكيد","الحفاظ على توثيق المشروع الحالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码期望值","开发最佳实践","代码质量","开发效率","代码维护","代码扩展"],"ja":["コードの期待値","開発のベストプラクティス","コード品質","開発効率","コード保守","コード拡張"],"ko":["코드 기대값","개발 최적화","코드 품질","개발 효율성","코드 유지보수","코드 확장"],"es":["desarrollo de software","expectativas para desarrolladores","trabajo con código","refactorización","documentación de proyectos","principios básicos","desarrollo de aplicaciones","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","attentes pour les développeurs","travail avec le code","refacturation","documentation de projets","principes de base","développement d''applications","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Erwartungen für Entwickler","Arbeit mit Code","Refaktorisierung","Projektdokumentation","Grundprinzipien","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","melhores práticas","trabalho com código","refatoração","documentação de projeto","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","лучшие практики","работа с кодом","рефакторинг","документация проекта","разработчики"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","أفضل الممارسات","العمل مع الكود","إعادة الهيكلة","توثيق المشروع","المطورين"]}},"owner":"jscriptcoder","repo":"jshack.me","repoPath":"jscriptcoder/jshack.me","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expectations","description":"Working expectations and documentation practices. Use when capturing learnings or understanding how to work with this codebase.","bodyPreview":"# Expectations\n\n## When Working with Code\n\n1. **Think deeply** before making any edits\n2. **Understand the full context** of the code and requirements\n3. **Ask clarifying questions** when requirements are ambiguous\n4. **Think from first principles** - don''t make assumptions\n5. **Assess refactoring after every green** - but only refactor if it adds value\n6. **Keep project docs current** - Update CLAUDE.md when introducing meaningful changes\n\n## Documentation Framework\n\n**At the end of every signi","body":"# Expectations\n\n## When Working with Code\n\n1. **Think deeply** before making any edits\n2. **Understand the full context** of the code and requirements\n3. **Ask clarifying questions** when requirements are ambiguous\n4. **Think from first principles** - don''t make assumptions\n5. **Assess refactoring after every green** - but only refactor if it adds value\n6. **Keep project docs current** - Update CLAUDE.md when introducing meaningful changes\n\n## Documentation Framework\n\n**At the end of every significant change, ask: \"What do I wish I''d known at the start?\"**\n\nDocument if ANY of these are true:\n\n- Would save future developers >30 minutes\n- Prevents a class of bugs or errors\n- Reveals non-obvious behavior or constraints\n- Captures architectural rationale or trade-offs\n- Documents domain-specific knowledge\n- Identifies effective patterns or anti-patterns\n- Clarifies tool setup or configuration gotchas\n\n## Types of Learnings to Capture\n\n- **Gotchas**: Unexpected behavior discovered (e.g., \"API returns null instead of empty array\")\n- **Patterns**: Approaches that worked particularly well\n- **Anti-patterns**: Approaches that seemed good but caused problems\n- **Decisions**: Architectural choices with rationale and trade-offs\n- **Edge cases**: Non-obvious scenarios that required special handling\n- **Tool knowledge**: Setup, configuration, or usage insights\n\n## Documentation Format\n\n```markdown\n#### Gotcha: [Descriptive Title]\n\n**Context**: When this occurs\n**Issue**: What goes wrong\n**Solution**: How to handle it\n\n// CORRECT - Solution\nconst example = \"correct approach\";\n\n// WRONG - What causes the problem\nconst wrong = \"incorrect approach\";\n```\n\n## Code Change Principles\n\n- **Start with a failing test** - always. No exceptions.\n- After making tests pass, always assess refactoring opportunities\n- After refactoring, verify all tests and static analysis pass, then commit\n- Respect the existing patterns and conventions\n- Maintain test coverage for all behavior changes\n- Keep changes small and incremental\n- Ensure all TypeScript strict mode requirements are met\n- Provide rationale for significant design decisions\n\n**If you find yourself writing production code without a failing test, STOP immediately and write the test first.**\n\n## Communication\n\n- Be explicit about trade-offs in different approaches\n- Explain the reasoning behind significant design decisions\n- Flag any deviations from guidelines with justification\n- Suggest improvements that align with these principles\n- When unsure, ask for clarification rather than assuming\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:35:13.608Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring meticulous coding practices and documentation standards","zh":"适用于需要严格编码实践和文档标准的代码审查代理","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが厳格なコーディング慣行とドキュメント基準を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 엄격한 코딩 관행과 문서화 표준을 필요로 할 경우 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren prácticas de codificación meticulosas y estándares de documentación","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des pratiques de codage méticuleuses et des normes de documentation","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die sorgfältige Codierungspraktiken und Dokumentationsstandards erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem práticas de codificação meticulosas e padrões de documentação","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, требующих тщательных практик кодирования и стандартов документации","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكودية الذين يتطلبون ممارسات برمجة دقيقة ومعايير وثائقية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to adhere to strict coding guidelines, ensuring high-quality code through rigorous context understanding, clarifying questions, and principled refactoring, all while maintaining up-to-date project documentation in CLAUDE.md","zh":"赋予代理人遵循严格的编码指南的能力，通过严格的上下文理解、澄清问题和原则性的重构，确保高质量的代码，同时保持最新的项目文档在CLAUDE.md中","ja":"エージェントが厳格なコーディングガイドラインに従うことを可能にし、厳格なコンテキスト理解、質問の明確化、原則的なリファクタリングを通じて、高品質のコードを保証し、CLAUDE.md内の最新のプロジェクトドキュメントを維持します","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 코딩 가이드라인을 준수할 수 있도록 하며, 엄격한 문맥 이해, 질문의 명확화, 원칙적인 리팩토링을 통해 고품질의 코드를 보장하며, CLAUDE.md의 최신 프로젝트 문서를 유지합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes adherirse a directrices de codificación estrictas, asegurando un código de alta calidad a través de una comprensión rigurosa del contexto, aclarando preguntas y refactorización principled, manteniendo al mismo tiempo la documentación del proyecto actualizada en CLAUDE.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de se conformer à des directives de codage strictes, assurant un code de haute qualité grâce à une compréhension rigoureuse du contexte, à des questions éclaircissantes et à une refactoring principled, tout en maintenant à jour la documentation du projet dans CLAUDE.md","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, sich an strenge Kodierungsrichtlinien zu halten, indem sie Code von hoher Qualität durch rigoroses Kontextverständnis, klärende Fragen und prinzipielle Refactoring sicherstellen, während sie gleichzeitig die Projekt-Dokumentation in CLAUDE.md auf dem neuesten Stand halten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aderir a diretrizes de codificação estritas, garantindo código de alta qualidade por meio de uma compreensão rigorosa do contexto, esclarecimento de perguntas e refatoração principled, mantendo sempre a documentação do projeto atualizada em CLAUDE.md","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью следовать строгим руководящим принципам кодирования, обеспечивая высококачественный код посредством тщательного понимания контекста, разъяснения вопросов и принципледной рефакторинга, при этом поддерживая актуальность документации проекта в формате CLAUDE.md","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الالتزام بالمبادئ التوجيهية للترميز الصارمة، مما يضمن الحصول على رمز عالي الجودة من خلال فهم السياق القاسي، و�ء الأسئلة، وإعادة هيكلة المبادئ، مع الحفاظ على توثيق المشروع الحالي في CLAUDE.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring code for readability and performance","Generating and updating project documentation","Debugging ambiguous requirements through clarifying questions"],"zh":["重构代码以提高可读性和性能","生成和更新项目文档","通过澄清问题调试模糊的要求"],"ja":["コードをリファクタリングして可読性とパフォーマンスを向上させる","プロジェクトドキュメントを生成して更新する","明確化された質問を通じて曖昧な要件をデバッグする"],"ko":["코드를 리팩토링하여 가독성과 성능을 향상시키는 것","프로젝트 문서를 생성하고 업데이트하는 것","명확화된 질문을 통해 모호한 요구 사항을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de código para legibilidad y rendimiento","Generación y actualización de la documentación del proyecto","Depuración de requisitos ambiguos a través de preguntas aclaratorias"],"fr":["Réorganisation de code pour la lisibilité et les performances","Génération et mise à jour de la documentation du projet","Débogage d''exigences ambiguës grâce à des questions éclaircissantes"],"de":["Umstrukturierung von Code für Lesbarkeit und Leistung","Erstellung und Aktualisierung der Projekt-Dokumentation","Fehlerbehebung von mehrdeutigen Anforderungen durch klärende Fragen"],"pt":["Reorganização do código para legibilidade e desempenho","Geração e atualização da documentação do projeto","Depuração de requisitos ambíguos por meio de perguntas esclarecedoras"],"ru":["Рефакторинг кода для читаемости и производительности","Генерация и обновление документации проекта","Отладка неоднозначных требований посредством разъясняющих вопросов"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الكود للقراءة والأداء","توليد وتحديث توثيق المشروع","تصحيح متطلبات غامضة من خلال أسئلة توضيحية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project documentation in CLAUDE.md format","Assumes familiarity with coding best practices"],"zh":["需要项目文档以CLAUDE.md格式存在","假设熟悉编码最佳实践"],"ja":["CLAUDE.md形式のプロジェクトドキュメントが必要","コーディングのベストプラクティスに慣れていない場合に機能しない"],"ko":["CLAUDE.md 형식의 프로젝트 문서가 필요함","코딩 최선의 관행에 익숙하지 않은 경우에 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere documentación del proyecto en formato CLAUDE.md","Supone familiaridad con las mejores prácticas de codificación"],"fr":["Nécessite une documentation de projet au format CLAUDE.md","Suppose une familiarité avec les meilleures pratiques de codage"],"de":["Benötigt Projekt-Dokumentation im CLAUDE.md-Format","Geht von Vertrautheit mit Kodierungsbest-Praktiken aus"],"pt":["Exige documentação do projeto no formato CLAUDE.md","Pressupõe familiaridade com as melhores práticas de codificação"],"ru":["Требует документации проекта в формате CLAUDE.md","Предполагает знакомство с лучшими практиками кодирования"],"ar":["يتطلب توثيق المشروع بنظام CLAUDE.md","يفترض دراية بممارسات الترميز المثلى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
