rp Vaultを使用して実現する","ko":"Keycloak, OPA, HashiCorp Vault를 사용하여 아이덴티티 관리, 인증, 인가 구현","es":"Identity & Authentication abarca gestión de identidad, autenticación y autorización con tecnologías como Keycloak y HashiCorp Vault.","fr":"Identity & Authentication couvre la gestion des identités, l''authentification et l''autorisation avec des technologies comme Keycloak et HashiCorp Vault.","de":"Identity & Authentication umfasst Identitätsmanagement, Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mit Technologien wie Keycloak und HashiCorp Vault.","pt":"Este skill aborda gerenciamento de identidade, autenticação e autorização utilizando Keycloak, OPA e HashiCorp Vault.","ru":"Этот навык включает в себя управление идентификацией, аутентификацию и авторизацию с помощью Keycloak, OPA и HashiCorp Vault.","ar":"هذا المهارة يغطي إدارة الهوية والتحقق والتفويض باستخدام Keycloak و OPA و HashiCorp Vault.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Keycloak身份管理","OPA认证和授权","HashiCorp Vault安全存储","Realm和Client管理","用户和角色管理"],"ja":["Keycloakによるアイデンティティ管理","OPAによる認証と認可","HashiCorp Vaultによるセキュアなストレージ","RealmとClientの管理","ユーザーとロールの管理"],"ko":["Keycloak을 통한 아이덴티티 관리","OPA를 통한 인증 및 인가","HashiCorp Vault를 통한 보안 저장","Realm 및 Client 관리","사용자 및 역할 관리"],"es":["Gestión de identidades con Keycloak","Autenticación y autorización con OPA","Almacenamiento seguro de secretos con HashiCorp Vault","Gestión de permisos y roles","Autenticación multifactor","Integración con aplicaciones y servicios"],"fr":["Gestion des identités avec Keycloak","Authentification et autorisation avec OPA","Stockage sécurisé de secrets avec HashiCorp Vault","Gestion des permissions et des rôles","Authentification multifacteur","Intégration avec des applications et des services"],"de":["Identitätsmanagement mit Keycloak","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mit OPA","Sicheres Speichern von Geheimnissen mit HashiCorp Vault","Berechtigungs- und Rollenmanagement","Mehrstufige Authentifizierung","Integration mit Anwendungen und Diensten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de identidade com Keycloak","Autenticação e autorização com OPA","Armazenamento de segredos com HashiCorp Vault","Gerenciamento de papéis e permissões","Integração com aplicativos e serviços","Segurança e conformidade"],"ru":["Управление идентификацией с помощью Keycloak","Аутентификация и авторизация с помощью OPA","Хранение секретов с помощью HashiCorp Vault","Управление ролями и разрешениями","Интеграция с приложениями и сервисами","Безопасность и соответствие"],"ar":["إدارة الهوية باستخدام Keycloak","التحقق والتفويض باستخدام OPA","تخزين الأسرار باستخدام HashiCorp Vault","إدارة الأدوار والتصريحات","التكامل مع التطبيقات والخدمات","الأمان والمطابقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["身份管理","认证和授权","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","Realm","Client","用户","角色"],"ja":["アイデンティティ管理","認証と認可","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","Realm","Client","ユーザー","ロール"],"ko":["아이덴티티 관리","인증 및 인가","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","Realm","Client","사용자","역할"],"es":["autenticación","gestión de identidad","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","seguridad de aplicaciones","autorización","permisos","roles"],"fr":["authentification","gestion d''identité","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","sécurité des applications","autorisation","permissions","rôles"],"de":["Authentifizierung","Identitätsmanagement","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","Sicherheit von Anwendungen","Autorisierung","Berechtigungen","Rollen"],"pt":["gerenciamento de identidade","autenticação","autorização","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","segurança","conformidade","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["управление идентификацией","аутентификация","авторизация","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","безопасность","соответствие","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إدارة الهوية","التحقق","التفويض","Keycloak","OPA","HashiCorp Vault","الأمان","المطابقة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"FlexNetOS","repo":"ripple-env","repoPath":"FlexNetOS/ripple-env","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Identity & Authentication","description":"Identity management and authentication systems. Activate when: (1) Configuring Keycloak realms/clients, (2) Writing OPA policies, (3) Managing Vault secrets, (4) Implementing OIDC/OAuth2 flows, or (5) Setting up RBAC/ABAC authorization.","bodyPreview":"# Identity & Authentication\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill covers identity management, authentication, and authorization using Keycloak, OPA (Open Policy Agent), and HashiCorp Vault.\n\n## Keycloak\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n| Concept | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Realm | A tenant - isolated namespace for users, clients, roles |\n| Client | An application that can request authentication |\n| User | An identity that can authenticate |\n| Role | A set of permissions |\n| Group | A collection of users |","body":"# Identity & Authentication\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill covers identity management, authentication, and authorization using Keycloak, OPA (Open Policy Agent), and HashiCorp Vault.\n\n## Keycloak\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n| Concept | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Realm | A tenant - isolated namespace for users, clients, roles |\n| Client | An application that can request authentication |\n| User | An identity that can authenticate |\n| Role | A set of permissions |\n| Group | A collection of users |\n| Identity Provider | External auth source (LDAP, social login) |\n\n### Admin CLI (kcadm)\n\n```bash\n# Configure CLI\nkcadm.sh config credentials \\\n  --server http://localhost:8080 \\\n  --realm master \\\n  --user admin \\\n  --password admin\n\n# Create realm\nkcadm.sh create realms -s realm=myrealm -s enabled=true\n\n# Create client\nkcadm.sh create clients -r myrealm \\\n  -s clientId=myapp \\\n  -s enabled=true \\\n  -s publicClient=false \\\n  -s secret=mysecret \\\n  -s ''redirectUris=[\"http://localhost:8080/*\"]'' \\\n  -s ''webOrigins=[\"http://localhost:8080\"]''\n\n# Create user\nkcadm.sh create users -r myrealm \\\n  -s username=testuser \\\n  -s enabled=true \\\n  -s emailVerified=true \\\n  -s email=test@example.com\n\n# Set password\nkcadm.sh set-password -r myrealm --username testuser --new-password test123\n\n# Create role\nkcadm.sh create roles -r myrealm -s name=admin\n\n# Assign role to user\nkcadm.sh add-roles -r myrealm --uusername testuser --rolename admin\n```\n\n### OIDC Token Flow\n\n```bash\n# Get token (password grant - dev only)\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/realms/myrealm/protocol/openid-connect/token\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"client_id=myapp\" \\\n  -d \"client_secret=mysecret\" \\\n  -d \"username=testuser\" \\\n  -d \"password=test123\" \\\n  -d \"grant_type=password\"\n\n# Introspect token\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/realms/myrealm/protocol/openid-connect/token/introspect\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"client_id=myapp\" \\\n  -d \"client_secret=mysecret\" \\\n  -d \"token=<access_token>\"\n```\n\n## OPA (Open Policy Agent)\n\n### Rego Policy Basics\n\n```rego\n# policy.rego\npackage authz\n\nimport future.keywords.if\nimport future.keywords.in\n\ndefault allow := false\n\n# Allow admins everything\nallow if {\n    \"admin\" in input.user.roles\n}\n\n# Allow users to read own resources\nallow if {\n    input.action == \"read\"\n    input.resource.owner == input.user.id\n}\n\n# Allow read on public resources\nallow if {\n    input.action == \"read\"\n    input.resource.public == true\n}\n```\n\n### OPA CLI\n\n```bash\n# Evaluate policy\nopa eval -d policy.rego -i input.json \"data.authz.allow\"\n\n# Test policies\nopa test . -v\n\n# Run as server\nopa run --server policy.rego\n\n# Query server\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8181/v1/data/authz/allow \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"input\": {\"user\": {\"roles\": [\"admin\"]}}}''\n```\n\n### Policy Testing\n\n```rego\n# policy_test.rego\npackage authz\n\ntest_admin_allowed {\n    allow with input as {\n        \"user\": {\"roles\": [\"admin\"]},\n        \"action\": \"delete\",\n        \"resource\": {\"type\": \"post\"}\n    }\n}\n\ntest_user_cannot_delete {\n    not allow with input as {\n        \"user\": {\"roles\": [\"user\"]},\n        \"action\": \"delete\",\n        \"resource\": {\"type\": \"post\"}\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## HashiCorp Vault\n\n### Basic Operations\n\n```bash\n# Start dev server\nvault server -dev\n\n# Set address\nexport VAULT_ADDR=''http://127.0.0.1:8200''\n\n# Login\nvault login <token>\n\n# KV Secrets Engine\nvault secrets enable -path=secret kv-v2\nvault kv put secret/myapp/config api_key=xxx db_pass=yyy\nvault kv get secret/myapp/config\nvault kv get -field=api_key secret/myapp/config\n\n# List secrets\nvault kv list secret/myapp/\n```\n\n### Policies\n\n```hcl\n# myapp-policy.hcl\npath \"secret/data/myapp/*\" {\n  capabilities = [\"read\", \"list\"]\n}\n\npath \"secret/metadata/myapp/*\" {\n  capabilities = [\"list\"]\n}\n\npath \"database/creds/myapp\" {\n  capabilities = [\"read\"]\n}\n```\n\n```bash\n# Create policy\nvault policy write myapp myapp-policy.hcl\n\n# List policies\nvault policy list\n```\n\n### AppRole Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Enable AppRole\nvault auth enable approle\n\n# Create role\nvault write auth/approle/role/myapp \\\n    secret_id_ttl=10m \\\n    token_num_uses=10 \\\n    token_ttl=20m \\\n    token_max_ttl=30m \\\n    secret_id_num_uses=40 \\\n    token_policies=\"myapp\"\n\n# Get role ID\nvault read auth/approle/role/myapp/role-id\n\n# Generate secret ID\nvault write -f auth/approle/role/myapp/secret-id\n\n# Login with AppRole\nvault write auth/approle/login \\\n    role_id=<role_id> \\\n    secret_id=<secret_id>\n```\n\n### Dynamic Database Credentials\n\n```bash\n# Enable database secrets engine\nvault secrets enable database\n\n# Configure PostgreSQL\nvault write database/config/mydb \\\n    plugin_name=postgresql-database-plugin \\\n    connection_url=\"postgresql://{{username}}:{{password}}@localhost:5432/mydb\" \\\n    allowed_roles=\"readonly\" \\\n    username=\"vault\" \\\n    password=\"vault\"\n\n# Create role\nvault write database/roles/readonly \\\n    db_name=mydb \\\n    creation_statements=\"CREATE ROLE \\\"{{name}}\\\" WITH LOGIN PASSWORD ''{{password}}'' VALID UNTIL ''{{expiration}}''; GRANT SELECT ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO \\\"{{name}}\\\";\" \\\n    default_ttl=\"1h\" \\\n    max_ttl=\"24h\"\n\n# Get credentials\nvault read database/creds/readonly\n```\n\n## Integration Patterns\n\n### JWT Validation in API\n\n```python\n# Python example with PyJWT\nimport jwt\nfrom jwt import PyJWKClient\n\nKEYCLOAK_URL = \"http://localhost:8080/realms/myrealm\"\njwks_client = PyJWKClient(f\"{KEYCLOAK_URL}/protocol/openid-connect/certs\")\n\ndef validate_token(token: str) -> dict:\n    signing_key = jwks_client.get_signing_key_from_jwt(token)\n    return jwt.decode(\n        token,\n        signing_key.key,\n        algorithms=[\"RS256\"],\n        audience=\"myapp\",\n        issuer=KEYCLOAK_URL\n    )\n```\n\n### OPA Sidecar Pattern\n\n```yaml\n# Kubernetes deployment with OPA sidecar\nspec:\n  containers:\n    - name: app\n      image: myapp:latest\n    - name: opa\n      image: openpolicyagent/opa:latest\n      args:\n        - \"run\"\n        - \"--server\"\n        - \"--addr=localhost:8181\"\n        - \"/policies\"\n      volumeMounts:\n        - name: policies\n          mountPath: /policies\n```\n\n## External Links\n\n- [Keycloak Documentation](https://www.keycloak.org/documentation)\n- [OPA Documentation](https://www.openpolicyagent.org/docs/)\n- [Vault Documentation](https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs)\n- [OIDC Specification](https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:34:50.056Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security Agents requiring advanced identity management and authentication capabilities using Keycloak, OPA, and HashiCorp Vault.","zh":"适用于需要使用Keycloak、OPA和HashiCorp Vault进行高级身份管理和身份验证的安全代理。","ja":"Keycloak、OPA、HashiCorp Vaultを使用した高度なアイデンティティ管理および認証機能を必要とするセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Keycloak, OPA 및 HashiCorp Vault를 사용하는 고급 身分 관리 및 인증 기능이 필요한 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad que requieren capacidades avanzadas de administración de identidad y autenticación utilizando Keycloak, OPA y HashiCorp Vault.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité nécessitant une gestion avancée des identités et des capacités d''authentification utilisant Keycloak, OPA et HashiCorp Vault.","de":"Ideal für Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Identitätsverwaltungs- und Authentifizierungsfunktionen unter Verwendung von Keycloak, OPA und HashiCorp Vault benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança que exigem gerenciamento de identidade avançado e capacidades de autenticação usando Keycloak, OPA e HashiCorp Vault.","ru":"Идеально для агентов безопасности, требующих расширенного управления идентификацией и возможностей аутентификации с использованием Keycloak, OPA и HashiCorp Vault.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الأمن التي تتطلب إدارة الهوية المتقدمة والقدرات على المصادقة باستخدام Keycloak و OPA و HashiCorp Vault."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage user identities, authenticate clients, and authorize access using Keycloak realms, OPA policies, and HashiCorp Vault secrets, streamlining identity and access management across multiple applications and services.","zh":"赋予代理管理用户身份、验证客户端并使用Keycloak域、OPA策略和HashiCorp Vault密钥授权访问的能力，简化了多个应用程序和服务的身份和访问管理。","ja":"エージェントに、Keycloakのリーム、OPAのポリシー、HashiCorp Vaultのシークレットを使用して、ユーザーID、クライアントの認証、およびアクセスの承認を管理する能力を与え、複数のアプリケーションおよびサービスでのアイデンティティおよびアクセス管理を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트에 Keycloak 영역, OPA 정책 및 HashiCorp Vault 시크릿을 사용하여 사용자 ID, 클라이언트 인증 및 액세스 승인을 관리할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 여러 애플리케이션 및 서비스에서 身分 및 액세스 관리를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar identidades de usuario, autenticar clientes y autorizar el acceso utilizando reinos de Keycloak, políticas de OPA y secretos de HashiCorp Vault, simplificando la gestión de identidad y acceso en múltiples aplicaciones y servicios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les identités des utilisateurs, d''authentifier les clients et d''autoriser l''accès en utilisant des domaines Keycloak, des politiques OPA et des secrets HashiCorp Vault, simplifiant ainsi la gestion des identités et des accès à travers plusieurs applications et services.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benutzeridentitäten zu verwalten, Clients zu authentifizieren und den Zugriff unter Verwendung von Keycloak-Reichen, OPA-Richtlinien und HashiCorp-Vault-Geheimnissen zu autorisieren, wodurch die Identitäts- und Zugriffsverwaltung über mehrere Anwendungen und Dienste hinweg vereinfacht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar identidades de usuário, autenticar clientes e autorizar o acesso usando reinos Keycloak, políticas OPA e segredos HashiCorp Vault, simplificando o gerenciamento de identidade e acesso em várias aplicações e serviços.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять идентификацией пользователей, аутентифицировать клиентов и авторизовывать доступ с использованием реалмов Keycloak, политик OPA и секретов HashiCorp Vault, упрощая управление идентификацией и доступом в нескольких приложениях и сервисах.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة هويات المستخدمين والمصادقة على العملاء والموافقة على الوصول باستخدام ممالك Keycloak وسياسات OPA وأسرار HashiCorp Vault، وبذلك يُبسّط إدارة الهوية والوصول عبر تطبيقات وخدمات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing multi-factor authentication for web applications","Managing user roles and permissions across different realms","Integrating OPA policies for fine-grained access control and authorization"],"zh":["为Web应用程序实施多因素身份验证","管理不同领域的用户角色和权限","集成OPA策略以实现细粒度的访问控制和授权"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション向けのマルチファクタ認証の実装","異なるリームのユーザーロールと権限の管理","OPAポリシーの統合による細粒度のアクセス制御および認可"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 다요소 인증의 구현","다른 영역의 사용자 역할 및 권한의 관리","OPA 정책의 통합을 통한 세부적인 액세스 제어 및 승인"],"es":["Implementar la autenticación de múltiples factores para aplicaciones web","Gestionar roles y permisos de usuario en diferentes reinos","Integrar políticas de OPA para un control y autorización de acceso detallados"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une authentification à plusieurs facteurs pour les applications Web","Gérer les rôles et les autorisations des utilisateurs dans différents domaines","Intégrer des politiques OPA pour un contrôle et une autorisation d''accès détaillés"],"de":["Implementierung der Authentifizierung mit mehreren Faktoren für Webanwendungen","Verwalten von Benutzerrollen und -berechtigungen in verschiedenen Reichen","Integrieren von OPA-Richtlinien für eine detaillierte Zugriffssteuerung und -autorisierung"],"pt":["Implementar autenticação de vários fatores para aplicações web","Gerenciar funções e permissões de usuário em diferentes reinos","Integrar políticas OPA para controle e autorização de acesso granular"],"ru":["Реализация многофакторной аутентификации для веб-приложений","Управление ролями и разрешениями пользователей в разных реалмах","Интеграция политик OPA для тонкого контроля доступа и авторизации"],"ar":["تنفيذ المصادقة المتعددة العوامل لتطبيقات الويب","إدارة أدوار المستخدمين والسماحات عبر ممالك مختلفة","دمج سياسات OPA للتحكم الدقيق في الوصول والموافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Keycloak, OPA, and HashiCorp Vault setup and configuration","Limited to identity and authentication use cases"],"zh":["需要Keycloak、OPA和HashiCorp Vault的设置和配置","仅限于身份和身份验证的使用场景"],"ja":["Keycloak、OPA、HashiCorp Vaultの設定と構成が必要","アイデンティティおよび認証のユースケースのみに限定"],"ko":["Keycloak, OPA 및 HashiCorp Vault의 설정 및 구성이 필요","身分 및 인증의 유즈케이스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración y establecimiento de Keycloak, OPA y HashiCorp Vault","Limitado a casos de uso de identidad y autenticación"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la mise en place de Keycloak, OPA et HashiCorp Vault","Limité aux cas d''utilisation de l''identité et de l''authentification"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung und Konfiguration von Keycloak, OPA und HashiCorp Vault","Begrenzt auf Identitäts- und Authentifizierungsanwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Exige configuração e instalação do Keycloak, OPA e HashiCorp Vault","Limitado a casos de uso de identidade e autenticação"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Keycloak, OPA и HashiCorp Vault","Ограничен случаи использования идентификации и аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتثبيت Keycloak و OPA و HashiCorp Vault","محدود لحالات استخدام الهوية والمصادقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MrPointer/dotfiles/testing-e2e-containers', 'community', 'MrPointer', 'dotfiles', 'MrPointer/dotfiles', 'testing-e2e-containers', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z', '2026-02-18T07:35:08.341Z', NULL, '{"id":"MrPointer/dotfiles/testing-e2e-containers","name":"testing-e2e-containers","description":{"zh":"E2E容器测试解决方案是一种用于测试安装程序在不同Linux发行版中的兼容性和稳定性的方法","ja":"E2Eコンテナテストソリューションは、インストーラの互換性と安定性をさまざまなLinuxディストリビューションでテストするための方法です","ko":"E2E 컨테이너 테스트 솔루션은 다양한 Linux 배포판에서 설치 프로그램의 호환성과 안정성을 테스트하는 방법입니다","es":"Pruebas E2E de contenedores para probar instaladores binarios en distribuciones Linux compatibles","fr":"Tests E2E de conteneurs pour tester des installateurs binaires sur des distributions Linux prises en charge","de":"E2E-Container-Tests zum Testen von Binär-Installern unter unterstützten Linux-Distributionen","pt":"Técnica de teste de contêiner E2E para verificar a instalação em distribuições Linux","ru":"Методология тестирования контейнеров E2E для проверки инсталляции на дистрибутивах Linux","ar":"تقنية اختبار حاويات E2E للتحقق من التثبيت على توزيعات لينكس","en":"My personal dotfiles"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"E2E容器测试解决方案","ja":"E2Eコンテナテストソリューション","ko":"E2E 컨테이너 테스트 솔루션","es":"Pruebas E2E de Contenedores","fr":"Tests E2E de Conteneurs","de":"E2E-Container-Tests","pt":"Teste de Contêiner E2E: Técnicas de Teste de Instalador","ru":"Тестирование контейнеров E2E: Методы тестирования инсталл...","ar":"اختبار حاويات E2E: تقنيات اختبار المثبت","en":"testing-e2e-containers"},"description":{"zh":"E2E容器测试解决方案是一种用于测试安装程序在不同Linux发行版中的兼容性和稳定性的方法","ja":"E2Eコンテナテストソリューションは、インストーラの互換性と安定性をさまざまなLinuxディストリビューションでテストするための方法です","ko":"E2E 컨테이너 테스트 솔루션은 다양한 Linux 배포판에서 설치 프로그램의 호환성과 안정성을 테스트하는 방법입니다","es":"Pruebas E2E de contenedores para probar instaladores binarios en distribuciones Linux compatibles","fr":"Tests E2E de conteneurs pour tester des installateurs binaires sur des distributions Linux prises en charge","de":"E2E-Container-Tests zum Testen von Binär-Installern unter unterstützten Linux-Distributionen","pt":"Técnica de teste de contêiner E2E para verificar a instalação em distribuições Linux","ru":"Методология тестирования контейнеров E2E для проверки инсталляции на дистрибутивах Linux","ar":"تقنية اختبار حاويات E2E للتحقق من التثبيت على توزيعات لينكس","en":"My personal dotfiles"},"definition":{"en":"My personal dotfiles"},"features":{"zh":["自动化测试","多平台支持","容器化环境","安装程序兼容性测试","端到端测试"],"ja":["自動テスト","マルチプラットフォーム対応","コンテナ化環境","インストーラの互換性テスト","エンドツーエンドテスト"],"ko":["자동화 테스트","다중 플랫폼 지원","컨테이너화 환경","설치 프로그램 호환성 테스트","종단 간 테스트"],"es":["Pruebas de instaladores binarios en contenedores Docker","Compatibilidad con distribuciones Linux como Ubuntu, Debian y Fedora","Uso de goreleaser para crear instantáneas de binarios","Verificación de resultados y detención de contenedores","Repetición de pruebas para cada distribución Linux","Soporte para múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Tests d''installateurs binaires dans des conteneurs Docker","Compatibilité avec les distributions Linux comme Ubuntu, Debian et Fedora","Utilisation de goreleaser pour créer des instantanés de binaires","Vérification des résultats et arrêt des conteneurs","Répétition des tests pour chaque distribution Linux","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Tests von Binär-Installern in Docker-Containern","Kompatibilität mit Linux-Distributionen wie Ubuntu, Debian und Fedora","Verwendung von goreleaser zur Erstellung von Binär-Snapshots","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse und Beenden der Container","Wiederholung der Tests für jede Linux-Distribution","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen"],"pt":["Teste de instalação em contêineres Docker","Suporte a distribuições Linux","Uso de goreleaser para build de binários","Verificação de resultados","Repetição de testes para cada distribuição"],"ru":["Тестирование инсталляции в контейнерах Docker","Поддержка дистрибутивов Linux","Использование goreleaser для сборки бинарных файлов","Проверка результатов","Повторение тестов для каждой дистрибутивы"],"ar":["اختبار التثبيت في حاويات Docker","دعم توزيعات لينكس","استخدام goreleaser لبناء الملفات الثنائية","التحقق من النتائج","تكرار الاختبارات لكل توزيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["E2E容器测试","安装程序测试","Linux兼容性测试","容器化环境","自动化测试","软件测试","质量保证"],"ja":["E2Eコンテナテスト","インストーラテスト","Linux互換性テスト","コンテナ化環境","自動テスト","ソフトウェアテスト","品質保証"],"ko":["E2E 컨테이너 테스트","설치 프로그램 테스트","Linux 호환성 테스트","컨테이너화 환경","자동화 테스트","소프트웨어 테스트","품질 보증"],"es":["pruebas E2E","contenedores Docker","instaladores binarios","distribuciones Linux","goreleaser","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","compatibilidad de software"],"fr":["tests E2E","conteneurs Docker","installateurs binaires","distributions Linux","goreleaser","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","compatibilité de logiciels"],"de":["E2E-Tests","Docker-Container","Binär-Installer","Linux-Distributionen","goreleaser","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests","Software-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["teste de contêiner E2E","teste de instalação","contêineres Docker","distribuições Linux","goreleaser","desenvolvimento de software","teste de software"],"ru":["тестирование контейнеров E2E","тестирование инсталляции","контейнеры Docker","дистрибутивы Linux","goreleaser","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения"],"ar":["اختبار حاويات E2E","اختبار التثبيت","حاويات Docker","توزيعات لينكس","goreleaser","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"MrPointer","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"MrPointer/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-e2e-containers","description":"Run E2E tests of the installer inside Docker containers on supported Linux distributions (Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora). Use when (1) verifying installer behavior on Linux, (2) testing new installer flags or features end-to-end, (3) running the installer in a controlled environment, (4) reproducing or debugging Linux-specific issues, or (5) validating that changes work across all supported distros before pushing to CI.","bodyPreview":"# E2E Container Testing\n\nTest the installer binary inside Docker containers running the supported Linux distributions.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Build** the installer for the container platform\n2. **Start** a fresh container\n3. **Run** the installer inside it\n4. **Verify** results\n5. **Stop** the container\n6. **Repeat** for each distro (ubuntu, debian, fedora)\n\n## Step 1: Build the Binary\n\nUse goreleaser to build snapshot binaries for all platforms defined in `.goreleaser.yaml`. Run from the `installer","body":"# E2E Container Testing\n\nTest the installer binary inside Docker containers running the supported Linux distributions.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Build** the installer for the container platform\n2. **Start** a fresh container\n3. **Run** the installer inside it\n4. **Verify** results\n5. **Stop** the container\n6. **Repeat** for each distro (ubuntu, debian, fedora)\n\n## Step 1: Build the Binary\n\nUse goreleaser to build snapshot binaries for all platforms defined in `.goreleaser.yaml`. Run from the `installer/` directory:\n\n```bash\ncd installer && goreleaser build --skip before --snapshot --clean\n```\n\nThis produces binaries under `installer/dist/`, one per OS-arch combo. The docker-compose volumes mount `installer/` into containers at `/workspace/installer`, so the binary path inside the container follows this pattern:\n\n```\n/workspace/installer/dist/dotfiles_installer_<os>_<arch>/dotfiles-installer\n```\n\nFor example, on a macOS ARM host (Apple Silicon) running Linux ARM64 containers:\n\n```\n/workspace/installer/dist/dotfiles_installer_linux_arm64_v8.0/dotfiles-installer\n```\n\nFor Linux AMD64 containers:\n\n```\n/workspace/installer/dist/dotfiles_installer_linux_amd64_v1/dotfiles-installer\n```\n\n## Step 2: Run Tests in Containers\n\n**Start a fresh container for each test scenario** to avoid state leakage from previous runs. Reuse the image, but always start from scratch.\n\n```bash\ncd installer/docker\n\n# Start container\ntask ubuntu:start\n\n# Run the installer (adjust flags for the scenario being tested)\ndocker-compose -f ubuntu/docker-compose.yml exec --user testuser installer-test-ubuntu \\\n  sudo /workspace/installer/dist/dotfiles_installer_linux_arm64_v8.0/dotfiles-installer install \\\n    --shell zsh --shell-source auto --non-interactive --install-prerequisites\n\n# Verify results (scenario-dependent)\n# ...\n\n# Tear down before next test\ntask ubuntu:stop\n```\n\nFor standalone containers (without docker-compose), bind-mount the dist directory explicitly:\n\n```bash\ndocker run -d --name test-ubuntu --platform linux/arm64 \\\n  -v \"$(pwd)/../dist:/workspace/installer/dist:ro\" \\\n  ubuntu-installer-test-ubuntu:latest tail -f /dev/null\n\ndocker exec test-ubuntu /workspace/installer/dist/dotfiles_installer_linux_arm64_v8.0/dotfiles-installer install \\\n  --shell zsh --shell-source system --non-interactive\n\ndocker stop test-ubuntu && docker rm test-ubuntu\n```\n\n## Step 3: Verify Results\n\nVerification depends on what the test scenario is exercising. After running the installer, determine appropriate checks based on the flags and features being tested, then run them inside the container using `docker-compose exec` or `docker exec`.\n\n## Testing All Distros\n\nRun through all three distros. Always stop before starting the next test:\n\n```bash\ncd installer/docker\n\nfor distro in ubuntu debian fedora; do\n  task ${distro}:start\n  # ... run installer and verify ...\n  task ${distro}:stop\ndone\n```\n\n## Interactive GPG Testing\n\nFor testing the GPG key setup flow interactively (which requires automating GPG''s prompts), see the [testing-interactive-gpg skill][gpg-skill].\n\n[gpg-skill]: /Users/timorgruber/.local/share/chezmoi/.claude/skills/testing-interactive-gpg/SKILL.md\n\n## Gotchas\n\n- See [distro-specific notes](references/distro-notes.md) for platform quirks (zsh paths, brew behavior, package manager differences)\n- Homebrew''s first run downloads portable Ruby (~30MB) and can take several minutes\n- Fedora''s first `dnf` triggers a repo metadata sync (~30MB) - be patient or use generous timeouts\n- If brew errors with \"process has already locked\", a previous install was interrupted - start a fresh container\n- When running long tests, prefer running in background and polling for completion over setting very long timeouts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:35:08.341Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents requiring automated end-to-end container testing for Linux distributions.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化的 Linux 发行版端到端容器测试的 DevOps 代理。","ja":"Linux ディストリビューションに対する自動化されたエンドツーエンド コンテナ テストを必要とする DevOps エージェントに最適です。","ko":"리눅스 배포판에 대한 자동화된 종단 간 컨테이너 테스트가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que requieren pruebas automatizadas de extremo a extremo de contenedores para distribuciones de Linux.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps nécessitant des tests automatisés de bout en bout de conteneurs pour les distributions Linux.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die automatisierte End-to-End-Container-Tests für Linux-Distributionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que exigem testes automatizados de ponta a ponta de contêineres para distribuições Linux.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматизированного тестирования контейнеров от начала до конца для дистрибутивов Linux.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبارات آلية من النهاية إلى النهاية لتحزيمات لينكس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate testing of installer binaries inside Docker containers across various Linux distributions, including ubuntu, debian, and fedora, using goreleaser for snapshot binary builds and verifying results.","zh":"赋予代理自动化测试 Docker 容器中各种 Linux 发行版（包括 ubuntu、debian 和 fedora）的安装程序二进制文件的能力，使用 goreleaser 进行快照二进制构建，并验证结果。","ja":"Docker コンテナ内でさまざまな Linux ディストリビューション（ubuntu、debian、fedora を含む）のインストーラー二進数ファイルの自動テストをエージェントに可能にし、goreleaser を使用してスナップショット二進数ビルドを行い、結果を検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Docker 컨테이너 내에서 다양한 리눅스 배포판(ubuntu, debian, fedora 포함)의 설치 프로그램 바이너리 파일을 자동화된 테스트할 수 있도록 하며, goreleaser를 사용하여 스냅샷 바이너리 빌드를 수행하고 결과를 검증합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas de binarios de instalador dentro de contenedores Docker en varias distribuciones de Linux, incluyendo ubuntu, debian y fedora, utilizando goreleaser para compilar binarios de instantáneas y verificando los resultados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de binaires d''installation à l''intérieur de conteneurs Docker sur différentes distributions Linux, y compris ubuntu, debian et fedora, en utilisant goreleaser pour les constructions de binaires de captures instantanées et en vérifiant les résultats.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Tests von Installer-Binärdateien innerhalb von Docker-Containern über verschiedene Linux-Distributionen hinweg zu automatisieren, einschließlich ubuntu, debian und fedora, unter Verwendung von goreleaser für Snapshot-Binärbuilds und Überprüfung der Ergebnisse.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de binários de instalador dentro de contêineres Docker em várias distribuições Linux, incluindo ubuntu, debian e fedora, utilizando goreleaser para compilações de binários instantâneos e verificando os resultados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование бинарных установщиков внутри контейнеров Docker на различных дистрибутивах Linux, включая ubuntu, debian и fedora, используя goreleaser для сборки бинарных снимков и проверки результатов.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تشغيل اختبارات آلية لثنائيات التركيب داخل حاويات докر عبر توزيعات لينكس المختلفة، بما في ذلك أوبنتو وديبيان وفيدورا، باستخدام جوريلاسر لإنشاء ثنائيات لحظية وتحقق النتائج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating end-to-end testing for installer binaries on multiple Linux distributions","Verifying installer functionality within Docker containers","Streamlining the testing process for supported Linux distributions"],"zh":["自动化多个 Linux 发行版的安装程序二进制文件的端到端测试","在 Docker 容器中验证安装程序功能","简化支持的 Linux 发行版的测试过程"],"ja":["複数の Linux ディストリビューションに対するインストーラー二進数ファイルのエンドツーエンド テストの自動化","Docker コンテナ内でのインストーラー機能の検証","サポート対象の Linux ディストリビューションのテスト プロセスの合理化"],"ko":["여러 리눅스 배포판에 대한 설치 프로그램 바이너리 파일의 종단 간 테스트 자동화","Docker 컨테이너 내에서의 설치 프로그램 기능 검증","지원되는 리눅스 배포판에 대한 테스트 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de extremo a extremo para binarios de instalador en varias distribuciones de Linux","Verificar la funcionalidad del instalador dentro de contenedores Docker","Optimizar el proceso de prueba para las distribuciones de Linux compatibles"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de bout en bout pour les binaires d''installation sur plusieurs distributions Linux","Vérifier la fonctionnalité de l''installation à l''intérieur de conteneurs Docker"," Rationaliser le processus de test pour les distributions Linux prises en charge"],"de":["Automatisieren von End-to-End-Tests für Installer-Binärdateien auf mehreren Linux-Distributionen","Überprüfen der Funktionalität des Installers innerhalb von Docker-Containern","Optimieren des Testprozesses für unterstützte Linux-Distributionen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de ponta a ponta para binários de instalador em várias distribuições Linux","Verificar a funcionalidade do instalador dentro de contêineres Docker","Otizar o processo de teste para distribuições Linux suportadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование от начала до конца для бинарных установщиков на нескольких дистрибутивах Linux","Проверять функциональность установщика внутри контейнеров Docker","Оптимизировать процесс тестирования для поддерживаемых дистрибутивов Linux"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبارات آلية من النهاية إلى النهاية لثنائيات التركيب على توزيعات لينكس المتعددة","التحقق من وظيفة ثنائي التركيب داخل حاويات دوكر","تبسيط عملية الاختبار لتوزيعات لينكس المدعومة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker for containerization","Limited to supported Linux distributions (ubuntu, debian, fedora)","Needs goreleaser for binary builds"],"zh":["需要 Docker 进行容器化","仅限支持的 Linux 发行版（ubuntu、debian、fedora）","需要 goreleaser 进行二进制构建"],"ja":["コンテナ化に Docker が必要","サポート対象の Linux ディストリビューション（ubuntu、debian、fedora）のみ","二進数ビルドに goreleaser が必要"],"ko":["컨테이너화에 Docker 필요","지원되는 리눅스 배포판(ubuntu, debian, fedora)만 해당","바이너리 빌드에 goreleaser 필요"],"es":["Requiere Docker para la contenerización","Limitado a distribuciones de Linux compatibles (ubuntu, debian, fedora)","Necesita goreleaser para compilar binarios"],"fr":["Nécessite Docker pour la conteneurisation","Limité aux distributions Linux prises en charge (ubuntu, debian, fedora)","Nécessite goreleaser pour les constructions de binaires"],"de":["Benötigt Docker für die Containerisierung","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Linux-Distributionen (ubuntu, debian, fedora)","Benötigt goreleaser für Binärbuilds"],"pt":["Exige Docker para containerização","Limitado às distribuições Linux suportadas (ubuntu, debian, fedora)","Necessita de goreleaser para compilações de binários"],"ru":["Требует Docker для контейнеризации","Ограничен поддерживаемыми дистрибутивами Linux (ubuntu, debian, fedora)","Требует goreleaser для сборки бинарных файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب دوكر للتحزيم","محدود بتوزيعات لينكس المدعومة (أوبنتو، ديبيان، فيدورا)","يحتاج إلى جوريلاسر لإنشاء الثنائيات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sunholo-data/ailang/Builtin Developer', 'community', 'sunholo-data', 'ailang', 'sunholo-data/ailang', 'Builtin Developer', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z', '2026-02-18T07:35:36.959Z', NULL, '{"id":"sunholo-data/ailang/Builtin Developer","name":"Builtin Developer","description":{"zh":"Builtin Developer 技术允许开发者使用现代注册系统（M-DX1）添加新的内置函数，简化开发流程","ja":"ビルトイン開発者スキルは、モダンレジストリーシステム（M-DX1）を使用して新しいビルトイン関数を追加することで、開発プロセスを簡素化","ko":"빌트인 개발자 기술은 최신 등록 시스템(M-DX1)을 사용하여 새로운 내장 함수를 추가하여 개발 프로세스를 단순화","es":"El desarrollador integrado permite agregar nuevas funciones a AILANG con el sistema de registro moderno M-DX1, reduciendo el tiempo de desarrollo a 2,5 horas.","fr":"Le développeur intégré permet d''ajouter de nouvelles fonctions à AILANG avec le système de registre moderne M-DX1, réduisant le temps de développement à 2,5 heures.","de":"Der Builtin-Entwickler ermöglicht das Hinzufügen neuer Funktionen zu AILANG mit dem modernen Registrierungssystem M-DX1, wodurch die Entwicklungszeit auf 2,5 Stunden reduziert wird.","pt":"O Desenvolvedor Integrado permite adicionar funções personalizadas ao AILANG com o sistema de registro moderno M-DX1, reduzindo o tempo de desenvolvimento para 2,5 horas.","ru":"Встроенный Разработчик позволяет добавлять пользовательские функции в AILANG с помощью современной системы регистрации M-DX1, сокращая время разработки до 2,5 часов.","ar":"مطور مدمج يسمح بإضافة وظائف مخصصة إلى AILANG باستخدام نظام التسجيل الحديث M-DX1، ويتقلص وقت التطوير إلى 2,5 ساعة.","en":"For humans, a language is a tool for expression. For AIs, it''s a substrate for reasoning."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Builtin Developer 技术","ja":"ビルトイン開発者スキル","ko":"빌트인 개발자 기술","es":"Desarrollador Integrado: Agrega Funciones con M-DX1","fr":"Développeur Intégré: Ajoutez des Fonctions avec M-DX1","de":"Builtin-Entwickler: Fügen Sie Funktion