etadatos","Pruebas herméticas para garantizar la calidad","Validación y inspección automatizadas","Conexión automática en tiempo de ejecución","Reducción del tiempo de desarrollo en un 66%"],"fr":["Enregistrement de fonctions intégrées avec des métadonnées","Tests hermétiques pour garantir la qualité","Validation et inspection automatisées","Connexion automatique à l''exécution","Réduction du temps de développement de 66%"],"de":["Registrierung von integrierten Funktionen mit Metadaten","Hermétique-Tests zur Qualitätsgarantie","Automatisierte Validierung und Inspektion","Automatische Laufzeitverbindung","Reduzierung der Entwicklungszeit um 66%"],"pt":["Registro de funções personalizadas com metadados","Testes herméticos para garantir a qualidade","Validação e inspeção automática","Redução do tempo de desenvolvimento para 2,5 horas","Integração com o sistema de registro moderno M-DX1"],"ru":["Регистрация пользовательских функций с метаданными","Герметические тесты для обеспечения качества","Автоматическая проверка и инспекция","Сокращение времени разработки до 2,5 часов","Интеграция с современной системой регистрации M-DX1"],"ar":["تسجيل وظائف مخصصة مع بيانات وصفية","اختبارات هرمية لضمان الجودة","التحقق التلقائي والتفتيش","تقليل وقت التطوير إلى 2,5 ساعة","التكامل مع نظام التسجيل الحديث M-DX1"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Builtin Developer","AILANG","内置函数","现代注册系统","开发效率","hermetic 测试","自动验证"],"ja":["ビルトイン開発者","AILANG","ビルトイン関数","モダンレジストリーシステム","開発効率","hermetic テスト","自動検証"],"ko":["빌트인 개발자","AILANG","내장 함수","최신 등록 시스템","개발 효율","hermetic 테스트","자동 검증"],"es":["desarrollador integrado","AILANG","M-DX1","registro de funciones","pruebas herméticas","validación automática","conexión en tiempo de ejecución","reducción del tiempo de desarrollo"],"fr":["développeur intégré","AILANG","M-DX1","enregistrement de fonctions","tests hermétiques","validation automatisée","connexion à l''exécution","réduction du temps de développement"],"de":["Builtin-Entwickler","AILANG","M-DX1","Registrierung von Funktionen","Hermétique-Tests","automatisierte Validierung","Laufzeitverbindung","Reduzierung der Entwicklungszeit"],"pt":["Desenvolvedor Integrado","AILANG","funções personalizadas","registro de funções","M-DX1","desenvolvimento de software","testes herméticos","validação automática"],"ru":["Встроенный Разработчик","AILANG","пользовательские функции","регистрация функций","M-DX1","разработка программного обеспечения","герметические тесты","автоматическая проверка"],"ar":["مطور مدمج","AILANG","وظائف مخصصة","تسجيل الوظائف","M-DX1","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات هرمية","التحقق التلقائي"]}},"owner":"sunholo-data","repo":"ailang","repoPath":"sunholo-data/ailang","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Builtin Developer","description":"Guides development of AILANG builtin functions. Use when user wants to add a builtin function, register new builtins, or understand the builtin system. Reduces development time from 7.5h to 2.5h (-67%).","bodyPreview":"# Builtin Developer\n\nAdd new builtin functions to AILANG using the modern registry system (M-DX1).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Development time: ~2.5 hours** (down from 7.5h with legacy system)\n\n**Most common workflow:**\n1. Register builtin with metadata (~30 min)\n2. Write hermetic tests (~1 hour)\n3. Validate and inspect (~30 min)\n4. Runtime auto-wires (already done!)\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- User wants to add a new builtin function\n- User asks about builtin registration proc","body":"# Builtin Developer\n\nAdd new builtin functions to AILANG using the modern registry system (M-DX1).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Development time: ~2.5 hours** (down from 7.5h with legacy system)\n\n**Most common workflow:**\n1. Register builtin with metadata (~30 min)\n2. Write hermetic tests (~1 hour)\n3. Validate and inspect (~30 min)\n4. Runtime auto-wires (already done!)\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- User wants to add a new builtin function\n- User asks about builtin registration process\n- User needs to understand the builtin system\n- User wants to validate or inspect builtins\n- User asks \"how do I add a builtin?\"\n\n## System Overview\n\n**Status**: 🎉 **M-DX1 COMPLETE (Oct 2025)** - 52 builtins migrated, fully documented\n\n**Key Benefits:**\n- **67% faster**: 2.5h instead of 7.5h\n- **1 file instead of 4**: Single-point registration\n- **71% less code**: Type Builder DSL reduces boilerplate\n- **Automatic wiring**: Registry connects to runtime/link\n- **Hermetic tests**: MockEffContext with HTTP/FS mocking\n\n**Components:**\n- **Central Registry** (`internal/builtins/spec.go`) - Single registration point\n- **Type Builder DSL** (`internal/types/builder.go`) - Fluent type construction\n- **Test Harness** (`internal/effects/testctx/`) - Hermetic testing helpers\n- **CLI Commands** - Validation and inspection tools\n\n## Available Scripts\n\n### `scripts/validate_builtins.sh`\nValidate all builtins in the registry.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/builtin-developer/scripts/validate_builtins.sh\n```\n\n**What it checks:**\n- All builtins are registered\n- Proper metadata structure\n- Type signatures valid\n- Test coverage exists\n\n### `scripts/check_builtin_health.sh`\nRun ailang doctor and list commands.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/builtin-developer/scripts/check_builtin_health.sh\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Register the Builtin (~30 min)\n\n**Create or edit module file** (e.g., `internal/builtins/string.go`):\n\n```go\n// internal/builtins/string.go\nfunc init() {\n    registerMyBuiltin()\n}\n\nfunc registerMyBuiltin() {\n    RegisterEffectBuiltin(BuiltinSpec{\n        Module:  \"std/string\",\n        Name:    \"_str_reverse\",\n        NumArgs: 1,\n        IsPure:  true,        // or false with Effect: \"IO\"\n        Type:    makeReverseType,\n        Impl:    strReverseImpl,\n        Metadata: &BuiltinMetadata{\n            Description: \"Reverse a string (Unicode-aware)\",\n            Params: []ParamDoc{\n                {Name: \"s\", Description: \"String to reverse\"},\n            },\n            Returns: \"Reversed string\",\n            Examples: []Example{\n                {Code: `_str_reverse(\"hello\")`, Description: \"Returns \\\"olleh\\\"\"},\n            },\n            Since:     \"v0.3.15\",\n            Stability: StabilityStable,\n            Tags:      []string{\"string\", \"reverse\", \"unicode\"},\n            Category:  \"string\",\n        },\n    })\n}\n\nfunc makeReverseType() types.Type {\n    T := types.NewBuilder()\n    return T.Func(T.String()).Returns(T.String())\n}\n\nfunc strReverseImpl(ctx *effects.EffContext, args []eval.Value) (eval.Value, error) {\n    str := args[0].(*eval.StringValue).Value\n    runes := []rune(str)\n    for i, j := 0, len(runes)-1; i < j; i, j = i+1, j-1 {\n        runes[i], runes[j] = runes[j], runes[i]\n    }\n    return &eval.StringValue{Value: string(runes)}, nil\n}\n```\n\n**Key points:**\n- Use `RegisterEffectBuiltin()` in `init()`\n- Use Type Builder DSL for type construction\n- Include complete metadata (description, params, examples, tags)\n- Set `IsPure: true` for pure functions, or `Effect: \"IO\"` for effects\n\n**See:** [resources/type_builder_examples.md](resources/type_builder_examples.md) for type patterns\n\n### Step 2: Write Hermetic Tests (~1 hour)\n\n**Add tests in** `internal/builtins/register_test.go`:\n\n```go\nfunc TestStrReverse(t *testing.T) {\n    ctx := testctx.NewMockEffContext()\n\n    tests := []struct {\n        input    string\n        expected string\n    }{\n        {\"hello\", \"olleh\"},\n        {\"\", \"\"},\n        {\"🎉\", \"🎉\"},\n    }\n\n    for _, tt := range tests {\n        result, err := strReverseImpl(ctx, []eval.Value{\n            testctx.MakeString(tt.input),\n        })\n        assert.NoError(t, err)\n        assert.Equal(t, tt.expected, testctx.GetString(result))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Test Harness helpers:**\n- `testctx.NewMockEffContext()` - Create test context\n- `testctx.MakeString()`, `MakeInt()`, `MakeRecord()` - Create test values\n- `testctx.GetString()`, `GetInt()`, `GetRecord()` - Extract values\n\n**For HTTP/FS effects:**\n```go\nctx := testctx.NewMockEffContext()\nctx.GrantAll(\"Net\")  // Grant Net capability\nctx.SetHTTPClient(server.Client())  // Use test server\n```\n\n**See:** [resources/testing_patterns.md](resources/testing_patterns.md) for more examples\n\n### Step 3: Validate and Inspect (~30 min)\n\n**Run validation:**\n```bash\n# Validate all builtins\nailang doctor builtins\n\n# List all builtins by module\nailang builtins list --by-module\n\n# Check for orphaned builtins (migration safety)\nailang builtins check-migration\n```\n\n**Run tests:**\n```bash\n# Test specific builtin\ngo test -v internal/builtins -run TestStrReverse\n\n# Test all builtins\nmake test\n```\n\n**Test in REPL:**\n```bash\nailang repl\n> :type _str_reverse\nstring -> string\n\n> _str_reverse(\"hello\")\n\"olleh\" : string\n```\n\n### Step 4: Runtime Wiring (Automatic!)\n\nNo manual wiring needed! The registry automatically:\n- ✅ Registers with evaluator (`internal/eval`)\n- ✅ Adds to type environment (`internal/types`)\n- ✅ Links to runtime (`internal/runtime`)\n- ✅ Generates module interface (`internal/link`)\n\n**Feature flag removed in v0.3.10** - New registry is now the default.\n\n## Key Components\n\n### Central Registry\n\n**Location:** `internal/builtins/spec.go`\n\n**Features:**\n- Single registration point with `RegisterEffectBuiltin()`\n- Compile-time validation (arity, types, impl, effects)\n- Freeze-safe (no registration after init)\n- 52 builtins migrated\n\n### Type Builder DSL\n\n**Location:** `internal/types/builder.go`\n\n**Reduces type construction from 35 lines → 10 lines (-71%)**\n\n**Available methods:**\n```go\nT := types.NewBuilder()\n\n// Primitive types\nT.String()\nT.Int()\nT.Float()\nT.Bool()\nT.Unit()\n\n// Complex types\nT.List(elementType)\nT.Record(fields...)\nT.Tuple(types...)\nT.Con(\"TypeName\")\nT.Var(\"α\")\n\n// Function types\nT.Func(arg1, arg2, ...).Returns(returnType).Effects(\"IO\", \"FS\")\n\n// Type applications\nT.App(\"Result\", okType, errType)\n```\n\n**See:** [resources/type_builder_examples.md](resources/type_builder_examples.md)\n\n### Test Harness\n\n**Location:** `internal/effects/testctx/`\n\n**Value constructors:**\n- `MakeString(s string)` → StringValue\n- `MakeInt(i int)` → IntValue\n- `MakeFloat(f float64)` → FloatValue\n- `MakeBool(b bool)` → BoolValue\n- `MakeList([]Value)` → ListValue\n- `MakeRecord(map[string]Value)` → RecordValue\n\n**Value extractors:**\n- `GetString(Value)` → string\n- `GetInt(Value)` → int\n- `GetFloat(Value)` → float64\n- `GetBool(Value)` → bool\n- `GetList(Value)` → []Value\n- `GetRecord(Value)` → map[string]Value\n\n**Effect mocking:**\n- `ctx.GrantAll(effect)` - Grant capabilities\n- `ctx.SetHTTPClient(client)` - Mock HTTP\n- `ctx.SetFS(fs)` - Mock filesystem\n\n### Validation & Inspection\n\n**Commands:**\n```bash\nailang doctor builtins              # Health checks\nailang builtins list                # List all builtins\nailang builtins list --by-module    # Group by module\nailang builtins list --by-effect    # Group by effect\nailang builtins check-migration     # Check for orphaned builtins\n```\n\n**6 validation rules:**\n1. Type function exists and valid\n2. Implementation function exists\n3. Arity matches NumArgs\n4. Effect consistency (IsPure vs Effect field)\n5. Module name valid\n6. Metadata complete\n\n## Metrics\n\n**Development time:**\n| Task | Before | After | Savings |\n|------|--------|-------|---------|\n| Files to edit | 4 | 1 | -75% |\n| Type construction | 35 LOC | 10 LOC | -71% |\n| Total time | 7.5h | 2.5h | -67% |\n| Test setup | ~50 LOC | ~15 LOC | -70% |\n\n## Resources\n\n### Detailed Examples\n\n**For type patterns:**\n- [resources/type_builder_examples.md](resources/type_builder_examples.md) - All type patterns\n\n**For testing patterns:**\n- [resources/testing_patterns.md](resources/testing_patterns.md) - Hermetic test examples\n\n**For comprehensive guide:**\n- [M-DX1-FINAL-SUMMARY.md](../../../M-DX1-FINAL-SUMMARY.md) - Complete M-DX1 summary\n- `design_docs/planned/easier-ailang-dev.md` - Design rationale\n- `CHANGELOG.md` (v0.3.10+) - Version history\n\n### File Locations\n\n**Builtin files by module:**\n- `internal/builtins/string.go` - String functions (9 builtins)\n- `internal/builtins/math.go` - Math functions (37 builtins)\n- `internal/builtins/io.go` - IO functions (3 builtins)\n- `internal/builtins/net.go` - Network functions (1 builtin)\n- `internal/builtins/show.go` - Show typeclass (1 builtin)\n- `internal/builtins/json_decode.go` - JSON decoding (1 builtin)\n\n**Test files:**\n- `internal/builtins/*_test.go` - Builtin tests\n- `internal/effects/testctx/*_test.go` - Test harness tests\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 0: \"Zero-Arg\" Builtins (M-DX10 Unit-Argument Model)\n\n**⚠️ AILANG has no true nullary functions!** All functions that appear to take no arguments must take a `unit` parameter.\n\n```go\n// ✅ CORRECT - Unit-argument model\nRegisterEffectBuiltin(BuiltinSpec{\n    Module:  \"std/sharedmem\",\n    Name:    \"_sharedmem_keys\",\n    NumArgs: 1,  // Takes unit parameter!\n    Effect:  \"SharedMem\",\n    Type: func() types.Type {\n        T := types.NewBuilder()\n        return T.Func(T.Unit()).Returns(T.List(T.String())).Effects(\"SharedMem\")\n    },\n    Impl: func(ctx *effects.EffContext, args []eval.Value) (eval.Value, error) {\n        // args[0] is unit, ignored (validates arity)\n        keys := ctx.SharedMem.Cache.Keys()\n        // ...\n    },\n})\n\n// ❌ WRONG - True nullary (causes \"arity mismatch: 0 vs 1\")\nRegisterEffectBuiltin(BuiltinSpec{\n    Name:    \"_sharedmem_keys\",\n    NumArgs: 0,  // BUG!\n})\n```\n\n**Stdlib wrapper:**\n```ailang\nexport func keys(u: unit) -> list[string] ! {SharedMem} {\n    _sharedmem_keys(u)\n}\n-- Or expression body:\nexport func now() -> int ! {Clock} = _clock_now()\n```\n\n**Go tests must pass unit:**\n```go\n// ✅ Correct\nresult, err := impl(ctx, []eval.Value{&eval.UnitValue{}})\n\n// ❌ Wrong - causes arity mismatch\nresult, err := impl(ctx, []eval.Value{})\n```\n\n**Reference:** [M-DX10 design doc](../../../design_docs/implemented/v0_4_6/m-dx10-nullary-function-calls.md)\n\n### Pattern 1: Pure String Function\n\n```go\nRegisterEffectBuiltin(BuiltinSpec{\n    Module:  \"std/string\",\n    Name:    \"_str_len\",\n    NumArgs: 1,\n    IsPure:  true,\n    Type: func() types.Type {\n        T := types.NewBuilder()\n        return T.Func(T.String()).Returns(T.Int())\n    },\n    Impl: func(ctx *effects.EffContext, args []eval.Value) (eval.Value, error) {\n        s := args[0].(*eval.StringValue).Value\n        return &eval.IntValue{Value: len([]rune(s))}, nil\n    },\n})\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Effect Function with HTTP\n\n```go\nRegisterEffectBuiltin(BuiltinSpec{\n    Module:  \"std/net\",\n    Name:    \"_net_httpRequest\",\n    NumArgs: 4,\n    Effect:  \"Net\",\n    Type:    makeHTTPRequestType,\n    Impl:    effects.NetHTTPRequest,  // Uses ctx.GetHTTPClient()\n})\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Complex Record Types\n\n**See:** [resources/type_builder_examples.md](resources/type_builder_examples.md) for full example with nested records.\n\n## Progressive Disclosure\n\nThis skill loads information progressively:\n\n1. **Always loaded**: This SKILL.md file (workflow overview)\n2. **Execute as needed**: Scripts in `scripts/` (validation)\n3. **Load on demand**: Detailed type examples in `resources/`\n\n## Notes\n\n- No feature flag needed (default since v0.3.10)\n- Registry auto-wires to all subsystems\n- Test harness prevents network/FS side effects\n- Metadata enables future tooling (docs, LSP)\n- Type Builder DSL is type-safe at compile time\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:35:36.959Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to extend AILANG functionality with custom builtin functions using the modern registry system (M-DX1).","zh":"非常适合需要使用现代注册系统（M-DX1）扩展AILANG功能的AI代理，特别是添加自定义内置函数。","ja":"M-DX1（モダン・レジストリ・システム）を使用してAILANGの機能をカスタムビルトイン関数で拡張する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"M-DX1(모던 레지스트리 시스템)을 사용하여 AILANG 기능을 커스텀 빌트인 함수로 확장해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan ampliar la funcionalidad de AILANG con funciones integradas personalizadas utilizando el sistema de registro moderno (M-DX1).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''étendre la fonctionnalité d''AILANG avec des fonctions intégrées personnalisées en utilisant le système d''enregistrement moderne (M-DX1).","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die die AILANG-Funktionalität mit benutzerdefinierten eingebauten Funktionen unter Verwendung des modernen Registrierungssystems (M-DX1) erweitern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam estender a funcionalidade do AILANG com funções internas personalizadas usando o sistema de registro moderno (M-DX1).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо расширить функциональность AILANG с помощью пользовательских встроенных функций, используя современную систему реестра (M-DX1).","ar":"مثالي لويبوتات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى توسيع وظائف AILANG مع الدوال المضمنة المخصصة باستخدام نظام السجل الحديث (M-DX1)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to register new builtin functions with metadata, write hermetic tests, and validate runtime auto-wiring, leveraging the M-DX1 registry system for streamlined development and reduced development time from 7.5 hours to ~2.5 hours.","zh":"赋予代理注册新内置函数的元数据、编写幂等测试并验证运行时自动连接的能力，利用M-DX1注册系统实现开发流程的简化，并将开发时间从7.5小时减少到约2.5小时。","ja":"エージェントに新しいビルトイン関数を登録するためのメタデータ、ヘルメティックテストの記述、ランタイム自動ワイヤリングの検証を行う機能を提供し、M-DX1レジストリシステムを利用して開発プロセスを合理化し、開発時間を7.5時間から約2.5時間に短縮します。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 내장 함수를 등록하는 메타데이터, 헤르메틱 테스트를 작성하고 런타임 자동 와이어링을 검증하는 기능을 제공하여 M-DX1 레지스트리 시스템을 활용하여 개발 프로세스를 간소화하고 개발 시간을 7.5시간에서 약 2.5시간으로 단축합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a registrar nuevas funciones integradas con metadatos, escribir pruebas herméticas y validar el cableado automático en tiempo de ejecución, aprovechando el sistema de registro M-DX1 para un desarrollo optimizado y reducir el tiempo de desarrollo de 7,5 horas a ~2,5 horas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enregistrer de nouvelles fonctions intégrées avec des métadonnées, d''écrire des tests hermétiques et de valider le câblage automatique à l''exécution, en exploitant le système d''enregistrement M-DX1 pour un développement optimisé et réduire le temps de développement de 7,5 heures à ~2,5 heures.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, neue eingebauten Funktionen mit Metadaten zu registrieren, hermetische Tests zu schreiben und die Laufzeit-Autoverdrahtung zu validieren, indem sie das M-DX1-Registrierungssystem für einen optimierten Entwicklungsprozess und eine Reduzierung der Entwicklungszeit von 7,5 Stunden auf ~2,5 Stunden nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a registrar novas funções internas com metadados, escrever testes herméticos e validar o auto-encaminhamento em tempo de execução, aproveitando o sistema de registro M-DX1 para desenvolvimento simplificado e redução do tempo de desenvolvimento de 7,5 horas para ~2,5 horas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью регистрировать новые встроенные функции с метаданными, писать герметичные тесты и проверять автоматическое подключение во время выполнения, используя систему реестра M-DX1 для упрощенного развития и сокращения времени разработки с 7,5 часов до ~2,5 часов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تسجيل دوال جديدة مضمنة مع بيانات وصفية، وكتابة الاختبارات الهرمية، والتحقق من التوصيل التلقائي في وقت التشغيل، مستفيدة من نظام السجل M-DX1 لتطوير مبسط ووقت تطوير مخفض من 7.5 ساعة إلى ~2.5 ساعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Registering custom builtin functions with metadata","Writing hermetic tests for new builtin functions","Validating and inspecting builtin function integrations"],"zh":["注册带有元数据的自定义内置函数","为新内置函数编写幂等测试","验证和检查内置函数集成"],"ja":["メタデータを使用したカスタムビルトイン関数の登録","新しいビルトイン関数のためのヘルメティックテストの記述","ビルトイン関数の統合の検証と調査"],"ko":["메타데이터를 사용한 커스텀 빌트인 함수 등록","새로운 빌트인 함수를 위한 헤르메틱 테스트 작성","빌트인 함수 통합의 검증 및 조사"],"es":["Registro de funciones integradas personalizadas con metadatos","Escritura de pruebas herméticas para nuevas funciones integradas","Validación e inspección de integraciones de funciones integradas"],"fr":["Enregistrement de fonctions intégrées personnalisées avec des métadonnées","Écriture de tests hermétiques pour de nouvelles fonctions intégrées","Validation et inspection des intégrations de fonctions intégrées"],"de":["Registrierung benutzerdefinierter eingebauter Funktionen mit Metadaten","Schreiben hermetischer Tests für neue eingebauten Funktionen","Validierung und Inspektion von eingebauten Funktionsintegrationen"],"pt":["Registro de funções internas personalizadas com metadados","Escrita de testes herméticos para novas funções internas","Validação e inspeção de integrações de funções internas"],"ru":["Регистрация пользовательских встроенных функций с метаданными","Написание герметичных тестов для новых встроенных функций","Проверка и осмотр интеграций встроенных функций"],"ar":["تسجيل الدوال المضمنة المخصصة مع بيانات وصفية","كتابة الاختبارات الهرمية للدوال المضمنة الجديدة","التحقق من التكاملات الدوال المضمنة وتفتيشها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of AILANG and the M-DX1 registry system","Limited to adding new builtin functions only"],"zh":["需要AILANG和M-DX1注册系统的知识","仅限添加新的内置函数"],"ja":["AILANGとM-DX1レジストリシステムの知識が必要","新しいビルトイン関数の追加のみに限定される"],"ko":["AILANG과 M-DX1 레지스트리 시스템에 대한 지식이 필요","새로운 빌트인 함수 추가만 가능"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de AILANG y del sistema de registro M-DX1","Limitado a la adición de nuevas funciones integradas solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance d''AILANG et du système d''enregistrement M-DX1","Limité à l''ajout de nouvelles fonctions intégrées uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von AILANG und dem M-DX1-Registrierungssystem","Begrenzt auf das Hinzufügen neuer eingebauter Funktionen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de AILANG e do sistema de registro M-DX1","Limitado à adição de novas funções internas apenas"],"ru":["Требует знания AILANG и системы реестра M-DX1","Ограничен только добавлением новых встроенных функций"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة AILANG ونظام السجل M-DX1","محدود بالإضافة إلى دوال مضمنة جديدة فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
