-Chart","Einhaltung der Projektkonventionen","Legt die Verzeichnisstruktur des Charts fest","Erstellt Konfigurationsdateien wie Chart.yaml und values.yaml","Enthält Vorlagen für Bereitstellung, Dienst und Konfiguration","Ermöglicht die Verwaltung von Edge-Geräten mit SignalBeam Edge"],"pt":["Crie gráficos Helm personalizados","Gerencie dispositivos de borda com facilidade","Onboard, monitor e atualize dispositivos de borda","Siga as convenções do projeto","Crie estruturas de diretórios de gráficos Helm"],"ru":["Создайте пользовательские графики Helm","Управляйте устройствами на краю сети с легкостью","Внедрите, отслеживайте и обновляйте устройства на краю сети","Следуйте конвенциям проекта","Создайте структуру директорий графиков Helm"],"ar":["انشئ مخططات Helm مخصصة","ادرس أجهزة الحواف بسهولة","شمل وتتبع وأعد تشغيل أجهزة الحواف","اتبع اتفاقيات المشروع","انشئ هيكل دليل مخططات Helm"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Helm图表","边缘设备管理","Kubernetes","应用部署","SignalBeam Edge","添加Helm图表","简化管理","更新边缘设备"],"ja":["Helmチャート","エッジデバイス管理","Kubernetes","アプリケーションデプロイ","SignalBeam Edge","Helmチャートを追加","管理を簡素化","エッジデバイスを更新"],"ko":["Helm 차트","에지 디바이스 관리","Kubernetes","애플리케이션 배포","SignalBeam Edge","Helm 차트 추가","관리 간소화","에지 디바이스 업데이트"],"es":["Helm Chart","Kubernetes","SignalBeam Edge","dispositivos de edge","gestión de dispositivos","despliegue de aplicaciones","configuración de clúster"],"fr":["Graphique Helm","Kubernetes","SignalBeam Edge","appareils de edge","gestion des appareils","déploiement d''applications","configuration de cluster"],"de":["Helm-Chart","Kubernetes","SignalBeam Edge","Edge-Geräte","Geräteverwaltung","Anwendungs bereitstellung","Cluster-Konfiguration"],"pt":["gráfico Helm","SignalBeam Edge","dispositivos de borda","gerenciamento de dispositivos","onboard","monitoramento","atualização"],"ru":["график Helm","SignalBeam Edge","устройства на краю сети","управление устройствами","внедрение","отслеживание","обновление"],"ar":["مخطط Helm","SignalBeam Edge","أجهزة الحواف","إدارة الأجهزة","شمل","تتبع","إعادة تشغيل"]}},"owner":"signalbeam-io","repo":"signalbeam-edge","repoPath":"signalbeam-io/signalbeam-edge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-helm-chart","description":"Scaffold a new Helm chart with standard templates and values","bodyPreview":"# Add Helm Chart\n\nScaffold a new Helm chart following project conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `{chart-name}` — Name of the chart (required, e.g., `signalbeam-platform`, `device-manager`)\n\n## Process\n\n1. Create the chart directory structure under `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/`:\n\n```\ndeploy/charts/{chart-name}/\n├── Chart.yaml\n├── values.yaml\n├── templates/\n│   ├── _helpers.tpl\n│   ├── deployment.yaml\n│   ├── service.yaml\n│   ├── configmap.yaml\n│   ├── ingress.yaml\n│   └── hpa.yaml\n```\n\n2. Read `.clau","body":"# Add Helm Chart\n\nScaffold a new Helm chart following project conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `{chart-name}` — Name of the chart (required, e.g., `signalbeam-platform`, `device-manager`)\n\n## Process\n\n1. Create the chart directory structure under `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/`:\n\n```\ndeploy/charts/{chart-name}/\n├── Chart.yaml\n├── values.yaml\n├── templates/\n│   ├── _helpers.tpl\n│   ├── deployment.yaml\n│   ├── service.yaml\n│   ├── configmap.yaml\n│   ├── ingress.yaml\n│   └── hpa.yaml\n```\n\n2. Read `.claude/rules/helm-charts.md` for project conventions.\n\n3. Generate files following these conventions:\n   - Namespace: `signalbeam`\n   - Standard Kubernetes labels: `app.kubernetes.io/name`, `app.kubernetes.io/instance`, `app.kubernetes.io/version`\n   - Health check paths: `/health/live` (liveness), `/health/ready` (readiness)\n   - Resource limits and requests with sensible defaults\n   - HPA with min 1, max 3 replicas\n\n4. **Chart.yaml** template:\n```yaml\napiVersion: v2\nname: {chart-name}\ndescription: {description}\ntype: application\nversion: 0.1.0\nappVersion: \"0.1.0\"\n```\n\n5. **values.yaml** — Include configurable values for:\n   - `image.repository`, `image.tag`, `image.pullPolicy`\n   - `replicaCount`\n   - `resources.requests` and `resources.limits`\n   - `service.type`, `service.port`\n   - `ingress.enabled`, `ingress.hosts`\n   - `env` (environment variables as key-value map)\n\n6. Validate the chart:\n```bash\nhelm lint deploy/charts/{chart-name}\nhelm template test deploy/charts/{chart-name} > /dev/null\n```\n\n## After Scaffolding\n\nReport what was created and remind to:\n- Customize `values.yaml` for the specific service\n- Add environment-specific value overrides if needed\n- Update any umbrella chart dependencies if applicable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:35:58.352Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Kubernetes Agents needing streamlined Helm chart management and edge device fleet automation.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Helm图表管理和边缘设备集群自动化的Kubernetes代理。","ja":"KubernetesエージェントがHelmチャートの管理とエッジデバイスのフリート自動化を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"헬름 차트 관리 및 에지 디바이스 플릿 자동화를 간소화해야 하는 쿠버네티스 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Kubernetes que necesitan una gestión de gráficos de Helm optimizada y una automatización de flotas de dispositivos de borde.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Kubernetes ayant besoin d''une gestion de graphiques Helm rationalisée et d''une automatisation de flottes de périphériques de bord.","de":"Perfekt für Kubernetes-Agents, die eine optimierte Helm-Chart-Verwaltung und eine Automatisierung von Edge-Geräte-Flotten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Kubernetes que necessitam de gerenciamento de gráficos do Helm otimizado e automação de frota de dispositivos de bordo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Kubernetes, которым требуется оптимизированное управление диаграммами Helm и автоматизация флота устройств края.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Kubernetes الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مخططات Helm المُبسطة وتحسين أتمتة أجهزة الحافة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scaffold new Helm charts following project conventions, utilizing Helm''s templating engine and YAML configurations for deployments, services, and ingress routes, all while supporting edge device management through SignalBeam Edge.","zh":"赋予代理创建新的Helm图表的能力，遵循项目惯例，利用Helm的模板引擎和YAML配置进行部署、服务和入站路由，同时支持通过SignalBeam Edge进行边缘设备管理。","ja":"プロジェクトの規約に従って新しいHelmチャートをスケルトン化し、HelmのテンプレートエンジンとYAML構成を使用してデプロイ、サービス、および入力ルートを実行し、同時にSignalBeam Edgeを介したエッジデバイスの管理をサポートします。","ko":"프로젝트 규칙에 따라 새로운 헬름 차트를 스캐폴딩하고 헬름의 템플릿 엔진 및 YAML 구성으로 배포, 서비스 및 인그레스 ルート를 사용하면서 시그널빔 에지를 통해 에지 디바이스 관리를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevos gráficos de Helm siguiendo las convenciones del proyecto, utilizando el motor de plantillas de Helm y configuraciones YAML para implementaciones, servicios y rutas de ingreso, todo mientras admite la administración de dispositivos de borde a través de SignalBeam Edge.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux graphiques Helm en suivant les conventions du projet, en utilisant le moteur de modèles Helm et des configurations YAML pour les déploiements, les services et les routes d''entrée, le tout tout en prenant en charge la gestion des périphériques de bord via SignalBeam Edge.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, neue Helm-Chart-Vorlagen zu erstellen, die den Projektvorgaben entsprechen, indem sie den Helm-Vorlagenmotor und YAML-Konfigurationen für Bereitstellungen, Dienste und Eingangswege verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig die Geräteverwaltung über SignalBeam Edge unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos gráficos do Helm seguindo as convenções do projeto, utilizando o mecanismo de modelagem do Helm e configurações YAML para implantações, serviços e rotas de entrada, tudo isso enquanto suporta o gerenciamento de dispositivos de bordo por meio do SignalBeam Edge.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые диаграммы Helm, следующими проектным соглашениям, используя движок шаблонов Helm и конфигурации YAML для развертываний, служб и маршрутов входа, все это при поддержке управления устройствами края через SignalBeam Edge.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مخططات Helm جديدة اتباعًا لتقاليد المشروع، باستخدام محرك قوالب Helm وتكوينات YAML للنشرات والخدمات وطرق الدخول، وكل ذلك مع دعم إدارة أجهزة الحافة من خلال SignalBeam Edge."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new Helm charts for edge device deployments","Automating fleet management of Raspberry Pi devices running containers"," Templating YAML configurations for Kubernetes deployments"],"zh":["为边缘设备部署创建新的Helm图表","自动化运行容器的树莓派设备的集群管理","为Kubernetes部署模板化YAML配置"],"ja":["エッジデバイスのデプロイのための新しいHelmチャートの作成","コンテナを実行するラズベリーパイデバイスのフリート管理の自動化","KubernetesデプロイのためのYAML構成のテンプレート化"],"ko":["에지 디바이스 배포를 위한 새로운 헬름 차트 생성","컨테이너를 실행하는 라즈베리 파이 디바이스의 플릿 관리 자동화","쿠버네티스 배포를 위한 YAML 구성 템플릿화"],"es":["Creación de nuevos gráficos de Helm para implementaciones de dispositivos de borde","Automatización de la administración de flotas de dispositivos Raspberry Pi que ejecutan contenedores","Creación de configuraciones YAML para implementaciones de Kubernetes"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux graphiques Helm pour les déploiements de périphériques de bord","Automatisation de la gestion de flottes de périphériques Raspberry Pi exécutant des conteneurs","Modélisation de configurations YAML pour les déploiements Kubernetes"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Helm-Chart-Vorlagen für Edge-Geräte-Implementierungen","Automatisierung der Flottenverwaltung von Raspberry-Pi-Geräten, die Container ausführen","Vorlagen für YAML-Konfigurationen für Kubernetes-Implementierungen"],"pt":["Criação de novos gráficos do Helm para implantações de dispositivos de bordo","Automação do gerenciamento de frota de dispositivos Raspberry Pi que executam contêineres","Modelagem de configurações YAML para implantações do Kubernetes"],"ru":["Создание новых диаграмм Helm для развертываний устройств края","Автоматизация управления флотом устройств Raspberry Pi, запускающих контейнеры","Шаблонизация конфигураций YAML для развертываний Kubernetes"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات Helm جديدة لنشر أجهزة الحافة","أتمتة إدارة أساطيل أجهزة Raspberry Pi التي تعمل بالحاويات","تمثيل تكوينات YAML لنشرات Kubernetes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Helm installation","Limited to YAML-based chart configurations","Dependent on SignalBeam Edge for edge device management"],"zh":["需要Helm安装","仅限YAML 기반的图表配置","依赖于SignalBeam Edge进行边缘设备管理"],"ja":["Helmのインストールが必要","YAMLベースのチャート構成のみ","エッジデバイスの管理にはSignalBeam Edgeに依存"],"ko":["헬름 설치가 필요함","YAML 기반의 차트 구성만 지원","에지 디바이스 관리에는 시그널빔 에지에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Helm","Limitado a configuraciones de gráficos basados en YAML","Dependiente de SignalBeam Edge para la administración de dispositivos de borde"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Helm","Limité aux configurations de graphiques basées sur YAML","Dépendant de SignalBeam Edge pour la gestion des périphériques de bord"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Helm","Begrenzt auf YAML-basierte Chart-Konfigurationen","Abhängig von SignalBeam Edge für die Geräteverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Helm","Limitado a configurações de gráficos baseadas em YAML","Dependente do SignalBeam Edge para gerenciamento de dispositivos de bordo"],"ru":["Требует установки Helm","Ограничен конфигурациями диаграмм на основе YAML","Зависит от SignalBeam Edge для управления устройствами края"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Helm","محدود بتكوينات المخططات القائمة على YAML","يعتمد على SignalBeam Edge لإدارة أجهزة الحافة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sanand0/scientific-research/rdkit', 'community', 'sanand0', 'scientific-research', 'sanand0/scientific-research', 'rdkit', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z', '2026-02-18T07:35:52.052Z', NULL, '{"id":"sanand0/scientific-research/rdkit","name":"rdkit","description":{"zh":"RDKit, API","ja":"RDKit, API","ko":"RDKit, API","es":"RDKit es una biblioteca de quimioinformática que proporciona APIs de Python para análisis y manipulación molecular. Ideal para tareas de investigación científica y descubrimiento de fármacos","fr":"RDKit est une bibliothèque de chimo-informatique qui fournit des API Python pour l''analyse et la manipulation moléculaire. Idéal pour les tâches de recherche scientifique et de découverte de médicaments","de":"RDKit ist eine Chemoinformatik-Bibliothek, die Python-APIs für Molekül-Analyse und -Manipulation bereitstellt. Ideal für wissenschaftliche Forschungsaufgaben und Arzneimittelentdeckung","pt":"RDKit é uma biblioteca de quimioinformática que fornece APIs em Python para análise e manipulação molecular. É utilizada em pesquisas de descoberta de drogas, química computacional e quimioinformática.","ru":"RDKit - это комплексная библиотека хемоинформатики, предоставляющая Python API для анализа и манипуляции молекулами. Она используется в исследованиях по открытию лекарств, вычислительной химии и хемоинформатике.","ar":"RDKit هي مكتبة كيمياء المعلومات التي توفر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات Python لتحليل وتصنيع الجزيئات. يتم استخدامها في أبحاث اكتشاف الأدوية والكيمياء الحاسوبية وكيمياء المعلومات.","en":"Scientific Research"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"RDKit ","ja":"RDKit","ko":"RDKit ","es":"RDKit: Biblioteca de Quimioinformática para Análisis Mole...","fr":"RDKit : Bibliothèque de Chimo-informatique pour l''Analyse...","de":"RDKit: Chemoinformatik-Bibliothek für Molekül-Analyse","pt":"RDKit: Ferramenta de Quimioinformática para Análise Molec...","ru":"RDKit: Комплексная библиотека хемоинформатики для анализа...","ar":"RDKit: أداة كيمياء المعلومات لتحليل الجزيئات","en":"rdkit"},"description":{"zh":"RDKit, API","ja":"RDKit, API","ko":"RDKit, API","es":"RDKit es una biblioteca de quimioinformática que proporciona APIs de Python para análisis y manipulación molecular. Ideal para tareas de investigación cientí...","fr":"RDKit est une bibliothèque de chimo-informatique qui fournit des API Python pour l''analyse et la manipulation moléculaire. Idéal pour les tâches de recherche...","de":"RDKit ist eine Chemoinformatik-Bibliothek, die Python-APIs für Molekül-Analyse und -Manipulation bereitstellt. Ideal für wissenschaftliche Forschungsaufgaben...","pt":"RDKit é uma biblioteca de quimioinformática que fornece APIs em Python para análise e manipulação molecular. É utilizada em pesquisas de descoberta de drogas...","ru":"RDKit - это комплексная библиотека хемоинформатики, предоставляющая Python API для анализа и манипуляции молекулами. Она используется в исследованиях по откр...","ar":"RDKit هي مكتبة كيمياء المعلومات التي توفر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات Python لتحليل وتصنيع الجزيئات. يتم استخدامها في أبحاث اكتشاف الأدوية والكيمياء الحاسوبية وكيمي...","en":"Scientific Research"},"definition":{"en":"Scientific Research"},"features":{"zh":["RDKit API","2D/3D","","API",""],"ja":["RDKit API","2D/3D","","API",""],"ko":["RDKit API","2D/3D","","API",""],"es":["Análisis de estructuras moleculares","Cálculo de descriptores","Búsqueda de subestructuras","Generación de coordenadas 2D/3D","Visualización molecular"],"fr":["Analyse de structures moléculaires","Calcul de descripteurs","Recherche de sous-structures","Génération de coordonnées 2D/3D","Visualisation moléculaire"],"de":["Analyse von Molekül-Strukturen","Berechnung von Deskriptoren","Suche nach Substrukturen","Generierung von 2D/3D-Koordinaten","Molekül-Visualisierung"],"pt":["Leitura e escrita de estruturas moleculares","Cálculo de descritores moleculares","Pesquisa de subestruturas","Geração de coordenadas 2D/3D","Visualização molecular"],"ru":["Чтение и запись молекулярных структур","Расчет молекулярных дескрипторов","Поиск субструктур","Генерация 2D/3D координат","Молекулярная визуализация"],"ar":["قراءة وكتابة البنيات الجزيئية","حساب الموصفات الجزيئية","بحث البنية الفرعية","توليد إحداثيات 2D/3D","تجسيم الجزيئات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RDKit","API","","2D/3D","","cheminformatics","python",""],"ja":["RDKit","API","","2D/3D","","cheminformatics","python",""],"ko":["RDKit","API","","2D/3D","","cheminformatics","python",""],"es":["quimioinformática","análisis molecular","descubrimiento de fármacos","RDKit","Python","biblioteca de quimioinformática"],"fr":["chimo-informatique","analyse moléculaire","découverte de médicaments","RDKit","Python","bibliothèque de chimo-informatique"],"de":["Chemoinformatik","Molekül-Analyse","Arzneimittelentdeckung","RDKit","Python","Chemoinformatik-Bibliothek"],"pt":["quimioinformática","análise molecular","manipulação molecular","descoberta de drogas","química computacional","RDKit"],"ru":["хемоинформатика","анализ молекул","манипуляция молекулами","открытие лекарств","вычислительная химия","RDKit"],"ar":["كيمياء المعلومات","تحليل جزيئي","تصنيع جزيئي","اكتشاف الأدوية","الكيمياء الحاسوبية","RDKit"]}},"owner":"sanand0","repo":"scientific-research","repoPath":"sanand0/scientific-research","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rdkit","description":"Cheminformatics toolkit for fine-grained molecular control. SMILES/SDF parsing, descriptors (MW, LogP, TPSA), fingerprints, substructure search, 2D/3D generation, similarity, reactions. For standard workflows with simpler interface, use datamol (wrapper around RDKit). Use rdkit for advanced control, custom sanitization, specialized algorithms.","bodyPreview":"# RDKit Cheminformatics Toolkit\n\n## Overview\n\nRDKit is a comprehensive cheminformatics library providing Python APIs for molecular analysis and manipulation. This skill provides guidance for reading/writing molecular structures, calculating descriptors, fingerprinting, substructure searching, chemical reactions, 2D/3D coordinate generation, and molecular visualization. Use this skill for drug discovery, computational chemistry, and cheminformatics research tasks.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Mo","body":"# RDKit Cheminformatics Toolkit\n\n## Overview\n\nRDKit is a comprehensive cheminformatics library providing Python APIs for molecular analysis and manipulation. This skill provides guidance for reading/writing molecular structures, calculating descriptors, fingerprinting, substructure searching, chemical reactions, 2D/3D coordinate generation, and molecular visualization. Use this skill for drug discovery, computational chemistry, and cheminformatics research tasks.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Molecular I/O and Creation\n\n**Reading Molecules:**\n\nRead molecular structures from various formats:\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit import Chem\n\n# From SMILES strings\nmol = Chem.MolFromSmiles(''Cc1ccccc1'')  # Returns Mol object or None\n\n# From MOL files\nmol = Chem.MolFromMolFile(''path/to/file.mol'')\n\n# From MOL blocks (string data)\nmol = Chem.MolFromMolBlock(mol_block_string)\n\n# From InChI\nmol = Chem.MolFromInchi(''InChI=1S/C6H6/c1-2-4-6-5-3-1/h1-6H'')\n```\n\n**Writing Molecules:**\n\nConvert molecules to text representations:\n\n```python\n# To canonical SMILES\nsmiles = Chem.MolToSmiles(mol)\n\n# To MOL block\nmol_block = Chem.MolToMolBlock(mol)\n\n# To InChI\ninchi = Chem.MolToInchi(mol)\n```\n\n**Batch Processing:**\n\nFor processing multiple molecules, use Supplier/Writer objects:\n\n```python\n# Read SDF files\nsuppl = Chem.SDMolSupplier(''molecules.sdf'')\nfor mol in suppl:\n    if mol is not None:  # Check for parsing errors\n        # Process molecule\n        pass\n\n# Read SMILES files\nsuppl = Chem.SmilesMolSupplier(''molecules.smi'', titleLine=False)\n\n# For large files or compressed data\nwith gzip.open(''molecules.sdf.gz'') as f:\n    suppl = Chem.ForwardSDMolSupplier(f)\n    for mol in suppl:\n        # Process molecule\n        pass\n\n# Multithreaded processing for large datasets\nsuppl = Chem.MultithreadedSDMolSupplier(''molecules.sdf'')\n\n# Write molecules to SDF\nwriter = Chem.SDWriter(''output.sdf'')\nfor mol in molecules:\n    writer.write(mol)\nwriter.close()\n```\n\n**Important Notes:**\n- All `MolFrom*` functions return `None` on failure with error messages\n- Always check for `None` before processing molecules\n- Molecules are automatically sanitized on import (validates valence, perceives aromaticity)\n\n### 2. Molecular Sanitization and Validation\n\nRDKit automatically sanitizes molecules during parsing, executing 13 steps including valence checking, aromaticity perception, and chirality assignment.\n\n**Sanitization Control:**\n\n```python\n# Disable automatic sanitization\nmol = Chem.MolFromSmiles(''C1=CC=CC=C1'', sanitize=False)\n\n# Manual sanitization\nChem.SanitizeMol(mol)\n\n# Detect problems before sanitization\nproblems = Chem.DetectChemistryProblems(mol)\nfor problem in problems:\n    print(problem.GetType(), problem.Message())\n\n# Partial sanitization (skip specific steps)\nfrom rdkit.Chem import rdMolStandardize\nChem.SanitizeMol(mol, sanitizeOps=Chem.SANITIZE_ALL ^ Chem.SANITIZE_PROPERTIES)\n```\n\n**Common Sanitization Issues:**\n- Atoms with explicit valence exceeding maximum allowed will raise exceptions\n- Invalid aromatic rings will cause kekulization errors\n- Radical electrons may not be properly assigned without explicit specification\n\n### 3. Molecular Analysis and Properties\n\n**Accessing Molecular Structure:**\n\n```python\n# Iterate atoms and bonds\nfor atom in mol.GetAtoms():\n    print(atom.GetSymbol(), atom.GetIdx(), atom.GetDegree())\n\nfor bond in mol.GetBonds():\n    print(bond.GetBeginAtomIdx(), bond.GetEndAtomIdx(), bond.GetBondType())\n\n# Ring information\nring_info = mol.GetRingInfo()\nring_info.NumRings()\nring_info.AtomRings()  # Returns tuples of atom indices\n\n# Check if atom is in ring\natom = mol.GetAtomWithIdx(0)\natom.IsInRing()\natom.IsInRingSize(6)  # Check for 6-membered rings\n\n# Find smallest set of smallest rings (SSSR)\nfrom rdkit.Chem import GetSymmSSSR\nrings = GetSymmSSSR(mol)\n```\n\n**Stereochemistry:**\n\n```python\n# Find chiral centers\nfrom rdkit.Chem import FindMolChiralCenters\nchiral_centers = FindMolChiralCenters(mol, includeUnassigned=True)\n# Returns list of (atom_idx, chirality) tuples\n\n# Assign stereochemistry from 3D coordinates\nfrom rdkit.Chem import AssignStereochemistryFrom3D\nAssignStereochemistryFrom3D(mol)\n\n# Check bond stereochemistry\nbond = mol.GetBondWithIdx(0)\nstereo = bond.GetStereo()  # STEREONONE, STEREOZ, STEREOE, etc.\n```\n\n**Fragment Analysis:**\n\n```python\n# Get disconnected fragments\nfrags = Chem.GetMolFrags(mol, asMols=True)\n\n# Fragment on specific bonds\nfrom rdkit.Chem import FragmentOnBonds\nfrag_mol = FragmentOnBonds(mol, [bond_idx1, bond_idx2])\n\n# Count ring systems\nfrom rdkit.Chem.Scaffolds import MurckoScaffold\nscaffold = MurckoScaffold.GetScaffoldForMol(mol)\n```\n\n### 4. Molecular Descriptors and Properties\n\n**Basic Descriptors:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem import Descriptors\n\n# Molecular weight\nmw = Descriptors.MolWt(mol)\nexact_mw = Descriptors.ExactMolWt(mol)\n\n# LogP (lipophilicity)\nlogp = Descriptors.MolLogP(mol)\n\n# Topological polar surface area\ntpsa = Descriptors.TPSA(mol)\n\n# Number of hydrogen bond donors/acceptors\nhbd = Descriptors.NumHDonors(mol)\nhba = Descriptors.NumHAcceptors(mol)\n\n# Number of rotatable bonds\nrot_bonds = Descriptors.NumRotatableBonds(mol)\n\n# Number of aromatic rings\naromatic_rings = Descriptors.NumAromaticRings(mol)\n```\n\n**Batch Descriptor Calculation:**\n\n```python\n# Calculate all descriptors at once\nall_descriptors = Descriptors.CalcMolDescriptors(mol)\n# Returns dictionary: {''MolWt'': 180.16, ''MolLogP'': 1.23, ...}\n\n# Get list of available descriptor names\ndescriptor_names = [desc[0] for desc in Descriptors._descList]\n```\n\n**Lipinski''s Rule of Five:**\n\n```python\n# Check drug-likeness\nmw = Descriptors.MolWt(mol) <= 500\nlogp = Descriptors.MolLogP(mol) <= 5\nhbd = Descriptors.NumHDonors(mol) <= 5\nhba = Descriptors.NumHAcceptors(mol) <= 10\n\nis_drug_like = mw and logp and hbd and hba\n```\n\n### 5. Fingerprints and Molecular Similarity\n\n**Fingerprint Types:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem import AllChem, RDKFingerprint\nfrom rdkit.Chem.AtomPairs import Pairs, Torsions\nfrom rdkit.Chem import MACCSkeys\n\n# RDKit topological fingerprint\nfp = Chem.RDKFingerprint(mol)\n\n# Morgan fingerprints (circular fingerprints, similar to ECFP)\nfp = AllChem.GetMorganFingerprint(mol, radius=2)\nfp_bits = AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(mol, radius=2, nBits=2048)\n\n# MACCS keys (166-bit structural key)\nfp = MACCSkeys.GenMACCSKeys(mol)\n\n# Atom pair fingerprints\nfp = Pairs.GetAtomPairFingerprint(mol)\n\n# Topological torsion fingerprints\nfp = Torsions.GetTopologicalTorsionFingerprint(mol)\n\n# Avalon fingerprints (if available)\nfrom rdkit.Avalon import pyAvalonTools\nfp = pyAvalonTools.GetAvalonFP(mol)\n```\n\n**Similarity Calculation:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit import DataStructs\n\n# Calculate Tanimoto similarity\nfp1 = AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(mol1, radius=2)\nfp2 = AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(mol2, radius=2)\nsimilarity = DataStructs.TanimotoSimilarity(fp1, fp2)\n\n# Calculate similarity for multiple molecules\nsimilarities = DataStructs.BulkTanimotoSimilarity(fp1, [fp2, fp3, fp4])\n\n# Other similarity metrics\ndice = DataStructs.DiceSimilarity(fp1, fp2)\ncosine = DataStructs.CosineSimilarity(fp1, fp2)\n```\n\n**Clustering and Diversity:**\n\n```python\n# Butina clustering based on fingerprint similarity\nfrom rdkit.ML.Cluster import Butina\n\n# Calculate distance matrix\ndists = []\nfps = [AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(mol, 2) for mol in mols]\nfor i in range(len(fps)):\n    sims = DataStructs.BulkTanimotoSimilarity(fps[i], fps[:i])\n    dists.extend([1-sim for sim in sims])\n\n# Cluster with distance cutoff\nclusters = Butina.ClusterData(dists, len(fps), distThresh=0.3, isDistData=True)\n```\n\n### 6. Substructure Searching and SMARTS\n\n**Basic Substructure Matching:**\n\n```python\n# Define query using SMARTS\nquery = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''[#6]1:[#6]:[#6]:[#6]:[#6]:[#6]:1'')  # Benzene ring\n\n# Check if molecule contains substructure\nhas_match = mol.HasSubstructMatch(query)\n\n# Get all matches (returns tuple of tuples with atom indices)\nmatches = mol.GetSubstructMatches(query)\n\n# Get only first match\nmatch = mol.GetSubstructMatch(query)\n```\n\n**Common SMARTS Patterns:**\n\n```python\n# Primary alcohols\nprimary_alcohol = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''[CH2][OH1]'')\n\n# Carboxylic acids\ncarboxylic_acid = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''C(=O)[OH]'')\n\n# Amides\namide = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''C(=O)N'')\n\n# Aromatic heterocycles\naromatic_n = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''[nR]'')  # Aromatic nitrogen in ring\n\n# Macrocycles (rings > 12 atoms)\nmacrocycle = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''[r{12-}]'')\n```\n\n**Matching Rules:**\n- Unspecified properties in query match any value in target\n- Hydrogens are ignored unless explicitly specified\n- Charged query atom won''t match uncharged target atom\n- Aromatic query atom won''t match aliphatic target atom (unless query is generic)\n\n### 7. Chemical Reactions\n\n**Reaction SMARTS:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem import AllChem\n\n# Define reaction using SMARTS: reactants >> products\nrxn = AllChem.ReactionFromSmarts(''[C:1]=[O:2]>>[C:1][O:2]'')  # Ketone reduction\n\n# Apply reaction to molecules\nreactants = (mol1,)\nproducts = rxn.RunReactants(reactants)\n\n# Products is tuple of tuples (one tuple per product set)\nfor product_set in products:\n    for product in product_set:\n        # Sanitize product\n        Chem.SanitizeMol(product)\n```\n\n**Reaction Features:**\n- Atom mapping preserves specific atoms between reactants and products\n- Dummy atoms in products are replaced by corresponding reactant atoms\n- \"Any\" bonds inherit bond order from reactants\n- Chirality preserved unless explicitly changed\n\n**Reaction Similarity:**\n\n```python\n# Generate reaction fingerprints\nfp = AllChem.CreateDifferenceFingerprintForReaction(rxn)\n\n# Compare reactions\nsimilarity = DataStructs.TanimotoSimilarity(fp1, fp2)\n```\n\n### 8. 2D and 3D Coordinate Generation\n\n**2D Coordinate Generation:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem import AllChem\n\n# Generate 2D coordinates for depiction\nAllChem.Compute2DCoords(mol)\n\n# Align molecule to template structure\ntemplate = Chem.MolFromSmiles(''c1ccccc1'')\nAllChem.Compute2DCoords(template)\nAllChem.GenerateDepictionMatching2DStructure(mol, template)\n```\n\n**3D Coordinate Generation and Conformers:**\n\n```python\n# Generate single 3D conformer using ETKDG\nAllChem.EmbedMolecule(mol, randomSeed=42)\n\n# Generate multiple conformers\nconf_ids = AllChem.EmbedMultipleConfs(mol, numConfs=10, randomSeed=42)\n\n# Optimize geometry with force field\nAllChem.UFFOptimizeMolecule(mol)  # UFF force field\nAllChem.MMFFOptimizeMolecule(mol)  # MMFF94 force field\n\n# Optimize all conformers\nfor conf_id in conf_ids:\n    AllChem.MMFFOptimizeMolecule(mol, confId=conf_id)\n\n# Calculate RMSD between conformers\nfrom rdkit.Chem import AllChem\nrms = AllChem.GetConformerRMS(mol, conf_id1, conf_id2)\n\n# Align molecules\nAllChem.AlignMol(probe_mol, ref_mol)\n```\n\n**Constrained Embedding:**\n\n```python\n# Embed with part of molecule constrained to specific coordinates\nAllChem.ConstrainedEmbed(mol, core_mol)\n```\n\n### 9. Molecular Visualization\n\n**Basic Drawing:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem import Draw\n\n# Draw single molecule to PIL image\nimg = Draw.MolToImage(mol, size=(300, 300))\nimg.save(''molecule.png'')\n\n# Draw to file directly\nDraw.MolToFile(mol, ''molecule.png'')\n\n# Draw multiple molecules in grid\nmols = [mol1, mol2, mol3, mol4]\nimg = Draw.MolsToGridImage(mols, molsPerRow=2, subImgSize=(200, 200))\n```\n\n**Highlighting Substructures:**\n\n```python\n# Highlight substructure match\nquery = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''c1ccccc1'')\nmatch = mol.GetSubstructMatch(query)\n\nimg = Draw.MolToImage(mol, highlightAtoms=match)\n\n# Custom highlight colors\nhighlight_colors = {atom_idx: (1, 0, 0) for atom_idx in match}  # Red\nimg = Draw.MolToImage(mol, highlightAtoms=match,\n                      highlightAtomColors=highlight_colors)\n```\n\n**Customizing Visualization:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem.Draw import rdMolDraw2D\n\n# Create drawer with custom options\ndrawer = rdMolDraw2D.MolDraw2DCairo(300, 300)\nopts = drawer.drawOptions()\n\n# Customize options\nopts.addAtomIndices = True\nopts.addStereoAnnotation = True\nopts.bondLineWidth = 2\n\n# Draw molecule\ndrawer.DrawMolecule(mol)\ndrawer.FinishDrawing()\n\n# Save to file\nwith open(''molecule.png'', ''wb'') as f:\n    f.write(drawer.GetDrawingText())\n```\n\n**Jupyter Notebook Integration:**\n\n```python\n# Enable inline display in Jupyter\nfrom rdkit.Chem.Draw import IPythonConsole\n\n# Customize default display\nIPythonConsole.ipython_useSVG = True  # Use SVG instead of PNG\nIPythonConsole.molSize = (300, 300)   # Default size\n\n# Molecules now display automatically\nmol  # Shows molecule image\n```\n\n**Visualizing Fingerprint Bits:**\n\n```python\n# Show what molecular features a fingerprint bit represents\nfrom rdkit.Chem import Draw\n\n# For Morgan fingerprints\nbit_info = {}\nfp = AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(mol, radius=2, bitInfo=bit_info)\n\n# Draw environment for specific bit\nimg = Draw.DrawMorganBit(mol, bit_id, bit_info)\n```\n\n### 10. Molecular Modification\n\n**Adding/Removing Hydrogens:**\n\n```python\n# Add explicit hydrogens\nmol_h = Chem.AddHs(mol)\n\n# Remove explicit hydrogens\nmol = Chem.RemoveHs(mol_h)\n```\n\n**Kekulization and Aromaticity:**\n\n```python\n# Convert aromatic bonds to alternating single/double\nChem.Kekulize(mol)\n\n# Set aromaticity\nChem.SetAromaticity(mol)\n```\n\n**Replacing Substructures:**\n\n```python\n# Replace substructure with another structure\nquery = Chem.MolFromSmarts(''c1ccccc1'')  # Benzene\nreplacement = Chem.MolFromSmiles(''C1CCCCC1'')  # Cyclohexane\n\nnew_mol = Chem.ReplaceSubstructs(mol, query, replacement)[0]\n```\n\n**Neutralizing Charges:**\n\n```python\n# Remove formal charges by adding/removing hydrogens\nfrom rdkit.Chem.MolStandardize import rdMolStandardize\n\n# Using Uncharger\nuncharger = rdMolStandardize.Uncharger()\nmol_neutral = uncharger.uncharge(mol)\n```\n\n### 11. Working with Molecular Hashes and Standardization\n\n**Molecular Hashing:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem import rdMolHash\n\n# Generate Murcko scaffold hash\nscaffold_hash = rdMolHash.MolHash(mol, rdMolHash.HashFunction.MurckoScaffold)\n\n# Canonical SMILES hash\ncanonical_hash = rdMolHash.MolHash(mol, rdMolHash.HashFunction.CanonicalSmiles)\n\n# Regioisomer hash (ignores stereochemistry)\nregio_hash = rdMolHash.MolHash(mol, rdMolHash.HashFunction.Regioisomer)\n```\n\n**Randomized SMILES:**\n\n```python\n# Generate random SMILES representations (for data augmentation)\nfrom rdkit.Chem import MolToRandomSmilesVect\n\nrandom_smiles = MolToRandomSmilesVect(mol, numSmiles=10, randomSeed=42)\n```\n\n### 12. Pharmacophore and 3D Features\n\n**Pharmacophore Features:**\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit.Chem import ChemicalFeatures\nfrom rdkit import RDConfig\nimport os\n\n# Load feature factory\nfdef_path = os.path.join(RDConfig.RDDataDir, ''BaseFeatures.fdef'')\nfactory = ChemicalFeatures.BuildFeatureFactory(fdef_path)\n\n# Get pharmacophore features\nfeatures = factory.GetFeaturesForMol(mol)\n\nfor feat in features:\n    print(feat.GetFamily(), feat.GetType(), feat.GetAtomIds())\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Drug-likeness Analysis\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit import Chem\nfrom rdkit.Chem import Descriptors\n\ndef analyze_druglikeness(smiles):\n    mol = Chem.MolFromSmiles(smiles)\n    if mol is None:\n        return None\n\n    # Calculate Lipinski descriptors\n    results = {\n        ''MW'': Descriptors.MolWt(mol),\n        ''LogP'': Descriptors.MolLogP(mol),\n        ''HBD'': Descriptors.NumHDonors(mol),\n        ''HBA'': Descriptors.NumHAcceptors(mol),\n        ''TPSA'': Descriptors.TPSA(mol),\n        ''RotBonds'': Descriptors.NumRotatableBonds(mol)\n    }\n\n    # Check Lipinski''s Rule of Five\n    results[''Lipinski''] = (\n        results[''MW''] <= 500 and\n        results[''LogP''] <= 5 and\n        results[''HBD''] <= 5 and\n        results[''HBA''] <= 10\n    )\n\n    return results\n```\n\n### Similarity Screening\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit import Chem\nfrom rdkit.Chem import AllChem\nfrom rdkit import DataStructs\n\ndef similarity_screen(query_smiles, database_smiles, threshold=0.7):\n    query_mol = Chem.MolFromSmiles(query_smiles)\n    query_fp = AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(query_mol, 2)\n\n    hits = []\n    for idx, smiles in enumerate(database_smiles):\n        mol = Chem.MolFromSmiles(smiles)\n        if mol:\n            fp = AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(mol, 2)\n            sim = DataStructs.TanimotoSimilarity(query_fp, fp)\n            if sim >= threshold:\n                hits.append((idx, smiles, sim))\n\n    return sorted(hits, key=lambda x: x[2], reverse=True)\n```\n\n### Substructure Filtering\n\n```python\nfrom rdkit import Chem\n\ndef filter_by_substructure(smiles_list, pattern_smarts):\n    query = Chem.MolFromSmarts(pattern_smarts)\n\n    hits = []\n    for smiles in smiles_list:\n        mol = Chem.MolFromSmiles(smiles)\n        if mol and mol.HasSubstructMatch(query):\n            hits.append(smiles)\n\n    return hits\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Error Handling\n\nAlways check for `None` when parsing molecules:\n\n```python\nmol = Chem.MolFromSmiles(smiles)\nif mol is None:\n    print(f\"Failed to parse: {smiles}\")\n    continue\n```\n\n### Performance Optimization\n\n**Use binary formats for storage:**\n\n```python\nimport pickle\n\n# Pickle molecules for fast loading\nwith open(''molecules.pkl'', ''wb'') as f:\n    pickle.dump(mols, f)\n\n# Load pickled molecules (much faster than reparsing)\nwith open(''molecules.pkl'', ''rb'') as f:\n    mols = pickle.load(f)\n```\n\n**Use bulk operations:**\n\n```python\n# Calculate fingerprints for all molecules at once\nfps = [AllChem.GetMorganFingerprintAsBitVect(mol, 2) for mol in mols]\n\n# Use bulk similarity calculations\nsimilarities = DataStructs.BulkTanimotoSimilarity(fps[0], fps[1:])\n```\n\n### Thread Safety\n\nRDKit operations are generally thread-safe for:\n- Molecule I/O (SMILES, mol blocks)\n- Coordinate generation\n- Fingerprinting and descriptors\n- Substructure searching\n- Reactions\n- Drawing\n\n**Not thread-safe:** MolSuppliers when accessed concurrently.\n\n### Memory Management\n\nFor large datasets:\n\n```python\n# Use ForwardSDMolSupplier to avoid loading entire file\nwith open(''large.sdf'') as f:\n    suppl = Chem.ForwardSDMolSupplier(f)\n    for mol in suppl:\n        # Process one molecule at a time\n        pass\n\n# Use MultithreadedSDMolSupplier for parallel processing\nsuppl = Chem.MultithreadedSDMolSupplier(''large.sdf'', numWriterThreads=4)\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Forgetting to check for None:** Always validate molecules after parsing\n2. **Sanitization failures:** Use `DetectChemistryProblems()` to debug\n3. **Missing hydrogens:** Use `AddHs()` when calculating properties that depend on hydrogen\n4. **2D vs 3D:** Generate appropriate coordinates before visualization or 3D analysis\n5. **SMARTS matching rules:** Remember that unspecified properties match anything\n6. **Thread safety with MolSuppliers:** Don''t share supplier objects across threads\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/\n\nThis skill includes detailed API reference documentation:\n\n- `api_reference.md` - Comprehensive listing of RDKit modules, functions, and classes organized by functionality\n- `descriptors_reference.md` - Complete list of available molecular descriptors with descriptions\n- `smarts_patterns.md` - Common SMARTS patterns for functional groups and structural features\n\nLoad these references when needing specific API details, parameter information, or pattern examples.\n\n### scripts/\n\nExample scripts for common RDKit workflows:\n\n- `molecular_properties.py` - Calculate comprehensive molecular properties and descriptors\n- `similarity_search.py` - Perform fingerprint-based similarity screening\n- `substructure_filter.py` - Filter molecules by substructure patterns\n\nThese scripts can be executed directly or used as templates for custom workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:35:52.052Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scientific Research Agents needing advanced cheminformatics and molecular analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级化学生物信息学和分子分析能力的科学研究代理","ja":"高度な化学生物学および分子分析機能を必要とする科学研究エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 화학 생물 정보학 및 분자 분석 기능이 필요한 과학 연구 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación científica que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de quimioinformática y análisis molecular.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche scientifique ayant besoin de capacités avancées de chimie informatique et d''analyse moléculaire.","de":"Perfekt für wissenschaftliche Forschungsagenten, die erweiterte Chemoinformatik- und Molekülanalysefähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa Científica que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de quimioinformática e análise molecular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для научных исследовательских агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности хемоинформатики и молекулярного анализа.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات البحث العلمي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة في الكيمياء الحاسوبية والتحليل الجزيئي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform molecular structure manipulation, descriptor calculation, and substructure searching using the RDKit cheminformatics library, enabling advanced tasks in drug discovery, computational chemistry, and cheminformatics research with Python APIs.","zh":"赋予代理执行分子结构操作、描述符计算和子结构搜索的能力，使用RDKit化学生物信息学库，通过Python API实现药物发现、计算化学和化学生物信息学研究等高级任务","ja":"RDKit 化学生物学ライブラリを使用して、分子構造操作、記述子計算、およびサブ構造検索を実行するエージェントを可能にし、Python APIを使用して薬物発見、計算化学、化学生物学研究などの高度なタスクを実現","ko":"RDKit 화학 생물 정보학 라이브러리를 사용하여 분자 구조 조작, 설명자 계산 및 서브 구조 검색을 수행 할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, Python API를 사용하여 약물 발견, 계산 화학 및 화학 생물 정보학 연구 등의 고급 작업을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar manipulación de estructuras moleculares, cálculo de descriptores y búsqueda de subestructuras utilizando la biblioteca de quimioinformática RDKit, lo que permite realizar tareas avanzadas en descubrimiento de fármacos, química computacional y investigación de quimioinformática con API de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une manipulation de structures moléculaires, un calcul de descripteurs et une recherche de sous-structures en utilisant la bibliothèque de chimie informatique RDKit, ce qui permet de réaliser des tâches avancées en découverte de médicaments, en chimie computationnelle et en recherche de chimie informatique avec des API Python.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Molekülstrukturmanipulation, Deskriptorberechnung und Substruktursuche mithilfe der RDKit-Chemoinformatikbibliothek durchzuführen, was erweiterte Aufgaben im Arzneimittelentdeckung, computergestützter Chemie und Chemoinformatikforschung mit Python-APIs ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar manipulação de estruturas moleculares, cálculo de descritores e busca de subestruturas utilizando a biblioteca de quimioinformática RDKit, permitindo tarefas avançadas na descoberta de drogas, química computacional e pesquisa em quimioinformática com APIs Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять манипуляции со структурой молекул, расчет дескрипторов и поиск подструктур с использованием библиотеки 