данных","Создание контрактов API","Генерация задач в порядке зависимости","Структурированные рабочие процессы для технического планирования"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط التنفيذ","إنشاء نماذج البيانات","إنشاء عقود واجهة البرمجة","إنشاء المهام المترابطة","عمليات عمل منظمة للتخطيط الفني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术规划","任务分解","API 合同","技术设计","数据模型","开发效率"],"ja":["技術計画","タスク分解","API 契約","技術設計","データモデル","開発効率"],"ko":["기술 기획","태스크 분해","API 계약","기술 설계","데이터 모델","개발 효율성"],"es":["planificación de implementación","generación de tareas","modelos de datos","contratos de API","desarrollo de software","planificación de proyectos"],"fr":["planification de mise en œuvre","génération de tâches","modèles de données","contrats d''API","développement de logiciels","planification de projets"],"de":["Implementierungsplanung","AufgabenGenerierung","Datenmodelle","API-Verträge","Software-Entwicklung","Projektplanung"],"pt":["planejamento técnico","arquitetos","planos de implementação","modelos de dados","contratos de API","geração de tarefas","fluxos de trabalho","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["техническое планирование","архитекторы","планы реализации","модели данных","контракты API","генерация задач","рабочие процессы","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التخطيط الفني","المهندسين المعماريين","خطط التنفيذ","نماذج البيانات","عقود واجهة البرمجة","إنشاء المهام","عمليات العمل","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"zeeshan080","repo":"ezee-erp","repoPath":"zeeshan080/ezee-erp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"planning","description":"Skill for the Architect agent to create implementation plans, data models, API contracts, and dependency-ordered task breakdowns. Use when executing /sp.plan (create technical plan) or /sp.tasks (generate task breakdown). Provides templates, design patterns, and workflow guidance for technical planning.","bodyPreview":"# Planning\n\nTechnical planning skill for the Architect agent. Enables creation of implementation plans, data models, API contracts, and task breakdowns from approved specifications.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides structured workflows for:\n1. **Implementation Planning** (`/sp.plan`) - Technical design from specification\n2. **Task Generation** (`/sp.tasks`) - Dependency-ordered task breakdown\n\n## Templates\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Use templates from `.specify/templates/` - do not duplicate:\n- `plan-temp","body":"# Planning\n\nTechnical planning skill for the Architect agent. Enables creation of implementation plans, data models, API contracts, and task breakdowns from approved specifications.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides structured workflows for:\n1. **Implementation Planning** (`/sp.plan`) - Technical design from specification\n2. **Task Generation** (`/sp.tasks`) - Dependency-ordered task breakdown\n\n## Templates\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Use templates from `.specify/templates/` - do not duplicate:\n- `plan-template.md` - Implementation plan structure\n- `tasks-template.md` - Task breakdown structure\n\n## Planning Workflow (/sp.plan)\n\n### Phase 0: Research\n\n1. Parse Technical Context from plan template\n2. Identify all \"NEEDS CLARIFICATION\" items\n3. Research each unknown:\n   - Technology choices\n   - Best practices\n   - Integration patterns\n4. Document findings in `research.md`\n\n### Phase 1: Design\n\n1. Extract entities from spec -> `data-model.md`\n2. Generate API contracts -> `contracts/`\n3. Create quickstart guide -> `quickstart.md`\n4. Update plan with resolved context\n\n### Constitution Check\n\nValidate design against constitution gates:\n- Technology constraints\n- Architecture principles\n- Security requirements\n- Performance requirements\n\n## Task Generation Workflow (/sp.tasks)\n\n### Input Documents\n\n**Required:**\n- `plan.md` - Technical context and structure\n- `spec.md` - User stories with priorities\n\n**Optional:**\n- `data-model.md` - Entity definitions\n- `contracts/` - API endpoints\n- `research.md` - Technology decisions\n\n### Task Organization\n\nTasks are organized by user story for independent implementation:\n\n```\nPhase 1: Setup (shared infrastructure)\nPhase 2: Foundational (blocking prerequisites)\nPhase 3+: User Stories (one phase per story, priority order)\nFinal: Polish (cross-cutting concerns)\n```\n\n### Task Format\n\nEvery task follows this format:\n\n```text\n- [ ] [TaskID] [P?] [Story?] Description with file path\n```\n\n- **TaskID**: Sequential (T001, T002...)\n- **[P]**: Parallelizable (different files, no dependencies)\n- **[Story]**: User story label (US1, US2...) - only in user story phases\n- **Description**: Action with exact file path\n\n### Parallel Opportunities\n\nMark tasks as `[P]` when:\n- They modify different files\n- They have no dependencies on incomplete tasks\n- They can be executed simultaneously\n\n### User Story Independence\n\nEach user story phase should be:\n- Complete (all needed tasks)\n- Testable (independent verification)\n- Deliverable (increment of value)\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed guidance, see:\n- `references/design-patterns.md` - Common architecture patterns\n- `references/task-decomposition.md` - Breaking down work effectively\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\nBefore completing planning:\n\n- [ ] All Technical Context resolved (no NEEDS CLARIFICATION)\n- [ ] Constitution check passed\n- [ ] Data model matches spec entities\n- [ ] API contracts cover all user actions\n- [ ] Tasks organized by user story\n- [ ] All tasks have file paths\n- [ ] Parallel opportunities marked\n- [ ] Dependencies documented\n- [ ] Independent test criteria per story\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Situation | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Spec missing | Report error, suggest `/sp.specify` |\n| Constitution violation | Document, find alternative, escalate if needed |\n| Unclear requirement | Add to clarifications, continue with assumption |\n| Technology uncertainty | Research, document options, recommend |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:37:01.734Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Architect Agents requiring technical planning capabilities for implementation and task management.","zh":"适用于需要技术规划能力以实现和任务管理的架构代理。","ja":"技術計画能力を必要とするアーキテクトエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구현 및 작업 관리를 위한 기술 계획 기능을 필요로 하는 아키텍트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitectura que requieren capacidades de planificación técnica para la implementación y la gestión de tareas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''architecture nécessitant des capacités de planification technique pour la mise en œuvre et la gestion des tâches.","de":"Ideal für Architekturagenten, die technische Planungsfähigkeiten für die Implementierung und die Aufgabenverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Arquitetos que requerem capacidades de planejamento técnico para implementação e gerenciamento de tarefas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Архитектурных Агентов, требующих технических возможностей планирования для реализации и управления задачами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهندسة المعمارية الذي يتطلب قدرات التخطيط الفني للتطبيق وإدارة المهام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create structured implementation plans, data models, and API contracts from approved specifications using dependency-ordered task breakdowns and technical design workflows, leveraging templates from `.specify/templates/` for efficient planning.","zh":"赋予代理创建结构化的实施计划、数据模型和API契约的能力，使用批准的规范、依赖顺序的任务分解和技术设计工作流程，并利用`.specify/templates/`中的模板进行高效规划。","ja":"エージェントが承認された仕様、依存順序のタスク分解、テクニカルデザインワークフローを使用して構造化された実装計画、データモデル、API契約を作成できるようにします。さらに、`.specify/templates/`のテンプレートを使用して効率的な計画を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 승인된 사양, 의존 순서 작업 분해 및 기술 설계 워크플로를 사용하여 구조화된 구현 계획, 데이터 모델 및 API 계약을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 `.specify/templates/`의 템플릿을 사용하여 효율적인 계획을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear planes de implementación estructurados, modelos de datos y contratos de API a partir de especificaciones aprobadas utilizando desgloses de tareas ordenados por dependencias y flujos de trabajo de diseño técnico, aprovechando plantillas de `.specify/templates/` para una planificación eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans de mise en œuvre structurés, des modèles de données et des contrats d''API à partir de spécifications approuvées en utilisant des décompositions de tâches ordonnées par dépendances et des flux de travail de conception technique, en exploitant des modèles de `.specify/templates/` pour une planification efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, strukturierte Implementierungspläne, Datenmodelle und API-Verträge aus genehmigten Spezifikationen zu erstellen, indem sie abhängigkeitsgeordnete Aufgabenzerlegungen und technische Design-Workflows verwenden und Vorlagen aus `.specify/templates/` für eine effiziente Planung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem planos de implementação estruturados, modelos de dados e contratos de API a partir de especificações aprovadas, utilizando a quebra de tarefas em ordem de dependência e fluxos de trabalho de design técnico, aproveitando modelos do `.specify/templates/` para planejamento eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать структурированные планы реализации, модели данных и контракты API из утвержденных спецификаций, используя разбиение задач в порядке зависимости и рабочие потоки технического дизайна, используя шаблоны из `.specify/templates/` для эффективного планирования.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إنشاء خطط تنفيذية منظمة ونماذج بيانات و عقود واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من المواصفات المعتمدة باستخدام كسر المهام بالترتيب التابع و اسهامات تصميم فني ، مستفيدا من القوالب من `.specify/templates/` للتنظيم الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating implementation plans from specifications","Creating dependency-ordered task breakdowns for project management","Developing data models and API contracts for technical design"],"zh":["从规范生成实施计划","创建依赖顺序的任务分解用于项目管理","开发数据模型和API契约用于技术设计"],"ja":["仕様から実装計画を生成する","プロジェクト管理のための依存順序のタスク分解を作成する","技術設計のためのデータモデルとAPI契約を開発する"],"ko":["사양에서 구현 계획을 생성하는 것","프로젝트 관리를 위한 의존 순서 작업 분해を作成하는 것","기술 설계를 위한 데이터 모델 및 API 계약을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Generar planes de implementación a partir de especificaciones","Crear desgloses de tareas ordenados por dependencias para la gestión de proyectos","Desarrollar modelos de datos y contratos de API para el diseño técnico"],"fr":["Générer des plans de mise en œuvre à partir de spécifications","Créer des décompositions de tâches ordonnées par dépendances pour la gestion de projets","Développer des modèles de données et des contrats d''API pour la conception technique"],"de":["Erstellung von Implementierungsplänen aus Spezifikationen","Erstellen von abhängigkeitsgeordneten Aufgabenzerlegungen für das Projektmanagement","Entwicklung von Datenmodellen und API-Verträgen für das technische Design"],"pt":["Geração de planos de implementação a partir de especificações","Criação de quebras de tarefas em ordem de dependência para gerenciamento de projetos","Desenvolvimento de modelos de dados e contratos de API para design técnico"],"ru":["Генерация планов реализации из спецификаций","Создание разбиения задач в порядке зависимости для управления проектами","Разработка моделей данных и контрактов API для технического дизайна"],"ar":["توليد خطط التنفيذ من المواصفات","إنشاء كسر المهام بالترتيب التابع لإدارة المشاريع","تطوير نماذج البيانات و عقود واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للتصميم الفني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to approved specifications","Limited to technical planning and task management workflows"],"zh":["需要访问批准的规范","仅限技术规划和任务管理工作流"],"ja":["承認された仕様へのアクセスが必要","技術計画とタスク管理のワークフローにのみ限られる"],"ko":["승인된 사양에 대한 액세스가 필요함","기술 계획 및 작업 관리 워크플로에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a especificaciones aprobadas","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de planificación técnica y gestión de tareas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des spécifications approuvées","Limité aux flux de travail de planification technique et de gestion des tâches"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf genehmigte Spezifikationen","Begrenzt auf technische Planungs- und Aufgabenverwaltungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Requer acesso a especificações aprovadas","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de planejamento técnico e gerenciamento de tarefas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к утвержденным спецификациям","Ограничен рабочими потоками технического планирования и управления задачами"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المواصفات المعتمدة","محدود بأسهم تصميم فني و إدارة المهام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
