onnels. Nécessite des clés API de Gemini, Remove.bg et Recraft.ai","de":"Der Logo-Ersteller AI nutzt die Bildgenerierung zur Erstellung professioneller Logos. Benötigt API-Schlüssel von Gemini, Remove.bg und Recraft.ai","pt":"A habilidade de criação de logotipos utiliza IA para gerar logotipos profissionais por meio de um processo de design iterativo.","ru":"Возможность создания логотипов использует ИИ для генерации профессиональных логотипов посредством итеративного процесса дизайна.","ar":"ميزة إنشاء الشعارات تستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنشاء شعارات احترافية من خلال عملية تصميم متكررة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["AI","API","Gemini 3 Pro","Remove.bg","Recraft.ai"],"ja":["AI","API","Gemini 3 Pro","Remove.bg","Recraft.ai"],"ko":["AI ","API ","Gemini 3 Pro","Remove.bg","Recraft.ai"],"es":["Generación de imágenes profesionales","Proceso de diseño iterativo","Requiere claves API de Gemini, Remove.bg y Recraft.ai","Utiliza la inteligencia artificial para crear logos","Diseño de logos personalizados"],"fr":["Génération d''images professionnelles","Processus de conception itératif","Nécessite des clés API de Gemini, Remove.bg et Recraft.ai","Utilise l''intelligence artificielle pour créer des logos","Conception de logos personnalisés"],"de":["Professionelle Bildgenerierung","Iterativer Entwurfsprozess","Benötigt API-Schlüssel von Gemini, Remove.bg und Recraft.ai","Nutzt künstliche Intelligenz zur Erstellung von Logos","Individuelles Logo-Design"],"pt":["Geração de logotipos profissionais com IA","Processo de design iterativo","Integração com APIs de terceiros","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Personalização de logotipos"],"ru":["Генерация профессиональных логотипов с помощью ИИ","Итеративный процесс дизайна","Интеграция с API третьих сторон","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Настройка логотипов"],"ar":["إنشاء شعارات احترافية بالذكاء الاصطناعي","عملية تصميم متكررة","التكامل مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات الطرف الثالث","دعم صيغ الملفات المتعددة","تخصيص الشعارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","API","Gemini 3 Pro","Remove.bg","Recraft.ai","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","API","Gemini 3 Pro","Remove.bg","Recraft.ai","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI ","API ","Gemini 3 Pro","Remove.bg","Recraft.ai","AI ","AI "],"es":["creador de logos AI","generación de imágenes","diseño de logos","inteligencia artificial","logos profesionales","herramientas de diseño","tecnología de diseño"],"fr":["créateur de logos IA","génération d''images","conception de logos","intelligence artificielle","logos professionnels","outils de conception","technologie de conception"],"de":["Logo-Ersteller AI","Bildgenerierung","Logo-Design","künstliche Intelligenz","professionelle Logos","Design-Tools","Design-Technologie"],"pt":["criador de logotipos","ia para logotipos","design de logotipos","logotipos profissionais","geração de logotipos","inteligência artificial para design"],"ru":["создатель логотипов","ИИ для логотипов","дизайн логотипов","профессиональные логотипы","генерация логотипов","искусственный интеллект для дизайна"],"ar":["مبدع الشعارات","الذكاء الاصطناعي للشعارات","تصميم الشعارات","شعارات احترافية","إنشاء الشعارات","الذكاء الاصطناعي للتصميم"]}},"owner":"plosson","repo":"siteio","repoPath":"plosson/siteio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.458Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"logo-creator","description":"Create logos using AI image generation. Discuss style/ratio, generate variations, iterate with user feedback, crop, remove background, and export as SVG. Use when user wants to create a logo, icon, favicon, or brand mark.","bodyPreview":"# Logo Creator Skill\n\nCreate professional logos through AI image generation with an iterative design process.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**Required API Keys (set in environment):**\n- `GEMINI_API_KEY` - Get from [Google AI Studio](https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)\n- `REMOVE_BG_API_KEY` - Get from [remove.bg](https://www.remove.bg/api)\n- `RECRAFT_API_KEY` - Get from [recraft.ai](https://www.recraft.ai/)\n\n**Required Skills:**\n- `nanobanana` - AI image generation (Gemini 3 Pro Image)\n\n\n\n## File Output Loc","body":"# Logo Creator Skill\n\nCreate professional logos through AI image generation with an iterative design process.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**Required API Keys (set in environment):**\n- `GEMINI_API_KEY` - Get from [Google AI Studio](https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)\n- `REMOVE_BG_API_KEY` - Get from [remove.bg](https://www.remove.bg/api)\n- `RECRAFT_API_KEY` - Get from [recraft.ai](https://www.recraft.ai/)\n\n**Required Skills:**\n- `nanobanana` - AI image generation (Gemini 3 Pro Image)\n\n\n\n## File Output Location\n\nAll generated files should be saved to the `.skill-archive` directory:\n\n```\n.skill-archive/logo-creator/<yyyy-mm-dd-summaryname>/\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n.skill-archive/logo-creator/2026-01-18-opc-logo/\n  logo-01.png\n  logo-02.png\n  ...\n  logo-09-cropped.png\n  logo-09-nobg.png\n  logo-09.svg\n  preview.html\n```\n\n**Guidelines:**\n- Use current date in format `yyyy-mm-dd`\n- Add short summary name (project/brand name, kebab-case)\n- Create directory before generating first logo\n- Keep all variations and iterations in same folder\n- Final approved logo should be copied to user''s desired location\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Discovery & Requirements\n\nBefore generating, gather requirements from user:\n\n**Ask about:**\n1. **Project/Brand name** - What is the logo for?\n2. **Style preference** - See [references/styles.md](./references/styles.md) for options:\n   - Pixel art / 8-bit retro\n   - Minimalist / flat design\n   - 3D / isometric\n   - Hand-drawn / sketch\n   - Mascot / character\n   - Monogram / lettermark\n   - Abstract / geometric\n\n3. **Aspect ratio** - Default is 1:1 (square), options:\n   - `1:1` - Square (favicons, app icons)\n   - `16:9` - Wide (headers, banners)\n   - `4:3` - Standard\n   - `2:3` - Portrait\n\n4. **Color preferences**:\n   - Monochrome (black & white)\n   - Specific brand colors\n   - Let AI decide\n\n5. **Reference images** - Any existing logos or styles to reference?\n\n**Wait for user confirmation before proceeding!**\n\n### Step 2: Generate Logo Variations\n\nGenerate 20 logo variations (default) using the `nanobanana` skill:\n\n```bash\n# Generate single logo\npython3 <nanobanana_skill_dir>/scripts/generate.py \"{style} logo for {brand}, {description}, {colors}\" \\\n  --ratio 1:1 -o .skill-archive/logo-creator/<date-name>/logo-01.png\n\n# Batch generate 20 logos\npython3 <nanobanana_skill_dir>/scripts/batch_generate.py \"{style} logo for {brand}, {description}, {colors}\" \\\n  -n 20 --ratio 1:1 -d .skill-archive/logo-creator/<date-name> -p logo\n```\n\n**Guidelines:**\n- Use batch_generate.py for multiple variations (includes auto-delay)\n- Save to `.skill-archive/logo-creator/<yyyy-mm-dd-summaryname>/` directory\n- Use sequential naming: `logo-01.png`, `logo-02.png`, etc.\n\n**Prompt Tips:**\n- Include style keywords: \"pixel art\", \"minimalist\", \"8-bit\", \"flat design\"\n- Specify colors: \"black on white\", \"monochrome\", \"blue gradient\"\n- Add context: \"tech startup\", \"food brand\", \"gaming company\"\n- Request format: \"icon\", \"emblem\", \"mascot\", \"lettermark\"\n\n### Step 3: Create HTML Preview\n\nCopy the preview template and open in browser:\n\n```bash\ncp <skill_dir>/templates/preview.html .skill-archive/logo-creator/<yyyy-mm-dd-summaryname>/preview.html\n```\n\nThen open in default browser:\n\n```bash\nopen .skill-archive/logo-creator/<yyyy-mm-dd-summaryname>/preview.html\n```\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Update the HTML to include the correct number of logos generated.\n\n### Step 4: Iterate with User\n\nAsk user which logos they prefer:\n- \"Which logos do you like? (e.g., #5, #12, #18)\"\n- \"What do you like about them?\"\n- \"Any changes you''d want?\"\n\nBased on feedback:\n1. Generate 10-20 more variations of favorite styles\n2. Use naming: `logo-{original}-v{n}.png` (e.g., `logo-05-v1.png`)\n3. Update HTML preview\n4. Repeat until user selects final logo\n\n### Step 5: Finalize Logo\n\nOnce user approves a logo, process it:\n\n**5a. Crop whitespace (make 1:1 with no margins):**\n```bash\npython3 <skill_dir>/scripts/crop_logo.py {input.png} {output-cropped.png}\n```\n\n**5b. Remove background:**\n```bash\npython3 <skill_dir>/scripts/remove_bg.py {input.png} {output-nobg.png}\n```\n\n**5c. Convert to SVG:**\n```bash\npython3 <skill_dir>/scripts/vectorize.py {input.png} {output.svg}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Deliver Final Assets\n\nPresent final deliverables:\n\n```\n## Final Logo Assets\n\n| File | Description | Size |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| logo.png | Original | 1024x1024 |\n| logo-cropped.png | No margins, 1:1 | ~800x800 |\n| logo-nobg.png | Transparent background | ~800x800 |\n| logo.svg | Vector (scalable) | ~20KB |\n\nAll files saved to: `.skill-archive/logo-creator/<yyyy-mm-dd-summaryname>/`\nCopy final logo to user''s desired location.\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Common Prompt Patterns\n\n**Pixel Art:**\n```\nPixel art {subject} logo, 8-bit retro style, black pixels on white background, {size}x{size} grid, minimalist icon\n```\n\n**Minimalist:**\n```\nMinimalist {subject} logo, flat design, clean lines, {color} on white, simple geometric shapes\n```\n\n**Mascot:**\n```\nCute {animal/character} mascot logo, friendly expression, {style} style, {colors}, suitable for brand icon\n```\n\n**Lettermark:**\n```\nLetter \"{letter}\" logo, modern typography, {style} design, {colors}, clean professional look\n```\n\n### Supported Aspect Ratios\n\n- `1:1` - Square (default for logos)\n- `2:3`, `3:2` - Portrait/Landscape\n- `3:4`, `4:3` - Standard\n- `4:5`, `5:4` - Photo\n- `9:16`, `16:9` - Wide\n- `21:9` - Ultra-wide\n\n## References\n\n- [references/styles.md](./references/styles.md) - Logo style guide with prompt examples\n- [examples/opc-logo-creation.md](./examples/opc-logo-creation.md) - Full example conversation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:37:47.390Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual AI Agents requiring professional logo creation through iterative AI image generation processes.","zh":"适合需要通过迭代AI图像生成过程创建专业标志的视觉AI代理。","ja":"視覚AIエージェントがプロフェッショナルなロゴの作成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"시각적 AI 에이전트가 반복적인 AI 이미지 생성 프로세스를 통해 전문 로고를 생성해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Visuales que requieren la creación profesional de logotipos a través de procesos de generación de imágenes de IA iterativos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Visuels nécessitant une création professionnelle de logos grâce à des processus de génération d''images de l''IA itératifs.","de":"Ideal für Visuelle KI-Agenten, die eine professionelle Logoerstellung durch iterative KI-Bildgenerierungsprozesse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Visuais que exigem criação profissional de logotipos por meio de processos de geração de imagens de IA iterativos.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, требующих профессионального создания логотипов посредством итеративных процессов генерации изображений ИИ.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المرئيين للذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون إنشاء شعار احترافي من خلال عمليات توليد الصور الإيائية التكرارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality logos using Gemini 3 Pro Image for AI image generation, and leverages APIs from Google AI Studio, remove.bg, and recraft.ai for advanced image processing and background removal, producing files in various formats.","zh":"赋予代理使用Gemini 3 Pro Image进行AI图像生成的能力，并利用Google AI Studio、remove.bg和recraft.ai的API进行高级图像处理和背景移除，生成多种格式的文件。","ja":"Gemini 3 Pro Imageを使用したAI画像生成、Google AI Studio、remove.bg、recraft.aiのAPIを使用した高度な画像処理と背景除去により、高品質のロゴを生成し、様々な形式のファイルを生成します。","ko":"Gemini 3 Pro Image를 사용하여 AI 이미지 생성을 수행하고, Google AI Studio, remove.bg, recraft.ai의 API를 활용하여 고급 이미지 처리 및 배경 제거를 수행하여 다양한 형식의 파일을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar logotipos de alta calidad utilizando Gemini 3 Pro Image para la generación de imágenes de IA y aprovecha las API de Google AI Studio, remove.bg y recraft.ai para el procesamiento avanzado de imágenes y la eliminación de fondo, produciendo archivos en varios formatos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des logos de haute qualité en utilisant Gemini 3 Pro Image pour la génération d''images de l''IA et en exploitant les API de Google AI Studio, remove.bg et recraft.ai pour le traitement avancé d''images et la suppression de l''arrière-plan, produisant des fichiers dans divers formats.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Logos mit Gemini 3 Pro Image für die KI-Bildgenerierung zu erstellen und nutzt APIs von Google AI Studio, remove.bg und recraft.ai für erweitertes Bildverarbeitung und Hintergrundentfernung, wodurch Dateien in verschiedenen Formaten produziert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar logotipos de alta qualidade usando Gemini 3 Pro Image para geração de imagens de IA e aproveita APIs do Google AI Studio, remove.bg e recraft.ai para processamento de imagem avançado e remoção de fundo, produzindo arquivos em vários formatos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать логотипы высокого качества с использованием Gemini 3 Pro Image для генерации изображений ИИ и использует API от Google AI Studio, remove.bg и recraft.ai для продвинутой обработки изображений и удаления фона, производя файлы в различных форматах.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء شعارات ذات جودة عالية باستخدام Gemini 3 Pro Image لتوليد الصور الإيائية، واستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات من Google AI Studio و remove.bg و recraft.ai لمعالجة الصور المتقدمة وإزالة الخلفية، وإنتاج ملفات بمتعدد الصيغ."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating professional logos for businesses","Creating iterative design concepts for branding","Automating logo design processes with AI"],"zh":["为企业生成专业标志","创建品牌的迭代设计概念","使用AI自动化标志设计过程"],"ja":["企業のプロフェッショナルなロゴを生成する","ブランドのためのイテレーティブなデザインコンセプトを生成する","AIを使用してロゴデザインプロセスを自動化する"],"ko":["기업을 위한 전문 로고 생성","브랜드를 위한 반복적인 디자인 개념 생성","AI를 사용하여 로고 디자인 프로세스 자동화"],"es":["Generar logotipos profesionales para empresas","Crear conceptos de diseño iterativos para la marca","Automatizar procesos de diseño de logotipos con IA"],"fr":["Générer des logos professionnels pour les entreprises","Créer des concepts de design itératifs pour la marque","Automatiser les processus de conception de logos avec l''IA"],"de":[" Professionelle Logos für Unternehmen generieren","Iterative Designkonzepte für die Marke erstellen","Logo-Designprozesse mit KI automatisieren"],"pt":["Gerar logotipos profissionais para empresas","Criar conceitos de design iterativos para marca","Automatizar processos de design de logotipo com IA"],"ru":["Генерировать профессиональные логотипы для бизнеса","Создавать итеративные концепции дизайна для брендинга","Автоматизировать процессы дизайна логотипов с помощью ИИ"],"ar":["إنشاء شعارات احترافية للشركات","خلق مفاهيم تصميم تكرارية للعلامة التجارية","تأتييم عمليات تصميم الشعارات باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GEMINI_API_KEY from Google AI Studio","Needs REMOVE_BG_API_KEY from remove.bg","RECRAFT_API_KEY from recraft.ai is necessary","Dependent on nanobanana skill for AI image generation"],"zh":["需要从Google AI Studio获取GEMINI_API_KEY","需要从remove.bg获取REMOVE_BG_API_KEY","需要从recraft.ai获取RECRAFT_API_KEY","依赖于nanobanana技能进行AI图像生成"],"ja":["Google AI StudioからGEMINI_API_KEYを取得する必要がある","remove.bgからREMOVE_BG_API_KEYを取得する必要がある","recraft.aiからRECRAFT_API_KEYを取得する必要がある","AI画像生成のためにnanobananaスキルに依存する"],"ko":["Google AI Studio에서 GEMINI_API_KEY를 가져와야 함","remove.bg에서 REMOVE_BG_API_KEY를 가져와야 함","recraft.ai에서 RECRAFT_API_KEY를 가져와야 함","AI 이미지 생성을 위해 nanobanana 스킬에 의존"],"es":["Requiere GEMINI_API_KEY de Google AI Studio","Necesita REMOVE_BG_API_KEY de remove.bg","Se requiere RECRAFT_API_KEY de recraft.ai","Dependiente de la habilidad nanobanana para la generación de imágenes de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite GEMINI_API_KEY de Google AI Studio","A besoin de REMOVE_BG_API_KEY de remove.bg","Nécessite RECRAFT_API_KEY de recraft.ai","Dépend de la compétence nanobanana pour la génération d''images de l''IA"],"de":["Benötigt GEMINI_API_KEY von Google AI Studio","Benötigt REMOVE_BG_API_KEY von remove.bg","Benötigt RECRAFT_API_KEY von recraft.ai","Abhängig von der Fähigkeit nanobanana für die KI-Bildgenerierung"],"pt":["Exige GEMINI_API_KEY do Google AI Studio","Necessita REMOVE_BG_API_KEY do remove.bg","RECRAFT_API_KEY do recraft.ai é necessário","Dependente da habilidade nanobanana para geração de imagens de IA"],"ru":["Требует GEMINI_API_KEY от Google AI Studio","Нуждается в REMOVE_BG_API_KEY от remove.bg","RECRAFT_API_KEY от recraft.ai необходим","Зависит от навыка nanobanana для генерации изображений ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب GEMINI_API_KEY من Google AI Studio","يحتاج إلى REMOVE_BG_API_KEY من remove.bg","RECRAFT_API_KEY من recraft.ai ضروري","يعتمد على مهارة nanobanana لتوليد الصور الإيائية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Vulnetix/vdb-api/commit-feature', 'community', 'Vulnetix', 'vdb-api', 'Vulnetix/vdb-api', 'commit-feature', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z', '2026-02-18T07:38:14.580Z', NULL, '{"id":"Vulnetix/vdb-api/commit-feature","name":"commit-feature","description":{"zh":"Commit Feature API for external users, providing a conventional commit message and detailed PR comments.","ja":"Commit Feature API","ko":"Commit Feature API","es":"El comando commit-feature permite a los desarrolladores automatizar el proceso de commit sin co-autoría. Se utiliza la API de VDB para usuarios externos","fr":"La commande commit-feature permet aux développeurs d''automatiser le processus de commit sans co-écriture. Elle utilise l''API VDB pour les utilisateurs externes","de":"Der Befehl commit-feature ermöglicht es Entwicklern, den Commit-Prozess ohne Co-Autorenschaft zu automatisieren. Er verwendet die VDB-API für externe Benutzer","pt":"A API VDB permite que os desenvolvedores commitam recursos sem co-autoria, melhorando o fluxo de trabalho do desenvolvimento.","ru":"VDB API позволяет разработчикам коммитить функции без соавторства, улучшая рабочий процесс разработки.","ar":"سماح API VDB للمطورين باستكمال الميزات بدون المساهمة المشتركة، مما يحسن تدفق عمل التطوير.","en":"VDB API for external users"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Commit Feature API","ja":"Commit Feature API","ko":"Commit Feature API","es":"Commit Feature: API de VDB para usuarios externos","fr":"Commit Feature: API VDB pour utilisateurs externes","de":"Commit Feature: VDB API für externe Benutzer","pt":"Commit Feature: API VDB para Usuários Externos","ru":"Commit Feature: VDB API для внешних пользователей","ar":"ميزة Commit: API VDB للمستخدمين الخارجيين","en":"commit-feature"},"description":{"zh":"Commit Feature API for external users, providing a conventional commit message and detailed PR comments.","ja":"Commit Feature API","ko":"Commit Feature API","es":"El comando commit-feature permite a los desarrolladores automatizar el proceso de commit sin co-autoría. Se utiliza la API de VDB para usuarios externos","fr":"La commande commit-feature permet aux développeurs d''automatiser le processus de commit sans co-écriture. Elle utilise l''API VDB pour les utilisateurs externes","de":"Der Befehl commit-feature ermöglicht es Entwicklern, den Commit-Prozess ohne Co-Autorenschaft zu automatisieren. Er verwendet die VDB-API für externe Benutzer","pt":"A API VDB permite que os desenvolvedores commitam recursos sem co-autoria, melhorando o fluxo de trabalho do desenvolvimento.","ru":"VDB API позволяет разработчикам коммитить функции без соавторства, улучшая рабочий процесс разработки.","ar":"سماح API VDB للمطورين باستكمال الميزات بدون المساهمة المشتركة، مما يحسن تدفق عمل التطوير.","en":"VDB API for external users"},"definition":{"en":"VDB API for external users"},"features":{"zh":["Stage all changes","Create conventional commit messages","Push to origin","Add detailed PR comments","Support for multiple commit types","Optional scope parameter"],"ja":["","","","","",""],"ko":["","","","","",""],"es":["Automatización del proceso de commit","Uso de la API de VDB para usuarios externos","Creación de un mensaje de commit convencional","Adición de un comentario detallado en la solicitud de extracción","Inclusión de contexto de sesión y TODOs","Soporte para tipos de commit como feat, fix, chore, etc."],"fr":["Automatisation du processus de commit","Utilisation de l''API VDB pour les utilisateurs externes","Création d''un message de commit conventionnel","Ajout d''un commentaire détaillé dans la demande d''extraction","Inclusion du contexte de session et des TODOs","Prise en charge des types de commit tels que feat, fix, chore, etc."],"de":["Automatisierung des Commit-Prozesses","Verwendung der VDB-API für externe Benutzer","Erstellung einer konventionellen Commit-Meldung","Hinzufügen eines detaillierten Kommentars zur Pull-Anfrage","Einbeziehung des Sitzungskontexts und der TODOs","Unterstützung für Commit-Typen wie feat, fix, chore usw."],"pt":["Commitar recursos sem co-autoria","Criar mensagens de commit convencionais","Adicionar comentários detalhados de PR","Incluir contexto de sessão e problemas conhecidos","Tipos de commit: feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert","Escopo de commit: componente ou área afetada"],"ru":["Коммитить функции без соавторства","Создавать конвенциональные сообщения коммита","Добавлять подробные комментарии PR","Включать контекст сессии и известные проблемы","Типы коммита: feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert","Область коммита: компонент или затронутая область"],"ar":["استكمال الميزات بدون المساهمة المشتركة","إنشاء رسائل استكمال متوافقة","إضافة تعليقات مفصلة من PR","تضمين سياق الدورة وتحديد المشاكل المعروفة","أنواع الاستكمال: feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert","نطاق الاستكمال: المكون أو المنطقة المتأثرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Commit Feature API","VDB API","conventional commit messages","PR comments","commit types","scope parameter","API for external users","developer tools","version control"],"ja":["Commit Feature API","VDB API","","","","","","",""],"ko":["Commit Feature API","VDB API","","","","","","",""],"es":["commit feature","API de VDB","usuarios externos","automatización de commit","desarrollo de software","control de versiones","Git","commit convencional","solicitud de extracción"],"fr":["commit feature","API VDB","utilisateurs externes","automatisation de commit","développement de logiciels","contrôle de version","Git","commit conventionnel","demande d''extraction"],"de":["commit feature","VDB-API","externe Benutzer","Automatisierung von Commits","Softwareentwicklung","Versionskontrolle","Git","konventioneller Commit","Pull-Anfrage"],"pt":["API VDB","commit feature","desenvolvimento de software","fluxo de trabalho","co-autoria","mensagens de commit","comentários de PR","contexto de sessão","problemas conhecidos"],"ru":["VDB API","коммит функций","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий процесс","соавторство","сообщения коммита","комментарии PR","контекст сессии","известные проблемы"],"ar":["API VDB","ميزة الاستكمال","تطوير البرمجيات","تدفق العمل","المساهمة المشتركة","رسائل الاستكمال","تعليقات PR","سياق الدورة","المشاكل المعروفة"]}},"owner":"Vulnetix","repo":"vdb-api","repoPath":"Vulnetix/vdb-api","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-feature","description":"Stage changes, create conventional commit (no co-author), push to origin, and add detailed PR comment with session context","bodyPreview":"# Commit Feature Without Co-Authoring\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit message without Claude co-authoring, push to origin, and add a detailed PR comment with session context including TODOs and known issues.\n\n## Arguments\n\n`$ARGUMENTS` should contain:\n- **type** (required): `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, `revert`\n- **scope** (optional): Component or area affected (e.g., `api`, `ui`, `auth`, `database`)\n\nExamples:\n- `/commit-fe","body":"# Commit Feature Without Co-Authoring\n\nStage all changes, create a conventional commit message without Claude co-authoring, push to origin, and add a detailed PR comment with session context including TODOs and known issues.\n\n## Arguments\n\n`$ARGUMENTS` should contain:\n- **type** (required): `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, `revert`\n- **scope** (optional): Component or area affected (e.g., `api`, `ui`, `auth`, `database`)\n\nExamples:\n- `/commit-feature feat api` — New API feature\n- `/commit-feature fix validation` — Bug fix in validation\n- `/commit-feature chore deps` — Dependency updates\n\n## Step 1 — Parse Arguments\n\nExtract type and optional scope from `$ARGUMENTS`:\n\n```bash\nARGS=\"$ARGUMENTS\"\nTYPE=$(echo \"$ARGS\" | awk ''{print $1}'')\nSCOPE=$(echo \"$ARGS\" | awk ''{print $2}'')\n```\n\nValidate type is one of: `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `build`, `ci`, `revert`\n\nIf invalid or missing:\n```\n❌ Invalid or missing commit type\n\nUsage: /commit-feature <type> [scope]\n\nValid types:\n  feat      - New feature\n  fix       - Bug fix\n  chore     - Maintenance tasks\n  docs      - Documentation changes\n  style     - Code style/formatting\n  refactor  - Code restructuring\n  perf      - Performance improvements\n  test      - Test additions/changes\n  build     - Build system changes\n  ci        - CI/CD changes\n  revert    - Revert previous commit\n\nExample: /commit-feature feat api\n```\n\n## Step 2 — Check Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status --porcelain\n```\n\nIf no changes found:\n```\nℹ️ No changes to commit\n\nWorking directory is clean. Make some changes first.\n```\n\n## Step 3 — Show Staged and Unstaged Changes\n\nDisplay what will be committed:\n\n```bash\necho \"📋 Files to be committed:\"\ngit status --short\n\necho \"\"\necho \"📊 Summary of changes:\"\ngit diff --stat\n```\n\n## Step 4 — Stage All Changes\n\n```bash\ngit add .\n```\n\nConfirm staging:\n```bash\ngit status --short\n```\n\n## Step 5 — Analyze Changes for Commit Message\n\nRead the git diff to understand what was changed:\n\n```bash\ngit diff --cached\n```\n\nBased on the diff, create a concise commit message following conventional commit format:\n\n**Format:**\n```\n<type>[(scope)]: <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer]\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- Subject: Imperative mood, lowercase, no period, max 50 chars\n- Body: Explain WHAT and WHY (not HOW), wrap at 72 chars\n- Footer: Breaking changes, issue references\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nfeat(api): add vulnerability triage endpoint\n\nImplements POST /api/triage for bulk finding updates with\nanalysis state, justification, and response tracking.\n\nCloses #123\n```\n\n```\nfix(validation): handle null values in SBOM parser\n\nPrevents TypeError when component.version is undefined in\nCycloneDX SBOM processing.\n```\n\n```\nchore(deps): update prisma to 5.20.0\n\nIncludes performance improvements for PostgreSQL queries\nand fixes KV cache invalidation race condition.\n```\n\n## Step 6 — Get Current Branch and PR\n\n```bash\nBRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\necho \"Current branch: $BRANCH\"\n\n# Check if PR exists\nPR_JSON=$(gh pr list --head \"$BRANCH\" --base main --json number,title,url,state --limit 1)\nPR_NUMBER=$(echo \"$PR_JSON\" | jq -r ''.[0].number // empty'')\nPR_URL=$(echo \"$PR_JSON\" | jq -r ''.[0].url // empty'')\n```\n\n## Step 7 — Create Commit (No Co-Author)\n\nCreate commit with the conventional message (WITHOUT Claude co-authoring):\n\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n<type>[(scope)]: <subject>\n\n<optional body>\n\n<optional footer>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:** Do NOT include `Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>` line.\n\nConfirm commit created:\n```bash\ngit log -1 --oneline\n```\n\n## Step 8 — Push to Origin\n\n```bash\ngit push origin \"$BRANCH\"\n```\n\nIf push fails (no upstream), set upstream and push:\n```bash\ngit push -u origin \"$BRANCH\"\n```\n\n## Step 9 — Collect Session Context\n\nGather detailed information for PR comment:\n\n### 9.1 — Get Session Todos\n\nUse TaskList tool to retrieve all tasks with their status, subjects, and descriptions.\n\nCategorize by status:\n- ✅ **Completed** — Tasks marked as completed\n- 🔄 **In Progress** — Tasks currently being worked on\n- ⏳ **Pending** — Tasks not yet started\n- ⚠️ **Blocked** — Tasks with unresolved blockers\n\n### 9.2 — Identify Known Issues Outside Session Scope\n\nReview the conversation history to identify:\n- Pre-existing bugs or issues mentioned but not fixed\n- Technical debt noted during implementation\n- Code patterns that should be improved later\n- Performance concerns identified but deferred\n- Security considerations for future work\n- Missing tests or documentation\n- Commented \"TODO\" or \"FIXME\" in changed files\n\nSearch for these patterns in the diff:\n```bash\ngit diff --cached | grep -E \"(TODO|FIXME|XXX|HACK|NOTE:|WARNING:)\"\n```\n\n### 9.3 — Extract Implementation Details\n\nFrom the conversation and code changes, document:\n- **Approach taken**: High-level implementation strategy\n- **Key decisions**: Why certain patterns or libraries were chosen\n- **Trade-offs**: What was prioritized and what was deferred\n- **Edge cases**: Known limitations or boundary conditions\n- **Dependencies**: New packages or services added\n- **Configuration**: Environment variables or settings changed\n\n## Step 10 — Create or Update PR Comment\n\nIf PR exists (`$PR_NUMBER` is not empty), add detailed comment:\n\n```bash\ngh pr comment \"$PR_NUMBER\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## 🤖 Session Summary\n\n### Commit Details\n**Type:** <type>\n**Scope:** <scope>\n**Message:** <commit subject>\n\n---\n\n### 📝 Implementation Context\n\n#### What Changed\n<Detailed explanation of the changes in this commit, including:>\n- Key functionality added/modified\n- Files affected and why\n- Integration points with existing code\n- Data model or API changes\n\n#### Approach & Decisions\n<Document the implementation approach:>\n- Why this solution was chosen over alternatives\n- Technical decisions made during implementation\n- Libraries or patterns introduced\n- Performance or security considerations\n\n#### Testing Notes\n<Testing considerations:>\n- Test coverage added\n- Manual testing performed\n- Edge cases validated\n- Known test gaps (if any)\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Session Tasks\n\n<If tasks exist, format as markdown checklist grouped by status>\n\n#### Completed\n- [x] Task 1\n- [x] Task 2\n\n#### In Progress\n- [ ] Task 3\n\n#### Pending\n- [ ] Task 4\n\n<If no tasks: \"No tracked tasks for this session\">\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Known Issues & Technical Debt\n\n<List issues identified but not addressed in this commit:>\n\n#### Pre-Existing Issues\n- Issue 1: Description and why it wasn''t addressed\n- Issue 2: Description and potential impact\n\n#### Deferred Work\n- TODO 1: What needs to be done and why it was deferred\n- TODO 2: Suggested approach for future implementation\n\n#### Code Quality Notes\n- Pattern 1: Existing pattern that could be improved\n- Pattern 2: Technical debt to address in future refactor\n\n<If none: \"No significant issues identified outside session scope\">\n\n---\n\n### 🔗 Related Work\n\n<If applicable, link to:>\n- Related issues: #123, #456\n- Documentation: Link to relevant docs\n- Design docs: Link to technical design\n- Dependent PRs: #789\n\n---\n\n<Timestamp>\n📅 Generated: <current date/time>\n🤖 [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) Session\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\nIf NO PR exists:\n```\nℹ️ No PR found for branch ''$BRANCH''\n\nChanges committed and pushed. Create a PR with:\n  gh pr create --base main --fill\n\nThe session context can be added as a comment after PR creation.\n```\n\n## Step 11 — Final Summary\n\nOutput comprehensive summary:\n\n```\n╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║           COMMIT & PUSH SUMMARY                   ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nCOMMIT:\n  Type:     <type>\n  Scope:    <scope>\n  Message:  <subject>\n  Hash:     <commit sha>\n\nBRANCH:     <branch name>\nSTATUS:     ✅ Committed and pushed\n\nFILES CHANGED:\n  Modified:   <count>\n  Added:      <count>\n  Deleted:    <count>\n\nPULL REQUEST:\n  Number:     #<pr number>\n  URL:        <pr url>\n  Comment:    ✅ Added detailed session context\n\nSESSION CONTEXT:\n  ✅ Completed tasks:     <count>\n  🔄 In progress:         <count>\n  ⏳ Pending:             <count>\n  ⚠️ Known issues:        <count>\n  📝 Implementation details included\n\nNEXT STEPS:\n  • Review PR comments for full session context\n  • Address any remaining TODOs or known issues\n  • Ensure CI/CD checks pass\n  • Request review when ready to merge\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Invalid Commit Type\n```\n❌ Invalid commit type: ''<type>''\n\nMust be one of: feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert\n```\n\n### No Changes to Commit\n```\nℹ️ Working directory is clean\n\nNo changes to commit. Make changes first, then run:\n  /commit-feature <type> [scope]\n```\n\n### Push Failed\n```\n❌ Failed to push to origin\n\nPossible causes:\n1. Network connectivity issues\n2. Authentication required\n3. Remote branch conflicts\n4. No upstream configured\n\nTry:\n  git push -u origin <branch>\n  # or resolve conflicts with:\n  git pull --rebase origin <branch>\n```\n\n### No PR Found\n```\nℹ️ No open PR found for branch ''<branch>''\n\nChanges committed and pushed successfully. Create PR with:\n  gh pr create --base main --fill\n\nRun /commit-feature again after PR creation to add session context.\n```\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```bash\n# Feature commit with scope\n/commit-feature feat api\n# → Creates: \"feat(api): add triage endpoint\"\n# → Pushes to origin\n# → Adds detailed PR comment with session context\n\n# Bug fix without scope\n/commit-feature fix\n# → Creates: \"fix: handle null values in parser\"\n# → Pushes and comments on PR\n\n# Chore with dependency scope\n/commit-feature chore deps\n# → Creates: \"chore(deps): update prisma to 5.20.0\"\n# → Documents dependency changes in PR comment\n\n# Documentation update\n/commit-feature docs\n# → Creates: \"docs: update API authentication guide\"\n# → Links to related documentation in PR comment\n```\n\n## Conventional Commit Reference\n\n| Type | Description | Example |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| `feat` | New feature | feat(auth): add OAuth2 support |\n| `fix` | Bug fix | fix(validation): prevent XSS in input |\n| `chore` | Maintenance | chore(deps): upgrade dependencies |\n| `docs` | Documentation | docs(api): update endpoint examples |\n| `style` | Formatting | style: apply prettier to codebase |\n| `refactor` | Code restructure | refactor(db): extract query helpers |\n| `perf` | Performance | perf(api): optimize database queries |\n| `test` | Tests | test(auth): add integration tests |\n| `build` | Build system | build: update webpack config |\n| `ci` | CI/CD | ci: add automated deployment |\n| `revert` | Revert commit | revert: revert \"add feature X\" |\n\n## Safety Notes\n\n- **No Claude co-authoring**: Commits will NOT include `Co-Authored-By` line\n- **Review before push**: Always verify staged changes match intent\n- **PR comments are append-only**: Multiple runs will add multiple comments\n- **Session context is detailed**: PR comments include implementation notes, TODOs, and known issues\n- **Push is automatic**: Changes will be pushed immediately after commit\n- **Conventional commits**: Follow the standard for automated changelog generation\n- **No destructive operations**: This skill only adds commits and comments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:38:14.580Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated Git workflow management with conventional commit messages and detailed PR comments.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 Git 工作流管理的开发代理，具有标准的提交消息和详细的 PR 评论。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化された Git ワークフロー管理を必要とする場合に最適で、従来のコミット メッセージと詳細な PR コメントが含まれています。","ko":"자동화된 Git 워크플로 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며, 표준 커밋 메시지와 자세한 PR 댓글을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada de Git con mensajes de confirmación convencionales y comentarios detallados de PR.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow Git automatisée avec des messages de commit conventionnels et des commentaires PR détaillés.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung mit konventionellen Commit-Nachrichten und detaillierten PR-Kommentaren benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado do Git com mensagens de commit convencionais e comentários detalhados de PR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим автоматизированный менеджмент рабочего процесса Git с обычными сообщениями о коммитах и подробными комментариями PR.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إدارة تدفق العمل التلقائي لجيت مع رسائل التزامات تقليدية وتعليقات طلب سحب مفصلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to stage changes, create standardized commit messages without co-authoring, push to origin, and add detailed PR comments with session context including TODOs and known issues, utilizing VDB API for external users and supporting various commit types such as feat, fix, and chore.","zh":"赋予代理人预提交更改、创建标准化的提交消息而无需共同作者、推送到远程仓库以及添加包含待办事项和已知问题的会话上下文的详细 PR 评论，利用 VDB API 支持外部用户，并支持多种类型的提交，如 feat、fix 和 chore。","ja":"エージェントにステージングの変更、共同作成者なしで標準化されたコミット メッセージの作成、オリジンへのプッシュ、および TODO と既知の問題を含むセッション コンテキストを使用した詳細な PR コメントの追加を可能にし、VDB API を使用して外部ユーザーをサポートし、feat、fix、chore などのさまざまなコミット タイプをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 변경 사항을 스테이징하고, 공동 저자 없이 표준화된 커밋 메시지를 생성하고, 원격 저장소에 푸시하고, 세션 컨텍스트를 포함하여 TODO 및 알려진 문제를 포함한 자세한 PR 댓글을 추가할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 VDB API를 사용하여 외부 사용자를 지원하며, feat, fix, chore 등의 다양한 커밋 유형을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a preparar cambios, crear mensajes de confirmación estandarizados sin coautoría, enviar a origen y agregar comentarios PR detallados con contexto de sesión, incluyendo TODO y problemas conocidos, utilizando la API de VDB para usuarios externos y admitiendo varios tipos de confirmación, como feat, fix y chore.","fr":"Permet aux agents de préparer des modifications, de créer des messages de commit standardisés sans co-écriture, de pousser vers l''origine et d''ajouter des commentaires PR détaillés avec le contexte de session, y compris les TODO et les problèmes connus, en utilisant l''API VDB pour les utilisateurs externes et en prenant en charge les différents types de commit tels que feat, fix et chore.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, Änderungen vorzubereiten, standardisierte Commit-Nachrichten ohne Co-Autorschaft zu erstellen, an den Ursprung zu übertragen und detaillierte PR-Kommentare mit Sitzungskontext, einschließlich TODOs und bekannter Probleme, unter Verwendung der VDB-API für externe Benutzer und Unterstützung verschiedener Commit-Typen wie feat, fix und chore, hinzuzufügen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a preparar alterações, criar mensagens de commit padronizadas sem co-autoria, enviar para o de origem e adicionar comentários de PR detalhados com contexto de sessão, incluindo TODOs e problemas conhecidos, utilizando a API do VDB para usuários externos e suportando vários tipos de commit, como feat, fix e chore.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью подготовки изменений, создания стандартизированных сообщений о коммитах без соавторства, отправки в origin и добавления подробных комментариев PR с контекстом сессии, включая TODO и известные проблемы, используя API VDB для внешних пользователей и поддерживая различные типы коммитов, такие как feat, fix и chore.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحضير التعديلات وإنشاء رسائل التزامات معيارية دون التأليف المشترك وإرسالها إلى الأصل وإضافة تعليقات طلب سحب مفصلة مع سياق الجلسة بما في ذلك أشياء للقيام بها وقضايا معروفة، باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات VDB للمستخدمين الخارجيين ودعم أنواع مختلفة من Commit مثل feat و fix و chore."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit messages with conventional commit syntax","Generating detailed PR comments with session context and TODOs","Pushing changes to origin with standardized commit messages"],"zh":["使用标准提交语法自动化提交消息","使用包含待办事项的会话上下文生成详细 PR 评论","使用标准化提交消息将更改推送到远程仓库"],"ja":["従来のコミット構文を使用してコミット メッセージを自動化する","セッション コンテキストと TODO を含む詳細な PR コメントを生成する","標準化されたコミット メッセージを使用して変更をオリジンにプッシュする"],"ko":["표준 커밋 구문을 사용하여 커밋 메시지를 자동화하는 것","세션 컨텍스트와 TODO를 포함한 자세한 PR 댓글을 생성하는 것","표준화된 커밋 메시지를 사용하여 변경 사항을 원격 저장소에 푸시하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar mensajes de confirmación con sintaxis de confirmación convencional","Generar comentarios PR detallados con contexto de sesión y TODO","Enviar cambios a origen con mensajes de confirmación estandarizados"],"fr":["Automatiser les messages de commit avec une syntaxe de commit conventionnelle","Générer des commentaires PR détaillés avec le contexte de session et les TODO","Envoyer des modifications à l''origine avec des messages de commit standardisés"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit-Nachrichten mit konventioneller Commit-Syntax","Erstellen detaillierter PR-Kommentare mit Sitzungskontext und TODOs","Übertragen von Änderungen an den Ursprung mit standardisierten Commit-Nachrichten"],"pt":["Automatizar mensagens de commit com sintaxe de commit convencional","Gerar comentários de PR detalhados com contexto de sessão e TODOs","Enviar alterações para o de origem com mensagens de commit padronizadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сообщения о коммитах с обычной синтаксисой коммитов","Генерировать подробные комментарии PR с контекстом сессии и TODO","Отправлять изменения в origin с стандартизированными сообщениями о коммитах"],"ar":["توفير رسائل التزامات تلقائي مع بناء جملة التزامات التقليدية","توليد تعليقات طلب سحب مفصلة مع سياق الجلسة وأشياء للقيام بها","إرسال التعديلات إلى الأصل مع رسائل التزامات معيارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VDB API access for external users","Limited to specific commit types (e.g., feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"zh":["需要外部用户的 VDB API 访问","仅限于特定的提交类型（例如 feat、fix、chore、docs、style、refactor、perf、test、build、ci、revert）"],"ja":["外部ユーザーには VDB API アクセスが必要","特定のコミット タイプ (例: feat、fix、chore、docs、style、refactor、perf、test、build、ci、revert) に限定される"],"ko":["외부 사용자의 경우 VDB API 접근이 필요함","특정 커밋 유형에만 제한됨 (예: feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de VDB para usuarios externos","Limitado a tipos de confirmación específicos (por ejemplo, feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API VDB pour les utilisateurs externes","Limité à des types de commit spécifiques (par exemple, feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die VDB-API für externe Benutzer","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Commit-Typen (z. B. feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do VDB para usuários externos","Limitado a tipos de commit específicos (por exemplo, feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API VDB для внешних пользователей","Ограничен конкретными типами коммитов (например, feat, fix, chore, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, revert)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات VDB للمستخدمين الخارجيين","محدود بنوع معين من Commit (على سبيل المثال feat و fix و chore و docs و style و refactor و perf و test و build و ci و revert)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dandedotdev/dotfiles/schema-markup', 'community', 'dandedotdev', 'dotfiles', 'dandedotdev/dotfiles', 'schema-markup', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z', '2026-02-18T07:38:40.882Z', NULL, '{"id":"dandedotdev/dotfiles/schema-markup","name":"schema-markup","description":{"zh":"Schema 标记是一种结构化数据格式，帮助搜索引擎理解您的内容并显示丰富的搜索结果","ja":"Schema マークアップは、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、豊富な検索結果を表示するための構造化データ形式です","ko":"스키마 마크업은 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 풍부한 검색 결과를 표시할 수 있는 구조화된 데이터 형식입니다","es":"Schema Markup es un lenguaje de marcado que ayuda a los motores de búsqueda a entender el contenido de una página web. Mejora la visibilidad y el posicionamiento en los resultados de búsqueda","fr":"Schema Markup est un langage de balisage qui aide les moteurs de recherche à comprendre le contenu d''une page web. Il améliore la visibilité et le positionnement dans les résultats de recherche","de":"Schema Markup ist eine Markupsprache, die Suchmaschinen hilft, den Inhalt einer Webseite zu verstehen. Sie verbessert die Sichtbarkeit und Platzierung in den Suchergebnissen","pt":"O marcar esquema é fundamental para a otimização de resultados de pesquisa. Ele ajuda os mecanismos de busca a entender o conteúdo e a exibir resultados ricos.","ru":"Маркировка схемы является фундаментальной для оптимизации результатов поиска. Она помогает поисковым системам понимать содержание и отображать богатые результаты.","ar":"تعليم مخطط هو أساسي لتحسين نتائج البحث. يساعد محركات البحث على فهم المحتوى و عرض نتائج غنية","en":"My personal environment settings"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Schema 标记 - 结构化数据专家","ja":"スキーマ マークアップ - 構造化データの専門家","ko":"스키마 마크업 - 구조화된 데이터 전문가","es":"Mejora tu SEO con Schema Markup","fr":"Améliorez votre SEO avec Schema Markup","de":"Verbessern Sie Ihr SEO mit Schema Markup","pt":"Marcar Esquema - Otimização de Resultados de Pesquisa","ru":"Маркировка Схемы -