dans les moteurs de recherche","Augmente la visibilité et le positionnement dans les résultats de recherche","Est compatible avec la plupart des moteurs de recherche","Peut être implémenté dans différents types de contenu"],"de":["Verbessert das Verständnis des Inhalts durch Suchmaschinen","Aktiviert erweiterte Ergebnisse in Suchmaschinen","Erhöht die Sichtbarkeit und Platzierung in den Suchergebnissen","Ist mit den meisten Suchmaschinen kompatibel","Kann in verschiedenen Inhaltstypen implementiert werden"],"pt":["Melhora a visibilidade dos resultados de pesquisa","Fornece resultados ricos em pesquisas","Ajuda os mecanismos de busca a entender o conteúdo","É compatível com schema.org","Pode ser implementado em diferentes tipos de páginas"],"ru":["Улучшает видимость результатов поиска","Предоставляет богатые результаты в поиске","Помогает поисковым системам понимать содержание","Компатибелен с schema.org","Может быть реализован на разных типах страниц"],"ar":["تحسين ظهور نتائج البحث","تقديم نتائج غنية في البحث","مساعدة محركات البحث على فهم المحتوى","متوافق مع schema.org","يمكن تنفيذه على أنواع مختلفة من الصفحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Schema 标记","结构化数据","搜索引擎优化","微数据","网页内容","搜索结果","点击率","SEO","网页开发"],"ja":["スキーマ マークアップ","構造化データ","検索エンジン最適化","マイクロデータ","ウェブページのコンテンツ","検索結果","クリック率","SEO","ウェブ開発"],"ko":["스키마 마크업","구조화된 데이터","검색 엔진 최적화","마이크로 데이터","웹 페이지의 콘텐츠","검색 결과","클릭률","SEO","웹 개발"],"es":["Schema Markup","SEO","motores de búsqueda","resultados enriquecidos","visibilidad","posicionamiento","contenido","datos estructurados","vocabulario"],"fr":["Schema Markup","SEO","moteurs de recherche","résultats enrichis","visibilité","positionnement","contenu","données structurées","vocabulaire"],"de":["Schema Markup","SEO","Suchmaschinen","erweiterte Ergebnisse","Sichtbarkeit","Platzierung","Inhalt","strukturierte Daten","Vokabular"],"pt":["marcar esquema","otimização de resultados de pesquisa","resultados ricos","schema.org","dados estruturados","mecanismos de busca","visibilidade de pesquisa"],"ru":["маркировка схемы","оптимизация результатов поиска","богатые результаты","schema.org","структурированные данные","поисковые системы","видимость поиска"],"ar":["تعليم مخطط","تحسين نتائج البحث","نتائج غنية","schema.org","بيانات منظمة","محركات البحث","ظهور البحث"]}},"owner":"dandedotdev","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"dandedotdev/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:38:40.882Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing advanced schema markup capabilities for rich search results.","zh":"非常适合需要高级schema标记功能以获得丰富搜索结果的SEO优化代理","ja":"SEO最適化エージェントが高度なスキーママークアップ機能を必要とする場合に最適です","ko":"豊富한 검색 결과를 얻기 위해 고급 스키마 마크업 기능이 필요한 SEO 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de SEO que necesitan capacidades de marcado de esquema avanzadas para resultados de búsqueda ricos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de SEO ayant besoin de capacités de balisage de schéma avancées pour des résultats de recherche riches.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die erweiterte Schema-Markup-Fähigkeiten für reichhaltige Suchergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeita para Agentes de Otimização do SEO que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de marcação de esquema para resultados de pesquisa ricos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов SEO-оптимизации, которым необходимы расширенные возможности маркировки схемы для получения богатых результатов поиска.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المحسنين لتحسين محركات البحث الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحديد مخطط للنتائج البحثية الغنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling rich results in search and enhancing content understanding through structured data, utilizing protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","zh":"赋予代理实现schema.org标记的能力，能够在搜索中实现丰富的结果，并通过结构化数据增强内容理解，利用JSON-LD和Microdata等协议","ja":"エージェントにschema.orgマークアップを実装する能力を与え、検索で豊富な結果を実現し、構造化データを通じてコンテンツの理解を強化する、JSON-LDやMicrodataなどのプロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 마크업을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 검색에서 풍부한 결과를 구현하고 구조화된 데이터를 통해 콘텐츠 이해를 향상시키며, JSON-LD 및 Microdata와 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar el marcado de schema.org, lo que permite resultados ricos en la búsqueda y mejora la comprensión del contenido a través de datos estructurados, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD y Microdata.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre le balisage de schema.org, ce qui permet des résultats riches dans la recherche et améliore la compréhension du contenu grâce à des données structurées, en utilisant des protocoles tels que JSON-LD et Microdata.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, schema.org-Markup zu implementieren, wodurch reiche Ergebnisse in der Suche ermöglicht und das Verständnis von Inhalten durch strukturierte Daten, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie JSON-LD und Microdata, verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar a marcação do schema.org, permitindo resultados ricos na pesquisa e aprimorando a compreensão do conteúdo por meio de dados estruturados, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD e Microdata.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать маркировку schema.org, что позволяет получать богатые результаты поиска и улучшать понимание контента с помощью структурированных данных, используя протоколы như JSON-LD и Microdata.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ تحديد مخطط schema.org، مما يسمح بالحصول على نتائج بحث غنية وتحسين فهم المحتوى من خلال البيانات المهيكلة، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل JSON-LD و Microdata."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing product markup for e-commerce sites","Generating schema for article and blog post content","Enhancing search engine results with review and rating snippets"],"zh":["为电子商务网站实施产品标记","为文章和博客帖子内容生成schema","使用评论和评分片段增强搜索引擎结果"],"ja":["電子商取引サイトの製品マークアップを実装する","記事やブログ投稿のコンテンツ用のスキーマを生成する","レビューと評価スニペットを使用して検索エンジンの結果を強化する"],"ko":["전자상거래 사이트에 대한 제품 마크업 구현","기사 및 블로그 게시물 콘텐츠에 대한 스키마 생성","검색 엔진 결과를 리뷰 및评分 스니펫으로 강화하는"],"es":["Implementar el marcado de producto para sitios de comercio electrónico","Generar esquema para contenido de artículos y publicaciones de blog","Mejorar los resultados de los motores de búsqueda con fragmentos de reseñas y calificaciones"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le balisage de produit pour les sites de commerce électronique","Générer un schéma pour le contenu d''articles et de billets de blog","Améliorer les résultats des moteurs de recherche avec des extraits de commentaires et de notes"],"de":["Implementierung von Produktmarkierungen für E-Commerce-Sites","Generierung von Schemas für Artikel- und Blogpost-Inhalte","Verbesserung der Suchmaschinenergebnisse mit Bewertungs- und Bewertungsausschnitten"],"pt":["Implementar marcação de produto para sites de comércio eletrônico","Gerar esquema para conteúdo de artigos e posts de blog","Aprimorar os resultados de motores de busca com trechos de revisão e classificação"],"ru":["Реализация маркировки продукта для сайтов электронной коммерции","Генерация схемы для контента статей и блог-постов","Улучшение результатов поисковых систем с помощью сниппетов обзора и рейтинга"],"ar":["تنفيذ تحديد مخطط المنتج للمواقع الإلكترونية للتجارة","генерация مخطط للمحتوى المكون من مقالات ومنشورات مدونة","تحسين نتائج محركات البحث باستخدام مقتطفات المراجعة والتقييم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of schema.org vocabulary","Dependent on specific page type and content context"],"zh":["需要了解schema.org词汇表","依赖于特定的页面类型和内容上下文"],"ja":["schema.orgの語彙を理解する必要がある","特定のページタイプとコンテンツコンテキストに依存する"],"ko":["schema.org 용어집을 이해해야 함","특정 페이지 유형 및 콘텐츠 컨텍스트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del vocabulario de schema.org","Dependiente del tipo de página y del contexto del contenido específico"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du vocabulaire de schema.org","Dépend du type de page et du contexte de contenu spécifique"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für das Vokabular von schema.org","Abhängig vom spezifischen Seitentyp und Kontext des Inhalts"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do vocabulário do schema.org","Depende do tipo específico de página e contexto de conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует понимания словаря schema.org","Зависит от конкретного типа страницы и контекста контента"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مفردات schema.org","يعتمد على نوع صفحة معين وسياق المحتوى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
