,"Registrar controladores en el registro de NodeHandler"],"fr":["Ajouter des gestionnaires de messages personnalisés","Améliorer la communication entre la couche UI et le backend","Utiliser le système NodeBridge pour les messages","Implémenter la logique métier dans les gestionnaires","Enregistrer les gestionnaires dans le registre de NodeHandler"],"de":["Hinzufügen von benutzerdefinierten Nachrichten-Handlern","Verbesserung der Kommunikation zwischen der UI-Schicht und dem Backend","Verwenden des NodeBridge-Systems für Nachrichten","Implementierung von Geschäftlogik in den Handlern","Registrieren von Handlern im NodeHandler-Register"],"pt":["Adicionar manipulador de mensagens ao sistema NodeBridge","Melhorar a comunicação entre a camada de UI e o backend Node.js","Implementar lógica de negócios personalizada","Utilizar o registro de manipuladores para gerenciar mensagens","Desenvolver aplicações escaláveis e eficientes"],"ru":["Добавить обработчик сообщений в систему NodeBridge","Улучшить коммуникацию между слоем UI и бэкендом Node.js","Реализовать пользовательскую логику бизнеса","Использовать регистр обработчиков для управления сообщениями","Разрабатывать масштабируемые и эффективные приложения"],"ar":["إضافة معالج رسائل إلى نظام NodeBridge","تحسين التواصل بين طبقة الواجهة و الخوادم Node.js","تنفيذ منطق الأعمال المخصص","استخدام سجل المعالجات لإدارة الرسائل","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة و الفعالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NodeBridge","Node.js","UI","registerHandlers","messageBus","add-nodebridge-handler"],"ja":["NodeBridge","Node.js","UI","registerHandlers","messageBus","add-nodebridge-handler"],"ko":["NodeBridge","Node.js","UI","registerHandlers","messageBus","add-nodebridge-handler"],"es":["NodeBridge","controlador de mensajes","comunicación UI-backend","Node.js","desarrollo de software","programación","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"fr":["NodeBridge","gestionnaire de messages","communication UI-backend","Node.js","développement de logiciels","programmation","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"de":["NodeBridge","Nachrichten-Handler","Kommunikation UI-Backend","Node.js","Softwareentwicklung","Programmierung","JavaScript","TypeScript"],"pt":["NodeBridge","manipulador de mensagens","comunicação UI-backend","desenvolvimento de aplicações","lógica de negócios","registro de manipuladores"],"ru":["NodeBridge","обработчик сообщений","коммуникация UI-бэкенд","разработка приложений","логика бизнеса","регистр обработчиков"],"ar":["NodeBridge","معالج رسائل","تواصل الواجهة-الخادم","تطوير التطبيقات","منطق الأعمال","سجل المعالجات"]}},"owner":"neovateai","repo":"neovate-code","repoPath":"neovateai/neovate-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-nodebridge-handler","description":"Use this skill when adding a new NodeBridge handler to src/nodeBridge.ts, including updating types in src/nodeBridge.types.ts and optionally testing with scripts/test-nodebridge.ts","bodyPreview":"# Add NodeBridge Handler\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the process of adding a new message handler to the NodeBridge system, which enables communication between the UI layer and the Node.js backend.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Add Handler Implementation in `src/nodeBridge.ts`\n\nLocate the `registerHandlers()` method in the `NodeHandlerRegistry` class and add your handler:\n\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''category.handlerName'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, ...otherParams } = data;\n  con","body":"# Add NodeBridge Handler\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides the process of adding a new message handler to the NodeBridge system, which enables communication between the UI layer and the Node.js backend.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Add Handler Implementation in `src/nodeBridge.ts`\n\nLocate the `registerHandlers()` method in the `NodeHandlerRegistry` class and add your handler:\n\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''category.handlerName'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, ...otherParams } = data;\n  const context = await this.getContext(cwd);\n  \n  // Implementation logic here\n  \n  return {\n    success: true,\n    data: {\n      // Return data\n    },\n  };\n});\n```\n\n**Handler Naming Convention:**\n- Use dot notation: `category.action` (e.g., `git.status`, `session.send`, `utils.getPaths`)\n- Categories: `config`, `git`, `mcp`, `models`, `outputStyles`, `project`, `projects`, `providers`, `session`, `sessions`, `slashCommand`, `status`, `utils`\n\n**Common Patterns:**\n- Always get context via `await this.getContext(cwd)`\n- Return `{ success: true, data: {...} }` for success\n- Return `{ success: false, error: ''message'' }` for errors\n- Wrap in try/catch for error handling\n\n### 2. Add Type Definitions in `src/nodeBridge.types.ts`\n\nAdd input and output types near the relevant section:\n\n```typescript\n// ============================================================================\n// Category Handlers\n// ============================================================================\n\ntype CategoryHandlerNameInput = {\n  cwd: string;\n  // other required params\n  optionalParam?: string;\n};\n\ntype CategoryHandlerNameOutput = {\n  success: boolean;\n  error?: string;\n  data?: {\n    // return data shape\n  };\n};\n```\n\nThen add to the `HandlerMap` type:\n\n```typescript\nexport type HandlerMap = {\n  // ... existing handlers\n  \n  // Category handlers\n  ''category.handlerName'': {\n    input: CategoryHandlerNameInput;\n    output: CategoryHandlerNameOutput;\n  };\n};\n```\n\n### 3. (Optional) Add to Test Script\n\nUpdate `scripts/test-nodebridge.ts` HANDLERS object if the handler should be easily testable:\n\n```typescript\nconst HANDLERS: Record<string, string> = {\n  // ... existing handlers\n  ''category.handlerName'': ''Description of what this handler does'',\n};\n```\n\n### 4. Test the Handler\n\nRun the test script:\n\n```bash\nbun scripts/test-nodebridge.ts category.handlerName --cwd=/path/to/dir --param=value\n```\n\nOr with JSON data:\n\n```bash\nbun scripts/test-nodebridge.ts category.handlerName --data=''{\"cwd\":\"/path\",\"param\":\"value\"}''\n```\n\n## Example: Complete Handler Addition\n\n### nodeBridge.ts\n```typescript\nthis.messageBus.registerHandler(''utils.example'', async (data) => {\n  const { cwd, name } = data;\n  try {\n    const context = await this.getContext(cwd);\n    \n    // Do something with context and params\n    const result = await someOperation(name);\n    \n    return {\n      success: true,\n      data: {\n        result,\n      },\n    };\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    return {\n      success: false,\n      error: error.message || ''Failed to execute example'',\n    };\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### nodeBridge.types.ts\n```typescript\ntype UtilsExampleInput = {\n  cwd: string;\n  name: string;\n};\n\ntype UtilsExampleOutput = {\n  success: boolean;\n  error?: string;\n  data?: {\n    result: string;\n  };\n};\n\n// In HandlerMap:\n''utils.example'': {\n  input: UtilsExampleInput;\n  output: UtilsExampleOutput;\n};\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Handlers are async functions that receive `data` parameter\n- Use `this.getContext(cwd)` to get the Context instance (cached per cwd)\n- Context provides access to: `config`, `paths`, `mcpManager`, `productName`, `version`, etc.\n- For long-running operations, consider using abort controllers (see `git.clone` pattern)\n- For operations that emit progress, use `this.messageBus.emitEvent()` (see `git.commit.output` pattern)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:40:34.589Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js Agents needing seamless communication between the UI layer and backend.","zh":"非常适合需要在UI层和后端之间实现无缝通信的Node.js代理。","ja":"UI層とバックエンドの間での無駄のない通信を必要とするNode.jsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"UI 계층과 백엔드 간의 무결점 통신이 필요한 Node.js 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Node.js que necesitan una comunicación fluida entre la capa de interfaz de usuario y el backend.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Node.js nécessitant une communication transparente entre la couche d''interface utilisateur et le backend.","de":"Perfekt für Node.js-Agents, die eine nahtlose Kommunikation zwischen der Benutzeroberflächenschicht und dem Backend benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Node.js que precisam de comunicação sem interrupções entre a camada de interface do usuário e o backend.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Node.js, которым требуется бесперебойная связь между слоем пользовательского интерфейса и бэкендом.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يحتاج إلى اتصال مستمر بين طبقة واجهة المستخدم وخلفية البرنامج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend the NodeBridge system with custom message handlers, enabling robust communication via the message bus and supporting async data processing in TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理扩展NodeBridge系统的自定义消息处理程序的能力，通过消息总线实现强大的通信，并支持TypeScript中的异步数据处理。","ja":"エージェントにNodeBridgeシステムをカスタムメッセージハンドラーで拡張する能力を付与し、メッセージバスを介した強力な通信とTypeScriptでの非同期データ処理をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 NodeBridge 시스템을 사용자 지정 메시지 처리기로 확장할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 메시지 버스를 통해 강력한 통신 및 TypeScript에서 비동기 데이터 처리를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ampliar el sistema NodeBridge con controladores de mensajes personalizados, lo que permite una comunicación robusta a través del autobús de mensajes y admite el procesamiento de datos asíncronos en TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre le système NodeBridge avec des gestionnaires de messages personnalisés, permettant ainsi une communication robuste via le bus de messages et prenant en charge le traitement de données asynchrones dans TypeScript.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das NodeBridge-System mit benutzerdefinierten Nachrichtenhandlern zu erweitern, wodurch eine robuste Kommunikation über den Nachrichtenbus ermöglicht wird und asynchrone Datenverarbeitung in TypeScript unterstützt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estendam o sistema NodeBridge com manipuladores de mensagens personalizados, habilitando uma comunicação robusta via barramento de mensagens e suportando processamento de dados assíncrono em TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширять систему NodeBridge с помощью пользовательских обработчиков сообщений, обеспечивая надежную связь через шину сообщений и поддержку асинхронной обработки данных в TypeScript.","ar":"يمكن للعميل扩يم نظام NodeBridge باستخدام معالجات رسائل مخصصة، مما يتيح اتصالاً قوياً من خلال حافلة الرسائل ودعم معالجة البيانات غير المتزامنة في لغة TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom message handlers for NodeBridge","Enhancing UI-backend communication with async data processing","Registering new handlers in the NodeHandlerRegistry"],"zh":["为NodeBridge实现自定义消息处理程序","使用异步数据处理增强UI后端通信","在NodeHandlerRegistry中注册新处理程序"],"ja":["NodeBridge用のカスタムメッセージハンドラーを実装する","非同期データ処理を使用してUIバックエンド通信を強化する","NodeHandlerRegistryに新しいハンドラーを登録する"],"ko":["NodeBridge를 위한 사용자 지정 메시지 핸들러 구현","비동기 데이터 처리를 사용하여 UI-백엔드 통신 강화","NodeHandlerRegistry에新しい 핸들러 등록"],"es":["Implementación de controladores de mensajes personalizados para NodeBridge","Mejora de la comunicación entre la interfaz de usuario y el backend con procesamiento de datos asíncronos","Registro de nuevos controladores en el registro de controladores de Node"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de gestionnaires de messages personnalisés pour NodeBridge","Amélioration de la communication entre l''interface utilisateur et le backend avec un traitement de données asynchrone","Enregistrement de nouveaux gestionnaires dans le registre de gestionnaires de nœuds"],"de":["Implementierung benutzerdefinierter Nachrichtenhandler für NodeBridge","Verbesserung der Kommunikation zwischen der Benutzeroberfläche und dem Backend mit asynchroner Datenverarbeitung","Registrierung neuer Handler im Node-Handler-Registry"],"pt":["Implementação de manipuladores de mensagens personalizados para NodeBridge","Melhoria da comunicação UI-backend com processamento de dados assíncrono","Registro de novos manipuladores no registro do NodeHandler"],"ru":["Реализация пользовательских обработчиков сообщений для NodeBridge","Улучшение связи между UI и бэкендом с асинхронной обработкой данных","Регистрация новых обработчиков в реестре NodeHandler"],"ar":["تنفيذ معالجات رسائل مخصصة لعميل NodeBridge","تحسين الاتصال بين واجهة المستخدم وخلفية البرنامج مع معالجة البيانات غير المتزامنة","تسجيل معالجات جديدة في سجل NodeHandler"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the NodeBridge system","Node.js and TypeScript environments only","Modification of the NodeHandlerRegistry class necessary"],"zh":["需要访问NodeBridge系统","仅限Node.js和TypeScript环境","需要修改NodeHandlerRegistry类"],"ja":["NodeBridgeシステムへのアクセスが必要","Node.jsとTypeScriptの環境のみ","NodeHandlerRegistryクラスの変更が必要"],"ko":["NodeBridge 시스템에 액세스할 수 있어야 함","Node.js 및 TypeScript 환경만","NodeHandlerRegistry 클래스 수정 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema NodeBridge","Solo entornos Node.js y TypeScript","Modificación de la clase NodeHandlerRegistry necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système NodeBridge","Environnements Node.js et TypeScript uniquement","Modification de la classe NodeHandlerRegistry nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das NodeBridge-System","Nur Node.js- und TypeScript-Umgebungen","Änderung der NodeHandlerRegistry-Klasse erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema NodeBridge","Ambientes Node.js e TypeScript apenas","Modificação da classe do registro do NodeHandler necessária"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к системе NodeBridge","Только среды Node.js и TypeScript","Необходимо изменение класса реестра NodeHandler"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام NodeBridge","بيئات Node.js و TypeScript فقط","التعديل على فصل تسجيل NodeHandler ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
