CSP und HSTS"],"pt":["Validação de servidor","Consultas parametrizadas","Autenticação baseada em política","Armazenamento de segredos com Key Vault","Configuração de cabeçalhos de segurança"],"ru":["Валидация на стороне сервера","Параметризованные запросы","Аутентификация на основе политики","Хранение секретов с помощью Key Vault","Настройка заголовков безопасности"],"ar":["التحقق من стор الخادم","استفسارات معلمات","التحقق من سياسة","تخزين الأسرار مع Key Vault","تكوين رؤوس الأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 安全开发","OWASP Top 10","服务器端验证","参数化查询","基于策略的认证","密钥保管库"],"ja":["AI セキュリティ開発","OWASP Top 10","サーバーサイド検証","パラメータ化されたクエリ","ポリシーベースの認証","キーボールト"],"ko":["AI 보안 개발","OWASP Top 10","서버 측 검증","매개 변수화 된 쿼리","정책 기반 인증","키 볼트"],"es":["seguridad de código","OWASP Top 10","mejores prácticas de seguridad","desarrollo seguro","protección de aplicaciones","validación del lado del servidor"],"fr":["sécurité du code","OWASP Top 10","meilleures pratiques de sécurité","développement sécurisé","protection des applications","validation côté serveur"],"de":["Code-Sicherheit","OWASP-Top-10","Sicherheitsbest-Practices","sichere Entwicklung","Anwendungsprotektion","Serverseitige Validierung"],"pt":["segurança de desenvolvimento","OWASP Top 10","melhores práticas de segurança","desenvolvimento de software seguro","proteção de aplicativos","segurança de dados"],"ru":["безопасность разработки","OWASP Top 10","лучшие практики безопасности","разработка программного обеспечения с учетом безопасности","защита приложений","безопасность данных"],"ar":["أمان التطوير","تحليل أمان تطبيق الويب","أفضل الممارسات لأمان","تطوير البرمجيات الآمن","حماية التطبيقات","أمان البيانات"]}},"owner":"TheBeardedBearSAS","repo":"claude-craft","repoPath":"TheBeardedBearSAS/claude-craft","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security","description":"Sécurité. Use when reviewing security, implementing auth, or hardening code.","bodyPreview":"# Sécurité\n\nThis skill provides security guidelines and OWASP Top 10 best practices.\n\nSee @REFERENCE.md for detailed documentation.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **Validation**: Always server-side, never trust client\n- **Queries**: Parameterized only (no SQL concatenation)\n- **Auth**: Policy-based `[Authorize(Policy = \"...\")]`\n- **Secrets**: Key Vault in prod, user-secrets in dev\n- **Headers**: CSP, X-Frame-Options, HSTS, nosniff","body":"# Sécurité\n\nThis skill provides security guidelines and OWASP Top 10 best practices.\n\nSee @REFERENCE.md for detailed documentation.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **Validation**: Always server-side, never trust client\n- **Queries**: Parameterized only (no SQL concatenation)\n- **Auth**: Policy-based `[Authorize(Policy = \"...\")]`\n- **Secrets**: Key Vault in prod, user-secrets in dev\n- **Headers**: CSP, X-Frame-Options, HSTS, nosniff\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:41:06.493Z","qualityScore":0}');
