rns"},"description":{"zh":"React 模式提供了优化 React 应用性能的最佳实践，包括使用 idiomatic React、尊重组件生命周期和使用钩子","ja":"React パターンは、React アプリのパフォーマンスを最適化するためのベスト プラクティスを提供します。Idiomatic React、コンポーネント ライフサイクルの尊重、フックの使用などが含まれます","ko":"React 패턴은 리액트 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는ための 베스트 프랙티스를 제공합니다. 아이디오틱 리액트, 컴포넌트 라이프사이클의尊重, 훅의 사용 등이 포함됩니다","es":"Los patrones de React son principios generales para desarrollar aplicaciones con React, Next.js y otros frameworks.","fr":"Les modèles React sont des principes généraux pour développer des applications avec React, Next.js et d''autres frameworks.","de":"Die React-Muster sind allgemeine Prinzipien für die Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React, Next.js und anderen Frameworks.","pt":"Desenvolva aplicações React escaláveis e manuteníveis com os padrões certos. Aprenda a escrever código idiômático React","ru":"Разрабатывайте масштабируемые и поддерживаемые приложения React с правильными шаблонами. Узнайте, как писать идиоматический код React","ar":"طور تطبيقات رياكت قابلة للتوسع والصيانة以 الأنماط الصحيحة. تعلم كيفية كتابة رمز رياكت المتماثل","en":"Saleor Storefront built using React, Next.js with App Router, TypeScript, GraphQL, and Tailwind CSS."},"definition":{"en":"Saleor Storefront built using React, Next.js with App Router, TypeScript, GraphQL, and Tailwind CSS."},"features":{"zh":["使用 idiomatic React","尊重组件生命周期","正确使用钩子","优化渲染性能","使用 TypeScript 和 GraphQL"],"ja":["Idiomatic React の使用","コンポーネント ライフサイクルの尊重","フックの正しい使用","レンダリング パフォーマンスの最適化","TypeScript と GraphQL の使用"],"ko":["아이디오틱 리액트의 사용","컴포넌트 라이프사이클의尊重","훅의 올바른 사용","렌더링 성능의 최적화","타입스크립트와 그래프QL의 사용"],"es":["React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","Desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","Développement d''applications"],"de":["React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Escrita de código idiômático React","Uso de hooks corretos","Respeito ao ciclo de vida do componente","Manutenção de renders puros","Integração com Next.js e App Router"],"ru":["Написание идиоматического кода React","Использование правильных хуков","Уважение к циклу жизни компонента","Сохранение чистых рендеров","Интеграция с Next.js и App Router"],"ar":["كتابة رمز رياكت المتماثل","استخدام Hooks الصحيح","احترام دورة حياة المكون","الحفاظ على العروض النقية","التكامل مع نكست.جس وآب روتر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 优化","React 性能","idiomatic React","React 钩子","TypeScript","GraphQL","React 最佳实践"],"ja":["React 最適化","React パフォーマンス","Idiomatic React","React フック","TypeScript","GraphQL","React ベスト プラクティス"],"ko":["리액트 최적화","리액트 성능","아이디오틱 리액트","리액트 훅","타입스크립트","그래프QL","리액트 베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["patrones de React","desarrollo de aplicaciones con React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","programación con React"],"fr":["modèles React","développement d''applications avec React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","programmation avec React"],"de":["React-Muster","Anwendungsentwicklung mit React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","Programmierung mit React"],"pt":["React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento de aplicações React","Padrões React","Melhores práticas React"],"ru":["React","Next.js","TypeScript","GraphQL","Tailwind CSS","Разработка приложений React","Шаблоны React","Лучшие практики React"],"ar":["رياكت","نكست.جس","تايبسكريبت","جرفكول","تايلويند سي أس","تطوير تطبيقات رياكت","نماذج رياكت","أفضل الممارسات رياكت"]}},"owner":"saleor","repo":"storefront","repoPath":"saleor/storefront","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-patterns","description":"Write idiomatic React with proper hooks and render purity. Use when writing components, fixing hook-related lint errors, or deciding where to put logic (render vs effect vs handler).","bodyPreview":"# React Patterns\n\n> **Source**: [React Documentation](https://react.dev/learn) — Official React mental model\n>\n> **Philosophy**: Generic principles, informed by anti-patterns we''ve seen in this codebase. Timeless rules, not line-number references.\n\n## The Golden Rule\n\n**Write idiomatic React.** Respect the component lifecycle (mount → update → unmount), keep renders pure, and use hooks correctly (`useEffect`, `useCallback`, `useRef`, `useMemo`).\n\nReact will call your component multiple times, in","body":"# React Patterns\n\n> **Source**: [React Documentation](https://react.dev/learn) — Official React mental model\n>\n> **Philosophy**: Generic principles, informed by anti-patterns we''ve seen in this codebase. Timeless rules, not line-number references.\n\n## The Golden Rule\n\n**Write idiomatic React.** Respect the component lifecycle (mount → update → unmount), keep renders pure, and use hooks correctly (`useEffect`, `useCallback`, `useRef`, `useMemo`).\n\nReact will call your component multiple times, in any order, at any time. Code that works \"by accident\" will break unpredictably.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing or reviewing React components\n- Fixing lint errors related to hooks or purity\n- Deciding where to put logic (render vs effect vs handler)\n\n## Key Principles\n\n### 1. Renders Must Be Pure\n\nNo side effects during render. Same props + state = same output.\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ Impure - different result each render\nconst now = Date.now();\n\n// ✅ Pure - computed once on mount\nconst [now] = useState(() => Date.now());\n```\n\n### 2. Effects Are for External Sync\n\nEffects connect React to external systems (APIs, DOM, subscriptions). Not for derived state.\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ Wrong - derived state in effect\nuseEffect(() => {\n\tsetFullName(first + \" \" + last);\n}, [first, last]);\n\n// ✅ Right - compute during render\nconst fullName = first + \" \" + last;\n```\n\n### 3. Respect the Lifecycle\n\n- **Mount**: Component appears, effects run\n- **Update**: Props/state change, component re-renders\n- **Unmount**: Component disappears, cleanup runs\n\nAlways return cleanup functions from effects that subscribe to things.\n\n### 4. Use the Right Hook\n\n| Hook          | Purpose                                       |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `useState`    | State that triggers re-renders                |\n| `useEffect`   | Sync with external systems                    |\n| `useRef`      | Mutable value that persists without re-render |\n| `useMemo`     | Cache expensive computation                   |\n| `useCallback` | Stable function reference for child props     |\n\n## Anti-patterns\n\n❌ **Don''t fight React** - If it feels hacky, you''re probably doing it wrong  \n❌ **Don''t ignore the linter** - It knows React''s rules better than you  \n❌ **Don''t put everything in effects** - Most logic belongs in render or handlers  \n❌ **Don''t forget cleanup** - Subscriptions, timers, event listeners need cleanup\n\n### State Sync Anti-patterns\n\nThese are common mistakes that technically work but violate React''s mental model:\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ State-to-state sync in effect\nuseEffect(() => {\n\tsetDerivedValue(computeFrom(sourceValue));\n}, [sourceValue]);\n\n// ✅ Compute inline or in the handler that changes source\nconst derivedValue = computeFrom(sourceValue);\n// OR: in the handler\nconst handleSourceChange = (newValue) => {\n\tsetSourceValue(newValue);\n\tsetDerivedValue(computeFrom(newValue));\n};\n```\n\n```tsx\n// ❌ Child updating parent state via effect\nuseEffect(() => {\n\tonLayoutChange(true); // parent setState\n}, []);\n\n// ✅ Parent derives state from what it knows\n// OR: callback on user action, not on mount\n```\n\n**Why this matters:** Effects run after render. State-to-state effects cause extra renders and make data flow hard to trace. Prefer computing values inline or updating in event handlers.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:41:04.353Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing mastery of idiomatic React patterns and best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要掌握习惯用React模式和最佳实践的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがReactの慣用パターンとベストプラクティスをマスターする必要がある場合に最適","ko":"React의 관용적인 패턴과 최고의 실践을 마스터해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan dominar patrones y prácticas recomendadas idiomáticos de React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de maîtriser les modèles et les meilleures pratiques idiomatiques de React.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die die Beherrschung idiomatischer React-Muster und Best Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam dominar padrões idiomáticos do React e boas práticas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо освоить идиоматические шаблоны React и лучшие практики.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إتقان الأنماط المتمثلة في React وأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write efficient React code using hooks like useEffect, useCallback, useRef, and useMemo, while respecting the component lifecycle and keeping renders pure with Next.js and TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理编写使用useEffect、useCallback、useRef和useMemo等钩子高效的React代码的能力，同时尊重组件生命周期并使用Next.js和TypeScript保持渲染的纯净","ja":"useEffect、useCallback、useRef、useMemoなどのフックを使用して効率的なReactコードを書くエージェントをEmpowerし、コンポーネントのライフサイクルを尊重し、Next.jsとTypeScriptを使用してレンダリングを純粋に保つ","ko":"useEffect, useCallback, useRef 및 useMemo 등의 훅을 사용하여 효율적인 React 코드를 작성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고, 컴포넌트 수명 주기와 Next.js 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 렌더링을 순수하게 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir código React eficiente utilizando ganchos como useEffect, useCallback, useRef y useMemo, respetando el ciclo de vida del componente y manteniendo renders puros con Next.js y TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire un code React efficace en utilisant des crochets comme useEffect, useCallback, useRef et useMemo, tout en respectant le cycle de vie du composant et en conservant des rendus purs avec Next.js et TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, effizienten React-Code mit Haken wie useEffect, useCallback, useRef und useMemo zu schreiben, während sie den Lebenszyklus des Komponenten respektieren und mit Next.js und TypeScript reine Rendern beibehalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código React eficiente usando ganchos como useEffect, useCallback, useRef e useMemo, respeitando o ciclo de vida do componente e mantendo renders puros com Next.js e TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать эффективный код React, используя хуки, такие как useEffect, useCallback, useRef и useMemo, при этом уважая жизненный цикл компонента и сохраняя чистоту рендеринга с Next.js и TypeScript.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من كتابة رمز React فعال باستخدام أجزاء مثل useEffect و useCallback و useRef و useMemo ، مع احترام دورة حياة المكون والحفاظ على تصييرات نقية مع Next.js و TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing optimized React component lifecycles","Debugging rendering issues with pure functions and hooks","Building scalable Saleor Storefronts with GraphQL and Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["实现优化的React组件生命周期","使用纯函数和钩子调试渲染问题","使用GraphQL和Tailwind CSS构建可扩展的Saleor Storefronts"],"ja":["最適化されたReactコンポーネントライフサイクルの実装","純関数とフックを使用したレンダリングの問題のデバッグ","GraphQLとTailwind CSSを使用した拡張可能なSaleor Storefrontsの構築"],"ko":["최적화된 React 컴포넌트 수명 주기의 구현","순수 함수 및 훅을 사용한 렌더링 문제의 디버깅","GraphQL 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용한 확장 가능한 Saleor Storefronts의 구축"],"es":["Implementar ciclos de vida de componentes React optimizados","Depurar problemas de renderizado con funciones puras y ganchos","Crear tiendas Saleor escalables con GraphQL y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des cycles de vie de composants React optimisés","Déboguer les problèmes de rendu avec des fonctions pures et des crochets","Construire des storefronts Saleor évolutifs avec GraphQL et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Optimierte React-Componenten-Lebenszyklen implementieren","Rendernprobleme mit reinen Funktionen und Haken debuggen","Skalierbare Saleor-Storefronts mit GraphQL und Tailwind CSS erstellen"],"pt":["Implementação de ciclos de vida de componentes React otimizados","Depuração de problemas de renderização com funções puras e ganchos","Construção de lojas Saleor escaláveis com GraphQL e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Реализация оптимизированных циклов жизни компонентов React","Отладка проблем с рендерингом с помощью чистых функций и хуков","Создание масштабируемых магазинов Saleor с помощью GraphQL и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["تنفيذ دورات حياة مكونات React محسنة","تصحيح أخطاء في التصيير باستخدام الدوال النقية والأجزاء","بناء متاجر Saleor قابلة للتحجيم باستخدام GraphQL و Tailwind CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and Next.js expertise","Limited to applications using TypeScript and GraphQL"],"zh":["需要React和Next.js的专业知识","仅限于使用TypeScript和GraphQL的应用程序"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsの専門知識が必要","TypeScriptとGraphQLを使用するアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js의 전문 지식이 필요","TypeScript 및 GraphQL을 사용하는 응용 프로그램에 제한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan TypeScript y GraphQL"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en React et Next.js","Limité aux applications qui utilisent TypeScript et GraphQL"],"de":["Benötigt Erfahrung mit React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die TypeScript und GraphQL verwenden"],"pt":["Exige especialização em React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações que usam TypeScript e GraphQL"],"ru":["Требует знаний React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений, использующих TypeScript и GraphQL"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم TypeScript و GraphQL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
