:"Nuestro boilerplate de TypeScript para Claude Code ofrece una forma sencilla de implementar pruebas de integración y E2E para verificar la interacción de com...","fr":"Notre boilerplate TypeScript pour Claude Code offre une façon simple de mettre en œuvre des tests d''intégration et E2E pour vérifier l''interaction des compos...","de":"Unser TypeScript-Boilerplate für Claude Code bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, Integrationstests und E2E-Tests zu implementieren, um die Interaktion von Komp...","pt":"O boilerplate TypeScript da Claude Code fornece uma estrutura para testes de integração e E2E, garantindo a qualidade do seu código","ru":"Boilerplate TypeScript от Claude Code предоставляет основу для интеграционных и E2E-тестов, обеспечивающую качество вашего кода","ar":"قالب TypeScript من Claude Code يوفر هيكلاً لاختبارات التكامل و E2E، مما يضمن جودة كودك","en":"Production-ready TypeScript boilerplate for Claude Code with specialized AI agents"},"definition":{"en":"Production-ready TypeScript boilerplate for Claude Code with specialized AI agents"},"features":{"es":["Boilerplate de TypeScript para Claude Code","Pruebas de integración para verificar la interacción de componentes","Pruebas E2E para verificar flujos de usuario críticos","Reglas de diseño e implementación de pruebas","Límites de pruebas por característica"],"fr":["Boilerplate TypeScript pour Claude Code","Tests d''intégration pour vérifier l''interaction des composants","Tests E2E pour vérifier les flux d''utilisateurs critiques","Règles de conception et de mise en œuvre des tests","Limites de tests par fonctionnalité"],"de":["TypeScript-Boilerplate für Claude Code","Integrationstests zur Überprüfung der Interaktion von Komponenten","E2E-Tests zur Überprüfung kritischer Benutzerflüsse","Regeln für das Design und die Implementierung von Tests","Testlimits pro Funktion"],"pt":["Testes de integração para verificação de interação entre componentes","Testes E2E para verificação de jornadas de usuário críticas","Boilerplate TypeScript para Claude Code","Regras de design e implementação de testes","Limites de testes por recurso","Princípio de comportamento em primeiro lugar"],"ru":["Интеграционные тесты для проверки взаимодействия между компонентами","E2E-тесты для проверки критических пользовательских путей","Boilerplate TypeScript для Claude Code","Правила设计 и реализации тестов","Ограничения тестов на функцию","Принцип поведения прежде всего"],"ar":["اختبارات التكامل للتحقق من التفاعل بين المكونات","اختبارات E2E للتحقق من المسارات المستخدمة الحرجة","قالب TypeScript ل Claude Code","قواعد تصميم وتنفيذ الاختبارات","حدود الاختبارات لكل ميزة","مبدأ السلوك أولاً"]},"keywords":{"es":["pruebas de integración","pruebas E2E","TypeScript","Claude Code","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","boilerplate","diseño de pruebas","implementación de pruebas"],"fr":["tests d''intégration","tests E2E","TypeScript","Claude Code","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","boilerplate","conception de tests","mise en œuvre de tests"],"de":["Integrationstests","E2E-Tests","TypeScript","Claude Code","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests","Boilerplate","Testdesign","Testimplementierung"],"pt":["testes de integração","testes E2E","boilerplate TypeScript","Claude Code","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","testes automatizados","princípio de comportamento em primeiro lugar"],"ru":["интеграционные тесты","E2E-тесты","boilerplate TypeScript","Claude Code","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","автоматизированное тестирование","принцип поведения прежде всего"],"ar":["اختبارات التكامل","اختبارات E2E","قالب TypeScript","Claude Code","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","اختبارات آلية","مبدأ السلوك أولاً"]}},"owner":"shinpr","repo":"ai-coding-project-boilerplate","repoPath":"shinpr/ai-coding-project-boilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"integration-e2e-testing","description":"Designs integration and E2E tests with mock boundaries and behavior verification rules. Use when writing E2E or integration tests.","bodyPreview":"# Integration Test & E2E Test Design/Implementation Rules\n\n## Test Types and Limits\n\n| Type | Purpose | File Format | Limit |\n|------|---------|-------------|-------|\n| Integration Test | Component interaction verification | `*.int.test.ts` | 3 per feature |\n| E2E Test | Critical user journey verification | `*.e2e.test.ts` | 1-2 per feature |\n\n**Critical User Journey**: Features with revenue impact, legal requirements, or daily use by majority of users\n\n## Behavior-First Principle\n\n### Observabi","body":"# Integration Test & E2E Test Design/Implementation Rules\n\n## Test Types and Limits\n\n| Type | Purpose | File Format | Limit |\n|------|---------|-------------|-------|\n| Integration Test | Component interaction verification | `*.int.test.ts` | 3 per feature |\n| E2E Test | Critical user journey verification | `*.e2e.test.ts` | 1-2 per feature |\n\n**Critical User Journey**: Features with revenue impact, legal requirements, or daily use by majority of users\n\n## Behavior-First Principle\n\n### Observability Check (All YES = Include)\n\n| Check | Question | If NO |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| Observable | Can user observe the result? | Exclude |\n| System Context | Does it require integration of multiple components? | Exclude |\n| Automatable | Can it run stably in CI environment? | Exclude |\n\n### Include/Exclude Criteria\n\n**Include**: Business logic accuracy, data integrity, user-visible features, error handling\n**Exclude**: External live connections, performance metrics, implementation details, UI layout\n\n## Skeleton Specification\n\n### Required Comment Format\n\n```typescript\n// AC: \"[Acceptance criteria original text]\"\n// ROI: [0-100] | Business Value: [0-10] | Frequency: [0-10]\n// Behavior: [Trigger] -> [Process] -> [Observable Result]\n// @category: core-functionality | integration | edge-case | ux | e2e\n// @dependency: none | [component name] | full-system\n// @complexity: low | medium | high\nit.todo(''[AC number]: [Test name]'')\n```\n\n### Property Annotations\n\n```typescript\n// Property: `[Verification expression]`\n// fast-check: fc.property(fc.[arbitrary], (input) => [invariant])\nit.todo(''[AC number]-property: [Invariant description]'')\n```\n\n### ROI Calculation\n\n```\nROI = (Business Value x Frequency + Legal Requirement x 10 + Defect Detection) / Total Cost\n```\n\n| Type | Total Cost | E2E Generation Condition |\n|------|------------|-------------------------|\n| Integration | 11 | - |\n| E2E | 38 | ROI > 50 |\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n### Property-Based Test Implementation\n\nWhen Property annotation exists, fast-check library is required:\n\n```typescript\nimport fc from ''fast-check''\n\nit(''AC2-property: Model name is always gemini-3-pro-image-preview'', () => {\n  fc.assert(\n    fc.property(fc.string(), (prompt) => {\n      const result = client.generate(prompt)\n      return result.model === ''gemini-3-pro-image-preview''\n    })\n  )\n})\n```\n\n**Requirements**:\n- Write in `fc.assert(fc.property(...))` format\n- Reflect skeleton''s `// fast-check:` comment directly in implementation\n- When failure case discovered, add as concrete unit test (regression prevention)\n\n### Behavior Verification Implementation\n\n**Behavior Description Verification Levels**:\n\n| Step Type | Verification Target | Example |\n|-----------|--------------------| --------|\n| Trigger | Reproduce in Arrange | API failure -> mockResolvedValue({ ok: false }) |\n| Process | Intermediate state or call | Function call, state change |\n| Observable Result | Final output value | Return value, error message, log output |\n\n**Pass Criteria**: Pass if \"observable result\" is verified as **return value or mock call argument** of test target\n\n### Verification Item Determination Rules\n\n| Skeleton State | Verification Item Determination Method |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------|\n| `// Verification items:` listed | Implement all listed items with expect |\n| No `// Verification items:` | Derive from \"observable result\" in \"Behavior\" description |\n| Both present | Prioritize verification items, use behavior as supplement |\n\n### Integration Test Mock Boundaries\n\n| Judgment Criteria | Mock | Actual |\n|-------------------|------|--------|\n| Part of test target? | No -> Can mock | Yes -> Actual required |\n| Is call verification target of test? | No -> Can mock | Yes -> Actual or verifiable mock |\n| External network communication? | Yes -> Mock required | No -> Actual recommended |\n\n**Judgment Flow**:\n1. External API (HTTP communication) -> Mock required\n2. Component interaction under test -> Actual required\n3. Log output verification needed -> Use verifiable mock (vi.fn())\n4. Log output verification not needed -> Actual or ignore\n\n### E2E Test Execution Conditions\n\n- Execute only after all components are implemented\n- Do not use mocks (`@dependency: full-system`)\n\n## Review Criteria\n\n### Skeleton and Implementation Consistency\n\n| Check | Failure Condition |\n|-------|-------------------|\n| Property Verification | Property annotation exists but fast-check not used |\n| Behavior Verification | No expect for \"observable result\" |\n| Verification Item Coverage | Listed verification items not included in expect |\n| Mock Boundary | Internal components mocked in integration test |\n\n### Implementation Quality\n\n| Check | Failure Condition |\n|-------|-------------------|\n| AAA Structure | Arrange/Act/Assert separation unclear |\n| Independence | State sharing between tests, execution order dependency |\n| Reproducibility | Depends on date/random, results vary |\n| Readability | Test name and verification content don''t match |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:41:43.062Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing robust integration and end-to-end testing for TypeScript applications.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的集成和端到端测试的 TypeScript 应用程序的 AI 代理，如 Claude Code。","ja":"Claude CodeのようなTypeScriptアプリケーションにロバストな統合とエンドツーエンドのテストが必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code와 같은 TypeScript 애플리케이션에 대한 강력한 통합 및 종단 간 테스트가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code que necesitan una integración robusta y pruebas de extremo a extremo para aplicaciones de TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code nécessitant une intégration robuste et des tests de bout en bout pour les applications TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine robuste Integration und End-to-End-Tests für TypeScript-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA, como Claude Code, que necessitam de integração robusta e testes de ponta a ponta para aplicações TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих надежной интеграции и тестирования от начала до конца для приложений TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى دمج قوي واختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية للتطبيقات TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify component interactions and critical user journeys using specialized test types, including integration tests with *.int.test.ts files and end-to-end tests with *.e2e.test.ts files, ensuring production-ready code quality.","zh":"赋予代理人使用专用测试类型验证组件交互和关键用户旅程的能力，包括使用*.int.test.ts文件的集成测试和使用*.e2e.test.ts文件的端到端测试，确保生产就绪的代码质量。","ja":"エージェントが、*.int.test.tsファイルを使用した統合テストや*.e2e.test.tsファイルを使用したエンドツーエンドテストなどの専用のテストタイプを使用して、コンポーネントの相互作用や重要なユーザージャーニーを検証する能力を提供し、生产就绪のコード品質を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 *.int.test.ts 파일을 사용하는 통합 테스트 및 *.e2e.test.ts 파일을 사용하는 종단 간 테스트와 같은 전문 테스트 유형을 사용하여 컴포�ント 상호 작용 및 중요한 사용자 여정과 같은 사항을 확인할 수 있도록 하여 생산 준비 코드 품질을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar las interacciones de los componentes y los recorridos críticos del usuario utilizando tipos de pruebas especializados, incluyendo pruebas de integración con archivos *.int.test.ts y pruebas de extremo a extremo con archivos *.e2e.test.ts, garantizando una calidad de código lista para producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier les interactions de composants et les parcours critiques de l''utilisateur en utilisant des types de tests spécialisés, notamment des tests d''intégration avec des fichiers *.int.test.ts et des tests de bout en bout avec des fichiers *.e2e.test.ts, assurant une qualité de code prête pour la production.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Interaktionen von Komponenten und kritischen Benutzerreisen zu überprüfen, indem sie spezialisierte Testtypen verwenden, einschließlich Integrationstests mit *.int.test.ts-Dateien und End-to-End-Tests mit *.e2e.test.ts-Dateien, um eine produktionsbereite Codequalität sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar interações de componentes e jornadas de usuário críticas usando tipos de testes especializados, incluindo testes de integração com arquivos *.int.test.ts e testes de ponta a ponta com arquivos *.e2e.test.ts, garantindo qualidade de código pronta para produção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять взаимодействие компонентов и критические пользовательские пути с помощью специализированных типов тестов, включая тесты интеграции с файлами *.int.test.ts и тесты от начала до конца с файлами *.e2e.test.ts, обеспечивая качество кода, готовое к производству.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق من تفاعلات المكونات والمسارات الحيوية للمستخدم باستخدام أنواع اختبارات متخصصة، بما في ذلك اختبارات التكامل مع الملفات *.int.test.ts واختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية مع الملفات *.e2e.test.ts، مما يضمن جودة代码 جاهزة للإنتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating integration tests for component verification","Validating critical user journeys for revenue-impacting features","Debugging issues with behavior-first principle and observability"],"zh":["自动化组件验证的集成测试","验证收入影响功能的关键用户旅程","使用行为优先原则和可观察性进行调试"],"ja":["コンポーネントの検証のための統合テストの自動化","収益に影響を与える機能の重要なユーザージャーニーの検証","動作優先原則と可観測性を使用したデバッグ"],"ko":["컴포넌트 확인을 위한 통합 테스트의 자동화","수익에 영향을 미치는 기능의 중요한 사용자 여정의 확인","동작 우선 원칙 및 관측 가능성을 사용한 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de integración para la verificación de componentes","Validar recorridos críticos del usuario para características que impactan los ingresos","Depurar problemas con el principio de comportamiento y la observabilidad"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''intégration pour la vérification de composants","Valider les parcours critiques de l''utilisateur pour les fonctionnalités à impact sur les revenus","Déboguer les problèmes avec le principe de comportement et l''observabilité"],"de":["Automatisieren von Integrationstests für die Überprüfung von Komponenten","Validieren kritischer Benutzerreisen für Umsatz-impaktierende Funktionen","Fehlerbehebung mit dem Verhaltensprinzip und der Beobachtbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de integração para verificação de componentes","Validar jornadas de usuário críticas para recursos que impactam a receita","Depurar problemas com princípio de comportamento e observabilidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты интеграции для верификации компонентов","Проверять критические пользовательские пути для функций, влияющих на доход","Отлаживать проблемы с принципом поведения и наблюдаемостью"],"ar":["تأتميم اختبارات التكامل للتحقق من المكونات","التحقق من مسارات المستخدم الحيوية للميزات التي تؤثر على الإيرادات","تصحيح الأخطاء في المبدأ السلوكي والمراقبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to 3 integration tests per feature","Restricted to 1-2 end-to-end tests per feature","Requires TypeScript and Claude Code compatibility"],"zh":["每个功能最多3个集成测试","每个功能最多1-2个端到端测试","需要TypeScript和Claude Code的兼容性"],"ja":["機能ごとに統合テストは3つまで","機能ごとにエンドツーエンドテストは1〜2つまで","TypeScriptとClaude Codeの互換性が必要"],"ko":["기능당 통합 테스트 3개 제한","기능당 종단 간 테스트 1-2개 제한","TypeScript 및 Claude Code 호환성 필요"],"es":["Limitado a 3 pruebas de integración por característica","Restringido a 1-2 pruebas de extremo a extremo por característica","Requiere compatibilidad con TypeScript y Claude Code"],"fr":["Limité à 3 tests d''intégration par fonctionnalité","Restreint à 1-2 tests de bout en bout par fonctionnalité","Nécessite la compatibilité avec TypeScript et Claude Code"],"de":["Begrenzt auf 3 Integrationstests pro Funktion","Eingeschränkt auf 1-2 End-to-End-Tests pro Funktion","Benötigt Kompatibilität mit TypeScript und Claude Code"],"pt":["Limitado a 3 testes de integração por recurso","Restrito a 1-2 testes de ponta a ponta por recurso","Requer compatibilidade com TypeScript e Claude Code"],"ru":["Ограничен до 3 тестов интеграции на функцию","Ограничен до 1-2 тестов от начала до конца на функцию","Требует совместимости с TypeScript и Claude Code"],"ar":["محدود ب 3 اختبارات تكامل لكل ميزة","محدود ب 1-2 اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية لكل ميزة","يتطلب توافقًا مع TypeScript و Claude Code"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
