сервиса LocalStack","ar":"مرجع مستويات الخدمة المحلية","en":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference"},"description":{"zh":"LocalStack 服务等级参考提供了 KECS 开发的关键见解，包括 ECS 不可用于免费版","ja":"LocalStack サービスティアーリファレンスは、KECS 開発のための重要な情報を提供し、ECS が無料版では利用できないことを含む","ko":"LocalStack 서비스 티어 레퍼런스는 KECS 개발을 위한 주요 정보를 제공하며, ECS가 무료 버전에서 사용할 수 없음을 포함합니다","es":"LocalStack ofrece diferentes niveles de servicio para desarrolladores, incluyendo el nivel gratuito y el nivel Base","fr":"LocalStack propose différents niveaux de service pour les développeurs, notamment le niveau gratuit et le niveau Base","de":"LocalStack bietet verschiedene Service-Ebenen für Entwickler an, einschließlich des kostenlosen Tarifs und des Base-Tarifs","pt":"O KECS é um serviço autônomo que fornece APIs compatíveis com Amazon ECS em execução no Kubernetes, utilizando o LocalStack para serviços compatíveis com a AWS.","ru":"KECS - это автономный сервис, предоставляющий API, совместимые с Amazon ECS, работающие на Kubernetes, использующий LocalStack для сервисов, совместимых с AWS.","ar":"KECS هو خدمة مستقلة توفر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Amazon ECS تعمل على Kubernetes، وتستخدم LocalStack لخدمات متوافقة مع AWS.","en":"KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service) is a standalone service that provides Amazon ECS compatible APIs running on Kubernetes."},"definition":{"en":"KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service) is a standalone service that provides Amazon ECS compatible APIs running on Kubernetes."},"features":{"zh":["KECS 为 Kubernetes 提供免费的 ECS 兼容环境","ECS 不可用于 LocalStack 免费版","Base 版本（$39/月）提供 ECS 兼容服务","LocalStack 服务等级参考提供了 KECS 开发的关键见解","支持多种服务，包括 ECS 和 Kubernetes"],"ja":["KECS は Kubernetes に無料の ECS 互換環境を提供する","ECS は LocalStack 無料版では利用できない","Base 版（$39/月）では ECS 互換サービスが提供される","LocalStack サービスティアーリファレンスは、KECS 開発のための重要な情報を提供する","複数のサービスをサポートしている、ECS や Kubernetes など"],"ko":["KECS는 Kubernetes에 무료 ECS 호환 환경을 제공합니다","ECS는 LocalStack 무료 버전에서 사용할 수 없습니다","Base 버전($39/월)에서 ECS 호환 서비스를 제공합니다","LocalStack 서비스 티어 레퍼런스는 KECS 개발을 위한 주요 정보를 제공합니다","여러 서비스를 지원합니다, ECS 및 Kubernetes 등"],"es":["Niveles de servicio de LocalStack","Disponibilidad de servicios en diferentes planes de precios","KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","Integración con Amazon ECS","Entorno local para desarrollo y pruebas"],"fr":["Niveaux de service LocalStack","Disponibilité des services dans les différents plans de tarification","KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","Intégration avec Amazon ECS","Environnement local pour le développement et les tests"],"de":["Service-Ebenen von LocalStack","Verfügbarkeit von Services in verschiedenen Preismodellen","KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service)","Integration mit Amazon ECS","Lokale Umgebung für Entwicklung und Tests"],"pt":["KECS fornece um ambiente ECS compatível local gratuito","LocalStack oferece serviços compatíveis com a AWS em execução localmente","Disponibilidade dos serviços LocalStack em diferentes níveis de preços","Integração com o Kubernetes","Compatibilidade com a API do Amazon ECS"],"ru":["KECS предоставляет бесплатную локальную среду, совместимую с ECS","LocalStack предлагает сервисы, совместимые с AWS, работающие локально","Доступность сервисов LocalStack на разных уровнях цен","Интеграция с Kubernetes","Совместимость с API Amazon ECS"],"ar":["KECS يقدم بيئة ECS متوافقة محلية مجانية","LocalStack تقدم خدمات متوافقة مع AWS تعمل محليًا","إتاحة خدمات LocalStack عبر مستويات الأسعار المختلفة","التكامل مع Kubernetes","التوافق مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Amazon ECS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LocalStack","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","服务等级参考","云计算","开发者工具","容器化"],"ja":["LocalStack","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","サービスティアーリファレンス","クラウドコンピューティング","開発者ツール","コンテナ化"],"ko":["LocalStack","KECS","ECS","Kubernetes","서비스 티어 레퍼런스","클라우드 컴퓨팅","개발자 도구","컨테이너화"],"es":["LocalStack","Niveles de servicio","Desarrollo de software","Entorno local","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","Servicios en la nube","Desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["LocalStack","Niveaux de service","Développement de logiciels","Environnement local","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","Services cloud","Développement d''applications"],"de":["LocalStack","Service-Ebenen","Software-Entwicklung","Lokale Umgebung","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","Cloud-Services","Anwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["LocalStack","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","Serviços compatíveis com a AWS","Ambiente local gratuito","Níveis de preços","Integração com o Kubernetes"],"ru":["LocalStack","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","Сервисы, совместимые с AWS","Бесплатная локальная среда","Уровни цен","Интеграция с Kubernetes"],"ar":["LocalStack","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","خدمات متوافقة مع AWS","بيئة محلية مجانية","مستويات الأسعار","التكامل مع Kubernetes"]}},"owner":"nandemo-ya","repo":"kecs","repoPath":"nandemo-ya/kecs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","description":"Reference for LocalStack AWS service availability by tier (Free/Base/Ultimate). Essential for KECS development to understand which AWS-compatible services can be used locally without cost.","bodyPreview":"# LocalStack Service Tiers Reference\n\nThis skill provides knowledge about LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers.\nKECS uses LocalStack for AWS-compatible services, relying on free tier services for ECS integrations.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Key Insight for KECS Development\n\n**ECS is NOT available in LocalStack Free tier** - it requires Base tier ($39/mo).\nThis is one of the primary reasons KECS exists: to provide a free, local ECS-compatible environment.\n\n### Pricing Tiers\n\n| Tier","body":"# LocalStack Service Tiers Reference\n\nThis skill provides knowledge about LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers.\nKECS uses LocalStack for AWS-compatible services, relying on free tier services for ECS integrations.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Key Insight for KECS Development\n\n**ECS is NOT available in LocalStack Free tier** - it requires Base tier ($39/mo).\nThis is one of the primary reasons KECS exists: to provide a free, local ECS-compatible environment.\n\n### Pricing Tiers\n\n| Tier | Price | Services |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| Free (Community) | $0 | 30+ services |\n| Base | $39/mo | 55+ services |\n| Ultimate | $89/mo | 110+ services |\n\n### Free Tier Services (Commonly Used with ECS)\n\nThese services are available for free and can be used with KECS:\n\n- **S3** - Object storage\n- **DynamoDB** - NoSQL database\n- **SQS** - Simple Queue Service\n- **SNS** - Simple Notification Service\n- **IAM** - Identity and Access Management\n- **SecretsManager** - Secrets management\n- **KMS** - Key Management Service\n- **SSM** - Systems Manager (Parameter Store)\n- **STS** - Security Token Service\n- **ACM** - Certificate Manager\n- **CloudWatch** - Monitoring (basic features)\n- **CloudWatch Logs** - Logging (basic features)\n- **Lambda** - Serverless functions (basic features)\n\n### Paid Tier Only Services (NOT Free)\n\nThese require LocalStack Base or Ultimate:\n\n- **ECS** - Elastic Container Service (Base+)\n- **ECR** - Elastic Container Registry (Base+)\n- **ELB/ALB** - Load Balancing (Base+)\n- **EC2** - Docker VM mode (Base+, Mock mode is free)\n\n## Detailed Documentation\n\nSee `service-tiers.md` for complete service tier information.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:41:26.066Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents requiring Amazon ECS compatible APIs on Kubernetes through LocalStack service tiers","zh":"适合需要在 Kubernetes 通过 LocalStack 服务层级使用 Amazon ECS 兼容 API 的云代理","ja":"Kubernetes を介して LocalStack サービス階層で Amazon ECS との互換性のある API を必要とするクラウド エージェントに最適","ko":"쿠버네티스를 통해 로컬스택 서비스 티어에서 아마존 ECS 호환 API가 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes en la nube que requieren APIs compatibles con Amazon ECS en Kubernetes a través de los niveles de servicio de LocalStack","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des API compatibles Amazon ECS sur Kubernetes via les niveaux de service LocalStack","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die Amazon ECS-kompatible APIs auf Kubernetes über die LocalStack-Service-Tier benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem APIs compatíveis com o Amazon ECS no Kubernetes por meio de camadas de serviço do LocalStack","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих API, совместимых с Amazon ECS, на Kubernetes через уровни обслуживания LocalStack","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابيين الذين يتطلبون واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Amazon ECS على Kubernetes من خلال مستويات خدمة LocalStack"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate LocalStack pricing tiers for optimal KECS development, utilizing Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service and Amazon ECS compatible APIs, while avoiding costly Base tier requirements for ECS integrations","zh":"赋予代理导航 LocalStack 定价层级以实现 KECS 的最佳开发，利用基于 Kubernetes 的 ECS 兼容服务和 Amazon ECS 兼容 API，同时避免为 ECS 集成支付昂贵的基本层级费用","ja":"KECS の最適な開発のために、LocalStack の価格階層をエージェントにナビゲートさせることで、Kubernetes ベースの ECS との互換性のあるサービスと Amazon ECS との互換性のある API を利用しながら、ECS 統合のための高額なベース階層の要件を回避","ko":"KECS 개발을 최적화하기 위해 에이전트가 로컬스택 가격 티어를 탐색할 수 있도록 함으로써 쿠버네티스 기반의 ECS 호환 서비스와 아마존 ECS 호환 API를 활용하여 ECS 통합을 위한 비싼 기본 티어 비용을 피함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por los niveles de precios de LocalStack para un desarrollo óptimo de KECS, utilizando el servicio compatible con ECS basado en Kubernetes y las API compatibles con Amazon ECS, mientras evita los costosos requisitos del nivel Base para las integraciones de ECS","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les niveaux de tarification de LocalStack pour un développement optimal de KECS, en utilisant le service ECS compatible basé sur Kubernetes et les API compatibles Amazon ECS, tout en évitant les coûteux exigences de niveau de base pour les intégrations ECS","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Preisstufen von LocalStack für eine optimale KECS-Entwicklung zu nutzen, indem sie den auf Kubernetes basierenden ECS-kompatiblen Dienst und die Amazon ECS-kompatiblen APIs verwenden, während sie die teuren Anforderungen der Basis-Stufe für ECS-Integrationen vermeiden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar pelas camadas de preços do LocalStack para o desenvolvimento óptimo do KECS, utilizando o Serviço Compatível com ECS baseado em Kubernetes e APIs compatíveis com o Amazon ECS, evitando os requisitos de nível Base caros para integrações do ECS","ru":"Позволяет агентам ориентироваться в тарифных планах LocalStack для оптимальной разработки KECS, используя сервис, совместимый с ECS на основе Kubernetes, и API, совместимые с Amazon ECS, избегая дорогих требований базового уровня для интеграции с ECS","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التنقل في مستويات التسعير الخاصة باللوكالستاك من أجل تطوير KECS الأمثل، باستخدام الخدمة المطابقة لـ ECS القائمة على كوبيرنيتس وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع Amazon ECS، مع تجنب متطلبات المستوى الأساسي الغالية لدمج ECS"},"useCases":{"en":["Determining optimal LocalStack tier for KECS projects","Avoiding unnecessary Base tier costs for ECS integrations","Configuring LocalStack for free tier services"],"zh":["确定 KECS 项目的最佳 LocalStack 层级","避免不必要的基本层级成本用于 ECS 集成","配置 LocalStack 以使用免费层级服务"],"ja":["KECS プロジェクトのための最適な LocalStack 層を決定する","ECS 統合のための不要なベース層のコストを避ける","無料層サービスを使用するための LocalStack の設定"],"ko":["KECS 프로젝트를 위한 로컬스택 최적의 티어 결정","ECS 통합을 위한 불필요한 기본 티어 비용 회피","무료 티어 서비스를 사용하기 위한 로컬스택 구성"],"es":["Determinar el nivel óptimo de LocalStack para proyectos KECS","Evitar costos innecesarios del nivel Base para integraciones de ECS","Configurar LocalStack para servicios de nivel gratuito"],"fr":["Déterminer le niveau optimal de LocalStack pour les projets KECS","Éviter les coûts inutiles du niveau de base pour les intégrations ECS","Configurer LocalStack pour les services de niveau gratuit"],"de":["Bestimmung des optimalen LocalStack-Levels für KECS-Projekte","Vermeidung unnötiger Basis-Level-Kosten für ECS-Integrationen","Konfiguration von LocalStack für kostenlose Level-Dienste"],"pt":["Determinar a camada óptima do LocalStack para projetos KECS","Evitar custos desnecessários da camada Base para integrações do ECS","Configurar o LocalStack para serviços de camada gratuita"],"ru":["Определение оптимального уровня LocalStack для проектов KECS","Избежание ненужных затрат базового уровня для интеграции с ECS","Настройка LocalStack для бесплатных услуг уровня"],"ar":["تحدید الطبقة المثلى للوكالستاك لمشاريع KECS","تجنب التكاليف غير الضرورية لمستوى الأساس لدمج ECS","تكوين اللوكالستاك لخدمات الطبقة المجانية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires KECS for free, local ECS-compatible environment","ECS not available in LocalStack Free tier"],"zh":["需要 KECS 来创建免费的本地 ECS 兼容环境","ECS 不可用于 LocalStack 免费层级"],"ja":["KECS が必要です (無料のローカル ECS との互換性のある環境を構築するため)","ECS は LocalStack の無料層では利用できない"],"ko":["KECS가 필요함(무료 로컬 ECS 호환 환경을 구성하기 위해)","ECS는 로컬스택 무료 티어에서 사용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere KECS para un entorno local compatible con ECS de forma gratuita","ECS no disponible en el nivel gratuito de LocalStack"],"fr":["Nécessite KECS pour un environnement local compatible ECS gratuit","ECS non disponible dans le niveau gratuit de LocalStack"],"de":["Benötigt KECS für eine kostenlose, lokale ECS-kompatible Umgebung","ECS nicht verfügbar in der LocalStack-Free-Stufe"],"pt":["Exige KECS para ambiente ECS compatível local e gratuito","ECS não está disponível na camada gratuita do LocalStack"],"ru":["Требует KECS для бесплатной, локальной среды, совместимой с ECS","ECS не доступен в бесплатном уровне LocalStack"],"ar":["يتطلب KECS لبيئة ECS متوافقة محلية ومجانية","ECS غير متوفر في مستوى اللوكالستاك المجاني"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
