v4 とコンパイラ最適化を含む高度な設定パターンを提供","ko":"Tamagui 최적의 실무 구성 시스템은 Config v4 및 컴파일러 최적화를 포함한 고급 구성 패턴을 제공","es":"Tamagui proporciona patrones para mejorar tu código. Aprende sobre Config v4, optimización del compilador y componentes compuestos.","fr":"Tamagui offre des modèles pour améliorer votre code. Découvrez Config v4, l''optimisation du compilateur et les composants composés.","de":"Tamagui bietet Muster, um Ihren Code zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie über Config v4, Compiler-Optimierung und Composite-Komponenten.","pt":"Este skill fornece padrões para Tamagui v1.x que vão além dos fundamentos, focando em Config v4 e otimização do compilador.","ru":"Этот навык предоставляет шаблоны для Tamagui v1.x, которые выходят за рамки основ, сосредотачиваясь на Config v4 и оптимизации компилятора.","ar":"هذاSkill يوفر نماذج لتاماغوي v1.x التي تتجاوز الأساسيات، تركز على Config v4 وضبط المحول.","en":"Comprehensive configuration system for Claude Code"},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive configuration system for Claude Code"},"features":{"zh":["Config v4","编译器优化","组合组件","常见错误避免","高级配置模式"],"ja":["Config v4","コンパイラ最適化","コンポーネントの組み合わせ","一般的なエラーの回避","高度な設定パターン"],"ko":["Config v4","컴파일러 최적화","컴포넌트 결합","일반적인 오류 회피","고급 구성 패턴"],"es":["Patrones para Config v4","Optimización del compilador","Componentes compuestos","Evitación de errores comunes","Mejora del rendimiento"],"fr":["Modèles pour Config v4","Optimisation du compilateur","Composants composés","Évitement des erreurs courantes","Amélioration des performances"],"de":["Muster für Config v4","Compiler-Optimierung","Composite-Komponenten","Vermeidung häufiger Fehler","Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["Config v4","Otimização do compilador","Componentes compostos","Padrões de diálogo e formulários","Evitando erros comuns"],"ru":["Config v4","Оптимизация компилятора","Составные компоненты","Шаблоны диалогов и форм","Избежание общих ошибок"],"ar":["Config v4","ضبط المحول","المركبات المركبة","نماذج الحوار والاستمارات","تجنب الأخطاء الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tamagui","Config v4","编译器优化","组合组件","最佳实践","高级配置模式","前端开发","开发者工具"],"ja":["Tamagui","Config v4","コンパイラ最適化","コンポーネントの組み合わせ","ベストプラクティス","高度な設定パターン","フロントエンド開発","開発者ツール"],"ko":["Tamagui","Config v4","컴파일러 최적화","컴포넌트 결합","최적의 실무","고급 구성 패턴","프론트엔드 개발","개발자 도구"],"es":["Tamagui","Config v4","optimización del compilador","componentes compuestos","desarrollo de software","mejores prácticas","patrones de código"," Claude Code"],"fr":["Tamagui","Config v4","optimisation du compilateur","composants composés","développement de logiciels","bonnes pratiques","modèles de code","Claude Code"],"de":["Tamagui","Config v4","Compiler-Optimierung","Composite-Komponenten","Software-Entwicklung","Best Practices","Code-Muster","Claude Code"],"pt":["Tamagui","Config v4","Otimização do compilador","Componentes compostos","Desenvolvimento de software","Melhores práticas","Claude Code"],"ru":["Tamagui","Config v4","Оптимизация компилятора","Составные компоненты","Разработка программного обеспечения","Лучшие практики","Claude Code"],"ar":["تاماغوي","Config v4","ضبط المحول","المركبات المركبة","تطوير البرمجيات","أفضل الممارسات","Claude Code"]}},"owner":"0xBigBoss","repo":"claude-code","repoPath":"0xBigBoss/claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tamagui-best-practices","description":"Provides Tamagui patterns for config v4, compiler optimization, styled context, and cross-platform styling. Must use when working with Tamagui projects (tamagui.config.ts, @tamagui imports).","bodyPreview":"This skill provides patterns for Tamagui v1.x that go beyond fundamentals. It focuses on Config v4, compiler optimization, compound components, and common mistakes.\n\n## Mandatory Context Loading\n\nWhen working with these components, read the corresponding pattern file BEFORE writing code:\n\n| Component Type | Required Reading | Cross-Skills |\n|---------------|------------------|--------------|\n| Dialog, Sheet, modal overlays | @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md | |\n| Form, Input, Label, validation | @FORM_PATTER","body":"This skill provides patterns for Tamagui v1.x that go beyond fundamentals. It focuses on Config v4, compiler optimization, compound components, and common mistakes.\n\n## Mandatory Context Loading\n\nWhen working with these components, read the corresponding pattern file BEFORE writing code:\n\n| Component Type | Required Reading | Cross-Skills |\n|---------------|------------------|--------------|\n| Dialog, Sheet, modal overlays | @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md | |\n| Form, Input, Label, validation | @FORM_PATTERNS.md | `typescript-best-practices` (zod) |\n| Animations, transitions | @ANIMATION_PATTERNS.md | |\n| Popover, Tooltip, Select | @OVERLAY_PATTERNS.md | |\n| Compiler optimization | @COMPILER_PATTERNS.md | |\n| Design tokens, theming | @DESIGN_SYSTEM.md | |\n\n## Config v4 Quick Start\n\nUse `@tamagui/config/v4` for simplified setup:\n\n```tsx\n// tamagui.config.ts\nimport { defaultConfig } from ''@tamagui/config/v4''\nimport { createTamagui } from ''tamagui''\n\nexport const config = createTamagui(defaultConfig)\n\ntype CustomConfig = typeof config\n\ndeclare module ''tamagui'' {\n  interface TamaguiCustomConfig extends CustomConfig {}\n}\n```\n\n**Recommended setting** for new projects (aligns flexBasis to React Native):\n```tsx\nexport const config = createTamagui({\n  ...defaultConfig,\n  settings: {\n    ...defaultConfig.settings,\n    styleCompat: ''react-native'',\n  },\n})\n```\n\n### createThemes Pattern\n\nFor custom themes, use `createThemes` with palette/accent/childrenThemes:\n\n```tsx\nimport { createThemes, defaultComponentThemes } from ''@tamagui/config/v4''\n\nconst generatedThemes = createThemes({\n  componentThemes: defaultComponentThemes,\n  base: {\n    palette: {\n      dark: [''#050505'', ''#151515'', /* ...12 colors */ ''#fff''],\n      light: [''#fff'', ''#f8f8f8'', /* ...12 colors */ ''#000''],\n    },\n    extra: {\n      light: { ...Colors.blue, shadowColor: ''rgba(0,0,0,0.04)'' },\n      dark: { ...Colors.blueDark, shadowColor: ''rgba(0,0,0,0.2)'' },\n    },\n  },\n  accent: {\n    palette: { dark: lightPalette, light: darkPalette }, // inverted\n  },\n  childrenThemes: {\n    blue: { palette: { dark: Object.values(Colors.blueDark), light: Object.values(Colors.blue) } },\n    red: { /* ... */ },\n    green: { /* ... */ },\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Token and Theme Syntax\n\n### $ Prefix Rules\n\n- **Props**: Use `$` prefix for token references: `<Text color=\"$color\" fontSize=\"$4\" />`\n- **Theme keys**: Access without `$` in theme definitions: `{ color: palette[11] }`\n- **Token access in variants**: Use `tokens.size[name]` pattern\n\n### Variant Spread Operators\n\nSpecial spread operators map token categories to variant values:\n\n```tsx\nconst Button = styled(View, {\n  variants: {\n    size: {\n      // Maps size tokens: $1, $2, $true, etc.\n      ''...size'': (size, { tokens }) => ({\n        height: tokens.size[size] ?? size,\n        borderRadius: tokens.radius[size] ?? size,\n        gap: tokens.space[size]?.val * 0.2,\n      }),\n    },\n    textSize: {\n      // Maps fontSize tokens\n      ''...fontSize'': (name, { font }) => ({\n        fontSize: font?.size[name],\n      }),\n    },\n  } as const,\n})\n```\n\n**Important**: Use `as const` on variants object until TypeScript supports inferred const generics.\n\n## Compound Components with createStyledContext\n\nFor compound APIs like `<Button><Button.Text>Click</Button.Text></Button>`:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  SizeTokens,\n  View,\n  Text,\n  createStyledContext,\n  styled,\n  withStaticProperties,\n} from ''@tamagui/core''\n\n// 1. Create context with shared variant types\nexport const ButtonContext = createStyledContext<{ size: SizeTokens }>({\n  size: ''$medium'',\n})\n\n// 2. Create frame with context\nexport const ButtonFrame = styled(View, {\n  name: ''Button'',\n  context: ButtonContext,\n  variants: {\n    size: {\n      ''...size'': (name, { tokens }) => ({\n        height: tokens.size[name],\n        borderRadius: tokens.radius[name],\n        gap: tokens.space[name].val * 0.2,\n      }),\n    },\n  } as const,\n  defaultVariants: {\n    size: ''$medium'',\n  },\n})\n\n// 3. Create text with same context (variants auto-sync)\nexport const ButtonText = styled(Text, {\n  name: ''ButtonText'',\n  context: ButtonContext,\n  variants: {\n    size: {\n      ''...fontSize'': (name, { font }) => ({\n        fontSize: font?.size[name],\n      }),\n    },\n  } as const,\n})\n\n// 4. Compose with withStaticProperties\nexport const Button = withStaticProperties(ButtonFrame, {\n  Props: ButtonContext.Provider,\n  Text: ButtonText,\n})\n```\n\n**Usage**:\n```tsx\n<Button size=\"$large\">\n  <Button.Text>Click me</Button.Text>\n</Button>\n\n// Or override defaults from above:\n<Button.Props size=\"$small\">\n  <Button><Button.Text>Small</Button.Text></Button>\n</Button.Props>\n```\n\n**Note**: `context` pattern does not work with compiler flattening. Use for higher-level components (Button, Card), not primitives (Stack, Text).\n\n## styleable() for Wrapper Components\n\nWhen wrapping a styled component in a functional component, use `.styleable()` to preserve variant inheritance:\n\n```tsx\nconst StyledText = styled(Text)\n\n// WITHOUT styleable - BROKEN variant inheritance\nconst BrokenWrapper = (props) => <StyledText {...props} />\n\n// WITH styleable - CORRECT\nconst CorrectWrapper = StyledText.styleable((props, ref) => (\n  <StyledText ref={ref} {...props} />\n))\n\n// Now this works:\nconst StyledCorrectWrapper = styled(CorrectWrapper, {\n  variants: {\n    bold: { true: { fontWeight: ''bold'' } },\n  },\n})\n```\n\n### Adding Extra Props\n\nPass generic type argument for additional props:\n\n```tsx\ntype ExtraProps = { icon?: React.ReactNode }\n\nconst IconText = StyledText.styleable<ExtraProps>((props, ref) => {\n  const { icon, ...rest } = props\n  return (\n    <XStack>\n      {icon}\n      <StyledText ref={ref} {...rest} />\n    </XStack>\n  )\n})\n```\n\n## accept Prop for Custom Components\n\nEnable token/theme resolution on non-standard props:\n\n```tsx\n// For SVG fill/stroke that should accept theme colors\nconst StyledSVG = styled(SVG, {}, {\n  accept: { fill: ''color'', stroke: ''color'' } as const,\n})\n\n// Usage: <StyledSVG fill=\"$blue10\" />\n\n// For style objects (like ScrollView''s contentContainerStyle)\nconst MyScrollView = styled(ScrollView, {}, {\n  accept: { contentContainerStyle: ''style'' } as const,\n})\n\n// Usage: <MyScrollView contentContainerStyle={{ padding: ''$4'' }} />\n```\n\n**Important**: Use `as const` on the accept object.\n\n## Prop Order Matters\n\nIn `styled()`, prop order determines override priority:\n\n```tsx\n// backgroundColor can be overridden by props\nconst Overridable = (props) => (\n  <View backgroundColor=\"$red10\" {...props} width={200} />\n)\n// width CANNOT be overridden (comes after spread)\n\n// Variant order matters too:\n<Component scale={3} huge />  // scale = 3 (scale comes first)\n<Component huge scale={3} />  // scale = 2 (huge overrides)\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### Dynamic Styles Break Optimization\n\n```tsx\n// BAD - breaks compiler optimization\n<View style={{ width: someVariable * 2 }} />\n<View backgroundColor={isDark ? ''$gray1'' : ''$gray12''} />\n\n// GOOD - use variants\nconst Box = styled(View, {\n  variants: {\n    dark: { true: { backgroundColor: ''$gray1'' }, false: { backgroundColor: ''$gray12'' } },\n  },\n})\n<Box dark={isDark} />\n```\n\n### Inline Functions\n\n```tsx\n// BAD - new function every render\n<View onPress={() => handlePress(id)} />\n\n// GOOD - stable reference\nconst handlePressCallback = useCallback(() => handlePress(id), [id])\n<View onPress={handlePressCallback} />\n```\n\n### Wrong Import Paths\n\n```tsx\n// These are different packages with different contents:\nimport { View } from ''tamagui''           // Full UI kit\nimport { View } from ''@tamagui/core''     // Core only (smaller)\nimport { Button } from ''@tamagui/button'' // Individual component\n\n// Pick one approach and be consistent\n```\n\n### Mixing RN StyleSheet with Tamagui\n\n```tsx\n// BAD - StyleSheet values don''t resolve tokens\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({ box: { padding: 20 } })\n<View style={styles.box} backgroundColor=\"$blue10\" />\n\n// GOOD - all Tamagui\n<View padding=\"$4\" backgroundColor=\"$blue10\" />\n```\n\n### Platform.OS Branching for Dialog/Sheet\n\n```tsx\n// BAD - manual platform branching\nif (Platform.OS === ''web'') {\n  return <Dialog>...</Dialog>\n}\nreturn <Sheet>...</Sheet>\n\n// GOOD - use Adapt (see @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md)\n<Dialog>\n  <Dialog.Portal>...</Dialog.Portal>\n  <Adapt when=\"sm\" platform=\"touch\">\n    <Sheet><Adapt.Contents /></Sheet>\n  </Adapt>\n</Dialog>\n```\n\n## Fetching Current Documentation\n\nFor latest API details, fetch markdown docs directly:\n\n```bash\n# Core docs\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/docs/core/configuration.md\"\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/docs/core/styled.md\"\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/docs/core/variants.md\"\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/docs/core/animations.md\"\n\n# Component docs\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/ui/sheet.md\"\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/ui/dialog.md\"\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/ui/select.md\"\n\n# Full docs index\ncurl -sL \"https://tamagui.dev/llms.txt\"\n```\n\nFor HTML pages, use the web-fetch skill with appropriate selectors.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Config v4 Shorthands (Tailwind-aligned)\n\n| Shorthand | Property |\n|-----------|----------|\n| `bg` | backgroundColor |\n| `p` | padding |\n| `m` | margin |\n| `w` | width |\n| `h` | height |\n| `br` | borderRadius |\n\n### Media Query Breakpoints\n\n| Token | Default | Server Default |\n|-------|---------|----------------|\n| `$xs` | 660px | true |\n| `$sm` | 800px | false |\n| `$md` | 1020px | false |\n| `$lg` | 1280px | false |\n| `$xl` | 1420px | false |\n\n### Animation Drivers\n\n| Driver | Platform | Use Case |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| `css` | Web | Default, best performance |\n| `react-native-reanimated` | Native | Required for native animations |\n\n## Additional Pattern Files\n\n- @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md - Dialog, Sheet, Adapt, accessibility\n- @FORM_PATTERNS.md - Form, Input, Label, validation with zod\n- @ANIMATION_PATTERNS.md - Animation drivers, enterStyle/exitStyle\n- @OVERLAY_PATTERNS.md - Popover, Tooltip, Select\n- @COMPILER_PATTERNS.md - Compiler optimization details\n- @DESIGN_SYSTEM.md - Design tokens and theming\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:41:33.927Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code Agents needing comprehensive configuration and optimization capabilities with Tamagui v1.x","zh":"非常适合需要对 Tamagui v1.x 进行全面配置和优化的 Claude Code Agents","ja":"Tamagui v1.x の包括的な構成と最適化機能が必要な Claude Code Agents に最適","ko":"Tamagui v1.x에 대한 전체 구성 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 Claude Code Agents에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de configuración y optimización comprehensivas con Tamagui v1.x","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Claude Code ayant besoin de capacités de configuration et d''optimisation complètes avec Tamagui v1.x","de":"Perfekt für Claude Code-Agents, die umfassende Konfigurations- und Optimierungsfunktionen mit Tamagui v1.x benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades de configuração e otimização abrangentes com Tamagui v1.x","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Claude Code, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности конфигурации и оптимизации с Tamagui v1.x","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تكوين وضبط شاملة مع Tamagui v1.x"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Config v4, compiler optimization, and compound components for efficient development, while avoiding common mistakes and leveraging patterns for Dialog, Sheet, and Form components, including modal overlays and validation using @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md and @FORM_PATTERNS.md","zh":"赋予代理使用 Config v4、编译器优化和复合组件进行高效开发的能力，同时避免常见错误，并利用 Dialog、Sheet 和 Form 组件的模式，包括使用 @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md 和 @FORM_PATTERNS.md 的模态叠加层和验证","ja":"Config v4、コンパイラ最適化、複合コンポーネントを使用して効率的な開発を行う能力をエージェントに与え、一般的なミスを避け、@DIALOG_PATTERNS.md と @FORM_PATTERNS.md を使用したダイアログ、シート、フォーム コンポーネントのパターンを利用する","ko":"Config v4, 컴파일러 최적화 및 복합 컴포넌트를 사용하여 효율적인 개발을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여함으로써 공통된 실수를 피하고, @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md 및 @FORM_PATTERNS.md를 사용한 다이얼로그, 시트, 폼 컴포넌트의 패턴을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar Config v4, la optimización del compilador y los componentes compuestos para un desarrollo eficiente, al mismo tiempo que evita errores comunes y aprovecha patrones para los componentes de diálogo, hoja y formulario, incluyendo superposiciones modales y validación utilizando @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md y @FORM_PATTERNS.md","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter Config v4, l''optimisation du compilateur et les composants composés pour un développement efficace, tout en évitant les erreurs courantes et en exploitant des modèles pour les composants de dialogue, feuille et formulaire, y compris les superpositions modales et la validation à l''aide de @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md et @FORM_PATTERNS.md","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Config v4, Compiler-Optimierung und Zusammengesetzte Komponenten für eine effiziente Entwicklung zu nutzen, während gleichzeitig häufige Fehler vermieden und Muster für Dialog-, Sheet- und Formkomponenten genutzt werden, einschließlich modaler Überlagerungen und Validierung unter Verwendung von @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md und @FORM_PATTERNS.md","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar Config v4, otimização do compilador e componentes compostos para desenvolvimento eficiente, evitando erros comuns e aproveitando padrões para componentes de Diálogo, Folha e Formulário, incluindo sobreposições modais e validação usando @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md e @FORM_PATTERNS.md","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать Config v4, оптимизацию компилятора и составные компоненты для эффективной разработки, избегая распространенных ошибок и используя шаблоны для компонентов Диалога, Листа и Формы, включая модальные наложения и проверку с помощью @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md и @FORM_PATTERNS.md","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استخدام Config v4 وضبط المترجم و‌مكونات المركب من أجل تطوير فعال، وتجنب الأخطاء الشائعة واستخدام أنماط للمكونات الحوار والورقة والنموذج، بما في ذلك الطبقات المضمنة والتحقق باستخدام @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md و @FORM_PATTERNS.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Tamagui components for optimal performance","Debugging common mistakes in Config v4 and compiler optimization","Implementing compound components for complex interfaces"],"zh":["为 Tamagui 组件配置最佳性能","调试 Config v4 和编译器优化中的常见错误","实现复合组件以用于复杂接口"],"ja":["Tamagui コンポーネントの最適なパフォーマンスを設定する","Config v4 とコンパイラ最適化の一般的なミスをデバッグする","複合コンポーネントを実装して複雑なインターフェイスを使用する"],"ko":["Tamagui 컴포넌트의 최적의 성능을 구성","Config v4 및 컴파일러 최적화의 일반적인 오류를 디버깅","복합 컴포넌트를 구현하여 복잡한 인터페이스를 사용"],"es":["Configuración de componentes de Tamagui para un rendimiento óptimo","Depuración de errores comunes en Config v4 y optimización del compilador","Implementación de componentes compuestos para interfaces complejas"],"fr":["Configuration des composants Tamagui pour des performances optimales","Débogage des erreurs courantes dans Config v4 et optimisation du compilateur","Mise en œuvre de composants composés pour des interfaces complexes"],"de":["Konfiguration von Tamagui-Komponenten für optimale Leistung","Fehlerbehebung bei häufigen Fehlern in Config v4 und Compiler-Optimierung","Implementierung von Zusammengesetzten Komponenten für komplexe Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Configurando componentes Tamagui para desempenho ótimo","Depurando erros comuns em Config v4 e otimização do compilador","Implementando componentes compostos para interfaces complexas"],"ru":["Настройка компонентов Tamagui для оптимальной производительности","Отладка распространенных ошибок в Config v4 и оптимизации компилятора","Реализация составных компонентов для сложных интерфейсов"],"ar":["تكوين مكونات Tamagui لأداء مثالي","تصحيح الأخطاء الشائعة في Config v4 وضبط المترجم","تنفيذ مكونات مركبة لمواجهات معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tamagui v1.x","Specific to Claude Code Agents","Mandatory context loading from pattern files like @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md and @FORM_PATTERNS.md"],"zh":["需要 Tamagui v1.x","特定于 Claude Code Agents","必须从模式文件（如 @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md 和 @FORM_PATTERNS.md）加载上下文"],"ja":["Tamagui v1.x が必要","Claude Code Agents 専用","パターン ファイル（@DIALOG_PATTERNS.md および @FORM_PATTERNS.md など）からコンテキストを読み込む必要がある"],"ko":["Tamagui v1.x가 필요","Claude Code Agents 전용","패턴 파일(@DIALOG_PATTERNS.md 및 @FORM_PATTERNS.md 등)에서 컨텍스트를 로드해야 함"],"es":["Requiere Tamagui v1.x","Específico para agentes de Claude Code","Carga de contexto obligatoria desde archivos de patrones como @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md y @FORM_PATTERNS.md"],"fr":["Nécessite Tamagui v1.x","Spécifique aux agents Claude Code","Chargement de contexte obligatoire à partir de fichiers de modèles tels que @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md et @FORM_PATTERNS.md"],"de":["Benötigt Tamagui v1.x","Spezifisch für Claude Code-Agents","Obligatorische Kontextladung aus Musterdateien wie @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md und @FORM_PATTERNS.md"],"pt":["Requer Tamagui v1.x","Específico para agentes Claude Code","Carregamento de contexto obrigatório a partir de arquivos de padrão como @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md e @FORM_PATTERNS.md"],"ru":["Требует Tamagui v1.x","Конкретно для агентов Claude Code","Обязательная загрузка контекста из файлов шаблонов, таких как @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md и @FORM_PATTERNS.md"],"ar":["يتطلب Tamagui v1.x","محدد للوكلاء Claude Code","تحميل السياق الإلزامي من ملفات النمط مثل @DIALOG_PATTERNS.md و @FORM_PATTERNS.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('abyssparanoia/rapid-go/crud-implementation', 'community', 'abyssparanoia', 'rapid-go', 'abyssparanoia/rapid-go', 'crud-implementation', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z', '2026-02-18T07:41:41.896Z', NULL, '{"id":"abyssparanoia/rapid-go/crud-implementation","name":"crud-implementation","description":{"zh":"CRUD 实现工作流为开发人员提供了快速开发 API 的入口点，包括添加数据库表、域实体和 API 端点","ja":"CRUD 実装ワークフローは、開発者が API を迅速に開発できるエントリーポイントを提供し、データベーステーブルの追加、ドメインエンティティの追加、API エンドポイントの追加が含まれます","ko":"CRUD 구현 워크플로는 개발자에게 빠른 API 개발의 진입점을 제공하며 데이터베이스 테이블 추가, 도메인 엔티티 추가, API 엔드포인트 추가가 포함됩니다","es":"La implementación CRUD con Rapid-Go permite desarrollar APIs de forma rápida y eficiente. Nuestro enfoque práctico te guía a través del proceso.","fr":"La mise en œuvre CRUD avec Rapid-Go permet de développer des APIs de manière rapide et efficace. Notre approche pratique vous guide à travers le processus.","de":"Die CRUD-Implementierung mit Rapid-Go ermöglicht eine schnelle und effiziente Entwicklung von APIs. Unser praxisorientierter Ansatz führt Sie durch den Prozess.","pt":"A implementação CRUD com Rapid-Go permite desenvolver APIs rapidamente com operações de criação, leitura, atualização e exclusão.","ru":"Реализация CRUD с Rapid-Go позволяет быстро разрабатывать API с операциями создания, чтения, обновления и удаления.","ar":"تنفيذ CRUD مع Rapid-Go يسمح بالتنمية السريعة لواجهات برمجة التطبيقات مع عمليات الإنشاء والقراءة والتحديث والحذف.","en":"By using rapid-go you can quickly start developing a great API......"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"CRUD 实现工作流 - 快速开发 API","ja":"CRUD 実装ワークフロー - API 開発を迅速化","ko":"CRUD 구현 워크플로 - 빠른 API 개발","es":"Implementación CRUD Rápida con Rapid-Go","fr":"Mise en œuvre CRUD rapide avec Rapid-Go","de":"Schnelle CRUD-Implementierung mit Rapid-Go","pt":"Implementação CRUD Rápida com Rapid-Go","ru":"Быстрая Реализация CRUD с Rapid-Go","ar":"تنفيذ CRUD السريع باستخدام Rapid-Go","en":"crud-implementation"},"description":{"zh":"CRUD 实现工作流为开发人员提供了快速开发 API 的入口点，包括添加数据库表、域实体和 API 端点","ja":"CRUD 実装ワークフローは、開発者が API を迅速に開発できるエントリーポイントを提供し、データベーステーブルの追加、ドメインエンティティの追加、API エンドポイントの追加が含まれます","ko":"CRUD 구현 워크플로는 개발자에게 빠른 API 개발의 진입점을 제공하며 데이터베이스 테이블 추가, 도메인 엔티티 추가, API 엔드포인트 추가가 포함됩니다","es":"La implementación CRUD con Rapid-Go permite desarrollar APIs de forma rápida y eficiente. Nuestro enfoque práctico te guía a través del proceso.","fr":"La mise en œuvre CRUD avec Rapid-Go permet de développer des APIs de manière rapide et efficace. Notre approche pratique vous guide à travers le processus.","de":"Die CRUD-Implementierung mit Rapid-Go ermöglicht eine schnelle und effiziente Entwicklung von APIs. Unser praxisorientierter Ansatz führt Sie durch den Prozess.","pt":"A implementação CRUD com Rapid-Go permite desenvolver APIs rapidamente com operações de criação, leitura, atualização e exclusão.","ru":"Реализация CRUD с Rapid-Go позволяет быстро разрабатывать API с операциями создания, чтения, обновления и удаления.","ar":"تنفيذ CRUD مع Rapid-Go يسمح بالتنمية السريعة لواجهات برمجة التطبيقات مع عمليات الإنشاء والقراءة والتحديث والحذف.","en":"By using rapid-go you can quickly start developing a great API......"},"definition":{"en":"By using rapid-go you can quickly start developing a great API......"},"features":{"zh":["快速开发 API","添加数据库表","添加域实体","添加 API 端点","支持 CRUD 操作"],"ja":["API 開発を迅速化","データベーステーブルの追加","ドメインエンティティの追加","API エンドポイントの追加","CRUD 操作のサポート"],"ko":["빠른 API 개발","데이터베이스 테이블 추가","도메인 엔티티 추가","API 엔드포인트 추가","CRUD 연산 지원"],"es":["Creación de tablas de base de datos","Definición de modelos de dominio","Implementación de endpoints de API","Uso de casos de uso y repositorios","Migraciones SQL y tablas de constantes"],"fr":["Création de tables de base de données","Définition de modèles de domaine","Mise en œuvre d''endpoints d''API","Utilisation de cas d''utilisation et de référentiels","Migration SQL et tables de constantes"],"de":["Erstellung von Datenbanktabellen","Definition von Domänenmodellen","Implementierung von API-Endpunkten","Verwendung von Anwendungsfällen und Repositorien","SQL-Migrationen und Konstantentabellen"],"pt":["Criação de tabelas de banco de dados","Modelagem de entidades de domínio","Criação de endpoints de API","Suporte a operações CRUD","Desenvolvimento rápido com Rapid-Go"],"ru":["Создание таблиц базы данных","Моделирование сущностей домена","Создание конечных точек API","Поддержка операций CRUD","Быстрое развитие с Rapid-Go"],"ar":["إنشاء جداول قاعدة البيانات","نمذجة كيانات النطاق","إنشاء نقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم عمليات CRUD","التنمية السريعة مع Rapid-Go"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CRUD 实现","API 开发","rapid-go","数据库表","域实体","API 端点","CRUD 操作"],"ja":["CRUD 実装","API 開発","rapid-go","データベーステーブル","ドメインエンティティ","API エンドポイント","CRUD 操作"],"ko":["CRUD 구현","API 개발","rapid-go","데이터베이스 테이블","도메인 엔티티","API 엔드포인트","CRUD 연산"],"es":["implementación CRUD","desarrollo de API","Rapid-Go","operaciones CRUD","patrón de diseño CRUD","desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["mise en œuvre CRUD","développement d''API","Rapid-Go","opérations CRUD","modèle de conception CRUD","développement efficace"],"de":["CRUD-Implementierung","API-Entwicklung","Rapid-Go","CRUD-Operationen","CRUD-Entwurfsmuster","effiziente Entwicklung"],"pt":["CRUD","Rapid-Go","API","Desenvolvimento rápido","Operações CRUD","Criação de tabelas","Modelagem de entidades","Endpoints de API"],"ru":["CRUD","Rapid-Go","API","Быстрое развитие","Операции CRUD","Создание таблиц","Моделирование сущностей","Конечные точки API"],"ar":["CRUD","Rapid-Go","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","التنمية السريعة","عمليات CRUD","إنشاء الجداول","نمذجة الكيانات","نقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"abyssparanoia","repo":"rapid-go","repoPath":"abyssparanoia/rapid-go","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"crud-implementation","description":"Complete workflow guide for implementing new CRUD entities. Use when adding a new resource, implementing full CRUD operations, or needing an overview of the database-to-API flow. Triggers: new entity, add resource, implement CRUD, create table and API. Orchestrates add-database-table, add-domain-entity, and add-api-endpoint skills.","bodyPreview":"# CRUD Implementation Workflow\n\nEntry point for implementing a new entity with full CRUD operations.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│  add-database-table │ --> │  add-domain-entity  │ --> │  add-api-endpoint   │\n│                     │     │                     │     │                     │\n│  - Migration SQL    │     │  - Domain model     │     │  - Usecase          │\n│  - Constant tables  │     │  - Repository       │","body":"# CRUD Implementation Workflow\n\nEntry point for implementing a new entity with full CRUD operations.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│  add-database-table │ --> │  add-domain-entity  │ --> │  add-api-endpoint   │\n│                     │     │                     │     │                     │\n│  - Migration SQL    │     │  - Domain model     │     │  - Usecase          │\n│  - Constant tables  │     │  - Repository       │     │  - Proto definition │\n│  - SQLBoiler gen    │     │  - Marshaller       │     │  - gRPC handler     │\n└─────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n| Step | Skill | Key Command |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| 1 | **add-database-table** | `make migrate.create` then `make migrate.up` |\n| 2 | **add-domain-entity** | `make generate.mock` |\n| 3 | **add-api-endpoint** | `make generate.buf` |\n\n## Before You Start\n\n1. Know the entity name and its fields\n2. Identify relationships to existing entities\n3. Determine which API actor (admin/public/debug)\n\n## Step-by-Step\n\n### Step 1: Database Layer\n\nUse the **add-database-table** skill for:\n- Creating migration file with table DDL\n- Adding indexes and foreign keys\n- Creating constant tables for enum fields\n- Running `make migrate.up` to generate SQLBoiler\n\n### Step 2: Domain Layer\n\nUse the **add-domain-entity** skill for:\n- Domain model with constructor and update methods\n- Repository interface with query structs\n- Marshaller (DB model <-> domain model)\n- Repository implementation\n\n### Step 3: API Layer\n\nUse the **add-api-endpoint** skill for:\n- Usecase input/output structs\n- Interactor interface and implementation\n- Protocol Buffers messages and RPCs\n- gRPC handler and marshaller\n- DI registration\n\n## Final Verification\n\n```bash\nmake lint.go && make test\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **code-investigation** - Analyze existing patterns before implementation\n- **review-pr** - Self-review before creating PR\n- **create-pull-request** - PR creation with proper format\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:41:41.896Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full Stack Agents requiring rapid API development with CRUD operations using rapid-go","zh":"适用于需要快速API开发的全栈代理，使用rapid-go进行CRUD操作","ja":"フルスタックエージェントが迅速なAPI開発を必要とする場合に最適で、rapid-goを使用したCRUD操作","ko":"rapid-go를 사용하여 CRUD 연산을 빠르게 수행하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합함","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Full Stack que requieren un desarrollo rápido de API con operaciones CRUD utilizando rapid-go","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full Stack nécessitant un développement d''API rapide avec des opérations CRUD en utilisant rapid-go","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine schnelle API-Entwicklung mit CRUD-Operationen unter Verwendung von rapid-go erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que exigem desenvolvimento de API rápido com operações CRUD usando rapid-go","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, требующих быстрого разработки API с операциями CRUD, используя rapid-go","ar":"مثالي لعميلون كاملون يحتاجون إلى تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات السريع مع عمليات CRUD باستخدام rapid-go"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to quickly implement new entities with full CRUD operations, leveraging Migration SQL, Domain models, and Usecase repositories, and streamlining the process with add-database-table, add-domain-entity, and add-api-endpoint workflows","zh":"赋予代理快速实现新实体的能力，利用迁移SQL、领域模型和用例仓库，并通过添加数据库表、添加领域实体和添加API端点工作流来简化流程","ja":"エージェントが新しいエンティティを迅速に実装できるようにし、Migration SQL、ドメインモデル、およびユースケースリポジトリを活用し、add-database-table、add-domain-entity、add-api-endpointワークフローでプロセスを合理化する","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 엔티티를 빠르게 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 마이그레이션 SQL, 도메인 모델 및 유스케이스 저장소를 활용하여 추가 데이터베이스 테이블, 추가 도메인 엔티티 및 추가 API 엔드포인트 워크플로를 통해 프로세스를 간소화함","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar rápidamente nuevas entidades con operaciones CRUD completas, aprovechando Migration SQL, modelos de dominio y repositorios de casos de uso, y optimizando el proceso con flujos de trabajo add-database-table, add-domain-entity y add-api-endpoint","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre rapidement de nouvelles entités avec des opérations CRUD complètes, en exploitant Migration SQL, les modèles de domaine et les référentiels de cas d''utilisation, et en rationalisant le processus avec des flux de travail add-database-table, add-domain-entity et add-api-endpoint","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Entitäten mit vollständigen CRUD-Operationen schnell zu implementieren, indem es Migration SQL, Domänenmodelle und Use-Case-Repositorys nutzt und den Prozess mit add-database-table-, add-domain-entity- und add-api-endpoint-Workflows rationalisiert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar rapidamente novas entidades com operações CRUD completas, aproveitando Migration SQL, modelos de domínio e repositórios de casos de uso, e otimizando o processo com fluxos de trabalho add-database-table, add-domain-entity e add-api-endpoint","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро реализовывать новые сущности с полными операциями CRUD, используя Migration SQL, модели домена и репозитории использования случаев, и оптимизируя процесс с рабочими процессами add-database-table, add-domain-entity и add-api-endpoint","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ الكيانات الجديدة بسرعة مع عمليات CRUD الكاملة، مستفيدا من Migration SQL و نماذج المجال و مستودعات استخدام الحالة، و تحسين العملية مع تدفقات العمل add-database-table و add-domain-entity و add-api-endpoint"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing RESTful APIs with CRUD endpoints","Automating database table creation with Migration SQL","Generating Domain models and Repository classes"],"zh":["实现RESTful API的CRUD端点","使用迁移SQL自动创建数据库表","生成领域模型和仓库类"],"ja":["CRUDエンドポイントを備えたRESTful APIの実装","Migration SQLを使用したデータベーステーブルの自動作成","ドメインモデルおよびリポジトリクラスの生成"],"ko":["CRUD 엔드포인트를 갖춘 RESTful API의 구현","마이그레이션 SQL을 사용한 데이터베이스 테이블의 자동 생성","도메인 모델 및 리포지토리 클래스의 생성"],"es":["Implementación de API RESTful con puntos de conexión CRUD","Automatización de la creación de tablas de base de datos con Migration SQL","Generación de modelos de dominio y clases de repositorio"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''API RESTful avec des points de terminaison CRUD","Automatisation de la création de tables de base de données avec Migration SQL","Génération de modèles de domaine et de classes de référentiel"],"de":["Implementierung von RESTful-APIs mit CRUD-Endpunkten","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Datenbanktabellen mit Migration SQL","Generierung von Domänenmodellen und Repository-Klassen"],"pt":["Implementação de APIs RESTful com pontos de extremidade CRUD","Criação automática de tabelas de banco de dados com Migration SQL","Geração de modelos de domínio e classes de repositório"],"ru":["Реализация RESTful API с точками CRUD","Автоматическое создание таблиц базы данных с помощью Migration SQL","Генерация моделей домена и классов репозитория"],"ar":["تنفيذ واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful مع نقاط نهاية CRUD","إنشاء جداول قاعدة البيانات تلقائياً باستخدام Migration SQL","توليد نماذج المجال و فئات المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires rapid-go framework","Limited to API development with CRUD operations"],"zh":["需要rapid-go框架","仅限于API开发中的CRUD操作"],"ja":["rapid-goフレームワークの必要性","CRUD操作のみのAPI開発への限定"],"ko":["rapid-go 프레임워크가 필요함","API 개발에서 CRUD 연산만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere el framework rapid-go","Limitado al desarrollo de API con operaciones CRUD"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework rapid-go","Limité au développement d''API avec des opérations CRUD"],"de":["Benötigt das rapid-go-Framework","Begrenzt auf die API-Entwicklung mit CRUD-Operationen"],"pt":["Exige o framework rapid-go","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de API com operações CRUD"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка rapid-go","Ограничен разработкой API с операциями CRUD"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار العمل rapid-go","محدود بتطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع عمليات CRUD"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
