的功能","ja":"KotlinはAndroid開発向けのモダンなプログラミング言語です。より簡潔な構文と強力な機能を提供します","ko":"코틀린은 안드로이드 개발을 위한 현대적인 프로그래밍 언어입니다. 더 간결한 구문과 더 강력한 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Kotlin es un lenguaje de programación que mejora la eficiencia en el desarrollo de Android. Aquí se muestra cómo configurar un proyecto con Gradle","fr":"Kotlin est un langage de programmation qui améliore l''efficacité dans le développement Android. Voici comment configurer un projet avec Gradle","de":"Kotlin ist eine Programmiersprache, die die Effizienz in der Android-Entwicklung verbessert. Hier wird gezeigt, wie ein Projekt mit Gradle konfiguriert wird","pt":"Kotlin é uma linguagem de programação que permite desenvolver aplicativos Android de forma eficaz. Com exemplos de código em Gradle Kotlin DSL","ru":"Kotlin - это язык программирования, который позволяет разрабатывать приложения Android эффективно. С примерами кода в Gradle Kotlin DSL","ar":"Kotlin هي لغة برمجة تمكنك من تطوير تطبيقات أندرويد بفعالية. مع أمثلة على الكود في Gradle Kotlin DSL","en":"A More Effective Agent Harness for Claude"},"definition":{"en":"A More Effective Agent Harness for Claude"},"features":{"zh":["简洁的语法","强大的类型系统","与Java的互操作性","更高的开发效率","更少的错误"],"ja":["簡潔な構文","強力なタイプシステム","Javaとの相互運用性","開発生産性の向上","エラーの削減"],"ko":["간결한 구문","강력한 타입 시스템","자바와의 상호 운용성","개발 효율성의 향상","에러의 감소"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos con Gradle","Uso de Kotlin para el desarrollo de Android","Mejora de la eficiencia en el desarrollo","Integración con el DSL de Gradle","Gestión de dependencias con Gradle","Creación de aplicaciones Android escalables"],"fr":["Configuration de projets avec Gradle","Utilisation de Kotlin pour le développement Android","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans le développement","Intégration avec le DSL de Gradle","Gestion des dépendances avec Gradle","Création d''applications Android escalables"],"de":["Projekt-Konfiguration mit Gradle","Verwendung von Kotlin für die Android-Entwicklung","Verbesserung der Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Integration mit dem Gradle-DSL","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung mit Gradle","Erstellung von skalierbaren Android-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos Android","Uso de Gradle Kotlin DSL","Configuração de projetos Android","Gerenciamento de dependências","Otimização de código","Integração com outras tecnologias"],"ru":["Разработка приложений Android","Использование Gradle Kotlin DSL","Настройка проектов Android","Управление зависимостями","Оптимизация кода","Интеграция с другими технологиями"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات أندرويد","استخدام Gradle Kotlin DSL","تهيئة مشاريع أندرويد","إدارة الإعتماديات","تحسين الكود","التكامل مع تقنيات أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kotlin开发","Android开发","Java替代","编程语言","开发工具","移动应用开发"],"ja":["Kotlin開発","Android開発","Java代替","プログラミング言語","開発ツール","モバイルアプリ開発"],"ko":["코틀린 개발","안드로이드 개발","자바 대체","프로그래밍 언어","개발 도구","모바일 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Kotlin","Android","Gradle","Desarrollo de Android","Programación Kotlin","Configuración de proyectos","Eficacia en el desarrollo","DSL de Gradle","Gestión de dependencias"],"fr":["Kotlin","Android","Gradle","Développement Android","Programmation Kotlin","Configuration de projets","Efficacité dans le développement","DSL de Gradle","Gestion des dépendances"],"de":["Kotlin","Android","Gradle","Android-Entwicklung","Kotlin-Programmierung","Projekt-Konfiguration","Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Gradle-DSL","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung"],"pt":["Kotlin","Desenvolvimento Android","Gradle Kotlin DSL","Aplicativos Android","Programação Android","Tecnologias móveis","Desenvolvimento de software","Linguagens de programação","Tecnologia da informação"],"ru":["Kotlin","Разработка Android","Gradle Kotlin DSL","Приложения Android","Программирование Android","Мобильные технологии","Разработка программного обеспечения","Языки программирования","Информационные технологии"],"ar":["Kotlin","تطوير أندرويد","Gradle Kotlin DSL","تطبيقات أندرويد","برمجة أندرويد","تقنيات الجوال","تطوير البرمجيات","لغات البرمجة","تكنولوجيا المعلومات"]}},"owner":"dralgorhythm","repo":"claude-agentic-framework","repoPath":"dralgorhythm/claude-agentic-framework","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kotlin","description":"Write Kotlin code for Android following best practices. Use when developing with Jetpack Compose, Android SDK, or Kotlin projects. Covers coroutines, state management, and tooling.","bodyPreview":"# Kotlin / Android Development\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Gradle Kotlin DSL\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\npluginManagement {\n    repositories {\n        google()\n        mavenCentral()\n        gradlePluginPortal()\n    }\n}\n\ndependencyResolutionManagement {\n    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.FAIL_ON_PROJECT_REPOS)\n    repositories {\n        google()\n        mavenCentral()\n    }\n}\n\nrootProject.name = \"MyApp\"\ninclude(\":app\")\n```\n\n### build.gradle.kts (app)\n```kotlin\nplugins {\n    alias(libs.plu","body":"# Kotlin / Android Development\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Gradle Kotlin DSL\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\npluginManagement {\n    repositories {\n        google()\n        mavenCentral()\n        gradlePluginPortal()\n    }\n}\n\ndependencyResolutionManagement {\n    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.FAIL_ON_PROJECT_REPOS)\n    repositories {\n        google()\n        mavenCentral()\n    }\n}\n\nrootProject.name = \"MyApp\"\ninclude(\":app\")\n```\n\n### build.gradle.kts (app)\n```kotlin\nplugins {\n    alias(libs.plugins.android.application)\n    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.android)\n    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.compose)\n}\n\nandroid {\n    namespace = \"com.example.myapp\"\n    compileSdk = 35\n\n    defaultConfig {\n        applicationId = \"com.example.myapp\"\n        minSdk = 26\n        targetSdk = 35\n        versionCode = 1\n        versionName = \"1.0\"\n    }\n\n    buildFeatures {\n        compose = true\n    }\n\n    compileOptions {\n        sourceCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17\n        targetCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17\n    }\n\n    kotlinOptions {\n        jvmTarget = \"17\"\n    }\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    implementation(libs.androidx.core.ktx)\n    implementation(libs.androidx.lifecycle.runtime.ktx)\n    implementation(libs.androidx.activity.compose)\n    implementation(platform(libs.androidx.compose.bom))\n    implementation(libs.androidx.ui)\n    implementation(libs.androidx.material3)\n\n    testImplementation(libs.junit)\n    androidTestImplementation(libs.androidx.junit)\n    androidTestImplementation(libs.androidx.espresso.core)\n}\n```\n\n### Version Catalog (libs.versions.toml)\n```toml\n[versions]\nkotlin = \"2.0.0\"\ncompose-bom = \"2024.06.00\"\nlifecycle = \"2.8.0\"\n\n[libraries]\nandroidx-core-ktx = { group = \"androidx.core\", name = \"core-ktx\", version = \"1.13.1\" }\nandroidx-lifecycle-runtime-ktx = { group = \"androidx.lifecycle\", name = \"lifecycle-runtime-ktx\", version.ref = \"lifecycle\" }\nandroidx-compose-bom = { group = \"androidx.compose\", name = \"compose-bom\", version.ref = \"compose-bom\" }\n\n[plugins]\nandroid-application = { id = \"com.android.application\", version = \"8.5.0\" }\nkotlin-android = { id = \"org.jetbrains.kotlin.android\", version.ref = \"kotlin\" }\nkotlin-compose = { id = \"org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose\", version.ref = \"kotlin\" }\n```\n\n## Type Patterns\n\n### Null Safety\n```kotlin\n// Safe call operator\nval length = name?.length\n\n// Elvis operator\nval displayName = user?.name ?: \"Guest\"\n\n// Safe cast\nval number = value as? Int\n\n// Not-null assertion (use sparingly)\nval name = user!!.name\n\n// let for null checks\nuser?.let { safeUser ->\n    println(safeUser.name)\n}\n```\n\n### Sealed Classes\n```kotlin\nsealed class Result<out T> {\n    data class Success<T>(val data: T) : Result<T>()\n    data class Error(val exception: Throwable) : Result<Nothing>()\n    data object Loading : Result<Nothing>()\n}\n\n// Exhaustive when\nfun handleResult(result: Result<User>) = when (result) {\n    is Result.Success -> showUser(result.data)\n    is Result.Error -> showError(result.exception)\n    Result.Loading -> showLoading()\n}\n```\n\n### Data Classes\n```kotlin\ndata class User(\n    val id: String,\n    val email: String,\n    val name: String,\n    val createdAt: Instant = Instant.now()\n)\n\n// Copy with modifications\nval updatedUser = user.copy(name = \"New Name\")\n\n// Destructuring\nval (id, email, name) = user\n```\n\n### Value Classes\n```kotlin\n@JvmInline\nvalue class UserId(val value: String)\n\n@JvmInline\nvalue class Email(val value: String) {\n    init {\n        require(value.contains(\"@\")) { \"Invalid email\" }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Result Type\n```kotlin\nfun parseNumber(input: String): Result<Int> {\n    return try {\n        Result.success(input.toInt())\n    } catch (e: NumberFormatException) {\n        Result.failure(e)\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage\nparseNumber(\"123\")\n    .onSuccess { number -> println(\"Parsed: $number\") }\n    .onFailure { error -> println(\"Error: ${error.message}\") }\n\n// Transform\nval doubled = parseNumber(\"42\")\n    .map { it * 2 }\n    .getOrDefault(0)\n```\n\n### runCatching\n```kotlin\nval result = runCatching {\n    riskyOperation()\n}.getOrElse { error ->\n    logError(error)\n    defaultValue\n}\n\n// Chain operations\nrunCatching { fetchUser(id) }\n    .mapCatching { user -> processUser(user) }\n    .onSuccess { result -> display(result) }\n    .onFailure { error -> showError(error) }\n```\n\n## Coroutines\n\n### Basic Coroutines\n```kotlin\n// Suspend function\nsuspend fun fetchUser(id: String): User {\n    return withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n        api.getUser(id)\n    }\n}\n\n// Launch coroutine\nviewModelScope.launch {\n    try {\n        val user = fetchUser(\"123\")\n        _uiState.value = UiState.Success(user)\n    } catch (e: Exception) {\n        _uiState.value = UiState.Error(e.message)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Flow\n```kotlin\n// Create flow\nfun observeUsers(): Flow<List<User>> = flow {\n    while (true) {\n        emit(repository.getUsers())\n        delay(5000)\n    }\n}.flowOn(Dispatchers.IO)\n\n// Collect flow\nviewModelScope.launch {\n    observeUsers()\n        .catch { e -> emit(emptyList()) }\n        .collect { users ->\n            _users.value = users\n        }\n}\n```\n\n### StateFlow\n```kotlin\nclass UserViewModel : ViewModel() {\n    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow<UiState>(UiState.Loading)\n    val uiState: StateFlow<UiState> = _uiState.asStateFlow()\n\n    fun loadUser(id: String) {\n        viewModelScope.launch {\n            _uiState.value = UiState.Loading\n            try {\n                val user = repository.getUser(id)\n                _uiState.value = UiState.Success(user)\n            } catch (e: Exception) {\n                _uiState.value = UiState.Error(e.message ?: \"Unknown error\")\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Jetpack Compose\n\n### Basic Composable\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun Greeting(name: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {\n    Text(\n        text = \"Hello, $name!\",\n        modifier = modifier.padding(16.dp),\n        style = MaterialTheme.typography.headlineMedium\n    )\n}\n\n@Preview(showBackground = true)\n@Composable\nfun GreetingPreview() {\n    MyAppTheme {\n        Greeting(\"Android\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### State Management\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun Counter() {\n    var count by remember { mutableIntStateOf(0) }\n\n    Column(\n        modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),\n        horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally\n    ) {\n        Text(\n            text = \"Count: $count\",\n            style = MaterialTheme.typography.headlineMedium\n        )\n        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n        Button(onClick = { count++ }) {\n            Text(\"Increment\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### ViewModel Integration\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun UserScreen(\n    viewModel: UserViewModel = hiltViewModel()\n) {\n    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()\n\n    when (val state = uiState) {\n        is UiState.Loading -> CircularProgressIndicator()\n        is UiState.Success -> UserContent(state.user)\n        is UiState.Error -> ErrorMessage(state.message)\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nfun UserContent(user: User) {\n    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n        Text(user.name, style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleLarge)\n        Text(user.email, style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Side Effects\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun UserDetailScreen(userId: String, viewModel: UserViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {\n    // Run once when userId changes\n    LaunchedEffect(userId) {\n        viewModel.loadUser(userId)\n    }\n\n    // Run on every recomposition\n    SideEffect {\n        analytics.trackScreen(\"UserDetail\")\n    }\n\n    // Cleanup when leaving composition\n    DisposableEffect(Unit) {\n        val listener = viewModel.addListener()\n        onDispose {\n            listener.remove()\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n### Unit Tests (JUnit 5)\n```kotlin\nclass UserViewModelTest {\n    @Test\n    fun `loadUser updates state to success`() = runTest {\n        val repository = mockk<UserRepository>()\n        coEvery { repository.getUser(\"123\") } returns User(\"123\", \"test@example.com\")\n\n        val viewModel = UserViewModel(repository)\n        viewModel.loadUser(\"123\")\n\n        assertEquals(\n            UiState.Success(User(\"123\", \"test@example.com\")),\n            viewModel.uiState.value\n        )\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun `loadUser updates state to error on failure`() = runTest {\n        val repository = mockk<UserRepository>()\n        coEvery { repository.getUser(any()) } throws IOException(\"Network error\")\n\n        val viewModel = UserViewModel(repository)\n        viewModel.loadUser(\"123\")\n\n        assertTrue(viewModel.uiState.value is UiState.Error)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Compose UI Tests\n```kotlin\nclass UserScreenTest {\n    @get:Rule\n    val composeTestRule = createComposeRule()\n\n    @Test\n    fun displaysUserName() {\n        val user = User(\"1\", \"test@example.com\", \"John Doe\")\n\n        composeTestRule.setContent {\n            MyAppTheme {\n                UserContent(user = user)\n            }\n        }\n\n        composeTestRule.onNodeWithText(\"John Doe\").assertIsDisplayed()\n        composeTestRule.onNodeWithText(\"test@example.com\").assertIsDisplayed()\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    fun buttonClickIncrementsCounter() {\n        composeTestRule.setContent {\n            MyAppTheme {\n                Counter()\n            }\n        }\n\n        composeTestRule.onNodeWithText(\"Count: 0\").assertIsDisplayed()\n        composeTestRule.onNodeWithText(\"Increment\").performClick()\n        composeTestRule.onNodeWithText(\"Count: 1\").assertIsDisplayed()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Tooling\n\n```bash\n# Build\n./gradlew build\n./gradlew assembleDebug\n./gradlew assembleRelease\n\n# Run tests\n./gradlew test                          # Unit tests\n./gradlew connectedAndroidTest          # Instrumented tests\n\n# Linting\n./gradlew detekt                        # Code smells\n./gradlew ktlintCheck                   # Style check\n./gradlew ktlintFormat                  # Auto-fix style\n\n# Code analysis\n./gradlew lint                          # Android Lint\n\n# Clean\n./gradlew clean\n```\n\n### detekt.yml\n```yaml\nbuild:\n  maxIssues: 0\n\ncomplexity:\n  LongMethod:\n    threshold: 30\n  ComplexCondition:\n    threshold: 4\n\nstyle:\n  MaxLineLength:\n    maxLineLength: 120\n  WildcardImport:\n    active: true\n\nnaming:\n  FunctionNaming:\n    functionPattern: ''[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]*''\n```\n\n### .editorconfig (ktlint)\n```ini\n[*.{kt,kts}]\nindent_size = 4\nmax_line_length = 120\nktlint_code_style = android_studio\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:42:01.902Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Android Development Agents seeking to leverage Kotlin''s concise syntax and robust Gradle Kotlin DSL for efficient project setup.","zh":"适用于希望利用Kotlin简洁语法和强大的Gradle Kotlin DSL进行高效项目设置的Android开发代理。","ja":"Android開発エージェントがKotlinの簡潔な構文と強力なGradle Kotlin DSLを利用して効率的なプロジェクト設定を行いたい場合に適しています。","ko":"Android 개발 에이전트가 Kotlin의 간결한 구문과 강력한 Gradle Kotlin DSL을 사용하여 효율적인 프로젝트 설정을 수행하려는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Android que buscan aprovechar la sintaxis concisa de Kotlin y el DSL de Kotlin de Gradle robusto para una configuración de proyecto eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Android qui cherchent à exploiter la syntaxe concise de Kotlin et le DSL Kotlin robuste de Gradle pour une configuration de projet efficace.","de":"Ideal für Android-Entwicklungsagenten, die die knappe Syntax von Kotlin und das robuste Gradle-Kotlin-DSL für eine effiziente Projektsetup nutzen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Android que buscam aproveitar a sintaxe concisa do Kotlin e o robusto Gradle Kotlin DSL para configuração de projeto eficiente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Android, стремящихся использовать краткий синтаксис Kotlin и мощный Gradle Kotlin DSL для эффективной настройки проекта.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين للهواتف الذكية الذين يسعون إلى الاستفادة من بنية الكوتلين الموجزة وقوة Gradle Kotlin DSL لإعداد المشروع الفعال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage dependencies with Gradle Plugin Portal, resolve repositories with Maven Central, and configure project structures using Kotlin DSL, enabling seamless integration with Android apps.","zh":"赋予代理管理依赖项的能力，使用Gradle插件门户，使用Maven Central解决仓库，并使用Kotlin DSL配置项目结构，从而实现与Android应用程序的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが依存関係を管理することを可能にし、Gradleプラグインポータルで依存関係を管理し、Maven Centralでリポジトリを解決し、Kotlin DSLでプロジェクト構造を構成することで、Androidアプリとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 의존성을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Gradle 플러그인 포털에서 의존성을 관리하고, Maven Central에서 리포지토리를 해결하며, Kotlin DSL을 사용하여 프로젝트 구조를 구성하여 Android 애플리케이션과 무결점 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes administrar dependencias con Gradle Plugin Portal, resolver repositorios con Maven Central y configurar estructuras de proyecto utilizando Kotlin DSL, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con aplicaciones de Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les dépendances avec le portail de plugins Gradle, de résoudre les référentiels avec Maven Central et de configurer les structures de projet à l''aide de Kotlin DSL, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec les applications Android.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Abhängigkeiten mit dem Gradle-Plugin-Portal zu verwalten, Repositorys mit Maven Central aufzulösen und Projektstrukturen mit Kotlin-DSL zu konfigurieren, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Android-Apps ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar dependências com o Gradle Plugin Portal, resolver repositórios com o Maven Central e configurar estruturas de projeto usando o Kotlin DSL, permitindo uma integração perfeita com aplicativos Android.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять зависимостями с помощью Gradle Plugin Portal, решать репозитории с помощью Maven Central и настраивать структуры проекта с помощью Kotlin DSL, обеспечивая беспрепятственную интеграцию с приложениями Android.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الإعتماديات باستخدام بوابة الإضافة Gradle، وحل المشكلات المتعلقة بالمخازن باستخدام المركز مافن، وتكوين هيكل المشروع باستخدام Kotlin DSL، مما يتيح التكامل السلس مع تطبيقات الهواتف الذكية."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Gradle builds for Android projects","Managing dependencies with Maven Central and Gradle Plugin Portal","Setting up repository modes for efficient project resolution"],"zh":["为Android项目配置Gradle构建","使用Maven Central和Gradle插件门户管理依赖项","为高效的项目解析设置仓库模式"],"ja":["Androidプロジェクト用のGradleビルドを構成する","Maven CentralとGradleプラグインポータルを使用して依存関係を管理する","効率的なプロジェクト解決のためにリポジトリモードを設定する"],"ko":["Android 프로젝트용 Gradle 빌드를 구성하는 것","Maven Central 및 Gradle 플러그인 포털을 사용하여 의존성을 관리하는 것","효율적인 프로젝트 해결을 위한 저장소 모드를 설정하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de compilaciones de Gradle para proyectos de Android","Administración de dependencias con Maven Central y Gradle Plugin Portal","Configuración de modos de repositorio para una resolución de proyecto eficiente"],"fr":["Configuration des builds Gradle pour les projets Android","Gestion des dépendances avec Maven Central et le portail de plugins Gradle","Configuration des modes de référentiel pour une résolution de projet efficace"],"de":["Konfiguration von Gradle-Builds für Android-Projekte","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten mit Maven Central und Gradle-Plugin-Portal","Einrichtung von Repository-Modi für eine effiziente Projekt-auflösung"],"pt":["Configurando compilações Gradle para projetos Android","Gerenciando dependências com Maven Central e Gradle Plugin Portal","Definindo modos de repositório para resolução de projeto eficiente"],"ru":["Настройка сборок Gradle для проектов Android","Управление зависимостями с помощью Maven Central и Gradle Plugin Portal","Установка режимов репозитория для эффективного разрешения проекта"],"ar":["تكوين عمليات بناء Gradle لمشاريع الهواتف الذكية","إدارة الإعتماديات باستخدام المركز مافن وبوابة الإضافة Gradle","تحديد أوضاع المخزن لحل المشكلات المتعلقة بالمشروع بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gradle and Kotlin setup","Specific to Android development","Kotlin DSL expertise necessary"],"zh":["需要Gradle和Kotlin设置","仅限Android开发","需要Kotlin DSL专业知识"],"ja":["GradleとKotlinの設定が必要","Android開発に限定される","Kotlin DSLの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["Gradle 및 Kotlin 설정이 필요","Android 개발에만 해당","Kotlin DSL 전문 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Gradle y Kotlin","Específico para el desarrollo de Android","Se requiere experiencia en Kotlin DSL"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Gradle et de Kotlin","Spécifique au développement Android","Une expertise en Kotlin DSL est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Gradle- und Kotlin-Setup","Spezifisch für die Android-Entwicklung","Kotlin-DSL-Expertise ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Gradle e Kotlin","Específico para desenvolvimento Android","Necessário conhecimento especializado em Kotlin DSL"],"ru":["Требует настройки Gradle и Kotlin","Специфичен для разработки Android","Необходимо владение Kotlin DSL"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Gradle و Kotlin","محدد لتطوير الهواتف الذكية","مطلوب خبرة في Kotlin DSL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
