 für DevTools","Validierung von Tools wie mise und fnox","Integration mit infisical","Verbesserung des Entwicklungsprozesses","Erhöhung der Produktivität"],"pt":["Configurações personalizadas para mise","Integração com fnox","Suporte a infisical","Validação de ferramentas","Instalação fácil com curl","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Персонализированные конфигурации для mise","Интеграция с fnox","Поддержка infisical","Валидация инструментов","Легкая установка с помощью curl","Дetailed документация"],"ar":["إعدادات مخصصة ل mise","التكامل مع fnox","دعم infisical","تحقق من أدوات","التثبيت السهل مع curl","وثائق مفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DevTools Secrets","mise","fnox","infisical","开发者工具","工具链","生产力提高"],"ja":["DevTools Secrets","mise","fnox","infisical","デベロッパー ツール","ツール チェーン","生産性の向上"],"ko":["DevTools Secrets","mise","fnox","infisical","개발자 도구","도구 체인","생산성 향상"],"es":["DevTools","Claude Code","mise","fnox","infisical","desarrollo de software","productividad","flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["DevTools","Claude Code","mise","fnox","infisical","développement de logiciels","productivité","flux de travail"],"de":["DevTools","Claude Code","mise","fnox","infisical","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","Arbeitsablauf"],"pt":["DevTools","mise","fnox","infisical","desenvolvimento","produtividade","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","configurações personalizadas","validação de ferramentas"],"ru":["DevTools","mise","fnox","infisical","разработка","производительность","инструменты разработки","персонализированные конфигурации","валидация инструментов"],"ar":["DevTools","mise","fnox","infisical","التطوير","الإنتاجية","أدوات التطوير","إعدادات مخصصة","تحقق من أدوات"]}},"owner":"basher83","repo":"lunar-claude","repoPath":"basher83/lunar-claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devtools-secrets","description":">","bodyPreview":"# DevTools Secrets\n\nKnowledge and guardrails for the **mise + fnox + infisical** secrets toolchain.\n\n## Toolchain Validation\n\n**IMPORTANT: Check tool availability before proceeding with any guidance.**\n\n- mise: !`command -v mise >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(mise --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: curl https://mise.run | sh\"`\n- fnox: !`command -v fnox >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(fnox --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install","body":"# DevTools Secrets\n\nKnowledge and guardrails for the **mise + fnox + infisical** secrets toolchain.\n\n## Toolchain Validation\n\n**IMPORTANT: Check tool availability before proceeding with any guidance.**\n\n- mise: !`command -v mise >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(mise --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: curl https://mise.run | sh\"`\n- fnox: !`command -v fnox >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(fnox --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: mise use -g fnox\"`\n- infisical: !`command -v infisical >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(infisical --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: mise use -g infisical\"`\n\nIf any tool above shows **MISSING**, stop and help the user install it before\nproceeding. Do not provide configuration guidance for tools that aren''t\ninstalled.\n\n## Project Config State\n\n- fnox.toml: !`test -f fnox.toml && echo \"YES\" || echo \"NO (run: fnox init)\"`\n- .infisical.json: !`test -f .infisical.json && cat .infisical.json || echo \"NO (run: infisical init)\"`\n- mise.toml env section: !`grep -A5 ''^\\[env\\]'' mise.toml 2>/dev/null || echo \"No env section\"`\n\n## System/Global Config\n\n- mise global config: !`test -f ~/.config/mise/config.toml && head -10 ~/.config/mise/config.toml || echo \"No global mise config\"`\n- fnox global config: !`test -f ~/.config/fnox/config.toml && head -10 ~/.config/fnox/config.toml || echo \"No global fnox config\"`\n- infisical logged in: !`infisical user get 2>/dev/null | head -3 || echo \"Not logged in or not installed\"`\n\n## Tool Roles\n\n| Tool | Role |\n|------|------|\n| **mise** | Task runner + env manager. Orchestrates dev tooling, runs tasks, manages env vars through plugins. |\n| **fnox** | Unified secret interface. Abstracts over multiple secret backends (infisical, age, env files) with a single CLI. |\n| **infisical** | Remote secrets backend. Stores, syncs, and injects secrets from a central server. |\n\nThese tools complement each other: infisical stores secrets remotely, fnox\nprovides a unified local interface to them, and mise orchestrates tasks that\nconsume secrets via fnox.\n\n## Integration Chain\n\nThe typical flow:\n\n1. **fnox.toml** defines infisical as a provider with project/environment config\n2. **`fnox exec --`** resolves secrets from the provider and injects them as env vars\n3. **mise tasks** can wrap `fnox exec` to run commands with secrets injected\n4. Alternatively, **mise env plugins** can call fnox directly for auto-injection on `cd`\n\n## Secrets Enforcement\n\nThis project enforces secrets hygiene via **always-on hooks** in\n`.claude/settings.json` (not scoped to this skill):\n\n- **`block-hardcoded-secrets.py`** — Blocks Edit/Write operations containing\n  hardcoded API keys, tokens, passwords, or known secret prefixes (sk-, ghp_,\n  AKIA, xox[bpras]-)\n- **`block-bare-secret-exports.py`** — Blocks Bash commands that `export`\n  secret-like env vars without wrapping in `fnox exec` or `infisical run`\n\nThese hooks are always active regardless of whether this skill is loaded.\n\n## Configuration Patterns\n\nDetailed configuration for each tool is in the reference files:\n\n- @references/mise-integration.md — mise env plugins, tasks, fnox integration\n- @references/fnox-configuration.md — fnox.toml structure, providers, profiles\n- @references/infisical-patterns.md — infisical CLI, scanning, CI/CD\n\n## Gotchas\n\n- **Order matters**: fnox.toml must exist before `fnox exec` works. Run\n  `fnox init` if missing.\n- **Profile mismatches**: fnox profiles (dev/staging/prod) must match infisical\n  environment slugs. A mismatch silently returns empty secrets.\n- **`.infisical.json` is safe to commit** — it contains project IDs and\n  workspace config, not secrets.\n- **`fnox.toml` may contain sensitive paths** — review before committing if\n  using age-encrypted file provider.\n- **mise env plugins run on `cd`** — if a plugin calls fnox and fnox is\n  misconfigured, you get errors on every directory change.\n- **infisical auth expires** — `infisical login` tokens have a TTL. CI/CD\n  should use `INFISICAL_TOKEN` (service token) instead.\n- **Token path scope is explicit** — a service token scoped to `/` cannot\n  access secrets in child paths like `/git_actions`. Each path requires its\n  own token or use `--recursive` with the CLI directly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:42:12.659Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Agents needing secure secret management with mise, fnox, and infisical toolchains.","zh":"非常适合需要使用mise、fnox和infisical工具链进行安全密钥管理的高级代理。","ja":"Mise、Fnox、Infisicalツールチェーンを使用してセキュアなシークレット管理を行う必要がある高度なエージェントに最適です。","ko":"mise, fnox 및 infisical 도구 체인을 사용하여 보안 시크릿 관리가 필요한 고급 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Avanzados que requieren una gestión segura de secretos con mise, fnox y cadenas de herramientas infisical.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Avancés ayant besoin d''une gestion sécurisée des secrets avec mise, fnox et les chaînes d''outils infisical.","de":"Perfekt für Advanced Agents, die eine sichere Verwaltung von Geheimnissen mit mise, fnox und infisical-Toolchains benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Avançados que necessitam de gerenciamento seguro de segredos com mise, fnox e cadeias de ferramentas infisical.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов, которым требуется безопасное управление секретами с помощью mise, fnox и инструментальных цепочек infisical.","ar":"مثالي لعميل متقدم يحتاج إلى إدارة الآمن للمعلومات السرية مع mise و fnox وسلاسل الأدوات infisical."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage secrets securely using the mise, fnox, and infisical toolchain, providing toolchain validation and version control through commands like `mise --version` and `fnox --version`, and ensuring proper installation with protocols like `curl https://mise.run | sh`.","zh":"赋予代理安全地使用mise、fnox和infisical工具链管理密钥的能力，通过命令如`mise --version`和`fnox --version`提供工具链验证和版本控制，并通过协议如`curl https://mise.run | sh`确保正确安装。","ja":"Mise、Fnox、Infisicalツールチェーンを使用してシークレットを安全に管理するエージェントの能力を提供し、`mise --version`および`fnox --version`などのコマンドを使用してツールチェーンの検証とバージョン管理を行い、`curl https://mise.run | sh`などのプロトコルを使用して正しいインストールを確保します。","ko":"mise, fnox 및 infisical 도구 체인을 사용하여 시크릿을 안전하게 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, `mise --version` 및 `fnox --version`와 같은 명령어를 사용하여 도구 체인의 검증 및 버전 관리를 수행하며, `curl https://mise.run | sh`와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 올바른 설치를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar secretos de forma segura utilizando la cadena de herramientas mise, fnox e infisical, proporcionando una validación de la cadena de herramientas y control de versiones a través de comandos como `mise --version` y `fnox --version`, y asegurando una instalación adecuada con protocolos como `curl https://mise.run | sh`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les secrets de manière sécurisée en utilisant la chaîne d''outils mise, fnox et infisical, en fournissant une validation de la chaîne d''outils et un contrôle de version via des commandes comme `mise --version` et `fnox --version`, et en assurant une installation correcte avec des protocoles comme `curl https://mise.run | sh`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Geheimnisse sicher zu verwalten, indem sie die mise-, fnox- und infisical-Toolchain verwenden, wodurch die Toolchain-Validierung und Versionskontrolle über Befehle wie `mise --version` und `fnox --version` sowie eine ordnungsgemäße Installation mit Protokollen wie `curl https://mise.run | sh` gewährleistet ist.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar segredos de forma segura usando a cadeia de ferramentas mise, fnox e infisical, fornecendo validação da cadeia de ferramentas e controle de versão por meio de comandos como `mise --version` e `fnox --version`, e garantindo a instalação correta com protocolos como `curl https://mise.run | sh`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасно управлять секретами с помощью инструментальных цепочек mise, fnox и infisical, обеспечивая валидацию цепочки инструментов и контроль версий посредством команд типа `mise --version` и `fnox --version`, а также гарантируя правильную установку по протоколам типа `curl https://mise.run | sh`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة المعلومات السرية بأمان باستخدام سلاسل الأدوات mise و fnox و infisical، وتوفير التحقق من سلاسل الأدوات ومراقبة الإصدارات من خلال أوامر مثل `mise --version` و `fnox --version`، وضمان التثبيت الصحيح بالبروتوكولات مثل `curl https://mise.run | sh`."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating toolchain availability with `command -v`","Installing missing tools like mise and fnox","Managing secrets with infisical"],"zh":["使用`command -v`验证工具链可用性","安装缺失的工具，如mise和fnox","使用infisical管理密钥"],"ja":["`command -v`を使用してツールチェーンの可用性を検証する","MiseやFnoxなどの不足しているツールをインストールする","Infisicalを使用してシークレットを管理する"],"ko":["`command -v`를 사용하여 도구 체인의 가용성을 검증하는 것","mise 및 fnox와 같은缺失된 도구를 설치하는 것","infisical을 사용하여 시크릿을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Validar la disponibilidad de la cadena de herramientas con `command -v`","Instalar herramientas que faltan como mise y fnox","Gestionar secretos con infisical"],"fr":["Valider la disponibilité de la chaîne d''outils avec `command -v`","Installer des outils manquants comme mise et fnox","Gérer les secrets avec infisical"],"de":["Die Verfügbarkeit der Toolchain mit `command -v` überprüfen","Fehlende Tools wie mise und fnox installieren","Geheimnisse mit infisical verwalten"],"pt":["Validar a disponibilidade da cadeia de ferramentas com `command -v`","Instalar ferramentas ausentes como mise e fnox","Gerenciar segredos com infisical"],"ru":["Проверка наличия инструментальной цепочки с помощью `command -v`","Установка отсутствующих инструментов, таких как mise и fnox","Управление секретами с помощью infisical"],"ar":["التحقق من توافر سلاسل الأدوات باستخدام `command -v`","تثبيت أدوات مفقودة مثل mise و fnox","إدارة المعلومات السرية باستخدام infisical"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of mise, fnox, and infisical","Dependent on command-line interface availability","Version compatibility issues may arise with mise and fnox"],"zh":["需要安装mise、fnox和infisical","依赖于命令行接口的可用性","可能会出现mise和fnox的版本兼容性问题"],"ja":["Mise、Fnox、Infisicalのインストールが必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスの可用性に依存している","MiseとFnoxのバージョン互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["mise, fnox 및 infisical의 설치가 필요합니다.","명령줄 인터페이스의 가용성에 의존합니다.","mise 및 fnox의 버전 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación de mise, fnox y infisical","Depende de la disponibilidad de la interfaz de línea de comandos","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad de versiones con mise y fnox"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de mise, fnox et infisical","Dépend de la disponibilité de l''interface de ligne de commande","Des problèmes de compatibilité de version peuvent survenir avec mise et fnox"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von mise, fnox und infisical","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit der Kommandozeilenoberfläche ab","Versionskompatibilitätsprobleme können mit mise und fnox auftreten"],"pt":["Requer a instalação de mise, fnox e infisical","Dependente da disponibilidade da interface de linha de comando","Pode surgir problemas de compatibilidade de versão com mise e fnox"],"ru":["Требует установки mise, fnox и infisical","Зависит от наличия командной строки интерфейса","Могут возникнуть проблемы совместимости версий с mise и fnox"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت mise و fnox و infisical","يعتمد على توافر واجهة سطر الأوامر","قد تطرأ مشاكل في توافق الإصدارات مع mise و fnox"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
