ия","координация","эффективность","интеграция","внешние API","детерминированные операции","сложные операции"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أتمتة","تنسيق","كفاءة","تكامل","واجهات برمجة تطبيقات خارجية","عمليات متعينة","عمليات معقدة"]}},"owner":"arbgjr","repo":"sdlc_agentico","repoPath":"arbgjr/sdlc_agentico","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-name","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Skill Name\n\n> **Philosophy**: Default to natural language. Use scripts ONLY for deterministic operations, complex I/O, or external API integration.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n[Concise example showing the most common use case - assume Claude is smart]\n\n**Example**:\n```bash\n# Process document\npython3 scripts/process.py input.pdf --output result.txt\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- [Specific scenario 1]\n- [Specific scenario 2]\n- [Keyword trigger mentioned by user]\n\nDO NOT use when:\n-","body":"# Skill Name\n\n> **Philosophy**: Default to natural language. Use scripts ONLY for deterministic operations, complex I/O, or external API integration.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n[Concise example showing the most common use case - assume Claude is smart]\n\n**Example**:\n```bash\n# Process document\npython3 scripts/process.py input.pdf --output result.txt\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- [Specific scenario 1]\n- [Specific scenario 2]\n- [Keyword trigger mentioned by user]\n\nDO NOT use when:\n- [Alternative approach is better]\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: [Name]\n\n**Use when**: [Specific trigger or scenario]\n\n**Steps**:\n1. [Natural language instruction - be specific]\n2. [Conditional logic: If X, then Y; else Z]\n3. [Verification step]\n\n**Example**:\n```markdown\n1. Check if document exists: `ls docs/*.pdf`\n2. If PDF found: Extract text using `scripts/extract.py`\n3. If no PDF: Search for DOCX alternatives\n4. Validate output has non-zero size\n```\n\n**Common Issues**:\n- **Problem**: [What goes wrong]\n- **Solution**: [How to fix it]\n\n---\n\n### Workflow 2: [Name]\n\n[Follow same pattern as Workflow 1]\n\n---\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nFor detailed information, see:\n- [Topic A Details](reference/topic-a.md) - When working with X\n- [Topic B Details](reference/topic-b.md) - For advanced Y usage\n- [API Reference](reference/api.md) - All available functions\n\n> **Note**: Claude loads these files ONLY when needed (progressive disclosure).\n\n---\n\n## Scripts (ONLY when justified)\n\n### script-name.py\n\n**Why this script is needed**: [ONE of these justifications]:\n- ✅ Deterministic validation (e.g., schema validation, syntax checking)\n- ✅ External API integration (e.g., GitHub API, third-party service)\n- ✅ Complex I/O operation (e.g., scanning thousands of files, binary parsing)\n- ✅ Safety-critical operation (e.g., git worktree, database migrations)\n- ❌ **NOT for**: Pattern matching, text analysis, conditional logic (Claude is better)\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 scripts/script-name.py --arg value\n```\n\n**Arguments**:\n- `--arg`: Description\n\n**Output**:\n```\nExpected output format\n```\n\n**Error Handling**:\nScript handles these errors explicitly (doesn''t punt to Claude):\n- Missing input file → Creates default\n- Permission denied → Uses alternative path\n- Network timeout → Retries with backoff\n\n---\n\n### validation-script.sh\n\n**Why needed**: [Justification - e.g., \"Bash validation faster than Python for simple checks\"]\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\n./scripts/validation-script.sh file.txt\n```\n\n**Returns**:\n- Exit code 0: Valid\n- Exit code 1: Invalid (with error message)\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n### Run Tests\n\n```bash\n# Unit tests\npytest tests/unit/ -v\n\n# Integration tests\npytest tests/integration/ -v\n\n# Specific test\npytest tests/test_specific.py::test_function -v\n```\n\n### Test Coverage\n\nCurrent coverage: XX%\n\n```bash\npytest --cov=scripts --cov-report=html\nopen htmlcov/index.html\n```\n\n---\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: [Common Use Case]\n\n**Scenario**: [Describe the situation]\n\n**Input**:\n```\n[What user provides]\n```\n\n**Process**:\n```markdown\n1. Claude reads input\n2. Validates format\n3. Calls script if needed: `python3 scripts/process.py`\n4. Formats output\n```\n\n**Output**:\n```\n[What user gets]\n```\n\n---\n\n### Example 2: [Edge Case]\n\n[Same structure as Example 1]\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n### With Other Skills\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- **skill-a**: Use after this skill for [purpose]\n- **skill-b**: Call this skill if [condition]\n\n### With Agents\n\nAgents that use this skill:\n- **agent-x** (Phase Y): Uses for [specific task]\n- **agent-z** (Phase W): Calls during [workflow step]\n\n---\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Required | Default | Description |\n|----------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `VAR_NAME` | No | `default` | What this controls |\n\n### Settings File\n\nCreate `~/.config/skill-name/settings.yml`:\n\n```yaml\noption1: value1\noption2: value2\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**Issue**: Script fails with \"Module not found\"\n\n**Solution**:\n```bash\npip install required-package\n```\n\n---\n\n**Issue**: Permission denied\n\n**Solution**:\n```bash\nchmod +x scripts/*.sh\nchmod +x scripts/*.py\n```\n\n---\n\n**Issue**: Output is empty\n\n**Solution**:\nCheck input file format. Expected: [format description]\n\n---\n\n## Development\n\n### Adding New Features\n\n1. Create feature branch\n2. Add tests FIRST (TDD)\n3. Implement in natural language if possible\n4. Add script ONLY if justified\n5. Update SKILL.md\n6. Run tests: `pytest -v`\n\n### Code Style\n\n- **Natural language**: Clear, concise, assume Claude is smart\n- **Python**: PEP 8, type hints, docstrings\n- **Bash**: ShellCheck compliant\n\n---\n\n## Changelog\n\n### v1.0.0 (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- Initial release\n- Core workflows implemented\n- [Feature X] added\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [External Documentation](https://example.com)\n- [Related Pattern](../../corpus/nodes/patterns/PATTERN-*.yml)\n- [ADR](../../corpus/nodes/decisions/ADR-*.yml)\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ **DON''T**:\n- Create scripts for pattern matching (Claude is better)\n- Write Python for simple Bash operations\n- Add dependencies without justification\n- Create \"utils\" or \"helpers\" (be specific)\n\n✅ **DO**:\n- Default to natural language instructions\n- Use progressive disclosure for > 500 lines\n- Document why each script is needed\n- Test with Claude before assuming script is needed\n\n---\n\n**Skill maintained by**: [Team/Person]\n**Last updated**: YYYY-MM-DD\n**Questions**: Contact [channel/person]\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:42:18.684Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Software Development Agents needing automated code generation and lifecycle management.","zh":"非常适合需要自动代码生成和生命周期管理的软件开发代理。","ja":"自動コード生成とライフサイクル管理が必要なソフトウェア開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동 코드 생성 및 수명 주기 관리가 필요한 소프트웨어 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de software que necesitan generación de código automatizada y gestión del ciclo de vida.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de logiciels ayant besoin de génération de code automatisée et de gestion du cycle de vie.","de":"Perfekt für Software-Entwicklungsagenten, die automatisierte Codegenerierung und Lebenszyklusverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Software que necessitam de geração de código automatizada e gerenciamento de ciclo de vida.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке программного обеспечения, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация кода и управление жизненным циклом.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير البرمجيات التي تحتاج إلى توليد تلقائي للرمز وتحكم دورة الحياة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate and coordinate the entire software development lifecycle using natural language and Python scripts for deterministic operations, complex I/O, or external API integration, supporting file formats like .pdf and .txt.","zh":"赋予代理人使用自然语言和Python脚本来自动化和协调整个软件开发生命周期的能力，用于确定性操作、复杂I/O或外部API集成，支持.pdf和.txt等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントが自然言語とPythonスクリプトを使用して、決定性操作、複雑なI/O、または外部API統合のためのソフトウェア開発ライフサイクル全体を自動化および調整できるようにします。.pdfや.txtなどのファイル形式がサポートされます。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어와 Python 스크립트를 사용하여 결정적 연산, 복잡한 입출력 또는 외부 API 통합을 위한 소프트웨어 개발 수명 주기의 전체를 자동화하고 조정할 수 있도록 합니다. .pdf 및 .txt와 같은 파일 형식이 지원됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar y coordinar todo el ciclo de vida del desarrollo de software utilizando lenguaje natural y scripts de Python para operaciones deterministas, I/O complejas o integración de API externa, y admite formatos de archivo como .pdf y .txt.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser et de coordonner l''ensemble du cycle de vie du développement de logiciels en utilisant le langage naturel et les scripts Python pour des opérations déterministes, des I/O complexes ou une intégration d''API externe, et prend en charge des formats de fichiers tels que .pdf et .txt.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den gesamten Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus mithilfe von natürlicher Sprache und Python-Skripten für deterministische Operationen, komplexe I/O oder externe API-Integration zu automatisieren und zu koordinieren, und unterstützt Dateiformate wie .pdf und .txt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar e coordenar todo o ciclo de vida do desenvolvimento de software usando linguagem natural e scripts Python para operações determinísticas, I/O complexas ou integração de API externa, suportando formatos de arquivo como .pdf e .txt.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать и координировать весь цикл разработки программного обеспечения с помощью естественного языка и скриптов Python для детерминированных операций, сложных ввода/вывода или интеграции внешних API, поддерживая форматы файлов, такие как .pdf и .txt.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تلقين وتعاون كامل لتحقيق دورة حياة تطوير البرامج باستخدام اللغة الطبيعية والسكريبتات بايثون للعمليات الحتمية أو مدخلات/مخرجات معقدة أو دمج واجهات برمجة تطبيقات خارجية، مع دعم صيغ الملفات مثل .pdf و .txt."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating software development workflows","Generating code snippets from natural language inputs","Coordinating collaborative development projects"],"zh":["自动化软件开发工作流程","从自然语言输入生成代码片段","协调协作开发项目"],"ja":["ソフトウェア開発ワークフローの自動化","自然言語入力からコードスニペットの生成","共同開発プロジェクトの調整"],"ko":["소프트웨어 개발 워크플로의 자동화","자연어 입력으로부터 코드 스니펫의 생성","공동 개발 프로젝트의 조정"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de software","Generación de fragmentos de código a partir de entradas de lenguaje natural","Coordinación de proyectos de desarrollo colaborativos"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de développement de logiciels","Génération de fragments de code à partir d''entrées de langage naturel","Coordination de projets de développement collaboratifs"],"de":["Automatisierung von Software-Entwicklungsworkflows","Generierung von Code-Snippets aus natürlichen Spracheneingaben","Koordinierung von kollaborativen Entwicklungsprojekten"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de software","Gerar trechos de código a partir de entradas de linguagem natural","Coordenar projetos de desenvolvimento colaborativo"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов разработки программного обеспечения","Генерация фрагментов кода из входных данных естественного языка","Координация совместных проектов разработки"],"ar":["تحويل سير عمل تطوير البرامج إلى تلقائي","توليد شذرات من الرمز من مدخلات اللغة الطبيعية","تنسيق مشاريع تطوير مشتركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x","Limited to deterministic operations and external API integrations via scripts"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x","仅限于通过脚本的确定性操作和外部API集成"],"ja":["Python 3.xが必要","スクリプトによる決定性操作と外部API統合のみに限定"],"ko":["Python 3.x가 필요","스크립트를 통한 결정적 연산 및 외부 API 통합에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.x","Limitado a operaciones deterministas y integraciones de API externa a través de scripts"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.x","Limité aux opérations déterministes et aux intégrations d''API externes via des scripts"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.x","Begrenzt auf deterministische Operationen und externe API-Integrationen über Skripte"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.x","Limitado a operações determinísticas e integrações de API externa via scripts"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3.x","Ограничен детерминированными операциями и интеграциями внешних API через скрипты"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3.x","محدود بالعمليات الحتمية ودمج واجهات برمجة تطبيقات خارجية عبر السكريبتات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
