:"agentic-product-prototyping"},"description":{"zh":"Agentic 产品原型设计是一种模块化的项目管理系统，通过 AI 助手实现产品的快速原型设计和开发","ja":"Agentic プロダクトプロトタイピングは、AI アシスタントによってプロダクトの迅速なプロトタイピングと開発を実現するモジュラーなプロジェクト管理システムです","ko":"Agentic 제품 프로토타이핑은 AI 보조를 통해 제품의 빠른 프로토타이핑 및 개발을 실현하는 모듈러 프로젝트 관리 시스템입니다","es":"El prototipado de producto Agentic es un sistema de gestión de productos modular que utiliza la IA para reducir los costos de creación de software","fr":"Le prototypage de produit Agentic est un système de gestion de produits modulaire qui utilise l''IA pour réduire les coûts de création de logiciels","de":"Das Agentic-Produkt-Prototyping ist ein modulares Produktmanagementsystem, das die KI nutzt, um die Kosten für die Softwareerstellung zu reduzieren","pt":"O sistema de gerenciamento de produtos agentic é uma abordagem modular para gerenciamento de produtos assistido por IA","ru":"Агентская система управления продуктами - это модульный подход к управлению продуктами с помощью ИИ","ar":"نظام إدارة المنتجات الذكي هو نهج تعاوني لتدبير المنتجات باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"A modular PM system for AI-assisted product management."},"definition":{"en":"A modular PM system for AI-assisted product management."},"features":{"zh":["AI 助手实现快速原型设计","模块化项目管理系统","减少软件开发成本","提高开发效率","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["AI アシスタントによる迅速なプロトタイピング","モジュラーなプロジェクト管理システム","ソフトウェア開発コストの削減","開発効率の向上","多種のプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["AI 보조를 통한 빠른 프로토타이핑","모듈러 프로젝트 관리 시스템","소프트웨어 개발 비용 감소","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 프로그래밍 언어 지원"],"es":["Sistema de gestión de productos modular","Codificación nativa de IA","Redución de costos de creación de software","Automatización del proceso de creación","Integración con agentes de IA"],"fr":["Système de gestion de produits modulaire","Codification native IA","Réduction des coûts de création de logiciels","Automatisation du processus de création","Intégration avec des agents IA"],"de":["Modulares Produktmanagementsystem","KI-native Codierung","Kostenreduzierung bei der Softwareerstellung","Automatisierung des Erstellungsprozesses","Integration mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["Criação de produtos de software de forma eficiente","Sistema de gerenciamento de produtos modular","Utilização de IA para criar e manter software","Redução do custo de criação de software","Foco em codificação nativa de IA"],"ru":["Эффективное создание программных продуктов","Модульная система управления продуктами","Использование ИИ для создания и поддержки программного обеспечения","Сокращение стоимости создания программного обеспечения","Фокус на родном кодировании ИИ"],"ar":["إنشاء منتجات البرمجيات بفعالية","نظام إدارة المنتجات التعاوني","استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنشاء وصيانة البرمجيات","تقليل تكلفة إنشاء البرمجيات","التركيز على البرمجة الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 产品原型设计","Agentic 产品原型","模块化项目管理","AI 助手","快速原型设计","软件开发"],"ja":["AI プロダクトプロトタイピング","Agentic プロダクトプロトタイピング","モジュラーなプロジェクト管理","AI アシスタント","迅速なプロトタイピング","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["AI 제품 프로토타이핑","Agentic 제품 프로토타이핑","모듈러 프로젝트 관리","AI 보조","빠른 프로토타이핑","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["prototipado de producto","desarrollo de software","IA","codificación nativa","reducción de costos","automatización","agentes de IA","gestión de productos"],"fr":["prototypage de produit","développement de logiciels","IA","codification native","réduction des coûts","automatisation","agents IA","gestion de produits"],"de":["Produkt-Prototyping","Software-Entwicklung","KI","KI-native Codierung","Kostenreduzierung","Automatisierung","KI-Agents","Produktmanagement"],"pt":["prototipagem de produto agentic","gerenciamento de produtos","IA","criação de software","redução de custos","codificação nativa de IA","desenvolvimento de software","produtos de software","sistema de gerenciamento de produtos"],"ru":["агентская прототипизация продукта","управление продуктами","ИИ","создание программного обеспечения","сокращение стоимости","родное кодирование ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения","программные продукты","система управления продуктами"],"ar":["نماذج إنتاج العميل الذكي","إدارة المنتجات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء البرمجيات","تقليل التكلفة","البرمجة الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","منتجات البرمجيات","نظام إدارة المنتجات"]}},"owner":"samarv","repo":"Shanon","repoPath":"samarv/Shanon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.459Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentic-product-prototyping","description":"Build functional software prototypes and MVPs without deep technical skills by using AI agents as developers in your pocket. Use this skill when you need to validate a new product concept, build custom back-office tools (e.g., a real estate data manager), or create high-fidelity demos to unblock engineering roadmaps.","bodyPreview":"# Agentic Product Prototyping\n\nThis skill allows product managers and founders to bypass the traditional \"design-to-engineering\" bottleneck by acting as a \"generative lead\" who directs AI agents to build, deploy, and maintain software. By focusing on \"AI-native coding\"—understanding system components and debugging rather than syntax—you can reduce the cost of software creation to near zero.\n\n## The Prototyping Workflow\n\n### 1. Draft the \"Super-Prompt\" (The PRD)\nInstead of a vague request, provid","body":"# Agentic Product Prototyping\n\nThis skill allows product managers and founders to bypass the traditional \"design-to-engineering\" bottleneck by acting as a \"generative lead\" who directs AI agents to build, deploy, and maintain software. By focusing on \"AI-native coding\"—understanding system components and debugging rather than syntax—you can reduce the cost of software creation to near zero.\n\n## The Prototyping Workflow\n\n### 1. Draft the \"Super-Prompt\" (The PRD)\nInstead of a vague request, provide a structured prompt that mimics a Product Requirement Document. Define the stack and core functionality immediately.\n- **Define the Stack:** Specify Node.js, React, or Python (or tell the agent to \"choose the best modern stack for a web app\").\n- **List Core Features:** Use bullet points for specific functionality (e.g., \"Voting system,\" \"Kanban board for status tracking,\" \"Admin dashboard\").\n- **Set Design Constraints:** Specify \"Modern UI,\" \"Responsive mobile view,\" or \"User-friendly dashboard.\"\n- **Define Data Persistence:** Explicitly ask for a database (e.g., Postgres) to ensure the app saves user data.\n\n### 2. Monitor the \"Multiplayer\" Session\nObserve the agent as it builds. Treat the agent as another user in your workspace.\n- **Watch the Progress Pane:** Monitor the installation of packages and database schema creation.\n- **Check for Proactive Fixes:** Agents often spot their own errors. Wait for the agent to attempt a self-repair before intervening.\n- **Verify via Screenshots:** Ask the agent to take a screenshot of the homepage to verify the UI is rendering correctly before you even open the app.\n\n### 3. Apply \"AI-Native\" Debugging\nWhen the agent gets stuck (the \"Gap\"), your role is to unblock it.\n- **Ask for the Admin Path:** If the agent builds an admin panel but you can''t find it, ask: \"How do I log into the admin panel?\" or \"Create an admin account for me using a SQL query.\"\n- **Iterate on UI Pixels:** Use an assistant-style tool for small adjustments. Example: \"Move this button 3 pixels to the left\" or \"Change the header color to match this hex code.\"\n- **Unblock Migrations:** If a feature requires a database change, ask the agent to \"Write the migration script\" or use a side-chat (like Claude or ChatGPT) to help you understand the error and feed the solution back to the agent.\n\n### 4. Deploy and Scale\n- **One-Click Deployment:** Use integrated cloud services (e.g., Replit''s Google Cloud abstraction) to get a live URL immediately.\n- **Maintenance:** Use the agent to run periodic SQL queries or update packages.\n- **Human-in-the-Loop:** If the agent reaches a fundamental architectural limit (like complex database sharding), use the prototype as a \"live PRD\" to hand off to a professional engineer.\n\n## Core Principles: \"Amjad''s Law\"\n- **ROI on Learning to Code:** The return on investment for learning to *read* and *debug* code (not write it from scratch) doubles every six months as AI agents become more powerful.\n- **Generative over Executional:** Your value shifts from \"managing a process\" to \"generating ideas.\" The faster you can generate and test ideas, the more successful the product.\n- **AI-Computer Interface (ACI):** Treat the environment as a computer designed for an AI. Give the agent tools (Shell access, SQL access, File editor) rather than just a chat box.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Internal Feature Request Dashboard**\n- **Context:** A PM needs a way for users to vote on upcoming features to help prioritize the roadmap.\n- **Input:** A prompt specifying: \"Build a Node.js web app where users can submit feature requests, upvote them, and I can move them from ''Planned'' to ''In Progress'' via an admin login.\"\n- **Application:** The agent builds the Postgres schema for votes, the React front-end, and the auth for the PM.\n- **Output:** A live URL the PM shares with the community to collect real data in 10 minutes.\n\n**Example 2: Marketing Competitive Pricing Tool**\n- **Context:** A Marketing Lead wants to monitor a competitor''s pricing daily without manual checks.\n- **Input:** \"Build a Python app that scrapes [Competitor URL] daily, saves the price of ''Product X'' to a database, and alerts me via Slack if it drops below $50.\"\n- **Application:** The agent sets up a cron job (scheduled task), handles the web scraping logic, and integrates the Slack API.\n- **Output:** A background tool that runs indefinitely, providing the team with a competitive edge.\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n- **The \"Git\" Trap:** Don''t waste time learning low-level version control (Git) or environment configuration. Let the agent manage the \"nonsense\" and focus only on the app''s logic and UI.\n- **Vague Iteration:** Avoid saying \"Make it better.\" Instead, say \"Add a comment thread to the feature request page\" or \"Change the font to Inter.\"\n- **Migration Errors:** AI agents can struggle with changing existing database structures. If an error occurs after adding a feature, ask the agent to \"Show me the current database schema and tell me why the last change failed.\"\n- **Over-Siloing:** Don''t wait for a \"final design\" to start building. Use the agent to build the functional prototype first, then use a Figma-to-Code extension to clean up the pixels."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:42:15.673Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced product management and prototyping capabilities through AI-native coding and generative leads.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，它们需要通过AI原生编码和生成式线索来实现高级产品管理和原型设计能力。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。AIネイティブコーディングとジェネレーティブリードを通じて、高度な製品管理とプロトタイピング機能を必要とするエージェントに適しています。","ko":"커서, 윈드서프, 클라우드 코드와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. AI 네이티브 코딩 및 생성 리드를 통해 고급 제품 관리 및 프로토 타이핑 기능이 필요한 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de productos y prototipado a través de codificación nativa de IA y generación de leads.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin de capacités avancées de gestion de produits et de prototypage via la codification native d''IA et la génération de leads.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die erweiterte Produktmanagement- und Prototyping-Funktionen durch KI-native Codierung und generative Leads benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de produtos e prototipagem por meio de codificação nativa de IA e leads gerativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления продуктами и прототипирования посредством кодирования, родного для ИИ, и генеративных лидов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الأعمال الذكي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة منتجات متقدمة وتصميم نماذج أولية من خلال برمجة الأعمال الأصلية وإدارة ليد جينيرتيف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bypass traditional design-to-engineering bottlenecks by directing AI agents to build, deploy, and maintain software, utilizing modular PM systems and understanding system components for near-zero cost software creation, leveraging AI-assisted product management and ''Super-Prompt'' drafting.","zh":"赋予代理绕过传统设计到工程瓶颈的能力，通过指导AI代理构建、部署和维护软件，利用模块化的产品管理系统和理解系统组件，以实现几乎零成本的软件创建，利用AI辅助的产品管理和''超级提示''草稿。","ja":"伝統的なデザインからエンジニアリングへのボトルネックを回避する能力をエージェントに与え、AIエージェントにソフトウェアを構築、デプロイ、メンテナンスするように指示し、モジュラーな製品管理システムとシステムコンポーネントの理解を利用して、ほぼゼロコストのソフトウェア作成を実現し、AIアシストされた製品管理と''スーパープロンプト''ドラフティングを利用します。","ko":"전통적인 설계에서 엔지니어링까지의 병목 현상을 피할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하여 AI 에이전트가 소프트웨어를 구축, 배포 및 유지 관리하도록 지시하고, 모듈화된 제품 관리 시스템 및 시스템 구성 요소 이해를 활용하여几乎 영 비용의 소프트웨어 생성을 달성하며, AI 지원 제품 관리 및 ''슈퍼 프롬프트'' 초안을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evitar cuellos de botella tradicionales de diseño a ingeniería al dirigir a los agentes de IA para construir, implementar y mantener software, utilizando sistemas de gestión de productos modulares y comprendiendo componentes del sistema para la creación de software de casi cero costo, aprovechando la gestión de productos asistida por IA y la redacción de ''Super-Prompt''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contourner les goulots d''étranglement traditionnels de la conception à l''ingénierie en dirigeant les agents d''IA pour construire, déployer et maintenir des logiciels, en utilisant des systèmes de gestion de produits modulaires et en comprenant les composants du système pour la création de logiciels à coût quasi nul, en exploitant la gestion de produits assistée par l''IA et la rédaction de ''Super-Prompt''.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, traditionelle Engpässe von Design zu Engineering zu umgehen, indem sie KI-Agents anweisen, Software zu erstellen, zu deployen und zu warten, unter Verwendung modulare PM-Systeme und das Verständnis von Systemkomponenten für die Erstellung von Software mit nahezu null Kosten, durch die Nutzung von KI-unterstütztem Produktmanagement und ''Super-Prompt''-Erstellung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a contornar gargalos tradicionais de design para engenharia, direcionando os agentes de IA para construir, implantar e manter software, utilizando sistemas de gerenciamento de produtos modulares e compreendendo componentes do sistema para criação de software com custo quase zero, aproveitando o gerenciamento de produtos assistido por IA e redação de ''Super-Prompt''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обходить традиционные узкие места проектирования и инжиниринга, направляя агентов ИИ на создание, развертывание и поддержку программного обеспечения, используя модульные системы управления продуктами и понимание компонентов системы для создания программного обеспечения с почти нулевой стоимостью, используя управление продуктами с помощью ИИ и черновик ''Super-Prompt''.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تجاوز العوائق التقليدية في التصميم الهندسي من خلال توجيه وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنشاء وتوزيع وصيانة البرامج، باستخدام أنظمة إدارة المنتجات المكونة من وحدات وفهما للمكونات النظامية من أجل إنشاء برامج بتكلفة قريبة من الصفر، واستغلال إدارة المنتجات بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي والتنسيق السريع ''Super-Prompt''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating product prototyping workflows","Generating ''Super-Prompts'' for AI agents","Debugging system components for reduced software creation costs"],"zh":["自动化产品原型设计工作流程","为AI代理生成''超级提示''","调试系统组件以降低软件创建成本"],"ja":["製品プロトタイピングワークフローの自動化","AIエージェントの''スーパープロンプト''の生成","システムコンポーネントのデバッグによるソフトウェア作成コストの削減"],"ko":["제품 프로토 타이핑 워크플로 자동화","AI 에이전트를 위한 ''슈퍼 프롬프트'' 생성","시스템 구성 요소 디버깅을 통한 소프트웨어 생성 비용 절감"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de prototipado de productos","Generación de ''Super-Prompts'' para agentes de IA","Depuración de componentes del sistema para reducir los costos de creación de software"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de prototypage de produits","Génération de ''Super-Prompts'' pour les agents d''IA","Débogage des composants du système pour réduire les coûts de création de logiciels"],"de":["Automatisierung von Produkt-Prototyping-Workflows","Generierung von ''Super-Prompts'' für KI-Agents","Fehlerbehebung von Systemkomponenten für reduzierte Software-Erstellungskosten"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de prototipagem de produtos","Gerar ''Super-Prompts'' para agentes de IA","Depurar componentes do sistema para reduzir os custos de criação de software"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов прототипирования продуктов","Генерация ''Super-Prompt'' для агентов ИИ","Отладка компонентов системы для снижения стоимости создания программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل تصميم نماذج أولية للمنتجات","إنشاء تنسيقات سريعة ''Super-Prompt'' لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصحيح الأعطال في مكونات النظام لتقليل تكاليف إنشاء البرامج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of AI-native coding principles","Dependent on AI agent capabilities for software development","May require additional development for non-modular systems"],"zh":["需要了解AI原生编码原理","依赖AI代理的软件开发能力","可能需要为非模块化系统进行额外开发"],"ja":["AIネイティブコーディングの原理の理解が必要","ソフトウェア開発のためにAIエージェントの能力に依存","モジュラー化されていないシステムの場合、追加の開発が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["AI 네이티브 코딩 원리의 이해가 필요","소프트웨어 개발을 위해 AI 에이전트의 능력에 의존","비모듈화 시스템의 경우 추가 개발이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de codificación nativa de IA","Depende de las capacidades de los agentes de IA para el desarrollo de software","Puede requerir desarrollo adicional para sistemas no modulares"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de codification native d''IA","Dépend des capacités des agents d''IA pour le développement de logiciels","Peut nécessiter un développement supplémentaire pour les systèmes non modulaires"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis von KI-nativen Codierungsprinzipien","Hängt von den Fähigkeiten der KI-Agents für die Software-Entwicklung ab","Kann zusätzliche Entwicklung für nicht-modulare Systeme erfordern"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de codificação nativa de IA","Depende das capacidades dos agentes de IA para o desenvolvimento de software","Pode requerer desenvolvimento adicional para sistemas não modulares"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов кодирования, родного для ИИ","Зависит от возможностей агентов ИИ для разработки программного обеспечения","Может потребовать дополнительного развития для немодульных систем"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ البرمجة الأصلية للنظام","يعتمد على إمكانيات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرامج","يمكن أن يتطلب تطويرًا إضافيًا لأنظمة غير مكونة من وحدات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gaebalai/claude-code-orchestrator/init', 'community', 'gaebalai', 'claude-code-orchestrator', 'gaebalai/claude-code-orchestrator', 'init', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:43:05.218Z', NULL, '{"id":"gaebalai/claude-code-orchestrator/init","name":"init","description":{"zh":"初始化项目配置并分析项目技术栈，使用多智能体AI开发环境","ja":"マルチエージェントAI開発環境を使用してプロジェクト設定を初期化し、プロジェクトの技術スタックを分析します","ko":"멀티 에이전트 AI 개발 환경을 사용하여 프로젝트 설정을 초기화하고 프로젝트 기술 스택을 분석합니다","es":"El entorno de desarrollo de IA multiagente ''init'' permite analizar y configurar proyectos de forma eficiente","fr":"L''environnement de développement d''IA multiagent ''init'' permet d''analyser et de configurer des projets de manière efficace","de":"Die Multiagenten-IA-Entwicklungsumgebung ''init'' ermöglicht die effiziente Analyse und Konfiguration von Projekten","pt":"O ambiente de desenvolvimento de IA multi-agente é uma ferramenta poderosa para análise e atualização de projetos","ru":"Мульти-агентная среда разработки ИИ является мощным инструментом для анализа и обновления проектов","ar":"بيئة تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي متعددة الوكلاء هي أداة قوية لتحليل و تحديث المشاريع","en":"Multi-Agent AI Development Environment"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"初始化项目配置 - 多智能体AI开发环境","ja":"プロジェクト設定の初期化 - マルチエージェントAI開発環境","ko":"프로젝트 설정 초기화 - 멀티 에이전트 AI 개발 환경","es":"Entorno de Desarrollo de IA Multiagente","fr":"Environnement de Développement d''IA Multiagent","de":"Multiagenten-IA-Entwicklungsumgebung","pt":"Ambiente de Desenvolvimento de IA Multi-Agente","ru":"Мульти-агентная среда разработки ИИ","ar":"بيئة تطوير ذكاء اصطناعي متعددة الوكلاء","en":"init"},"description":{"zh":"初始化项目配置并分析项目技术栈，使用多智能体AI开发环境","ja":"マルチエージェントAI開発環境を使用してプロジェクト設定を初期化し、プロジェクトの技術スタックを分析します","ko":"멀티 에이전트 AI 개발 환경을 사용하여 프로젝트 설정을 초기화하고 프로젝트 기술 스택을 분석합니다","es":"El entorno de desarrollo de IA multiagente ''init'' permite analizar y configurar proyectos de forma eficiente","fr":"L''environnement de développement d''IA multiagent ''init'' permet d''analyser et de configurer des projets de manière efficace","de":"Die Multiagenten-IA-Entwicklungsumgebung ''init'' ermöglicht die effiziente Analyse und Konfiguration von Projekten","pt":"O ambiente de desenvolvimento de IA multi-agente é uma ferramenta poderosa para análise e atualização de projetos","ru":"Мульти-агентная среда разработки ИИ является мощным инструментом для анализа и обновления проектов","ar":"بيئة تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي متعددة الوكلاء هي أداة قوية لتحليل و تحديث المشاريع","en":"Multi-Agent AI Development Environment"},"definition":{"en":"Multi-Agent AI Development Environment"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种编程语言","项目技术栈分析","初始化项目配置","多智能体AI开发环境"],"ja":["複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","プロジェクトの技術スタックを分析","プロジェクト設定を初期化","マルチエージェントAI開発環境"],"ko":["다양한 프로그래밍 언어 지원","프로젝트 기술 스택 분석","프로젝트 설정 초기화","멀티 에이전트 AI 개발 환경"],"es":["Análisis de proyectos","Configuración de proyectos","Compatibilidad con Node.js, Python, Rust y Go","Actualización de secciones de proyecto específicas","Identificación del stack tecnológico"],"fr":["Analyse de projets","Configuration de projets","Compatibilité avec Node.js, Python, Rust et Go","Mise à jour des sections de projet spécifiques","Identification de la pile technologique"],"de":["Projektanalyse","Projektkonfiguration","Kompatibilität mit Node.js, Python, Rust und Go","Aktualisierung von projektspezifischen Abschnitten","Identifizierung des Technologie-Stacks"],"pt":["Análise de projetos","Atualização de configurações de projeto","Suporte a múltiplos frameworks","Identificação de tech stack","Facilidade de uso"],"ru":["Анализ проектов","Обновление конфигураций проекта","Поддержка нескольких фреймворков","Определение технологического стека","Легкость использования"],"ar":["تحليل المشاريع","تحديث إعدادات المشروع","دعم الإطارات المتعددة","تحديد حزمة التقنية","سهولة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["多智能体AI","开发环境","项目配置","技术栈分析","初始化项目","AI开发"],"ja":["マルチエージェントAI","開発環境","プロジェクト設定","技術スタック分析","プロジェクト初期化","AI開発"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 AI","개발 환경","프로젝트 설정","기술 스택 분석","프로젝트 초기화","AI 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de IA","entorno de desarrollo","proyectos de IA","análisis de proyectos","configuración de proyectos","Node.js","Python","Rust","Go"],"fr":["développement d''IA","environnement de développement","projets d''IA","analyse de projets","configuration de projets","Node.js","Python","Rust","Go"],"de":["IA-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsumgebung","IA-Projekte","Projektanalyse","Projektkonfiguration","Node.js","Python","Rust","Go"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ia","ia multi-agente","análise de projeto","atualização de configuração","tech stack","nodejs","python","rust","go"],"ru":["разработка ИИ","мульти-агентный ИИ","анализ проекта","обновление конфигурации","технологический стек","nodejs","python","rust","go"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","ذكاء اصطناعي متعددة الوكلاء","تحليل المشروع","تحديث الإعدادات","حزمة التقنية","nodejs","python","rust","go"]}},"owner":"gaebalai","repo":"claude-code-orchestrator","repoPath":"gaebalai/claude-code-orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"init","description":"Analyze project structure and update AGENTS.md with detected tech stack, commands, and configurations.","bodyPreview":"# Initialize Project Configuration\n\nAnalyze this project and update **only the project-specific sections** of AGENTS.md.\n\n## Important\n\n- Do **NOT** modify the \"Extensions\" section and below in existing AGENTS.md\n- Only update the top project-specific sections\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Project Analysis\n\nFind these files to identify the tech stack:\n\n- `package.json` → Node.js/TypeScript project\n- `pyproject.toml` / `setup.py` / `requirements.txt` → Python project\n- `Cargo.toml` → Rust project\n- `go.mod`","body":"# Initialize Project Configuration\n\nAnalyze this project and update **only the project-specific sections** of AGENTS.md.\n\n## Important\n\n- Do **NOT** modify the \"Extensions\" section and below in existing AGENTS.md\n- Only update the top project-specific sections\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Project Analysis\n\nFind these files to identify the tech stack:\n\n- `package.json` → Node.js/TypeScript project\n- `pyproject.toml` / `setup.py` / `requirements.txt` → Python project\n- `Cargo.toml` → Rust project\n- `go.mod` → Go project\n- `Makefile` / `Dockerfile` → Build/deploy config\n- `.github/workflows/` → CI/CD config\n\nAlso detect:\n\n- npm scripts / poe tasks / make targets → Common commands\n- Major libraries/frameworks\n\n### 2. Ask User\n\nUse AskUserQuestion tool to ask:\n\n1. **Project overview**: What does this project do? (1-2 sentences)\n2. **Code language**: English or Korean for comments/variable names?\n3. **Additional rules**: Any other coding conventions to follow?\n\n### 3. Partial Update of AGENTS.md\n\nUse Edit tool to update only the top section (up to first `---`) with this format:\n\n```markdown\n# Project Overview\n\n{User''s answer}\n\n## Language Settings\n\n- **Thinking/Reasoning**: English\n- **Code**: {Based on analysis - English or Korean}\n- **User Communication**: Korean\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- **Language**: {Detected language}\n- **Package Manager**: {Detected tools}\n- **Dev Tools**: {Detected tools}\n- **Main Libraries**: {Detected libraries}\n```\n\n### 4. Update Common Commands\n\nUpdate the `## Common Commands` section with detected commands:\n\n```markdown\n## Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Detected commands (example)\n{npm run dev / poe test / make build etc.}\n```\n```\n\n### 5. Check Unnecessary Rules\n\nCheck rules in `.claude/rules/` and suggest removing unnecessary ones:\n\n- Non-Python project → `dev-environment.md` (uv/ruff/ty) may not be needed\n- No-test project → `testing.md` may not be needed\n\n### 6. Report Completion\n\nReport to user (in Korean):\n\n- Detected tech stack\n- Updated sections\n- Recommended rules to remove (if any)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:43:05.218Z","qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('renato0307/rocha/done', 'community', 'renato0307', 'rocha', 'renato0307/rocha', 'done', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:43:33.925Z', NULL, '{"id":"renato0307/rocha/done","name":"done","description":{"zh":"代码提交工作流是开发任务的重要组成部分，确保正确的提交和审查流程对于项目的成功至关重要","ja":"コードコミットワークフローは開発タスクの重要な要素であり、正しいコミットとレビューのプロセスはプロジェクトの成功に不可欠です","ko":"코드 커밋 워크플로우는 개발 태스크의 중요한 구성 요소であり, 올바른 커밋과 리뷰 프로세스는 프로젝트의 성공에 필수적입니다","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de conclusão de tarefas é um guia passo a passo para desenvolvedores, abordando commits, rebases e pull requests","ru":"Поток выполнения задач - это пошаговое руководство для разработчиков, охватывающее коммиты, ребейзы и запросы на включение","ar":"تدفق إكمال المهام هو دليل خطوة بخطوة للمطورين، يغطي الإشتراكات وإعادة الترتيب والطلبات السحابية","en":"I''m Rocha, and I manage code agents"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码提交工作流 - 任务完成指南","ja":"コードコミットワークフロー - タスク完了ガイド","ko":"코드 커밋 워크플로우 - 태스크 완료 가이드","pt":"Fluxo de Trabalho de Conclusão de Tarefas","ru":"Поток Выполнения Задач","ar":"تدفق إكمال المهام","en":"done"},"description":{"zh":"代码提交工作流是开发任务的重要组成部分，确保正确的提交和审查流程对于项目的成功至关重要","ja":"コードコミットワークフローは開発タスクの重要な要素であり、正しいコミットとレビューのプロセスはプロジェクトの成功に不可欠です","ko":"코드 커밋 워크플로우는 개발 태스크의 중요한 구성 요소であり, 올바른 커밋과 리뷰 프로세스는 프로젝트의 성공에 필수적입니다","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de conclusão de tarefas é um guia passo a passo para desenvolvedores, abordando commits, rebases e pull requests","ru":"Поток выполнения задач - это пошаговое руководство для разработчиков, охватывающее коммиты, ребейзы и запросы на включение","ar":"تدفق إكمال المهام هو دليل خطوة بخطوة للمطورين، يغطي الإشتراكات وإعادة الترتيب والطلبات السحابية","en":"I''m Rocha, and I manage code agents"},"definition":{"en":"I''m Rocha, and I manage code agents"},"features":{"zh":["预检检查","提交代码变更","重置到主分支","创建拉取请求","遵循约定提交格式"],"ja":["プレフライトチェック","コードの変更をコミット","メインブランチへのリベース","プルリクエストの作成","従来のコミット形式の遵守"],"ko":["프리플ライト 체크","코드 변경을 커밋","메인 브랜치로 리베이스","풀 리퀘스트 생성","従来의 커밋 형식 준수"],"pt":["Commits organizados","Rebases automatizados","Pull requests personalizados","Verificação de código","Histórico de git limpo"],"ru":["Организованные коммиты","Автоматические ребейзы","Пользовательские запросы на включение","Проверка кода","Чистый исторический журнал git"],"ar":["الاشتراكات المنظمة","إعادة الترتيب الآلي","الطلبات السحابية المخصصة","فحص الشفرة","سجل جيت نظيف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码提交","开发任务","工作流","预检检查","提交代码","重置到主分支","拉取请求","约定提交格式"],"ja":["コードコミット","開発タスク","ワークフロー","プレフライトチェック","コードの変更をコミット","メインブランチへのリベース","プルリクエスト","従来のコミット形式"],"ko":["코드 커밋","개발 태스크","워크플로우","프리플ライト 체크","코드 변경을 커밋","메인 브랜치로 리베이스","풀 리퀘스트","従来의 커밋 형식"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho","conclusão de tarefas","commits","rebase","pull request","desenvolvimento de software","git","código limpo"],"ru":["поток выполнения","завершение задач","коммиты","ребейз","запрос на включение","разработка программного обеспечения","git","чистый код"],"ar":["تدفق إكمال","إكمال المهام","الاشتراكات","إعادة الترتيب","الطلبات السحابية","تطوير البرمجيات","جيت","شفرة نظيفة"]}},"owner":"renato0307","repo":"rocha","repoPath":"renato0307/rocha","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"done","description":"Finish a task by committing changes, rebasing on main, and creating a PR","bodyPreview":"# Task Completion Workflow\n\nYou are finishing a development task. Follow these steps in order to commit changes, rebase on main, and create a pull request.\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n- **NEVER** include AI tool references in commits, PRs, or code comments\n- **NO** \"Co-Authored-By: Claude\" or similar AI attributions\n- All git history must appear human-authored\n- Follow conventional commit format: `<type>: <description>`\n\n## Step 1: Pre-flight Checks\n\nRun these checks **sequentially**:\n\n1. Verify in git","body":"# Task Completion Workflow\n\nYou are finishing a development task. Follow these steps in order to commit changes, rebase on main, and create a pull request.\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n- **NEVER** include AI tool references in commits, PRs, or code comments\n- **NO** \"Co-Authored-By: Claude\" or similar AI attributions\n- All git history must appear human-authored\n- Follow conventional commit format: `<type>: <description>`\n\n## Step 1: Pre-flight Checks\n\nRun these checks **sequentially**:\n\n1. Verify in git repository:\n   ```bash\n   git rev-parse --git-dir\n   ```\n\n2. Get current branch:\n   ```bash\n   git branch --show-current\n   ```\n\n3. Check for changes:\n   ```bash\n   git status --porcelain\n   ```\n\n**Stop conditions:**\n- If not in git repo → **Error**: \"Not in a git repository\"\n- If on `main` branch → **Error**: \"Cannot commit directly to main branch. Create a feature branch first.\"\n- If no changes (empty output) → **Error**: \"No changes to commit\"\n\nIf all checks pass, proceed to Step 2.\n\n## Step 2: Analyze and Commit Changes\n\n### 2.1 Review Changes\n\nRun these commands to understand what changed:\n\n```bash\ngit status\ngit diff HEAD\n```\n\nIf there are already staged files, also check:\n```bash\ngit diff --staged\n```\n\n### 2.2 Analyze Changes\n\nBased on the diff output, determine:\n\n- **Commit type**: Choose from:\n  - `feat` - New feature\n  - `fix` - Bug fix\n  - `refactor` - Code restructuring without behavior change\n  - `docs` - Documentation only\n  - `style` - Formatting, whitespace, missing semicolons\n  - `test` - Adding or updating tests\n  - `chore` - Build process, dependencies, tooling\n\n- **Description**: Write a concise summary (< 72 characters) that completes the sentence: \"This commit will...\"\n  - Good: \"add user authentication middleware\"\n  - Good: \"fix null pointer dereference in login handler\"\n  - Bad: \"changes\" or \"updates stuff\"\n\n- **Body** (optional): Add if the change is complex and needs explanation\n\n### 2.3 Security Check\n\nCheck if any changed files match sensitive patterns:\n```bash\ngit status --porcelain | grep -E ''\\.(env|key|pem)|credentials|secrets''\n```\n\nIf matches found:\n- **Warn the user**: \"Detected potential sensitive files: [list]. Are you sure you want to commit these?\"\n- **Wait for user confirmation** before proceeding\n- If user declines, stop here\n\n### 2.4 Stage Files\n\nPrefer staging specific files rather than using `git add .`:\n\n```bash\ngit add <file1> <file2> <file3>\n```\n\nOnly use `git add .` if justified (many files changed, all safe to commit).\n\n### 2.5 Create Commit\n\n**If $ARGUMENTS is provided**: Use it as the commit message directly:\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"$ARGUMENTS\"\n```\n\n**Otherwise**: Generate the commit message using the format:\n```\n<type>: <description>\n```\n\nExample:\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"feat: add user authentication middleware\"\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: Do NOT add any Co-Authored-By or AI attribution trailers.\n\n### 2.6 Verify Commit\n\nCheck the commit was created:\n```bash\ngit log -1 --oneline\n```\n\nIf commit failed (pre-commit hooks, etc.):\n- Show the error message to the user\n- **STOP**: Let the user fix the issue\n- User can run `/done` again after fixing\n\n## Step 3: Rebase on origin/main\n\n### 3.1 Fetch Latest\n\nUpdate the remote tracking branches:\n```bash\ngit fetch origin\n```\n\n### 3.2 Rebase\n\nRebase current branch onto origin/main:\n```bash\ngit rebase origin/main\n```\n\n### 3.3 Handle Rebase Result\n\n**If rebase succeeds**: Proceed to Step 4.\n\n**If conflicts are detected** (non-zero exit code):\n\n**STOP** and inform the user:\n\n```\nRebase conflicts detected. To resolve:\n\n1. Check conflict status:\n   git status\n\n2. Open conflicted files and resolve conflicts (look for <<<<<<< markers)\n\n3. Stage resolved files:\n   git add <resolved-file>\n\n4. Continue the rebase:\n   git rebase --continue\n\n5. After resolving all conflicts, run /done again to create the PR\n\nTo abort the rebase:\n   git rebase --abort\n```\n\n**DO NOT** attempt automatic conflict resolution. This requires human judgment.\n\n## Step 4: Create Pull Request\n\n### 4.1 Gather Context\n\nGet branch and commit information:\n\n```bash\n# Current branch name\ngit branch --show-current\n\n# All commits in this branch (not in main)\ngit log origin/main..HEAD --oneline\n\n# Full commit details\ngit log origin/main..HEAD\n\n# Summary of changed files\ngit diff origin/main...HEAD --stat\n```\n\n### 4.2 Analyze Commits\n\nReview ALL commits in the branch to understand the overall change:\n- If **single commit**: PR title = commit message (which already includes the type prefix)\n- If **multiple commits**: Summarize the overall feature/fix with appropriate type prefix (feat, fix, refactor, etc.)\n\n### 4.3 Generate PR Title\n\n- **MUST** start with conventional commit type prefix: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `docs:`, `style:`, `test:`, or `chore:`\n- Use clear, concise language after the prefix\n- Keep under 72 characters total\n- No AI attribution\n\nExample titles:\n- \"feat: add user authentication middleware\"\n- \"fix: null pointer dereference in login handler\"\n- \"refactor: session management for improved performance\"\n- \"docs: add API documentation for auth endpoints\"\n- \"chore: update dependencies to latest versions\"\n\n### 4.4 Generate PR Body\n\nUse this format:\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n\n- [Key change 1]\n- [Key change 2]\n- [Key change 3]\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] [Test scenario 1]\n- [ ] [Test scenario 2]\n- [ ] [Test scenario 3]\n```\n\nGuidelines:\n- 3-5 bullet points in Summary\n- Focus on \"what\" and \"why\", not implementation details\n- Test plan should be actionable checklist items\n- **NO** \"Generated with Claude Code\" or AI attribution footer\n\n### 4.5 Push Branch (if needed)\n\nBefore creating the PR, check if the branch has been pushed:\n\n```bash\ngit rev-parse --abbrev-ref --symbolic-full-name @{u} 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**If this command fails** (no upstream branch set):\n\nPush the branch and set upstream:\n```bash\ngit push -u origin <branch-name>\n```\n\n**If this command succeeds** (upstream branch exists):\n\nCheck if local is ahead of remote:\n```bash\ngit status -sb\n```\n\nIf the output shows `[ahead N]` or `[ahead N, behind M]`:\n- After rebase, the branch needs a force push\n- Run: `git push --force-with-lease`\n\n### 4.6 Create PR\n\nUse heredoc for proper formatting:\n\n```bash\ngh pr create --title \"PR title here\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n\n- Key change 1\n- Key change 2\n- Key change 3\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Test scenario 1\n- [ ] Test scenario 2\n- [ ] Test scenario 3\nEOF\n)\" --base main\n```\n\n### 4.7 Handle PR Creation Result\n\n**If successful**:\n- Display the PR URL to the user\n\n**If PR already exists**:\n- Show error message\n- If possible, extract and display the existing PR URL from the error\n- Inform user: \"A PR already exists for this branch\"\n\n**If GitHub CLI not found**:\n- Show installation instructions:\n  ```\n  GitHub CLI (gh) not found. Install it:\n  - macOS: brew install gh\n  - Linux: See https://github.com/cli/cli#installation\n\n  After installation, authenticate: gh auth login\n  ```\n\n## Error Handling\n\nFor any command that fails:\n1. Show the **exact error message** from the command\n2. Provide **actionable next steps** for the user\n3. **DO NOT** proceed to the next phase\n4. User can fix the issue and run `/done` again\n\n## Notes\n\n- The workflow automatically handles pushing the branch if needed (Step 4.5)\n- Prefer clear, atomic commits over large batch commits\n- The PR description should help reviewers understand the context quickly\n- If pre-commit hooks modify files, they''ll need to be staged and committed again\n- After rebase, force push with `--force-with-lease` is safer than `--force` (protects against overwriting others'' work)\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n**Basic usage (auto-generated commit message):**\n```\n/done\n```\n\n**With custom commit message:**\n```\n/done \"feat: add new authentication feature\"\n```\n\n**With multi-line commit message:**\n```\n/done \"feat: add authentication\n\nImplements OAuth2 flow with JWT tokens.\nIncludes session management and refresh tokens.\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:43:33.925Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit and pull request workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交和拉取请求工作流的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたコミットとプルリクエストのワークフローを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 및 풀 요청 워크플ロー가 필요한 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Código que necesitan flujos de trabajo de commit y solicitud de extracción estandarizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Code nécessitant des flux de travail de commit et de demande de tirage standardisés.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agenten, die standardisierte Commit- und Pull-Request-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de commit e pull request padronizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, требующих стандартизированных рабочих процессов commit и pull request.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى سير عمل موحد لالتزامات وطلبات السحب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a clean git history by following conventional commit formats and excluding AI tool references, ensuring all commits, PRs, and code comments adhere to human-authored standards using protocols like git.","zh":"使代理能够通过遵循传统的提交格式并排除AI工具引用来维护干净的Git历史记录，确保所有提交、PR和代码注释都遵循人类编写的标准，使用像Git这样的协议。","ja":"エージェントが伝統的なコミット形式に従ってAIツールの参照を除外することでクリーンなGit履歴を維持できるようにし、すべてのコミット、PR、コードコメントがGitなどのプロトコルを使用して人間が書いた標準に従うようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 전통적인 커밋 형식을 따르고 AI 도구 참조를 제외함으로써 깨끗한 Git 기록을 유지할 수 있도록 하여 모든 커밋, PR 및 코드 注释가 Git과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 인간이 작성한 표준을 따르도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener un historial de git limpio siguiendo formatos de commit convencionales y excluyendo referencias de herramientas de inteligencia artificial, asegurando que todos los commits, solicitudes de extracción y comentarios de código cumplan con los estándares de autoría humana utilizando protocolos como git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir un historique git propre en suivant des formats de commit conventionnels et en excluant les références d''outils d''intelligence artificielle, en s''assurant que tous les commits, les demandes de tirage et les commentaires de code sont conformes aux normes rédigées par l''homme en utilisant des protocoles comme git.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ein sauberes Git-Verlauf zu erhalten, indem sie konventionelle Commit-Formate befolgen und AI-Tool-Referenzen ausschließen, um sicherzustellen, dass alle Commits, Pull-Requests und Code-Kommentare den von Menschen verfassten Standards entsprechen, indem Protokolle wie Git verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um histórico de git limpo seguindo formatos de commit convencionais e excluindo referências de ferramentas de IA, garantindo que todos os commits, PRs e comentários de código adiram a padrões autorados por humanos usando protocolos como git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать чистую историю git, следуя конвенциональным форматам commit и исключая ссылки на инструменты ИИ, гарантируя, что все коммиты, PR и комментарии кода соответствуют стандартам, написанным человеком, используя протоколы như git.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على سجل git نظيف من خلال اتباع تنسيقات الالتزام التقليدية واستبعاد مراجع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يضمن أن tấtалуالتزامات وطلبات السحب وتعليقات الشفرة تتماشى مع معايير مكتوبة من قبل البشر باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل git."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task completion workflows","Creating pull requests with standardized descriptions","Rebasing code on main branches while maintaining commit integrity"],"zh":["自动化任务完成工作流","创建具有标准化描述的拉取请求","在维护提交完整性时在主分支上重新应用代码"],"ja":["タスク完了ワークフローの自動化","標準化された説明を持つプルリクエストの作成","コミットの完全性を維持したままメインブランチでコードをリベース"],"ko":["작업 완료 워크플로 자동화","표준화된 설명을 가진 풀 리퀘스트 생성","提交 무결성을 유지하는 동안 메인 브랜치에서 코드 리베이스"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de finalización de tareas","Crear solicitudes de extracción con descripciones estandarizadas","Reorganizar el código en ramas principales manteniendo la integridad de los commits"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail d''achèvement des tâches","Créer des demandes de tirage avec des descriptions standardisées","Réorganiser le code sur les branches principales en maintenant l''intégrité des commits"],"de":["Automatisieren von Arbeitsabläufen zur Aufgabenvervollständigung","Erstellen von Pull-Requests mit standardisierten Beschreibungen","Neuorganisation des Codes in Hauptzweigen unter Beibehaltung der Commit-Integrität"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de conclusão de tarefas","Criar pull requests com descrições padronizadas","Reorganizar código em branches principais mantendo a integridade do commit"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов завершения задач","Создание pull request с стандартизированными описаниями","Перебазирование кода в основных ветках при сохранении целостности коммита"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل استكمال المهام","إنشاء طلبات السحب مع_descriptions موحدة","إعادة تنظيم الشفرة في الفروع الرئيسية مع الحفاظ على سلامة الالتزام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to conventional commit format","No AI tool references allowed in commits or PRs","Git history must appear human-authored"],"zh":["需要遵循传统的提交格式","不允许在提交或PR中包含AI工具引用","Git历史记录必须看起来像是由人类编写的"],"ja":["伝統的なコミット形式に従う必要がある","コミットまたはPRにAIツールの参照を含めることはできない","Git履歴は人間が書いたように見える必要がある"],"ko":["전통적인 커밋 형식을 따라야 함","커밋 또는 PR에 AI 도구 참조를 포함할 수 없음","Git 기록은 인간이 작성한 것으로 보아야 함"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al formato de commit convencional","No se permiten referencias de herramientas de inteligencia artificial en commits o solicitudes de extracción","El historial de git debe parecer autorizado por humanos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au format de commit conventionnel","Les références d''outils d''intelligence artificielle ne sont pas autorisées dans les commits ou les demandes de tirage","L''historique git doit sembler rédigé par l''homme"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des konventionellen Commit-Formats","Keine AI-Tool-Referenzen in Commits oder Pull-Requests erlaubt","Der Git-Verlauf muss wie von Menschen autorisiert erscheinen"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao formato de commit convencional","Não são permitidas referências de ferramentas de IA em commits ou PRs","O histórico de git deve parecer autorado por humanos"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конвенционального формата commit","Не допускаются ссылки на инструменты ИИ в коммитах или PR","История git должна выглядеть как написанная человеком"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع تنسيق الالتزام التقليدي","لا يسمح bằng مراجع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي في الالتزامات أو طلبات السحب","يجب أن يبدو سجل git كما لو كان مكتوبا من قبل البشر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Clay-Ferguson/mkbrowser/app-pages', 'community', 'Clay-Ferguson', 'mkbrowser', 'Clay-Ferguson/mkbrowser', 'app-pages', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:43:09.716Z', NULL, '{"id":"Clay-Ferguson/mkbrowser/app-pages","name":"app-pages","description":{"zh":"Electron, Markdown ","ja":"Electron, Markdown","ko":"Electron, Markdown ","es":"La aplicación de escritorio Electron ofrece un navegador de Markdown y un explorador de archivos para una experiencia de usuario intuitiva","fr":"L''application de bureau Electron propose un navigateur Markdown et un explorateur de fichiers pour une expérience utilisateur intuitive","de":"Die Electron-Desktop-Anwendung bietet einen Markdown-Browser und einen Datei-Explorer für eine benutzerfreundliche Erfahrung","pt":"O aplicativo de desktop Electron permite a criação e gerenciamento de páginas, incluindo navegação e edição de Markdown. As páginas são vistas de nível superior que exibimos no aplicativo.","ru":"Приложение Electron для настольных компьютеров позволяет создавать и управлять страницами, включая просмотр файлов и редактирование Markdown. Страницы представляют собой верхнеуровневые представления, которые мы отображаем в приложении.","ar":"يسمح تطبيق سطح المكتب الإلكتروني بإنشاء وإدارة الصفحات، بما في ذلك متصفح الملفات ومدقق Markdown. تمثل الصفحات معالجات المستوى الأعلى التي نعرضها في التطبيق.","en":"File Explorer and Markdown Browser/Editor (Electron Desktop App) "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Electron ","ja":"Electron","ko":"Electron ","es":"Navegador de Markdown y Explorador de Archivos","fr":"Navigateur Markdown et Explorateur de Fichiers","de":"Markdown-Browser und Datei-Explorer","pt":"App Pages: Navegação e Edição de Markdown","ru":"Страницы приложения: Просмотр файлов и редактор Markdown","ar":"صفحات التطبيق: مستكشف الملفات ومدقق Markdown","en":"app-pages"},"description":{"zh":"Electron, Markdown ","ja":"Electron, Markdown","ko":"Electron, Markdown ","es":"La aplicación de escritorio Electron ofrece un navegador de Markdown y un explorador de archivos para una experiencia de usuario intuitiva","fr":"L''application de bureau Electron propose un navigateur Markdown et un explorateur de fichiers pour une expérience utilisateur intuitive","de":"Die Electron-Desktop-Anwendung bietet einen Markdown-Browser und einen Datei-Explorer für eine benutzerfreundliche Erfahrung","pt":"O aplicativo de desktop Electron permite a criação e gerenciamento de páginas, incluindo navegação e edição de Markdown. As páginas são vistas de nível super...","ru":"Приложение Electron для настольных компьютеров позволяет создавать и управлять страницами, включая просмотр файлов и редактирование Markdown. Страницы предст...","ar":"يسمح تطبيق سطح المكتب الإلكتروني بإنشاء وإدارة الصفحات، بما في ذلك متصفح الملفات ومدقق Markdown. تمثل الصفحات معالجات المستوى الأعلى التي نعرضها في التطبيق.","en":"File Explorer and Markdown Browser/Editor (Electron Desktop App) "},"definition":{"en":"File Explorer and Markdown Browser/Editor (Electron Desktop App) "},"features":{"zh":["Electron ","Markdown ","TypeScript ","React "," "," "],"ja":["Electron","Markdown","TypeScript","React"," "," "],"ko":["Electron ","Markdown ","TypeScript ","React "," "," "],"es":["Navegador de Markdown integrado","Explorador de archivos para una fácil navegación","Edición de archivos Markdown en tiempo real","Compatibilidad con la aplicación de escritorio Electron","Diseño de interfaz de usuario intuitivo"],"fr":["Navigateur Markdown intégré","Explorateur de fichiers pour une navigation facile","Édition de fichiers Markdown en temps réel","Compatibilité avec l''application de bureau Electron","Conception d''interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Integrierter Markdown-Browser","Datei-Explorer für eine einfache Navigation","Echtzeit-Bearbeitung von Markdown-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit der Electron-Desktop-Anwendung","Intuitive Benutzeroberflächengestaltung"],"pt":["Navegação de arquivos","Edição de Markdown","Criação de páginas personalizadas","Gerenciamento de vistas de nível superior","Integração com o aplicativo Electron"],"ru":["Просмотр файлов","Редактирование Markdown","Создание пользовательских страниц","Управление верхнеуровневыми представлениями","Интеграция с приложением Electron"],"ar":["متصفح الملفات","مدقق Markdown","إنشاء صفحات مخصصة","إدارة معالجات المستوى الأعلى","التكامل مع تطبيق الإلكترون"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Electron","Markdown","TypeScript","React"," "," "," "," "],"ja":["Electron","Markdown","TypeScript","React"," "," "," "," "],"ko":["Electron","Markdown","TypeScript","React"," "," "," "," "],"es":["navegador de Markdown","explorador de archivos","aplicación de escritorio Electron","edición de Markdown","sistema de archivos","interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["navigateur Markdown","explorateur de fichiers","application de bureau Electron","édition de Markdown","système de fichiers","interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Markdown-Browser","Datei-Explorer","Electron-Desktop-Anwendung","Markdown-Bearbeitung","Dateisystem","intuitive Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["app pages","electron desktop app","markdown browser","file explorer","criação de páginas","gerenciamento de vistas","integração com electron","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["страницы приложения","электронное приложение для настольных компьютеров","просмотр файлов","редактор markdown","создание страниц","управление верхнеуровневыми представлениями","интеграция с электроном","разработка приложений"],"ar":["صفحات التطبيق","تطبيق سطح المكتب الإلكتروني","متصفح الملفات","مدقق markdown","إنشاء صفحات","إدارة معالجات المستوى الأعلى","التكامل مع الإلكترون","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"Clay-Ferguson","repo":"mkbrowser","repoPath":"Clay-Ferguson/mkbrowser","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"app-pages","description":"Pattern for application pages","bodyPreview":"# Instructions\n\n## Page Name and Component Location\n\nPages are the different top level views (aka panels) that we display in the application. Their names are defined in file `src/store/types.ts` in the following line of code.\n\n```\nexport type AppView = ''browser'' | ''search-results'' | ''settings'';\n```\n\nThe ''browser'' one is the main default application `src/App.tsx`, but any pages other than the main (browser) page should follow a pattern similar to what you find in `src/components/SearchResultsView","body":"# Instructions\n\n## Page Name and Component Location\n\nPages are the different top level views (aka panels) that we display in the application. Their names are defined in file `src/store/types.ts` in the following line of code.\n\n```\nexport type AppView = ''browser'' | ''search-results'' | ''settings'';\n```\n\nThe ''browser'' one is the main default application `src/App.tsx`, but any pages other than the main (browser) page should follow a pattern similar to what you find in `src/components/SearchResultsView.tsx`\n\n## Tab Navigation\n\nEach page has a corresponding tab button in the tab panel at the top of the screen (Browse, Search, Settings). When the user clicks a tab button, we update the `currentView` in the global `AppState`, and that causes the page to display at next render.\n\n## React Global State Management\n\nExample: `setCurrentView(''search-results'');`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:43:09.716Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Electron Desktop App Agents requiring advanced page management and Markdown editing capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级页面管理和Markdown编辑功能的Electron桌面应用程序代理。","ja":"Electronデスクトップアプリエージェントが高度なページ管理とMarkdown編集機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 페이지 관리 및 Markdown 편집 기능이 필요한 Electron 데스크톱 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones de Escritorio de Electron que requieren una gestión de páginas avanzada y capacidades de edición de Markdown.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''applications de bureau Electron nécessitant une gestion de pages avancée et des capacités de modification de Markdown.","de":"Ideal für Electron-Desktop-App-Agents, die eine erweiterte Seitenverwaltung und Markdown-Bearbeitungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicativos de Desktop Electron que exigem gerenciamento de página avançado e capacidades de edição de Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронных приложений для настольных компьютеров, требующих расширенного управления страницами и возможностей редактирования Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق سطح المكتب الإلكتروني الذي يتطلب إدارة صفحة متقدمة وقدرات تحرير Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate and edit Markdown files using a File Explorer, while also managing different top-level views defined in TypeScript, specifically utilizing the `AppView` type from `src/store/types.ts` and rendering pages with React components like those found in `src/components/SearchResultsView`.","zh":"赋予代理在文件资源管理器中导航和编辑Markdown文件的能力，同时还管理TypeScript中定义的不同顶级视图，特别是利用`src/store/types.ts`中的`AppView`类型，并使用React组件（如`src/components/SearchResultsView`中找到的）渲染页面。","ja":"エージェントにファイルエクスプローラー内でMarkdownファイルをナビゲートして編集する能力を与え、TypeScriptで定義された異なるトップレベルのビューを管理する、特に`src/store/types.ts`内の`AppView`タイプを利用し、`src/components/SearchResultsView`内にあるようなReactコンポーネントを使用してページをレンダリングする。","ko":"파일 탐색기 내에서 Markdown 파일을 탐색하고 편집할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, TypeScript에서 정의된 다양한 최상위 뷰를 관리하며, 특히 `src/store/types.ts`의 `AppView` 유형을 사용하며, `src/components/SearchResultsView`에 있는 것과 같은 React 컴포넌트를 사용하여 페이지를 렌더링합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes navegar y editar archivos de Markdown utilizando un Explorador de archivos, mientras también gestiona diferentes vistas de nivel superior definidas en TypeScript, específicamente utilizando el tipo `AppView` desde `src/store/types.ts` y renderizando páginas con componentes de React como los encontrados en `src/components/SearchResultsView`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer et de modifier des fichiers Markdown à l''aide d''un Explorateur de fichiers, tout en gérant également différentes vues de niveau supérieur définies en TypeScript, en utilisant spécifiquement le type `AppView` depuis `src/store/types.ts` et en rendant des pages avec des composants React comme ceux trouvés dans `src/components/SearchResultsView`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Markdown-Dateien mithilfe eines Datei-Explorers zu navigieren und zu bearbeiten, während auch verschiedene oberste Ansichten verwaltet werden, die in TypeScript definiert sind, insbesondere unter Verwendung des `AppView`-Typs aus `src/store/types.ts` und mit React-Komponenten wie denen in `src/components/SearchResultsView` gerendert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar e editar arquivos Markdown usando um Explorador de Arquivos, além de gerenciar diferentes visualizações de nível superior definidas em TypeScript, utilizando especificamente o tipo `AppView` de `src/store/types.ts` e renderizando páginas com componentes React como os encontrados em `src/components/SearchResultsView`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навигации и редактирования файлов Markdown с помощью Проводника файлов, а также управления различными представлениями верхнего уровня, определёнными в TypeScript, в частности, используя тип `AppView` из `src/store/types.ts` и отображая страницы с помощью компонентов React, таких как те, что находятся в `src/components/SearchResultsView`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية التنقل وتحرير ملفات Markdown باستخدام مستكشف الملفات، بالإضافة إلى إدارة مختلف العروض من المستوى الأعلى المحددة في TypeScript، وتحديدا باستخدام نوع `AppView` من `src/store/types.ts` وتمثيل الصفحات باستخدام مكونات React مثل تلك الموجودة في `src/components/SearchResultsView`."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring page names and locations","Editing Markdown content within the app","Developing custom page components following the `SearchResultsView` pattern"],"zh":["配置页面名称和位置","在应用程序内编辑Markdown内容","遵循`SearchResultsView`模式开发自定义页面组件"],"ja":["ページ名と場所を構成する","アプリ内でMarkdownコンテンツを編集する","`SearchResultsView`パターンに従ってカスタムページコンポーネントを開発する"],"ko":["페이지 이름 및 위치를 구성합니다","애플리케이션 내에서 Markdown 콘텐츠를 편집합니다","`SearchResultsView` 패턴을 따르는 사용자 지정 페이지 컴포넌트를 개발합니다"],"es":["Configuración de nombres y ubicaciones de páginas","Edición de contenido de Markdown dentro de la aplicación","Desarrollo de componentes de página personalizados siguiendo el patrón de `SearchResultsView`"],"fr":["Configuration des noms et emplacements de pages","Édition de contenu Markdown à l''intérieur de l''application","Développement de composants de page personnalisés suivant le modèle de `SearchResultsView`"],"de":["Konfiguration von Seitennamen und -positionen","Bearbeitung von Markdown-Inhalt innerhalb der Anwendung","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Seitenkomponenten unter Verwendung des Musters von `SearchResultsView`"],"pt":["Configurando nomes e localizações de páginas","Editando conteúdo Markdown dentro do aplicativo","Desenvolvendo componentes de página personalizados seguindo o padrão `SearchResultsView`"],"ru":["Настройка имен и местоположений страниц","Редактирование содержимого Markdown внутри приложения","Разработка пользовательских компонентов страниц, следующих шаблону `SearchResultsView`"],"ar":["تكوين أسماء واماكن الصفحات","تحرير المحتوى Markdown داخل التطبيق","تطوير مكونات صفحة مخصصة متبعة نمط `SearchResultsView`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Electron Desktop App environment","Limited to predefined page types defined in `src/store/types.ts`","Needs knowledge of TypeScript and React for customization"],"zh":["需要Electron桌面应用程序环境","仅限于`src/store/types.ts`中定义的预定义页面类型","需要TypeScript和React的知识来进行自定义"],"ja":["Electronデスクトップアプリ環境が必要","`src/store/types.ts`内で定義された事前定義されたページタイプのみに限定される","カスタマイズするにはTypeScriptとReactの知識が必要"],"ko":["Electron 데스크톱 앱 환경이 필요합니다","`src/store/types.ts`에서 정의한 사전 정의된 페이지 유형으로만 제한됩니다","사용자 정의하려면 TypeScript 및 React에 대한 지식이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Aplicación de Escritorio de Electron","Limitado a tipos de páginas predefinidos definidos en `src/store/types.ts`","Requiere conocimientos de TypeScript y React para la personalización"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''application de bureau Electron","Limité aux types de pages prédéfinis définis dans `src/store/types.ts`","Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript et React pour la personnalisation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Electron-Desktop-App-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf vordefinierte Seitentypen, die in `src/store/types.ts` definiert sind","Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript und React für die Anpassung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de Aplicativo de Desktop Electron","Limitado a tipos de páginas predefinidos definidos em `src/store/types.ts`","Necessita conhecimento de TypeScript e React para personalização"],"ru":["Требует среды электронного приложения для настольных компьютеров","Ограничен предопределёнными типами страниц, определёнными в `src/store/types.ts`","Требует знания TypeScript и React для настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطبيق سطح المكتب الإلكتروني","محدد بالأنواع المسبقة التعريف للصفحات المحددة في `src/store/types.ts`","يحتاج إلى معرفة TypeScript و React للتخصيص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
