س إديت: أداة التعليق المباشر","en":"canvas-edit"},"description":{"zh":"Canvas 编辑是一个实时注释工具栏，直接在网页上标记设计审查发现。它提供编号徽章、严重性指示器和悬停弹出窗口等功能","ja":"キャンバス編集は、ウェブページ上でリアルタイムにデザインレビューの結果をマークアップするツールバーです。番号バッジ、重大性インジケーター、ホーバーポップオーバーなどの機能を提供します","ko":"캔버스 편집은 웹 페이지에서 실시간으로 디자인 검토 결과를 표시하는 도구 모음입니다. 번호 배지, 심각도 표시기, 호버 팝오버 등의 기능을 제공합니다","es":"La herramienta de edición de canvas en vivo permite anotar y revisar diseños web en tiempo real","fr":"L''outil de modification de canvas en temps réel permet d''annoter et de réviser les conceptions web en temps réel","de":"Das Live-Canvas-Bearbeitungstool ermöglicht die Annotation und Überprüfung von Webdesigns in Echtzeit","pt":"O Canvas Edit é uma ferramenta de anotação ao vivo que permite a revisão de design em tempo real. Ela exibe badges numerados em elementos problemáticos com b...","ru":"Canvas Edit - это инструмент живой аннотации, который позволяет проверять дизайн в режиме реального времени. Он отображает пронумерованные значки на проблемн...","ar":"كانفاس إديت هو أداة للتعليق المباشر يسمح بمراجعة التصميم في الوقت الفعلي. يعرض شارات مرقمة على عناصر مشكلة مع حدود ملونة لدرجة الخطورة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实时注释","编号徽章","严重性指示器","悬停弹出窗口","一键截图"],"ja":["リアルタイム注釈","番号バッジ","重大性インジケーター","ホーバーポップオーバー","ワンクリックスクリーンショット"],"ko":["실시간 주석","번호 배지","심각도 표시기","호버 팝오버","한 클릭 스크린샷"],"es":["Anotaciones en vivo","Indicadores de gravedad","Emergentes de problemas","Captura de pantalla de un solo clic","Barra de herramientas flotante","Números de badges en elementos problemáticos"],"fr":["Annotations en temps réel","Indicateurs de gravité","Emergents de problèmes","Capture d''écran en un seul clic","Barre d''outils flottante","Numéros de badges sur les éléments problématiques"],"de":["Live-Anmerkungen","Schweregrad-Indikatoren","Problemmeldungen","Ein-Klick-Screenshot","Schwebende Werkzeugleiste","Numerierte Badges auf problematischen Elementen"],"pt":["Anotações ao vivo","Indicadores de gravidade","Popovers de problemas","Captura de tela com um clique","Barra de ferramentas flutuante"],"ru":["Живые аннотации","Индикаторы степени тяжести","Поповеры проблем","Захват экрана в один клик","Плавающая панель инструментов"],"ar":["التعليقات المباشرة","مؤشرات درجة الخطورة","نافذة ظهور المشكلات","التقاط الشاشة بضغطة واحدة","شريط أدوات عائم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["canvas 编辑","实时注释","设计审查","网页标记","开发工具"],"ja":["キャンバス編集","リアルタイム注釈","デザインレビュー","ウェブページマークアップ","開発ツール"],"ko":["캔버스 편집","실시간 주석","디자인 검토","웹 페이지 표시","개발 도구"],"es":["edición de canvas en vivo","anotación en tiempo real","revisión de diseños web","herramienta de edición de canvas","anotaciones en vivo","indicadores de gravedad","desarrollo web","diseño web"],"fr":["modification de canvas en temps réel","annotation en temps réel","révision de conceptions web","outil de modification de canvas","annotations en temps réel","indicateurs de gravité","développement web","conception web"],"de":["Live-Canvas-Bearbeitung","Echtzeit-Anmerkung","Überprüfung von Webdesigns","Live-Canvas-Bearbeitungstool","Live-Anmerkungen","Schweregrad-Indikatoren","Webentwicklung","Webdesign"],"pt":["anotação ao vivo","revisão de design","ferramenta de anotação","design em tempo real","barra de ferramentas flutuante","captura de tela"],"ru":["живая аннотация","проверка дизайна","инструмент аннотации","дизайн в режиме реального времени","плавающая панель инструментов","захват экрана"],"ar":["التعليق المباشر","مراجعة التصميم","أداة التعليق","التصميم في الوقت الفعلي","شريط أدوات عائم","التقاط الشاشة"]}},"owner":"edrouhardmicrosoft","repo":"agent-canvas-skills","repoPath":"edrouhardmicrosoft/agent-canvas-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canvas-edit","description":"Live Annotation Feedback Toolbar that overlays design review findings directly on web pages. Displays numbered badges on elements with issues, severity indicators, filtering, and screenshot capture. Integrates with design-review for real-time issue display. Triggers on show annotations, display issues, annotate page, overlay findings, or after running design-review.","bodyPreview":"# Canvas Edit - Live Annotation Toolbar\n\nFloating toolbar that overlays design review findings directly on web pages in real-time. Displays numbered badges on problematic elements with severity-colored borders, hover popovers for issue details, and one-click screenshot capture.\n\n**Key features:**\n- **Live annotations** - Numbered badges appear on elements as issues are found\n- **Severity indicators** - Color-coded badges (red/orange/blue) with counts\n- **Issue popovers** - Click badges to see fu","body":"# Canvas Edit - Live Annotation Toolbar\n\nFloating toolbar that overlays design review findings directly on web pages in real-time. Displays numbered badges on problematic elements with severity-colored borders, hover popovers for issue details, and one-click screenshot capture.\n\n**Key features:**\n- **Live annotations** - Numbered badges appear on elements as issues are found\n- **Severity indicators** - Color-coded badges (red/orange/blue) with counts\n- **Issue popovers** - Click badges to see full issue details and recommendations\n- **Screenshot capture** - Capture annotated page (toolbar hidden, annotations visible)\n- **Shadow DOM** - Toolbar is invisible to agent-eyes screenshots\n- **Filtering** - Filter by severity or pillar category\n\n## Breaking Changes from v1\n\n> **This is a complete redesign.** Canvas-edit is now a **viewing tool**, not an editing tool.\n\n| Old Functionality | New Behavior |\n|-------------------|--------------|\n| Text editing via textarea | **REMOVED** |\n| Style sliders (fontSize, etc.) | **REMOVED** |\n| \"Save All to Code\" button | **REPLACED** with screenshot capture |\n| contentEditable toggle | **REMOVED** |\n| `edit` command | **REPLACED** with `inject` command |\n\nFor live editing, use `agent-canvas --with-edit` instead.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Python 3.10+\n- `uv` package manager\n- Playwright browsers: `playwright install chromium`\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\nSKILL_DIR=\".claude/skills/canvas-edit/scripts\"\n```\n\n### Inject Annotations onto Page\n\n```bash\n# Inject toolbar with issues from JSON file\nuv run $SKILL_DIR/canvas_edit.py inject http://localhost:3000 --issues issues.json\n\n# Inject with issues from stdin\necho ''[{\"id\": 1, \"selector\": \"h1\", \"severity\": \"major\", \"title\": \"Contrast issue\"}]'' | \\\n  uv run $SKILL_DIR/canvas_edit.py inject http://localhost:3000 --issues -\n\n# Auto-screenshot on load\nuv run $SKILL_DIR/canvas_edit.py inject http://localhost:3000 --issues issues.json --screenshot\n```\n\n### Typical Workflow: Design Review + Annotations\n\n```bash\n# 1. Run design review to find issues\nuv run .claude/skills/design-review/scripts/design_review.py review http://localhost:3000 \\\n  --output-json issues.json\n\n# 2. Inject annotations onto the page\nuv run $SKILL_DIR/canvas_edit.py inject http://localhost:3000 --issues issues.json\n\n# 3. User interacts with annotations, takes screenshots, closes browser\n```\n\n## Toolbar Controls\n\nThe floating toolbar (top-right by default) provides:\n\n**Status Display**\n- Issue count (\"5 Issues\" or \"All looks good!\")\n- Severity badges: 🔴 blocking, 🟡 major, 🔵 minor\n\n**Actions**\n- **👁 Visibility**: Show/hide all annotations\n- **⚙ Filter**: Filter by severity or pillar category\n- **📸 Screenshot**: Capture page with annotations (toolbar hidden)\n- **↕/↔ Orientation**: Toggle vertical/horizontal toolbar\n- **✕ Dismiss**: Remove toolbar and all annotations\n\n**Dragging**\n- Grab the ☰ handle to drag toolbar anywhere on screen\n- Position persists during session\n\n## Annotation Badges\n\nEach issue appears as a numbered badge on its target element:\n\n- **Position**: Top-right of target element (auto-adjusts at screen edges)\n- **Color**: Border matches severity (red/orange/blue)\n- **Click**: Opens popover with full issue details\n- **Hover**: Highlights the target element\n\n### Badge Popover Contents\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ #3  Contrast issue         [major] │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Color contrast ratio 3.2:1 fails   │\n│ WCAG AA requirement of 4.5:1       │\n│                                     │\n│ Pillar: Quality Craft               │\n│ Check: color-contrast               │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Recommendation:                     │\n│ Change text color to #1a1a1a or    │\n│ background to #ffffff              │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Issue JSON Format\n\nIssues can come from design-review output or be manually constructed:\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"selector\": \".hero-title\",\n    \"severity\": \"major\",\n    \"title\": \"Contrast ratio insufficient\",\n    \"description\": \"Text contrast 3.2:1 fails WCAG AA (4.5:1 required)\",\n    \"pillar\": \"Quality Craft\",\n    \"checkId\": \"color-contrast\",\n    \"recommendation\": \"Use darker text (#1a1a1a) or lighter background\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": 2,\n    \"selector\": \"button.submit\",\n    \"severity\": \"minor\",\n    \"title\": \"Touch target too small\",\n    \"description\": \"Button is 36x28px, minimum is 44x44px\",\n    \"pillar\": \"Quality Craft\",\n    \"checkId\": \"touch-target-size\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### Required Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | number | Unique identifier |\n| `selector` | string | CSS selector for target element |\n| `severity` | string | `\"blocking\"`, `\"major\"`, or `\"minor\"` |\n| `title` | string | Short issue title |\n\n### Optional Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `description` | string | Detailed explanation |\n| `pillar` | string | Design pillar category |\n| `checkId` | string | Identifier for the check that found this |\n| `recommendation` | string | Suggested fix |\n\n## Event API (Canvas Bus)\n\nCanvas-edit integrates with other skills via the canvas bus event system.\n\n### Events Emitted\n\n| Event | Payload | When |\n|-------|---------|------|\n| `annotation.clicked` | `{issueId, selector, severity}` | User clicks a badge |\n| `screenshot.requested` | `{directory, filename, issueCount}` | Screenshot button clicked |\n| `screenshot.captured` | `{path, issueCount}` | Screenshot saved (Python-side) |\n| `annotations.cleared` | `{}` | Dismiss button clicked |\n| `filter.changed` | `{severity, pillars}` | Filter settings changed |\n\n### Events Subscribed\n\n| Event | Action |\n|-------|--------|\n| `review.started` | Show \"Scanning...\" state |\n| `review.issue_found` | Add badge for new issue |\n| `review.completed` | Show final count or success message |\n| `capture_mode.changed` | Hide/show toolbar for agent-eyes |\n\n### Integration Example\n\n```javascript\n// In another skill''s JavaScript\nconst bus = window.__canvasBus;\n\n// Listen for annotation clicks\nbus.subscribe(''annotation.clicked'', (payload) => {\n  console.log(`Issue ${payload.issueId} clicked: ${payload.selector}`);\n});\n\n// Add an issue programmatically\nwindow.__annotationLayer.addIssue({\n  id: 99,\n  selector: ''.problematic-element'',\n  severity: ''major'',\n  title: ''New issue found''\n});\n```\n\n## Screenshot Output\n\nScreenshots are saved to `.canvas/screenshots/` with timestamp filenames:\n\n```\n.canvas/screenshots/\n├── 2026-01-23T15-30-45_5-issues.png\n└── 2026-01-23T15-45-12_0-issues.png\n```\n\nFilename format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH-MM-SS_N-issues.png`\n\nScreenshots capture:\n- Full page content\n- All visible annotation badges\n- Element highlights (if active)\n- **NOT** the toolbar (hidden during capture)\n\n## Toolbar States\n\n| State | Display | Trigger |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| **Issues Found** | \"N Issues\" + severity badges | Default when issues > 0 |\n| **All Clear** | \"✓ All looks good!\" (randomized) | Zero issues after review completes |\n| **Scanning** | \"⟳ Analyzing...\" with spinner | During `review.started` |\n\nSuccess messages rotate randomly:\n- \"All looks good!\"\n- \"Ship it!\"\n- \"Pixel perfect\"\n- \"Zero issues found\"\n- \"Looking sharp!\"\n\n## Keyboard Navigation\n\n| Key | Action |\n|-----|--------|\n| `Tab` | Navigate toolbar controls |\n| `1-9` | Jump to badge by number |\n| `Arrow keys` | Navigate between visible badges |\n| `Enter/Space` | Activate focused button/badge |\n| `Escape` | Close open popover |\n\n## Shadow DOM Isolation\n\nThe toolbar is rendered inside a closed Shadow DOM:\n- Invisible to `document.querySelector()`\n- Excluded from agent-eyes DOM snapshots\n- Hidden from screenshots (annotations remain visible)\n- Page styles cannot affect toolbar appearance\n\n## Notes\n\n- Toolbar auto-repositions to stay on screen when dragged or resized\n- Badges reposition when window resizes or scrolls\n- Multiple badges on the same element stack with offset\n- Orphaned badges (element removed) are automatically cleaned up\n- Filter state persists during session but resets on page reload\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:44:21.036Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing real-time web page annotation capabilities for design review and issue tracking.","zh":"非常适合需要实时网页注释功能的前端代理，以进行设计审查和问题跟踪。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがリアルタイムのWebページ注釈機能を必要とするデザインレビューと問題追跡に最適です。","ko":"디자인 검토 및 문제 추적을 위해 실시간 웹 페이지 주석 기능이 필요한 프런트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de anotación de páginas web en tiempo real para revisión de diseños y seguimiento de problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités d''annotation de pages web en temps réel pour la revue de conception et le suivi des problèmes.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Echtzeit-Webseiten-Annotationsfunktionen für Design-Reviews und Fehlerverfolgung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades de anotação de páginas web em tempo real para revisão de design e acompanhamento de problemas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы возможности аннотации веб-страниц в режиме реального времени для проверки дизайна и отслеживания проблем.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تعليق صفحات الويب في الوقت الفعلي لمراجعة التصميم وتتبع المشكلات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to overlay live annotations directly on web pages, utilizing numbered badges with severity-colored borders, hover popovers for issue details, and one-click screenshot capture via HTML and CSS protocols.","zh":"使代理能够直接在网页上叠加实时注释，利用带有严重性颜色边框的编号徽章、悬停弹出窗口显示问题详细信息，并通过HTML和CSS协议实现一键截屏。","ja":"エージェントがWebページに直接リアルタイムの注釈を重ねることを可能にし、重み付けカラーボーダーの付いた番号バッジ、問題の詳細を表示するホバーポップオーバー、およびHTMLおよびCSSプロトコルを介したワンクリックスクリーンショットキャプチャを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 웹 페이지에 직접 실시간 주석을 오버레이 할 수 있도록 하여, 심각성 색상 테두리가 있는 번호 배지, 문제 세부 정보를 표시하는 호버 팝오버 및 HTML 및 CSS 프로토콜을 통한 한 번의 클릭으로 스크린샷을 캡처하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a superponer anotaciones en vivo directamente en las páginas web, utilizando insignias numeradas con bordes de colores de gravedad, popover de desplazamiento para detalles de problemas y captura de pantalla de un solo clic a través de protocolos HTML y CSS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de superposer des annotations en temps réel directement sur les pages web, en utilisant des badges numérotés avec des bordures de couleur de gravité, des popovers de survol pour les détails des problèmes et une capture d''écran en un seul clic via les protocoles HTML et CSS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, live-Anmerkungen direkt auf Webseiten zu überlagern, indem sie nummerierte Abzeichen mit Schweregrad-farbenen Rändern, Hover-Popover für Problemdetails und Ein-Klick-Screenshot-Erfassung über HTML- und CSS-Protokolle verwenden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes sobreponham anotações ao vivo diretamente em páginas web, utilizando badges numerados com bordas coloridas de gravidade, popovers de hover para detalhes de problemas e captura de tela de um clique via protocolos HTML e CSS.","ru":"Позволяет агентам наложить живые аннотации непосредственно на веб-страницы, используя пронумерованные значки с цветными границами степени тяжести, подсказки при наведении для деталей проблемы и захват экрана в один клик через протоколы HTML и CSS.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بوضع تعليقات مباشرة على صفحات الويب، باستخدام شارات رقمية مع حدود ملونة للشدة، ومعلومات مشاكل عند وضع المؤشر فوقها، وتصوير الشاشة بضغطة واحدة عبر بروتوكولات HTML وCSS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue tracking on web pages","Generating annotated screenshots for design reviews","Debugging UI elements with severity indicators"],"zh":["在网页上自动进行问题跟踪","为设计审查生成带注释的截图","使用严重性指示器调试UI元素"],"ja":["Webページでの問題追跡の自動化","デザインレビューのための注釈付きスクリーンショットの生成","重大性インジケータを使用したUI要素のデバッグ"],"ko":["웹 페이지에서 문제 추적 자동화","디자인 검토를 위한 주석이 포함된 스크린샷 생성","심각성 표시기를 사용한 UI 요소 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de problemas en páginas web","Generación de capturas de pantalla anotadas para revisiones de diseños","Depuración de elementos de interfaz de usuario con indicadores de gravedad"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des problèmes sur les pages web","Génération de captures d''écran annotées pour les revues de conception","Débogage des éléments d''interface utilisateur avec des indicateurs de gravité"],"de":["Automatisierung der Fehlerverfolgung auf Webseiten","Generierung von annotierten Screenshots für Design-Reviews","Fehlersuche von Benutzeroberflächenelementen mit Schweregrad-Indikatoren"],"pt":["Automatizar o acompanhamento de problemas em páginas web","Gerar capturas de tela anotadas para revisões de design","Depurar elementos de interface do usuário com indicadores de gravidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание проблем на веб-страницах","Генерировать аннотированные снимки экрана для проверки дизайна","Отлаживать элементы пользовательского интерфейса с индикаторами степени тяжести"],"ar":["أتمتة تتبع المشكلات على صفحات الويب","توليد لقطات شاشة معروضة لمراجعة التصميم","تصحيح أخطاء عناصر واجهة المستخدم مع مؤشرات الشدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires webpage access for overlay","Limited to web-based applications"],"zh":["需要网页访问权限才能叠加","仅限于基于Web的应用程序"],"ja":["重ね合わせるにはWebページへのアクセスが必要","Webベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["오버레이를 위해 웹 페이지 액세스가 필요함","웹 기반 응용 프로그램으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la página web para superponer","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en web"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la page web pour la superposition","Limité aux applications basées sur le web"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Webseite für die Überlagerung","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à página web para sobreposição","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web"],"ru":["Требует доступа к веб-странице для наложения","Ограничен веб-приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى صفحة الويب للتغطية","محدود بالتطبيقات القائمة على الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gpad1234/skills-imaginary-guide-agent/system-health', 'community', 'gpad1234', 'skills-imaginary-guide-agent', 'gpad1234/skills-imaginary-guide-agent', 'system-health', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:44:52.377Z', NULL, '{"id":"gpad1234/skills-imaginary-guide-agent/system-health","name":"system-health","description":{"zh":"系统健康检查技能提供系统信息、内存使用情况、CPU信息、顶级进程和磁盘使用情况","ja":"システムヘルスチェックスキルはシステム情報、メモリ使用状況、CPU情報、トッププロセス、ディスク使用状況を提供する","ko":"시스템 헬스 체크 스킬은 시스템 정보, 메모리 사용량, CPU 정보, 상위 프로세스, 디스크 사용량을 제공한다","es":"La comprobación de salud del sistema proporciona información detallada sobre el estado actual del sistema, incluyendo uso de memoria, CPU y disco","fr":"La vérification de l''état du système fournit des informations détaillées sur l''état actuel du système, y compris l''utilisation de la mémoire, du CPU et du disque","de":"Die Systemzustandsprüfung liefert detaillierte Informationen über den aktuellen Systemzustand, einschließlich Speicher-, CPU- und Festplattennutzung","pt":"O skill de sistema de saúde fornece informações detalhadas sobre o status do seu sistema, incluindo uso de memória, CPU e recursos de rede.","ru":"Навык системы здоровья предоставляет подробную информацию о состоянии вашей системы, включая использование памяти, CPU и сетевых ресурсов.","ar":"مهارة نظام الصحة توفر معلومات مفصلة عن حالة نظامك، بما في ذلك استخدام الذاكرة والcpu وموارد الشبكة.","en":"adding skills to mcp"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"系统健康检查工具","ja":"システムヘルスチェックツール","ko":"시스템 헬스 체크 도구","es":"Comprobación de Salud del Sistema","fr":"Vérification de l''État de Système","de":"Systemzustandsprüfung","pt":"Saúde do Sistema: Verifique o Status do Seu Sistema","ru":"Здоровье Системы: Проверьте Состояние Вашей Системы","ar":"صحة النظام: تحقق من حالة نظامك","en":"system-health"},"description":{"zh":"系统健康检查技能提供系统信息、内存使用情况、CPU信息、顶级进程和磁盘使用情况","ja":"システムヘルスチェックスキルはシステム情報、メモリ使用状況、CPU情報、トッププロセス、ディスク使用状況を提供する","ko":"시스템 헬스 체크 스킬은 시스템 정보, 메모리 사용량, CPU 정보, 상위 프로세스, 디스크 사용량을 제공한다","es":"La comprobación de salud del sistema proporciona información detallada sobre el estado actual del sistema, incluyendo uso de memoria, CPU y disco","fr":"La vérification de l''état du système fournit des informations détaillées sur l''état actuel du système, y compris l''utilisation de la mémoire, du CPU et du di...","de":"Die Systemzustandsprüfung liefert detaillierte Informationen über den aktuellen Systemzustand, einschließlich Speicher-, CPU- und Festplattennutzung","pt":"O skill de sistema de saúde fornece informações detalhadas sobre o status do seu sistema, incluindo uso de memória, CPU e recursos de rede.","ru":"Навык системы здоровья предоставляет подробную информацию о состоянии вашей системы, включая использование памяти, CPU и сетевых ресурсов.","ar":"مهارة نظام الصحة توفر معلومات مفصلة عن حالة نظامك، بما في ذلك استخدام الذاكرة والcpu وموارد الشبكة.","en":"adding skills to mcp"},"definition":{"en":"adding skills to mcp"},"features":{"zh":["系统信息（操作系统、主机名、运行时间）","内存使用情况","CPU信息","顶级进程和内存消耗","磁盘使用情况","网络接口"],"ja":["システム情報（OS、ホスト名、起動時間）","メモリ使用状況","CPU情報","トッププロセスとメモリ消費","ディスク使用状況","ネットワークインターフェース"],"ko":["시스템 정보（운영 체제, 호스트 이름, 실행 시간）","메모리 사용량","CPU 정보","상위 프로세스와 메모리 소비","디스크 사용량","네트워크 인터페이스"],"es":["Información del sistema (SO, nombre de host, tiempo de actividad)","Uso de memoria y CPU","Monitoreo de rendimiento","Procesos en ejecución y consumo de recursos","Uso de disco y redes"],"fr":["Informations sur le système (OS, nom d''hôte, temps d''activité)","Utilisation de la mémoire et du CPU","Surveillance des performances","Processus en cours et consommation de ressources","Utilisation du disque et des réseaux"],"de":["Systeminformationen (Betriebssystem, Hostname, Laufzeit)","Speicher- und CPU-Auslastung","Leistungsüberwachung","Aktuell laufende Prozesse und Ressourcenverbrauch","Festplatten- und Netzwerkauslastung"],"pt":["Verificação do status do sistema","Uso de memória e CPU","Monitoramento de recursos de rede","Informações sobre processos em execução","Uso de disco e interfaces de rede"],"ru":["Проверка состояния системы","Использование памяти и CPU","Мониторинг сетевых ресурсов","Информация о запущенных процессах","Использование диска и сетевых интерфейсов"],"ar":["التحقق من حالة النظام","استخدام الذاكرة والcpu","مراقبة موارد الشبكة","معلومات عن العمليات التي يتم تشغيلها","استخدام القرص وواجهات الشبكة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["系统健康检查","系统监控","资源利用率","性能指标","系统信息","内存使用情况","CPU信息","顶级进程"],"ja":["システムヘルスチェック","システムモニタリング","リソース使用率","パフォーマンスメトリック","システム情報","メモリ使用状況","CPU情報","トッププロセス"],"ko":["시스템 헬스 체크","시스템 모니터링","리소스 사용량","성능 지표","시스템 정보","메모리 사용량","CPU 정보","상위 프로세스"],"es":["comprobación de salud del sistema","monitoreo de rendimiento","uso de recursos","información del sistema","gestión de procesos","optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["vérification de l''état du système","surveillance des performances","utilisation des ressources","informations sur le système","gestion des processus","optimisation des performances"],"de":["Systemzustandsprüfung","Leistungsüberwachung","Ressourcenverbrauch","Systeminformationen","Prozessverwaltung","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["saúde do sistema","verificação de sistema","uso de memória","uso de cpu","monitoramento de recursos","desempenho do sistema"],"ru":["здоровье системы","проверка системы","использование памяти","использование cpu","мониторинг ресурсов","производительность системы"],"ar":["صحة النظام","التحقق من النظام","استخدام الذاكرة","استخدام cpu","مراقبة الموارد","أداء النظام"]}},"owner":"gpad1234","repo":"skills-imaginary-guide-agent","repoPath":"gpad1234/skills-imaginary-guide-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"system-health","description":"Query system health metrics including CPU, memory, disk usage, and running processes. Use this when the user asks about system status, performance monitoring, or resource utilization.","bodyPreview":"# System Health Check\n\nRun this skill when the user asks about:\n- System status or health\n- Resource utilization\n- Performance monitoring\n- Memory or CPU usage\n- Running processes and their consumption\n\n## Run using:\n\n```bash\n# Ensure venv is activated\nsource venv/bin/activate\npython scripts/check_system_health.py\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON with:\n- System information (OS, hostname, uptime)\n- Memory usage\n- CPU information\n- Top processes by memory consumption\n- Disk usage\n- Network interfaces","body":"# System Health Check\n\nRun this skill when the user asks about:\n- System status or health\n- Resource utilization\n- Performance monitoring\n- Memory or CPU usage\n- Running processes and their consumption\n\n## Run using:\n\n```bash\n# Ensure venv is activated\nsource venv/bin/activate\npython scripts/check_system_health.py\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON with:\n- System information (OS, hostname, uptime)\n- Memory usage\n- CPU information\n- Top processes by memory consumption\n- Disk usage\n- Network interfaces\n\n## Dependencies\n\nRequires the MCP osquery server to be available. Install dependencies with:\n```bash\nsource venv/bin/activate\npip install -r requirements.txt\n```\n\n## Environment\n\nNo environment variables required for basic usage.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:44:52.377Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for System Monitoring Agents requiring real-time system resource utilization and performance metrics.","zh":"适用于需要实时系统资源利用率和性能指标的系统监控代理。","ja":"システムモニタリングエージェントがリアルタイムのシステムリソース使用率とパフォーマンスメトリクスを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"실시간 시스템 리소스 사용량 및 성능 메트릭이 필요한 시스템 모니터링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Monitoreo de Sistemas que requieren utilización de recursos del sistema y métricas de rendimiento en tiempo real.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Surveillance de Système nécessitant une utilisation des ressources du système et des métriques de performance en temps réel.","de":"Ideal für Systemüberwachungsagenten, die eine Echtzeit-Systemressourcenauslastung und Leistungsmerkmale erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Monitoramento de Sistema que exigem utilização de recursos do sistema e métricas de desempenho em tempo real.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мониторинга системы, требующих отслеживания использования системных ресурсов и метрик производительности в режиме реального времени.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراقبة النظام الذي يتطلب استخدام موارد النظام وأداء الوقت الفعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to collect and analyze system information, including memory usage, CPU consumption, and disk usage, utilizing Python scripts and JSON output for seamless integration with various AI frameworks.","zh":"使代理能够收集和分析系统信息，包括内存使用情况、CPU消耗和磁盘使用情况，利用Python脚本和JSON输出实现与各种AI框架的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがシステム情報を収集して分析できるようにし、PythonスクリプトとJSON出力を使用して、メモリ使用状況、CPU消耗、ディスク使用状況などを収集し、様々なAIフレームワークとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 시스템 정보를 수집하고 분석할 수 있도록 하며, 파이썬 스크립트와 JSON 출력을 사용하여 메모리 사용량, CPU 소비, 디스크 사용량 등을 수집하고, 다양한 AI 프레임워크와의无缝集成을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recopilar y analizar información del sistema, incluido el uso de memoria, el consumo de CPU y el uso del disco, utilizando scripts de Python y salida JSON para una integración perfecta con varios marcos de inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Permet aux agents de collecter et d''analyser les informations du système, y compris l''utilisation de la mémoire, la consommation de CPU et l''utilisation du disque, en utilisant des scripts Python et une sortie JSON pour une intégration transparente avec divers cadres d''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Systeminformationen zu sammeln und zu analysieren, einschließlich Speicherauslastung, CPU-Verbrauch und Festplattenauslastung, unter Verwendung von Python-Skripten und JSON-Ausgabe für eine nahtlose Integration mit verschiedenen KI-Frameworks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coletar e analisar informações do sistema, incluindo uso de memória, consumo de CPU e uso de disco, utilizando scripts Python e saída JSON para integração perfeita com vários quadros de IA.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность собирать и анализировать системную информацию, включая использование памяти, потребление процессора и использование диска, с использованием скриптов Python и вывода JSON для бесшовной интеграции с различными框ами ИИ.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية جمع وتحليل المعلومات النظامية، بما في ذلك استخدام الذاكرة واستهلاك وحدة المعالجة المركزية واستخدام القرص، باستخدام نصوص برمجة بايثون وخرج JSON لتكامل مثالي مع إطارات الذكاء الاصطناعي المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring system performance for bottleneck detection","Automating resource utilization reporting","Debugging memory leaks in running processes"],"zh":["监控系统性能以检测瓶颈","自动化资源利用率报告","调试运行进程中的内存泄漏"],"ja":["ボトルネック検出のためのシステムパフォーマンスの監視","リソース使用率レポートの自動化","実行中のプロセス内のメモリリークのデバッグ"],"ko":["병목 현상检测을 위한 시스템 성능 모니터링","리소스 사용량 보고서 자동화","실행 중인 프로세스 내의 메모리 누수 디버깅"],"es":["Detección de cuellos de botella en el monitoreo del rendimiento del sistema","Automatización de informes de utilización de recursos","Depuración de fugas de memoria en procesos en ejecución"],"fr":["Détection de goulots d''étranglement pour la surveillance des performances du système","Automatisation des rapports d''utilisation des ressources","Débogage des fuites de mémoire dans les processus en cours d''exécution"],"de":["Erkennung von Engpässen bei der Systemleistungsüberwachung","Automatisierung von Ressourcenauslastungsberichten","Fehlerbehebung von Speicherlecks in laufenden Prozessen"],"pt":["Monitoramento do desempenho do sistema para detecção de gargalos","Automação de relatórios de utilização de recursos","Depuração de vazamentos de memória em processos em execução"],"ru":["Мониторинг производительности системы для обнаружения узких мест","Автоматизация отчетов об использовании ресурсов","Отладка утечек памяти в запущенных процессах"],"ar":["مراقبة أداء النظام لاكتشاف عُقبات الأداء","تأتمة تقارير استخدام الموارد","تصحيح أخطاء تسربات الذاكرة في العمليات المُشتغلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x and virtual environment setup","Limited to system-level metrics, no application-specific monitoring"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x和虚拟环境设置","仅限于系统级指标，无应用程序特定监控"],"ja":["Python 3.xと仮想環境設定が必要","システムレベルのメトリクスのみ、応用プログラム特定の監視はなし"],"ko":["파이썬 3.x와 가상 환경 설정이 필요함","시스템 수준의 메트릭만 해당하며, 응용 프로그램 특정 모니터링은 없음"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.x y configuración de entorno virtual","Limitado a métricas a nivel de sistema, no monitoreo específico de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.x et configuration d''un environnement virtuel","Limité aux métriques au niveau du système, pas de surveillance spécifique des applications"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.x und virtuelle UmgebungsEinrichtung","Begrenzt auf Systemebene-Metriken, keine anwendungsspezifische Überwachung"],"pt":["Exige Python 3.x e configuração de ambiente virtual","Limitado a métricas de nível de sistema, sem monitoramento específico de aplicativos"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.x и настройки виртуальной среды","Ограничен метриками уровня системы, без мониторинга конкретных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3.x وضبط بيئة افتراضية","محدود بمقاييس مستوى النظام، بدون مراقبة تطبيقات محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
