ement de logiciel assisté par l''IA, qui exécute des analyses de sécurité contre la base de code.","de":"Das Sicherheitsanalyse-Tool für Code ist eine von KI unterstützte Software-Entwicklungs-Vorlage, die Sicherheitsüberprüfungen gegen den Code-Stamm durchführt.","en":"Language-agnostic template for AI-assisted software development"},"definition":{"en":"Language-agnostic template for AI-assisted software development"},"features":{"zh":["支持代码安全扫描","识别代码漏洞和安全风险","语言无关的模板","支持依赖扫描","支持代码扫描","支持秘密扫描"],"ja":["コードセキュリティスキャンのサポート","コードの脆弱性とセキュリティリスクの識別","言語非依存テンプレート","依存関係スキャンのサポート","コードスキャンのサポート","シークレットスキャンのサポート"],"ko":["코드 보안 스캔 지원","코드 취약성과 보안 위험 식별","언어 독립형 템플릿","의존성 스캔 지원","코드 스캔 지원","비밀 스캔 지원"],"es":["Análisis de seguridad de código","Detección de vulnerabilidades","Análisis de dependencias","Búsqueda de secretos","Informes detallados"],"fr":["Analyse de sécurité de code","Détection de vulnérabilités","Analyse de dépendances","Recherche de secrets","Rapports détaillés"],"de":["Sicherheitsanalyse von Code","Schwachstellen-Erkennung","Abhängigkeitsanalyse","Geheimsuche","Detaillierte Berichte"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码安全扫描","AI驱动的代码安全","代码漏洞识别","安全风险识别","语言无关的模板","依赖扫描","代码扫描","秘密扫描"],"ja":["コードセキュリティスキャン","AI駆動のコードセキュリティ","コードの脆弱性識別","セキュリティリスク識別","言語非依存テンプレート","依存関係スキャン","コードスキャン","シークレットスキャン"],"ko":["코드 보안 스캔","AI 기반 코드 보안","코드 취약성 식별","보안 위험 식별","언어 독립형 템플릿","의존성 스캔","코드 스캔","비밀 스캔"],"es":["análisis de seguridad de código","desarrollo de software asistido por IA","herramienta de análisis de código","seguridad de código","vulnerabilidades de código","dependencias de código"],"fr":["analyse de sécurité de code","développement de logiciel assisté par l''IA","outil d''analyse de code","sécurité de code","vulnérabilités de code","dépendances de code"],"de":["Sicherheitsanalyse von Code","Software-Entwicklung mit KI-Unterstützung","Code-Analyse-Tool","Code-Sicherheit","Code-Schwachstellen","Code-Abhängigkeiten"]}},"owner":"coreindustries","repo":"core-ai-template","repoPath":"coreindustries/core-ai-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scan","description":"Run security scans against the codebase.","bodyPreview":"# /scan\n\nRun security scans against the codebase.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/security-scan [target] [--deps] [--code] [--secrets] [--all]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `target`: Specific file or directory (default: entire project)\n- `--deps`: Scan dependencies only\n- `--code`: Scan code only\n- `--secrets`: Scan for secrets only\n- `--all`: Run all scans (default)\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen this skill is invoked:\n\n### Agent Behavior (Codex-Max Pattern)\n\n**Autonomy:**\n- Complete all security scans end-to-end\n- Categorize","body":"# /scan\n\nRun security scans against the codebase.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/security-scan [target] [--deps] [--code] [--secrets] [--all]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `target`: Specific file or directory (default: entire project)\n- `--deps`: Scan dependencies only\n- `--code`: Scan code only\n- `--secrets`: Scan for secrets only\n- `--all`: Run all scans (default)\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen this skill is invoked:\n\n### Agent Behavior (Codex-Max Pattern)\n\n**Autonomy:**\n- Complete all security scans end-to-end\n- Categorize findings by severity\n- Provide remediation guidance\n\n**Thoroughness:**\n- Run all applicable security tools\n- Check against OWASP Top 10\n- Follow `.claude/rules/security*.md` guidelines\n\n### Scan Process\n\n1. **Read `prd/00_technology.md`** for security tools\n2. **Review `.claude/rules/security*.md`** for security standards\n\n3. **Run dependency scan**:\n   ```bash\n   # Tool depends on your stack (see prd/00_technology.md)\n   {dependency_scan_command}\n   ```\n\n4. **Run static code analysis**:\n   ```bash\n   {security_scan_command} src/\n   ```\n\n5. **Run secrets and PII detection** (gitleaks):\n   ```bash\n   # Full repo scan\n   scripts/scan-secrets.sh --all\n\n   # Or directly:\n   gitleaks detect --config .gitleaks.toml --verbose\n   ```\n\n6. **Categorize findings** by severity:\n   - **Critical**: Immediate action required\n   - **High**: Fix before deployment\n   - **Medium**: Address soon\n   - **Low**: Review when possible\n   - **Info**: Best practice suggestions\n\n7. **Generate report**\n\n### Security Report Format\n\n```markdown\n## Security Scan Report\n\n**Scan Date:** {date}\n**Overall Score:** {score}/100\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n\n| Severity | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| Critical | 0 |\n| High | 1 |\n| Medium | 2 |\n| Low | 3 |\n| Info | 5 |\n\n---\n\n### Dependency Vulnerabilities\n\n#### High Severity\n\n1. **CVE-2024-XXXX** in `package@1.2.3`\n   - Impact: Remote code execution\n   - Fix: Upgrade to 1.2.4+\n   - File: package.json:15\n\n---\n\n### Code Security Issues\n\n#### Medium Severity\n\n1. **SQL Injection Risk** (`src/{project}/db/queries:45`)\n   ```\n   # Issue: String concatenation in query\n   query = f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = {user_id}\"\n\n   # Fix: Use parameterized query\n   query = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\"\n   ```\n\n---\n\n### Secrets Detected\n\n#### High Severity\n\n1. **Potential API Key** (`src/{project}/config:23`)\n   - Pattern: `API_KEY = \"sk-...\"`\n   - Fix: Move to environment variable\n\n---\n\n### PII Detected\n\n#### High Severity\n\n1. **US Social Security Number** (`src/{project}/utils:78`)\n   - Pattern: `ssn = \"123-45-6789\"`\n   - Fix: Remove hardcoded PII, use encrypted storage\n2. **Credit Card Number** (`src/{project}/payments:34`)\n   - Pattern: `card = \"4111-1111-1111-1111\"`\n   - Fix: Use tokenized payment processing\n\n---\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. **Immediate**: Upgrade {package} to fix CVE-XXXX\n2. **High Priority**: Move hardcoded secrets to .env\n3. **Medium Priority**: Fix SQL injection in queries\n```\n\n### OWASP Top 10 Checks\n\nFrom `.claude/rules-available/security-owasp.md`:\n\n| Category | Check |\n|----------|-------|\n| A01 - Broken Access Control | Auth on all protected routes |\n| A02 - Cryptographic Failures | Modern algorithms, no hardcoded secrets |\n| A03 - Injection | Parameterized queries, input validation |\n| A04 - Insecure Design | Security headers, rate limiting |\n| A05 - Security Misconfiguration | No debug in prod, secure defaults |\n| A06 - Vulnerable Components | Up-to-date dependencies |\n| A07 - Auth Failures | Strong passwords, MFA, session management |\n| A08 - Integrity Failures | Safe deserialization, signed packages |\n| A09 - Logging Failures | Security event logging |\n| A10 - SSRF | URL validation, IP filtering |\n\n## Example Output\n\n```\n$ /scan\n\n🔒 Running security scans...\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📦 Dependency Scan\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nFound 2 vulnerabilities:\n  🔴 High: CVE-2024-1234 in requests@2.25.0\n  🟡 Medium: CVE-2024-5678 in yaml@5.3.0\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔍 Code Analysis\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nFound 1 issue:\n  🟡 Medium: Potential SQL injection (src/db/queries:45)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔑 Secrets & PII Detection (gitleaks)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ No secrets or PII detected\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📊 Security Score: 78/100\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nRecommendations:\n1. Upgrade requests to 2.28.0+\n2. Upgrade yaml to 6.0.0+\n3. Fix SQL injection in src/db/queries:45\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:45:38.314Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security-focused AI Agents requiring automated code vulnerability assessments.","zh":"适合需要自动代码漏洞评估的安全焦点AI代理的理想选择。","ja":"自動コード脆弱性評価を必要とするセキュリティ重視のAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동 코드 취약성 평가가 필요한 보안 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA con enfoque en seguridad que requieren evaluaciones de vulnerabilidades de código automatizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur la sécurité nécessitant des évaluations de vulnérabilités de code automatisées.","de":"Ideal für sicherheitsorientierte KI-Agents, die automatisierte Code-Schwachstellenbewertungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em Segurança que exigem avaliações de vulnerabilidade de código automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на безопасность, требующих автоматизированных оценок уязвимостей кода.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين مع التركيز على الأمن الذين يتطلبون تقييمات ثغرات الأمان الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run comprehensive security scans against codebases, including dependency and secret scanning, using protocols like security-scan with options such as --deps, --code, and --secrets.","zh":"赋予代理运行综合安全扫描的能力，包括对代码库进行依赖和密钥扫描，使用诸如security-scan的协议和--deps、--code、--secrets等选项。","ja":"セキュリティスキャンなどのプロトコルを使用して、依存関係やシークレットのスキャンを含むコードベースに対する包括的なセキュリティスキャンを実行するエージェントの能力を提供します。オプションとして--deps、--code、--secretsなどがあります。","ko":"보안 스캔 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 의존성 및 비밀 스캔을 포함한 코드베이스에 대한 포괄적인 보안 스캔을 실행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. --deps, --code, --secrets 등의 옵션이 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar análisis de seguridad integrales contra las bases de código, incluyendo análisis de dependencias y secretos, utilizando protocolos como security-scan con opciones como --deps, --code y --secrets.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des analyses de sécurité complètes contre les bases de code, y compris l''analyse des dépendances et des secrets, en utilisant des protocoles tels que security-scan avec des options telles que --deps, --code et --secrets.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, umfassende Sicherheitsscans gegen Codebasen durchzuführen, einschließlich Abhängigkeits- und Geheimnissscans, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie security-scan mit Optionen wie --deps, --code und --secrets.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar varreduras de segurança abrangentes contra repositórios de código, incluindo varredura de dependências e segredos, usando protocolos como security-scan com opções como --deps, --code e --secrets.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать комплексные проверки безопасности кодовых баз, включая сканирование зависимостей и секретов, с использованием протоколов типа security-scan с опциями типа --deps, --code и --secrets.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل فحوصات أمنية شاملة ضد قواعد بيانات التعليمات البرمجية، بما في ذلك فحص الإعتماديات والأسرار، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل security-scan مع خيارات مثل --deps و --code و --secrets."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating vulnerability detection in code repositories","Scanning dependencies for known security risks","Identifying hardcoded secrets in codebases"],"zh":["自动化代码仓库中的漏洞检测","扫描依赖项以发现已知的安全风险","在代码库中识别硬编码的密钥"],"ja":["コードリポジトリの脆弱性検出の自動化","依存関係のスキャンによる既知のセキュリティリスクの特定","コードベース内のハードコードされたシークレットの特定"],"ko":["코드 저장소에서 취약성 감지를 자동화하는 것","의존関係을 스캔하여 알려진 보안 위험을 식별하는 것","코드베이스에서 하드코딩된 비밀을 식별하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la detección de vulnerabilidades en repositorios de código","Escaneo de dependencias para riesgos de seguridad conocidos","Identificar secretos codificados en las bases de código"],"fr":["Automatiser la détection des vulnérabilités dans les référentiels de code","Analyser les dépendances pour les risques de sécurité connus","Identifier les secrets codés dans les bases de code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erkennung von Schwachstellen in Code-Repositorys","Scannen von Abhängigkeiten auf bekannte Sicherheitsrisiken","Identifizierung von hartcodierten Geheimnissen in Codebasen"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção de vulnerabilidades em repositórios de código","Digitalizar dependências para riscos de segurança conhecidos","Identificar segredos codificados no código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение уязвимостей в кодовых репозиториях","Сканировать зависимости на наличие известных рисков безопасности","Определять закодированные секреты в кодовой базе"],"ar":["أتمتة الكشف عن الثغرات في مستودعات التعليمات البرمجية","فحص الإعتماديات لتحديد المخاطر الأمنية المعروفة","تحديد الأسرار المدمجة في التعليمات البرمجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the codebase","Limited to security scans, does not provide code fixes"],"zh":["需要访问代码库","仅限安全扫描，不提供代码修复"],"ja":["コードベースへのアクセスが必要","セキュリティスキャンに限定され、コードの修復は提供されない"],"ko":["코드베이스에 접근할 수 있어야 함","보안 스캔만 가능하며 코드 수정은 제공되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código","Limitado a análisis de seguridad, no proporciona soluciones de código"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code","Limité aux analyses de sécurité, ne fournit pas de corrections de code"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Codebasis","Begrenzt auf Sicherheitsscans, bietet keine Codekorrekturen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à base de código","Limitado a varreduras de segurança, não fornece correções de código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе","Ограничен сканированием безопасности, не предоставляет исправления кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية","محدود بالفحوصات الأمنية، ولا يوفر تصحيحات للتعليمات البرمجية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
