:["Création de nouveaux projets de code","Enregistrement de projets existants","Consolidation des connaissances et mise à jour des documents","Gestion des priorités et mise à jour des fichiers de contexte","Exécution sécurisée de runbooks pour résoudre des problèmes courants"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Codeprojekte","Registrierung bestehender Projekte","Konsolidierung von Wissen und Aktualisierung von Dokumenten","Verwaltung von Prioritäten und Aktualisierung von Kontextdateien","Sichere Ausführung von Runbooks zur Lösung häufiger Probleme"],"pt":["Criação de novos projetos","Registro de projetos existentes","Consolidação de conhecimento e atualização de documentos","Gerenciamento de prioridades e contexto de projetos","Execução de runbooks para resolver problemas comuns"],"ru":["Создание новых проектов","Регистрация существующих проектов","Консолидация знаний и обновление документов","Управление приоритетами и контекстом проектов","Выполнение runbooks для решения общих проблем"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع جديدة","تسجيل المشاريع الحالية","توحيد المعرفة وتحديث الوثائق","إدارة الأولويات وسياق المشاريع","تنفيذ كتب التشغيل لحل المشاكل الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目管理","项目生命周期","AIfred","项目创建","项目注册","项目整合","项目管理工具"],"ja":["プロジェクト管理","プロジェクトライフサイクル","AIfred","プロジェクトの作成","プロジェクトの登録","プロジェクトの整合","プロジェクト管理ツール"],"ko":["프로젝트 관리","프로젝트 생명주기","AIfred","프로젝트 생성","프로젝트 등록","프로젝트 통합","프로젝트 관리 도구"],"es":["ciclo de vida del proyecto","gestión de proyectos","automatización de flujo de trabajo","creación de proyectos","consolidación de proyectos","gestión de prioridades"],"fr":["cycle de vie du projet","gestion de projet","automatisation de flux de travail","création de projets","consolidation de projets","gestion des priorités"],"de":["Projekt-Lebenszyklus","Projektverwaltung","Automatisierung von Workflow","Erstellung von Projekten","Konsolidierung von Projekten","Verwaltung von Prioritäten"],"pt":["gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de projetos","AIfred","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de projetos","consolidação de conhecimento","execução de runbooks"],"ru":["управление жизненным циклом проектов","AIfred","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектами","консолидация знаний","выполнение runbooks"],"ar":["إدارة دورة حياة المشروع","AIfred","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشاريع","توحيد المعرفة","تنفيذ كتب التشغيل"]}},"owner":"davidmoneil","repo":"AIfred","repoPath":"davidmoneil/AIfred","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-lifecycle","description":"End-to-end project management from creation through consolidation and archival","version":"1.0.0","tags":["projects","lifecycle","creation","registration","consolidation"],"bodyPreview":"# Project Lifecycle Skill\n\nComplete project management workflow from creation through consolidation and archival.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill consolidates all project lifecycle operations:\n- **Creation**: New code projects in ~/Code or internal projects in .claude/projects\n- **Registration**: Register existing projects with AIfred tracking\n- **Consolidation**: Sync knowledge, update docs, create commits\n- **Management**: Track priorities, update context files\n\n**Value**: Unified approach to pr","body":"# Project Lifecycle Skill\n\nComplete project management workflow from creation through consolidation and archival.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill consolidates all project lifecycle operations:\n- **Creation**: New code projects in ~/Code or internal projects in .claude/projects\n- **Registration**: Register existing projects with AIfred tracking\n- **Consolidation**: Sync knowledge, update docs, create commits\n- **Management**: Track priorities, update context files\n\n**Value**: Unified approach to project management with consistent patterns and documentation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Actions\n\n| Need | Action | Reference |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| Create new code project | `/new-code-project <name>` | @.claude/commands/new-code-project.md |\n| Register existing project | `/register-project <path-or-url>` | @.claude/commands/register-project.md |\n| Create internal project | `/create-project <name>` | @.claude/commands/create-project.md |\n| Consolidate project knowledge | `/consolidate-project <name>` | @.claude/commands/consolidate-project.md |\n\n---\n\n## Project Lifecycle Workflow\n\n```\nPROJECT LIFECYCLE\n=================\n\nCREATE (new projects)\n  /new-code-project <name>\n    - Creates in ~/Code/<name>\n    - Initializes git, README, .claude/CLAUDE.md\n    - Registers in paths-registry.yaml\n    - Creates context file at .claude/context/projects/<name>.md\n\n  /create-project <name>\n    - Creates internal project in .claude/projects/<name>\n    - For non-code projects (writing, research, planning)\n    - Creates project structure with config.yaml\n\nREGISTER (existing projects)\n  /register-project <path-or-url>\n    - Clones GitHub URL to ~/Code/ if needed\n    - Auto-detects language/type\n    - Adds to paths-registry.yaml\n    - Creates context file\n\nCONSOLIDATE (ongoing maintenance)\n  /consolidate-project <name>\n    - Updates context file with current state\n    - Syncs documentation with code\n    - Creates git commit with changes\n    - Options: --infrastructure, --analyze, --all\n\nARCHIVE (completed projects)\n  - Move context to .claude/context/archive/\n  - Update paths-registry.yaml status\n  - Optional: Remove from ~/Code/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Project Locations\n\nUnderstanding where projects live:\n\n| Project Type | Location | Registration |\n|--------------|----------|--------------|\n| Code projects | `~/Code/<project>/` | `paths-registry.yaml` → `coding.projects` |\n| Internal projects | `.claude/projects/<project>/` | Direct in AIfred |\n| Context/notes | `.claude/context/projects/<project>.md` | Always in AIfred |\n| External sources | `external-sources/<category>/` | Symlinks to external data |\n\n---\n\n## Context File Template\n\nWhen creating project context files, use this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Project: <name>\n\n**Type**: web-app | api | cli | library | docker | internal\n**Language**: typescript | python | go | rust | N/A\n**Location**: ~/Code/<name> or .claude/projects/<name>\n**Status**: active | maintenance | archived\n**Created**: YYYY-MM-DD\n\n## Overview\n\nBrief description of project purpose.\n\n## Key Files\n\n- `src/` - Main source code\n- `README.md` - Project documentation\n\n## Current State\n\nWhat''s working, what''s in progress.\n\n## Integration Points\n\nHow this connects to AIfred infrastructure.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Registration Patterns\n\n### GitHub URL Detection\n\nWhen user mentions a GitHub URL:\n1. Check if already registered in `paths-registry.yaml`\n2. If not, clone to `~/Code/<repo-name>`\n3. Auto-detect language from file extensions\n4. Add to registry under `coding.projects`\n5. Create context file\n\n### Existing Local Project\n\nWhen registering an existing local project:\n1. Verify path exists\n2. Detect project type and language\n3. Add to `paths-registry.yaml`\n4. Create context file\n5. Optionally initialize `.claude/CLAUDE.md` in project\n\n---\n\n## Integration Points\n\n### With Session Management\n- New projects can be noted in session-state.md\n- Project work tracked via current-priorities.md\n\n### With Orchestration\n- Complex project setup may trigger orchestration\n- Use `/orchestration:plan \"setup [project]\"` for multi-phase setup\n\n### With Memory MCP\n- Store project metadata as Memory entities\n- Track project relationships and dependencies\n\n### With paths-registry.yaml\n- Source of truth for all project locations\n- Check before assuming any path\n\n---\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Starting a New Feature Project\n\n```\n1. /new-code-project my-feature --type api --lang typescript\n2. Review generated structure in ~/Code/my-feature\n3. Update context file with specific requirements\n4. Begin development\n```\n\n### Onboarding Existing Project\n\n```\n1. /register-project https://github.com/user/repo\n2. Review auto-detected settings\n3. Update context file with domain knowledge\n4. Add any custom CLAUDE.md to the project\n```\n\n### Project Knowledge Sync\n\n```\n1. /consolidate-project my-project\n2. Review documentation updates\n3. Commit changes\n4. Update session-state.md if needed\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Project not appearing in registry?\n- Check `paths-registry.yaml` directly\n- Verify path exists: `ls ~/Code/<project>`\n- Re-run `/register-project <path>`\n\n### Context file out of date?\n- Run `/consolidate-project <name>`\n- Review changes before committing\n- Update manually if consolidation misses details\n\n### Git clone failing?\n- Check SSH key: `ssh -T git@github.com`\n- Verify URL format\n- Check network connectivity\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n### Commands\n- @.claude/commands/new-code-project.md - New code project creation\n- @.claude/commands/register-project.md - Project registration\n- @.claude/commands/create-project.md - Internal project creation\n- @.claude/commands/consolidate-project.md - Project consolidation\n\n### Context Files\n- @paths-registry.yaml - Project registration source of truth\n- @.claude/context/projects/ - All project context files\n- @.claude/templates/project-template/ - Project template structure\n\n### Patterns\n- @.claude/context/patterns/memory-storage-pattern.md - When to store in Memory\n- @.claude/context/standards/documentation-location.md - Where to document\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:46:43.901Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT that require streamlined project management, from creation to archival, to enhance their development workflows.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 等需要从创建到存档的流线项目管理以增强其开发工作流程的 AI 代理。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの、作成からアーカイブまでの一貫したプロジェクト管理が必要な AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Claude Code와 AutoGPT 같은 개발 워크플로우를 강화하기 위해 생성에서 보관까지의 일관된 프로젝트 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren una gestión de proyectos optimizada, desde la creación hasta el archivo, para mejorar sus flujos de trabajo de desarrollo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT qui nécessitent une gestion de projet rationalisée, de la création à l''archivage, pour améliorer leurs flux de travail de développement.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die eine optimierte Projektverwaltung von der Erstellung bis zum Archivieren benötigen, um ihre Entwicklungsworkflows zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que requerem uma gestão de projetos simplificada, desde a criação até o arquivamento, para melhorar os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которые требуют оптимизированного управления проектами, от создания до архивации, для улучшения рабочих процессов разработки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يتطلبون إدارة مشروع مبسطة، من الإنشاء إلى الأرشفة، لتحسين سير عمل التطوير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to unify project lifecycle operations, including creation, registration, consolidation, and management, utilizing runbooks and plain English explanations to track priorities and update context files via protocols like Git commits.","zh":"赋予代理统一项目生命周期操作的能力，包括创建、注册、整合和管理，利用运行手册和纯英语解释来跟踪优先级并通过 Git 提交等协议更新上下文文件。","ja":"作成、登録、統合、管理など、プロジェクトライフサイクル操作を一元化するエージェントの能力を提供します。ランブックや平易な英語による説明を使用して、優先順位を追跡し、Git コミットなどのプロトコルを使用してコンテキストファイルを更新します。","ko":"생성, 등록, 통합 및 관리 등을 포함한 프로젝트 생명주기 작업을 일원화하여 에이전트의 능력을 강화하며, 런북과 평이한 영어 설명을 사용하여 우선순위를 추적하고 Git 커밋 등의 프로토콜을 통해 컨텍스트 파일을 업데이트 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a unificar las operaciones del ciclo de vida del proyecto, incluyendo la creación, el registro, la consolidación y la gestión, utilizando runbooks y explicaciones en inglés claro para rastrear prioridades y actualizar archivos de contexto a través de protocolos como Git commits.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''unifier les opérations du cycle de vie du projet, y compris la création, l''enregistrement, la consolidation et la gestion, en utilisant des runbooks et des explications en anglais clair pour suivre les priorités et mettre à jour les fichiers de contexte via des protocoles comme Git commits.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Projektlebenszyklus-Operationen zu vereinen, einschließlich Erstellung, Registrierung, Konsolidierung und Verwaltung, unter Verwendung von Runbooks und klaren englischen Erklärungen, um Prioritäten zu verfolgen und Kontextdateien über Protokolle wie Git-Commits zu aktualisieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes unifiquem as operações do ciclo de vida do projeto, incluindo criação, registro, consolidação e gestão, utilizando runbooks e explicações em inglês simples para rastrear prioridades e atualizar arquivos de contexto via protocolos como commits do Git.","ru":"Позволяет агентам объединять операции жизненного цикла проекта, включая создание, регистрацию, консолидацию и управление, используя runbooks и объяснения на простом английском языке для отслеживания приоритетов и обновления файлов контекста через протоколы, такие как коммиты Git.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توحيد عمليات دورة حياة المشروع، بما في ذلك الإنشاء والتسجيل والتحويل والتدارة، باستخدام الكتب التشغيلية والتوضيحات باللغة الإنجليزية البسيطة لتتبع الأولويات وتحديث ملفات السياق عبر بروتوكولات مثل تعهدات Git."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project setup and registration for new code projects in ~/Code or internal projects in .claude/projects","Consolidating knowledge and updating documentation for existing projects","Managing project priorities and context files through AIfred''s tracking and execution capabilities"],"zh":["为新代码项目在 ~/Code 或内部项目在 .claude/projects 中自动设置和注册项目","整合现有项目的知识并更新文档","通过 AIfred 的跟踪和执行能力来管理项目优先级和上下文文件"],"ja":["~/Code または .claude/projects 内の新しいコードプロジェクトのプロジェクト設定と登録を自動化する","既存のプロジェクトの知識を統合してドキュメントを更新する","AIfred のトラッキングと実行機能を使用してプロジェクトの優先順位とコンテキストファイルを管理する"],"ko":["~/Code 또는 .claude/projects 내의 새로운 코드 프로젝트를 위한 프로젝트 설정 및 등록 자동화","기존 프로젝트의 지식 통합 및 문서 업데이트","AIfred의 추적 및 실행 기능을 사용하여 프로젝트 우선순위 및 컨텍스트 파일 관리"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración y el registro de proyectos de código nuevos en ~/Code o proyectos internos en .claude/projects","Consolidar conocimientos y actualizar la documentación para proyectos existentes","Gestionar prioridades y archivos de contexto a través de las capacidades de seguimiento y ejecución de AIfred"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration et l''enregistrement de projets de code nouveaux dans ~/Code ou des projets internes dans .claude/projects","Consolider les connaissances et mettre à jour la documentation pour les projets existants","Gérer les priorités et les fichiers de contexte via les capacités de suivi et d''exécution d''AIfred"],"de":["Automatisieren der Einrichtung und Registrierung neuer Codeprojekte in ~/Code oder interner Projekte in .claude/projects","Konsolidieren von Wissen und Aktualisieren der Dokumentation für bestehende Projekte","Verwalten von Prioritäten und Kontextdateien über die Nachverfolgungs- und Ausführungsfähigkeiten von AIfred"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração e registro de projetos de código novos em ~/Code ou projetos internos em .claude/projects","Consolidar conhecimento e atualizar documentação para projetos existentes","Gerenciar prioridades e arquivos de contexto por meio das capacidades de rastreamento e execução do AIfred"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку и регистрацию новых проектов кода в ~/Code или внутренних проектов в .claude/projects","Консолидировать знания и обновлять документацию для существующих проектов","Управлять приоритетами и файлами контекста с помощью возможностей отслеживания и выполнения AIfred"],"ar":["توفير تشغيل تلقائي لإعداد وتسجيل مشاريع код جديدة في ~/Code أو مشاريع داخلية في .claude/projects","تحويل المعرفة وتحديث الوثائق لمشاريع موجودة","إدارة الأولويات وملفات السياق من خلال إمكانيات تتبع وتشغيل AIfred"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AIfred command deck integration","Limited to projects within ~/Code or .claude/projects directories","Dependent on runbooks for safe execution of fixes"],"zh":["需要 AIfred 命令甲板集成","仅限于 ~/Code 或 .claude/projects 目录内的项目","依赖于运行手册以安全地执行修复"],"ja":["AIfred コマンドデッキの統合が必要","~/Code または .claude/projects ディレクトリ内のプロジェクトのみに対応","修復の安全な実行にはランブックに依存する"],"ko":["AIfred 명령 덱 통합이 필요함","~/Code 또는 .claude/projects 디렉토리 내의 프로젝트만 해당","수정의 안전한 실행을 위해 런북에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con el comando AIfred","Limitado a proyectos dentro de los directorios ~/Code o .claude/projects","Dependiente de runbooks para la ejecución segura de correcciones"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le pont de commandes AIfred","Limité aux projets dans les répertoires ~/Code ou .claude/projects","Dépendant de runbooks pour l''exécution sécurisée des correctifs"],"de":["Benötigt Integration mit dem AIfred-Befehlsdeck","Begrenzt auf Projekte innerhalb der Verzeichnisse ~/Code oder .claude/projects","Abhängig von Runbooks für die sichere Ausführung von Korrekturen"],"pt":["Requer integração com o convés de comando AIfred","Limitado a projetos dentro dos diretórios ~/Code ou .claude/projects","Dependente de runbooks para execução segura de correções"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с командным мостом AIfred","Ограничен проектами внутри директорий ~/Code или .claude/projects","Зависит от runbooks для безопасного выполнения исправлений"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع غرفة قيادة AIfred","محدود بمشاريع داخل المجلدات ~/Code أو .claude/projects","يعتمد على الكتب التشغيلية لتنفيذ الإصلاحات بأمان"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mcsdodo/kniha-jazd/code-review', 'community', 'mcsdodo', 'kniha-jazd', 'mcsdodo/kniha-jazd', 'code-review', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:46:32.717Z', NULL, '{"id":"mcsdodo/kniha-jazd/code-review","name":"code-review","description":{"zh":"代码审查技能是一种确保代码质量和正确性的技术，通过两阶段审查过程和预设配置来实现","ja":"コードレビュースキルは、コードの品質と正確性を確保する技術です。2段階のレビューと事前設定を使用します","ko":"코드 리뷰 스킬은 코드 품질과 정확성을 보장하는 기술로, 2단계 리뷰 프로세스와 사전 설정을 사용합니다","es":"La revisión de código es un proceso de dos fases que analiza y documenta los hallazgos, y luego aplica las soluciones aprobadas.","fr":"La révision de code est un processus en deux phases qui analyse et documente les résultats, puis applique les solutions approuvées.","de":"Die Code-Review ist ein zweiphasiger Prozess, der die Ergebnisse analysiert und dokumentiert und dann die genehmigten Lösungen anwendet.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查技能-确保代码质量","ja":"コードレビュースキル-コード品質を確保","ko":"코드 리뷰 스킬-코드 품질 보장","es":"Revisión de Código: Mejora la Calidad del Código","fr":"Révision de Code : Améliorer la Qualité du Code","de":"Code-Review: Code-Qualität verbessern","en":"code-review"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查技能是一种确保代码质量和正确性的技术，通过两阶段审查过程和预设配置来实现","ja":"コードレビュースキルは、コードの品質と正確性を確保する技術です。2段階のレビューと事前設定を使用します","ko":"코드 리뷰 스킬은 코드 품질과 정확성을 보장하는 기술로, 2단계 리뷰 프로세스와 사전 설정을 사용합니다","es":"La revisión de código es un proceso de dos fases que analiza y documenta los hallazgos, y luego aplica las soluciones aprobadas.","fr":"La révision de code est un processus en deux phases qui analyse et documente les résultats, puis applique les solutions approuvées.","de":"Die Code-Review ist ein zweiphasiger Prozess, der die Ergebnisse analysiert und dokumentiert und dann die genehmigten Lösungen anwendet.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["两阶段审查过程","预设配置","代码质量检查","正确性验证","最多4次迭代"],"ja":["2段階のレビュー","事前設定","コード品質のチェック","正確性の検証","最大4回のイテレーション"],"ko":["2단계 리뷰 프로세스","사전 설정","코드 품질 검사","정확성 검증","최대 4회 반복"],"es":["Análisis y documentación de hallazgos","Aplicación de soluciones aprobadas","Enfoque en la calidad del código","Verificación de la calidad después de la fusión","Revisión en dos fases"],"fr":["Analyse et documentation des résultats","Application des solutions approuvées","Focus sur la qualité du code","Vérification de la qualité après la fusion","Révision en deux phases"],"de":["Analyse und Dokumentation der Ergebnisse","Anwendung der genehmigten Lösungen","Fokus auf die Code-Qualität","Qualitätsprüfung nach dem Merge","Zweiphasige Überprüfung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","代码正确性","代码审查技能","开发人员工具","代码review"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","コード正確性","コードレビュースキル","開発者ツール","コードreview"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","코드 정확성","코드 리뷰 스킬","개발자 도구","코드review"],"es":["revisión de código","calidad del código","desarrollo de software","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","mejora de la calidad","optimización del código"],"fr":["révision de code","qualité du code","développement de logiciels","flux de travail de développement","amélioration de la qualité","optimisation du code"],"de":["Code-Review","Code-Qualität","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsworkflow","Qualitätsverbesserung","Code-Optimierung"]}},"owner":"mcsdodo","repo":"kniha-jazd","repoPath":"mcsdodo/kniha-jazd","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-review","description":"Use to review code implementations for quality, correctness, and best practices","bodyPreview":"# Code Review Skill\n\nTwo-phase review: First analyze and document findings, then apply approved fixes.\n\n**Preset Configuration:**\n- Focus: Code quality, correctness, best practices\n- Quality Gate: No new findings for 1 iteration (review comprehensive)\n- Reviewer Type: Senior Code Reviewer\n- Max Iterations: 4\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing implementation of a feature\n- Before creating a pull request\n- When refactoring significant code\n- Post-merge quality verification\n\n## Required Informatio","body":"# Code Review Skill\n\nTwo-phase review: First analyze and document findings, then apply approved fixes.\n\n**Preset Configuration:**\n- Focus: Code quality, correctness, best practices\n- Quality Gate: No new findings for 1 iteration (review comprehensive)\n- Reviewer Type: Senior Code Reviewer\n- Max Iterations: 4\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing implementation of a feature\n- Before creating a pull request\n- When refactoring significant code\n- Post-merge quality verification\n\n## Required Information\n\n1. **Target** - code path or git range (e.g., `src-tauri/src/calculations.rs` or `HEAD~3..HEAD`)\n2. **Reference** - plan or spec the code implements\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Review (Findings Only)\n\n### Step 1: Gather Code Context\n\nIf git range provided:\n```bash\ngit diff --stat {BASE}..{HEAD}\ngit diff {BASE}..{HEAD}\n```\n\nIf file path provided:\n- Read the file(s)\n- Identify recent changes\n\n### Step 2: Run Tests (Baseline)\n\n```bash\nnpm run test:backend\n```\n\nNote test status for review context (pass/fail). Do NOT fix yet.\n\n### Step 3: Create Review Document\n\nCreate `_code-review.md` in project root or task folder:\n\n```markdown\n# Code Review\n\n**Target:** {TARGET}\n**Reference:** {REFERENCE}\n**Started:** YYYY-MM-DD\n**Status:** In Progress\n**Focus:** Quality, correctness, best practices\n\n**Baseline Test Status:** [Pass / N failures]\n\n## Iteration 1\n\n### Findings\n\n[To be filled by review agent]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Review Loop\n\nFor each iteration (max 4):\n\n**Spawn Review Agent:**\n\n```\nTask tool (superpowers:code-reviewer):\n  Use template from requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\n\n  WHAT_WAS_IMPLEMENTED: {description from reference}\n  PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS: {REFERENCE}\n  BASE_SHA: {BASE or N/A}\n  HEAD_SHA: {HEAD or current}\n\n  IMPORTANT: Document findings only. Do not apply fixes.\n```\n\n**Update Review Document:** Append findings to `_code-review.md`:\n```markdown\n## Iteration N\n\n### New Findings\n- [Critical] Issue description - `file:line` - Suggested fix\n- [Important] Issue description - `file:line` - Suggested fix\n- [Minor] Issue description - `file:line` - Suggested fix\n\n### Test Gaps\n[Any missing test coverage noted]\n\n### Coverage Assessment\n[Areas reviewed / Areas remaining]\n```\n\n**Commit Review Only:**\n```bash\ngit add _code-review.md\ngit commit -m \"review(code): iteration N findings for {TARGET}\"\n```\n\n**Quality Gate:** Exit when no new findings for 1 iteration (review is comprehensive).\n\n### Step 5: Finalize Review Document\n\nUpdate `_code-review.md` with summary:\n\n```markdown\n## Review Summary\n\n**Status:** Ready for User Review\n**Iterations:** N\n**Total Findings:** X Critical, Y Important, Z Minor\n**Test Status:** [Pass / Fail]\n\n### All Findings (Consolidated)\n\n#### Critical\n1. [ ] Issue - `file:line` - Suggested fix\n\n#### Important\n1. [ ] Issue - `file:line` - Suggested fix\n\n#### Minor\n1. [ ] Issue - `file:line` - Suggested fix\n\n### Test Gaps\n- [ ] Missing test for X\n- [ ] Edge case Y not covered\n\n### Recommendation\n[Ready to merge / Needs fixes / Major issues]\n```\n\n**Commit:**\n```bash\ngit add _code-review.md\ngit commit -m \"review(code): complete findings for {TARGET}\"\n```\n\n### Step 6: Present Review for Approval\n\nInform user:\n\n> **Code review complete.**\n>\n> Please review `_code-review.md` for findings.\n>\n> After your review, let me know:\n> - Which findings to fix\n> - Which to skip (with reason)\n> - Any questions about findings\n\n**STOP and wait for user direction.**\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Apply Approved Fixes\n\n*Only proceed after user approval.*\n\n### Step 7: Apply Approved Fixes\n\nFor each user-approved finding:\n\n1. Implement the fix\n2. Check the finding as addressed in `_code-review.md`: `[x]`\n\n### Step 8: Run Tests\n\n```bash\nnpm run test:backend\n```\n\nIf tests fail:\n- Diagnose the failure\n- Fix or report to user for decision\n\n### Step 9: Commit Changes\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"fix: address code review findings\n\nAddressed:\n- [list of fixed issues]\"\n```\n\n### Step 10: Final Assessment\n\nUpdate `_code-review.md`:\n\n```markdown\n## Resolution\n\n**Addressed:** N findings\n**Skipped:** M findings (user decision)\n**Test Status:** All passing\n**Status:** Complete\n\n### Applied Fixes\n- Finding 1: [how resolved]\n- Finding 2: [how resolved]\n\n### Skipped Items\n- Finding X: [user''s reason]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Domain-Specific Checklist\n\nReview should verify:\n- [ ] Tests pass\n- [ ] No obvious bugs\n- [ ] Error handling present\n- [ ] No security vulnerabilities (input validation, etc.)\n- [ ] Code matches plan/spec\n- [ ] No scope creep (extra features not requested)\n- [ ] Follows project patterns (see CLAUDE.md)\n\n## Example\n\n```\nUser: /code-review src-tauri/src/suggestions.rs against _tasks/19-feature/02-plan.md\n\nClaude: [Executes Phase 1 - runs tests, creates _code-review.md, iterates until comprehensive]\nClaude: Code review complete. Please review _code-review.md for findings.\n\nUser: Fix all Critical issues. Skip the Minor style suggestions.\n\nClaude: [Executes Phase 2 - applies approved fixes, runs tests, commits]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:46:32.717Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Senior Code Reviewer Agents automating pull request analysis and technical debt reduction.","zh":"非常适合高级代码审查者代理自动化拉取请求分析和技术债务减少。","ja":"シニアコードレビューエージェントによるプルリクエスト分析とテクニカルデット削減の自動化に最適。","ko":"시니어 코드 리뷰어 에이전트가 풀 리퀘스트 분석 및 기술 부채 감소를 자동화하는 데 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código Senior que automatizan el análisis de solicitudes de extracción y la reducción de deuda técnica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code senior qui automatisent l''analyse des demandes d''extraction et la réduction de la dette technique.","de":"Perfekt für Senior-Code-Reviewer-Agents, die die Analyse von Pull-Request und die Reduzierung von technischer Schulden automatisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código Sênior que automatizam a análise de solicitações de pull e redução de dívida técnica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для старших агентов кодового обзора, автоматизирующих анализ запросов на включение и сокращение технического долга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الأقدم الذي يؤتمة تحليل طلبات السحب وتقليل الديون الفنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive two-phase code review with documented analysis followed by automated fix application. Provides senior-level quality gates ensuring no new findings for one full iteration with configurable maximum review cycles.","zh":"能够进行全面性的双阶段代码审查，伴随着记录分析并随后进行自动修复。提供高级质量门控，确保一个完整迭代周期内无新发现，且最大审查循环可配置。","ja":"包括ドキュメント化された分析に続く自動修正を含む、包括的な2段階のコードレビューを可能にします。シニアレベルの品質ゲートを提供し、1つの完全なイテレーションで新しい発見がないことを保証し、最大レビューサイクルは設定可能です。","ko":"전반적인 2단계 코드 리뷰를 가능하게 하며, 문서화된 분석에 따른 자동 수정을 포함합니다. 한 전체 반복周期 동안 새로 발견되는 내용이 없음을 보장하는 시니어급 품질 게이트를 제공하며, 최대 리뷰 주기는 설정 가능합니다.","es":"Permite una revisión de código integral de dos fases con análisis documentado seguido de la aplicación automática de soluciones. Proporciona puertas de calidad de nivel senior que garantizan que no haya nuevos hallazgos durante una iteración completa con ciclos de revisión máximo configurables.","fr":"Permet une révision de code globale en deux phases avec une analyse documentée suivie d''une application automatique de correctifs. Fournit des portes de qualité de niveau senior qui garantissent qu''il n''y a pas de nouveaux résultats pendant une itération complète avec des cycles de révision maximum configurables.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende zweiphasige Code-Überprüfung mit dokumentierter Analyse gefolgt von der automatischen Anwendung von Lösungen. Bietet Senior-Qualitätsschranken, die sicherstellen, dass es während einer vollen Iteration keine neuen Ergebnisse gibt, mit konfigurierbaren maximalen Überprüfungszyklen.","pt":"Permite uma revisão de código abrangente de duas fases com análise documentada seguida de aplicação de correção automática. Fornece portões de qualidade de nível sênior que garantem que não haja novas descobertas por uma iteração completa com ciclos de revisão máximos configuráveis.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять всесторонний двухфазный обзор кода с документированным анализом, за которым следует автоматическое применение исправления. Обеспечивает старшие ворота качества, гарантирующие, что не будет новых результатов за один полный итерацию с настраиваемыми максимальными циклами обзора.","ar":"يسمح بمراجعة شاملة لمدة مرحلتين مع تحليل مدون يليها تطبيق تصحيح آلي. يوفر بوابات جودة من المستوى الأعلى التي تضمن عدم وجود نتائج جديدة لمدة.iteration واحدة مع دورات مراجعة قابلة للتكوين."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing code quality and correctness pre-PR","Applying approved best practice fixes automatically","Verifying post-merge quality standards","Refactoring significant code sections systematically"],"zh":["分析代码质量和正确性（PR前）","自动应用批准的最佳实践修复","验证合并后的质量标准","系统地重构重要代码部分"],"ja":["PR前のコード品質と正しさの分析","承認されたベストプラクティス修正の自動適用","マージ後の品質基準の検証","重要なコードセクションの体系的なリファクタリング"],"ko":["PR前的 코드 품질 및 올바름 분석","승인된 모범 사례 수정의 자동 적용","병합 후의 품질 표준 확인","중요한 코드 섹션의 체계적인 리팩토링"],"es":["Analizar la calidad y corrección del código pre-solicitud de extracción","Aplicar soluciones de mejores prácticas aprobadas automáticamente","Verificar los estándares de calidad posteriores a la fusión","Reestructurar secciones de código significativas de manera sistemática"],"fr":["Analyser la qualité et la correction du code avant la demande d''extraction","Appliquer des correctifs de meilleures pratiques approuvés automatiquement","Vérifier les normes de qualité post-fusion","Réorganiser systématiquement des sections de code importantes"],"de":["Die Qualität und Richtigkeit des Codes vor der Pull-Request-Analyse","Automatisch genehmigte Best-Practice-Lösungen anwenden","Qualitätsstandards nach dem Merge überprüfen","Bedeutende Codeabschnitte systematisch umstrukturieren"],"pt":["Analisar a qualidade e a correção do código pré-solicitação de pull","Aplicar correções de melhor prática aprovadas automaticamente","Verificar os padrões de qualidade pós-fusão","Reestruturar seções de código significativas de forma sistemática"],"ru":["Анализировать качество и правильность кода до запроса на включение","Применять автоматически утвержденные исправления лучших практик","Проверять стандарты качества после слияния","Перестраивать значительные разделы кода систематически"],"ar":["تحليل جودة وصحّة الكود قبل طلب السحب","تطبيق إصلاحات أفضل الممارسات المعتمدة آليًا","التحقق من معايير الجودة بعد الدمج","إعادة هيكلة أقسام الكود الهامة بشكل منهجي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive implementation documentation","Limited to 4 maximum review iterations","Depends on clear quality gate criteria definition"],"zh":["需要全面性的实现文档","仅限4次最大审查迭代","依赖于明确的质量门控标准定义"],"ja":["包括的な実装ドキュメントが必要","最大4回のレビューサイクルに限定","明確な品質ゲート基準の定義に依存"],"ko":["포괄적인 구현 문서가 필요","최대 4회의 리뷰 사이클로 제한","명확한 품질 게이트 기준 정의에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una documentación de implementación integral","Limitado a 4 iteraciones de revisión máximo","Depende de la definición clara de los criterios de las puertas de calidad"],"fr":["Nécessite une documentation d''implémentation complète","Limité à 4 itérations de révision maximum","Dépend de la définition claire des critères des portes de qualité"],"de":["Erfordert umfassende Implementierungsdokumentation","Begrenzt auf 4 maximale Überprüfungszyklen","Hängt von der klaren Definition der Qualitäts-Schranken-Kriterien ab"],"pt":["Exige documentação de implementação abrangente","Limitado a 4 iterações de revisão máximas","Depende da definição clara dos critérios de portas de qualidade"],"ru":["Требует всесторонней документации по реализации","Ограничен до 4 максимальных итераций обзора","Зависит от четкого определения критериев ворот качества"],"ar":["يتطلب توثيق شاملا للتطبيق","محدود ب 4 دورات مراجعة قصوى","يعتمد على تعريف واضح لمعايير بوابات الجودة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
