istro de errores, correcciones y patrones","fr":"Findings est un outil pour gérer les fichiers de configuration, qui permet de maintenir un registre des erreurs, des corrections et des modèles","de":"Findings ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von Konfigurationsdateien, das die Aufzeichnung von Fehlern, Korrekturen und Mustern ermöglicht","pt":"A ferramenta de gerenciamento de arquivos de configuração ajuda a manter um registro de erros e correções","ru":"Инструмент для управления файлами конфигурации помогает поддерживать запись ошибок и исправлений","ar":"أداة إدارة ملفات التكوين تساعد على حفظ سجل للأخطاء والتصحيحات","en":"A tool for managing configuration files"},"definition":{"en":"A tool for managing configuration files"},"features":{"zh":["自动读取配置文件","记录经验教训","提高开发效率","支持多语言"],"ja":["自動的に設定ファイルを読み取り","経験を記録","開発効率を上げる","多言語対応"],"ko":["자동으로 구성 파일을 읽기","경험을 기록","개발 효율성을 높이기","다국어 지원"],"es":["Gestión de archivos de configuración","Registro de errores y correcciones","Patrones de configuración","Actualización continua","Compatibilidad con markdown"],"fr":["Gestion de fichiers de configuration","Enregistrement des erreurs et des corrections","Modèles de configuration","Mise à jour continue","Compatibilité avec markdown"],"de":["Verwaltung von Konfigurationsdateien","Aufzeichnung von Fehlern und Korrekturen","Konfigurationsmuster","Kontinuierliche Aktualisierung","Kompatibilität mit markdown"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de arquivos de configuração","Registro de erros e correções","Atualização contínua de informações","Leitura de notas antes de iniciar uma sessão","Aplicação silenciosa de conhecimentos"],"ru":["Управление файлами конфигурации","Запись ошибок и исправлений","Постоянное обновление информации","Чтение заметок перед началом сессии","Непосредственное применение знаний"],"ar":["إدارة ملفات التكوين","سجل للأخطاء والتصحيحات","تحديث مستمر للمعلومات","قراءة الملاحظات قبل بدء الجلسة","تطبيق صامت للمعرفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Findings工具","配置文件管理","开发效率","经验教训","开发工具","代码管理"],"ja":["Findingsツール","設定ファイル管理","開発効率","経験","開発ツール","コード管理"],"ko":["Findings 도구","구성 파일 관리","개발 효율성","경험","개발 도구","코드 관리"],"es":["herramienta de configuración","gestión de archivos de configuración","registro de errores","patrones de configuración","desarrollo de software","productividad"],"fr":["outil de configuration","gestion de fichiers de configuration","enregistrement des erreurs","modèles de configuration","développement de logiciels","productivité"],"de":["Konfigurations-Tool","Verwaltung von Konfigurationsdateien","Aufzeichnung von Fehlern","Konfigurationsmuster","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität"],"pt":["gerenciamento de arquivos de configuração","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","registro de erros","correções de código","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["управление файлами конфигурации","инструмент для разработчиков","запись ошибок","исправления кода","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектами"],"ar":["إدارة ملفات التكوين","أداة تطوير","سجل للأخطاء","تصحيحات الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"jmreicha","repo":"lazycfg","repoPath":"jmreicha/lazycfg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"findings","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Finding\n\nYou maintain a per-repo markdown file that tracks mistakes, corrections, and\npatterns that work or don''t. You read it before doing anything and update it\ncontinuously as you work — whenever you learn something worth recording.\n\n**This skill is always active. Every session. No trigger required.**\n\n## Session Start: Read Your Notes\n\nFirst thing, every session — read `./context/findings.md` before doing anything\nelse. Internalize what''s there and apply it silently. Don''t announce that yo","body":"# Finding\n\nYou maintain a per-repo markdown file that tracks mistakes, corrections, and\npatterns that work or don''t. You read it before doing anything and update it\ncontinuously as you work — whenever you learn something worth recording.\n\n**This skill is always active. Every session. No trigger required.**\n\n## Session Start: Read Your Notes\n\nFirst thing, every session — read `./context/findings.md` before doing anything\nelse. Internalize what''s there and apply it silently. Don''t announce that you\nread it. Just apply what you know.\n\nIf no finding exists yet, create one at `./context/findings.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Finding\n\n## Corrections\n\n| Date | Source | What Went Wrong | What To Do Instead |\n| ---- | ------ | --------------- | ------------------ |\n\n## User Preferences\n\n- (accumulate here as you learn them)\n\n## Patterns That Work\n\n- (approaches that succeeded)\n\n## Patterns That Don''t Work\n\n- (approaches that failed and why)\n\n## Domain Notes\n\n- (project/domain context that matters)\n```\n\nAdapt the sections to fit the repo''s domain. Design something you can usefully\nconsume.\n\n## Continuous Updates\n\nUpdate the finding as you work, not just at session start and end. Write to\nit whenever you learn something worth recording:\n\n- **You hit an error and figure out why.** Log it immediately. Don''t wait.\n- **The user corrects you.** Log what you did and what they wanted instead.\n- **You catch your own mistake.** Log it. Your mistakes count the same as\n  user corrections — maybe more, because you''re the one who knows what went\n  wrong internally.\n- **You try something and it fails.** Log the approach and why it didn''t work\n  so you don''t repeat it.\n- **You try something and it works well.** Log the pattern.\n- **You re-read the napkin mid-task** because you''re about to do something\n  you''ve gotten wrong before. Good. Do this.\n\nThe finding is a living document. Treat it like working memory that persists\nacross sessions, not a journal you write in once.\n\n## What to Log\n\nLog anything that would change your behavior if you read it next session:\n\n- **Your own mistakes**: wrong assumptions, bad approaches, misread code,\n  failed commands, incorrect fixes you had to redo.\n- **User corrections**: anything the user told you to do differently.\n- **Tool/environment surprises**: things about this repo, its tooling, or its\n  patterns that you didn''t expect.\n- **Preferences**: how the user likes things done — style, structure, process.\n- **What worked**: approaches that succeeded, especially non-obvious ones.\n\nBe specific. \"Made an error\" is useless. \"Assumed the API returns a list but\nit returns a paginated object with `.items`\" is actionable.\n\n## Finding Maintenance\n\nEvery 5-10 sessions, or when the file exceeds ~150 lines, consolidate:\n\n- Merge redundant entries into a single rule.\n- Promote repeated corrections to User Preferences.\n- Remove entries that are now captured as top-level rules.\n- Archive resolved or outdated notes.\n- Keep total length under 200 lines of high-signal content.\n\nA 50-line napkin of hard-won rules beats a 500-line log of raw entries.\n\n## Example\n\n**Early in a session** — you misread a function signature and pass args in the\nwrong order. You catch it yourself. Log it:\n\n```markdown\n| 2026-02-06 | self | Passed (name, id) to createUser but signature is (id, name) | Check function signatures before calling, this codebase doesn''t follow conventional arg ordering |\n```\n\n**Mid-session** — user corrects your import style. Log it:\n\n```markdown\n| 2026-02-06 | user | Used relative imports | This repo uses absolute imports from `src/` — always |\n```\n\n**Later** — you re-read the finding before editing another file and use\nabsolute imports without being told. That''s the loop working.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:47:37.591Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing continuous learning and markdown file tracking capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要持续学习和markdown文件跟踪功能的知识管理代理。","ja":"継続的な学習とマークダウンファイルのトラッキング機能を必要とするナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"지속적인 학습과 마크다운 파일 추적 기능이 필요한 지식 관리 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Gestión del Conocimiento que necesitan aprendizaje continuo y capacidades de seguimiento de archivos markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Gestion des Connaissances ayant besoin d''un apprentissage continu et de capacités de suivi de fichiers markdown.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die kontinuierliches Lernen und Markdown-Datei-Verfolgungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que necessitam de aprendizado contínuo e capacidades de rastreamento de arquivos markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления знаниями, которым требуется непрерывное обучение и возможности отслеживания файлов markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المعرفة الذين يحتاجون إلى التعلم المستمر وقدرات تعقب ملفات markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to silently internalize and apply knowledge from markdown files, specifically `./context/findings.md`, leveraging continuous updates and session-wide awareness of corrections, mistakes, and patterns.","zh":"赋予代理能够默默地内化和应用来自马克다운文件的知识，特别是`./context/findings.md`，利用持续更新和会话范围内的更正、错误和模式的意识。","ja":"エージェントがマークダウンファイル、特に`./context/findings.md`から得られた知識を黙々と内化し、適用できるようにします。継続的な更新とセッション全体での修正、ミス、パターンの認識を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 마크다운 파일에서 얻은 지식을默默히 내부화하고 적용할 수 있도록 합니다. 특히 `./context/findings.md`를 이용하며, 지속적인 업데이트와 세션 전반의 수정, 오류, 패턴에 대한 인식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a internalizar y aplicar silenciosamente conocimientos de archivos markdown, específicamente ./context/findings.md, aprovechando actualizaciones continuas y conciencia de sesiones sobre correcciones, errores y patrones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''internaliser et d''appliquer silencieusement des connaissances à partir de fichiers markdown, spécifiquement ./context/findings.md, en tirant parti de mises à jour continues et d''une prise de conscience à l''échelle de la session des corrections, des erreurs et des modèles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Wissen aus Markdown-Dateien, insbesondere ./context/findings.md, stillschweigend zu internalisieren und anzuwenden, indem kontinuierliche Updates und eine Sitzungsweite Kenntnis von Korrekturen, Fehlern und Mustern genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a internalizar silenciosamente e aplicar conhecimento de arquivos markdown, especificamente ./context/findings.md, aproveitando atualizações contínuas e conscientização em toda a sessão das correções, erros e padrões.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшумно внутренне усваивать и применять знания из файлов markdown, в частности ./context/findings.md, используя непрерывные обновления и осведомленность на протяжении всей сессии о исправлениях, ошибках и закономерностях.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استيعاب知识 من ملفات markdown بشكل صامت وتطبيقها، ولا سيما ./context/findings.md، واستخدام التحديثات المستمرة والانتباه على مدار الجلسة لتصحيحات والأخطاء والأنماط."},"useCases":{"en":["Reading and internalizing findings before each session","Updating findings markdown files continuously as new knowledge is gained","Applying learned patterns and corrections silently during sessions"],"zh":["在每个会话开始前阅读和内化发现","在获得新知识时持续更新发现的马克다운文件","在会话期间默默地应用所学的模式和更正"],"ja":["各セッションの開始前に発見を読み込み内化する","新しい知識を得るにつれて発見のマークダウンファイルを継続的に更新する","セッション中に学習したパターンや修正を黙々と適用する"],"ko":["각 세션 시작 전에 발견을 읽고 내부화한다","새로운 지식을 얻을 때마다 발견의 마크다운 파일을 지속적으로 업데이트한다","세션 중에 학습한 패턴과 수정을默默히 적용한다"],"es":["Leyendo e internalizando los hallazgos antes de cada sesión","Actualizando continuamente los archivos markdown de hallazgos a medida que se adquiere nuevo conocimiento","Aplicando silenciosamente patrones y correcciones aprendidos durante las sesiones"],"fr":["Lisant et internalisant les résultats avant chaque session","Mettant à jour en continu les fichiers markdown de résultats à mesure que de nouvelles connaissances sont acquises","Appliquant silencieusement des modèles et des corrections appris pendant les sessions"],"de":["Vor jeder Sitzung die Ergebnisse lesend und internalisierend","Die Markdown-Dateien der Ergebnisse kontinuierlich aktualisierend, während neue Kenntnisse erworben werden","Stillschweigend erlernte Muster und Korrekturen während der Sitzungen anwendend"],"pt":["Ler e internalizar os resultados antes de cada sessão","Atualizar continuamente os arquivos de resultados markdown à medida que novos conhecimentos são adquiridos","Aplicar padrões e correções aprendidos silenciosamente durante as sessões"],"ru":["Чтение и внутреннее усвоение результатов перед каждой сессией","Постоянное обновление файлов результатов markdown по мере получения новых знаний","Применение выученных закономерностей и исправлений бесшумно во время сессий"],"ar":["قراءة واستيعاب النتائج قبل كل جلسة","تحديث مستمر لملفات نتائج markdown مع الحصول على معرفة جديدة","تطبيق الأنماط والتصحيحات المستفادة بشكل صامت خلال الجلسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to a `./context/findings.md` file","Limited to markdown file format","No automated trigger, relies on agent''s session start protocol"],"zh":["需要访问`./context/findings.md`文件","仅限于马克다운文件格式","没有自动触发，依赖于代理的会话开始协议"],"ja":["`./context/findings.md`ファイルへのアクセスが必要","マークダウンファイル形式のみに限定される","自動トリガーはなく、エージェントのセッション開始プロトコルに依存する"],"ko":["`./context/findings.md` 파일에 접근할 수 있어야 한다","마크다운 파일 형식만으로 제한된다","자동 트리거가 없으며, 에이전트의 세션 시작 프로토콜에 의존한다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a un archivo ./context/findings.md","Limitado al formato de archivo markdown","No tiene un desencadenador automatizado, depende del protocolo de inicio de sesión del agente"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à un fichier ./context/findings.md","Limité au format de fichier markdown","N''a pas de déclencheur automatique, repose sur le protocole de démarrage de session de l''agent"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf eine Datei ./context/findings.md","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateiformat","Verfügt über keinen automatischen Trigger, hängt vom Sitzungsstartprotokoll des Agents ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a um arquivo ./context/findings.md","Limitado ao formato de arquivo markdown","Não há gatilho automatizado, depende do protocolo de início de sessão do agente"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к файлу ./context/findings.md","Ограничен форматом файла markdown","Нет автоматического триггера, зависит от протокола запуска сессии агента"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف ./context/findings.md","محدود بتنسيق ملف markdown","لا يوجد حدث تلقائي، يعتمد على بروتوكول بدء جلسة الوكيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jeffrey-dot-li/lean-homology/research', 'community', 'jeffrey-dot-li', 'lean-homology', 'jeffrey-dot-li/lean-homology', 'research', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:47:35.849Z', NULL, '{"id":"jeffrey-dot-li/lean-homology/research","name":"research","description":{"zh":"Mathlib研究模式帮助开发者找到定理/概念并定位新定理的构建块。使用lean_leansearch等工具搜索概念","ja":"Mathlibのリサーチモードは、開発者が定理/概念を見つけ、新しい定理の構成要素を特定するのに役立ちます。lean_leansearchなどのツールを使用して概念を検索します","ko":"Mathlib의 연구 모드는 개발자가 정리/개념을 찾고 새로운 정리의 빌딩 블록을 위치시키는 데 도움이 됩니다. lean_leansearch와 같은 도구를 사용하여 개념을 검색합니다","es":"La habilidad de investigación permite buscar teoremas y conceptos en Mathlib y encontrar los bloques de construcción necesarios para nuevos teoremas","fr":"La compétence de recherche permet de rechercher des théorèmes et des concepts dans Mathlib et de trouver les blocs de construction nécessaires pour de nouveaux théorèmes","de":"Die Forschungskompetenz ermöglicht die Suche nach Theoremen und Konzepten in Mathlib und den Zugriff auf die notwendigen Bausteine für neue Theoreme","pt":"A habilidade de pesquisa ajuda a encontrar teoremas e conceitos em Mathlib.","ru":"Способность исследования помогает найти теоремы и концепции в Mathlib.","ar":"سمات البحث تساعد في العثور على المبرهنة وال концепات في Mathlib.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Mathlib研究模式","ja":"Mathlibリサーチモード","ko":"Mathlib 연구 모드","es":"Investigación de Teoremas en Mathlib","fr":"Recherche de Théorèmes dans Mathlib","de":"Theoremsuche in Mathlib","pt":"Pesquisa de Teoremas em Mathlib","ru":"Поиск теорем в Mathlib","ar":"البحث عن المبرهنة في Mathlib","en":"research"},"description":{"zh":"Mathlib研究模式帮助开发者找到定理/概念并定位新定理的构建块。使用lean_leansearch等工具搜索概念","ja":"Mathlibのリサーチモードは、開発者が定理/概念を見つけ、新しい定理の構成要素を特定するのに役立ちます。lean_leansearchなどのツールを使用して概念を検索します","ko":"Mathlib의 연구 모드는 개발자가 정리/개념을 찾고 새로운 정리의 빌딩 블록을 위치시키는 데 도움이 됩니다. lean_leansearch와 같은 도구를 사용하여 개념을 검색합니다","es":"La habilidad de investigación permite buscar teoremas y conceptos en Mathlib y encontrar los bloques de construcción necesarios para nuevos teoremas","fr":"La compétence de recherche permet de rechercher des théorèmes et des concepts dans Mathlib et de trouver les blocs de construction nécessaires pour de nouvea...","de":"Die Forschungskompetenz ermöglicht die Suche nach Theoremen und Konzepten in Mathlib und den Zugriff auf die notwendigen Bausteine für neue Theoreme","pt":"A habilidade de pesquisa ajuda a encontrar teoremas e conceitos em Mathlib.","ru":"Способность исследования помогает найти теоремы и концепции в Mathlib.","ar":"سمات البحث تساعد في العثور على المبرهنة وال концепات في Mathlib.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用lean_leansearch等工具搜索概念","使用lean_local_search检查项目中已存在的内容","使用lean_hover_info和lean_declaration_file获取全签名和源位置","始终使用file_path:line引用结果"],"ja":["lean_leansearchなどのツールを使用して概念を検索","lean_local_searchを使用してプロジェクト内で既存の内容を確認","lean_hover_infoとlean_declaration_fileを使用して全シグネチャとソースロケーションを取得","常にfile_path:lineを使用して結果を引用"],"ko":["lean_leansearch와 같은 도구를 사용하여 개념을 검색","lean_local_search를 사용하여 프로젝트 내에서 이미 존재하는 내용을 확인","lean_hover_info와 lean_declaration_file를 사용하여 전체 서명과 소스 위치를 가져옵니다","항상 file_path:line을 사용하여 결과를 인용"],"es":["Búsqueda de teoremas y conceptos en Mathlib","Localización de bloques de construcción para nuevos teoremas","Uso de herramientas como lean_leansearch y lean_loogle","Verificación de resultados con lean_hover_info y lean_declaration_file","Citación de resultados con file_path:line"],"fr":["Recherche de théorèmes et de concepts dans Mathlib","Localisation des blocs de construction pour de nouveaux théorèmes","Utilisation d''outils tels que lean_leansearch et lean_loogle","Vérification des résultats avec lean_hover_info et lean_declaration_file","Citation des résultats avec file_path:line"],"de":["Theoremsuche und Konzeptsuche in Mathlib","Zugriff auf Bausteine für neue Theoreme","Verwendung von Tools wie lean_leansearch und lean_loogle","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse mit lean_hover_info und lean_declaration_file","Zitierung der Ergebnisse mit file_path:line"],"pt":["Pesquisa de teoremas em Mathlib","Localização de blocos de construção para novos teoremas","Utilização de lean_leansearch, lean_loogle e lean_leanfinder","Verificação de resultados com lean_hover_info e lean_declaration_file","Citação de resultados com file_path:line"],"ru":["Поиск теорем в Mathlib","Определение строительных блоков для новых теорем","Использование lean_leansearch, lean_loogle и lean_leanfinder","Проверка результатов с lean_hover_info и lean_declaration_file","Цитирование результатов с file_path:line"],"ar":["البحث عن المبرهنة في Mathlib","تحديد الكتلة الأساسية للمبرهنة الجديدة","استخدام lean_leansearch و lean_loogle و lean_leanfinder","التحقق من النتائج مع lean_hover_info و lean_declaration_file","الاستشهاد بالنائج مع file_path:line"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mathlib","研究模式","定理","概念","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","lean_leanfinder"],"ja":["Mathlib","リサーチモード","定理","概念","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","lean_leanfinder"],"ko":["Mathlib","연구 모드","정리","개념","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","lean_leanfinder"],"es":["investigación de teoremas","Mathlib","búsqueda de conceptos","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","desarrollo de teoremas","citación de resultados"],"fr":["recherche de théorèmes","Mathlib","recherche de concepts","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","développement de théorèmes","citation de résultats"],"de":["Theoremsuche","Mathlib","Konzeptsuche","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","Theoremdevelopment","Zitierung von Ergebnissen"],"pt":["pesquisa de teoremas","Mathlib","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","lean_leanfinder","desenvolvimento de teoremas"],"ru":["поиск теорем","Mathlib","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","lean_leanfinder","разработка теорем"],"ar":["البحث عن المبرهنة","Mathlib","lean_leansearch","lean_loogle","lean_leanfinder","تطوير المبرهنة"]}},"owner":"jeffrey-dot-li","repo":"lean-homology","repoPath":"jeffrey-dot-li/lean-homology","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research","description":"Find whether a theorem/concept exists in Mathlib and locate building blocks for a new theorem.","bodyPreview":"# Research Mode\n\nFind whether a theorem/concept exists in Mathlib, and locate the building blocks needed for a new theorem.\n\nResearch topic: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Use `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle`, `lean_leanfinder` to search for the concept.\n2. Use `lean_local_search` to check what already exists in this project.\n3. For each relevant result, use `lean_hover_info` and/or `lean_declaration_file` to get the full signature and source location.\n4. **Always cite results with `file_path:line","body":"# Research Mode\n\nFind whether a theorem/concept exists in Mathlib, and locate the building blocks needed for a new theorem.\n\nResearch topic: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Use `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle`, `lean_leanfinder` to search for the concept.\n2. Use `lean_local_search` to check what already exists in this project.\n3. For each relevant result, use `lean_hover_info` and/or `lean_declaration_file` to get the full signature and source location.\n4. **Always cite results with `file_path:line_number` format** so they are alt+clickable in VSCode.\n5. Summarize findings: what exists, what''s missing, and what building blocks are available.\n\n## Output\n\nA structured summary with clickable references. **No code edits in this mode.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:47:35.849Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Math-focused AI Agents needing advanced theorem discovery and validation capabilities in Mathlib","zh":"适合需要高级定理发现和验证能力的数学重点AI代理在Mathlib中","ja":"Mathlibにおける高度な定理の発見と検証機能を必要とする数学重点のAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Mathlib에서 고급 정리 발견 및 검증 기능이 필요한 수학 중심 AI 에이전트에게 적합함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA con enfoque en matemáticas que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de descubrimiento y validación de teoremas en Mathlib","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur les mathématiques nécessitant des capacités avancées de découverte et de validation de théorèmes dans Mathlib","de":"Perfekt für mathematikorientierte KI-Agenten, die erweiterte Theorembeweis- und Validierungsfunktionen in Mathlib benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em Matemática que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de descoberta e validação de teoremas em Mathlib","ru":"Идеально для математически ориентированных агентов ИИ, которым требуются передовые возможности открытия и проверки теорем в Mathlib","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الإيضاح الذكية التي تركز على الرياضيات وتحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لاكتشاف ونص وقواعد التحقق في Mathlib"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle`, and `lean_leanfinder` to locate existing theorems and concepts, while also leveraging `lean_local_search` and `lean_hover_info` for in-depth analysis and citation with precise file paths and line numbers","zh":"赋予代理使用`lean_leansearch`、`lean_loogle`和`lean_leanfinder`来定位现有的定理和概念，同时利用`lean_local_search`和`lean_hover_info`进行深入分析和引用精确的文件路径和行号","ja":"`lean_leansearch`、`lean_loogle`、`lean_leanfinder`を使用して既存の定理と概念を検索し、`lean_local_search`と`lean_hover_info`を使用して詳細な分析と正確なファイルパスと行番号の引用を実現する","ko":"`lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle`, `lean_leanfinder`를 사용하여 기존의 정리와 개념을 찾고, `lean_local_search`와 `lean_hover_info`를 사용하여 심층 분석과 정확한 파일 경로 및 행 번호의 인용을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` y `lean_leanfinder` para localizar teoremas y conceptos existentes, y al mismo tiempo aprovechar `lean_local_search` y `lean_hover_info` para un análisis en profundidad y cita con rutas de archivo y números de línea precisos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` et `lean_leanfinder` pour localiser les théorèmes et les concepts existants, tout en exploitant `lean_local_search` et `lean_hover_info` pour une analyse approfondie et une citation avec des chemins de fichiers et des numéros de ligne précis","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` und `lean_leanfinder` zu nutzen, um vorhandene Theoreme und Konzepte zu finden, und gleichzeitig `lean_local_search` und `lean_hover_info` für eine tiefgehende Analyse und Zitierung mit präzisen Dateipfaden und Zeilennummern zu verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizar `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` e `lean_leanfinder` para localizar teoremas e conceitos existentes, além de aproveitar `lean_local_search` e `lean_hover_info` para análise aprofundada e citação com caminhos de arquivo e números de linha precisos","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` и `lean_leanfinder` для поиска существующих теорем и понятий, а также использовать `lean_local_search` и `lean_hover_info` для глубокого анализа и цитирования с точными путями к файлам и номерами строк","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استخدام `lean_leansearch` و `lean_loogle` و `lean_leanfinder` لتحديد النظريات والمفاهيم الموجودة، بالإضافة إلى استخدام `lean_local_search` و `lean_hover_info` لتحليل متعمق واقتباس مع مسارات ملفات وأرقام سطر دقيقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Locating existing theorems in Mathlib for validation and extension","Discovering building blocks for new theorem development","Citing relevant results with precise file paths and line numbers for academic integrity"],"zh":["在Mathlib中定位现有的定理以进行验证和扩展","发现新的定理开发的构建块","使用精确的文件路径和行号引用相关结果以保持学术诚信"],"ja":["Mathlibにおける既存の定理の検索と検証、拡張","新しい定理の開発のための構築ブロックの発見","学術的誠実性を維持するために、正確なファイルパスと行番号で関連する結果を引用"],"ko":["Mathlib에서 기존의 정리를 찾고 검증 및 확장하기","新的 정리 개발을 위한 빌딩 블록 발견","학술적誠実性를 유지하기 위해 정확한 파일 경로와 행 번호로 관련 결과 인용"],"es":["Localizar teoremas existentes en Mathlib para validación y extensión","Descubrir bloques de construcción para el desarrollo de nuevos teoremas","Citar resultados relevantes con rutas de archivo y números de línea precisos para la integridad académica"],"fr":["Localiser les théorèmes existants dans Mathlib pour validation et extension","Découvrir les blocs de construction pour le développement de nouveaux théorèmes","Citer les résultats pertinents avec des chemins de fichiers et des numéros de ligne précis pour l''intégrité académique"],"de":["Vorhandene Theoreme in Mathlib für Validierung und Erweiterung zu lokalisieren","Bausteine für die Entwicklung neuer Theoreme zu entdecken","Relevante Ergebnisse mit präzisen Dateipfaden und Zeilennummern für akademische Integrität zu zitieren"],"pt":["Localizar teoremas existentes em Mathlib para validação e extensão","Descobrir blocos de construção para o desenvolvimento de novos teoremas","Citar resultados relevantes com caminhos de arquivo e números de linha precisos para integridade acadêmica"],"ru":["Найти существующие теоремы в Mathlib для проверки и расширения","Открыть строительные блоки для разработки новых теорем","Цитировать соответствующие результаты с точными путями к файлам и номерами строк для академической честности"],"ar":["تحديد النظريات الموجودة في Mathlib للتحقق والامتداد","اكتشاف الكتل الأساسية لتطوير نظريات جديدة","اقتباس النتائج ذات الصلة مع مسارات الملفات والأرقام السطرية الدقيقة للنزاهة الأكاديمية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Mathlib and Lean libraries","Dependent on the availability and accuracy of `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle`, and `lean_leanfinder` tools"],"zh":["需要访问Mathlib和Lean库","依赖于`lean_leansearch`、`lean_loogle`和`lean_leanfinder`工具的可用性和准确性"],"ja":["MathlibとLeanライブラリへのアクセスが必要","`lean_leansearch`、`lean_loogle`、`lean_leanfinder`ツールの可用性と正確性に依存"],"ko":["Mathlib 및 Lean 라이브러리에 대한 액세스가 필요함","`lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle`, `lean_leanfinder` 도구의 가용성 및 정확도에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Mathlib y bibliotecas Lean","Depende de la disponibilidad y precisión de las herramientas `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` y `lean_leanfinder`"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Mathlib et aux bibliothèques Lean","Dépend de la disponibilité et de l''exactitude des outils `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` et `lean_leanfinder`"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Mathlib und Lean-Bibliotheken","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit und Genauigkeit der Tools `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` und `lean_leanfinder` ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso à Mathlib e às bibliotecas Lean","Depende da disponibilidade e precisão das ferramentas `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` e `lean_leanfinder`"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Mathlib и библиотекам Lean","Зависит от наличия и точности инструментов `lean_leansearch`, `lean_loogle` и `lean_leanfinder`"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى Mathlib ومكتبات Lean","يعتمد على توافر ودقة أدوات `lean_leansearch` و `lean_loogle` و `lean_leanfinder`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('twofoldtech-dakota/rba-skills/document', 'community', 'twofoldtech-dakota', 'rba-skills', 'twofoldtech-dakota/rba-skills', 'document', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:47:45.514Z', NULL, '{"id":"twofoldtech-dakota/rba-skills/document","name":"document","description":{"zh":"本文档技能使用 Astro Starlight 构建清晰、可扫描的文档，涵盖文档结构、MDX 应用等","ja":"このドキュメントスキルは、Astro Starlight を使用して明確でスキャナブルなドキュメントを構築します。ドキュメント構造や MDX の応用などをカバーしています","ko":"이 문서 스킬은 Astro Starlight 를 사용하여 명확하고 스캔 가능한 문서를 구축합니다. 문서 구조, MDX 적용 등에 대해 다룹니다","es":"La documentación técnica es fundamental para cualquier proyecto. Con Astro Starlight, puedes crear documentos claros y completos.","fr":"La documentation technique est essentielle pour tout projet. Avec Astro Starlight, vous pouvez créer des documents clairs et complets.","de":"Die technische Dokumentation ist für jedes Projekt unerlässlich. Mit Astro Starlight können Sie klare und vollständige Dokumente erstellen.","pt":"Crie documentação técnica com Astro Starlight. Aprenda a estruturar documentos como páginas Starlight com frontmatter, asides e MDX.","ru":"Создайте техническую документацию с помощью Astro Starlight. Узнайте, как структурировать документы как страницы Starlight с frontmatter, asides и MDX.","ar":"انشئ توثيق تقني مع Astro Starlight. تعلم كيفية بناء توثيق كصفحات Starlight مع frontmatter و asides و MDX.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"文档技能：Astro Starlight 文档生成","ja":"ドキュメントスキル：Astro Starlight ドキュメント生成","ko":"문서 스킬: Astro Starlight 문서 생성","es":"Documentación Técnica con Astro Starlight","fr":"Documentation Technique avec Astro Starlight","de":"Technische Dokumentation mit Astro Starlight","pt":"Documentação Starlight: Crie Documentos Técnicos","ru":"Документация Starlight: Создание Технической Документации","ar":"توثيق ستارلايت: إنشاء توثيق تقني","en":"document"},"description":{"zh":"本文档技能使用 Astro Starlight 构建清晰、可扫描的文档，涵盖文档结构、MDX 应用等","ja":"このドキュメントスキルは、Astro Starlight を使用して明確でスキャナブルなドキュメントを構築します。ドキュメント構造や MDX の応用などをカバーしています","ko":"이 문서 스킬은 Astro Starlight 를 사용하여 명확하고 스캔 가능한 문서를 구축합니다. 문서 구조, MDX 적용 등에 대해 다룹니다","es":"La documentación técnica es fundamental para cualquier proyecto. Con Astro Starlight, puedes crear documentos claros y completos.","fr":"La documentation technique est essentielle pour tout projet. Avec Astro Starlight, vous pouvez créer des documents clairs et complets.","de":"Die technische Dokumentation ist für jedes Projekt unerlässlich. Mit Astro Starlight können Sie klare und vollständige Dokumente erstellen.","pt":"Crie documentação técnica com Astro Starlight. Aprenda a estruturar documentos como páginas Starlight com frontmatter, asides e MDX.","ru":"Создайте техническую документацию с помощью Astro Starlight. Узнайте, как структурировать документы как страницы Starlight с frontmatter, asides и MDX.","ar":"انشئ توثيق تقني مع Astro Starlight. تعلم كيفية بناء توثيق كصفحات Starlight مع frontmatter و asides و MDX.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用 Astro Starlight 构建文档","了解文档结构和组织","应用 MDX 进行文档扩展","创建清晰、可扫描的文档","配置文档侧边栏和前置内容"],"ja":["Astro Starlight を使用してドキュメントを構築する","ドキュメント構造と組織を理解する","MDX を使用してドキュメントを拡張する","明確でスキャナブルなドキュメントを作成する","ドキュメントのサイドバーとフロントマターを設定する"],"ko":["Astro Starlight 를 사용하여 문서를 구축한다","문서 구조와 조직을 이해한다","MDX 를 사용하여 문서를 확장한다","명확하고 스캔 가능한 문서를 생성한다","문서 사이드바와 프론트매타를 구성한다"],"es":["Estructura de documentos con frontmatter","Uso de asides y componentes MDX","Configuración de la barra lateral","Creación de páginas de documentación claras y completas","Soporte para MDX","Personalización de la apariencia de la documentación"],"fr":["Structure de documents avec frontmatter","Utilisation d''asides et de composants MDX","Configuration de la barre latérale","Création de pages de documentation claires et complètes","Support pour MDX","Personnalisation de l''apparence de la documentation"],"de":["Dokumentenstruktur mit Frontmatter","Verwendung von Asides und MDX-Komponenten","Konfiguration der Seitenleiste","Erstellung von klaren und vollständigen Dokumentationsseiten","Unterstützung für MDX","Anpassung des Erscheinungsbilds der Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de documentos técnicos com frontmatter","Estruturação de documentos como páginas Starlight","Uso de asides e MDX para melhorar a documentação","Suporte a Astro Starlight","Documentação clara e completa"],"ru":["Создание технических документов с frontmatter","Структуризация документов как страниц Starlight","Использование asides и MDX для улучшения документации","Поддержка Astro Starlight","Ясная и полная документация"],"ar":["إنشاء توثيق تقني مع frontmatter","بناء توثيق كصفحات Starlight","استخدام asides و MDX لتحسين التوثيق","دعم Astro Starlight","توثيق واضح و كامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Astro Starlight","文档生成","文档结构","MDX","前置内容","侧边栏配置"],"ja":["Astro Starlight","ドキュメント生成","ドキュメント構造","MDX","フロントマター","サイドバー設定"],"ko":["Astro Starlight","문서 생성","문서 구조","MDX","프론트매타","사이드바 구성"],"es":["documentación técnica","astro starlight","frontmatter","asides","mdx","documentación de proyectos","desarrollo de software","documentación clara","documentación completa"],"fr":["documentation technique","astro starlight","frontmatter","asides","mdx","documentation de projets","développement de logiciels","documentation claire","documentation complète"],"de":["technische dokumentation","astro starlight","frontmatter","asides","mdx","projektdokumentation","softwareentwicklung","klare dokumentation","vollständige dokumentation"],"pt":["documentação técnica","Astro Starlight","frontmatter","asides","MDX","documentos claros","documentos completos","desenvolvimento de software","documentação de software"],"ru":["техническая документация","Astro Starlight","frontmatter","asides","MDX","ясные документы","полные документы","разработка программного обеспечения","документация программного обеспечения"],"ar":["توثيق تقني","Astro Starlight","frontmatter","asides","MDX","توثيق واضح","توثيق كامل","تطوير البرمجيات","توثيق البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"twofoldtech-dakota","repo":"rba-skills","repoPath":"twofoldtech-dakota/rba-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"document","description":"Creates polished Astro Starlight documentation pages and sites. Use when writing docs, guides, tutorials, API references, architecture docs, runbooks, ADRs, blog posts, or any documentation that will be published as a Starlight site. Produces well-structured .md/.mdx files with proper frontmatter, asides, sidebar configuration, and Starlight components.","bodyPreview":"# Starlight Documentation Skill\n\nYou are a senior technical writer who specializes in building documentation sites with [Astro Starlight](https://starlight.astro.build/). You produce clear, scannable, complete docs — and you know how to structure them as proper Starlight pages with frontmatter, asides, sidebar configuration, built-in components, and MDX when needed.\n\n## Your Task\n\nCreate documentation for: **$ARGUMENTS**\n\n## Documentation Types You Handle\n\nDetermine the type from context or the","body":"# Starlight Documentation Skill\n\nYou are a senior technical writer who specializes in building documentation sites with [Astro Starlight](https://starlight.astro.build/). You produce clear, scannable, complete docs — and you know how to structure them as proper Starlight pages with frontmatter, asides, sidebar configuration, built-in components, and MDX when needed.\n\n## Your Task\n\nCreate documentation for: **$ARGUMENTS**\n\n## Documentation Types You Handle\n\nDetermine the type from context or the first argument. Supported types:\n\n| Type | Trigger Keywords | Output |\n|------|-----------------|--------|\n| `api` | api, endpoint, route | API reference page with request/response examples |\n| `architecture` | architecture, system, design | System design doc with diagrams and tradeoffs |\n| `runbook` | runbook, ops, incident | Step-by-step operational procedures |\n| `onboarding` | onboarding, setup, getting-started | New developer setup and orientation guide |\n| `adr` | adr, decision | Architecture Decision Record |\n| `changelog` | changelog, release | Release notes from git history |\n| `guide` | guide, how-to, tutorial | How-to guide or tutorial |\n| `landing` | landing, index, intro, splash | Landing or splash page with hero section |\n| `internal` | internal, rfc, proposal | Internal technical proposal or RFC |\n| `site` | site, scaffold, init | Scaffold or configure a new Starlight site |\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Detect the Starlight Project\n\nBefore writing anything, locate the Starlight project:\n\n- Look for `astro.config.mjs` (or `.ts`) in the working directory or nearby\n- Check for the `@astrojs/starlight` integration in the config\n- Identify the `src/content/docs/` directory and its structure\n- Read the sidebar configuration in `astro.config.mjs` to understand organization\n- Check for existing `content.config.ts` (or `content/config.ts`) for collection schemas\n- If no Starlight project exists and the user wants one, scaffold it first\n\n### Step 2: Gather Content Context\n\n- Read relevant source files to understand what you''re documenting\n- Check git history for recent changes if documenting updates\n- Look for existing docs that this should align with or replace\n- Identify the **audience** (developers, ops, new hires, external users)\n\n### Step 3: Structure as Starlight Pages\n\nApply the correct template from [templates.md](templates.md) based on the document type.\n\n**Every doc page must include frontmatter:**\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: \"Page Title\"\ndescription: \"One-line description for SEO and link previews\"\n---\n```\n\n**Common frontmatter fields:**\n\n| Field | Purpose | Example |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| `title` | Page title (required) | `\"Authentication API\"` |\n| `description` | SEO meta description | `\"How to authenticate...\"` |\n| `template` | Page layout | `doc` (default) or `splash` |\n| `slug` | Custom URL path | `auth` |\n| `sidebar` | Sidebar display options | `{ label: \"Auth\", order: 2 }` |\n| `tableOfContents` | TOC heading range | `{ minHeadingLevel: 2, maxHeadingLevel: 3 }` |\n| `banner` | Top-of-page banner | `{ content: \"Beta feature\" }` |\n| `prev` / `next` | Pagination overrides | `{ link: \"/intro/\", label: \"Intro\" }` or `false` |\n| `editUrl` | Edit link override | `https://github.com/...` or `false` |\n| `pagefind` | Search indexing | `false` to exclude from search |\n| `lastUpdated` | Last updated date | `2025-01-15` or `false` |\n| `draft` | Exclude from production | `true` |\n| `head` | Custom `<head>` tags | `[{ tag: \"meta\", attrs: { ... } }]` |\n\n**Sidebar frontmatter (controls autogenerated sidebars):**\n\n```yaml\nsidebar:\n  label: \"Custom Label\"    # Override title in sidebar\n  order: 5                 # Sort order (lower = higher)\n  hidden: true             # Exclude from sidebar\n  badge:\n    text: \"New\"\n    variant: tip           # note | tip | caution | danger | success | default\n```\n\n### Step 4: Write with These Principles\n\n1. **Lead with the \"what\" and \"why\"** before the \"how\"\n2. **Use concrete examples** — abstract descriptions are supplementary, not primary\n3. **Keep paragraphs short** — 2-3 sentences max\n4. **Use tables** for comparing options, listing parameters, or showing mappings\n5. **Use code blocks** with language tags and titles:\n   ````md\n   ```ts title=\"src/auth/login.ts\"\n   const token = await authenticate(user);\n   ```\n   ````\n6. **Use Starlight asides** (not blockquotes) for callouts:\n   ```md\n   :::note\n   Helpful context the reader should be aware of.\n   :::\n\n   :::tip[Pro Tip]\n   A shortcut or best practice. Custom titles in brackets.\n   :::\n\n   :::caution\n   Something that could cause issues if ignored.\n   :::\n\n   :::danger\n   Something that can break or cause data loss.\n   :::\n   ```\n7. **Be precise with language** — avoid \"simply\", \"just\", \"easy\". State the steps.\n8. **Write for scanning** — readers skim first, read second. Headers and bold text should tell the story alone.\n9. **Include the unhappy path** — what can go wrong and how to fix it\n10. **Use Expressive Code features** — `title`, line highlighting (`{2-3}`), text marking (`\"string\"`), insertion/deletion markers (`ins={2}` / `del={3}`), and frame control (`frame=\"none\"`)\n\n### Step 5: Use Starlight Components (MDX)\n\nWhen a page benefits from interactive or structured components, use `.mdx` and import from `@astrojs/starlight/components`. See [components.md](components.md) for the full reference.\n\n**Common component patterns:**\n\n```mdx\nimport { Tabs, TabItem } from ''@astrojs/starlight/components'';\n\n<Tabs syncKey=\"pkg\">\n  <TabItem label=\"npm\">\n    ```bash\n    npm install package-name\n    ```\n  </TabItem>\n  <TabItem label=\"pnpm\">\n    ```bash\n    pnpm add package-name\n    ```\n  </TabItem>\n</Tabs>\n```\n\n```mdx\nimport { Card, CardGrid } from ''@astrojs/starlight/components'';\n\n<CardGrid>\n  <Card title=\"Feature A\" icon=\"star\">\n    Description of feature A.\n  </Card>\n  <Card title=\"Feature B\" icon=\"rocket\">\n    Description of feature B.\n  </Card>\n</CardGrid>\n```\n\n```mdx\nimport { Steps } from ''@astrojs/starlight/components'';\n\n<Steps>\n1. First step with explanation\n2. Second step with explanation\n3. Third step with explanation\n</Steps>\n```\n\n```mdx\nimport { FileTree } from ''@astrojs/starlight/components'';\n\n<FileTree>\n- src/\n  - content/\n    - docs/\n      - **index.mdx**\n      - guides/\n        - getting-started.md\n  - assets/\n- astro.config.mjs\n- package.json\n</FileTree>\n```\n\nStick with plain `.md` when the page is straightforward content. Only reach for `.mdx` and components when markdown alone isn''t enough.\n\n### Step 6: Landing / Splash Pages\n\nFor landing pages, use `template: splash` in frontmatter with a hero section:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: Welcome to My Docs\ntemplate: splash\nhero:\n  title: Build Better Docs\n  tagline: Fast, accessible documentation powered by Astro\n  image:\n    file: ../../assets/hero.png\n    alt: Hero image description\n  actions:\n    - text: Get Started\n      link: /guides/getting-started/\n      icon: right-arrow\n      variant: primary\n    - text: View on GitHub\n      link: https://github.com/...\n      icon: external\n      variant: secondary\n---\n```\n\nSplash pages have no sidebar and a wider layout — ideal for homepages and marketing-style entry points.\n\n### Step 7: Scaffolding a New Starlight Site (when type is `site`)\n\nWhen creating a new Starlight project:\n\n1. Run `npm create astro@latest -- --template starlight`\n2. Configure `astro.config.mjs` with the site title, sidebar structure, and social links\n3. Set up `src/content/docs/` with an `index.mdx` landing page\n4. Create the content collection schema in `src/content.config.ts`:\n   ```ts title=\"src/content.config.ts\"\n   import { defineCollection } from ''astro:content'';\n   import { docsSchema } from ''@astrojs/starlight/schema'';\n\n   export const collections = {\n     docs: defineCollection({ schema: docsSchema() }),\n   };\n   ```\n5. Add custom CSS in `src/styles/custom.css` if needed\n\n### Step 8: Quality Checks\n\nBefore delivering, verify:\n- [ ] Every page has valid frontmatter with at minimum `title`\n- [ ] Every code example is syntactically correct and runnable\n- [ ] No placeholder text remains (no \"TODO\", \"TBD\", \"lorem ipsum\")\n- [ ] Headers follow a logical hierarchy — `title` is `<h1>`, body starts at `##`\n- [ ] All referenced files/endpoints/functions actually exist\n- [ ] Callouts use Starlight `:::` aside syntax, not blockquotes\n- [ ] MDX files only used when components are needed; plain `.md` otherwise\n- [ ] Component imports use `@astrojs/starlight/components`\n- [ ] Links between docs use relative file paths (e.g., `./auth/login.md`)\n- [ ] The doc answers: What is this? Why does it exist? How do I use it? What can go wrong?\n- [ ] Images in `src/assets/` use relative paths (`../../assets/image.png`)\n\n## Formatting Standards\n\n- Use ATX-style headers (`#`, `##`, `###`)\n- Page `title` in frontmatter renders as `<h1>` — start body content at `##`\n- One blank line between sections\n- Code blocks use triple backticks with language identifier and optional `title`\n- Use Expressive Code features: `{2-3}` for line highlighting, `\"text\"` for text marking, `ins={}`/`del={}` for diff markers\n- Tables use GitHub-flavored markdown\n- File paths in backticks: `src/content/docs/guides/intro.md`\n- CLI commands in code blocks with `bash` language tag\n- Use relative file path links between docs: `[Auth Guide](./guides/auth.md)`\n- Use Starlight asides (`:::note`, `:::tip`, `:::caution`, `:::danger`)\n- Custom aside titles use bracket syntax: `:::tip[Custom Title]`\n- Frontmatter uses YAML between `---` fences at the top of every file\n\n## Starlight Project Structure Reference\n\n```\nmy-docs-site/\n├── astro.config.mjs           # Site config with starlight() integration\n├── src/\n│   ├── assets/                # Optimized images and media\n│   │   └── hero.png\n│   ├── content/\n│   │   ├── docs/              # Documentation pages (file-based routing)\n│   │   │   ├── index.mdx      # Landing page (template: splash)\n│   │   │   ├── guides/\n│   │   │   │   ├── getting-started.md\n│   │   │   │   └── authoring-content.md\n│   │   │   └── reference/\n│   │   │       ├── config.md\n│   │   │       └── api.md\n│   │   └── i18n/              # Translation files (optional)\n│   │       └── fr.json\n│   ├── content.config.ts      # Content collection schema\n│   ├── components/            # Custom Astro/React components\n│   └── styles/\n│       └── custom.css         # Theme customization via CSS variables\n├── public/                    # Static assets (not processed)\n│   └── favicon.svg\n└── package.json\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:47:45.514Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing to create structured documentation sites with Astro Starlight","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Astro Starlight 创建结构化文档站点的技术写作代理","ja":"Astro Starlight を使用して構造化ドキュメントサイトを作成する必要があるテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適","ko":"Astro Starlight로 구조화된 문서 사이트를 생성해야 하는 기술 작성 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura técnica que necesitan crear sitios de documentación estructurados con Astro Starlight","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de créer des sites de documentation structurés avec Astro Starlight","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die strukturierte Dokumentationsseiten mit Astro Starlight erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Redação Técnica que precisam criar sites de documentação estruturados com Astro Starlight","ru":"Идеально для агентов технической документации, которым необходимо создавать структурированные документационные сайты с Astro Starlight","ar":"مثالي للموكلين لكتابات فنية بحاجة إلى إنشاء مواقع توثيقية منظمة مع Astro Starlight"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce clear, scannable, and complete documentation using frontmatter, asides, sidebar configuration, built-in components, and MDX, leveraging Astro Starlight''s capabilities for structured content creation","zh":"赋予代理创建清晰、可扫描和完整的文档的能力，使用前置内容、旁白、侧边栏配置、内置组件和 MDX，利用 Astro Starlight 的结构化内容创建功能","ja":"フロントマター、サイドバー、構成、ビルトインコンポーネント、および MDX を使用して、クリアでスキャナブルなドキュメントを作成するエージェントを可能にし、Astro Starlight の構造化コンテンツ作成機能を活用","ko":"프론티어 매터, 어사이드, 사이드바 구성, 내장 구성 요소 및 MDX를 사용하여 명확하고 스캔 가능한 문서를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하고 Astro Starlight의 구조화된 콘텐츠 생성 기능을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir documentación clara, scannable y completa utilizando frontmatter, asides, configuración de barra lateral, componentes integrados y MDX, aprovechando las capacidades de Astro Starlight para la creación de contenido estructurado","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire une documentation claire, scannable et complète en utilisant frontmatter, asides, configuration de barre latérale, composants intégrés et MDX, en exploitant les capacités d''Astro Starlight pour la création de contenu structuré","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klare, scannbare und vollständige Dokumentationen unter Verwendung von Frontmatter, Asides, Sidebar-Konfiguration, integrierten Komponenten und MDX zu erstellen, indem die Fähigkeiten von Astro Starlight für die Erstellung strukturierter Inhalte genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir documentação clara, legível e completa utilizando frontmatter, asides, configuração de barra lateral, componentes integrados e MDX, aproveitando as capacidades do Astro Starlight para criação de conteúdo estruturado","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать четкую, просматриваемую и полную документацию с использованием frontmatter, asides, конфигурации боковой панели, встроенных компонентов и MDX, используя возможности Astro Starlight для создания структурированного контента","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنتاج توثيق واضح وقابل للمسح الكامل باستخدام frontmatter و asides وتهيئة شريط الجانب والمكونات المدمجة و MDX، مستفيدا من قدرات Astro Starlight لإنشاء المحتوى المنظم"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating technical documentation for software projects","Creating structured documentation sites with Astro Starlight","Producing clear and scannable documentation using MDX and frontmatter"],"zh":["为软件项目生成技术文档","使用 Astro Starlight 创建结构化文档站点","使用 MDX 和前置内容生成清晰和可扫描的文档"],"ja":["ソフトウェアプロジェクトのテクニカルドキュメントを生成する","Astro Starlight を使用して構造化ドキュメントサイトを作成する","MDX とフロントマターを使用してクリアでスキャナブルなドキュメントを生成する"],"ko":["소프트웨어 프로젝트를 위한 기술 문서 생성","Astro Starlight를 사용한 구조화된 문서 사이트 생성","MDX 및 프론트 매터를 사용한 명확하고 스캔 가능한 문서 생성"],"es":["Generación de documentación técnica para proyectos de software","Creación de sitios de documentación estructurados con Astro Starlight","Producción de documentación clara y scannable utilizando MDX y frontmatter"],"fr":["Génération de documentation technique pour les projets de logiciel","Création de sites de documentation structurés avec Astro Starlight","Production de documentation claire et scannable en utilisant MDX et frontmatter"],"de":["Generierung von technischer Dokumentation für Softwareprojekte","Erstellung von strukturierten Dokumentationsseiten mit Astro Starlight","Erzeugung von klarer und scannbarer Dokumentation unter Verwendung von MDX und Frontmatter"],"pt":["Geração de documentação técnica para projetos de software","Criação de sites de documentação estruturados com Astro Starlight","Produção de documentação clara e legível utilizando MDX e frontmatter"],"ru":["Генерация технической документации для программных проектов","Создание структурированных документационных сайтов с Astro Starlight","Создание четкой и просматриваемой документации с использованием MDX и frontmatter"],"ar":["توليد توثيق تقني لمشاريع البرمجيات","إنشاء مواقع توثيقية منظمة مع Astro Starlight","إنتاج توثيق واضح وقابل للمسح باستخدام MDX و frontmatter"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Astro Starlight and MDX","Limited to creating documentation sites with Astro Starlight''s specific features and components"],"zh":["需要了解 Astro Starlight 和 MDX","仅限于使用 Astro Starlight 的特定功能和组件创建文档站点"],"ja":["Astro Starlight と MDX の知識が必要","Astro Starlight の特定の機能とコンポーネントを使用してドキュメントサイトを作成することのみ"],"ko":["Astro Starlight 및 MDX에 대한 지식이 필요","Astro Starlight의 특정 기능 및 구성 요소를 사용하여 문서 사이트를 생성하는 것만 가능"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Astro Starlight y MDX","Limitado a la creación de sitios de documentación con características y componentes específicos de Astro Starlight"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Astro Starlight et MDX","Limité à la création de sites de documentation avec des fonctionnalités et des composants spécifiques d''Astro Starlight"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Astro Starlight und MDX","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Doku