検証","ハンドオフ要件の評価","レポートの生成","PRDベースのコンテキストエンジニアリング","体系的なAI製品開発方法","製品の有効性と効率の向上"],"ko":["게이트 기준의 검증","핸드오버 요구사항의 평가","리포트의 생성","PRD 기반의 컨텍스트 엔지니어링","체계적인 AI 제품 개발 방법","제품의 유효성과 효율性的 향상"],"es":["Validación de requisitos de desarrollo","Ingeniería de contexto para productos AI","Optimización de flujos de trabajo","Informes detallados de progreso","Integración con PRD.md"],"fr":["Validation des exigences de développement","Ingénierie de contexte pour les produits IA","Optimisation des flux de travail","Rapports détaillés de progrès","Intégration avec PRD.md"],"de":["Überprüfung von Entwicklungsanforderungen","Kontext-Engineering für KI-Produkte","Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Detaillierte Fortschrittsberichte","Integration mit PRD.md"],"pt":["Carregamento de critérios de portão","Verificação de evidências","Avaliação de prontidão","Relatório de aprovação ou bloqueio"],"ru":["Загрузка критериев шлюза","Проверка доказательств","Оценка готовности","Отчет о разрешении или блокировке"],"ar":["تحميل معايير البوابة","التحقق من الأدلة","تقييم الجاهزية","تقرير الموافقة أو الحجب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI产品开发","PRD","上下文工程","系统方法","有效性","效率","ゲート基準","ハンドオフ要件"],"ja":["AI製品開発","PRD","コンテキストエンジニアリング","体系的な方法","有効性","効率","ゲート基準","ハンドオフ要件"],"ko":["AI 제품 개발","PRD","컨텍스트 엔지니어링","체계적인 방법","유효성","효율성","게이트 기준","핸드오버 요구사항"],"es":["ghm-gate-check","ingeniería de contexto","productos AI","validación de requisitos","optimización de flujos de trabajo","PRD.md","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["ghm-gate-check","ingénierie de contexte","produits IA","validation des exigences","optimisation des flux de travail","PRD.md","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["ghm-gate-check","Kontext-Engineering","KI-Produkte","Überprüfung von Anforderungen","Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen","PRD.md","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungs-Tools"],"pt":["verificação de portão","engenharia de contexto","PRD","desenvolvimento de produtos de IA","fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento","documentação progressiva"],"ru":["контроль шлюза","контекстная инженерия","PRD","создание продуктов ИИ","рабочие процессы разработки","прогрессивная документация"],"ar":["فحص البوابة","هندسة السياق","PRD","إنشاء منتجات ذكاء اصطناعي","عمليات عمل التطوير","توثيق تقدمي"]}},"owner":"mattgierhart","repo":"PRD-driven-context-engineering","repoPath":"mattgierhart/PRD-driven-context-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ghm-gate-check","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Gate Check\n\nValidate all gate criteria are met before advancing the PRD lifecycle version.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. **Load Gate Criteria** → Read target gate requirements from PRD.md\n2. **Verify Evidence** → Check required artifacts exist with valid IDs\n3. **Assess Readiness** → Evaluate handoff requirements\n4. **Report** → Pass/Block with specific gaps\n\n## Core Output Template\n\n| Element | Definition | Evidence |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **Target Gate** | Version being validated","body":"# Gate Check\n\nValidate all gate criteria are met before advancing the PRD lifecycle version.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. **Load Gate Criteria** → Read target gate requirements from PRD.md\n2. **Verify Evidence** → Check required artifacts exist with valid IDs\n3. **Assess Readiness** → Evaluate handoff requirements\n4. **Report** → Pass/Block with specific gaps\n\n## Core Output Template\n\n| Element | Definition | Evidence |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **Target Gate** | Version being validated | `v0.3 → v0.4` |\n| **Status** | Pass or Block | Clear determination |\n| **Missing Artifacts** | What''s not complete | Specific list with IDs |\n| **Recommendation** | Action to take | Proceed / Address gaps |\n\n## Gate Reference\n\n| Gate | Focus | Key Artifacts |\n|------|-------|---------------|\n| v0.1 → v0.2 | Problem validated | CFD-XXX evidence |\n| v0.2 → v0.3 | Market defined | Segment definitions |\n| v0.3 → v0.4 | Commercial viable | BR-XXX, pricing |\n| v0.4 → v0.5 | Journeys mapped | UJ-XXX complete |\n| v0.5 → v0.6 | Risks addressed | Risk register |\n| v0.6 → v0.7 | Architecture set | API-XXX, schemas |\n| v0.7 → v0.8 | Build complete | Tests passing |\n| v0.8 → v0.9 | Deployed | Live environment |\n| v0.9 → v1.0 | Launched | Metrics tracking |\n\n## Step 1: Load Gate Criteria\n\n1. Read PRD.md gate section for target version\n2. Extract all required criteria\n3. Identify artifact types needed (BR, UJ, API, CFD)\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] Target gate identified\n- [ ] All criteria extracted\n- [ ] Required artifact types listed\n\n## Step 2: Verify Evidence\n\nFor each required criterion:\n\n1. Check artifact exists in SoT/\n2. Verify artifact status is not \"Draft\"\n3. Confirm cross-references are valid\n4. Check for required CFD-XXX evidence\n\n### Evidence Matrix\n\n| Criterion Type | Verification |\n|----------------|--------------|\n| Business Rule | BR-XXX exists, status Active |\n| User Journey | UJ-XXX exists, all steps defined |\n| API Contract | API-XXX exists, endpoints specified |\n| Customer Evidence | CFD-XXX linked to BR-XXX |\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] All required BR-XXX verified\n- [ ] All required UJ-XXX verified\n- [ ] All required API-XXX verified\n- [ ] Evidence chain (CFD → BR) validated\n\n## Step 3: Assess Handoff Readiness\n\nCheck downstream requirements:\n\n1. Next agent has context needed\n2. No open blockers in current EPIC\n3. Documentation is current\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] EPIC Session State section has no blockers\n- [ ] README.md is synchronized\n- [ ] Handoff documentation exists\n\n## Step 4: Generate Report\n\n```markdown\n## Gate Check Report: v0.X → v0.Y\n\n**Status**: [PASS / BLOCK]\n**Date**: YYYY-MM-DD\n\n### Criteria Assessment\n\n| Criterion | Status | Evidence |\n|-----------|--------|----------|\n| [Criterion 1] | ✅/❌ | [ID or gap] |\n| [Criterion 2] | ✅/❌ | [ID or gap] |\n\n### Missing Artifacts\n- [ ] [Specific gap with required action]\n\n### Recommendation\n[Proceed to v0.Y / Address [N] gaps before advancing]\n```\n\n## Quality Gates\n\n### Pass Checklist\n- [ ] All criteria evaluated (none skipped)\n- [ ] Evidence is traceable to IDs\n- [ ] Recommendation is actionable\n\n### Testability Check\n- [ ] Report can be validated against PRD.md criteria\n- [ ] Missing artifacts are specific and findable\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Example | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| Skipping criteria | \"Probably fine\" | → Verify each explicitly |\n| Vague gaps | \"Needs more work\" | → Cite specific missing ID |\n| Override blocks | Advancing despite fails | → Address gaps first |\n\n## Boundaries\n\n**DO**:\n- Validate against documented criteria\n- Identify specific gaps\n- Provide actionable recommendations\n\n**DON''T**:\n- Create missing artifacts (just report)\n- Override gate blocks\n- Make subjective quality judgments\n\n## Handoff\n\nAfter gate check:\n- If PASS: Advance PRD version, trigger `ghm-status-sync`\n- If BLOCK: Return to current stage, address gaps\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:48:12.707Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Product Development Agents needing systematic PRD-driven Context Engineering and gate validation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要系统化的PRD驱动上下文工程和门槛验证能力的产品开发代理","ja":"製品開発エージェントが体系的なPRD駆動のコンテキストエンジニアリングとゲート検証機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"시스템적인 PRD 기반 컨텍스트 엔지니어링 및 게이트 검증 기능이 필요한 제품 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de productos que necesitan ingeniería de contexto impulsada por PRD y capacidades de validación de puerta sistemáticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de produits ayant besoin d''une ingénierie de contexte pilotée par PRD et de capacités de validation de portail systématiques.","de":"Perfekt für Produktentwicklungsagenten, die systematische PRD-getriebene Kontext-Engineering- und Torvalidierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Produtos que necessitam de Engenharia de Contexto baseada em PRD e capacidades de validação de gateway sistemáticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке продуктов, которым необходима системная инженерия контекста на основе PRD и возможности проверки шлюза.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير المنتجات الذين يحتاجون إلى هندسة السياق القائمة على مواصفات المنتج وخصائص التحقق من بوابة منهجية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate gate criteria using progressive documentation and context-aware development workflows, leveraging PRD.md for target gate requirements and assessing readiness through evidence verification and handoff evaluation.","zh":"赋予代理验证门槛标准的能力，使用渐进式文档和上下文感知开发工作流，利用PRD.md实现目标门槛要求，并通过证据验证和交付评估来评估就绪性","ja":"エージェントがゲート基準を検証する能力を付与し、進歩的なドキュメントとコンテキスト認識開発ワークフローを使用し、PRD.mdを利用してターゲットゲート要件を実現し、証拠の検証とハンドオフ評価を通じて準備状況を評価する","ko":"에이전트가 게이트 기준을 검증할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며,渐进적인 문서 및 컨텍스트 인식 개발 워크플로우를 사용하여 PRD.md를 활용하여 대상 게이트 요구사항을 달성하고, 증거 검증 및 인도 평가를 통해 준비 완료 여부를 평가","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar los criterios de puerta utilizando documentación progresiva y flujos de trabajo de desarrollo conscientes del contexto, aprovechando PRD.md para los requisitos de puerta objetivo y evaluando la preparación a través de la verificación de evidencia y la evaluación de entrega.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les critères de portail en utilisant une documentation progressive et des flux de travail de développement sensibles au contexte, en exploitant PRD.md pour les exigences de portail cible et en évaluant la préparation grâce à la vérification des preuves et à l''évaluation de remise.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tor-Kriterien mithilfe progressiver Dokumentation und kontextbewusster Entwicklungsworkflows zu validieren, indem PRD.md für die Ziel-Tor-Anforderungen genutzt und die Bereitschaft durch Evidenz-Verifizierung und Handoff-Evaluierung bewertet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar critérios de gateway usando documentação progressiva e fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento sensíveis ao contexto, aproveitando o PRD.md para requisitos de gateway de destino e avaliando a prontidão por meio de verificação de evidências e avaliação de entrega.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять критерии шлюза с помощью прогрессивной документации и контекстно-зависимых рабочих процессов разработки, используя PRD.md для целевых требований шлюза и оценивая готовность путем проверки доказательств и оценки передачи.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من التحقق من معايير البوابة باستخدام توثيق تقدمي وعمليات تطوير تعتمد على السياق، مستفيدا من مواصفات المنتج لتحديد متطلبات البوابة المستهدفة وتقييم الجاهزية من خلال التحقق من الأدلة وتقييم التسليم."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating gate criteria before advancing PRD lifecycle versions","Automating evidence verification for required artifacts","Assessing product readiness through handoff requirement evaluation"],"zh":["在推进PRD生命周期版本之前验证门槛标准","为所需工件自动验证证据","通过交付要求评估评估产品就绪性"],"ja":["PRDライフサイクルバージョンを進める前にゲート基準を検証する","必要な成果物の証拠を自動的に検証する","ハンドオフ要件評価を通じて製品の準備状況を評価する"],"ko":["PRD 生命周期 버전을 진행하기 전에 게이트 기준을 검증","필요한 아티팩트에 대한 증거 자동 검증","인도 요구사항 평가를 통해 제품 준비 완료 여부 평가"],"es":["Validar los criterios de puerta antes de avanzar en las versiones del ciclo de vida de PRD","Automatizar la verificación de evidencia para artefactos requeridos","Evaluar la preparación del producto a través de la evaluación de los requisitos de entrega"],"fr":["Valider les critères de portail avant de passer aux versions du cycle de vie de PRD","Automatiser la vérification des preuves pour les artefacts requis","Évaluer la préparation du produit à travers l''évaluation des exigences de remise"],"de":["Validieren der Tor-Kriterien vor dem Vorrücken in die Versionszyklen von PRD","Automatisieren der Evidenz-Verifizierung für erforderliche Artefakte","Bewerten der Produktbereitschaft durch Evaluierung der Handoff-Anforderungen"],"pt":["Validar critérios de gateway antes de avançar com versões do ciclo de vida do PRD","Automatizar a verificação de evidências para artefatos necessários","Avaliar a prontidão do produto por meio da avaliação dos requisitos de entrega"],"ru":["Проверять критерии шлюза перед продвижением по версиям цикла жизни PRD","Автоматизировать проверку доказательств для необходимых артефактов","Оценивать готовность продукта путем оценки требований к передаче"],"ar":["التحقق من معايير البوابة قبل التقدم في إصدارات دورة حياة مواصفات المنتج","توفير التحقق الآلي للأدلة للمكونات المطلوبة","تقييم جاهزية المنتج من خلال تقييم متطلبات التسليم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PRD.md file for target gate requirements","Limited to gate validation workflow"],"zh":["需要PRD.md文件来实现目标门槛要求","仅限于门槛验证工作流"],"ja":["ターゲットゲート要件を実現するためにPRD.mdファイルが必要","ゲート検証ワークフローにのみ限られる"],"ko":["대상 게이트 요구사항을 달성하기 위해 PRD.md 파일이 필요","게이트 검증 워크플로우에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere archivo PRD.md para los requisitos de puerta objetivo","Limitado al flujo de trabajo de validación de puerta"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier PRD.md pour les exigences de portail cible","Limité au flux de travail de validation de portail"],"de":["Benötigt PRD.md-Datei für die Ziel-Tor-Anforderungen","Begrenzt auf den Workflow zur Tor-Validierung"],"pt":["Exige arquivo PRD.md para requisitos de gateway de destino","Limitado ao fluxo de trabalho de validação de gateway"],"ru":["Требует файла PRD.md для целевых требований шлюза","Ограничен рабочим процессом проверки шлюза"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف مواصفات المنتج لتحديد متطلبات البوابة المستهدفة","محدود بعمليات التحقق من البوابة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
