 de voix d''ElevenLabs","Kit de voix en direct LiveKit"],"de":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi-Sprachagenten","Spracherkennung und -synthese von Deepgram","Sprachsynthese von ElevenLabs","LiveKit-Sprachkit"],"pt":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi voice agents","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs voice synthesis","LiveKit real-time"],"ru":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi голосовые агенты","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs синтез голоса","LiveKit реального времени"],"ar":["OpenAI Realtime API","وكلاء صوت Vapi","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs合成 الصوت","LiveKit في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["语音AI开发","实时语音应用","延迟预算","音频质量","用户体验","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"ja":["ボイスAI開発","リアルタイム音声アプリケーション","遅延予算","音質","ユーザー体験","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"ko":["보이스 AI 개발","실시간 음성 애플리케이션","지연 예산","음질","사용자 경험","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"es":["desarrollo de voz AI","aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real","latencia de voz","calidad del audio","experiencia del usuario","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"fr":["développement de voix AI","applications de voix en temps réel","latence de voix","qualité de l''audio","expérience utilisateur","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"de":["Sprach-AI-Entwicklung","Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen","Sprachlatenz","Audioqualität","Benutzererfahrung","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de IA de voz","aplicações de voz em tempo real","OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi voice agents","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs voice synthesis"],"ru":["разработка голосового ИИ","голосовые приложения в реальном времени","OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi голосовые агенты","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs синтез голоса"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي","تطبيقات صوتية في الوقت الفعلي","OpenAI Realtime API","وكلاء صوت Vapi","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs合成 الصوت"]}},"owner":"Nguyenthang2292","repo":"Sovereign-IQ","repoPath":"Nguyenthang2292/Sovereign-IQ","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"voice-ai-development","description":"Expert in building voice AI applications - from real-time voice agents to voice-enabled apps. Covers OpenAI Realtime API, Vapi for voice agents, Deepgram for transcription, ElevenLabs for synthesis, LiveKit for real-time infrastructure, and WebRTC fundamentals. Knows how to build low-latency, production-ready voice experiences. Use when: voice ai, voice agent, speech to text, text to speech, realtime voice.","bodyPreview":"# Voice AI Development\n\n**Role**: Voice AI Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building real-time voice applications. You think in terms of\nlatency budgets, audio quality, and user experience. You know that voice apps feel\nmagical when fast and broken when slow. You choose the right combination of providers\nfor each use case and optimize relentlessly for perceived responsiveness.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- OpenAI Realtime API\n- Vapi voice agents\n- Deepgram STT/TTS\n- ElevenLabs voice synthesis\n- LiveKit rea","body":"# Voice AI Development\n\n**Role**: Voice AI Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building real-time voice applications. You think in terms of\nlatency budgets, audio quality, and user experience. You know that voice apps feel\nmagical when fast and broken when slow. You choose the right combination of providers\nfor each use case and optimize relentlessly for perceived responsiveness.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- OpenAI Realtime API\n- Vapi voice agents\n- Deepgram STT/TTS\n- ElevenLabs voice synthesis\n- LiveKit real-time infrastructure\n- WebRTC audio handling\n- Voice agent design\n- Latency optimization\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python or Node.js\n- API keys for providers\n- Audio handling knowledge\n\n## Patterns\n\n### OpenAI Realtime API\n\nNative voice-to-voice with GPT-4o\n\n**When to use**: When you want integrated voice AI without separate STT/TTS\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nimport websockets\nimport json\nimport base64\n\nOPENAI_API_KEY = \"sk-...\"\n\nasync def voice_session():\n    url = \"wss://api.openai.com/v1/realtime?model=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {OPENAI_API_KEY}\",\n        \"OpenAI-Beta\": \"realtime=v1\"\n    }\n\n    async with websockets.connect(url, extra_headers=headers) as ws:\n        # Configure session\n        await ws.send(json.dumps({\n            \"type\": \"session.update\",\n            \"session\": {\n                \"modalities\": [\"text\", \"audio\"],\n                \"voice\": \"alloy\",  # alloy, echo, fable, onyx, nova, shimmer\n                \"input_audio_format\": \"pcm16\",\n                \"output_audio_format\": \"pcm16\",\n                \"input_audio_transcription\": {\n                    \"model\": \"whisper-1\"\n                },\n                \"turn_detection\": {\n                    \"type\": \"server_vad\",  # Voice activity detection\n                    \"threshold\": 0.5,\n                    \"prefix_padding_ms\": 300,\n                    \"silence_duration_ms\": 500\n                },\n                \"tools\": [\n                    {\n                        \"type\": \"function\",\n                        \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n                        \"description\": \"Get weather for a location\",\n                        \"parameters\": {\n                            \"type\": \"object\",\n                            \"properties\": {\n                                \"location\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                ]\n            }\n        }))\n\n        # Send audio (PCM16, 24kHz, mono)\n        async def send_audio(audio_bytes):\n            await ws.send(json.dumps({\n                \"type\": \"input_audio_buffer.append\",\n                \"audio\": base64.b64encode(audio_bytes).decode()\n            }))\n\n        # Receive events\n        async for message in ws:\n            event = json.loads(message)\n\n            if event[\"type\"] == \"resp\n```\n\n### Vapi Voice Agent\n\nBuild voice agents with Vapi platform\n\n**When to use**: Phone-based agents, quick deployment\n\n```python\n# Vapi provides hosted voice agents with webhooks\n\nfrom flask import Flask, request, jsonify\nimport vapi\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\nclient = vapi.Vapi(api_key=\"...\")\n\n# Create an assistant\nassistant = client.assistants.create(\n    name=\"Support Agent\",\n    model={\n        \"provider\": \"openai\",\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n        \"messages\": [\n            {\n                \"role\": \"system\",\n                \"content\": \"You are a helpful support agent...\"\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    voice={\n        \"provider\": \"11labs\",\n        \"voiceId\": \"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\"  # Rachel\n    },\n    firstMessage=\"Hi! How can I help you today?\",\n    transcriber={\n        \"provider\": \"deepgram\",\n        \"model\": \"nova-2\"\n    }\n)\n\n# Webhook for conversation events\n@app.route(\"/vapi/webhook\", methods=[\"POST\"])\ndef vapi_webhook():\n    event = request.json\n\n    if event[\"type\"] == \"function-call\":\n        # Handle tool call\n        name = event[\"functionCall\"][\"name\"]\n        args = event[\"functionCall\"][\"parameters\"]\n\n        if name == \"check_order\":\n            result = check_order(args[\"order_id\"])\n            return jsonify({\"result\": result})\n\n    elif event[\"type\"] == \"end-of-call-report\":\n        # Call ended - save transcript\n        transcript = event[\"transcript\"]\n        save_transcript(event[\"call\"][\"id\"], transcript)\n\n    return jsonify({\"ok\": True})\n\n# Start outbound call\ncall = client.calls.create(\n    assistant_id=assistant.id,\n    customer={\n        \"number\": \"+1234567890\"\n    },\n    phoneNumber={\n        \"twilioPhoneNumber\": \"+0987654321\"\n    }\n)\n\n# Or create web call\nweb_call = client.calls.create(\n    assistant_id=assistant.id,\n    type=\"web\"\n)\n# Returns URL for WebRTC connection\n```\n\n### Deepgram STT + ElevenLabs TTS\n\nBest-in-class transcription and synthesis\n\n**When to use**: High quality voice, custom pipeline\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom deepgram import DeepgramClient, LiveTranscriptionEvents\nfrom elevenlabs import ElevenLabs\n\n# Deepgram real-time transcription\ndeepgram = DeepgramClient(api_key=\"...\")\n\nasync def transcribe_stream(audio_stream):\n    connection = deepgram.listen.live.v(\"1\")\n\n    async def on_transcript(result):\n        transcript = result.channel.alternatives[0].transcript\n        if transcript:\n            print(f\"Heard: {transcript}\")\n            if result.is_final:\n                # Process final transcript\n                await handle_user_input(transcript)\n\n    connection.on(LiveTranscriptionEvents.Transcript, on_transcript)\n\n    await connection.start({\n        \"model\": \"nova-2\",  # Best quality\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"smart_format\": True,\n        \"interim_results\": True,  # Get partial results\n        \"utterance_end_ms\": 1000,\n        \"vad_events\": True,  # Voice activity detection\n        \"encoding\": \"linear16\",\n        \"sample_rate\": 16000\n    })\n\n    # Stream audio\n    async for chunk in audio_stream:\n        await connection.send(chunk)\n\n    await connection.finish()\n\n# ElevenLabs streaming synthesis\neleven = ElevenLabs(api_key=\"...\")\n\ndef text_to_speech_stream(text: str):\n    \"\"\"Stream TTS audio chunks.\"\"\"\n    audio_stream = eleven.text_to_speech.convert_as_stream(\n        voice_id=\"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\",  # Rachel\n        model_id=\"eleven_turbo_v2_5\",  # Fastest\n        text=text,\n        output_format=\"pcm_24000\"  # Raw PCM for low latency\n    )\n\n    for chunk in audio_stream:\n        yield chunk\n\n# Or with WebSocket for lowest latency\nasync def tts_websocket(text_stream):\n    async with eleven.text_to_speech.stream_async(\n        voice_id=\"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\",\n        model_id=\"eleven_turbo_v2_5\"\n    ) as tts:\n        async for text_chunk in text_stream:\n            audio = await tts.send(text_chunk)\n            yield audio\n\n        # Flush remaining audio\n        final_audio = await tts.flush()\n        yield final_audio\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Non-streaming Pipeline\n\n**Why bad**: Adds seconds of latency.\nUser perceives as slow.\nLoses conversation flow.\n\n**Instead**: Stream everything:\n- STT: interim results\n- LLM: token streaming\n- TTS: chunk streaming\nStart TTS before LLM finishes.\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Interruptions\n\n**Why bad**: Frustrating user experience.\nFeels like talking to a machine.\nWastes time.\n\n**Instead**: Implement barge-in detection.\nUse VAD to detect user speech.\nStop TTS immediately.\nClear audio queue.\n\n### ❌ Single Provider Lock-in\n\n**Why bad**: May not be best quality.\nSingle point of failure.\nHarder to optimize.\n\n**Instead**: Mix best providers:\n- Deepgram for STT (speed + accuracy)\n- ElevenLabs for TTS (voice quality)\n- OpenAI/Anthropic for LLM\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Latency varies by provider\n- Cost per minute adds up\n- Quality depends on network\n- Complex debugging\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `langgraph`, `structured-output`, `langfuse`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:47:57.393Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents requiring real-time voice application development with low latency and high audio quality.","zh":"非常适合需要低延迟和高音频质量的实时语音应用程序开发的对话式代理。","ja":"低遅延かつ高音質のリアルタイム音声アプリケーション開発を必要とする会話型エージェントに最適です。","ko":"낮은 지연 시간과 높은 오디오 품질이 필요한 실시간 음성 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 대화형 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes conversacionales que requieren desarrollo de aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real con baja latencia y alta calidad de audio.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents conversationnels nécessitant un développement d''applications vocales en temps réel avec une faible latence et une haute qualité audio.","de":"Ideal für Konversationsagenten, die Echtzeit-Sprachapplikationsentwicklung mit niedriger Latenz und hoher Audioqualität erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação que exigem desenvolvimento de aplicações de voz em tempo real com baixa latência e alta qualidade de áudio.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, требующих разработки голосовых приложений в реальном времени с низкой задержкой и высоким качеством аудио.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التخاطبيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات الصوت في الوقت الفعلي منخفضة الظفر وعالية جودة الصوت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build seamless voice experiences using OpenAI Realtime API, Vapi voice agents, Deepgram STT/TTS, ElevenLabs voice synthesis, and LiveKit, optimizing for perceived responsiveness and latency budgets.","zh":"赋能代理使用OpenAI Realtime API、Vapi语音代理、Deepgram STT/TTS、ElevenLabs语音合成和LiveKit构建无缝语音体验，并针对感知响应能力和延迟预算进行优化。","ja":"OpenAI Realtime API、Vapi音声エージェント、Deepgram STT/TTS、ElevenLabs音声合成、LiveKitを使用してシームレスな音声体験を構築し、知覚される応答性とレイテンシ予算に最適化することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"OpenAI Realtime API, Vapi 음성 에이전트, Deepgram STT/TTS, ElevenLabs 음성 합성 및 LiveKit을 사용하여 원활한 음성 경험을 구축하고 지각된 응답성과 지연 시간 예산에 최적화함으로써 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear experiencias de voz fluidas utilizando la API de OpenAI Realtime, agentes de voz Vapi, STT/TTS de Deepgram, síntesis de voz de ElevenLabs y LiveKit, optimizando para la capacidad de respuesta percibida y los presupuestos de latencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences vocales transparentes en utilisant l''API OpenAI Realtime, les agents vocaux Vapi, Deepgram STT/TTS, la synthèse vocale ElevenLabs et LiveKit, en optimisant la réactivité perçue et les budgets de latence.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten die Erstellung nahtloser Spracherlebnisse mit der OpenAI Realtime API, Vapi-Sprachagenten, Deepgram STT/TTS, ElevenLabs-Sprachsynthese und LiveKit, optimiert für wahrgenommene Reaktionsfähigkeit und Latenzbudgets.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir experiências de voz sem interrupção usando a API OpenAI Realtime, agentes de voz Vapi, Deepgram STT/TTS, síntese de voz ElevenLabs e LiveKit, otimizando para responsividade percebida e orçamentos de latência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать бесшовные голосовые trải nghiệm с помощью API OpenAI Realtime, голосовых агентов Vapi, Deepgram STT/TTS, синтеза голоса ElevenLabs и LiveKit, оптимизируя для воспринимаемой отзывчивости и бюджетов задержки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تجارب صوتية متواصلة باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI في الوقت الفعلي، ووكلاء الصوت Vapi، و Deepgram STT/TTS، و ElevenLabs ل合성 الصوت، و LiveKit، مع تحسين الاستجابة المتصورة وميزانيات التأخير."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing real-time voice assistants","Integrating voice agents with institutional-grade trading frameworks","Optimizing audio quality for voice applications"],"zh":["开发实时语音助手","将语音代理与机构级交易框架集成","优化语音应用程序的音频质量"],"ja":["リアルタイム音声アシスタントの開発","音声エージェントと機関向け取引フレームワークの統合","音声アプリケーションのための音質最適化"],"ko":["실시간 음성 어시스턴트 개발","음성 에이전트와 기관급 거래 프레임워크 통합","음성 애플리케이션을 위한 오디오 품질 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollo de asistentes de voz en tiempo real","Integración de agentes de voz con marcos de trading de grado institucional","Optimización de la calidad de audio para aplicaciones de voz"],"fr":["Développement d''assistants vocaux en temps réel","Intégration d''agents vocaux avec des cadres de trading de qualité institutionnelle","Optimisation de la qualité audio pour les applications vocales"],"de":["Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Sprachassistenten","Integration von Sprachagenten in institutionelle Handelsframeworks","Optimierung der Audioqualität für Sprachanwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolver assistentes de voz em tempo real","Integrar agentes de voz com estruturas de negociação institucionais de classe","Otimizar a qualidade do áudio para aplicações de voz"],"ru":["Разработка голосовых помощников в реальном времени","Интеграция голосовых агентов с институциональными торговыми фреймворками","Оптимизация качества аудио для голосовых приложений"],"ar":["تطوير مساعدين صوتيين في الوقت الفعلي","دمج وكلاء الصوت مع إطارات تجارية مؤسسية","تحسين جودة الصوت لتطبيقات الصوت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI Realtime API access","Dependent on Deepgram STT/TTS and ElevenLabs voice synthesis services","Needs careful optimization for latency and audio quality"],"zh":["需要OpenAI Realtime API访问权限","依赖于Deepgram STT/TTS和ElevenLabs语音合成服务","需要对延迟和音频质量进行仔细优化"],"ja":["OpenAI Realtime APIへのアクセスが必要","Deepgram STT/TTSおよびElevenLabs音声合成サービスに依存","レイテンシと音質の慎重な最適化が必要"],"ko":["OpenAI Realtime API 접근 권한 필요","Deepgram STT/TTS 및 ElevenLabs 음성 합성 서비스에 의존","지연 시간과 오디오 품질에 대한 신중한 최적화 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de OpenAI Realtime","Depende de los servicios de STT/TTS de Deepgram y de síntesis de voz de ElevenLabs","Requiere una optimización cuidadosa de la latencia y la calidad de audio"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API OpenAI Realtime","Dépend des services Deepgram STT/TTS et de synthèse vocale ElevenLabs","Nécessite une optimisation minutieuse de la latence et de la qualité audio"],"de":["Erfordert Zugang zur OpenAI Realtime API","Abhängig von Deepgram STT/TTS- und ElevenLabs-Sprachsynthese-Diensten","Erfordert eine sorgfältige Optimierung von Latenz und Audioqualität"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API OpenAI Realtime","Depende dos serviços de STT/TTS da Deepgram e síntese de voz da ElevenLabs","Necessita de otimização cuidadosa para latência e qualidade de áudio"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API OpenAI Realtime","Зависит от сервисов STT/TTS Deepgram и синтеза голоса ElevenLabs","Требует тщательной оптимизации для задержки и качества аудио"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI في الوقت الفعلي","يعتمد على خدمات STT/TTS من Deepgram وخدمات 합성 الصوت من ElevenLabs","يحتاج إلى تحسين دقيق للتأخير وجودة الصوت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Mavrick91/tanstack-start-app/admin-crud', 'community', 'Mavrick91', 'tanstack-start-app', 'Mavrick91/tanstack-start-app', 'admin-crud', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z', '2026-02-18T07:48:06.491Z', NULL, '{"id":"Mavrick91/tanstack-start-app/admin-crud","name":"admin-crud","description":{"zh":"Admin CRUD, admin, CRUD","ja":"Admin CRUD, admin, CRUD","ko":"Admin CRUD, admin, CRUD","es":"El generador CRUD de administración crea páginas de panel de administración siguiendo patrones establecidos. Permite la creación de listas y formularios de edición","fr":"Le générateur CRUD d''administration crée des pages de tableau de bord d''administration en suivant les modèles établis. Il permet la création de listes et de formulaires d''édition","de":"Der Admin-CRUD-Generator erstellt Verwaltungsdashboard-Seiten, indem er etablierte Muster befolgt. Er ermöglicht die Erstellung von Listen und Bearbeitungsformularen","pt":"O gerador de CRUD admin cria páginas de dashboard de admin seguindo os padrões do projeto. Ele inclui listagem, criação e edição de recursos.","ru":"Генератор Admin CRUD создает страницы панели администратора, следующими устоявшимся шаблонам проекта. Он включает в себя список, создание и редактирование ресурсов.","ar":"مولد CRUD Admin ينشئ صفحات لوحة التحكم الإدارية بسهولة. يتضمن قائمة، إنشاء وتحرير الموارد.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Admin CRUD","ja":"Admin CRUD","ko":"Admin CRUD","es":"Generador CRUD de administración","fr":"Générateur CRUD d''administration","de":"Admin-CRUD-Generator","pt":"Gerador de CRUD Admin","ru":"Генератор Admin CRUD","ar":"مُولِّد CRUD Admin","en":"admin-crud"},"description":{"zh":"Admin CRUD, admin, CRUD","ja":"Admin CRUD, admin, CRUD","ko":"Admin CRUD, admin, CRUD","es":"El generador CRUD de administración crea páginas de panel de administración siguiendo patrones establecidos. Permite la creación de listas y formularios de e...","fr":"Le générateur CRUD d''administration crée des pages de tableau de bord d''administration en suivant les modèles établis. Il permet la création de listes et de ...","de":"Der Admin-CRUD-Generator erstellt Verwaltungsdashboard-Seiten, indem er etablierte Muster befolgt. Er ermöglicht die Erstellung von Listen und Bearbeitungsfo...","pt":"O gerador de CRUD admin cria páginas de dashboard de admin seguindo os padrões do projeto. Ele inclui listagem, criação e edição de recursos.","ru":"Генератор Admin CRUD создает страницы панели администратора, следующими устоявшимся шаблонам проекта. Он включает в себя список, создание и редактирование ре...","ar":"مولد CRUD Admin ينشئ صفحات لوحة التحكم الإدارية بسهولة. يتضمن قائمة، إنشاء وتحرير الموارد.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Admin","CRUD","admin","API","TSX"],"ja":["Admin","CRUD","admin","API","TSX"],"ko":["Admin","CRUD","admin","API","TSX"],"es":["Estructura de página de administración predefinida","Creación de listas y formularios de edición","Compatibilidad con recursos personalizados","Integración con rutas de administración","Soporte para componentes personalizados"],"fr":["Structure de page de tableau de bord prédéfinie","Création de listes et de formulaires d''édition","Compatibilité avec des ressources personnalisées","Intégration avec des routes d''administration","Prise en charge de composants personnalisés"],"de":["Vordefinierte Verwaltungsdashboard-Seitenstruktur","Erstellung von Listen und Bearbeitungsformularen","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Ressourcen","Integration mit Verwaltungsroutes","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Komponenten"],"pt":["Criação de páginas de dashboard de admin","Listagem de recursos","Criação e edição de recursos","Integração com o projeto","Seguimento dos padrões do projeto"],"ru":["Создание страниц панели администратора","Список ресурсов","Создание и редактирование ресурсов","Интеграция с проектом","Следование устоявшимся шаблонам проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات لوحة التحكم الإدارية","قائمة الموارد","إنشاء وتحرير الموارد","التكامل مع المشروع","اتباع أنماط المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Admin CRUD","admin","CRUD","TSX","admin","API"],"ja":["Admin CRUD","admin","CRUD","TSX","admin","API"],"ko":["Admin CRUD","admin","CRUD","TSX","admin","API"],"es":["generador CRUD","administración","panel de administración","desarrollo web","react","typescript","crud generator","admin dashboard"],"fr":["générateur CRUD","administration","tableau de bord d''administration","développement web","react","typescript","crud generator","admin dashboard"],"de":["CRUD-Generator","Verwaltung","Verwaltungsdashboard","Webentwicklung","react","typescript","crud generator","admin dashboard"],"pt":["gerador de CRUD admin","criação de páginas de admin","listagem de recursos","criação e edição de recursos","integração com o projeto","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["генератор Admin CRUD","создание страниц администратора","список ресурсов","создание и редактирование ресурсов","интеграция с проектом","веб-разработка"],"ar":["مولد CRUD Admin","إنشاء صفحات إدارية","قائمة الموارد","إنشاء وتحرير الموارد","التكامل مع المشروع","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"Mavrick91","repo":"tanstack-start-app","repoPath":"Mavrick91/tanstack-start-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"admin-crud","description":"Generate admin dashboard pages with data tables, filters, bulk actions, dialogs, and forms. Use when building admin interfaces, management pages, or dashboard components.","bodyPreview":"# Admin CRUD Generator\n\nCreate admin dashboard pages following this project''s established patterns.\n\n## Admin Page Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── routes/admin/\n│   └── resources/\n│       ├── index.tsx          # List page\n│       └── $resourceId.tsx    # Detail/edit page\n└── components/admin/\n    └── resources/\n        ├── ResourcesList.tsx        # List container\n        ├── ResourceForm.tsx         # Create/edit form\n        └── components/\n            ├── ResourceTable.tsx    # Data table","body":"# Admin CRUD Generator\n\nCreate admin dashboard pages following this project''s established patterns.\n\n## Admin Page Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── routes/admin/\n│   └── resources/\n│       ├── index.tsx          # List page\n│       └── $resourceId.tsx    # Detail/edit page\n└── components/admin/\n    └── resources/\n        ├── ResourcesList.tsx        # List container\n        ├── ResourceForm.tsx         # Create/edit form\n        └── components/\n            ├── ResourceTable.tsx    # Data table\n            ├── StatusBadge.tsx      # Status indicator\n            ├── BulkActionsBar.tsx   # Bulk operations\n            └── ResourceActions.tsx  # Row actions\n```\n\n## List Page Template\n\n```typescript\n// src/routes/admin/resources/index.tsx\nimport { createFileRoute } from ''@tanstack/react-router''\nimport { ResourcesList } from ''@/components/admin/resources/ResourcesList''\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/admin/resources/'')({\n  component: ResourcesPage,\n})\n\nfunction ResourcesPage() {\n  return <ResourcesList />\n}\n```\n\n## List Component with Data Table\n\n```typescript\n// src/components/admin/resources/ResourcesList.tsx\nimport { useQuery } from ''@tanstack/react-query''\nimport { useTranslation } from ''react-i18next''\nimport { Plus } from ''lucide-react''\nimport { Link } from ''@tanstack/react-router''\n\nimport { Button } from ''@/components/ui/button''\nimport { ResourceTable } from ''./components/ResourceTable''\n\nexport function ResourcesList() {\n  const { t } = useTranslation()\n\n  const { data, isLoading, error } = useQuery({\n    queryKey: [''resources''],\n    queryFn: async () => {\n      const res = await fetch(''/api/resources'', { credentials: ''include'' })\n      const json = await res.json()\n      if (!json.success) throw new Error(json.error)\n      return json\n    },\n  })\n\n  if (isLoading) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-center h-64\">\n        <div\n          className=\"animate-spin rounded-full h-8 w-8 border-t-2 border-b-2 border-pink-500\"\n          role=\"status\"\n          aria-label=\"Loading\"\n        />\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  if (error) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"text-center py-12\">\n        <p className=\"text-red-500\">{t(''Failed to load'')}</p>\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  const { items, total } = data\n\n  if (items.length === 0) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"text-center py-12\">\n        <Package className=\"mx-auto h-12 w-12 text-muted-foreground\" />\n        <h3 className=\"mt-2 text-sm font-semibold\">{t(''No resources'')}</h3>\n        <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          {t(''Get started by creating a new resource.'')}\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"mt-6\">\n          <Button asChild>\n            <Link to=\"/admin/resources/new\">\n              <Plus className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4\" />\n              {t(''Add Resource'')}\n            </Link>\n          </Button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <h1 className=\"text-2xl font-bold\">{t(''Resources'')}</h1>\n        <Button asChild>\n          <Link to=\"/admin/resources/new\">\n            <Plus className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4\" />\n            {t(''Add Resource'')}\n          </Link>\n        </Button>\n      </div>\n\n      <ResourceTable resources={items} />\n\n      <div className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n        {t(''{{count}} total'', { count: total })}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Data Table Component\n\n```typescript\n// src/components/admin/resources/components/ResourceTable.tsx\nimport { useState } from ''react''\nimport { Link } from ''@tanstack/react-router''\nimport { MoreHorizontal, ArrowUpDown, ArrowUp, ArrowDown } from ''lucide-react''\nimport { useTranslation } from ''react-i18next''\n\nimport {\n  DropdownMenu,\n  DropdownMenuContent,\n  DropdownMenuItem,\n  DropdownMenuTrigger,\n} from ''@/components/ui/dropdown-menu''\nimport { Button } from ''@/components/ui/button''\nimport { Checkbox } from ''@/components/ui/checkbox''\nimport { StatusBadge } from ''./StatusBadge''\n\ninterface Resource {\n  id: string\n  name: { en: string }\n  status: ''active'' | ''draft'' | ''archived''\n  createdAt: string\n}\n\ninterface Props {\n  resources: Resource[]\n}\n\nexport function ResourceTable({ resources }: Props) {\n  const { t } = useTranslation()\n  const [selectedIds, setSelectedIds] = useState<Set<string>>(new Set())\n  const [sortKey, setSortKey] = useState<string>(''createdAt'')\n  const [sortOrder, setSortOrder] = useState<''asc'' | ''desc''>(''desc'')\n\n  const toggleSelect = (id: string) => {\n    const next = new Set(selectedIds)\n    if (next.has(id)) {\n      next.delete(id)\n    } else {\n      next.add(id)\n    }\n    setSelectedIds(next)\n  }\n\n  const toggleSelectAll = () => {\n    if (selectedIds.size === resources.length) {\n      setSelectedIds(new Set())\n    } else {\n      setSelectedIds(new Set(resources.map((r) => r.id)))\n    }\n  }\n\n  const isAllSelected = selectedIds.size === resources.length\n  const isSomeSelected = selectedIds.size > 0 && selectedIds.size < resources.length\n\n  const handleSort = (key: string) => {\n    if (sortKey === key) {\n      setSortOrder(sortOrder === ''asc'' ? ''desc'' : ''asc'')\n    } else {\n      setSortKey(key)\n      setSortOrder(''desc'')\n    }\n  }\n\n  const SortIcon = ({ columnKey }: { columnKey: string }) => {\n    if (sortKey !== columnKey) return <ArrowUpDown className=\"ml-2 h-4 w-4\" />\n    return sortOrder === ''asc''\n      ? <ArrowUp className=\"ml-2 h-4 w-4\" />\n      : <ArrowDown className=\"ml-2 h-4 w-4\" />\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {selectedIds.size > 0 && (\n        <BulkActionsBar\n          selectedCount={selectedIds.size}\n          onClearSelection={() => setSelectedIds(new Set())}\n        />\n      )}\n\n      <div className=\"rounded-md border\">\n        <table className=\"w-full\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr className=\"border-b bg-muted/50\">\n              <th className=\"w-12 p-4\">\n                <Checkbox\n                  checked={isAllSelected}\n                  indeterminate={isSomeSelected}\n                  onCheckedChange={toggleSelectAll}\n                />\n              </th>\n              <th className=\"p-4 text-left\">\n                <button\n                  className=\"flex items-center font-medium\"\n                  onClick={() => handleSort(''name'')}\n                >\n                  {t(''Name'')}\n                  <SortIcon columnKey=\"name\" />\n                </button>\n              </th>\n              <th className=\"p-4 text-left\">{t(''Status'')}</th>\n              <th className=\"p-4 text-left\">\n                <button\n                  className=\"flex items-center font-medium\"\n                  onClick={() => handleSort(''createdAt'')}\n                >\n                  {t(''Created'')}\n                  <SortIcon columnKey=\"createdAt\" />\n                </button>\n              </th>\n              <th className=\"w-12 p-4\"></th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            {resources.map((resource) => (\n              <tr\n                key={resource.id}\n                className={`border-b hover:bg-muted/50 group ${\n                  selectedIds.has(resource.id) ? ''bg-pink-500/5'' : ''''\n                }`}\n              >\n                <td className=\"p-4\">\n                  <Checkbox\n                    checked={selectedIds.has(resource.id)}\n                    onCheckedChange={() => toggleSelect(resource.id)}\n                  />\n                </td>\n                <td className=\"p-4\">\n                  <Link\n                    to=\"/admin/resources/$resourceId\"\n                    params={{ resourceId: resource.id }}\n                    className=\"font-medium hover:underline\"\n                  >\n                    {resource.name.en}\n                  </Link>\n                </td>\n                <td className=\"p-4\">\n                  <StatusBadge status={resource.status} />\n                </td>\n                <td className=\"p-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n                  {new Date(resource.createdAt).toLocaleDateString()}\n                </td>\n                <td className=\"p-4\">\n                  <DropdownMenu>\n                    <DropdownMenuTrigger asChild>\n                      <Button variant=\"ghost\" size=\"icon\">\n                        <MoreHorizontal className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n                      </Button>\n                    </DropdownMenuTrigger>\n                    <DropdownMenuContent align=\"end\">\n                      <DropdownMenuItem asChild>\n                        <Link\n                          to=\"/admin/resources/$resourceId\"\n                          params={{ resourceId: resource.id }}\n                        >\n                          {t(''Edit'')}\n                        </Link>\n                      </DropdownMenuItem>\n                      <DropdownMenuItem className=\"text-destructive\">\n                        {t(''Delete'')}\n                      </DropdownMenuItem>\n                    </DropdownMenuContent>\n                  </DropdownMenu>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            ))}\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Status Badge\n\n```typescript\n// src/components/admin/resources/components/StatusBadge.tsx\nimport { cn } from ''@/lib/utils''\n\nconst statusStyles = {\n  active: ''bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-500'',\n  draft: ''bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500'',\n  archived: ''bg-muted text-muted-foreground'',\n  pending: ''bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-500'',\n  processing: ''bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-500'',\n  shipped: ''bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-500'',\n  delivered: ''bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-500'',\n  cancelled: ''bg-red-500/10 text-red-500'',\n  paid: ''bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-500'',\n  failed: ''bg-red-500/10 text-red-500'',\n  refunded: ''bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500'',\n}\n\ninterface Props {\n  status: keyof typeof statusStyles\n}\n\nexport function StatusBadge({ status }: Props) {\n  return (\n    <span\n      className={cn(\n        ''inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase'',\n        statusStyles[status] || statusStyles.draft\n      )}\n    >\n      <span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-current\" />\n      {status}\n    </span>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Bulk Actions Bar\n\n```typescript\n// src/components/admin/resources/components/BulkActionsBar.tsx\nimport { useMutation, useQueryClient } from ''@tanstack/react-query''\nimport { useTranslation } from ''react-i18next''\nimport { toast } from ''sonner''\n\nimport { Button } from ''@/components/ui/button''\n\ninterface Props {\n  selectedCount: number\n  selectedIds: string[]\n  onClearSelection: () => void\n}\n\nexport function BulkActionsBar({ selectedCount, selectedIds, onClearSelection }: Props) {\n  const { t } = useTranslation()\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient()\n\n  const bulkUpdate = useMutation({\n    mutationFn: async (action: ''activate'' | ''archive'' | ''delete'') => {\n      const res = await fetch(''/api/resources/bulk'', {\n        method: ''POST'',\n        headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n        credentials: ''include'',\n        body: JSON.stringify({ ids: selectedIds, action }),\n      })\n      const json = await res.json()\n      if (!json.success) throw new Error(json.error)\n      return json\n    },\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [''resources''] })\n      onClearSelection()\n      toast.success(t(''Updated successfully''))\n    },\n    onError: (error) => {\n      toast.error(error.message)\n    },\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border bg-muted/50 p-4\">\n      <span className=\"text-sm font-medium\">\n        {t(''{{count}} selected'', { count: selectedCount })}\n      </span>\n      <div className=\"flex gap-2\">\n        <Button\n          size=\"sm\"\n          variant=\"outline\"\n          onClick={() => bulkUpdate.mutate(''activate'')}\n          disabled={bulkUpdate.isPending}\n        >\n          {t(''Activate'')}\n        </Button>\n        <Button\n          size=\"sm\"\n          variant=\"outline\"\n          onClick={() => bulkUpdate.mutate(''archive'')}\n          disabled={bulkUpdate.isPending}\n        >\n          {t(''Archive'')}\n        </Button>\n        <Button\n          size=\"sm\"\n          variant=\"destructive\"\n          onClick={() => bulkUpdate.mutate(''delete'')}\n          disabled={bulkUpdate.isPending}\n        >\n          {t(''Delete'')}\n        </Button>\n      </div>\n      <Button\n        size=\"sm\"\n        variant=\"ghost\"\n        onClick={onClearSelection}\n        className=\"ml-auto\"\n      >\n        {t(''Clear selection'')}\n      </Button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Card-Based Form Layout\n\n```typescript\n// Product form pattern with gradient accent cards\n<div className=\"grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n  {/* Main content - 2 columns */}\n  <div className=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-6\">\n    {/* Details Card */}\n    <Card className=\"border-border/50 shadow-xl shadow-foreground/5 bg-card/50 backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden\">\n      <div className=\"h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-purple-500\" />\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>{t(''Details'')}</CardTitle>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        {/* Form fields */}\n      </CardContent>\n    </Card>\n\n    {/* Media Card */}\n    <Card className=\"overflow-hidden\">\n      <div className=\"h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-500 to-fuchsia-500\" />\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>{t(''Media'')}</CardTitle>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        {/* Image uploader */}\n      </CardContent>\n    </Card>\n  </div>\n\n  {/* Sidebar - 1 column, sticky */}\n  <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n    <div className=\"lg:sticky lg:top-4\">\n      {/* Status Card */}\n      <Card>\n        <div className=\"h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-500\" />\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>{t(''Status'')}</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          {/* Status select */}\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Gradient Accent Colors\n\n| Section  | Gradient                         |\n| -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Details  | `from-pink-500 to-purple-500`    |\n| Media    | `from-violet-500 to-fuchsia-500` |\n| Options  | `from-blue-500 to-cyan-500`      |\n| Variants | `from-emerald-500 to-teal-500`   |\n| SEO      | `from-amber-500 to-orange-500`   |\n\n## Confirmation Dialog\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  AlertDialog,\n  AlertDialogAction,\n  AlertDialogCancel,\n  AlertDialogContent,\n  AlertDialogDescription,\n  AlertDialogFooter,\n  AlertDialogHeader,\n  AlertDialogTitle,\n} from ''@/components/ui/alert-dialog''\n\nfunction DeleteConfirmDialog({ open, onOpenChange, onConfirm, resourceName }) {\n  const { t } = useTranslation()\n\n  return (\n    <AlertDialog open={open} onOpenChange={onOpenChange}>\n      <AlertDialogContent>\n        <AlertDialogHeader>\n          <AlertDialogTitle>{t(''Delete Resource'')}</AlertDialogTitle>\n          <AlertDialogDescription>\n            {t(''Are you sure you want to delete \"{{name}}\"? This action cannot be undone.'', {\n              name: resourceName,\n            })}\n          </AlertDialogDescription>\n        </AlertDialogHeader>\n        <AlertDialogFooter>\n          <AlertDialogCancel>{t(''Cancel'')}</AlertDialogCancel>\n          <AlertDialogAction\n            onClick={onConfirm}\n            className=\"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\"\n          >\n            {t(''Delete'')}\n          </AlertDialogAction>\n        </AlertDialogFooter>\n      </AlertDialogContent>\n    </AlertDialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## See Also\n\n- `src/components/admin/products/` - Full product CRUD example\n- `src/components/admin/orders/` - Order management\n- `src/hooks/useDataTable.ts` - Table state management\n- `forms` skill - Form patterns with FNForm\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:48:06.491Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Development Agents that need to rapidly scaffold admin dashboard interfaces following React-based patterns.","zh":"适合需要快速搭建基于React的管理仪表板接口的全栈开发代理","ja":"Reactベースのパターンに従って管理ダッシュボードインターフェイスを迅速にスcaffoldする必要があるフルスタック開発エージェントに最適","ko":"리액트 기반 패턴에 따라 관리 대시보드 인터페이스를迅速하게 스캐폴딩해야 하는 풀스택 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Full-Stack que necesitan crear rápidamente interfaces de paneles de administración con patrones basados en React.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Full-Stack qui ont besoin de créer rapidement des interfaces de tableau de bord d''administration suivant des modèles basés sur React.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Entwicklungsagenten, die schnell Administrator-Dashboard-Schnittstellen nach React-basierten Mustern erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Full-Stack que precisam criar rapidamente interfaces de painel de administração seguindo padrões baseados em React.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов полного стека разработки, которым необходимо быстро создавать интерфейсы панели администратора, следуя шаблонам на основе React.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء واجهات لوحة التحكم الإدارية بسرعة وفقًا لأنماط مُستندة إلى React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automatic generation of complete admin CRUD interfaces with pre-configured routing structure, including list views ($resourceId.tsx) and detail/edit pages (index.tsx). Provides component architecture with dedicated containers (ResourcesList.tsx) and form components (ResourceForm.tsx) following established project conventions.","zh":"实现自动生成完整的管理CRUD接口，包括预配置的路由结构、列表视图($resourceId.tsx)和详细/编辑页面(index.tsx)，并提供遵循已建立的项目约定的组件架构，包括专用的容器(ResourcesList.tsx)和表单组件(ResourceForm.tsx)","ja":"自動的に完全な管理CRUDインターフェイスを生成することを可能にします。事前に構成されたルーティング構造、リストビュー($resourceId.tsx)、詳細/編集ページ(index.tsx)を含み、確立されたプロジェクト慣習に従ったコンポーネントアーキテクチャを提供します。専用のコンテナ(ResourcesList.tsx)とフォームコンポーネント(ResourceForm.tsx)を含みます","ko":"완전한 관리 CRUD 인터페이스의 자동 생성을 가능하게 하며, 事前に 구성된 라우팅 구조, 목록 보기($resourceId.tsx), 상세/편집 페이지(index.tsx)를 포함하며, 확립된 프로젝트 관행에 따라 구성된 컴포넌트 아키텍처를 제공합니다. 전용 컨테이너(ResourcesList.tsx)와 폼 컴포넌트(ResourceForm.tsx)를 포함","es":"Permite la generación automática de interfaces de administración CRUD completas con una estructura de enrutamiento preconfigurada, incluyendo vistas de lista ($resourceId.tsx) y páginas de detalles/edición (index.tsx). Proporciona una arquitectura de componentes con contenedores dedicados (ResourcesList.tsx) y componentes de formulario (ResourceForm.tsx) siguiendo las convenciones de proyecto establecidas.","fr":"Permet la génération automatique d''interfaces CRUD d''administration complètes avec une structure de routage préconfigurée, y compris des vues de liste ($resourceId.tsx) et des pages de détails/édition (index.tsx). Fournit une architecture de composants avec des conteneurs dédiés (ResourcesList.tsx) et des composants de formulaire (ResourceForm.tsx) suivant les conventions de projet établies.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatische Generierung von vollständigen Admin-CRUD-Schnittstellen mit einer vorkonfigurierten Routing-Struktur, einschließlich Listenansichten ($resourceId.tsx) und Detail-/Bearbeitungsseiten (index.tsx). Bietet eine Komponentenarchitektur mit dedizierten Containern (ResourcesList.tsx) und Formularkomponenten (ResourceForm.tsx) unter Einhaltung etablierter Projektkonventionen.","pt":"Permite a geração automática de interfaces CRUD de administração completas com estrutura de roteamento pré-configurada, incluindo vistas de lista ($resourceId.tsx) e páginas de detalhe/edição (index.tsx). Fornece arquitetura de componentes com contêineres dedicados (ResourcesList.tsx) e componentes de formulário (ResourceForm.tsx) seguindo convenções de projeto estabelecidas.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически генерировать полные интерфейсы CRUD администратора с предварительно сконфигурированной структурой маршрутизации, включая представления списков ($resourceId.tsx) и страницы деталей/редактирования (index.tsx). Предоставляет архитектуру компонентов с посвященными контейнерами (ResourcesList.tsx) и компонентами форм (ResourceForm.tsx) в соответствии с установленными конвенциями проекта.","ar":"تمكن من توليد تلقائي ل_interfaces CRUD كاملة للوحة التحكم مع هيكل التوجيه مسبقًا، بما في ذلك عروض القوائم ($resourceId.tsx) وصفحات التفاصيل/التحرير (index.tsx). يوفر هيكلية المكونات مع حاويات مخصصة (ResourcesList.tsx) ومكونات النماذج (ResourceForm.tsx) وفقًا لاتفاقيات المشروع المعتمدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating admin dashboard routes for new resources","Scaffolding CRUD interface components with proper separation of concerns","Creating data table components (ResourceTable.tsx) for list views","Building detail/edit forms with consistent patterns"],"zh":["为新资源生成管理仪表板路由","使用适当的关注点分离来搭建CRUD接口组件","为列表视图创建数据表格组件(ResourceTable.tsx)","使用一致的模式构建详细/编辑表单"],"ja":["新しいリソースの管理ダッシュボードルートを生成する","関心の分離が適切なCRUDインターフェイスコンポーネントをスキャフォールドする","リストビュー用のデータテーブルコンポーネント(ResourceTable.tsx)を作成する","一貫したパターンで詳細/編集フォームを構築する"],"ko":["새로운 리소스에 대한 관리 대시보드 路由를 생성","적절한 관심사 분리를 사용하여 CRUD 인터페이스 컴포넌트를 스캐폴딩","목록 보기용 데이터 테이블 컴포넌트(ResourceTable.tsx)를 생성","일관된 패턴으로 상세/편집 폼을 구축"],"es":["Generar rutas de panel de administración para nuevos recursos","Crear componentes de interfaz CRUD con una separación adecuada de preocupaciones","Crear componentes de tabla de datos (ResourceTable.tsx) para vistas de lista","Crear formularios de detalles/edición con patrones coherentes"],"fr":["Générer des routes de tableau de bord d''administration pour de nouvelles ressources","Créer des composants d''interface CRUD avec une séparation appropriée des préoccupations","Créer des composants de tableau de données (ResourceTable.tsx) pour les vues de liste","Créer des formulaires de détails/édition avec des modèles cohérents"],"de":["Erzeugen von Administrator-Dashboard-Routen für neue Ressourcen","Erstellen von CRUD-Schnittstellenkomponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Trennung von Belangen","Erstellen von Datenkomponenten (ResourceTable.tsx) für Listenansichten","Erstellen von Detail-/Bearbeitungsformularen mit konsistenten Mustern"],"pt":["Gerar rotas de painel de administração para novos recursos","Criar componentes de interface CRUD com separação apropriada de preocupações","Criar componentes de tabela de dados (ResourceTable.tsx) para vistas de lista","Construir formulários de detalhe/edição com padrões consistentes"],"ru":["Генерировать маршруты панели администратора для новых ресурсов","Создавать компоненты интерфейса CRUD с правильным разделением задач","Создавать компоненты таблицы данных (ResourceTable.tsx) для представлений списков","Строить формы деталей/редактирования с последовательными шаблонами"],"ar":["توليد مسارات لوحة التحكم الإدارية لموارد جديدة","إنشاء مكونات واجهة CRUD مع فصل مناسب للقضايا","إنشاء مكونات جدول البيانات (ResourceTable.tsx) لعروض القوائم","بناء نماذج التفاصيل/التحرير أنماطاً متسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React/TypeScript project structure","Depends on existing routing conventions (src/routes/admin/)","Needs component architecture alignment (src/components/admin/)"],"zh":["需要React/TypeScript项目结构","依赖于现有的路由约定(src/routes/admin/)","需要组件架构对齐(src/components/admin/)"],"ja":["React/TypeScriptプロジェクト構造が必要","既存のルーティング慣習(src/routes/admin/)に依存","コンポーネントアーキテクチャの整合(src/components/admin/)が必要"],"ko":["리액트/타입스크립트 프로젝트 구조가 필요","既存의 라우팅 관행(src/routes/admin/)에 의존","컴포넌트 아키텍처의 정렬(src/components/admin/)이 필요"],"es":["Requiere estructura de proyecto React/TypeScript","Depende de convenciones de enrutamiento existentes (src/routes/admin/)","Necesita alineación de la arquitectura de componentes (src/components/admin/)"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de projet React/TypeScript","Dépend de conventions de routage existantes (src/routes/admin/)","Nécessite une alignment de l''architecture de composants (src/components/admin/)"],"de":["Benötigt React/TypeScript-Projektstruktur","Hängt von bestehenden Routing-Konventionen ab (src/routes/admin/)","Benötigt Ausrichtung der Komponentenarchitektur (src/components/admin/)"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de projeto React/TypeScript","Depende das convenções de roteamento existentes (src/routes/admin/)","Necessita de alinhamento da arquitetura de componentes (src/components/admin/)"],"ru":["Требует структуры проекта React/TypeScript","Зависит от существующих конвенций маршрутизации (src/routes/admin/)","Требует выравнивания архитектуры компонентов (src/components/admin/)"],"ar":["يتطلب هيكلة مشروع React/TypeScript","يعتمد على اتفاقيات التوجيه الحالية (src/routes/admin/)","يحتاج إلى محاذاة هيكلية المكونات (src/components/admin/)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
