azel 的功能和优点，选择最适合您的项目的工具","ja":"モノレポツールは大規模なコードベースを管理するための必須ツールです。Turborepo、Nx、Bazel の機能とメリットを比較して、プロジェクトに最適なツールを選択しましょう","ko":"모노레포 도구는 대규모 코드베이스를 관리하는 필수 도구입니다. Turborepo, Nx, Bazel의 기능과 장점을 비교하여 프로젝트에 적합한 도구를 선택하세요","es":"Las herramientas de monorepo como Turborepo, Nx y Bazel ayudan a gestionar y optimizar proyectos de desarrollo de gran escala.","fr":"Les outils de monorepo tels que Turborepo, Nx et Bazel aident à gérer et à optimiser les projets de développement à grande échelle.","de":"Monorepo-Tools wie Turborepo, Nx und Bazel helfen bei der Verwaltung und Optimierung von Entwicklungsprojekten großer Unternehmen.","pt":"As ferramentas de monorepo permitem gerenciar múltiplos projetos em um repositório único, melhorando a produtividade e a colaboração.","ru":"Инструменты монорепо позволяют управлять несколькими проектами в одном репозитории, повышая производительность и сотрудничество.","ar":"أدوات مونوريبو تسمح بإدارة مشاريع متعددة في مستودع واحد، مما يحسن الإنتاجية والتعاون.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 项目","提供缓存和远程缓存功能","支持代码生成和执行","具有低至高的学习曲线","支持多种构建和部署工具"],"ja":["JavaScript と TypeScript プロジェクトをサポート","キャッシュとリモートキャッシュ機能を提供","コード生成と実行をサポート","低〜高の学習曲線を提供","多種のビルドとデプロイツールをサポート"],"ko":["자바스크립트와 타입스크립트 프로젝트를 지원","캐시와 리모트 캐시 기능을 제공","코드 생성과 실행을 지원","낮은〜높은 학습 곡선을 제공","다양한 빌드와 배포 도구를 지원"],"es":["Gestión de proyectos de gran escala","Optimización de la compilación y el despliegue","Caché remoto para mejorar el rendimiento","Generación de código automático","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Gestion de projets à grande échelle","Optimisation de la compilation et du déploiement","Cache distant pour améliorer les performances","Génération de code automatique","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Verwaltung von Entwicklungsprojekten großer Unternehmen","Optimierung der Kompilierung und des Deployments","Remote-Cache für verbesserte Leistung","Automatische Codegenerierung","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de projetos múltiplos em um repositório único","Melhoria da produtividade e colaboração","Suporte a JavaScript e TypeScript","Caching e execução remota","Geração de código e regras"],"ru":["Управление несколькими проектами в одном репозитории","Повышение производительности и сотрудничества","Поддержка JavaScript и TypeScript","Кэширование и удаленная выполнение","Генерация кода и правила"],"ar":["إدارة مشاريع متعددة في مستودع واحد","تحسين الإنتاجية والتعاون","دعم جافاسكريبت وتايبسكريبت","التخزين المؤقت والتنفيذ عن بعد","توليد الشفرة والقواعد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["monorepo","Turborepo","Nx","Bazel","JavaScript","TypeScript","代码管理","缓存","远程缓存","代码生成"],"ja":["モノレポ","Turborepo","Nx","Bazel","JavaScript","TypeScript","コード管理","キャッシュ","リモートキャッシュ","コード生成"],"ko":["모노레포","Turborepo","Nx","Bazel","자바스크립트","타입스크립트","코드 관리","캐시","리모트 캐시","코드 생성"],"es":["monorepo","turborepo","nx","bazel","herramientas de desarrollo","gestión de proyectos","optimización de la compilación","caché remoto","generación de código"],"fr":["monorepo","turborepo","nx","bazel","outils de développement","gestion de projets","optimisation de la compilation","cache distant","génération de code"],"de":["monorepo","turborepo","nx","bazel","entwicklungsTools","projektverwaltung","optimierung der Kompilierung","remote-cache","codegenerierung"],"pt":["monorepo","turborepo","nx","bazel","javascript","typescript","gerenciamento de código","produtividade","colaboração"],"ru":["монорепо","turborepo","nx","bazel","javascript","typescript","управление кодом","производительность","сотрудничество"],"ar":["مونوريبو","turborepo","nx","bazel","جافاسكريبت","تايبسكريبت","إدارة الشفرة","الإنتاجية","التعاون"]}},"owner":"jlaws","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"jlaws/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monorepo-tools","description":"Decision framework for monorepo build tools (Turborepo, Nx, Bazel). Use when choosing a monorepo tool, configuring build pipelines, or optimizing caching strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Monorepo Tools\n\n## Decision Framework\n\n| Factor | Turborepo | Nx | Bazel |\n|--------|-----------|-----|-------|\n| **Best for** | JS/TS monorepos, simple needs | JS/TS with architecture enforcement | Polyglot, large-scale |\n| **Learning curve** | Low | Medium | High |\n| **Caching** | File hash | File hash + computation | Content-addressable |\n| **Remote cache** | Vercel (built-in) | Nx Cloud / S3 | gRPC remote execution |\n| **Code generation** | None | Generators/executors | Rules/macros |\n| **","body":"# Monorepo Tools\n\n## Decision Framework\n\n| Factor | Turborepo | Nx | Bazel |\n|--------|-----------|-----|-------|\n| **Best for** | JS/TS monorepos, simple needs | JS/TS with architecture enforcement | Polyglot, large-scale |\n| **Learning curve** | Low | Medium | High |\n| **Caching** | File hash | File hash + computation | Content-addressable |\n| **Remote cache** | Vercel (built-in) | Nx Cloud / S3 | gRPC remote execution |\n| **Code generation** | None | Generators/executors | Rules/macros |\n| **Architecture rules** | None | Module boundaries | Visibility rules |\n| **Package manager** | npm/pnpm/yarn | npm/pnpm/yarn | Own dependency model |\n\n### When to Choose Each\n\n**Turborepo** (default choice for JS/TS):\n- <50 packages\n- Team already uses Vercel\n- Need fast setup with minimal config\n- No need for architecture enforcement\n- `turbo.json` pipeline config is all you need\n\n**Nx** (when you need guardrails):\n- Need module boundary enforcement (`@nx/enforce-module-boundaries`)\n- Want code generators for consistent project scaffolding\n- Plugin ecosystem matters (React, Angular, Node have first-class support)\n- Team is growing and you need architectural constraints\n\n**Bazel** (when scale demands it):\n- Polyglot codebase (JS + Python + Go + Java)\n- >100 packages / >500 engineers\n- Need hermetic, reproducible builds\n- Need remote execution (distribute builds across machines)\n- Willing to invest in build infrastructure team\n\n### Migration Path\nTurborepo -> Nx (when you need boundaries) -> Bazel (when Nx can''t scale)\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n**Task graph**: DAG of build tasks. `^build` = build dependencies first. Tools traverse this for parallelism and caching.\n\n**Caching**: Hash inputs (source files, env vars, configs) -> cache key -> store outputs. Cache hit = skip execution. All tools support local + remote cache.\n\n**Affected detection**: Compare current state to base branch. Run only tasks for changed packages and their dependents. Critical for CI speed.\n\n## Turborepo Key Opinions\n\n### Pipeline Configuration\n- Always specify `inputs` -- default hashes everything, including test files for build tasks\n- Set `outputs` precisely -- `[\"dist/**\"]` not `[\"dist\"]`\n- `env` must list all env vars that affect output -- missing one = stale cache\n- `\"dev\": { \"cache\": false, \"persistent\": true }` -- dev servers are never cacheable\n\n### Filtering\n```bash\nturbo build --filter=''...[origin/main]''  # Changed since main (CI)\nturbo build --filter=@myorg/web...       # Package + its dependencies\nturbo build --filter=''./apps/*''          # By directory\n```\n\n### Cache Debugging\n```bash\nturbo build --dry-run          # What would run\nturbo build --summarize        # Cache hit/miss stats\nturbo build --force            # Skip cache entirely\n```\n\n## Nx Key Opinions\n\n### Library Types (enforce via tags)\n| Type | Purpose | Can Depend On |\n|------|---------|---------------|\n| `type:app` | Deployable applications | feature, ui, data-access, util |\n| `type:feature` | Smart components, business logic | ui, data-access, util |\n| `type:ui` | Presentational components | ui, util |\n| `type:data-access` | API calls, state | data-access, util |\n| `type:util` | Pure functions | util |\n\nThis hierarchy prevents circular dependencies and enforces separation of concerns.\n\n### Scope Tags\nAdd `scope:web`, `scope:api`, `scope:shared` to prevent cross-platform leaks.\n\n## Shared Patterns\n\n### TypeScript Config\n- Single `tsconfig.base.json` at root with shared `compilerOptions`\n- Per-project `tsconfig.json` extends base, adds `rootDir`/`outDir`\n- Use `\"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\"` for modern projects\n\n### Package Exports\n```json\n{\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": { \"import\": \"./dist/index.js\", \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\" },\n    \"./button\": { \"import\": \"./dist/button.js\", \"types\": \"./dist/button.d.ts\" }\n  }\n}\n```\n- Always include `types` condition\n- Use granular exports, not barrel files with everything\n\n### Dependency Management (pnpm preferred)\n- pnpm workspaces for JS/TS monorepos -- strict, fast, disk-efficient\n- `pnpm add react --filter @repo/ui` -- add to specific package\n- Use `catalog:` in pnpm-workspace.yaml to pin shared dependency versions\n\n### Changesets for Publishing\n- `@changesets/cli` for version management and npm publishing\n- Changeset per PR -- enforced via CI check\n- Auto-merge minor/patch updates, manual review for major\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:48:45.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents managing large-scale, polyglot monorepos with Turborepo, Nx, or Bazel.","zh":"非常适合管理大规模、多语言单体仓库的DevOps代理，支持Turborepo、Nx或Bazel。","ja":"大規模なマルチ言語モノレポをTurborepo、Nx、またはBazelで管理するDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"터보레포, Nx 또는 베즐을 사용하는 대규모 멀티언어 모노레포를 관리하는 데브옵스 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que gestionan monorepos de gran escala y políglotas con Turborepo, Nx o Bazel.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps qui gèrent des monorepos à grande échelle et polyglottes avec Turborepo, Nx ou Bazel.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die große, polyglotte Monorepos mit Turborepo, Nx oder Bazel verwalten.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que gerenciam monorepos de grande escala e poliglotas com Turborepo, Nx ou Bazel.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которые управляют крупномасштабными, полиглотными монорепозиториями с помощью Turborepo, Nx или Bazel.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يدير مستودعات مونو كبيرة النطاق متعددة اللغات باستخدام Turborepo و Nx و Bazel."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize monorepo builds using content-addressable caching, gRPC remote execution, and code generation via rules/macros, while enforcing architecture with Nx or leveraging Vercel''s built-in remote cache with Turborepo.","zh":"赋予代理优化单体仓库构建的能力，使用基于内容的缓存、gRPC远程执行和规则/宏代码生成，同时使用Nx强制执行架构或利用Turborepo的内置远程缓存。","ja":"エージェントがコンテンツアドレッシングキャッシュ、gRPCリモート実行、ルール/マクロによるコード生成を使用してモノレポビルドを最適化し、Nxでアーキテクチャを適用またはTurborepoの組み込みリモートキャッシュを活用することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 콘텐츠 주소 지정 캐싱, gRPC 원격 실행 및 규칙/매크로를 통한 코드 생성을 사용하여 모노레포 빌드를 최적화하고, Nx로 아키텍처를 적용하거나 터보레포의 내장 원격 캐시를 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar las compilaciones de monorepo mediante caché direccionable por contenido, ejecución remota de gRPC y generación de código a través de reglas/macro, mientras se hace cumplir la arquitectura con Nx o se aprovecha la caché remota integrada de Vercel con Turborepo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les constructions de monorepo en utilisant un cache adressable par contenu, une exécution à distance de gRPC et une génération de code via des règles/macro, tout en faisant respecter l''architecture avec Nx ou en exploitant la cache distante intégrée de Vercel avec Turborepo.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Monorepo-Builds mithilfe von inhaltsadressierbarem Caching, gRPC-Remote-Ausführung und Codegenerierung über Regeln/Makros zu optimieren, während die Architektur mit Nx durchgesetzt oder der integrierte Remote-Cache von Vercel mit Turborepo genutzt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem as compilações de monorepo usando cache de endereçamento de conteúdo, execução remota gRPC e geração de código via regras/macros, além de impor a arquitetura com Nx ou aproveitar o cache remoto integrado do Vercel com o Turborepo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать сборку монорепозитория с помощью кэширования по содержимому, удаленного выполнения gRPC и генерации кода через правила/макросы, а также обеспечивает соблюдение архитектуры с помощью Nx или использует встроенный удаленный кэш Vercel с Turborepo.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتحسين بناء مستودع المونو باستخدام ذاكرة التخزين المؤشرة إلى المحتوى والتنفيذ البعدي gRPC وتوليد الكود من خلال القواعد / الماكروات، بالإضافة إلى فرض الهيكل المعماري باستخدام Nx أو الاستفادة من ذاكرة التخزين البعيدة المدمجة في Vercel مع Turborepo."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating monorepo build optimizations with Turborepo and Nx","Enforcing architecture compliance in JS/TS monorepos using Nx","Scaling large-scale, polyglot monorepos with Bazel''s content-addressable caching"],"zh":["使用Turborepo和Nx自动执行单体仓库构建优化","使用Nx在JS/TS单体仓库中强制执行架构合规性","使用Bazel的基于内容的缓存扩展大规模多语言单体仓库"],"ja":["TurborepoとNxを使用してモノレポビルドの自動最適化を行う","Nxを使用してJS/TSモノレポのアーキテクチャコンプライアンスを適用する","Bazelのコンテンツアドレッシングキャッシュを使用して大規模なマルチ言語モノレポを拡張する"],"ko":["터보레포와 Nx를 사용하여 모노레포 빌드 최적화를 자동화한다","Nx를 사용하여 JS/TS 모노레포의 아키텍처 규정 준수를 강제한다","베즐의 콘텐츠 주소 지정 캐싱을 사용하여 대규모 멀티언어 모노레포를 확장한다"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización de compilaciones de monorepo con Turborepo y Nx","Hacer cumplir el cumplimiento de la arquitectura en monorepos JS/TS que utilizan Nx","Escalabilidad de monorepos de gran escala y políglotas con caché direccionable por contenido de Bazel"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des constructions de monorepo avec Turborepo et Nx","Faire respecter la conformité de l''architecture dans les monorepos JS/TS qui utilisent Nx","Mettre à l''échelle des monorepos à grande échelle et polyglottes avec un cache adressable par contenu de Bazel"],"de":["Automatisierung der Optimierung von Monorepo-Builds mit Turborepo und Nx","Durchsetzung der Architekturkonformität in JS/TS-Monorepos mit Nx","Skalierung großer, polyglotter Monorepos mit inhaltsadressierbarem Caching von Bazel"],"pt":["Automatizar otimizações de compilação de monorepo com Turborepo e Nx","Impor conformidade de arquitetura em monorepos JS/TS usando Nx","Dimensionar monorepos de grande escala e poliglotas com cache de endereçamento de conteúdo do Bazel"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию сборки монорепозитория с помощью Turborepo и Nx","Обеспечить соблюдение архитектуры в монорепозиториях JS/TS с помощью Nx","Масштабировать крупномасштабные, полиглотные монорепозитории с помощью кэширования по содержимому Bazel"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات بناء مستودع المونو تلقائيًا باستخدام Turborepo و Nx","فرض الامتثال للهيكل المعماري في مستودعات المونو JS/TS باستخدام Nx","توسيع مستودعات المونو كبيرة النطاق متعددة اللغات باستخدام ذاكرة التخزين المؤشرة إلى المحتوى من Bazel"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific monorepo tooling expertise","High learning curve for Bazel","Limited code generation capabilities with Turborepo"],"zh":["需要特定的单体仓库工具专业知识","Bazel的学习曲线较高","Turborepo的代码生成能力有限"],"ja":["モノレポツールの専門知識が必要","Bazelの学習曲線が高い","Turborepoのコード生成能力が限定されている"],"ko":["특정 모노레포 툴링 전문 지식이 필요하다","베즐의 학습 곡선이 높다","터보레포의 코드 생성 능력이 제한적이다"],"es":["Requiere una experiencia específica en herramientas de monorepo","Curva de aprendizaje alta para Bazel","Capacidades de generación de código limitadas con Turborepo"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise spécifique dans les outils de monorepo","Courbe d''apprentissage élevée pour Bazel","Capacités de génération de code limitées avec Turborepo"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Expertise in Monorepo-Tools","Hohe Lernkurve für Bazel","Eingeschränkte Codegenerierungsfähigkeiten mit Turborepo"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento específico de ferramentas de monorepo","Curva de aprendizado alta para Bazel","Capacidades limitadas de geração de código com Turborepo"],"ru":["Требует специфических знаний инструментов монорепозитория","Высокая кривая обучения для Bazel","Ограниченные возможности генерации кода с помощью Turborepo"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة محددة بأدوات مستودع المونو","منحنى تعلم مرتفع لبرنامج Bazel","قدرات محدودة لتوليد الكود مع Turborepo"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
