イコンライブラリです","ko":"RemixIcon은 개발자를 위한 포괄적인 아이콘 라이브러리입니다","es":"RemixIcon es una biblioteca de iconos con más de 3100 diseños para aplicaciones web y móviles. Está disponible en estilos outline y relleno.","fr":"RemixIcon est une bibliothèque d''icônes avec plus de 3100 conceptions pour applications web et mobiles. Elle est disponible en styles outline et rempli.","de":"RemixIcon ist eine Icon-Bibliothek mit über 3100 Designs für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen. Sie ist in Outline- und Füllstilen verfügbar.","pt":"RemixIcon é uma biblioteca de ícones abrangente com mais de 3100 ícones projetados com cuidado, disponíveis em estilos contornados e preenchidos.","ru":"RemixIcon - это всесторонняя библиотека иконок, содержащая более 3100 тщательно спроектированных иконок в контурных и заполненных стилях.","ar":"RemixIcon هي مكتبة أيقونات شاملة تحتوي على أكثر من 3100 أيقونة مصممة بدقة، متاحة في الأشكال المخططة والمملوءة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["3100+图标","outlined和filled样式","24x24像素网格","适用于Web应用和移动应用","一致的图标设计"],"ja":["3100以上のアイコン","アウトラインと充填スタイル","24x24ピクセルのグリッド","Webアプリとモバイルアプリ向け","一貫したアイコン設計"],"ko":["3100개 이상의 아이콘","아웃라인과充填 스타일","24x24 픽셀 격자","웹 애플리케이션과 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한","일관된 아이콘 디자인"],"es":["Más de 3100 iconos disponibles","Estilos outline y relleno","Diseño en cuadrícula de 24x24 píxeles","Ideal para aplicaciones web y móviles","Implementación sencilla"],"fr":["Plus de 3100 icônes disponibles","Styles outline et rempli","Conception en grille de 24x24 pixels","Idéal pour les applications web et mobiles","Intégration simple"],"de":["Über 3100 Icons verfügbar","Outline- und Füllstile","Design in 24x24-Pixel-Raster","Ideal für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Einfache Implementierung"],"pt":["Mais de 3100 ícones disponíveis","Estilos contornados e preenchidos","Ícones projetados em uma grade de 24x24 pixels","Perfeita para uso em aplicações web e móveis","Facilmente personalizável"],"ru":["Более 3100 иконок на выбор","Контурные и заполненные стили","Иконки спроектированы на сетке 24x24 пикселя","Идеально подходит для использования в веб- и мобильных приложениях","Легко настраивается"],"ar":["أكثر من 3100 أيقونة متاحة","الأشكال المخططة والمملوءة","الأيقونات مصممة على شبكة 24x24 بكسل","مثالية للاستخدام في تطبيقات الويب والجوال","يمكن تخصيصها بسهولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RemixIcon","图标库","Web开发","移动应用开发","设计系统","图标设计","UI组件"],"ja":["RemixIcon","アイコンライブラリ","Web開発","モバイルアプリ開発","デザインシステム","アイコン設計","UIコンポーネント"],"ko":["RemixIcon","아이콘 라이브러리","웹 개발","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","디자인 시스템","아이콘 디자인","UI 컴포넌트"],"es":["biblioteca de iconos","iconos para aplicaciones web","iconos para aplicaciones móviles","diseño de iconos","implementación de iconos","remixicon"],"fr":["bibliothèque d''icônes","icônes pour applications web","icônes pour applications mobiles","conception d''icônes","intégration d''icônes","remixicon"],"de":["icon-bibliothek","icons für web-anwendungen","icons für mobile-anwendungen","icon-design","icon-implementierung","remixicon"],"pt":["remixicon","biblioteca de ícones","ícones para desenvolvedores","desenvolvimento web","desenvolvimento móvel","experiência do usuário","ui design"],"ru":["remixicon","библиотека иконок","иконки для разработчиков","веб-разработка","мобильная разработка","пользовательский опыт","дизайн ui"],"ar":["remixicon","مكتبة الأيقونات","أيقونات للمطورين","تطوير الويب","تطوير الجوال","تجربة المستخدم","تصميم واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"levanminhduc","repo":"LuongHoaThoNew","repoPath":"levanminhduc/LuongHoaThoNew","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.460Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remix-icon","description":"Guide for implementing RemixIcon - an open-source neutral-style icon library with 3,100+ icons in outlined and filled styles. Use when adding icons to applications, building UI components, or designing interfaces. Supports webfonts, SVG, React, Vue, and direct integration.","bodyPreview":"# RemixIcon Implementation Guide\n\nRemixIcon is a comprehensive icon library with **3,100+ meticulously designed icons** available in both outlined (`-line`) and filled (`-fill`) styles. All icons are built on a 24x24 pixel grid for perfect alignment and consistency.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse RemixIcon when:\n\n- Adding icons to web applications, mobile apps, or design systems\n- Building UI components that need consistent iconography\n- Implementing navigation, buttons, status indicators, or m","body":"# RemixIcon Implementation Guide\n\nRemixIcon is a comprehensive icon library with **3,100+ meticulously designed icons** available in both outlined (`-line`) and filled (`-fill`) styles. All icons are built on a 24x24 pixel grid for perfect alignment and consistency.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse RemixIcon when:\n\n- Adding icons to web applications, mobile apps, or design systems\n- Building UI components that need consistent iconography\n- Implementing navigation, buttons, status indicators, or media controls\n- Creating presentations, documents, or design mockups\n- Need bilingual icon search (English + Chinese)\n- Require both outlined and filled icon variants\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n**NPM (recommended for web projects):**\n\n```bash\nnpm install remixicon\n# or\nyarn add remixicon\n# or\npnpm install remixicon\n```\n\n**CDN (no installation):**\n\n```html\n<link\n  href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.7.0/fonts/remixicon.css\"\n  rel=\"stylesheet\"\n/>\n```\n\n**React:**\n\n```bash\nnpm install @remixicon/react\n```\n\n**Vue 3:**\n\n```bash\nnpm install @remixicon/vue\n```\n\n## Icon Naming Convention\n\n**Pattern:** `ri-{icon-name}-{style}`\n\nWhere:\n\n- `icon-name`: Descriptive name in kebab-case (e.g., `arrow-right`, `home`, `user-add`)\n- `style`: Either `line` (outlined) or `fill` (filled)\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```\nri-home-line           # Home icon, outlined\nri-home-fill           # Home icon, filled\nri-arrow-right-line    # Right arrow, outlined\nri-search-line         # Search icon, outlined\nri-heart-fill          # Heart icon, filled\n```\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### 1. Webfont (HTML/CSS)\n\n**Basic usage:**\n\n```html\n<i class=\"ri-admin-line\"></i> <i class=\"ri-home-fill\"></i>\n```\n\n**With sizing classes:**\n\n```html\n<i class=\"ri-home-line ri-2x\"></i>\n<!-- 2em size -->\n<i class=\"ri-search-line ri-lg\"></i>\n<!-- 1.3333em -->\n<i class=\"ri-heart-fill ri-xl\"></i>\n<!-- 1.5em -->\n```\n\n**Available size classes:**\n\n- `ri-xxs` (0.5em)\n- `ri-xs` (0.75em)\n- `ri-sm` (0.875em)\n- `ri-1x` (1em)\n- `ri-lg` (1.3333em)\n- `ri-xl` (1.5em)\n- `ri-2x` through `ri-10x` (2em - 10em)\n- `ri-fw` (fixed width for alignment)\n\n### 2. Direct SVG\n\n**Download and use:**\n\n```html\n<img height=\"32\" width=\"32\" src=\"path/to/admin-fill.svg\" />\n```\n\n**Inline SVG:**\n\n```html\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n  <path d=\"...icon path data...\" />\n</svg>\n```\n\n### 3. SVG Sprite\n\n```html\n<svg class=\"remix-icon\">\n  <use xlink:href=\"path/to/remixicon.symbol.svg#ri-admin-fill\"></use>\n</svg>\n```\n\n```css\n.remix-icon {\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 24px;\n  fill: #333;\n}\n```\n\n### 4. React Integration\n\n```jsx\nimport { RiHeartFill, RiHomeLine, RiSearchLine } from \"@remixicon/react\";\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <RiHeartFill\n        size={36} // Custom size\n        color=\"red\" // Fill color\n        className=\"my-icon\" // Custom class\n      />\n      <RiHomeLine size={24} />\n      <RiSearchLine size=\"1.5em\" color=\"#666\" />\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Vue 3 Integration\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { RiHeartFill, RiHomeLine } from \"@remixicon/vue\";\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <RiHeartFill size=\"36px\" color=\"red\" className=\"my-icon\" />\n  <RiHomeLine size=\"24px\" />\n</template>\n```\n\n## Icon Categories\n\nIcons are organized into **20 semantic categories**:\n\n| Category             | Examples                             | Use Cases                     |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| **Arrows**           | arrow-left, arrow-up, corner-up-left | Navigation, directions, flows |\n| **Buildings**        | home, bank, hospital, store          | Locations, facilities         |\n| **Business**         | briefcase, archive, pie-chart        | Commerce, analytics           |\n| **Communication**    | chat, phone, mail, message           | Messaging, contact            |\n| **Design**           | brush, palette, magic, crop          | Creative tools                |\n| **Development**      | code, terminal, bug, git-branch      | Developer tools               |\n| **Device**           | phone, laptop, tablet, printer       | Hardware, electronics         |\n| **Document**         | file, folder, article, draft         | Files, content                |\n| **Editor**           | bold, italic, link, list             | Text formatting               |\n| **Finance**          | money, wallet, bank-card, coin       | Payments, transactions        |\n| **Food**             | restaurant, cake, cup, knife         | Dining, beverages             |\n| **Health & Medical** | health, heart-pulse, capsule         | Healthcare, wellness          |\n| **Logos**            | github, twitter, facebook            | Brand icons                   |\n| **Map**              | map, pin, compass, navigation        | Location, directions          |\n| **Media**            | play, pause, volume, camera          | Multimedia controls           |\n| **System**           | settings, download, delete, add      | UI controls, actions          |\n| **User & Faces**     | user, account, team, contacts        | Profiles, people              |\n| **Weather**          | sun, cloud, rain, moon               | Climate, forecast             |\n| **Others**           | miscellaneous icons                  | General purpose               |\n\n## Finding Icons\n\n### 1. Browse by Category\n\nVisit https://remixicon.com and navigate categories to visually browse icons.\n\n### 2. Search with Keywords\n\nUse English or Chinese keywords. Icons have comprehensive tags for discoverability.\n\n**Example searches:**\n\n- \"home\" → home, home-2, home-3, home-gear, home-wifi\n- \"arrow\" → arrow-left, arrow-right, arrow-up, arrow-down\n- \"user\" → user, user-add, user-follow, account-circle\n\n### 3. Consider Icon Variants\n\nMany icons have numbered variants (home, home-2, home-3) offering stylistic alternatives.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Choosing Styles\n\n**Line (Outlined) Style:**\n\n- Use for: Clean, minimal interfaces\n- Best with: Light backgrounds, high contrast needs\n- Examples: Navigation menus, toolbars, forms\n\n**Fill (Filled) Style:**\n\n- Use for: Emphasis, active states, primary actions\n- Best with: Buttons, selected items, important indicators\n- Examples: Active nav items, primary CTAs, notifications\n\n### Accessibility\n\n**Always provide aria-labels for icon-only elements:**\n\n```html\n<button aria-label=\"Search\">\n  <i class=\"ri-search-line\"></i>\n</button>\n```\n\n**For decorative icons, use aria-hidden:**\n\n```html\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <i class=\"ri-star-fill\"></i>\n</span>\n```\n\n### Performance\n\n**For web applications:**\n\n- Use webfonts (WOFF2: 179KB) for multiple icons\n- Use individual SVGs for 1-5 icons only\n- Use SVG sprites for 5-20 icons\n- Prefer CDN for faster global delivery\n\n**Font formats by size (smallest to largest):**\n\n1. WOFF2: 179KB (recommended)\n2. WOFF: 245KB\n3. TTF: 579KB\n4. EOT: 579KB (legacy IE support)\n\n### Color and Sizing\n\n**Use currentColor for flexibility:**\n\n```css\n.icon {\n  color: #333; /* Icon inherits this color */\n}\n```\n\n**Maintain 24x24 grid alignment:**\n\n```css\n/* Good - maintains grid */\n.icon {\n  font-size: 24px;\n}\n.icon {\n  font-size: 48px;\n} /* 24 * 2 */\n\n/* Avoid - breaks grid alignment */\n.icon {\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n.icon {\n  font-size: 30px;\n}\n```\n\n### Framework Integration\n\n**Next.js:**\n\n```jsx\nimport \"@/styles/remixicon.css\"; // In _app.js or layout\nimport { RiHomeLine } from \"@remixicon/react\";\n```\n\n**Tailwind CSS:**\n\n```html\n<i class=\"ri-home-line text-2xl text-blue-500\"></i>\n```\n\n**CSS Modules:**\n\n```jsx\nimport styles from \"./component.module.css\";\nimport \"remixicon/fonts/remixicon.css\";\n\n<i className={`ri-home-line ${styles.icon}`}></i>;\n```\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### Custom Icon Sizing with CSS\n\n```css\n.custom-icon {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  line-height: 1;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n\n/* Responsive sizing */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .custom-icon {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Icon Animations\n\n```css\n.spinning-icon {\n  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes spin {\n  from {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  to {\n    transform: rotate(360deg);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Dynamic Icons in React\n\n```jsx\nfunction IconButton({ iconName, filled = false }) {\n    const iconClass = `ri-${iconName}-${filled ? ''fill'' : ''line''}`;\n    return <i className={iconClass} />;\n}\n\n// Usage\n<IconButton iconName=\"home\" />\n<IconButton iconName=\"heart\" filled />\n```\n\n## Design Tool Integration\n\n### Figma Plugin\n\nInstall the official RemixIcon plugin for Figma:\n\n- **Plugin:** RemixIcon\n- **URL:** https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1089569154784319246/remixicon\n- **Feature:** Direct icon access within Figma workspace\n\n### Copy to Design Tools\n\nIcons can be directly copied from https://remixicon.com to:\n\n- Sketch\n- Figma (without plugin)\n- Adobe XD\n- Adobe Illustrator\n\n### PowerPoint & Keynote\n\nUse RemixIcon-Slides for direct integration:\n\n- **Repository:** https://github.com/Remix-Design/RemixIcon-Slides\n- **Feature:** Edit icon styles directly in presentations\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Navigation Menu\n\n```html\n<nav>\n  <a href=\"/home\">\n    <i class=\"ri-home-line\"></i>\n    <span>Home</span>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/search\">\n    <i class=\"ri-search-line\"></i>\n    <span>Search</span>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/profile\">\n    <i class=\"ri-user-line\"></i>\n    <span>Profile</span>\n  </a>\n</nav>\n```\n\n### Button with Icon\n\n```html\n<button class=\"btn-primary\">\n  <i class=\"ri-download-line\"></i>\n  Download\n</button>\n```\n\n### Status Indicators\n\n```jsx\n// React example\nfunction StatusIcon({ status }) {\n  const icons = {\n    success: <RiCheckboxCircleFill color=\"green\" />,\n    error: <RiErrorWarningFill color=\"red\" />,\n    warning: <RiAlertFill color=\"orange\" />,\n    info: <RiInformationFill color=\"blue\" />,\n  };\n  return icons[status];\n}\n```\n\n### Input with Icon\n\n```html\n<div class=\"input-group\">\n  <i class=\"ri-search-line\"></i>\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search...\" />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Icons not displaying\n\n**Check:**\n\n1. CSS file is loaded: `<link href=\"remixicon.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />`\n2. Class name syntax: `ri-{name}-{style}` (e.g., `ri-home-line`)\n3. Font files are accessible (check browser Network tab)\n4. No font-family override conflicting with `.ri-*` classes\n\n### Wrong icon size\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n- Use size classes: `ri-lg`, `ri-2x`, etc.\n- Set parent `font-size` property\n- Ensure `line-height: 1` for proper alignment\n- Use `vertical-align: middle` if needed\n\n### Icons look blurry\n\n**Causes:**\n\n- Non-integer font sizes breaking pixel grid\n- Browser zoom levels\n- Transform properties causing subpixel rendering\n\n**Fix:** Use multiples of 24px (24, 48, 72, 96) for crisp rendering\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Website:** https://remixicon.com\n- **GitHub:** https://github.com/Remix-Design/RemixIcon\n- **NPM:** https://www.npmjs.com/package/remixicon\n- **React Package:** @remixicon/react\n- **Vue Package:** @remixicon/vue\n- **License:** Apache 2.0 (free for personal and commercial use)\n- **Total Icons:** 3,100+\n- **Current Version:** 4.7.0\n\n## Support\n\n- **Issues:** https://github.com/Remix-Design/RemixIcon/issues\n- **Email:** jimmy@remixdesign.cn\n- **Twitter/X:** @RemixDesignHQ\n\n## Version History\n\n- **v4.7.0** (Latest): 3,100+ icons with React and Vue packages\n- Full changelog available on GitHub releases\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:48:36.188Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI-focused Agents requiring consistent iconography in web and mobile applications","zh":"适用于需要在Web和移动应用中保持一致的图标的UI专注代理","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントがWebおよびモバイルアプリケーションで一貫したアイコンを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션에서 일관된 아이콘을 필요로 하는 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes centrados en UI que requieren iconografía coherente en aplicaciones web y móviles","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''UI nécessitant une iconographie cohérente dans les applications Web et mobiles","de":"Ideal für UI-fokussierte Agenten, die konsistente Iconografie in Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em UI que requerem iconografia consistente em aplicações web e móveis","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, требующих последовательной иконографии в веб- и мобильных приложениях","ar":"مثالي لويجوه المستخدم التي تركز على واجهة المستخدم التي تتطلب الرسوم المتسقة في التطبيقات الويب والجوال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate 3,100+ meticulously designed icons in both outlined and filled styles, utilizing a 24x24 pixel grid for perfect alignment and consistency, and supporting various use cases such as navigation, buttons, and status indicators","zh":"赋予代理集成3100多个精心设计的图标的能力，既有线框样式，也有填充样式，利用24x24像素网格实现完美的对齐和一致性，并支持诸如导航、按钮和状态指示器等各种用例","ja":"エージェントがアウトラインと塗りつぶしの両方のスタイルで3,100以上のこみ入ったアイコンを統合する能力を提供し、24x24ピクセルのグリッドを使用して完璧な整列と一貫性を実現し、ナビゲーション、ボタン、ステータスインジケータなどのさまざまなユースケースをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 아웃라인과 채움 스타일의 3,100개 이상의 세심하게 설계된 아이콘을 통합할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 24x24 픽셀 격자를 사용하여 완벽한 정렬과 일관성을 실현하고, 네비게이션, 버튼, 상태 지시기 등 다양한 사용 사례를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar más de 3,100 iconos meticulosamente diseñados en estilos delineados y rellenos, utilizando una cuadrícula de 24x24 píxeles para un alineamiento y consistencia perfectos, y que admiten varios casos de uso como navegación, botones e indicadores de estado","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer plus de 3 100 icônes soigneusement conçues dans des styles définis et remplis, en utilisant une grille de 24x24 pixels pour un alignement et une cohérence parfaits, et qui prennent en charge divers cas d''utilisation tels que la navigation, les boutons et les indicateurs d''état","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehr als 3.100 sorgfältig gestaltete Symbole in Kontur- und Füllstilen zu integrieren, indem sie ein 24x24-Pixel-Raster für perfektes Ausrichten und Konsistenz verwenden und verschiedene Anwendungsfälle wie Navigation, Schaltflächen und Statusindikatoren unterstützen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrarem 3.100+ ícones projetados com cuidado, nos estilos contornados e preenchidos, utilizando uma grade de 24x24 pixels para alinhamento e consistência perfeitos e suportando vários casos de uso, como navegação, botões e indicadores de status","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать 3 100+ тщательно спроектированных иконок как в контурном, так и в заливном стиле, используя сетку 24х24 пикселей для идеального выравнивания и согласованности, а также поддерживая различные случаи использования, такие как навигация, кнопки и индикаторы статуса","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من دمج 3،100+ رمز مخطط بعناية في كل من الأسلوبين المحدد والمملوء، باستخدام شبكة 24x24 بكسل للتراصف والاتساق المثاليين، ودعم حالات استخدام مختلفة مثل التنقل وأزرار ومؤشرات الحالة"},"useCases":{"en":["Adding icons to web applications for enhanced user experience","Building UI components with consistent iconography","Implementing navigation and status indicators in mobile apps"],"zh":["在Web应用中添加图标以增强用户体验","使用一致的图标创建UI组件","在移动应用中实现导航和状态指示器"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションにアイコンを追加してユーザーエクスペリエンスを強化する","一貫したアイコンを使用してUIコンポーネントを構築する","モバイルアプリでナビゲーションとステータスインジケータを実装する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션에서 아이콘을 추가하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키기","일관된 아이콘을 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하기","모바일 앱에서 네비게이션 및 상태 지시기를 구현하기"],"es":["Agregar iconos a aplicaciones web para una experiencia del usuario mejorada","Crear componentes de UI con iconografía coherente","Implementar indicadores de navegación y estado en aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Ajouter des icônes aux applications Web pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Construire des composants d''UI avec une iconographie cohérente","Mettre en œuvre des indicateurs de navigation et d''état dans les applications mobiles"],"de":["Hinzufügen von Symbolen zu Webanwendungen für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Erstellen von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit konsistenter Iconografie","Implementierung von Navigations- und Statusindikatoren in mobilen Apps"],"pt":["Adicionar ícones a aplicações web para uma experiência de usuário aprimorada","Construir componentes de UI com iconografia consistente","Implementar indicadores de navegação e status em aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Добавление иконок в веб-приложения для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Создание компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с согласованной иконографией","Реализация указателей навигации и состояния в мобильных приложениях"],"ar":["إضافة الرموز إلى التطبيقات الويب لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم مع الرسوم المتسقة","تنفيذ مؤشرات التنقل والحالة في التطبيقات الجوال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to 3,100+ predefined icons","Requires integration with existing design systems or web applications"],"zh":["仅限3100多个预定义图标","需要与现有的设计系统或Web应用程序集成"],"ja":["3,100以上の事前に定義されたアイコンに限定される","既存のデザインシステムまたはWebアプリケーションとの統合が必要"],"ko":["3,100개 이상의 사전 정의된 아이콘으로 제한됨","기존 디자인 시스템 또는 웹 애플리케이션과 통합이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a más de 3,100 iconos predefinidos","Requiere integración con sistemas de diseño existentes o aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Limité à plus de 3 100 icônes prédéfinies","Nécessite une intégration avec les systèmes de conception existants ou les applications Web"],"de":["Begrenzt auf mehr als 3.100 vordefinierte Symbole","Erfordert Integration mit bestehenden Designs oder Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Limitado a 3.100+ ícones predefinidos","Exige integração com sistemas de design existentes ou aplicações web"],"ru":["Ограничен 3 100+ предопределенными иконками","Требует интеграции с существующими системами дизайна или веб-приложениями"],"ar":["محدود بـ 3،100+ رموز محددة مسبقا","يتطلب التكامل مع أنظمة التصميم الحالية أو التطبيقات الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('colmarius/dot-agents/tmux', 'community', 'colmarius', 'dot-agents', 'colmarius/dot-agents', 'tmux', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:49:19.068Z', NULL, '{"id":"colmarius/dot-agents/tmux","name":"tmux","description":{"zh":"tmux 是一个 AI 准备好的工作空间，用于管理后台进程。使用 tmux 可以提高开发效率","ja":"tmux は AI 用のワークスペースで、バックグラウンド プロセスを管理します。tmux を使用することで開発の効率を向上させることができます","ko":"tmux는 AI 작업 공간으로 백그라운드 프로세스를 관리합니다. tmux를 사용하면 개발 효율을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"tmux es un entorno de trabajo para proyectos que permite gestionar procesos en segundo plano de manera eficiente","fr":"tmux est un espace de travail pour les projets qui permet de gérer les processus en arrière-plan de manière efficace","de":"tmux ist eine Arbeitsumgebung für Projekte, die die effiziente Verwaltung von Hintergrundprozessen ermöglicht","pt":"O tmux é uma ferramenta para gerenciar processos em segundo plano. Ele permite criar janelas e executar comandos em background sem bloquear o terminal.","ru":"tmux — это инструмент для управления фоновыми процессами. Он позволяет создавать окна и выполнять команды в фоновом режиме без блокировки терминала.","ar":"tmux هو أداة لإدارة العمليات في الخلفية. يسمح بإنشاء نوافذ وتنفيذ أوامر في الخلفية دون حظر المحطة.","en":"AI-ready workspace for any project"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"tmux AI 工作空间","ja":"tmux AI ワークスペース","ko":"tmux AI 작업 공간","es":"tmux: Entorno de trabajo para proyectos","fr":"tmux: Espace de travail pour les projets","de":"tmux: Arbeitsumgebung für Projekte","pt":"tmux: Gerenciamento de Processos em Segundo Plano","ru":"tmux: Управление фоновыми процессами","ar":"tmux: إدارة العمليات في الخلفية","en":"tmux"},"description":{"zh":"tmux 是一个 AI 准备好的工作空间，用于管理后台进程。使用 tmux 可以提高开发效率","ja":"tmux は AI 用のワークスペースで、バックグラウンド プロセスを管理します。tmux を使用することで開発の効率を向上させることができます","ko":"tmux는 AI 작업 공간으로 백그라운드 프로세스를 관리합니다. tmux를 사용하면 개발 효율을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"tmux es un entorno de trabajo para proyectos que permite gestionar procesos en segundo plano de manera eficiente","fr":"tmux est un espace de travail pour les projets qui permet de gérer les processus en arrière-plan de manière efficace","de":"tmux ist eine Arbeitsumgebung für Projekte, die die effiziente Verwaltung von Hintergrundprozessen ermöglicht","pt":"O tmux é uma ferramenta para gerenciar processos em segundo plano. Ele permite criar janelas e executar comandos em background sem bloquear o terminal.","ru":"tmux — это инструмент для управления фоновыми процессами. Он позволяет создавать окна и выполнять команды в фоновом режиме без блокировки терминала.","ar":"tmux هو أداة لإدارة العمليات في الخلفية. يسمح بإنشاء نوافذ وتنفيذ أوامر في الخلفية دون حظر المحطة.","en":"AI-ready workspace for any project"},"definition":{"en":"AI-ready workspace for any project"},"features":{"zh":["后台管理进程","支持多窗口","可自定义窗口名称","支持发送键盘命令","可分离窗口"],"ja":["バックグラウンドでプロセスを管理","複数のウィンドウをサポート","ウィンドウ名をカスタマイズ","キーボード コマンドを送信","ウィンドウを分離"],"ko":["백그라운드에서 프로세스를 관리","여러 창을 지원","창 이름을 사용자 지정","키보드 명령을 전송","창을 분리"],"es":["Gestión de procesos en segundo plano","Creación de ventanas y paneles personalizados","Ejecución de comandos en segundo plano","Gestión de sesiones de tmux","Integración con otros herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Gestion des processus en arrière-plan","Création de fenêtres et de panneaux personnalisés","Exécution de commandes en arrière-plan","Gestion des sessions tmux","Intégration avec d''autres outils de développement"],"de":["Verwaltung von Hintergrundprozessen","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Fenstern und Panels","Ausführung von Befehlen im Hintergrund","Verwaltung von tmux-Sitzungen","Integration mit anderen Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de processos em segundo plano","Criação de janelas e execução de comandos em background","Desacoplamento de sessões de terminal","Suporte a múltiplas sessões em uma única janela","Personalização de layouts e configurações"],"ru":["Управление фоновыми процессами","Создание окон и выполнение команд в фоновом режиме","Отсоединение сессий терминала","Поддержка нескольких сессий в одном окне","Настройка макетов и конфигураций"],"ar":["إدارة العمليات في الخلفية","إنشاء نوافذ وتنفيذ أوامر في الخلفية","فك ارتباط جلسات المحطة","دعم عدة جلسات في نافذة واحدة","تخصيص تخطيطات وضبط الإعدادات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["tmux","AI 工作空间","后台管理","终端复用器","开发效率","进程管理"],"ja":["tmux","AI ワークスペース","バックグラウンド管理","ターミナル マルチプレクサ","開発効率","プロセス管理"],"ko":["tmux","AI 작업 공간","백그라운드 관리","터미널 멀티플렉서","개발 효율","프로세스 관리"],"es":["tmux","entorno de trabajo","procesos en segundo plano","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["tmux","espace de travail","processus en arrière-plan","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","gestion de projets"],"de":["tmux","Arbeitsumgebung","Hintergrundprozesse","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Projektverwaltung"],"pt":["tmux","gerenciamento de processos","terminal","segundo plano","janelas","comandos","desenvolvimento","produtividade"],"ru":["tmux","управление процессами","терминал","фоновой режим","окна","команды","разработка","производительность"],"ar":["tmux","إدارة العمليات","المحطة","الخلفية","النوافذ","الأوامر","التطوير","الإنتاجية"]}},"owner":"colmarius","repo":"dot-agents","repoPath":"colmarius/dot-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tmux","description":"Instructions for using tmux to spawn multiple processes, inspect them, and capture their output. Use when running servers, long-running tasks, or background processes.","bodyPreview":"# tmux\n\nManage background processes using tmux windows without blocking the terminal.\n\n## 1. Verify Environment & Check Status\n\nConfirm tmux is running and list existing windows:\n\n```bash\ntmux list-windows\n```\n\n## 2. Spawn a Background Process\n\nCreate a new tmux window and run a command:\n\n```bash\ntmux new-window -n \"my-server\" -d\ntmux send-keys -t \"my-server\" \"npm run dev\" C-m\n```\n\n- `-n \"my-server\"` names the window for easy reference\n- `-d` keeps it detached (runs in background)\n- `C-m` sends","body":"# tmux\n\nManage background processes using tmux windows without blocking the terminal.\n\n## 1. Verify Environment & Check Status\n\nConfirm tmux is running and list existing windows:\n\n```bash\ntmux list-windows\n```\n\n## 2. Spawn a Background Process\n\nCreate a new tmux window and run a command:\n\n```bash\ntmux new-window -n \"my-server\" -d\ntmux send-keys -t \"my-server\" \"npm run dev\" C-m\n```\n\n- `-n \"my-server\"` names the window for easy reference\n- `-d` keeps it detached (runs in background)\n- `C-m` sends Enter to execute the command\n\n## 3. Inspect Output (Read Logs)\n\n### Visible screen only\n\n```bash\ntmux capture-pane -p -t \"my-server\"\n```\n\n### Full scrollback history\n\n```bash\ntmux capture-pane -p -t \"my-server\" -S -1000\n```\n\n- `-S -1000` captures the last 1000 lines of scrollback\n\n## 4. Interact with the Process\n\n### Send Ctrl+C (interrupt)\n\n```bash\ntmux send-keys -t \"my-server\" C-c\n```\n\n### Kill the window\n\n```bash\ntmux kill-window -t \"my-server\"\n```\n\n## 5. Advanced: Chaining Commands\n\nRun multiple commands in sequence:\n\n```bash\ntmux new-window -n \"build\" -d && \\\ntmux send-keys -t \"build\" \"npm run build && npm run test\" C-m\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Action | Command |\n| ------ | ------- |\n| Create window | `tmux new-window -n \"ID\" -d` |\n| Run command | `tmux send-keys -t \"ID\" \"CMD\" C-m` |\n| Read output | `tmux capture-pane -p -t \"ID\"` |\n| Send interrupt | `tmux send-keys -t \"ID\" C-c` |\n| Kill window | `tmux kill-window -t \"ID\"` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:49:19.068Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Terminal-based Agents needing advanced process management and background task execution.","zh":"非常适合需要高级进程管理和后台任务执行的基于终端的代理。","ja":"ターミナルベースのエージェントが高度なプロセス管理とバックグラウンドタスクの実行を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 프로세스 관리 및 백그라운드 작업 실행이 필요한 터미널 기반 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en terminal que necesitan una gestión de procesos avanzada y ejecución de tareas en segundo plano.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur terminal nécessitant une gestion de processus avancée et une exécution de tâches en arrière-plan.","de":"Perfekt für terminalbasierte Agenten, die eine erweiterte Prozessverwaltung und Hintergrundaufgabenausführung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em Terminal que necessitam de gerenciamento de processos avançado e execução de tarefas em segundo plano.","ru":"Идеально для Терминальных Агентов, требующих продвинутого управления процессами и выполнения фоновых задач.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يعتمدون على الطرفية و الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة متقدمة للمعالجات وتشغيل المهام في الخلفية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage background processes using tmux windows, send keys to windows, and detach sessions, all while utilizing commands like `tmux new-window` and `tmux send-keys` for seamless interaction.","zh":"使代理能够使用tmux窗口管理后台进程，向窗口发送键盘输入，并分离会话，同时利用诸如`tmux new-window`和`tmux send-keys`的命令实现无缝交互。","ja":"エージェントがtmuxウィンドウを使用してバックグラウンドプロセスを管理し、ウィンドウにキーを送信し、セッションを切り離すことができ、`tmux new-window`や`tmux send-keys`などのコマンドを使用してシームレスなインタラクションを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 tmux 창을 사용하여 백그라운드 프로세스를 관리하고 창에 키를 전송하며 세션을 분리할 수 있으며, `tmux new-window` 및 `tmux send-keys`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 무장애 상호 작용을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar procesos en segundo plano utilizando ventanas tmux, enviar teclas a ventanas y desvincular sesiones, todo mientras utiliza comandos como `tmux new-window` y `tmux send-keys` para una interacción sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les processus en arrière-plan en utilisant des fenêtres tmux, d''envoyer des touches à des fenêtres et de détacher des sessions, le tout en utilisant des commandes comme `tmux new-window` et `tmux send-keys` pour une interaction fluide.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, Hintergrundaufgaben mithilfe von tmux-Fenstern zu verwalten, Tasten an Fenster zu senden und Sitzungen zu trennen, während gleichzeitig Befehle wie `tmux new-window` und `tmux send-keys` für eine nahtlose Interaktion verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar processos em segundo plano usando janelas do tmux, enviar teclas para janelas e desanexar sessões, tudo isso utilizando comandos como `tmux new-window` e `tmux send-keys` para interação sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять фоновыми процессами с помощью окон tmux, отправлять клавиши в окна и отключать сеансы, все это при помощи команд như `tmux new-window` и `tmux send-keys` для бесперебойного взаимодействия.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة العمليات في الخلفية باستخدام نوافذ tmux و إرسال مفاتيح إلى النوافذ و فصل الجلسات، و كل ذلك باستخدام أوامر مثل `tmux new-window` و `tmux send-keys` من أجل التفاعل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating server startups with `npm run dev`","Debugging detached processes in tmux windows","Managing multiple background tasks with named windows"],"zh":["使用`npm run dev`自动化服务器启动","在tmux窗口中调试分离的进程","使用命名窗口管理多个后台任务"],"ja":["`npm run dev`を使用してサーバーの起動を自動化する","tmuxウィンドウ内で切り離されたプロセスをデバッグする","名前付きウィンドウを使用して複数のバックグラウンドタスクを管理する"],"ko":["`npm run dev`를 사용하여 서버 시작 자동화","tmux 창에서 분리된 프로세스 디버깅","이름있는 창을 사용하여 여러 백그라운드 작업 관리"],"es":["Automatizar el arranque de servidores con `npm run dev`","Depurar procesos desvinculados en ventanas tmux","Gestionar varias tareas en segundo plano con ventanas con nombre"],"fr":["Automatiser les démarrages de serveur avec `npm run dev`","Déboguer des processus détachés dans des fenêtres tmux","Gérer plusieurs tâches en arrière-plan avec des fenêtres nommées"],"de":["Automatisieren des Serverstarts mit `npm run dev`","Fehlerbehebung bei abgetrennten Prozessen in tmux-Fenstern","Verwalten mehrerer Hintergrundaufgaben mit benannten Fenstern"],"pt":["Automatizar inicializações de servidor com `npm run dev`","Depurar processos desanexados em janelas do tmux","Gerenciar várias tarefas em segundo plano com janelas nomeadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запуск серверов с помощью `npm run dev`","Отлаживать отключенные процессы в окнах tmux","Управлять несколькими фоновыми задачами с именованными окнами"],"ar":["تutomatizar تشغيل الخوادم باستخدام `npm run dev`","تصحيح الأعطال للعمليات المنفصلة في نوافذ tmux","إدارة مهام متعددة في الخلفية باستخدام نوافذ ذات أسماء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires tmux installation","Terminal access necessary","Limited to command-line interface"],"zh":["需要tmux安装","需要终端访问","仅限于命令行接口"],"ja":["tmuxのインストールが必要","ターミナルへのアクセスが必要","コマンドラインインターフェースのみ"],"ko":["tmux 설치 필요","터미널 액세스 필요","명령줄 인터페이스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación de tmux","Acceso a terminal necesario","Limitado a la interfaz de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de tmux","Accès terminal nécessaire","Limité à l''interface en ligne de commande"],"de":["Benötigt tmux-Installation","Terminalzugriff erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Kommandozeilenoberfläche"],"pt":["Exige instalação do tmux","Acesso ao Terminal necessário","Limitado à interface de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требует установки tmux","Необходим доступ к Терминалу","Ограничен интерфейсом командной строки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت tmux","필요 وصول إلى الطرفية","محدود إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
