是优化React Native应用性能的指南，涵盖JavaScript、React、Native（iOS/Android）和打包优化","ja":"React Nativeベストプラクティスは、React Nativeアプリのパフォーマンスを最適化するためのガイドです。JavaScript、React、Native（iOS/Android）、バンドル最適化を含みます","ko":"리액트 네이티브 최적화 가이드는 리액트 네이티브 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 방법에 대한 설명입니다. 자바스크립트, 리액트, 네이티브(ios/안드로이드) 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones de React Native, cubriendo JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) y optimizaciones de bundling","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React Native, couvrant JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) et les optimisations de bundling","de":"Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung für React-Native-Anwendungen, der JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) und Bundling-Optimierungen abdeckt","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para aplicações React Native, abordando JavaScript, React e otimizações nativas.","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для приложений React Native, охватывающее JavaScript, React и родные оптимизации.","ar":"دليل تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات ري액ت نيتيف، يشمل جافاسكريبت وري액ت وتحسينات الأصلية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["JavaScript和React优化","Native（iOS/Android）优化","打包优化","快速查找和深入理解的混合格式","错误/正确代码片段和Shell命令"],"ja":["JavaScriptとReactの最適化","Native（iOS/Android）の最適化","バンドルの最適化","高速な検索と深い理解のためのハイブリッド形式","誤った/正しいコードスニペットとシェルコマンド"],"ko":["자바스크립트와 리액트 최적화","네이티브(ios/안드로이드) 최적화","번들 최적화","빠른 조회 및 깊은 이해를 위한 하이브리드 형식","잘못된/올바른 코드 조각 및 쉘 명령"],"es":["Optimización de JavaScript y React","Optimización de Native (iOS/Android)","Optimización de bundling","Guía de patrones rápidos para la identificación de problemas","Comandos de shell para procesos y mediciones","Mejores prácticas para desarrolladores de React Native"],"fr":["Optimisation de JavaScript et React","Optimisation de Native (iOS/Android)","Optimisation de bundling","Guide de modèles rapides pour l''identification des problèmes","Commandes de shell pour les processus et les mesures","Meilleures pratiques pour les développeurs de React Native"],"de":["Optimierung von JavaScript und React","Optimierung von Native (iOS/Android)","Optimierung von Bundling","Leitfaden für schnelle Muster zur Problemerkennung","Shell-Befehle für Prozesse und Messungen","Best Practices für React-Native-Entwickler"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para JavaScript e React","Otimizações nativas para iOS e Android","Melhorias de bundling para aplicações React Native","Padrões de código para desenvolvimento eficiente","Comandos de shell para medição e processo"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для JavaScript и React","Родные оптимизации для iOS и Android","Улучшения пакетирования для приложений React Native","Шаблоны кода для эффективной разработки","Команды оболочки для измерения и процесса"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لجافاسكريبت وري액ت","تحسينات الأصلية لآي أو إس وأندرويد","تحسينات التعبئة لتطبيقات ري액ت نيتيف","أنماط الكود للتنمية الفعالة","أوامر الشل لقياس والعملية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native优化","JavaScript优化","React优化","Native优化","打包优化","React Native最佳实践"],"ja":["React Native最適化","JavaScript最適化","React最適化","Native最適化","バンドル最適化","React Nativeベストプラクティス"],"ko":["리액트 네이티브 최적화","자바스크립트 최적화","리액트 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들 최적화","리액트 네이티브 최적화 가이드"],"es":["React Native","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","bundling"],"fr":["React Native","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","bundling"],"de":["React Native","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","JavaScript","React","Native","iOS","Android","Bundling"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","JavaScript","React","Otimizações nativas","Bundling","Desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","JavaScript","React","Родные оптимизации","Пакетирование","Разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["ري액ت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","جافاسكريبت","ري액ت","تحسينات الأصلية","التعبئة","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة"]}},"owner":"ZA512","repo":"Stratum","repoPath":"ZA512/Stratum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Preload commonly-used expensive screens before navigating to them\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in [references/][references]:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md][js-lists-flatlist-flashlist] | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| [js-measure-fps.md][js-measure-fps] | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| [js-memory-leaks.md][js-memory-leaks] | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| [js-atomic-state.md][js-atomic-state] | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| [js-concurrent-react.md][js-concurrent-react] | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| [js-react-compiler.md][js-react-compiler] | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| [js-animations-reanimated.md][js-animations-reanimated] | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| [js-uncontrolled-components.md][js-uncontrolled-components] | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [native-turbo-modules.md][native-turbo-modules] | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| [native-sdks-over-polyfills.md][native-sdks-over-polyfills] | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| [native-measure-tti.md][native-measure-tti] | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| [native-threading-model.md][native-threading-model] | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| [native-profiling.md][native-profiling] | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| [native-platform-setup.md][native-platform-setup] | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| [native-view-flattening.md][native-view-flattening] | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| [native-memory-patterns.md][native-memory-patterns] | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| [native-memory-leaks.md][native-memory-leaks] | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| [native-android-16kb-alignment.md][native-android-16kb-alignment] | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [bundle-barrel-exports.md][bundle-barrel-exports] | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| [bundle-analyze-js.md][bundle-analyze-js] | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| [bundle-tree-shaking.md][bundle-tree-shaking] | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| [bundle-analyze-app.md][bundle-analyze-app] | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| [bundle-r8-android.md][bundle-r8-android] | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| [bundle-hermes-mmap.md][bundle-hermes-mmap] | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| [bundle-native-assets.md][bundle-native-assets] | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| [bundle-library-size.md][bundle-library-size] | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| [bundle-code-splitting.md][bundle-code-splitting] | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | [js-measure-fps.md][js-measure-fps] → [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] |\n| Too many re-renders | [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] → [js-react-compiler.md][js-react-compiler] |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | [native-measure-tti.md][native-measure-tti] → [bundle-analyze-js.md][bundle-analyze-js] |\n| Large app size | [bundle-analyze-app.md][bundle-analyze-app] → [bundle-r8-android.md][bundle-r8-android] |\n| Memory growing | [js-memory-leaks.md][js-memory-leaks] or [native-memory-leaks.md][native-memory-leaks] |\n| Animation drops frames | [js-animations-reanimated.md][js-animations-reanimated] |\n| List scroll jank | [js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md][js-lists-flatlist-flashlist] |\n| TextInput lag | [js-uncontrolled-components.md][js-uncontrolled-components] |\n| Native module slow | [native-turbo-modules.md][native-turbo-modules] → [native-threading-model.md][native-threading-model] |\n| Native library alignment issue | [native-android-16kb-alignment.md][native-android-16kb-alignment] |\n\n[references]: references/\n[js-lists-flatlist-flashlist]: references/js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md\n[js-profile-react]: references/js-profile-react.md\n[js-measure-fps]: references/js-measure-fps.md\n[js-memory-leaks]: references/js-memory-leaks.md\n[js-atomic-state]: references/js-atomic-state.md\n[js-concurrent-react]: references/js-concurrent-react.md\n[js-react-compiler]: references/js-react-compiler.md\n[js-animations-reanimated]: references/js-animations-reanimated.md\n[js-uncontrolled-components]: references/js-uncontrolled-components.md\n[native-turbo-modules]: references/native-turbo-modules.md\n[native-sdks-over-polyfills]: references/native-sdks-over-polyfills.md\n[native-measure-tti]: references/native-measure-tti.md\n[native-threading-model]: references/native-threading-model.md\n[native-profiling]: references/native-profiling.md\n[native-platform-setup]: references/native-platform-setup.md\n[native-view-flattening]: references/native-view-flattening.md\n[native-memory-patterns]: references/native-memory-patterns.md\n[native-memory-leaks]: references/native-memory-leaks.md\n[native-android-16kb-alignment]: references/native-android-16kb-alignment.md\n[bundle-barrel-exports]: references/bundle-barrel-exports.md\n[bundle-analyze-js]: references/bundle-analyze-js.md\n[bundle-tree-shaking]: references/bundle-tree-shaking.md\n[bundle-analyze-app]: references/bundle-analyze-app.md\n[bundle-r8-android]: references/bundle-r8-android.md\n[bundle-hermes-mmap]: references/bundle-hermes-mmap.md\n[bundle-native-assets]: references/bundle-native-assets.md\n[bundle-library-size]: references/bundle-library-size.md\n[bundle-code-splitting]: references/bundle-code-splitting.md\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:49:43.842Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents needing expert React Native performance optimization strategies.","zh":"适合需要专家级React Native性能优化策略的移动开发代理。","ja":"React Nativeのパフォーマンス最適化戦略を必要とするモバイル開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"React Native 성능 최적화 전략을 전문적으로 필요로 하는 모바일 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo Móvil que necesitan estrategias de optimización de rendimiento de React Native expertas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement mobile ayant besoin de stratégies d''optimisation de performance React Native d''experts.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Development Agents, die Expertenstrategien zur Leistungsoptimierung von React Native benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que precisam de estratégias de otimização de desempenho do React Native especializadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильной разработки, которым необходимы экспертные стратегии оптимизации производительности React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الهاتف المحمول الذي يحتاج إلى استراتيجيات محسنة للأداء من قبل React Native"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript and Native module best practices, covering bundling optimizations and performance measurements via shell commands.","zh":"赋予代理优化使用JavaScript和原生模块最佳实践的React Native应用的能力，包括通过shell命令的打包优化和性能测量。","ja":"JavaScriptとネイティブモジュールのベストプラクティスを使用してReact Nativeアプリケーションを最適化するエージェントをEmpowerすることができます。シェルコマンド経由のバンドル最適化とパフォーマンス測定も含まれています。","ko":"JavaScript와 네이티브 모듈의 최적实践을 사용하여 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화하고, 쉘 명령어를 통해 번들 최적화와 성능 측정을 하는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React Native utilizando las mejores prácticas de JavaScript y módulos nativos, cubriendo optimizaciones de empaquetado y mediciones de rendimiento a través de comandos de shell.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant les meilleures pratiques de JavaScript et de modules natifs, couvrant les optimisations de regroupement et les mesures de performances via des commandes shell.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React-Native-Anwendungen mithilfe von JavaScript- und Native-Modul-Best-Practices zu optimieren, einschließlich Optimierungen der Bundling und Leistungsmessungen über Shell-Befehle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicações React Native usando as melhores práticas de JavaScript e módulos nativos, cobrindo otimizações de empacotamento e medições de desempenho via comandos de shell.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native, используя лучшие практики JavaScript и родных модулей, охватывая оптимизации пакетирования и измерения производительности через команды оболочки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تحسين تطبيقات React Native باستخدام أفضل الممارسات لجافا سكريبت والوحدات الأصلية، وتغطية تحسينات التعبئة وقياسات الأداء عبر أوامر Shell."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native app performance","Debugging JavaScript and Native module issues","Implementing efficient bundling strategies"],"zh":["优化React Native应用性能","调试JavaScript和原生模块问题","实现高效的打包策略"],"ja":["React Nativeアプリのパフォーマンスを最適化する","JavaScriptとネイティブモジュールの問題をデバッグする","効率的なバンドル戦略を実装する"],"ko":["React Native 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","JavaScript와 네이티브 모듈 문제 디버깅","효율적인 번들 전략 구현"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación de React Native","Depurar problemas de JavaScript y módulos nativos","Implementar estrategias de empaquetado eficientes"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de l''application React Native","Déboguer les problèmes de JavaScript et de modules natifs","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de regroupement efficaces"],"de":["Optimieren der Leistung von React-Native-Apps","Debuggen von JavaScript- und Native-Modul-Problemen","Implementieren effizienter Bundling-Strategien"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do aplicativo React Native","Depurar problemas de JavaScript e módulos nativos","Implementar estratégias de empacotamento eficientes"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложения React Native","Отладить проблемы JavaScript и родных модулей","Реализовать эффективные стратегии пакетирования"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيق React Native","تصحيح أخطاء جافا سكريبت والوحدات الأصلية","تنفيذ استراتيجيات تعبئة فعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Native development","Focused on React Native optimization only"],"zh":["需要对React和原生开发有了解","仅专注于React Native优化"],"ja":["Reactとネイティブ開発の知識が必要","React Native最適化のみに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["React와 네이티브 개발에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","React Native 최적화에만 중점을 두고 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y desarrollo nativo","Se centra solo en la optimización de React Native"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et développement natif","Se concentre uniquement sur l''optimisation de React Native"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Native-Entwicklung","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf die Optimierung von React Native"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React e desenvolvimento nativo","Focado apenas na otimização do React Native"],"ru":["Требует знаний React и родной разработки","Сосредоточен только на оптимизации React Native"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة رياكت والتنمية الأصلية","يركز فقط على تحسين أداء React Native"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
