","ar":"مراجعة.setRequest: أداة مراجعة الكود","en":"review-pr"},"description":{"zh":"Review PR是一种代码审查工具，能够对PR进行彻底的评估，并返回结构化的推荐结果","ja":"Review PRはコードレビューツールであり、プルリクエストに対して徹底的な評価を行い、構造化された推奨結果を返す","ko":"Review PR은 코드 리뷰 도구로 PR을 철저하게 평가하여 구조화된 추천 결과를 반환합니다","es":"La revisión de PR es un proceso que evalúa la preparación de un pull request para su revisión y merge. Este proceso garantiza la calidad y la seguridad del c...","fr":"L''examen PR est un processus qui évalue la préparation d''une demande de tirage pour sa révision et sa fusion. Ce processus garantit la qualité et la sécurité...","de":"Die PR-Überprüfung ist ein Prozess, der die Vorbereitung eines Pull-Requests für seine Überprüfung und Zusammenführung bewertet. Dieser Prozess gewährleistet...","pt":"A ferramenta de análise de PR é uma solução para revisão de código que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade do código. Ela fornece uma avaliação estruturada da pront...","ru":"Инструмент проверки PR - это решение для обзора кода, которое помогает улучшить качество кода. Он предоставляет структурированную оценку готовности кода к об...","ar":"أداة مراجعة.setRequest هي حل لمراجعة الكود تساعد على تحسين جودة الكود. توفر تقييمًا هيكليًا لجاهزية الكود لمراجعة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["对PR进行彻底的评估","返回结构化的推荐结果","确保评估的安全性","防止自动推送到主分支","支持手动输入PR号或URL"],"ja":["プルリクエストに対して徹底的な評価を行う","構造化された推奨結果を返す","評価の安全性を確保する","自動的にメインブランチにプッシュしない","手動でプルリクエスト番号またはURLを入力することをサポートする"],"ko":["PR에 대한 철저한 평가","구조화된 추천 결과 반환","평가의 안전성 보장","자동으로 메인 브랜치에 푸시하지 않음","수동으로 PR 번호 또는 URL 입력 지원"],"es":["Evaluación exhaustiva de PR","Recomendaciones estructuradas para la preparación de PR","Garantía de calidad y seguridad del código","Proceso de revisión de solo lectura","No se permite la ejecución de comandos de git push"],"fr":["Évaluation approfondie de PR","Recommandations structurées pour la préparation de PR","Garantie de la qualité et de la sécurité du code","Processus d''examen en lecture seule","Il n''est pas autorisé d''exécuter des commandes git push"],"de":["Gründliche PR-Überprüfung","Strukturierte Empfehlungen für die Vorbereitung von PR","Gewährleistung der Qualität und Sicherheit des Codes","Überprüfungsprozess nur zum Lesen","Ausführen von git push-Befehlen nicht erlaubt"],"pt":["Avaliação estruturada da prontidão do código","Revisão de código detalhada","Não executa comandos de push ou stop","Trata a revisão como somente leitura","Solicita número ou URL do PR"],"ru":["Структурированная оценка готовности кода","Детальный обзор кода","Не выполняет команды push или stop","Обрабатывает обзор как только для чтения","Запрашивает номер или URL PR"],"ar":["تقييم هيكلي لجاهزية الكود","مراجعة الكود المفصلة","لا ينفذ أوامر الاشتراك أو الإيقاف","يعامل المراجعة على أنها قراءة فقط","يطلب رقم أو عنوان URL ل.setRequest"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","PR评估","代码质量","自动化代码审查","代码安全","PR号","代码审查工具"],"ja":["コードレビュー","プルリクエスト評価","コード品質","自動化コードレビュー","コードセキュリティ","プルリクエスト番号","コードレビューツール"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","PR 평가","코드 품질","자동화된 코드 리뷰","코드 보안","PR 번호","코드 리뷰 도구"],"es":["revisión de PR","evaluación de PR","preparación de PR","calidad del código","seguridad del código","proceso de revisión","git push","pull request"],"fr":["examen PR","évaluation de PR","préparation de PR","qualité du code","sécurité du code","processus d''examen","git push","demande de tirage"],"de":["PR-Überprüfung","Bewertung von PR","Vorbereitung von PR","Qualität des Codes","Sicherheit des Codes","Überprüfungsprozess","git push","Pull-Request"],"pt":["análise de PR","revisão de código","ferramenta de revisão","qualidade do código","desenvolvimento de software","revisão de código automatizada"],"ru":["проверка PR","обзор кода","инструмент обзора","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированный обзор кода"],"ar":["مراجعة.setRequest","مراجعة الكود","أداة مراجعة","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","مراجعة الكود الآلية"]}},"owner":"rdfinanzas","repo":"openClawEmpresarial","repoPath":"rdfinanzas/openClawEmpresarial","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-pr","description":"Review-only GitHub pull request analysis with the gh CLI. Use when asked to review a PR, provide structured feedback, or assess readiness to land. Do not merge, push, or make code changes you intend to keep.","bodyPreview":"# Review PR\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a thorough review-only PR assessment and return a structured recommendation on readiness for /prepare-pr.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, always ask. Never auto-detect from conversation.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never push to `main` or `origin/main`, not during review, not ever.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during review. Treat review as read only.\n- Do not stop or kill the gateway. Do not run gateway stop commands. Do not kill","body":"# Review PR\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a thorough review-only PR assessment and return a structured recommendation on readiness for /prepare-pr.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, always ask. Never auto-detect from conversation.\n- If ambiguous, ask.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never push to `main` or `origin/main`, not during review, not ever.\n- Do not run `git push` at all during review. Treat review as read only.\n- Do not stop or kill the gateway. Do not run gateway stop commands. Do not kill processes on port 18792.\n\n## Execution Rule\n\n- Execute the workflow. Do not stop after printing the TODO checklist.\n- If delegating, require the delegate to run commands and capture outputs, not a plan.\n\n## Known Failure Modes\n\n- If you see \"fatal: not a git repository\", you are in the wrong directory. Use `~/dev/openclaw` if available; otherwise ask user.\n- Do not stop after printing the checklist. That is not completion.\n\n## Writing Style for Output\n\n- Write casual and direct.\n- Avoid em dashes and en dashes. Use commas or separate sentences.\n\n## Completion Criteria\n\n- Run the commands in the worktree and inspect the PR directly.\n- Produce the structured review sections A through J.\n- Save the full review to `.local/review.md` inside the worktree.\n\n## First: Create a TODO Checklist\n\nCreate a checklist of all review steps, print it, then continue and execute the commands.\n\n## Setup: Use a Worktree\n\nUse an isolated worktree for all review work.\n\n```sh\ncd ~/dev/openclaw\n# Sanity: confirm you are in the repo\ngit rev-parse --show-toplevel\n\nWORKTREE_DIR=\".worktrees/pr-<PR>\"\ngit fetch origin main\n\n# Reuse existing worktree if it exists, otherwise create new\nif [ -d \"$WORKTREE_DIR\" ]; then\n  cd \"$WORKTREE_DIR\"\n  git checkout temp/pr-<PR> 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b temp/pr-<PR>\n  git fetch origin main\n  git reset --hard origin/main\nelse\n  git worktree add \"$WORKTREE_DIR\" -b temp/pr-<PR> origin/main\n  cd \"$WORKTREE_DIR\"\nfi\n\n# Create local scratch space that persists across /review-pr to /prepare-pr to /merge-pr\nmkdir -p .local\n```\n\nRun all commands inside the worktree directory.\nStart on `origin/main` so you can check for existing implementations before looking at PR code.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Identify PR meta and context\n\n```sh\ngh pr view <PR> --json number,title,state,isDraft,author,baseRefName,headRefName,headRepository,url,body,labels,assignees,reviewRequests,files,additions,deletions --jq ''{number,title,url,state,isDraft,author:.author.login,base:.baseRefName,head:.headRefName,headRepo:.headRepository.nameWithOwner,additions,deletions,files:.files|length,body}''\n```\n\n2. Check if this already exists in main before looking at the PR branch\n\n- Identify the core feature or fix from the PR title and description.\n- Search for existing implementations using keywords from the PR title, changed file paths, and function or component names from the diff.\n\n```sh\n# Use keywords from the PR title and changed files\nrg -n \"<keyword_from_pr_title>\" -S src packages apps ui || true\nrg -n \"<function_or_component_name>\" -S src packages apps ui || true\n\ngit log --oneline --all --grep=\"<keyword_from_pr_title>\" | head -20\n```\n\nIf it already exists, call it out as a BLOCKER or at least IMPORTANT.\n\n3. Claim the PR\n\nAssign yourself so others know someone is reviewing. Skip if the PR looks like spam or is a draft you plan to recommend closing.\n\n```sh\ngh_user=$(gh api user --jq .login)\ngh pr edit <PR> --add-assignee \"$gh_user\"\n```\n\n4. Read the PR description carefully\n\nUse the body from step 1. Summarize goal, scope, and missing context.\n\n5. Read the diff thoroughly\n\nMinimum:\n\n```sh\ngh pr diff <PR>\n```\n\nIf you need full code context locally, fetch the PR head to a local ref and diff it. Do not create a merge commit.\n\n```sh\ngit fetch origin pull/<PR>/head:pr-<PR>\n# Show changes without modifying the working tree\n\ngit diff --stat origin/main..pr-<PR>\ngit diff origin/main..pr-<PR>\n```\n\nIf you want to browse the PR version of files directly, temporarily check out `pr-<PR>` in the worktree. Do not commit or push. Return to `temp/pr-<PR>` and reset to `origin/main` afterward.\n\n```sh\n# Use only if needed\n# git checkout pr-<PR>\n# ...inspect files...\n\ngit checkout temp/pr-<PR>\ngit reset --hard origin/main\n```\n\n6. Validate the change is needed and valuable\n\nBe honest. Call out low value AI slop.\n\n7. Evaluate implementation quality\n\nReview correctness, design, performance, and ergonomics.\n\n8. Perform a security review\n\nAssume OpenClaw subagents run with full disk access, including git, gh, and shell. Check auth, input validation, secrets, dependencies, tool safety, and privacy.\n\n9. Review tests and verification\n\nIdentify what exists, what is missing, and what would be a minimal regression test.\n\n10. Check docs\n\nCheck if the PR touches code with related documentation such as README, docs, inline API docs, or config examples.\n\n- If docs exist for the changed area and the PR does not update them, flag as IMPORTANT.\n- If the PR adds a new feature or config option with no docs, flag as IMPORTANT.\n- If the change is purely internal with no user-facing impact, skip this.\n\n11. Check changelog\n\nCheck if `CHANGELOG.md` exists and whether the PR warrants an entry.\n\n- If the project has a changelog and the PR is user-facing, flag missing entry as IMPORTANT.\n- Leave the change for /prepare-pr, only flag it here.\n\n12. Answer the key question\n\nDecide if /prepare-pr can fix issues or the contributor must update the PR.\n\n13. Save findings to the worktree\n\nWrite the full structured review sections A through J to `.local/review.md`.\nCreate or overwrite the file and verify it exists and is non-empty.\n\n```sh\nls -la .local/review.md\nwc -l .local/review.md\n```\n\n14. Output the structured review\n\nProduce a review that matches what you saved to `.local/review.md`.\n\nA) TL;DR recommendation\n\n- One of: READY FOR /prepare-pr | NEEDS WORK | NEEDS DISCUSSION | NOT USEFUL (CLOSE)\n- 1 to 3 sentences.\n\nB) What changed\n\nC) What is good\n\nD) Security findings\n\nE) Concerns or questions (actionable)\n\n- Numbered list.\n- Mark each item as BLOCKER, IMPORTANT, or NIT.\n- For each, point to file or area and propose a concrete fix.\n\nF) Tests\n\nG) Docs status\n\n- State if related docs are up to date, missing, or not applicable.\n\nH) Changelog\n\n- State if `CHANGELOG.md` needs an entry and which category.\n\nI) Follow ups (optional)\n\nJ) Suggested PR comment (optional)\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Worktree only.\n- Do not delete the worktree after review.\n- Review only, do not merge, do not push.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:49:51.302Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring thorough PR assessment and git workflow management.","zh":"适合需要对代码审查代理进行彻底的PR评估和git工作流管理的场景。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が徹底的なPR評価とgitワークフローの管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 철저한 PR 평가 및 Git 워크플로 관리를 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren una evaluación exhaustiva de PR y administración de flujo de trabajo de git.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une évaluation approfondie de PR et une gestion de workflow git.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine gründliche PR-Bewertung und Git-Workflow-Verwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem uma avaliação de PR aprofundada e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho do git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, требующих тщательной оценки PR и управления рабочим процессом git.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة الكود الذين يتطلبون تقييمًا شاملاً ل-PR وإدارة تدفق العمل git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform read-only PR reviews using git, providing structured recommendations on readiness for merge, while ensuring safety protocols such as never pushing to main or running git push commands during review.","zh":"赋予代理使用git进行只读PR审查的能力，提供有关合并就绪性的结构化建议，同时确保安全协议，如永远不会推送到主分支或在审查期间运行git推送命令。","ja":"gitを使用して読み取り専用のPRレビューを実行するエージェントを可能にし、安全なプロトコルを確保しながら、マージの準備就緒性に関する構造化された推奨事項を提供します。たとえば、メインブランチにプッシュしたり、レビュー中にgitプッシュコマンドを実行したりすることはありません。","ko":"에이전트가 Git을 사용하여 읽기 전용 PR 리뷰를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 안전 프로토콜을 보장하면서 병합 준비 상태에 대한 구조화된 추천을 제공합니다. 예를 들어, 메인 브랜치에 푸시하거나 리뷰 중에 Git 푸시 명령을 실행하지 않습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de PR de solo lectura utilizando git, proporcionando recomendaciones estructuradas sobre la preparación para la fusión, garantizando al mismo tiempo protocolos de seguridad como nunca empujar a main o ejecutar comandos git push durante la revisión.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des révisions de PR en lecture seule à l''aide de git, fournissant des recommandations structurées sur la préparation à la fusion, tout en garantissant des protocoles de sécurité tels que ne jamais pousser vers main ou exécuter des commandes git push pendant la révision.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, schreibgeschützte PR-Überprüfungen mit git durchzuführen, strukturierte Empfehlungen zur Merge-Bereitschaft bereitzustellen, während Sicherheitsprotokolle wie das Nie-Pushen in den Hauptzweig oder Ausführen von git-Push-Befehlen während der Überprüfung gewährleistet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões de PR somente leitura usando o git, fornecendo recomendações estruturadas sobre a prontidão para mesclagem, garantindo protocolos de segurança como nunca enviar para o principal ou executar comandos git push durante a revisão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять только чтение обзоров PR с помощью git, предоставляя структурированные рекомендации по готовности к слиянию, гарантируя протоколы безопасности, такие как никогда не отправлять в основную ветку или выполнять команды git push во время обзора.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أداء مراجعات PR للقراءة فقط باستخدام git، مع تقديم توصيات منسقة بشأن جاهزية الدمج، مع ضمان بروتوكولات الأمان مثل أبدا الإرسال إلى الرئيسي أو تشغيل أوامر git push أثناء المراجعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing PR readiness for merge","Generating structured review recommendations","Validating PR numbers or URLs"],"zh":["评估PR合并的就绪性","生成结构化的审查建议","验证PR编号或URL"],"ja":["マージの準備就緒性を評価する","構造化されたレビューの推奨事項を生成する","PR番号またはURLを検証する"],"ko":["PR 병합 준비 상태 평가","구조화된 리뷰 추천 생성","PR 번호 또는 URL 검증"],"es":["Evaluación de la preparación de PR para la fusión","Generación de recomendaciones de revisión estructuradas","Validación de números o URLs de PR"],"fr":["Évaluation de la préparation de PR à la fusion","Génération de recommandations de révision structurées","Validation des numéros ou des URL de PR"],"de":["Bewertung der PR-Bereitschaft für den Merge","Erzeugung strukturierter Überprüfungsempfehlungen","Validierung von PR-Nummern oder -URLs"],"pt":["Avaliar a prontidão do PR para mesclagem","Gerar recomendações de revisão estruturadas","Validar números ou URLs de PR"],"ru":["Оценка готовности PR к слиянию","Генерация структурированных рекомендаций по обзору","Проверка номеров или URL-адресов PR"],"ar":["تقييم جاهزية PR للدمج","توليد توصيات مراجعة منسقة","التحقق من أرقام أو عناوين URL ل-PR"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git setup and PR access","Read-only review mode only","Never pushes to main or origin/main"],"zh":["需要git设置和PR访问","仅读取审查模式","永远不会推送到主分支或origin/main"],"ja":["gitの設定とPRへのアクセスが必要","読み取り専用のレビューモードのみ","メインブランチまたはorigin/mainにプッシュしない"],"ko":["Git 설정 및 PR 액세스가 필요","읽기 전용 리뷰 모드만","메인 브랜치 또는 origin/main에 푸시하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere configuración de git y acceso a PR","Modo de revisión de solo lectura","Nunca empuja a main o origin/main"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration git et un accès PR","Mode de révision en lecture seule","Ne pousse jamais vers main ou origin/main"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Setup und PR-Zugriff","Nur-Lese-Überprüfungsmodus","Kommt nie in den Hauptzweig oder origin/main"],"pt":["Exige configuração do git e acesso ao PR","Modo de revisão somente leitura","Nunca envia para o principal ou origem/principal"],"ru":["Требует настройки git и доступа к PR","Только режим чтения обзора","Никогда не отправляет в основную ветку или origin/main"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد git ووصول إلى PR","الوضع القراءة فقط للمراجعة","أبدا الإرسال إلى الرئيسي أو الأصل/الرئيسي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ruvnet/claude-flow/agent-raft-manager', 'community', 'ruvnet', 'claude-flow', 'ruvnet/claude-flow', 'agent-raft-manager', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:50:27.285Z', NULL, '{"id":"ruvnet/claude-flow/agent-raft-manager","name":"agent-raft-manager","description":{"zh":"agent-raft-manager是一种智能多agent编排平台，采用企业级架构和分布式群集智能，支持RAG集成和Claude Code","ja":"agent-raft-managerはマルチエージェントオーケストレーションプラットフォームであり、企業レベルのアーキテクチャと分散型のスウォームインテリジェンスを採用しています","ko":"agent-raft-manager는 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션 플랫폼으로, 기업급 아키텍처와 분산형 스와ーム 인텔리전스를採用합니다","es":"El gestor de agentes Raft es una plataforma de orquestación de agentes para Claude que permite desplegar enjambres de agentes inteligentes y coordina flujos de trabajo autónomos.","fr":"Le gestionnaire d''agents Raft est une plateforme d''orchestration d''agents pour Claude qui permet de déployer des essaims d''agents intelligents et de coordonner des flux de travail autonomes.","de":"Der Raft-Agent-Manager ist eine Orchestrierungsplattform für Claude, die das Bereitstellen von intelligenten Agenten-Schwärmen und die Koordinierung von autonomen Arbeitsabläufen ermöglicht.","pt":"O gerenciador de Raft é uma plataforma de orquestração de agentes para Claude, com recursos de eleição de líder e replicação de logs. Ele permite a implantação de enxames de agentes inteligentes e a coordenação de fluxos de trabalho autônomos","ru":"Менеджер Raft — это платформа для оркестровки агентов для Claude, с возможностями выбора лидера и репликации журналов. Он позволяет развертывать рои интеллектуальных агентов и координировать автономные рабочие процессы","ar":"مدير Raft هو منصة لتوجيه الوكلاء لشركة Claude، مع إمكانيات انتخاب الزعيم وتكرار السجلات. يسمح بالتوجيه الفعّال للوكلاء الذكيين وتنسيق تدفقات العمل الذاتية","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP p..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"agent-raft-manager：领先的智能多agent编排平台","ja":"agent-raft-manager：クラウドのための先進的なマルチエージェントオーケストレーションプラットフォーム","ko":"agent-raft-manager: 클라우드용 최첨단 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션 플랫폼","es":"Gestor de agentes Raft para Claude","fr":"Gestionnaire d''agents Raft pour Claude","de":"Raft-Agent-Manager für Claude","pt":"Gerenciador de Raft: Plataforma de Orquestração de Agentes","ru":"Менеджер Raft: Платформа для Оркестровки Агентов","ar":"مدير Raft: منصة لتوجيه الوكلاء","en":"agent-raft-manager"},"description":{"zh":"agent-raft-manager是一种智能多agent编排平台，采用企业级架构和分布式群集智能，支持RAG集成和Claude Code","ja":"agent-raft-managerはマルチエージェントオーケストレーションプラットフォームであり、企業レベルのアーキテクチャと分散型のスウォームインテリジェンスを採用しています","ko":"agent-raft-manager는 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션 플랫폼으로, 기업급 아키텍처와 분산형 스와ーム 인텔리전스를採用합니다","es":"El gestor de agentes Raft es una plataforma de orquestación de agentes para Claude que permite desplegar enjambres de agentes inteligentes y coordina flujos ...","fr":"Le gestionnaire d''agents Raft est une plateforme d''orchestration d''agents pour Claude qui permet de déployer des essaims d''agents intelligents et de coordonn...","de":"Der Raft-Agent-Manager ist eine Orchestrierungsplattform für Claude, die das Bereitstellen von intelligenten Agenten-Schwärmen und die Koordinierung von auto...","pt":"O gerenciador de Raft é uma plataforma de orquestração de agentes para Claude, com recursos de eleição de líder e replicação de logs. Ele permite a implantaç...","ru":"Менеджер Raft — это платформа для оркестровки агентов для Claude, с возможностями выбора лидера и репликации журналов. Он позволяет развертывать рои интеллек...","ar":"مدير Raft هو منصة لتوجيه الوكلاء لشركة Claude، مع إمكانيات انتخاب الزعيم وتكرار السجلات. يسمح بالتوجيه الفعّال للوكلاء الذكيين وتنسيق تدفقات العمل الذاتية","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI s..."},"definition":{"en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP protocol. Ranked #1 in agent-based frameworks."},"features":{"zh":["企业级架构","分布式群集智能","RAG集成","Claude Code支持","leader选举","日志复制"],"ja":["企業レベルのアーキテクチャ","分散型のスウォームインテリジェンス","RAG統合","Claude Codeサポート","リーダー選挙","ログ複製"],"ko":["기업급 아키텍처","분산형 스와ーム 인텔리전스","RAG 통합","Claude Code 지원","리더 선출","로그 복제"],"es":["Arquitectura de empresa","Inteligencia de enjambre distribuida","Integración de RAG","Soporte nativo para Claude Code a través del protocolo MCP","Elección de líder y replicación de registros","Gestión de seguidores y cambios de membresía"],"fr":["Architecture d''entreprise","Intelligence de essaim distribuée","Intégration de RAG","Support natif pour Claude Code via le protocole MCP","Élection de leader et réplication de journaux","Gestion de followers et de changements de membres"],"de":["Unternehmensarchitektur","Verteilte Schwarmintelligenz","RAG-Integration","Native Unterstützung für Claude Code über das MCP-Protokoll","Leader-Election und Log-Replikation","Follower-Management und Mitgliedschaftsänderungen"],"pt":["Arquitetura empresarial","Inteligência de enxame distribuída","Integração com RAG","Suporte nativo ao Claude Code via protocolo MCP","Eleição de líder e replicação de logs","Gerenciamento de membros e verificação de consistência"],"ru":["Корпоративная архитектура","Распределенный интеллект роя","Интеграция с RAG","Родная поддержка Claude Code через протокол MCP","Выбор лидера и репликация журналов","Управление членами и проверка согласованности"],"ar":["هندسة مؤسسية","ذكاء سرب موزع","التكامل مع RAG","دعم أصلي للكود Claude عبر بروتوكول MCP","اختيار الزعيم وتكرار السجلات","إدارة الأعضاء وتحقق الاتساق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能多agent编排","企业级架构","分布式群集智能","RAG集成","Claude Code","leader选举","日志复制","对话式AI系统"],"ja":["マルチエージェントオーケストレーション","企業レベルのアーキテクチャ","分散型のスウォームインテリジェンス","RAG統合","Claude Code","リーダー選挙","ログ複製","会話型AIシステム"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션","기업급 아키텍처","분산형 스와ーム 인텔리전스","RAG 통합","Claude Code","리더 선출","로그 복제","대화형 AI 시스템"],"es":["gestor de agentes Raft","orquestación de agentes","Claude","inteligencia artificial","agentes autónomos","flujos de trabajo autónomos","arquitectura de empresa","inteligencia de enjambre distribuida"],"fr":["gestionnaire d''agents Raft","orchestration d''agents","Claude","intelligence artificielle","agents autonomes","flux de travail autonomes","architecture d''entreprise","intelligence de essaim distribuée"],"de":["Raft-Agent-Manager","Orchestrierung von Agenten","Claude","künstliche Intelligenz","autonome Agenten","autonome Arbeitsabläufe","Unternehmensarchitektur","Verteilte Schwarmintelligenz"],"pt":["orquestração de agentes","plataforma de orquestração","gerenciador de Raft","inteligência de enxame","arquitetura empresarial","Claude Code","protocolo MCP","eleição de líder","replicação de logs"],"ru":["оркестровка агентов","платформа для оркестровки","менеджер Raft","интеллект роя","корпоративная архитектура","Claude Code","протокол MCP","выбор лидера","репликация журналов"],"ar":["توجيه الوكلاء","منصة لتوجيه","مدير Raft","ذكاء سرب","هندسة مؤسسية","كود Claude","بروتوكول MCP","اختيار الزعيم","تكرار السجلات"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-raft-manager","description":"Agent skill for raft-manager - invoke with $agent-raft-manager","bodyPreview":"---\nname: raft-manager\ntype: coordinator\ncolor: \"#2196F3\"\ndescription: Manages Raft consensus algorithm with leader election and log replication\ncapabilities:\n  - leader_election\n  - log_replication\n  - follower_management\n  - membership_changes\n  - consistency_verification\npriority: high\nhooks:\n  pre: |\n    echo \"🗳️  Raft Manager starting: $TASK\"\n    # Check cluster health before operations\n    if [[ \"$TASK\" == *\"election\"* ]]; then\n      echo \"🎯 Preparing leader election process\"\n    fi\n  po","body":"---\nname: raft-manager\ntype: coordinator\ncolor: \"#2196F3\"\ndescription: Manages Raft consensus algorithm with leader election and log replication\ncapabilities:\n  - leader_election\n  - log_replication\n  - follower_management\n  - membership_changes\n  - consistency_verification\npriority: high\nhooks:\n  pre: |\n    echo \"🗳️  Raft Manager starting: $TASK\"\n    # Check cluster health before operations\n    if [[ \"$TASK\" == *\"election\"* ]]; then\n      echo \"🎯 Preparing leader election process\"\n    fi\n  post: |\n    echo \"📝 Raft operation complete\"\n    # Verify log consistency\n    echo \"🔍 Validating log replication and consistency\"\n---\n\n# Raft Consensus Manager\n\nImplements and manages the Raft consensus algorithm for distributed systems with strong consistency guarantees.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Leader Election**: Coordinate randomized timeout-based leader selection\n2. **Log Replication**: Ensure reliable propagation of entries to followers\n3. **Consistency Management**: Maintain log consistency across all cluster nodes\n4. **Membership Changes**: Handle dynamic node addition$removal safely\n5. **Recovery Coordination**: Resynchronize nodes after network partitions\n\n## Implementation Approach\n\n### Leader Election Protocol\n- Execute randomized timeout-based elections to prevent split votes\n- Manage candidate state transitions and vote collection\n- Maintain leadership through periodic heartbeat messages\n- Handle split vote scenarios with intelligent backoff\n\n### Log Replication System\n- Implement append entries protocol for reliable log propagation\n- Ensure log consistency guarantees across all follower nodes\n- Track commit index and apply entries to state machine\n- Execute log compaction through snapshotting mechanisms\n\n### Fault Tolerance Features\n- Detect leader failures and trigger new elections\n- Handle network partitions while maintaining consistency\n- Recover failed nodes to consistent state automatically\n- Support dynamic cluster membership changes safely\n\n## Collaboration\n\n- Coordinate with Quorum Manager for membership adjustments\n- Interface with Performance Benchmarker for optimization analysis\n- Integrate with CRDT Synchronizer for eventual consistency scenarios\n- Synchronize with Security Manager for secure communication"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:50:27.285Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring distributed swarm intelligence and Raft consensus algorithm management","zh":"适用于需要分布式群体智能和Raft共识算法管理的自主代理","ja":"分散型スウォームインテリジェンスとRaftコンセンサスアルゴリズムの管理を必要とする自律エージェントに適している","ko":"분산 스웜 인텔리전스 및 Raft 합의 알고리즘 관리가 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren inteligencia de enjambre distribuida y gestión del algoritmo de consenso Raft","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant une intelligence de swarm distribuée et une gestion de l''algorithme de consensus Raft","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die verteilte Schwarmintelligenz und Raft-Konsensalgorithmus-Verwaltung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem inteligência de enxame distribuída e gerenciamento de algoritmo de consenso Raft","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих распределенного интеллекта роя и управления алгоритмом консенсуса Raft","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يتطلبون ذكاء السرب الموزع وإدارة خوارزمية الإجماع Raft"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage leader election and log replication using the Raft consensus algorithm, ensuring consistency verification and membership changes, all while leveraging native Claude Code support via MCP","zh":"赋予代理管理领导者选举和日志复制使用Raft共识算法，确保一致性验证和成员变更，同时利用基于MCP的Claude Code支持","ja":"Raftコンセンサスアルゴリズムを使用してリーダー選出とログ複製を管理し、一貫性の検証とメンバーシップの変更を保証する同时、MCPを介したClaude Codeのネイティブサポートを活用する","ko":"Raft 합의 알고리즘을 사용하여 리더 선출 및 로그 복제를 관리하고 일관성 검증 및 멤버십 변경을 보장하면서 MCP를 통한 Claude Code 네이티브 지원을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar la elección de líder y la replicación de registros utilizando el algoritmo de consenso Raft, lo que garantiza la verificación de coherencia y los cambios de membresía, todo mientras aprovecha el soporte nativo de Claude Code a través de MCP","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''élection du leader et la réplication des journaux en utilisant l''algorithme de consensus Raft, garantissant ainsi la vérification de la cohérence et les changements de membres, le tout en exploitant le support natif de Claude Code via MCP","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Leader-Wahl und die Protokollreplikation unter Verwendung des Raft-Konsensalgorithmus zu verwalten, was die Konsistenzüberprüfung und die Mitgliedschaftsänderungen gewährleistet, und zwar unter Ausnutzung der nativen Claude-Code-Unterstützung via MCP","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar a eleição do líder e a replicação de logs usando o algoritmo de consenso Raft, garantindo verificação de consistência e alterações de associação, tudo isso aproveitando o suporte nativo do Claude Code via MCP","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять выбором лидера и репликацией журналов с помощью алгоритма консенсуса Raft, обеспечивая проверку согласованности и изменений членства, все это при использовании родной поддержки Claude Code через MCP","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة انتخابات القيادة ونسخ سجلات باستخدام خوارزمية الإجماع Raft، مما يضمن التحقق من الاتساق وتغييرات العضوية، وكل هذا بالاستفادة من دعم Claude Code الأصلي عبر MCP"},"useCases":{"en":["Coordinating autonomous workflows across multi-agent swarms","Deploying intelligent agent swarms with enterprise-grade architecture","Building conversational AI systems with RAG integration"],"zh":["跨多代理群的自治工作流协调","具有企业级架构的智能代理群部署","构建具有RAG集成的对话式AI系统"],"ja":["マルチエージェントスウォーム間の自律ワークフロー調整","企業レベルのアーキテクチャを備えたインテリジェントエージェントスウォームの展開","RAG統合を備えた会話型AIシステムの構築"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 스웜 간의 자율 워크플로우 조정","사업급 아키텍처를 갖춘 지능형 에이전트 스웜 배포","RAG 통합을 갖춘 대화형 AI 시스템 구축"],"es":["Coordinar flujos de trabajo autónomos en enjambres multiagente","Desplegar enjambres de agentes inteligentes con arquitectura de nivel empresarial","Crear sistemas de inteligencia artificial conversacional con integración de RAG"],"fr":["Coordonner les flux de travail autonomes à travers les essaims multi-agents","Déployer des essaims d''agents intelligents avec une architecture de niveau entreprise","Construire des systèmes d''intelligence artificielle conversationnelle avec une intégration de RAG"],"de":["Autonome Workflows in Multiagenten-Schwärmen koordinieren","Intelligente Agenten-Schwärme mit Unternehmensarchitektur bereitstellen","Konversationale KI-Systeme mit RAG-Integration erstellen"],"pt":["Coordenar fluxos de trabalho autônomos em enxames multiagente","Implantar enxames de agentes inteligentes com arquitetura de nível empresarial","Construir sistemas de IA conversacional com integração RAG"],"ru":["Координация автономных рабочих процессов в многоагентных роях","Развертывание интеллектуальных агентских роев с архитектурой уровня предприятия","Построение систем разговорного ИИ с интеграцией RAG"],"ar":["تنسيق تدفقات العمل المستقلة عبر السرب متعدد الوكلاء","نشر سرب وكلاء ذكي مع هندسة معمارية من المستوى المؤسسي","بناء أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي محادثية مع دمج RAG"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code support via MCP","Dependent on cluster health for operations","Limited to Raft consensus algorithm"],"zh":["需要通过MCP获得Claude Code支持","依赖集群健康状况进行操作","仅限于Raft共识算法"],"ja":["MCPを介したClaude Codeのサポートが必要","クラスターのヘルス状態に依存して操作","Raftコンセンサスアルゴリズムのみ"],"ko":["MCP를 통한 Claude Code 지원 필요","클러스터 헬스 상태에 의존하여 작동","Raft 합의 알고리즘만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere soporte de Claude Code a través de MCP","Depende de la salud del clúster para las operaciones","Limitado al algoritmo de consenso Raft"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de Claude Code via MCP","Dépend de la santé du cluster pour les opérations","Limité à l''algorithme de consensus Raft"],"de":["Benötigt Claude-Code-Unterstützung via MCP","Ist von der Cluster-Gesundheit für den Betrieb abhängig","Begrenzt auf den Raft-Konsensalgorithmus"],"pt":["Exige suporte do Claude Code via MCP","Dependente da saúde do cluster para operações","Limitado ao algoritmo de consenso Raft"],"ru":["Требует поддержки Claude Code через MCP","Зависит от здоровья кластера для операций","Ограничен алгоритмом консенсуса Raft"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم Claude Code عبر MCP","يعتمد على صحة المجموعة للعمليات","محدود بخوارزمية الإجماع Raft"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('acquia/nebula/canvas-component-definition', 'community', 'acquia', 'nebula', 'acquia/nebula', 'canvas-component-definition', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:50:14.651Z', NULL, '{"id":"acquia/nebula/canvas-component-definition","name":"canvas-component-definition","description":{"zh":"Canvas组件是由React实现、元数据、命名和结构兼容性以及兼容的Props/Slots模型组成的包。","ja":"Canvasコンポーネントは、Reactの実装、メタデータ、命名と構造の互換性、および互換性のあるProps/Slotsモデルで構成されるパッケージです。","ko":"Canvas 컴포넌트는 React 구현, 메타데이터, 명명 및 구조 호환성 및 호환되는 Props/Slots 모델로 구성된 패키지입니다.","es":"Un componente de Canvas es un paquete que incluye una implementación de React, metadatos y una estructura de compatibilidad. Aprende sobre los requisitos para crear componentes de Canvas.","fr":"Un composant Canvas est un package qui inclut une implémentation React, des métadonnées et une structure de compatibilité. Découvrez les exigences pour créer des composants Canvas.","de":"Ein Canvas-Komponente ist ein Paket, das eine React-Implementierung, Metadaten und eine Kompatibilitätsstruktur enthält. Erfahren Sie mehr über die Anforderungen für die Erstellung von Canvas-Komponenten.","pt":"Um componente Canvas é um pacote de implementação React, metadados, estrutura e propriedades compatíveis com Canvas","ru":"Компонент Canvas представляет собой пакет реализации React, метаданных, структуры и свойств, совместимых с Canvas","ar":"مكون Canvas هو حزمة من تنفيذ React والبيانات الوصفية والهيكل والخصائص المتوافقة مع Canvas","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Canvas组件定义","ja":"Canvasコンポーネント定義","ko":"Canvas 컴포넌트 정의","es":"Definición de componente de Canvas","fr":"Définition de composant Canvas","de":"Canvas-Komponenten-Definition","pt":"Definição de Componente Canvas","ru":"Определение компонента Canvas","ar":"تعريف مكون Canvas","en":"canvas-component-definition"},"description":{"zh":"Canvas组件是由React实现、元数据、命名和结构兼容性以及兼容的Props/Slots模型组成的包。","ja":"Canvasコンポーネントは、Reactの実装、メタデータ、命名と構造の互換性、および互換性のあるProps/Slotsモデルで構成されるパッケージです。","ko":"Canvas 컴포넌트는 React 구현, 메타데이터, 명명 및 구조 호환성 및 호환되는 Props/Slots 모델로 구성된 패키지입니다.","es":"Un componente de Canvas es un paquete que incluye una implementación de React, metadatos y una estructura de compatibilidad. Aprende sobre los requisitos par...","fr":"Un composant Canvas est un package qui inclut une implémentation React, des métadonnées et une structure de compatibilité. Découvrez les exigences pour créer...","de":"Ein Canvas-Komponente ist ein Paket, das eine React-Implementierung, Metadaten und eine Kompatibilitätsstruktur enthält. Erfahren Sie mehr über die Anforderu...","pt":"Um componente Canvas é um pacote de implementação React, metadados, estrutura e propriedades compatíveis com Canvas","ru":"Компонент Canvas представляет собой пакет реализации React, метаданных, структуры и свойств, совместимых с Canvas","ar":"مكون Canvas هو حزمة من تنفيذ React والبيانات الوصفية والهيكل والخصائص المتوافقة مع Canvas","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["React实现","元数据","命名和结构兼容性","兼容的Props/Slots模型"],"ja":["Reactの実装","メタデータ","命名と構造の互換性","互換性のあるProps/Slotsモデル"],"ko":["React 구현","메타데이터","명명 및 구조 호환성","호환되는 Props/Slots 모델"],"es":["Implementación de React","Metadatos y esquema","Estructura de compatibilidad","Modelado de propiedades y ranuras","Compatibilidad con Drupal Canvas"],"fr":["Implémentation React","Métadonnées et schéma","Structure de compatibilité","Modélisation de propriétés et de slots","Compatibilité avec Drupal Canvas"],"de":["React-Implementierung","Metadaten und Schema","Kompatibilitätsstruktur","Modellierung von Eigenschaften und Slots","Kompatibilität mit Drupal Canvas"],"pt":["Implementação React","Metadados Canvas","Estrutura de pasta compatível","Modelagem de propriedades e slots","Compatibilidade com Drupal Canvas"],"ru":["Реализация React","Метаданные Canvas","Совместимая структура папок","Моделирование свойств и слотов","Совместимость с Drupal Canvas"],"ar":["تنفيذ React","البيانات الوصفية Canvas","هيكل المجلد المتوافق","نمذجة الخصائص والفتحات","توافق مع Drupal Canvas"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Canvas组件","React","元数据","命名和结构兼容性","兼容的Props/Slots模型","Drupal Canvas"],"ja":["Canvasコンポーネント","React","メタデータ","命名と構造の互換性","互換性のあるProps/Slotsモデル","Drupal Canvas"],"ko":["Canvas 컴포넌트","React","메타데이터","명명 및 구조 호환성","호환되는 Props/Slots 모델","Drupal Canvas"],"es":["componentes de Canvas","Drupal Canvas","React","metadatos","compatibilidad","desarrollo de software","tecnologías web","frameworks de JavaScript"],"fr":["composants Canvas","Drupal Canvas","React","métadonnées","compatibilité","développement de logiciels","technologies web","frameworks JavaScript"],"de":["Canvas-Komponenten","Drupal Canvas","React","Metadaten","Kompatibilität","Softwareentwicklung","Webtechnologien","JavaScript-Frameworks"],"pt":["Componente Canvas","React","Drupal Canvas","Metadados","Estrutura de pasta","Propriedades e slots","Desenvolvimento web","Front-end"],"ru":["Компонент Canvas","React","Drupal Canvas","Метаданные","Структура папок","Свойства и слоты","Веб-разработка","Front-end"],"ar":["مكون Canvas","React","Drupal Canvas","البيانات الوصفية","هيكل المجلد","الخصائص والفتحات","تطوير الويب","الواجهة الأمامية"]}},"owner":"acquia","repo":"nebula","repoPath":"acquia/nebula","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canvas-component-definition","description":"","bodyPreview":"## Canonical definition\n\nA Canvas component is a package of:\n\n1. A React implementation (`index.jsx`)\n2. Canvas metadata/schema (`component.yml`)\n3. Naming and structure compatibility (`machineName`, folder path, story path)\n4. Canvas-compatible props/slots modeling\n\nAll four parts are required for the component to be usable in Drupal Canvas.\n\n## Minimum contract (MUST)\n\nEvery Canvas component MUST satisfy all checks below:\n\n- Component folder exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/` (use t","body":"## Canonical definition\n\nA Canvas component is a package of:\n\n1. A React implementation (`index.jsx`)\n2. Canvas metadata/schema (`component.yml`)\n3. Naming and structure compatibility (`machineName`, folder path, story path)\n4. Canvas-compatible props/slots modeling\n\nAll four parts are required for the component to be usable in Drupal Canvas.\n\n## Minimum contract (MUST)\n\nEvery Canvas component MUST satisfy all checks below:\n\n- Component folder exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/` (use the\n  repository''s configured components root, which may be defined in `.env`)\n- React implementation exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/index.jsx`\n- Metadata exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/component.yml`\n- `component.yml` includes required top-level keys (`name`, `machineName`,\n  `status`, `required`, `props`, `slots`)\n- Folder name exactly matches `machineName` in `component.yml` (kebab-case)\n- A matching story exists at `<stories-root>/<machine-name>.stories.jsx` (use\n  the repository''s configured stories root)\n- Props/slots follow Canvas rules (for example, avoid unsupported\n  array-of-object prop shapes; use slots for repeatable complex content)\n\nIf any item is missing, the component is incomplete for Canvas usage.\n\n## Naming guidance\n\nUse `references/naming.md` for naming rules and examples.\n\n## Skill coordination\n\nEvaluate using companion skills in this order.\n\n1. `canvas-component-metadata`\n   - Use when creating/changing `component.yml`, props/slots, enums, or fixing\n     prop validation errors.\n2. `canvas-component-composability`\n   - Use when designing prop/slot structure, decomposing large components,\n     deciding props vs slots, or modeling repeatable list/grid content.\n3. `canvas-styling-conventions`\n   - Use for all styling work: new components, style props, Tailwind token\n     usage, CVA variants, class changes, and prop changes that affect styles.\n4. `canvas-component-utils`\n   - Use when rendering formatted HTML text or media via `FormattedText` and\n     `Image`.\n5. `canvas-data-fetching`\n   - Use when fetching/rendering Drupal content with JSON:API, SWR, includes,\n     and filter patterns.\n6. `canvas-component-upload`\n   - Use after implementation is complete and validated, when uploading and\n     recovering from upload failures.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:50:14.651Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React component development and Drupal Canvas integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React组件开发和Drupal Canvas集成的前端智能体。","ja":"高度なReactコンポーネント開発とDrupal Canvas統合を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 컴포넌트 개발과 Drupal Canvas 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan desarrollo avanzado de componentes React y integración con Drupal Canvas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin d''un développement avancé de composants React et d''une intégration avec Drupal Canvas.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Entwicklung von React-Komponenten und eine Integration mit Drupal Canvas benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento avançado de componentes React e integração com o Canvas do Drupal.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим продвинутый разработка компонентов React и интеграция с Drupal Canvas.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير متقدم لمكونات React وتكامل مع Canvas Drupal."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create reusable and compatible Canvas components using React implementation, Canvas metadata/schema, and naming structure, enabling seamless integration with Drupal Canvas via component.yml and machineName compatibility.","zh":"使智能体能够利用React实现、Canvas元数据/模式和命名结构，创建可重用且兼容的Canvas组件，通过component.yml和machineName兼容性实现与Drupal Canvas的无缝集成。","ja":"Reactの実装、Canvasメタデータ/スキーマ、および命名構造を使用して、再利用可能で互換性のあるCanvasコンポーネントを作成する機能をエージェントに提供し、component.ymlとmachineNameの互換性によるDrupal Canvasとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"React 구현, Canvas 메타데이터/스키마 및 명명 구조를 사용하여 재사용 가능하고 호환되는 Canvas 컴포넌트를 생성하여, component.yml 및 machineName 호환성을 통해 Drupal Canvas와의 원활한 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de Canvas reutilizables y compatibles utilizando la implementación de React, los metadatos/esquema de Canvas y la estructura de nombres, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con Drupal Canvas a través de component.yml y la compatibilidad con machineName.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants de Canvas réutilisables et compatibles en utilisant la mise en œuvre de React, les métadonnées/schéma de Canvas et la structure de noms, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec Drupal Canvas via component.yml et la compatibilité avec machineName.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, wiederverwendbare und kompatible Canvas-Komponenten zu erstellen, indem sie die React-Implementierung, die Canvas-Metadaten/Datenschema und die Namensstruktur nutzen, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Drupal Canvas über component.yml und machineName-Kompatibilität ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Canvas reutilizáveis e compatíveis usando a implementação React, metadados/esquema do Canvas e estrutura de nomenclatura, permitindo uma integração sem problemas com o Drupal Canvas por meio do component.yml e compatibilidade com machineName.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать многократно используемые и совместимые компоненты Canvas с помощью реализации React, метаданных/схемы Canvas и структуры именования, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с Drupal Canvas посредством component.yml и совместимости с machineName.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات Canvas قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام ومتوافقة باستخدام تنفيذ React وبيانات تعريف Canvas / مخطط والهيكل التسمي، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع Drupal Canvas من خلال component.yml وتوافق machineName."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom Canvas components with React","Validating component compatibility with Drupal Canvas","Automating component folder structure and naming conventions"],"zh":["使用React构建自定义Canvas组件","验证组件与Drupal Canvas的兼容性","自动化组件文件夹结构和命名约定"],"ja":["Reactを使用したカスタムCanvasコンポーネントの構築","Drupal Canvasとのコンポーネント互換性の検証","コンポーネントのフォルダ構造と命名規則の自動化"],"ko":["React로 사용자 정의 Canvas 컴포넌트 구축","Drupal Canvas와의 컴포넌트 호환성 검증","컴포넌트 폴더 구조 및 명명 규칙 자동화"],"es":["Creación de componentes personalizados de Canvas con React","Validación de la compatibilidad de componentes con Drupal Canvas","Automatización de la estructura de carpetas y convenciones de nombres de componentes"],"fr":["Création de composants de Canvas personnalisés avec React","Validation de la compatibilité des composants avec Drupal Canvas","Automatisation de la structure de dossiers et des conventions de nommage des composants"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Canvas-Komponenten mit React","Überprüfung der Kompatibilität von Komponenten mit Drupal Canvas","Automatisierung der Ordnerstruktur und der Namenskonventionen von Komponenten"],"pt":["Construir componentes personalizados do Canvas com React","Validar a compatibilidade do componente com o Canvas do Drupal","Automatizar a estrutura de pastas e convenções de nomenclatura do componente"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских компонентов Canvas с помощью React","Проверка совместимости компонента с Drupal Canvas","Автоматизация структуры папок и соглашений об именовании компонента"],"ar":["بناء مكونات Canvas مخصصة مع React","تحقق من توافق المكون مع Canvas Drupal","توفير هيكل المجلدات وأساليب التسمية للمكون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React implementation (index.jsx)","Must adhere to Canvas metadata/schema (component.yml) standards","Demands strict naming and structure compatibility (machineName, folder path, story path)"],"zh":["需要React实现（index.jsx）","必须遵守Canvas元数据/模式（component.yml）标准","要求严格的命名和结构兼容性（machineName、文件夹路径、story路径）"],"ja":["Reactの実装（index.jsx）が必要","Canvasメタデータ/スキーマ（component.yml）標準に準拠する必要あり","厳格な命名と構造の互換性（machineName、フォルダパス、ストーリーパス）が要求される"],"ko":["React 구현(index.jsx) 필요","Canvas 메타데이터/스키마(component.yml) 표준 준수 필요","엄격한 명명 및 구조 호환성(machineName, 폴더 경로, 스토리 경로) 요구"],"es":["Requiere implementación de React (index.jsx)","Debe cumplir con los estándares de metadatos/esquema de Canvas (component.yml)","Exige una estricta compatibilidad de nombres y estructura (machineName, ruta de carpeta, ruta de historia)"],"fr":["Nécessite une mise en œuvre de React (index.jsx)","Doit respecter les normes de métadonnées/schéma de Canvas (component.yml)","Exige une compatibilité stricte des noms et de la structure (machineName, chemin de dossier, chemin d''histoire)"],"de":["Erfordert React-Implementierung (index.jsx)","Muss den Standards für Canvas-Metadaten/Datenschema (component.yml) entsprechen","Fordert eine strikte Namens- und Strukturkompatibilität (machineName, Ordnerpfad, Story-Pfad)"],"pt":["Exige implementação React (index.jsx)","Deve aderir aos padrões de metadados/esquema do Canvas (component.yml)","Exige compatibilidade estrita de nomenclatura e estrutura (machineName, caminho da pasta, caminho da história)"],"ru":["Требует реализации React (index.jsx)","Должно соответствовать стандартам метаданных/схемы Canvas (component.yml)","Требует строгой совместимости именования и структуры (machineName, путь к папке, путь к истории)"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ React (index.jsx)","يجب الامتثال لمعايير بيانات تعريف Canvas / مخطط (component.yml)","يتطلب توافقا صارما في التسمية والهيكل (machineName، مسار المجلد، مسار القصة)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('simorgh3196/tsuzulint/m09-domain', 'community', 'simorgh3196', 'tsuzulint', 'simorgh3196/tsuzulint', 'm09-domain', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:50:48.979Z', NULL, '{"id":"simorgh3196/tsuzulint/m09-domain","name":"m09-domain","description":{"zh":"m09-domain是一个高性能的自然语言校验工具，帮助开发者优化代码。它使用Rust编写，具有高性能和可扩展性","ja":"m09-domainは、高性能の自然言語リントツールです。Rustで開発されたこのツールは、高性能とスケーラビリティを備えています","ko":"m09-domain은 고성능 자연어 린트 도구로, 개발者的 코드 최적화를 지원합니다. 러스트로 작성되었으며, 고성능과 확장성을 보장합니다","es":"m09-domain es una herramienta de linter de lenguaje natural que ayuda a los desarrolladores a modelar dominios de manera efectiva","fr":"m09-domain est un outil de linter de langage naturel qui aide les développeurs à modéliser des domaines de manière efficace","de":"m09-domain ist ein Naturalsprach-Linter-Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, Domains effektiv zu modellieren","pt":"O m09-domain é um linter de linguagem natural de alto desempenho que ajuda a modelar domínios em código.","ru":"m09-domain - это высокопроизводительный линтер естественного языка, который помогает моделировать домены в коде.","ar":"m09-domain هو لينتر لغة طبيعية عالية الأداء يساعد في نمذجة المجالات في الكود.","en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"m09-domain：高性能自然语言校验工具","ja":"m09-domain：高性能自然言語リントツール","ko":"m09-domain: 고성능 자연어 린트 도구","es":"Modelado de Dominio con m09-domain","fr":"Modélisation de Domaine avec m09-domain","de":"Domain-Modellierung mit m09-domain","pt":"m09-domain: Linter de Linguagem Natural de Alto Desempenho","ru":"m09-domain: Высокопроизводительный линтер естественного я...","ar":"m09-domain: لينتر لغة طبيعية عالية الأداء","en":"m09-domain"},"description":{"zh":"m09-domain是一个高性能的自然语言校验工具，帮助开发者优化代码。它使用Rust编写，具有高性能和可扩展性","ja":"m09-domainは、高性能の自然言語リントツールです。Rustで開発されたこのツールは、高性能とスケーラビリティを備えています","ko":"m09-domain은 고성능 자연어 린트 도구로, 개발者的 코드 최적화를 지원합니다. 러스트로 작성되었으며, 고성능과 확장성을 보장합니다","es":"m09-domain es una herramienta de linter de lenguaje natural que ayuda a los desarrolladores a modelar dominios de manera efectiva","fr":"m09-domain est un outil de linter de langage naturel qui aide les développeurs à modéliser des domaines de manière efficace","de":"m09-domain ist ein Naturalsprach-Linter-Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, Domains effektiv zu modellieren","pt":"O m09-domain é um linter de linguagem natural de alto desempenho que ajuda a modelar domínios em código.","ru":"m09-domain - это высокопроизводительный линтер естественного языка, который помогает моделировать домены в коде.","ar":"m09-domain هو لينتر لغة طبيعية عالية الأداء يساعد في نمذجة المجالات في الكود.","en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"definition":{"en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"features":{"zh":["高性能自然语言校验","Rust编写，具有高性能和可扩展性","支持实体和值对象的区分","提供代码优化建议"],"ja":["高性能自然言語リント","Rustで開発された高性能とスケーラビリティ","エンティティと値オブジェクトの区別をサポート","コード最適化の提案"],"ko":["고성능 자연어 린트","러스트로 작성된 고성능과 확장성","엔티티와 값 객체의 구분 지원","코드 최적화 제안"],"es":["Modelado de dominio basado en entidades y objetos de valor","Mantenimiento de invariantes y límites de agregado","Patrones de Rust para la implementación de conceptos de dominio","Propietario único y identificador para entidades","Interoperabilidad con textlint"],"fr":["Modélisation de domaine basée sur des entités et des objets de valeur","Maintien des invariants et des limites d''agrégat","Modèles Rust pour la mise en œuvre de concepts de domaine","Propriétaire unique et identifiant pour les entités","Interopérabilité avec textlint"],"de":["Domain-Modellierung basierend auf Entitäten und Wertobjekten","Beibehaltung von Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen","Rust-Muster für die Implementierung von Domain-Konzepten","Eigentümer und eindeutiger Identifikator für Entitäten","Kompatibilität mit textlint"],"pt":["Linter de linguagem natural de alto desempenho","Escrito em Rust","Inspirado no textlint","Ajuda a modelar domínios em código","Garante a consistência do modelo de domínio"],"ru":["Высокопроизводительный линтер естественного языка","Написан на Rust","Вдохновлен textlint","Помогает моделировать домены в коде","Обеспечивает согласованность модели домена"],"ar":["لينتر لغة طبيعية عالية الأداء","مكتوب بلغة روست","مستوحى من textlint","يساعد في نمذجة المجالات في الكود","يضمن الاتساق في نموذج المجال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["m09-domain","自然语言校验","Rust","代码优化","实体和值对象","高性能"],"ja":["m09-domain","自然言語リント","Rust","コード最適化","エンティティと値オブジェクト","高性能"],"ko":["m09-domain","자연어 린트","러스트","코드 최적화","엔티티와 값 객체","고성능"],"es":["modelado de dominio","linter de lenguaje natural","Rust","textlint","entidades","objetos de valor","invariantes","límites de agregado"],"fr":["modélisation de domaine","linter de langage naturel","Rust","textlint","entités","objets de valeur","invariants","limites d''agrégat"],"de":["Domain-Modellierung","Naturalsprach-Linter","Rust","textlint","Entitäten","Wertobjekte","Invarianten","Aggregatgrenzen"],"pt":["linter de linguagem natural","alto desempenho","Rust","textlint","modelagem de domínio","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["линтер естественного языка","высокопроизводительный","Rust","textlint","моделирование домена","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["لينتر لغة طبيعية","عالية الأداء","روست","textlint","نمذجة المجال","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"simorgh3196","repo":"tsuzulint","repoPath":"simorgh3196/tsuzulint","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m09-domain","description":"CRITICAL: Use for domain modeling. Triggers: domain model, DDD, domain-driven design, entity, value object, aggregate, repository pattern, business rules, validation, invariant, 领域模型, 领域驱动设计, 业务规则","bodyPreview":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique ident","body":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique identity |\n| Value Object | struct + Clone/Copy | Shareable, immutable |\n| Aggregate Root | struct owns children | Clear ownership tree |\n| Repository | trait | Abstracts persistence |\n| Domain Event | enum | Captures state changes |\n| Service | impl block / free fn | Stateless operations |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore creating a domain type:\n\n1. **What''s the concept''s identity?**\n   - Needs unique identity → Entity (Id field)\n   - Interchangeable by value → Value Object (Clone/Copy)\n\n2. **What invariants must hold?**\n   - Always valid → private fields + validated constructor\n   - Transition rules → type state pattern\n\n3. **Who owns this data?**\n   - Single owner (parent) → owned field\n   - Shared reference → Arc/Rc\n   - Weak reference → Weak\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nTo domain constraints (Layer 3):\n\n```\n\"How should I model a Transaction?\"\n    ↑ Ask: What domain rules govern transactions?\n    ↑ Check: domain-fintech (audit, precision requirements)\n    ↑ Check: Business stakeholders (what invariants?)\n```\n\n| Design Question | Trace To | Ask |\n|-----------------|----------|-----|\n| Entity vs Value Object | domain-* | What makes two instances \"the same\"? |\n| Aggregate boundaries | domain-* | What must be consistent together? |\n| Validation rules | domain-* | What business rules apply? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nTo implementation (Layer 1):\n\n```\n\"Model as Entity\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Owned, unique\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Newtype for Id\n\n\"Model as Value Object\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Clone/Copy OK\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Validate at construction\n\n\"Model as Aggregate\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Parent owns children\n    ↓ m02-resource: Consider Rc for shared within aggregate\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| DDD Concept | Rust Pattern | Example |\n|-------------|--------------|---------|\n| Value Object | Newtype | `struct Email(String);` |\n| Entity | Struct + ID | `struct User { id: UserId, ... }` |\n| Aggregate | Module boundary | `mod order { ... }` |\n| Repository | Trait | `trait UserRepo { fn find(...) }` |\n| Domain Event | Enum | `enum OrderEvent { Created, ... }` |\n\n## Pattern Templates\n\n### Value Object\n\n```rust\nstruct Email(String);\n\nimpl Email {\n    pub fn new(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ValidationError> {\n        validate_email(s)?;\n        Ok(Self(s.to_string()))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Entity\n\n```rust\nstruct UserId(Uuid);\n\nstruct User {\n    id: UserId,\n    email: Email,\n    // ... other fields\n}\n\nimpl PartialEq for User {\n    fn eq(&self, other: &Self) -> bool {\n        self.id == other.id  // Identity equality\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Aggregate\n\n```rust\nmod order {\n    pub struct Order {\n        id: OrderId,\n        items: Vec<OrderItem>,  // Owned children\n        // ...\n    }\n\n    impl Order {\n        pub fn add_item(&mut self, item: OrderItem) {\n            // Enforce aggregate invariants\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Why Wrong | Better |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Primitive obsession | No type safety | Newtype wrappers |\n| Public fields with invariants | Invariants violated | Private + accessor |\n| Leaked aggregate internals | Broken encapsulation | Methods on root |\n| String for semantic types | No validation | Validated newtype |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Type-driven implementation | m05-type-driven |\n| Ownership for aggregates | m01-ownership |\n| Domain error handling | m13-domain-error |\n| Specific domain rules | domain-* |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:50:48.979Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing high-performance natural language linting capabilities in Rust","zh":"非常适合需要高性能自然语言 linting 能力的代码分析代理，特别是在 Rust 中","ja":"Rust で高性能な自然言語 linting 機能が必要なコード分析エージェントに最適","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 러스트에서 높은 성능의 자연어 린팅 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽한 선택","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan capacidades de linting de lenguaje natural de alto rendimiento en Rust","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant des capacités de linting de langage naturel haute performance en Rust","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die Hochleistungs-Naturalsprachen-Linting-Funktionen in Rust benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de linting de linguagem natural de alto desempenho em Rust","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа кода, которым требуются возможности высокопроизводительного линтинга естественного языка в Rust","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات لينتينغ لغة طبيعية عالية الأداء في روست"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce domain modeling best practices, utilizing Rust patterns for entity and value object identification, and maintaining invariants within aggregate boundaries using struct and Id combinations","zh":"赋予代理实施领域建模最佳实践的能力，利用 Rust 模式识别实体和值对象，并在聚合边界内维持不变性，使用结构体和 Id 组合","ja":"エージェントがドメインモデリングのベストプラクティスを施行することを可能にし、Rust のパターンを使用してエンティティと値オブジェクトを識別し、構造体と Id の組み合わせを使用して集約の境界内で不変性を維持する","ko":"에이전트가 도메인 모델링의 최선의 관행을 시행할 수 있도록 하며, 러스트 패턴을 사용하여 엔티티 및 값 개체를 식별하고, 구조체 및 Id 조합을 사용하여 집계 경계 내에서 불변성을 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir las mejores prácticas de modelado de dominio, utilizando patrones de Rust para la identificación de entidades y objetos de valor, y manteniendo invariantes dentro de los límites de agregado utilizando combinaciones de struct e Id","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques de modélisation de domaine, en utilisant des modèles Rust pour l''identification d''entités et d''objets de valeur, et en maintenant les invariants à l''intérieur des limites d''agrégat en utilisant des combinaisons de struct et d''Id","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Domänenmodellierungs-Best-Practices durchzusetzen, indem Rust-Muster für die Identifizierung von Entitäten und Wertobjekten verwendet werden und Invarianten innerhalb von Aggregatgrenzen mit Hilfe von struct- und Id-Kombinationen aufrechterhalten werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor as melhores práticas de modelagem de domínio, utilizando padrões Rust para identificação de entidades e objetos de valor, e manter invariantes dentro dos limites de agregados usando estruturas e combinações de Id","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение лучших практик моделирования предметной области, используя шаблоны Rust для выявления сущностей и объектов значения, и поддержание инвариантов в пределах границ агрегатов с помощью комбинаций struct и Id","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على فرض أفضل الممارسات لنمذجة المجال، باستخدام أنماط روست لتحديد الكيانات وأجسام القيمة، و الحفاظ على الثوابت داخل حدود التجمعات باستخدام هيكل ومجموعات الهوية"},"useCases":{"en":["Modeling domain concepts as Entities or Value Objects","Enforcing invariants and aggregate boundaries in Rust code","Improving code readability with natural language linting"],"zh":["以实体或值对象的形式建模领域概念","在 Rust 代码中强制执行不变性和聚合边界","使用自然语言 linting 改进代码可读性"],"ja":["エンティティまたは値オブジェクトとしてドメイン概念をモデル化する","Rust コード内で不変性と集約境界を強制する","自然言語 linting を使用してコードの可読性を向上させる"],"ko":["엔티티 또는 값 개체로 도메인 개념을 모델링","러스트 코드 내에서 불변성과 집계 경계를 적용","자연어 린팅을 사용하여 코드 가독성을 개선"],"es":["Modelar conceptos de dominio como Entidades o Objetos de Valor","Hacer cumplir invariantes y límites de agregado en código Rust","Mejorar la legibilidad del código con linting de lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Modéliser des concepts de domaine en tant qu''Entités ou Objets de Valeur","Faire respecter les invariants et les limites d''agrégat dans le code Rust","Améliorer la lisibilité du code avec le linting de langage naturel"],"de":["Domänenkonzepte als Entitäten oder Wertobjekte modellieren","Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen in Rust-Code durchsetzen","Code-Lesbarkeit mit naturalsprachlichem Linting verbessern"],"pt":["Modelar conceitos de domínio como Entidades ou Objetos de Valor","Impor invariantes e limites de agregados no código Rust","Melhorar a legibilidade do código com linting de linguagem natural"],"ru":["Моделирование понятий предметной области в качестве сущностей или объектов значения","Обеспечение соблюдения инвариантов и границ агрегатов в коде Rust","Улучшение читаемости кода с помощью линтинга естественного языка"],"ar":["تمثيل مفاهيم المجال كنواحي أو أجسام القيمة","فرض الثوابت وحدود التجمعات في رمز روست","تحسين قراءة الشفرة بلينتينغ لغة طبيعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming language","Inspired by textlint, may have compatibility issues with other linters"],"zh":["需要 Rust 编程语言","可能会受到 textlint 的启发，并与其他 linter 兼容性问题"],"ja":["Rust プログラミング言語が必要","textlint によってインスパイアされているため、他の linter との互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["러스트 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","textlint 에서 영감을 받았기 때문에 다른 린터와의 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Rust","Inspirado en textlint, puede tener problemas de compatibilidad con otros linters"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Rust","Inspiré de textlint, peut avoir des problèmes de compatibilité avec d''autres linters"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Rust","Von textlint inspiriert, kann mit anderen Lintern Kompatibilitätsprobleme haben"],"pt":["Requer a linguagem de programação Rust","Inspirado no textlint, pode ter problemas de compatibilidade com outros linters"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Rust","Вдохновлён textlint, может иметь проблемы совместимости с другими линтерами"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة البرمجة روست","مستوحى من تيكستلينت، قد يكون له مشاكل في التوافق مع لينتيرات أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web/core-web-vitals', 'community', 'sayeedjoy', 'seucampusmate-web', 'sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web', 'core-web-vitals', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:50:38.919Z', NULL, '{"id":"sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web/core-web-vitals","name":"core-web-vitals","description":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化是指针对三个影响 Google 搜索排名和用户体验的关键指标进行的优化，包括加载时间、交互性和视觉稳定性。","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、Google 検索ランキングとユーザー体験に影響を与える 3 つの重要な指標、ロード時間、インタラクティブ性、視覚的安定性を対象とした最適化です。","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화는 Google 검색 순위와 사용자 경험에 영향을 미치는 세 가지 주요 지표, 로딩 시간, 상호 작용 성, 시각적 안정성을 대상으로 하는 최적화입니다.","es":"Optimiza tus métricas de Core Web Vitals para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y la clasificación en Google. Aprende a mejorar LCP, INP y CLS.","fr":"Optimisez vos métriques de Core Web Vitals pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le référencement Google. Découvrez comment améliorer LCP, INP et CLS.","de":"Optimieren Sie Ihre Core Web Vitals-Metriken, um die Benutzererfahrung und die Google-Suche zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie LCP, INP und CLS verbessern können.","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para melhorar a experiência do usuário e o ranking no Google. Aprenda sobre os três principais métricos: LCP, INP e CLS","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для улучшения пользовательского опыта и рейтинга в Google. Узнайте о трех основных метриках: LCP, INP и CLS","ar":"تحسين معايير الويب الأساسية لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وتصنيف جوجل. تعرف على المعايير الثلاثة الرئيسية: LCP و INP و CLS","en":"Web companion for Southeast University students. Academic tools, campus info, and student resources in one place."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화","es":"Optimización de Core Web Vitals","fr":"Optimisation des Core Web Vitals","de":"Core Web Vitals Optimierung","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для Разработчиков","ar":"تحسين معايير الويب الأساسية للأداء","en":"core-web-vitals"},"description":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化是指针对三个影响 Google 搜索排名和用户体验的关键指标进行的优化，包括加载时间、交互性和视觉稳定性。","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、Google 検索ランキングとユーザー体験に影響を与える 3 つの重要な指標、ロード時間、インタラクティブ性、視覚的安定性を対象とした最適化です。","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화는 Google 검색 순위와 사용자 경험에 영향을 미치는 세 가지 주요 지표, 로딩 시간, 상호 작용 성, 시각적 안정성을 대상으로 하는 최적화입니다.","es":"Optimiza tus métricas de Core Web Vitals para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y la clasificación en Google. Aprende a mejorar LCP, INP y CLS.","fr":"Optimisez vos métriques de Core Web Vitals pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le référencement Google. Découvrez comment améliorer LCP, INP et CLS.","de":"Optimieren Sie Ihre Core Web Vitals-Metriken, um die Benutzererfahrung und die Google-Suche zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie LCP, INP und CLS verbessern ...","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para melhorar a experiência do usuário e o ranking no Google. Aprenda sobre os três principais métricos: LCP, INP e CLS","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для улучшения пользовательского опыта и рейтинга в Google. Узнайте о трех основных метриках: LCP, INP и CLS","ar":"تحسين معايير الويب الأساسية لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وتصنيف جوجل. تعرف على المعايير الثلاثة الرئيسية: LCP و INP و CLS","en":"Web companion for Southeast University students. Academic tools, campus info, and student resources in one place."},"definition":{"en":"Web companion for Southeast University students. Academic tools, campus info, and student resources in one place."},"features":{"zh":["加载时间优化","交互性优化","视觉稳定性优化","Google 搜索排名提升","用户体验改善"],"ja":["ロード時間最適化","インタラクティブ性最適化","視覚的安定性最適化","Google 検索ランキングの向上","ユーザー体験の改善"],"ko":["로딩 시간 최적화","상호 작용 성 최적화","시각적 안정성 최적화","Google 검색 순위 향상","사용자 경험 개선"],"es":["Optimización de LCP","Mejora de INP","Reducción de CLS","Análisis de rendimiento","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Optimisation de LCP","Amélioration de INP","Réduction de CLS","Analyse de performances","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Optimierung von LCP","Verbesserung von INP","Reduzierung von CLS","Leistungsanalyse","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Otimização de LCP (Loading)","Otimização de INP (Interatividade)","Otimização de CLS (Estabilidade Visual)","Melhoria do ranking no Google","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Análise de desempenho de página"],"ru":["Оптимизация LCP (Время загрузки)","Оптимизация INP (Интерактивность)","Оптимизация CLS (Визуальная стабильность)","Улучшение рейтинга в Google","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Анализ производительности страницы"],"ar":["تحسين معيار LCP (وقت التحميل)","تحسين معيار INP (التفاعل)","تحسين معيار CLS (الاستقرار البصري)","تحسين تصنيف جوجل","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تحليل أداء الصفحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Core Web Vitals","加载时间优化","交互性优化","视觉稳定性优化","Google 搜索排名","用户体验","Web 性能优化"],"ja":["Core Web Vitals","ロード時間最適化","インタラクティブ性最適化","視覚的安定性最適化","Google 検索ランキング","ユーザー体験","Web パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Core Web Vitals","로딩 시간 최적화","상호 작용 성 최적화","시각적 안정성 최적화","Google 검색 순위","사용자 경험","웹 성능 최적화"],"es":["Core Web Vitals","Optimización de LCP","Mejora de INP","Reducción de CLS","Experiencia del usuario","Rendimiento web","SEO técnico"],"fr":["Core Web Vitals","Optimisation de LCP","Amélioration de INP","Réduction de CLS","Expérience utilisateur","Performances web","SEO technique"],"de":["Core Web Vitals","Optimierung von LCP","Verbesserung von INP","Reduzierung von CLS","Benutzererfahrung","Web-Performance","Technisches SEO"],"pt":["Core Web Vitals","Otimização de site","Experiência do usuário","Ranking no Google","Desempenho de página","LCP","INP","CLS","SEO"],"ru":["Core Web Vitals","Оптимизация сайта","Пользовательский опыт","Рейтинг в Google","Производительность страницы","LCP","INP","CLS","SEO"],"ar":["معايير الويب الأساسية","تحسين موقع","تجربة المستخدم","تصنيف جوجل","أداء الصفحة","LCP","INP","CLS","SEO"]}},"owner":"sayeedjoy","repo":"seucampusmate-web","repoPath":"sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-web-vitals","description":"Optimize Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) for better page experience and search ranking. Use when asked to improve Core Web Vitals, fix LCP, reduce CLS, optimize INP, page experience optimization, or fix layout shifts.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page","body":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page visits must meet \"Good\" thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## LCP: Largest Contentful Paint\n\nLCP measures when the largest visible content element renders. Usually this is:\n- Hero image or video\n- Large text block\n- Background image\n- `<svg>` element\n\n### Common LCP issues\n\n**1. Slow server response (TTFB > 800ms)**\n```\nFix: CDN, caching, optimized backend, edge rendering\n```\n\n**2. Render-blocking resources**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Blocks rendering -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/all-styles.css\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Critical CSS inlined, rest deferred -->\n<style>/* Critical above-fold CSS */</style>\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/styles.css\" as=\"style\" \n      onload=\"this.onload=null;this.rel=''stylesheet''\">\n```\n\n**3. Slow resource load times**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ No hints, discovered late -->\n<img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Hero\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Preloaded with high priority -->\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.webp\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<img src=\"/hero.webp\" alt=\"Hero\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n```\n\n**4. Client-side rendering delays**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Content loads after JavaScript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  fetch(''/api/hero-text'').then(r => r.json()).then(setHeroText);\n}, []);\n\n// ✅ Server-side or static rendering\n// Use SSR, SSG, or streaming to send HTML with content\nexport async function getServerSideProps() {\n  const heroText = await fetchHeroText();\n  return { props: { heroText } };\n}\n```\n\n### LCP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] TTFB < 800ms (use CDN, edge caching)\n- [ ] LCP image preloaded with fetchpriority=\"high\"\n- [ ] LCP image optimized (WebP/AVIF, correct size)\n- [ ] Critical CSS inlined (< 14KB)\n- [ ] No render-blocking JavaScript in <head>\n- [ ] Fonts don''t block text rendering (font-display: swap)\n- [ ] LCP element in initial HTML (not JS-rendered)\n```\n\n### LCP element identification\n```javascript\n// Find your LCP element\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  const entries = list.getEntries();\n  const lastEntry = entries[entries.length - 1];\n  console.log(''LCP element:'', lastEntry.element);\n  console.log(''LCP time:'', lastEntry.startTime);\n}).observe({ type: ''largest-contentful-paint'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## INP: Interaction to Next Paint\n\nINP measures responsiveness across ALL interactions (clicks, taps, key presses) during a page visit. It reports the worst interaction (at 98th percentile for high-traffic pages).\n\n### INP breakdown\n\nTotal INP = **Input Delay** + **Processing Time** + **Presentation Delay**\n\n| Phase | Target | Optimization |\n|-------|--------|--------------|\n| Input Delay | < 50ms | Reduce main thread blocking |\n| Processing | < 100ms | Optimize event handlers |\n| Presentation | < 50ms | Minimize rendering work |\n\n### Common INP issues\n\n**1. Long tasks blocking main thread**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Long synchronous task\nfunction processLargeArray(items) {\n  items.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n}\n\n// ✅ Break into chunks with yielding\nasync function processLargeArray(items) {\n  const CHUNK_SIZE = 100;\n  for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i += CHUNK_SIZE) {\n    const chunk = items.slice(i, i + CHUNK_SIZE);\n    chunk.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n    \n    // Yield to main thread\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 0));\n    // Or use scheduler.yield() when available\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Heavy event handlers**\n```javascript\n// ❌ All work in handler\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Heavy computation\n  const result = calculateComplexThing();\n  // DOM updates\n  updateUI(result);\n  // Analytics\n  trackEvent(''click'');\n});\n\n// ✅ Prioritize visual feedback\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Immediate visual feedback\n  button.classList.add(''loading'');\n  \n  // Defer non-critical work\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    const result = calculateComplexThing();\n    updateUI(result);\n  });\n  \n  // Use requestIdleCallback for analytics\n  requestIdleCallback(() => trackEvent(''click''));\n});\n```\n\n**3. Third-party scripts**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Eagerly loaded, blocks interactions\n<script src=\"https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js\"></script>\n\n// ✅ Lazy loaded on interaction or visibility\nconst loadWidget = () => {\n  import(''https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js'')\n    .then(widget => widget.init());\n};\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', loadWidget, { once: true });\n```\n\n**4. Excessive re-renders (React/Vue)**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Re-renders entire tree\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <ExpensiveComponent /> {/* Re-renders on every count change */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// ✅ Memoized expensive components\nconst MemoizedExpensive = React.memo(ExpensiveComponent);\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <MemoizedExpensive />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### INP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] No tasks > 50ms on main thread\n- [ ] Event handlers complete quickly (< 100ms)\n- [ ] Visual feedback provided immediately\n- [ ] Heavy work deferred with requestIdleCallback\n- [ ] Third-party scripts don''t block interactions\n- [ ] Debounced input handlers where appropriate\n- [ ] Web Workers for CPU-intensive operations\n```\n\n### INP debugging\n```javascript\n// Identify slow interactions\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (entry.duration > 200) {\n      console.warn(''Slow interaction:'', {\n        type: entry.name,\n        duration: entry.duration,\n        processingStart: entry.processingStart,\n        processingEnd: entry.processingEnd,\n        target: entry.target\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''event'', buffered: true, durationThreshold: 16 });\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLS: Cumulative Layout Shift\n\nCLS measures unexpected layout shifts. A shift occurs when a visible element changes position between frames without user interaction.\n\n**CLS Formula:** `impact fraction × distance fraction`\n\n### Common CLS causes\n\n**1. Images without dimensions**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Causes layout shift when loaded -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Space reserved -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4/3; width: 100%;\">\n```\n\n**2. Ads, embeds, and iframes**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Unknown size until loaded -->\n<iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\"></iframe>\n\n<!-- ✅ Reserve space with min-height -->\n<div style=\"min-height: 250px;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\" height=\"250\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio container -->\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/...\" \n          style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n</div>\n```\n\n**3. Dynamically injected content**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Inserts content above viewport\nnotifications.prepend(newNotification);\n\n// ✅ Insert below viewport or use transform\nconst insertBelow = viewport.bottom < newNotification.top;\nif (insertBelow) {\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n} else {\n  // Animate in without shifting\n  newNotification.style.transform = ''translateY(-100%)'';\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    newNotification.style.transform = '''';\n  });\n}\n```\n\n**4. Web fonts causing FOUT**\n```css\n/* ❌ Font swap shifts text */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n}\n\n/* ✅ Optional font (no shift if slow) */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: optional;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Or match fallback metrics */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 105%; /* Match fallback size */\n  ascent-override: 95%;\n  descent-override: 20%;\n}\n```\n\n**5. Animations triggering layout**\n```css\n/* ❌ Animates layout properties */\n.animate {\n  transition: height 0.3s, width 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Use transform instead */\n.animate {\n  transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n.animate.expanded {\n  transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n```\n\n### CLS optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] All images have width/height or aspect-ratio\n- [ ] All videos/embeds have reserved space\n- [ ] Ads have min-height containers\n- [ ] Fonts use font-display: optional or matched metrics\n- [ ] Dynamic content inserted below viewport\n- [ ] Animations use transform/opacity only\n- [ ] No content injected above existing content\n```\n\n### CLS debugging\n```javascript\n// Track layout shifts\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (!entry.hadRecentInput) {\n      console.log(''Layout shift:'', entry.value);\n      entry.sources?.forEach(source => {\n        console.log(''  Shifted element:'', source.node);\n        console.log(''  Previous rect:'', source.previousRect);\n        console.log(''  Current rect:'', source.currentRect);\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''layout-shift'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Measurement tools\n\n### Lab testing\n- **Chrome DevTools** → Performance panel, Lighthouse\n- **WebPageTest** → Detailed waterfall, filmstrip\n- **Lighthouse CLI** → `npx lighthouse <url>`\n\n### Field data (real users)\n- **Chrome User Experience Report (CrUX)** → BigQuery or API\n- **Search Console** → Core Web Vitals report\n- **web-vitals library** → Send to your analytics\n\n```javascript\nimport {onLCP, onINP, onCLS} from ''web-vitals'';\n\nfunction sendToAnalytics({name, value, rating}) {\n  gtag(''event'', name, {\n    event_category: ''Web Vitals'',\n    value: Math.round(name === ''CLS'' ? value * 1000 : value),\n    event_label: rating\n  });\n}\n\nonLCP(sendToAnalytics);\nonINP(sendToAnalytics);\nonCLS(sendToAnalytics);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Framework quick fixes\n\n### Next.js\n```jsx\n// LCP: Use next/image with priority\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n<Image src=\"/hero.jpg\" priority fill alt=\"Hero\" />\n\n// INP: Use dynamic imports\nconst HeavyComponent = dynamic(() => import(''./Heavy''), { ssr: false });\n\n// CLS: Image component handles dimensions automatically\n```\n\n### React\n```jsx\n// LCP: Preload in head\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.jpg\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n\n// INP: Memoize and useTransition\nconst [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();\nstartTransition(() => setExpensiveState(newValue));\n\n// CLS: Always specify dimensions in img tags\n```\n\n### Vue/Nuxt\n```vue\n<!-- LCP: Use nuxt/image with preload -->\n<NuxtImg src=\"/hero.jpg\" preload loading=\"eager\" />\n\n<!-- INP: Use async components -->\n<component :is=\"() => import(''./Heavy.vue'')\" />\n\n<!-- CLS: Use aspect-ratio CSS -->\n<img :style=\"{ aspectRatio: ''16/9'' }\" />\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [web.dev LCP](https://web.dev/articles/lcp)\n- [web.dev INP](https://web.dev/articles/inp)\n- [web.dev CLS](https://web.dev/articles/cls)\n- [Performance skill](../performance/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:50:38.919Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for SEO Optimization Agents focusing on enhancing user experience through Core Web Vitals metrics like LCP, INP, and CLS.","zh":"适用于专注于通过核心网页指标（如LCP、INP和CLS）提高用户体验的SEO优化代理","ja":"SEO最適化エージェントがコアウェブバイタルズメトリクス（LCP、INP、CLSなど）を使用してユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるのに最適","ko":"LCP, INP, CLS 등의 코어 웹 비탈스 메트릭스를 통해 사용자 경험을 개선하는 SEO 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de optimización de SEO que se centran en mejorar la experiencia del usuario a través de métricas de Core Web Vitals como LCP, INP y CLS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''optimisation de SEO qui se concentrent sur l''amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur à travers des métriques de Core Web Vitals comme LCP, INP et CLS.","de":"Ideal für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die sich auf die Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung durch Core Web Vitals-Metriken wie LCP, INP und CLS konzentrieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização do SEO que se concentram em melhorar a experiência do usuário por meio de métricas de Core Web Vitals como LCP, INP e CLS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации SEO, ориентированных на улучшение пользовательского опыта через метрики Core Web Vitals, такие как LCP, INP и CLS.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحسين محركات البحث التي تركز على تعزيز تجربة المستخدم من خلال مقاييس Core Web Vitals مثل LCP و INP و CLS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize web pages for better Google Search ranking by targeting the 75th percentile of LCP, INP, and CLS metrics, ensuring a smoother and more stable user interface with loading times under 2.5s, interactivity response under 200ms, and visual stability scores under 0.1.","zh":"赋予代理优化网页以提高谷歌搜索排名的能力，通过针对LCP、INP和CLS指标的第75百分位，确保加载时间小于2.5秒、交互响应时间小于200毫秒、视觉稳定性评分小于0.1的更流畅和更稳定的用户界面","ja":"エージェントがWebページを最適化してGoogle検索ランキングを向上させる力を与え、LCP、INP、CLSメトリクスの75パーセントをターゲットにして、ロード時間が2.5秒未満、インタラクティブレスポンスが200ミリ秒未満、視覚的安定性スコアが0.1未満となるようにして、よりスムーズで安定したユーザーインターフェイスを実現","ko":"에이전트가 웹 페이지를 최적화하여 구글 검색 순위를 높이는 기능을 제공하고, LCP, INP 및 CLS 메트릭스의 75번째 백분위수를 대상으로하여 로딩 시간이 2.5초 미만, 상호작용 응답 시간이 200ms 미만, 시각적 안정성 점수가 0.1 미만인 더 부드럽고 안정적인 사용자 인터페이스를 제공","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar las páginas web para una mejor clasificación en la búsqueda de Google, apuntando al percentil 75 de las métricas LCP, INP y CLS, garantizando una interfaz de usuario más suave y estable con tiempos de carga inferiores a 2,5 s, tiempos de respuesta de interactividad inferiores a 200 ms y puntuaciones de estabilidad visual inferiores a 0,1.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les pages Web pour un meilleur classement dans la recherche Google en ciblant le 75e percentile des métriques LCP, INP et CLS, garantissant une interface utilisateur plus fluide et plus stable avec des temps de chargement inférieurs à 2,5 s, des temps de réponse d''interactivité inférieurs à 200 ms et des scores de stabilité visuelle inférieurs à 0,1.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Webseiten für eine bessere Google-Suchmaschinenplatzierung zu optimieren, indem sie auf den 75. Perzentil der LCP-, INP- und CLS-Metriken abzielen, und stellt so eine reibungslosere und stabilere Benutzeroberfläche mit Ladezeiten unter 2,5 s, Interaktivitätsantwortzeiten unter 200 ms und visuellen Stabilitätsscores unter 0,1 sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar páginas da web para um melhor ranqueamento do Google Search, visando o percentil 75 das métricas LCP, INP e CLS, garantindo uma interface do usuário mais suave e estável com tempos de carregamento abaixo de 2,5s, resposta de interatividade abaixo de 200ms e escores de estabilidade visual abaixo de 0,1.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать веб-страницы для лучшего рейтинга поиска Google, ориентируясь на 75-й процентиль метрик LCP, INP и CLS, обеспечивая более плавный и стабильный пользовательский интерфейс с временем загрузки менее 2,5 с, время реакции на взаимодействие менее 200 мс и оценки визуальной стабильности менее 0,1.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من تحسين صفحات الويب لتحسين تصنيف بحث جوجل من خلال استهداف Percentil 75 من مقاييس LCP و INP و CLS، مما يضمن واجهة مستخدم أكثر سلاسة واستقرارًا مع أوقات تحميل أقل من 2.5 ثانية واستجابة تفاعل أقل من 200 مللي ثانية ودرجات استقرار مرئي أقل من 0.1."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing LCP for faster loading times","Improving INP for enhanced interactivity","Enhancing CLS for better visual stability"],"zh":["优化LCP以实现更快的加载时间","提高INP以增强交互性","提高CLS以实现更好的视觉稳定性"],"ja":["LCPを最適化してロード時間を短縮する","INPを向上させてインタラクティブ性を高める","CLSを高めて視覚的安定性を向上させる"],"ko":["LCP를 최적화하여 더 빠른 로딩 시간을实现","INP를 향상시켜 상호작용성을 강화","CLS를 향상시켜 시각적 안정성을 향상"],"es":["Optimizar LCP para tiempos de carga más rápidos","Mejorar INP para una mayor interactividad","Mejorar CLS para una mejor estabilidad visual"],"fr":["Optimiser LCP pour des temps de chargement plus rapides","Améliorer INP pour une interactivité améliorée","Améliorer CLS pour une meilleure stabilité visuelle"],"de":["LCP für schnellere Ladezeiten optimieren","INP für verbesserte Interaktivität verbessern","CLS für bessere visuelle Stabilität verbessern"],"pt":["Otimização do LCP para tempos de carregamento mais rápidos","Melhoria do INP para interatividade aprimorada","Melhoria do CLS para melhor estabilidade visual"],"ru":["Оптимизация LCP для более быстрых времен загрузки","Улучшение INP для повышения интерактивности","Улучшение CLS для лучшей визуальной стабильности"],"ar":["تحسين LCP لأوقات تحميل أسرع","تحسين INP لتفاعل محسّن","تحسين CLS لاستقرار مرئي أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Google Search ranking factors","Metrics are measured at the 75th percentile"],"zh":["需要了解谷歌搜索排名因素","指标在第75百分位处进行测量"],"ja":["Google検索ランキング要因を理解する必要がある","メトリクスは75パーセントで測定される"],"ko":["구글 검색 순위 요인을 이해해야 함","메트릭스는 75번째 백분위에서 측정"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los factores de clasificación de la búsqueda de Google","Las métricas se miden en el percentil 75"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des facteurs de classement de la recherche Google","Les métriques sont mesurées au 75e percentile"],"de":["Erfordert ein Verständnis der Google-Suchmaschinenplatzierungsfaktoren","Die Metriken werden im 75. Perzentil gemessen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos fatores de ranqueamento do Google Search","As métricas são medidas no percentil 75"],"ru":["Требует понимания факторов рейтинга поиска Google","Метрики измеряются на 75-м процентиле"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم عوامل تصنيف بحث جوجل","تُقاس المقاييس في Percentil 75"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ender-Wiggin2019/elo/tfm-add-card', 'community', 'Ender-Wiggin2019', 'elo', 'Ender-Wiggin2019/elo', 'tfm-add-card', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:50:40.258Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ender-Wiggin2019/elo/tfm-add-card","name":"tfm-add-card","description":{"zh":"tfm-add-card 技能提供了将新卡片添加到 TFM 的工作流程，涉及注册、实现和测试","ja":"tfm-add-card スキルは、TFM に新しいカードを追加するためのワークフローを提供し、登録、実装、テストが含まれる","ko":"tfm-add-card 스킬은 TFM에 새로운 카드를 추가하는 워크플로우를 제공하며, 등록, 구현, 테스트가 포함됩니다","es":"La habilidad tfm-add-card permite agregar una nueva tarjeta a TFM siguiendo 4 pasos: registro, implementación, registro en manifiesto y pruebas unitarias","fr":"La compétence tfm-add-card permet d''ajouter une nouvelle carte à TFM en suivant 4 étapes : enregistrement, implémentation, enregistrement dans le manifeste et tests unitaires","de":"Die Fähigkeit tfm-add-card ermöglicht das Hinzufügen einer neuen Karte zu TFM in 4 Schritten: Registrierung, Implementierung, Registrierung im Manifest und Unit-Tests","pt":"O tfm-add-card permite adicionar cartões ao TFM em 4 etapas. Implemente e registre seu cartão com facilidade.","ru":"tfm-add-card позволяет добавлять карты в TFM за 4 этапа. Реализуйте и зарегистрируйте свою карту легко.","ar":"يسمح tfm-add-card بإضافة بطاقات إلى TFM في 4 مراحل. قم بتنفيذ وتسجيل بطاقتك بسهولة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TFM 添加新卡片 - tfm-add-card 技能","ja":"TFM に新しいカードを追加 - tfm-add-card スキル","ko":"TFM 새로운 카드 추가 - tfm-add-card 스킬","es":"Agregar tarjeta a TFM con tfm-add-card","fr":"Ajouter une carte à TFM avec tfm-add-card","de":"Karte zu TFM mit tfm-add-card hinzufügen","pt":"Adicionar Cartão ao TFM com tfm-add-card","ru":"Добавление карты в TFM с помощью tfm-add-card","ar":"إضافة بطاقة إلى TFM باستخدام tfm-add-card","en":"tfm-add-card"},"description":{"zh":"tfm-add-card 技能提供了将新卡片添加到 TFM 的工作流程，涉及注册、实现和测试","ja":"tfm-add-card スキルは、TFM に新しいカードを追加するためのワークフローを提供し、登録、実装、テストが含まれる","ko":"tfm-add-card 스킬은 TFM에 새로운 카드를 추가하는 워크플로우를 제공하며, 등록, 구현, 테스트가 포함됩니다","es":"La habilidad tfm-add-card permite agregar una nueva tarjeta a TFM siguiendo 4 pasos: registro, implementación, registro en manifiesto y pruebas unitarias","fr":"La compétence tfm-add-card permet d''ajouter une nouvelle carte à TFM en suivant 4 étapes : enregistrement, implémentation, enregistrement dans le manifeste e...","de":"Die Fähigkeit tfm-add-card ermöglicht das Hinzufügen einer neuen Karte zu TFM in 4 Schritten: Registrierung, Implementierung, Registrierung im Manifest und U...","pt":"O tfm-add-card permite adicionar cartões ao TFM em 4 etapas. Implemente e registre seu cartão com facilidade.","ru":"tfm-add-card позволяет добавлять карты в TFM за 4 этапа. Реализуйте и зарегистрируйте свою карту легко.","ar":"يسمح tfm-add-card بإضافة بطاقات إلى TFM في 4 مراحل. قم بتنفيذ وتسجيل بطاقتك بسهولة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["注册卡名","实现卡片","注册清单","编写单元测试"],"ja":["カード名の登録","カードの実装","マニフェストの登録","ユニットテストの記述"],"ko":["카드 이름 등록","카드 구현","매니페스트 등록","유닛 테스트 작성"],"es":["Registro de nombre de tarjeta","Implementación de la tarjeta","Registro en manifiesto","Pruebas unitarias"],"fr":["Enregistrement du nom de la carte","Implémentation de la carte","Enregistrement dans le manifeste","Tests unitaires"],"de":["Registrierung des Kartennamens","Implementierung der Karte","Registrierung im Manifest","Unit-Tests"],"pt":["Registro do nome do cartão","Implementação do cartão","Registro no manifesto","Escrita de testes unitários"],"ru":["Регистрация имени карты","Реализация карты","Регистрация в манифесте","Написание юнит-тестов"],"ar":["تسجيل اسم البطاقة","تنفيذ البطاقة","التسجيل في الملف التأشيري","كتابة الاختبارات الوحدوية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TFM","添加新卡片","tfm-add-card","注册卡名","实现卡片","注册清单"],"ja":["TFM","新しいカードを追加","tfm-add-card","カード名の登録","カードの実装","マニフェストの登録"],"ko":["TFM","새로운 카드 추가","tfm-add-card","카드 이름 등록","카드 구현","매니페스트 등록"],"es":["tfm-add-card","agregar tarjeta a TFM","desarrollo de tarjetas","TFM","tarjetas de juego","desarrollo de juegos"],"fr":["tfm-add-card","ajouter une carte à TFM","développement de cartes","TFM","cartes de jeu","développement de jeux"],"de":["tfm-add-card","Karte zu TFM hinzufügen","Kartenerstellung","TFM","Spielkarten","Spieleentwicklung"],"pt":["tfm-add-card","adicionar cartão","TFM","cartão","desenvolvimento","implementação"],"ru":["tfm-add-card","добавление карты","TFM","карта","разработка","реализация"],"ar":["tfm-add-card","إضافة بطاقة","TFM","بطاقة","التطوير","التنفيذ"]}},"owner":"Ender-Wiggin2019","repo":"elo","repoPath":"Ender-Wiggin2019/elo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tfm-add-card","description":"Guide for adding a new card to the TFM (Terraforming Mars) project. Use when the user wants to create, add, or implement a new card — including project cards (IProjectCard), corporation cards (CorporationCard), or any card type. Covers CardName registration, card implementation, manifest registration, and the CardRenderer DSL.","bodyPreview":"# Add a New Card to TFM\n\n## Workflow\n\nAdding a card requires exactly 4 steps:\n\n1. **Register the card name** in `src/common/cards/CardName.ts`\n2. **Implement the card** in `src/server/cards/commission/<CardName>.ts`\n3. **Register in manifest** in `src/server/cards/commission/CommissionCardManifest.ts`\n4. **Write unit tests** in `tests/cards/commission/<CardName>.spec.ts`\n\nBefore implementing, confirm with the user:\n- Card name and display name\n- Card type: `CorporationCard` or `IProjectCard` (an","body":"# Add a New Card to TFM\n\n## Workflow\n\nAdding a card requires exactly 4 steps:\n\n1. **Register the card name** in `src/common/cards/CardName.ts`\n2. **Implement the card** in `src/server/cards/commission/<CardName>.ts`\n3. **Register in manifest** in `src/server/cards/commission/CommissionCardManifest.ts`\n4. **Write unit tests** in `tests/cards/commission/<CardName>.spec.ts`\n\nBefore implementing, confirm with the user:\n- Card name and display name\n- Card type: `CorporationCard` or `IProjectCard` (and sub-type: `ACTIVE`, `AUTOMATED`, `EVENT`. Somethings User may ask for \"蓝卡\", \"绿卡\", which means: Blue -> Active, Green -> Automated, Red -> Event)\n- Tags, cost, requirements, victory points\n- Card effect/ability (exact mechanics and numerical values)\n- Card number (XB series)\n\nIf any detail is unclear or ambiguous, **ask the user to clarify before proceeding**.\n\n## Step 1: Register Card Name\n\nAdd an entry to the `CardName` enum in `src/common/cards/CardName.ts`.\n\nCommission cards use `🌸` prefix/suffix in the display string. Find the commission card section (near line 626+) and append:\n\n```typescript\n// In the commission cards section of CardName enum:\nMY_NEW_CARD = ''🌸My New Card🌸'',\n```\n\nNaming conventions:\n- Enum key: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`\n- Value: `''🌸Display Name🌸''` (Chinese names are also acceptable, e.g. `''🌸城电转能🌸''`)\n\n## Step 2: Implement the Card\n\nCreate a new file in `src/server/cards/commission/`. File name uses **UpperCamelCase** (e.g. `MyNewCard.ts`).\n\n### Determine Card Type\n\nRead the card details to determine which base class to use:\n\n| Type | Base Class | Implements | When to Use |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Corporation | `CorporationCard` | `ICorporationCard` | Cards with `startingMegaCredits`, corp-level effects |\n| Active Corp | `ActiveCorporationCard` | `ICorporationCard` + `IActionCard` | Corp cards with per-turn `action()` |\n| Project (Active) | `Card` | `IProjectCard` | Blue cards with ongoing effects or actions |\n| Project (Automated) | `Card` | `IProjectCard` | Green cards with one-time effects |\n| Project (Event) | `Card` | `IProjectCard` | Red cards with one-time effects |\n| Project w/ Action | `ActionCard` | `IProjectCard` + has `action` behavior | Blue cards with data-driven action |\n\n### Template: Corporation Card\n\n```typescript\nimport {Tag} from ''../../../common/cards/Tag'';\nimport {IPlayer} from ''../../IPlayer'';\nimport {CardName} from ''../../../common/cards/CardName'';\nimport {CardRenderer} from ''../render/CardRenderer'';\nimport {CorporationCard} from ''../corporation/CorporationCard'';\n\nexport class MyCorpCard extends CorporationCard {\n  constructor() {\n    super({\n      name: CardName.MY_CORP_CARD,\n      tags: [Tag.SCIENCE],\n      startingMegaCredits: 50,\n      // Optional: initialActionText for first action description\n      // initialActionText: ''Draw 1 card with a science tag'',\n\n      metadata: {\n        cardNumber: ''XB??'',\n        description: ''You start with 50 M€.'',\n        renderData: CardRenderer.builder((b) => {\n          b.megacredits(50);\n          b.corpBox(''effect'', (ce) => {\n            ce.effect(''description of effect'', (eb) => {\n              eb.cards(1).startEffect.megacredits(1);\n            });\n          });\n        }),\n      },\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Override for first-action corps\n  // public override initialAction(player: IPlayer) { ... }\n\n  // For effects triggered when any player plays a card:\n  // public onCardPlayedByAnyPlayer(owner: IPlayer, card: ICard, currentPlayer: IPlayer) { ... }\n\n  // For effects triggered when this corp''s owner plays a card:\n  // public onCardPlayedForCorps(player: IPlayer, card: ICard) { ... }\n}\n```\n\n### Template: Project Card (IProjectCard)\n\n```typescript\nimport {CardName} from ''../../../common/cards/CardName'';\nimport {CardType} from ''../../../common/cards/CardType'';\nimport {Tag} from ''../../../common/cards/Tag'';\nimport {CardRenderer} from ''../render/CardRenderer'';\nimport {Card} from ''../Card'';\nimport {IProjectCard} from ''../IProjectCard'';\n\nexport class MyProjectCard extends Card implements IProjectCard {\n  constructor() {\n    super({\n      name: CardName.MY_PROJECT_CARD,\n      type: CardType.ACTIVE,       // or AUTOMATED, EVENT\n      tags: [Tag.BUILDING],\n      cost: 15,\n      // victoryPoints: 1,          // static VP\n      // requirements: {tag: Tag.SCIENCE, count: 2},  // requirements\n\n      // For simple effects, use behavior instead of bespokePlay:\n      // behavior: {\n      //   production: {energy: 1},\n      //   stock: {megacredits: 3},\n      //   global: {temperature: 1},\n      //   drawCard: 1,\n      // },\n\n      metadata: {\n        cardNumber: ''XB??'',\n        // description: ''Requires 2 science tags. ...'',\n        renderData: CardRenderer.builder((b) => {\n          b.effect(''When you play a building tag, gain 2 M€.'', (eb) => {\n            eb.tag(Tag.BUILDING).startEffect.megacredits(2);\n          });\n        }),\n      },\n    });\n  }\n\n  // --- Callback methods (choose what applies) ---\n\n  // For ACTIVE cards with a player action:\n  // public canAct(player: IPlayer): boolean { return true; }\n  // public action(player: IPlayer) { return undefined; }\n\n  // For triggered effects when this card''s owner plays a card:\n  // public onCardPlayed(player: IPlayer, card: IProjectCard) { ... }\n\n  // For triggered effects when any tile is placed:\n  // public onTilePlaced(cardOwner: IPlayer, activePlayer: IPlayer, space: Space) { ... }\n\n  // For card cost discounts:\n  // public override getCardDiscount(player: IPlayer, card: ICard): number { return 0; }\n\n  // For custom VP calculation:\n  // public override getVictoryPoints(player: IPlayer): number { return 0; }\n}\n```\n\n### Common Patterns Reference\n\nSee `references/card-patterns.md` for detailed examples of common card patterns including:\n- Cards with `behavior` (declarative effects)\n- Cards with `onCardPlayed` / `onCardPlayedByAnyPlayer` callbacks\n- Cards with `onTilePlaced` callbacks\n- Cards with `canAct()` / `action()` (blue card actions)\n- Cards with `getCardDiscount()`\n- Cards with requirements\n- Corporation cards with `initialAction` and `corpBox`\n\n## Step 3: Register in Manifest\n\nEdit `src/server/cards/commission/CommissionCardManifest.ts`:\n\n1. Add import at top:\n```typescript\nimport {MyNewCard} from ''./MyNewCard'';\n```\n\n2. Add entry in the appropriate section of `COMMISSION_CARD_MANIFEST`:\n\nFor corporation cards:\n```typescript\ncorporationCards: {\n  // ... existing entries\n  [CardName.MY_NEW_CARD]: {Factory: MyNewCard}, // XB??\n},\n```\n\nFor project cards:\n```typescript\nprojectCards: {\n  // ... existing entries\n  [CardName.MY_NEW_CARD]: {Factory: MyNewCard}, // XB??\n},\n```\n\nOptional: add `compatibility` for expansion-dependent cards:\n```typescript\n[CardName.MY_NEW_CARD]: {Factory: MyNewCard, compatibility: ''turmoil''},\n```\n\n## Step 4: Write Unit Tests\n\nCreate a test file at `tests/cards/commission/<CardName>.spec.ts`.\n\n### Test Command\n\nRun tests for a single card:\n```bash\nnpx ts-mocha -p tests/tsconfig.json --reporter-option maxDiffSize=256 -r tests/testing/setup.ts tests/cards/commission/<CardName>.spec.ts\n```\n\nRun all commission card tests:\n```bash\nnpx ts-mocha -p tests/tsconfig.json --reporter-option maxDiffSize=256 -r tests/testing/setup.ts ''tests/cards/commission/**/*.spec.ts''\n```\n\n### Test Template\n\n```typescript\nimport {expect} from ''chai'';\nimport {MyCard} from ''../../../src/server/cards/commission/MyCard'';\nimport {testGame} from ''../../TestGame'';\nimport {TestPlayer} from ''../../TestPlayer'';\nimport {runAllActions, cast} from ''../../TestingUtils'';\nimport {IGame} from ''../../../src/server/IGame'';\nimport {Tag} from ''../../../src/common/cards/Tag'';\nimport {CardType} from ''../../../src/common/cards/CardType'';\nimport {Resource} from ''../../../src/common/Resource'';\n\ndescribe(''MyCard'', () => {\n  let card: MyCard;\n  let player: TestPlayer;\n  let game: IGame;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    card = new MyCard();\n    [game, player] = testGame(2, {skipInitialShuffling: true});\n    player.megaCredits = 100;\n  });\n\n  it(''basic properties'', () => {\n    expect(card.cost).to.eq(15);\n    expect(card.type).to.eq(CardType.ACTIVE);\n    expect(card.tags).to.deep.eq([Tag.BUILDING]);\n  });\n\n  it(''should apply initial behavior on play'', () => {\n    player.playCard(card);\n    runAllActions(game);\n    // Assert production, stock, or other changes\n  });\n\n  // Add more tests for each card effect/ability\n});\n```\n\n### Testing Tips\n\n- Use `testGame(n, {skipInitialShuffling: true})` for deterministic setup\n- Use `runAllActions(game)` after play/actions to resolve deferred actions\n- Use `cast(input, OrOptions)` to type-check player input responses\n- Use `player.popWaitingFor()` to get pending player input\n- When setting `card.resourceCount` manually, do so **after** `runAllActions(game)` to avoid other card triggers (e.g. Decomposers) interfering\n- **Known engine limitation**: `play()` fires **before** the card is added to `playedCards`, so `onProductionGain` / other tableau callbacks won''t self-trigger during initial play (the \"including this\" pattern)\n- For corporation card tests, use `player.playCorporationCard(card)` instead of `player.playCard(card)`\n- For testing `canAct()` / `action()`, manually set up the required state (resources, cards, etc.) then call the methods directly\n\n## Key Imports Quick Reference\n\n```typescript\n// Common imports for card implementation\nimport {CardName} from ''../../../common/cards/CardName'';\nimport {CardType} from ''../../../common/cards/CardType'';\nimport {Tag} from ''../../../common/cards/Tag'';\nimport {Resource} from ''../../../common/Resource'';\nimport {CardResource} from ''../../../common/CardResource'';\nimport {CardRenderer} from ''../render/CardRenderer'';\nimport {Size} from ''../../../common/cards/render/Size'';\nimport {AltSecondaryTag} from ''../../../common/cards/render/AltSecondaryTag'';\nimport {Card} from ''../Card'';\nimport {IProjectCard} from ''../IProjectCard'';\nimport {ICard} from ''../ICard'';\nimport {IPlayer} from ''../../IPlayer'';\nimport {CorporationCard} from ''../corporation/CorporationCard'';\nimport {Board} from ''../../boards/Board'';\nimport {Space} from ''../../boards/Space'';\n```\n\n## CardRenderer DSL Quick Reference\n\n**Resources:** `megacredits(n)`, `steel(n)`, `titanium(n)`, `plants(n)`, `energy(n)`, `heat(n)`, `cards(n)`, `tr(n)`\n\n**Global params:** `temperature(n)`, `oxygen(n)`, `oceans(n)`, `venus(n)`\n\n**Tiles:** `city()`, `greenery()`, `emptyTile()`, `specialTile()`\n\n**Tags:** `tag(Tag.XXX)`, `wild(n)`, `noTags()`\n\n**Production:** `production((pb) => { pb.energy(1); })`\n\n**Layout:** `.br` (line break), `.nbsp`, `vSpace(size?)`, `text(str)`, `vpText(str)`\n\n**Effect box:** `effect(desc, (eb) => { eb.cause.startEffect.result })`\n\n**Action box:** `action(desc, (eb) => { eb.cost.startAction.result })`\n\n**Corp box:** `corpBox(''effect''|''action'', (ce) => { ce.effect(...) })`\n\n**Options:** `{all: true}` any player, `{secondaryTag: Tag.XXX}`, `{size: Size.SMALL}`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:50:40.258Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript Agents needing to extend TFM card functionality with custom implementations.","zh":"非常适合需要使用自定义实现扩展TFM卡片功能的TypeScript代理。","ja":"TFMカードの機能をカスタム実装で拡張する必要があるTypeScriptエージェントに最適です。","ko":"TFM 카드 기능을 사용자 지정 구현으로 확장해야 하는 TypeScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de TypeScript que necesitan ampliar la funcionalidad de la tarjeta TFM con implementaciones personalizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents TypeScript ayant besoin d''étendre la fonctionnalité de la carte TFM avec des implémentations personnalisées.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-Agents, die die Funktionalität der TFM-Karte mit benutzerdefinierten Implementierungen erweitern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes TypeScript que precisam estender a funcionalidade do cartão TFM com implementações personalizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов TypeScript, которым необходимо расширить функциональность карты TFM с помощью пользовательских реализаций.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء TypeScript الذين يحتاجون إلى توسيع وظائف بطاقة TFM مع التطبيقات المخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement new cards in TFM by registering card names in CardName.ts, implementing card logic in CommissionCardManifest.ts, and writing unit tests in .spec.ts files, utilizing TypeScript for robust card development and integration with CommissionCardManifest.","zh":"使代理能够通过在CardName.ts中注册卡片名称、在CommissionCardManifest.ts中实现卡片逻辑以及在.spec.ts文件中编写单元测试来实现TFM中的新卡片，利用TypeScript进行强大的卡片开发和与CommissionCardManifest的集成。","ja":"エージェントがCardName.tsでカード名を登録し、CommissionCardManifest.tsでカードロジックを実装し、.spec.tsファイルでユニットテストを記述することで、TFMで新しいカードを実装できるようにし、TypeScriptを使用して強力なカード開発とCommissionCardManifestとの統合を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 CardName.ts에서 카드 이름을 등록하고 CommissionCardManifest.ts에서 카드 논리를 구현하고 .spec.ts 파일에서 유닛 테스트를 작성하여 TFM에서 새로운 카드를 구현할 수 있도록 하며 TypeScript를 사용하여 강력한 카드 개발 및 CommissionCardManifest와의 통합을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar nuevas tarjetas en TFM mediante el registro de nombres de tarjetas en CardName.ts, la implementación de la lógica de la tarjeta en CommissionCardManifest.ts y la escritura de pruebas unitarias en archivos .spec.ts, utilizando TypeScript para un desarrollo y una integración de tarjetas robustos con CommissionCardManifest.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre de nouvelles cartes dans TFM en enregistrant les noms de cartes dans CardName.ts, en implémentant la logique de carte dans CommissionCardManifest.ts et en écrivant des tests unitaires dans des fichiers .spec.ts, en utilisant TypeScript pour un développement et une intégration de cartes robustes avec CommissionCardManifest.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Karten in TFM zu implementieren, indem sie Kartennamen in CardName.ts registrieren, Kartenlogik in CommissionCardManifest.ts implementieren und Einheitstests in .spec.ts-Dateien schreiben, wobei TypeScript für eine robuste Kartenentwicklung und -integration mit CommissionCardManifest verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar novos cartões no TFM registrando nomes de cartões em CardName.ts, implementando lógica de cartão em CommissionCardManifest.ts e escrevendo testes unitários em arquivos .spec.ts, utilizando TypeScript para desenvolvimento de cartões robusto e integração com CommissionCardManifest.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать новые карты в TFM, регистрируя имена карт в CardName.ts, реализуя логику карты в CommissionCardManifest.ts и пишет модульные тесты в файлах .spec.ts, используя TypeScript для надежного разработки карт и интеграции с CommissionCardManifest.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ بطاقات جديدة في TFM عن طريق تسجيل أسماء البطاقات في CardName.ts، وتنفيذ منطق البطاقة في CommissionCardManifest.ts، وكتابة الاختبارات الوحدوية في ملفات .spec.ts، مستخدمين TypeScript من أجل تطوير بطاقات قوي وتكامل مع CommissionCardManifest."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom CorporationCard logic","Registering new IProjectCard types","Writing unit tests for commission card functionality"],"zh":["实现自定义CorporationCard逻辑","注册新的IProjectCard类型","为委托卡功能编写单元测试"],"ja":["カスタムCorporationCardロジックの実装","新しいIProjectCardタイプの登録","委託カード機能のユニットテストの記述"],"ko":["사용자 지정 CorporationCard 논리 구현","새로운 IProjectCard 유형 등록","위임 카드 기능을 위한 유닛 테스트 작성"],"es":["Implementación de lógica personalizada de CorporationCard","Registro de nuevos tipos de IProjectCard","Escritura de pruebas unitarias para la funcionalidad de la tarjeta de comisión"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de la logique personnalisée de CorporationCard","Enregistrement de nouveaux types de IProjectCard","Écriture de tests unitaires pour la fonctionnalité de la carte de commission"],"de":["Implementierung von benutzerdefinierter CorporationCard-Logik","Registrierung neuer IProjectCard-Typen","Schreiben von Einheitstests für die Funktionalität der Kommissionskarte"],"pt":["Implementar lógica personalizada de CorporationCard","Registrar novos tipos de IProjectCard","Escrever testes unitários para funcionalidade de cartão de comissão"],"ru":["Реализовать пользовательскую логику CorporationCard","Зарегистрировать новые типы IProjectCard","Написать модульные тесты для функциональности карты комиссии"],"ar":["تنفيذ منطق مخصص للبطاقة الشركات","تسجيل أنواع جديدة من IProjectCard","كتابة الاختبارات الوحدوية لوظيفة بطاقة العمولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires modification of specific TFM files (CardName.ts, CommissionCardManifest.ts, .spec.ts)","Limited to TFM ecosystem","Demands exact 4-step workflow for card addition"],"zh":["需要修改特定的TFM文件（CardName.ts、CommissionCardManifest.ts、.spec.ts）","仅限于TFM生态系统","需要精确的4步工作流程来添加卡片"],"ja":["特定のTFMファイル（CardName.ts、CommissionCardManifest.ts、.spec.ts）を修正する必要がある","TFMエコシステムのみに限定される","カードの追加には正確な4ステップのワークフローが必要"],"ko":["특정 TFM 파일(CardName.ts, CommissionCardManifest.ts, .spec.ts)을 수정해야 함","TFM 생태계에만 제한됨","카드 추가를 위해 정확한 4단계 워크플로가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la modificación de archivos TFM específicos (CardName.ts, CommissionCardManifest.ts, .spec.ts)","Limitado al ecosistema TFM","Exige un flujo de trabajo exacto de 4 pasos para la adición de tarjetas"],"fr":["Nécessite la modification de fichiers TFM spécifiques (CardName.ts, CommissionCardManifest.ts, .spec.ts)","Limité à l''écosystème TFM","Exige un flux de travail exact de 4 étapes pour l''ajout de cartes"],"de":["Erfordert die Modifizierung spezifischer TFM-Dateien (CardName.ts, CommissionCardManifest.ts, .spec.ts)","Begrenzt auf das TFM-Ökosystem","Fordert einen exakten 4-Schritte-Arbeitsablauf für die Hinzufügung von Karten"],"pt":["Exige modificação de arquivos TFM específicos (CardName.ts, CommissionCardManifest.ts, .spec.ts)","Limitado ao ecossistema TFM","Exige fluxo de trabalho exato de 4 etapas para adição de cartão"],"ru":["Требует изменения определенных файлов TFM (CardName.ts, CommissionCardManifest.ts, .spec.ts)","Ограничен экосистемой TFM","Требует точного 4-этапного рабочего процесса для добавления карты"],"ar":["يتطلب تعديل ملفات TFM محددة (CardName.ts، CommissionCardManifest.ts، .spec.ts)","محدود بنظام التFM","يتطلب سير عمل دقيق من 4 خطوات لإضافة بطاقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('PaoloQuaranta/Webarmonium/copywriting', 'community', 'PaoloQuaranta', 'Webarmonium', 'PaoloQuaranta/Webarmonium', 'copywriting', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:50:38.357Z', NULL, '{"id":"PaoloQuaranta/Webarmonium/copywriting","name":"copywriting","description":{"zh":"作为专业的转化率文案写作专家，撰写清晰、引人入胜的文案，驱动开发者采取行动。","ja":"開発者向けの明確で魅力的なコピーライティングを作成し、行動を促す。","ko":"개발자를 위한 명확하고 매력적인 카피라이팅을 작성하여 행동을 유도합니다.","es":"El copywriting es la técnica de escribir textos que impulsan la acción. Aprende a escribir marketing copy claro y atractivo","fr":"Le copywriting est la technique d''écriture de textes qui impulsen l''action. Apprenez à écrire du marketing copy clair et attrayant","de":"Copywriting ist die Technik, Texte zu schreiben, die zur Aktion anregen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Marketing-Texte schreiben, die klar und ansprechend sind","pt":"O copywriting é uma técnica de escrita de marketing que visa impulsionar conversões. Aprenda a criar conteúdo claro e atraente.","ru":"Копирайтинг - это техника написания маркетингового текста, направленная на увеличение конверсий. Узнайте, как создать ясный и привлекательный контент.","ar":"كتابة المحتوى هي تقنية كتابة تسويقية تهدف إلى زيادة التحويلات. تعلم كيفية إنشاء محتوى واضح وجذاب","en":"Real-time generative music from internet activity.  Webarmonium transforms live data streams into music and enables collaborative music creation through gestures. No account needed, completely free."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"开发者文案写作技巧","ja":"開発者向けコピーライティング","ko":"개발자를 위한 카피라이팅","es":"Copywriting efectivo para desarrolladores","fr":"Copywriting efficace pour les développeurs","de":"Effektives Copywriting für Entwickler","pt":"Copywriting: Escreva Marketing Copy de Conversão","ru":"Копирайтинг: Напишите Маркетинговый Текст для Конверсии","ar":"كتابة المحتوى: اكتب نص تسويقي لتحويل","en":"copywriting"},"description":{"zh":"作为专业的转化率文案写作专家，撰写清晰、引人入胜的文案，驱动开发者采取行动。","ja":"開発者向けの明確で魅力的なコピーライティングを作成し、行動を促す。","ko":"개발자를 위한 명확하고 매력적인 카피라이팅을 작성하여 행동을 유도합니다.","es":"El copywriting es la técnica de escribir textos que impulsan la acción. Aprende a escribir marketing copy claro y atractivo","fr":"Le copywriting est la technique d''écriture de textes qui impulsen l''action. Apprenez à écrire du marketing copy clair et attrayant","de":"Copywriting ist die Technik, Texte zu schreiben, die zur Aktion anregen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Marketing-Texte schreiben, die klar und ansprechend sind","pt":"O copywriting é uma técnica de escrita de marketing que visa impulsionar conversões. Aprenda a criar conteúdo claro e atraente.","ru":"Копирайтинг - это техника написания маркетингового текста, направленная на увеличение конверсий. Узнайте, как создать ясный и привлекательный контент.","ar":"كتابة المحتوى هي تقنية كتابة تسويقية تهدف إلى زيادة التحويلات. تعلم كيفية إنشاء محتوى واضح وجذاب","en":"Real-time generative music from internet activity.  Webarmonium transforms live data streams into music and enables collaborative music creation through gest..."},"definition":{"en":"Real-time generative music from internet activity.  Webarmonium transforms live data streams into music and enables collaborative music creation through gestures. No account needed, completely free."},"features":{"zh":["清晰的页面目的","理想客户识别","问题解决方案","行动驱动文案","开发者营销策略"],"ja":["ページの目的の明確化","理想顧客の特定","問題解決方案","行動を促すコピーライティング","開発者向けマーケティング戦略"],"ko":["페이지 목적의 명확화","理想고객의 특정","문제해결方案","행동을 유도하는 카피라이팅","개발자를 위한 마케팅 전략"],"es":["Técnicas de copywriting para desarrolladores","Escribir marketing copy claro y atractivo","Impulsar la acción en los visitantes","Crear textos que promueven un producto o servicio","Mejorar la conversión con copywriting efectivo","Aprender a escribir para diferentes tipos de páginas"],"fr":["Techniques de copywriting pour les développeurs","Écrire du marketing copy clair et attrayant","Impulser l''action chez les visiteurs","Créer des textes qui promeuvent un produit ou un service","Améliorer la conversion avec un copywriting efficace","Apprendre à écrire pour différents types de pages"],"de":["Copywriting-Techniken für Entwickler","Schreiben von Marketing-Texten, die klar und ansprechend sind","Zur Aktion anregen bei den Besuchern","Erstellen von Texten, die ein Produkt oder eine Dienstleistung bewerben","Verbessern der Konvertierung mit effektivem Copywriting","Erfahren, wie man für verschiedene Arten von Seiten schreibt"],"pt":["Técnicas de escrita de marketing eficaz","Dicas para criar conteúdo atraente","Estratégias para impulsionar conversões","Análise de público-alvo","Otimização de texto para motores de busca"],"ru":["Техники написания эффективного маркетингового текста","Советы для создания привлекательного контента","Стратегии для увеличения конверсий","Анализ целевой аудитории","Оптимизация текста для поисковых систем"],"ar":["تقنيات كتابة نص تسويقي فعال","نصائح لإنشاء محتوى جذاب","استراتيجيات لزيادة التحويلات","تحليل الجمهور المستهدف","تحسين النص للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["开发者文案写作","转化率优化","开发者营销","清晰文案","行动驱动文案","开发者向けコピーライティング"],"ja":["開発者向けコピーライティング","コンバージョン率最適化","開発者マーケティング","明確なコピーライティング","行動を促すコピーライティング","開発者向けマーケティング戦略"],"ko":["개발자를 위한 카피라이팅","コンバージョン率 최적화","개발자를 위한 마케팅","명확한 카피라이팅","행동을 유도하는 카피라이팅","개발자를 위한 마케팅 전략"],"es":["copywriting para desarrolladores","técnicas de copywriting","marketing copy","escribir para la web","conversión en la web","copywriting efectivo","desarrollo web","contenido de marketing","redacción publicitaria"],"fr":["copywriting pour les développeurs","techniques de copywriting","marketing copy","écrire pour le web","conversion sur le web","copywriting efficace","développement web","contenu de marketing","rédaction publicitaire"],"de":["Copywriting für Entwickler","Copywriting-Techniken","Marketing-Texte","Schreiben für das Web","Konvertierung im Web","effektives Copywriting","Web-Entwicklung","Marketing-Inhalt","Werbetexte schreiben"],"pt":["copywriting","marketing de conversão","escrita de marketing","conteúdo atraente","otimização de texto","análise de público-alvo"],"ru":["копирайтинг","маркетинг конверсии","написание маркетингового текста","привлекательный контент","оптимизация текста","анализ целевой аудитории"],"ar":["كتابة المحتوى","تسويق التحويل","كتابة نص تسويقي","محتوى جذاب","تحسين النص","تحليل الجمهور المستهدف"]}},"owner":"PaoloQuaranta","repo":"Webarmonium","repoPath":"PaoloQuaranta/Webarmonium","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriting","description":"When the user wants to write, rewrite, or improve marketing copy for any page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, about pages, or product pages. Also use when the user says write copy for, improve this copy, rewrite this page, marketing copy, headline help, or CTA copy. For email copy, see email-sequence. For popup copy, see popup-cro.","bodyPreview":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solv","body":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page is this? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n- What''s the secondary action (if any)?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer for this page?\n- What problem are they trying to solve?\n- What have they already tried?\n- What objections or hesitations do they have?\n- What language do they use to describe their problem?\n\n### 3. Product/Offer\n- What are you selling or offering?\n- What makes it different from alternatives?\n- What''s the key transformation or outcome?\n- Any proof points (numbers, testimonials, case studies)?\n\n### 4. Context\n- Where is traffic coming from? (ads, organic, email)\n- What do visitors already know before arriving?\n- What messaging are they seeing before this page?\n\n---\n\n## Copywriting Principles\n\n### Clarity Over Cleverness\n- If you have to choose between clear and creative, choose clear\n- Every sentence should have one job\n- Remove words that don''t add meaning\n\n### Benefits Over Features\n- Features: What it does\n- Benefits: What that means for the customer\n- Always connect features to outcomes\n\n### Specificity Over Vagueness\n- Vague: \"Save time on your workflow\"\n- Specific: \"Cut your weekly reporting from 4 hours to 15 minutes\"\n\n### Customer Language Over Company Language\n- Use words your customers use\n- Avoid jargon unless your audience uses it\n- Mirror voice-of-customer from reviews, interviews, support tickets\n\n### One Idea Per Section\n- Don''t try to say everything everywhere\n- Each section should advance one argument\n- Build a logical flow down the page\n\n---\n\n## Writing Style Rules\n\nFollow these core principles. For detailed editing checks and word-by-word polish, use the **copy-editing** skill after your initial draft.\n\n### Core Style Principles\n\n1. **Simple over complex** — Use everyday words. \"Use\" instead of \"utilize,\" \"help\" instead of \"facilitate.\"\n\n2. **Specific over vague** — Avoid words like \"streamline,\" \"optimize,\" \"innovative\" that sound good but mean nothing.\n\n3. **Active over passive** — \"We generate reports\" not \"Reports are generated.\"\n\n4. **Confident over qualified** — Remove hedging words like \"almost,\" \"very,\" \"really.\"\n\n5. **Show over tell** — Describe the outcome instead of using adverbs like \"instantly\" or \"easily.\"\n\n6. **Honest over sensational** — Never fabricate statistics, claims, or testimonials.\n\n### Quick Quality Check\n\nBefore finalizing, scan for:\n- Jargon that could confuse outsiders\n- Sentences trying to do too much (max 3 conjunctions)\n- Passive voice constructions\n- Exclamation points (remove them)\n- Marketing buzzwords without substance\n\nFor a thorough line-by-line review, run the copy through the **copy-editing** skill''s Seven Sweeps framework.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Be Direct\nGet to the point. Don''t bury the value in qualifications.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot? Send as many documents, images, and audio files as your heart desires.\n\n### Use Rhetorical Questions\nQuestions engage readers and make them think about their own situation.\n\n✅ Hate returning stuff to Amazon?\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot?\n\n✅ Tired of chasing approvals?\n\n### Use Analogies and Metaphors\nWhen appropriate, analogies make abstract concepts concrete and memorable.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Imagine Slack''s file-sharing as a digital whiteboard where everyone can post files, images, and updates in real time.\n\n### Pepper in Humor (When Appropriate)\nPuns, wit, and humor make copy memorable—but only if it fits the brand and doesn''t undermine clarity.\n\n---\n\n## Page Structure Framework\n\n### Above the Fold (First Screen)\n\n**Headline**\n- Your single most important message\n- Should communicate core value proposition\n- Specific > generic\n\n**Headline Formulas:**\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} without {pain point}**\n*Example: Understand how users are really experiencing your site without drowning in numbers*\n\n**The {opposite of usual process} way to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: The easiest way to turn your passion into income*\n\n**Never {unpleasant event} again**\n*Example: Never miss a sales opportunity again*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience}**\n*Example: Advanced analytics for Shopify e-commerce*\n\n**{Key feature/product type} for {target audience} to {what it''s used for}**\n*Example: An online whiteboard for teams to ideate and brainstorm together*\n\n**You don''t have to {skills or resources} to {achieve desirable outcome}**\n*Example: With Ahrefs, you don''t have to be an SEO pro to rank higher and get more traffic*\n\n**{Achieve desirable outcome} by {how product makes it possible}**\n*Example: Generate more leads by seeing which companies visit your site*\n\n**{Key benefit of your product}**\n*Example: Sound clear in online meetings*\n\n**{Question highlighting the main pain point}**\n*Example: Hate returning stuff to Amazon?*\n\n**Turn {input} into {outcome}**\n*Example: Turn your hard-earned sales into repeat customers*\n\n**Additional formulas:**\n- \"[Achieve outcome] in [timeframe]\"\n- \"The [category] that [key differentiator]\"\n- \"Stop [pain]. Start [pleasure].\"\n- \"[Number] [people] use [product] to [outcome]\"\n\n**Subheadline**\n- Expands on the headline\n- Adds specificity or addresses secondary concern\n- 1-2 sentences max\n\n**Primary CTA**\n- Action-oriented button text\n- Communicate what they get, not what they do\n- \"Start Free Trial\" > \"Sign Up\"\n- \"Get Your Report\" > \"Submit\"\n\n**Supporting Visual**\n- Product screenshot, demo, or hero image\n- Should reinforce the message, not distract\n\n### Social Proof Section\n\nOptions (use 1-2):\n- Customer logos (recognizable > many)\n- Key metric (\"10,000+ teams\")\n- Short testimonial with attribution\n- Star rating with review count\n\n### Problem/Pain Section\n\n- Articulate the problem better than they can\n- Show you understand their situation\n- Create recognition (\"that''s exactly my problem\")\n\nStructure:\n- \"You know the feeling...\" or \"If you''re like most [role]...\"\n- Describe the specific frustrations\n- Hint at the cost of not solving it\n\n### Solution/Benefits Section\n\n- Bridge from problem to your solution\n- Focus on 3-5 key benefits (not 10)\n- Each benefit: headline + short explanation + proof point if available\n\nFormat options:\n- Benefit blocks with icons\n- Before/after comparison\n- Feature → Benefit → Proof structure\n\n### How It Works Section\n\n- Reduce perceived complexity\n- 3-4 step process\n- Each step: simple action + outcome\n\nExample:\n1. \"Connect your tools (2 minutes)\"\n2. \"Set your preferences\"\n3. \"Get automated reports every Monday\"\n\n### Social Proof (Detailed)\n\n- Full testimonials with:\n  - Specific results\n  - Customer name, role, company\n  - Photo if possible\n- Case study snippets\n- Logos section (if not above)\n\n### Objection Handling\n\nCommon objections to address:\n- \"Is this right for my situation?\"\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n- \"Is it hard to set up?\"\n- \"How is this different from X?\"\n\nFormats:\n- FAQ section\n- Comparison table\n- Guarantee/promise section\n- \"Built for [specific audience]\" section\n\n### Final CTA Section\n\n- Recap the value proposition\n- Repeat the primary CTA\n- Add urgency if genuine (deadline, limited availability)\n- Risk reversal (guarantee, free trial, no credit card)\n\n---\n\n## Landing Page Section Variety\n\nA great landing page isn''t just a list of features. Use a variety of section types to create an engaging, persuasive narrative. Mix and match from these:\n\n### Section Types to Include\n\n**How It Works (Numbered Steps)**\nWalk users through the process in 3-4 clear steps. Reduces perceived complexity and shows the path to value.\n\n**Alternative/Competitor Comparison**\nShow how you stack up against the status quo or competitors. Tables, side-by-side comparisons, or \"Unlike X, we...\" sections.\n\n**Founder Manifesto / Our Story**\nShare why you built this and what you believe. Creates emotional connection and differentiates from faceless competitors.\n\n**Testimonials**\nCustomer quotes with names, photos, and specific results. Multiple formats: quote cards, video testimonials, tweet embeds.\n\n**Case Studies**\nDeeper stories of customer success. Problem → Solution → Results format with specific metrics.\n\n**Use Cases**\nShow different ways the product is used. Helps visitors self-identify: \"This is for people like me.\"\n\n**Personas / \"Built For\" Sections**\nExplicitly call out who the product is for: \"Perfect for marketers,\" \"Built for agencies,\" etc.\n\n**Stats and Social Proof**\nKey metrics that build credibility: \"10,000+ customers,\" \"4.9/5 rating,\" \"$2M saved for customers.\"\n\n**Demo / Product Tour**\nInteractive demos, video walkthroughs, or GIF previews showing the product in action.\n\n**FAQ Section**\nAddress common objections and questions. Good for SEO and reducing support burden.\n\n**Integrations / Partners**\nShow what tools you connect with. Logos build credibility and answer \"Will this work with my stack?\"\n\n**Pricing Preview**\nEven on non-pricing pages, a pricing teaser can move decision-makers forward.\n\n**Guarantee / Risk Reversal**\nMoney-back guarantee, free trial terms, or \"cancel anytime\" messaging reduces friction.\n\n### Recommended Section Mix\n\nFor a landing page, aim for variety. Don''t just stack features:\n\n**Typical Feature-Heavy Page (Weak):**\n1. Hero\n2. Feature 1\n3. Feature 2\n4. Feature 3\n5. Feature 4\n6. CTA\n\n**Varied, Engaging Page (Strong):**\n1. Hero with clear value prop\n2. Social proof bar (logos or stats)\n3. Problem/pain section\n4. How it works (3 steps)\n5. Key benefits (2-3, not 10)\n6. Testimonial\n7. Use cases or personas\n8. Comparison to alternatives\n9. Case study snippet\n10. FAQ\n11. Final CTA with guarantee\n\n---\n\n## CTA Copy Guidelines\n\n**Weak CTAs (avoid):**\n- Submit\n- Sign Up\n- Learn More\n- Click Here\n- Get Started\n\n**Strong CTAs (use):**\n- Start Free Trial\n- Get [Specific Thing]\n- See [Product] in Action\n- Create Your First [Thing]\n- Book My Demo\n- Download the Guide\n- Try It Free\n\n**CTA formula:**\n[Action Verb] + [What They Get] + [Qualifier if needed]\n\nExamples:\n- \"Start My Free Trial\"\n- \"Get the Complete Checklist\"\n- \"See Pricing for My Team\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen writing copy, provide:\n\n### Page Copy\nOrganized by section with clear labels:\n- Headline\n- Subheadline\n- CTA\n- Section headers\n- Body copy\n- Secondary CTAs\n\n### Annotations\nFor key elements, explain:\n- Why you made this choice\n- What principle it applies\n- Alternatives considered\n\n### Alternatives\nFor headlines and CTAs, provide 2-3 options:\n- Option A: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option B: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option C: [copy] — [rationale]\n\n### Meta Content (if relevant)\n- Page title (for SEO)\n- Meta description\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Guidance\n\n### Homepage Copy\n- Serve multiple audiences without being generic\n- Lead with broadest value proposition\n- Provide clear paths for different visitor intents\n- Balance \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page Copy\n- Single message, single CTA\n- Match headline to ad/traffic source\n- Complete argument on one page\n- Remove distractions (often no nav)\n\n### Pricing Page Copy\n- Help visitors choose the right plan\n- Clarify what''s included at each level\n- Address \"which is right for me?\" anxiety\n- Make recommended plan obvious\n\n### Feature Page Copy\n- Connect feature to benefit to outcome\n- Show use cases and examples\n- Differentiate from competitors'' versions\n- Clear path to try or buy\n\n### About Page Copy\n- Tell the story of why you exist\n- Connect company mission to customer benefit\n- Build trust through transparency\n- Still include a CTA (it''s still a marketing page)\n\n---\n\n## Voice and Tone Considerations\n\nBefore writing, establish:\n\n**Formality level:**\n- Casual/conversational\n- Professional but friendly\n- Formal/enterprise\n\n**Brand personality:**\n- Playful or serious?\n- Bold or understated?\n- Technical or accessible?\n\nMaintain consistency throughout, but adjust intensity:\n- Headlines can be bolder\n- Body copy should be clearer\n- CTAs should be action-oriented\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copy-editing**: For polishing and improving existing copy (use after writing your first draft)\n- **page-cro**: If the page structure/strategy needs work, not just copy\n- **email-sequence**: For email copywriting\n- **popup-cro**: For popup and modal copy\n- **ab-test-setup**: To test copy variations properly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:50:38.357Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing compelling marketing content generation.","zh":"非常适合需要创造性营销内容生成的语言代理。","ja":"マーケティングコンテンツの生成が必要な言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"마케팅 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan generar contenido de marketing atractivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de générer du contenu de marketing convaincant.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die ansprechende Marketinginhalte generieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de geração de conteúdo de marketing convincente.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым требуется создание привлекательного маркетингового контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء محتوى تسويقي مقنع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft clear and persuasive marketing copy using conversion-focused strategies, incorporating context such as page purpose and audience analysis, and leveraging technical keywords like landing pages, feature descriptions, and pricing pages.","zh":"赋予代理人使用转化为焦点的策略、融入上下文（如页面目的和受众分析）以及利用技术关键词（如着陆页、功能描述和价格页）来制作清晰且具有说服力的营销文案的能力。","ja":"エージェントが、ページの目的やオーディエンス分析などのコンテキストを組み込み、ランディングページや機能説明、価格ページなどの技術キーワードを利用して、転換に焦点を当てた戦略を使用してクリアで説得力のあるマーケティングコピーを作成する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 전환을 중점으로 하는 전략을 사용하여 페이지 목적 및 대상자 분석 등의 콘텍스트를 통합하고 랜딩 페이지, 기능 설명, 가격 페이지 등의 기술 키워드를 활용하여 명확하고 설득력 있는 마케팅 사본을 작성할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear copias de marketing claras y persuasivas utilizando estrategias enfocadas en la conversión, incorporando contextos como el propósito de la página y el análisis de la audiencia, y aprovechando palabras clave técnicas como páginas de aterrizaje, descripciones de características y páginas de precios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des copies de marketing claires et persuasives en utilisant des stratégies axées sur la conversion, en incorporant des contextes tels que l''objectif de la page et l''analyse du public, et en exploitant des mots-clés techniques comme les pages de destination, les descriptions de fonctionnalités et les pages de tarifs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, klare und überzeugende Marketingkopien mit konversionsorientierten Strategien zu erstellen, indem sie Kontexte wie die Zweckbestimmung der Seite und die Zielgruppenanalyse einbeziehen und technische Schlüsselwörter wie Landeseiten, Funktionsbeschreibungen und Preisseiten nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar cópias de marketing claras e persuasivas usando estratégias focadas na conversão, incorporando contextos como o propósito da página e a análise do público, e aproveitando palavras-chave técnicas como páginas de destino, descrições de recursos e páginas de preços.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать четкие и убедительные маркетинговые тексты, используя стратегии, ориентированные на конверсию, учитывая контекст, такой как цель страницы и анализ аудитории, и используя технические ключевые слова, такие как целевые страницы, описания функций и страницы цен.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء نصوص تسويقية واضحة ومقنعة باستخدام استراتيجيات تركز على التحويل، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار السياق مثل غرض الصفحة وتحليل الجمهور، واستخدام الكلمات الرئيسية الفنية مثل صفحات الهبوط ووصفات الميزات وصفحات الأسعار."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating high-converting landing page copy","Crafting engaging product descriptions for e-commerce sites","Optimizing homepage content for improved user experience"],"zh":["生成高转化率的着陆页文案","为电子商务网站制作引人入胜的产品描述","优化首页内容以提高用户体验"],"ja":["高転換率のランディングページコピーの生成","電子商取引サイト向けの製品説明の作成","ホームページコンテンツの最適化によるユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["고전환률 랜딩 페이지 복사본 생성","전자상거래 사이트를 위한 제품 설명 작성","홈페이지 콘텐츠 최적화에 의한 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Generar copias de página de aterrizaje de alta conversión","Crear descripciones de productos atractivas para sitios de comercio electrónico","Optimizar el contenido de la página de inicio para mejorar la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Générer des copies de page de destination à forte conversion","Créer des descriptions de produits engageantes pour les sites de commerce électronique","Optimiser le contenu de la page d''accueil pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von hochkonvertierenden Landeseitenkopien","Erstellung ansprechender Produktbeschreibungen für E-Commerce-Websites","Optimierung des Inhalts der Startseite für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Geração de cópias de landing page de alta conversão","Criação de descrições de produtos atraentes para sites de comércio eletrônico","Otimização do conteúdo da página inicial para melhorar a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Генерация копий landing page с высокой конверсией","Создание привлекательных описаний продуктов для сайтов электронной коммерции","Оптимизация контента домашней страницы для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["إنشاء نسخ من الصفحات الناظمة ذات التحويل العالي","creating وصفات منتجات جذابة لمواقع التجارة الإلكترونية","تحسين محتوى الصفحة الرئيسية لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of target audience and page purpose","Limited to text-based marketing content"],"zh":["需要了解目标受众和页面目的","仅限于基于文本的营销内容"],"ja":["ターゲットオーディエンスとページの目的を理解する必要がある","テキストベースのマーケティングコンテンツに限定される"],"ko":["대상 受众 및 페이지 목적을 이해해야 함","텍스트 기반 마케팅 콘텐츠에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la audiencia objetivo y el propósito de la página","Limitado a contenido de marketing basado en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du public cible et de l''objectif de la page","Limité au contenu de marketing basé sur le texte"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Zielgruppe und des Seitenzwecks","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Marketinginhalte"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do público-alvo e do propósito da página","Limitado a conteúdo de marketing baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требует понимания целевой аудитории и цели страницы","Ограничен текстовым маркетинговым контентом"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الجمهور المستهدف وغرض الصفحة","محدود بمحتوى التسويق القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
