ge des tests de bout en bout avec réessais","Compatibilité avec les cibles Make pour une exécution efficace","Option d''affichage des erreurs de test de bout en bout","Sortie détaillée pour le débogage"],"de":["Zentrale Befehle für Unit- und End-to-End-Tests","Debug-Flow zum Identifizieren und Beheben von Fehlern","Unterstützung für End-to-End-Tests mit Wiederholungen","Kompatibilität mit Make-Zielen für eine effiziente Ausführung","Option zum Anzeigen von End-to-End-Testfehlern","Detaillierte Ausgabe für das Debuggen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento centralizado de agentes AI","Testes unitários e de ponta a ponta","Comandos de teste personalizados","Depuração de erros e saída detalhada","Integração com ferramentas de teste populares"],"ru":["Централизованное управление агентами ИИ","Юнит-тесты и тесты от начала до конца","Пользовательские команды тестирования","Отладка ошибок и подробный вывод","Интеграция с популярными инструментами тестирования"],"ar":["إدارة مركزية لوحدات المستجيبين الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختبارات وحدة واختبارات من البداية إلى النهاية","أوامر اختبار مخصصة","تصحيح الأخطاء والإخراج المفصل","التكامل مع أدوات الاختبار الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Zerg 测试","AI 代理管理","测试命令","调试流程","集中管理","测试效率","AI 开发","自动化测试"],"ja":["Zerg テスト","AI エージェント管理","テストコマンド","デバッグフロー","集中管理","テスト効率","AI 開発","自動テスト"],"ko":["Zerg 테스트","AI 에이전트 관리","테스트 명령","디버깅 흐름","중앙 관리","테스트 효율성","AI 개발","자동 테스트"],"es":["pruebas de IA","agentes de IA","gestión de agentes","comandos centralizados","depuración de pruebas","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de extremo a extremo","Make targets","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["tests IA","agents IA","gestion des agents","commandes centralisées","débogage des tests","tests unitaires","tests de bout en bout","cibles Make","développement de logiciels"],"de":["KI-Tests","KI-Agents","Verwaltung von KI-Agents","zentrale Befehle","Test-Debugging","Unit-Tests","End-to-End-Tests","Make-Ziele","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Zerg Testing","gerenciamento de agentes AI","testes unitários","testes de ponta a ponta","depuração de erros","integração com ferramentas de teste"],"ru":["Zerg Тестирование","управление агентами ИИ","юнит-тесты","тесты от начала до конца","отладка ошибок","интеграция с инструментами тестирования"],"ar":["زيرج تيستينج","إدارة وحدات المستجيبين الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختبارات وحدة","اختبارات من البداية إلى النهاية","تصحيح الأخطاء","التكامل مع أدوات الاختبار"]}},"owner":"cipher982","repo":"longhouse","repoPath":"cipher982/longhouse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zerg-testing","description":"Zerg testing workflow (unit + E2E). Use when running or debugging tests.","bodyPreview":"# Zerg Testing\n\n## Rules\n- Always use Make targets. Never run pytest/bun/playwright directly.\n\n## Core Commands\n```bash\nmake test                # unit tests\nmake test-e2e-core       # core E2E (must pass 100%)\nmake test-e2e            # full E2E (retries ok)\nmake test-all            # unit + full E2E\nmake test-e2e-single TEST=tests/<spec>.ts\nmake test-e2e-errors     # show last E2E errors\nmake test-e2e-verbose    # full output for debugging\n```\n\n## Debugging Flow\n1) `make test-e2e-errors`\n2) `m","body":"# Zerg Testing\n\n## Rules\n- Always use Make targets. Never run pytest/bun/playwright directly.\n\n## Core Commands\n```bash\nmake test                # unit tests\nmake test-e2e-core       # core E2E (must pass 100%)\nmake test-e2e            # full E2E (retries ok)\nmake test-all            # unit + full E2E\nmake test-e2e-single TEST=tests/<spec>.ts\nmake test-e2e-errors     # show last E2E errors\nmake test-e2e-verbose    # full output for debugging\n```\n\n## Debugging Flow\n1) `make test-e2e-errors`\n2) `make test-e2e-single TEST=tests/<spec>.ts`\n3) `make test-e2e-verbose`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:51:16.749Z","qualityScore":30}');
