ネントのコレクションで、開発者が迅速にアプリケーションを構築するのに役立ちます","ko":"shadcn-ui는 컴포넌트 모음으로 개발자가 빠르게 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"shadcn-ui es una colección de componentes reutilizables para aplicaciones frontend, construidos con Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"shadcn-ui est une collection de composants réutilisables pour les applications frontend, construits avec Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"shadcn-ui ist eine Sammlung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten für Frontend-Anwendungen, die mit Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS erstellt wurden","pt":"A shadcn-ui é uma coleção de componentes reutilizáveis para frontend, projetados para ser acessíveis e personalizáveis.","ru":"shadcn-ui — это коллекция повторно используемых компонентов для frontend, предназначенных для доступности и настройки.","ar":"شادكن-يو آي هي مجموعة من المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام للواجهة الأمامية، مصممة لتكون قابلة للوصول والتعديل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["美观设计","可访问性","可定制","快速集成","不需要安装"],"ja":["美しいデザイン","使いやすさ","カスタマイズ可能","迅速な統合","インストール不要"],"ko":["아름다운 디자인","접근성","사용자 정의 가능","빠른 통합","설치 필요 없음"],"es":["Componentes personalizables","Accesibilidad garantizada","Integración con Radix UI o Base UI","Diseño responsive con Tailwind CSS","Código abierto y reusable"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables","Accessibilité garantie","Intégration avec Radix UI ou Base UI","Conception responsive avec Tailwind CSS","Code ouvert et réutilisable"],"de":["Anpassbare Komponenten","Garantierte Zugänglichkeit","Integration mit Radix UI oder Base UI","Responsives Design mit Tailwind CSS","Offener und wiederverwendbarer Code"],"pt":["Componentes acessíveis e personalizáveis","Integração fácil com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS","Coleção de componentes reutilizáveis","Projetado para ser highly customizable","Compatível com diferentes frameworks frontend"],"ru":["Доступные и настраиваемые компоненты","Легкая интеграция с Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS","Коллекция повторно используемых компонентов","Продуман для высокой настраиваемости","Совместим с разными фреймворками frontend"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة للوصول والتعديل","دمج سهل مع راديكس يو آي أو بيس يو آي وتايل ويند سي إس إس","مجموعة من المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","مصمم ليكون قابل للتعديل بدرجة عالية","متوافق مع إطارات عمل واجهة أمامية مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","组件集成","前端开发","可访问性","可定制","快速开发"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","コンポーネント統合","フロントエンド開発","使いやすさ","カスタマイズ可能","迅速な開発"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","컴포넌트 통합","프론트엔드 개발","접근성","사용자 정의 가능","빠른 개발"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","desarrollo frontend","integración de componentes"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","développement frontend","intégration de composants"],"de":["shadcn-ui","Frontend-Komponenten","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","Frontend-Entwicklung","Komponenten-Integration"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes frontend","acessibilidade","personalização","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento frontend"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты frontend","доступность","настройка","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","разработка frontend"],"ar":["شادكن-يو آي","مكونات واجهة أمامية","قابلية الوصول","التعديل","راديكس يو آي","بيس يو آي","تايل ويند سي إس إس","تطوير واجهة أمامية"]}},"owner":"mohdakil2426","repo":"Nezuko-Telegram-Bot","repoPath":"mohdakil2426/Nezuko-Telegram-Bot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:50:13.877Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in accessible and customizable UI component integration with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"适合专门从事无障碍和可定制的UI组件集成的前端代理，尤其是与Radix UI、Base UI和Tailwind CSS集成。","ja":"Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSSとのUIコンポーネントの統合に特化したフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS와의 UI 컴포넌트 통합에 전문적인 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que se especializan en la integración de componentes de UI accesibles y personalizables con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend qui se spécialisent dans l''intégration de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Integration von zugänglichen und anpassbaren UI-Komponenten mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em integração de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на интеграции доступных и настраиваемых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتخصصة في دمج مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والقابلة للتخصيص مع Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate and customize shadcn/ui components following best practices, leveraging full ownership and customization capabilities with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS, ensuring beautifully designed and accessible applications.","zh":"赋予代理集成和自定义shadcn/ui组件的能力，遵循最佳实践，利用Radix UI或Base UI和Tailwind CSS的全部所有权和自定义能力，确保设计美观且无障碍的应用程序。","ja":"shadcn/uiコンポーネントを統合し、カスタマイズするエージェントの能力を与え、ベストプラクティスに従い、Radix UIまたはBase UIとTailwind CSSの所有権とカスタマイズ能力を最大限に活用し、美しく設計されアクセス可能なアプリケーションを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트를 통합하고 사용자 정의하는能力을 부여하여 최고의 실践을 따르며, Radix UI 또는 Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS의 모든 소유권 및 사용자 정의 기능을 활용하여 아름답게 설계되고 접근 가능한 애플리케이션을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes integrar y personalizar componentes de shadcn/ui siguiendo las mejores prácticas, aprovechando la propiedad y las capacidades de personalización completas con Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS, garantizando aplicaciones con un diseño hermoso y accesible.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer et de personnaliser les composants shadcn/ui en suivant les meilleures pratiques, en exploitant la propriété et les capacités de personnalisation complètes avec Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS, garantissant des applications conçues de manière élégante et accessibles.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, shadcn/ui-Komponenten zu integrieren und anzupassen, indem sie bewährte Verfahren befolgen, die vollständige Eigentümerschaft und Anpassungsfähigkeiten mit Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS nutzen, um schön gestaltete und zugängliche Anwendungen zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar e personalizar componentes shadcn/ui seguindo as melhores práticas, aproveitando a propriedade e capacidades de personalização completas com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS, garantindo aplicativos projetados de forma bonita e acessíveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать и настраивать компоненты shadcn/ui, следуя лучшим практикам, используя полную собственность и возможности настройки с Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS, обеспечивая красиво спроектированные и доступные приложения.","ar":"تمكن العميل من دمج مكونات shadcn/ui وتخصيصها اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات، واستخدام ملكية كاملة وقدرات تخصيص مع Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS، مما يضمن تطبيقات مصممة بطريقة جميلة وقابلة للوصول."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating shadcn/ui components into existing projects for enhanced accessibility and customization","Customizing shadcn/ui components to fit specific application design requirements using Tailwind CSS","Discovering and implementing new shadcn/ui components to improve application UI/UX"],"zh":["将shadcn/ui组件集成到现有项目中以提高无障碍性和自定义性","使用Tailwind CSS将shadcn/ui组件自定义以满足特定应用程序设计要求","发现和实现新的shadcn/ui组件以提高应用程序的UI/UX"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクトにshadcn/uiコンポーネントを統合してアクセシビリティとカスタマイズ性を向上させる","Tailwind CSSを使用して、特定のアプリケーションデザイン要件に合うようにshadcn/uiコンポーネントをカスタマイズする","新しいshadcn/uiコンポーネントを発見して実装し、アプリケーションのUI/UXを向上させる"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트에 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트를 통합하여 접근성 및 사용자 정의 기능을 향상시키는 것","Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 특정 애플리케이션 디자인 요구 사항에 맞게 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트를 사용자 정의하는 것","새로운 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트를 발견하고 구현하여 애플리케이션의 UI/UX를 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Integrar componentes de shadcn/ui en proyectos existentes para mejorar la accesibilidad y la personalización","Personalizar componentes de shadcn/ui para adaptarlos a requisitos de diseño de aplicaciones específicas utilizando Tailwind CSS","Descubrir e implementar nuevos componentes de shadcn/ui para mejorar la interfaz de usuario y la experiencia del usuario de la aplicación"],"fr":["Intégrer les composants shadcn/ui dans des projets existants pour améliorer l''accessibilité et la personnalisation","Personnaliser les composants shadcn/ui pour les adapter à des exigences de conception d''applications spécifiques en utilisant Tailwind CSS","Découvrir et mettre en œuvre de nouveaux composants shadcn/ui pour améliorer l''interface utilisateur et l''expérience utilisateur de l''application"],"de":["shadcn/ui-Komponenten in bestehende Projekte integrieren, um die Zugänglichkeit und Anpassungsfähigkeit zu verbessern","shadcn/ui-Komponenten anpassen, um sie an spezifische Anwendungsdesignanforderungen mit Tailwind CSS anzupassen","Neue shadcn/ui-Komponenten entdecken und implementieren, um die Benutzeroberfläche und Benutzererfahrung der Anwendung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Integrar componentes shadcn/ui em projetos existentes para melhorar a acessibilidade e personalização","Personalizar componentes shadcn/ui para atender aos requisitos de design de aplicativos específicos usando Tailwind CSS","Descobrir e implementar novos componentes shadcn/ui para melhorar a IU/UX de aplicativos"],"ru":["Интегрировать компоненты shadcn/ui в существующие проекты для улучшения доступности и настройки","Настроить компоненты shadcn/ui для удовлетворения конкретных требований к дизайну приложений с помощью Tailwind CSS","Обнаружить и реализовать новые компоненты shadcn/ui для улучшения IU/UX приложений"],"ar":["دمج مكونات shadcn/ui في المشاريع الحالية لتحسين القدرة على الوصول والتخصيص","تخصيص مكونات shadcn/ui لتناسب متطلبات تصميم التطبيقات النوعية باستخدام Tailwind CSS","اكتشاف و