リンターで、Rustコードの最適化を支援する","ko":"m01-ownership는 고성능 자연어 린터로 Rust 코드 최적화를 지원한다","es":"m01-ownership es un linter de lenguaje natural de alto rendimiento que ayuda a gestionar errores de propiedad y ciclos de vida en Rust","fr":"m01-ownership est un linter de langage naturel haute performance qui aide à gérer les erreurs de propriété et de durée de vie en Rust","de":"m01-ownership ist ein hochleistungsfähiger natürlicher Sprachlinter, der hilft, Eigentums- und Lebensdauerfehler in Rust zu verwalten","pt":"O m01-ownership é um linter de linguagem natural de alto desempenho que ajuda a otimizar a propriedade de dados no seu código","ru":"m01-ownership - это высокопроизводительный линтер естественного языка, который помогает оптимизировать владение данными в вашем коде","ar":"m01-ownership هو لينتر لغة طبيعية عالي الأداء يساعد على تحسين ملكية البيانات في كودك","en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"definition":{"en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"features":{"zh":["高性能的自然语言分析","优化Rust代码","支持所有权和生命周期分析","提高开发效率","易于使用"],"ja":["高性能な自然言語分析","Rustコードの最適化","所有権とライフタイムの分析をサポート","開発効率の向上","使いやすい"],"ko":["고성능 자연어 분석","Rust 코드 최적화","소유권과 수명 분석 지원","개발 효율성 향상","사용하기 쉬움"],"es":["Detección de errores de propiedad","Análisis de ciclos de vida de datos","Compatibilidad con Rust","Alto rendimiento","Inspiration en textlint"],"fr":["Détection d''erreurs de propriété","Analyse de la durée de vie des données","Compatibilité avec Rust","Haute performance","Inspiré de textlint"],"de":["Eigentumsfehler-Erkennung","Analyse der Lebensdauer von Daten","Kompatibilität mit Rust","Hochleistung","Inspiration von textlint"],"pt":["Otimização de propriedade de dados","Análise de erros de propriedade","Suporte a linguagem Rust","Inspiração no textlint","Alto desempenho"],"ru":["Оптимизация владения данными","Анализ ошибок владения","Поддержка языка Rust","Вдохновение от textlint","Высокая производительность"],"ar":["تحسين ملكية البيانات","تحليل أخطاء الملكية","دعم لغة الرست","إلهام من textlint","أداء عالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust语言","自然语言lint工具","所有权","生命周期","代码优化","开发效率"],"ja":["Rust言語","自然言語リンター","所有権","ライフタイム","コード最適化","開発効率"],"ko":["Rust 언어","자연어 린터","소유권","수명","코드 최적화","개발 효율성"],"es":["Ownership en Rust","ciclos de vida de datos","linter de lenguaje natural","errores de propiedad","Rust","textlint","alto rendimiento"],"fr":["Propriété en Rust","durée de vie des données","linter de langage naturel","erreurs de propriété","Rust","textlint","haute performance"],"de":["Eigentum in Rust","Lebensdauer von Daten","natürlicher Sprachlinter","Eigentumsfehler","Rust","textlint","Hochleistung"],"pt":["m01-ownership","linter de linguagem natural","otimização de propriedade de dados","erros de propriedade","Rust","textlint","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["m01-ownership","линтер естественного языка","оптимизация владения данными","ошибки владения","Rust","textlint","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["m01-ownership","لينتر لغة طبيعية","تحسين ملكية البيانات","أخطاء الملكية","رست","textlint","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"simorgh3196","repo":"tsuzulint","repoPath":"simorgh3196/tsuzulint","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m01-ownership","description":"CRITICAL: Use for ownership/borrow/lifetime issues. Triggers: E0382, E0597, E0506, E0507, E0515, E0716, E0106, value moved, borrowed value does not live long enough, cannot move out of, use of moved value, ownership, borrow, lifetime, a, static, move, clone, Copy, 所有权, 借用, 生命周期","bodyPreview":"# Ownership & Lifetimes\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Who should own this data, and for how long?**\n\nBefore fixing ownership errors, understand the data''s role:\n- Is it shared or exclusive?\n- Is it short-lived or long-lived?\n- Is it transformed or just read?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0382 | \"Clone it\" | Who should own this data? |\n| E0597 | \"Extend lifetime\" | Is the scope bound","body":"# Ownership & Lifetimes\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Who should own this data, and for how long?**\n\nBefore fixing ownership errors, understand the data''s role:\n- Is it shared or exclusive?\n- Is it short-lived or long-lived?\n- Is it transformed or just read?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0382 | \"Clone it\" | Who should own this data? |\n| E0597 | \"Extend lifetime\" | Is the scope boundary correct? |\n| E0506 | \"End borrow first\" | Should mutation happen elsewhere? |\n| E0507 | \"Clone before move\" | Why are we moving from a reference? |\n| E0515 | \"Return owned\" | Should caller own the data? |\n| E0716 | \"Bind to variable\" | Why is this temporary? |\n| E0106 | \"Add ''a\" | What is the actual lifetime relationship? |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore fixing an ownership error, ask:\n\n1. **What is this data''s domain role?**\n   - Entity (unique identity) → owned\n   - Value Object (interchangeable) → clone/copy OK\n   - Temporary (computation result) → maybe restructure\n\n2. **Is the ownership design intentional?**\n   - By design → work within constraints\n   - Accidental → consider redesign\n\n3. **Fix symptom or redesign?**\n   - If Strike 3 (3rd attempt) → escalate to Layer 2\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nWhen errors persist, trace to design layer:\n\n```\nE0382 (moved value)\n    ↑ Ask: What design choice led to this ownership pattern?\n    ↑ Check: m09-domain (is this Entity or Value Object?)\n    ↑ Check: domain-* (what constraints apply?)\n```\n\n| Persistent Error | Trace To | Question |\n|-----------------|----------|----------|\n| E0382 repeated | m02-resource | Should use Arc/Rc for sharing? |\n| E0597 repeated | m09-domain | Is scope boundary at right place? |\n| E0506/E0507 | m03-mutability | Should use interior mutability? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nFrom design decisions to implementation:\n\n```\n\"Data needs to be shared immutably\"\n    ↓ Use: Arc<T> (multi-thread) or Rc<T> (single-thread)\n\n\"Data needs exclusive ownership\"\n    ↓ Use: move semantics, take ownership\n\n\"Data is read-only view\"\n    ↓ Use: &T (immutable borrow)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Ownership | Cost | Use When |\n|---------|-----------|------|----------|\n| Move | Transfer | Zero | Caller doesn''t need data |\n| `&T` | Borrow | Zero | Read-only access |\n| `&mut T` | Exclusive borrow | Zero | Need to modify |\n| `clone()` | Duplicate | Alloc + copy | Actually need a copy |\n| `Rc<T>` | Shared (single) | Ref count | Single-thread sharing |\n| `Arc<T>` | Shared (multi) | Atomic ref count | Multi-thread sharing |\n| `Cow<T>` | Clone-on-write | Alloc if mutated | Might modify |\n\n## Error Code Reference\n\n| Error | Cause | Quick Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----------|\n| E0382 | Value moved | Clone, reference, or redesign ownership |\n| E0597 | Reference outlives owner | Extend owner scope or restructure |\n| E0506 | Assign while borrowed | End borrow before mutation |\n| E0507 | Move out of borrowed | Clone or use reference |\n| E0515 | Return local reference | Return owned value |\n| E0716 | Temporary dropped | Bind to variable |\n| E0106 | Missing lifetime | Add `''a` annotation |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why Bad | Better |\n|--------------|---------|--------|\n| `.clone()` everywhere | Hides design issues | Design ownership properly |\n| Fight borrow checker | Increases complexity | Work with the compiler |\n| `''static` for everything | Restricts flexibility | Use appropriate lifetimes |\n| Leak with `Box::leak` | Memory leak | Proper lifetime design |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Need smart pointers | m02-resource |\n| Need interior mutability | m03-mutability |\n| Data is domain entity | m09-domain |\n| Learning ownership concepts | m14-mental-model |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:51:13.057Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based AI Agents needing high-performance natural language linting and ownership error resolution.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能自然语言linting和所有权错误解决的Rust基础AI代理。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントが高性能な自然言語Lintingと所有権エラーソリューションを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고성능 자연어 linting 및 소유권 오류 해결이 필요한 Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Rust que necesitan una corrección de lenguaje natural de alto rendimiento y resolución de errores de propiedad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA basés sur Rust nécessitant une correction de langage naturel haute performance et une résolution d''erreurs de propriété.","de":"Perfekt für Rust-basierte KI-Agenten, die eine Hochleistungs-Natursprachencorrection und Eigentumsfehlerbehebung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que necessitam de linting de linguagem natural de alto desempenho e resolução de erros de propriedade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, которым необходима высокопроизводительная проверка языка и решение проблем владения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى رست التي تحتاج إلى تنقيح لغة طبيعية عالي الأداء وتحديد أخطاء الملكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to resolve ownership errors using Rust, by understanding data roles such as shared or exclusive access, and lifetimes including short-lived or long-lived data, and transforming or reading data, with error codes like E0382 and E0597.","zh":"赋予代理使用Rust解决所有权错误的能力，通过理解数据角色（如共享或独占访问）和生命周期（包括短暂或长期数据），并转换或读取数据，并具有类似E0382和E0597的错误代码。","ja":"Rustを使用して、共有または排他的アクセスなどのデータロールと、短期または長期のデータなどのライフタイムを理解し、データを変換または読み取ることで、E0382およびE0597などのエラーコードで所有権エラーを解決するエージェントに権限を付与します。","ko":"공유 또는 배타적 액세스와 같은 데이터 역할과 짧은 기간 또는 긴 기간의 데이터와 같은 수명을 이해하고 데이터를 변환하거나 읽는ことで E0382 및 E0597와 같은 오류 코드로 소유권 오류를 해결할 수 있는 에이전트에게 권한을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver errores de propiedad utilizando Rust, entendiendo roles de datos como acceso compartido o exclusivo, y ciclos de vida que incluyen datos de corta o larga duración, y transformando o leyendo datos, con códigos de error como E0382 y E0597.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre les erreurs de propriété en utilisant Rust, en comprenant les rôles de données tels que l''accès partagé ou exclusif, et les cycles de vie incluant des données à court ou long terme, et en transformant ou en lisant des données, avec des codes d''erreur tels que E0382 et E0597.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Eigentumsfehler mit Rust zu beheben, indem es Datenrollen wie gemeinsamen oder exklusiven Zugriff und Lebensdauern einschließlich kurzlebiger oder langlebiger Daten versteht und Daten transformiert oder liest, mit Fehlernummern wie E0382 und E0597.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver erros de propriedade usando Rust, entendendo funções de dados como acesso compartilhado ou exclusivo e tempos de vida, incluindo dados de curta ou longa duração, e transformando ou lendo dados, com códigos de erro como E0382 e E0597.","ru":"Позволяет агентам решать проблемы владения с помощью Rust, понимая роли данных, такие как общий или исключительный доступ, и сроки действия, включая краткосрочные или долгосрочные данные, и преобразуя или читая данные, с кодами ошибок, такими как E0382 и E0597.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من حل أخطاء الملكية باستخدام رست، من خلال فهم أدوار البيانات مثل الوصول المشترك أو الحصري، وأوقات الحياة، بما في ذلك البيانات قصيرة أو طويلة الأجل، وتحويل أو قراءة البيانات، مع رموز الخطأ مثل E0382 و E0597."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging ownership errors in Rust code","Determining optimal data lifetimes for performance","Resolving E0382 and E0597 errors with informed design questions"],"zh":["调试Rust代码中的所有权错误","确定性能的最佳数据生命周期","使用明智的设计问题解决E0382和E0597错误"],"ja":["Rustコードの所有権エラーのデバッグ","パフォーマンスのための最適なデータライフタイムの決定","情報に基づいた設計の疑問を使用してE0382とE0597エラーを解決"],"ko":["Rust 코드의 소유권 오류 디버깅","성능을 위한 최적의 데이터 수명 결정","정보에 आधabase한 설계 질문을 사용하여 E0382 및 E0597 오류 해결"],"es":["Depuración de errores de propiedad en código Rust","Determinación de ciclos de vida de datos óptimos para el rendimiento","Resolución de errores E0382 y E0597 con preguntas de diseño informadas"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs de propriété dans le code Rust","Détermination des cycles de vie de données optimaux pour les performances","Résolution des erreurs E0382 et E0597 avec des questions de conception éclairées"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von Eigentumsfehlern in Rust-Code","Bestimmung optimaler Datenlebensdauern für die Leistung","Behebung von Fehlern E0382 und E0597 mit informierten Designfragen"],"pt":["Depuração de erros de propriedade no código Rust","Determinação de tempos de vida de dados ótimos para desempenho","Resolução de erros E0382 e E0597 com questões de design informadas"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок владения в коде Rust","Определение оптимальных сроков жизни данных для производительности","Решение ошибок E0382 и E0597 с информированными вопросами проектирования"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء ملكية في رمز رست","تحديد أوقات الحياة للمعلومات الأمثل للأداء","حل أخطاء E0382 و E0597 مع أسئلة التصميم المطلع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming language","Limited to textlint-inspired linting"],"zh":["需要Rust编程语言","仅限于textlint风格的linting"],"ja":["Rustプログラミング言語が必要","textlint風のLintingのみ"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","textlint 스타일의 linting만"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Rust","Limitado a la corrección de lenguaje de texto inspirada en textlint"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Rust","Limité à la correction de langage de texte inspirée de textlint"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Rust","Begrenzt auf textlint-inspirierte Textkorrektur"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Rust","Limitado ao linting inspirado em textlint"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Rust","Ограничен проверкой, вдохновленной textlint"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة رست","محدود بالتنقيح الذي يلهم textlint"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
