oudflare-d1과 cloudflare-worker-base에 의존","drizzle-orm, drizzle-kit, better-sqlite3의 특정 버전에 한정"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de npm de drizzle-orm y drizzle-kit","Dependiente de cloudflare-d1 y cloudflare-worker-base","Limitado a versiones específicas de drizzle-orm, drizzle-kit y better-sqlite3"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation npm de drizzle-orm et drizzle-kit","Dépendant de cloudflare-d1 et cloudflare-worker-base","Limité à des versions spécifiques de drizzle-orm, drizzle-kit et better-sqlite3"],"de":["Benötigt die npm-Installation von drizzle-orm und drizzle-kit","Abhängig von cloudflare-d1 und cloudflare-worker-base","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Versionen von drizzle-orm, drizzle-kit und better-sqlite3"],"pt":["Requer instalação do npm de drizzle-orm e drizzle-kit","Dependente de cloudflare-d1 e cloudflare-worker-base","Limitado a versões específicas de drizzle-orm, drizzle-kit e better-sqlite3"],"ru":["Требует установки npm drizzle-orm и drizzle-kit","Зависит от cloudflare-d1 и cloudflare-worker-base","Ограничен определёнными версиями drizzle-orm, drizzle-kit и better-sqlite3"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm drizzle-orm و drizzle-kit","يعتمد على cloudflare-d1 و cloudflare-worker-base","محدود بإصدارات معينة من drizzle-orm و drizzle-kit و better-sqlite3"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
