e fichiers analyse et structure vos dossiers pour une meilleure organisation","de":"Der Datei-Organizer analysiert und ordnet Ihre Ordnerstruktur für eine bessere Organisation","pt":"O organizador de arquivos é uma ferramenta que analisa e organiza seus arquivos e pastas de forma eficiente.","ru":"Организатор файлов - это инструмент, который анализирует и организует ваши файлы и папки эффективно.","ar":"منظم الملفات هو أداة تحليل وتنظيم ملفاتك ومجلداتك بفعالية.","en":"Luxury Cheat''s"},"definition":{"en":"Luxury Cheat''s"},"features":{"zh":["分析当前文件结构","整理文件和文件夹","删除重复文件","建立合理的文件夹结构","提高工作效率"],"ja":["現在のファイル構造を分析","ファイルとフォルダを整理","重複ファイルを削除","合理なフォルダ構造を確立","作業効率を向上"],"ko":["현재 파일 구조 분석","파일과 폴더 정리","중복 파일 삭제","합리적인 폴더 구조 설정","작업 효율 향상"],"es":["Análisis de la estructura de carpetas actual","Ordenamiento de archivos y carpetas","Eliminación de archivos duplicados","Creación de una estructura de carpetas lógica","Mejora de la organización y productividad"],"fr":["Analyse de la structure de dossiers actuelle"," Organisation de fichiers et de dossiers","Suppression de fichiers en double","Création d''une structure de dossiers logique","Amélioration de l''organisation et de la productivité"],"de":["Analyse der aktuellen Ordnerstruktur","Ordnung von Dateien und Ordnern","Entfernung von doppelten Dateien","Erstellung einer logischen Ordnerstruktur","Verbesserung der Organisation und Produktivität"],"pt":["Análise da estrutura atual de arquivos e pastas","Organização de arquivos e pastas de forma eficiente","Eliminação de arquivos duplicados","Criação de uma estrutura de pastas lógica","Melhoria da produtividade com arquivos organizados"],"ru":["Анализ текущей структуры файлов и папок","Организация файлов и папок эффективно","Удаление дубликатов файлов","Создание логической структуры папок","Повышение производительности с организованными файлами"],"ar":["تحليل هيكل الملفات والمجلدات الحالي","تنظيم الملفات والمجلدات بفعالية","إزالة الملفات المكررة","إنشاء هيكل مجلدات منطقي","تحسين الإنتاجية مع الملفات المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文件组织器","文件管理","文件整理","文件夹结构","工作效率","生产力","文件分析"],"ja":["ファイルオーガナイザー","ファイル管理","ファイル整理","フォルダ構造","作業効率","生産性","ファイル分析"],"ko":["파일 조직자","파일 관리","파일 정리","폴더 구조","작업 효율","생산성","파일 분석"],"es":["organizador de archivos","estructura de carpetas","ordenamiento de archivos","eliminación de archivos duplicados","productividad","organización de proyectos"],"fr":["organisateur de fichiers","structure de dossiers","organisation de fichiers","suppression de fichiers en double","productivité","organisation de projets"],"de":["Datei-Organizer","Ordnerstruktur","Ordnung von Dateien","Entfernung von doppelten Dateien","Produktivität","Projektorganisation"],"pt":["organizador de arquivos","gerenciamento de arquivos","organização de pastas","eliminação de arquivos duplicados","produtividade","eficiência"],"ru":["организатор файлов","управление файлами","организация папок","удаление дубликатов файлов","производительность","эффективность"],"ar":["منظم الملفات","إدارة الملفات","تنظيم المجلدات","إزالة الملفات المكررة","الإنتاجية","الفعالية"]}},"owner":"iFor-Lux","repo":"LuxuryCheats","repoPath":"iFor-Lux/LuxuryCheats","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"file-organizer","description":"Intelligently organizes files and folders by understanding context, finding duplicates, and suggesting better organizational structures. Use when user wants to clean up directories, organize downloads, remove duplicates, or restructure projects.","bodyPreview":"# File Organizer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Your Downloads folder is a chaotic mess\n- You can''t find files because they''re scattered everywhere\n- You have duplicate files taking up space\n- Your folder structure doesn''t make sense anymore\n- You want to establish better organization habits\n- You''re starting a new project and need a good structure\n- You''re cleaning up before archiving old projects\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Current Structure**: Reviews your folders and files to unde","body":"# File Organizer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Your Downloads folder is a chaotic mess\n- You can''t find files because they''re scattered everywhere\n- You have duplicate files taking up space\n- Your folder structure doesn''t make sense anymore\n- You want to establish better organization habits\n- You''re starting a new project and need a good structure\n- You''re cleaning up before archiving old projects\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Current Structure**: Reviews your folders and files to understand what you have\n2. **Finds Duplicates**: Identifies duplicate files across your system\n3. **Suggests Organization**: Proposes logical folder structures based on your content\n4. **Automates Cleanup**: Moves, renames, and organizes files with your approval\n5. **Maintains Context**: Makes smart decisions based on file types, dates, and content\n6. **Reduces Clutter**: Identifies old files you probably don''t need anymore\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests file organization help:\n\n1. **Understand the Scope**\n\n   Ask clarifying questions:\n\n   - Which directory needs organization? (Downloads, Documents, entire home folder?)\n   - What''s the main problem? (Can''t find things, duplicates, too messy, no structure?)\n   - Any files or folders to avoid? (Current projects, sensitive data?)\n   - How aggressively to organize? (Conservative vs. comprehensive cleanup)\n\n2. **Analyze Current State**\n\n   Review the target directory:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Get overview of current structure\n   ls -la [target_directory]\n\n   # Check file types and sizes\n   find [target_directory] -type f -exec file {} \\; | head -20\n\n   # Identify largest files\n   du -sh [target_directory]/* | sort -rh | head -20\n\n   # Count file types\n   find [target_directory] -type f | sed ''s/.*\\.//'' | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\n   ```\n\n   Summarize findings:\n\n   - Total files and folders\n   - File type breakdown\n   - Size distribution\n   - Date ranges\n   - Obvious organization issues\n\n3. **Identify Organization Patterns**\n\n   Based on the files, determine logical groupings:\n\n   **By Type**:\n\n   - Documents (PDFs, DOCX, TXT)\n   - Images (JPG, PNG, SVG)\n   - Videos (MP4, MOV)\n   - Archives (ZIP, TAR, DMG)\n   - Code/Projects (directories with code)\n   - Spreadsheets (XLSX, CSV)\n   - Presentations (PPTX, KEY)\n\n   **By Purpose**:\n\n   - Work vs. Personal\n   - Active vs. Archive\n   - Project-specific\n   - Reference materials\n   - Temporary/scratch files\n\n   **By Date**:\n\n   - Current year/month\n   - Previous years\n   - Very old (archive candidates)\n\n4. **Find Duplicates**\n\n   When requested, search for duplicates:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Find exact duplicates by hash\n   find [directory] -type f -exec md5 {} \\; | sort | uniq -d\n\n   # Find files with similar names\n   find [directory] -type f -printf ''%f\\n'' | sort | uniq -d\n\n   # Find similar-sized files\n   find [directory] -type f -printf ''%s %p\\n'' | sort -n\n   ```\n\n   For each set of duplicates:\n\n   - Show all file paths\n   - Display sizes and modification dates\n   - Recommend which to keep (usually newest or best-named)\n   - **Important**: Always ask for confirmation before deleting\n\n5. **Propose Organization Plan**\n\n   Present a clear plan before making changes:\n\n   ```markdown\n   # Organization Plan for [Directory]\n\n   ## Current State\n\n   - X files across Y folders\n   - [Size] total\n   - File types: [breakdown]\n   - Issues: [list problems]\n\n   ## Proposed Structure\n\n   [Directory]/\n   ├── Work/\n   │ ├── Projects/\n   │ ├── Documents/\n   │ └── Archive/\n   ├── Personal/\n   │ ├── Photos/\n   │ ├── Documents/\n   │ └── Media/\n   └── Downloads/\n   ├── To-Sort/\n   └── Archive/\n\n   ## Changes I''ll Make\n\n   1. **Create new folders**: [list]\n   2. **Move files**:\n      - X PDFs → Work/Documents/\n      - Y images → Personal/Photos/\n      - Z old files → Archive/\n   3. **Rename files**: [any renaming patterns]\n   4. **Delete**: [duplicates or trash files]\n\n   ## Files Needing Your Decision\n\n   - [List any files you''re unsure about]\n\n   Ready to proceed? (yes/no/modify)\n   ```\n\n6. **Execute Organization**\n\n   After approval, organize systematically:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Create folder structure\n   mkdir -p \"path/to/new/folders\"\n\n   # Move files with clear logging\n   mv \"old/path/file.pdf\" \"new/path/file.pdf\"\n\n   # Rename files with consistent patterns\n   # Example: \"YYYY-MM-DD - Description.ext\"\n   ```\n\n   **Important Rules**:\n\n   - Always confirm before deleting anything\n   - Log all moves for potential undo\n   - Preserve original modification dates\n   - Handle filename conflicts gracefully\n   - Stop and ask if you encounter unexpected situations\n\n7. **Provide Summary and Maintenance Tips**\n\n   After organizing:\n\n   ```markdown\n   # Organization Complete! ✨\n\n   ## What Changed\n\n   - Created [X] new folders\n   - Organized [Y] files\n   - Freed [Z] GB by removing duplicates\n   - Archived [W] old files\n\n   ## New Structure\n\n   [Show the new folder tree]\n\n   ## Maintenance Tips\n\n   To keep this organized:\n\n   1. **Weekly**: Sort new downloads\n   2. **Monthly**: Review and archive completed projects\n   3. **Quarterly**: Check for new duplicates\n   4. **Yearly**: Archive old files\n\n   ## Quick Commands for You\n\n   # Find files modified this week\n\n   find . -type f -mtime -7\n\n   # Sort downloads by type\n\n   [custom command for their setup]\n\n   # Find duplicates\n\n   [custom command]\n   ```\n\n   Want to organize another folder?\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Folder Naming\n\n- Use clear, descriptive names\n- Avoid spaces (use hyphens or underscores)\n- Be specific: \"client-proposals\" not \"docs\"\n- Use prefixes for ordering: \"01-current\", \"02-archive\"\n\n### File Naming\n\n- Include dates: \"2024-10-17-meeting-notes.md\"\n- Be descriptive: \"q3-financial-report.xlsx\"\n- Avoid version numbers in names (use version control instead)\n- Remove download artifacts: \"document-final-v2 (1).pdf\" → \"document.pdf\"\n\n### When to Archive\n\n- Projects not touched in 6+ months\n- Completed work that might be referenced later\n- Old versions after migration to new systems\n- Files you''re hesitant to delete (archive first)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:51:27.600Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing advanced file management and organization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要高级的文件管理和组织能力。","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度なファイル管理および組織機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 고급 파일 관리 및 조직 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de gestión y organización de archivos avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme AutoGPT et LangChain ayant besoin de capacités de gestion et d''organisation de fichiers avancées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Dateiverwaltungs- und Organisationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing advanced file management and organization capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing advanced file management and organization capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing advanced file management and organization capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze current folder structures, eliminate duplicate files, and establish better organization habits using protocols like file system analysis and folder restructuring, while also supporting various file formats.","zh":"赋予代理分析当前文件夹结构、消除重复文件、使用文件系统分析和文件夹重构等协议建立更好的组织习惯的能力，同时也支持各种文件格式。","ja":"エージェントに現在のフォルダ構造を分析し、重複ファイルを排除し、ファイルシステム分析やフォルダ再構成などのプロトコルを使用してより良い組織習慣を確立する能力を付与し、同時にさまざまなファイル形式もサポートします。","ko":"현재 폴더 구조를 분석하고 중복 파일을 제거하며 파일 시스템 분석 및 폴더 재구성 등 프로토콜을 사용하여 더好的 조직 습관을养成하는 능력을 부여하며 동시에 다양한 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar las estructuras de carpetas actuales, eliminar archivos duplicados y establecer mejores hábitos de organización utilizando protocolos como análisis de sistema de archivos y reestructuración de carpetas, y también admite varios formatos de archivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les structures de dossiers actuelles, d''éliminer les fichiers en double et d''établir de meilleures habitudes d''organisation en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''analyse du système de fichiers et la réorganisation des dossiers, tout en prenant en charge divers formats de fichiers.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die aktuellen Ordnerstrukturen zu analysieren, doppelte Dateien zu eliminieren und bessere Organisationsgewohnheiten mit Protokollen wie Dateisystemanalyse und Ordnerumstrukturierung zu etablieren, und unterstützt auch verschiedene Dateiformate.","pt":"Empowers agents to analyze current folder structures, eliminate duplicate files, and establish better organization habits using protocols like file system analysis and folder restructuring, while also supporting various file formats.","ru":"Empowers agents to analyze current folder structures, eliminate duplicate files, and establish better organization habits using protocols like file system analysis and folder restructuring, while also supporting various file formats.","ar":"Empowers agents to analyze current folder structures, eliminate duplicate files, and establish better organization habits using protocols like file system analysis and folder restructuring, while also supporting various file formats."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating folder cleanups","Generating organized project structures","Eliminating duplicate files","Establishing better file naming conventions"],"zh":["自动化文件夹清理","生成有组织的项目结构","消除重复文件","建立更好的文件命名约定"],"ja":["フォルダのクリーンアップを自動化する","整理されたプロジェクト構造を生成する","重複ファイルを排除する","より良いファイル命名規則を確立する"],"ko":["폴더 정리를 자동화하는 것","조직화된 프로젝트 구조를 생성하는 것","중복 파일을 제거하는 것","더好的 파일 이름 규칙을养成하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de limpieza de carpetas","Generación de estructuras de proyecto organizadas","Eliminación de archivos duplicados","Establecimiento de mejores convenciones de nomenclatura de archivos"],"fr":["Automatisation du nettoyage des dossiers","Génération de structures de projet organisées","Élimination de fichiers en double","Établissement de meilleures conventions de dénomination de fichiers"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ordnerbereinigung","Generierung von organisierten Projektstrukturen","Eliminierung von doppelten Dateien","Festlegung besserer Dateibenennungskonventionen"],"pt":["Automating folder cleanups","Generating organized project structures","Eliminating duplicate files","Establishing better file naming conventions"],"ru":["Automating folder cleanups","Generating organized project structures","Eliminating duplicate files","Establishing better file naming conventions"],"ar":["Automating folder cleanups","Generating organized project structures","Eliminating duplicate files","Establishing better file naming conventions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access","May not support all file formats","Limited to local file system organization"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限","可能不支持所有文件格式","仅限于本地文件系统组织"],"ja":["ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","すべてのファイル形式をサポートできない","ローカルファイルシステムの組織のみに限定される"],"ko":["파일 시스템 접근 권한이 필요함","모든 파일 형식을 지원하지 않을 수 있음","로컬 파일 시스템 조직만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos","Es posible que no admita todos los formatos de archivo","Limitado a la organización del sistema de archivos local"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers","Peut ne pas prendre en charge tous les formats de fichiers","Limité à l''organisation du système de fichiers local"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem","Unterstützt möglicherweise nicht alle Dateiformate","Begrenzt auf die Organisation des lokalen D