e archivos de red","Escaneo de datos de alta entropía","Trabajo con firmas de archivo y bytes mágicos"],"fr":["Analyse de fichiers suspects","Extraction de données cachées","Détection de la stéganographie","Analyse de fichiers de réseau","Balayage de données à haute entropie","Travail avec des signatures de fichier et des bytes magiques"],"de":["Analyse von verdächtigen Dateien","Extraktion von versteckten Daten","Erkennung von Steganographie","Analyse von Netzwerkdiensten","Scannen von Daten mit hoher Entropie","Arbeit mit Dateisignaturen und magischen Bytes"],"pt":["Análise de arquivos","Extração de dados","Detecção de esteganografia","Análise de rede","Digital Forensics"],"ru":["Анализ файлов","Извлечение данных","Обнаружение стеганографии","Анализ сети","Цифровая судебная экспертиза"],"ar":["تحليل الملفات","استخراج البيانات","اكتشاف الاستغانوغرافيا","تحليل الشبكة","فورينسيك رقمي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数字取证","数字证据","隐写","文件分析","网络安全","加密"],"ja":["デジタルフォレンジック","デジタル証拠","ステガノグラフィー","ファイル分析","ネットワークセキュリティ","暗号化"],"ko":["디지털 포렌식","디지털 증거","은닉","파일 분석","네트워크 보안","암호화"],"es":["herramientas de forensia digital","análisis de archivos","seguridad informática","esteganografía","cifrado","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["outils de forensique numérique","analyse de fichiers","sécurité informatique","stéganographie","chiffrement","développement de logiciels"],"de":["digitale Forensik-Tools","Dateianalyse","Computer-Sicherheit","Steganographie","Verschlüsselung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de forense digital","análise de arquivos","extração de dados","esteganografia","segurança cibernética","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["цифровые инструменты судебной экспертизы","анализ файлов","извлечение данных","стеганография","кибербезопасность","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أدوات فورينسيك رقمية","تحليل الملفات","استخراج البيانات","استغانوغرافيا","أمن المعلومات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"G36maid","repo":"ctf-arsenal","repoPath":"G36maid/ctf-arsenal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"forensics-tools","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Digital Forensics Tools\n\n## When to Use\n\nLoad this skill when:\n- Analyzing suspicious files or unknown file formats\n- Extracting hidden data or carved files\n- Detecting steganography in images/audio\n- Analyzing network PCAP files\n- Scanning for high-entropy (encrypted/compressed) data\n- Working with file signatures and magic bytes\n\n## File Analysis and Carving\n\n### Binwalk - Extract Embedded Files\n\n```bash\n# Scan for embedded files\nbinwalk suspicious.bin\n\n# Extract all found files\nbinwalk -e s","body":"# Digital Forensics Tools\n\n## When to Use\n\nLoad this skill when:\n- Analyzing suspicious files or unknown file formats\n- Extracting hidden data or carved files\n- Detecting steganography in images/audio\n- Analyzing network PCAP files\n- Scanning for high-entropy (encrypted/compressed) data\n- Working with file signatures and magic bytes\n\n## File Analysis and Carving\n\n### Binwalk - Extract Embedded Files\n\n```bash\n# Scan for embedded files\nbinwalk suspicious.bin\n\n# Extract all found files\nbinwalk -e suspicious.bin\n\n# Extract with signature scan\nbinwalk --dd=''.*'' suspicious.bin\n\n# Scan for specific file types\nbinwalk --signature image.png\n```\n\n### Common File Signatures (Magic Bytes)\n\n| File Type | Signature (Hex) | Signature (ASCII) |\n|-----------|----------------|-------------------|\n| **PNG** | `89 50 4E 47 0D 0A 1A 0A` | `.PNG....` |\n| **JPEG** | `FF D8 FF E0/E1` | `ÿØÿà` |\n| **GIF** | `47 49 46 38 37/39 61` | `GIF87a/GIF89a` |\n| **ZIP** | `50 4B 03 04` | `PK..` |\n| **PDF** | `25 50 44 46` | `%PDF` |\n| **ELF** | `7F 45 4C 46` | `.ELF` |\n| **RAR** | `52 61 72 21 1A 07` | `Rar!..` |\n\n### Manual File Carving with dd\n\n```bash\n# Extract bytes from offset to end\ndd if=input.bin of=output.bin skip=1024 bs=1\n\n# Extract specific byte range\ndd if=input.bin of=output.bin skip=1024 count=2048 bs=1\n\n# Find PNG signature and extract\ngrep --only-matching --byte-offset --binary --text $''\\x89PNG'' file.bin\n```\n\n### Strings Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Extract ASCII strings\nstrings suspicious.bin\n\n# Extract with minimum length\nstrings -n 10 suspicious.bin\n\n# Search for specific patterns\nstrings suspicious.bin | grep -i \"flag\\|password\\|key\"\n\n# Unicode strings (16-bit little-endian)\nstrings -el suspicious.bin\n\n# With file offsets\nstrings -t x suspicious.bin\n```\n\n## Steganography Detection\n\n### Image Steganography\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Quick steganography checks\"\"\"\nfrom PIL import Image\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef check_lsb(image_path):\n    \"\"\"Check LSB (Least Significant Bit) steganography\"\"\"\n    img = Image.open(image_path)\n    pixels = np.array(img)\n    \n    # Extract LSBs\n    lsb = pixels & 1\n    \n    # Visualize LSBs (amplify for visibility)\n    lsb_img = Image.fromarray((lsb * 255).astype(''uint8''))\n    lsb_img.save(''lsb_analysis.png'')\n    print(\"[+] LSB analysis saved to lsb_analysis.png\")\n\ndef extract_lsb_data(image_path):\n    \"\"\"Extract data from LSBs\"\"\"\n    img = Image.open(image_path)\n    pixels = np.array(img).flatten()\n    \n    # Extract LSBs as bits\n    bits = ''''.join([str(p & 1) for p in pixels])\n    \n    # Convert to bytes\n    data = bytearray()\n    for i in range(0, len(bits), 8):\n        byte = bits[i:i+8]\n        if len(byte) == 8:\n            data.append(int(byte, 2))\n    \n    return bytes(data)\n\n# Usage\ncheck_lsb(''suspicious.png'')\ndata = extract_lsb_data(''suspicious.png'')\nprint(data[:100])  # First 100 bytes\n```\n\n### Common Steganography Tools\n\n```bash\n# Steghide (JPEG, BMP, WAV, AU)\nsteghide info suspicious.jpg\nsteghide extract -sf suspicious.jpg\n\n# StegSolve (GUI tool for image analysis)\njava -jar stegsolve.jar\n\n# Zsteg (PNG, BMP)\nzsteg suspicious.png\nzsteg -a suspicious.png  # All checks\n\n# Exiftool (metadata analysis)\nexiftool suspicious.jpg\nexiftool -all suspicious.jpg\n\n# Foremost (file carving)\nforemost -i suspicious.bin -o output/\n```\n\n### Audio Steganography\n\n```bash\n# Spectogram analysis with Sox\nsox audio.wav -n spectrogram -o spectro.png\n\n# Or with Python\npython3 helpers/spectrogram.py audio.wav\n\n# Audacity (GUI)\n# File -> Open -> Analyze -> Plot Spectrum\n```\n\n## Network Forensics\n\n### PCAP Analysis with tshark\n\n```bash\n# Basic statistics\ntshark -r capture.pcap -q -z io,phs\n\n# Extract HTTP objects\ntshark -r capture.pcap --export-objects http,output/\n\n# Filter by protocol\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"http\"\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"dns\"\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"tcp.port == 80\"\n\n# Extract HTTP requests\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"http.request\" -T fields -e http.request.full_uri\n\n# Extract HTTP POST data\ntshark -r capture.pcap -Y \"http.request.method == POST\" -T fields -e http.file_data\n\n# Follow TCP stream\ntshark -r capture.pcap -z follow,tcp,ascii,0\n\n# Extract files\ntshark -r capture.pcap --export-objects http,extracted/\ntshark -r capture.pcap --export-objects smb,extracted/\n```\n\n### Extract HTTP Traffic\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract HTTP traffic from PCAP\"\"\"\nfrom scapy.all import *\n\ndef extract_http(pcap_file):\n    \"\"\"Extract HTTP requests and responses\"\"\"\n    packets = rdpcap(pcap_file)\n    \n    for pkt in packets:\n        if pkt.haslayer(TCP) and pkt.haslayer(Raw):\n            payload = pkt[Raw].load\n            \n            # Check for HTTP\n            if payload.startswith(b''GET'') or payload.startswith(b''POST''):\n                print(\"[HTTP Request]\")\n                print(payload.decode(''latin-1'', errors=''ignore''))\n                print(\"-\" * 60)\n            \n            elif payload.startswith(b''HTTP/''):\n                print(\"[HTTP Response]\")\n                print(payload.decode(''latin-1'', errors=''ignore'')[:200])\n                print(\"-\" * 60)\n\nextract_http(''capture.pcap'')\n```\n\n### Reconstruct Files from PCAP\n\n```bash\n# NetworkMiner (Windows/Linux with Mono)\nmono NetworkMiner.exe --nogui -r capture.pcap -o output/\n\n# tcpflow - Reconstruct TCP sessions\ntcpflow -r capture.pcap -o output/\n\n# Wireshark export\n# File -> Export Objects -> HTTP/SMB/TFTP\n```\n\n## Entropy Analysis\n\n### Detect Encrypted/Compressed Data\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Scan file for high-entropy regions\"\"\"\nimport math\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef calculate_entropy(data):\n    \"\"\"Calculate Shannon entropy\"\"\"\n    if not data:\n        return 0\n    \n    entropy = 0\n    counter = Counter(data)\n    length = len(data)\n    \n    for count in counter.values():\n        probability = count / length\n        entropy -= probability * math.log2(probability)\n    \n    return entropy\n\ndef scan_entropy(filename, block_size=256):\n    \"\"\"Scan file for high-entropy blocks\"\"\"\n    with open(filename, ''rb'') as f:\n        data = f.read()\n    \n    print(f\"Scanning {filename} for high-entropy regions...\")\n    print(f\"Block size: {block_size} bytes\")\n    print(\"-\" * 60)\n    \n    for i in range(0, len(data), block_size):\n        block = data[i:i+block_size]\n        if len(block) < block_size // 2:\n            continue\n        \n        entropy = calculate_entropy(block)\n        \n        # High entropy (> 7.5) indicates encryption/compression\n        if entropy > 7.5:\n            print(f\"Offset 0x{i:08x}: Entropy = {entropy:.4f} [HIGH]\")\n\n# Usage\nscan_entropy(''suspicious.bin'', block_size=512)\n```\n\n## Memory Forensics\n\n### Volatility (if applicable in CTF)\n\n```bash\n# Identify profile\nvolatility -f memory.dmp imageinfo\n\n# List processes\nvolatility -f memory.dmp --profile=Win7SP1x64 pslist\n\n# Dump process memory\nvolatility -f memory.dmp --profile=Win7SP1x64 memdump -p 1234 -D output/\n\n# Extract files\nvolatility -f memory.dmp --profile=Win7SP1x64 filescan\nvolatility -f memory.dmp --profile=Win7SP1x64 dumpfiles -Q 0x000000003e8b6f20 -D output/\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool | Command |\n|------|------|---------|\n| **File carving** | binwalk | `binwalk -e file.bin` |\n| **Strings** | strings | `strings -n 10 file.bin` |\n| **Image LSB** | zsteg | `zsteg -a image.png` |\n| **JPEG steg** | steghide | `steghide extract -sf image.jpg` |\n| **Metadata** | exiftool | `exiftool image.jpg` |\n| **PCAP HTTP** | tshark | `tshark -r file.pcap --export-objects http,out/` |\n| **TCP stream** | tshark | `tshark -r file.pcap -z follow,tcp,ascii,0` |\n| **Spectrogram** | sox | `sox audio.wav -n spectrogram -o spec.png` |\n| **Entropy** | custom | `python3 helpers/entropy_scan.py file.bin` |\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### File Analysis\n\n- `file_analysis/binwalk_extract.sh` - Wrapper for binwalk extraction\n\n### Steganography\n\n- `steganography/steg_quickcheck.py` - Automated steg detection\n  - LSB analysis\n  - Metadata extraction\n  - Entropy visualization\n\n### Network Forensics\n\n- `network_forensics/pcap_extract_http.py` - Extract HTTP from PCAP\n- `network_forensics/pcap_extract_files.py` - Reconstruct files from PCAP\n\n### Helpers\n\n- `helpers/entropy_scan.py` - Scan files for high-entropy regions\n- `helpers/file_signature_check.py` - Verify file signatures\n- `helpers/strings_smart.py` - Enhanced string extraction\n\n## External Tools\n\n```bash\n# Install common forensics tools\nsudo apt install binwalk foremost steghide exiftool\n\n# Python tools\npip install pillow numpy scapy\n\n# Specialized tools\n# - StegSolve: https://github.com/zardus/ctf-tools (Java-based)\n# - Audacity: https://www.audacityteam.org/ (audio analysis)\n# - Wireshark: https://www.wireshark.org/ (PCAP GUI analysis)\n```\n\n## Keywords\n\nforensics, digital forensics, file carving, binwalk, steganography, steg, LSB, least significant bit, PCAP, packet capture, network forensics, tshark, wireshark, entropy analysis, strings, metadata, exiftool, file signatures, magic bytes, audio steganography, spectrogram, image analysis, data extraction, hidden data\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:52:04.525Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cybersecurity Agents requiring advanced digital forensics capabilities for analyzing suspicious files and network traffic.","zh":"适用于需要高级数字取证功能的网络安全代理，以分析可疑文件和网络流量。","ja":"サイバーセキュリティエージェントが高度なデジタルフォレンジック機能を必要とする場合に適しています。サスペンドファイルとネットワークトラフィックを分析するために使用されます。","ko":"고급 디지털 포렌식 기능이 필요한 사이버 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 의심스러운 파일 및 네트워크 트래픽을 분석하는 데 사용됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de ciberseguridad que requieren capacidades de forensia digital avanzadas para analizar archivos y tráfico de red sospechosos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de cybersécurité nécessitant des capacités de forensique numérique avancées pour analyser des fichiers et un trafic réseau suspects.","de":"Ideal für Cybersicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte digitale Forensikfähigkeiten für die Analyse von verdächtigen Dateien und Netzwerkverkehr benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Cibersegurança que requerem capacidades avançadas de perícia digital para analisar arquivos suspeitos e tráfego de rede.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кибербезопасности, требующих продвинутых возможностей цифровой криминалистики для анализа подозрительных файлов и сетевого трафика.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الأمن السيبراني الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحليل رقمية متقدمة لتحليل الملفات المشبوهة وحركة المرور الشبكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract hidden data, detect steganography, and scan for high-entropy data using tools like Binwalk, providing critical insights into file signatures, magic bytes, and network PCAP files.","zh":"赋予代理提取隐藏数据、检测隐写术并使用Binwalk等工具扫描高熵数据的能力，从而为文件签名、魔术字节和网络PCAP文件提供关键见解。","ja":"エージェントが隠されたデータを抽出してステガノグラフィーを検出し、Binwalkなどのツールを使用して高エントロピーのデータをスキャンする能力を提供し、ファイルのシグネチャ、マジックバイト、ネットワークPCAPファイルに関する重要な洞察を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 숨겨진 데이터를 추출하고 스테가노그래피를 감지하며 Binwalk와 같은 도구를 사용하여 높은 엔트로피 데이터를 스캔할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 파일 시그니처, 매직 바이트 및 네트워크 PCAP 파일에 대한 중요한 통찰력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer datos ocultos, detectar esteganografía y escanear datos de alta entropía utilizando herramientas como Binwalk, lo que proporciona información crítica sobre firmas de archivos, bytes mágicos y archivos de captura de red PCAP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des données cachées, de détecter la stéganographie et de scanner des données à haute entropie à l''aide d''outils tels que Binwalk, ce qui fournit des informations critiques sur les signatures de fichiers, les bytes magiques et les fichiers PCAP de capture de réseau.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, versteckte Daten zu extrahieren, Steganographie zu erkennen und hochentropische Daten mithilfe von Tools wie Binwalk zu scannen, wodurch kritische Einblicke in Dateisignaturen, Magie-Bytes und Netzwerk-PCAP-Dateien gewonnen werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam dados ocultos, detectem esteganografia e escaneiem dados de alta entropia usando ferramentas como Binwalk, fornecendo insights críticos sobre assinaturas de arquivo, bytes mágicos e arquivos PCAP de rede.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать скрытые данные, обнаруживать стеганографию и сканировать данные с высокой энтропией с помощью инструментов như Binwalk, обеспечивая критическую информацию о подписях файлов, магических байтах и сетевых файлах PCAP.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية استخراج البيانات المخفية ، وكشف التشفير المزدوج ، ومسح البيانات عالية الإنتروبي باستخدام أدوات مثل Binwalk ، مما يوفر رؤى حاسمة حول توقيعات الملفات ، بايتات السحر والملفات الشبكية PCAP."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing suspicious files for embedded malware","Extracting carved files from disk images","Detecting steganography in images and audio files","Scanning network PCAP files for signs of intrusion"],"zh":["分析嵌入恶意软件的可疑文件","从磁盘映像中提取刻录文件","在图像和音频文件中检测隐写术","扫描网络PCAP文件以查找入侵迹象"],"ja":["潜在のマルウェアを含むサスペンドファイルを分析する","ディスクイメージからカービングされたファイルを抽出する","画像やオーディオファイルのステガノグラフィーを検出する","ネットワークPCAPファイルをスキャンして侵入の兆候を探す"],"ko":["임베디드 악성 코드를 포함하는 의심스러운 파일을 분석하는 것","디스크 이미지에서 캐빙된 파일을 추출하는 것","이미지 및 오디오 파일에서 스테가노그래피를 감지하는 것","네트워크 PCAP 파일을 스캔하여 침입의 징조를 찾는 것"],"es":["Analizar archivos sospechosos para malware incrustado","Extraer archivos tallados de imágenes de disco","Detectar esteganografía en imágenes y archivos de audio","Escanear archivos de captura de red PCAP en busca de signos de intrusión"],"fr":["Analyser des fichiers suspects pour malware intégré","Extraire des fichiers taillés à partir d''images de disque","Détecter la stéganographie dans des images et des fichiers audio","Analyser des fichiers PCAP de capture de réseau pour les signes d''intrusion"],"de":["Analysieren von verdächtigen Dateien auf eingebettetes Malware","Extrahieren von geschnittenen Dateien aus Disk-Images","Erkennen von Steganographie in Bildern und Audio-Dateien","Scannen von Netzwerk-PCAP-Dateien auf Anzeichen von Eindringen"],"pt":["Analisar arquivos suspeitos para malware incorporado","Extrair arquivos talhados de imagens de disco","Detectar esteganografia em imagens e arquivos de áudio","Escaneiar arquivos PCAP de rede para sinais de intrusão"],"ru":["Анализ подозрительных файлов на наличие встроенного вредоносного ПО","Извлечение вырезанных файлов из образов диска","Обнаружение стеганографии в изображениях и аудиофайлах","Сканирование сетевых файлов PCAP на наличие признаков вторжения"],"ar":["تحليل الملفات المشبوهة للبرمجيات الخبيثة المضمنة","استخراج الملفات المنحوتة من صور القرص","كشف التشفير المزدوج في الصور وملفات الصوت","مسح ملفات PCAP الشبكية لآثار الاختراق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access for file analysis","Limited to specific file formats and protocols (e.g., PCAP, binwalk-supported files)"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限才能分析文件","仅限于特定的文件格式和协议（例如PCAP、Binwalk支持的文件）"],"ja":["ファイル分析のためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","特定のファイル形式やプロトコル（例：PCAP、Binwalkでサポートされているファイル）のみに限定される"],"ko":["파일 분석을 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요함","특정 파일 형식 및 프로토콜(예: PCAP, Binwalk에서 지원하는 파일)으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para el análisis de archivos","Limitado a formatos de archivo y protocolos específicos (por ejemplo, PCAP, archivos compatibles con binwalk)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour l''analyse de fichiers","Limité à des formats de fichiers et des protocoles spécifiques (par exemple, PCAP, fichiers pris en charge par binwalk)"],"de":["Benötigt Dateisystemzugriff für die Dateianalyse","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Dateiformate und Protokolle (z. B. PCAP, binwalk-unterstützte Dateien)"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para análise de arquivos","Limitado a formatos de arquivo e protocolos específicos (por exemplo, PCAP, arquivos compatíveis com Binwalk)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для анализа файлов","Ограничен конкретными форматами файлов и протоколами (например, PCAP, файлы, поддерживаемые Binwalk)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لتحليل الملفات","محدود بالتنسيقات المحددة للملفات والبروتوكولات (على سبيل المثال ، PCAP ، ملفات مدعومة من Binwalk)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
