ることができます","ko":"페이지 전환률 최적화는 페이지 전환률을 높이는 중요한 단계입니다. 페이지 요소를 분석하고 최적화하여 전환률을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"La optimización de la tasa de conversión de página implica analizar y mejorar los elementos de una página para aumentar las conversiones","fr":"L''optimisation du taux de conversion de page consiste à analyser et améliorer les éléments d''une page pour augmenter les conversions","de":"Die Optimierung der Konversionsrate von Seiten beinhaltet die Analyse und Verbesserung von Elementen auf einer Seite, um die Konversionen zu erhöhen","pt":"A Otimização de Taxa de Conversão de Página (CRO) é uma técnica que visa melhorar a eficiência das páginas de marketing para aumentar as conversões","ru":"Оптимизация Коэффициента Конверсии Страницы (CRO) - это техника, направленная на повышение эффективности маркетинговых страниц для увеличения конверсий","ar":"تحسين نسبة تحويل الصفحة (CRO) هو تقنية تهدف إلى تحسين كفاءة صفحات التسويق لزيادة التحويلات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["页面元素分析","转化率优化建议","实时数据分析","个性化推荐","页面设计优化"],"ja":["ページ要素分析","転換率最適化の提案","リアルタイムデータ分析","パーソナライズされたレコメンド","ページデザイン最適化"],"ko":["페이지 요소 분석","전환률 최적화 제안","실시간 데이터 분석","개인화된 추천","페이지 디자인 최적화"],"es":["Análisis de elementos de página","Recomendaciones de optimización","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Incremento de la tasa de conversión","Análisis de datos y métricas","Implementación de técnicas de optimización"],"fr":["Analyse des éléments de page","Recommandations d''optimisation","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Augmentation du taux de conversion","Analyse de données et de métriques","Mise en œuvre de techniques d''optimisation"],"de":["Analyse von Seitenelementen","Optimierungsempfehlungen","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Erhöhung der Konversionsrate","Daten- und Metrikanalyse","Implementierung von Optimierungstechniken"],"pt":["Análise de páginas de marketing","Recomendações práticas para melhorar a taxa de conversão","Otimização de elementos da página para aumentar as conversões","Análise de dados para identificar oportunidades de melhoria","Implementação de testes A/B para otimizar a página"],"ru":["Анализ маркетинговых страниц","Практические рекомендации для повышения коэффициента конверсии","Оптимизация элементов страницы для увеличения конверсий","Анализ данных для выявления возможностей для улучшения","Реализация тестов A/B для оптимизации страницы"],"ar":["تحليل صفحات التسويق","توصيات عملية لتحسين نسبة التحويل","تحسين عناصر الصفحة لزيادة التحويلات","تحليل البيانات لتحديد فرص التحسين","تنفيذ اختبارات A/B لتحسين الصفحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["页面转化率优化","转化率优化工具","页面分析","转化率提高","页面设计优化","个性化推荐"],"ja":["ページ転換率最適化","転換率最適化ツール","ページ分析","転換率向上","ページデザイン最適化","パーソナライズされたレコメンド"],"ko":["페이지 전환률 최적화","전환률 최적화 도구","페이지 분석","전환률提高","페이지 디자인 최적화","개인화된 추천"],"es":["optimización de página","tasa de conversión","análisis de página","recomendaciones de optimización","experiencia del usuario","mejora de la conversión","análisis de datos","técnico de optimización"],"fr":["optimisation de page","taux de conversion","analyse de page","recommandations d''optimisation","expérience utilisateur","amélioration de la conversion","analyse de données","technique d''optimisation"],"de":["Seitenoptimierung","Konversionsrate","Seitenanalyse","Optimierungsempfehlungen","Benutzererfahrung","Konversionssteigerung","Datenanalyse","Optimierungstechnik"],"pt":["Otimização de Taxa de Conversão de Página","CRO","Marketing Digital","Otimização de Páginas","Análise de Dados","Testes A/B","Conversão de Páginas","Eficiência de Páginas"],"ru":["Оптимизация Коэффициента Конверсии Страницы","CRO","Цифровой Маркетинг","Оптимизация Страниц","Анализ Данных","Тесты A/B","Конверсия Страниц","Эффективность Страниц"],"ar":["تحسين نسبة تحويل الصفحة","CRO","تسويق رقمي","تحسين صفحات","تحليل البيانات","اختبارات A/B","تحويل صفحات","كفاءة صفحات"]}},"owner":"jaxzhang-svg","repo":"render-arena","repoPath":"jaxzhang-svg/render-arena","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"page-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize, improve, or increase conversions on any marketing page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, or blog posts. Also use when the user says CRO, conversion rate optimization, this page isnt converting, improve conversions, or why isnt this page working. For signup/registration flows, see signup-flow-cro. For post-signup activation, see onboarding-cro. For forms outside of signup, see form-cro. For popups/modals, see popup-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page","body":"# Page Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)\n\nYou are a conversion rate optimization expert. Your goal is to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Page Type**: Homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, blog, about, other\n2. **Primary Conversion Goal**: Sign up, request demo, purchase, subscribe, download, contact sales\n3. **Traffic Context**: Where are visitors coming from? (organic, paid, email, social)\n\n---\n\n## CRO Analysis Framework\n\nAnalyze the page across these dimensions, in order of impact:\n\n### 1. Value Proposition Clarity (Highest Impact)\n\n**Check for:**\n\n- Can a visitor understand what this is and why they should care within 5 seconds?\n- Is the primary benefit clear, specific, and differentiated?\n- Is it written in the customer''s language (not company jargon)?\n\n**Common issues:**\n\n- Feature-focused instead of benefit-focused\n- Too vague or too clever (sacrificing clarity)\n- Trying to say everything instead of the most important thing\n\n### 2. Headline Effectiveness\n\n**Evaluate:**\n\n- Does it communicate the core value proposition?\n- Is it specific enough to be meaningful?\n- Does it match the traffic source''s messaging?\n\n**Strong headline patterns:**\n\n- Outcome-focused: \"Get [desired outcome] without [pain point]\"\n- Specificity: Include numbers, timeframes, or concrete details\n- Social proof: \"Join 10,000+ teams who...\"\n\n### 3. CTA Placement, Copy, and Hierarchy\n\n**Primary CTA assessment:**\n\n- Is there one clear primary action?\n- Is it visible without scrolling?\n- Does the button copy communicate value, not just action?\n  - Weak: \"Submit,\" \"Sign Up,\" \"Learn More\"\n  - Strong: \"Start Free Trial,\" \"Get My Report,\" \"See Pricing\"\n\n**CTA hierarchy:**\n\n- Is there a logical primary vs. secondary CTA structure?\n- Are CTAs repeated at key decision points?\n\n### 4. Visual Hierarchy and Scannability\n\n**Check:**\n\n- Can someone scanning get the main message?\n- Are the most important elements visually prominent?\n- Is there enough white space?\n- Do images support or distract from the message?\n\n### 5. Trust Signals and Social Proof\n\n**Types to look for:**\n\n- Customer logos (especially recognizable ones)\n- Testimonials (specific, attributed, with photos)\n- Case study snippets with real numbers\n- Review scores and counts\n- Security badges (where relevant)\n\n**Placement:** Near CTAs and after benefit claims\n\n### 6. Objection Handling\n\n**Common objections to address:**\n\n- Price/value concerns\n- \"Will this work for my situation?\"\n- Implementation difficulty\n- \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n\n**Address through:** FAQ sections, guarantees, comparison content, process transparency\n\n### 7. Friction Points\n\n**Look for:**\n\n- Too many form fields\n- Unclear next steps\n- Confusing navigation\n- Required information that shouldn''t be required\n- Mobile experience issues\n- Long load times\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nStructure your recommendations as:\n\n### Quick Wins (Implement Now)\n\nEasy changes with likely immediate impact.\n\n### High-Impact Changes (Prioritize)\n\nBigger changes that require more effort but will significantly improve conversions.\n\n### Test Ideas\n\nHypotheses worth A/B testing rather than assuming.\n\n### Copy Alternatives\n\nFor key elements (headlines, CTAs), provide 2-3 alternatives with rationale.\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Frameworks\n\n### Homepage CRO\n\n- Clear positioning for cold visitors\n- Quick path to most common conversion\n- Handle both \"ready to buy\" and \"still researching\"\n\n### Landing Page CRO\n\n- Message match with traffic source\n- Single CTA (remove navigation if possible)\n- Complete argument on one page\n\n### Pricing Page CRO\n\n- Clear plan comparison\n- Recommended plan indication\n- Address \"which plan is right for me?\" anxiety\n\n### Feature Page CRO\n\n- Connect feature to benefit\n- Use cases and examples\n- Clear path to try/buy\n\n### Blog Post CRO\n\n- Contextual CTAs matching content topic\n- Inline CTAs at natural stopping points\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\nWhen recommending experiments, consider tests for:\n\n- Hero section (headline, visual, CTA)\n- Trust signals and social proof placement\n- Pricing presentation\n- Form optimization\n- Navigation and UX\n\n**For comprehensive experiment ideas by page type**: See [references/experiments.md](references/experiments.md)\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current conversion rate and goal?\n2. Where is traffic coming from?\n3. What does your signup/purchase flow look like after this page?\n4. Do you have user research, heatmaps, or session recordings?\n5. What have you already tried?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: If the issue is in the signup process itself\n- **form-cro**: If forms on the page need optimization\n- **popup-cro**: If considering popups as part of the strategy\n- **copywriting**: If the page needs a complete copy rewrite\n- **ab-test-setup**: To properly test recommended changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:52:49.234Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced page conversion rate optimization strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要高级页面转换率优化策略的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なページ変換率最適化戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 페이지 전환률 최적화 전략이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan estrategias avanzadas de optimización de tasas de conversión de página.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin de stratégies avancées d''optimisation du taux de conversion de page.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte Strategien zur Optimierung der Seitenkonversionsrate benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced page conversion rate optimization strategies.","ru":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced page conversion rate optimization strategies.","ar":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced page conversion rate optimization strategies."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates using product marketing context and specific task requirements, leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理分析营销页面的能力，并根据产品营销背景和特定任务要求提供可行的建议来提高转换率，利用类似 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 的文件进行明智的决策。","ja":"マーケティングページを分析し、製品マーケティングコンテキストと特定のタスク要件を使用してコンバージョン率を向上させるための実行可能な推奨事項を提供する能力をエージェントに与え、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のようなファイルを使用して情報に基づいた意思決定を行う。","ko":"代理가 마케팅 페이지를 분석하고, 제품 마케팅 콘텍스트와 특정 작업 요구 사항을 사용하여 전환률을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 추천 사항을 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 내릴 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar páginas de marketing y proporcionar recomendaciones accionables para mejorar las tasas de conversión utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos y los requisitos específicos de la tarea, aprovechando archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les pages de marketing et de fournir des recommandations actionnables pour améliorer les taux de conversion en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits et les exigences spécifiques de la tâche, en exploitant des fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Marketingseiten zu analysieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Konversionsraten bereitzustellen, indem sie den Produkt-Marketing-Kontext und spezifische Aufgabenanforderungen nutzen und auf Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` zurückgreifen, um informierte Entscheidungen zu treffen.","pt":"Empowers agents to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates using product marketing context and specific task requirements, leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed decision-making.","ru":"Empowers agents to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates using product marketing context and specific task requirements, leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed decision-making.","ar":"Empowers agents to analyze marketing pages and provide actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates using product marketing context and specific task requirements, leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed decision-making."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing marketing pages for optimization opportunities","Generating actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates","Identifying key elements for page conversion rate optimization"],"zh":["分析营销页面以寻找优化机会","生成可行的建议以提高转换率","确定页面转换率优化的关键要素"],"ja":["最適化の機会を分析するためのマーケティングページ","コンバージョン率を向上させるための実行可能な推奨事項を生成する","ページコンバージョン率最適化の重要な要素を特定する"],"ko":["최적화 기회를 분석하기 위한 마케팅 페이지","전환률을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 추천 사항을 생성하는 것","페이지 전환률 최적화의 핵심 요소를 식별하는 것"],"es":["Análisis de páginas de marketing para oportunidades de optimización","Generación de recomendaciones accionables para mejorar las tasas de conversión","Identificación de elementos clave para la optimización de la tasa de conversión de página"],"fr":["Analyse de pages de marketing pour les opportunités d''optimisation","Génération de recommandations actionnables pour améliorer les taux de conversion","Identification des éléments clés pour l''optimisation du taux de conversion de page"],"de":["Analyse von Marketingseiten für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten","Erzeugung von handhabbaren Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Konversionsraten","Identifizierung von Schlüsselelementen für die Optimierung der Seitenkonversionsrate"],"pt":["Analyzing marketing pages for optimization opportunities","Generating actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates","Identifying key elements for page conversion rate optimization"],"ru":["Analyzing marketing pages for optimization opportunities","Generating actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates","Identifying key elements for page conversion rate optimization"],"ar":["Analyzing marketing pages for optimization opportunities","Generating actionable recommendations to improve conversion rates","Identifying key elements for page conversion rate optimization"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Limited to conversion rate optimization tasks"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销背景文件","仅限于转换率优化任务"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルへのアクセスが必要","コンバージョン率最適化タスクのみに限定"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 콘텍스트 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","전환률 최적화 작업만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos","Limitado a tareas de optimización de tasas de conversión"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits","Limité aux tâches d''optimisation des taux de conversion"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Produkt-Marketing-Kontextdateien","Begrenzt auf Konversionsraten-Optimierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Limited to conversion rate optimization tasks"],"ru":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Limited to conversion rate optimization tasks"],"ar":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Limited to conversion rate optimization tasks"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Sri-Krishna-V/Derived-WMD/creating-styled-wrappers', 'community', 'Sri-Krishna-V', 'Derived-WMD', 'Sri-Krishna-V/Derived-WMD', 'creating-styled-wrappers', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:52:59.465Z', NULL, '{"id":"Sri-Krishna-V/Derived-WMD/creating-styled-wrappers","name":"creating-styled-wrappers","description":{"zh":"创建样式包装器技能，用于生成生产就绪的React应用，通过组合头部组件实现高效开发","ja":"スタイル付きラッパーを作成するスキルは、プロダクションレディのReactアプリを生成し、ヘッドレスベースコンポーネントを組み合わせて効率的な開発を実現します","ko":"스타일.wrapper 생성 스킬은 프로덕션 레디 리액트 애플리케이션을 생성하며, 헤드리스 기반 컴포넌트를 조합하여 효율적인 개발을実現합니다","es":"Crea componentes de envoltura estilizados que componen componentes base compuestos sin cabeza. Esta habilidad complementa la creación de componentes compuestos.","fr":"Créez des composants d''enveloppe stylisés qui composent des composants de base composés sans tête. Cette compétence complète la création de composants composés.","de":"Erstellen Sie gestylte Wrapper-Komponenten, die headless Basis-Compound-Komponenten komponieren. Diese Fähigkeit ergänzt die Erstellung von Compound-Komponenten.","en":"The Agentic Generative UI Platform: Transform natural language into production-ready React apps in seconds. Featuring autonomous Tambo agents, Model Context Protocol (MCP) for codebase grounding, and secure E2B sandboxed execution."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"创建样式包装器 - 高效开发React应用","ja":"スタイル付きラッパーを作成する - Reactアプリ開発の効率化","ko":"스타일.wrapper 생성 - 리액트 애플리케이션 개발 효율화","es":"Crear envolturas estilizadas para componentes React","fr":"Créer des enveloppes stylisées pour les composants React","de":"Erstellen von gestylten Wrappern für React-Komponenten","en":"creating-styled-wrappers"},"description":{"zh":"创建样式包装器技能，用于生成生产就绪的React应用，通过组合头部组件实现高效开发","ja":"スタイル付きラッパーを作成するスキルは、プロダクションレディのReactアプリを生成し、ヘッドレスベースコンポーネントを組み合わせて効率的な開発を実現します","ko":"스타일.wrapper 생성 스킬은 프로덕션 레디 리액트 애플리케이션을 생성하며, 헤드리스 기반 컴포넌트를 조합하여 효율적인 개발을実現합니다","es":"Crea componentes de envoltura estilizados que componen componentes base compuestos sin cabeza. Esta habilidad complementa la creación de componentes compuestos.","fr":"Créez des composants d''enveloppe stylisés qui composent des composants de base composés sans tête. Cette compétence complète la création de composants composés.","de":"Erstellen Sie gestylte Wrapper-Komponenten, die headless Basis-Compound-Komponenten komponieren. Diese Fähigkeit ergänzt die Erstellung von Compound-Komponen...","en":"The Agentic Generative UI Platform: Transform natural language into production-ready React apps in seconds. Featuring autonomous Tambo agents, Model Context ..."},"definition":{"en":"The Agentic Generative UI Platform: Transform natural language into production-ready React apps in seconds. Featuring autonomous Tambo agents, Model Context Protocol (MCP) for codebase grounding, and secure E2B sandboxed execution."},"features":{"zh":["生成生产就绪的React应用","组合头部组件实现高效开发","支持自然语言转换","安全的E2B沙盒执行","自治的Tambo代理"],"ja":["プロダクションレディのReactアプリを生成","ヘッドレスベースコンポーネントを組み合わせて効率的な開発を実現","自然言語を瞬く間にプロダクションレディのReactアプリに変換","安全なE2Bサンドボックス実行","自治的なTamboエージェント"],"ko":["프로덕션 레디 리액트 애플리케이션 생성","헤드리스 기반 컴포넌트를 조합하여 효율적인 개발을実現","자연어를瞬く間に 프로덕션 레디 리액트 애플리케이션으로 변환","安全한 E2B 샌드박스 실행","자치적인 Tambo 에이전트"],"es":["Crea envolturas estilizadas para componentes React","Componer componentes base compuestos sin cabeza","Agregar estilo y comportamiento a componentes","Compatibilidad con la plataforma Agentic Generative UI","Soporte para ejecución sandboxed E2B"],"fr":["Créez des enveloppes stylisées pour les composants React","Composent des composants de base composés sans tête","Ajoutez du style et du comportement aux composants","Compatibilité avec la plateforme Agentic Generative UI","Prise en charge de l''exécution sandboxed E2B"],"de":["Erstellen von gestylten Wrappern für React-Komponenten","Komponieren von Basis-Compound-Komponenten ohne Kopf","Hinzufügen von Stil und Verhalten zu Komponenten","Kompatibilität mit der Agentic Generative UI-Plattform","Unterstützung für sandboxed E2B-Ausführung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["创建样式包装器","React应用开发","自然语言转换","组合头部组件","安全的E2B沙盒执行","自治的Tambo代理","开发效率"],"ja":["スタイル付きラッパーを作成する","Reactアプリ開発","自然言語を瞬く間にプロダクションレディのReactアプリに変換","ヘッドレスベースコンポーネントを組み合わせて効率的な開発を実現","安全なE2Bサンドボックス実行","自治的なTamboエージェント","開発効率"],"ko":["스타일.wrapper 생성","리액트 애플리케이션 개발","자연어를瞬く間に 프로덕션 레디 리액트 애플리케이션으로 변환","헤드리스 기반 컴포넌트를 조합하여 효율적인 개발을実現","安全한 E2B 샌드박스 실행","자치적인 Tambo 에이전트","개발 효율성"],"es":["envolturas estilizadas","componentes React","Agentic Generative UI","componentes compuestos","estilo y comportamiento","ejecución sandboxed E2B"],"fr":["enveloppes stylisées","composants React","Agentic Generative UI","composants composés","style et comportement","exécution sandboxed E2B"],"de":["gestylte Wraper","React-Komponenten","Agentic Generative UI","Compound-Komponenten","Stil und Verhalten","sandboxed E2B-Ausführung"]}},"owner":"Sri-Krishna-V","repo":"Derived-WMD","repoPath":"Sri-Krishna-V/Derived-WMD","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-styled-wrappers","description":"Creates styled wrapper components that compose headless/base compound components. Use when refactoring styled components to use base primitives, implementing opinionated design systems on top of headless components, or when the user mentions use base components, compose primitives, styled wrapper, or refactor to use base.","bodyPreview":"# Styling Compound Wrappers\n\nCreate styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components. This skill complements `building-compound-components` (which builds the base primitives) by focusing on **how to properly consume and wrap them** with styling and additional behavior.\n\n**Real-world example**: See [references/real-world-example.md](references/real-world-example.md) for a complete before/after MessageInput refactoring.\n\n## Core Principle: Compose, Don''t Duplicate\n\nStyled w","body":"# Styling Compound Wrappers\n\nCreate styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components. This skill complements `building-compound-components` (which builds the base primitives) by focusing on **how to properly consume and wrap them** with styling and additional behavior.\n\n**Real-world example**: See [references/real-world-example.md](references/real-world-example.md) for a complete before/after MessageInput refactoring.\n\n## Core Principle: Compose, Don''t Duplicate\n\nStyled wrappers should **compose** base components, not **re-implement** their logic.\n\n```tsx\n// WRONG - re-implementing what base already does\nconst StyledInput = ({ children, className }) => {\n  const { value, setValue, submit } = useTamboThreadInput(); // Duplicated!\n  const [isDragging, setIsDragging] = useState(false); // Duplicated!\n  const handleDrop = useCallback(/* ... */); // Duplicated!\n\n  return (\n    <form onDrop={handleDrop} className={className}>\n      {children}\n    </form>\n  );\n};\n\n// CORRECT - compose the base component\nconst StyledInput = ({ children, className, variant }) => {\n  return (\n    <BaseInput.Root className={cn(inputVariants({ variant }), className)}>\n      <BaseInput.Content className=\"rounded-xl data-[dragging]:border-dashed\">\n        {children}\n      </BaseInput.Content>\n    </BaseInput.Root>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n## Refactoring Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nStyled Wrapper Refactoring:\n- [ ] Step 1: Identify duplicated logic\n- [ ] Step 2: Import base components\n- [ ] Step 3: Wrap with Base Root\n- [ ] Step 4: Apply state-based styling and behavior\n- [ ] Step 5: Wrap sub-components with styling\n- [ ] Step 6: Final verification\n```\n\n### Step 1: Identify Duplicated Logic\n\nLook for patterns that indicate logic should come from base:\n\n- SDK hooks (`useTamboThread`, `useTamboThreadInput`, etc.)\n- Context creation (`React.createContext`)\n- State management that mirrors base component state\n- Event handlers (drag, submit, etc.) that base components handle\n\n### Step 2: Import Base Components\n\n```tsx\nimport { MessageInput as MessageInputBase } from \"@tambo-ai/react-ui-base/message-input\";\n```\n\n### Step 3: Wrap with Base Root\n\nReplace custom context/state management with the base Root:\n\n```tsx\n// Before\nconst MessageInput = ({ children, variant }) => {\n  return (\n    <MessageInputInternal variant={variant}>{children}</MessageInputInternal>\n  );\n};\n\n// After\nconst MessageInput = ({ children, variant, className }) => {\n  return (\n    <MessageInputBase.Root className={cn(variants({ variant }), className)}>\n      {children}\n    </MessageInputBase.Root>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply State-Based Styling and Behavior\n\nState access follows a hierarchy — use the simplest option that works:\n\n1. **Data attributes** (preferred for styling) — base components expose `data-*` attributes\n2. **Render props** (for behavior changes) — use when rendering different components\n3. **Context hooks** (for sub-components) — OK for styled sub-components needing deep context access\n\n```tsx\n// BEST - data-* classes for styling, render props only for behavior\n// Note: use `data-[dragging]:*` syntax (v3-compatible), not `data-dragging:*` (v4 only)\nconst StyledContent = ({ children }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.Content\n    className={cn(\n      \"group rounded-xl border\",\n      \"data-[dragging]:border-dashed data-[dragging]:border-emerald-400\",\n    )}\n  >\n    {({ elicitation, resolveElicitation }) => (\n      <>\n        {/* Drop overlay uses group-data-* for styling */}\n        <div className=\"hidden group-data-[dragging]:flex absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-50/90\">\n          <p>Drop files here</p>\n        </div>\n\n        {elicitation ? (\n          <ElicitationUI\n            request={elicitation}\n            onResponse={resolveElicitation}\n          />\n        ) : (\n          children\n        )}\n      </>\n    )}\n  </BaseComponent.Content>\n);\n\n// OK - styled sub-components can use context hook for deep access\nconst StyledTextarea = ({ placeholder }) => {\n  const { value, setValue, handleSubmit, editorRef } = useMessageInputContext();\n  return (\n    <CustomEditor\n      ref={editorRef}\n      value={value}\n      onChange={setValue}\n      onSubmit={handleSubmit}\n      placeholder={placeholder}\n    />\n  );\n};\n```\n\n**When to use context hooks vs render props:**\n\n- Render props: when the parent wrapper needs state for behavior changes\n- Context hooks: when a styled sub-component needs values not exposed via render props\n\n### Step 5: Wrap Sub-Components\n\n```tsx\n// Submit button\nconst SubmitButton = ({ className, children }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.SubmitButton className={cn(\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg\", className)}>\n    {({ showCancelButton }) =>\n      children ?? (showCancelButton ? <Square /> : <ArrowUp />)\n    }\n  </BaseComponent.SubmitButton>\n);\n\n// Error\nconst Error = ({ className }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.Error className={cn(\"text-sm text-destructive\", className)} />\n);\n\n// Staged images - base pre-computes props array, just iterate\nconst StagedImages = ({ className }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.StagedImages className={cn(\"flex gap-2\", className)}>\n    {({ images }) =>\n      images.map((imageProps) => (\n        <ImageBadge key={imageProps.image.id} {...imageProps} />\n      ))\n    }\n  </BaseComponent.StagedImages>\n);\n```\n\n### Step 6: Final Verification\n\n```\nFinal Checks:\n- [ ] No duplicate context creation\n- [ ] No duplicate SDK hooks in root wrappers\n- [ ] No duplicate state management or event handlers\n- [ ] Base namespace imported and `Base.Root` used as wrapper\n- [ ] `data-*` classes used for styling (with `group-data-*` for children)\n- [ ] Render props used only for rendering behavior changes\n- [ ] Base sub-components wrapped with styling\n- [ ] Icon factories passed from styled layer to base hooks\n- [ ] Visual sub-components and CSS variants stay in styled layer\n```\n\n## What Belongs in Styled Layer\n\n### Icon Factories\n\nWhen base hooks need icons, pass a factory function:\n\n```tsx\n// Base hook accepts optional icon factory\nexport function useCombinedResourceList(\n  providers: ResourceProvider[] | undefined,\n  search: string,\n  createMcpIcon?: (serverName: string) => React.ReactNode,\n) {\n  /* ... */\n}\n\n// Styled layer provides the factory\nconst resources = useCombinedResourceList(providers, search, (serverName) => (\n  <McpServerIcon name={serverName} className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n));\n```\n\n### CSS Variants\n\n```tsx\nconst inputVariants = cva(\"w-full\", {\n  variants: {\n    variant: {\n      default: \"\",\n      solid: \"[&>div]:shadow-xl [&>div]:ring-1\",\n      bordered: \"[&>div]:border-2\",\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Layout Logic, Visual Sub-Components, Custom Data Fetching\n\nThese all stay in the styled layer. Base handles behavior; styled handles presentation.\n\n## Type Handling\n\nHandle ref type differences between base and styled components:\n\n```tsx\n// Base context may have RefObject<T | null>\n// Styled component may need RefObject<T>\n<TextEditor ref={editorRef as React.RefObject<TamboEditor>} />\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Re-implementing base logic** - if base handles it, compose it\n- **Using render props for styling** - prefer `data-*` classes; render props are for behavior changes\n- **Duplicating context in wrapper** - use base Root which provides context\n- **Hardcoding icons in base hooks** - use factory functions to keep styling in styled layer\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:52:59.465Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to generate production-ready React apps with styled wrapper components.","zh":"非常适合需要生成生产就绪的React应用程序的前端代理，具有样式化的包装组件。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがスタイリッシュなラッパーコンポーネントを備えたプロダクションレディのReactアプリを生成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 스타일이 적용된 래퍼 컴포넌트를 갖춘 프로덕션 레디 리액트 앱을 생성해야 하는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan generar aplicaciones React listas para producción con componentes de wrapper estilizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de générer des applications React prêtes pour la production avec des composants de wrapper stylisés.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die produktionsreife React-Apps mit gestylten Wrapper-Komponenten erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam gerar aplicativos React prontos para produção com componentes de wrapper estilizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо создавать готовые к производству приложения React с компонентами-обертками, имеющими стили.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى توليد تطبيقات React جاهزة للإنتاج مع مكونات غلاف مصممة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compose headless base compound components with styling and additional behavior using Model Context Protocol (MCP) for codebase grounding and secure E2B sandboxed execution, all within the Agentic Generative UI Platform.","zh":"赋予代理通过模型上下文协议（MCP）进行代码库接地和安全的E2B沙盒执行，组合无头基础复合组件，具有样式和附加行为，所有这些都在Agentic生成UI平台内。","ja":"モデルコンテキストプロトコル（MCP）を使用したコードベースの接地と安全なE2Bサンドボックス実行により、ヘッドレスベースコンポウンドコンポーネントをスタイリングと追加の動作で構成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。すべてはAgentic生成UIプラットフォーム内で実行されます。","ko":"모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜(MCP)을 사용하여 코드베이스를 접지하고 보안 E2B 샌드박스 실행을 통해 헤드리스 기반 복합 컴포넌트를 스타일과 추가 동작으로 구성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 Empower합니다. 모든 것은 Agentic 생성 UI 플랫폼 내에서 작동합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a componer componentes compuestos base headless con estilo y comportamiento adicional utilizando el Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP) para la base de código y la ejecución segura de sandbox E2B, todo dentro de la Plataforma de UI Generativa Agentic.","fr":"Permet aux agents de composer des composants composés de base headless avec style et comportement supplémentaires en utilisant le Protocole de Contexte de Modèle (MCP) pour l''ancre de codebase et l''exécution sécurisée de sandbox E2B, le tout dans la Plateforme d''UI Generative Agentic.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, headless Basis-Compound-Komponenten mit Stil und zusätzlichem Verhalten zu komponieren, indem sie das Modellkontextprotokoll (MCP) für die Codebasis und die sichere E2B-Sandbox-Ausführung verwenden, all dies innerhalb der Agentic Generative UI-Plattform.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compor componentes compostos base headless com estilização e comportamento adicionais usando o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP) para ancoragem do código e execução segura em sandbox E2B, tudo dentro da Plataforma de Interface de Usuário Gerativa Agentic.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью составлять базовые компоненты headless с стилизацией и дополнительным поведением с использованием Протокола контекста модели (MCP) для закрепления кодовой базы и безопасного выполнения в песочнице E2B, все в рамках Платформы генеративного интерфейса пользователя Agentic.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تجميع مكونات مركبة قاعدة رأسية مع تنسيق وتصرف إضافي باستخدام بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP) لتأصيل قاعدة الشفرة والتنفيذ الآمن في حاوية رملية E2B، كل ذلك داخل منصة واجهة المستخدم التوليدية Agentic"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of styled wrapper components for React apps","Generating production-ready UI components with autonomous Tambo agents","Composing headless base compound components with custom styling and behavior"],"zh":["自动创建React应用程序的样式化包装组件","使用自主Tambo代理生成生产就绪的UI组件","组合具有自定义样式和行为的无头基础复合组件"],"ja":["Reactアプリのスタイリッシュなラッパーコンポーネントの自動生成","自律的なTamboエージェントを使用したプロダクションレディのUIコンポーネントの生成","カスタムスタイリングと動作を備えたヘッドレスベースコンポウンドコンポーネントの構成"],"ko":["리액트 앱의 스타일이 적용된 래퍼 컴포넌트 자동 생성","자율적인 탐보 에이전트를 사용한 프로덕션 레디 UI 컴포넌트 생성","사용자 정의 스타일 및 동작을 갖춘 헤드리스 기반 복합 컴포넌트 구성"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de componentes de wrapper estilizados para aplicaciones React","Generar componentes de UI listos para producción con agentes Tambo autónomos","Componer componentes com