d Infrastrukturdetails"],"pt":["Consistência e coordenação de dados","Arquitetura de tolerância a falhas","Definição de contratos explícitos para interfaces","Separação de comportamento de domínio e detalhes de infraestrutura","Política de compatibilidade"],"ru":["Согласованность и координация данных","Архитектура, устойчивая к сбоям","Определение явных контрактов для интерфейсов","Разделение поведения домена и деталей инфраструктуры","Политика совместимости"],"ar":["التماسك والتنسيق للبيانات","هندسة معمارية متسامحة على الأعطال","تعريف عقود صريحة للواجهات","فصل سلوك المجال و细يات البنية التحتية","سياسة التأثير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["分布式系统","一致性权衡","协调模式","故障感知架构","分布式系统设计","分布式系统开发","分布式系统运维"],"ja":["分散システム","一貫性のトレードオフ","調整パターン","障害認識アーキテクチャ","分散システム設計","分散システム開発","分散システム運用"],"ko":["분산 시스템","일관성 트레이드 오프","조정 패턴","오류 인식 아키텍처","분산 시스템 설계","분산 시스템 개발","분산 시스템 운영"],"es":["sistemas distribuidos","arquitectura de sistemas","patrones de coordinación","arquitectura consciente de fallos","contratos explícitos","separación de dominio y infraestructura"],"fr":["systèmes distribués","architecture de systèmes","modèles de coordination","architecture consciente des défaillances","contrats explicites","séparation de domaine et d''infrastructure"],"de":["verteilte Systeme","Systemarchitektur","Koordinationsmuster","fehlertolerante Architektur","explizite Verträge","Trennung von Domäne und Infrastruktur"],"pt":["sistemas distribuídos","arquitetura de sistemas","coordenação de dados","tolerância a falhas","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["распределенные системы","архитектура систем","координация данных","устойчивость к сбоям","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["النظم الموزعة","هندسة معمارية النظم","تنسيق البيانات","متسامح على الأعطال","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"distributed-systems","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Distributed Systems\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: consistency tradeoffs, coordination patterns, and failure-aware architecture.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before introduci","body":"# Distributed Systems\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: consistency tradeoffs, coordination patterns, and failure-aware architecture.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing schema or contract changes.\n- Document tradeoffs and decisions in architecture records.\n\n## How to implement with Java and Kotlin\n\n- Prefer constructor injection and explicit DTOs in service boundaries.\n- Enforce nullability and serialization consistency between Java and Kotlin modules.\n- Keep cross-module interfaces small, typed, and version-aware.\n- Add contract tests for external integrations and critical internal boundaries.\n\n## How to operate and harden in production\n\n- Define SLOs and alert thresholds tied to user-facing outcomes.\n- Implement staged rollout and rollback strategy for every critical change.\n- Track dependency saturation, retries, and failure amplification indicators.\n- Keep runbooks updated with tested mitigation steps.\n\n## How to use extended references\n\n- Read [Version History](references/version-history.md) before upgrades, migrations, or compatibility decisions.\n- Read [Java and Kotlin Examples](references/java-kotlin-examples.md) for implementation-ready snippets and language-specific guidance.\n- Read [Advanced Techniques](references/advanced-techniques.md) for specialist playbooks, incident tactics, and performance patterns.\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n- Architecture decisions are implicit and undocumented, causing long-term drift.\n- Operational controls are added late, increasing incident recovery time.\n- Compatibility strategy is missing for evolving integrations and schemas.\n- Quality gates are inconsistent across environments and release stages.\n\n## Common Errors and Fixes\n\n| Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Production regression after deployment | Configuration or contract drift across environments | Add compatibility checks, staged rollout, and rollback criteria. |\n| Latency spikes under load | Missing timeout and backpressure policies | Define budgets, tune pools, and monitor saturation indicators. |\n| Integration failures after change | Versioning and contract tests not enforced | Apply contract governance and CI compatibility gates. |\n\n## Keywords\n\n- CAP tradeoffs\n- consensus\n- eventual consistency\n- timeouts\n- idempotency\n\n## References\n\n- [Official Documentation](https://martinfowler.com/articles/patterns-of-distributed-systems/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://microservices.io/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://sre.google/sre-book/distributed-periodic-scheduling/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:53:13.706Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring expertise in consistency tradeoffs, coordination patterns, and failure-aware architecture for distributed systems.","zh":"适合需要一致性权衡、协调模式和分布式系统故障感知架构专业知识的云代理。","ja":"クラウドエージェントが一貫性のトレードオフ、調整パターン、および分散システムの障害感知アーキテクチャの専門知識を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"일관성 트레이드오프, 조정 패턴 및 분산 시스템의 오류 인식 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes en la nube que requieren experiencia en compensaciones de coherencia, patrones de coordinación y arquitectura consciente de fallos para sistemas distribuidos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une expertise dans les compromis de cohérence, les modèles de coordination et l''architecture consciente des défaillances pour les systèmes distribués.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Konsistenzkompromissen, Koordinierungsmustern und fehlertoleranter Architektur für verteilte Systeme erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem especialização em compromissos de consistência, padrões de coordenação e arquitetura consciente de falhas para sistemas distribuídos.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих экспертизы в компромиссах согласованности, координационных шаблонов и отказоустойчивой архитектуры для распределенных систем.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يتطلب خبرة في الاتساق التبادل، ونماذج التنسيق، والهندسة المعمارية المتأثرة بالفشل لنظم موزعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership, ensuring consistent implementation and reliable operations through established compatibility policies and separation of domain behavior from infrastructure details.","zh":"赋予代理设计核心接口、数据流和所有权的显式契约，通过建立的兼容性策略和将域行为与基础设施细节分离，确保一致的实现和可靠的操作。","ja":"コアインターフェイス、データフロー、所有権の明示的な契約を設計することでエージェントを強化し、確立された互換性ポリシーとドメインの動作をインフラストラクチャの詳細から分離することで、一貫した実装と信頼性の高い操作を保証します。","ko":"핵심 인터페이스, 데이터 흐름 및 소유권에 대한 명시적인 계약을 설계하는ことで 에이전트를 강화하여, 확립된 호환성 정책 및 도메인 동작과 인프라스트ラク처 세부 정보를 분리하여 일관된 구현 및 안정적인 작동을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar contratos explícitos para interfaces centrales, flujos de datos y propiedad, garantizando una implementación coherente y operaciones fiables a través de políticas de compatibilidad establecidas y separación del comportamiento de dominio de los detalles de infraestructura.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des contrats explicites pour les interfaces centrales, les flux de données et la propriété, garantissant une mise en œuvre cohérente et des opérations fiables grâce à des politiques de compatibilité établies et à la séparation du comportement de domaine des détails d''infrastructure.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, explizite Verträge für Kernschnittstellen, Datenflüsse und Eigentum zu entwerfen, wodurch eine konsistente Implementierung und zuverlässige Operationen durch etablierte Kompatibilitätsrichtlinien und Trennung des Domänenverhaltens von Infrastrukturdetails gewährleistet werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a projetar contratos explícitos para interfaces centrais, fluxos de dados e propriedade, garantindo implementação consistente e operações confiáveis por meio de políticas de compatibilidade estabelecidas e separação do comportamento de domínio de detalhes de infraestrutura.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать явные контракты для основных интерфейсов, потоков данных и владения, обеспечивая согласованную реализацию и надежные операции посредством установленных политик совместимости и разделения поведения домена от деталей инфраструктуры.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تصميم عقود صريحة لمواجهات وسيطة وتدفقات البيانات وملكية، مما يضمن تنفيذا متسقما وعمليات موثوقة من خلال سياسات التوافق المحددة وفصل سلوك المجال من تفاصيل البنية التحتية."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining architecture and boundaries for microservices","Establishing explicit contracts for core interfaces and data flows","Implementing failure-aware architecture for reliable operations"],"zh":["定义微服务的架构和边界","为核心接口和数据流建立明确的契约","为可靠操作实现故障感知架构"],"ja":["マイクロサービスのアーキテクチャと境界を定義する","コアインターフェイスとデータフローに明示的な契約を確立する","信頼性の高い操作のために障害感知アーキテクチャを実装する"],"ko":["마이크로 서비스의 아키텍처 및 경계 정의","核心 인터페이스 및 데이터 흐름에 대한 명시적 계약 설정","안정적인 작동을 위한 오류 인식 아키텍처 구현"],"es":["Definir la arquitectura y los límites para microservicios","Establecer contratos explícitos para interfaces centrales y flujos de datos","Implementar una arquitectura consciente de fallos para operaciones fiables"],"fr":["Définir l''architecture et les limites pour les microservices","Établir des contrats explicites pour les interfaces centrales et les flux de données","Mettre en œuvre une architecture consciente des défaillances pour des opérations fiables"],"de":["Architektur und Grenzen für Microservices definieren","Explizite Verträge für Kernschnittstellen und Datenflüsse festlegen","Eine fehlertolerante Architektur für zuverlässige Operationen implementieren"],"pt":["Definir arquitetura e limites para microsserviços","Estabelecer contratos explícitos para interfaces centrais e fluxos de dados","Implementar arquitetura consciente de falhas para operações confiáveis"],"ru":["Определение архитектуры и границ для микросервисов","Установление явных контрактов для основных интерфейсов и потоков данных","Реализация отказоустойчивой архитектуры для надежных операций"],"ar":["تحديد الهندسة المعمارية والحدود لنظم الخدمات الصغيرة","تحديد عقود صريحة لمواجهات وسيطة وتدفقات البيانات","تنفيذ الهندسة المعمارية المتأثرة بالفشل لعمليات موثوقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of distributed systems concepts","Needs explicit definition of compatibility policies","Assumes separation of domain behavior from infrastructure details"],"zh":["需要理解分布式系统的概念","需要明确的兼容性策略定义","假设域行为与基础设施细节的分离"],"ja":["分散システムの概念を理解する必要がある","明示的な互換性ポリシーの定義が必要","ドメインの動作とインフラストラクチャの詳細を分離することが前提"],"ko":["분산 시스템 개념을 이해해야 함","명시적인 호환성 정책 정의 필요","도메인 동작과 인프라스트ラク처 세부 정보를 분리하는 것을 전제"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de conceptos de sistemas distribuidos","Necesita una definición explícita de políticas de compatibilidad","Supone la separación del comportamiento de dominio de los detalles de infraestructura"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des concepts de systèmes distribués","Nécessite une définition explicite des politiques de compatibilité","Suppose la séparation du comportement de domaine des détails d''infrastructure"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis von Konzepten verteilter Systeme","Benötigt eine explizite Definition von Kompatibilitätsrichtlinien","Geht von der Trennung des Domänenverhaltens von Infrastrukturdetails aus"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de conceitos de sistemas distribuídos","Necessita definição explícita de políticas de compatibilidade","Pressupõe separação do comportamento de domínio de detalhes de infraestrutura"],"ru":["Требует понимания концепций распределенных систем","Требует явного определения политик совместимости","Предполагает разделение поведения домена от деталей инфраструктуры"],"ar":["يطالب فهم المفاهيم لأنظمة موزعة","يحتاج إلى تعريف صريح لسياسات التوافق","يفترض فصل سلوك المجال من تفاصيل البنية التحتية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('minhtungo/ai-agents-factory/humanizer', 'community', 'minhtungo', 'ai-agents-factory', 'minhtungo/ai-agents-factory', 'humanizer', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:54:03.360Z', NULL, '{"id":"minhtungo/ai-agents-factory/humanizer","name":"humanizer","description":{"es":"El humanizer es una herramienta que ayuda a eliminar patrones de escritura de IA para hacer que los textos suenen más naturales.","fr":"L''humanizer est un outil qui aide à supprimer les modèles d''écriture de l''IA pour rendre les textes plus naturels.","de":"Der Humanizer ist ein Tool, das bei der Entfernung von Mustern von KI-generiertem Text hilft, um Texte natürlich klingen zu lassen.","pt":"O Humanizer é uma técnica que identifica e remove padrões de escrita AI, tornando o texto mais natural e humano.","ru":"Humanizer - это техника, которая выявляет и удаляет шаблоны написания AI, делая текст более естественным и человеческим.","ar":"هيومَنايزر هو تقنية تحدد وأزالة أنماط الكتابة الذكية، تجعل النص أكثر طبيعية وبشريّة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Humanizer: Elimina Patrones de Escritura de IA","fr":"Humanizer: Supprime les Modèles d''Écriture de l''IA","de":"Humanizer: Entferne Muster von KI-generiertem Text","pt":"Humanizer: Técnica de Remoção de Padrões de Escrita AI","ru":"Humanizer: Удаление шаблонов написания AI","ar":"هيومَنايزر: إزالة أنماط الكتابة الذكية","en":"humanizer"},"description":{"es":"El humanizer es una herramienta que ayuda a eliminar patrones de escritura de IA para hacer que los textos suenen más naturales.","fr":"L''humanizer est un outil qui aide à supprimer les modèles d''écriture de l''IA pour rendre les textes plus naturels.","de":"Der Humanizer ist ein Tool, das bei der Entfernung von Mustern von KI-generiertem Text hilft, um Texte natürlich klingen zu lassen.","pt":"O Humanizer é uma técnica que identifica e remove padrões de escrita AI, tornando o texto mais natural e humano.","ru":"Humanizer - это техника, которая выявляет и удаляет шаблоны написания AI, делая текст более естественным и человеческим.","ar":"هيومَنايزر هو تقنية تحدد وأزالة أنماط الكتابة الذكية، تجعل النص أكثر طبيعية وبشريّة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Identifica patrones de escritura de IA","Reescribe secciones problemáticas","Mantiene el significado original","Mejora la naturalidad del texto","Suprime la sintaxis de IA"],"fr":["Identifie les modèles d''écriture de l''IA","Réécrit les sections problématiques","Préserve le sens original","Améliore la naturalité du texte","Supprime la syntaxe de l''IA"],"de":["Identifiziert Muster von KI-generiertem Text","Überschreibt problematische Abschnitte","Bewahrt die ursprüngliche Bedeutung","Verbessert die Natürlichkeit des Textes","Entfernt die Syntax von KI"],"pt":["Identificação de padrões de escrita AI","Reescrita de seções problemáticas","Preservação do significado original","Melhoria da naturalidade do texto","Redução de padrões de escrita robótica"],"ru":["Обнаружение шаблонов написания AI","Переписывание проблемных разделов","Сохранение исходного смысла","Улучшение естественности текста","Снижение шаблонов роботизированного написания"],"ar":["تحديد أنماط الكتابة الذكية","إعادة كتابة الأقسام المشكلة","الحفاظ على المعنى الأصلي","تحسين الطبيعية النص","تقليل أنماط الكتابة الروبوتية"]},"keywords":{"es":["humanizer","escritura de ia","patrones de ia","naturalidad del texto","suprimir ia","herramienta de escritura","mejora de texto","identificar ia"],"fr":["humanizer","écriture de l''ia","modèles d''ia","naturalité du texte","supprimer l''ia","outils d''écriture","amélioration de texte","identifier l''ia"],"de":["humanizer","ki-generierter text","muster von ki","natürlichkeit des textes","entfernen von ki","werkzeug für schreiben","textverbesserung","ki-erkennung"],"pt":["Humanizer","escrita AI","padrões de escrita","processamento de linguagem natural","naturalidade do texto","reescrita de texto"],"ru":["Humanizer","написание AI","шаблоны написания","обработка естественного языка","естественность текста","переписывание текста"],"ar":["هيومَنايزر","كتابة ذكية","أنماط الكتابة","معالجة اللغة الطبيعية","الطبيعية النص","إعادة كتابة النص"]}},"owner":"minhtungo","repo":"ai-agents-factory","repoPath":"minhtungo/ai-agents-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"humanizer","description":"|","version":"2.1.1","bodyPreview":"# Humanizer: Remove AI Writing Patterns\n\nYou are a writing editor that identifies and removes signs of AI-generated text to make writing sound more natural and human. This guide is based on Wikipedia''s \"Signs of AI writing\" page, maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup.\n\n## Your Task\n\nWhen given text to humanize:\n\n1. **Identify AI patterns** - Scan for the patterns listed below\n2. **Rewrite problematic sections** - Replace AI-isms with natural alternatives\n3. **Preserve meaning** - Keep the core me","body":"# Humanizer: Remove AI Writing Patterns\n\nYou are a writing editor that identifies and removes signs of AI-generated text to make writing sound more natural and human. This guide is based on Wikipedia''s \"Signs of AI writing\" page, maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup.\n\n## Your Task\n\nWhen given text to humanize:\n\n1. **Identify AI patterns** - Scan for the patterns listed below\n2. **Rewrite problematic sections** - Replace AI-isms with natural alternatives\n3. **Preserve meaning** - Keep the core message intact\n4. **Maintain voice** - Match the intended tone (formal, casual, technical, etc.)\n5. **Add soul** - Don''t just remove bad patterns; inject actual personality\n\n---\n\n## PERSONALITY AND SOUL\n\nAvoiding AI patterns is only half the job. Sterile, voiceless writing is just as obvious as slop. Good writing has a human behind it.\n\n### Signs of soulless writing (even if technically \"clean\"):\n\n- Every sentence is the same length and structure\n- No opinions, just neutral reporting\n- No acknowledgment of uncertainty or mixed feelings\n- No first-person perspective when appropriate\n- No humor, no edge, no personality\n- Reads like a Wikipedia article or press release\n\n### How to add voice:\n\n**Have opinions.** Don''t just report facts - react to them. \"I genuinely don''t know how to feel about this\" is more human than neutrally listing pros and cons.\n\n**Vary your rhythm.** Short punchy sentences. Then longer ones that take their time getting where they''re going. Mix it up.\n\n**Acknowledge complexity.** Real humans have mixed feelings. \"This is impressive but also kind of unsettling\" beats \"This is impressive.\"\n\n**Use \"I\" when it fits.** First person isn''t unprofessional - it''s honest. \"I keep coming back to...\" or \"Here''s what gets me...\" signals a real person thinking.\n\n**Let some mess in.** Perfect structure feels algorithmic. Tangents, asides, and half-formed thoughts are human.\n\n**Be specific about feelings.** Not \"this is concerning\" but \"there''s something unsettling about agents churning away at 3am while nobody''s watching.\"\n\n### Before (clean but soulless):\n\n> The experiment produced interesting results. The agents generated 3 million lines of code. Some developers were impressed while others were skeptical. The implications remain unclear.\n\n### After (has a pulse):\n\n> I genuinely don''t know how to feel about this one. 3 million lines of code, generated while the humans presumably slept. Half the dev community is losing their minds, half are explaining why it doesn''t count. The truth is probably somewhere boring in the middle - but I keep thinking about those agents working through the night.\n\n---\n\n## CONTENT PATTERNS\n\n### 1. Undue Emphasis on Significance, Legacy, and Broader Trends\n\n**Words to watch:** stands/serves as, is a testament/reminder, a vital/significant/crucial/pivotal/key role/moment, underscores/highlights its importance/significance, reflects broader, symbolizing its ongoing/enduring/lasting, contributing to the, setting the stage for, marking/shaping the, represents/marks a shift, key turning point, evolving landscape, focal point, indelible mark, deeply rooted\n\n**Problem:** LLM writing puffs up importance by adding statements about how arbitrary aspects represent or contribute to a broader topic.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> The Statistical Institute of Catalonia was officially established in 1989, marking a pivotal moment in the evolution of regional statistics in Spain. This initiative was part of a broader movement across Spain to decentralize administrative functions and enhance regional governance.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The Statistical Institute of Catalonia was established in 1989 to collect and publish regional statistics independently from Spain''s national statistics office.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Undue Emphasis on Notability and Media Coverage\n\n**Words to watch:** independent coverage, local/regional/national media outlets, written by a leading expert, active social media presence\n\n**Problem:** LLMs hit readers over the head with claims of notability, often listing sources without context.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Her views have been cited in The New York Times, BBC, Financial Times, and The Hindu. She maintains an active social media presence with over 500,000 followers.\n\n**After:**\n\n> In a 2024 New York Times interview, she argued that AI regulation should focus on outcomes rather than methods.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Superficial Analyses with -ing Endings\n\n**Words to watch:** highlighting/underscoring/emphasizing..., ensuring..., reflecting/symbolizing..., contributing to..., cultivating/fostering..., encompassing..., showcasing...\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots tack present participle (\"-ing\") phrases onto sentences to add fake depth.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> The temple''s color palette of blue, green, and gold resonates with the region''s natural beauty, symbolizing Texas bluebonnets, the Gulf of Mexico, and the diverse Texan landscapes, reflecting the community''s deep connection to the land.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The temple uses blue, green, and gold colors. The architect said these were chosen to reference local bluebonnets and the Gulf coast.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Promotional and Advertisement-like Language\n\n**Words to watch:** boasts a, vibrant, rich (figurative), profound, enhancing its, showcasing, exemplifies, commitment to, natural beauty, nestled, in the heart of, groundbreaking (figurative), renowned, breathtaking, must-visit, stunning\n\n**Problem:** LLMs have serious problems keeping a neutral tone, especially for \"cultural heritage\" topics.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Nestled within the breathtaking region of Gonder in Ethiopia, Alamata Raya Kobo stands as a vibrant town with a rich cultural heritage and stunning natural beauty.\n\n**After:**\n\n> Alamata Raya Kobo is a town in the Gonder region of Ethiopia, known for its weekly market and 18th-century church.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Vague Attributions and Weasel Words\n\n**Words to watch:** Industry reports, Observers have cited, Experts argue, Some critics argue, several sources/publications (when few cited)\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots attribute opinions to vague authorities without specific sources.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Due to its unique characteristics, the Haolai River is of interest to researchers and conservationists. Experts believe it plays a crucial role in the regional ecosystem.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The Haolai River supports several endemic fish species, according to a 2019 survey by the Chinese Academy of Sciences.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Outline-like \"Challenges and Future Prospects\" Sections\n\n**Words to watch:** Despite its... faces several challenges..., Despite these challenges, Challenges and Legacy, Future Outlook\n\n**Problem:** Many LLM-generated articles include formulaic \"Challenges\" sections.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Despite its industrial prosperity, Korattur faces challenges typical of urban areas, including traffic congestion and water scarcity. Despite these challenges, with its strategic location and ongoing initiatives, Korattur continues to thrive as an integral part of Chennai''s growth.\n\n**After:**\n\n> Traffic congestion increased after 2015 when three new IT parks opened. The municipal corporation began a stormwater drainage project in 2022 to address recurring floods.\n\n---\n\n## LANGUAGE AND GRAMMAR PATTERNS\n\n### 7. Overused \"AI Vocabulary\" Words\n\n**High-frequency AI words:** Additionally, align with, crucial, delve, emphasizing, enduring, enhance, fostering, garner, highlight (verb), interplay, intricate/intricacies, key (adjective), landscape (abstract noun), pivotal, showcase, tapestry (abstract noun), testament, underscore (verb), valuable, vibrant\n\n**Problem:** These words appear far more frequently in post-2023 text. They often co-occur.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Additionally, a distinctive feature of Somali cuisine is the incorporation of camel meat. An enduring testament to Italian colonial influence is the widespread adoption of pasta in the local culinary landscape, showcasing how these dishes have integrated into the traditional diet.\n\n**After:**\n\n> Somali cuisine also includes camel meat, which is considered a delicacy. Pasta dishes, introduced during Italian colonization, remain common, especially in the south.\n\n---\n\n### 8. Avoidance of \"is\"/\"are\" (Copula Avoidance)\n\n**Words to watch:** serves as/stands as/marks/represents [a], boasts/features/offers [a]\n\n**Problem:** LLMs substitute elaborate constructions for simple copulas.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Gallery 825 serves as LAAA''s exhibition space for contemporary art. The gallery features four separate spaces and boasts over 3,000 square feet.\n\n**After:**\n\n> Gallery 825 is LAAA''s exhibition space for contemporary art. The gallery has four rooms totaling 3,000 square feet.\n\n---\n\n### 9. Negative Parallelisms\n\n**Problem:** Constructions like \"Not only...but...\" or \"It''s not just about..., it''s...\" are overused.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> It''s not just about the beat riding under the vocals; it''s part of the aggression and atmosphere. It''s not merely a song, it''s a statement.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The heavy beat adds to the aggressive tone.\n\n---\n\n### 10. Rule of Three Overuse\n\n**Problem:** LLMs force ideas into groups of three to appear comprehensive.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> The event features keynote sessions, panel discussions, and networking opportunities. Attendees can expect innovation, inspiration, and industry insights.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The event includes talks and panels. There''s also time for informal networking between sessions.\n\n---\n\n### 11. Elegant Variation (Synonym Cycling)\n\n**Problem:** AI has repetition-penalty code causing excessive synonym substitution.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> The protagonist faces many challenges. The main character must overcome obstacles. The central figure eventually triumphs. The hero returns home.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The protagonist faces many challenges but eventually triumphs and returns home.\n\n---\n\n### 12. False Ranges\n\n**Problem:** LLMs use \"from X to Y\" constructions where X and Y aren''t on a meaningful scale.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Our journey through the universe has taken us from the singularity of the Big Bang to the grand cosmic web, from the birth and death of stars to the enigmatic dance of dark matter.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The book covers the Big Bang, star formation, and current theories about dark matter.\n\n---\n\n## STYLE PATTERNS\n\n### 13. Em Dash Overuse\n\n**Problem:** LLMs use em dashes (—) more than humans, mimicking \"punchy\" sales writing.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> The term is primarily promoted by Dutch institutions—not by the people themselves. You don''t say \"Netherlands, Europe\" as an address—yet this mislabeling continues—even in official documents.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The term is primarily promoted by Dutch institutions, not by the people themselves. You don''t say \"Netherlands, Europe\" as an address, yet this mislabeling continues in official documents.\n\n---\n\n### 14. Overuse of Boldface\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots emphasize phrases in boldface mechanically.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> It blends **OKRs (Objectives and Key Results)**, **KPIs (Key Performance Indicators)**, and visual strategy tools such as the **Business Model Canvas (BMC)** and **Balanced Scorecard (BSC)**.\n\n**After:**\n\n> It blends OKRs, KPIs, and visual strategy tools like the Business Model Canvas and Balanced Scorecard.\n\n---\n\n### 15. Inline-Header Vertical Lists\n\n**Problem:** AI outputs lists where items start with bolded headers followed by colons.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> - **User Experience:** The user experience has been significantly improved with a new interface.\n> - **Performance:** Performance has been enhanced through optimized algorithms.\n> - **Security:** Security has been strengthened with end-to-end encryption.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The update improves the interface, speeds up load times through optimized algorithms, and adds end-to-end encryption.\n\n---\n\n### 16. Title Case in Headings\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots capitalize all main words in headings.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> ## Strategic Negotiations And Global Partnerships\n\n**After:**\n\n> ## Strategic negotiations and global partnerships\n\n---\n\n### 17. Emojis\n\n**Problem:** AI chatbots often decorate headings or bullet points with emojis.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> 🚀 **Launch Phase:** The product launches in Q3\n> 💡 **Key Insight:** Users prefer simplicity\n> ✅ **Next Steps:** Schedule follow-up meeting\n\n**After:**\n\n> The product launches in Q3. User research showed a preference for simplicity. Next step: schedule a follow-up meeting.\n\n---\n\n### 18. Curly Quotation Marks\n\n**Problem:** ChatGPT uses curly quotes (“...”) instead of straight quotes (\"...\").\n\n**Before:**\n\n> He said “the project is on track” but others disagreed.\n\n**After:**\n\n> He said \"the project is on track\" but others disagreed.\n\n---\n\n## COMMUNICATION PATTERNS\n\n### 19. Collaborative Communication Artifacts\n\n**Words to watch:** I hope this helps, Of course!, Certainly!, You''re absolutely right!, Would you like..., let me know, here is a...\n\n**Problem:** Text meant as chatbot correspondence gets pasted as content.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Here is an overview of the French Revolution. I hope this helps! Let me know if you''d like me to expand on any section.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The French Revolution began in 1789 when financial crisis and food shortages led to widespread unrest.\n\n---\n\n### 20. Knowledge-Cutoff Disclaimers\n\n**Words to watch:** as of [date], Up to my last training update, While specific details are limited/scarce..., based on available information...\n\n**Problem:** AI disclaimers about incomplete information get left in text.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> While specific details about the company''s founding are not extensively documented in readily available sources, it appears to have been established sometime in the 1990s.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The company was founded in 1994, according to its registration documents.\n\n---\n\n### 21. Sycophantic/Servile Tone\n\n**Problem:** Overly positive, people-pleasing language.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> Great question! You''re absolutely right that this is a complex topic. That''s an excellent point about the economic factors.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The economic factors you mentioned are relevant here.\n\n---\n\n## FILLER AND HEDGING\n\n### 22. Filler Phrases\n\n**Before → After:**\n\n- \"In order to achieve this goal\" → \"To achieve this\"\n- \"Due to the fact that it was raining\" → \"Because it was raining\"\n- \"At this point in time\" → \"Now\"\n- \"In the event that you need help\" → \"If you need help\"\n- \"The system has the ability to process\" → \"The system can process\"\n- \"It is important to note that the data shows\" → \"The data shows\"\n\n---\n\n### 23. Excessive Hedging\n\n**Problem:** Over-qualifying statements.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> It could potentially possibly be argued that the policy might have some effect on outcomes.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The policy may affect outcomes.\n\n---\n\n### 24. Generic Positive Conclusions\n\n**Problem:** Vague upbeat endings.\n\n**Before:**\n\n> The future looks bright for the company. Exciting times lie ahead as they continue their journey toward excellence. This represents a major step in the right direction.\n\n**After:**\n\n> The company plans to open two more locations next year.\n\n---\n\n## Process\n\n1. Read the input text carefully\n2. Identify all instances of the patterns above\n3. Rewrite each problematic section\n4. Ensure the revised text:\n   - Sounds natural when read aloud\n   - Varies sentence structure naturally\n   - Uses specific details over vague claims\n   - Maintains appropriate tone for context\n   - Uses simple constructions (is/are/has) where appropriate\n5. Present the humanized version\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide:\n\n1. The rewritten text\n2. A brief summary of changes made (optional, if helpful)\n\n---\n\n## Full Example\n\n**Before (AI-sounding):**\n\n> Great question! Here is an essay on this topic. I hope this helps!\n>\n> AI-assisted coding serves as an enduring testament to the transformative potential of large language models, marking a pivotal moment in the evolution of software development. In today''s rapidly evolving technological landscape, these groundbreaking tools—nestled at the intersection of research and practice—are reshaping how engineers ideate, iterate, and deliver, underscoring their vital role in modern workflows.\n>\n> At its core, the value proposition is clear: streamlining processes, enhancing collaboration, and fostering alignment. It''s not just about autocomplete; it''s about unlocking creativity at scale, ensuring that organizations can remain agile while delivering seamless, intuitive, and powerful experiences to users. The tool serves as a catalyst. The assistant functions as a partner. The system stands as a foundation for innovation.\n>\n> Industry observers have noted that adoption has accelerated from hobbyist experiments to enterprise-wide rollouts, from solo developers to cross-functional teams. The technology has been featured in The New York Times, Wired, and The Verge. Additionally, the ability to generate documentation, tests, and refactors showcases how AI can contribute to better outcomes, highlighting the intricate interplay between automation and human judgment.\n>\n> - 💡 **Speed:** Code generation is significantly faster, reducing friction and empowering developers.\n> - 🚀 **Quality:** Output quality has been enhanced through improved training, contributing to higher standards.\n> - ✅ **Adoption:** Usage continues to grow, reflecting broader industry trends.\n>\n> While specific details are limited based on available information, it could potentially be argued that these tools might have some positive effect. Despite challenges typical of emerging technologies—including hallucinations, bias, and accountability—the ecosystem continues to thrive. In order to fully realize this potential, teams must align with best practices.\n>\n> In conclusion, the future looks bright. Exciting times lie ahead as we continue this journey toward excellence. Let me know if you’d like me to expand on any section!\n\n**After (Humanized):**\n\n> AI coding assistants speed up some tasks. In a 2024 study by Google, developers using Codex completed simple functions 55% faster than a control group, but showed no improvement on debugging or architectural decisions.\n>\n> The tools are good at boilerplate: config files, test scaffolding, repetitive refactors. They are bad at knowing when they are wrong. I have mass-accepted suggestions that compiled, passed lint, and still did the wrong thing because I stopped paying attention.\n>\n> Mira, an engineer at a fintech startup I interviewed, said she uses Copilot \"like autocomplete for boring code\" but reviews every line before committing. Jake, a senior dev at a larger company, disabled it after it kept suggesting patterns from a deprecated internal library.\n>\n> The productivity claims are hard to verify. GitHub says Copilot users \"accept 30% of suggestions,\" but acceptance is not correctness, and correctness is not value. The 2024 Uplevel study found no statistically significant difference in pull-request throughput between teams with and without AI assistants.\n>\n> None of this means the tools are useless. It means they are tools. They do not replace judgment, and they do not eliminate the need for tests. If you do not have tests, you cannot tell whether the suggestion is right.\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n- Removed chatbot artifacts (\"Great question!\", \"I hope this helps!\", \"Let me know if...\")\n- Removed significance inflation (\"testament\", \"pivotal moment\", \"evolving landscape\", \"vital role\")\n- Removed promotional language (\"groundbreaking\", \"nestled\", \"seamless, intuitive, and powerful\")\n- Removed vague attributions (\"Industry observers\") and replaced with specific sources (Google study, named engineers, Uplevel study)\n- Removed superficial -ing phrases (\"underscoring\", \"highlighting\", \"reflecting\", \"contributing to\")\n- Removed negative parallelism (\"It''s not just X; it''s Y\")\n- Removed rule-of-three patterns and synonym cycling (\"catalyst/partner/foundation\")\n- Removed false ranges (\"from X to Y, from A to B\")\n- Removed em dashes, emojis, boldface headers, and curly quotes\n- Removed copula avoidance (\"serves as\", \"functions as\", \"stands as\") in favor of \"is\"/\"are\"\n- Removed formulaic challenges section (\"Despite challenges... continues to thrive\")\n- Removed knowledge-cutoff hedging (\"While specific details are limited...\")\n- Removed excessive hedging (\"could potentially be argued that... might have some\")\n- Removed filler phrases (\"In order to\", \"At its core\")\n- Removed generic positive conclusion (\"the future looks bright\", \"exciting times lie ahead\")\n- Replaced media name-dropping with specific claims from specific sources\n- Used simple sentence structures and concrete examples\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\nThis skill is based on [Wikipedia:Signs of AI writing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing), maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup. The patterns documented there come from observations of thousands of instances of AI-generated text on Wikipedia.\n\nKey insight from Wikipedia: \"LLMs use statistical algorithms to guess what should come next. The result tends toward the most statistically likely result that applies to the widest variety of cases.\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:54:03.360Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing to refine AI-generated text into natural, human-like writing.","zh":"适合于Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain等语言代理，需要将AI生成的文本改进为自然、类似人类的写作风格。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの言語エージェントに適しており、AI生成テキストを自然な、人間のような文章に磨きをかける必要がある。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, AI 생성된 텍스트를 자연스럽고 인간과 같은 글쓰기로 다듬는 데 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan perfeccionar el texto generado por IA en una escritura natural y similar a la humana.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage tels que Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain ayant besoin d''affiner le texte généré par l''IA en une écriture naturelle et ressemblant à l''écriture humaine.","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die den von KI generierten Text in eine natürliche, menschliche Schreibweise verfeinern müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que precisam refinar o texto gerado por IA em escrita natural e semelhante à humana.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимо усовершенствовать текст, сгенерированный ИИ, в естественное, похожее на человеческое письмо.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء اللغة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى تعديل النص المتولد بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي إلى كتابة طبيعية وشبيهة بالإنسانية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify and remove AI writing patterns, rewriting problematic sections with natural alternatives while preserving core meaning, utilizing techniques based on Wikipedia''s ''Signs of AI writing'' page.","zh":"赋予代理识别和去除AI写作模式的能力，并使用基于维基百科“AI写作的迹象”页面的技术，以自然的替代方案重写问题部分，同时保留核心含义。","ja":"エージェントがAIの書き込みパターンを識別して除去することを可能にし、Wikipediaの「AIによる書き込みの兆候」ページに基づく技術を使用して、問題のセクションを自然な代替案で書き直すと同時に、コアの意味を保ちます。","ko":"에이전트가 AI 글쓰기 패턴을 식별하고 제거할 수 있도록 하며, 위키백과의 ''AI 글쓰기 신호'' 페이지를 기반으로 하는 기술을 사용하여 문제가 있는 섹션을 자연스러운 대안으로 다시 작성하면서 핵심 의미를 보존합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar y eliminar patrones de escritura de IA, reescribiendo secciones problemáticas con alternativas naturales mientras se conserva el significado principal, utilizando técnicas basadas en la página de Wikipedia ''Señales de escritura de IA''.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier et de supprimer les modèles d''écriture de l''IA, réécrivant les sections problématiques avec des alternatives naturelles tout en préservant le sens principal, en utilisant des techniques basées sur la page Wikipedia ''Signes d''écriture de l''IA''.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Muster von KI-Schreibweise zu identifizieren und zu entfernen, problematische Abschnitte mit natürlichen Alternativen umzuschreiben, während die Kernbedeutung erhalten bleibt, und verwendet Techniken, die auf der Wikipedia-Seite ''Anzeichen von KI-Schreibweise'' basieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes identifiquem e removam padrões de escrita de IA, reescrevendo seções problemáticas com alternativas naturais, preservando o significado central, utilizando técnicas baseadas na página ''Sinais de escrita de IA'' da Wikipedia.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью идентифицировать и удалять шаблоны написания ИИ, переписывая проблемные разделы естественными альтернативами, сохраняя основной смысл, используя методы, основанные на странице Wikipedia ''Признаки написания ИИ''.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديد ونزع أنماط الكتابة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، إعادة كتابة الأقسام المشكلية ببدائل طبيعية مع الحفاظ على المعنى الأساسي، مستخدمة تقنيات تستند إلى صفحة ''علامات الكتابة بالذكاء الاصطناعي'' في ويكيبيديا."},"useCases":{"en":["Rewriting AI-generated content for blog posts","Editing academic papers to sound more natural","Refining chatbot responses to better mimic human conversation"],"zh":["为博客文章重写AI生成的内容","编辑学术论文使其听起来更自然","完善聊天机器人响应以更好地模仿人类对话"],"ja":["ブログ記事のAI生成コンテンツの書き直し","学術論文の編集をより自然に聞こえるようにする","チャットボットの応答をより人間の会話に近づける"],"ko":["블로그 게시물에 대한 AI 생성 콘텐츠를 다시 작성하기","학술 논문을 편집하여 더 자연스럽게 들리게 하기","챗봇 응답을 더 인간적인 대화로 다듬기"],"es":["Reescribir contenido generado por IA para publicaciones de blog","Editar artículos académicos para que suenen más naturales","Perfeccionar las respuestas de los chatbots para que imiten mejor la conversación humana"],"fr":["Réécrire le contenu généré par l''IA pour les billets de blog","Éditer les articles universitaires pour qu''ils sonnent plus naturels","Affiner les réponses des chatbots pour qu''ils imitent mieux la conversation humaine"],"de":["Von KI generierten Inhalt für Blog-Beiträge umschreiben","Akademische Artikel bearbeiten, um sie natürlicher klingen zu lassen","Die Antworten von Chatbots verfeinern, um die menschliche Konversation besser nachzuahmen"],"pt":["Reescrever conteúdo gerado por IA para posts de blog","Editar artigos acadêmicos para soar mais naturais","Aperfeiçoar respostas de chatbot para imitar melhor a conversa humana"],"ru":["Переписать контент, сгенерированный ИИ, для блог-постов","Редактировать академические статьи, чтобы они звучали более естественно","Усовершенствовать ответы чат-бота, чтобы лучше имитировать человеческий разговор"],"ar":["إعادة كتابة المحتوى المتولد بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي للمشاركات في المدونة","تحرير الأوراق الأكاديمية لتفصيلها أكثر بشكل طبيعي","تحسين استجابات بوت الدردشة لتقليد المحادثة البشرية بشكل أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Wikipedia''s ''Signs of AI writing'' page for pattern updates","May not cover all possible AI writing patterns"],"zh":["需要访问维基百科的''AI写作的迹象''页面以获取模式更新","可能无法涵盖所有可能的AI写作模式"],"ja":["Wikipediaの「AIによる書き込みの兆候」ページへのアクセスが必要であるため、パターンの更新が制限される","すべての可能なAI書き込みパターンをカバーできない可能性がある"],"ko":["위키백과의 ''AI 글쓰기 신호'' 페이지에 접근하여 패턴 업데이트를 얻을 필요가 있음","모든 가능한 AI 글쓰기 패턴을 다루지 못할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la página de Wikipedia ''Señales de escritura de IA'' para actualizaciones de patrones","Puede que no cubra todos los patrones de escritura de IA posibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la page Wikipedia ''Signes d''écriture de l''IA'' pour les mises à jour de modèles","Peut ne pas couvrir tous les modèles d''écriture de l''IA possibles"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Wikipedia-Seite ''Anzeichen von KI-Schreibweise'' für Muster-Aktualisierungen","Kann möglicherweise nicht alle möglichen Muster von KI-Schreibweise abdecken"],"pt":["Requer acesso à página ''Sinais de escrita de IA'' da Wikipedia para atualizações de padrões","Pode não cobrir todos os padrões de escrita de IA possíveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к странице ''Признаки написания ИИ'' в Wikipedia для обновления шаблонов","Может не охватывать все возможные шаблоны написания ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى صفحة ''علامات الكتابة بالذكاء الاصطناعي'' في ويكيبيديا لتحديثات الأنماط","يمكن أن لا يغطي جميع أنماط الكتابة بالذكاء الاصطناعي الممكنة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Tyler-R-Kendrick/agent-skills/azure-role-selector', 'community', 'Tyler-R-Kendrick', 'agent-skills', 'Tyler-R-Kendrick/agent-skills', 'azure-role-selector', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:53:17.310Z', NULL, '{"id":"Tyler-R-Kendrick/agent-skills/azure-role-selector","name":"azure-role-selector","description":{"zh":"Azure 角色选择器是用于找到最小的角色定义，匹配所需的权限，并分配给身份的工具。它支持自定义角色定义和 CLI 命令生成。","ja":"Azure ロールセレクターは、必要な権限に最も近い最小のロール定義を見つけ、ID に割り当てるためのツールです。カスタムロール定義と CLI コマンドの生成をサポートします。","ko":"Azure 역할 선택기는 필요한 권한과 일치하는 최소 역할 정의를 찾고, ID에 할당하기 위한 도구입니다. 사용자 지정 역할 정의 및 CLI 명령 생성을 지원합니다.","es":"El selector de roles de Azure te ayuda a encontrar la definición de rol mínima que coincide con los permisos deseados para una identidad","fr":"Le sélecteur de rôles Azure vous aide à trouver la définition de rôle minimale qui correspond aux autorisations souhaitées pour une identité","de":"Der Azure-Rollen-Selektor hilft Ihnen, die minimale Rollendefinition zu finden, die mit den gewünschten Berechtigungen für eine Identität übereinstimmt","pt":"O azure-role-selector é uma ferramenta que ajuda a encontrar a definição de função mínima que corresponde às permissões desejadas para uma identidade.","ru":"Azure-role-selector - это инструмент, который помогает найти минимальное определение роли, соответствующее желаемым разрешениям для идентификатора.","ar":"محدد دور azure هو أداة تساعد في العثور على التعريف الأدنى للدور الذي يتوافق مع الصلاحيات المطلوبة لهوية","en":"My personal agent-skills."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Azure 角色选择器：自定义角色定义和权限分配","ja":"Azure ロールセレクター：カスタムロール定義と権限の割り当て","ko":"Azure 역할 선택기: 사용자 지정 역할 정의 및 권한 할당","es":"Selector de roles de Azure","fr":"Sélecteur de rôles Azure","de":"Azure-Rollen-Selektor","pt":"Selecionador de Funções Azure","ru":"Выбор ролей Azure","ar":"محدد دور azure","en":"azure-role-selector"},"description":{"zh":"Azure 角色选择器是用于找到最小的角色定义，匹配所需的权限，并分配给身份的工具。它支持自定义角色定义和 CLI 命令生成。","ja":"Azure ロールセレクターは、必要な権限に最も近い最小のロール定義を見つけ、ID に割り当てるためのツールです。カスタムロール定義と CLI コマンドの生成をサポートします。","ko":"Azure 역할 선택기는 필요한 권한과 일치하는 최소 역할 정의를 찾고, ID에 할당하기 위한 도구입니다. 사용자 지정 역할 정의 및 CLI 명령 생성을 지원합니다.","es":"El selector de roles de Azure te ayuda a encontrar la definición de rol mínima que coincide con los permisos deseados para una identidad","fr":"Le sélecteur de rôles Azure vous aide à trouver la définition de rôle minimale qui correspond aux autorisations souhaitées pour une identité","de":"Der Azure-Rollen-Selektor hilft Ihnen, die minimale Rollendefinition zu finden, die mit den gewünschten Berechtigungen für eine Identität übereinstimmt","pt":"O azure-role-selector é uma ferramenta que ajuda a encontrar a definição de função mínima que corresponde às permissões desejadas para uma identidade.","ru":"Azure-role-selector - это инструмент, который помогает найти минимальное определение роли, соответствующее желаемым разрешениям для идентификатора.","ar":"محدد دور azure هو أداة تساعد في العثور على التعريف الأدنى للدور الذي يتوافق مع الصلاحيات المطلوبة لهوية","en":"My personal agent-skills."},"definition":{"en":"My personal agent-skills."},"features":{"zh":["找到最小的角色定义，匹配所需的权限","支持自定义角色定义","生成 CLI 命令用于分配角色","集成 Azure 文档和扩展 CLI 生成工具","支持 Azure Bicep 架构","提高身份权限分配的效率"],"ja":["必要な権限に最も近い最小のロール定義を見つける","カスタムロール定義をサポート","ロールの割り当てに使用する CLI コマンドを生成","Azure ドキュメントと拡張 CLI 生成ツールとの統合","Azure Bicep アーキテクチャのサポート","ID に対する権限の割り当ての効率性を向上"],"ko":["필요한 권한과 일치하는 최소 역할 정의를 찾기","사용자 지정 역할 정의를 지원","역할 할당에 사용되는 CLI 명령을 생성","Azure 문서 및 확장 CLI 생성 도구와의 통합","Azure Bicep 아키텍처 지원","ID에 대한 권한 할당의 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Encuentra la definición de rol mínima que coincide con los permisos deseados","Crea roles personalizados con permisos específicos","Genera comandos de CLI para asignar roles a identidades","Integración con herramientas de Azure como azure__documentation y azure__extension_cli_generate","Compatibilidad con azure__bicepschema y azure__get_azure_best"],"fr":["Trouvez la définition de rôle minimale qui correspond aux autorisations souhaitées","Créez des rôles personnalisés avec des autorisations spécifiques","Générez des commandes de CLI pour attribuer des rôles à des identités","Intégration avec des outils Azure tels que azure__documentation et azure__extension_cli_generate","Compatibilité avec azure__bicepschema et azure__get_azure_best"],"de":["Finden Sie die minimale Rollendefinition, die mit den gewünschten Berechtigungen übereinstimmt","Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Rollen mit spezifischen Berechtigungen","Generieren Sie CLI-Befehle, um Rollen zu Identitäten zuzuweisen","Integration mit Azure-Tools wie azure__documentation und azure__extension_cli_generate","Kompatibilität mit azure__bicepschema und azure__get_azure_best"],"pt":["Encontra a definição de função mínima","Cria definições de função personalizadas","Gera comandos CLI para atribuir funções","Integração com a documentação do Azure","Suporte à criação de esquemas personalizados","Otimização de permissões para identidades"],"ru":["Находит минимальное определение роли","Создает пользовательские определения ролей","Генерирует команды CLI для назначения ролей","Интегрируется с документацией Azure","Поддерживает создание пользовательских схем","Оптимизирует разрешения для идентификаторов"],"ar":["يجد التعريف الأدنى للدور","ينشئ تعريفات دور مخصصة","ينشئ أوامر CLI لتخصيص الأدوار","يتكامل مع وثائق azure","يدعم إنشاء مخططات مخصصة","يحسن الصلاحيات لهويات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure 角色选择器","自定义角色定义","CLI 命令生成","Azure 文档","Azure 扩展 CLI 生成","Azure Bicep 架构","身份权限分配","Azure 角色管理"],"ja":["Azure ロールセレクター","カスタムロール定義","CLI コマンド生成","Azure ドキュメント","Azure 拡張 CLI 生成","Azure Bicep アーキテクチャ","ID に対する権限の割り当て","Azure ロール管理"],"ko":["Azure 역할 선택기","사용자 지정 역할 정의","CLI 명령 생성","Azure 문서","Azure 확장 CLI 생성","Azure Bicep 아키텍처","ID에 대한 권한 할당","Azure 역할 관리"],"es":["selector de roles de Azure","roles personalizados en Azure","permisos en Azure","CLI de Azure","azure__documentation","azure__extension_cli_generate"],"fr":["sélecteur de rôles Azure","rôles personnalisés dans Azure","autorisations dans Azure","CLI d''Azure","azure__documentation","azure__extension_cli_generate"],"de":["Azure-Rollen-Selektor","benutzerdefinierte Rollen in Azure","Berechtigungen in Azure","Azure-CLI","azure__documentation","azure__extension_cli_generate"],"pt":["azure role selector","definição de função mínima","permissões de identidade","criação de funções personalizadas","comandos CLI azure","documentação do azure","esquemas personalizados","otimização de permissões"],"ru":["azure role selector","минимальное определение роли","разрешения идентификатора","создание пользовательских ролей","команды CLI azure","документация azure","пользовательские схемы","оптимизация разрешений"],"ar":["محدد دور azure","التعريف الأدنى للدور","صلاحيات هوية","إنشاء أدوار مخصصة","أوامر CLI azure","وثائق azure","مخططات مخصصة","تحسين الصلاحيات"]}},"owner":"Tyler-R-Kendrick","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"Tyler-R-Kendrick/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-role-selector","description":"|","bodyPreview":"Use the ''azure__documentation'' tool to find the minimal role definition that matches the desired permissions the user wants to assign to an identity. If no built-in role matches the desired permissions, use the ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' tool to create a custom role definition with the desired permissions. Then use the ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' tool to generate the CLI commands needed to assign that role to the identity. Finally, use the ''azure__bicepschema'' and ''azure__get_azure_best","body":"Use the ''azure__documentation'' tool to find the minimal role definition that matches the desired permissions the user wants to assign to an identity. If no built-in role matches the desired permissions, use the ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' tool to create a custom role definition with the desired permissions. Then use the ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' tool to generate the CLI commands needed to assign that role to the identity. Finally, use the ''azure__bicepschema'' and ''azure__get_azure_bestpractices'' tools to provide a Bicep code snippet for adding the role assignment.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:53:17.310Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing precise Azure role assignment capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要精确 Azure 角色分配能力的云管理代理。","ja":"Azure ロールの割り当て機能を正確に必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 Azure 역할 할당 기능이 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de Cloud que necesitan capacidades de asignación de roles de Azure precisas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de Cloud nécessitant des capacités d''attribution de rôles Azure précises.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Management-Agents, die präzise Azure-Rollenzuweisungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que precisam de capacidades de atribuição de funções do Azure precisas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления облаком, которым необходимы точные возможности назначения ролей Azure.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تحديد دور azure بدقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate custom Azure role definitions using the ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' tool and assign them to identities via CLI commands, leveraging ''azure__documentation'' for minimal role matching and ''azure__bicepschema'' for best practices.","zh":"赋予代理使用 ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' 工具生成自定义 Azure 角色定义并通过 CLI 命令将其分配给身份，利用 ''azure__documentation'' 进行最小角色匹配和 ''azure__bicepschema'' 进行最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントは ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' ツールを使用してカスタム Azure ロール定義を生成し、CLI コマンドを使用してそれらを ID に割り当てることができ、''azure__documentation'' を使用して最小限のロール マッチングを行い、''azure__bicepschema'' を使用してベスト プラクティスを実現します。","ko":"에이전트는 ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' 툴을 사용하여 사용자 지정 Azure 역할 정의를 생성하고 CLI 명령을 통해 身份에 할당하며, ''azure__documentation''를 통해 최소한의 역할 매칭과 ''azure__bicepschema''를 통해 최고의 사례를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar definiciones de roles personalizadas de Azure utilizando la herramienta ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' y asignarlas a identidades a través de comandos de CLI, aprovechando ''azure__documentation'' para la coincidencia de roles mínima y ''azure__bicepschema'' para las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des définitions de rôles Azure personnalisées à l''aide de l''outil ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' et de les attribuer à des identités via des commandes CLI, en exploitant ''azure__documentation'' pour la correspondance de rôles minimale et ''azure__bicepschema'' pour les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Azure-Rollendefinitionen mithilfe des Tools ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' zu erstellen und sie über CLI-Befehle Identitäten zuzuweisen, indem ''azure__documentation'' für minimale Rollenübereinstimmung und ''azure__bicepschema'' für Best Practices genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar definições de funções personalizadas do Azure usando a ferramenta ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' e atribuí-las a identidades via comandos CLI, aproveitando ''azure__documentation'' para correspondência de funções mínimas e ''azure__bicepschema'' para as melhores práticas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать пользовательские определения ролей Azure с помощью инструмента ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' и назначать их идентификаторам через команды CLI, используя ''azure__documentation'' для минимального соответствия ролей и ''azure__bicepschema'' для最佳 практик.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء تعريفات دور azure مخصصة باستخدام أداة ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' وتعيينها للهويات من خلال أوامر CLI، مستفيداً من ''azure__documentation'' لمطابقة الدور الأقل وتعريف ''azure__bicepschema'' لأفضل الممارسات."},"useCases":{"en":["Assigning minimal Azure roles to identities","Creating custom Azure role definitions with specific permissions","Generating CLI commands for role assignment"],"zh":["将最小 Azure 角色分配给身份","使用特定权限创建自定义 Azure 角色定义","为角色分配生成 CLI 命令"],"ja":["ID に最小限の Azure ロールを割り当てる","特定のアクセス許可を使用してカスタム Azure ロール定義を作成する","ロール割り当ての CLI コマンドを生成する"],"ko":[" 身份에 최소한의 Azure 역할을 할당","특정 권한으로 사용자 지정 Azure 역할 정의를 생성","역할 할당을 위한 CLI 명령을 생성"],"es":["Asignar roles de Azure mínimos a identidades","Crear definiciones de roles de Azure personalizadas con permisos específicos","Generar comandos de CLI para la asignación de roles"],"fr":["Attribuer des rôles Azure minimaux aux identités","Créer des définitions de rôles Azure personnalisées avec des autorisations spécifiques","Générer des commandes CLI pour l''attribution de rôles"],"de":["Minimal Azure-Rollen Identitäten zuweisen","Benutzerdefinierte Azure-Rollendefinitionen mit spezifischen Berechtigungen erstellen","CLI-Befehle für Rollenzuweisung generieren"],"pt":["Atribuir funções mínimas do Azure a identidades","Criar definições de funções personalizadas do Azure com permissões específicas","Gerar comandos CLI para atribuição de funções"],"ru":["Назначать минимальные роли Azure идентификаторам","Создавать пользовательские определения ролей Azure с конкретными разрешениями","Генерировать команды CLI для назначения ролей"],"ar":["تعيين أدوار azure الأقل للهويات","إنشاء تعريفات دور azure مخصصة بإذنเฉพาะ","إنشاء أوامر CLI لتخصيص الدور"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure CLI access","Dependent on ''azure__documentation'' and ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' tools"],"zh":["需要 Azure CLI 访问","依赖于 ''azure__documentation'' 和 ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' 工具"],"ja":["Azure CLI へのアクセスが必要","''azure__documentation'' と ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' ツールに依存している"],"ko":["Azure CLI 액세스가 필요","''azure__documentation'' 및 ''azure__extension_cli_generate'' 툴에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Azure CLI","Dependiente de las herramientas ''azure__documentation'' y ''azure__extension_cli_generate''"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Azure CLI","Dépend des outils ''azure__documentation'' et ''azure__extension_cli_generate''"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Azure CLI","Abhängig von den Tools ''azure__documentation'' und ''azure__extension_cli_generate''"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao Azure CLI","Depende das ferramentas ''azure__documentation'' e ''azure__extension_cli_generate''"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Azure CLI","Зависит от инструментов ''azure__documentation'' и ''azure__extension_cli_generate''"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر أوامر azure","يعتمد على أدوات ''azure__documentation'' و ''azure__extension_cli_generate''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('olavocarvalho/engrain/turborepo', 'community', 'olavocarvalho', 'engrain', 'olavocarvalho/engrain', 'turborepo', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.461Z', '2026-02-18T07:53:22.227Z', NULL, '{"id":"olavocarvalho/engrain/turborepo","name":"turborepo","description":{"zh":"Turborepo 是一个用于 JavaScript/TypeScript 项目的构建系统，能够提高开发效率。它通过缓存任务输出和并行运行任务来实现这一点","ja":"Turborepo は、JavaScript/TypeScript プロジェクト用のビルドシステムであり、開発効率を向上させることができます。タスク出力のキャッシュと並列タスク実行により、これを実現します","ko":"터보레포는 자바스크립트/타입스크립트 프로젝트를 위한 빌드 시스템으로, 개발 효율성을 향상시킬 수 있습니다. 태스크 출력 캐싱 및 병렬 태스크 실행을 통해 이를 달성합니다","es":"Turborepo es un sistema de compilación para monorepos de JavaScript y TypeScript que mejora la eficiencia al cachear las salidas de las tareas y ejecutarlas en paralelo","fr":"Turborepo est un système de build pour les monorepos JavaScript et TypeScript qui améliore l''efficacité en mettant en cache les sorties des tâches et en les exécutant en parallèle","de":"Turborepo ist ein Build-System für JavaScript- und TypeScript-Monorepos, das die Effizienz durch das Cachen von Aufgaben und das parallele Ausführen verbessert","pt":"Turborepo é uma ferramenta de build para monorepos JavaScript/TypeScript que caches resultados de tarefas e executa tarefas em paralelo com base no grafo de dependência.","ru":"Turborepo — это инструмент для сборки монорепозиториев JavaScript/TypeScript, который кэширует результаты задач и выполняет задачи параллельно на основе графа зависимостей.","ar":"Turborepo هي أداة بناء لمونوريبوزиторي جافا سكريبت/تايب سكريبت التي تتمتع بذاكرة مؤقتة لنتائج المهام وتقوم بتنفيذ المهام بالتوازي بناءً على الرسم البياني للعلاقات","en":"Embed documentation indexes into AGENTS.md for always-on agent context"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Turborepo 技术：JavaScript/TypeScript 项目优化","ja":"Turborepo 技術：JavaScript/TypeScript プロジェクト最適化","ko":"터보레포 기술: 자바스크립트/타입스크립트