,"Contrats explicites","Compatibilité priorisée"],"de":["JAX-WS-Interoperabilität","SOAP-Fehlerbehandlung","Sicherheitsrichtlinien","Migrationsnähte","Explizite Verträge","Kompatibilität priorisiert"],"pt":["Interoperabilidade JAX-WS","Tratamento de falhas SOAP","Política de segurança","Costuras de migração","Contratos explícitos","Clareza operacional"],"ru":["Интероперабельность JAX-WS","Обработка ошибок SOAP","Политика безопасности","Швы миграции","Явные контракты","Операционная ясность"],"ar":["التفاعل JAX-WS","معالجة أخطاء SOAP","سياسة الأمان","خياطة الهجرة","عقود صريحة","وضوح تشغيلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Java SOAP","JAX-WS","SOAP Web 服务","XML 消息交换","安全策略","迁移接缝","兼容性优先","明确的契约"],"ja":["Java SOAP","JAX-WS","SOAP Web サービス","XML メッセージ交換","セキュリティ ポリシー","移行シーム","互換性優先","明確な契約"],"ko":["자바 SOAP","JAX-WS","SOAP 웹 서비스","XML 메시지 교환","보안 정책","마이그레이션 시ーム","호환성 우선","분명한 계약"],"es":["servicios web SOAP Java","interoperabilidad JAX-WS","fallos SOAP","política de seguridad","migración de servicios web","desarrollo de servicios web en Java"],"fr":["services Web SOAP Java","interopérabilité JAX-WS","erreurs SOAP","politique de sécurité","migration de services Web","développement de services Web en Java"],"de":["SOAP-Webdienste Java","JAX-WS-Interoperabilität","SOAP-Fehler","Sicherheitsrichtlinien","Migration von Webdiensten","Entwicklung von Webdiensten in Java"],"pt":["serviços web SOAP Java","interoperabilidade JAX-WS","falhas SOAP","política de segurança","migração de serviços web","desenvolvimento de serviços web","Java para serviços web","segurança de serviços web"],"ru":["веб-службы SOAP Java","интероперабельность JAX-WS","ошибки SOAP","политика безопасности","миграция веб-служб","разработка веб-служб","Java для веб-служб","безопасность веб-служб"],"ar":["خدمات الويب SOAP الجافا","التفاعل JAX-WS","أخطاء SOAP","سياسة الأمان","هجرة خدمات الويب","تطوير خدمات الويب","الجافا لخدمات الويب","أمان خدمات الويب"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"soap-web-services-java","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# SOAP Web Services Java\n\n\nThe main operating scope is: JAX-WS interoperability, SOAP faults, security policy, and migration seams. Prioritize stable contracts, operational clarity, and compatibility-first delivery.\n\n## How to design architecture and boundaries\n\n- Use explicit contracts for JAX-WS interoperability, SOAP faults, security policy, and migration seams.\n- Keep ownership clear for each component and avoid implicit shared state.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing breaking","body":"# SOAP Web Services Java\n\n\nThe main operating scope is: JAX-WS interoperability, SOAP faults, security policy, and migration seams. Prioritize stable contracts, operational clarity, and compatibility-first delivery.\n\n## How to design architecture and boundaries\n\n- Use explicit contracts for JAX-WS interoperability, SOAP faults, security policy, and migration seams.\n- Keep ownership clear for each component and avoid implicit shared state.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing breaking changes.\n- Keep technology choices aligned with quality attributes and delivery constraints.\n\n## How to implement with Java and Kotlin\n\n- Apply constructor-injected services and explicit DTO contracts.\n- Keep framework and transport concerns out of business-core logic.\n- Enforce deterministic error mapping and typed responses.\n- Use static analysis and tests to prevent boundary regressions.\n\n## How to operate and scale safely\n\n- Define SLOs and alerts for latency, error rate, and saturation.\n- Implement rollout plans with canary checks and rollback criteria.\n- Keep runbooks updated with known failure modes and mitigations.\n- Track dependency risk and budget for resilience patterns.\n\n## How to troubleshoot production incidents\n\n- Start with user-impacting symptoms, then trace to dependencies.\n- Correlate logs, metrics, and traces using correlation identifiers.\n- Validate recent deployments, config changes, and feature-flag state.\n- Capture incident learnings as repeatable diagnostics and tests.\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n- Over-coupling implementation to specific infrastructure details instead of explicit boundaries.\n- Insufficient contract testing for changes touching JAX-WS interoperability, SOAP faults, security policy, and migration seams.\n- Missing observability and rollback strategy for production incidents.\n- Drift between runtime behavior and documented operational guidelines.\n\n## Common Errors and Fixes\n\n| Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Unexpected behavior after deployment | Configuration and contract mismatch between environments | Add compatibility checks, diff configs, and run canary verification. |\n| Latency and error spikes under load | Missing timeout budgets or retry amplification | Set explicit timeout/retry policy and observe dependency saturation. |\n| Regression in integrations | Schema or interface drift without version guardrails | Adopt versioning policy and contract tests in CI. |\n\n## How to use extended references\n\n- Read [Version History](references/version-history.md) before upgrades, migrations, or compatibility decisions.\n- Read [Java and Kotlin Examples](references/java-kotlin-examples.md) for implementation-ready snippets and language-specific guidance.\n- Read [Advanced Techniques](references/advanced-techniques.md) for specialist playbooks, incident tactics, and performance patterns.\n\n## References\n\n- [Official Documentation](https://jakarta.ee/specifications/xml-web-services/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/webservices/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://www.w3.org/TR/soap12-part1/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:55:01.746Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Enterprise Integration Agents handling legacy SOAP-based Java web services.","zh":"适用于处理基于遗留SOAP的Java Web服务的企业集成代理。","ja":"レガシーソープベースのJava Webサービスを扱うエンタープライズ統合エージェントに不可欠。","ko":"레거시 SOAP 기반 자바 웹 서비스를 처리하는 엔터프라이즈 통합 에이전트에 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de integración empresarial que manejan servicios web de Java basados en SOAP heredados.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''intégration d''entreprise gérant les services Web Java basés sur SOAP hérités.","de":"Wesentlich für Enterprise-Integration-Agents, die legacy-SOAP-basierte Java-Webservices verarbeiten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Integração Empresarial que lidam com serviços web Java baseados em SOAP legado.","ru":"Необходим для агентов企业ной интеграции, обрабатывающих веб-сервисы Java на основе SOAP-legacy.","ar":"ضروري لعميلة التكامل المؤسسي التي تتعامل مع خدمات الويب القديمة المبنية على SOAP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables robust JAX-WS interoperability with explicit contract handling, SOAP fault management, and security policy implementation. Provides standardized interfaces for migration seams between legacy and modern systems while maintaining stable service contracts and operational clarity.","zh":"实现了强大的JAX-WS互操作性，具有显式的合同处理、SOAP错误管理和安全策略实施。为遗留系统和现代系统之间的迁移提供了标准化的接口，同时保持稳定的服务合同和运营清晰度。","ja":"明示的な契約処理、SOAP フォルト管理、セキュリティ ポリシーの実装を備えた強力なJAX-WS 相互運用性を実現します。レガシーシステムとモダン システムの間の移行シームに対して標準化されたインターフェイスを提供し、安定したサービス契約と運用の明確性を維持します。","ko":"명시적인 계약 처리, SOAP 오류 관리 및 보안 정책 구현을 갖춘 강력한 JAX-WS 상호 운용성을 제공합니다. 레거시 시스템과 모던 시스템 간의 마이그레이션 시ーム을 위한 표준화된 인터페이스를 제공하며 안정적인 서비스 계약 및 운영의 명확성을 유지합니다.","es":"Permite una interoperabilidad robusta de JAX-WS con un manejo de contrato explícito, gestión de errores SOAP y implementación de políticas de seguridad. Proporciona interfaces estandarizadas para las costuras de migración entre sistemas heredados y modernos, manteniendo contratos de servicio estables y claridad operativa.","fr":"Permet une interopérabilité robuste de JAX-WS avec une gestion de contrat explicite, une gestion des erreurs SOAP et une mise en œuvre des politiques de sécurité. Fournit des interfaces standardisées pour les coutures de migration entre les systèmes hérités et modernes, tout en maintenant des contrats de service stables et une clarté opérationnelle.","de":"Ermöglicht eine robuste JAX-WS-Interoperabilität mit explizitem Vertragsmanagement, SOAP-Fehlermanagement und Sicherheitsrichtlinienimplementierung. Bietet standardisierte Schnittstellen für Migrationsschweißnähte zwischen veralteten und modernen Systemen, während stabilere Dienstverträge und operative Klarheit aufrechterhalten werden.","pt":"Permite interoperabilidade robusta do JAX-WS com tratamento de contrato explícito, gerenciamento de falhas SOAP e implementação de política de segurança. Fornece interfaces padronizadas para costuras de migração entre sistemas legados e modernos, mantendo contratos de serviço estáveis e clareza operacional.","ru":"Позволяет обеспечить надежную совместимость JAX-WS с явным управлением контрактами, управлением ошибками SOAP и реализацией политики безопасности. Предоставляет стандартизированные интерфейсы для швов миграции между устаревшими и современными системами, сохраняя стабильность сервисных контрактов и оперативную ясность.","ar":"يسمح بالتشغيل المتوافق الجيد لبروتوكول JAX-WS مع معالجة العقود الصريحة وإدارة أخطاء بروتوكول SOAP وتنفيذ سياسة الأمن. يوفر واجهات موحدة لترقيعات الهجرة بين الأنظمة القديمة والحديثة مع الحفاظ على عقود الخدمة المستقرة ووضوح العمليات."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating legacy SOAP services to modern architectures","Handling SOAP fault interoperability across JAX-WS implementations","Implementing WS-Security policies for enterprise web services","Maintaining contract stability during service evolution"],"zh":["将遗留SOAP服务迁移到现代架构","处理JAX-WS实现之间的SOAP错误互操作性","为企业Web服务实施WS-Security策略","在服务演化过程中保持合同的稳定性"],"ja":["レガシーソープ サービスをモダン アーキテクチャに移行する","JAX-WS 実装間の SOAP フォルト相互運用性を処理する","エンタープライズ Web サービスに WS-Security ポリシーを実装する","サービス進化中に契約の安定性を維持する"],"ko":["레거시 SOAP 서비스를 최신 아키텍처로 마이그레이션","JAX-WS 구현 간의 SOAP 오류 상호 운용성 처리","엔터프라이즈 웹 서비스에 WS-Security 정책 구현","서비스 진화过程에서 계약 안정성 유지"],"es":["Migrar servicios SOAP heredados a arquitecturas modernas","Gestionar la interoperabilidad de errores SOAP entre implementaciones de JAX-WS","Implementar políticas de WS-Security para servicios web empresariales","Mantener la estabilidad del contrato durante la evolución del servicio"],"fr":["Migrer les services SOAP hérités vers des architectures modernes","Gérer l''interopérabilité des erreurs SOAP entre les implémentations de JAX-WS","Mettre en œuvre les politiques de WS-Security pour les services Web d''entreprise","Maintenir la stabilité du contrat lors de l''évolution du service"],"de":["Legacy-SOAP-Dienste auf moderne Architekturen migrieren","SOAP-Fehlerinteroperabilität zwischen JAX-WS-Implementierungen handhaben","WS-Sicherheitsrichtlinien für Unternehmenswebservices implementieren","Vertragsstabilität während der Diensteentwicklung aufrechterhalten"],"pt":["Migrar serviços SOAP legados para arquiteturas modernas","Lidar com interoperabilidade de falhas SOAP em implementações do JAX-WS","Implementar políticas de segurança WS para serviços web empresariais","Manter estabilidade de contrato durante a evolução do serviço"],"ru":["Мигрировать устаревшие сервисы SOAP в современные архитектуры","Обрабатывать ошибки SOAP-интероперабельности в реализациях JAX-WS","Реализовывать политику безопасности WS для веб-сервисов предприятия","Сохранять стабильность контракта во время эволюции сервиса"],"ar":["هجرة خدمات الويب القديمة المبنية على بروتوكول SOAP إلى هياكل حديثة","معالجة توافق أخطاء بروتوكول SOAP عبر تنفيذات بروتوكول JAX-WS","تنفيذ سياسات أمن بروتوكول WS لخدمات الويب المؤسسية","الحفاظ على استقرار العقد أثناء تطور الخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Java/JAX-WS ecosystem specific","Requires clear compatibility policy definition","Focuses on contract stability over rapid iteration"],"zh":["特定于Java/JAX-WS生态系统","需要明确的兼容性策略定义","优先考虑合同稳定性而不是快速迭代"],"ja":["Java/JAX-WS エコシステムに特有のもの","明確な互換性ポリシー定義が必要","契約の安定性を優先し、迅速なイテレーションよりも優先"],"ko":["자바/JAX-WS 생태계에 특정","명확한 호환성 정책 정의 필요","계약 안정성을 빠른 반복보다 우선"],"es":["Específico del ecosistema Java/JAX-WS","Requiere una definición clara de la política de compatibilidad","Se centra en la estabilidad del contrato sobre la iteración rápida"],"fr":["Spécifique à l''écosystème Java/JAX-WS","Nécessite une définition claire de la politique de compatibilité","Se concentre sur la stabilité du contrat plutôt que sur l''itération rapide"],"de":["Spezifisch für das Java/JAX-WS-Ökosystem","Benötigt eine klare Kompatibilitätsrichtliniendefinition","Konzentriert sich auf Vertragsstabilität anstatt auf schnelle Iteration"],"pt":["Ecosistema específico do Java/JAX-WS","Exige definição clara de política de compatibilidade","Foca na estabilidade do contrato em vez de iteração rápida"],"ru":["Специфичность экосистемы Java/JAX-WS","Требует четкого определения политики совместимости","Сосредоточен на стабильности контракта, а не на быстрой итерации"],"ar":["البيئة الخاصة ببروتوكول Java/JAX-WS","يتطلب تعريفًا واضحًا لسياسة التوافق","يركز على استقرار العقد بدلاً من التكرار السريع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
