ers de proto","Utilisation de Protocol Buffers pour la sérialisation de données","Mise en œuvre de RPC unaires et de streaming","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Dienstedefinition mit gRPC","Strukturierung von Proto-Dateien","Verwendung von Protocol Buffers für die Daten-Serialisierung","Implementierung von RPC-Anfragen und -Streaming","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Criação de serviços gRPC com Protocol Buffers","Definição de serviços RPC com unary e stream","Estruturação de arquivos proto para serialização eficiente","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas, incluindo Java e Python","Integração com outros frameworks e bibliotecas","Otimização do desempenho e escalabilidade"],"ru":["Создание сервисов gRPC с Protocol Buffers","Определение сервисов RPC с unary и stream","Структуризация файлов proto для эффективной сериализации","Поддержка нескольких языков, включая Java и Python","Интеграция с другими фреймворками и библиотеками","Оптимизация производительности и масштабируемости"],"ar":["إنشاء خدمات gRPC مع بروتوكول بفرز","تعريف خدمات RPC مع unary و stream","هيكلة ملفات بروتو لتحقيق تسلسل فعال","دعم العديد من اللغات ، بما في ذلك Java و Python","التكامل مع إطارات و مكتبات أخرى","تحسين الأداء والتوسع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["gRPC","Protocol Buffers","RPC 框架","可扩展服务","proto 文件结构","服务定义","高性能","数据序列化","编程语言"],"ja":["gRPC","Protocol Buffers","RPC フレームワーク","拡張可能なサービス","proto ファイル構造","サービス定義","高性能","データシリアル化","プログラミング言語"],"ko":["gRPC","프로토콜 버퍼","RPC 프레임워크","확장 가능한 서비스","프로토 파일 구조","서비스 정의","고성능","데이터 시리얼화","프로그래밍 언어"],"es":["gRPC","Protocol Buffers","RPC","serialización de datos","desarrollo de servicios","alta disponibilidad","escalabilidad"],"fr":["gRPC","Protocol Buffers","RPC","sérialisation de données","développement de services","haute disponibilité","évolutivité"],"de":["gRPC","Protocol Buffers","RPC","Daten-Serialisierung","Dienstentwicklung","Hochverfügbarkeit","Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["gRPC","Protocol Buffers","serviços RPC","serialização eficiente","desenvolvimento de serviços","comunicação de alta performance","escalabilidade","Java","Python"],"ru":["gRPC","Protocol Buffers","сервисы RPC","эффективная сериализация","разработка сервисов","связь высокой производительности","масштабируемость","Java","Python"],"ar":["gRPC","بروتوكول بفرز","خدمات RPC","تسلسل فعال","تطوير الخدمات","اتصال ذو أداء عالي","التوسع","Java","Python"]}},"owner":"arsac","repo":"qb-sync","repoPath":"arsac/qb-sync","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"grpc-protobuf","description":"gRPC and Protocol Buffers - use for service-to-service communication, API definitions, streaming, and inter-service contracts","bodyPreview":"# gRPC and Protocol Buffers Patterns\n\n## Proto File Structure\n\n```protobuf\nsyntax = \"proto3\";\n\npackage orca.environment.v1;\n\noption java_package = \"orca.server.grpc.environment\";\noption java_multiple_files = true;\n\nimport \"google/protobuf/timestamp.proto\";\nimport \"google/protobuf/empty.proto\";\n\n// Service definition\nservice EnvironmentService {\n  // Unary RPCs\n  rpc CreateEnvironment(CreateEnvironmentRequest) returns (Environment);\n  rpc GetEnvironment(GetEnvironmentRequest) returns (Environment","body":"# gRPC and Protocol Buffers Patterns\n\n## Proto File Structure\n\n```protobuf\nsyntax = \"proto3\";\n\npackage orca.environment.v1;\n\noption java_package = \"orca.server.grpc.environment\";\noption java_multiple_files = true;\n\nimport \"google/protobuf/timestamp.proto\";\nimport \"google/protobuf/empty.proto\";\n\n// Service definition\nservice EnvironmentService {\n  // Unary RPCs\n  rpc CreateEnvironment(CreateEnvironmentRequest) returns (Environment);\n  rpc GetEnvironment(GetEnvironmentRequest) returns (Environment);\n  rpc ListEnvironments(ListEnvironmentsRequest) returns (ListEnvironmentsResponse);\n  rpc DeleteEnvironment(DeleteEnvironmentRequest) returns (google.protobuf.Empty);\n\n  // Server streaming\n  rpc WatchEnvironment(WatchEnvironmentRequest) returns (stream EnvironmentEvent);\n\n  // Bidirectional streaming\n  rpc StreamLogs(stream LogRequest) returns (stream LogResponse);\n}\n\n// Messages\nmessage Environment {\n  string id = 1;\n  string name = 2;\n  EnvironmentStatus status = 3;\n  google.protobuf.Timestamp created_at = 4;\n  google.protobuf.Timestamp updated_at = 5;\n  map<string, string> labels = 6;\n}\n\nenum EnvironmentStatus {\n  ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED = 0;\n  ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_PENDING = 1;\n  ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_RUNNING = 2;\n  ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_STOPPED = 3;\n  ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_FAILED = 4;\n}\n\nmessage CreateEnvironmentRequest {\n  string name = 1;\n  string description = 2;\n  map<string, string> labels = 3;\n}\n\nmessage GetEnvironmentRequest {\n  string id = 1;\n}\n\nmessage ListEnvironmentsRequest {\n  int32 page_size = 1;\n  string page_token = 2;\n  string filter = 3;  // e.g., \"status=RUNNING\"\n}\n\nmessage ListEnvironmentsResponse {\n  repeated Environment environments = 1;\n  string next_page_token = 2;\n  int32 total_count = 3;\n}\n\nmessage DeleteEnvironmentRequest {\n  string id = 1;\n}\n\nmessage WatchEnvironmentRequest {\n  string id = 1;\n}\n\nmessage EnvironmentEvent {\n  Environment environment = 1;\n  EventType type = 2;\n  google.protobuf.Timestamp timestamp = 3;\n\n  enum EventType {\n    EVENT_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED = 0;\n    EVENT_TYPE_CREATED = 1;\n    EVENT_TYPE_UPDATED = 2;\n    EVENT_TYPE_DELETED = 3;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Spring gRPC Server Implementation\n\n```kotlin\n@GrpcService\nclass EnvironmentGrpcService(\n    private val environmentService: EnvironmentService\n) : EnvironmentServiceGrpcKt.EnvironmentServiceCoroutineImplBase() {\n\n    override suspend fun createEnvironment(\n        request: CreateEnvironmentRequest\n    ): Environment {\n        val result = environmentService.create(request.toDomain())\n        return result.toProto()\n    }\n\n    override suspend fun getEnvironment(\n        request: GetEnvironmentRequest\n    ): Environment {\n        val id = UUID.fromString(request.id)\n        val env = environmentService.findById(id)\n            ?: throw StatusException(Status.NOT_FOUND.withDescription(\"Environment not found: ${request.id}\"))\n        return env.toProto()\n    }\n\n    override suspend fun listEnvironments(\n        request: ListEnvironmentsRequest\n    ): ListEnvironmentsResponse {\n        val page = environmentService.findAll(\n            pageSize = request.pageSize,\n            pageToken = request.pageToken.ifEmpty { null }\n        )\n\n        return ListEnvironmentsResponse.newBuilder()\n            .addAllEnvironments(page.items.map { it.toProto() })\n            .setNextPageToken(page.nextToken ?: \"\")\n            .setTotalCount(page.total)\n            .build()\n    }\n\n    override fun watchEnvironment(\n        request: WatchEnvironmentRequest\n    ): Flow<EnvironmentEvent> = flow {\n        val id = UUID.fromString(request.id)\n\n        environmentService.watchEvents(id).collect { event ->\n            emit(event.toProto())\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## gRPC Client Implementation\n\n```kotlin\n@Component\nclass ComputeClient(\n    @GrpcClient(\"compute\")\n    private val stub: ComputeServiceGrpcKt.ComputeServiceCoroutineStub\n) {\n\n    suspend fun createInstance(request: CreateInstanceRequest): Instance {\n        return try {\n            stub.createInstance(request)\n        } catch (e: StatusException) {\n            when (e.status.code) {\n                Status.Code.NOT_FOUND -> throw ResourceNotFoundRestException(\"Instance template not found\")\n                Status.Code.ALREADY_EXISTS -> throw ConflictRestException(\"Instance already exists\")\n                Status.Code.RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED -> throw ServiceUnavailableException(\"Quota exceeded\")\n                else -> throw InternalServerException(\"Compute service error: ${e.message}\")\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    suspend fun getInstance(id: String): Instance? {\n        return try {\n            stub.getInstance(GetInstanceRequest.newBuilder().setId(id).build())\n        } catch (e: StatusException) {\n            if (e.status.code == Status.Code.NOT_FOUND) null\n            else throw e\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling with gRPC Status\n\n```kotlin\n// Mapping domain exceptions to gRPC status\n@GrpcAdvice\nclass GrpcExceptionHandler {\n\n    @GrpcExceptionHandler(ResourceNotFoundRestException::class)\n    fun handleNotFound(e: ResourceNotFoundRestException): StatusException =\n        StatusException(\n            Status.NOT_FOUND\n                .withDescription(e.message)\n                .withCause(e)\n        )\n\n    @GrpcExceptionHandler(ValidationRestException::class)\n    fun handleValidation(e: ValidationRestException): StatusException =\n        StatusException(\n            Status.INVALID_ARGUMENT\n                .withDescription(e.message)\n                .withCause(e)\n        )\n\n    @GrpcExceptionHandler(ConflictRestException::class)\n    fun handleConflict(e: ConflictRestException): StatusException =\n        StatusException(\n            Status.ALREADY_EXISTS\n                .withDescription(e.message)\n                .withCause(e)\n        )\n}\n```\n\n## Interceptors\n\n```kotlin\n// Server interceptor for logging/metrics\n@Component\nclass LoggingServerInterceptor : ServerInterceptor {\n\n    override fun <ReqT, RespT> interceptCall(\n        call: ServerCall<ReqT, RespT>,\n        headers: Metadata,\n        next: ServerCallHandler<ReqT, RespT>\n    ): ServerCall.Listener<ReqT> {\n        val method = call.methodDescriptor.fullMethodName\n        val startTime = System.currentTimeMillis()\n\n        logger.info(\"gRPC call started: $method\")\n\n        return object : ForwardingServerCallListener.SimpleForwardingServerCallListener<ReqT>(\n            next.startCall(call, headers)\n        ) {\n            override fun onComplete() {\n                val duration = System.currentTimeMillis() - startTime\n                logger.info(\"gRPC call completed: $method (${duration}ms)\")\n                super.onComplete()\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Client interceptor for auth\n@Component\nclass AuthClientInterceptor(\n    private val tokenProvider: TokenProvider\n) : ClientInterceptor {\n\n    override fun <ReqT, RespT> interceptCall(\n        method: MethodDescriptor<ReqT, RespT>,\n        callOptions: CallOptions,\n        next: Channel\n    ): ClientCall<ReqT, RespT> {\n        return object : ForwardingClientCall.SimpleForwardingClientCall<ReqT, RespT>(\n            next.newCall(method, callOptions)\n        ) {\n            override fun start(responseListener: Listener<RespT>, headers: Metadata) {\n                headers.put(\n                    Metadata.Key.of(\"authorization\", Metadata.ASCII_STRING_MARSHALLER),\n                    \"Bearer ${tokenProvider.getToken()}\"\n                )\n                super.start(responseListener, headers)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Proto to Domain Mapping\n\n```kotlin\n// Domain to Proto\nfun orca.server.domain.Environment.toProto(): Environment =\n    Environment.newBuilder()\n        .setId(id.toString())\n        .setName(name)\n        .setStatus(status.toProto())\n        .setCreatedAt(createdAt.toProtoTimestamp())\n        .apply { updatedAt?.let { setUpdatedAt(it.toProtoTimestamp()) } }\n        .putAllLabels(labels)\n        .build()\n\nfun EnvironmentStatus.toProto(): orca.grpc.EnvironmentStatus =\n    when (this) {\n        EnvironmentStatus.PENDING -> orca.grpc.EnvironmentStatus.ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_PENDING\n        EnvironmentStatus.RUNNING -> orca.grpc.EnvironmentStatus.ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_RUNNING\n        EnvironmentStatus.STOPPED -> orca.grpc.EnvironmentStatus.ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_STOPPED\n        EnvironmentStatus.FAILED -> orca.grpc.EnvironmentStatus.ENVIRONMENT_STATUS_FAILED\n    }\n\nfun Instant.toProtoTimestamp(): Timestamp =\n    Timestamp.newBuilder()\n        .setSeconds(epochSecond)\n        .setNanos(nano)\n        .build()\n\n// Proto to Domain\nfun CreateEnvironmentRequest.toDomain() = CreateEnvironmentDomainRequest(\n    name = name,\n    description = description.ifEmpty { null },\n    labels = labelsMap\n)\n```\n\n## Streaming Patterns\n\n```kotlin\n// Server streaming\noverride fun watchEnvironment(request: WatchRequest): Flow<Event> = flow {\n    val channel = eventBus.subscribe(request.id)\n\n    try {\n        for (event in channel) {\n            emit(event.toProto())\n        }\n    } finally {\n        channel.cancel()\n    }\n}\n\n// Bidirectional streaming\noverride fun chat(requests: Flow<ChatMessage>): Flow<ChatResponse> = flow {\n    requests.collect { message ->\n        val response = processMessage(message)\n        emit(response)\n    }\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:55:14.865Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Native Agents needing scalable gRPC service development with Protocol Buffers serialization.","zh":"非常适合需要可扩展的gRPC服务开发和Protocol Buffers序列化的云原生代理。","ja":"クラウドネイティブエージェントがスケーラブルなgRPCサービス開発とProtocol Buffersのシリアル化を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"확장 가능한 gRPC 서비스 개발 및 Protocol Buffers 직렬화를 필요로 하는 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Nativos en la Nube que necesitan un desarrollo de servicios gRPC escalables con serialización de Protocol Buffers.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Cloud Natifs ayant besoin d''un développement de services gRPC évolutif avec une serialisation de Protocol Buffers.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud Native Agents, die eine skalierbare gRPC-Service-Entwicklung mit Protocol Buffers-Serialisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Nativos de Nuvem que necessitam de desenvolvimento de serviço gRPC escalável com serialização de Protocol Buffers.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуется разработка масштабируемых сервисов gRPC с сериализацией Protocol Buffers.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين في السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير خدمة gRPC قابلة للتوسيع مع تسلسل بروتوكول البуفر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define service interfaces and generate client/stub code using Protocol Buffers, enabling efficient gRPC communication with protobuf3 syntax and java_package options for seamless integration with Java environments.","zh":"赋予代理定义服务接口和生成客户端/存根代码的能力，使用Protocol Buffers实现高效的gRPC通信，支持protobuf3语法和java_package选项，以便与Java环境实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがサービスインターフェースを定義し、Protocol Buffersを使用してクライアント/スタブコードを生成できるようにし、protobuf3構文とjava_packageオプションを使用してJava環境とのシームレスな統合を実現することで、効率的なgRPC通信を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 서비스 인터페이스를 정의하고 Protocol Buffers를 사용하여 클라이언트/스텁 코드를 생성할 수 있도록 하여, protobuf3 구문 및 java_package 옵션을 사용하여 자바 환경과無縫な 통합을实现하여 효율적인 gRPC 통신을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir interfaces de servicio y generar código de cliente/stub utilizando Protocol Buffers, lo que permite una comunicación gRPC eficiente con sintaxis protobuf3 y opciones de java_package para una integración sin problemas con entornos de Java.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des interfaces de service et de générer du code client/stub en utilisant Protocol Buffers, ce qui permet une communication gRPC efficace avec une syntaxe protobuf3 et des options java_package pour une intégration transparente avec les environnements Java.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Service-Schnittstellen zu definieren und Client/Stubs-Code mit Hilfe von Protocol Buffers zu generieren, was eine effiziente gRPC-Kommunikation mit protobuf3-Syntax und java_package-Optionen für eine nahtlose Integration mit Java-Umgebungen ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir interfaces de serviço e gerar código de cliente/stub usando Protocol Buffers, permitindo comunicação gRPC eficiente com sintaxe protobuf3 e opções java_package para integração perfeita com ambientes Java.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять интерфейсы служб и генерировать код клиента/stub с помощью Protocol Buffers, обеспечивая эффективное общение gRPC с синтаксисом protobuf3 и опциями java_package для бесшовной интеграции с средами Java.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تعريف واجهات الخدمة وتوليد رمز العميل/الخدعة باستخدام بروتوكول البفر، وتمكين الاتصالات الفعالة gRPC بناءً على بناء الجملة protobuf3 وخيارات java_package من أجل التكامل السلس مع بيئات جافا."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining gRPC service interfaces with protobuf","Generating client code for EnvironmentService","Serializing data with google/protobuf/timestamp.proto"],"zh":["使用protobuf定义gRPC服务接口","为EnvironmentService生成客户端代码","使用google/protobuf/timestamp.proto序列化数据"],"ja":["protobufを使用してgRPCサービスインターフェースを定義する","EnvironmentServiceのクライアントコードを生成する","google/protobuf/timestamp.protoを使用してデータをシリアル化する"],"ko":["protobuf를 사용하여 gRPC 서비스 인터페이스를 정의한다","EnvironmentService의 클라이언트 코드를 생성한다","google/protobuf/timestamp.proto를 사용하여 데이터를 직렬화한다"],"es":["Definir interfaces de servicio gRPC con protobuf","Generar código de cliente para EnvironmentService","Serializar datos con google/protobuf/timestamp.proto"],"fr":["Définir des interfaces de service gRPC avec protobuf","Générer du code client pour EnvironmentService","Sérialiser des données avec google/protobuf/timestamp.proto"],"de":["Definieren von gRPC-Service-Schnittstellen mit protobuf","Generieren von Client-Code für EnvironmentService","Serialisieren von Daten mit google/protobuf/timestamp.proto"],"pt":["Definir interfaces de serviço gRPC com protobuf","Gerar código de cliente para EnvironmentService","Serializar dados com google/protobuf/timestamp.proto"],"ru":["Определение интерфейсов служб gRPC с помощью protobuf","Генерация кода клиента для EnvironmentService","Сериализация данных с помощью google/protobuf/timestamp.proto"],"ar":["تعريف واجهات خدمة gRPC باستخدام بروتوكول البفر","توليد رمز عميل لبيئة الخدمة","تسلسل البيانات باستخدام بروتوكول البفر google/protobuf/timestamp.proto"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires protobuf compiler installation","Java environment needed for java_package option"],"zh":["需要安装protobuf编译器","需要Java环境来使用java_package选项"],"ja":["protobufコンパイラのインストールが必要","java_packageオプションを使用するにはJava環境が必要"],"ko":["protobuf 컴파일러를 설치해야 함","java_package 옵션을 사용하려면 자바 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere instalación del compilador de protobuf","Entorno de Java necesario para la opción java_package"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du compilateur de protobuf","Environnement Java nécessaire pour l''option java_package"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des Protobuf-Compilers","Java-Umgebung erforderlich für die Option java_package"],"pt":["Requer instalação do compilador protobuf","Ambiente Java necessário para opção java_package"],"ru":["Требует установки компилятора protobuf","Необходимо окружение Java для опции java_package"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مترجم بروتوكول البفر","بيئة جافا ضرورية لخيار java_package"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
