ces et de l''architecture cloud","Maîtrise des modèles de conception et des principes SOLID","Expérience avec Project Reactor et la programmation réactive","Connaissances de Clean Architecture et des modèles de conception de production"],"de":["Erfahrung in Spring Boot 3.x-Anwendungen","Kenntnisse von Microservices und Cloud-Architektur","Beherrschung von Entwurfsmustern und SOLID-Prinzipien","Erfahrung mit Project Reactor und reaktiver Programmierung","Kenntnisse von Clean Architecture und Produktionsentwurfsmustern"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis com Spring Boot","Arquitetura de microserviços","Programação reativa com Project Reactor","Aplicação de princípios SOLID e Clean Architecture","Desenvolvimento de aplicações cloud-native"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых приложений с помощью Spring Boot","Архитектура микросервисов","Реактивное программирование с помощью Project Reactor","Применение принципов SOLID и Clean Architecture","Разработка облачных приложений"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع مع سبرينج بوت","هندسة ميكروسيرفيس","برمجة تفاعلية مع مشروع رياكتور","تطبيق مبادئ SOLID و Clean Architecture","تطوير تطبيقات سحابية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Java架构师","Spring Boot","微服务架构","云原生开发","反应式编程","Clean Architecture","SOLID原则","企业级Java应用"],"ja":["Javaアーキテクト","Spring Boot","ミクロサービスアーキテクチャ","クラウドネイティブ開発","リアクティブプログラミング","Clean Architecture","SOLID原則","企業レベルのJavaアプリケーション"],"ko":["자바 아키텍트","스프링 부트","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처","클라우드 네이티브 개발","반응형 프로그래밍","클린 아키텍처","SOLID 원칙","엔터프라이즈급 자바 애플리케이션"],"es":["arquitecto java senior","spring boot","microservicios","cloud native","patrones de diseño","principios solid","project reactor","programación reactiva"],"fr":["architecte java senior","spring boot","microservices","cloud native","modèles de conception","principes solid","project reactor","programmation réactive"],"de":["senior java architekt","spring boot","microservices","cloud native","entwurfsmuster","solid-prinzipien","project reactor","reaktive programmierung"],"pt":["arquiteto java sênior","desenvolvimento de aplicações java","spring boot","microserviços","programação reativa","clean architecture","princípios solid","cloud-native"],"ru":["сеньор-архитектор java","разработка приложений на java","spring boot","микросервисы","реактивное программирование","clean architecture","принципы solid","облачные приложения"],"ar":["مهندس معماري جافا السنيور","تطوير تطبيقات جافا","سبرينج بوت","ميكروسيرفيس","برمجة تفاعلية","هندسة نظيفة","مبادئ صلبة","تطبيقات سحابية"]}},"owner":"anyulled","repo":"superhero-battle-arena","repoPath":"anyulled/superhero-battle-arena","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"java-architect","description":"Use when building enterprise Java applications with Spring Boot 3.x, microservices, or reactive programming. Invoke for WebFlux, JPA optimization, Spring Security, cloud-native patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n-","body":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Spring Boot microservices\n- Implementing reactive WebFlux applications\n- Optimizing JPA/Hibernate performance\n- Designing event-driven architectures\n- Setting up Spring Security with OAuth2/JWT\n- Creating cloud-native applications\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Architecture analysis** - Review project structure, dependencies, Spring config\n2. **Domain design** - Create models following DDD and Clean Architecture\n3. **Implementation** - Build services with Spring Boot best practices\n4. **Data layer** - Optimize JPA queries, implement repositories\n5. **Quality assurance** - Test with JUnit 5, TestContainers, achieve 85%+ coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Spring Boot | `references/spring-boot-setup.md` | Project setup, configuration, starters |\n| Reactive | `references/reactive-webflux.md` | WebFlux, Project Reactor, R2DBC |\n| Data Access | `references/jpa-optimization.md` | JPA, Hibernate, query tuning |\n| Security | `references/spring-security.md` | OAuth2, JWT, method security |\n| Testing | `references/testing-patterns.md` | JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use Java 21 LTS features (records, sealed classes, pattern matching)\n- Apply Clean Architecture and SOLID principles\n- Use Spring Boot 3.x with proper dependency injection\n- Write comprehensive tests (JUnit 5, Mockito, TestContainers)\n- Document APIs with OpenAPI/Swagger\n- Use proper exception handling hierarchy\n- Apply database migrations (Flyway/Liquibase)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use deprecated Spring APIs\n- Skip input validation\n- Store sensitive data unencrypted\n- Use blocking code in reactive applications\n- Ignore transaction boundaries\n- Hardcode configuration values\n- Skip proper logging and monitoring\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Java features, provide:\n1. Domain models (entities, DTOs, records)\n2. Service layer (business logic, transactions)\n3. Repository interfaces (Spring Data)\n4. Controller/REST endpoints\n5. Test classes with comprehensive coverage\n6. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nSpring Boot 3.x, Java 21, Spring WebFlux, Project Reactor, Spring Data JPA, Spring Security, OAuth2/JWT, Hibernate, R2DBC, Spring Cloud, Resilience4j, Micrometer, JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito, Maven/Gradle\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Full-stack feature implementation\n- **API Designer** - REST API design and documentation\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Deployment and CI/CD\n- **Database Optimizer** - Query optimization and indexing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:56:00.010Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud-Native Agents needing expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot applications and microservices architecture.","zh":"非常适合需要在企业级Spring Boot应用程序和微服务架构方面具有专业知识的云原生代理。","ja":"エンタープライズグレードのSpring Bootアプリケーションおよびマイクロサービスアーキテクチャに関する専門知識が必要なクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適です。","ko":"기업급 스프링 부트 애플리케이션 및 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Cloud-Native que necesitan experiencia en aplicaciones y arquitectura de microservicios de grado empresarial de Spring Boot.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud-Native ayant besoin d''expertise dans les applications et l''architecture de microservices de niveau entreprise Spring Boot.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Native-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Unternehmensanwendungen und Microservice-Architektur von Spring Boot benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cloud-Native que precisam de especialização em aplicações e arquitetura de microsserviços de nível empresarial do Spring Boot.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым необходимы знания в области корпоративных приложений и архитектуры микросervices Spring Boot.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تطبيقات وعمارة微 الخدمات من الدرجة المؤسسية لبرنامج Spring Boot."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable microservices using Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS, and reactive programming with Project Reactor, while applying Clean Architecture and SOLID principles for production-ready patterns.","zh":"赋予代理设计使用Spring Boot 3.x、Java 21 LTS和Project Reactor的响应式编程的可扩展微服务的能力，同时应用Clean Architecture和SOLID原则以实现生产就绪模式。","ja":"Spring Boot 3.x、Java 21 LTS、Project Reactorを使用したリアクティブプログラミングによるスケーラブルなマイクロサービスを設計するエージェントを可能にし、Clean ArchitectureとSOLIDの原則を適用して生产就绪パターンを実現します。","ko":"스프링 부트 3.x, 자바 21 LTS 및 프로젝트 리액터를 사용한 반응형 프로그래밍으로 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스를 설계할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 클린 아키텍처 및 SOLID 원칙을 적용하여 생산 준비 패턴을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar microservicios escalables utilizando Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS y programación reactiva con Project Reactor, aplicando principios de Arquitectura Limpia y SOLID para patrones de producción listos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des microservices évolutifs en utilisant Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS et la programmation réactive avec Project Reactor, en appliquant les principes d''Architecture Propre et SOLID pour des modèles de production prêts.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, skalierbare Microservices mit Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS und reaktiver Programmierung mit Project Reactor zu entwerfen, während saubere Architektur- und SOLID-Prinzipien für produktionsbereite Muster angewendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar microsserviços escaláveis usando Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS e programação reativa com Project Reactor, aplicando Arquitetura Limpa e princípios SOLID para padrões de produção prontos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать масштабируемые микросервисы с использованием Spring Boot 3.x, Java 21 LTS и реактивного программирования с Project Reactor, применяя Чистую Архитектуру и принципы SOLID для производственных шаблонов.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم الخدمات الميكروية القابلة للتوسيع باستخدام Spring Boot 3.x و Java 21 LTS والبرمجة التفاعلية مع مشروع Reactor، مع تطبيق عمارة النظافة ومبادئ SOLID لنماذج الإنتاج الجاهزة."},"useCases":{"en":["Architecting cloud-native Spring Boot applications","Building scalable microservices with reactive programming","Applying Clean Architecture and SOLID principles for enterprise-grade development"],"zh":["架构云原生Spring Boot应用程序","使用响应式编程构建可扩展的微服务","应用Clean Architecture和SOLID原则进行企业级开发"],"ja":["クラウドネイティブSpring Bootアプリケーションのアーキテクチャ","リアクティブプログラミングを使用したスケーラブルなマイクロサービスの構築","エンタープライズグレード開発のためのClean ArchitectureとSOLIDの原則の適用"],"ko":["클라우드 네이티브 스프링 부트 애플리케이션 아키텍처","반응형 프로그래밍을 사용한 확장 가능한 마이크로 서비스 구축","기업급 개발을 위한 클린 아키텍처 및 SOLID 원칙 적용"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones Cloud-Native de Spring Boot","Construir microservicios escalables con programación reactiva","Aplicar principios de Arquitectura Limpia y SOLID para el desarrollo de grado empresarial"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications Cloud-Native Spring Boot","Construire des microservices évolutifs avec une programmation réactive","Appliquer les principes d''Architecture Propre et SOLID pour le développement de niveau entreprise"],"de":["Entwerfen von Cloud-Native-Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","Erstellen von skalierbaren Microservices mit reaktiver Programmierung","Anwenden von sauberer Architektur- und SOLID-Prinzipien für die Unternehmensentwicklung"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações cloud-native do Spring Boot","Construir microsserviços escaláveis com programação reativa","Aplicar Arquitetura Limpa e princípios SOLID para desenvolvimento de nível empresarial"],"ru":["Проектирование облачных приложений Spring Boot","Построение масштабируемых микросервисов с реактивным программированием","Применение Чистой Архитектуры и принципов SOLID для корпоративного развития"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات الوكلاء الأصليين السحابية لبرنامج Spring Boot","بناء خدمات ميكروية قابلة للتوسيع مع البرمجة التفاعلية","تطبيق عمارة النظافة ومبادئ SOLID لتطوير المؤسسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in Java 21 LTS and Spring Boot 3.x","Limited to enterprise-grade applications and microservices architecture"],"zh":["需要Java 21 LTS和Spring Boot 3.x的专业知识","仅限于企业级应用程序和微服务架构"],"ja":["Java 21 LTSとSpring Boot 3.xの専門知識が必要","エンタープライズグレードアプリケーションとマイクロサービスアーキテクチャのみに限定"],"ko":["자바 21 LTS 및 스프링 부트 3.x의 전문 지식이 필요","기업급 애플리케이션 및 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en Java 21 LTS y Spring Boot 3.x","Limitado a aplicaciones y arquitectura de microservicios de grado empresarial"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en Java 21 LTS et Spring Boot 3.x","Limité aux applications et à l''architecture de microservices de niveau entreprise"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in Java 21 LTS und Spring Boot 3.x","Begrenzt auf Unternehmensanwendungen und Microservice-Architektur"],"pt":["Exige especialização em Java 21 LTS e Spring Boot 3.x","Limitado a aplicações e arquitetura de microsserviços de nível empresarial"],"ru":["Требует знаний в области Java 21 LTS и Spring Boot 3.x","Ограничен корпоративными приложениями и архитектурой микросervices"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في Java 21 LTS و Spring Boot 3.x","محدود للتطبيقات وعمارة 微 الخدمات من الدرجة المؤسسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
