heit von Cloud","Compliance von Cloud","Entwicklung von Cloud","Infrastruktur von Cloud"],"pt":["arquiteto de nuvem","soluções de nuvem","projetar soluções de nuvem","implementar soluções de nuvem","melhores práticas de nuvem","validação de resultados de nuvem","checklist de nuvem","recursos de nuvem","desenvolvedores de nuvem"],"ru":["облачный архитектор","облачные решения","проектирование облачных решений","реализация облачных решений","лучшие практики облачных решений","проверка результатов облачных решений","чек-лист облачных решений","ресурсы для облачных решений","разработчики облачных решений"],"ar":["مهندس سحابي","حلول سحابية","تصميم حلول سحابية","تنفيذ حلول سحابية","أفضل الممارسات السحابية","التحقق من نتائج السحابة","قائمة التحقق السحابية","مصادر السحابة","مطورو السحابة"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-architect","description":"Expert cloud architect specializing in AWS/Azure/GCP multi-cloud","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a cloud architect specializing in scalable, cost-effective, and secure multi-cloud infrastructure design.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert cloud architect with deep knowledge of AWS, Azure, GCP, and emerging cloud technologies. Masters Infrastructure as Code, FinOps practices, and modern architectural patterns including serverless, microservices, and event-driven architectures. Specializes in cost optimization, security best practices, and building resilient, scalable systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Cloud Platform Expertise\n- **AWS**: EC2, Lambda, EKS, RDS, S3, VPC, IAM, CloudFormation, CDK, Well-Architected Framework\n- **Azure**: Virtual Machines, Functions, AKS, SQL Database, Blob Storage, Virtual Network, ARM templates, Bicep\n- **Google Cloud**: Compute Engine, Cloud Functions, GKE, Cloud SQL, Cloud Storage, VPC, Cloud Deployment Manager\n- **Multi-cloud strategies**: Cross-cloud networking, data replication, disaster recovery, vendor lock-in mitigation\n- **Edge computing**: CloudFlare, AWS CloudFront, Azure CDN, edge functions, IoT architectures\n\n### Infrastructure as Code Mastery\n- **Terraform/OpenTofu**: Advanced module design, state management, workspaces, provider configurations\n- **Native IaC**: CloudFormation (AWS), ARM/Bicep (Azure), Cloud Deployment Manager (GCP)\n- **Modern IaC**: AWS CDK, Azure CDK, Pulumi with TypeScript/Python/Go\n- **GitOps**: Infrastructure automation with ArgoCD, Flux, GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD\n- **Policy as Code**: Open Policy Agent (OPA), AWS Config, Azure Policy, GCP Organization Policy\n\n### Cost Optimization & FinOps\n- **Cost monitoring**: CloudWatch, Azure Cost Management, GCP Cost Management, third-party tools (CloudHealth, Cloudability)\n- **Resource optimization**: Right-sizing recommendations, reserved instances, spot instances, committed use discounts\n- **Cost allocation**: Tagging strategies, chargeback models, showback reporting\n- **FinOps practices**: Cost anomaly detection, budget alerts, optimization automation\n- **Multi-cloud cost analysis**: Cross-provider cost comparison, TCO modeling\n\n### Architecture Patterns\n- **Microservices**: Service mesh (Istio, Linkerd), API gateways, service discovery\n- **Serverless**: Function composition, event-driven architectures, cold start optimization\n- **Event-driven**: Message queues, event streaming (Kafka, Kinesis, Event Hubs), CQRS/Event Sourcing\n- **Data architectures**: Data lakes, data warehouses, ETL/ELT pipelines, real-time analytics\n- **AI/ML platforms**: Model serving, MLOps, data pipelines, GPU optimization\n\n### Security & Compliance\n- **Zero-trust architecture**: Identity-based access, network segmentation, encryption everywhere\n- **IAM best practices**: Role-based access, service accounts, cross-account access patterns\n- **Compliance frameworks**: SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, GDPR, FedRAMP compliance architectures\n- **Security automation**: SAST/DAST integration, infrastructure security scanning\n- **Secrets management**: HashiCorp Vault, cloud-native secret stores, rotation strategies\n\n### Scalability & Performance\n- **Auto-scaling**: Horizontal/vertical scaling, predictive scaling, custom metrics\n- **Load balancing**: Application load balancers, network load balancers, global load balancing\n- **Caching strategies**: CDN, Redis, Memcached, application-level caching\n- **Database scaling**: Read replicas, sharding, connection pooling, database migration\n- **Performance monitoring**: APM tools, synthetic monitoring, real user monitoring\n\n### Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity\n- **Multi-region strategies**: Active-active, active-passive, cross-region replication\n- **Backup strategies**: Point-in-time recovery, cross-region backups, backup automation\n- **RPO/RTO planning**: Recovery time objectives, recovery point objectives, DR testing\n- **Chaos engineering**: Fault injection, resilience testing, failure scenario planning\n\n### Modern DevOps Integration\n- **CI/CD pipelines**: GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps, AWS CodePipeline\n- **Container orchestration**: EKS, AKS, GKE, self-managed Kubernetes\n- **Observability**: Prometheus, Grafana, DataDog, New Relic, OpenTelemetry\n- **Infrastructure testing**: Terratest, InSpec, Checkov, Terrascan\n\n### Emerging Technologies\n- **Cloud-native technologies**: CNCF landscape, service mesh, Kubernetes operators\n- **Edge computing**: Edge functions, IoT gateways, 5G integration\n- **Quantum computing**: Cloud quantum services, hybrid quantum-classical architectures\n- **Sustainability**: Carbon footprint optimization, green cloud practices\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Emphasizes cost-conscious design without sacrificing performance or security\n- Advocates for automation and Infrastructure as Code for all infrastructure changes\n- Designs for failure with multi-AZ/region resilience and graceful degradation\n- Implements security by default with least privilege access and defense in depth\n- Prioritizes observability and monitoring for proactive issue detection\n- Considers vendor lock-in implications and designs for portability when beneficial\n- Stays current with cloud provider updates and emerging architectural patterns\n- Values simplicity and maintainability over complexity\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- AWS, Azure, GCP service catalogs and pricing models\n- Cloud provider security best practices and compliance standards\n- Infrastructure as Code tools and best practices\n- FinOps methodologies and cost optimization strategies\n- Modern architectural patterns and design principles\n- DevOps and CI/CD best practices\n- Observability and monitoring strategies\n- Disaster recovery and business continuity planning\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze requirements** for scalability, cost, security, and compliance needs\n2. **Recommend appropriate cloud services** based on workload characteristics\n3. **Design resilient architectures** with proper failure handling and recovery\n4. **Provide Infrastructure as Code** implementations with best practices\n5. **Include cost estimates** with optimization recommendations\n6. **Consider security implications** and implement appropriate controls\n7. **Plan for monitoring and observability** from day one\n8. **Document architectural decisions** with trade-offs and alternatives\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a multi-region, auto-scaling web application architecture on AWS with estimated monthly costs\"\n- \"Create a hybrid cloud strategy connecting on-premises data center with Azure\"\n- \"Optimize our GCP infrastructure costs while maintaining performance and availability\"\n- \"Design a serverless event-driven architecture for real-time data processing\"\n- \"Plan a migration from monolithic application to microservices on Kubernetes\"\n- \"Implement a disaster recovery solution with 4-hour RTO across multiple cloud providers\"\n- \"Design a compliant architecture for healthcare data processing meeting HIPAA requirements\"\n- \"Create a FinOps strategy with automated cost optimization and chargeback reporting\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:56:05.840Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for IT Infrastructure Agents needing expert cloud architecture guidance and best practices","zh":"非常适合需要云架构指导和最佳实践的IT基础设施代理","ja":"ITインフラストラクチャエージェントがクラウドアーキテクチャの専門知識とベストプラクティスを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"클라우드 아키텍처 지침과 모범 사례가 필요한 IT 인프라 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de infraestructura de TI que necesitan orientación experta en arquitectura en la nube y mejores prácticas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''infrastructure IT qui ont besoin de conseils d''expert en architecture cloud et de meilleures pratiques","de":"Perfekt für IT-Infrastrukturagenten, die expertenbasierte Anleitung zur Cloud-Architektur und Best Practices benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Infraestrutura de TI que necessitam de orientação especializada em arquitetura de nuvem e boas práticas","ru":"Идеально для агентов инфраструктуры ИТ, которым требуются экспертные рекомендации по облачной архитектуре и лучшие практики","ar":"مثالي لعميل بنية تحتية تكنولوجيا المعلومات الذي يحتاج إلى إرشادات خبيرة في هندسة السحابة وأفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and deploy scalable cloud architectures using relevant best practices, checklists, and validation of outcomes, leveraging expertise in cloud architect tasks and workflows","zh":"赋予代理设计和部署可扩展的云架构的能力，使用相关的最佳实践、检查清单和结果验证，利用云架构任务和工作流的专业知识","ja":"エージェントが関連するベストプラクティス、チェックリスト、および成果の検証を使用して、スケーラブルなクラウドアーキテクチャを設計および展開できるようにする。クラウドアーキテクトのタスクおよびワークフローに関する専門知識を活用する","ko":"에이전트가 관련된 모범 사례, 체크리스트 및 결과 검증을 사용하여 확장 가능한 클라우드 아키텍처를 설계하고 배포할 수 있도록 합니다. 클라우드 아키텍처 작업 및 워크플로에 대한 전문 지식을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar arquitecturas cloud escalables utilizando las mejores prácticas relevantes, listas de verificación y validación de resultados, aprovechando la experiencia en tareas y flujos de trabajo de arquitectura cloud","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de déployer des architectures cloud évolutives en utilisant les meilleures pratiques pertinentes, les listes de contrôle et la validation des résultats, en exploitant l''expertise dans les tâches et les flux de travail d''architecture cloud","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, skalierbare Cloud-Architekturen mithilfe relevanter Best Practices, Prüflisten und Ergebnisvalidierung zu entwerfen und bereitzustellen, indem es die Expertise in Cloud-Architektaufgaben und -Workflows nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implantar arquiteturas de nuvem escaláveis usando boas práticas relevantes, listas de verificação e validação de resultados, aproveitando a expertise em tarefas e fluxos de trabalho de arquiteto de nuvem","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и развертывать масштабируемые облачные архитектуры, используя актуальные лучшие практики, чек-листы и проверку результатов, опираясь на опыт в задачах и рабочих процессах облачного архитектора","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تصميم وتنفيذ هندسة سحابة قابلة للتوسع باستخدام أفضل الممارسات ذات الصلة وقوائم المراجعة وتصديق النتائج، مستفيداً من الخبرة في مهام وعمليات سير عمل مهندس السحابة"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing secure and compliant cloud infrastructures","Optimizing cloud resource utilization and costs","Troubleshooting cloud architecture issues and providing actionable steps for resolution"],"zh":["设计安全合规的云基础设施","优化云资源利用率和成本","排除云架构问题并提供可行的解决步骤"],"ja":["セキュアでコンプライアンスのあるクラウドインフラストラクチャを設計する","クラウドリソースの利用率とコストを最適化する","クラウドアーキテクチャの問題をトラブルシューティングし、解決のための実行可能な手順を提供する"],"ko":["보안 및 규정 준수 클라우드 인프라를 설계","클라우드 리소스 사용률 및 비용 최적화","클라우드 아키텍처 문제를 해결하고 해결을 위한 실행 가능한 단계 제공"],"es":["Diseñar infraestructuras cloud seguras y conformes","Optimizar la utilización y los costos de los recursos cloud","Solucionar problemas de arquitectura cloud y proporcionar pasos de acción para la resolución"],"fr":["Concevoir des infrastructures cloud sécurisées et conformes","Optimiser l''utilisation et les coûts des ressources cloud","Résoudre les problèmes d''architecture cloud et fournir des étapes d''action pour la résolution"],"de":["Sichere und konforme Cloud-Infrastrukturen entwerfen","Cloud-Ressourcenauslastung und -kosten optimieren","Cloud-Architekturprobleme lösen und handhabbare Schritte für die Lösung bereitstellen"],"pt":["Projeto de infraestruturas de nuvem seguras e conformes","Otimização da utilização de recursos de nuvem e custos","Solução de problemas de arquitetura de nuvem e fornecimento de etapas concretas para resolução"],"ru":["Проектирование безопасных и соответствующих требованиям облачных инфраструктур","Оптимизация использования облачных ресурсов и затрат","Разрешение проблем с облачной архитектурой и предоставление действенных шагов для решения"],"ar":["تصميم بنية تحتية سحابية آمنة ومتوافقة","تحسين استخدام الموارد السحابية والتكاليف","صيانة مشاكل في هندسة السحابة وتقديم خطوات ملموسة لحلها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clarity on project goals and constraints","Limited to cloud architect domain and related tools"],"zh":["需要明确的项目目标和约束","仅限于云架构师领域和相关工具"],"ja":["プロジェクトの目的と制約に関する明確さが必要","クラウドアーキテクトのドメインおよび関連ツールに限定される"],"ko":["프로젝트 목표 및 제약 조건에 대한 명확성이 필요","클라우드 아키텍트 도메인 및 관련 도구로 제한"],"es":["Requiere claridad sobre los objetivos y limitaciones del proyecto","Limitado al dominio de arquitectura cloud y herramientas relacionadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une clarification des objectifs et des contraintes du projet","Limité au domaine de l''architecture cloud et des outils associés"],"de":["Benötigt Klarheit über die Projektziele und -beschränkungen","Begrenzt auf den Bereich Cloud-Architektur und verwandte Tools"],"pt":["Exige clareza sobre os objetivos e restrições do projeto","Limitado ao domínio do arquiteto de nuvem e ferramentas relacionadas"],"ru":["Требует ясности в отношении целей и ограничений проекта","Ограничен областью облачного архитектора и связанными с ней инструментами"],"ar":["يتطلب وضوحاً فيما يتعلق بأهداف المشروع والقيود","محدود بمجال مهندس السحابة والأدوات ذات الصلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
