avec Conductor pour les projets de développement","Mise à jour du contexte pour les projets de développement existants","Intégration des membres de l''équipe aux projets Conductor"],"de":["Implementierung von Kontext in IA-Entwicklungsprojekten","Aufrechterhaltung der Konsistenz in IA-gestützten Entwicklungs-Sitzungen","Integration mit Conductor für Entwicklungsprojekte","Aktualisierung von Kontext für bestehende Entwicklungsprojekte","Onboarding von Teammitgliedern zu Conductor-Projekten"],"pt":["Implementação de contexto como artefato gerenciado","Interações de IA consistentes","Alinhamento da equipe através de documentação estruturada","Manutenção de consistência em sessões de desenvolvimento assistidas por IA","Onboarding de membros da equipe para projetos existentes","Decisão sobre quando atualizar o contexto"],"ru":["Реализация контекста как управляемого артефакта","Последовательные взаимодействия ИИ","Выравнивание команды через структурированную документацию","Поддержание последовательности в сессиях разработки,辅助ной ИИ","Внедрение новых членов команды в существующие проекты","Решение о том, когда обновлять контекст"],"ar":["تنفيذ السياق كartifact قابل للتعامل","تفاعلات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتسقة","تنسق الفريق من خلال توثيق منظم","صيانة الاتساق في جلسات التطوير المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","توجيه أعضاء الفريق الجدد إلى مشاريع موجودة","قرار بشأن متى تحديث السياق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文驱动开发","AI交互","团队协调","结构化项目文档","Conductor项目","代码管理","团队管理","AI开发"],"ja":["コンテキスト駆動開発","AIのやり取り","チームの調整","構造化されたプロジェクトドキュメント","Conductorプロジェクト","コード管理","チーム管理","AI開発"],"ko":["컨텍스트 주도 개발","AI 상호 작용","팀 조정","구조화된 프로젝트 문서","Conductor 프로젝트","코드 관리","팀 관리","AI 개발"],"es":["desarrollo dirigido por contexto","IA","conductor","contexto","proyectos de desarrollo","desarrollo de software","integración de contexto","onboarding de equipo"],"fr":["développement dirigé par le contexte","IA","conductor","contexte","projets de développement","développement de logiciels","intégration de contexte","intégration d''équipe"],"de":["kontextgetriebene Entwicklung","IA","Conductor","Kontext","Entwicklungsprojekte","Software-Entwicklung","Kontext-Integration","Team-Onboarding"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por contexto","contexto como artefato","interações de IA","alinhamento da equipe","documentação estruturada","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de contexto"],"ru":["контекстно-ориентированное развитие","контекст как артефакт","взаимодействия ИИ","выравнивание команды","структурированная документация","разработка программного обеспечения","управление контекстом"],"ar":["التطوير القائم على السياق","السياق كartifact","تفاعلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنسق الفريق","توثيق منظم","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة السياق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-driven-development","description":"Use this skill when working with Conductors context-driven development methodology, managing project context artifacts, or understanding the relationship between product.md, tech-stack.md, and workflow.md files.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Context-Driven Development\n\nGuide for implementing and maintaining context as a managed artifact alongside code, enabling consistent AI interactions and team alignment through structured project documentation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new projects with Conductor\n- Understanding the relationship between context artifacts\n- Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions\n- Onboarding team members to an existing Conductor project\n- Deciding when to update context d","body":"# Context-Driven Development\n\nGuide for implementing and maintaining context as a managed artifact alongside code, enabling consistent AI interactions and team alignment through structured project documentation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new projects with Conductor\n- Understanding the relationship between context artifacts\n- Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions\n- Onboarding team members to an existing Conductor project\n- Deciding when to update context documents\n- Managing greenfield vs brownfield project contexts\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\nContext-Driven Development treats project context as a first-class artifact managed alongside code. Instead of relying on ad-hoc prompts or scattered documentation, establish a persistent, structured foundation that informs all AI interactions.\n\nKey principles:\n\n1. **Context precedes code**: Define what you''re building and how before implementation\n2. **Living documentation**: Context artifacts evolve with the project\n3. **Single source of truth**: One canonical location for each type of information\n4. **AI alignment**: Consistent context produces consistent AI behavior\n\n## The Workflow\n\nFollow the **Context → Spec & Plan → Implement** workflow:\n\n1. **Context Phase**: Establish or verify project context artifacts exist and are current\n2. **Specification Phase**: Define requirements and acceptance criteria for work units\n3. **Planning Phase**: Break specifications into phased, actionable tasks\n4. **Implementation Phase**: Execute tasks following established workflow patterns\n\n## Artifact Relationships\n\n### product.md - Defines WHAT and WHY\n\nPurpose: Captures product vision, goals, target users, and business context.\n\nContents:\n\n- Product name and one-line description\n- Problem statement and solution approach\n- Target user personas\n- Core features and capabilities\n- Success metrics and KPIs\n- Product roadmap (high-level)\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Product vision or goals change\n- New major features are planned\n- Target audience shifts\n- Business priorities evolve\n\n### product-guidelines.md - Defines HOW to Communicate\n\nPurpose: Establishes brand voice, messaging standards, and communication patterns.\n\nContents:\n\n- Brand voice and tone guidelines\n- Terminology and glossary\n- Error message conventions\n- User-facing copy standards\n- Documentation style\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Brand guidelines change\n- New terminology is introduced\n- Communication patterns need refinement\n\n### tech-stack.md - Defines WITH WHAT\n\nPurpose: Documents technology choices, dependencies, and architectural decisions.\n\nContents:\n\n- Primary languages and frameworks\n- Key dependencies with versions\n- Infrastructure and deployment targets\n- Development tools and environment\n- Testing frameworks\n- Code quality tools\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Adding new dependencies\n- Upgrading major versions\n- Changing infrastructure\n- Adopting new tools or patterns\n\n### workflow.md - Defines HOW to Work\n\nPurpose: Establishes development practices, quality gates, and team workflows.\n\nContents:\n\n- Development methodology (TDD, etc.)\n- Git workflow and commit conventions\n- Code review requirements\n- Testing requirements and coverage targets\n- Quality assurance gates\n- Deployment procedures\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Team practices evolve\n- Quality standards change\n- New workflow patterns are adopted\n\n### tracks.md - Tracks WHAT''S HAPPENING\n\nPurpose: Registry of all work units with status and metadata.\n\nContents:\n\n- Active tracks with current status\n- Completed tracks with completion dates\n- Track metadata (type, priority, assignee)\n- Links to individual track directories\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- New tracks are created\n- Track status changes\n- Tracks are completed or archived\n\n## Context Maintenance Principles\n\n### Keep Artifacts Synchronized\n\nEnsure changes in one artifact reflect in related documents:\n\n- New feature in product.md → Update tech-stack.md if new dependencies needed\n- Completed track → Update product.md to reflect new capabilities\n- Workflow change → Update all affected track plans\n\n### Update tech-stack.md When Adding Dependencies\n\nBefore adding any new dependency:\n\n1. Check if existing dependencies solve the need\n2. Document the rationale for new dependencies\n3. Add version constraints\n4. Note any configuration requirements\n\n### Update product.md When Features Complete\n\nAfter completing a feature track:\n\n1. Move feature from \"planned\" to \"implemented\" in product.md\n2. Update any affected success metrics\n3. Document any scope changes from original plan\n\n### Verify Context Before Implementation\n\nBefore starting any track:\n\n1. Read all context artifacts\n2. Flag any outdated information\n3. Propose updates before proceeding\n4. Confirm context accuracy with stakeholders\n\n## Greenfield vs Brownfield Handling\n\n### Greenfield Projects (New)\n\nFor new projects:\n\n1. Run `/conductor:setup` to create all artifacts interactively\n2. Answer questions about product vision, tech preferences, and workflow\n3. Generate initial style guides for chosen languages\n4. Create empty tracks registry\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n- Full control over context structure\n- Define standards before code exists\n- Establish patterns early\n\n### Brownfield Projects (Existing)\n\nFor existing codebases:\n\n1. Run `/conductor:setup` with existing codebase detection\n2. System analyzes existing code, configs, and documentation\n3. Pre-populate artifacts based on discovered patterns\n4. Review and refine generated context\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n- Extract implicit context from existing code\n- Reconcile existing patterns with desired patterns\n- Document technical debt and modernization plans\n- Preserve working patterns while establishing standards\n\n## Benefits\n\n### Team Alignment\n\n- New team members onboard faster with explicit context\n- Consistent terminology and conventions across the team\n- Shared understanding of product goals and technical decisions\n\n### AI Consistency\n\n- AI assistants produce aligned outputs across sessions\n- Reduced need to re-explain context in each interaction\n- Predictable behavior based on documented standards\n\n### Institutional Memory\n\n- Decisions and rationale are preserved\n- Context survives team changes\n- Historical context informs future decisions\n\n### Quality Assurance\n\n- Standards are explicit and verifiable\n- Deviations from context are detectable\n- Quality gates are documented and enforceable\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nconductor/\n├── index.md              # Navigation hub linking all artifacts\n├── product.md            # Product vision and goals\n├── product-guidelines.md # Communication standards\n├── tech-stack.md         # Technology preferences\n├── workflow.md           # Development practices\n├── tracks.md             # Work unit registry\n├── setup_state.json      # Resumable setup state\n├── code_styleguides/     # Language-specific conventions\n│   ├── python.md\n│   ├── typescript.md\n│   └── ...\n└── tracks/\n    └── <track-id>/\n        ├── spec.md\n        ├── plan.md\n        ├── metadata.json\n        └── index.md\n```\n\n## Context Lifecycle\n\n1. **Creation**: Initial setup via `/conductor:setup`\n2. **Validation**: Verify before each track\n3. **Evolution**: Update as project grows\n4. **Synchronization**: Keep artifacts aligned\n5. **Archival**: Document historical decisions\n\n## Context Validation Checklist\n\nBefore starting implementation on any track, validate context:\n\n### Product Context\n\n- [ ] product.md reflects current product vision\n- [ ] Target users are accurately described\n- [ ] Feature list is up to date\n- [ ] Success metrics are defined\n\n### Technical Context\n\n- [ ] tech-stack.md lists all current dependencies\n- [ ] Version numbers are accurate\n- [ ] Infrastructure targets are correct\n- [ ] Development tools are documented\n\n### Workflow Context\n\n- [ ] workflow.md describes current practices\n- [ ] Quality gates are defined\n- [ ] Coverage targets are specified\n- [ ] Commit conventions are documented\n\n### Track Context\n\n- [ ] tracks.md shows all active work\n- [ ] No stale or abandoned tracks\n- [ ] Dependencies between tracks are noted\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\nAvoid these context management mistakes:\n\n### Stale Context\n\nProblem: Context documents become outdated and misleading.\nSolution: Update context as part of each track''s completion process.\n\n### Context Sprawl\n\nProblem: Information scattered across multiple locations.\nSolution: Use the defined artifact structure; resist creating new document types.\n\n### Implicit Context\n\nProblem: Relying on knowledge not captured in artifacts.\nSolution: If you reference something repeatedly, add it to the appropriate artifact.\n\n### Context Hoarding\n\nProblem: One person maintains context without team input.\nSolution: Review context artifacts in pull requests; make updates collaborative.\n\n### Over-Specification\n\nProblem: Context becomes so detailed it''s impossible to maintain.\nSolution: Keep artifacts focused on decisions that affect AI behavior and team alignment.\n\n## Integration with Development Tools\n\n### IDE Integration\n\nConfigure your IDE to display context files prominently:\n\n- Pin conductor/product.md for quick reference\n- Add tech-stack.md to project notes\n- Create snippets for common patterns from style guides\n\n### Git Hooks\n\nConsider pre-commit hooks that:\n\n- Warn when dependencies change without tech-stack.md update\n- Remind to update product.md when feature branches merge\n- Validate context artifact syntax\n\n### CI/CD Integration\n\nInclude context validation in pipelines:\n\n- Check tech-stack.md matches actual dependencies\n- Verify links in context documents resolve\n- Ensure tracks.md status matches git branch state\n\n## Session Continuity\n\nConductor supports multi-session development through context persistence:\n\n### Starting a New Session\n\n1. Read index.md to orient yourself\n2. Check tracks.md for active work\n3. Review relevant track''s plan.md for current task\n4. Verify context artifacts are current\n\n### Ending a Session\n\n1. Update plan.md with current progress\n2. Note any blockers or decisions made\n3. Commit in-progress work with clear status\n4. Update tracks.md if status changed\n\n### Handling Interruptions\n\nIf interrupted mid-task:\n\n1. Mark task as `[~]` with note about stopping point\n2. Commit work-in-progress to feature branch\n3. Document any uncommitted decisions in plan.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Read context first**: Always read relevant artifacts before starting work\n2. **Small updates**: Make incremental context changes, not massive rewrites\n3. **Link decisions**: Reference context when making implementation choices\n4. **Version context**: Commit context changes alongside code changes\n5. **Review context**: Include context artifact reviews in code reviews\n6. **Validate regularly**: Run context validation checklist before major work\n7. **Communicate changes**: Notify team when context artifacts change significantly\n8. **Preserve history**: Use git to track context evolution over time\n9. **Question staleness**: If context feels wrong, investigate and update\n10. **Keep it actionable**: Every context item should inform a decision or behavior\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:56:25.819Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conductor Agents requiring structured project documentation and consistent AI interactions through context-driven development","zh":"适用于需要结构化项目文档和通过上下文驱动开发实现一致性 AI 交互的 Conductor Agents","ja":"構造化されたプロジェクト文書と、コンテキスト駆動開発を通じて一貫性のある AI インタラクションを必要とする Conductor エージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 문서와 컨텍스트 주도 개발을 통해 일관된 AI 상호작용이 필요한 Conductor 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Conductor que requieren documentación de proyecto estructurada y interacciones de IA consistentes a través del desarrollo impulsado por contexto","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Conductor qui nécessitent une documentation de projet structurée et des interactions d''IA cohérentes via le développement piloté par le contexte","de":"Ideal für Conductor-Agents, die eine strukturierte Projektunterlagen und konsistente KI-Interaktionen durch kontextgetriebene Entwicklung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Condutores que exigem documentação de projeto estruturada e interações de IA consistentes por meio do desenvolvimento orientado por contexto","ru":"Идеально для агентов-дирижеров, требующих структурированной документации проекта и последовательных взаимодействий ИИ посредством контекстно-ориентированного развития","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء القائد الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق مشروع منظم وتفاعلات ذكاء اصطناعي متسقة من خلال التطوير الموجه بالسياق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain consistency across AI-assisted development sessions, understand context artifact relationships, and onboard team members efficiently using managed context artifacts and Conductor project documentation protocols","zh":"赋予代理维护 AI 辅助开发会话的一致性、理解上下文工件关系并使用托管上下文工件和 Conductor 项目文档协议高效地将团队成员纳入其中的能力","ja":"エージェントに、AI アシスト開発セッションの一貫性を維持し、コンテキスト・アーティファクトの関係を理解し、管理されたコンテキスト・アーティファクトと Conductor プロジェクト文書化プロトコルを使用してチームメンバーを効率的にオンボードする能力を付与","ko":"에이전트가 AI 보조 개발 세션에서 일관성을 유지하고, 컨텍스트 아티팩트 관계를 이해하며, 관리되는 컨텍스트 아티팩트와 Conductor 프로젝트 문서화 프로토콜을 사용하여 팀원을 효율적으로 온보딩할 수 있도록 하는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener la coherencia en todas las sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA, a comprender las relaciones entre artefactos de contexto y a integrar a los miembros del equipo de manera eficiente utilizando artefactos de contexto administrados y protocolos de documentación de proyectos Conductor","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir la cohérence à travers toutes les sessions de développement assistées par IA, de comprendre les relations entre les artefacts de contexte et d''intégrer les membres de l''équipe de manière efficace en utilisant des artefacts de contexte gérés et des protocoles de documentation de projet Conductor","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Konsistenz über alle von KI unterstützten Entwicklungssitzungen hinweg zu wahren, Kontextartefaktbeziehungen zu verstehen und Teammitglieder effizient mithilfe von verwalteten Kontextartefakten und Conductor-Projektunterlagenprotokollen aufzunehmen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a consistência em todo o desenvolvimento assistido por IA, compreender as relações entre artefatos de contexto e integrar membros da equipe de forma eficiente usando artefatos de contexto gerenciados e protocolos de documentação de projeto do Conductor","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательность на протяжении сеансов разработки с помощью ИИ, понимать взаимосвязи между артефактами контекста и эффективно интегрировать членов команды с помощью управляемых артефактов контекста и протоколов документации проекта Conductor","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على الاتساق عبر جلسات التطوير المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، وفهم علاقات محتوى السياق وتسريح أعضاء الفريق بفعالية باستخدام محتوى السياق المدارة وبروتوكولات توثيق مشروع القائد"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new projects with structured context","Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions","Onboarding team members to existing Conductor projects","Updating context documentation"],"zh":["设置具有结构化上下文的新项目","在 AI 辅助开发会话中保持一致性","将团队成员加入现有的 Conductor 项目","更新上下文文档"],"ja":["構造化されたコンテキストを持つ新しいプロジェクトを設定","AI アシスト開発セッションの一貫性を維持","チームメンバーを既存の Conductor プロジェクトにオンボード","コンテキスト文書を更新"],"ko":["구조화된 컨텍스트를 갖춘 새로운 프로젝트 설정","AI 보조 개발 세션에서 일관성을 유지","팀원을 기존 Conductor 프로젝트에 온보딩","컨텍스트 문서 업데이트"],"es":["Configuración de nuevos proyectos con contexto estructurado","Mantenimiento de la coherencia en las sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA","Integración de miembros del equipo en proyectos Conductor existentes","Actualización de la documentación de contexto"],"fr":["Configuration de nouveaux projets avec un contexte structuré","Maintenance de la cohérence à travers les sessions de développement assistées par IA","Intégration des membres de l''équipe dans les projets Conductor existants","Mise à jour de la documentation de contexte"],"de":["Einrichtung neuer Projekte mit strukturiertem Kontext","Wahrung der Konsistenz über von KI unterstützte Entwicklungssitzungen hinweg","Aufnahme von Teammitgliedern in bestehende Conductor-Projekte","Aktualisierung der Kontextdokumentation"],"pt":["Configuração de novos projetos com contexto estruturado","Manutenção da consistência em sessões de desenvolvimento assistidas por IA","Integração de membros da equipe a projetos Conductor existentes","Atualização da documentação de contexto"],"ru":["Настройка новых проектов со структурированным контекстом","Поддержание последовательности в сеансах разработки с помощью ИИ","Интеграция членов команды в существующие проекты Conductor","Обновление документации контекста"],"ar":["إعداد مشاريع جديدة مع سياق منظم","الحفاظ على الاتساق عبر جلسات التطوير المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تسريح أعضاء الفريق في مشاريع القائد الحالية","تحديث توثيق السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Conductor project setup","Context artifacts must be managed alongside code"],"zh":["需要 Conductor 项目设置","上下文工件必须与代码一起管理"],"ja":["Conductor プロジェクトの設定が必要","コンテキスト・アーティファクトはコードとともに管理する必要がある"],"ko":["Conductor 프로젝트 설정이 필요","컨텍스트 아티팩트는 코드와 함께 관리되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto Conductor","Los artefactos de contexto deben gestionarse junto con el código"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Conductor","Les artefacts de contexte doivent être gérés conjointement avec le code"],"de":["Benötigt Conductor-Projektkonfiguration","Kontextartefakte müssen zusammen mit dem Code verwaltet werden"],"pt":["Exige configuração do projeto Conductor","Os artefatos de contexto devem ser gerenciados juntamente com o código"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Conductor","Артефакты контекста должны управляться вместе с кодом"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع القائد","يجب إدارة محتوى السياق جنبًا إلى جنب مع الكود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
