n von Alarmen","Reduzierung von Alarmmüdigkeit","Verwaltung von Incident-Response-Workflows"],"pt":["Configuração de regras e thresholds de alerta","Gerenciamento de on-call e escalonamento","Redução da fadiga de alertas","Melhoria da resposta a incidentes","Integração com plataformas de monitoramento e comunicação"],"ru":["Настройка правил и порогов оповещений","Управление дежурством и эскалацией","Снижение усталости от оповещений","Улучшение реагирования на инциденты","Интеграция с платформами мониторинга и коммуникации"],"ar":["تكوين قوانين و عتبات التنبيه","إدارة على کال و التدرج","تقليل إجهاد التنبيهات","تحسين استجابة الحوادث","التكامل مع منصات المراقبة و التواصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["告警管理","值班管理","生产系统","监控系统","告警规则","值班轮换","事件响应"],"ja":["アラート管理","オンコール管理","生産システム","モニタリングシステム","アラートルール","オンコールローテーション","インシデントレスポンス"],"ko":["알림 관리","온콜 관리","생산 시스템","모니터링 시스템","알림 규칙","온콜轮换","사건 응답"],"es":["alertas de producción","gestión de llamadas de atención","sistemas de monitoreo","plataformas de llamadas","canales de comunicación","respuesta a incidentes","fatiga de alertas"],"fr":["alertes de production","gestion d''appel","systèmes de surveillance","plateformes d''appel","canaux de communication","réponse aux incidents","fatigue d''alerte"],"de":["Produktionsalarme","On-Call-Management","Überwachungssysteme","On-Call-Plattformen","Kommunikationskanäle","Incident-Response","Alarmmüdigkeit"],"pt":["alertas e on-call","gerenciamento de on-call","redução da fadiga de alertas","resposta a incidentes","integração com plataformas de monitoramento","configuração de regras de alerta"],"ru":["оповещения и дежурство","управление дежурством","снижение усталости от оповещений","реагирование на инциденты","интеграция с платформами мониторинга","настройка правил оповещений"],"ar":["تنبيهات و على کال","إدارة على کال","تقليل إجهاد التنبيهات","استجابة الحوادث","التكامل مع منصات المراقبة","تكوين قوانين التنبيه"]}},"owner":"allthingslinux","repo":"atl.services","repoPath":"allthingslinux/atl.services","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"alerting-oncall","description":"Set up alerting rules, configure on-call rotations, and manage incident response workflows. Integrate with PagerDuty, Opsgenie, or Grafana OnCall for alert routing and escalation. Use when implementing alerting strategies and on-call management for production systems.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Alerting & On-Call\n\nConfigure effective alerting and on-call management for production systems.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Setting up alerting rules and thresholds\n- Configuring on-call rotations and schedules\n- Implementing alert routing and escalation\n- Reducing alert fatigue\n- Managing incident response workflows\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Monitoring system (Prometheus, Datadog, etc.)\n- On-call platform (PagerDuty, Opsgenie, Grafana OnCall)\n- Communication channels (Slack,","body":"# Alerting & On-Call\n\nConfigure effective alerting and on-call management for production systems.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Setting up alerting rules and thresholds\n- Configuring on-call rotations and schedules\n- Implementing alert routing and escalation\n- Reducing alert fatigue\n- Managing incident response workflows\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Monitoring system (Prometheus, Datadog, etc.)\n- On-call platform (PagerDuty, Opsgenie, Grafana OnCall)\n- Communication channels (Slack, email)\n\n## Alerting Best Practices\n\n### Alert Categories\n\n```yaml\n# Severity levels\ncritical:\n  - Service completely down\n  - Data loss imminent\n  - Security breach\n  response: Immediate page, wake people up\n\nhigh:\n  - Service degraded significantly\n  - Error rate above SLO\n  - Capacity near limit\n  response: Page during business hours, notify after hours\n\nmedium:\n  - Performance degradation\n  - Non-critical component failure\n  - Warning thresholds exceeded\n  response: Notify via Slack, review next business day\n\nlow:\n  - Informational alerts\n  - Capacity planning triggers\n  - Routine maintenance needed\n  response: Email notification, weekly review\n```\n\n### Alert Design Principles\n\n```yaml\n# Good alert characteristics\nalerts:\n  actionable:\n    - Every alert should require human action\n    - Include runbook links\n    - Clear remediation steps\n\n  relevant:\n    - Alert on symptoms, not causes\n    - Focus on user impact\n    - Avoid alerting on expected behavior\n\n  timely:\n    - Appropriate thresholds\n    - Suitable evaluation windows\n    - Account for normal variance\n\n  unique:\n    - No duplicate alerts\n    - Proper alert grouping\n    - Clear ownership\n```\n\n## Prometheus Alerting\n\n### Alert Rules\n\n```yaml\n# prometheus/rules/alerts.yml\ngroups:\n  - name: service_alerts\n    rules:\n      # High-level service health\n      - alert: ServiceDown\n        expr: up{job=\"myapp\"} == 0\n        for: 1m\n        labels:\n          severity: critical\n        annotations:\n          summary: \"Service {{ $labels.instance }} is down\"\n          description: \"{{ $labels.job }} on {{ $labels.instance }} has been down for more than 1 minute.\"\n          runbook_url: \"https://wiki.example.com/runbooks/service-down\"\n\n      # Error rate alert\n      - alert: HighErrorRate\n        expr: |\n          sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) by (service)\n          / sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m])) by (service) > 0.05\n        for: 5m\n        labels:\n          severity: critical\n        annotations:\n          summary: \"High error rate for {{ $labels.service }}\"\n          description: \"Error rate is {{ $value | humanizePercentage }} for the last 5 minutes\"\n\n      # Latency alert (SLO-based)\n      - alert: HighLatency\n        expr: |\n          histogram_quantile(0.95, \n            sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, service)\n          ) > 0.5\n        for: 5m\n        labels:\n          severity: high\n        annotations:\n          summary: \"P95 latency above 500ms for {{ $labels.service }}\"\n```\n\n### Alertmanager Configuration\n\n```yaml\n# alertmanager.yml\nglobal:\n  resolve_timeout: 5m\n  slack_api_url: ''https://hooks.slack.com/services/xxx''\n  pagerduty_url: ''https://events.pagerduty.com/v2/enqueue''\n\ntemplates:\n  - ''/etc/alertmanager/templates/*.tmpl''\n\nroute:\n  receiver: ''default-receiver''\n  group_by: [''alertname'', ''service'']\n  group_wait: 30s\n  group_interval: 5m\n  repeat_interval: 4h\n  \n  routes:\n    # Critical alerts go to PagerDuty\n    - match:\n        severity: critical\n      receiver: ''pagerduty-critical''\n      group_wait: 0s\n      repeat_interval: 1h\n\n    # High severity during business hours\n    - match:\n        severity: high\n      receiver: ''slack-high''\n      active_time_intervals:\n        - business-hours\n\n    # Route by team\n    - match_re:\n        team: platform.*\n      receiver: ''platform-team''\n\nreceivers:\n  - name: ''default-receiver''\n    slack_configs:\n      - channel: ''#alerts''\n        send_resolved: true\n\n  - name: ''pagerduty-critical''\n    pagerduty_configs:\n      - service_key: ''xxx''\n        severity: critical\n        description: ''{{ .CommonAnnotations.summary }}''\n        details:\n          firing: ''{{ template \"pagerduty.firing\" . }}''\n\n  - name: ''slack-high''\n    slack_configs:\n      - channel: ''#alerts-high''\n        title: ''{{ .CommonAnnotations.summary }}''\n        text: ''{{ .CommonAnnotations.description }}''\n        actions:\n          - type: button\n            text: ''Runbook''\n            url: ''{{ .CommonAnnotations.runbook_url }}''\n          - type: button\n            text: ''Dashboard''\n            url: ''{{ .CommonAnnotations.dashboard_url }}''\n\n  - name: ''platform-team''\n    slack_configs:\n      - channel: ''#platform-alerts''\n\ntime_intervals:\n  - name: business-hours\n    time_intervals:\n      - weekdays: [''monday:friday'']\n        times:\n          - start_time: ''09:00''\n            end_time: ''17:00''\n\ninhibit_rules:\n  - source_match:\n      severity: critical\n    target_match:\n      severity: high\n    equal: [''service'']\n```\n\n## PagerDuty Integration\n\n### Service Configuration\n\n```yaml\n# Terraform example\nresource \"pagerduty_service\" \"myapp\" {\n  name                    = \"MyApp Production\"\n  description             = \"Production application service\"\n  escalation_policy       = pagerduty_escalation_policy.default.id\n  alert_creation          = \"create_alerts_and_incidents\"\n  auto_resolve_timeout    = 14400  # 4 hours\n  acknowledgement_timeout = 600    # 10 minutes\n\n  incident_urgency_rule {\n    type    = \"use_support_hours\"\n    \n    during_support_hours {\n      type    = \"constant\"\n      urgency = \"high\"\n    }\n    \n    outside_support_hours {\n      type    = \"constant\"\n      urgency = \"low\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"pagerduty_escalation_policy\" \"default\" {\n  name      = \"Default Escalation\"\n  num_loops = 2\n\n  rule {\n    escalation_delay_in_minutes = 10\n    target {\n      type = \"schedule_reference\"\n      id   = pagerduty_schedule.primary.id\n    }\n  }\n\n  rule {\n    escalation_delay_in_minutes = 15\n    target {\n      type = \"user_reference\"\n      id   = pagerduty_user.manager.id\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Schedule Configuration\n\n```yaml\nresource \"pagerduty_schedule\" \"primary\" {\n  name      = \"Primary On-Call\"\n  time_zone = \"America/New_York\"\n\n  layer {\n    name                         = \"Weekly Rotation\"\n    start                        = \"2024-01-01T00:00:00-05:00\"\n    rotation_virtual_start       = \"2024-01-01T00:00:00-05:00\"\n    rotation_turn_length_seconds = 604800  # 1 week\n    users                        = [for user in pagerduty_user.oncall : user.id]\n  }\n\n  # Override layer for holidays\n  layer {\n    name                         = \"Holiday Coverage\"\n    start                        = \"2024-01-01T00:00:00-05:00\"\n    rotation_virtual_start       = \"2024-01-01T00:00:00-05:00\"\n    rotation_turn_length_seconds = 86400\n    users                        = [pagerduty_user.holiday_coverage.id]\n\n    restriction {\n      type              = \"daily_restriction\"\n      start_time_of_day = \"00:00:00\"\n      duration_seconds  = 86400\n      start_day_of_week = 0  # Sunday\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Grafana OnCall\n\n### Integration Setup\n\n```yaml\n# docker-compose.yml addition\nservices:\n  oncall:\n    image: grafana/oncall\n    environment:\n      - SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key\n      - BASE_URL=http://oncall:8080\n      - GRAFANA_API_URL=http://grafana:3000\n    ports:\n      - \"8080:8080\"\n```\n\n### Escalation Chain\n\n```yaml\n# Example escalation chain structure\nescalation_chains:\n  - name: \"Production Critical\"\n    steps:\n      - step: 1\n        type: notify\n        persons:\n          - \"@oncall-primary\"\n        wait_delay: 0\n        \n      - step: 2\n        type: notify\n        persons:\n          - \"@oncall-secondary\"\n        wait_delay: 5m\n        \n      - step: 3\n        type: notify\n        persons:\n          - \"@engineering-manager\"\n        wait_delay: 10m\n        \n      - step: 4\n        type: trigger_action\n        action: \"escalate_to_incident_commander\"\n        wait_delay: 15m\n```\n\n## Alert Templates\n\n### Slack Alert Template\n\n```go\n{{ define \"slack.title\" }}\n[{{ .Status | toUpper }}{{ if eq .Status \"firing\" }}:{{ .Alerts.Firing | len }}{{ end }}] {{ .CommonLabels.alertname }}\n{{ end }}\n\n{{ define \"slack.text\" }}\n{{ range .Alerts }}\n*Alert:* {{ .Annotations.summary }}\n*Severity:* {{ .Labels.severity }}\n*Description:* {{ .Annotations.description }}\n*Runbook:* {{ .Annotations.runbook_url }}\n{{ end }}\n{{ end }}\n```\n\n### PagerDuty Details Template\n\n```go\n{{ define \"pagerduty.firing\" }}\n{{ range .Alerts.Firing }}\nAlert: {{ .Labels.alertname }}\nService: {{ .Labels.service }}\nInstance: {{ .Labels.instance }}\nValue: {{ .Annotations.value }}\nStarted: {{ .StartsAt.Format \"2006-01-02 15:04:05\" }}\n{{ end }}\n{{ end }}\n```\n\n## On-Call Best Practices\n\n### Rotation Guidelines\n\n```yaml\non_call_guidelines:\n  rotation_length: 1 week\n  handoff_time: \"10:00 AM Monday\"\n  \n  responsibilities:\n    - Monitor alerts during shift\n    - Respond within SLA (critical: 5min, high: 15min)\n    - Document incidents\n    - Handoff unresolved issues\n    \n  support:\n    - Secondary on-call for backup\n    - Clear escalation path\n    - Manager availability for major incidents\n    \n  wellness:\n    - Maximum 1 week on-call per month\n    - Comp time after high-alert periods\n    - No-interrupt recovery day after shift\n```\n\n### Runbook Template\n\n```markdown\n# Alert: High Error Rate\n\n## Summary\nError rate has exceeded the threshold of 5% for the service.\n\n## Impact\nUsers may experience errors when accessing the application.\n\n## Investigation Steps\n1. Check service logs: `kubectl logs -l app=myapp -n production`\n2. Review recent deployments: `kubectl rollout history deployment/myapp`\n3. Check database connectivity: `kubectl exec -it myapp -- nc -zv postgres 5432`\n4. Review error traces in APM dashboard\n\n## Remediation\n### If caused by recent deployment:\n```bash\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/myapp -n production\n```\n\n### If database related:\n```bash\nkubectl delete pod -l app=postgres -n production\n```\n\n## Escalation\nIf not resolved within 15 minutes, escalate to:\n- Database team: @db-oncall\n- Platform team: @platform-oncall\n```\n\n## Alert Fatigue Reduction\n\n### Strategies\n\n```yaml\nfatigue_reduction:\n  aggregate_alerts:\n    - Group related alerts\n    - Use inhibit rules\n    - Implement alert correlation\n    \n  tune_thresholds:\n    - Base on SLOs, not arbitrary values\n    - Account for normal variance\n    - Use appropriate evaluation windows\n    \n  automate_responses:\n    - Auto-remediation for known issues\n    - Self-healing infrastructure\n    - Automated scaling\n    \n  regular_review:\n    - Weekly alert review\n    - Remove unused alerts\n    - Update thresholds based on data\n```\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### Issue: Alert Storm\n**Problem**: Too many alerts firing simultaneously\n**Solution**: Implement proper grouping and inhibition rules\n\n### Issue: Missed Alerts\n**Problem**: Critical alerts not reaching on-call\n**Solution**: Test escalation policies, verify contact methods\n\n### Issue: False Positives\n**Problem**: Alerts firing without actual issues\n**Solution**: Tune thresholds, increase evaluation windows\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Define clear severity levels\n- Every alert needs a runbook\n- Test on-call notifications regularly\n- Review and tune alerts weekly\n- Implement proper escalation paths\n- Use alert grouping and inhibition\n- Track alert metrics (MTTR, frequency)\n- Practice incident response regularly\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [prometheus-grafana](../prometheus-grafana/) - Monitoring setup\n- [incident-response](../../../security/operations/incident-response/) - Incident handling\n- [runbook-automation](../../../compliance/continuity/runbook-automation/) - Runbook creation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:56:08.198Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Operations Agents requiring advanced alerting and on-call management for production systems using Prometheus, Datadog, or similar monitoring tools.","zh":"适用于需要高级警报和值班管理的运维人员，尤其是使用Prometheus、Datadog或类似监控工具的生产系统。","ja":"Prometheus、Datadogなどの監視ツールを使用する生産システム向けに、高度なアラートとオンチャーム管理が必要な運用エージェントに最適です。","ko":"프로메테우스, 데이터독 또는 유사한 모니터링 도구를 사용하는 프로덕션 시스템을 위한 고급 경고 및 온콜 관리가 필요한 운영 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Operaciones que requieren alertas avanzadas y gestión de llamadas para sistemas de producción que utilizan Prometheus, Datadog o herramientas de monitoreo similares.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''exploitation nécessitant des alertes avancées et une gestion des appels pour les systèmes de production utilisant Prometheus, Datadog ou des outils de surveillance similaires.","de":"Ideal für Operationsagenten, die erweiterte Warnungen und On-Call-Management für Produktionsysteme benötigen, die Prometheus, Datadog oder ähnliche Überwachungstools verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Operações que exigem alertas avançados e gerenciamento de chamadas para sistemas de produção que utilizam Prometheus, Datadog ou ferramentas de monitoramento semelhantes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для операционных агентов, требующих расширенных оповещений и управления вызовами для производственных систем, использующих Prometheus, Datadog или аналогичные инструменты мониторинга.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء التشغيلية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنذار متقدم وإدارة المكالمات لأنظمة الإنتاج التي تستخدم Prometheus و Datadog أو أدوات مراقبة مماثلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure effective alerting rules and thresholds, implement alert routing and escalation using PagerDuty, Opsgenie, or Grafana OnCall, and reduce alert fatigue through optimized incident response workflows over communication channels like Slack.","zh":"赋予代理配置有效的警报规则和阈值，使用PagerDuty、Opsgenie或Grafana OnCall实现警报路由和升级，并通过优化的事件响应工作流减少警报疲劳，通过Slack等通信渠道实现。","ja":"エージェントが効果的なアラートルールとしきい値を構成し、PagerDuty、Opsgenie、またはGrafana OnCallを使用してアラートルーティングとエスカレーションを実装し、Slackなどのコミュニケーションチャネルを介した最適化されたインシデントレスポンスワークフローを通じてアラート疲労を減らすことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 효과적인 경고 규칙과 임계값을 구성하고 PagerDuty, Opsgenie 또는 Grafana OnCall을 사용하여 경고 ルーティング 및 에스컬레이션을 구현하며 슬랙과 같은 커뮤니케이션 채널을 통해 최적화된 인시던트 응답 워크플로를 통해 경고 피로를 줄일 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar reglas y umbrales de alertas efectivas, implementar enrutamiento y escalación de alertas utilizando PagerDuty, Opsgenie o Grafana OnCall, y reducir la fatiga de alertas a través de flujos de trabajo de respuesta a incidentes optimizados en canales de comunicación como Slack.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer des règles et des seuils d''alerte efficaces, de mettre en œuvre un routage et une escalade d''alerte à l''aide de PagerDuty, Opsgenie ou Grafana OnCall, et de réduire la fatigue des alertes grâce à des flux de travail de réponse aux incidents optimisés sur des canaux de communication tels que Slack.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, effektive Warnregeln und -schwellen zu konfigurieren, Warnweiterleitung und -escalation mit PagerDuty, Opsgenie oder Grafana OnCall umzusetzen und Warnmüdigkeit durch optimierte Vorfallreaktionsworkflows auf Kommunikationskanälen wie Slack zu reduzieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar regras de alerta eficazes e limiares, implementar roteamento de alerta e escalonamento usando PagerDuty, Opsgenie ou Grafana OnCall e reduzir a fadiga de alerta por meio de fluxos de trabalho de resposta a incidentes otimizados em canais de comunicação como Slack.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настроить эффективные правила оповещения и пороги, реализовать маршрутизацию оповещений и эскалацию с помощью PagerDuty, Opsgenie или Grafana OnCall, а также уменьшить усталость от оповещений за счет оптимизированных рабочих процессов реагирования на инциденты через каналы связи, такие как Slack.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تكوين قواعد إنذار فعالة وعتبات، وتنفيذ маршруطة الإنذار وتعزيزها باستخدام PagerDuty و Opsgenie أو Grafana OnCall، وتقليل إجهاد الإنذار من خلال سير عمل استجابة للحوادث محسّنة عبر قنوات الاتصال مثل Slack."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring on-call rotations and schedules for development teams","Implementing alert routing and escalation protocols for critical system failures","Reducing alert fatigue through intelligent alert filtering and prioritization"],"zh":["为开发团队配置值班轮换和时间表","为关键系统故障实现警报路由和升级协议","通过智能警报过滤和优先级减少警报疲劳"],"ja":["開発チームのためのオンコールローテーションとスケジュールの構成","クリティカルシステム障害のためのアラートルーティングとエスカレーションプロトコルの実装","インテリジェントなアラートフィルタリングと優先順位付けを通じてアラート疲労の軽減"],"ko":["개발 팀을 위한 온콜 로테이션 및 스케줄 구성","임계 시스템 장애에 대한 경고 ルーティング 및 에스컬레이션 프로토콜 구현","지능형 경고 필터링 및 우선 순위를 통해 경고 피로 감소"],"es":["Configurar rotaciones y horarios de llamadas para equipos de desarrollo","Implementar protocolos de enrutamiento y escalación de alertas para fallos críticos del sistema","Reducir la fatiga de alertas a través de la filtración y priorización inteligentes de alertas"],"fr":["Configurer des rotations et des plannings d''appels pour les équipes de développement","Mettre en œuvre des protocoles de routage et d''escalade d''alerte pour les défaillances critiques du système","Réduire la fatigue des alertes grâce au filtrage et à la priorisation intelligents des alertes"],"de":["Konfiguration von On-Call-Rotationen und -Zeitplänen für Entwicklungsteams","Implementierung von Warnweiterleitungs- und -escalationsprotokollen für kritische Systemfehler","Reduzierung von Warnmüdigkeit durch intelligente Warnfilterung und -priorisierung"],"pt":["Configurando rotações e horários de chamadas para equipes de desenvolvimento","Implementando protocolos de roteamento e escalonamento de alertas para falhas críticas do sistema","Reduzindo a fadiga de alerta por meio de filtragem e priorização de alertas inteligentes"],"ru":["Настройка вращений и графиков вызовов для команд разработки","Реализация протоколов маршрутизации и эскалации оповещений для критических сбоев системы","Уменьшение усталости от оповещений за счет интеллектуальной фильтрации и приоритизации оповещений"],"ar":["تكوين دورات وجدول المكالمات لفريق التطوير","تنفيذ بروتوكولات маршруطة الإنذار وتعزيزها لعيوب النظام الحرجة","تقليل إجهاد الإنذار من خلال تصفية الإنذارات وتحديد الأولويات الذكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a monitoring system such as Prometheus or Datadog","Needs an on-call platform like PagerDuty, Opsgenie, or Grafana OnCall","Dependent on communication channels such as Slack for alert notifications"],"zh":["需要Prometheus或Datadog等监控系统","需要PagerDuty、Opsgenie或Grafana OnCall等值班平台","依赖于Slack等通信渠道进行警报通知"],"ja":["PrometheusまたはDatadogなどの監視システムが必要","PagerDuty、Opsgenie、またはGrafana OnCallなどのオンコールプラットフォームが必要","Slackなどのコミュニケーションチャネルに依存してアラート通知を行う"],"ko":["프로메테우스 또는 데이터독과 같은 모니터링 시스템이 필요","페이지더티, 옵스지니 또는 그라파나 온콜과 같은 온콜 플랫폼이 필요","슬랙과 같은 커뮤니케이션 채널에 의존하여 경고 알림을 수행"],"es":["Requiere un sistema de monitoreo como Prometheus o Datadog","Necesita una plataforma de llamadas como PagerDuty, Opsgenie o Grafana OnCall","Depende de canales de comunicación como Slack para notificaciones de alertas"],"fr":["Nécessite un système de surveillance tel que Prometheus ou Datadog","A besoin d''une plateforme d''appels telle que PagerDuty, Opsgenie ou Grafana OnCall","Dépend de canaux de communication tels que Slack pour les notifications d''alerte"],"de":["Benötigt ein Überwachungssystem wie Prometheus oder Datadog","Benötigt eine On-Call-Plattform wie PagerDuty, Opsgenie oder Grafana OnCall","Hängt von Kommunikationskanälen wie Slack für Warnbenachrichtigungen ab"],"pt":["Exige um sistema de monitoramento como Prometheus ou Datadog","Necessita de uma plataforma de chamadas como PagerDuty, Opsgenie ou Grafana OnCall","Depende de canais de comunicação como Slack para notificações de alerta"],"ru":["Требует системы мониторинга, такой как Prometheus или Datadog","Требует платформы вызовов, такой как PagerDuty, Opsgenie или Grafana OnCall","Зависит от каналов связи, таких как Slack, для уведомлений об оповещениях"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام مراقبة مثل Prometheus أو Datadog","يحتاج إلى منصة مكالمات مثل PagerDuty و Opsgenie أو Grafana OnCall","يعتمد على قنوات الاتصال مثل Slack لإشعارات الإنذار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
