,"es":"El módulo de licencias Equinox maneja licencias basadas en hardware y suscripciones con validación y período de gracia","fr":"Le module de licence Equinox gère les licences liées au matériel et les abonnements avec validation et période de grâce","de":"Das Equinox-Lizenzmodul verwaltet Hardware-basierte Lizenzen und Abonnements mit Validierung und Gnadenfrist","pt":"O módulo de licenciamento Equinox lida com licenças de hardware e validação de assinaturas. Ele oferece recursos como período de carência e migração de hardw...","ru":"Модуль лицензирования Equinox занимается лицензиями на аппаратное обеспечение и проверкой подписки. Он предлагает функции, такие как льготный период и миграц...","ar":"مكون ترخيص إيكوينوكس يتعامل مع تراخيص الأجهزة والتحقق من الاشتراك. يقدم ميزات مثل فترة السماح والهجرة للأجهزة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["硬件绑定","订阅验证","宽限期","自助硬件迁移","降级模式"],"ja":["ハードウェアバインド","サブスクリプションの検証","グレース期間","セルフサービスハードウェアの移行","ダウングレードモード"],"ko":["하드웨어 바인딩","구독 검증","宽限 기간","자가 하드웨어 마이그레이션","다운그레이드 모드"],"es":["Licencias basadas en hardware","Validación de suscripciones","Período de gracia de 7 días","Migración de hardware de autoservicio","Modo degradado de solo lectura"],"fr":["Licences liées au matériel","Validation des abonnements","Période de grâce de 7 jours","Migration de matériel en libre-service","Mode dégradé en lecture seule"],"de":["Hardware-basierte Lizenzen","Abonnement-Validierung","Gnadenfrist von 7 Tagen","Selbstbedienung-Hardware-Migration","Abgegradeter Modus mit Lesezugriff"],"pt":["Licenças de hardware vinculadas","Validação de assinaturas via Supabase","Período de carência de 7 dias","Migração de hardware autoatendida","Modo degradado (somente leitura quando expirado)"],"ru":["Лицензии на аппаратное обеспечение, привязанные к оборудованию","Проверка подписки через Supabase","Льготный период 7 дней","Самостоятельная миграция оборудования","Деградированный режим (только чтение при истечении срока)"],"ar":["تراخيص الأجهزة المرتبطة","التحقق من الاشتراك عبر سوبر بيس","فترة السماح لمدة 7 أيام","هجرة الأجهزة الذاتية","الوضع المتدهور (قراءة فقط عند الانتهاء)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["许可证管理","硬件绑定","订阅验证","软件许可证","Equinox","自助硬件迁移"],"ja":["ライセンス管理","ハードウェアバインド","サブスクリプションの検証","ソフトウェアライセンス","Equinox","セルフサービスハードウェアの移行"],"ko":["라이선스 관리","하드웨어 바인딩","구독 검증","소프트웨어 라이선스","Equinox","자가 하드웨어 마이그레이션"],"es":["licencias de software","gestión de licencias","validación de suscripciones","licencias basadas en hardware","migración de hardware","modo degradado"],"fr":["licences de logiciels","gestion de licences","validation des abonnements","licences liées au matériel","migration de matériel","mode dégradé"],"de":["Software-Lizenzen","Lizenzverwaltung","Abonnement-Validierung","Hardware-basierte Lizenzen","Hardware-Migration","abgegradeter Modus"],"pt":["licenciamento de software","gerenciamento de licenças","assinaturas de software","migração de hardware","supabase","equinox"],"ru":["лицензирование программного обеспечения","управление лицензиями","подписки на программное обеспечение","миграция оборудования","supabase","equinox"],"ar":["ترخيص البرامج","إدارة التراخيص","الاشتراكات البرمجية","هجرة الأجهزة","سوبر بيس","إيكوينوكس"]}},"owner":"ArgonautaDev","repo":"equinox","repoPath":"ArgonautaDev/equinox","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"equinox-licensing","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## Module Overview\n\nThe Licensing module handles:\n- Hardware-bound licenses (fiscal modules only)\n- Subscription validation via Supabase\n- Grace period (7 days after expiry)\n- Self-service hardware migration (2/year)\n- Degraded mode (read-only when expired)\n\n## License Types\n\n| Module Type | Hardware Lock | Validation |\n|-------------|---------------|------------|\n| Fiscal (Invoicing, Accounting) | 🔒 Required | Every 30 days |\n| Non-Fiscal (CRM, WhatsApp) | 🔓 None | Account-based |\n\n## Rust Ba","body":"## Module Overview\n\nThe Licensing module handles:\n- Hardware-bound licenses (fiscal modules only)\n- Subscription validation via Supabase\n- Grace period (7 days after expiry)\n- Self-service hardware migration (2/year)\n- Degraded mode (read-only when expired)\n\n## License Types\n\n| Module Type | Hardware Lock | Validation |\n|-------------|---------------|------------|\n| Fiscal (Invoicing, Accounting) | 🔒 Required | Every 30 days |\n| Non-Fiscal (CRM, WhatsApp) | 🔓 None | Account-based |\n\n## Rust Backend\n\n### Models\n\n```rust\n// models/license.rs\n#[derive(Debug, Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct License {\n    pub org_id: String,\n    pub tenant_id: String,\n    pub plan: Plan,\n    pub hardware_id: Option<String>,\n    pub modules: Vec<String>,\n    pub expires_at: DateTime<Utc>,\n    pub last_validated: DateTime<Utc>,\n    pub is_valid: bool,\n}\n\npub enum Plan {\n    Starter,\n    Basic,\n    Pro,\n    Enterprise,\n}\n\npub enum LicenseStatus {\n    Valid,\n    GracePeriod { days_remaining: u32 },\n    Expired,\n    InvalidHardware,\n}\n```\n\n### Hardware Fingerprint\n\n```rust\n// security/hardware_lock.rs\nuse sha2::{Sha256, Digest};\n\npub fn get_hardware_fingerprint() -> String {\n    let machine_id = machine_uid::get()\n        .unwrap_or_else(|_| \"fallback\".to_string());\n    \n    let salt = \"equinox-hw-v1\";\n    let raw = format!(\"{}{}\", machine_id, salt);\n    \n    let mut hasher = Sha256::new();\n    hasher.update(raw.as_bytes());\n    hex::encode(hasher.finalize())\n}\n\npub fn verify_hardware_lock(expected: &str) -> bool {\n    get_hardware_fingerprint() == expected\n}\n```\n\n### License Validation\n\n```rust\n// commands/licensing.rs\n#[tauri::command]\npub async fn validate_license(state: State<''_, AppState>) -> Result<LicenseStatus, String> {\n    let license = fetch_license_from_supabase(&state.org_id).await?;\n    \n    // Check hardware for fiscal modules\n    if license.modules.iter().any(is_fiscal_module) {\n        if let Some(hw_id) = &license.hardware_id {\n            if !verify_hardware_lock(hw_id) {\n                return Ok(LicenseStatus::InvalidHardware);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    let now = Utc::now();\n    let days_since_expiry = (now - license.expires_at).num_days();\n    \n    if days_since_expiry < 0 {\n        Ok(LicenseStatus::Valid)\n    } else if days_since_expiry <= 7 {\n        Ok(LicenseStatus::GracePeriod { \n            days_remaining: (7 - days_since_expiry) as u32 \n        })\n    } else {\n        Ok(LicenseStatus::Expired)\n    }\n}\n\nfn is_fiscal_module(module: &str) -> bool {\n    matches!(module, \"invoicing\" | \"accounting\" | \"fiscal_reports\")\n}\n```\n\n### Hardware Migration\n\n```rust\n#[tauri::command]\npub async fn generate_transfer_code(state: State<''_, AppState>) -> Result<String, String> {\n    // Generate 24-hour valid code\n    let code = format!(\"EQUINOX-MIGRATE-{}\", generate_random_code());\n    \n    // Store in Supabase\n    store_transfer_code(&state.tenant_id, &code, 24).await?;\n    \n    Ok(code)\n}\n\n#[tauri::command]\npub async fn apply_transfer_code(\n    state: State<''_, AppState>,\n    code: String,\n) -> Result<(), String> {\n    // Validate code\n    let transfer = get_transfer_code(&code).await?;\n    \n    if transfer.is_expired() {\n        return Err(\"Transfer code expired\".into());\n    }\n    \n    // Update hardware ID in Supabase\n    let new_hw_id = get_hardware_fingerprint();\n    update_hardware_id(&transfer.tenant_id, &new_hw_id).await?;\n    \n    // Invalidate old hardware\n    invalidate_old_hardware(&transfer.old_hardware_id).await?;\n    \n    // Delete used code\n    delete_transfer_code(&code).await?;\n    \n    Ok(())\n}\n```\n\n## Degraded Mode\n\n```rust\npub fn check_module_access(license: &License, module: &str) -> ModuleAccess {\n    match validate_license_sync(license) {\n        LicenseStatus::Valid => ModuleAccess::Full,\n        LicenseStatus::GracePeriod { .. } => {\n            // Show banner but allow full access\n            ModuleAccess::FullWithWarning\n        },\n        LicenseStatus::Expired | LicenseStatus::InvalidHardware => {\n            // Read-only mode\n            ModuleAccess::ReadOnly\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n- ✅ ALWAYS verify hardware for fiscal modules\n- ✅ ALWAYS allow 7-day grace period\n- ✅ ALWAYS allow read-only in expired state\n- ✅ ALWAYS validate on account switch\n- ❌ NEVER block access to existing data\n- ❌ NEVER allow more than 2 self-migrations/year\n- ❌ NEVER skip validation for fiscal operations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:56:32.929Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents handling subscription-based services needing automated license validation and management.","zh":"非常适合处理基于订阅的服务的 AI 代理，需要自动化的许可证验证和管理。","ja":"サブスクリプションベースのサービスで自動的なライセンスの検証と管理が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동 라이선스 검증 및 관리가 필요한 구독 기반 서비스를 처리하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que manejan servicios basados en suscripción que necesitan una validación y administración de licencias automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui gèrent des services basés sur l''abonnement nécessitant une validation et une gestion de licences automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die abonnementbasierte Dienste verwalten, die eine automatisierte Lizenzvalidierung und -verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que lidam com serviços baseados em assinatura que necessitam de validação e gerenciamento de licenças automatizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, обрабатывающих сервисы на основе подписки, требующие автоматизированной проверки и управления лицензиями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يتعاملون مع الخدمات القائمة على الاشتراك التي تحتاج إلى التحقق والتأكيد التلقائي للتراخيص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage hardware-bound licenses, validate subscriptions via Supabase, and enforce grace periods, all while providing self-service hardware migration capabilities and degraded mode functionality for expired licenses, utilizing Rust for robustness.","zh":"赋予代理管理基于硬件的许可证、通过 Supabase 验证订阅、强制实施宽限期的能力，同时提供自助硬件迁移能力和过期许可证的降级模式功能，利用 Rust 实现稳固性。","ja":"エージェントにハードウェアバウンドライセンスの管理、Supabase経由でのサブスクリプションの検証、猶予期間の適用などを可能にし、自助ハードウェア移行機能や有効期限切れのライセンスに対する機能低下モードを提供することで、Rustを使用して堅牢性を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 하드웨어 바운드 라이센스를 관리하고, Supabase를 통해 구독을驗證하며, 유예 기간을 적용할 수 있도록 하며, 동시에 자가 서비스 하드웨어 마이그레이션 기능과 만료된 라이센스의 기능 저하 모드를 제공함으로써, Rust를 사용하여 안정성을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar licencias vinculadas a hardware, validar suscripciones a través de Supabase, hacer cumplir períodos de gracia y proporcionar capacidades de migración de hardware de autoservicio y funcionalidad de modo degradado para licencias vencidas, utilizando Rust para robustez.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les licences liées au matériel, de valider les abonnements via Supabase, de faire respecter les périodes de grâce et de fournir des capacités de migration de matériel en libre-service et une fonctionnalité de mode dégradé pour les licences expirées, en utilisant Rust pour la robustesse.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hardwaregebundene Lizenzen zu verwalten, Abonnements über Supabase zu validieren, Gnadenfristen durchzusetzen und Self-Service-Hardware-Migrationsfunktionen sowie eine abgespeckte Modi-Funktionalität für abgelaufene Lizenzen bereitzustellen, wobei Rust für Robustheit verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar licenças vinculadas ao hardware, validar assinaturas via Supabase, impor períodos de carência, além de fornecer capacidades de migração de hardware de autoatendimento e funcionalidade de modo degradado para licenças expiradas, utilizando Rust para robustez.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять лицензиями, привязанными к оборудованию, проверять подписки через Supabase, обеспечивать режимы простоя, а также предоставляет возможности самообслуживания для миграции оборудования и функциональность режима ограничения для просроченных лицензий, используя Rust для повышения надежности.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة التراخيص المرتبطة بالعتاد والتحقق من الاشتراكات من خلال Supabase وتطبيق فترات السماح، بالإضافة إلى تقديم إمكانيات الهجرة الذاتية للعتاد ووظيفة الوضع المتدهور للتراخيص المنتهية الصلاحية، باستخدام Rust لتعزيز المتانة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating fiscal module licenses","Automating subscription renewals via Supabase","Enforcing read-only modes for expired licenses","Managing self-service hardware migrations"],"zh":["验证财务模块许可证","通过 Supabase 自动续订订阅","对过期许可证施加只读模式","管理自助硬件迁移"],"ja":["財務モジュールライセンスの検証","Supabase経由でのサブスクリプションの自動更新","有効期限切れのライセンスに対する読み取り専用モードの適用","自助ハードウェア移行の管理"],"ko":["재무 모듈 라이센스 검증","Supabase를 통한 구독 자동 갱신","만료된 라이센스에 대한 읽기 전용 모드 적용","자가 서비스 하드웨어 마이그레이션 관리"],"es":["Validar licencias de módulos fiscales","Automatizar renovaciones de suscripciones a través de Supabase","Hacer cumplir modos de solo lectura para licencias vencidas","Administrar migraciones de hardware de autoservicio"],"fr":["Valider les licences de modules fiscaux","Automatiser les renouvellements d''abonnement via Supabase","Faire respecter les modes lecture seule pour les licences expirées","Gérer les migrations de matériel en libre-service"],"de":["Fiskalmodul-Lizenzen überprüfen","Abonnementverlängerungen über Supabase automatisieren","Schreibschutzmodi für abgelaufene Lizenzen durchsetzen","Self-Service-Hardware-Migrationen verwalten"],"pt":["Validar licenças de módulos fiscais","Automatizar renovações de assinaturas via Supabase","Aplicar modos somente leitura para licenças expiradas","Gerenciar migrações de hardware de autoatendimento"],"ru":["Проверка лицензий фискальных модулей","Автоматизация продления подписки через Supabase","Внедрение режима только для чтения для просроченных лицензий","Управление самообслуживанием для миграции оборудования"],"ar":["التحقق من تراخيص الوحدات المالية","توفير تجديد الاشتراكات تلقائيًا من خلال Supabase","تطبيق وضع القراءة فقط للتراخيص المنتهية الصلاحية","إدارة هجرة العتاد ذاتية الخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Supabase for subscription validation","Limited to 2 self-service hardware migrations per year","Grace period limited to 7 days after expiry"],"zh":["需要 Supabase 进行订阅验证","每年仅限 2 次自助硬件迁移","宽限期仅限于过期后 7 天"],"ja":["サブスクリプションの検証にはSupabaseが必要","1年あたり自助ハードウェア移行は2回まで","猶予期間は有効期限切れ後7日間のみ"],"ko":["구독驗證을 위해 Supabase가 필요합니다","1년 동안 자가 서비스 하드웨어 마이그레이션은 2회로 제한됩니다","유예 기간은 만료 후 7일간만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere Supabase para la validación de suscripciones","Limitado a 2 migraciones de hardware de autoservicio por año","Período de gracia limitado a 7 días después de la expiración"],"fr":["Nécessite Supabase pour la validation des abonnements","Limité à 2 migrations de matériel en libre-service par an","Période de grâce limitée à 7 jours après l''expiration"],"de":["Benötigt Supabase für die Abonnementvalidierung","Begrenzt auf 2 Self-Service-Hardware-Migrationen pro Jahr","Gnadenfrist auf 7 Tage nach Ablauf beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige Supabase para validação de assinatura","Limitado a 2 migrações de hardware de autoatendimento por ano","Período de carência limitado a 7 dias após a expiração"],"ru":["Требует Supabase для проверки подписки","Ограничен до 2 самообслуживаний миграции оборудования в год","Срок действия режима простоя ограничен 7 днями после истечения срока"],"ar":["يتطلب Supabase للتحقق من الاشتراك","محدود ب兩 هجرة ذاتية للعتاد في السنة","فترة السماح محدودة ب 7 أيام بعد انتهاء الصلاحية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('KaziNizamul/SaveMyTax/appstore-readiness', 'community', 'KaziNizamul', 'SaveMyTax', 'KaziNizamul/SaveMyTax', 'appstore-readiness', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z', '2026-02-18T07:56:47.233Z', NULL, '{"id":"KaziNizamul/SaveMyTax/appstore-readiness","name":"appstore-readiness","description":{"zh":"iOS 9 .","ja":"iOS 9 .","ko":"iOS 9 .","es":"Nuestro conjunto de habilidades de preparación para la App Store ayuda a los desarrolladores a asegurarse de que sus aplicaciones cumplan con las normas de Apple","fr":"Notre ensemble de compétences de préparation pour l''App Store aide les développeurs à s''assurer que leurs applications respectent les normes d''Apple","de":"Unser Satz von Fähigkeiten für die App Store-Bereitschaft hilft Entwicklern, sicherzustellen, dass ihre Apps die Apple-Standards erfüllen","pt":"A prontidão para a App Store é um conjunto de habilidades que ajudam os desenvolvedores a garantir a aprovação da App Store.","ru":"Готовность к App Store - это набор навыков, которые помогают разработчикам гарантировать одобрение App Store.","ar":"استعداد متجر التطبيقات هو مجموعة من المهارات التي تساعد المطورين على ضمان موافقة متجر التطبيقات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"iOS ","ja":"iOS","ko":"iOS ","es":"Preparación para la App Store","fr":"Préparation pour l''App Store","de":"App Store Bereitschaft","pt":"Prontidão para a App Store","ru":"Готовность к App Store","ar":"استعداد متجر التطبيقات","en":"appstore-readiness"},"description":{"zh":"iOS 9 .","ja":"iOS 9 .","ko":"iOS 9 .","es":"Nuestro conjunto de habilidades de preparación para la App Store ayuda a los desarrolladores a asegurarse de que sus aplicaciones cumplan con las normas de A...","fr":"Notre ensemble de compétences de préparation pour l''App Store aide les développeurs à s''assurer que leurs applications respectent les normes d''Apple","de":"Unser Satz von Fähigkeiten für die App Store-Bereitschaft hilft Entwicklern, sicherzustellen, dass ihre Apps die Apple-Standards erfüllen","pt":"A prontidão para a App Store é um conjunto de habilidades que ajudam os desenvolvedores a garantir a aprovação da App Store.","ru":"Готовность к App Store - это набор навыков, которые помогают разработчикам гарантировать одобрение App Store.","ar":"استعداد متجر التطبيقات هو مجموعة من المهارات التي تساعد المطورين على ضمان موافقة متجر التطبيقات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["9 ","UI/UX","ATT","HIG","API","SDK"],"ja":["9 ","UI/UX","ATT","HIG","API","SDK"],"ko":["9 ","UI/UX","ATT","HIG","API","SDK"],"es":["Revisión de cumplimiento","Análisis de diseño","Privacidad y seguridad","Preparación para la aprobación","Cumplimiento con las normas de Apple","Optimización para la App Store"],"fr":["Révision de conformité","Analyse de conception","Confidentialité et sécurité","Préparation pour l''approbation","Respect des normes d''Apple","Optimisation pour l''App Store"],"de":["Überprüfung der Konformität","Designanalyse","Datenschutz und Sicherheit","Vorbereitung auf die Genehmigung","Einhaltung der Apple-Standards","Optimierung für den App Store"],"pt":["Avaliação de conformidade","Revisão de design","Privacidade e segurança","Otimização para aprovação","Análise de desempenho","Suporte à publicação"],"ru":["Оценка соответствия","Проверка дизайна","Конфиденциальность и безопасность","Оптимизация для одобрения","Анализ производительности","Поддержка публикации"],"ar":["تقييم الامتثال","مراجعة التصميم","الخصوصية والأمان","تحسين للموافقة","تحليل الأداء","دعم النشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iOS","App Store","UI/UX","HIG","ATT","API","SDK","iOS "],"ja":["iOS","App Store","UI/UX","HIG","ATT","API","SDK","iOS "],"ko":["iOS","App Store","UI/UX","HIG","ATT","API","SDK","iOS "],"es":["preparación para la App Store","cumplimiento de Apple","diseño de aplicaciones","privacidad y seguridad","aprobación de aplicaciones","optimización para la App Store","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","normas de Apple"],"fr":["préparation pour l''App Store","conformité d''Apple","conception d''applications","confidentialité et sécurité","approbation d''applications","optimisation pour l''App Store","développement d''applications mobiles","normes d''Apple"],"de":["App Store-Bereitschaft","Apple-Konformität","App-Design","Datenschutz und Sicherheit","App-Genehmigung","Optimierung für den App Store","Mobile-App-Entwicklung","Apple-Standards"],"pt":["App Store","prontidão para a App Store","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","conformidade","design","privacidade","segurança","otimização"],"ru":["App Store","Готовность к App Store","Разработка приложений","Соответствие","Дизайн","Конфиденциальность","Безопасность","Оптимизация"],"ar":["متجر التطبيقات","استعداد متجر التطبيقات","تطوير التطبيقات","الامتثال","التصميم","الخصوصية","الأمان","تحسين"]}},"owner":"KaziNizamul","repo":"SaveMyTax","repoPath":"KaziNizamul/SaveMyTax","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"appstore-readiness","description":"Expert iOS App Store submission and approval system. 9 specialized agents providing senior App Review Team-level expertise across compliance, design, privacy, monetization, metadata, technical requirements, timing, rejection recovery, and learning. Triggers on keywords like app store, iOS submission, apple review, app rejection, aso, privacy manifest, privacy labels, ATT, iap, in-app purchase, subscription, storekit, review guidelines, HIG, testflight, app store connect.","bodyPreview":"# iOS App Store Readiness Skill\n\nNine specialized agents for achieving first-submission App Store approval.\n\n## Agent Roster\n\n| Agent | Role | Expertise Level | When to Invoke |\n|-------|------|-----------------|----------------|\n| **Reviewer** | Compliance Auditor | Senior App Review | \"Will this pass?\", pre-submission audit |\n| **Designer** | HIG Expert | Apple Design Evangelist | UI/UX review, design patterns |\n| **Privacy** | Data Guardian | Privacy Compliance Specialist | ATT, labels, manif","body":"# iOS App Store Readiness Skill\n\nNine specialized agents for achieving first-submission App Store approval.\n\n## Agent Roster\n\n| Agent | Role | Expertise Level | When to Invoke |\n|-------|------|-----------------|----------------|\n| **Reviewer** | Compliance Auditor | Senior App Review | \"Will this pass?\", pre-submission audit |\n| **Designer** | HIG Expert | Apple Design Evangelist | UI/UX review, design patterns |\n| **Privacy** | Data Guardian | Privacy Compliance Specialist | ATT, labels, manifests, policies |\n| **Commerce** | IAP Strategist | App Store Business Expert | Payments, subscriptions, commissions |\n| **Metadata** | ASO Specialist | App Store Optimization | Screenshots, descriptions, keywords |\n| **Technical** | Build Engineer | iOS Build & Performance | SDK, crashes, performance |\n| **Sentinel** | Deadline Tracker | Review Timeline Expert | Submission timing, review status |\n| **Fixer** | Rejection Recovery | Appeals Specialist | Rejection responses, communication |\n| **Mentor** | Teaching Partner | Experienced iOS Publisher | Learning, explanations, context |\n\n## Quick Dispatch\n\n```\nreviewer: audit my app for compliance\ndesigner: check my UI against HIG\nprivacy: review my data collection and privacy manifest\ncommerce: is my IAP implementation correct?\nmetadata: optimize my app store listing\ntechnical: verify my build meets requirements\nsentinel: when should I submit?\nfixer: we got rejected, help me respond\nmentor: explain why Apple requires X\n```\n\n---\n\n## REVIEWER — Compliance Auditor\n\n**Expertise:** Former App Review Team member with 10+ years reviewing apps across all categories\n\n**Purpose:** Audit apps against ALL App Store Review Guidelines before submission. Think like a reviewer. Catch rejection triggers before Apple does.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **Systematic Section Check:**\n   - Section 1: Safety (objectionable content, UGC, kids, physical harm)\n   - Section 2: Performance (completeness, metadata, compatibility)\n   - Section 3: Business (payments, monetization, spam)\n   - Section 4: Design (copycats, minimum functionality, extensions)\n   - Section 5: Legal (privacy, IP, gambling)\n\n2. **Flag Specific Guidelines:**\n   - Always cite the exact guideline number (e.g., \"Guideline 2.3.7\")\n   - Explain what the guideline requires\n   - Show how the app violates or complies\n\n3. **Rejection Probability Assessment:**\n   - 🔴 **HIGH RISK** — Almost certain rejection, must fix\n   - 🟡 **MEDIUM RISK** — Likely rejection, strongly recommend fix\n   - 🟢 **LOW RISK** — Minor concern, consider addressing\n   - ✅ **CLEAR** — Compliant, no issues detected\n\n4. **Generate Pre-Submission Report:**\n   ```\n   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   │        PRE-SUBMISSION AUDIT REPORT      │\n   ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n   │ App: [Name]                             │\n   │ Date: [Date]                            │\n   │ Overall Risk: [HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/CLEAR]   │\n   ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n   │ BLOCKING ISSUES (Must Fix)              │\n   │ • [Issue] — Guideline X.X.X             │\n   ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n   │ WARNINGS (Should Fix)                   │\n   │ • [Issue] — Guideline X.X.X             │\n   ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n   │ RECOMMENDATIONS                         │\n   │ • [Suggestion]                          │\n   └─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   ```\n\n5. **Think Like a Reviewer:**\n   - Does the app do what it claims?\n   - Is everything functional during first launch?\n   - Are there any hidden features?\n   - Does the metadata match the app?\n   - Is there anything that \"feels off\"?\n\n### Key Knowledge\n\n**Most Scrutinized Areas:**\n- Privacy compliance (Section 5.1)\n- Payment system usage (Section 3.1)\n- User-generated content moderation (Section 1.2)\n- Kids category compliance (Section 1.3)\n- Minimum functionality (Section 4.2)\n\n**Gray Area Navigation:**\n- When metadata is \"misleading\" vs \"marketing\"\n- What constitutes \"minimum functionality\"\n- When external links are acceptable\n- What counts as \"user-generated content\"\n\n**Review Process Insights:**\n- Reviewers test on real devices\n- They follow user flows completely\n- They check edge cases (no internet, interrupted flows)\n- They compare metadata to actual functionality\n- They look for undocumented features\n\n### Tone\n\nThorough examiner. Finds what others miss. Never approves lightly, but fair and specific about issues. Provides exact fix paths.\n\n---\n\n## DESIGNER — HIG Expert\n\n**Expertise:** Apple Design Evangelist, WWDC presenter level, 15+ years iOS design\n\n**Purpose:** Ensure app follows Human Interface Guidelines for iOS. Catch design patterns that \"feel wrong\" to Apple''s design philosophy.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **Platform Alignment Check:**\n   - Does it feel like an iOS app?\n   - Does it use standard iOS patterns appropriately?\n   - Does it leverage platform capabilities?\n\n2. **Navigation Review:**\n   - Tab bar usage (2-5 tabs, not for actions)\n   - Navigation bar patterns\n   - Modal presentation appropriateness\n   - Gesture navigation support\n\n3. **Control Assessment:**\n   - Touch targets (minimum 44pt × 44pt)\n   - Button styling consistency\n   - Form input patterns\n   - Picker and date selector usage\n\n4. **Typography & Color:**\n   - Dynamic Type support\n   - System font usage vs custom fonts\n   - Color contrast ratios\n   - Dark Mode support\n\n5. **Accessibility Compliance:**\n   - VoiceOver support\n   - Reduce Motion support\n   - Color blindness considerations\n   - Focus management\n\n### Key HIG Principles\n\n**iOS Design Philosophy:**\n- **Clarity** — Text is legible, icons precise, adornments subtle\n- **Deference** — UI helps people understand content, never competes\n- **Depth** — Visual layers and motion impart hierarchy\n\n**Common HIG Violations:**\n- Using tab bar for actions (should be toolbar)\n- Non-standard back button behavior\n- Buttons without clear tap states\n- Missing Dynamic Type support\n- Poor Dark Mode implementation\n- Touch targets under 44pt\n\n**Device-Specific Considerations:**\n- Safe areas and notch handling\n- Home indicator area respect\n- Keyboard handling\n- Orientation support\n\n### Tone\n\nDesign mentor. Explains the \"why\" behind HIG requirements. Specific about fixes. Never just says \"this is wrong\"—shows the right pattern.\n\n---\n\n## PRIVACY — Data Guardian\n\n**Expertise:** Privacy Compliance Specialist, GDPR/CCPA certified, deep knowledge of Apple''s privacy requirements\n\n**Purpose:** Ensure full privacy compliance—the #1 rejection reason. Audit data collection, verify privacy manifests, and validate privacy nutrition labels.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **Data Collection Audit:**\n   - What data is collected?\n   - Why is each piece collected?\n   - How long is it retained?\n   - Who has access?\n   - How can users delete it?\n\n2. **Privacy Manifest Verification:**\n   - All data types declared?\n   - Required reason APIs justified?\n   - Third-party SDK manifests included?\n   - Signatures present?\n\n3. **ATT Assessment:**\n   - Is tracking occurring?\n   - Is ATT prompt required?\n   - Is implementation correct?\n   - Is user choice respected?\n\n4. **Privacy Nutrition Labels:**\n   - Labels match actual collection?\n   - All categories covered?\n   - Linked to user correctly marked?\n   - Used to track correctly marked?\n\n5. **Privacy Policy Review:**\n   - Comprehensive coverage?\n   - Plain language?\n   - Contact information?\n   - Deletion instructions?\n\n### When ATT is Required\n\n**REQUIRED:**\n- Targeted ads based on data from other companies\n- Sharing location/email with data brokers\n- Sharing identifiers with ad networks for retargeting\n- SDKs that combine user data across apps\n\n**NOT REQUIRED:**\n- Data linked only on-device (never sent off device)\n- Data broker used solely for fraud detection\n- Consumer reporting for credit purposes\n- First-party analytics without cross-site linking\n\n### Privacy Manifest Requirements\n\n**Mandatory since May 2024:**\n```\nPrivacyInfo.xcprivacy must declare:\n- NSPrivacyTracking (true/false)\n- NSPrivacyTrackingDomains (array of domains)\n- NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes (all data collected)\n- NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes (required reason APIs)\n```\n\n**Required Reason APIs:**\n- File timestamp APIs\n- System boot time APIs\n- Disk space APIs\n- User defaults APIs\n- Active keyboard APIs\n\n### Privacy Nutrition Label Categories\n\n| Category | Examples |\n|----------|----------|\n| Contact Info | Name, email, phone, address |\n| Health & Fitness | Health, fitness data |\n| Financial Info | Payment info, credit score |\n| Location | Precise, coarse location |\n| Sensitive Info | Racial data, sexual orientation |\n| Contacts | Address book |\n| User Content | Photos, videos, audio, messages |\n| Browsing History | Web history |\n| Search History | Search queries |\n| Identifiers | User ID, device ID, IDFA |\n| Purchases | Purchase history |\n| Usage Data | Product interaction, advertising data |\n| Diagnostics | Crash data, performance data |\n\n### Tone\n\nVigilant guardian. Catches privacy issues others miss. Explains the \"why\" behind requirements. Never compromises on user privacy.\n\n---\n\n## COMMERCE — IAP Strategist\n\n**Expertise:** App Store Business Expert, subscription monetization specialist, 500+ apps launched\n\n**Purpose:** Navigate Apple''s payment rules correctly. Determine when IAP is required, verify implementation, optimize commission.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **IAP Requirement Assessment:**\n   - What is being sold?\n   - Where is it consumed?\n   - Who is the buyer?\n   - Does an exception apply?\n\n2. **Implementation Review:**\n   - Correct IAP type used?\n   - StoreKit integration proper?\n   - Receipt validation implemented?\n   - Restore purchases available?\n\n3. **Subscription Compliance:**\n   - Sign-up screen requirements met?\n   - Price prominently displayed?\n   - Cancellation easy to find?\n   - Free trial clearly explained?\n\n4. **Commission Optimization:**\n   - Small Business Program eligible?\n   - Subscriber retention for 15% rate?\n   - Alternative payment eligible?\n\n### When IAP is REQUIRED\n\n**Must use IAP for:**\n- Premium content\n- Subscriptions to digital content\n- Game currencies\n- Additional game levels\n- \"Full\" versions of apps\n- Unlocking features/functionality\n- Ad removal\n- Social media boosts\n\n### When IAP is NOT Required\n\n**Exceptions (Guideline 3.1.3):**\n\n| Exception | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| **(a) Reader Apps** | Magazines, newspapers, books, audio, music, video (previously purchased) |\n| **(b) Multiplatform** | Content purchased on other platforms |\n| **(c) Enterprise** | B2B apps for organizations |\n| **(d) Person-to-Person** | Real-time 1:1 services (tutoring, consultations) |\n| **(e) Physical Goods** | Consumed outside the app |\n| **(f) Free Companions** | To paid web-based tools |\n| **(g) Ad Management** | For managing ad campaigns |\n\n### Commission Structure\n\n| Scenario | Apple | Developer |\n|----------|-------|-----------|\n| Standard rate | 30% | 70% |\n| After 1 year subscriber | 15% | 85% |\n| Small Business Program | 15% | 85% |\n\n**Small Business Program:**\n- <$1M revenue in prior year\n- Must apply annually\n- Resets if exceed $1M\n\n### Subscription Sign-Up Requirements\n\n**Must display:**\n- Subscription name and duration\n- Content/services provided\n- **Full renewal price (MOST PROMINENT)**\n- Localized pricing\n- Restore purchases option\n- Terms of Service link\n- Privacy Policy link\n\n**Free Trial Requirements:**\n- Clearly state trial duration\n- Show price billed when trial ends\n- Cannot mislead about automatic billing\n\n### Tone\n\nStrategic advisor. Finds the compliant path that also optimizes revenue. Never suggests rule violations. Explains the business logic.\n\n---\n\n## METADATA — ASO Specialist\n\n**Expertise:** App Store Optimization expert, 500+ successful launches, SEO/ASO certified\n\n**Purpose:** Optimize App Store presence while staying compliant. Make the listing as effective as possible within the rules.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **App Name Review:**\n   - Under 30 characters?\n   - Unique and distinctive?\n   - No trademarked terms?\n   - No keyword stuffing?\n\n2. **Screenshot Audit:**\n   - Show app in use?\n   - Correct sizes for all devices?\n   - Not misleading?\n   - Professional quality?\n\n3. **Description Optimization:**\n   - Clear value proposition?\n   - Features explained?\n   - No unverifiable claims?\n   - Links included (ToS, Privacy)?\n\n4. **Keyword Strategy:**\n   - Relevant to app?\n   - No competitor names?\n   - No trademarked terms?\n   - Optimized for search?\n\n5. **What''s New:**\n   - Describes changes?\n   - Not marketing copy?\n   - Useful to users?\n\n### Screenshot Specifications\n\n**iPhone Required Sizes:**\n\n| Display | Devices | Portrait | Landscape |\n|---------|---------|----------|-----------|\n| 6.9\" | iPhone 17/16 Pro Max, 16 Plus, 15 Pro Max, 15 Plus | 1320×2868 / 1290×2796 | 2868×1320 / 2796×1290 |\n| 6.5\" | iPhone 14 Plus, 13/12/11 Pro Max | 1284×2778 / 1242×2688 | 2778×1284 / 2688×1242 |\n| 6.3\"/6.1\" | iPhone 17/16/15/14 Pro, 16/15/14 | 1206×2622 / 1179×2556 | 2622×1206 / 2556×1179 |\n\n**Requirements:**\n- 1-10 screenshots per device size\n- Formats: .jpeg, .jpg, .png\n- Must show app in use (not splash screens, login pages)\n\n### Metadata Rules\n\n**App Name (Guideline 2.3.7):**\n- Maximum 30 characters\n- No keyword stuffing\n- No trademarked terms without rights\n- No price information\n- No references to other platforms\n\n**App Subtitle:**\n- Additional context only\n- No inappropriate content\n- No other app references\n- No unverifiable claims\n\n**Description:**\n- Accurate representation\n- No competitor mentions\n- No unverifiable claims\n- Include ToS and Privacy links\n\n**Keywords:**\n- Accurately describe app\n- No competitor names\n- No trademarked terms\n- No offensive content\n\n### Age Rating (Guideline 2.3.6)\n\n**Answer honestly:**\n- Cartoon/fantasy violence\n- Realistic violence\n- Sexual content\n- Profanity\n- Drug/alcohol references\n- Horror themes\n- Gambling simulation\n- User-generated content\n\n### Tone\n\nOptimization expert. Finds every legitimate advantage. Never suggests misleading tactics. Balances discoverability with compliance.\n\n---\n\n## TECHNICAL — Build Engineer\n\n**Expertise:** iOS Build & Performance specialist, knows Xcode intimately, 10+ years platform experience\n\n**Purpose:** Ensure technical requirements are met. Verify SDK compliance, performance standards, and stability.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **SDK Version Check:**\n   - Built with Xcode 16+?\n   - Using iOS 18 SDK?\n   - Privacy manifest included?\n   - Third-party SDKs compliant?\n\n2. **Device Compatibility:**\n   - iPhone support declared correctly?\n   - iPad support if applicable?\n   - Minimum iOS version appropriate?\n   - Device capabilities required?\n\n3. **Performance Review:**\n   - Launch time acceptable?\n   - Memory usage reasonable?\n   - Battery impact minimal?\n   - No excessive heat generation?\n\n4. **Stability Audit:**\n   - Crash reports reviewed?\n   - Edge cases tested?\n   - Network failure handling?\n   - Offline functionality?\n\n5. **Privacy Manifest Technical:**\n   - PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy exists?\n   - All required reason APIs declared?\n   - Third-party SDK signatures?\n   - Tracking domains listed?\n\n### Current Requirements (December 2025)\n\n**SDK Requirements:**\n- Xcode 16 or later\n- iOS 18 / iPadOS 18 / tvOS 18 / visionOS 2 / watchOS 11 SDK\n- Apps submitted after April 2025 must meet this\n\n**Privacy Manifest:**\n- Mandatory since May 2024\n- Must declare all data types\n- Must justify required reason APIs\n- Third-party SDKs must have manifests and signatures\n\n### Performance Standards\n\n**Prohibited:**\n- Cryptocurrency mining on device\n- Rapid battery drain\n- Excessive heat generation\n- Excessive write cycles\n- Unrelated background processes\n\n**Required:**\n- Reasonable launch time (<5 seconds warm launch)\n- Responsive UI (no frozen frames)\n- Proper memory management\n- Graceful degradation on older devices\n\n### Device Compatibility\n\n**iPhone Apps on iPad:**\n- Should run on iPad whenever possible\n- Declare compatibility correctly\n- Test on iPad if supported\n\n**Universal Apps:**\n- Provide appropriate UI for each platform\n- Use size classes correctly\n- Support all orientations when appropriate\n\n### Third-Party SDK Compliance\n\n**Required:**\n- SDKs must have privacy manifests\n- SDKs must be signed\n- Check Apple''s list of SDKs requiring manifests\n- Verify SDKs are updated\n\n### Tone\n\nTechnical expert. Precise about requirements. Knows exactly what Xcode version, what SDK, what settings. Never vague about technical specs.\n\n---\n\n## SENTINEL — Deadline Tracker\n\n**Expertise:** Review timeline expert, submission strategist, knows Apple''s calendar\n\n**Purpose:** Plan submission timing and track review status. Optimize for fastest approval.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **Review Time Estimation:**\n   - First submission vs update?\n   - App complexity?\n   - Time of year?\n   - Category?\n\n2. **Submission Timing:**\n   - Avoid holiday freezes\n   - Account for weekends\n   - Plan for rejection possibility\n   - Buffer before hard deadlines\n\n3. **Status Tracking:**\n   - Monitor App Store Connect\n   - Interpret status messages\n   - Predict next steps\n   - Alert on changes\n\n4. **Expedited Review:**\n   - Eligible scenarios\n   - How to request\n   - Success likelihood\n   - Alternative strategies\n\n### Typical Review Times\n\n| Scenario | Typical Time |\n|----------|--------------|\n| First submission | 24-48 hours |\n| App updates | 24 hours |\n| Simple apps | 24 hours |\n| Complex apps | Up to 7 days |\n| Games | 24-72 hours |\n| Kids category | 48-72 hours |\n\n### Holiday Submission Freeze\n\n**Apple''s annual freeze:**\n- December 23-27 (typically)\n- No new submissions processed\n- Updates may be delayed\n- Plan accordingly for holiday releases\n\n### Expedited Review Eligibility\n\n**Valid reasons:**\n- Critical bug fix affecting users\n- Time-sensitive event (conference, launch)\n- Security vulnerability\n- Legal/regulatory requirement\n\n**How to request:**\n- App Store Connect → Contact Us → Expedite App Review\n- Provide clear justification\n- Not guaranteed to be approved\n\n### App Store Connect Statuses\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| Waiting for Review | In queue, not yet assigned |\n| In Review | Actively being reviewed |\n| Pending Developer Release | Approved, waiting for you to release |\n| Ready for Sale | Live on App Store |\n| Rejected | Failed review, action needed |\n| Metadata Rejected | Only metadata needs fixes |\n\n### Tone\n\nStrategic planner. Always thinking ahead. Helps avoid last-minute scrambles. Tracks everything precisely.\n\n---\n\n## FIXER — Rejection Recovery\n\n**Expertise:** Appeals specialist, successful rejection resolution, knows Resolution Center inside out\n\n**Purpose:** Handle rejections and communicate with App Review. Turn rejections into approvals efficiently.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **Rejection Analysis:**\n   - What exactly was cited?\n   - Which guideline number?\n   - Is this correct?\n   - What''s the fastest fix?\n\n2. **Response Strategy:**\n   - Fix and resubmit, or\n   - Appeal the decision, or\n   - Request clarification\n\n3. **Draft Communication:**\n   - Clear and professional\n   - Address specific concerns\n   - Explain changes made\n   - Request guidance if unclear\n\n4. **Document for Prevention:**\n   - What caused this?\n   - How to prevent next time?\n   - Update checklists\n\n### Rejection Types\n\n**Binary Rejection:**\n- App fails review completely\n- Must fix and resubmit\n- Most common type\n\n**Metadata Rejection:**\n- Only metadata issues\n- Can fix without new build\n- Faster to resolve\n\n### When to Appeal vs Fix\n\n**APPEAL when:**\n- You believe the rejection is incorrect\n- The guideline doesn''t apply\n- You have documentation supporting compliance\n- The reviewer may have misunderstood\n\n**FIX AND RESUBMIT when:**\n- The rejection is valid\n- The fix is straightforward\n- Faster than arguing\n\n### Effective Communication\n\n**DO:**\n- Be professional and polite\n- Reference specific guideline numbers\n- Explain exactly what you changed\n- Provide additional context if helpful\n- Ask clarifying questions if confused\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Be argumentative\n- Blame the reviewer\n- Repeat the same submission without changes\n- Ignore the stated reason\n- Submit multiple appeals for same issue\n\n### Resolution Center Tips\n\n- Respond promptly (within 24-48 hours ideal)\n- Use the app notes for additional context\n- Provide demo accounts with full access\n- Include screenshots/videos if helpful\n- Be specific about what was changed\n\n### Common Rejection Fixes\n\n| Rejection Reason | Typical Fix |\n|------------------|-------------|\n| Privacy violation | Update privacy manifest, labels |\n| Crashes | Fix bug, test thoroughly |\n| Metadata mismatch | Update screenshots/description |\n| Missing demo account | Provide working credentials |\n| IAP issues | Correct StoreKit implementation |\n| UGC without moderation | Add filtering/reporting/blocking |\n\n### Tone\n\nProblem solver. Stays calm under pressure. Finds the fastest path to approval. Never adversarial with Apple.\n\n---\n\n## MENTOR — Teaching Partner\n\n**Expertise:** Experienced iOS publisher, 100+ apps shipped, educator\n\n**Purpose:** Build App Store publishing proficiency. Help users understand not just what, but why.\n\n### Behavior Protocol\n\n1. **Meet Them Where They Are:**\n   - Assess current knowledge\n   - Don''t assume expertise\n   - Build from foundations\n\n2. **Explain in Context:**\n   - Connect to their specific app\n   - Use real examples\n   - Make it practical\n\n3. **Progressive Learning:**\n   - Foundation → intermediate → advanced\n   - Don''t overwhelm\n   - Build systematically\n\n4. **Why, Not Just What:**\n   - Why does Apple care?\n   - What''s the history?\n   - What problem does it solve?\n\n### Teaching Topics\n\n**Level 1: Foundations**\n- [ ] What the App Store Review Guidelines are\n- [ ] How the review process works\n- [ ] Basic metadata requirements\n- [ ] Privacy fundamentals\n- [ ] TestFlight vs production\n\n**Level 2: Operations**\n- [ ] Complete metadata optimization\n- [ ] Privacy manifest creation\n- [ ] IAP implementation\n- [ ] Subscription setup\n- [ ] Screenshot creation\n\n**Level 3: Optimization**\n- [ ] ASO strategies\n- [ ] A/B testing listings\n- [ ] Commission optimization\n- [ ] Review time optimization\n- [ ] Multi-region strategies\n\n**Level 4: Mastery**\n- [ ] Edge case navigation\n- [ ] Appeal strategies\n- [ ] Enterprise considerations\n- [ ] Platform expansion (visionOS, watchOS)\n- [ ] Pre-launch optimization\n\n### Common Questions Explained\n\n**\"Why does Apple require IAP for digital goods?\"**\nApple built the platform, maintains the App Store, handles payments, and provides developer tools. The 30%/15% commission funds this ecosystem. It also provides user trust—purchases are secure, refundable, and consistent across apps.\n\n**\"Why are privacy manifests required?\"**\nApple positions itself as privacy-first. Privacy manifests ensure transparency about data collection. They help Apple verify privacy nutrition label accuracy and prevent hidden data practices.\n\n**\"Why is the review process so strict?\"**\nApple curates the App Store to maintain user trust. Unlike open platforms, users expect every app to be safe, functional, and honest. Strict review protects this trust.\n\n### Tone\n\nPatient guide. Celebrates questions. Never condescending. Remembers what it was like to not know. Makes complex approachable.\n\n---\n\n## ID8Pipeline Integration\n\n### Stage 9: Launch Prep — HARD GATE\n\nBefore advancing to Stage 10 (Ship), the following must pass:\n\n**Required Checkpoints:**\n```\n[ ] REVIEWER: Full compliance audit — no HIGH RISK issues\n[ ] DESIGNER: HIG compliance verified — no blocking violations\n[ ] PRIVACY: Privacy audit passed — manifest complete, labels accurate\n[ ] COMMERCE: IAP implementation correct (if applicable)\n[ ] METADATA: App Store listing validated — all specs met\n[ ] TECHNICAL: Build requirements met — SDK/Xcode current\n```\n\n**Checkpoint Question:**\n\"Have all App Store readiness checks passed? Can you confirm no blocking issues exist?\"\n\n**If blocked:**\n- List blocking issues with guideline numbers\n- Provide fix paths for each\n- Cannot proceed until resolved\n\n### Stage 10: Ship — Submission Support\n\n**Pre-Submission:**\n- SENTINEL determines optimal timing\n- Final checklist verification\n- Submission executed\n\n**During Review:**\n- SENTINEL monitors status\n- Prepare for possible rejection\n\n**If Rejected:**\n- FIXER analyzes rejection\n- Drafts response\n- Guides resubmission\n\n**If Approved:**\n- METADATA can optimize based on performance\n- Document lessons learned\n\n---\n\n## Reference Files\n\nDetailed expertise in `references/`:\n\n| File | Contents |\n|------|----------|\n| `app-store-review-guidelines.md` | Complete 5-section guideline breakdown |\n| `human-interface-guidelines.md` | iOS HIG essentials and patterns |\n| `privacy-requirements.md` | ATT, labels, manifests, policies |\n| `in-app-purchase-rules.md` | When IAP required, implementation |\n| `subscription-guidelines.md` | Auto-renewable subscription rules |\n| `screenshot-metadata-specs.md` | Screenshot sizes, metadata rules |\n| `common-rejection-reasons.md` | Top rejections and prevention |\n| `technical-requirements.md` | SDK, performance, compatibility |\n| `pre-submission-checklist.md` | Final readiness checklist |\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Review Guidelines | https://developer.apple.com/app-store/review/guidelines/ |\n| Human Interface Guidelines | https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/ |\n| App Store Connect | https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/ |\n| Screenshot Specs | https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/reference/app-information/screenshot-specifications/ |\n| Privacy Manifests | https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy-manifest-files |\n| In-App Purchase | https://developer.apple.com/in-app-purchase/ |\n| Subscriptions | https://developer.apple.com/app-store/subscriptions/ |\n| User Privacy | https://developer.apple.com/app-store/user-privacy-and-data-use/ |\n| Third-Party SDK Requirements | https://developer.apple.com/support/third-party-SDK-requirements/ |\n\n---\n\n*This skill is maintained for iOS App Store compliance. Guidelines change—always verify against current Apple documentation.*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:56:47.233Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code needing specialized expertise for iOS App Store approval and compliance","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要专门的专业知识来获得iOS App Store的批准和合规","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。これらは、iOS App Storeの承認とコンプライアンスのための専門知識が必要です","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 iOS App Store의 승인 및 준수에 필요한 전문 지식이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code que necesitan experiencia especializada para la aprobación y cumplimiento de la App Store de iOS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code nécessitant une expertise spécialisée pour l''approbation et la conformité de l''App Store d''iOS","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die spezielle Fachkenntnisse für die Zulassung und Konformität mit dem iOS App Store benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code que necessitam de especialização para aprovação e conformidade na App Store do iOS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, требующих специализированной экспертизы для утверждения и соответствия требованиям App Store для iOS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code التي تحتاج إلىخبرة متخصصة لموافقة وتوافق متجر التطبيقات الخاص بهاتف iOS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure App Store readiness by auditing compliance, reviewing UI/UX design patterns, and verifying privacy compliance, including ATT and data labels, to guarantee first-submission approval, leveraging expertise in Apple''s Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) and App Store Review Guidelines","zh":"赋予代理人审计合规性、审查UI/UX设计模式、验证隐私合规性（包括ATT和数据标签）的能力，以保证首次提交的批准，利用苹果的人机界面指南（HIG）和App Store审查指南的专业知识","ja":"エージェントに、コンプライアンスを監査し、UI/UXデザインパターンをレビューし、プライバシーコンプライアンス（包括ATTとデータラベル）を検証する能力を与え、最初の提出での承認を保証します。AppleのHuman Interface Guidelines（HIG）とApp Storeレビューガイドラインの専門知識を活用します","ko":"에이전트에게 앱 스토어 준비를 보장하기 위해 컴플라이언스를 감사하고, UI/UX 디자인 패턴을 검토하고, 개인 정보 보호 컴플라이언스(包括 ATT 및 데이터 라벨)를 검증하여 첫 번째 제출 승인을 보장하는 능력을 부여합니다. 애플의 휴먼 인터페이스 가이드라인(HIG) 및 앱 스토어 리뷰 가이드라인의 전문 지식을 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar la preparación para la App Store mediante la auditoría de cumplimiento, la revisión de patrones de diseño de UI/UX y la verificación del cumplimiento de la privacidad, incluidos ATT y etiquetas de datos, para garantizar la aprobación en la primera presentación, aprovechando la experiencia en las Pautas de interfaz humana de Apple (HIG) y las Pautas de revisión de la App Store","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir la préparation de l''App Store en auditant la conformité, en examinant les modèles de conception UI/UX et en vérifiant la conformité à la confidentialité, y compris ATT et les étiquettes de données, pour garantir l''approbation lors de la première soumission, en exploitant l''expertise dans les Lignes directrices d''interface humaine d''Apple (HIG) et les Lignes directrices d''examen de l''App Store","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die App-Store-Bereitschaft durch Auditierung der Konformität, Überprüfung von UI/UX-Designmustern und Überprüfung der Datenschutzkonformität, einschließlich ATT und Datenschilder, zu gewährleisten, um die Zulassung bei der ersten Einreichung sicherzustellen, indem es die Fachkenntnisse in Apples Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) und App-Store-Überprüfungsrichtlinien nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a preparação para a App Store, auditando a conformidade, revisando padrões de design de UI/UX e verificando a conformidade com a privacidade, incluindo ATT e rótulos de dados, para garantir a aprovação na primeira submissão, utilizando a especialização nas Diretrizes de Interface Humana da Apple (HIG) e nas Diretrizes de Revisão da App Store","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить готовность приложения к публикации в App Store, проводя аудит соответствия требованиям, пересматривая шаблоны дизайна UI/UX и проверяя соответствие требованиям конфиденциальности, включая ATT и метки данных, для гарантирования утверждения при первом представлении, используя экспертизу в Руководстве по интерфейсу человека Apple (HIG) и Руководстве по проверке App Store","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من ضمان جاهزية متجر التطبيقات عن طريق التدقيق في التوافق ومراجعة أنماط تصميم UI/UX وتحقق متطلبات الخصوصية، بما في ذلك ATT وملصقات البيانات، لضمان الموافقة عند الإرسال الأول، مستفيداً من الخبرة في إرشادات واجهة المستخدم البشري من شركة آبل (HIG) وإرشادات مراجعة متجر التطبيقات"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing apps for compliance with App Store Review Guidelines","Reviewing and refining UI/UX design to meet Apple''s HIG standards","Ensuring privacy compliance, including App Tracking Transparency (ATT) and data label requirements"],"zh":["审核应用程序是否符合App Store审查指南的合规性","审查和完善UI/UX设计以满足苹果的HIG标准","确保隐私合规性，包括应用程序跟踪透明度（ATT）和数据标签要求"],"ja":["App Storeレビューガイドラインのコンプライアンスに従ったアプリの監査","UI/UXデザインのレビューと精緻化をして、AppleのHIG標準を満たす","プライバシーコンプライアンスの確保、包括App Tracking Transparency（ATT）とデータラベル要件"],"ko":["앱 스토어 리뷰 가이드라인의 컴플라이언스에 따라 앱을 감사하는 것","UI/UX 디자인을 검토하고 정제하여 애플의 HIG 표준을 충족하는 것","개인 정보 보호 컴플라이언스를 확보하는 것, 포함 앱 트래킹 투명성(ATT) 및 데이터 라벨 요구 사항"],"es":["Auditoría de aplicaciones para el cumplimiento de las Pautas de revisión de la App Store","Revisión y perfeccionamiento del diseño de UI/UX para cumplir con los estándares de la HIG de Apple","Garantizar el cumplimiento de la privacidad, incluidos los requisitos de transparencia de seguimiento de aplicaciones (ATT) y de etiquetas de datos"],"fr":["Audit des applications pour la conformité aux Lignes directrices d''examen de l''App Store","Examen et affinement de la conception UI/UX pour répondre aux normes de la HIG d''Apple","Assurer la conformité à la confidentialité, y compris les exigences de transparence du suivi des applications (ATT) et d''étiquettes de données"],"de":["Auditing von Apps für die Konformität mit den App-Store-Überprüfungsrichtlinien","Überprüfung und Verfeinerung des UI/UX-Designs, um den HIG-Standards von Apple zu entsprechen","Gewährleistung der Datenschutzkonformität, einschließlich der Anforderungen an die Transparenz von App-Tracking (ATT) und an Datenschilder"],"pt":["Auditoria de aplicativos para conformidade com as Diretrizes de Revisão da App Store","Revisão e aperfeiçoamento do design de UI/UX para atender aos padrões da HIG da Apple","Garantia da conformidade com a privacidade, incluindo requisitos de transparência de rastreamento de aplicativos (ATT) e rótulos de dados"],"ru":["Проведение аудита приложений на соответствие Руководству по проверке App Store","Пересмотр и усовершенствование дизайна UI/UX для соответствия стандартам HIG от Apple","Обеспечение соответствия требованиям конфиденциальности, включая требования прозрачности отслеживания приложений (ATT) и меток данных"],"ar":["تدقيق التطبيقات للامتثال لإرشادات مراجعة متجر التطبيقات","مراجعة وتحسين تصميم UI/UX لملاءمة معايير HIG لشركة آبل","ضمان الامتثال لمتطلبات الخصوصية، بما في ذلك متطلبات شفافية تتبع التطبيقات (ATT) وملصقات البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Apple''s App Store Review process and guidelines","Specific to iOS app development and submission","May require additional expertise for complex or niche app categories"],"zh":["需要了解苹果的App Store审查流程和指南","仅适用于iOS应用开发和提交","可能需要额外的专业知识来处理复杂或细分的应用类别"],"ja":["AppleのApp Storeレビュープロセスとガイドラインの知識が必要","iOSアプリ開発と提出のみに特化","複雑またはニッチなアプリカテゴリの場合、追加の専門知識が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["애플의 앱 스토어 리뷰 프로세스 및 가이드라인에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","iOS 앱 개발 및 제출에만 특화되어 있습니다","복잡하거나 니치한 앱 카테고리의 경우 추가적인 전문 지식이 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del proceso de revisión de la App Store de Apple y de las pautas","Específico para el desarrollo y la presentación de aplicaciones de iOS","Puede requerir experiencia adicional para categorías de aplicaciones complejas o de nicho"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du processus d''examen de l''App Store d''Apple et des lignes directrices","Spécifique au développement et à la soumission d''applications iOS","Peut nécessiter une expertise supplémentaire pour des catégories d''applications complexes ou de niche"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des App-Store-Überprüfungsprozesses und der Richtlinien von Apple","Spezifisch für die Entwicklung und Einreichung von iOS-Apps","Kann zusätzliche Fachkenntnisse für komplexe oder Nischen-App-Kategorien erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do processo de revisão da App Store e das diretrizes da Apple","Específico para desenvolvimento e envio de aplicativos para iOS","Pode exigir especialização adicional para categorias de aplicativos complexas ou de nicho"],"ru":["Требует знания процесса проверки App Store и руководств Apple","Спецефичен для разработки и отправки приложений для iOS","Может требует дополнительной специализации для сложных или нишевых категорий приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة عملية مراجعة متجر التطبيقات وإرشادات شركة آبل","محدد لتطوير وإرسال تطبيقات iOS","يمكن أن يتطلب خبرة إضافية لمجموعات تطبيقات معقدة أو محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ymsjl/page-scaffold-builder/pro-components-guide', 'community', 'ymsjl', 'page-scaffold-builder', 'ymsjl/page-scaffold-builder', 'pro-components-guide', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z', '2026-02-18T07:57:15.950Z', NULL, '{"id":"ymsjl/page-scaffold-builder/pro-components-guide","name":"pro-components-guide","description":{"zh":"ProComponents 是一个用于构建后台页面的组件库，提供了布局、表格、表单等组件。我们的文档和指南将帮助您快速上手使用 ProComponents。","ja":"ProComponents は、後台ページを構築するためのコンポーネントライブラリです。レイアウト、テーブル、フォームなど、さまざまなコンポーネントを提供します。ドキュメントとガイドを参照して、ProComponents を使用してみましょう!","ko":"ProComponents는 후배 페이지를构築하는 데 도움이 되는 컴포넌트 라이브러리입니다. 레이아웃, 테이블, 폼 등 다양한 컴포넌트를 제공합니다. 문서와 가이드를 참조하여 ProComponents를 사용해 보세요!","es":"La guía de componentes Pro ofrece documentación y recursos para diseñar y construir páginas de administración con Ant Design.","fr":"Le guide des composants Pro propose une documentation et des ressources pour concevoir et construire des pages d''administration avec Ant Design.","de":"Der Leitfaden für Pro-Komponenten bietet Dokumentation und Ressourcen, um administrative Seiten mit Ant Design zu entwerfen und zu erstellen.","pt":"O guia de componentes Pro fornece documentação e recursos para construir interfaces de usuário avançadas com Ant Design Pro","ru":"Руководство по компонентам Pro предоставляет документацию и ресурсы для создания продвинутых интерфейсов пользователя с помощью Ant Design Pro","ar":"يدل دليل المكونات المحترفة على توثيق وموارد لبناء واجهات مستخدم متقدمة باستخدام Ant Design Pro","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ProComponents 指南和文档","ja":"ProComponents ガイドとドキュメント","ko":"ProComponents 가이드 및 문서","es":"Guía de Componentes Pro: Diseño y Documentación","fr":"Guide des Composants Pro: Conception et Documentation","de":"Pro-Komponenten-Anleitung: Design und Dokumentation","pt":"Guia de Componentes Pro: Construa Interfaces de Usuário A...","ru":"Руководство по компонентам Pro: Создание продвинутых инте...","ar":"دليل المكونات المحترفة: بناء واجهات مستخدم متقدمة","en":"pro-components-guide"},"description":{"zh":"ProComponents 是一个用于构建后台页面的组件库，提供了布局、表格、表单等组件。我们的文档和指南将帮助您快速上手使用 ProComponents。","ja":"ProComponents は、後台ページを構築するためのコンポーネントライブラリです。レイアウト、テーブル、フォームなど、さまざまなコンポーネントを提供します。ドキュメントとガイドを参照して、ProComponents を使用してみましょう!","ko":"ProComponents는 후배 페이지를构築하는 데 도움이 되는 컴포넌트 라이브러리입니다. 레이아웃, 테이블, 폼 등 다양한 컴포넌트를 제공합니다. 문서와 가이드를 참조하여 ProComponents를 사용해 보세요!","es":"La guía de componentes Pro ofrece documentación y recursos para diseñar y construir páginas de administración con Ant Design.","fr":"Le guide des composants Pro propose une documentation et des ressources pour concevoir et construire des pages d''administration avec Ant Design.","de":"Der Leitfaden für Pro-Komponenten bietet Dokumentation und Ressourcen, um administrative Seiten mit Ant Design zu entwerfen und zu erstellen.","pt":"O guia de componentes Pro fornece documentação e recursos para construir interfaces de usuário avançadas com Ant Design Pro","ru":"Руководство по компонентам Pro предоставляет документацию и ресурсы для создания продвинутых интерфейсов пользователя с помощью Ant Design Pro","ar":"يدل دليل المكونات المحترفة على توثيق وموارد لبناء واجهات مستخدم متقدمة باستخدام Ant Design Pro","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["布局组件（ProLayout）","表格组件（ProTable）","表单组件（ProForm）","页面容器（PageContainer）","底部工具栏（FooterToolbar）"],"ja":["レイアウトコンポーネント（ProLayout）","テーブルコンポーネント（ProTable）","フォームコンポーネント（ProForm）","ページコンテナ（PageContainer）","フッターツールバー（FooterToolbar）"],"ko":["레이아웃 컴포넌트（ProLayout）","테이블 컴포넌트（ProTable）","폼 컴포넌트（ProForm）","페이지 컨테이너（PageContainer）","푸터 툴바（FooterToolbar）"],"es":["Diseño de layout con ProLayout","Creación de contenedores de página con PageContainer","Herramientas de navegación y búsqueda","Personalización de componentes","Compatibilidad con dispositivos móviles"],"fr":["Conception de mise en page avec ProLayout","Création de conteneurs de page avec PageContainer","Outils de navigation et de recherche","Personnalisation de composants","Compatibilité avec les appareils mobiles"],"de":["Layout-Design mit ProLayout","Erstellung von Seitencontainern mit PageContainer","Navigations- und Suchtools","Anpassung von Komponenten","Kompatibilität mit mobilen Geräten"],"pt":["Layouts personalizados com ProLayout","Contêiner de página padrão com PageContainer","Barra de ferramentas fixa com FooterToolbar","Suporte a breadcrumbs e títulos","Configuração de colunas e linhas"],"ru":["Индивидуальные макеты с помощью ProLayout","Стандартный контейнер страницы с PageContainer","Фиксированная панель инструментов с FooterToolbar","Поддержка breadcrumbs и заголовков","Настройка столбцов и строк"],"ar":["تخطيطات مخصصة باستخدام ProLayout","حاويات صفحة معيارية باستخدام PageContainer","شريط أدوات مثبت مع FooterToolbar","دعم الفهرس والعناوين","تكوين الأعمدة والصفوف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ProComponents","后台页面构建","组件库","布局组件","表格组件","表单组件","页面容器","底部工具栏"],"ja":["ProComponents","後台ページ構築","コンポーネントライブラリ","レイアウトコンポーネント","テーブルコンポーネント","フォームコンポーネント","ページコンテナ","フッターツールバー"],"ko":["ProComponents","후배 페이지构築","컴포넌트 라이브러리","레이아웃 컴포넌트","테이블 컴포넌트","폼 컴포넌트","페이지 컨테이너","푸터 툴바"],"es":["componentes Pro","Ant Design","diseño de administración","construcción de páginas","layout","navegación","búsqueda","personalización"],"fr":["composants Pro","Ant Design","conception d''administration","construction de pages","mise en page","navigation","recherche","personnalisation"],"de":["Pro-Komponenten","Ant Design","Administrationsdesign","Seitenbau","Layout","Navigation","Suche","Anpassung"],"pt":["componentes Pro","Ant Design Pro","layouts personalizados","experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","ProLayout","PageContainer","FooterToolbar"],"ru":["компоненты Pro","Ant Design Pro","индивидуальные макеты","пользовательский опыт","разработка приложений","ProLayout","PageContainer","FooterToolbar"],"ar":["المكونات المحترفة","Ant Design Pro","تخطيطات مخصصة","تجربة المستخدم","تطوير التطبيقات","ProLayout","PageContainer","FooterToolbar"]}},"owner":"ymsjl","repo":"page-scaffold-builder","repoPath":"ymsjl/page-scaffold-builder","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pro-components-guide","description":"包含 Ant Design Pro Components (ProComponents) 的组件列表、适用场景及官方文档链接。用于辅助代码生成和参数查询。","bodyPreview":"# ProComponents Guide & Documentation\n\n当用户询问 Ant Design Pro 组件、构建后台页面或需要查找具体组件参数时，请参考以下目录。\n**关键指令**：如果需要编写详细代码且不确定某个 Props（如 `request` 的返回值格式、`columns` 的具体配置），请使用浏览工具（Browsing Tool）读取对应的 URL。\n\n## 1. Layout 布局组件\n**核心组件**: `ProLayout`\n- **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/layout](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/layout)\n- **包含**:\n    - `ProLayout`: 解决侧边栏、顶部导航、面包屑等全局布局。\n    - `PageContainer`: 页面的标准容器，自动生成面包屑和标题。\n    - `FooterToolbar`: 底部固定工具栏。\n    - `WaterMar","body":"# ProComponents Guide & Documentation\n\n当用户询问 Ant Design Pro 组件、构建后台页面或需要查找具体组件参数时，请参考以下目录。\n**关键指令**：如果需要编写详细代码且不确定某个 Props（如 `request` 的返回值格式、`columns` 的具体配置），请使用浏览工具（Browsing Tool）读取对应的 URL。\n\n## 1. Layout 布局组件\n**核心组件**: `ProLayout`\n- **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/layout](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/layout)\n- **包含**:\n    - `ProLayout`: 解决侧边栏、顶部导航、面包屑等全局布局。\n    - `PageContainer`: 页面的标准容器，自动生成面包屑和标题。\n    - `FooterToolbar`: 底部固定工具栏。\n    - `WaterMark`: 水印组件。\n\n## 2. Table 表格与列表\n**核心组件**: `ProTable`\n- **ProTable (超级表格)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/table](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/table)\n    - **用途**: 包含查询表单、工具栏、表格体的全功能表格，CRUD 标配。\n- **EditableProTable (可编辑表格)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/editable-table](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/editable-table)\n    - **用途**: 行内编辑、实时保存。\n- **DragSortTable (拖拽排序)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/drag-sort-table](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/drag-sort-table)\n- **ProList (高级列表)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/list](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/list)\n    - **用途**: 卡片列表、文章列表，支持展开、选择。\n\n## 3. Form 表单组件\n**核心组件**: `ProForm`\n- **通用表单 (ProForm, ModalForm, DrawerForm, StepsForm)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/form](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/form)\n    - **用途**:\n        - `ProForm`: 标准页面表单。\n        - `ModalForm`: 弹窗表单。\n        - `DrawerForm`: 抽屉表单。\n        - `StepsForm`: 分步表单。\n        - `LoginForm`: 登录页专用。\n- **SchemaForm (JSON配置表单)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/schema-form](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/schema-form)\n- **QueryFilter (筛选表单)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/query-filter](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/query-filter)\n\n## 4. Data Display 数据展示\n- **ProCard (高级卡片)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/card](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/card)\n    - **用途**: 页面切分、分栏布局、栅格布局。\n- **ProDescriptions (定义列表)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/descriptions](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/descriptions)\n    - **用途**: 详情页展示，支持 `columns` 定义。\n- **StatisticCard (指标卡)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/statistic-card](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/statistic-card)\n\n## 5. Other 其他\n- **ProSkeleton (骨架屏)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/skeleton](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/skeleton)\n- **ProField (原子组件)**:\n    - **文档链接**: [https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/field](https://pro-components.antdigital.dev/components/field)\n    - **用途**: 根据 valueType 渲染只读/编辑模式的原子组件。\n\n## 最佳实践提醒\n1. **Request 模式**: ProTable 和 ProForm 推荐使用 `request` 属性配合 `async` 函数来接管数据加载，而不是手动管理 loading 和 data state。详情请查阅 ProTable 文档中的 `request` 部分。\n2. **ValueType**: 善用 `valueType` (''money'', ''date'', ''select'' 等) 来自动格式化显示和表单项，减少手写 render 代码。"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:57:15.950Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Ant Design Pro component integration and layout customization.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Ant Design Pro 组件集成和布局自定义的前端代理。","ja":"Ant Design Pro コンポーネントの高度な統合とレイアウトのカスタマイズが必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Ant Design Pro 컴포넌트 통합 및 레이아웃 사용자 지정이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una integración avanzada de componentes de Ant Design Pro y personalización de diseño.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée de composants Ant Design Pro et de personnalisation de mise en page.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration von Ant Design Pro-Komponenten und eine Anpassung der Layouts benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração avançada de componentes do Ant Design Pro e personalização de layout.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция компонентов Ant Design Pro и настройка макета.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متقدم لمكونات Ant Design Pro وتخصيص التصميم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate complex layouts using ProLayout, PageContainer, and FooterToolbar components, while leveraging Ant Design Pro''s documentation and browsing tools for seamless integration with protocols like URL and libraries like Ant Design.","zh":"赋予代理生成复杂布局的能力，使用 ProLayout、PageContainer 和 FooterToolbar 组件，同时利用 Ant Design Pro 的文档和浏览工具实现与 URL 和 Ant Design 等协议及库的无缝集成。","ja":"ProLayout、PageContainer、FooterToolbar コンポーネントを使用して複雑なレイアウトを生成し、Ant Design Pro のドキュメントとブラウジング ツールを利用して URL や Ant Design などのプロトコルやライブラリとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"ProLayout, PageContainer 및 FooterToolbar 컴포넌트를 사용하여 복잡한 레이아웃을 생성하고 Ant Design Pro의 문서 및 브라우징 도구를 활용하여 URL 및 Ant Design와 같은 프로토콜 및 라이브러리와의 무결점 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar diseños complejos utilizando los componentes ProLayout, PageContainer y FooterToolbar, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha la documentación y las herramientas de navegación de Ant Design Pro para una integración sin problemas con protocolos como URL y bibliotecas como Ant Design.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des mises en page complexes en utilisant les composants ProLayout, PageContainer et FooterToolbar, tout en exploitant la documentation et les outils de navigation d''Ant Design Pro pour une intégration transparente avec des protocoles comme URL et des bibliothèques comme Ant Design.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Layouts mit den Komponenten ProLayout, PageContainer und FooterToolbar zu generieren, während sie gleichzeitig die Dokumentation und die Navigationswerkzeuge von Ant Design Pro nutzen, um eine nahtlose Integration mit Protokollen wie URL und Bibliotheken wie Ant Design zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar layouts complexos usando os componentes ProLayout, PageContainer e FooterToolbar, aproveitando a documentação e as ferramentas de navegação do Ant Design Pro para integração sem problemas com protocolos como URL e bibliotecas como Ant Design.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать сложные макеты с помощью компонентов ProLayout, PageContainer и FooterToolbar, используя документацию и инструменты навигации Ant Design Pro для беспрепятственной интеграции с протоколами типа URL и библиотеками типа Ant Design.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من生成 تخطيطات معقدة باستخدام مكونات ProLayout و PageContainer و FooterToolbar ، مستفيدًا من توثيق أدوات المتصفح من Ant Design Pro للاندماج السلس مع بروتوكولات مثل URL ومكتبات مثل Ant Design."},"useCases":{"en":["Customizing ProLayout for unique sidebar and top navigation configurations","Generating standardized page containers with PageContainer","Debugging component props using browsing tools for inspecting URL returns and column configurations"],"zh":["为唯一的侧边栏和顶部导航配置自定义 ProLayout","使用 PageContainer 生成标准化的页面容器","使用浏览工具调试组件属性，检查 URL 返回和列配置"],"ja":["独自のサイドバーとトップナビゲーションの構成用に ProLayout をカスタマイズする","PageContainer を使用して標準化されたページ コンテナーを生成する","ブラウジング ツールを使用してコンポーネントのプロパティをデバッグし、URL の戻り値と列の構成を確認する"],"ko":["고유한 사이드바 및 상단 탐색 구성에 대한 ProLayout 사용자 지정","PageContainer를 사용하여 표준화된 페이지 컨테이너 생성","브라우징 도구를 사용하여 컴포넌트 속성 디버깅 및 URL 반환 및 열 구성 확인"],"es":["Personalizar ProLayout para configuraciones únicas de barra lateral y navegación superior","Generar contenedores de página estandarizados con PageContainer","Depurar las propiedades de los componentes usando herramientas de navegación para inspeccionar los resultados de URL y las configuraciones de columnas"],"fr":["Personnaliser ProLayout pour des configurations de barre latérale et de navigation supérieure uniques","Générer des conteneurs de page standardisés avec PageContainer","Déboguer les propriétés des composants en utilisant des outils de navigation pour inspecter les résultats de l''URL et les configurations de colonnes"],"de":["ProLayout für einzigartige Konfigurationen von Seitenleisten und oberer Navigation anpassen","Standardisierte Seitencontainer mit PageContainer generieren","Komponenteneigenschaften mithilfe von Navigationswerkzeugen zur Inspektion von URL-Rückgaben und Spaltenkonfigurationen debuggen"],"pt":["Personalizar o ProLayout para configurações de barra lateral e navegação superior únicas","Gerar contêineres de páginas padronizados com PageContainer","Depurar props de componentes usando ferramentas de navegação para inspecionar retornos de URL e configurações de coluna"],"ru":["Настроить ProLayout для уникальных конфигураций боковой панели и верхней навигации","Генерировать стандартизированные контейнеры страниц с помощью PageContainer","Отладить свойства компонентов, используя инструменты навигации для инспекции возвращаемых значений URL и конфигураций столбцов"],"ar":["تخصيص ProLayout لتكوينات شريط جانبي وتنقل أعلى فريدة","توليد حاويات صفحة معيارية باستخدام PageContainer","تصحيح أخطاء مكونات باستخدام أدوات المتصفح لاستكشاف إرجاع URL وتكوينات العمود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ant Design Pro components and documentation access","Specific to Ant Design Pro ecosystem","Needs understanding of component props like ''request'' and ''columns''"],"zh":["需要 Ant Design Pro 组件和文档访问权限","仅限于 Ant Design Pro 生态系统","需要了解 ''request'' 和 ''columns'' 等组件属性"],"ja":["Ant Design Pro コンポーネントとドキュメントのアクセスが必要","Ant Design Pro エコシステムに限定される","''request'' や ''columns'' などのコンポーネント プロパティの理解が必要"],"ko":["Ant Design Pro 컴포넌트 및 문서 액세스가 필요함","Ant Design Pro 생태계에만 국한됨","''request'' 및 ''columns''와 같은 컴포넌트 속성에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a componentes y documentación de Ant Design Pro","Específico del ecosistema de Ant Design Pro","Necesita comprensión de propiedades de componentes como ''solicitud'' y ''columnas''"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux composants et à la documentation d''Ant Design Pro","Spécifique à l''écosystème d''Ant Design Pro","Nécessite une compréhension des propriétés des composants comme ''demande'' et ''colonnes''"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Ant Design Pro-Komponenten und -Dokumentation","Spezifisch für das Ant Design Pro-Ökosystem","Benötigt Verständnis von Komponenteneigenschaften wie ''Anfrage'' und ''Spalten''"],"pt":["Requer acesso a componentes e documentação do Ant Design Pro","Específico para o ecossistema do Ant Design Pro","Necessita de compreensão de props de componentes como ''request'' e ''columns''"],"ru":["Требует доступа к компонентам и документации Ant Design Pro","Спецефичен для экосистемы Ant Design Pro","Требует понимания свойств компонентов, таких как ''request'' и ''columns''"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مكونات وتوثيق Ant Design Pro","محدد لمنظومة Ant Design Pro","يحتاج إلى فهم مكونات مثل ''request'' و ''columns''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents/build-check', 'community', 'ShouxinZhang', 'agent-multiSubAgents', 'ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents', 'build-check', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z', '2026-02-18T07:57:50.517Z', NULL, '{"id":"ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents/build-check","name":"build-check","description":{"zh":"构建检查规范是一种自动化代码测试方法，确保代码质量和稳定性。通过执行默认命令和补充测试，记录测试结果到开发日志中","ja":"ビルドチェック規約は、コードの品質と安定性を確保する自動テスト方法です。デフォルトコマンドと追加テストを実行し、テスト結果を開発ログに記録します","ko":"빌드 체크 규약은 코드 품질과 안정성을 보장하는 자동화 테스트 방법입니다. 기본 명령어와 추가 테스트를 실행하고, 테스트 결과를 개발 로그에 기록합니다","es":"Build Check es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a verificar y mejorar la calidad de su código mediante scripts de bash y pruebas de npm.","fr":"Build Check est un outil qui aide les développeurs à vérifier et améliorer la qualité de leur code à l''aide de scripts bash et de tests npm.","de":"Build Check ist ein Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, die Qualität ihres Codes mit Bash-Skripten und npm-Tests zu überprüfen und zu verbessern.","pt":"O build-check é uma ferramenta que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do código, executando testes e verificando erros","ru":"Build-check - это инструмент, который помогает обеспечить качество кода, выполняя тесты и проверяя ошибки","ar":"build-check هو أداة تساعد في ضمان جودة الشفرة من خلال تشغيل الاختبارات وफحص الأخطاء","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"构建检查规范 - 自动化代码测试","ja":"ビルドチェック規約 - 自動コードテスト","ko":"빌드 체크 규약 - 자동화 코드 테스트","es":"Build Check: Herramienta de verificación de código","fr":"Build Check : Outil de vérification de code","de":"Build Check: Code-Überprüfungstool","pt":"Verifique o Código com build-check","ru":"Проверьте код с помощью build-check","ar":"تحقق من الشفرة باستخدام build-check","en":"build-check"},"description":{"zh":"构建检查规范是一种自动化代码测试方法，确保代码质量和稳定性。通过执行默认命令和补充测试，记录测试结果到开发日志中","ja":"ビルドチェック規約は、コードの品質と安定性を確保する自動テスト方法です。デフォルトコマンドと追加テストを実行し、テスト結果を開発ログに記録します","ko":"빌드 체크 규약은 코드 품질과 안정성을 보장하는 자동화 테스트 방법입니다. 기본 명령어와 추가 테스트를 실행하고, 테스트 결과를 개발 로그에 기록합니다","es":"Build Check es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a verificar y mejorar la calidad de su código mediante scripts de bash y pruebas de npm.","fr":"Build Check est un outil qui aide les développeurs à vérifier et améliorer la qualité de leur code à l''aide de scripts bash et de tests npm.","de":"Build Check ist ein Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, die Qualität ihres Codes mit Bash-Skripten und npm-Tests zu überprüfen und zu verbessern.","pt":"O build-check é uma ferramenta que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do código, executando testes e verificando erros","ru":"Build-check - это инструмент, который помогает обеспечить качество кода, выполняя тесты и проверяя ошибки","ar":"build-check هو أداة تساعد في ضمان جودة الشفرة من خلال تشغيل الاختبارات وफحص الأخطاء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码测试","默认命令和补充测试","测试结果记录到开发日志","确保代码质量和稳定性","提升开发效率"],"ja":["自動コードテスト","デフォルトコマンドと追加テスト","テスト結果を開発ログに記録","コード品質と安定性を確保","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["자동화 코드 테스트","기본 명령어와 추가 테스트","테스트 결과를 개발 로그에 기록","코드 품질과 안정성을 보장","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Ejecución de scripts de bash para verificar errores","Ejecución de pruebas de npm para garantizar la calidad del código","Registro de resultados en el log de desarrollo","Requisito de ejecución después de cada cambio de código","Requisito de reparación y reejecución en caso de fallo"],"fr":["Exécution de scripts bash pour vérifier les erreurs","Exécution de tests npm pour garantir la qualité du code","Enregistrement des résultats dans le journal de développement","Exigence d''exécution après chaque modification de code","Exigence de réparation et de réexécution en cas d''échec"],"de":["Ausführung von Bash-Skripten zur Fehlerüberprüfung","Ausführung von npm-Tests zur Qualitätsgarantie des Codes","Aufzeichnung der Ergebnisse im Entwicklungslog","Erfordernis der Ausführung nach jedem Code-Änderung","Erfordernis der Reparatur und Wiederholung bei Fehlschlag"],"pt":["Executa testes automatizados","Verifica erros no código","Registra resultados em log de desenvolvimento","Fornece relatórios detalhados","Integração com scripts de teste"],"ru":["Выполняет автоматические тесты","Проверяет ошибки в коде","Записывает результаты в журнал разработки","Предоставляет подробные отчеты","Интеграция со скриптами тестирования"],"ar":["يقوم بتشغيل الاختبارات الآلية","يبحث عن الأخطاء في الشفرة","يسجل النتائج في سجل التطوير","يقدم تقارير مفصلة","التكامل مع스크рипتات الاختبار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["构建检查规范","自动化代码测试","代码质量","稳定性","开发效率","自动化测试","开发日志"],"ja":["ビルドチェック規約","自動コードテスト","コード品質","安定性","開発効率","自動テスト","開発ログ"],"ko":["빌드 체크 규약","자동화 코드 테스트","코드 품질","안정성","개발 효율성","자동 테스트","개발 로그"],"es":["build check","verificación de código","calidad del código","pruebas de npm","scripts de bash","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["build check","vérification de code","qualité du code","tests npm","scripts bash","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["build check","code-überprüfung","code-qualität","npm-tests","bash-skripte","software-entwicklung","entwicklertools"],"pt":["build-check","verificação de código","testes automatizados","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["build-check","проверка кода","автоматические тесты","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["build-check","فحص الشفرة","الاختبارات الآلية","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الشفرة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ShouxinZhang","repo":"agent-multiSubAgents","repoPath":"ShouxinZhang/agent-multiSubAgents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"build-check","description":"代码构建全链路质量门禁。代码改动后必须执行。","bodyPreview":"# 构建检查规范（通用版）\n\n## 默认命令\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/check_errors.sh\n```\n\n## 补充测试\n\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n\n## 执行要求\n\n1. 每次代码改动后执行。\n2. 如失败，修复并重跑，直至全部通过。\n3. 将结果记录到 dev log。","body":"# 构建检查规范（通用版）\n\n## 默认命令\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/check_errors.sh\n```\n\n## 补充测试\n\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n\n## 执行要求\n\n1. 每次代码改动后执行。\n2. 如失败，修复并重跑，直至全部通过。\n3. 将结果记录到 dev log。\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:57:50.517Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated code validation and error checking using bash scripts and npm tests.","zh":"适合需要使用bash脚本和npm测试进行自动化代码验证和错误检查的开发代理。","ja":"bashスクリプトとnpmテストを使用して自動化されたコードの検証とエラーチェックが必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"bash 스크립트와 npm 테스트를 사용하여 자동화된 코드 검증과 오류 확인이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren validación de código automatizada y verificación de errores utilizando scripts de bash y pruebas de npm.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une validation de code automatisée et une vérification d''erreurs à l''aide de scripts bash et de tests npm.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Code-Validierung und Fehlerüberprüfung mit Bash-Skripten und npm-Tests benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem validação de código automatizada e verificação de erros usando scripts bash e testes npm.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированной проверки кода и обнаружения ошибок с помощью скриптов bash и тестов npm.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب التحقق التلقائي من الشفرة وตรวจ الأخطاء باستخدام نصوص باش واختبارات npm."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute build checks using scripts like `check_errors.sh` and `npm test`, ensuring code integrity and reliability by enforcing consistent execution requirements and dev log recording.","zh":"赋予代理执行构建检查的能力，使用诸如`check_errors.sh`和`npm test`的脚本，通过强制一致的执行要求和开发日志记录来确保代码的完整性和可靠性。","ja":"エージェントにビルドの確認を実行する能力を付与し、`check_errors.sh`や`npm test`などのスクリプトを使用して、コードの完全性と信頼性を一貫した実行要件と開発ログの記録によって確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 `check_errors.sh`와 `npm test` 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 빌드 확인을 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 코드의 무결성과 신뢰성을 일관된 실행 요구사항과 개발 로그 기록을 통해 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar controles de compilación utilizando scripts como `check_errors.sh` y `npm test`, asegurando la integridad y confiabilidad del código al aplicar requisitos de ejecución consistentes y grabación de registros de desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des contrôles de construction à l''aide de scripts tels que `check_errors.sh` et `npm test`, garantissant l''intégrité et la fiabilité du code en appliquant des exigences d''exécution cohérentes et enregistrant les journaux de développement.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Build-Checks mit Skripten wie `check_errors.sh` und `npm test` auszuführen, um die Integrität und Zuverlässigkeit des Codes sicherzustellen, indem konsistente Ausführungsanforderungen durchgesetzt und Entwicklungsprotokolle aufgezeichnet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar verificações de compilação usando scripts como `check_errors.sh` e `npm test`, garantindo a integridade e confiabilidade do código, aplicando requisitos de execução consistentes e gravação de logs de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять проверки сборки с помощью скриптов типа `check_errors.sh` и `npm test`, обеспечивая целостность и надежность кода путем обеспечения последовательных требований к выполнению и записи журналов разработки.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تشغيل فحص البناء باستخدام نصوص مثل `check_errors.sh` و `npm test` ، مما يضمن سلامة الشفرة وموثوقيتها من خلال تطبيق متطلبات التنفيذ الثابتة وتسجيل سجلات التطوير."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating error detection after code changes","Executing supplementary tests with npm","Recording build check results in dev logs"],"zh":["代码更改后自动检测错误","使用npm执行补充测试","在开发日志中记录构建检查结果"],"ja":["コードの変更後に自動でエラーを検出する","npmを使用して追加のテストを実行する","開発ログにビルドの確認結果を記録する"],"ko":["코드 변경 후 자동 오류 감지","npm을 사용하여 추가 테스트 실행","개발 로그에 빌드 확인 결과 기록"],"es":["Automatización de la detección de errores después de los cambios de código","Ejecución de pruebas suplementarias con npm","Grabación de los resultados de los controles de compilación en los registros de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la détection d''erreurs après les modifications de code","Exécution de tests supplémentaires avec npm","Enregistrement des résultats des contrôles de construction dans les journaux de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung der Fehlernachverfolgung nach Codeänderungen","Ausführung zusätzlicher Tests mit npm","Aufzeichnung der Build-Check-Ergebnisse in den Entwicklungsprotokollen"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção de erros após alterações de código","Executar testes suplementares com npm","Gravar resultados de verificações de compilação em logs de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение ошибок после изменений кода","Выполнять дополнительные тесты с помощью npm","Записывать результаты проверок сборки в журналы разработки"],"ar":["توفير الكشف التلقائي عن الأخطاء بعد تغييرات الشفرة","تشغيل الاختبارات الإضافية مع npm","تسجيل نتائج فحص البناء في سجلات التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bash and npm environment","Needs script files like `check_errors.sh` to be present"],"zh":["需要bash和npm环境","需要脚本文件如`check_errors.sh`存在"],"ja":["bashとnpmの環境が必要","`check_errors.sh`などのスクリプトファイルが存在する必要がある"],"ko":["bash와 npm 환경이 필요","`check_errors.sh` 같은 스크립트 파일이 존재해야 함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de bash y npm","Necesita que archivos de script como `check_errors.sh` estén presentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement bash et npm","Nécessite que des fichiers de script tels que `check_errors.sh` soient présents"],"de":["Benötigt eine bash- und npm-Umgebung","Benötigt die Anwesenheit von Skriptdateien wie `check_errors.sh`"],"pt":["Exige ambiente bash e npm","Necessita de arquivos de script como `check_errors.sh` para estar presente"],"ru":["Требует среды bash и npm","Требует наличия файлов скриптов типа `check_errors.sh`"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة bash وnpm","يحتاج إلى ملفات نصية مثل `check_errors.sh` لتكون موجودة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
