result es una biblioteca para el manejo de errores tipado, que permite migrar código existente a un enfoque más robusto","fr":"better-result est une bibliothèque pour la gestion d''erreurs typée, qui permet de migrer le code existant vers une approche plus robuste","de":"better-result ist eine Bibliothek für die typsichere Fehlerbehandlung, die es ermöglicht, bestehenden Code auf einen robusteren Ansatz umzustellen","pt":"Melhore a adopção de better-result para um tratamento de erros mais robusto e tipado","ru":"Улучшите принятие better-result для более прочной и типизированной обработки ошибок","ar":"حسن采用 better-result لتعامل الأخطاء أكثر متانة وتنسيق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["类型化错误处理","Promise 重试机制","铁路导向编程模式","现有代码库迁移支持","try/catch 块转换"],"ja":["型付きエラー処理","Promise 再試行メカニズム","鉄道指向プログラミングパターン","既存コードベースへの移行サポート","try/catch ブロックの変換"],"ko":["유형화된 오류 처리","Promise 재시도 메커니즘","철도지향 프로그래밍 패턴","기존 코드베이스 이移 지원","try/catch 블록 변환"],"es":["Manejo de errores tipado","Migración de código existente","Reemplazo de excepciones lanzadas","Introducción de patrones de programación orientados a ferrocarril","Compatibilidad con Promesas"],"fr":["Gestion d''erreurs typée","Migration de code existant","Remplacement d''exceptions lancées","Introduction de modèles de programmation orientés ferroviaire","Compatibilité avec les Promesses"],"de":["Typsichere Fehlerbehandlung","Migration von bestehendem Code","Ersetzen von ausgelösten Ausnahmen","Einführung von schienengebundenen Programmiermustern","Kompatibilität mit Promises"],"pt":["Migração de tratamento de erros existente para better-result","Conversão de blocos try/catch para tipos Result","Substituição de exceções lançadas por erros tipados","Migração de código baseado em Promises para Result.tryPromise","Introdução de padrões de programação orientados a trilhos"],"ru":["Миграция существующей обработки ошибок на better-result","Преобразование блоков try/catch в типы Result","Замена выброшенных исключений на типизированные ошибки","Миграция кода на основе Promises на Result.tryPromise","Введение шаблонов программирования, ориентированных на железную дорогу"],"ar":["هجرة معالجة الأخطاء الحالية إلى better-result","تحويل كتل try/catch إلى أنواع Result","استبدال الاستثناءات المرسلة بأخطاء منضبط","هجرة رمز قائم على Promises إلى Result.tryPromise","إدخال أنماط البرمجة الموجهة إلى السكك الحديدية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["better-result","结果处理","错误处理","类型化错误","Promise","铁路导向编程","代码迁移"],"ja":["better-result","結果処理","エラー処理","型付きエラー","Promise","鉄道指向プログラミング","コード移行"],"ko":["better-result","결과 처리","오류 처리","유형화된 오류","Promise","철도지향 프로그래밍","코드 이移"],"es":["manejo de errores","errores tipados","migración de código","better-result","programación orientada a ferrocarril","promesas","errores en javascript"],"fr":["gestion d''erreurs","erreurs typées","migration de code","better-result","programmation orientée ferroviaire","promesses","erreurs en javascript"],"de":["fehlerbehandlung","typsichere fehler","code-migration","better-result","schienengebundene programmierung","promises","fehler in javascript"],"pt":["better-result","tratamento de erros","tipado","migração","try/catch","Promises","Result","programação orientada a trilhos"],"ru":["better-result","обработка ошибок","типизированная","миграция","try/catch","Promises","Result","программирование, ориентированное на железную дорогу"],"ar":["better-result","معالجة الأخطاء","منضبط","هجرة","try/catch","Promises","Result","برمجة موجهة إلى السكك الحديدية"]}},"owner":"sutin1234","repo":"tanstack-start-agent-skills","repoPath":"sutin1234/tanstack-start-agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"better-result-adopt","description":"Migrate codebase from try/catch or Promise-based error handling to better-result. Use when adopting Result types, converting thrown exceptions to typed errors, or refactoring existing error handling to railway-oriented programming.","bodyPreview":"# better-result Adoption\n\nMigrate existing error handling (try/catch, Promise rejections, thrown exceptions) to typed Result-based error handling with better-result.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adopting better-result in existing codebase\n- Converting try/catch blocks to Result types\n- Replacing thrown exceptions with typed errors\n- Migrating Promise-based code to Result.tryPromise\n- Introducing railway-oriented programming patterns\n\n## Migration Strategy\n\n### 1. Start at Boundaries\n\nBegin migration at I/","body":"# better-result Adoption\n\nMigrate existing error handling (try/catch, Promise rejections, thrown exceptions) to typed Result-based error handling with better-result.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adopting better-result in existing codebase\n- Converting try/catch blocks to Result types\n- Replacing thrown exceptions with typed errors\n- Migrating Promise-based code to Result.tryPromise\n- Introducing railway-oriented programming patterns\n\n## Migration Strategy\n\n### 1. Start at Boundaries\n\nBegin migration at I/O boundaries (API calls, DB queries, file ops) and work inward. Don''t attempt full-codebase migration at once.\n\n### 2. Identify Error Categories\n\nBefore migrating, categorize errors in target code:\n\n| Category       | Example                | Migration Target                                |\n| -------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| Domain errors  | NotFound, Validation   | TaggedError + Result.err                        |\n| Infrastructure | Network, DB connection | Result.tryPromise + TaggedError                 |\n| Bugs/defects   | null deref, type error | Let throw (becomes Panic if in Result callback) |\n\n### 3. Migration Order\n\n1. Define TaggedError classes for domain errors\n2. Wrap throwing functions with Result.try/tryPromise\n3. Convert imperative error checks to Result chains\n4. Refactor callbacks to generator composition\n\n## Pattern Transformations\n\n### Try/Catch to Result.try\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nfunction parseConfig(json: string): Config {\n  try {\n    return JSON.parse(json);\n  } catch (e) {\n    throw new ParseError(e);\n  }\n}\n\n// AFTER\nfunction parseConfig(json: string): Result<Config, ParseError> {\n  return Result.try({\n    try: () => JSON.parse(json) as Config,\n    catch: (e) => new ParseError({ cause: e, message: `Parse failed: ${e}` }),\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Async/Await to Result.tryPromise\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nasync function fetchUser(id: string): Promise<User> {\n  const res = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);\n  if (!res.ok) throw new ApiError(res.status);\n  return res.json();\n}\n\n// AFTER\nasync function fetchUser(id: string): Promise<Result<User, ApiError | UnhandledException>> {\n  return Result.tryPromise({\n    try: async () => {\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);\n      if (!res.ok) throw new ApiError({ status: res.status, message: `API ${res.status}` });\n      return res.json() as Promise<User>;\n    },\n    catch: (e) => (e instanceof ApiError ? e : new UnhandledException({ cause: e })),\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Null Checks to Result\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nfunction findUser(id: string): User | null {\n  return users.find((u) => u.id === id) ?? null;\n}\n// Caller must check: if (user === null) ...\n\n// AFTER\nfunction findUser(id: string): Result<User, NotFoundError> {\n  const user = users.find((u) => u.id === id);\n  return user\n    ? Result.ok(user)\n    : Result.err(new NotFoundError({ id, message: `User ${id} not found` }));\n}\n// Caller: yield* findUser(id) in Result.gen, or .match()\n```\n\n### Callback Hell to Generator\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nasync function processOrder(orderId: string) {\n  try {\n    const order = await fetchOrder(orderId);\n    if (!order) throw new NotFoundError(orderId);\n    const validated = validateOrder(order);\n    if (!validated.ok) throw new ValidationError(validated.errors);\n    const result = await submitOrder(validated.data);\n    return result;\n  } catch (e) {\n    if (e instanceof NotFoundError) return { error: \"not_found\" };\n    if (e instanceof ValidationError) return { error: \"invalid\" };\n    throw e;\n  }\n}\n\n// AFTER\nasync function processOrder(orderId: string): Promise<Result<OrderResult, OrderError>> {\n  return Result.gen(async function* () {\n    const order = yield* Result.await(fetchOrder(orderId));\n    const validated = yield* validateOrder(order);\n    const result = yield* Result.await(submitOrder(validated));\n    return Result.ok(result);\n  });\n}\n// Error type is union of all yielded errors\n```\n\n## Defining TaggedErrors\n\nSee [references/tagged-errors.md](references/tagged-errors.md) for TaggedError patterns.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Check for source reference**: Look for `opensrc/` directory - if present, read the better-result source code for implementation details and patterns\n2. **Audit**: Find try/catch, Promise.catch, thrown errors in target module\n3. **Define errors**: Create TaggedError classes for domain errors\n4. **Wrap boundaries**: Use Result.try/tryPromise at I/O points\n5. **Chain operations**: Convert if/else error checks to .andThen or Result.gen\n6. **Update signatures**: Change return types to Result<T, E>\n7. **Update callers**: Propagate Result handling up call stack\n8. **Test**: Verify error paths with .match or type narrowing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Over-wrapping**: Don''t wrap every function. Start at boundaries, propagate inward.\n- **Losing error info**: Always include cause/context in TaggedError constructors.\n- **Mixing paradigms**: Once a module returns Result, callers should too (or explicitly .unwrap).\n- **Ignoring Panic**: Callbacks that throw become Panic. Fix the bug, don''t catch Panic.\n\n## References\n\n- [TaggedError Patterns](references/tagged-errors.md) - Defining and matching typed errors\n- `opensrc/` directory (if present) - Full better-result source code for deeper context\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:57:12.941Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Refactoring Agents needing advanced error handling capabilities with typed Result-based error handling","zh":"适用于需要高级错误处理能力的代码重构代理，特别是基于类型的结果错误处理","ja":"コードリファクタリングエージェントに適しています。進んだエラーハンドリング機能と型付きの結果ベースのエラーハンドリングを必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"고급 에러 처리 기능과 타입이 있는 결과 기반 에러 처리가 필요한 코드 리팩토링 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de refactorización de código que necesitan capacidades de manejo de errores avanzadas con manejo de errores basado en Result con tipos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de refactoring de code nécessitant des capacités de gestion d''erreurs avancées avec une gestion d''erreurs basée sur le type Result","de":"Perfekt für Code-Refactoring-Agents, die erweiterte Fehlernbehandlungsfunktionen mit typisierter Ergebnisbehandlung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Refatoração de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de tratamento de erros com tratamento de erros baseado em Result com tipos","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов рефакторинга кода, которым требуются продвинутые возможности обработки ошибок с обработкой ошибок на основе типизированных Result","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إعادة هيكلة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لمعالجة الأخطاء مع معالجة الأخطاء القائمة على النتائج المحددة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to migrate existing error handling to better-result, leveraging typed Result types, railway-oriented programming patterns, and Result.tryPromise for Promise-based code, ensuring more robust and maintainable codebases","zh":"赋予代理将现有的错误处理迁移到更好的结果，利用类型结果类型、铁路导向的编程模式和 Result.tryPromise 来处理 Promise 基础的代码，确保代码库更加强健和可维护","ja":"エージェントが既存のエラーハンドリングをより優れた結果に移行できるようにし、型付きの結果タイプ、鉄道指向のプログラミングパターン、およびPromiseベースのコードのResult.tryPromiseを利用して、より強健で保守可能なコードベースを確保する","ko":"에이전트가 기존의 에러 처리를 더 나은 결과로 마이그레이션 할 수 있도록 하여, 타입 결과 유형, 철도 지향 프로그래밍 패턴 및 Result.tryPromise를 사용하여 Promise 기반 코드를 처리하여 더 강력하고 유지 가능한 코드베이스를 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a migrar el manejo de errores existente a un mejor resultado, aprovechando los tipos de resultado tipados, los patrones de programación orientados a ferrocarril y Result.tryPromise para código basado en promesas, lo que garantiza bases de código más robustas y mantenibles","fr":"Permet aux agents de migrer la gestion d''erreurs existante vers un meilleur résultat, en exploitant les types de résultat typés, les modèles de programmation orientés chemin de fer et Result.tryPromise pour le code basé sur les promesses, garantissant ainsi des bases de code plus robustes et plus maintenables","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bestehende Fehlernbehandlungen auf bessere Ergebnisse umzustellen, indem sie typisierte Ergebnistypen, schienengebundene Programmierungsmuster und Result.tryPromise für promisbasierten Code nutzen, um so robustere und wartbare Codebasen sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a migrar mecanismos de tratamento de erros existentes para melhor resultado, aproveitando tipos Result tipados, padrões de programação orientados a trilhos e Result.tryPromise para código baseado em Promessa, garantindo bases de código mais robustas e mantidas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью мигрировать существующие механизмы обработки ошибок на лучший результат, используя типизированные типы Result, шаблоны программирования, ориентированные на железную дорогу, и Result.tryPromise для кода на основе Promises, обеспечивая более прочные и поддерживаемые кодовые базы","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية نقل آليات معالجة الأخطاء الحالية إلى نتائج أفضل، مستفيداً من أنواع النتائج المحددة، وأنماط البرمجة الموجهة إلى السكة الحديدية، و Result.tryPromise للكود المبني على الوعد، مما يضمن قواعد شفرة أكثر متانة وقابلة للصيانة"},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating try/catch blocks to Result types","Converting thrown exceptions to typed errors","Introducing railway-oriented programming patterns in existing codebases","Replacing Promise rejections with Result.tryPromise"],"zh":["将 try/catch 块迁移到结果类型","将抛出的异常转换为类型化错误","在现有的代码库中引入铁路导向的编程模式","用 Result.tryPromise 替换 Promise 拒绝"],"ja":["try/catch ブロックを結果タイプに移行する","スローされた例外を型付きのエラーに変換する","既存のコードベースに鉄道指向のプログラミングパターンを導入する","Promise の拒否を Result.tryPromise に置き換える"],"ko":["try/catch 블록을 결과 유형으로 마이그레이션","던져진 예외를 유형화된 오류로 변환","기존 코드베이스에 철도 지향 프로그래밍 패턴을 도입","Promise 거부를 Result.tryPromise로 대체"],"es":["Migrar bloques try/catch a tipos de resultado","Convertir excepciones lanzadas en errores tipados","Introducir patrones de programación orientados a ferrocarril en bases de código existentes","Reemplazar rechazos de promesas con Result.tryPromise"],"fr":["Migrer les blocs try/catch vers des types de résultat","Convertir les exceptions lancées en erreurs typées","Introduire des modèles de programmation orientés chemin de fer dans les bases de code existantes","Remplacer les rejets de promesses par Result.tryPromise"],"de":["Try/Catch-Blöcke in Ergebnistypen migrieren","Geworfene Ausnahmen in typisierte Fehler umwandeln","Schienengebundene Programmierungsmuster in bestehenden Codebasen einführen","Promis-Ablehnungen durch Result.tryPromise ersetzen"],"pt":["Migrar blocos try/catch para tipos Result","Converter exceções lançadas para erros tipados","Introduzir padrões de programação orientados a trilhos em bases de código existentes","Substituir rejeições de Promessa por Result.tryPromise"],"ru":["Мигрировать блоки try/catch на типы Result","Преобразовать брошенные исключения в типизированные ошибки","Ввести шаблоны программирования, ориентированные на железную дорогу, в существующие кодовые базы","Заменить отклонения Promises на Result.tryPromise"],"ar":["نقل كتلات try/catch إلى أنواع النتائج","تحويل الاستثناءات المرفوعة إلى أخطاء محددة","إدخال أنماط البرمجة الموجهة إلى السكة الحديدية في قواعد الشفرة الحالية","استبدال رفضات الوعد بنتائج المحاولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing codebase with error handling mechanisms like try/catch or Promise rejections","Better-result library dependency needed"],"zh":["需要现有的代码库具有错误处理机制，如 try/catch 或 Promise 拒绝","需要 better-result 库依赖"],"ja":["既存のコードベースに try/catch または Promise の拒否のようなエラーハンドリングメカニズムが必要","better-result ライブラリ依存が必要"],"ko":["기존 코드베이스에 try/catch 또는 Promise 거부와 같은 에러 처리 메커니즘이 필요","better-result 라이브러리 종속이 필요"],"es":["Requiere una base de código existente con mecanismos de manejo de errores como try/catch o rechazos de promesas","Se necesita la dependencia de la biblioteca better-result"],"fr":["Nécessite une base de code existante avec des mécanismes de gestion d''erreurs tels que try/catch ou des rejets de promesses","La dépendance de la bibliothèque better-result est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt eine bestehende Codebasis mit Fehlernbehandlungsmechanismen wie try/catch oder Promis-Ablehnungen","Better-Result-Bibliothek-Abhängigkeit erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige base de código existente com mecanismos de tratamento de erros como try/catch ou rejeições de Promessa","Dependência da biblioteca better-result necessária"],"ru":["Требует существующей кодовой базы с механизмами обработки ошибок, такими как try/catch или отклонения Promises","Необходима зависимость от библиотеки better-result"],"ar":["يتطلب قاعدة شفرة موجودة مع آليات معالجة الأخطاء مثل try/catch أو رفضات الوعد","الحاجة إلى اعتمادية المكتبة better-result"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
