rkPolicy","Konfiguration von PodSecurityPolicy","Zugriffsverwaltung mit RBAC","Pod-Sicherheitsstandards","Verbesserung der Cluster-Sicherheit","Schutz von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de NetworkPolicy","Configuração de PodSecurityPolicy","Gerenciamento de acesso com RBAC","Aplicação de Pod Security Standards","Validação de resultados e práticas recomendadas"],"ru":["Реализация NetworkPolicy","Настройка PodSecurityPolicy","Управление доступом с помощью RBAC","Применение Pod Security Standards","Проверка результатов и рекомендуемых практик"],"ar":["تنفيذ NetworkPolicy","تكوين PodSecurityPolicy","إدارة الوصول باستخدام RBAC","تطبيق Pod Security Standards","تحقق النتائج والممارسات الموصى بها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes 安全","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod 安全标准","容器安全","云原生安全"],"ja":["Kubernetes セキュリティ","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod セキュリティ標準","コンテナ セキュリティ","クラウド ネイティブ セキュリティ"],"ko":["쿠버네티스 보안","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod 보안 표준","컨테이너 보안","클라우드 네이티브 보안"],"es":["Kubernetes","seguridad","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","estándares de seguridad","cluster","aplicaciones","desarrollo de software","devops"],"fr":["Kubernetes","sécurité","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","normes de sécurité","cluster","applications","développement de logiciels","devops"],"de":["Kubernetes","Sicherheit","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Sicherheitsstandards","Cluster","Anwendungen","Softwareentwicklung","devops"],"pt":["Kubernetes","segurança","políticas de segurança","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod Security Standards","desenvolvimento de software","orquestração de contêineres"],"ru":["Kubernetes","безопасность","политики безопасности","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod Security Standards","разработка программного обеспечения","оркестрация контейнеров"],"ar":["كيوبيرنتس","أمان","سياسات أمان","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod Security Standards","تطوير البرمجيات","أوركسترا الحاويات"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"k8s-security-policies","description":"Implement Kubernetes security policies including NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, and RBAC for production-grade security. Use when securing Kubernetes clusters, implementing network isolation, or enforcing pod security standards.","bodyPreview":"# Kubernetes Security Policies\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC, and Pod Security Standards in Kubernetes.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to kubernetes security policies\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required","body":"# Kubernetes Security Policies\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC, and Pod Security Standards in Kubernetes.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to kubernetes security policies\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement defense-in-depth security for Kubernetes clusters using network policies, pod security standards, and RBAC.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Implement network segmentation\n- Configure pod security standards\n- Set up RBAC for least-privilege access\n- Create security policies for compliance\n- Implement admission control\n- Secure multi-tenant clusters\n\n## Pod Security Standards\n\n### 1. Privileged (Unrestricted)\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: privileged-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: privileged\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: privileged\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: privileged\n```\n\n### 2. Baseline (Minimally restrictive)\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: baseline-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: baseline\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: baseline\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: baseline\n```\n\n### 3. Restricted (Most restrictive)\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: restricted-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: restricted\n```\n\n## Network Policies\n\n### Default Deny All\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: default-deny-all\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector: {}\n  policyTypes:\n  - Ingress\n  - Egress\n```\n\n### Allow Frontend to Backend\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-frontend-to-backend\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: backend\n  policyTypes:\n  - Ingress\n  ingress:\n  - from:\n    - podSelector:\n        matchLabels:\n          app: frontend\n    ports:\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 8080\n```\n\n### Allow DNS\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-dns\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector: {}\n  policyTypes:\n  - Egress\n  egress:\n  - to:\n    - namespaceSelector:\n        matchLabels:\n          name: kube-system\n    ports:\n    - protocol: UDP\n      port: 53\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/network-policy-template.yaml`\n\n## RBAC Configuration\n\n### Role (Namespace-scoped)\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Role\nmetadata:\n  name: pod-reader\n  namespace: production\nrules:\n- apiGroups: [\"\"]\n  resources: [\"pods\"]\n  verbs: [\"get\", \"watch\", \"list\"]\n```\n\n### ClusterRole (Cluster-wide)\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: ClusterRole\nmetadata:\n  name: secret-reader\nrules:\n- apiGroups: [\"\"]\n  resources: [\"secrets\"]\n  verbs: [\"get\", \"watch\", \"list\"]\n```\n\n### RoleBinding\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: RoleBinding\nmetadata:\n  name: read-pods\n  namespace: production\nsubjects:\n- kind: User\n  name: jane\n  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n- kind: ServiceAccount\n  name: default\n  namespace: production\nroleRef:\n  kind: Role\n  name: pod-reader\n  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/rbac-patterns.md`\n\n## Pod Security Context\n\n### Restricted Pod\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\n  name: secure-pod\nspec:\n  securityContext:\n    runAsNonRoot: true\n    runAsUser: 1000\n    fsGroup: 1000\n    seccompProfile:\n      type: RuntimeDefault\n  containers:\n  - name: app\n    image: myapp:1.0\n    securityContext:\n      allowPrivilegeEscalation: false\n      readOnlyRootFilesystem: true\n      capabilities:\n        drop:\n        - ALL\n```\n\n## Policy Enforcement with OPA Gatekeeper\n\n### ConstraintTemplate\n```yaml\napiVersion: templates.gatekeeper.sh/v1\nkind: ConstraintTemplate\nmetadata:\n  name: k8srequiredlabels\nspec:\n  crd:\n    spec:\n      names:\n        kind: K8sRequiredLabels\n      validation:\n        openAPIV3Schema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            labels:\n              type: array\n              items:\n                type: string\n  targets:\n    - target: admission.k8s.gatekeeper.sh\n      rego: |\n        package k8srequiredlabels\n        violation[{\"msg\": msg, \"details\": {\"missing_labels\": missing}}] {\n          provided := {label | input.review.object.metadata.labels[label]}\n          required := {label | label := input.parameters.labels[_]}\n          missing := required - provided\n          count(missing) > 0\n          msg := sprintf(\"missing required labels: %v\", [missing])\n        }\n```\n\n### Constraint\n```yaml\napiVersion: constraints.gatekeeper.sh/v1beta1\nkind: K8sRequiredLabels\nmetadata:\n  name: require-app-label\nspec:\n  match:\n    kinds:\n      - apiGroups: [\"apps\"]\n        kinds: [\"Deployment\"]\n  parameters:\n    labels: [\"app\", \"environment\"]\n```\n\n## Service Mesh Security (Istio)\n\n### PeerAuthentication (mTLS)\n```yaml\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: PeerAuthentication\nmetadata:\n  name: default\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  mtls:\n    mode: STRICT\n```\n\n### AuthorizationPolicy\n```yaml\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: AuthorizationPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-frontend\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: backend\n  action: ALLOW\n  rules:\n  - from:\n    - source:\n        principals: [\"cluster.local/ns/production/sa/frontend\"]\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Implement Pod Security Standards** at namespace level\n2. **Use Network Policies** for network segmentation\n3. **Apply least-privilege RBAC** for all service accounts\n4. **Enable admission control** (OPA Gatekeeper/Kyverno)\n5. **Run containers as non-root**\n6. **Use read-only root filesystem**\n7. **Drop all capabilities** unless needed\n8. **Implement resource quotas** and limit ranges\n9. **Enable audit logging** for security events\n10. **Regular security scanning** of images\n\n## Compliance Frameworks\n\n### CIS Kubernetes Benchmark\n- Use RBAC authorization\n- Enable audit logging\n- Use Pod Security Standards\n- Configure network policies\n- Implement secrets encryption at rest\n- Enable node authentication\n\n### NIST Cybersecurity Framework\n- Implement defense in depth\n- Use network segmentation\n- Configure security monitoring\n- Implement access controls\n- Enable logging and monitoring\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**NetworkPolicy not working:**\n```bash\n# Check if CNI supports NetworkPolicy\nkubectl get nodes -o wide\nkubectl describe networkpolicy <name>\n```\n\n**RBAC permission denied:**\n```bash\n# Check effective permissions\nkubectl auth can-i list pods --as system:serviceaccount:default:my-sa\nkubectl auth can-i ''*'' ''*'' --as system:serviceaccount:default:my-sa\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `assets/network-policy-template.yaml` - Network policy examples\n- `assets/pod-security-template.yaml` - Pod security policies\n- `references/rbac-patterns.md` - RBAC configuration patterns\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `k8s-manifest-generator` - For creating secure manifests\n- `gitops-workflow` - For automated policy deployment\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:57:24.155Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Security Agents requiring advanced Kubernetes security policy management and implementation.","zh":"适用于需要高级Kubernetes安全策略管理和实施的云安全代理。","ja":"Kubernetesのセキュリティポリシー管理および実装を要するクラウドセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Kubernetes 보안 정책 관리 및 구현이 필요한 클라우드 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad en la nube que requieren una gestión y implementación avanzada de políticas de seguridad de Kubernetes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité cloud nécessitant une gestion et une mise en œuvre avancées des politiques de sécurité Kubernetes.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die eine erweiterte Kubernetes-Sicherheitsrichtlinienverwaltung und -implementierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que exigem gestão e implementação avançadas de políticas de segurança do Kubernetes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов безопасности, требующих продвинутого управления политиками безопасности Kubernetes и их реализации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل أمن السحابة الذي يتطلب إدارة وتطبيق متقدمة لسياسات أمان كوبيرنيتس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, and RBAC in Kubernetes environments, ensuring secure pod communication and access control through Pod Security Standards and comprehensive security audits.","zh":"赋予代理执行NetworkPolicy、PodSecurityPolicy和RBAC的能力，在Kubernetes环境中确保安全的Pod通信和访问控制，通过Pod安全标准和全面安全审计。","ja":"エージェントにNetworkPolicy、PodSecurityPolicy、RBACを実施する能力を付与し、Kubernetes環境でセキュアなPod通信とアクセス制御を確保し、Podセキュリティスタンダードと包括的なセキュリティ監査を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy 및 RBAC를 시행할 수 있도록 하여 Kubernetes 환경에서 보안 ポッド 통신 및 액세스 제어를 보장하고, ポッド 보안 표준 및 포괄적인 보안 감사를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy y RBAC en entornos de Kubernetes, garantizando una comunicación segura entre pods y un control de acceso a través de estándares de seguridad de pods y auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy et RBAC dans les environnements Kubernetes, assurant une communication sécurisée entre les pods et un contrôle d''accès via les normes de sécurité des pods et des audits de sécurité complets.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy und RBAC in Kubernetes-Umgebungen durchzusetzen, um eine sichere Kommunikation zwischen Pods und Zugriffskontrolle durch Pod-Sicherheitsstandards und umfassende Sicherheitsaudits sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy e RBAC em ambientes Kubernetes, garantindo comunicação segura de pods e controle de acesso por meio de Padrões de Segurança de Pods e auditorias de segurança abrangentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy и RBAC в средах Kubernetes, гарантируя безопасное общение между подами и контроль доступа посредством Стандартов безопасности подов и всеобъемлющих проверок безопасности.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء صلاحية تنفيذ سياسات الشبكة وأمان الحاويات ومراقبة الوصول في بيئات كوبيرنيتس، مما يضمن تواصل حاويات آمن وتحكم وصول من خلال معايير أمان الحاويات والتدقيقات الأمنية الشاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing NetworkPolicy for secure pod communication","Enforcing PodSecurityPolicy for workload protection","Configuring RBAC for fine-grained access control","Validating Pod Security Standards for compliance"],"zh":["实现NetworkPolicy以实现安全的Pod通信","执行PodSecurityPolicy以保护工作负载","配置RBAC以实现细粒度的访问控制","验证Pod安全标准以确保合规性"],"ja":["セキュアなPod通信のためにNetworkPolicyを実装する","ワークロード保護のためにPodSecurityPolicyを実施する","細粒度のアクセス制御のためにRBACを構成する","コンプライアンスのためにPodセキュリティスタンダードを検証する"],"ko":["보안 ポッド 통신을 위한 NetworkPolicy 구현","워크로드 보호를 위한 PodSecurityPolicy 시행","세부적인 액세스 제어를 위한 RBAC 구성","준수 확인을 위한 ポッド 보안 표준 검증"],"es":["Implementar NetworkPolicy para una comunicación segura entre pods","Aplicar PodSecurityPolicy para la protección de cargas de trabajo","Configurar RBAC para un control de acceso granular","Validar los estándares de seguridad de pods para el cumplimiento"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre NetworkPolicy pour une communication sécurisée entre les pods","Appliquer PodSecurityPolicy pour la protection des charges de travail","Configurer RBAC pour un contrôle d''accès granulaire","Valider les normes de sécurité des pods pour la conformité"],"de":["Implementierung von NetworkPolicy für eine sichere Kommunikation zwischen Pods","Durchsetzung von PodSecurityPolicy für den Schutz von Workloads","Konfiguration von RBAC für eine granulare Zugriffskontrolle","Validierung der Sicherheitsstandards für Pods für die Einhaltung"],"pt":["Implementação da NetworkPolicy para comunicação segura de pods","Aplicação da PodSecurityPolicy para proteção de cargas de trabalho","Configuração do RBAC para controle de acesso granular","Validação dos Padrões de Segurança de Pods para conformidade"],"ru":["Реализация NetworkPolicy для безопасного общения между подами","Применение PodSecurityPolicy для защиты рабочих нагрузок","Настройка RBAC для детального контроля доступа","Проверка Стандартов безопасности подов на соответствие"],"ar":["تنفيذ سياسات الشبكة للتواصل الآمن بين الحاويات","تطبيق سياسات أمان الحاويات لحماية الحمولات العملية","تكوين مراقبة الوصول لتحكم وصول دقيق","التحقق من معايير أمان الحاويات للامتثال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kubernetes environment","Limited to Kubernetes security policies","Needs cluster administrator privileges"],"zh":["需要Kubernetes环境","仅限Kubernetes安全策略","需要集群管理员权限"],"ja":["Kubernetes環境が必要","Kubernetesセキュリティポリシーに限定される","クラスタ管理者権限が必要"],"ko":["Kubernetes 환경이 필요합니다","Kubernetes 보안 정책으로 제한됩니다","클러스터 관리자 권한이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Kubernetes","Limitado a políticas de seguridad de Kubernetes","Requiere privilegios de administrador de clúster"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Kubernetes","Limité aux politiques de sécurité Kubernetes","Nécessite des privilèges d''administrateur de cluster"],"de":["Benötigt eine Kubernetes-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Kubernetes-Sicherheitsrichtlinien","Benötigt Cluster-Administrator-Privilegien"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Kubernetes","Limitado a políticas de segurança do Kubernetes","Necessita de privilégios de administrador de cluster"],"ru":["Требует среды Kubernetes","Ограничен политиками безопасности Kubernetes","Требует привилегий администратора кластера"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة كوبيرنيتس","محدود بسياسات أمان كوبيرنيتس","يحتاج إلى صلاحيات مدير الكلستر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
