 permite a los desarrolladores automatizar operaciones de ticket de HelpDesk de manera eficiente.","fr":"L''automation de HelpDesk avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs d''automatiser les opérations de billetterie de HelpDesk de manière efficace.","de":"Die HelpDesk-Automatisierung mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, HelpDesk-Ticketing-Operationen effizient zu automatisieren.","pt":"A automação de HelpDesk via Rube MCP permite automatizar operações de ticket de HelpDesk com o toolkit Composio. Veja como configurar.","ru":"Автоматизация HelpDesk с помощью Rube MCP позволяет автоматизировать операции по тикетам HelpDesk с помощью инструментария Composio. Узнайте, как настроить.","ar":"تطبيق تلقائي لتقارير الدعم الفني عبر Rube MCP يسمح بتطبيق تلقائي لعمليات تذاكر الدعم الفني باستخدام أدوات Composio. تعرف على كيفية الإعداد.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Rube MCP","HelpDesk","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","MCP","API"],"ja":["Rube MCP","HelpDesk","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","MCP","API"],"ko":["Rube MCP","HelpDesk","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","MCP","API"],"es":["Automatización de operaciones de ticket de HelpDesk","Integración con la herramienta de HelpDesk de Composio","Conexión con Rube MCP","No requiere claves de API","Configuración sencilla","Mejora de la eficiencia en la gestión de tickets"],"fr":["Automatisation des opérations de billetterie de HelpDesk","Intégration avec l''outil de HelpDesk de Composio","Connexion avec Rube MCP","Nécessite pas de clés d''API","Configuration simple","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans la gestion des tickets"],"de":["Automatisierung von HelpDesk-Ticketing-Operationen","Integration mit dem HelpDesk-Toolkit von Composio","Verbindung mit Rube MCP","Benötigt keine API-Schlüssel","Einfache Konfiguration","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der Ticketverwaltung"],"pt":["Automação de operações de ticket de HelpDesk","Integração com o toolkit Composio","Conexão com Rube MCP","Configuração simples","Sem necessidade de chaves de API"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций по тикетам HelpDesk","Интеграция с инструментарием Composio","Соединение с Rube MCP","Простая настройка","Не требуется ключи API"],"ar":["تطبيق تلقائي لعمليات تذاكر الدعم الفني","التكامل مع أدوات Composio","اتصال ب Rube MCP","إعدادات بسيطة","لا يلزم استخدام مفتاح API"]},"keywords":{"zh":["HelpDesk","Rube MCP","MCP","API","HelpDesk","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Composio"],"ja":["HelpDesk","Rube MCP","MCP","API","HelpDesk","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Composio"],"ko":["HelpDesk","Rube MCP","MCP","API","HelpDesk","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Composio"],"es":["automatización de HelpDesk","Rube MCP","herramienta de HelpDesk","Composio","ticket de HelpDesk","automatización de tareas","eficiencia en la gestión de tickets","integración con Rube MCP","configuración de HelpDesk"],"fr":["automation de HelpDesk","Rube MCP","outil de HelpDesk","Composio","billetterie de HelpDesk","automatisation de tâches","efficacité dans la gestion des tickets","intégration avec Rube MCP","configuration de HelpDesk"],"de":["HelpDesk-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","HelpDesk-Toolkit","Composio","HelpDesk-Ticketing","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Effizienz bei der Ticketverwaltung","Integration mit Rube MCP","Konfiguration von HelpDesk"],"pt":["automação de HelpDesk","Rube MCP","Composio","ticket de HelpDesk","automatização de operações","integração de ferramentas","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["автоматизация HelpDesk","Rube MCP","Composio","тикет HelpDesk","автоматизация операций","интеграция инструментов","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطبيق تلقائي لتقارير الدعم الفني","Rube MCP","Composio","تذاكر الدعم الفني","تطبيق تلقائي لعمليات","تكامل أدوات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"helpdesk-automation","description":"Automate HelpDesk tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): list tickets, manage views, use canned responses, and configure custom fields. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# HelpDesk Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate HelpDesk ticketing operations through Composio''s HelpDesk toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active HelpDesk connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `helpdesk`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint","body":"# HelpDesk Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate HelpDesk ticketing operations through Composio''s HelpDesk toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active HelpDesk connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `helpdesk`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `helpdesk`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete HelpDesk authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Browse Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to retrieve, browse, or paginate through support tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `HELPDESK_LIST_TICKETS` - List tickets with sorting and pagination [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `silo`: Ticket folder - ''tickets'', ''archive'', ''trash'', or ''spam'' (default: ''tickets'')\n- `sortBy`: Sort field - ''createdAt'', ''updatedAt'', or ''lastMessageAt'' (default: ''createdAt'')\n- `order`: Sort direction - ''asc'' or ''desc'' (default: ''desc'')\n- `pageSize`: Results per page, 1-100 (default: 20)\n- `next.value`: Timestamp cursor for forward pagination\n- `next.ID`: ID cursor for forward pagination\n- `prev.value`: Timestamp cursor for backward pagination\n- `prev.ID`: ID cursor for backward pagination\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Pagination uses cursor-based approach with timestamp + ID pairs\n- Forward pagination requires both `next.value` and `next.ID` from previous response\n- Backward pagination requires both `prev.value` and `prev.ID`\n- `silo` determines which folder to list from; default is active tickets\n- `pageSize` max is 100; default is 20\n- Archived and trashed tickets are in separate silos\n\n### 2. Manage Ticket Views\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see saved agent views for organizing tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `HELPDESK_LIST_VIEWS` - List all agent views [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**: (none required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Views are predefined saved filters configured by agents in the HelpDesk UI\n- View definitions include filter criteria that can be used to understand ticket organization\n- Views cannot be created or modified via API; they are managed in the HelpDesk UI\n\n### 3. Use Canned Responses\n\n**When to use**: User wants to list available canned (template) responses for tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `HELPDESK_LIST_CANNED_RESPONSES` - Retrieve all predefined reply templates [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**: (none required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Canned responses are predefined templates for common replies\n- They may include placeholder variables that need to be filled in\n- Canned responses are managed through the HelpDesk UI\n- Response content may include HTML formatting\n\n### 4. Inspect Custom Fields\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view custom field definitions for the account\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `HELPDESK_LIST_CUSTOM_FIELDS` - List all custom field definitions [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**: (none required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Custom fields extend the default ticket schema with organization-specific data\n- Field definitions include field type, name, and validation rules\n- Custom fields are configured in the HelpDesk admin panel\n- Field values appear on tickets when the field has been populated\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Ticket Browsing Pattern\n\n```\n1. Call HELPDESK_LIST_TICKETS with desired silo and sortBy\n2. Process the returned page of tickets\n3. Extract next.value and next.ID from the response\n4. Call HELPDESK_LIST_TICKETS with those cursor values for next page\n5. Continue until no more cursor values are returned\n```\n\n### Ticket Folder Navigation\n\n```\nActive tickets:  silo=''tickets''\nArchived:        silo=''archive''\nTrashed:         silo=''trash''\nSpam:            silo=''spam''\n```\n\n### Cursor-Based Pagination\n\n```\nForward pagination:\n  - Use next.value (timestamp) and next.ID from response\n  - Pass as next.value and next.ID parameters in next call\n\nBackward pagination:\n  - Use prev.value (timestamp) and prev.ID from response\n  - Pass as prev.value and prev.ID parameters in next call\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Cursor Pagination**:\n- Both timestamp and ID are required for cursor navigation\n- Cursor values are timestamps in ISO 8601 date-time format\n- Mixing forward and backward cursors in the same request is undefined behavior\n\n**Silo Filtering**:\n- Tickets are physically separated into silos (folders)\n- Moving tickets between silos is done in the HelpDesk UI\n- Each silo query is independent; there is no cross-silo search\n\n**Read-Only Operations**:\n- Current Composio toolkit provides list/read operations\n- Ticket creation, update, and reply operations may require additional tools\n- Check RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS for any newly available tools\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- HelpDesk API has per-account rate limits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n- Keep page sizes reasonable to avoid timeouts\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Ticket IDs are strings\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List tickets | HELPDESK_LIST_TICKETS | silo, sortBy, order, pageSize |\n| List views | HELPDESK_LIST_VIEWS | (none) |\n| List canned responses | HELPDESK_LIST_CANNED_RESPONSES | (none) |\n| List custom fields | HELPDESK_LIST_CUSTOM_FIELDS | (none) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:58:12.840Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing seamless HelpDesk ticketing operations integration via Rube MCP","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Rube MCP 实现无缝 HelpDesk 票据操作集成的自动化代理","ja":"Rube MCP を介して HelpDesk チケット操作のシームレスな統合を必要とする自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 HelpDesk 티켓 작업의 무결점 통합을 필요로 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan operaciones de ticketing de HelpDesk integradas de forma inalámbrica a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin d''opérations de ticketing de HelpDesk intégrées de manière transparente via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Integration von HelpDesk-Ticketing-Operationen über Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de operações de ticketing de HelpDesk integradas de forma sem interrupções via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция операций по созданию тикетов HelpDesk через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الروبوت التي تحتاج إلى عمليات تذاكر HelpDesk متكاملة دون انقطاع عبر Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate HelpDesk operations through Composio''s HelpDesk toolkit, leveraging RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for streamlined ticket management, utilizing protocols like MCP for effortless connections","zh":"通过 Composio 的 HelpDesk 工具包，利用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 和 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 进行流畅的票据管理，使用像 MCP 的协议进行无缝连接，从而赋予代理自动化 HelpDesk 操作的能力","ja":"Composio の HelpDesk ツールキットを使用して、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS と RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を活用し、MCP などのプロトコルを使用して Effortless 接続を行い、チケット管理をストリームライン化することで、エージェントが HelpDesk 操作を自動化できるようになる","ko":"Composio의 HelpDesk 툴킷을 사용하여 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 활용하고 MCP 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 노력 없는 연결을 수행하여 티켓 관리를 간소화함으로써 에이전트가 HelpDesk 작업을 자동화할 수 있는 기능을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de HelpDesk a través de la herramienta de HelpDesk de Composio, aprovechando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una gestión de tickets optimizada, utilizando protocolos como MCP para conexiones sin esfuerzo","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en place l''automatisation des opérations de HelpDesk via la boîte à outils de HelpDesk de Composio, en exploitant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une gestion de tickets rationalisée, en utilisant des protocoles comme MCP pour des connexions sans effort","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, HelpDesk-Operationen über das HelpDesk-Toolkit von Composio zu automatisieren, indem es RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine optimierte Ticketverwaltung nutzt und Protokolle wie MCP für mühelose Verbindungen verwendet","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatizem as operações do HelpDesk por meio da ferramenta HelpDesk da Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para gerenciamento de tarefas de tiquetes otimizado, utilizando protocolos como MCP para conexões sem esforço","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать операции HelpDesk с помощью инструмента HelpDesk Composio, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для оптимизированного управления тикетами, используя протоколы, такие как MCP, для бесперебойных соединений","ar":"يمكن للوكيل توفير قوة لعمليات HelpDesk من خلال أداة HelpDesk الخاصة بشركة Composio، مع استخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS لتدفق مهام التذاكر المُستخدمة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل MCP للاتصال دون مجهود"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating HelpDesk ticketing operations","Streamlining customer support workflows","Integrating Rube MCP with existing HelpDesk systems"],"zh":["自动化 HelpDesk 票据操作","优化客户支持工作流","将 Rube MCP 与现有 HelpDesk 系统集成"],"ja":["HelpDesk チケット操作の自動化","カスタマー サポート ワークフローの最適化","Rube MCP を既存の HelpDesk システムに統合"],"ko":["HelpDesk 티켓 작업의 자동화","고객 지원 워크플로우의 최적화","Rube MCP를 기존 HelpDesk 시스템에 통합"],"es":["Automatización de operaciones de ticketing de HelpDesk","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de soporte al cliente","Integración de Rube MCP con sistemas de HelpDesk existentes"],"fr":["Automatisation des opérations de ticketing de HelpDesk","Optimisation des flux de travail de support client","Intégration de Rube MCP avec des systèmes de HelpDesk existants"],"de":["Automatisierung von HelpDesk-Ticketing-Operationen","Optimierung von Kunden-Support-Workflows","Integration von Rube MCP in bestehende HelpDesk-Systeme"],"pt":["Automatizar operações de ticketing do HelpDesk","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de suporte ao cliente","Integrar Rube MCP com sistemas HelpDesk existentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать операции по созданию тикетов HelpDesk","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы поддержки клиентов","Интегрировать Rube MCP с существующими системами HelpDesk"],"ar":["تأتمة مهام تذاكر HelpDesk","تحسين تدفقات عمل دعم العملاء","دمج Rube MCP مع أنظمة HelpDesk الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active HelpDesk connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","Dependent on RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS for tool schemas"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 连接","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 的活动 HelpDesk 连接","依赖于 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 进行工具模式"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を介した HelpDesk 接続が必要","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS への依存が必要"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 활성화된 HelpDesk 연결이 필요","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP","Conexión de HelpDesk activa a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","Dependiente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de herramientas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion HelpDesk active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","Dépend de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour les schémas d''outils"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive HelpDesk-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","Abhängig von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für Werkzeugschemata"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa do HelpDesk via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","Dependente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de ferramentas"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP","Необходимо активное подключение к HelpDesk через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Зависит от RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для схем инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال ب Rube MCP","التواصل النشط مع HelpDesk عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS ضروري","يعتمد على RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS لمخططات الأدوات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('artiefy/artiefy/aws-s3-management', 'community', 'artiefy', 'artiefy', 'artiefy/artiefy', 'aws-s3-management', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z', '2026-02-18T07:58:12.736Z', NULL, '{"id":"artiefy/artiefy/aws-s3-management","name":"aws-s3-management","description":{"zh":"AWS S3提供安全、耐用和高度可扩展的对象存储，支持加密、版本控制、访问控制和生命周期政策","ja":"AWS S3はセキュアで耐久性があり、高度にスケーラブルなオブジェクトストレージを提供し、暗号化、バージョニング、ｱｸｾｽ制御、ライフサイクルポリシーをサポート","ko":"AWS S3는 보안이 강화된 객체 저장소를 제공하며, 암호화, 버전 관리, 접근 제어 및 수명 주기 정책을 지원합니다","es":"AWS S3 proporciona almacenamiento de objetos seguro y escalable. Administre buckets con cifrado, versiones y controles de acceso","fr":"AWS S3 offre un stockage d''objets sécurisé et évolutif. Gérez des buckets avec chiffrement, versionning et contrôles d''accès","de":"AWS S3 bietet sicheres und skalierbares Objekt-Speicher. Verwalten Sie Bucket mit Verschlüsselung, Versionen und Zugriffskontrollen","pt":"O AWS S3 fornece armazenamento de objetos seguro, durável e escalável. Gerencie buckets com criptografia e controle de acesso","ru":"AWS S3 предоставляет безопасное, долговечное и масштабируемое хранение объектов. Управляйте бакетами с шифрованием и контролем доступа","ar":"يقدم أمازون إس 3 تخزينًا آمنًا ومتينًا و قابل للتوسيع. إدارة الدلاء مع التشفير ومراقبة الوصول","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AWS S3 管理：安全可靠的对象存储","ja":"AWS S3 管理：安全で信頼性の高いオブジェクトストレージ","ko":"AWS S3 관리: 보안이 강화된 객체 저장소","es":"Administración de AWS S3","fr":"Gestion AWS S3","de":"AWS S3-Verwaltung","pt":"Gerenciamento de AWS S3","ru":"Управление AWS S3","ar":"إدارة أمازون إس 3","en":"aws-s3-management"},"description":{"zh":"AWS S3提供安全、耐用和高度可扩展的对象存储，支持加密、版本控制、访问控制和生命周期政策","ja":"AWS S3はセキュアで耐久性があり、高度にスケーラブルなオブジェクトストレージを提供し、暗号化、バージョニング、ｱｸｾｽ制御、ライフサイクルポリシーをサポート","ko":"AWS S3는 보안이 강화된 객체 저장소를 제공하며, 암호화, 버전 관리, 접근 제어 및 수명 주기 정책을 지원합니다","es":"AWS S3 proporciona almacenamiento de objetos seguro y escalable. Administre buckets con cifrado, versiones y controles de acceso","fr":"AWS S3 offre un stockage d''objets sécurisé et évolutif. Gérez des buckets avec chiffrement, versionning et contrôles d''accès","de":"AWS S3 bietet sicheres und skalierbares Objekt-Speicher. Verwalten Sie Bucket mit Verschlüsselung, Versionen und Zugriffskontrollen","pt":"O AWS S3 fornece armazenamento de objetos seguro, durável e escalável. Gerencie buckets com criptografia e controle de acesso","ru":"AWS S3 предоставляет безопасное, долговечное и масштабируемое хранение объектов. Управляйте бакетами с шифрованием и контролем доступа","ar":"يقدم أمازون إس 3 تخزينًا آمنًا ومتينًا و قابل للتوسيع. إدارة الدلاء مع التشفير ومراقبة الوصول","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["安全的对象存储","加密和版本控制","访问控制和生命周期政策","跨区域复制和数据共享","静态网站托管和CDN源"],"ja":["セキュアなオブジェクトストレージ","暗号化とバージョニング","ｱｸｾｽ制御とライフサイクルポリシー","クロスリージョン複製とデータ共有","静的ウェブサイトホスティングとCDN源"],"ko":["보안이 강화된 객체 저장소","암호화 및 버전 관리","접근 제어 및 수명 주기 정책","クロ스 리전 복제 및 데이터 공유","정적 웹사이트 호스팅 및 CDN 소스"],"es":["Almacenamiento de objetos seguro y escalable","Cifrado y versiones de datos","Controles de acceso y autenticación","Replicación entre regiones","Políticas de ciclo de vida"],"fr":["Stockage d''objets sécurisé et évolutif","Chiffrement et versionning des données","Contrôles d''accès et d''authentification","Réplication entre régions","Politiques de cycle de vie"],"de":["Sicheres und skalierbares Objekt-Speicher","Verschlüsselung und Versionen von Daten","Zugriffskontrollen und Authentifizierung","Replikation zwischen Regionen","Lebenszyklus-Richtlinien"],"pt":["Criptografia de dados","Controle de acesso","Replicação de dados","Armazenamento de website estático","Armazenamento de logs e análise"],"ru":["Шифрование данных","Контроль доступа","Репликация данных","Хранение статических сайтов","Хранение журналов и анализ"],"ar":["تشفير البيانات","مراقبة الوصول","تكرار البيانات","تخزين موقع الويب الثابت","تخزين سجلات وتحليل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AWS S3管理","对象存储","加密","版本控制","访问控制","生命周期政策","跨区域复制","数据共享"],"ja":["AWS S3管理","オブジェクトストレージ","暗号化","バージョニング","ｱｸｾｽ制御","ライフサイクルポリシー","クロスリージョン複製","データ共有"],"ko":["AWS S3 관리","객체 저장소","암호화","버전 관리","접근 제어","수명 주기 정책","クロ스 리전 복제","데이터 공유"],"es":["AWS S3","administración de buckets","almacenamiento de objetos","seguridad de datos","versiones de datos","controles de acceso","replicación de datos","políticas de ciclo de vida"],"fr":["AWS S3","gestion de buckets","stockage d''objets","sécurité des données","versionning des données","contrôles d''accès","réplication des données","politiques de cycle de vie"],"de":["AWS S3","Bucket-Verwaltung","Objekt-Speicher","Datensicherheit","Datenversionen","Zugriffskontrollen","Datenreplikation","Lebenszyklus-Richtlinien"],"pt":["AWS S3","Gerenciamento de buckets","Armazenamento de objetos","Criptografia de dados","Controle de acesso","Replicação de dados","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["AWS S3","Управление бакетами","Хранение объектов","Шифрование данных","Контроль доступа","Репликация данных","Разработка приложений"],"ar":["أمازون إس 3","إدارة الدلاء","تخزين الكائنات","تشفير البيانات","مراقبة الوصول","تكرار البيانات","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"artiefy","repo":"artiefy","repoPath":"artiefy/artiefy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aws-s3-management","description":"Manage S3 buckets with versioning, encryption, access control, lifecycle policies, and replication. Use for object storage, static sites, and data lakes.","bodyPreview":"# AWS S3 Management\n\n## Overview\n\nAmazon S3 provides secure, durable, and highly scalable object storage. Manage buckets with encryption, versioning, access controls, lifecycle policies, and cross-region replication for reliable data storage and retrieval.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Static website hosting\n- Data backup and archival\n- Media library and CDN origin\n- Data lake and analytics\n- Log storage and analysis\n- Application asset storage\n- Disaster recovery\n- Data sharing and collaboration\n\n## Imple","body":"# AWS S3 Management\n\n## Overview\n\nAmazon S3 provides secure, durable, and highly scalable object storage. Manage buckets with encryption, versioning, access controls, lifecycle policies, and cross-region replication for reliable data storage and retrieval.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Static website hosting\n- Data backup and archival\n- Media library and CDN origin\n- Data lake and analytics\n- Log storage and analysis\n- Application asset storage\n- Disaster recovery\n- Data sharing and collaboration\n\n## Implementation Examples\n\n### 1. **S3 Bucket Creation and Configuration with AWS CLI**\n\n```bash\n# Create bucket\naws s3api create-bucket \\\n  --bucket my-app-bucket-$(date +%s) \\\n  --region us-east-1\n\n# Enable versioning\naws s3api put-bucket-versioning \\\n  --bucket my-app-bucket \\\n  --versioning-configuration Status=Enabled\n\n# Block public access\naws s3api put-public-access-block \\\n  --bucket my-app-bucket \\\n  --public-access-block-configuration \\\n    BlockPublicAcls=true,IgnorePublicAcls=true,\\\n    BlockPublicPolicy=true,RestrictPublicBuckets=true\n\n# Enable encryption\naws s3api put-bucket-encryption \\\n  --bucket my-app-bucket \\\n  --server-side-encryption-configuration ''{\n    \"Rules\": [{\n      \"ApplyServerSideEncryptionByDefault\": {\n        \"SSEAlgorithm\": \"AES256\"\n      }\n    }]\n  }''\n\n# Upload file with metadata\naws s3 cp index.html s3://my-app-bucket/ \\\n  --cache-control \"max-age=3600\" \\\n  --metadata \"author=john,version=1\"\n\n# Sync directory to S3\naws s3 sync ./dist s3://my-app-bucket/ \\\n  --delete \\\n  --exclude \"*.map\"\n\n# List objects with metadata\naws s3api list-objects-v2 \\\n  --bucket my-app-bucket \\\n  --query ''Contents[].{Key:Key,Size:Size,Modified:LastModified}''\n```\n\n### 2. **S3 Lifecycle Policy Configuration**\n\n```bash\n# Create lifecycle policy\naws s3api put-bucket-lifecycle-configuration \\\n  --bucket my-app-bucket \\\n  --lifecycle-configuration ''{\n    \"Rules\": [\n      {\n        \"Id\": \"archive-old-logs\",\n        \"Status\": \"Enabled\",\n        \"Prefix\": \"logs/\",\n        \"Transitions\": [\n          {\n            \"Days\": 30,\n            \"StorageClass\": \"STANDARD_IA\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"Days\": 90,\n            \"StorageClass\": \"GLACIER\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"Expiration\": {\n          \"Days\": 365\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"Id\": \"cleanup-incomplete-uploads\",\n        \"Status\": \"Enabled\",\n        \"AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload\": {\n          \"DaysAfterInitiation\": 7\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }''\n\n# Get bucket lifecycle\naws s3api get-bucket-lifecycle-configuration \\\n  --bucket my-app-bucket\n```\n\n### 3. **Terraform S3 Configuration**\n\n```hcl\n# s3.tf\nterraform {\n  required_providers {\n    aws = {\n      source  = \"hashicorp/aws\"\n      version = \"~> 5.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nprovider \"aws\" {\n  region = \"us-east-1\"\n}\n\n# S3 bucket\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = \"my-app-data-${data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id}\"\n}\n\n# Block public access\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  block_public_acls       = true\n  block_public_policy     = true\n  ignore_public_acls      = true\n  restrict_public_buckets = true\n}\n\n# Enable versioning\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_versioning\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  versioning_configuration {\n    status = \"Enabled\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Server-side encryption\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  rule {\n    apply_server_side_encryption_by_default {\n      sse_algorithm = \"AES256\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n# Lifecycle policy\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_lifecycle_configuration\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  rule {\n    id     = \"archive-logs\"\n    status = \"Enabled\"\n\n    filter {\n      prefix = \"logs/\"\n    }\n\n    transition {\n      days          = 30\n      storage_class = \"STANDARD_IA\"\n    }\n\n    transition {\n      days          = 90\n      storage_class = \"GLACIER\"\n    }\n\n    expiration {\n      days = 365\n    }\n  }\n\n  rule {\n    id     = \"cleanup-incomplete-uploads\"\n    status = \"Enabled\"\n\n    abort_incomplete_multipart_upload {\n      days_after_initiation = 7\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n# CORS configuration\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_cors_configuration\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  cors_rule {\n    allowed_headers = [\"*\"]\n    allowed_methods = [\"GET\", \"PUT\", \"POST\"]\n    allowed_origins = [\"https://example.com\"]\n    expose_headers  = [\"ETag\"]\n    max_age_seconds = 3000\n  }\n}\n\n# Bucket policy for CloudFront\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_policy\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  policy = jsonencode({\n    Version = \"2012-10-17\"\n    Statement = [\n      {\n        Sid    = \"AllowCloudFront\"\n        Effect = \"Allow\"\n        Principal = {\n          Service = \"cloudfront.amazonaws.com\"\n        }\n        Action   = \"s3:GetObject\"\n        Resource = \"${aws_s3_bucket.app_data.arn}/*\"\n        Condition = {\n          StringEquals = {\n            \"AWS:SourceArn\" = \"arn:aws:cloudfront::${data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id}:distribution/${aws_cloudfront_distribution.app.id}\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  })\n}\n\n# Enable logging\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_logging\" \"app_data\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  target_bucket = aws_s3_bucket.logs.id\n  target_prefix = \"s3-logs/\"\n}\n\n# Replication configuration\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_replication_configuration\" \"app_data\" {\n  depends_on = [aws_s3_bucket_versioning.app_data]\n  role       = aws_iam_role.s3_replication.arn\n  bucket     = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.id\n\n  rule {\n    status = \"Enabled\"\n\n    filter {}\n\n    destination {\n      bucket       = aws_s3_bucket.replica.arn\n      storage_class = \"STANDARD_IA\"\n\n      replication_time {\n        status = \"Enabled\"\n        time {\n          minutes = 15\n        }\n      }\n\n      metrics {\n        status = \"Enabled\"\n        event_threshold {\n          minutes = 15\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\ndata \"aws_caller_identity\" \"current\" {}\n\n# Replica bucket\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"replica\" {\n  bucket = \"my-app-data-replica-${data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id}\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket_versioning\" \"replica\" {\n  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.replica.id\n\n  versioning_configuration {\n    status = \"Enabled\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Logs bucket\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"logs\" {\n  bucket = \"my-app-logs-${data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id}\"\n}\n\n# IAM role for replication\nresource \"aws_iam_role\" \"s3_replication\" {\n  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({\n    Version = \"2012-10-17\"\n    Statement = [{\n      Action = \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n      Effect = \"Allow\"\n      Principal = {\n        Service = \"s3.amazonaws.com\"\n      }\n    }]\n  })\n}\n\nresource \"aws_iam_role_policy\" \"s3_replication\" {\n  role = aws_iam_role.s3_replication.id\n\n  policy = jsonencode({\n    Version = \"2012-10-17\"\n    Statement = [\n      {\n        Effect = \"Allow\"\n        Action = [\n          \"s3:GetReplicationConfiguration\",\n          \"s3:ListBucket\"\n        ]\n        Resource = aws_s3_bucket.app_data.arn\n      },\n      {\n        Effect = \"Allow\"\n        Action = [\n          \"s3:GetObjectVersionForReplication\",\n          \"s3:GetObjectVersionAcl\"\n        ]\n        Resource = \"${aws_s3_bucket.app_data.arn}/*\"\n      },\n      {\n        Effect = \"Allow\"\n        Action = [\n          \"s3:ReplicateObject\",\n          \"s3:ReplicateDelete\"\n        ]\n        Resource = \"${aws_s3_bucket.replica.arn}/*\"\n      }\n    ]\n  })\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **S3 Access with Presigned URLs**\n\n```bash\n# Generate presigned URL (1 hour expiration)\naws s3 presign s3://my-app-bucket/private/document.pdf \\\n  --expires-in 3600\n\n# Generate presigned URL for PUT (upload)\naws s3 presign s3://my-app-bucket/uploads/file.jpg \\\n  --expires-in 3600 \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --request-method PUT\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n\n- Enable versioning for important data\n- Use server-side encryption\n- Block public access by default\n- Implement lifecycle policies\n- Enable logging and monitoring\n- Use bucket policies for access control\n- Enable MFA delete for critical buckets\n- Use IAM roles instead of access keys\n- Implement cross-region replication\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n\n- Make buckets publicly accessible\n- Store sensitive credentials\n- Ignore CloudTrail logging\n- Use overly permissive policies\n- Forget to set lifecycle rules\n- Ignore encryption requirements\n\n## Monitoring\n\n- S3 CloudWatch metrics\n- CloudTrail for API logging\n- CloudWatch Alarms for threshold\n- S3 Inventory for object tracking\n- S3 Access Analyzer for permissions\n\n## Resources\n\n- [AWS S3 Documentation](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/s3/)\n- [S3 Security Best Practices](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/security.html)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:58:12.736Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring secure and scalable object storage management via AWS S3","zh":"适用于需要安全且可扩展的对象存储管理的云代理，通过AWS S3实现","ja":"AWS S3を介してセキュアでスケーラブルなオブジェクトストレージ管理を必要とするクラウドエージェントに最適","ko":"AWS S3를 통해 보안이 되고 확장 가능한 객체 저장소 관리가 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes en la Nube que requieren una gestión de almacenamiento de objetos segura y escalable a través de AWS S3","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une gestion de stockage d''objets sécurisée et évolutivité via AWS S3","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die eine sichere und skalierbare Objekt-Speicher-Verwaltung über AWS S3 erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem gerenciamento de armazenamento de objetos seguro e escalável via AWS S3","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих безопасного и масштабируемого управления объектным хранилищем через AWS S3","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تخزين الكائنات الآمنة والمقاسة من خلال AWS S3"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage buckets with encryption, versioning, access controls, lifecycle policies, and cross-region replication for reliable data storage and retrieval using AWS S3 APIs and protocols like HTTPS","zh":"赋予代理管理存储桶的能力，包括加密、版本控制、访问控制、生命周期策略和跨区域复制，实现可靠的数据存储和检索，使用AWS S3 API和HTTPS等协议","ja":"エージェントがバケットを管理できるようにし、暗号化、バージョニング、ｱｸｾｽ制御、ライフサイクルポリシー、クロスリージョンレプリケーションを実現し、AWS S3 APIやHTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用して信頼性の高いデータストレージと取得を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 버킷을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 암호화, 버전 관리, 액세스 제어, 수명 주기 정책 및 크로스 리전 복제를 통해 안정적인 데이터 저장 및 검색을 가능하게 하며, AWS S3 API 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar buckets con cifrado, control de versiones, controles de acceso, políticas de ciclo de vida y replicación entre regiones para un almacenamiento y recuperación de datos confiables utilizando las API y protocolos de AWS S3 como HTTPS","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des buckets avec un chiffrement, une gestion de versions, des contrôles d''accès, des politiques de cycle de vie et une réplication entre régions pour un stockage et une récupération de données fiables en utilisant les API et les protocoles AWS S3 comme HTTPS","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Buckets mit Verschlüsselung, Versionskontrolle, Zugriffskontrollen, Lebenszyklus-Richtlinien und Replikation zwischen Regionen zu verwalten, um zuverlässigen Daten-Speicher und -Abruf unter Verwendung von AWS S3-APIs und -Protokollen wie HTTPS zu ermöglichen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar buckets com criptografia, controle de versão, controles de acesso, políticas de ciclo de vida e replicação entre regiões para armazenamento e recuperação de dados confiáveis usando APIs e protocolos AWS S3, como HTTPS","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять бакетами с помощью шифрования, контроля версий, контроля доступа, политик жизненного цикла и межрегиональной репликации для надежного хранения и извлечения данных с использованием API и протоколов AWS S3, таких как HTTPS","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة الدفاتر مع التشفير وإدارة الإصدارات ومراقبة الوصول وسياسات دورة الحياة والتكرار عبر المناطق من أجل تخزين واسترجاع البيانات الموثوقة باستخدام واجهات برمجة تطبيقات AWS S3 والبروتوكولات مثل HTTPS"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating static website hosting on S3","Configuring data backup and archival with versioning and lifecycle policies","Implementing media library and CDN origin with cross-region replication"],"zh":["在S3上自动托管静态网站","使用版本控制和生命周期策略配置数据备份和归档","实现媒体库和CDN源，使用跨区域复制"],"ja":["S3上で静的Webサイトの自動ホスティング","バージョニングとライフサイクルポリシーを使用したデータバックアップとアーカイブの構成","メディアライブラリとCDNソースの実現、クロスリージョンレプリケーションを使用"],"ko":["S3에서 정적 웹사이트 자동 호스팅","버저닝 및 수명 주기 정책을 사용한 데이터 백업 및 아카이빙 구성","미디어 라이브러리 및 CDN 소스를 통한 크로스 리전 복제 구현"],"es":["Automatizar la hospedaje de sitios web estáticos en S3","Configurar copias de seguridad y archivo con control de versiones y políticas de ciclo de vida","Implementar biblioteca de medios y origen de CDN con replicación entre regiones"],"fr":["Automatiser l''hébergement de sites web statiques sur S3","Configurer des sauvegardes et des archives avec une gestion de versions et des politiques de cycle de vie","Mettre en œuvre une bibliothèque de médias et une origine de CDN avec une réplication entre régions"],"de":["Automatisieren der statischen Website-Hostings auf S3","Konfigurieren von Datensicherungen und Archivierung mit Versionskontrolle und Lebenszyklus-Richtlinien","Implementieren einer Medienbibliothek und CDN-Quelle mit Replikation zwischen Regionen"],"pt":["Automatizar o hospedagem de sites estáticos no S3","Configurar backup e arquivamento de dados com controle de versão e políticas de ciclo de vida","Implementar biblioteca de mídia e origem de CDN com replicação entre regiões"],"ru":["Автоматизировать размещение статических веб-сайтов на S3","Настроить резервное копирование и архивирование данных с помощью контроля версий и политик жизненного цикла","Реализовать медиабиблиотеку и источник CDN с межрегиональной репликацией"],"ar":["توفير استضافة مواقع الويب الثابتة على S3","تكوين النسخ الاحتياطي والأرشفة للبيانات مع مراقبة الإصدارات وسياسات دورة الحياة","تنفيذ مكتبة الوسائط ومصدر CDN مع التكرار عبر المناطق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AWS Account and S3 Access","Dependent on AWS S3 Service Limits and Pricing"],"zh":["需要AWS账户和S3访问权限","依赖于AWS S3服务限制和定价"],"ja":["AWSアカウントとS3へのｱｸｾｽが必要","AWS S3サービスの制限と料金に依存"],"ko":["AWS 계정 및 S3 액세스가 필요","AWS S3 서비스 제한 및 요금에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de AWS y acceso a S3","Dependiente de los límites de servicio y precios de AWS S3"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte AWS et un accès à S3","Dépend des limites de service et des tarifs de AWS S3"],"de":["Benötigt ein AWS-Konto und Zugriff auf S3","Abhängig von den Service-Grenzwerten und Preisen von AWS S3"],"pt":["Exige Conta da AWS e Acesso ao S3","Dependente dos Limites de Serviço e Preços da AWS S3"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи AWS и доступа к S3","Зависит от ограничений сервиса и цен AWS S3"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب AWS ووصول إلى S3","يعتمد على حدود الخدمة وأسعار AWS S3"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
