ce開発のためのベストプラクティスガイド。Lightning Web Component、Bulkified Apex Trigger、Queueable Apexを包含","ko":"Salesforce 개발 가이드. Lightning Web Component, Bulkified Apex Trigger, Queueable Apex 등을 포함","es":"Desarrollo de Salesforce implica patrones como componentes web de Lightning y Apex para una integración eficiente","fr":"Le développement Salesforce implique des modèles tels que les composants Web Lightning et Apex pour une intégration efficace","de":"Salesforce-Entwicklung umfasst Muster wie Lightning-Web-Komponenten und Apex für eine effiziente Integration","pt":"O desenvolvimento Salesforce envolve padrões e práticas específicas, como o uso de Lightning Web Component e Apex Trigger","ru":"Разработка Salesforce предполагает использование определенных шаблонов и практик, таких как Lightning Web Component и Apex Trigger","ar":"يتضمن تطوير Salesforce أنماطًا وممارسات محددة، مثل Lightning Web Component و Apex Trigger","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Lightning Web Component","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Wire Service","Handler Pattern","Reactive Data Binding"],"ja":["Lightning Web Component","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Wire Service","Handler Pattern","リアクティブデータバインディング"],"ko":["Lightning Web Component","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Wire Service","Handler Pattern","반응형 데이터 바인딩"],"es":["Componentes web de Lightning con servicio de cable","Disparadores de Apex a granel con patrón de controlador","Cola de Apex para procesamiento asíncrono","Enlace de datos reactivo con Lightning Data Service","Optimización del rendimiento de Salesforce"],"fr":["Composants Web Lightning avec service de fil","Déclencheurs Apex à granel avec modèle de gestionnaire","File d''attente Apex pour le traitement asynchrone","Liaison de données réactive avec Lightning Data Service","Optimisation des performances Salesforce"],"de":["Lightning-Web-Komponenten mit Wire-Service","Bulk-Apex-Trigger mit Handler-Muster","Apex-Warteschlange für asynchronen Prozess","Reaktive Datenbindung mit Lightning Data Service","Salesforce-Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Lightning Web Component com Wire Service","Apex Trigger em massa com padrão de manipulador","Queueable Apex para processamento em segundo plano","Reativo de dados com Lightning Data Service","Separação de preocupações com padrão de manipulador"],"ru":["Lightning Web Component с Wire Service","Apex Trigger в массе с шаблоном обработчика","Queueable Apex для фоновой обработки","Реактивность данных с Lightning Data Service","Разделение проблем с шаблоном обработчика"],"ar":["Lightning Web Component مع Wire Service","Apex Trigger بالجملة مع نمط المعالج","Queueable Apex للمعالجة في الخلفية","تفاعل البيانات مع Lightning Data Service","فصل الاهتمامات بنمط المعالج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce开发","Lightning Web Component","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforce性能优化","Apex开发","Salesforce平台"],"ja":["Salesforce開発","Lightning Web Component","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforceパフォーマンス最適化","Apex開発","Salesforceプラットフォーム"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발","Lightning Web Component","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforce 성능 최적화","Apex 개발","Salesforce 플랫폼"],"es":["desarrollo de Salesforce","componentes web de Lightning","Apex","servicio de cable","disparadores a granel","patrón de controlador"],"fr":["développement Salesforce","composants Web Lightning","Apex","service de fil","déclencheurs à granel","modèle de gestionnaire"],"de":["Salesforce-Entwicklung","Lightning-Web-Komponenten","Apex","Wire-Service","Bulk-Trigger","Handler-Muster"],"pt":["desenvolvimento salesforce","lightning web component","apex trigger","queueable apex","salesforce performance","desenvolvimento de soluções salesforce"],"ru":["разработка salesforce","lightning web component","apex trigger","queueable apex","производительность salesforce","разработка решений salesforce"],"ar":["تطوير salesforce","lightning web component","apex trigger","queueable apex","أداء salesforce","تطوير حلول salesforce"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"salesforce-development","description":"Expert patterns for Salesforce platform development including Lightning Web Components (LWC), Apex triggers and classes, REST/Bulk APIs, Connected Apps, and Salesforce DX with scratch orgs and 2nd generation packages (2GP). Use when: salesforce, sfdc, apex, lwc, lightning web components.","bodyPreview":"# Salesforce Development\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Lightning Web Component with Wire Service\n\nUse @wire decorator for reactive data binding with Lightning Data Service\nor Apex methods. @wire fits LWC''s reactive architecture and enables\nSalesforce performance optimizations.\n\n\n### Bulkified Apex Trigger with Handler Pattern\n\nApex triggers must be bulkified to handle 200+ records per transaction.\nUse handler pattern for separation of concerns, testability, and\nrecursion prevention.\n\n\n### Queueable Apex for","body":"# Salesforce Development\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Lightning Web Component with Wire Service\n\nUse @wire decorator for reactive data binding with Lightning Data Service\nor Apex methods. @wire fits LWC''s reactive architecture and enables\nSalesforce performance optimizations.\n\n\n### Bulkified Apex Trigger with Handler Pattern\n\nApex triggers must be bulkified to handle 200+ records per transaction.\nUse handler pattern for separation of concerns, testability, and\nrecursion prevention.\n\n\n### Queueable Apex for Async Processing\n\nUse Queueable Apex for async processing with support for non-primitive\ntypes, monitoring via AsyncApexJob, and job chaining. Limit: 50 jobs\nper transaction, 1 child job when chaining.\n\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ SOQL Inside Loops\n\n### ❌ DML Inside Loops\n\n### ❌ Hardcoding IDs\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:58:06.044Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Integration Agents needing advanced Salesforce customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Salesforce定制功能的云集成代理。","ja":"高度なSalesforceのカスタマイズ機能を必要とするクラウド統合エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Salesforce 사용자 정의 기능이 필요한 클라우드 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de integración en la nube que necesitan capacidades de personalización avanzadas de Salesforce.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intégration cloud nécessitant des capacités de personnalisation avancées de Salesforce.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Integration-Agents, die erweiterte Salesforce-Anpassungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração de Nuvem que precisam de capacidades de personalização avançadas do Salesforce.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции облачных сервисов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности настройки Salesforce.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتكاملين مع السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تعديل متقدمة من Salesforce."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Lightning Web Components with Wire Service for reactive data binding, utilizing Apex methods and Lightning Data Service for optimized performance, and implementing bulkified Apex triggers with handler patterns for enhanced scalability and testability.","zh":"赋予代理使用Lightning Web Components与Wire Service进行反应式数据绑定，利用Apex方法和Lightning Data Service进行优化性能，并使用批量化Apex触发器和处理程序模式实现增强的可扩展性和可测试性。","ja":"エージェントがLightning Web ComponentsとWire Serviceを使用してリアクティブなデータバインディングを行い、アペックスメソッドとLightning Data Serviceを使用してパフォーマンスを最適化し、バルク化されたアペックストリガーとハンドラーパターンを使用してスケーラビリティとテスト性を高めることを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Lightning Web Components와 Wire Service를 사용하여 반응형 데이터 바인딩을 수행하고, Apex 메소드와 Lightning Data Service를 사용하여 성능을 최적화하며, 벌크 처리된 Apex 트리거와 핸들러 패턴을 사용하여 확장성과 테스트성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar los componentes web de Lightning con el servicio Wire para la vinculación de datos reactiva, utilizando métodos Apex y el servicio de datos de Lightning para un rendimiento optimizado, y implementando desencadenadores Apex en bloque con patrones de controladores para una escalabilidad y pruebas mejoradas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les composants Web Lightning avec le service Wire pour le binding de données réactif, en utilisant des méthodes Apex et le service de données Lightning pour des performances optimisées, et en mettant en œuvre des déclencheurs Apex en bloc avec des modèles de gestionnaires pour une évolutivité et une testabilité améliorées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Lightning-Web-Komponenten mit Wire-Service für reaktive Datenbindung zu nutzen, Apex-Methoden und Lightning Data Service für optimierte Leistung zu verwenden und bulkifizierte Apex-Trigger mit Handler-Mustern für verbesserte Skalierbarkeit und Testbarkeit zu implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem os Componentes Web Lightning com o Serviço Wire para ligação de dados reativa, utilizando métodos Apex e o Serviço de Dados Lightning para desempenho otimizado, e implementando gatilhos Apex em massa com padrões de manipulador para escalabilidade e testabilidade aprimoradas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать компоненты Lightning Web с сервисом Wire для реактивного связывания данных, использовать методы Apex и службу данных Lightning для оптимизированной производительности, а также реализовывать массовые триггеры Apex с шаблонами обработчиков для повышения масштабируемости и тестируемости.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من مكونات الويب Lightning مع خدمة الوصل لربط البيانات التفاعلي، واستخدام أساليب Apex وخدمة بيانات Lightning لأداء محسّن، وتنفيذ معالجات Apex بالجملة مع أنماط المعالج لتحسين القابلية للتوسيع والاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom Lightning Web Components with @wire decorator","Implementing bulkified Apex triggers for large-scale data processing","Utilizing Queueable Apex for asynchronous operations and recursion prevention"],"zh":["使用@wire装饰器开发自定义Lightning Web Components","为大规模数据处理实现批量化Apex触发器","使用Queueable Apex进行异步操作和递归防止"],"ja":["@wireデコレーターを使用してカスタムLightning Web Componentsを開発する","大規模なデータ処理のためにバルク化されたアペックストリガーを実装する","Queueable Apexを使用して非同期操作と再帰防止を行う"],"ko":["@wire 데코레이터를 사용하여 사용자 정의 Lightning Web Components를 개발하는 것","대규모 데이터 처리를 위한 벌크 처리된 Apex 트리거 구현","Queueable Apex를 사용하여 비동기 연산과 재귀 방지"],"es":["Desarrollar componentes web personalizados de Lightning con decorador @wire","Implementar desencadenadores Apex en bloque para el procesamiento de datos a gran escala","Utilizar Queueable Apex para operaciones asíncronas y prevención de recursividad"],"fr":["Développer des composants Web Lightning personnalisés avec le décorateur @wire","Mettre en œuvre des déclencheurs Apex en bloc pour le traitement de données à grande échelle","Utiliser Queueable Apex pour les opérations asynchrones et la prévention de la récursivité"],"de":["Entwickeln von benutzerdefinierten Lightning-Web-Komponenten mit @wire-Decorator","Implementieren von bulkifizierten Apex-Trigger für die Verarbeitung großer Datenmengen","Verwenden von Queueable Apex für asynchrone Operationen und Verhinderung von Rekursion"],"pt":["Desenvolver componentes personalizados Lightning Web com decorador @wire","Implementar gatilhos Apex em massa para processamento de dados em larga escala","Utilizar Queueable Apex para operações assíncronas e prevenção de recursividade"],"ru":["Разработка пользовательских компонентов Lightning Web с декоратором @wire","Реализация массовых триггеров Apex для обработки больших объемов данных","Использование Queueable Apex для асинхронных операций и предотвращения рекурсии"],"ar":["تطوير مكونات الويب Lightning المخصصة مع زين @wire","تنفيذ معالجات Apex بالجملة لمعالجة البيانات على نطاق واسع","استخدام Queueable Apex للعمليات غير المتزامنة ومنع التكرار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Salesforce developer edition or higher","Apex programming knowledge necessary","Limited to 200+ records per transaction for bulkified Apex triggers"],"zh":["需要Salesforce开发者版或更高版本","需要Apex编程知识","批量化Apex触发器每次事务限制200+记录"],"ja":["Salesforce開発者エディション以上が必要","アペックスプログラミングの知識が必要","バルク化されたアペックストリガーはトランザクションごとに200件以上のレコードに制限される"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발자 에디션 이상이 필요합니다","Apex 프로그래밍 지식이 필요합니다","벌크 처리된 Apex 트리거는 트랜잭션당 200개 이상의 레코드로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere edición de desarrollador de Salesforce o superior","Conocimiento de programación Apex necesario","Limitado a 200+ registros por transacción para desencadenadores Apex en bloque"],"fr":["Nécessite l''édition développeur de Salesforce ou supérieure","Connaissances de programmation Apex nécessaires","Limité à 200+ enregistrements par transaction pour les déclencheurs Apex en bloc"],"de":["Benötigt Salesforce-Entwickleredition oder höher","Apex-Programmierkenntnisse erforderlich","Begrenzt auf 200+ Datensätze pro Transaktion für bulkifizierte Apex-Trigger"],"pt":["Requer edição de desenvolvedor do Salesforce ou superior","Conhecimento de programação Apex necessário","Limitado a 200+ registros por transação para gatilhos Apex em massa"],"ru":["Требуется издание разработчика Salesforce или выше","Необходимо знание программирования на Apex","Ограничено 200+ записями на транзакцию для массовых триггеров Apex"],"ar":["يتطلب طبعة المطور من Salesforce أو أعلى","معرفة برمجة Apex ضرورية","محدود بـ 200+ سجل في المعاملات للمعالجات Apex بالجملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
