"ko":"스킬 업데이트는 지침을 명확하고 간결하게 유지하고, 중복과 혼란을 피하여 업데이트 프로세스를 원활하게 유지하는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"La actualización de habilidades de agente implica leer y editar archivos de habilidades y agentes para mantener la claridad y la concisión","fr":"La mise à jour des compétences d''agent consiste à lire et à éditer les fichiers de compétences et d''agents pour maintenir la clarté et la concision","de":"Die Aktualisierung von Agentenfähigkeiten beinhaltet das Lesen und Bearbeiten von Fähigkeits- und Agentendateien, um Klarheit und Prägnanz zu bewahren","pt":"O update-skill é uma habilidade que ajuda a manter as instruções claras e concisas ao atualizar arquivos como SKILL.md e AGENTS.md.","ru":"Обновление навыков - это способность, которая помогает поддерживать инструкции краткими и ясными при обновлении файлов, таких как SKILL.md и AGENTS.md.","ar":"تحديث المهارات هو مهارة تساعد على الحفاظ على الإرشادات واضحة وموجزة عند تحديث الملفات مثل SKILL.md و AGENTS.md.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["保持指令简洁清晰","避免重复和混乱","确保更新流程顺畅","支持SKILL.md和AGENTS.md文件更新","逻辑性地放置更改","删除或合并重复内容"],"ja":["指示を簡潔かつ明確に保つ","重複や混乱を避ける","更新フローをスムーズに保つ","SKILL.mdとAGENTS.mdファイルの更新をサポート","変更を論理的に配置する","重複内容を削除または統合する"],"ko":["지침을 명확하고 간결하게 유지","중복과 혼란을 피한다","업데이트 프로세스를 원활하게 유지","SKILL.md와 AGENTS.md 파일 업데이트를 지원","변경을 논리적으로 배치","중복된 내용을 삭제 또는 병합"],"es":["Lectura de archivos de habilidades y agentes","Edición de archivos para mejorar la claridad","Eliminación de contenido duplicado","Integración de actualizaciones en el flujo de habilidades","Mantenimiento de la concisión y la claridad"],"fr":["Lecture de fichiers de compétences et d''agents","Édition de fichiers pour améliorer la clarté","Élimination de contenu dupliqué","Intégration de mises à jour dans le flux de compétences","Maintenance de la concision et de la clarté"],"de":["Lesevorgang für Fähigkeits- und Agentendateien","Bearbeitung von Dateien zur Verbesserung der Klarheit","Entfernung von doppeltem Inhalt","Integrierung von Aktualisierungen in den Fähigkeitsfluss","Beibehaltung von Prägnanz und Klarheit"],"pt":["Leitura completa do arquivo de habilidade antes da edição","Leitura de arquivos relacionados antes da edição","Colocação de alterações onde elas logicamente pertencem","Remoção ou mesclagem de instruções duplicadas","Manutenção de instruções claras e concisas"],"ru":["Полное чтение файла навыка перед редактированием","Чтение связанных файлов перед редактированием","Размещение изменений там, где они логически принадлежат","Удаление или слияние дублирующихся инструкций","Поддержание инструкций краткими и ясными"],"ar":["قراءة كاملة لملف المهارة قبل التعديل","قراءة الملفات المرتبطة قبل التعديل","وضع التغييرات حيث تنتمي منطقيًا","إزالة أو دمج الإرشادات المكررة","الحفاظ على الإرشادات واضحة وموجزة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["更新技能","指令更新","SKILL.md","AGENTS.md","简洁清晰","避免重复","更新流程","逻辑性放置","删除重复内容"],"ja":["スキル更新","指示更新","SKILL.md","AGENTS.md","簡潔かつ明確","重複避け","更新フロー","論理的な配置","重複内容削除"],"ko":["스킬 업데이트","지침 업데이트","SKILL.md","AGENTS.md","명확하고 간결","중복 피하기","업데이트 프로세스","논리적인 배치","중복된 내용 삭제"],"es":["actualización de habilidades de agente","edición de archivos de habilidades","agentes de software","desarrollo de habilidades","eficiencia en la edición","claridad en la documentación"],"fr":["mise à jour des compétences d''agent","édition de fichiers de compétences","agents de logiciel","développement de compétences","efficacité dans l''édition","clarté dans la documentation"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Agentenfähigkeiten","Bearbeitung von Fähigkeitsdateien","Software-Agenten","Fähigkeitsentwicklung","Effizienz bei der Bearbeitung","Klarheit in der Dokumentation"],"pt":["atualização de habilidades","otimização de habilidades","desenvolvimento de habilidades","fluxo de habilidades","instruções claras","concisão em habilidades"],"ru":["обновление навыков","оптимизация навыков","разработка навыков","поток навыков","ясные инструкции","краткость в навыках"],"ar":["تحديث المهارات","تحسين المهارات","تطوير المهارات","تدفق المهارات","إرشادات واضحة","الاجمال في المهارات"]}},"owner":"fredeschmidt","repo":"byg-nemt-selv","repoPath":"fredeschmidt/byg-nemt-selv","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update-skill","description":"Update existing skills while keeping them simple, coherent, and non-duplicative; always recommend the best placement for new rules.","bodyPreview":"# Update Skill\n\nUse this skill when a user asks to update `SKILL.md` or `AGENTS.md` and wants the result cleaner without losing intent.\n\n## Goal\n\nKeep instructions short, clear, and non-duplicative.\nIntegrate updates into the full skill flow, not as isolated add-ons.\n\n## Required Rules\n\n1. Read the whole target skill file before editing.\n2. Read relevant related files (for example `AGENTS.md`) before editing.\n3. Place changes where they logically belong; do not append blindly.\n4. Remove or merge","body":"# Update Skill\n\nUse this skill when a user asks to update `SKILL.md` or `AGENTS.md` and wants the result cleaner without losing intent.\n\n## Goal\n\nKeep instructions short, clear, and non-duplicative.\nIntegrate updates into the full skill flow, not as isolated add-ons.\n\n## Required Rules\n\n1. Read the whole target skill file before editing.\n2. Read relevant related files (for example `AGENTS.md`) before editing.\n3. Place changes where they logically belong; do not append blindly.\n4. Remove or merge overlaps and repeated wording.\n5. Keep sections short, headings predictable, and language direct.\n6. Preserve behavioral intent when refactoring.\n\n## Placement Decision (Mandatory)\n\nRecommend the best location before editing, even if the user named a file.\n\nChoose in this order:\n\n1. Existing skill, existing section (best).\n2. Existing skill, new section (if concept is new but belongs there).\n3. Different existing skill (if concern belongs elsewhere).\n4. New skill (only if reusable and it does not fit existing skills cleanly).\n\nIf the requested file is a poor fit, state:\n1. Why it is a mismatch.\n2. Which file is better.\n3. Whether to move or duplicate (default: move).\n\nRecommend a new skill only when all are true:\n1. The rule is reusable across multiple skills.\n2. It defines a distinct workflow.\n3. Adding it to an existing skill would cause clutter.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Parse the requested update.\n2. Read all relevant file(s) end-to-end.\n3. Identify duplication, conflicts, and wording drift.\n4. Give placement recommendation with rationale.\n5. Apply edit in the chosen location.\n6. Refactor nearby text for flow and consistency.\n7. Run a cleanup pass: deduplicate, normalize terms, tighten sections.\n8. Report outcome clearly.\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nReport:\n\n1. Placement recommendation and reason.\n2. Files changed.\n3. Cleanup performed.\n4. Remaining ambiguity and recommended next step.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:59:07.391Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing to refine and update skill files efficiently.","zh":"非常适合像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI 代理，需要高效地改进和更新技能文件。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに最適で、スキル ファイルを効率的に改良および更新する必要があります。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 효율적으로 스킬 파일을 개선하고 업데이트할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan refinar y actualizar archivos de habilidades de manera eficiente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code qui ont besoin d''affiner et de mettre à jour des fichiers de compétences de manière efficace.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die ihre Fähigkeitsdateien effizient verfeinern und aktualisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing to refine and update skill files efficiently.","ru":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing to refine and update skill files efficiently.","ar":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing to refine and update skill files efficiently."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate updates seamlessly into skill flows, ensuring instructions remain concise and non-duplicative by reading and editing target files like `SKILL.md` and related files such as `AGENTS.md`, and applying changes logically without append-only approaches.","zh":"使代理能够无缝地将更新集成到技能流中，通过读取和编辑目标文件（如 `SKILL.md` 和相关文件 `AGENTS.md`），确保指令简洁明了且不重复，并以逻辑方式应用更改，而不是仅追加方法。","ja":"エージェントが更新をスキル フローにシームレスに統合できるようにし、ターゲット ファイル (`SKILL.md` や関連ファイル `AGENTS.md` など) を読み込み編集し、指示が簡潔で重複しないことを保証し、論理的に変更を適用して追加専用のアプローチを回避します。","ko":"에이전트가 업데이트를 스킬 흐름에无缝하게 통합할 수 있도록 하며, 대상 파일(`SKILL.md` 및 관련 파일 `AGENTS.md` 등)을 읽고 편집하여 지시가 간결하고 중복되지 않음을 보장하며, 논리적으로 변경을 적용하여 추가 전용 접근 방식을 피합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes integrar actualizaciones de manera fluida en los flujos de habilidades, asegurando que las instrucciones sigan siendo concisas y no duplicadas al leer y editar archivos de destino como `SKILL.md` y archivos relacionados como `AGENTS.md`, y aplicar cambios de manera lógica sin enfoques de solo agregar.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer des mises à jour de manière transparente dans les flux de compétences, en veillant à ce que les instructions restent concises et non redondantes en lisant et en éditant des fichiers cibles comme `SKILL.md` et des fichiers associés comme `AGENTS.md`, et en appliquant des modifications de manière logique sans approches d''ajout uniquement.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Updates nahtlos in die Fähigkeitsflüsse zu integrieren, indem sichergestellt wird, dass die Anweisungen präzise und nicht dupliziert bleiben, indem Zieldateien wie `SKILL.md` und verwandte Dateien wie `AGENTS.md` gelesen und bearbeitet werden und Änderungen logisch ohne Append-only-Ansätze angewendet werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to integrate updates seamlessly into skill flows, ensuring instructions remain concise and non-duplicative by reading and editing target files like `SKILL.md` and related files such as `AGENTS.md`, and applying changes logically without append-only approaches.","ru":"Empowers agents to integrate updates seamlessly into skill flows, ensuring instructions remain concise and non-duplicative by reading and editing target files like `SKILL.md` and related files such as `AGENTS.md`, and applying changes logically without append-only approaches.","ar":"Empowers agents to integrate updates seamlessly into skill flows, ensuring instructions remain concise and non-duplicative by reading and editing target files like `SKILL.md` and related files such as `AGENTS.md`, and applying changes logically without append-only approaches."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining `SKILL.md` files for clarity","Updating `AGENTS.md` with new agent information","Merging redundant instructions in skill files"],"zh":["改进 `SKILL.md` 文件以提高清晰度","使用新代理信息更新 `AGENTS.md`","合并技能文件中的冗余指令"],"ja":["スキル ファイルの明確性のために `SKILL.md` を改良する","新しいエージェント情報で `AGENTS.md` を更新する","スキル ファイルの冗長な指示を統合する"],"ko":["클래스 파일의 명확성을 위해 `SKILL.md`를 개선합니다","새 에이전트 정보로 `AGENTS.md`를 업데이트합니다","스킬 파일의 중복된 지시를 병합합니다"],"es":["Refinar archivos `SKILL.md` para mayor claridad","Actualizar `AGENTS.md` con nueva información de agentes","Combinar instrucciones redundantes en archivos de habilidades"],"fr":["Affiner les fichiers `SKILL.md` pour plus de clarté","Mettre à jour `AGENTS.md` avec de nouvelles informations d''agents","Fusionner des instructions redondantes dans les fichiers de compétences"],"de":["Fähigkeitsdateien `SKILL.md` für bessere Klarheit verfeinern","`AGENTS.md` mit neuen Agenteninformationen aktualisieren","Redundante Anweisungen in Fähigkeitsdateien zusammenführen"],"pt":["Refining `SKILL.md` files for clarity","Updating `AGENTS.md` with new agent information","Merging redundant instructions in skill files"],"ru":["Refining `SKILL.md` files for clarity","Updating `AGENTS.md` with new agent information","Merging redundant instructions in skill files"],"ar":["Refining `SKILL.md` files for clarity","Updating `AGENTS.md` with new agent information","Merging redundant instructions in skill files"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to skill files like `SKILL.md` and `AGENTS.md`","Needs understanding of file structure and content flow"],"zh":["需要访问类似 `SKILL.md` 和 `AGENTS.md` 的技能文件","需要了解文件结构和内容流"],"ja":["`SKILL.md` や `AGENTS.md` などのスキル ファイルへのアクセスが必要","ファイル構造やコンテンツ フローの理解が必要"],"ko":["`SKILL.md` 및 `AGENTS.md`와 같은 스킬 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","파일 구조 및 콘텐츠 흐름에 대한 이해가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de habilidades como `SKILL.md` y `AGENTS.md`","Necesita comprensión de la estructura del archivo y del flujo de contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de compétences comme `SKILL.md` et `AGENTS.md`","Nécessite une compréhension de la structure du fichier et du flux de contenu"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Fähigkeitsdateien wie `SKILL.md` und `AGENTS.md`","Benötigt Verständnis der Dateistruktur und des Inhaltsflusses"],"pt":["Requires access to skill files like `SKILL.md` and `AGENTS.md`","Needs understanding of file structure and content flow"],"ru":["Requires access to skill files like `SKILL.md` and `AGENTS.md`","Needs understanding of file structure and content flow"],"ar":["Requires access to skill files like `SKILL.md` and `AGENTS.md`","Needs understanding of file structure and content flow"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
