"fr":"L''outil agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-mkdir permet aux développeurs de créer des répertoires dans un environnement de sandbox de manière efficace","de":"Das Tool agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-mkdir ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Verzeichnisse in einer Sandbox-Umgebung effizient zu erstellen","pt":"O comando Agentuity CLI Cloud Sandbox Mkdir permite criar diretórios em um sandbox. Ele é usado para organizar projetos em nuvem.","ru":"Команда Agentuity CLI Облако Песочница Mkdir позволяет создавать директории в песочнице. Она используется для организации облачных проектов.","ar":"الأمر Agentuity CLI ساند بوكس الغيوم mkdir يسمح بإنشاء المجلدات في ساند بوكس. يستخدم لتنظيم مشاريع السحابة.","en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"definition":{"en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"features":{"es":["Crea directorios en un entorno de sandbox","Autenticación mediante agentuity auth login","Requiere contexto de organización","Soporte para opciones de línea de comandos","Compatibilidad con sandbox de cloud"],"fr":["Crée des répertoires dans un environnement de sandbox","Authentification via agentuity auth login","Nécessite un contexte d''organisation","Prise en charge des options de ligne de commande","Compatibilité avec les sandbox de cloud"],"de":["Erstellt Verzeichnisse in einer Sandbox-Umgebung","Authentifizierung über agentuity auth login","Benötigt Organisationskontext","Unterstützung für Befehlszeilenoptionen","Kompatibilität mit Cloud-Sandbox"],"pt":["Criação de diretórios em sandbox","Organização de projetos em nuvem","Uso do comando mkdir","Requer autenticação com `agentuity auth login`","Requer contexto de organização (`--org-id` ou org padrão)"],"ru":["Создание директорий в песочнице","Организация облачных проектов","Использование команды mkdir","Требуется аутентификация с `agentuity auth login`","Требуется контекст организации (`--org-id` или дефолтная орг)"],"ar":["إنشاء المجلدات في ساند بوكس","تنظيم مشاريع السحابة","استخدام الأمر mkdir","يتطلب المصادقة مع `agentuity auth login`","يتطلب سياق المنظمة (`--org-id` أو المنظمة الافتراضية)"]},"keywords":{"es":["agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-mkdir","sandbox de cloud","herramienta de línea de comandos","desarrollo de software","entorno de sandbox","autenticación","organización","opciones de línea de comandos"],"fr":["agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-mkdir","sandbox de cloud","outil de ligne de commande","développement de logiciels","environnement de sandbox","authentification","organisation","options de ligne de commande"],"de":["agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-mkdir","Cloud-Sandbox","Befehlszeilen-Tool","Software-Entwicklung","Sandbox-Umgebung","Authentifizierung","Organisation","Befehlszeilenoptionen"],"pt":["Agentuity CLI","Cloud Sandbox","Mkdir","Criação de diretórios","Organização de projetos em nuvem","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Agentuity CLI","Облако Песочница","Mkdir","Создание директорий","Организация облачных проектов","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Agentuity CLI","ساند بوكس الغيوم","mkdir","إنشاء المجلدات","تنظيم مشاريع السحابة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"agentuity","repo":"sdk-explorer","repoPath":"agentuity/sdk-explorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-mkdir","description":"Create a directory in a sandbox. Requires authentication. Use for Agentuity cloud platform operations","version":"0.1.2","tags":"slow requires-auth","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Sandbox Mkdir\n\nCreate a directory in a sandbox\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Organization context required (`--org-id` or default org)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud sandbox mkdir <sandboxId> <path> [options]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<sandboxId>` | string | Yes | - |\n| `<path>` | string | Yes | - |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default | Description |","body":"# Cloud Sandbox Mkdir\n\nCreate a directory in a sandbox\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Organization context required (`--org-id` or default org)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud sandbox mkdir <sandboxId> <path> [options]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<sandboxId>` | string | Yes | - |\n| `<path>` | string | Yes | - |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--parents` | boolean | No | `false` | Create parent directories as needed |\n\n## Examples\n\nCreate a directory in the sandbox:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud sandbox mkdir sbx_abc123 /path/to/dir\n```\n\nCreate nested directories recursively:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud sandbox mkdir sbx_abc123 /path/to/nested/dir -p\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": \"boolean\",\n  \"path\": \"string\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `success` | boolean | - |\n| `path` | string | - |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:59:05.715Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing sandbox directory creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要沙盒目录创建功能的云管理代理。","ja":"サンドボックスディレクトリ作成機能を必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"샌드박스 디렉토리 생성 기능이 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión en la nube que necesitan capacidades de creación de directorios de sandbox.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion cloud ayant besoin de capacités de création de répertoires de sandbox.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Management-Agents, die Sandbox-Verzeichniserstellungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades de criação de diretórios de sandbox.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления облаком, которым необходимы возможности создания директорий sandbox.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة السحاب التي تحتاج إلى قدرات إنشاء دليل حماية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create directories in sandboxes using the Agentuity platform, leveraging authenticated sessions and organization context with options like --org-id for seamless integration with cloud sandbox environments.","zh":"赋予代理在沙盒中使用Agentuity平台创建目录的能力，利用经过身份验证的会话和组织上下文，具有诸如--org-id等选项，以实现与云沙盒环境的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに、Agentuityプラットフォームを使用してサンドボックス内でディレクトリを作成する能力を与え、認証されたセッションと組織コンテキストを利用し、--org-idなどのオプションを備えて、クラウドサンドボックス環境とのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 에이전투티 플랫폼을 사용하여 샌드박스에서 디렉토리를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 인증된 세션과 조직 contexto를 활용하고, --org-id와 같은 옵션을 제공하여 클라우드 샌드박스 환경과无缝な 통합을实现합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear directorios en sandbox utilizando la plataforma Agentuity, aprovechando sesiones autenticadas y contexto de organización con opciones como --org-id para una integración sin problemas con entornos de sandbox en la nube.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des répertoires dans des sandbox en utilisant la plateforme Agentuity, en exploitant les sessions authentifiées et le contexte d''organisation avec des options comme --org-id pour une intégration transparente avec les environnements de sandbox cloud.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Verzeichnisse in Sandboxes mithilfe der Agentuity-Plattform zu erstellen, indem authentifizierte Sitzungen und Organisationskontext mit Optionen wie --org-id für eine nahtlose Integration mit Cloud-Sandbox-Umgebungen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar diretórios em sandboxes usando a plataforma Agentuity, aproveitando sessões autenticadas e contexto de organização com opções como --org-id para integração transparente com ambientes de sandbox em nuvem.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать директории в sandbox с помощью платформы Agentuity, используя аутентифицированные сеансы и контекст организации с опциями типа --org-id для бесшовной интеграции с облачными sandbox-окружениями.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء دلایل في حماية باستخدام منصة Agentuity، واستغلال الجلسات المُصادقة وسياق المنظمة مع خيارات مثل --org-id من أجل التكامل السلس مع بيئات حماية السحاب."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing sandbox environments","Organizing cloud storage","Automating directory structures"],"zh":["初始化沙盒环境","组织云存储","自动化目录结构"],"ja":["サンドボックス環境の初期化","クラウドストレージの整理","ディレクトリ構造の自動化"],"ko":["샌드박스 환경 초기화","클라우드 스토리지 조직","디렉토리 구조 자동화"],"es":["Inicialización de entornos de sandbox","Organización de almacenamiento en la nube","Automatización de estructuras de directorios"],"fr":["Initialisation des environnements de sandbox","Organisation du stockage cloud","Automatisation des structures de répertoires"],"de":["Initialisierung von Sandbox-Umgebungen","Organisation von Cloud-Speicher","Automatisierung von Verzeichnisstrukturen"],"pt":["Inicialização de ambientes de sandbox","Organização de armazenamento em nuvem","Automação de estruturas de diretórios"],"ru":["Инициализация sandbox-окружений","Организация облачного хранилища","Автоматизация структуры директорий"],"ar":["تثبيت بيئات حماية","تنظيم تخزين السحاب","أتمتة هياكل الدلایل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires authentication with agentuity auth login","Organization context required","Limited to Agentuity platform"],"zh":["需要使用agentuity auth login进行身份验证","需要组织上下文","仅限于Agentuity平台"],"ja":["agentuity auth loginでの認証が必要","組織コンテキストが必要","Agentuityプラットフォームでのみ使用可能"],"ko":["에이전투티 인증 로그인으로 인증이 필요","조직 contexto가 필요","에이전투티 플랫폼에서만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere autenticación con agentuity auth login","Se requiere contexto de organización","Limitado a la plataforma Agentuity"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification avec agentuity auth login","Contexte d''organisation requis","Limité à la plateforme Agentuity"],"de":["Erfordert Authentifizierung mit agentuity auth login","Organisationskontext erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Agentuity-Plattform"],"pt":["Exige autenticação com login de autenticação da Agentuity","Contexto de organização necessário","Limitado à plataforma Agentuity"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации с помощью входа в систему Agentuity","Необходим контекст организации","Ограничен платформой Agentuity"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة بlogin مصادق Agentuity","مطلوب سياق المنظمة","محدود بمنصة Agentuity"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Dknight203/AesopIDE/baoyu-slide-deck', 'community', 'Dknight203', 'AesopIDE', 'Dknight203/AesopIDE', 'baoyu-slide-deck', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z', '2026-02-18T07:58:58.755Z', NULL, '{"id":"Dknight203/AesopIDE/baoyu-slide-deck","name":"baoyu-slide-deck","description":{"zh":"baoyu-slide-deck ","ja":"baoyu","ko":"baoyu ","es":"baoyu-slide-deck es una herramienta que transforma contenido en diapositivas profesionales. Permite personalizar el estilo y el público objetivo","fr":"baoyu-slide-deck est un outil qui transforme du contenu en diapositives professionnelles. Il permet de personnaliser le style et le public cible","de":"baoyu-slide-deck ist ein Tool, das Inhalte in professionelle Präsentationen umwandelt. Es ermöglicht die Anpassung des Stils und der Zielgruppe","pt":"O baoyu-slide-deck é uma ferramenta que transforma conteúdo em imagens de slide deck profissionais. Ele oferece opções de personalização, como estilo e idioma.","ru":"Baoyu-slide-deck - это инструмент, который преобразует контент в профессиональные изображения слайд-шоу. Он предлагает варианты настройки, такие как стиль и язык.","ar":"مُولِد شريحة العرض هو أداة لتحويل المحتوى إلى صور شريحة عرض احترافية. يقدم خيارات تخصيص، مثل الأسلوب واللغة.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"baoyu-slide-deck ","ja":"baoyu","ko":"baoyu","es":"Generador de diapositivas baoyu-slide-deck","fr":"Générateur de diapositives baoyu-slide-deck","de":"Präsentationsgenerator baoyu-slide-deck","pt":"Gerador de Slide Deck - baoyu-slide-deck","ru":"Генератор слайд-шоу - baoyu-slide-deck","ar":"مُولِد شريحة العرض - baoyu-slide-deck","en":"baoyu-slide-deck"},"description":{"zh":"baoyu-slide-deck ","ja":"baoyu","ko":"baoyu ","es":"baoyu-slide-deck es una herramienta que transforma contenido en diapositivas profesionales. Permite personalizar el estilo y el público objetivo","fr":"baoyu-slide-deck est un outil qui transforme du contenu en diapositives professionnelles. Il permet de personnaliser le style et le public cible","de":"baoyu-slide-deck ist ein Tool, das Inhalte in professionelle Präsentationen umwandelt. Es ermöglicht die Anpassung des Stils und der Zielgruppe","pt":"O baoyu-slide-deck é uma ferramenta que transforma conteúdo em imagens de slide deck profissionais. Ele oferece opções de personalização, como estilo e idioma.","ru":"Baoyu-slide-deck - это инструмент, который преобразует контент в профессиональные изображения слайд-шоу. Он предлагает варианты настройки, такие как стиль и ...","ar":"مُولِد شريحة العرض هو أداة لتحويل المحتوى إلى صور شريحة عرض احترافية. يقدم خيارات تخصيص، مثل الأسلوب واللغة.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["MD","UI","10","zh","--style","--audience"],"ja":["MD","UI","10","zh","--style","--audience"],"ko":["MD","UI","10","zh","--style","--audience"],"es":["Transformación de contenido en diapositivas","Personalización del estilo","Selección del público objetivo","Compatibilidad con múltiples idiomas","Opción de generar diapositivas con esquema solo","Posibilidad de especificar el número de diapositivas"],"fr":["Transformation de contenu en diapositives","Personnalisation du style","Sélection du public cible","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langues","Option de générer des diapositives avec schéma seul","Possibilité de spécifier le nombre de diapositives"],"de":["Umwandlung von Inhalten in Präsentationen","Anpassung des Stils","Auswahl der Zielgruppe","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Sprachen","Option, Präsentationen mit Schema nur zu generieren","Möglichkeit, die Anzahl der Präsentationen zu spezifizieren"],"pt":["Geração de slide decks a partir de arquivos Markdown","Opções de personalização, como estilo e idioma","Suporte a vários estilos, incluindo sketch notes","Capacidade de definir o número de slides","Opção de gerar apenas o esboço do slide deck"],"ru":["Генерация слайд-шоу из файлов Markdown","Варианты настройки, такие как стиль и язык","Поддержка нескольких стилей, включая sketch notes","Возможность задать количество слайдов","Опция генерации только контура слайд-шоу"],"ar":["إنشاء شرائح العرض من ملفات ماركداون","خيارات تخصيص، مثل الأسلوب واللغة","دعم أنماط متعددة، بما في ذلك ملاحظات السكتش","قدرة على تحديد عدد الشرائح","خيار إنشاء مخطط شرائح العرض فقط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["baoyu-slide-deck","AesopIDE","Antigravity","UI","MD","10"],"ja":["baoyu","AesopIDE","Antigravity","UI","MD","10"],"ko":["baoyu","AesopIDE","Antigravity","UI","MD","10"],"es":["generador de diapositivas","herramienta de presentación","contenido en diapositivas","personalización de estilo","selección de público objetivo","compatibilidad con idiomas","diapositivas profesionales"],"fr":["générateur de diapositives","outils de présentation","contenu en diapositives","personnalisation de style","sélection du public cible","compatibilité avec les langues","diapositives professionnelles"],"de":["Präsentationsgenerator","Präsentationswerkzeug","Inhalte in Präsentationen","Anpassung des Stils","Auswahl der Zielgruppe","Kompatibilität mit Sprachen","professionelle Präsentationen"],"pt":["gerador de slide deck","baoyu-slide-deck","ferramenta de linha de comando","markdown","slides","apresentação","estilo","idioma"],"ru":["генератор слайд-шоу","baoyu-slide-deck","командный инструмент","markdown","слайды","презентация","стиль","язык"],"ar":["مُولِد شريحة العرض","baoyu-slide-deck","أداة سطر أوامر","ماركداون","شرائح","عرض","أسلوب","لغة"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-slide-deck","description":"Generates professional slide deck images from content. Creates outlines with style instructions, then generates individual slide images. Use when user asks to create slides, make a presentation, generate deck, slide deck, or PPT.","bodyPreview":"# Slide Deck Generator\n\nTransform content into professional slide deck images.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --style sketch-notes\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --audience executives\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --lang zh\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --slides 10\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --outline-only\n/baoyu-slide-deck  # Then paste content\n```\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:","body":"# Slide Deck Generator\n\nTransform content into professional slide deck images.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --style sketch-notes\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --audience executives\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --lang zh\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --slides 10\n/baoyu-slide-deck path/to/content.md --outline-only\n/baoyu-slide-deck  # Then paste content\n```\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/merge-to-pptx.ts` | Merge slides into PowerPoint |\n| `scripts/merge-to-pdf.ts` | Merge slides into PDF |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--style <name>` | Visual style: preset name, `custom`, or custom style name |\n| `--audience <type>` | Target: beginners, intermediate, experts, executives, general |\n| `--lang <code>` | Output language (en, zh, ja, etc.) |\n| `--slides <number>` | Target slide count (8-25 recommended, max 30) |\n| `--outline-only` | Generate outline only, skip image generation |\n| `--prompts-only` | Generate outline + prompts, skip images |\n| `--images-only` | Generate images from existing prompts directory |\n| `--regenerate <N>` | Regenerate specific slide(s): `--regenerate 3` or `--regenerate 2,5,8` |\n\n**Slide Count by Content Length**:\n| Content | Slides |\n|---------|--------|\n| < 1000 words | 5-10 |\n| 1000-3000 words | 10-18 |\n| 3000-5000 words | 15-25 |\n| > 5000 words | 20-30 (consider splitting) |\n\n## Style System\n\n### Presets\n\n| Preset | Dimensions | Best For |\n|--------|------------|----------|\n| `blueprint` (Default) | grid + cool + technical + balanced | Architecture, system design |\n| `chalkboard` | organic + warm + handwritten + balanced | Education, tutorials |\n| `corporate` | clean + professional + geometric + balanced | Investor decks, proposals |\n| `minimal` | clean + neutral + geometric + minimal | Executive briefings |\n| `sketch-notes` | organic + warm + handwritten + balanced | Educational, tutorials |\n| `watercolor` | organic + warm + humanist + minimal | Lifestyle, wellness |\n| `dark-atmospheric` | clean + dark + editorial + balanced | Entertainment, gaming |\n| `notion` | clean + neutral + geometric + dense | Product demos, SaaS |\n| `bold-editorial` | clean + vibrant + editorial + balanced | Product launches, keynotes |\n| `editorial-infographic` | clean + cool + editorial + dense | Tech explainers, research |\n| `fantasy-animation` | organic + vibrant + handwritten + minimal | Educational storytelling |\n| `intuition-machine` | clean + cool + technical + dense | Technical docs, academic |\n| `pixel-art` | pixel + vibrant + technical + balanced | Gaming, developer talks |\n| `scientific` | clean + cool + technical + dense | Biology, chemistry, medical |\n| `vector-illustration` | clean + vibrant + humanist + balanced | Creative, children''s content |\n| `vintage` | paper + warm + editorial + balanced | Historical, heritage |\n\n### Style Dimensions\n\n| Dimension | Options | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| **Texture** | clean, grid, organic, pixel, paper | Visual texture and background treatment |\n| **Mood** | professional, warm, cool, vibrant, dark, neutral | Color temperature and palette style |\n| **Typography** | geometric, humanist, handwritten, editorial, technical | Headline and body text styling |\n| **Density** | minimal, balanced, dense | Information density per slide |\n\nFull specs: `references/dimensions/*.md`\n\n### Auto Style Selection\n\n| Content Signals | Preset |\n|-----------------|--------|\n| tutorial, learn, education, guide, beginner | `sketch-notes` |\n| classroom, teaching, school, chalkboard | `chalkboard` |\n| architecture, system, data, analysis, technical | `blueprint` |\n| creative, children, kids, cute | `vector-illustration` |\n| briefing, academic, research, bilingual | `intuition-machine` |\n| executive, minimal, clean, simple | `minimal` |\n| saas, product, dashboard, metrics | `notion` |\n| investor, quarterly, business, corporate | `corporate` |\n| launch, marketing, keynote, magazine | `bold-editorial` |\n| entertainment, music, gaming, atmospheric | `dark-atmospheric` |\n| explainer, journalism, science communication | `editorial-infographic` |\n| story, fantasy, animation, magical | `fantasy-animation` |\n| gaming, retro, pixel, developer | `pixel-art` |\n| biology, chemistry, medical, scientific | `scientific` |\n| history, heritage, vintage, expedition | `vintage` |\n| lifestyle, wellness, travel, artistic | `watercolor` |\n| Default | `blueprint` |\n\n## Design Philosophy\n\nDecks designed for **reading and sharing**, not live presentation:\n- Each slide self-explanatory without verbal commentary\n- Logical flow when scrolling\n- All necessary context within each slide\n- Optimized for social media sharing\n\nSee `references/design-guidelines.md` for:\n- Audience-specific principles\n- Visual hierarchy\n- Content density guidelines\n- Color and typography selection\n- Font recommendations\n\nSee `references/layouts.md` for layout options.\n\n## File Management\n\n### Output Directory\n\n```\nslide-deck/{topic-slug}/\n├── source-{slug}.{ext}\n├── outline.md\n├── prompts/\n│   └── 01-slide-cover.md, 02-slide-{slug}.md, ...\n├── 01-slide-cover.png, 02-slide-{slug}.png, ...\n├── {topic-slug}.pptx\n└── {topic-slug}.pdf\n```\n\n**Slug**: Extract topic (2-4 words, kebab-case). Example: \"Introduction to Machine Learning\" → `intro-machine-learning`\n\n**Conflict Handling**: See Step 1.3 for existing content detection and user options.\n\n## Language Handling\n\n**Detection Priority**:\n1. `--lang` flag (explicit)\n2. EXTEND.md `language` setting\n3. User''s conversation language (input language)\n4. Source content language\n\n**Rule**: ALL responses use user''s preferred language:\n- Questions and confirmations\n- Progress reports\n- Error messages\n- Completion summaries\n\nTechnical terms (style names, file paths, code) remain in English.\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and check off items as you complete them:\n\n```\nSlide Deck Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Setup & Analyze\n  - [ ] 1.1 Load preferences\n  - [ ] 1.2 Analyze content\n  - [ ] 1.3 Check existing ⚠️ REQUIRED\n- [ ] Step 2: Confirmation ⚠️ REQUIRED (Round 1, optional Round 2)\n- [ ] Step 3: Generate outline\n- [ ] Step 4: Review outline (conditional)\n- [ ] Step 5: Generate prompts\n- [ ] Step 6: Review prompts (conditional)\n- [ ] Step 7: Generate images\n- [ ] Step 8: Merge to PPTX/PDF\n- [ ] Step 9: Output summary\n```\n\n### Flow\n\n```\nInput → Preferences → Analyze → [Check Existing?] → Confirm (1-2 rounds) → Outline → [Review Outline?] → Prompts → [Review Prompts?] → Images → Merge → Complete\n```\n\n### Step 1: Setup & Analyze\n\n**1.1 Load Preferences (EXTEND.md)**\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-slide-deck/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-slide-deck/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-slide-deck/EXTEND.md         │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-slide-deck/EXTEND.md   │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n**When EXTEND.md Found** → Read, parse, **output summary to user**:\n\n```\n📋 Loaded preferences from [full path]\n├─ Style: [preset/custom name]\n├─ Audience: [audience or \"auto-detect\"]\n├─ Language: [language or \"auto-detect\"]\n└─ Review: [enabled/disabled]\n```\n\n**When EXTEND.md Not Found** → First-time setup using AskUserQuestion or proceed with defaults.\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Preferred style | Custom dimensions | Default audience | Language preference | Review preference\n\nSchema: `references/config/preferences-schema.md`\n\n**1.2 Analyze Content**\n\n1. Save source content (if pasted, save as `source.md`)\n2. Follow `references/analysis-framework.md` for content analysis\n3. Analyze content signals for style recommendations\n4. Detect source language\n5. Determine recommended slide count\n6. Generate topic slug from content\n\n**1.3 Check Existing Content** ⚠️ REQUIRED\n\n**MUST execute before proceeding to Step 2.**\n\nUse Bash to check if output directory exists:\n\n```bash\ntest -d \"slide-deck/{topic-slug}\" && echo \"exists\"\n```\n\n**If directory exists**, use AskUserQuestion:\n\n```\nheader: \"Existing\"\nquestion: \"Existing content found. How to proceed?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Regenerate outline\"\n    description: \"Keep images, regenerate outline only\"\n  - label: \"Regenerate images\"\n    description: \"Keep outline, regenerate images only\"\n  - label: \"Backup and regenerate\"\n    description: \"Backup to {slug}-backup-{timestamp}, then regenerate all\"\n  - label: \"Exit\"\n    description: \"Cancel, keep existing content unchanged\"\n```\n\n**Save to `analysis.md`** with:\n- Topic, audience, content signals\n- Recommended style (based on Auto Style Selection)\n- Recommended slide count\n- Language detection\n\n### Step 2: Confirmation ⚠️ REQUIRED\n\n**Two-round confirmation**: Round 1 always, Round 2 only if \"Custom dimensions\" selected.\n\n**Language**: Use user''s input language or saved language preference.\n\n**Display summary**:\n- Content type + topic identified\n- Language: [from EXTEND.md or detected]\n- **Recommended style**: [preset] (based on content signals)\n- **Recommended slides**: [N] (based on content length)\n\n#### Round 1 (Always)\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion** for all 5 questions:\n\n**Question 1: Style**\n```\nheader: \"Style\"\nquestion: \"Which visual style for this deck?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"{recommended_preset} (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"Best match based on content analysis\"\n  - label: \"{alternative_preset}\"\n    description: \"[alternative style description]\"\n  - label: \"Custom dimensions\"\n    description: \"Choose texture, mood, typography, density separately\"\n```\n\n**Question 2: Audience**\n```\nheader: \"Audience\"\nquestion: \"Who is the primary reader?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"General readers (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"Broad appeal, accessible content\"\n  - label: \"Beginners/learners\"\n    description: \"Educational focus, clear explanations\"\n  - label: \"Experts/professionals\"\n    description: \"Technical depth, domain knowledge\"\n  - label: \"Executives\"\n    description: \"High-level insights, minimal detail\"\n```\n\n**Question 3: Slide Count**\n```\nheader: \"Slides\"\nquestion: \"How many slides?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"{N} slides (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"Based on content length\"\n  - label: \"Fewer ({N-3} slides)\"\n    description: \"More condensed, less detail\"\n  - label: \"More ({N+3} slides)\"\n    description: \"More detailed breakdown\"\n```\n\n**Question 4: Review Outline**\n```\nheader: \"Outline\"\nquestion: \"Review outline before generating prompts?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Yes, review outline (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"Review slide titles and structure\"\n  - label: \"No, skip outline review\"\n    description: \"Proceed directly to prompt generation\"\n```\n\n**Question 5: Review Prompts**\n```\nheader: \"Prompts\"\nquestion: \"Review prompts before generating images?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Yes, review prompts (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"Review image generation prompts\"\n  - label: \"No, skip prompt review\"\n    description: \"Proceed directly to image generation\"\n```\n\n#### Round 2 (Only if \"Custom dimensions\" selected)\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion** for all 4 dimensions:\n\n**Question 1: Texture**\n```\nheader: \"Texture\"\nquestion: \"Which visual texture?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"clean\"\n    description: \"Pure solid color, no texture\"\n  - label: \"grid\"\n    description: \"Subtle grid overlay, technical\"\n  - label: \"organic\"\n    description: \"Soft textures, hand-drawn feel\"\n  - label: \"pixel\"\n    description: \"Chunky pixels, 8-bit aesthetic\"\n```\n(Note: \"paper\" available via Other)\n\n**Question 2: Mood**\n```\nheader: \"Mood\"\nquestion: \"Which color mood?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"professional\"\n    description: \"Cool-neutral, navy/gold\"\n  - label: \"warm\"\n    description: \"Earth tones, friendly\"\n  - label: \"cool\"\n    description: \"Blues, grays, analytical\"\n  - label: \"vibrant\"\n    description: \"High saturation, bold\"\n```\n(Note: \"dark\", \"neutral\" available via Other)\n\n**Question 3: Typography**\n```\nheader: \"Typography\"\nquestion: \"Which typography style?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"geometric\"\n    description: \"Modern sans-serif, clean\"\n  - label: \"humanist\"\n    description: \"Friendly, readable\"\n  - label: \"handwritten\"\n    description: \"Marker/brush, organic\"\n  - label: \"editorial\"\n    description: \"Magazine style, dramatic\"\n```\n(Note: \"technical\" available via Other)\n\n**Question 4: Density**\n```\nheader: \"Density\"\nquestion: \"Information density?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"balanced (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"2-3 key points per slide\"\n  - label: \"minimal\"\n    description: \"One focus point, maximum whitespace\"\n  - label: \"dense\"\n    description: \"Multiple data points, compact\"\n```\n\n**After Round 2**: Store custom dimensions as the style configuration.\n\n**After Confirmation**:\n1. Update `analysis.md` with confirmed preferences\n2. Store `skip_outline_review` flag from Question 4\n3. Store `skip_prompt_review` flag from Question 5\n4. → Step 3\n\n### Step 3: Generate Outline\n\nCreate outline using the confirmed style from Step 2.\n\n**Style Resolution**:\n- If preset selected → Read `references/styles/{preset}.md`\n- If custom dimensions → Read dimension files from `references/dimensions/` and combine\n\n**Generate**:\n1. Follow `references/outline-template.md` for structure\n2. Build STYLE_INSTRUCTIONS from style or dimensions\n3. Apply confirmed audience, language, slide count\n4. Save as `outline.md`\n\n**After generation**:\n- If `--outline-only`, stop here\n- If `skip_outline_review` is true → Skip Step 4, go to Step 5\n- If `skip_outline_review` is false → Continue to Step 4\n\n### Step 4: Review Outline (Conditional)\n\n**Skip this step** if user selected \"No, skip outline review\" in Step 2.\n\n**Purpose**: Review outline structure before prompt generation.\n\n**Language**: Use user''s input language or saved language preference.\n\n**Display**:\n- Total slides: N\n- Style: [preset name or \"custom: texture+mood+typography+density\"]\n- Slide-by-slide summary table:\n\n```\n| # | Title | Type | Layout |\n|---|-------|------|--------|\n| 1 | [title] | Cover | title-hero |\n| 2 | [title] | Content | [layout] |\n| 3 | [title] | Content | [layout] |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... |\n```\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion**:\n```\nheader: \"Confirm\"\nquestion: \"Ready to generate prompts?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Yes, proceed (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"Generate image prompts\"\n  - label: \"Edit outline first\"\n    description: \"I''ll modify outline.md before continuing\"\n  - label: \"Regenerate outline\"\n    description: \"Create new outline with different approach\"\n```\n\n**After response**:\n1. If \"Edit outline first\" → Inform user to edit `outline.md`, ask again when ready\n2. If \"Regenerate outline\" → Back to Step 3\n3. If \"Yes, proceed\" → Continue to Step 5\n\n### Step 5: Generate Prompts\n\n1. Read `references/base-prompt.md`\n2. For each slide in outline:\n   - Extract STYLE_INSTRUCTIONS from outline (not from style file again)\n   - Add slide-specific content\n   - If `Layout:` specified, include layout guidance from `references/layouts.md`\n3. Save to `prompts/` directory\n\n**After generation**:\n- If `--prompts-only`, stop here and output prompt summary\n- If `skip_prompt_review` is true → Skip Step 6, go to Step 7\n- If `skip_prompt_review` is false → Continue to Step 6\n\n### Step 6: Review Prompts (Conditional)\n\n**Skip this step** if user selected \"No, skip prompt review\" in Step 2.\n\n**Purpose**: Review prompts before image generation.\n\n**Language**: Use user''s input language or saved language preference.\n\n**Display**:\n- Total prompts: N\n- Style: [preset name or custom dimensions]\n- Prompt list:\n\n```\n| # | Filename | Slide Title |\n|---|----------|-------------|\n| 1 | 01-slide-cover.md | [title] |\n| 2 | 02-slide-xxx.md | [title] |\n| ... | ... | ... |\n```\n\n- Path to prompts directory: `prompts/`\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion**:\n```\nheader: \"Confirm\"\nquestion: \"Ready to generate slide images?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Yes, proceed (Recommended)\"\n    description: \"Generate all slide images\"\n  - label: \"Edit prompts first\"\n    description: \"I''ll modify prompts before continuing\"\n  - label: \"Regenerate prompts\"\n    description: \"Create new prompts with different approach\"\n```\n\n**After response**:\n1. If \"Edit prompts first\" → Inform user to edit prompts, ask again when ready\n2. If \"Regenerate prompts\" → Back to Step 5\n3. If \"Yes, proceed\" → Continue to Step 7\n\n### Step 7: Generate Images\n\n**For `--images-only`**: Start here with existing prompts.\n\n**For `--regenerate N`**: Only regenerate specified slide(s).\n\n**Standard flow**:\n1. Select available image generation skill\n2. Generate session ID: `slides-{topic-slug}-{timestamp}`\n3. Generate each slide sequentially with same session ID\n4. Report progress: \"Generated X/N\" (in user''s language)\n5. Auto-retry once on failure before reporting error\n\n### Step 8: Merge to PPTX and PDF\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/merge-to-pptx.ts <slide-deck-dir>\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/merge-to-pdf.ts <slide-deck-dir>\n```\n\n### Step 9: Output Summary\n\n**Language**: Use user''s input language or saved language preference.\n\n```\nSlide Deck Complete!\n\nTopic: [topic]\nStyle: [preset name or custom dimensions]\nLocation: [directory path]\nSlides: N total\n\n- 01-slide-cover.png - Cover\n- 02-slide-intro.png - Content\n- ...\n- {NN}-slide-back-cover.png - Back Cover\n\nOutline: outline.md\nPPTX: {topic-slug}.pptx\nPDF: {topic-slug}.pdf\n```\n\n## Partial Workflows\n\n| Option | Workflow |\n|--------|----------|\n| `--outline-only` | Steps 1-3 only (stop after outline) |\n| `--prompts-only` | Steps 1-5 (generate prompts, skip images) |\n| `--images-only` | Skip to Step 7 (requires existing prompts/) |\n| `--regenerate N` | Regenerate specific slide(s) only |\n\n### Using `--prompts-only`\n\nGenerate outline and prompts without images:\n\n```bash\n/baoyu-slide-deck content.md --prompts-only\n```\n\nOutput: `outline.md` + `prompts/*.md` ready for review/editing.\n\n### Using `--images-only`\n\nGenerate images from existing prompts (starts at Step 7):\n\n```bash\n/baoyu-slide-deck slide-deck/topic-slug/ --images-only\n```\n\nPrerequisites:\n- `prompts/` directory with slide prompt files\n- `outline.md` with style information\n\n### Using `--regenerate`\n\nRegenerate specific slides:\n\n```bash\n# Single slide\n/baoyu-slide-deck slide-deck/topic-slug/ --regenerate 3\n\n# Multiple slides\n/baoyu-slide-deck slide-deck/topic-slug/ --regenerate 2,5,8\n```\n\nFlow:\n1. Read existing prompts for specified slides\n2. Regenerate images only for those slides\n3. Regenerate PPTX/PDF\n\n## Slide Modification\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n| Action | Command | Manual Steps |\n|--------|---------|--------------|\n| **Edit** | `--regenerate N` | Update prompt → Regenerate image → Regenerate PDF |\n| **Add** | Manual | Create prompt → Generate image → Renumber subsequent → Update outline → Regenerate PDF |\n| **Delete** | Manual | Remove files → Renumber subsequent → Update outline → Regenerate PDF |\n\n### Edit Single Slide\n\n1. Update prompt in `prompts/NN-slide-{slug}.md`\n2. Run: `/baoyu-slide-deck <dir> --regenerate N`\n3. Or manually regenerate image + PDF\n\n### Add New Slide\n\n1. Create prompt at position: `prompts/NN-slide-{new-slug}.md`\n2. Generate image using same session ID\n3. **Renumber**: Subsequent files NN+1 (slugs unchanged)\n4. Update `outline.md`\n5. Regenerate PPTX/PDF\n\n### Delete Slide\n\n1. Remove `NN-slide-{slug}.png` and `prompts/NN-slide-{slug}.md`\n2. **Renumber**: Subsequent files NN-1 (slugs unchanged)\n3. Update `outline.md`\n4. Regenerate PPTX/PDF\n\n### File Naming\n\nFormat: `NN-slide-[slug].png`\n- `NN`: Two-digit sequence (01, 02, ...)\n- `slug`: Kebab-case from content (2-5 words, unique)\n\n**Renumbering Rule**: Only NN changes, slugs remain unchanged.\n\nSee `references/modification-guide.md` for complete details.\n\n## References\n\n| File | Content |\n|------|---------|\n| `references/analysis-framework.md` | Content analysis for presentations |\n| `references/outline-template.md` | Outline structure and format |\n| `references/modification-guide.md` | Edit, add, delete slide workflows |\n| `references/content-rules.md` | Content and style guidelines |\n| `references/design-guidelines.md` | Audience, typography, colors, visual elements |\n| `references/layouts.md` | Layout options and selection tips |\n| `references/base-prompt.md` | Base prompt for image generation |\n| `references/dimensions/*.md` | Dimension specifications (texture, mood, typography, density) |\n| `references/dimensions/presets.md` | Preset → dimension mapping |\n| `references/styles/<style>.md` | Full style specifications (legacy) |\n| `references/config/preferences-schema.md` | EXTEND.md structure |\n\n## Notes\n\n- Image generation: 10-30 seconds per slide\n- Auto-retry once on generation failure\n- Use stylized alternatives for sensitive public figures\n- Maintain style consistency via session ID\n- **Step 2 confirmation required** - do not skip (style, audience, slides, outline review, prompt review)\n- **Step 4 conditional** - only if user requested outline review in Step 2\n- **Step 6 conditional** - only if user requested prompt review in Step 2\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Step 1.1** for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:58:58.755Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing advanced slide deck generation capabilities with customizable styles and languages.","zh":"非常适合需要高级幻灯片生成功能的内容创作代理，具有可自定义的样式和语言。","ja":"コンテンツ作成エージェントが高度なスライドデッキ生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。カスタマイズ可能なスタイルと言語を備えています。","ko":"고급 슬라이드 덱 생성 기능과 사용자 지정 가능한 스타일 및 언어가 필요한 콘텐츠 작성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de presentaciones con estilos y lenguajes personalizables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de diapositives avec des styles et des langues personnalisables.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die erweiterte Präsentationsgenerierungsfunktionen mit anpassbaren Stilen und Sprachen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de decks de slides com estilos e idiomas personalizáveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов создания контента, требующих продвинутых возможностей генерации презентационных слайдов с настраиваемыми стилями и языками.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إنشاء المحتوى الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء شريحة العرض مع أنماط قابلة للتخصيص واللغات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform content into professional slide deck images using Markdown files, supporting various styles such as sketch-notes and multiple languages like zh, with options to specify the number of slides and outline-only generation, utilizing command-line interfaces and file system interactions.","zh":"使代理能够使用Markdown文件将内容转换为专业的幻灯片图像，支持各种样式，如草图笔记和多种语言，如中文，具有指定幻灯片数量和仅大纲生成的选项，利用命令行接口和文件系统交互。","ja":"エージェントがMarkdownファイルを使用してコンテンツをプロフェッショナルのスライドデッキ画像に変換できるようにします。スケッチノートや多言語（例：中国語）などの様々なスタイルをサポートし、スライドの数やアウトラインのみの生成を指定するオプションを提供し、コマンドラインインターフェイスとファイルシステムの相互作用を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 콘텐츠를 전문가용 슬라이드 덱 이미지로 변환할 수 있도록 합니다. 스케치 노트 및 여러 언어(예: 중국어)와 같은 다양한 스타일을 지원하며, 슬라이드의 수 및 아웃라인만 생성하는 옵션을 제공하며, 명령줄 인터페이스와 파일 시스템 상호 작용을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar contenido en imágenes de diapositivas profesionales utilizando archivos Markdown, que admiten varios estilos como notas de esbozo y múltiples lenguajes como zh, con opciones para especificar el número de diapositivas y generación solo de esquema, utilizando interfaces de línea de comandos y interacciones con el sistema de archivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer du contenu en images de diapositives professionnelles à l''aide de fichiers Markdown, prenant en charge divers styles tels que les notes de croquis et plusieurs langues comme zh, avec des options pour spécifier le nombre de diapositives et la génération de seul sommaire, en utilisant des interfaces de ligne de commande et des interactions avec le système de fichiers.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Inhalte in professionelle Bildschirmpräsentationen umzuwandeln, indem sie Markdown-Dateien verwenden, die verschiedene Stile wie Skizzennotizen und mehrere Sprachen wie zh unterstützen, mit Optionen, um die Anzahl der Bildschirme und die Outline-Generierung zu spezifizieren, unter Verwendung von Befehlszeilen-Schnittstellen und Dateisysteminteraktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar o conteúdo em imagens profissionais de decks de slides usando arquivos Markdown, suportando vários estilos, como anotações esboçadas e vários idiomas, como zh, com opções para especificar o número de slides e geração apenas do esboço, utilizando interfaces de linha de comando e interações de sistema de arquivos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать контент в профессиональные изображения слайд-шоу, используя файлы Markdown, поддерживающие различные стили, такие как эскизные заметки и несколько языков, таких как zh, с возможностью указать количество слайдов и генерацию только контура, используя командную строку и взаимодействие с файловой системой.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تحويل المحتوى إلى صور احترافية لشريحة العرض باستخدام ملفات Markdown، مع دعم لعدة أساليب مثل ملاحظات المسودة وعدة لغات مثل zh، مع خيارات لتحديد عدد الشرائح وإنشاء مخطط فقط، باستخدام واجهات سطر الأوامر وتفاعلات نظام الملفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating presentation slides from Markdown content","Customizing slide decks for specific audiences like executives","Creating multilingual slide decks supporting languages such as zh","Automating the generation of slide decks with predefined styles"],"zh":["从Markdown内容生成演示幻灯片","为特定受众（如高管）自定义幻灯片","创建支持多种语言（如中文）的多语言幻灯片","使用预定义样式自动生成幻灯片"],"ja":["Markdownコンテンツからプレゼンテーションスライドを生成する","特定のオーディエンス（例：経営陣）向けにスライドデッキをカスタマイズする","様々な言語（例：中国語）をサポートするマルチリンガルスライドデッキを作成する","事前に定義されたスタイルを使用してスライドデッキを自動生成する"],"ko":["마크다운 콘텐츠에서 프레젠테이션 슬라이드를 생성하는 것","특정 대상자(예: 경영진)를 위한 슬라이드 덱을 사용자 지정하는 것","여러 언어(예: 중국어)를 지원하는 다국어 슬라이드 덱을 생성하는 것","사전에 정의된 스타일을 사용하여 슬라이드 덱을 자동으로 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generación de diapositivas de presentación a partir de contenido Markdown","Personalización de presentaciones para audiencias específicas como ejecutivos","Creación de presentaciones multilingües que admiten lenguajes como zh","Automatización de la generación de presentaciones con estilos predefinidos"],"fr":["Génération de diapositives de présentation à partir de contenu Markdown","Personnalisation de présentations pour des publics spécifiques tels que des cadres","Création de présentations multilingues prenant en charge des langues telles que zh","Automatisation de la génération de présentations avec des styles prédéfinis"],"de":["Generierung von Präsentationsfolien aus Markdown-Inhalten","Anpassung von Präsentationen für spezifische Zielgruppen wie Führungskräfte","Erstellung von mehrsprachigen Präsentationen, die Sprachen wie zh unterstützen","Automatisierung der Generierung von Präsentationen mit vordefinierten Stilen"],"pt":["Gerar slides de apresentação a partir de conteúdo Markdown","Personalizar decks de slides para públicos específicos, como executivos","Criar decks de slides multilíngues que suportam idiomas como zh","Automatizar a geração de decks de slides com estilos pré-definidos"],"ru":["Генерировать презентационные слайды из контента Markdown","Настроить слайд-шоу для конкретных аудиторий, таких как руководители","Создать многоязычные слайд-шоу, поддерживающие языки, такие как zh","Автоматизировать генерацию слайд-шоу с предварительно определёнными стилями"],"ar":["إنشاء شرائح عرض من المحتوى Markdown","تخصيص شرائح العرض للجماهير المحددة مثل التنفيذيين","إنشاء شرائح عرض متعددة اللغات التي تدعم اللغات مثل zh","تأتميم إنشاء شرائح العرض بالأساليب المحددة مسبقًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Markdown file as input","Limited to generating slide deck images","Dependent on command-line interface for execution"],"zh":["需要Markdown文件作为输入","仅限生成幻灯片图像","依赖命令行接口执行"],"ja":["Markdownファイルが入力として必要","スライドデッキ画像の生成のみ","コマンドラインインターフェイスに依存して実行"],"ko":["마크다운 파일이 입력으로 필요합니다","슬라이드 덱 이미지 생성만 가능합니다","명령줄 인터페이스에 의존하여 실행"],"es":["Requiere un archivo Markdown como entrada","Limitado a la generación de imágenes de presentaciones","Dependiente de la interfaz de línea de comandos para la ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier Markdown en entrée","Limité à la génération d''images de diapositives","Dépendant de l''interface de ligne de commande pour l''exécution"],"de":["Benötigt eine Markdown-Datei als Eingabe","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Bildschirmpräsentationen","Von der Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle für die Ausführung abhängig"],"pt":["Exige arquivo Markdown como entrada","Limitado à geração de imagens de decks de slides","Dependente da interface de linha de comando para execução"],"ru":["Требует файла Markdown в качестве входных данных","Ограничен генерацией изображений слайд-шоу","Зависит от командной строки для выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف Markdown كمدخل","محدود بإنشاء صور شريحة العرض","يعتمد على واجهة سطر الأوامر للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
