scription":{"zh":"本工具自动检查网页设计是否符合最新的Web Interface Guidelines，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"このツールは、最新のWeb Interface Guidelinesに従ってWebデザインを自動的にチェックし、開発者の効率を向上させる","ko":"이 도구는 최신 Web Interface Guidelines에 따라 웹 디자인을 자동으로 검사하여 개발자의 효율을 높여줍니다","es":"Nuestras pautas de diseño web ofrecen reglas y directrices para mejorar la usabilidad y accesibilidad de tus sitios web.","fr":"Les guidelines de conception web fournissent des règles et des directives pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et l''accessibilité de vos sites web.","de":"Unsere Webdesign-Richtlinien bieten Regeln und Leitfäden, um die Benutzerfreundlichkeit und Barrierefreiheit Ihrer Websites zu verbessern.","pt":"As diretrizes de design web ajudam a garantir a acessibilidade e a usabilidade dos sites. Elas fornecem um conjunto de regras para criar interfaces web de qu...","ru":"Руководство по веб-дизайну помогает обеспечить доступность и удобство использования сайтов. Оно предоставляет набор правил для создания качественных веб-инте...","ar":"إرشادات تصميم الويب تساعد على ضمان إمكانية الوصول وسهولة استخدام المواقع. توفر مجموعة من القواعد لإنشاء واجهات ويب ذات جودة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动检查网页设计是否符合最新的Web Interface Guidelines","支持从GitHub仓库中获取最新的指南","输出检查结果以便于开发者快速定位问题","支持用户自定义文件或文件模式","检查结果以terse `file:line`格式输出"],"ja":["最新のWeb Interface Guidelinesに従ってWebデザインを自動的にチェック","GitHubリポジトリから最新のガイドラインを取得することをサポート","チェック結果を出力して開発者が問題を迅速に特定できるようにする","ユーザーがファイルやファイルパターンをカスタマイズできる","チェック結果をterse `file:line`形式で出力"],"ko":["최신 Web Interface Guidelines에 따라 웹 디자인을 자동으로 검사","GitHub 저장소에서 최신 가이드라인을 가져오는 것을 지원","검사 결과를 출력하여 개발자가 문제를 빠르게 찾을 수 있도록 함","사용자가 파일이나 파일 패턴을 사용자 지정할 수 있음","검사 결과를_terse `file:line` 형식으로 출력"],"es":["Revisión de archivos para cumplimiento con pautas de diseño web","Verificación de reglas y directrices para mejorar la accesibilidad","Salida de resultados en formato conciso","Actualización automática de pautas desde fuente externa"],"fr":["Vérification de fichiers pour la conformité aux guidelines de conception web","Vérification des règles et des directives pour améliorer l''accessibilité","Sortie des résultats dans un format concis","Mise à jour automatique des guidelines à partir d''une source externe"],"de":["Überprüfung von Dateien auf Einhaltung der Webdesign-Richtlinien","Überprüfung von Regeln und Leitfäden zur Verbesserung der Barrierefreiheit","Ausgabe der Ergebnisse in kompaktem Format","Automatische Aktualisierung der Richtlinien aus externer Quelle"],"pt":["Verificação de conformidade com as diretrizes de design web","Otimização da interface para melhorar a acessibilidade","Análise de arquivos para garantir a conformidade","Saída de resultados em formato conciso","Integração com fontes de diretrizes de design web"],"ru":["Проверка соответствия руководству по веб-дизайну","Оптимизация интерфейса для улучшения доступности","Анализ файлов для обеспечения соответствия","Выход результатов в кратком формате","Интеграция с источниками руководства по веб-дизайну"],"ar":["فحص مطابقة إرشادات تصميم الويب","تحسين الواجهة لتحسين إمكانية الوصول","تحليل الملفات لضمان المطابقة","إخراج النتائج في شكل موجز","التكامل مع مصادر إرشادات تصميم الويب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web 设计指南","自动检查工具","Web Interface Guidelines","网页设计","开发效率","自动化工具"],"ja":["Web デザインガイドライン","自動チェックツール","Web Interface Guidelines","Webデザイン","開発効率","自動化ツール"],"ko":["웹 디자인 가이드라인","자동 검사도구","Web Interface Guidelines","웹 디자인","개발 효율","자동화 도구"],"es":["pautas de diseño web","reglas de diseño web","accesibilidad web","usabilidad web","diseño de interfaces web","guias de diseño web"],"fr":["guidelines de conception web","règles de conception web","accessibilité web","expérience utilisateur web","conception d''interfaces web","directives de conception web"],"de":["Webdesign-Richtlinien","Regeln für Webdesign","Barrierefreiheit im Web","Benutzerfreundlichkeit im Web","Gestaltung von Web-Oberflächen","Leitfäden für Webdesign"],"pt":["diretrizes de design web","otimização de interface","acessibilidade web","usabilidade","desenvolvimento web","design de interface"],"ru":["руководство по веб-дизайну","оптимизация интерфейса","доступность веб","удобство использования","разработка веб","дизайн интерфейса"],"ar":["إرشادات تصميم الويب","تحسين الواجهة","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","سهولة الاستخدام","تطوير الويب","تصميم الواجهة"]}},"owner":"daunload","repo":"asdf","repoPath":"daunload/asdf","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-design-guidelines","description":"Review UI code for Web Interface Guidelines compliance. Use when asked to review my UI, check accessibility, audit design, review UX, or check my site against best practices.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Web Interface Guidelines\n\nReview files for compliance with Web Interface Guidelines.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Fetch the latest guidelines from the source URL below\n2. Read the specified files (or prompt user for files/pattern)\n3. Check against all rules in the fetched guidelines\n4. Output findings in the terse `file:line` format\n\n## Guidelines Source\n\nFetch fresh guidelines before each review:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/vercel-labs/web-interface-guidelines/main/command.md\n```\n\nUse WebF","body":"# Web Interface Guidelines\n\nReview files for compliance with Web Interface Guidelines.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Fetch the latest guidelines from the source URL below\n2. Read the specified files (or prompt user for files/pattern)\n3. Check against all rules in the fetched guidelines\n4. Output findings in the terse `file:line` format\n\n## Guidelines Source\n\nFetch fresh guidelines before each review:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/vercel-labs/web-interface-guidelines/main/command.md\n```\n\nUse WebFetch to retrieve the latest rules. The fetched content contains all the rules and output format instructions.\n\n## Usage\n\nWhen a user provides a file or pattern argument:\n\n1. Fetch guidelines from the source URL above\n2. Read the specified files\n3. Apply all rules from the fetched guidelines\n4. Output findings using the format specified in the guidelines\n\nIf no files specified, ask the user which files to review.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:00:03.377Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing automated web interface compliance checks","zh":"非常适合需要自动化网页接口合规性检查的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが自動化されたWebインターフェイスのコンプライアンスチェックを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자동화된 웹 인터페이스 컴플라이언스 체크가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan controles de cumplimiento de interfaz web automatizados","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de vérifications de conformité d''interface web automatisées","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die automatisierte Compliance-Checks für Web-Oberflächen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de verificações de conformidade de interface web automatizadas","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы автоматические проверки соответствия веб-интерфейса","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى عمليات فحص التزام تلقائي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce web design standards by fetching and applying guidelines from remote sources like GitHub, utilizing Markdown files for rule definitions, and outputting findings in a concise format for easy debugging and compliance reporting","zh":"赋予代理商强制执行网页设计标准的能力，通过从GitHub等远程源获取并应用指南，利用Markdown文件定义规则，并以简洁的格式输出结果，以便于调试和合规性报告","ja":"エージェントにWebデザイン標準を適用する能力を付与し、GitHubなどのリモートソースからガイドラインを取得して適用し、Markdownファイルを使用してルールを定義し、コンパクトな形式で結果を出力してデバッグとコンプライアンス報告を容易にする","ko":"에이전트에게 웹 디자인 표준을 강제하는 능력을 부여하며, GitHub와 같은 원격 소스에서 가이드라인을 가져와 적용하고, 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 규칙을 정의하며, 결과를 간결한 형식으로 출력하여 디버깅 및 컴플라이언스 보고를 쉽게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir los estándares de diseño web al recuperar y aplicar directrices de fuentes remotas como GitHub, utilizando archivos Markdown para definiciones de reglas y generando resultados en un formato conciso para una fácil depuración y generación de informes de cumplimiento","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter les normes de conception web en récupérant et en appliquant des directives à partir de sources distantes comme GitHub, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown pour les définitions de règles et en produisant des résultats dans un format concis pour un débogage et une génération de rapports de conformité faciles","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Webdesign-Standards durch Abrufen und Anwenden von Richtlinien aus Remotequellen wie GitHub durchzusetzen, indem Markdown-Dateien für Regeldaten verwendet und Ergebnisse in einem prägnanten Format für einfaches Debugging und Konformitätsberichterstattung ausgegeben werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar padrões de design web, buscando e aplicando diretrizes de fontes remotas como o GitHub, utilizando arquivos Markdown para definições de regras e produzindo resultados em um formato conciso para facilitar a depuração e o relatório de conformidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить соблюдение веб-стандартов дизайна, получая и применяя руководства из удаленных источников, таких как GitHub, используя файлы Markdown для определений правил и выводя результаты в кратком формате для простой отладки и отчетности о соответствии","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من فرض معايير تصميم الويب من خلال استرداد وتطبيق الإرشادات من مصادر بعيدة مثل جيت هاب، باستخدام ملفات markdown لتعريف القواعد وإخراج النتائج بلغة متوافقة لسهولة فحص الأخطاء وتقرير الامتثال"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web interface guideline checks for new deployments","Validating HTML and CSS files against company standards","Debugging non-compliant web interface elements"],"zh":["自动化新的部署的网页接口指南检查","验证HTML和CSS文件是否符合公司标准","调试不合规的网页接口元素"],"ja":["新しいデプロイのWebインターフェイスガイドラインチェックを自動化","HTMLとCSSファイルを会社の標準に従って検証","コンプライアンスに違反するWebインターフェイス要素をデバッグ"],"ko":["새로운 배포의 웹 인터페이스 가이드라인 체크를 자동화","HTML 및 CSS 파일을 회사 표준에 따라 검증","컴플라이언스에 위반하는 웹 인터페이스 요소를 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar controles de directrices de interfaz web para nuevos despliegues","Validar archivos HTML y CSS frente a los estándares de la empresa","Depurar elementos de interfaz web no cumplidores"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de directives d''interface web pour les nouveaux déploiements","Valider les fichiers HTML et CSS par rapport aux normes de l''entreprise","Déboguer les éléments d''interface web non conformes"],"de":["Automatisieren von Kontrollen der Richtlinien für Web-Oberflächen bei neuen Bereitstellungen","Validieren von HTML- und CSS-Dateien gegenüber den Unternehmensstandards","Debuggen nicht konformer Web-Oberflächenelemente"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de diretrizes de interface web para novas implantações","Validar arquivos HTML e CSS contra os padrões da empresa","Depurar elementos de interface web não conformes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки соответствия веб-интерфейса для новых развертываний","Проверять файлы HTML и CSS на соответствие корпоративным стандартам","Отлаживать невыполняющие требования элементы веб-интерфейса"],"ar":["تحويل عمليات فحص التزام واجهة المستخدم تلقائيًا لعمليات النشر الجديدة","تحقق من صحة ملفات HTML وCSS مقابل معايير الشركة","تصحيح أخطاء عناصر واجهة المستخدم غير المتوافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for fetching guidelines","Limited to guidelines hosted in Markdown format","Dependent on the source URL for guideline updates"],"zh":["需要互联网访问来获取指南","仅限于以Markdown格式托管的指南","依赖于源URL来获取指南更新"],"ja":["ガイドラインを取得するためにインターネットアクセスが必要","Markdown形式でホストされているガイドラインのみに限定","ガイドラインの更新を取得するためにソースURLに依存"],"ko":["가이드라인을 가져오기 위해 인터넷 접근이 필요","마크다운 형식으로 호스팅되는 가이드라인만으로 제한","가이드라인 업데이트를 가져오기 위해 소스 URL에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Internet para recuperar directrices","Limitado a directrices alojadas en formato Markdown","Dependiente de la URL de origen para actualizaciones de directrices"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Internet pour récupérer les directives","Limité aux directives hébergées au format Markdown","Dépendant de l''URL de source pour les mises à jour des directives"],"de":["Benötigt Internetzugang zum Abrufen von Richtlinien","Begrenzt auf Richtlinien, die im Markdown-Format gehostet werden","Abhängig von der Quell-URL für Richtlinien-Updates"],"pt":["Requer acesso à internet para buscar diretrizes","Limitado a diretrizes hospedadas no formato Markdown","Dependente da URL de origem para atualizações de diretrizes"],"ru":["Требует доступа к интернету для получения руководств","Ограничен руководствами, размещенными в формате Markdown","Зависит от URL-адреса источника для обновлений руководств"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت لاسترداد الإرشادات","محدود بالإرشادات المضيفة بملفات markdown","يعتمد على عنوان URL للمصدر لتحديث الإرشادات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lisposter/creator/baoyu-xhs-images', 'community', 'lisposter', 'creator', 'lisposter/creator', 'baoyu-xhs-images', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z', '2026-02-18T08:00:04.007Z', NULL, '{"id":"lisposter/creator/baoyu-xhs-images","name":"baoyu-xhs-images","description":{"es":"El generador de infografías Xiaohongshu crea contenido visual atractivo a partir de texto complejo","fr":"Le générateur d''infographies Xiaohongshu crée du contenu visuel attractif à partir de texte complexe","de":"Der Xiaohongshu-Infografik-Generator erstellt ansprechende visuelle Inhalte aus komplexen Texten","pt":"O Gerador de Série de Infográficos Xiaohongshu é uma ferramenta que transforma conteúdo complexo em infográficos atraentes","ru":"Генератор инфографики Xiaohongshu - это инструмент, который преобразует сложный контент в привлекательные инфографики","ar":"مُولِد سلاسل المعلومات المرئية Xiaohongshu هو أداة تُحَوِّل المحتوى المعقد إلى رسومات معلومات جذابة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Generador de infografías Xiaohongshu","fr":"Générateur d''infographies Xiaohongshu","de":"Xiaohongshu Infografik Generator","pt":"Gerador de Série de Infográficos Xiaohongshu","ru":"Генератор инфографики Xiaohongshu","ar":"مُولِد سلاسل المعلومات المرئية Xiaohongshu","en":"baoyu-xhs-images"},"description":{"es":"El generador de infografías Xiaohongshu crea contenido visual atractivo a partir de texto complejo","fr":"Le générateur d''infographies Xiaohongshu crée du contenu visuel attractif à partir de texte complexe","de":"Der Xiaohongshu-Infografik-Generator erstellt ansprechende visuelle Inhalte aus komplexen Texten","pt":"O Gerador de Série de Infográficos Xiaohongshu é uma ferramenta que transforma conteúdo complexo em infográficos atraentes","ru":"Генератор инфографики Xiaohongshu - это инструмент, который преобразует сложный контент в привлекательные инфографики","ar":"مُولِد سلاسل المعلومات المرئية Xiaohongshu هو أداة تُحَوِّل المحتوى المعقد إلى رسومات معلومات جذابة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Opciones de estilo múltiples","Diseño de layout automático","Compatibilidad con Xiaohongshu","Generación de series de infografías","Personalización de estilo y layout"],"fr":["Options de style multiples","Conception de layout automatique","Compatibilité avec Xiaohongshu","Génération de séries d''infographies","Personnalisation de style et de layout"],"de":["Mehrere Stiloptionen","Automatischer Layout-Entwurf","Kompatibilität mit Xiaohongshu","Erstellung von Infografik-Serien","Anpassung von Stil und Layout"],"pt":["Opções de estilo múltiplo","Layouts personalizáveis","Geração automática de infográficos","Compatibilidade com Xiaohongshu","Fácil integração com markdown"],"ru":["Множество стилевых вариантов","Настраиваемые компоновки","Автоматическая генерация инфографики","Совместимость с Xiaohongshu","Легкая интеграция с markdown"],"ar":["خيارات أسلوب متعددة","تنسيقات قابلة للتعديل","توليد تلقائي للرسومات المعلوماتية","توافق مع منصة Xiaohongshu","إمكانية دمج سهلة مع markdown"]},"keywords":{"es":["generador de infografías","Xiaohongshu","infografías visuales","contenido visual","diseño de layout","estilo de infografías"],"fr":["générateur d''infographies","Xiaohongshu","infographies visuelles","contenu visuel","conception de layout","style d''infographie"],"de":["Infografik-Generator","Xiaohongshu","visuelle Infografiken","visueller Inhalt","Layout-Entwurf","Infografik-Stil"],"pt":["gerador de infográficos","xiaohongshu","ferramenta de criação de conteúdo","infográficos personalizados","layout de infográficos","estilo de infográficos"],"ru":["генератор инфографики","xiaohongshu","инструмент создания контента","пользовательские инфографики","макет инфографики","стиль инфографики"],"ar":["مُولِد رسومات المعلومات","xiaohongshu","أداة إنشاء المحتوى","رسومات معلومات مخصصة","تنسيق رسومات المعلومات","أسلوب رسومات المعلومات"]}},"owner":"lisposter","repo":"creator","repoPath":"lisposter/creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-xhs-images","description":"Generates Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book) infographic series with 10 visual styles and 8 layouts. Breaks content into 1-10 cartoon-style images optimized for XHS engagement. Use when user mentions 小红书图片, XHS images, RedNote infographics, 小红书种草, or wants social media infographics for Chinese platforms.","bodyPreview":"# Xiaohongshu Infographic Series Generator\n\nBreak down complex content into eye-catching infographic series for Xiaohongshu with multiple style options.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select style and layout based on content\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md\n\n# Specify style\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style notion\n\n# Specify layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --layout dense\n\n# Combine style and layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style","body":"# Xiaohongshu Infographic Series Generator\n\nBreak down complex content into eye-catching infographic series for Xiaohongshu with multiple style options.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select style and layout based on content\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md\n\n# Specify style\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style notion\n\n# Specify layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --layout dense\n\n# Combine style and layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style notion --layout list\n\n# Direct content input\n/baoyu-xhs-images\n[paste content]\n\n# Direct input with options\n/baoyu-xhs-images --style bold --layout comparison\n[paste content]\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--style <name>` | Visual style (see Style Gallery) |\n| `--layout <name>` | Information layout (see Layout Gallery) |\n\n## Two Dimensions\n\n| Dimension | Controls | Options |\n|-----------|----------|---------|\n| **Style** | Visual aesthetics: colors, lines, decorations | cute, fresh, warm, bold, minimal, retro, pop, notion, chalkboard, study-notes |\n| **Layout** | Information structure: density, arrangement | sparse, balanced, dense, list, comparison, flow, mindmap, quadrant |\n\nStyle × Layout can be freely combined. Example: `--style notion --layout dense` creates an intellectual-looking knowledge card with high information density.\n\n## Style Gallery\n\n| Style | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cute` (Default) | Sweet, adorable, girly - classic Xiaohongshu aesthetic |\n| `fresh` | Clean, refreshing, natural |\n| `warm` | Cozy, friendly, approachable |\n| `bold` | High impact, attention-grabbing |\n| `minimal` | Ultra-clean, sophisticated |\n| `retro` | Vintage, nostalgic, trendy |\n| `pop` | Vibrant, energetic, eye-catching |\n| `notion` | Minimalist hand-drawn line art, intellectual |\n| `chalkboard` | Colorful chalk on black board, educational |\n| `study-notes` | Realistic handwritten photo style, blue pen + red annotations + yellow highlighter |\n\nDetailed style definitions: `references/presets/<style>.md`\n\n## Layout Gallery\n\n| Layout | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `sparse` (Default) | Minimal information, maximum impact (1-2 points) |\n| `balanced` | Standard content layout (3-4 points) |\n| `dense` | High information density, knowledge card style (5-8 points) |\n| `list` | Enumeration and ranking format (4-7 items) |\n| `comparison` | Side-by-side contrast layout |\n| `flow` | Process and timeline layout (3-6 steps) |\n| `mindmap` | Center radial mind map layout (4-8 branches) |\n| `quadrant` | Four-quadrant / circular section layout |\n\nDetailed layout definitions: `references/elements/canvas.md`\n\n## Auto Selection\n\n| Content Signals | Style | Layout |\n|-----------------|-------|--------|\n| Beauty, fashion, cute, girl, pink | `cute` | sparse/balanced |\n| Health, nature, clean, fresh, organic | `fresh` | balanced/flow |\n| Life, story, emotion, feeling, warm | `warm` | balanced |\n| Warning, important, must, critical | `bold` | list/comparison |\n| Professional, business, elegant, simple | `minimal` | sparse/balanced |\n| Classic, vintage, old, traditional | `retro` | balanced |\n| Fun, exciting, wow, amazing | `pop` | sparse/list |\n| Knowledge, concept, productivity, SaaS | `notion` | dense/list |\n| Education, tutorial, learning, teaching, classroom | `chalkboard` | balanced/dense |\n| Notes, handwritten, study guide, knowledge, realistic, photo | `study-notes` | dense/list/mindmap |\n\n## Outline Strategies\n\nThree differentiated outline strategies for different content goals:\n\n### Strategy A: Story-Driven (故事驱动型)\n\n| Aspect | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Concept** | Personal experience as main thread, emotional resonance first |\n| **Features** | Start from pain point, show before/after change, strong authenticity |\n| **Best for** | Reviews, personal shares, transformation stories |\n| **Structure** | Hook → Problem → Discovery → Experience → Conclusion |\n\n### Strategy B: Information-Dense (信息密集型)\n\n| Aspect | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Concept** | Value-first, efficient information delivery |\n| **Features** | Clear structure, explicit points, professional credibility |\n| **Best for** | Tutorials, comparisons, product reviews, checklists |\n| **Structure** | Core conclusion → Info card → Pros/Cons → Recommendation |\n\n### Strategy C: Visual-First (视觉优先型)\n\n| Aspect | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Concept** | Visual impact as core, minimal text |\n| **Features** | Large images, atmospheric, instant appeal |\n| **Best for** | High-aesthetic products, lifestyle, mood-based content |\n| **Structure** | Hero image → Detail shots → Lifestyle scene → CTA |\n\n## File Structure\n\nEach session creates an independent directory named by content slug:\n\n```\nxhs-images/{topic-slug}/\n├── source-{slug}.{ext}             # Source files (text, images, etc.)\n├── analysis.md                     # Deep analysis + questions asked\n├── outline-strategy-a.md           # Strategy A: Story-driven\n├── outline-strategy-b.md           # Strategy B: Information-dense\n├── outline-strategy-c.md           # Strategy C: Visual-first\n├── outline.md                      # Final selected/merged outline\n├── prompts/\n│   ├── 01-cover-[slug].md\n│   ├── 02-content-[slug].md\n│   └── ...\n├── 01-cover-[slug].png\n├── 02-content-[slug].png\n└── NN-ending-[slug].png\n```\n\n**Slug Generation**:\n1. Extract main topic from content (2-4 words, kebab-case)\n2. Example: \"AI工具推荐\" → `ai-tools-recommend`\n\n**Conflict Resolution**:\nIf `xhs-images/{topic-slug}/` already exists:\n- Append timestamp: `{topic-slug}-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`\n- Example: `ai-tools` exists → `ai-tools-20260118-143052`\n\n**Source Files**:\nCopy all sources with naming `source-{slug}.{ext}`:\n- `source-article.md`, `source-photo.jpg`, etc.\n- Multiple sources supported: text, images, files from conversation\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Progress Checklist\n\nCopy and track progress:\n\n```\nXHS Infographic Progress:\n- [ ] Step 0: Check preferences (EXTEND.md) ⛔ BLOCKING\n  - [ ] Found → load preferences → continue\n  - [ ] Not found → run first-time setup → MUST complete before Step 1\n- [ ] Step 1: Analyze content → analysis.md\n- [ ] Step 2: Confirmation 1 - Content understanding ⚠️ REQUIRED\n- [ ] Step 3: Generate 3 outline + style variants\n- [ ] Step 4: Confirmation 2 - Outline & style & elements selection ⚠️ REQUIRED\n- [ ] Step 5: Generate images (sequential)\n- [ ] Step 6: Completion report\n```\n\n### Flow\n\n```\nInput → [Step 0: Preferences] ─┬─ Found → Continue\n                               │\n                               └─ Not found → First-Time Setup ⛔ BLOCKING\n                                              │\n                                              └─ Complete setup → Save EXTEND.md → Continue\n                                                                                      │\n        ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n        ↓\nAnalyze → [Confirm 1] → 3 Outlines → [Confirm 2: Outline + Style + Elements] → Generate → Complete\n```\n\n### Step 0: Load Preferences (EXTEND.md) ⛔ BLOCKING\n\n**Purpose**: Load user preferences or run first-time setup.\n\n**CRITICAL**: If EXTEND.md not found, MUST complete first-time setup before ANY other questions or steps. Do NOT proceed to content analysis, do NOT ask about style, do NOT ask about layout — ONLY complete the preferences setup first.\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                        Path                        │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md           │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md     │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                              Action                                              │\n├───────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, display summary → Continue to Step 1                                                 │\n├───────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ ⛔ BLOCKING: Run first-time setup ONLY (see below) → Complete and save EXTEND.md → Then Step 1    │\n└───────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**First-Time Setup** (when EXTEND.md not found):\n\n**Language**: Use user''s input language or saved language preference.\n\nUse AskUserQuestion with ALL questions in ONE call. See `references/config/first-time-setup.md` for question details.\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Watermark | Preferred style/layout | Custom style definitions | Language preference\n\nSchema: `references/config/preferences-schema.md`\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Content → `analysis.md`\n\nRead source content, save it if needed, and perform deep analysis.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. **Save source content** (if not already a file):\n   - If user provides a file path: use as-is\n   - If user pastes content: save to `source.md` in target directory\n   - **Backup rule**: If `source.md` exists, rename to `source-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n2. Read source content\n3. **Deep analysis** following `references/workflows/analysis-framework.md`:\n   - Content type classification (种草/干货/测评/教程/避坑...)\n   - Hook analysis (爆款标题潜力)\n   - Target audience identification\n   - Engagement potential (收藏/分享/评论)\n   - Visual opportunity mapping\n   - Swipe flow design\n4. Detect source language\n5. Determine recommended image count (2-10)\n6. **Generate clarifying questions** (see Step 2)\n7. **Save to `analysis.md`**\n\n### Step 2: Confirmation 1 - Content Understanding ⚠️\n\n**Purpose**: Validate understanding + collect missing info. **Do NOT skip.**\n\n**Display summary**:\n- Content type + topic identified\n- Key points extracted\n- Tone detected\n- Source images count\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion** for:\n1. Core selling point (multiSelect: true)\n2. Target audience\n3. Style preference: Authentic sharing / Professional review / Aesthetic mood / Auto\n4. Additional context (optional)\n\n**After response**: Update `analysis.md` → Step 3\n\n### Step 3: Generate 3 Outline + Style Variants\n\nBased on analysis + user context, create three distinct strategy variants. Each variant includes both **outline structure** and **visual style recommendation**.\n\n**For each strategy**:\n\n| Strategy | Filename | Outline | Recommended Style |\n|----------|----------|---------|-------------------|\n| A | `outline-strategy-a.md` | Story-driven: emotional, before/after | warm, cute, fresh |\n| B | `outline-strategy-b.md` | Information-dense: structured, factual | notion, minimal, chalkboard |\n| C | `outline-strategy-c.md` | Visual-first: atmospheric, minimal text | bold, pop, retro |\n\n**Outline format** (YAML front matter + content):\n```yaml\n---\nstrategy: a  # a, b, or c\nname: Story-Driven\nstyle: warm  # recommended style for this strategy\nstyle_reason: \"Warm tones enhance emotional storytelling and personal connection\"\nelements:  # from style preset, can be customized in Step 4\n  background: solid-pastel\n  decorations: [clouds, stars-sparkles]\n  emphasis: star-burst\n  typography: highlight\nlayout: balanced  # primary layout\nimage_count: 5\n---\n\n## P1 Cover\n**Type**: cover\n**Hook**: \"入冬后脸不干了🥹终于找到对的面霜\"\n**Visual**: Product hero shot with cozy winter atmosphere\n**Layout**: sparse\n\n## P2 Problem\n**Type**: pain-point\n**Message**: Previous struggles with dry skin\n**Visual**: Before state, relatable scenario\n**Layout**: balanced\n\n...\n```\n\n**Differentiation requirements**:\n- Each strategy MUST have different outline structure AND different recommended style\n- Adapt page count: A typically 4-6, B typically 3-5, C typically 3-4\n- Include `style_reason` explaining why this style fits the strategy\n- Consider user''s style preference from Step 2\n\nReference: `references/workflows/outline-template.md`\n\n### Step 4: Confirmation 2 - Outline & Style & Elements Selection ⚠️\n\n**Purpose**: User chooses outline strategy, confirms visual style, and customizes elements. **Do NOT skip.**\n\n**Display each strategy**:\n- Strategy name + page count + recommended style\n- Page-by-page summary (P1 → P2 → P3...)\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion** with three questions:\n\n**Question 1: Outline Strategy**\n- Strategy A (Recommended if \"authentic sharing\")\n- Strategy B (Recommended if \"professional review\")\n- Strategy C (Recommended if \"aesthetic mood\")\n- Combine: specify pages from each\n\n**Question 2: Visual Style**\n- Use strategy''s recommended style (show which style)\n- Or select from: cute / fresh / warm / bold / minimal / retro / pop / notion / chalkboard\n- Or type custom style description\n\n**Question 3: Visual Elements** (show after style selection)\nDisplay the selected style''s default elements from preset, then ask:\n- Use style defaults (Recommended) - show preview: background, decorations, emphasis\n- Adjust background - options: solid-pastel / solid-saturated / gradient-linear / gradient-radial / paper-texture / grid\n- Adjust decorations - options: hearts / stars-sparkles / flowers / clouds / leaves / confetti\n- Type custom element preferences\n\n**After response**:\n- Single strategy → copy to `outline.md` with confirmed style\n- Combination → merge specified pages with confirmed style\n- Custom request → regenerate based on feedback\n- Style defaults → use preset''s Element Combination as-is\n- Background adjustment → update elements.background with user choice\n- Decorations adjustment → update elements.decorations with user choice\n- Custom elements → parse user''s preferences into elements fields\n- Update `outline.md` frontmatter with final style and elements\n\n### Step 5: Generate Images\n\nWith confirmed outline + style + layout:\n\n**For each image (cover + content + ending)**:\n1. Save prompt to `prompts/NN-{type}-[slug].md` (in user''s preferred language)\n   - **Backup rule**: If prompt file exists, rename to `prompts/NN-{type}-[slug]-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n2. Generate image using confirmed style and layout\n   - **Backup rule**: If image file exists, rename to `NN-{type}-[slug]-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.png`\n3. Report progress after each generation\n\n**Watermark Application** (if enabled in preferences):\nAdd to each image generation prompt:\n```\nInclude a subtle watermark \"[content]\" positioned at [position].\nThe watermark should be legible but not distracting from the main content.\n```\nReference: `references/config/watermark-guide.md`\n\n**Image Generation Skill Selection**:\n- Check available image generation skills\n- If multiple skills available, ask user preference\n\n**Session Management**:\nIf image generation skill supports `--sessionId`:\n1. Generate unique session ID: `xhs-{topic-slug}-{timestamp}`\n2. Use same session ID for all images\n3. Ensures visual consistency across generated images\n\n### Step 6: Completion Report\n\n```\nXiaohongshu Infographic Series Complete!\n\nTopic: [topic]\nStrategy: [A/B/C/Combined]\nStyle: [style name]\nLayout: [layout name or \"varies\"]\nLocation: [directory path]\nImages: N total\n\n✓ analysis.md\n✓ outline-strategy-a.md\n✓ outline-strategy-b.md\n✓ outline-strategy-c.md\n✓ outline.md (selected: [strategy])\n\nFiles:\n- 01-cover-[slug].png ✓ Cover (sparse)\n- 02-content-[slug].png ✓ Content (balanced)\n- 03-content-[slug].png ✓ Content (dense)\n- 04-ending-[slug].png ✓ Ending (sparse)\n```\n\n## Image Modification\n\n| Action | Steps |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Edit** | **Update prompt file FIRST** → Regenerate with same session ID |\n| **Add** | Specify position → Create prompt → Generate → Renumber subsequent files (NN+1) → Update outline |\n| **Delete** | Remove files → Renumber subsequent (NN-1) → Update outline |\n\n**IMPORTANT**: When updating images, ALWAYS update the prompt file (`prompts/NN-{type}-[slug].md`) FIRST before regenerating. This ensures changes are documented and reproducible.\n\n## Content Breakdown Principles\n\n1. **Cover (Image 1)**: Hook + visual impact → `sparse` layout\n2. **Content (Middle)**: Core value per image → `balanced`/`dense`/`list`/`comparison`/`flow`\n3. **Ending (Last)**: CTA / summary → `sparse` or `balanced`\n\n**Style × Layout Matrix** (✓✓ = highly recommended, ✓ = works well):\n\n| | sparse | balanced | dense | list | comparison | flow | mindmap | quadrant |\n|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| cute | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| fresh | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| warm | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| bold | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ |\n| minimal | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| retro | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| pop | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| notion | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ |\n| chalkboard | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ |\n| study-notes | ✗ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ |\n\n## References\n\nDetailed templates in `references/` directory:\n\n**Elements** (Visual building blocks):\n- `elements/canvas.md` - Aspect ratios, safe zones, grid layouts\n- `elements/image-effects.md` - Cutout, stroke, filters\n- `elements/typography.md` - Decorated text (花字), tags, text direction\n- `elements/decorations.md` - Emphasis marks, backgrounds, doodles, frames\n\n**Presets** (Style presets):\n- `presets/<name>.md` - Element combination definitions (cute, notion, warm...)\n\n**Workflows** (Process guides):\n- `workflows/analysis-framework.md` - Content analysis framework\n- `workflows/outline-template.md` - Outline template with layout guide\n- `workflows/prompt-assembly.md` - Prompt assembly guide\n\n**Config** (Settings):\n- `config/preferences-schema.md` - EXTEND.md schema\n- `config/first-time-setup.md` - First-time setup flow\n- `config/watermark-guide.md` - Watermark configuration\n\n## Notes\n\n- Auto-retry once on failure | Cartoon alternatives for sensitive figures\n- Use confirmed language preference | Maintain style consistency\n- **Two confirmation points required** (Steps 2 & 4) - do not skip\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Step 0** for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:00:04.007Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing advanced infographic series generation for Xiaohongshu","zh":"非常适合需要为Xiaohongshu生成高级信息图系列的视觉内容代理","ja":"Xiaohongshu向けの高度なインフォグラフィックシリーズ生成を必要とするビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適","ko":"샤오홍슈를 위한 고급 정보 그래프 시리즈 생성이 필요한 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Contenido Visual que necesitan generación avanzada de series de infografías para Xiaohongshu","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contenu Visuel ayant besoin de génération avancée de séries d''infographies pour Xiaohongshu","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die eine erweiterte Erstellung von Infografik-Reihen für Xiaohongshu benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que precisam de geração avançada de séries de infográficos para Xiaohongshu","ru":"Идеально для Визуальных Контент Агентов, которым нужен продвинутый генератор инфографики для Xiaohongshu","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء سلسلة من الرسومات التوضيحية لمنصة Xiaohongshu"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to break down complex content into eye-catching infographic series with multiple style options, utilizing Markdown files and generating visually appealing layouts, and supports customization through style and layout specifications","zh":"赋予代理人将复杂内容分解为吸引眼球的信息图系列的能力，具有多种样式选项，利用Markdown文件生成视觉上吸引人的布局，并支持通过样式和布局规范进行自定义","ja":"エージェントが複雑なコンテンツを目につくインフォグラフィックシリーズに分解する能力を提供し、複数のスタイルオプションを備え、Markdownファイルを利用して視覚的に魅力的なレイアウトを生成し、スタイルおよびレイアウトの仕様を通じてカスタマイズをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 콘텐츠를 시각적으로 매력적인 정보 그래프 시리즈로 분해할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 여러 스타일 옵션을 가지며, Markdown 파일을 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적인 레이아웃을 생성하며, 스타일 및 레이아웃 사양을 통해 사용자 정의를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descomponer contenido