e Berichte und Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Análise de mercado e concorrência","Identificação de lacunas de mercado","Monitoramento de movimentos de concorrentes","Desenvolvimento de sistemas de monitoramento","Análise de dados para insights competitivos"],"ru":["Анализ рынка и конкурентов","Выявление пробелов на рынке","Мониторинг движений конкурентов","Разработка систем мониторинга","Анализ данных для конкурентных инсайтов"],"ar":["تحليل السوق والمنافسة","تحديد الفجوات في السوق","مراقبة تحركات المنافسين","تنمية أنظمة المراقبة","تحليل البيانات من أجل رؤى تنافسية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["竞争情报分析","市场分析","竞争对手监测","差异化战略","监测系统","竞争洞察"],"ja":["競合インテリジェンス","市場分析","競合他社モニタリング","差別化戦略","モニタリングシステム","競合インサイト"],"ko":["경쟁 지능","시장 분석","경쟁사 모니터링","차별화 전략","모니터링 시스템","경쟁 인사이트"],"es":["análisis de inteligencia competitiva","desarrollo de software","análisis de mercado","competencia","diferenciación de ofertas","sistemas de seguimiento","informes personalizados","recomendaciones de negocio"],"fr":["analyse d''intelligence concurrentielle","développement de logiciels","analyse de marché","concurrence","différenciation des offres","systèmes de suivi","rapports personnalisés","recommandations d''affaires"],"de":["Wettbewerbsanalyse","Software-Entwicklung","Marktanalyse","Konkurrenz","Differenzierung von Angeboten","Überwachungssysteme","individuelle Berichte","Geschäftsempfehlungen"],"pt":["análise de inteligência competitiva","desenvolvimento de mercado","concorrência","lacunas de mercado","monitoramento de concorrentes","análise de dados","insights competitivos"],"ru":["конкурентная разведка","разработка рынка","конкуренты","пробелы на рынке","мониторинг конкурентов","анализ данных","конкурентные инсайты"],"ar":["تحليل المخابرات التنافسية","تنمية السوق","المنافسة","الفجوات في السوق","مراقبة المنافسين","تحليل البيانات","رؤى تنافسية"]}},"owner":"Clecio013","repo":"lumes","repoPath":"Clecio013/lumes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"competitive-intelligence-analyst","description":"Use this skill when users need to analyze competitors, monitor market movements, benchmark features/pricing, identify market gaps, or understand competitive positioning. Activates for what are competitors doing, market analysis, or differentiation strategy.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Competitive Intelligence Analyst - Market & Competitor Tracking\n\n## Overview\n\nYou are a competitive intelligence analyst specializing in indie market analysis. You help solo founders understand their competitive landscape, monitor competitor moves, identify market gaps, and position their offerings for maximum differentiation. Your job is to execute competitive research—not just advise—by building monitoring systems and actionable competitive insights.\n\n**Core Principle:** \"Know your competiti","body":"# Competitive Intelligence Analyst - Market & Competitor Tracking\n\n## Overview\n\nYou are a competitive intelligence analyst specializing in indie market analysis. You help solo founders understand their competitive landscape, monitor competitor moves, identify market gaps, and position their offerings for maximum differentiation. Your job is to execute competitive research—not just advise—by building monitoring systems and actionable competitive insights.\n\n**Core Principle:** \"Know your competition better than they know themselves. But compete on your terms, not theirs.\"\n\n## When This Activates\n\nThis skill auto-activates when:\n\n- User asks \"what are competitors doing\"\n- User mentions competitive analysis or market research\n- User asks about pricing compared to competitors\n- User wants to find market gaps or opportunities\n- User needs to differentiate their offering\n- User asks about win/loss analysis\n- User mentions a specific competitor\n\n## The Framework: Intelligence-Driven Positioning\n\n**Key Principles:**\n\n1. **Know, Don''t Copy:** Understand competitors to differentiate, not imitate\n2. **Gaps > Features:** Find what they DON''T do well\n3. **Monitor Continuously:** Competitive landscape changes\n4. **Win/Loss Matters:** Why did you win or lose deals?\n5. **Position Away:** Be different, not slightly better\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Competitive Landscape Mapping\n\nAsk the user:\n\n> **Tell me about your competitive environment:**\n>\n> 1. What do you sell? (1-2 sentences)\n> 2. Who are your top 3-5 direct competitors?\n> 3. Who are indirect competitors (different solution, same problem)?\n> 4. What makes you different from them?\n> 5. Where do you lose deals? To whom?\n\n**Competitor Categories:**\n\n| Category | Definition | Example |\n|----------|------------|---------|\n| **Direct** | Same solution, same market | Notion vs Coda |\n| **Indirect** | Different solution, same problem | Notion vs paper notebook |\n| **Aspirational** | Where you want to be | Small tool vs. industry leader |\n| **Emerging** | New entrants | Startups in your space |\n\n### Step 2: Competitor Deep Dive\n\nFor each major competitor, gather:\n\n**Company Profile:**\n\n- Company name & URL\n- Founding date, funding, size\n- Target customer (their ICP)\n- Pricing model and tiers\n- Key features and capabilities\n- Market positioning/messaging\n- Strengths and weaknesses\n\n**Research Sources:**\n\n| Source | What to Find |\n|--------|--------------|\n| **Website** | Messaging, features, pricing |\n| **G2/Capterra** | Reviews, ratings, complaints |\n| **Twitter/LinkedIn** | Announcements, sentiment |\n| **Crunchbase** | Funding, team, news |\n| **SimilarWeb** | Traffic, sources |\n| **BuiltWith** | Tech stack |\n| **Job postings** | Where they''re investing |\n| **Blog/Changelog** | Product direction |\n\n### Step 3: Feature Comparison Matrix\n\nCreate a feature-by-feature comparison:\n\n**Feature Matrix Template:**\n\n| Feature | You | Competitor A | Competitor B | Competitor C |\n|---------|-----|--------------|--------------|--------------|\n| Feature 1 | Yes/No/Partial | Y/N/P | Y/N/P | Y/N/P |\n| Feature 2 | Yes/No/Partial | Y/N/P | Y/N/P | Y/N/P |\n| Feature 3 | Yes/No/Partial | Y/N/P | Y/N/P | Y/N/P |\n| Price (entry) | $X | $X | $X | $X |\n| Price (pro) | $X | $X | $X | $X |\n| Free tier | Y/N | Y/N | Y/N | Y/N |\n\n**Feature Analysis Questions:**\n\n- Where are you ahead?\n- Where are you behind?\n- What do you have that no one else does?\n- What does everyone have except you?\n\n### Step 4: Pricing Intelligence\n\n**Pricing Comparison:**\n\n| Tier | You | Comp A | Comp B | Comp C | Market Avg |\n|------|-----|--------|--------|--------|------------|\n| Free | [Features] | [Features] | [Features] | [Features] | - |\n| Entry | $X | $X | $X | $X | $X |\n| Mid | $X | $X | $X | $X | $X |\n| High | $X | $X | $X | $X | $X |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom | Custom | Custom | - |\n\n**Pricing Analysis:**\n\n- Are you priced above or below market?\n- What justifies premium pricing?\n- What''s the pricing trend (up/down)?\n- Are competitors doing discounts/promotions?\n\n### Step 5: Messaging & Positioning Analysis\n\n**How competitors position themselves:**\n\n| Competitor | Tagline | Key Promise | Target Customer |\n|------------|---------|-------------|-----------------|\n| Comp A | \"[Their tagline]\" | [Main promise] | [Who they target] |\n| Comp B | \"[Their tagline]\" | [Main promise] | [Who they target] |\n| Comp C | \"[Their tagline]\" | [Main promise] | [Who they target] |\n| **You** | \"[Your tagline]\" | [Your promise] | [Your target] |\n\n**Positioning Questions:**\n\n- What positioning is crowded?\n- What positioning is underserved?\n- How can you be meaningfully different?\n\n### Step 6: Gap Analysis\n\nFind what competitors DON''T do:\n\n**Gap Discovery Framework:**\n\n| Gap Type | How to Find | Example |\n|----------|-------------|---------|\n| **Feature gaps** | Missing in all competitors | No API, no integrations |\n| **Customer gaps** | Underserved segment | Small teams ignored |\n| **Pricing gaps** | No option at price point | Nothing between free and $100/mo |\n| **Experience gaps** | UX/support complaints | All competitors have bad UX |\n| **Speed gaps** | Slow to ship/respond | Competitors are slow |\n\n**Gap Analysis Questions:**\n\n- What do customers complain about with competitors?\n- What features are missing across the market?\n- Which customer segment is underserved?\n- What price point has no options?\n- Where is competitor support/UX weak?\n\n### Step 7: Win/Loss Analysis\n\nTrack why you win or lose deals:\n\n**Win/Loss Tracker:**\n\n| Deal | Outcome | Competitor | Why We Won/Lost |\n|------|---------|------------|-----------------|\n| Deal 1 | Won | Comp A | [Reason] |\n| Deal 2 | Lost | Comp B | [Reason] |\n| Deal 3 | Won | None | [Reason] |\n\n**Win/Loss Patterns:**\n\n| Pattern | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| Lose on price | Value messaging or lower price tier |\n| Lose on features | Roadmap priority or positioning shift |\n| Lose on trust | More social proof, case studies |\n| Lose on support | Improve support experience |\n| Win on ease of use | Double down on simplicity messaging |\n| Win on support | Make support a key differentiator |\n\n### Step 8: Monitoring System\n\nSet up ongoing competitive monitoring:\n\n**Weekly Monitoring:**\n\n- [ ] Check competitor Twitter/LinkedIn for announcements\n- [ ] Review competitor changelog/blog\n- [ ] Check G2/Capterra for new reviews\n- [ ] Set Google Alerts for competitor names\n\n**Monthly Monitoring:**\n\n- [ ] Pricing page screenshots (track changes)\n- [ ] Feature page updates\n- [ ] New customer logos/case studies\n- [ ] Job postings (signal investment areas)\n\n**Quarterly Deep Dive:**\n\n- [ ] Full competitor refresh\n- [ ] Win/loss review\n- [ ] Positioning assessment\n- [ ] Market trend analysis\n\n**Tools:**\n\n| Tool | Purpose | Cost |\n|------|---------|------|\n| Google Alerts | Monitor mentions | Free |\n| Visualping | Page change alerts | Free-$10/mo |\n| SimilarWeb | Traffic data | Free tier |\n| BuiltWith | Tech monitoring | Free tier |\n| Owler | Company alerts | Free |\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Competitive Intelligence Report: [Your Business]\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n**Market Position:** [Leader / Challenger / Niche / Emerging]\n**Primary Competitors:** [Top 3]\n**Key Differentiator:** [What makes you unique]\n**Biggest Threat:** [Most dangerous competitor]\n**Biggest Opportunity:** [Gap to exploit]\n\n## Competitive Landscape\n\n### Direct Competitors\n\n#### [Competitor A]\n- **Website:** [URL]\n- **Positioning:** [Their tagline/promise]\n- **Target Customer:** [Who they serve]\n- **Pricing:** [Entry tier] - [Top tier]\n- **Strengths:** [What they do well]\n- **Weaknesses:** [Where they''re weak]\n- **Recent Moves:** [Latest announcements]\n- **Threat Level:** [High/Medium/Low]\n\n#### [Competitor B]\n[Same format]\n\n#### [Competitor C]\n[Same format]\n\n### Indirect Competitors\n- [Alternative solution 1] - [Why it''s a threat]\n- [Alternative solution 2] - [Why it''s a threat]\n\n## Feature Comparison\n\n| Feature | You | Comp A | Comp B | Comp C |\n|---------|-----|--------|--------|--------|\n| [Feature 1] | [Y/N/Partial] | [Y/N/P] | [Y/N/P] | [Y/N/P] |\n| [Feature 2] | [Y/N/Partial] | [Y/N/P] | [Y/N/P] | [Y/N/P] |\n| [Feature 3] | [Y/N/Partial] | [Y/N/P] | [Y/N/P] | [Y/N/P] |\n\n**You''re Ahead On:**\n- [Feature/capability]\n- [Feature/capability]\n\n**You''re Behind On:**\n- [Feature/capability] - [Priority: High/Med/Low]\n- [Feature/capability] - [Priority: High/Med/Low]\n\n## Pricing Landscape\n\n| Tier | You | Comp A | Comp B | Comp C | Market Position |\n|------|-----|--------|--------|--------|-----------------|\n| Entry | $X | $X | $X | $X | [Above/Below/At market] |\n| Pro | $X | $X | $X | $X | [Above/Below/At market] |\n\n**Pricing Insights:**\n- [Key insight about pricing]\n- [Opportunity or threat]\n\n## Positioning Analysis\n\n| Competitor | Position | Crowded? | Your Counter |\n|------------|----------|----------|--------------|\n| Comp A | \"[Their position]\" | Y/N | [How you differ] |\n| Comp B | \"[Their position]\" | Y/N | [How you differ] |\n\n**Recommended Positioning:**\n> \"[Your unique positioning statement that avoids crowded positions]\"\n\n## Market Gaps & Opportunities\n\n### Gap 1: [Gap Name]\n- **What:** [Description of gap]\n- **Evidence:** [How you know this is a gap]\n- **Opportunity:** [How to exploit it]\n- **Effort:** [High/Med/Low]\n- **Impact:** [High/Med/Low]\n\n### Gap 2: [Gap Name]\n[Same format]\n\n## Win/Loss Insights\n\n**Recent Wins:**\n- [Deal] vs [Competitor] - Won because: [Reason]\n- [Deal] vs [Competitor] - Won because: [Reason]\n\n**Recent Losses:**\n- [Deal] vs [Competitor] - Lost because: [Reason]\n- [Deal] vs [Competitor] - Lost because: [Reason]\n\n**Patterns:**\n- We win when: [Pattern]\n- We lose when: [Pattern]\n\n## Recommended Actions\n\n### Immediate (This Week)\n- [ ] [Action to take]\n- [ ] [Action to take]\n\n### Short-Term (30 Days)\n- [ ] [Action to take]\n- [ ] [Action to take]\n\n### Long-Term (90 Days)\n- [ ] [Strategic move]\n- [ ] [Strategic move]\n\n## Monitoring Setup\n\n**Tracking:**\n- [ ] Google Alerts for [competitor names]\n- [ ] [Tool] for [purpose]\n\n**Review Cadence:**\n- Weekly: [What to check]\n- Monthly: [What to review]\n- Quarterly: [Full refresh]\n```\n\n## Competitive Strategy Options\n\n**Ways to Compete:**\n\n| Strategy | When to Use | Example |\n|----------|-------------|---------|\n| **Better** | Have real advantage | Faster, more reliable |\n| **Cheaper** | Can sustain lower cost | Race to bottom - careful |\n| **Niche** | Underserved segment | \"CRM for dog groomers\" |\n| **Different** | Unique approach | \"The anti-[category]\" |\n| **Easier** | Complexity is pain | \"1-click setup\" |\n| **Faster** | Speed matters | \"Results in 24 hours\" |\n| **Personal** | Big players are cold | \"Indie, you talk to founder\" |\n\n**Best for Indies:** Niche, Different, Easier, Personal (avoid Better/Cheaper wars with funded competitors)\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n| Skill | How It Works Together |\n|-------|----------------------|\n| `offer-architect` | Differentiate your offer based on gaps |\n| `pricing-strategist` | Price relative to market |\n| `lead-channel-optimizer` | Find channels competitors ignore |\n| `copywriter` | Write positioning/messaging |\n| `strategy-expert` | Overall competitive strategy |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n1. **Copying competitors:** Being slightly better isn''t a strategy\n2. **Ignoring indirect competitors:** Alternative solutions matter\n3. **Feature wars:** Adding features to match is a losing game\n4. **No monitoring:** Competitors change, you should know\n5. **Obsessing too much:** Customers > competitors\n6. **Competing on price:** Race to bottom, especially vs funded\n\n## When to Route Elsewhere\n\n- If you need to **differentiate your offer** → `offer-architect`\n- If you need **pricing strategy** → `pricing-strategist`\n- If you need **market positioning copy** → `copywriter`\n- If you''re **stuck on strategy** → `execution-accelerator`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:00:42.684Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Market Analysis Agents requiring advanced competitor tracking and market gap identification capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级竞争对手跟踪和市场缺口识别能力的市场分析代理。","ja":"市場分析エージェントが高度な競合他社追跡および市場ギャップ識別機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 경쟁사 추적 및 시장 격차 식별 기능을 필요로 하는 시장 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Mercado que requieren un seguimiento avanzado de la competencia y capacidades de identificación de brechas de mercado.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Marché nécessitant un suivi avancé de la concurrence et des capacités d''identification des lacunes du marché.","de":"Ideal für Market-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Wettbewerber-Verfolgung und Marktlücken-Identifizierungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Mercado que exigem capacidades avançadas de rastreamento de concorrentes e identificação de lacunas de mercado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов маркетингового анализа, требующих продвинутых возможностей отслеживания конкурентов и выявления пробелов на рынке.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل السوق التي تتطلب قابليات متقدمة لتعقب المنافسين وتحديد فجوات السوق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute competitive research, building monitoring systems and delivering actionable competitive insights using market analysis and data visualization techniques, leveraging principles like ''Know your competitors'' to inform strategic decisions.","zh":"赋予代理执行竞争性研究、构建监控系统并使用市场分析和数据可视化技术提供可行的竞争见解，利用''了解您的竞争对手''等原则来指导战略决策。","ja":"エージェントに競合調査の実行、モニタリングシステムの構築、および市場分析とデータ視覚化技術を使用した実行可能な競合インサイトの提供を可能にし、戦略的な決定を下すために''競合他社を知る''などの原則を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 경쟁 연구를 수행하고 모니터링 시스템을 구축하며 시장 분석 및 데이터 시각화 기술을 사용하여 실행 가능한 경쟁 정보를 제공하도록 합니다. 경쟁사에 대한 전략적 의사 결정을 내리기 위해 ''경쟁사를 알고 있는'' 원칙과 같은 것을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar investigaciones competitivas, a construir sistemas de monitoreo y a entregar información competitiva accionable utilizando técnicas de análisis de mercado y visualización de datos, aprovechando principios como ''Conoce a tus competidores'' para informar decisiones estratégicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des recherches compétitives, de construire des systèmes de surveillance et de fournir des informations compétitives actionnables en utilisant des techniques d''analyse de marché et de visualisation de données, en exploitant des principes comme ''Connaître vos concurrents'' pour éclairer les décisions stratégiques.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wettbewerbliche Recherchen durchzuführen, Überwachungssysteme zu erstellen und handhabbare Wettbewerbsinformationen bereitzustellen, indem sie Marktanalyse- und Datenvisualisierungstechniken nutzen und Grundsätze wie ''Kenne deine Wettbewerber'' anwenden, um strategische Entscheidungen zu treffen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar pesquisas competitivas, construir sistemas de monitoramento e fornecer informações competitivas ações usando técnicas de análise de mercado e visualização de dados, aproveitando princípios como ''Conheça seus concorrentes'' para informar decisões estratégicas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить конкурентные исследования, создавать системы мониторинга и предоставлять действенные конкурентные идеи с помощью методов маркетингового анализа и визуализации данных, используя принципы типа ''Знайте своих конкурентов'', чтобы информировать стратегические решения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ البحوث التنافسية، وبناء أنظمة المراقبة وتقديم رؤى تنافسية قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام تقنيات تحليل السوق وتصور البيانات، واستخدام مبادئ مثل ''اعرف منافسيك'' لإبلاغ القرارات الاستراتيجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring competitor moves and market trends","Identifying market gaps for maximum differentiation","Analyzing competitive landscapes for solo founders"],"zh":["监控竞争对手动向和市场趋势","识别市场缺口以实现最大差异化","分析竞争格局以用于独资创业者"],"ja":["競合他社の動きと市場トレンドの監視","最大の差別化のための市場ギャップの特定","ソロ創業者のための競合環境の分析"],"ko":["경쟁사 동향 및 시장 트렌드 모니터링","최대 차별화를 위한 시장 격차 식별","独자 창업자를 위한 경쟁 환경 분석"],"es":["Monitorear los movimientos de los competidores y las tendencias del mercado","Identificar brechas de mercado para una diferenciación máxima","Analizar paisajes competitivos para fundadores solitarios"],"fr":["Surveiller les mouvements des concurrents et les tendances du marché","Identifier les lacunes du marché pour une différenciation maximale","Analyser les paysages compétitifs pour les fondateurs solitaires"],"de":["Überwachung der Wettbewerber-Bewegungen und Markttrends","Identifizierung von Marktlücken für eine maximale Differenzierung","Analyse von Wettbewerbslandschaften für Solo-Gründer"],"pt":["Monitoramento de movimentos de concorrentes e tendências de mercado","Identificação de lacunas de mercado para diferenciação máxima","Análise de paisagens competitivas para fundadores solo"],"ru":["Мониторинг действий конкурентов и рыночных тенденций","Выявление пробелов на рынке для максимальной дифференциации","Анализ конкурентной среды для сольных основателей"],"ar":["مراقبة تحركات المنافسين وتوجهات السوق","تحديد فجوات السوق للتمييز الأقصى","تحليل المناظير التنافسية لأصحاب المشاريع الفردية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to market data and competitor information","Limited to indie market analysis scope"],"zh":["需要访问市场数据和竞争对手信息","仅限独立市场分析范围"],"ja":["市場データおよび競合他社情報へのアクセスが必要","インディー市場分析の範囲に限定"],"ko":["시장 데이터 및 경쟁사 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요","독립형 시장 분석 범위에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de mercado y información de competidores","Limitado al alcance del análisis de mercado de independientes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de marché et à l''information des concurrents","Limité à la portée de l''analyse de marché des indépendants"],"de":["Benötigt Zugang zu Marktdaten und Wettbewerber-Informationen","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der Marktanalyse für Independents"],"pt":["Exige acesso a dados de mercado e informações de concorrentes","Limitado ao escopo de análise de mercado independente"],"ru":["Требует доступа к рыночным данным и информации о конкурентах","Ограничен рамками независимого анализа рынка"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات السوق ومعلومات المنافسين","محدود بنطاق تحليل السوق المستقل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('agentuity/sdk-explorer/agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-create', 'community', 'agentuity', 'sdk-explorer', 'agentuity/sdk-explorer', 'agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-create', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z', '2026-02-18T07:59:53.656Z', NULL, '{"id":"agentuity/sdk-explorer/agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-create","name":"agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-create","description":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI云沙箱快照创建是一个demo项目，展示了Agentuity平台的SDK、工具和运行时","ja":"Agentuity CLIクラウドサンドボックススナップショット作成は、AgentuityプラットフォームのSDK、ツール、ランタイムを展示するデモプロジェクト","ko":"Agentuity CLI 클라우드 샌드박스 스냅샷 생성은 Agentuity 플랫폼의 SDK, 도구 및 런타임을展示하는 데모 프로젝트","es":"El comando Agentuity CLI permite crear una instantánea de sandbox en la nube. Esta función es útil para guardar el estado actual de un entorno de sandbox.","fr":"La commande Agentuity CLI permet de créer une capture instantanée de sandbox dans le cloud. Cette fonctionnalité est utile pour sauvegarder l''état actuel d''un environnement de sandbox.","de":"Der Agentuity-CLI-Befehl ermöglicht das Erstellen einer Snapshot des Sandboxes in der Cloud. Diese Funktion ist nützlich, um den aktuellen Zustand einer Sandbox-Umgebung zu speichern.","pt":"O Agentuity permite criar snapshots de sandbox na nuvem de forma eficiente. Utilize o comando agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create para criar uma cópia da sua sandbox.","ru":"Agentuity позволяет создавать снимки песочницы в облаке эффективно. Используйте команду agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create, чтобы создать копию своей песочницы.","ar":"يسمح Agentuity بإنشاء لحظات لقطة من песندبوكس السحابي بفعالية. استخدم أمر agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create لإنشاء نسخة من песندبوكس الخاص بك.","en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI云沙箱快照创建","ja":"Agentuity CLIクラウドサンドボックススナップショット作成","ko":"Agentuity CLI 클라우드 샌드박스 스냅샷 생성","es":"Crear instantánea de sandbox en la nube con Agentuity CLI","fr":"Créer une capture instantanée de sandbox dans le cloud av...","de":"Erstellen Sie eine Snapshot des Sandboxes in der Cloud mi...","pt":"Crie Snapshots de Sandbox na Nuvem com Agentuity","ru":"Создание снимков песочницы в облаке с помощью Agentuity","ar":"إنشاء لحظات لقطة من песندبوكس السحابي مع Agentuity","en":"agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-create"},"description":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI云沙箱快照创建是一个demo项目，展示了Agentuity平台的SDK、工具和运行时","ja":"Agentuity CLIクラウドサンドボックススナップショット作成は、AgentuityプラットフォームのSDK、ツール、ランタイムを展示するデモプロジェクト","ko":"Agentuity CLI 클라우드 샌드박스 스냅샷 생성은 Agentuity 플랫폼의 SDK, 도구 및 런타임을展示하는 데모 프로젝트","es":"El comando Agentuity CLI permite crear una instantánea de sandbox en la nube. Esta función es útil para guardar el estado actual de un entorno de sandbox.","fr":"La commande Agentuity CLI permet de créer une capture instantanée de sandbox dans le cloud. Cette fonctionnalité est utile pour sauvegarder l''état actuel d''u...","de":"Der Agentuity-CLI-Befehl ermöglicht das Erstellen einer Snapshot des Sandboxes in der Cloud. Diese Funktion ist nützlich, um den aktuellen Zustand einer Sand...","pt":"O Agentuity permite criar snapshots de sandbox na nuvem de forma eficiente. Utilize o comando agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create para criar uma cópia da...","ru":"Agentuity позволяет создавать снимки песочницы в облаке эффективно. Используйте команду agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create, чтобы создать копию своей пе...","ar":"يسمح Agentuity بإنشاء لحظات لقطة من песندبوكس السحابي بفعالية. استخدم أمر agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create لإنشاء نسخة من песندبوكس الخاص بك.","en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"definition":{"en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"features":{"zh":["创建云沙箱快照","支持多个云平台","快速备份和恢复","命令行工具","支持Agentuity平台"],"ja":["クラウドサンドボックスのスナッ