ォーム"],"ko":["Agentuity CLI","클라우드 샌드박스 스냅샷","명령줄 도구","클라우드 컴퓨팅","백업 및 복원","Agentuity 플랫폼"],"es":["Agentuity CLI","sandbox en la nube","instantánea de sandbox","comando Agentuity","autenticación con Agentuity","contexto de organización"],"fr":["Agentuity CLI","sandbox dans le cloud","capture instantanée de sandbox","commande Agentuity","authentification avec Agentuity","contexte d''organisation"],"de":["Agentuity CLI","Sandbox in der Cloud","Snapshot des Sandboxes","Agentuity-CLI-Befehl","Authentifizierung mit Agentuity","Organisationskontext"],"pt":["agentuity","sandbox na nuvem","snapshot","comando agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create","autenticação","contexto de organização","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Agentuity","песочница в облаке","снимок","команда agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create","аутентификация","контекст организации","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Agentuity","پسندبوكس السحابي","لحظة لقطة","أمر agentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create","التحقق من الهوية","سياق المنظمة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"agentuity","repo":"sdk-explorer","repoPath":"agentuity/sdk-explorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentuity-cli-cloud-sandbox-snapshot-create","description":"Create a snapshot from a sandbox. Requires authentication. Use for Agentuity cloud platform operations","version":"0.1.2","tags":"slow requires-auth","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Sandbox Snapshot Create\n\nCreate a snapshot from a sandbox\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Organization context required (`--org-id` or default org)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create <sandboxId> [options]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<sandboxId>` | string | Yes | - |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|-","body":"# Cloud Sandbox Snapshot Create\n\nCreate a snapshot from a sandbox\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n- Organization context required (`--org-id` or default org)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity cloud sandbox snapshot create <sandboxId> [options]\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n| Argument | Type | Required | Description |\n|----------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `<sandboxId>` | string | Yes | - |\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Type | Required | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--tag` | string | Yes | - | Tag for the snapshot |\n\n## Examples\n\nCreate a snapshot from a sandbox:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud sandbox snapshot create sbx_abc123\n```\n\nCreate a tagged snapshot:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli cloud sandbox snapshot create sbx_abc123 --tag latest\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"snapshotId\": \"string\",\n  \"tag\": \"unknown\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": \"number\",\n  \"fileCount\": \"number\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"string\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `snapshotId` | string | Snapshot ID |\n| `tag` | unknown | Snapshot tag |\n| `sizeBytes` | number | Snapshot size in bytes |\n| `fileCount` | number | Number of files in snapshot |\n| `createdAt` | string | Snapshot creation timestamp |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T07:59:53.656Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring sandbox snapshot creation capabilities within the Agentuity platform","zh":"适用于需要在 Agentuity 平台创建沙盒快照的云代理","ja":"Agentuity プラットフォーム内でサンドボックス スナップショットを作成する必要があるクラウド エージェントに最適","ko":"에이전투티 플랫폼 내에서 샌드박스 스냅샷을 생성해야 하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Cloud que requieren capacidades de creación de instantáneas de sandbox dentro de la plataforma Agentuity","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des capacités de création d''instantanés de sandbox au sein de la plateforme Agentuity","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die Sandbox-Snapshot-Erstellungs-Funktionen innerhalb der Agentuity-Plattform benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem capacidades de criação de snapshots de sandbox dentro da plataforma Agentuity","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих возможности создания снимков sandbox в платформе Agentuity","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل السحابي التي تتطلب إمكانيات إنشاء لقطة sandbox داخل منصة Agentuity"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create snapshots from sandboxes using the Agentuity CLI, enabling organization context management via --org-id and default org settings, while leveraging authenticated sessions initiated by agentuity auth login","zh":"通过 Agentuity CLI 启用代理创建沙盒快照，使用 --org-id 和默认组织设置管理组织上下文，同时利用通过 agentuity auth login 初始化的身份验证会话","ja":"Agentuity CLI を使用してエージェントがサンドボックス スナップショットを作成できるようにし、--org-id とデフォルトの組織設定を使用して組織コンテキストを管理し、agentuity auth login で開始された認証セッションを活用","ko":"에이전투티 CLI를 사용하여 에이전트가 샌드박스 스냅샷을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 --org-id 및 기본 조직 설정을 사용하여 조직 컨텍스트를 관리하고 에이전투티 인증 로그인에서 시작된 인증 세션을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear instantáneas desde sandbox utilizando la CLI de Agentuity, lo que permite la gestión del contexto de la organización a través de --org-id y la configuración de organización predeterminada, aprovechando las sesiones autenticadas iniciadas por agentuity auth login","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour créer des instantanés à partir de sandbox en utilisant la CLI d''Agentuity, ce qui permet la gestion du contexte d''organisation via --org-id et les paramètres d''organisation par défaut, tout en exploitant les sessions authentifiées initiées par agentuity auth login","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Snapshots aus Sandboxes mithilfe der Agentuity-CLI zu erstellen, wodurch die Verwaltung des Organisationskontexts über --org-id und die Standardorganisations-Einstellungen ermöglicht wird, während authentifizierte Sitzungen, die von agentuity auth login initiiert werden, genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem snapshots de sandbox usando a CLI do Agentuity, permitindo o gerenciamento de contexto de organização via --org-id e configurações de organização padrão, aproveitando sessões autenticadas iniciadas por agentuity auth login","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать снимки sandbox с помощью CLI Agentuity, обеспечивая управление контекстом организации через --org-id и настройки организации по умолчанию, используя аутентифицированные сеансы, инициированные agentuity auth login","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء لقطة sandbox باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر Agentuity، مما يتيح إدارة سياق المنظمة عبر --org-id وإعدادات المنظمة الافتراضية، مع الاستفادة من الجلسات المُصادق عليها التي تمت إعدادها بواسطة تسجيل الدخول المُصادق على agentuity"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating sandbox snapshots for development environments","Managing organization contexts with --org-id","Automating sandbox snapshot creation via authenticated sessions"],"zh":["为开发环境创建沙盒快照","使用 --org-id 管理组织上下文","通过身份验证会话自动创建沙盒快照"],"ja":["開発環境用のサンドボックス スナップショットを作成","--org-id を使用して組織コンテキストを管理","認証セッションを使用してサンドボックス スナップショットを作成を自動化"],"ko":["개발 환경을 위한 샌드박스 스냅샷 생성","--org-id를 사용하여 조직 컨텍스트 관리","인증 세션을 통해 샌드박스 스냅샷 생성 자동화"],"es":["Crear instantáneas de sandbox para entornos de desarrollo","Gestionar contextos de organización con --org-id","Automatizar la creación de instantáneas de sandbox mediante sesiones autenticadas"],"fr":["Créer des instantanés de sandbox pour les environnements de développement","Gérer les contextes d''organisation avec --org-id","Automatiser la création d''instantanés de sandbox via des sessions authentifiées"],"de":["Erstellen von Sandbox-Snapshots für Entwicklungsumgebungen","Verwalten von Organisationskontexten mit --org-id","Automatisieren der Erstellung von Sandbox-Snapshots über authentifizierte Sitzungen"],"pt":["Criação de snapshots de sandbox para ambientes de desenvolvimento","Gerenciamento de contextos de organização com --org-id","Automação da criação de snapshots de sandbox via sessões autenticadas"],"ru":["Создание снимков sandbox для сред разработки","Управление контекстами организации с помощью --org-id","Автоматизация создания снимков sandbox через аутентифицированные сеансы"],"ar":["إنشاء لقطة sandbox لبيئات التطوير","إدارة سياقات المنظمة باستخدام --org-id","آليّة إنشاء لقطة sandbox عبر الجلسات المُصادق عليها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires authentication with agentuity auth login","Organization context required via --org-id or default org"],"zh":["需要使用 agentuity auth login 进行身份验证","需要通过 --org-id 或默认组织设置提供组织上下文"],"ja":["agentuity auth login を使用した認証が必要","--org-id またはデフォルトの組織設定を使用して組織コンテキストを提供する必要がある"],"ko":["에이전투티 인증 로그인을 사용한 인증 필요","--org-id 또는 기본 조직 설정을 사용하여 조직 컨텍스트 제공 필요"],"es":["Requiere autenticación con agentuity auth login","Se requiere contexto de organización a través de --org-id o configuración de organización predeterminada"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification avec agentuity auth login","Contexte d''organisation requis via --org-id ou paramètres d''organisation par défaut"],"de":["Erfordert Authentifizierung mit agentuity auth login","Organisationskontext erforderlich über --org-id oder Standardorganisations-Einstellungen"],"pt":["Exige autenticação com agentuity auth login","Contexto de organização necessário via --org-id ou organização padrão"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации с помощью agentuity auth login","Контекст организации необходим через --org-id или организацию по умолчанию"],"ar":["يتطلب المصادقة باستخدام تسجيل الدخول المُصادق على agentuity","سياق المنظمة مطلوب عبر --org-id أو إعدادات المنظمة الافتراضية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('first-fluke/fullstack-starter/marketing-ideas', 'community', 'first-fluke', 'fullstack-starter', 'first-fluke/fullstack-starter', 'marketing-ideas', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:01:00.438Z', NULL, '{"id":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter/marketing-ideas","name":"marketing-ideas","description":{"zh":"该技能提供一个生产就绪的全栈单体仓库模板，包含 Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform 和 mise，帮助开发者找到合适的 SaaS 营销策略。","ja":"このスキルは、Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform、mise を含む生産準備完了のフルスタックモノレポテンプレートを提供し、開発者が適切な SaaS マーケティング戦略を見つけるのを支援します。","ko":"이 스킬은 Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform 및 mise를 포함하는 프로덕션 준비 완료된 풀스택 모노레포 템플릿을 제공하여 개발자가 적절한 SaaS 마케팅 전략을 찾는 것을 지원합니다.","pt":"Este template de monorepo fullstack oferece 139 ideias de marketing para SaaS, incluindo Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter e Terraform.","ru":"Этот шаблон монорепозитория fullstack предлагает 139 маркетинговых идей для SaaS, включая Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter и Terraform.","ar":"قالب Monorepo الكامل هذا يوفر 139 فكرة تسويقية لموقع SaaS ، بما في ذلك Next.js و FastAPI و Flutter و Terraform.","en":"Production-ready fullstack monorepo template with Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform, and mise"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SaaS 营销创意模板","ja":"SaaS マーケティングアイデアテンプレート","ko":"SaaS 마케팅 아이디어 템플릿","pt":"Ideias de Marketing para SaaS com Next.js e FastAPI","ru":"Маркетинговые идеи для SaaS с Next.js и FastAPI","ar":"أفكار تسويقية لموقع SaaS باستخدام Next.js و FastAPI","en":"marketing-ideas"},"description":{"zh":"该技能提供一个生产就绪的全栈单体仓库模板，包含 Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform 和 mise，帮助开发者找到合适的 SaaS 营销策略。","ja":"このスキルは、Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform、mise を含む生産準備完了のフルスタックモノレポテンプレートを提供し、開発者が適切な SaaS マーケティング戦略を見つけるのを支援します。","ko":"이 스킬은 Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform 및 mise를 포함하는 프로덕션 준비 완료된 풀스택 모노레포 템플릿을 제공하여 개발자가 적절한 SaaS 마케팅 전략을 찾는 것을 지원합니다.","pt":"Este template de monorepo fullstack oferece 139 ideias de marketing para SaaS, incluindo Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter e Terraform.","ru":"Этот шаблон монорепозитория fullstack предлагает 139 маркетинговых идей для SaaS, включая Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter и Terraform.","ar":"قالب Monorepo الكامل هذا يوفر 139 فكرة تسويقية لموقع SaaS ، بما في ذلك Next.js و FastAPI و Flutter و Terraform.","en":"Production-ready fullstack monorepo template with Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform, and mise"},"definition":{"en":"Production-ready fullstack monorepo template with Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform, and mise"},"features":{"zh":["生产就绪的全栈单体仓库模板","包含 Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform 和 mise","139 个已验证的 SaaS 营销创意","适合不同阶段和资源的营销策略","支持多种技术栈"],"ja":["生産準備完了のフルスタックモノレポテンプレート","Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform、mise を含む","139 の実証済み SaaS マーケティングアイデア","異なる段階とリソースのマーケティング戦略に適合","複数のテクノロジースタックをサポート"],"ko":["프로덕션 준비 완료된 풀스택 모노레포 템플릿","Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, Terraform 및 mise 포함","139개의 검증된 SaaS 마케팅 아이디어","다양한 단계와 리소스의 마케팅 전략에 적합","複数의 기술 스택을 지원"],"pt":["Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","139 ideias de marketing"],"ru":["Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","139 маркетинговых идей"],"ar":["Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","139 فكرة تسويقية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS 营销","全栈单体仓库","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","营销策略"],"ja":["SaaS マーケティング","フルスタックモノレポ","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","マーケティング戦略"],"ko":["SaaS 마케팅","풀스택 모노레포","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","마케팅 전략"],"pt":["SaaS","marketing digital","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","monorepo"],"ru":["SaaS","цифровой маркетинг","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","монорепозиторий"],"ar":["SaaS","التسويق الرقمي","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","monorepo"]}},"owner":"first-fluke","repo":"fullstack-starter","repoPath":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marketing-ideas","description":"When the user needs marketing ideas, inspiration, or strategies for their SaaS or software product. Also use when the user asks for marketing ideas, growth ideas, how to market, marketing strategies, marketing tactics, ways to promote, or ideas to grow. This skill provides 139 proven marketing approaches organized by category.","bodyPreview":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas","body":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas:\n1. Ask about their product, audience, and current stage if not clear\n2. Suggest 3-5 most relevant ideas based on their context\n3. Provide details on implementation for chosen ideas\n4. Consider their resources (time, budget, team size)\n\n---\n\n## Ideas by Category (Quick Reference)\n\n| Category | Ideas | Examples |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Content & SEO | 1-10 | Programmatic SEO, Glossary marketing, Content repurposing |\n| Competitor | 11-13 | Comparison pages, Marketing jiu-jitsu |\n| Free Tools | 14-22 | Calculators, Generators, Chrome extensions |\n| Paid Ads | 23-34 | LinkedIn, Google, Retargeting, Podcast ads |\n| Social & Community | 35-44 | LinkedIn audience, Reddit marketing, Short-form video |\n| Email | 45-53 | Founder emails, Onboarding sequences, Win-back |\n| Partnerships | 54-64 | Affiliate programs, Integration marketing, Newsletter swaps |\n| Events | 65-72 | Webinars, Conference speaking, Virtual summits |\n| PR & Media | 73-76 | Press coverage, Documentaries |\n| Launches | 77-86 | Product Hunt, Lifetime deals, Giveaways |\n| Product-Led | 87-96 | Viral loops, Powered-by marketing, Free migrations |\n| Content Formats | 97-109 | Podcasts, Courses, Annual reports, Year wraps |\n| Unconventional | 110-122 | Awards, Challenges, Guerrilla marketing |\n| Platforms | 123-130 | App marketplaces, Review sites, YouTube |\n| International | 131-132 | Expansion, Price localization |\n| Developer | 133-136 | DevRel, Certifications |\n| Audience-Specific | 137-139 | Referrals, Podcast tours, Customer language |\n\n**For the complete list with descriptions**: See [references/ideas-by-category.md](references/ideas-by-category.md)\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Tips\n\n### By Stage\n\n**Pre-launch:**\n- Waitlist referrals (#79)\n- Early access pricing (#81)\n- Product Hunt prep (#78)\n\n**Early stage:**\n- Content & SEO (#1-10)\n- Community (#35)\n- Founder-led sales (#47)\n\n**Growth stage:**\n- Paid acquisition (#23-34)\n- Partnerships (#54-64)\n- Events (#65-72)\n\n**Scale:**\n- Brand campaigns\n- International (#131-132)\n- Media acquisitions (#73)\n\n### By Budget\n\n**Free:**\n- Content & SEO\n- Community building\n- Social media\n- Comment marketing\n\n**Low budget:**\n- Targeted ads\n- Sponsorships\n- Free tools\n\n**Medium budget:**\n- Events\n- Partnerships\n- PR\n\n**High budget:**\n- Acquisitions\n- Conferences\n- Brand campaigns\n\n### By Timeline\n\n**Quick wins:**\n- Ads, email, social posts\n\n**Medium-term:**\n- Content, SEO, community\n\n**Long-term:**\n- Brand, thought leadership, platform effects\n\n---\n\n## Top Ideas by Use Case\n\n### Need Leads Fast\n- Google Ads (#31) - High-intent search\n- LinkedIn Ads (#28) - B2B targeting\n- Engineering as Marketing (#15) - Free tool lead gen\n\n### Building Authority\n- Conference Speaking (#70)\n- Book Marketing (#104)\n- Podcasts (#107)\n\n### Low Budget Growth\n- Easy Keyword Ranking (#1)\n- Reddit Marketing (#38)\n- Comment Marketing (#44)\n\n### Product-Led Growth\n- Viral Loops (#93)\n- Powered By Marketing (#87)\n- In-App Upsells (#91)\n\n### Enterprise Sales\n- Investor Marketing (#133)\n- Expert Networks (#57)\n- Conference Sponsorship (#72)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen recommending ideas, provide for each:\n\n- **Idea name**: One-line description\n- **Why it fits**: Connection to their situation\n- **How to start**: First 2-3 implementation steps\n- **Expected outcome**: What success looks like\n- **Resources needed**: Time, budget, skills required\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current stage and main growth goal?\n2. What''s your marketing budget and team size?\n3. What have you already tried that worked or didn''t?\n4. What competitor tactics do you admire?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For scaling SEO content (#4)\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison pages (#11)\n- **email-sequence**: For email marketing tactics\n- **free-tool-strategy**: For engineering as marketing (#15)\n- **referral-program**: For viral growth (#93)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:01:00.438Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SaaS-focused AI Agents needing proven marketing strategies and Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter, and Terraform integration.","zh":"非常适合需要已验证的营销策略和 Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter 和 Terraform 集成的 SaaS 专注的 AI 代理。","ja":"Next.js、FastAPI、Flutter、Terraform の統合と実証済みのマーケティング戦略を必要とする SaaS 対応の AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter 및 Terraform 통합 및 검증된 마케팅 전략이 필요한 SaaS 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en SaaS que necesitan estrategias de marketing probadas y la integración de Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter y Terraform.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur le SaaS qui ont besoin de stratégies de marketing éprouvées et d''une intégration de Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter et Terraform.","de":"Perfekt für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agents, die bewährte Marketingstrategien und Next.js-, FastAPI-, Flutter- und Terraform-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em SaaS que necessitam de estratégias de marketing comprovadas e integração com Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter e Terraform.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SaaS, которым необходимы проверенные маркетинговые стратегии и интеграция с Next.js, FastAPI, Flutter и Terraform.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ال IA المتخصصة في SaaS التي تحتاج إلى استراتيجيات تسويقية مثبتة وتكامل مع Next.js و FastAPI و Flutter و Terraform."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate tailored marketing ideas using 139 proven strategies, leveraging product marketing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files and integrating with full-stack technologies like Next.js, FastAPI, and Terraform.","zh":"赋予代理生成定制的营销创意，使用 139 个已验证的策略，利用来自 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 文件的产品营销背景，并与 Next.js、FastAPI 和 Terraform 等全栈技术集成。","ja":"エージェントにカスタマイズされたマーケティングアイデアを生成する機能を提供します。139 の実証済み戦略を使用し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ファイルからの製品マーケティングコンテキストを活用し、Next.js、FastAPI、Terraform などのフルスタックテクノロジーと統合します。","ko":"139개의 검증된 전략을 사용하여 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일의 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하고 Next.js, FastAPI 및 Terraform과 같은 풀스택 기술과 통합하여 에이전트가 맞춤형 마케팅 아이디어를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar ideas de marketing personalizadas utilizando 139 estrategias probadas, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de los archivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e integrándose con tecnologías de pilas completas como Next.js, FastAPI y Terraform.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des idées de marketing personnalisées en utilisant 139 stratégies éprouvées, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits des fichiers `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en s''intégrant avec des technologies de pile complète comme Next.js, FastAPI et Terraform.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, maßgeschneiderte Marketingideen unter Verwendung von 139 bewährten Strategien zu generieren, den Produktmarketingkontext aus Dateien `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` zu nutzen und sich in volle Stack-Technologien wie Next.js, FastAPI und Terraform zu integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar ideias de marketing personalizadas usando 139 estratégias comprovadas, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos a partir de arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e integrando com tecnologias de pilha completa, como Next.js, FastAPI e Terraform.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать индивидуальные маркетинговые идеи, используя 139 проверенных стратегий, используя контекст маркетинга продукта из файлов `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и интегрируя с полностековыми технологиями, такими как Next.js, FastAPI и Terraform.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من توليد أفكار تسويقية مخصصة باستخدام 139 استراتيجية مثبتة ، واستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج من ملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وتكاملها مع تقنيات الSTACK الكاملة مثل Next.js و FastAPI و Terraform."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating targeted marketing campaigns for SaaS products","Analyzing product marketing context for informed strategy decisions","Integrating marketing ideas with full-stack development using Next.js and FastAPI"],"zh":["为 SaaS 产品生成有针对性的营销活动","分析产品营销背景以进行明智的战略决策","使用 Next.js 和 FastAPI 将营销创意与全栈开发集成"],"ja":["SaaS 製品のターゲットを絞ったマーケティングキャンペーンを生成する","製品マーケティングコンテキストを分析して情報に基づいた戦略的決定を下す","Next.js と FastAPI を使用してマーケティングアイデアをフルスタック開発に統合する"],"ko":["SaaS 제품을 위한 타겟 마케팅 캠페인을 생성한다","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 분석하여 정보에 기반한 전략적 의사결정을 내린다","Next.js 및 FastAPI를 사용하여 마케팅 아이디어를 풀스택 개발과 통합한다"],"es":["Generar campañas de marketing dirigidas para productos SaaS","Analizar el contexto de marketing de productos para tomar decisiones de estrategia informadas","Integrar ideas de marketing con el desarrollo de pilas completas utilizando Next.js y FastAPI"],"fr":["Générer des campagnes de marketing ciblées pour les produits SaaS","Analyser le contexte de marketing de produits pour prendre des décisions de stratégie éclairées","Intégrer des idées de marketing avec le développement de pile complète en utilisant Next.js et FastAPI"],"de":["Zielgerichtete Marketingkampagnen für SaaS-Produkte generieren","Produktmarketingkontext analysieren, um fundierte Strategieentscheidungen zu treffen","Marketingideen mit Full-Stack-Entwicklung unter Verwendung von Next.js und FastAPI integrieren"],"pt":["Geração de campanhas de marketing direcionadas para produtos SaaS","Análise do contexto de marketing de produtos para decisões de estratégia informadas","Integração de ideias de marketing com desenvolvimento de pilha completa usando Next.js e FastAPI"],"ru":["Генерация целевых маркетинговых кампаний для продуктов SaaS","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта для принятия обоснованных стратегических решений","Интеграция маркетинговых идей с полностековым развитием с помощью Next.js и FastAPI"],"ar":["توليد حملات تسويقية مستهدفة لمنتجات SaaS","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لاتخاذ قرارات استراتيجية مستنيرة","دمج الأفكار التسويقية مع التطوير الSTACK الكامل باستخدام Next.js و FastAPI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` file for context","Limited to SaaS marketing strategies"],"zh":["需要 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 文件来提供背景","仅限 SaaS 营销策略"],"ja":["コンテキストを提供するために `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ファイルが必要","SaaS マーケティング戦略のみに限定される"],"ko":["컨텍스트를 제공하기 위해 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일이 필요합니다","SaaS 마케팅 전략만으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere un archivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para el contexto","Limitado a estrategias de marketing de SaaS"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte","Limité aux stratégies de marketing SaaS"],"de":["Benötigt eine Datei `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für den Kontext","Begrenzt auf SaaS-Marketingstrategien"],"pt":["Requer arquivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto","Limitado a estratégias de marketing SaaS"],"ru":["Требует файла `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста","Ограничен стратегиями маркетинга SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للسياق","محدود بالاستراتيجيات التسويقية ل SaaS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('iulspop/production-app-template-postgres-supabase/unit-tests', 'community', 'iulspop', 'production-app-template-postgres-supabase', 'iulspop/production-app-template-postgres-supabase', 'unit-tests', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:01:18.306Z', NULL, '{"id":"iulspop/production-app-template-postgres-supabase/unit-tests","name":"unit-tests","description":{"es":"Las pruebas unitarias son fundamentales para garantizar la calidad del código. Aprende a escribir pruebas unitarias efectivas","fr":"Les tests unitaires sont essentiels pour garantir la qualité du code. Apprenez à écrire des tests unitaires efficaces","de":"Unit-Tests sind grundlegend, um die Qualität des Codes zu gewährleisten. Lernen Sie, wie Sie effektive Unit-Tests schreiben","pt":"Testes unitários são fundamentais para o desenvolvimento de software de alto nível. Aprenda a escrever testes unitários eficazes para garantir a qualidade do seu código.","ru":"Юнит-тесты являются фундаментальными для разработки программного обеспечения высокого уровня. Узнайте, как писать эффективные юнит-тесты, чтобы обеспечить качество вашего кода.","ar":"اختبارات الوحدة هي أساسية لتطوير البرمجيات ذو المستوى العالي. تعلم كيفية كتابة اختبارات وحدة فعالة لضمان جودة كودك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Pruebas Unitarias: Mejora la Calidad de Tu Código","fr":"Tests Unitaires: Améliorez la Qualité de Votre Code","de":"Unit-Tests: Verbessern Sie die Qualität Ihres Codes","pt":"Testes Unitários: Desenvolvimento de Software de Alto Nível","ru":"Юнит-тесты: Разработка программного обеспечения высокого ...","ar":"اختبارات الوحدة: تطوير البرمجيات ذو المستوى العالي","en":"unit-tests"},"description":{"es":"Las pruebas unitarias son fundamentales para garantizar la calidad del código. Aprende a escribir pruebas unitarias efectivas","fr":"Les tests unitaires sont essentiels pour garantir la qualité du code. Apprenez à écrire des tests unitaires efficaces","de":"Unit-Tests sind grundlegend, um die Qualität des Codes zu gewährleisten. Lernen Sie, wie Sie effektive Unit-Tests schreiben","pt":"Testes unitários são fundamentais para o desenvolvimento de software de alto nível. Aprenda a escrever testes unitários eficazes para garantir a qualidade do...","ru":"Юнит-тесты являются фундаментальными для разработки программного обеспечения высокого уровня. Узнайте, как писать эффективные юнит-тесты, чтобы обеспечить ка...","ar":"اختبارات الوحدة هي أساسية لتطوير البرمجيات ذو المستوى العالي. تعلم كيفية كتابة اختبارات وحدة فعالة لضمان جودة كودك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Escribe pruebas unitarias para verificar la funcionalidad de tu código","Mejora la calidad y la confiabilidad de tu código","Identifica y corrige errores de manera eficiente","Garantiza la estabilidad y la escalabilidad de tu código","Integra pruebas unitarias en tu flujo de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Écrivez des tests unitaires pour vérifier la fonctionnalité de votre code","Améliorez la qualité et la fiabilité de votre code","Identifiez et corrigez les erreurs de manière efficace","Assurez la stabilité et la scalabilité de votre code","Intégrez des tests unitaires dans votre flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Schreiben Sie Unit-Tests, um die Funktionalität Ihres Codes zu überprüfen","Verbessern Sie die Qualität und Zuverlässigkeit Ihres Codes","Identifizieren und korrigieren Sie Fehler effizient","Gewährleisten Sie die Stabilität und Skalierbarkeit Ihres Codes","Integrieren Sie Unit-Tests in Ihren Entwicklungsprozess"],"pt":["Escrita de testes unitários eficazes","Verificação da qualidade do código","Desenvolvimento de software de alto nível","Melhoria das habilidades de teste","Garantia da estabilidade do código"],"ru":["Написание эффективных юнит-тестов","Проверка качества кода","Разработка программного обеспечения высокого уровня","Улучшение навыков тестирования","Гарантия стабильности кода"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدة فعالة","تحقق من جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات ذو المستوى العالي","تحسين مهارات الاختبار","ضمان استقرار الكود"]},"keywords":{"es":["pruebas unitarias","testing","calidad del código","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","unidad de código","funcionalidad","errores","estabilidad","escalabilidad"],"fr":["tests unitaires","testing","qualité du code","développement de logiciel","tests de logiciel","unité de code","fonctionnalité","erreurs","stabilité","scalabilité"],"de":["Unit-Tests","Testing","Code-Qualität","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests","Code-Einheit","Funktionalität","Fehler","Stabilität","Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["testes unitários","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","qualidade de código","testes de unidade","desenvolvimento de alto nível"],"ru":["юнит-тесты","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","качество кода","тесты единицы","разработка высокого уровня"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","جودة الكود","اختبارات الوحدة","تطوير البرمجيات ذو المستوى العالي"]}},"owner":"iulspop","repo":"production-app-template-postgres-supabase","repoPath":"iulspop/production-app-template-postgres-supabase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unit-tests","description":"Generates well-structured unit tests using Vitest with the given/should prose format. Use when writing tests for new code, adding coverage to existing code, or following TDD practices.","bodyPreview":"# Unit Tests\n\nAct as a top-tier software engineer with serious testing skills.\n\nWrite unit tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\nEach test must answer these 5 questions:\n\n1. What is the unit under test? (test should be in a named describe block)\n2. What is the expected behavior? ($given and $should arguments are adequate)\n3. What is the actual output? (the unit under test was exercised by the test)\n4. What is the expected output? ($expected and/or $should are adequate)\n5. How can we find the bug? (implicitly a","body":"# Unit Tests\n\nAct as a top-tier software engineer with serious testing skills.\n\nWrite unit tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\nEach test must answer these 5 questions:\n\n1. What is the unit under test? (test should be in a named describe block)\n2. What is the expected behavior? ($given and $should arguments are adequate)\n3. What is the actual output? (the unit under test was exercised by the test)\n4. What is the expected output? ($expected and/or $should are adequate)\n5. How can we find the bug? (implicitly answered if the above questions are answered correctly)\n\n## Rules\n\n- Use Vitest with describe, expect, and test.\n- Tests must use the \"given: ..., should: ...\" prose format.\n- Colocate tests with functions. Test files should be in the same folder as the implementation file.\n- Use cuid2 for IDs unless specified otherwise.\n- If an argument is a database entity, use an existing factory function and override values as needed.\n- Capture the `actual` and the `expected` value in variables.\n- The top-level `describe` block should describe the component under test.\n- The `test` block should describe the case via `\"given: ..., should: ...\"`.\n- Avoid `expect.any(Constructor)` in assertions. Expect specific values instead.\n- Always use the `toEqual` equality assertion.\n- Empty line before `actual` variable assignment.\n- NO empty line between `actual` and `expected` assignments.\n- Empty line after `expected` variable assignment before the `toEqual` assertion.\n- Tests must be readable, isolated, thorough, and explicit.\n- Test expected edge cases.\n- Create factory functions for reused data structures rather than sharing mutable fixtures.\n\n## When NOT to use this skill\n\n- For React component render tests (`.test.tsx`), use `/happy-dom-tests` instead.\n- For database or server action tests (`.spec.ts`), use `/integration-tests` instead.\n- For browser-level user flow tests (`.e2e.ts`), use `/e2e-tests` instead.\n- This skill is for pure function unit tests (`.test.ts`) only.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:01:18.306Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing comprehensive unit testing capabilities for validating software functionality.","zh":"适合需要全面单元测试能力以验证软件功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理がソフトウェアの機能を検証するための包括的な単体テスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"소프트웨어 기능을 검증하기 위한 포괄적인 유닛 테스트 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para los Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan capacidades de prueba de unidad comprehensivas para validar la funcionalidad del software.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Revue de Code ayant besoin de capacités de test unitaire complètes pour valider la fonctionnalité du logiciel.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die umfassende Einheitentestfunktionen zur Überprüfung der Softwarefunktionalität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de capacidades de teste unitário abrangentes para validar a funcionalidade do software.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности единиц тестирования для проверки функциональности программного обеспечения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار وحدة شاملة للتحقق من وظيفة البرمجيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust unit tests using describe blocks, exercising units under test and validating expected behavior through $given, $should, $expected arguments, and implicitly identifying bugs.","zh":"使代理能够使用描述块编写强大的单元测试，通过$given、$should、$expected参数来测试单元，并通过系统测试隐式地识别错误。","ja":"代理が記述ブロックを使って強力なユニットテストを書くことができるようにし、$given、$should、$expected引数を使用してテスト対象の単位を実行し、期待される動作を検証し、システムテストを介してバグを暗黙的に識別します。","ko":"에이전트가 설명 블록을 사용하여 강력한 유닛 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 하여, $given, $should, $expected 인수를 사용하여 테스트 대상 단위에 대해 테스트를 실행하고 예상된 동작을 확인하며, 시스템 테스트를 통해 오류를 암시적으로 식별합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas de unidad robustas utilizando bloques de descripción, ejercitando unidades bajo prueba y validando el comportamiento esperado a través de los argumentos $given, $should, $expected, e identificando implícitamente errores.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests unitaires robustes en utilisant des blocs de description, en exerçant les unités sous test et en validant le comportement attendu via les arguments $given, $should, $expected, et en identifiant implicitement les bogues.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, robuste Einheitentests mit Beschreibungsblöcken zu schreiben, Einheiten unter Test auszuüben und das erwartete Verhalten durch die Argumente $given, $should, $expected zu überprüfen und Fehler implizit zu identifizieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes unitários robustos usando blocos de descrição, exercitando unidades em teste e validando o comportamento esperado por meio dos argumentos $given, $should, $expected e identificando implicitamente bugs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать прочные единицы тестирования, используя блоки описания, упражняя единицы под тестированием и проверяя ожидаемое поведение через аргументы $given, $should, $expected и неявно выявляя ошибки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية كتابة اختبارات وحدة متينة باستخدام كتلة وصف ، وممارسة الوحدات قيد الاختبار والتحقق من السلوك المتوقع من خلال الحجج $given، $should، $expected والتحديد الضمني للأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing unit tests for complex software modules","Validating expected behavior of functions and methods","Debugging code issues through systematic testing"],"zh":["为复杂软件模块编写单元测试","验证函数和方法的预期行为","通过系统测试调试代码问题"],"ja":["複雑なソフトウェアモジュールのユニットテストの記述","関数とメソッドの期待される動作の検証","コードの問題のデバッグをシステムテストを通じて"],"ko":["复잡한 소프트웨어 모듈을 위한 유닛 테스트 작성","함수 및 메소드의 예상 동작 확인","시스템 테스트를 통한 코드 이슈 디버깅"],"es":["Escribir pruebas de unidad para módulos de software complejos","Validar el comportamiento esperado de funciones y métodos","Depurar problemas de código a través de pruebas sistemáticas"],"fr":["Écrire des tests unitaires pour des modules de logiciel complexes","Valider le comportement attendu des fonctions et des méthodes","Déboguer les problèmes de code via des tests systématiques"],"de":["Schreiben von Einheitentests für komplexe Softwaremodule","Überprüfen des erwarteten Verhaltens von Funktionen und Methoden","Fehlerbehebung von Codeproblemen durch systematische Tests"],"pt":["Escrita de testes unitários para módulos de software complexos","Validação do comportamento esperado de funções e métodos","Depuração de problemas de código por meio de testes sistemáticos"],"ru":["Написание единиц тестирования для сложных модулей программного обеспечения","Проверка ожидаемого поведения функций и методов","Отладка проблем кода посредством систематического тестирования"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدة لمكونات برمجية معقدة","التحقق من السلوك المتوقع للدوال والأساليب","تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة من خلال الاختبارات المنهجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires programming knowledge","Test coverage limited to units under test"],"zh":["需要编程知识","测试覆盖范围仅限于测试单元"],"ja":["プログラミング知識が必要","テストカバレッジはテスト対象の単位に限定される"],"ko":["프로그래밍 지식이 필요","테스트 커버리지의 범위가 테스트 대상 단위로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación","La cobertura de las pruebas está limitada a las unidades bajo prueba"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation","La couverture des tests est limitée aux unités sous test"],"de":["Benötigt Programmierkenntnisse","Die Testabdeckung ist auf die unter Test stehenden Einheiten beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de programação","Cobertura de teste limitada às unidades em teste"],"ru":["Требует знаний программирования","Ограничение тестового покрытия единицами под тестированием"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالبرمجة","الحد من تغطية الاختبار للوحدات قيد الاختبار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('BintzGavin/helios/example-react', 'community', 'BintzGavin', 'helios', 'BintzGavin/helios', 'example-react', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:00:39.210Z', NULL, '{"id":"BintzGavin/helios/example-react","name":"example-react","description":{"zh":"使用 React 和 Helios 进行程序化视频创建，利用 CSS 动画和 React 钩子","ja":"React と Helios を使用してプログラム動画を作成し、CSS アニメーションと React フックを活用","ko":"React 와 Helios 를 사용하여 프로그램 동영상 생성, CSS 애니메이션 및 React 훅 사용","es":"example-react permite la creación de videos con tecnologías web conocidas y React, utilizando CSS animations de forma sencilla.","fr":"example-react permet de créer des vidéos avec des technologies web connues et React, en utilisant des animations CSS de manière simple.","de":"example-react ermöglicht die Erstellung von Videos mit bekannten Web-Technologien und React, wobei CSS-Animationen einfach verwendet werden.","pt":"A biblioteca example-react permite a criação de vídeos programáticos com React. Ela fornece uma forma fácil de integrar a biblioteca Helios em seus componentes.","ru":"Библиотека example-react позволяет создавать программные видео с помощью React. Она предоставляет простой способ интегрировать библиотеку Helios в ваши компоненты.","ar":"مكتبة example-react تسمح بإنشاء فيديوهات برمجية مع ري액ت. توفر طريقة سهلة لدمج مكتبة هيليوس في مكوناتك.","en":"Programmatic video creation with web technologies you already know. CSS animations just work."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"使用 React 进行程序化视频创建","ja":"React を使用したプログラム動画作成","ko":"React 사용 프로그램 동영상 생성","es":"Crear videos con React: ejemplo-react","fr":"Créer des vidéos avec React : example-react","de":"Videos mit React erstellen: example-react","pt":"Crie Vídeos com React - example-react","ru":"Создание видео с помощью React - example-react","ar":"إنشاء فيديوهات مع ري액ت - example-react","en":"example-react"},"description":{"zh":"使用 React 和 Helios 进行程序化视频创建，利用 CSS 动画和 React 钩子","ja":"React と Helios を使用してプログラム動画を作成し、CSS アニメーションと React フックを活用","ko":"React 와 Helios 를 사용하여 프로그램 동영상 생성, CSS 애니메이션 및 React 훅 사용","es":"example-react permite la creación de videos con tecnologías web conocidas y React, utilizando CSS animations de forma sencilla.","fr":"example-react permet de créer des vidéos avec des technologies web connues et React, en utilisant des animations CSS de manière simple.","de":"example-react ermöglicht die Erstellung von Videos mit bekannten Web-Technologien und React, wobei CSS-Animationen einfach verwendet werden.","pt":"A biblioteca example-react permite a criação de vídeos programáticos com React. Ela fornece uma forma fácil de integrar a biblioteca Helios em seus componentes.","ru":"Библиотека example-react позволяет создавать программные видео с помощью React. Она предоставляет простой способ интегрировать библиотеку Helios в ваши компо...","ar":"مكتبة example-react تسمح بإنشاء فيديوهات برمجية مع ري액ت. توفر طريقة سهلة لدمج مكتبة هيليوس في مكوناتك.","en":"Programmatic video creation with web technologies you already know. CSS animations just work."},"definition":{"en":"Programmatic video creation with web technologies you already know. CSS animations just work."},"features":{"zh":["使用 React 钩子进行状态管理","使用 Refs 访问画布","支持 CSS 动画","程序化视频创建","使用 Helios 订阅视频帧"],"ja":["React フックを使用した状態管理","Refs を使用したキャンバスへのアクセス","CSS アニメーションのサポート","プログラム動画作成","Helios を使用したビデオフレームの订阅"],"ko":["React 훅을 사용한 상태 관리","Refs 를 사용한 캔버스 접근","CSS 애니메이션 지원","프로그램 동영상 생성","Helios 를 사용한 비디오 프레임订阅"],"es":["Creación de videos con tecnologías web conocidas","Integración con React para una fácil implementación","Uso de CSS animations para una experiencia de usuario fluida","Gestión de estado con hooks para una mayor flexibilidad","Acceso a canvas con Refs para una personalización avanzada"],"fr":["Création de vidéos avec des technologies web connues","Intégration avec React pour une mise en œuvre facile","Utilisation d''animations CSS pour une expérience utilisateur fluide","Gestion d''état avec des hooks pour une plus grande flexibilité","Accès au canvas avec des Refs pour une personnalisation avancée"],"de":["Erstellung von Videos mit bekannten Web-Technologien","Integration mit React für eine einfache Implementierung","Verwendung von CSS-Animationen für eine flüssige Benutzererfahrung","Zustandsverwaltung mit Hooks für eine größere Flexibilität","Zugriff auf Canvas mit Refs für eine erweiterte Anpassung"],"pt":["Criação de vídeos programáticos com React","Integração com a biblioteca Helios","Uso de hooks para gerenciamento de estado","Acesso ao canvas com Refs","Re-renderização automática com uso de useEffect"],"ru":["Создание программных видео с помощью React","Интеграция с библиотекой Helios","Использование хуков для управления состоянием","Доступ к canvas с помощью Refs","Автоматический рендеринг с использованием useEffect"],"ar":["إنشاء فيديوهات برمجية مع ري액ت","التكامل مع مكتبة هيليوس","استخدام Hooks لإدارة الحالة","الدخول إلى Canvas باستخدام Refs","إعادة التصيير التلقائية باستخدام useEffect"]},"keywords":{"zh":["程序化视频创建","React","Helios","CSS 动画","React 钩子","状态管理","Refs","画布访问"],"ja":["プログラム動画作成","React","Helios","CSS アニメーション","React フック","状態管理","Refs","キャンバスへのアクセス"],"ko":["프로그램 동영상 생성","React","Helios","CSS 애니메이션","React 훅","상태 관리","Refs","캔버스 접근"],"es":["creación de videos con React","tecnologías web para videos","CSS animations en React","gestión de estado con hooks","acceso a canvas con Refs","desarrollo de aplicaciones con React"],"fr":["création de vidéos avec React","technologies web pour vidéos","animations CSS dans React","gestion d''état avec des hooks","accès au canvas avec des Refs","développement d''applications avec React"],"de":["Erstellung von Videos mit React","Web-Technologien für Videos","CSS-Animationen in React","Zustandsverwaltung mit Hooks","Zugriff auf Canvas mit Refs","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React"],"pt":["react","vídeos programáticos","helios","hooks","refs","useEffect","criação de vídeos","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["react","программные видео","helios","хуки","рефы","useEffect","создание видео","веб-разработка"],"ar":["ري액ت","فيديوهات برمجية","هيليوس","Hooks","Refs","useEffect","إنشاء فيديوهات","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"BintzGavin","repo":"helios","repoPath":"BintzGavin/helios","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"example-react","description":"Patterns for using Helios with React. Use when building compositions in a React environment.","bodyPreview":"# React Composition Patterns\n\nIntegrate Helios into React components using hooks for state management and Refs for canvas access.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Create `useVideoFrame` Hook\n\nThis hook subscribes to Helios and returns the current frame, triggering re-renders.\n\n```javascript\n// hooks/useVideoFrame.js\nimport { useState, useEffect } from ''react'';\n\nexport function useVideoFrame(helios) {\n  const [frame, setFrame] = useState(helios.currentFrame.peek());\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    // Subscribe t","body":"# React Composition Patterns\n\nIntegrate Helios into React components using hooks for state management and Refs for canvas access.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Create `useVideoFrame` Hook\n\nThis hook subscribes to Helios and returns the current frame, triggering re-renders.\n\n```javascript\n// hooks/useVideoFrame.js\nimport { useState, useEffect } from ''react'';\n\nexport function useVideoFrame(helios) {\n  const [frame, setFrame] = useState(helios.currentFrame.peek());\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    // Subscribe to updates\n    const unsubscribe = helios.subscribe((state) => {\n      setFrame(state.currentFrame);\n    });\n    return unsubscribe;\n  }, [helios]);\n\n  return frame;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Create Composition Component\n\n```jsx\n// App.jsx\nimport React, { useRef, useEffect } from ''react'';\nimport { Helios } from ''@helios-project/core'';\nimport { useVideoFrame } from ''./hooks/useVideoFrame'';\n\n// Initialize Singleton (outside component to persist across re-renders)\nconst helios = new Helios({\n  duration: 10,\n  fps: 30\n});\nhelios.bindToDocumentTimeline();\n\n// Expose for Renderer/Player\nif (typeof window !== ''undefined'') window.helios = helios;\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const canvasRef = useRef(null);\n  const frame = useVideoFrame(helios);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const ctx = canvasRef.current?.getContext(''2d'');\n    if (!ctx) return;\n\n    const { width, height } = canvasRef.current;\n\n    // Clear\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n    // Draw based on frame\n    const progress = frame / (helios.duration * helios.fps);\n    ctx.fillStyle = ''#61dafb'';\n    ctx.fillRect(progress * width, height / 2 - 50, 100, 100);\n\n  }, [frame]); // Re-run draw when frame changes\n\n  return <canvas ref={canvasRef} width={1920} height={1080} />;\n}\n```\n\n## Optimization\n\nFor complex scenes, avoid React state updates for every frame (which triggers full component re-render). Instead, use a `useRef` to hold the frame and an animation loop, or update the canvas imperatively inside `subscribe`.\n\n### Imperative Pattern (High Performance)\n\n```jsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const ctx = canvasRef.current.getContext(''2d'');\n\n  const unsubscribe = helios.subscribe((state) => {\n    // Draw directly without triggering React render\n    drawScene(ctx, state.currentFrame);\n  });\n\n  return unsubscribe;\n}, []);\n```\n\n## Source Files\n\n- Example: `examples/react-canvas-animation/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:00:39.210Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring seamless integration of programmatic video creation with React components and CSS animations.","zh":"适用于需要将程序化视频创建无缝集成到 React 组件和 CSS 动画的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがReactコンポーネントとCSSアニメーションを使用したプログラムによる動画作成をシームレスに統合する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 React 컴포넌트 및 CSS 애니메이션과 프로그래매틱 비디오 생성을无缝 통합해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren una integración sin problemas de la creación de video programática con componentes de React y animaciones CSS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une intégration transparente de la création de vidéos programmatiques avec des composants React et des animations CSS.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration der programmgemäßen Videocreation mit React-Komponenten und CSS-Animationen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem integração perfeita da criação de vídeo programática com componentes React e animações CSS.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции программной создания видео с компонентами React и анимациями CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يتطلبون تكاملًا سلسًا لإنشاء الفيديو البرمجي مع مكونات React وanimations CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate dynamic video content using React hooks for state management and Refs for canvas access, leveraging web technologies like Helios and CSS animations for enhanced visual effects.","zh":"赋予代理生成动态视频内容的能力，使用React hooks进行状态管理和Refs进行canvas访问，利用Helios和CSS动画等Web技术增强视觉效果。","ja":"エージェントがReactフックスを使用した状態管理とRefsを使用したcanvasアクセスにより、動的な動画コンテンツを生成する能力を提供します。また、HeliosやCSSアニメーションなどのWeb技術を利用して視覚効果を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 동적 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, React 훅을 사용한 상태 관리와 Refs를 사용한 캔버스 액세스를 통해 Helios 및 CSS 애니메이션과 같은 웹 기술을 활용하여 시각적 효과를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar contenido de video dinámico utilizando ganchos de React para la gestión de estados y Refs para el acceso al lienzo, aprovechando tecnologías web como Helios y animaciones CSS para efectos visuales mejorados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu vidéo dynamique en utilisant des crochets React pour la gestion d''état et des Refs pour l''accès au canevas, en exploitant les technologies Web comme Helios et les animations CSS pour des effets visuels améliorés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, dynamischen Video-Inhalt zu generieren, indem sie React-Hooks für die Zustandsverwaltung und Refs für den Zugriff auf die Leinwand verwenden, wobei Webtechnologien wie Helios und CSS-Animationen für verbesserte visuelle Effekte genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conteúdo de vídeo dinâmico usando ganchos React para gerenciamento de estado e Refs para acesso ao canvas, aproveitando tecnologias da web como Helios e animações CSS para efeitos visuais aprimorados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать динамическое видеоконтент с помощью крючков React для управления состоянием и ссылок для доступа к холсту, используя веб-технологии, такие как Helios и анимации CSS, для улучшенных визуальных эффектов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء محتوى فيديو ديناميكي باستخدام مشابك React لإدارة الحالة و Refs للوصول إلى Canvas ، واستخدام تقنيات الويب مثل Helios و animations CSS لتحسين التأثيرات البصرية."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating Helios into React components for programmatic video creation","Creating customizable video frames using React hooks and CSS animations","Developing interactive video experiences with React and canvas access"],"zh":["将Helios集成到React组件中以进行程序化视频创建","使用React hooks和CSS动画创建可定制的视频帧","使用React和canvas访问开发交互式视频体验"],"ja":["ReactコンポーネントにHeliosを統合してプログラムによる動画作成を行う","ReactフックスとCSSアニメーションを使用してカスタマイズ可能な動画フレームを作成する","Reactとcanvasアクセスを使用してインタラクティブな動画体験を開発する"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트에 Helios를 통합하여 프로그래매틱 비디오 생성을 수행하는 경우","React 훅과 CSS 애니메이션을 사용하여 사용자 정의 가능한 비디오 프레임을 생성하는 경우","React 및 캔버스 액세스를 사용하여 상호 작용형 비디오 경험을 개발하는 경우"],"es":["Integrar Helios en componentes de React para la creación de video programática","Crear fotogramas de video personalizables utilizando ganchos de React y animaciones CSS","Desarrollar experiencias de video interactivas con React y acceso al lienzo"],"fr":["Intégrer Helios dans des composants React pour la création de vidéos programmatiques","Créer des cadres de vidéo personnalisables en utilisant des crochets React et des animations CSS","Développer des expériences de vidéo interactives avec React et l''accès au canevas"],"de":["Helios in React-Komponenten für die programmgemäße Videocreation integrieren","Anpassbare Videoframes mit React-Hooks und CSS-Animationen erstellen","Interaktive Videoerfahrungen mit React und Zugriff auf die Leinwand entwickeln"],"pt":["Integrar Helios em componentes React para criação de vídeo programática","Criar quadros de vídeo personalizáveis usando ganchos React e animações CSS","Desenvolver experiências de vídeo interativas com React e acesso ao canvas"],"ru":["Интегрировать Helios в компоненты React для программной создания видео","Создавать настраиваемые кадры видео с помощью крючков React и анимаций CSS","Разрабатывать интерактивные видеоопыты с React и доступом к холсту"],"ar":["دمج Helios في مكونات React لإنشاء الفيديو البرمجي","إنشاء إطارات فيديو قابلة للتعديل باستخدام مشابك React و animations CSS","تطوير تجارب الفيديو التفاعلية مع React ووصول إلى Canvas"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and Helios setup","Limited to web technologies and CSS animations"],"zh":["需要React和Helios设置","仅限于Web技术和CSS动画"],"ja":["ReactとHeliosの設定が必要","Web技術とCSSアニメーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Helios 설정이 필요","웹 기술 및 CSS 애니메이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React y Helios","Limitado a tecnologías web y animaciones CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration React et Helios","Limité aux technologies Web et aux animations CSS"],"de":["Benötigt React- und Helios-Setup","Begrenzt auf Webtechnologien und CSS-Animationen"],"pt":["Requer configuração React e Helios","Limitado a tecnologias da web e animações CSS"],"ru":["Требует настройки React и Helios","Ограничен веб-технологиями и анимациями CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد React و Helios","محدود bằng تقنيات الويب و animations CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ruvnet/claude-flow/agent-release-swarm', 'community', 'ruvnet', 'claude-flow', 'ruvnet/claude-flow', 'agent-release-swarm', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:00:45.605Z', NULL, '{"id":"ruvnet/claude-flow/agent-release-swarm","name":"agent-release-swarm","description":{"zh":"agent-release-swarm是领先的智能体编队平台，用于部署智能多智能体编队和协调自动工作流程","ja":"エージェントリリーススウォームは、知能のあるマルチエージェントスウォームを展開し、自動ワークフローを調整するための先進的なエージェントオーケストレーション平台です","ko":"에이전트 릴리스 스와ーム은 지능형 멀티 에이전트 스와ーム을 배포하고 자동 워크플ロー를 조정하는 선도적인 에이전트 오케스트레이션 플랫폼입니다","es":"Release-swarm es una plataforma de orquestación de agentes líder para Claude, que permite desplegar swarms de agentes inteligentes y coordinar flujos de trabajo autónomos","fr":"Release-swarm est une plateforme d''orchestration d''agents leader pour Claude, qui permet de déployer des essaims d''agents intelligents et de coordonner des flux de travail autonomes","de":"Release-swarm ist eine führende Agenten-Orchestrierungsplattform für Claude, die das Bereitstellen intelligenter Agenten-Schwärme und die Koordination autonomer Workflows ermöglicht","pt":"A plataforma de orquestração de agentes líder para Claude, permitindo o deploy de swarms de agentes inteligentes e a coordenação de fluxos de trabalho autônomos","ru":"Ведущая платформа оркестрации агентов для Claude, позволяющая развертывать рои интеллектуальных агентов и координировать автономные рабочие процессы","ar":"منصة توجيه الوحدات الرائدة لـ Claude، تمكنك من نشر سرب من الوحدات الذكية وتنسيق سير العمل الذاتي","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP p..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":" Claude智能体编队平台","ja":"Claude智能エージェントオーケストレーション","ko":"클라우드 인텔리전트 에이전트 오케스트레이션","es":"Orquestación de agentes con release-swarm","fr":"Orchestration d''agents avec release-swarm","de":"Agenten-Orchestrierung mit release-swarm","pt":"Orquestração de Agentes de Liberação em Swarms","ru":"Оркестрация агентов выпуска в стаях","ar":"توجيه وحدات الإصدار في السرب","en":"agent-release-swarm"},"description":{"zh":"agent-release-swarm是领先的智能体编队平台，用于部署智能多智能体编队和协调自动工作流程","ja":"エージェントリリーススウォームは、知能のあるマルチエージェントスウォームを展開し、自動ワークフローを調整するための先進的なエージェントオーケストレーション平台です","ko":"에이전트 릴리스 스와ーム은 지능형 멀티 에이전트 스와ーム을 배포하고 자동 워크플ロー를 조정하는 선도적인 에이전트 오케스트레이션 플랫폼입니다","es":"Release-swarm es una plataforma de orquestación de agentes líder para Claude, que permite desplegar swarms de agentes inteligentes y coordinar flujos de trab...","fr":"Release-swarm est une plateforme d''orchestration d''agents leader pour Claude, qui permet de déployer des essaims d''agents intelligents et de coordonner des f...","de":"Release-swarm ist eine führende Agenten-Orchestrierungsplattform für Claude, die das Bereitstellen intelligenter Agenten-Schwärme und die Koordination autono...","pt":"A plataforma de orquestração de agentes líder para Claude, permitindo o deploy de swarms de agentes inteligentes e a coordenação de fluxos de trabalho autônomos","ru":"Ведущая платформа оркестрации агентов для Claude, позволяющая развертывать рои интеллектуальных агентов и координировать автономные рабочие процессы","ar":"منصة توجيه الوحدات الرائدة لـ Claude، تمكنك من نشر سرب من الوحدات الذكية وتنسيق سير العمل الذاتي","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI s..."},"definition":{"en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP protocol. Ranked #1 in agent-based frameworks."},"features":{"zh":["企业级架构","分布式集群智能","RAG集成","原生Claude Code支持"],"ja":["エンタープライズグレードアーキテクチャ","分散クラスタインテリジェンス","RAG統合","ネイティブClaude Codeサポート"],"ko":["엔터프라이즈급 아키텍처","분산 클러스터 인텔리전스","RAG 통합","네이티브 클라우드 코드 지원"],"es":["Arquitectura de empresa","Inteligencia de enjambre distribuida","Integración de RAG","Soporte nativo para Claude Code a través del protocolo MCP"],"fr":["Architecture d''entreprise","Intelligence de essaim distribuée","Intégration de RAG","Prise en charge native de Claude Code via le protocole MCP"],"de":["Unternehmensarchitektur","Verteilte Schwarmintelligenz","RAG-Integration","Native Unterstützung für Claude Code über das MCP-Protokoll"],"pt":["Arquitetura de empresa","Inteligência de swarm distribuída","Integração com RAG","Suporte nativo ao Claude Code via protocolo MCP","Deploy de swarms de agentes inteligentes","Coordenação de fluxos de trabalho autônomos"],"ru":["Корпоративная архитектура","Распределенная интеллект роя","Интеграция с RAG","Родная поддержка кода Claude через протокол MCP","Развертывание роев интеллектуальных агентов","Координация автономных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["هندسة شركة","ذكاء سرب موزع","دمج مع RAG","دعم أصلي للكود Claude عبر بروتوكول MCP","نشر سرب من الوحدات الذكية","تنسيق سير العمل الذاتي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能体编队","多智能体系统","自动工作流程","对话式AI","Claude","RAG","MCP协议"],"ja":["エージェントオーケストレーション","マルチエージェントシステム","自動ワークフロー","会話型AI","Claude","RAG","MCPプロトコル"],"ko":["에이전트 오케스트레이션","멀티 에이전트 시스템","자동 워크플ロー","대화형 AI","클라우드","RAG","MCP 프로토콜"],"es":["orquestación de agentes","swarm de agentes","IA conversacional","flujos de trabajo autónomos","plataforma de orquestación","Claude Code","MCP protocolo"],"fr":["orchestration d''agents","essaim d''agents","IA conversationnelle","flux de travail autonomes","plateforme d''orchestration","Claude Code","protocole MCP"],"de":["Agenten-Orchestrierung","Agenten-Schwarm","konversationale KI","autonome Workflows","Orchestrierungsplattform","Claude Code","MCP-Protokoll"],"pt":["orquestração de agentes","swarm de agentes","inteligência artificial","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de lançamentos","plataforma de orquestração","Claude","RAG","MCP","automação de fluxos de trabalho"],"ru":["оркестрация агентов","рой агентов","искусственный интеллект","разработка программного обеспечения","управление выпусками","платформа оркестрации","Claude","RAG","MCP","автоматизация рабочих процессов"],"ar":["توجيه الوحدات","سرب الوحدات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة الإصدارات","منصة توجيه","Claude","RAG","MCP","أتمتة سير العمل"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-release-swarm","description":"Agent skill for release-swarm - invoke with $agent-release-swarm","bodyPreview":"---\nname: release-swarm\ndescription: Orchestrate complex software releases using AI swarms that handle everything from changelog generation to multi-platform deployment\ntype: coordination\ncolor: \"#4ECDC4\"\ntools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n  - Edit\n  - TodoWrite\n  - TodoRead\n  - Task\n  - WebFetch\n  - mcp__github__create_pull_request\n  - mcp__github__merge_pull_request\n  - mcp__github__create_branch\n  - mcp__github__push_files\n  - mcp__github__create_issue\n  - mcp__claude-flow__swarm_init\n  - mcp","body":"---\nname: release-swarm\ndescription: Orchestrate complex software releases using AI swarms that handle everything from changelog generation to multi-platform deployment\ntype: coordination\ncolor: \"#4ECDC4\"\ntools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n  - Edit\n  - TodoWrite\n  - TodoRead\n  - Task\n  - WebFetch\n  - mcp__github__create_pull_request\n  - mcp__github__merge_pull_request\n  - mcp__github__create_branch\n  - mcp__github__push_files\n  - mcp__github__create_issue\n  - mcp__claude-flow__swarm_init\n  - mcp__claude-flow__agent_spawn\n  - mcp__claude-flow__task_orchestrate\n  - mcp__claude-flow__parallel_execute\n  - mcp__claude-flow__load_balance\nhooks:\n  pre_task: |\n    echo \"🐝 Initializing release swarm coordination...\"\n    npx ruv-swarm hook pre-task --mode release-swarm --init-swarm\n  post_edit: |\n    echo \"🔄 Synchronizing release swarm state and validating changes...\"\n    npx ruv-swarm hook post-edit --mode release-swarm --sync-swarm\n  post_task: |\n    echo \"🎯 Release swarm task completed. Coordinating final deployment...\"\n    npx ruv-swarm hook post-task --mode release-swarm --finalize-release\n  notification: |\n    echo \"📡 Broadcasting release completion across all swarm agents...\"\n    npx ruv-swarm hook notification --mode release-swarm --broadcast\n---\n\n# Release Swarm - Intelligent Release Automation\n\n## Overview\nOrchestrate complex software releases using AI swarms that handle everything from changelog generation to multi-platform deployment.\n\n## Core Features\n\n### 1. Release Planning\n```bash\n# Plan next release using gh CLI\n# Get commit history since last release\nLAST_TAG=$(gh release list --limit 1 --json tagName -q ''.[0].tagName'')\nCOMMITS=$(gh api repos/:owner/:repo$compare/${LAST_TAG}...HEAD --jq ''.commits'')\n\n# Get merged PRs\nMERGED_PRS=$(gh pr list --state merged --base main --json number,title,labels,mergedAt \\\n  --jq \".[] | select(.mergedAt > \\\"$(gh release view $LAST_TAG --json publishedAt -q .publishedAt)\\\")\")  \n\n# Plan release with commit analysis\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-plan \\\n  --commits \"$COMMITS\" \\\n  --merged-prs \"$MERGED_PRS\" \\\n  --analyze-commits \\\n  --suggest-version \\\n  --identify-breaking \\\n  --generate-timeline\n```\n\n### 2. Automated Versioning\n```bash\n# Smart version bumping\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-version \\\n  --strategy \"semantic\" \\\n  --analyze-changes \\\n  --check-breaking \\\n  --update-files\n```\n\n### 3. Release Orchestration\n```bash\n# Full release automation with gh CLI\n# Generate changelog from PRs and commits\nCHANGELOG=$(gh api repos/:owner/:repo$compare/${LAST_TAG}...HEAD \\\n  --jq ''.commits[].commit.message'' | \\\n  npx ruv-swarm github generate-changelog)\n\n# Create release draft\ngh release create v2.0.0 \\\n  --draft \\\n  --title \"Release v2.0.0\" \\\n  --notes \"$CHANGELOG\" \\\n  --target main\n\n# Run release orchestration\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-create \\\n  --version \"2.0.0\" \\\n  --changelog \"$CHANGELOG\" \\\n  --build-artifacts \\\n  --deploy-targets \"npm,docker,github\"\n\n# Publish release after validation\ngh release edit v2.0.0 --draft=false\n\n# Create announcement issue\ngh issue create \\\n  --title \"🎉 Released v2.0.0\" \\\n  --body \"$CHANGELOG\" \\\n  --label \"announcement,release\"\n```\n\n## Release Configuration\n\n### Release Config File\n```yaml\n# .github$release-swarm.yml\nversion: 1\nrelease:\n  versioning:\n    strategy: semantic\n    breaking-keywords: [\"BREAKING\", \"!\"]\n    \n  changelog:\n    sections:\n      - title: \"🚀 Features\"\n        labels: [\"feature\", \"enhancement\"]\n      - title: \"🐛 Bug Fixes\"\n        labels: [\"bug\", \"fix\"]\n      - title: \"📚 Documentation\"\n        labels: [\"docs\", \"documentation\"]\n        \n  artifacts:\n    - name: npm-package\n      build: npm run build\n      publish: npm publish\n      \n    - name: docker-image\n      build: docker build -t app:$VERSION .\n      publish: docker push app:$VERSION\n      \n    - name: binaries\n      build: .$scripts$build-binaries.sh\n      upload: github-release\n      \n  deployment:\n    environments:\n      - name: staging\n        auto-deploy: true\n        validation: npm run test:e2e\n        \n      - name: production\n        approval-required: true\n        rollback-enabled: true\n        \n  notifications:\n    - slack: releases-channel\n    - email: stakeholders@company.com\n    - discord: webhook-url\n```\n\n## Release Agents\n\n### Changelog Agent\n```bash\n# Generate intelligent changelog with gh CLI\n# Get all merged PRs between versions\nPRS=$(gh pr list --state merged --base main --json number,title,labels,author,mergedAt \\\n  --jq \".[] | select(.mergedAt > \\\"$(gh release view v1.0.0 --json publishedAt -q .publishedAt)\\\")\")  \n\n# Get contributors\nCONTRIBUTORS=$(echo \"$PRS\" | jq -r ''[.author.login] | unique | join(\", \")'')\n\n# Get commit messages\nCOMMITS=$(gh api repos/:owner/:repo$compare$v1.0.0...HEAD \\\n  --jq ''.commits[].commit.message'')\n\n# Generate categorized changelog\nCHANGELOG=$(npx ruv-swarm github changelog \\\n  --prs \"$PRS\" \\\n  --commits \"$COMMITS\" \\\n  --contributors \"$CONTRIBUTORS\" \\\n  --from v1.0.0 \\\n  --to HEAD \\\n  --categorize \\\n  --add-migration-guide)\n\n# Save changelog\necho \"$CHANGELOG\" > CHANGELOG.md\n\n# Create PR with changelog update\ngh pr create \\\n  --title \"docs: Update changelog for v2.0.0\" \\\n  --body \"Automated changelog update\" \\\n  --base main\n```\n\n**Capabilities:**\n- Semantic commit analysis\n- Breaking change detection\n- Contributor attribution\n- Migration guide generation\n- Multi-language support\n\n### Version Agent\n```bash\n# Determine next version\nnpx ruv-swarm github version-suggest \\\n  --current v1.2.3 \\\n  --analyze-commits \\\n  --check-compatibility \\\n  --suggest-pre-release\n```\n\n**Logic:**\n- Analyzes commit messages\n- Detects breaking changes\n- Suggests appropriate bump\n- Handles pre-releases\n- Validates version constraints\n\n### Build Agent\n```bash\n# Coordinate multi-platform builds\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-build \\\n  --platforms \"linux,macos,windows\" \\\n  --architectures \"x64,arm64\" \\\n  --parallel \\\n  --optimize-size\n```\n\n**Features:**\n- Cross-platform compilation\n- Parallel build execution\n- Artifact optimization\n- Dependency bundling\n- Build caching\n\n### Test Agent\n```bash\n# Pre-release testing\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-test \\\n  --suites \"unit,integration,e2e,performance\" \\\n  --environments \"node:16,node:18,node:20\" \\\n  --fail-fast false \\\n  --generate-report\n```\n\n### Deploy Agent\n```bash\n# Multi-target deployment\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-deploy \\\n  --targets \"npm,docker,github,s3\" \\\n  --staged-rollout \\\n  --monitor-metrics \\\n  --auto-rollback\n```\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### 1. Progressive Deployment\n```yaml\n# Staged rollout configuration\ndeployment:\n  strategy: progressive\n  stages:\n    - name: canary\n      percentage: 5\n      duration: 1h\n      metrics:\n        - error-rate < 0.1%\n        - latency-p99 < 200ms\n        \n    - name: partial\n      percentage: 25\n      duration: 4h\n      validation: automated-tests\n      \n    - name: full\n      percentage: 100\n      approval: required\n```\n\n### 2. Multi-Repo Releases\n```bash\n# Coordinate releases across repos\nnpx ruv-swarm github multi-release \\\n  --repos \"frontend:v2.0.0,backend:v2.1.0,cli:v1.5.0\" \\\n  --ensure-compatibility \\\n  --atomic-release \\\n  --synchronized\n```\n\n### 3. Hotfix Automation\n```bash\n# Emergency hotfix process\nnpx ruv-swarm github hotfix \\\n  --issue 789 \\\n  --target-version v1.2.4 \\\n  --cherry-pick-commits \\\n  --fast-track-deploy\n```\n\n## Release Workflows\n\n### Standard Release Flow\n```yaml\n# .github$workflows$release.yml\nname: Release Workflow\non:\n  push:\n    tags: [''v*'']\n\njobs:\n  release-swarm:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions$checkout@v3\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n          \n      - name: Setup GitHub CLI\n        run: echo \"${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\" | gh auth login --with-token\n          \n      - name: Initialize Release Swarm\n        run: |\n          # Get release tag and previous tag\n          RELEASE_TAG=${{ github.ref_name }}\n          PREV_TAG=$(gh release list --limit 2 --json tagName -q ''.[1].tagName'')\n          \n          # Get PRs and commits for changelog\n          PRS=$(gh pr list --state merged --base main --json number,title,labels,author \\\n            --search \"merged:>=$(gh release view $PREV_TAG --json publishedAt -q .publishedAt)\")\n          \n          npx ruv-swarm github release-init \\\n            --tag $RELEASE_TAG \\\n            --previous-tag $PREV_TAG \\\n            --prs \"$PRS\" \\\n            --spawn-agents \"changelog,version,build,test,deploy\"\n            \n      - name: Generate Release Assets\n        run: |\n          # Generate changelog from PR data\n          CHANGELOG=$(npx ruv-swarm github release-changelog \\\n            --format markdown)\n          \n          # Update release notes\n          gh release edit ${{ github.ref_name }} \\\n            --notes \"$CHANGELOG\"\n          \n          # Generate and upload assets\n          npx ruv-swarm github release-assets \\\n            --changelog \\\n            --binaries \\\n            --documentation\n            \n      - name: Upload Release Assets\n        run: |\n          # Upload generated assets to GitHub release\n          for file in dist/*; do\n            gh release upload ${{ github.ref_name }} \"$file\"\n          done\n          \n      - name: Publish Release\n        run: |\n          # Publish to package registries\n          npx ruv-swarm github release-publish \\\n            --platforms all\n          \n          # Create announcement issue\n          gh issue create \\\n            --title \"🚀 Released ${{ github.ref_name }}\" \\\n            --body \"See [release notes](https:/$github.com/${{ github.repository }}$releases$tag/${{ github.ref_name }})\" \\\n            --label \"announcement\"\n```\n\n### Continuous Deployment\n```bash\n# Automated deployment pipeline\nnpx ruv-swarm github cd-pipeline \\\n  --trigger \"merge-to-main\" \\\n  --auto-version \\\n  --deploy-on-success \\\n  --rollback-on-failure\n```\n\n## Release Validation\n\n### Pre-Release Checks\n```bash\n# Comprehensive validation\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-validate \\\n  --checks \"\n    version-conflicts,\n    dependency-compatibility,\n    api-breaking-changes,\n    security-vulnerabilities,\n    performance-regression,\n    documentation-completeness\n  \" \\\n  --block-on-failure\n```\n\n### Compatibility Testing\n```bash\n# Test backward compatibility\nnpx ruv-swarm github compat-test \\\n  --previous-versions \"v1.0,v1.1,v1.2\" \\\n  --api-contracts \\\n  --data-migrations \\\n  --generate-report\n```\n\n### Security Scanning\n```bash\n# Security validation\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-security \\\n  --scan-dependencies \\\n  --check-secrets \\\n  --audit-permissions \\\n  --sign-artifacts\n```\n\n## Monitoring & Rollback\n\n### Release Monitoring\n```bash\n# Monitor release health\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-monitor \\\n  --version v2.0.0 \\\n  --metrics \"error-rate,latency,throughput\" \\\n  --alert-thresholds \\\n  --duration 24h\n```\n\n### Automated Rollback\n```bash\n# Configure auto-rollback\nnpx ruv-swarm github rollback-config \\\n  --triggers ''{\n    \"error-rate\": \">5%\",\n    \"latency-p99\": \">1000ms\",\n    \"availability\": \"<99.9%\"\n  }'' \\\n  --grace-period 5m \\\n  --notify-on-rollback\n```\n\n### Release Analytics\n```bash\n# Analyze release performance\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-analytics \\\n  --version v2.0.0 \\\n  --compare-with v1.9.0 \\\n  --metrics \"adoption,performance,stability\" \\\n  --generate-insights\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n### Auto-Generated Docs\n```bash\n# Update documentation\nnpx ruv-swarm github release-docs \\\n  --api-changes \\\n  --migration-guide \\\n  --example-updates \\\n  --publish-to \"docs-site,wiki\"\n```\n\n### Release Notes\n```markdown\n<!-- Auto-generated release notes template -->\n# Release v2.0.0\n\n## 🎉 Highlights\n- Major feature X with 50% performance improvement\n- New API endpoints for feature Y\n- Enhanced security with feature Z\n\n## 🚀 Features\n### Feature Name (#PR)\nDetailed description of the feature...\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n### Fixed issue with... (#PR)\nDescription of the fix...\n\n## 💥 Breaking Changes\n### API endpoint renamed\n- Before: `$api$old-endpoint`\n- After: `$api$new-endpoint`\n- Migration: Update all client calls...\n\n## 📈 Performance Improvements\n- Reduced memory usage by 30%\n- API response time improved by 200ms\n\n## 🔒 Security Updates\n- Updated dependencies to patch CVE-XXXX\n- Enhanced authentication mechanism\n\n## 📚 Documentation\n- Added examples for new features\n- Updated API reference\n- New troubleshooting guide\n\n## 🙏 Contributors\nThanks to all contributors who made this release possible!\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Release Planning\n- Regular release cycles\n- Feature freeze periods\n- Beta testing phases\n- Clear communication\n\n### 2. Automation\n- Comprehensive CI/CD\n- Automated testing\n- Progressive rollouts\n- Monitoring and alerts\n\n### 3. Documentation\n- Up-to-date changelogs\n- Migration guides\n- API documentation\n- Example updates\n\n## Integration Examples\n\n### NPM Package Release\n```bash\n# NPM package release\nnpx ruv-swarm github npm-release \\\n  --version patch \\\n  --test-all \\\n  --publish-beta \\\n  --tag-latest-on-success\n```\n\n### Docker Image Release\n```bash\n# Docker multi-arch release\nnpx ruv-swarm github docker-release \\\n  --platforms \"linux$amd64,linux$arm64\" \\\n  --tags \"latest,v2.0.0,stable\" \\\n  --scan-vulnerabilities \\\n  --push-to \"dockerhub,gcr,ecr\"\n```\n\n### Mobile App Release\n```bash\n# Mobile app store release\nnpx ruv-swarm github mobile-release \\\n  --platforms \"ios,android\" \\\n  --build-release \\\n  --submit-review \\\n  --staged-rollout\n```\n\n## Emergency Procedures\n\n### Hotfix Process\n```bash\n# Emergency hotfix\nnpx ruv-swarm github emergency-release \\\n  --severity critical \\\n  --bypass-checks security-only \\\n  --fast-track \\\n  --notify-all\n```\n\n### Rollback Procedure\n```bash\n# Immediate rollback\nnpx ruv-swarm github rollback \\\n  --to-version v1.9.9 \\\n  --reason \"Critical bug in v2.0.0\" \\\n  --preserve-data \\\n  --notify-users\n```\n\nSee also: [workflow-automation.md](.$workflow-automation.md), [multi-repo-swarm.md](.$multi-repo-swarm.md)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:00:45.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude-based Agents needing advanced multi-agent swarm orchestration for complex software releases.","zh":"非常适合需要高级多代理群编排的Claude基于代理，用于复杂的软件发布。","ja":"Claudeベースのエージェントが複雑なソフトウェアリリースのための高度なマルチエージェントスウォームオーケストレーションを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"클라우드 기반 에이전트가 복잡한 소프트웨어 릴리스를 위한 고급 다중 에이전트 스웜 오케스트레이션을 필요로 할 때 가장 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en Claude que necesitan una orquestación de enjambre de agentes múltiples avanzada para lanzamientos de software complejos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur Claude nécessitant une orchestration de swarm d''agents multiples avancée pour des versions logicielles complexes.","de":"Perfekt für Claude-basierte Agenten, die eine erweiterte Mehrfachagenten-Schwarm-Orchestrierung für komplexe Software-Veröffentlichungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em Claude que necessitam de orquestração de enxame de multi-agente avançada para lançamentos de software complexos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов на основе Claude, которым требуется продвинутая оркестрация многоагентных роев для сложных выпусков программного обеспечения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستندة إلى Claude الذين يحتاجون إلى أوركسترا متقدمة لمجموعة من الوكلاء متعددة لطرح برامج معقدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate autonomous workflows, leveraging distributed swarm intelligence and native Claude Code support via MCP, to handle everything from changelog generation to multi-platform deployment using tools like Bash, GitHub, and WebFetch.","zh":"赋予代理人协调自主工作流的能力，利用分布式群集智能和MCP上的本地Claude代码支持，处理从更改日志生成到使用Bash、GitHub和WebFetch等工具的多平台部署等一切事务。","ja":"エージェントに自治型ワークフローを調整する能力を与え、MCP経由のネイティブClaudeコードサポートを使用した分散スウォームインテリジェンスを活用し、Bash、GitHub、WebFetchなどのツールを使用したマルチプラットフォームデプロイから変更ログの生成まで一切を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 자율적 인 워크플ロー를 조정 할 수있는 능력을 부여하고 분산 스ウォーム 인텔리전스를 활용하여 MCP를 통해 네이티브 클라우드 코드 지원을 사용하여 Bash, GitHub 및 WebFetch와 같은 도구를 사용하여 다중 플랫폼 배포에서 변경 로그 생성까지 모든 것을 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes coordinar flujos de trabajo autónomos, aprovechando la inteligencia de enjambre distribuida y el soporte nativo de Claude Code a través de MCP, para manejar todo, desde la generación de registros de cambios hasta la implementación en varias plataformas utilizando herramientas como Bash, GitHub y WebFetch.","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner des flux de travail autonomes, en exploitant l''intelligence de swarm distribuée et le support natif du code Claude via MCP, pour gérer tout, des générations de journaux de modifications à la mise en production multi-plateforme en utilisant des outils comme Bash, GitHub et WebFetch.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, autonome Workflows zu koordinieren, indem sie die verteilte Schwarmintelligenz und die native Claude-Code-Unterstützung über MCP nutzen, um alles von der Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen bis hin zur Bereitstellung auf mehreren Plattformen mithilfe von Tools wie Bash, GitHub und WebFetch zu verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar fluxos de trabalho autônomos, aproveitando a inteligência de enxame distribuída e o suporte nativo ao Claude Code via MCP, para lidar com tudo, desde a geração de changelog até a implantação em várias plataformas usando ferramentas como Bash, GitHub e WebFetch.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность координировать автономные рабочие процессы, используя распределенную интеллектуальность роев и родную поддержку кода Claude через MCP, чтобы обрабатывать все, от генерации журнала изменений до развертывания на нескольких платформах с помощью инструментов seperti Bash, GitHub и WebFetch.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق سير العمل المستقلة، مستفيدة من ذكاء الحشد الموزع والدعم الأصلي لкод Claude من خلال MCP، لمعالجة كل شيء من توليد سجل التغييرات إلى النشر عبر منصات متعددة باستخدام أدوات مثل Bash و GitHub و WebFetch."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating software release processes using AI swarms","Coordinating multi-platform deployments with GitHub integration","Generating changelogs and handling issues with TodoWrite and TodoRead tools"],"zh":["使用AI群集自动化软件发布流程","使用GitHub集成协调多平台部署","使用TodoWrite和TodoRead工具生成更改日志和处理问题"],"ja":["AIスウォームを使用してソフトウェアリリースプロセスを自動化する","GitHubとの統合を使用してマルチプラットフォームデプロイを調整する","TodoWriteとTodoReadツールを使用して変更ログを生成し、問題を処理する"],"ko":["AI 스웜을 사용하여 소프트웨어 릴리스 프로세스를 자동화하는 것","GitHub 통합을 사용하여 다중 플랫폼 배포를 조정하는 것","TodoWrite 및 TodoRead 도구를 사용하여 변경 로그를 생성하고 문제를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar procesos de lanzamiento de software utilizando enjambres de IA","Coordinar implementaciones en varias plataformas con integración de GitHub","Generar registros de cambios y manejar problemas con herramientas TodoWrite y TodoRead"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de version logicielle en utilisant des essaims d''IA","Coordonner les déploiements multi-plateformes avec l''intégration de GitHub","Générer des journaux de modifications et gérer les problèmes avec les outils TodoWrite et TodoRead"],"de":["Automatisierung von Software-Veröffentlichungsprozessen mithilfe von KI-Schwärmen","Koordinierung von Multi-Plattform-Bereitstellungen mit GitHub-Integration","Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen und Handhabung von Problemen mit den Tools TodoWrite und TodoRead"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de lançamento de software usando enxames de IA","Coordenar implantações em várias plataformas com integração do GitHub","Gerar changelogs e lidar com problemas com as ferramentas TodoWrite e TodoRead"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы выпуска программного обеспечения с помощью роев ИИ","Координировать развертывания на нескольких платформах с интеграцией GitHub","Генерировать журналы изменений и обрабатывать проблемы с помощью инструментов TodoWrite и TodoRead"],"ar":["تأتمتة عمليات إصدار البرامج باستخدام سلاسل ذكاء اصطناعي","تنسيق التوزيعات عبر منصات متعددة مع دمج GitHub","توليد سجلات التغييرات ومعالجة المشاكل باستخدام أدوات TodoWrite و TodoRead"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code support via MCP","Dependent on GitHub API for deployment and issue management","Needs Bash for script execution"],"zh":["需要MCP上的Claude代码支持","依赖于GitHub API进行部署和问题管理","需要Bash进行脚本执行"],"ja":["MCP経由のClaudeコードサポートが必要","デプロイと問題管理のためにGitHub APIに依存","スクリプト実行のためにBashが必要"],"ko":["MCP上的클라우드 코드 지원이 필요합니다.","배포 및 문제 관리를 위해 GitHub API에 의존합니다.","스크립트 실행을 위해 Bash가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere soporte de Claude Code a través de MCP","Dependiente de la API de GitHub para la implementación y administración de problemas","Necesita Bash para la ejecución de scripts"],"fr":["Nécessite le support du code Claude via MCP","Dépend de l''API GitHub pour le déploiement et la gestion des problèmes","Nécessite Bash pour l''exécution de scripts"],"de":["Benötigt Claude-Code-Unterstützung über MCP","Abhängig von der GitHub-API für die Bereitstellung und die Problemeverwaltung","Benötigt Bash für die Skriptausführung"],"pt":["Requer suporte ao Claude Code via MCP","Dependente da API do GitHub para implantação e gerenciamento de problemas","Necessita do Bash para execução de scripts"],"ru":["Требует поддержки кода Claude через MCP","Зависит от API GitHub для развертывания и управления проблемами","Требует Bash для выполнения скриптов"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم kod Claude من خلال MCP","يعتمد على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub للنشر وإدارة المشاكل","يحتاج إلى Bash لتنفيذ البرامج النصية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
