SS 애니메이션 및 상태 관리 구현","es":"Svelte permite la creación de videos programáticos con tecnologías web conocidas. Integra Helios en tus componentes Svelte","fr":"Svelte permet la création de vidéos programmatiques avec des technologies web connues. Intégrez Helios dans vos composants Svelte","de":"Svelte ermöglicht die Erstellung von programmatischen Videos mit bekannten Webtechnologien. Integrieren Sie Helios in Ihre Svelte-Komponenten","pt":"O exemplo-svelte permite a criação de vídeos programáticos com tecnologias web conhecidas, tornando as CSS animations fáceis de usar.","ru":"Пример Svelte позволяет создавать программные видео с известными веб-технологиями, делая CSS-анимации легко используемыми.","ar":"النموذج example-svelte يسمح بإنشاء فيديوهات برمجية مع التكنولوجيا الويب المعروفة، مما يسهل استخدام animations CSS.","en":"Programmatic video creation with web technologies you already know. CSS animations just work."},"definition":{"en":"Programmatic video creation with web technologies you already know. CSS animations just work."},"features":{"zh":["使用Svelte Stores管理帧状态","实现CSS动画","程序化视频创建","状态管理","可扩展性"],"ja":["Svelte Storesを使用してフレーム状態を管理","CSSアニメーションの実現","プログラム動画の作成","状態管理","拡張性"],"ko":["Svelte Stores를 사용하여 프레임 상태 관리","CSS 애니메이션 구현","프로그램 동영상 생성","상태 관리","확장성"],"es":["Creación de videos programáticos","Integración con Helios","Uso de Svelte Stores para gestionar el estado de los frames","Compatibilidad con CSS animations","Creación de componentes web reactivos"],"fr":["Création de vidéos programmatiques","Intégration avec Helios","Utilisation de Svelte Stores pour gérer l''état des frames","Compatibilité avec les animations CSS","Création de composants web réactifs"],"de":["Erstellung von programmatischen Videos","Integration mit Helios","Verwendung von Svelte Stores zur Verwaltung des Frame-Zustands","Kompatibilität mit CSS-Animationen","Erstellung reaktiver Webkomponenten"],"pt":["Criação de vídeos programáticos com Svelte","Uso de CSS animations","Integração com Svelte Stores","Gestão de estado reativo com readable store","Facilidade de uso e personalização"],"ru":["Создание программных видео с Svelte","Использование CSS-анимаций","Интеграция с Svelte Stores","Управление реактивным состоянием с помощью readable store","Легкость использования и настройки"],"ar":["إنشاء فيديوهات برمجية مع Svelte","استخدام animations CSS","التكامل مع Svelte Stores","إدارة الحالة التفاعلية مع readable store","سهولة الاستخدام والتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Svelte","程序化视频创建","CSS动画","状态管理","Svelte Stores","Web技术"],"ja":["Svelte","プログラム動画作成","CSSアニメーション","状態管理","Svelte Stores","Web技術"],"ko":["Svelte","프로그램 동영상 생성","CSS 애니메이션","상태 관리","Svelte Stores","웹 기술"],"es":["Svelte","creación de videos programáticos","Helios","Svelte Stores","CSS animations","desarrollo web","programación web"],"fr":["Svelte","création de vidéos programmatiques","Helios","Svelte Stores","animations CSS","développement web","programmation web"],"de":["Svelte","Erstellung von programmatischen Videos","Helios","Svelte Stores","CSS-Animationen","Webentwicklung","Webprogrammierung"],"pt":["Svelte","vídeos programáticos","CSS animations","Svelte Stores","reactividade","desenvolvimento web","programação de vídeo"],"ru":["Svelte","программные видео","CSS-анимации","Svelte Stores","реактивность","веб-разработка","программирование видео"],"ar":["Svelte","فيديوهات برمجية","animations CSS","Svelte Stores","التفاعلية","تطوير الويب","برمجة الفيديو"]}},"owner":"BintzGavin","repo":"helios","repoPath":"BintzGavin/helios","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"example-svelte","description":"Patterns for using Helios with Svelte. Use when building compositions in a Svelte environment, utilizing Svelte stores for reactive frame updates.","bodyPreview":"# Svelte Composition Patterns\n\nIntegrate Helios into Svelte components using Svelte Stores to manage frame state reactivity efficiently.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Create Helios Store\n\nWrap the Helios instance in a readable store to make state reactive.\n\n```javascript\n// lib/store.js\nimport { readable } from ''svelte/store'';\n\nexport const createHeliosStore = (helios) => {\n  return readable(helios.getState(), (set) => {\n    // Set initial value\n    set(helios.getState());\n\n    // Subscribe to updates","body":"# Svelte Composition Patterns\n\nIntegrate Helios into Svelte components using Svelte Stores to manage frame state reactivity efficiently.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Create Helios Store\n\nWrap the Helios instance in a readable store to make state reactive.\n\n```javascript\n// lib/store.js\nimport { readable } from ''svelte/store'';\n\nexport const createHeliosStore = (helios) => {\n  return readable(helios.getState(), (set) => {\n    // Set initial value\n    set(helios.getState());\n\n    // Subscribe to updates\n    const unsubscribe = helios.subscribe((state) => {\n      set(state);\n    });\n\n    return unsubscribe;\n  });\n};\n```\n\n### 2. Create Composition Component\n\n```svelte\n<!-- App.svelte -->\n<script>\n  import { onMount, onDestroy } from ''svelte'';\n  import { Helios } from ''@helios-project/core'';\n  import { createHeliosStore } from ''./lib/store'';\n\n  let canvas;\n  let ctx;\n  const duration = 5;\n  const fps = 30;\n\n  // Initialize Singleton\n  const helios = new Helios({ duration, fps });\n  helios.bindToDocumentTimeline();\n\n  // Expose to window\n  if (typeof window !== ''undefined'') window.helios = helios;\n\n  // Create Store\n  const heliosStore = createHeliosStore(helios);\n\n  // Reactive Drawing Statement\n  $: if (ctx && $heliosStore) {\n    draw($heliosStore.currentFrame);\n  }\n\n  function draw(frame) {\n    const width = canvas.width;\n    const height = canvas.height;\n\n    // Clear\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n    // Draw\n    const progress = frame / (duration * fps);\n    ctx.fillStyle = ''#ff3e00'';\n    ctx.fillRect(progress * width, height / 2 - 50, 100, 100);\n  }\n\n  onMount(() => {\n    ctx = canvas.getContext(''2d'');\n    canvas.width = 1920;\n    canvas.height = 1080;\n    // Initial draw\n    draw(helios.currentFrame.peek());\n  });\n</script>\n\n<canvas bind:this={canvas}></canvas>\n\n<style>\n  canvas {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n</style>\n```\n\n## Svelte 5 (Runes)\n\nFor Svelte 5, use the `$state` rune to create a reactive state class.\n\n### 1. Create Helios State Class\n\n```javascript\n// lib/helios.svelte.ts\nimport { Helios } from ''@helios-project/core'';\n\nexport class HeliosState {\n    currentFrame = $state(0);\n    fps = $state(0);\n    duration = $state(0);\n    isPlaying = $state(false);\n\n    constructor(helios) {\n        this.fps = helios.fps;\n        this.duration = helios.duration;\n        this.isPlaying = helios.isPlaying;\n\n        helios.subscribe((state) => {\n            this.currentFrame = state.currentFrame;\n            this.isPlaying = state.isPlaying;\n        });\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Use in Component\n\n```svelte\n<!-- App.svelte -->\n<script>\n  import { Helios } from ''@helios-project/core'';\n  import { HeliosState } from ''./lib/helios.svelte.js'';\n\n  const helios = new Helios({ duration: 10, fps: 30 });\n  const state = new HeliosState(helios);\n\n  // Reactivity works automatically with state properties\n  $effect(() => {\n    console.log(`Current Frame: ${state.currentFrame}`);\n  });\n</script>\n\n<div>Frame: {state.currentFrame}</div>\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **Store Pattern:** Svelte''s `readable` store is the perfect primitive for wrapping the `helios.subscribe` callback.\n- **Reactive Statements (`$:`):** Use reactive statements to trigger redraws whenever `$heliosStore` updates.\n- **Singleton Helios:** Initialize `Helios` outside the component script or in a separate module to ensure it persists if the component remounts (though for a root App component, inside `<script>` is fine).\n\n## Audio Visualization Pattern\n\nFor audio visualization, use a **derived store** to compute analysis data (RMS, Waveform) reactively based on the current frame.\n\n### 1. Create Audio Store\n\n```javascript\n// lib/audio.js\nimport { derived } from ''svelte/store'';\n\nexport function createAudioStore(bufferStore, heliosStore) {\n    return derived(\n        [bufferStore, heliosStore],\n        ([$buffer, $heliosState]) => {\n            if (!$buffer || !$heliosState) return { rms: 0, waveform: [] };\n\n            const data = $buffer.getChannelData(0);\n            const sampleRate = $buffer.sampleRate;\n            const time = $heliosState.currentFrame / $heliosState.fps;\n\n            // Analyze window around current time\n            const center = Math.floor(time * sampleRate);\n            const windowSize = 1024;\n            // ... (FFT logic or simple time-domain analysis) ...\n\n            return { rms: 0.5, waveform: [] }; // Mock result\n        }\n    );\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Use in Component\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n    import { createAudioStore } from ''./lib/audio'';\n    // ... setup heliosStore and bufferStore ...\n\n    const audioStore = createAudioStore(bufferStore, heliosStore);\n\n    $: if (ctx && $audioStore) {\n        const { rms, waveform } = $audioStore;\n        // Draw using rms/waveform\n    }\n</script>\n```\n\n## Source Files\n\n- Example: `examples/svelte-canvas-animation/`\n- Example: `examples/svelte-runes-animation/`\n- Example: `examples/svelte-audio-visualization/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:00:41.000Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing programmatic video creation with Svelte and CSS animations.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Svelte和CSS动画进行程序化视频创建的前端代理。","ja":"SvelteとCSSアニメーションを使用したプログラムによるビデオ作成が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Svelte와 CSS 애니메이션을 사용하여 프로그래밍 방식으로 비디오를 생성해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan creación de video programática con Svelte y animaciones CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin de création de vidéos programmatiques avec Svelte et des animations CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine programmatische Videocreation mit Svelte und CSS-Animationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de criação de vídeo programática com Svelte e animações CSS.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется программная создание видео с помощью Svelte и анимаций CSS.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء فيديو برمجي باستخدام Svelte ورسومات CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate Helios into Svelte components using Svelte Stores for efficient frame state reactivity, leveraging web technologies like CSS animations and readable stores from ''svelte/store''.","zh":"赋予代理将Helios集成到Svelte组件中使用Svelte Stores以实现高效的帧状态响应式，利用像CSS动画和''svelte/store''中的可读存储等Web技术。","ja":"エージェントに、Svelte Storesを使用して効率的なフレーム状態のリアクティブ性を実現し、CSSアニメーションや''svelte/store''からの読み取り可能なストアなどのWeb技術を活用して、HeliosをSvelteコンポーネントに統合する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 Svelte 스토어를 사용하여 효율적인 프레임 상태 반응성을实现하고, CSS 애니메이션 및 ''svelte/store''의 읽기 가능한 저장소와 같은 웹 기술을 활용하여 Helios를 Svelte 구성 요소에 통합할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar Helios en componentes de Svelte utilizando Svelte Stores para una reactividad eficiente del estado de los fotogramas, aprovechando tecnologías web como animaciones CSS y tiendas legibles de ''svelte/store''.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer Helios dans des composants Svelte en utilisant Svelte Stores pour une réactivité efficace de l''état des images, en exploitant les technologies web comme les animations CSS et les magasins lisibles de ''svelte/store''.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Helios in Svelte-Komponenten zu integrieren, indem sie Svelte Stores für eine effiziente Reaktivität des Frame-Zustands verwenden, wobei Webtechnologien wie CSS-Animationen und lesbare Stores von ''svelte/store'' genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar Helios em componentes Svelte usando Lojas Svelte para reatividade de estado de quadro eficiente, aproveitando tecnologias da web como animações CSS e lojas legíveis de ''svelte/store''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать Helios в компоненты Svelte, используя магазины Svelte для эффективной реактивности состояния кадра, используя веб-технологии, такие как анимации CSS и читаемые магазины из ''svelte/store''.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من دمج Helios في مكونات Svelte باستخدام متاجر Svelte من أجل استجابة فعالة لحالة الإطار، واستغلال تقنيات الويب مثل رسومات CSS والمتاجر القابلة للقراءة من ''svelte/store''."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating reactive video components with Svelte","Managing frame state efficiently using Svelte Stores","Integrating Helios with Svelte for programmatic video creation"],"zh":["使用Svelte创建反应式视频组件","使用Svelte Stores高效地管理帧状态","将Helios与Svelte集成以实现程序化视频创建"],"ja":["Svelteを使用してリアクティブなビデオコンポーネントを作成する","Svelte Storesを使用してフレーム状態を効率的に管理する","HeliosをSvelteに統合してプログラムによるビデオ作成を実現する"],"ko":["Svelte를 사용하여 반응형 비디오 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","Svelte 스토어를 사용하여 프레임 상태를 효율적으로 관리하는 것","Helios를 Svelte에 통합하여 프로그래밍 방식으로 비디오를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Crear componentes de video reactivos con Svelte","Administrar el estado de los fotogramas de forma eficiente utilizando Svelte Stores","Integrar Helios con Svelte para la creación de video programática"],"fr":["Créer des composants de vidéo réactifs avec Svelte","Gérer l''état des images de manière efficace en utilisant Svelte Stores","Intégrer Helios avec Svelte pour la création de vidéos programmatiques"],"de":["Reaktive Video-Komponenten mit Svelte erstellen","Frame-Zustand effizient mit Svelte Stores verwalten","Helios mit Svelte für die programmatische Videocreation integrieren"],"pt":["Criar componentes de vídeo reativos com Svelte","Gerenciar o estado do quadro de forma eficiente usando Lojas Svelte","Integrar Helios com Svelte para criação de vídeo programática"],"ru":["Создание реактивных видеокомпонентов с помощью Svelte","Эффективное управление состоянием кадра с помощью магазинов Svelte","Интеграция Helios с Svelte для программной создания видео"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات فيديو تفاعلية مع Svelte","إدارة حالة الإطار بفعالية باستخدام متاجر Svelte","دمج Helios مع Svelte من أجل إنشاء فيديو برمجي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Svelte and Helios setup","Limited to web technologies and CSS animations"],"zh":["需要Svelte和Helios设置","仅限于Web技术和CSS动画"],"ja":["SvelteとHeliosの設定が必要","Web技術とCSSアニメーションに限定される"],"ko":["Svelte와 Helios 설정이 필요","웹 기술과 CSS 애니메이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Svelte y Helios","Limitado a tecnologías web y animaciones CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Svelte et Helios","Limité aux technologies web et aux animations CSS"],"de":["Benötigt Svelte- und Helios-Setup","Begrenzt auf Webtechnologien und CSS-Animationen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Svelte e Helios","Limitado a tecnologias da web e animações CSS"],"ru":["Требует настройки Svelte и Helios","Ограничен веб-технологиями и анимациями CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Svelte و Helios","محدود بالتكنولوجيا المستخدمة في الويب ورسومات CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
