gular","ru":"Внедрение зависимостей в Angular","ar":"إدخال التبعية في أنجولار","en":"angular-di"},"description":{"zh":"Angular 依赖注入（DI）允许您配置和使用依赖项。使用 inject() 和提供者来简化您的Angular应用程序","ja":"Angular DI を使用して依存性を構成して使用します。inject() と provider を使用して Angular アプリケーションを簡素化します","ko":"Angular DI를 사용하여 의존성을 구성하고 사용합니다. inject()와 제공자를 사용하여 Angular 애플리케이션을 간소화합니다","es":"La inyección de dependencias en Angular permite a los desarrolladores configurar y utilizar dependencias de manera eficiente. Con la versión 20+, se introduc...","fr":"L''injection de dépendances dans Angular permet aux développeurs de configurer et d''utiliser des dépendances de manière efficace. Avec la version 20+, l''utili...","de":"Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Abhängigkeiten effizient zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden. Mit der Version 20+ wird die Ver...","pt":"Configure e use injeção de dependência no Angular com inject() e providers. Aprenda a melhorar a sua aplicação","ru":"Настройте и используйте внедрение зависимостей в Angular с inject() и провайдерами. Улучшите свою aplikatsiyu","ar":"اضبط واستخدم إدخال التبعية في أنجولار مع inject() و providers. تحسين التطبيق الخاص بك","en":"Application de planification de budget personnel"},"definition":{"en":"Application de planification de budget personnel"},"features":{"zh":["使用 inject() 配置依赖项","定义和使用提供者","简化 Angular 应用程序的依赖关系","提高代码的可维护性和可扩展性","支持 Angular v20+"],"ja":["inject() を使用して依存性を構成する","provider を定義して使用する","Angular アプリケーションの依存関係を簡素化する","コードの保守性と拡張性を高める","Angular v20+ をサポートする"],"ko":["inject()를 사용하여 의존성을 구성합니다","제공자를 정의하고 사용합니다","Angular 애플리케이션의 의존 관계를 간소화합니다","코드의 유지 보수성과 확장성을 높입니다","Angular v20+를 지원합니다"],"es":["Configuración de dependencias con inject()","Uso de proveedores para la inyección de dependencias","Compatibilidad con Angular v20+","Flexibilidad en la configuración de dependencias","Mejora de la testabilidad de los componentes"],"fr":["Configuration des dépendances avec inject()","Utilisation de fournisseurs pour l''injection de dépendances","Compatibilité avec Angular v20+","Flexibilité dans la configuration des dépendances","Amélioration de la testabilité des composants"],"de":["Konfiguration von Abhängigkeiten mit inject()","Verwendung von Anbietern für die Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Kompatibilität mit Angular v20+","Flexibilität bei der Konfiguration von Abhängigkeiten","Verbesserung der Testbarkeit von Komponenten"],"pt":["Configuração de injeção de dependência com inject()","Uso de providers para gerenciar dependências","Melhoria da aplicação com injeção de dependência","Compatibilidade com Angular v20+","Exemplos de código para injeção de dependência"],"ru":["Настройка внедрения зависимостей с inject()","Использование провайдеров для управления зависимостями","Улучшение приложения с помощью внедрения зависимостей","Совместимость с Angular v20+","Примеры кода для внедрения зависимостей"],"ar":["ضبط إدخال التبعية مع inject()","استخدام providers لإدارة التبعيات","تحسين التطبيق مع إدخال التبعية","التوافق مع أنجولار v20+","أمثلة من الكود لإدخال التبعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 依赖注入","Angular DI","inject()","提供者","Angular v20+","依赖关系","软件设计模式"],"ja":["Angular 依存性注入","Angular DI","inject()","provider","Angular v20+","依存関係","ソフトウェア設計パターン"],"ko":["Angular 의존성 주입","Angular DI","inject()","제공자","Angular v20+","의존 관계","소프트웨어 디자인 패턴"],"es":["inyección de dependencias","angular","inject()","proveedores","desarrollo de aplicaciones","patrones de diseño","testabilidad"],"fr":["injection de dépendances","angular","inject()","fournisseurs","développement d''applications","patrons de conception","testabilité"],"de":["abhängigkeitsinjektion","angular","inject()","anbieter","anwendungsentwicklung","entwurfsmuster","testbarkeit"],"pt":["injeção de dependência angular","angular dependency injection","inject()","providers","angular v20+","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","padrões de design"],"ru":["внедрение зависимостей ангуляр","angular dependency injection","inject()","провайдеры","angular v20+","разработка приложений","шаблоны проектирования"],"ar":["إدخال التبعية أنجولار","angular dependency injection","inject()","providers","أنجولار v20+","تطوير التطبيقات","أنماط التصميم"]}},"owner":"neogenz","repo":"pulpe","repoPath":"neogenz/pulpe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-di","description":"Implement dependency injection in Angular v20+ using inject(), injection tokens, and provider configuration. Use for service architecture, providing dependencies at different levels, creating injectable tokens, and managing singleton vs scoped services. Triggers on service creation, configuring providers, using injection tokens, or understanding DI hierarchy.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(H","body":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  private userService = inject(User);\n  \n  // Can use immediately\n  users = this.userService.getUsers();\n}\n```\n\n### Injectable Services\n\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable, inject, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\n\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'', // Singleton at root level\n})\nexport class User {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  \n  private users = signal<User[]>([]);\n  readonly users$ = this.users.asReadonly();\n  \n  async loadUsers() {\n    const users = await firstValueFrom(\n      this.http.get<User[]>(''/api/users'')\n    );\n    this.users.set(users);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Scopes\n\n### Root Level (Singleton)\n\n```typescript\n// Recommended: providedIn\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n})\nexport class Auth {}\n\n// Alternative: in app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Auth,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Component Level (Instance per Component)\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-editor'',\n  providers: [EditorState], // New instance for each component\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class Editor {\n  private editorState = inject(EditorState);\n}\n```\n\n### Route Level\n\n```typescript\nexport const routes: Routes = [\n  {\n    path: ''admin'',\n    providers: [Admin], // Shared within this route tree\n    children: [\n      { path: '''', component: AdminDashboard },\n      { path: ''users'', component: AdminUsers },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n```\n\n## Injection Tokens\n\n### Creating Tokens\n\n```typescript\nimport { InjectionToken } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Simple value token\nexport const API_URL = new InjectionToken<string>(''API_URL'');\n\n// Object token\nexport interface AppConfig {\n  apiUrl: string;\n  features: {\n    darkMode: boolean;\n    analytics: boolean;\n  };\n}\n\nexport const APP_CONFIG = new InjectionToken<AppConfig>(''APP_CONFIG'');\n\n// Token with factory (self-providing)\nexport const WINDOW = new InjectionToken<Window>(''Window'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => window,\n});\n\nexport const LOCAL_STORAGE = new InjectionToken<Storage>(''LocalStorage'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => localStorage,\n});\n```\n\n### Providing Token Values\n\n```typescript\n// app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    { provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' },\n    {\n      provide: APP_CONFIG,\n      useValue: {\n        apiUrl: ''https://api.example.com'',\n        features: { darkMode: true, analytics: true },\n      },\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Injecting Tokens\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Api {\n  private apiUrl = inject(API_URL);\n  private config = inject(APP_CONFIG);\n  private window = inject(WINDOW);\n  \n  getBaseUrl(): string {\n    return this.apiUrl;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Types\n\n### useClass\n\n```typescript\n// Provide implementation\n{ provide: Logger, useClass: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Conditional implementation\n{\n  provide: Logger,\n  useClass: environment.production\n    ? ProductionLogger\n    : ConsoleLogger,\n}\n```\n\n### useValue\n\n```typescript\n// Static values\n{ provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' }\n\n// Configuration objects\n{ provide: APP_CONFIG, useValue: { theme: ''dark'', language: ''en'' } }\n```\n\n### useFactory\n\n```typescript\n// Factory with dependencies\n{\n  provide: User,\n  useFactory: (http: HttpClient, config: AppConfig) => {\n    return new User(http, config.apiUrl);\n  },\n  deps: [HttpClient, APP_CONFIG],\n}\n\n// Async factory (not recommended - use provideAppInitializer)\n{\n  provide: CONFIG,\n  useFactory: () => fetch(''/config.json'').then(r => r.json()),\n}\n```\n\n### useExisting\n\n```typescript\n// Alias to existing provider\n{ provide: AbstractLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Multiple tokens pointing to same instance\nproviders: [\n  ConsoleLogger,\n  { provide: Logger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n  { provide: ErrorLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n]\n```\n\n## Injection Options\n\n### Optional Injection\n\n```typescript\n@Component({...})\nexport class My {\n  // Returns null if not provided\n  private analytics = inject(Analytics, { optional: true });\n  \n  trackEvent(name: string) {\n    this.analytics?.track(name);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Self, SkipSelf, Host\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  providers: [Local],\n})\nexport class Parent {\n  // Only look in this component''s injector\n  private local = inject(Local, { self: true });\n}\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Child {\n  // Skip this component, look in parent\n  private parentService = inject(ParentSvc, { skipSelf: true });\n\n  // Only look up to host component\n  private hostService = inject(Host, { host: true });\n}\n```\n\n## Multi Providers\n\nCollect multiple values for same token:\n\n```typescript\n// Token for multiple validators\nexport const VALIDATORS = new InjectionToken<Validator[]>(''Validators'');\n\n// Provide multiple values\nproviders: [\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: RequiredValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: EmailValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: MinLengthValidator, multi: true },\n]\n\n// Inject as array\n@Injectable()\nexport class Validation {\n  private validators = inject(VALIDATORS); // Validator[]\n  \n  validate(value: string): ValidationError[] {\n    return this.validators\n      .map(v => v.validate(value))\n      .filter(Boolean);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### HTTP Interceptors (Multi Provider)\n\n```typescript\n// Interceptors use multi providers internally\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    provideHttpClient(\n      withInterceptors([\n        authInterceptor,\n        loggingInterceptor,\n        errorInterceptor,\n      ])\n    ),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## App Initializers\n\nRun async code before app starts using `provideAppInitializer`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { provideAppInitializer, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Config,\n    provideAppInitializer(() => {\n      const configService = inject(Config);\n      return configService.loadConfig();\n    }),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Multiple Initializers\n\n```typescript\nproviders: [\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const config = inject(Config);\n    return config.load();\n  }),\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const auth = inject(Auth);\n    return auth.checkSession();\n  }),\n]\n```\n\n## Environment Injector\n\nCreate injectors programmatically:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createEnvironmentInjector, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Plugin {\n  private parentInjector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  loadPlugin(providers: Provider[]): EnvironmentInjector {\n    return createEnvironmentInjector(providers, this.parentInjector);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## runInInjectionContext\n\nRun code with injection context:\n\n```typescript\nimport { runInInjectionContext, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Utility {\n  private injector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  executeWithDI<T>(fn: () => T): T {\n    return runInInjectionContext(this.injector, fn);\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nutilityService.executeWithDI(() => {\n  const http = inject(HttpClient);\n  // Use http...\n});\n```\n\nFor advanced patterns, see [references/di-patterns.md](references/di-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:01:32.635Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Angular dependency injection capabilities with inject() and providers.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Angular依赖注入功能的前端代理，包括使用inject()和providers的能力。","ja":"Angularの依存性注入機能を使用するフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。inject()とprovidersを使用した高度な依存性注入機能が提供されます。","ko":"고급 Angular 의존성 주입 기능을 필요로하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. inject()와 providers를 사용한 의존성 주입 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de inyección de dependencias de Angular con inject() y proveedores.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''injection de dépendances Angular avec inject() et fournisseurs.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Angular-Abhängigkeitsinjektionsfunktionen mit inject() und Providern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de injeção de dependência do Angular com inject() e providers.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности внедрения зависимостей Angular с inject() и providers.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإدارة الحقن التابعة لانجولار مع inject() و providers."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with inject() and providers, leveraging libraries like @angular/core and @angular/common/http for robust application development.","zh":"赋予代理配置和使用Angular v20+中的依赖注入功能，使用inject()和providers，并利用@angular/core和@angular/common/http等库进行强大的应用开发。","ja":"エージェントがAngular v20+で依存性注入を構成して使用できるようにし、inject()とprovidersを使用して、@angular/coreや@angular/common/httpなどのライブラリを活用して強力なアプリケーション開発を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular v20+에서 의존성 주입을 구성하고 사용할 수 있도록 하며, inject()와 providers를 사용하여 @angular/core와 @angular/common/http 등의 라이브러리를 활용하여 강력한 애플리케이션 개발을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar y usar la inyección de dependencias en Angular v20+ con inject() y proveedores, aprovechando bibliotecas como @angular/core y @angular/common/http para un desarrollo de aplicaciones robustas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et d''utiliser l''injection de dépendances dans Angular v20+ avec inject() et fournisseurs, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme @angular/core et @angular/common/http pour un développement d''applications robuste.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular v20+ mit inject() und Providern zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden, indem Bibliotheken wie @angular/core und @angular/common/http für eine robuste Anwendungsentwicklung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e usar injeção de dependência no Angular v20+ com inject() e providers, aproveitando bibliotecas como @angular/core e @angular/common/http para desenvolvimento de aplicações robustas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать и использовать внедрение зависимостей в Angular v20+ с inject() и providers, используя библиотеки seperti @angular/core и @angular/common/http для создания прочных приложений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية تكوين واستخدام حقن التبعية في Angular v20+ مع inject() و providers، مستفيداً من المكتبات مثل @angular/core و @angular/common/http من أجل تطوير تطبيقات قوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring providers for HttpClient","Injecting dependencies with inject()","Optimizing component architecture with dependency injection"],"zh":["为HttpClient配置提供者","使用inject()注入依赖项","使用依赖注入优化组件架构"],"ja":["HttpClientのプロバイダーを構成する","inject()を使用して依存関係を注入する","依存性注入を使用してコンポーネントアーキテクチャを最適化する"],"ko":["HttpClient를 위한 제공자 구성","inject()를 사용하여 의존성 주입","의존성 주입을 사용하여 컴포넌트 아키텍처 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de proveedores para HttpClient","Inyección de dependencias con inject()","Optimización de la arquitectura de componentes con inyección de dependencias"],"fr":["Configuration des fournisseurs pour HttpClient","Injection de dépendances avec inject()","Optimisation de l''architecture de composants avec injection de dépendances"],"de":["Konfiguration von Providern für HttpClient","Injektion von Abhängigkeiten mit inject()","Optimierung der Komponentenarchitektur mit Abhängigkeitsinjektion"],"pt":["Configurando provedores para HttpClient","Injetando dependências com inject()","Otimizando arquitetura de componentes com injeção de dependência"],"ru":["Настройка провайдеров для HttpClient","Внедрение зависимостей с inject()","Оптимизация архитектуры компонентов с внедрением зависимостей"],"ar":["تكوين مزودي خدمات للعميل HttpClient","حَقن التبعيات باستخدام inject()","تحسين هيكل المكونات باستخدام حقن التبعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular v20+","Limited to TypeScript-based applications"],"zh":["需要Angular v20+","仅限于基于TypeScript的应用程序"],"ja":["Angular v20+が必要","TypeScriptベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Angular v20+ 필요","TypeScript 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere Angular v20+","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite Angular v20+","Limité aux applications basées sur TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt Angular v20+","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige Angular v20+","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em TypeScript"],"ru":["Требуется Angular v20+","Ограничен для приложений на основе TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب Angular v20+","محدود للتطبيقات المبنية على TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('les269/list-project-angular/angular-di', 'community', 'les269', 'list-project-angular', 'les269/list-project-angular', 'angular-di', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:01:12.179Z', NULL, '{"id":"les269/list-project-angular/angular-di","name":"angular-di","description":{"zh":"Angular 依赖注入（DI）使得组件间的依赖关系更加清晰和易于管理","ja":"Angular ディペンデンシー インジェクション（DI）により、コンポーネント間の依存関係が明確かつ管理しやすくなります","ko":"Angular 의존성 주입(DI)은 컴포넌트 간의 의존 관계를 명확하고 관리하기 쉽게 만듭니다","es":"Configura y utiliza la inyección de dependencias en Angular v20+ con inject() y proveedores para crear un sistema de lista personalizado","fr":"Configurez et utilisez l''injection de dépendances dans Angular v20+ avec inject() et fournisseurs pour créer un système de liste personnalisé","de":"Konfigurieren und verwenden Sie die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular v20+ mit inject() und Anbietern, um ein benutzerdefiniertes Listensystem zu erstellen","pt":"Configure e use injeção de dependência no Angular com inject() e provedores. Aprenda a criar um sistema de lista personalizado","ru":"Настройте и используйте внедрение зависимостей в Angular с inject() и провайдерами. Узнайте, как создать систему списков на заказ","ar":"اضبط واستخدم إدخال التبعية في أنجولار مع inject() والمزودين. تعلم كيفية إنشاء نظام قائمة مخصص","en":"Creating a custom list system"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Angular 依赖注入（DI）指南","ja":"Angular ディペンデンシー インジェクション（DI）ガイド","ko":"Angular 의존성 주입(DI) 가이드","es":"Inyección de dependencias en Angular","fr":"Injection de dépendances dans Angular","de":"Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular","pt":"Injeção de Dependência Angular","ru":"Внедрение зависимостей в Angular","ar":"إدخال التبعية في أنجولار","en":"angular-di"},"description":{"zh":"Angular 依赖注入（DI）使得组件间的依赖关系更加清晰和易于管理","ja":"Angular ディペンデンシー インジェクション（DI）により、コンポーネント間の依存関係が明確かつ管理しやすくなります","ko":"Angular 의존성 주입(DI)은 컴포넌트 간의 의존 관계를 명확하고 관리하기 쉽게 만듭니다","es":"Configura y utiliza la inyección de dependencias en Angular v20+ con inject() y proveedores para crear un sistema de lista personalizado","fr":"Configurez et utilisez l''injection de dépendances dans Angular v20+ avec inject() et fournisseurs pour créer un système de liste personnalisé","de":"Konfigurieren und verwenden Sie die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular v20+ mit inject() und Anbietern, um ein benutzerdefiniertes Listensystem zu erstellen","pt":"Configure e use injeção de dependência no Angular com inject() e provedores. Aprenda a criar um sistema de lista personalizado","ru":"Настройте и используйте внедрение зависимостей в Angular с inject() и провайдерами. Узнайте, как создать систему списков на заказ","ar":"اضبط واستخدم إدخال التبعية في أنجولار مع inject() والمزودين. تعلم كيفية إنشاء نظام قائمة مخصص","en":"Creating a custom list system"},"definition":{"en":"Creating a custom list system"},"features":{"zh":["使用 inject() 进行依赖注入","配置和使用提供者","在 Angular v20+ 中使用依赖注入","简化组件间的依赖关系","提高代码的可维护性和可扩展性"],"ja":["inject() を使用した依存関係の注入","プロバイダーの構成と使用","Angular v20+ での依存関係の注入","コンポーネント間の依存関係の簡素化","コードの保守性と拡張性の向上"],"ko":["inject()를 사용한 의존성 주입","제공자의 구성 및 사용","Angular v20+에서 의존성 주입","컴포넌트 간의 의존 관계 단순화","코드의 유지 보수성 및 확장성 향상"],"es":["Configuración de la inyección de dependencias con inject()","Uso de proveedores para gestionar dependencias","Creación de un sistema de lista personalizado","Compatibilidad con Angular v20+","Mejora de la modularidad y reutilización de código"],"fr":["Configuration de l''injection de dépendances avec inject()","Utilisation de fournisseurs pour gérer les dépendances","Création d''un système de liste personnalisé","Compatibilité avec Angular v20+","Amélioration de la modularité et de la réutilisation de code"],"de":["Konfiguration der Abhängigkeitsinjektion mit inject()","Verwendung von Anbietern zur Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","Erstellung eines benutzerdefinierten Listensystems","Kompatibilität mit Angular v20+","Verbesserung der Modularität und Wiederverwendbarkeit von Code"],"pt":["Injeção de dependência com inject()","Provedores de serviços","Criação de sistema de lista personalizado","Suporte ao Angular v20+"],"ru":["Внедрение зависимостей с inject()","Провайдеры сервисов","Создание системы списков на заказ","Поддержка Angular v20+"],"ar":["إدخال التبعية مع inject()","مزودي الخدمات","إنشاء نظام قائمة مخصص","دعم أنجولار v20+"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 依赖注入","DI","inject()","提供者","Angular v20+","组件间的依赖关系","软件设计模式","依赖注入模式"],"ja":["Angular ディペンデンシー インジェクション","DI","inject()","プロバイダー","Angular v20+","コンポーネント間の依存関係","ソフトウェア設計パターン","依存関係の注入パターン"],"ko":["Angular 의존성 주입","DI","inject()","제공자","Angular v20+","컴포넌트 간의 의존 관계","소프트웨어 디자인 패턴","의존성 주입 패턴"],"es":["inyección de dependencias","Angular","inject()","proveedores","sistema de lista personalizado","modularidad","reutilización de código"],"fr":["injection de dépendances","Angular","inject()","fournisseurs","système de liste personnalisé","modularité","réutilisation de code"],"de":["Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Angular","inject()","Anbieter","benutzerdefiniertes Listensystem","Modularität","Wiederverwendbarkeit von Code"],"pt":["angular","injeção de dependência","inject()","provedores","sistema de lista","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["angular","внедрение зависимостей","inject()","провайдеры","система списков","веб-разработка"],"ar":["أنجولار","إدخال التبعية","inject()","المزودون","نظام القائمة","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"les269","repo":"list-project-angular","repoPath":"les269/list-project-angular","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-di","description":"Implement dependency injection in Angular v20+ using inject(), injection tokens, and provider configuration. Use for service architecture, providing dependencies at different levels, creating injectable tokens, and managing singleton vs scoped services. Triggers on service creation, configuring providers, using injection tokens, or understanding DI hierarchy.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(H","body":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  private userService = inject(User);\n  \n  // Can use immediately\n  users = this.userService.getUsers();\n}\n```\n\n### Injectable Services\n\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable, inject, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\n\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'', // Singleton at root level\n})\nexport class User {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  \n  private users = signal<User[]>([]);\n  readonly users$ = this.users.asReadonly();\n  \n  async loadUsers() {\n    const users = await firstValueFrom(\n      this.http.get<User[]>(''/api/users'')\n    );\n    this.users.set(users);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Scopes\n\n### Root Level (Singleton)\n\n```typescript\n// Recommended: providedIn\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n})\nexport class Auth {}\n\n// Alternative: in app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Auth,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Component Level (Instance per Component)\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-editor'',\n  providers: [EditorState], // New instance for each component\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class Editor {\n  private editorState = inject(EditorState);\n}\n```\n\n### Route Level\n\n```typescript\nexport const routes: Routes = [\n  {\n    path: ''admin'',\n    providers: [Admin], // Shared within this route tree\n    children: [\n      { path: '''', component: AdminDashboard },\n      { path: ''users'', component: AdminUsers },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n```\n\n## Injection Tokens\n\n### Creating Tokens\n\n```typescript\nimport { InjectionToken } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Simple value token\nexport const API_URL = new InjectionToken<string>(''API_URL'');\n\n// Object token\nexport interface AppConfig {\n  apiUrl: string;\n  features: {\n    darkMode: boolean;\n    analytics: boolean;\n  };\n}\n\nexport const APP_CONFIG = new InjectionToken<AppConfig>(''APP_CONFIG'');\n\n// Token with factory (self-providing)\nexport const WINDOW = new InjectionToken<Window>(''Window'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => window,\n});\n\nexport const LOCAL_STORAGE = new InjectionToken<Storage>(''LocalStorage'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => localStorage,\n});\n```\n\n### Providing Token Values\n\n```typescript\n// app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    { provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' },\n    {\n      provide: APP_CONFIG,\n      useValue: {\n        apiUrl: ''https://api.example.com'',\n        features: { darkMode: true, analytics: true },\n      },\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Injecting Tokens\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Api {\n  private apiUrl = inject(API_URL);\n  private config = inject(APP_CONFIG);\n  private window = inject(WINDOW);\n  \n  getBaseUrl(): string {\n    return this.apiUrl;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Types\n\n### useClass\n\n```typescript\n// Provide implementation\n{ provide: Logger, useClass: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Conditional implementation\n{\n  provide: Logger,\n  useClass: environment.production\n    ? ProductionLogger\n    : ConsoleLogger,\n}\n```\n\n### useValue\n\n```typescript\n// Static values\n{ provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' }\n\n// Configuration objects\n{ provide: APP_CONFIG, useValue: { theme: ''dark'', language: ''en'' } }\n```\n\n### useFactory\n\n```typescript\n// Factory with dependencies\n{\n  provide: User,\n  useFactory: (http: HttpClient, config: AppConfig) => {\n    return new User(http, config.apiUrl);\n  },\n  deps: [HttpClient, APP_CONFIG],\n}\n\n// Async factory (not recommended - use provideAppInitializer)\n{\n  provide: CONFIG,\n  useFactory: () => fetch(''/config.json'').then(r => r.json()),\n}\n```\n\n### useExisting\n\n```typescript\n// Alias to existing provider\n{ provide: AbstractLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Multiple tokens pointing to same instance\nproviders: [\n  ConsoleLogger,\n  { provide: Logger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n  { provide: ErrorLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n]\n```\n\n## Injection Options\n\n### Optional Injection\n\n```typescript\n@Component({...})\nexport class My {\n  // Returns null if not provided\n  private analytics = inject(Analytics, { optional: true });\n  \n  trackEvent(name: string) {\n    this.analytics?.track(name);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Self, SkipSelf, Host\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  providers: [Local],\n})\nexport class Parent {\n  // Only look in this component''s injector\n  private local = inject(Local, { self: true });\n}\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Child {\n  // Skip this component, look in parent\n  private parentService = inject(ParentSvc, { skipSelf: true });\n\n  // Only look up to host component\n  private hostService = inject(Host, { host: true });\n}\n```\n\n## Multi Providers\n\nCollect multiple values for same token:\n\n```typescript\n// Token for multiple validators\nexport const VALIDATORS = new InjectionToken<Validator[]>(''Validators'');\n\n// Provide multiple values\nproviders: [\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: RequiredValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: EmailValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: MinLengthValidator, multi: true },\n]\n\n// Inject as array\n@Injectable()\nexport class Validation {\n  private validators = inject(VALIDATORS); // Validator[]\n  \n  validate(value: string): ValidationError[] {\n    return this.validators\n      .map(v => v.validate(value))\n      .filter(Boolean);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### HTTP Interceptors (Multi Provider)\n\n```typescript\n// Interceptors use multi providers internally\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    provideHttpClient(\n      withInterceptors([\n        authInterceptor,\n        loggingInterceptor,\n        errorInterceptor,\n      ])\n    ),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## App Initializers\n\nRun async code before app starts using `provideAppInitializer`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { provideAppInitializer, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Config,\n    provideAppInitializer(() => {\n      const configService = inject(Config);\n      return configService.loadConfig();\n    }),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Multiple Initializers\n\n```typescript\nproviders: [\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const config = inject(Config);\n    return config.load();\n  }),\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const auth = inject(Auth);\n    return auth.checkSession();\n  }),\n]\n```\n\n## Environment Injector\n\nCreate injectors programmatically:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createEnvironmentInjector, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Plugin {\n  private parentInjector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  loadPlugin(providers: Provider[]): EnvironmentInjector {\n    return createEnvironmentInjector(providers, this.parentInjector);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## runInInjectionContext\n\nRun code with injection context:\n\n```typescript\nimport { runInInjectionContext, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Utility {\n  private injector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  executeWithDI<T>(fn: () => T): T {\n    return runInInjectionContext(this.injector, fn);\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nutilityService.executeWithDI(() => {\n  const http = inject(HttpClient);\n  // Use http...\n});\n```\n\nFor advanced patterns, see [references/di-patterns.md](references/di-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:01:12.179Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focusing on Angular development, leveraging dependency injection for modular and scalable applications.","zh":"适合专注于Angular开发的前端代理，利用依赖注入实现模块化和可扩展的应用程序。","ja":"Angular開発に焦点を当てたフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。依存性の注入を使用してモジュール化およびスケーラブルなアプリケーションを実現します。","ko":"Angular 개발에 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 의존성 주입을 사용하여 모듈화되고 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구현합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que se centran en el desarrollo de Angular, aprovechando la inyección de dependencias para aplicaciones modulares y escalables.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend qui se concentrent sur le développement Angular, en exploitant l''injection de dépendances pour des applications modulaires et évolutives.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Entwicklung von Angular konzentrieren, die die Abhängigkeitsinjektion für modulare und skalierbare Anwendungen nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que se concentram no desenvolvimento Angular, utilizando injeção de dependência para aplicações modulares e escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, ориентированных на разработку Angular, использующих внедрение зависимостей для модульных и масштабируемых приложений.","ar":"مثالية لوكيلات الواجهة الأمامية التي تركز على تطوير Angular، باستخدام الحقن التلقائي للتطبيقات المॉडULAR والقابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and utilize dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers, enhancing component modularity and reusability through libraries like `@angular/core` and `@angular/common/http`.","zh":"使代理能够在Angular v20+中使用`inject()`和提供者配置和利用依赖注入，通过`@angular/core`和`@angular/common/http`等库增强组件的模块化和可重用性。","ja":"エージェントがAngular v20+で`inject()`とプロバイダーを使用して依存性の注入を構成および利用できるようにし、`@angular/core`と`@angular/common/http`などのライブラリを使用してコンポーネントのモジュール化と再利用性を高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular v20+에서 `inject()`와 제공자를 사용하여 의존성 주입을 구성하고 활용할 수 있도록 하며, `@angular/core`와 `@angular/common/http`와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 컴포넌트의 모듈화와 재사용성을 향상합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar y utilizar la inyección de dependencias en Angular v20+ con `inject()` y proveedores, mejorando la modularidad y reutilización de componentes a través de bibliotecas como `@angular/core` y `@angular/common/http`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et d''utiliser l''injection de dépendances dans Angular v20+ avec `inject()` et les fournisseurs, améliorant la modularité et la réutilisation des composants via des bibliothèques comme `@angular/core` et `@angular/common/http`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular v20+ mit `inject()` und Anbietern zu konfigurieren und zu nutzen, wodurch die Modularität und Wiederverwendbarkeit von Komponenten durch Bibliotheken wie `@angular/core` und `@angular/common/http` verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e utilizar injeção de dependência no Angular v20+ com `inject()` e provedores, melhorando a modularidade e reutilização de componentes por meio de bibliotecas como `@angular/core` e `@angular/common/http`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конфигурировать и использовать внедрение зависимостей в Angular v20+ с помощью `inject()` и провайдеров, повышая модульность и повторное использование компонентов через библиотеки типа `@angular/core` и `@angular/common/http`.","ar":"تمكن الوكالات من تكوين واستخدام الحقن التلقائي في Angular v20+ مع `inject()` وموفري الخدمات، مما يعزز مرونة العناصر القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام من خلال مكتبات مثل `@angular/core` و `@angular/common/http`."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom list systems with dynamic data fetching using `HttpClient`","Optimizing component dependencies with `inject()` for improved performance","Creating modular and reusable Angular components with dependency injection"],"zh":["使用`HttpClient`实现自定义列表系统，实现动态数据获取","使用`inject()`优化组件依赖，提高性能","使用依赖注入创建模块化和可重用的Angular组件"],"ja":["カスタムリストシステムを`HttpClient`で実装して、動的データ取得を実現する","`inject()`を使用してコンポーネントの依存関係を最適化し、パフォーマンスを向上させる","依存性の注入を使用してモジュール化および再利用可能なAngularコンポーネントを作成する"],"ko":["`HttpClient`를 사용하여 사용자 지정 목록 시스템을 구현하고 동적 데이터 가져오기를 구현합니다.","`inject()`를 사용하여 컴포넌트 종속성을 최적화하고 성능을 향상합니다.","의존성 주입을 사용하여 모듈화되고 재사용 가능한 Angular 컴포넌트를 생성합니다."],"es":["Implementar sistemas de lista personalizados con recuperación de datos dinámicos utilizando `HttpClient`","Optimizar las dependencias de los componentes con `inject()` para mejorar el rendimiento","Crear componentes de Angular modulares y reutilizables con inyección de dependencias"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des systèmes de liste personnalisés avec une récupération de données dynamique à l''aide de `HttpClient`","Optimiser les dépendances des composants avec `inject()` pour améliorer les performances","Créer des composants Angular modulaires et réutilisables avec l''injection de dépendances"],"de":["Implementieren von benutzerdefinierten Listen-Systemen mit dynamischer Datenabfrage mithilfe von `HttpClient`","Optimieren von Komponentenabhängigkeiten mit `inject()` für eine verbesserte Leistung","Erstellen von modularen und wiederverwendbaren Angular-Komponenten mit Abhängigkeitsinjektion"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de lista personalizados com recuperação de dados dinâmicos usando `HttpClient`","Otimização das dependências de componentes com `inject()` para melhorar o desempenho","Criação de componentes Angular modulares e reutilizáveis com injeção de dependência"],"ru":["Реализация пользовательских систем списков с динамической загрузкой данных с помощью `HttpClient`","Оптимизация зависимостей компонентов с помощью `inject()` для улучшения производительности","Создание модульных и повторно используемых компонентов Angular с помощью внедрения зависимостей"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة قائمة مخصصة مع استرجاع بيانات ديناميكي باستخدام `HttpClient`","تحسين التبعيات المكونات باستخدام `inject()` لتحسين الأداء","إنشاء مكونات Angular القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والحديثة باستخدام الحقن التلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular v20+","Dependent on `@angular/core` and `@angular/common/http` libraries"],"zh":["需要Angular v20+","依赖于`@angular/core`和`@angular/common/http`库"],"ja":["Angular v20+が必要","`@angular/core`と`@angular/common/http`ライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["Angular v20+가 필요합니다.","`@angular/core`와 `@angular/common/http` 라이브러리에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere Angular v20+","Dependiente de las bibliotecas `@angular/core` y `@angular/common/http`"],"fr":["Nécessite Angular v20+","Dépend des bibliothèques `@angular/core` et `@angular/common/http`"],"de":["Benötigt Angular v20+","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken `@angular/core` und `@angular/common/http`"],"pt":["Exige Angular v20+","Depende das bibliotecas `@angular/core` e `@angular/common/http`"],"ru":["Требует Angular v20+","Зависит от библиотек `@angular/core` и `@angular/common/http`"],"ar":["يتطلب Angular v20+","يعتمد على المكتبات `@angular/core` و `@angular/common/http`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
