ailed reporting","enterprise-grade architecture","distributed swarm intelligence","RAG integration"],"ja":["complex analysis","thorough research","detailed reporting","enterprise-grade architecture","distributed swarm intelligence","RAG integration"],"ko":["complex analysis","thorough research","detailed reporting","enterprise-grade architecture","distributed swarm intelligence","RAG integration"],"es":["Análisis en profundidad de código y documentación","Investigación exhaustiva a través de múltiples fuentes","Generación de informes detallados y documentación","Arquitectura de empresa de nivel","Inteligencia de enjambre distribuida"],"fr":["Analyse approfondie de code et de documentation","Recherche exhaustive à travers plusieurs sources","Génération de rapports détaillés et de documentation","Architecture d''entreprise de niveau","Intelligence de swarm distribuée"],"de":["Tiefgehende Analyse von Code und Dokumentation","Umfassende Recherche über mehrere Quellen hinweg","Erstellung detaillierter Berichte und Dokumentation","Unternehmensarchitektur von höchstem Niveau","Verteilte Schwarmintelligenz"],"pt":["Arquitetura de nível empresarial","Inteligência de swarm distribuída","Integração com RAG","Suporte nativo ao código Claude via protocolo MCP","Análise complexa","Pesquisa aprofundada"],"ru":["Предприятие-уровень архитектуры","Распределенная swarm-интеллект","Интеграция с RAG","Родная поддержка кода Claude через протокол MCP","Сложный анализ","Глубокое исследование"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية من المستوى المؤسسي","ذكاء السرب الموزع","التكامل مع RAG","دعم أصلي للكود Claude من خلال بروتوكول MCP","التحليل المعقد","البحث الشامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["agent-test-long-runner","agent orchestration platform","conversational AI systems","autonomous workflows","distributed swarm intelligence","RAG integration","Claude Code","MCP protocol"],"ja":["agent-test-long-runner","agent orchestration platform","conversational AI systems","autonomous workflows","distributed swarm intelligence","RAG integration","Claude Code","MCP protocol"],"ko":["agent-test-long-runner","agent orchestration platform","conversational AI systems","autonomous workflows","distributed swarm intelligence","RAG integration","Claude Code","MCP protocol"],"es":["agente de pruebas de ejecución prolongada","análisis en profundidad","investigación exhaustiva","generación de informes","arquitectura de empresa","inteligencia de enjambre","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","automatización de pruebas"],"fr":["agent de test à exécution longue","analyse approfondie","recherche exhaustive","génération de rapports","architecture d''entreprise","intelligence de swarm","développement de logiciel","tests de logiciel","automatisation de tests"],"de":["Langzeit-Testagent","tiefgehende Analyse","umfassende Recherche","Erstellung von Berichten","Unternehmensarchitektur","verteilte Schwarmintelligenz","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests","Testautomatisierung"],"pt":["agente de teste de longa duração","desenvolvimento de software","IA conversacional","swarms de agentes inteligentes","orquestração de agentes","análise complexa","pesquisa aprofundada","desenvolvimento de sistemas de IA"],"ru":["агент долгосрочного тестирования","разработка программного обеспечения","разговорный ИИ","рои интеллектуальных агентов","оркестровка агентов","сложный анализ","глубокое исследование","разработка систем ИИ"],"ar":["وكيل اختبار التشغيل الطويل","تطوير البرمجيات","ذكاء اصطناعي محادثاتي","مجموعات من وكلاء ذكيين","تنسيق الوكلاء","التحليل المعقد","البحث الشامل","تطوير أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-test-long-runner","description":"Agent skill for test-long-runner - invoke with $agent-test-long-runner","bodyPreview":"---\nname: test-long-runner\ndescription: Test agent that can run for 30+ minutes on complex tasks\ncategory: custom\n---\n\n# Test Long-Running Agent\n\nYou are a specialized test agent designed to handle long-running tasks that may take 30 minutes or more to complete.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- **Complex Analysis**: Deep dive into codebases, documentation, and systems\n- **Thorough Research**: Comprehensive research across multiple sources\n- **Detailed Reporting**: Generate extensive reports and documentation","body":"---\nname: test-long-runner\ndescription: Test agent that can run for 30+ minutes on complex tasks\ncategory: custom\n---\n\n# Test Long-Running Agent\n\nYou are a specialized test agent designed to handle long-running tasks that may take 30 minutes or more to complete.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- **Complex Analysis**: Deep dive into codebases, documentation, and systems\n- **Thorough Research**: Comprehensive research across multiple sources\n- **Detailed Reporting**: Generate extensive reports and documentation\n- **Long-Form Content**: Create comprehensive guides, tutorials, and documentation\n- **System Design**: Design complex distributed systems and architectures\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Take Your Time**: Don''t rush - quality over speed\n2. **Be Thorough**: Cover all aspects of the task comprehensively\n3. **Document Everything**: Provide detailed explanations and reasoning\n4. **Iterate**: Continuously improve and refine your work\n5. **Communicate Progress**: Keep the user informed of your progress\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide detailed, well-structured responses with:\n- Clear section headers\n- Code examples where applicable\n- Diagrams and visualizations (in text format)\n- References and citations\n- Action items and next steps\n\n## Example Use Cases\n\n- Comprehensive codebase analysis and refactoring plans\n- Detailed system architecture design documents\n- In-depth research reports on complex topics\n- Complete implementation guides for complex features\n- Thorough security audits and vulnerability assessments\n\nRemember: You have plenty of time to do thorough, high-quality work!\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:01:00.120Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code Agents requiring prolonged task execution and comprehensive analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要长时间任务执行和全面分析能力的 Claude Code Agents。","ja":"クロードコードエージェントが長時間のタスク実行と包括的な分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"클로드 코드 에이전트가 긴 시간의 작업 실행과 포괄적인 분석 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Claude Code que requieren una ejecución de tareas prolongada y capacidades de análisis comprehensivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Claude Code nécessitant une exécution de tâches prolongée et des capacités d''analyse complète.","de":"Perfekt für Claude-Code-Agents, die eine langfristige Aufgabenausführung und umfassende Analysefähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Código Claude que exigem execução de tarefa prolongada e capacidades de análise abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Claude Code, требующих длительного выполнения задач и всесторонних возможностей анализа.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كلود كود الذين يتطلبون تنفيذاً طويلاً لل任务 وقدرات تحليل شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform complex analysis, thorough research, and generate detailed reports, leveraging distributed swarm intelligence and native Claude Code support via MCP.","zh":"赋予代理执行复杂分析、彻底研究和生成详细报告的能力，利用分布式集群智能和原生克劳德代码支持通过MCP。","ja":"複雑な分析、徹底的なリサーチ、詳細なレポートの生成を行う機能をエージェントに提供し、分散型スウォームインテリジェンスとネイティブのクロードコードサポートをMCP経由で利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 분석,彻底한 연구 및 자세한 보고서 생성을 수행하도록 하는 기능을 제공하며, 분산형 스ウォーム 인텔리전스 및 네이티브 클라우드 코드 지원을 MCP를 통해 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar análisis complejos, investigaciones exhaustivas y generar informes detallados, aprovechando la inteligencia de enjambre distribuida y el soporte nativo de Claude Code a través de MCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des analyses complexes, des recherches approfondies et de générer des rapports détaillés, en exploitant l''intelligence de swarm distribuée et le support natif de Claude Code via MCP.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, komplexe Analysen durchzuführen, gründliche Recherchen und detaillierte Berichte zu erstellen, indem sie die verteilte Schwarmintelligenz und die native Claude-Code-Unterstützung über MCP nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análises complexas, pesquisas aprofundadas e gerar relatórios detalhados, aproveitando a inteligência de enxame distribuída e o suporte nativo ao Claude Code via MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить сложный анализ, углубленное исследование и генерировать подробные отчеты, используя распределенный рой интеллекта и родную поддержку Claude Code через MCP.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إجراء تحليلات معقدة وأبحاث متعمقة وتوليد تقارير مفصلة، مستفيداً من ذكاء الحشد الموزع والدعم الأصلي لكلود كود عبر MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing lengthy data processing tasks","Conducting in-depth research across multiple sources","Generating extensive documentation for complex systems"],"zh":["执行长时间的数据处理任务","进行多个来源的深入研究","为复杂系统生成大量文档"],"ja":["長時間のデータ処理タスクの実行","複数の情報源に対する詳細な調査","複雑なシステムの包括的な文書化"],"ko":["긴 시간의 데이터 처리 작업 실행","複数의 정보源에 대한 심층적인 연구","복잡한 시스템에 대한大量의 문서 생성"],"es":["Ejecutar tareas de procesamiento de datos prolongadas","Realizar investigaciones en profundidad en varias fuentes","Generar documentación extensa para sistemas complejos"],"fr":["Exécuter des tâches de traitement de données prolongées","Effectuer des recherches approfondies sur plusieurs sources","Générer une documentation extensive pour des systèmes complexes"],"de":["Ausführen langer Datenverarbeitungsaufgaben","Durchführen gründlicher Recherchen über mehrere Quellen","Erstellen umfassender Dokumentationen für komplexe Systeme"],"pt":["Executar tarefas de processamento de dados longas","Realizar pesquisas aprofundadas em várias fontes","Gerar documentação extensiva para sistemas complexos"],"ru":["Выполнение длительных задач обработки данных","Проведение углубленного исследования по нескольким источникам","Генерация обширной документации для сложных систем"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام معالجة البيانات الطويلة","إجراء بحث متعمق عبر عدة مصادر","توليد توثيق موسع لأنظمة معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","Task execution limited to 30+ minutes"],"zh":["需要克劳德代码集成","任务执行时间限制在30分钟以上"],"ja":["クロードコードの統合が必要","タスクの実行時間が30分以上に制限される"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 통합이 필요","작업 실행 시간이 30분 이상으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","La ejecución de tareas está limitada a 30+ minutos"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","L''exécution de tâches est limitée à 30+ minutes"],"de":["Benötigt Claude-Code-Integration","Die Aufgabenausführung ist auf 30+ Minuten beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige integração com Claude Code","A execução da tarefa limitada a 30+ minutos"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Claude Code","Ограничение времени выполнения задачи 30+ минут"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج كلود كود","تحديد زمن تنفيذ المهمة ب 30+ دقيقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Yeyo-Dev/SUSIE/angular-di', 'community', 'Yeyo-Dev', 'SUSIE', 'Yeyo-Dev/SUSIE', 'angular-di', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:01:46.792Z', NULL, '{"id":"Yeyo-Dev/SUSIE/angular-di","name":"angular-di","description":{"zh":"Angular 依赖注入（DI）是一种管理依赖关系的机制，允许您在应用程序中解耦组件","ja":"Angular 依存性インジェクション（DI）は、依存関係を管理するメカニズムで、アプリケーション内のコンポーネントを解耦することを可能にします","ko":"Angular 의존성 주입(DI)은 종속 관계를 관리하는 메커니즘으로 응용 프로그램 내의 구성 요소를 분리하는 것을 가능하게 합니다","es":"La inyección de dependencias en Angular permite configurar y usar dependencias de manera eficiente. Aprende a utilizar inject() y proveedores en Angular v20+","fr":"L''injection de dépendances dans Angular permet de configurer et d''utiliser des dépendances de manière efficace. Découvrez comment utiliser inject() et les fournisseurs dans Angular v20+","de":"Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular ermöglicht es, Abhängigkeiten effizient zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie inject() und Provider in Angular v20+ verwenden können","pt":"A injeção de dependência é uma técnica fundamental em Angular que permite a separação de preocupações e a reutilização de código. Configure e use injeção de dependência em Angular v20+.","ru":"Внедрение зависимостей - это фундаментальная техника в Angular, которая позволяет разделить проблемы и повторно использовать код. Настройте и используйте внедрение зависимостей в Angular v20+.","ar":"حقن الإعتماد هو تقنية أساسية في أنجولار التي تسمح بفصل المشاكل وإعادة استخدام الكود. configure وحقن الإعتماد في أنجولار v20+.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Angular 依赖注入（DI）","ja":"Angular 依存性インジェクション（DI）","ko":"Angular 의존성 주입(DI)","es":"Inyección de Dependencias en Angular","fr":"Injection de Dépendances dans Angular","de":"Angular-Abhängigkeitsinjektion","pt":"Injeção de Dependência Angular","ru":"Внедрение Зависимостей в Angular","ar":"حقن الإعتماد في أنجولار","en":"angular-di"},"description":{"zh":"Angular 依赖注入（DI）是一种管理依赖关系的机制，允许您在应用程序中解耦组件","ja":"Angular 依存性インジェクション（DI）は、依存関係を管理するメカニズムで、アプリケーション内のコンポーネントを解耦することを可能にします","ko":"Angular 의존성 주입(DI)은 종속 관계를 관리하는 메커니즘으로 응용 프로그램 내의 구성 요소를 분리하는 것을 가능하게 합니다","es":"La inyección de dependencias en Angular permite configurar y usar dependencias de manera eficiente. Aprende a utilizar inject() y proveedores en Angular v20+","fr":"L''injection de dépendances dans Angular permet de configurer et d''utiliser des dépendances de manière efficace. Découvrez comment utiliser inject() et les fo...","de":"Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Angular ermöglicht es, Abhängigkeiten effizient zu konfigurieren und zu verwenden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie inject() und Provider ...","pt":"A injeção de dependência é uma técnica fundamental em Angular que permite a separação de preocupações e a reutilização de código. Configure e use injeção de ...","ru":"Внедрение зависимостей - это фундаментальная техника в Angular, которая позволяет разделить проблемы и повторно использовать код. Настройте и используйте вне...","ar":"حقن الإعتماد هو تقنية أساسية في أنجولار التي تسمح بفصل المشاكل وإعادة استخدام الكود. configure وحقن الإعتماد في أنجولار v20+.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用 inject() 实现依赖注入","配置和使用提供者","解耦组件和服务","提高应用程序的可维护性和可扩展性","支持 Angular v20+"],"ja":["inject() を使用して依存性インジェクションを実現する","提供者を構成して使用する","コンポーネントとサービスを解耦する","アプリケーションの保守性と拡張性を高める","Angular v20+ をサポートする"],"ko":["inject()를 사용하여 의존성 주입을 구현한다","제공자를 구성하고 사용한다","구성 요소와 서비스를 분리한다","응용 프로그램의 유지 보수성과 확장성을 높인다","Angular v20+를 지원한다"],"es":["Configuración de dependencias con inject()","Uso de proveedores para la inyección de dependencias","Compatibilidad con Angular v20+","Mejora de la eficiencia del desarrollo","Flexibilidad en la inyección de dependencias"],"fr":["Configuration des dépendances avec inject()","Utilisation des fournisseurs pour l''injection de dépendances","Compatibilité avec Angular v20+","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développement","Flexibilité dans l''injection de dépendances"],"de":["Konfiguration von Abhängigkeiten mit inject()","Verwendung von Providern für die Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Kompatibilität mit Angular v20+","Verbesserung der Effizienz der Entwicklung","Flexibilität bei der Abhängigkeitsinjektion"],"pt":["Configuração de injeção de dependência com inject()","Uso de providers para gerenciar dependências","Separação de preocupações com injeção de dependência","Reutilização de código com injeção de dependência","Suporte a Angular v20+"],"ru":["Настройка внедрения зависимостей с помощью inject()","Использование провайдеров для управления зависимостями","Разделение проблем с помощью внедрения зависимостей","Повторное использование кода с помощью внедрения зависимостей","Поддержка Angular v20+"],"ar":["تكوين حقن الإعتماد مع inject()","استخدام مقدمي الخدمات لإدارة الإعتماد","فصل المشاكل مع حقن الإعتماد","إعادة استخدام الكود مع حقن الإعتماد","دعم أنجولار v20+"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 依赖注入","DI","inject()","提供者","Angular v20+","依赖关系管理","组件解耦"],"ja":["Angular 依存性インジェクション","DI","inject()","提供者","Angular v20+","依存関係管理","コンポーネント解耦"],"ko":["Angular 의존성 주입","DI","inject()","제공자","Angular v20+","종속 관계 관리","구성 요소 분리"],"es":["inyección de dependencias","Angular","inject()","proveedores","desarrollo de software","patrones de diseño","eficiencia del desarrollo"],"fr":["injection de dépendances","Angular","inject()","fournisseurs","développement de logiciels","patrons de conception","efficacité du développement"],"de":["Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Angular","inject()","Provider","Software-Entwicklung","Entwurfsmuster","Entwicklungseffizienz"],"pt":["injeção de dependência","angular","inject()","providers","desenvolvimento de software","programação","tecnologia"],"ru":["внедрение зависимостей","angular","inject()","провайдеры","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","технологии"],"ar":["حقن الإعتماد","أنجولار","inject()","مقدمي الخدمات","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"Yeyo-Dev","repo":"SUSIE","repoPath":"Yeyo-Dev/SUSIE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-di","description":"Implement dependency injection in Angular v20+ using inject(), injection tokens, and provider configuration. Use for service architecture, providing dependencies at different levels, creating injectable tokens, and managing singleton vs scoped services. Triggers on service creation, configuring providers, using injection tokens, or understanding DI hierarchy.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(H","body":"# Angular Dependency Injection\n\nConfigure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers.\n\n## Basic Injection\n\n### Using inject()\n\nPrefer `inject()` over constructor injection:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\nimport { User } from ''./user.service'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-user-list'',\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class UserList {\n  // Inject dependencies\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  private userService = inject(User);\n  \n  // Can use immediately\n  users = this.userService.getUsers();\n}\n```\n\n### Injectable Services\n\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable, inject, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\n\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'', // Singleton at root level\n})\nexport class User {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  \n  private users = signal<User[]>([]);\n  readonly users$ = this.users.asReadonly();\n  \n  async loadUsers() {\n    const users = await firstValueFrom(\n      this.http.get<User[]>(''/api/users'')\n    );\n    this.users.set(users);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Scopes\n\n### Root Level (Singleton)\n\n```typescript\n// Recommended: providedIn\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n})\nexport class Auth {}\n\n// Alternative: in app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Auth,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Component Level (Instance per Component)\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-editor'',\n  providers: [EditorState], // New instance for each component\n  template: `...`,\n})\nexport class Editor {\n  private editorState = inject(EditorState);\n}\n```\n\n### Route Level\n\n```typescript\nexport const routes: Routes = [\n  {\n    path: ''admin'',\n    providers: [Admin], // Shared within this route tree\n    children: [\n      { path: '''', component: AdminDashboard },\n      { path: ''users'', component: AdminUsers },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n```\n\n## Injection Tokens\n\n### Creating Tokens\n\n```typescript\nimport { InjectionToken } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n// Simple value token\nexport const API_URL = new InjectionToken<string>(''API_URL'');\n\n// Object token\nexport interface AppConfig {\n  apiUrl: string;\n  features: {\n    darkMode: boolean;\n    analytics: boolean;\n  };\n}\n\nexport const APP_CONFIG = new InjectionToken<AppConfig>(''APP_CONFIG'');\n\n// Token with factory (self-providing)\nexport const WINDOW = new InjectionToken<Window>(''Window'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => window,\n});\n\nexport const LOCAL_STORAGE = new InjectionToken<Storage>(''LocalStorage'', {\n  providedIn: ''root'',\n  factory: () => localStorage,\n});\n```\n\n### Providing Token Values\n\n```typescript\n// app.config.ts\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    { provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' },\n    {\n      provide: APP_CONFIG,\n      useValue: {\n        apiUrl: ''https://api.example.com'',\n        features: { darkMode: true, analytics: true },\n      },\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Injecting Tokens\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Api {\n  private apiUrl = inject(API_URL);\n  private config = inject(APP_CONFIG);\n  private window = inject(WINDOW);\n  \n  getBaseUrl(): string {\n    return this.apiUrl;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Provider Types\n\n### useClass\n\n```typescript\n// Provide implementation\n{ provide: Logger, useClass: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Conditional implementation\n{\n  provide: Logger,\n  useClass: environment.production\n    ? ProductionLogger\n    : ConsoleLogger,\n}\n```\n\n### useValue\n\n```typescript\n// Static values\n{ provide: API_URL, useValue: ''https://api.example.com'' }\n\n// Configuration objects\n{ provide: APP_CONFIG, useValue: { theme: ''dark'', language: ''en'' } }\n```\n\n### useFactory\n\n```typescript\n// Factory with dependencies\n{\n  provide: User,\n  useFactory: (http: HttpClient, config: AppConfig) => {\n    return new User(http, config.apiUrl);\n  },\n  deps: [HttpClient, APP_CONFIG],\n}\n\n// Async factory (not recommended - use provideAppInitializer)\n{\n  provide: CONFIG,\n  useFactory: () => fetch(''/config.json'').then(r => r.json()),\n}\n```\n\n### useExisting\n\n```typescript\n// Alias to existing provider\n{ provide: AbstractLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger }\n\n// Multiple tokens pointing to same instance\nproviders: [\n  ConsoleLogger,\n  { provide: Logger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n  { provide: ErrorLogger, useExisting: ConsoleLogger },\n]\n```\n\n## Injection Options\n\n### Optional Injection\n\n```typescript\n@Component({...})\nexport class My {\n  // Returns null if not provided\n  private analytics = inject(Analytics, { optional: true });\n  \n  trackEvent(name: string) {\n    this.analytics?.track(name);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Self, SkipSelf, Host\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  providers: [Local],\n})\nexport class Parent {\n  // Only look in this component''s injector\n  private local = inject(Local, { self: true });\n}\n\n@Component({...})\nexport class Child {\n  // Skip this component, look in parent\n  private parentService = inject(ParentSvc, { skipSelf: true });\n\n  // Only look up to host component\n  private hostService = inject(Host, { host: true });\n}\n```\n\n## Multi Providers\n\nCollect multiple values for same token:\n\n```typescript\n// Token for multiple validators\nexport const VALIDATORS = new InjectionToken<Validator[]>(''Validators'');\n\n// Provide multiple values\nproviders: [\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: RequiredValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: EmailValidator, multi: true },\n  { provide: VALIDATORS, useClass: MinLengthValidator, multi: true },\n]\n\n// Inject as array\n@Injectable()\nexport class Validation {\n  private validators = inject(VALIDATORS); // Validator[]\n  \n  validate(value: string): ValidationError[] {\n    return this.validators\n      .map(v => v.validate(value))\n      .filter(Boolean);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### HTTP Interceptors (Multi Provider)\n\n```typescript\n// Interceptors use multi providers internally\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    provideHttpClient(\n      withInterceptors([\n        authInterceptor,\n        loggingInterceptor,\n        errorInterceptor,\n      ])\n    ),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## App Initializers\n\nRun async code before app starts using `provideAppInitializer`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { provideAppInitializer, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\nexport const appConfig: ApplicationConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    Config,\n    provideAppInitializer(() => {\n      const configService = inject(Config);\n      return configService.loadConfig();\n    }),\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Multiple Initializers\n\n```typescript\nproviders: [\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const config = inject(Config);\n    return config.load();\n  }),\n  provideAppInitializer(() => {\n    const auth = inject(Auth);\n    return auth.checkSession();\n  }),\n]\n```\n\n## Environment Injector\n\nCreate injectors programmatically:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createEnvironmentInjector, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Plugin {\n  private parentInjector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  loadPlugin(providers: Provider[]): EnvironmentInjector {\n    return createEnvironmentInjector(providers, this.parentInjector);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## runInInjectionContext\n\nRun code with injection context:\n\n```typescript\nimport { runInInjectionContext, EnvironmentInjector, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class Utility {\n  private injector = inject(EnvironmentInjector);\n  \n  executeWithDI<T>(fn: () => T): T {\n    return runInInjectionContext(this.injector, fn);\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nutilityService.executeWithDI(() => {\n  const http = inject(HttpClient);\n  // Use http...\n});\n```\n\nFor advanced patterns, see [references/di-patterns.md](references/di-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:01:46.792Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced dependency management in Angular applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在Angular应用程序中高级依赖管理的前端代理。","ja":"Angularアプリケーションで高度な依存関係管理が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular 애플리케이션에서 고급 의존성 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que necesitan una gestión avanzada de dependencias en aplicaciones Angular.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée des dépendances dans les applications Angular.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die ein erweitertes Abhängigkeitsmanagement in Angular-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento avançado de dependências em aplicações Angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется продвинутый менеджмент зависимостей в приложениях Angular.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة متقدمة للالتزامات في التطبيقات الإنجليزية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and utilize dependency injection in Angular v20+ with `inject()` and providers, streamlining component dependencies and enhancing code maintainability through libraries like `@angular/core` and `@angular/common/http`.","zh":"赋予代理配置和利用Angular v20+中的依赖注入的能力，使用`inject()`和提供者，简化组件依赖，并通过诸如`@angular/core`和`@angular/common/http`的库提高代码的可维护性。","ja":"Angular v20+の依存性注入を`inject()`とプロバイダーを使用して構成および使用するエージェントを可能にし、コンポーネントの依存性を簡素化し、`@angular/core`や`@angular/common/http`などのライブラリを通じてコードの保守性を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 `inject()`와 공급자 사용하여 Angular v20+의 의존성 주입을 구성하고 사용할 수 있도록 하여 컴포넌트 종속성을 단순화하고 `@angular/core` 및 `@angular/common/http`와 같은 라이브러리를 통해 코드 유지 보수성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar y utilizar la inyección de dependencias en Angular v20+ con `inject()` y proveedores, optimizando las dependencias de los componentes y mejorando la mantenibilidad del código mediante bibliotecas como `@angular/core` y `@angular/common/http`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et d''utiliser l''injection de dépendances dans Angular v20+ avec `inject()` et les fournisseurs, rationalisant les dépendances des composants et améliorant la maintenabilité du code grâce à des bibliothèques comme `@angular/core` et `@angular/common/http`.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die Konfiguration und Nutzung der Dependency Injection in Angular v20+ mit `inject()` und Providern, optimiert die Abhängigkeiten von Komponenten und verbessert die Wartbarkeit des Codes durch Bibliotheken wie `@angular/core` und `@angular/common/http`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e utilizar injeção de dependência no Angular v20+ com `inject()` e provedores, simplificando as dependências de componentes e melhorando a manutenibilidade do código por meio de bibliotecas como `@angular/core` e `@angular/common/http`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать и использовать внедрение зависимостей в Angular v20+ с помощью `inject()` и провайдеров, упрощая зависимости компонентов и улучшая поддерживаемость кода с помощью библиотек như `@angular/core` и `@angular/common/http`.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تكوين واستخدام الحقن التبعي في Angular v20+ باستخدام `inject()` والمهندسين ، مما يبسط التبعيات المكون وتحسين صيانة الشفرة من خلال المكتبات مثل `@angular/core` و `@angular/common/http`."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring providers for HTTP clients","Injecting services into components using `inject()`","Managing dependencies between components and services"],"zh":["为HTTP客户端配置提供者","使用`inject()`将服务注入组件","管理组件和服务之间的依赖关系"],"ja":["HTTPクライアントのプロバイダーを構成する","`inject()`を使用してサービスをコンポーネントに注入する","コンポーネントとサービス間の依存関係を管理する"],"ko":["HTTP 클라이언트를 위한 공급자 구성","`inject()` 사용하여 서비스를 컴포넌트에 주입","컴포넌트와 서비스 사이의 의존 관계 관리"],"es":["Configurar proveedores para clientes HTTP","Inyectar servicios en componentes usando `inject()`","Gestionar dependencias entre componentes y servicios"],"fr":["Configurer des fournisseurs pour les clients HTTP","Injecter des services dans des composants en utilisant `inject()`","Gérer les dépendances entre les composants et les services"],"de":["Konfigurieren von Providern für HTTP-Clients","Injectieren von Services in Komponenten mit `inject()`","Verwalten von Abhängigkeiten zwischen Komponenten und Services"],"pt":["Configurando provedores para clientes HTTP","Injetando serviços em componentes usando `inject()`","Gerenciando dependências entre componentes e serviços"],"ru":["Настройка провайдеров для HTTP-клиентов","Внедрение сервисов в компоненты с помощью `inject()`","Управление зависимостями между компонентами и сервисами"],"ar":["تكوين الموردين لعملاء HTTP","الحقن الخدمات في المكونات باستخدام `inject()`","إدارة التبعيات بين المكونات والخدمات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular v20+","Limited to TypeScript-based projects"],"zh":["需要Angular v20+","仅限于TypeScript 기반项目"],"ja":["Angular v20+が必要","TypeScriptベースのプロジェクトのみ"],"ko":["Angular v20+ 필요","TypeScript 기반 프로젝트만 해당"],"es":["Requiere Angular v20+","Limitado a proyectos basados en TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite Angular v20+","Limité aux projets basés sur TypeScript"],"de":["Erfordert Angular v20+","Beschränkt auf TypeScript-basierte Projekte"],"pt":["Requer Angular v20+","Limitado a projetos baseados em TypeScript"],"ru":["Требуется Angular v20+","Ограничен проектами на основе TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب Angular v20+","محدود بمشاريع قائمة على TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nakafaai/nakafa.com/ai-sdk', 'community', 'nakafaai', 'nakafa.com', 'nakafaai/nakafa.com', 'ai-sdk', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:01:56.351Z', NULL, '{"id":"nakafaai/nakafa.com/ai-sdk","name":"ai-sdk","description":{"zh":"AI SDK是一个免费的高质量学习平台，支持K-12到大学教育，提供灵活的AI解决方案","ja":"AI SDKは無料の高品質学習プラットフォームで、K-12から大学教育をサポートし、柔軟なAIソリューションを提供します","ko":"AI SDK는 무료의 고품질 학습 플랫폼으로, K-12부터 대학 교육을 지원하며, 유연한 AI 솔루션을 제공합니다","es":"La plataforma AI SDK ofrece aprendizaje nativo de IA de alta calidad para estudiantes de K-12 a universidad.","fr":"La plateforme AI SDK propose un apprentissage natif IA de haute qualité pour les étudiants de K-12 à université.","de":"Die AI-SDK-Plattform bietet native AI-Lerninhalte in hoher Qualität für Schüler von K-12 bis Universität.","pt":"A plataforma ai-sdk é uma solução de aprendizado de IA nativa de alta qualidade para educação K-12 a universitário.","ru":"Платформа ai-sdk - это родная платформа обучения ИИ высокого качества для образования от К-12 до университета.","ar":"منصة ai-sdk هي منصة تعلم الذكاء الاصطناعي الأصلية ذات الجودة العالية للتعليم من المرحلة الابتدائية إلى الجامعية.","en":"AI Native Free High-Quality Learning Platform (K-12 to University)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI SDK开发者平台","ja":"AI SDK開発者プラットフォーム","ko":"AI SDK 개발자 플랫폼","es":"AI SDK: Plataforma de aprendizaje nativa de IA","fr":"AI SDK: Plateforme d''apprentissage native IA","de":"AI SDK: Native AI-Lernplattform","pt":"Desenvolva com ai-sdk: Plataforma de Aprendizado de IA","ru":"Разработка с ai-sdk: Платформа обучения ИИ","ar":"تطوير مع ai-sdk: منصة تعلم الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"ai-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"AI SDK是一个免费的高质量学习平台，支持K-12到大学教育，提供灵活的AI解决方案","ja":"AI SDKは無料の高品質学習プラットフォームで、K-12から大学教育をサポートし、柔軟なAIソリューションを提供します","ko":"AI SDK는 무료의 고품질 학습 플랫폼으로, K-12부터 대학 교육을 지원하며, 유연한 AI 솔루션을 제공합니다","es":"La plataforma AI SDK ofrece aprendizaje nativo de IA de alta calidad para estudiantes de K-12 a universidad.","fr":"La plateforme AI SDK propose un apprentissage natif IA de haute qualité pour les étudiants de K-12 à université.","de":"Die AI-SDK-Plattform bietet native AI-Lerninhalte in hoher Qualität für Schüler von K-12 bis Universität.","pt":"A plataforma ai-sdk é uma solução de aprendizado de IA nativa de alta qualidade para educação K-12 a universitário.","ru":"Платформа ai-sdk - это родная платформа обучения ИИ высокого качества для образования от К-12 до университета.","ar":"منصة ai-sdk هي منصة تعلم الذكاء الاصطناعي الأصلية ذات الجودة العالية للتعليم من المرحلة الابتدائية إلى الجامعية.","en":"AI Native Free High-Quality Learning Platform (K-12 to University)"},"definition":{"en":"AI Native Free High-Quality Learning Platform (K-12 to University)"},"features":{"zh":["免费的高质量学习平台","支持K-12到大学教育","提供灵活的AI解决方案","使用node_modules/ai/docs/进行文档查找","支持pnpm add ai包管理","可安装provider包和client包"],"ja":["無料の高品質学習プラットフォーム","K-12から大学教育をサポート","柔軟なAIソリューションを提供","node_modules/ai/docs/を使用してドキュメントを検索","pnpm add aiパッケージ管理をサポート","プロバイダパッケージとクライアントパッケージをインストール可能"],"ko":["무료의 고품질 학습 플랫폼","K-12부터 대학 교육을 지원","유연한 AI 솔루션을 제공","node_modules/ai/docs/를 사용하여 문서를 검색","pnpm add ai 패키지 관리를 지원","제공자 패키지와 클라이언트 패키지를 설치 가능"],"es":["Aprendizaje nativo de IA","Plataforma de alta calidad","Para estudiantes de K-12 a universidad","Instalación sencilla con package manager","Compatibilidad con proveedores y clientes de AI"],"fr":["Apprentissage natif IA","Plateforme de haute qualité","Pour les étudiants de K-12 à université","Installation simple avec package manager","Compatibilité avec les fournisseurs et les clients IA"],"de":["Native AI-Lerninhalte","Plattform in hoher Qualität","Für Schüler von K-12 bis Universität","Einfache Installation mit Package-Manager","Kompatibilität mit AI-Anbietern und -Client"],"pt":["Plataforma de aprendizado de IA nativa","Suporte para educação K-12 a universitário","Instalação simples com package manager","Integração com provedores de IA","Componentes reutilizáveis para interfaces de usuário"],"ru":["Родная платформа обучения ИИ","Поддержка образования от К-12 до университета","Простая установка с помощью менеджера пакетов","Интеграция с провайдерами ИИ","Переиспользуемые компоненты для интерфейсов пользователя"],"ar":["منصة تعلم الذكاء الاصطناعي الأصلية","دعم التعليم من المرحلة الابتدائية إلى الجامعية","تثبيت بسيط مع مدير الحزم","التكامل مع مزودي الذكاء الاصطناعي","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام للواجهات المستخدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI SDK","免费学习平台","K-12教育","大学教育","AI解决方案","node_modules","pnpm add ai"],"ja":["AI SDK","無料学習プラットフォーム","K-12教育","大学教育","AIソリューション","node_modules","pnpm add ai"],"ko":["AI SDK","무료 학습 플랫폼","K-12교육","대학 교육","AI 솔루션","node_modules","pnpm add ai"],"es":["AI SDK","aprendizaje nativo de IA","plataforma de aprendizaje","K-12","universidad","desarrollo de software","package manager"],"fr":["AI SDK","apprentissage natif IA","plateforme d''apprentissage","K-12","université","développement de logiciel","package manager"],"de":["AI SDK","native AI-Lerninhalte","Lernplattform","K-12","Universität","Software-Entwicklung","Package-Manager"],"pt":["ai-sdk","plataforma de aprendizado de IA","educação K-12","universitário","desenvolvimento de software","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["ai-sdk","платформа обучения ИИ","образование от К-12","университет","разработка программного обеспечения","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["ai-sdk","منصة تعلم الذكاء الاصطناعي","التعليم من المرحلة الابتدائية","الجامعية","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"nakafaai","repo":"nakafa.com","repoPath":"nakafaai/nakafa.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-sdk","description":"Answer questions about the AI SDK and help build AI-powered features. Use when developers: (1) Ask about AI SDK functions like generateText, streamText, ToolLoopAgent, embed, or tools, (2) Want to build AI agents, chatbots, RAG systems, or text generation features, (3) Have questions about AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, etc.), streaming, tool calling, structured output, or embeddings, (4) Use React hooks like useChat or useCompletion. Triggers on: AI SDK, Vercel AI SDK, generateText, streamText, add AI to my app, build an agent, tool calling, structured output, useChat.","bodyPreview":"## Prerequisites\n\nBefore searching docs, check if `node_modules/ai/docs/` exists. If not, install **only** the `ai` package using the project''s package manager (e.g., `pnpm add ai`).\n\nDo not install other packages at this stage. Provider packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/openai`) and client packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/react`) should be installed later when needed based on user requirements.\n\n## Critical: Do Not Trust Internal Knowledge\n\nEverything you know about the AI SDK is outdated or wrong. Your trainin","body":"## Prerequisites\n\nBefore searching docs, check if `node_modules/ai/docs/` exists. If not, install **only** the `ai` package using the project''s package manager (e.g., `pnpm add ai`).\n\nDo not install other packages at this stage. Provider packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/openai`) and client packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/react`) should be installed later when needed based on user requirements.\n\n## Critical: Do Not Trust Internal Knowledge\n\nEverything you know about the AI SDK is outdated or wrong. Your training data contains obsolete APIs, deprecated patterns, and incorrect usage.\n\n**When working with the AI SDK:**\n\n1. Ensure `ai` package is installed (see Prerequisites)\n2. Search `node_modules/ai/docs/` and `node_modules/ai/src/` for current APIs\n3. If not found locally, search ai-sdk.dev documentation (instructions below)\n4. Never rely on memory - always verify against source code or docs\n5. **`useChat` has changed significantly** - check [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) before writing client code\n6. When deciding which model and provider to use (e.g. OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini), use the Vercel AI Gateway provider unless the user specifies otherwise. See [AI Gateway Reference](references/ai-gateway.md) for usage details.\n7. **Always fetch current model IDs** - Never use model IDs from memory. Before writing code that uses a model, run `curl -s https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1/models | jq -r ''[.data[] | select(.id | startswith(\"provider/\")) | .id] | reverse | .[]''` (replacing `provider` with the relevant provider like `anthropic`, `openai`, or `google`) to get the full list with newest models first. Use the model with the highest version number (e.g., `claude-sonnet-4-5` over `claude-sonnet-4` over `claude-3-5-sonnet`).\n8. Run typecheck after changes to ensure code is correct\n9. **Be minimal** - Only specify options that differ from defaults. When unsure of defaults, check docs or source rather than guessing or over-specifying.\n\nIf you cannot find documentation to support your answer, state that explicitly.\n\n## Finding Documentation\n\n### ai@6.0.34+\n\nSearch bundled docs and source in `node_modules/ai/`:\n\n- **Docs**: `grep \"query\" node_modules/ai/docs/`\n- **Source**: `grep \"query\" node_modules/ai/src/`\n\nProvider packages include docs at `node_modules/@ai-sdk/<provider>/docs/`.\n\n### Earlier versions\n\n1. Search: `https://ai-sdk.dev/api/search-docs?q=your_query`\n2. Fetch `.md` URLs from results (e.g., `https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/agents/building-agents.md`)\n\n## When Typecheck Fails\n\n**Before searching source code**, grep [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) for the failing property or function name. Many type errors are caused by deprecated APIs documented there.\n\nIf not found in common-errors.md:\n\n1. Search `node_modules/ai/src/` and `node_modules/ai/docs/`\n2. Search ai-sdk.dev (for earlier versions or if not found locally)\n\n## Building and Consuming Agents\n\n### Creating Agents\n\nAlways use the `ToolLoopAgent` pattern. Search `node_modules/ai/docs/` for current agent creation APIs.\n\n**File conventions**: See [type-safe-agents.md](references/type-safe-agents.md) for where to save agents and tools.\n\n**Type Safety**: When consuming agents with `useChat`, always use `InferAgentUIMessage<typeof agent>` for type-safe tool results. See [reference](references/type-safe-agents.md).\n\n### Consuming Agents (Framework-Specific)\n\nBefore implementing agent consumption:\n\n1. Check `package.json` to detect the project''s framework/stack\n2. Search documentation for the framework''s quickstart guide\n3. Follow the framework-specific patterns for streaming, API routes, and client integration\n\n## References\n\n- [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) - Renamed parameters reference (parameters → inputSchema, etc.)\n- [AI Gateway](references/ai-gateway.md) - Gateway setup and usage\n- [Type-Safe Agents with useChat](references/type-safe-agents.md) - End-to-end type safety with InferAgentUIMessage\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:01:56.351Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Educational Agents requiring a native, high-quality learning platform for K-12 to university levels","zh":"适用于需要原生、高品质学习平台的教育代理，涵盖K-12至大学水平","ja":"K-12から大学レベルまでの教育エージェントに適した、高品質のネイティブ学習プラットフォーム","ko":"K-12부터 대학 수준까지의 교육 에이전트에게 적합한 고품질의 네이티브 학습 플랫폼","es":"Ideal para agentes educativos que requieren una plataforma de aprendizaje nativa y de alta calidad para niveles de K-12 a universitarios","fr":"Idéal pour les agents éducatifs nécessitant une plateforme d''apprentissage native et de haute qualité pour les niveaux de K-12 à universitaires","de":"Ideal für Bildungsagenten, die eine native, hochwertige Lernplattform für K-12- bis Universitätsniveau benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Educacionais que requerem uma plataforma de aprendizado nativa e de alta qualidade para níveis de K-12 a universitário","ru":"Идеально подходит для образовательных агентов, требующих родной, высококачественной платформы обучения для уровней от K-12 до университетского","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التعليميين الذين يحتاجون إلى منصة تعلم أصلية وعالية الجودة لمستويات من K-12 إلى الجامعية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop and integrate AI-driven educational content using the ai-sdk package, facilitating seamless installation via project package managers like pnpm, and enabling the utilization of provider packages such as @ai-sdk/openai and client packages like @ai-sdk/react for tailored user experiences","zh":"赋予代理开发和集成使用ai-sdk包的AI驱动教育内容的能力，通过项目包管理器如pnpm实现无缝安装，并通过@ai-sdk/openai和@ai-sdk/react等提供商包和客户端包来实现个性化用户体验","ja":"エージェントがai-sdkパッケージを使用してAI駆動の教育コンテンツを開発・統合できるようにし、pnpmなどのプロジェクトパッケージマネージャーを介したシームレスなインストールを可能にし、@ai-sdk/openaiや@ai-sdk/reactなどのプロバイダーパッケージやクライアントパッケージを利用してカスタマイズされたユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現","ko":"에이전트가 ai-sdk 패키지를 사용하여 AI 구동 교육 콘텐츠를 개발하고 통합할 수 있도록 하며, pnpm과 같은 프로젝트 패키지 관리자를 통해无缝 설치를 가능하게 하고, @ai-sdk/openai와 @ai-sdk/react와 같은 제공자 패키지와 클라이언트 패키지를 사용하여 맞춤형 사용자 경험을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar e integrar contenido educativo impulsado por IA utilizando el paquete ai-sdk, facilitando una instalación sin problemas a través de administradores de paquetes de proyectos como pnpm, y permitiendo la utilización de paquetes de proveedores como @ai-sdk/openai y paquetes de cliente como @ai-sdk/react para experiencias de usuario personalizadas","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer et d''intégrer du contenu éducatif piloté par l''IA en utilisant le package ai-sdk, facilitant une installation sans problème via des gestionnaires de packages de projet comme pnpm, et permettant l''utilisation de packages de fournisseurs tels que @ai-sdk/openai et des packages de client comme @ai-sdk/react pour des expériences utilisateur personnalisées","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, AI-getriebenen Bildungsinhalt mit dem ai-sdk-Paket zu entwickeln und zu integrieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Installation über Projekt-Paket-Manager wie pnpm ermöglicht wird und die Nutzung von Anbieter-Paketen wie @ai-sdk/openai und Client-Paketen wie @ai-sdk/react für maßgeschneiderte Benutzererfahrungen ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver e integrar conteúdo educacional impulsionado por IA usando o pacote ai-sdk, facilitando a instalação sem problemas via gerenciadores de pacotes de projeto como pnpm, e permitindo a utilização de pacotes de fornecedores como @ai-sdk/openai e pacotes de cliente como @ai-sdk/react para experiências de usuário personalizadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработать и интегрировать образовательный контент, управляемый ИИ, с использованием пакета ai-sdk, облегчая бесшовную установку через менеджеры пакетов проекта, такие как pnpm, и позволяя использовать пакеты поставщиков, такие как @ai-sdk/openai, и пакеты клиентов, такие как @ai-sdk/react, для индивидуальных пользовательских trải nghiệm","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير وتكامل المحتوى التعليمي المدفوع بالذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام حزمة ai-sdk، وتسهيل التثبيت الخالي من المشاكل عبر مديري حزم المشروع مثل pnpm، وتمكين استخدام حزم الموردين مثل @ai-sdk/openai وحزم العميل مثل @ai-sdk/react لتحقيق تجارب مستخدم مخصصة"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing AI-native learning platforms","Integrating OpenAI capabilities for enhanced educational content","Customizing educational experiences with @ai-sdk/react"],"zh":["开发AI原生学习平台","集成OpenAI能力以增强教育内容","使用@ai-sdk/react定制教育体验"],"ja":["AIネイティブ学習プラットフォームの開発","OpenAIの機能を統合して教育コンテンツを強化","@ai-sdk/reactを使用して教育体験をカスタマイズ"],"ko":["AI 네이티브 학습 플랫폼 개발","OpenAI 기능을 통합하여 교육 콘텐츠 강화","@ai-sdk/react를 사용하여 교육 경험을 맞춤화"],"es":["Desarrollar plataformas de aprendizaje nativas de IA","Integrar capacidades de OpenAI para un contenido educativo mejorado","Personalizar experiencias educativas con @ai-sdk/react"],"fr":["Développer des plateformes d''apprentissage natives IA","Intégrer les capacités d''OpenAI pour un contenu éducatif amélioré","Personnaliser les expériences éducatives avec @ai-sdk/react"],"de":["Entwicklung von AI-nativen Lernplattformen","Integration von OpenAI-Funktionen für verbesserten Bildungsinhalt","Anpassen von Bildungserfahrungen mit @ai-sdk/react"],"pt":["Desenvolver plataformas de aprendizado nativas em IA","Integrar capacidades do OpenAI para melhorar o conteúdo educacional","Personalizar experiências educacionais com @ai-sdk/react"],"ru":["Разработка платформ обучения, родных для ИИ","Интеграция возможностей OpenAI для улучшения образовательного контента","Настройка образовательных trải nghiệm с помощью @ai-sdk/react"],"ar":["تطوير منصات تعلم أصلية بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تكامل قدرات OpenAI لتحسين المحتوى التعليمي","تخصيص تجارب تعليمية باستخدام @ai-sdk/react"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of the ai package via a project''s package manager","Dependent on provider and client packages for full functionality"],"zh":["需要通过项目包管理器安装ai包","依赖于提供商和客户端包以实现全部功能"],"ja":["プロジェクトパッケージマネージャーを介してaiパッケージのインストールが必要","完全な機能を実現するためにプロバイダーパッケージとクライアントパッケージに依存"],"ko":["프로젝트 패키지 관리자를 통해 ai 패키지를 설치해야 함","전체 기능을 구현하기 위해 제공자 패키지와 클라이언트 패키지에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del paquete de IA a través de un administrador de paquetes del proyecto","Depende de los paquetes de proveedor y de cliente para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du package d''IA via un gestionnaire de packages de projet","Dépend des packages de fournisseur et de client pour la fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des AI-Pakets über einen Projekt-Paket-Manager","Ist von Anbieter- und Client-Paketen für die vollständige Funktionalität abhängig"],"pt":["Requer a instalação do pacote ai via gerenciador de pacotes do projeto","Depende de pacotes de fornecedores e clientes para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требует установки пакета ai через менеджер пакетов проекта","Зависит от пакетов поставщиков и клиентов для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت حزمة ai عبر مدير حزم المشروع","يعتمد على حزم الموردين وحزم العميل للوظيفة الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kowyo-bot/16Chats/ai-sdk', 'community', 'kowyo-bot', '16Chats', 'kowyo-bot/16Chats', 'ai-sdk', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:02:30.188Z', NULL, '{"id":"kowyo-bot/16Chats/ai-sdk","name":"ai-sdk","description":{"zh":"AI SDK是一种开发工具包，帮助开发者创建智能化的应用程序。通过安装ai包并配置相关依赖，开发者可以快速开发出智能化的应用","ja":"AI SDKは開発者がスマートなアプリケーションを開発するためのツールキットです。aiパッケージをインストールし、依存関係を構成することで、開発者は迅速にスマートなアプリケーションを開発できます","ko":"AI SDK는 개발자가 지능형 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 도와주는 툴킷입니다. ai 패키지를 설치하고 필요한 의존성을 구성하면 개발자는 빠르게 지능형 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있습니다","es":"El SDK de IA es una herramienta para desarrollar aplicaciones inteligentes. Ofrece funcionalidades para integrar la inteligencia artificial en proyectos.","fr":"Le SDK d''IA est un outil pour développer des applications intelligentes. Il offre des fonctionnalités pour intégrer l''intelligence artificielle dans les projets.","de":"Das KI-SDK ist ein Tool für die Entwicklung intelligenter Anwendungen. Es bietet Funktionalitäten zur Integration künstlicher Intelligenz in Projekte.","en":"16Chats"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI SDK开发指南","ja":"AI SDK開発ガイド","ko":"AI SDK 개발자 가이드","es":"SDK de IA: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Inteligentes","fr":"SDK d''IA: Développement d''Applications Intelligents","de":"KI-SDK: Entwicklung Intelligenter Anwendungen","en":"ai-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"AI SDK是一种开发工具包，帮助开发者创建智能化的应用程序。通过安装ai包并配置相关依赖，开发者可以快速开发出智能化的应用","ja":"AI SDKは開発者がスマートなアプリケーションを開発するためのツールキットです。aiパッケージをインストールし、依存関係を構成することで、開発者は迅速にスマートなアプリケーションを開発できます","ko":"AI SDK는 개발자가 지능형 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 도와주는 툴킷입니다. ai 패키지를 설치하고 필요한 의존성을 구성하면 개발자는 빠르게 지능형 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있습니다","es":"El SDK de IA es una herramienta para desarrollar aplicaciones inteligentes. Ofrece funcionalidades para integrar la inteligencia artificial en proyectos.","fr":"Le SDK d''IA est un outil pour développer des applications intelligentes. Il offre des fonctionnalités pour intégrer l''intelligence artificielle dans les proj...","de":"Das KI-SDK ist ein Tool für die Entwicklung intelligenter Anwendungen. Es bietet Funktionalitäten zur Integration künstlicher Intelligenz in Projekte.","en":"16Chats"},"definition":{"en":"16Chats"},"features":{"zh":["快速开发智能化应用","支持多种依赖包安装","提供详细的开发文档","兼容多种开发环境"],"ja":["スマートなアプリケーションの迅速開発","多種の依存パッケージのインストールをサポート","詳細な開発ドキュメントを提供","多種の開発環境に対応"],"ko":["지능형 애플리케이션의 빠른 개발","다양한 의존성 패키지 설치 지원","詳細한 개발 문서 제공","다양한 개발 환경対応"],"es":["Integración de inteligencia artificial en proyectos","Funcionalidades para desarrollar aplicaciones inteligentes","Compatibilidad con diferentes proveedores de IA","Instalación sencilla mediante el administrador de paquetes","Documentación detallada para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Intégration de l''intelligence artificielle dans les projets","Fonctionnalités pour développer des applications intelligentes","Compatibilité avec différents fournisseurs d''IA","Installation simple via le gestionnaire de paquets","Documentation détaillée pour les développeurs"],"de":["Integration künstlicher Intelligenz in Projekte","Funktionen zur Entwicklung intelligenter Anwendungen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen KI-Anbietern","Einfache Installation über den Paketmanager","Detaillierte Dokumentation für Entwickler"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI SDK","开发工具包","智能化应用","人工智能","软件开发","依赖包安装"],"ja":["AI SDK","開発ツールキット","スマートなアプリケーション","人工知能","ソフトウェア開発","依存パッケージのインストール"],"ko":["AI SDK","개발 도구套件","지능형 애플리케이션","인공지능","소프트웨어 개발","의존성 패키지 설치"],"es":["SDK de IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones inteligentes","inteligencia artificial","integración de IA","proveedores de IA","documentación para desarrolladores"],"fr":["SDK d''IA","développement d''applications intelligentes","intelligence artificielle","intégration de l''IA","fournisseurs d''IA","documentation pour développeurs"],"de":["KI-SDK","Entwicklung intelligenter Anwendungen","künstliche Intelligenz","Integration von KI","KI-Anbieter","Dokumentation für Entwickler"]}},"owner":"kowyo-bot","repo":"16Chats","repoPath":"kowyo-bot/16Chats","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-sdk","description":"Answer questions about the AI SDK and help build AI-powered features. Use when developers: (1) Ask about AI SDK functions like generateText, streamText, ToolLoopAgent, embed, or tools, (2) Want to build AI agents, chatbots, RAG systems, or text generation features, (3) Have questions about AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, etc.), streaming, tool calling, structured output, or embeddings, (4) Use React hooks like useChat or useCompletion. Triggers on: AI SDK, Vercel AI SDK, generateText, streamText, add AI to my app, build an agent, tool calling, structured output, useChat.","bodyPreview":"## Prerequisites\n\nBefore searching docs, check if `node_modules/ai/docs/` exists. If not, install **only** the `ai` package using the project''s package manager (e.g., `pnpm add ai`).\n\nDo not install other packages at this stage. Provider packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/openai`) and client packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/react`) should be installed later when needed based on user requirements.\n\n## Critical: Do Not Trust Internal Knowledge\n\nEverything you know about the AI SDK is outdated or wrong. Your trainin","body":"## Prerequisites\n\nBefore searching docs, check if `node_modules/ai/docs/` exists. If not, install **only** the `ai` package using the project''s package manager (e.g., `pnpm add ai`).\n\nDo not install other packages at this stage. Provider packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/openai`) and client packages (e.g., `@ai-sdk/react`) should be installed later when needed based on user requirements.\n\n## Critical: Do Not Trust Internal Knowledge\n\nEverything you know about the AI SDK is outdated or wrong. Your training data contains obsolete APIs, deprecated patterns, and incorrect usage.\n\n**When working with the AI SDK:**\n\n1. Ensure `ai` package is installed (see Prerequisites)\n2. Search `node_modules/ai/docs/` and `node_modules/ai/src/` for current APIs\n3. If not found locally, search ai-sdk.dev documentation (instructions below)\n4. Never rely on memory - always verify against source code or docs\n5. **`useChat` has changed significantly** - check [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) before writing client code\n6. When deciding which model and provider to use (e.g. OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini), use the Vercel AI Gateway provider unless the user specifies otherwise. See [AI Gateway Reference](references/ai-gateway.md) for usage details.\n7. **Always fetch current model IDs** - Never use model IDs from memory. Before writing code that uses a model, run `curl -s https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1/models | jq -r ''[.data[] | select(.id | startswith(\"provider/\")) | .id] | reverse | .[]''` (replacing `provider` with the relevant provider like `anthropic`, `openai`, or `google`) to get the full list with newest models first. Use the model with the highest version number (e.g., `claude-sonnet-4-5` over `claude-sonnet-4` over `claude-3-5-sonnet`).\n8. Run typecheck after changes to ensure code is correct\n9. **Be minimal** - Only specify options that differ from defaults. When unsure of defaults, check docs or source rather than guessing or over-specifying.\n\nIf you cannot find documentation to support your answer, state that explicitly.\n\n## Finding Documentation\n\n### ai@6.0.34+\n\nSearch bundled docs and source in `node_modules/ai/`:\n\n- **Docs**: `grep \"query\" node_modules/ai/docs/`\n- **Source**: `grep \"query\" node_modules/ai/src/`\n\nProvider packages include docs at `node_modules/@ai-sdk/<provider>/docs/`.\n\n### Earlier versions\n\n1. Search: `https://ai-sdk.dev/api/search-docs?q=your_query`\n2. Fetch `.md` URLs from results (e.g., `https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/agents/building-agents.md`)\n\n## When Typecheck Fails\n\n**Before searching source code**, grep [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) for the failing property or function name. Many type errors are caused by deprecated APIs documented there.\n\nIf not found in common-errors.md:\n\n1. Search `node_modules/ai/src/` and `node_modules/ai/docs/`\n2. Search ai-sdk.dev (for earlier versions or if not found locally)\n\n## Building and Consuming Agents\n\n### Creating Agents\n\nAlways use the `ToolLoopAgent` pattern. Search `node_modules/ai/docs/` for current agent creation APIs.\n\n**File conventions**: See [type-safe-agents.md](references/type-safe-agents.md) for where to save agents and tools.\n\n**Type Safety**: When consuming agents with `useChat`, always use `InferAgentUIMessage<typeof agent>` for type-safe tool results. See [reference](references/type-safe-agents.md).\n\n### Consuming Agents (Framework-Specific)\n\nBefore implementing agent consumption:\n\n1. Check `package.json` to detect the project''s framework/stack\n2. Search documentation for the framework''s quickstart guide\n3. Follow the framework-specific patterns for streaming, API routes, and client integration\n\n## References\n\n- [Common Errors](references/common-errors.md) - Renamed parameters reference (parameters → inputSchema, etc.)\n- [AI Gateway](references/ai-gateway.md) - Gateway setup and usage\n- [Type-Safe Agents with useChat](references/type-safe-agents.md) - End-to-end type safety with InferAgentUIMessage\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:02:30.188Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced integration with AI SDKs via Node.js and package managers like pnpm.","zh":"适合需要通过Node.js和包管理器（如pnpm）与AI SDK进行高级集成的AI代理。","ja":"Node.jsおよびパッケージマネージャー（pnpmなど）を使用してAI SDKと高度に統合する必要があるAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Node.js 및 패키지 매니저(pnpm 等)를 사용하여 AI SDK와 고급 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una integración avanzada con SDK de IA a través de Node.js y administradores de paquetes como pnpm.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée avec des SDK IA via Node.js et des gestionnaires de paquets comme pnpm.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration mit KI-SDKs über Node.js und Paketmanagern wie pnpm benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de integração avançada com SDKs de IA via Node.js e gerenciadores de pacotes como o pnpm.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция с SDK ИИ через Node.js и менеджеров пакетов, таких как pnpm.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى دمج متقدم مع SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي عبر Node.js ومدیر 包 مثل pnpm."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with AI services using provider packages like @ai-sdk/openai and client packages like @ai-sdk/react, leveraging node_modules for seamless integration and avoiding version conflicts by installing only the required ai package initially.","zh":"赋予代理使用提供程序包（如@ai-sdk/openai）和客户端包（如@ai-sdk/react）与AI服务交互的能力，利用node_modules实现无缝集成，并通过仅安装所需的ai包来避免版本冲突。","ja":"エージェントは、プロバイダーパッケージ（@ai-sdk/openaiなど）とクライアントパッケージ（@ai-sdk/reactなど）を使用してAIサービスとやり取りできるようにし、node_modulesを利用してシームレスな統合を行い、必要なaiパッケージのみをインストールすることでバージョンの競合を回避します。","ko":"에이전트가 제공자 패키지(@ai-sdk/openai 등) 및 클라이언트 패키지(@ai-sdk/react 등)를 사용하여 AI 서비스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하며, node_modules를 활용하여 無縫な 통합을 thực hiện하며, 필요한 ai 패키지만을 설치하여 버전 충돌을 피합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con servicios de IA utilizando paquetes de proveedores como @ai-sdk/openai y paquetes de cliente como @ai-sdk/react, aprovechando node_modules para una integración sin problemas y evitando conflictos de versiones al instalar solo el paquete de IA requerido inicialmente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec des services d''IA en utilisant des packages de fournisseurs comme @ai-sdk/openai et des packages clients comme @ai-sdk/react, en exploitant node_modules pour une intégration transparente et en évitant les conflits de versions en installant uniquement le package d''IA requis initialement.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, mit KI-Diensten zu interagieren, indem sie Anbieter-Pakete wie @ai-sdk/openai und Client-Pakete wie @ai-sdk/react verwenden, node_modules für eine nahtlose Integration nutzt und Versionskonflikte vermeidet, indem nur das erforderliche KI-Paket initial installiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com serviços de IA usando pacotes de provedores como @ai-sdk/openai e pacotes de cliente como @ai-sdk/react, aproveitando node_modules para integração sem problemas e evitando conflitos de versão ao instalar apenas o pacote de IA necessário inicialmente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с сервисами ИИ, используя пакеты провайдеров, такие как @ai-sdk/openai, и пакеты клиентов, такие как @ai-sdk/react, используя node_modules для бесшовной интеграции и избегая конфликтов версий, устанавливая изначально только необходимый пакет ИИ.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من التفاعل مع خدمات الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام حزم مزودي الخدمة مثل @ai-sdk/openai وحزم العملاء مثل @ai-sdk/react، مستفيداً من node_modules من أجل التكامل السلس ومتجناً من الصراعات الإصدارية من خلال تثبيت حزمة الذكاء الاصطناعي المطلوبة فقط في البداية."},"useCases":{"en":["Installing ai package using pnpm for project-specific requirements","Configuring provider packages for OpenAI integration","Implementing client packages for React applications"],"zh":["使用pnpm安装ai包以满足项目特定要求","为OpenAI集成配置提供程序包","为React应用程序实现客户端包"],"ja":["pnpmを使用してプロジェクト固有の要件を満たすためのaiパッケージをインストールする","OpenAI統合のためにプロバイダーパッケージを構成する","Reactアプリケーションのためにクライアントパッケージを実装する"],"ko":["pnpm을 사용하여 프로젝트 고유의 요구 사항을 충족하기 위한 ai 패키지를 설치합니다.","OpenAI 통합을 위해 제공자 패키지를 구성합니다.","React 애플리케이션을 위한 클라이언트 패키지를 구현합니다."],"es":["Instalar paquete de IA usando pnpm para requisitos específicos del proyecto","Configurar paquetes de proveedores para la integración con OpenAI","Implementar paquetes de cliente para aplicaciones React"],"fr":["Installer le package d''IA en utilisant pnpm pour les exigences spécifiques du projet","Configurer les packages de fournisseurs pour l''intégration avec OpenAI","Mettre en œuvre les packages clients pour les applications React"],"de":["Installieren des KI-Pakets mit pnpm für projektspezifische Anforderungen","Konfigurieren von Anbieter-Paketen für die Integration mit OpenAI","Implementieren von Client-Paketen für React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Instalar pacote de IA usando pnpm para requisitos específicos do projeto","Configurar pacotes de provedores para integração com OpenAI","Implementar pacotes de cliente para aplicações React"],"ru":["Установка пакета ИИ, используя pnpm, для проектных требований","Настройка пакетов провайдеров для интеграции с OpenAI","Реализация пакетов клиентов для приложений React"],"ar":["تثبيت حزمة الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام pnpm لمتطلبات المشروع الخاصة","تكوين حزم مزودي الخدمة لتكامل OpenAI","تنفيذ حزم العملاء لتطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Must install ai package before other dependencies","Dependent on package manager like pnpm for installation"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","必须在其他依赖项之前安装ai包","依赖于包管理器（如pnpm）进行安装"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","他の依存関係よりも前にaiパッケージをインストールする必要がある","パッケージマネージャー（pnpmなど）に依存してインストールする"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요합니다.","他の 의존성보다 먼저 ai 패키지를 설치해야 합니다.","패키지 매니저(pnpm 등)에 의존하여 설치합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Debe instalar el paquete de IA antes que otras dependencias","Depende de un administrador de paquetes como pnpm para la instalación"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Doit installer le package d''IA avant d''autres dépendances","Dépend d''un gestionnaire de paquets comme pnpm pour l''installation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Muss das KI-Paket vor anderen Abhängigkeiten installieren","Ist von einem Paketmanager wie pnpm für die Installation abhängig"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js","Deve instalar pacote de IA antes das outras dependências","Depende de gerenciador de pacotes como pnpm para instalação"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Необходимо установить пакет ИИ до других зависимостей","Зависит от менеджера пакетов, такого как pnpm, для установки"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","يجب تثبيت حزمة الذكاء الاصطناعي قبل غيرها من الإعتمادات","يعتمد على مدير الحزم مثل pnpm لتثبيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
