ть команды для создания задач","Совместим с dex","Легко использовать","Позволяет создавать отслеживаемые задачи"],"ar":["يحول مستندات Markdown إلى مهام","يسمح باستخدام الأوامر لإنشاء المهام","متوافق مع dex","سهل الاستخدام","يسمح بإنشاء مهام قابلة للتعقب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dex-plan","Markdown 文档转换","任务转换技术","开发效率","可跟踪的任务","命令调用方式"],"ja":["dex-plan","マークダウン文書変換","タスク変換技術","開発効率","追跡可能なタスク","コマンド呼び出し方法"],"ko":["dex-plan","마크다운 문서 변환","태스크 변환 기술","개발 효율성","추적 가능한 태스크","명령 호출 방법"],"es":["dex-plan","conversión de markdown","tareas trackeables","planificación de proyectos","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad","gestión de tareas"],"fr":["dex-plan","conversion de markdown","tâches suivies","planification de projets","outils de développement","productivité","gestion de tâches"],"de":["dex-plan","Umwandlung von Markdown","nachverfolgbare Aufgaben","Projektplanung","Entwicklungstools","Produktivität","Aufgabenmanagement"],"pt":["dex-plan","converte markdown em tarefas","ferramenta de linha de comando","dex","tarefas trackeáveis","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["dex-plan","преобразование markdown в задачи","командный инструмент","dex","отслеживаемые задачи","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["dex-plan","تحويل markdown إلى مهام","أداة سطر أوامر","dex","مهام قابلة للتعقب","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"sanjitsaluja","repo":"zugzwang-puzzle-trainer","repoPath":"sanjitsaluja/zugzwang-puzzle-trainer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dex-plan","description":"Create dex task from markdown planning documents (plans, specs, design docs, roadmaps)","bodyPreview":"# Converting Markdown Documents to Tasks\n\n## Command Invocation\n\nUse `dex` directly for all commands:\n\n```bash\ndex <command>\n```\n\nIf `dex` is not on PATH, use `npx @zeeg/dex <command>` instead. Check once at the start:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v dex &>/dev/null && echo \"use: dex\" || echo \"use: npx @zeeg/dex\"\n```\n\nUse `/dex-plan` to convert any markdown planning document into a trackable dex task.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing a plan in plan mode\n- Converting specification documents to trackable t","body":"# Converting Markdown Documents to Tasks\n\n## Command Invocation\n\nUse `dex` directly for all commands:\n\n```bash\ndex <command>\n```\n\nIf `dex` is not on PATH, use `npx @zeeg/dex <command>` instead. Check once at the start:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v dex &>/dev/null && echo \"use: dex\" || echo \"use: npx @zeeg/dex\"\n```\n\nUse `/dex-plan` to convert any markdown planning document into a trackable dex task.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After completing a plan in plan mode\n- Converting specification documents to trackable tasks\n- Converting design documents to implementation tasks\n- Creating tasks from roadmap or milestone documents\n- Tracking any markdown planning or design content\n\n## Supported Documents\n\nAny markdown file containing planning or design content:\n\n- Plan files from plan mode (`~/.claude/plans/*.md`)\n- Specification documents (`SPEC.md`, `REQUIREMENTS.md`)\n- Design documents (`DESIGN.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`)\n- Roadmaps and milestone documents (`ROADMAP.md`)\n- Feature proposals and technical RFCs\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan <markdown-file-path>\n```\n\n### Examples\n\n**From plan mode:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan /home/user/.claude/plans/moonlit-brewing-lynx.md\n```\n\n**From specification document:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan @SPEC.md\n```\n\n**From design document:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan docs/AUTHENTICATION_DESIGN.md\n```\n\n**From roadmap:**\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan ROADMAP.md\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n1. Reads the markdown file\n2. Extracts title from first `#` heading (or uses filename as fallback)\n3. Strips \"Plan: \" prefix if present (case-insensitive)\n4. Creates dex task with full markdown content as context\n5. Analyzes plan structure for potential subtask breakdown\n6. Automatically creates subtasks when appropriate\n7. Returns task ID and breakdown summary\n\n## Examples\n\n**From plan mode file:**\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Add JWT Authentication\n\n## Summary\n\n...\n```\n\n→ Task description: \"Add JWT Authentication\" (note: \"Plan: \" prefix stripped)\n\n**From specification document:**\n\n```markdown\n# User Authentication Specification\n\n## Requirements\n\n...\n```\n\n→ Task description: \"User Authentication Specification\"\n\n## Automatic Subtask Breakdown\n\nAfter creating the main task, the skill analyzes the plan structure to determine if breaking it into subtasks adds value.\n\n### Hierarchy Levels\n\nThe skill supports up to 3 levels (maximum depth enforced by dex):\n\n| Level | Name        | Example                           |\n| ----- | ----------- | --------------------------------- |\n| L0    | **Epic**    | \"Add user authentication system\"  |\n| L1    | **Task**    | \"Implement JWT middleware\"        |\n| L2    | **Subtask** | \"Add token verification function\" |\n\n### When Breakdown Happens\n\nThe skill creates subtasks when the plan has:\n\n- 3-7 clearly separable work items (numbered steps, distinct sections, implementation phases)\n- Implementation across multiple files or components (different modules, layers, or areas)\n- Clear sequential dependencies (step 1 before step 2)\n- Independent items that benefit from separate tracking\n\n**Epic-level breakdown** (creates tasks, not subtasks) when:\n\n- Plan has major phases/sections with their own sub-items\n- 5+ distinct areas of work\n- Plan spans multiple systems or components\n- Work will require multiple sessions\n\n### When Breakdown Does NOT Happen\n\nThe skill keeps a single task when:\n\n- Plan describes one cohesive task (even if detailed with multiple paragraphs)\n- Only 1-2 steps present (not enough to warrant breakdown)\n- Work items are tightly coupled (can''t be separated meaningfully)\n- Plan is exploratory or investigative (research, analysis, discovery)\n- Breaking down would create artificial boundaries that don''t reflect natural work units\n\n### What Each Subtask Contains\n\nWhen breakdown occurs, each subtask includes:\n\n- Description: Brief summary extracted from list item, heading, or section\n- Context: Relevant details from that section plus reference to parent task\n- Parent link: Automatically linked to main task via `--parent`\n\n### Example: With Breakdown\n\n**Input plan** (`auth-plan.md`):\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Add Authentication System\n\n## Implementation\n\n1. Create database schema for users/tokens\n2. Implement auth controller with endpoints\n3. Add JWT middleware for route protection\n4. Build frontend login/register forms\n5. Add integration tests\n```\n\n**Output**:\n\n```\nCreated task abc123 from plan\n\nAnalyzed plan structure: Found 5 distinct implementation steps\nCreated 5 subtasks:\n- abc124: Create database schema for users/tokens\n- abc125: Implement auth controller with endpoints\n- abc126: Add JWT middleware for route protection\n- abc127: Build frontend login/register forms\n- abc128: Add integration tests\n\nView full structure: dex show abc123\n```\n\n### Example: Without Breakdown\n\n**Input plan** (`bugfix-plan.md`):\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Fix Login Validation Bug\n\n## Problem\n\nLogin fails when username has spaces\n\n## Solution\n\nUpdate validation regex in auth.ts line 42 to allow spaces\n```\n\n**Output**:\n\n```\nCreated task xyz789 from plan\n\nPlan describes a cohesive single task. No subtask breakdown needed.\n\nView task: dex show xyz789\n```\n\n### Example: Epic-Level Breakdown (Two-Level Hierarchy)\n\n**Input plan** (`full-auth-plan.md`):\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Complete User Authentication System\n\n## Phase 1: Backend Infrastructure\n\n1. Create database schema for users and sessions\n2. Implement password hashing with bcrypt\n3. Add JWT token generation and validation\n\n## Phase 2: API Endpoints\n\n1. POST /auth/register - User registration\n2. POST /auth/login - User login\n3. POST /auth/logout - Session invalidation\n4. POST /auth/reset-password - Password reset flow\n\n## Phase 3: Frontend Integration\n\n1. Login/register forms with validation\n2. Protected route components\n3. Session persistence with refresh tokens\n```\n\n**Output**:\n\n```\nCreated epic abc123 from plan\n\nAnalyzed plan structure: Found 3 major phases with sub-items\nCreated as epic with 3 tasks:\n- def456: Backend Infrastructure (3 subtasks)\n- ghi789: API Endpoints (4 subtasks)\n- jkl012: Frontend Integration (3 subtasks)\n\nView full structure: dex list abc123\n```\n\n## Options\n\n```bash\n/dex-plan <file> --priority 2              # Set priority\n/dex-plan <file> --parent abc123           # Create as subtask\n```\n\n## After Creating\n\nOnce created, you can:\n\n- View the task: `dex show <task-id>`\n- Create additional subtasks: `dex create \"...\" --parent <task-id> --description \"...\"`\n- Track progress through implementation\n- Complete the task: `dex complete <task-id> --result \"...\"`\n\nRun `dex show <task-id>` to see the full task structure including any automatically created subtasks.\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- Document is incomplete or exploratory (just draft notes)\n- Content isn''t actionable or ready for implementation\n- File hasn''t been saved to disk yet\n- File doesn''t contain meaningful planning/design content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Instructions for Skill\n\n**These instructions are for the skill agent executing `/dex-plan`.** Follow this workflow exactly:\n\n### Step 1: Create Main Task\n\nExecute the `dex plan` command with the provided markdown file:\n\n```bash\ndex plan <markdown-file> [options]\n```\n\nThis creates the parent task and returns its ID. Capture this ID for subsequent steps.\n\n### Step 2: Read and Analyze the Plan\n\nAfter creating the main task, read it back to analyze its structure:\n\n```bash\ndex show <task-id>\n```\n\nExamine the context field (which contains the full markdown) for breakdown potential.\n\n### Step 3: Apply Breakdown Decision Logic\n\n**Analyze the plan structure and decide**: Should this be broken down into subtasks?\n\n#### Look for these breakdown indicators:\n\n1. Numbered or bulleted implementation lists (3-7 items):\n\n   ```markdown\n   ## Implementation\n\n   1. Create database schema → SUBTASK\n   2. Build API endpoints → SUBTASK\n   3. Add frontend components → SUBTASK\n   ```\n\n2. Clear subsections under implementation/tasks/steps:\n\n   ```markdown\n   ### 1. Backend Changes\n\n   - Modify server.ts\n   - Add authentication\n     → SUBTASK: \"Backend Changes\" with this context\n\n   ### 2. Frontend Updates\n\n   - Update login form\n   - Add error handling\n     → SUBTASK: \"Frontend Updates\" with this context\n   ```\n\n3. File-specific sections:\n\n   ```markdown\n   ### `src/auth.ts` - Add JWT validation\n\n   [Details about changes]\n   → SUBTASK: \"Add JWT validation to auth.ts\"\n\n   ### `src/middleware.ts` - Create auth middleware\n\n   [Details about changes]\n   → SUBTASK: \"Create auth middleware\"\n   ```\n\n4. Sequential phases:\n\n   ```markdown\n   ## Implementation Sequence\n\n   **Phase 1: Database Layer**\n   [Details] → SUBTASK\n\n   **Phase 2: API Layer**\n   [Details] → SUBTASK\n\n   **Phase 3: Frontend Layer**\n   [Details] → SUBTASK\n   ```\n\n#### Do NOT break down when:\n\n- Only 1-2 steps/items present\n- Plan is a single cohesive fix or small change\n- Content is exploratory (\"investigate\", \"research\", \"explore\")\n- Work items are inseparable (tightly coupled implementation)\n- Breaking down creates artificial boundaries\n- Plan is very short (< 10 lines of meaningful content)\n\n### Step 4: Extract Subtasks (If Breaking Down)\n\nFor each identified subtask:\n\n1. Extract description: Use the list item text, heading, or section title\n   - Strip numbering and bullets: \"1. Add auth\" → \"Add auth\"\n   - Keep it concise (1-10 words)\n   - Use imperative form: \"Add\", \"Create\", \"Update\", \"Fix\"\n\n2. Extract context: Include relevant details from that section\n   - Copy the full section content for that subtask\n   - Add reference: \"This is part of [parent task description]\"\n   - Include code snippets, file paths, specific requirements\n\n3. Create the subtask:\n   ```bash\n   dex create \"<subtask-description>\" \\\n     --parent <parent-task-id> \\\n     --description \"<extracted-context-with-parent-reference>\"\n   ```\n\n### Step 5: Report Results\n\nIf subtasks were created:\n\n```\nCreated task <id> from plan\n\nAnalyzed plan structure: Found <N> distinct implementation steps\nCreated <N> subtasks:\n- <subtask-id-1>: <description-1>\n- <subtask-id-2>: <description-2>\n- <subtask-id-3>: <description-3>\n...\n\nView full structure: dex show <parent-id>\n```\n\nIf no breakdown occurred:\n\n```\nCreated task <id> from plan\n\nPlan describes a cohesive single task. No subtask breakdown needed.\n\nView task: dex show <id>\n```\n\n### Examples of Subtask Extraction\n\nExample 1: Numbered list\n\n```markdown\n## Implementation Steps\n\n1. Create User model with email, password fields\n2. Add POST /api/auth/register endpoint\n3. Implement JWT token generation\n```\n\nExtracted subtasks:\n\n```bash\ndex create \"Create User model with email, password fields\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Create a User model with email and password fields. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n\ndex create \"Add POST /api/auth/register endpoint\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Add POST /api/auth/register endpoint to handle user registration. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n\ndex create \"Implement JWT token generation\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Implement JWT token generation for authenticated sessions. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n```\n\nExample 2: Subsections with details\n\n```markdown\n### Frontend: Login Form Component\n\nCreate a new React component at `src/components/LoginForm.tsx`:\n\n- Email and password inputs\n- Submit button with loading state\n- Error message display\n- Validation on submit\n\n### Backend: Auth Routes\n\nAdd to `src/routes/auth.ts`:\n\n- POST /login endpoint\n- Password verification using bcrypt\n- JWT token generation on success\n```\n\nExtracted subtasks:\n\n```bash\ndex create \"Frontend: Login Form Component\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Create a new React component at src/components/LoginForm.tsx with email/password inputs, submit button with loading state, error message display, and validation on submit. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n\ndex create \"Backend: Auth Routes\" \\\n  --parent abc123 \\\n  --description \"Add to src/routes/auth.ts: POST /login endpoint, password verification using bcrypt, JWT token generation on success. This is part of ''Add Authentication System''.\"\n```\n\nExample 3: Should NOT break down\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: Fix Typo in Error Message\n\n## Problem\n\nError message says ''Sucessful'' instead of ''Successful''\n\n## Solution\n\nFix typo in src/messages.ts line 42\n```\n\nDecision: Single cohesive task, only one change. Do NOT create subtasks.\n\n### Key Principles\n\n1. Agent judgment is critical: Use intelligence to determine if breakdown adds value\n2. Err on the side of NOT breaking down: Only break down when it clearly helps\n3. Each subtask must be meaningful: Not just a single line change\n4. Context is essential: Each subtask should have enough context to be actionable independently\n5. Preserve plan semantics: Don''t force a structure that doesn''t match the plan''s intent\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:02:26.529Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Planning Agents that need to convert markdown specifications into executable task workflows.","zh":"对于需要将Markdown规范转换为可执行任务工作流程的规划代理来说，这是必不可少的。","ja":"マークダウン仕様を実行可能なタスクワークフローに変換する必要があるプランニングエージェントにとって必須です。","ko":"Markdown 명세를 실행 가능한 작업 워크플로우로 변환해야 하는 플래닝 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de planificación que necesitan convertir especificaciones de markdown en flujos de trabajo de tareas ejecutables.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de planification qui ont besoin de convertir des spécifications markdown en flux de travail de tâches exécutables.","de":"Wesentlich für Planungsagenten, die Markdown-Spezifikationen in ausführbare Aufgaben-Workflows umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Planejamento que precisam converter especificações em markdown em fluxos de trabalho de tarefas executáveis.","ru":"Необходимо для Планирующих Агентов, которым нужно преобразовывать спецификации markdown в выполнимые рабочие процессы задач.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات تخطيط الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل مواصفات markdown إلى تدفقات عمل قابلة للتنفيذ"},"recommendation":{"en":"Converts markdown planning documents and specifications directly into trackable dex tasks through command-line invocation. Enables seamless transition from planning phase to execution phase using the dex task management system with npx fallback support.","zh":"通过命令行调用，将Markdown规划文档和规范直接转换为可追踪的dex任务。利用dex任务管理系统（支持npx后备方案），实现从规划阶段到执行阶段的无缝过渡。","ja":"コマンドライン起動を通じて、マークダウンプランニングドキュメントと仕様を直接追跡可能なdexタスクに変換します。npxフォールバックサポートを備えたdexタスク管理システムを使用して、プランニングフェーズから実行フェーズへのシームレスな移行を実現します。","ko":"명령줄 호출을 통해 Markdown 플랜 문서 및 명세를 추적 가능한 dex 작업으로 직접 변환합니다. npx 폴백 지원을 포함한 dex 작업 관리 시스템을 사용하여 플래닝 단계에서 실행 단계로의 원활한 전환을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Convierte documentos de planificación y especificaciones markdown directamente en tareas dex rastreables a través de la invocación de la línea de comandos. Permite una transición sin problemas desde la fase de planificación a la fase de ejecución utilizando el sistema de gestión de tareas dex con soporte de fallback npx.","fr":"Convertissez des documents de planification et des spécifications markdown directement en tâches dex suivies via l''invocation de la ligne de commande. Permet une transition en douceur de la phase de planification à la phase d''exécution en utilisant le système de gestion de tâches dex avec une prise en charge de fallback npx.","de":"Wandelt Markdown-Planungsdokumente und -spezifikationen direkt in nachverfolgbare dex-Aufgaben durch die Kommandozeilenaufruf um. Ermöglicht einen nahtlosen Übergang von der Planungsphase zur Ausführungsphase unter Verwendung des dex-Aufgabenmanagementsystems mit npx-Fallback-Unterstützung.","pt":"Converte documentos de planejamento markdown e especificações diretamente em tarefas dex rastreáveis por meio de invocação de linha de comando. Permite transição sem problemas da fase de planejamento para a fase de execução usando o sistema de gerenciamento de tarefas dex com suporte de fallback npx.","ru":"Преобразует документы планирования markdown и спецификации непосредственно в отслеживаемые задачи dex через командную строку. Позволяет бесшовный переход от фазы планирования к фазе выполнения с помощью системы управления задачами dex с поддержкой fallback npx.","ar":"يحول وثائق التخطيط markdown والمواصفات مباشرة إلى مهام dex قابلة للتتبع من خلال استدعاء سطر الأوامر. يتيح الانتقال السلس من مرحلة التخطيط إلى مرحلة التنفيذ باستخدام نظام إدارة المهام dex مع دعم نpx للallback"},"useCases":{"en":["Converting markdown planning documents to trackable tasks","Processing specification documents into executable workflows","Automating task creation from structured markdown content","Streamlining planning-to-execution pipeline for development agents"],"zh":["将Markdown规划文档转换为可追踪的任务","将规范文档处理为可执行的工作流程","从结构化的Markdown内容自动创建任务","为开发代理简化从规划到执行的流程"],"ja":["マークダウンプランニングドキュメントを追跡可能なタスクに変換","仕様ドキュメントを実行可能なワークフローに処理","構造化されたマークダウンコンテンツからのタスク作成の自動化","開発エージェントのためのプランニングから実行へのパイプラインの効率化"],"ko":["Markdown 플랜 문서를 추적 가능한 작업으로 변환","명세 문서를 실행 가능한 워크플로우로 처리","구조화된 Markdown 콘텐츠로부터 작업 생성 자동화","개발 에이전트를 위한 플래닝-실행 파이프라인 간소화"],"es":["Conversión de documentos de planificación markdown en tareas rastreables","Procesamiento de documentos de especificación en flujos de trabajo ejecutables","Automatización de la creación de tareas a partir de contenido markdown estructurado","Optimización de la canalización de planificación a ejecución para agentes de desarrollo"],"fr":["Conversion de documents de planification markdown en tâches suivies","Traitement de documents de spécification en flux de travail exécutables","Automatisation de la création de tâches à partir de contenu markdown structuré","Optimisation du pipeline de planification à exécution pour les agents de développement"],"de":["Umwandlung von Markdown-Planungsdokumenten in nachverfolgbare Aufgaben","Verarbeitung von Spezifikationsdokumenten in ausführbare Workflows","Automatisierung der Aufgabenbereitstellung aus strukturiertem Markdown-Inhalt","Optimierung der Planungs-Ausführungs-Pipeline für Entwicklungsagenten"],"pt":["Converte documentos de planejamento markdown em tarefas rastreáveis","Processa documentos de especificação em fluxos de trabalho executáveis","Automatiza a criação de tarefas a partir de conteúdo markdown estruturado","Otimiza o pipeline de planejamento para execução para agentes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Преобразует документы планирования markdown в отслеживаемые задачи","Обрабатывает документы спецификации в выполнимые рабочие процессы","Автоматизирует создание задач из структурированного содержимого markdown","Оптимизирует конвейер планирования-выполнения для агентов разработки"],"ar":["يحول وثائق التخطيط markdown إلى مهام قابلة للتتبع","يعالج وثائق المواصفات إلى تدفقات عمل قابلة للتنفيذ","يُ автоматيكية إنشاء المهام من المحتوى markdown المنظم","يُ tốiميز خط أنابيب التخطيط إلى التنفيذ لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires dex CLI or npx availability","Markdown format dependency for input documents","Command-line interface only, no API access"],"zh":["需要dex CLI或npx可用","输入文档依赖Markdown格式","仅提供命令行界面，无API访问"],"ja":["dex CLIまたはnpxの利用可能性が必要","入力ドキュメントはマークダウン形式に依存","コマンドラインインターフェースのみ、APIアクセスなし"],"ko":["dex CLI 또는 npx 사용 가능성 필요","입력 문서에 대한 Markdown 형식 의존성","명령줄 인터페이스만 제공, API 접근 없음"],"es":["Requiere disponibilidad de dex CLI o npx","Dependencia del formato markdown para documentos de entrada","Interfaz de línea de comandos solo, sin acceso a la API"],"fr":["Nécessite la disponibilité de dex CLI ou npx","Dépendance du format markdown pour les documents d''entrée","Interface de ligne de commande uniquement, sans accès à l''API"],"de":["Erfordert Verfügbarkeit von dex CLI oder npx","Abhängigkeit vom Markdown-Format für Eingabedokumente","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle nur, kein API-Zugriff"],"pt":["Exige disponibilidade do CLI dex ou npx","Dependência de formato markdown para documentos de entrada","Interface de linha de comando apenas, sem acesso à API"],"ru":["Требует доступности CLI dex или npx","Зависимость от формата markdown для входных документов","Только командная строка, нет доступа к API"],"ar":["يتطلب توافر واجهة سطر الأوامر dex أو npx","اعتماد تنسيق markdown لوثائق الإدخال","واجهة سطر الأوامر فقط، لا يوجد اتصال API"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
