x-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max是一个移动应用设计指南，包含50+样式、97色板、57字体配对和99个用户体验指南","ja":"UI/UX Pro Maxは、50+のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントペアと99のユーザーエクスペリエンスガイドラインを含むモバイルアプリのデザインガイドです","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 50+ 스타일, 97 색상 팔레트, 57 폰트 페어 및 99 개의 사용자 경험 가이드ライン을 포함하는 모바일 앱 디자인 가이드입니다","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles con estilos, paletas de colores y pautas de UX","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles avec des styles, des palettes de couleurs et des directives d''UX","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassendes Designhandbuch für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen mit Stilen, Farbpaletten und UX-Richtlinien","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é uma ferramenta de design de interfaces de usuário para web e mobile, com guias e recursos para desenvolvedores.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это инструмент для разработки интерфейсов пользователя для веба и мобильных приложений, с руководствами и ресурсами для разработчиков.","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هو أداة لتصميم واجهات المستخدم للويب والتطبيقات المحمولة، مع أدلة وموارد للمطورين.","en":"A mobile App based on the 1Panel Open API."},"definition":{"en":"A mobile App based on the 1Panel Open API."},"features":{"zh":["50+样式","97色板","57字体配对","99个用户体验指南","可搜索数据库"],"ja":["50+のスタイル","97のカラーパレット","57のフォントペア","99のユーザーエクスペリエンスガイドライン","検索可能なデータベース"],"ko":["50+ 스타일","97 색상 팔레트","57 폰트 페어","99 개의 사용자 경험 가이드라인","검색 가능한 데이터베이스"],"es":["50+ estilos de diseño","97 paletas de colores","57 combinaciones de fuentes","99 pautas de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"fr":["50+ styles de conception","97 palettes de couleurs","57 combinaisons de polices","99 directives d''UX","25 types de graphiques"],"de":["50+ Designstile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftkombinationen","99 UX-Richtlinien","25 Chart-Typen"],"pt":["50+ estilos de design","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["50+ стилей дизайна","97 цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 руководств по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["50+ نمط تصميم","97 لوحة ألوان","57 تركيبة خطوط","99 إرشادات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","25 نوعًا من الرسومات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动应用设计","UI/UX设计","设计智能","设计指南","可搜索数据库","用户体验"],"ja":["モバイルアプリのデザイン","UI/UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","デザインガイド","検索可能なデータベース","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["모바일 앱 디자인","UI/UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","디자인 가이드","검색 가능한 데이터베이스","사용자 경험"],"es":["diseño de UI","experiencia de usuario","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","guía de diseño","estilos de diseño","paletas de colores","pautas de UX"],"fr":["conception d''UI","expérience utilisateur","applications web","applications mobiles","guide de conception","styles de conception","palettes de couleurs","directives d''UX"],"de":["UI-Design","Benutzererfahrung","Web-Anwendungen","Mobile-Anwendungen","Designhandbuch","Designstile","Farbpaletten","UX-Richtlinien"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário","ui/ux design","ferramentas de design","guias de design","recursos de design","desenvolvimento web","desenvolvimento mobile"],"ru":["разработка интерфейсов пользователя","ui/ux дизайн","инструменты дизайна","руководства по дизайну","ресурсы дизайна","веб-разработка","мобильная разработка"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم","ui/ux تصميم","أدوات التصميم","دلائل التصميم","موارد التصميم","تطوير الويب","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة"]}},"owner":"IsKenKenYa","repo":"Open1PanelApp","repoPath":"IsKenKenYa/Open1PanelApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implem","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\r\n\r\n## Rule Categories by Priority\r\n\r\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\r\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\r\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\r\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\r\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\r\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\r\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\r\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\r\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\r\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\r\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\r\n\r\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\r\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\r\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\r\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\r\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\r\n\r\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\r\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\r\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\r\n\r\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\r\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\r\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\r\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\r\n\r\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\r\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\r\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\r\n\r\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\r\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\r\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\r\n\r\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\r\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\r\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\r\n\r\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\r\n\r\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\r\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\r\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\r\n\r\n## How to Use\r\n\r\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\nCheck if Python is installed:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 --version || python --version\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\r\n\r\n**macOS:**\r\n```bash\r\nbrew install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\r\n```bash\r\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Windows:**\r\n```powershell\r\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\r\n\r\nExtract key information from user request:\r\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\r\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\r\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\r\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command:\r\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\r\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\r\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\r\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**When to use detailed searches:**\r\n\r\n| Need | Domain | Example |\r\n|------|--------|---------|\r\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\r\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\r\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\r\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\r\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\r\n\r\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Search Reference\r\n\r\n### Available Domains\r\n\r\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\r\n|--------|---------|------------------|\r\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\r\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\r\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\r\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\r\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\r\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\r\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\r\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\r\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\r\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\r\n\r\n### Available Stacks\r\n\r\n| Stack | Focus |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\r\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\r\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\r\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\r\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\r\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\r\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\r\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\r\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Example Workflow\r\n\r\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\r\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\r\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\r\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\r\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\r\n\r\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Output Formats\r\n\r\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\r\n\r\n# Markdown - best for documentation\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips for Better Results\r\n\r\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\r\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\r\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\r\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\r\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\r\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\r\n\r\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\r\n\r\n### Icons & Visual Elements\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\r\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\r\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\r\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\r\n\r\n### Interaction & Cursor\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\r\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\r\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\r\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\r\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\r\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\r\n\r\n### Layout & Spacing\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\r\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\r\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\r\n\r\n### Visual Quality\r\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\r\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\r\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\r\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\r\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\r\n\r\n### Interaction\r\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\r\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\r\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\r\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode\r\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\r\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\r\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\r\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\r\n\r\n### Layout\r\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\r\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\r\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\r\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\r\n\r\n### Accessibility\r\n- [ ] All images have alt text\r\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\r\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\r\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:02:37.731Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-focused Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines and recommendations for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面UI/UX指南和网页及移动应用程序推荐的设计导向型Agent。","ja":"デザイン重視のエージェントが、Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションに対する包括的なUI/UXガイドラインと推奨事項を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"디자인 중심의 에이전트가 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션에 대한 포괄적인 UI/UX 가이드라인 및 권장 사항을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en diseño que necesitan directrices y recomendaciones de UI/UX integrales para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur la conception nécessitant des directives et des recommandations de UI/UX globales pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien und Empfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Design que necessitam de diretrizes e recomendações abrangentes de UI/UX para aplicativos web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым требуются комплексные рекомендации и руководство по UI/UX для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على التصميم وهم في حاجة إلى إرشادات شاملة وتوصيات لتحسين واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم للويب والتطبيقات المتنقلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces by leveraging 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring adherence to 99 UX guidelines and compatibility across 9 technology stacks, utilizing a searchable database with priority-based recommendations.","zh":"通过利用50+样式、97种颜色调色板和57种字体配对，同时确保遵守99个UX指南和跨9个技术栈的兼容性，使用带有优先级推荐的可搜索数据库，使得代理能够创建视觉上吸引人和用户友好的接口。","ja":"50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントペアを活用し、99のUXガイドラインに従ったり、9つのテクノロジースタックに対する互換性を保ったりすることで、エージェントが視覚的に魅力的でユーザーに優しいインターフェイスを作成できるようにします。また、優先順位に基づく推奨事項を搭載した検索可能なデータベースを使用します。","ko":"50가지 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 폰트 페어를 활용하여 99개의 UX 가이드라인을 준수하고 9개의 기술 스택에서 호환성을 보장하는 동시에 우선순위에 기반한 추천을 제공하는 검색 가능한 데이터베이스를 사용하여 에이전트가 시각적으로 매력적이고 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visualmente atractivas y de fácil uso aprovechando más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, garantizando al mismo tiempo el cumplimiento de 99 directrices de UX y la compatibilidad en 9 pilas de tecnología, utilizando una base de datos searchable con recomendaciones basadas en prioridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes et conviviales en exploitant plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en garantissant le respect de 99 directives d''UX et la compatibilité sur 9 piles technologiques, en utilisant une base de données consultable avec des recommandations basées sur la priorité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell ansprechende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem es mehr als 50 Stile, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen nutzt und gleichzeitig die Einhaltung von 99 UX-Richtlinien und die Kompatibilität in 9 Technologie-Stacks sicherstellt, wobei es eine durchsuchbare Datenbank mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente atraentes e amigáveis ao usuário, aproveitando mais de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a adesão a 99 diretrizes de UX e compatibilidade em 9 pilhas de tecnologia, utilizando um banco de dados pesquisável com recomendações baseadas em prioridade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально привлекательные и удобные для пользователя интерфейсы, используя более 50 стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 парных шрифтов, обеспечивая при этом соблюдение 99 рекомендаций по UX и совместимость на 9 технологических стеках, используя поисковую базу данных с рекомендациями, основанными на приоритете.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مرئية جذابة وسهلة الاستخدام من خلال الاستفادة من أكثر من 50 نمطًا و97 لوحة ألوان و57 زوجًا من الخطوط، مع ضمان الامتثال ل99 إرشادة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم ومتوافق مع 9 مجموعات تكنولوجية، باستخدام قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث مع توصيات قائمة على الأهمية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color schemes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and providing data-driven recommendations","Building landing pages or dashboards with pre-defined chart types and design intelligence"],"zh":["设计新的UI组件或页面，优化颜色方案和字体样式","审查代码以查找UX问题并提供数据驱动的推荐","使用预定义的图表类型和设计智能构建登陆页面或仪表板"],"ja":["最適化されたカラースキームとタイポグラフィを持つ新しいUIコンポーネントまたはページを設計する","UXの問題を特定し、データ駆動型の推奨事項を提供するためのコードのレビュー","事前に定義されたチャートタイプとデザインインテリジェンスを使用して、ランディングページまたはダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["최적화된 색상 구성표와 타이포그래피를 가진 새로운 UI 구성 요소 또는 페이지를 설계합니다.","UX 문제를 식별하고 데이터 주도형 추천을 제공하기 위한 코드 검토","사전 정의된 차트 유형과 디자인 인텔리เจンス를 사용하여 랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드를 구축합니다."],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con esquemas de color y tipografía optimizados","Revisar el código para problemas de UX y proporcionar recomendaciones basadas en datos","Crear páginas de destino o paneles de control con tipos de gráficos predefinidos e inteligencia de diseño"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur ou des pages avec des schémas de couleur et de typographie optimisés","Examiner le code pour les problèmes d''UX et fournir des recommandations basées sur les données","Créer des pages de destination ou des tableaux de bord avec des types de graphiques prédéfinis et une intelligence de conception"],"de":["Neue UI-Komponenten oder Seiten mit optimierten Farbschemata und Typografie entwerfen","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und datenbasierte Empfehlungen bereitstellen","Landingpages oder Dashboards mit vordefinierten Charttypen und Designintelligenz erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar novos componentes de interface do usuário ou páginas com esquemas de cor otimizados e tipografia","Revisar código para problemas de UX e fornecer recomendações baseadas em dados","Construir páginas de destino ou painéis com tipos de gráficos pré-definidos e inteligência de design"],"ru":["Проектировать новые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса или страницы с оптимизированными цветовыми схемами и типографией","Проверять код на проблемы с UX и предоставлять рекомендации, основанные на данных","Создавать посадочные страницы или панели с предопределенными типами графиков и интеллектом дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع مخططات الألوان المُحسّنة وطباعة الحروف","مراجعة الشفرة المتعلقة بأخطاء تحسين تجربة المستخدم وتقديم توصيات قائمة على البيانات","بناء صفحات الهبوط أو لوحات القيادة مع أنواع الرسومات المحددة مسبقًا وذكاء التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the 1Panel Open API","Limited to design guidance for web and mobile applications"],"zh":["需要访问1Panel Open API","仅限于网页和移动应用程序的设计指导"],"ja":["1Panel Open APIへのアクセスが必要","Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションの設計ガイダンスのみに限定される"],"ko":["1Panel Open API에 접근할 수 있어야 합니다.","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션의 디자인 가이드에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API abierta de 1Panel","Limitado a la orientación de diseño para aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API ouverte 1Panel","Limité à la direction de conception pour les applications Web et mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die 1Panel-Open-API","Begrenzt auf Designanleitung für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API Aberta do 1Panel","Limitado a orientação de design para aplicativos web e móveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к открытому API 1Panel","Ограничен руководством по дизайну для веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المفتوحة من 1Panel","محدود بالتوجيه التصميمي لتطبيقات الويب والمتنقلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
