ectrices UX","25 types de graphiques"],"de":["50+ Designstile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftkombinationen","99 UX-Richtlinien","25 Grafiktypen"],"pt":["50+ estilos de design","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["50+ стилей дизайна","97 цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 руководств по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["50+ أسلوب تصميم","97 صفوف الألوان","57 تركيبات الخطوط","99 إرشادات UX","25 نوعًا من الرسوم البيانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计指南","开发者工具","前端开发","网页设计","移动应用设计","设计系统","UI/UX设计"],"ja":["UIデザイン","UXデザイン","設計ガイド","開発者ツール","フロントエンド開発","ウェブデザイン","モバイルアプリデザイン","デザインシステム","UI/UXデザイン"],"ko":["UI디자인","UX디자인","디자인 가이드","개발자 도구","프론트엔드 개발","웹 디자인","모바일 애플리케이션 디자인","디자인 시스템","UI/UX디자인"],"es":["diseño UI/UX","guias de diseño","estilos de diseño","paletas de colores","fuentes y tipografía","UX y accesibilidad","desarrollo web","aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["conception UI/UX","guides de conception","styles de conception","palettes de couleurs","polices et typographie","UX et accessibilité","développement Web","applications mobiles"],"de":["UI/UX-Design","Designleitfäden","Designstile","Farbpaletten","Schriftarten und Typografie","UX und Barrierefreiheit","Webentwicklung","Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["ui/ux design","desenvolvimento web","aplicativos móveis","guias de design","estilos de design","paletas de cores","combinações de fontes","diretrizes de UX"],"ru":["ui/ux дизайн","веб-разработка","мобильные приложения","руководства по дизайну","стили дизайна","цветовые палитры","комбинации шрифтов","руководства по UX"],"ar":["تصميم ui/ux","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات الجوال","دلائل التصميم","أساليب التصميم","صفوف الألوان","تركيبات الخطوط","إرشادات UX"]}},"owner":"codelabsab","repo":"codelabs.se","repoPath":"codelabsab/codelabs.se","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implem","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\r\n\r\n## Rule Categories by Priority\r\n\r\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\r\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\r\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\r\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\r\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\r\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\r\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\r\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\r\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\r\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\r\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\r\n\r\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\r\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\r\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\r\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\r\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\r\n\r\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\r\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\r\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\r\n\r\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\r\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\r\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\r\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\r\n\r\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\r\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\r\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\r\n\r\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\r\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\r\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\r\n\r\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\r\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\r\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\r\n\r\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\r\n\r\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\r\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\r\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\r\n\r\n## How to Use\r\n\r\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\nCheck if Python is installed:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 --version || python --version\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\r\n\r\n**macOS:**\r\n```bash\r\nbrew install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\r\n```bash\r\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Windows:**\r\n```powershell\r\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\r\n\r\nExtract key information from user request:\r\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\r\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\r\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\r\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command:\r\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\r\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\r\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\r\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**When to use detailed searches:**\r\n\r\n| Need | Domain | Example |\r\n|------|--------|---------|\r\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\r\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\r\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\r\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\r\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\r\n\r\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Search Reference\r\n\r\n### Available Domains\r\n\r\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\r\n|--------|---------|------------------|\r\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\r\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\r\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\r\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\r\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\r\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\r\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\r\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\r\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\r\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\r\n\r\n### Available Stacks\r\n\r\n| Stack | Focus |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\r\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\r\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\r\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\r\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\r\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\r\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\r\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\r\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Example Workflow\r\n\r\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\r\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\r\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\r\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\r\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\r\n\r\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Output Formats\r\n\r\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\r\n\r\n# Markdown - best for documentation\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips for Better Results\r\n\r\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\r\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\r\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\r\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\r\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\r\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\r\n\r\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\r\n\r\n### Icons & Visual Elements\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\r\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\r\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\r\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\r\n\r\n### Interaction & Cursor\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\r\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\r\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\r\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\r\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\r\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\r\n\r\n### Layout & Spacing\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\r\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\r\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\r\n\r\n### Visual Quality\r\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\r\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\r\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\r\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\r\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\r\n\r\n### Interaction\r\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\r\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\r\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\r\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode\r\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\r\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\r\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\r\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\r\n\r\n### Layout\r\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\r\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\r\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\r\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\r\n\r\n### Accessibility\r\n- [ ] All images have alt text\r\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\r\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\r\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:02:53.930Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX design guidance for web and mobile applications in Next.js 13","zh":"非常适合需要全面UI/UX设计指导的前端代理，用于Next.js 13的网页和移动应用程序","ja":"Next.js 13のウェブおよびモバイルアプリケーションに対する包括的なUI/UXデザインガイダンスを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Next.js 13의 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션에 대한 포괄적인 UI/UX 디자인 가이드가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan una guía de diseño de UI/UX integral para aplicaciones web y móviles en Next.js 13","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une guidance complète de conception UI/UX pour les applications web et mobiles dans Next.js 13","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine umfassende UI/UX-Designanleitung für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen in Next.js 13 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de orientação abrangente de design UI/UX para aplicativos web e móveis no Next.js 13","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется комплексное руководство по дизайну UI/UX для веб- и мобильных приложений в Next.js 13","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة لتصميم UI/UX لتطبيقات الويب والأجهزة المحمولة في Next.js 13"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually stunning and user-friendly interfaces with 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring 99 UX guidelines are met, utilizing searchable databases with priority-based recommendations for technology stacks including Next.js","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉效果惊人且用户友好的界面，拥有50+样式、97色板和57字体配对，同时确保满足99个UX指南，利用具有优先级推荐的可搜索数据库，包括Next.js在内的技术栈","ja":"エージェントが、50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントのペアリングを備えた、視覚的に惊くばかりでユーザーに優しいインターフェースを作成できるようにし、99のUXガイドラインを満たすとともに、Next.jsを含む技術スタックに対する優先度ベースの推奨事項を備えた検索可能なデータベースを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 50가지 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57가지 폰트 페어링을 갖춘 시각적으로惊艳한 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 99개의 UX 지침을 충족하고 Next.js를 포함한 기술 스택에 대한 우선순위 기반 추천 사항을 갖춘 검색 가능한 데이터베이스를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visualmente impresionantes y fáciles de usar con más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, al mismo tiempo que se garantiza el cumplimiento de las 99 pautas de UX, utilizando bases de datos buscables con recomendaciones basadas en prioridades para pilas tecnológicas que incluyen Next.js","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement époustouflantes et conviviales avec plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en garantissant le respect des 99 lignes directrices UX, en utilisant des bases de données consultables avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités pour les piles technologiques incluant Next.js","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, visuell beeindruckende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen mit über 50 Stilen, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen zu erstellen, während gleichzeitig die Einhaltung der 99 UX-Richtlinien sichergestellt wird, unter Nutzung von durchsuchbaren Datenbanken mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen für Technologiestacks, einschließlich Next.js","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente deslumbrantes e amigáveis ao usuário com mais de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo que sejam atendidas 99 diretrizes de UX, utilizando bancos de dados pesquisáveis com recomendações baseadas em prioridade para pilhas de tecnologia, incluindo Next.js","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально впечатляющие и удобные для пользователя интерфейсы с более чем 50 стилями, 97 цветовыми палитрами и 57 комбинациями шрифтов, обеспечивая соблюдение 99 руководств по UX, используя поисковые базы данных с рекомендациями, основанными на приоритете, для стеков технологий, включая Next.js","ar":"يتمكن العميل من إنشاء واجهات مرئية مبهرة وسهلة الاستخدام مع أكثر من 50 نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان و 57 زوجًا من الخطوط ، مع ضمان اتباع 99 إرشادة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم ، باستخدام قواعد بيانات قابلة للبحث مع توصيات تستند إلى الأولوية لمجموعات التكنولوجيا ، بما في ذلك Next.js"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color schemes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing 25 chart types for enhanced data visualization","Building landing pages or dashboards with consistent design language across 9 technology stacks"],"zh":["使用优化的色彩方案和字体设计新的UI组件或页面","审查代码中的UX问题并实施25种图表类型以增强数据可视化","使用一致的设计语言跨9个技术栈构建登陆页面或仪表板"],"ja":["最適化された色彩スキームとタイポグラフィを使用して新しいUIコンポーネントまたはページを設計する","コード内のUXの問題をレビューし、データの視覚化を強化するために25種類のチャートタイプを実装する","9つの技術スタックにわたる一貫したデザイン言語を使用してランディングページまたはダッシュボードを構築する"],"ko":["최적화된 색상 구성표와 타이포그래피를 사용하여 새로운 UI 구성 요소 또는 페이지를 디자인","코드의 UX 문제를 검토하고 데이터 시각화를 강화하기 위해 25가지 차트 유형을 구현","9개의 기술 스택에 걸쳐 일관된 디자인 언어를 사용하여 랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드를 구축"],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con esquemas de color y tipografía optimizados","Revisar el código para problemas de UX e implementar 25 tipos de gráficos para una visualización de datos mejorada","Crear páginas de aterrizaje o paneles de control con un lenguaje de diseño coherente en 9 pilas tecnológicas"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants UI ou pages avec des schémas de couleur et une typographie optimisés","Réviser le code pour les problèmes d''UX et mettre en œuvre 25 types de graphiques pour une visualisation de données améliorée","Créer des pages de destination ou des tableaux de bord avec un langage de conception cohérent sur 9 piles technologiques"],"de":["Neue UI-Komponenten oder Seiten mit optimierten Farbschemata und Typografie entwerfen","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und 25 Charttypen für eine verbesserte Datenvisualisierung implementieren","Landingpages oder Dashboards mit einem konsistenten Designsprach auf 9 Technologiestacks erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar novos componentes da interface do usuário ou páginas com esquemas de cores e tipografia otimizados","Revisar código para problemas de UX e implementar 25 tipos de gráficos para visualização de dados aprimorada","Construir páginas de destino ou painéis com linguagem de design consistente em 9 pilhas de tecnologia"],"ru":["Проектировать новые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса или страницы с оптимизированными цветовыми схемами и типографией","Проверять код на наличие проблем с UX и реализовывать 25 типов графиков для улучшения визуализации данных","Создавать целевые страницы или панели с согласованной языком дизайна в 9 стеках технологий"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع مخططات الألوان والطباعة المطبعية المُحسّنة","مراجعة الشفرة للعثور على مشاكل في تجربة المستخدم وتطبيق 25 نوعًا من الرسومات لتحسين تجسير البيانات","بناء صفحات الهبوط أو لوحات التحكم مع لغة تصميم متسقة عبر 9 مجموعات تقنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js 13 compatibility","Limited to web and mobile application design"],"zh":["需要Next.js 13兼容性","仅限于网页和移动应用程序设计"],"ja":["Next.js 13の互換性が必要","ウェブおよびモバイルアプリケーションのデザインのみ"],"ko":["Next.js 13 호환성 필요","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인만 해당"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Next.js 13","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Next.js 13","Limité à la conception d''applications web et mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js 13-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o Next.js 13","Limitado ao design de aplicativos web e móveis"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Next.js 13","Ограничен дизайном веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Next.js 13","محدود بتصميم تطبيقات الويب والأجهزة المحمولة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('motoya0118/pavlok_CLI_agent/pavlok', 'community', 'motoya0118', 'pavlok_CLI_agent', 'motoya0118/pavlok_CLI_agent', 'pavlok', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:03:11.324Z', NULL, '{"id":"motoya0118/pavlok_CLI_agent/pavlok","name":"pavlok","description":{"zh":"Pavlok API scripts/pavlok.py","ja":"PavlokAPI scripts/pavlok.py","ko":"Pavlok API scripts/pavlok.py","es":"Pavlok es una herramienta que permite enviar estímulos a través de la API. Utiliza scripts/pavlok.py para enviar un estímulo al usuario","fr":"Pavlok est un outil qui permet d''envoyer des stimuli via l''API. Utilisez scripts/pavlok.py pour envoyer un stimulus à l''utilisateur","de":"Pavlok ist ein Tool, das das Senden von Stimuli über die API ermöglicht. Verwenden Sie scripts/pavlok.py, um einen Stimulus an den Benutzer zu senden","pt":"O Pavlok é uma ferramenta de estímulo que pode ser controlada por CLI, permitindo a criação de estímulos personalizados","ru":"Pavlok - это инструмент стимуляции, который можно контролировать через CLI, что позволяет создавать индивидуальные стимулы","ar":"بافلوك هو أداة إشارات يمكن التحكم فيها من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر، مما يسمح بإنشاء إشارات مخصصة","en":"CLI agentにpavlokを使用させたらどうなるか自傷実験"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Pavlok API ","ja":"PavlokAPI","ko":"Pavlok API ","es":"Pavlok: Estimulación a través de la API","fr":"Pavlok: Stimulation via l''API","de":"Pavlok: Stimulierung über die API","pt":"Pavlok: Estímulo por CLI","ru":"Pavlok: стимул через CLI","ar":"بافلوك: إشارات من واجهة سطر الأوامر","en":"pavlok"},"description":{"zh":"Pavlok API scripts/pavlok.py","ja":"PavlokAPI scripts/pavlok.py","ko":"Pavlok API scripts/pavlok.py","es":"Pavlok es una herramienta que permite enviar estímulos a través de la API. Utiliza scripts/pavlok.py para enviar un estímulo al usuario","fr":"Pavlok est un outil qui permet d''envoyer des stimuli via l''API. Utilisez scripts/pavlok.py pour envoyer un stimulus à l''utilisateur","de":"Pavlok ist ein Tool, das das Senden von Stimuli über die API ermöglicht. Verwenden Sie scripts/pavlok.py, um einen Stimulus an den Benutzer zu senden","pt":"O Pavlok é uma ferramenta de estímulo que pode ser controlada por CLI, permitindo a criação de estímulos personalizados","ru":"Pavlok - это инструмент стимуляции, который можно контролировать через CLI, что позволяет создавать индивидуальные стимулы","ar":"بافلوك هو أداة إشارات يمكن التحكم فيها من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر، مما يسمح بإنشاء إشارات مخصصة","en":"CLI agentにpavlokを使用させたらどうなるか自傷実験"},"definition":{"en":"CLI agentにpavlokを使用させたらどうなるか自傷実験"},"features":{"zh":["Pavlok API","scripts/pavlok.py","stimulusType","stimulusValue","reason"],"ja":["PavlokAPI","scripts/pavlok.py","stimulusType","stimulusValue","reason"],"ko":["Pavlok API","scripts/pavlok.py","stimulusType","stimulusValue","reason"],"es":["Envío de estímulos a través de la API","Compatibilidad con varios tipos de estímulos (vibe, beep, zap)","Requiere clave de API Pavlok","Soporte para entornos de desarrollo","Limitaciones de estímulo configurable"],"fr":["Envoi de stimuli via l''API","Compatibilité avec plusieurs types de stimuli (vibe, beep, zap)","Nécessite une clé d''API Pavlok","Prise en charge des environnements de développement","Limitations de stimulus configurables"],"de":["Senden von Stimuli über die API","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Stimulustypen (vibe, beep, zap)","Benötigt einen Pavlok-API-Schlüssel","Unterstützung für Entwicklungsumgebungen","Konfigurierbare Stimulusbegrenzungen"],"pt":["Envio de estímulos personalizados","Controle por CLI","Integração com API","Suporte a vários tipos de estímulos","Configuração de limites de estímulo"],"ru":["Отправка индивидуальных стимулов","Контроль через CLI","Интеграция с API","Поддержка нескольких типов стимулов","Настройка пределов стимуляции"],"ar":["إرسال إشارات مخصصة","التحكم من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم أنواع متعددة من الإشارات","تكوين حدود الإشارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pavlok API","CLI","API","stimulusType","stimulusValue","reason","Pavlok"],"ja":["PavlokAPI","CLI","API","stimulusType","stimulusValue","reason","Pavlok"],"ko":["Pavlok API","CLI","API","stimulusType","stimulusValue","reason","Pavlok"],"es":["Pavlok API","estimulación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","API de estimulación","envío de estímulos"],"fr":["Pavlok API","stimulation","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","API de stimulation","envoi de stimuli"],"de":["Pavlok API","Stimulierung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Stimulierungs-API","Stimuli senden"],"pt":["Pavlok","CLI","estímulo","API","desenvolvimento","programação","automatização"],"ru":["Pavlok","CLI","стимул","API","разработка","программирование","автоматизация"],"ar":["بافلوك","واجهة سطر الأوامر","إشارات","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","التطوير","البرمجة","الآلي"]}},"owner":"motoya0118","repo":"pavlok_CLI_agent","repoPath":"motoya0118/pavlok_CLI_agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pavlok","description":"Send a Pavlok stimulus via the Pavlok API using scripts/pavlok.py. Use when you need to trigger vibe/beep/zap with a numeric value in this repo and print the API response.","bodyPreview":"# Pavlok Stimulus\n\nUse `scripts/pavlok.py` to send a stimulus to the Pavlok API.\n\n## Run\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/pavlok.py zap 30 \"reason for trigger\"\n```\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `stimulusType` is a string such as `vibe`, `beep`, or `zap`.\n- `stimulusValue` is an integer.\n- `reason` is required by the CLI parser but is not currently sent to the API.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Requires `PAVLOK_API_KEY` in `.env` or the environment.\n- For `zap`, `LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS` and `LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE` are required. If the","body":"# Pavlok Stimulus\n\nUse `scripts/pavlok.py` to send a stimulus to the Pavlok API.\n\n## Run\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/pavlok.py zap 30 \"reason for trigger\"\n```\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `stimulusType` is a string such as `vibe`, `beep`, or `zap`.\n- `stimulusValue` is an integer.\n- `reason` is required by the CLI parser but is not currently sent to the API.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Requires `PAVLOK_API_KEY` in `.env` or the environment.\n- For `zap`, `LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS` and `LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE` are required. If the daily zap limit is exceeded, the script returns a JSON object with `skipped: true` and `reason: \"limit_reached\"`. If the value is above the limit, it is clamped to `LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:03:11.324Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CLI Agents requiring Pavlok API integration for custom stimulus triggering","zh":"适用于需要Pavlok API集成以触发自定义刺激的CLI代理","ja":"Pavlok APIを介してカスタム刺激をトリガーする必要があるCLIエージェントに適しています","ko":"사용자 정의 자극을 트리거하는 데 Pavlok API 통합이 필요한 CLI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de CLI que requieren integración con la API de Pavlok para activar estímulos personalizados","fr":"Idéal pour les agents CLI nécessitant une intégration à l''API Pavlok pour déclencher des stimuli personnalisés","de":"Ideal für CLI-Agents, die eine Pavlok-API-Integration für die Auslösung benutzerdefinierter Reize erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes CLI que exigem integração com a API Pavlok para disparar estímulos personalizados","ru":"Идеально для агентов CLI, требующих интеграции с API Pavlok для запуска пользовательских стимулов","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يتطلب تكامل API Pavlok لتحفيز الاستجابة المخصصة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to send targeted stimuli to the Pavlok API, including vibe, beep, or zap signals, using scripts like pavlok.py with environment variables such as PAVLOK_API_KEY and LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS","zh":"赋予代理发送目标刺激至Pavlok API的能力，包括vibe、beep或zap信号，使用如pavlok.py的脚本以及环境变量，如PAVLOK_API_KEY和LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS","ja":"エージェントに、vibe、beep、またはzap信号を含むターゲット刺激をPavlok APIに送信する機能を提供します。pavlok.pyなどのスクリプトと、PAVLOK_API_KEYやLIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTSなどの環境変数を使用します","ko":"에이전트가 타겟 자극을 Pavlok API에 보내는 기능을 제공합니다. 이는 vibe, beep 또는 zap 신호를 포함하며 pavlok.py와 같은 스크립트와 PAVLOK_API_KEY 및 LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS와 같은 환경 변수를 사용합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes enviar estímulos dirigidos a la API de Pavlok, incluyendo señales de vibración, beep o zap, utilizando scripts como pavlok.py con variables de entorno como PAVLOK_API_KEY y LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des stimuli ciblés à l''API Pavlok, notamment des signaux de vibration, de beep ou de zap, en utilisant des scripts tels que pavlok.py avec des variables d''environnement telles que PAVLOK_API_KEY et LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, gezielte Reize an die Pavlok-API zu senden, einschließlich Vibration-, Beep- oder Zap-Signalen, unter Verwendung von Skripten wie pavlok.py mit Umgebungsvariablen wie PAVLOK_API_KEY und LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS","pt":"Habilita os agentes a enviar estímulos direcionados para a API Pavlok, incluindo sinais de vibração, sinal sonoro ou choque, usando scripts como pavlok.py com variáveis de ambiente como PAVLOK_API_KEY e LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность отправлять целевые стимулы в API Pavlok, включая вибрационные, звуковые или ударные сигналы, используя скрипты типа pavlok.py с переменными окружения, такими как PAVLOK_API_KEY и LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إرسال محفزات موجهة إلى API Pavlok، بما في ذلك إشارات الاهتزاز أو الصفير أو الصدمة، باستخدام سكريبتات مثل pavlok.py مع متغيرات البيئة مثل PAVLOK_API_KEY و LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS"},"useCases":{"en":["Triggering custom zaps for specific reasons","Automating vibe or beep signals based on agent conditions","Integrating Pavlok stimuli into larger behavioral modification flows"],"zh":["针对特定原因触发自定义的zap","根据代理条件自动化vibe或beep信号","将Pavlok刺激集成到更大的行为修正流程中"],"ja":["特定の理由に基づいてカスタムのzapをトリガーする","エージェントの条件に基づいてvibeまたはbeep信号を自動化する","Pavlok刺激をより大きな行動修正フローに統合する"],"ko":["특정 이유에 대한 사용자 정의 zap 트리거","에이전트 조건에 따라 vibe 또는 beep 신호 자동화","より 큰 행동 수정 흐름에 Pavlok 자극 통합"],"es":["Activar zaps personalizados por razones específicas","Automatizar señales de vibración o beep en función de las condiciones del agente","Integrar estímulos de Pavlok en flujos de modificación de comportamiento más grandes"],"fr":["Déclencher des zaps personnalisés pour des raisons spécifiques","Automatiser les signaux de vibration ou de beep en fonction des conditions de l''agent","Intégrer les stimuli de Pavlok dans des flux de modification de comportement plus importants"],"de":["Aktivieren von benutzerdefinierten Zaps aus bestimmten Gründen","Automatisieren von Vibration- oder Beep-Signalen basierend auf den Bedingungen des Agents","Integrieren von Pavlok-Reizen in größere Verhaltensmodifikationsflüsse"],"pt":["Disparar zaps personalizados por razões específicas","Automatizar sinais de vibração ou sinal sonoro com base em condições do agente","Integrar estímulos Pavlok em fluxos de modificação comportamental mais amplos"],"ru":["Запуск пользовательских ударов по конкретным причинам","Автоматизация вибрационных или звуковых сигналов на основе условий агента","Интеграция стимулов Pavlok в более крупные потоки модификации поведения"],"ar":["تشغيل صدمات مخصصة لأسباب محددة","توفير إشارات اهتزازية أو صوتية تلقائية استنادا إلى شروط العميل","دمج محفزات Pavlok في تدفقات تعديل السلوك الأكبر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PAVLOK_API_KEY in .env or environment","LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS and LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE required for zap stimuli","Currently only supports string inputs for stimulusType and reason"],"zh":[".env或环境中需要PAVLOK_API_KEY","zap刺激需要LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS和LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE","目前仅支持string输入用于stimulusType和reason"],"ja":[".envまたは環境にPAVLOK_API_KEYが必要","zap刺激にはLIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTSとLIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUEが必要","現在、stimulusTypeとreasonの入力は文字列のみをサポート"],"ko":[".env 또는 환경에서 PAVLOK_API_KEY가 필요함","zap 자극에는 LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS 및 LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE가 필요함","현재 stimulusType 및 reason의 입력은 문자열만 지원"],"es":["Requiere PAVLOK_API_KEY en .env o entorno","Se requieren LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS y LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE para estímulos de zap","Actualmente solo admite entradas de cadena para stimulusType y reason"],"fr":["Nécessite PAVLOK_API_KEY dans .env ou l''environnement","LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS et LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE sont nécessaires pour les stimuli de zap","Actuellement, ne prend en charge que les entrées de chaîne pour stimulusType et reason"],"de":["Benötigt PAVLOK_API_KEY in .env oder Umgebung","LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS und LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE werden für Zap-Reize benötigt","Unterstützt derzeit nur Zeichenfolgen-Eingaben für stimulusType und reason"],"pt":["Exige PAVLOK_API_KEY em .env ou ambiente","LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS e LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE são necessários para estímulos de choque","Atualmente suporta apenas entradas de string para stimulusType e reason"],"ru":["Требует PAVLOK_API_KEY в .env или окружении","LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS и LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE необходимы для стимулов удара","В настоящее время поддерживает только строковые входные данные для stimulusType и reason"],"ar":["يتطلب PAVLOK_API_KEY في .env أو بيئة","LIMIT_DAY_PAVLOK_COUNTS و LIMIT_PAVLOK_ZAP_VALUE مطلوبان لمحفزات الصدمة","يدعم حاليًا إدخالات السلاسل فقط لنوع المحفز والسبب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
