seño","97 paletas de colores personalizables","57 parejas de fuentes para una tipografía óptima","99 pautas de UX para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","25 tipos de gráficos para una visualización de datos efectiva"],"fr":["Plus de 50 styles de conception","97 palettes de couleurs personnalisables","57 paires de polices pour une typographie optimale","99 directives UX pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","25 types de graphiques pour une visualisation de données efficace"],"de":["Mehr als 50 Design-Styles","97 anpassbare Farbpaletten","57 Schriftartenpaare für eine optimale Typografie","99 UX-Richtlinien für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","25 Chart-Typen für eine effektive Datenvisualisierung"],"pt":["Mais de 50 estilos","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["Более 50 стилей","97 цветовых палитр","57 пар шрифтов","99 рекомендаций по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["أكثر من 50 نمطًا","97 لوحة ألوان","57 تركيبة من الخطوط","99 إرشادًا لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","25 نوعًا من الرسوم البيانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计智能","设计指南","用户体验","网页设计","移动应用设计"],"ja":["UIデザイン","UXデザイン","設計インテリジェンス","設計ガイド","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ウェブデザイン","モバイルアプリケーションデザイン"],"ko":["UI 디자인","UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","디자인 가이드","사용자 경험","웹 디자인","모바일 애플리케이션 디자인"],"es":["diseño de aplicaciones web","diseño de aplicaciones móviles","experiencia de usuario","guias de diseño","estilos de diseño","paletas de colores","tipografía","UX","UI"],"fr":["conception d''applications web","conception d''applications mobiles","expérience utilisateur","guides de conception","styles de conception","palettes de couleurs","typographie","UX","UI"],"de":["Web-Anwendungs-Design","Mobile-Anwendungs-Design","Benutzererfahrung","Design-Leitfäden","Design-Styles","Farbpaletten","Typografie","UX","UI"],"pt":["design de interface de usuário","guias de design","aplicativos web","aplicativos móveis","UX","UI","estilos de design","paletas de cores"],"ru":["дизайн интерфейса пользователя","руководства по дизайну","веб-приложения","мобильные приложения","UX","UI","стили дизайна","цветовые палитры"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","دلائل التصميم","التطبيقات الويب","التطبيقات الموبايل","UX","UI","أنماط التصميم","اللوحات الألوان"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implem","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\r\n\r\n## Rule Categories by Priority\r\n\r\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\r\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\r\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\r\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\r\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\r\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\r\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\r\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\r\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\r\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\r\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\r\n\r\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\r\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\r\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\r\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\r\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\r\n\r\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\r\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\r\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\r\n\r\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\r\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\r\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\r\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\r\n\r\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\r\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\r\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\r\n\r\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\r\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\r\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\r\n\r\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\r\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\r\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\r\n\r\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\r\n\r\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\r\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\r\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\r\n\r\n## How to Use\r\n\r\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\nCheck if Python is installed:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 --version || python --version\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\r\n\r\n**macOS:**\r\n```bash\r\nbrew install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\r\n```bash\r\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Windows:**\r\n```powershell\r\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\r\n\r\nExtract key information from user request:\r\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\r\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\r\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\r\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command:\r\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\r\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\r\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\r\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**When to use detailed searches:**\r\n\r\n| Need | Domain | Example |\r\n|------|--------|---------|\r\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\r\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\r\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\r\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\r\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\r\n\r\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Search Reference\r\n\r\n### Available Domains\r\n\r\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\r\n|--------|---------|------------------|\r\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\r\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\r\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\r\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\r\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\r\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\r\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\r\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\r\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\r\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\r\n\r\n### Available Stacks\r\n\r\n| Stack | Focus |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\r\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\r\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\r\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\r\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\r\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\r\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\r\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\r\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Example Workflow\r\n\r\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\r\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\r\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\r\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\r\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\r\n\r\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Output Formats\r\n\r\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\r\n\r\n# Markdown - best for documentation\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips for Better Results\r\n\r\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\r\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\r\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\r\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\r\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\r\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\r\n\r\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\r\n\r\n### Icons & Visual Elements\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\r\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\r\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\r\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\r\n\r\n### Interaction & Cursor\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\r\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\r\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\r\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\r\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\r\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\r\n\r\n### Layout & Spacing\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\r\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\r\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\r\n\r\n### Visual Quality\r\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\r\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\r\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\r\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\r\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\r\n\r\n### Interaction\r\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\r\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\r\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\r\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode\r\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\r\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\r\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\r\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\r\n\r\n### Layout\r\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\r\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\r\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\r\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\r\n\r\n### Accessibility\r\n- [ ] All images have alt text\r\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\r\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\r\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:03:15.341Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-focused Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines and recommendations for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面UI/UX指南和推荐的设计导向型代理，用于Web和移动应用程序。","ja":"デザイン重視のエージェントに最適で、Webおよびモバイルアプリケーション向けの包括的なUI/UXガイドラインと推奨事項が必要です。","ko":"디자인 중심의 에이전트에게 적합하며, 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 포괄적인 UI/UX 가이드라인 및 권장 사항이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en diseño que necesitan pautas y recomendaciones de UI/UX comprehensivas para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur la conception nécessitant des lignes directrices et des recommandations UI/UX complètes pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien und Empfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Design que precisam de diretrizes e recomendações abrangentes de UI/UX para aplicações web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым необходимы комплексные рекомендации и руководства по UI/UX для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المهتمين بالتصميم الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات وتوصيات شاملة لويحة التحكم / تجربة المستخدم للتطبيقات الويب والجوال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces by leveraging 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring adherence to 99 UX guidelines across 9 technology stacks.","zh":"通过利用50+样式、97个颜色调色板和57个字体配对，同时确保遵守9个技术栈中的99个UX指南，从而使代理能够创建视觉上吸引人和用户友好的界面。","ja":"50を超えるスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントペアを利用し、9つのテクノロジースタックにわたる99のUXガイドラインに従うことで、視覚的に魅力的なユーザーフレンドリなインターフェイスを作成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"50개 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트 및 57개의 글꼴 쌍을 활용하여 9개의 기술 스택에 걸쳐 99개의 UX 가이드라인을 준수하면서 시각적으로 매력적이고 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear interfaces visualmente atractivas y fáciles de usar mediante la utilización de más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, garantizando al mismo tiempo el cumplimiento de 99 pautas de UX en 9 pilas tecnológicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes et conviviales en exploitant plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en assurant le respect de 99 lignes directrices UX sur 9 piles technologiques.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, visuell ansprechende und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie mehr als 50 Stile, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen nutzen und gleichzeitig die Einhaltung von 99 UX-Richtlinien in 9 Technologie-Stacks sicherstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente atraentes e amigáveis ao usuário, aproveitando 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a adesão a 99 diretrizes de UX em 9 pilhas de tecnologia.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально привлекательные и удобные для пользователя интерфейсы, используя 50+ стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 партий шрифтов, обеспечивая при этом соблюдение 99 руководств по UX на 9 технологических стеках.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم جذابة وسهلة الاستخدام من خلال استخدام أكثر من 50 نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان و 57 زوجًا من الخطوط، مع ضمان الامتثال لما يقرب من 99 إرشادة لويحة التحكم عبر 9 مجموعات تكنولوجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with priority-based recommendations","Generating consistent color schemes and typography for landing pages or dashboards","Reviewing code for UX issues and optimizing user experience"],"zh":["使用基于优先级的推荐设计新的UI组件或页面","为着陆页或仪表板生成一致的色彩方案和字体样式","审查代码以查找UX问题并优化用户体验"],"ja":["優先順位に基づいた推奨事項を使用して、新しいUIコンポーネントまたはページを設計する","ランディングページまたはダッシュボードのための、一貫した色彩スキームとタイポグラフィを生成する","UXの問題を検出してコードをレビューし、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化する"],"ko":["우선순위 기반 권장 사항을 사용하여新的 UI 구성 요소 또는 페이지를 설계합니다.","랜딩 페이지 또는 대시보드에 대한 일관된 색상 스키마 및 타이포그래피를 생성합니다.","코드를 검토하여 UX 문제를 발견하고 사용자 경험을 최적화합니다."],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de UI o páginas con recomendaciones basadas en prioridades","Generar esquemas de color y tipografía coherentes para páginas de destino o paneles de control","Revisar el código para problemas de UX y optimizar la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants UI ou pages avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités","Générer des schémas de couleur et de typographie cohérents pour les pages de destination ou les tableaux de bord","Réviser le code pour les problèmes d''UX et optimiser l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Neue UI-Komponenten oder Seiten mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen entwerfen","Konsistente Farbschemata und Typografie für Landingpages oder Dashboards generieren","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und Benutzererfahrung optimieren"],"pt":["Projeto de novos componentes da UI ou páginas com recomendações baseadas em prioridade","Geração de esquemas de cores e tipografia consistentes para páginas de destino ou painéis de controle","Revisão de código para problemas de UX e otimização da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Проектирование новых компонентов UI или страниц с рекомендациями, основанными на приоритете","Генерация последовательных цветовых схем и типографики для посадочных страниц или панелей управления","Проверка кода на проблемы UX и оптимизация пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع التوصيات المستندة إلى الأولوية","توليد مخططات الألوان والكتابة المتسقة للصفحات الهبوطية أو لوحات القيادة","مراجعة الشفرة لproblems لويحة التحكم وتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires searchable database access for priority-based recommendations","Limited to 9 technology stacks for UX guidelines"],"zh":["需要可搜索的数据库访问权限以实现基于优先级的推荐","仅限于9个技术栈的UX指南"],"ja":["優先順位に基づいた推奨事項のために、検索可能なデータベースへのアクセスが必要","UXガイドラインは9つのテクノロジースタックに限定される"],"ko":["우선순위 기반 추천을 위한 검색 가능한 데이터베이스 액세스가 필요합니다.","UX 가이드라인은 9개의 기술 스택으로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a una base de datos buscable para recomendaciones basadas en prioridades","Limitado a 9 pilas tecnológicas para pautas de UX"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à une base de données recherchable pour des recommandations basées sur les priorités","Limité à 9 piles technologiques pour les lignes directrices UX"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf eine durchsuchbare Datenbank für prioritätsbasierte Empfehlungen","Begrenzt auf 9 Technologie-Stacks für UX-Richtlinien"],"pt":["Exige acesso a banco de dados pesquisável para recomendações baseadas em prioridade","Limitado a 9 pilhas de tecnologia para diretrizes de UX"],"ru":["Требует доступа к поисковому базе данных для рекомендаций, основанных на приоритете","Ограничен 9 технологическими стеками для руководств по UX"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث لتوصيات قائمة على الأولوية","محدود بـ 9 مجموعات تكنولوجية لإرشادات لويحة التحكم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('moorestech/moorestech/pr-create', 'community', 'moorestech', 'moorestech', 'moorestech/moorestech', 'pr-create', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:03:05.379Z', NULL, '{"id":"moorestech/moorestech/pr-create","name":"pr-create","description":{"zh":"PR创建指南提供了创建高质量PR的步骤和自动化工厂游戏的开发流程","ja":"プルリクエスト作成ガイドは、高品質のPRを作成する手順と自動化ファクトリーゲームの開発プロセスを提供します","ko":"PR 생성 가이드는 고품질의 PR을 생성하는 단계와 자동화 Factory 게임 개발 프로세스를 제공합니다","es":"Guía para crear solicitudes de extracción con pr-create, incluyendo la recopilación de información y el análisis de cambios","fr":"Guide pour créer des demandes d''extraction avec pr-create, y compris la collecte d''informations et l''analyse des modifications","de":"Anleitung zum Erstellen von Pull-Requests mit pr-create, einschließlich der Informationsbeschaffung und der Änderungsanalyse","pt":"O pr-create é um guia para criação de pull requests, incluindo comandos para entender o estado atual e analisar alterações.","ru":"Pr-create - это руководство для создания запросов на вытягивание, включая команды для понимания текущего состояния и анализа изменений.","ar":"pr-create هو دليل لإنشاء طلبات السحب ، بما في ذلك أوامر لفهم الحالة الحالية وتحليل التغييرات.","en":"Animated open world automated factory game"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PR创建指南：自动化工厂游戏","ja":"プルリクエスト作成ガイド：自動化ファクトリーゲーム","ko":"PR 생성 가이드: 자동화_FACTORY 게임","es":"Crear Solicitudes de Extracción con pr-create","fr":"Créer des Demandes d''Extraction avec pr-create","de":"Erstellen von Pull-Requests mit pr-create","pt":"Guia de Criação de Pull Request","ru":"Руководство по созданию запроса на вытягивание","ar":"دليل إنشاء طلب سحب","en":"pr-create"},"description":{"zh":"PR创建指南提供了创建高质量PR的步骤和自动化工厂游戏的开发流程","ja":"プルリクエスト作成ガイドは、高品質のPRを作成する手順と自動化ファクトリーゲームの開発プロセスを提供します","ko":"PR 생성 가이드는 고품질의 PR을 생성하는 단계와 자동화 Factory 게임 개발 프로세스를 제공합니다","es":"Guía para crear solicitudes de extracción con pr-create, incluyendo la recopilación de información y el análisis de cambios","fr":"Guide pour créer des demandes d''extraction avec pr-create, y compris la collecte d''informations et l''analyse des modifications","de":"Anleitung zum Erstellen von Pull-Requests mit pr-create, einschließlich der Informationsbeschaffung und der Änderungsanalyse","pt":"O pr-create é um guia para criação de pull requests, incluindo comandos para entender o estado atual e analisar alterações.","ru":"Pr-create - это руководство для создания запросов на вытягивание, включая команды для понимания текущего состояния и анализа изменений.","ar":"pr-create هو دليل لإنشاء طلبات السحب ، بما في ذلك أوامر لفهم الحالة الحالية وتحليل التغييرات.","en":"Animated open world automated factory game"},"definition":{"en":"Animated open world automated factory game"},"features":{"zh":["创建高质量的PR","自动化工厂游戏开发流程","Git命令行工具使用","代码审查和测试","开发团队协作"],"ja":["高品質のPRを作成","自動化ファクトリーゲームの開発プロセス","Gitコマンドラインツールの使用","コードレビューとテスト","開発チームのコラボレーション"],"ko":["고품질의 PR을 생성","자동화 Factory 게임 개발 프로세스","Git 명령줄 도구 사용","코드 리뷰 및 테스트","개발 팀 협업"],"es":["Recopilación de información con comandos Git","Análisis de cambios y commits","Creación de solicitudes de extracción","Integración con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","Mejora de la colaboración en equipo","Automatización de tareas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Collecte d''informations avec des commandes Git","Analyse des modifications et des commits","Création de demandes d''extraction","Intégration avec les flux de travail de développement","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe","Automatisation des tâches de développement"],"de":["Informationsbeschaffung mit Git-Befehlen","Änderungs- und Commit-Analyse","Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Integration in Entwicklungsworkflows","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit","Automatisierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Comandos para entender o estado atual","Análise de alterações","Criação de pull requests","Integração com git","Análise de commits","Histórico de commits"],"ru":["Команды для понимания текущего состояния","Анализ изменений","Создание запросов на вытягивание","Интеграция с git","Анализ коммитов","История коммитов"],"ar":["أوامر لفهم الحالة الحالية","تحليل التغييرات","إنشاء طلبات السحب","التكامل مع git","تحليل التعديلات","سجل التعديلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PR创建","自动化工厂游戏","Git命令行工具","代码审查","代码测试","开发团队协作"],"ja":["プルリクエスト作成","自動化ファクトリーゲーム","Gitコマンドラインツール","コードレビュー","コードテスト","開発チームのコラボレーション"],"ko":["PR 생성","자동화 Factory 게임","Git 명령줄 도구","코드 리뷰","코드 테스트","개발 팀 협업"],"es":["pr-create","solicitudes de extracción","desarrollo de software","Git","colaboración en equipo","automatización de tareas","flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","integración de herramientas"],"fr":["pr-create","demandes d''extraction","développement de logiciels","Git","collaboration d''équipe","automatisation de tâches","flux de travail de développement","intégration d''outils"],"de":["pr-create","Pull-Requests","Software-Entwicklung","Git","Teamzusammenarbeit","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Entwicklungsworkflows","Tool-Integration"],"pt":["criação de pull requests","git","desenvolvimento de software","controle de versão","análise de código","integração contínua","desenvolvedores","programação","pr-create"],"ru":["создание запросов на вытягивание","git","разработка программного обеспечения","контроль версий","анализ кода","постоянная интеграция","разработчики","программирование","pr-create"],"ar":["إنشاء طلبات السحب","git","تطوير البرمجيات","مراقبة الإصدار","تحليل الشفرة","التكامل المستمر","مطورو البرمجيات","البرمجة","pr-create"]}},"owner":"moorestech","repo":"moorestech","repoPath":"moorestech/moorestech","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-create","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Pull Request Creation Guide\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Gather Information\nRun these commands in parallel to understand the current state:\n\n```bash\n# Show untracked files\ngit status\n\n# Show staged and unstaged changes\ngit diff\n\n# Check if branch tracks remote and is up to date\ngit branch -vv\n\n# Show commit history from base branch\ngit log --oneline origin/master..HEAD\n\n# Show full diff from base branch\ngit diff origin/master...HEAD\n```\n\n### 2. Analyze Changes\nReview all commits that will be included","body":"# Pull Request Creation Guide\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Gather Information\nRun these commands in parallel to understand the current state:\n\n```bash\n# Show untracked files\ngit status\n\n# Show staged and unstaged changes\ngit diff\n\n# Check if branch tracks remote and is up to date\ngit branch -vv\n\n# Show commit history from base branch\ngit log --oneline origin/master..HEAD\n\n# Show full diff from base branch\ngit diff origin/master...HEAD\n```\n\n### 2. Analyze Changes\nReview all commits that will be included in the PR (not just the latest commit).\n\nDraft a PR title and summary:\n- Keep title under 70 characters\n- Use description/body for details\n\n### 3. Create Pull Request\n\n```bash\n# Create new branch if needed\ngit checkout -b feature/branch-name\n\n# Push to remote with tracking\ngit push -u origin HEAD\n\n# Create PR using gh CLI\ngh pr create --title \"the pr title\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n<1-3 bullet points>\n\n## Test plan\n[Bulleted markdown checklist of TODOs for testing the pull request...]\n\nGenerated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- Return the PR URL when done so the user can see it\n- Do not push to remote unless explicitly asked\n- Never use destructive git commands without explicit permission\n- If there are uncommitted changes, ask user if they should be committed first\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:03:05.379Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated Git workflow management and pull request creation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要自动化Git工作流管理和拉取请求创建能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化されたGitワークフロー管理とプルリクエストの作成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 Git 워크플로 관리 및 풀 리퀘스트 생성 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada de Git y capacidades de creación de solicitudes de extracción.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow Git automatisée et de capacités de création de demandes d''extraction.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung und Pull-Request-Erstellungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado do Git e capacidades de criação de solicitações de pull.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим автоматизированный менеджер рабочих процессов Git и возможности создания запросов на включение.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إدارة تدفق العمل التلقائي لجيت وتنفيذ طلبات السحب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Git workflows using commands like git status, git diff, and git log, streamlining the pull request creation process and ensuring accurate change tracking and analysis through protocols like Git.","zh":"赋予代理使用git status、git diff和git log等命令来自动化Git工作流，从而简化拉取请求的创建过程，并通过Git等协议确保准确的变更跟踪和分析。","ja":"git status、git diff、git logなどのコマンドを使用してGitワークフローを自動化することで、プルリクエストの作成プロセスを簡素化し、Gitなどのプロトコルを介して正確な変更の追跡と分析を保証します。","ko":"git status, git diff, git logなどの 명령을 사용하여 Git 워크플ロー 자동화를 통해 풀 리퀘스트 생성 프로세스를 간소화하고, Git 등의 프로토콜을 통해 정확한 변경 사항 추적 및 분석을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de Git mediante comandos como git status, git diff y git log, lo que simplifica el proceso de creación de solicitudes de extracción y garantiza un seguimiento y análisis de cambios precisos a través de protocolos como Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail Git à l''aide de commandes comme git status, git diff et git log, ce qui rationalise le processus de création de demandes d''extraction et garantit un suivi et une analyse précise des modifications via des protocoles comme Git.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Git-Workflows mithilfe von Befehlen wie git status, git diff und git log zu automatisieren, wodurch der Prozess der Pull-Request-Erstellung rationalisiert und eine genaue Änderungsverfolgung und -analyse durch Protokolle wie Git gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho do Git usando comandos como git status, git diff e git log, simplificando o processo de criação de solicitações de pull e garantindo o acompanhamento e análise precisos de alterações por meio de protocolos como o Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы Git с помощью команд seperti git status, git diff и git log, оптимизируя процесс создания запросов на включение и обеспечивая точное отслеживание и анализ изменений через протоколы, такие как Git.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توفيرautomatizar سير عمل جيت باستخدام أوامر مثل git status و git diff و git log ، وتبسيط عملية إنشاء طلبات السحب وضمان تتبع دقيق وتحليل التغييرات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل جيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation with git commands","Analyzing commit histories with git log","Debugging staged and unstaged changes with git diff"],"zh":["使用git命令自动创建拉取请求","使用git log分析提交历史","使用git diff调试暂存和未暂存的更改"],"ja":["gitコマンドを使用してプルリクエストを自動作成する","git logを使用してコミット履歴を分析する","git diffを使用してステージングおよびステージングされていない変更をデバッグする"],"ko":["git 명령을 사용하여 풀 리퀘스트 자동 생성하기","git log를 사용하여 커밋 기록 분석하기","git diff를 사용하여 스테이징 및 스테이징되지 않은 변경 사항 디버깅하기"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de solicitudes de extracción con comandos git","Analizar historias de confirmación con git log","Depurar cambios con git diff en diferentes etapas"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de demandes d''extraction avec des commandes Git","Analyser les historiques de validation avec git log","Déboguer les modifications enregistrées et non enregistrées avec git diff"],"de":["Automatisieren der Pull-Request-Erstellung mit Git-Befehlen","Analyse von Commit-Verlaufsprotokollen mit git log","Fehlerbehebung von gestagten und nicht gestagten Änderungen mit git diff"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de solicitações de pull com comandos git","Analizar histórico de commits com git log","Depurar alterações em estágio e não em estágio com git diff"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания запросов на включение с помощью команд git","Анализ истории коммитов с помощью git log","Отладка изменений в стадии и не в стадии с помощью git diff"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء طلبات السحب باستخدام أوامر جيت","تحليل سجل التعديلات باستخدام جيت لوغ","تصحيح الأخطاء في التغييرات المحلية وغير المحلية باستخدام جيت ديف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to Git version control system"],"zh":["需要Git的安装和配置","仅限于Git版本控制系统"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","Gitバージョン管理システムのみに限定される"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité au système de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf das Git-Versionierungssystem"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Ограничен системой контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت جيت وتفاصيله","محدود بنظام جيت لإدارة الإصدارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nibzard/scribe/doc-maintainer', 'community', 'nibzard', 'scribe', 'nibzard/scribe', 'doc-maintainer', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:03:10.819Z', NULL, '{"id":"nibzard/scribe/doc-maintainer","name":"doc-maintainer","description":{"zh":"Doc Maintainer, ESP32 ","ja":"Doc Maintainer, ESP32","ko":"Doc Maintainer, ESP32 ","es":"Doc Maintainer es un firmware de escritura sin distracciones para dispositivos M5stack ESP32 que mantiene la documentación actualizada y precisa","fr":"Doc Maintainer est un firmware d''écriture sans distraction pour les appareils M5stack ESP32 qui maintient la documentation à jour et précise","de":"Doc Maintainer ist ein Firmware für distractionsfreies Schreiben auf M5stack-ESP32-Geräten, der die Dokumentation aktuell und präzise hält","pt":"O Doc Maintainer é uma ferramenta de escrita de documentação que ajuda a manter a documentação precisa e atualizada para o dispositivo Tab5 baseado em ESP32","ru":"Doc Maintainer - это инструмент для поддержания документации, который помогает сохранять документацию точной и актуальной для устройства Tab5 на основе ESP32","ar":"Doc Maintainer هي أداة كتابة الدокументات التي تساعد في الحفاظ على دقة وحداثة الوثائق لأنظمة Tab5 المعتمدة على ESP32","en":"Distraction-Free Writing firmware for the M5stack ESP32 based Tab5 device"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Doc Maintainer: ESP32 ","ja":"Doc Maintainer: ESP32","ko":"Doc Maintainer: ESP32 ","es":"Doc Maintainer: Firmware de escritura sin distracciones p...","fr":"Doc Maintainer : Firmware d''écriture sans distraction pou...","de":"Doc Maintainer: Firmware für distractionsfreies Schreiben...","pt":"Doc Maintainer: Ferramenta de Escrita de Documentação","ru":"Doc Maintainer: Инструмент для поддержания документации","ar":"Doc Maintainer: أداة كتابة الدокументات","en":"doc-maintainer"},"description":{"zh":"Doc Maintainer, ESP32 ","ja":"Doc Maintainer, ESP32","ko":"Doc Maintainer, ESP32 ","es":"Doc Maintainer es un firmware de escritura sin distracciones para dispositivos M5stack ESP32 que mantiene la documentación actualizada y precisa","fr":"Doc Maintainer est un firmware d''écriture sans distraction pour les appareils M5stack ESP32 qui maintient la documentation à jour et précise","de":"Doc Maintainer ist ein Firmware für distractionsfreies Schreiben auf M5stack-ESP32-Geräten, der die Dokumentation aktuell und präzise hält","pt":"O Doc Maintainer é uma ferramenta de escrita de documentação que ajuda a manter a documentação precisa e atualizada para o dispositivo Tab5 baseado em ESP32","ru":"Doc Maintainer - это инструмент для поддержания документации, который помогает сохранять документацию точной и актуальной для устройства Tab5 на основе ESP32","ar":"Doc Maintainer هي أداة كتابة الدокументات التي تساعد في الحفاظ على دقة وحداثة الوثائق لأنظمة Tab5 المعتمدة على ESP32","en":"Distraction-Free Writing firmware for the M5stack ESP32 based Tab5 device"},"definition":{"en":"Distraction-Free Writing firmware for the M5stack ESP32 based Tab5 device"},"features":{"zh":["ESP32 ","Tab5 ","DOCS.MD","",""],"ja":["ESP32 ","Tab5 ","DOCS.MD","",""],"ko":["ESP32 ","Tab5 ","DOCS.MD","",""],"es":["Mantiene la documentación actualizada y precisa","Escanea el repositorio para detectar cambios","Compara el código con la documentación","Agrega o actualiza la documentación según sea necesario","Mantiene los cambios concisos y precisos"],"fr":["Maintient la documentation à jour et précise","Analyse le référentiel pour détecter les modifications","Compare le code avec la documentation","Ajoute ou met à jour la documentation selon les besoins","Maintient les modifications concises et précises"],"de":["Hält die Dokumentation aktuell und präzise","Scannet das Repository auf Änderungen","Vergleicht den Code mit der Dokumentation","Fügt oder aktualisiert die Dokumentation nach Bedarf","Hält die Änderungen knapp und präzise"],"pt":["Escrita de documentação distraction-free","Compatibilidade com o dispositivo Tab5 baseado em ESP32","Verificação automática de mudanças no código","Atualização da documentação em tempo real","Manutenção da precisão e da atualidade da documentação"],"ru":["Беспристрастная запись документации","Совместимость с устройством Tab5 на основе ESP32","Автоматическая проверка изменений в коде","Обновление документации в режиме реального времени","Поддержание точности и актуальности документации"],"ar":["كتابة الدокументات بدون إلهاء","توافق مع أنظمة Tab5 المعتمدة على ESP32","فحص آلي للتغييرات في الكود","تحديث الوثائق في الوقت الفعلي","الحفاظ على دقة وحداثة الوثائق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Doc Maintainer","ESP32","Tab5","DOCS.MD","","","M5stack"],"ja":["Doc Maintainer","ESP32","Tab5","DOCS.MD","","","M5stack"],"ko":["Doc Maintainer","ESP32","Tab5","DOCS.MD","","","M5stack"],"es":["M5stack ESP32","firmware de escritura sin distracciones","documentación precisa","actualización de documentación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["M5stack ESP32","firmware d''écriture sans distraction","documentation précise","mise à jour de documentation","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["M5stack ESP32","Firmware für distractionsfreies Schreiben","präzise Dokumentation","Aktualisierung von Dokumentationen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["Doc Maintainer","ferramenta de escrita de documentação","dispositivo Tab5","ESP32","documentação precisa","atualidade da documentação","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Doc Maintainer","инструмент для поддержания документации","устройство Tab5","ESP32","точная документация","актуальность документации","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Doc Maintainer","أداة كتابة الدокументات","أنظمة Tab5","ESP32","وثائق دقيقة","حداثة الوثائق","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"nibzard","repo":"scribe","repoPath":"nibzard/scribe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-maintainer","description":"Maintain and expand DOCS.MD to cover the full Scribe codebase. Use when asked to update documentation, add missing modules/flows, improve coverage maps, or align docs with code changes in this repo.","bodyPreview":"# Doc Maintainer\n\n## Goal\nKeep `DOCS.MD` accurate, comprehensive, and aligned with the current codebase.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Scan the repo for new or changed areas (prefer `rg --files` + targeted file reads).\n2. Compare code areas to `DOCS.MD` sections and the Table of Contents.\n3. Add or update documentation so each major subsystem and user-facing flow is covered.\n4. Keep changes concise, factual, and tied to the actual implementation.\n\n## Coverage Rules\n- Ensure every top-level folder with code or","body":"# Doc Maintainer\n\n## Goal\nKeep `DOCS.MD` accurate, comprehensive, and aligned with the current codebase.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Scan the repo for new or changed areas (prefer `rg --files` + targeted file reads).\n2. Compare code areas to `DOCS.MD` sections and the Table of Contents.\n3. Add or update documentation so each major subsystem and user-facing flow is covered.\n4. Keep changes concise, factual, and tied to the actual implementation.\n\n## Coverage Rules\n- Ensure every top-level folder with code or assets is represented in `DOCS.MD`.\n- For each subsystem, list:\n  - Responsibilities (1-3 bullets).\n  - Key entry files (headers + sources).\n- If new developer sections are added, update the Table of Contents to include them.\n- Prefer a single “Codebase Map” section for breadth, and add focused sections only for complex features.\n\n## DOCS.MD Style\n- Use short paragraphs and bullet lists; avoid long prose.\n- Keep headings numbered to match the Table of Contents.\n- Use inline code for file paths.\n- Mention specific files for claims; avoid vague wording like “some files.”\n\n## When Updating After Code Changes\n- If a new service or screen is added, document it under the relevant subsystem.\n- If behavior changes (e.g., keybindings, UI flow), update both the behavior summary and key files.\n- If a file is deprecated or unused, note it briefly rather than deleting documentation.\n\n## Do Not\n- Do not add unrelated documentation files; only update `DOCS.MD`.\n- Do not describe managed components in depth; note them at a high level.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:03:10.819Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents requiring automated documentation maintenance for ESP32 based devices.","zh":"适用于需要自动维护基于ESP32的设备文档的技术写作代理","ja":"ESP32ベースのデバイスの自動ドキュメントメンテナンスを必要とするテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適","ko":"ESP32 기반 장치의 자동 문서 유지 관리가 필요한 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de escritura técnica que requieren mantenimiento de documentación automatizado para dispositivos basados en ESP32.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de rédaction technique nécessitant une maintenance de documentation automatisée pour les appareils basés sur ESP32.","de":"Ideal für technische Schreibagenten, die ein automatisiertes Wartungsverfahren für ESP32-basierte Geräte benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que exigem manutenção automatizada de documentação para dispositivos baseados em ESP32.","ru":"Идеально для агентов технической документации, требующих автоматизированного обслуживания документации для устройств на основе ESP32.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذي يتطلب صيانة التوثيق الآلي لأجهزة ESP32"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain accurate and comprehensive documentation in Markdown format, utilizing targeted file reads and comparisons to ensure alignment with the current codebase, specifically leveraging `rg --files` for repository scanning and adhering to Coverage Rules for top-level folders.","zh":"赋予代理维护准确、全面文档的能力，以Markdown格式呈现，利用有针对性的文件读取和比较，以确保与当前代码库的对齐，特别是利用`rg --files`进行仓库扫描，并遵循顶级文件夹的Coverage规则","ja":"エージェントが正確で包括的なドキュメントを保守できるようにし、Markdown形式で提供し、ターゲットを絞ったファイルの読み取りと比較を行って、現在のコードベースとの整合を保つことを可能にし、特に`rg --files`を使用してリポジトリのスキャニングを行い、トップレベルのフォルダーのカバレッジルールに従う","ko":"에이전트가 정확하고 포괄적인 문서를 유지할 수 있도록 해주며, 마크다운 형식으로 제공하며, 대상 파일 읽기 및 비교를 통해 현재 코드베이스와 일치하는 것을 보장하며, 특히 `rg --files`를 사용하여 저장소 스캔을 수행하고 최상위 폴더의 커버리지 규칙을 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener una documentación precisa y completa en formato Markdown, utilizando lecturas y comparaciones de archivos dirigidas para garantizar el alineamiento con la base de código actual, aprovechando específicamente `rg --files` para el análisis del repositorio y ajustándose a las Reglas de Cobertura para las carpetas de nivel superior.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une documentation précise et complète au format Markdown, en utilisant des lectures et des comparaisons de fichiers ciblées pour garantir l''alignement avec la base de code actuelle, en exploitant spécifiquement `rg --files` pour l''analyse du référentiel et en respectant les Règles de couverture pour les dossiers de niveau supérieur.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine genaue und umfassende Dokumentation im Markdown-Format zu pflegen, indem gezielte Dateilektüren und -vergleiche verwendet werden, um die Ausrichtung mit dem aktuellen Codebestand sicherzustellen, wobei insbesondere `rg --files` für die Repository-Überprüfung genutzt wird und die Abdeckungsregeln für die obersten Ordner eingehalten werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manterem documentação precisa e abrangente no formato Markdown, utilizando leituras de arquivos e comparações direcionadas para garantir alinhamento com o código atual, aproveitando `rg --files` para varredura do repositório e seguindo as Regras de Cobertura para pastas de nível superior.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать точную и всестороннюю документацию в формате Markdown, используя нацеленные чтения файлов и сравнения для обеспечения соответствия текущему кодовому базису, специально используя `rg --files` для сканирования репозитория и соблюдения Правил покрытия для папок верхнего уровня.","ar":"تمكين العميل من الحفاظ على توثيق دقيق ومتكامل بالتنسيق Markdown، باستخدام قراءات الملفات والمقارنات المستهدفة لضمان الانسجام مع قاعدة البيانات الحالية، واستخدام `rg --files` لفحص المستودع والامتثال لقواعد التغطية للمجلدات ذات المستوى الأعلى."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates for new or changed code areas","Generating Table of Contents aligned with the current codebase","Ensuring concise and factual documentation for major subsystems and user-facing flows"],"zh":["自动更新新代码或更改代码区域的文档","生成与当前代码库对齐的目录","确保主要子系统和用户面向流程的文档简洁、事实"],"ja":["新しいコードまたは変更されたコード領域のドキュメントを自動更新する","現在のコードベースと整合した目次を生成する","主要サブシステムとユーザー向けフローのドキュメントが簡潔で事実であることを保証する"],"ko":["새 코드 또는 변경된 코드 영역의 문서를 자동으로 업데이트함","현재 코드베이스와 일치하는 목차를 생성함","주요 하위 시스템 및 사용자 대상 흐름의 문서가 간결하고 사실임을 보장함"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de documentación para nuevas o modificadas áreas de código","Generar un índice alineado con la base de código actual","Garantizar documentación concisa y fáctica para subsistemas principales y flujos orientados al usuario"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de la documentation pour les nouvelles ou modifiées zones de code","Générer un sommaire aligné avec la base de code actuelle","Assurer une documentation concise et factuelle pour les sous-systèmes principaux et les flux orientés vers l''utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dokumenten-Updates für neue oder geänderte Code-Bereiche","Erzeugen eines Inhaltsverzeichnisses, das mit dem aktuellen Codebestand übereinstimmt","Sicherstellen einer präzisen und faktischen Dokumentation für Haupt-Teilsysteme und benutzerorientierte Abläufe"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação para novas áreas de código ou alteradas","Gerar Tabela de Conteúdo alinhada com o código atual","Garantir documentação concisa e factual para subsistemas principais e fluxos orientados ao usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации для новых или измененных областей кода","Генерировать Таблицу содержания, выровненную с текущим кодовым базисом","Обеспечить краткую и фактическую документацию для основных подсистем и пользовательских потоков"],"ar":["تحديث التوثيق تلقائيًا للمناطق الجديدة أو المعدلة من الشفرة","توليد جدول المحتويات المتوافق مع قاعدة البيانات الحالية","ضمان توثيق موجز وحقيقي للنظم الفرعية الرئيسية والتدفقات الموجهة للمستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the repository and `DOCS.MD` file","Specifically designed for M5stack ESP32 based Tab5 devices","Dependent on `rg` command-line tool for file searching"],"zh":["需要访问仓库和`DOCS.MD`文件","特别为M5stack ESP32基于Tab5设备设计","依赖于`rg`命令行工具进行文件搜索"],"ja":["リポジトリと`DOCS.MD`ファイルへのアクセスが必要","M5stack ESP32ベースのTab5デバイス専用に設計","`rg`コマンドラインツールに依存してファイル検索を行う"],"ko":["저장소 및 `DOCS.MD` 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","M5stack ESP32 기반 Tab5 장치専用로 설계됨","`rg` 명령줄 도구에 의존하여 파일 검색을 수행"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio y al archivo `DOCS.MD`","Diseñado específicamente para dispositivos M5stack ESP32 basados en Tab5","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `rg` para la búsqueda de archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel et au fichier `DOCS.MD`","Conçu spécifiquement pour les appareils M5stack ESP32 basés sur Tab5","Dépendant de l''outil de ligne de commande `rg` pour la recherche de fichiers"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Repository und die Datei `DOCS.MD`","Speziell für M5stack-ESP32-Geräte basierend auf Tab5 konzipiert","Abhängig von der Befehlszeilentool `rg` für die Dateisuche"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório e ao arquivo `DOCS.MD`","Projetado especificamente para dispositivos Tab5 baseados em ESP32 da M5stack","Dependente da ferramenta de linha de comando `rg` para busca de arquivos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию и файлу `DOCS.MD`","Специально разработан для устройств Tab5 на основе ESP32 от M5stack","Зависит от командной строки `rg` для поиска файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المستودع وملف `DOCS.MD`","تم تصميمه خصيصًا لأجهزة Tab5 المعتمدة على ESP32 من M5stack","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `rg` للبحث عن الملفات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('prateek/dotfiles/grmrepo', 'community', 'prateek', 'dotfiles', 'prateek/dotfiles', 'grmrepo', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:03:22.501Z', NULL, '{"id":"prateek/dotfiles/grmrepo","name":"grmrepo","description":{"zh":"GRM 仓库管理工具使用 git-repo-manager 和一个薄包装器，生成配置文件以管理代码仓库","ja":"GRM リポジトリ管理ツールは git-repo-manager と薄いラッパーを使用してコードリポジトリを管理する","ko":"GRM 저장소 관리 도구는 git-repo-manager와 얇은 래퍼를 사용하여 코드 저장소를 관리","es":"GRM Repo es una herramienta para gestionar repositorios Git con un wrapper delgado y un archivo de configuración generado","fr":"GRM Repo est un outil pour gérer des dépôts Git avec un wrapper léger et un fichier de configuration généré","de":"GRM Repo ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung von Git-Repositorys mit einem dünnen Wrapper und einer generierten Konfigurationsdatei","pt":"O GRM é uma ferramenta para gerenciar repositórios Git, permitindo que os desenvolvedores organizem e acessem seus códigos de forma eficiente","ru":"GRM - это инструмент для управления репозиториями Git, позволяющий разработчикам организовывать и доступ к своим кодам эффективно","ar":"GRM هو أداة لإدارة المستودعات Git، مما يسمح للمطورين بتنظيم وصولهم إلى الأكواد بفعالية","en":"My dotfiles"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GRM 仓库管理工具","ja":"GRM リポジトリ管理ツール","ko":"GRM 저장소 관리 도구","es":"GRM Repo: Administración de repositorios Git","fr":"GRM Repo : Gestion de dépôts Git","de":"GRM Repo: Git-Repository-Verwaltung","pt":"Gerenciamento de Repositórios com GRM","ru":"Управление репозиториями с помощью GRM","ar":"إدارة المستودعات مع GRM","en":"grmrepo"},"description":{"zh":"GRM 仓库管理工具使用 git-repo-manager 和一个薄包装器，生成配置文件以管理代码仓库","ja":"GRM リポジトリ管理ツールは git-repo-manager と薄いラッパーを使用してコードリポジトリを管理する","ko":"GRM 저장소 관리 도구는 git-repo-manager와 얇은 래퍼를 사용하여 코드 저장소를 관리","es":"GRM Repo es una herramienta para gestionar repositorios Git con un wrapper delgado y un archivo de configuración generado","fr":"GRM Repo est un outil pour gérer des dépôts Git avec un wrapper léger et un fichier de configuration généré","de":"GRM Repo ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung von Git-Repositorys mit einem dünnen Wrapper und einer generierten Konfigurationsdatei","pt":"O GRM é uma ferramenta para gerenciar repositórios Git, permitindo que os desenvolvedores organizem e acessem seus códigos de forma eficiente","ru":"GRM - это инструмент для управления репозиториями Git, позволяющий разработчикам организовывать и доступ к своим кодам эффективно","ar":"GRM هو أداة لإدارة المستودعات Git، مما يسمح للمطورين بتنظيم وصولهم إلى الأكواد بفعالية","en":"My dotfiles"},"definition":{"en":"My dotfiles"},"features":{"zh":["代码仓库管理","git-repo-manager 集成","薄包装器","生成配置文件","工作树灵活性"],"ja":["コードリポジトリ管理","git-repo-manager 統合","薄いラッパー","設定ファイル生成","ワークツリーの柔軟性"],"ko":["코드 저장소 관리","git-repo-manager 통합","얇은 래퍼","설정 파일 생성","작업 트리 유연성"],"es":["Clones canónicos en ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Excepciones para clones de repositorios específicos","Worktrees pueden estar en cualquier lugar","No se trackean worktrees en la configuración de GRM","Uso de un archivo de configuración generado"],"fr":["Clones canoniques dans ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Exceptions pour des clones de dépôts spécifiques","Worktrees peuvent être n''importe où","Les worktrees ne sont pas suivis dans la configuration de GRM","Utilisation d''un fichier de configuration généré"],"de":["Kanonische Klone in ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Ausnahmen für Klone von bestimmten Repositorys","Worktrees können überall sein","Worktrees werden nicht in der GRM-Konfiguration verfolgt","Verwendung einer generierten Konfigurationsdatei"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de repositórios Git","Organização de códigos em pastas personalizadas","Acesso rápido aos repositórios","Suporte a worktrees","Configuração personalizada"],"ru":["Управление репозиториями Git","Организация кодов в пользовательских папках","Быстрый доступ к репозиториям","Поддержка worktrees","Персонализированная конфигурация"],"ar":["إدارة المستودعات Git","تنظيم الأكواد في مجلدات مخصصة","وصول سريع إلى المستودعات","دعم worktrees","تكوين مخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GRM","git-repo-manager","代码仓库管理","薄包装器","生成配置文件","工作树"],"ja":["GRM","git-repo-manager","コードリポジトリ管理","薄いラッパー","設定ファイル生成","ワークツリー"],"ko":["GRM","git-repo-manager","코드 저장소 관리","얇은 래퍼","설정 파일 생성","작업 트리"],"es":["git repo manager","grm repo","gestión de repositorios git","clones canónicos","worktrees git","configuración de grm","wrapper de git-repo-manager"],"fr":["git repo manager","grm repo","gestion de dépôts git","clones canoniques","worktrees git","configuration de grm","wrapper de git-repo-manager"],"de":["git repo manager","grm repo","verwaltung von git-repositorys","kanonische klone","git worktrees","grm konfiguration","wrapper für git-repo-manager"],"pt":["GRM","gerenciamento de repositórios","Git","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade","organização de códigos","worktrees","configuração personalizada"],"ru":["GRM","управление репозиториями","Git","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","организация кодов","worktrees","персонализированная конфигурация"],"ar":["GRM","إدارة المستودعات","Git","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية","تنظيم الأكواد","worktrees","تكوين مخصص"]}},"owner":"prateek","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"prateek/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"grmrepo","description":"Use git-repo-manager (GRM) on this machine via the `grmrepo` wrappers: refresh config from canonical clones, view status, and bootstrap a new machine by syncing repos.","bodyPreview":"# GRM on this machine (`grmrepo`)\n\nThis machine uses [git-repo-manager](https://github.com/hakoerber/git-repo-manager) (“GRM”) with a thin wrapper named `grmrepo` and a generated config file.\n\n## Key conventions\n\n- **Canonical clones** live under `~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>`\n- **Exceptions**\n  - `github.com/openai/openai` → `~/code/openai`\n  - `github.com/chronosphereio/chronosphere-openai` → `~/code/chronosphere-openai`\n- **Worktrees can be anywhere** and are *not* tracked by the GRM conf","body":"# GRM on this machine (`grmrepo`)\n\nThis machine uses [git-repo-manager](https://github.com/hakoerber/git-repo-manager) (“GRM”) with a thin wrapper named `grmrepo` and a generated config file.\n\n## Key conventions\n\n- **Canonical clones** live under `~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>`\n- **Exceptions**\n  - `github.com/openai/openai` → `~/code/openai`\n  - `github.com/chronosphereio/chronosphere-openai` → `~/code/chronosphere-openai`\n- **Worktrees can be anywhere** and are *not* tracked by the GRM config here.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Refresh the GRM config from local canonical clones:\n  - `grmrepo refresh`\n- Show status for all configured repos:\n  - `grmrepo repos status`\n- Bootstrap a new machine (clone everything in the config):\n  - `grmrepo repos sync config`\n\n## How it’s wired\n\n- GRM binary: `~/.cargo/bin/grm`\n- Wrapper: `~/bin/grmrepo` → `~/dotfiles/bin/grmrepo`\n- Config: `~/.config/grm/config.toml` → `~/dotfiles/.config/grm/config.toml`\n- Config generator: `~/dotfiles/bin/grmrepo-refresh`\n\n### Why the config has one `[[trees]]` per owner\n\nTo keep `grm repos status` working with `owner/repo` naming, `grmrepo-refresh` emits one `[[trees]]` per GitHub owner and sets `name=\"<repo>\"` inside that tree.\n\n## Common workflows\n\n### Add a new canonical repo\n\n1. Clone into the canonical path (or use `ghc owner/repo`).\n2. Run `grmrepo refresh`.\n\n### Worktrees\n\n- Create worktrees wherever you want (standard `git worktree add ...`).\n- The repo’s *canonical clone* remains the thing tracked by GRM here.\n\n### Keeping things in sync automatically\n\n- Interactive shells trigger a best-effort background refresh (at most once/day).\n- `git clone` / `git worktree {add,remove,prune}` trigger a background refresh.\n- `gh repo clone/create` and `ghc` trigger a background refresh.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **Repo missing / “Run sync?”**\n  - Your local clone isn’t in the canonical location *or* the config is stale.\n  - Fix: move/standardize the clone, then `grmrepo refresh`.\n- **`grmrepo repos status | head` panics**\n  - `grm` currently panics on broken pipes; avoid piping to `head` (use a pager or redirect).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:03:22.501Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing streamlined Git repository management with git-repo-manager (GRM) and custom config files.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 Git 仓库管理的开发者代理，使用 git-repo-manager (GRM) 和自定义配置文件。","ja":"開発者エージェントが Git リポジトリの管理を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。git-repo-manager (GRM) とカスタム構成ファイルを使用します。","ko":"개발자 에이전트가 Git 저장소 관리를 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다. git-repo-manager(GRM)와 사용자 지정 구성 파일을 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una gestión de repositorio Git optimizada con git-repo-manager (GRM) y archivos de configuración personalizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de référentiel Git rationalisée avec git-repo-manager (GRM) et des fichiers de configuration personnalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Git-Repository-Verwaltung mit git-repo-manager (GRM) und benutzerdefinierten Konfigurationsdateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de gerenciamento de repositório Git otimizado com git-repo-manager (GRM) e arquivos de configuração personalizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков, которым необходим упрощенное управление репозиторием Git с помощью git-repo-manager (GRM) и настраиваемых файлов конфигурации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة مستودع جيت البسيطة مع git-repo-manager (GRM) وملفات التكوين المخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage canonical clones under ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> with exceptions for specific repositories like github.com/openai/openai, utilizing a thin wrapper named grmrepo and generated config files, while also handling worktrees anywhere without tracking by the GRM conf.","zh":"赋予代理管理 canonical 克隆的能力，位于 ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>，并为特定存储库（如 github.com/openai/openai）提供例外，使用名为 grmrepo 的薄包装器和生成的配置文件，同时也处理任何位置的工作树，而不受 GRM 配置的跟踪。","ja":"エージェントがカノニカルクローンを管理できるようにし、~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> に配置し、github.com/openai/openai などの特定のリポジトリには例外を使用し、grmrepo という薄いラッパーと生成された構成ファイルを使用し、同時に GRM 構成の追跡なしでどこでもワークツリーを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 canonical 클론을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>에 배치하고, github.com/openai/openai와 같은 특정 저장소에는 예외를 사용하며, grmrepo라는 얇은 래퍼와 생성된 구성 파일을 사용하며,同時に GRM 구성의 추적 없이どこでも 작업 트리를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar clonaciones canónicas bajo ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> con excepciones para repositorios específicos como github.com/openai/openai, utilizando un delgado envoltorio llamado grmrepo y archivos de configuración generados, mientras también maneja worktrees en cualquier lugar sin seguimiento por la configuración de GRM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des clones canoniques sous ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> avec des exceptions pour des référentiels spécifiques comme github.com/openai/openai, en utilisant un wrapper léger nommé grmrepo et des fichiers de configuration générés, tout en gérant des worktrees n''importe où sans suivi par la configuration GRM.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kanonische Klonen unter ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> zu verwalten, mit Ausnahmen für bestimmte Repositorys wie github.com/openai/openai, unter Verwendung eines dünnen Wrappers namens grmrepo und generierter Konfigurationsdateien, während auch Worktrees überall ohne Nachverfolgung durch die GRM-Konfiguration gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem clones canônicos em ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> com exceções para repositórios específicos como github.com/openai/openai, utilizando uma camada fina chamada grmrepo e arquivos de configuração gerados, além de lidar com worktrees em qualquer lugar sem rastreamento pela configuração do GRM.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять каноническими клонами в ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> с исключениями для определенных репозиториев, таких как github.com/openai/openai, используя тонкий обертку под названием grmrepo и сгенерированные файлы конфигурации, а также обрабатывать worktrees где угодно без отслеживания конфигурацией GRM.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إدارة النسخ المتماثلة القanon في ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo> مع استثناءات لمستودعات محددة مثل github.com/openai/openai، باستخدام غطاء رقيق يسمى grmrepo وملفات التكوين المولدة، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع worktrees في أي مكان بدون تتبع من قبل تكوين GRM."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing canonical clones of GitHub repositories","Handling exceptions for specific repositories like openai and chronosphere-openai","Creating worktrees anywhere without GRM conf tracking"],"zh":["管理 GitHub 仓库的 canonical 克隆","处理特定仓库（如 openai 和 chronosphere-openai）例外","创建任何位置的工作树，而不受 GRM 配置跟踪"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリのカノニカルクローンを管理する","openai や chronosphere-openai などの特定のリポジトリの例外を処理する","GRM 構成の追跡なしでどこでもワークツリーを作成する"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소의 canonical 클론을 관리하는 것","openai 및 chronosphere-openai와 같은 특정 저장소의 예외를 처리하는 것","GRM 구성의 추적 없이どこでも 작업 트리를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Gestión de clonaciones canónicas de repositorios de GitHub","Manejo de excepciones para repositorios específicos como openai y chronosphere-openai","Creación de worktrees en cualquier lugar sin seguimiento de la configuración de GRM"],"fr":["Gestion de clones canoniques de référentiels GitHub","Gestion d''exceptions pour des référentiels spécifiques comme openai et chronosphere-openai","Création de worktrees n''importe où sans suivi de la configuration GRM"],"de":["Verwaltung kanonischer Klonen von GitHub-Repositorys","Handhabung von Ausnahmen für bestimmte Repositorys wie openai und chronosphere-openai","Erstellung von Worktrees überall ohne Nachverfolgung durch die GRM-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de clones canônicos de repositórios do GitHub","Tratamento de exceções para repositórios específicos como openai e chronosphere-openai","Criação de worktrees em qualquer lugar sem rastreamento pela configuração do GRM"],"ru":["Управление каноническими клонами репозиториев GitHub","Обработка исключений для определенных репозиториев, таких как openai и chronosphere-openai","Создание worktrees где угодно без отслеживания конфигурацией GRM"],"ar":["إدارة النسخ المتماثلة القanon لمستودعات جيت هب","معالجة الاستثناءات لمستودعات محددة مثل openai و chronosphere-openai","إنشاء worktrees في أي مكان بدون تتبع من قبل تكوين GRM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git-repo-manager installation","Specific directory structure under ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Manual configuration needed for exceptions and worktrees"],"zh":["需要 git-repo-manager 安装","特定的目录结构 ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","需要手动配置例外和工作树"],"ja":["git-repo-manager のインストールが必要","特定のディレクトリ構造 ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","例外とワークツリーの手動構成が必要"],"ko":["git-repo-manager 설치가 필요합니다.","특정 디렉토리 구조 ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","예외 및 작업 트리의 수동 구성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación de git-repo-manager","Estructura de directorio específica bajo ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Configuración manual necesaria para excepciones y worktrees"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de git-repo-manager","Structure de répertoire spécifique sous ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Configuration manuelle nécessaire pour les exceptions et les worktrees"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von git-repo-manager","Spezifische Verzeichnisstruktur unter ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Manuelle Konfiguration erforderlich für Ausnahmen und Worktrees"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do git-repo-manager","Estrutura de diretório específica em ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Configuração manual necessária para exceções e worktrees"],"ru":["Требует установки git-repo-manager","Конкретная структура директорий в ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","Необходима ручная настройка для исключений и worktrees"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت git-repo-manager","هيكل دليلي محدد في ~/code/github.com/<owner>/<repo>","التكوين اليدوي مطلوب للاستثناءات و worktrees"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TbK0ng/silver-bullet-kernel/before-backend-dev', 'community', 'TbK0ng', 'silver-bullet-kernel', 'TbK0ng/silver-bullet-kernel', 'before-backend-dev', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:03:30.503Z', NULL, '{"id":"TbK0ng/silver-bullet-kernel/before-backend-dev","name":"before-backend-dev","description":{"zh":"后端开发前规划指南，按照Trellis规范完成开发任务","ja":"バックエンド開発前の計画ガイド、Trellisの仕様に従って開発タスクを完了する","ko":"백엔드 개발 전 계획 가이드, Trellis 사양에 따라 개발 작업을 완료합니다","es":"La planificación de desarrollo de backend con Trellis implica leer las guías de desarrollo de backend y seguir los pasos para entender las pautas disponibles","fr":"La planification du développement backend avec Trellis implique la lecture des guides de développement backend et le suivi des étapes pour comprendre les directives disponibles","de":"Die Planung der Backend-Entwicklung mit Trellis beinhaltet das Lesen der Backend-Entwicklungsleitfäden und das Befolgen der Schritte, um die verfügbaren Richtlinien zu verstehen","pt":"O before-backend-dev é uma habilidade que ajuda a criar um plano de desenvolvimento de backend com base em trellis. Siga os passos para entender as diretrizes de desenvolvimento de backend","ru":"Before-backend-dev — это навык, который помогает создать план разработки бэкенда на основе trellis. Следуйте шагам, чтобы понять руководство по разработке бэкенда","ar":"before-backend-dev هو مهارة تساعد على إنشاء خطة لتطوير الخلفية باستخدام Trellis. اتبع الخطوات لفهم إرشادات تطوير الخلفية","en":"Try to make a final plan on programming base on trellis."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"后端开发前规划指南","ja":"バックエンド開発前の計画ガイド","ko":"백엔드 개발 전 계획 가이드","es":"Planificación de Desarrollo de Backend con Trellis","fr":"Planification du Développement Backend avec Trellis","de":"Backend-Entwicklungsplanung mit Trellis","pt":"Planejamento de Desenvolvimento de Backen