Kategorien zur Priorisierung des Einflusses","Leitfaden zur automatischen Refaktorierung","Codegenerierung zur Leistungsverbesserung","Optimierung der Datenladung","Verbesserung der Leistung von React und Next.js"],"pt":["45 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar o impacto","Refatoração e geração de código automatizadas","Otimização de componentes React","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Guia de melhores práticas para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для определения приоритета влияния","Автоматизированная рефакторинга и генерация кода","Оптимизация компонентов React","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Руководство по лучшим практикам для разработчиков"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتوجيه الأثر","إعادة الهيكلة وتوليد الكود التلقائي","تحسين مكونات رياكت","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","دليل أفضل الممارسات للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 性能优化","Next.js 性能优化","Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 最佳实践","性能优化指南"],"ja":["React パフォーマンス最適化","Next.js パフォーマンス最適化","Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化ガイド"],"ko":["React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","Vercel React","React 최고의 실천","Next.js 최고의 실천","성능 최적화 가이드"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","renderizado del servidor","carga de datos"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","rendu serveur","chargement de données"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Server-Seitiges Rendering","Datenladung"],"pt":["melhores práticas react","vercel react","otimização de desempenho react","next.js","desenvolvimento web","react performance","vercel","react best practices","desenvolvedores react"],"ru":["лучшие практики react","vercel react","оптимизация производительности react","next.js","веб-разработка","react производительность","vercel","react лучшие практики","разработчики react"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لرياكت","فيرسيل رياكت","تحسين الأداء رياكت","نكست.جس","تطوير الويب","أداء رياكت","فيرسيل","أفضل الممارسات لرياكت","مطورون رياكت"]}},"owner":"sho-sho-T","repo":"goodspot-app","repoPath":"sho-sho-T/goodspot-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:04:23.513Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for React-focused Code Agents specializing in Next.js performance optimization and automated refactoring.","zh":"适用于专注于 Next.js 性能优化和自动重构的 React 代码代理。","ja":"Next.js のパフォーマンス最適化と自動リファクタリングに特化した React 対応コードエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"Next.js 성능 최적화 및 자동 리팩토링을専門으로 하는 React 코드 에이전트에 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de código enfocados en React que se especializan en la optimización del rendimiento de Next.js y la refactorización automatizada.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de code axés sur React qui se spécialisent dans l''optimisation des performances de Next.js et la refactoring automatisée.","de":"Wesentlich für React-fokussierte Codeagenten, die sich auf die Leistungsoptimierung von Next.js und die automatisierte Refactoring spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Código focados em React que se especializam em otimização de desempenho do Next.js e refatoração automática.","ru":"Необходим для реактивных агентов кода, специализирующихся на оптимизации производительности Next.js и автоматической рефакторинге.","ar":"ضروري لعميل الترميز الذي يركز على React والمتخصص في تحسين أداء Next.js وإعادة هيكلة الترميز الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated detection and implementation of 45 Vercel-validated React performance rules across 8 categories including data fetching, bundling optimization, and component patterns. Provides prioritized impact assessment for guiding code generation and refactoring decisions.","zh":"实现自动检测和应用 45 个 Vercel 验证的 React 性能规则，涵盖 8 个类别，包括数据获取、打包优化和组件模式。为指导代码生成和重构决策提供了优先的影响评估。","ja":"Vercel が検証した 45 の React パフォーマンス ルールを自動検出して適用し、データ取得、バンドル最適化、コンポーネント パターンなど 8 つのカテゴリをカバーする。コード生成およびリファクタリングの決定を導くための優先順位付きの影響評価を提供する。","ko":"Vercel이 검증한 45개의 React 성능 규칙을 자동으로检测하고 적용하여 데이터 가져오기, 번들 최적화, 컴포넌트 패턴 등을 포함한 8개의 카테고리를 커버합니다. 코드 생성 및 리팩토링 결정에 대한 우선순위가 있는 影響 평가를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la detección y implementación automatizadas de 45 reglas de rendimiento de React validadas por Vercel en 8 categorías, incluyendo la obtención de datos, la optimización de empaquetado y los patrones de componentes. Proporciona una evaluación de impacto priorizada para guiar las decisiones de generación y refactorización de código.","fr":"Permet la détection et la mise en œuvre automatisées de 45 règles de performances React validées par Vercel dans 8 catégories, notamment la récupération de données, l''optimisation du packaging et les modèles de composants. Fournit une évaluation d''impact priorisée pour guider les décisions de génération et de refactoring de code.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Erkennung und Implementierung von 45 von Vercel validierten React-Leistungsregeln in 8 Kategorien, einschließlich Datenabruf, Optimierung der Bundling und Komponentenmuster. Bietet eine priorisierte Auswirkungsabschätzung, um die Entscheidungen zur Codegenerierung und -refactoring zu leiten.","pt":"Permite a detecção e implementação automatizadas de 45 regras de desempenho do React validadas pelo Vercel em 8 categorias, incluindo busca de dados, otimização de empacotamento e padrões de componentes. Fornece avaliação de impacto priorizada para orientar as decisões de geração e refatoração de código.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически обнаруживать и реализовывать 45 правил производительности React, проверенных Vercel, в 8 категориях, включая получение данных, оптимизацию пакетирования и шаблоны компонентов. Предоставляет оценку приоритета воздействия для руководства решениями по генерации и рефакторингу кода.","ar":"تمكن من الكشف التلقائي والتنفيذ لقواعد أداء React المحسنة في 45 حالة موضحة من قبل Vercel في 8 فئات، بما في ذلك استرجاع البيانات وتحسين التعبئة ونمط المكونات. يوفر تقييم تأثير موجه لإرشاد قرارات توليد الشفرة وإعادة هيكلتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance-focused React component generation","Refactoring existing Next.js applications to Vercel standards","Implementing optimized data fetching strategies (client/server-side)","Analyzing bundle size and implementing code splitting"],"zh":["自动化以性能为中心的 React 组件生成","将现有的 Next.js 应用程序重构为 Vercel 标准","实施优化的数据获取策略（客户端/服务器端）","分析包大小并实施代码分割"],"ja":["パフォーマンスに焦点を当てた React コンポーネントの自動生成","既存の Next.js アプリケーションを Vercel 標準にリファクタリングする","最適化されたデータ取得戦略（クライアント側/サーバー側）を実装する","バンドルサイズを分析してコード分割を実装する"],"ko":["성능 중심의 React 컴포넌트 자동 생성","기존 Next.js 애플리케이션을 Vercel 표준으로 리팩토링","최적화된 데이터 가져오기 전략(클라이언트/서버 측) 구현","번들 크기 분석 및 코드 분할 구현"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de componentes de React enfocados en el rendimiento","Refactorización de aplicaciones existentes de Next.js a los estándares de Vercel","Implementación de estrategias de obtención de datos optimizadas (cliente/servidor)","Análisis del tamaño del paquete y implementación de la división de código"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de composants React axés sur les performances","Refactoring d''applications Next.js existantes aux normes Vercel","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de récupération de données optimisées (client/serveur)","Analyse de la taille du paquet et mise en œuvre de la division de code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von React-Komponenten mit Fokus auf Leistung","Refactoring bestehender Next.js-Anwendungen auf Vercel-Standards","Implementierung optimierter Datenabrufstrategien (Client/Server)","Analyse der Bundle-Größe und Implementierung von Code-Splitting"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de componentes React focados no desempenho","Refatorar aplicações existentes do Next.js para atender aos padrões do Vercel","Implementar estratégias de busca de dados otimizadas (lado do cliente/lado do servidor)","Analisar o tamanho do pacote e implementar a divisão de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию компонентов React, ориентированных на производительность","Рефакторить существующие приложения Next.js для соответствия стандартам Vercel","Реализовывать оптимизированные стратегии получения данных (клиентская/серверная сторона)","Анализировать размер пакета и реализовывать разделение кода"],"ar":["توفير توليد مكونات React آلي مع التركيز على الأداء","إعادة هيكلة التطبيقات الحالية من Next.js لتحقيق معايير Vercel","تنفيذ استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات المُحسنة (جانب العميل/جانب الخادم)","تحليل حجم الحزمة وتنفيذ تقسيم الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["React/Next.js specific optimization only","Requires existing React codebase for refactoring scenarios","Focuses exclusively on Vercel''s performance framework"],"zh":["仅针对 React/Next.js 的优化","需要现有的 React 代码库用于重构场景","仅专注于 Vercel 的性能框架"],"ja":["React/Next.js 専用の最適化のみ","リファクタリングシナリオには既存の React コードベースが必要","Vercel のパフォーマンス フレームワークにのみ焦点を当てて"],"ko":["React/Next.js 전용 최적화만","리팩토링 시나리오에는 기존의 React 코드베이스가 필요","Vercel의 성능 프레임워크에만 집중"],"es":["Optimización específica de React/Next.js solo","Requiere una base de código React existente para escenarios de refactorización","Se centra exclusivamente en el marco de trabajo de rendimiento de Vercel"],"fr":["Optimisation spécifique à React/Next.js uniquement","Nécessite une base de code React existante pour les scénarios de refactoring","Se concentre exclusivement sur le cadre de travail de performances de Vercel"],"de":["Reine React/Next.js-spezifische Optimierung","Benötigt eine bestehende React-Codebasis für Refactoring-Szenarien","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf Vercels Leistungsframework"],"pt":["Otimização específica do React/Next.js apenas","Exige uma base de código React existente para cenários de refatoração","Concentra-se exclusivamente no quadro de desempenho do Vercel"],"ru":["Оптимизация только для React/Next.js","Требует существующей базы кода React для сценариев рефакторинга","Сосредоточен исключительно на框архитектуре производительности Vercel"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء الخاص ب React/Next.js فقط","يتطلب قاعدة شفرة React موجودة لسيناريوهات إعادة الهيكلة","يركز حصرياً على إطار أداء Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
