a e geração de código","Otimização para React e Next.js","Melhoria do desempenho das aplicações"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации оптимизации","Руководство для автоматической рефакторации и генерации кода","Оптимизация для React и Next.js","Улучшение производительности приложений"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد الأولوية لتحسين الأداء","دليل لتحسين وتوليد الكود","تحسين أداء تطبيقات ري액ت ونيكست.جس","تحسين أداء التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","最佳实践","React 优化","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["Vercel React","ベストプラクティス","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["Vercel React","최상의 실践","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["React","Vercel","Next.js","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","aplicaciones web","rendimiento de aplicaciones","automatización de código"],"fr":["React","Vercel","Next.js","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","développement web","applications web","performances des applications","automatisation de code"],"de":["React","Vercel","Next.js","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","Webentwicklung","Webanwendungen","Anwendungsleistung","Codeautomatisierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","React performance","Vercel","Guia de otimização"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","React производительность","Vercel","Руководство по оптимизации"],"ar":["ري액ت فيرسيل","أفضل الممارسات لري액ت","تحسين أداء ري액ت","نيكست.جس","تطوير الويب","أداء ري액ت","فيرسيل","دليل تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"kl3inIT","repo":"shoes-shopping-online-system-fe","repoPath":"kl3inIT/shoes-shopping-online-system-fe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:04:35.894Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React和Next.js性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsの高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프런트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and optimizing bundling for better performance, leveraging client and server-side data fetching.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，适用于React和Next.js应用，使用45条规则，跨8个类别，按影响力优先，并优化捆绑以提高性能，利用客户端和服务器端数据获取。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsアプリケーション向けに45のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって影響度に基づいて優先化し、バンドルの最適化によりパフォーマンスを向上させるためにクライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得を利用して、コードの自動リファクタリングと生成を可能にします。","ko":"리액트와 넥스트 자스를 위한 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능한하며, 8개 카테고리에 걸쳐 45개의 규칙을 영향력에 따라 우선순위를 매기고, 클라이언트 및 서버 측 데이터 가져오기를 활용하여 번들을 최적화하여 성능을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto y optimizando la agrupación para un mejor rendimiento, aprovechando la recuperación de datos del lado del cliente y del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact et optimisant le regroupement pour de meilleures performances, en exploitant la récupération de données côté client et côté serveur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert und die Bündelung für eine bessere Leistung optimiert werden, indem Client- und Server-seitige Datenabfrage genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicações React e Next.js usando 45 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e otimizando o agrupamento para melhor desempenho, aproveitando os dados de busca do cliente e do servidor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по степени воздействия, и оптимизируя сборку для лучшей производительности, используя данные клиентской и серверной выборки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تutomation إعادة هيكلة وإنشاء رمز لتطبيقات React و Next.js باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، يتم تحديد الأولوية لها حسب التأثير، وضبط التجميع لتحقيق أداء أفضل، مستفيداً من بيانات العميل وبيانات الخادم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues","Generating optimized React components and Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Optimizing bundling for faster application loading"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以查找性能问题","生成优化的React组件和Next.js页面","重构现有的React和Next.js代码以提高性能","优化捆绑以实现更快的应用程序加载"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を検出するためのコードレビューの自動化","最適化されたReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページの生成","パフォーマンスの向上のための既存のReactとNext.jsコードのリファクタリング","より高速なアプリケーションの読み込みのためのバンドルの最適化"],"ko":["성능 문제를 확인하기 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","최적화된 리액트 컴포넌트 및 넥스트 자스 페이지 생성","성능 향상을 위한 기존 리액트 및 넥스트 자스 코드 리팩토링","더 빠른 애플리케이션 로딩을 위한 번들 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento","Generar componentes de React y páginas de Next.js optimizados","Refactorizar el código de React y Next.js existente para un mejor rendimiento","Optimizar la agrupación para una carga de aplicaciones más rápida"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances","Générer des composants React et des pages Next.js optimisés","Refactoriser le code React et Next.js existant pour de meilleures performances","Optimiser le regroupement pour un chargement d''applications plus rapide"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme","Generieren von optimierten React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Refaktorisieren von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für eine bessere Leistung","Optimieren der Bündelung für ein schnelleres Laden von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho","Gerar componentes React e páginas Next.js otimizados","Refatorar código React e Next.js existente para melhor desempenho","Otimizar o agrupamento para carregamento de aplicativos mais rápido"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты React и страницы Next.js","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Оптимизировать сборку для более быстрой загрузки приложений"],"ar":["توفير التلقائية لمراجعة الشفرة لمشاكل الأداء","إنشاء مكونات React وصفحات Next.js المُحسنة","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء","تحسين التجميع لتحميل التطبيقات بشكل أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to React and Next.js applications","Dependent on Vercel guidelines and updates"],"zh":["需要React和Next.js的知识","仅限于React和Next.js应用","依