ادة هيكلة التلقائية للرمز","генерация رمز محسّن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","Vercel 指南","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 开发","Next.js 开发"],"ja":["React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","Vercel ガイド","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React 開発","Next.js 開発"],"ko":["리액트 최적화 가이드","넥스트.js 성능 최적화","버셀 가이드","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","리액트 개발","넥스트.js 개발"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización del rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","rendimiento de aplicaciones","optimización de código"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","performances des applications","optimisation de code"],"de":["Vercel React","Best-Practices","Leistungs-Optimierung","React","Next.js","Web-Entwicklung","Anwendungs-Leistung","Code-Optimierung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Vercel","melhores práticas","desempenho de aplicação","refatoração de código","geração de código"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Vercel","лучшие практики","производительность приложения","рефакторинг кода","генерация кода"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","Vercel","أفضل الممارسات","أداء التطبيق","إعادة هيكلة الرمز","генерация الرمز"]}},"owner":"frankstallone","repo":"f4-tonal-foundry","repoPath":"frankstallone/f4-tonal-foundry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:05:04.005Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React和Next.js性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsの高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide for improved client and server-side data fetching and bundling optimization.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于React和Next.js应用，利用45条规则跨8个类别，按影响力优先，并利用Vercel的综合性能优化指南来改进客户端和服务器端数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsアプリケーションに対して、45のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって影響力に基づいて優先順位付けし、Vercelの包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを利用してクライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得およびバンドル最適化を改善するためのコードの自動リファクタリングと生成を可能にします。","ko":"리액트와 넥스트.js 애플리케이션을 위해 45개의 규칙을 8개의 범주에 걸쳐 영향에 따라 우선순위를 정하고, 버셀의 포괄적인 성능 최적화 가이드를 활용하여 클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 개선하기 위한 코드의 자동 리팩토링 및 생성을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la guía integral de optimización del rendimiento de Vercel para una mejor captura y optimización de datos del lado del cliente y del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réfactorisation et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide complet d''optimisation des performances de Vercel pour une meilleure récupération et optimisation des données côté client et côté serveur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refaktorisierung und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind, und die umfassende Leistungsoptimierungsanleitung von Vercel für eine verbesserte Client- und Server-seitige Datenabfrage und Bundling-Optimierung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicativos React e Next.js usando 45 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e utilizando o guia abrangente de otimização de desempenho da Vercel para melhorar a obtenção de dados do cliente e do servidor e a otimização de empacotamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по степени воздействия, и использует всесторонний гид по оптимизации производительности Vercel для улучшения получения данных на стороне клиента и сервера и оптимизации пакетирования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير الترميز التلقائي وتوليد الرمز للطبيقات React و Next.js باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، يتم تحديد الأولوية لها حسب التأثير، وتستفيد من دليل تحسين الأداء الشامل من Vercel لتحسين استرجاع البيانات على جانب العميل والخادم وتحسين التجميع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues","Generating optimized React components and Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以发现性能问题","生成优化的React组件和Next.js页面","重构现有的React和Next.js代码以获得更好的性能","实施高效的数据获取策略"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を発見するためのコードレビューの自動化","最適化されたReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページの生成","パフォーマンスの向上のための既存のReactとNext.jsコードのリファクタリング","効率的なデータ取得戦略の実施"],"ko":["성능 문제를 발견하기 위한 코드 리뷰의 자동화","최적화된 리액트 컴포넌트 및 넥스트.js 페이지의 생성","성능 개선을 위한 기존 리액트 및 넥스트.js 코드의 리팩토링","효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략의 구현"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento","Generar componentes de React y páginas de Next.js optimizados","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar estrategias de captura de datos eficientes"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances","Générer des composants React et des pages Next.js optimisés","Réfactoriser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de récupération de données efficaces"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme","Generieren von optimierten React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Refaktorisieren von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für bessere Leistung","Implementieren effizienter Datenabfragestrategien"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho","Gerar componentes React e páginas Next.js otimizados","Refatorar código React e Next.js existente para melhor desempenho","Implementar estratégias de obtenção de dados eficientes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты React и страницы Next.js","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для улучшения производительности","Реализовывать эффективные стратегии получения данных"],"ar":["توفير مراجعة الترميز التلقائية لأخطاء الأداء","توليد مكونات React وصفحات Next.js المُحسّنة","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي من أجل تحسين الأداء","تنفيذ استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات الفعّالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to JavaScript and TypeScript applications"],"zh":["需要React和Next.js的知识","仅限于JavaScript和TypeScript应用"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsの知識が必要","JavaScriptとTypeScriptアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["리액트 및 넥스트.js에 대한 지식이 필요","자바스크립트 및 타입스크립트 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones de JavaScript y TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux applications JavaScript et TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf JavaScript- und TypeScript-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações JavaScript e TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен приложениями JavaScript и TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود بالتطبيقات التي تستخدم لغات JavaScript و TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
