"description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:05:01.763Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React和Next.js性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsの高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e do Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الامامي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide, including data fetching and bundling optimization.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，适用于React和Next.js应用，使用45条规则跨8个类别，按影响力优先，并利用Vercel的综合性能优化指南，包括数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsアプリケーション向けに、45のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって、影響度に基づいて優先し、Vercelの包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを利用し、データ取得とバンドル最適化を含む自動リファクタリングとコード生成の機能をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 자동화하여 리팩토링하고 코드를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 8개 카테고리에 걸쳐 45개의 규칙을 영향력에 따라 우선순위를 매기고, Vercel의 종합적인 성능 최적화 가이드를 활용하여 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la guía integral de optimización del rendimiento de Vercel, incluida la optimización de la recopilación de datos y la agrupación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide complet d''optimisation des performances de Vercel, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind und Vercels umfassende Leistungsoptimierungsanleitung nutzen, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicações React e Next.js usando 45 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e aproveitando o guia abrangente de otimização de desempenho da Vercel, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по влиянию, и используя всесторонний гид по оптимизации производительности Vercel, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и пакетирования.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تutomation إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز للتطبيقات React و Next.js باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات ، يتم تحديدها حسب التأثير ، وتستفيد من دليل شاملة لتحسين الأداء من Vercel ، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحزم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React code for better performance and maintainability","Optimizing bundling for faster application loading times"],"zh":["自动化React组件的代码审查以发现性能问题","使用服务器端渲染生成优化的Next.js页面","重构现有的React代码以获得更好的性能和可维护性","优化打包以实现更快的应用程序加载时间"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのコードレビューを自動化してパフォーマンスの問題を特定する","サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用して最適化されたNext.jsページを生成する","既存のReactコードをリファクタリングしてパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる","バンドルを最適化してアプリケーションの読み込み時間を短縮する"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트의 코드 리뷰를 자동화하여 성능 문제를 식별하는こと","서버 측 렌더링을 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성하는 것","기존 React 코드를 리팩토링하여 성능과 유지 보수성을 개선하는 것","번들을 최적화하여 애플리케이션의 로딩 시간을 단축하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en componentes de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con representación del lado del servidor","Reorganizar el código de React existente para un mejor rendimiento y mantenibilidad","Optimizar la agrupación para tiempos de carga de aplicaciones más rápidos"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les composants React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec un rendu côté serveur","Réorganiser le code React existant pour de meilleures performances et maintenabilité","Optimiser le regroupement pour des temps de chargement d''applications plus rapides"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit Server-seitiger Rendering","Umstrukturieren des bestehenden React-Codes für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit","Optimieren der Bündelung für schnellere Ladezeiten von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em componentes React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com renderização no lado do servidor","Refatorar código React existente para melhor desempenho e manutenibilidade","Otimizar empacotamento para tempos de carregamento de aplicativos mais rápidos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в компонентах React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с серверной отрисовкой","Перестраивать существующий код React для лучшей производительности и поддерживаемости","Оптимизировать пакетирование для более быстрой загрузки приложений"],"ar":["تutomation مراجعة الشفرة لمشاكل الأداء في مكونات React","توليد صفحات Next.js المُحسّنة مع عرض الخادم","إعادة هيكلة رمز React الحالي لتحسين الأداء والصيانة","تحسين التغليف لأوقات تحميل التطبيقات أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to Vercel''s specific performance optimization rules and guidelines"],"zh":["需要了解React和Next.js","仅限于Vercel的特定性能优化规则和指南"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsの知識が必要","Vercelの特定のパフォーマンス最適化ルールとガイドに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요함","Vercel의 특정 성능 최적화 규칙 및 가이드로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a las reglas y pautas específicas de optimización del rendimiento de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux règles et directives spécifiques d''optimisation des performances de Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf Vercels spezifische Leistungsoptimierungsregeln und -richtlinien"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado às regras e diretrizes específicas de otimização de desempenho da Vercel"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен конкретными правилами и руководствами по оптимизации производительности Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود بقواعد و إرشادات تحسين الأداء الخاصة بـ Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
