目标构建/测试，基于变化的内容进行优化","ja":"Run Checksスキルは、最小の静的チェックとターゲットビルド/テストを実行し、変更された内容に基づいて最適化","ko":"Run Checks 기능은 최소한의 정적 검사와 대상 빌드/테스트를 실행하며 변경된 내용을 기반으로 최적화","es":"La habilidad ''run-checks'' ejecuta comprobaciones estáticas minimas y construcciones/pruebas dirigidas para optimizar el flujo de trabajo","fr":"La compétence ''run-checks'' exécute des vérifications statiques minimales et des constructions/tests ciblés pour optimiser le flux de travail","de":"Die Fähigkeit ''run-checks'' führt minimale statische Überprüfungen und gezielte Builds/Tests aus, um den Arbeitsablauf zu optimieren","pt":"Run-Checks executa o conjunto mínimo de verificações estáticas e compilações/testes direcionados com base no que mudou.","ru":"Run-Checks выполняет минимальный набор статических проверок и нацеленных сборок/тестов на основе того, что изменилось.","ar":"Run-Checks يقوم بتشغيل مجموعة صغيرة من الفحوصات الثابتة والبناء/الاختبارات المستهدفة بناءً على ما تم تغييره.","en":"Inline is a fast, lightweight, scalable, and powerful work chat app which enables unprecedented collaboration bandwidth."},"definition":{"en":"Inline is a fast, lightweight, scalable, and powerful work chat app which enables unprecedented collaboration bandwidth."},"features":{"zh":["快速静态检查","目标构建和测试","基于变化的内容进行优化","支持多个代码仓库","灵活的配置选项"],"ja":["高速静的チェック","ターゲットビルドとテスト","変更された内容に基づいて最適化","複数のコードリポジトリをサポート","柔軟な設定オプション"],"ko":["빠른 정적 검사","대상 빌드 및 테스트","변경된 내용을 기반으로 최적화","여러 코드 저장소를 지원","유연한 구성 옵션"],"es":["Ejecuta comprobaciones estáticas minimas","Construcciones y pruebas dirigidas","Identifica cambios en el código","Optimiza el flujo de trabajo","Soporte para múltiples áreas del proyecto"],"fr":["Exécute des vérifications statiques minimales","Constructions et tests ciblés","Identifie les changements dans le code","Optimise le flux de travail","Prise en charge de plusieurs domaines du projet"],"de":["Führt minimale statische Überprüfungen aus","Gezielte Builds und Tests","Identifiziert Änderungen im Code","Optimiert den Arbeitsablauf","Unterstützung für mehrere Projektbereiche"],"pt":["Executa verificações rápidas e focalizadas","Otimiza o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","Identifica o escopo das alterações","Confirma com o usuário antes de etapas de longa duração","Suporta vários diretórios e subdiretórios"],"ru":["Выполняет быстрые и сосредоточенные проверки","Оптимизирует рабочий процесс разработки","Определяет объем изменений","Запрашивает подтверждение у пользователя перед длительными шагами","Поддерживает несколько директорий и поддиректорий"],"ar":["يقوم بتشغيل الفحوصات السريعة والمتعمقة","يحسن تدفق العمل التطويري","يحدد نطاق التغييرات","يتأكد من موافقة المستخدم قبل الخطوات الطويلة","يدعم العديد من الدلائل والفرعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Run Checks","静态检查","目标构建","代码优化","开发效率","代码仓库"],"ja":["Run Checks","静的チェック","ターゲットビルド","コード最適化","開発効率","コードリポジトリ"],"ko":["Run Checks","정적 검사","대상 빌드","코드 최적화","개발 효율성","코드 저장소"],"es":["comprobaciones rápidas","flujo de trabajo optimizado","construcciones y pruebas","identificación de cambios","soporte para proyectos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["vérifications rapides","flux de travail optimisé","constructions et tests","identification de changements","support pour les projets","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["schnelle Überprüfungen","optimierter Arbeitsablauf","gezielte Builds und Tests","Identifizierung von Änderungen","Unterstützung für Projekte","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Run-Checks","verificações rápidas","otimização de fluxo de trabalho","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","git status","git diff"],"ru":["Run-Checks","быстрые проверки","оптимизация рабочего процесса","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","git статус","git дифф"],"ar":["Run-Checks","الفحوصات السريعة","تحسين تدفق العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","حالة جيت","فرق جيت"]}},"owner":"inline-chat","repo":"inline","repoPath":"inline-chat/inline","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-checks","description":"Run static checks and high-level validation before a production push in the Inline repo. Use when asked to run checks, verify correctness, or do pre-push/pre-release validation across server/web/admin/apple/cli/proto changes.","bodyPreview":"# Run Checks\n\n## Overview\nRun the minimal set of static checks and targeted builds/tests based on what changed. Prefer fast, focused checks and confirm with the user before long-running steps.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n### 1) Identify Scope\nRun `git status -sb` and `git diff --name-only`. Group changes by top-level area:\n\n- `server/`\n- `web/`\n- `admin/`\n- `apple/InlineKit`\n- `apple/InlineUI`\n- `apple/InlineIOS`\n- `apple/InlineMac`\n- `cli/`\n- `proto/`\n\nIf only docs or comments changed, report t","body":"# Run Checks\n\n## Overview\nRun the minimal set of static checks and targeted builds/tests based on what changed. Prefer fast, focused checks and confirm with the user before long-running steps.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n### 1) Identify Scope\nRun `git status -sb` and `git diff --name-only`. Group changes by top-level area:\n\n- `server/`\n- `web/`\n- `admin/`\n- `apple/InlineKit`\n- `apple/InlineUI`\n- `apple/InlineIOS`\n- `apple/InlineMac`\n- `cli/`\n- `proto/`\n\nIf only docs or comments changed, report that checks are optional and ask whether to skip.\n\n### 2) Run Pre-Checks\nIf `proto/` changed, run `bun run generate:proto` from repo root and include generated diffs.\n\nIf dependencies changed, run the relevant install/build for that stack:\n\n- JS/TS: `bun install`\n- Rust: `cargo fetch` (or rely on `cargo test/check`)\n- Swift: `swift build` in the affected package directory\n\n### 3) Run Component Checks\nRun only what maps to the touched areas.\n\nBackend (`server/`):\n- `cd server && bun run typecheck`\n- `cd server && bun run lint`\n- `cd server && bun test` (prefer targeted tests when possible)\n\nWeb (`web/`):\n- `cd web && bun run typecheck`\n- Run `cd web && bun run build` only when explicitly requested or required for release validation\n\nAdmin (`admin/`):\n- `cd admin && bun run typecheck`\n\nCLI (`cli/` or protocol changes):\n- `cd cli && cargo test` for full validation\n- Use `cd cli && cargo check` if a fast static check is sufficient\n\nSwift packages:\n- `cd apple/InlineKit && swift build` (run `swift test` if tests were modified)\n- `cd apple/InlineUI && swift build`\n\nApps:\n- If changes are in `apple/InlineIOS` or `apple/InlineMac`, do not run full app builds. Ask the user to run `xcodebuild` locally if needed.\n\n### 4) Report Results\nSummarize what ran, what passed/failed, and what was skipped with reasons. For failures, include the first actionable error and the next recommended step.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:05:35.253Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring efficient static code analysis and targeted testing capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高效静态代码分析和有针对性的测试能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが効率的な静的コード分析とターゲットを絞ったテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 효율적인 정적 코드 분석과 목표를 명확하게 하는 테스트 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un análisis de código estático eficiente y capacidades de prueba dirigidas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une analyse de code statique efficace et des capacités de test ciblées.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine effiziente statische Codeanalyse und gezielte Testfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem análise de código estático eficiente e capacidades de teste direcionadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих эффективного статического анализа кода и нацеленных возможностей тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب تحليل код ثابت فعال وقدرات اختبار محددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run minimal sets of static checks and targeted builds/tests based on Git changes, utilizing commands like `git status -sb` and `git diff --name-only` for focused validation, and confirming with users before initiating long-running steps.","zh":"赋予代理运行最小静态检查集和基于 Git 更改的有针对性的构建/测试，利用命令如 `git status -sb` 和 `git diff --name-only` 进行专注的验证，并在启动长时间运行的步骤之前与用户确认。","ja":"エージェントが、Git の変更に基づいて最小限の静的チェックセットとターゲットを絞ったビルド/テストを実行できるようにし、`git status -sb` や `git diff --name-only` のようなコマンドを使用して集中検証を行い、長時間実行されるステップを開始する前にユーザーと確認する。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 변경 사항을 기반으로 최소한의 정적 체크 세트와 목표를 명확하게 하는 빌드/테스트를 실행할 수 있도록 하며, `git status -sb` 및 `git diff --name-only`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 집중적인 검증을 수행하고, 오랜 시간 चल하는 단계를 시작하기 전에 사용자와 확인함으로써 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar conjuntos mínimos de comprobaciones estáticas y compilaciones/pruebas dirigidas basadas en los cambios de Git, utilizando comandos como `git status -sb` y `git diff --name-only` para una validación enfocada, y confirmando con los usuarios antes de iniciar pasos de ejecución prolongada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des ensembles minimalistes de vérifications statiques et des constructions/tests ciblées basées sur les modifications Git, en utilisant des commandes comme `git status -sb` et `git diff --name-only` pour une validation ciblée, et en confirmant avec les utilisateurs avant d''initier des étapes à exécution longue.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, minimale Mengen an statischen Prüfungen und gezielten Builds/Tests auf Basis von Git-Änderungen auszuführen, indem Befehle wie `git status -sb` und `git diff --name-only` für eine fokussierte Überprüfung verwendet werden, und die Benutzer bestätigen, bevor lang laufende Schritte eingeleitet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem conjuntos mínimos de verificações estáticas e compilações/testes direcionados com base em alterações do Git, utilizando comandos como `git status -sb` e `git diff --name-only` para validação focada, e confirmando com os usuários antes de iniciar etapas de longa execução.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать минимальные наборы статических проверок и нацеленных сборок/тестов на основе изменений Git, используя команды как `git status -sb` и `git diff --name-only` для целенаправленной проверки, и подтверждая с пользователями перед началом длительных шагов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل مجموعات صغيرة من عمليات الفحص الثابتة والبناء/الاختبار المستهدف على أساس التغييرات التي أُجريت على Git، باستخدام أوامر مثل `git status -sb` و `git diff --name-only` للتحقق المحدد، والتحقق مع المستخدمين قبل بدء الخطوات التي تستغرق وقتًا طويلاً."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-commit checks for code quality","Debugging specific areas of the codebase like `server/` or `web/`","Optimizing test workflows by running targeted builds/tests"],"zh":["自动执行代码质量的预提交检查","调试代码库的特定区域，如 `server/` 或 `web/`","通过运行有针对性的构建/测试来优化测试工作流"],"ja":["コード品質の事前コミットチェックを自動化する","`server/` または `web/` のようなコードベースの特定の領域をデバッグする","ターゲットを絞ったビルド/テストを実行してテストワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["코드 품질의 사전 커밋 체크를 자동화하는 것","`server/` 또는 `web/`와 같은 코드베이스의 특정 영역을 디버깅하는 것","목표를 명확하게 하는 빌드/테스트를 실행하여 테스트 워크플로우를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones previas al compromiso para la calidad del código","Depuración de áreas específicas del código como `server/` o `web/`","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de prueba mediante la ejecución de compilaciones/pruebas dirigidas"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications préalables à l''engagement pour la qualité du code","Débogage de zones spécifiques du code comme `server/` ou `web/`","Optimisation des flux de travail de test en exécutant des constructions/tests ciblées"],"de":["Automatisierung von Vorkommis-Prüfungen für die Code-Qualität","Fehlerbehebung in bestimmten Bereichen des Codes wie `server/` oder `web/`","Optimierung von Testarbeitsflüssen durch die Ausführung von gezielten Builds/Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações pré-envio para qualidade de código","Depurar áreas específicas do código como `server/` ou `web/`","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de teste executando compilações/testes direcionados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки перед коммитом для качества кода","Отлаживать конкретные области кодовой базы как `server/` или `web/`","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы тестирования, запуская нацеленные сборки/тесты"],"ar":["تأمين الفحوصات قبل الإرسال لنوعية الشفرة","تصحيح أخطاء مناطق محددة من قاعدة الشفرة مثل `server/` أو `web/`","تحسين سير عمل الاختبار من خلال تشغيل عمليات البناء/الاختبار المستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to specific top-level areas like `admin/`, `apple/InlineKit`, and `cli/`"],"zh":["需要 Git 的安装和配置","仅限于特定的顶级区域，如 `admin/`、`apple/InlineKit` 和 `cli/`"],"ja":["Git のインストールと設定が必要","特定のトップレベルの領域（例：`admin/`、`apple/InlineKit`、`cli/`）に限定される"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","특정 최상위 영역(`admin/`, `apple/InlineKit`, `cli/`)에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado a áreas de nivel superior específicas como `admin/`, `apple/InlineKit` y `cli/`"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité à des zones de niveau supérieur spécifiques comme `admin/`, `apple/InlineKit` et `cli/`"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von Git","Begrenzt auf bestimmte oberste Bereiche wie `admin/`, `apple/InlineKit` und `cli/`"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado a áreas de nível superior específicas como `admin/`, `apple/InlineKit`, e `cli/`"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Ограничен конкретными верхними областями как `admin/`, `apple/InlineKit`, и `cli/`"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","محدود بمناطق رئيسية محددة مثل `admin/` و `apple/InlineKit` و `cli/`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('eclipse-rdf4j/rdf4j/debug-surefire', 'community', 'eclipse-rdf4j', 'rdf4j', 'eclipse-rdf4j/rdf4j', 'debug-surefire', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:05:26.315Z', NULL, '{"id":"eclipse-rdf4j/rdf4j/debug-surefire","name":"debug-surefire","description":{"zh":"Debug Surefire 是一个 Java 调试工具，允许您运行 Maven Surefire 测试并附加调试器以步骤执行代码","ja":"Debug Surefire は Java のデバッグ ツールで、Maven Surefire テストを実行し、デバッガーを付けてコードをステップ実行できる","ko":"Debug Surefire는 자바 디버깅 도구로 Maven Surefire 테스트를 실행하고 디버거를附加하여 코드를 단계적으로 실행할 수 있다","es":"Debug-surefire permite depurar pruebas Maven Surefire en modo suspensión JDWP. Es ideal para entornos headless y agentes.","fr":"Debug-surefire permet de déboguer des tests Maven Surefire en mode suspension JDWP. Il est idéal pour les environnements headless et les agents.","de":"Debug-surefire ermöglicht das Debuggen von Maven-Surefire-Tests im JDWP-Suspend-Modus. Es eignet sich hervorragend für headless-Umgebungen und Agenten.","pt":"O debug-surefire é uma ferramenta para executar testes Maven em modo de depuração. Ele permite que você anexe um depurador e passe pela codificação","ru":"Debug-surefire - это инструмент для выполнения тестов Maven в режиме отладки. Он позволяет присоединить отладчик и пройти через кодирование","ar":"ديباج سورفاير هو أداة لتشغيل اختبارات مافن في وضع التصحيح. يسمح لك بالاطلاع على مشاكل التعليمة البرمجية","en":"Eclipse RDF4J: scalable RDF for Java"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Debug Surefire：Java 调试工具","ja":"Debug Surefire：Java デバッグ ツール","ko":"Debug Surefire：자바 디버깅 도구","es":"Depuración de pruebas con debug-surefire","fr":"Débogage de tests avec debug-surefire","de":"Debuggen von Tests mit debug-surefire","pt":"Debug Surefire: Depuração de Testes Maven","ru":"Debug Surefire: Отладка тестов Maven","ar":"ديباج سورفاير: تصحيح أخطاء اختبارات مافن","en":"debug-surefire"},"description":{"zh":"Debug Surefire 是一个 Java 调试工具，允许您运行 Maven Surefire 测试并附加调试器以步骤执行代码","ja":"Debug Surefire は Java のデバッグ ツールで、Maven Surefire テストを実行し、デバッガーを付けてコードをステップ実行できる","ko":"Debug Surefire는 자바 디버깅 도구로 Maven Surefire 테스트를 실행하고 디버거를附加하여 코드를 단계적으로 실행할 수 있다","es":"Debug-surefire permite depurar pruebas Maven Surefire en modo suspensión JDWP. Es ideal para entornos headless y agentes.","fr":"Debug-surefire permet de déboguer des tests Maven Surefire en mode suspension JDWP. Il est idéal pour les environnements headless et les agents.","de":"Debug-surefire ermöglicht das Debuggen von Maven-Surefire-Tests im JDWP-Suspend-Modus. Es eignet sich hervorragend für headless-Umgebungen und Agenten.","pt":"O debug-surefire é uma ferramenta para executar testes Maven em modo de depuração. Ele permite que você anexe um depurador e passe pela codificação","ru":"Debug-surefire - это инструмент для выполнения тестов Maven в режиме отладки. Он позволяет присоединить отладчик и пройти через кодирование","ar":"ديباج سورفاير هو أداة لتشغيل اختبارات مافن في وضع التصحيح. يسمح لك بالاطلاع على مشاكل التعليمة البرمجية","en":"Eclipse RDF4J: scalable RDF for Java"},"definition":{"en":"Eclipse RDF4J: scalable RDF for Java"},"features":{"zh":["运行 Maven Surefire 测试","附加调试器以步骤执行代码","支持头部和代理环境","使用 jdb 附加调试器"],"ja":["Maven Surefire テストを実行","デバッガーを付けてコードをステップ実行","ヘッドレスおよびエージェント環境をサポート","jdb を使用してデバッガーを付ける"],"ko":["Maven Surefire 테스트 실행","디버거를附加하여 코드를 단계적으로 실행","헤드리스 및 에이전트 환경 지원","jdb를 사용하여 디버거를附加"],"es":["Ejecuta pruebas Maven Surefire en modo depuración","Permite la suspensión JDWP para depuración","Se integra con entornos headless y agentes","Utiliza el depurador de línea de comandos del JDK (jdb)","Soporta la ejecución de pruebas en paralelo"],"fr":["Exécute des tests Maven Surefire en mode débogage","Permet la suspension JDWP pour le débogage","S''intègre aux environnements headless et aux agents","Utilise le débogueur de ligne de commande du JDK (jdb)","Prend en charge l''exécution de tests en parallèle"],"de":["Führt Maven-Surefire-Tests im Debug-Modus aus","Ermöglicht die JDWP-Suspension für das Debuggen","Integriert sich in headless-Umgebungen und Agenten","Verwendet den JDK-Befehlszeilendepurierer (jdb)","Unterstützt die parallele Ausführung von Tests"],"pt":["Executa testes Maven em modo de depuração","Permite anexar um depurador","Suporta JDWP","Funciona em ambientes headless","Permite depuração com jdb"],"ru":["Выполняет тесты Maven в режиме отладки","Позволяет присоединить отладчик","Поддерживает JDWP","Работает в средах headless","Позволяет отладку с jdb"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبارات مافن في وضع التصحيح","السماح بالاطلاع على مشاكل التعليمة البرمجية","دعم JDWP","العمل في بيئات رأسية","السماح بالتصحيح مع jdb"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Java 调试","Maven Surefire","Debug Surefire","Java开发","代码调试","头部环境","代理环境"],"ja":["Java デバッグ","Maven Surefire","Debug Surefire","Java 開発","コード デバッグ","ヘッドレス環境","エージェント環境"],"ko":["자바 디버깅","Maven Surefire","Debug Surefire","자바 개발","코드 디버깅","헤드리스 환경","에이전트 환경"],"es":["debug-surefire","depuración de pruebas","Maven Surefire","JDWP","entornos headless","agentes","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software"],"fr":["debug-surefire","débogage de tests","Maven Surefire","JDWP","environnements headless","agents","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels"],"de":["debug-surefire","Debuggen von Tests","Maven-Surefire","JDWP","headless-Umgebungen","Agenten","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests"],"pt":["debug-surefire","depuração de testes","Maven","Surefire","JDWP","jdb","desenvolvimento de software","testes de unidade"],"ru":["debug-surefire","отладка тестов","Maven","Surefire","JDWP","jdb","разработка программного обеспечения","ユニット-тесты"],"ar":["ديباج سورفاير","تصحيح أخطاء اختبارات","مافن","سورفاير","JDWP","jdb","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدة"]}},"owner":"eclipse-rdf4j","repo":"rdf4j","repoPath":"eclipse-rdf4j/rdf4j","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"debug-surefire","description":"Debug Maven Surefire unit tests by running them in JDWP wait for debugger mode (`-Dmaven.surefire.debug`) and attaching to the forked test JVM using **jdb** (preferred for CLI/agent debugging), IntelliJ, or VS Code. Use when asked to debug/step through a failing JUnit test, attach a debugger to a Maven test run, or run `mvn test -Dtest=Class[#method]` suspended on a port (including multi-module `-pl` runs). The JVM will block at startup until a debugger attaches; the agent should attach with `jdb -attach <host>:<port>` and drive the session from the terminal.","bodyPreview":"# debug-surefire\n\nRun Maven Surefire tests **suspended in JDWP** so you can attach a debugger and step through the code.  \nIn headless/agent environments, **attach with `jdb`** (the JDK’s command-line debugger).\n\n## What this does\n\n- Runs `mvn test` with Surefire in debug mode via `-Dmaven.surefire.debug`.\n- Surefire launches the **forked test JVM** with a JDWP socket and `suspend=y`, meaning:\n  - the forked JVM starts,\n  - prints “Listening for transport dt_socket at address: <port>”,\n  - then","body":"# debug-surefire\n\nRun Maven Surefire tests **suspended in JDWP** so you can attach a debugger and step through the code.  \nIn headless/agent environments, **attach with `jdb`** (the JDK’s command-line debugger).\n\n## What this does\n\n- Runs `mvn test` with Surefire in debug mode via `-Dmaven.surefire.debug`.\n- Surefire launches the **forked test JVM** with a JDWP socket and `suspend=y`, meaning:\n  - the forked JVM starts,\n  - prints “Listening for transport dt_socket at address: <port>”,\n  - then **waits** until a debugger attaches,\n  - only then does it begin executing tests.\n\nThis is important: you do **not** attach to the `mvn` process itself; you attach to the **forked JVM** running the tests.\n\n## Quick start\n\n1) Start a suspended test run\n\n- Debug a test class:\n  - `.codex/skills/debug-surefire/scripts/debug-surefire.sh --test-class MyTest`\n- Debug a single test method (quote the `#`):\n  - `.codex/skills/debug-surefire/scripts/debug-surefire.sh --test ''MyTest#shouldDoThing''`\n- Debug a test in a specific module:\n  - `.codex/skills/debug-surefire/scripts/debug-surefire.sh --module core/sail/shacl --test-class ShaclSailTest`\n  - `.codex/skills/debug-surefire/scripts/debug-surefire.sh --module rdf4j-sail-shacl --test ''ShaclSailTest#testSomething''`\n\nWhen the forked JVM is ready, you should see something like:\n\n- `Listening for transport dt_socket at address: 55005`\n\n2) Attach with `jdb` (preferred)\n\nIn a second terminal, attach to the printed port:\n\n- Local attach (port only implies localhost):\n  - `jdb -attach 55005`\n- Explicit host+port:\n  - `jdb -attach localhost:55005`\n\nIf you need source listing inside jdb, provide a sourcepath up front:\n\n- `jdb -sourcepath module/src/main/java:module/src/test/java -attach 55005`\n\n3) Set breakpoints / catches, then resume\n\nOnce you’re at the `jdb` prompt, set a breakpoint (or exception catch) and continue:\n\n- `stop in com.example.MyTest.shouldDoThing`\n- `catch uncaught java.lang.AssertionError`\n- `cont`\n\nTip: right after attaching to a just-started suspended JVM, `jdb` may show:\n- `No frames on the current call stack`\n\nThat’s normal. The JVM hasn’t executed into any Java frames yet. Set breakpoints first, then `cont`.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- The script runs a fast pre-test install (`-Pquick` into the repo-local `.m2_repo`) and then runs `mvn test` with Surefire in debug mode.\n- Use `SUREFIRE_DEBUG_PORT=8000` to change the port (default: `55005`).\n- Use `--no-offline` / `--online` if offline (`-o`) resolution fails.\n- Everything after `--` is passed to Maven, e.g.:\n  - `.codex/skills/debug-surefire/scripts/debug-surefire.sh --test-class MyTest -- -DtrimStackTrace=false -DfailIfNoTests=false -DforkCount=1 -DreuseForks=false`\n\n---\n\n## jdb interaction guide\n\nThis section is optimized for quickly getting signal from a failing unit test without drowning in framework/JDK internals.\n\n### Command cheat sheet (the ones you’ll actually use)\n\n**Start / resume**\n- `cont` — continue execution from current stop/breakpoint\n- `run` — start execution *when jdb launched the VM* (less relevant when you used `-attach`)\n\n**Breakpoints**\n- `stop in <class>.<method>` — break on method entry\n- `stop at <class>:<line>` — break at a specific line\n- `stop` — list all breakpoints\n- `clear <class>.<method>` / `clear <class>:<line>` — remove a breakpoint\n- `clear` — list breakpoints (same idea as `stop` listing)\n\n**Stepping**\n- `next` — step over calls (line-level)\n- `step` — step into calls (line-level)\n- `step up` — run until current method returns\n- `stepi` — step one bytecode instruction (rarely needed)\n\n**Threads / stacks**\n- `threads` — list threads\n- `thread <id>` — select default thread\n- `where` — stack trace for current thread\n- `where all` — stack traces for all threads\n- `up` / `down` — move the current frame up/down the stack\n\n**Inspect state**\n- `locals` — print locals in current frame\n- `print <expr>` — evaluate/print an expression (same as `eval`)\n- `dump <expr>` — more complete object dump\n- `set <lvalue> = <expr>` — mutate a variable/field (use sparingly)\n\n**Source**\n- `list` — show source around current line\n- `list <line>` or `list <method>` — show a specific region\n- `use <path1>:<path2>` (aka `sourcepath`) — set where jdb looks for sources\n\n**Exceptions**\n- `catch uncaught <exception>` — break when an uncaught exception occurs\n- `catch caught <exception>` — break when a caught exception occurs\n- `catch all <exception>` — break for both caught+uncaught\n- `ignore ...` — undo a catch\n\n**Reduce noise**\n- `exclude <pattern>,<pattern>,...` — don’t report step/method events for matching classes\n- `exclude none` — clear exclusions\n\n**Automation**\n- `monitor <command>` — run a command every time the program stops (e.g., `monitor where`)\n- `read <file>` — execute commands from a file\n- `!!` — repeat last command\n- `<n> <command>` — repeat command n times (e.g., `10 next`)\n\n### Efficient workflow for failing JUnit tests\n\n#### 1) Add exclusions immediately (so stepping doesn’t become a swamp)\n\nRight after connecting, set exclusions to avoid stepping into JDK/framework code:\n\n- `exclude java.*,javax.*,jdk.*,sun.*,com.sun.*,org.junit.*,org.junit.jupiter.*,org.assertj.*,org.hamcrest.*,org.mockito.*,org.apache.maven.*`\n\nYou can always clear this later:\n\n- `exclude none`\n\n#### 2) Break where it matters\n\nCommon breakpoint patterns:\n\n- Break at the failing test method:\n  - `stop in com.example.MyTest.shouldDoThing`\n\n- Break inside the code under test:\n  - `stop in com.example.service.FooService.doWork`\n\n- Break at a specific suspicious line:\n  - `stop at com.example.service.FooService:123`\n\nIf the method is overloaded, specify argument types:\n\n- `stop in com.example.FooService.doWork(int,java.lang.String)`\n\nNote: `jdb` supports **deferred breakpoints**. If the class isn’t loaded yet, it will still accept the breakpoint and activate it when the class loads.\n\n#### 3) Break on the *failure*, not just your guess\n\nFor unit tests, breaking on the thrown assertion/error is often faster than guessing a line.\n\nUseful catches:\n\n- Classic Java assertions / many test failures:\n  - `catch uncaught java.lang.AssertionError`\n\n- Common in JUnit 5 assertions:\n  - `catch uncaught org.opentest4j.AssertionFailedError`\n\n- NPE hunting:\n  - `catch uncaught java.lang.NullPointerException`\n\nYou can remove a catch with `ignore`:\n\n- `ignore uncaught java.lang.AssertionError`\n\nTip: `catch all java.lang.Throwable` is the nuclear option. It works, but it can get loud.\n\n#### 4) Resume and drive\n\nOnce breakpoints/catches are set:\n\n- `cont`\n\nWhen you hit a breakpoint:\n\n- `where` to see the call stack\n- `list` to see nearby source\n- `locals` to see local variables\n- `print someVar` or `print this.someField` to inspect\n- `next` to step over, `step` to step into\n\n#### 5) Find the “real” test thread quickly\n\nSurefire + JUnit can spin up multiple threads (and Maven itself has its own). When in doubt:\n\n- `threads`\n- `where all`\n\nThen pick the thread that’s in your test/code-under-test:\n\n- `thread <id>`\n- `where`\n\n#### 6) Keep the JVM count predictable\n\nSurefire forking and parallelism can make debugging confusing. If you see multiple JVMs / inconsistent behavior, pass Maven flags to keep it single and fresh:\n\n- `-DforkCount=1 -DreuseForks=false`\n\nExample:\n\n- `.codex/skills/debug-surefire/scripts/debug-surefire.sh --test ''MyTest#shouldDoThing'' -- -DforkCount=1 -DreuseForks=false`\n\n#### 7) Use “thread-only” breakpoints when concurrency matters\n\nBy default, `jdb` breakpoints suspend all threads, which can create deadlocks in concurrent tests. You can tell jdb to suspend only the thread that hits the breakpoint:\n\n- `stop thread in com.example.concurrent.Worker.run`\n\n(You can also target a specific thread id with `stop thread <thread_id> in ...` if needed.)\n\n---\n\n## jdb startup customization (optional but powerful)\n\njdb will execute startup commands from `jdb.ini` or `.jdbrc` in either `user.home` or `user.dir`.\n\nThis is handy for keeping your default exclusions/catches consistent, e.g.:\n\n- `exclude java.*,javax.*,jdk.*,sun.*,com.sun.*,org.junit.*,org.assertj.*`\n- `catch uncaught java.lang.AssertionError`\n\nYou can also keep a project-local command file and load it on demand:\n\n- `read .codex/skills/debug-surefire/jdb.cmds`\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **jdb can’t connect**\n  - Confirm the port printed by the suspended JVM matches what you used in `jdb -attach`.\n  - Confirm you’re attaching to the forked JVM port (the one that prints “Listening for transport…”), not Maven’s PID.\n  - If running remotely (CI box / container / VM), ensure the port is reachable or forwarded.\n\n- **Breakpoints don’t hit**\n  - Use fully qualified class names.\n  - If overloaded, include argument types.\n  - Use `classes` to see what’s loaded.\n  - Try `stop at <class>:<line>` to avoid signature mismatch.\n\n- **`list` can’t find source**\n  - Set sourcepath:\n    - `use module/src/main/java:module/src/test/java`\n  - Or launch jdb with `-sourcepath ...` from the start.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:05:26.315Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java-based AI Agents needing to debug Maven Surefire tests with JDWP and jdb command-line debugger integration.","zh":"非常适合需要使用JDWP和jdb命令行调试器集成调试Maven Surefire测试的基于Java的AI代理。","ja":"JDWPおよびjdbコマンドラインデバッガーを使用してMaven Surefireテストをデバッグする必要があるJavaベースのAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"JDWP와 jdb 명령줄 디버거를 사용하여 Maven Surefire 테스트를 디버깅해야 하는 자바 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA basados en Java que necesitan depurar pruebas de Maven Surefire con integración de JDWP y depurador de línea de comandos jdb.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Java ayant besoin de déboguer des tests Maven Surefire avec une intégration de JDWP et de débogueur de ligne de commande jdb.","de":"Perfekt für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die Maven Surefire-Tests mit JDWP- und jdb-Kommandozeilen-Debugger-Integration debuggen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Java que precisam depurar testes Maven Surefire com integração JDWP e depurador de linha de comando jdb.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на Java, которым необходимо отлаживать тесты Maven Surefire с интеграцией JDWP и командной строки jdb.","ar":"مثالي لعميل حاسوبي ذكاء اصطناعي يستند إلى Java ويحتاج إلى تصحيح أخطاء اختبارات Maven Surefire مع دمج JDWP و jdb سطر الأوامر المصحح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run Maven tests in debug mode via -Dmaven.surefire.debug, launching forked test JVMs with JDWP sockets for step-through debugging and issue resolution using protocols like dt_socket.","zh":"使代理能够通过-Dmaven.surefire.debug运行Maven测试以调试模式，启动具有JDWP套接字的分叉测试JVM以进行步骤调试和问题解决，使用诸如dt_socket的协议。","ja":"エージェントが-Dmaven.surefire.debugを介してデバッグモードでMavenテストを実行できるようにし、JDWPソケットを使用したステップ実行デバッグと問題解決を可能にし、dt_socketなどのプロトコルを使用してフォークされたテストJVMを起動します。","ko":"에이전트가 -Dmaven.surefire.debug를 통해 디버깅 모드로 Maven 테스트를 실행할 수 있도록 하여 JDWP 소켓을 사용한 단계별 디버깅 및 문제 해결을 가능하게 하고 dt_socket와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 분기된 테스트 JVM을启动합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas de Maven en modo de depuración a través de -Dmaven.surefire.debug, lanzando máquinas virtuales de prueba bifurcadas con sockets JDWP para depuración paso a paso y resolución de problemas utilizando protocolos como dt_socket.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests Maven en mode débogage via -Dmaven.surefire.debug, en lançant des JVM de test bifurquées avec des sockets JDWP pour une débogage étape par étape et une résolution de problèmes en utilisant des protocoles comme dt_socket.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Maven-Tests im Debug-Modus über -Dmaven.surefire.debug auszuführen, indem sie geforkte Test-JVMs mit JDWP-Sockets für schrittweises Debuggen und Problemlösung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie dt_socket starten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes Maven no modo de depuração via -Dmaven.surefire.debug, iniciando JVMs de teste bifurcados com soquetes JDWP para depuração passo a passo e resolução de problemas usando protocolos como dt_socket.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать тесты Maven в режиме отладки через -Dmaven.surefire.debug, запуская вилочные тестовые JVM с сокетами JDWP для пошаговой отладки и решения проблем с использованием протоколов, таких как dt_socket.","ar":"يمنح العميل الحاسوبي القدرة على تشغيل اختبارات Maven في وضع التصحيح عن طريق -Dmaven.surefire.debug، وإطلاق JVM اختبارات منقسمة مع مداخل JDWP للتصحيح خطوة بخطوة وحل المشكلات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل dt_socket."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging Maven Surefire tests in headless environments","Attaching jdb command-line debugger for step-through analysis","Resolving issues in forked test JVMs with JDWP socket integration"],"zh":["在无头环境中调试Maven Surefire测试","附加jdb命令行调试器进行步骤分析","使用JDWP套接字集成解决分叉测试JVM中的问题"],"ja":["ヘッドレス環境でMaven Surefireテストをデバッグする","jdbコマンドラインデバッガーを接続してステップ実行分析を実行する","JDWPソケットを使用してフォークされたテストJVM内の問題を解決する"],"ko":["헤드리스 환경에서 Maven Surefire 테스트를 디버깅하는 것","jdb 명령줄 디버거를첨부하여 단계별 분석을 수행하는 것","JDWP 소켓을 사용하여 분기된 테스트 JVM 내의 문제를 해결하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de pruebas de Maven Surefire en entornos sin interfaz gráfica","Adjuntar el depurador de línea de comandos jdb para análisis paso a paso","Resolución de problemas en máquinas virtuales de prueba bifurcadas con integración de socket JDWP"],"fr":["Débogage des tests Maven Surefire dans des environnements sans interface graphique","Attacher le débogueur de ligne de commande jdb pour une analyse étape par étape","Résolution de problèmes dans des JVM de test bifurquées avec une intégration de socket JDWP"],"de":["Debuggen von Maven Surefire-Tests in headless Umgebungen","Anhängen des Kommandozeilen-Debuggers jdb für schrittweises Analyse","Behebung von Problemen in geforkten Test-JVMs mit JDWP-Socket-Integration"],"pt":["Depuração de testes Maven Surefire em ambientes headless","Anexar depurador de linha de comando jdb para análise passo a passo","Resolução de problemas em JVMs de teste bifurcadas com integração de soquete JDWP"],"ru":["Отладка тестов Maven Surefire в безголовых средах","Присоединение командной строки jdb для пошагового анализа","Решение проблем в вилочных тестовых JVM с интеграцией сокета JDWP"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء اختبارات Maven Surefire في بيئات headless","الارتباط ب jdb سطر الأوامر المصحح للتحليل خطوة بخطوة","حل المشكلات في JVM اختبارات منقسمة مع دمج مدخل JDWP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JDWP and jdb command-line debugger setup","Limited to Maven Surefire test framework","Needs JDK for command-line debugging capabilities"],"zh":["需要JDWP和jdb命令行调试器设置","仅限于Maven Surefire测试框架","需要JDK用于命令行调试功能"],"ja":["JDWPとjdbコマンドラインデバッガーの設定が必要","Maven Surefireテストフレームワークに限定される","コマンドラインデバッグ機能を使用するにはJDKが必要"],"ko":["JDWP와 jdb 명령줄 디버거 설정이 필요","Maven Surefire 테스트 프레임워크로 제한됨","명령줄 디버깅 기능을 사용하려면 JDK가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de JDWP y depurador de línea de comandos jdb","Limitado al marco de pruebas de Maven Surefire","Necesita JDK para capacidades de depuración de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de JDWP et de débogueur de ligne de commande jdb","Limité au cadre de test Maven Surefire","Nécessite un JDK pour les capacités de débogage de ligne de commande"],"de":["Benötigt JDWP- und jdb-Kommandozeilen-Debugger-Setup","Begrenzt auf Maven Surefire-Testframework","Benötigt JDK für Kommandozeilen-Debugging-Funktionen"],"pt":["Requer configuração JDWP e depurador de linha de comando jdb","Limitado ao framework de teste Maven Surefire","Necessita JDK para capacidades de depuração de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требует настройки JDWP и командной строки jdb","Ограничен фреймворком тестирования Maven Surefire","Требует JDK для возможностей командной строки отладки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد JDWP و jdb سطر الأوامر المصحح","محدود بإطار اختبار Maven Surefire","يحتاج إلى JDK لسمات التصحيح سطر الأوامر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
