간격","불변의 데이터베이스 변경"],"es":["Monitoreo del registro de escritura anticipada de SQLite","Replicación de cambios en almacenamiento en la nube","Archivos LTX inmutables","Subida de cambios a la nube","Configuración de intervalos de monitoreo"],"fr":["Surveillance du journal d''écriture anticipée de SQLite","Réplication des modifications sur le stockage en nuage","Fichiers LTX inaltérables","Téléchargement des modifications sur le nuage","Configuration des intervalles de surveillance"],"de":["Überwachung des Write-Ahead-Logs von SQLite","Replikation von Änderungen in der Cloud","Unveränderliche LTX-Dateien","Hochladen von Änderungen in die Cloud","Konfiguration von Überwachungsintervallen"],"pt":["Monitoramento do Write-Ahead Log (WAL)","Criação de arquivos LTX imutáveis","Upload contínuo para armazenamento em nuvem","Replicação contínua de alterações do banco de dados","Integração com diferentes backends de armazenamento"],"ru":["Мониторинг журнала Write-Ahead Log (WAL)","Создание неизменяемых файлов LTX","Непрерывная загрузка в облачное хранилище","Непрерывная репликация изменений базы данных","Интеграция с разными бэкендами хранилища"],"ar":["مراقبة سجل Write-Ahead Log (WAL)","إنشاء ملفات LTX غير قابلة للتغيير","تحميل مستمر إلى تخزين السحابة","تكرار مستمر للتغييرات على قاعدة البيانات","التكامل مع مختلف خلفيات التخزين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SQLite 灾难恢复","Litestream","云存储","数据库安全","WAL 监视","LTX 文件"],"ja":["SQLite ディザスタ回復","Litestream","クラウドストレージ","データベースセキュリティ","WAL モニタリング","LTX ファイル"],"ko":["SQLite 재해 복구","Litestream","클라우드 저장소","데이터베이스 보안","WAL 모니터링","LTX 파일"],"es":["Litestream","recuperación de desastres","SQLite","bases de datos","almacenamiento en la nube","replicación de datos","seguridad de datos"],"fr":["Litestream","récupération de données","SQLite","bases de données","stockage en nuage","réplication de données","sécurité des données"],"de":["Litestream","Disaster-Recovery","SQLite","Datenbanken","Cloud-Speicher","Datenreplikation","Datensicherheit"],"pt":["Litestream","Recuperação de desastres","SQLite","Armazenamento em nuvem","Replicação contínua","Write-Ahead Log","Arquivos LTX","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Litestream","Восстановление после аварий","SQLite","Облачное хранилище","Непрерывная репликация","Журнал Write-Ahead Log","Файлы LTX","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ليتستريم","استعادة بعد الكارثة","SQLite","تخزين السحابة","تكرار مستمر","سجل Write-Ahead Log","ملفات LTX","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"benbjohnson","repo":"litestream-skills","repoPath":"benbjohnson/litestream-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"litestream","description":"SQLite disaster recovery and streaming replication to cloud storage (S3, GCS, Azure, SFTP, NATS). Use this skill for configuring Litestream, deploying to cloud platforms, troubleshooting WAL replication issues, implementing point-in-time recovery, and setting up VFS read replicas.","version":"0.5.5","bodyPreview":"# Litestream\n\nLitestream is a disaster recovery tool for SQLite that runs as a background process, continuously replicating database changes to cloud storage. It monitors the SQLite Write-Ahead Log (WAL), converts changes to immutable LTX files, and uploads them to your chosen storage backend.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **WAL Monitoring**: Watches SQLite Write-Ahead Log for changes at configurable intervals (default 1s)\n- **LTX Files**: Immutable files containing database page changes, never modified a","body":"# Litestream\n\nLitestream is a disaster recovery tool for SQLite that runs as a background process, continuously replicating database changes to cloud storage. It monitors the SQLite Write-Ahead Log (WAL), converts changes to immutable LTX files, and uploads them to your chosen storage backend.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **WAL Monitoring**: Watches SQLite Write-Ahead Log for changes at configurable intervals (default 1s)\n- **LTX Files**: Immutable files containing database page changes, never modified after creation\n- **Level-Based Compaction**: Multi-level system (L0-L9) that merges LTX files to reduce storage overhead\n- **Point-in-Time Recovery**: Restore to any transaction using TXID or timestamp\n- **VFS Support**: Read replicas directly from cloud storage without local database copy\n- **MCP Server**: AI tool integration for automated database management\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# macOS\nbrew install litestream\n\n# Linux (Debian/Ubuntu)\nwget https://github.com/benbjohnson/litestream/releases/download/v0.5.5/litestream-v0.5.5-linux-amd64.deb\nsudo dpkg -i litestream-v0.5.5-linux-amd64.deb\n\n# Docker\ndocker pull litestream/litestream:0.5\n```\n\n### Basic Replication\n\n```bash\n# Command line (single database)\nlitestream replicate /path/to/db.sqlite s3://bucket/db\n\n# With config file\nlitestream replicate -config /etc/litestream.yml\n```\n\n### Restore Database\n\n```bash\n# Restore latest backup\nlitestream restore -o /path/to/restored.db s3://bucket/db\n\n# Point-in-time recovery\nlitestream restore -timestamp 2024-01-15T10:30:00Z -o /tmp/db s3://bucket/db\n\n# Restore to specific transaction\nlitestream restore -txid 1000 -o /tmp/db s3://bucket/db\n```\n\n### Check Status\n\n```bash\n# View all databases and their replication status\nlitestream status\n\n# List available LTX files\nlitestream ltx /path/to/db.sqlite\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\nThese rules are essential for correct Litestream operation:\n\n1. **Lock Page at 1GB**: SQLite reserves the page at offset 0x40000000 (1GB). This page must always be skipped during replication and compaction. The page number varies by page size:\n   - 4KB pages: page 262145\n   - 8KB pages: page 131073\n   - 16KB pages: page 65537\n\n2. **LTX Files are Immutable**: Once created, LTX files are never modified. New changes create new files.\n\n3. **Single Replica per Database**: Each database can only replicate to one destination. Use multiple Litestream instances for multiple destinations.\n\n4. **WAL Mode Required**: SQLite must be in WAL mode (`PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL;`)\n\n5. **Use `litestream ltx`**: The `litestream wal` command is deprecated.\n\n## Storage Backends\n\n| Backend | URL Scheme | Example |\n|---------|-----------|---------|\n| AWS S3 | `s3://` | `s3://bucket/path` |\n| S3-Compatible (R2, Tigris, MinIO) | `s3://` | `s3://bucket/path?endpoint=host:port` |\n| Google Cloud Storage | `gs://` | `gs://bucket/path` |\n| Azure Blob Storage | `abs://` | `abs://container@account/path` |\n| SFTP | `sftp://` | `sftp://user@host:22/path` |\n| NATS JetStream | `nats://` | `nats://host:4222/bucket` |\n| WebDAV | `webdav://` | `webdav://host/path` |\n| Alibaba OSS | `oss://` | `oss://bucket/path` |\n| Local File | (path) | `/var/backups/db` |\n\n## Configuration File Example\n\n```yaml\ndbs:\n  - path: /data/app.db\n    replica:\n      url: s3://my-bucket/app-backup\n      access-key-id: ${AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID}\n      secret-access-key: ${AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY}\n      region: us-east-1\n      sync-interval: 1s\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse Litestream skill when:\n- Configuring SQLite database replication to cloud storage\n- Setting up disaster recovery for SQLite applications\n- Troubleshooting replication issues (WAL growth, sync failures)\n- Implementing point-in-time recovery procedures\n- Deploying Litestream with Docker, Fly.io, Kubernetes, or systemd\n- Understanding WAL-based replication concepts\n\n## Skill Contents\n\n- `concepts/` - Architecture, replication mechanics, LTX format, SQLite WAL, VFS support, compaction\n- `configuration/` - Storage backend configurations (S3, GCS, Azure, SFTP, NATS, OSS, WebDAV, File)\n- `commands/` - CLI command reference (replicate, restore, status, ltx, databases)\n- `operations/` - Monitoring, troubleshooting, recovery, and heartbeat monitoring\n- `deployment/` - Docker, Fly.io, Kubernetes, and systemd deployment guides\n- `integrations/` - MCP server integration for AI tools\n- `scripts/` - Validation and diagnostic helper scripts\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### WAL Growing Too Large\n- Check sync interval (default 1s may be too slow for write-heavy workloads)\n- Verify storage backend connectivity\n- Check for checkpoint blocking (long-running transactions)\n\n### Replication Lag\n- Monitor with `litestream status`\n- Check network connectivity to storage backend\n- Review sync interval configuration\n\n### Restore Failures\n- Verify backup exists: `litestream ltx /path/to/db`\n- Check storage backend credentials\n- Ensure target directory is writable\n\n## Links\n\n- [Official Documentation](https://litestream.io)\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/benbjohnson/litestream)\n- [Getting Started Guide](https://litestream.io/getting-started/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:06:18.748Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Database Management Agents requiring automated SQLite disaster recovery and replication to cloud storage.","zh":"适用于需要自动化SQLite灾难恢复和复制到云存储的数据库管理代理。","ja":"SQLiteの自動災害復旧とクラウドストレージへのレプリケーションを必要とするデータベース管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"자동화된 SQLite 재해 복구 및 클라우드 저장소로의 복제가 필요한 데이터베이스 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de bases de datos que requieren recuperación ante desastres automatizada de SQLite y replicación a almacenamiento en la nube.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de bases de données nécessitant une récupération automatique après sinistre SQLite et une réplication vers un stockage dans le cloud.","de":"Ideal für Datenbank-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Wiederherstellung nach SQLite-Desastern und eine Replikation in Cloud-Speicher erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Banco de Dados que exigem recuperação automática de desastres do SQLite e replicação para armazenamento em nuvem.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления базами данных, требующих автоматического восстановления после аварий SQLite и репликации в облачное хранилище.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة قواعد البيانات التي تتطلب استعادة الكارثة التلقائي SQLite والتماثل إلى التخزين السحابي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to continuously replicate SQLite database changes to cloud storage using WAL monitoring and immutable LTX files, ensuring data integrity and availability through protocols like cloud storage backends.","zh":"赋予代理持续将SQLite数据库更改复制到云存储，使用WAL监视和不可变的LTX文件，通过像云存储后端这样的协议确保数据完整性和可用性。","ja":"エージェントがWALモニタリングと不変のLTXファイルを使用して、SQLiteデータベースの変更をクラウドストレージに継続的にレプリケートできるようにし、クラウドストレージバックエンドなどのプロトコルを介してデータの整合性と可用性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 WAL 모니터링 및 변경 불가능한 LTX 파일을 사용하여 SQLite 데이터베이스의 변경 사항을 클라우드 저장소에 지속적으로 복제할 수 있도록 하여, 클라우드 저장소 백엔드와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 데이터 무결성 및 가용성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a replicar continuamente los cambios en la base de datos SQLite al almacenamiento en la nube mediante la supervisión de WAL y archivos LTX inmutables, garantizando la integridad y disponibilidad de los datos a través de protocolos como los backends de almacenamiento en la nube.","fr":"Permet aux agents de répliquer en continu les modifications de la base de données SQLite vers le stockage dans le cloud en utilisant la surveillance WAL et des fichiers LTX immuables, garantissant l''intégrité et la disponibilité des données via des protocoles tels que les backends de stockage dans le cloud.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, SQLite-Datenbankänderungen kontinuierlich auf Cloud-Speicher mittels WAL-Überwachung und unveränderlichen LTX-Dateien zu replizieren, wodurch die Datenintegrität und -verfügbarkeit durch Protokolle wie Cloud-Speicher-Backends sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a replicar continuamente as alterações do banco de dados SQLite para o armazenamento em nuvem usando monitoramento WAL e arquivos LTX imutáveis, garantindo a integridade e disponibilidade dos dados por meio de protocolos como backends de armazenamento em nuvem.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью непрерывно реплицировать изменения базы данных SQLite в облачное хранилище с помощью мониторинга WAL и неизменяемых файлов LTX, обеспечивая целостность и доступность данных посредством протоколов, таких как бэкенды облачного хранилища.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تكرار التغييرات المستمرة لقاعدة بيانات SQLite إلى التخزين السحابي باستخدام مراقبة WAL وأوراق LTX غير القابلة للتغيير، مما يضمن سلامة البيانات ومتانتها من خلال بروتوكولات مثل خلفيات التخزين السحابي."},"useCases":{"en":["Replicating SQLite databases to cloud storage for disaster recovery","Monitoring SQLite Write-Ahead Logs for real-time change detection","Converting database page changes to immutable LTX files for version control"],"zh":["将SQLite数据库复制到云存储以进行灾难恢复","监视SQLite写前日志以进行实时更改检测","将数据库页更改转换为不可变的LTX文件以进行版本控制"],"ja":["クラウドストレージへのSQLiteデータベースのレプリケーションによる災害復旧","SQLiteのWrite-Ahead Logの監視によるリアルタイムの変更検出","データベースページの変更を不変のLTXファイルに変換してバージョン管理を行う"],"ko":["재해 복구를 위해 클라우드 저장소로 SQLite 데이터베이스를 복제하는 것","실시간 변경 감지를 위한 SQLite 쓰기 앞 로그 모니터링","버전 관리를 위해 데이터베이스 페이지 변경을 변경 불가능한 LTX 파일로 변환하는 것"],"es":["Replicar bases de datos SQLite a almacenamiento en la nube para recuperación ante desastres","Supervisar registros de escritura anticipada de SQLite para la detección de cambios en tiempo real","Convertir cambios de página de base de datos a archivos LTX inmutables para control de versiones"],"fr":["Répliquer les bases de données SQLite vers un stockage dans le cloud pour la récupération après sinistre","Surveiller les journaux d''écriture anticipée SQLite pour la détection de modifications en temps réel","Convertir les modifications de page de base de données en fichiers LTX immuables pour le contrôle de version"],"de":["Replizieren von SQLite-Datenbanken auf Cloud-Speicher für die Wiederherstellung nach Desastern","Überwachung von SQLite-Write-Ahead-Logs für die Echtzeit-Erkennung von Änderungen","Umwandlung von Datenbankseitenänderungen in unveränderliche LTX-Dateien für die Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Replicar bancos de dados SQLite para armazenamento em nuvem para recuperação de desastres","Monitorar Registros de Gravação Adiante do SQLite para detecção de alterações em tempo real","Converter alterações de página de banco de dados em arquivos LTX imutáveis para controle de versão"],"ru":["Реплицировать базы данных SQLite в облачное хранилище для восстановления после аварий","Мониторить журналы предварительной записи SQLite для обнаружения изменений в режиме реального времени","Преобразовывать изменения страниц базы данных в неизменяемые файлы LTX для управления версиями"],"ar":["تكرار قواعد البيانات SQLite إلى التخزين السحابي لاستعادة الكارثة","مراقبة سجلات الكتابة مسبقًا من SQLite للكشف عن التغييرات في الوقت الفعلي","تحويل التغييرات في صفحة قاعدة البيانات إلى ملفات LTX غير قابلة للتغيير للتحكم في الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SQLite database","Cloud storage backend needed","Runs as a background process"],"zh":["需要SQLite数据库","需要云存储后端","作为后台进程运行"],"ja":["SQLiteデータベースが必要","クラウドストレージバックエンドが必要","バックグラウンドプロセスとして実行"],"ko":["SQLite 데이터베이스가 필요합니다.","클라우드 저장소 백엔드가 필요합니다.","백그라운드 프로세스로 실행됩니다."],"es":["Requiere base de datos SQLite","Se necesita backend de almacenamiento en la nube","Se ejecuta como un proceso en segundo plano"],"fr":["Nécessite une base de données SQLite","Un backend de stockage dans le cloud est nécessaire","S''exécute comme un processus en arrière-plan"],"de":["Benötigt SQLite-Datenbank","Cloud-Speicher-Backend erforderlich","Führt als Hintergrundprozess aus"],"pt":["Exige banco de dados SQLite","Necessário backend de armazenamento em nuvem","Executa como um processo em segundo plano"],"ru":["Требуется база данных SQLite","Необходим бэкенд облачного хранилища","Выполняется как фоновый процесс"],"ar":["يتطلب قاعدة بيانات SQLite","مطلوب خلفية التخزين السحابي","يعمل كعملية في الخلفية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
