,"规范文档更新"],"ja":["プラン分析","実装計画分析","フルスタック開発","ソフトウェアアーキテクチャ","技術分析","仕様書更新"],"ko":["플랜 분석","구현 계획 분석","풀스택 개발","소프트웨어 아키텍처","기술 분석","사양 문서 업데이트"],"es":["análisis de planificación","desarrollo full-stack","implementación de proyectos","actualización de especificaciones","análisis de impacto","evaluación de riesgos","NET","Angular"],"fr":["analyse de planification","développement full-stack","mise en œuvre de projets","mise à jour de spécifications","analyse d''impact","évaluation des risques","NET","Angular"],"de":["Plananalyse","Full-Stack-Entwicklung","Implementierung von Projekten","Aktualisierung von Spezifikationen","Auswirkungsanalyse","Risikobewertung","NET","Angular"],"pt":["análise de plano de implementação","desenvolvimento full-stack","análise de impacto","atualização de especificações","arquitetura de software","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","dotnet","angular","tecnologia da informação"],"ru":["анализ плана реализации","разработка full-stack","анализ воздействия","обновление спецификаций","архитектура программного обеспечения","разработка приложений","dotnet","angular","информационные технологии"],"ar":["تحليل خطة التنفيذ","التطوير كامل النطاق","تحليل التأثير","تحديث المواصفات","هندسة البرمجيات","تطوير التطبيقات","dotnet","angular","تكنولوجيا المعلومات"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-analysis","description":"Use when the user provides an implementation plan file and asks to analyze it, assess impact, update specifications, or verify planned changes. Triggers on keywords like analyze plan, implementation plan, assess impact, update spec from plan, verify plan.","bodyPreview":"# Implementation Plan Analysis & Specification Update\n\nYou are to operate as an expert full-stack dotnet angular principle developer, software architect, and technical analyst to analyze a detailed implementation plan, perform comprehensive impact analysis, and update specification documents.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Always thinks hard, plan step by step to-do list first before execute. Always remember to-do list, never compact or summary it when memory context limit reach. Always preserve and carry your","body":"# Implementation Plan Analysis & Specification Update\n\nYou are to operate as an expert full-stack dotnet angular principle developer, software architect, and technical analyst to analyze a detailed implementation plan, perform comprehensive impact analysis, and update specification documents.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Always thinks hard, plan step by step to-do list first before execute. Always remember to-do list, never compact or summary it when memory context limit reach. Always preserve and carry your to-do list through every operation.\n\n---\n\n## Core Anti-Hallucination Protocols\n\n### ASSUMPTION_VALIDATION_CHECKPOINT\nBefore every major operation:\n1. \"What assumptions am I making about [X]?\"\n2. \"Have I verified this with actual code evidence?\"\n3. \"Could I be wrong about [specific pattern/relationship]?\"\n\n### EVIDENCE_CHAIN_VALIDATION\nBefore claiming any relationship:\n- \"I believe X calls Y because...\" → show actual code\n- \"This follows pattern Z because...\" → cite specific examples\n- \"Service A owns B because...\" → grep for actual boundaries\n\n### TOOL_EFFICIENCY_PROTOCOL\n- Batch multiple Grep searches into single calls with OR patterns\n- Use parallel Read operations for related files\n- Combine semantic searches with related keywords\n\n### CONTEXT_ANCHOR_SYSTEM\nEvery 10 operations:\n1. Re-read the original task description\n2. Verify the current operation aligns with original goals\n3. Update the `Current Focus` in `## Progress` section\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 1: EXTERNAL MEMORY-DRIVEN IMPLEMENTATION PLAN ANALYSIS\n\nBuild a structured knowledge model in `ai_task_analysis_notes/[plan-name].ai_task_analysis_notes_temp.md`.\n\n### PHASE 1A: INITIALIZATION AND DISCOVERY\n\n1. **Initialize** the analysis file with standard headings\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION PLAN COMPREHENSIVE ANALYSIS\n\n**IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN_DEEP_ANALYSIS**: Thorough analysis of the implementation plan file:\n\n1. **Plan Structure Analysis**:\n   - Read and parse the implementation plan completely\n   - Extract all planned features, requirements, and changes\n   - Identify implementation phases and dependencies\n   - Document under `## Implementation Plan Overview`\n\n2. **Requirements Extraction**:\n   - Parse Knowledge Graph from implementation plan\n   - Extract new business requirements\n   - Map functional and non-functional requirements\n   - Identify changed business workflows\n   - Document under `## Extracted Requirements`\n\n3. **Planned Changes Analysis**:\n   - Catalog all planned code changes (new files, modifications, deletions)\n   - Identify affected components, services, and layers\n   - Map file-level changes to business capabilities\n   - Extract integration points\n   - Document under `## Planned Changes Analysis`\n\n4. **Architecture Impact Assessment**:\n   - Analyze how changes affect overall system architecture\n   - Identify CQRS pattern impacts (new Commands/Queries/Events)\n   - Map domain entity changes and repository patterns\n   - Document under `## Architecture Impact Assessment`\n\n5. **Existing Specification Analysis**:\n   - Read and analyze existing specification document structure\n   - Identify current test cases, requirements, entity relationships\n   - Map existing test coverage to planned changes\n   - Document under `## Current Specification Analysis`\n\n**AFFECTED_COMPONENTS_DISCOVERY**: For each planned change, discover:\n- Direct Dependencies\n- Indirect Dependencies\n- Test Coverage Impact\n- API Integration Impact\n- Cross-Service Communication\n- Database Schema Impact\n\nSave to `## Comprehensive File List` with:\n- `filePath`, `changeType`, `relationshipType`, `impactLevel`\n- `serviceContext`, `planContext`, `specificationRelevance`\n\n### PHASE 1B: KNOWLEDGE GRAPH CONSTRUCTION\n\n**IMPORTANT: MUST DO WITH TODO LIST**\n\nFor each file, document in `## Knowledge Graph`:\n- Standard fields plus plan-specific:\n- `currentContent`: Existing functionality (if file exists)\n- `plannedChanges`: Specific changes planned\n- `changeImpactAnalysis`: How changes affect other components\n- `testingRequirements`: New test cases needed\n- `specificationMapping`: How component maps to spec sections\n- `testCaseImpact`: Existing test cases needing modification\n\n### PHASE 1C: SPECIFICATION MAPPING ANALYSIS\n\n- **Test Case Mapping**: Which existing test cases are affected\n- **Business Requirement Mapping**: How new requirements relate to existing\n- **Entity Relationship Impact**: Changes to entity relationships\n- **Workflow Integration**: How new workflows integrate with existing\n- **Coverage Gap Analysis**: Areas where new test cases needed\n\n### PHASE 1D: OVERALL ANALYSIS\n\nWrite comprehensive summary showing:\n- Complete end-to-end workflows affected\n- Architectural patterns impacted\n- Business logic workflow changes\n- Integration points affected\n- Comprehensive test coverage requirements\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 2: COMPREHENSIVE ANALYSIS AND PLANNING\n\nGenerate detailed analysis under these headings:\n\n1. **Implementation Impact Analysis**: Component impact, integration points, data flow changes, platform compliance\n\n2. **Business Logic Analysis**: New business rules, modified workflows, validation requirements\n\n3. **Testing Strategy Analysis**: Test coverage requirements, new test scenarios, regression testing needs\n\n4. **Specification Update Strategy**: How to integrate new requirements, maintain traceability, preserve existing coverage\n\n5. **Rollback and Safety Strategy**: Backup procedures, rollback plan, validation checkpoints\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3: APPROVAL GATE\n\n**CRITICAL**: Present comprehensive analysis for explicit approval. **DO NOT** proceed without it.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 4: SPECIFICATION UPDATE EXECUTION\n\nOnce approved, execute with MANDATORY steps:\n\n1. **Backup Original Specification**\n2. **Read and Parse Existing Specification**\n3. **Execute Planned Updates**:\n   - New Requirements Integration\n   - Entity Relationship Updates\n   - Test Case Enhancement\n   - Traceability Matrix Updates\n   - Coverage Analysis Updates\n4. **Maintain Specification Structure**\n5. **Quality Assurance Validation**\n\n---\n\n## SUCCESS VALIDATION\n\nVerify under `## Specification Validation`:\n- **Requirements Traceability**: All plan requirements mapped\n- **Test Coverage Validation**: All changes covered by tests\n- **Business Workflow Validation**: End-to-end workflows documented\n- **Integration Testing Coverage**: Cross-service impacts covered\n- **Regression Prevention**: Existing functionality protected\n\n---\n\n## Plan Analysis Guidelines\n\n- **Plan-Driven Analysis**: Base all analysis on the detailed implementation plan\n- **Specification Structure Preservation**: Maintain standardized specification format\n- **Comprehensive Impact Assessment**: Analyze direct and indirect effects\n- **End-to-End Workflow Mapping**: Understand affected business processes\n- **Enterprise Architecture Awareness**: Respect platform patterns\n- **Quality-Focused Testing**: Create comprehensive test specifications\n- **Specification Completeness**: Ensure full traceability\n- **Risk Assessment and Mitigation**: Identify risks and provide rollback strategies\n- **Bidirectional Traceability**: Maintain clear mapping between plan and spec\n- **Coverage Preservation**: Maintain existing test coverage while adding new\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:06:26.884Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Analysis Agents needing detailed implementation plan examination and specification updates in dotnet and angular environments.","zh":"非常适合需要详细实施计划检查和规格更新的技术分析代理，尤其是在dotnet和angular环境中。","ja":"dotnetおよびangularの環境における詳細な実装計画の検査と仕様の更新が必要な技術分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"dotnet과 angular 환경에서 자세한 구현 계획 검사 및 사양 업데이트가 필요한 기술 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Técnico que necesitan un examen detallado del plan de implementación y actualizaciones de especificaciones en entornos dotnet y angular.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Technique ayant besoin d''un examen détaillé du plan de mise en œuvre et de mises à jour de spécifications dans des environnements dotnet et angular.","de":"Perfekt für Technische Analyseagenten, die eine detaillierte Prüfungsplan- und Spezifikationsaktualisierung in dotnet- und angular-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Técnica que necessitam de um plano de implementação detalhado e atualizações de especificações em ambientes dotnet e angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технического анализа, которым требуется детальный план реализации и обновление спецификаций в средах dotnet и angular.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحليل الفني الذي يحتاج إلى خطة تنفيذ مفصلة وتحديثات مواصفات في بيئات dotnet و angular."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive impact analysis, update specification documents, and preserve memory context limits, utilizing to-do lists and step-by-step planning, all within a full-stack development framework including dotnet and angular.","zh":"赋予代理商进行全面影响分析、更新规范文档和保存内存上下文限制的能力，利用待办事项列表和分步骤规划，所有这些都在包括dotnet和angular在内的全栈开发框架内。","ja":"エージェントに影響分析の実施、仕様書の更新、メモリコンテキストの制限の保存を行う能力を与え、todoリストとステップバイステップの計画を利用し、dotnetおよびangularを含むフルスタック開発フレームワーク内で実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 영향 분석을 수행하고, 규격 문서를 업데이트하고, 메모리 контекст 제한을 저장할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 할 일 목록과 단계별 계획을 사용하여 dotnet 및 angular를 포함한 전체 스택 개발 프레임워크 내에서 모든 것을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un análisis de impacto integral, actualizar documentos de especificación y preservar los límites de contexto de memoria, utilizando listas de tareas y planificación paso a paso, todo dentro de un marco de desarrollo full-stack que incluye dotnet y angular.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser une analyse d''impact complète, de mettre à jour des documents de spécification et de préserver les limites de contexte de mémoire, en utilisant des listes de tâches et une planification étape par étape, le tout dans un cadre de développement full-stack incluant dotnet et angular.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine umfassende Auswirkungsanalyse durchzuführen, Spezifikationsdokumente zu aktualisieren und die Speicherkontextgrenzen zu bewahren, indem sie Aufgabenlisten und schrittweise Planung verwenden, all dies innerhalb eines Full-Stack-Entwicklungsrahmens, der dotnet und angular enthält.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análise de impacto abrangente, atualizar documentos de especificação e preservar os limites de contexto de memória, utilizando listas de tarefas e planejamento passo a passo, tudo dentro de um framework de desenvolvimento full-stack que inclui dotnet e angular.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всесторонний анализ воздействия, обновлять документы спецификации и сохранять пределы контекста памяти, используя списки дел и пошаговое планирование, все в рамках полнофункционального фреймворка разработки, включающего dotnet и angular.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إجراء تحليل تأثير شامل وتحديث وثائق المواصفات والحفاظ على حدود سياق الذاكرة، باستخدام قوائم المهام والتخطيط التدريجي، كل ذلك داخل إطار عمل كامل لتنمية البرمجيات يشمل dotnet و angular."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing implementation plans for software projects","Updating specification documents for technical compliance","Performing impact analysis for system integration"],"zh":["分析软件项目的实施计划","更新技术合规的规范文档","执行系统集成的影响分析"],"ja":["ソフトウェアプロジェクトの実装計画を分析する","技術基準適合の仕様書を更新する","システム統合の影響分析を実行する"],"ko":["소프트웨어 프로젝트의 구현 계획 분석","기술 규격 준수 규격서 업데이트","시스템 통합의 영향 분석 수행"],"es":["Análisis de planes de implementación para proyectos de software","Actualización de documentos de especificación para la compliance técnica","Realización de análisis de impacto para la integración de sistemas"],"fr":["Analyse de plans de mise en œuvre pour les projets de logiciel","Mise à jour de documents de spécification pour la conformité technique","Réalisations d''analyses d''impact pour l''intégration de systèmes"],"de":["Analyse von Implementierungsplänen für Softwareprojekte","Aktualisierung von Spezifikationsdokumenten für die technische Compliance","Durchführung von Auswirkungsanalysen für die Systemintegration"],"pt":["Analisar planos de implementação para projetos de software","Atualizar documentos de especificação para conformidade técnica","Realizar análise de impacto para integração de sistemas"],"ru":["Анализ планов реализации для проектов программного обеспечения","Обновление документов спецификации для технической соответствия","Проведение анализа воздействия для интеграции систем"],"ar":["تحليل خطط التنفيذ لمشاريع البرمجيات","تحديث وثائق المواصفات للامتثال الفني","إجراء تحليل التأثير لتكامل الأنظمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in dotnet and angular","Needs access to project root directory for file operations","Demands meticulous step-by-step planning and to-do list management"],"zh":["需要dotnet和angular的专业知识","需要访问项目根目录以进行文件操作","需要细致的分步骤规划和待办事项列表管理"],"ja":["dotnetおよびangularの専門知識が必要","ファイル操作のためにプロジェクトのルートディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","詳細なステップバイステップの計画とtodoリストの管理が必要"],"ko":["dotnet 및 angular의 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","파일 작업을 위해 프로젝트 루트 디렉토리에 액세스해야 합니다.","세부적인 단계별 계획 및 할 일 목록 관리가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere experiencia en dotnet y angular","Necesita acceso al directorio raíz del proyecto para operaciones de archivo","Exige una planificación y gestión de listas de tareas meticulosas y paso a paso"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en dotnet et angular","A besoin d''un accès au répertoire racine du projet pour les opérations de fichiers","Exige une planification et une gestion de listes de tâches méticuleuses et étape par étape"],"de":["Erfordert Expertenwissen in dotnet und angular","Benötigt Zugriff auf das Stammverzeichnis des Projekts für Dateivorgänge","Fordert eine sorgfältige und schrittweise Planung und Aufgabenlistenverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige expertise em dotnet e angular","Necessita acesso ao diretório raiz do projeto para operações de arquivo","Exige planejamento meticuloso passo a passo e gestão de listas de tarefas"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в dotnet и angular","Требует доступа к корневому каталогу проекта для файловых операций","Требует тщательного пошагового планирования и управления списками дел"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في dotnet و angular","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى الدليل الجذري للمشروع لعمليات الملفات","يتطلب تخطيطًا متعمقًا خطوة بخطوة وإدارة قائمة المهام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ThalesGroup/agilab/agilab-testing', 'community', 'ThalesGroup', 'agilab', 'ThalesGroup/agilab', 'agilab-testing', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:07:03.203Z', NULL, '{"id":"ThalesGroup/agilab/agilab-testing","name":"agilab-testing","description":{"zh":"AGILAB测试技能旨在帮助工程师快速实验AI驱动方法，提高工程效率。","ja":"AGILABテストスキルは、エンジニアがAI駆動方法を迅速に実験できるように設計されています。","ko":"AGILAB 테스트 스킬은 엔지니어가 AI驱动 방법을 빠르게 실험할 수 있도록 설계되었습니다.","es":"La habilidad de testing agilab está diseñada para ayudar a los ingenieros a experimentar con métodos impulsados por IA de manera rápida y eficiente","fr":"La compétence de testing agilab est conçue pour aider les ingénieurs à expérimenter rapidement avec des méthodes impulsées par l''IA","de":"Die Testfähigkeit agilab ist dafür entwickelt, Ingenieuren zu helfen, schnell und effizient mit IA-gesteuerten Methoden zu experimentieren","pt":"O AGILAB Testing é uma ferramenta projetada para ajudar engenheiros a experimentar métodos de IA de forma rápida e eficaz","ru":"AGILAB Тестирование - это инструмент, предназначенный для помощи инженерам в быстром экспериментировании с методами ИИ","ar":"أداة اختبار AGILAB هي أداة مصممة لمساعدة مهندسي في تجربة أساليب الذكاء الاصطناعي بسرعة وفعالية","en":"AGILAB project purpose is to explore AI for engineering. It is designed to help engineers quickly experiment with AI-driven methods."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AGILAB测试技能","ja":"AGILABテストスキル","ko":"AGILAB 테스트 스킬","es":"Pruebas de agilab: habilidad de testing para ingenieros","fr":"Tests agilab : compétence de testing pour ingénieurs","de":"Agilab-Tests: Testfähigkeit für Ingenieure","pt":"AGILAB Testing: Ferramenta de Testes para Engenheiros","ru":"AGILAB Тестирование: Инструмент для Инженеров","ar":"اختبار AGILAB: أداة اختبار للهندسين","en":"agilab-testing"},"description":{"zh":"AGILAB测试技能旨在帮助工程师快速实验AI驱动方法，提高工程效率。","ja":"AGILABテストスキルは、エンジニアがAI駆動方法を迅速に実験できるように設計されています。","ko":"AGILAB 테스트 스킬은 엔지니어가 AI驱动 방법을 빠르게 실험할 수 있도록 설계되었습니다.","es":"La habilidad de testing agilab está diseñada para ayudar a los ingenieros a experimentar con métodos impulsados por IA de manera rápida y eficiente","fr":"La compétence de testing agilab est conçue pour aider les ingénieurs à expérimenter rapidement avec des méthodes impulsées par l''IA","de":"Die Testfähigkeit agilab ist dafür entwickelt, Ingenieuren zu helfen, schnell und effizient mit IA-gesteuerten Methoden zu experimentieren","pt":"O AGILAB Testing é uma ferramenta projetada para ajudar engenheiros a experimentar métodos de IA de forma rápida e eficaz","ru":"AGILAB Тестирование - это инструмент, предназначенный для помощи инженерам в быстром экспериментировании с методами ИИ","ar":"أداة اختبار AGILAB هي أداة مصممة لمساعدة مهندسي في تجربة أساليب الذكاء الاصطناعي بسرعة وفعالية","en":"AGILAB project purpose is to explore AI for engineering. It is designed to help engineers quickly experiment with AI-driven methods."},"definition":{"en":"AGILAB project purpose is to explore AI for engineering. It is designed to help engineers quickly experiment with AI-driven methods."},"features":{"zh":["快速实验AI驱动方法","提高工程效率","支持本地测试","支持核心测试","支持仓库测试"],"ja":["AI駆動方法の迅速な実験","エンジニアリングの効率向上","ローカルテストのサポート","コアテストのサポート","リポジトリテストのサポート"],"ko":["AI驱动 방법의 빠른 실험","엔지니어링 효율 향상","로컬 테스트 지원","코어 테스트 지원","리포지토리 테스트 지원"],"es":["Ejecución de pruebas locales y rápidas","Validación de cambios de manera eficiente","Compatibilidad con métodos impulsados por IA","Integración con herramientas de testing existentes","Flexibilidad para adaptarse a diferentes proyectos de ingeniería"],"fr":["Exécution de tests locaux et rapides","Validation des modifications de manière efficace","Compatibilité avec des méthodes impulsées par l''IA","Intégration avec des outils de testing existants","Flexibilité pour s''adapter à différents projets d''ingénierie"],"de":["Ausführung von lokalen und schnellen Tests","Überprüfung von Änderungen auf effiziente Weise","Kompatibilität mit IA-gesteuerten Methoden","Integration mit bestehenden Testtools","Flexibilität, um sich an verschiedene Ingenieursprojekte anzupassen"],"pt":["Execução de testes core","Execução de testes em todo o repositório","Suporte a pré-visualização de recursos","Suporte a dependências de construção extras","Interface de linha de comando"],"ru":["Выполнение основных тестов","Выполнение тестов всего репозитория","Поддержка предварительного просмотра функций","Поддержка дополнительных зависимостей сборки","Интерфейс командной строки"],"ar":["تشغيل الاختبارات الأساسية","تشغيل الاختبارات في المستودع بأكمله","دعم معاينة الميزات","دعم التبعيات الإضافية للبناء","واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AGILAB","AI驱动方法","工程效率","测试工具","本地测试","核心测试","仓库测试"],"ja":["AGILAB","AI駆動方法","エンジニアリング効率","テストツール","ローカルテスト","コアテスト","リポジトリテスト"],"ko":["AGILAB","AI驱动 방법","엔지니어링 효율","테스트 툴","로컬 테스트","코어 테스트","리포지토리 테스트"],"es":["testing agilab","pruebas de ingeniería","métodos impulsados por IA","validación de cambios","eficiencia en proyectos de ingeniería","herramientas de testing","ingeniería de software","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["tests agilab","tests d''ingénierie","méthodes impulsées par l''IA","validation des modifications","efficacité dans les projets d''ingénierie","outils de testing","ingénierie logicielle","développement de logiciels"],"de":["agilab-testing","ingenieurstests","IA-gesteuerte methoden","überprüfung von änderungen","effizienz in ingenieursprojekten","testtools","softwareingenieurwesen","softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["AGILAB Testing","Testes de IA","Engenharia de software","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de testes","Métodos de IA"],"ru":["AGILAB Тестирование","Тестирование ИИ","Инженерия программного обеспечения","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты для тестирования","Методы ИИ"],"ar":["اختبار AGILAB","اختبارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","هندسة البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الاختبار","أساليب الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ThalesGroup","repo":"agilab","repoPath":"ThalesGroup/agilab","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agilab-testing","description":"Quick, targeted test strategy for AGILAB (core unit tests, app smoke tests, regression).","bodyPreview":"# Testing Skill (AGILAB)\n\nUse this skill when validating changes.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n- Start small and local: run only the tests that cover the files you changed.\n- Avoid “fixing the world”: do not chase unrelated test failures.\n\n## Common Commands\n\n- Core tests (repo root):\n  - `uv --preview-features extra-build-dependencies run --no-sync pytest src/agilab/core/agi-env/test`\n  - `uv --preview-features extra-build-dependencies run --no-sync pytest src/agilab/core/test`\n\n- Whole repo tests (if neede","body":"# Testing Skill (AGILAB)\n\nUse this skill when validating changes.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n- Start small and local: run only the tests that cover the files you changed.\n- Avoid “fixing the world”: do not chase unrelated test failures.\n\n## Common Commands\n\n- Core tests (repo root):\n  - `uv --preview-features extra-build-dependencies run --no-sync pytest src/agilab/core/agi-env/test`\n  - `uv --preview-features extra-build-dependencies run --no-sync pytest src/agilab/core/test`\n\n- Whole repo tests (if needed):\n  - `uv --preview-features extra-build-dependencies run --no-sync pytest`\n\n## Adding Coverage (Easy Wins)\n\n- Add narrow unit tests for pure functions/helpers (path resolution, parsing, small transforms).\n- Prefer tests that don’t require network, GPUs, or large datasets.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:07:03.203Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Testing Agents needing efficient test validation for AI-driven engineering methods.","zh":"非常适合需要高效测试验证的 AI 驱动工程方法的 Python 测试代理。","ja":"Python テストエージェントが効率的なテスト検証を必要とする AI ドリブンのエンジニアリング方法に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 테스트 검증이 필요한 AI 주도 엔지니어링 방법을 위한 Python 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de prueba de Python que necesitan una validación de prueba eficiente para métodos de ingeniería impulsados por inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test Python nécessitant une validation de test efficace pour les méthodes d''ingénierie propulsées par l''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Testagenten, die eine effiziente Testvalidierung für von künstlicher Intelligenz angetriebene Ingenieurmethoden benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste Python que precisam de uma validação de teste eficiente para métodos de engenharia impulsionados por IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов тестирования Python, которым требуется эффективная проверка тестов для методов инженерии, управляемых ИИ.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اختبار بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق من صحة اختبار فعالة لطرق الهندسة التي تعمل بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run targeted tests using pytest, focusing on specific files and avoiding unrelated test failures, while leveraging preview features like extra-build-dependencies for comprehensive testing.","zh":"赋予代理运行有针对性的测试，使用 pytest，专注于特定的文件，并避免不相关的测试失败，同时利用预览功能，如 extra-build-dependencies 进行全面测试。","ja":"エージェントが特定のファイルに焦点を当ててターゲットテストを実行し、pytest を使用して無関係なテストの失敗を回避し、extra-build-dependencies などのプレビュー機能を利用して包括的なテストを行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 특정 파일에 초점을 맞추고 대상 테스트를 실행하도록 하는데, pytest를 사용하고, 관련이 없는 테스트 실패를 피하며, extra-build-dependencies와 같은 미리 보기 기능을 사용하여 포괄적인 테스트를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas dirigidas utilizando pytest, centrándose en archivos específicos y evitando fallos de prueba no relacionados, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha las características de vista previa como extra-build-dependencies para pruebas exhaustivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests ciblés en utilisant pytest, en se concentrant sur des fichiers spécifiques et en évitant les échecs de test non liés, tout en exploitant les fonctionnalités d''aperçu telles que extra-build-dependencies pour des tests complets.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gezielte Tests mit pytest auszuführen, sich auf bestimmte Dateien zu konzentrieren und nicht damit zusammenhängende Testfehler zu vermeiden, während es gleichzeitig Vorschau-Features wie extra-build-dependencies für umfassende Tests nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes direcionados usando pytest, focando em arquivos específicos e evitando falhas de teste não relacionadas, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita recursos de visualização como extra-build-dependencies para testes abrangentes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать целевые тесты с помощью pytest, фокусируясь на определенных файлах и избегая не связанных сбоев тестов, а также используя функции предварительного просмотра, такие как extra-build-dependencies, для комплексного тестирования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل الاختبارات المستهدفة باستخدام pytest، مع التركيز على الملفات المحددة وتجنب فشل الاختبار غير المرتبط، وفي الوقت نفسه استفادة من ميزات المعاينة مثل extra-build-dependencies للاختبار الشامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating changes in AGILAB project files","Running core tests for agi-env and core components","Executing whole repository tests for thorough validation"],"zh":["验证 AGILAB 项目文件中的更改","运行 agi-env 和核心组件的核心测试","执行整个存储库的测试以进行彻底的验证"],"ja":["AGILAB プロジェクトファイルの変更の検証","agi-env とコアコンポーネントのコアテストの実行","リポジトリ全体のテストの実行による徹底的な検証"],"ko":["AGILAB 프로젝트 파일의 변경 사항 검증","agi-env 및 핵심 구성 요소에 대한 핵심 테스트 실행","전체 저장소 테스트를 통한 철저한 검증"],"es":["Validar cambios en archivos de proyecto AGILAB","Ejecutar pruebas principales para agi-env y componentes básicos","Ejecutar pruebas de todo el repositorio para una validación exhaustiva"],"fr":["Valider les modifications dans les fichiers de projet AGILAB","Exécuter des tests principaux pour agi-env et les composants principaux","Exécuter des tests de tout le référentiel pour une validation complète"],"de":["Änderungen in AGILAB-Projektdateien überprüfen","Kerntests für agi-env und Kernkomponenten ausführen","Gesamtrepository-Tests für eine gründliche Überprüfung ausführen"],"pt":["Validar alterações em arquivos de projeto AGILAB","Executar testes principais para agi-env e componentes principais","Executar testes de repositório completo para validação abrangente"],"ru":["Проверка изменений в файлах проекта AGILAB","Запуск основных тестов для agi-env и основных компонентов","Выполнение тестов всего репозитория для всесторонней проверки"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات في ملفات مشروع AGILAB","تشغيل الاختبارات الأساسية ل agi-env والمكونات الأساسية","تشغيل اختبارات مستودع كاملة للتحقق الشامل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pytest installation","Limited to Python-based testing","Needs specific directory structure for test execution"],"zh":["需要安装 pytest","仅限于基于 Python 的测试","需要特定的目录结构来执行测试"],"ja":["pytest のインストールが必要","Python ベースのテストに限定されている","テストの実行には特定のディレクトリ構造が必要"],"ko":["pytest 설치가 필요합니다.","Python 기반 테스트로 제한됩니다.","테스트 실행을 위해 특정 디렉토리 구조가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pytest","Limitado a pruebas basadas en Python","Necesita una estructura de directorio específica para la ejecución de pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pytest","Limité aux tests basés sur Python","Nécessite une structure de répertoire spécifique pour l''exécution des tests"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von pytest","Begrenzt auf Python-basiertes Testen","Benötigt eine bestimmte Verzeichnisstruktur für die Testausführung"],"pt":["Requer instalação do pytest","Limitado ao teste baseado em Python","Necessita de estrutura de diretório específica para execução de testes"],"ru":["Требует установки pytest","Ограничен тестированием на основе Python","Требует конкретной структуры директории для выполнения тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pytest","محدود بالاختبار القائم على بايثون","يحتاج إلى هيكل دليل محدد لتشغيل الاختبار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('RtlZeroMemory/Zireael/zireael-platform-boundary', 'community', 'RtlZeroMemory', 'Zireael', 'RtlZeroMemory/Zireael', 'zireael-platform-boundary', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:06:21.240Z', NULL, '{"id":"RtlZeroMemory/Zireael/zireael-platform-boundary","name":"zireael-platform-boundary","description":{"zh":"Zireael 平台边界是一个终端 UI 核心引擎，支持 Win32 和 POSIX 后端，用于构建高性能终端 UI 应用","ja":"Zireael プラットフォーム境界は、Win32 と POSIX バックエンドをサポートするターミナル UI コアエンジンです","ko":"Zireael 플랫폼 경계는 Win32 및 POSIX 백엔드를 지원하는 터미널 UI 핵심 엔진입니다","es":"Zireael-Plataforma-Frontera es un motor de interfaz de usuario determinista en C, diseñado para trabajar con FFI/ABI. Se utiliza para crear interfaces de usuario en Win32 o POSIX.","fr":"Zireael-Plateforme-Limite est un moteur d''interface utilisateur déterministe en C, conçu pour fonctionner avec FFI/ABI. Il est utilisé pour créer des interfaces utilisateur sur Win32 ou POSIX.","de":"Zireael-Plattform-Grenze ist ein deterministischer Benutzeroberflächen-Motor in C, der für die Arbeit mit FFI/ABI konzipiert ist. Er wird verwendet, um Benutzeroberflächen in Win32 oder POSIX zu erstellen.","pt":"O Zireael-Plataforma é um núcleo de interface de terminal determinístico em C, projetado para trabalhar com backends Win32 e POSIX.","ru":"Zireael-Платформа - детерминированное ядро терминального интерфейса на языке C, предназначенное для работы с бэкендами Win32 и POSIX.","ar":"Zireael-منصة هو نواة واجهة طرفية محددة في لغة C، مصممة للعمل مع خلفيات Win32 و POSIX.","en":"Deterministic terminal UI core engine in C (FFI/ABI backend for Zireael-UI)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Zireael 平台边界 - 终端 UI 核心引擎","ja":"Zireael プラットフォーム境界 - ターミナル UI コアエンジン","ko":"Zireael 플랫폼 경계 - 터미널 UI 핵심 엔진","es":"Zireael-Plataforma-Frontera: Motor de interfaz de usuario...","fr":"Zireael-Plateforme-Limite: Moteur d''interface utilisateur...","de":"Zireael-Plattform-Grenze: Deterministischer Benutzeroberf...","pt":"Zireael-Plataforma: Núcleo de Interface de Terminal","ru":"Zireael-Платформа: Ядро Терминального Интерфейса","ar":"زيريل-منصة:핵 نواة واجهة الطرفية","en":"zireael-platform-boundary"},"description":{"zh":"Zireael 平台边界是一个终端 UI 核心引擎，支持 Win32 和 POSIX 后端，用于构建高性能终端 UI 应用","ja":"Zireael プラットフォーム境界は、Win32 と POSIX バックエンドをサポートするターミナル UI コアエンジンです","ko":"Zireael 플랫폼 경계는 Win32 및 POSIX 백엔드를 지원하는 터미널 UI 핵심 엔진입니다","es":"Zireael-Plataforma-Frontera es un motor de interfaz de usuario determinista en C, diseñado para trabajar con FFI/ABI. Se utiliza para crear interfaces de usu...","fr":"Zireael-Plateforme-Limite est un moteur d''interface utilisateur déterministe en C, conçu pour fonctionner avec FFI/ABI. Il est utilisé pour créer des interfa...","de":"Zireael-Plattform-Grenze ist ein deterministischer Benutzeroberflächen-Motor in C, der für die Arbeit mit FFI/ABI konzipiert ist. Er wird verwendet, um Benut...","pt":"O Zireael-Plataforma é um núcleo de interface de terminal determinístico em C, projetado para trabalhar com backends Win32 e POSIX.","ru":"Zireael-Платформа - детерминированное ядро терминального интерфейса на языке C, предназначенное для работы с бэкендами Win32 и POSIX.","ar":"Zireael-منصة هو نواة واجهة طرفية محددة في لغة C، مصممة للعمل مع خلفيات Win32 و POSIX.","en":"Deterministic terminal UI core engine in C (FFI/ABI backend for Zireael-UI)."},"definition":{"en":"Deterministic terminal UI core engine in C (FFI/ABI backend for Zireael-UI)."},"features":{"zh":["支持 Win32 和 POSIX 后端","终端 UI 核心引擎","事件循环阻塞/唤醒策略","终端原始模式生命周期和恢复","平台接口头文件"],"ja":["Win32 と POSIX バックエンドをサポート","ターミナル UI コアエンジン","イベントループブロック/ウェイク戦略","ターミナル生のモードライフサイクルと復元","プラットフォームインターフェイスヘッダー"],"ko":["Win32 및 POSIX 백엔드 지원","터미널 UI 핵심 엔진","이벤트 루프 블록/웨이크 전략","터미널 원시 모드 라이프사이클 및 복원","플랫폼 인터페이스 헤더"],"es":["Motor de interfaz de usuario determinista en C","Compatibilidad con FFI/ABI","Soporte para Win32 y POSIX","Gestión de eventos y ciclo de vida de la interfaz de usuario","Aislamiento de código específico de la plataforma"],"fr":["Moteur d''interface utilisateur déterministe en C","Compatibilité avec FFI/ABI","Prise en charge de Win32 et POSIX","Gestion des événements et du cycle de vie de l''interface utilisateur","Isolement du code spécifique à la plateforme"],"de":["Deterministischer Benutzeroberflächen-Motor in C","Kompatibilität mit FFI/ABI","Unterstützung für Win32 und POSIX","Ereignis- und Lebenszyklusverwaltung der Benutzeroberfläche","Isolierung plattformspezifischen Codes"],"pt":["Núcleo de interface de terminal determinístico em C","Suporte a backends Win32 e POSIX","Isolamento de código específico do SO","Evitação de `#ifdef` em código de núcleo","Suporte a modo raw de terminal e restauração"],"ru":["Детерминированное ядро терминального интерфейса на языке C","Поддержка бэкендов Win32 и POSIX","Изоляция кода, специфичного для ОС","Избежание `#ifdef` в коде ядра","Поддержка сырого режима терминала и восстановления"],"ar":["نواة واجهة طرفية محددة في لغة C","دعم للخلفيات Win32 و POSIX","عزل код محدد بنظام التشغيل","تجنب `#ifdef` في رمز النواة","دعم لنمط الطرفية الخام واستعادتها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Zireael","终端 UI","核心引擎","Win32","POSIX","事件循环","终端原始模式","平台接口"],"ja":["Zireael","ターミナル UI","コアエンジン","Win32","POSIX","イベントループ","ターミナル生のモード","プラットフォームインターフェイス"],"ko":["Zireael","터미널 UI","핵심 엔진","Win32","POSIX","이벤트 루프","터미널 원시 모드","플랫폼 인터페이스"],"es":["Zireael-Plataforma-Frontera","motor de interfaz de usuario determinista","FFI/ABI","Win32","POSIX","desarrollo de software","programación en C"],"fr":["Zireael-Plateforme-Limite","moteur d''interface utilisateur déterministe","FFI/ABI","Win32","POSIX","développement de logiciels","programmation en C"],"de":["Zireael-Plattform-Grenze","deterministischer Benutzeroberflächen-Motor","FFI/ABI","Win32","POSIX","Softwareentwicklung","Programmierung in C"],"pt":["Zireael-Plataforma","núcleo de interface de terminal","C","Win32","POSIX","desenvolvimento de software","programação em C","interface de terminal"],"ru":["Zireael-Платформа","ядро терминального интерфейса","C","Win32","POSIX","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование на C","терминальный интерфейс"],"ar":["Zireael-منصة","نواة واجهة طرفية","C","Win32","POSIX","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة بلغة C","واجهة الطرفية"]}},"owner":"RtlZeroMemory","repo":"Zireael","repoPath":"RtlZeroMemory/Zireael","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zireael-platform-boundary","description":"Enforce the strict platform boundary where core/unicode/util stay OS-header-free.","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skill when working on:\n\n- the platform interface header (`src/platform/zr_platform.h`)\n- Win32 or POSIX backend implementation\n- event loop blocking/wake strategy\n- terminal raw mode lifecycle and restoration\n\n## Non-negotiable boundary rules\n\n- `src/core`, `src/unicode`, `src/util` MUST NOT include OS headers (Win32 or POSIX).\n- OS-specific code MUST be isolated to:\n    - `src/platform/win32/`\n    - `src/platform/posix/`\n- Avoid `#ifdef` in core/unicode/util; allowed on","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skill when working on:\n\n- the platform interface header (`src/platform/zr_platform.h`)\n- Win32 or POSIX backend implementation\n- event loop blocking/wake strategy\n- terminal raw mode lifecycle and restoration\n\n## Non-negotiable boundary rules\n\n- `src/core`, `src/unicode`, `src/util` MUST NOT include OS headers (Win32 or POSIX).\n- OS-specific code MUST be isolated to:\n    - `src/platform/win32/`\n    - `src/platform/posix/`\n- Avoid `#ifdef` in core/unicode/util; allowed only in platform backends and minimal selection glue.\n\n## Platform interface design\n\nGoal: a core-facing platform interface that is:\n\n- POD-only (fixed-width integer types; no OS types)\n- opaque handle based (`plat_t*`)\n- allocation-free in hot paths\n- supports a \"wake\" primitive to interrupt blocking waits\n\nInterface categories:\n\n- **lifecycle**: create/destroy, enter/leave raw (idempotent best-effort restore)\n- **I/O**: read input bytes, write output bytes (single flush per present)\n- **wait/wake**: block until input or wake event, wake from other threads\n- **caps/size**: get terminal size, capabilities (color/mouse/paste)\n\n## Source of truth\n\n- `docs/REPO_LAYOUT.md` — boundary rules and `#ifdef` policy\n- `docs/modules/PLATFORM_INTERFACE.md` — core-facing interface spec\n- `src/platform/zr_platform.h` — actual interface header\n\n## Backend notes\n\n**POSIX:**\n\n- raw mode: termios; restore on exit; best-effort restore on signals\n- blocking: `poll/select` on stdin + wake fd (eventfd/self-pipe)\n- resize: SIGWINCH + ioctl(TIOCGWINSZ) when flagged\n\n**Win32:**\n\n- enable VT output (`ENABLE_VIRTUAL_TERMINAL_PROCESSING`)\n- prefer VT input bytes (`ENABLE_VIRTUAL_TERMINAL_INPUT`)\n- blocking: wait on input handle + wake event handle\n- restore modes on teardown; handle console close events\n\n## Testing\n\nPlatform correctness is validated via integration tests:\n\n- POSIX: PTY-based tests (headless)\n- Windows: ConPTY-based tests where possible\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:06:21.240Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for low-level System Agents requiring deterministic terminal UI core engine integration with C-based FFI/ABI backends.","zh":"适用于需要确定性终端 UI 核心引擎与基于 C 的 FFI/ABI 后端集成的低级系统代理。","ja":"CベースのFFI/ABIバックエンドとの決定論的なターミナルUIコアエンジンの統合を必要とする低レベルのシステムエージェントに最適。","ko":"C 기반 FFI/ABI 백엔드와의 결정적 터미널 UI 핵심 엔진 통합을 필요로 하는 저수준 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Sistema de bajo nivel que requieren una integración determinista del núcleo del motor de la interfaz de usuario de terminal con backends FFI/ABI basados en C.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Système de bas niveau nécessitant une intégration déterministe du noyau du moteur d''interface utilisateur de terminal avec des backends FFI/ABI basés sur C.","de":"Ideal für Systemagenten mit geringem Level, die eine deterministische Terminal-Benutzeroberflächen-Core-Engine-Integration mit C-basierten FFI/ABI-Backends erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Sistema de baixo nível que exigem integração de núcleo de UI de terminal determinístico com backends FFI/ABI baseados em C.","ru":"Идеально подходит для низкоуровневых системных агентов, требующих детерминированной интеграции ядра терминального UI с бэкендами FFI/ABI на основе C.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل النظامية منخفضة المستوى التي تتطلب دمج محرك واجهة المستخدم الطرفية القائم على الحتمية مع خلفيات FFI/ABI المبنية على سي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage platform-specific code for Win32 and POSIX backends, ensuring isolation of OS-specific code and adherence to non-negotiable boundary rules, while working with event loop blocking/wake strategies and terminal raw mode lifecycles.","zh":"赋予代理管理特定于Win32和POSIX后端的平台代码，确保操作系统特定代码的隔离和对不可协商边界规则的遵守，同时使用事件循环阻塞/唤醒策略和终端原始模式生命周期。","ja":"Win32およびPOSIXバックエンドのプラットフォーム固有のコードを管理するエージェントを可能にし、OS固有のコードの隔離と交渉不可能な境界規則の遵守を保証しながら、イベントループブロッキング/ウェイク戦略およびターミナルの生存周期を使用する。","ko":"에이전트가 Win32 및 POSIX 백엔드의 플랫폼별 코드를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 운영 체제별 코드의 격리와 비谈判 경계 규칙을 준수하는 동시에 이벤트 루프 블로킹/웨이크 전략 및 터미널 원시 모드 수명 주기를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes administrar el código específico de la plataforma para backends Win32 y POSIX, asegurando el aislamiento del código específico del sistema operativo y el cumplimiento de las reglas de límite no negociables, mientras trabaja con estrategias de bloqueo/despertar de bucle de eventos y ciclos de vida de modo raw de terminal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer le code spécifique à la plateforme pour les backends Win32 et POSIX, en garantissant l''isolement du code spécifique au système d''exploitation et le respect des règles de limite non négociables, tout en travaillant avec des stratégies de blocage/éveil de boucle d''événements et des cycles de vie de mode raw de terminal.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, plattformspezifischen Code für Win32- und POSIX-Backends zu verwalten, wodurch der Code spezifisch für das Betriebssystem isoliert und die nicht verhandelbaren Grenzregeln eingehalten werden, während mit Strategien zur Blockierung/Weckung von Ereignisschleifen und Lebenszyklen im Rohmodus der Terminalbenutzeroberfläche gearbeitet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar código específico de plataforma para backends Win32 e POSIX, garantindo o isolamento do código específico do SO e a adesão a regras de limites não negociáveis, enquanto trabalha com estratégias de bloqueio/desbloqueio de loop de eventos e ciclos de vida de modo bruto de terminal.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять кодом, специфичным для платформы, для бэкендов Win32 и POSIX, гарантируя изоляцию кода, специфичного для ОС, и соблюдение непреклонных правил границ, при этом работая со стратегиями блокировки/разблокировки цикла событий и жизненных циклов режима терминала.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الشفرة الخاصة بالمنصة للخلفيات Win32 وPOSIX، مع ضمان عزل الشفرة الخاصة بنظام التشغيل والامتثال للقواعد الحدودية غير القابلة للتفاوض، أثناء العمل مع استراتيجيات حظر الاستيقاظ للحلقات الحدثية ودورات حياة الوضع الخام للطرفية"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing platform interface headers for zireael-platform-boundary","Developing Win32 or POSIX backend implementations with strict boundary rules","Optimizing event loop blocking/wake strategies for terminal UI core engines","Restoring terminal raw mode lifecycles across different platforms"],"zh":["为zireael-platform-boundary实现平台接口头文件","开发Win32或POSIX后端实现，具有严格的边界规则","优化事件循环阻塞/唤醒策略以用于终端UI核心引擎","在不同平台之间恢复终端原始模式生命周期"],"ja":["zireael-platform-boundary用のプラットフォームインターフェイスヘッダーの実装","厳格な境界規則を持つWin32またはPOSIXバックエンドの実装の開発","ターミナルUIコアエンジン用のイベントループブロッキング/ウェイク戦略の最適化","異なるプラットフォーム間でターミナルの生存周期を回復する"],"ko":["zireael-platform-boundary를 위한 플랫폼 인터페이스 헤더 구현","엄격한 경계 규칙을 갖는 Win32 또는 POSIX 백엔드 구현 개발","터미널 UI 핵심 엔진을 위한 이벤트 루프 블로킹/웨이크 전략 최적화","다른 플랫폼 간에 터미널의 원시 모드 수명 주기를 복원"],"es":["Implementar encabezados de interfaz de plataforma para zireael-platform-boundary","Desarrollar implementaciones de backend Win32 o POSIX con reglas de límite estrictas","Optimizar estrategias de bloqueo/despertar de bucle de eventos para motores de interfaz de usuario de terminal","Restaurar ciclos de vida de modo raw de terminal en diferentes plataformas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des en-têtes d''interface de plateforme pour zireael-platform-boundary","Développer des implémentations de backend Win32 ou POSIX avec des règles de limite strictes","Optimiser les stratégies de blocage/éveil de boucle d''événements pour les moteurs d''interface utilisateur de terminal","Rétablir les cycles de vie de mode raw de terminal sur différentes plateformes"],"de":["Implementieren von Plattform-Schnittstellen-Headern für zireael-platform-boundary","Entwickeln von Win32- oder POSIX-Backend-Implementierungen mit strengen Grenzregeln","Optimieren von Blockierungs-/Weckstrategien für Ereignisschleifen in Terminalbenutzeroberflächen-Engines","Wiederherstellen von Lebenszyklen im Rohmodus der Terminalbenutzeroberfläche auf verschiedenen Plattformen"],"pt":["Implementação de cabeçalhos de interface de plataforma para zireael-platform-boundary","Desenvolvimento de implementações de backend Win32 ou POSIX com regras de limites estritas","Otimização de estratégias de bloqueio/desbloqueio de loop de eventos para motores de núcleo de UI de terminal","Restauração de ciclos de vida de modo bruto de terminal em diferentes plataformas"],"ru":["Реализация заголовков интерфейса платформы для zireael-platform-boundary","Разработка реализаций бэкенда Win32 или POSIX со строгими правилами границ","Оптимизация стратегий блокировки/разблокировки цикла событий для ядер терминального UI","Восстановление жизненных циклов режима терминала на разных платформах"],"ar":["تنفيذ رؤوس واجهة المنصة ل zireael-platform-boundary","تطوير تنفيذات خلفية Win32 أو POSIX بقواعد حدود صارمة","تحسين استراتيجيات حظر الاستيقاظ للحلقات الحدثية لمحركات واجهة المستخدم الطرفية","استعادة دورات حياة الوضع الخام للطرفية عبر منصات مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires isolation of OS-specific code to designated directories","Prohibits inclusion of OS headers in core, unicode, and utility code","Mandates strict adherence to non-negotiable boundary rules for platform-specific code"],"zh":["需要将操作系统特定代码隔离到指定目录","禁止在核心、Unicode和实用程序代码中包含操作系统头文件","要求对平台特定代码严格遵守不可协商的边界规则"],"ja":["OS固有コードを指定されたディレクトリに隔離する必要がある","コア、Unicode、およびユーティリティコード内でOSヘッダーを含めることを禁止する","プラットフォーム固有コードに対して交渉不可能な境界規則の厳格な遵守を要求する"],"ko":["운영 체제별 코드를 지정된 디렉토리에 격리해야 함","코어, 유니코드 및 유틸리티 코드 내에서 운영 체제 헤더를 포함하는 것을 금지","플랫폼별 코드에 대해 비谈判 경계 규칙을 엄격히 준수해야 함"],"es":["Requiere el aislamiento del código específico del sistema operativo en directorios designados","Prohíbe la inclusión de encabezados del sistema operativo en el código principal, unicode y de utilidad","Exige el cumplimiento estricto de las reglas de límite no negociables para el código específico de la plataforma"],"fr":["Nécessite l''isolement du code spécifique au système d''exploitation dans des répertoires désignés","Interdit l''inclusion d''en-têtes du système d''exploitation dans le code principal, unicode et d''utilité","Exige le respect strict des règles de limite non négociables pour le code spécifique à la plateforme"],"de":["Erfordert die Isolierung des betriebssystemspezifischen Codes in bestimmten Verzeichnissen","Verhindert die Einbindung von Betriebssystem-Headern in den Hauptcode, Unicode und Utility-Code","Fordert die strikte Einhaltung der nicht verhandelbaren Grenzregeln für plattformspezifischen Code"],"pt":["Exige isolamento de código específico do SO em diretórios designados","Proíbe a inclusão de cabeçalhos do SO no código core, unicode e utility","Exige adesão estrita a regras de limites não negociáveis para código específico de plataforma"],"ru":["Требует изоляции кода, специфичного для ОС, в назначенных директориях","Запрещает включение заголовков ОС в код core, unicode и utility","Требует строгого соблюдения непреклонных правил границ для кода, специфичного для платформы"],"ar":["يتطلب عزل الشفرة الخاصة بنظام التشغيل في دلائل محددة","يمنع تضمين رؤوس نظام التشغيل في الشفرة الأساسية واليوني كود والبرامج المساعدة","يتطلب اتباع قواعد حدودية غير قابلة للتفاوض بشكل صارم للشفرة الخاصة بالمنصة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('miethe/codebase-map/d3-viz', 'community', 'miethe', 'codebase-map', 'miethe/codebase-map', 'd3-viz', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z', '2026-02-18T08:07:10.827Z', NULL, '{"id":"miethe/codebase-map/d3-viz","name":"d3-viz","description":{"zh":"D3.js,,","ja":"D3.js","ko":"D3.js ","es":"D3.js es una biblioteca para crear visualizaciones de datos interactivas y personalizadas","fr":"D3.js est une bibliothèque pour créer des visualisations de données interactives et personnalisées","de":"D3.js ist eine Bibliothek zur Erstellung interaktiver und benutzerdefinierter Datenvisualisierungen","pt":"D3-Viz é uma habilidade que fornece orientação para criar visualizações de dados sofisticadas e interativas com D3.js","ru":"D3-Viz — это навык, который предоставляет рекомендации по созданию сложных интерактивных визуализаций данных с помощью D3.js","ar":"D3-Viz هو مهارة توفر إرشادات لإنشاء تصورات بيانات متقدمة و تفاعلية باستخدام D3.js","en":"Visualize your codebase and all code flows with various views."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"D3.js ","ja":"D3.js","ko":"D3.js ","es":"Visualización de código con D3.js","fr":"Visualisation de code avec D3.js","de":"Code-Visualisierung mit D3.js","pt":"D3-Viz: Visualização de Dados com D3.js","ru":"D3-Viz: Визуализация данных с помощью D3.js","ar":"D3-Viz: تصور البيانات باستخدام D3.js","en":"d3-viz"},"description":{"zh":"D3.js,,","ja":"D3.js","ko":"D3.js ","es":"D3.js es una biblioteca para crear visualizaciones de datos interactivas y personalizadas","fr":"D3.js est une bibliothèque pour créer des visualisations de données interactives et personnalisées","de":"D3.js ist eine Bibliothek zur Erstellung interaktiver und benutzerdefinierter Datenvisualisierungen","pt":"D3-Viz é uma habilidade que fornece orientação para criar visualizações de dados sofisticadas e interativas com D3.js","ru":"D3-Viz — это навык, который предоставляет рекомендации по созданию сложных интерактивных визуализаций данных с помощью D3.js","ar":"D3-Viz هو مهارة توفر إرشادات لإنشاء تصورات بيانات متقدمة و تفاعلية باستخدام D3.js","en":"Visualize your codebase and all code flows with various views."},"definition":{"en":"Visualize your codebase and all code flows with various views."},"features":{"zh":["D3.js","DOM","","ReactVueSvelte",""],"ja":["D3.js","DOM","","ReactVueSvelte",""],"ko":["D3.js","DOM","","ReactVueSvelte",""],"es":["Visualización de datos interactiva","Personalización de elementos visuales","Compatibilidad con varios entornos JavaScript","Creación de visualizaciones de publicación de alta calidad","Enlace de datos a elementos DOM"],"fr":["Visualisation de données interactive","Personnalisation d''éléments visuels","Compatibilité avec plusieurs environnements JavaScript","Création de visualisations de publication de haute qualité","Lien de données à des éléments DOM"],"de":["Interaktive Datenvisualisierung","Anpassung von visuellen Elementen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen JavaScript-Umgebungen","Erstellung von Veröffentlichungsvisualisierungen in hoher Qualität","Datenverknüpfung mit DOM-Elementen"],"pt":["Criação de visualizações de dados interativas","Personalização de elementos visuais","Compatibilidade com várias bibliotecas JavaScript","Controle preciso sobre elementos visuais","Suporte a vários frameworks"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных визуализаций данных","Настройка визуальных элементов","Совместимость с несколькими библиотеками JavaScript","Точный контроль над визуальными элементами","Поддержка нескольких фреймворков"],"ar":["إنشاء تصورات بيانات تفاعلية","تخصيص العناصر المرئية","دعم المكتبات الجافاسكريبت المتعددة","التحكم الدقيق في العناصر المرئية","دعم الإطارات المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["D3.js","data visualization","javascript","react","vue","svelte","dom"],"ja":["D3.js","data visualization","javascript","react","vue","svelte","dom"],"ko":["D3.js","data visualization","javascript","react","vue","svelte","dom"],"es":["D3.js","visualización de datos","JavaScript","visualización interactiva","personalización de visualizaciones","desarrollo web"],"fr":["D3.js","visualisation de données","JavaScript","visualisation interactive","personnalisation de visualisations","développement web"],"de":["D3.js","Datenvisualisierung","JavaScript","interaktive Visualisierung","Anpassung von Visualisierungen","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["D3.js","visualização de dados","JavaScript","bibliotecas JavaScript","frameworks","desenvolvimento web","interatividade","personalização"],"ru":["D3.js","визуализация данных","JavaScript","библиотеки JavaScript","фреймворки","веб-разработка","интерактивность","настройка"],"ar":["D3.js","تصور البيانات","جافاسكريبت","مكتبات جافاسكريبت","الإطارات","تطوير الويب","التفاعلية","تخصيص"]}},"owner":"miethe","repo":"codebase-map","repoPath":"miethe/codebase-map","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.463Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"d3-viz","description":"Creating interactive data visualisations using d3.js. This skill should be used when creating custom charts, graphs, network diagrams, geographic visualisations, or any complex SVG-based data visualisation that requires fine-grained control over visual elements, transitions, or interactions. Use this for bespoke visualisations beyond standard charting libraries, whether in React, Vue, Svelte, vanilla JavaScript, or any other environment.","bodyPreview":"# D3.js Visualisation\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating sophisticated, interactive data visualisations using d3.js. D3.js (Data-Driven Documents) excels at binding data to DOM elements and applying data-driven transformations to create custom, publication-quality visualisations with precise control over every visual element. The techniques work across any JavaScript environment, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, and other frameworks.\n\n## When to use d3.js\n\n*","body":"# D3.js Visualisation\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating sophisticated, interactive data visualisations using d3.js. D3.js (Data-Driven Documents) excels at binding data to DOM elements and applying data-driven transformations to create custom, publication-quality visualisations with precise control over every visual element. The techniques work across any JavaScript environment, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, and other frameworks.\n\n## When to use d3.js\n\n**Use d3.js for:**\n- Custom visualisations requiring unique visual encodings or layouts\n- Interactive explorations with complex pan, zoom, or brush behaviours\n- Network/graph visualisations (force-directed layouts, tree diagrams, hierarchies, chord diagrams)\n- Geographic visualisations with custom projections\n- Visualisations requiring smooth, choreographed transitions\n- Publication-quality graphics with fine-grained styling control\n- Novel chart types not available in standard libraries\n\n**Consider alternatives for:**\n- 3D visualisations - use Three.js instead\n\n## Core workflow\n\n### 1. Set up d3.js\n\nImport d3 at the top of your script:\n\n```javascript\nimport * as d3 from ''d3'';\n```\n\nOr use the CDN version (7.x):\n\n```html\n<script src=\"https://d3js.org/d3.v7.min.js\"></script>\n```\n\nAll modules (scales, axes, shapes, transitions, etc.) are accessible through the `d3` namespace.\n\n### 2. Choose the integration pattern\n\n**Pattern A: Direct DOM manipulation (recommended for most cases)**\nUse d3 to select DOM elements and manipulate them imperatively. This works in any JavaScript environment:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawChart(data) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart''); // Select by ID, class, or DOM element\n\n  // Clear previous content\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  // Set up dimensions\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n\n  // Create scales, axes, and draw visualisation\n  // ... d3 code here ...\n}\n\n// Call when data changes\ndrawChart(myData);\n```\n\n**Pattern B: Declarative rendering (for frameworks with templating)**\nUse d3 for data calculations (scales, layouts) but render elements via your framework:\n\n```javascript\nfunction getChartElements(data) {\n  const xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)])\n    .range([0, 400]);\n\n  return data.map((d, i) => ({\n    x: 50,\n    y: i * 30,\n    width: xScale(d.value),\n    height: 25\n  }));\n}\n\n// In React: {getChartElements(data).map((d, i) => <rect key={i} {...d} fill=\"steelblue\" />)}\n// In Vue: v-for directive over the returned array\n// In vanilla JS: Create elements manually from the returned data\n```\n\nUse Pattern A for complex visualisations with transitions, interactions, or when leveraging d3''s full capabilities. Use Pattern B for simpler visualisations or when your framework prefers declarative rendering.\n\n### 3. Structure the visualisation code\n\nFollow this standard structure in your drawing function:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawVisualization(data) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart''); // Or pass a selector/element\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove(); // Clear previous render\n\n  // 1. Define dimensions\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  // 2. Create main group with margins\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  // 3. Create scales\n  const xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.x)])\n    .range([0, innerWidth]);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.y)])\n    .range([innerHeight, 0]); // Note: inverted for SVG coordinates\n\n  // 4. Create and append axes\n  const xAxis = d3.axisBottom(xScale);\n  const yAxis = d3.axisLeft(yScale);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(0,${innerHeight})`)\n    .call(xAxis);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .call(yAxis);\n\n  // 5. Bind data and create visual elements\n  g.selectAll(\"circle\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"circle\")\n    .attr(\"cx\", d => xScale(d.x))\n    .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.y))\n    .attr(\"r\", 5)\n    .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n}\n\n// Call when data changes\ndrawVisualization(myData);\n```\n\n### 4. Implement responsive sizing\n\nMake visualisations responsive to container size:\n\n```javascript\nfunction setupResponsiveChart(containerId, data) {\n  const container = document.getElementById(containerId);\n  const svg = d3.select(`#${containerId}`).append(''svg'');\n\n  function updateChart() {\n    const { width, height } = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n    svg.attr(''width'', width).attr(''height'', height);\n\n    // Redraw visualisation with new dimensions\n    drawChart(data, svg, width, height);\n  }\n\n  // Update on initial load\n  updateChart();\n\n  // Update on window resize\n  window.addEventListener(''resize'', updateChart);\n\n  // Return cleanup function\n  return () => window.removeEventListener(''resize'', updateChart);\n}\n\n// Usage:\n// const cleanup = setupResponsiveChart(''chart-container'', myData);\n// cleanup(); // Call when component unmounts or element removed\n```\n\nOr use ResizeObserver for more direct container monitoring:\n\n```javascript\nfunction setupResponsiveChartWithObserver(svgElement, data) {\n  const observer = new ResizeObserver(() => {\n    const { width, height } = svgElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n    d3.select(svgElement)\n      .attr(''width'', width)\n      .attr(''height'', height);\n\n    // Redraw visualisation\n    drawChart(data, d3.select(svgElement), width, height);\n  });\n\n  observer.observe(svgElement.parentElement);\n  return () => observer.disconnect();\n}\n```\n\n## Common visualisation patterns\n\n### Bar chart\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawBarChart(data, svgElement) {\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(svgElement);\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 400;\n  const margin = { top: 20, right: 30, bottom: 40, left: 50 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  const xScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(data.map(d => d.category))\n    .range([0, innerWidth])\n    .padding(0.1);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)])\n    .range([innerHeight, 0]);\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(0,${innerHeight})`)\n    .call(d3.axisBottom(xScale));\n\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .call(d3.axisLeft(yScale));\n\n  g.selectAll(\"rect\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"rect\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d.category))\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d.value))\n    .attr(\"width\", xScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"height\", d => innerHeight - yScale(d.value))\n    .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n}\n\n// Usage:\n// drawBarChart(myData, document.getElementById(''chart''));\n```\n\n### Line chart\n\n```javascript\nconst line = d3.line()\n  .x(d => xScale(d.date))\n  .y(d => yScale(d.value))\n  .curve(d3.curveMonotoneX); // Smooth curve\n\ng.append(\"path\")\n  .datum(data)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"none\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"steelblue\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 2)\n  .attr(\"d\", line);\n```\n\n### Scatter plot\n\n```javascript\ng.selectAll(\"circle\")\n  .data(data)\n  .join(\"circle\")\n  .attr(\"cx\", d => xScale(d.x))\n  .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.y))\n  .attr(\"r\", d => sizeScale(d.size)) // Optional: size encoding\n  .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(d.category)) // Optional: colour encoding\n  .attr(\"opacity\", 0.7);\n```\n\n### Chord diagram\n\nA chord diagram shows relationships between entities in a circular layout, with ribbons representing flows between them:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawChordDiagram(data) {\n  // data format: array of objects with source, target, and value\n  // Example: [{ source: ''A'', target: ''B'', value: 10 }, ...]\n\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart'');\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 600;\n  const height = 600;\n  const innerRadius = Math.min(width, height) * 0.3;\n  const outerRadius = innerRadius + 30;\n\n  // Create matrix from data\n  const nodes = Array.from(new Set(data.flatMap(d => [d.source, d.target])));\n  const matrix = Array.from({ length: nodes.length }, () => Array(nodes.length).fill(0));\n\n  data.forEach(d => {\n    const i = nodes.indexOf(d.source);\n    const j = nodes.indexOf(d.target);\n    matrix[i][j] += d.value;\n    matrix[j][i] += d.value;\n  });\n\n  // Create chord layout\n  const chord = d3.chord()\n    .padAngle(0.05)\n    .sortSubgroups(d3.descending);\n\n  const arc = d3.arc()\n    .innerRadius(innerRadius)\n    .outerRadius(outerRadius);\n\n  const ribbon = d3.ribbon()\n    .source(d => d.source)\n    .target(d => d.target);\n\n  const colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10)\n    .domain(nodes);\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width / 2},${height / 2})`);\n\n  const chords = chord(matrix);\n\n  // Draw ribbons\n  g.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"fill-opacity\", 0.67)\n    .selectAll(\"path\")\n    .data(chords)\n    .join(\"path\")\n    .attr(\"d\", ribbon)\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(nodes[d.source.index]))\n    .attr(\"stroke\", d => d3.rgb(colourScale(nodes[d.source.index])).darker());\n\n  // Draw groups (arcs)\n  const group = g.append(\"g\")\n    .selectAll(\"g\")\n    .data(chords.groups)\n    .join(\"g\");\n\n  group.append(\"path\")\n    .attr(\"d\", arc)\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(nodes[d.index]))\n    .attr(\"stroke\", d => d3.rgb(colourScale(nodes[d.index])).darker());\n\n  // Add labels\n  group.append(\"text\")\n    .each(d => { d.angle = (d.startAngle + d.endAngle) / 2; })\n    .attr(\"dy\", \"0.31em\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", d => `rotate(${(d.angle * 180 / Math.PI) - 90})translate(${outerRadius + 30})${d.angle > Math.PI ? \"rotate(180)\" : \"\"}`)\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", d => d.angle > Math.PI ? \"end\" : null)\n    .text((d, i) => nodes[i])\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n}\n```\n\n### Heatmap\n\nA heatmap uses colour to encode values in a two-dimensional grid, useful for showing patterns across categories:\n\n```javascript\nfunction drawHeatmap(data) {\n  // data format: array of objects with row, column, and value\n  // Example: [{ row: ''A'', column: ''X'', value: 10 }, ...]\n\n  if (!data || data.length === 0) return;\n\n  const svg = d3.select(''#chart'');\n  svg.selectAll(\"*\").remove();\n\n  const width = 800;\n  const height = 600;\n  const margin = { top: 100, right: 30, bottom: 30, left: 100 };\n  const innerWidth = width - margin.left - margin.right;\n  const innerHeight = height - margin.top - margin.bottom;\n\n  // Get unique rows and columns\n  const rows = Array.from(new Set(data.map(d => d.row)));\n  const columns = Array.from(new Set(data.map(d => d.column)));\n\n  const g = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`);\n\n  // Create scales\n  const xScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(columns)\n    .range([0, innerWidth])\n    .padding(0.01);\n\n  const yScale = d3.scaleBand()\n    .domain(rows)\n    .range([0, innerHeight])\n    .padding(0.01);\n\n  // Colour scale for values\n  const colourScale = d3.scaleSequential(d3.interpolateYlOrRd)\n    .domain([0, d3.max(data, d => d.value)]);\n\n  // Draw rectangles\n  g.selectAll(\"rect\")\n    .data(data)\n    .join(\"rect\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d.column))\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d.row))\n    .attr(\"width\", xScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"height\", yScale.bandwidth())\n    .attr(\"fill\", d => colourScale(d.value));\n\n  // Add x-axis labels\n  svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`)\n    .selectAll(\"text\")\n    .data(columns)\n    .join(\"text\")\n    .attr(\"x\", d => xScale(d) + xScale.bandwidth() / 2)\n    .attr(\"y\", -10)\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"middle\")\n    .text(d => d)\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n  // Add y-axis labels\n  svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${margin.left},${margin.top})`)\n    .selectAll(\"text\")\n    .data(rows)\n    .join(\"text\")\n    .attr(\"x\", -10)\n    .attr(\"y\", d => yScale(d) + yScale.bandwidth() / 2)\n    .attr(\"dy\", \"0.35em\")\n    .attr(\"text-anchor\", \"end\")\n    .text(d => d)\n    .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n  // Add colour legend\n  const legendWidth = 20;\n  const legendHeight = 200;\n  const legend = svg.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width - 60},${margin.top})`);\n\n  const legendScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n    .domain(colourScale.domain())\n    .range([legendHeight, 0]);\n\n  const legendAxis = d3.axisRight(legendScale)\n    .ticks(5);\n\n  // Draw colour gradient in legend\n  for (let i = 0; i < legendHeight; i++) {\n    legend.append(\"rect\")\n      .attr(\"y\", i)\n      .attr(\"width\", legendWidth)\n      .attr(\"height\", 1)\n      .attr(\"fill\", colourScale(legendScale.invert(i)));\n  }\n\n  legend.append(\"g\")\n    .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${legendWidth},0)`)\n    .call(legendAxis);\n}\n```\n\n### Pie chart\n\n```javascript\nconst pie = d3.pie()\n  .value(d => d.value)\n  .sort(null);\n\nconst arc = d3.arc()\n  .innerRadius(0)\n  .outerRadius(Math.min(width, height) / 2 - 20);\n\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10);\n\nconst g = svg.append(\"g\")\n  .attr(\"transform\", `translate(${width / 2},${height / 2})`);\n\ng.selectAll(\"path\")\n  .data(pie(data))\n  .join(\"path\")\n  .attr(\"d\", arc)\n  .attr(\"fill\", (d, i) => colourScale(i))\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"white\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 2);\n```\n\n### Force-directed network\n\n```javascript\nconst simulation = d3.forceSimulation(nodes)\n  .force(\"link\", d3.forceLink(links).id(d => d.id).distance(100))\n  .force(\"charge\", d3.forceManyBody().strength(-300))\n  .force(\"center\", d3.forceCenter(width / 2, height / 2));\n\nconst link = g.selectAll(\"line\")\n  .data(links)\n  .join(\"line\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", \"#999\")\n  .attr(\"stroke-width\", 1);\n\nconst node = g.selectAll(\"circle\")\n  .data(nodes)\n  .join(\"circle\")\n  .attr(\"r\", 8)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\")\n  .call(d3.drag()\n    .on(\"start\", dragstarted)\n    .on(\"drag\", dragged)\n    .on(\"end\", dragended));\n\nsimulation.on(\"tick\", () => {\n  link\n    .attr(\"x1\", d => d.source.x)\n    .attr(\"y1\", d => d.source.y)\n    .attr(\"x2\", d => d.target.x)\n    .attr(\"y2\", d => d.target.y);\n  \n  node\n    .attr(\"cx\", d => d.x)\n    .attr(\"cy\", d => d.y);\n});\n\nfunction dragstarted(event) {\n  if (!event.active) simulation.alphaTarget(0.3).restart();\n  event.subject.fx = event.subject.x;\n  event.subject.fy = event.subject.y;\n}\n\nfunction dragged(event) {\n  event.subject.fx = event.x;\n  event.subject.fy = event.y;\n}\n\nfunction dragended(event) {\n  if (!event.active) simulation.alphaTarget(0);\n  event.subject.fx = null;\n  event.subject.fy = null;\n}\n```\n\n## Adding interactivity\n\n### Tooltips\n\n```javascript\n// Create tooltip div (outside SVG)\nconst tooltip = d3.select(\"body\").append(\"div\")\n  .attr(\"class\", \"tooltip\")\n  .style(\"position\", \"absolute\")\n  .style(\"visibility\", \"hidden\")\n  .style(\"background-color\", \"white\")\n  .style(\"border\", \"1px solid #ddd\")\n  .style(\"padding\", \"10px\")\n  .style(\"border-radius\", \"4px\")\n  .style(\"pointer-events\", \"none\");\n\n// Add to elements\ncircles\n  .on(\"mouseover\", function(event, d) {\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"opacity\", 1);\n    tooltip\n      .style(\"visibility\", \"visible\")\n      .html(`<strong>${d.label}</strong><br/>Value: ${d.value}`);\n  })\n  .on(\"mousemove\", function(event) {\n    tooltip\n      .style(\"top\", (event.pageY - 10) + \"px\")\n      .style(\"left\", (event.pageX + 10) + \"px\");\n  })\n  .on(\"mouseout\", function() {\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"opacity\", 0.7);\n    tooltip.style(\"visibility\", \"hidden\");\n  });\n```\n\n### Zoom and pan\n\n```javascript\nconst zoom = d3.zoom()\n  .scaleExtent([0.5, 10])\n  .on(\"zoom\", (event) => {\n    g.attr(\"transform\", event.transform);\n  });\n\nsvg.call(zoom);\n```\n\n### Click interactions\n\n```javascript\ncircles\n  .on(\"click\", function(event, d) {\n    // Handle click (dispatch event, update app state, etc.)\n    console.log(\"Clicked:\", d);\n\n    // Visual feedback\n    d3.selectAll(\"circle\").attr(\"fill\", \"steelblue\");\n    d3.select(this).attr(\"fill\", \"orange\");\n\n    // Optional: dispatch custom event for your framework/app to listen to\n    // window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(''chartClick'', { detail: d }));\n  });\n```\n\n## Transitions and animations\n\nAdd smooth transitions to visual changes:\n\n```javascript\n// Basic transition\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(750)\n  .attr(\"r\", 10);\n\n// Chained transitions\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"fill\", \"orange\")\n  .transition()\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"r\", 15);\n\n// Staggered transitions\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .delay((d, i) => i * 50)\n  .duration(500)\n  .attr(\"cy\", d => yScale(d.value));\n\n// Custom easing\ncircles\n  .transition()\n  .duration(1000)\n  .ease(d3.easeBounceOut)\n  .attr(\"r\", 10);\n```\n\n## Scales reference\n\n### Quantitative scales\n\n```javascript\n// Linear scale\nconst xScale = d3.scaleLinear()\n  .domain([0, 100])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Log scale (for exponential data)\nconst logScale = d3.scaleLog()\n  .domain([1, 1000])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Power scale\nconst powScale = d3.scalePow()\n  .exponent(2)\n  .domain([0, 100])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n\n// Time scale\nconst timeScale = d3.scaleTime()\n  .domain([new Date(2020, 0, 1), new Date(2024, 0, 1)])\n  .range([0, 500]);\n```\n\n### Ordinal scales\n\n```javascript\n// Band scale (for bar charts)\nconst bandScale = d3.scaleBand()\n  .domain([''A'', ''B'', ''C'', ''D''])\n  .range([0, 400])\n  .padding(0.1);\n\n// Point scale (for line/scatter categories)\nconst pointScale = d3.scalePoint()\n  .domain([''A'', ''B'', ''C'', ''D''])\n  .range([0, 400]);\n\n// Ordinal scale (for colours)\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleOrdinal(d3.schemeCategory10);\n```\n\n### Sequential scales\n\n```javascript\n// Sequential colour scale\nconst colourScale = d3.scaleSequential(d3.interpolateBlues)\n  .domain([0, 100]);\n\n// Diverging colour scale\nconst divScale = d3.scaleDiverging(d3.interpolateRdBu)\n  .domain([-10, 0, 10]);\n```\n\n## Best practices\n\n### Data preparation\n\nAlways validate and prepare data before visualisation:\n\n```javascript\n// Filter invalid values\nconst cleanData = data.filter(d => d.value != null && !isNaN(d.value));\n\n// Sort data if order matters\nconst sortedData = [...data].sort((a, b) => b.value - a.value);\n\n// Parse dates\nconst parsedData = data.map(d => ({\n  ...d,\n  date: d3.timeParse(\"%Y-%m-%d\")(d.date)\n}));\n```\n\n### Performance optimisation\n\nFor large datasets (>1000 elements):\n\n```javascript\n// Use canvas instead of SVG for many elements\n// Use quadtree for collision detection\n// Simplify paths with d3.line().curve(d3.curveStep)\n// Implement virtual scrolling for large lists\n// Use requestAnimationFrame for custom animations\n```\n\n### Accessibility\n\nMake visualisations accessible:\n\n```javascript\n// Add ARIA labels\nsvg.attr(\"role\", \"img\")\n   .attr(\"aria-label\", \"Bar chart showing quarterly revenue\");\n\n// Add title and description\nsvg.append(\"title\").text(\"Quarterly Revenue 2024\");\nsvg.append(\"desc\").text(\"Bar chart showing revenue growth across four quarters\");\n\n// Ensure sufficient colour contrast\n// Provide keyboard navigation for interactive elements\n// Include data table alternative\n```\n\n### Styling\n\nUse consistent, professional styling:\n\n```javascript\n// Define colour palettes upfront\nconst colours = {\n  primary: ''#4A90E2'',\n  secondary: ''#7B68EE'',\n  background: ''#F5F7FA'',\n  text: ''#333333'',\n  gridLines: ''#E0E0E0''\n};\n\n// Apply consistent typography\nsvg.selectAll(\"text\")\n  .style(\"font-family\", \"Inter, sans-serif\")\n  .style(\"font-size\", \"12px\");\n\n// Use subtle grid lines\ng.selectAll(\".tick line\")\n  .attr(\"stroke\", colours.gridLines)\n  .attr(\"stroke-dasharray\", \"2,2\");\n```\n\n## Common issues and solutions\n\n**Issue**: Axes not appearing\n- Ensure scales have valid domains (check for NaN values)\n- Verify axis is appended to correct group\n- Check transform translations are correct\n\n**Issue**: Transitions not working\n- Call `.transition()` before attribute changes\n- Ensure elements have unique keys for proper data binding\n- Check that useEffect dependencies include all changing data\n\n**Issue**: Responsive sizing not working\n- Use ResizeObserver or window resize listener\n- Update dimensions in state to trigger re-render\n- Ensure SVG has width/height attributes or viewBox\n\n**Issue**: Performance problems\n- Limit number of DOM elements (consider canvas for >1000 items)\n- Debounce resize handlers\n- Use `.join()` instead of separate enter/update/exit selections\n- Avoid unnecessary re-renders by checking dependencies\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/\nContains detailed reference materials:\n- `d3-patterns.md` - Comprehensive collection of visualisation patterns and code examples\n- `scale-reference.md` - Complete guide to d3 scales with examples\n- `colour-schemes.md` - D3 colour schemes and palette recommendations\n\n### assets/\n\nContains boilerplate templates:\n\n- `chart-template.js` - Starter template for basic chart\n- `interactive-template.js` - Template with tooltips, zoom, and interactions\n- `sample-data.json` - Example datasets for testing\n\nThese templates work with vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, Svelte, or any other JavaScript environment. Adapt them as needed for your specific framework.\n\nTo use these resources, read the relevant files when detailed guidance is needed for specific visualisation types or patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:07:10.827Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing interactive, publication-quality visualizations with d3.js","zh":"非常适合需要交互式、出版级可视化的数据分析代理，使用d3.js","ja":"d3.jsを使用してインタラクティブな、出版向けのビジュアライゼーションを必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"d3.js를 사용하여 상호 작용형, 출판급 시각화가 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan visualizaciones interactivas de calidad de publicación con d3.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données ayant besoin de visualisations interactives de qualité d''édition avec d3.js","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die interaktive, publikationsreife Visualisierungen mit d3.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de visualizações interativas de qualidade de publicação com d3.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, требующих интерактивных визуализаций публикационного качества с использованием d3.js","ar":"เหมาะ لعميل تحليل البيانات الذي يحتاج إلى تصورات تفاعلية من نوعية النشر مع d3.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bind data to DOM elements and apply data-driven transformations, creating custom visualizations with precise control over every visual element using d3.js, across various JavaScript environments, including vanilla JavaScript, React, Vue, and Svelte","zh":"赋予代理绑定数据到DOM元素并应用数据驱动的变换的能力，使用d3.js创建自定义可视化，在各种JavaScript环境中（包括vanilla JavaScript、React、Vue和Svelte）对每个视觉元素进行精确控制","ja":"d3.jsを使用して、DOM要素にデータをバインドし、データ駆動の変換を適用してカスタムビジュアライゼーションを作成する能力をエージェントに与え、バニラJavaScript、React、Vue、Svelteを含むさまざまなJavaScript環境で、すべての視覚要素を精密に制御","ko":"d3.js를 사용하여 DOM 요소에 데이터를 바인딩하고 데이터 주도 변환을 적용하여 사용자 지정 시각화를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에 부여하여, 바닐라 자바스크립트, 리액트, 뷰 및 스벨트를 포함한 다양한 자바스크립트 환경에서 모든 시각 요소를 정밀하게 제어","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enlazar datos con elementos DOM y aplicar transformaciones impulsadas por datos, creando visualizaciones personalizadas con control preciso sobre cada elemento visual usando d3.js, en varios entornos de JavaScript, incluyendo JavaScript vanilla, React, Vue y Svelte","fr":"Permet aux agents de lier des données à des éléments DOM et d''appliquer des transformations pilotées par les données, créant des visualisations personnalisées avec un contrôle précis sur chaque élément visuel en utilisant d3.js, dans différents environnements JavaScript, notamment JavaScript vanilla, React, Vue et Svelte","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Daten mit DOM-Elementen zu binden und datengetriebene Transformationen anzuwenden, um benutzerdefinierte Visualisierungen mit präziser Kontrolle über jedes visuelle Element mithilfe von d3.js in verschiedenen JavaScript-Umgebungen zu erstellen, einschließlich Vanilla-JavaScript, React, Vue und Svelte","pt":"Permite que os agentes vinculem dados a elementos DOM e apliquem transformações impulsionadas por dados, criando visualizações personalizadas com controle preciso sobre cada elemento visual usando d3.js, em vários ambientes JavaScript, incluindo JavaScript puro, React, Vue e Svelte","ru":"Позволяет агентам привязывать данные к элементам DOM и применять трансформации, управляемые данными, создавая настраиваемые визуализации с точным контролем над каждым визуальным элементом с использованием d3.js, в различных средах JavaScript, включая чистый JavaScript, React, Vue и Svelte","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء ربط البيانات بعناصر DOM وتطبيق تحويلات مدفوعة بالبيانات، مما يتيح إنشاء تصورات مخصصة مع سيطرة دقيقة على كل عنصر بصرية باستخدام d3.js، عبر بيئات جافا سكريبت المختلفة، بما في ذلك جافا سكريبت الفانيليا، رياكت، فيو، وسفلت"},"useCases":{"en":["Visualizing codebase structures with interactive SVG elements","Generating custom, publication-quality visualizations for data analysis","Creating dynamic, data-driven transformations for web applications"],"zh":["使用交互式SVG元素可视化代码库结构","为数据分析生成自定义、出版级可视化","为Web应用程序创建动态、数据驱动的变换"],"ja":["インタラクティブなSVG要素を使用してコードベース構造をビジュアライズ","データ分析のためのカスタム、出版向けビジュアライゼーションを生成","Webアプリケーションのための動的、データ駆動の変換を作成"],"ko":["상호 작용형 SVG 요소를 사용하여 코드베이스 구조 시각화","데이터 분석을 위한 사용자 지정, 출판급 시각화 생성","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 동적, 데이터 주도 변환 생성"],"es":["Visualizar estructuras de código con elementos SVG interactivos","Generar visualizaciones personalizadas de calidad de publicación para el análisis de datos","Crear transformaciones dinámicas y impulsadas por datos para aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Visualiser des structures de codebase avec des éléments SVG interactifs","Générer des visualisations personnalisées de qualité d''édition pour l''analyse de données","Créer des transformations dynamiques et pilotées par les données pour les applications web"],"de":["Visualisieren von Codebasen-Strukturen mit interaktiven SVG-Elementen","Erzeugen von benutzerdefinierten, publikationsreifen Visualisierungen für die Datenanalyse","Erstellen von dynamischen, datengetriebenen Transformationen für Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Visualizar estruturas de código com elementos SVG interativos","Gerar visualizações personalizadas de qualidade de publicação para análise de dados","Criar transformações dinâmicas e impulsionadas por dados para aplicações web"],"ru":["Визуализация структур кода с помощью интерактивных элементов SVG","Генерация настраиваемых визуализаций публикационного качества для анализа данных","Создание динамических и управляемых данными трансформаций для веб-приложений"],"ar":["تجسيد هياكل الشفرة البرمجية بعناصر SVG التفاعلية","توليد تصورات مخصصة من نوعية النشر لتحليل البيانات","إنشاء تحويلات ديناميكية مدفوعة بالبيانات لتطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JavaScript environment","Limited to d3.js library","Needs DOM element access for data binding"],"zh":["需要JavaScript环境","仅限于d3.js库","需要DOM元素访问以进行数据绑定"],"ja":["JavaScript環境が必要","d3.jsライブラリに限定","データバインドのためにDOM要素へのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["자바스크립트 환경 필요","d3.js 라이브러리에 제한됨","데이터 바인딩을 위해 DOM 요소에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de JavaScript","Limitado a la biblioteca d3.js","Necesita acceso a elementos DOM para enlazar datos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement JavaScript","Limité à la bibliothèque d3.js","Nécessite un accès aux éléments DOM pour lier des données"],"de":["Benötigt JavaScript-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die d3.js-Bibliothek","Benötigt Zugriff auf DOM-Elemente für Datenbindung"],"pt":["Requer um ambiente JavaScript","Limitado à biblioteca d3.js","Necessita de acesso a elementos DOM para vinculação de dados"],"ru":["Требует среды JavaScript","Ограничен библиотекой d3.js","Требует доступа к элементам DOM для привязки данных"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة جافا سكريبت","محدود بمكتبة d3.js","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى عناصر DOM للربط مع البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
