2D-игр в браузере","Использование Phaser 3"],"ar":["هندسة القائمة على المشاهد","النظم الفيزيائية","تحسين تحميل الصور","بناء ألعاب 2D في المتصفح","استخدام Phaser 3"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Phaser游戏开发","2D浏览器游戏","Phaser 3","spritesheet加载","场景架构","物理系统","游戏开发框架"],"ja":["Phaserゲーム開発","2Dブラウザゲーム","Phaser 3","スプライトシートのロード","シーンアーキテクチャ","物理システム","ゲーム開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["페이저 게임 개발","2D 브라우저 게임","페이저 3","스프라이트 시트 로딩","씬 아키텍처","물리 시스템","게임 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos","Phaser 3","juegos 2D","arquitectura basada en escenas","sistemas de física","spritesheets","navegadores modernos"],"fr":["développement de jeux","Phaser 3","jeux 2D","architecture basée sur les scènes","systèmes de physique","spritesheets","navigateurs modernes"],"de":["Spielentwicklung","Phaser 3","2D-Spiele","szenenbasierte Architektur","Physiksysteme","Spritesheets","moderne Browser"],"pt":["Phaser Game Development","jogos 2D","navegador","Phaser 3","arquitetura baseada em cenas","sistemas de física","otimização de carga de spritesheets"],"ru":["Phaser Game Development","2D-игры","браузер","Phaser 3","сценарная архитектура","физические системы","оптимизация загрузки спрайтов"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب Phaser","ألعاب 2D","المتصفح","Phaser 3","هندسة القائمة على المشاهد","النظم الفيزيائية","تحسين تحميل الصور"]}},"owner":"chongdashu","repo":"phaserjs-oakwoods","repoPath":"chongdashu/phaserjs-oakwoods","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"phaser-gamedev","description":"Build 2D browser games with Phaser 3 (JS/TS): scenes, sprites, physics (Arcade/Matter), tilemaps (Tiled), animations, input. Trigger: Phaser scene, Arcade physics, tilemap, Phaser 3 game.","bodyPreview":"# Phaser Game Development\n\nBuild 2D browser games using Phaser 3''s scene-based architecture and physics systems.\n\n---\n\n## STOP: Before Loading Any Spritesheet\n\n**Read [spritesheets-nineslice.md](references/spritesheets-nineslice.md) FIRST.**\n\nSpritesheet loading is fragile—a few pixels off causes silent corruption that compounds into broken visuals. The reference file contains the mandatory inspection protocol.\n\n**Quick rules** (details in reference):\n\n1. **Measure the asset** before writing loa","body":"# Phaser Game Development\n\nBuild 2D browser games using Phaser 3''s scene-based architecture and physics systems.\n\n---\n\n## STOP: Before Loading Any Spritesheet\n\n**Read [spritesheets-nineslice.md](references/spritesheets-nineslice.md) FIRST.**\n\nSpritesheet loading is fragile—a few pixels off causes silent corruption that compounds into broken visuals. The reference file contains the mandatory inspection protocol.\n\n**Quick rules** (details in reference):\n\n1. **Measure the asset** before writing loader code—never guess frame dimensions\n2. **Character sprites use SQUARE frames**: If you calculate frameWidth=56, try 56 for height first\n3. **Different animations have different frame sizes**: A run cycle needs wider frames than idle; an attack needs extra width for weapon swing. Measure EACH spritesheet independently\n4. **Check for spacing**: Gaps between frames require `spacing: N` in loader config\n5. **Verify the math**: `imageWidth = (frameWidth × cols) + (spacing × (cols - 1))`\n\n---\n\n## Reference Files\n\nRead these BEFORE working on the relevant feature:\n\n| When working on... | Read first |\n|--------------------|------------|\n| Loading ANY spritesheet | [spritesheets-nineslice.md](references/spritesheets-nineslice.md) |\n| Nine-slice UI panels | [spritesheets-nineslice.md](references/spritesheets-nineslice.md) |\n| Config, scenes, objects, input, animations | [core-patterns.md](references/core-patterns.md) |\n| Tiled tilemaps, collision layers | [tilemaps.md](references/tilemaps.md) |\n| Physics tuning, groups, pooling | [arcade-physics.md](references/arcade-physics.md) |\n| Performance issues, object pooling | [performance.md](references/performance.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Decisions (Make Early)\n\n**Before building, decide**:\n- What **scenes** does this game need? (Boot, Menu, Game, UI overlay, GameOver)\n- What are the **core entities** and how do they interact?\n- What **physics** model fits? (Arcade for speed, Matter for realism, None for menus)\n- What **input methods**? (keyboard/gamepad/touch)\n\n### Physics System Choice\n\n| System | Use When |\n|--------|----------|\n| **Arcade** | Platformers, shooters, most 2D games. Fast AABB collisions |\n| **Matter** | Physics puzzles, ragdolls, realistic collisions. Slower, more accurate |\n| **None** | Menu scenes, visual novels, card games |\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Scene-first architecture**: Organize code around scene lifecycle and transitions\n2. **Composition over inheritance**: Build entities from sprite/body/controllers, not deep class trees\n3. **Physics-aware design**: Choose collision model early; don''t retrofit physics late\n4. **Asset pipeline discipline**: Preload everything; reference by keys; keep loading deterministic\n5. **Frame-rate independence**: Use `delta` for motion and timers; avoid frame counting\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Problem | Solution |\n|--------------|---------|----------|\n| Global state on `window` | Scene transitions break state | Use scene data, registries |\n| Loading in `create()` | Assets not ready when referenced | Load in `preload()`, use Boot scene |\n| Frame counting | Game speed varies with FPS | Use `delta / 1000` |\n| Matter for simple collisions | Unnecessary complexity | Arcade handles most 2D games |\n| One giant scene | Hard to extend | Separate gameplay/UI/menus |\n| Magic numbers | Impossible to balance | Config objects, constants |\n| No object pooling | GC stutters | Groups with `setActive(false)` |\n\n---\n\n## Variation Guidance\n\nOutputs should vary based on:\n- **Genre** (platformer vs top-down vs shmup)\n- **Target platform** (mobile touch, desktop keyboard, gamepad)\n- **Art style** (pixel art scaling vs HD smoothing)\n- **Performance envelope** (many sprites → pooling; few sprites → simpler code)\n\n---\n\n## Remember\n\nPhaser provides powerful primitives—scenes, sprites, physics, input—but **architecture is your responsibility**.\n\nThink in systems: define the scenes, define the entities, define their interactions—then implement.\n\n**Codex can build complete, polished Phaser games. These guidelines illuminate the path—they don''t fence it.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:07:30.227Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Game Development Agents needing 2D browser game creation capabilities with Phaser 3''s scene-based architecture","zh":"非常适合需要使用Phaser 3的场景基于架构创建2D浏览器游戏的游戏开发代理","ja":"Phaser 3のシーンベースのアーキテクチャを使用した2Dブラウザゲーム作成機能が必要なゲーム開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Phaser 3의 시네마 기반 아키텍처를 사용하여 2D 브라우저 게임을 생성해야 하는 게임 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de juegos que necesitan capacidades de creación de juegos de navegador 2D con arquitectura basada en escenas de Phaser 3","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de jeux ayant besoin de capacités de création de jeux de navigateur 2D avec l''architecture basée sur des scènes de Phaser 3","de":"Perfekt für Game-Development-Agents, die 2D-Browser-Spiel-Erstellungsfähigkeiten mit Phasers 3 Szenen-basierter Architektur benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Jogos que precisam de capacidades de criação de jogos de navegador 2D com arquitetura baseada em cenas do Phaser 3","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, которым необходимы возможности создания 2D-игр для браузера с архитектурой на основе сцен Phaser 3","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الألعاب الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إنشاء ألعاب المتصفح 2D مع هندسة Phaser 3 القائمة على المشاهد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build 2D browser games using Phaser 3''s physics systems and scene-based architecture, while ensuring accurate spritesheet loading through a mandatory inspection protocol outlined in the spritesheets-nineslice.md reference file","zh":"赋予代理使用Phaser 3的物理系统和场景基于架构构建2D浏览器游戏的能力，同时通过spritesheets-nineslice.md参考文件中概述的强制检查协议确保精灵表加载的准确性","ja":"Phaser 3の物理システムとシーンベースのアーキテクチャを使用して2Dブラウザゲームを構築するエージェントの能力を提供し、spritesheets-nineslice.mdリファレンスファイルに概説されている強制検査プロトコルを通じてスプライトシートの読み込みの正確性を確保する","ko":"Phaser 3의 물리 시스템과 시네마 기반 아키텍처를 사용하여 2D 브라우저 게임을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, spritesheets-nineslice.md 참조 파일에概述된 강제 검사 프로토콜을 통해 스프라이트 시트 로딩의 정확성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir juegos de navegador 2D utilizando los sistemas de física y la arquitectura basada en escenas de Phaser 3, mientras se garantiza la carga precisa de spritesheets a través de un protocolo de inspección obligatorio descrito en el archivo de referencia spritesheets-nineslice.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des jeux de navigateur 2D en utilisant les systèmes de physique et l''architecture basée sur des scènes de Phaser 3, tout en assurant le chargement précis des spritesheets grâce à un protocole d''inspection obligatoire décrit dans le fichier de référence spritesheets-nineslice.md","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, 2D-Browser-Spiele mit Phasers 3 Physiksystemen und szenenbasierter Architektur zu erstellen, während eine genaue Spritesheet-Ladung durch ein obligatorisches Inspektionprotokoll gemäß der Referenzdatei spritesheets-nineslice.md sichergestellt wird","pt":"Habilite os agentes a construir jogos de navegador 2D usando os sistemas de física e a arquitetura baseada em cenas do Phaser 3, garantindo o carregamento preciso de spritesheets por meio de um protocolo de inspeção obrigatório delineado no arquivo de referência spritesheets-nineslice.md","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать 2D-игры для браузера с использованием систем физики и архитектуры на основе сцен Phaser 3, обеспечивая точную загрузку спрайтов через обязательный протокол проверки, описанный в справочном файле spritesheets-nineslice.md","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من بناء ألعاب المتصفح 2D باستخدام أنظمة الفيزياء وهندسة المشاهد من Phaser 3، مع ضمان تحميل دقيق للصور المصغرة من خلال بروتوكول فحص إجباري محدد في ملف المرجع spritesheets-nineslice.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Building RPG platformers","Implementing scene-based architecture in games","Debugging silent corruption in spritesheet loading"],"zh":["构建RPG平台游戏","在游戏中实现场景基于架构","调试精灵表加载中的静默损坏"],"ja":["RPGプラットフォームゲームの構築","ゲームにおけるシーンベースのアーキテクチャの実装","スプライトシートの読み込みにおけるサイレントコルロプションのデバッグ"],"ko":["RPG 플랫폼 게임 구축","게임에서 시네마 기반 아키텍처 구현","스프라이트 시트 로딩의 무음 부패 디버깅"],"es":["Construcción de plataformas de RPG","Implementación de arquitectura basada en escenas en juegos","Depuración de corrupción silenciosa en la carga de spritesheets"],"fr":["Conception de plateformes de RPG","Mise en œuvre d''une architecture basée sur des scènes dans les jeux","Débogage de la corruption silencieuse lors du chargement des spritesheets"],"de":["Erstellung von RPG-Plattformen","Implementierung von szenenbasierter Architektur in Spielen","Fehlerbehebung bei stummer Korruption bei der Spritesheet-Ladung"],"pt":["Construção de plataformas de RPG","Implementação de arquitetura baseada em cenas em jogos","Depuração de corrupção silenciosa no carregamento de spritesheets"],"ru":["Создание платформерных игр RPG","Реализация архитектуры на основе сцен в играх","Отладка беззвучной коррупции при загрузке спрайтов"],"ar":["بناء منصات ألعاب RPG","تنفيذ هندسة المشاهد في الألعاب","تصحيح أخطاء الفساد الصامت في تحميل الصور المصغرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to spritesheet loading inspection protocol","Phaser 3 compatibility only","2D browser game development only"],"zh":["需要遵守精灵表加载检查协议","仅支持Phaser 3兼容","仅限2D浏览器游戏开发"],"ja":["スプライトシートの読み込み検査プロトコルへの準拠が必要","Phaser 3のみとの互換性","2Dブラウザゲーム開発のみ"],"ko":["스프라이트 시트 로딩 검사 프로토콜을 준수해야 함","Phaser 3만 호환","2D 브라우저 게임 개발만"],"es":["Requiere adherencia al protocolo de inspección de carga de spritesheets","Compatibilidad solo con Phaser 3","Desarrollo de juegos de navegador 2D solo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au protocole d''inspection du chargement des spritesheets","Compatibilité avec Phaser 3 uniquement","Développement de jeux de navigateur 2D uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert Einhaltung des Inspektionprotokolls für die Spritesheet-Ladung","Kompatibilität nur mit Phaser 3","Entwicklung von 2D-Browser-Spielen nur"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao protocolo de inspeção de carregamento de spritesheets","Compatibilidade apenas com Phaser 3","Desenvolvimento de jogos de navegador 2D apenas"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения протокола проверки загрузки спрайтов","Совместимость только с Phaser 3","Разработка только 2D-игр для браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع بروتوكول فحص تحميل الصور المصغرة","التوافق مع Phaser 3 فقط","تطوير ألعاب المتصفح 2D فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
