ispositivos y navegadores"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","Focus sur l''esthétique et la créativité","Code de production de haute qualité","Attention aux détails","Compatibilité avec différents appareils et navigateurs"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächen","Fokus auf Ästhetik und Kreativität","Hochwertiger Produktionscode","Aufmerksamkeit für Details","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Geräten und Browsern"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web e móveis","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Escolhas criativas e inovadoras","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas personalizadas","Integração com sistemas de gerenciamento de conteúdo"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Разработка веб- и мобильных приложений","Внимание к эстетическим деталям","Творческие и инновационные решения","Разработка индивидуальных компонентов и страниц","Интеграция с системами управления контентом"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير تطبيقات الويب والجوال","الاهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","الخيارات الإبداعية والمبتكرة","تطوير مكونات وصفحات مخصصة","التكامل مع أنظمة إدارة المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","AI风格","前端开发","界面设计","用户体验"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","生産レベルのインターフェース","AIスタイル","フロントエンド開発","インターフェースデザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 인터페이스","AI 스타일","프론트엔드 개발","인터페이스 디자인","사용자 경험"],"es":["diseño de frontend","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario","estética y creatividad","código de producción","compatibilidad cruzada"],"fr":["conception de frontend","développement web","interfaces utilisateur","esthétique et créativité","code de production","compatibilité croisée"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Web-Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Ästhetik und Kreativität","Produktionscode","Plattformübergreifende Kompatibilität"],"pt":["frontend design","desenvolvimento de interfaces","aplicações web e móveis","design de usuário","experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias web","design responsivo"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка интерфейсов","веб- и мобильные приложения","дизайн пользователя","опыт пользователя","разработка программного обеспечения","веб-технологии","адаптивный дизайн"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تطوير الواجهات","تطبيقات الويب والجوال","تصميم المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنيات الويب","تصميم مستجيب"]}},"owner":"heyAyushh","repo":"gloves","repoPath":"heyAyushh/gloves","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:08:39.476Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing production-grade frontend interfaces with custom aesthetic designs.","zh":"非常适合需要生产级前端界面和自定义美学设计的UI专注代理","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントが、生産性の高いフロントエンドインターフェイスとカスタマイズされた美的設計を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스와 사용자 지정 미학 설계가 필요한 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan interfaces de frontend de grado de producción con diseños estéticos personalizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant des interfaces frontend de grade de production avec des conceptions esthétiques sur mesure.","de":"Perfekt für UI-fokussierte Agenten, die produktionsreife Frontend-Schnittstellen mit benutzerdefinierten ästhetischen Designs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que necessitam de interfaces de frontend de produção com designs estéticos personalizados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым требуются производственные интерфейсы frontend с индивидуальными эстетическими дизайнами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم ويهتمون bằng واجهات أمامية من الدرجة الأولى مع تصاميم جمالية مخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real-world frontend components using OpenCLAW credentials and passwords manager, incorporating audits and exceptional aesthetic attention to detail, all while utilizing modern frontend technologies and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建独特的、现实世界的前端组件的能力，使用OpenCLAW凭证和密码管理器，结合审计和异常的美学细节，同时利用现代前端技术和协议","ja":"OpenCLAWの資格情報とパスワードマネージャーを使用して、独自のリアルワールドのフロントエンドコンポーネントを作成するエージェントの能力を付与し、監査と優れた美的注意を組み込み、同時に最新のフロントエンド技術とプロトコルを利用","ko":"에이전트가 OpenCLAW 자격 증명 및 비밀번호 관리자를 사용하여 고유한 실제 프론트엔드 구성 요소를 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여하여审计과 예외적인 미적 주의를 통합하여 동시에 최신 프론트엔드 기술 및 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes frontend distintivos y del mundo real utilizando credenciales y administrador de contraseñas de OpenCLAW, incorporando auditorías y una atención excepcional al detalle estético, todo mientras se utilizan tecnologías y protocolos frontend modernos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants frontend distinctifs et du monde réel en utilisant des informations d''identification et un gestionnaire de mots de passe OpenCLAW, en intégrant des audits et une attention esthétique exceptionnelle aux détails, le tout en utilisant des technologies et des protocoles frontend modernes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eigenständige, realweltliche Frontend-Komponenten unter Verwendung von OpenCLAW-Anmeldeinformationen und Passwort-Manager zu erstellen, wobei Audits und außergewöhnliche ästhetische Aufmerksamkeit für Details berücksichtigt werden, während moderne Frontend-Technologien und -Protokolle verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes frontend distintos e do mundo real, utilizando credenciais e gerenciador de senhas OpenCLAW, incorporando auditorias e atenção excepcional ao detalhe estético, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza tecnologias e protocolos frontend modernos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительные компоненты frontend реального мира, используя учетные данные и менеджер паролей OpenCLAW, включающий аудиты и исключительное внимание к эстетическим деталям, при этом используя современные технологии и протоколы frontend.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم الفريدة والمعاصرة باستخدام بيانات اعتماد OpenCLAW وادارة كلمات المرور، مع دمج التدقيق والاهتمام الاستثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية، في الوقت نفسه استخدام تقنيات وبروتوكولات واجهة المستخدم الحديثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing custom login pages with enhanced security audits","Building responsive application interfaces for diverse user audiences","Creating production-ready component libraries with unique aesthetic choices"],"zh":["使用增强的安全审计设计自定义登录页面","为多样化的用户受众构建响应式应用程序接口","创建具有独特美学选择的生产就绪组件库"],"ja":["強化されたセキュリティ監査を使用したカスタムログインページの設計","多様なユーザー受衆向けのレスポンシブなアプリケーションインターフェイスの構築","ユニークな美的選択を備えた生産性の高いコンポーネントライブラリの作成"],"ko":["강화된 보안 감사를 사용한 사용자 지정 로그인 페이지 설계","다양한 사용자 대상 응답형 애플리케이션 인터페이스 구축","고유한 미적 선택을 가진 생산 준비 구성 요소 라이브러리 생성"],"es":["Diseñar páginas de inicio de sesión personalizadas con auditorías de seguridad mejoradas","Crear interfaces de aplicación responsivas para audiencias de usuarios diversas","Crear bibliotecas de componentes listas para la producción con opciones estéticas únicas"],"fr":["Concevoir des pages de connexion personnalisées avec des audits de sécurité améliorés","Créer des interfaces d''application réactives pour des publics utilisateurs divers","Créer des bibliothèques de composants prêtes pour la production avec des options esthétiques uniques"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Anmeldeseiten mit verbesserten Sicherheitsaudits entwerfen","Erstellen von responsiven Anwendungs-Schnittstellen für unterschiedliche Benutzergruppen","Erstellen von produktionsreifen Komponentenbibliotheken mit einzigartigen ästhetischen Auswahlmöglichkeiten"],"pt":["Projetar páginas de login personalizadas com auditorias de segurança aprimoradas","Construir interfaces de aplicativos responsivas para públicos diversos","Criar bibliotecas de componentes prontas para produção com escolhas estéticas únicas"],"ru":["Проектировать индивидуальные страницы входа с улучшенными аудитами безопасности","Создавать отзывчивые интерфейсы приложений для разнообразной аудитории","Создавать библиотеки компонентов, готовые к производству, с уникальными эстетическими выборами"],"ar":["تصميم صفحات تسجيل الدخول المخصصة مع تدقيقات أمنية محسنة","بناء واجهات تطبيقات مستجيبة لمجموعة متنوعة من المستخدمين","إنشاء مكتبات مكونات جاهزة للإنتاج مع خيارات جمالية فريدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires context about purpose, audience, or technical constraints","Dependent on user-provided frontend requirements"],"zh":["需要关于目的、受众或技术约束的上下文","依赖于用户提供的前端要求"],"ja":["目的、対象者、または技術的制約に関するコンテキストが必要","ユーザー提供のフロントエンド要件に依存"],"ko":["목적, 대상 또는 기술적 제약에 대한 컨텍스트가 필요","사용자 제공 프론트엔드 요구 사항에 의존"],"es":["Requiere contexto sobre el propósito, la audiencia o las limitaciones técnicas","Depende de los requisitos frontend proporcionados por el usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte sur l''objectif, le public ou les contraintes techniques","Dépend des exigences frontend fournies par l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Kontext über den Zweck, das Publikum oder die technischen Einschränkungen","Hängt von den vom Benutzer bereitgestellten Frontend-Anforderungen ab"],"pt":["Exige contexto sobre propósito, público ou restrições técnicas","Depende dos requisitos frontend fornecidos pelo usuário"],"ru":["Требует контекста о цели, аудитории или технических ограничениях","Зависит от требований frontend, предоставленных пользователем"],"ar":["يتطلب سياقًا حول الغرض أو الجمهور أو القيود الفنية","يعتمد على متطلبات واجهة المستخدم التي يقدمها المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
