n Tools und aktuellen Praktiken","pt":"O python-pro é um especialista em desenvolvimento Python 3.12+ com foco em ferramentas e práticas modernas.","ru":"Python-pro - это специалист по разработке на Python 3.12+ с фокусом на современных инструментах и практиках.","ar":"python-pro هو خبير في تطوير بايثون 3.12+ مع التركيز على الأدوات والممارسات الحديثة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Python 3.12+ 特性","现代工具和实践","生产就绪开发","包管理","代码质量保证","异步模式"],"ja":["Python 3.12+ 機能","モダントールと実践","プロダクションレディな開発","パッケージ管理","コード品質保証","非同期パターン"],"ko":["파이썬 3.12+ 기능","최신 도구 및 실践","생산 준비 개발","패키지 관리","코드 품질 보장","비동기 패턴"],"es":["Desarrollo de Python 3.12+","Herramientas modernas como uv y ruff","Prácticas de desarrollo de producción","Patrones asíncronos para aplicaciones de alto rendimiento","Gestión de paquetes con uv","Garantía de calidad de código con ruff"],"fr":["Développement Python 3.12+","Outils modernes tels que uv et ruff","Pratiques de développement de production","Modèles asynchrones pour des applications à haute performance","Gestion de paquets avec uv","Assurance de la qualité du code avec ruff"],"de":["Entwicklung von Python 3.12+","Moderne Tools wie uv und ruff","Entwicklungspraktiken für die Produktion","Asynchrone Muster für Hochleistungsanwendungen","Paketverwaltung mit uv","Code-Qualitätssicherung mit ruff"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento Python 3.12+","Ferramentas modernas","Práticas de desenvolvimento de produção","Gerenciamento de pacotes com uv","Controle de qualidade com ruff"],"ru":["Разработка на Python 3.12+","Современные инструменты","Практики разработки для производства","Управление пакетами с uv","Контроль качества с ruff"],"ar":["تطوير بايثون 3.12+","أدوات حديثة","ممارسات التطوير للإنتاج","إدارة الحزم مع uv","مراقبة الجودة مع ruff"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python 开发","Python 3.12+","现代 Python","生产就绪","包管理","代码质量","异步开发","Python 专家"],"ja":["Python 開発","Python 3.12+","モダン Python","プロダクションレディ","パッケージ管理","コード品質","非同期開発","Python エキスパート"],"ko":["파이썬 개발","파이썬 3.12+","최신 파이썬","생산 준비","패키지 관리","코드 품질","비동기 개발","파이썬 전문가"],"es":["desarrollo python","python 3.12","herramientas de desarrollo python","prácticas de desarrollo de python","desarrollo de aplicaciones python","python pro","programación python","desarrollo de software python"],"fr":["développement python","python 3.12","outils de développement python","pratiques de développement python","développement d''applications python","python pro","programmation python","développement de logiciels python"],"de":["python-entwicklung","python 3.12","entwicklungstools python","entwicklungspraktiken python","entwicklung von python-anwendungen","python pro","python-programmierung","entwicklung von python-software"],"pt":["desenvolvimento python","python 3.12+","ferramentas modernas","práticas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de pacotes","controle de qualidade"],"ru":["разработка на python","python 3.12+","современные инструменты","практики разработки","управление пакетами","контроль качества"],"ar":["تطوير بايثون","بايثون 3.12+","أدوات حديثة","ممارسات التطوير","إدارة الحزم","مراقبة الجودة"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-pro","description":"Master Python 3.12+ with modern features, async programming, performance optimization, and production-ready practices. Expert in the latest Python ecosystem including uv, ruff, pydantic, and FastAPI. Use PROACTIVELY for Python development, optimization, or advanced Python patterns.","bodyPreview":"You are a Python expert specializing in modern Python 3.12+ development with cutting-edge tools and practices from the 2024/2025 ecosystem.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert Python developer mastering Python 3.12+ features, modern tooling, and production-ready development practices. Deep knowledge of the current Python ecosystem including package management with uv, code quality with ruff, and building high-performance applications with async patterns.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Python Features\n\n- Python 3.","body":"You are a Python expert specializing in modern Python 3.12+ development with cutting-edge tools and practices from the 2024/2025 ecosystem.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert Python developer mastering Python 3.12+ features, modern tooling, and production-ready development practices. Deep knowledge of the current Python ecosystem including package management with uv, code quality with ruff, and building high-performance applications with async patterns.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Python Features\n\n- Python 3.12+ features including improved error messages, performance optimizations, and type system enhancements\n- Advanced async/await patterns with asyncio, aiohttp, and trio\n- Context managers and the `with` statement for resource management\n- Dataclasses, Pydantic models, and modern data validation\n- Pattern matching (structural pattern matching) and match statements\n- Type hints, generics, and Protocol typing for robust type safety\n- Descriptors, metaclasses, and advanced object-oriented patterns\n- Generator expressions, itertools, and memory-efficient data processing\n\n### Modern Tooling & Development Environment\n\n- Package management with uv (2024''s fastest Python package manager)\n- Code formatting and linting with ruff (replacing black, isort, flake8)\n- Static type checking with mypy and pyright\n- Project configuration with pyproject.toml (modern standard)\n- Virtual environment management with venv, pipenv, or uv\n- Pre-commit hooks for code quality automation\n- Modern Python packaging and distribution practices\n- Dependency management and lock files\n\n### Testing & Quality Assurance\n\n- Comprehensive testing with pytest and pytest plugins\n- Property-based testing with Hypothesis\n- Test fixtures, factories, and mock objects\n- Coverage analysis with pytest-cov and coverage.py\n- Performance testing and benchmarking with pytest-benchmark\n- Integration testing and test databases\n- Continuous integration with GitHub Actions\n- Code quality metrics and static analysis\n\n### Performance & Optimization\n\n- Profiling with cProfile, py-spy, and memory_profiler\n- Performance optimization techniques and bottleneck identification\n- Async programming for I/O-bound operations\n- Multiprocessing and concurrent.futures for CPU-bound tasks\n- Memory optimization and garbage collection understanding\n- Caching strategies with functools.lru_cache and external caches\n- Database optimization with SQLAlchemy and async ORMs\n- NumPy, Pandas optimization for data processing\n\n### Web Development & APIs\n\n- FastAPI for high-performance APIs with automatic documentation\n- Django for full-featured web applications\n- Flask for lightweight web services\n- Pydantic for data validation and serialization\n- SQLAlchemy 2.0+ with async support\n- Background task processing with Celery and Redis\n- WebSocket support with FastAPI and Django Channels\n- Authentication and authorization patterns\n\n### Data Science & Machine Learning\n\n- NumPy and Pandas for data manipulation and analysis\n- Matplotlib, Seaborn, and Plotly for data visualization\n- Scikit-learn for machine learning workflows\n- Jupyter notebooks and IPython for interactive development\n- Data pipeline design and ETL processes\n- Integration with modern ML libraries (PyTorch, TensorFlow)\n- Data validation and quality assurance\n- Performance optimization for large datasets\n\n### DevOps & Production Deployment\n\n- Docker containerization and multi-stage builds\n- Kubernetes deployment and scaling strategies\n- Cloud deployment (AWS, GCP, Azure) with Python services\n- Monitoring and logging with structured logging and APM tools\n- Configuration management and environment variables\n- Security best practices and vulnerability scanning\n- CI/CD pipelines and automated testing\n- Performance monitoring and alerting\n\n### Advanced Python Patterns\n\n- Design patterns implementation (Singleton, Factory, Observer, etc.)\n- SOLID principles in Python development\n- Dependency injection and inversion of control\n- Event-driven architecture and messaging patterns\n- Functional programming concepts and tools\n- Advanced decorators and context managers\n- Metaprogramming and dynamic code generation\n- Plugin architectures and extensible systems\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Follows PEP 8 and modern Python idioms consistently\n- Prioritizes code readability and maintainability\n- Uses type hints throughout for better code documentation\n- Implements comprehensive error handling with custom exceptions\n- Writes extensive tests with high coverage (>90%)\n- Leverages Python''s standard library before external dependencies\n- Focuses on performance optimization when needed\n- Documents code thoroughly with docstrings and examples\n- Stays current with latest Python releases and ecosystem changes\n- Emphasizes security and best practices in production code\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Python 3.12+ language features and performance improvements\n- Modern Python tooling ecosystem (uv, ruff, pyright)\n- Current web framework best practices (FastAPI, Django 5.x)\n- Async programming patterns and asyncio ecosystem\n- Data science and machine learning Python stack\n- Modern deployment and containerization strategies\n- Python packaging and distribution best practices\n- Security considerations and vulnerability prevention\n- Performance profiling and optimization techniques\n- Testing strategies and quality assurance practices\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** for modern Python best practices\n2. **Suggest current tools and patterns** from the 2024/2025 ecosystem\n3. **Provide production-ready code** with proper error handling and type hints\n4. **Include comprehensive tests** with pytest and appropriate fixtures\n5. **Consider performance implications** and suggest optimizations\n6. **Document security considerations** and best practices\n7. **Recommend modern tooling** for development workflow\n8. **Include deployment strategies** when applicable\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Help me migrate from pip to uv for package management\"\n- \"Optimize this Python code for better async performance\"\n- \"Design a FastAPI application with proper error handling and validation\"\n- \"Set up a modern Python project with ruff, mypy, and pytest\"\n- \"Implement a high-performance data processing pipeline\"\n- \"Create a production-ready Dockerfile for a Python application\"\n- \"Design a scalable background task system with Celery\"\n- \"Implement modern authentication patterns in FastAPI\"\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:09:38.584Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing expertise in modern Python 3.12+ development with cutting-edge tools like uv and ruff.","zh":"适合需要精通现代 Python 3.12+ 开发的代码生成代理，包括使用像 uv 和 ruff 这样的前沿工具。","ja":"Python 3.12+ のモダンな開発でエキスパートなコード生成エージェントに最適で、uv や ruff などの最先端のツールを使用します。","ko":"파이썬 3.12+ 개발에서 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 코드 생성 에이전트에게 적합하며, uv와 ruff 같은 최신 도구를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de código que necesitan experiencia en desarrollo de Python 3.12+ moderno con herramientas de vanguardia como uv y ruff.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de code ayant besoin d''expertise en développement Python 3.12+ moderne avec des outils de pointe comme uv et ruff.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die Expertenwissen in moderner Python-3.12+-Entwicklung mit hochmodernen Tools wie uv und ruff benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código que necessitam de especialização em desenvolvimento Python 3.12+ moderno com ferramentas de ponta como uv e ruff.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации кода, которым необходимы знания в области современного развития Python 3.12+ с использованием передовых инструментов, таких как uv и ruff.","ar":"مثالي لعميل генера代码 الذي يحتاج إلى خبرة في تطوير بايثون 3.12+ الحديث مع أدوات متقدمة مثل uv و ruff."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance applications with async patterns, leveraging modern Python features and production-ready development practices, including package management with uv and code quality checks with ruff.","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能应用程序的能力，使用异步模式，利用现代 Python 功能和生产就绪的开发实践，包括使用 uv 进行包管理和使用 ruff 进行代码质量检查。","ja":"エージェントに、高パフォーマンスのアプリケーションを構築する機能を付与し、uv を使用したパッケージ管理や ruff を使用したコード品質のチェックなど、モダンな Python 機能やプロダクションレディな開発実践を利用することで、async パターンでアプリケーションを構築できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 고성능 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, uv를 사용한 패키지 관리 및 ruff를 사용한 코드 품질 확인 등과 같은 최신 파이썬 기능과 프로덕션 준비 개발 관행을 활용하여 비동기 패턴으로 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones de alto rendimiento con patrones asíncronos, aprovechando las características modernas de Python y prácticas de desarrollo listas para la producción, incluyendo la gestión de paquetes con uv y controles de calidad de código con ruff.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications haute performance avec des modèles asynchrones, en exploitant les fonctionnalités modernes de Python et les pratiques de développement prêtes pour la production, y compris la gestion de paquets avec uv et les contrôles de qualité de code avec ruff.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Hochleistungsanwendungen mit asynchronen Mustern zu erstellen, indem sie moderne Python-Funktionen und produktionssichere Entwicklungsmethoden nutzen, einschließlich Paketverwaltung mit uv und Codequalitätsprüfungen mit ruff.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de alto desempenho com padrões assíncronos, aproveitando recursos modernos do Python e práticas de desenvolvimento prontas para produção, incluindo gerenciamento de pacotes com uv e verificação de qualidade de código com ruff.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные приложения с асинхронными шаблонами, используя современные функции Python и готовые к производству методы разработки, включая управление пакетами с uv и проверку качества кода с ruff.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على بناء تطبيقات أداء عالية باستخدام أنماط غير متزامنة، واستخدام ميزات بايثون الحديثة وممارسات التطوير الجاهزة للانتاج، بما في ذلك إدارة الحزم مع uv وفحص جودة الشفرة مع ruff."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing scalable applications with Python 3.12+","Optimizing code quality with ruff","Building high-performance async applications"],"zh":["使用 Python 3.12+ 开发可扩展的应用程序","使用 ruff 优化代码质量","构建高性能的异步应用程序"],"ja":["Python 3.12+ を使用してスケーラブルなアプリケーションを開発する","ruff を使用してコード品質を最適化する","高パフォーマンスの async アプリケーションを構築する"],"ko":["파이썬 3.12+를 사용하여 확장 가능한 애플리케이션 개발","ruff를 사용하여 코드 품질 최적화","고성능 비동기 애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones escalables con Python 3.12+","Optimizar la calidad del código con ruff","Construir aplicaciones asíncronas de alto rendimiento"],"fr":["Développer des applications évolutives avec Python 3.12+","Optimiser la qualité du code avec ruff","Construire des applications asynchrones haute performance"],"de":["Skalierbare Anwendungen mit Python 3.12+ entwickeln","Codequalität mit ruff optimieren","Hochleistungsasynchronanwendungen erstellen"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações escaláveis com Python 3.12+","Otimizar a qualidade do código com ruff","Construir aplicações assíncronas de alto desempenho"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых приложений с Python 3.12+","Оптимизация качества кода с ruff","Создание высокопроизводительных асинхронных приложений"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع مع بايثون 3.12+","تحسين جودة الشفرة مع ruff","بناء تطبيقات غير متزامنة عالية الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.12+ environment","Limited to Python ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Python 3.12+ 环境","仅限于 Python 生态系统"],"ja":["Python 3.12+ の環境が必要","Python エコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["파이썬 3.12+ 환경 필요","파이썬 생태계에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno Python 3.12+","Limitado al ecosistema de Python"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python 3.12+","Limité à l''écosystème Python"],"de":["Benötigt Python-3.12+-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Python-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python 3.12+","Limitado ao ecossistema Python"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python 3.12+","Ограничен экосистемой Python"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون 3.12+","محدود بنظام بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hinsley/DiffSymAgent/reduce-relie-basics', 'community', 'hinsley', 'DiffSymAgent', 'hinsley/DiffSymAgent', 'reduce-relie-basics', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:10:07.375Z', NULL, '{"id":"hinsley/DiffSymAgent/reduce-relie-basics","name":"reduce-relie-basics","description":{"es":"El flujo de trabajo de agente AI para métodos de grupo de Lie en ecuaciones diferenciales utiliza REDUCE CAS y ReLie","fr":"Le workflow de l''agent AI pour les méthodes de groupe de Lie dans les équations différentielles utilise REDUCE CAS et ReLie","de":"Der Workflow des AI-Agents für Lie-Gruppenmethoden in Differentialgleichungen verwendet REDUCE CAS und ReLie","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho do agente AI para métodos de grupo de Lie em equações diferenciais com REDUCE CAS e ReLie. Garanta que o Docker esteja em execução","ru":"Рабочий процесс агента ИИ для методов группы Ли в дифференциальных уравнениях с REDUCE CAS и ReLie. Убедитесь, что Docker запущен","ar":"تدفق العمل للوكيل الذكي لطرق مجموعة لي في المعادلات التفاضلية مع REDUCE CAS و ReLie. تأكد من تشغيل Docker","en":"AI agent workflow for Lie group methods in differential equations (REDUCE CAS + ReLie)"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Métodos de grupo de Lie con REDUCE CAS + ReLie","fr":"Méthodes de groupe de Lie avec REDUCE CAS + ReLie","de":"Lie-Gruppenmethoden mit REDUCE CAS + ReLie","pt":"Métodos de Grupo de Lie com REDUCE e ReLie","ru":"Методы группы Ли с REDUCE и ReLie","ar":"طرق مجموعة لي مع REDUCE و ReLie","en":"reduce-relie-basics"},"description":{"es":"El flujo de trabajo de agente AI para métodos de grupo de Lie en ecuaciones diferenciales utiliza REDUCE CAS y ReLie","fr":"Le workflow de l''agent AI pour les méthodes de groupe de Lie dans les équations différentielles utilise REDUCE CAS et ReLie","de":"Der Workflow des AI-Agents für Lie-Gruppenmethoden in Differentialgleichungen verwendet REDUCE CAS und ReLie","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho do agente AI para métodos de grupo de Lie em equações diferenciais com REDUCE CAS e ReLie. Garanta que o Docker esteja em execução","ru":"Рабочий процесс агента ИИ для методов группы Ли в дифференциальных уравнениях с REDUCE CAS и ReLie. Убедитесь, что Docker запущен","ar":"تدفق العمل للوكيل الذكي لطرق مجموعة لي في المعادلات التفاضلية مع REDUCE CAS و ReLie. تأكد من تشغيل Docker","en":"AI agent workflow for Lie group methods in differential equations (REDUCE CAS + ReLie)"},"definition":{"en":"AI agent workflow for Lie group methods in differential equations (REDUCE CAS + ReLie)"},"features":{"es":["Utiliza Docker para ejecutar el flujo de trabajo","Verifica la disponibilidad del daemon de Docker","Inicia Docker Desktop o Colima para asegurar la ejecución","Utiliza REDUCE CAS y ReLie para resolver ecuaciones diferenciales","Soporte para macOS y otros sistemas operativos","Ejecución de comandos CLI para verificar la configuración"],"fr":["Utilise Docker pour exécuter le workflow","Vérifie la disponibilité du daemon Docker","Lance Docker Desktop ou Colima pour assurer l''exécution","Utilise REDUCE CAS et ReLie pour résoudre des équations différentielles","Prise en charge de macOS et d''autres systèmes d''exploitation","Exécution de commandes CLI pour vérifier la configuration"],"de":["Verwendet Docker, um den Workflow auszuführen","Überprüft die Verfügbarkeit des Docker-Daemons","Startet Docker Desktop oder Colima, um die Ausführung zu gewährleisten","Verwendet REDUCE CAS und ReLie, um Differentialgleichungen zu lösen","Unterstützung für macOS und andere Betriebssysteme","Ausführen von CLI-Befehlen, um die Konfiguration zu überprüfen"],"pt":["Garantir que o Docker esteja em execução","Verificar a disponibilidade do daemon do Docker","Iniciar o Docker Desktop ou Colima","Verificar a versão do Docker","Executar comandos do Docker","Utilizar o fluxo de trabalho do agente AI"],"ru":["Гарантировать запуск Docker","Проверить доступность демона Docker","Запустить Docker Desktop или Colima","Проверить версию Docker","Выполнить команды Docker","Использовать рабочий процесс агента ИИ"],"ar":["تأكد من تشغيل Docker","تحقق من إمكانية الوصول إلى ديمون Docker","تشغيل Docker Desktop أو Colima","تحقق من إصدار Docker","تشغيل أوامر Docker","استخدام تدفق العمل للوكيل الذكي"]},"keywords":{"es":["métodos de grupo de Lie","ecuaciones diferenciales","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","Docker","Colima","macOS","CLI","resolución de ecuaciones","análisis numérico"],"fr":["méthodes de groupe de Lie","équations différentielles","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","Docker","Colima","macOS","CLI","résolution d''équations","analyse numérique"],"de":["Lie-Gruppenmethoden","Differentialgleichungen","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","Docker","Colima","macOS","CLI","Lösung von Gleichungen","numerische Analyse"],"pt":["métodos de grupo de Lie","equações diferenciais","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","Docker","Colima","agente AI","fluxo de trabalho","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["методы группы Ли","дифференциальные уравнения","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","Docker","Colima","агент ИИ","рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["طرق مجموعة لي","المعادلات التفاضلية","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","Docker","Colima","الوكيل الذكي","تدفق العمل","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"hinsley","repo":"DiffSymAgent","repoPath":"hinsley/DiffSymAgent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reduce-relie-basics","description":"Run REDUCE in Docker for this repo (using lunacamp/reduce-algebra), load the vendored ReLie file from resources/relie-src/relie.red, and perform a tiny smoke test. Use when you need the canonical docker run command or a minimal ReLie bootstrap.","bodyPreview":"# REDUCE + ReLie basics\n\n## Ensure Docker is running\n\n- Check the CLI is available: `docker --version`.\n- Check the daemon is reachable: `docker info`.\n- If the daemon is not available, start Docker Desktop (macOS: `open -a Docker`) and wait until `docker info` succeeds.\n  - Example wait loop:\n    ```bash\n    for i in {1..60}; do docker info >/dev/null 2>&1 && break; sleep 1; done\n    ```\n- If you use Colima instead of Docker Desktop, start it with `colima start` and then re-check `docker info`.","body":"# REDUCE + ReLie basics\n\n## Ensure Docker is running\n\n- Check the CLI is available: `docker --version`.\n- Check the daemon is reachable: `docker info`.\n- If the daemon is not available, start Docker Desktop (macOS: `open -a Docker`) and wait until `docker info` succeeds.\n  - Example wait loop:\n    ```bash\n    for i in {1..60}; do docker info >/dev/null 2>&1 && break; sleep 1; done\n    ```\n- If you use Colima instead of Docker Desktop, start it with `colima start` and then re-check `docker info`.\n- If you see `permission denied while trying to connect to the docker API at unix:///.../docker.sock`, rerun the command with elevated permissions or fix your socket access.\n  - In Codex CLI with sandboxing, rerun the docker command with escalated permissions so it can reach the socket.\n\n## Use local ReLie source\n\nUse the vendored ReLie file in this repo:\n\n`resources/relie-src/relie.red`\n\n## Run REDUCE in Docker (repo mounted)\n\nUse this canonical command from the repo root:\n\n```bash\ndocker run --rm -it --platform linux/amd64 \\\n  -v \"$PWD\":/workspace -w /workspace \\\n  --entrypoint /usr/lib/reduce/cslbuild/csl/reduce \\\n  lunacamp/reduce-algebra\n```\n\nNotes:\n- On Apple Silicon, keep `--platform linux/amd64`.\n- If `docker` is not in PATH, use its full path.\n\n## Load ReLie and run a tiny smoke test\n\nIn the REDUCE prompt:\n\n```reduce\nin \"resources/relie-src/relie.red\"$\n\n% Tiny smoke test: confirm the REPL responds after load.\n1+1;\n```\n\nExit with `bye;` when done.\n\n## Optional: run a tiny ReLie pipeline test (heat equation)\n\nThis mirrors a full run without interactive typing:\n\n```bash\ndocker run --rm -i --platform linux/amd64 \\\n  -v \"$PWD\":/workspace -w /workspace \\\n  --entrypoint /usr/lib/reduce/cslbuild/csl/reduce \\\n  lunacamp/reduce-algebra <<''EOF''\n\nin \"resources/relie-src/relie.red\"$\n\njetorder := 2$\nxvar := {t,x}$\nuvar := {u}$\ndiffeqs := {u_t - u_xx}$\nleadders := {u_xx}$\n\nrelie(4)$\nreliegen(1,{})$\n\nsymmetries;\ngenerators;\nbye;\nEOF\n```\n\nIf you present results to a user, summarize them in natural language (see `reduce-relie-lie-symmetries`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:10:07.375Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mathematical Agents requiring advanced differential equation solving capabilities with Lie group methods","zh":"适用于需要使用李群方法进行高级微分方程求解的数学代理","ja":"李群法を用いた高度な微分方程式の解を求める数学エージェントに適している","ko":"고급 미분 방정식 풀이를 위해 리 군 방법이 필요한 수학 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Matemáticos que requieren capacidades avanzadas de resolución de ecuaciones diferenciales con métodos de grupo de Lie","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mathématiques nécessitant des capacités avancées de résolution d''équations différentielles avec des méthodes de groupe de Lie","de":"Ideal für mathematische Agenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Lösung von Differentialgleichungen mit Lie-Gruppenmethoden benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Matemáticos que exigem capacidades avançadas de resolução de equações diferenciais com métodos de grupo de Lie","ru":"Идеально для математических агентов, требующих передовых возможностей решения дифференциальных уравнений с методами группы Ли","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الرياضيين الذين يتطلبون قدرات متقدمة لحل المعادلات التفاضلية بأسلوب مجموعة لي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage REDUCE CAS and ReLie for symbolic computation, enabling efficient solving of differential equations using Lie group methods over Docker containers, ensuring seamless integration and scalability","zh":"赋予代理使用REDUCE CAS和ReLie进行符号计算的能力，从而能够使用李群方法高效地求解微分方程，并通过Docker容器实现无缝集成和可扩展性","ja":"REDUCE CASとReLieを用いた記号計算をエージェントが利用できるようにし、李群法を用いた微分方程式の効率的な解を求めることを可能にし、Dockerコンテナを介してシームレスな統合とスケーラビリティを実現する","ko":"에이전트가 REDUCE CAS와 ReLie를 이용한 기호 계산을 활용할 수 있게 함으로써 리 군 방법을 사용하여 미분 방정식을 효율적으로 풀 수 있도록 하며, 도커 컨테이너를 통해無缝한 통합과 확장성을 보장","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar REDUCE CAS y ReLie para cálculo simbólico, lo que permite una resolución eficiente de ecuaciones diferenciales mediante métodos de grupo de Lie sobre contenedores Docker, garantizando una integración y escalabilidad sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter REDUCE CAS et ReLie pour le calcul symbolique, permettant ainsi une résolution efficace des équations différentielles à l''aide de méthodes de groupe de Lie sur des conteneurs Docker, garantissant une intégration et une scalabilité sans problème","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, REDUCE CAS und ReLie für symbolische Berechnungen zu nutzen, wodurch eine effiziente Lösung von Differentialgleichungen mithilfe von Lie-Gruppenmethoden in Docker-Containern ermöglicht wird, was eine nahtlose Integration und Skalierbarkeit gewährleistet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o REDUCE CAS e o ReLie para computação simbólica, permitindo a resolução eficiente de equações diferenciais usando métodos de grupo de Lie sobre contêineres Docker, garantindo integração e escalabilidade sem interrupções","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать REDUCE CAS и ReLie для символических вычислений, что позволяет эффективно решать дифференциальные уравнения методами группы Ли в контейнерах Docker, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию и масштабируемость","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من REDUCE CAS و ReLie للحسابات الرمزية، مما يسمح بحل فعال للمعادلات التفاضلية باستخدام أساليب مجموعة لي على حاويات Docker، مما يضمن التكامل السلس وال قابلية للتوسع"},"useCases":{"en":["Solving differential equations with Lie group symmetries","Automating Lie algebra computations with ReLie","Debugging REDUCE CAS scripts for complex mathematical models"],"zh":["使用李群对称性求解微分方程","使用ReLie自动化李代数计算","调试REDUCE CAS脚本以用于复杂的数学模型"],"ja":["李群対称性を用いた微分方程式の解の求め方","ReLieを用いたリー代数の自動計算","複雑な数学モデル用のREDUCE CASスクリプトのデバッグ"],"ko":["리 군 대칭성을 이용한 미분 방정식 풀이","ReLie를 이용한 리 대수 자동 계산","복잡한 수학 모델을 위한 REDUCE CAS 스크립트 디버깅"],"es":["Resolución de ecuaciones diferenciales con simetrías de grupo de Lie","Automatización de cálculos de álgebra de Lie con ReLie","Depuración de scripts de REDUCE CAS para modelos matemáticos complejos"],"fr":["Résolution d''équations différentielles avec des symétries de groupe de Lie","Automatisation des calculs d''algèbre de Lie avec ReLie","Débogage des scripts REDUCE CAS pour des modèles mathématiques complexes"],"de":["Lösen von Differentialgleichungen mit Lie-Gruppensymmetrien","Automatisierung von Lie-Algebreberechnungen mit ReLie","Fehlerbehebung von REDUCE-CAS-Skripten für komplexe mathematische Modelle"],"pt":["Resolução de equações diferenciais com simetrias de grupo de Lie","Automatização de computações de álgebra de Lie com ReLie","Depuração de scripts REDUCE CAS para modelos matemáticos complexos"],"ru":["Решение дифференциальных уравнений с симметриями группы Ли","Автоматизация вычислений лииевой алгебры с помощью ReLie","Отладка скриптов REDUCE CAS для сложных математических моделей"],"ar":["حل المعادلات التفاضلية ذات التناظر مجموعة لي","أتمتة حسابات جبر لي مع ReLie","تصحيح أخطاء برامج REDUCE CAS لنماذج رياضية معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker or Colima installation","Dependent on REDUCE CAS and ReLie compatibility","Needs CLI access for Docker management"],"zh":["需要Docker或Colima安装","依赖REDUCE CAS和ReLie的兼容性","需要CLI访问以管理Docker"],"ja":["DockerまたはColimaのインストールが必要","REDUCE CASとReLieの互換性に依存する","Docker管理のためのCLIアクセスが必要"],"ko":["도커 또는 콜리마 설치가 필요","REDUCE CAS와 ReLie의 호환성에 의존","도커 관리를 위한 CLI 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Docker o Colima","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de REDUCE CAS y ReLie","Necesita acceso a CLI para la administración de Docker"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Docker ou Colima","Dépend de la compatibilité de REDUCE CAS et ReLie","Nécessite un accès à la CLI pour la gestion de Docker"],"de":["Benötigt eine Installation von Docker oder Colima","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität von REDUCE CAS und ReLie","Benötigt Zugriff auf die CLI für die Docker-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Docker ou Colima","Dependente da compatibilidade do REDUCE CAS e ReLie","Necessita acesso à CLI para gerenciamento do Docker"],"ru":["Требует установки Docker или Colima","Зависит от совместимости REDUCE CAS и ReLie","Требует доступа к CLI для управления Docker"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Docker أو Colima","يعتمد على توافق REDUCE CAS و ReLie","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى سطر الأوامر للتحكم في Docker"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list/storytelling', 'community', 'thewoolleyman', 'tab-groups-windows-list', 'thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list', 'storytelling', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:09:49.836Z', NULL, '{"id":"thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list/storytelling","name":"storytelling","description":{"zh":"故事讲述技术是通过特定的工作流配置来执行任务的关键步骤","ja":"ストーリーテリング技術は、特定のワークフローコンフィグを通じてタスクを実行するための重要なステップ","ko":"스토리 텔링 기술은 특정 워크플로우 구성을 통해 태스크를 실행하는 중요한 단계","es":"La técnica de storytelling es crucial para los desarrolladores que buscan crear experiencias de usuario atractivas","fr":"La technique de storytelling est essentielle pour les développeurs qui cherchent à créer des expériences utilisateur attrayantes","de":"Die Storytelling-Technik ist entscheidend für Entwickler, die ansprechende Benutzererfahrungen schaffen möchten","pt":"Storytelling é uma técnica de narração que ajuda desenvolvedores a criar histórias envolventes e melhorar a comunicação de projetos","ru":"Искусство рассказывания - это техника, которая помогает разработчикам создавать увлекательные истории и улучшать коммуникацию проектов","ar":"السرد هو تقنية سرد تساعد المطورين على إنشاء قصص جذابة وتحسين الاتصال بمشاريعهم","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"故事讲述技术","ja":"ストーリーテリング技術","ko":"스토리 텔링 기술","es":"Técnica de Storytelling para Desarrolladores","fr":"Technique de Storytelling pour Développeurs","de":"Storytelling-Technik für Entwickler","pt":"Storytelling: Técnicas de Narração para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Искусство рассказывания: техники для разработчиков","ar":"السرد: تقنيات لل مطورين","en":"storytelling"},"description":{"zh":"故事讲述技术是通过特定的工作流配置来执行任务的关键步骤","ja":"ストーリーテリング技術は、特定のワークフローコンフィグを通じてタスクを実行するための重要なステップ","ko":"스토리 텔링 기술은 특정 워크플로우 구성을 통해 태스크를 실행하는 중요한 단계","es":"La técnica de storytelling es crucial para los desarrolladores que buscan crear experiencias de usuario atractivas","fr":"La technique de storytelling est essentielle pour les développeurs qui cherchent à créer des expériences utilisateur attrayantes","de":"Die Storytelling-Technik ist entscheidend für Entwickler, die ansprechende Benutzererfahrungen schaffen möchten","pt":"Storytelling é uma técnica de narração que ajuda desenvolvedores a criar histórias envolventes e melhorar a comunicação de projetos","ru":"Искусство рассказывания - это техника, которая помогает разработчикам создавать увлекательные истории и улучшать коммуникацию проектов","ar":"السرد هو تقنية سرد تساعد المطورين على إنشاء قصص جذابة وتحسين الاتصال بمشاريعهم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["加载工作流配置文件","读取工作流配置文件内容","传递工作流配置参数","执行特定任务","支持多语言","提高工作效率"],"ja":["ワークフローコンフィグファイルを読み込む","ワークフローコンフィグファイルの内容を読み取る","ワークフローコンフィグパラメータを渡す","特定のタスクを実行","複数言語をサポート","作業効率を向上"],"ko":["워크플로우 구성을 파일을 로드","워크플로우 구성을 파일의 내용을 읽기","워크플로우 구성을 매개변수를 전달","특정 태스크를 실행","다중 언어 지원","작업 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Carga del archivo workflow.xml","Lectura del contenido del archivo","Paso del parámetro ''workflow-config'' al trabajo","Implementación de la técnica de storytelling en proyectos de desarrollo","Creación de experiencias de usuario atractivas","Transmisión de información de manera efectiva"],"fr":["Chargement du fichier workflow.xml","Lecture du contenu du fichier","Passage du paramètre ''workflow-config'' au travail","Mise en œuvre de la technique de storytelling dans les projets de développement","Création d''expériences utilisateur attrayantes","Transmission d''informations de manière efficace"],"de":["Laden der Datei workflow.xml","Lesen des Dateiinhalts","Übergabe des Parameters ''workflow-config'' an die Arbeit","Implementierung der Storytelling-Technik in Entwicklungsprojekten","Erstellung ansprechender Benutzererfahrungen","Übermittlung von Informationen auf effektive Weise"],"pt":["Técnica de narração para desenvolvedores","Criação de histórias envolventes","Melhoria da comunicação de projetos","Apresentação de projetos de forma atraente","Desenvolvimento de habilidades de comunicação"],"ru":["Техника рассказывания для разработчиков","Создание увлекательных историй","Улучшение коммуникации проектов","Презентация проектов в привлекательной форме","Развитие навыков общения"],"ar":["تقنية سرد للمطورين","إنشاء قصص جذابة","تحسين الاتصال بمشاريع","عرض المشاريع بشكل جذاب","تنمية مهارات الاتصال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["故事讲述技术","工作流配置","任务执行","效率提高","多语言支持","工作流管理","任务管理","配置文件","参数传递"],"ja":["ストーリーテリング技術","ワークフローコンフィグ","タスク実行","効率向上","複数言語サポート","ワークフローマネジメント","タスクマネジメント","コンフィグファイル","パラメータ渡し"],"ko":["스토리 텔링 기술","워크플로우 구성을","태스크 실행","효율성을 향상","다중 언어 지원","워크플로우 관리","태스크 관리","구성을 파일","매개변수 전달"],"es":["storytelling para desarrolladores","técnica de storytelling","desarrollo de experiencias de usuario","transmisión de información","carga de archivos","lectura de contenido","paso de parámetros","implementación de técnicas","creación de experiencias atractivas"],"fr":["storytelling pour développeurs","technique de storytelling","développement d''expériences utilisateur","transmission d''informations","chargement de fichiers","lecture de contenu","passage de paramètres","mise en œuvre de techniques","création d''expériences attrayantes"],"de":["storytelling für Entwickler","Storytelling-Technik","Entwicklung von Benutzererfahrungen","Übermittlung von Informationen","Laden von Dateien","Lesen von Inhalten","Übergabe von Parametern","Implementierung von Techniken","Erstellung ansprechender Erfahrungen"],"pt":["storytelling para desenvolvedores","técnicas de narração","comunicação de projetos","apresentação de projetos","desenvolvimento de habilidades","narração de histórias","criação de conteúdo"],"ru":["искусство рассказывания для разработчиков","техники рассказывания","коммуникация проектов","презентация проектов","развитие навыков","рассказывание историй","создание контента"],"ar":["السرد للمطورين","تقنيات السرد","الاتصال بمشاريع","عرض المشاريع","تنمية المهارات","سرد القصص","إنشاء المحتوى"]}},"owner":"thewoolleyman","repo":"tab-groups-windows-list","repoPath":"thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"storytelling","description":"Craft compelling narratives using proven story frameworks and techniques. This workflow guides users through structured narrative development, applying appropriate story frameworks to create emotionally resonant and engaging stories for any purpose.","bodyPreview":"IT IS CRITICAL THAT YOU FOLLOW THESE STEPS - while staying in character as the current agent persona you may have loaded:\n\n<steps CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\n1. Always LOAD the FULL @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml\n2. READ its entire contents - this is the CORE OS for EXECUTING the specific workflow-config @{project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/storytelling/workflow.yaml\n3. Pass the yaml path @{project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/storytelling/workflow.yaml as ''workflow-config'' parameter to the work","body":"IT IS CRITICAL THAT YOU FOLLOW THESE STEPS - while staying in character as the current agent persona you may have loaded:\n\n<steps CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\n1. Always LOAD the FULL @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml\n2. READ its entire contents - this is the CORE OS for EXECUTING the specific workflow-config @{project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/storytelling/workflow.yaml\n3. Pass the yaml path @{project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/storytelling/workflow.yaml as ''workflow-config'' parameter to the workflow.xml instructions\n4. Follow workflow.xml instructions EXACTLY as written to process and follow the specific workflow config and its instructions\n5. Save outputs after EACH section when generating any documents from templates\n</steps>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:09:49.836Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT needing advanced narrative generation capabilities.","zh":"适合于需要高级叙事生成能力的对话式代理，如 Claude Code 或 AutoGPT。","ja":"Claude Code または AutoGPT のような、高度なナラティブ生成機能を必要とする会話エージェントに適しています。","ko":"클로드 코드 또는 오토지피티와 같은 고급적인 내러티브 생성 기능이 필요한 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de conversación como Claude Code o AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de generación de narrativas avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conversation comme Claude Code ou AutoGPT qui ont besoin de capacités de génération de récits avancées.","de":"Ideal für Conversationsagenten wie Claude Code oder AutoGPT, die erweiterte Erzählgenerierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação, como Claude Code ou AutoGPT, que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de narrativas.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, таких как Claude Code или AutoGPT, требующих продвинутых возможностей генерации нарративов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحادثين مثل Claude Code أو AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات توليد سرد متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute complex storytelling workflows using YAML configuration files and XML-based core OS, enabling seamless narrative generation and character development through protocols like workflow-config and data exchange formats.","zh":"使代理能够使用 YAML 配置文件和基于 XML 的核心操作系统执行复杂的故事创作工作流，通过工作流配置和数据交换格式等协议实现无缝的内러티브生成和角色发展。","ja":"YAML 構成ファイルと XML ベースのコア OS を使用して、複雑なストーリー作成ワークフローを実行できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。ワークフロー構成とデータ交換形式などのプロトコルを介して、シームレスなナラティブ生成とキャラクタ開発を可能にします。","ko":"YAML 구성 파일과 XML 기반의 핵심 운영 체제를 사용하여 복잡한 스토리 생성 워크플로를 실행할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 워크플로 구성 및 데이터 교환 형식과 같은 프로토콜을 통해無쓸모한 내러티브 생성과 캐릭터 개발을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar flujos de trabajo de narración complejos utilizando archivos de configuración YAML y un sistema operativo básico basado en XML, lo que permite una generación de narrativa y desarrollo de personajes sin problemas a través de protocolos como workflow-config y formatos de intercambio de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des flux de travail de narration complexes en utilisant des fichiers de configuration YAML et un système d''exploitation de base basé sur XML, ce qui permet une génération de récits et un développement de personnages sans problème via des protocoles tels que workflow-config et des formats d''échange de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Erzählworkflows mithilfe von YAML-Konfigurationsdateien und einem XML-basierten Core-OS auszuführen, wodurch eine nahtlose Erzählgenerierung und Charakterentwicklung durch Protokolle wie workflow-config und Daten austauschformate ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho de narrativa complexos usando arquivos de configuração YAML e core OS baseado em XML, permitindo geração de narrativa sem interrupções e desenvolvimento de personagens por meio de protocolos como workflow-config e formatos de troca de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять сложные рабочие процессы повествования, используя файлы конфигурации YAML и ядро ОС на основе XML, что позволяет обеспечить бесперебойную генерацию нарратива и развитие персонажей посредством протоколов, таких как workflow-config и форматы обмена данными.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل تدفقات عمل سرد معقدة باستخدام ملفات تكوين YAML ونظام تشغيل temel XML، مما يسمح بالتوليد السلس للقصص وتطوير الشخصيات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل workflow-config وتنسيقات تبادل البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating immersive stories","Developing character personas","Creating interactive narrative flows"],"zh":["生成身临其境的故事","开发角色个性","创建交互式叙事流"],"ja":["没入型のストーリーを生成する","キャラクターペルソナを開発する","インタラクティブなナラティブフローを作成する"],"ko":["몰입형 스토리를 생성하는 것","캐릭터 개성을 개발하는 것","인터랙티브 내러티브 흐름을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generar historias inmersivas","Desarrollar personajes","Crear flujos de narrativa interactivos"],"fr":["Générer des histoires immersives","Développer des personnages","Créer des flux de narration interactifs"],"de":["Immersive Geschichten generieren","Charakterpersönlichkeiten entwickeln","Interaktive Erzählflüsse erstellen"],"pt":["Gerar histórias imersivas","Desenvolver personas de personagens","Criar fluxos narrativos interativos"],"ru":["Генерация погружающих историй","Разработка персонажей","Создание интерактивных нарративных потоков"],"ar":["توليد قصص غامرة","تطوير شخصيات الشخصيات","إنشاء تدفقات سرد تفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires loading of full workflow.xml","Dependent on specific workflow-config YAML files","Needs access to project-root directory"],"zh":["需要加载完整的 workflow.xml","依赖于特定的 workflow-config YAML 文件","需要访问项目根目录"],"ja":["完全な workflow.xml を読み込む必要がある","特定の workflow-config YAML ファイルに依存する","プロジェクトルートディレクトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["完整한 워크플로.xml을 로드해야 함","특정 워크플로 구성 YAML 파일에 의존함","프로젝트 루트 디렉토리에 접근할 필요가 있음"],"es":["Requiere la carga de workflow.xml completo","Depende de archivos YAML de configuración de flujo de trabajo específicos","Necesita acceso al directorio raíz del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite le chargement de workflow.xml complet","Dépend de fichiers YAML de configuration de flux de travail spécifiques","Nécessite un accès au répertoire racine du projet"],"de":["Erfordert das Laden der vollständigen workflow.xml","Hängt von bestimmten YAML-Workflow-Konfigurationsdateien ab","Benötigt Zugriff auf das Projekt-Stammdirectory"],"pt":["Requer carregar o workflow.xml completo","Depende de arquivos YAML de configuração de fluxo de trabalho específicos","Necessita acesso ao diretório project-root"],"ru":["Требует загрузки полного workflow.xml","Зависит от конкретных файлов конфигурации workflow-config YAML","Требует доступа к каталогу project-root"],"ar":["يتطلب تحميل ملف workflow.xml الكامل","يعتمد على ملفات تكوين YAML الخاصة بتدفق العمل","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى دليل المشروع-الجذر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yumehiko/jp-ui/jp-ui-foundations', 'community', 'yumehiko', 'jp-ui', 'yumehiko/jp-ui', 'jp-ui-foundations', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:09:29.575Z', NULL, '{"id":"yumehiko/jp-ui/jp-ui-foundations","name":"jp-ui-foundations","description":{"zh":"jp-ui 基础组件是一套用于构建统一的 UI 设计语言的工具集","ja":"jp-ui ファウンデーションは、統一された UI デザイン言語を構築するためのツールセットです","ko":"jp-ui 기본 구성 요소는統一された UI 디자인 언어를構築하는ためのツールセット입니다","es":"Los fundamentos de la interfaz de usuario de JP proporcionan una base para la implementación de componentes con tokens de foundation","fr":"Les fondations de l''interface utilisateur JP offrent une base pour l''implémentation de composants avec des tokens de foundation","de":"Die Fundamente der Benutzeroberfläche von JP bieten eine Basis für die Implementierung von Komponenten mit Foundation-Tokens","pt":"Os fundamentos de UI do JP fornecem uma base sólida para o desenvolvimento de componentes, garantindo uma experiência de usuário consistente.","ru":"Фундаментальные принципы JP UI обеспечивают прочную основу для разработки компонентов, гарантируя последовательный пользовательский опыт.","ar":"أساسيات واجهة المستخدم JP توفر أساسا متينا لتطوير المكونات، مما يضمن تجربة مستخدم متسقة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"jp-ui 基础组件","ja":"jp-ui ファウンデーション","ko":"jp-ui 기본 구성 요소","es":"Fundamentos de interfaz de usuario de JP","fr":"Fondations d''interface utilisateur JP","de":"JP-Benutzeroberflächen-Fundamente","pt":"Fundamentos de UI do JP: Desenvolvimento de Componentes","ru":"Фундаментальные принципы JP UI: разработка компонентов","ar":"أساسيات واجهة المستخدم JP: تطوير المكونات","en":"jp-ui-foundations"},"description":{"zh":"jp-ui 基础组件是一套用于构建统一的 UI 设计语言的工具集","ja":"jp-ui ファウンデーションは、統一された UI デザイン言語を構築するためのツールセットです","ko":"jp-ui 기본 구성 요소는統一された UI 디자인 언어를構築하는ためのツールセット입니다","es":"Los fundamentos de la interfaz de usuario de JP proporcionan una base para la implementación de componentes con tokens de foundation","fr":"Les fondations de l''interface utilisateur JP offrent une base pour l''implémentation de composants avec des tokens de foundation","de":"Die Fundamente der Benutzeroberfläche von JP bieten eine Basis für die Implementierung von Komponenten mit Foundation-Tokens","pt":"Os fundamentos de UI do JP fornecem uma base sólida para o desenvolvimento de componentes, garantindo uma experiência de usuário consistente.","ru":"Фундаментальные принципы JP UI обеспечивают прочную основу для разработки компонентов, гарантируя последовательный пользовательский опыт.","ar":"أساسيات واجهة المستخدم JP توفر أساسا متينا لتطوير المكونات، مما يضمن تجربة مستخدم متسقة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["颜色管理","字体管理","图标管理","形状管理","自动更新Tokens"],"ja":["色管理","タイポグラフィ管理","アイコン管理","形状管理","トークンの自動更新"],"ko":["색상 관리","타이포그래피 관리","아이콘 관리","모양 관리","토큰 자동 업데이트"],"es":["Tokens de foundation para colores, tipografía, iconos y formas","Actualizaciones automáticas de tokens y roles","Generación de tonos de color y roles","Compatibilidad con temas claros y oscuros","Tokens de foundation para sombras y efectos visuales"],"fr":["Tokens de foundation pour les couleurs, la typographie, les icônes et les formes","Mises à jour automatiques des tokens et des rôles","Génération de tons de couleur et de rôles","Compatibilité avec les thèmes clairs et sombres","Tokens de foundation pour les ombres et les effets visuels"],"de":["Foundation-Tokens für Farben, Typografie, Symbole und Formen","Automatische Updates von Tokens und Rollen","Generierung von Farbtönen und Rollen","Unterstützung für helle und dunkle Designs","Foundation-Tokens für Schatten und visuelle Effekte"],"pt":["Tokens de cores e tipografia","Sistema de roles para componentes","Geração de tons de cores","Saída de tokens de cores e roles","CSS básico para componentes"],"ru":["Токены цветов и типографики","Система ролей для компонентов","Генерация тонов цветов","Выходные токены цветов и ролей","Базовый CSS для компонентов"],"ar":["رموز الألوان والطباعة","نظام الأدوار للمكونات","توليد درجات الألوان","إخراج رموز الألوان والأدوار","CSS أساسي للمكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["jp-ui","基础组件","设计语言","颜色管理","字体管理","图标管理","形状管理"],"ja":["jp-ui","ファウンデーション","デザイン言語","色管理","タイポグラフィ管理","アイコン管理","形状管理"],"ko":["jp-ui","기본 구성 요소","디자인 언어","색상 관리","타이포그래피 관리","아이콘 관리","모양 관리"],"es":["fundamentos de interfaz de usuario","tokens de foundation","componentes de interfaz de usuario","diseño de interfaz de usuario","desarrollo de interfaz de usuario","tokens de color","tipografía de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["fondations d''interface utilisateur","tokens de foundation","composants d''interface utilisateur","conception d''interface utilisateur","développement d''interface utilisateur","tokens de couleur","typographie d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächen-Fundamente","Foundation-Tokens","Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten","Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Benutzeroberflächen-Entwicklung","Farbtokens","Benutzeroberflächen-Typografie"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de componentes","fundamentos de UI","tokens de cores","tipografia","sistema de roles","geração de tons de cores","css básico"],"ru":["разработка компонентов","фундаментальные принципы UI","токены цветов","типография","система ролей","генерация тонов цветов","базовый CSS"],"ar":["تطوير المكونات","أساسيات واجهة المستخدم","رموز الألوان","الطباعة","نظام الأدوار","توليد درجات الألوان","CSS أساسي"]}},"owner":"yumehiko","repo":"jp-ui","repoPath":"yumehiko/jp-ui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jp-ui-foundations","description":"jp-uiのFoundation（色/タイポ/アイコン/形状/影）を参照して実装するためのスキル。Foundationトークンや関連ファイルが更新されたらこのスキルも更新する。","bodyPreview":"# jp-ui Foundations\n\n## 使いどころ\n- コンポーネント実装時に Foundation トークン（色/タイポ/アイコン/形状/影）を参照する\n- Tokens/roles/tones の更新があった場合に内容を追随\n\n## 参照先（Source of Truth）\n- 色トーン生成: `scripts/generate-tones.mjs`\n- Role抽出: `scripts/extract-roles.mjs`\n- Role CSS生成: `scripts/generate-roles-css.mjs`\n- 色入力: `tokens/source.json`\n- 色トーン出力: `tokens/tones.json`, `tokens/tones.css`\n- Role出力: `tokens/roles.light.json`, `tokens/roles.dark.json`, `tokens/roles.css`\n- 基本CSSトークン: `src/index.css`\n\n## Foundation トークン\n### Typography\n- ベースフォン","body":"# jp-ui Foundations\n\n## 使いどころ\n- コンポーネント実装時に Foundation トークン（色/タイポ/アイコン/形状/影）を参照する\n- Tokens/roles/tones の更新があった場合に内容を追随\n\n## 参照先（Source of Truth）\n- 色トーン生成: `scripts/generate-tones.mjs`\n- Role抽出: `scripts/extract-roles.mjs`\n- Role CSS生成: `scripts/generate-roles-css.mjs`\n- 色入力: `tokens/source.json`\n- 色トーン出力: `tokens/tones.json`, `tokens/tones.css`\n- Role出力: `tokens/roles.light.json`, `tokens/roles.dark.json`, `tokens/roles.css`\n- 基本CSSトークン: `src/index.css`\n\n## Foundation トークン\n### Typography\n- ベースフォント: `\"Hiragino Sans\", sans-serif`\n- `typesetting-body` / `typesetting-betagumi` / `typesetting-tsumegumi`\n- 見出し: `typesetting-display`, `typesetting-headline`, `typesetting-title`\n- ラベル: `typesetting-label` (tsumegumi), `typesetting-editable-label` (betagumi)\n- キャプション: `typesetting-caption` (betagumi)\n\n### Color\n- 役割色: `tokens/roles.css` から `--surface`, `--on-surface`, `--primary`, `--on-primary` など\n- パレット色: `--red`, `--on-red`, `--red-container`, `--on-red-container`, `--inverse-red` など\n- Fixed: `--true-white`, `--true-black`\n- テーマクラス: `.theme-light`, `.theme-dark`\n\n### Shape\n- `--radius-none: 0`\n- `--radius-xs: 4px`\n- `--radius-s: 8px`\n- `--radius-m: 12px`\n- `--radius-l: 16px`\n- `--radius-xl: 28px`\n- `--radius-full: 8192px`\n\n### Shadow\n- `--shadow-rgb: 0 0 0`\n- `--elevation-0..5`\n- `--elevation-1`: `0 0 8px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.2), 1px 1px 4px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.1)`\n- `--elevation-2`: `0 0 12px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.2), 1px 1px 6px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.15)`\n- `--elevation-3`: `0 0 16px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.2), 2px 2px 8px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.2)`\n- `--elevation-4`: `0 0 20px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.2), 3px 3px 12px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.2)`\n- `--elevation-5`: `0 0 24px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.2), 4px 4px 16px 0 rgb(var(--shadow-rgb) / 0.3)`\n\n### Icons\n- アイコン: `src/assets/icons/Icon.tsx`\n- 生成マップ: `src/assets/icons/iconMap.generated.ts`\n- アイコン一覧: `src/pages/IconsPage.tsx`\n\n## 更新時のルール\n- Foundation トークンを更新したら、このスキルの記載も更新する\n- 新しい参照先ファイルを追加したら `参照先` セクションに追加\n\n## スクリプト実行コマンド\n- `pnpm gen:tones`\n- `pnpm gen:roles`\n- `pnpm gen:roles-css`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:09:29.575Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing standardized UI component implementation with Foundation Tokens","zh":"非常适合需要标准化UI组件实现的Foundation Tokens的前端代理","ja":"標準化されたUIコンポーネントの実装が必要なFoundation Tokensを使用するフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"표준화된 UI 컴포넌트 구현이 필요한 Foundation Tokens를 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes front-end que necesitan implementación de componentes de interfaz de usuario estandarizados con Tokens de Foundation","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une mise en œuvre de composants d''interface utilisateur standardisés avec des Jetons de Foundation","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine standardisierte Implementierung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Foundation-Tokens benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de implementação de componentes de interface do usuário padronizados com Tokens de Fundação","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется стандартизированная реализация компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью токенов Foundation","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ مكونات واجهة المستخدم الموحدة باستخدام رموز الأساس"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and update UI components using Foundation Tokens, including color tones, typography, icons, shapes, and shadows, with scripts like generate-tones.mjs and extract-roles.mjs, and file formats like JSON and CSS","zh":"赋予代理生成和更新UI组件的能力，使用Foundation Tokens，包括颜色调色板、字体、图标、形状和阴影，并使用脚本如generate-tones.mjs和extract-roles.mjs，以及文件格式如JSON和CSS","ja":"エージェントに、Foundation Tokensを使用してUIコンポーネントを生成および更新する能力を付与します。色調、字体、アイコン、形状、影などを含み、generate-tones.mjsやextract-roles.mjsなどのスクリプトやJSON、CSSなどのファイル形式を使用します","ko":"에이전트가 Foundation Tokens를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트를 생성 및 업데이트할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 색상 톤, 타이포그래피, 아이콘, 모양, 그림자 등과 같이 generate-tones.mjs 및 extract-roles.mjs와 같은 스크립트 및 JSON, CSS와 같은 파일 형식을 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y actualizar componentes de interfaz de usuario mediante Tokens de Foundation, incluidas tonos de color, tipografía, iconos, formas y sombras, con scripts como generate-tones.mjs y extract-roles.mjs, y formatos de archivo como JSON y CSS","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de mettre à jour des composants d''interface utilisateur à l''aide de Jetons de Foundation, y compris des tons de couleur, de la typographie, des icônes, des formes et des ombres, avec des scripts comme generate-tones.mjs et extract-roles.mjs, et des formats de fichier comme JSON et CSS","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Foundation-Tokens zu generieren und zu aktualisieren, einschließlich Farbtöne, Typografie, Symbole, Formen und Schatten, mit Skripten wie generate-tones.mjs und extract-roles.mjs und Dateiformaten wie JSON und CSS","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e atualizar componentes de interface do usuário usando Tokens de Fundação, incluindo tons de cor, tipografia, ícones, formas e sombras, com scripts como generate-tones.mjs e extract-roles.mjs, e formatos de arquivo como JSON e CSS","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать и обновлять компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, используя токены Foundation, включая оттенки цвета, типографику, иконки, формы и тени, с помощью скриптов, таких как generate-tones.mjs и extract-roles.mjs, и форматов файлов, таких как JSON и CSS","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من生成 وتحديث مكونات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام رموز الأساس، بما في ذلك درجات الألوان، وتنسيق النصوص، والأيقونات، والأشكال، والظلال، مع سكريبتات مثل generate-tones.mjs و extract-roles.mjs، وشكلاً من أشكال الملفات مثل JSON و CSS"},"useCases":{"en":["Referencing Foundation Tokens for component implementation","Updating content with new Tokens/roles/tones","Generating color tones with scripts/generate-tones.mjs"],"zh":["引用Foundation Tokens进行组件实现","使用新Tokens/roles/tones更新内容","使用脚本/generate-tones.mjs生成颜色调色板"],"ja":["コンポーネントの実装にFoundation Tokensを参照する","新しいトークン/ロール/トーンを使用してコンテンツを更新する","スクリプト/generate-tones.mjsを使用して色調を生成する"],"ko":["컴포넌트 구현을 위해 Foundation Tokens 참조","새 토큰/역할/톤을 사용하여 컨텐츠 업데이트","스크립트/generate-tones.mjs를 사용하여 색상 톤 생성"],"es":["Hacer referencia a los Tokens de Foundation para la implementación de componentes","Actualizar contenido con nuevos Tokens/roles/tonos","Generar tonos de color con scripts/generate-tones.mjs"],"fr":["Référencer les Jetons de Foundation pour la mise en œuvre de composants","Mettre à jour le contenu avec de nouveaux Jetons/rôles/tons","Générer des tons de couleur avec scripts/generate-tones.mjs"],"de":["Verweis auf Foundation-Tokens für die Implementierung von Komponenten","Inhalte mit neuen Tokens/Rollen/Tönen aktualisieren","Farbtöne mit Skripten wie generate-tones.mjs generieren"],"pt":["Fazendo referência a Tokens de Fundação para implementação de componentes","Atualizando conteúdo com novos Tokens/roles/tons","Gerando tons de cor com scripts/generate-tones.mjs"],"ru":["Ссылка на токены Foundation для реализации компонентов","Обновление содержимого с помощью новых токенов/ролей/оттенков","Генерация оттенков цвета со скриптом generate-tones.mjs"],"ar":["الإشارة إلى رموز الأساس لتنفيذ المكونات","تحديث المحتوى مع رموز/أدوار/درجات ألوان جديدة","توليد درجات الألوان باستخدام سكريبتات generate-tones.mjs"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to scripts and tokens files like tokens/source.json and tokens/tones.json","Limited to UI component implementation with Foundation Tokens"],"zh":["需要访问脚本和tokens文件，如tokens/source.json和tokens/tones.json","仅限于使用Foundation Tokens的UI组件实现"],"ja":["スクリプトやトークンファイル（tokens/source.jsonやtokens/tones.jsonなど）へのアクセスが必要","Foundation Tokensを使用したUIコンポーネントの実装のみに限定"],"ko":["스크립트 및 토큰 파일(tokens/source.json 및 tokens/tones.json 등) 액세스가 필요","Foundation Tokens를 사용한 UI 컴포넌트 구현만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a scripts y archivos de tokens como tokens/source.json y tokens/tones.json","Limitado a la implementación de componentes de interfaz de usuario con Tokens de Foundation"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux scripts et aux fichiers de jetons tels que tokens/source.json et tokens/tones.json","Limité à la mise en œuvre de composants d''interface utilisateur avec des Jetons de Foundation"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Skripte und Token-Dateien wie tokens/source.json und tokens/tones.json","Begrenzt auf die Implementierung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Foundation-Tokens"],"pt":["Requer acesso a scripts e arquivos de tokens, como tokens/source.json e tokens/tones.json","Limitado à implementação de componentes de interface do usuário com Tokens de Fundação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к скриптам и файлам токенов, таким как tokens/source.json и tokens/tones.json","Ограничен реализацией компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью токенов Foundation"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى السكريبتات وملفات الرموز مثل tokens/source.json و tokens/tones.json","محدود بتنفيذ مكونات واجهة المستخدم مع رموز الأساس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/error-trace', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'error-trace', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:09:42.633Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/error-trace","name":"error-trace","description":{"zh":"错误追踪与监控专家，帮助您实现实时错误检测、有意义的警报和性能监控","ja":"エラートレースと監視の専門家が、リアルタイムのエラーディテクション、意味のあるアラート、パフォーマンスモニタリングを実現","ko":"오류 추적 및 모니터링 전문가가 실시간 오류 감지, 의미 있는 경고 및 성능 모니터링을 구현","es":"El seguimiento de errores y la observabilidad son fundamentales para detectar y resolver problemas de producción de manera eficiente","fr":"Le suivi des erreurs et l''observabilité sont essentiels pour détecter et résoudre les problèmes de production de manière efficace","de":"Fehlerverfolgung und Überwachung sind entscheidend für die effiziente Erkennung und Behebung von Produktionsproblemen","pt":"O skill error-trace é especializado em implementar soluções de rastreio de erros para detectar problemas em tempo real","ru":"Навык error-trace специализируется на реализации решений для отслеживания ошибок для обнаружения проблем в реальном времени","ar":"المهارة error-trace متخصصة في تطبيق حلول تتبع الأخطاء لاكتشاف المشاكل في الوقت الفعلي","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"错误追踪与监控","ja":"エラートレースと監視","ko":"오류 추적 및 모니터링","es":"Rastreo de Errores y Monitoreo en Tiempo Real","fr":"Suivi et Surveillance des Erreurs en Temps Réel","de":"Fehlerverfolgung und Überwachung in Echtzeit","pt":"Rastreio de Erros em Tempo Real","ru":"Отслеживание Ошибок в Реальном Времени","ar":"تتبع الأخطاء في الوقت الفعلي","en":"error-trace"},"description":{"zh":"错误追踪与监控专家，帮助您实现实时错误检测、有意义的警报和性能监控","ja":"エラートレースと監視の専門家が、リアルタイムのエラーディテクション、意味のあるアラート、パフォーマンスモニタリングを実現","ko":"오류 추적 및 모니터링 전문가가 실시간 오류 감지, 의미 있는 경고 및 성능 모니터링을 구현","es":"El seguimiento de errores y la observabilidad son fundamentales para detectar y resolver problemas de producción de manera eficiente","fr":"Le suivi des erreurs et l''observabilité sont essentiels pour détecter et résoudre les problèmes de production de manière efficace","de":"Fehlerverfolgung und Überwachung sind entscheidend für die effiziente Erkennung und Behebung von Produktionsproblemen","pt":"O skill error-trace é especializado em implementar soluções de rastreio de erros para detectar problemas em tempo real","ru":"Навык error-trace специализируется на реализации решений для отслеживания ошибок для обнаружения проблем в реальном времени","ar":"المهارة error-trace متخصصة في تطبيق حلول تتبع الأخطاء لاكتشاف المشاكل في الوقت الفعلي","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实时错误检测","有意义的警报","错误分组","性能监控","与其他工具的集成"],"ja":["リアルタイムのエラーディテクション","意味のあるアラート","エラーグルーピング","パフォーマンスモニタリング","他のツールとの統合"],"ko":["실시간 오류 감지","의미 있는 경고","오류 그룹화","성능 모니터링","다른 도구와의 통합"],"es":["Detección de errores en tiempo real","Alertas personalizables","Registros estructurados","Monitoreo de rendimiento","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Détection d''erreurs en temps réel","Alertes personnalisables","Journaux structurés","Surveillance des performances","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Echtzeit-Fehlererkennung","Anpassbare Alarme","Strukturierte Protokolle","Leistungsüberwachung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Detecção de erros em tempo real","Alertas personalizáveis","Registo estruturado de erros","Monitoramento de desempenho","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Обнаружение ошибок в реальном времени","Настраиваемые оповещения","Структурированное логирование ошибок","Мониторинг производительности","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["اكتشاف الأخطاء في الوقت الفعلي","تنبيهات قابلة للتعديل","تسجيل مخطط للأخطاء","مراقبة الأداء","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["错误追踪","监控","实时错误检测","性能监控","错误分组","警报","集成"],"ja":["エラートレース","監視","リアルタイムのエラーディテクション","パフォーマンスモニタリング","エラーグルーピング","アラート","統合"],"ko":["오류 추적","모니터링","실시간 오류 감지","성능 모니터링","오류 그룹화","경고","통합"],"es":["rastreo de errores","monitoreo de errores","detención de errores","registros de errores","monitoreo de rendimiento","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["suivi des erreurs","surveillance des erreurs","détection d''erreurs","journaux d''erreurs","surveillance des performances","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Fehlerverfolgung","Fehlerüberwachung","Fehlererkennung","Fehlerprotokolle","Leistungsüberwachung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["rastreio de erros","detecção de erros","monitoramento de desempenho","registo de erros","alertas personalizáveis","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["отслеживание ошибок","обнаружение ошибок","мониторинг производительности","регистрация ошибок","настраиваемые оповещения","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تتبع الأخطاء","اكتشاف الأخطاء","مراقبة الأداء","تسجيل الأخطاء","تنبيهات قابلة للتعديل","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"error-trace","description":"You are an error tracking and observability expert specializing in implementing comprehensive error monitoring solutions. Set up error tracking systems, configure alerts, implement structured logging, and ensure teams can quickly identify and resolve production issues.","bodyPreview":"# Error Tracking and Monitoring\n\nYou are an error tracking and observability expert specializing in implementing comprehensive error monitoring solutions. Set up error tracking systems, configure alerts, implement structured logging, and ensure teams can quickly identify and resolve production issues.\n\n## Context\n\nThe user needs to implement or improve error tracking and monitoring. Focus on real-time error detection, meaningful alerts, error grouping, performance monitoring, and integration wit","body":"# Error Tracking and Monitoring\n\nYou are an error tracking and observability expert specializing in implementing comprehensive error monitoring solutions. Set up error tracking systems, configure alerts, implement structured logging, and ensure teams can quickly identify and resolve production issues.\n\n## Context\n\nThe user needs to implement or improve error tracking and monitoring. Focus on real-time error detection, meaningful alerts, error grouping, performance monitoring, and integration with popular error tracking services.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Error Tracking Analysis\n\nAnalyze current error handling and tracking:\n\n**Error Analysis Script**\n\n```python\nimport os\nimport re\nimport ast\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\nclass ErrorTrackingAnalyzer:\n    def analyze_codebase(self, project_path):\n        \"\"\"\n        Analyze error handling patterns in codebase\n        \"\"\"\n        analysis = {\n            ''error_handling'': self._analyze_error_handling(project_path),\n            ''logging_usage'': self._analyze_logging(project_path),\n            ''monitoring_setup'': self._check_monitoring_setup(project_path),\n            ''error_patterns'': self._identify_error_patterns(project_path),\n            ''recommendations'': []\n        }\n\n        self._generate_recommendations(analysis)\n        return analysis\n\n    def _analyze_error_handling(self, project_path):\n        \"\"\"Analyze error handling patterns\"\"\"\n        patterns = {\n            ''try_catch_blocks'': 0,\n            ''unhandled_promises'': 0,\n            ''generic_catches'': 0,\n            ''error_types'': defaultdict(int),\n            ''error_reporting'': []\n        }\n\n        for file_path in Path(project_path).rglob(''*.{js,ts,py,java,go}''):\n            content = file_path.read_text(errors=''ignore'')\n\n            # JavaScript/TypeScript patterns\n            if file_path.suffix in [''.js'', ''.ts'']:\n                patterns[''try_catch_blocks''] += len(re.findall(r''try\\s*{'', content))\n                patterns[''generic_catches''] += len(re.findall(r''catch\\s*\\([^)]*\\)\\s*{\\s*}'', content))\n                patterns[''unhandled_promises''] += len(re.findall(r''\\.then\\([^)]+\\)(?!\\.catch)'', content))\n\n            # Python patterns\n            elif file_path.suffix == ''.py'':\n                try:\n                    tree = ast.parse(content)\n                    for node in ast.walk(tree):\n                        if isinstance(node, ast.Try):\n                            patterns[''try_catch_blocks''] += 1\n                            for handler in node.handlers:\n                                if handler.type is None:\n                                    patterns[''generic_catches''] += 1\n                except:\n                    pass\n\n        return patterns\n\n    def _analyze_logging(self, project_path):\n        \"\"\"Analyze logging patterns\"\"\"\n        logging_patterns = {\n            ''console_logs'': 0,\n            ''structured_logging'': False,\n            ''log_levels_used'': set(),\n            ''logging_frameworks'': []\n        }\n\n        # Check for logging frameworks\n        package_files = [''package.json'', ''requirements.txt'', ''go.mod'', ''pom.xml'']\n        for pkg_file in package_files:\n            pkg_path = Path(project_path) / pkg_file\n            if pkg_path.exists():\n                content = pkg_path.read_text()\n                if ''winston'' in content or ''bunyan'' in content:\n                    logging_patterns[''logging_frameworks''].append(''winston/bunyan'')\n                if ''pino'' in content:\n                    logging_patterns[''logging_frameworks''].append(''pino'')\n                if ''logging'' in content:\n                    logging_patterns[''logging_frameworks''].append(''python-logging'')\n                if ''logrus'' in content or ''zap'' in content:\n                    logging_patterns[''logging_frameworks''].append(''logrus/zap'')\n\n        return logging_patterns\n```\n\n### 2. Error Tracking Service Integration\n\nImplement integrations with popular error tracking services:\n\n**Sentry Integration**\n\n```javascript\n// sentry-setup.js\nimport * as Sentry from \"@sentry/node\";\nimport { ProfilingIntegration } from \"@sentry/profiling-node\";\n\nclass SentryErrorTracker {\n  constructor(config) {\n    this.config = config;\n    this.initialized = false;\n  }\n\n  initialize() {\n    Sentry.init({\n      dsn: this.config.dsn,\n      environment: this.config.environment,\n      release: this.config.release,\n\n      // Performance Monitoring\n      tracesSampleRate: this.config.tracesSampleRate || 0.1,\n      profilesSampleRate: this.config.profilesSampleRate || 0.1,\n\n      // Integrations\n      integrations: [\n        // HTTP integration\n        new Sentry.Integrations.Http({ tracing: true }),\n\n        // Express integration\n        new Sentry.Integrations.Express({\n          app: this.config.app,\n          router: true,\n          methods: [\"GET\", \"POST\", \"PUT\", \"DELETE\", \"PATCH\"],\n        }),\n\n        // Database integration\n        new Sentry.Integrations.Postgres(),\n        new Sentry.Integrations.Mysql(),\n        new Sentry.Integrations.Mongo(),\n\n        // Profiling\n        new ProfilingIntegration(),\n\n        // Custom integrations\n        ...this.getCustomIntegrations(),\n      ],\n\n      // Filtering\n      beforeSend: (event, hint) => {\n        // Filter sensitive data\n        if (event.request?.cookies) {\n          delete event.request.cookies;\n        }\n\n        // Filter out specific errors\n        if (this.shouldFilterError(event, hint)) {\n          return null;\n        }\n\n        // Enhance error context\n        return this.enhanceErrorEvent(event, hint);\n      },\n\n      // Breadcrumbs\n      beforeBreadcrumb: (breadcrumb, hint) => {\n        // Filter sensitive breadcrumbs\n        if (breadcrumb.category === \"console\" && breadcrumb.level === \"debug\") {\n          return null;\n        }\n\n        return breadcrumb;\n      },\n\n      // Options\n      attachStacktrace: true,\n      shutdownTimeout: 5000,\n      maxBreadcrumbs: 100,\n      debug: this.config.debug || false,\n\n      // Tags\n      initialScope: {\n        tags: {\n          component: this.config.component,\n          version: this.config.version,\n        },\n        user: {\n          id: this.config.userId,\n          segment: this.config.userSegment,\n        },\n      },\n    });\n\n    this.initialized = true;\n    this.setupErrorHandlers();\n  }\n\n  setupErrorHandlers() {\n    // Global error handler\n    process.on(\"uncaughtException\", (error) => {\n      console.error(\"Uncaught Exception:\", error);\n      Sentry.captureException(error, {\n        tags: { type: \"uncaught_exception\" },\n        level: \"fatal\",\n      });\n\n      // Graceful shutdown\n      this.gracefulShutdown();\n    });\n\n    // Promise rejection handler\n    process.on(\"unhandledRejection\", (reason, promise) => {\n      console.error(\"Unhandled Rejection:\", reason);\n      Sentry.captureException(reason, {\n        tags: { type: \"unhandled_rejection\" },\n        extra: { promise: promise.toString() },\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  enhanceErrorEvent(event, hint) {\n    // Add custom context\n    event.extra = {\n      ...event.extra,\n      memory: process.memoryUsage(),\n      uptime: process.uptime(),\n      nodeVersion: process.version,\n    };\n\n    // Add user context\n    if (this.config.getUserContext) {\n      event.user = this.config.getUserContext();\n    }\n\n    // Add custom fingerprinting\n    if (hint.originalException) {\n      event.fingerprint = this.generateFingerprint(hint.originalException);\n    }\n\n    return event;\n  }\n\n  generateFingerprint(error) {\n    // Custom fingerprinting logic\n    const fingerprint = [];\n\n    // Group by error type\n    fingerprint.push(error.name || \"Error\");\n\n    // Group by error location\n    if (error.stack) {\n      const match = error.stack.match(/at\\s+(.+?)\\s+\\(/);\n      if (match) {\n        fingerprint.push(match[1]);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Group by custom properties\n    if (error.code) {\n      fingerprint.push(error.code);\n    }\n\n    return fingerprint;\n  }\n}\n\n// Express middleware\nexport const sentryMiddleware = {\n  requestHandler: Sentry.Handlers.requestHandler(),\n  tracingHandler: Sentry.Handlers.tracingHandler(),\n  errorHandler: Sentry.Handlers.errorHandler({\n    shouldHandleError(error) {\n      // Capture 4xx and 5xx errors\n      if (error.status >= 400) {\n        return true;\n      }\n      return false;\n    },\n  }),\n};\n```\n\n**Custom Error Tracking Service**\n\n```typescript\n// error-tracker.ts\ninterface ErrorEvent {\n  timestamp: Date;\n  level: \"debug\" | \"info\" | \"warning\" | \"error\" | \"fatal\";\n  message: string;\n  stack?: string;\n  context: {\n    user?: any;\n    request?: any;\n    environment: string;\n    release: string;\n    tags: Record<string, string>;\n    extra: Record<string, any>;\n  };\n  fingerprint: string[];\n}\n\nclass ErrorTracker {\n  private queue: ErrorEvent[] = [];\n  private batchSize = 10;\n  private flushInterval = 5000;\n\n  constructor(private config: ErrorTrackerConfig) {\n    this.startBatchProcessor();\n  }\n\n  captureException(error: Error, context?: Partial<ErrorEvent[\"context\"]>) {\n    const event: ErrorEvent = {\n      timestamp: new Date(),\n      level: \"error\",\n      message: error.message,\n      stack: error.stack,\n      context: {\n        environment: this.config.environment,\n        release: this.config.release,\n        tags: {},\n        extra: {},\n        ...context,\n      },\n      fingerprint: this.generateFingerprint(error),\n    };\n\n    this.addToQueue(event);\n  }\n\n  captureMessage(message: string, level: ErrorEvent[\"level\"] = \"info\") {\n    const event: ErrorEvent = {\n      timestamp: new Date(),\n      level,\n      message,\n      context: {\n        environment: this.config.environment,\n        release: this.config.release,\n        tags: {},\n        extra: {},\n      },\n      fingerprint: [message],\n    };\n\n    this.addToQueue(event);\n  }\n\n  private addToQueue(event: ErrorEvent) {\n    // Apply sampling\n    if (Math.random() > this.config.sampleRate) {\n      return;\n    }\n\n    // Filter sensitive data\n    event = this.sanitizeEvent(event);\n\n    // Add to queue\n    this.queue.push(event);\n\n    // Flush if queue is full\n    if (this.queue.length >= this.batchSize) {\n      this.flush();\n    }\n  }\n\n  private sanitizeEvent(event: ErrorEvent): ErrorEvent {\n    // Remove sensitive data\n    const sensitiveKeys = [\"password\", \"token\", \"secret\", \"api_key\"];\n\n    const sanitize = (obj: any): any => {\n      if (!obj || typeof obj !== \"object\") return obj;\n\n      const cleaned = Array.isArray(obj) ? [] : {};\n\n      for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(obj)) {\n        if (sensitiveKeys.some((k) => key.toLowerCase().includes(k))) {\n          cleaned[key] = \"[REDACTED]\";\n        } else if (typeof value === \"object\") {\n          cleaned[key] = sanitize(value);\n        } else {\n          cleaned[key] = value;\n        }\n      }\n\n      return cleaned;\n    };\n\n    return {\n      ...event,\n      context: sanitize(event.context),\n    };\n  }\n\n  private async flush() {\n    if (this.queue.length === 0) return;\n\n    const events = this.queue.splice(0, this.batchSize);\n\n    try {\n      await this.sendEvents(events);\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(\"Failed to send error events:\", error);\n      // Re-queue events\n      this.queue.unshift(...events);\n    }\n  }\n\n  private async sendEvents(events: ErrorEvent[]) {\n    const response = await fetch(this.config.endpoint, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        Authorization: `Bearer ${this.config.apiKey}`,\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ events }),\n    });\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      throw new Error(`Error tracking API returned ${response.status}`);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Structured Logging Implementation\n\nImplement comprehensive structured logging:\n\n**Advanced Logger**\n\n```typescript\n// structured-logger.ts\nimport winston from ''winston'';\nimport { ElasticsearchTransport } from ''winston-elasticsearch'';\n\nclass StructuredLogger {\n    private logger: winston.Logger;\n\n    constructor(config: LoggerConfig) {\n        this.logger = winston.createLogger({\n            level: config.level || ''info'',\n            format: winston.format.combine(\n                winston.format.timestamp(),\n                winston.format.errors({ stack: true }),\n                winston.format.metadata(),\n                winston.format.json()\n            ),\n            defaultMeta: {\n                service: config.service,\n                environment: config.environment,\n                version: config.version\n            },\n            transports: this.createTransports(config)\n        });\n    }\n\n    private createTransports(config: LoggerConfig): winston.transport[] {\n        const transports: winston.transport[] = [];\n\n        // Console transport for development\n        if (config.environment === ''development'') {\n            transports.push(new winston.transports.Console({\n                format: winston.format.combine(\n                    winston.format.colorize(),\n                    winston.format.simple()\n                )\n            }));\n        }\n\n        // File transport for all environments\n        transports.push(new winston.transports.File({\n            filename: ''logs/error.log'',\n            level: ''error'',\n            maxsize: 5242880, // 5MB\n            maxFiles: 5\n        }));\n\n        transports.push(new winston.transports.File({\n            filename: ''logs/combined.log'',\n            maxsize: 5242880,\n            maxFiles: 5\n        }));\n\n        // Elasticsearch transport for production\n        if (config.elasticsearch) {\n            transports.push(new ElasticsearchTransport({\n                level: ''info'',\n                clientOpts: config.elasticsearch,\n                index: `logs-${config.service}`,\n                transformer: (logData) => {\n                    return {\n                        ''@timestamp'': logData.timestamp,\n                        severity: logData.level,\n                        message: logData.message,\n                        fields: {\n                            ...logData.metadata,\n                            ...logData.defaultMeta\n                        }\n                    };\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        return transports;\n    }\n\n    // Logging methods with context\n    error(message: string, error?: Error, context?: any) {\n        this.logger.error(message, {\n            error: {\n                message: error?.message,\n                stack: error?.stack,\n                name: error?.name\n            },\n            ...context\n        });\n    }\n\n    warn(message: string, context?: any) {\n        this.logger.warn(message, context);\n    }\n\n    info(message: string, context?: any) {\n        this.logger.info(message, context);\n    }\n\n    debug(message: string, context?: any) {\n        this.logger.debug(message, context);\n    }\n\n    // Performance logging\n    startTimer(label: string): () => void {\n        const start = Date.now();\n        return () => {\n            const duration = Date.now() - start;\n            this.info(`Timer ${label}`, { duration, label });\n        };\n    }\n\n    // Audit logging\n    audit(action: string, userId: string, details: any) {\n        this.info(''Audit Event'', {\n            type: ''audit'',\n            action,\n            userId,\n            timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n            details\n        });\n    }\n}\n\n// Request logging middleware\nexport function requestLoggingMiddleware(logger: StructuredLogger) {\n    return (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        const start = Date.now();\n\n        // Log request\n        logger.info(''Incoming request'', {\n            method: req.method,\n            url: req.url,\n            ip: req.ip,\n            userAgent: req.get(''user-agent'')\n        });\n\n        // Log response\n        res.on(''finish'', () => {\n            const duration = Date.now() - start;\n            logger.info(''Request completed'', {\n                method: req.method,\n                url: req.url,\n                status: res.statusCode,\n                duration,\n                contentLength: res.get(''content-length'')\n            });\n        });\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Error Alerting Configuration\n\nSet up intelligent alerting:\n\n**Alert Manager**\n\n```python\n# alert_manager.py\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Optional\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nimport asyncio\n\n@dataclass\nclass AlertRule:\n    name: str\n    condition: str\n    threshold: float\n    window: timedelta\n    severity: str\n    channels: List[str]\n    cooldown: timedelta = timedelta(minutes=15)\n\nclass AlertManager:\n    def __init__(self, config):\n        self.config = config\n        self.rules = self._load_rules()\n        self.alert_history = {}\n        self.channels = self._setup_channels()\n\n    def _load_rules(self):\n        \"\"\"Load alert rules from configuration\"\"\"\n        return [\n            AlertRule(\n                name=\"High Error Rate\",\n                condition=\"error_rate\",\n                threshold=0.05,  # 5% error rate\n                window=timedelta(minutes=5),\n                severity=\"critical\",\n                channels=[\"slack\", \"pagerduty\"]\n            ),\n            AlertRule(\n                name=\"Response Time Degradation\",\n                condition=\"response_time_p95\",\n                threshold=1000,  # 1 second\n                window=timedelta(minutes=10),\n                severity=\"warning\",\n                channels=[\"slack\"]\n            ),\n            AlertRule(\n                name=\"Memory Usage Critical\",\n                condition=\"memory_usage_percent\",\n                threshold=90,\n                window=timedelta(minutes=5),\n                severity=\"critical\",\n                channels=[\"slack\", \"pagerduty\"]\n            ),\n            AlertRule(\n                name=\"Disk Space Low\",\n                condition=\"disk_free_percent\",\n                threshold=10,\n                window=timedelta(minutes=15),\n                severity=\"warning\",\n                channels=[\"slack\", \"email\"]\n            )\n        ]\n\n    async def evaluate_rules(self, metrics: Dict):\n        \"\"\"Evaluate all alert rules against current metrics\"\"\"\n        for rule in self.rules:\n            if await self._should_alert(rule, metrics):\n                await self._send_alert(rule, metrics)\n\n    async def _should_alert(self, rule: AlertRule, metrics: Dict) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Check if alert should be triggered\"\"\"\n        # Check if metric exists\n        if rule.condition not in metrics:\n            return False\n\n        # Check threshold\n        value = metrics[rule.condition]\n        if not self._check_threshold(value, rule.threshold, rule.condition):\n            return False\n\n        # Check cooldown\n        last_alert = self.alert_history.get(rule.name)\n        if last_alert and datetime.now() - last_alert < rule.cooldown:\n            return False\n\n        return True\n\n    async def _send_alert(self, rule: AlertRule, metrics: Dict):\n        \"\"\"Send alert through configured channels\"\"\"\n        alert_data = {\n            \"rule\": rule.name,\n            \"severity\": rule.severity,\n            \"value\": metrics[rule.condition],\n            \"threshold\": rule.threshold,\n            \"timestamp\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n            \"environment\": self.config.environment,\n            \"service\": self.config.service\n        }\n\n        # Send to all channels\n        tasks = []\n        for channel_name in rule.channels:\n            if channel_name in self.channels:\n                channel = self.channels[channel_name]\n                tasks.append(channel.send(alert_data))\n\n        await asyncio.gather(*tasks)\n\n        # Update alert history\n        self.alert_history[rule.name] = datetime.now()\n\n# Alert channels\nclass SlackAlertChannel:\n    def __init__(self, webhook_url):\n        self.webhook_url = webhook_url\n\n    async def send(self, alert_data):\n        \"\"\"Send alert to Slack\"\"\"\n        color = {\n            \"critical\": \"danger\",\n            \"warning\": \"warning\",\n            \"info\": \"good\"\n        }.get(alert_data[\"severity\"], \"danger\")\n\n        payload = {\n            \"attachments\": [{\n                \"color\": color,\n                \"title\": f\"🚨 {alert_data[''rule'']}\",\n                \"fields\": [\n                    {\n                        \"title\": \"Severity\",\n                        \"value\": alert_data[\"severity\"].upper(),\n                        \"short\": True\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"title\": \"Environment\",\n                        \"value\": alert_data[\"environment\"],\n                        \"short\": True\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"title\": \"Current Value\",\n                        \"value\": str(alert_data[\"value\"]),\n                        \"short\": True\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"title\": \"Threshold\",\n                        \"value\": str(alert_data[\"threshold\"]),\n                        \"short\": True\n                    }\n                ],\n                \"footer\": alert_data[\"service\"],\n                \"ts\": int(datetime.now().timestamp())\n            }]\n        }\n\n        # Send to Slack\n        async with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:\n            await session.post(self.webhook_url, json=payload)\n```\n\n### 5. Error Grouping and Deduplication\n\nImplement intelligent error grouping:\n\n**Error Grouping Algorithm**\n\n```python\nimport hashlib\nimport re\nfrom difflib import SequenceMatcher\n\nclass ErrorGrouper:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.groups = {}\n        self.patterns = self._compile_patterns()\n\n    def _compile_patterns(self):\n        \"\"\"Compile regex patterns for normalization\"\"\"\n        return {\n            ''numbers'': re.compile(r''\\b\\d+\\b''),\n            ''uuids'': re.compile(r''[a-f0-9]{8}-[a-f0-9]{4}-[a-f0-9]{4}-[a-f0-9]{4}-[a-f0-9]{12}''),\n            ''urls'': re.compile(r''https?://[^\\s]+''),\n            ''file_paths'': re.compile(r''(/[^/\\s]+)+''),\n            ''memory_addresses'': re.compile(r''0x[0-9a-fA-F]+''),\n            ''timestamps'': re.compile(r''\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}[T\\s]\\d{2}:\\d{2}:\\d{2}'')\n        }\n\n    def group_error(self, error):\n        \"\"\"Group error with similar errors\"\"\"\n        fingerprint = self.generate_fingerprint(error)\n\n        # Find existing group\n        group = self.find_similar_group(fingerprint, error)\n\n        if group:\n            group[''count''] += 1\n            group[''last_seen''] = error[''timestamp'']\n            group[''instances''].append(error)\n        else:\n            # Create new group\n            self.groups[fingerprint] = {\n                ''fingerprint'': fingerprint,\n                ''first_seen'': error[''timestamp''],\n                ''last_seen'': error[''timestamp''],\n                ''count'': 1,\n                ''instances'': [error],\n                ''pattern'': self.extract_pattern(error)\n            }\n\n        return fingerprint\n\n    def generate_fingerprint(self, error):\n        \"\"\"Generate unique fingerprint for error\"\"\"\n        # Normalize error message\n        normalized = self.normalize_message(error[''message''])\n\n        # Include error type and location\n        components = [\n            error.get(''type'', ''Unknown''),\n            normalized,\n            self.extract_location(error.get(''stack'', ''''))\n        ]\n\n        # Generate hash\n        fingerprint = hashlib.sha256(\n            ''|''.join(components).encode()\n        ).hexdigest()[:16]\n\n        return fingerprint\n\n    def normalize_message(self, message):\n        \"\"\"Normalize error message for grouping\"\"\"\n        # Replace dynamic values\n        normalized = message\n        for pattern_name, pattern in self.patterns.items():\n            normalized = pattern.sub(f''<{pattern_name}>'', normalized)\n\n        return normalized.strip()\n\n    def extract_location(self, stack):\n        \"\"\"Extract error location from stack trace\"\"\"\n        if not stack:\n            return ''unknown''\n\n        lines = stack.split(''\\n'')\n        for line in lines:\n            # Look for file references\n            if '' at '' in line:\n                # Extract file and line number\n                match = re.search(r''at\\s+(.+?)\\s*\\((.+?):(\\d+):(\\d+)\\)'', line)\n                if match:\n                    file_path = match.group(2)\n                    # Normalize file path\n                    file_path = re.sub(r''.*/(?=src/|lib/|app/)'', '''', file_path)\n                    return f\"{file_path}:{match.group(3)}\"\n\n        return ''unknown''\n\n    def find_similar_group(self, fingerprint, error):\n        \"\"\"Find similar error group using fuzzy matching\"\"\"\n        if fingerprint in self.groups:\n            return self.groups[fingerprint]\n\n        # Try fuzzy matching\n        normalized_message = self.normalize_message(error[''message''])\n\n        for group_fp, group in self.groups.items():\n            similarity = SequenceMatcher(\n                None,\n                normalized_message,\n                group[''pattern'']\n            ).ratio()\n\n            if similarity > 0.85:  # 85% similarity threshold\n                return group\n\n        return None\n```\n\n### 6. Performance Impact Tracking\n\nMonitor performance impact of errors:\n\n**Performance Monitor**\n\n```typescript\n// performance-monitor.ts\ninterface PerformanceMetrics {\n  responseTime: number;\n  errorRate: number;\n  throughput: number;\n  apdex: number;\n  resourceUsage: {\n    cpu: number;\n    memory: number;\n    disk: number;\n  };\n}\n\nclass PerformanceMonitor {\n  private metrics: Map<string, PerformanceMetrics[]> = new Map();\n  private intervals: Map<string, NodeJS.Timer> = new Map();\n\n  startMonitoring(service: string, interval: number = 60000) {\n    const timer = setInterval(() => {\n      this.collectMetrics(service);\n    }, interval);\n\n    this.intervals.set(service, timer);\n  }\n\n  private async collectMetrics(service: string) {\n    const metrics: PerformanceMetrics = {\n      responseTime: await this.getResponseTime(service),\n      errorRate: await this.getErrorRate(service),\n      throughput: await this.getThroughput(service),\n      apdex: await this.calculateApdex(service),\n      resourceUsage: await this.getResourceUsage(),\n    };\n\n    // Store metrics\n    if (!this.metrics.has(service)) {\n      this.metrics.set(service, []);\n    }\n\n    const serviceMetrics = this.metrics.get(service)!;\n    serviceMetrics.push(metrics);\n\n    // Keep only last 24 hours\n    const dayAgo = Date.now() - 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n    const filtered = serviceMetrics.filter((m) => m.timestamp > dayAgo);\n    this.metrics.set(service, filtered);\n\n    // Check for anomalies\n    this.detectAnomalies(service, metrics);\n  }\n\n  private detectAnomalies(service: string, current: PerformanceMetrics) {\n    const history = this.metrics.get(service) || [];\n    if (history.length < 10) return; // Need history for comparison\n\n    // Calculate baselines\n    const baseline = this.calculateBaseline(history.slice(-60)); // Last hour\n\n    // Check for anomalies\n    const anomalies = [];\n\n    if (current.responseTime > baseline.responseTime * 2) {\n      anomalies.push({\n        type: \"response_time_spike\",\n        severity: \"warning\",\n        value: current.responseTime,\n        baseline: baseline.responseTime,\n      });\n    }\n\n    if (current.errorRate > baseline.errorRate + 0.05) {\n      anomalies.push({\n        type: \"error_rate_increase\",\n        severity: \"critical\",\n        value: current.errorRate,\n        baseline: baseline.errorRate,\n      });\n    }\n\n    if (anomalies.length > 0) {\n      this.reportAnomalies(service, anomalies);\n    }\n  }\n\n  private calculateBaseline(history: PerformanceMetrics[]) {\n    const sum = history.reduce(\n      (acc, m) => ({\n        responseTime: acc.responseTime + m.responseTime,\n        errorRate: acc.errorRate + m.errorRate,\n        throughput: acc.throughput + m.throughput,\n        apdex: acc.apdex + m.apdex,\n      }),\n      {\n        responseTime: 0,\n        errorRate: 0,\n        throughput: 0,\n        apdex: 0,\n      },\n    );\n\n    return {\n      responseTime: sum.responseTime / history.length,\n      errorRate: sum.errorRate / history.length,\n      throughput: sum.throughput / history.length,\n      apdex: sum.apdex / history.length,\n    };\n  }\n\n  async calculateApdex(service: string, threshold: number = 500) {\n    // Apdex = (Satisfied + Tolerating/2) / Total\n    const satisfied = await this.countRequests(service, 0, threshold);\n    const tolerating = await this.countRequests(\n      service,\n      threshold,\n      threshold * 4,\n    );\n    const total = await this.getTotalRequests(service);\n\n    if (total === 0) return 1;\n\n    return (satisfied + tolerating / 2) / total;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 7. Error Recovery Strategies\n\nImplement automatic error recovery:\n\n**Recovery Manager**\n\n```javascript\n// recovery-manager.js\nclass RecoveryManager {\n  constructor(config) {\n    this.strategies = new Map();\n    this.retryPolicies = config.retryPolicies || {};\n    this.circuitBreakers = new Map();\n    this.registerDefaultStrategies();\n  }\n\n  registerStrategy(errorType, strategy) {\n    this.strategies.set(errorType, strategy);\n  }\n\n  registerDefaultStrategies() {\n    // Network errors\n    this.registerStrategy(\"NetworkError\", async (error, context) => {\n      return this.retryWithBackoff(\n        context.operation,\n        this.retryPolicies.network || {\n          maxRetries: 3,\n          baseDelay: 1000,\n          maxDelay: 10000,\n        },\n      );\n    });\n\n    // Database errors\n    this.registerStrategy(\"DatabaseError\", async (error, context) => {\n      // Try read replica if available\n      if (context.operation.type === \"read\" && context.readReplicas) {\n        return this.tryReadReplica(context);\n      }\n\n      // Otherwise retry with backoff\n      return this.retryWithBackoff(\n        context.operation,\n        this.retryPolicies.database || {\n          maxRetries: 2,\n          baseDelay: 500,\n          maxDelay: 5000,\n        },\n      );\n    });\n\n    // Rate limit errors\n    this.registerStrategy(\"RateLimitError\", async (error, context) => {\n      const retryAfter = error.retryAfter || 60;\n      await this.delay(retryAfter * 1000);\n      return context.operation();\n    });\n\n    // Circuit breaker for external services\n    this.registerStrategy(\"ExternalServiceError\", async (error, context) => {\n      const breaker = this.getCircuitBreaker(context.service);\n\n      try {\n        return await breaker.execute(context.operation);\n      } catch (error) {\n        // Fallback to cache or default\n        if (context.fallback) {\n          return context.fallback();\n        }\n        throw error;\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  async recover(error, context) {\n    const errorType = this.classifyError(error);\n    const strategy = this.strategies.get(errorType);\n\n    if (!strategy) {\n      // No recovery strategy, rethrow\n      throw error;\n    }\n\n    try {\n      const result = await strategy(error, context);\n\n      // Log recovery success\n      this.logRecovery(error, errorType, \"success\");\n\n      return result;\n    } catch (recoveryError) {\n      // Log recovery failure\n      this.logRecovery(error, errorType, \"failure\", recoveryError);\n\n      // Throw original error\n      throw error;\n    }\n  }\n\n  async retryWithBackoff(operation, policy) {\n    let lastError;\n    let delay = policy.baseDelay;\n\n    for (let attempt = 0; attempt < policy.maxRetries; attempt++) {\n      try {\n        return await operation();\n      } catch (error) {\n        lastError = error;\n\n        if (attempt < policy.maxRetries - 1) {\n          await this.delay(delay);\n          delay = Math.min(delay * 2, policy.maxDelay);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    throw lastError;\n  }\n\n  getCircuitBreaker(service) {\n    if (!this.circuitBreakers.has(service)) {\n      this.circuitBreakers.set(\n        service,\n        new CircuitBreaker({\n          timeout: 3000,\n          errorThresholdPercentage: 50,\n          resetTimeout: 30000,\n          rollingCountTimeout: 10000,\n          rollingCountBuckets: 10,\n          volumeThreshold: 10,\n        }),\n      );\n    }\n\n    return this.circuitBreakers.get(service);\n  }\n\n  classifyError(error) {\n    // Classify by error code\n    if (error.code === \"ECONNREFUSED\" || error.code === \"ETIMEDOUT\") {\n      return \"NetworkError\";\n    }\n\n    if (error.code === \"ER_LOCK_DEADLOCK\" || error.code === \"SQLITE_BUSY\") {\n      return \"DatabaseError\";\n    }\n\n    if (error.status === 429) {\n      return \"RateLimitError\";\n    }\n\n    if (error.isExternalService) {\n      return \"ExternalServiceError\";\n    }\n\n    // Default\n    return \"UnknownError\";\n  }\n}\n\n// Circuit breaker implementation\nclass CircuitBreaker {\n  constructor(options) {\n    this.options = options;\n    this.state = \"CLOSED\";\n    this.failures = 0;\n    this.successes = 0;\n    this.nextAttempt = Date.now();\n  }\n\n  async execute(operation) {\n    if (this.state === \"OPEN\") {\n      if (Date.now() < this.nextAttempt) {\n        throw new Error(\"Circuit breaker is OPEN\");\n      }\n\n      // Try half-open\n      this.state = \"HALF_OPEN\";\n    }\n\n    try {\n      const result = await Promise.race([\n        operation(),\n        this.timeout(this.options.timeout),\n      ]);\n\n      this.onSuccess();\n      return result;\n    } catch (error) {\n      this.onFailure();\n      throw error;\n    }\n  }\n\n  onSuccess() {\n    this.failures = 0;\n\n    if (this.state === \"HALF_OPEN\") {\n      this.successes++;\n      if (this.successes >= this.options.volumeThreshold) {\n        this.state = \"CLOSED\";\n        this.successes = 0;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  onFailure() {\n    this.failures++;\n\n    if (this.state === \"HALF_OPEN\") {\n      this.state = \"OPEN\";\n      this.nextAttempt = Date.now() + this.options.resetTimeout;\n    } else if (this.failures >= this.options.volumeThreshold) {\n      this.state = \"OPEN\";\n      this.nextAttempt = Date.now() + this.options.resetTimeout;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 8. Error Dashboard\n\nCreate comprehensive error dashboard:\n\n**Dashboard Component**\n\n```typescript\n// error-dashboard.tsx\nimport React from ''react'';\nimport { LineChart, BarChart, PieChart } from ''recharts'';\n\nconst ErrorDashboard: React.FC = () => {\n    const [metrics, setMetrics] = useState<DashboardMetrics>();\n    const [timeRange, setTimeRange] = useState(''1h'');\n\n    useEffect(() => {\n        const fetchMetrics = async () => {\n            const data = await getErrorMetrics(timeRange);\n            setMetrics(data);\n        };\n\n        fetchMetrics();\n        const interval = setInterval(fetchMetrics, 30000); // Update every 30s\n\n        return () => clearInterval(interval);\n    }, [timeRange]);\n\n    if (!metrics) return <Loading />;\n\n    return (\n        <div className=\"error-dashboard\">\n            <Header>\n                <h1>Error Tracking Dashboard</h1>\n                <TimeRangeSelector\n                    value={timeRange}\n                    onChange={setTimeRange}\n                    options={[''1h'', ''6h'', ''24h'', ''7d'', ''30d'']}\n                />\n            </Header>\n\n            <MetricCards>\n                <MetricCard\n                    title=\"Error Rate\"\n                    value={`${(metrics.errorRate * 100).toFixed(2)}%`}\n                    trend={metrics.errorRateTrend}\n                    status={metrics.errorRate > 0.05 ? ''critical'' : ''ok''}\n                />\n                <MetricCard\n                    title=\"Total Errors\"\n                    value={metrics.totalErrors.toLocaleString()}\n                    trend={metrics.errorsTrend}\n                />\n                <MetricCard\n                    title=\"Affected Users\"\n                    value={metrics.affectedUsers.toLocaleString()}\n                    trend={metrics.usersTrend}\n                />\n                <MetricCard\n                    title=\"MTTR\"\n                    value={formatDuration(metrics.mttr)}\n                    trend={metrics.mttrTrend}\n                />\n            </MetricCards>\n\n            <ChartGrid>\n                <ChartCard title=\"Error Trend\">\n                    <LineChart data={metrics.errorTrend}>\n                        <Line\n                            type=\"monotone\"\n                            dataKey=\"errors\"\n                            stroke=\"#ff6b6b\"\n                            strokeWidth={2}\n                        />\n                        <Line\n                            type=\"monotone\"\n                            dataKey=\"warnings\"\n                            stroke=\"#ffd93d\"\n                            strokeWidth={2}\n                        />\n                    </LineChart>\n                </ChartCard>\n\n                <ChartCard title=\"Error Distribution\">\n                    <PieChart data={metrics.errorDistribution}>\n                        <Pie\n                            dataKey=\"count\"\n                            nameKey=\"type\"\n                            cx=\"50%\"\n                            cy=\"50%\"\n                            outerRadius={80}\n                        />\n                    </PieChart>\n                </ChartCard>\n\n                <ChartCard title=\"Top Errors\">\n                    <BarChart data={metrics.topErrors}>\n                        <Bar dataKey=\"count\" fill=\"#ff6b6b\" />\n                    </BarChart>\n                </ChartCard>\n\n                <ChartCard title=\"Error Heatmap\">\n                    <ErrorHeatmap data={metrics.errorHeatmap} />\n                </ChartCard>\n            </ChartGrid>\n\n            <ErrorList>\n                <h2>Recent Errors</h2>\n                <ErrorTable\n                    errors={metrics.recentErrors}\n                    onErrorClick={handleErrorClick}\n                />\n            </ErrorList>\n\n            <AlertsSection>\n                <h2>Active Alerts</h2>\n                <AlertsList alerts={metrics.activeAlerts} />\n            </AlertsSection>\n        </div>\n    );\n};\n\n// Real-time error stream\nconst ErrorStream: React.FC = () => {\n    const [errors, setErrors] = useState<ErrorEvent[]>([]);\n\n    useEffect(() => {\n        const eventSource = new EventSource(''/api/errors/stream'');\n\n        eventSource.onmessage = (event) => {\n            const error = JSON.parse(event.data);\n            setErrors(prev => [error, ...prev].slice(0, 100));\n        };\n\n        return () => eventSource.close();\n    }, []);\n\n    return (\n        <div className=\"error-stream\">\n            <h3>Live Error Stream</h3>\n            <div className=\"stream-container\">\n                {errors.map((error, index) => (\n                    <ErrorStreamItem\n                        key={error.id}\n                        error={error}\n                        isNew={index === 0}\n                    />\n                ))}\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    );\n};\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n1. **Error Tracking Analysis**: Current error handling assessment\n2. **Integration Configuration**: Setup for error tracking services\n3. **Logging Implementation**: Structured logging setup\n4. **Alert Rules**: Intelligent alerting configuration\n5. **Error Grouping**: Deduplication and grouping logic\n6. **Recovery Strategies**: Automatic error recovery implementation\n7. **Dashboard Setup**: Real-time error monitoring dashboard\n8. **Documentation**: Implementation and troubleshooting guide\n\nFocus on providing comprehensive error visibility, intelligent alerting, and quick error resolution capabilities.\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:09:42.633Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Observability Agents needing advanced error tracking and monitoring capabilities with real-time error detection and meaningful alerts.","zh":"非常适合需要高级错误跟踪和监控能力的可观察性代理，具有实时错误检测和有意义的警报功能。","ja":"高度なエラートラッキングとモニタリング機能が必要な観測可能エージェントに最適です。リアルタイムのエラーディテクションと有意義なアラートを備えています。","ko":"고급 오류 추적 및 모니터링 기능이 필요한 관찰 가능 에이전트에 적합합니다. 실시간 오류 감지 및 유의미한 경고 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Observabilidad que necesitan seguimiento y monitoreo de errores avanzados con detección de errores en tiempo real y alertas significativas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Observabilité nécessitant un suivi et une surveillance d''erreurs avancés avec une détection d''erreurs en temps réel et des alertes significatives.","de":"Perfekt für Observability-Agents, die erweiterte Fehlernachverfolgung und -überwachung mit Echtzeitfehlererkennung und sinnvollen Warnungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Observabilidade que necessitam de rastreamento de erros avançado e capacidades de monitoramento com detecção de erros em tempo real e alertas significativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов наблюдения, которым требуются продвинутые функции отслеживания ошибок и мониторинга с возможностью обнаружения ошибок в режиме реального времени и осмысленных оповещений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل المراقبة التي تحتاج إلى تتبع ошибات متقدم وقدرات مراقبة مع اكتشاف الأخطاء في الوقت الفعلي والتنبيهات المهمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement comprehensive error monitoring solutions using structured logging, error grouping, and performance monitoring, ensuring seamless integration with production environments via protocols like HTTP and WebSocket.","zh":"赋予代理实现全面的错误监控解决方案的能力，使用结构化日志记录、错误分组和性能监控，通过HTTP和WebSocket等协议确保与生产环境的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに、構造化ログ記録、エラーグループ化、パフォーマンスモニタリングを使用して包括的なエラーモニタリングソリューションを実装する能力を付与し、HTTPやWebSocketなどのプロトコルを介して生産環境とのシームレスな統合を確保します。","ko":"에이전트에게 구조화된 로그 기록, 오류 그룹화, 성능 모니터링을 사용하여 포괄적인 오류 모니터링 솔루션을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, HTTP 및 WebSocket과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 생산 환경との 無縫한 통합을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar soluciones de monitoreo de errores integrales utilizando registro estructurado, agrupación de errores y monitoreo de rendimiento, garantizando una integración sin problemas con entornos de producción a través de protocolos como HTTP y WebSocket.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des solutions de surveillance d''erreurs complètes en utilisant un journal structuré, un regroupement d''erreurs et une surveillance des performances, garantissant une intégration sans problème avec les environnements de production via des protocoles tels que HTTP et WebSocket.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Fehlerüberwachungslösungen mithilfe von strukturiertem Protokollieren, Fehlerngruppierung und Leistungsüberwachung zu implementieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit Produktionsumgebungen über Protokolle wie HTTP und WebSocket gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar soluções de monitoramento de erros abrangentes usando registro estruturado, agrupamento de erros e monitoramento de desempenho, garantindo integração perfeita com ambientes de produção por meio de protocolos como HTTP e WebSocket.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать комплексные решения для мониторинга ошибок с использованием структурированного логирования, группировки ошибок и мониторинга производительности, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с производственными средами через протоколы типа HTTP и WebSocket.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تنفيذ حلول شاملة لمراقبة الأخطاء باستخدام تسجيل منظم ومجموعة أخطاء ومراقبة الأداء، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع بيئات الإنتاج من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وWebSocket."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing real-time error detection for production issues","Configuring alerts for error tracking systems","Integrating error monitoring with performance metrics for data-driven insights"],"zh":["为生产问题实现实时错误检测","为错误跟踪系统配置警报","将错误监控与性能指标集成以获得数据驱动的洞察"],"ja":["生産問題のためのリアルタイムエラーディテクションの実装","エラートラッキングシステムのためのアラートの構成","エラーモニタリングとパフォーマンスメトリクスの統合によるデータドリブンの洞察の取得"],"ko":["생산 문제를 위한 실시간 오류 감지 구현","오류 추적 시스템을 위한 경고 구성","오류 모니터링과 성능 메트릭의 통합을 통한 데이터 驅動형 통찰력 획득"],"es":["Implementar la detección de errores en tiempo real para problemas de producción","Configurar alertas para sistemas de seguimiento de errores","Integrar la supervisión de errores con métricas de rendimiento para obtener información basada en datos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une détection d''erreurs en temps réel pour les problèmes de production","Configurer des alertes pour les systèmes de suivi d''erreurs","Intégrer la surveillance des erreurs avec des métriques de performances pour obtenir des informations basées sur les données"],"de":["Implementierung der Echtzeitfehlererkennung für Produktionsprobleme","Konfigurieren von Warnungen für Fehlernachverfolgungssysteme","Integration der Fehlerüberwachung mit Leistungsmetriken für datengetriebene Erkenntnisse"],"pt":["Implementação da detecção de erros em tempo real para problemas de produção","Configuração de alertas para sistemas de rastreamento de erros","Integração da monitoração de erros com métricas de desempenho para obtenção de informações baseadas em dados"],"ru":["Реализация обнаружения ошибок в режиме реального времени для производственных проблем","Настройка оповещений для систем отслеживания ошибок","Интеграция мониторинга ошибок с метриками производительности для получения данных, основанных на информации"],"ar":["تنفيذ اكتشاف الأخطاء في الوقت الفعلي لمشاكل الإنتاج","تكوين التنبيهات لأنظمة تتبع الأخطاء","دمج مراقبة الأخطاء مع مقاييس الأداء للحصول على معلومات مدعومة بالبيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to system logs and performance data","Dependent on specific error tracking system implementations"],"zh":["需要访问系统日志和性能数据","依赖于特定的错误跟踪系统实现"],"ja":["システムログとパフォーマンスデータへのアクセスが必要","特定のエラートラッキングシステムの実装に依存する"],"ko":["시스템 로그 및 성능 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요","특정 오류 추적 시스템 구현에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a registros del sistema y datos de rendimiento","Depende de implementaciones específicas de sistemas de seguimiento de errores"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux journaux du système et aux données de performances","Dépend de mises en œuvre spécifiques de systèmes de suivi d''erreurs"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Systemprotokolle und Leistungsdaten","Hängt von spezifischen Implementierungen von Fehlernachverfolgungssystemen ab"],"pt":["Exige acesso a logs do sistema e dados de desempenho","Depende de implementações específicas de sistemas de rastreamento de erros"],"ru":["Требует доступа к системным журналам и данным о производительности","Зависит от конкретных реализаций систем отслеживания ошибок"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سجلات النظام وبيانات الأداء","يعتمد على تنفيذ أنظمة تتبع الأخطاء المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
