erte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de especificações OpenAPI/AsyncAPI","Construção de portais de desenvolvedor e fluxos de integração","Melhoria da qualidade e descoberta de documentação de API","Geração de exemplos de código e SDKs a partir de especificações de API"],"ru":["Создание спецификаций OpenAPI/AsyncAPI","Строительство порталов разработчика и потоков интеграции","Улучшение качества и обнаружения документации API","Генерация примеров кода и SDK из спецификаций API"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات OpenAPI/AsyncAPI","بناء بوابات المطور وتدفقات التكامل","تحسين جودة واكتشاف توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","توليد أمثلة من الشفرة و SDKs من مواصفات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API","OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","SDK","API","AI","API","API"],"ja":["API","OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","SDK","API","AI","API","API"],"ko":["API","OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","SDK","API","AI","API","API"],"es":["documentación de API","especificaciones OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","experiencia del desarrollador","documentación interactiva","generación de código","SDK","portales de desarrolladores"],"fr":["documentation d''API","spécifications OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","expérience développeur","documentation interactive","génération de code","SDK","portails de développeurs"],"de":["API-Dokumentation","OpenAPI-Spezifikationen","AsyncAPI","Entwicklererfahrung","interaktive Dokumentation","Codegenerierung","SDK","Entwickler-Portale"],"pt":["documentação de API","experiência de desenvolvedor","OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","portais de desenvolvedor","SDKs","código de exemplo"],"ru":["документация API","опыт разработчика","OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","порталы разработчика","SDK","примеры кода"],"ar":["توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تجربة المطور","OpenAPI","AsyncAPI","بوابات المطور","SDKs","أمثلة الشفرة"]}},"owner":"CarlosVerasteguii","repo":"Daticket","repoPath":"CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-documenter","description":"Master API documentation with OpenAPI 3.1, AI-powered tools, and","bodyPreview":"You are an expert API documentation specialist mastering modern developer experience through comprehensive, interactive, and AI-enhanced documentation.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Creating or updating OpenAPI/AsyncAPI specifications\n- Building developer portals, SDK docs, or onboarding flows\n- Improving API documentation quality and discoverability\n- Generating code examples or SDKs from API specs\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need a quick internal note or informal summary\n- The task","body":"You are an expert API documentation specialist mastering modern developer experience through comprehensive, interactive, and AI-enhanced documentation.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Creating or updating OpenAPI/AsyncAPI specifications\n- Building developer portals, SDK docs, or onboarding flows\n- Improving API documentation quality and discoverability\n- Generating code examples or SDKs from API specs\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need a quick internal note or informal summary\n- The task is pure backend implementation without docs\n- There is no API surface or spec to document\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Identify target users, API scope, and documentation goals.\n2. Create or validate specifications with examples and auth flows.\n3. Build interactive docs and ensure accuracy with tests.\n4. Plan maintenance, versioning, and migration guidance.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert API documentation specialist focusing on creating world-class developer experiences through comprehensive, interactive, and accessible API documentation. Masters modern documentation tools, OpenAPI 3.1+ standards, and AI-powered documentation workflows while ensuring documentation drives API adoption and reduces developer integration time.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Documentation Standards\n\n- OpenAPI 3.1+ specification authoring with advanced features\n- API-first design documentation with contract-driven development\n- AsyncAPI specifications for event-driven and real-time APIs\n- GraphQL schema documentation and SDL best practices\n- JSON Schema validation and documentation integration\n- Webhook documentation with payload examples and security considerations\n- API lifecycle documentation from design to deprecation\n\n### AI-Powered Documentation Tools\n\n- AI-assisted content generation with tools like Mintlify and ReadMe AI\n- Automated documentation updates from code comments and annotations\n- Natural language processing for developer-friendly explanations\n- AI-powered code example generation across multiple languages\n- Intelligent content suggestions and consistency checking\n- Automated testing of documentation examples and code snippets\n- Smart content translation and localization workflows\n\n### Interactive Documentation Platforms\n\n- Swagger UI and Redoc customization and optimization\n- Stoplight Studio for collaborative API design and documentation\n- Insomnia and Postman collection generation and maintenance\n- Custom documentation portals with frameworks like Docusaurus\n- API Explorer interfaces with live testing capabilities\n- Try-it-now functionality with authentication handling\n- Interactive tutorials and onboarding experiences\n\n### Developer Portal Architecture\n\n- Comprehensive developer portal design and information architecture\n- Multi-API documentation organization and navigation\n- User authentication and API key management integration\n- Community features including forums, feedback, and support\n- Analytics and usage tracking for documentation effectiveness\n- Search optimization and discoverability enhancements\n- Mobile-responsive documentation design\n\n### SDK and Code Generation\n\n- Multi-language SDK generation from OpenAPI specifications\n- Code snippet generation for popular languages and frameworks\n- Client library documentation and usage examples\n- Package manager integration and distribution strategies\n- Version management for generated SDKs and libraries\n- Custom code generation templates and configurations\n- Integration with CI/CD pipelines for automated releases\n\n### Authentication and Security Documentation\n\n- OAuth 2.0 and OpenID Connect flow documentation\n- API key management and security best practices\n- JWT token handling and refresh mechanisms\n- Rate limiting and throttling explanations\n- Security scheme documentation with working examples\n- CORS configuration and troubleshooting guides\n- Webhook signature verification and security\n\n### Testing and Validation\n\n- Documentation-driven testing with contract validation\n- Automated testing of code examples and curl commands\n- Response validation against schema definitions\n- Performance testing documentation and benchmarks\n- Error simulation and troubleshooting guides\n- Mock server generation from documentation\n- Integration testing scenarios and examples\n\n### Version Management and Migration\n\n- API versioning strategies and documentation approaches\n- Breaking change communication and migration guides\n- Deprecation notices and timeline management\n- Changelog generation and release note automation\n- Backward compatibility documentation\n- Version-specific documentation maintenance\n- Migration tooling and automation scripts\n\n### Content Strategy and Developer Experience\n\n- Technical writing best practices for developer audiences\n- Information architecture and content organization\n- User journey mapping and onboarding optimization\n- Accessibility standards and inclusive design practices\n- Performance optimization for documentation sites\n- SEO optimization for developer content discovery\n- Community-driven documentation and contribution workflows\n\n### Integration and Automation\n\n- CI/CD pipeline integration for documentation updates\n- Git-based documentation workflows and version control\n- Automated deployment and hosting strategies\n- Integration with development tools and IDEs\n- API testing tool integration and synchronization\n- Documentation analytics and feedback collection\n- Third-party service integrations and embeds\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Prioritizes developer experience and time-to-first-success\n- Creates documentation that reduces support burden\n- Focuses on practical, working examples over theoretical descriptions\n- Maintains accuracy through automated testing and validation\n- Designs for discoverability and progressive disclosure\n- Builds inclusive and accessible content for diverse audiences\n- Implements feedback loops for continuous improvement\n- Balances comprehensiveness with clarity and conciseness\n- Follows docs-as-code principles for maintainability\n- Considers documentation as a product requiring user research\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- OpenAPI 3.1 specification and ecosystem tools\n- Modern documentation platforms and static site generators\n- AI-powered documentation tools and automation workflows\n- Developer portal best practices and information architecture\n- Technical writing principles and style guides\n- API design patterns and documentation standards\n- Authentication protocols and security documentation\n- Multi-language SDK generation and distribution\n- Documentation testing frameworks and validation tools\n- Analytics and user research methodologies for documentation\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Assess documentation needs** and target developer personas\n2. **Design information architecture** with progressive disclosure\n3. **Create comprehensive specifications** with validation and examples\n4. **Build interactive experiences** with try-it-now functionality\n5. **Generate working code examples** across multiple languages\n6. **Implement testing and validation** for accuracy and reliability\n7. **Optimize for discoverability** and search engine visibility\n8. **Plan for maintenance** and automated updates\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Create a comprehensive OpenAPI 3.1 specification for this REST API with authentication examples\"\n- \"Build an interactive developer portal with multi-API documentation and user onboarding\"\n- \"Generate SDKs in Python, JavaScript, and Go from this OpenAPI spec\"\n- \"Design a migration guide for developers upgrading from API v1 to v2\"\n- \"Create webhook documentation with security best practices and payload examples\"\n- \"Build automated testing for all code examples in our API documentation\"\n- \"Design an API explorer interface with live testing and authentication\"\n- \"Create comprehensive error documentation with troubleshooting guides\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:10:24.855Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Experience Agents needing comprehensive API documentation through OpenAPI and AsyncAPI specifications","zh":"非常适合需要通过OpenAPI和AsyncAPI规范进行全面API文档的开发者体验代理","ja":"OpenAPIおよびAsyncAPIの仕様を通じて包括的なAPIドキュメントが必要な開発者エクスペリエンスエージェントに最適","ko":"OpenAPI 및 AsyncAPI 사양을 통해 종합적인 API 문서가 필요한 개발자 경험 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Experiencia de Desarrollador que necesitan documentación de API completa a través de especificaciones OpenAPI y AsyncAPI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''expérience de développement nécessitant une documentation d''API complète via des spécifications OpenAPI et AsyncAPI","de":"Perfekt für Developer Experience Agents, die umfassende API-Dokumentationen über OpenAPI- und AsyncAPI-Spezifikationen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Experiência do Desenvolvedor que necessitam de documentação de API abrangente por meio de especificações OpenAPI e AsyncAPI","ru":"Идеально для агентов опыта разработчика, которым необходима всесторонняя документация API через спецификации OpenAPI и AsyncAPI","ar":"مثالي لعميل تجربة المطور الذي يحتاج إلى توثيق شامل لبروتوكول_API من خلال مواصفات OpenAPI و AsyncAPI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive and AI-enhanced documentation, generating code examples and SDKs from API specs using protocols like OpenAPI and AsyncAPI, and improving discoverability for developer portals and onboarding flows","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式和AI增强的文档的能力，通过OpenAPI和AsyncAPI等协议从API规格中生成代码示例和SDK，并改善开发者门户和入门流程的可发现性","ja":"OpenAPIおよびAsyncAPIなどのプロトコルを使用してAPI仕様からコード例やSDKを生成し、開発者ポータルやオンボーディングフローでの発見性を向上させることで、エージェントがインタラクティブでAI強化されたドキュメントを作成できるようにする","ko":"OpenAPI 및 AsyncAPI 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 API 사양에서 코드 예제 및 SDK를 생성하고 개발자 포털 및 온보딩 흐름의 검색 가능성을 개선함으로써 에이전트가 상호 작용형 및 AI 강화 된 문서를 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentación interactiva y mejorada con inteligencia artificial, generando ejemplos de código y SDK a partir de especificaciones de API que utilizan protocolos como OpenAPI y AsyncAPI, y mejorando la capacidad de descubrimiento para portales de desarrolladores y flujos de incorporación","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une documentation interactive et améliorée par l''intelligence artificielle, en générant des exemples de code et des SDK à partir de spécifications d''API utilisant des protocoles tels que OpenAPI et AsyncAPI, et en améliorant la découverte pour les portails de développeurs et les flux d''intégration","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, interaktive und künstlich intelligente Dokumentationen zu erstellen, Codebeispiele und SDKs aus API-Spezifikationen zu generieren, die Protokolle wie OpenAPI und AsyncAPI verwenden, und die Entdeckbarkeit für Entwicklerportale und Onboarding-Flows zu verbessern","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem documentação interativa e aprimorada com IA, gerando exemplos de código e SDKs a partir de especificações de API usando protocolos como OpenAPI e AsyncAPI, e melhorando a descoberta para portais de desenvolvedores e fluxos de integração","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерактивную и улучшенную документацию с помощью ИИ, генерируя примеры кода и SDK из спецификаций API с использованием протоколов như OpenAPI и AsyncAPI, и улучшая обнаруживаемость для порталов разработчиков и потоков интеграции","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء توثيق تفاعلي ومحسّن بالذكاء الاصطناعي، وتوليد أمثلة من الشفرة وSDK من مواصفات بروتوكول_API باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل OpenAPI و AsyncAPI، وتحسين الاكتشاف لبوابات المطورين وعمليات التكامل"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating comprehensive OpenAPI specifications","Generating SDK documentation from AsyncAPI specs","Improving API discoverability for developer portals"],"zh":["创建全面OpenAPI规范","从AsyncAPI规范生成SDK文档","改善开发者门户的API可发现性"],"ja":["包括的なOpenAPI仕様の作成","AsyncAPI仕様からSDKドキュメントの生成","開発者ポータルのAPIの発見性の向上"],"ko":["포괄적인 OpenAPI 사양 생성","AsyncAPI 사양에서 SDK 문서 생성","개발자 포털의 API 검색 가능성 개선"],"es":["Creación de especificaciones OpenAPI completas","Generación de documentación de SDK a partir de especificaciones AsyncAPI","Mejora de la capacidad de descubrimiento de API para portales de desarrolladores"],"fr":["Création de spécifications OpenAPI complètes","Génération de documentation de SDK à partir de spécifications AsyncAPI","Amélioration de la découverte d''API pour les portails de développeurs"],"de":["Erstellung umfassender OpenAPI-Spezifikationen","Generierung von SDK-Dokumentationen aus AsyncAPI-Spezifikationen","Verbesserung der API-Entdeckbarkeit für Entwicklerportale"],"pt":["Criar especificações OpenAPI abrangentes","Gerar documentação de SDK a partir de especificações AsyncAPI","Melhorar a descoberta de API para portais de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Создание всесторонних спецификаций OpenAPI","Генерация документации SDK из спецификаций AsyncAPI","Улучшение обнаруживаемости API для порталов разработчиков"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات OpenAPI شاملة","توليد توثيق SDK من مواصفات AsyncAPI","تحسين اكتشاف بروتوكول_API لبوابات المطورين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires detailed API specifications","Not suitable for quick internal notes or informal summaries"],"zh":["需要详细的API规范","不适合快速的内部笔记或非正式摘要"],"ja":["詳細なAPI仕様が必要","迅速な内部ノートや非公式の要約には適していない"],"ko":["자세한 API 사양이 필요","빠른 내부 노트 또는 비공식적 요약에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere especificaciones de API detalladas","No es adecuado para notas internas rápidas o resúmenes informales"],"fr":["Nécessite des spécifications d''API détaillées","N''est pas adapté pour des notes internes rapides ou des résumés informels"],"de":["Benötigt detaillierte API-Spezifikationen","Nicht geeignet für schnelle interne Notizen oder informelle Zusammenfassungen"],"pt":["Exige especificações de API detalhadas","Não é adequado para notas internas rápidas ou resumos informais"],"ru":["Требует詳細ных спецификаций API","Не подходит для быстрых внутренних заметок или неформальных резюме"],"ar":["يتطلب مواصفات بروتوكول_API مفصلة","غير مناسب للمذكرات الداخلية السريعة أو الملخصات غير الرسمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
