r de style de réponse permet aux développeurs de configurer le style de réponse préféré de l''utilisateur lors de la première interaction, améliora...","de":"Der Antwortstil-Selektor ermöglicht es Entwicklern, den bevorzugten Antwortstil des Benutzers bei der ersten Interaktion zu konfigurieren, wodurch die Benutz...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持技术和人性化的响应风格","允许用户在首次交互时选择响应风格","记录用户的偏好以便后续交互","支持用户后续更改响应风格"],"ja":["技術的な応答スタイルと人間的な応答スタイルをサポート","ユーザーが初回のやり取り時に応答スタイルを選択できる","ユーザーの好みを記録して後のやり取りに利用","ユーザーが後のやり取りで応答スタイルを変更できる"],"ko":["기술적 및 인간적인 응답 스타일 지원","사용자가 초기 상호 작용 시 응답 스타일을 선택할 수 있도록 함","사용자의 선호도를 기록하여 이후 상호 작용에 활용","사용자가 이후 상호 작용에서 응답 스타일을 변경할 수 있도록 함"],"es":["Permite a los usuarios elegir su estilo de respuesta preferido","Registra la elección del usuario en un archivo de preferencias","Mantiene las respuestas cortas y alineadas con el estilo elegido","Permite a los usuarios cambiar el estilo más tarde","Mejora la experiencia del usuario con un lenguaje plano y minimalista"],"fr":["Permet aux utilisateurs de choisir leur style de réponse préféré","Enregistre le choix de l''utilisateur dans un fichier de préférences","Maintient les réponses courtes et alignées sur le style choisi","Permet aux utilisateurs de changer le style plus tard","Améliore l''expérience utilisateur avec un langage plat et minimaliste"],"de":["Ermöglicht es Benutzern, ihren bevorzugten Antwortstil auszuwählen","Speichert die Auswahl des Benutzers in einer Preferences-Datei","Hält die Antworten kurz und ausgerichtet auf den gewählten Stil","Ermöglicht es Benutzern, den Stil später zu ändern","Verbessert die Benutzererfahrung mit einer einfachen und minimalistischen Sprache"]},"keywords":{"zh":["响应样式选择器","用户体验","技术响应","人性化响应","个性化","交互设计"],"ja":["レスポンススタイルセレクター","ユーザー体験","技術的な応答","人間的な応答","カスタマイズ","インタラクションデザイン"],"ko":["응답 스타일 선택기","사용자 경험","기술적 응답","인간적인 응답","개인화","상호 작용 디자인"],"es":["selector de estilo de respuesta","desarrollo de software","experiencia del usuario","lenguaje plano","minimalismo","preferencias del usuario","interacción con el usuario","desarrollo de aplicaciones","tecnologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["sélecteur de style de réponse","développement de logiciels","expérience utilisateur","langage plat","minimalisme","préférences de l''utilisateur","interaction avec l''utilisateur","développement d''applications","technologies de développement"],"de":["Antwortstil-Selektor","Software-Entwicklung","Benutzererfahrung","einfache Sprache","Minimalismus","Benutzervorlieben","Benutzerinteraktion","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Entwicklungs-Technologien"]}},"owner":"CheekyCodexConjurer","repo":"aera-chart-engine","repoPath":"CheekyCodexConjurer/aera-chart-engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"response_style_selector","description":"Ask the user to pick a response style and persist the preference.","bodyPreview":"## Purpose\nSet the user''s preferred response style on first interaction.\n\n## Steps\n1. Ask the user to choose: technical or humanized.\n2. Record the choice in `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`.\n3. Keep responses short and aligned to the chosen style.\n4. Allow the user to change the style later.\n\n## Humanized Mode\n- Short, plain language with minimal bullets.\n- Minimal code details unless requested.","body":"## Purpose\nSet the user''s preferred response style on first interaction.\n\n## Steps\n1. Ask the user to choose: technical or humanized.\n2. Record the choice in `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`.\n3. Keep responses short and aligned to the chosen style.\n4. Allow the user to change the style later.\n\n## Humanized Mode\n- Short, plain language with minimal bullets.\n- Minimal code details unless requested.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:10:45.294Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents requiring adaptive response formatting, such as Claude Code or AutoGPT, to enhance user experience.","zh":"适用于需要自适应响应格式的对话式代理，例如 Claude Code 或 AutoGPT，以增强用户体验。","ja":"会話エージェントが適応的なレスポンス形式を必要とする場合、たとえば Claude Code または AutoGPT で、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるために適しています。","ko":"대화형 에이전트가 적응형 응답 형식을 필요로 하는 경우, 예를 들어 Claude Code 또는 AutoGPT와 같은 경우, 사용자 경험을 향상시키기 위해 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de conversación que requieren un formato de respuesta adaptable, como Claude Code o AutoGPT, para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conversation nécessitant un format de réponse adaptable, tels que Claude Code ou AutoGPT, pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Ideal für Conversational Agents, die ein adaptives Antwortformat benötigen, wie z.B. Claude Code oder AutoGPT, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação que requerem formatação de resposta adaptativa, como Claude Code ou AutoGPT, para melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Идеально для разговорных агентов, требующих адаптивной форматировки ответов, таких как Claude Code или AutoGPT, для улучшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحادثة الذي يتطلب تنسيق استجابة قابل للتكيف، مثل Claude Code أو AutoGPT، لتحسين تجربة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to tailor responses according to user preferences, utilizing markdown files like `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` for personalized interaction, and supporting both technical and humanized response styles.","zh":"赋予代理人根据用户偏好定制响应的能力，利用 markdown 文件（如 `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`）进行个性化交互，并支持技术和人性化响应风格。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーの好みに応じてレスポンスをカスタマイズする機能を提供し、Markdown ファイル（`.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` など）を使用してパーソナライズされた相互作用を実現し、技術的および人間化されたレスポンススタイルの両方をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자의 선호도에 따라 응답을 맞춤설정할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 마크다운 파일(`.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` 등)을 사용하여 개인화된 상호작용을 구현하며, 기술적 및 인간화된 응답 스타일을 모두 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes personalizar las respuestas según las preferencias del usuario, utilizando archivos markdown como `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` para una interacción personalizada, y soportando tanto estilos de respuesta técnicos como humanizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de personnaliser les réponses en fonction des préférences de l''utilisateur, en utilisant des fichiers markdown tels que `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` pour une interaction personnalisée, et en prenant en charge à la fois les styles de réponse techniques et humanisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Antworten an die Benutzerpräferenzen anzupassen, indem sie Markdown-Dateien wie `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` für eine personalisierte Interaktion verwenden und sowohl technische als auch humanisierte Antwortstile unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a personalizar respostas de acordo com as preferências do usuário, utilizando arquivos markdown como `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` para interação personalizada e suportando tanto estilos de resposta técnica quanto humanizada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью адаптировать ответы в соответствии с предпочтениями пользователя, используя файлы markdown, такие как `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`, для персонализированного взаимодействия и поддержки как технических, так и гуманизированных стилей ответов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتكييف الاستجابات وفقًا لتفضيلات المستخدم، باستخدام ملفات markdown مثل `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` للتفاعل المخصص ودعم أنماط الاستجابة الفنية والبشرية على حد سواء."},"useCases":{"en":["Customizing response formats for technical users","Simplifying responses for non-technical users","Updating user preferences dynamically"],"zh":["针对技术用户自定义响应格式","简化非技术用户的响应","动态更新用户偏好"],"ja":["技術ユーザー向けのレスポンス形式をカスタマイズ","非技術ユーザー向けのレスポンスを簡略化","ユーザー好みを動的に更新"],"ko":["기술 사용자를 위한 응답 형식 맞춤설정","비기술 사용자를 위한 응답 단순화","사용자 선호도 동적 업데이트"],"es":["Personalizar formatos de respuesta para usuarios técnicos","Simplificar respuestas para usuarios no técnicos","Actualizar preferencias de usuario de forma dinámica"],"fr":["Personnaliser les formats de réponse pour les utilisateurs techniques","Simplifier les réponses pour les utilisateurs non techniques","Mettre à jour les préférences de l''utilisateur de manière dynamique"],"de":["Anpassen von Antwortformaten für technische Benutzer","Vereinfachen von Antworten für nicht-technische Benutzer","Dynamisches Aktualisieren von Benutzerpräferenzen"],"pt":["Personalizar formatos de resposta para usuários técnicos","Simplificar respostas para usuários não técnicos","Atualizar preferências de usuário dinamicamente"],"ru":["Настройка форматов ответов для технических пользователей","Упрощение ответов для не технических пользователей","Динамическое обновление предпочтений пользователя"],"ar":["تخصيص تنسيقات الاستجابة للمستخدمين التقنيين","بسط الاستجابات للمستخدمين غير التقنيين","تحديث تفضيلات المستخدم بشكل ديناميكي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access to update `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`","Limited to two predefined response styles: technical or humanized"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限来更新 `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`","仅限两个预定义的响应风格：技术或人性化"],"ja":["`.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` を更新するためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","2 つの事前定義されたレスポンススタイル（技術的または人間化）に限定"],"ko":["`.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`를 업데이트하기 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","2개의 사전 정의된 응답 스타일(기술적 또는 인간화)로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para actualizar `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`","Limitado a dos estilos de respuesta predefinidos: técnico o humanizado"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour mettre à jour `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`","Limité à deux styles de réponse prédéfinis : technique ou humanisé"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem, um `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md` zu aktualisieren","Begrenzt auf zwei vordefinierte Antwortstile: technisch oder humanisiert"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para atualizar `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`","Limitado a dois estilos de resposta predefinidos: técnico ou humanizado"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для обновления `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`","Ограничен двумя предопределенными стилями ответов: техническим или гуманизированным"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لتحديث `.agent-docs/memory/USER_PREFERENCES.md`","محدود بنمطين من الاستجابة محددين مسبقًا: تقني أو بشري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('AndyMarigoldLabs/continuous-funding/gsap-animations', 'community', 'AndyMarigoldLabs', 'continuous-funding', 'AndyMarigoldLabs/continuous-funding', 'gsap-animations', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:10:54.308Z', NULL, '{"id":"AndyMarigoldLabs/continuous-funding/gsap-animations","name":"gsap-animations","description":{"zh":"GSAP, 60fps, ","ja":"GSAP, 60fps, ","ko":"GSAP, 60fps, ","es":"Guía completa para implementar animaciones profesionales y accesibles con GSAP. Aprende a optimizar el rendimiento y la accesibilidad.","fr":"Guide complet pour implémenter des animations professionnelles et accessibles avec GSAP. Apprenez à optimiser les performances et l''accessibilité.","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden zur Implementierung professioneller und zugänglicher Animationen mit GSAP. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Leistung und Zugänglichkeit optimieren.","pt":"Guia abrangente para implementar animações profissionais e acessíveis com GSAP. Aprenda a otimizar o desempenho e a acessibilidade","ru":"Полное руководство по реализации профессиональных и доступных анимаций с помощью GSAP. Узнайте, как оптимизировать производительность и доступность","ar":"دليل شامل لتنفيذ Animations محترفة ومتوافقة مع GSAP. تعلم كيفية تحسين الأداء والتوافق","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GSAP ","ja":"GSAP","ko":"GSAP ","es":"GSAP Animaciones: Mejores Prácticas para Desarrolladores","fr":"GSAP Animations: Bonnes Pratiques pour les Développeurs","de":"GSAP Animationen: Best Practices für Entwickler","pt":"GSAP Animações: Melhores Práticas para Desenvolvedores","ru":"GSAP Анимации: Лучшие практики для разработчиков","ar":"GSAP Animations: أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","en":"gsap-animations"},"description":{"zh":"GSAP, 60fps, ","ja":"GSAP, 60fps, ","ko":"GSAP, 60fps, ","es":"Guía completa para implementar animaciones profesionales y accesibles con GSAP. Aprende a optimizar el rendimiento y la accesibilidad.","fr":"Guide complet pour implémenter des animations professionnelles et accessibles avec GSAP. Apprenez à optimiser les performances et l''accessibilité.","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden zur Implementierung professioneller und zugänglicher Animationen mit GSAP. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Leistung und Zugänglichkeit optimieren.","pt":"Guia abrangente para implementar animações profissionais e acessíveis com GSAP. Aprenda a otimizar o desempenho e a acessibilidade","ru":"Полное руководство по реализации профессиональных и доступных анимаций с помощью GSAP. Узнайте, как оптимизировать производительность и доступность","ar":"دليل شامل لتنفيذ Animations محترفة ومتوافقة مع GSAP. تعلم كيفية تحسين الأداء والتوافق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["GPU","60fps","prefers-reduced-motion","will-change","transform","opacity"],"ja":["GPU","60fps","prefers-reduced-motion","will-change","transform","opacity"],"ko":["GPU","60fps","prefers-reduced-motion","will-change","transform","opacity"],"es":["Animaciones con rendimiento óptimo","Accesibilidad garantizada","Compatibilidad con dispositivos móviles","Personalización de animaciones","Integración con otros frameworks y bibliotecas"],"fr":["Animations avec un rendement optimal","Accessibilité garantie","Compatibilité avec les appareils mobiles","Personnalisation des animations","Intégration avec d''autres frameworks et bibliothèques"],"de":["Animationen mit optimaler Leistung","Garantierte Zugänglichkeit","Kompatibilität mit mobilen Geräten","Anpassung von Animationen","Integration mit anderen Frameworks und Bibliotheken"],"pt":["Otimização do desempenho com animações GPU-acceleradas","Acessibilidade garantida com respeito à preferência de movimento reduzido","Compatibilidade com dispositivos móveis e desktop","Animações personalizáveis e flexíveis","Integração com bibliotecas e frameworks populares"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности с помощью анимаций, ускоренных с помощью GPU","Гарантия доступности с учетом предпочтения уменьшенного движения","Совместимость с мобильными и настольными устройствами","Настраиваемые и гибкие анимации","Интеграция с популярными библиотеками и фреймворками"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء مع Animations معززة بواسطة GPU","ضمان التوافق مع تفضيل الحركة المنخفضة","التوافق مع الأجهزة المحمولة و سطح المكتب","Animations قابلة للتعديل والمرنة","التكامل مع المكتبات والإطارات الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GSAP","Web","60fps","GPU","prefers-reduced-motion","will-change","transform","opacity","Web"],"ja":["GSAP","Web","60fps","GPU","prefers-reduced-motion","will-change","transform","opacity","Web"],"ko":["GSAP","Web","60fps","GPU","prefers-reduced-motion","will-change","transform","opacity","Web"],"es":["GSAP","animaciones web","desarrollo web","accesibilidad","rendimiento","animaciones profesionales","desarrollo de aplicaciones","diseño de interfaces"],"fr":["GSAP","animations web","développement web","accessibilité","rendement","animations professionnelles","développement d''applications","conception d''interfaces"],"de":["GSAP","Web-Animationen","Web-Entwicklung","Zugänglichkeit","Leistung","professionelle Animationen","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen-Design"],"pt":["GSAP","animações web","desempenho","acessibilidade","preferência de movimento reduzido","GPU-acelerado","transform","opacity"],"ru":["GSAP","веб-анимации","производительность","доступность","предпочтение уменьшенного движения","GPU-ускорение","transform","opacity"],"ar":["GSAP","Animations الويب","الأداء","التوافق","تفضيل الحركة المنخفضة","GPU-معزز","transform","opacity"]}},"owner":"AndyMarigoldLabs","repo":"continuous-funding","repoPath":"AndyMarigoldLabs/continuous-funding","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gsap-animations","description":"GSAP animation best practices for web design - scroll triggers, performance optimization, accessibility, responsive animations, and testing integration. Use when implementing or reviewing animations on WordPress or any web project.","bodyPreview":"# GSAP Animation Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing professional, accessible, and performant animations using GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform).\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Performance First\n- Animate `transform` and `opacity` only (GPU-accelerated)\n- Avoid animating `width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`\n- Use `will-change` sparingly\n- Target 60fps on all devices\n\n### 2. Accessibility Always\n- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n- Ensure content is visible withou","body":"# GSAP Animation Best Practices\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing professional, accessible, and performant animations using GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform).\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Performance First\n- Animate `transform` and `opacity` only (GPU-accelerated)\n- Avoid animating `width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`\n- Use `will-change` sparingly\n- Target 60fps on all devices\n\n### 2. Accessibility Always\n- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n- Ensure content is visible without JavaScript\n- Don''t hide critical content behind animations\n- Provide skip/pause controls for long animations\n\n### 3. Progressive Enhancement\n- Content must work without animations\n- Animations enhance, not replace, functionality\n- Test with animations disabled\n\n---\n\n## GSAP Setup\n\n### Installation\n\n```html\n<!-- CDN (recommended for WordPress) -->\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n<!-- Optional plugins -->\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollSmoother.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/SplitText.min.js\"></script>\n```\n\n### WordPress Enqueue\n\n```php\nfunction theme_enqueue_gsap() {\n    // GSAP Core\n    wp_enqueue_script(\n        ''gsap'',\n        ''https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js'',\n        array(),\n        ''3.12.5'',\n        true\n    );\n\n    // ScrollTrigger\n    wp_enqueue_script(\n        ''gsap-scrolltrigger'',\n        ''https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js'',\n        array(''gsap''),\n        ''3.12.5'',\n        true\n    );\n\n    // Theme animations\n    wp_enqueue_script(\n        ''theme-animations'',\n        get_theme_file_uri(''/assets/js/animations.js''),\n        array(''gsap'', ''gsap-scrolltrigger''),\n        filemtime(get_theme_file_path(''/assets/js/animations.js'')),\n        true\n    );\n}\nadd_action(''wp_enqueue_scripts'', ''theme_enqueue_gsap'');\n```\n\n---\n\n## Animation Patterns\n\n### 1. Fade In on Scroll\n\n```javascript\n// Basic fade in\ngsap.from(''.fade-in'', {\n    opacity: 0,\n    y: 50,\n    duration: 1,\n    stagger: 0.2,\n    scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: ''.fade-in'',\n        start: ''top 80%'',\n        toggleActions: ''play none none none''\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Staggered Elements\n\n```javascript\n// Cards appearing one by one\ngsap.from(''.card'', {\n    opacity: 0,\n    y: 100,\n    duration: 0.8,\n    stagger: {\n        amount: 0.6,\n        from: ''start''\n    },\n    ease: ''power2.out'',\n    scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: ''.cards-container'',\n        start: ''top 75%''\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Parallax Effect\n\n```javascript\n// Subtle parallax on images\ngsap.to(''.parallax-image'', {\n    yPercent: -20,\n    ease: ''none'',\n    scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: ''.parallax-section'',\n        start: ''top bottom'',\n        end: ''bottom top'',\n        scrub: true\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### 4. Text Reveal (Line by Line)\n\n```javascript\n// Requires SplitText plugin (Club GreenSock)\n// Or use CSS-based alternative below\n\n// CSS Alternative - wrap each line in a span\ngsap.from(''.reveal-line'', {\n    opacity: 0,\n    y: ''100%'',\n    duration: 0.8,\n    stagger: 0.1,\n    ease: ''power3.out'',\n    scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: ''.text-reveal'',\n        start: ''top 80%''\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### 5. Curtain/Mask Reveal\n\n```javascript\n// Image revealed by sliding mask\ngsap.to(''.curtain-mask'', {\n    scaleX: 0,\n    transformOrigin: ''right center'',\n    duration: 1.2,\n    ease: ''power4.inOut'',\n    scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: ''.curtain-container'',\n        start: ''top 70%''\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### 6. Hero Animation Timeline\n\n```javascript\n// Complex hero sequence\nconst heroTL = gsap.timeline({\n    defaults: { ease: ''power3.out'' }\n});\n\nheroTL\n    .from(''.hero-bg'', { scale: 1.2, duration: 1.5 })\n    .from(''.hero-title'', { opacity: 0, y: 100, duration: 1 }, ''-=1'')\n    .from(''.hero-subtitle'', { opacity: 0, y: 50, duration: 0.8 }, ''-=0.5'')\n    .from(''.hero-cta'', { opacity: 0, y: 30, duration: 0.6 }, ''-=0.3'');\n```\n\n---\n\n## Accessibility\n\n### Respect Reduced Motion\n\n```javascript\n// Check user preference\nconst prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(''(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'').matches;\n\n// Option 1: Disable all animations\nif (prefersReducedMotion) {\n    gsap.globalTimeline.timeScale(0);\n    ScrollTrigger.getAll().forEach(st => st.kill());\n}\n\n// Option 2: Simplified animations\nconst animationConfig = prefersReducedMotion\n    ? { duration: 0, stagger: 0 }\n    : { duration: 1, stagger: 0.2 };\n\ngsap.from(''.element'', {\n    opacity: 0,\n    y: prefersReducedMotion ? 0 : 50,\n    ...animationConfig\n});\n```\n\n### CSS Fallback\n\n```css\n/* Ensure content visible without JS */\n.fade-in {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n}\n\n/* Only hide if animations will run */\n.js .fade-in {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(50px);\n}\n\n/* Respect reduced motion in CSS too */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .js .fade-in {\n        opacity: 1;\n        transform: none;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Add JS Class to HTML\n\n```javascript\n// Add at start of script\ndocument.documentElement.classList.add(''js'');\n```\n\n---\n\n## Responsive Animations\n\n### Breakpoint-Aware Animations\n\n```javascript\n// Create responsive animations\nconst mm = gsap.matchMedia();\n\nmm.add(''(min-width: 1024px)'', () => {\n    // Desktop animations\n    gsap.from(''.hero-image'', {\n        x: 100,\n        opacity: 0,\n        duration: 1.2\n    });\n\n    return () => {\n        // Cleanup on breakpoint change\n    };\n});\n\nmm.add(''(max-width: 1023px)'', () => {\n    // Mobile animations (simpler)\n    gsap.from(''.hero-image'', {\n        opacity: 0,\n        duration: 0.8\n    });\n});\n```\n\n### Refresh on Resize\n\n```javascript\n// Recalculate ScrollTrigger on resize\nlet resizeTimer;\nwindow.addEventListener(''resize'', () => {\n    clearTimeout(resizeTimer);\n    resizeTimer = setTimeout(() => {\n        ScrollTrigger.refresh();\n    }, 250);\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### 1. Use Transform Properties Only\n\n```javascript\n// GOOD - GPU accelerated\ngsap.to(''.element'', {\n    x: 100,          // transform: translateX\n    y: 50,           // transform: translateY\n    rotation: 45,    // transform: rotate\n    scale: 1.2,      // transform: scale\n    opacity: 0.5\n});\n\n// BAD - Causes layout/paint\ngsap.to(''.element'', {\n    left: 100,       // Triggers layout\n    width: ''200px'',  // Triggers layout\n    marginTop: 50    // Triggers layout\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Batch Similar Animations\n\n```javascript\n// Use batch for many similar elements\nScrollTrigger.batch(''.card'', {\n    onEnter: batch => gsap.to(batch, {\n        opacity: 1,\n        y: 0,\n        stagger: 0.1\n    }),\n    start: ''top 85%''\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Kill Unused ScrollTriggers\n\n```javascript\n// Cleanup when navigating (SPA) or component unmount\nfunction cleanup() {\n    ScrollTrigger.getAll().forEach(st => st.kill());\n    gsap.killTweensOf(''*'');\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Lazy Initialize\n\n```javascript\n// Only initialize animations for visible sections\nconst observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n    entries.forEach(entry => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n            initSectionAnimations(entry.target);\n            observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n        }\n    });\n}, { rootMargin: ''100px'' });\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll(''.animated-section'').forEach(section => {\n    observer.observe(section);\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## ScrollTrigger Best Practices\n\n### 1. Proper Start/End Points\n\n```javascript\n// Avoid common mistakes\nScrollTrigger.create({\n    trigger: ''.section'',\n    start: ''top 80%'',    // When top of trigger hits 80% from top of viewport\n    end: ''bottom 20%'',   // When bottom of trigger hits 20% from top\n    markers: true,       // Debug only - remove in production!\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Pin Sections Carefully\n\n```javascript\n// Pinning can cause layout issues\nScrollTrigger.create({\n    trigger: ''.pinned-section'',\n    start: ''top top'',\n    end: ''+=100%'',\n    pin: true,\n    pinSpacing: true,    // Usually want this true\n    anticipatePin: 1     // Helps with mobile\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Handle Images Loading\n\n```javascript\n// Wait for images before calculating positions\nScrollTrigger.config({\n    ignoreMobileResize: true\n});\n\nwindow.addEventListener(''load'', () => {\n    ScrollTrigger.refresh();\n});\n\n// Or refresh after lazy images load\ndocument.querySelectorAll(''img[loading=\"lazy\"]'').forEach(img => {\n    img.addEventListener(''load'', () => ScrollTrigger.refresh());\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Testing Integration\n\n### Visual QA Compatibility\n\nFor the visual-qa skill to capture animations correctly:\n\n```javascript\n// Expose function to complete all animations instantly\nwindow.completeAllAnimations = function() {\n    gsap.globalTimeline.progress(1);\n    ScrollTrigger.getAll().forEach(st => {\n        st.scroll(st.end);\n    });\n};\n\n// Or skip animations entirely for screenshots\nif (window.location.search.includes(''skip-animations'')) {\n    gsap.globalTimeline.timeScale(100);\n}\n```\n\n### Playwright Testing\n\n```javascript\n// In Playwright test\nawait page.evaluate(() => {\n    if (window.completeAllAnimations) {\n        window.completeAllAnimations();\n    }\n});\nawait page.waitForTimeout(500);\nawait page.screenshot({ path: ''screenshot.png'', fullPage: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Animation Library\n\n### Reusable Animation Classes\n\n```javascript\n// animations.js - Reusable animation library\n\nconst Animations = {\n    // Initialize all animations\n    init() {\n        if (window.matchMedia(''(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'').matches) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        this.fadeIn();\n        this.slideIn();\n        this.parallax();\n        this.textReveal();\n    },\n\n    fadeIn() {\n        gsap.utils.toArray(''[data-animate=\"fade-in\"]'').forEach(el => {\n            gsap.from(el, {\n                opacity: 0,\n                y: 50,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: el,\n                    start: ''top 85%'',\n                    once: true\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    },\n\n    slideIn() {\n        gsap.utils.toArray(''[data-animate=\"slide-left\"]'').forEach(el => {\n            gsap.from(el, {\n                opacity: 0,\n                x: -100,\n                duration: 1,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: el,\n                    start: ''top 80%'',\n                    once: true\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        gsap.utils.toArray(''[data-animate=\"slide-right\"]'').forEach(el => {\n            gsap.from(el, {\n                opacity: 0,\n                x: 100,\n                duration: 1,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: el,\n                    start: ''top 80%'',\n                    once: true\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    },\n\n    parallax() {\n        gsap.utils.toArray(''[data-parallax]'').forEach(el => {\n            const speed = el.dataset.parallax || 0.2;\n            gsap.to(el, {\n                yPercent: -100 * speed,\n                ease: ''none'',\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: el.parentElement,\n                    start: ''top bottom'',\n                    end: ''bottom top'',\n                    scrub: true\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    },\n\n    textReveal() {\n        gsap.utils.toArray(''[data-animate=\"text-reveal\"]'').forEach(el => {\n            const lines = el.querySelectorAll(''.line'');\n            gsap.from(lines, {\n                opacity: 0,\n                y: ''100%'',\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: el,\n                    start: ''top 80%'',\n                    once: true\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    },\n\n    // Refresh after dynamic content\n    refresh() {\n        ScrollTrigger.refresh();\n    },\n\n    // Cleanup for SPA navigation\n    destroy() {\n        ScrollTrigger.getAll().forEach(st => st.kill());\n        gsap.killTweensOf(''*'');\n    }\n};\n\n// Initialize on DOM ready\ndocument.addEventListener(''DOMContentLoaded'', () => Animations.init());\n```\n\n### HTML Usage\n\n```html\n<!-- Fade in -->\n<div data-animate=\"fade-in\">Content</div>\n\n<!-- Slide from left -->\n<div data-animate=\"slide-left\">Content</div>\n\n<!-- Parallax (0.2 = 20% speed) -->\n<img data-parallax=\"0.3\" src=\"image.jpg\">\n\n<!-- Text reveal (requires line wrapping) -->\n<div data-animate=\"text-reveal\">\n    <div class=\"line\">First line</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Second line</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Debugging\n\n### Enable Markers\n\n```javascript\nScrollTrigger.defaults({\n    markers: true  // Shows start/end markers\n});\n```\n\n### Log Animation Events\n\n```javascript\ngsap.to(''.element'', {\n    x: 100,\n    onStart: () => console.log(''Animation started''),\n    onComplete: () => console.log(''Animation completed''),\n    onUpdate: self => console.log(''Progress:'', self.progress())\n});\n```\n\n### Check for Issues\n\n```javascript\n// List all ScrollTriggers\nconsole.log(''ScrollTriggers:'', ScrollTrigger.getAll());\n\n// Check if element exists\nconst el = document.querySelector(''.animated-element'');\nif (!el) console.warn(''Animation target not found!'');\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Before Launch\n\n- [ ] Remove all `markers: true`\n- [ ] Test with `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`\n- [ ] Test on mobile devices (real devices, not just DevTools)\n- [ ] Check performance in DevTools Performance tab\n- [ ] Verify 60fps on target devices\n- [ ] Content visible without JavaScript\n- [ ] Images lazy-loaded before ScrollTrigger refresh\n- [ ] No layout thrashing (avoid animating layout properties)\n\n### Visual QA Integration\n\n- [ ] Animations complete before screenshots\n- [ ] Full-page scroll triggers all animations\n- [ ] Screenshots capture final animated state\n- [ ] Test at all viewport sizes\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [GSAP Documentation](https://greensock.com/docs/)\n- [ScrollTrigger Documentation](https://greensock.com/docs/v3/Plugins/ScrollTrigger)\n- [GSAP Cheat Sheet](https://greensock.com/cheatsheet/)\n- [GreenSock Forums](https://greensock.com/forums/)\n- [Reduced Motion Best Practices](https://web.dev/prefers-reduced-motion/)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:10:54.308Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing professional-grade web animation capabilities using GSAP.","zh":"非常适合需要专业级网页动画功能的前端代理，使用GSAP。","ja":"GSAPを使用してプロフェッショナルグレードのWebアニメーション機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"GSAP를 사용하여 전문가급 웹 애니메이션 기능을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de animación web de grado profesional utilizando GSAP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités d''animation web de niveau professionnel en utilisant GSAP.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die professionelle Web-Animationsfunktionen mit GSAP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de animação web de nível profissional usando GSAP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы профессиональные возможности веб-анимации с использованием GSAP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات الرسوم المتحركة على الويب من الدرجة المهنية باستخدام GSAP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft performant and accessible animations by leveraging GPU-accelerated properties like transform and opacity, while respecting user preferences for reduced motion and ensuring 60fps on all devices.","zh":"通过利用GPU加速的属性（如变换和不透明度）来赋予代理创建高性能和易访问的动画的能力，同时尊重用户对减少动作的偏好，并确保所有设备的60fps。","ja":"変換や不透明度などのGPUアクセラレーションされたプロパティを利用して、高パフォーマンスでアクセスしやすいアニメーションを作成することができ、また、ユーザーの動きを減らすための偏好を尊重し、すべてのデバイスで60fpsを確保します。","ko":"변환 및 불투명도와 같은 GPU 가속 속성을 활용하여 고성능 및 접근성이 좋은 애니메이션을 만들 수 있으며 사용자의 감소된 동작에 대한 선호도를 존중하고 모든 기기에서 60fps를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear animaciones accesibles y de alto rendimiento mediante el uso de propiedades aceleradas por GPU como transformación y opacidad, respetando las preferencias del usuario para reducir el movimiento y garantizando 60 fps en todos los dispositivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations performantes et accessibles en exploitant les propriétés accélérées par GPU comme la transformation et l''opacité, tout en respectant les préférences de l''utilisateur pour une réduction du mouvement et en assurant 60 images par seconde sur tous les appareils.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, leistungsstarke und zugängliche Animationen zu erstellen, indem GPU-beschleunigte Eigenschaften wie Transformation und Opazität genutzt werden, während die Benutzervorlieben für reduzierte Bewegung respektiert und 60 Bilder pro Sekunde auf allen Geräten gewährleistet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar animações performáticas e acessíveis aproveitando propriedades aceleradas por GPU, como transformação e opacidade, respeitando as preferências do usuário para movimento reduzido e garantindo 60fps em todos os dispositivos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать производительные и доступные анимации, используя свойства, ускоренные с помощью GPU, такие как трансформация и непрозрачность, при этом уважая предпочтения пользователя в отношении уменьшенного движения и обеспечивая 60 кадров в секунду на всех устройствах.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة ذات أداء جيد ويمكن الوصول إليها من خلال الاستفادة من خصائص معززة بواسطة وحدة معالجة الرسومات، مثل التحويل وال opak، مع احترام تفضيلات المستخدم لتحريك مخفض وضمان 60 إطارًا في الثانية على جميع الأجهزة."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing web page animations for better user experience","Creating accessible animations that respect user preferences","Debugging performance issues in complex web animations"],"zh":["优化网页动画以改善用户体验","创建尊重用户偏好的易访问动画","调试复杂网页动画中的性能问题"],"ja":["ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるためのWebページアニメーションの最適化","ユーザーの偏好を尊重したアクセスしやすいアニメーションの作成","複雑なWebアニメーションのパフォーマンス問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["사용자 경험을 개선하기 위한 웹 페이지 애니메이션 최적화","사용자 선호도를 존중하는 접근성 좋은 애니메이션 만들기","복잡한 웹 애니메이션의 성능 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Optimizar las animaciones de página web para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Crear animaciones accesibles que respeten las preferencias del usuario","Depurar problemas de rendimiento en animaciones web complejas"],"fr":["Optimiser les animations de page web pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Créer des animations accessibles qui respectent les préférences de l''utilisateur","Déboguer les problèmes de performances dans les animations web complexes"],"de":["Webseiten-Animationen für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung optimieren","Zugängliche Animationen erstellen, die die Benutzervorlieben respektieren","Leistungsprobleme in komplexen Web-Animationen debuggen"],"pt":["Otimizar animações da página web para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Criar animações acessíveis que respeitem as preferências do usuário","Depurar problemas de desempenho em animações web complexas"],"ru":["Оптимизация анимации веб-страниц для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Создание доступных анимаций, которые уважают предпочтения пользователя","Отладка проблем с производительностью в сложных веб-анимациях"],"ar":["تحسين رسوم متحركة صفحة الويب لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","إنشاء رسوم متحركة يمكن الوصول إليها التي تحترم تفضيلات المستخدم","تصحيح مشاكل الأداء في رسوم متحركة الويب المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GSAP library integration","Limited to animating transform and opacity properties for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要GSAP库集成","仅限对变换和不透明度属性进行动画处理以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["GSAPライブラリの統合が必要","パフォーマンスを最適化するために、変換と不透明度のプロパティのみをアニメーション化"],"ko":["GSAP 라이브러리 통합이 필요","최적의 성능을 위해 변환 및 불투명도 속성만 애니메이션"],"es":["Requiere la integración de la biblioteca GSAP","Limitado a la animación de propiedades de transformación y opacidad para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque GSAP","Limité à l''animation des propriétés de transformation et d''opacité pour un rendement optimal"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der GSAP-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf die Animation von Transformations- und Opazitätseigenschaften für ein optimales Leistungsverhalten"],"pt":["Requer integração da biblioteca GSAP","Limitado à animação de propriedades de transformação e opacidade para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует интеграции библиотеки GSAP","Ограничен анимацией свойств трансформации и непрозрачности для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مكتبة GSAP","محدود بالتحريك الخاصيات التحويل والopak من أجل الأداء الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nechmads/hot-metal/workflow-planning', 'community', 'nechmads', 'hot-metal', 'nechmads/hot-metal', 'workflow-planning', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:11:19.839Z', NULL, '{"id":"nechmads/hot-metal/workflow-planning","name":"workflow-planning","description":{"zh":"工作流程规划是一个6步骤的结构化过程，用于指导您完成产品需求文档的创建和工作流程的规划","ja":"ワークフロー計画は、6つのステップで構成された構造化されたプロセスであり、製品要件文書の作成とワークフローの計画を支援します","ko":"워크플로우 계획은 6개의 단계로 구성된 구조화된 프로세스로 제품 요구사항 문서의 생성과 워크플로우의 계획을 지원합니다","es":"La planificación de flujo de trabajo es un proceso estructurado que te guía a través de 6 pasos para mejorar la productividad y la eficiencia.","fr":"La planification de workflow est un processus structuré qui vous guide à travers 6 étapes pour améliorer la productivité et l''efficacité.","de":"Die Workflows-Planung ist ein strukturierter Prozess, der Sie durch 6 Schritte führt, um die Produktivität und Effizienz zu verbessern.","pt":"O planejamento de fluxo de trabalho é um processo estruturado que ajuda a melhorar a produtividade. Aprenda a criar um plano de trabalho eficaz.","ru":"Планирование рабочего процесса - это структурированный процесс, который помогает улучшить производительность. Узнайте, как создать эффективный план работы.","ar":"تخطيط تدفق العمل هو عملية منظمة تساعد على تحسين الإنتاجية. تعلم كيفية إنشاء خطة عمل فعالة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"workflow-planning","ja":"ワークフロー計画","ko":"워크플로우 계획","es":"Planificación de flujo de trabajo: 6 pasos para el éxito","fr":"Planification de workflow : 6 étapes pour la réussite","de":"Workflows planen: 6 Schritte zum Erfolg","pt":"Planejamento de Fluxo de Trabalho","ru":"Планирование рабочего процесса","ar":"تخطيط تدفق العمل","en":"workflow-planning"},"description":{"zh":"工作流程规划是一个6步骤的结构化过程，用于指导您完成产品需求文档的创建和工作流程的规划","ja":"ワークフロー計画は、6つのステップで構成された構造化されたプロセスであり、製品要件文書の作成とワークフローの計画を支援します","ko":"워크플로우 계획은 6개의 단계로 구성된 구조화된 프로세스로 제품 요구사항 문서의 생성과 워크플로우의 계획을 지원합니다","es":"La planificación de flujo de trabajo es un proceso estructurado que te guía a través de 6 pasos para mejorar la productividad y la eficiencia.","fr":"La planification de workflow est un processus structuré qui vous guide à travers 6 étapes pour améliorer la productivité et l''efficacité.","de":"Die Workflows-Planung ist ein strukturierter Prozess, der Sie durch 6 Schritte führt, um die Produktivität und Effizienz zu verbessern.","pt":"O planejamento de fluxo de trabalho é um processo estruturado que ajuda a melhorar a produtividade. Aprenda a criar um plano de trabalho eficaz.","ru":"Планирование рабочего процесса - это структурированный процесс, который помогает улучшить производительность. Узнайте, как создать эффективный план работы.","ar":"تخطيط تدفق العمل هو عملية منظمة تساعد على تحسين الإنتاجية. تعلم كيفية إنشاء خطة عمل فعالة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["6个步骤的结构化流程","产品需求文档的创建","工作流程的规划","交互式的PRD创建","详细的规则指南","可执行的工作流程"],"ja":["6つのステップで構成された構造化されたプロセス","製品要件文書の作成","ワークフローの計画","対話式のPRD作成","詳細なルールガイド","実行可能なワークフロー"],"ko":["6개의 단계로 구성된 구조화된 프로세스","제품 요구사항 문서의 생성","워크플로우의 계획","대화식의 PRD 생성","상세한 규칙 가이드","실행 가능한 워크플로우"],"es":["6 pasos para planificar un flujo de trabajo efectivo","Proceso estructurado para mejorar la productividad","Guía paso a paso para la creación de PRDs","Integración con herramientas de gestión de proyectos","Análisis y seguimiento del progreso","Mejora de la eficiencia y la colaboración en equipo"],"fr":["6 étapes pour planifier un workflow efficace","Processus structuré pour améliorer la productivité","Guide étape par étape pour la création de PRDs","Intégration avec des outils de gestion de projets","Analyse et suivi de la progression","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la collaboration d''équipe"],"de":["6 Schritte zur Planung eines effektiven Workflows","Strukturierter Prozess zur Verbesserung der Produktivität","Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung zur Erstellung von PRDs","Integration mit Projektmanagement-Tools","Analyse und Verfolgung des Fortschritts","Verbesserung der Effizienz und der Teamzusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Criação de PRDs interativos","Planejamento de fluxo de trabalho em 6 etapas","Execução de tarefas de forma estruturada","Melhoria da produtividade","Criação de planos de trabalho personalizados","Integração com ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных PRD","Планирование рабочего процесса в 6 шагах","Выполнение задач в структурированном порядке","Повышение производительности","Создание индивидуальных планов работы","Интеграция с инструментами управления проектами"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج التفاعلية","تخطيط تدفق العمل في 6 خطوات","تنفيذ المهام بطريقة منظمة","تحسين الإنتاجية","إنشاء خطط عمل مخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات إدارة المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["工作流程规划","产品需求文档","结构化流程","交互式PRD","工作流程管理","流程自动化"],"ja":["ワークフロー計画","製品要件文書","構造化されたプロセス","対話式PRD","ワークフローの管理","プロセス自動化"],"ko":["워크플로우 계획","제품 요구사항 문서","구조화된 프로세스","대화식 PRD","워크플로우 관리","프로세스 자동화"],"es":["planificación de flujo de trabajo","gestión de proyectos","productividad","eficiencia","colaboración en equipo","PRDs","herramientas de gestión de proyectos","análisis de progreso"],"fr":["planification de workflow","gestion de projets","productivité","efficacité","collaboration d''équipe","PRDs","outils de gestion de projets","analyse de progression"],"de":["Workflows-Planung","Projektmanagement","Produktivität","Effizienz","Teamzusammenarbeit","PRDs","Projektmanagement-Tools","Fortschrittsanalyse"],"pt":["planejamento de fluxo de trabalho","produtividade","gerenciamento de projetos","PRD interativo","fluxo de trabalho eficaz","melhoria da produtividade","ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos","planejamento de projeto","gestão de tarefas"],"ru":["планирование рабочего процесса","производительность","управление проектами","интерактивный PRD","эффективный рабочий процесс","повышение производительности","инструменты управления проектами","планирование проекта","управление задачами"],"ar":["تخطيط تدفق العمل","الإنتاجية","إدارة المشاريع","وثائق متطلبات المنتج التفاعلية","تدفق العمل الفعال","تحسين الإنتاجية","أدوات إدارة المشاريع","تخطيط المشروع","إدارة المهام"]}},"owner":"nechmads","repo":"hot-metal","repoPath":"nechmads/hot-metal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"workflow-planning","description":"Run the complete product planning workflow. Use when starting a new project or feature to create PRD, conduct market research, design UX/UI, and generate development tasks.","bodyPreview":"# Planning Workflow\n\nComplete Planning workflow with 6 steps. Follow each step in order.\n\n## How to Use This Workflow\n\nThis workflow guides you through a structured process. Execute each step in order.\n\n**To run the complete workflow**, follow the steps below. Each step has detailed instructions in its own rule.\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n### Step 1: Create Prd Interactive\n\nYou are a product manager who creates clear, concise PRDs through conversation.\n\n**Invoke**: $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte","body":"# Planning Workflow\n\nComplete Planning workflow with 6 steps. Follow each step in order.\n\n## How to Use This Workflow\n\nThis workflow guides you through a structured process. Execute each step in order.\n\n**To run the complete workflow**, follow the steps below. Each step has detailed instructions in its own rule.\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n### Step 1: Create Prd Interactive\n\nYou are a product manager who creates clear, concise PRDs through conversation.\n\n**Invoke**: $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-interactive\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Run Market Research\n\nYou are a market research analyst who conducts comprehensive competitive and market analysis.\n\n**Invoke**: $workflow-planning-02-run-market-research\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Write Development Phases\n\nYou are a product strategist who creates phased product roadmaps.\n\n**Invoke**: $workflow-planning-03-write-development-phases\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Ux Research\n\nYou are a UX researcher who investigates how products should feel and flow.\n\n**Invoke**: $workflow-planning-04-ux-research\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Ui Design\n\nYou are a UI design director who creates comprehensive, implementable visual designs.\n\n**Invoke**: $workflow-planning-05-ui-design\n\n---\n\n### Step 6: Generate Todos\n\nFirst make sure you read the following documents to fully understand the project, the scope, the research, goals and proposed UI:\n\n**Invoke**: $workflow-planning-06-generate-todos\n\n---\n\n## Execution Instructions\n\n1. Start with Step 1 and complete it fully before moving to the next step\n2. Each step may require user input or produce artifacts\n3. Steps build on previous outputs, so order matters\n4. If a step references a file that doesn''t exist, complete the prerequisite step first\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:11:19.839Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing structured workflow planning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要结构化的工作流规划能力。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの構造化されたワークフロー計画機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 구조화된 워크플로 계획 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de planificación de flujo de trabajo estructurado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin de capacités de planification de workflow structurées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die strukturierte Workflow-Planungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades de planejamento de fluxo de trabalho estruturado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы возможности структурированного планирования рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التخطيط للتسلسل الهرمي للمهام المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute multi-step workflows using protocols like $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte, providing a clear and concise PRD creation process through conversation.","zh":"使代理能够使用$workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte等协议执行多步骤的工作流，通过对话提供清晰简洁的PRD创建过程。","ja":"$workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inteなどのプロトコルを使用して、マルチステップのワークフローを実行することが代理を可能にし、対話を通じて明確かつ簡潔なPRD作成プロセスを提供します。","ko":"대리人が $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 멀티 스텝 워크플ロー를 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 대화를 통해 명확하고 간결한 PRD 생성 프로세스를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar flujos de trabajo multietapa utilizando protocolos como $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte, proporcionando un proceso de creación de PRD claro y conciso a través de la conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des flux de travail multietapes en utilisant des protocoles comme $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte, fournissant un processus de création de PRD clair et concis à travers la conversation.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, mehrschrittige Workflows mit Protokollen wie $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte auszuführen, wodurch ein klarer und präziser PRD-Erstellungsprozess durch die Konversation bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho em várias etapas usando protocolos como $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte, fornecendo um processo de criação de PRD claro e conciso por meio de conversas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять многоступенчатые рабочие процессы с использованием протоколов, таких как $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte, обеспечивая четкий и краткий процесс создания PRD через разговор.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تنفيذ سلاسل مهام متعددة المراحل باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل $workflow-planning-01-create-prd-inte، مما يوفر عملية إنشاء PRD واضحة وموجزة من خلال المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating product development workflows","Generating PRDs through interactive conversations","Streamlining workflow planning with 6-step processes"],"zh":["自动化产品开发工作流","通过交互式对话生成PRD","使用6步骤流程简化工作流规划"],"ja":["製品開発ワークフローの自動化","対話を通じてPRDを生成する","6ステップのプロセスを使用してワークフロー計画を合理化する"],"ko":["제품 개발 워크플로 자동화","대화를 통해 PRD 생성","6단계 프로세스를 사용하여 워크플로 계획 단순화"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de productos","Generación de PRD a través de conversaciones interactivas","Optimización de la planificación de flujos de trabajo con procesos de 6 pasos"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de développement de produits","Génération de PRD via des conversations interactives","Optimisation de la planification de flux de travail avec des processus de 6 étapes"],"de":["Automatisierung von Produktentwicklungs-Workflows","Erstellung von PRD durch interaktive Konversationen","Optimierung der Workflow-Planung mit 6-Schritt-Prozessen"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de produtos","Gerar PRDs por meio de conversas interativas","Otimizar o planejamento de fluxos de trabalho com processos de 6 etapas"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов разработки продуктов","Генерация PRD через интерактивные разговоры","Оптимизация планирования рабочих процессов с 6-ступенчатыми процессами"],"ar":["تأتميم سلاسل مهام تطوير المنتجات","إنشاء PRD من خلال محادثات تفاعلية","تبسيط تخطيط التسلسل الهرمي للمهام بخوض 6 مراحل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires step-by-step execution","Limited to 6 predefined workflow steps"],"zh":["需要一步一步的执行","仅限于6个预定义的工作流步骤"],"ja":["ステップごとの実行が必要","6つの事前定義されたワークフローステップに限定される"],"ko":["一步一步의 실행이 필요","6개의预定义 워크플로 단계로 제한"],"es":["Requiere ejecución paso a paso","Limitado a 6 pasos de flujo de trabajo predefinidos"],"fr":["Nécessite une exécution étape par étape","Limité à 6 étapes de flux de travail prédéfinies"],"de":["Benötigt schrittweise Ausführung","Begrenzt auf 6 vorgegebene Workflow-Schritte"],"pt":["Requer execução passo a passo","Limitado a 6 etapas de fluxo de trabalho predefinidas"],"ru":["Требует пошагового выполнения","Ограничен 6 предопределенными шагами рабочего процесса"],"ar":["يتطلب التنفيذ بالخطوات","محدود بـ 6 خطوات مسبقة التخطيط في سلاسل المهام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nadavyigal/Running-coach-/post-run-debrief', 'community', 'nadavyigal', 'Running-coach-', 'nadavyigal/Running-coach-', 'post-run-debrief', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:11:16.397Z', NULL, '{"id":"nadavyigal/Running-coach-/post-run-debrief","name":"post-run-debrief","description":{"zh":"post-run-debrief技能用于代码运行后分析，提供反馈和改进建议。它帮助开发者优化代码和提高效率。","ja":"post-run-debriefスキルは、コード実行後に分析を実施し、フィードバックと改善提案を提供します。開発者のコード最適化と効率向上をサポートします。","ko":"post-run-debrief 기능은 코드 실행 후 분석을 수행하여 피드백과 개선 제안을 제공합니다. 개발者の 코드 최적화와 효율성 향상을 지원합니다.","es":"El skill de debriefing de ejecución de Codex proporciona reflexión y confianza después de una ejecución. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a identificar próximos pasos y a mejorar su flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Le skill de débriefing d''exécution de Codex fournit une réflexion et une confiance après une exécution. Il aide les développeurs à identifier les prochaines étapes et à améliorer leur flux de travail.","de":"Der Skill für die Ausführungsdebriefing von Codex bietet Reflexion und Vertrauen nach einer Ausführung. Er hilft Entwicklern, nächste Schritte zu identifizieren und ihren Arbeitsablauf zu verbessern.","pt":"O post-run debrief é uma técnica de otimização de código que ajuda a refletir sobre a execução recente e identificar áreas de melhoria.","ru":"Пост-запуск дебриф - это техника оптимизации кода, которая помогает отразить最近нюю работу и выявить области для улучшения.","ar":"إعادة تشغيل البرنامج بعد التشغيل هو تقنية لتحسين الكود تساعد على التفكير في التشغيل الأخير وتحديد المجالات التي يمكن تحسينها.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码运行后分析工具","ja":"コード実行後の分析ツール","ko":"코드 실행 후 분석 도구","es":"Resumen de ejecución de Codex","fr":"Débriefing d''exécution de Codex","de":"Codex-Ausführungsdebriefing","pt":"Post-Run Debrief: Otimização de Código","ru":"Пост-Запуск Дебриф: Оптимизация Код","ar":"إعادة تشغيل البرنامج بعد التشغيل: تحسين الكود","en":"post-run-debrief"},"description":{"zh":"post-run-debrief技能用于代码运行后分析，提供反馈和改进建议。它帮助开发者优化代码和提高效率。","ja":"post-run-debriefスキルは、コード実行後に分析を実施し、フィードバックと改善提案を提供します。開発者のコード最適化と効率向上をサポートします。","ko":"post-run-debrief 기능은 코드 실행 후 분석을 수행하여 피드백과 개선 제안을 제공합니다. 개발者の 코드 최적화와 효율성 향상을 지원합니다.","es":"El skill de debriefing de ejecución de Codex proporciona reflexión y confianza después de una ejecución. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a identificar próximos p...","fr":"Le skill de débriefing d''exécution de Codex fournit une réflexion et une confiance après une exécution. Il aide les développeurs à identifier les prochaines ...","de":"Der Skill für die Ausführungsdebriefing von Codex bietet Reflexion und Vertrauen nach einer Ausführung. Er hilft Entwicklern, nächste Schritte zu identifizie...","pt":"O post-run debrief é uma técnica de otimização de código que ajuda a refletir sobre a execução recente e identificar áreas de melhoria.","ru":"Пост-запуск дебриф - это техника оптимизации кода, которая помогает отразить最近нюю работу и выявить области для улучшения.","ar":"إعادة تشغيل البرنامج بعد التشغيل هو تقنية لتحسين الكود تساعد على التفكير في التشغيل الأخير وتحديد المجالات التي يمكن تحسينها.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码运行后分析","反馈和改进建议","RecentRunTelemetry数据提供","可选的SafetyFlag输出"],"ja":["コード実行後の分析","フィードバックと改善提案","RecentRunTelemetryデータの提供","SafetyFlagの出力（オプション）"],"ko":["코드 실행 후 분석","피드백과 개선 제안","RecentRunTelemetry 데이터 제공","SafetyFlag 출력(선택 사항)"],"es":["Proporciona reflexión y confianza después de una ejecución","Ayuda a identificar próximos pasos","Incluye métricas derivadas y notas de usuario","Genera puntuaciones de confianza y orientación para el próximo paso","Incluye banderas de seguridad opcionales"],"fr":["Fournit une réflexion et une confiance après une exécution","Aide à identifier les prochaines étapes","Inclut des métriques dérivées et des notes d''utilisateur","Génère des scores de confiance et des conseils pour l''étape suivante","Inclut des drapeaux de sécurité optionnels"],"de":["Bietet Reflexion und Vertrauen nach einer Ausführung","Hilft bei der Identifizierung nächster Schritte","Enthält abgeleitete Metriken und Benutzerhinweise","Generiert Vertrauenswerte und Anleitung für den nächsten Schritt","Enthält optionale Sicherheitsflaggen"],"pt":["Reflexão sobre a execução recente","Identificação de áreas de melhoria","Geração de balas de reflexão","Verificação de confiança","Orientação para o próximo passo"],"ru":["Отражение最近ней работы","Выявление областей для улучшения","Генерация пуль отражения","Проверка уверенности","Направление для следующего шага"],"ar":["التفكير في التشغيل الأخير","تحديد المجالات التي يمكن تحسينها","إصدار نقط التفكير","تحقق من الثقة","التوجيه للخطوة التالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码分析","运行后分析","反馈机制","代码优化","开发者工具","post-run-debrief"],"ja":["コード分析","実行後の分析","フィードバックメカニズム","コード最適化","開発者ツール","post-run-debrief"],"ko":["코드 분석","실행 후 분석","피드백 메커니즘","코드 최적화","개발자 도구","post-run-debrief"],"es":["debriefing de ejecución","reflexión de ejecución","confianza de ejecución","próximos pasos","métricas derivadas","notas de usuario","banderas de seguridad"],"fr":["débriefing d''exécution","réflexion d''exécution","confiance d''exécution","prochaines étapes","métriques dérivées","notes d''utilisateur","drapeaux de sécurité"],"de":["Ausführungsdebriefing","Ausführungsreflexion","Ausführungsvertrauen","nächste Schritte","abgeleitete Metriken","Benutzerhinweise","Sicherheitsflaggen"],"pt":["post-run debrief","otimização de código","reflexão sobre a execução","identificação de áreas de melhoria","geração de balas de reflexão","verificação de confiança"],"ru":["пост-запуск дебриф","оптимизация кода","отражение最近ней работы","выявление областей для улучшения","генерация пуль отражения","проверка уверенности"],"ar":["إعادة تشغيل البرنامج بعد التشغيل","تحسين الكود","التفكير في التشغيل الأخير","تحديد المجالات التي يمكن تحسينها","إصدار نقط التفكير","تحقق من الثقة"]}},"owner":"nadavyigal","repo":"Running-coach-","repoPath":"nadavyigal/Running-coach-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"post-run-debrief","description":"Converts telemetry and user notes into a structured reflection, confidence score, and next-step guidance.","bodyPreview":"## When Codex should use it\n- Immediately after run save to prompt reflection.\n- When user asks for a recap or confidence check.\n\n## Invocation guidance\n1. Provide `RecentRunTelemetry`, derived metrics, and user notes.\n2. Generate reflection bullets, confidence (0–1), and next-step guidance linked to the plan.\n3. Output must include optional `SafetyFlag[]` if pain/abnormal HR reported.\n\n## Input schema\nSee `references/input-schema.json`.\n\n## Output schema\nSee `references/output-schema.json`.\n\n##","body":"## When Codex should use it\n- Immediately after run save to prompt reflection.\n- When user asks for a recap or confidence check.\n\n## Invocation guidance\n1. Provide `RecentRunTelemetry`, derived metrics, and user notes.\n2. Generate reflection bullets, confidence (0–1), and next-step guidance linked to the plan.\n3. Output must include optional `SafetyFlag[]` if pain/abnormal HR reported.\n\n## Input schema\nSee `references/input-schema.json`.\n\n## Output schema\nSee `references/output-schema.json`.\n\n## Integration points\n- UI: Post-run modal and chat thread insertion.\n- Storage: Save alongside run insight in Dexie (`v0/lib/db.ts`).\n- Telemetry: Emit `ai_insight_created`.\n\n## Safety & guardrails\n- If user notes include pain/dizziness → advise stopping further activity and consulting a professional.\n- Keep debrief ≤140 words, supportive tone.\n- Default to conservative next-step if data incomplete.\n\n## Telemetry\n- Emit `ai_skill_invoked`, `ai_insight_created`, and `ai_safety_flag_raised` when applicable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:11:16.397Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Reflective Agents needing advanced post-execution analysis and user feedback integration, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code.","zh":"适用于需要高级后执行分析和用户反馈集成的反思代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code。","ja":"後処理分析とユーザーフィードバックの統合が必要なリフレクティブエージェントに適しています。たとえば、Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeなどです。","ko":"고급 후 처리 분석 및 사용자 피드백 통합이 필요한 반성 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 에이전트입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes reflexivos que necesitan un análisis de post-ejecución avanzado y la integración de comentarios de los usuarios, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents réflexifs ayant besoin d''une analyse de post-exécution avancée et d''une intégration de commentaires utilisateur, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code.","de":"Ideal für reflektierende Agenten, die eine erweiterte Nachbearbeitungsanalyse und eine Integration von Benutzerfeedback benötigen, wie z. B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code.","pt":"Ideal para agentes reflexivos que necessitam de análise pós-execução avançada e integração de feedback do usuário, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для рефлексивных агентов, которым требуется продвинутый пост-исполнительный анализ и интеграция пользовательского反馈, например, Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التأمليين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم بعد التنفيذ وتكامل ملاحظات المستخدم، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate detailed reflection bullets, confidence metrics, and next-step guidance linked to the plan, leveraging RecentRunTelemetry and derived metrics, while optionally incorporating SafetyFlags for enhanced user safety, all through JSON-based input and output schemas.","zh":"赋予代理生成详细的反思要点、置信度指标和下一步指导，链接到计划，利用RecentRunTelemetry和派生指标，并可选地纳入SafetyFlags以增强用户安全性，所有这些都通过基于JSON的输入和输出架构实现。","ja":"エージェントに、RecentRunTelemetryや派生メトリクスを利用して、詳細な反射の要点、信頼性の指標、計画にリンクされた次のステップのガイダンスを生成する機能を付与します。また、SafetyFlagsをオプションで組み込むことで、ユーザーの安全性を高めることができます。すべての機能は、JSONベースの入力および出力スキーマを通じて提供されます。","ko":"에이전트가 RecentRunTelemetry 및 파생 메트릭스를 사용하여詳細한 반성의 주요 사항, 신뢰도 지표 및 계획에 연결된 다음 단계의 가이드를 생성 할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 SafetyFlags를 선택적으로 통합하여 사용자 안전을 강화 할 수 있으며 모든 것은 JSON 기반의 입력 및 출력 스키마를 통해 제공됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar balas de reflexión detalladas, métricas de confianza y orientación para los próximos pasos vinculados al plan, aprovechando RecentRunTelemetry y métricas derivadas, y opcionalmente incorporando SafetyFlags para una mayor seguridad del usuario, todo a través de esquemas de entrada y salida basados en JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des balles de réflexion détaillées, des métriques de confiance et des conseils pour les étapes suivantes liés au plan, en exploitant RecentRunTelemetry et des métriques dérivées, tout en incorporant facultativement des SafetyFlags pour une sécurité renforcée des utilisateurs, le tout via des schémas d''entrée et de sortie basés sur JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, detaillierte Reflexionspunkte, Vertrauensmetriken und nächste Schritte zu generieren, die an den Plan geknüpft sind, wobei RecentRunTelemetry und abgeleitete Metriken genutzt werden und optional SafetyFlags zur Erhöhung der Benutzersicherheit integriert werden, und zwar über JSON-basierte Eingabe- und Ausgabeschemata.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem balas de reflexão detalhadas, métricas de confiança e orientação de próxima etapa vinculada ao plano, aproveitando RecentRunTelemetry e métricas derivadas, enquanto opcionalmente incorpora SafetyFlags para uma maior segurança do usuário, tudo por meio de esquemas de entrada e saída baseados em JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать подробные отражающие пули, метрики уверенности и руководство следующего шага, связанное с планом, используя RecentRunTelemetry и производные метрики, а также опционально включая SafetyFlags для повышения безопасности пользователя, все через входные и выходные схемы на основе JSON.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توليد رصاصات反عكسة مفصلة وأدلة أمان وارشادات الخطوة التالية المرتبطة بالخطة، مستفيدة من RecentRunTelemetry والتحليلات المشتقة، مع إمكانية دمج SafetyFlags لتعزيز سلامة المستخدم، كل ذلك من خلال مخططات الإدخال والإخراج القائمة على JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating post-run reflections for enhanced user experience","Generating confidence metrics for run validation","Debugging runs with abnormal heart rate or pain reports through SafetyFlag analysis"],"zh":["为增强用户体验自动执行后运行反思","为运行验证生成置信度指标","通过SafetyFlag分析调试具有异常心率或疼痛报告的运行"],"ja":["ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上のためにポスト実行の反射を自動化する","実行の検証のために信頼性の指標を生成する","SafetyFlagの分析を通じて異常な心拍数または痛みレポートを持つ実行をデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자 경험을 향상하기위한 자동화 된 후 실행 반성","실행 유효성 검사에 대한 신뢰도 지표 생성","SafetyFlag 분석을 통해 비정상적인 심박수 또는 통증 보고서가 있는 실행 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de reflexiones posteriores a la ejecución para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","Generación de métricas de confianza para la validación de ejecuciones","Depuración de ejecuciones con frecuencia cardíaca anormal o informes de dolor a través del análisis de SafetyFlags"],"fr":["Automatisation des réflexions post-exécution pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Génération de métriques de confiance pour la validation des exécutions","Débogage des exécutions avec une fréquence cardiaque anormale ou des rapports de douleur via l''analyse de SafetyFlags"],"de":["Automatisierung von Nachbearbeitungsreflexionen für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Generierung von Vertrauensmetriken für die Überprüfung von Ausführungen","Fehlerbehebung von Ausführungen mit abnormaler Herzfrequenz oder Schmerzberichten durch SafetyFlag-Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar reflexões pós-execução para experiência do usuário aprimorada","Gerar métricas de confiança para validação de execução","Depurar execuções com frequência cardíaca anormal ou relatórios de dor por meio da análise de SafetyFlag"],"ru":["Автоматизировать пост-исполнительные отражения для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Генерировать метрики уверенности для валидации запуска","Отлаживать запуски с аномальной частотой сердечных сокращений или отчетами о боли через анализ SafetyFlag"],"ar":["تأتمتة الانعكاسات بعد التشغيل لتجربة مستخدم محسنة","توليد مقاييس الثقة لتحقق التشغيل","تصحيح أخطاء التشغيل مع معدل ضربات قلب غير طبيعي أو تقارير الألم من خلال تحليل SafetyFlag"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires RecentRunTelemetry data","Needs user notes for comprehensive analysis","Output schema must be followed for compatibility"],"zh":["需要RecentRunTelemetry数据","需要用户笔记以进行全面分析","输出架构必须遵循兼容性"],"ja":["RecentRunTelemetryデータが必要","包括的な分析のためにユーザーノートが必要","出力スキーマを従う必要があるため互換性が確保される"],"ko":["RecentRunTelemetry 데이터가 필요합니다","포괄적인 분석을 위해 사용자 메모가 필요합니다","출력 스키마를 따라야 하므로 호환성이 보장됩니다"],"es":["Requiere datos de RecentRunTelemetry","Necesita notas de los usuarios para un análisis integral","El esquema de salida debe seguirse para la compatibilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite des données RecentRunTelemetry","A besoin de notes d''utilisateurs pour une analyse complète","Le schéma de sortie doit être suivi pour la compatibilité"],"de":["Benötigt RecentRunTelemetry-Daten","Benötigt Benutzerhinweise für eine umfassende Analyse","Das Ausgabeschema muss für die Kompatibilität befolgt werden"],"pt":["Requer dados do RecentRunTelemetry","Necessita de notas do usuário para análise abrangente","O esquema de saída deve ser seguido para compatibilidade"],"ru":["Требует данных RecentRunTelemetry","Требует заметок пользователя для всестороннего анализа","Схема вывода должна следовать для совместимости"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات RecentRunTelemetry","يحتاج إلى ملاحظات المستخدم للتحليل الشامل","يجب اتباع مخطط الإخراج للتوافق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('AmiranChubinidze/royaltoursadmin/mobile-ios-design', 'community', 'AmiranChubinidze', 'royaltoursadmin', 'AmiranChubinidze/royaltoursadmin', 'mobile-ios-design', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:11:16.624Z', NULL, '{"id":"AmiranChubinidze/royaltoursadmin/mobile-ios-design","name":"mobile-ios-design","description":{"zh":"iOS HIG SwiftUI","ja":"iOS HIG SwiftUI","ko":"iOS HIG SwiftUI","es":"Aprende a diseñar aplicaciones iOS con las guías de interfaz de usuario de Apple y patrones de SwiftUI para crear aplicaciones nativas pulidas","fr":"Apprenez à concevoir des applications iOS avec les guides d''interface utilisateur d''Apple et les modèles SwiftUI pour créer des applications natives polies","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie iOS-Apps mit den Benutzeroberflächen-Richtlinien von Apple und SwiftUI-Mustern entwerfen, um native, polierte Anwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Desenvolva aplicativos iOS com design nativo e acessível, seguindo as diretrizes de interface do usuário da Apple","ru":"Создавайте приложения для iOS с родным дизайном и доступностью, следуя руководящим принципам интерфейса пользователя Apple","ar":"إنشاء تطبيقات iOS مع تصميم أصلي وقابلية الوصول، مع اتباع إرشادات واجهة المستخدم من Apple","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"iOS","ja":"iOS","ko":"iOS","es":"Diseño de iOS: Guías de interfaz de usuario y SwiftUI","fr":"Conception iOS : Guide d''interface utilisateur et modèles...","de":"iOS-Design: Benutzeroberflächen-Richtlinien und SwiftUI-M...","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Interfaces iOS","ru":"Дизайн интерфейса iOS","ar":"تصميم واجهة المستخدم لآي أو إس","en":"mobile-ios-design"},"description":{"zh":"iOS HIG SwiftUI","ja":"iOS HIG SwiftUI","ko":"iOS HIG SwiftUI","es":"Aprende a diseñar aplicaciones iOS con las guías de interfaz de usuario de Apple y patrones de SwiftUI para crear aplicaciones nativas pulidas","fr":"Apprenez à concevoir des applications iOS avec les guides d''interface utilisateur d''Apple et les modèles SwiftUI pour créer des applications natives polies","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie iOS-Apps mit den Benutzeroberflächen-Richtlinien von Apple und SwiftUI-Mustern entwerfen, um native, polierte Anwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Desenvolva aplicativos iOS com design nativo e acessível, seguindo as diretrizes de interface do usuário da Apple","ru":"Создавайте приложения для iOS с родным дизайном и доступностью, следуя руководящим принципам интерфейса пользователя Apple","ar":"إنشاء تطبيقات iOS مع تصميم أصلي وقابلية الوصول، مع اتباع إرشادات واجهة المستخدم من Apple","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["iOS HIG","SwiftUI","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols","iOS"],"ja":["iOS HIG","SwiftUI","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols","iOS"],"ko":["iOS HIG","SwiftUI","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols","iOS"],"es":["Diseño de interfaces de usuario con las guías de Apple","Creación de vistas y diseños con SwiftUI","Implementación de patrones de navegación de iOS","Diseño de layouts adaptativos para iPhone y iPad","Uso de SF Symbols y tipografía del sistema","Creación de interfaces de usuario accesibles"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur avec les guides d''Apple","Création de vues et de mises en page avec SwiftUI","Mise en œuvre de modèles de navigation d''iOS","Conception de mises en page adaptatives pour iPhone et iPad","Utilisation de SF Symbols et de la typographie du système","Création d''interfaces utilisateur accessibles"],"de":["Entwerfen von Benutzeroberflächen mit den Apple-Richtlinien","Erstellen von Ansichten und Layouts mit SwiftUI","Implementierung von iOS-Navigationsmustern","Entwerfen von adaptiven Layouts für iPhone und iPad","Verwenden von SF Symbols und Systemtypografie","Erstellen von zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com design nativo","Implementação de padrões de navegação iOS","Criação de layouts adaptáveis para iPhone e iPad","Uso de SF Symbols e tipografia do sistema","Desenvolvimento de interfaces acessíveis"],"ru":["Создание кастомных интерфейсов пользователя","Разработка приложений с родным дизайном","Реализация шаблонов навигации iOS","Создание адаптивных макетов для iPhone и iPad","Использование SF Symbols и системной типографики","Разработка доступных интерфейсов"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير تطبيقات مع تصميم أصلي","تنفيذ أنماط الملاحة لآي أو إس","إنشاء تخطيطات قابلة للتكيف لآي فون وآي باد","استخدام رموز SF وطباعة النظام","تطوير واجهات قابلة للوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iOS","HIG","SwiftUI","iOS","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols","iOS","iOS"],"ja":["iOS","HIG","SwiftUI","iOS","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols","iOS","iOS"],"ko":["iOS","HIG","SwiftUI","iOS","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols","iOS","iOS"],"es":["diseño de iOS","guías de interfaz de usuario de Apple","SwiftUI","aplicaciones iOS nativas","interfaces de usuario accesibles","patrones de navegación de iOS","diseño de layouts adaptativos","SF Symbols","tipografía del sistema"],"fr":["conception iOS","guides d''interface utilisateur d''Apple","SwiftUI","applications iOS natives","interfaces utilisateur accessibles","modèles de navigation d''iOS","conception de mises en page adaptatives","SF Symbols","typographie du système"],"de":["iOS-Design","Apple-Benutzeroberflächen-Richtlinien","SwiftUI","native iOS-Anwendungen","zugängliche Benutzeroberflächen","iOS-Navigationsmuster","Entwerfen von adaptiven Layouts","SF Symbols","Systemtypografie"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de interfaces iOS","design de aplicativos iOS","SwiftUI","navegação iOS","layouts adaptáveis","SF Symbols","tipografia do sistema","acessibilidade em iOS"],"ru":["дизайн интерфейса iOS","разработка приложений для iOS","SwiftUI","навигация iOS","адаптивные макеты","SF Symbols","системная типография","доступность в iOS"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم لآي أو إس","تطوير تطبيقات لآي أو إس","SwiftUI","ملاحة لآي أو إس","تخطيطات قابلة للتكيف","رموز SF","طباعة النظام","قابلية الوصول في آي أو إس"]}},"owner":"AmiranChubinidze","repo":"royaltoursadmin","repoPath":"AmiranChubinidze/royaltoursadmin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-ios-design","description":"Master iOS Human Interface Guidelines and SwiftUI patterns for building native iOS apps. Use when designing iOS interfaces, implementing SwiftUI views, or ensuring apps follow Apples design principles.","bodyPreview":"# iOS Mobile Design\n\nMaster iOS Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) and SwiftUI patterns to build polished, native iOS applications that feel at home on Apple platforms.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing iOS app interfaces following Apple HIG\n- Building SwiftUI views and layouts\n- Implementing iOS navigation patterns (NavigationStack, TabView, sheets)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for iPhone and iPad\n- Using SF Symbols and system typography\n- Building accessible iOS interfaces\n- Implementing iO","body":"# iOS Mobile Design\n\nMaster iOS Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) and SwiftUI patterns to build polished, native iOS applications that feel at home on Apple platforms.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing iOS app interfaces following Apple HIG\n- Building SwiftUI views and layouts\n- Implementing iOS navigation patterns (NavigationStack, TabView, sheets)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for iPhone and iPad\n- Using SF Symbols and system typography\n- Building accessible iOS interfaces\n- Implementing iOS-specific gestures and interactions\n- Designing for Dynamic Type and Dark Mode\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Human Interface Guidelines Principles\n\n**Clarity**: Content is legible, icons are precise, adornments are subtle\n**Deference**: UI helps users understand content without competing with it\n**Depth**: Visual layers and motion convey hierarchy and enable navigation\n\n**Platform Considerations:**\n\n- **iOS**: Touch-first, compact displays, portrait orientation\n- **iPadOS**: Larger canvas, multitasking, pointer support\n- **visionOS**: Spatial computing, eye/hand input\n\n### 2. SwiftUI Layout System\n\n**Stack-Based Layouts:**\n\n```swift\n// Vertical stack with alignment\nVStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 12) {\n    Text(\"Title\")\n        .font(.headline)\n    Text(\"Subtitle\")\n        .font(.subheadline)\n        .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n}\n\n// Horizontal stack with flexible spacing\nHStack {\n    Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")\n    Text(\"Featured\")\n    Spacer()\n    Text(\"View All\")\n        .foregroundStyle(.blue)\n}\n```\n\n**Grid Layouts:**\n\n```swift\n// Adaptive grid that fills available width\nLazyVGrid(columns: [\n    GridItem(.adaptive(minimum: 150, maximum: 200))\n], spacing: 16) {\n    ForEach(items) { item in\n        ItemCard(item: item)\n    }\n}\n\n// Fixed column grid\nLazyVGrid(columns: [\n    GridItem(.flexible()),\n    GridItem(.flexible()),\n    GridItem(.flexible())\n], spacing: 12) {\n    ForEach(items) { item in\n        ItemThumbnail(item: item)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Navigation Patterns\n\n**NavigationStack (iOS 16+):**\n\n```swift\nstruct ContentView: View {\n    @State private var path = NavigationPath()\n\n    var body: some View {\n        NavigationStack(path: $path) {\n            List(items) { item in\n                NavigationLink(value: item) {\n                    ItemRow(item: item)\n                }\n            }\n            .navigationTitle(\"Items\")\n            .navigationDestination(for: Item.self) { item in\n                ItemDetailView(item: item)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**TabView:**\n\n```swift\nstruct MainTabView: View {\n    @State private var selectedTab = 0\n\n    var body: some View {\n        TabView(selection: $selectedTab) {\n            HomeView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Home\", systemImage: \"house\")\n                }\n                .tag(0)\n\n            SearchView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Search\", systemImage: \"magnifyingglass\")\n                }\n                .tag(1)\n\n            ProfileView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Profile\", systemImage: \"person\")\n                }\n                .tag(2)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. System Integration\n\n**SF Symbols:**\n\n```swift\n// Basic symbol\nImage(systemName: \"heart.fill\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.red)\n\n// Symbol with rendering mode\nImage(systemName: \"cloud.sun.fill\")\n    .symbolRenderingMode(.multicolor)\n\n// Variable symbol (iOS 16+)\nImage(systemName: \"speaker.wave.3.fill\", variableValue: volume)\n\n// Symbol effect (iOS 17+)\nImage(systemName: \"bell.fill\")\n    .symbolEffect(.bounce, value: notificationCount)\n```\n\n**Dynamic Type:**\n\n```swift\n// Use semantic fonts\nText(\"Headline\")\n    .font(.headline)\n\nText(\"Body text that scales with user preferences\")\n    .font(.body)\n\n// Custom font that respects Dynamic Type\nText(\"Custom\")\n    .font(.custom(\"Avenir\", size: 17, relativeTo: .body))\n```\n\n### 5. Visual Design\n\n**Colors and Materials:**\n\n```swift\n// Semantic colors that adapt to light/dark mode\nText(\"Primary\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.primary)\nText(\"Secondary\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n\n// System materials for blur effects\nRectangle()\n    .fill(.ultraThinMaterial)\n    .frame(height: 100)\n\n// Vibrant materials for overlays\nText(\"Overlay\")\n    .padding()\n    .background(.regularMaterial, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))\n```\n\n**Shadows and Depth:**\n\n```swift\n// Standard card shadow\nRoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 16)\n    .fill(.background)\n    .shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.1), radius: 8, y: 4)\n\n// Elevated appearance\n.shadow(radius: 2, y: 1)\n.shadow(radius: 8, y: 4)\n```\n\n## Quick Start Component\n\n```swift\nimport SwiftUI\n\nstruct FeatureCard: View {\n    let title: String\n    let description: String\n    let systemImage: String\n\n    var body: some View {\n        HStack(spacing: 16) {\n            Image(systemName: systemImage)\n                .font(.title)\n                .foregroundStyle(.blue)\n                .frame(width: 44, height: 44)\n                .background(.blue.opacity(0.1), in: Circle())\n\n            VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 4) {\n                Text(title)\n                    .font(.headline)\n                Text(description)\n                    .font(.subheadline)\n                    .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n                    .lineLimit(2)\n            }\n\n            Spacer()\n\n            Image(systemName: \"chevron.right\")\n                .foregroundStyle(.tertiary)\n        }\n        .padding()\n        .background(.background, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))\n        .shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.05), radius: 4, y: 2)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Semantic Colors**: Always use `.primary`, `.secondary`, `.background` for automatic light/dark mode support\n2. **Embrace SF Symbols**: Use system symbols for consistency and automatic accessibility\n3. **Support Dynamic Type**: Use semantic fonts (`.body`, `.headline`) instead of fixed sizes\n4. **Add Accessibility**: Include `.accessibilityLabel()` and `.accessibilityHint()` modifiers\n5. **Use Safe Areas**: Respect `safeAreaInset` and avoid hardcoded padding at screen edges\n6. **Implement State Restoration**: Use `@SceneStorage` for preserving user state\n7. **Support iPad Multitasking**: Design for split view and slide over\n8. **Test on Device**: Simulator doesn''t capture full haptic and performance experience\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Layout Breaking**: Use `.fixedSize()` sparingly; prefer flexible layouts\n- **Performance Issues**: Use `LazyVStack`/`LazyHStack` for long scrolling lists\n- **Navigation Bugs**: Ensure `NavigationLink` values are `Hashable`\n- **Dark Mode Problems**: Avoid hardcoded colors; use semantic or asset catalog colors\n- **Accessibility Failures**: Test with VoiceOver enabled\n- **Memory Leaks**: Watch for strong reference cycles in closures\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Human Interface Guidelines](https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/)\n- [SwiftUI Documentation](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/swiftui)\n- [SF Symbols App](https://developer.apple.com/sf-symbols/)\n- [WWDC SwiftUI Sessions](https://developer.apple.com/videos/swiftui/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:11:16.624Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing to master iOS Human Interface Guidelines and SwiftUI patterns for native app development.","zh":"非常适合需要掌握iOS人机界面指南和SwiftUI模式的UI/UX代理，用于原生应用开发。","ja":"UI/UXエージェントがiOS Human Interface GuidelinesとSwiftUIパターンをマスターする必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"iOS Human Interface Guidelines와 SwiftUI 패턴을 마스터해야 하는 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan dominar las pautas de interfaz humana de iOS y los patrones de SwiftUI para el desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX qui ont besoin de maîtriser les directives d''interface utilisateur humaine d''iOS et les modèles de SwiftUI pour le développement d''applications natives.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die die iOS-Richtlinien für die menschliche Benutzeroberfläche und die SwiftUI-Muster für die native App-Entwicklung beherrschen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de UI/UX que precisam dominar as Diretrizes de Interface Humana do iOS e os padrões do SwiftUI para desenvolvimento de aplicativos nativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, которым необходимо овладеть руководящими принципами интерфейса человека iOS и шаблонами SwiftUI для разработки родных приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / الخبرة الذين يحتاجون إلى التسلط على إرشادات واجهة المستخدم البشرية لنظام التشغيل iOS وأنماط SwiftUI لتطوير التطبيقات الأصلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design polished iOS interfaces using SwiftUI, implementing NavigationStack, TabView, and adaptive layouts, while leveraging SF Symbols and system typography for accessible and intuitive user experiences.","zh":"赋予代理设计精美的iOS界面使用SwiftUI，实现NavigationStack、TabView和自适应布局，同时利用SF Symbols和系统字体实现可访问和直观的用户体验。","ja":"SwiftUIを使用して洗練されたiOSインターフェイスを設計し、NavigationStack、TabView、適応型レイアウトを実装し、SF Symbolsとシステムフォントを利用してアクセスしやすく直感的なユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現します。","ko":"SwiftUI를 사용하여 정교한 iOS 인터페이스를 설계하고 NavigationStack, TabView 및 적응형 레이아웃을 구현하며 SF Symbols와 시스템 글꼴을 활용하여 접근성과 직관적인 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar interfaces de iOS pulidas utilizando SwiftUI, implementando NavigationStack, TabView y diseños adaptables, aprovechando los símbolos SF y la tipografía del sistema para experiencias de usuario accesibles e intuitivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des interfaces iOS polies en utilisant SwiftUI, en implémentant NavigationStack, TabView et des dispositions adaptatives, en exploitant les symboles SF et la typographie du système pour des expériences utilisateur accessibles et intuitives.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, mit SwiftUI polierte iOS-Oberflächen zu entwerfen, indem sie NavigationStack, TabView und adaptive Layouts implementieren und SF-Symbole sowie Systemtypografie für zugängliche und intuitiv bedienbare Benutzeroberflächen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar interfaces iOS polidas usando o SwiftUI, implementando NavigationStack, TabView e layouts adaptáveis, aproveitando os símbolos SF e a tipografia do sistema para experiências de usuário acessíveis e intuitivas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать отполированные интерфейсы iOS с помощью SwiftUI, реализуя NavigationStack, TabView и адаптивные макеты, а также использует SF Symbols и системную типографику для доступных и интуитивных пользовательских опытов.","ar":"تمكين العميل من ت