ext.js 웹사이트용 블로그 포스트 포맷터, MDX 시스템 자동 처리","es":"El formateador de publicaciones de blog estructura el contenido en archivos markdown para sitios web de portfolio de Next.js","fr":"Le formateur de billets de blog structure le contenu en fichiers markdown pour les sites web de portfolio Next.js","de":"Der Blog-Beitrag-Formatter strukturiert den Inhalt in Markdown-Dateien für Next.js-Portfolio-Websites","pt":"O formatador de postagens de blog ajuda a organizar conteúdo em markdown para portfolios Next.js. Ele processa automaticamente os posts e os armazena na past...","ru":"Форматировщик блог-постов помогает организовать контент в markdown для портфолио Next.js. Он автоматически обрабатывает посты и хранит их в папке _posts.","ar":"مُصمم منشورات المدونة يساعد في تنظيم المحتوى في ملفات markdown لمنصات Next.js. يقوم بمعالجة المنشورات تلقائيًا ويخزّنها في مجلد _posts.","en":"Check out my site."},"definition":{"en":"Check out my site."},"features":{"zh":["自动格式化Markdown文件","支持Next.js MDX系统","自定义模板","按文件夹组织博客文章"],"ja":["Markdownファイルを自動で整形","Next.js MDXシステムをサポート","カスタムテンプレート","フォルダでブログ投稿を整理"],"ko":["Markdown 파일 자동 포맷팅","Next.js MDX 시스템 지원","사용자 정의 템플릿","폴더로 블로그 포스트 정리"],"es":["Estructuración de contenido de blog en archivos markdown","Compatibilidad con el sistema MDX de Next.js","Plantilla personalizable para publicaciones de blog","Procesamiento automático de publicaciones de blog","Almacenamiento de publicaciones de blog en el directorio _posts/"],"fr":["Structuration du contenu de blog en fichiers markdown","Compatibilité avec le système MDX de Next.js","Modèle personnalisable pour les billets de blog","Traitement automatique des billets de blog","Stockage des billets de blog dans le répertoire _posts/"],"de":["Strukturierung von Blog-Inhalten in Markdown-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit dem MDX-System von Next.js","Anpassbares Template für Blog-Beiträge","Automatische Verarbeitung von Blog-Beiträgen","Speicherung von Blog-Beiträgen im _posts/-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Formatação automática de postagens de blog","Organização de conteúdo em markdown","Compatibilidade com portfolios Next.js","Armazenamento de posts na pasta _posts","Suporte a frontmatter e templates"],"ru":["Автоматическое форматирование блог-постов","Организация контента в markdown","Совместимость с портфолио Next.js","Хранение постов в папке _posts","Поддержка frontmatter и шаблонов"],"ar":["تنسيق تلقائي لمنشورات المدونة","تنظيم المحتوى في ملفات markdown","التوافق مع منصات Next.js","خزن المنشورات في مجلد _posts","دعم frontmatter والقوالب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","博客文章格式化","Markdown","MDX","自动化工具","开发效率"],"ja":["Next.js","ブログ投稿フォーマッター","Markdown","MDX","自動化ツール","開発効率"],"ko":["Next.js","블로그 포스트 포맷터","Markdown","MDX","자동화 도구","개발 효율성"],"es":["formato de publicaciones de blog","Next.js","markdown","MDX","portfolio","sitio web","desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo","automatización de contenido"],"fr":["formateur de billets de blog","Next.js","markdown","MDX","portfolio","site web","développement web","outils de développement","automatisation de contenu"],"de":["Blog-Beitrag-Formatter","Next.js","Markdown","MDX","Portfolio","Website","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Inhaltsautomatisierung"],"pt":["formatador de postagens de blog","Next.js","markdown","portfolio","frontmatter","template","desenvolvimento web","otimização de SEO"],"ru":["форматировщик блог-постов","Next.js","markdown","портфолио","frontmatter","шаблон","веб-разработка","оптимизация SEO"],"ar":["مُصمم منشورات المدونة","Next.js","markdown","منصة","frontmatter","قالب","تطوير الويب","تحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"santosrai","repo":"santosrai.github.io","repoPath":"santosrai/santosrai.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"blog-post-formatter","description":"Format blog content into properly structured markdown files for Next.js portfolio blog. Use when user wants to: (1) Format raw blog content into markdown with frontmatter, (2) Create new blog posts from topics or titles, (3) Generate blog post files with proper metadata (title, excerpt, date, author) and save to _posts/ directory. Automatically generates excerpts, converts titles to kebab-case filenames, and ensures proper frontmatter format.","bodyPreview":"Format blog content into properly structured markdown files for the Next.js portfolio website. All blog posts are stored in `_posts/` directory and automatically processed by the site''s MDX system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **File location**: `_posts/{slug}.md` (slug is kebab-case of title)\n- **Frontmatter format**: See [references/post-structure.md](references/post-structure.md)\n- **Template**: See [assets/template.md](assets/template.md)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Format Existing Content\n\nWhen user pro","body":"Format blog content into properly structured markdown files for the Next.js portfolio website. All blog posts are stored in `_posts/` directory and automatically processed by the site''s MDX system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **File location**: `_posts/{slug}.md` (slug is kebab-case of title)\n- **Frontmatter format**: See [references/post-structure.md](references/post-structure.md)\n- **Template**: See [assets/template.md](assets/template.md)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Format Existing Content\n\nWhen user provides raw blog content:\n\n1. **Extract or generate title**:\n   - If first line is a heading (H1), use it as title\n   - If content starts with text, extract first sentence or generate from content\n   - Ensure title is clear and descriptive\n\n2. **Generate excerpt**:\n   - Extract first meaningful paragraph (150-200 characters)\n   - Remove markdown formatting from excerpt\n   - If no suitable paragraph, generate summary from first few sentences\n   - Keep excerpt concise and engaging\n\n3. **Set metadata**:\n   - **Date**: Use current date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format if not provided\n   - **Author**: Default to `''Santosh Rai''` (wrapped in single quotes)\n   - **Title**: Wrap in single quotes in frontmatter\n\n4. **Format content**:\n   - Do NOT include an H1 heading in the content (the page component already displays the title from frontmatter)\n   - Start content directly with paragraphs or H2 headings\n   - Preserve user''s original markdown formatting\n   - Validate markdown syntax (code blocks, lists, links)\n\n5. **Generate filename**:\n   - Convert title to kebab-case (lowercase, hyphens for spaces)\n   - Remove special characters, keep only alphanumeric and hyphens\n   - Example: \"Understanding JavaScript\" → `understanding-javascript.md`\n\n6. **Save file**: Write to `_posts/{slug}.md`\n\n### 2. Create New Post\n\nWhen user provides topic/title:\n\n1. **Generate frontmatter**:\n   - Use provided title or generate from topic\n   - Create excerpt placeholder or generate from topic description\n   - Set date to current date\n   - Set author to `''Santosh Rai''`\n\n2. **Create structure**:\n   - Do NOT add an H1 heading (the page component already displays the title from frontmatter)\n   - Start content directly with paragraphs or H2 headings\n   - Add placeholder sections or basic outline\n   - Use template from `assets/template.md` as starting point\n\n3. **Save file**: Write to `_posts/{slug}.md`\n\n### 3. Auto-Generation Rules\n\n**Excerpt generation**:\n- Extract first paragraph (up to 200 characters)\n- Remove markdown syntax (links, bold, code)\n- If paragraph is too short, include next sentence\n- Ensure excerpt is complete and grammatically correct\n\n**Title to slug conversion**:\n- Convert to lowercase\n- Replace spaces with hyphens\n- Remove special characters (keep only alphanumeric and hyphens)\n- Remove leading/trailing hyphens\n- Examples:\n  - \"What is JavaScript?\" → `what-is-javascript`\n  - \"Design Patterns With VBA\" → `design-patterns-with-vba`\n  - \"Simple calculator in javascript using MVC pattern\" → `simple-calculator-in-javascript-using-mvc-pattern`\n\n**Date format**: Always use `YYYY-MM-DD` (e.g., `''2024-01-20''`)\n\n## Frontmatter Format\n\nAll posts must include this exact frontmatter structure:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: ''Post Title''\nexcerpt: ''Brief description''\ndate: ''YYYY-MM-DD''\nauthor: ''Santosh Rai''\n---\n```\n\n**Important**: All values must be wrapped in single quotes.\n\n## Validation\n\nBefore saving, verify:\n- Frontmatter has all required fields (title, excerpt, date, author)\n- Date is in YYYY-MM-DD format\n- All frontmatter values are wrapped in single quotes\n- Content does NOT start with an H1 heading (title is displayed from frontmatter)\n- Filename is valid kebab-case slug\n- File will be saved in `_posts/` directory\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Format existing content**\n```\nUser: \"Here''s my blog post about JavaScript closures...\"\n\nOutput: Creates _posts/javascript-closures.md with:\n- Title extracted/generated from content\n- Excerpt from first paragraph\n- Current date\n- Properly formatted markdown\n```\n\n**Example 2: Create new post**\n```\nUser: \"Create a blog post about React hooks\"\n\nOutput: Creates _posts/react-hooks.md with:\n- Title: \"React Hooks\"\n- Generated excerpt about React hooks\n- Current date\n- Basic structure starting with content (no H1 heading)\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **Post structure details**: See [references/post-structure.md](references/post-structure.md) for complete format specification and examples\n- **Template**: See [assets/template.md](assets/template.md) for reusable blog post template\n\n## Integration\n\nThe formatted files integrate automatically with the existing blog system:\n- `lib/mdx.ts` reads all `.md` files from `_posts/`\n- Posts are sorted by date (newest first)\n- Individual posts accessible at `/blog/[slug]`\n- Blog listing at `/blog` displays all posts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:11:41.155Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Management Agents needing advanced markdown formatting capabilities for Next.js portfolio websites.","zh":"非常适合需要高级markdown格式化功能的内容管理代理，用于Next.js_portfolio网站。","ja":"Next.jsポートフォリオサイトで高度なMarkdownフォーマット機能を必要とするコンテンツ管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Next.js 포트폴리오 웹사이트에서 고급 마크다운 형식 기능을 필요로 하는 콘텐츠 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de contenido que necesitan capacidades de formato de markdown avanzadas para sitios web de portafolio de Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de contenu ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de mise en forme de markdown avancées pour les sites web de portfolio Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Markdown-Formatierungsfunktionen für Next.js-Portfolio-Websites benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conteúdo que necessitam de capacidades de formatação de markdown avançadas para sites de portfólio Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления контентом, которым требуются расширенные возможности форматирования markdown для сайтов-портфолио Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المحتوى الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تنسيق markdown متقدمة لمواقع محفظة Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to format blog content into properly structured markdown files using MDX system, with support for frontmatter format and template-based generation, leveraging file locations like `_posts/{slug}.md` and protocols like kebab-case slug formatting.","zh":"使得代理能够使用MDX系统将博客内容格式化为正确结构的markdown文件，支持frontmatter格式和基于模板的生成，利用文件位置如 `_posts/{slug}.md` 和协议如kebab-case slug格式化。","ja":"エージェントがMDXシステムを使用してブログコンテンツを適切に構造化されたMarkdownファイルにフォーマットできるようにし、フロントマター形式とテンプレートベースの生成をサポートし、 `_posts/{slug}.md` のようなファイル位置やケバブケーススラッグ形式などのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 MDX 시스템을 사용하여 블로그 콘텐츠를 적절하게 구조화된 마크다운 파일로 형식화할 수 있도록 하며, frontmatter 형식 및 템플릿 기반 생성을 지원하며, `_posts/{slug}.md`와 같은 파일 위치 및 캐밥 케이스 슬러그 형식화와 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dar formato a contenido de blog en archivos markdown estructurados correctamente utilizando el sistema MDX, con soporte para formato frontmatter y generación basada en plantillas, aprovechando ubicaciones de archivos como `_posts/{slug}.md` y protocolos como formato de slug con guiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de formater le contenu du blog en fichiers markdown structurés correctement en utilisant le système MDX, avec une prise en charge du format frontmatter et de la génération basée sur des modèles, en exploitant des emplacements de fichiers tels que `_posts/{slug}.md` et des protocoles tels que la mise en forme de slug avec traits d''union.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Blog-Inhalt in ordnungsgemäß strukturierte Markdown-Dateien zu formatieren, indem sie das MDX-System verwenden, mit Unterstützung für Frontmatter-Format und templatebasierte Generierung, unter Ausnutzung von Dateispeicherorten wie `_posts/{slug}.md` und Protokollen wie Bindestrich-Formatierung von Slugs.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a formatar o conteúdo do blog em arquivos markdown estruturados corretamente usando o sistema MDX, com suporte ao formato frontmatter e geração baseada em modelos, aproveitando locais de arquivos como `_posts/{slug}.md` e protocolos como formatação de slug em kebab-case.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью форматировать контент блога в правильно структурированные файлы markdown с помощью системы MDX, с поддержкой формата frontmatter и генерацией на основе шаблонов, используя местоположения файлов, такие как `_posts/{slug}.md`, и протоколы, такие как форматирование slug в kebab-case.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تنسيق محتوى المدونة في ملفات markdown منظمّة بشكل صحيح باستخدام نظام MDX، مع دعم تنسيق frontmatter والجيل القائم على القوالب، مع الاستفادة من مواقع الملفات مثل `_posts/{slug}.md` وبروتوكولات مثل تنسيق slug في kebab-case."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating blog post formatting for Next.js sites","Generating markdown files with standardized frontmatter","Processing blog content for MDX system integration"],"zh":["为Next.js站点自动化博客文章格式化","使用标准化frontmatter生成markdown文件","处理博客内容以集成MDX系统"],"ja":["Next.jsサイトのブログ投稿のフォーマットを自動化する","標準化されたフロントマターでMarkdownファイルを生成する","ブログコンテンツをMDXシステムに統合するために処理する"],"ko":["Next.js 사이트의 블로그 게시물 형식화를 자동화하는 것","표준화된 frontmatter로 마크다운 파일을 생성하는 것","MDX 시스템 통합을 위해 블로그 콘텐츠를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Automatización del formato de publicaciones de blog para sitios de Next.js","Generación de archivos markdown con frontmatter estandarizado","Procesamiento de contenido de blog para la integración del sistema MDX"],"fr":["Automatisation de la mise en forme des publications de blog pour les sites Next.js","Génération de fichiers markdown avec frontmatter standardisé","Traitement de contenu de blog pour l''intégration du système MDX"],"de":["Automatisierung der Formatierung von Blog-Beiträgen für Next.js-Seiten","Erzeugung von Markdown-Dateien mit standardisiertem Frontmatter","Verarbeitung von Blog-Inhalt für die Integration des MDX-Systems"],"pt":["Automatizar a formatação de posts de blog para sites Next.js","Gerar arquivos markdown com frontmatter padronizado","Processar o conteúdo do blog para integração com o sistema MDX"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование постов в блоге для сайтов Next.js","Генерировать файлы markdown с стандартизированным frontmatter","Обрабатывать контент блога для интеграции с системой MDX"],"ar":["تحسين تنسيق منشورات المدونة تلقائيًا لمواقع Next.js","جعل ملفات markdown مع frontmatter معياري","معالجة محتوى المدونة لتكامل نظام MDX"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `_posts/` directory","Limited to Next.js portfolio websites with MDX system","Dependent on specific frontmatter format and template structure"],"zh":["需要访问 `_posts/` 目录","仅限于具有MDX系统的Next.js_portfolio网站","依赖于特定的frontmatter格式和模板结构"],"ja":[" `_posts/` ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","MDXシステムを備えたNext.jsポートフォリオサイトに限定される","特定のフロントマター形式とテンプレート構造に依存する"],"ko":[" `_posts/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","MDX 시스템을 사용하는 Next.js 포트폴리오 웹사이트에만 적용됩니다","특정 frontmatter 형식 및 템플릿 구조에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `_posts/`","Limitado a sitios web de portafolio de Next.js con sistema MDX","Dependiente de un formato de frontmatter específico y estructura de plantilla"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `_posts/`","Limité aux sites web de portfolio Next.js avec système MDX","Dépendant d''un format de frontmatter spécifique et d''une structure de modèle"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `_posts/`","Begrenzt auf Next.js-Portfolio-Websites mit MDX-System","Abhängig von einem bestimmten Frontmatter-Format und einer Template-Struktur"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `_posts/`","Limitado a sites de portfólio Next.js com sistema MDX","Dependente de formato de frontmatter específico e estrutura de modelo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `_posts/`","Ограничен для сайтов-портфолио Next.js с системой MDX","Зависит от конкретного формата frontmatter и структуры шаблона"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `_posts/`","محدود لمواقع المحفظة Next.js بنظام MDX","يعتمد على تنسيق محدد ل frontmatter وهيكل القالب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
