150","ar":"التحليل العميق مع Analyze-Think 150","en":"31-analyze-think-150"},"description":{"zh":"Analyze-Think 150 协议是一种提高质量思考的AI技能，适用于代码审查、调试和决策等场景","ja":"Analyze-Think 150 プロトコルは、コードレビュー、デバッグ、意思決定などのシナリオで質の高い思考を実現するAIスキルです","ko":"Analyze-Think 150 프로토콜은 코드 리뷰, 디버깅, 의사결정 등의 시나리오에서 높은 품질의思考을 가능하게 하는 AI 기술입니다","es":"El protocolo Analyze-Think 150 es una habilidad que te permite pensar profundamente y resolver problemas de manera efectiva.","fr":"Le protocole Analyze-Think 150 est une compétence qui vous permet de penser en profondeur et de résoudre des problèmes de manière efficace.","de":"Das Analyze-Think-150-Protokoll ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Ihnen ermöglicht, tief zu denken und Probleme effektiv zu lösen.","pt":"Analyze-Think 150 é um protocolo que promove a qualidade do pensamento em qualquer situação, ajudando a resolver problemas complexos e tomar decisões informadas","ru":"Analyze-Think 150 - это протокол, который способствует качеству мышления в любой ситуации, giúpая решать сложные проблемы и принимать обоснованные решения","ar":"Analyze-Think 150 هو بروتوكول يروج لجودة التفكير في أي حالة، مما يساعد على حل المشكلات المعقدة واتخاذ قرارات مدروسة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高代码审查质量","增强调试能力","优化决策过程","提高问题解决能力","增强代码分析能力","支持规划和策略"],"ja":["コードレビューの品質を高める","デバッグ能力を向上させる","意思決定プロセスを最適化する","問題解決能力を高める","コード分析能力を向上させる","計画と戦略をサポートする"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 품질 향상","디버깅 능력增强","의사결정 프로세스 최적화","문제 해결 능력 향상","코드 분석 능력增强","계획과 전략 지원"],"es":["Resolución de problemas y depuración","Toma de decisiones a cualquier escala","Revisión y análisis de código","Planificación y estrategia","Comprensión de sistemas complejos","Evaluación de opciones y compensaciones"],"fr":["Résolution de problèmes et débogage","Prise de décision à toute échelle","Révision et analyse de code","Planification et stratégie","Compréhension de systèmes complexes","Évaluation d''options et compromis"],"de":["Problemlösung und Fehlersuche","Entscheidungsfindung auf jeder Ebene","Code-Überprüfung und -Analyse","Planung und Strategie","Verständnis komplexer Systeme","Bewertung von Optionen und Kompromissen"],"pt":["Pensamento crítico e profundo","Resolução de problemas complexos","Tomada de decisões informadas","Análise de código e revisão","Planejamento e estratégia","Entendimento de sistemas complexos"],"ru":["Критическое и глубокое мышление","Решение сложных проблем","Принятие обоснованных решений","Анализ кода и ревизия","Планирование и стратегия","Понимание сложных систем"],"ar":["التفكير النقدي والعميق","حل المشكلات المعقدة","اتخاذ قرارات مدروسة","تحليل الشفرة ومراجعتها","التخطيط والاستراتيجية","فهم الأنظمة المعقدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI技能","代码审查","调试","决策","问题解决","代码分析","规划","策略","质量思考","彻底分析"],"ja":["AIスキル","コードレビュー","デバッグ","意思決定","問題解決","コード分析","計画","戦略","質の高い思考","徹底的な分析"],"ko":["AI기술","코드 리뷰","디버깅","의사결정","문제 해결","코드 분석","계획","전략","높은 품질의思考","철저한 분석"],"es":["análisis de código","resolución de problemas","toma de decisiones","planificación","estrategia","sistemas complejos","desarrollo de software","pensamiento crítico"],"fr":["analyse de code","résolution de problèmes","prise de décision","planification","stratégie","systèmes complexes","développement de logiciels","pensée critique"],"de":["Code-Analyse","Problemlösung","Entscheidungsfindung","Planung","Strategie","komplexe Systeme","Software-Entwicklung","kritisches Denken"],"pt":["pensamento crítico","resolução de problemas","tomada de decisões","análise de código","planejamento estratégico","entendimento de sistemas complexos","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["критическое мышление","решение проблем","принятие решений","анализ кода","стратегическое планирование","понимание сложных систем","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التفكير النقدي","حل المشكلات","اتخاذ القرارات","تحليل الشفرة","التخطيط الاستراتيجي","فهم الأنظمة المعقدة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"MykhailoDmytriakha","repo":"my-preacher-helper","repoPath":"MykhailoDmytriakha/my-preacher-helper","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"31-analyze-think-150","description":"[31] ANALYZE. Universal deep thinking methodology for any situation requiring quality reasoning. Use when solving problems, debugging, making decisions, analyzing code, planning, reviewing, or anytime you need thorough thinking instead of surface-level responses. Triggers on \\think deeply\\, \\analyze thoroughly\\, \\reason carefully\\, \\deep thinking\\, \\understand completely\\, or any task requiring careful thought.","bodyPreview":"# Analyze-Think 150 Protocol\n\n**Core Principle:** Think deeply, reason thoroughly, understand completely. Quality thinking for any situation.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\n**Universal trigger:** Any situation requiring quality thinking over quick responses.\n\n**Specific triggers:**\n- Problem solving and debugging\n- Decision making at any scale\n- Code review and analysis\n- Planning and strategy\n- Understanding complex systems\n- Evaluating options and trade-offs\n- When user says \"think deeply\", \"a","body":"# Analyze-Think 150 Protocol\n\n**Core Principle:** Think deeply, reason thoroughly, understand completely. Quality thinking for any situation.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\n**Universal trigger:** Any situation requiring quality thinking over quick responses.\n\n**Specific triggers:**\n- Problem solving and debugging\n- Decision making at any scale\n- Code review and analysis\n- Planning and strategy\n- Understanding complex systems\n- Evaluating options and trade-offs\n- When user says \"think deeply\", \"analyze\", \"reason carefully\"\n\n**Key insight:** This skill applies at ANY point in work, not just at the beginning.\n\n## The 150% Rule\n\n- **100% Core:** Complete internal analysis to coherent conclusion\n- **50% Enhancement:** Identify hidden assumptions, risks, and alternative interpretations\n\n## Execution Protocol\n\n### Step 1: IMMEDIATE PAUSE\nBefore any response, stop and prepare for systematic analysis.\n\n### Step 2: MODEL FORMATION\nBuild understanding: **Goal → Context → Constraints → Dependencies**\n- What is the real objective?\n- What is the full context?\n- What are the constraints?\n- What depends on this?\n\n### Step 3: ASSUMPTION AUDIT\nList and test every assumption:\n- What am I assuming without proof?\n- Which assumptions are verified vs unverified?\n- What evidence supports each assumption?\n\n### Step 4: ALTERNATIVE ANALYSIS\nGenerate 3+ different interpretations:\n- How else could this problem be viewed?\n- What''s the opposite perspective?\n- What if my initial assumption is wrong?\n\n### Step 5: RISK & FAILURE ANALYSIS\nIdentify potential failures:\n- What could go wrong?\n- What''s the impact of wrong assumptions?\n- How can I mitigate risks?\n\n### Step 6: SYNTHESIS & VALIDATION\nCombine insights into coherent model:\n- Can I explain this simply?\n- Is anything missing?\n- Does the logic hold together?\n\n## Mandatory Analysis Questions\n\nAsk yourself before responding:\n1. \"What do I actually understand about this problem?\"\n2. \"What am I assuming without verification?\"\n3. \"What could disprove my current conclusion?\"\n4. \"How would this look from another perspective?\"\n5. \"What am I missing?\"\n6. \"Can I explain this in simple words?\"\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen using Deep-Think 150, structure response as:\n\n```\n🧠 **Deep-Think 150 Analysis**\n\n**Understanding:**\n[Core problem/goal identified]\n\n**Assumptions Checked:**\n- ✅ Verified: [assumption with evidence]\n- ⚠️ Unverified: [assumption needing validation]\n\n**Alternative Perspectives:**\n- [Alternative 1]\n- [Alternative 2]\n\n**Risks Identified:**\n- [Risk and mitigation]\n\n**Conclusion:**\n[Well-reasoned conclusion with confidence level]\n```\n\n## Operational Rules\n\n1. **NO SURFACE SOLUTIONS:** Never respond without full internal analysis\n2. **COMPLETE BEFORE PROCEEDING:** Finish analysis before any action\n3. **QUESTION EVERYTHING:** Challenge every assumption\n4. **MULTIPLE PERSPECTIVES:** Consider problem from different angles\n5. **SIMPLE EXPLANATION TEST:** If you can''t explain simply, analysis is incomplete\n6. **CONTINUOUS VALIDATION:** Keep validating throughout work\n\n## Examples\n\n### ❌ BAD (Surface Response)\n```\nUser: \"Fix the login bug\"\nAI: \"I''ll add a null check to the login function.\"\n```\nProblem: No analysis, jumped to solution based on assumption.\n\n### ✅ GOOD (Deep-Think Response)\n```\nUser: \"Fix the login bug\"\nAI: \"🧠 Deep-Think 150 Analysis\n\nUnderstanding: Login fails for some users. Need to identify root cause.\n\nAssumptions Checked:\n- ⚠️ Unverified: Bug is in login function (need to trace full flow)\n- ⚠️ Unverified: It''s a null pointer issue (no evidence yet)\n\nAlternative Perspectives:\n1. Could be authentication API timeout\n2. Could be session management issue\n3. Could be database connection problem\n\nRisks: Fixing symptom without finding root cause = bug returns\n\nConclusion: First, I''ll trace the full authentication flow and check \nerror logs before proposing a fix. Let me investigate...\"\n```\n\n## Failure Modes & Recovery\n\n| Failure | Detection | Recovery |\n|---------|-----------|----------|\n| **Premature Action** | Responding without analysis | Stop, return to Step 1 |\n| **Hidden Assumptions** | Unverified beliefs in reasoning | Explicit assumption testing |\n| **Single Perspective** | Only one interpretation considered | Generate 3+ alternatives |\n| **Complex Explanation** | Can''t explain simply | Simplify model, extract core |\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis Skill is **universal** and applies to any situation requiring quality thinking:\n- **At the start:** Understanding new problems or requests\n- **In the middle:** When stuck or facing complexity\n- **At decision points:** Before making important choices\n- **During review:** Analyzing code, plans, or solutions\n- **Anytime:** When you need to think, not just react\n\n## Session Log Entry (MANDATORY)\n\nAfter completing this skill, write to `.sessions/SESSION_[date]-[name].md`:\n\n```\n### [date - HH\"MM] Analyze-Think 150 Complete\n**Topic:** <what was analyzed>\n**Conclusion:** <key insight/decision>\n**Risks:** <identified risks>\n```\n\n---\n\n**Remember:** Deep-Think 150 is not about slowing down — it''s about thinking better. Apply the depth appropriate to the complexity. Simple questions get simple analysis; complex problems get full Deep-Think treatment.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:12:21.193Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cognitive Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced critical thinking for complex problem solving and decision making","zh":"适合于 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 等认知代理，需要高级批判性思维来解决复杂问题和决策","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの認知エージェントに適しており、複雑な問題解決と意思決定に高度な批判的思考が必要","ko":"Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 인지 에이전트에 적합하며, 복잡한 문제 해결 및 의사 결정에 고급 비판적 사고가 필요","es":"Ideal para Agentes Cognitivos como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren pensamiento crítico avanzado para la resolución de problemas complejos y la toma de decisiones","fr":"Idéal pour les agents cognitifs comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une pensée critique avancée pour la résolution de problèmes complexes et la prise de décision","de":"Ideal für kognitive Agenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die ein fortschrittliches kritisches Denken für die Lösung komplexer Probleme und die Entscheidungsfindung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Cognitivos como Claude Code e AutoGPT que exigem pensamento crítico avançado para resolução de problemas complexos e tomada de decisões","ru":"Идеально подходит для когнитивных агентов, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих продвинутого критического мышления для решения сложных проблем и принятия решений","ar":"مثالي للعملاء المعرفيين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يتطلبون التفكير النقدي المتقدم لحل المشكلات المعقدة واتخاذ القرارات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to engage in thorough analysis and reasoning for quality thinking, utilizing protocols like the Analyze-Think 150 for enhanced decision making, code review, and strategy planning through understanding complex systems and evaluating trade-offs","zh":"赋予代理进行彻底分析和推理以实现高质量思考，利用 Analyze-Think 150 等协议增强决策、代码审查和战略规划，通过理解复杂系统和评估权衡","ja":"エージェントに徹底的な分析と推論を実行させ、高品質な思考を実現する。Analyze-Think 150 などのプロトコルを利用して、意思決定、コードレビュー、戦略計画を強化し、複雑なシステムを理解し、トレードオフを評価","ko":"에이전트가 철저한 분석 및 추론을 수행하여 고품질 사고를 실현할 수 있도록 합니다. Analyze-Think 150과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 의사 결정, 코드 리뷰 및 전략 계획을 강화하고, 복잡한 시스템을 이해하고 트레이드 오프를 평가","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un análisis y razonamiento exhaustivos para una pensamiento de calidad, utilizando protocolos como el Analyze-Think 150 para una toma de decisiones mejorada, revisión de código y planificación de estrategias a través de la comprensión de sistemas complejos y la evaluación de compensaciones","fr":"Permet aux agents d''engager une analyse et un raisonnement approfondis pour une pensée de qualité, en utilisant des protocoles comme l''Analyze-Think 150 pour une prise de décision améliorée, une revue de code et une planification stratégique grâce à la compréhension de systèmes complexes et à l''évaluation de compromis","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine gründliche Analyse und Argumentation für qualitatives Denken durchzuführen, indem Protokolle wie das Analyze-Think 150 für eine verbesserte Entscheidungsfindung, Code-Überprüfung und Strategieplanung durch das Verständnis komplexer Systeme und die Bewertung von Kompromissen verwendet werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem uma análise minuciosa e raciocínio de qualidade para o pensamento, utilizando protocolos como o Analyze-Think 150 para uma tomada de decisões aprimorada, revisão de código e planejamento de estratégias por meio da compreensão de sistemas complexos e avaliação de trade-offs","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательный анализ и рассуждения для качественного мышления, используя протоколы, такие как Analyze-Think 150, для улучшения принятия решений, проверки кода и стратегического планирования посредством понимания сложных систем и оценки компромиссов","ar":"تمكّن العملاء من القيام بتحليل شامل وعقلاني للتفكير الجيد، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Analyze-Think 150 لتعزيز اتخاذ القرارات ومراجعة الشفرة وتخطيط الاستراتيجية من خلال فهم الأنظمة المعقدة وتقييم التبادل"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging intricate codebases","Evaluating options and trade-offs in strategic planning","Conducting in-depth code reviews and analysis"],"zh":["调试复杂的代码库","在战略规划中评估选项和权衡","进行深入的代码审查和分析"],"ja":["複雑なコードベースのデバッグ","戦略計画におけるオプションとトレードオフの評価","コードレビューと分析の実施"],"ko":["복잡한 코드베이스 디버깅","전략 계획에서 옵션 및 트레이드 오프 평가","코드 리뷰 및 분석 수행"],"es":["Depuración de bases de código intrincadas","Evaluación de opciones y compensaciones en la planificación estratégica","Realización de revisiones y análisis de código en profundidad"],"fr":["Débogage de bases de code complexes","Évaluation d''options et de compromis dans la planification stratégique","Conduite d''examens et d''analyses de code en profondeur"],"de":["Fehlersuche in komplexen Codebasen","Bewertung von Optionen und Kompromissen bei der strategischen Planung","Durchführung von Code-Überprüfungen und -Analysen in der Tiefe"],"pt":["Depuração de bases de código intrincadas","Avaliação de opções e trade-offs no planejamento estratégico","Realização de revisões e análises de código aprofundadas"],"ru":["Отладка сложных баз кода","Оценка вариантов и компромиссов при стратегическом планировании","Проведение глубоких обзоров и анализов кода"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء قواعد الشفرة المعقدة","تقييم الخيارات والتبادل في التخطيط الاستراتيجي","إجراء مراجعات وتحليلات شفرة متعمقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit user trigger, such as ''think deeply'' or ''analyze thoroughly''","May not be suitable for situations requiring quick responses"],"zh":["需要显式用户触发，例如 ''深入思考'' 或 ''彻底分析''","可能不适合需要快速响应的情况"],"ja":["明示的なユーザーによるトリガーが必要。たとえば ''深く考える'' または ''徹底的に分析''","迅速なレスポンスが必要な状況では適さない可能性"],"ko":["명시적인 사용자 트리거가 필요합니다. 예를 들어 ''깊이 생각'' 또는 ''彻底 분석''","빠른 응답이 필요한 상황에서는 적합하지 않을 수"],"es":["Requiere un desencadenador de usuario explícito, como ''piensa profundamente'' o ''analiza a fondo''","Puede no ser adecuado para situaciones que requieren respuestas rápidas"],"fr":["Nécessite un déclencheur d''utilisateur explicite, tel que ''pense profondément'' ou ''analyse soigneusement''","Peut ne pas être adapté pour les situations nécessitant des réponses rapides"],"de":["Benötigt einen expliziten Benutzertrigger, wie ''denke tief'' oder ''analysiere gründlich''","Kann für Situationen, die schnelle Antworten erfordern, nicht geeignet sein"],"pt":["Exige um gatilho de usuário explícito, como ''pense profundamente'' ou ''analise minuciosamente''","Pode não ser adequado para situações que exigem respostas rápidas"],"ru":["Требует явного триггера пользователя, такого как ''подумать глубоко'' или ''проанализировать тщательно''","Может быть не подходит для ситуаций, требующих быстрых ответов"],"ar":["يتطلب إشارة مستخدم صريحة، مثل ''تفكّر بعمق'' أو ''قُم بتحليل دقيق''","قد لا يكون مناسبًا للوضعيات التي تتطلب استجابات سريعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('miwtoo/credit-card-extraction/extracting-pdf-text', 'community', 'miwtoo', 'credit-card-extraction', 'miwtoo/credit-card-extraction', 'extracting-pdf-text', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z', '2026-02-18T08:12:17.941Z', NULL, '{"id":"miwtoo/credit-card-extraction/extracting-pdf-text","name":"extracting-pdf-text","description":{"zh":"此技能提供从PDF中提取文本的工具和指南，适用于语言模型的消费。支持简单文本PDF、PDF表格、扫描图像PDF和复杂布局的PDF","ja":"このスキルは、言語モデルで使用できる形式のPDFからテキストを抽出するためのツールとガイドを提供します。シンプルなテキストPDF、PDFの表、スキャンされた画像PDF、複雑なレイアウトのPDFをサポートしています","ko":"이 스킬은 언어 모델에서 사용할 수 있는 형식의 PDF에서 텍스트를 추출하는 도구와 가이드를 제공합니다. 단순 텍스트 PDF, PDF 표, 스캔된 이미지 PDF 및 복잡한 레이아웃의 PDF를 지원합니다","es":"Esta habilidad proporciona herramientas y orientación para extraer texto de PDFs en formatos adecuados para el consumo de modelos de lenguaje","fr":"Cette compétence fournit des outils et des conseils pour extraire du texte à partir de PDF dans des formats adaptés à la consommation de modèles de langage","de":"Diese Fähigkeit bietet Tools und Anleitung zur Extraktion von Text aus PDFs in Formaten, die für die Verarbeitung von Sprachmodellen geeignet sind","pt":"Esta habilidade fornece ferramentas e orientação para extrair texto de PDFs em formatos adequados para consumo de modelos de linguagem","ru":"Этот навык предоставляет инструменты и рекомендации для извлечения текста из PDF в форматах, подходящих для потребления языковыми моделями","ar":"توفر هذه المهارة أدوات وتوجيهات لاستخراج النص من ملفات PDF بالتنسيقات المناسبة لاستهلاك نماذج اللغة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PDF文本提取工具","ja":"PDFテキスト抽出ツール","ko":"PDF 텍스트 추출 도구","es":"Extraer texto de PDF para LLM","fr":"Extraction de texte PDF pour LLM","de":"PDF-Textextraktion für LLM","pt":"Extraia Texto de PDF para LLMs","ru":"Извлечение текста из PDF для LLM","ar":"استخراج نص من PDF ل LLMS","en":"extracting-pdf-text"},"descr