sApp: Automatisierung von Nachrichten","pt":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp: Automação de Mensagens","ru":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp: Автоматизация сообщений","ar":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp: أتمتة الرسائل","en":"sr-cardoso-whatsapp"},"description":{"zh":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp 是一个自动消息流开发工具，通过 Evolution API 和管理面板实现高效的消息发送","ja":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp は自動メッセージフロー開発ツールで、Evolution API と管理パネルを使用して効率的なメッセージ送信を実現する","ko":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp 는 자동 메시지 흐름 개발 도구로 Evolution API와 관리 패널을 사용하여 효율적인 메시지 전송을 구현합니다","es":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp es una herramienta para automatizar y gestionar mensajes automáticos a través de la Evolution API y un panel de administración","fr":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp est un outil pour automatiser et gérer les messages automatiques via l''Evolution API et un panneau d''administration","de":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung und Verwaltung von automatischen Nachrichten über die Evolution API und ein Administrationspanel","pt":"O Sr Cardoso WhatsApp é uma solução para automação de mensagens via Evolution API e painel admin. Permite operar e evoluir o fluxo de mensagens automáticas d...","ru":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp - это решение для автоматизации сообщений через Evolution API и панель администратора. Позволяет оперировать и совершенствовать поток авт...","ar":"Sr Cardoso WhatsApp هو حل لأتمتة الرسائل عبر Evolution API ولوحة الإدارة. يسمح بتشغيل وتحسين تدفق الرسائل الآلية بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动消息流开发","Evolution API 集成","管理面板支持","高效的消息发送","可自定义的消息模板"],"ja":["自動メッセージフロー開発","Evolution API 統合","管理パネルサポート","効率的なメッセージ送信","カスタマイズ可能なメッセージテンプレート"],"ko":["자동 메시지 흐름 개발","Evolution API 통합","관리 패널 지원","효율적인 메시지 전송","사용자 정의 가능한 메시지 템플릿"],"es":["Automatización de mensajes","Integración con Evolution API","Panel de administración","Gestión de cron jobs","Esquemas de payload personalizables","Soporte para múltiples endpoints"],"fr":["Automatisation de messages","Intégration avec l''Evolution API","Panneau d''administration","Gestion de cron jobs","Schémas de payload personnalisables","Prise en charge de plusieurs points de terminaison"],"de":["Automatisierung von Nachrichten","Integration mit der Evolution API","Administrationspanel","Verwaltung von Cron-Jobs","Anpassbare Payload-Schemata","Unterstützung für multiple Endpunkte"],"pt":["Automação de mensagens via Evolution API","Integração com painel admin","Envio de notificações personalizadas","Cron endpoints para agendamento","Schemas de payload personalizáveis"],"ru":["Автоматизация сообщений через Evolution API","Интеграция с панелью администратора","Отправка персонализированных уведомлений","Крон-пункты для планирования","Настраиваемые схемы полезной нагрузки"],"ar":["أتمتة الرسائل عبر Evolution API","التكامل مع لوحة الإدارة","إرسال إشعارات مخصصة","نقاط الكرون لجدولة","سخامات الحمولة القابلة للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Sr Cardoso WhatsApp","自动消息流","Evolution API","管理面板","消息发送","开发工具"],"ja":["Sr Cardoso WhatsApp","自動メッセージフロー","Evolution API","管理パネル","メッセージ送信","開発ツール"],"ko":["Sr Cardoso WhatsApp","자동 메시지 흐름","Evolution API","관리 패널","메시지 전송","개발 도구"],"es":["automatización de mensajería","Evolution API","panel de administración","cron jobs","esquemas de payload","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de mensajería","integración de APIs"],"fr":["automatisation de messagerie","Evolution API","panneau d''administration","cron jobs","schémas de payload","développement de logiciels","technologies de messagerie","intégration d''API"],"de":["Automatisierung von Nachrichten","Evolution API","Administrationspanel","Cron-Jobs","Payload-Schemata","Softwareentwicklung","Nachrichtentechnologien","API-Integration"],"pt":["automação de mensagens","Evolution API","painel admin","notificações personalizadas","cron endpoints","schemas de payload","desenvolvimento de software","soluções de automação"],"ru":["автоматизация сообщений","Evolution API","панель администратора","персонализированные уведомления","крон-пункты","схемы полезной нагрузки","разработка программного обеспечения","решения для автоматизации"],"ar":["أتمتة الرسائل","Evolution API","لوحة الإدارة","إشعارات مخصصة","نقاط الكرون","سخامات الحمولة","تطوير البرمجيات","حلول الأتمتة"]}},"owner":"yurikrat","repo":"sr-cardoso-barbearia-app","repoPath":"yurikrat/sr-cardoso-barbearia-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sr-cardoso-whatsapp","description":"Integracao WhatsApp via Evolution API no Sr Cardoso. Use quando configurar EVOLUTION_*, conectar instancias, ajustar notificacoes, cron jobs, filas de retry e mensagens automaticas.","bodyPreview":"# Sr Cardoso WhatsApp\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nOperar e evoluir o fluxo de mensagens automaticas via Evolution API e painel admin.\r\n\r\n## Arquivos-chave\r\n- `apps/server/src/services/whatsappNotifications.ts` (logica de envios).\r\n- `apps/server/src/lib/evolutionApi.ts` (cliente HTTP para Evolution).\r\n- `apps/server/src/routes/admin.ts` (endpoints admin WhatsApp).\r\n- `apps/server/src/routes/public.ts` (cron endpoints).\r\n- `packages/shared/src/schemas/whatsapp.schema.ts` (schemas de payload).\r\n- `apps/web/sr","body":"# Sr Cardoso WhatsApp\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nOperar e evoluir o fluxo de mensagens automaticas via Evolution API e painel admin.\r\n\r\n## Arquivos-chave\r\n- `apps/server/src/services/whatsappNotifications.ts` (logica de envios).\r\n- `apps/server/src/lib/evolutionApi.ts` (cliente HTTP para Evolution).\r\n- `apps/server/src/routes/admin.ts` (endpoints admin WhatsApp).\r\n- `apps/server/src/routes/public.ts` (cron endpoints).\r\n- `packages/shared/src/schemas/whatsapp.schema.ts` (schemas de payload).\r\n- `apps/web/src/pages/admin/WhatsappPage.tsx` (UI).\r\n\r\n## Env vars e infra\r\n- Usar `EVOLUTION_BASE_URL`, `EVOLUTION_API_KEY`, `EVOLUTION_INSTANCE_NAME`.\r\n- Usar `CRON_SECRET` para `/api/cron/*`.\r\n- Consultar `documento.md` e `docs/WHATSAPP_INFRA_PLAN.md` para rede/VM.\r\n\r\n## Dados no Firestore\r\n- Config em `settings/whatsapp-notifications`.\r\n- Fila em `whatsappMessageQueue`.\r\n- Logs/testes em `whatsappOutbound`.\r\n\r\n## Fluxos principais\r\n- Enviar confirmacao no `POST /api/bookings`.\r\n- Enviar lembrete via `POST /api/cron/send-reminders`.\r\n- Reprocessar fila via `POST /api/cron/process-queue`.\r\n- Enviar cancelamento via `POST /api/public/cancel/:cancelCode`.\r\n\r\n## Operacao da instacia\r\n- Checar status em `GET /api/admin/whatsapp/status`.\r\n- Conectar por QR ou pairing em `POST /api/admin/whatsapp/connect`.\r\n- Desconectar em `POST /api/admin/whatsapp/disconnect`.\r\n- Enviar teste em `POST /api/admin/whatsapp/send-test`.\r\n\r\n## Observacoes de negocio\r\n- Montar mensagens com nome do servico vindo de `settings/finance.services[].label`.\r\n- Manter textos em PT-BR e evitar PII desnecessaria.\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:11:53.996Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents managing WhatsApp messaging workflows through Evolution API integration.","zh":"Ideal for Automation Agents managing WhatsApp messaging workflows through Evolution API integration.","ja":"Ideal for Automation Agents managing WhatsApp messaging workflows through Evolution API integration.","ko":"Ideal for Automation Agents managing WhatsApp messaging workflows through Evolution API integration.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que gestionan flujos de mensajería de WhatsApp a través de la integración de la API de Evolution.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation gérant les flux de messagerie WhatsApp via l''intégration de l''API Evolution.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die WhatsApp-Nachrichtenworkflows über die Evolution-API-Integration verwalten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que gerenciam fluxos de mensagens do WhatsApp por meio da integração da API Evolution.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, которые управляют рабочими процессами обмена сообщениями WhatsApp через интеграцию с API Evolution.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يديرون تدفقات رسائل WhatsApp من خلال دمج API Evolution."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to operate and evolve automated WhatsApp messaging flows via Evolution API HTTP client, including admin panel endpoints for message management and cron-triggered notifications through structured payload schemas.","zh":"Enables agents to operate and evolve automated WhatsApp messaging flows via Evolution API HTTP client, including admin panel endpoints for message management and cron-triggered notifications through structured payload schemas.","ja":"Enables agents to operate and evolve automated WhatsApp messaging flows via Evolution API HTTP client, including admin panel endpoints for message management and cron-triggered notifications through structured payload schemas.","ko":"Enables agents to operate and evolve automated WhatsApp messaging flows via Evolution API HTTP client, including admin panel endpoints for message management and cron-triggered notifications through structured payload schemas.","es":"Permite a los agentes operar y evolucionar flujos de mensajería automatizados de WhatsApp a través del cliente HTTP de la API de Evolution, incluyendo puntos de conexión del panel de administración para la gestión de mensajes y notificaciones desencadenadas por cron a través de esquemas de cargas estructuradas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter et de faire évoluer des flux de messagerie automatisés WhatsApp via le client HTTP de l''API Evolution, y compris les points de terminaison du panneau d''administration pour la gestion des messages et les notifications déclenchées par cron via des schémas de charge structurés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, automatisierte WhatsApp-Nachrichtenflüsse über den HTTP-Client der Evolution-API zu betreiben und weiterzuentwickeln, einschließlich Administrator-Panel-Endpunkten für die Nachrichtenverwaltung und cron-gestartete Benachrichtigungen über strukturierte Payload-Schemata.","pt":"Permite que os agentes operem e evoluam fluxos de mensagens automatizados do WhatsApp por meio do cliente HTTP da API Evolution, incluindo endpoints de painel de administração para gerenciamento de mensagens e notificações disparadas por cron por meio de esquemas de payload estruturados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам работать и развивать автоматизированные потоки обмена сообщениями WhatsApp через HTTP-клиент API Evolution, включая конечные точки панели администратора для управления сообщениями и уведомления, срабатывающие по cron, через структурированные схемы полезной нагрузки.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بالعمل وتطوير تدفقات رسائل WhatsApp الآلية عبر عميل HTTP ل API Evolution، بما في ذلك نقاط النهاية للوحة الإدارة لإدارة الرسائل والإشعارات المفعلة بواسطة cron من خلال مخططات الحمولة المنظمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Operating automated WhatsApp message flows via Evolution API","Managing admin panel endpoints for WhatsApp configuration","Executing cron-triggered notification services","Validating WhatsApp payload schemas against shared standards"],"zh":["Operating automated WhatsApp message flows via Evolution API","Managing admin panel endpoints for WhatsApp configuration","Executing cron-triggered notification services","Validating WhatsApp payload schemas against shared standards"],"ja":["Operating automated WhatsApp message flows via Evolution API","Managing admin panel endpoints for WhatsApp configuration","Executing cron-triggered notification services","Validating WhatsApp payload schemas against shared standards"],"ko":["Operating automated WhatsApp message flows via Evolution API","Managing admin panel endpoints for WhatsApp configuration","Executing cron-triggered notification services","Validating WhatsApp payload schemas against shared standards"],"es":["Operar flujos de mensajes automatizados de WhatsApp a través de la API de Evolution","Gestionar puntos de conexión del panel de administración para la configuración de WhatsApp","Ejecutar servicios de notificación desencadenados por cron","Validar esquemas de carga de WhatsApp contra estándares compartidos"],"fr":["Exploiter des flux de messagerie automatisés WhatsApp via l''API Evolution","Gérer les points de terminaison du panneau d''administration pour la configuration de WhatsApp","Exécuter des services de notification déclenchés par cron","Valider les schémas de charge WhatsApp contre des normes partagées"],"de":["Automatisierte WhatsApp-Nachrichtenflüsse über die Evolution-API betreiben","Administrator-Panel-Endpunkte für die WhatsApp-Konfiguration verwalten","Cron-gestartete Benachrichtigungsdienste ausführen","WhatsApp-Payload-Schemata gegen gemeinsame Standards validieren"],"pt":["Operação de fluxos de mensagens automatizados do WhatsApp por meio da API Evolution","Gerenciamento de endpoints de painel de administração para configuração do WhatsApp","Execução de serviços de notificação disparados por cron","Validação de esquemas de payload do WhatsApp contra padrões compartilhados"],"ru":["Эксплуатация автоматизированных потоков обмена сообщениями WhatsApp через API Evolution","Управление конечными точками панели администратора для настройки WhatsApp","Выполнение сервисов уведомлений, срабатывающих по cron","Валидация схем полезной нагрузки WhatsApp против общих стандартов"],"ar":["تشغيل تدفقات رسائل WhatsApp الآلية عبر API Evolution","إدارة نقاط النهاية للوحة الإدارة لتكوين WhatsApp","تنفيذ خدمات الإشعارات المفعلة بواسطة cron","التحقق من مخططات الحمولة من WhatsApp مقابل المعايير المشتركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Evolution API integration","Dependent on specific schema validation from shared package","Limited to WhatsApp channel operations only"],"zh":["Requires Evolution API integration","Dependent on specific schema validation from shared package","Limited to WhatsApp channel operations only"],"ja":["Requires Evolution API integration","Dependent on specific schema validation from shared package","Limited to WhatsApp channel operations only"],"ko":["Requires Evolution API integration","Dependent on specific schema validation from shared package","Limited to WhatsApp channel operations only"],"es":["Requiere integración con la API de Evolution","Depende de la validación de esquemas específicos del paquete compartido","Limitado a operaciones del canal de WhatsApp solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec l''API Evolution","Dépend de la validation de schémas spécifiques du package partagé","Limité aux opérations du canal WhatsApp uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Evolution-API-Integration","Hängt von der Validierung spezifischer Schemata des gemeinsamen Pakets ab","Begrenzt auf WhatsApp-Kanal-Operationen nur"],"pt":["Exige integração da API Evolution","Dependente de validação de esquema específica do pacote compartilhado","Limitado a operações do canal WhatsApp apenas"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с API Evolution","Зависит от конкретной валидации схемы из общего пакета","Ограничен только операциями канала WhatsApp"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج API Evolution","يعتمد على التحقق من مخطط معين من الحزمة المشتركة","محدود لعمليات قناة WhatsApp فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
