니다","es":"El Agente de Revisión de Arquitectura evalúa el diseño del sistema, la operabilidad en la nube y la calidad del código","fr":"L''Agent de Révision d''Architecture évalue la conception du système, l''opérabilité dans le cloud et la qualité du code","de":"Der Architektur-Überprüfungs-Agent bewertet das Systemdesign, die Cloud-Operabilität und die Code-Qualität","pt":"O Agente de Revisão de Arquitetura avalia o design do sistema, a operabilidade nativa da nuvem e a qualidade do código","ru":"Агент обзора архитектуры оценивает проектирование системы, облачную оперативность и качество кода","ar":"يوفر وكيل مراجعة الهندسة المعمارية تقييمًا لتصميم النظام والتشغيل السحابي الأصلي وجودة الكود","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["评估系统设计","评估云原生操作性","评估代码质量","提供详细的审查报告","推荐解决方案","支持可观测的接受标准"],"ja":["システム設計の評価","クラウドネイティブ操作性の評価","コード品質の評価","詳細なレビュー報告書の提供","解決策の推奨","可観測な受け入れ基準のサポート"],"ko":["시스템 설계 평가","클라우드 네이티브 운영성 평가","코드 품질 평가","詳細한 리뷰 보고서 제공","해결책 권장","관찰 가능한 수용 기준 지원"],"es":["Evaluación del diseño del sistema","Análisis de la operabilidad en la nube","Revisión de la calidad del código","Informe de auditoría de arquitectura y código","Recomendaciones de solución para los hallazgos","Criterios de aceptación observables"],"fr":["Évaluation de la conception du système","Analyse de l''opérabilité dans le cloud","Examen de la qualité du code","Rapport d''audit d''architecture et de code","Recommandations de solution pour les constats","Critères d''acceptation observables"],"de":["Bewertung des Systemdesigns","Analyse der Cloud-Operabilität","Überprüfung der Code-Qualität","Architektur- und Code-Audit-Bericht","Lösungsempfehlungen für die Feststellungen","Beobachtbare Akzeptanzkriterien"],"pt":["Avaliação do design do sistema","Análise de operabilidade nativa da nuvem","Verificação da qualidade do código","Geração de relatórios de auditoria","Recomendações de melhoria"],"ru":["Оценка проектирования системы","Анализ облачной оперативности","Проверка качества кода","Генерация отчетов об аудите","Рекомендации по улучшению"],"ar":["تقييم تصميم النظام","تحليل التشغيل السحابي الأصلي","فحص جودة الكود","توليد تقارير التدقيق","توصيات التحسين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["架构审查代理","代码质量评估","云原生操作性","系统设计评估","代码审查","架构优化","云原生架构","代码质量优化"],"ja":["アーキテクチャレビュー エージェント","コード品質の評価","クラウドネイティブ操作性","システム設計の評価","コードレビュー","アーキテクチャ最適化","クラウドネイティブアーキテクチャ","コード品質最適化"],"ko":["아키텍처 리뷰 에이전트","코드 품질 평가","클라우드 네이티브 운영성","시스템 설계 평가","코드 리뷰","아키텍처 최적화","클라우드 네이티브 아키텍처","코드 품질 최적화"],"es":["revisión de arquitectura","operabilidad en la nube","calidad del código","informe de auditoría","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","arquitectura de sistema","análisis de código","mejora de la calidad"],"fr":["révision d''architecture","opérabilité dans le cloud","qualité du code","rapport d''audit","développement de logiciel","ingénierie de logiciel","architecture de système","analyse de code","amélioration de la qualité"],"de":["Architektur-Überprüfung","Cloud-Operabilität","Code-Qualität","Audit-Bericht","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","System-Architektur","Code-Analyse","Qualitätsverbesserung"],"pt":["revisão de arquitetura","análise de código","operabilidade nativa da nuvem","desenvolvimento de software","auditoria de código","melhoria de software"],"ru":["обзор архитектуры","анализ кода","облачная оперативность","разработка программного обеспечения","аудит кода","улучшение программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مراجعة الهندسة المعمارية","تحليل الكود","التشغيل السحابي الأصلي","تطوير البرمجيات","تدقيق الكود","تحسين البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"koala-man-64","repo":"asset-allocation","repoPath":"koala-man-64/asset-allocation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.464Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture-review-agent","description":"Audit architecture and code for cloud-native reliability, security, operability, and performance. Use for architecture reviews or delivery-readiness audits requiring an Architecture & Code Audit Report and actionable work items.","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Review Agent\n\n## Overview\n\nAssess system design, cloud-native operability, and code quality; triage findings and recommend fixes with observable acceptance criteria.\n\n## Required Output\n\n- Produce the \"Architecture & Code Audit Report\" artifact in the exact format specified in `references/agent.md`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Read `references/agent.md` before responding.\n- Follow its directives on scope, constraints, output format, and stop conditions.\n- Capture operational readiness gaps (h","body":"# Architecture Review Agent\n\n## Overview\n\nAssess system design, cloud-native operability, and code quality; triage findings and recommend fixes with observable acceptance criteria.\n\n## Required Output\n\n- Produce the \"Architecture & Code Audit Report\" artifact in the exact format specified in `references/agent.md`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Read `references/agent.md` before responding.\n- Follow its directives on scope, constraints, output format, and stop conditions.\n- Capture operational readiness gaps (health checks, metrics, traces) and include evidence pointers.\n- Ask questions only when blocked; otherwise proceed with best-effort assumptions.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `references/agent.md` - Canonical agent definition and detailed instructions.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:12:54.417Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-Native Agents requiring advanced system design assessment and code quality evaluation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级系统设计评估和代码质量评估能力的云原生代理。","ja":"クラウドネイティブエージェントに高度なシステム設計評価とコード品質評価機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 시스템 디자인 평가 및 코드 품질 평가 기능이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos de la Nube que requieren una evaluación avanzada del diseño del sistema y capacidades de evaluación de la calidad del código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud-Native nécessitant une évaluation avancée de la conception de système et des capacités d''évaluation de la qualité du code.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Systemdesignbewertung und Codequalitätsevaluierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que exigem avaliação avançada de design de sistema e capacidades de avaliação de qualidade de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих расширенной оценки системного проектирования и возможностей оценки качества кода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل السحابي الذي يتطلب تقييم تصميم نظام متقدم وسيطات تقييم جودة الشيفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to assess system design, evaluate cloud-native operability, and triage code quality findings, providing actionable recommendations with observable acceptance criteria using standardized audit reports in a specified format.","zh":"赋予代理评估系统设计、评估云原生可操作性、分类代码质量发现的能力，并提供可观察的接受标准和标准化审计报告中的可执行推荐。","ja":"エージェントにシステム設計を評価し、クラウドネイティブの可操作性を評価し、コード品質の発見を分類し、観察可能な受け入れ基準と標準化された監査レポートの中で実行可能な推奨事項を提供する機能を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 시스템 디자인을 평가하고 클라우드 네이티브 운용 가능성을 평가하며 코드 품질 발견을 분류하고 관찰 가능한 수용 기준 및 표준화된 감사 보고서에서 실행 가능한 권장 사항을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar el diseño del sistema, evaluar la operabilidad nativa de la nube y triage de los resultados de la calidad del código, proporcionando recomendaciones accionables con criterios de aceptación observables utilizando informes de auditoría estandarizados en un formato especificado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer la conception de système, d''évaluer l''exploitabilité native du cloud et de trier les résultats de la qualité du code, en fournissant des recommandations actionnables avec des critères d''acceptation observables en utilisant des rapports d''audit standardisés dans un format spécifié.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Systemdesignbewertung, die Bewertung der Cloud-Native-Betriebsfähigkeit und die Triage der Codequalitätsergebnisse durchzuführen, und stellt handhabbare Empfehlungen mit beobachtbaren Akzeptanzkriterien bereit, die mithilfe standardisierter Prüfberichte in einem festgelegten Format erstellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar o design do sistema, avaliar a operabilidade nativa em nuvem e triar as descobertas de qualidade do código, fornecendo recomendações com critérios de aceitação observáveis usando relatórios de auditoria padronizados em um formato especificado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценить системное проектирование, оценить облачную оперативность и от triage результатов качества кода, предоставляя рекомендации с наблюдаемыми критериями приемки, используя стандартизированные аудиторские отчеты в указанном формате.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم تصميم النظام وتقييم تشغيل السحابي الأصيل وترشيح نتائج جودة الشيفرة، وتوفير توصيات ذات معايير قبول قابلة للملاحظة باستخدام تقارير تدقيق معيارية في تنسيق محدد."},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing cloud-native operability of existing systems","Evaluating code quality and providing actionable fix recommendations","Generating comprehensive Architecture & Code Audit Reports"],"zh":["评估现有系统的云原生可操作性","评估代码质量并提供可执行的修复推荐","生成综合体系结构和代码审计报告"],"ja":["既存システムのクラウドネイティブ可操作性を評価する","コード品質を評価し実行可能な修正を推奨する","包括的なアーキテクチャとコード監査レポートを生成する"],"ko":["기존 시스템의 클라우드 네이티브 운용 가능성을 평가하는 것","코드 품질을 평가하고 실행 가능한 수정 권장 사항을 제공하는 것","포괄적인 아키텍처 및 코드 감사 보고서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Evaluar la operabilidad nativa de la nube de los sistemas existentes","Evaluar la calidad del código y proporcionar recomendaciones de reparación accionables","Generar informes de auditoría de arquitectura y código comprehensivos"],"fr":["Évaluer l''exploitabilité native du cloud des systèmes existants","Évaluer la qualité du code et fournir des recommandations de correction actionnables","Générer des rapports d''audit d''architecture et de code complets"],"de":["Bewertung der Cloud-Native-Betriebsfähigkeit bestehender Systeme","Bewertung der Codequalität und Bereitstellung handhabbarer Reparaturempfehlungen","Erstellung umfassender Architektur- und Code-Prüfberichte"],"pt":["Avaliando a operabilidade nativa em nuvem de sistemas existentes","Avaliando a qualidade do código e fornecendo recomendações de correção ativas","Gerando relatórios abrangentes de auditoria de arquitetura e código"],"ru":["Оценка облачной оперативности существующих систем","Оценка качества кода и предоставление действенных рекомендаций по исправлению","Генерация комплексных отчетов об аудите архитектуры и кода"],"ar":["تقييم تشغيل السحابي الأصيل للنظم الحالية","تقييم جودة الشيفرة وتقديم توصيات إصلاح فعالة","توليد تقارير شاملة لتدقيق الهياكل والشيفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to system design and codebase","Must follow directives outlined in references/agent.md","Output format is constrained to the specified format in references/agent.md"],"zh":["需要访问系统设计和代码库","必须遵循 references/agent.md 中概述的指令","输出格式受 references/agent.md 中指定格式的约束"],"ja":["システム設計とコードベースへのアクセスが必要","references/agent.md に概説された指令に従う必要がある","出力形式は references/agent.md に指定された形式に制約される"],"ko":["시스템 디자인과 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요함","참조/에이전트.md에概説된 지시를 따라야 함","출력 형식은 참조/에이전트.md에 지정된 형식으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al diseño del sistema y a la base de código","Debe seguir las directrices descritas en references/agent.md","El formato de salida está limitado al formato especificado en references/agent.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la conception de système et à la base de code","Doit suivre les directives décrites dans references/agent.md","Le format de sortie est limité au format spécifié dans references/agent.md"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Systemdesign und den Codebasis","Muss den in references/agent.md beschriebenen Richtlinien folgen","Das Ausgabeformat ist auf das in references/agent.md spezifizierte Format beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao design do sistema e à base de código","Deve seguir as diretrizes delineadas em referências/agent.md","O formato de saída é restrito ao formato especificado em referências/agent.md"],"ru":["Требует доступа к системному проектированию и кодовой базе","Должно следовать директивам, изложенным в ссылках/agent.md","Формат вывода ограничен указанным форматом в ссылках/agent.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تصميم النظام وقاعدة الشيفرة","يجب اتباع التوجيهات المحددة في المراجع/وكيل.md","تنسيق الإخراج مقيد التنسيق المحدد في المراجع/وكيل.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('goodnight000/KittyCourt/auth-implementation-patterns', 'community', 'goodnight000', 'KittyCourt', 'goodnight000/KittyCourt', 'auth-implementation-patterns', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z', '2026-02-18T08:13:06.456Z', NULL, '{"id":"goodnight000/KittyCourt/auth-implementation-patterns","name":"auth-implementation-patterns","description":{"zh":"Build secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.","ja":"Build secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.","ko":"Build secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.","es":"Implementa sistemas de autenticación y autorización seguros y escalables con patrones y prácticas recomendadas de la industria","fr":"Implémentez des systèmes d''authentification et d''autorisation sécurisés et évolutifs avec des modèles et des pratiques recommandées par l''industrie","de":"Implementieren Sie sichere und skalierbare Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungssysteme mit Branchenmustern und -best-Practices","pt":"Construa sistemas de autenticação e autorização seguros e escaláveis com padrões da indústria e práticas recomendadas modernas","ru":"Постройте безопасные и масштабируемые системы аутентификации и авторизации с помощью отраслевых стандартов и современных лучших практик","ar":"ابني أنظمة مصادقة وتصريح آمنة ومتماسكة باستخدام معايير الصناعة وأفضل الممارسات الحديثة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"auth-implementation-patterns","ja":"auth-implementation-patterns","ko":"auth-implementation-patterns","es":"Patrones de Implementación de Autenticación y Autorización","fr":"Modèles d''Implémentation d''Authentification et d''Autorisa...","de":"Muster für die Implementierung von Authentifizierung und ...","pt":"Padrões de Implementação de Autenticação e Autorização","ru":"Шаблоны реализации аутентификации и авторизации","ar":"نماذج تنفيذ المصادقة والتفويض","en":"auth-implementation-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Build secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.","ja":"Build secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.","ko":"Build secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.","es":"Implementa sistemas de autenticación y autorización seguros y escalables con patrones y prácticas recomendadas de la industria","fr":"Implémentez des systèmes d''authentification et d''autorisation sécurisés et évolutifs avec des modèles et des pratiques recommandées par l''industrie","de":"Implementieren Sie sichere und skalierbare Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungssysteme mit Branchenmustern und -best-Practices","pt":"Construa sistemas de autenticação e autorização seguros e escaláveis com padrões da indústria e práticas recomendadas modernas","ru":"Постройте безопасные и масштабируемые системы аутентификации и авторизации с помощью отраслевых стандартов и современных лучших практик","ar":"ابني أنظمة مصادقة وتصريح آمنة ومتماسكة باستخدام معايير الصناعة وأفضل الممارسات الحديثة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Implementing user authentication systems","Securing REST or GraphQL APIs","Adding OAuth2/social login","Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)","Designing session management","Migrating authentication systems"],"ja":["Implementing user authentication systems","Securing REST or GraphQL APIs","Adding OAuth2/social login","Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)","Designing session management","Migrating authentication systems"],"ko":["Implementing user authentication systems","Securing REST or GraphQL APIs","Adding OAuth2/social login","Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)","Designing session management","Migrating authentication systems"],"es":["Implementación de autenticación de usuarios","Seguridad de APIs REST y GraphQL","Autenticación OAuth2 y login social","Control de acceso basado en roles (RBAC)","Gestión de sesiones","Migración de sistemas de autenticación"],"fr":["Implémentation de l''authentification des utilisateurs","Sécurité des APIs REST et GraphQL","Authentification OAuth2 et login social","Contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles (RBAC)","Gestion des sessions","Migration des systèmes d''authentification"],"de":["Implementierung von Benutzerauthentifizierung","Sicherheit von REST- und GraphQL-APIs","Authentifizierung OAuth2 und soziales Login","Rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle (RBAC)","Sitzungsverwaltung","Migration von Authentifizierungssystemen"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de autenticação de usuário","Proteção de APIs REST ou GraphQL","Adição de login OAuth2/social","Implementação de controle de acesso baseado em papéis (RBAC)","Gerenciamento de sessões"],"ru":["Реализация систем аутентификации пользователей","Защита API REST или GraphQL","Добавление логина OAuth2/социального","Реализация контроля доступа на основе ролей (RBAC)","Управление сессиями"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة مصادقة المستخدم","حماية واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST أو GraphQL","إضافة تسجيل الدخول OAuth2/اجتماعي","تنفيذ التحكم في الوصول القائم على الأدوار (RBAC)","إدارة الدروس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["auth-implementation-patterns","authentication","authorization","security","scalability","industry-standard patterns","modern best practices"],"ja":["auth-implementation-patterns","authentication","authorization","security","scalability","industry-standard patterns","modern best practices"],"ko":["auth-implementation-patterns","authentication","authorization","security","scalability","industry-standard patterns","modern best practices"],"es":["autenticación y autorización","patrones de implementación","seguridad de APIs","OAuth2","login social","control de acceso basado en roles","gestión de sesiones","migración de sistemas de autenticación"],"fr":["authentification et autorisation","modèles d''implémentation","sécurité des APIs","OAuth2","login social","contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles","gestion des sessions","migration des systèmes d''authentification"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Implementierungsmuster","Sicherheit von APIs","OAuth2","soziales Login","rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle","Sitzungsverwaltung","Migration von Authentifizierungssystemen"],"pt":["autenticação e autorização","padrões de implementação","segurança da informação","desenvolvimento de software","sistemas de autenticação","controle de acesso"],"ru":["аутентификация и авторизация","шаблоны реализации","безопасность информации","разработка программного обеспечения","системы аутентификации","контроль доступа"],"ar":["المصادقة والتفويض","نماذج التنفيذ","أمن المعلومات","تطوير البرمجيات","أنظمة المصادقة","التحكم في الوصول"]}},"owner":"goodnight000","repo":"KittyCourt","repoPath":"goodnight000/KittyCourt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"auth-implementation-patterns","description":"Master authentication and authorization patterns including JWT, OAuth2, session management, and RBAC to build secure, scalable access control systems. Use when implementing auth systems, securing APIs, or debugging security issues.","bodyPreview":"# Authentication & Authorization Implementation Patterns\n\nBuild secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing user authentication systems\n- Securing REST or GraphQL APIs\n- Adding OAuth2/social login\n- Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Designing session management\n- Migrating authentication systems\n- Debugging auth issues\n- Implementing SSO or multi-tenancy\n\n## Core Con","body":"# Authentication & Authorization Implementation Patterns\n\nBuild secure, scalable authentication and authorization systems using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing user authentication systems\n- Securing REST or GraphQL APIs\n- Adding OAuth2/social login\n- Implementing role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Designing session management\n- Migrating authentication systems\n- Debugging auth issues\n- Implementing SSO or multi-tenancy\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Authentication vs Authorization\n\n**Authentication (AuthN)**: Who are you?\n- Verifying identity (username/password, OAuth, biometrics)\n- Issuing credentials (sessions, tokens)\n- Managing login/logout\n\n**Authorization (AuthZ)**: What can you do?\n- Permission checking\n- Role-based access control (RBAC)\n- Resource ownership validation\n- Policy enforcement\n\n### 2. Authentication Strategies\n\n**Session-Based:**\n- Server stores session state\n- Session ID in cookie\n- Traditional, simple, stateful\n\n**Token-Based (JWT):**\n- Stateless, self-contained\n- Scales horizontally\n- Can store claims\n\n**OAuth2/OpenID Connect:**\n- Delegate authentication\n- Social login (Google, GitHub)\n- Enterprise SSO\n\n## JWT Authentication\n\n### Pattern 1: JWT Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// JWT structure: header.payload.signature\nimport jwt from ''jsonwebtoken'';\nimport { Request, Response, NextFunction } from ''express'';\n\ninterface JWTPayload {\n    userId: string;\n    email: string;\n    role: string;\n    iat: number;\n    exp: number;\n}\n\n// Generate JWT\nfunction generateTokens(userId: string, email: string, role: string) {\n    const accessToken = jwt.sign(\n        { userId, email, role },\n        process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n        { expiresIn: ''15m'' }  // Short-lived\n    );\n\n    const refreshToken = jwt.sign(\n        { userId },\n        process.env.JWT_REFRESH_SECRET!,\n        { expiresIn: ''7d'' }  // Long-lived\n    );\n\n    return { accessToken, refreshToken };\n}\n\n// Verify JWT\nfunction verifyToken(token: string): JWTPayload {\n    try {\n        return jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET!) as JWTPayload;\n    } catch (error) {\n        if (error instanceof jwt.TokenExpiredError) {\n            throw new Error(''Token expired'');\n        }\n        if (error instanceof jwt.JsonWebTokenError) {\n            throw new Error(''Invalid token'');\n        }\n        throw error;\n    }\n}\n\n// Middleware\nfunction authenticate(req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) {\n    const authHeader = req.headers.authorization;\n    if (!authHeader?.startsWith(''Bearer '')) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''No token provided'' });\n    }\n\n    const token = authHeader.substring(7);\n    try {\n        const payload = verifyToken(token);\n        req.user = payload;  // Attach user to request\n        next();\n    } catch (error) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid token'' });\n    }\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.get(''/api/profile'', authenticate, (req, res) => {\n    res.json({ user: req.user });\n});\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Refresh Token Flow\n\n```typescript\ninterface StoredRefreshToken {\n    token: string;\n    userId: string;\n    expiresAt: Date;\n    createdAt: Date;\n}\n\nclass RefreshTokenService {\n    // Store refresh token in database\n    async storeRefreshToken(userId: string, refreshToken: string) {\n        const expiresAt = new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n        await db.refreshTokens.create({\n            token: await hash(refreshToken),  // Hash before storing\n            userId,\n            expiresAt,\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Refresh access token\n    async refreshAccessToken(refreshToken: string) {\n        // Verify refresh token\n        let payload;\n        try {\n            payload = jwt.verify(\n                refreshToken,\n                process.env.JWT_REFRESH_SECRET!\n            ) as { userId: string };\n        } catch {\n            throw new Error(''Invalid refresh token'');\n        }\n\n        // Check if token exists in database\n        const storedToken = await db.refreshTokens.findOne({\n            where: {\n                token: await hash(refreshToken),\n                userId: payload.userId,\n                expiresAt: { $gt: new Date() },\n            },\n        });\n\n        if (!storedToken) {\n            throw new Error(''Refresh token not found or expired'');\n        }\n\n        // Get user\n        const user = await db.users.findById(payload.userId);\n        if (!user) {\n            throw new Error(''User not found'');\n        }\n\n        // Generate new access token\n        const accessToken = jwt.sign(\n            { userId: user.id, email: user.email, role: user.role },\n            process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n            { expiresIn: ''15m'' }\n        );\n\n        return { accessToken };\n    }\n\n    // Revoke refresh token (logout)\n    async revokeRefreshToken(refreshToken: string) {\n        await db.refreshTokens.deleteOne({\n            token: await hash(refreshToken),\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Revoke all user tokens (logout all devices)\n    async revokeAllUserTokens(userId: string) {\n        await db.refreshTokens.deleteMany({ userId });\n    }\n}\n\n// API endpoints\napp.post(''/api/auth/refresh'', async (req, res) => {\n    const { refreshToken } = req.body;\n    try {\n        const { accessToken } = await refreshTokenService\n            .refreshAccessToken(refreshToken);\n        res.json({ accessToken });\n    } catch (error) {\n        res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid refresh token'' });\n    }\n});\n\napp.post(''/api/auth/logout'', authenticate, async (req, res) => {\n    const { refreshToken } = req.body;\n    await refreshTokenService.revokeRefreshToken(refreshToken);\n    res.json({ message: ''Logged out successfully'' });\n});\n```\n\n## Session-Based Authentication\n\n### Pattern 1: Express Session\n\n```typescript\nimport session from ''express-session'';\nimport RedisStore from ''connect-redis'';\nimport { createClient } from ''redis'';\n\n// Setup Redis for session storage\nconst redisClient = createClient({\n    url: process.env.REDIS_URL,\n});\nawait redisClient.connect();\n\napp.use(\n    session({\n        store: new RedisStore({ client: redisClient }),\n        secret: process.env.SESSION_SECRET!,\n        resave: false,\n        saveUninitialized: false,\n        cookie: {\n            secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === ''production'',  // HTTPS only\n            httpOnly: true,  // No JavaScript access\n            maxAge: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000,  // 24 hours\n            sameSite: ''strict'',  // CSRF protection\n        },\n    })\n);\n\n// Login\napp.post(''/api/auth/login'', async (req, res) => {\n    const { email, password } = req.body;\n\n    const user = await db.users.findOne({ email });\n    if (!user || !(await verifyPassword(password, user.passwordHash))) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid credentials'' });\n    }\n\n    // Store user in session\n    req.session.userId = user.id;\n    req.session.role = user.role;\n\n    res.json({ user: { id: user.id, email: user.email, role: user.role } });\n});\n\n// Session middleware\nfunction requireAuth(req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) {\n    if (!req.session.userId) {\n        return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n    }\n    next();\n}\n\n// Protected route\napp.get(''/api/profile'', requireAuth, async (req, res) => {\n    const user = await db.users.findById(req.session.userId);\n    res.json({ user });\n});\n\n// Logout\napp.post(''/api/auth/logout'', (req, res) => {\n    req.session.destroy((err) => {\n        if (err) {\n            return res.status(500).json({ error: ''Logout failed'' });\n        }\n        res.clearCookie(''connect.sid'');\n        res.json({ message: ''Logged out successfully'' });\n    });\n});\n```\n\n## OAuth2 / Social Login\n\n### Pattern 1: OAuth2 with Passport.js\n\n```typescript\nimport passport from ''passport'';\nimport { Strategy as GoogleStrategy } from ''passport-google-oauth20'';\nimport { Strategy as GitHubStrategy } from ''passport-github2'';\n\n// Google OAuth\npassport.use(\n    new GoogleStrategy(\n        {\n            clientID: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID!,\n            clientSecret: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n            callbackURL: ''/api/auth/google/callback'',\n        },\n        async (accessToken, refreshToken, profile, done) => {\n            try {\n                // Find or create user\n                let user = await db.users.findOne({\n                    googleId: profile.id,\n                });\n\n                if (!user) {\n                    user = await db.users.create({\n                        googleId: profile.id,\n                        email: profile.emails?.[0]?.value,\n                        name: profile.displayName,\n                        avatar: profile.photos?.[0]?.value,\n                    });\n                }\n\n                return done(null, user);\n            } catch (error) {\n                return done(error, undefined);\n            }\n        }\n    )\n);\n\n// Routes\napp.get(''/api/auth/google'', passport.authenticate(''google'', {\n    scope: [''profile'', ''email''],\n}));\n\napp.get(\n    ''/api/auth/google/callback'',\n    passport.authenticate(''google'', { session: false }),\n    (req, res) => {\n        // Generate JWT\n        const tokens = generateTokens(req.user.id, req.user.email, req.user.role);\n        // Redirect to frontend with token\n        res.redirect(`${process.env.FRONTEND_URL}/auth/callback?token=${tokens.accessToken}`);\n    }\n);\n```\n\n## Authorization Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\nenum Role {\n    USER = ''user'',\n    MODERATOR = ''moderator'',\n    ADMIN = ''admin'',\n}\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<Role, Role[]> = {\n    [Role.ADMIN]: [Role.ADMIN, Role.MODERATOR, Role.USER],\n    [Role.MODERATOR]: [Role.MODERATOR, Role.USER],\n    [Role.USER]: [Role.USER],\n};\n\nfunction hasRole(userRole: Role, requiredRole: Role): boolean {\n    return roleHierarchy[userRole].includes(requiredRole);\n}\n\n// Middleware\nfunction requireRole(...roles: Role[]) {\n    return (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        if (!roles.some(role => hasRole(req.user.role, role))) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Insufficient permissions'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.delete(''/api/users/:id'',\n    authenticate,\n    requireRole(Role.ADMIN),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        // Only admins can delete users\n        await db.users.delete(req.params.id);\n        res.json({ message: ''User deleted'' });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Permission-Based Access Control\n\n```typescript\nenum Permission {\n    READ_USERS = ''read:users'',\n    WRITE_USERS = ''write:users'',\n    DELETE_USERS = ''delete:users'',\n    READ_POSTS = ''read:posts'',\n    WRITE_POSTS = ''write:posts'',\n}\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<Role, Permission[]> = {\n    [Role.USER]: [Permission.READ_POSTS, Permission.WRITE_POSTS],\n    [Role.MODERATOR]: [\n        Permission.READ_POSTS,\n        Permission.WRITE_POSTS,\n        Permission.READ_USERS,\n    ],\n    [Role.ADMIN]: Object.values(Permission),\n};\n\nfunction hasPermission(userRole: Role, permission: Permission): boolean {\n    return rolePermissions[userRole]?.includes(permission) ?? false;\n}\n\nfunction requirePermission(...permissions: Permission[]) {\n    return (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        const hasAllPermissions = permissions.every(permission =>\n            hasPermission(req.user.role, permission)\n        );\n\n        if (!hasAllPermissions) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Insufficient permissions'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.get(''/api/users'',\n    authenticate,\n    requirePermission(Permission.READ_USERS),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        const users = await db.users.findAll();\n        res.json({ users });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Resource Ownership\n\n```typescript\n// Check if user owns resource\nasync function requireOwnership(\n    resourceType: ''post'' | ''comment'',\n    resourceIdParam: string = ''id''\n) {\n    return async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n        if (!req.user) {\n            return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Not authenticated'' });\n        }\n\n        const resourceId = req.params[resourceIdParam];\n\n        // Admins can access anything\n        if (req.user.role === Role.ADMIN) {\n            return next();\n        }\n\n        // Check ownership\n        let resource;\n        if (resourceType === ''post'') {\n            resource = await db.posts.findById(resourceId);\n        } else if (resourceType === ''comment'') {\n            resource = await db.comments.findById(resourceId);\n        }\n\n        if (!resource) {\n            return res.status(404).json({ error: ''Resource not found'' });\n        }\n\n        if (resource.userId !== req.user.userId) {\n            return res.status(403).json({ error: ''Not authorized'' });\n        }\n\n        next();\n    };\n}\n\n// Usage\napp.put(''/api/posts/:id'',\n    authenticate,\n    requireOwnership(''post''),\n    async (req, res) => {\n        // User can only update their own posts\n        const post = await db.posts.update(req.params.id, req.body);\n        res.json({ post });\n    }\n);\n```\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n### Pattern 1: Password Security\n\n```typescript\nimport bcrypt from ''bcrypt'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\n// Password validation schema\nconst passwordSchema = z.string()\n    .min(12, ''Password must be at least 12 characters'')\n    .regex(/[A-Z]/, ''Password must contain uppercase letter'')\n    .regex(/[a-z]/, ''Password must contain lowercase letter'')\n    .regex(/[0-9]/, ''Password must contain number'')\n    .regex(/[^A-Za-z0-9]/, ''Password must contain special character'');\n\n// Hash password\nasync function hashPassword(password: string): Promise<string> {\n    const saltRounds = 12;  // 2^12 iterations\n    return bcrypt.hash(password, saltRounds);\n}\n\n// Verify password\nasync function verifyPassword(\n    password: string,\n    hash: string\n): Promise<boolean> {\n    return bcrypt.compare(password, hash);\n}\n\n// Registration with password validation\napp.post(''/api/auth/register'', async (req, res) => {\n    try {\n        const { email, password } = req.body;\n\n        // Validate password\n        passwordSchema.parse(password);\n\n        // Check if user exists\n        const existingUser = await db.users.findOne({ email });\n        if (existingUser) {\n            return res.status(400).json({ error: ''Email already registered'' });\n        }\n\n        // Hash password\n        const passwordHash = await hashPassword(password);\n\n        // Create user\n        const user = await db.users.create({\n            email,\n            passwordHash,\n        });\n\n        // Generate tokens\n        const tokens = generateTokens(user.id, user.email, user.role);\n\n        res.status(201).json({\n            user: { id: user.id, email: user.email },\n            ...tokens,\n        });\n    } catch (error) {\n        if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n            return res.status(400).json({ error: error.errors[0].message });\n        }\n        res.status(500).json({ error: ''Registration failed'' });\n    }\n});\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Rate Limiting\n\n```typescript\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit'';\nimport RedisStore from ''rate-limit-redis'';\n\n// Login rate limiter\nconst loginLimiter = rateLimit({\n    store: new RedisStore({ client: redisClient }),\n    windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,  // 15 minutes\n    max: 5,  // 5 attempts\n    message: ''Too many login attempts, please try again later'',\n    standardHeaders: true,\n    legacyHeaders: false,\n});\n\n// API rate limiter\nconst apiLimiter = rateLimit({\n    windowMs: 60 * 1000,  // 1 minute\n    max: 100,  // 100 requests per minute\n    standardHeaders: true,\n});\n\n// Apply to routes\napp.post(''/api/auth/login'', loginLimiter, async (req, res) => {\n    // Login logic\n});\n\napp.use(''/api/'', apiLimiter);\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Never Store Plain Passwords**: Always hash with bcrypt/argon2\n2. **Use HTTPS**: Encrypt data in transit\n3. **Short-Lived Access Tokens**: 15-30 minutes max\n4. **Secure Cookies**: httpOnly, secure, sameSite flags\n5. **Validate All Input**: Email format, password strength\n6. **Rate Limit Auth Endpoints**: Prevent brute force attacks\n7. **Implement CSRF Protection**: For session-based auth\n8. **Rotate Secrets Regularly**: JWT secrets, session secrets\n9. **Log Security Events**: Login attempts, failed auth\n10. **Use MFA When Possible**: Extra security layer\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Weak Passwords**: Enforce strong password policies\n- **JWT in localStorage**: Vulnerable to XSS, use httpOnly cookies\n- **No Token Expiration**: Tokens should expire\n- **Client-Side Auth Checks Only**: Always validate server-side\n- **Insecure Password Reset**: Use secure tokens with expiration\n- **No Rate Limiting**: Vulnerable to brute force\n- **Trusting Client Data**: Always validate on server\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/jwt-best-practices.md**: JWT implementation guide\n- **references/oauth2-flows.md**: OAuth2 flow diagrams and examples\n- **references/session-security.md**: Secure session management\n- **assets/auth-security-checklist.md**: Security review checklist\n- **assets/password-policy-template.md**: Password requirements template\n- **scripts/token-validator.ts**: JWT validation utility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:13:06.456Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security Agents requiring advanced authentication and authorization implementation patterns for scalable systems","zh":"适用于需要高级身份验证和授权实现模式的可扩展安全代理系统","ja":"高度な認証および認可の実装パターンを必要とするセキュリティエージェントに最適","ko":"확장 가능한 시스템을 위한 고급 인증 및 인가 구현 패턴이 필요한 보안 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Seguridad que requieren patrones de implementación de autenticación y autorización avanzados para sistemas escalables","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Sécurité nécessitant des modèles d''implémentation d''authentification et d''autorisation avancés pour des systèmes évolutifs","de":"Ideal für Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsimplementierungsmuster für skalierbare Systeme benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança que exigem padrões de implementação de autenticação e autorização avançados para sistemas escaláveis","ru":"Идеально для агентов безопасности, требующих продвинутых шаблонов аутентификации и авторизации для масштабируемых систем","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمنيين الذين يتطلبون أنماط تنفيذ متقدمة للاستيثاق والتصريح لإنظمة قابلة للتحجيم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure OAuth2 and social login protocols, design role-based access control systems, and manage sessions using industry-standard patterns and modern best practices like REST and GraphQL APIs","zh":"赋予代理实现安全的OAuth2和社交登录协议的能力，设计基于角色的访问控制系统，并使用行业标准模式和现代最佳实践（如REST和GraphQL API）管理会话","ja":"エージェントがセキュアなOAuth2およびソーシャルログインプロトコルを実装し、ロールベースのアクセス制御システムを設計し、業界標準のパターンおよびモダンなベストプラクティス（例：RESTおよびGraphQL API）を使用してセッションを管理することを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 보안 OAuth2 및 사회적 로그인 프로토콜을 구현하고 역할 기반의 접근 제어 시스템을 설계하며 산업 표준 패턴 및 최신 모범 사례(예: REST 및 GraphQL API)를 사용하여 세션을 관리할 수 있