тов","Разговорные интерфейсы"],"ar":["فهم اللغة الطبيعية","إدارة السياق","التكاملات السلسة","تطوير محادثات الروبوت","واجهات المحادثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI助手开发","智能对话接口","AI应用","自然语言理解","上下文管理","无缝集成"],"ja":["AIアシスタント開発","会話インターフェース","AIアプリケーション","自然言語理解","コンテキスト管理","シームレスな統合"],"ko":["AI 보조 개발","智能 대화 인터페이스","AI 应用","자연어 이해","콘텍스트 관리","无缝集成"],"es":["desarrollo de asistentes de IA","interfaces conversacionales","comprensión del lenguaje natural","gestión de contexto","aplicaciones de chatbot","soluciones de asistentes de IA","inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de IA"],"fr":["développement d''assistant IA","interfaces conversationnelles","compréhension du langage naturel","gestion de contexte","applications de chatbot","solutions d''assistant IA","intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels","technologies de l''IA"],"de":["Entwicklung von KI-Assistenten","Konversationsinterfaces","natürliche Sprachverständigung","Kontextverwaltung","Chatbot-Anwendungen","KI-Assistenten-Lösungen","künstliche Intelligenz","Software-Entwicklung","KI-Technologien"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de assistente de ia","soluções de ia","chatbots","inteligência artificial","linguagem natural","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["разработка помощника ии","решения ии","чат-боты","искусственный интеллект","естественный язык","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطوير مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي","حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","محادثات الروبوت","الذكاء الاصطناعي","اللغة الطبيعية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"CarlosVerasteguii","repo":"Daticket","repoPath":"CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llm-application-dev-ai-assistant","description":"You are an AI assistant development expert specializing in creating intelligent conversational interfaces, chatbots, and AI-powered applications. Design comprehensive AI assistant solutions with natur","bodyPreview":"# AI Assistant Development\n\nYou are an AI assistant development expert specializing in creating intelligent conversational interfaces, chatbots, and AI-powered applications. Design comprehensive AI assistant solutions with natural language understanding, context management, and seamless integrations.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on ai assistant development tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for ai assistant development\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The","body":"# AI Assistant Development\n\nYou are an AI assistant development expert specializing in creating intelligent conversational interfaces, chatbots, and AI-powered applications. Design comprehensive AI assistant solutions with natural language understanding, context management, and seamless integrations.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on ai assistant development tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for ai assistant development\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to ai assistant development\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Context\nThe user needs to develop an AI assistant or chatbot with natural language capabilities, intelligent responses, and practical functionality. Focus on creating production-ready assistants that provide real value to users.\n\n## Requirements\n$ARGUMENTS\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:13:12.019Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents requiring advanced natural language understanding and context management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级自然语言理解和上下文管理能力的对话式 AI 代理。","ja":"会話式 AI エージェントが高度な自然言語理解とコンテキスト管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 자연어 이해와 컨텍스트 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 대화형 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial conversacional que requieren una comprensión avanzada del lenguaje natural y capacidades de gestión de contexto.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle conversationnelle nécessitant une compréhension avancée du langage naturel et des capacités de gestion de contexte.","de":"Ideal für Conversational-AI-Agents, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur natürlichen Sprachverarbeitung und Kontextverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que exigem compreensão avançada de linguagem natural e capacidades de gerenciamento de contexto.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных ИИ-агентов, требующих продвинутого понимания естественного языка и возможностей управления контекстом.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات 智能 المحادثة التي تتطلب فهمًا متقدمًا للغة الطبيعية وقدرات إدارة السياق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design comprehensive AI assistant solutions with seamless integrations, leveraging natural language understanding and context management protocols, and implementing best practices for chatbot development.","zh":"赋予代理设计全面的人工智能助手解决方案的能力，实现无缝集成，利用自然语言理解和上下文管理协议，并实施聊天机器人开发的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが包括的な AI アシスタント ソリューションを設計できるようにし、シームレスな統合を実現し、自然言語理解とコンテキスト管理のプロトコルを利用し、チャットボット開発のベスト プラクティスを実施します。","ko":"에이전트가 종합적인 AI 어시스턴트 솔루션을 설계할 수 있도록 하며, 무결점 통합을 제공하고, 자연어 이해 및 컨텍스트 관리 프로토콜을 활용하며, 채팅봇 개발 모범 사례를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar soluciones de asistentes de IA integrales con integraciones perfectas, aprovechando protocolos de comprensión del lenguaje natural y gestión de contexto, e implementando las mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de chatbots.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des solutions d''assistants d''IA intégrales avec des intégrations sans accroc, en exploitant les protocoles de compréhension du langage naturel et de gestion de contexte, et en mettant en œuvre les meilleures pratiques pour le développement de chatbots.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende KI-Assistentenlösungen mit nahtlosen Integrationen zu entwerfen, die natürliche Sprachverarbeitung und Kontextverwaltungsprotokolle nutzen und bewährte Verfahren für die Chatbot-Entwicklung implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar soluções de assistentes de IA abrangentes com integrações sem interrupções, utilizando protocolos de compreensão de linguagem natural e gerenciamento de contexto e implementando as melhores práticas para o desenvolvimento de chatbots.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать комплексные решения ИИ-помощников с бесшовными интеграциями, используя протоколы понимания естественного языка и управления контекстом, и реализуя лучшие практики для разработки чат-ботов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم حلول مساعدين ذكاء اصطناعي شاملة مع تكاملات دون انقطاع، مستخدمين بروتوكولات فهم اللغة الطبيعية وإدارة السياق وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات الدردشة."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing intelligent conversational interfaces","Creating AI-powered chatbot applications","Implementing context management for AI assistants"],"zh":["开发智能对话界面","创建 AI 驱动的聊天机器人应用","实现 AI 助手的上下文管理"],"ja":["智能会話インターフェースの開発","AI駆動のチャットボットアプリケーションの作成","AIアシスタントのコンテキスト管理の実装"],"ko":["지능형 대화 인터페이스 개발","AI 구동 채팅봇 애플리케이션 생성","AI 어시스턴트를 위한 컨텍스트 관리 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar interfaces conversacionales inteligentes","Crear aplicaciones de chatbot alimentadas por IA","Implementar gestión de contexto para asistentes de IA"],"fr":["Développer des interfaces conversationnelles intelligentes","Créer des applications de chatbot alimentées par l''IA","Mettre en œuvre une gestion de contexte pour les assistants d''IA"],"de":["Intelligente Konversationsinterfaces entwickeln","KI-gestützte Chatbot-Anwendungen erstellen","Kontextverwaltung für KI-Assistenten implementieren"],"pt":["Desenvolver interfaces de conversação inteligentes","Criar aplicações de chatbot alimentadas por IA","Implementar gerenciamento de contexto para assistentes de IA"],"ru":["Разработка интеллектуальных интерфейсов для разговора","Создание чат-ботов на основе ИИ","Реализация управления контекстом для ИИ-помощников"],"ar":["تحويل واجهات المحادثة الذكية","إنشاء تطبيقات الدردشة القائمة على الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ إدارة السياق لمساعدي الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in AI assistant development","Limited to conversational AI applications"],"zh":["需要 AI 助手开发的专业知识","仅限于对话式 AI 应用"],"ja":["AI アシスタント開発の専門知識が必要","会話式 AI アプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["AI 어시스턴트 개발 전문 지식이 필요","대화형 AI 애플리케이션에만 국한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en desarrollo de asistentes de IA","Limitado a aplicaciones de IA conversacional"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans le développement d''assistants d''IA","Limité aux applications d''IA conversationnelle"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in der Entwicklung von KI-Assistenten","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen für Conversational AI"],"pt":["Exige especialização no desenvolvimento de assistentes de IA","Limitado a aplicações de IA conversacional"],"ru":["Требует специализации в области разработки ИИ-помощников","Ограничен чат-ботами на основе ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصًا في تطوير مساعدي الذكاء الاصطناعي","محدود لتطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
