로는 코드 변경 사항을 확인하고 테스트 실패를 수정하며 표준화된 커밋을 생성하여 푸시합니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo de commit y push valida cambios, soluciona errores y crea commits convencionales para una publicación exitosa","fr":"Le workflow de commit et push valide les modifications, résout les échecs et crée des commits conventionnels pour une publication réussie","de":"Der Commit- und Push-Workflow überprüft Änderungen, behebt Fehler und erstellt konventionelle Commits für eine erfolgreiche Veröffentlichung","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho commit-and-push é usado para validar alterações, corrigir falhas e criar commits convencionais","ru":"Рабочий поток коммита и пуша используется для проверки изменений, исправления неудач и создания конвенциональных коммитов","ar":"تدفق عمل التزام و دفع يستخدم للتحقق من التعديلات و تصحيح الفشل و إنشاء التزامات تقليدية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["运行测试","修复测试失败","创建标准化的提交","推送代码","支持pytest测试框架","配置pytest设置"],"ja":["テストの実行","テストの失敗の修正","標準化されたコミットの作成","コードのプッシュ","pytestテストフレームワークのサポート","pytest設定の構成"],"ko":["테스트 실행","테스트 실패 수정","표준화된 커밋 생성","코드 푸시","pytest 테스트 프레임워크 지원","pytest 설정 구성"],"es":["Validación de cambios","Solución de errores","Creación de commits convencionales","Ejecución de pruebas unitarias e integrales","Configuración de Pytest","Publicación de commits"],"fr":["Validation des modifications","Résolution des échecs","Création de commits conventionnels","Exécution de tests unitaires et d''intégration","Configuration de Pytest","Publication de commits"],"de":["Überprüfung von Änderungen","Behebung von Fehlern","Erstellung von konventionellen Commits","Ausführung von Unit- und Integrationsprüfungen","Konfiguration von Pytest","Veröffentlichung von Commits"],"pt":["Executa testes com pytest","Corrige falhas e re-executa testes","Cria commits convencionais","Envia alterações para repositório","Valida alterações antes de enviar"],"ru":["Выполняет тесты с помощью pytest","Исправляет неудачи и повторно запускает тесты","Создает конвенциональные коммиты","Отправляет изменения в репозиторий","Проверяет изменения перед отправкой"],"ar":["ينفذ الاختبارات باستخدام pytest","يصلح الفشل و يعيد تشغيل الاختبارات","ينشئ التزامات تقليدية","يرسل التعديلات إلى المستودع","يتحقق من التعديلات قبل الإرسال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["commit-and-push","代码提交","代码推送","pytest","代码测试","代码验证","代码修复","标准化提交"],"ja":["コミットとプッシュ","コードのコミット","コードのプッシュ","pytest","コードのテスト","コードの検証","コードの修正","標準化されたコミット"],"ko":["commit-and-push","코드 제출","코드 푸시","pytest","코드 테스트","코드 확인","코드 수정","표준화된 커밋"],"es":["commit y push","flujo de trabajo de commit","validación de cambios","solución de errores","commits convencionales","pruebas unitarias","pruebas integrales","Pytest","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["commit et push","workflow de commit","validation des modifications","résolution des échecs","commits conventionnels","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","Pytest","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Commit und Push","Commit-Workflow","Überprüfung von Änderungen","Behebung von Fehlern","konventionelle Commits","Unit-Tests","Integrationsprüfungen","Pytest","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["commit-and-push","fluxo de trabalho","validação de alterações","criação de commits","envio de alterações","pytest","testes automatizados"],"ru":["коммит и пуш","рабочий поток","проверка изменений","создание коммитов","отправка изменений","pytest","автоматические тесты"],"ar":["التزام و دفع","تدفق عمل","التحقق من التعديلات","إنشاء التزامات","إرسال التعديلات","pytest","اختبارات آلية"]}},"owner":"mplemay","repo":"brussels","repoPath":"mplemay/brussels","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-and-push","description":"Run the repos finalize workflow (uv pytest, pre-commit with per-hook fixes, conventional commit, git push). Use when asked to run tests/lint, fix hook failures, commit changes, or push updates.","bodyPreview":"# Commit And Push\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this workflow to validate changes, fix failures, create a conventional commit, and push.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Run tests\n\n- Run `uv run pytest`.\n- If tests fail, fix the code/tests and re-run until green.\n- Tests live in `src/belgie/__test__/`; mirror the source layout.\n- Unit tests use the matching file name; integration tests use `_integration` suffix.\n- Test functions must be prefixed with `test_`.\n- Pytest settings live in `pyproject.toml`.\n- If failures ar","body":"# Commit And Push\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this workflow to validate changes, fix failures, create a conventional commit, and push.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Run tests\n\n- Run `uv run pytest`.\n- If tests fail, fix the code/tests and re-run until green.\n- Tests live in `src/belgie/__test__/`; mirror the source layout.\n- Unit tests use the matching file name; integration tests use `_integration` suffix.\n- Test functions must be prefixed with `test_`.\n- Pytest settings live in `pyproject.toml`.\n- If failures are unrelated or require product decisions, stop and ask.\n\n### 2) Run pre-commit and fix hooks\n\n- Run `uv run pre-commit run --all`.\n- For each failing hook:\n  - Diagnose the root cause and fix it directly.\n  - Avoid ignores unless the issue is a true edge case or false positive.\n  - Re-run only the failing hook by name: `uv run pre-commit run <hook-name> --all`.\n  - If hooks conflict (format vs. lint), resolve the underlying formatting/code issue, then re-run the affected hooks.\n- When all hooks pass, run `uv run pre-commit run --all` again to confirm.\n- Ruff is the linter; rules are in `pyproject.toml`.\n- Type checking uses `ty`. Use specific ignores only when needed, e.g. `# ty: ignore[attr-defined]` with a short reason\n  when not obvious.\n- Pre-commit configuration is in `.pre-commit-config.yaml`.\n\n### 3) Commit\n\n- Ensure tests and pre-commit pass before committing.\n- Use a conventional commit message (single line, lowercase, <72 chars when possible).\n- If needed, inspect changes to choose the correct type: `git status -sb`, `git diff --stat`.\n- If the changes are already known, skip `git status` and `git diff` and choose the type directly.\n- Examples: `feat: added config validator with schema builder`, `fix: corrected validation error message formatting`.\n- Avoid multi-line messages or vague subjects.\n- Branch names should be kebab-case and prefixed: `feature/`, `bugfix/`, `refactor/`, `docs/`, `test/`.\n\n### 4) Push\n\n- Push with `git push` (autoSetupRemote/autoSetupMerge is configured).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:13:36.158Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CI/CD Agents requiring automated validation and deployment workflows with Pytest and Git.","zh":"适合需要使用 Pytest 和 Git 自动化验证和部署工作流的 CI/CD 代理。","ja":"Pytest および Git を使用して自動化された検証およびデプロイ ワークフローを必要とする CI/CD エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Pytest 및 Git를 사용하여 자동화된 검증 및 배포 워크플로가 필요한 CI/CD 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que requieren flujos de trabajo de validación y despliegue automatizados con Pytest y Git.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents CI/CD nécessitant des flux de travail de validation et de déploiement automatisés avec Pytest et Git.","de":"Ideal für CI/CD-Agents, die automatisierte Validierungs- und Deploy-Workflows mit Pytest und Git benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de validação e implantação automatizados com Pytest e Git.","ru":"Идеально для агентов CI/CD, требующих автоматизированных рабочих процессов проверки и развертывания с помощью Pytest и Git.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل CI/CD التي تتطلب تدفقات عمل التحقق التلقائي والتركيب باستخدام Pytest و Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate testing with Pytest, create conventional commits, and push changes to repositories using Git, ensuring seamless and reliable deployment pipelines with uv run pytest and pyproject.toml configurations.","zh":"赋予代理自动化使用 Pytest 进行测试、创建标准提交以及使用 Git 将更改推送到存储库，确保使用 uv run pytest 和 pyproject.toml 配置实现无缝且可靠的部署管道。","ja":"Pytest を使用してテストを自動化し、標準的なコミットを作成し、Git を使用して変更をリポジトリにプッシュすることで、uv run pytest および pyproject.toml 構成を使用してシームレスで信頼性の高いデプロイ パイプラインを実現します。","ko":"Pytest를 사용하여 테스트를 자동화하고 표준 커밋을 생성하며 Git을 사용하여 변경 사항을 리포지토리에 푸시함으로써 uv run pytest 및 pyproject.toml 구성으로 무결점이고 신뢰할 수 있는 배포 파이프라인을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas con Pytest, crear commits convencionales y enviar cambios a los repositorios utilizando Git, lo que garantiza canalizaciones de despliegue sin problemas y confiables con configuraciones de uv run pytest y pyproject.toml.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests avec Pytest, de créer des commits conventionnels et de pousser les modifications vers les référentiels en utilisant Git, assurant ainsi des pipelines de déploiement sans problème et fiables avec des configurations uv run pytest et pyproject.toml.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Tests mit Pytest zu automatisieren, konventionelle Commits zu erstellen und Änderungen an die Repositorys mit Git zu übertragen, wodurch nahtlose und zuverlässige Deployment-Pipelines mit uv run pytest- und pyproject.toml-Konfigurationen sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar os testes com Pytest, criar compromissos convencionais e enviar alterações para repositórios usando Git, garantindo pipelines de implantação sem interrupções e confiáveis com configurações uv run pytest e pyproject.toml.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование с помощью Pytest, создавать конвенциональные коммиты и отправлять изменения в репозитории с помощью Git, обеспечивая бесперебойные и надежные конвейеры развертывания с конфигурациями uv run pytest и pyproject.toml.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من تutomation الاختبارات باستخدام Pytest، وإنشاء التزامات تقليدية وإرسال التغييرات إلى المستودعات باستخدام Git، مما يضمن خطوط أنابيب تركيب موثوقة وبدون انقطاع مع تكوينات uv run pytest و pyproject.toml."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test-driven development with Pytest","Validating code changes before deployment","Streamlining Git workflows with conventional commits"],"zh":["使用 Pytest 自动化测试驱动开发","在部署前验证代码更改","使用标准提交简化 Git 工作流"],"ja":["Pytest を使用したテスト駆動開発の自動化","デプロイ前のコード変更の検証","標準コミットを使用した Git ワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["Pytest를 사용한 테스트 주도 개발 자동화","배포 전 코드 변경 사항 검증","표준 커밋을 사용한 Git 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar el desarrollo dirigido por pruebas con Pytest","Validar los cambios de código antes del despliegue","Optimizar los flujos de trabajo de Git con commits convencionales"],"fr":["Automatiser le développement piloté par les tests avec Pytest","Valider les modifications de code avant le déploiement","Optimiser les flux de travail Git avec des commits conventionnels"],"de":["Testgetriebene Entwicklung mit Pytest automatisieren","Code-Änderungen vor dem Deployment validieren","Git-Workflows mit konventionellen Commits optimieren"],"pt":["Automatizar o desenvolvimento orientado a testes com Pytest","Validar alterações de código antes da implantação","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho do Git com compromissos convencionais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разработку, ориентированную на тестирование, с помощью Pytest","Проверять изменения кода перед развертыванием","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы Git с помощью конвенциональных коммитов"],"ar":["توفير التطوير الموجه بإختبار باستخدام Pytest","التحقق من تغييرات الكود قبل التثبيت","تبسيط تدفقات العمل في Git باستخدام الالتزامات التقليدية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Pytest installation","Python environment needed","Git repository access required"],"zh":["需要 Pytest 安装","需要 Python 环境","需要 Git 存储库访问"],"ja":["Pytest のインストールが必要","Python 環境が必要","Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Pytest 설치 필요","Python 환경 필요","Git 리포지토리 접근 필요"],"es":["Se requiere la instalación de Pytest","Se necesita un entorno de Python","Se requiere acceso al repositorio de Git"],"fr":["L''installation de Pytest est requise","Un environnement Python est nécessaire","L''accès au référentiel Git est requis"],"de":["Pytest-Installation erforderlich","Python-Umgebung erforderlich","Git-Repository-Zugriff erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Pytest","Ambiente Python necessário","Acesso ao repositório Git necessário"],"ru":["Требуется установка Pytest","Необходимо окружение Python","Требуется доступ к репозиторию Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب Pytest","بيئة بايثون ضرورية","يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
