ibles avec Gemini Conductor","Maintenance d''artefacts pour garantir la compatibilité","Compatibilité avec l''extension Gemini Conductor","Structure de fichier requise pour la configuration","Prise en charge de la création de nouveaux projets et du suivi des progrès"],"de":["Erstellung von Artefakten, die mit Gemini Conductor kompatibel sind","Wartung von Artefakten, um die Kompatibilität zu gewährleisten","Kompatibilität mit der Erweiterung Gemini Conductor","Erforderliche Dateistruktur für die Konfiguration","Unterstützung für die Erstellung neuer Projekte und die Verfolgung des Fortschritts"],"pt":["Criação de artefatos compatíveis","Manutenção de tracks e projetos","Integração com a extensão Gemini Conductor","Suporte a novos projetos e tracks","Verificação de progresso e reverter alterações"],"ru":["Создание совместимых артефактов","Поддержка треков и проектов","Интеграция с расширением Gemini Conductor","Поддержка новых проектов и треков","Проверка прогресса и отмена изменений"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات متوافقة","صيانة المسارات والمشاريع","التكامل مع ملحق قائد الأوركسترا جيمي","دعم مشاريع وتراكات جديدة","فحص التقدم وإلغاء التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Conductor兼容性","Gemini Conductor扩展","Conductor项目","Codex技能","项目设置","状态管理"],"ja":["Conductor互換性","Gemini Conductor拡張機能","Conductorプロジェクト","Codexスキル","プロジェクト設定","状態管理"],"ko":["Conductor 호환성","Gemini Conductor 확장","Conductor 프로젝트","Codex 스킬","프로젝트 설정","상태 관리"],"es":["Conductor","Gemini Conductor","compatibilidad","artefactos","desarrollo","extensión","configuración","proyectos","seguimiento de progreso"],"fr":["Conductor","Gemini Conductor","compatibilité","artefacts","développement","extension","configuration","projets","suivi des progrès"],"de":["Conductor","Gemini Conductor","Kompatibilität","Artefakte","Entwicklung","Erweiterung","Konfiguration","Projekte","Fortschrittsverfolgung"],"pt":["Conductor","Gemini Conductor","compatibilidade","desenvolvedores","codex","artefatos","tracks","projetos"],"ru":["Conductor","Gemini Conductor","совместимость","разработчики","codex","артефакты","треки","проекты"],"ar":["قائد الأوركسترا","قائد الأوركسترا جيمي","التوافق","المطورين","كودكس","الملفات","التراكات","المشاريع"]}},"owner":"pythrick","repo":"codex-conductor","repoPath":"pythrick/codex-conductor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"conductor","description":"Maintain Conductor-compatible project context, tracks, specs, and plans.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Conductor Compatibility Skill\n\nPurpose: create and maintain Conductor artifacts so they remain fully compatible with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow (Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement).\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to set up a new project context, start a new track, implement or resume a track, check progress, or revert work.\n\n## Required File Structure (Do Not Deviate)\n\n```\nconductor/\n  product.md\n  product-guidelines.md\n  tech-stack.md\n  workflow.md\n  setup_state.json","body":"# Conductor Compatibility Skill\n\nPurpose: create and maintain Conductor artifacts so they remain fully compatible with the Gemini Conductor extension and its workflow (Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement).\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to set up a new project context, start a new track, implement or resume a track, check progress, or revert work.\n\n## Required File Structure (Do Not Deviate)\n\n```\nconductor/\n  product.md\n  product-guidelines.md\n  tech-stack.md\n  workflow.md\n  setup_state.json\n  code_styleguides/\n    *.md\n  tracks.md\n  tracks/\n    <track_id>/\n      spec.md\n      plan.md\n      metadata.json\n  archive/                 (optional)\n    <track_id>/            (optional)\n```\n\n## Required Formats\n\n### Track ID\n- Format: `shortname_YYYYMMDD` (lowercase ASCII, underscores only).\n- Example: `auth_20251219`.\n\n### `conductor/tracks.md`\n- Must use `---` separators between track sections.\n- Each track section must use the exact heading format below.\n\n```\n---\n\n## [ ] Track: <Track Description>\n*Link: [./conductor/tracks/<track_id>/](./conductor/tracks/<track_id>/)*\n```\n\n### `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/metadata.json`\n- Required keys: `track_id`, `type`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `description`.\n- Timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC, e.g., `2025-12-19T23:59:59Z`.\n- `status` values: `new`, `in_progress`, `completed`, `cancelled`.\n\n### `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/plan.md`\n- Use checklist markers: `[ ]` (pending), `[~]` (in progress), `[x]` (done).\n- When completing a task, append the first 7 chars of the commit SHA to the task line.\n- If the workflow defines the Phase Completion Verification protocol, append a meta-task to each phase:\n  `- [ ] Task: Conductor - User Manual Verification ''<Phase Name>'' (Protocol in workflow.md)`\n- When a phase is checkpointed, append `[checkpoint: <sha>]` to the phase heading.\n\n## Setup Workflow (Greenfield or Brownfield)\n\n1. Detect project maturity (greenfield vs brownfield) based on repo and code presence.\n2. Create `conductor/` and `conductor/setup_state.json` if missing. Start with:\n   `{ \"last_successful_step\": \"\" }`\n3. Generate or update the core documents with user input:\n   - `product.md`\n   - `product-guidelines.md`\n   - `tech-stack.md`\n4. Copy the workflow template from `assets/templates/workflow.md` into `conductor/workflow.md` unless the user provides a custom workflow.\n5. Copy code style guides from `assets/templates/code_styleguides/` into `conductor/code_styleguides/`.\n6. Initialize `conductor/tracks.md` using the format in `assets/templates/tracks.md`.\n7. Create the initial track folder and artifacts (`spec.md`, `plan.md`, `metadata.json`).\n8. Update `conductor/setup_state.json` as steps complete using these values:\n   - `2.1_product_guide`\n   - `2.2_product_guidelines`\n   - `2.3_tech_stack`\n   - `2.4_code_styleguides`\n   - `2.5_workflow`\n   - `3.3_initial_track_generated`\n\n## New Track Workflow\n\n1. Confirm Conductor is set up (`product.md`, `tech-stack.md`, `workflow.md` exist).\n2. Collect or confirm a track description.\n3. Draft and confirm `spec.md` (requirements, acceptance criteria, out of scope).\n4. Draft and confirm `plan.md` based on `workflow.md` (TDD steps if required).\n5. Create `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/` with `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `metadata.json`.\n6. Append the track section to `conductor/tracks.md` using the required format.\n\n## Implement Workflow\n\n1. Parse `conductor/tracks.md` by `---` separators and select the target track.\n2. Mark the selected track as `[~]` in `conductor/tracks.md` before work starts.\n3. Read `conductor/tracks/<track_id>/spec.md`, `plan.md`, and `conductor/workflow.md`.\n4. Execute tasks strictly following the Task Workflow in `workflow.md` (including tests, commits, git notes, and plan updates).\n5. When the track is complete, mark the track as `[x]` in `conductor/tracks.md`.\n6. Synchronize `product.md`, `tech-stack.md`, and `product-guidelines.md` when the spec warrants it, with explicit user approval.\n7. Offer to archive or delete the completed track. If archiving, move it to `conductor/archive/<track_id>` and remove its section from `tracks.md`.\n\n## Status Workflow\n\n- Verify Conductor setup and `conductor/tracks.md` exists.\n- Summarize counts of tracks and tasks (done/in progress/pending).\n- Report current phase/task and next action.\n\n## Revert Workflow\n\n- Confirm the target track/phase/task from `tracks.md` and `plan.md`.\n- Use git history to identify associated commits.\n- Present a clear revert plan and wait for explicit user confirmation before executing any destructive action.\n\n## Templates Available\n\n- `assets/templates/workflow.md`\n- `assets/templates/code_styleguides/*.md`\n- `assets/templates/tracks.md`\n- `assets/templates/product.md`\n- `assets/templates/product-guidelines.md`\n- `assets/templates/tech-stack.md`\n- `assets/templates/spec.md`\n- `assets/templates/plan.md`\n- `assets/templates/metadata.json`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:14:18.106Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents requiring seamless integration with the Gemini Conductor extension for project context management.","zh":"适用于需要与Gemini Conductor扩展进行无缝集成以进行项目上下文管理的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"Gemini Conductor拡張機能とのシームレスな統合が必要なワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Gemini Conductor 확장 기능과의无缝 통합이 필요한 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents requiring seamless integration with the Gemini Conductor extension for project context management.","fr":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents requiring seamless integration with the Gemini Conductor extension for project context management.","de":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents requiring seamless integration with the Gemini Conductor extension for project context management.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que exigem integração perfeita com a extensão Gemini Conductor para gerenciamento de contexto do projeto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, требующих бесшовной интеграции с расширением Gemini Conductor для управления контекстом проекта.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات عمل وكيل التutomatisation المتطلبات التكامل السلس مع ملحق Gemini Conductor لإدارة سياق المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and maintain Conductor artifacts, ensuring compatibility with the Gemini Conductor workflow and facilitating context setup, track implementation, and progress tracking through JSON files like setup_state.json.","zh":"赋予代理创建和维护Conductor工件的能力，确保与Gemini Conductor工作流的兼容性，并通过JSON文件（如setup_state.json）实现上下文设置、跟踪实现和进度跟踪。","ja":"エージェントがConductorアーティファクトを作成および維持できるようにし、Gemini Conductorワークフローとの互換性を確保し、JSONファイル（例： setup_state.json）を介してコンテキストの設定、実装の追跡、進捗の追跡を容易にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Conductor 아티팩트를 생성 및 유지 관리할 수 있도록 하여 Gemini Conductor 워크플로와의 호환성을 보장하고 JSON 파일(예: setup_state.json)을 통해 컨텍스트 설정, 구현 추적 및 진행 상황 추적을 허용합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to create and maintain Conductor artifacts, ensuring compatibility with the Gemini Conductor workflow and facilitating context setup, track implementation, and progress tracking through JSON files like setup_state.json.","fr":"Empowers agents to create and maintain Conductor artifacts, ensuring compatibility with the Gemini Conductor workflow and facilitating context setup, track implementation, and progress tracking through JSON files like setup_state.json.","de":"Empowers agents to create and maintain Conductor artifacts, ensuring compatibility with the Gemini Conductor workflow and facilitating context setup, track implementation, and progress tracking through JSON files like setup_state.json.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e manter artefatos do Conductor, garantindo compatibilidade com o fluxo de trabalho do Gemini Conductor e facilitando a configuração do contexto, implementação da faixa, e acompanhamento do progresso por meio de arquivos JSON como setup_state.json.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и поддерживать артефакты Conductor, обеспечивая совместимость с рабочим процессом Gemini Conductor и облегчая настройку контекста, отслеживание реализации и прогресса через файлы JSON, такие как setup_state.json.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وحفظ مكونات Conductor، مما يضمن التوافق مع تدفق عمل Gemini Conductor ويسهل إعداد السياق وتنفيذ المسار وتتبع التقدم من خلال ملفات JSON مثل setup_state.json."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new project contexts","Implementing or resuming tracks","Checking progress and reverting work","Maintaining product and tech stack guidelines in markdown files like product.md and tech-stack.md"],"zh":["设置新项目上下文","实现或恢复跟踪","检查进度和还原工作","在markdown文件中维护产品和技术栈指南，如product.md和tech-stack.md"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトコンテキストを設定する","実装または追跡を再開する","進捗状況を確認し、作業を元に戻す","product.mdやtech-stack.mdのようなマークダウンファイルで製品とテクノロジースタックのガイドラインを維持する"],"ko":["새 프로젝트 컨텍스트 설정","구현 또는 추적 재개","진행 상황 확인 및 작업 되돌리기","product.md 및 tech-stack.md와 같은 마크다운 파일에서 제품 및 기술 스택 가이드라인 유지"],"es":["Setting up new project contexts","Implementing or resuming tracks","Checking progress and reverting work","Maintaining product and tech stack guidelines in markdown files like product.md and tech-stack.md"],"fr":["Setting up new project contexts","Implementing or resuming tracks","Checking progress and reverting work","Maintaining product and tech stack guidelines in markdown files like product.md and tech-stack.md"],"de":["Setting up new project contexts","Implementing or resuming tracks","Checking progress and reverting work","Maintaining product and tech stack guidelines in markdown files like product.md and tech-stack.md"],"pt":["Configurando novos contextos de projeto","Implementando ou retomando faixas","Verificando progresso e reverter trabalho","Manter diretrizes de produto e pilha de tecnologia em arquivos markdown como product.md e tech-stack.md"],"ru":["Настройка новых контекстов проекта","Реализация или возобновление трасс","Проверка прогресса и отмена работы","Поддержание рекомендаций по продукту и технологическому стеку в файлах markdown, таких как product.md и tech-stack.md"],"ar":["إعداد سياقات المشروع الجديدة","تنفيذ أو استئناف المسارات","التحقق من التقدم وإلغاء العمل","الحفاظ على إرشادات المنتج ومتطلبات التكنولوجيا في ملفات markdown مثل product.md وtech-stack.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific file structure with conductor directory","Compatibility limited to Gemini Conductor extension","Must adhere to predefined workflow of Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement"],"zh":["需要具有conductor目录的特定文件结构","兼容性仅限于Gemini Conductor扩展","必须遵循预定义的工作流：上下文 -> 规范和计划 -> 实现"],"ja":["conductorディレクトリを含む特定のファイル構造が必要","互換性はGemini Conductor拡張機能に限定される","コンテキスト -> 仕様および計画 -> 実装という事前定義されたワークフローに従う必要がある"],"ko":["conductor 디렉토리를 포함하는 특정 파일 구조가 필요","호환성은 Gemini Conductor 확장 기능으로 제한","사전 정의된 워크플로우를 따라야 함: 컨텍스트 -> 사양 및 계획 -> 구현"],"es":["Requires specific file structure with conductor directory","Compatibility limited to Gemini Conductor extension","Must adhere to predefined workflow of Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement"],"fr":["Requires specific file structure with conductor directory","Compatibility limited to Gemini Conductor extension","Must adhere to predefined workflow of Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement"],"de":["Requires specific file structure with conductor directory","Compatibility limited to Gemini Conductor extension","Must adhere to predefined workflow of Context -> Spec & Plan -> Implement"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de arquivo específica com diretório do conductor","Compatibilidade limitada à extensão Gemini Conductor","Deve aderir ao fluxo de trabalho predefinido de Contexto -> Especificação e Plano -> Implementação"],"ru":["Требует специфической структуры файла с каталогом проводника","Совместимость ограничена расширением Gemini Conductor","Должен соответствовать предопределенному рабочему процессу Контекст -> Спецификация и План -> Реализация"],"ar":["يتطلب هيكلاً ملفًا محددًا مع دليل موجه","التوافق مقيد بملحق Gemini Conductor","يجب الالتزام بتدفق العمل المحدد مسبقًا من السياق إلى المواصفات والخطة ثم التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
