e tipos","configuración estricta","optimización de inferencia de tipos","decoradores","metadatos","módulos","espacios de nombres"],"fr":["TypeScript","typage avancé","développement d''entreprise","systèmes de types","configuration stricte","optimisation de l''inférence de types","décorateurs","métadonnées","modules","espaces de noms"],"de":["TypeScript","erweitertes Typisieren","Unternehmensentwicklung","Typsysteme","strenge Konfiguration","Optimierung der Typinferenz","Dekoratoren","Metadaten","Modulsysteme","Namensräume"],"pt":["TypeScript","tipagem avançada","desenvolvimento de nível empresarial","sistemas de tipo avançados","configuração estrita do TypeScript","otimização de inferência de tipo","programação de decoradores","integração com React","integração com Node.js","integração com Express"],"ru":["TypeScript","продвинутая типизация","разработка корпоративного уровня","продвинутые системы типов","строгая конфигурация TypeScript","оптимизация вывода типов","программирование декораторов","интеграция с React","интеграция с Node.js","интеграция с Express"],"ar":["TypeScript","النمط المتقدم","التطوير على مستوى المؤسسة","أنظمة النمط المتقدمة","تكوين TypeScript الصارم","تحسين استدلال النمط","برمجة المزينين","التكامل مع React","التكامل مع Node.js","التكامل مع Express"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"typescript-pro","description":"Master TypeScript with advanced types, generics, and strict type safety. Handles complex type systems, decorators, and enterprise-grade patterns. Use PROACTIVELY for TypeScript architecture, type inference optimization, or advanced typing patterns.","bodyPreview":"You are a TypeScript expert specializing in advanced typing and enterprise-grade development.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Advanced type systems (generics, conditional types, mapped types)\n- Strict TypeScript configuration and compiler options\n- Type inference optimization and utility types\n- Decorators and metadata programming\n- Module systems and namespace organization\n- Integration with modern frameworks (React, Node.js, Express)\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Leverage strict type checking with appropriate compiler","body":"You are a TypeScript expert specializing in advanced typing and enterprise-grade development.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Advanced type systems (generics, conditional types, mapped types)\n- Strict TypeScript configuration and compiler options\n- Type inference optimization and utility types\n- Decorators and metadata programming\n- Module systems and namespace organization\n- Integration with modern frameworks (React, Node.js, Express)\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Leverage strict type checking with appropriate compiler flags\n2. Use generics and utility types for maximum type safety\n3. Prefer type inference over explicit annotations when clear\n4. Design robust interfaces and abstract classes\n5. Implement proper error boundaries with typed exceptions\n6. Optimize build times with incremental compilation\n\n## Output\n\n- Strongly-typed TypeScript with comprehensive interfaces\n- Generic functions and classes with proper constraints\n- Custom utility types and advanced type manipulations\n- Jest/Vitest tests with proper type assertions\n- TSConfig optimization for project requirements\n- Type declaration files (.d.ts) for external libraries\n\nSupport both strict and gradual typing approaches. Include comprehensive TSDoc comments and maintain compatibility with latest TypeScript versions.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:15:44.794Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents requiring advanced TypeScript typing and enterprise-grade development capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级TypeScript类型和企业级开发能力的代码生成代理。","ja":"高度なTypeScript型とエンタープライズグレードの開発機能を必要とするコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 TypeScript 타이핑 및 엔터프라이즈급 개발 기능이 필요한 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de código que requieren tipado avanzado de TypeScript y capacidades de desarrollo de nivel empresarial.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de code nécessitant un typage TypeScript avancé et des capacités de développement de niveau entreprise.","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungsagenten, die erweitertes TypeScript-Typing und unternehmensweite Entwicklungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents requiring advanced TypeScript typing and enterprise-grade development capabilities.","ru":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents requiring advanced TypeScript typing and enterprise-grade development capabilities.","ar":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents requiring advanced TypeScript typing and enterprise-grade development capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage strict type checking with compiler options, utilizing advanced type systems like generics, conditional types, and mapped types, while integrating with modern frameworks such as React, Node.js, and Express.","zh":"赋予代理使用编译器选项执行严格的类型检查，利用高级类型系统，如泛型、条件类型和映射类型，同时集成现代框架，如React、Node.js和Express。","ja":"コンパイラオプションを使用して厳格な型チェックを実行することでエージェントを強化し、高度な型システム（ジェネリクス、条件付き型、 맵드 タイプなど）を利用し、 React、Node.js、Expressなどのモダンフレームワークと統合します。","ko":"컴파일러 옵션을 사용하여 엄격한 타입 검사를 수행하여 에이전트를 강화하고, 제네릭, 조건부 타입, 매핑된 타입과 같은 고급 타입 시스템을 활용하며, React, Node.js, Express 등의 모던 프레임워크와 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la verificación estricta de tipos con opciones del compilador, utilizando sistemas de tipos avanzados como genéricos, tipos condicionales y tipos mapeados, al mismo tiempo que se integran con frameworks modernos como React, Node.js y Express.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter la vérification stricte des types avec des options de compilateur, en utilisant des systèmes de types avancés tels que les génériques, les types conditionnels et les types mappés, tout en s''intégrant avec des frameworks modernes tels que React, Node.js et Express.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, strikte Typüberprüfung mit Compiler-Optionen zu nutzen, indem erweiterte Typsysteme wie Generics, bedingte Typen und zugeordnete Typen verwendet werden, während gleichzeitig eine Integration mit modernen Frameworks wie React, Node.js und Express erfolgt.","pt":"Empowers agents to leverage strict type checking with compiler options, utilizing advanced type systems like generics, conditional types, and mapped types, while integrating with modern frameworks such as React, Node.js, and Express.","ru":"Empowers agents to leverage strict type checking with compiler options, utilizing advanced type systems like generics, conditional types, and mapped types, while integrating with modern frameworks such as React, Node.js, and Express.","ar":"Empowers agents to leverage strict type checking with compiler options, utilizing advanced type systems like generics, conditional types, and mapped types, while integrating with modern frameworks such as React, Node.js, and Express."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing robust type inference optimization and utility types","Developing modular systems with namespace organization and decorators","Integrating TypeScript with React, Node.js, and Express for scalable applications"],"zh":["实现强大的类型推断优化和实用类型","使用命名空间组织和装饰器开发模块化系统","将TypeScript与React、Node.js和Express集成，以创建可扩展的应用程序"],"ja":["強力な型推論の最適化とユーティリティ型の実装","ネームスペースの組織化とデコレータを使用したモジュラーシステムの開発","TypeScriptとReact、Node.js、Expressの統合によるスケーラブルなアプリケーションの作成"],"ko":["강력한 타입 추론 최적화 및 유틸리티 타입 구현","네임스페이스 조직 및 데코레이터를 사용한 모듈화 시스템 개발","TypeScript와 React, Node.js, Express의 통합을 통한 확장 가능한 애플리케이션 생성"],"es":["Implementar la optimización de inferencia de tipos robusta y tipos de utilidad","Desarrollar sistemas modulares con organización de espacios de nombres y decoradores","Integrar TypeScript con React, Node.js y Express para aplicaciones escalables"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''optimisation de l''inférence de type robuste et les types d''utilité","Développer des systèmes modulaires avec une organisation d''espaces de noms et des décorateurs","Intégrer TypeScript avec React, Node.js et Express pour des applications évolutives"],"de":["Implementierung der robusten Typinferenzoptimierung und Utility-Typen","Entwicklung modularer Systeme mit Namensraumorganisation und Dekoratoren","Integration von TypeScript mit React, Node.js und Express für skalierbare Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementing robust type inference optimization and utility types","Developing modular systems with namespace organization and decorators","Integrating TypeScript with React, Node.js, and Express for scalable applications"],"ru":["Implementing robust type inference optimization and utility types","Developing modular systems with namespace organization and decorators","Integrating TypeScript with React, Node.js, and Express for scalable applications"],"ar":["Implementing robust type inference optimization and utility types","Developing modular systems with namespace organization and decorators","Integrating TypeScript with React, Node.js, and Express for scalable applications"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict TypeScript configuration","Limited to TypeScript-based projects","Dependent on compatibility with specific frameworks like React, Node.js, and Express"],"zh":["需要严格的TypeScript配置","仅限于TypeScript项目","依赖于与特定框架（如React、Node.js和Express）的兼容性"],"ja":["厳格なTypeScriptの設定が必要","TypeScriptベースのプロジェクトのみ","特定のフレームワーク（React、Node.js、Expressなど）との互換性に依存"],"ko":["엄격한 TypeScript 구성이 필요","TypeScript 기반 프로젝트에만 국한","특정 프레임워크(React, Node.js, Express 등)와의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una configuración estricta de TypeScript","Limitado a proyectos basados en TypeScript","Dependiente de la compatibilidad con frameworks específicos como React, Node.js y Express"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration stricte de TypeScript","Limité aux projets basés sur TypeScript","Dépend de la compatibilité avec des frameworks spécifiques tels que React, Node.js et Express"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte TypeScript-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-basierte Projekte","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität mit bestimmten Frameworks wie React, Node.js und Express"],"pt":["Requires strict TypeScript configuration","Limited to TypeScript-based projects","Dependent on compatibility with specific frameworks like React, Node.js, and Express"],"ru":["Requires strict TypeScript configuration","Limited to TypeScript-based projects","Dependent on compatibility with specific frameworks like React, Node.js, and Express"],"ar":["Requires strict TypeScript configuration","Limited to TypeScript-based projects","Dependent on compatibility with specific frameworks like React, Node.js, and Express"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
