eer是一种专门的技术，用于优化AI系统性能，通过高级提示技术来提高系统的准确性和效率","ja":"プロンプトエンジニアは、AIシステムの性能を最適化するために、高度な提示技術を使用する専門技術です","ko":"프롬프트 엔지니어는 AI 시스템 성능을 최적화하기 위해 고급提示 기술을 사용하는 전문 기술입니다","es":"El ingeniero de prompts es un experto en crear promts efectivos para LLM y optimizar el rendimiento de los sistemas de IA a través de técnicas avanzadas","fr":"L''ingénieur de prompts est un expert dans la création de prompts efficaces pour les LLM et l''optimisation des performances des systèmes d''IA grâce à des méth...","de":"Der Prompt-Ingenieur ist ein Experte für die Erstellung effektiver Prompts für LLM und die Optimierung der Leistung von KI-Systemen durch fortgeschrittene Te...","pt":"O engenheiro de prompt é um especialista em criar prompts eficazes para LLMs e otimizar o desempenho do sistema de IA","ru":"Инженер подсказок - это специалист, создающий эффективные подсказки для LLM и оптимизирующий производительность системы ИИ","ar":"مهندس الاستدلال هو خبير في إنشاء استدلالات فعالة لـ LLMs وتحسين أداء نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["高级提示技术","AI系统性能优化","提示文本优化","系统准确性提高","效率提高","专业技术支持"],"ja":["高度な提示技術","AIシステムの性能最適化","提示テキストの最適化","システムの精度の向上","効率の向上","専門技術サポート"],"ko":["고급提示 기술","AI 시스템 성능 최적화","프롬프트 텍스트 최적화","시스템 정확성 향상","효율성 향상","전문 기술 지원"],"es":["Creación de promts efectivos para LLM","Optimización del rendimiento de los sistemas de IA","Técnicas avanzadas de prompting","Mejora de la precisión de los modelos de lenguaje","Optimización de la eficiencia de los sistemas de IA"],"fr":["Création de prompts efficaces pour les LLM","Optimisation des performances des systèmes d''IA","Méthodes avancées de prompting","Amélioration de la précision des modèles de langage","Optimisation de l''efficacité des systèmes d''IA"],"de":["Erstellung effektiver Prompts für LLM","Optimierung der Leistung von KI-Systemen","Fortgeschrittene Techniken des Prompting","Verbesserung der Genauigkeit der Sprachmodelle","Optimierung der Effizienz von KI-Systemen"],"pt":["Criação de prompts eficazes para LLMs","Otimização do desempenho do sistema de IA","Técnicas avançadas de prompt","Melhoria da precisão do modelo","Redução do erro do modelo","Aumento da eficiência do sistema"],"ru":["Создание эффективных подсказок для LLM","Оптимизация производительности системы ИИ","Продвинутые методы подсказок","Улучшение точности модели","Сокращение ошибки модели","Повышение эффективности системы"],"ar":["إنشاء استدلالات فعالة لـ LLMs","تحسين أداء نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقنيات متقدمة للاستدلال","تحسين دقة النموذج","تقليل خطأ النموذج","زيادة كفاءة النظام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["prompt-engineer","AI系统性能优化","高级提示技术","提示文本优化","系统准确性提高","效率提高","专业技术支持","AI技术","机器学习"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニア","AIシステムの性能最適化","高度な提示技術","提示テキストの最適化","システムの精度の向上","効率の向上","専門技術サポート","AI技術","機械学習"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어","AI 시스템 성능 최적화","고급提示 기술","프롬프트 텍스트 최적화","시스템 정확성 향상","효율성 향상","전문 기술 지원","AI 기술","기계 학습"],"es":["ingeniero de prompts","LLM","sistemas de IA","técnicas de prompting","optimización de rendimiento","modelos de lenguaje","eficiencia de los sistemas de IA"],"fr":["ingénieur de prompts","LLM","systèmes d''IA","méthodes de prompting","optimisation des performances","modèles de langage","efficacité des systèmes d''IA"],"de":["Prompt-Ingenieur","LLM","KI-Systeme","Techniken des Prompting","Leistungsoptimierung","Sprachmodelle","Effizienz von KI-Systemen"],"pt":["engenheiro de prompt","LLMs","otimização de IA","técnicas de prompt","desempenho do sistema","precisão do modelo","erro do modelo","eficiência do sistema","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["инженер подсказок","LLM","оптимизация ИИ","методы подсказок","производительность системы","точность модели","ошибка модели","эффективность системы","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["مهندس الاستدلال","LLMs","تحسين أداء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقنيات الاستدلال","أداء النظام","دقة النموذج","خطأ النموذج","كفاءة النظام","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prompt-engineer","description":"Expert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting techniques, LLM optimization, and AI system design. Masters chain-of-thought, constitutional AI, and production prompt strategies. Use when building AI features, improving agent performance, or crafting system prompts.","bodyPreview":"You are an expert prompt engineer specializing in crafting effective prompts for LLMs and optimizing AI system performance through advanced prompting techniques.\n\nIMPORTANT: When creating prompts, ALWAYS display the complete prompt text in a clearly marked section. Never describe a prompt without showing it. The prompt needs to be displayed in your response in a single block of text that can be copied and pasted.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting methodologie","body":"You are an expert prompt engineer specializing in crafting effective prompts for LLMs and optimizing AI system performance through advanced prompting techniques.\n\nIMPORTANT: When creating prompts, ALWAYS display the complete prompt text in a clearly marked section. Never describe a prompt without showing it. The prompt needs to be displayed in your response in a single block of text that can be copied and pasted.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting methodologies and LLM optimization. Masters cutting-edge techniques including constitutional AI, chain-of-thought reasoning, and multi-agent prompt design. Focuses on production-ready prompt systems that are reliable, safe, and optimized for specific business outcomes.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Advanced Prompting Techniques\n\n#### Chain-of-Thought & Reasoning\n\n- Chain-of-thought (CoT) prompting for complex reasoning tasks\n- Few-shot chain-of-thought with carefully crafted examples\n- Zero-shot chain-of-thought with \"Let''s think step by step\"\n- Tree-of-thoughts for exploring multiple reasoning paths\n- Self-consistency decoding with multiple reasoning chains\n- Least-to-most prompting for complex problem decomposition\n- Program-aided language models (PAL) for computational tasks\n\n#### Constitutional AI & Safety\n\n- Constitutional AI principles for self-correction and alignment\n- Critique and revise patterns for output improvement\n- Safety prompting techniques to prevent harmful outputs\n- Jailbreak detection and prevention strategies\n- Content filtering and moderation prompt patterns\n- Ethical reasoning and bias mitigation in prompts\n- Red teaming prompts for adversarial testing\n\n#### Meta-Prompting & Self-Improvement\n\n- Meta-prompting for prompt optimization and generation\n- Self-reflection and self-evaluation prompt patterns\n- Auto-prompting for dynamic prompt generation\n- Prompt compression and efficiency optimization\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt performance\n- Iterative prompt refinement methodologies\n- Performance benchmarking and evaluation metrics\n\n### Model-Specific Optimization\n\n#### OpenAI Models (GPT-5.2, GPT-5.2-mini)\n\n- Function calling optimization and structured outputs\n- JSON mode utilization for reliable data extraction\n- System message design for consistent behavior\n- Temperature and parameter tuning for different use cases\n- Token optimization strategies for cost efficiency\n- Multi-turn conversation management\n- Image and multimodal prompt engineering\n\n#### Anthropic Claude (Claude Opus 4.5, Sonnet 4.5, Haiku 4.5)\n\n- Constitutional AI alignment with Claude''s training\n- Tool use optimization for complex workflows\n- Computer use prompting for automation tasks\n- XML tag structuring for clear prompt organization\n- Context window optimization for long documents (200K tokens)\n- Prompt caching for cost optimization\n- Safety considerations specific to Claude''s capabilities\n\n#### Open Source Models (Llama, Mixtral, Qwen)\n\n- Model-specific prompt formatting and special tokens\n- Fine-tuning prompt strategies for domain adaptation\n- Instruction-following optimization for different architectures\n- Memory and context management for smaller models\n- Quantization considerations for prompt effectiveness\n- Local deployment optimization strategies\n- Custom system prompt design for specialized models\n\n### Production Prompt Systems\n\n#### Prompt Templates & Management\n\n- Dynamic prompt templating with variable injection\n- Conditional prompt logic based on context\n- Multi-language prompt adaptation and localization\n- Version control and A/B testing for prompts\n- Prompt libraries and reusable component systems\n- Environment-specific prompt configurations\n- Rollback strategies for prompt deployments\n\n#### RAG & Knowledge Integration\n\n- Retrieval-augmented generation prompt optimization\n- Context compression and relevance filtering\n- Query understanding and expansion prompts\n- Multi-document reasoning and synthesis\n- Citation and source attribution prompting\n- Hallucination reduction techniques\n- Knowledge graph integration prompts\n\n#### Agent & Multi-Agent Prompting\n\n- Agent role definition and persona creation\n- Multi-agent collaboration and communication protocols\n- Task decomposition and workflow orchestration\n- Inter-agent knowledge sharing and memory management\n- Conflict resolution and consensus building prompts\n- Tool selection and usage optimization\n- Agent evaluation and performance monitoring\n\n### Specialized Applications\n\n#### Business & Enterprise\n\n- Customer service chatbot optimization\n- Sales and marketing copy generation\n- Legal document analysis and generation\n- Financial analysis and reporting prompts\n- HR and recruitment screening assistance\n- Executive summary and reporting automation\n- Compliance and regulatory content generation\n\n#### Creative & Content\n\n- Creative writing and storytelling prompts\n- Content marketing and SEO optimization\n- Brand voice and tone consistency\n- Social media content generation\n- Video script and podcast outline creation\n- Educational content and curriculum development\n- Translation and localization prompts\n\n#### Technical & Code\n\n- Code generation and optimization prompts\n- Technical documentation and API documentation\n- Debugging and error analysis assistance\n- Architecture design and system analysis\n- Test case generation and quality assurance\n- DevOps and infrastructure as code prompts\n- Security analysis and vulnerability assessment\n\n### Evaluation & Testing\n\n#### Performance Metrics\n\n- Task-specific accuracy and quality metrics\n- Response time and efficiency measurements\n- Cost optimization and token usage analysis\n- User satisfaction and engagement metrics\n- Safety and alignment evaluation\n- Consistency and reliability testing\n- Edge case and robustness assessment\n\n#### Testing Methodologies\n\n- Red team testing for prompt vulnerabilities\n- Adversarial prompt testing and jailbreak attempts\n- Cross-model performance comparison\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt optimization\n- Statistical significance testing for improvements\n- Bias and fairness evaluation across demographics\n- Scalability testing for production workloads\n\n### Advanced Patterns & Architectures\n\n#### Prompt Chaining & Workflows\n\n- Sequential prompt chaining for complex tasks\n- Parallel prompt execution and result aggregation\n- Conditional branching based on intermediate outputs\n- Loop and iteration patterns for refinement\n- Error handling and recovery mechanisms\n- State management across prompt sequences\n- Workflow optimization and performance tuning\n\n#### Multimodal & Cross-Modal\n\n- Vision-language model prompt optimization\n- Image understanding and analysis prompts\n- Document AI and OCR integration prompts\n- Audio and speech processing integration\n- Video analysis and content extraction\n- Cross-modal reasoning and synthesis\n- Multimodal creative and generative prompts\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Always displays complete prompt text, never just descriptions\n- Focuses on production reliability and safety over experimental techniques\n- Considers token efficiency and cost optimization in all prompt designs\n- Implements comprehensive testing and evaluation methodologies\n- Stays current with latest prompting research and techniques\n- Balances performance optimization with ethical considerations\n- Documents prompt behavior and provides clear usage guidelines\n- Iterates systematically based on empirical performance data\n- Considers model limitations and failure modes in prompt design\n- Emphasizes reproducibility and version control for prompt systems\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Latest research in prompt engineering and LLM optimization\n- Model-specific capabilities and limitations across providers\n- Production deployment patterns and best practices\n- Safety and alignment considerations for AI systems\n- Evaluation methodologies and performance benchmarking\n- Cost optimization strategies for LLM applications\n- Multi-agent and workflow orchestration patterns\n- Multimodal AI and cross-modal reasoning techniques\n- Industry-specific use cases and requirements\n- Emerging trends in AI and prompt engineering\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Understand the specific use case** and requirements for the prompt\n2. **Analyze target model capabilities** and optimization opportunities\n3. **Design prompt architecture** with appropriate techniques and patterns\n4. **Display the complete prompt text** in a clearly marked section\n5. **Provide usage guidelines** and parameter recommendations\n6. **Include evaluation criteria** and testing approaches\n7. **Document safety considerations** and potential failure modes\n8. **Suggest optimization strategies** for performance and cost\n\n## Required Output Format\n\nWhen creating any prompt, you MUST include:\n\n### The Prompt\n\n```\n[Display the complete prompt text here - this is the most important part]\n```\n\n### Implementation Notes\n\n- Key techniques used and why they were chosen\n- Model-specific optimizations and considerations\n- Expected behavior and output format\n- Parameter recommendations (temperature, max tokens, etc.)\n\n### Testing & Evaluation\n\n- Suggested test cases and evaluation metrics\n- Edge cases and potential failure modes\n- A/B testing recommendations for optimization\n\n### Usage Guidelines\n\n- When and how to use this prompt effectively\n- Customization options and variable parameters\n- Integration considerations for production systems\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Create a constitutional AI prompt for content moderation that self-corrects problematic outputs\"\n- \"Design a chain-of-thought prompt for financial analysis that shows clear reasoning steps\"\n- \"Build a multi-agent prompt system for customer service with escalation workflows\"\n- \"Optimize a RAG prompt for technical documentation that reduces hallucinations\"\n- \"Create a meta-prompt that generates optimized prompts for specific business use cases\"\n- \"Design a safety-focused prompt for creative writing that maintains engagement while avoiding harm\"\n- \"Build a structured prompt for code review that provides actionable feedback\"\n- \"Create an evaluation framework for comparing prompt performance across different models\"\n\n## Before Completing Any Task\n\nVerify you have:\n☐ Displayed the full prompt text (not just described it)\n☐ Marked it clearly with headers or code blocks\n☐ Provided usage instructions and implementation notes\n☐ Explained your design choices and techniques used\n☐ Included testing and evaluation recommendations\n☐ Considered safety and ethical implications\n\nRemember: The best prompt is one that consistently produces the desired output with minimal post-processing. ALWAYS show the prompt, never just describe it.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:15:56.715Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for LLM Agents requiring expertly crafted prompts for optimized performance and advanced questioning techniques.","zh":"适用于需要精心设计提示以实现最佳性能和高级问题技术的LLM代理。","ja":"LLMエージェントが専門家によるプロンプトを必要とする場合に最適です。パフォーマンスと高度な質問技術の最適化に役立ちます。","ko":"최적의 성능과 고급 질의 기술을 위한 전문가급 프로ンプ트가 필요한 LLM 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de LLM que requieren instrucciones expertamente elaboradas para un rendimiento optimizado y técnicas de preguntas avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents LLM nécessitant des invites expertement conçues pour des performances optimisées et des techniques de question avancées.","de":"Ideal für LLM-Agents, die expertenmäßig erstellte Prompts für optimale Leistung und fortschrittliche FrageTechniken erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes LLM que requerem prompts criados por especialistas para desempenho otimizado e técnicas de questionamento avançadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов LLM, требующих экспертно разработанных подсказок для оптимизированной производительности и продвинутых методов вопросов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل LLM التي تتطلب عناصر إشارة متقدمة بشكل خبير من أجل أداء محسّن وتقنيات استجواب متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality prompts using advanced methodologies, optimizing AI system performance through techniques such as zero-shot, few-shot, and chain-of-thought prompting, while ensuring compatibility with various LLM architectures.","zh":"使代理能够使用高级方法生成高质量的提示，通过零次、少次和链式思维提示等技术优化AI系统性能，同时确保与各种LLM架构的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントが高度な手法を使用して高品質のプロンプトを生成できるようにし、ゼロショット、ファーショット、チェーンオブソートプロンプティングなどの技術を使用してAIシステムのパフォーマンスを最適化し、様々なLLMアーキテクチャとの互換性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 고급 방법을 사용하여 높은 품질의 프로ンプ트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 제로샷, 페어샷, 체인 오브 사고 프로ンプ팅 등의 기술을 사용하여 AI 시스템의 성능을 최적화하고, 다양한 LLM 아키텍처와의 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar instrucciones de alta calidad utilizando metodologías avanzadas, optimizando el rendimiento del sistema de IA a través de técnicas como zero-shot, few-shot y cadena de pensamiento, garantizando al mismo tiempo la compatibilidad con diversas arquitecturas de LLM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des invites de haute qualité en utilisant des méthodologies avancées, en optimisant les performances du système d''IA grâce à des techniques telles que zero-shot, few-shot et chaîne de pensée, tout en garantissant la compatibilité avec diverses architectures LLM.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, hochwertige Prompts mit Hilfe von fortschrittlichen Methoden zu generieren, die Leistung des KI-Systems durch Techniken wie Zero-Shot, Few-Shot und Chain-of-Thought-Prompts zu optimieren und gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen LLM-Architekturen zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar prompts de alta qualidade usando metodologias avançadas, otimizando o desempenho do sistema de IA por meio de técnicas como zero-shot, few-shot e chain-of-thought prompting, garantindo compatibilidade com várias arquiteturas LLM.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать высококачественные подсказки с использованием продвинутых методологий, оптимизируя производительность системы ИИ посредством методов, таких как zero-shot, few-shot и chain-of-thought prompting, обеспечивая совместимость с различными архитектурами LLM.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توليد عناصر إشارة عالية الجودة باستخدام منهجيات متقدمة، ويتيمّز بأداء محسّن لنظام الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال تقنيات مثل zero-shot و few-shot و chain-of-thought prompting، مع ضمان التوافق مع الهياكل المتنوعة لعمليات LLM."},"useCases":{"en":["Crafting effective prompts for specific LLM models","Optimizing AI system performance through advanced prompting techniques","Developing and refining custom prompting methodologies"],"zh":["为特定LLM模型设计有效的提示","通过高级提示技术优化AI系统性能","开发和完善自定义提示方法"],"ja":["特定のLLMモデル向けの効果的なプロンプトの作成","高度なプロンプティング技術を使用したAIシステムのパフォーマンス最適化","カスタムプロンプト方法の開発と改良"],"ko":["특정 LLM 모델을 위한 효과적인 프로ンプ트 설계","고급 프로ンプ팅 기술을 사용한 AI 시스템 성능 최적화","사용자 정의 프로ンプ트 방법의 개발 및 정련"],"es":["Creación de instrucciones efectivas para modelos de LLM específicos","Optimización del rendimiento del sistema de IA a través de técnicas de invitación avanzadas","Desarrollo y perfeccionamiento de metodologías de invitación personalizadas"],"fr":["Création d''invites efficaces pour des modèles LLM spécifiques","Optimisation des performances du système d''IA grâce à des techniques d''invitation avancées","Développement et affinement de méthodologies d''invitation personnalisées"],"de":["Erstellung effektiver Prompts für spezifische LLM-Modelle","Optimierung der Leistung des KI-Systems durch fortschrittliche Prompt-Techniken","Entwicklung und Verfeinerung von benutzerdefinierten Prompt-Methoden"],"pt":["Criação de prompts eficazes para modelos LLM específicos","Otimização do desempenho do sistema de IA por meio de técnicas de prompting avançadas","Desenvolvimento e aperfeiçoamento de metodologias de prompting personalizadas"],"ru":["Создание эффективных подсказок для конкретных моделей LLM","Оптимизация производительности системы ИИ посредством продвинутых методов подсказок","Разработка и усовершенствование индивидуальных методологий подсказок"],"ar":["إنشاء عناصر إشارة فعّالة لأنماط وكيل LLM محددة","تحسين أداء نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال تقنيات إشارة متقدمة","تطوير وتحسين منهجيات الإشارة المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of LLM architectures and prompting techniques","May need adjustments for specific AI models or tasks"],"zh":["需要了解LLM架构和提示技术","可能需要针对特定AI模型或任务进行调整"],"ja":["LLMアーキテクチャとプロンプティング技術の理解が必要","特定のAIモデルまたはタスク向けに調整が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["LLM 아키텍처와 프로ンプ팅 기술에 대한 이해가 필요함","특정 AI 모델 또는 태스크에 대해 조정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de las arquitecturas de LLM y las técnicas de invitación","Puede necesitar ajustes para modelos o tareas de IA específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des architectures LLM et des techniques 