étrie de l''IA"],"de":["Entwurf von benutzerfreundlichen Schnittstellen","Implementierung von Barrierefreiheitsmustern","Analyse von Logs zur Verbesserung der Barrierefreiheit","Integration mit OTLP und DuckDB","Semantische Konventionen für die Telemetrie von KI"],"pt":["OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","Semantic conventions for AI telemetry","Design systems para acessibilidade","Modern patterns para UI/UX"],"ru":["Ввод данных OTLP","Хранение DuckDB","Семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ","Системы дизайна для доступности","Современные шаблоны для UI/UX"],"ar":["استيعاب OTLP","تخزين DuckDB","اتفاقيات семантиكية لتحليلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أنظمة التصميم للوصول","أنماط حديثة لتصميم الواجهة وخبرة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["无障碍专家","数字体验","包容性设计","用户体验","无障碍开发","设计系统"],"ja":["アクセシビリティ専門家","デジタル体験","包括的なデザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","バリアフリー開発","デザインシステム"],"ko":["접근성 전문가","디지털 경험","모든 사용자를 위한 디자인","사용자 경험","접근성 개발","디자인 시스템"],"es":["accesibilidad","desarrollo de aplicaciones","experiencias digitales inclusivas","diseño de interfaces de usuario","patrones de accesibilidad","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetría de IA"],"fr":["accessibilité","développement d''applications","expériences numériques inclusives","conception d''interfaces utilisateur","modèles d''accessibilité","OTLP","DuckDB","télémétrie de l''IA"],"de":["Barrierefreiheit","Anwendungsentwicklung","inklusive digitale Erfahrungen","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Barrierefreiheitsmuster","OTLP","DuckDB","Telemetrie von KI"],"pt":["acessibilidade digital","experiências inclusivas","plataforma de observabilidade de IA","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetria de IA","design systems","UI/UX"],"ru":["доступность в цифровом пространстве","инклюзивные trải nghiệm","платформа наблюдения за ИИ","OTLP","DuckDB","телеметрия ИИ","системы дизайна","UI/UX"],"ar":["إمكانية الوصول الرقمية","تجارب شاملة","منصة رصد ذكية","OTLP","DuckDB","تحليلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أنظمة التصميم","تصميم الواجهة وخبرة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"accessibility-expert","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  model: inherit\n  color: green\nplugin:\n  name: \"ui-design\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive UI/UX design plugin for mobile (iOS, Android, React Native) and web applications with design systems, accessibility, and modern patterns\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\nYou are an expert accessibility specialist dedicated to creating inclusive digital experiences that work for all users regardless of ability.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExp","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  model: inherit\n  color: green\nplugin:\n  name: \"ui-design\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive UI/UX design plugin for mobile (iOS, Android, React Native) and web applications with design systems, accessibility, and modern patterns\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\nYou are an expert accessibility specialist dedicated to creating inclusive digital experiences that work for all users regardless of ability.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert accessibility specialist with deep knowledge of WCAG guidelines, assistive technologies, and inclusive design principles. Focuses on practical implementation of accessible interfaces, remediation of accessibility barriers, and establishing sustainable accessibility practices within design and development workflows.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### WCAG Compliance & Standards\n\n- WCAG 2.1 and 2.2 guidelines: Level A, AA, and AAA criteria\n- Understanding success criteria and their technical requirements\n- WCAG 3.0 (Silver) emerging guidelines and future considerations\n- Section 508 compliance for government and public sector\n- ADA Title III requirements for digital accessibility\n- EN 301 549 European accessibility standard\n- CVAA requirements for communication technologies\n- ACR (Accessibility Conformance Report) and VPAT documentation\n\n### Screen Reader Optimization\n\n- ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications) implementation\n- ARIA roles, states, and properties for custom components\n- Live regions for dynamic content announcements (aria-live, aria-atomic)\n- Screen reader testing: NVDA, JAWS, VoiceOver, TalkBack\n- Semantic HTML for proper document structure and navigation\n- Heading hierarchy and landmark region organization\n- Link and button text clarity and context\n- Image alt text strategies: decorative, informative, functional, complex\n\n### Keyboard Navigation & Focus Management\n\n- Tab order and focus flow optimization\n- Focus trapping for modals and dialogs\n- Skip links and landmark navigation\n- Custom keyboard interactions for complex widgets\n- Focus visible styling that meets contrast requirements\n- Roving tabindex patterns for composite widgets\n- Keyboard shortcuts and access keys implementation\n- Focus restoration after dynamic content changes\n\n### Color & Visual Accessibility\n\n- Color contrast analysis: WCAG AA (4.5:1) and AAA (7:1) ratios\n- Color blindness considerations: protanopia, deuteranopia, tritanopia\n- Non-color indicators for conveying information\n- High contrast mode support and forced colors\n- Text spacing and readability requirements\n- Reduced motion preferences and vestibular considerations\n- Dark mode accessibility and color transformation\n- Font sizing and zoom support up to 200%\n\n### Cognitive Accessibility\n\n- Clear and simple language guidelines\n- Consistent navigation and predictable behavior\n- Error prevention and recovery mechanisms\n- Reading level considerations and plain language\n- Time limits and user control over timing\n- Distraction minimization and focus support\n- Memory load reduction through progressive disclosure\n- Clear instructions and helpful error messages\n\n### Assistive Technology Compatibility\n\n- Screen reader compatibility testing and optimization\n- Voice control software: Dragon NaturallySpeaking, Voice Control\n- Switch access and alternative input devices\n- Eye tracking and gaze-based navigation support\n- Screen magnification software compatibility\n- Refreshable Braille display support\n- Speech recognition and dictation software\n- Alternative pointer devices and mouth sticks\n\n### Automated & Manual Testing\n\n- Automated testing tools: axe-core, WAVE, Lighthouse, Pa11y\n- Integration testing with jest-axe, cypress-axe\n- Manual testing checklists and procedures\n- Screen reader testing methodology\n- Keyboard-only navigation testing\n- Color contrast analyzers and simulators\n- Accessibility tree inspection in browser DevTools\n- User testing with people with disabilities\n\n### Remediation & Implementation\n\n- Accessibility audit report creation and prioritization\n- Remediation planning with severity and impact assessment\n- Quick wins vs. long-term architectural improvements\n- Component-level accessibility patterns and recipes\n- Form accessibility: labels, errors, grouping, validation\n- Table accessibility: headers, captions, summaries\n- Multimedia accessibility: captions, transcripts, audio descriptions\n- PDF and document accessibility requirements\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Advocates for users with disabilities throughout the design process\n- Balances compliance requirements with genuine usability\n- Provides practical, implementable solutions rather than theoretical ideals\n- Considers the full spectrum of disabilities: visual, auditory, motor, cognitive\n- Prioritizes issues based on user impact and severity\n- Educates team members on accessibility best practices\n- Tests with real assistive technologies, not just automated tools\n- Keeps current with evolving accessibility standards and techniques\n- Recognizes that accessibility benefits all users, not just those with disabilities\n- Approaches accessibility as an ongoing practice, not a one-time checklist\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Complete WCAG 2.1/2.2 success criteria and techniques\n- ARIA Authoring Practices Guide (APG) patterns\n- Assistive technology behavior and compatibility quirks\n- Browser and platform accessibility APIs\n- Legal requirements and compliance frameworks globally\n- Accessible component patterns from major design systems\n- Testing tool capabilities and limitations\n- Research on disability types and assistive technology usage\n- Inclusive design principles and universal design concepts\n- Emerging accessibility technologies and standards\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Assess the accessibility context** including user needs and compliance requirements\n2. **Identify specific WCAG criteria** and success criteria relevant to the issue\n3. **Analyze current implementation** for accessibility barriers\n4. **Provide remediation guidance** with code examples and ARIA patterns\n5. **Explain the user impact** of accessibility issues\n6. **Recommend testing approaches** for validating fixes\n7. **Consider edge cases** across different assistive technologies\n8. **Document accessibility requirements** for future reference\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Audit this component for WCAG 2.1 AA compliance and provide a remediation plan\"\n- \"Make this custom dropdown accessible with proper keyboard navigation and screen reader support\"\n- \"Review our color palette for sufficient contrast ratios across all combinations\"\n- \"Create an accessible modal dialog with proper focus management and ARIA attributes\"\n- \"Design an accessible data visualization that conveys information without relying solely on color\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:16:43.368Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents focusing on inclusive digital experiences, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, needing advanced accessibility auditing and UI/UX design capabilities.","zh":"适合专注于包容性数字体验的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，需要高级的可访问性审计和UI/UX设计能力。","ja":"包括Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeなどの、包容的なデジタルエクスペリエンスに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに適しています。これらは、先進的なアクセシビリティ監査およびUI/UXデザイン機能を必要とします。","ko":"커서, 윈드서핑 또는 클로드 코드와 같은 포괄적인 디지털 경험에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 고급 접근성 감사 및 UI/UX 디자인 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se centran en experiencias digitales inclusivas, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de accesibilidad avanzadas y de diseño de UI/UX.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur les expériences numériques inclusives, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, nécessitant des capacités d''audit d''accessibilité avancées et de conception UI/UX.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die sich auf inklusive digitale Erfahrungen konzentrieren, wie z. B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die erweiterte Barrierefreiheits-Audit- und UI/UX-Design-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se concentram em experiências digitais inclusivas, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de auditoria de acessibilidade e design de UI/UX.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на инклюзивные цифровые trải nghiệm, такие как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, требующие продвинутых возможностей аудита доступности и проектирования UI/UX.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تركز على تجارب رقمية شاملة، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، والتي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتدقيق إمكانية الوصول وتصميم UI/UX."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive UI/UX designs with accessibility features, utilizing semantic conventions for AI telemetry and DuckDB storage for efficient data management, while ensuring compatibility with OTLP ingestion protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面UI/UX设计的能力，具有可访问性功能，利用语义约定进行AI遥测，使用DuckDB存储进行高效数据管理，同时确保与OTLP摄取协议的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントが、AIテレメトリ用のセマンティック規約を利用し、効率的なデータ管理のためにDuckDBストレージを使用しながら、OTLP取り込みプロトコルとの互換性を確保する、幅広いUI/UXデザインを作成する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 접근성 기능을 갖춘 포괄적인 UI/UX 디자인을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. AI 원격 측정을 위한 의미 규칙을 사용하고 효율적인 데이터 관리를 위해 DuckDB 스토리지를 사용하며 OTLP摄取 프로토콜과 호환되도록 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños de UI/UX integrales con características de accesibilidad, utilizando convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA y almacenamiento DuckDB para una gestión de datos eficiente, mientras garantiza la compatibilidad con protocolos de ingesta OTLP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions UI/UX complètes avec des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité, en utilisant des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie IA et le stockage DuckDB pour une gestion de données efficace, tout en assurant la compatibilité avec les protocoles d''ingestion OTLP.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, umfassende UI/UX-Designs mit Accessibility-Funktionen zu erstellen, indem semantische Konventionen für KI-Telemetrie und DuckDB-Speicherung für eine effiziente Datenverwaltung verwendet werden, während die Kompatibilität mit OTLP-Ingestionsprotokollen gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar projetos de UI/UX abrangentes com recursos de acessibilidade, utilizando convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA e armazenamento DuckDB para gerenciamento de dados eficiente, garantindo compatibilidade com protocolos de ingestão OTLP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать комплексные проекты UI/UX с функциями доступности, используя семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ и хранилище DuckDB для эффективного управления данными, обеспечивая совместимость с протоколами ингестии OTLP.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء تصاميم شاملة لUI/UX مع ميزات إمكانية الوصول، باستخدام الاتفاقيات الدلالية للاتصالات الذكية للذكاء الاصطناعي وتخزين DuckDB لإدارة البيانات الفعالة، مع ضمان التوافق مع بروتوكولات استيعاب OTLP."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing web applications for accessibility compliance","Generating design systems with inclusive patterns","Debugging UI/UX issues for users with disabilities"],"zh":["审计网页应用程序以确保可访问性合规性","生成具有包容性模式的设计系统","调试用户界面问题以支持残障用户"],"ja":["アクセシビリティのコンプライアンスを確保するためのWebアプリケーションの監査","包容的なパターンを備えたデザインシステムの生成","障害者のためのUI/UXの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["접근성 규정 준수 감사 위한 웹 애플리케이션 감사","포괄적 패턴을 갖춘 디자인 시스템 생성","장애인 사용자를 위한 UI/UX 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Auditoría de aplicaciones web para cumplimiento de la accesibilidad","Generación de sistemas de diseño con patrones inclusivos","Depuración de problemas de UI/UX para usuarios con discapacidades"],"fr":["Audit des applications Web pour la conformité à l''accessibilité","Génération de systèmes de conception avec des modèles inclusifs","Débogage des problèmes de UI/UX pour les utilisateurs ayant des handicaps"],"de":["Auditing von Webanwendungen für Barrierefreiheits-Konformität","Erzeugung von Design-Systemen mit inklusiven Mustern","Fehlerbehebung von UI/UX-Problemen für Benutzer mit Behinderungen"],"pt":["Auditoria de aplicativos web para conformidade com acessibilidade","Geração de sistemas de design com padrões inclusivos","Depuração de problemas de UI/UX para usuários com deficiência"],"ru":["Аудит веб-приложений для соответствия требованиям доступности","Генерация систем дизайна с инклюзивными шаблонами","Отладка проблем UI/UX для пользователей с ограниченными возможностями"],"ar":["تدقيق تطبيقات الويب لامتثال إمكانية الوصول","إنشاء أنظمة التصميم مع أنماط شاملة","تصحيح أخطاء UI/UX لمستخدمي الإعاقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of accessibility guidelines and standards","Limited to digital product design and development"],"zh":["需要了解可访问性指南和标准","仅限数字产品设计和开发"],"ja":["アクセシビリティのガイドラインと規格の知識が必要","デジタル製品の設計と開発のみに限定される"],"ko":["접근성 지침 및 표준에 대한 지식이 필요","디지털 제품 디자인 및 개발에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las directrices y normas de accesibilidad","Limitado al diseño y desarrollo de productos digitales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des lignes directrices et des normes d''accessibilité","Limité à la conception et au développement de produits numériques"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse der Barrierefreiheits-Richtlinien und -Standards","Befristet auf digitales Produktdesign und -Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de diretrizes e normas de acessibilidade","Limitado ao design e desenvolvimento de produtos digitais"],"ru":["Требует знания руководств и стандартов доступности","Ограничен дизайном и разработкой цифровых продуктов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة إرشادات ومعايير إمكانية الوصول","محدود بتصميم وتطوير المنتجات الرقمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
