de diversas fuentes"],"fr":["Générer un contenu de site de documentation Mintlify unifié pour l''écosystème ANcpLua","Créer des conventions sémantiques pour les données de télémétrie IA","Maintenir le contenu de la documentation en extrayant des informations de diverses sources"],"de":["Erstellen eines einheitlichen Inhalts für Mintlify-Dokumentationsseiten im ANcpLua-Ökosystem","Erstellung semantischer Konventionen für KI-Telemetriedaten","Pflegen des Dokumentationsinhalts durch Abrufen von Informationen aus verschiedenen Quellen"],"pt":["Gerar conteúdo unificado do site de docs Mintlify para o ecossistema ANcpLua","Criar convenções semânticas para dados de telemetria de IA","Manter o conteúdo da documentação puxando informações de várias fontes"],"ru":["Генерировать унифицированный контент сайта документации Mintlify для экосистемы ANcpLua","Создавать семантические конвенции для данных телеметрии ИИ","Поддерживать контент документации, извлекая информацию из различных источников"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى موحد لموقع Mintlify للتوثيق لمجموعة ANcpLua","إنشاء اتفاقيات دلالية لبيانات قياس أداء الذكاء الاصطناعي","صيانة محتوى التوثيق bằng سحب المعلومات من مصادر مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of the ANcpLua ecosystem and Mintlify docs site","Limited to generating documentation for the ANcpLua Framework","Dependent on tools like Read, Grep, Glob, and Write for documentation generation"],"zh":["需要了解ANcpLua生态系统和Mintlify文档站点","仅限为ANcpLua框架生成文档","依赖于Read、Grep、Glob和Write等工具进行文档生成"],"ja":["ANcpLuaエコシステムとMintlifyドキュメントサイトを理解する必要がある","ANcpLuaフレームワークのドキュメント生成のみに限定される","ドキュメント生成のためにRead、Grep、Glob、Writeなどのツールに依存する"],"ko":["ANcpLua 생태계와 Mintlify 문서 사이트를 이해해야 함","ANcpLua 프레임워크 문서 생성에만 제한","문서 생성을 위해 Read, Grep, Glob, Write 등의 툴에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del ecosistema ANcpLua y del sitio de documentación Mintlify","Limitado a la generación de documentación para el Marco de trabajo ANcpLua","Dependiente de herramientas como Read, Grep, Glob y Write para la generación de documentación"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de l''écosystème ANcpLua et du site de documentation Mintlify","Limité à la génération de documentation pour le Cadre de travail ANcpLua","Dépendant d''outils tels que Read, Grep, Glob et Write pour la génération de documentation"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des ANcpLua-Ökosystems und der Mintlify-Dokumentationsseite","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Dokumentation für das ANcpLua-Framework","Abhängig von Tools wie Read, Grep, Glob und Write für die Dokumentenerstellung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do ecossistema ANcpLua e do site de docs Mintlify","Limitado à geração de documentação para o Framework ANcpLua","Dependente de ferramentas como Read, Grep, Glob e Write para geração de documentação"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистемы ANcpLua и сайта документации Mintlify","Ограничен генерацией документации только для фреймворка ANcpLua","Зависит от инструментов таких как Read, Grep, Glob и Write для генерации документации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمجموعة ANcpLua وموقع Mintlify للتوثيق","محدود بالتوثيق لإطار العمل ANcpLua","يعتمد على أدوات مثل Read و Grep و Glob و Write لإنشاء التوثيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Joseph-VJ/XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS/ReasoningBank with AgentDB', 'community', 'Joseph-VJ', 'XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS', 'Joseph-VJ/XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS', 'ReasoningBank with AgentDB', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z', '2026-02-18T08:16:57.211Z', NULL, '{"id":"Joseph-VJ/XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS/ReasoningBank with AgentDB","name":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB","description":{"zh":"ReasoningBank 与 AgentDB 提供高性能适应性学习模式，能够从经验中学习、判断结果、提炼记忆并改善决策","ja":"ReasoningBank と AgentDB は、高性能アダプティブ学習パターンを提供し、エージェントが経験から学習し、結果を判断し、記憶を抽出し、意思決定を改善できるようにします","ko":"ReasoningBank와 AgentDB는 고성능 적응형 학습 패턴을 제공하여 에이전트가 경험에서 학습하고 결과를 판단하고 기억을 추출하며 의사 결정 능력을 향상시킬 수 있습니다","es":"ReasoningBank con AgentDB proporciona patrones de aprendizaje adaptativo para mejorar la toma de decisiones. Ofrece una velocidad de recuperación de patrones 150 veces más rápida y un acceso a la memoria inferior a 1 ms","fr":"ReasoningBank avec AgentDB fournit des modèles d''apprentissage adaptatif pour améliorer la prise de décision. Il offre une vitesse de récupération de modèles 150 fois plus rapide et un accès à la mémoire inférieur à 1 ms","de":"ReasoningBank mit AgentDB bietet adaptive Lernmuster, um die Entscheidungsfindung zu verbessern. Es bietet eine 150-mal schnellere Musterwiederherstellung und einen Zugriff auf die Speicherung unter 1 ms","pt":"O ReasoningBank com AgentDB fornece padrões de aprendizado adaptativo com backend de alto desempenho, melhorando a tomada de decisões em 150x.","ru":"ReasoningBank с AgentDB обеспечивает адаптивные модели обучения с высокопроизводительным бэкендом, улучшая принятие решений в 150 раз.","ar":"ي 提供 ReasoningBank مع AgentDB أنماط التعلم التكيفي مع الخلفية عالية الأداء، مما يحسن اتخاذ القرارات في 150 مرة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ReasoningBank 与 AgentDB：高性能适应性学习","ja":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB：高性能アダプティブ学習","ko":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB: 고성능 적응형 학습","es":"ReasoningBank con AgentDB: Aprendizaje Adaptativo","fr":"ReasoningBank avec AgentDB: Apprentissage Adaptatif","de":"ReasoningBank mit AgentDB: Adaptives Lernen","pt":"ReasoningBank com AgentDB: Aprendizado Adaptativo","ru":"ReasoningBank с AgentDB: Адаптивное Обучение","ar":"ReasoningBank مع AgentDB: التعلم التكيفي","en":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB"},"description":{"zh":"ReasoningBank 与 AgentDB 提供高性能适应性学习模式，能够从经验中学习、判断结果、提炼记忆并改善决策","ja":"ReasoningBank と AgentDB は、高性能アダプティブ学習パターンを提供し、エージェントが経験から学習し、結果を判断し、記憶を抽出し、意思決定を改善できるようにします","ko":"ReasoningBank와 AgentDB는 고성능 적응형 학습 패턴을 제공하여 에이전트가 경험에서 학습하고 결과를 판단하고 기억을 추출하며 의사 결정 능력을 향상시킬 수 있습니다","es":"ReasoningBank con AgentDB proporciona patrones de aprendizaje adaptativo para mejorar la toma de decisiones. Ofrece una velocidad de recuperación de patrones...","fr":"ReasoningBank avec AgentDB fournit des modèles d''apprentissage adaptatif pour améliorer la prise de décision. Il offre une vitesse de récupération de modèles...","de":"ReasoningBank mit AgentDB bietet adaptive Lernmuster, um die Entscheidungsfindung zu verbessern. Es bietet eine 150-mal schnellere Musterwiederherstellung un...","pt":"O ReasoningBank com AgentDB fornece padrões de aprendizado adaptativo com backend de alto desempenho, melhorando a tomada de decisões em 150x.","ru":"ReasoningBank с AgentDB обеспечивает адаптивные модели обучения с высокопроизводительным бэкендом, улучшая принятие решений в 150 раз.","ar":"ي 提供 ReasoningBank مع AgentDB أنماط التعلم التكيفي مع الخلفية عالية الأداء، مما يحسن اتخاذ القرارات في 150 مرة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["高性能适应性学习","150x 更快的模式检索","500x 更快的批量操作","小于 1ms 的内存访问","100% 向后兼容"],"ja":["高性能アダプティブ学習","150x高速なパターン検索","500x高速なバッチ操作","1ms未満のメモリアクセス","100%の後方互換性"],"ko":["고성능 적응형 학습","150x 더 빠른 패턴 검색","500x 더 빠른 일괄 작업","1ms 미만의 메모리 액세스","100%의 後方 호환성"],"es":["Aprendizaje adaptativo con patrones de ReasoningBank","Velocidad de recuperación de patrones 150 veces más rápida","Acceso a la memoria inferior a 1 ms","Compatibilidad hacia atrás del 100%","Operaciones por lotes 500 veces más rápidas"],"fr":["Apprentissage adaptatif avec des modèles de ReasoningBank","Vitesse de récupération de modèles 150 fois plus rapide","Accès à la mémoire inférieur à 1 ms","Compatibilité descendante de 100%","Opérations par lots 500 fois plus rapides"],"de":["Adaptives Lernen mit ReasoningBank-Mustern","150-mal schnellere Musterwiederherstellung","Zugriff auf die Speicherung unter 1 ms","100% rückwärtskompatibel","500-mal schnellere Batch-Operationen"],"pt":["Aprendizado adaptativo com padrões de ReasoningBank","Melhoria de 150x na recuperação de padrões","Acesso à memória em menos de 1ms","Compatibilidade de 100% para trás"],"ru":["Адаптивное обучение с моделями ReasoningBank","Улучшение на 150 раз скорости извлечения моделей","Доступ к памяти менее 1мс","Совместимость 100% назад"],"ar":["التعلم التكيفي مع أنماط ReasoningBank","تحسين 150 مرة في استرجاع الأنماط","وصول إلى الذاكرة في أقل من 1 مللي ثانية","التوافق 100% إلى الوراء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["适应性学习","高性能计算","AgentDB","ReasoningBank","智能体","决策能力"],"ja":["アダプティブ学習","高性能計算","AgentDB","ReasoningBank","エージェント","意思決定能力"],"ko":["적응형 학습","고성능 계산","AgentDB","ReasoningBank","에이전트","의사 결정 능력"],"es":["ReasoningBank","AgentDB","aprendizaje adaptativo","toma de decisiones","patrones de aprendizaje","velocidad de recuperación de patrones","acceso a la memoria","compatibilidad hacia atrás"],"fr":["ReasoningBank","AgentDB","apprentissage adaptatif","prise de décision","modèles d''apprentissage","vitesse de récupération de modèles","accès à la mémoire","compatibilité descendante"],"de":["ReasoningBank","AgentDB","adaptives Lernen","Entscheidungsfindung","Lernmuster","Musterwiederherstellung","Zugriff auf die Speicherung","rückwärtskompatibel"],"pt":["aprendizado adaptativo","ReasoningBank","AgentDB","tomada de decisões","padrões de aprendizado","desempenho de backend","tecnologia de aprendizado"],"ru":["адаптивное обучение","ReasoningBank","AgentDB","принятие решений","модели обучения","высокопроизводительный бэкенд","технология обучения"],"ar":["التعلم التكيفي","ReasoningBank","AgentDB","اتخاذ القرارات","أنماط التعلم","الخلفية عالية الأداء","تكنولوجيا التعلم"]}},"owner":"Joseph-VJ","repo":"XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS","repoPath":"Joseph-VJ/XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB","description":"Implement ReasoningBank adaptive learning with AgentDBs 150x faster vector database. Includes trajectory tracking, verdict judgment, memory distillation, and pattern recognition. Use when building self-learning agents, optimizing decision-making, or implementing experience replay systems.","bodyPreview":"# ReasoningBank with AgentDB\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nProvides ReasoningBank adaptive learning patterns using AgentDB''s high-performance backend (150x-12,500x faster). Enables agents to learn from experiences, judge outcomes, distill memories, and improve decision-making over time with 100% backward compatibility.\n\n**Performance**: 150x faster pattern retrieval, 500x faster batch operations, <1ms memory access.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\n- Understandin","body":"# ReasoningBank with AgentDB\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nProvides ReasoningBank adaptive learning patterns using AgentDB''s high-performance backend (150x-12,500x faster). Enables agents to learn from experiences, judge outcomes, distill memories, and improve decision-making over time with 100% backward compatibility.\n\n**Performance**: 150x faster pattern retrieval, 500x faster batch operations, <1ms memory access.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\n- Understanding of reinforcement learning concepts (optional)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start with CLI\n\n### Initialize ReasoningBank Database\n\n```bash\n# Initialize AgentDB for ReasoningBank\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db --dimension 1536\n\n# Start MCP server for Claude Code integration\nnpx agentdb@latest mcp\nclaude mcp add agentdb npx agentdb@latest mcp\n```\n\n### Migrate from Legacy ReasoningBank\n\n```bash\n# Automatic migration with validation\nnpx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db\n\n# Verify migration\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start with API\n\n```typescript\nimport { createAgentDBAdapter, computeEmbedding } from ''agentic-flow/reasoningbank'';\n\n// Initialize ReasoningBank with AgentDB\nconst rb = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb/reasoningbank.db'',\n  enableLearning: true,      // Enable learning plugins\n  enableReasoning: true,      // Enable reasoning agents\n  cacheSize: 1000,            // 1000 pattern cache\n});\n\n// Store successful experience\nconst query = \"How to optimize database queries?\";\nconst embedding = await computeEmbedding(query);\n\nawait rb.insertPattern({\n  id: '''',\n  type: ''experience'',\n  domain: ''database-optimization'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding,\n    pattern: {\n      query,\n      approach: ''indexing + query optimization'',\n      outcome: ''success'',\n      metrics: { latency_reduction: 0.85 }\n    }\n  }),\n  confidence: 0.95,\n  usage_count: 1,\n  success_count: 1,\n  created_at: Date.now(),\n  last_used: Date.now(),\n});\n\n// Retrieve similar experiences with reasoning\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\n  domain: ''database-optimization'',\n  k: 5,\n  useMMR: true,              // Diverse results\n  synthesizeContext: true,    // Rich context synthesis\n});\n\nconsole.log(''Memories:'', result.memories);\nconsole.log(''Context:'', result.context);\nconsole.log(''Patterns:'', result.patterns);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core ReasoningBank Concepts\n\n### 1. Trajectory Tracking\n\nTrack agent execution paths and outcomes:\n\n```typescript\n// Record trajectory (sequence of actions)\nconst trajectory = {\n  task: ''optimize-api-endpoint'',\n  steps: [\n    { action: ''analyze-bottleneck'', result: ''found N+1 query'' },\n    { action: ''add-eager-loading'', result: ''reduced queries'' },\n    { action: ''add-caching'', result: ''improved latency'' }\n  ],\n  outcome: ''success'',\n  metrics: { latency_before: 2500, latency_after: 150 }\n};\n\nconst embedding = await computeEmbedding(JSON.stringify(trajectory));\n\nawait rb.insertPattern({\n  id: '''',\n  type: ''trajectory'',\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({ embedding, pattern: trajectory }),\n  confidence: 0.9,\n  usage_count: 1,\n  success_count: 1,\n  created_at: Date.now(),\n  last_used: Date.now(),\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Verdict Judgment\n\nJudge whether a trajectory was successful:\n\n```typescript\n// Retrieve similar past trajectories\nconst similar = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\n  k: 10,\n});\n\n// Judge based on similarity to successful patterns\nconst verdict = similar.memories.filter(m =>\n  m.pattern.outcome === ''success'' &&\n  m.similarity > 0.8\n).length > 5 ? ''likely_success'' : ''needs_review'';\n\nconsole.log(''Verdict:'', verdict);\nconsole.log(''Confidence:'', similar.memories[0]?.similarity || 0);\n```\n\n### 3. Memory Distillation\n\nConsolidate similar experiences into patterns:\n\n```typescript\n// Get all experiences in domain\nconst experiences = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\n  k: 100,\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Automatic consolidation\n});\n\n// Distill into high-level pattern\nconst distilledPattern = {\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\n  pattern: ''For N+1 queries: add eager loading, then cache'',\n  success_rate: 0.92,\n  sample_size: experiences.memories.length,\n  confidence: 0.95\n};\n\nawait rb.insertPattern({\n  id: '''',\n  type: ''distilled-pattern'',\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding: await computeEmbedding(JSON.stringify(distilledPattern)),\n    pattern: distilledPattern\n  }),\n  confidence: 0.95,\n  usage_count: 0,\n  success_count: 0,\n  created_at: Date.now(),\n  last_used: Date.now(),\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Reasoning Agents\n\nAgentDB provides 4 reasoning modules that enhance ReasoningBank:\n\n### 1. PatternMatcher\n\nFind similar successful patterns:\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''problem-solving'',\n  k: 10,\n  useMMR: true,  // Maximal Marginal Relevance for diversity\n});\n\n// PatternMatcher returns diverse, relevant memories\nresult.memories.forEach(mem => {\n  console.log(`Pattern: ${mem.pattern.approach}`);\n  console.log(`Similarity: ${mem.similarity}`);\n  console.log(`Success Rate: ${mem.success_count / mem.usage_count}`);\n});\n```\n\n### 2. ContextSynthesizer\n\nGenerate rich context from multiple memories:\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''code-optimization'',\n  synthesizeContext: true,  // Enable context synthesis\n  k: 5,\n});\n\n// ContextSynthesizer creates coherent narrative\nconsole.log(''Synthesized Context:'', result.context);\n// \"Based on 5 similar optimizations, the most effective approach\n//  involves profiling, identifying bottlenecks, and applying targeted\n//  improvements. Success rate: 87%\"\n```\n\n### 3. MemoryOptimizer\n\nAutomatically consolidate and prune:\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''testing'',\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Enable automatic optimization\n});\n\n// MemoryOptimizer consolidates similar patterns and prunes low-quality\nconsole.log(''Optimizations:'', result.optimizations);\n// { consolidated: 15, pruned: 3, improved_quality: 0.12 }\n```\n\n### 4. ExperienceCurator\n\nFilter by quality and relevance:\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''debugging'',\n  k: 20,\n  minConfidence: 0.8,  // Only high-confidence experiences\n});\n\n// ExperienceCurator returns only quality experiences\nresult.memories.forEach(mem => {\n  console.log(`Confidence: ${mem.confidence}`);\n  console.log(`Success Rate: ${mem.success_count / mem.usage_count}`);\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Legacy API Compatibility\n\nAgentDB maintains 100% backward compatibility with legacy ReasoningBank:\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  retrieveMemories,\n  judgeTrajectory,\n  distillMemories\n} from ''agentic-flow/reasoningbank'';\n\n// Legacy API works unchanged (uses AgentDB backend automatically)\nconst memories = await retrieveMemories(query, {\n  domain: ''code-generation'',\n  agent: ''coder''\n});\n\nconst verdict = await judgeTrajectory(trajectory, query);\n\nconst newMemories = await distillMemories(\n  trajectory,\n  verdict,\n  query,\n  { domain: ''code-generation'' }\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Characteristics\n\n- **Pattern Search**: 150x faster (100µs vs 15ms)\n- **Memory Retrieval**: <1ms (with cache)\n- **Batch Insert**: 500x faster (2ms vs 1s for 100 patterns)\n- **Trajectory Judgment**: <5ms (including retrieval + analysis)\n- **Memory Distillation**: <50ms (consolidate 100 patterns)\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Hierarchical Memory\n\nOrganize memories by abstraction level:\n\n```typescript\n// Low-level: Specific implementation\nawait rb.insertPattern({\n  type: ''concrete'',\n  domain: ''debugging/null-pointer'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding,\n    pattern: { bug: ''NPE in UserService.getUser()'', fix: ''Add null check'' }\n  }),\n  confidence: 0.9,\n  // ...\n});\n\n// Mid-level: Pattern across similar cases\nawait rb.insertPattern({\n  type: ''pattern'',\n  domain: ''debugging'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding,\n    pattern: { category: ''null-pointer'', approach: ''defensive-checks'' }\n  }),\n  confidence: 0.85,\n  // ...\n});\n\n// High-level: General principle\nawait rb.insertPattern({\n  type: ''principle'',\n  domain: ''software-engineering'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding,\n    pattern: { principle: ''fail-fast with clear errors'' }\n  }),\n  confidence: 0.95,\n  // ...\n});\n```\n\n### Multi-Domain Learning\n\nTransfer learning across domains:\n\n```typescript\n// Learn from backend optimization\nconst backendExperience = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\n  domain: ''backend-optimization'',\n  k: 10,\n});\n\n// Apply to frontend optimization\nconst transferredKnowledge = backendExperience.memories.map(mem => ({\n  ...mem,\n  domain: ''frontend-optimization'',\n  adapted: true,\n}));\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLI Operations\n\n### Database Management\n\n```bash\n# Export trajectories and patterns\nnpx agentdb@latest export ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db ./backup.json\n\n# Import experiences\nnpx agentdb@latest import ./experiences.json\n\n# Get statistics\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db\n# Shows: total patterns, domains, confidence distribution\n```\n\n### Migration\n\n```bash\n# Migrate from legacy ReasoningBank\nnpx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db --target .agentdb/reasoningbank.db\n\n# Validate migration\nnpx agentdb@latest stats .agentdb/reasoningbank.db\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: Migration fails\n```bash\n# Check source database exists\nls -la .swarm/memory.db\n\n# Run with verbose logging\nDEBUG=agentdb:* npx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db\n```\n\n### Issue: Low confidence scores\n```typescript\n// Enable context synthesis for better quality\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\n  synthesizeContext: true,\n  useMMR: true,\n  k: 10,\n});\n```\n\n### Issue: Memory growing too large\n```typescript\n// Enable automatic optimization\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Consolidates similar patterns\n});\n\n// Or manually optimize\nawait rb.optimize();\n```\n\n---\n\n## Learn More\n\n- **AgentDB Integration**: node_modules/agentic-flow/docs/AGENTDB_INTEGRATION.md\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/ruvnet/agentic-flow/tree/main/packages/agentdb\n- **MCP Integration**: `npx agentdb@latest mcp`\n- **Website**: https://agentdb.ruv.io\n\n---\n\n**Category**: Machine Learning / Reinforcement Learning\n**Difficulty**: Intermediate\n**Estimated Time**: 20-30 minutes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:16:57.211Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents seeking accelerated adaptive learning and decision-making capabilities with Node.js 18+ and AgentDB v1.0.7+","zh":"适用于正在寻求加速自适应学习和决策能力的高级 AI 代理，需要 Node.js 18+ 和 AgentDB v1.0.7+","ja":"Node.js 18+ および AgentDB v1.0.7+ を使用して加速された適応型学習および意思決定機能を求める高度な AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Node.js 18+ 및 AgentDB v1.0.7+를 사용하여 가속된 적응형 학습 및 의사决策 기능을 찾는 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados que buscan un aprendizaje adaptativo acelerado y capacidades de toma de decisiones con Node.js 18+ y AgentDB v1.0.7+","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés qui recherchent un apprentissage adaptatif accéléré et des capacités de prise de décision avec Node.js 18+ et AgentDB v1.0.7+","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents, die ein beschleunigtes adaptives Lernen und Entscheidungskapazitäten mit Node.js 18+ und AgentDB v1.0.7+ suchen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados que buscam aprendizado adaptativo acelerado e capacidades de tomada de decisão com Node.js 18+ e AgentDB v1.0.7+","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, стремящихся к ускоренному адаптивному обучению и возможностям принятия решений с Node.js 18+ и AgentDB v1.0.7+","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يسعون إلى تعلم وتكيف سريع مع Node.js 18+ و AgentDB v1.0.7+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to learn from experiences, judge outcomes, and distill memories with 100% backward compatibility, leveraging AgentDB''s high-performance backend for 150x-12,500x faster pattern retrieval and <1ms memory access via Node.js and agentic-flow","zh":"赋予代理从经验中学习、判断结果并提炼记忆的能力，实现 100% 的向后兼容性，利用 AgentDB 的高性能后端实现 150x-12,500x 更快的模式检索和 <1ms 的内存访问，通过 Node.js 和 agentic-flow","ja":"エージェントが経験から学び、結果を判断し、記憶を抽出する機能を提供します。100% の下位互換性を実現し、AgentDB の高パフォーマンス バックエンドを活用して、150x-12,500x よりも高速なパターン抽出と <1ms のメモリ アクセスを実現します。Node.js および agentic-flow を使用","ko":"에이전트가 경험에서 배우고 결과를 판단하고 기억을 추출하는 기능을 제공하며 100%의 하위 호환성을 제공하고 AgentDB의 고성능 백엔드를 aprove하여 150x-12,500x 더 빠른 패턴 검색 및 <1ms의 메모리 접근을 제공합니다. Node.js 및 agentic-flow를 통해","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprender de las experiencias, juzgar los resultados y destilar recuerdos con una compatibilidad hacia atrás del 100%, aprovechando el backend de alto rendimiento de AgentDB para una recuperación de patrones 150x-12,500x más rápida y un acceso a la memoria de <1ms a través de Node.js y agentic-flow","fr":"Permet aux agents d''apprendre des expériences, de juger les résultats et de distiller des souvenirs avec une compatibilité descendante de 100 %, en exploitant le backend haute performance d''AgentDB pour une récupération de modèles 150x-12 500x plus rapide et un accès à la mémoire de <1ms via Node.js et agentic-flow","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, aus Erfahrungen zu lernen, Ergebnisse zu bewerten und Erinnerungen zu destillieren, mit einer 100%igen Abwärtskompatibilität, indem sie die Hochleistungs-Backend von AgentDB für eine 150x-12.500x schnellere Musterwiederherstellung und einen Zugriff auf die Speicher von <1ms über Node.js und agentic-flow nutzen","pt":"Habilita agentes a aprender com experiências, julgar resultados e destilar memórias com 100% de compatibilidade para trás, aproveitando o backend de alto desempenho do AgentDB para um padrão de recuperação 150x-12.500x mais rápido e acesso à memória inferior a 1ms via Node.js e agentic-flow","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью учиться на опыте, оценивать результаты и извлекать воспоминания с 100% обратной совместимостью, используя высокопроизводительный бэкенд AgentDB для 150x-12,500x более быстрого извлечения шаблонов и доступа к памяти менее 1 мс через Node.js и agentic-flow","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التعلم من الخبرات ، و تقييم النتائج ، و استخلاص الذكريات مع توافق خلفي بنسبة 100٪ ، واستخدام الخلفية عالية الأداء من AgentDB للحصول على استرجاع نمط أسرع 150x-12،500x وأقل من 1 مللي ثانية عبر Node.js و agentic-flow"},"useCases":{"en":["Accelerating pattern retrieval for improved decision-making","Enhancing batch operations for large-scale data processing","Optimizing memory access for real-time learning and adaptation"],"zh":["加速模式检索以改善决策","增强批处理操作以进行大规模数据处理","优化内存访问以实现实时学习和适应"],"ja":["意思決定の改善のためのパターン抽出の加速","大規模データ処理のためのバッチ操作の強化","リアルタイムの学習および適応のためのメモリ アクセスの最適化"],"ko":["의사결정 개선을 위한 패턴 검색 가속","대규모 데이터 처리를 위한 배치 작업 강화","실시간 학습 및 적응을 위한 메모리 접근 최적화"],"es":["Acelerar la recuperación de patrones para una mejor toma de decisiones","Mejorar las operaciones por lotes para el procesamiento de datos a gran escala","Optimizar el acceso a la memoria para el aprendizaje y la adaptación en tiempo real"],"fr":["Accélérer la récupération de modèles pour une meilleure prise de décision","Améliorer les opérations par lots pour le traitement de données à grande échelle","Optimiser l''accès à la mémoire pour l''apprentissage et l''adaptation en temps réel"],"de":["Beschleunigen der Musterwiederherstellung für eine verbesserte Entscheidungsfindung","Verbesserung der Batch-Operationen für die Verarbeitung von Daten im großen Maßstab","Optimieren des Speicherzugriffs für Echtzeit-Lernen und -Anpassung"],"pt":["Acelerar a recuperação de padrões para melhoria da tomada de decisão","Aumentar as operações em lote para processamento de dados em grande escala","Otimizar o acesso à memória para aprendizado e adaptação em tempo real"],"ru":["Ускорение извлечения шаблонов для улучшения принятия решений","Улучшение пакетных операций для обработки больших объемов данных","Оптимизация до