mettent de protéger les secrets du serveur et les opérations de base de données, et offrent une validation et un proxy d''API","de":"API-Routen ermöglichen es, Server-Geheimnisse und Datenbankvorgänge zu schützen und bieten Validierung und API-Proxy","pt":"As rotas de API são usadas para proteger segredos do servidor, operações de banco de dados e muito mais. Elas fornecem uma camada de segurança adicional para...","ru":"Маршруты API используются для защиты серверных секретов, операций с базами данных и многое другое. Они предоставляют дополнительный уровень безопасности для ...","ar":"تستخدم طرق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لحماية الأسرار الخادومية وعمليات قواعد البيانات وغير ذلك. توفر طبقة أمان إضافية لتطبيقاتك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Server-side ","Database ","Third-party API ","Server-side ","Webhook ","Rate limit"],"ja":["Server-side ","Database ","Third-party API ","Server-side ","Webhook ","Rate limit"],"ko":["Server-side ","Database ","Third-party API ","Server-side ","Webhook ","Rate limit"],"es":["Protección de secretos del servidor","Operaciones de base de datos seguras","Proxy de API para servicios externos","Validación de datos en el servidor","Puntos de terminación de webhook","Limitación de velocidad"],"fr":["Protection des secrets du serveur","Opérations de base de données sécurisées","Proxy d''API pour les services externes","Validation des données sur le serveur","Points de terminaison de webhook","Limitation de débit"],"de":["Schutz von Server-Geheimnissen","Sichere Datenbankvorgänge","API-Proxy für externe Dienste","Datenvalidierung auf dem Server","Webhook-Endpunkte","Rate Limiting"],"pt":["Proteção de segredos do servidor","Operações de banco de dados seguras","Proxys de API de terceiros","Validação de servidor","Endpoints de webhook","Limitação de taxa"],"ru":["Защита серверных секретов","Безопасные операции с базами данных","Прокси API третьих сторон","Валидация на сервере","Конечные точки вебхука","Ограничение скорости"],"ar":["حماية الأسرار الخادومية","عمليات قواعد البيانات الآمنة","وكلاء واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للجهات الخارجية","التحقق من الصحة على الخادم","نقاط نهاية الويب هوك","تقييد السرعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API","Server-side","Database","API","Webhook","Rate limit","API","API"],"ja":["API","Server-side","Database","API","Webhook","Rate limit","API","API"],"ko":["API","Server-side","Database","API","Webhook","Rate limit","API","API"],"es":["rutas de API","seguridad de API","protección de secretos","operaciones de base de datos","proxy de API","validación de datos","puntos de terminación de webhook","limitación de velocidad"],"fr":["routes API","sécurité API","protection des secrets","opérations de base de données","proxy d''API","validation des données","points de terminaison de webhook","limitation de débit"],"de":["API-Routen","API-Sicherheit","Schutz von Geheimnissen","Datenbankvorgänge","API-Proxy","Datenvalidierung","Webhook-Endpunkte","Rate Limiting"],"pt":["rotas de api","segredos do servidor","operações de banco de dados","proxys de api","validação de servidor","endpoints de webhook","limitação de taxa","desenvolvimento de aplicações","segurança de aplicações"],"ru":["маршруты api","серверные секреты","операции с базами данных","прокси api","валидация на сервере","конечные точки вебхука","ограничение скорости","разработка приложений","безопасность приложений"],"ar":["طرق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","الأسرار الخادومية","عمليات قواعد البيانات","وكلاء واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","التحقق من الصحة على الخادم","نقاط نهاية الويب هوك","تقييد السرعة","تطوير التطبيقات","أمان التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"marcoodignoti","repo":"couple-diary","repoPath":"marcoodignoti/couple-diary","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-routes","description":"Guidelines for creating API routes in Expo Router with EAS Hosting","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Use API Routes\n\nUse API routes when you need:\n\n- **Server-side secrets** — API keys, database credentials, or tokens that must never reach the client\n- **Database operations** — Direct database queries that shouldn''t be exposed\n- **Third-party API proxies** — Hide API keys when calling external services (OpenAI, Stripe, etc.)\n- **Server-side validation** — Validate data before database writes\n- **Webhook endpoints** — Receive callbacks from services like Stripe or GitHub\n- **Rate limi","body":"## When to Use API Routes\n\nUse API routes when you need:\n\n- **Server-side secrets** — API keys, database credentials, or tokens that must never reach the client\n- **Database operations** — Direct database queries that shouldn''t be exposed\n- **Third-party API proxies** — Hide API keys when calling external services (OpenAI, Stripe, etc.)\n- **Server-side validation** — Validate data before database writes\n- **Webhook endpoints** — Receive callbacks from services like Stripe or GitHub\n- **Rate limiting** — Control access at the server level\n- **Heavy computation** — Offload processing that would be slow on mobile\n\n## When NOT to Use API Routes\n\nAvoid API routes when:\n\n- **Data is already public** — Use direct fetch to public APIs instead\n- **No secrets required** — Static data or client-safe operations\n- **Real-time updates needed** — Use WebSockets or services like Supabase Realtime\n- **Simple CRUD** — Consider Firebase, Supabase, or Convex for managed backends\n- **File uploads** — Use direct-to-storage uploads (S3 presigned URLs, Cloudflare R2)\n- **Authentication only** — Use Clerk, Auth0, or Firebase Auth instead\n\n## File Structure\n\nAPI routes live in the `app` directory with `+api.ts` suffix:\n\n```\napp/\n  api/\n    hello+api.ts          → GET /api/hello\n    users+api.ts          → /api/users\n    users/[id]+api.ts     → /api/users/:id\n  (tabs)/\n    index.tsx\n```\n\n## Basic API Route\n\n```ts\n// app/api/hello+api.ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  return Response.json({ message: \"Hello from Expo!\" });\n}\n```\n\n## HTTP Methods\n\nExport named functions for each HTTP method:\n\n```ts\n// app/api/items+api.ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  return Response.json({ items: [] });\n}\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const body = await request.json();\n  return Response.json({ created: body }, { status: 201 });\n}\n\nexport async function PUT(request: Request) {\n  const body = await request.json();\n  return Response.json({ updated: body });\n}\n\nexport async function DELETE(request: Request) {\n  return new Response(null, { status: 204 });\n}\n```\n\n## Dynamic Routes\n\n```ts\n// app/api/users/[id]+api.ts\nexport function GET(request: Request, { id }: { id: string }) {\n  return Response.json({ userId: id });\n}\n```\n\n## Request Handling\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n```ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  const url = new URL(request.url);\n  const page = url.searchParams.get(\"page\") ?? \"1\";\n  const limit = url.searchParams.get(\"limit\") ?? \"10\";\n\n  return Response.json({ page, limit });\n}\n```\n\n### Headers\n\n```ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  const auth = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\");\n\n  if (!auth) {\n    return Response.json({ error: \"Unauthorized\" }, { status: 401 });\n  }\n\n  return Response.json({ authenticated: true });\n}\n```\n\n### JSON Body\n\n```ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { email, password } = await request.json();\n\n  if (!email || !password) {\n    return Response.json({ error: \"Missing fields\" }, { status: 400 });\n  }\n\n  return Response.json({ success: true });\n}\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nUse `process.env` for server-side secrets:\n\n```ts\n// app/api/ai+api.ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { prompt } = await request.json();\n\n  const response = await fetch(\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\", {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: {\n      \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY}`,\n    },\n    body: JSON.stringify({\n      model: \"gpt-4\",\n      messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }],\n    }),\n  });\n\n  const data = await response.json();\n  return Response.json(data);\n}\n```\n\nSet environment variables:\n\n- **Local**: Create `.env` file (never commit)\n- **EAS Hosting**: Use `eas env:create` or Expo dashboard\n\n## CORS Headers\n\nAdd CORS for web clients:\n\n```ts\nconst corsHeaders = {\n  \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\": \"*\",\n  \"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\": \"GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS\",\n  \"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\": \"Content-Type, Authorization\",\n};\n\nexport function OPTIONS() {\n  return new Response(null, { headers: corsHeaders });\n}\n\nexport function GET() {\n  return Response.json({ data: \"value\" }, { headers: corsHeaders });\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json();\n    // Process...\n    return Response.json({ success: true });\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"API error:\", error);\n    return Response.json({ error: \"Internal server error\" }, { status: 500 });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Locally\n\nStart the development server with API routes:\n\n```bash\nnpx expo serve\n```\n\nThis starts a local server at `http://localhost:8081` with full API route support.\n\nTest with curl:\n\n```bash\ncurl http://localhost:8081/api/hello\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8081/api/users -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d ''{\"name\":\"Test\"}''\n```\n\n## Deployment to EAS Hosting\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Deploy\n\n```bash\neas deploy\n```\n\nThis builds and deploys your API routes to EAS Hosting (Cloudflare Workers).\n\n### Environment Variables for Production\n\n```bash\n# Create a secret\neas env:create --name OPENAI_API_KEY --value sk-xxx --environment production\n\n# Or use the Expo dashboard\n```\n\n### Custom Domain\n\nConfigure in `eas.json` or Expo dashboard.\n\n## EAS Hosting Runtime (Cloudflare Workers)\n\nAPI routes run on Cloudflare Workers. Key limitations:\n\n### Missing/Limited APIs\n\n- **No Node.js filesystem** — `fs` module unavailable\n- **No native Node modules** — Use Web APIs or polyfills\n- **Limited execution time** — 30 second timeout for CPU-intensive tasks\n- **No persistent connections** — WebSockets require Durable Objects\n- **fetch is available** — Use standard fetch for HTTP requests\n\n### Use Web APIs Instead\n\n```ts\n// Use Web Crypto instead of Node crypto\nconst hash = await crypto.subtle.digest(\n  \"SHA-256\",\n  new TextEncoder().encode(\"data\")\n);\n\n// Use fetch instead of node-fetch\nconst response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com\");\n\n// Use Response/Request (already available)\nreturn new Response(JSON.stringify(data), {\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n});\n```\n\n### Database Options\n\nSince filesystem is unavailable, use cloud databases:\n\n- **Cloudflare D1** — SQLite at the edge\n- **Turso** — Distributed SQLite\n- **PlanetScale** — Serverless MySQL\n- **Supabase** — Postgres with REST API\n- **Neon** — Serverless Postgres\n\nExample with Turso:\n\n```ts\n// app/api/users+api.ts\nimport { createClient } from \"@libsql/client/web\";\n\nconst db = createClient({\n  url: process.env.TURSO_URL!,\n  authToken: process.env.TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN!,\n});\n\nexport async function GET() {\n  const result = await db.execute(\"SELECT * FROM users\");\n  return Response.json(result.rows);\n}\n```\n\n## Calling API Routes from Client\n\n```ts\n// From React Native components\nconst response = await fetch(\"/api/hello\");\nconst data = await response.json();\n\n// With body\nconst response = await fetch(\"/api/users\", {\n  method: \"POST\",\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n  body: JSON.stringify({ name: \"John\" }),\n});\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Authentication Middleware\n\n```ts\n// utils/auth.ts\nexport async function requireAuth(request: Request) {\n  const token = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\")?.replace(\"Bearer \", \"\");\n\n  if (!token) {\n    throw new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Unauthorized\" }), {\n      status: 401,\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Verify token...\n  return { userId: \"123\" };\n}\n\n// app/api/protected+api.ts\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../../utils/auth\";\n\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const { userId } = await requireAuth(request);\n  return Response.json({ userId });\n}\n```\n\n### Proxy External API\n\n```ts\n// app/api/weather+api.ts\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const url = new URL(request.url);\n  const city = url.searchParams.get(\"city\");\n\n  const response = await fetch(\n    `https://api.weather.com/v1/current?city=${city}&key=${process.env.WEATHER_API_KEY}`\n  );\n\n  return Response.json(await response.json());\n}\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- NEVER expose API keys or secrets in client code\n- ALWAYS validate and sanitize user input\n- Use proper HTTP status codes (200, 201, 400, 401, 404, 500)\n- Handle errors gracefully with try/catch\n- Keep API routes focused — one responsibility per endpoint\n- Use TypeScript for type safety\n- Log errors server-side for debugging\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:17:27.383Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security-Conscious Agents requiring protected server-side secrets and database operations","zh":"适用于需要保护服务器端密钥和数据库操作的安全意识强的代理","ja":"保護されたサーバーサイドのシークレットとデータベース操作を必要とするセキュリティ意識の高いエージェントに最適","ko":"보호된 서버 측 시크릿과 데이터베이스 작업이 필요한 보안 의식이 높은 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes conscientes de la seguridad que requieren secretos protegidos y operaciones de base de datos en el servidor","fr":"Idéal pour les agents conscients de la sécurité nécessitant des secrets protégés et des opérations de base de données côté serveur","de":"Ideal für sicherheitsbewusste Agenten, die geschützte Server-secrets und Datenbankoperationen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Conscientes de Segurança que requerem segredos protegidos no servidor e operações de banco de dados","ru":"Идеально для агентов, осознающих проблемы безопасности, требующих защищенных секретов на стороне сервера и операций с базами данных","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المدركين لأمان требует سر버 محمي وجانب الخادم عمليات قاعدة البيانات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely handle server-side secrets, such as API keys and database credentials, while providing a robust framework for database operations, third-party API proxies, and server-side validation using protocols like HTTPS and libraries for encryption","zh":"赋予代理安全地处理服务器端密钥（如API密钥和数据库凭证）的能力，同时提供一个强大的框架用于数据库操作、第三方API代理和服务器端验证，使用像HTTPS这样的协议和加密库","ja":"APIキーやデータベースの資格情報などのサーバーサイドのシークレットを安全に処理するエージェントを可能にし、HTTPSなどのプロトコルや暗号化ライブラリを使用したサーバーサイドの検証、データベース操作、第三者APIプロキシを提供するための強力なフレームワーク","ko":"API 키 또는 데이터베이스 자격증명과 같은 서버 측 시크릿을 안전하게 처리할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜 및 암호화 라이브러리를 사용한 서버 측 유효성 검사, 데이터베이스 작업 및 제3자 API 프록시를 위한 강력한 프레임워크를 제공","es":"Permite a los agentes manejar secretos del lado del servidor de manera segura, como claves de API y credenciales de base de datos, al tiempo que proporciona un marco robusto para operaciones de base de datos, proxies de API de terceros y validación del lado del servidor utilizando protocolos como HTTPS y bibliotecas de cifrado","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière sécurisée les secrets côté serveur, tels que les clés API et les informations d''identification de base de données, tout en fournissant un cadre robuste pour les opérations de base de données, les proxies API de tiers et la validation côté serveur à l''aide de protocoles comme HTTPS et des bibliothèques de cryptage","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Server-secrets wie API-Schlüssel und Datenbank-Zugangsdaten sicher zu handhaben, während es einen robusten Rahmen für Datenbankoperationen, Proxy-Server für Drittanbieter-APIs und Server-seitige Validierung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie HTTPS und Bibliotheken für Verschlüsselung bietet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar de forma segura com segredos no servidor, como chaves de API e credenciais de banco de dados, ao mesmo tempo em que fornece um framework robusto para operações de banco de dados, proxies de API de terceiros e validação no servidor usando protocolos como HTTPS e bibliotecas de criptografia","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасно обрабатывать секреты на стороне сервера, такие как ключи API и учетные данные базы данных, а также предоставляет прочную основу для операций с базами данных, прокси-серверов API третьих сторон и проверки на стороне сервера с использованием протоколов như HTTPS и библиотек шифрования","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التعامل بأمان مع الأسرار على جانب الخادم، مثل مفاتيح API وأسماء المستخدمين و كلمات المرور للقواعد، في الوقت نفسه تقديم إطار قوي للعمليات على قواعد البيانات ووكلاء API للجهات الخارجية والتحقق من جانب الخادم باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS ومكتبات التشفير"},"useCases":{"en":["Protecting API keys when calling external services like OpenAI or Stripe","Validating user data before writing to databases","Creating webhook endpoints for services like GitHub or Stripe"],"zh":["在调用外部服务（如OpenAI或Stripe）时保护API密钥","在写入数据库之前验证用户数据","为GitHub或Stripe等服务创建Webhook端点"],"ja":["OpenAIやStripeなどの外部サービスを呼び出すときにAPIキーを保護する","データベースに書き込む前にユーザーデータを検証する","GitHubやStripeなどのサービス用にWebhookエンドポイントを作成する"],"ko":["외부 서비스(예: OpenAI 또는 Stripe)를 호출할 때 API 키를 보호","데이터베이스에 쓰기 전에 사용자 데이터를 확인","GitHub 또는 Stripe와 같은 서비스를 위한 웹 훅 엔드 포인트 생성"],"es":["Proteger las claves de API al llamar a servicios externos como OpenAI o Stripe","Validar los datos de usuario antes de escribir en las bases de datos","Crear puntos de conexión de webhook para servicios como GitHub o Stripe"],"fr":["Protéger les clés API lors de l''appel à des services externes tels que OpenAI ou Stripe","Valider les données utilisateur avant de les écrire dans les bases de données","Créer des points de terminaison de webhook pour des services tels que GitHub ou Stripe"],"de":["Schützen von API-Schlüsseln beim Aufruf externer Dienste wie OpenAI oder Stripe","Validieren von Benutzerdaten vor dem Schreiben in Datenbanken","Erstellen von Webhook-Endpunkten für Dienste wie GitHub oder Stripe"],"pt":["Proteger chaves de API ao chamar serviços externos como OpenAI ou Stripe","Validar dados de usuário antes de gravar em bancos de dados","Criar pontos de extremidade de webhook para serviços como GitHub ou Stripe"],"ru":["Защищать ключи API при вызове внешних сервисов, таких как OpenAI или Stripe","Проверять данные пользователя до записи в базы данных","Создавать конечные точки вебхука для сервисов, таких как GitHub или Stripe"],"ar":["حماية مفاتيح API عند استدعاء خدمات خارجية مثل OpenAI أو Stripe","التحقق من بيانات المستخدم قبل كتابتها إلى قواعد البيانات","إنشاء نقاط نهاية للويب هك لخدمات مثل GitHub أو Stripe"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires server-side infrastructure","May need additional configuration for rate limiting and IP blocking"],"zh":["需要服务器端基础设施","可能需要额外的配置以实现速率限制和IP阻塞"],"ja":["サーバーサイドのインフラストラクチャが必要","レート制限やIPブロッキングのために追加の設定が必要になる可能性"],"ko":["서버 측 인프라가 필요","속도 제한 및 IP 차단을 위해 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere infraestructura del lado del servidor","Puede necesitar configuración adicional para limitar la tasa y bloquear IP"],"fr":["Nécessite une infrastructure côté serveur","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour la limitation de débit et le blocage d''IP"],"de":["Benötigt Server-seitige Infrastruktur","Kann zusätzliche Konfiguration für Rate Limiting und IP-Sperren erfordern"],"pt":["Requer infraestrutura no servidor","Pode precisar de configuração adicional para limitação de taxa e bloqueio de IP"],"ru":["Требует инфраструктуры на стороне сервера","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для ограничения скорости и блокировки IP"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية تحتية على جانب الخادم","يمكن أن يحتاج إلى تكوين إضافي للتحكم في معدل و حجب IP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
