Excel pour automatiser des tâches avec facilité. Utilisez des configurations centralisées et une validation MCP pour les scripts de cod...","de":"Integrieren Sie Playwright in Excel, um Aufgaben einfach zu automatisieren. Verwenden Sie zentrale Konfigurationen und MCP-Validierung für Codegen-Skripte","pt":"Playwright Excel é uma integração que permite converter scripts Playwright em automações dirigidas por Excel com config centralizada e validação MCP.","ru":"Playwright Excel — это интеграция, которая позволяет преобразовать скрипты Playwright в автоматизации, управляемые Excel, с центральной конфигурацией и валид...","ar":"بلاي رايت إكسيل هي دمج تسمح بتحويل البرامج النصية Playwright إلى أتمتة مدفوعة بExcel مع تكوين مركزي والتحقق من MCP.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Conversión de scripts de codegen en automatizaciones de Excel","Configuración centralizada para scripts de Playwright","Validación MCP para garantizar la seguridad y precisión","Integración con entornos de Python como conda","Compatibilidad con archivos Excel (.xlsx)"],"fr":["Conversion de scripts de codegen en automatisations Excel","Configuration centralisée pour les scripts Playwright","Validation MCP pour assurer la sécurité et la précision","Intégration avec des environnements Python tels que conda","Compatibilité avec les fichiers Excel (.xlsx)"],"de":["Umwandlung von Codegen-Scripts in Excel-Automatisierungen","Zentrale Konfiguration für Playwright-Skripte","MCP-Validierung für Sicherheit und Präzision","Integration mit Python-Umgebungen wie conda","Kompatibilität mit Excel-Dateien (.xlsx)"],"pt":["Conversão de scripts Playwright em automações Excel","Configuração centralizada para fácil gerenciamento","Validação MCP para garantir a segurança","Integração com o ambiente conda","Suporte à execução de comandos Python"],"ru":["Преобразование скриптов Playwright в автоматизации Excel","Центральная конфигурация для простого управления","Валидация MCP для обеспечения безопасности","Интеграция с окружением conda","Поддержка выполнения команд Python"],"ar":["تحويل برامج نصية Playwright إلى أتمتة Excel","التهيئة المركزية لسهولة الإدارة","التحقق من MCP لضمان الأمان","التكامل مع بيئة conda","دعم تشغيل أوامر Python"]},"keywords":{"es":["Playwright Excel","automatización de scripts","codegen","configuración centralizada","validación MCP","integación con Python","Excel","automatización de tareas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Playwright Excel","automatisation de scripts","codegen","configuration centralisée","validation MCP","intégration avec Python","Excel","automatisation de tâches","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Playwright Excel","Skriptautomatisierung","codegen","zentrale Konfiguration","MCP-Validierung","Integration mit Python","Excel","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["Playwright Excel","automação de scripts","config centralizada","validação MCP","integração conda","execução de comandos Python","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de automação"],"ru":["Playwright Excel","автоматизация скриптов","центральная конфигурация","валидация MCP","интеграция conda","выполнение команд Python","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты автоматизации"],"ar":["بلاي رايت إكسيل","أتمتة البرامج النصية","التهيئة المركزية","التحقق من MCP","التكامل conda","تشغيل أوامر Python","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الأتمتة"]}},"owner":"Rukkha1024","repo":"post_auto_work","repoPath":"Rukkha1024/post_auto_work","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-excel","description":"Integrate Excel (.xlsx) data into Playwright codegen scripts by replacing hardcoded values with config-driven lookups, loading data with polars, and validating every step with Playwright MCP (start MCP from the repo if not running). Use for Playwright automation updates that require Excel-backed data, config.yaml centralization, or MCP validation/reporting.","bodyPreview":"# Playwright Excel Integration\n\n## Overview\nConvert Playwright codegen scripts into Excel-driven automations with centralized config and required MCP validation.\n\n## Environment\n- Use the `playwright` conda environment.\n- Before running any Python command, run: `conda run -n playwright python -c \"import sys; print(sys.executable)\"`\n- Do not create or activate any venv or `.venv`.\n\n## Inputs\n- Playwright codegen script path\n- Excel `.xlsx` path\n- Mapping lines: `\"hardcoded_value\" -> Excel[Sheet][","body":"# Playwright Excel Integration\n\n## Overview\nConvert Playwright codegen scripts into Excel-driven automations with centralized config and required MCP validation.\n\n## Environment\n- Use the `playwright` conda environment.\n- Before running any Python command, run: `conda run -n playwright python -c \"import sys; print(sys.executable)\"`\n- Do not create or activate any venv or `.venv`.\n\n## Inputs\n- Playwright codegen script path\n- Excel `.xlsx` path\n- Mapping lines: `\"hardcoded_value\" -> Excel[Sheet][FilterCol==FilterVal][DataCol]`\n- Optional override: `PLAYWRIGHT_TARGET_SUBJECT`\n\n## Workflow\n1. Analyze the Playwright script and the Excel structure (sheets, columns, sample rows).\n2. Detect hardcoded `.fill()` values and confirm that each has a mapping; request clarification for mismatches.\n3. Ensure dependencies in the `playwright` conda env (prefer `conda install -n playwright`, fall back to `conda run -n playwright pip install`).\n4. Create or update `config.yaml` using centralized control (paths, patterns, column definitions, constants, tunables, shared texts).\n5. Modify the Playwright script:\n   - Add a config loader and an Excel loader (polars; see `references/excel-loading.md`).\n   - Replace hardcoded values with `data[...]`.\n6. Always run Playwright MCP validation; if MCP is not running, start it from this repo before continuing (see `references/mcp-validation.md`).\n7. When refactoring existing pipelines/logic, generate outputs and compare MD5 checksums with reference files (see `references/md5-validation.md`).\n8. Run the updated script with `conda run -n playwright python`.\n\n## References\n- `references/excel-loading.md`\n- `references/mcp-validation.md`\n- `references/md5-validation.md`\n- `references/examples.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:18:08.003Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing to convert Playwright codegen scripts into Excel-driven automations with centralized configuration and MCP validation.","zh":"适合需要将 Playwright 代码生成脚本转换为 Excel 驱动的自动化的自动化代理，具有集中配置和 MCP 验证。","ja":"Playwright のコード生成スクリプトを Excel ドリブンの自動化に変換する必要がある自動化エージェントに最適です。集中構成と MCP 検証を備えています。","ko":"Playwright 코드 생성 스크립트를 Excel 기반의 자동화로 변환해야 하는 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 중앙 집중식 구성 및 MCP 검증을 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan convertir scripts de codegen de Playwright en automatizaciones impulsadas por Excel con configuración centralizada y validación de MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation ayant besoin de convertir des scripts de codegen Playwright en automatisations pilotées par Excel avec une configuration centralisée et une validation MCP.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die Playwright-Codegen-Skripte in Excel-automatisierte Automatisierungen mit zentraler Konfiguration und MCP-Validierung umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam converter scripts de codegen do Playwright em automações impulsionadas pelo Excel com configuração centralizada e validação do MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым необходимо преобразовывать скрипты Playwright codegen в автоматизацию, управляемую Excel, с централизованной конфигурацией и проверкой MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل نصوص برمجيّة Playwright codegen إلى عمليات أتمتة مدفوعة ببرنامج Excel مع تكوين مركزي وتحقق MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Playwright and Excel for automated testing and validation, utilizing the `playwright` conda environment and Python for seamless integration with Excel `.xlsx` files and MCP validation protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Playwright 和 Excel 进行自动化测试和验证的能力，利用 `playwright` conda 环境和 Python 实现与 Excel `.xlsx` 文件和 MCP 验证协议的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが Playwright と Excel を利用して自動テストと検証を行う能力を提供します。`playwright` コンダ環境と Python を使用して、Excel `.xlsx` ファイルおよび MCP 検証プロトコルとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright와 Excel을 사용하여 자동화된 테스트 및 검증을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. `playwright` conda 환경 및 Python을 사용하여 Excel `.xlsx` 파일 및 MCP 검증 프로토콜과 무제한으로 통합할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar Playwright y Excel para pruebas y validación automatizadas, utilizando el entorno conda `playwright` y Python para una integración transparente con archivos Excel `.xlsx` y protocolos de validación de MCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser Playwright et Excel pour des tests et une validation automatisés, en utilisant l''environnement conda `playwright` et Python pour une intégration transparente avec les fichiers Excel `.xlsx` et les protocoles de validation MCP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Playwright und Excel für automatisierte Tests und Validierung zu nutzen, indem es die conda-Umgebung `playwright` und Python für eine nahtlose Integration mit Excel-Dateien `.xlsx` und MCP-Validierungsprotokollen verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem o Playwright e o Excel para testes e validação automatizados, utilizando o ambiente conda `playwright` e Python para integração transparente com arquivos Excel `.xlsx` e protocolos de validação do MCP.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать Playwright и Excel для автоматизированного тестирования и проверки, используя среду conda `playwright` и Python для бесшовной интеграции с файлами Excel `.xlsx` и протоколами проверки MCP.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من Playwright و Excel من أجل الاختبارات والتحقق الآليين، باستخدام بيئة conda `playwright` و Python من أجل التكامل السلس مع ملفات Excel `.xlsx` وبروتوكولات التحقق MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Playwright codegen script conversions","Generating Excel-driven automations with centralized config","Validating MCP protocols for automated testing"],"zh":["自动化 Playwright 代码生成脚本转换","生成具有集中配置的 Excel 驱动自动化","验证自动化测试的 MCP 协议"],"ja":["Playwright コード生成スクリプトの自動化変換","集中構成を備えた Excel ドリブンの自動化の生成","自動テストの MCP プロトコルの検証"],"ko":["Playwright 코드 생성 스크립트 자동화 변환","중앙 집중식 구성이 있는 Excel 기반 자동화 생성","자동화 테스트를 위한 MCP 프로토콜 검증"],"es":["Automatizar conversión de scripts de codegen de Playwright","Generar automatizaciones impulsadas por Excel con configuración centralizada","Validar protocolos de MCP para pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["Automatiser la conversion de scripts de codegen Playwright","Générer des automatisations pilotées par Excel avec une configuration centralisée","Valider les protocoles de MCP pour des tests automatisés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Umwandlung von Playwright-Codegen-Skripten","Erzeugen von Excel-automatisierten Automatisierungen mit zentraler Konfiguration","Validierung von MCP-Protokollen für automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar conversões de scripts de codegen do Playwright","Gerar automações impulsionadas pelo Excel com configuração centralizada","Validar protocolos do MCP para testes automatizados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать преобразование скриптов Playwright codegen","Генерировать автоматизацию, управляемую Excel, с централизованной конфигурацией","Проверять протоколы MCP для автоматизированного тестирования"],"ar":["أتمتة تحويل نصوص برمجيّة Playwright codegen","генерировать عمليات أتمتة مدفوعة ببرنامج Excel مع تكوين مركزي","التحقق من بروتوكولات MCP من أجل الاختبارات الآلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `playwright` conda environment","Python only","No virtual environment (.venv) support"],"zh":["需要 `playwright` conda 环境","仅支持 Python","不支持虚拟环境 (.venv)"],"ja":["`playwright` コンダ環境が必要","Python のみをサポート","仮想環境 (.venv) はサポートされません"],"ko":["`playwright` conda 환경이 필요","파이썬만 지원","가상 환경 (.venv) 미지원"],"es":["Requiere entorno conda `playwright`","Solo Python","No admite entorno virtual (.venv)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''environnement conda `playwright`","Uniquement Python","Pas de support pour l''environnement virtuel (.venv)"],"de":["Benötigt conda-Umgebung `playwright`","Nur Python","Keine Unterstützung für virtuelle Umgebung (.venv)"],"pt":["Exige ambiente conda `playwright`","Apenas Python","Sem suporte a ambiente virtual (.venv)"],"ru":["Требует среды conda `playwright`","Только Python","Нет поддержки виртуальной среды (.venv)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة conda `playwright`","-python فقط","لا يدعم البيئة الافتراضية (.venv)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ANcpLua/qyl/review-pr', 'community', 'ANcpLua', 'qyl', 'ANcpLua/qyl', 'review-pr', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z', '2026-02-18T08:18:23.600Z', NULL, '{"id":"ANcpLua/qyl/review-pr","name":"review-pr","description":{"zh":"Review PR是代码审查工具，用于提高代码质量和可靠性。它支持OTLP ingestion和DuckDB存储","ja":"Review PRはコードレビューツールで、コードの品質と信頼性を向上させるものです。OTLP ingestionとDuckDBストレージをサポートしています","ko":"Review PR은 코드 품질 및 안정성을 향상시키는 코드 리뷰 도구입니다. OTLP ingestion 및 DuckDB 저장소 지원","es":"Nuestra herramienta de revisión de solicitudes de extracción utiliza IA para analizar y mejorar la calidad del código","fr":"Notre outil de révision de demandes d''extraction utilise l''IA pour analyser et améliorer la qualité du code","de":"Unser Tool für die Überprüfung von Pull-Requests verwendet KI, um die Codequalität zu analysieren und zu verbessern","pt":"A plataforma de revisão de PR com AI oferece uma solução abrangente para análise de logs e telemetria de IA. Com suporte a OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB.","ru":"Платформа обзора PR с помощью ИИ предоставляет комплексное решение для анализа логов и телеметрии ИИ. С поддержкой OTLP и хранилищем DuckDB.","ar":"توفر منصة استعراض طلب السحب بالذكاء الاصطناعي حلا شاملا لتحليل السجلات وتелеметрия الاصطناعي. مع دعم OTLP وتخزين DuckDB.","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查工具 - Review PR","ja":"コードレビューツール - Review PR","ko":"코드 리뷰 도구 - Review PR","es":"Revisión de solicitudes de extracción con AI","fr":"Révision de demandes d''extraction avec l''IA","de":"Überprüfung von Pull-Requests mit KI","pt":"Revisão de PR Com AI","ru":"Обзор PR с помощью AI","ar":"استعراض طلب السحب بالذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"review-pr"},"description":{"zh":"Review PR是代码审查工具，用于提高代码质量和可靠性。它支持OTLP ingestion和DuckDB存储","ja":"Review PRはコードレビューツールで、コードの品質と信頼性を向上させるものです。OTLP ingestionとDuckDBストレージをサポートしています","ko":"Review PR은 코드 품질 및 안정성을 향상시키는 코드 리뷰 도구입니다. OTLP ingestion 및 DuckDB 저장소 지원","es":"Nuestra herramienta de revisión de solicitudes de extracción utiliza IA para analizar y mejorar la calidad del código","fr":"Notre outil de révision de demandes d''extraction utilise l''IA pour analyser et améliorer la qualité du code","de":"Unser Tool für die Überprüfung von Pull-Requests verwendet KI, um die Codequalität zu analysieren und zu verbessern","pt":"A plataforma de revisão de PR com AI oferece uma solução abrangente para análise de logs e telemetria de IA. Com suporte a OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB.","ru":"Платформа обзора PR с помощью ИИ предоставляет комплексное решение для анализа логов и телеметрии ИИ. С поддержкой OTLP и хранилищем DuckDB.","ar":"توفر منصة استعراض طلب السحب بالذكاء الاصطناعي حلا شاملا لتحليل السجلات وتелеметрия الاصطناعي. مع دعم OTLP وتخزين DuckDB.","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"zh":["代码审查","OTLP ingestion","DuckDB存储","语义约定","AI遥测"],"ja":["コードレビュー","OTLP ingestion","DuckDBストレージ","セマンティック規約","AIテレメトリ"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","OTLP ingestion","DuckDB 저장소","의미 규약","AI 원격 측정"],"es":["Análisis de código con IA","Revisión de solicitudes de extracción automatizada","Mejora de la calidad del código","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Informes detallados y personalizables"],"fr":["Analyse de code avec l''IA","Révision de demandes d''extraction automatisée","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Rapports détaillés et personnalisables"],"de":["Code-Analyse mit KI","Automatisierte Überprüfung von Pull-Requests","Verbes