pec-verify-change","pt":"Verifique alterações com openspec-verify-change","ru":"Проверьте изменения с openspec-verify-change","ar":"تحقق من التغييرات مع openspec-verify-change","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 是一个用于验证实现是否匹配变化的设计和任务的技术，用于日常锻炼应用的单一仓库","ja":"openspec-verify-change は、実装が設計とタスクに合わせているかを検証する技術であり、日常の運動アプリのモノレポで使用する","ko":"openspec-verify-change는 구현과 디자인 및 태스크의 일치 여부를 확인하는 기술로, 일일 운동 앱의 모노레포에서 사용됩니다","es":"openspec-verify-change es una herramienta para verificar que la implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio. Ideal para monorepos de aplicaciones de...","fr":"openspec-verify-change est un outil pour vérifier que la mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification. Idéal pour les monorepos d''applications d''ex...","de":"openspec-verify-change ist ein Tool, um zu überprüfen, ob die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Ideal für Monorepos von täglichen Wo...","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta para verificar se a implementação corresponde às alterações nos artifacts de specs, tarefas e design","ru":"Openspec-verify-change - это инструмент для проверки соответствия реализации изменениям в артефактах спецификаций, задач и дизайна","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة للتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع التغييرات في مواصفات المهمة والتصميم","en":"Monorepo for daily workout app"},"definition":{"en":"Monorepo for daily workout app"},"features":{"zh":["验证实现是否匹配变化的设计和任务","支持日常锻炼应用的单一仓库","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具让用户选择变化","运行 openspec list --json 获取可用的变化","显示具有实现任务的变化"],"ja":["実装が設計とタスクに合わせているかを検証","日常の運動アプリのモノレポをサポート","AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してユーザーが変更を選択","openspec list --json を実行して利用可能な変更を取得","実装タスクを持つ変更を表示"],"ko":["구현과 디자인 및 태스크의 일치 여부를 확인","일일 운동 앱의 모노레포를 지원","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자가 변경을 선택","openspec list --json을 실행하여 사용 가능한 변경을 가져옴","구현 태스크가 있는 변경을 표시"],"es":["Verificación de implementación","Selección de cambios","Integración con openspec","Soporte para monorepos","Flujos de trabajo eficientes"],"fr":["Vérification de la mise en œuvre","Sélection de modifications","Intégration avec openspec","Prise en charge des monorepos","Flux de travail efficaces"],"de":["Implementierungsüberprüfung","Änderungsauswahl","Integration mit openspec","Unterstützung für Monorepos","Effiziente Workflows"],"pt":["Verificação de alterações nos artifacts de specs","Verificação de alterações nas tarefas","Verificação de alterações no design","Integração com o AskUserQuestion tool","Suporte à seleção de alterações"],"ru":["Проверка изменений в артефактах спецификаций","Проверка изменений в задачах","Проверка изменений в дизайне","Интеграция с инструментом AskUserQuestion","Поддержка выбора изменений"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات في مواصفات المهمة","التحقق من التغييرات في التصميم","التحقق من التغييرات في المهام","التكامل مع أداة AskUserQuestion","دعم اختيار التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","技术验证","实现匹配","设计和任务","日常锻炼应用","单一仓库"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","実装検証","設計とタスク","日常の運動アプリ","モノレポ","実装と検証"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","기술驗證","구현 일치","디자인 및 태스크","일일 운동 앱","모노레포"],"es":["openspec-verify-change","monorepo","verificación de cambios","implementación","desarrollo de software","eficiencia en el trabajo","flujos de trabajo","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["openspec-verify-change","monorepo","vérification de modifications","mise en œuvre","développement de logiciels","efficacité du travail","flux de travail","outils de développement"],"de":["openspec-verify-change","Monorepo","Änderungsüberprüfung","Implementierung","Softwareentwicklung","Arbeitseffizienz","Workflows","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de alterações","artifacts de specs","tarefas","design","AskUserQuestion tool","seleção de alterações"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка изменений","артефакты спецификаций","задачи","дизайн","инструмент AskUserQuestion","выбор изменений"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","التحقق من التغييرات","مواصفات المهمة","التصميم","المهام","أداة AskUserQuestion","اختيار التغييرات"]}},"owner":"morganabel","repo":"daily-workout","repoPath":"morganabel/daily-workout","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:18:16.160Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing monorepo verification and change management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要单体仓库验证和变更管理功能的开发代理。","ja":"モノレポの検証と変更管理機能が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"모노레포 확인 및 변경 관리 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan verificación de monorepo y capacidades de gestión de cambios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui nécessitent une vérification de monorepo et des capacités de gestion de modifications.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine Monorepo-Verifizierung und Änderungsmanagementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de verificação de monorepo e capacidades de gerenciamento de alterações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима проверка monorepo и возможности управления изменениями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق من mono-repo وإمكانيات إدارة التغييرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using openspec, facilitating tasks like running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while handling JSON data and conversation context.","zh":"赋予代理人使用openspec验证实现是否匹配更改工件的能力，促进运行`openspec list --json`等任务，并利用AskUserQuestion工具进行用户选择，同时处理JSON数据和对话上下文。","ja":"エージェントがopenspecを使用して実装が変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証できるようにし、`openspec list --json`の実行やAskUserQuestionツールを使用したユーザー選択などを促進し、同時にJSONデータと会話のコンテキストを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 openspec를 사용하여 구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인할 수 있도록 하며, `openspec list --json` 실행과 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용한 사용자 선택 등과 같은 작업을 촉진하고,同時에 JSON 데이터와 대화 컨텍스트를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio utilizando openspec, facilitando tareas como ejecutar `openspec list --json` y utilizar la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección de usuarios, todo mientras maneja datos JSON y contexto de conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que la mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification en utilisant openspec, facilitant des tâches comme l''exécution de `openspec list --json` et l''utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, le tout en gérant les données JSON et le contexte de conversation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, die Implementierung zu überprüfen, um Änderungsartefakte mit openspec zu entsprechen, wodurch Aufgaben wie das Ausführen von `openspec list --json` und die Verwendung des AskUserQuestion-Tools für die Benutzerauswahl erleichtert werden, während JSON-Daten und Konversationskontext gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração usando openspec, facilitando tarefas como executar `openspec list --json` e utilizar a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção do usuário, tudo enquanto lida com dados JSON e contexto de conversa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменений с помощью openspec, облегчая задачи, такие как запуск `openspec list --json` и использование инструмента AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, все это при обработке данных JSON и контекста разговора.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع محتوى التغييرات باستخدام openspec ، و تسهيل المهام مثل تشغيل `openspec list --json` واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لتحديد المستخدم ، و كل ذلك أثناء التعامل مع بيانات JSON و سياق المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying daily workout app changes","Validating implementation against specs and design","Automating change inference from conversation context"],"zh":["验证每日健身应用程序更改","验证实现是否符合规格和设计","自动从对话上下文推断更改"],"ja":["日常の運動アプリの変更を検証する","実装が仕様と設計に一致することを検証する","会話のコンテキストから変更を自動的に推論する"],"ko":["일일 운동 애플리케이션 변경 사항을 검증하는 것","구현이 사양 및 설계와 일치하는지 확인","대화 컨텍스트에서 변경 사항을 자동으로 추론"],"es":["Verificar los cambios de la aplicación de ejercicio diaria","Validar la implementación contra las especificaciones y el diseño","Automatizar la inferencia de cambios del contexto de conversación"],"fr":["Vérifier les modifications de l''application de travail quotidien","Valider la mise en œuvre par rapport aux spécifications et à la conception","Automatiser l''inférence de modifications à partir du contexte de conversation"],"de":["Überprüfen der Änderungen an der täglichen Fitnes-App","Überprüfen der Implementierung gegen Spezifikationen und Design","Automatisieren der Änderungsableitung aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Verificar alterações no aplicativo de treinamento diário","Validar a implementação contra especificações e design","Automatizar a inferência de alterações do contexto da conversa"],"ru":["Проверка изменений в ежедневном фитнес-приложении","Проверка реализации против спецификаций и дизайна","Автоматизация вывода изменений из контекста разговора"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات في تطبيق التمرين اليومي","التحقق من التنفيذ مقابل المواصفات و التصميم","توسيط استدلال التغييرات من سياق المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Limited to monorepo environments","Needs user interaction for change selection when not specified"],"zh":["需要openspec的安装和配置","仅限于单体仓库环境","需要用户交互来选择更改时未指定"],"ja":["openspecのインストールと構成が必要","モノレポ環境のみに限定される","変更の選択時に未指定の場合、ユーザーとのやり取りが必要"],"ko":["openspec 설치 및 구성이 필요","모노레포 환경에만 제한","변경 선택 시 지정되지 않은 경우 사용자 상호 작용이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de openspec","Limitado a entornos de monorepo","Necesita interacción del usuario para la selección de cambios cuando no se especifica"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","Limité aux environnements de monorepo","Nécessite une interaction utilisateur pour la sélection de modifications lorsque cela n''est pas spécifié"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Begrenzt auf Monorepo-Umgebungen","Benötigt Benutzereingriff für die Änderungsauswahl, wenn diese nicht angegeben ist"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do openspec","Limitado a ambientes monorepo","Necessita interação do usuário para seleção de alterações quando não especificado"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки openspec","Ограничен средами monorepo","Требует взаимодействия пользователя для выбора изменений, когда не указано"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين openspec","محدود بالبيئات monorepo","يحتاج إلى互одействة المستخدم لتحديد التغييرات عند عدم التحديد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Erland366/merginguriel/domain-advisor', 'community', 'Erland366', 'merginguriel', 'Erland366/merginguriel', 'domain-advisor', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z', '2026-02-18T08:18:33.433Z', NULL, '{"id":"Erland366/merginguriel/domain-advisor","name":"domain-advisor","description":{"zh":"domain-advisor 技术用于优化开发流程，提供实用建议和指导","ja":"domain-advisor スキルは開発プロセスを最適化し、実用的アドバイスを提供する","ko":"domain-advisor는 개발 프로세스를 최적화하고 실용적인 제안을 제공하는 기술입니다","es":"El asesor de dominio es una habilidad que ofrece consejos personalizados para mejorar el desarrollo. Se activa cuando el mensaje del usuario comienza con <advise> o cuando se hacen preguntas de planificación","fr":"Le conseiller de domaine est une compétence qui offre des conseils sur mesure pour améliorer le développement. Il est activé lorsque le message de l''utilisateur commence par <advise> ou lorsqu''il pose des questions de planification","de":"Der Domain-Berater ist eine Fähigkeit, die maßgeschneiderte Tipps für die Verbesserung der Entwicklung bietet. Sie wird aktiviert, wenn die Benachrichtigung des Benutzers mit <advise> beginnt oder wenn Planungsfragen gestellt werden","pt":"O skill domain-advisor é uma ferramenta de otimização de experimentos que fornece dicas personalizadas para melhorar resultados","ru":"Навык domain-advisor является инструментом оптимизации экспериментов, который предоставляет персонализированные советы для улучшения результатов","ar":"مهارة domain-advisor هي أداة تحسين تجارب تقدم نصائح متخصصة لتحسين النتائج","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"domain-advisor 技术指南","ja":"domain-advisor スキルの使い方","ko":"domain-advisor 개발자 가이드","es":"Asesor de Dominio: Mejora tu Desarrollo con Consejos Pers...","fr":"Conseiller de Domaine: Améliorez votre Développement avec...","de":"Domain-Berater: Verbessern Sie Ihre Entwicklung mit Maßge...","pt":"Assessor de Domínio: Otimização de Experimentos","ru":"Доменный советник: оптимизация экспериментов","ar":"مستشار المجال: تحسين التجارب","en":"domain-advisor"},"description":{"zh":"domain-advisor 技术用于优化开发流程，提供实用建议和指导","ja":"domain-advisor スキルは開発プロセスを最適化し、実用的アドバイスを提供する","ko":"domain-advisor는 개발 프로세스를 최적화하고 실용적인 제안을 제공하는 기술입니다","es":"El asesor de dominio es una habilidad que ofrece consejos personalizados para mejorar el desarrollo. Se activa cuando el mensaje del usuario comienza con <ad...","fr":"Le conseiller de domaine est une compétence qui offre des conseils sur mesure pour améliorer le développement. Il est activé lorsque le message de l''utilisat...","de":"Der Domain-Berater ist eine Fähigkeit, die maßgeschneiderte Tipps für die Verbesserung der Entwicklung bietet. Sie wird aktiviert, wenn die Benachrichtigung ...","pt":"O skill domain-advisor é uma ferramenta de otimização de experimentos que fornece dicas personalizadas para melhorar resultados","ru":"Навык domain-advisor является инструментом оптимизации экспериментов, который предоставляет персонализированные советы для улучшения результатов","ar":"مهارة domain-advisor هي أداة تحسين تجارب تقدم نصائح متخصصة لتحسين النتائج","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["根据用户输入提供实用建议","支持多种开发路径和报告","可适配不同开发环境","提供实验日志和故障排除指南","支持 research、unsloth、cuda 等多种域"],"ja":["ユーザーの入力に応じた実用的アドバイス","複数の開発パスとレポートをサポート","異なる開発環境に適応可能","実験ログとトラブルシューティングガイドを提供","research、unsloth、cuda などの複数のドメインをサポート"],"ko":["사용자의 입력에 따라 실용적인 제안을 제공","다양한 개발 경로와 보고서를 지원","다른 개발 환경에 맞게 설정할 수 있음","실험 로그와 문제 해결 가이드를 제공","research, unsloth, cuda 등 다양한 도메인을 지원"],"es":["Consejos personalizados para el desarrollo","Activación mediante mensajes de usuario que comienzan con <advise>","Respuestas a preguntas de planificación","Configuración adaptable basada en el dominio","Integración con registros de experimentos y guías de solución de problemas"],"fr":["Conseils sur mesure pour le développement","Activation via des messages d''utilisateur qui commencent par <advise>","Réponses à des questions de planification","Configuration adaptable basée sur le domaine","Intégration avec des registres d''expériences et des guides de dépannage"],"de":["Maßgeschneiderte Tipps für die Entwicklung","Aktivierung durch Benachrichtigungen, die mit <advise> beginnen","Antworten auf Planungsfragen","Anpassbare Konfiguration basierend auf dem Domain","Integration mit Experimenten- und Fehlerbehebungsleitfäden"],"pt":["Otimização de experimentos","Dicas personalizadas","Melhoria de resultados","Integração com registry.json","Suporte a múltiplos domínios"],"ru":["Оптимизация экспериментов","Персонализированные советы","Улучшение результатов","Интеграция с registry.json","Поддержка нескольких доменов"],"ar":["تحسين التجارب","نصائح متخصصة","تحسين النتائج","التكامل مع registry.json","دعم المجالات المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["domain-advisor","开发流程优化","实用建议","开发技术","research","unsloth","cuda"],"ja":["domain-advisor","開発プロセス最適化","実用的アドバイス","開発技術","research","unsloth","cuda"],"ko":["domain-advisor","개발 프로세스 최적화","실용적인 제안","개발 기술","research","unsloth","cuda"],"es":["asesor de dominio","desarrollo de software","consejos personalizados","planificación de proyectos","registros de experimentos","guías de solución de problemas"],"fr":["conseiller de domaine","développement de logiciels","conseils sur mesure","planification de projets","registres d''expériences","guides de dépannage"],"de":["Domain-Berater","Software-Entwicklung","maßgeschneiderte Tipps","Projektplanung","Experimenten-Register","Fehlerbehebungs-Leitfäden"],"pt":["domain-advisor","otimização de experimentos","dicas personalizadas","melhoria de resultados","registry.json","desenvolvimento de software","experimentos de benchmark"],"ru":["domain-advisor","оптимизация экспериментов","персонализированные советы","улучшение результатов","registry.json","разработка программного обеспечения","эксперименты по бенчмарку"],"ar":["domain-advisor","تحسين التجارب","نصائح متخصصة","تحسين النتائج","registry.json","تطوير البرمجيات","تجارب بンチمارك"]}},"owner":"Erland366","repo":"merginguriel","repoPath":"Erland366/merginguriel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"domain-advisor","description":">","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Skill: domain-advisor\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The user message starts with `<advise>`, or\n- The user asks \"What should we try next?\" or similar planning questions.\n\n## Initialization\n\n1. Read `.codex/skills/registry.json` to determine:\n   - `domain`: research | unsloth | cuda\n   - `paths.reports`: where to find experiment/benchmark reports\n   - `paths.experiment_log`: path to experiment log\n   - `paths.troubleshooting`: path to troubleshooting guide\n\n2. Adapt behavior based on","body":"# Skill: domain-advisor\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The user message starts with `<advise>`, or\n- The user asks \"What should we try next?\" or similar planning questions.\n\n## Initialization\n\n1. Read `.codex/skills/registry.json` to determine:\n   - `domain`: research | unsloth | cuda\n   - `paths.reports`: where to find experiment/benchmark reports\n   - `paths.experiment_log`: path to experiment log\n   - `paths.troubleshooting`: path to troubleshooting guide\n\n2. Adapt behavior based on domain (see Domain-Specific Behavior below).\n\n## Inputs\n\n- User goal (including constraints like run budget, hardware, time).\n- Optional references to files (configs, reports, logs) mentioned in the goal.\n\n## Behavior\n\n1. **Understand the goal**\n   - Parse the research/development goal and constraints.\n   - If unclear, ask a concise clarifying question.\n\n2. **Gather context**\n   - Scan `.codex/skills/` for **relevant result skills** matching the task.\n   - Read relevant reports from the `paths.reports` directory.\n   - Skim recent entries in `paths.experiment_log`.\n   - If errors are mentioned, check `paths.troubleshooting` for known patterns.\n\n3. **Propose a plan**\n   - Design **2–5 concrete experiments/tasks**, each with:\n     - Clear objective\n     - Key configuration/parameters\n     - Expected outcome or hypothesis\n     - Any relevant variation to test\n   - Respect constraints (budget, hardware, time).\n   - **Reuse defaults** from existing skills instead of inventing new ones.\n\n4. **Output format**\n   - Start with a short natural-language summary.\n   - Provide a markdown table:\n\n     | id | description | key_differences | notes |\n     |----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n\n   - Optionally propose file paths for configs or reports to create.\n   - If errors were mentioned, explain how this plan avoids known failure patterns.\n\n5. **Logging**\n   - When useful, append a short entry to `paths.experiment_log` summarizing\n     the proposed plan (only with user approval).\n\n---\n\n## Domain-Specific Behavior\n\n### Research Domain\n\nWhen `domain: research`:\n\n**Focus areas:**\n- Hyperparameter sweeps (learning rate, batch size, epochs)\n- Model architecture variations (layers, dimensions, attention heads)\n- Dataset mixtures and sampling strategies\n- Training dynamics (warmup, schedulers, checkpointing)\n\n**Context to gather:**\n- `training_reports/*.md` - past training runs\n- Model configs and their performance\n- Loss curves and convergence patterns\n\n**Output emphasis:**\n- Parameter sweep tables with specific values\n- Ablation study designs\n- Baseline comparisons\n\n### Unsloth Domain\n\nWhen `domain: unsloth`:\n\n**Focus areas:**\n- LoRA rank and alpha selection\n- Quantization settings (4-bit, 8-bit, nf4)\n- Gradient checkpointing configuration\n- Fine-tuning hyperparameters for specific model families\n- Memory optimization strategies\n\n**Context to gather:**\n- `training_reports/*.md` - past fine-tuning runs\n- Model-specific Unsloth configurations\n- Memory usage patterns\n\n**Output emphasis:**\n- LoRA configuration recommendations\n- Memory/speed tradeoffs\n- Model-specific settings (Llama, Mistral, Qwen, etc.)\n\n### CUDA Domain\n\nWhen `domain: cuda`:\n\n**Focus areas:**\n- Tiling strategies and block sizes\n- Shared memory usage patterns\n- Warp-level primitives\n- Memory coalescing optimization\n- Triton autotuning configurations\n\n**Context to gather:**\n- `benchmark_results/*.md` - past kernel benchmarks\n- Profiling data (nsight, ncu reports)\n- Bandwidth and occupancy metrics\n\n**Output emphasis:**\n- Kernel configuration parameters\n- Expected speedup estimates\n- Memory access pattern recommendations\n- Profiling metrics to track\n\n---\n\n## Example Output\n\n### Research Example\n\n```markdown\n## Experiment Plan: Attention Head Ablation\n\nBased on previous runs in `training_reports/baseline-2025-01.md`, the 8-head\nconfiguration achieved 92% accuracy. Testing whether fewer heads can match\nthis with lower compute.\n\n| id | description | key_differences | notes |\n|----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n| A1 | 4-head attention | heads=4 vs baseline 8 | Test if 4 heads sufficient |\n| A2 | 6-head attention | heads=6 | Middle ground |\n| A3 | 4-head + wider FFN | heads=4, ffn_dim=4096 | Compensate with FFN |\n\nAll runs use: lr=1e-4, batch_size=32, epochs=10 (from baseline config).\n```\n\n### Unsloth Example\n\n```markdown\n## Fine-tuning Plan: Llama-3 8B with Unsloth\n\nBased on `training_reports/llama3-lora-v1.md`, rank=16 showed good results\nbut OOM''d at batch_size=4. Testing memory-efficient configurations.\n\n| id | description | key_differences | notes |\n|----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n| U1 | rank=8 + grad_ckpt | Lower rank, enable checkpointing | Memory baseline |\n| U2 | rank=16 + 4bit | Full rank with 4-bit quantization | Quality vs memory |\n| U3 | rank=32 + offload | Higher rank with CPU offload | Max quality attempt |\n\nAll runs use: alpha=32, dropout=0.05, target_modules=[\"q_proj\", \"v_proj\"]\n```\n\n### CUDA Example\n\n```markdown\n## Kernel Optimization Plan: Softmax\n\nBased on `benchmark_results/softmax-v1.md`, current implementation achieves\n80% of theoretical bandwidth. Testing tiling strategies.\n\n| id | description | key_differences | notes |\n|----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n| K1 | 2D tiling | BLOCK_M=64, BLOCK_N=64 | Better L2 reuse |\n| K2 | Warp reduction | Use warp shuffles | Reduce shared mem |\n| K3 | Online softmax | Single-pass algorithm | Fused with attention |\n\nProfile with: `ncu --set full` to capture memory metrics.\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:18:33.433Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Research Agents requiring targeted domain guidance and experiment planning.","zh":"适用于需要目标领域指导和实验规划的研究代理。","ja":"ターゲット ドメインのガイダンスと実験計画が必要な研究エージェントに最適です。","ko":"목표 도메인 지침 및 실험 계획이 필요한 연구 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Investigación que requieren orientación de dominio objetivo y planificación de experimentos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche nécessitant une orientation de domaine ciblée et une planification d''expériences.","de":"Ideal für Forschungsagenten, die eine gezielte Domänenführung und Experimentplanung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa que requerem orientação de domínio direcionada e planejamento de experimentos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-исследователей, требующих целенаправленного руководства в области и планирования экспериментов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات domaine محددة وتخطيط تجارب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide data-driven advice by reading registry files, understanding domain-specific paths, and adapting behavior based on the domain, utilizing JSON files like ''registry.json'' for configuration and interacting with experiment logs and troubleshooting guides.","zh":"使代理能够通过读取注册表文件、理解特定于域的路径并根据域适应行为来提供数据驱动的建议，使用类似 ''registry.json'' 的 JSON 文件进行配置，并与实验日志和故障排除指南交互。","ja":"エージェントがレジストリ ファイルを読み取り、ドメイン固有のパスを理解し、ドメインに応じて動作を適応させることで、データ ドリブンのアドバイスを提供できるようにし、''registry.json'' のような JSON ファイルを使用して構成し、実験ログやトラブルシューティング ガイドとやり取りします。","ko":"에이전트가 레지스트리 파일을 읽고 도메인별 경로를 이해하며 도메인에 따라 동작을 적응시켜 데이터 주도적인 조언을 제공할 수 있도록 하며 ''registry.json'' 같은 JSON 파일을 사용하여 구성하며 실험 로그 및 문제 해결 가이드와 상호 작용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar asesoramiento basado en datos leyendo archivos de registro, entendiendo rutas específicas del dominio y adaptando el comportamiento en función del dominio, utilizando archivos JSON como ''registry.json'' para la configuración e interactuando con registros de experimentos y guías de solución de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des conseils basés sur les données en lisant les fichiers de registre, en comprenant les chemins spécifiques au domaine et en adaptant le comportement en fonction du domaine, en utilisant des fichiers JSON tels que ''registry.json'' pour la configuration et en interagissant avec les journaux d''expériences et les guides de dépannage.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, datengetriebene Beratung zu geben, indem sie Registrierungsdateien lesen, domänen-spezifische Pfade verstehen und das Verhalten basierend auf der Domäne anpassen, indem sie JSON-Dateien wie ''registry.json'' für die Konfiguration verwenden und mit Experimentprotokollen und Fehlerbehebungsleitfäden interagieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer conselhos baseados em dados, lendo arquivos de registro, entendendo caminhos específicos de domínio e adaptando o comportamento com base no domínio, utilizando arquivos JSON como ''registry.json'' para configuração e interagindo com logs de experimentos e guias de solução de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять рекомендации, основанные на данных, читая файлы реестра, понимая пути, специфичные для области, и адаптируя поведение на основе области, используя файлы JSON, такие как ''registry.json'', для конфигурации и взаимодействия с журналами экспериментов и руководствами по устранению неполадок.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تقديم المشورة القائمة على البيانات من خلال قراءة ملفات السجل وفهم مسارات محددة للنطاق وتكييف السلوك بناءً على النطاق، باستخدام ملفات JSON مثل ''registry.json'' للضبط والتفاعل مع سجلات التجارب وإرشادات حل المشكلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating experiment planning based on user queries","Generating domain-specific advice for research tasks","Debugging experiment issues using troubleshooting guides"],"zh":["基于用户查询自动化实验规划","为研究任务生成特定于域的建议","使用故障排除指南调试实验问题"],"ja":["ユーザー クエリに基づく実験計画の自動化","研究タスクのドメイン固有のアドバイスを生成する","トラブルシューティング ガイドを使用して実験の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자 쿼리 기반 실험 계획 자동화","연구 태스크를 위한 도메인별 조언 생성","문제 해결 가이드를 사용한 실험 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la planificación de experimentos en función de las consultas de los usuarios","Generar asesoramiento específico del dominio para tareas de investigación","Depurar problemas de experimentos utilizando guías de solución de problemas"],"fr":["Automatiser la planification d''expériences en fonction des requêtes des utilisateurs","Générer des conseils spécifiques au domaine pour les tâches de recherche","Déboguer les problèmes d''expériences en utilisant les guides de dépannage"],"de":["Automatisieren der Experimentplanung basierend auf Benutzeranfragen","Generieren von domänen-spezifischen Empfehlungen für Forschungsaufgaben","Fehlerbehebung von Experimentproblemen mithilfe von Fehlerbehebungsleitfäden"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de experimentos com base em consultas de usuário","Gerar conselhos específicos de domínio para tarefas de pesquisa","Depurar problemas de experimento usando guias de solução de problemas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование экспериментов на основе запросов пользователей","Генерировать рекомендации, специфичные для области, для задач исследований","Отлаживать проблемы эксперимента, используя руководства по устранению неполадок"],"ar":["تأتمة تخطيط التجارب بناءً على استفسارات المستخدم","توليد نصائح محددة للنطاق لمهام البحث","تصحيح مشاكل التجارب باستخدام إرشادات حل المشكلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ''.codex/skills/registry.json'' file","Limited to ''research'', ''unsloth'', and ''cuda'' domains"],"zh":["需要访问 ''.codex/skills/registry.json'' 文件","仅限 ''research'', ''unsloth'', 和 ''cuda'' 域"],"ja":["''.codex/skills/registry.json'' ファイルへのアクセスが必要","''research'', ''unsloth'', ''cuda'' ドメインのみに限定"],"ko":["''.codex/skills/registry.json'' 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","''research'', ''unsloth'', ''cuda'' 도메인에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo ''.codex/skills/registry.json''","Limitado a los dominios ''investigación'', ''unsloth'' y ''cuda''"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au fichier ''.codex/skills/registry.json''","Limité aux domaines ''recherche'', ''unsloth'' et ''cuda''"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei ''.codex/skills/registry.json''","Begrenzt auf die Domänen ''Forschung'', ''unsloth'' und ''cuda''"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo ''.codex/skills/registry.json''","Limitado aos domínios ''research'', ''unsloth'' e ''cuda''"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу ''.codex/skills/registry.json''","Ограничен доменами ''research'', ''unsloth'' и ''cuda''"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف ''.codex/skills/registry.json''","محدود بنطاقات ''research'' و ''unsloth'' و ''cuda''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
