":"AIビジネスケースジェネレーターはOTLPとDuckDBを使用して投資家向けのビジネスケース文書を生成","ko":"AI 비즈니스 케이스 생성기는 OTLP 및 DuckDB를 사용하여 투자자용 비즈니스 케이스 문서를 생성","es":"La plataforma de observabilidad de AI permite a los desarrolladores crear documentos de casos de negocio completos y listos para inversores","fr":"La plateforme d''observabilité de l''IA permet aux développeurs de créer des documents de cas d''affaires complets et prêts pour les investisseurs","de":"Die AI-Observability-Plattform ermöglicht es Entwicklern, umfassende und investitionsreife Geschäftsfälle zu erstellen","pt":"O Business Case Generator é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar documentos de caso de negócios abrangentes e personalizados para desenvolvedores","ru":"Генератор делового случая - это инструмент, который помогает создать комплексные и настраиваемые документы делового случая для разработчиков","ar":"مولد حالة الأعمال هو أداة تساعد في إنشاء مستندات شاملة ومتخصصة لحالة الأعمال لمطورين","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"zh":["OTLP摄取","DuckDB存储","语义约定","AI遥测","商业案例生成"],"ja":["OTLPインジェスト","DuckDBストレージ","セマンティックコンベンション","AIテレメトリ","ビジネスケース生成"],"ko":["OTLP 수신","DuckDB 저장","语义约定","AI 원격 측정","비즈니스 케이스 생성"],"es":["Ingestión de OTLP","Almacenamiento en DuckDB","Convenciones semánticas para telemetría de AI","Generación de documentos de casos de negocio","Análisis de mercado y modelado financiero","Planificación de equipos y investigación estratégica"],"fr":["Ingestion OTLP","Stockage DuckDB","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA","Génération de documents de cas d''affaires","Analyse de marché et modélisation financière","Planification d''équipes et recherche stratégique"],"de":["OTLP-Ingestion","DuckDB-Speicher","Semantische Konventionen für AI-Telemetrie","Erstellung von Geschäftsfällen","Marktanalyse und Finanzmodellierung","Teamplanung und strategische Forschung"],"pt":["Geração de documentos de caso de negócios personalizados","Análise de mercado e modelagem financeira","Planejamento de equipe e pesquisa estratégica","Suporte a OTLP e armazenamento em DuckDB","Convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA"],"ru":["Генерация настраиваемых документов делового случая","Анализ рынка и финансовое моделирование","Планирование команды и стратегические исследования","Поддержка OTLP и хранение в DuckDB","Семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات حالة الأعمال المخصصة","تحليل السوق والنمذجة المالية","تخطيط الفريق والبحوث الإستراتيجية","دعم OTLP وتخزين في DuckDB","الأعراف الدلالية لتелеметрия الإصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI商业案例","OTLP","DuckDB","AI遥测","商业案例生成","GenAI","LLM"],"ja":["AIビジネスケース","OTLP","DuckDB","AIテレメトリ","ビジネスケース生成","GenAI","LLM"],"ko":["AI 비즈니스 케이스","OTLP","DuckDB","AI 원격 측정","비즈니스 케이스 생성","GenAI","LLM"],"es":["casos de negocio","observabilidad de AI","OTLP","DuckDB","telemetría de AI","generador de casos de negocio","análisis de mercado","modelado financiero","planificación de equipos"],"fr":["cas d''affaires","observabilité de l''IA","OTLP","DuckDB","télémétrie de l''IA","générateur de cas d''affaires","analyse de marché","modélisation financière","planification d''équipes"],"de":["Geschäftsfälle","AI-Observability","OTLP","DuckDB","AI-Telemetrie","Business-Fall-Generator","Marktanalyse","Finanzmodellierung","Teamplanung"],"pt":["gerador de caso de negócios","desenvolvedores","análise de mercado","modelagem financeira","telemetria de IA","OTLP","DuckDB","convenções semânticas"],"ru":["генератор делового случая","разработчики","анализ рынка","финансовое моделирование","телеметрия ИИ","OTLP","DuckDB","семантические конвенции"],"ar":["مولد حالة الأعمال","مطورين","تحليل السوق","النمذجة المالية","تелеметрия الإصطناعي","OTLP","DuckDB","الأعراف الدلالية"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-case","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools:\n    [\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Edit\", \"Glob\", \"Grep\", \"Bash\", \"WebSearch\", \"WebFetch\"]\nplugin:\n  name: \"startup-business-analyst\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive startup business analysis with market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM), financial modeling, team planning, and strategic research\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# Business Case Generator\n\nGenerate a comprehensive, investor-ready business case document coverin","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools:\n    [\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Edit\", \"Glob\", \"Grep\", \"Bash\", \"WebSearch\", \"WebFetch\"]\nplugin:\n  name: \"startup-business-analyst\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive startup business analysis with market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM), financial modeling, team planning, and strategic research\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# Business Case Generator\n\nGenerate a comprehensive, investor-ready business case document covering market opportunity, solution, competitive landscape, financial projections, team, risks, and funding ask for startup fundraising and strategic planning.\n\n## What This Command Does\n\nCreate a complete business case including:\n\n1. Executive summary\n2. Problem and market opportunity\n3. Solution and product\n4. Competitive analysis and differentiation\n5. Financial projections\n6. Go-to-market strategy\n7. Team and organization\n8. Risks and mitigation\n9. Funding ask and use of proceeds\n\n## Instructions for Claude\n\nWhen this command is invoked, follow these steps:\n\n### Step 1: Gather Context\n\nAsk the user for key information:\n\n**Company Basics:**\n\n- Company name and elevator pitch\n- Stage (pre-seed, seed, Series A)\n- Problem being solved\n- Target customers\n\n**Audience:**\n\n- Who will read this? (VCs, angels, strategic partners)\n- What''s the primary goal? (fundraising, partnership, internal planning)\n\n**Available Materials:**\n\n- Existing pitch deck or docs?\n- Market sizing data?\n- Financial model?\n- Competitive analysis?\n\n### Step 2: Activate Relevant Skills\n\nReference skills for comprehensive analysis:\n\n- **market-sizing-analysis** - TAM/SAM/SOM calculations\n- **startup-financial-modeling** - Financial projections\n- **competitive-landscape** - Competitive analysis frameworks\n- **team-composition-analysis** - Organization planning\n- **startup-metrics-framework** - Key metrics and benchmarks\n\n### Step 3: Structure the Business Case\n\nCreate a comprehensive document with these sections:\n\n---\n\n## Business Case Document Structure\n\n### Section 1: Executive Summary (1-2 pages)\n\n**Company Overview:**\n\n- One-sentence description\n- Founded, location, stage\n- Team highlights\n\n**Problem Statement:**\n\n- Core problem being solved (2-3 sentences)\n- Market pain quantified\n\n**Solution:**\n\n- How the product solves it (2-3 sentences)\n- Key differentiation\n\n**Market Opportunity:**\n\n- TAM: $X.XB\n- SAM: $X.XM\n- SOM (Year 5): $X.XM\n\n**Traction:**\n\n- Current metrics (MRR, customers, growth rate)\n- Key milestones achieved\n\n**Financial Snapshot:**\n\n```\n| Metric | Current | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 |\n|--------|---------|--------|--------|--------|\n| ARR | $X | $Y | $Z | $W |\n| Customers | X | Y | Z | W |\n| Team Size | X | Y | Z | W |\n```\n\n**Funding Ask:**\n\n- Amount seeking\n- Use of proceeds (top 3-4)\n- Expected milestones\n\n### Section 2: Problem & Market Opportunity (2-3 pages)\n\n**The Problem:**\n\n- Detailed problem description\n- Who experiences this problem\n- Current solutions and their limitations\n- Cost of the problem (quantified)\n\n**Market Landscape:**\n\n- Industry overview\n- Key trends driving opportunity\n- Market growth rate and drivers\n\n**Market Sizing:**\n\n- TAM calculation and methodology\n- SAM with filters applied\n- SOM with assumptions\n- Validation and data sources\n- Comparison to public companies\n\n**Target Customer Profile:**\n\n- Primary segments\n- Customer characteristics\n- Decision-makers and buying process\n\n### Section 3: Solution & Product (2-3 pages)\n\n**Product Overview:**\n\n- What it does (features and capabilities)\n- How it works (architecture/approach)\n- Key differentiators\n- Technology advantages\n\n**Value Proposition:**\n\n- Benefits by customer segment\n- ROI or value delivered\n- Time to value\n\n**Product Roadmap:**\n\n- Current state\n- Near-term (6 months)\n- Medium-term (12-18 months)\n- Vision (2-3 years)\n\n**Intellectual Property:**\n\n- Patents (filed, pending)\n- Proprietary technology\n- Data advantages\n- Defensibility\n\n### Section 4: Competitive Analysis (2 pages)\n\n**Competitive Landscape:**\n\n- Direct competitors\n- Indirect competitors (alternatives)\n- Adjacent players (potential entrants)\n\n**Competitive Matrix:**\n\n```\n| Feature/Factor | Us | Comp A | Comp B | Comp C |\n|----------------|----|---------| -------|--------|\n| Feature 1 | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✓ |\n| Feature 2 | ✓ | ✗ | ✓ | ✗ |\n| Pricing | $X | $Y | $Z | $W |\n```\n\n**Differentiation:**\n\n- 3-5 key differentiators\n- Why these matter to customers\n- Defensibility of advantages\n\n**Competitive Positioning:**\n\n- Positioning map (2-3 dimensions)\n- Market positioning statement\n\n**Barriers to Entry:**\n\n- What protects against competition\n- Network effects, switching costs, etc.\n\n### Section 5: Business Model & Go-to-Market (2 pages)\n\n**Business Model:**\n\n- Revenue model (subscriptions, transactions, etc.)\n- Pricing strategy and tiers\n- Customer acquisition approach\n- Expansion revenue strategy\n\n**Go-to-Market Strategy:**\n\n- Customer acquisition channels\n- Sales model (self-serve, sales-led, hybrid)\n- Customer acquisition cost (CAC)\n- Sales cycle and conversion rates\n\n**Marketing Strategy:**\n\n- Positioning and messaging\n- Channel strategy\n- Content and demand generation\n- Partnerships and integrations\n\n**Customer Success:**\n\n- Onboarding approach\n- Support model\n- Retention strategy\n- Net dollar retention target\n\n### Section 6: Financial Projections (2-3 pages)\n\n**Revenue Model:**\n\n- Cohort-based projections\n- Key assumptions\n- Revenue breakdown by segment\n\n**3-Year Financial Summary:**\n\n```\n| Metric | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Revenue | $X.XM | $Y.YM | $Z.ZM |\n| Gross Margin | XX% | XX% | XX% |\n| Operating Expenses | $X.XM | $Y.YM | $Z.ZM |\n| Net Income | ($X.XM) | ($Y.YM) | $Z.ZM |\n| EBITDA Margin | (XX%) | (XX%) | XX% |\n```\n\n**Unit Economics:**\n\n- CAC: $X,XXX\n- LTV: $X,XXX\n- LTV:CAC ratio: X.X\n- CAC Payback: XX months\n- Gross margin: XX%\n\n**Key Metrics Trajectory:**\n\n```\n| Metric | Current | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 |\n|--------|---------|--------|--------|--------|\n| MRR/ARR | $X | $Y | $Z | $W |\n| Customers | X | Y | Z | W |\n| Net Dollar Retention | XX% | XX% | XX% | XX% |\n| Burn Multiple | X.X | X.X | X.X | X.X |\n```\n\n**Scenario Analysis:**\n\n- Conservative, base, optimistic\n- Key drivers and sensitivities\n\n**Path to Profitability:**\n\n- Break-even timeline\n- Key milestones\n- Unit economics at scale\n\n### Section 7: Team & Organization (1-2 pages)\n\n**Leadership Team:**\nFor each founder/executive:\n\n- Name, title, photo (if available)\n- Relevant background (2-3 sentences)\n- Key accomplishments\n- Why they''re uniquely qualified\n\n**Current Team:**\n\n- Headcount by department\n- Key hires and their backgrounds\n- Advisory board\n\n**Hiring Plan:**\n\n- Year 1-3 headcount growth\n- Key roles to fill\n- Recruiting strategy\n\n**Organization Evolution:**\n\n```\nCurrent (5 people) → Year 1 (15) → Year 2 (35) → Year 3 (60)\nEngineering: 3 → 7 → 15 → 25\nSales & Marketing: 1 → 4 → 12 → 20\nOther: 1 → 4 → 8 → 15\n```\n\n**Equity & Compensation:**\n\n- Option pool sizing\n- Compensation philosophy\n- Retention strategy\n\n### Section 8: Traction & Milestones (1 page)\n\n**Current Traction:**\n\n- Revenue or user metrics\n- Growth rate\n- Key customer wins\n- Product development progress\n\n**Milestones Achieved:**\n\n- Product launches\n- Funding rounds\n- Team hires\n- Customer acquisition\n- Partnerships\n\n**Upcoming Milestones (12-18 months):**\n\n- Product milestones\n- Revenue targets\n- Customer goals\n- Team goals\n- Partnership goals\n\n### Section 9: Risks & Mitigation (1 page)\n\n**Market Risks:**\n\n- Market size assumptions\n- Competitive intensity\n- Substitute adoption\n- Mitigation strategies\n\n**Execution Risks:**\n\n- Product development\n- Go-to-market effectiveness\n- Hiring and retention\n- Mitigation strategies\n\n**Financial Risks:**\n\n- Burn rate management\n- Fundraising market\n- Unit economics\n- Mitigation strategies\n\n**Regulatory/External Risks:**\n\n- Compliance requirements\n- Data privacy\n- Economic conditions\n- Mitigation strategies\n\n### Section 10: Funding Request & Use of Proceeds (1 page)\n\n**Funding Ask:**\n\n- Amount seeking: $X.XM\n- Structure: Equity, SAFE, convertible note\n- Target valuation: $X.XM (if applicable)\n\n**Use of Proceeds:**\n\n```\nTotal Raise: $5.0M\n- Product Development: $2.0M (40%)\n  • Engineering team expansion\n  • Infrastructure and tools\n  • Product roadmap execution\n\n- Sales & Marketing: $2.0M (40%)\n  • Sales team hiring (5 AEs)\n  • Marketing programs\n  • Demand generation\n\n- Operations & G&A: $0.5M (10%)\n  • Finance/legal/HR\n  • Office and facilities\n\n- Working Capital: $0.5M (10%)\n  • 6-month buffer\n```\n\n**Milestones to Achieve:**\n\n- Revenue: $X.XM ARR (X% growth)\n- Customer: XXX customers\n- Product: Key features launched\n- Team: XX employees\n- Metric: Key metric targets\n\n**Expected Timeline:**\n\n- 18-24 month runway\n- Achieve milestones in 15-18 months\n- 6-month buffer for next raise\n\n**Next Round:**\n\n- Series A in 18-24 months\n- Expected metrics at that time\n- Target raise amount\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Enhance with Visuals\n\nSuggest including:\n\n- Charts for market sizing (TAM funnel)\n- Product screenshots or mockups\n- Positioning maps\n- Financial trend charts (revenue, customers, burn)\n- Organization chart\n- Timeline/roadmap\n- Use of proceeds pie chart\n\n### Step 5: Provide Additional Sections (Optional)\n\n**If Relevant, Add:**\n\n- Regulatory/Compliance section (for regulated industries)\n- Technology Architecture (for deep tech)\n- Clinical/Scientific Data (for biotech/health tech)\n- Unit Economics Deep Dive (for complex business models)\n- Strategic Partnerships (if material to strategy)\n\n### Step 6: Create Executive Summary Slide\n\nProvide one-page summary for quick review:\n\n- Problem & Solution (3 bullets each)\n- Market: TAM/SAM/SOM\n- Traction: Key metrics\n- Team: Founders\n- Ask: Amount and use\n- Contact information\n\n### Step 7: Save Business Case\n\nOffer to save as markdown:\n\n- Filename: `business-case-[company-name]-YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- Suggest converting to PDF for sharing\n- Provide tips for presentation format\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Do:**\n\n- Lead with customer problem\n- Quantify everything\n- Show, don''t just tell (use data)\n- Be realistic on projections\n- Acknowledge risks honestly\n- Cite all data sources\n- Keep executive summary concise\n- Focus on differentiation\n\n**Don''t:**\n\n- Use jargon without explanation\n- Make unsupported claims\n- Ignore competition\n- Be overly optimistic\n- Skip the \"why now\"\n- Forget to proofread\n- Use generic templates without customization\n\n## Integration with Other Commands\n\nThis command synthesizes outputs from:\n\n- `/market-opportunity` - Include TAM/SAM/SOM analysis\n- `/financial-projections` - Include full financial model\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```\nUser: /business-case\n\nClaude: I''ll create a comprehensive business case document. Let me gather the key information first.\n\nCompany name and description?\n→ \"AcmeCorp - AI-powered email marketing for e-commerce\"\n\nWho is the audience?\n→ \"Series A investors\"\n\nWhat materials do you have?\n→ \"We have market sizing and financial model done\"\n\n[Claude creates comprehensive 15-20 page business case with all sections]\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Business case creation takes 1-2 hours\n- Result is investor-grade document\n- Can be used for pitch deck development\n- Update quarterly or for funding rounds\n- Customize sections based on audience\n- Keep executive summary to 2 pages max\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:18:21.540Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Business Analysis Agents needing comprehensive startup business case generation with market sizing and financial modeling capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要全面启动业务案例生成、市场规模和财务建模能力的商业分析代理。","ja":"ビジネス分析エージェントが包括的なスタートアップビジネスケース生成や市場規模、財務モデリング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 비즈니스 케이스 생성 및 시장 규모, 재무 모델링 기능이 필요한 비즈니스 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Negocios que necesitan una generación de casos de negocio de startup integral con capacidades de tamaño de mercado y modelado financiero.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse commerciale ayant besoin d''une génération complète de cas d''affaires de startup avec des capacités de taille de marché et de modélisation financière.","de":"Perfekt für Geschäftsanalyse-Agenten, die eine umfassende Erstellung von Startup-Geschäftsfallen mit Marktgrößen- und Finanzmodellierungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Negócios que precisam de geração de casos de negócios abrangentes de startup com capacidades de dimensionamento de mercado e modelagem financeira.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-анализа, которым необходима комплексная генерация деловых случаев стартапов с возможностями определения размера рынка и финансового моделирования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الأعمال التي تحتاج إلى توليد حالات أعمال شاملة لبدء التشغيل مع القدرات المتعلقة بحجم السوق والنمذجة المالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate investor-ready business case documents covering market sizing, financial modeling, team planning, and strategic research using OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage, with support for semantic conventions for AI telemetry.","zh":"赋予代理人生成投资者准备就绪的业务案例文档的能力，涵盖市场规模、财务建模、团队规划和战略研究，使用OTLP摄取和DuckDB存储，并支持AI遥测的语义约定。","ja":"OTLPの取り込みとDuckDBストレージを使用して、市場規模、財務モデリング、チームプランニング、戦略研究をカバーする投資家向けのビジネスケース文書を生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、AIテレメトリのセマンティック規約もサポートします。","ko":"OTLP 수집 및 DuckDB 저장소를 사용하여 시장 규모, 재무 모델링, 팀 계획 및 전략 연구를 포함한 투자자용 비즈니스 케이스 문서를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, AI 원격 분석을 위한 세マン틱 규약도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de caso de negocio listos para inversores que cubren el tamaño de mercado, la modelización financiera, la planificación del equipo y la investigación estratégica utilizando la ingesta de OTLP y el almacenamiento de DuckDB, con soporte para convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents de cas d''affaires prêts pour les investisseurs couvrant la taille de marché, la modélisation financière, la planification d''équipe et la recherche stratégique en utilisant l''ingestion OTLP et le stockage DuckDB, avec prise en charge des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie IA.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, investorreife Geschäftsfall-Dokumente zu erstellen, die Marktgröße, Finanzmodellierung, Teamplanung und strategische Forschung unter Verwendung von OTLP-Eingabe und DuckDB-Speicherung abdecken, mit Unterstützung für semantische Konventionen für KI-Telemetrie.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos de caso de negócios prontos para investidores que abordam o dimensionamento do mercado, modelagem financeira, planejamento de equipes e pesquisa estratégica usando ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB, com suporte a convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать документы деловых случаев, готовые для инвесторов, охватывающие определение размера рынка, финансовое моделирование, планирование команды и стратегические исследования с использованием ингестии OTLP и хранилища DuckDB, с поддержкой семантических конвенций для телеметрии ИИ.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد مستندات الحالات التجارية الجاهزة للمستثمرين التي تغطي حجم السوق والنمذجة المالية وتخطيط الفريق والبحث الاستراتيجي باستخدام过程 استهلاك OTLP وتخزين DuckDB ، مع دعم الاتفاقيات المعمارية للتелеметрія الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating comprehensive business case documents for startup funding","Analyzing market size and growth potential using TAM/SAM/SOM metrics","Creating detailed financial models and team planning strategies"],"zh":["为启动资金生成全面业务案例文档","使用TAM/SAM/SOM指标分析市场规模和增长潜力","创建详细的财务模型和团队规划策略"],"ja":["スタートアップの資金調達のための包括的なビジネスケース文書を生成する","TAM/SAM/SOMメトリクスを使用して市場規模と成長潜在力を分析する","詳細な財務モデルとチームプランニング戦略を作成する"],"ko":["启动 자금을 위한 포괄적인 비즈니스 케이스 문서 생성","TAM/SAM/SOM 메트릭스를 사용하여 시장 규모 및 성장 잠재력을 분석","세부적인 재무 모델 및 팀 계획 전략 생성"],"es":["Generación de documentos de caso de negocio integral para financiación de startup","Análisis del tamaño y potencial de crecimiento del mercado utilizando métricas TAM/SAM/SOM","Creación de modelos financieros detallados y estrategias de planificación de equipo"],"fr":["Génération de documents de cas d''affaires complets pour le financement de startup","Analyse de la taille et du potentiel de croissance du marché à l''aide de métriques TAM/SAM/SOM","Création de modèles financiers détaillés et de stratégies de planification d''équipe"],"de":["Erstellung umfassender Geschäftsfall-Dokumente für Startup-Finanzierung","Analyse der Marktgröße und Wachstumspotenzials unter Verwendung von TAM/SAM/SOM-Metriken","Erstellung detaillierter Finanzmodelle und Teamplanungsstrategien"],"pt":["Gerar documentos de caso de negócios abrangentes para financiamento de startup","Analisar o tamanho do mercado e o potencial de crescimento usando métricas TAM/SAM/SOM","Criar modelos financeiros detalhados e estratégias de planejamento de equipes"],"ru":["Генерировать комплексные документы деловых случаев для финансирования стартапов","Анализировать размер рынка и потенциал роста с использованием метрик TAM/SAM/SOM","Создавать подробные финансовые модели и стратегии планирования команд"],"ar":["توليد مستندات حالات أعمال شاملة لتمويل بدء التشغيل","تحليل حجم السوق وانتشار النمو باستخدام مقاييس TAM/SAM/SOM","إنشاء نماذج مالية مفصلة واستراتيجيات تخطيط الفريق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to business data and market research","Limited to startup business analysis and planning"],"zh":["需要访问业务数据和市场研究","仅限启动业务分析和规划"],"ja":["ビジネスデータと市場リサーチへのアクセスが必要","スタートアップのビジネス分析と計画に限定される"],"ko":["비즈니스 데이터 및 시장 연구에 대한 액세스가 필요","启动 비즈니스 분석 및 계획에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos comerciales y investigación de mercado","Limitado al análisis y planificación de negocios de startup"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des données commerciales et à des recherches de marché","Limité à l''analyse et à la planification commerciale de startup"],"de":["Erfordert Zugang zu Geschäftdaten und Marktforschung","Begrenzt auf die Analyse und Planung von Startup-Geschäften"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de negócios e pesquisa de mercado","Limitado à análise e planejamento de negócios de startup"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным бизнеса и рыночным исследованиям","Ограничен анализом и планированием бизнеса стартапов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات الأعمال والبحث السوقي","محدود بالتحليل والتخطيط للأعمال لبدء التشغيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills/workspace-init', 'community', 'WILLOSCAR', 'research-units-pipeline-skills', 'WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills', 'workspace-init', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z', '2026-02-18T08:18:52.129Z', NULL, '{"id":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills/workspace-init","name":"workspace-init","description":{"zh":"Workspace Init 技术用于创建结构化的工作空间，包括输入输出定义、检查点和决策跟踪。它提供了一个标准化的模板","ja":"Workspace Init 技術は構造化されたワークスペースを作成し、入出力定義、チェックポイント、意思決定を追跡。標準化されたテンプレートを提供","ko":"Workspace Init 기술은 구조화된 작업 공간을 생성하고 입력 출력 정의, 체크포인트, 의사 결정 추적을 제공하며 표준화된 템플릿을 제공","es":"El skill ''workspace-init'' crea un espacio de trabajo con un modelo estándar y genera artefactos como STATUS.md y CHECKPOINTS.md","fr":"Le skill ''workspace-init'' crée un espace de travail avec un modèle standard et génère des artefactes tels que STATUS.md et CHECKPOINTS.md","de":"Das Skill ''workspace-init'' erstellt einen Arbeitsbereich mit einem Standardmodell und generiert Artefakte wie STATUS.md und CHECKPOINTS.md","pt":"O skill workspace-init cria um workspace padrão com artefatos estruturados, incluindo STATUS.md, CHECKPOINTS.md e UNITS.csv.","ru":"Навык workspace-init создает стандартное рабочее пространство со структурированными артефактами, включая STATUS.md, CHECKPOINTS.md и UNITS.csv.","ar":"مهارة workspace-init تنشئ مساحة عمل قياسية مع محتوى منظم، بما في ذلك STATUS.md و CHECKPOINTS.md و UNITS.csv","en":"Research pipelines as semantic execution units: each skill declares inputs/outputs, acceptance criteria, and guardrails. Evidence-first methodology prevents hollow writing through structured intermediate artifacts."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"初始化工作空间 - Workspace Init 技术","ja":"ワークスペース初期化 - Workspace Init 技術","ko":"작업 공간 초기화 - Workspace Init 기술","es":"Inicialización de Espacio de Trabajo","fr":"Initialisation