証拠文書の作成","執筆プロセスの最適化","無意味なコンテンツの削減","執筆の効率の向上","複数のドキュメント形式のサポート"],"ko":["구조화된 중간 증거 문서의 생성","글쓰기 프로세스의 최적화","무의미한 콘텐츠의 감소","글쓰기 효율의 향상","다중 문서 형식의 지원"],"es":["Mejora la calidad de la escritura","Crea artefactos intermedios estructurados","Optimiza las pipelines de investigación","Proporciona una lista de tareas acciónables","Identifica subsections con poca evidencia"],"fr":["Améliore la qualité de l''écriture","Crée des artefacts intermédiaires structurés","Optimise les pipelines de recherche","Fournit une liste de tâches actionables","Identifie les sous-sections avec peu de preuves"],"de":["Verbessert die Qualität des Schreibens","Erstellt strukturierte Zwischenartefakte","Optimiert die Forschungspipelines","Bietet eine Liste von handlungsfähigen Aufgaben","Identifiziert Unterkapitel mit wenig Beweisen"],"pt":["Otimização de pipelines de pesquisa","Criação de lista de tarefas para resolver problemas","Melhoria da qualidade da escrita","Prevenção de prosa vazia","Análise de mapeamento e extração de evidências"],"ru":["Оптимизация исследовательских трубопроводов","Создание списка задач для решения проблем","Улучшение качества письма","Предотвращение пустой прозы","Анализ отображения и извлечения доказательств"],"ar":["تحسين أنابيب البحث","إنشاء قائمة المهام لحل المشاكل","تحسين جودة الكتابة","منع الكتابة المملة","تحليل الخريطة واستخراج الأدلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["证据自循环","写作质量","中间证据文档","结构化文档","写作效率","内容生成","开发人员工具"],"ja":["エビデンスセルフループ","執筆品質","中間証拠文書","構造化ドキュメント","執筆の効率","コンテンツ生成","開発者ツール"],"ko":["증거 자기 루프","글쓰기 품질","중간 증거 문서","구조화된 문서","글쓰기 효율","콘텐츠 생성","개발자 도구"],"es":["evidence self-loop","pipelines de investigación","artefactos intermedios","escritura de calidad","optimización de pipelines","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["evidence self-loop","pipelines de recherche","artefacts intermédiaires","écriture de qualité","optimisation de pipelines","développement de logiciels"],"de":["evidence self-loop","Forschungspipelines","Zwischenartefakte","Schreiben von Qualität","Optimierung von Pipelines","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Evidence Self-loop","Otimização de pipelines de pesquisa","Melhoria da qualidade da escrita","Prevenção de prosa vazia","Análise de mapeamento","Extração de evidências","Desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["Evidence Self-loop","Оптимизация исследовательских трубопроводов","Улучшение качества письма","Предотвращение пустой прозы","Анализ отображения","Извлечение доказательств","Развитие навыков"],"ar":["Evidence Self-loop","تحسين أنابيب البحث","تحسين جودة الكتابة","منع الكتابة المملة","تحليل الخريطة","استخراج الأدلة","تنمية المهارات"]}},"owner":"WILLOSCAR","repo":"research-units-pipeline-skills","repoPath":"WILLOSCAR/research-units-pipeline-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.465Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"evidence-selfloop","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Evidence Self-loop (C3/C4 fix → rebind → redraft)\n\nPurpose: make the evidence-first pipeline converge **without writing filler prose**.\n\nThis skill reads the *intermediate evidence artifacts* (briefs/bindings/packs) and produces an actionable TODO list that answers:\n\n- Which subsections are under-supported?\n- Is the problem mapping/coverage (C2) or evidence extraction (C3) or binding/planning (C4)?\n- Which skill(s) should be rerun, in what order, to unblock high-quality writing?\n\n## Inputs\n\n-","body":"# Evidence Self-loop (C3/C4 fix → rebind → redraft)\n\nPurpose: make the evidence-first pipeline converge **without writing filler prose**.\n\nThis skill reads the *intermediate evidence artifacts* (briefs/bindings/packs) and produces an actionable TODO list that answers:\n\n- Which subsections are under-supported?\n- Is the problem mapping/coverage (C2) or evidence extraction (C3) or binding/planning (C4)?\n- Which skill(s) should be rerun, in what order, to unblock high-quality writing?\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `outline/subsection_briefs.jsonl`\n- `outline/evidence_bindings.jsonl` (expects `binding_gaps` / `binding_rationale` if available)\n- `outline/evidence_drafts.jsonl` (expects `blocking_missing`, comparisons, eval protocol, limitations)\n- Optional (improves routing):\n  - `outline/evidence_binding_report.md`\n  - `outline/anchor_sheet.jsonl`\n  - `papers/paper_notes.jsonl`\n  - `papers/fulltext_index.jsonl`\n  - `queries.md`\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `output/EVIDENCE_SELFLOOP_TODO.md` (report-class; always written)\n\n## Self-loop contract (what “fixing evidence” means)\n\n- Prefer fixing **upstream evidence**, not writing around gaps.\n- If an evidence pack has `blocking_missing`, treat it as a STOP signal: strengthen notes/fulltext/mapping, then regenerate packs.\n- If bindings show `binding_gaps`, treat it as a ROUTING signal: either enrich the evidence bank for the mapped papers, expand mapping coverage, or adjust `required_evidence_fields` if unrealistic.\n\nRecommended rerun chain (minimal):\n\n- If C3 evidence is thin: `pdf-text-extractor` → `paper-notes` → `evidence-binder` → `evidence-draft` → `anchor-sheet` → `writer-context-pack`\n- If C2 coverage is weak: `section-mapper` → `outline-refiner` → (then rerun C3/C4 evidence skills)\n\n## Workflow (analysis-only)\n\n1) Read `queries.md` (if present)\n- Use it only as a soft config hint (evidence_mode / draft_profile); do not override the artifact contract.\n\n2) Read `outline/subsection_briefs.jsonl`\n- For each `sub_id`, capture `axes` + `required_evidence_fields` (what evidence types this subsection expects).\n\n3) Read `outline/evidence_bindings.jsonl`\n- For each `sub_id`, surface `binding_rationale` and `binding_gaps` (what the binder could/could not cover from the evidence bank).\n\n4) (Optional) Read `outline/evidence_binding_report.md`\n- Use it as a human-readable summary; treat it as a view of `outline/evidence_bindings.jsonl`, not a separate truth source.\n\n5) Read `outline/evidence_drafts.jsonl`\n- Surface `blocking_missing` (STOP signals), and check for missing comparisons / eval protocol / limitations that would force hollow writing.\n\n6) (Optional) Read `outline/anchor_sheet.jsonl`\n- Check whether each subsection has at least a few citation-backed anchors (numbers / evaluation / limitations).\n\n7) (Optional) Read `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` and `papers/fulltext_index.jsonl`\n- Use these to route fixes: if evidence is abstract-only and missing eval tokens, prefer enriching notes/fulltext before drafting prose.\n\n## What the report contains\n\n- Summary counts: subsections with `blocking_missing`, with `binding_gaps`, and common failure reasons.\n- Per-subsection TODO: the smallest upstream fix path (skills + artifacts) to make the subsection writeable.\n\n## Status semantics (unblock rules)\n\nThis skill is the *prewrite router* for evidence quality. Treat its `Status:` line as the unblock contract:\n\n- `PASS`: no `blocking_missing` and no `binding_gaps` -> proceed to C5 writing (but still scan non-blocking writability smells: low comparisons/eval/anchors often predict hollow prose).\n- `OK`: no `blocking_missing`, but some `binding_gaps` -> you may draft, but expect weaker specificity; prefer fixing gaps first.\n- `FAIL`: missing inputs OR any `blocking_missing` -> do not write filler prose; fix upstream and rerun C3/C4.\n\n## Routing matrix (symptom -> root cause -> upstream fix)\n\nUse this as a *semantic routing table* (not a script checklist). The goal is to fix the earliest broken intermediate artifact.\n\n| Symptom (where you see it) | Likely root cause | Inspect first | Smallest upstream fix chain |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `evidence_drafts.blocking_missing: no usable citation keys` | mapped papers lack `bibkey` / bibkeys not in `citations/ref.bib` | `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` (bibkey fields), `citations/ref.bib` | C3 `paper-notes` (ensure bibkeys) -> C4 `citation-verifier` -> rerun `evidence-binder` -> rerun `evidence-draft` |\n| `blocking_missing: title-only evidence` | retrieval/metadata lacks abstracts (or aggressive filtering) | `papers/papers_raw.jsonl` abstracts, `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` evidence_level | C1 `literature-engineer` (enrich metadata) OR C3 `pdf-text-extractor` (fulltext) -> rerun `paper-notes` |\n| `blocking_missing: no evidence snippets extractable` | notes are too thin / evidence bank empty for mapped papers | `papers/evidence_bank.jsonl` (counts), `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` | C3 `paper-notes` (richer extraction; prefer fulltext when possible) -> rerun C4 packs |\n| `blocking_missing: no concrete evaluation tokens` | notes/bank did not extract benchmarks/metrics/budgets | `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` (metrics/benchmarks fields), `outline/anchor_sheet.jsonl` | C3 `paper-notes` (extract eval anchors) -> rerun `anchor-sheet` + `evidence-draft` |\n| `evidence pack comparisons` are sparse (signals: comparisons low) | clusters are not contrastable OR mapping coverage too weak | `outline/subsection_briefs.jsonl` (clusters), `outline/mapping.tsv` | C2 `section-mapper` (coverage) OR C3 `subsection-briefs` (better clusters) -> rerun `evidence-draft` |\n| `bindings.binding_gaps` mentions benchmarks/metrics/protocol | binder cannot find evaluation-tagged evidence for this subsection | `outline/evidence_binding_report.md` (tag mix), `papers/evidence_bank.jsonl` tags | C3 `paper-notes` (tag/evidence extraction) OR C2 expand mapping for that subsection -> rerun `evidence-binder` |\n| `binding_gaps` mentions security/threat model/attacks | mapped set lacks security-focused works or notes lack threat-model detail | `outline/mapping.tsv`, `papers/paper_notes.jsonl` | C2 expand mapping (+ C1 queries if needed) OR C3 enrich notes -> rerun binder/packs |\n| `binding report` looks mechanically uniform across H3 (same mix, low tag variance) | binder selection too recipe-like OR evidence bank tags too coarse | `outline/evidence_binding_report.md` (tag mix), evidence bank tags | tighten `required_evidence_fields` + improve evidence bank tags, then rerun binder; avoid writing around non-specific bindings |\n\n## Interface with the writer self-loop (avoid writing around evidence)\n\n- If `writer-selfloop` is FAIL due to missing anchors/comparisons and the corresponding writer pack has `pack_warnings`, **stop** and run this evidence self-loop: the section is telling you the pack is not writeable.\n- Prefer fixing evidence gaps once, upstream, rather than patching every H3 with generic filler.\n\n## What this skill does NOT do\n\n- It does not edit `papers/*`, `outline/*`, or `sections/*`.\n- It does not invent new facts/citations.\n- It does not \"relax\" quality by changing thresholds; it routes you to the earliest artifact to fix.\n\n## Script\n\n### Quick Start\n\n- `python .codex/skills/evidence-selfloop/scripts/run.py --workspace workspaces/<ws>`\n\n### All Options\n\n- `--workspace <dir>`\n- `--unit-id <U###>` (optional)\n- `--inputs <semicolon-separated>` (optional override)\n- `--outputs <semicolon-separated>` (optional override; default writes `output/EVIDENCE_SELFLOOP_TODO.md`)\n- `--checkpoint <C#>` (optional)\n\n### Examples\n\n- Generate an evidence TODO list after C4 packs are generated:\n  - `python .codex/skills/evidence-selfloop/scripts/run.py --workspace workspaces/<ws>`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:18:57.962Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing structured evidence-based writing pipelines","zh":"非常适合需要结构化的基于证据的写作流程的研究代理","ja":"構造化されたエビデンスベースのライティングパイプラインを必要とするリサーチエージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 증거 기반 작성 파이프라인이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 완벽한","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan canalizaciones de escritura basadas en evidencia estructurada","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin de canalisations d''écriture basées sur des preuves structurées","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die strukturierte, evidenzbasierte Schreibpipelines benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de pipelines de escrita baseados em evidências estruturadas","ru":"Идеально для исследовательских агентов, которым требуются структурированные доказательные письменные конвейеры","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى خطوط أنابيب كتابة مبنية على أدلة منظمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prevent hollow writing through evidence-first methodology, utilizing intermediate artifacts like briefs, bindings, and packs to converge on high-quality content without filler prose, leveraging semantic execution units and guardrails","zh":"赋予代理人通过证据优先方法防止空泛写作的能力，利用中间制品如简报、绑定和包来收敛高质量内容，而不使用填充散文，利用语义执行单元和防护栏","ja":"エージェントに空の文章を防ぐためのエビデンスファーストの方法論を使用し、中間アーティファクトとしてのブリーフ、バインディング、パックを使用して、フィラーの散文を使用せずに、高品質のコンテンツに収束し、セマンティック実行ユニットとガードレールを利用する能力を付与する","ko":"에이전트에게 증거 우선 방법론을 사용하여 빈약한 글쓰기를 방지하는 능력을 부여하며, 중간 산출물인 브리핑, 바인딩 및 패키지를 사용하여 필러 문장을 사용하지 않고 고품질 콘텐츠에 수렴하며, 의미 실행 단위 및 가드레일을 활용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a prevenir la escritura hueca a través de una metodología basada en la evidencia, utilizando artefactos intermedios como informes, enlaces y paquetes para converger en contenido de alta calidad sin prosa rellena, aprovechando unidades de ejecución semántica y barandillas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''éviter l''écriture creuse grâce à une méthodologie basée sur les preuves, en utilisant des artefacts intermédiaires tels que des rapports, des liens et des paquets pour converger vers un contenu de haute qualité sans prose superflue, en exploitant les unités d''exécution sémantique et les garde-fous","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hohle Schreibweisen durch eine evidenzbasierte Methodik zu vermeiden, indem sie Zwischenartefakte wie Berichte, Bindungen und Pakete nutzen, um auf hochwertigen Inhalt ohne Fülltext zuzukommen, indem sie semantische Ausführungseinheiten und Schutzgeländer nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a prevenir a escrita oca por meio de uma metodologia baseada em evidências, utilizando artefatos intermediários como breves, ligações e pacotes para convergir para conteúdo de alta qualidade sem prosa de enchimento, aproveitando unidades de execução semântica e guardrails","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предотвращать пустую писанину посредством методологии, основанной на доказательствах, используя промежуточные артефакты, такие как брифы, связи и пакеты, для сходимости на контент высокого качества без наполнителя, используя семантические единицы выполнения и ограждения","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من منع الكتابة الفارغة من خلال منهجية تستند إلى الأدلة، باستخدام مكونات وسيطة مثل المذكرات والربط والحصص للتقارب على المحتوى عالي الجودة بدون نص مملأ، واستخدام وحدات تنفيذ семантиية وحدود الحماية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating research pipeline optimization","Identifying under-supported subsections in evidence artifacts","Debugging problem mapping and evidence extraction workflows"],"zh":["自动化研究流程优化","识别证据制品中支持不充分的子部分","调试问题映射和证据提取工作流"],"ja":["リサーチパイプラインの最適化の自動化","エビデンスアーティファクトの中でサポートが不十分なサブセクションの特定","問題マッピングとエビデンス抽出ワークフローのデバッグ"],"ko":["연구 파이프라인 최적화 자동화","증거 아티팩트에서 지원이 불충분한 하위 섹션 식별","문제 매핑 및 증거 추출 워크플로우 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la optimización de la canalización de investigación","Identificación de subsecciones poco respaldadas en artefactos de evidencia","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de mapeo de problemas y extracción de evidencia"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''optimisation de la canalisation de recherche","Identification de sous-sections peu soutenues dans les artefacts de preuve","Débogage des flux de travail de mapping de problèmes et d''extraction de preuves"],"de":["Automatisierung der Optimierung der Forschungspipeline","Identifizierung von wenig unterstützten Unterkapiteln in Evidenz-Artefakten","Fehlerbehebung bei Arbeitsabläufen zur Problemmapping und Evidenzextraktion"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização do pipeline de pesquisa","Identificar subseções subapoiadas em artefatos de evidências","Depurar fluxos de trabalho de mapeamento de problemas e extração de evidências"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию исследовательского конвейера","Определить подсекции с недостаточной поддержкой в артефактах доказательств","Отладить рабочие процессы картирования проблем и извлечения доказательств"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحسين خط أنابيب البحث","تحديد الفقرات الفرعية غير المدعومة في مكونات الأدلة","تصحيح أخطاء في سير عمل رسم الخرائط ومعالجة الأدلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires declared inputs and outputs for skills","Needs acceptance criteria and guardrails for semantic execution units"],"zh":["需要声明输入和输出技能","需要语义执行单元的接受标准和防护栏"],"ja":["スキルの宣言された入力と出力が必要","セマンティック実行ユニットの受け入れ基準とガードレールが必要"],"ko":["기술의 선언된 입력 및 출력이 필요","의미 실행 단위의 수용 기준 및 가드레일이 필요"],"es":["Requiere entradas y salidas declaradas para las habilidades","Necesita criterios de aceptación y barandillas para las unidades de ejecución semántica"],"fr":["Nécessite des entrées et des sorties déclarées pour les compétences","A besoin de critères d''acceptation et de garde-fous pour les unités d''exécution sémantique"],"de":["Benötigt deklarierte Eingaben und Ausgaben für Fähigkeiten","Benötigt Akzeptanzkriterien und Schutzgeländer für semantische Ausführungseinheiten"],"pt":["Requer entradas e saídas declaradas para habilidades","Necessita de critérios de aceitação e guardrails para unidades de execução semântica"],"ru":["Требует объявленных входов и выходов для навыков","Требует критериев приемки и ограждений для семантических единиц выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخالات ومخرجات معلنة للكفاءات","يحتاج إلى معايير قبول وحدود حماية للوحدات التنفيذية الدلالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
