ionnelles","Amélioration de la sécurité et des performances","Flexibilité et personnalisation","Compatibilité avec différentes technologies et frameworks"],"de":["Entwurf einer skalierbaren Backend-Architektur","Integration optionaler Funktionalitäten","Verbesserung der Sicherheit und Leistung","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Technologien und Frameworks"],"pt":["Separação de responsabilidades","Escalabilidade e flexibilidade","Melhoria da manutenção e atualização","Integração com serviços externos","Segurança e autenticação"],"ru":["Разделение обязанностей","Масштабируемость и гибкость","Улучшение обслуживания и обновления","Интеграция с внешними сервисами","Безопасность и аутентификация"],"ar":["فصل المسؤوليات","التوسعة والمرنة","تحسين الصيانة والتحديث","التكامل مع الخدمات الخارجية","الأمان والمصادقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计分层后端架构","后端系统设计","可扩展性","维护性","性能","安全性","编程语言","框架"],"ja":["レイヤードバックエンドアーキテクチャの設計","バックエンドシステムの設計","拡張性","保守性","パフォーマンス","セキュリティ","プログラミング言語","フレームワーク"],"ko":["계층화된 백엔드 아키텍처 디자인","백엔드 시스템 디자인","확장성","유지보수성","성능","보안성","프로그래밍 언어","프레임워크"],"es":["diseño de arquitectura de backend","arquitectura de backend en capas","desarrollo de software","escalabilidad","seguridad","rendimiento","flexibilidad","personalización"],"fr":["conception d''architecture backend","architecture backend en couches","développement de logiciels","évolutivité","sécurité","performances","flexibilité","personnalisation"],"de":["Entwurf von Backend-Architektur","schichtbasierte Backend-Architektur","Software-Entwicklung","Skalierbarkeit","Sicherheit","Leistung","Flexibilität","Anpassungsfähigkeit"],"pt":["arquitetura de backend","desenvolvimento de aplicações","escalabilidade","flexibilidade","segurança","autenticação","integração de serviços"],"ru":["архитектура бэкенда","разработка приложений","масштабируемость","гибкость","безопасность","аутентификация","интеграция сервисов"],"ar":["هندسة الخلفية","تطوير التطبيقات","التوسعة","المرنة","الأمان","المصادقة","تكامل الخدمات"]}},"owner":"willyu1007","repo":"Skill_Template_Addon","repoPath":"willyu1007/Skill_Template_Addon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-layered-backend-architecture","description":"Design or review a layered backend architecture (routes, controllers, services, repositories) for HTTP APIs and microservices.","bodyPreview":"# design-layered-backend-architecture (entry)\n\nCanonical source: `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/`\n\nOpen `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/SKILL.md` and any supporting files referenced there (for example `reference.md`, `examples.md`, `scripts/`, `templates/`).\n\n> **Note**: The frontmatter above is identical to the canonical source except for `ssot_path` and `category` which are added for navigation. After opening the source","body":"# design-layered-backend-architecture (entry)\n\nCanonical source: `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/`\n\nOpen `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/SKILL.md` and any supporting files referenced there (for example `reference.md`, `examples.md`, `scripts/`, `templates/`).\n\n> **Note**: The frontmatter above is identical to the canonical source except for `ssot_path` and `category` which are added for navigation. After opening the source file, skip re-reading the description to avoid redundant token usage.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:20:18.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Backend Agents needing to integrate optional add-on functionality with base skill templates for advanced architecture design.","zh":"非常适合后端代理需要将可选的附加功能与基本技能模板集成以用于高级架构设计的情形。","ja":"バックエンドエージェントがオプショナルなアドオン機能をベースのスキルテンプレートに統合して高度なアーキテクチャ設計を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"백엔드 에이전트가 기본 스킬 템플릿에 선택적 추가 기능을 통합하여 고급 아키텍처 디자인을 해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de backend que necesitan integrar funcionalidades adicionales opcionales con plantillas de habilidades base para el diseño de arquitecturas avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents backend qui ont besoin d''intégrer des fonctionnalités complémentaires optionnelles avec des modèles de compétences de base pour la conception d''architectures avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Backend-Agents, die optionalen Add-on-Funktionalitäten mit Basis-Skill-Vorlagen für das Design von fortschrittlicher Architektur integrieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Backend que precisam integrar funcionalidades adicionais opcionais com modelos de habilidades base para design de arquitetura avançada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Backend, которым необходимо интегрировать необязательные дополнительные функции с базовыми шаблонами навыков для продвинутого проектирования архитектуры.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الخلفية التي تحتاج إلى دمج الوظائف الإضافية الاختيارية مع قوالب المهارات الأساسية لتصميم الهندسة المعمارية المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design layered backend architectures by integrating optional add-ons with base versions, utilizing skills templating and referencing canonical sources like `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` for optimized backend development.","zh":"赋予代理设计分层后端架构的能力，通过将可选的附加功能与基本版本集成，利用技能模板和引用规范化的来源如 `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` 进行优化的后端开发。","ja":"エージェントが層構造のバックエンドアーキテクチャを設計できるようにし、オプショナルなアドオン機能をベースバージョンに統合し、スキルテンプレートを活用し、`.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` のような正規の情報源を参照して、最適化されたバックエンド開発を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 계층화된 백엔드 아키텍처를 설계할 수 있도록 해주며, 선택적 추가 기능을 기본 버전과 통합하고, 스킬 템플릿을 활용하며, `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/`와 같은 표준 정보원을 참조하여 최적화된 백엔드 개발을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar arquitecturas backend en capas integrando complementos opcionales con versiones base, utilizando plantillas de habilidades y haciendo referencia a fuentes canónicas como `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` para un desarrollo de backend optimizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des architectures backend en couches en intégrant des compléments optionnels avec des versions de base, en utilisant des modèles de compétences et en faisant référence à des sources canoniques comme `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` pour un développement de backend optimisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schichtbasierte Backend-Architekturen zu entwerfen, indem optionalen Add-ons mit Basisversionen integriert, Fähigkeitsvorlagen genutzt und kanonische Quellen wie `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` für optimierte Backend-Entwicklung referenziert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem arquiteturas de backend em camadas, integrando add-ons opcionais com versões base, utilizando habilidades de modelagem e referenciando fontes canônicas como `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` para desenvolvimento de backend otimizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать многослойные архитектуры Backend, интегрируя необязательные добавки с базовыми версиями, используя шаблоны навыков и ссылки на канонические источники, такие как `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/`, для оптимизации разработки Backend.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من تصميم هندسة خلفية متعددة الطبقات من خلال دمج الإضافات الاختيارية مع الإصدارات الأساسية، واستخدام قوالب المهارات والإشارة إلى المصادر القانونية مثل `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/` من أجل تطوير خلفية محسّن."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating add-on functionality with base skill templates","Designing modular backend architectures","Implementing layered architecture patterns for scalable development"],"zh":["将附加功能与基本技能模板集成","设计模块化的后端架构","实施分层架构模式以实现可扩展的开发"],"ja":["アドオン機能をベースのスキルテンプレートに統合する","モジュラーなバックエンドアーキテクチャを設計する","層構造のアーキテクチャパターンを実装してスケーラブルな開発を行う"],"ko":["추가 기능을 기본 스킬 템플릿에 통합하는 것","모듈화된 백엔드 아키텍처를 설계하는 것","계층화된 아키텍처 패턴을 구현하여 확장 가능한 개발을 하는 것"],"es":["Integrar funcionalidades adicionales con plantillas de habilidades base","Diseñar arquitecturas backend modulares","Implementar patrones de arquitectura en capas para un desarrollo escalable"],"fr":["Intégrer des fonctionnalités complémentaires avec des modèles de compétences de base","Concevoir des architectures backend modulaires","Mettre en œuvre des modèles d''architecture en couches pour un développement évolutif"],"de":["Optionalen Add-on-Funktionalitäten mit Basis-Skill-Vorlagen integrieren","Modulare Backend-Architekturen entwerfen","Schichtbasierte Architekturmuster für skalierbares Entwicklung implementieren"],"pt":["Integrar funcionalidades adicionais com modelos de habilidades base","Projetar arquiteturas de backend modulares","Implementar padrões de arquitetura em camadas para desenvolvimento escalável"],"ru":["Интегрировать дополнительные функции с базовыми шаблонами навыков","Проектировать модульные архитектуры Backend","Реализовывать многослойные шаблоны архитектуры для масштабируемого развития"],"ar":["دمج الوظائف الإضافية مع قوالب المهارات الأساسية","تصميم هندسة خلفية قابلة للتحديث","تطبيق أنماط الهندسة المعمارية المتعددة الطبقات من أجل التطوير القابل للتوسيع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to skill template repository","Dependent on compatibility with base skill versions"],"zh":["需要访问技能模板仓库","依赖于与基本技能版本的兼容性"],"ja":["スキルテンプレートリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","ベースのスキルバージョンとの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["스킬 템플릿 저장소에 액세스해야 함","기본 스킬 버전과의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de plantillas de habilidades","Depende de la compatibilidad con las versiones de habilidades base"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel de modèles de compétences","Dépend de la compatibilité avec les versions de compétences de base"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Skill-Vorlagen-Repository","Hängt von der Kompatibilität mit Basis-Skill-Versionen ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório de modelos de habilidades","Depende da compatibilidade com as versões base de habilidades"],"ru":["Требует доступа к хранилищу шаблонов навыков","Зависит от совместимости с базовыми версиями навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع قوالب المهارات","يعتمد على التوافق مع الإصدارات الأساسية للمهارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vtakaj/ADO-History/openspec-verify-change', 'community', 'vtakaj', 'ADO-History', 'vtakaj/ADO-History', 'openspec-verify-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:21:04.639Z', NULL, '{"id":"vtakaj/ADO-History/openspec-verify-change","name":"openspec-verify-change","description":{"es":"El skill openspec-verify-change verifica que una implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio. Aprende a utilizarlo para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo de desarrollo.","fr":"Le skill openspec-verify-change vérifie que une implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification. Découvrez comment l''utiliser pour améliorer votre flux de travail de développement.","de":"Das Skill openspec-verify-change überprüft, ob eine Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es verwenden können, um Ihren Entwicklungsworkflow zu verbessern.","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração. Ele permite que os desenvolvedores trabalhem de forma eficiente.","ru":"openspec-verify-change - это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменения. Он позволяет разработчикам работать эффективно.","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة تحقق مما إذا كانت التنفيذ تتوافق مع محددات التغيير. يسمح للمطورين بالعمل بفعالية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Verificar cambios en la implementación con openspec-verif...","fr":"Vérifier les modifications d''implémentation avec openspec...","de":"Überprüfen von Änderungen in der Implementierung mit open...","pt":"Verifique Alterações com openspec-verify-change","ru":"Проверьте изменения с openspec-verify-change","ar":"تحقق من التغييرات باستخدام openspec-verify-change","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"es":"El skill openspec-verify-change verifica que una implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio. Aprende a utilizarlo para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo ...","fr":"Le skill openspec-verify-change vérifie que une implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification. Découvrez comment l''utiliser pour améliorer votre fl...","de":"Das Skill openspec-verify-change überprüft, ob eine Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es verwenden können, um ...","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração. Ele permite que os desenvolvedores trabal...","ru":"openspec-verify-change - это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменения. Он позволяет разработчикам работать эффективно.","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة تحقق مما إذا كانت التنفيذ تتوافق مع محددات التغيير. يسمح للمطورين بالعمل بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Verificación de implementaciones","Coincidencia con artefactos de cambio","Selección de cambios","Uso de la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Ejecución de comandos openspec","Mejora del flujo de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Vérification des implémentations","Correspondance avec les artefacts de modification","Sélection de modifications","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution de commandes openspec","Amélioration du flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Überprüfung von Implementierungen","Übereinstimmung mit Änderungsartefakten","Auswahl von Änderungen","Verwendung der AskUserQuestion-Tools","Ausführung von openspec-Befehlen","Verbesserung des Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Verificação de alterações","Integração com openspec","Seleção de alterações","Trabalho eficiente","Implementação de tarefas","Análise de artefatos"],"ru":["Проверка изменений","Интеграция с openspec","Выбор изменений","Эффективная работа","Реализация задач","Анализ артефактов"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات","التكامل مع openspec","اختيار التغييرات","العمل بفعالية","تنفيذ المهام","تحليل المحددات"]},"keywords":{"es":["openspec-verify-change","verificación de implementaciones","desarrollo de software","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","artefactos de cambio","AskUserQuestion","comandos openspec"],"fr":["openspec-verify-change","vérification des implémentations","développement de logiciels","flux de travail de développement","artefacts de modification","AskUserQuestion","commandes openspec"],"de":["openspec-verify-change","Überprüfung von Implementierungen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsworkflow","Änderungsartefakte","AskUserQuestion","openspec-Befehle"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de alterações","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","eficiência no desenvolvimento","implementação de tarefas","análise de artefatos","openspec"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка изменений","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","эффективность разработки","реализация задач","анализ артефактов","openspec"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","التحقق من التغييرات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","فعالية التطوير","تنفيذ المهام","تحليل المحددات","openspec"]}},"owner":"vtakaj","repo":"ADO-History","repoPath":"vtakaj/ADO-History","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:21:04.639Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated verification of change artifacts against implementation tasks","zh":"非常适合需要自动验证变更工件与实现任务的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントが変更アーティファクトを実装タスクに対して自動検証する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"변경 아티팩트를 구현 태스크에 대해 자동 검증해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan verificación automática de artefactos de cambio contra tareas de implementación","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une vérification automatisée des artefacts de modification par rapport aux tâches d''implémentation","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Überprüfung von Änderungsartefakten gegen Implementierungsaufgaben benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de verificação automática de artefatos de alteração contra tarefas de implementação","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматическая верификация артефактов изменений против задач реализации","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق التلقائي لعناصر التغيير مقابل مهام التنفيذ"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change specs, tasks, and design using the openspec tool, enabling accurate validation of implementation tasks and change artifacts in JSON format","zh":"赋予代理验证实现是否与变更规范、任务和设计相匹配的能力，使用openspec工具，使得能够以JSON格式准确验证实现任务和变更工件","ja":"エージェントに、実装が変更仕様、タスク、デザインと一致することを検証する能力を与え、openspecツールを使用して、JSON形式での実装タスクと変更アーティファクトの正確な検証を可能にします","ko":"에이전트에 구현이 변경 규格, 태스크 및 디자인과 일치하는지 확인할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 openspec 툴을 사용하여 JSON 형식의 구현 태스크 및 변경 아티팩트의 정확한 검증을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes para verificar que la implementación coincide con las especificaciones de cambio, tareas y diseño utilizando la herramienta openspec, lo que permite una validación precisa de las tareas de implementación y los artefactos de cambio en formato JSON","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux spécifications de modification, aux tâches et à la conception en utilisant l''outil openspec, ce qui permet une validation précise des tâches d''implémentation et des artefacts de modification au format JSON","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, die Implementierung mit den Änderungsspezifikationen, Aufgaben und dem Design unter Verwendung des openspec-Tools zu überprüfen, wodurch eine genaue Überprüfung der Implementierungsaufgaben und Änderungsartefakte im JSON-Format ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde às especificações de alteração, tarefas e design usando a ferramenta openspec, permitindo uma validação precisa das tarefas de implementação e artefatos de alteração no formato JSON","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить, соответствует ли реализация спецификациям изменений, задачам и дизайну с помощью инструмента openspec, обеспечивая точную проверку задач реализации и артефактов изменений в формате JSON","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من مطابقة التنفيذ لمواصفات التغيير والمهام والتصميم باستخدام أداة openspec، وتمكين التحقق الدقيق لمهام التنفيذ وعناصر التغيير بتنسيق JSON"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying change implementation against specs","Automating validation of design changes","Debugging implementation tasks using openspec list --json"],"zh":["验证变更实现是否与规范一致","自动验证设计变更","使用openspec list --json调试实现任务"],"ja":["変更実装が仕様と一致することを検証する","設計変更の自動検証","openspec list --jsonを使用して実装タスクをデバッグする"],"ko":["변경 구현이 규격과 일치하는지 확인","디자인 변경 자동 검증","openspec list --json을 사용하여 구현 태스크 디버깅"],"es":["Verificar la implementación de cambios contra las especificaciones","Automatizar la validación de cambios de diseño","Depurar tareas de implementación utilizando openspec lista --json"],"fr":["Vérifier l''implémentation des modifications par rapport aux spécifications","Automatiser la validation des modifications de conception","Déboguer les tâches d''implémentation en utilisant openspec liste --json"],"de":["Überprüfen der Implementierung von Änderungen gegen die Spezifikationen","Automatisieren der Überprüfung von Designänderungen","Fehlerbehebung von Implementierungsaufgaben unter Verwendung von openspec Liste --json"],"pt":["Verificar a implementação da alteração contra as especificações","Automatizar a validação de alterações de design","Depurar tarefas de implementação usando openspec list --json"],"ru":["Проверка реализации изменений против спецификаций","Автоматизация проверки изменений дизайна","Отладка задач реализации с помощью openspec list --json"],"ar":["التحقق من تنفيذ التغيير مقابل المواصفات","تأتمة التحقق من تغييرات التصميم","تصحيح أخطاء مهام التنفيذ باستخدام openspec list --json"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec tool installation","Needs access to change artifacts and implementation tasks","May prompt for user selection if change name is vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["需要安装openspec工具","需要访问变更工件和实现任务","如果变更名称不明确或模糊，可能会提示用户选择"],"ja":["openspecツールのインストールが必要","変更アーティファクトと実装タスクへのアクセスが必要","変更名が不明確または曖昧な場合、ユーザー選択を求める場合がある"],"ko":["openspec 툴 설치가 필요","변경 아티팩트 및 구현 태스크에 대한 액세스가 필요","변경 이름이 불분명하거나 모호한 경우 사용자 선택을 요청할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la herramienta openspec","Necesita acceso a artefactos de cambio y tareas de implementación","Puede solicitar la selección del usuario si el nombre del cambio es vago o ambiguo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''outil openspec","A besoin d''un accès aux artefacts de modification et aux tâches d''implémentation","Peut demander une sélection utilisateur si le nom de la modification est vague ou ambigu"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des openspec-Tools","Benötigt Zugriff auf Änderungsartefakte und Implementierungsaufgaben","Kann die Benutzerauswahl auffordern, wenn der Änderungsname vage oder mehrdeutig ist"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da ferramenta openspec","Necessita acesso a artefatos de alteração e tarefas de implementação","Pode solicitar seleção do usuário se o nome da alteração for vago ou ambíguo"],"ru":["Требует установки инструмента openspec","Требует доступа к артефактам изменений и задачам реализации","Может предложить выбор пользователя, если имя изменения неоднозначно или двусмысленно"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى عناصر التغيير و مهام التنفيذ","قد يطلب من المستخدم اختيار إذا كان اسم التغيير غامض أو غير واضح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('willyu1007/MyTrader/design-layered-backend-architecture', 'community', 'willyu1007', 'MyTrader', 'willyu1007/MyTrader', 'design-layered-backend-architecture', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:20:41.262Z', NULL, '{"id":"willyu1007/MyTrader/design-layered-backend-architecture","name":"design-layered-backend-architecture","description":{"zh":"设计分层后端架构是一种优化后端开发的方法，通过分离关注点和模块化代码来提高性能和可扩展性","ja":"設計階層バックエンドアーキテクチャは、後端開発を最適化するための方法であり、関心の分離とコードのモジュール化によってパフォーマンスとスケーラビリティを向上させます","ko":"설계 계층형 백엔드 아키텍처는 백엔드 개발을 최적화하는 방법으로, 관심사를 분리하고 코드를 모듈화하여 성능과 확장성을 향상시킵니다","es":"El diseño de arquitectura de backend en capas permite una personalización y escalabilidad para uso diario","fr":"La conception d''une architecture backend en couches permet une personnalisation et une évolutivité pour un usage quotidien","de":"Der Entwurf einer schichtbasierten Backend-Architektur ermöglicht eine Personalisierung und Skalierbarkeit für den täglichen Gebrauch","pt":"A arquitetura de backend em camadas é uma abordagem personalizada para uso diário não profissional, permitindo uma estrutura flexível e escalável","ru":"Многослойная архитектура бэкенда - это адаптированный подход для ежедневного непрофессионального использования, обеспечивающий гибкую и масштабируемую структуру","ar":"هندسة الخلفية المتعددة الطبقات هي نهج مخصص للاستخدام اليومي غير المهني، مما يسمح بهيكل مرن وقابل للتوسيع","en":"Personalized trade that is customized for unprofessional daily use"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"设计分层后端架构 - 优化后端开发","ja":"設計階層バックエンドアーキテクチャ - 最適化されたバックエンド開発","ko":"설계 계층형 백엔드 아키텍처 - 최적화된 백엔드 개발","es":"Diseño de arquitectura de backend en capas","fr":"Conception d''une architecture backend en couches","de":"Entwurf einer schichtbasierten Backend-Architektur","pt":"Arquitetura de Backend em Camadas","ru":"Многослойная Архитектура Бэкенда","a