s and microservices.","bodyPreview":"# design-layered-backend-architecture (entry)\n\nCanonical source: `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/`\n\nOpen `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/SKILL.md` and any supporting files referenced there (for example `reference.md`, `examples.md`, `scripts/`, `templates/`).\n\n> **Note**: The frontmatter above is identical to the canonical source except for `ssot_path` and `category` which are added for navigation. After opening the source","body":"# design-layered-backend-architecture (entry)\n\nCanonical source: `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/`\n\nOpen `.ai/skills/backend/architecture/design-layered-backend-architecture/SKILL.md` and any supporting files referenced there (for example `reference.md`, `examples.md`, `scripts/`, `templates/`).\n\n> **Note**: The frontmatter above is identical to the canonical source except for `ssot_path` and `category` which are added for navigation. After opening the source file, skip re-reading the description to avoid redundant token usage.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:20:41.262Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Architecture Agents needing to design scalable and modular backend systems with layered architecture","zh":"非常适合需要设计可扩展和模块化后端系统的架构代理，具有分层架构","ja":"アーキテクチャエージェントがスケーラブルでモジュラーなバックエンドシステムを設計する必要がある場合に最適です。階層化されたアーキテクチャを備えています","ko":"확장 가능하고 모듈화된 백엔드 시스템을 설계해야 하는 아키텍처 에이전트에게完璧한 선택입니다. 계층화된 아킭첵처를 갖추고 있습니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Arquitectura que necesitan diseñar sistemas de backend escalables y modulares con arquitectura en capas","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Architecture ayant besoin de concevoir des systèmes de backend escalables et modulaires avec une architecture en couches","de":"Perfekt für Architektur-Agenten, die skalierbare und modulare Backendsysteme mit geschichteter Architektur entwerfen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Arquitetura que precisam projetar sistemas de backend escaláveis e modulares com arquitetura em camadas","ru":"Идеально для Архитектурных Агентов, которым необходимо проектировать масштабируемые и модульные системы бэкэнда с многослойной архитектурой","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهيكلة الذي يحتاج إلى تصميم أنظمة خلفية قابلة للتوسعة والتعديل مع هيكلية متعددة الطبقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create personalized trade systems with customized backend architecture, utilizing design patterns and principles to ensure flexibility and maintainability, while supporting canonical sources and navigation through added frontmatter like ssot_path and category","zh":"赋予代理创建具有自定义后端架构的个性化交易系统的能力，利用设计模式和原则确保灵活性和可维护性，同时支持规范源和通过添加前置内容（如ssot_path和category）进行导航","ja":"エージェントがカスタマイズされたバックエンドアーキテクチャを備えたパーソナライズされたトレードシステムを作成する能力を付与します。設計パターンと原則を利用して、柔軟性と保守性を確保し、規範ソースと追加のフロントマター（ssot_pathやカテゴリなど）を介したナビゲーションもサポートします","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 지정된 백엔드 아키텍처를 갖춘 개인화된 거래 시스템을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 디자인 패턴과 원칙을 활용하여 유연성과 유지보수성을 보장하며, 표준 소스 및 추가 프론트매터(예: ssot_path 및 category)를 통해 탐색도 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear sistemas de comercio personalizados con arquitectura de backend personalizada, utilizando patrones y principios de diseño para garantizar flexibilidad y mantenibilidad, al mismo tiempo que admite fuentes canónicas y navegación a través de frontmatter agregado como ssot_path y categoría","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes de commerce personnalisés avec une architecture de backend personnalisée, en utilisant des modèles et des principes de conception pour assurer la flexibilité et la maintenabilité, tout en prenant en charge les sources canoniques et la navigation via des frontmatter ajoutés comme ssot_path et catégorie","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, personalisierte Handelssysteme mit benutzerdefinierter Backend-Architektur zu erstellen, indem Designmuster und -prinzipien verwendet werden, um Flexibilität und Wartbarkeit sicherzustellen, während gleichzeitig kanonische Quellen und Navigation durch hinzugefügtes Frontmatter wie ssot_path und Kategorie unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem sistemas de comércio personalizados com arquitetura de backend personalizada, utilizando padrões e princípios de design para garantir flexibilidade e manutenibilidade, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta fontes canônicas e navegação por meio de frontmatter adicionais como ssot_path e categoria","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать персонализированные торговые системы с индивидуальной архитектурой бэкэнда, используя шаблоны и принципы проектирования для обеспечения гибкости и поддерживаемости, а также поддержку канонических источников и навигацию через добавленный frontmatter, такой как ssot_path и категория","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إنشاء أنظمة تجارية مخصصة مع هندسة خلفية مخصصة، باستخدام أنماط و مبادئ التصميم لضمان المرونة و الصيانة، في الوقت نفسه الدعم للمصادر القانونية و الملاحة من خلال добавات.frontmatter مثل ssot_path و الفئة"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing modular backend systems for daily use","Creating personalized trade systems with customized architecture","Implementing scalable design patterns for unprofessional users"],"zh":["为日常使用设计模块化的后端系统","创建具有自定义架构的个性化交易系统","为非专业用户实现可扩展的设计模式"],"ja":["日常使用のためのモジュラーなバックエンドシステムを設計する","カスタマイズされたアーキテクチャを備えたパーソナライズされたトレードシステムを作成する","非専門家ユーザー向けにスケーラブルな設計パターンを実装する"],"ko":["일상적인 사용을 위한 모듈화된 백엔드 시스템을 설계한다","사용자 지정된 아키텍처를 갖춘 개인화된 거래 시스템을 생성한다","비전문가 사용자를 위한 확장 가능한 디자인 패턴을 구현한다"],"es":["Diseñar sistemas de backend modulares para uso diario","Crear sistemas de comercio personalizados con arquitectura personalizada","Implementar patrones de diseño escalables para usuarios no profesionales"],"fr":["Concevoir des systèmes de backend modulaires pour une utilisation quotidienne","Créer des systèmes de commerce personnalisés avec une architecture personnalisée","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de conception escalables pour les utilisateurs non professionnels"],"de":["Entwerfen von modularen Backendsystemen für den täglichen Gebrauch","Erstellen von personalisierten Handelssystemen mit benutzerdefinierter Architektur","Implementieren von skalierbaren Designmustern für nicht professionelle Benutzer"],"pt":["Projeto de sistemas de backend modulares para uso diário","Criação de sistemas de comércio personalizados com arquitetura personalizada","Implementação de padrões de design escaláveis para usuários não profissionais"],"ru":["Проектирование модульных систем бэкэнда для ежедневного использования","Создание персонализированных торговых систем с индивидуальной архитектурой","Реализация масштабируемых шаблонов проектирования для непрофессиональных пользователей"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة خلفية قابلة للتوسعة للاستخدام اليومي","إنشاء أنظمة تجارية مخصصة مع هندسة خلفية مخصصة","تنفيذ أنماط تصميم قابلة للتوسعة للمستخدمين غير المحترفين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of backend architecture design principles","Limited to unprofessional daily use cases","Dependent on canonical source files like SKILL.md and reference.md"],"zh":["需要了解后端架构设计原则","仅限于非专业的日常使用场景","依赖于规范源文件，如SKILL.md和reference.md"],"ja":["バックエンドアーキテクチャの設計原則に関する知識が必要です","非専門家の日常使用シナリオに限定されます","規範ソースファイル（SKILL.mdやreference.mdなど）に依存しています"],"ko":["백엔드 아키텍처 설계 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","비전문가의 일상적인 사용 시나리오에限定됩니다","표준 소스 파일(SKILL.md 및 reference.md 등)에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios de diseño de la arquitectura de backend","Limitado a casos de uso diarios no profesionales","Dependiente de archivos de fuente canónicos como SKILL.md y reference.md"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des principes de conception de l''architecture de backend","Limité aux cas d''utilisation quotidiens non professionnels","Dépendant de fichiers de source canoniques tels que SKILL.md et reference.md"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Prinzipien des Backend-Architektur-Designs","Begrenzt auf nicht professionelle tägliche Anwendungsfälle","Abhängig von kanonischen Quelldateien wie SKILL.md und reference.md"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de princípios de design de arquitetura de backend","Limitado a casos de uso diário não profissionais","Dependente de arquivos de fontes canônicas como SKILL.md e reference.md"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов проектирования архитектуры бэкэнда","Ограничен для непрофессиональных ежедневных случаев использования","Зависит от файлов канонических источников, таких как SKILL.md и reference.md"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة مبادئ تصميم هيكلية الخلفية","محدود للاستخدام اليومي غير المحترف","يعتمد على ملفات المصادر القانونية مثل SKILL.md و reference.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('seoky0/openspec-example-todo-app/openspec-verify-change', 'community', 'seoky0', 'openspec-example-todo-app', 'seoky0/openspec-example-todo-app', 'openspec-verify-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:20:47.896Z', NULL, '{"id":"seoky0/openspec-example-todo-app/openspec-verify-change","name":"openspec-verify-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术用于验证实现是否匹配更改文档，确保开发一致性","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術は，実装が変更文書と一致するかを検証，開発の一貫性を確保","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술은 구현이 변경 문서와 일치하는지 검증하여 개발 일관성을 보장","es":"La habilidad openspec-verify-change verifica que una implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a garantizar la coherencia en sus proyectos","fr":"La compétence openspec-verify-change vérifie que une implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification. Elle aide les développeurs à garantir la cohérence dans leurs projets","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-verify-change überprüft, ob eine Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Sie hilft Entwicklern, die Konsistenz in ihren Projekten sicherzustellen","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração. Ele executa o comando openspec list --json para obter as alterações disponíveis.","ru":"Openspec-verify-change - это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменений. Он выполняет команду openspec list --json, чтобы получить доступные изменения.","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة تتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع محددات التغيير. يقوم بتنفيذ الأمر openspec list --json للحصول على التغييرات المتاحة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术验证","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術検証","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술 검증","es":"Verificación de cambios con openspec-verify-change","fr":"Vérification des modifications avec openspec-verify-change","de":"Änderungsverifizierung mit openspec-verify-change","pt":"Verifique Alterações com openspec-verify-change","ru":"Проверьте изменения с openspec-verify-change","ar":"التحقق من التغييرات باستخدام openspec-verify-change","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术用于验证实现是否匹配更改文档，确保开发一致性","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術は，実装が変更文書と一致するかを検証，開発の一貫性を確保","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술은 구현이 변경 문서와 일치하는지 검증하여 개발 일관성을 보장","es":"La habilidad openspec-verify-change verifica que una implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a garantizar la cohere...","fr":"La compétence openspec-verify-change vérifie que une implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification. Elle aide les développeurs à garantir la cohére...","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-verify-change überprüft, ob eine Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Sie hilft Entwicklern, die Konsistenz in i...","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração. Ele executa o comando openspec list --jso...","ru":"Openspec-verify-change - это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменений. Он выполняет команду openspec list --json, чтоб...","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة تتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع محددات التغيير. يقوم بتنفيذ الأمر openspec list --json للحصول على التغييرات المتاحة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证实现是否匹配更改文档","支持选择更改名称","自动推断更改名称","提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["実装が変更文書と一致するかを検証","変更名の選択をサポート","変更名を自動的に推断","ユーザーに変更の選択を促す"],"ko":["구현이 변경 문서와 일치하는지 검증","변경 이름 선택 지원","변경 이름 자동 추론","사용자에게 변경 선택提示"],"es":["Verificación de implementaciones","Coincidencia con artefactos de cambio","Selección de cambios","Uso de la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Compatibilidad con openspec list --json","Soporte para inferir el nombre del cambio del contexto de conversación"],"fr":["Vérification des implémentations","Correspondance avec les artefacts de modification","Sélection des modifications","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Compatibilité avec openspec list --json","Prise en charge de l''inférence du nom de la modification à partir du contexte de conversation"],"de":["Überprüfung von Implementierungen","Übereinstimmung mit Änderungsartefakten","Auswahl von Änderungen","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion","Kompatibilität mit openspec list --json","Unterstützung für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Verificação de alterações","Execução do comando openspec list --json","Seleção de alterações disponíveis","Integração com o AskUserQuestion tool","Suporte a implementações personalizadas"],"ru":["Проверка изменений","Выполнение команды openspec list --json","Выбор доступных изменений","Интеграция с инструментом AskUserQuestion","Поддержка пользовательских реализаций"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات","تنفيذ الأمر openspec list --json","اختيار التغييرات المتاحة","التكامل مع أداة AskUserQuestion","دعم التنفيذ المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","技术验证","实现验证","更改文档","开发一致性","自动化测试"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","技術検証","実装検証","変更文書","開発の一貫性","自動化テスト"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","기술 검증","구현 검증","변경 문서","개발 일관성","자동화 테스트"],"es":["openspec-verify-change","verificación de cambios","desarrollo de software","implementación de cambios","artefactos de cambio","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","inferencia de contexto"],"fr":["openspec-verify-change","vérification des modifications","développement de logiciels","implémentation des modifications","artefacts de modification","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","inférence de contexte"],"de":["openspec-verify-change","Änderungsverifizierung","Softwareentwicklung","Implementierung von Änderungen","Änderungsartefakte","AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","Kontextableitung"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de alterações","implementação de software","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","AskUserQuestion tool"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка изменений","реализация программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","AskUserQuestion инструмент"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","التحقق من التغييرات","تنفيذ البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","أداة AskUserQuestion"]}},"owner":"seoky0","repo":"openspec-example-todo-app","repoPath":"seoky0/openspec-example-todo-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:20:47.896Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise implementation verification and change management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要精确的实施验证和变更管理能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが正確な実装の検証と変更管理の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 구현 검증 및 변경 관리 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una verificación de implementación precisa y capacidades de gestión de cambios.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une vérification d''implémentation précise et des capacités de gestion de changements.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine präzise Implementierungsverifizierung und Änderungsmanagementfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem verificação de implementação precisa e capacidades de gerenciamento de alterações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих точной проверки реализации и возможностей управления изменениями.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب التحقق الدقيق من التنفيذ وقدرات إدارة التغيير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches against change artifacts, utilizing tools like openspec and AskUserQuestion, ensuring accuracy and reducing ambiguity in development tasks through JSON data and conversation context analysis.","zh":"赋予代理验证实施是否与变更工件相匹配的能力，利用openspec和AskUserQuestion等工具，通过JSON数据和对话上下文分析，确保准确性并减少开发任务中的模糊性。","ja":"実装が変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証するエージェントの能力を強化します。openspecやAskUserQuestionなどのツールを使用して、JSONデータと会話コンテキストの分析を通じて、精度を確保し、開発タスクの曖昧性を減らします。","ko":"구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다. openspec와 AskUserQuestionなどの 도구를 사용하여 JSON 데이터 및 대화 문맥 분석을 통해 정확성을 보장하고 개발 작업의 모호성을 줄입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio, utilizando herramientas como openspec y AskUserQuestion, garantizando la precisión y reduciendo la ambigüedad en las tareas de desarrollo a través del análisis de datos JSON y contexto de conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux artefacts de changement, en utilisant des outils tels que openspec et AskUserQuestion, garantissant ainsi l''exactitude et réduisant l''ambiguïté dans les tâches de développement grâce à l''analyse des données JSON et du contexte de conversation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten zu überprüfen, unter Verwendung von Tools wie openspec und AskUserQuestion, um Genauigkeit zu gewährleisten und Mehrdeutigkeit in Entwicklungsaufgaben durch JSON-Daten- und Konversationskontextanalyse zu reduzieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração, utilizando ferramentas como openspec e AskUserQuestion, garantindo precisão e reduzindo ambiguidades nas tarefas de desenvolvimento por meio da análise de dados JSON e contexto de conversa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять соответствие реализации артефактам изменений, используя инструменты, такие как openspec и AskUserQuestion, обеспечивая точность и снижая неоднозначность в задачах разработки посредством анализа данных JSON и контекста разговора.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق من مطابقة التنفيذ مع محددات التغيير، باستخدام أدوات مثل openspec و AskUserQuestion، وضمان الدقة وتقليل الغموض في مهام التطوير من خلال تحليل بيانات JSON وسياق المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying implementation against specified change artifacts","Automating the process of checking for implementation matches","Debugging discrepancies between implementation and design specs"],"zh":["验证实施是否与指定的变更工件一致","自动执行实施匹配检查的过程","调试实施和设计规范之间的差异"],"ja":["実装が指定された変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証する","実装マッチの確認プロセスを自動化する","実装と設計仕様の間の差異をデバッグする"],"ko":["구현이 지정된 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인","구현 일치 확인 프로세스를 자동화","구현과 설계 사양 간의 불일치를 디버깅"],"es":["Verificar la implementación contra artefactos de cambio especificados","Automatizar el proceso de comprobación de coincidencias de implementación","Depurar discrepancias entre implementación y especificaciones de diseño"],"fr":["Vérifier l''implémentation par rapport aux artefacts de changement spécifiés","Automatiser le processus de vérification des correspondances d''implémentation","Déboguer les écarts entre l''implémentation et les spécifications de conception"],"de":["Überprüfen der Implementierung gegenüber spezifizierten Änderungsartefakten","Automatisieren des Prozesses der Überprüfung von Implementierungsübereinstimmungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Unstimmigkeiten zwischen Implementierung und Entwurfsspezifikationen"],"pt":["Verificar a implementação contra artefatos de alteração especificados","Automatizar o processo de verificação de correspondência de implementação","Depurar discrepâncias entre a implementação e as especificações de design"],"ru":["Проверка реализации против заданных артефактов изменений","Автоматизация процесса проверки соответствия реализации","Отладка несоответствий между реализацией и спецификациями дизайна"],"ar":["التحقق من التنفيذ مقابل محددات التغيير المحددة","تأتميم عملية التحقق من مطابقة التنفيذ","تصحيح الأخطاء بين التنفيذ ومواصفات التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec tool installation","Needs access to conversation context or explicit change name specification","Limited to changes with implementation tasks"],"zh":["需要安装openspec工具","需要访问对话上下文或显式的变更名称规范","仅限于具有实施任务的变更"],"ja":["openspecツールのインストールが必要","会話コンテキストまたは明示的な変更名の指定へのアクセスが必要","実装タスクを持つ変更のみに制限"],"ko":["openspec 도구 설치가 필요","대화 문맥 또는 명시적인 변경 이름 사양에 대한 액세스가 필요","구현 태스크가 있는 변경만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la herramienta openspec","Necesita acceso al contexto de conversación o especificación explícita del nombre de cambio","Limitado a cambios con tareas de implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''outil openspec","Nécessite l''accès au contexte de conversation ou à la spécification explicite du nom de changement","Limité aux changements avec des tâches d''implémentation"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des openspec-Tools","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext oder explizite Spezifikation des Änderungsnamens","Begrenzt auf Änderungen mit Implementierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da ferramenta openspec","Necessita acesso ao contexto de conversa ou especificação explícita do nome da alteração","Limitado a alterações com tarefas de implementação"],"ru":["Требует установки инструмента openspec","Требует доступа к контексту разговора или явного указания имени изменений","Ограничен изменением с задачами реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة أو تحديد اسم التغيير明","محدود بالتغييرات التي لها مهام تنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('harqian/wifi-client/openspec-verify-change', 'community', 'harqian', 'wifi-client', 'harqian/wifi-client', 'openspec-verify-change', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:20:53.361Z', NULL, '{"id":"harqian/wifi-client/openspec-verify-change","name":"openspec-verify-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能是一个自动化工具，用于验证变更并确保实现匹配设计规范","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキルは、変更を自動検証し、実装が設計仕様と一致することを保証するツールです","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술은 변경 사항을 자동으로 확인하여 구현이 디자인 사양과 일치하는지 확인하는 도구입니다","es":"openspec-verify-change es una herramienta que verifica que la implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio, como specs y tareas de diseño. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a identificar problemas y asegurarse de que los cambios se implementen correctamente","fr":"openspec-verify-change est un outil qui vérifie que la mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification, tels que les specs et les tâches de conception. Il aide les développeurs à identifier les problèmes et à s''assurer que les modifications sont mises en œuvre correctement","de":"openspec-verify-change ist ein Tool, das überprüft, ob die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten, wie Spezifikationen und Designaufgaben, übereinstimmt. Es hilft Entwicklern, Probleme zu identifizieren und sicherzustellen, dass Änderungen korrekt implementiert werden","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta inteligente que verifica se a implementação de um projeto corresponde às especificações e artefatos de mudança","ru":"openspec-verify-change - это умный инструмент, который проверяет соответствие реализации проекта спецификациям и артефактам изменения","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة ذكية تحقق من مطابقة تنفيذ المشروع للمواصفات ومرتكزات التغيير","en":"A smart Wi-Fi client designed to manage connections, auto-fill captive portals, monitor connection speed and security, and store/share passwords. It provides transparency into connection issues and sends notifications for poor performance."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能：自动化变更验证","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキル：変更の自動検証","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술: 변경 사항 자동 확인","es":"Verifica cambios con openspec-verify-change","fr":"Vérifiez les modifications avec openspec-verify-change","de":"Änderungen mit openspec-verify-change überprüfen","pt":"Verificar Alterações com openspec-verify-change","ru":"Проверка изменений с openspec-verify-change","ar":"التحقق من التغييرات مع openspec-verify-change","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能是一个自动化工具，用于验证变更并确保实现匹配设计规范","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキルは、変更を自動検証し、実装が設計仕様と一致することを保証するツールです","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술은 변경 사항을 자동으로 확인하여 구현이 디자인 사양과 일치하는지 확인하는 도구입니다","es":"openspec-verify-change es una herramienta que verifica que la implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio, como specs y tareas de diseño. Ayuda a lo...","fr":"openspec-verify-change est un outil qui vérifie que la mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification, tels que les specs et les tâches de conception...","de":"openspec-verify-change ist ein Tool, das überprüft, ob die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten, wie Spezifikationen und Designaufgaben, übereinstimmt...","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta inteligente que verifica se a implementação de um projeto corresponde às especificações e artefatos de mudança","ru":"openspec-verify-change - это умный инструмент, который проверяет соответствие реализации проекта спецификациям и артефактам изменения","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة ذكية تحقق من مطابقة تنفيذ المشروع للمواصفات ومرتكزات التغيير","en":"A smart Wi-Fi client designed to manage connections, auto-fill captive portals, monitor connection speed and security, and store/share passwords. It provides..."},"definition":{"en":"A smart Wi-Fi client designed to manage connections, auto-fill captive portals, monitor connection speed and security, and store/share passwords. It provides transparency into connection issues and sends notifications for poor performance."},"features":{"zh":["自动验证变更","确保实现匹配设计规范","提供可选的变更名称输入","支持从对话上下文推断变更名称","当变更名称不明确时提示用户选择"],"ja":["変更の自動検証","実装が設計仕様と一致することを保証","変更名の入力をオプションで提供","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推測することをサポート","変更名が不明確な場合にユーザーに選択を促す"],"ko":["변경 사항 자동 확인","구현이 디자인 사양과 일치하는지 확인","변경 이름 입력을 선택적으로 제공","대화의 맥락에서 변경 이름을 추론하는 것을 지원","변경 이름이 불분명할 때 사용자에게 선택을 요청"],"es":["Verificación de implementación","Identificación de problemas","Compatibilidad con specs y tareas de diseño","Selección de cambios","Notificaciones de problemas"],"fr":["Vérification de mise en œuvre","Identification de problèmes","Compatibilité avec les specs et les tâches de conception","Sélection de modifications","Notifications de problèmes"],"de":["Implementierungsüberprüfung","Problemerkennung","Kompatibilität mit Spezifikationen und Designaufgaben","Änderungsauswahl","Problembenachrichtigungen"],"pt":["Verificação automática de mudanças","Compatibilidade com várias plataformas","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Relatórios detalhados de verificação","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo"],"ru":["Автоматическая проверка изменений","Совместимость с несколькими платформами","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Детальные отчеты о проверке","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов"],"ar":["التحقق التلقائي من التغييرات","التوافق مع منصات متعددة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تقارير مفصلة عن التحقق","دعم صيغ ملفات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","自动化变更验证","设计规范","实现匹配","开发效率","自动化工具"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","自動化された変更検証","設計仕様","実装のマッチング","開発効率","自動化ツール"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","자동화된 변경 확인","디자인 사양","구현 일치","개발 효율성","자동화 도구"],"es":["verificación de implementación","openspec-verify-change","desarrollo de software","specs","tareas de diseño","problemas de implementación","notificaciones de problemas","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["vérification de mise en œuvre","openspec-verify-change","développement de logiciels","specs","tâches de conception","problèmes de mise en œuvre","notifications de problèmes","outils de développement"],"de":["Implementierungsüberprüfung","openspec-verify-change","Softwareentwicklung","Spezifikationen","Designaufgaben","Implementierungsprobleme","ProblemBenachrichtigungen","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["verificação de mudanças","openspec-verify-change","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gestão de projetos","qualidade de software"],"ru":["проверка изменений","openspec-verify-change","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","управление проектами","качество программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التحقق من التغييرات","openspec-verify-change","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة المشاريع","جودة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"harqian","repo":"wifi-client","repoPath":"harqian/wifi-client","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:20:53.361Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated verification of implementation changes against specs and design artifacts.","zh":"适合需要自动验证实现更改与规格和设计文档的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが仕様および設計アーティファクトに対する実装変更の自動検証を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 사양 및 디자인 아티팩트에 대한 구현 변경의 자동 검증을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan verificación automatizada de cambios de implementación contra especificaciones y artefactos de diseño.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une vérification automatisée des modifications d''implémentation par rapport aux spécifications et aux artefacts de conception.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Überprüfung von Implementierungsänderungen gegen Spezifikationen und Designartefakte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de verificação automática de alterações de implementação contra especificações e artefatos de design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым требуется автоматическая проверка изменений реализации против спецификаций и артефактов дизайна.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة للرمز الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق التلقائي لتغييرات التنفيذ ضد المواصفات وأدوات التصميم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts, including specs, tasks, and design, using tools like AskUserQuestion and openspec list --json, ensuring transparency and accuracy in development workflows.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 AskUserQuestion 和 openspec list --json 等工具来验证实现是否与更改文档（包括规格、任务和设计）匹配，确保开发工作流的透明度和准确性。","ja":"AskUserQuestion および openspec list --json などのツールを使用して、実装が変更アーティファクト（仕様、タスク、設計など）と一致することを検証できるようにエージェントに権限を付与し、開発ワークフローの透明性と精度を確保します。","ko":"에이전트에게 AskUserQuestion 및 openspec list --json 등의 도구를 사용하여 구현이 변경 아티팩트(사양, 작업, 디자인 등)와 일치하는지 검증할 수 있는 권한을 부여하여 개발 워크플로의 투명성과 정확성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio, incluidas las especificaciones, tareas y diseño, utilizando herramientas como AskUserQuestion y openspec list --json, garantizando la transparencia y la precisión en los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification, y compris les spécifications, les tâches et la conception, en utilisant des outils tels que AskUserQuestion et openspec list --json, garantissant ainsi la transparence et l''exactitude dans les flux de travail de développement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten abzugleichen, einschließlich Spezifikationen, Aufgaben und Design, unter Verwendung von Tools wie AskUserQuestion und openspec list --json, und gewährleistet so Transparenz und Genauigkeit in den Entwicklungsworkflows.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração, incluindo especificações, tarefas e design, utilizando ferramentas como AskUserQuestion e openspec list --json, garantindo transparência e precisão nos fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменений, включая спецификации, задачи и дизайн, используя инструменты, такие как AskUserQuestion и openspec list --json, обеспечивая прозрачность и точность в рабочих процессах разработки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع أدوات التغيير، بما في ذلك المواصفات والمهام وتصميم، باستخدام أدوات مثل AskUserQuestion وopenspec list --json، مما يضمن الشفافية والدقة في سير عمل التطوير."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating verification of code changes against design specifications","Debugging implementation mismatches using openspec list --json","Validating task completion against change artifacts"],"zh":["自动验证代码更改与设计规格的匹配","使用 openspec list --json 调试实现不匹配","验证任务完成与更改文档的匹配"],"ja":["コードの変更を設計仕様と自動で検証する","openspec list --json を使用して実装の不一致をデバッグする","タスクの完了を変更アーティファクトと検証する"],"ko":["코드 변경을 디자인 사양과 자동으로 검증하는 것","openspec list --json을 사용하여 구현의 불일치를 디버깅하는 것","작업 완성을 변경 아티팩트와 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la verificación de cambios de código contra especificaciones de diseño","Depuración de discrepancias de implementación utilizando openspec list --json","Validación de la finalización de tareas contra artefactos de cambio"],"fr":["Automatisation de la vérification des modifications de code par rapport aux spécifications de conception","Débogage des écarts d''implémentation en utilisant openspec list --json","Validation de l''achèvement des tâches par rapport aux artefacts de modification"],"de":["Automatisierung der Überprüfung von Codeänderungen gegen Designspezifikationen","Fehlerbehebung von Implementierungsfehlern unter Verwendung von openspec list --json","Validierung der Aufgabenerfüllung gegen Änderungsartefakte"],"pt":["Automatizar a verificação de alterações de código contra especificações de design","Depurar discrepâncias de implementação usando openspec list --json","Validar conclusão de tarefas contra artefatos de alteração"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку изменений кода против спецификаций дизайна","Отладить несоответствия реализации с помощью openspec list --json","Проверить завершение задач против артефактов изменений"],"ar":["أتمتة التحقق من تغييرات الرمز ضد مواصفات التصميم","تصحيح أخطاء التنفيذ باستخدام openspec list --json","التحقق من إكمال المهام ضد أدوات التغيير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires conversation context or explicit change name specification","Dependent on availability of change artifacts and implementation tasks"],"zh":["需要会话上下文或显式的更改名称指定","依赖于更改文档和实现任务的可用性"],"ja":["会話のコンテキストまたは明示的な変更名の指定が必要","変更アーティファクトおよび実装タスクの可用性に依存する"],"ko":["대화 상텍스트 또는 명시적인 변경 이름 지정이 필요","변경 아티팩트 및 구현 작업의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere contexto de conversación o especificación explícita del nombre del cambio","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de artefactos de cambio y tareas de implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de conversation ou une spécification explicite du nom du changement","Dépend de la disponibilité des artefacts de modification et des tâches d''implémentation"],"de":["Benötigt Konversationskontext oder explizite Änderungsnamensspezifikation","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von Änderungsartefakten und Implementierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer contexto de conversa ou especificação explícita do nome da alteração","Depende da disponibilidade de artefatos de alteração e tarefas de implementação"],"ru":["Требует контекста разговора или явного указания имени изменений","Зависит от наличия артефактов изменений и задач реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق المحادثة أو تحديد اسم التغيير بشكل صريح","يعتمد على توافر أدوات التغيير ومهام التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
