verify-change","ru":"Проверьте изменения с openspec-verify-change","ar":"تحقق من التغييرات مع openspec-verify-change","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change技能用于验证实现是否匹配变更的设计文档和任务","ja":"openspec-verify-changeスキルは、実装が変更の設計書とタスクに一致することを確認します","ko":"openspec-verify-change 스킬은 구현이 변경의 설계 문서와 태스크에 일치하는지 확인합니다","es":"openspec-verify-change es una herramienta que verifica que una implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio. Permite a los desarrolladores asegurarse...","fr":"openspec-verify-change est un outil qui vérifie que une mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification. Il permet aux développeurs de s''assurer que l...","de":"openspec-verify-change ist ein Tool, das überprüft, ob eine Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, sicherzuste...","pt":"Verifique se uma implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração com openspec-verify-change, garantindo a precisão e a conformidade.","ru":"Проверьте, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменений с помощью openspec-verify-change, гарантируя точность и соответствие.","ar":"تحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع مكونات التغيير باستخدام openspec-verify-change، وضمان الدقة والامتثال.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证实现与变更规范的匹配","支持从会话上下文推断变更名称","当变更名称不明确时，提示用户选择","使用AskUserQuestion工具让用户选择变更","显示具有实现任务的变更"],"ja":["実装と変更仕様の整合性を検証","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推測する機能","変更名が不明確な場合にユーザーに選択を求める","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザーに選択を求める","実装タスクを持つ変更を表示"],"ko":["구현과 변경 규격의 일致성을 확인","대화의 맥락에서 변경 이름을 추론하는 기능","변경 이름이 불명확한 경우 사용자에게 선택을 요청","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자에게 선택을 요청","구현 태스크가 있는 변경을 표시"],"es":["Verificación de implementación","Compatibilidad con artefactos de cambio","Selección de cambios","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Soporte para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Vérification de mise en œuvre","Compatibilité avec les artefacts de modification","Sélection de modifications","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Prise en charge des flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Implementierungsüberprüfung","Kompatibilität mit Änderungsartefakten","Änderungsauswahl","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Verificação de implementação","Correspondência com artefatos de alteração","Suporte a seleção de alterações","Integração com openspec list","Utilização do AskUserQuestion tool"],"ru":["Проверка реализации","Соответствие артефактам изменений","Поддержка выбора изменений","Интеграция с openspec list","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["التحقق من التنفيذ","الامتثال لمكونات التغيير","دعم اختيار التغييرات","التكامل مع openspec list","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","变更规范","实现验证","设计文档","任务管理","会话上下文","AskUserQuestion"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","変更仕様","実装検証","設計書","タスク管理","会話のコンテキスト","AskUserQuestion"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","변경 규격","구현 확인","설계 문서","태스크 관리","대화의 맥락","AskUserQuestion"],"es":["openspec-verify-change","verificación de implementación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","artefactos de cambio"],"fr":["openspec-verify-change","vérification de mise en œuvre","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","flux de travail de développement","artefacts de modification"],"de":["openspec-verify-change","Implementierungsüberprüfung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungsworkflows","Änderungsartefakte"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de implementação","artefatos de alteração","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","openspec list","AskUserQuestion tool"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка реализации","артефакты изменений","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","openspec list","инструмент AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","تحقق من التنفيذ","مكونات التغيير","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","openspec list","أداة AskUserQuestion"]}},"owner":"VanLengs","repo":"askTony","repoPath":"VanLengs/askTony","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:20:47.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing precise implementation verification against change artifacts.","zh":"非常适合需要对变更工件进行精确实现验证的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが変更アーティファクトに対して正確な実装の検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"변경 아티팩트에 대한 정확한 구현 확인이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una verificación de implementación precisa contra artefactos de cambio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une vérification d''implémentation précise contre les artefacts de modification.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine präzise Implementierungsverifizierung gegenüber Änderungsartefakten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de verificação de implementação precisa contra artefatos de alteração.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется точная проверка реализации против артефактов изменений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق الدقيق لتنفيذ التغييرات مقابل ملفات التغيير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches specs, tasks, and design using the openspec library, facilitating accurate change validation and inference from conversation context via the AskUserQuestion tool.","zh":"赋予代理验证实现是否符合规格、任务和设计，使用openspec库，通过AskUserQuestion工具从对话上下文中实现准确的更改验证和推理。","ja":"エージェントに実装が仕様、タスク、設計に一致することを検証する能力を与え、openspecライブラリを使用し、AskUserQuestionツールを介して会話のコンテキストから正確な変更の検証と推論を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 구현이 사양, 작업 및 설계와 일치하는지 확인할 수 있도록 하며, openspec 라이브러리를 사용하여 AskUserQuestion 도구를 통해 대화 컨텍스트에서 정확한 변경 사항의 검증 및 추론을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincide con las especificaciones, tareas y diseños utilizando la biblioteca openspec, lo que facilita la validación y la inferencia precisas de los cambios a partir del contexto de la conversación a través de la herramienta AskUserQuestion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux spécifications, tâches et conceptions en utilisant la bibliothèque openspec, ce qui facilite la validation et l''inférence précises des modifications à partir du contexte de la conversation via l''outil AskUserQuestion.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, die Implementierung mit Spezifikationen, Aufgaben und Designs unter Verwendung der openspec-Bibliothek zu überprüfen, wodurch eine genaue Änderungsvalidierung und -ableitung aus dem Konversationskontext über das Tool AskUserQuestion erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde às especificações, tarefas e design usando a biblioteca openspec, facilitando a validação precisa das alterações e inferência do contexto da conversa via a ferramenta AskUserQuestion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить, соответствует ли реализация спецификациям, задачам и дизайну, используя библиотеку openspec, что облегчает точную проверку изменений и вывод из контекста разговора с помощью инструмента AskUserQuestion.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع المواصفات والمهام والتصميم باستخدام مكتبة openspec، ويسهم في التحقق الدقيق للتغييرات الاستدلال من سياق المحادثة من خلال أداة AskUserQuestion."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying implementation against change specifications","Inferring change names from conversation context","Prompting users for change selection when necessary"],"zh":["验证实现是否符合更改规格","从对话上下文中推断更改名称","在必要时提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["実装が変更仕様と一致することを検証する","会話のコンテキストから変更名を推論する","必要に応じてユーザーに変更の選択を求める"],"ko":["구현이 변경 사양과 일치하는지 확인하기","대화 컨텍스트에서 변경 이름 추론하기","필요에 따라 사용자에게 변경 선택提示하기"],"es":["Verificar la implementación contra las especificaciones de cambio","Inferir los nombres de los cambios a partir del contexto de la conversación","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen los cambios cuando sea necesario"],"fr":["Vérifier l''implémentation par rapport aux spécifications de modification","Déduire les noms des modifications à partir du contexte de la conversation","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner les modifications lorsque cela est nécessaire"],"de":["Implementierung gegen Änderungsspezifikationen überprüfen","Änderungsnamen aus dem Konversationskontext ableiten","Benutzer auffordern, Änderungen auszuwählen, wenn dies erforderlich ist"],"pt":["Verificar a implementação contra especificações de alteração","Inferir nomes de alterações do contexto da conversa","Solicitar aos usuários a seleção de alterações quando necessário"],"ru":["Проверка реализации против спецификаций изменений","Вывод имен изменений из контекста разговора","Запрос к пользователям выбора изменений при необходимости"],"ar":["التحقق من التنفيذ مقابل مواصفات التغيير","استنتاج أسماء التغييرات من سياق المحادثة","طلب من المستخدمين اختيار التغييرات عند الحاجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec library installation","Needs access to conversation context for change inference","Limited to changes with implementation tasks"],"zh":["需要安装openspec库","需要访问对话上下文以进行更改推理","仅限于具有实现任务的更改"],"ja":["openspecライブラリのインストールが必要","会話のコンテキストへのアクセスが変更の推論に必要","実装タスクを持つ変更のみに限定される"],"ko":["openspec 라이브러리 설치 필요","대화 컨텍스트에 대한 액세스가 변경 추론에 필요","구현 작업이 있는 변경만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la biblioteca openspec","Necesita acceso al contexto de la conversación para la inferencia de cambios","Limitado a cambios con tareas de implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la bibliothèque openspec","A besoin d''un accès au contexte de la conversation pour l''inférence des modifications","Limité aux modifications avec des tâches d''implémentation"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der openspec-Bibliothek","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext für die Änderungsableitung","Begrenzt auf Änderungen mit Implementierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer a instalação da biblioteca openspec","Necessita de acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência de alterações","Limitado a alterações com tarefas de implementação"],"ru":["Требует установки библиотеки openspec","Требует доступа к контексту разговора для вывода изменений","Ограничен изменениями с задачами реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبة openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج التغييرات","محدود بالتغييرات التي تحتوي على مهام التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('liveloveapp/hashbrown/design-doc-interviewer', 'community', 'liveloveapp', 'hashbrown', 'liveloveapp/hashbrown', 'design-doc-interviewer', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:21:21.303Z', NULL, '{"id":"liveloveapp/hashbrown/design-doc-interviewer","name":"design-doc-interviewer","description":{"zh":"设计文档采访者是 Hashbrown 框架的一部分，用于快速创建设计文档。它通过短小的问答批次和进步式细化，获取所需的决策和细节","ja":"設計ドキュメントインタビュアーは Hashbrown フレームワークの一部で、設計ドキュメントを作成するために使用されます。短い質問バッチと進歩的な精製を通じて必要な決定と詳細を取得","ko":"디자인 문서 인터뷰어는 Hashbrown 프레임워크의 일부로, 디자인 문서를 신속하게 작성하는 데 사용됩니다. 짧은 질문 배치 및 진보적 세부화를 통해 필요한 결정 및 세부 사항을 얻을 수 있습니다","es":"El entrevistador de documentos de diseño es una herramienta que ayuda a crear documentos de diseño claros y concisos, utilizando preguntas breves y refinement progresivo","fr":"L''intervieweur de documents de conception est un outil qui aide à créer des documents de conception clairs et concis, en utilisant des questions courtes et un affinement progressif","de":"Der Design-Dokument-Interviewer ist ein Tool, das dabei hilft, klare und präzise Design-Dokumente zu erstellen, indem es kurze Fragen und progressive Verfeinerung verwendet","pt":"O Design Doc Interviewer é uma ferramenta para criar documentos de design claros e concisos, utilizando questionários numerados e refinamento progressivo","ru":"Design Doc Interviewer - это инструмент для создания четких и кратких документов дизайна, использующий пронумерованные вопросы и прогрессивное уточнение","ar":"مصاحب وثائق التصميم هو أداة لإنشاء وثائق التصميم الواضحة والموجزة، باستخدام استبيانات مرقمة وتصفية متطورة","en":"Hashbrown is a framework for building agents that run the browser. Built for Angular and React."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"设计文档采访者 - Hashbrown 框架","ja":"設計ドキュメントインタビュアー - Hashbrown フレームワーク","ko":"디자인 문서 인터뷰어 - Hashbrown 프레임워크","es":"Entrevistador de documentos de diseño","fr":"Intervieweur de documents de conception","de":"Design-Dokument-Interviewer","pt":"Design Doc Interviewer: Ferramenta de Documentação de Design","ru":"Design Doc Interviewer: Инструмент для создания документа...","ar":"مصاحب وثائق التصميم: أداة لإنشاء وثائق التصميم","en":"design-doc-interviewer"},"description":{"zh":"设计文档采访者是 Hashbrown 框架的一部分，用于快速创建设计文档。它通过短小的问答批次和进步式细化，获取所需的决策和细节","ja":"設計ドキュメントインタビュアーは Hashbrown フレームワークの一部で、設計ドキュメントを作成するために使用されます。短い質問バッチと進歩的な精製を通じて必要な決定と詳細を取得","ko":"디자인 문서 인터뷰어는 Hashbrown 프레임워크의 일부로, 디자인 문서를 신속하게 작성하는 데 사용됩니다. 짧은 질문 배치 및 진보적 세부화를 통해 필요한 결정 및 세부 사항을 얻을 수 있습니다","es":"El entrevistador de documentos de diseño es una herramienta que ayuda a crear documentos de diseño claros y concisos, utilizando preguntas breves y refinemen...","fr":"L''intervieweur de documents de conception est un outil qui aide à créer des documents de conception clairs et concis, en utilisant des questions courtes et u...","de":"Der Design-Dokument-Interviewer ist ein Tool, das dabei hilft, klare und präzise Design-Dokumente zu erstellen, indem es kurze Fragen und progressive Verfein...","pt":"O Design Doc Interviewer é uma ferramenta para criar documentos de design claros e concisos, utilizando questionários numerados e refinamento progressivo","ru":"Design Doc Interviewer - это инструмент для создания четких и кратких документов дизайна, использующий пронумерованные вопросы и прогрессивное уточнение","ar":"مصاحب وثائق التصميم هو أداة لإنشاء وثائق التصميم الواضحة والموجزة، باستخدام استبيانات مرقمة وتصفية متطورة","en":"Hashbrown is a framework for building agents that run the browser. Built for Angular and React."},"definition":{"en":"Hashbrown is a framework for building agents that run the browser. Built for Angular and React."},"features":{"zh":["快速创建设计文档","短小的问答批次","进步式细化","支持 Angular 和 React","可自定义模板"],"ja":["設計ドキュメントの迅速な作成","短い質問バッチ","進歩的な精製","Angular と React のサポート","カスタマイズ可能なテンプレート"],"ko":["디자인 문서의 신속한 작성","짧은 질문 배치","진보적 세부화","Angular 및 React 지원","사용자 정의 가능한 템플릿"],"es":["Elicitación de decisiones y detalles necesarios","Uso de preguntas breves y refinement progresivo","Alineación con el formato y alcance del documento","Identificación del paquete objetivo en el monorepo","Uso de plantillas y ejemplos para guiar el proceso"],"fr":["Élicitation des décisions et des détails nécessaires","Utilisation de questions courtes et d''un affinement progressif","Alignement sur le format et la portée du document","Identification du paquet cible dans le monorepo","Utilisation de modèles et d''exemples pour guider le processus"],"de":["Ermittlung der notwendigen Entscheidungen und Details","Verwendung von kurzen Fragen und progressiver Verfeinerung","Abstimmung auf das Format und den Umfang des Dokuments","Identifizierung des Ziel-Pakets im Monorepo","Verwendung von Vorlagen und Beispielen, um den Prozess zu leiten"],"pt":["Criação de documentos de design claros e concisos","Utilização de questionários numerados","Refinamento progressivo","Compatibilidade com Angular e React","Facilidade de uso para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Создание четких и кратких документов дизайна","Использование пронумерованных вопросов","Прогрессивное уточнение","Совместимость с Angular и React","Легкость использования для разработчиков"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق التصميم الواضحة والموجزة","استخدام استبيانات مرقمة","التصفية المتطورة","التوافق مع Angular و React","سهولة الاستخدام لمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计文档","Hashbrown 框架","Angular","React","设计文档采访者","快速创建设计文档","短小的问答批次","进步式细化"],"ja":["設計ドキュメント","Hashbrown フレームワーク","Angular","React","設計ドキュメントインタビュアー","設計ドキュメントの迅速な作成","短い質問バッチ","進歩的な精製"],"ko":["디자인 문서","Hashbrown 프레임워크","Angular","React","디자인 문서 인터뷰어","디자인 문서의 신속한 작성","짧은 질문 배치","진보적 세부화"],"es":["entrevistador de documentos de diseño","hashbrown","angular","react","documentos de diseño","desarrollo de software","herramientas de diseño","monorepo","plantillas de diseño"],"fr":["intervieweur de documents de conception","hashbrown","angular","react","documents de conception","développement de logiciels","outils de conception","monorepo","modèles de conception"],"de":["Design-Dokument-Interviewer","hashbrown","angular","react","Design-Dokumente","Software-Entwicklung","Design-Tools","Monorepo","Design-Vorlagen"],"pt":["design doc interviewer","documentação de design","ferramenta de design","desenvolvedores","angular","react","documentos de design","questionários numerados","refinamento progressivo"],"ru":["design doc interviewer","документация дизайна","инструмент дизайна","разработчики","angular","react","документы дизайна","пронумерованные вопросы","прогрессивное уточнение"],"ar":["مصاحب وثائق التصميم","وثائق التصميم","أداة التصميم","مطورين","angular","react","وثائق التصميم","استبيانات مرقمة","التصفية المتطورة"]}},"owner":"liveloveapp","repo":"hashbrown","repoPath":"liveloveapp/hashbrown","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-doc-interviewer","description":"Interview the user to turn a proposed product/engineering change into a structured design document. Use when the user asks to be interviewed, wants help clarifying a design, or wants a design doc produced from Q&A. Emphasize numbered questions (few at a time), capture requirements/constraints/UX/data/logic/testing, and output a clean design doc.","bodyPreview":"# Design Doc Interviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nElicit the minimum set of decisions and details needed to produce a clear design document, using short, numbered question batches and progressive refinement.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Align on format and scope\n\n- Ask for the intended audience, affected systems, and whether there is a preferred template or example to mirror.\n- If the user provided a sample doc, follow its section order and tone.\n- Identify the target package in this monorepo. If unclear, ask the","body":"# Design Doc Interviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nElicit the minimum set of decisions and details needed to produce a clear design document, using short, numbered question batches and progressive refinement.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Align on format and scope\n\n- Ask for the intended audience, affected systems, and whether there is a preferred template or example to mirror.\n- If the user provided a sample doc, follow its section order and tone.\n- Identify the target package in this monorepo. If unclear, ask the user to pick one of the packages managed here before proceeding.\n\n### 1.5) Pre-flight repo context\n\n- Search `design/*` with emphasis on `design/ideas/` for related context before asking detailed questions.\n- Summarize any relevant findings and confirm whether they should be incorporated.\n\n### 2) Run a structured interview in small batches\n\n- Ask **2–4 numbered questions per turn**.\n- Keep questions concise, unambiguous, and grouped by section.\n- After each response, confirm key points and update the working outline.\n\nUse the question bank when needed: `references/question-bank.md`.\n\n### 3) Draft the design doc incrementally\n\n- Populate sections as soon as sufficient information is available.\n- Mark unknowns as **Open Questions** rather than blocking progress.\n- Use the template for consistent structure: `references/design-doc-template.md`.\n\n### 4) Review for completeness and risk\n\n- Check for missing: goals/non-goals, data model/API changes, compatibility, rollout, testing.\n- Ask final clarifying questions only for high-impact gaps.\n\n### 5) Deliver the final document\n\n- Output a clean, single-pass doc with headings and code fences where needed.\n- Preserve the user’s terminology and system names.\n- Always save the final design doc at `design/{package}/` where `{package}` is a package managed in this monorepo. Create the directory if it does not exist.\n\n## Interview Style Rules\n\n- Number all questions.\n- Keep question batches small (2–4).\n- Prefer concrete, scenario-based prompts over abstract ones.\n- Avoid asking about sections the user explicitly scoped out.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/design-doc-template.md` for the canonical structure.\n- `references/question-bank.md` for section-specific prompts.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:21:21.303Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing structured design document generation for Angular and React applications.","zh":"非常适合需要为Angular和React应用程序生成结构化设计文档的技术写作代理。","ja":"AngularおよびReactアプリケーションの構造化設計文書生成を必要とするテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適。","ko":"Angular 및 React 애플리케이션에 구조화된 디자인 문서 생성이 필요한 기술 문서 작성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que necesitan generación de documentos de diseño estructurados para aplicaciones Angular y React.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Écriture Technique ayant besoin de génération de documents de conception structurés pour les applications Angular et React.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die strukturierte Designdokumentenerstellung für Angular- und React-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que precisam de geração de documentos de design estruturados para aplicações Angular e React.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации, которым требуется структурированная генерация документов по дизайну для приложений Angular и React.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكتابيين الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مستندات التصميم المنظمة لتطبيقات Angular و React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to elicit minimum sets of decisions and details using short, numbered question batches and progressive refinement, producing clear design documents with targeted scope and format alignment, potentially leveraging templates or examples.","zh":"使代理能够使用短的、编号的问卷批次和渐进的细化，获取最小的决策和详细信息，从而生成清晰的设计文档，目标范围和格式对齐，并可能利用模板或示例。","ja":"エージェントが短い番号付きの質問バッチと進歩的な洗練を使用して、最小限の決定と詳細を引き出して、ターゲット範囲とフォーマットの整列をもって明確な設計文書を生成できるようにし、テンプレートや例を利用することができる。","ko":"에이전트가 짧은 번호가 매겨진 질문 배치와 점진적인 세부 정보를 사용하여 최소한의 결정과 세부 정보를 유도하여, 대상 범위 및 형식 정렬을 갖춘 명확한 디자인 문서를 생성할 수 있으며, 템플릿 또는 예제를 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a obtener conjuntos mínimos de decisiones y detalles utilizando lotes de preguntas numeradas cortas y refinamiento progresivo, produciendo documentos de diseño claros con alcance y alineación de formato objetivo, potencialmente aprovechando plantillas o ejemplos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''obtenir des ensembles minimaux de décisions et de détails en utilisant des lots de questions numérotées courtes et un affinement progressif, produisant des documents de conception clairs avec une portée et une alignement de format ciblés, en exploitant potentiellement des modèles ou des exemples.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, minimale Entscheidungs- und Detailmengen unter Verwendung kurzer, nummerierter Fragebatches und fortschreitender Verfeinerung zu ermitteln, um klare Designdokumente mit gezieltem Umfang und Formatanpassung zu erstellen, möglicherweise unter Nutzung von Vorlagen oder Beispielen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a obter conjuntos mínimos de decisões e detalhes usando lotes de perguntas numeradas curtas e refinamento progressivo, produzindo documentos de design claros com alinhamento de escopo e formato direcionado, potencialmente utilizando modelos ou exemplos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получать минимальные наборы решений и деталей с помощью небольших пронумерованных пакетов вопросов и прогрессивного уточнения, производя четкие документы по дизайну с целевым объемом и выравниванием формата, потенциально используя шаблоны или примеры.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الحصول على مجموعات قوائم قرارات و تفاصيل باستخدام دفعات من الأسئلة المختصرة و المرقمة و التطوير التدريجي ، لإنتاج مستندات التصميم الواضحة مع صياغة نطاق و تنسيق موجه ، ربما باستخدام قوالب أو أمثلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating design document creation for monorepo packages","Generating clear documentation for affected systems","Refining design details through iterative questioning"],"zh":["自动为monorepo包生成设计文档","生成受影响系统的清晰文档","通过迭代提问来细化设计细节"],"ja":["monorepoパッケージの設計文書の自動生成","影響を受けるシステムの明確な文書の生成","設計詳細の洗練を繰り返し質問を通じて行う"],"ko":["monorepo 패키지에 대한 디자인 문서 자동 생성","영향을 받는 시스템에 대한 명확한 문서 생성","반복적인 질문을 통해 디자인 세부 정보의 세부화를 수행"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de documentos de diseño para paquetes monorepo","Generación de documentación clara para sistemas afectados","Refinamiento de detalles de diseño a través de preguntas iterativas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de documents de conception pour les packages monorepo","Génération d''une documentation claire pour les systèmes affectés","Affinement des détails de conception via des questions itératives"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Designdokumenten für Monorepo-Pakete","Erzeugung klarer Dokumentation für betroffene Systeme","Verfeinerung von Designdetails durch iterative Befragung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de documentos de design para pacotes monorepo","Gerar documentação clara para sistemas afetados","Aperfeiçoar detalhes de design por meio de questionamento iterativo"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания документов по дизайну для пакетов monorepo","Генерация четкой документации для затронутых систем","Уточнение деталей дизайна посредством итеративного вопроса"],"ar":["تحسين إنشاء مستندات التصميم للأحزمة monorepo","توليد توثيق واضح للنظم المتأثرة","تعدين تفاصيل التصميم من خلال الاستفهام التكراري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for intended audience and scope","Limited to Angular and React frameworks","Dependent on Hashbrown framework for browser-based agent execution"],"zh":["需要用户输入预期受众和范围","仅限于Angular和React框架","依赖于Hashbrown框架进行浏览器基于的代理执行"],"ja":["意図された対象者と範囲のユーザー入力を必要とする","AngularおよびReactフレームワークのみに限定","ブラウザーベースのエージェント実行のためHashbrownフレームワークに依存"],"ko":["예상 대중과 범위에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요함","Angular 및 React 프레임워크에만 국한됨","브라우저 기반 에이전트 실행을 위해 Hashbrown 프레임워크에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario para audiencia y alcance previstos","Limitado a los marcos Angular y React","Dependiente del marco Hashbrown para la ejecución del agente basado en navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour le public et la portée prévus","Limité aux cadres Angular et React","Dépendant du cadre Hashbrown pour l''exécution de l''agent basé sur le navigateur"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingabe für die vorgesehene Zielgruppe und den Umfang","Begrenzt auf Angular- und React-Frameworks","Abhängig vom Hashbrown-Framework für die browserbasierte Agentenausführung"],"pt":["Exige entrada do usuário para público-alvo e escopo pretendidos","Limitado a estruturas Angular e React","Dependente do framework Hashbrown para execução de agente baseada em navegador"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для предполагаемой аудитории и объема","Ограничен фреймворками Angular и React","Зависит от фреймворка Hashbrown для выполнения агента на основе браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم للجمهور والمدى المقصود","محدود بالإطارات Angular و React","يعتمد على إطار Hashbrown لتنفيذ الوكيل القائم على المتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
