ead Inspector: أداة قراءة μεταداتا GitHub","en":"gh-read-inspector"},"description":{"zh":"gh-read-inspector技能用于GitHub元数据的读取操作，支持issue和PR详情的查看","ja":"gh-read-inspectorスキルはGitHubメタデータの読み取り操作に使用され、issueとPRの詳細を閲覧できます","ko":"gh-read-inspector 스킬은 GitHub 메타데이터의 읽기 작업에 사용되며 issue와 PR의 세부 정보를 조회할 수 있습니다","es":"gh-read-inspector es una herramienta para buscar metadatos de GitHub, diseñada para ser utilizada con el comando gh-read-inspector.py","fr":"gh-read-inspector est un outil de recherche de métadonnées GitHub, conçu pour être utilisé avec la commande gh-read-inspector.py","de":"gh-read-inspector ist ein Werkzeug zur Suche nach GitHub-Metadaten, das für die Verwendung mit dem Befehl gh-read-inspector.py entwickelt wurde","pt":"O GH Read Inspector é uma ferramenta para busca de metadados do GitHub, projetada para ser usada apenas para leitura, sem operações de gravação.","ru":"GH Read Inspector - это инструмент для поиска метаданных GitHub, предназначенный только для чтения, без операций записи.","ar":"GH Read Inspector هو أداة للبحث عن μεταداتا في GitHub، مصممة للاستخدام فقط للقراءة، دون عمليات الكتابة.","en":"Eclipse RDF4J: scalable RDF for Java"},"definition":{"en":"Eclipse RDF4J: scalable RDF for Java"},"features":{"zh":["支持issue详情的查看","支持PR详情的查看","仅支持读取操作","需要安装GitHub CLI","使用python脚本进行操作","支持多种仓库的元数据查看"],"ja":["issueの詳細を閲覧できます","PRの詳細を閲覧できます","読み取りのみをサポートします","GitHub CLIのインストールが必要です","pythonスクリプトを使用して操作します","複数のリポジトリのメタデータを閲覧できます"],"ko":["issue 세부 정보를 조회할 수 있습니다","PR 세부 정보를 조회할 수 있습니다","읽기 전용을 지원합니다","GitHub CLI 설치가 필요합니다","python 스크립트를 사용하여 작업합니다","여러 저장소의 메타데이터를 조회할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Búsqueda de metadatos de GitHub","Uso del comando gh-read-inspector.py","Compatibilidad con GitHub CLI","Recuperación de información de repositorios y problemas","Seguridad y eficiencia en la búsqueda de metadatos"],"fr":["Recherche de métadonnées GitHub","Utilisation de la commande gh-read-inspector.py","Compatibilité avec GitHub CLI","Récupération d''informations sur les référentiels et les problèmes","Sécurité et efficacité dans la recherche de métadonnées"],"de":["Suche nach GitHub-Metadaten","Verwendung des Befehls gh-read-inspector.py","Kompatibilität mit GitHub CLI","Wiederherstellung von Informationen über Repositorys und Probleme","Sicherheit und Effizienz bei der Suche nach Metadaten"],"pt":["Busca de metadados do GitHub","Leitura de detalhes de issues","Leitura de detalhes de pull requests","Sem operações de gravação","Uso da linha de comando do GitHub"],"ru":["Поиск метаданных GitHub","Чтение деталей issues","Чтение деталей pull requests","Без операций записи","Использование командной строки GitHub"],"ar":["بحث عن μεταداتا في GitHub","قراءة تفاصيل Issues","قراءة تفاصيل Pull Requests","دون عمليات الكتابة","استخدام سطر الأوامر في GitHub"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub元数据","gh-read-inspector","issue详情","PR详情","GitHub CLI","python脚本","读取操作","仓库元数据"],"ja":["GitHubメタデータ","gh-read-inspector","issueの詳細","PRの詳細","GitHub CLI","pythonスクリプト","読み取り操作","リポジトリのメタデータ"],"ko":["GitHub 메타데이터","gh-read-inspector","issue 세부 정보","PR 세부 정보","GitHub CLI","python 스크립트","읽기 작업","저장소 메타데이터"],"es":["gh-read-inspector","búsqueda de metadatos","GitHub","GitHub CLI","repositorios","problemas","seguridad","eficiencia"],"fr":["gh-read-inspector","recherche de métadonnées","GitHub","GitHub CLI","référentiels","problèmes","sécurité","efficacité"],"de":["gh-read-inspector","Suche nach Metadaten","GitHub","GitHub CLI","Repositorys","Probleme","Sicherheit","Effizienz"],"pt":["GH Read Inspector","GitHub","metadados","leitura","desenvolvimento","ferramenta","linha de comando","issues","pull requests"],"ru":["GH Read Inspector","GitHub","метаданные","чтение","разработка","инструмент","командная строка","issues","pull requests"],"ar":["GH Read Inspector","GitHub","метадата","قراءة","تطوير","أداة","سطر الأوامر","Issues","Pull Requests"]}},"owner":"eclipse-rdf4j","repo":"rdf4j","repoPath":"eclipse-rdf4j/rdf4j","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-read-inspector","description":"Retrieve GitHub issues, pull requests, and milestones with read-only, whitelisted `gh` commands only. Use when you need complete issue or PR context, need to resolve a PR from commit ID/PR ID/issue ID, fetch milestone metadata, or list all issues in a milestone (labels, status, assignees, and related fields).","bodyPreview":"# gh-read-inspector\n\nUse this skill for GitHub metadata lookup only. No write operations.\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Use only `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py ...`.\n- Do not run ad-hoc `gh` commands from this skill.\n- If `gh` is missing, stop and ask the user to install GitHub CLI (`https://cli.github.com/`).\n\n## Commands\n\n- Issue details:\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py issue --repo owner/repo --issue 123`\n- PR details by PR","body":"# gh-read-inspector\n\nUse this skill for GitHub metadata lookup only. No write operations.\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Use only `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py ...`.\n- Do not run ad-hoc `gh` commands from this skill.\n- If `gh` is missing, stop and ask the user to install GitHub CLI (`https://cli.github.com/`).\n\n## Commands\n\n- Issue details:\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py issue --repo owner/repo --issue 123`\n- PR details by PR number:\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py pr --repo owner/repo --pr 123`\n- PR details by issue number:\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py pr --repo owner/repo --issue 123`\n- PR details by commit SHA:\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py pr --repo owner/repo --commit <sha>`\n- Milestone details (number or exact title):\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py milestone --repo owner/repo --milestone 7`\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py milestone --repo owner/repo --milestone \"Release 4.3\"`\n- Milestone issues:\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py milestone-issues --repo owner/repo --milestone 7 --state all`\n- Show exact whitelist:\n  - `python3 .codex/skills/gh-read-inspector/scripts/gh_read_inspector.py whitelist`\n\n## Whitelist\n\nThe script can execute only these command templates:\n\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/issues/{issue}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/issues/{issue}/comments?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/issues/{issue}/events?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json,application/vnd.github.mockingbird-preview+json\" /repos/{repo}/issues/{issue}/timeline?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/pulls/{pr}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/issues/{pr}/comments?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/pulls/{pr}/reviews?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/pulls/{pr}/comments?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/issues/{pr}/events?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/pulls/{pr}/commits?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/pulls/{pr}/files?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/commits/{commit}/pulls?per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/commits/{commit}/check-runs`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/commits/{commit}/status`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/milestones/{milestone}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/milestones?state=all&per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n- `gh api -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" /repos/{repo}/issues?milestone={milestone}&state={state}&per_page={per_page}&page={page}`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:21:08.400Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub Integration Agents needing metadata lookup capabilities using the GitHub CLI and Python 3","zh":"适用于需要使用 GitHub CLI 和 Python 3 进行元数据查找的 GitHub 集成代理","ja":"GitHub CLI と Python 3 を使用したメタデータの検索機能が必要な GitHub 統合エージェントに適しています","ko":"GitHub CLI와 Python 3를 사용하여 메타데이터 조회 기능이 필요한 GitHub 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Integración de GitHub que necesitan capacidades de búsqueda de metadatos utilizando la CLI de GitHub y Python 3","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intégration GitHub nécessitant des capacités de recherche de métadonnées à l''aide de la CLI GitHub et de Python 3","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-Integration-Agenten, die Metadaten-Suchfunktionen über die GitHub-CLI und Python 3 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração do GitHub que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa de metadados usando o GitHub CLI e Python 3","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции GitHub, которым необходимы возможности поиска метаданных с использованием GitHub CLI и Python 3","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق إدماج GitHub الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات البحث عن البيانات الوصفية باستخدام GitHub CLI و Python 3"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform GitHub metadata lookup using the `gh` command-line tool and Python scripts, providing issue details and PR information through the `gh_read_inspector.py` script, utilizing protocols like GitHub API","zh":"赋予代理使用 `gh` 命令行工具和 Python 脚本执行 GitHub 元数据查找的能力，通过 `gh_read_inspector.py` 脚本提供问题详情和 PR 信息，利用 GitHub API 等协议","ja":"エージェントが `gh` コマンドラインツールと Python スクリプトを使用して GitHub のメタデータ検索を実行できるようにし、`gh_read_inspector.py` スクリプトを介して問題の詳細と PR 情報を提供し、GitHub API などのプロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 `gh` 명령줄 도구와 Python 스크립트를 사용하여 GitHub 메타데이터 조회를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, `gh_read_inspector.py` 스크립트를 통해 문제 세부 정보와 PR 정보를 제공하며, GitHub API 등의 프로토콜을 활용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar búsquedas de metadatos de GitHub usando la herramienta de línea de comandos `gh` y scripts de Python, proporcionando detalles de problemas e información de PR a través del script `gh_read_inspector.py`, utilizando protocolos como la API de GitHub","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des recherches de métadonnées GitHub à l''aide de l''outil de ligne de commande `gh` et de scripts Python, fournissant des détails de problèmes et des informations de PR via le script `gh_read_inspector.py`, en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''API GitHub","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, GitHub-Metadaten mit dem `gh`-Befehlszeilenwerkzeug und Python-Skripten zu suchen, wobei ProblemDetails und PR-Informationen über das Skript `gh_read_inspector.py` bereitgestellt werden, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie der GitHub-API","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar a pesquisa de metadados do GitHub usando a ferramenta de linha de comando `gh` e scripts Python, fornecendo detalhes de problema e informações de PR por meio do script `gh_read_inspector.py`, utilizando protocolos como a API do GitHub","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнить поиск метаданных GitHub с использованием инструмента командной строки `gh` и скриптов Python, обеспечивая предоставление деталей проблемы и информации о PR посредством скрипта `gh_read_inspector.py`, используя протоколы như GitHub API","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إجراء بحث البيانات الوصفية لجيت هاب باستخدام أداة سطر الأوامر `gh` وبرامج نصية بايثون، وتوفير تفاصيل المشكلة ومعلومات طلب السحب عبر برنامج `gh_read_inspector.py` ، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هاب"},"useCases":{"en":["Retrieving issue details by repository and issue number","Fetching PR details by PR number","Automating GitHub metadata lookup for repository owners"],"zh":["按仓库和问题编号检索问题详情","按 PR 编号获取 PR 详情","自动化 GitHub 元数据查找以供仓库所有者使用"],"ja":["リポジトリと問題番号によって問題の詳細を取得する","PR 番号によって PR の詳細を取得する","リポジトリ所有者のために GitHub のメタデータ検索を自動化する"],"ko":["저장소와 문제 번호로 문제 세부 정보를检索","PR 번호로 PR 세부 정보를 가져오기","저장소 소유자를 위해 GitHub 메타데이터 조회를 자동화"],"es":["Recuperar detalles de problemas por repositorio y número de problema","Recuperar detalles de PR por número de PR","Automatizar la búsqueda de metadatos de GitHub para propietarios de repositorios"],"fr":["Récupérer les détails des problèmes par référentiel et numéro de problème","Récupérer les détails des PR par numéro de PR","Automatiser la recherche de métadonnées GitHub pour les propriétaires de référentiels"],"de":["Abrufen von Problemdetails nach Repository und Problemmnummer","Abrufen von PR-Details nach PR-Nummer","Automatisieren der GitHub-Metadatensuche für Repository-Besitzer"],"pt":["Recuperar detalhes do problema por repositório e número do problema","Buscar detalhes do PR por número do PR","Automatizar a pesquisa de metadados do GitHub para proprietários de repositórios"],"ru":["Получение деталей проблемы по репозиторию и номеру проблемы","Получение деталей PR по номеру PR","Автоматизация поиска метаданных GitHub для владельцев репозиториев"],"ar":["استرجاع تفاصيل المشكلة من خلال المستودع ورقم المشكلة","استرجاع تفاصيل طلب السحب من خلال رقم طلب السحب","توفير بحث البيانات الوصفية تلقائيًا لمالكي المستودعات على جيت هاب"]},"limitations":{"en":["No write operations allowed","Requires GitHub CLI installation","Python 3 environment required"],"zh":["不允许写操作","需要安装 GitHub CLI","需要 Python 3 环境"],"ja":["書き込み操作は許可されない","GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","Python 3 の環境が必要"],"ko":["쓰기 작업을 허용하지 않음","GitHub CLI 설치가 필요","Python 3 환경이 필요"],"es":["No se permiten operaciones de escritura","Se requiere la instalación de la CLI de GitHub","Se requiere un entorno de Python 3"],"fr":["Aucune opération d''écriture n''est autorisée","L''installation de la CLI GitHub est requise","Un environnement Python 3 est requis"],"de":["Keine Schreiboperationen erlaubt","GitHub-CLI-Installation erforderlich","Python-3-Umgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Não são permitidas operações de gravação","Requer instalação do GitHub CLI","Ambiente Python 3 necessário"],"ru":["Операции записи не допускаются","Требуется установка GitHub CLI","Требуется среда Python 3"],"ar":["لا يسمح بالكتابات","يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر أوامر جيت هاب","يتطلب بيئة بايثون 3"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
