 de plusieurs domaines"],"de":["Initialisierung durch das Lesen der Fähigkeitsregistrierungsdatei","Anpassung des Verhaltens je nach Domäne","Bietet Beratung in Forschung und Experimentierung","Hilft bei der Problemlösung","Unterstützung für mehrere Domänen"],"pt":["Otimização de experimentos","Melhoria da tomada de decisões","Análise de relatórios de experimentos","Guia de solução de problemas","Personalização de comportamento"],"ru":["Оптимизация экспериментов","Улучшение принятия решений","Анализ отчетов об экспериментах","Руководство по решению проблем","Настройка поведения"],"ar":["تحسين التجارب","تحسين اتخاذ القرارات","تحليل تقارير التجارب","دليل حل المشكلات","تخصيص السلوك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Domain Advisor","技术技能","开发建议","开发规划","注册表","适应行为"],"ja":["ドメインアドバイザー","技術スキル","開発提案","開発計画","レジストリ","動作の適応"],"ko":["도메인 고문","기술 스킬","개발 제안","개발 계획","레지스트리","행동의 적응"],"es":["asesor de dominio","habilidad de asesoramiento","investigación","experimentación","resolución de problemas","dominio de investigación","dominio de experimentación"],"fr":["conseiller de domaine","compétence d''orientation","recherche","expérimentation","résolution de problèmes","domaine de recherche","domaine d''expérimentation"],"de":["Domain-Berater","Fähigkeit zur Beratung","Forschung","Experimentierung","Problemlösung","Forschungsdomäne","Experimentierdomäne"],"pt":["domain-advisor","otimização de experimentos","tomada de decisões","análise de relatórios","solução de problemas","personalização de comportamento"],"ru":["domain-advisor","оптимизация экспериментов","принятие решений","анализ отчетов","решение проблем","настройка поведения"],"ar":["domain-advisor","تحسين التجارب","اتخاذ القرارات","تحليل التقارير","حل المشكلات","تخصيص السلوك"]}},"owner":"Erland366","repo":"transformers_playground","repoPath":"Erland366/transformers_playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"domain-advisor","description":">","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Skill: domain-advisor\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The user message starts with `<advise>`, or\n- The user asks \"What should we try next?\" or similar planning questions.\n\n## Initialization\n\n1. Read `.codex/skills/registry.json` to determine:\n   - `domain`: research | unsloth | cuda\n   - `paths.reports`: where to find experiment/benchmark reports\n   - `paths.experiment_log`: path to experiment log\n   - `paths.troubleshooting`: path to troubleshooting guide\n\n2. Adapt behavior based on","body":"# Skill: domain-advisor\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The user message starts with `<advise>`, or\n- The user asks \"What should we try next?\" or similar planning questions.\n\n## Initialization\n\n1. Read `.codex/skills/registry.json` to determine:\n   - `domain`: research | unsloth | cuda\n   - `paths.reports`: where to find experiment/benchmark reports\n   - `paths.experiment_log`: path to experiment log\n   - `paths.troubleshooting`: path to troubleshooting guide\n\n2. Adapt behavior based on domain (see Domain-Specific Behavior below).\n\n## Inputs\n\n- User goal (including constraints like run budget, hardware, time).\n- Optional references to files (configs, reports, logs) mentioned in the goal.\n\n## Behavior\n\n1. **Understand the goal**\n   - Parse the research/development goal and constraints.\n   - If unclear, ask a concise clarifying question.\n\n2. **Gather context**\n   - Scan `.codex/skills/` for **relevant result skills** matching the task.\n   - Read relevant reports from the `paths.reports` directory.\n   - Skim recent entries in `paths.experiment_log`.\n   - If errors are mentioned, check `paths.troubleshooting` for known patterns.\n\n3. **Propose a plan**\n   - Design **2–5 concrete experiments/tasks**, each with:\n     - Clear objective\n     - Key configuration/parameters\n     - Expected outcome or hypothesis\n     - Any relevant variation to test\n   - Respect constraints (budget, hardware, time).\n   - **Reuse defaults** from existing skills instead of inventing new ones.\n\n4. **Output format**\n   - Start with a short natural-language summary.\n   - Provide a markdown table:\n\n     | id | description | key_differences | notes |\n     |----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n\n   - Optionally propose file paths for configs or reports to create.\n   - If errors were mentioned, explain how this plan avoids known failure patterns.\n\n5. **Logging**\n   - When useful, append a short entry to `paths.experiment_log` summarizing\n     the proposed plan (only with user approval).\n\n---\n\n## Domain-Specific Behavior\n\n### Research Domain\n\nWhen `domain: research`:\n\n**Focus areas:**\n- Hyperparameter sweeps (learning rate, batch size, epochs)\n- Model architecture variations (layers, dimensions, attention heads)\n- Dataset mixtures and sampling strategies\n- Training dynamics (warmup, schedulers, checkpointing)\n\n**Context to gather:**\n- `training_reports/*.md` - past training runs\n- Model configs and their performance\n- Loss curves and convergence patterns\n\n**Output emphasis:**\n- Parameter sweep tables with specific values\n- Ablation study designs\n- Baseline comparisons\n\n### Unsloth Domain\n\nWhen `domain: unsloth`:\n\n**Focus areas:**\n- LoRA rank and alpha selection\n- Quantization settings (4-bit, 8-bit, nf4)\n- Gradient checkpointing configuration\n- Fine-tuning hyperparameters for specific model families\n- Memory optimization strategies\n\n**Context to gather:**\n- `training_reports/*.md` - past fine-tuning runs\n- Model-specific Unsloth configurations\n- Memory usage patterns\n\n**Output emphasis:**\n- LoRA configuration recommendations\n- Memory/speed tradeoffs\n- Model-specific settings (Llama, Mistral, Qwen, etc.)\n\n### CUDA Domain\n\nWhen `domain: cuda`:\n\n**Focus areas:**\n- Tiling strategies and block sizes\n- Shared memory usage patterns\n- Warp-level primitives\n- Memory coalescing optimization\n- Triton autotuning configurations\n\n**Context to gather:**\n- `benchmark_results/*.md` - past kernel benchmarks\n- Profiling data (nsight, ncu reports)\n- Bandwidth and occupancy metrics\n\n**Output emphasis:**\n- Kernel configuration parameters\n- Expected speedup estimates\n- Memory access pattern recommendations\n- Profiling metrics to track\n\n---\n\n## Example Output\n\n### Research Example\n\n```markdown\n## Experiment Plan: Attention Head Ablation\n\nBased on previous runs in `training_reports/baseline-2025-01.md`, the 8-head\nconfiguration achieved 92% accuracy. Testing whether fewer heads can match\nthis with lower compute.\n\n| id | description | key_differences | notes |\n|----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n| A1 | 4-head attention | heads=4 vs baseline 8 | Test if 4 heads sufficient |\n| A2 | 6-head attention | heads=6 | Middle ground |\n| A3 | 4-head + wider FFN | heads=4, ffn_dim=4096 | Compensate with FFN |\n\nAll runs use: lr=1e-4, batch_size=32, epochs=10 (from baseline config).\n```\n\n### Unsloth Example\n\n```markdown\n## Fine-tuning Plan: Llama-3 8B with Unsloth\n\nBased on `training_reports/llama3-lora-v1.md`, rank=16 showed good results\nbut OOM''d at batch_size=4. Testing memory-efficient configurations.\n\n| id | description | key_differences | notes |\n|----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n| U1 | rank=8 + grad_ckpt | Lower rank, enable checkpointing | Memory baseline |\n| U2 | rank=16 + 4bit | Full rank with 4-bit quantization | Quality vs memory |\n| U3 | rank=32 + offload | Higher rank with CPU offload | Max quality attempt |\n\nAll runs use: alpha=32, dropout=0.05, target_modules=[\"q_proj\", \"v_proj\"]\n```\n\n### CUDA Example\n\n```markdown\n## Kernel Optimization Plan: Softmax\n\nBased on `benchmark_results/softmax-v1.md`, current implementation achieves\n80% of theoretical bandwidth. Testing tiling strategies.\n\n| id | description | key_differences | notes |\n|----|-------------|-----------------|-------|\n| K1 | 2D tiling | BLOCK_M=64, BLOCK_N=64 | Better L2 reuse |\n| K2 | Warp reduction | Use warp shuffles | Reduce shared mem |\n| K3 | Online softmax | Single-pass algorithm | Fused with attention |\n\nProfile with: `ncu --set full` to capture memory metrics.\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:21:01.963Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code that require strategic planning and domain-specific guidance.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code这样的AI代理，它们需要战略规划和特定领域的指导。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeなどの戦略的計画とドメイン固有のガイダンスを必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 전략적 계획 및 특정 도메인 지침이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code que requieren planificación estratégica y orientación específica del dominio.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code qui nécessitent une planification stratégique et des conseils spécifiques au domaine.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die strategische Planung und domänen-spezifische Anleitung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code que requerem planejamento estratégico e orientação específica de domínio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, которые требуют стратегического планирования и домен-специфического руководства.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code الذي يتطلب التخطيط الاستراتيجي والتوجيه المحدد للنطاق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide expert advice based on registry.json configurations, leveraging paths to reports, experiment logs, and troubleshooting guides for informed decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理提供基于registry.json配置的专家建议的能力，利用路径到报告、实验日志和故障排除指南进行明智的决策。","ja":"レジストリ.json構成に基づく専門家のアドバイスを提供するエージェントをEmpower化し、報告書、実験ログ、およびトラブルシューティングガイドへのパスを利用して情報に基づいた意思決定を行う。","ko":"registry.json 구성에 기반한 전문가 조언을 제공하는 에이전트를 Empower화하며, 보고서, 실험 로그 및 문제 해결 가이드로의 경로를 활용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정を行う.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para proporcionar asesoramiento experto basado en configuraciones de registry.json, aprovechando rutas a informes, registros de experimentos y guías de solución de problemas para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des conseils d''experts basés sur les configurations de registry.json, en exploitant les chemins d''accès aux rapports, journaux d''expériences et guides de dépannage pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, auf Basis von registry.json-Konfigurationen Expertenrat zu geben, indem es Pfade zu Berichten, Experimentprotokollen und Fehlersuche-Anleitungen für fundierte Entscheidungen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer conselhos especializados com base em configurações registry.json, aproveitando caminhos para relatórios, logs de experimentos e guias de solução de problemas para tomar decisões informadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять экспертные советы на основе конфигураций registry.json, используя пути к отчетам, журналам экспериментов и руководствам по устранению неполадок для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقديم مشورة خبيرة بالاعتماد على تكوينات registry.json، واستخدام مسارات إلى تقارير وسجلات تجارب وإرشادات لتحليل الأخطاء لاتخاذ قرارات مدروسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating experiment planning by analyzing past reports","Generating next-step recommendations based on user queries","Debugging issues using the troubleshooting guide and experiment log"],"zh":["通过分析过去的报告来自动化实验规划","根据用户查询生成下一步的建议","使用故障排除指南和实验日志来调试问题"],"ja":["過去のレポートを分析して実験計画を自動化する","ユーザー照会に基づいて次のステップの推奨事項を生成する","トラブルシューティングガイドと実験ログを使用して問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["과거 보고서를 분석하여 실험 계획을 자동화하는 것","사용자 쿼리에 기반한 다음 단계의 추천을 생성하는 것","문제 해결 가이드 및 실험 로그를 사용하여 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de experimentos mediante el análisis de informes anteriores","Generación de recomendaciones de siguiente paso en función de las consultas de los usuarios","Depuración de problemas utilizando la guía de solución de problemas y el registro de experimentos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification d''expériences en analysant les rapports antérieurs","Génération de recommandations de prochaines étapes en fonction des requêtes des utilisateurs","Débogage des problèmes en utilisant le guide de dépannage et le journal d''expériences"],"de":["Automatisierung der Experimentplanung durch Analyse vorheriger Berichte","Generierung von Empfehlungen für den nächsten Schritt basierend auf Benutzeranfragen","Fehlersuche mithilfe der Fehlersuche-Anleitung und des Experimentprotokolls"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de experimentos analisando relatórios anteriores","Gerar recomendações de próxima etapa com base em consultas de usuário","Depurar problemas usando o guia de solução de problemas e log de experimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование экспериментов путем анализа предыдущих отчетов","Генерировать рекомендации по следующему шагу на основе запросов пользователей","Отладить проблемы с помощью руководства по устранению неполадок и журнала эксперимента"],"ar":["تحسين تخطيط التجارب عن طريق تحليل التقارير السابقة","توليد توصيات للخطوة التالية بالاعتماد على استفسارات المستخدم","تصحيح الأخطاء باستخدام دليل تحليل الأخطاء وسجل التجربة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to .codex/skills/registry.json","Dependent on specific domain configurations (research, unsloth, cuda)","Needs file system access to read reports and logs"],"zh":["需要访问.codox/skills/registry.json","依赖于特定领域的配置（研究、unsloth、cuda）","需要文件系统访问来读取报告和日志"],"ja":[".codex/skills/registry.jsonへのアクセスが必要","特定のドメイン構成（研究、unsloth、cuda）に依存","レポートとログを読み取るためにファイルシステムアクセスが必要"],"ko":[".codex/skills/registry.json에 대한 액세스가 필요함","특정 도메인 구성(연구, unsloth, cuda)에 의존","보고서 및 로그를 읽기 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a .codex/skills/registry.json","Depende de configuraciones de dominio específicas (investigación, unsloth, cuda)","Necesita acceso al sistema de archivos para leer informes y registros"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à .codex/skills/registry.json","Dépend de configurations de domaine spécifiques (recherche, unsloth, cuda)","A besoin d''un accès au système de fichiers pour lire les rapports et les journaux"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf .codex/skills/registry.json","Hängt von bestimmten Domänenkonfigurationen (Forschung, unsloth, cuda) ab","Benötigt Dateisystemzugriff, um Berichte und Protokolle zu lesen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a .codex/skills/registry.json","Dependente de configurações de domínio específicas (pesquisa, unsloth, cuda)","Necessita acesso ao sistema de arquivos para ler relatórios e logs"],"ru":["Требует доступа к .codex/skills/registry.json","Зависит от конкретных конфигураций домена (исследование, unsloth, cuda)","Требует доступа к файловой системе для чтения отчетов и журналов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى .codex/skills/registry.json","يعتمد على تكوينات نطاق محددة (بحث، unsloth، cuda)","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لقراءة التقارير والسجلات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('moorestech/moorestech/validate-schema', 'community', 'moorestech', 'moorestech', 'moorestech/moorestech', 'validate-schema', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:21:33.384Z', NULL, '{"id":"moorestech/moorestech/validate-schema","name":"validate-schema","description":{"zh":"validate-schema技能用于自动化工厂游戏中的模式验证，确保数据一致性和防止运行时错误","ja":"validate-schemaスキルは、自動化ファクトリーゲームにおけるスキーマの検証を実行し、データの一貫性を確保し、実行時エラーを防ぎます","ko":"validate-schema 스킬은 자동화 공장 게임에서 스키마를 검증하여 데이터 일관성을 보장하고 실행 시 오류를 방지합니다","es":"La validación de esquemas es crucial para evitar errores en tiempo de ejecución. Nuestra guía te muestra cómo hacerlo de forma automática.","fr":"La validation de schéma est cruciale pour éviter les erreurs à l''exécution. Notre guide vous montre comment le faire de manière automatisée.","de":"Die Validierung von Schemata ist entscheidend, um Laufzeitfehler zu vermeiden. Unsere Anleitung zeigt Ihnen, wie Sie dies automatisch tun können.","pt":"Guia de verificação de esquema para desenvolvedores, com mapeamento de esquema para validador","ru":"Руководство по проверке схемы для разработчиков, с сопоставлением схемы и проверяющего","ar":"دليل للتحقق من مخطط الجدول لمطوري البرمجيات، مع対応 بين مخطط الجدول ومدقق","en":"Animated open world automated factory game"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"validate-schema技能：自动化工厂游戏中的模式验证","ja":"validate-schemaスキル：自動化ファクトリーゲームにおけるスキーマの検証","ko":"validate-schema 스킬: 자동화 공장 게임의 스키마 유효성 검사","es":"Validación de esquemas automatizada","fr":"Validation de schéma automatisée","de":"Automatisierte Schema-Validierung","pt":"Validação de Esquema Automática","ru":"Автоматическая проверка схемы","ar":"التحقق التلقائي من مخطط الجدول","en":"validate-schema"},"description":{"zh":"validate-schema技能用于自动化工厂游戏中的模式验证，确保数据一致性和防止运行时错误","ja":"validate-schemaスキルは、自動化ファクトリーゲームにおけるスキーマの検証を実行し、データの一貫性を確保し、実行時エラーを防ぎます","ko":"validate-schema 스킬은 자동화 공장 게임에서 스키마를 검증하여 데이터 일관성을 보장하고 실행 시 오류를 방지합니다","es":"La validación de esquemas es crucial para evitar errores en tiempo de ejecución. Nuestra guía te muestra cómo hacerlo de forma automática.","fr":"La validation de schéma est cruciale pour éviter les erreurs à l''exécution. Notre guide vous montre comment le faire de manière automatisée.","de":"Die Validierung von Schemata ist entscheidend, um Laufzeitfehler zu vermeiden. Unsere Anleitung zeigt Ihnen, wie Sie dies automatisch tun können.","pt":"Guia de verificação de esquema para desenvolvedores, com mapeamento de esquema para validador","ru":"Руководство по проверке схемы для разработчиков, с сопоставлением схемы и проверяющего","ar":"دليل للتحقق من مخطط الجدول لمطوري البرمجيات، مع対応 بين مخطط الجدول ومدقق","en":"Animated open world automated factory game"},"definition":{"en":"Animated open world automated factory game"},"features":{"zh":["自动化工厂游戏中的模式验证","防止运行时错误","确保数据一致性","支持多种模式文件","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["自動化ファクトリーゲームにおけるスキーマの検証","実行時エラーの防止","データの一貫性の確保","複数のスキーマファイルのサポート","使いやすさと統合の容易さ"],"ko":["자동화 공장 게임에서의 스키마 검증","실행 시 오류 방지","데이터 일관성 보장","다중 스키마 파일 지원","사용 kolay성 및 통합 용이성"],"es":["Validación automática de esquemas","Evita errores en tiempo de ejecución","Integración con SourceGenerator","Compatibilidad con varios formatos de esquema","Generación de código de validación personalizado"],"fr":["Validation de schéma automatisée","Évitez les erreurs à l''exécution","Intégration avec SourceGenerator","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de schéma","Génération de code de validation personnalisé"],"de":["Automatisierte Validierung von Schemata","Vermeidung von Laufzeitfehlern","Integration mit SourceGenerator","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Schemformaten","Generierung von benutzerdefiniertem Validierungscode"],"pt":["Geração automática de código de validação","Mapeamento de esquema para validador","Suporte a ForeignKey","Prevenção de erros de InvalidOperationException","Integração com C#"],"ru":["Автоматическая генерация кода проверки","Сопоставление схемы и проверяющего","Поддержка ForeignKey","Предотвращение ошибок InvalidOperationException","Интеграция с C#"],"ar":["التحقق التلقائي من كود التحقق","التطابق بين مخطط الجدول ومدقق","دعم ForeignKey","منع أخطاء InvalidOperationException","التكامل مع C#"]},"keywords":{"zh":["validate-schema","自动化工厂游戏","模式验证","数据一致性","运行时错误","游戏开发","软件开发"],"ja":["validate-schema","自動化ファクトリーゲーム","スキーマの検証","データの一貫性","実行時エラー","ゲーム開発","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["validate-schema","자동화 공장 게임","스키마 검증","데이터 일관성","실행 시 오류","게임 개발","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["validación de esquemas","SourceGenerator","validación automática","evitar errores","esquemas de datos","validación de datos"],"fr":["validation de schéma","SourceGenerator","validation automatisée","éviter les erreurs","schémas de données","validation de données"],"de":["Validierung von Schemata","SourceGenerator","automatisierte Validierung","Vermeidung von Fehlern","Schemata von Daten","Validierung von Daten"],"pt":["validação de esquema","esquema de dados","ForeignKey","C#","desenvolvimento de software","programação","validação automática","geração de código"],"ru":["проверка схемы","схема данных","ForeignKey","C#","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","автоматическая проверка","генерация кода"],"ar":["التحقق من مخطط الجدول","مخطط البيانات","ForeignKey","C#","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","التحقق التلقائي","توليد الكود"]}},"owner":"moorestech","repo":"moorestech","repoPath":"moorestech/moorestech","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"validate-schema","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Schema Validation Check Guide\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nSourceGeneratorは`foreignKey`定義からバリデーションコードを**自動生成しない**。\n手動でC#バリデーションを追加しないと、存在しないGuidが実行時に`InvalidOperationException`を引き起こす。\n\n## Schema to Validator Mapping\n\n| スキーマファイル | Validatorファイル |\n|-----------------|------------------|\n| blocks.yml | `BlockMasterUtil.cs` |\n| items.yml | `ItemMasterUtil.cs` |\n| fluids.yml | `FluidMasterUtil.cs` |\n| craftRecipes.yml | `CraftRecipeMasterUtil.cs` |\n| machineRecipes.yml | `MachineRecipesMasterUtil.cs` |\n| r","body":"# Schema Validation Check Guide\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nSourceGeneratorは`foreignKey`定義からバリデーションコードを**自動生成しない**。\n手動でC#バリデーションを追加しないと、存在しないGuidが実行時に`InvalidOperationException`を引き起こす。\n\n## Schema to Validator Mapping\n\n| スキーマファイル | Validatorファイル |\n|-----------------|------------------|\n| blocks.yml | `BlockMasterUtil.cs` |\n| items.yml | `ItemMasterUtil.cs` |\n| fluids.yml | `FluidMasterUtil.cs` |\n| craftRecipes.yml | `CraftRecipeMasterUtil.cs` |\n| machineRecipes.yml | `MachineRecipesMasterUtil.cs` |\n| research.yml | `ResearchMasterUtil.cs` |\n| challenges.yml | `ChallengeMasterUtil.cs` |\n| mapObjects.yml | `MapObjectMasterUtil.cs` |\n| placeSystem.yml | `PlaceSystemMasterUtil.cs` |\n| train.yml | `TrainUnitMasterUtil.cs` |\n| characters.yml | `CharacterMasterUtil.cs` |\n\n**Validatorパス**: `moorestech_server/Assets/Scripts/Core.Master/Validator/`\n\n## foreignKey Types and Validation Methods\n\n### ItemGuid → items\n```csharp\nvar id = MasterHolder.ItemMaster.GetItemIdOrNull(element.ItemGuid);\nif (id == null)\n{\n    logs += $\"[{MasterName}] Name:{name} has invalid ItemGuid:{element.ItemGuid}\\n\";\n}\n```\n\n### FluidGuid → fluids\n```csharp\nvar id = MasterHolder.FluidMaster.GetFluidIdOrNull(element.FluidGuid);\nif (id == null)\n{\n    logs += $\"[{MasterName}] Name:{name} has invalid FluidGuid:{element.FluidGuid}\\n\";\n}\n```\n\n### BlockGuid → blocks\n```csharp\nvar id = MasterHolder.BlockMaster.GetBlockIdOrNull(element.BlockGuid);\nif (id == null)\n{\n    logs += $\"[{MasterName}] Name:{name} has invalid BlockGuid:{element.BlockGuid}\\n\";\n}\n```\n\n### 同一スキーマ内参照 (blocks → blocks等)\n```csharp\n// ヘルパー関数を定義\nbool ExistsBlockGuid(Guid blockGuid)\n{\n    return Array.Exists(blocks.Data, b => b.BlockGuid == blockGuid);\n}\n\n// バリデーション\nif (!ExistsBlockGuid(element.TargetBlockGuid))\n{\n    logs += $\"[{MasterName}] Name:{name} has invalid TargetBlockGuid:{element.TargetBlockGuid}\\n\";\n}\n```\n\n### MapObjectGuid → mapObjects\n```csharp\nvar id = MasterHolder.MapObjectMaster.GetMapObjectIdOrNull(element.MapObjectGuid);\nif (id == null)\n{\n    logs += $\"[{MasterName}] Name:{name} has invalid MapObjectGuid:{element.MapObjectGuid}\\n\";\n}\n```\n\n### ResearchGuid → research\n```csharp\nvar id = MasterHolder.ResearchMaster.GetResearchIdOrNull(element.ResearchGuid);\nif (id == null)\n{\n    logs += $\"[{MasterName}] Name:{name} has invalid ResearchGuid:{element.ResearchGuid}\\n\";\n}\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### 1. ref経由のforeignKey見落とし\n```yaml\n# blocks.yml\n- key: generateFluid\n  ref: generateFluids  # ← ref先にforeignKeyがある！\n```\n`generateFluids.yml`内の`fluidGuid`がforeignKeyを持つ。\nrefを使う場合は**ref先のスキーマも確認**すること。\n\n### 2. switch/cases内のforeignKey見落とし\n```yaml\ncases:\n- when: GearPump\n  properties:\n  - key: generateFluid\n    ref: generateFluids  # ← cases内も要確認\n```\n各caseのBlockParamごとにバリデーションが必要。\n\n### 3. 配列内要素のforeignKey見落とし\n```yaml\n- key: requiredItems\n  type: array\n  items:\n    type: object\n    properties:\n    - key: itemGuid\n      foreignKey: ...  # ← 配列要素内のforeignKey\n```\n`foreach`でループしてバリデーションする。\n\n### 4. optional: true のforeignKey\n```yaml\n- key: upgradeBlockGuid\n  type: uuid\n  optional: true\n  foreignKey: ...\n```\n空のGuid（`Guid.Empty`）をスキップする処理が必要：\n```csharp\nif (element.UpgradeBlockGuid != Guid.Empty)\n{\n    // バリデーション\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Nullable型のforeignKey\n```yaml\n- key: upBlockGuid\n  type: uuid\n  optional: true\n```\n`HasValue`チェックが必要：\n```csharp\nif (element.UpBlockGuid.HasValue && element.UpBlockGuid.Value != Guid.Empty)\n{\n    // バリデーション\n}\n```\n\n## Validation Implementation Procedure\n\n### Step 1: Identify foreignKeys\n編集したYAMLファイルで`foreignKey:`を検索し、追加したforeignKeyを特定する。\nref先のスキーマも確認すること。\n\n### Step 2: Find Target Validator\n対応するValidatorファイルを開く（上記マッピング表参照）。\n\n### Step 3: Locate Validation Method\n`Validate`メソッド内の適切な場所を見つける。\nBlockParamの場合は`BlockParamValidation()`内。\n\n### Step 4: Add Validation Code\n既存パターンに従ってバリデーションコードを追加。\nコメントは日本語・英語の2行セットで記述。\n\n### Step 5: Compile and Test\nコンパイルを実行し、エラーがないことを確認。\n\n## Checklist\n\nスキーマ編集完了時に以下を確認：\n\n- [ ] 追加したforeignKeyをすべてリストアップしたか？\n- [ ] ref経由のforeignKeyを見落としていないか？\n- [ ] switch/cases内のforeignKeyを見落としていないか？\n- [ ] 配列内要素のforeignKeyを見落としていないか？\n- [ ] 対応するValidatorにバリデーションコードを追加したか？\n- [ ] optional/nullable型の場合、Guid.Empty/HasValueチェックを追加したか？\n- [ ] コンパイルが通ることを確認したか？\n\n## Quick Validation Audit\n\n既存スキーマのバリデーション漏れを確認するコマンド：\n\n```bash\n# スキーマ内のforeignKey数をカウント\ngrep -r \"foreignKey:\" VanillaSchema/ | wc -l\n\n# Validator内のバリデーション呼び出し数をカウント\ngrep -rE \"GetItemIdOrNull|GetFluidIdOrNull|GetBlockIdOrNull|GetMapObjectIdOrNull|ExistsBlockGuid\" \\\n  moorestech_server/Assets/Scripts/Core.Master/Validator/ | wc -l\n```\n\n数が大きく乖離している場合、バリデーション漏れの可能性がある。\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:21:33.384Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing automated schema validation and C# code integration.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化模式验证和C#代码集成的代码生成代理。","ja":"自動スキーマ検証とC#コード統合を必要とするコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 스키마 유효성 검사 및 C# 코드 통합이 필요한 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Código que necesitan validación de esquemas automatizada e integración de código C#.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Génération de Code nécessitant une validation de schéma automatisée et une intégration de code C#.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die eine automatisierte Schema-Validierung und C#-Code-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código que necessitam de validação de esquema automatizada e integração de código C#.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, требующих автоматической валидации схемы и интеграции с кодом C#.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق التلقائي من مخطط قاعدة البيانات وتكامل رمز سي شارب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically generate validation code from foreignKey definitions, preventing InvalidOperationExceptions at runtime and ensuring data consistency through schema validation checks, leveraging YAML schema files like blocks.yml and items.yml.","zh":"赋予代理自动生成外键定义的验证代码的能力，防止运行时的InvalidOperationException，并通过模式验证检查确保数据一致性，利用类似blocks.yml和items.yml的YAML模式文件。","ja":"외键定義から検証コードを自動的に生成するエージェントの能力を与え、実行時 InvalidOperationException を防ぎ、YAML スキーマファイル (blocks.yml や items.yml など) を使用してスキーマ検証チェックを通じてデータの一貫性を確保します。","ko":"외부키 정의에서 유효성 검사 코드를 자동으로 생성하여 런타임 InvalidOperationException을 방지하며 YAML 스키마 파일(blocks.yml 및 items.yml 등)을 사용하여 스키마 유효성 검사 확인을 통해 데이터 일관성을 보장하는 에이전트의 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar automáticamente código de validación a partir de definiciones de foreignKey, evitando InvalidOperationExceptions en tiempo de ejecución y garantizando la coherencia de los datos a través de comprobaciones de validación de esquemas, aprovechando archivos de esquema YAML como blocks.yml e items.yml.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer automatiquement du code de validation à partir de définitions de foreignKey, évitant les InvalidOperationExceptions à l''exécution et garantissant la cohérence des données grâce à des vérifications de validation de schémas, en exploitant des fichiers de schéma YAML comme blocks.yml et items.yml.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Validierungscode automatisch aus foreignKey-Definitionen zu generieren, InvalidOperationExceptions bei der Ausführung zu vermeiden und die Datenkonsistenz durch Schema-Validierungsprüfungen sicherzustellen, indem YAML-Schema-Dateien wie blocks.yml und items.yml genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem automaticamente código de validação a partir de definições de foreignKey, evitando InvalidOperationExceptions em tempo de execução e garantindo a consistência dos dados por meio de verificações de validação de esquema, utilizando arquivos de esquema YAML como blocks.yml e items.yml.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматически генерировать код проверки из определений foreignKey, предотвращая InvalidOperationExceptions во время выполнения и гарантируя согласованность данных посредством проверок валидации схемы, используя файлы схемы YAML, такие как blocks.yml и items.yml.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء生成 تلقائيًا رمز التحقق من الصحة من تعريفات foreignKey، وتجنب InvalidOperationExceptions في وقت التشغيل وضمان الاتساق البيانات من خلال عمليات فحص صحة مخطط البيانات، باستخدام ملفات مخطط YAML مثل blocks.yml و items.yml."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating schema definitions for automated factory games","Generating C# validation code for master utility classes like BlockMasterUtil.cs","Debugging InvalidOperationExceptions caused by missing Guid validations"],"zh":["自动化工厂游戏的模式定义验证","为类似BlockMasterUtil.cs的主实用程序类生成C#验证代码","调试由缺失Guid验证引起的InvalidOperationException"],"ja":["自動化ファクトリーゲームのスキーマ定義の検証","BlockMasterUtil.csのようなマスターユーティリティクラスのC#検証コードの生成","GUID検証の不足によって引き起こされるInvalidOperationExceptionのデバッグ"],"ko":["자동화된 공장 게임의 스키마 정의 유효성 검사","BlockMasterUtil.cs와 같은 마스터 유틸리티 클래스를 위한 C# 유효성 검사 코드 생성","GUID 유효성 검사의 부족으로 인한 InvalidOperationException의 디버깅"],"es":["Validar definiciones de esquema para juegos de fábricas automatizadas","Generar código de validación C# para clases de utilidad maestras como BlockMasterUtil.cs","Depurar InvalidOperationExceptions causadas por la falta de validaciones de Guid"],"fr":["Valider les définitions de schéma pour les jeux de fabriques automatisés","Générer du code de validation C# pour les classes d''utilité maîtres comme BlockMasterUtil.cs","Déboguer les InvalidOperationExceptions causées par le manque de validations de Guid"],"de":["Validieren von Schemadefinitionen für automatisierte Fabrikspiele","Generieren von C#-Validierungscode für Master-Utility-Klassen wie BlockMasterUtil.cs","Beheben von InvalidOperationExceptions, die durch fehlende Guid-Validierungen verursacht werden"],"pt":["Validar definições de esquema para jogos de fábrica automatizados","Gerar código de validação C# para classes de utilidade mestre como BlockMasterUtil.cs","Depurar InvalidOperationExceptions causados por validações de Guid ausentes"],"ru":["Проверка определений схемы для автоматизированных игр фабрик","Генерирование кода проверки C# для мастер-классов утилит, таких как BlockMasterUtil.cs","Отладка InvalidOperationExceptions, вызванных отсутствующими проверками Guid"],"ar":["التحقق من تعريفات مخطط البيانات للعبة المصنع التلقائي","توليد رمز التحقق من صحة سي شارب لفصول الأدوات الرئيسية مثل BlockMasterUtil.cs","تصحيح أخطاء InvalidOperationExceptions الناجمة عن نقص التحقق من الصحة Guid"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual addition of C# validation code for SourceGenerator","Limited to specific YAML schema files and C# master utility classes"],"zh":["需要手动添加C#验证代码以用于SourceGenerator","仅限于特定的YAML模式文件和C#主实用程序类"],"ja":["SourceGenerator用のC#検証コードの手動追加が必要","特定のYAMLスキーマファイルとC#マスタユーティリティクラスに限定"],"ko":["SourceGenerator용 C# 유효성 검사 코드의 수동 추가가 필요","특정 YAML 스키마 파일 및 C# 마스터 유틸리티 클래스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la adición manual de código de validación C# para SourceGenerator","Limitado a archivos de esquema YAML específicos y clases de utilidad maestras C#"],"fr":["Nécessite l''ajout manuel de code de validation C# pour SourceGenerator","Limité à des fichiers de schéma YAML spécifiques et à des classes d''utilité maîtres C#"],"de":["Benötigt die manuelle Hinzufügung von C#-Validierungscode für SourceGenerator","Begrenzt auf bestimmte YAML-Schema-Dateien und C#-Master-Utility-Klassen"],"pt":["Requer a adição manual de código de validação C# para SourceGenerator","Limitado a arquivos de esquema YAML específicos e classes de utilidade mestre C#"],"ru":["Требует ручного добавления кода проверки C# для SourceGenerator","Ограничен конкретными файлами схемы YAML и мастер-классами утилит C#"],"ar":["يتطلب إضافة يدوية لرمز التحقق من صحة سي شارب لمولد المصدر","محدود بملفات مخطط YAML والمصنفات الرئيسية لسي شارب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown/ci-cd-multi-platform-matrix', 'community', 'kreuzberg-dev', 'html-to-markdown', 'kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown', 'ci-cd-multi-platform-matrix', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:21:33.595Z', NULL, '{"id":"kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown/ci-cd-multi-platform-matrix","name":"ci-cd-multi-platform-matrix","description":{"zh":"CI/CD, GitHub Actions, ","ja":"CI/CD, GitHub Actions, ","ko":"CI/CD, GitHub Actions, ","es":"La matriz de plataforma múltiple de CI/CD es una estrategia para probar en múltiples sistemas operativos, arquitecturas y versiones de lenguaje con minimal duplicación","fr":"La matrice de plateforme multi-CI/CD est une stratégie pour tester sur plusieurs systèmes d''exploitation, architectures et versions de langage avec une duplication minimale","de":"Die CI/CD-Multi-Plattform-Matrix ist eine Strategie, um auf mehreren Betriebssystemen, Architekturen und Sprachversionen mit minimaler Duplizierung zu testen","pt":"A matriz de CI/CD multiplataforma é uma estratégia para testar em várias plataformas, incluindo Linux, Windows e macOS","ru":"Матрица многоплатформенной CI/CD - это стратегия для тестирования на нескольких платформах, включая Linux, Windows и macOS","ar":"مصفوفة متعددة المنصات ل CI/CD هي استراتيجية لاختبار منصات متعددة، بما في ذلك Linux و Windows و macOS","en":"High performance and CommonMark compliant HTML to Markdown converter. Maintained by the Kreuzberg team. Kreuzberg is a fast, polyglot document intelligence engine with a Rust core. It extracts structured data from 56+ document formats using streaming parsers and built-in OCR."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"CI/CD ","ja":"CI/CD","ko":"CI/CD ","es":"Matriz de plataforma múltiple de CI/CD","fr":"Matrice de plateforme multi-CI/CD","de":"CI/CD-Multi-Plattform-Matrix","pt":"Matriz de Multiplataforma CI/CD","ru":"Матрица многоплатформенной CI/CD","ar":"مصفوفة متعددة المنصات ل CI/CD","en":"ci-cd-multi-platform-matrix"},"description":{"zh":"CI/CD, GitHub Actions, ","ja":"CI/CD, GitHub Actions, ","ko":"CI/CD, GitHub Actions, ","es":"La matriz de plataforma múltiple de CI/CD es una estrategia para probar en múltiples sistemas operativos, arquitecturas y versiones de lenguaje con minimal d...","fr":"La matrice de plateforme multi-CI/CD est une stratégie pour tester sur plusieurs systèmes d''exploitation, architectures et versions de langage avec une dupli...","de":"Die CI/CD-Multi-Plattform-Matrix ist eine Strategie, um auf mehreren Betriebssystemen, Architekturen und Sprachversionen mit minimaler Duplizierung zu testen","pt":"A matriz de CI/CD multiplataforma é uma estratégia para testar em várias plataformas, incluindo Linux, Windows e macOS","ru":"Матрица многоплатформенной CI/CD - это стратегия для тестирования на нескольких платформах, включая Linux, Windows и macOS","ar":"مصفوفة متعددة المنصات ل CI/CD هي استراتيجية لاختبار منصات متعددة، بما في ذلك Linux و Windows و macOS","en":"High performance and CommonMark compliant HTML to Markdown converter. Maintained by the Kreuzberg team. Kreuzberg is a fast, polyglot document intelligence e..."},"definition":{"en":"High performance and CommonMark compliant HTML to Markdown converter. Maintained by the Kreuzberg team. Kreuzberg is a fast, polyglot document intelligence engine with a Rust core. It extracts structured data from 56+ document formats using streaming parsers and built-in OCR."},"features":{"zh":["GitHub Actions","56","Rust","CI/CD","Matrix "],"ja":["GitHub Actions","56","Rust","CI/CD","Matrix "],"ko":["GitHub Actions","56","Rust","CI/CD","Matrix "],"es":["Pruebas en múltiples sistemas operativos","Pruebas en diferentes arquitecturas","Pruebas en varias versiones de lenguaje","Minimal duplicación de código","Integración con GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Tests sur plusieurs systèmes d''exploitation","Tests sur différentes architectures","Tests sur plusieurs versions de langage","Duplication minimale de code","Intégration avec GitHub Actions"],"de":["Tests auf mehreren Betriebssystemen","Tests auf verschiedenen Architekturen","Tests auf mehreren Sprachversionen","Minimale Code-Duplizierung","Integration mit GitHub Actions"],"pt":["Teste em várias plataformas","Economia de tempo e recursos","Automatização de testes","Suporte a Linux, Windows e macOS","Integração com GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Тестирование на нескольких платформах","Экономия времени и ресурсов","Автоматизация тестирования","Поддержка Linux, Windows и macOS","Интеграция с GitHub Actions"],"ar":["اختبار على منصات متعددة","توفير الوقت والموارد","تحسين التلقائي للاختبار","دعم Linux و Windows و macOS","التكامل مع GitHub Actions"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Rust","Matrix ","56","CI/CD","DevOps","Automated Testing"],"ja":["CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Rust","Matrix ","56","CI/CD","DevOps","Automated Testing"],"ko":["CI/CD","GitHub Actions","Rust","Matrix ","56","CI/CD","DevOps","Automated Testing"],"es":["CI/CD","Matriz de plataforma múltiple","GitHub Actions","Pruebas automatizadas","Desarrollo de software","Integración continua","Entrega continua"],"fr":["CI/CD","Matrice de plateforme multi","GitHub Actions","Tests automatisés","Développement de logiciels","Intégration continue","Livraison continue"],"de":["CI/CD","Multi-Plattform-Matrix","GitHub Actions","Automatisierte Tests","Software-Entwicklung","Kontinuierliche Integration","Kontinuierliche Lieferung"],"pt":["CI/CD","Matriz de CI/CD","Teste automatizado","GitHub Actions","Desenvolvimento de software","Automatização de testes","Economia de tempo","Suporte a várias plataformas"],"ru":["CI/CD","Матрица CI/CD","Автоматизированное тестирование","GitHub Actions","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматизация тестирования","Экономия времени","Поддержка нескольких платформ"],"ar":["CI/CD","مصفوفة CI/CD","اختبار تلقائي","GitHub Actions","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين التلقائي للاختبار","توفير الوقت","دعم منصات متعددة"]}},"owner":"kreuzberg-dev","repo":"html-to-markdown","repoPath":"kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ci-cd-multi-platform-matrix","description":"","bodyPreview":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: critical\n\n# CI/CD Multi-Platform Matrix\n\n## GitHub Actions Matrix Strategy\n\nUse matrix strategy to test across multiple OS, architectures, and language versions with minimal duplication:\n\n```yaml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n  pull_request:\n\njobs:\n  test-matrix:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    strategy:\n      fail-fast: false\n      matrix:\n        include:\n          # Linux: x86_64 and A","body":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: critical\n\n# CI/CD Multi-Platform Matrix\n\n## GitHub Actions Matrix Strategy\n\nUse matrix strategy to test across multiple OS, architectures, and language versions with minimal duplication:\n\n```yaml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n  pull_request:\n\njobs:\n  test-matrix:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    strategy:\n      fail-fast: false\n      matrix:\n        include:\n          # Linux: x86_64 and ARM64\n          - { os: ubuntu-latest, arch: x86_64, target: x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu }\n          - { os: ubuntu-latest, arch: arm64, target: aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu }\n\n          # macOS: Intel and Apple Silicon\n          - { os: macos-12, arch: x86_64, target: x86_64-apple-darwin }\n          - { os: macos-14, arch: arm64, target: aarch64-apple-darwin }\n\n          # Windows: x86_64 only\n          - { os: windows-latest, arch: x86_64, target: x86_64-pc-windows-msvc }\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Install Rust\n        uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable\n        with:\n          targets: ${{ matrix.target }}\n\n      - name: Setup cross compilation\n        if: matrix.arch == ''arm64'' && matrix.os == ''ubuntu-latest''\n        run: cargo install cross\n\n      - name: Build\n        run: |\n          if [ \"${{ matrix.arch }}\" = \"arm64\" ] && [ \"${{ matrix.os }}\" = \"ubuntu-latest\" ]; then\n            cross build --target ${{ matrix.target }} --release\n          else\n            cargo build --target ${{ matrix.target }} --release\n          fi\n        shell: bash\n\n      - name: Test\n        run: |\n          if [ \"${{ matrix.arch }}\" = \"arm64\" ] && [ \"${{ matrix.os }}\" = \"ubuntu-latest\" ]; then\n            cross test --target ${{ matrix.target }}\n          else\n            cargo test --target ${{ matrix.target }}\n          fi\n        shell: bash\n\n      - name: Upload artifacts\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3\n        with:\n          name: binaries-${{ matrix.os }}-${{ matrix.arch }}\n          path: target/${{ matrix.target }}/release/myapp*\n```\n\n## Language Version Matrices\n\nTest against multiple language versions simultaneously:\n\n```yaml\nname: Polyglot CI\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  test-rust:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        rust-version: [''1.70'', ''stable'', ''nightly'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@master\n        with:\n          toolchain: ${{ matrix.rust-version }}\n      - run: cargo test --all-features\n\n  test-python:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        python-version: [''3.8'', ''3.9'', ''3.10'', ''3.11'', ''3.12'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-python@v4\n        with:\n          python-version: ${{ matrix.python-version }}\n      - run: |\n          pip install -e . -v\n          pytest tests/ -v\n\n  test-node:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        node-version: [''18.x'', ''20.x'', ''22.x'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ matrix.node-version }}\n      - run: |\n          npm ci\n          npm run test\n\n  test-ruby:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        ruby-version: [''3.0'', ''3.1'', ''3.2'', ''3.3'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: ruby/setup-ruby@v1\n        with:\n          ruby-version: ${{ matrix.ruby-version }}\n          bundler-cache: true\n      - run: bundle exec rspec\n\n  test-java:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        java-version: [''11'', ''17'', ''21'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-java@v3\n        with:\n          java-version: ${{ matrix.java-version }}\n          distribution: ''temurin''\n      - run: ./gradlew test\n\n  test-go:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        go-version: [''1.20'', ''1.21'', ''1.22'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-go@v4\n        with:\n          go-version: ${{ matrix.go-version }}\n      - run: go test ./...\n```\n\n## Artifact Caching Strategy\n\nReuse built artifacts and dependencies across runs to speed up CI:\n\n```yaml\nname: Build with Cache\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      # Rust dependency caching\n      - uses: Swatinem/rust-cache@v2\n        with:\n          workspaces: ''crates''\n          cache-targets: true\n\n      # Python pip caching\n      - uses: actions/cache@v3\n        with:\n          path: ~/.cache/pip\n          key: ${{ runner.os }}-pip-${{ hashFiles(''**/requirements.txt'') }}\n          restore-keys: |\n            ${{ runner.os }}-pip-\n\n      # Node.js caching\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ''20''\n          cache: ''npm''\n          cache-dependency-path: ''**/package-lock.json''\n\n      # Docker layer caching\n      - uses: docker/setup-buildx-action@v2\n\n      - name: Build with Docker cache\n        uses: docker/build-push-action@v5\n        with:\n          context: .\n          push: false\n          cache-from: type=gha\n          cache-to: type=gha,mode=max\n\n      # Custom cargo build cache\n      - name: Cache cargo build\n        uses: actions/cache@v3\n        with:\n          path: target\n          key: ${{ runner.os }}-cargo-build-${{ hashFiles(''Cargo.lock'') }}\n          restore-keys: |\n            ${{ runner.os }}-cargo-build-\n\n      - run: cargo build --release\n```\n\n## Test Result Aggregation\n\nCombine test results from multiple jobs into single report:\n\n```yaml\nname: Aggregate Test Results\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  test-rust:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable\n      - run: cargo test --all --no-fail-fast -- --test-threads=1 --nocapture\n        continue-on-error: true\n      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3\n        with:\n          name: test-results-rust\n          path: target/test-results.xml\n\n  test-python:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-python@v4\n        with:\n          python-version: ''3.11''\n      - run: pip install pytest pytest-xml pytest-cov\n      - run: pytest --junitxml=test-results.xml --cov=. --cov-report=term\n        continue-on-error: true\n      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3\n        with:\n          name: test-results-python\n          path: test-results.xml\n\n  aggregate:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    needs: [test-rust, test-python]\n    if: always()\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/download-artifact@v3\n        with:\n          path: artifacts\n\n      - name: Publish test results\n        uses: EnricoMi/publish-unit-test-result-action@v2\n        if: always()\n        with:\n          files: artifacts/**/test-results.xml\n          check_name: ''Test Results''\n          comment_mode: ''always''\n```\n\n## Split CI Workflows by Domain\n\nOrganize workflows by language/domain to parallelize and reduce noise:\n\n**ci-rust.yaml** (Rust-specific testing):\n\n```yaml\nname: CI - Rust\n\non:\n  push:\n    paths:\n      - ''crates/**''\n      - ''Cargo.toml''\n      - ''Cargo.lock''\n      - ''.github/workflows/ci-rust.yaml''\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable\n        with:\n          components: rustfmt, clippy\n      - run: cargo fmt --all -- --check\n      - run: cargo clippy --all --all-targets --all-features\n      - run: cargo test --all --all-features\n      - run: cargo tarpaulin --out Xml --timeout 300 --fail-under 95\n      - uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n\n  msrv:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@master\n        with:\n          toolchain: ''1.70''  # MSRV\n      - run: cargo test --all\n```\n\n**ci-python.yaml** (Python-specific testing):\n\n```yaml\nname: CI - Python\n\non:\n  push:\n    paths:\n      - ''python/**''\n      - ''bindings/python/**''\n      - ''pyproject.toml''\n      - ''.github/workflows/ci-python.yaml''\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        python-version: [''3.8'', ''3.9'', ''3.10'', ''3.11'', ''3.12'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-python@v4\n        with:\n          python-version: ${{ matrix.python-version }}\n          cache: ''pip''\n      - run: pip install -e .[dev]\n      - run: ruff check .\n      - run: ruff format --check .\n      - run: mypy bindings/python --strict\n      - run: pytest tests/ -v --cov=bindings/python --cov-report=xml\n      - uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n        if: matrix.python-version == ''3.11''\n```\n\n**ci-node.yaml** (Node.js/TypeScript-specific):\n\n```yaml\nname: CI - Node.js\n\non:\n  push:\n    paths:\n      - ''bindings/node/**''\n      - ''package.json''\n      - ''pnpm-lock.yaml''\n      - ''.github/workflows/ci-node.yaml''\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        node-version: [''18.x'', ''20.x'', ''22.x'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ matrix.node-version }}\n          cache: ''pnpm''\n      - run: pnpm install\n      - run: pnpm lint\n      - run: pnpm format:check\n      - run: pnpm test:unit\n      - run: pnpm build\n      - uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n        if: matrix.node-version == ''20.x''\n```\n\n**ci-java.yaml** (Java-specific testing):\n\n```yaml\nname: CI - Java\n\non:\n  push:\n    paths:\n      - ''bindings/java/**''\n      - ''build.gradle''\n      - ''.github/workflows/ci-java.yaml''\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        java-version: [''11'', ''17'', ''21'']\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-java@v3\n        with:\n          java-version: ${{ matrix.java-version }}\n          distribution: ''temurin''\n          cache: ''gradle''\n      - run: ./gradlew check\n      - run: ./gradlew jacocoTestReport\n      - uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n```\n\n## Matrix Expansion with Environment\n\nAvoid duplicating test definitions by expanding with environment matrices:\n\n```yaml\nname: Build & Test\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.config.os }}\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        config:\n          - { os: ubuntu-latest, rust: stable, coverage: true }\n          - { os: ubuntu-latest, rust: nightly }\n          - { os: macos-latest, rust: stable }\n          - { os: windows-latest, rust: stable }\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@master\n        with:\n          toolchain: ${{ matrix.config.rust }}\n\n      - name: Run tests\n        run: cargo test --all\n\n      - name: Generate coverage\n        if: matrix.config.coverage\n        run: |\n          cargo install cargo-tarpaulin\n          cargo tarpaulin --out Xml\n\n      - name: Upload coverage\n        if: matrix.config.coverage\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n```\n\n## Conditional Step Execution\n\nControl which steps run based on matrix context:\n\n```yaml\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n        include:\n          - os: ubuntu-latest\n            install-cmd: apt-get install -y\n          - os: macos-latest\n            install-cmd: brew install\n          - os: windows-latest\n            install-cmd: choco install\n\n    steps:\n      - name: Install dependencies (Linux)\n        if: runner.os == ''Linux''\n        run: sudo ${{ matrix.install-cmd }} libc6-dev\n\n      - name: Install dependencies (macOS)\n        if: runner.os == ''macOS''\n        run: ${{ matrix.install-cmd }} openssl\n\n      - name: Install dependencies (Windows)\n        if: runner.os == ''Windows''\n        run: ${{ matrix.install-cmd }} openssl\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No fail-fast control**: Use `fail-fast: false` to run all matrix variants even if one fails\n\n- **Duplicating CI logic**: Extract common steps to reusable workflows\n\n- **Unbounded matrix expansion**: Avoid cartesian product of too many dimensions\n\n  ```yaml\n  # BAD: 3×4×3×2 = 72 jobs\n  strategy:\n    matrix:\n      os: [ubuntu, macos, windows]\n      rust: [1.70, stable, beta, nightly]\n      python: [3.8, 3.9, 3.10, 3.11]\n      node: [18, 20]\n\n  # GOOD: Use include/exclude to select specific combinations\n  strategy:\n    matrix:\n      include:\n        - { os: ubuntu, rust: stable, python: ''3.11'', node: ''20'' }\n        - { os: macos, rust: stable, python: ''3.11'', node: ''20'' }\n        - { os: windows, rust: stable, python: ''3.11'', node: ''20'' }\n  ```\n\n- **No artifact caching**: Always cache dependencies and build artifacts\n\n- **Mixed domains in single workflow**: Separate Rust, Python, Node.js, Java into independent workflows\n\n- **Test failures not surfaced**: Always publish results to PR comments with action\n\n- **No cross-platform testing**: Test on Linux, macOS, Windows (especially for FFI bindings)\n\n- **Hardcoded versions**: Use matrix variables for all version-dependent steps\n\n- **No architecture testing**: Test both x86_64 and ARM64 (cross-compile with `cross` crate)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:21:33.595Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing automated testing across multiple OS, architectures, and language versions","zh":"适用于需要跨多个操作系统、架构和语言版本进行自动化测试的DevOps代理","ja":"DevOpsエージェントが複数のOS、Architecture、言語バージョンで自動テストを実行する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"다중 OS, 아키텍처 및 언어 버전에서 자동 테스트가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan pruebas automatizadas en múltiples sistemas operativos, arquitecturas y versiones de lenguaje","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin de tests automatisés sur plusieurs systèmes d''exploitation, architectures et versions de langage","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die automatisierte Tests über mehrere Betriebssysteme, Architekturen und Sprachversionen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de testes automatizados em várias OS, arquiteturas e versões de linguagem","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходимы автоматизированные тесты в нескольких ОС, архитектурах и версиях языков","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يحتاج إلى اختبارات آلية عبر عدة أنظمة تشغيل وهياكل ونسخ لغات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize GitHub Actions matrix strategy for streamlined testing, minimizing duplication and supporting a wide range of environments, including Linux and various architectures, with features like fail-fast strategy and matrix inclusion","zh":"赋予代理利用GitHub Actions矩阵策略进行流线测试的能力，尽量减少重复并支持包括Linux和各种架构在内的广泛环境，具有快速失败策略和矩阵包含等特性","ja":"GitHub Actionsのマトリックス戦略を使用してテストをストリームライン化し、重複を最小限に抑え、Linuxや様々なアーキテクチャを含む幅広い環境をサポートするエージェントの能力を付与し、fail-fast戦略やマトリックスの包含などの機能を備える","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub Actions의 행렬 전략을 사용하여 테스트를 간소화하고 중복을 최소화하며 Linux 및 다양한 아키텍처를 포함한 광범위한 환경을 지원할 수 있도록 하며, 빠른 실패 전략 및 행렬 포함 등의 기능을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar la estrategia de matriz de GitHub Actions para pruebas optimizadas, minimizando la duplicación y admitiendo una amplia gama de entornos, incluidos Linux y diversas arquitecturas, con características como estrategia de falla rápida y inclusión de matriz","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser la stratégie de matrice de GitHub Actions pour des tests rationalisés, minimisant la duplication et prenant en charge une large gamme d''environnements, y compris Linux et différentes architectures, avec des fonctionnalités comme la stratégie de défaillance rapide et l''inclusion de matrice","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Matrix-Strategie von GitHub Actions für optimierte Tests zu nutzen, wodurch Duplizierungen minimiert und eine breite Palette von Umgebungen unterstützt werden, einschließlich Linux und verschiedener Architekturen, mit Funktionen wie Fail-Fast-Strategie und Matrix-Einbeziehung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem a estratégia de matriz do GitHub Actions para testes otimizados, minimizando a duplicação e suportando uma ampla gama de ambientes, incluindo Linux e várias arquiteturas, com recursos como estratégia de falha rápida e inclusão de matriz","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать стратегию матрицы GitHub Actions для оптимизированного тестирования, минимизируя дублирование и поддерживая широкий спектр сред, включая Linux и различные архитектуры, с функциями, такими как стратег